EO, 페이지 최적화 및 구조화된 데이터에 중점","es":"El audit SEO AEO se centra en la optimización técnica, la optimización en página y los datos estructurados para mejorar la visibilidad en los motores de búsq...","fr":"L''audit SEO AEO se concentre sur l''optimisation technique, l''optimisation sur page et les données structurées pour améliorer la visibilité dans les moteurs d...","de":"Der SEO AEO-Audit konzentriert sich auf die technische Optimierung, die Onpage-Optimierung und die strukturierten Daten, um die Sichtbarkeit in den Suchmasch...","pt":"A auditoria SEO AEO é uma ferramenta essencial para melhorar o desempenho do seu site. Aprenda sobre otimização técnica e crawlability.","ru":"Аудит SEO AEO - это необходимый инструмент для улучшения производительности вашего сайта. Узнайте о технической оптимизации и crawlability.","ar":"تدقيق seo aeo هو أداة ضرورية لتحسين أداء موقعك. تعرف على التحسين الفني والزحف.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["遵循Lighthouse SEO审计和Google搜索指南","技术SEO、页面优化和结构化数据","提高网站排名和可见性","优化robots.txt和元标签","提高网站渲染速度和用户体验"],"ja":["Lighthouse SEOオーディットとGoogle検索ガイドラインに基づく","技術SEO、ページ最適化、構造化データ","サイトのランキングと可視性の向上","robots.txtとメタタグの最適化","サイトのレンダリング速度とユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上"],"ko":["라이츠하우스 SEO 감사 및 구글 검색 가이드라인을 따름","기술 SEO, 페이지 최적화 및 구조화된 데이터","사이트의 랭킹과 가시성을 높임","로봇스.txt 및 메타 태그 최적화","사이트의 렌더링 속도 및 사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["Análisis de crawlabilidad","Optimización de meta robots","Implementación de datos estructurados","Análisis de velocidad de carga","Optimización de contenido"],"fr":["Analyse de la crawlabilité","Optimisation des meta robots","Implémentation de données structurées","Analyse de la vitesse de chargement","Optimisation du contenu"],"de":["Analyse der Crawlbility","Optimierung von Meta-Robots","Implementierung von strukturierten Daten","Analyse der Ladezeit","Optimierung des Inhalts"],"pt":["Otimização técnica","Crawlability e indexação","Metadados e estrutura de dados","Análise de desempenho com Lighthouse","Otimização para motores de busca"],"ru":["Техническая оптимизация","Crawlability и индексация","Метаданные и структура данных","Анализ производительности с помощью Lighthouse","Оптимизация для поисковых систем"],"ar":["التحسين الفني","الزحف والفهرسة","البيانات الوصفية وهيكل البيانات","تحليل الأداء باستخدام Lighthouse","تحسين محركات البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO技术审计","技术SEO","页面优化","结构化数据","Lighthouse","Google搜索指南","网站排名","可见性"],"ja":["SEOテクニカルオーディット","技術SEO","ページ最適化","構造化データ","Lighthouse","Google検索ガイドライン","サイトのランキング","可視性"],"ko":["SEO 기술 감사","기술 SEO","페이지 최적화","구조화된 데이터","라이츠하우스","구글 검색 가이드라인","사이트의 랭킹","가시성"],"es":["auditoría SEO","optimización técnica","Lighthouse","directrices de Google","posicionamiento en motores de búsqueda","SEO para desarrolladores"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation technique","Lighthouse","directives de Google","positionnement dans les moteurs de recherche","SEO pour développeurs"],"de":["SEO-Audit","technische Optimierung","Lighthouse","Google-Richtlinien","Positionierung in den Suchmaschinen","SEO für Entwickler"],"pt":["auditoria seo","otimização técnica","crawlability","metadados","lighthouse","desempenho do site","otimização para motores de busca"],"ru":["аудит seo","техническая оптимизация","crawlability","метаданные","lighthouse","производительность сайта","оптимизация для поисковых систем"],"ar":["تدقيق seo","التحسين الفني","الزحف","البيانات الوصفية","lighthouse","أداء الموقع","تحسين محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"warpdotdev","repo":"oz-skills","repoPath":"warpdotdev/oz-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-aeo-audit","description":"Optimize for search engine visibility, ranking, and AI citations. Use when asked to improve SEO, optimize for search, fix meta tags, add structured data, or improve AEO and AI visibility.","version":"2.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Optimization\n\nSearch engine optimization based on Lighthouse SEO audits and Google Search guidelines. Focus on technical SEO, on-page optimization, and structured data.\n\n## Technical SEO\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**robots.txt:**\n```text\n# /robots.txt\nUser-agent: *\nAllow: /\n\n# Block admin/private areas\nDisallow: /admin/\nDisallow: /api/\nDisallow: /private/\n\n# Don''t block resources needed for rendering\n# ❌ Disallow: /static/\n\nSitemap: https://example.com/sitemap.xml\n```\n\n**Meta robots:**\n```html\n<!-","body":"# SEO Optimization\n\nSearch engine optimization based on Lighthouse SEO audits and Google Search guidelines. Focus on technical SEO, on-page optimization, and structured data.\n\n## Technical SEO\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**robots.txt:**\n```text\n# /robots.txt\nUser-agent: *\nAllow: /\n\n# Block admin/private areas\nDisallow: /admin/\nDisallow: /api/\nDisallow: /private/\n\n# Don''t block resources needed for rendering\n# ❌ Disallow: /static/\n\nSitemap: https://example.com/sitemap.xml\n```\n\n**Meta robots:**\n```html\n<!-- Default: indexable, followable -->\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\">\n\n<!-- Noindex specific pages -->\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex, nofollow\">\n\n<!-- Indexable but don''t follow links -->\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, nofollow\">\n\n<!-- Control snippets -->\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"max-snippet:150, max-image-preview:large\">\n```\n\n**Canonical URLs:**\n```html\n<!-- Prevent duplicate content issues -->\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://example.com/page\">\n\n<!-- Self-referencing canonical (recommended) -->\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://example.com/current-page\">\n\n<!-- For paginated content -->\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://example.com/products\">\n<!-- Or use rel=\"prev\" / rel=\"next\" for explicit pagination -->\n```\n\n### XML sitemap\n\n```xml\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<urlset xmlns=\"http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9\">\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://example.com/</loc>\n    <lastmod>2024-01-15</lastmod>\n    <changefreq>daily</changefreq>\n    <priority>1.0</priority>\n  </url>\n  <url>\n    <loc>https://example.com/products</loc>\n    <lastmod>2024-01-14</lastmod>\n    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>\n    <priority>0.8</priority>\n  </url>\n</urlset>\n```\n\n**Sitemap best practices:**\n- Maximum 50,000 URLs or 50MB per sitemap\n- Use sitemap index for larger sites\n- Include only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Update `lastmod` when content changes\n- Submit to Google Search Console\n\n### URL structure\n\n```\n✅ Good URLs:\nhttps://example.com/products/blue-widget\nhttps://example.com/blog/how-to-use-widgets\n\n❌ Poor URLs:\nhttps://example.com/p?id=12345\nhttps://example.com/products/item/category/subcategory/blue-widget-2024-sale-discount\n```\n\n**URL guidelines:**\n- Use hyphens, not underscores\n- Lowercase only\n- Keep short (< 75 characters)\n- Include target keywords naturally\n- Avoid parameters when possible\n- Use HTTPS always\n\n### HTTPS & security\n\n```html\n<!-- Ensure all resources use HTTPS -->\n<img src=\"https://example.com/image.jpg\">\n\n<!-- Not: -->\n<img src=\"http://example.com/image.jpg\">\n```\n\n**Security headers for SEO trust signals:**\n```\nStrict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains\nX-Content-Type-Options: nosniff\nX-Frame-Options: DENY\n```\n\n---\n\n## On-page SEO\n\n### Title tags\n\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Missing or generic -->\n<title>Page</title>\n<title>Home</title>\n\n<!-- ✅ Descriptive with primary keyword -->\n<title>Blue Widgets for Sale | Premium Quality | Example Store</title>\n```\n\n**Title tag guidelines:**\n- 50-60 characters (Google truncates ~60)\n- Primary keyword near the beginning\n- Unique for every page\n- Brand name at end (unless homepage)\n- Action-oriented when appropriate\n\n### Meta descriptions\n\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Missing or duplicate -->\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Compelling and unique -->\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Shop premium blue widgets with free shipping. 30-day returns. Rated 4.9/5 by 10,000+ customers. Order today and save 20%.\">\n```\n\n**Meta description guidelines:**\n- 150-160 characters\n- Include primary keyword naturally\n- Compelling call-to-action\n- Unique for every page\n- Matches page content\n\n### Heading structure\n\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Poor structure -->\n<h2>Welcome to Our Store</h2>\n<h4>Products</h4>\n<h1>Contact Us</h1>\n\n<!-- ✅ Proper hierarchy -->\n<h1>Blue Widgets - Premium Quality</h1>\n  <h2>Product Features</h2>\n    <h3>Durability</h3>\n    <h3>Design</h3>\n  <h2>Customer Reviews</h2>\n  <h2>Pricing</h2>\n```\n\n**Heading guidelines:**\n- Single `<h1>` per page (the main topic)\n- Logical hierarchy (don''t skip levels)\n- Include keywords naturally\n- Descriptive, not generic\n\n### Image SEO\n\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Poor image SEO -->\n<img src=\"IMG_12345.jpg\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Optimized image -->\n<img src=\"blue-widget-product-photo.webp\"\n     alt=\"Blue widget with chrome finish, side view showing control panel\"\n     width=\"800\"\n     height=\"600\"\n     loading=\"lazy\">\n```\n\n**Image guidelines:**\n- Descriptive filenames with keywords\n- Alt text describes the image content\n- Compressed and properly sized\n- WebP/AVIF with fallbacks\n- Lazy load below-fold images\n\n### Internal linking\n\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Non-descriptive -->\n<a href=\"/products\">Click here</a>\n<a href=\"/widgets\">Read more</a>\n\n<!-- ✅ Descriptive anchor text -->\n<a href=\"/products/blue-widgets\">Browse our blue widget collection</a>\n<a href=\"/guides/widget-maintenance\">Learn how to maintain your widgets</a>\n```\n\n**Linking guidelines:**\n- Descriptive anchor text with keywords\n- Link to relevant internal pages\n- Reasonable number of links per page\n- Fix broken links promptly\n- Use breadcrumbs for hierarchy\n\n---\n\n## Structured data (JSON-LD)\n\n### Organization\n\n```html\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"name\": \"Example Company\",\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://example.com/logo.png\",\n  \"sameAs\": [\n    \"https://twitter.com/example\",\n    \"https://linkedin.com/company/example\"\n  ],\n  \"contactPoint\": {\n    \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\n    \"telephone\": \"+1-555-123-4567\",\n    \"contactType\": \"customer service\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### Article\n\n```html\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Article\",\n  \"headline\": \"How to Choose the Right Widget\",\n  \"description\": \"Complete guide to selecting widgets for your needs.\",\n  \"image\": \"https://example.com/article-image.jpg\",\n  \"author\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\n    \"name\": \"Jane Smith\",\n    \"url\": \"https://example.com/authors/jane-smith\"\n  },\n  \"publisher\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"Example Blog\",\n    \"logo\": {\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n      \"url\": \"https://example.com/logo.png\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"datePublished\": \"2024-01-15\",\n  \"dateModified\": \"2024-01-20\"\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### Product\n\n```html\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"name\": \"Blue Widget Pro\",\n  \"image\": \"https://example.com/blue-widget.jpg\",\n  \"description\": \"Premium blue widget with advanced features.\",\n  \"brand\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n    \"name\": \"WidgetCo\"\n  },\n  \"offers\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n    \"price\": \"49.99\",\n    \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n    \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n    \"url\": \"https://example.com/products/blue-widget\"\n  },\n  \"aggregateRating\": {\n    \"@type\": \"AggregateRating\",\n    \"ratingValue\": \"4.8\",\n    \"reviewCount\": \"1250\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### FAQ\n\n```html\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What colors are available?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Our widgets come in blue, red, and green.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the warranty?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"All widgets include a 2-year warranty.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### Breadcrumbs\n\n```html\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n  \"itemListElement\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n      \"position\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Home\",\n      \"item\": \"https://example.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n      \"position\": 2,\n      \"name\": \"Products\",\n      \"item\": \"https://example.com/products\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n      \"position\": 3,\n      \"name\": \"Blue Widgets\",\n      \"item\": \"https://example.com/products/blue-widgets\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### Validation\n\nTest structured data at:\n- [Google Rich Results Test](https://search.google.com/test/rich-results)\n- [Schema.org Validator](https://validator.schema.org/)\n\n---\n\n## Mobile SEO\n\n### Responsive design\n\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Not mobile-friendly -->\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=1024\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Responsive viewport -->\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n```\n\n### Tap targets\n\n```css\n/* ❌ Too small for mobile */\n.small-link {\n  padding: 4px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Adequate tap target */\n.mobile-friendly-link {\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  min-height: 48px;\n  min-width: 48px;\n}\n```\n\n### Font sizes\n\n```css\n/* ❌ Too small on mobile */\nbody {\n  font-size: 10px;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Readable without zooming */\nbody {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## International SEO\n\n### Hreflang tags\n\n```html\n<!-- For multi-language sites -->\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://example.com/page\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://example.com/es/page\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://example.com/fr/page\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://example.com/page\">\n```\n\n### Language declaration\n\n```html\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<!-- or -->\n<html lang=\"es-MX\">\n```\n\n---\n\n## SEO audit checklist\n\n### Critical\n- [ ] HTTPS enabled\n- [ ] robots.txt allows crawling\n- [ ] No `noindex` on important pages\n- [ ] Title tags present and unique\n- [ ] Single `<h1>` per page\n\n### High priority\n- [ ] Meta descriptions present\n- [ ] Sitemap submitted\n- [ ] Canonical URLs set\n- [ ] Mobile-responsive\n- [ ] Core Web Vitals passing\n\n### Medium priority\n- [ ] Structured data implemented\n- [ ] Internal linking strategy\n- [ ] Image alt text\n- [ ] Descriptive URLs\n- [ ] Breadcrumb navigation\n\n### Ongoing\n- [ ] Fix crawl errors in Search Console\n- [ ] Update sitemap when content changes\n- [ ] Monitor ranking changes\n- [ ] Check for broken links\n- [ ] Review Search Console insights\n\n---\n\n## Audit workflow\n\n1. Baseline: run Lighthouse and PageSpeed on key templates (home, category, detail, blog).\n2. Crawl: verify indexability, canonicals, and duplicate content (use Search Console + crawler).\n3. Fix blockers: `noindex`, `robots.txt`, canonical mismatches, redirect chains.\n4. On-page: titles, meta descriptions, headings, internal linking, image alt.\n5. Structured data: add JSON-LD and validate rich results.\n6. Re-verify: re-run Lighthouse/PageSpeed and check Search Console coverage.\n\n---\n\n## Common pitfalls\n\n- `noindex` or `X-Robots-Tag` accidentally set on important pages\n- `robots.txt` blocks CSS/JS or critical render resources\n- Canonical points to a different URL than the one indexed\n- Mixed `http`/`https` or `www`/non-`www` causing duplicate content\n- Redirect chains/loops (waste crawl budget and slow page load)\n- Parameterized URLs indexable (filters, sort, UTM) without canonical control\n- JavaScript-rendered content not visible in initial HTML\n- Soft 404s (200 status with \"not found\" content)\n- Sitemap includes non-canonical or `noindex` URLs\n- Hreflang tags missing reciprocal links or using wrong language/region codes\n\n---\n\n## Tools\n\n| Tool | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Google Search Console | Monitor indexing, fix issues |\n| Google PageSpeed Insights | Performance + Core Web Vitals |\n| Rich Results Test | Validate structured data |\n| Lighthouse | Full SEO audit |\n| Screaming Frog | Crawl analysis |\n\n---\n\n## Scripts (optional)\n\nScripts under `scripts/` for repeatable audits:\n\n- `scripts/lighthouse.sh`: run Lighthouse CLI against a URL or URL list and store JSON reports.\n- `scripts/pagespeed.sh`: call PageSpeed Insights API with `curl` and capture JSON output.\n- `scripts/search-console-export.mjs`: export Search Console Search Analytics data (requires OAuth access token).\n\nExample usage:\n```bash\n# Lighthouse (SEO category only)\nscripts/lighthouse.sh https://example.com\nscripts/lighthouse.sh urls.txt reports/lighthouse\n\n# PageSpeed Insights API (requires PAGESPEED_API_KEY)\nPAGESPEED_API_KEY=... scripts/pagespeed.sh https://example.com\nPAGESPEED_API_KEY=... scripts/pagespeed.sh urls.txt reports/pagespeed\n\n# Search Console API (requires GSC_ACCESS_TOKEN)\nGSC_ACCESS_TOKEN=... scripts/search-console-export.mjs https://example.com 2024-01-01 2024-01-31\n```\n\n---\n\n## AEO / AI Visibility Optimization\n\nAnswer Engine Optimization (AEO) focuses on making content discoverable and citable by AI agents (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, Google AI Overviews). While SEO targets rankings and clicks, AEO targets citations, mentions, and brand authority within AI-generated responses.\n\n### Key differences from SEO\n\n```\nSEO: Rank high → get clicks → drive traffic\nAEO: Be cited → own the answer → build authority\n\nSEO metric: Position, CTR, impressions\nAEO metric: Citations, mentions, AI visibility score\n\nSEO query: \"best project management software\"\nAEO query: \"What''s the best project management software for a remote team of 15 with budget under $500/month?\"\n```\n\n**Market shift:**\n- Gartner predicts 25% drop in traditional search volume by 2026 due to AI chatbots\n- 400M+ people use OpenAI products weekly\n- 58% of searches are now \"zero-click\" (answered directly in AI interface)\n\n### Content structure for AEO\n\n**Answer-first formatting:**\n\n```markdown\n<!-- ❌ SEO-style (context first) -->\n## What is AEO?\nIn recent years, the rise of AI-powered search has transformed \nhow users discover information. This shift has created new \nopportunities for brands. Answer Engine Optimization is...\n\n<!-- ✅ AEO-style (answer first) -->\n## What is AEO?\nAnswer Engine Optimization (AEO) is the practice of structuring \ncontent so AI systems can directly extract and cite answers. \nIt focuses on citations in AI responses rather than search rankings.\n\nUnlike traditional SEO, AEO optimizes for conversational queries \nand zero-click results where users get answers without visiting \nyour site.\n```\n\n**Guidelines:**\n- Lead with 40-60 word direct answer\n- Self-contained responses (AI extracts without surrounding context)\n- Conversational, natural language\n- Specific data > vague claims\n- Include quantified claims, dates, authoritative citations\n\n**Entity-based optimization:**\n\n```markdown\n<!-- ❌ Keyword-focused -->\n\"Our software helps teams collaborate better with features \nfor project management and communication.\"\n\n<!-- ✅ Entity-focused -->\n\"Acme PM is a project management platform for remote teams. \nFounded in 2020, serves 50,000+ companies. Key features: \nKanban boards, time tracking, Slack integration. Pricing: \n$12/user/month.\"\n```\n\nDefine who you are, what you do, and why AI should trust you.\n\n### Schema for AEO\n\nExpand beyond SEO schema to optimize for AI extraction.\n\n**Critical schema types for AEO:**\n\n1. **FAQPage** (highest AI citation rate)\n   - Template: `references/json-ld-templates.md`\n\n**FAQ answer guidelines for AEO:**\n- 40-60 words ideal (under 30 = lacks substance, over 80 = hard to extract)\n- Match visible H2/H3 headings to schema \"name\" property exactly\n- Include specific numbers, dates, and data\n- Self-contained (makes sense without context)\n- Natural question phrasing (how users actually ask)\n\n2. **Author + Organization** (trust signals)\n   - Template: `references/json-ld-templates.md`\n\n**Why it matters:** AI engines prioritize content from identifiable, authoritative sources. Use `sameAs` links to disambiguate your brand.\n\n3. **Product** (for e-commerce AEO)\n   - Template: `references/json-ld-templates.md`\n\nAllows AI shopping modules to show accurate pricing, availability, reviews.\n\n### Platform-specific optimization\n\nDifferent AI engines have different preferences. Balance all three for maximum citation probability.\n\n**ChatGPT:**\n- Neutral, encyclopedia-style tone\n- Authoritative external citations\n- Specific data and quantified claims\n- Formal structure\n\n```markdown\nExample: \"According to a 2025 Gartner study, 78% of enterprises \nadopted AI-powered search tools. The primary drivers were cost \nreduction (cited by 62% of respondents) and improved accuracy \n(58%). Source: Gartner AI Search Report 2025.\"\n```\n\n**Perplexity:**\n- Conversational, experience-driven\n- Practical examples and case studies\n- Community insights and real-world context\n- Less formal tone\n\n```markdown\nExample: \"Most teams start with the free tier and upgrade after \n2-3 months once they''ve proven ROI. Based on feedback from 500+ \ncustomers, common triggers for upgrading include hitting user \nlimits or needing advanced reporting.\"\n```\n\n**Google AI Overviews:**\n- E-E-A-T signals (Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, Trust)\n- Fresh content with recent dates\n- Featured snippet-friendly formatting\n- Mobile-optimized structure\n\n```markdown\nExample: \"Updated February 2026: Current pricing starts at \n$12/user/month (annual billing). Month-to-month adds 20%. \nEducation and nonprofit discounts available. No free tier \nas of Q1 2026.\"\n```\n\n### AEO measurement & tools\n\n**Metrics:**\n- Citation frequency (how often AI mentions your brand)\n- Visibility score (presence across AI platforms)\n- Context quality (positive/neutral/negative sentiment)\n- Source attribution (which URLs AI cites)\n\n**Tracking AI referral traffic:**\n\nIn Google Analytics 4, filter traffic sources:\n- `chat.openai.com` (ChatGPT)\n- `perplexity.ai`\n- `gemini.google.com`\n- `copilot.microsoft.com`\n\nMonitor these as separate acquisition sources.\n\nUse your preferred AEO monitoring tool to track citation frequency, context, and source attribution.\n\n### AEO audit checklist\n\n#### Content audit\n- [ ] All key pages have 40-60 word direct answers upfront\n- [ ] FAQ sections with self-contained answers\n- [ ] Conversational language matching natural queries\n- [ ] Specific data (numbers, dates, sources) not vague claims\n- [ ] Author bios and organization info visible\n- [ ] Content updated with recent dates (freshness)\n\n#### Schema audit\n- [ ] FAQPage schema on FAQ/guide pages\n- [ ] Author schema on all articles/blogs\n- [ ] Organization schema site-wide\n- [ ] Product schema on product pages (if e-commerce)\n- [ ] Article schema with datePublished/dateModified\n- [ ] Schema matches visible content exactly (no hidden markup)\n- [ ] Validate with Google Rich Results Test\n\n#### Technical audit\n- [ ] JSON-LD format (preferred by AI engines)\n- [ ] Schema.org standards compliance\n- [ ] No conflicting or duplicate schema\n- [ ] Fast page load (AI crawlers prefer fast sites)\n- [ ] Clean HTML structure (semantic headings)\n- [ ] Mobile-optimized (especially for Google AI Overviews)\n\n#### Entity & authority signals\n- [ ] Clear brand identity (who you are, what you do)\n- [ ] Consistent NAP (name, address, phone) across web\n- [ ] `sameAs` links to LinkedIn, Twitter, official profiles\n- [ ] External citations and backlinks from authoritative sources\n- [ ] Active presence on review platforms\n- [ ] Google Business Profile optimized (local businesses)\n\n#### AI visibility monitoring\n- [ ] Test top 10-20 commercial queries monthly\n- [ ] Track AI referral traffic in GA4\n- [ ] Monitor brand mentions across AI platforms\n- [ ] Check citation context (positive/neutral/negative)\n- [ ] Verify factual accuracy of AI responses about your brand\n- [ ] Set up alerts for visibility changes (if using paid tools)\n\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [Google Search Central](https://developers.google.com/search)\n- [Schema.org](https://schema.org/)\n- [Core Web Vitals](../core-web-vitals/SKILL.md)\n- [Web Quality Audit](../web-quality-audit/SKILL.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:24:52.377Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced SEO optimization capabilities based on Lighthouse audits and Google Search guidelines.","zh":"非常适合需要基于 Lighthouse 审计和 Google 搜索指南的高级 SEO 优化功能的 Web 开发代理。","ja":"Lighthouse 監査と Google 検索ガイドラインに基づいた高度な SEO 最適化機能を必要とする Web 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Lighthouse 감사 및 Google 검색 가이드라인을 기반으로 하는 고급 SEO 최적화 기능을 필요로 하는 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan capacidades de optimización de SEO avanzadas basadas en auditorías de Lighthouse y pautas de búsqueda de Google.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant des capacités d''optimisation de SEO avancées basées sur des audits Lighthouse et des directives de recherche Google.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte SEO-Optimierungs-Funktionen auf der Grundlage von Lighthouse-Audits und Google-Suchrichtlinien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que precisam de capacidades avançadas de otimização do SEO com base em auditorias do Lighthouse e diretrizes de Pesquisa do Google.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации SEO на основе аудитов Lighthouse и руководств по поиску Google.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير الويب الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين محركات البحث بناءً على مراجعات لighthouse وإرشادات بحث جوجل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform technical SEO audits, leveraging robots.txt and meta robots protocols for optimal crawlability, while ensuring on-page optimization and structured data compliance for enhanced search engine ranking.","zh":"赋予代理商执行技术 SEO 审计的能力，利用 robots.txt 和元机器人协议实现最佳爬行性，同时确保页面优化和结构化数据合规以提高搜索引擎排名。","ja":"エージェントが技術 SEO 監査を実行できるようにし、robots.txt とメタロボットプロトコルを使用して最適なクロール性を実現し、ページ最適化と構造化データのコンプライアンスを確保して、検索エンジンのランキングを高める。","ko":"에이전트가 기술 SEO 감사를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, robots.txt 및 메타 로봇 프로토콜을 사용하여 최적의 크롤링을 달성하면서 페이지 최적화 및 구조화된 데이터 준수를 보장하여 검색 엔진 순위를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de SEO técnicas, aprovechando los protocolos robots.txt y meta robots para una capacidad de rastreo óptima, al tiempo que garantiza la optimización en la página y el cumplimiento de los datos estructurados para una mejor clasificación en los motores de búsqueda.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de SEO techniques, en exploitant les protocoles robots.txt et meta robots pour une crawlabilité optimale, tout en assurant l''optimisation en page et la conformité des données structurées pour un meilleur référencement dans les moteurs de recherche.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, technische SEO-Audits durchzuführen, indem sie die Protokolle robots.txt und meta robots für eine optimale Crawlfähigkeit nutzen und gleichzeitig eine Onpage-Optimierung und die Einhaltung von strukturierten Daten für eine verbesserte Suchmaschinenrangliste sicherstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias técnicas de SEO, aproveitando os protocolos robots.txt e meta robots para uma rastreabilidade ótima, garantindo ao mesmo tempo a otimização na página e a conformidade com dados estruturados para uma classificação melhorada de mecanismos de busca.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить технические аудиты SEO, используя протоколы robots.txt и meta robots для оптимальной индексации, обеспечивая при этом оптимизацию на странице и соблюдение структурированных данных для улучшения рейтинга поисковых систем.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إجراء مراجعات تقنية لتحسين محركات البحث، مستفيدة من بروتوكولات robots.txt و meta robots لتحقيق أفضل قابلية للفهرسة، مع ضمان تحسينات على الصفحة والامتثال للبيانات المهيكلة لتحسين تصنيف محركات البحث."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website crawlability using robots.txt and meta robots directives","Optimizing on-page elements for improved search engine ranking","Implementing structured data for enhanced search engine results pages (SERPs) display"],"zh":["使用 robots.txt 和元机器人指令对网站爬行性进行审计","优化页面元素以提高搜索引擎排名","实现结构化数据以增强搜索引擎结果页面（SERPs）显示"],"ja":["robots.txt とメタロボットディレクティブを使用して Web サイトのクロール性を監査する","ページ要素を最適化して検索エンジンのランキングを向上させる","構造化データを実装して検索エンジン結果ページ（SERPs）を強化表示する"],"ko":["robots.txt 및 메타 로봇 지시문을 사용하여 웹 사이트의 크롤링 가능성에 대한 감사를 수행한다.","페이지 요소를 최적화하여 검색 엔진 순위를 향상시킨다.","구조화된 데이터를 구현하여 검색 엔진 결과 페이지(SERPs)를 강화하여 표시한다."],"es":["Auditoría de la capacidad de rastreo del sitio web utilizando directivas robots.txt y meta robots","Optimización de los elementos en la página para una mejor clasificación en los motores de búsqueda","Implementación de datos estructurados para una mejor visualización de las páginas de resultados de los motores de búsqueda (SERPs)"],"fr":["Audit de la crawlabilité du site Web en utilisant des directives robots.txt et meta robots","Optimisation des éléments en page pour un meilleur référencement dans les moteurs de recherche","Mise en œuvre de données structurées pour une meilleure affichage des pages de résultats de recherche (SERPs)"],"de":["Auditoría der Crawlfähigkeit der Website unter Verwendung von robots.txt- und meta robots-Direktiven","Optimierung der Onpage-Elemente für eine verbesserte Suchmaschinenrangliste","Implementierung von strukturierten Daten für eine verbesserte Anzeige der Suchmaschinenergebnisseiten (SERPs)"],"pt":["Auditoria da rastreabilidade do site usando diretivas robots.txt e meta robots","Otimização de elementos na página para melhorar o ranking de mecanismos de busca","Implementação de dados estruturados para exibição aprimorada de páginas de resultados de mecanismos de busca (SERPs)"],"ru":["Аудит индексации сайта с использованием директив robots.txt и meta robots","Оптимизация элементов на странице для улучшения рейтинга поисковых систем","Реализация структурированных данных для улучшения отображения страниц результатов поисковых систем (SERPs)"],"ar":["مراجعة قابلية فهرسة الموقع باستخدام توجيهات robots.txt و meta robots","تحسين عناصر الصفحة لتحسين تصنيف محركات البحث","تنفيذ البيانات المهيكلة لتحسين عرض صفحات نتائج محركات البحث (SERPs)"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to website source code for robots.txt and meta robots implementation","Limited to Google Search guidelines and Lighthouse SEO audits"],"zh":["需要访问网站源代码以实现 robots.txt 和元机器人实现","仅限于 Google 搜索指南和 Lighthouse SEO 审计"],"ja":["robots.txt とメタロボットの実装のために Web サイトのソースコードへのアクセスが必要","Google 検索ガイドラインと Lighthouse SEO 監査のみに限定される"],"ko":["로봇트.txt 및 메타 로봇 구현을 위해 웹 사이트 소스 코드에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","구글 검색 가이드라인 및 라이트하우스 SEO 감사에만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso al código fuente de la página web para la implementación de robots.txt y meta robots","Limitado a las pautas de búsqueda de Google y auditorías de SEO de Lighthouse"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code source du site Web pour la mise en œuvre de robots.txt et meta robots","Limité aux directives de recherche Google et audits de SEO Lighthouse"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf den Quellcode der Website für die Implementierung von robots.txt und meta robots","Begrenzt auf die Suchrichtlinien von Google und Lighthouse-SEO-Audits"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código fonte do site para implementação de robots.txt e meta robots","Limitado às diretrizes de Pesquisa do Google e auditorias de SEO do Lighthouse"],"ru":["Требует доступа к исходному коду сайта для реализации robots.txt и meta robots","Ограничен руководствами по поиску Google и аудитами SEO Lighthouse"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى код المصدر للموقع لتنفيذ robots.txt و meta robots","محدود بإرشادات بحث جوجل ومراجعات تحسين محركات البحث لighthouse"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
