인 지원","EAS 통합","자동화 배포 및 PR预览","TestFlight 및 앱스토어 제출"],"es":["Despliegue de aplicaciones en todas las plataformas","Configuración de flujos de trabajo de CI/CD","Optimización de la tienda de aplicaciones","Soporte para OAuth y autenticación social","Integración con NativeWind y Panda CSS"],"fr":["Déploiement d''applications sur toutes les plateformes","Configuration de flux de travail CI/CD","Optimisation du magasin d''applications","Prise en charge d''OAuth et d''authentification sociale","Intégration avec NativeWind et Panda CSS"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Anwendungen auf allen Plattformen","Konfiguration von CI/CD-Workflows","Optimierung des App-Stores","Unterstützung für OAuth und soziale Authentifizierung","Integration mit NativeWind und Panda CSS"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicativos Expo em todas as plataformas","Uso de EAS para automação de implantação","Suporte a OAuth com Socialite","Integração com Google e Apple Sign In","Gerenciamento de metadados da App Store","Otimização de ASO"],"ru":["Развертывание приложений Expo на всех платформах","Использование EAS для автоматизации развертывания","Поддержка OAuth с Socialite","Интеграция с Google и Apple Sign In","Управление метаданными App Store","Оптимизация ASO"],"ar":["نشر تطبيقات إكسبو على جميع المنصات","استخدام EAS للتنصيب التلقائي","دعم OAuth مع Socialite","التكامل مع Google و Apple Sign In","إدارة البيانات الوصفية لتطبيق المتجر","تحسين ASO"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo 部署","EAS","OAuth","社交登录","跨平台部署","自动化部署"],"ja":["Expo デプロイメント","EAS","OAuth","ソーシャル ログイン","クロスプラットフォーム デプロイ","自動化デプロイ"],"ko":["Expo 배포","EAS","OAuth","소셜 로그인","크로스 플랫폼 배포","자동화 배포"],"es":["despliegue de expo","eas","ci/cd","optimización de tienda de aplicaciones","oauth","autenticación social","nativewind","panda css"],"fr":["déploiement expo","eas","ci/cd","optimisation du magasin d''applications","oauth","authentification sociale","nativewind","panda css"],"de":["expo-deployment","eas","ci/cd","app-store-optimierung","oauth","soziale authentifizierung","nativewind","panda css"],"pt":["expo-deployment","implantação de aplicativos","EAS","OAuth","Socialite","Google Sign In","Apple Sign In","ASO","metadados da App Store"],"ru":["экспо-развертывание","развертывание приложений","EAS","OAuth","Socialite","Google Sign In","Apple Sign In","ASO","метаданные App Store"],"ar":["تطبيق إكسبو","نشر التطبيقات","EAS","OAuth","Socialite","Google Sign In","Apple Sign In","ASO","بيانات وصفية لتطبيق المتجر"]}},"owner":"Liinkiing","repo":"larastack","repoPath":"Liinkiing/larastack","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expo-deployment","description":"Deploying Expo apps to iOS App Store, Android Play Store, web hosting, and API routes","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Goog","body":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Google Play Store\n- ./references/ios-app-store.md -- iOS App Store submission and review process\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Install EAS CLI\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g eas-cli\neas login\n```\n\n### Initialize EAS\n\n```bash\nnpx eas-cli@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `eas.json` with build profiles.\n\n## Build Commands\n\n### Production Builds\n\n```bash\n# iOS App Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production\n\n# Android Play Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production\n\n# Both platforms\nnpx eas-cli@latest build --profile production\n```\n\n### Submit to Stores\n\n```bash\n# iOS: Build and submit to App Store Connect\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production --submit\n\n# Android: Build and submit to Play Store\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production --submit\n\n# Shortcut for iOS TestFlight\nnpx testflight\n```\n\n## Web Deployment\n\nDeploy web apps using EAS Hosting:\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to production\nnpx expo export -p web\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy --prod\n\n# Deploy PR preview\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy\n```\n\n## EAS Configuration\n\nStandard `eas.json` for production deployments:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"cli\": {\n    \"version\": \">= 16.0.1\",\n    \"appVersionSource\": \"remote\"\n  },\n  \"build\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"autoIncrement\": true,\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"resourceClass\": \"m-medium\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"development\": {\n      \"developmentClient\": true,\n      \"distribution\": \"internal\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"submit\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"appleId\": \"your@email.com\",\n        \"ascAppId\": \"1234567890\"\n      },\n      \"android\": {\n        \"serviceAccountKeyPath\": \"./google-service-account.json\",\n        \"track\": \"internal\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Platform-Specific Guides\n\n### iOS\n\n- Use `npx testflight` for quick TestFlight submissions\n- Configure Apple credentials via `eas credentials`\n- See ./reference/testflight.md for credential setup\n- See ./reference/ios-app-store.md for App Store submission\n\n### Android\n\n- Set up Google Play Console service account\n- Configure tracks: internal → closed → open → production\n- See ./reference/play-store.md for detailed setup\n\n### Web\n\n- EAS Hosting provides preview URLs for PRs\n- Production deploys to your custom domain\n- See ./reference/workflows.md for CI/CD automation\n\n## Automated Deployments\n\nUse EAS Workflows for CI/CD:\n\n```yaml\n# .eas/workflows/release.yml\nname: Release\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build-ios:\n    type: build\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n\n  submit-ios:\n    type: submit\n    needs: [build-ios]\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n```\n\nSee ./reference/workflows.md for more workflow examples.\n\n## Version Management\n\nEAS manages version numbers automatically with `appVersionSource: \"remote\"`:\n\n```bash\n# Check current versions\neas build:version:get\n\n# Manually set version\neas build:version:set -p ios --build-number 42\n```\n\n## Monitoring\n\n```bash\n# List recent builds\neas build:list\n\n# Check build status\neas build:view\n\n# View submission status\neas submit:list\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:25:33.219Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Agents requiring streamlined Expo application deployment across multiple platforms using EAS","zh":"适合需要在多个平台上使用EAS进行Expo应用程序部署的移动代理","ja":"EASを使用して複数のプラットフォームにExpoアプリケーションをデプロイする必要があるモバイルエージェントに最適","ko":"EAS를 사용해 여러 플랫폼에 Expo 애플리케이션을 배포해야 하는 모바일 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes móviles que requieren una implementación de aplicaciones Expo optimizada en varias plataformas utilizando EAS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents mobiles nécessitant un déploiement d''applications Expo rationalisé sur plusieurs plateformes à l''aide d''EAS","de":"Ideal für Mobile Agents, die eine optimierte Expo-Anwendungsbereitstellung auf mehreren Plattformen mithilfe von EAS benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Móveis que exigem uma implantação de aplicativos Expo simplificada em várias plataformas usando EAS","ru":"Идеально для мобильных агентов, требующих упрощенную установку приложений Expo на нескольких платформах с помощью EAS","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحمولة التي تتطلب نشر تطبيقات Expo المُيسَر عبر منصات متعددة باستخدام EAS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate deployments and PR previews using CI/CD workflows, while also managing App Store metadata and submitting builds to TestFlight and the Google Play Store, leveraging OAuth with Socialite and native Google and Apple Sign In on mobile","zh":"赋予代理人使用CI/CD工作流自动化部署和PR预览的能力，同时还可以管理应用商店元数据，并将构建提交到TestFlight和Google Play Store，利用OAuth与Socialite以及移动设备上的原生Google和Apple登录","ja":"CI/CDワークフローを使用したデプロイとPRプレビューの自動化、およびApp Storeメタデータの管理とTestFlightおよびGoogle Play Storeへのビルドの提出を可能にし、OAuthとSocialiteおよびモバイルデバイスのネイティブGoogleとAppleサインインを利用","ko":"CI/CD 워크플ロー 사용에 의한 배포 및 PR 미리 보기를 자동화하고, 앱 스토어 메타데이터 관리 및 TestFlight 및 Google Play 스토어에 빌드를 제출할 수 있으며, OAuth 및 Socialite 및 모바일 기기의 네이티브 Google 및 Apple 로그인을 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar implementaciones y vistas previas de PR utilizando flujos de trabajo de CI/CD, al mismo tiempo que gestionan metadatos de la App Store y envían compilaciones a TestFlight y Google Play Store, aprovechando OAuth con Socialite y inicio de sesión nativo de Google y Apple en dispositivos móviles","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les déploiements et les aperçus de PR en utilisant des flux de travail CI/CD, tout en gérant les métadonnées de l''App Store et en soumettant des builds à TestFlight et au Google Play Store, en exploitant OAuth avec Socialite et la connexion native Google et Apple sur mobile","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Bereitstellungen und PR-Vorschauen mithilfe von CI/CD-Workflows zu automatisieren, während sie gleichzeitig App Store-Metadaten verwalten und Builds an TestFlight und den Google Play Store senden, indem sie OAuth mit Socialite und native Google- und Apple-Anmeldung auf mobilen Geräten nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar implantações e visualizações de PR usando fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD, além de gerenciar metadados da App Store e enviar compilações para o TestFlight e a Google Play Store, utilizando OAuth com Socialite e entrada do Google e Apple nativa em dispositivos móveis","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать развертывания и предварительные просмотры PR с помощью рабочих процессов CI/CD, а также управлять метаданными App Store и отправлять сборки в TestFlight и Google Play Store, используя OAuth с Socialite и родную авторизацию Google и Apple на мобильных устройствах","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير آلي للنشرات و معاينة طلبات السحب باستخدام سير عمل CI/CD، بالإضافة إلى إدارة بيانات تعريف متجر التطبيقات وإرسال المجمعات إلى TestFlight ومتجر Google Play، مستخدمة OAuth مع Socialite وتسجيل الدخول الأصلي من Google و Apple على الأجهزة المحمولة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Expo application deployments across web and mobile platforms","Generating and submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing","Managing and optimizing App Store metadata for improved discoverability"],"zh":["跨web和移动平台自动化Expo应用程序部署","生成并将iOS构建提交到TestFlight进行beta测试","管理和优化应用商店元数据以提高发现度"],"ja":["Webとモバイルプラットフォームを跨いでExpoアプリケーションのデプロイを自動化する","iOSビルドを生成してTestFlightに提出してベータテストを行う","App Storeメタデータを管理して最適化して発見性を向上させる"],"ko":["웹 및 모바일 플랫폼을跨いで Expo 애플리케이션 배포를 자동화","iOS 빌드를 생성하여 TestFlight에 제출하여 베타 테스트를 수행","앱 스토어 메타데이터를 관리 및 최적화하여 발견성을 향상"],"es":["Automatizar implementaciones de aplicaciones Expo en plataformas web y móviles","Generar y enviar compilaciones de iOS a TestFlight para pruebas beta","Gestionar y optimizar metadatos de la App Store para mejorar la capacidad de descubrimiento"],"fr":["Automatiser les déploiements d''applications Expo sur les plateformes web et mobiles","Générer et soumettre des builds iOS à TestFlight pour des tests bêta","Gérer et optimiser les métadonnées de l''App Store pour améliorer la découverte"],"de":["Automatisieren der Bereitstellung von Expo-Anwendungen auf Web- und Mobilplattformen","Erzeugen und Senden von iOS-Builds an TestFlight für Betatests","Verwalten und Optimieren von App Store-Metadaten für verbesserte Auffindbarkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de aplicativos Expo em plataformas web e móveis","Gerar e enviar compilações do iOS para o TestFlight para testes beta","Gerenciar e otimizar metadados da App Store para melhor descoberta"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывания приложений Expo на веб- и мобильных платформах","Генерировать и отправлять сборки iOS в TestFlight для бета-тестирования","Управлять и оптимизировать метаданные App Store для улучшения обнаружения"],"ar":["توفير آلي لنشر تطبيقات Expo عبر منصات الويب والمحمولة","إنشاء وإرسال مجمعات iOS إلى TestFlight لاختبار البيتا","إدارة وتحسين بيانات تعريف متجر التطبيقات لتحسين الاكتشاف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo Application Services (EAS) setup","Limited to Expo applications","Native Google and Apple Sign In required for mobile OAuth"],"zh":["需要设置Expo Application Services (EAS)","仅限于Expo应用程序","移动设备上的原生Google和Apple登录所需的OAuth"],"ja":["Expo Application Services (EAS)の設定が必要","Expoアプリケーションに限定される","モバイルデバイスのネイティブGoogleとAppleサインインが必要なOAuth"],"ko":["Expo Application Services (EAS) 설정이 필요","Expo 애플리케이션에만 제한","모바일 기기의 네이티브 Google 및 Apple 로그인이 필요한 OAuth"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Servicios de Aplicaciones Expo (EAS)","Limitado a aplicaciones Expo","Se requiere inicio de sesión nativo de Google y Apple para OAuth en dispositivos móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration des Services d''Application Expo (EAS)","Limité aux applications Expo","Connexion native Google et Apple requise pour OAuth sur mobile"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration von Expo-Anwendungsdiensten (EAS)","Begrenzt auf Expo-Anwendungen","Native Google- und Apple-Anmeldung erforderlich für OAuth auf mobilen Geräten"],"pt":["Exige configuração dos Serviços de Aplicativos Expo (EAS)","Limitado a aplicativos Expo","Entrada do Google e Apple nativa necessária para OAuth móvel"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервисов приложений Expo (EAS)","Ограничен приложениями Expo","Родная авторизация Google и Apple необходима для мобильного OAuth"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خدمات تطبيقات Expo (EAS)","محدود بتطبيقات Expo","تسجيل الدخول الأصلي لجوجل وآبل مطلوب ل OAuth المحمول"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
