tionは開発プロセスの重要な原則であり、作業完了前に検証を行うことを保証する","ko":"검증 전 완료 스킬은 개발 프로세스에서 중요한 원칙으로, 작업 완료 전 검증을 보장한다","es":"La verificación antes de finalizar es un principio fundamental que garantiza la honestidad y la eficiencia en el trabajo.","fr":"La vérification avant achèvement est un principe fondamental qui garantit l''honnêteté et l''efficacité dans le travail.","de":"Die Verifizierung vor Abschluss ist ein Grundprinzip, das die Ehrlichkeit und Effizienz in der Arbeit gewährleistet.","pt":"Verificação antes da conclusão é um princípio fundamental para garantir a qualidade e a honestidade nos projetos de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Верификация до завершения является фундаментальным принципом для обеспечения качества и честности в проектах разработки.","ar":"التحقق قبل الاستكمال هو مبدأ أساسي لضمان الجودة والنزاهة في مشاريع التطوير.","en":"나다운 집을 만들어주는 여정, 하우미"},"definition":{"en":"나다운 집을 만들어주는 여정, 하우미"},"features":{"zh":["确保工作完成前验证","提高开发效率","减少错误和缺陷","提高代码质量","简化测试和调试过程"],"ja":["作業完了前に検証を行う","開発効率を高める","エラーと欠陥を減らす","コード品質を高める","テストとデバッグプロセスを簡素化する"],"ko":["작업 완료 전 검증을 수행한다","개발 효율성을 높인다","오류와 결함을 줄인다","코드 품질을 높인다","테스트와 디버깅 프로세스를 단순화한다"],"es":["Principio fundamental de honestidad y eficiencia","Comprobación de la evidencia antes de claimar la finalización","Mejora de la calidad del trabajo","Reducción de errores y retrasos","Incremento de la transparencia y la confianza"],"fr":["Principe fondamental d''honnêteté et d''efficacité","Vérification des preuves avant de revendiquer l''achèvement","Amélioration de la qualité du travail","Réduction des erreurs et des retards","Augmentation de la transparence et de la confiance"],"de":["Grundprinzip von Ehrlichkeit und Effizienz","Überprüfung der Beweise vor dem Anspruch auf Abschluss","Verbesserung der Arbeitsqualität","Verringerung von Fehlern und Verzögerungen","Erhöhung der Transparenz und des Vertrauens"],"pt":["Garantia de qualidade","Prevenção de erros","Eficiência nos projetos","Transparência nos processos","Melhoria da produtividade"],"ru":["Гарантия качества","Предотвращение ошибок","Эффективность в проектах","Прозрачность процессов","Повышение производительности"],"ar":["ضمان الجودة","منع الأخطاء","الكفاءة في المشاريع","الشفافية في العمليات","تحسين الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["验证前完成","开发原则","效率提高","代码质量","测试和调试","开发流程"],"ja":["Verification Before Completion","開発原則","効率向上","コード品質","テストとデバッグ","開発プロセス"],"ko":["검증 전 완료","개발 원칙","효율성 향상","코드 품질","테스트와 디버깅","개발 프로세스"],"es":["verificación antes de finalizar","principio fundamental","honestidad y eficiencia","comprobación de evidencia","mejora de la calidad","reducción de errores","transparencia y confianza"],"fr":["vérification avant achèvement","principe fondamental","honnêteté et efficacité","vérification des preuves","amélioration de la qualité","réduction des erreurs","transparence et confiance"],"de":["Verifizierung vor Abschluss","Grundprinzip","Ehrlichkeit und Effizienz","Überprüfung der Beweise","Verbesserung der Arbeitsqualität","Verringerung von Fehlern","Transparenz und Vertrauen"],"pt":["verificação antes da conclusão","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","eficiência nos projetos","práticas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de projetos"],"ru":["верификация до завершения","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","эффективность в проектах","практики разработки","управление проектами"],"ar":["التحقق قبل الاستكمال","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","الكفاءة في المشاريع","ممارسات التطوير","إدارة المشاريع"]}},"owner":"TEAM-HOUME","repo":"HOUME-CLIENT","repoPath":"TEAM-HOUME/HOUME-CLIENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"verification-before-completion","description":"Use when about to claim work is complete, fixed, or passing, before committing or creating PRs - requires running verification commands and confirming output before making any success claims; evidence before assertions always","bodyPreview":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing sati","body":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing satisfaction:\n\n1. IDENTIFY: What command proves this claim?\n2. RUN: Execute the FULL command (fresh, complete)\n3. READ: Full output, check exit code, count failures\n4. VERIFY: Does output confirm the claim?\n   - If NO: State actual status with evidence\n   - If YES: State claim WITH evidence\n5. ONLY THEN: Make the claim\n\nSkip any step = lying, not verifying\n```\n\n## Common Failures\n\n| Claim                 | Requires                        | Not Sufficient                 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| Tests pass            | Test command output: 0 failures | Previous run, \"should pass\"    |\n| Linter clean          | Linter output: 0 errors         | Partial check, extrapolation   |\n| Build succeeds        | Build command: exit 0           | Linter passing, logs look good |\n| Bug fixed             | Test original symptom: passes   | Code changed, assumed fixed    |\n| Regression test works | Red-green cycle verified        | Test passes once               |\n| Agent completed       | VCS diff shows changes          | Agent reports \"success\"        |\n| Requirements met      | Line-by-line checklist          | Tests passing                  |\n\n## Red Flags - STOP\n\n- Using \"should\", \"probably\", \"seems to\"\n- Expressing satisfaction before verification (\"Great!\", \"Perfect!\", \"Done!\", etc.)\n- About to commit/push/PR without verification\n- Trusting agent success reports\n- Relying on partial verification\n- Thinking \"just this once\"\n- Tired and wanting work over\n- **ANY wording implying success without having run verification**\n\n## Rationalization Prevention\n\n| Excuse                                  | Reality                |\n| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| \"Should work now\"                       | RUN the verification   |\n| \"I''m confident\"                         | Confidence ≠ evidence  |\n| \"Just this once\"                        | No exceptions          |\n| \"Linter passed\"                         | Linter ≠ compiler      |\n| \"Agent said success\"                    | Verify independently   |\n| \"I''m tired\"                             | Exhaustion ≠ excuse    |\n| \"Partial check is enough\"               | Partial proves nothing |\n| \"Different words so rule doesn''t apply\" | Spirit over letter     |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n**Tests:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run test command] [See: 34/34 pass] \"All tests pass\"\n❌ \"Should pass now\" / \"Looks correct\"\n```\n\n**Regression tests (TDD Red-Green):**\n\n```\n✅ Write → Run (pass) → Revert fix → Run (MUST FAIL) → Restore → Run (pass)\n❌ \"I''ve written a regression test\" (without red-green verification)\n```\n\n**Build:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run build] [See: exit 0] \"Build passes\"\n❌ \"Linter passed\" (linter doesn''t check compilation)\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n```\n✅ Re-read plan → Create checklist → Verify each → Report gaps or completion\n❌ \"Tests pass, phase complete\"\n```\n\n**Agent delegation:**\n\n```\n✅ Agent reports success → Check VCS diff → Verify changes → Report actual state\n❌ Trust agent report\n```\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nFrom 24 failure memories:\n\n- your human partner said \"I don''t believe you\" - trust broken\n- Undefined functions shipped - would crash\n- Missing requirements shipped - incomplete features\n- Time wasted on false completion → redirect → rework\n- Violates: \"Honesty is a core value. If you lie, you''ll be replaced.\"\n\n## When To Apply\n\n**ALWAYS before:**\n\n- ANY variation of success/completion claims\n- ANY expression of satisfaction\n- ANY positive statement about work state\n- Committing, PR creation, task completion\n- Moving to next task\n- Delegating to agents\n\n**Rule applies to:**\n\n- Exact phrases\n- Paraphrases and synonyms\n- Implications of success\n- ANY communication suggesting completion/correctness\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**No shortcuts for verification.**\n\nRun the command. Read the output. THEN claim the result.\n\nThis is non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:25:16.889Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for QA Agents requiring rigorous verification protocols to ensure accuracy and honesty in completion claims.","zh":"非常适合需要严格验证协议的质量保证代理，以确保完成声明的准确性和真实性。","ja":"完了の主張における正確性と誠実性を確保するために、厳格な検証プロトコルを必要とするQAエージェントに最適です。","ko":"완료 주장의 정확성과 정직성을 보장하기 위해 엄격한 검증 프로토콜이 필요한 QA 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de QA que requieren protocolos de verificación rigurosos para garantizar la precisión y la honestidad en las reclamaciones de finalización.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de QA nécessitant des protocoles de vérification rigoureux pour assurer l''exactitude et l''honnêteté des réclamations de finition.","de":"Ideal für QA-Agenten, die strenge Überprüfungsprotokolle erfordern, um Genauigkeit und Ehrlichkeit bei der Fertigstellung von Ansprüchen zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de QA que requerem protocolos de verificação rigorosos para garantir a exatidão e a honestidade nas reclamações de conclusão.","ru":"Идеально для агентов QA, требующих строгих протоколов верификации для обеспечения точности и честности в заявлениях об окончании.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء QA الذين يتطلبون بروتوكولات التحقق القاسية لضمان الدقة والصدق في مطالبات الإكمال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce the core principle of evidence before claims, always, utilizing the Iron Law of NO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE, thereby ensuring the integrity of work completion status through strict verification gate functions.","zh":"赋能代理始终执行‘主张之前必先有证据’的核心原则，利用‘没有最新验证证据就不能声称完成’的铁律，通过严格的验证门功能确保工作完成状态的完整性。","ja":"常に「主張の前に証拠」という核心原則を実施するようエージェントを強化し、「最新の検証証拠なしに完了を主張してはならない」という鉄則を利用することで、厳格な検証ゲート機能を通じて作業完了状況の完全性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 ''주장 전에 증거''라는 핵심 원칙을 항상 시행할 수 있도록 하여, ''최신 검증 증거 없이는 완료 주장 없음''의 철칙을 활용함으로써 엄격한 검증 게이트 기능을 통해 작업 완료 상태의 무결성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes hacer cumplir el principio fundamental de evidencia antes de las reclamaciones, siempre, utilizando la Ley de Hierro de NO RECLAMACIONES DE FINALIZACIÓN SIN EVIDENCIA DE VERIFICACIÓN FRESCA, garantizando así la integridad del estado de finalización del trabajo a través de funciones de verificación estrictas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter le principe fondamental de preuve avant les réclamations, toujours, en utilisant la Loi de Fer de PAS DE RÉCLAMATIONS DE FINITION SANS PREUVES DE VÉRIFICATION FRAÎCHES, assurant ainsi l''intégrité de l''état d''achèvement du travail grâce à des fonctions de vérification strictes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, das Kernprinzip der Beweisführung vor Ansprüchen durchzusetzen, immer, unter Verwendung des Eisernen Gesetzes von KEINE ANSPRÜCHE ÜBER DIE FERTIGSTELLUNG OHNE FRESHE ÜBERPRÜFUNGSBEWEISE, und gewährleistet so die Integrität des Arbeitsabschlussstatus durch strenge Überprüfungsfunktionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor o princípio fundamental de evidências antes de reclamações, sempre, utilizando a Lei de Ferro de NENHUMA RECLAMAÇÃO DE CONCLUSÃO SEM EVIDÊNCIAS DE VERIFICAÇÃO FRESCA, garantindo assim a integridade do status de conclusão do trabalho por meio de funções de portão de verificação estritas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов полномочиями по обеспечению основного принципа доказательств до заявлений, всегда, используя Железный закон НИ ОДНОГО ЗАЯВЛЕНИЯ О ЗАВЕРШЕНИИ БЕЗ СВЕЖИХ ДОКАЗАТЕЛЬСТВ ВЕРИФИКАЦИИ, тем самым обеспечивая целостность статуса завершения работы посредством строгих функций ворота верификации.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء صلاحية فرض المبدأ الأساسي للأدلة قبل المطالبات، دائمًا، باستخدام قانون الحديد لا مطالبات إكمال بدون أدلة تحقق tươiة، وبالتالي ضمان سلامة حالة إكمال العمل من خلال وظائف بوابة التحقق الصارمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing verification protocols before project completion","Validating task status with fresh evidence","Preventing premature completion claims without proper verification"],"zh":["在项目完成前执行验证协议","用最新证据验证任务状态","防止在没有适当验证的情况下过早提出完成声明"],"ja":["プロジェクト完了前に検証プロトコルを実施する","最新の証拠でタスクの状況を検証する","適切な検証なしでの時期尚早な完了主張を防止する"],"ko":["프로젝트 완료 전 검증 프로토콜 시행","최신 증거로 작업 상태 검증","적절한 검증 없이 조기 완료 주장 방지"],"es":["Hacer cumplir los protocolos de verificación antes de la finalización del proyecto","Validar el estado de la tarea con evidencia fresca","Prevenir las reclamaciones de finalización prematuras sin verificación adecuada"],"fr":["Faire respecter les protocoles de vérification avant l''achèvement du projet","Valider le statut de la tâche avec des preuves fraîches","Prévenir les réclamations de finition prématurées sans vérification appropriée"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Überprüfungsprotokollen vor der Fertigstellung des Projekts","Validieren des Aufgabenstatus mit frischen Beweisen","Verhindern von vorzeitigen Fertigstellungsansprüchen ohne ordnungsgemäße Überprüfung"],"pt":["Impor protocolos de verificação antes da conclusão do projeto","Validar status de tarefas com evidências frescas","Prevenir reclamações de conclusão prematura sem verificação adequada"],"ru":["Внедрение протоколов верификации перед завершением проекта","Проверка статуса задач с помощью свежих доказательств","Предотвращение преждевременных заявлений об окончании без надлежащей верификации"],"ar":["إجراء بروتوكولات التحقق قبل إكمال المشروع","التحقق من حالة المهام مع أدلة tươiة","منع مطالبات الإكمال المسبق بدون تحقق مناسب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to the Iron Law","Mandatory implementation of verification gate functions before claiming completion"],"zh":["要求严格遵守铁律","在声称完成前必须实施验证门功能"],"ja":["鉄則への厳格な遵守が必要","完了を主張する前に検証ゲート機能の実装が必須"],"ko":["철칙을 엄격히 준수해야 함","완료 주장 전 검증 게이트 기능 구현 필수"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adhesión a la Ley de Hierro","Implementación obligatoria de funciones de verificación antes de reclamar la finalización"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte à la Loi de Fer","Mise en œuvre obligatoire des fonctions de vérification avant de réclamer l''achèvement"],"de":["Erfordert eine strenge Einhaltung des Eisernen Gesetzes","Obligatorische Implementierung von Überprüfungsfunktionen vor der Geltendmachung der Fertigstellung"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita à Lei de Ferro","Implementação obrigatória de funções de portão de verificação antes de reclamar conclusão"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения Железного закона","Обязательная реализация функций ворота верификации перед заявлением об окончании"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام الصارم โดย قانون الحديد","تنفيذ إلزامي لوظائف بوابة التحقق قبل المطالبة بالإكمال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
