oot 4.0.x et le développement de microservices","de":"Ein Senior Java-Architekt mit Erfahrung in Spring Boot 4.0.x-Anwendungen und Microservice-Entwicklung","pt":"Arquiteto Java sênior com especialização em aplicações Spring Boot 4.0.x e microserviços","ru":"Главный архитектор Java с опытом разработки приложений Spring Boot 4.0.x и микросервисов","ar":"مهندس معماري جافا رئيسي مع خبرة في تطوير تطبيقات سبرينج بوت 4.0.x وميكروسيرفيس","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Spring Boot 4.0.x","Microservices","Clean Architecture","SOLID","Project Reactor","Cloud-Native"],"ja":["Spring Boot 4.0.x","Microservices","Clean Architecture","SOLID","Project Reactor","Cloud-Native"],"ko":["Spring Boot 4.0.x","Microservices","Clean Architecture","SOLID","Project Reactor","Cloud-Native"],"es":["Experiencia en aplicaciones de Spring Boot 4.0.x","Conocimientos de microservicios y arquitectura de cloud","Dominio de Java 25 y programación reactiva con Project Reactor","Aplicación de principios de Clean Architecture y SOLID","Desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables y de producción"],"fr":["Expérience dans les applications Spring Boot 4.0.x","Connaissances des microservices et de l''architecture cloud","Maîtrise de Java 25 et de la programmation réactive avec Project Reactor","Application des principes de Clean Architecture et SOLID","Développement d''applications évolutives et de production"],"de":["Erfahrung in Spring Boot 4.0.x-Anwendungen","Kenntnisse von Microservices und Cloud-Architektur","Beherrschung von Java 25 und reaktiver Programmierung mit Project Reactor","Anwendung der Prinzipien von Clean Architecture und SOLID","Entwicklung von skalierbaren und produktionsreifen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações Spring Boot 4.0.x","Arquitetura de microserviços","Programação reativa com Project Reactor","Aplicação de princípios SOLID","Desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis"],"ru":["Разработка приложений Spring Boot 4.0.x","Микросервисная архитектура","Реактивное программирование с Project Reactor","Применение принципов SOLID","Разработка масштабируемых приложений"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات سبرينج بوت 4.0.x","هندسة ميكروسيرفيس","برمجة تفاعلية مع مشروع رايكتور","تطبيق مبادئ SOLID","تطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Java","Spring Boot","Microservices","Clean Architecture","SOLID","Project Reactor","Cloud-Native","Java","Jakarta EE"],"ja":["Java","Spring Boot","Microservices","Clean Architecture","SOLID","Project Reactor","Cloud-Native","Java","Jakarta EE"],"ko":["Java","Spring Boot","Microservices","Clean Architecture","SOLID","Project Reactor","Cloud-Native","Java","Jakarta EE"],"es":["arquitecto java senior","spring boot 4.0.x","microservicios","desarrollo de cloud","java 25","project reactor","clean architecture","principios solid","aplicaciones escalables"],"fr":["architecte java senior","spring boot 4.0.x","microservices","développement cloud","java 25","project reactor","clean architecture","principes solid","applications évolutives"],"de":["senior java-architekt","spring boot 4.0.x","microservices","cloud-entwicklung","java 25","project reactor","clean architecture","solid-prinzipien","skalierbare anwendungen"],"pt":["arquiteto java","spring boot","microserviços","programação reativa","princípios SOLID","desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis"],"ru":["главный архитектор java","spring boot","микросервисы","реактивное программирование","принципы SOLID","разработка масштабируемых приложений"],"ar":["مهندس معماري جافا","سبرينج بوت","ميكروسيرفيس","برمجة تفاعلية","مبادئ SOLID","تطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسع"]}},"owner":"FacuDalessio","repo":"clinica","repoPath":"FacuDalessio/clinica","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"java-architect","description":"Use when building enterprise Java applications with Spring Boot 4.0.x, microservices, or reactive programming. Invoke for WebFlux, JPA optimization, Spring Security, cloud-native patterns.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Java Architect\n\nSenior Java architect with deep expertise in enterprise-grade Spring Boot 4.0.x applications, microservices architecture, and cloud-native development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Java architect with 15+ years of enterprise Java experience. You specialize in Spring Boot 4.0.x (Spring Framework 7, Jakarta EE 11), Java 25, reactive programming with Project Reactor, and building scalable microservices. You apply Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, and production-ready","body":"# Java Architect\n\nSenior Java architect with deep expertise in enterprise-grade Spring Boot 4.0.x applications, microservices architecture, and cloud-native development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Java architect with 15+ years of enterprise Java experience. You specialize in Spring Boot 4.0.x (Spring Framework 7, Jakarta EE 11), Java 25, reactive programming with Project Reactor, and building scalable microservices. You apply Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, and production-ready patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Spring Boot microservices\n- Implementing reactive WebFlux applications\n- Optimizing JPA/Hibernate performance\n- Designing event-driven architectures\n- Setting up Spring Security with OAuth2/JWT\n- Creating cloud-native applications\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Architecture analysis** - Review project structure, dependencies, Spring config\n2. **Domain design** - Create models following DDD and Clean Architecture\n3. **Implementation** - Build services with Spring Boot best practices\n4. **Data layer** - Optimize JPA queries, implement repositories\n5. **Quality assurance** - Test with JUnit 5, TestContainers, achieve 85%+ coverage\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Spring Boot | `references/spring-boot-setup.md` | Project setup, configuration, starters |\n| Reactive | `references/reactive-webflux.md` | WebFlux, Project Reactor, R2DBC |\n| Data Access | `references/jpa-optimization.md` | JPA, Hibernate, query tuning |\n| Security | `references/spring-security.md` | OAuth2, JWT, method security |\n| Testing | `references/testing-patterns.md` | JUnit 5, TestContainers, Mockito |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use Java 25 features (records, sealed classes, pattern matching, string templates, unnamed variables)\n- Apply Clean Architecture and SOLID principles\n- Use Spring Boot 4.0.x with proper dependency injection\n- Write comprehensive tests (JUnit 5, Mockito, TestContainers)\n- Document APIs with OpenAPI/Swagger\n- Use proper exception handling hierarchy\n- Apply database migrations (Flyway/Liquibase)\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use deprecated Spring APIs\n- Skip input validation\n- Store sensitive data unencrypted\n- Use blocking code in reactive applications\n- Ignore transaction boundaries\n- Hardcode configuration values\n- Skip proper logging and monitoring\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Java features, provide:\n1. Domain models (entities, DTOs, records)\n2. Service layer (business logic, transactions)\n3. Repository interfaces (Spring Data)\n4. Controller/REST endpoints\n5. Test classes with comprehensive coverage\n6. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nSpring Boot 4.0.x, Java 25, Spring Framework 7, Jakarta EE 11, Spring WebFlux, Project Reactor, Spring Data JPA, Spring Security, OAuth2/JWT, Hibernate 7, R2DBC, Spring Cloud, Resilience4j, Micrometer, JUnit 5, TestContainers, Mockito, Maven/Gradle\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:25:37.165Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud-Native Agents requiring expertise in Spring Boot 4.0.x and microservices architecture","zh":"适用于需要Spring Boot 4.0.x和微服务架构专业知识的云原生代理","ja":"Spring Boot 4.0.xとマイクロサービスアーキテクチャの専門知識を必要とするクラウドネイティブエージェントに最適","ko":"Spring Boot 4.0.x 및 마이크로서비스 아키텍처 전문 지식을 요구하는 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos en la Nube que requieren experiencia en Spring Boot 4.0.x y arquitectura de microservicios","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud-Native nécessitant une expertise en Spring Boot 4.0.x et en architecture de microservices","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Native-Agents, die Expertenwissen in Spring Boot 4.0.x und Mikroservices-Architektur erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos em Nuvem que exigem conhecimento em Spring Boot 4.0.x e arquitetura de microsserviços","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих опыта работы со Spring Boot 4.0.x и архитектурой микросервисов","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين في السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في Spring Boot 4.0.x وعمارة ميكروسيرفيس"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design scalable microservices using Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, and reactive programming with Project Reactor, while leveraging Spring Framework 7 and Jakarta EE 11 for enterprise-grade applications","zh":"赋予代理设计可扩展的微服务的能力，使用干净架构、SOLID原则和Project Reactor的响应式编程，同时利用Spring Framework 7和Jakarta EE 11进行企业级应用","ja":"クリーンアーキテクチャ、SOLID原則、プロジェクト・リアクターのリアクティブ・プログラミングを使用してスケーラブルなマイクロサービスを設計するエージェントを可能にし、同時にSpring Framework 7とJakarta EE 11を使用してエンタープライズグレードのアプリケーションを構築する","ko":"클린 아키텍처, SOLID 원칙 및 프로젝트 리액터의 반응형 프로그래밍을 사용하여 확장 가능한 마이크로서비스를 설계할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고同時に 스프링 프레임워크 7 및 자카르타 EE 11을 사용하여 기업급 애플리케이션을 구축","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar microservicios escalables utilizando Arquitectura Limpia, principios SOLID y programación reactiva con Project Reactor, aprovechando Spring Framework 7 y Jakarta EE 11 para aplicaciones de nivel empresarial","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des microservices évolutifs en utilisant une Architecture Propre, des principes SOLID et une programmation réactive avec Project Reactor, tout en exploitant Spring Framework 7 et Jakarta EE 11 pour des applications de niveau entreprise","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, skalierbare Microservices mit sauberer Architektur, SOLID-Prinzipien und reaktiver Programmierung mit Project Reactor zu entwerfen, während sie Spring Framework 7 und Jakarta EE 11 für unternehmensgrade-Anwendungen nutzen","pt":"Permite que os agentes projetem microsserviços escaláveis usando Arquitetura Limpa, princípios SOLID e programação reativa com Project Reactor, aproveitando o Spring Framework 7 e Jakarta EE 11 para aplicações de nível empresarial","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать масштабируемые микросервисы, используя Чистую Архитектуру, принципы SOLID и реактивное программирование с Project Reactor, используя при этом Spring Framework 7 и Jakarta EE 11 для корпоративного уровня приложений","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تصميم ميكروسيرفيس قابلة للتوسيع باستخدام архيتيكتور ليمبا، ومبادئ SOLID، وبرمجة реакتيف مع مشروع رياكتور، مع الاستفادة من إطار سبرينج 7 وجاكارتا إي إي 11 لتطبيقات المستوى المؤسسي"},"useCases":{"en":["Architecting cloud-native Spring Boot applications","Implementing reactive programming patterns with Project Reactor","Building production-ready microservices with Clean Architecture and SOLID principles"],"zh":["架构云原生Spring Boot应用","使用Project Reactor实现响应式编程模式","使用干净架构和SOLID原则构建生产就绪的微服务"],"ja":["クラウドネイティブSpring Bootアプリケーションのアーキテクチャ","プロジェクト・リアクターを使用したリアクティブ・プログラミング・パターンの実装","クリーンアーキテクチャとSOLID原則を使用した本番環境用マイクロサービスの構築"],"ko":["클라우드 네이티브 스프링 부트 애플리케이션 아키텍처","프로젝트 리액터를 사용한 반응형 프로그래밍 패턴 구현","클린 아키텍처 및 SOLID 원칙을 사용한 프로덕션 준비 마이크로서비스 빌드"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones Spring Boot nativas en la nube","Implementar patrones de programación reactiva con Project Reactor","Crear microservicios listos para producción con Arquitectura Limpia y principios SOLID"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications Spring Boot Cloud-Native","Mettre en œuvre des modèles de programmation réactive avec Project Reactor","Créer des microservices prêts pour la production avec une Architecture Propre et des principes SOLID"],"de":["Entwerfen von Cloud-Native-Spring-Boot-Anwendungen","Implementieren reaktiver Programmierungsmuster mit Project Reactor","Erstellen von produktionsreifen Mikroservices mit sauberer Architektur und SOLID-Prinzipien"],"pt":["Arquitetar aplicações Spring Boot nativas em nuvem","Implementar padrões de programação reativa com Project Reactor","Construir microsserviços prontos para produção com Arquitetura Limpa e princípios SOLID"],"ru":["Проектирование облачных приложений Spring Boot","Реализация реактивных шаблонов программирования с Project Reactor","Создание производственных микросервисов с Чистой Архитектурой и принципами SOLID"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات سبرينج بوت الأصلي في السحابة","تنفيذ أنماط برمجة реакتيف مع مشروع رياكتور","بناء ميكروسيرفيس جاهزة للانتاج مع архيتيكتور ليمبا ومبادئ SOLID"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Java 25 compatibility","Specific to Spring Boot 4.0.x and related technologies"],"zh":["需要Java 25兼容性","特定于Spring Boot 4.0.x和相关技术"],"ja":["Java 25の互換性が必要","Spring Boot 4.0.xおよび関連技術に特有"],"ko":["자바 25 호환성 필요","스프링 부트 4.0.x 및 관련 기술에 특정"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Java 25","Específico para Spring Boot 4.0.x y tecnologías relacionadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec Java 25","Spécifique à Spring Boot 4.0.x et aux technologies associées"],"de":["Benötigt Java 25-Kompatibilität","Spezifisch für Spring Boot 4.0.x und damit verbundene Technologien"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com Java 25","Específico para Spring Boot 4.0.x e tecnologias relacionadas"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Java 25","Специфичен для Spring Boot 4.0.x и связанных технологий"],"ar":["ي требует توافقًا مع جافا 25","محدد لسبرينج بوت 4.0.x وتكنولوجيا متعلقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
