 المهارات مع find-skills","en":"find-skills"},"description":{"zh":"find-skills GitHub ,","ja":"find-skills GitHub","ko":"find-skills GitHub ","es":"Find-skills es una acción de GitHub que evalúa la calidad de los contribuyentes utilizando métricas objetivas, ayudando a combatir el spam y el código de baj...","fr":"Find-skills est une action GitHub qui évalue la qualité des contributeurs en utilisant des métriques objectives, aidant à combattre le spam et le code de mau...","de":"Find-skills ist eine GitHub-Aktion, die die Qualität der Mitwirkenden anhand objektiver Metriken bewertet, um Spam und schlechten Code zu bekämpfen","pt":"O find-skills é uma ação do GitHub que avalia a qualidade do contribuidor usando métricas objetivas, combatendo spam PRs e código de baixa qualidade.","ru":"Find-skills - это действие GitHub, которое оценивает качество вкладчика с помощью объективных метрик, борясь со спамом PR и низкокачественным кодом.","ar":"find-skills هو إجراء GitHub يقيّم جودة المساهم باستخدام معايير موضوعية ، يقاوم البريد العشوائي PR والرمز ذو الجودة المنخفضة.","en":"GitHub Action to evaluate contributor quality using objective metrics - Combat AI-generated spam PRs and slop code"},"definition":{"en":"GitHub Action to evaluate contributor quality using objective metrics - Combat AI-generated spam PRs and slop code"},"features":{"zh":["GitHub ","AI","PRs","GitHub ","API"],"ja":["GitHub ","AI","PRs","GitHub ","API"],"ko":["GitHub ","AI","PRs","GitHub ","API"],"es":["Evalúa la calidad de los contribuyentes utilizando métricas objetivas","Combate el spam y el código de baja calidad","Integración con GitHub","Análisis de código automatizado","Informes detallados sobre la calidad del código"],"fr":["Évalue la qualité des contributeurs en utilisant des métriques objectives","Combinez le spam et le code de mauvaise qualité","Intégration avec GitHub","Analyse de code automatisée","Rapports détaillés sur la qualité du code"],"de":["Bewertet die Qualität der Mitwirkenden anhand objektiver Metriken","Bekämpft Spam und schlechten Code","Integration mit GitHub","Automatisierte Code-Analyse","Detaillierte Berichte über die Code-Qualität"],"pt":["Avaliação de qualidade do contribuidor","Combate a spam PRs","Detecção de código de baixa qualidade","Integração com o ecossistema de habilidades de agentes abertos","Instalação de habilidades personalizadas"],"ru":["Оценка качества вкладчика","Борьба со спамом PR","Обнаружение низкокачественного кода","Интеграция с экосистемой открытых навыков агентов","Установка индивидуальных навыков"],"ar":["تقييم جودة المساهم","مكافحة البريد العشوائي PR","اكتشاف الرمز ذو الجودة المنخفضة","التكامل مع النظام البيئي المفتوح لمهارات الوكيل","تثبيت مهارات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub ","find-skills","AI","PRs","GitHub ","API","SEO"],"ja":["GitHub ","find-skills","AI","PRs","GitHub ","API","SEO"],"ko":["GitHub ","find-skills","AI","PRs","GitHub ","API","SEO"],"es":["evaluación de contribuyentes","calidad de código","acción de GitHub","combate al spam","análisis de código","informes de calidad","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["évaluation des contributeurs","qualité de code","action GitHub","combattre le spam","analyse de code","rapports de qualité","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Bewertung von Mitwirkenden","Code-Qualität","GitHub-Aktion","Bekämpfung von Spam","Code-Analyse","Qualitätsberichte","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["find-skills","habilidades de agentes","ecossistema de habilidades","qualidade do contribuidor","spam PRs","código de baixa qualidade","GitHub Action","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["find-skills","навыки агентов","экосистема навыков","качество вкладчика","спам PR","низкокачественный код","GitHub Action","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["find-skills","مهارات الوكيل","نظام بيئي للمهارات","جودة المساهم","البريد العشوائي PR","الرمز ذو الجودة المنخفضة","إجراء GitHub","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"jdiegosierra","repo":"contributor-report","repoPath":"jdiegosierra/contributor-report","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"find-skills","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Find Skills\n\nThis skill helps you discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Asks \"how do I do X\" where X might be a common task with an existing skill\n- Says \"find a skill for X\" or \"is there a skill for X\"\n- Asks \"can you do X\" where X is a specialized capability\n- Expresses interest in extending agent capabilities\n- Wants to search for tools, templates, or workflows\n- Mentions they wish they had help with a","body":"# Find Skills\n\nThis skill helps you discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Asks \"how do I do X\" where X might be a common task with an existing skill\n- Says \"find a skill for X\" or \"is there a skill for X\"\n- Asks \"can you do X\" where X is a specialized capability\n- Expresses interest in extending agent capabilities\n- Wants to search for tools, templates, or workflows\n- Mentions they wish they had help with a specific domain (design, testing, deployment, etc.)\n\n## What is the Skills CLI?\n\nThe Skills CLI (`npx skills`) is the package manager for the open agent skills ecosystem. Skills are modular packages\nthat extend agent capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, and tools.\n\n**Key commands:**\n\n- `npx skills find [query]` - Search for skills interactively or by keyword\n- `npx skills add <package>` - Install a skill from GitHub or other sources\n- `npx skills check` - Check for skill updates\n- `npx skills update` - Update all installed skills\n\n**Browse skills at:** https://skills.sh/\n\n## How to Help Users Find Skills\n\n### Step 1: Understand What They Need\n\nWhen a user asks for help with something, identify:\n\n1. The domain (e.g., React, testing, design, deployment)\n2. The specific task (e.g., writing tests, creating animations, reviewing PRs)\n3. Whether this is a common enough task that a skill likely exists\n\n### Step 2: Search for Skills\n\nRun the find command with a relevant query:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills find [query]\n```\n\nFor example:\n\n- User asks \"how do I make my React app faster?\" → `npx skills find react performance`\n- User asks \"can you help me with PR reviews?\" → `npx skills find pr review`\n- User asks \"I need to create a changelog\" → `npx skills find changelog`\n\nThe command will return results like:\n\n```\nInstall with npx skills add <owner/repo@skill>\n\nvercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices\n└ https://skills.sh/vercel-labs/agent-skills/vercel-react-best-practices\n```\n\n### Step 3: Present Options to the User\n\nWhen you find relevant skills, present them to the user with:\n\n1. The skill name and what it does\n2. The install command they can run\n3. A link to learn more at skills.sh\n\nExample response:\n\n```\nI found a skill that might help! The \"vercel-react-best-practices\" skill provides\nReact and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering.\n\nTo install it:\nnpx skills add vercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices\n\nLearn more: https://skills.sh/vercel-labs/agent-skills/vercel-react-best-practices\n```\n\n### Step 4: Offer to Install\n\nIf the user wants to proceed, you can install the skill for them:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills add <owner/repo@skill> -g -y\n```\n\nThe `-g` flag installs globally (user-level) and `-y` skips confirmation prompts.\n\n## Common Skill Categories\n\nWhen searching, consider these common categories:\n\n| Category        | Example Queries                          |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| Web Development | react, nextjs, typescript, css, tailwind |\n| Testing         | testing, jest, playwright, e2e           |\n| DevOps          | deploy, docker, kubernetes, ci-cd        |\n| Documentation   | docs, readme, changelog, api-docs        |\n| Code Quality    | review, lint, refactor, best-practices   |\n| Design          | ui, ux, design-system, accessibility     |\n| Productivity    | workflow, automation, git                |\n\n## Tips for Effective Searches\n\n1. **Use specific keywords**: \"react testing\" is better than just \"testing\"\n2. **Try alternative terms**: If \"deploy\" doesn''t work, try \"deployment\" or \"ci-cd\"\n3. **Check popular sources**: Many skills come from `vercel-labs/agent-skills` or `ComposioHQ/awesome-claude-skills`\n\n## When No Skills Are Found\n\nIf no relevant skills exist:\n\n1. Acknowledge that no existing skill was found\n2. Offer to help with the task directly using your general capabilities\n3. Suggest the user could create their own skill with `npx skills init`\n\nExample:\n\n```\nI searched for skills related to \"xyz\" but didn''t find any matches.\nI can still help you with this task directly! Would you like me to proceed?\n\nIf this is something you do often, you could create your own skill:\nnpx skills init my-xyz-skill\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:26:04.434Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code seeking efficient skill discovery and installation from the open agent skills ecosystem.","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的高级AI代理，寻求从开放代理技能生态系统中高效发现和安装技能。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeなどの高度なAIエージェントに適しており、オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムからの効率的なスキル発見とインストールを求めています。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf 및 Claude Code와 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 오픈 에이전트 스킬 에코 시스템에서 효율적인 스킬 발견 및 설치를 cherche합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que buscan un descubrimiento y instalación de habilidades eficientes desde el ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code recherchant une découverte et une installation de compétences efficaces à partir de l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert.","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine effiziente Fähigkeitsentdeckung und -installation aus dem offenen Agenten-Fähigkeits-Ökosystem suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que buscam descoberta e instalação de habilidades eficientes do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, ищущих эффективное обнаружение и установку навыков из открытого экосистемы навыков агентов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدمين مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يبحثون عن اكتشاف وتثبيت مهارات فعالة من بيئة مهارات الوكيل المفتوحة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover and install skills using objective metrics, combating AI-generated spam PRs and sloppy code through GitHub Actions, and leveraging keywords like contributor quality evaluation and open agent skills ecosystem.","zh":"赋予代理发现和安装技能的能力，使用客观指标，通过GitHub Actions抵制AI生成的垃圾PR和糟糕的代码，并利用关键词如贡献者质量评估和开放代理技能生态系统。","ja":"エージェントがスキルを発見してインストールする機能を提供し、客観的な指標を使用して、GitHub Actionsを通じてAI生成のスパムPRや悪いコードに対抗し、貢献者品質評価やオープンエージェントスキルエコシステムなどのキーワードを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 스킬을 발견하고 설치하는 기능을 제공하며, 객관적인 지표를 사용하여 GitHub Actions를 통해 AI 생성 스팸 PR 및 나쁨 코드를 방지하며, 기여자 품질 평가 및 오픈 에이전트 스킬 에코 시스템과 같은 키워드를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes descubrir e instalar habilidades utilizando métricas objetivas, combatiendo los spam PR generados por IA y el código descuidado a través de GitHub Actions, y aprovechando palabras clave como la evaluación de la calidad del contribuyente y el ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir et d''installer des compétences en utilisant des métriques objectives, combattant les spam PR générés par l''IA et le code négligé via GitHub Actions, et exploitant des mots-clés tels que l''évaluation de la qualité du contributeur et l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Fähigkeiten mithilfe objektiver Metriken zu entdecken und zu installieren, kämpft gegen von KI generierten Spam-PR und schlampigen Code durch GitHub Actions und nutzt Schlüsselwörter wie die Bewertung der Mitwirkungsqualität und das offene Agenten-Fähigkeits-Ökosystem.","pt":"Habilita agentes a descobrirem e instalarem habilidades usando métricas objetivas, combatendo SPAMs de PRs gerados por IA e códigos descuidados por meio de GitHub Actions, e aproveitando palavras-chave como avaliação da qualidade do contribuinte e ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать и устанавливать навыки с использованием объективных метрик, борясь с спамом PR, сгенерированным ИИ, и неряшливым кодом через GitHub Actions, и используя ключевые слова, такие как оценка качества участника и открытый экосистема навыков агентов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من اكتشاف وتثبيت المهارات باستخدام معايير موضوعية، ومكافحة البريد المزعج لطلبات السحب التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي والرمز غير الدقيق من خلال إجراءات GitHub، و利用 الكلمات الرئيسية مثل تقييم جودة المساهم وبيئة مهارات الوكيل المفتوحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Discovering skills for common tasks","Installing skills for specialized capabilities","Searching for tools and workflows","Evaluating contributor quality using objective metrics"],"zh":["发现常见任务的技能","安装专门技能","搜索工具和工作流","使用客观指标评估贡献者质量"],"ja":["一般的なタスクのスキルを発見する","専門的な能力のスキルをインストールする","ツールやワークフローを検索する","客観的な指標を使用して貢献者品質を評価する"],"ko":["일반적인 작업을 위한 스킬 발견","전문적인 능력의 스킬 설치","도구 및 워크플로우 검색","객관적인 지표를 사용하여 기여자 품질 평가"],"es":["Descubrir habilidades para tareas comunes","Instalar habilidades para capacidades especializadas","Buscar herramientas y flujos de trabajo","Evaluar la calidad del contribuyente utilizando métricas objetivas"],"fr":["Découvrir des compétences pour des tâches courantes","Installer des compétences pour des capacités spécialisées","Rechercher des outils et des flux de travail","Évaluer la qualité du contributeur en utilisant des métriques objectives"],"de":["Fähigkeiten für allgemeine Aufgaben entdecken","Fähigkeiten für spezialisierte Fähigkeiten installieren","Werkzeuge und Arbeitsabläufe suchen","Mitwirkungsqualität mithilfe objektiver Metriken bewerten"],"pt":["Descobrir habilidades para tarefas comuns","Instalar habilidades para capacidades especializadas","Procurar ferramentas e fluxos de trabalho","Avaliar a qualidade do contribuinte usando métricas objetivas"],"ru":["Обнаружение навыков для обычных задач","Установка навыков для специализированных возможностей","Поиск инструментов и рабочих процессов","Оценка качества участника с использованием объективных метрик"],"ar":["اكتشاف المهارات للمهام الشائعة","تثبيت المهارات للقدرات المتخصصة","بحث الأدوات والتدفقات العمل","تقييم جودة المساهم باستخدام معايير موضوعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Action setup","Limited to open agent skills ecosystem","Objective metrics may require customization"],"zh":["需要GitHub Action设置","仅限于开放代理技能生态系统","客观指标可能需要定制"],"ja":["GitHub Actionsの設定が必要","オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムに限定される","客観的な指標はカスタマイズが必要となる可能性がある"],"ko":["GitHub Action 설정이 필요","오픈 에이전트 스킬 에코 시스템에만 제한","객관적인 지표는 사용자 정의가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere configuración de GitHub Action","Limitado al ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas","Las métricas objetivas pueden requerir personalización"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de GitHub Action","Limité à l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert","Les métriques objectives peuvent nécessiter une personnalisation"],"de":["Benötigt eine GitHub-Action-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf das offene Agenten-Fähigkeits-Ökosystem","Objektive Metriken können eine Anpassung erfordern"],"pt":["Exige configuração do GitHub Action","Limitado ao ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto","As métricas objetivas podem exigir personalização"],"ru":["Требует настройки GitHub Action","Ограничен открытой экосистемой навыков агентов","Объективные метрики могут требовать настройки"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد إجراء GitHub","محدود ببيئة مهارات الوكيل المفتوحة","المعايير الموضوعية قد تتطلب تخصيص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
