["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos empresariais escaláveis","Experiência em .NET 8 e C# 12","Conhecimento em padrões de aplicativos nativos de nuvem","Desenvolvimento de APIs mínimas com .NET 8","Uso de Entity Framework Core"],"ru":["Разработка корпоративных приложений с высокой производительностью","Опыт работы с .NET 8 и C# 12","Знания в области облачных приложений","Разработка минималистичных API с .NET 8","Использование Entity Framework Core"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات تجارية قابلة للتوسع","خبرة في .NET 8 و C# 12","معرفة بنمط التطبيقات الأصلي السحابي","تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المتناهية الصغر مع .NET 8","استخدام Entity Framework Core"]},"keywords":{"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones empresariales","NET Core","C#","APIs mínimas","Entity Framework Core","patrones de aplicaciones en la nube","arquitectura limpia","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["développement d''applications entreprises","NET Core","C#","APIs minimales","Entity Framework Core","modèles d''applications cloud","architecture propre","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Entwicklung von Unternehmensanwendungen","NET Core","C#","minimale APIs","Entity Framework Core","Cloud-Anwendungs-Muster","saubere Architektur","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicativos empresariais",".NET 8","C# 12","aplicativos nativos de nuvem","APIs mínimas","Entity Framework Core","desenvolvedor .NET Core"],"ru":["корпоративные приложения",".NET 8","C# 12","облачные приложения","минималистичные API","Entity Framework Core","эксперт .NET Core"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات التجارية",".NET 8","C# 12","نمط التطبيقات الأصلي السحابي","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المتناهية الصغر","Entity Framework Core","خبير .NET Core"]}},"owner":"vorluno","repo":"Vorluno-Planilla","repoPath":"vorluno/Vorluno-Planilla","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-core-expert","description":"Use when building .NET 8 applications with minimal APIs, clean architecture, or cloud-native microservices. Invoke for Entity Framework Core, CQRS with MediatR, JWT authentication, AOT compilation.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- I","body":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- Implementing clean architecture with CQRS/MediatR\n- Setting up Entity Framework Core with async patterns\n- Creating microservices with cloud-native patterns\n- Implementing JWT authentication and authorization\n- Optimizing performance with AOT compilation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify architecture pattern, data models, API design\n2. **Design solution** - Create clean architecture layers with proper separation\n3. **Implement** - Write high-performance code with modern C# features\n4. **Secure** - Add authentication, authorization, and security best practices\n5. **Test** - Write comprehensive tests with xUnit and integration testing\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Minimal APIs | `references/minimal-apis.md` | Creating endpoints, routing, middleware |\n| Clean Architecture | `references/clean-architecture.md` | CQRS, MediatR, layers, DI patterns |\n| Entity Framework | `references/entity-framework.md` | DbContext, migrations, relationships |\n| Authentication | `references/authentication.md` | JWT, Identity, authorization policies |\n| Cloud-Native | `references/cloud-native.md` | Docker, health checks, configuration |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use .NET 8 and C# 12 features\n- Enable nullable reference types\n- Use async/await for all I/O operations\n- Implement proper dependency injection\n- Use record types for DTOs\n- Follow clean architecture principles\n- Write integration tests with WebApplicationFactory\n- Configure OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use synchronous I/O operations\n- Expose entities directly in API responses\n- Store secrets in code or appsettings.json\n- Skip input validation\n- Use legacy .NET Framework patterns\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Mix concerns across architectural layers\n- Use deprecated EF Core patterns\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing .NET features, provide:\n1. Project structure (solution/project files)\n2. Domain models and DTOs\n3. API endpoints or service implementations\n4. Database context and migrations if applicable\n5. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\n.NET 8, C# 12, ASP.NET Core, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, MediatR, CQRS, clean architecture, dependency injection, JWT authentication, xUnit, Docker, Kubernetes, AOT compilation, OpenAPI/Swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:26:35.319Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI Agents specializing in enterprise-grade .NET 8 application development and Panamanian payroll compliance.","zh":"适用于专门从事企业级 .NET 8 应用程序开发和巴拿马工资单合规性的 AI 代理。","ja":"エンタープライズグレードの .NET 8 アプリケーション開発およびパナマの給与計算コンプライアンスに特化した AI エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"기업급 .NET 8 애플리케이션 개발 및 파나마 급여 지급 규정 준수를 전문으로 하는 AI 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de IA que se especializan en el desarrollo de aplicaciones de grado empresarial .NET 8 y en el cumplimiento de la nómina panameña.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents IA spécialisés dans le développement d''applications .NET 8 de niveau entreprise et dans le respect de la législation sur les salaires au Panama.","de":"Wesentlich für KI-Agents, die auf die Entwicklung von unternehmensweiten .NET 8-Anwendungen und die Einhaltung der panamaischen Lohnabrechnung spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de IA especializados em desenvolvimento de aplicativos de nível empresarial .NET 8 e conformidade com a folha de pagamento panamenha.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов ИИ, специализирующихся на разработке корпоративных приложений .NET 8 и соблюдении панамских правил оплаты труда.","ar":"ضروري لعميلين الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصين في تطوير تطبيقات级企業 .NET 8 والامتثال لقواعد رواتب بنما."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to architect and implement high-performance payroll systems using .NET 9 minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and Clean Architecture patterns, with built-in expertise for CSS, Seguro Educativo, and ISR tax compliance in Panama.","zh":"使代理能够使用 .NET 9 最小 API、实体框架核心和清洁架构模式架构和实现高性能工资单系统，并内置专门用于巴拿马的 CSS、Seguro Educativo 和 ISR 税务合规性的专业知识。","ja":".NET 9 ミニマル API、Entity Framework Core、Clean Architecture パターンを使用して、高パフォーマンスの給与計算システムを設計および実装できるようにエージェントを有効にし、パナマの CSS、Seguro Educativo、ISR 税制コンプライアンスのための組み込みの専門知識を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 .NET 9 최소 API, 엔티티 프레임워크 코어 및 클린 아키텍처 패턴을 사용하여 고성능 급여 시스템을 설계 및 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 파나마의 CSS, Seguro Educativo 및 ISR 세금 규정 준수를 위한 내장 전문 지식을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar e implementar sistemas de nómina de alto rendimiento utilizando las API mínimas de .NET 9, Entity Framework Core y patrones de arquitectura Clean, con conocimientos incorporados para el cumplimiento de CSS, Seguro Educativo e ISR en Panamá.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des systèmes de paie haute performance en utilisant les API minimales .NET 9, Entity Framework Core et les modèles d''architecture Clean, avec une expertise intégrée pour le respect de CSS, Seguro Educativo et ISR au Panama.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Hochleistungs-Lohnabrechnungssysteme mithilfe von .NET 9-Minimal-APIs, Entity Framework Core und Clean-Architecture-Mustern zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, mit integriertem Know-how für CSS, Seguro Educativo und ISR-Steuerkonformität in Panama.","pt":"Permite que os agentes arquitetem e implementem sistemas de folha de pagamento de alto desempenho usando APIs mínimas .NET 9, Entity Framework Core e padrões de Arquitetura Limpa, com especialização incorporada para conformidade com CSS, Seguro Educativo e imposto ISR no Panamá.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать и реализовывать системы расчета заработной платы с высокими показателями производительности, используя минимальные API .NET 9, Entity Framework Core и шаблоны Clean Architecture, с встроенной экспертизой для соблюдения требований CSS, Seguro Educativo и налога ISR в Панаме.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تصميم وتنفيذ أنظمة دفع رواتب ذات أداء عالي باستخدام واجهات برمجة تطبيقات .NET 9 القصوى، و Entity Framework Core، ونمط هندسة نظيفة، مع خبرة مدمجة لامتثال CSS، و Seguro Educativo، وضريبة ISR في بنما."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating compliant payroll calculation modules for Panama","Architecting cloud-native enterprise systems with .NET 9 and React 19","Implementing Entity Framework Core data access layers","Developing minimal API endpoints for VOR-PLAN systems"],"zh":["为巴拿马生成符合工资单计算模块","使用 .NET 9 和 React 19 架构云原生企业系统","实现实体框架核心数据访问层","为 VOR-PLAN 系统开发最小 API 端点"],"ja":["パナマの給与計算モジュールのコンプライアンスを生成する",".NET 9 と React 19 を使用してクラウドネイティブエンタープライズシステムを設計する","Entity Framework Core データアクセス層を実装する","VOR-PLAN システムのための最小 API エンドポイントを開発する"],"ko":["파나마 급여 계산 모듈을 위한 규정 준수 생성",".NET 9 및 React 19를 사용하여 클라우드 네이티브 엔터프라이즈 시스템 아키텍처","엔티티 프레임워크 코어 데이터 액세스 계층 구현","VOR-PLAN 시스템을 위한 최소 API 엔드포인트 개발"],"es":["Generación de módulos de cálculo de nómina compatibles para Panamá","Diseño de sistemas empresariales nativos en la nube con .NET 9 y React 19","Implementación de capas de acceso a datos de Entity Framework Core","Desarrollo de puntos finales de API mínimos para sistemas VOR-PLAN"],"fr":["Génération de modules de calcul de paie compatibles pour le Panama","Conception de systèmes d''entreprise natifs dans le cloud avec .NET 9 et React 19","Mise en œuvre de couches d''accès aux données Entity Framework Core","Développement de points de terminaison d''API minimale pour les systèmes VOR-PLAN"],"de":["Erzeugung von lohnabrechnungskonformen Berechnungsmodulen für Panama","Entwurf von cloudbasierten Unternehmenssystemen mit .NET 9 und React 19","Implementierung von Entity Framework Core-Datenzugriffsschichten","Entwicklung von Minimal-API-Endpunkten für VOR-PLAN-Systeme"],"pt":["Geração de módulos de cálculo de folha de pagamento conformes para o Panamá","Arquitetura de sistemas empresariais nativos na nuvem com .NET 9 e React 19","Implementação de camadas de acesso a dados Entity Framework Core","Desenvolvimento de pontos de extremidade de API mínima para sistemas VOR-PLAN"],"ru":["Генерация модулей расчета заработной платы, соответствующих требованиям Панамы","Проектирование облачных корпоративных систем с использованием .NET 9 и React 19","Реализация слоев доступа к данным Entity Framework Core","Разработка конечных точек минимального API для систем VOR-PLAN"],"ar":["توليد وحدات لحساب الرواتب المتوافقة مع بنما","تصميم أنظمة شركات سحابية مع .NET 9 و React 19","تنفيذ طبقات وصول إلى بيانات Entity Framework Core","تطوير نقاط نهاية API القصوى لأنظمة VOR-PLAN"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specialized for Panamanian tax and labor regulations",".NET 9 and C# 12 specific implementation required","Enterprise-scale architecture knowledge presupposed"],"zh":["仅适用于巴拿马税法和劳动法规","需要 .NET 9 和 C# 12 特定实现","假设企业级架构知识"],"ja":["パナマの税法および労働法規に特化",".NET 9 および C# 