أداء وتحسينه","تحقق جودة الكود","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تقارير مفصلة وقابلة للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","代码质量","安全漏洞","性能优化","代码review","自动化代码审查"],"ja":["コードレビュー","コード品質","セキュリティ脆弱性","パフォーマンス最適化","コードレビュー自動化","コードチェック"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","코드 품질","보안 취약점","성능 최적화","코드 리뷰 자동화","코드 검사"],"es":["revisión de código","seguridad de código","calidad de código","rendimiento de código","mejores prácticas de código","herramientas de desarrollo","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["revue de code","sécurité de code","qualité de code","performances de code","meilleures pratiques de code","outils de développement","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Code-Review","Code-Sicherheit","Code-Qualität","Code-Leistung","beste Praktiken für Code","Entwicklungstools","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["revisão de código","análise de segurança","desempenho de código","qualidade de código","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","otimização de código","segurança de código","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["проверка кода","анализ безопасности","производительность кода","качество кода","инструменты разработки","оптимизация кода","безопасность кода","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود","تحليل الأمان","أداء الكود","جودة الكود","أدوات التطوير","تحسين الكود","أمان الكود","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"omerg864","repo":"budget","repoPath":"omerg864/budget","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-reviewer","description":"|","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Code Reviewer\n\nYou are an expert code reviewer who identifies security vulnerabilities, performance issues, and code quality problems.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Reviewing pull requests\n- Performing security audits\n- Checking code quality\n- Identifying performance bottlenecks\n- Ensuring best practices\n- Pre-deployment code review\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill contains **detailed rules** in the `rules/` directory, organized by category and priority.\n\n### Quick Start\n\n1. *","body":"# Code Reviewer\n\nYou are an expert code reviewer who identifies security vulnerabilities, performance issues, and code quality problems.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Reviewing pull requests\n- Performing security audits\n- Checking code quality\n- Identifying performance bottlenecks\n- Ensuring best practices\n- Pre-deployment code review\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill contains **detailed rules** in the `rules/` directory, organized by category and priority.\n\n### Quick Start\n\n1. **Review [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)** for a complete compilation of all rules with examples\n2. **Reference specific rules** from `rules/` directory for deep dives\n3. **Follow priority order**: Security → Performance → Correctness → Maintainability\n\n### Available Rules\n\n**Security (CRITICAL)**\n- [SQL Injection Prevention](rules/security-sql-injection.md)\n- [XSS Prevention](rules/security-xss-prevention.md)\n\n**Performance (HIGH)**\n- [Avoid N+1 Query Problem](rules/performance-n-plus-one.md)\n\n**Correctness (HIGH)**\n- [Proper Error Handling](rules/correctness-error-handling.md)\n\n**Maintainability (MEDIUM)**\n- [Use Meaningful Variable Names](rules/maintainability-naming.md)\n- [Add Type Hints](rules/maintainability-type-hints.md)\n\n## Review Process\n\n### 1. **Security First** (CRITICAL)\nLook for vulnerabilities that could lead to data breaches or unauthorized access:\n- SQL injection\n- XSS (Cross-Site Scripting)\n- Authentication/authorization bypasses\n- Hardcoded secrets\n- Insecure dependencies\n\n### 2. **Performance** (HIGH)\nIdentify code that will cause slow performance at scale:\n- N+1 database queries\n- Missing indexes\n- Inefficient algorithms\n- Memory leaks\n- Unnecessary API calls\n\n### 3. **Correctness** (HIGH)\nFind bugs and edge cases:\n- Error handling gaps\n- Race conditions\n- Off-by-one errors\n- Null/undefined handling\n- Input validation\n\n### 4. **Maintainability** (MEDIUM)\nImprove code quality for long-term health:\n- Clear naming\n- Type safety\n- DRY principle\n- Single responsibility\n- Documentation\n\n### 5. **Testing**\nVerify adequate coverage:\n- Unit tests for new code\n- Edge case testing\n- Error path testing\n- Integration tests where needed\n\n## Review Output Format\n\nStructure your reviews as:\n\n```markdown\nThis function retrieves user data but has critical security and reliability issues.\n\n## Critical Issues 🔴\n\n1. **SQL Injection Vulnerability** (Line 2)\n   - **Problem:** User input directly interpolated into SQL query\n   - **Impact:** Attackers can execute arbitrary SQL commands\n   - **Fix:** Use parameterized queries\n   ```python\n   query = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\"\n   result = db.execute(query, (user_id,))\n   ```\n\n## High Priority 🟠\n\n1. **No Error Handling** (Line 3-4)\n   - **Problem:** Assumes result always has data\n   - **Impact:** IndexError if user doesn''t exist\n   - **Fix:** Check result before accessing\n   ```python\n   if not result:\n       return None\n   return result[0]\n   ```\n\n2. **Missing Type Hints** (Line 1)\n   - **Problem:** No type annotations\n   - **Impact:** Reduces code clarity and IDE support\n   - **Fix:** Add type hints\n   ```python\n   def get_user(user_id: int) -> Optional[Dict[str, Any]]:\n   ```\n\n## Recommendations\n- Add logging for debugging\n- Consider using an ORM to prevent SQL injection\n- Add input validation for user_id\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:26:28.080Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced code analysis and security auditing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级代码分析和安全审计能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが高度なコード分析とセキュリティ監査機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 코드 분석 및 보안 감사 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis de código y auditoría de seguridad.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des capacités avancées d''analyse de code et d''audit de sécurité.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungs-Agenten, die erweiterte Code-Analyse- und Sicherheitsüberprüfungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de análise de código avançada e capacidades de auditoria de segurança.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы расширенные возможности анализа кода и аудита безопасности.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التطوير التي تحتاج إلى تحليل شفرة متقدم وقدرات تدقيق أمان متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify security vulnerabilities, performance issues, and code quality problems using detailed rules and best practices, ensuring high-quality code through pre-deployment reviews and security audits.","zh":"赋予代理识别安全漏洞、性能问题和代码质量问题的能力，使用详细的规则和最佳实践，通过预部署审查和安全审计确保高质量的代码。","ja":"エージェントにセキュリティの脆弱性、パフォーマンスの問題、コード品質の問題を特定する能力を付与し、詳細なルールとベストプラクティスを使用して、事前デプロイメントレビューとセキュリティ監査を通じて、高品質のコードを確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 보안 취약점, 성능 문제 및 코드 품질 문제를 식별할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여, 세부 규칙 및 모범 사례를 사용하여 사전 배포 검토 및 보안 감사를 통해 고품질 코드를 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes identificar vulnerabilidades de seguridad, problemas de rendimiento y problemas de calidad del código mediante el uso de reglas detalladas y mejores prácticas, garantizando código de alta calidad a través de revisiones previas al despliegue y auditorías de seguridad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les vulnérabilités de sécurité, les problèmes de performance et les problèmes de qualité de code en utilisant des règles détaillées et des meilleures pratiques, garantissant ainsi un code de haute qualité grâce à des revues pré-déploiement et des audits de sécurité.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Sicherheitslücken, Leistungsprobleme und Code-Qualitätsprobleme anhand detaillierter Regeln und Best Practices zu identifizieren und stellt durch Pre-Deployment-Reviews und Sicherheitsaudits hochqualitativen Code sicher.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar vulnerabilidades de segurança, problemas de desempenho e problemas de qualidade de código usando regras detalhadas e as melhores práticas, garantindo um código de alta qualidade por meio de revisões pré-implementação e auditorias de segurança.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять уязвимости безопасности, проблемы производительности и проблемы качества кода, используя подробные правила и лучшие практики, гарантируя высококачественный код за счет предварительных проверок и аудитов безопасности.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد ثغرات الأمان ومشاكل الأداء ومشاكل جودة الشفرة باستخدام قواعد مفصلة وأفضل الممارسات، مما يضمن شفرة عالية الجودة من خلال المراجعات قبل النشر وتدقيق الأمان."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request reviews","Performing thorough security audits","Debugging performance bottlenecks","Enforcing best practices in code quality"],"zh":["自动化拉取请求审查","执行彻底的安全审计","调试性能瓶颈","强制执行代码质量的最佳实践"],"ja":["プルリクエストのレビューを自動化する","徹底的なセキュリティ監査を実行する","パフォーマンスのボトルネックをデバッグする","コード品質のベストプラクティスを強制する"],"ko":["풀 요청 검토 자동화","彻底한 보안 감사 수행","성능 병목현상 디버깅","코드 품질 모범 사례 강제 적용"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de pull requests","Realización de auditorías de seguridad exhaustivas","Depuración de cuellos de botella de rendimiento","Aplicación de mejores prácticas en calidad de código"],"fr":["Automatisation des revues de pull requests","Réalisation d''audits de sécurité approfondis","Débogage des goulots d''étranglement de performance","Application des meilleures pratiques en matière de qualité de code"],"de":["Automatisierung von Pull-Request-Überprüfungen","Durchführung gründlicher Sicherheitsaudits","Debuggen von Leistungsengpässen","Durchsetzung von Best Practices in der Code-Qualität"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de solicitações de pull","Realizar auditorias de segurança exhaustivas","Depurar gargalos de desempenho","Impor as melhores práticas na qualidade do código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку запросов на слияние","Проводить тщательные аудиты безопасности","Отлаживать проблемы производительности","Прививать лучшие практики в качестве кода"],"ar":["توفير مراجعة طلبات السحب تلقائيًا","إجراء تدقيق أمان شامل","تصحيح مشاكل الأداء","إقامة أفضل الممارسات في جودة الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to code repositories","Limited to programming languages with defined rules in the rules/ directory"],"zh":["需要访问代码仓库","仅限于规则目录中定义了规则的编程语言"],"ja":["コードリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","ルールディレクトリに定義されたルールを持つプログラミング言語に限定される"],"ko":["코드 저장소에 대한 액세스가 필요함","rules/ 디렉토리에 정의된 규칙을 갖는 프로그래밍 언어로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a repositorios de código","Limitado a lenguajes de programación con reglas definidas en el directorio rules/"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux dépôts de code","Limité aux langages de programmation avec des règles définies dans le répertoire rules/"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Code-Repositories","Beschränkt auf Programmiersprachen mit definierten Regeln im rules/-Verzeichnis"],"pt":["Requer acesso a repositórios de código","Limitado a linguagens de programação com regras definidas no diretório rules/"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиториям кода","Ограничен языками программирования с определенными правилами в директории rules/"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودعات الشفرة","محدود باللغات البرمجية المعرفة بالقواعد في الدليل rules/"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
