沙盒中运行命令","ja":"cloudrouter browser はクラウドブラウザ自動化に使用されるツールで、クラウドサンドボックス内でコマンドを実行することができます","ko":"cloudrouter browser는 클라우드 브라우저 자동화를 위한 툴로, 클라우드 샌드박스 내에서 명령을 실행할 수 있습니다","es":"Automatice las interacciones del navegador en la nube con cloudrouter browser. Ejecute comandos dentro del sandbox a través de SSH.","fr":"Automatisez les interactions de navigateur dans le cloud avec cloudrouter browser. Exécutez des commandes à l''intérieur du sandbox via SSH.","de":"Automatisieren Sie Browser-Interaktionen in der Cloud mit cloudrouter browser. Führen Sie Befehle innerhalb des Sandboxes über SSH aus.","pt":"O Agent-Browser é uma ferramenta para automação de navegador em ambientes de sandbox em nuvem. Ele permite automatizar interações de navegador via SSH.","ru":"Agent-Browser — это инструмент для автоматизации браузера в облачных песочницах. Он позволяет автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера через SSH.","ar":"Agent-Browser هو أداة لأتمتة المتصفح في بيئات الرمل السحابية. وهو يسمح بأتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح عبر SSH.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持云沙盒中的浏览器自动化","使用 cloudrouter browser 命令行工具","支持在云沙盒中运行命令","实现浏览器交互的自动化","支持快照和重复快照功能"],"ja":["クラウドサンドボックス内でのブラウザ自動化をサポート","cloudrouter browser コマンドラインツールを使用","クラウドサンドボックス内でのコマンド実行をサポート","ブラウザインタラクションの自動化を実現","スナップショットとリスナップショット機能をサポート"],"ko":["클라우드 샌드박스 내에서의 브라우저 자동화를 지원","cloudrouter browser 명령줄 툴을 사용","클라우드 샌드박스 내에서의 명령 실행을 지원","브라우저 상호작용의 자동화를 실현","스냅샷과 리스냅샷 기능을 지원"],"es":["Automatización de interacciones del navegador","Ejecución de comandos dentro del sandbox","Conexión a través de SSH","Compatibilidad con entornos de sandbox en la nube","Integración con cloudrouter"],"fr":["Automation des interactions de navigateur","Exécution de commandes à l''intérieur du sandbox","Connexion via SSH","Compatibilité avec les environnements de sandbox en ligne","Intégration avec cloudrouter"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browser-Interaktionen","Ausführung von Befehlen innerhalb des Sandboxes","Verbindung über SSH","Kompatibilität mit Cloud-Sandbox-Umgebungen","Integration mit cloudrouter"],"pt":["Automação de interações de navegador","Execução de comandos via SSH","Compatibilidade com ambientes de sandbox em nuvem","Integração com cloudrouter","Suporte a snapshots e re-snapshots"],"ru":["Автоматизация взаимодействий браузера","Выполнение команд через SSH","Совместимость с облачными песочницами","Интеграция с cloudrouter","Поддержка снимков и повторных снимков"],"ar":["أتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح","تنفيذ الأوامر عبر SSH","توافق مع بيئات الرمل السحابية","التكامل مع cloudrouter","دعم الصور والصور المتكررة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["云浏览器自动化","agent-browser","cloudrouter browser","浏览器自动化","云沙盒","自动化测试"],"ja":["クラウドブラウザ自動化","agent-browser","cloudrouter browser","ブラウザ自動化","クラウドサンドボックス","自動化テスト"],"ko":["클라우드 브라우저 자동화","agent-browser","cloudrouter browser","브라우저 자동화","클라우드 샌드박스","자동화 테스트"],"es":["automatización de navegador","cloudrouter browser","sandbox en la nube","ssh","desarrollo de software","automatización de pruebas","entornos de desarrollo"],"fr":["automation de navigateur","cloudrouter browser","sandbox en ligne","ssh","développement de logiciels","automation de tests","environnements de développement"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","cloudrouter browser","Cloud-Sandbox","ssh","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Tests","Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["automação de navegador","agent-browser","cloudrouter","sandbox em nuvem","SSH","snapshots","re-snapshots","desenvolvimento de software","teste de software"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","Agent-Browser","cloudrouter","облачная песочница","SSH","снимки","повторные снимки","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أتمتة المتصفح","Agent-Browser","cloudrouter","بيئة الرمل السحابية","SSH","الصور","الصور المتكررة","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبار البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"manaflow-ai","repo":"cloudrouter","repoPath":"manaflow-ai/cloudrouter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-browser","description":"Browser automation for web tasks - scraping, form filling, testing, screenshots, data extraction. Use when tasks involve web pages, URLs, login flows, or web interaction.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation via `cloudrouter browser`\n\nAutomate browser interactions in cloud sandboxes. `cloudrouter browser` wraps [agent-browser](https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser) and runs commands inside the sandbox via SSH.\n\n**Prerequisite:** You need a running cloudrouter sandbox. Get the sandbox ID from `cloudrouter ls` or create one with `cloudrouter start .`.\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nAlways follow this pattern: **Open -> Snapshot -> Interact -> Re-snapshot**\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser","body":"# Browser Automation via `cloudrouter browser`\n\nAutomate browser interactions in cloud sandboxes. `cloudrouter browser` wraps [agent-browser](https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser) and runs commands inside the sandbox via SSH.\n\n**Prerequisite:** You need a running cloudrouter sandbox. Get the sandbox ID from `cloudrouter ls` or create one with `cloudrouter start .`.\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nAlways follow this pattern: **Open -> Snapshot -> Interact -> Re-snapshot**\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser open <id> \"https://example.com\"\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>         # -i = interactive elements only\ncloudrouter browser click <id> @e5           # Click element ref\ncloudrouter browser fill <id> @e3 \"text\"     # Fill input\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>         # Re-snapshot after change\n```\n\n## Essential Commands\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser open <id> <url>          # Navigate to URL\ncloudrouter browser back <id>                # Go back\ncloudrouter browser forward <id>             # Go forward\ncloudrouter browser reload <id>              # Refresh page\ncloudrouter browser url <id>                 # Get current URL\ncloudrouter browser title <id>               # Get page title\n```\n\n### Inspection\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>         # Interactive elements only (RECOMMENDED)\ncloudrouter browser snapshot <id>            # Full accessibility tree\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -c <id>         # Compact output\ncloudrouter browser screenshot <id>          # Screenshot (base64 to stdout)\ncloudrouter browser screenshot <id> out.png  # Save screenshot to file\ncloudrouter browser screenshot --full <id>   # Full page screenshot\ncloudrouter browser eval <id> \"document.title\"  # Run JavaScript\n```\n\n### Interaction\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser click <id> @e1           # Click element\ncloudrouter browser dblclick <id> @e1        # Double-click\ncloudrouter browser fill <id> @e2 \"text\"     # Clear input and type text\ncloudrouter browser type <id> @e2 \"text\"     # Type without clearing (appends)\ncloudrouter browser press <id> Enter         # Press key (Enter, Tab, Escape, etc.)\ncloudrouter browser hover <id> @e5           # Hover over element\ncloudrouter browser focus <id> @e3           # Focus element\ncloudrouter browser scroll <id> down         # Scroll down (default pixels)\ncloudrouter browser scroll <id> down 500     # Scroll down 500px\ncloudrouter browser scroll <id> up           # Scroll up\ncloudrouter browser scrollintoview <id> \"#element\"  # Scroll into view (CSS selector only, NOT @e refs)\ncloudrouter browser select <id> @e7 \"value\"  # Select dropdown option\ncloudrouter browser check <id> @e8           # Check checkbox\ncloudrouter browser uncheck <id> @e9         # Uncheck checkbox\ncloudrouter browser upload <id> @e10 /path   # Upload file\ncloudrouter browser drag <id> @e1 @e2        # Drag and drop\ncloudrouter browser wait <id> @e3            # Wait for element to appear\ncloudrouter browser wait <id> 2000           # Wait milliseconds\n```\n\n### Get Information\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser get-text <id> @e1        # Get element text\ncloudrouter browser get-value <id> @e2       # Get input value\ncloudrouter browser get-attr <id> @e3 href   # Get attribute\ncloudrouter browser get-html <id> @e4        # Get innerHTML\ncloudrouter browser get-count <id> \".item\"   # Count matching elements\ncloudrouter browser is-visible <id> @e1      # Check visibility\ncloudrouter browser is-enabled <id> @e1      # Check if enabled\ncloudrouter browser is-checked <id> @e1      # Check if checked\n```\n\n### Semantic Locators (alternative to refs)\n\nWhen refs are unreliable on dynamic pages:\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser find <id> text \"Sign In\" click                 # By visible text\ncloudrouter browser find <id> label \"Email\" fill \"user@test.com\"   # By label\ncloudrouter browser find <id> placeholder \"Search\" type \"query\"    # By placeholder\ncloudrouter browser find <id> testid \"submit-btn\" click            # By data-testid\n```\n\n> **Note:** `find <id> role button click` finds the FIRST button on the page — it cannot filter by name. Use `find <id> text \"Button Name\" click` to target a specific button. There is no `--name` flag.\n\n### JavaScript & Debugging\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser eval <id> \"document.title\"          # Evaluate JS\ncloudrouter browser console <id>                        # View console output\ncloudrouter browser errors <id>                         # View JS errors\n```\n\n### Tabs & Frames\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser tab-list <id>                       # List tabs\ncloudrouter browser tab-new <id> \"https://...\"          # New tab\ncloudrouter browser tab-switch <id> 2                   # Switch tab\ncloudrouter browser tab-close <id>                      # Close tab\ncloudrouter browser frame <id> \"#iframe\"                # Switch to iframe\ncloudrouter browser frame <id> main                     # Back to main\n```\n\n### Cookies & Storage\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser cookies <id>                        # List cookies\ncloudrouter browser cookies-set <id> name value         # Set cookie\ncloudrouter browser cookies-clear <id>                  # Clear cookies\ncloudrouter browser storage-local <id>                  # Get localStorage\ncloudrouter browser storage-local-set <id> key value    # Set localStorage\ncloudrouter browser storage-local-clear <id>            # Clear localStorage\n```\n\n### State Management\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser state-save <id> /tmp/auth.json      # Save cookies + storage\ncloudrouter browser state-load <id> /tmp/auth.json      # Restore state\n```\n\n### Browser Settings\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser set-viewport <id> 1920 1080         # Set viewport\ncloudrouter browser set-device <id> \"iPhone 14\"         # Emulate device\ncloudrouter browser set-geo <id> 37.77 -122.42          # Set geolocation\ncloudrouter browser set-offline <id> on                 # Toggle offline\ncloudrouter browser set-media <id> dark                 # Color scheme\n```\n\n### Network Interception\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser network-route <id> \"**/api/*\"       # Intercept requests\ncloudrouter browser network-route <id> \"**/ads/*\" --abort  # Block requests\ncloudrouter browser network-unroute <id>                # Remove routes\ncloudrouter browser network-requests <id>               # List requests\n```\n\n### Dialogs\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser dialog-accept <id>                  # Accept alert/confirm\ncloudrouter browser dialog-accept <id> \"answer\"         # Accept prompt with text\ncloudrouter browser dialog-dismiss <id>                 # Dismiss dialog\n```\n\n## Element Selectors\n\n- **Element refs** from snapshot: `@e1`, `@e2`, `@e3`... (preferred)\n- **CSS selectors**: `#id`, `.class`, `button[type=\"submit\"]`\n\nSnapshot output shows `[ref=e1]` — use as `@e1` in commands.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Login Flow\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser open <id> \"https://app.example.com/login\"\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>\n# → @e1 [input] Email, @e2 [input] Password, @e3 [button] Sign In\ncloudrouter browser fill <id> @e1 \"user@example.com\"\ncloudrouter browser fill <id> @e2 \"password123\"\ncloudrouter browser click <id> @e3\ncloudrouter browser wait <id> 2000\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>         # Verify login success\ncloudrouter browser screenshot <id> /tmp/result.png\n```\n\n### Form Submission\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser open <id> \"https://example.com/contact\"\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>\ncloudrouter browser fill <id> @e1 \"John Doe\"\ncloudrouter browser fill <id> @e2 \"john@email.com\"\ncloudrouter browser fill <id> @e3 \"Hello world\"\ncloudrouter browser click <id> @e4           # Submit\ncloudrouter browser wait <id> 2000\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>         # Verify submission\n```\n\n### Data Extraction\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser open <id> \"https://example.com/products\"\ncloudrouter browser snapshot <id>            # Full tree for structure\ncloudrouter browser get-text <id> @e5        # Extract specific text\ncloudrouter browser eval <id> \"JSON.stringify([...document.querySelectorAll(''.product'')].map(p => p.textContent))\"\n```\n\n### Multi-page Navigation\n\n```bash\ncloudrouter browser open <id> \"https://example.com\"\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>\ncloudrouter browser click <id> @e3           # Click a link\ncloudrouter browser wait <id> 2000           # Wait for page load\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>         # ALWAYS re-snapshot after navigation\n```\n\n### Auth State Persistence\n\n```bash\n# Login once and save state\ncloudrouter browser open <id> \"https://app.example.com/login\"\ncloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>\ncloudrouter browser fill <id> @e1 \"user@example.com\"\ncloudrouter browser fill <id> @e2 \"password\"\ncloudrouter browser click <id> @e3\ncloudrouter browser wait <id> 2000\ncloudrouter browser state-save <id> /tmp/auth.json\n\n# Restore in future sessions\ncloudrouter browser state-load <id> /tmp/auth.json\ncloudrouter browser open <id> \"https://app.example.com/dashboard\"\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. **Flags go BEFORE the sandbox ID.** `cloudrouter browser snapshot -i <id>` works. `cloudrouter browser snapshot <id> -i` silently returns empty/wrong results.\n\n2. **ALWAYS re-snapshot after navigation or clicks.** Page content changes, refs become stale.\n\n3. **Use `-i` flag** for snapshots — interactive elements only, much more efficient.\n\n4. **Don''t mix snapshot modes.** Full `snapshot` and `snapshot -i` assign DIFFERENT ref numbers. Stick to one mode (use `-i`).\n\n5. **Use `fill` not `type`** for form fields. `fill` clears first; `type` appends.\n\n6. **Refs are temporary.** They reset after each snapshot. Always use fresh refs.\n\n7. **Verify before interacting.** Check snapshot output to confirm you have the right element.\n\n8. **Handle loading states.** If elements are missing, `wait` and re-snapshot.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Element not found / wrong element | Re-snapshot with `-i`, refs are stale |\n| `snapshot <id> -i` returns empty | Put flags BEFORE id: `snapshot -i <id>` |\n| Click doesn''t work | Try `hover` first, then `click` |\n| Page not loading | Check URL with `cloudrouter browser url <id>` |\n| Browser not ready | Wait a few seconds after sandbox creation, retry |\n| Refs differ between snapshots | Don''t mix full and `-i` snapshots |\n| Form field has old text | Use `fill` (clears first) instead of `type` |\n| `find ... role button click` clicks wrong button | Use `find ... text \"Button Name\" click` instead |\n| `find ... --name \"X\"` fails | There is no `--name` flag — use `text` locator |\n| `npm install` EACCES error | Run `cloudrouter ssh <id> \"sudo chown -R 1000:1000 /home/user/.npm\"` first |\n| `scrollintoview @e1` fails with \"Unsupported token\" | `scrollintoview` and `highlight` only accept CSS selectors (`\"#id\"`, `\".class\"`), NOT `@e` refs |\n| `pkill -f` kills SSH session (exit 143/255) | `pkill -f` pattern may match the SSH session. Just run another command to recover |\n| `pdf` saves to remote, not local | File saves inside sandbox (e.g. `/tmp/page.pdf`). Use `cloudrouter download` to retrieve |\n| `storage-local <id> key` shows \"Done\" not value | Use `eval <id> \"localStorage.getItem(''key'')\"` to get a specific localStorage value |\n| Stale ref error: \"Action timed out\" | Always re-snapshot after clicks/form submits that change the DOM |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:26:49.940Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing advanced browser automation capabilities via SSH in cloud sandboxes.","zh":"非常适合需要在云沙盒中通过SSH实现高级浏览器自动化能力的云代理。","ja":"クラウドエージェントがクラウドサンドボックス内でSSHを介して高度なブラウザ自動化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"클라우드 샌드박스 내에서 SSH를 통해 고급 브라우저 자동화 기능이 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes en la nube que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de automatización del navegador a través de SSH en entornos de sandbox en la nube.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant des capacités avancées d''automatisation de navigateur via SSH dans les sandbox cloud.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die erweiterte Browser-Automatisierungsfähigkeiten über SSH in Cloud-Sandboxen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que precisam de capacidades avançadas de automação de navegador via SSH em ambientes de sandbox de nuvem.","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, требующих продвинутых возможностей автоматизации браузера через SSH в облачных песочницах.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذي يحتاج إلى مميزات متقدمة في أتمتة المتصفح عبر SSH في بيئات رمل السحابة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using cloudrouter browser, wrapping agent-browser for seamless command execution inside sandboxes via SSH, leveraging protocols like SSH for secure interactions.","zh":"赋予代理浏览器交互的自动化能力，使用cloudrouter浏览器，将代理-浏览器包装为无缝的命令执行，通过SSH在沙盒内进行安全交互，利用SSH等协议。","ja":"クラウドルーター ブラウザを使用して、エージェントとブラウザの無縫なコマンド実行を可能にし、SSH経由でサンドボックス内で安全なやり取りを実現することで、ブラウザの自動化をエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"클라우드 라우터 브라우저를 사용하여 에이전트-브라우저를 無縫한 명령 실행으로包装하여 SSH를 통해 샌드박스 내에서 보안 상호 작용을 구현함으로써 브라우저 상호 작용의 자동화를 에이전트에 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las interacciones del navegador utilizando el navegador cloudrouter, que envuelve el agente-navegador para una ejecución de comandos sin problemas dentro de los entornos de sandbox a través de SSH, aprovechando protocolos como SSH para interacciones seguras.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour automatiser les interactions de navigateur en utilisant le navigateur cloudrouter, qui enveloppe l''agent-navigateur pour une exécution de commandes transparente à l''intérieur des sandbox via SSH, en exploitant des protocoles comme SSH pour des interactions sécurisées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Browser-Interaktionen mithilfe des cloudrouter-Browsers zu automatisieren, der den Agent-Browser für eine nahtlose Befehlsausführung in Sandboxen über SSH umhüllt, indem Protokolle wie SSH für sichere Interaktionen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações do navegador usando o navegador cloudrouter, envolvendo o agente-navegador para execução de comandos sem interrupção dentro das caixas de areia via SSH, aproveitando protocolos como SSH para interações seguras.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера, используя браузер cloudrouter, оборачивая агент-браузер для беспрепятственной выполнения команд внутри песочниц через SSH, используя протоколы, такие как SSH, для безопасных взаимодействий.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح باستخدام متصفح cloudrouter ، ومحاكاة وكيل المتصفح لتنفيذ الأوامر بسلاسة داخل صناديق الرمل عبر SSH ، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل SSH للتفاعلات الآمنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser interactions in cloud sandboxes","Running commands inside sandboxes via SSH","Snapshotting and re-snapshotting browser states for analysis"],"zh":["在云沙盒中自动化浏览器交互","通过SSH在沙盒中运行命令","快照和重新快照浏览器状态以进行分析"],"ja":["クラウドサンドボックス内でのブラウザ操作の自動化","SSH経由でサンドボックス内でコマンドを実行","ブラウザの状態をスナップショットして再スナップショットして分析"],"ko":["클라우드 샌드박스 내에서 브라우저 상호 작용의 자동화","SSH를 통해 샌드박스 내에서 명령을 실행","브라우저 상태를 스냅샷하고 재스냅샷하여 분석"],"es":["Automatizar interacciones del navegador en entornos de sandbox en la nube","Ejecutar comandos dentro de los entornos de sandbox a través de SSH","Instantáneas y volver a instantáneas de los estados del navegador para análisis"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions de navigateur dans les sandbox cloud","Exécuter des commandes à l''intérieur des sandbox via SSH","Instantanés et réinstantanés des états de navigateur pour analyse"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browser-Interaktionen in Cloud-Sandboxen","Ausführen von Befehlen innerhalb von Sandboxen über SSH","Schnappschüsse und erneute Schnappschüsse von Browserzuständen für Analysen"],"pt":["Automatizar interações do navegador em ambientes de sandbox de nuvem","Executar comandos dentro das caixas de areia via SSH","Capturar e recapturar estados do navegador para análise"],"ru":["Автоматизация взаимодействий браузера в облачных песочницах","Выполнение команд внутри песочниц через SSH","Создание снимков и повторное создание снимков состояний браузера для анализа"],"ar":["أتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح في بيئات رمل السحابة","تشغيل الأوامر داخل صناديق الرمل عبر SSH ","تصوير وتصوير مرئي لحالات المتصفح للتحليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a running cloudrouter sandbox","Needs sandbox ID from cloudrouter ls or creation with cloudrouter start"],"zh":["需要运行中的cloudrouter沙盒","需要从cloudrouter ls或cloudrouter start创建中获取沙盒ID"],"ja":["cloudrouterサンドボックスが実行されている必要がある","cloudrouter lsまたはcloudrouter startからサンドボックスIDを取得する必要がある"],"ko":["실행 중인 클라우드 라우터 샌드박스가 필요","클라우드 라우터 ls 또는 클라우드 라우터 시작에서 샌드박스 ID를 얻는 것이 필요"],"es":["Requiere un sandbox cloudrouter en ejecución","Necesita el ID de sandbox de cloudrouter ls o creación con cloudrouter start"],"fr":["Nécessite un sandbox cloudrouter en cours d''exécution","A besoin de l''ID de sandbox de cloudrouter ls ou de création avec cloudrouter start"],"de":["Benötigt einen laufenden cloudrouter-Sandbox","Benötigt die Sandbox-ID von cloudrouter ls oder Erstellung mit cloudrouter start"],"pt":["Exige uma caixa de areia cloudrouter em execução","Necessita do ID da caixa de areia do cloudrouter ls ou criação com cloudrouter start"],"ru":["Требует работающей песочницы cloudrouter","Требует идентификатора песочницы из cloudrouter ls или создания с cloudrouter start"],"ar":["يتطلب sandbox cloudrouter قيد التشغيل","يحتاج إلى معرف sandbox من cloudrouter ls أو إنشائه باستخدام cloudrouter start"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
