ботчиков","ar":"تأتمة كالندلي للمطورين","en":"calendly-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Calendly automation ","ja":"Calendly ","ko":"Calendly ","es":"La automatización de Calendly permite a los desarrolladores gestionar eventos y organizaciones de manera eficiente. Con Composio, puedes automatizar operacio...","fr":"L''automatisation de Calendly permet aux développeurs de gérer les événements et les organisations de manière efficace. Avec Composio, vous pouvez automatiser...","de":"Die Automatisierung von Calendly ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Ereignisse und Organisationen effizient zu verwalten. Mit Composio können Sie Operationen wie die...","pt":"Automatize operações do Calendly, incluindo lista de eventos, gerenciamento de convidados e criação de links de agendamento","ru":"Автоматизируйте операции Calendly, включая список событий, управление приглашениями и создание ссылок на планирование","ar":"أتمة عمليات كالندلي، بما في ذلك قائمة بالأحداث وإدارة المدعوين وإنشاء روابط للمواعيد","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Calendly","Rube MCP","API","Calendly","Calendly"],"ja":["Calendly","Rube MCP","API","Calendly","Calendly"],"ko":["Calendly","Rube MCP","API","Calendly","Calendly"],"es":["Creación de enlaces de programación","Administración de invitados","Lista de eventos","Administración de organizaciones","Consulta de disponibilidad","Integración con Rube MCP"],"fr":["Création de liens de planification","Gestion des invités","Liste d''événements","Administration d''organisations","Requête de disponibilité","Intégration avec Rube MCP"],"de":["Erstellung von Terminierungslinks","Verwaltung von Gästen","Ereignisliste","Organisationsverwaltung","Verfügbarkeitsabfrage","Integration mit Rube MCP"],"pt":["Automatização de operações do Calendly","Gerenciamento de convidados e eventos","Criação de links de agendamento","Consultas de disponibilidade","Administração de organizações"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций Calendly","Управление приглашениями и событиями","Создание ссылок на планирование","Запросы на доступность","Администрирование организаций"],"ar":["تأتمة عمليات كالندلي","إدارة المدعوين والأحداث","إنشاء روابط للمواعيد","استفسارات عن التوفر","إدارة المنظمات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Calendly automation","Rube MCP","Calendly API","Calendly","Calendly","Calendly"],"ja":["Calendly automation","Rube MCP","Calendly API","Calendly","Calendly","Calendly"],"ko":["Calendly automation","Rube MCP","Calendly API","Calendly","Calendly","Calendly"],"es":["automatización de Calendly","desarrollo de Calendly","integración de Calendly","herramientas de Calendly","gestión de eventos Calendly","administración de organizaciones Calendly","Rube MCP","Composio"],"fr":["automatisation de Calendly","développement de Calendly","intégration de Calendly","outils de Calendly","gestion d''événements Calendly","administration d''organisations Calendly","Rube MCP","Composio"],"de":["Automatisierung von Calendly","Entwicklung von Calendly","Integration von Calendly","Tools von Calendly","Ereignisverwaltung Calendly","Organisationsverwaltung Calendly","Rube MCP","Composio"],"pt":["Calendly Automation","Rube MCP","Automatização de operações","Gerenciamento de convidados","Criação de links de agendamento","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Автоматизация Calendly","Rube MCP","Автоматизация операций","Управление приглашениями","Создание ссылок на планирование","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تأتمة كالندلي","Rube MCP","تأتمة عمليات","إدارة المدعوين","إنشاء روابط للمواعيد","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"calendly-automation","description":"Automate Calendly scheduling, event management, invitee tracking, availability checks, and organization administration via Rube MCP (Composio). Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendl","body":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendly URI, obtained via `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER`\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Calendly OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and View Scheduled Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see their upcoming, past, or filtered Calendly events\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get authenticated user URI and organization URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - List events scoped by user, organization, or group [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Get detailed info for a specific event by UUID [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `user`: Full Calendly API URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`) - NOT `\"me\"`\n- `organization`: Full organization URI for org-scoped queries\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `min_start_time` / `max_start_time`: UTC timestamps (e.g., `2024-01-01T00:00:00.000000Z`)\n- `invitee_email`: Filter events by invitee email (filter only, not a scope)\n- `sort`: `\"start_time:asc\"` or `\"start_time:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n- `page_token`: Pagination token from previous response\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Exactly ONE of `user`, `organization`, or `group` must be provided - omitting or combining scopes fails\n- The `user` parameter requires the full API URI, not `\"me\"` - use `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` first\n- `invitee_email` is a filter, not a scope; you still need one of user/organization/group\n- Pagination uses `count` + `page_token`; loop until `page_token` is absent for complete results\n- Admin rights may be needed for organization or group scope queries\n\n### 2. Manage Event Invitees\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see who is booked for events or get invitee details\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the target event(s) [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - List all invitees for a specific event [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` - Get detailed info for a single invitee [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID (for `LIST_EVENT_INVITEES`)\n- `event_uuid` + `invitee_uuid`: Both required for `GET_EVENT_INVITEE`\n- `email`: Filter invitees by email address\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `sort`: `\"created_at:asc\"` or `\"created_at:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- The `uuid` parameter for `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` is the event UUID, not the invitee UUID\n- Paginate using `page_token` until absent for complete invitee lists\n- Canceled invitees are excluded by default; use `status: \"canceled\"` to see them\n\n### 3. Create Scheduling Links and Check Availability\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate a booking link or check available time slots\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` - List available event types [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` - Check available slots for an event type [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` - Generate a single-use scheduling link [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` - View user''s availability schedules [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `owner`: Event type URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/{uuid}`)\n- `owner_type`: `\"EventType\"` (default)\n- `max_event_count`: Must be exactly `1` for single-use links\n- `start_time` / `end_time`: UTC timestamps for availability queries (max 7-day range)\n- `active`: Boolean to filter active/inactive event types\n- `user`: User URI for event type listing\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` can return 403 if token lacks rights or owner URI is invalid\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` requires UTC timestamps and max 7-day range; split longer searches\n- Available times results are NOT paginated - all results returned in one response\n- Event type URIs must be full API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/...`)\n\n### 4. Cancel Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to cancel a scheduled Calendly event\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the event to cancel [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Confirm event details before cancellation [Prerequisite]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - Check who will be affected [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` - Cancel the event [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID to cancel\n- `reason`: Optional cancellation reason (may be included in notification to invitees)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Cancellation is IRREVERSIBLE - always confirm with the user before calling\n- Cancellation may trigger notifications to invitees\n- Only active events can be canceled; already-canceled events return errors\n- Get explicit user confirmation before executing `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT`\n\n### 5. Manage Organization and Invitations\n\n**When to use**: User wants to invite members, manage organization, or handle org invitations\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user and organization context [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` - Get organization details [Optional]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` - Check existing invitations [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Send an org invitation [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Revoke a pending invitation [Optional]\n6. `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` - Remove a member [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Organization UUID\n- `email`: Email address of user to invite\n- `status`: Filter invitations by `\"pending\"`, `\"accepted\"`, or `\"declined\"`\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Only org owners/admins can manage invitations and removals; others get authorization errors\n- Duplicate active invitations for the same email are rejected - check existing invitations first\n- Organization owners cannot be removed via `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION`\n- Invitation statuses include pending, accepted, declined, and revoked - handle each appropriately\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### ID Resolution\nCalendly uses full API URIs as identifiers, not simple IDs:\n- **Current user URI**: `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` returns `resource.uri` (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- **Organization URI**: Found in current user response at `resource.current_organization`\n- **Event UUID**: Extract from event URI or list responses\n- **Event type URI**: From `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` response\n\nImportant: Never use `\"me\"` as a user parameter in list/filter endpoints. Always resolve to the full URI first.\n\n### Pagination\nMost Calendly list endpoints use token-based pagination:\n- Set `count` for page size (default 20)\n- Follow `page_token` from `pagination.next_page_token` until absent\n- Sort with `field:direction` format (e.g., `start_time:asc`, `created_at:desc`)\n\n### Time Handling\n- All timestamps must be in UTC format: `yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss.ffffffZ`\n- Use `min_start_time` / `max_start_time` for date range filtering on events\n- Available times queries have a maximum 7-day range; split longer searches into multiple calls\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n### URI Formats\n- All entity references use full Calendly API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- Never pass bare UUIDs where URIs are expected, and never pass `\"me\"` to list endpoints\n- Extract UUIDs from URIs when tools expect UUID parameters (e.g., `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT`)\n\n### Scope Requirements\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` requires exactly one scope (user, organization, or group) - no more, no less\n- Organization/group scoped queries may require admin privileges\n- Token scope determines which operations are available; 403 errors indicate insufficient permissions\n\n### Data Relationships\n- Events have invitees (attendees who booked)\n- Event types define scheduling pages (duration, availability rules)\n- Organizations contain users and groups\n- Scheduling links are tied to event types, not directly to events\n\n### Rate Limits\n- Calendly API has rate limits; avoid tight loops over large datasets\n- Paginate responsibly and add delays for batch operations\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Get current user | `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` | (none) |\n| Get user by UUID | `CALENDLY_GET_USER` | `uuid` |\n| List events | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` | `user`, `status`, `min_start_time` |\n| Get event details | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` | `uuid` |\n| Cancel event | `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` | `uuid`, `reason` |\n| List invitees | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` | `uuid`, `status`, `email` |\n| Get invitee | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` | `event_uuid`, `invitee_uuid` |\n| List event types | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` | `user`, `active` |\n| Get event type | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_TYPE` | `uuid` |\n| Check availability | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` | event type URI, `start_time`, `end_time` |\n| Create scheduling link | `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` | `owner`, `max_event_count` |\n| List availability schedules | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` | user URI |\n| Get organization | `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` | `uuid` |\n| Invite to org | `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | `uuid`, `email` |\n| List org invitations | `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` | `uuid`, `status` |\n| Revoke org invitation | `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | org UUID, invitation UUID |\n| Remove from org | `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` | membership UUID |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:26:50.890Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Scheduling Agents needing seamless Calendly integration and automation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝Calendly集成和自动化能力的调度代理。","ja":"スケジューリングエージェントがシームレスなCalendly統合と自動化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"스케줄링 에이전트가 무결점의 Calendly 통합 및 자동화 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de programación que necesitan una integración y capacidades de automatización de Calendly sin problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de planification ayant besoin d''une intégration Calendly transparente et de capacités d''automatisation.","de":"Perfekt für Scheduling-Agents, die eine nahtlose Calendly-Integration und Automatisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Agendamento que necessitam de integração sem interrupções com o Calendly e capacidades de automação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов планирования, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с Calendly и возможности автоматизации.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات एजنت التي تحتاج إلى دمج أتمتة بدون انقطاع مع Calendly و القدرات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Calendly operations, including event listing, invitee management, and scheduling link creation, utilizing Composio''s Calendly toolkit and Rube MCP connections, while querying availability and administering organizations via the `calendly` toolkit and `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` protocol.","zh":"赋予代理自动化Calendly操作的能力，包括事件列表、受邀者管理和调度链接创建，利用Composio的Calendly工具包和Rube MCP连接，同时查询可用性并通过`calendly`工具包和`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`协议管理组织。","ja":"エージェントがCalendly操作を自動化する能力を提供します。イベントリスト、招待者管理、スケジューリングリンクの作成などをComposioのCalendlyツールキットとRube MCP接続を使用して実行し、同時に`calendly`ツールキットと`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`プロトコルを使用して可用性の照会と組織の管理を行います。","ko":"에이전트가 Composio의 Calendly 툴킷과 Rube MCP 연결을 사용하여 Calendly 작동을 자동화 할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. 이는 이벤트 목록, 초대자 관리 및 스케줄링 링크 생성을 포함하며, 동시에 `calendly` 툴킷과 `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` 프로토콜을 사용하여 가용성을 조회하고 조직을 관리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de Calendly, incluida la lista de eventos, la gestión de invitados y la creación de enlaces de programación, utilizando la herramienta de Calendly de Composio y las conexiones de Rube MCP, mientras se consulta la disponibilidad y se administran las organizaciones a través de la herramienta `calendly` y el protocolo `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations Calendly, notamment la liste d''événements, la gestion des invités et la création de liens de planification, en utilisant le kit d''outils Calendly de Composio et les connexions Rube MCP, tout en interrogeant la disponibilité et en administrant les organisations via le kit d''outils `calendly` et le protocole `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Calendly-Operationen zu automatisieren, einschließlich Ereignisauflistung, Invitee-Verwaltung und Erstellung von Terminverknüpfungen, unter Verwendung des Calendly-Toolkits von Composio und der Rube-MCP-Verbindungen, während die Verfügbarkeit abgefragt und die Organisationen über das `calendly`-Toolkit und das `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`-Protokoll verwaltet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações do Calendly, incluindo listagem de eventos, gerenciamento de convidados e criação de links de agendamento, utilizando a caixa de ferramentas do Calendly da Composio e conexões Rube MCP, enquanto consulta a disponibilidade e administra organizações por meio da caixa de ferramentas `calendly` e do protocolo `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции Calendly, включая перечисление событий, управление приглашенными и создание ссылок на планирование, используя набор инструментов Calendly Composio и подключения Rube MCP, а также проверка доступности и администрирование организаций через набор инструментов `calendly` и протокол `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`.","ar":"يمنح الوكالات القدرة على تلقين عمليات كالندلي، بما في ذلك قائمة الأحداث وإدارة المُدعوين وإنشاء روابط الجدولة، باستخدام أدوات كالندلي من كومبوسيو و اتصالات روب ام سي بي، مع استعلام التوفر وإدارة المنظمات عبر أدوات `calendly` و بروتوكول `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating event scheduling and invitee management through Calendly","Generating scheduling links and querying availability for optimal meeting times","Administering organization settings and user permissions within Calendly"],"zh":["通过Calendly自动化事件调度和受邀者管理","生成调度链接并查询可用性以确定最佳会议时间","在Calendly中管理组织设置和用户权限"],"ja":["Calendlyを使用したイベントスケジューリングと招待者管理の自動化","スケジューリングリンクの生成と可用性の照会による最適なミーティング時間の決定","Calendly内での組織設定とユーザーパーミッションの管理"],"ko":["Calendly를 사용한 이벤트 스케줄링 및 초대자 관리 자동화","스케줄링 링크 생성 및 가용성 조회를 통한 최적의 미팅 시간 결정","Calendly 내의 조직 설정 및 사용자 권한 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la programación de eventos y gestión de invitados a través de Calendly","Generación de enlaces de programación y consulta de disponibilidad para momentos de reunión óptimos","Administración de la configuración de la organización y los permisos de usuario dentro de Calendly"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification d''événements et de la gestion des invités via Calendly","Génération de liens de planification et interrogation de la disponibilité pour des moments de réunion optimaux","Administration des paramètres d''organisation et des autorisations d''utilisateur au sein de Calendly"],"de":["Automatisierung der Terminplanung und Invitee-Verwaltung über Calendly","Erstellung von Terminverknüpfungen und Abfrage der Verfügbarkeit für optimale Besprechungszeiten","Verwaltung der Organisations-einstellungen und Benutzerberechtigungen innerhalb von Calendly"],"pt":["Automatizar a programação de eventos e gerenciamento de convidados por meio do Calendly","Gerar links de programação e consultar a disponibilidade para horários de reunião ótimos","Administrar configurações de organização e permissões de usuário dentro do Calendly"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование событий и управление приглашенными через Calendly","Генерировать ссылки на планирование и проверять доступность для оптимальных времен встреч","Администрировать настройки организации и разрешения пользователей внутри Calendly"],"ar":["تلبين جدولة الأحداث وإدارة المُدعوين من خلال كالندلي","توليد روابط الجدولة واستعلام التوفر لأوقات الاجتماعات المثلى","إدارة إعدادات المنظمة و صلاحيات المستخدم داخل كالندلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with `calendly` toolkit necessary","Many operations require the user''s Calendly credentials"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接且RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS可用","需要通过`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`的Calendly连接以及`calendly`工具包","许多操作需要用户的Calendly凭证"],"ja":["Rube MCP接続が必要であり、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSが利用可能であること","`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`を介したCalendly接続および`calendly`ツールキットが必要","多くの操作ではユーザーのCalendly資格情報が必要"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결이 필요하며 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 사용할 수 있어야 함","`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`를 통한 Calendly 연결 및 `calendly` 툴킷이 필요","많은 작업에서 사용자의 Calendly 자격 증명이 필요"],"es":["Requiere conexión Rube MCP con herramientas de búsqueda RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Conexión Calendly activa a través de `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` con herramienta `calendly` necesaria","Muchas operaciones requieren las credenciales de Calendly del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP avec des outils de recherche RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Connexion Calendly active via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` avec l''outil `calendly` nécessaire","De nombreuses opérations nécessitent les informations d''identification de Calendly de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung mit verfügbaren RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS-Suchwerkzeugen","Aktive Calendly-Verbindung über `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` mit `calendly`-Toolkit erforderlich","Viele Operationen erfordern die Calendly-Anmeldeinformationen des Benutzers"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponíveis","Conexão ativa do Calendly via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` com caixa de ferramentas `calendly` necessária","Muitas operações requerem as credenciais do Calendly do usuário"],"ru":["Требует подключения Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Активное подключение Calendly через `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` с набором инструментов `calendly` необходимо","Многие операции требуют учетных данных Calendly пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصال روب ام سي بي مع أدوات البحث RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS المتاحة","اتصال نشط لكالندلي عبر `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` مع أدوات `calendly` ضروري","تتطلب العديد من العمليات بيانات اعتماد المستخدم لكالندلي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('StraitjacketOne/documentalcases/gh-address-comments', 'community', 'StraitjacketOne', 'documentalcases', 'StraitjacketOne/documentalcases', 'gh-address-comments', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z', '2026-02-18T09:27:08.165Z', NULL, '{"id":"StraitjacketOne/documentalcases/gh-address-comments","name":"gh-address-comments","description":{"zh":"gh-address-comments, GitHub PR .","ja":"gh-address-commentsGitHubPR","ko":"gh-address-comments, GitHub PR ","es":"GH Address Comments es una herramienta para automatizar respuestas a comentarios de PR. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a gestionar comentarios de forma eficiente","fr":"GH Address Comments est un outil pour automatiser les réponses aux commentaires de PR. Il aide les développeurs à gérer les commentaires de manière efficace","de":"GH Address Comments ist ein Tool zum Automatisieren von PR-Kommentar-Antworten. Es hilft Entwicklern, Kommentare effizient zu verwalten","pt":"O manipulador de comentários do GitHub é uma ferramenta para gerenciar comentários de PR. Utilize o comando gh para gerenciar comentários de forma eficaz.","ru":"Обработчик комментариев GitHub - это инструмент для управления комментариями PR. Используйте команду gh для эффективного управления комментариями.","ar":"معالج تعليقات جيثب هو أداة لتدارة التعليقات على طلبات السحب. استخدم أمر جيثب لإدارة التعليقات بفعالية.","en":"Dump"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"gh-address-comments: GitHub PR ","ja":"gh-address-comments: GitHubPR","ko":"gh-address-comments: GitHub PR ","es":"GH Address Comments: automatiza respuestas a comentarios ...","fr":"GH Address Comments : automatez les réponses aux commenta...","de":"GH Address Comments: Automatisieren Sie PR-Kommentar-Antw...","pt":"Manipulador de Comentários do GitHub","ru":"Обработчик комментариев GitHub","ar":"معالج تعليقات جيثب","en":"gh-address-comments"},"description":{"zh":"gh-address-comments, GitHub PR .","ja":"gh-address-commentsGitHubPR","ko":"gh-address-comments, GitHub PR ","es":"GH Address Comments es una herramienta para automatizar respuestas a comentarios de PR. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a gestionar comentarios de forma eficiente","fr":"GH Address Comments est un outil pour automatiser les réponses aux commentaires de PR. Il aide les développeurs à gérer les commentaires de manière efficace","de":"GH Address Comments ist ein Tool zum Automatisieren von PR-Kommentar-Antworten. Es hilft Entwicklern, Kommentare effizient zu verwalten","pt":"O manipulador de comentários do GitHub é uma ferramenta para gerenciar comentários de PR. Utilize o comando gh para gerenciar comentários de forma eficaz.","ru":"Обработчик комментариев GitHub - это инструмент для управления комментариями PR. Используйте команду gh для эффективного управления комментариями.","ar":"معالج تعليقات جيثب هو أداة لتدارة التعليقات على طلبات السحب. استخدم أمر جيثب لإدارة التعليقات بفعالية.","en":"Dump"},"definition":{"en":"Dump"},"features":{"zh":["GitHub PR ","gh CLI","PR ","gh auth login","gh auth status","sandbox_permissions"],"ja":["GitHubPR","ghCLI","PR","gh auth login","gh auth status","sandbox_permissions"],"ko":["GitHub PR ","gh CLI","PR ","gh auth login","gh auth status","sandbox_permissions"],"es":["Automatiza respuestas a comentarios de PR","Integración con GitHub CLI","Permite acceso de red elevado","Requiere autenticación con gh auth login","Soporta sandboxing con permisos escalados"],"fr":["Automatisez les réponses aux commentaires de PR","Intégration à GitHub CLI","Permet un accès réseau élevé","Requiert une authentification avec gh auth login","Prend en charge le sandboxing avec des autorisations élevées"],"de":["Automatisiert PR-Kommentar-Antworten","Integration mit GitHub CLI","Ermöglicht erweiterten Netzwerkzugriff","Benötigt Authentifizierung mit gh auth login","Unterstützt Sandboxing mit erhöhten Berechtigungen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de comentários de PR","Utilização do comando gh","Acesso de rede elevado","Autenticação com gh auth login","Verificação de status com gh auth status","Execução de scripts para inspecionar comentários"],"ru":["Управление комментариями PR","Использование команды gh","Повышенный доступ к сети","Аутентификация с помощью gh auth login","Проверка статуса с помощью gh auth status","Выполнение скриптов для проверки комментариев"],"ar":["إدارة التعليقات على طلبات السحب","استخدام أمر جيثب","وصول الشبكة المعزز","التحقق من خلال جيثب للتسجيل","التحقق من الحالة باستخدام جيثب للحالة","تشغيل البرامج النصية لتفحص التعليقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["gh-address-comments","GitHub PR","gh CLI","PR ","gh auth login","gh auth status","sandbox_permissions","GitHub","PR"],"ja":["gh-address-comments","GitHubPR","ghCLI","PR","gh auth login","gh auth status","sandbox_permissions","GitHub","PR"],"ko":["gh-address-comments","GitHub PR","gh CLI","PR ","gh auth login","gh auth status","sandbox_permissions","GitHub","PR"],"es":["GH Address Comments","automatizar comentarios de PR","GitHub CLI","acceso de red elevado","autenticación gh auth login","sandboxing con permisos escalados"],"fr":["GH Address Comments","automatiser les commentaires de PR","GitHub CLI","accès réseau élevé","authentification gh auth login","sandboxing avec autorisations élevées"],"de":["GH Address Comments","Automatisieren von PR-Kommentaren","GitHub CLI","erweiterter Netzwerkzugriff","Authentifizierung mit gh auth login","Sandboxing mit erhöhten Berechtigungen"],"pt":["github","pr","comentários","gh","autenticação","acesso de rede","gerenciamento de comentários","desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["github","pr","комментарии","gh","аутентификация","доступ к сети","управление комментариями","разработчики","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["جيثب","طلبات السحب","التعليقات","جيثب","التحقق","وصول الشبكة","إدارة التعليقات","المطورون","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"StraitjacketOne","repo":"documentalcases","repoPath":"StraitjacketOne/documentalcases","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-address-comments","description":"Help address review/issue comments on the open GitHub PR for the current branch using gh CLI; verify gh auth first and prompt the user to authenticate if not logged in.","bodyPreview":"# PR Comment Handler\n\nGuide to find the open PR for the current branch and address its comments with gh CLI. Run all `gh` commands with elevated network access.\n\nPrereq: ensure `gh` is authenticated (for example, run `gh auth login` once), then run `gh auth status` with escalated permissions (include workflow/repo scopes) so `gh` commands succeed. If sandboxing blocks `gh auth status`, rerun it with `sandbox_permissions=require_escalated`.\n\n## 1) Inspect comments needing attention\n- Run scripts/","body":"# PR Comment Handler\n\nGuide to find the open PR for the current branch and address its comments with gh CLI. Run all `gh` commands with elevated network access.\n\nPrereq: ensure `gh` is authenticated (for example, run `gh auth login` once), then run `gh auth status` with escalated permissions (include workflow/repo scopes) so `gh` commands succeed. If sandboxing blocks `gh auth status`, rerun it with `sandbox_permissions=require_escalated`.\n\n## 1) Inspect comments needing attention\n- Run scripts/fetch_comments.py which will print out all the comments and review threads on the PR\n\n## 2) Ask the user for clarification\n- Number all the review threads and comments and provide a short summary of what would be required to apply a fix for it\n- Ask the user which numbered comments should be addressed\n\n## 3) If user chooses comments\n- Apply fixes for the selected comments\n\nNotes:\n- If gh hits auth/rate issues mid-run, prompt the user to re-authenticate with `gh auth login`, then retry.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:27:08.165Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for GitHub Integration Agents needing automated PR comment handling with gh CLI.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化PR评论处理的GitHub集成代理，使用gh CLI。","ja":"GitHub Integration Agentsが自動化されたPRコメントハンドリングを必要とする場合に最適です。gh CLIを使用します。","ko":"자동화된 PR 댓글 처리가 필요한 GitHub 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다. gh CLI를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Integración de GitHub que necesitan manejo automatizado de comentarios de PR con gh CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''intégration GitHub nécessitant une gestion automatique des commentaires de PR avec gh CLI.","de":"Perfekt für GitHub-Integration-Agents, die ein automatisiertes PR-Kommentar-Handling mit gh CLI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Integração do GitHub que necessitam de manejo automatizado de comentários de PR com gh CLI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов интеграции GitHub, которым требуется автоматизированная обработка комментариев PR с помощью gh CLI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التكامل GitHub الذي يحتاج إلى التعامل التلقائي مع تعليقات طلبات السحب باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر gh."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to inspect and address comments on open PRs using the gh command-line interface, ensuring seamless communication with elevated network access and workflow/repo scopes.","zh":"赋予代理人检查和处理打开的PR上的评论的能力，使用gh命令行接口，确保与提高网络访问和工作流/仓库范围的无缝通信。","ja":"エージェントがghコマンドラインインターフェイスを使用してオープンPRのコメントを調査して対応できるようにし、ネットワークアクセスとワークフロー/リポジトリの範囲が高められた無缝なコミュニケーションを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 gh 명령줄 인터페이스를 사용하여 열린 PR의 댓글을 조사하고対応할 수 있도록 하여 네트워크 액세스와 워크플로/리포지토리 범위가 향상된 무결점 통신을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a inspeccionar y abordar comentarios en PRs abiertas utilizando la interfaz de línea de comandos gh, garantizando una comunicación fluida con acceso elevado a la red y ámbitos de flujo de trabajo/repositorio.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''inspecter et de traiter les commentaires sur les PR ouvertes en utilisant l''interface de ligne de commande gh, garantissant une communication fluide avec un accès réseau élevé et des étendues de workflow/répertoire.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Kommentare in offenen PRs mithilfe der gh-Kommandozeilenoberfläche zu überprüfen und zu bearbeiten, und gewährleistet so eine nahtlose Kommunikation mit erhöhtem Netzwerkzugriff und Workflow/Repository-Umfängen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a inspecionar e abordar comentários em PRs abertos usando a interface de linha de comando gh, garantindo uma comunicação sem interrupções com acesso de rede elevado e escopos de fluxo de trabalho/repositório.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять и обрабатывать комментарии к открытым PR, используя командную строку gh, обеспечивая бесперебойную связь с повышенным доступом к сети и областями действия рабочего процесса/репозитория.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فحص وتناول التعليقات على طلبات السحب المفتوحة باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر gh، مما يضمن الاتصال السلس بدون انقطاع مع وصول الشبكة المعزز ونطاقات سير العمل/المستودع."},"useCases":{"en":["Inspecting comments needing attention on open PRs","Automating PR comment responses with gh CLI","Debugging authentication issues with gh auth status"],"zh":["检查打开的PR上需要关注的评论","使用gh CLI自动化PR评论响应","调试gh auth status的身份验证问题"],"ja":["オープンPRのコメントを調査して対応する","gh CLIを使用してPRコメントの自動応答","gh auth statusの認証問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["열린 PR의 댓글을 조사하여注意가 필요한 항목을 확인","gh CLI를 사용하여 PR 댓글 자동 응답","gh auth status의 인증 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Inspeccionar comentarios que necesitan atención en PRs abiertas","Automatizar respuestas de comentarios de PR con gh CLI","Depurar problemas de autenticación con gh auth status"],"fr":["Inspecter les commentaires nécessitant une attention sur les PR ouvertes","Automatiser les réponses de commentaires de PR avec gh CLI","Déboguer les problèmes d''authentification avec gh auth status"],"de":["Überprüfen von Kommentaren, die in offenen PRs Aufmerksamkeit benötigen","Automatisieren von PR-Kommentar-Antworten mit gh CLI","Beheben von Authentifizierungsproblemen mit gh auth status"],"pt":["Inspecionar comentários que precisam de atenção em PRs abertos","Automatizar respostas de comentários de PR com gh CLI","Depurar problemas de autenticação com gh auth status"],"ru":["Проверка комментариев, требующих внимания, в открытых PR","Автоматизация ответов на комментарии PR с помощью gh CLI","Отладка проблем аутентификации с помощью gh auth status"],"ar":["فحص التعليقات التي تحتاج إلى الانتباه في طلبات السحب المفتوحة","تأليف ردود آليّة لتعليقات طلبات السحب باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر gh","تصحيح أخطاء المصادقة باستخدام حالة المصادقة gh"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires gh authentication and authorization","Needs escalated permissions for workflow/repo scopes","May require sandbox_permissions=require_escalated for successful execution"],"zh":["需要gh身份验证和授权","需要提高的权限用于工作流/仓库范围","可能需要sandbox_permissions=require_escalated才能成功执行"],"ja":["ghの認証と認可が必要","ワークフロー/リポジトリの範囲に昇格された権限が必要","実行に成功するにはsandbox_permissions=require_escalatedが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["gh 인증 및 승인이 필요","워크플로/리포지토리 범위에 대해 승격된 권한 필요","성공적인 실행을 위해 sandbox_permissions=require_escalated가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere autenticación y autorización de gh","Necesita permisos elevados para ámbitos de flujo de trabajo/repositorio","Puede requerir sandbox_permissions=require_escalated para una ejecución exitosa"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification et une autorisation gh","Nécessite des autorisations élevées pour les étendues de workflow/répertoire","Peut nécessiter sandbox_permissions=require_escalated pour une exécution réussie"],"de":["Erfordert gh-Authentifizierung und -Autorisierung","Benötigt erhöhte Berechtigungen für Workflow/Repository-Umfänge","Kann sandbox_permissions=require_escalated für eine erfolgreiche Ausführung erfordern"],"pt":["Exige autenticação e autorização gh","Necessita de permissões elevadas para escopos de fluxo de trabalho/repositório","Pode exigir sandbox_permissions=require_escalated para execução bem-sucedida"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации и авторизации gh","Требует повышенных разрешений для областей действия рабочего процесса/репозитория","Может требовать sandbox_permissions=require_escalated для успешного выполнения"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة ومؤشر تقرير غه","يحتاج إلى صلاحيات مرفوعة لمجالات سير العمل/المستودع","يمكن أن يتطلب sandbox_permissions=require_escalated من أجل التنفيذ الناجح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/ai-agents-architect', 'community', 'xiangteng007', 'XXT-AGENT', 'xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT', 'ai-agents-architect', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z', '2026-02-18T09:27:11.432Z', NULL, '{"id":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/ai-agents-architect","name":"ai-agents-architect","description":{"zh":"AI","ja":"AI","ko":"AI ","es":"El arquitecto de agentes de IA diseña sistemas autónomos y controlables. Combina autonomía con supervisión para lograr un equilibrio óptimo.","fr":"L''architecte d''agents IA conçoit des systèmes autonomes et contrôlables. Il équilibre l''autonomie avec la supervision pour atteindre un équilibre optimal.","de":"Der AI-Agenten-Architekt entwirft autonome und steuerbare Systeme. Er balanciert Autonomie mit Überwachung, um ein optimales Gleichgewicht zu erreichen.","pt":"O Arquiteto de Agentes de IA projeta sistemas autônomos que podem atuar de forma independente, com controle e flexibilidade.","ru":"Архитектор ИИ-агентов проектирует автономные системы, которые могут действовать самостоятельно, с контролем и гибкостью.","ar":"مهندس معماري للوكلاء الذكية يصمم أنظمة مستقلة يمكنها العمل بشكل مستقل، مع التحكم والمرونة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI","ja":"AI","ko":"AI ","es":"Arquitecto de Agentes de IA: Diseño de Sistemas Autónomos","fr":"Architecte d''Agents IA : Conception de Systèmes Autonomes","de":"AI-Agenten-Architekt: Entwurf autonomer Systeme","pt":"Arquiteto de Agentes de IA: Desenvolvimento de Sistemas A...","ru":"Архитектор ИИ-агентов: Разработка автономных систем","ar":"مهندس معماري للوكلاء الذكية: بناء أنظمة مستقلة","en":"ai-agents-architect"},"description":{"zh":"AI","ja":"AI","ko":"AI ","es":"El arquitecto de agentes de IA diseña sistemas autónomos y controlables. Combina autonomía con supervisión para lograr un equilibrio óptimo.","fr":"L''architecte d''agents IA conçoit des systèmes autonomes et contrôlables. Il équilibre l''autonomie avec la supervision pour atteindre un équilibre optimal.","de":"Der AI-Agenten-Architekt entwirft autonome und steuerbare Systeme. Er balanciert Autonomie mit Überwachung, um ein optimales Gleichgewicht zu erreichen.","pt":"O Arquiteto de Agentes de IA projeta sistemas autônomos que podem atuar de forma independente, com controle e flexibilidade.","ru":"Архитектор ИИ-агентов проектирует автономные системы, которые могут действовать самостоятельно, с контролем и гибкостью.","ar":"مهندس معماري للوكلاء الذكية يصمم أنظمة مستقلة يمكنها العمل بشكل مستقل، مع التحكم والمرونة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["AI","API","AI","AI","AI"],"ja":["AI","API","AI","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI ","API ","AI ","AI ","AI "],"es":["Diseño de arquitectura de agentes","Sistemas de memoria de agentes","Estrategias de planificación y razonamiento","Orquestación de multiagentes","Diseño de herramientas y funciones"],"fr":["Conception d''architecture d''agents","Systèmes de mémoire d''agents","Stratégies de planification et de raisonnement","Orchestration de multiagents","Conception d''outils et de fonctions"],"de":["Entwurf von Agenten-Architektur","Agenten-Speichersysteme","Planungs- und Reasoning-Strategien","Multiagenten-Orchestrierung","Entwurf von Tools und Funktionen"],"pt":["Design de arquitetura de agentes","Desenvolvimento de sistemas autônomos","Estratégias de planejamento e raciocínio","Sistemas de memória de agentes","Orquestração de múltiplos agentes"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектуры агентов","Разработка автономных систем","Стратегии планирования и рассуждения","Системы памяти агентов","Оркестровка多их агентов"],"ar":["تصميم هياكل الوكلاء","بناء أنظمة مستقلة","استراتيجيات التخطيط والاستدلال","نظم ذاكرة الوكلاء","أوركسترا الوكلاء المتعددين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ja":["AI","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI ","AI ","AI ","AI ","AI ","AI "],"es":["arquitecto de agentes de IA","sistemas autónomos","agentes de IA","diseño de arquitectura de agentes","multiagentes","planificación y razonamiento"],"fr":["architecte d''agents IA","systèmes autonomes","agents IA","conception d''architecture d''agents","multiagents","planification et raisonnement"],"de":["AI-Agenten-Architekt","autonome Systeme","AI-Agenten","Entwurf von Agenten-Architektur","Multiagenten","Planung und Reasoning"],"pt":["Arquiteto de Agentes de IA","Desenvolvimento de Sistemas Autônomos","Inteligência Artificial","Sistemas de Agentes","Autonomia","Controle","Flexibilidade"],"ru":["Архитектор ИИ-агентов","Разработка автономных систем","Искусственный интеллект","Системы агентов","Автономность","Контроль","Гибкость"],"ar":["مهندس معماري للوكلاء الذكية","بناء أنظمة مستقلة","ذكاء اصطناعي","نظم الوكلاء","الاستقلالية","التحكم","المرونة"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-agents-architect","description":"Expert in designing and building autonomous AI agents. Masters tool use, memory systems, planning strategies, and multi-agent orchestration. Use when: build agent, AI agent, autonomous agent, tool use, function calling.","bodyPreview":"# AI Agents Architect\n\n**Role**: AI Agent Systems Architect\n\nI build AI systems that can act autonomously while remaining controllable.\nI understand that agents fail in unexpected ways - I design for graceful\ndegradation and clear failure modes. I balance autonomy with oversight,\nknowing when an agent should ask for help vs proceed independently.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Agent architecture design\n- Tool and function calling\n- Agent memory systems\n- Planning and reasoning strategies\n- Multi-agent orch","body":"# AI Agents Architect\n\n**Role**: AI Agent Systems Architect\n\nI build AI systems that can act autonomously while remaining controllable.\nI understand that agents fail in unexpected ways - I design for graceful\ndegradation and clear failure modes. I balance autonomy with oversight,\nknowing when an agent should ask for help vs proceed independently.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Agent architecture design\n- Tool and function calling\n- Agent memory systems\n- Planning and reasoning strategies\n- Multi-agent orchestration\n- Agent evaluation and debugging\n\n## Requirements\n\n- LLM API usage\n- Understanding of function calling\n- Basic prompt engineering\n\n## Patterns\n\n### ReAct Loop\n\nReason-Act-Observe cycle for step-by-step execution\n\n```javascript\n- Thought: reason about what to do next\n- Action: select and invoke a tool\n- Observation: process tool result\n- Repeat until task complete or stuck\n- Include max iteration limits\n```\n\n### Plan-and-Execute\n\nPlan first, then execute steps\n\n```javascript\n- Planning phase: decompose task into steps\n- Execution phase: execute each step\n- Replanning: adjust plan based on results\n- Separate planner and executor models possible\n```\n\n### Tool Registry\n\nDynamic tool discovery and management\n\n```javascript\n- Register tools with schema and examples\n- Tool selector picks relevant tools for task\n- Lazy loading for expensive tools\n- Usage tracking for optimization\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Unlimited Autonomy\n\n### ❌ Tool Overload\n\n### ❌ Memory Hoarding\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Agent loops without iteration limits | critical | Always set limits: |\n| Vague or incomplete tool descriptions | high | Write complete tool specs: |\n| Tool errors not surfaced to agent | high | Explicit error handling: |\n| Storing everything in agent memory | medium | Selective memory: |\n| Agent has too many tools | medium | Curate tools per task: |\n| Using multiple agents when one would work | medium | Justify multi-agent: |\n| Agent internals not logged or traceable | medium | Implement tracing: |\n| Fragile parsing of agent outputs | medium | Robust output handling: |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `rag-engineer`, `prompt-engineer`, `backend`, `mcp-builder`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:27:11.432Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring advanced architecture design and multi-agent orchestration capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级架构设计和多代理编排能力的自主代理。","ja":"高度なアーキテクチャ設計とマルチエージェントオーケストレーション機能を必要とする自律エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 아키텍처 설계 및 다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션 기능이 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requieren un diseño de arquitectura avanzado y capacidades de orquestación de multiagentes.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Autonomes nécessitant une conception d''architecture avancée et des capacités d''orchestration multi-agents.","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die einen fortschrittlichen Architektur-Design und Multi-Agenten-Orchestrierungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes autônomos que exigem design de arquitetura avançado e capacidades de orquestração de multiagentes.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, требующих продвинутого проектирования архитектуры и возможностей оркестровки нескольких агентов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المستقلة التي تتطلب تصميمًا معماريًا متقدمًا وقدرات إدارة متعددة الوكلاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design autonomous systems with graceful degradation and clear failure modes, utilizing agent memory systems, planning and reasoning strategies, and tool and function calling protocols.","zh":"赋予代理设计自主系统的能力，具有优雅的降级和明确的故障模式，利用代理内存系统、规划和推理策略以及工具和函数调用协议。","ja":"エージェントに自律システムを設計する能力を与え、優雅な劣化と明確な故障モードを備え、エージェントのメモリシステム、計画と推論戦略、およびツールと関数呼び出しプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 자율 시스템을 설계할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 우아한 하향 및 명확한 오류 모드를 갖추고, 에이전트 메모리 시스템, 계획 및 추론 전략 및 도구 및 함수 호출 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar sistemas autónomos con degradación gradual y modos de fallo claros, utilizando sistemas de memoria de agente, estrategias de planificación y razonamiento, y protocolos de llamada de herramientas y funciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des systèmes autonomes avec une dégradation progressive et des modes de défaillance clairs, en utilisant des systèmes de mémoire d''agent, des stratégies de planification et de raisonnement, et des protocoles d''appel d''outils et de fonctions.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, autonome Systeme mit sanfter Degradation und klaren Ausfallmodi zu entwerfen, indem sie Agenten-Speichersysteme, Planungs- und Argumentationsstrategien sowie Werkzeug- und Funktionsaufrufprotokolle verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar sistemas autônomos com degradação graciosa e modos de falha claros, utilizando sistemas de memória de agente, estratégias de planejamento e raciocínio e protocolos de chamada de ferramentas e funções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать автономные системы с плавным ухудшением и ясными режимами отказа, используя системы памяти агентов, стратегии планирования и рассуждения, а также протоколы вызова инструментов и функций.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصميم أنظمة مستقلة مع تدهور لطيف ووظائف فشل واضحة، باستخدام أنظمة ذاكرة الوكيل، واستراتيجيات التخطيط والاستدلال، وبروتوكولات استدعاء الأدوات والدالات."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing agent architecture for complex tasks","Implementing multi-agent orchestration for distributed systems","Developing planning and reasoning strategies for autonomous decision-making"],"zh":["为复杂任务设计代理架构","为分布式系统实现多代理编排","为自主决策开发规划和推理策略"],"ja":["複雑なタスクのためのエージェントアーキテクチャの設計","分散システムのためのマルチエージェントオーケストレーションの実装","自律的な意思決定のための計画と推論戦略の開発"],"ko":["복잡한 작업을 위한 에이전트 아키텍처 설계","분산 시스템을 위한 다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션 구현","자율적인 의사결정을 위한 계획 및 추론 전략 개발"],"es":["Diseñar la arquitectura de agente para tareas complejas","Implementar la orquestación de multiagentes para sistemas distribuidos","Desarrollar estrategias de planificación y razonamiento para la toma de decisiones autónoma"],"fr":["Concevoir l''architecture d''agent pour des tâches complexes","Mettre en œuvre l''orchestration multi-agents pour les systèmes distribués","Développer des stratégies de planification et de raisonnement pour la prise de décision autonome"],"de":["Entwerfen der Agenten-Architektur für komplexe Aufgaben","Implementierung der Multi-Agenten-Orchestrierung für verteilte Systeme","Entwicklung von Planungs- und Argumentationsstrategien für autonome Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Projeto de arquitetura de agente para tarefas complexas","Implementação de orquestração de multiagente para sistemas distribuídos","Desenvolvimento de estratégias de planejamento e raciocínio para tomada de decisões autônoma"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектуры агента для сложных задач","Реализация оркестровки нескольких агентов для распределенных систем","Разработка стратегий планирования и рассуждения для автономного принятия решений"],"ar":["تصميم بنية العميل لعمليات معقدة","تنفيذ إدارة متعددة الوكلاء لأنظمة موزعة","تطوير استراتيجيات التخطيط والاستدلال لاتخاذ القرارات المستقلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of autonomous agent systems","Limited to design and architecture, not implementation details"],"zh":["需要了解自主代理系统","仅限于设计和架构，不包括实现细节"],"ja":["自律エージェントシステムの理解が必要","設計とアーキテクチャに限られ、実装の詳細は含まない"],"ko":["자율 에이전트 시스템에 대한 이해가 필요","설계 및 아키텍처에만 국한되어 있으며, 구현 세부 정보는 포함하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los sistemas de agentes autónomos","Limitado al diseño y la arquitectura, no a los detalles de implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des systèmes d''agents autonomes","Limité à la conception et à l''architecture, et non aux détails d''implémentation"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verständnis für autonome Agenten-Systeme","Begrenzt auf Design und Architektur, nicht auf Implementierungsdetails"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de sistemas de agentes autônomos","Limitado a design e arquitetura, não detalhes de implementação"],"ru":["Требует понимания автономных систем агентов","Ограничен проектированием и архитектурой, а не деталями реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم أنظمة الوكلاء المستقلة","محدود بالتصميم والهيكل، وليس تفاصيل التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/dotnet-backend-patterns', 'community', 'xiangteng007', 'XXT-AGENT', 'xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT', 'dotnet-backend-patterns', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z', '2026-02-18T09:27:24.079Z', NULL, '{"id":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/dotnet-backend-patterns","name":"dotnet-backend-patterns","description":{"zh":"掌握C#/.NET后端开发模式，构建高性能API和企业后端。学习现代最佳实践，包括依赖注入、缓存策略和数据库优化","ja":"C#/.NETバックエンド開発パターンをマスターして、高パフォーマンスのAPIとエンタープライズバックエンドを構築する。モダンなベストプラクティスを学び、依存性注入、キャッシュ戦略、データベース最適化などを学ぶ","ko":"C#/.NET 백엔드 개발 패턴을 마스터하여 고성능 API 및 엔터프라이즈 백엔드를 구축하십시오. 최신 모범 사례를 배우고 종속성 주입, 캐싱 전략 및 데이터베이스 최적화 등에 대해 학습하십시오","es":"Domina patrones de backend .NET para construir APIs y servidores de producción con C# y las mejores prácticas actuales","fr":"Maîtrisez les modèles de backend .NET pour construire des API et des serveurs de production avec C# et les meilleures pratiques actuelles","de":"Meistern Sie .NET-Backend-Muster, um Produktions-APIs und -Server mit C# und aktuellen Best Practices zu erstellen","pt":"Desenvolva habilidades em padrões de desenvolvimento backend .NET para construir APIs de produção e backends empresariais.","ru":"Разработайте навыки в шаблонах разработки бэкенда .NET для создания производственных API и корпоративных бэкендов.","ar":"طور مهارات في أنماط تطوير backend .NET لبناء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الإنتاجية والخلفيات المؤسسية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":".NET后端开发模式","ja":"DotNet-backendパターン","ko":"닷넷 백엔드 개발 패턴","es":"Patrones de backend .NET para APIs y servidores","fr":"Modèles de backend .NET pour les API et les serveurs","de":".NET-Backend-Muster für APIs und Server","pt":"Padrões de Desenvolvimento Backend .NET","ru":"Шаблоны разработки бэкенда .NET","ar":"نماذج desenvolvimento backend .NET","en":"dotnet-backend-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"掌握C#/.NET后端开发模式，构建高性能API和企业后端。学习现代最佳实践，包括依