twurfsmuster für React-Native-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado","Busca de dados API","Cache e gerenciamento de cache","Recursos avançados como atualizações otimistas e streaming","Integração com React Native/Expo"],"ru":["Управление состоянием","Запросы API","Кэширование и управление кэшем","Продвинутые функции, такие как оптимистические обновления и потоковая передача","Интеграция с React Native/Expo"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة","استرجاع بيانات API","الแคش وإدارة الكاش","الميزات المتقدمة مثل التحديثات المثالية والبث","التكامل مع رياكت نيتيف/إكسبو"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Redux Toolkit","RTK Query","React Native","Expo","状态管理","API 数据获取","缓存"],"ja":["Redux Toolkit","RTK Query","React Native","Expo","状態管理","API データ取得","キャッシュ"],"ko":["Redux Toolkit","RTK Query","React Native","Expo","상태 관리","API 데이터 가져오기","캐싱"],"es":["Redux Toolkit","RTK Query","React Native","Expo","Gestión de estado","Caché de datos","Actualizaciones optimistas","Desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Redux Toolkit","RTK Query","React Native","Expo","Gestion d''état","Cache de données","Mises à jour optimistes","Développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Redux Toolkit","RTK Query","React Native","Expo","Zustandsverwaltung","Daten-Cache","Optimistische Updates","Entwicklung von Mobilanwendungen"],"pt":["Redux Toolkit","React Native","Expo","Gerenciamento de estado","Busca de dados API","Cache","Recursos avançados","Desenvolvimento de aplicações móveis"],"ru":["Redux Toolkit","React Native","Expo","Управление состоянием","Запросы API","Кэширование","Продвинутые функции","Разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["ريدوكس تولكيت","رياكت نيتيف","إكسبو","إدارة الحالة","استرجاع بيانات API","الแคش","الميزات المتقدمة","تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة"]}},"owner":"chathuraed","repo":"existing_project","repoPath":"chathuraed/existing_project","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"redux-toolkit","description":"Redux Toolkit and RTK Query patterns for state management and API data fetching. Use when setting up Redux store, creating slices, implementing API calls, building optimistic updates, managing cache, or handling real-time data. Covers store setup, RTK Query endpoints, cache strategies, and advanced patterns.","version":"2.0.0","tags":["react","redux","redux-toolkit","rtk-query","state-management","api","typescript"],"bodyPreview":"# Redux Toolkit & RTK Query\n\nComprehensive Redux Toolkit and RTK Query guide for React Native/Expo applications. Contains patterns for state management, API data fetching, cache management, and advanced features like optimistic updates and streaming.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Setting up Redux store in React Native/Expo app\n- Creating feature slices with actions and reducers\n- Implementing API data fetching and caching\n- Building optimistic updates for instant UI feed","body":"# Redux Toolkit & RTK Query\n\nComprehensive Redux Toolkit and RTK Query guide for React Native/Expo applications. Contains patterns for state management, API data fetching, cache management, and advanced features like optimistic updates and streaming.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Setting up Redux store in React Native/Expo app\n- Creating feature slices with actions and reducers\n- Implementing API data fetching and caching\n- Building optimistic updates for instant UI feedback\n- Managing normalized cache with entity adapters\n- Implementing real-time streaming updates\n- Handling pagination or infinite scroll\n- Testing Redux code\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category            | Impact   | Prefix        |\n| -------- | ------------------- | -------- | ------------- |\n| 1        | Store Setup         | CRITICAL | `store-`      |\n| 2        | State Management    | HIGH     | `slice-`      |\n| 3        | API Integration     | HIGH     | `api-`        |\n| 4        | Cache Management    | MEDIUM   | `cache-`      |\n| 5        | Advanced Patterns   | MEDIUM   | `advanced-`   |\n| 6        | Testing             | MEDIUM   | `testing-`    |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Store Setup (CRITICAL)\n\n- `store-configure` - Configure Redux store with reducers and middleware\n- `store-provider` - Wrap app with Redux Provider\n- `store-typed-hooks` - Create typed hooks for dispatch and selector\n- `store-types` - Export RootState and AppDispatch types\n\n### 2. State Management (HIGH)\n\n- `slice-create-basic` - Create basic slice with reducers\n- `slice-with-payload` - Handle actions with payloads\n- `slice-async-thunk` - Create async thunks for side effects\n- `slice-selectors` - Build memoized selectors\n- `slice-feature-structure` - Organize code by features\n\n### 3. API Integration (HIGH)\n\n- `api-base-setup` - Configure base API with fetchBaseQuery\n- `api-query-endpoints` - Create query endpoints for GET requests\n- `api-mutation-endpoints` - Create mutation endpoints for POST/PUT/DELETE\n- `api-tags-system` - Implement tag-based cache invalidation\n- `api-error-handling` - Handle API errors and loading states\n\n### 4. Cache Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `cache-invalidation-selective` - Use specific tag invalidation\n- `cache-prefetching` - Prefetch data before navigation\n- `cache-polling` - Implement polling for real-time updates\n- `cache-conditional-fetch` - Skip queries conditionally\n- `cache-manual-update` - Manually update cache entries\n\n### 5. Advanced Patterns (MEDIUM)\n\n- `advanced-optimistic-updates` - Implement optimistic UI updates\n- `advanced-entity-adapters` - Use entity adapters for normalized cache\n- `advanced-streaming` - Implement WebSocket streaming\n- `advanced-pagination` - Handle infinite scroll pagination\n- `advanced-code-splitting` - Lazy load API slices\n\n### 6. Testing (MEDIUM)\n\n- `testing-slices` - Test Redux slices and reducers\n- `testing-selectors` - Test memoized selectors\n- `testing-async-thunks` - Test async thunks\n- `testing-api-endpoints` - Test RTK Query endpoints\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/store-configure.md\nrules/api-base-setup.md\nrules/advanced-optimistic-updates.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Impact explanation and when to apply\n- Bad example with explanation\n- Good example with explanation\n- Additional context and best practices\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all patterns expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n\n## Quick Patterns (Most Common)\n\n## Quick Patterns (Most Common)\n\n### Store Setup\n```typescript\nimport { configureStore } from ''@reduxjs/toolkit'';\nimport counterReducer from ''../features/counter/counter.slice'';\nimport { baseApi } from ''../features/api/baseApi'';\n\nexport const store = configureStore({\n  reducer: {\n    counter: counterReducer,\n    [baseApi.reducerPath]: baseApi.reducer,\n  },\n  middleware: (getDefaultMiddleware) =>\n    getDefaultMiddleware().concat(baseApi.middleware),\n});\n\nexport type RootState = ReturnType<typeof store.getState>;\nexport type AppDispatch = typeof store.dispatch;\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Create Slice\n```typescript\nimport { createSlice, PayloadAction } from ''@reduxjs/toolkit'';\n\nconst counterSlice = createSlice({\n  name: ''counter'',\n  initialState: { value: 0, loading: false },\n  reducers: {\n    increment: (state) => {\n      state.value += 1; // Immer allows \"mutation\"\n    },\n    incrementByAmount: (state, action: PayloadAction<number>) => {\n      state.value += action.payload;\n    },\n  },\n});\n\nexport const { increment, incrementByAmount } = counterSlice.actions;\nexport default counterSlice.reducer;\n```\n\n### Typed Hooks\n```typescript\n// src/store/hooks.ts\nimport { useDispatch, useSelector, TypedUseSelectorHook } from ''react-redux'';\nimport type { RootState, AppDispatch } from ''./store'';\n\nexport const useAppDispatch = () => useDispatch<AppDispatch>();\nexport const useAppSelector: TypedUseSelectorHook<RootState> = useSelector;\n```\n\n### RTK Query Base API\n```typescript\nimport { createApi, fetchBaseQuery } from ''@reduxjs/toolkit/query/react'';\n\nexport const baseApi = createApi({\n  reducerPath: ''api'',\n  baseQuery: fetchBaseQuery({\n    baseUrl: ''https://api.example.com'',\n    prepareHeaders: (headers, { getState }) => {\n      const token = (getState() as RootState).auth.token;\n      if (token) headers.set(''authorization'', `Bearer ${token}`);\n      return headers;\n    },\n  }),\n  tagTypes: [''User'', ''Post'', ''Comment''],\n  endpoints: () => ({}), // Defined in feature files\n});\n```\n\n### Query Endpoint\n```typescript\nexport const userApi = baseApi.injectEndpoints({\n  endpoints: (builder) => ({\n    getUsers: builder.query<User[], void>({\n      query: () => ''/users'',\n      providesTags: [''User''],\n    }),\n    getUserById: builder.query<User, string>({\n      query: (id) => `/users/${id}`,\n      providesTags: (result, error, id) => [{ type: ''User'', id }],\n    }),\n  }),\n});\n\nexport const { useGetUsersQuery, useGetUserByIdQuery } = userApi;\n```\n\n### Mutation Endpoint\n```typescript\nexport const userApi = baseApi.injectEndpoints({\n  endpoints: (builder) => ({\n    updateUser: builder.mutation<User, { id: string; data: UpdateUserRequest }>({\n      query: ({ id, data }) => ({\n        url: `/users/${id}`,\n        method: ''PUT'',\n        body: data,\n      }),\n      invalidatesTags: (result, error, { id }) => [{ type: ''User'', id }],\n    }),\n  }),\n});\n\nexport const { useUpdateUserMutation } = userApi;\n```\n\n### Using in Component\n```typescript\nimport { useAppDispatch, useAppSelector } from ''@/store/hooks'';\nimport { increment } from ''@/features/counter'';\nimport { useGetUsersQuery } from ''@/features/user'';\n\nexport const MyScreen: React.FC = () => {\n  const dispatch = useAppDispatch();\n  const count = useAppSelector(state => state.counter.value);\n  const { data: users, isLoading } = useGetUsersQuery();\n\n  return (\n    <View>\n      <Text>Count: {count}</Text>\n      <Button title=\"+\" onPress={() => dispatch(increment())} />\n      {isLoading ? <ActivityIndicator /> : <UserList users={users} />}\n    </View>\n  );\n};\n```\n\n### Memoized Selectors\n```typescript\nimport { createSelector } from ''@reduxjs/toolkit'';\nimport { RootState } from ''@/store/store'';\n\nconst selectCounterValue = (state: RootState) => state.counter.value;\nconst selectCounterHistory = (state: RootState) => state.counter.history;\n\nexport const selectHistorySummary = createSelector(\n  [selectCounterHistory],\n  (history) => ({\n    total: history.length,\n    increments: history.filter(h => h.action === ''increment'').length,\n    decrements: history.filter(h => h.action === ''decrement'').length,\n  })\n);\n```\n\n### Async Thunk\n```typescript\nimport { createAsyncThunk } from ''@reduxjs/toolkit'';\n\nexport const fetchUser = createAsyncThunk(\n  ''user/fetchUser'',\n  async (userId: string, { rejectWithValue }) => {\n    try {\n      const response = await userApi.getUser(userId);\n      return response.data;\n    } catch (error: any) {\n      return rejectWithValue(error.response?.data || ''Failed to fetch'');\n    }\n  }\n);\n\n// Handle in slice\nextraReducers: (builder) => {\n  builder\n    .addCase(fetchUser.pending, (state) => { state.loading = true; })\n    .addCase(fetchUser.fulfilled, (state, action) => {\n      state.loading = false;\n      state.currentUser = action.payload;\n    })\n    .addCase(fetchUser.rejected, (state, action) => {\n      state.loading = false;\n      state.error = action.payload as string;\n    });\n}\n```\n\n### Optimistic Update\n```typescript\naddReaction: builder.mutation<Post, { postId: string; reaction: string }>({\n  query: ({ postId, reaction }) => ({\n    url: `/posts/${postId}/reactions`,\n    method: ''POST'',\n    body: { reaction },\n  }),\n  async onQueryStarted({ postId, reaction }, { dispatch, queryFulfilled }) {\n    // Optimistic update\n    const patchResult = dispatch(\n      postsApi.util.updateQueryData(''getPosts'', undefined, (draft) => {\n        const post = draft.entities[postId];\n        if (post) post.reactions[reaction]++;\n      })\n    );\n\n    try {\n      await queryFulfilled;\n    } catch {\n      patchResult.undo(); // Rollback on error\n    }\n  },\n}),\n```\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns\n\n❌ Never mutate state outside `createSlice` reducers\n❌ Don''t store non-serializable data (functions, promises, class instances)\n❌ Avoid putting UI-only state in Redux (use local state instead)\n❌ Don''t over-invalidate cache (use specific tags)\n❌ Never skip loading/error state handling in components\n\n## Requirements\n\n- **React Native/Expo**: Any version\n- **Redux Toolkit**: ^2.0.0 or ^1.9.0\n- **React Redux**: ^8.0.0 or ^9.0.0\n- **TypeScript**: ^5.0.0 (recommended)\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Redux Toolkit Documentation](https://redux-toolkit.js.org/)\n- [RTK Query Documentation](https://redux-toolkit.js.org/rtk-query/overview)\n- [Redux Essentials Tutorial](https://redux.js.org/tutorials/essentials/part-1-overview-concepts)"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:28:11.499Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced state management and API data fetching capabilities in React Native/Expo applications.","zh":"非常适合需要在 React Native/Expo 应用中使用高级状态管理和 API 数据获取功能的前端代理。","ja":"React Native/Expo アプリケーションで高度な状態管理と API データ取得機能が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React Native/Expo 애플리케이션에서 고급 상태 관리 및 API 데이터 가져오기 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan gestión de estado avanzada y capacidades de recuperación de datos de API en aplicaciones React Native/Expo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une gestion d''état avancée et de capacités de récupération de données d''API dans les applications React Native/Expo.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Zustandsverwaltung und API-Datenabruf-Funktionen in React Native/Expo-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de gerenciamento de estado avançado e capacidades de fetching de dados de API em aplicações React Native/Expo.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуются продвинутые возможности управления состоянием и извлечения данных API в приложениях React Native/Expo.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة حالة متقدمة وقدرات استرجاع بيانات API في تطبيقات React Native/Expo."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage global state with Redux Toolkit, fetch data with RTK Query, and implement optimistic updates and caching using React Native/Expo APIs and libraries.","zh":"赋予代理管理全局状态的能力，使用 Redux Toolkit，使用 RTK Query 获取数据，并使用 React Native/Expo API 和库实现乐观更新和缓存。","ja":"Redux Toolkit を使用してグローバル状態を管理し、RTK Query を使用してデータを取得し、React Native/Expo API およびライブラリを使用して楽観的な更新とキャッシングを実装するエージェントをEmpowersします。","ko":"Redux Toolkit을 사용하여 전역 상태를 관리하고, RTK Query를 사용하여 데이터를 가져오고, React Native/Expo API 및 라이브러리를 사용하여 낙관적 업데이트와 캐싱을 구현할 수 있는 에이전트를赋予합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado global con Redux Toolkit, recuperar datos con RTK Query e implementar actualizaciones optimistas y almacenamiento en caché utilizando las API y bibliotecas de React Native/Expo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état global avec Redux Toolkit, de récupérer des données avec RTK Query et de mettre en œuvre des mises à jour optimistes et un stockage en cache en utilisant les API et les bibliothèques React Native/Expo.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, den globalen Zustand mit Redux Toolkit zu verwalten, Daten mit RTK Query abzurufen und optimistische Updates und Caching unter Verwendung der React Native/Expo-APIs und -Bibliotheken zu implementieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o estado global com Redux Toolkit, buscar dados com RTK Query e implementar atualizações otimistas e cache utilizando APIs e bibliotecas do React Native/Expo.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность управлять глобальным состоянием с помощью Redux Toolkit, извлекать данные с помощью RTK Query и реализовывать оптимистические обновления и кэширование, используя API и библиотеки React Native/Expo.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة الحالة العالمية باستخدام Redux Toolkit، واسترجاع البيانات باستخدام RTK Query، وتنفيذ تحديثات مثالية وتخزين مؤقت باستخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات وиблиوتيكات React Native/Expo."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up Redux stores for React Native/Expo apps","Creating feature slices with actions and reducers","Implementing API data fetching and caching with RTK Query","Building optimistic updates for instant UI feedback"],"zh":["为 React Native/Expo 应用设置 Redux 存储","使用操作和减速器创建功能切片","使用 RTK Query 实现 API 数据获取和缓存","为即时 UI 反馈构建乐观更新"],"ja":["React Native/Expo アプリケーションの Redux ストアを設定する","アクションとレデューサーを使用して機能スライスを作成する","RTK Query を使用して API データ取得とキャッシングを実装する","即時 UI フィードバックのための楽観的な更新を構築する"],"ko":["React Native/Expo 애플리케이션에 대한 Redux 저장소를 설정하는 것","액션 및 리듀서를 사용하여 기능 슬라이스를 만드는 것","RTK Query를 사용하여 API 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱을 구현하는 것","즉각적인 UI 피드백을 위한 낙관적 업데이트를 구축하는 것"],"es":["Configuración de tiendas de Redux para aplicaciones React Native/Expo","Creación de rebanadas de características con acciones y reductores","Implementación de la recuperación y almacenamiento en caché de datos de API con RTK Query","Creación de actualizaciones optimistas para una retroalimentación de la interfaz de usuario instantánea"],"fr":["Configuration des magasins Redux pour les applications React Native/Expo","Création de tranches de fonctionnalités avec des actions et des réducteurs","Mise en œuvre de la récupération et du stockage en cache des données d''API avec RTK Query","Conception de mises à jour optimistes pour une rétroaction instantanée de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Einrichtung von Redux-Speichern für React Native/Expo-Anwendungen","Erstellung von Featureslices mit Aktionen und Reducern","Implementierung von API-Datenabruf und Caching mit RTK Query","Erstellung von optimistischen Updates für eine sofortige Benutzeroberflächen-Rückmeldung"],"pt":["Configurar lojas Redux para aplicações React Native/Expo","Criar fatias de recursos com ações e reducers","Implementar busca de dados de API e cache com RTK Query","Construir atualizações otimistas para feedback de UI instantâneo"],"ru":["Настройка магазинов Redux для приложений React Native/Expo","Создание функциональных срезов с действиями и редукторами","Реализация извлечения данных API и кэширования с помощью RTK Query","Построение оптимистических обновлений для мгновенного обратной связи интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["تكوين متاجر Redux لتطبيقات React Native/Expo","إنشاء شرائح ميزة مع الإجراءات والReducers","تنفيذ استرجاع بيانات API والتخزين المؤقت مع RTK Query","بناء تحديثات مثالية لتعليقات واجهة المستخدم الفورية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native/Expo environment","Specific to Redux Toolkit and RTK Query"],"zh":["需要 React Native/Expo 环境","特定于 Redux Toolkit 和 RTK Query"],"ja":["React Native/Expo 環境が必要","Redux Toolkit と RTK Query に特有"],"ko":["React Native/Expo 환경이 필요","Redux Toolkit 및 RTK Query에 특정"],"es":["Requiere entorno React Native/Expo","Específico de Redux Toolkit y RTK Query"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React Native/Expo","Spécifique à Redux Toolkit et RTK Query"],"de":["Benötigt React Native/Expo-Umgebung","Spezifisch für Redux Toolkit und RTK Query"],"pt":["Requer ambiente React Native/Expo","Específico para Redux Toolkit e RTK Query"],"ru":["Требует среды React Native/Expo","Специфичен для Redux Toolkit и RTK Query"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React Native/Expo","محدد ل Redux Toolkit و RTK Query"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
