инамическая генерация изображения OG","Структурированные данные JSON-LD (schema.org)","Хлебные крошки и канонические URL"],"ar":["ضبط سيو","توليد ملفات robots.txt و sitemap.xml","توليد صورة أو جي ديناميكية","بيانات بنية JSON-LD (schema.org)","بقايا الخبز والروابط καν"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nuxt SEO","Nuxt.js优化","搜索引擎优化","SEO配置","robots.txt","sitemap.xml"],"ja":["Nuxt SEO","Nuxt.js最適化","検索エンジン最適化","SEO設定","robots.txt","sitemap.xml"],"ko":["누트 SEO","누트.js 최적화","검색 엔진 최적화","SEO 설정","로봇.txt","사이트맵.xml"],"es":["Nuxt SEO","Configuración de SEO","Optimización de SEO","Nuxt.js","Desarrollo web","SEO para sitios web","Mejora de la visibilidad en buscadores"],"fr":["Nuxt SEO","Configuration SEO","Optimisation SEO","Nuxt.js","Développement web","SEO pour les sites web","Amélioration de la visibilité dans les moteurs de recherche"],"de":["Nuxt SEO","SEO-Konfiguration","SEO-Optimierung","Nuxt.js","Webentwicklung","SEO für Websites","Verbesserung der Sichtbarkeit in Suchmaschinen"],"pt":["Nuxt SEO","Otimização para mecanismos de busca","Desenvolvimento web","Nuxt.js","SEO","Robots.txt","Sitemap.xml","Imagem OG","JSON-LD"],"ru":["Nuxt SEO","Оптимизация для поисковых систем","Веб-разработка","Nuxt.js","SEO","Robots.txt","Sitemap.xml","Изображение OG","JSON-LD"],"ar":["نيكست سيو","تحسين لتحقيق أفضل نتائج","تطوير الويب","نيكست جس","سيو","ملفات robots.txt","ملفات sitemap.xml","صورة أو جي","JSON-LD"]}},"owner":"hipi","repo":"nuxt-nav-ai","repoPath":"hipi/nuxt-nav-ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nuxt-seo","description":"Nuxt SEO meta-module with robots, sitemap, og-image, schema-org. Use when configuring SEO, generating sitemaps, creating OG images, or adding structured data.","bodyPreview":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Usage Pattern\n\n**Progressive loading - only read what you need:**\n\n- Configuring site? → [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md)\n- Setting up robots/sitemap? → [references/crawlability.md](references/","body":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Usage Pattern\n\n**Progressive loading - only read what you need:**\n\n- Configuring site? → [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md)\n- Setting up robots/sitemap? → [references/crawlability.md](references/crawlability.md)\n- Generating OG images? → [references/og-image.md](references/og-image.md)\n- Adding JSON-LD? → [references/schema-org.md](references/schema-org.md)\n- Breadcrumbs, links, icons? → [references/utilities.md](references/utilities.md)\n\n## Site Config\n\nFoundation for all SEO modules. Configure `site` in `nuxt.config.ts`, access via `useSiteConfig()`. See [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) for full options.\n\n## Module Overview\n\n| Module            | Purpose         | Key API                       |\n| ----------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| nuxt-site-config  | Shared config   | `useSiteConfig()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/robots    | robots.txt      | `useRobotsRule()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/sitemap   | sitemap.xml     | `defineSitemapEventHandler()` |\n| nuxt-og-image     | OG images       | `defineOgImage()`             |\n| nuxt-schema-org   | JSON-LD         | `useSchemaOrg()`              |\n| nuxt-seo-utils    | Meta utilities  | `useBreadcrumbItems()`        |\n| nuxt-link-checker | Link validation | Build-time checks             |\n\n## Nuxt Content v3\n\nUse `asSeoCollection()` for automatic sitemap, og-image, and schema-org from frontmatter:\n\n```ts\n// content.config.ts\nimport { defineCollection, defineContentConfig } from ''@nuxt/content''\nimport { asSeoCollection } from ''@nuxtjs/seo/content''\n\nexport default defineContentConfig({\n  collections: {\n    posts: defineCollection(asSeoCollection({ type: ''page'', source: ''posts/**'' }))\n  }\n})\n```\n\n**Important:** Load `@nuxtjs/seo` before `@nuxt/content` in modules array:\n\n```ts\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''@nuxtjs/seo'', ''@nuxt/content'']\n})\n```\n\nFrontmatter fields: `ogImage`, `sitemap`, `robots`, `schemaOrg`.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [nuxt-content](../nuxt-content/SKILL.md) - For MDC rendering with SEO frontmatter\n\n## Links\n\n- [Documentation](https://nuxtseo.com)\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/harlan-zw/nuxt-seo)\n\n## Token Efficiency\n\nMain skill: ~250 tokens. Each sub-file: ~400-600 tokens. Only load files relevant to current task.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:27:46.554Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced SEO configuration and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO配置和优化能力的Web开发代理。","ja":"高度なSEO設定と最適化機能を必要とするWeb開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 구성 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Desarrollo Web que necesitan configuración y capacidades de optimización de SEO avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web ayant besoin d''une configuration SEO avancée et de capacités d''optimisation.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte SEO-Konfigurations- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de configuração e capacidades de otimização de SEO avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности конфигурации и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الويب الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد وتفصيل متقدم لتحسين محركات البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure site SEO settings, generate robots.txt and sitemap.xml files, and create dynamic OG images using JSON-LD structured data and schema.org protocols.","zh":"赋予代理配置站点SEO设置、生成robots.txt和sitemap.xml文件，并使用JSON-LD结构化数据和schema.org协议创建动态OG图像的能力。","ja":"エージェントがサイトのSEO設定を構成し、robots.txtとsitemap.xmlファイルを生成し、JSON-LD構造化データとschema.orgプロトコルを使用して動的なOGイメージを作成する能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 사이트의 SEO 설정을 구성하고 robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml 파일을 생성하며 JSON-LD 구조화 데이터 및 schema.org 프로토콜을 사용하여 동적 OG 이미지를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes configurar la configuración de SEO del sitio, generar archivos robots.txt y sitemap.xml, y crear imágenes OG dinámicas utilizando datos estructurados JSON-LD y protocolos schema.org.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer les paramètres de SEO du site, de générer des fichiers robots.txt et sitemap.xml, et de créer des images OG dynamiques à l''aide de données structurées JSON-LD et de protocoles schema.org.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die SEO-Seiteneinstellungen zu konfigurieren, robots.txt- und sitemap.xml-Dateien zu generieren und dynamische OG-Bilder mit strukturierten JSON-LD-Daten und schema.org-Protokollen zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar as configurações de SEO do site, gerar arquivos robots.txt e sitemap.xml, e criar imagens OG dinâmicas usando dados estruturados JSON-LD e protocolos schema.org.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конфигурировать настройки SEO сайта, генерировать файлы robots.txt и sitemap.xml, а также создавать динамические изображения OG с использованием структурированных данных JSON-LD и протоколов schema.org.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية تكوين إعدادات تحسين محركات البحث للموقع ، وتوليد ملفات robots.txt و sitemap.xml ، وإنشاء صور OG गतيناميك باستخدام بيانات JSON-LD المنظمة وبروتوكولات schema.org."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring site metadata for search engine indexing","Generating dynamic OG images for social media sharing","Creating JSON-LD structured data for enhanced search engine results"],"zh":["为搜索引擎索引配置站点元数据","为社交媒体分享生成动态OG图像","使用JSON-LD结构化数据和schema.org协议创建增强的搜索引擎结果"],"ja":["検索エンジンのインデックス作成のためのサイトメタデータの構成","ソーシャルメディアの共有のための動的なOGイメージの生成","JSON-LD構造化データとschema.orgプロトコルを使用した検索エンジンの結果の強化"],"ko":["검색 엔진 인덱싱을 위한 사이트 메타데이터 구성","소셜 미디어 공유를 위한 동적 OG 이미지 생성","JSON-LD 구조화 데이터 및 schema.org 프로토콜을 사용한 검색 엔진 결과 강화"],"es":["Configuración de metadatos del sitio para indexación de motores de búsqueda","Generación de imágenes OG dinámicas para compartir en redes sociales","Creación de datos estructurados JSON-LD para resultados de búsqueda mejorados"],"fr":["Configuration des métadonnées du site pour l''indexation des moteurs de recherche","Génération d''images OG dynamiques pour le partage sur les réseaux sociaux","Création de données structurées JSON-LD pour améliorer les résultats de recherche"],"de":["Konfiguration von Seitemetadaten für die Indexierung von Suchmaschinen","Generierung von dynamischen OG-Bildern für das Teilen in sozialen Medien","Erstellung von strukturierten JSON-LD-Daten für verbesserte Suchmaschinenergebnisse"],"pt":["Configurando metadados do site para indexação de mecanismos de busca","Gerando imagens OG dinâmicas para compartilhamento em redes sociais","Criando dados estruturados JSON-LD para resultados de mecanismos de busca aprimorados"],"ru":["Настройка метаданных сайта для индексации поисковыми системами","Генерация динамических изображений OG для обмена в социальных сетях","Создание структурированных данных JSON-LD для улучшения результатов поисковых систем"],"ar":["تكوين بيانات موقع الويب لفهارس محركات البحث","توليد صور OG गतيناميك للمشاركة على وسائل التواصل الاجتماعي","إنشاء بيانات JSON-LD المنظمة لتحسين نتائج محركات البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nuxt.js framework installation","Limited to SEO configuration and optimization tasks"],"zh":["需要Nuxt.js框架安装","仅限SEO配置和优化任务"],"ja":["Nuxt.jsフレームワークのインストールが必要","SEO設定と最適化タスクのみに限定"],"ko":["Nuxt.js 프레임워크 설치가 필요","SEO 구성 및 최적화 작업만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del framework Nuxt.js","Limitado a tareas de configuración y optimización de SEO"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du framework Nuxt.js","Limité aux tâches de configuration et d''optimisation de SEO"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des Nuxt.js-Frameworks","Begrenzt auf SEO-Konfigurations- und Optimierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer instalação do framework Nuxt.js","Limitado a tarefas de configuração e otimização de SEO"],"ru":["Требуется установка фреймворка Nuxt.js","Ограничен задачами конфигурации и оптимизации SEO"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت إطار Nuxt.js","محدود بمهام تكوين وضبط تحسين محركات البحث"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gutierrezp22/administracion-departamentos/electron', 'community', 'gutierrezp22', 'administracion-departamentos', 'gutierrezp22/administracion-departamentos', 'electron', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z', '2026-02-18T09:28:21.744Z', NULL, '{"id":"gutierrezp22/administracion-departamentos/electron","name":"electron","description":{"zh":"Electron 是一个构建跨平台桌面应用的框架，支持多种操作系统和框架","ja":"Electron はクロスプラットフォーム デスクトップ アプリケーションを構築するためのフレームワークで、複数のオペレーティング システムとフレームワークをサポートしています","ko":"Electron은 크로스 플랫폼 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 구축하는 프레임워크로 여러 운영 체제와 프레임워크를 지원합니다","es":"Electron es un framework para crear aplicaciones de escritorio cross-plataforma. Permite a los desarrolladores crear aplicaciones de escritorio con tecnologías web como JavaScript, HTML y CSS.","fr":"Electron est un framework pour créer des applications de bureau cross-plateforme. Il permet aux développeurs de créer des applications de bureau avec des technologies web comme JavaScript, HTML et CSS.","de":"Electron ist ein Framework für die Erstellung cross-plattformfähiger Desktop-Anwendungen. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, Desktop-Anwendungen mit Web-Technologien wie JavaScript, HTML und CSS zu erstellen.","pt":"Electron é uma plataforma para criar aplicativos desktop cross-platform. Ele permite trabalhar com processos principais e renderizadores, IPC e recursos do sistema operacional.","ru":"Electron — это платформа для создания кроссплатформенных приложений для рабочего стола. Она позволяет работать с основными и рендеринговыми процессами, IPC и функциями операционной системы.","ar":"إلكترون هو منصة لإنشاء تطبيقات سطح المكتب متعددة المنصات. يسمح بالعمل مع العمليات الرئيسية وعمليات التصفح ، و IPC و ميزات نظام التشغيل.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Electron 框架：构建跨平台桌面应用","ja":"Electron フレームワーク：クロスプラットフォーム デスクトップ アプリケーションの構築","ko":"Electron 프레임워크: 크로스 플랫폼 데스크톱 애플리케이션 구축","es":"Electron: Desarrollo de Aplicaciones de Escritorio Cross-...","fr":"Electron : Développement d''Applications de Bureau Cross-P...","de":"Electron: Cross-Plattform-Desktop-Anwendungen Entwickeln","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos Desktop com Electron","ru":"Создание кроссплатформенных приложений с помощью Electron","ar":"إنشاء تطبيقات سطح المكتب متعددة المنصات مع إلكترون","en":"electron"},"description":{"zh":"Electron 是一个构建跨平台桌面应用的框架，支持多种操作系统和框架","ja":"Electron はクロスプラットフォーム デスクトップ アプリケーションを構築するためのフレームワークで、複数のオペレーティング システムとフレームワークをサポートしています","ko":"Electron은 크로스 플랫폼 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 구축하는 프레임워크로 여러 운영 체제와 프레임워크를 지원합니다","es":"Electron es un framework para crear aplicaciones de escritorio cross-plataforma. Permite a los desarrolladores crear aplicaciones de escritorio con tecnologí...","fr":"Electron est un framework pour créer des applications de bureau cross-plateforme. Il permet aux développeurs de créer des applications de bureau avec des tec...","de":"Electron ist ein Framework für die Erstellung cross-plattformfähiger Desktop-Anwendungen. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, Desktop-Anwendungen mit Web-Technologien...","pt":"Electron é uma plataforma para criar aplicativos desktop cross-platform. Ele permite trabalhar com processos principais e renderizadores, IPC e recursos do s...","ru":"Electron — это платформа для создания кроссплатформенных приложений для рабочего стола. Она позволяет работать с основными и рендеринговыми процессами, IPC и...","ar":"إلكترون هو منصة لإنشاء تطبيقات سطح المكتب متعددة المنصات. يسمح بالعمل مع العمليات الرئيسية وعمليات التصفح ، و IPC و ميزات نظام التشغيل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["跨平台支持","主进程和渲染进程","IPC 通信","原生 OS 功能集成","React 和 Vue 支持","自动更新和应用分发"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォーム サポート","メイン プロセスとレンダラー プロセス","IPC コミュニケーション","ネイティブ OS 機能の統合","React と Vue のサポート","自動更新とアプリケーションの配布"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 지원","메인 프로세스와 렌더러 프로세스","IPC 통신","원生 OS 기능 통합","React와 Vue 지원","자동 업데이트 및 애플리케이션 배포"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones de escritorio cross-plataforma","Integración con React, Vue y otros frameworks","Comunicación entre procesos (IPC)","Acceso a características del sistema operativo nativo","Actualizaciones automáticas y distribución de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Création d''applications de bureau cross-plateforme","Intégration avec React, Vue et d''autres frameworks","Communication entre processus (IPC)","Accès aux fonctionnalités du système d''exploitation natif","Mises à jour automatiques et distribution d''applications"],"de":["Erstellung cross-plattformfähiger Desktop-Anwendungen","Integration mit React, Vue und anderen Frameworks","Kommunikation zwischen Prozessen (IPC)","Zugriff auf native Betriebssystemfunktionen","Automatische Updates und Anwendungsverteilung"],"pt":["Criação de aplicativos desktop cross-platform","Trabalho com processos principais e renderizadores","Implementação de IPC","Integração com recursos do sistema operacional","Suporte a React, Vue e outros frameworks"],"ru":["Создание кроссплатформенных приложений для рабочего стола","Работа с основными и рендеринговыми процессами","Реализация IPC","Интеграция с функциями операционной системы","Поддержка React, Vue и других фреймворков"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات سطح المكتب متعددة المنصات","العمل مع العمليات الرئيسية وعمليات التصفح","تنفيذ IPC","التكامل مع ميزات نظام التشغيل","دعم React و Vue و الإطارات الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Electron","跨平台","桌面应用","JavaScript","React","Vue","IPC","原生 OS 功能"],"ja":["Electron","クロスプラットフォーム","デスクトップ アプリケーション","JavaScript","React","Vue","IPC","ネイティブ OS 機能"],"ko":["Electron","크로스 플랫폼","데스크톱 애플리케이션","자바스크립트","React","Vue","IPC","원生 OS 기능"],"es":["Electron","aplicaciones de escritorio cross-plataforma","desarrollo de aplicaciones","JavaScript","HTML","CSS","React","Vue"],"fr":["Electron","applications de bureau cross-plateforme","développement d''applications","JavaScript","HTML","CSS","React","Vue"],"de":["Electron","cross-plattformfähige Desktop-Anwendungen","Anwendungsentwicklung","JavaScript","HTML","CSS","React","Vue"],"pt":["Electron","aplicativos desktop","cross-platform","IPC","recursos do sistema operacional","React","Vue","desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["Electron","приложения для рабочего стола","кроссплатформенные","IPC","функции операционной системы","React","Vue","разработка приложений"],"ar":["إلكترون","تطبيقات سطح المكتب","متعددة المنصات","IPC","ميزات نظام التشغيل","React","Vue","تنمية التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"gutierrezp22","repo":"administracion-departamentos","repoPath":"gutierrezp22/administracion-departamentos","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"electron","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"## When to Use\n\nLoad this skill when:\n- Building cross-platform desktop applications\n- Working with Electron''s main and renderer processes\n- Implementing IPC (Inter-Process Communication)\n- Integrating native OS features (menus, notifications, file system)\n- Setting up Electron with React, Vue, or other frameworks\n- Configuring auto-updates and app distribution\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Project Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── main/                    # Main process (Node.js)\n│   ├── index.ts","body":"## When to Use\n\nLoad this skill when:\n- Building cross-platform desktop applications\n- Working with Electron''s main and renderer processes\n- Implementing IPC (Inter-Process Communication)\n- Integrating native OS features (menus, notifications, file system)\n- Setting up Electron with React, Vue, or other frameworks\n- Configuring auto-updates and app distribution\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Project Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── main/                    # Main process (Node.js)\n│   ├── index.ts            # Entry point\n│   ├── ipc/                # IPC handlers\n│   │   ├── handlers.ts\n│   │   └── channels.ts     # Type-safe channel names\n│   ├── services/           # Native services\n│   │   ├── store.ts        # electron-store\n│   │   └── updater.ts      # auto-updater\n│   └── windows/            # Window management\n│       └── main-window.ts\n├── renderer/               # Renderer process (browser)\n│   ├── src/\n│   │   ├── App.tsx\n│   │   ├── components/\n│   │   └── hooks/\n│   │       └── useIPC.ts   # IPC hooks\n│   └── index.html\n├── preload/                # Preload scripts\n│   └── index.ts            # Expose safe APIs\n└── shared/                 # Shared types\n    └── types.ts\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Secure IPC Communication\n\nAlways use contextBridge for secure communication:\n\n```typescript\n// preload/index.ts\nimport { contextBridge, ipcRenderer } from ''electron'';\nimport type { IpcChannels } from ''../shared/types'';\n\n// Type-safe exposed API\nconst electronAPI = {\n  // One-way: renderer -> main\n  send: <T extends keyof IpcChannels>(\n    channel: T, \n    data: IpcChannels[T][''request'']\n  ) => {\n    ipcRenderer.send(channel, data);\n  },\n\n  // Two-way: renderer -> main -> renderer\n  invoke: <T extends keyof IpcChannels>(\n    channel: T, \n    data: IpcChannels[T][''request'']\n  ): Promise<IpcChannels[T][''response'']> => {\n    return ipcRenderer.invoke(channel, data);\n  },\n\n  // Listen: main -> renderer\n  on: <T extends keyof IpcChannels>(\n    channel: T, \n    callback: (data: IpcChannels[T][''response'']) => void\n  ) => {\n    const subscription = (_: Electron.IpcRendererEvent, data: IpcChannels[T][''response'']) => {\n      callback(data);\n    };\n    ipcRenderer.on(channel, subscription);\n    return () => ipcRenderer.removeListener(channel, subscription);\n  },\n};\n\ncontextBridge.exposeInMainWorld(''electron'', electronAPI);\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Type-Safe IPC Channels\n\nDefine all channels with request/response types:\n\n```typescript\n// shared/types.ts\nexport interface IpcChannels {\n  ''app:get-version'': {\n    request: void;\n    response: string;\n  };\n  ''file:read'': {\n    request: { path: string };\n    response: { content: string } | { error: string };\n  };\n  ''file:write'': {\n    request: { path: string; content: string };\n    response: { success: boolean };\n  };\n  ''dialog:open-file'': {\n    request: { filters?: Electron.FileFilter[] };\n    response: string | null;\n  };\n  ''store:get'': {\n    request: { key: string };\n    response: unknown;\n  };\n  ''store:set'': {\n    request: { key: string; value: unknown };\n    response: void;\n  };\n}\n\n// Extend Window interface for renderer\ndeclare global {\n  interface Window {\n    electron: typeof electronAPI;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### Example 1: Main Process Setup\n\n```typescript\n// main/index.ts\nimport { app, BrowserWindow, ipcMain } from ''electron'';\nimport path from ''path'';\nimport { registerIpcHandlers } from ''./ipc/handlers'';\n\nlet mainWindow: BrowserWindow | null = null;\n\nasync function createWindow() {\n  mainWindow = new BrowserWindow({\n    width: 1200,\n    height: 800,\n    minWidth: 800,\n    minHeight: 600,\n    webPreferences: {\n      preload: path.join(__dirname, ''../preload/index.js''),\n      contextIsolation: true,  // Required for security\n      nodeIntegration: false,  // Required for security\n      sandbox: true,           // Extra security\n    },\n    titleBarStyle: process.platform === ''darwin'' ? ''hiddenInset'' : ''default'',\n    trafficLightPosition: { x: 15, y: 10 },\n  });\n\n  // Register IPC handlers\n  registerIpcHandlers();\n\n  // Load the app\n  if (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''development'') {\n    mainWindow.loadURL(''http://localhost:5173'');\n    mainWindow.webContents.openDevTools();\n  } else {\n    mainWindow.loadFile(path.join(__dirname, ''../renderer/index.html''));\n  }\n\n  mainWindow.on(''closed'', () => {\n    mainWindow = null;\n  });\n}\n\napp.whenReady().then(createWindow);\n\napp.on(''window-all-closed'', () => {\n  if (process.platform !== ''darwin'') {\n    app.quit();\n  }\n});\n\napp.on(''activate'', () => {\n  if (BrowserWindow.getAllWindows().length === 0) {\n    createWindow();\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### Example 2: IPC Handlers\n\n```typescript\n// main/ipc/handlers.ts\nimport { ipcMain, dialog, app } from ''electron'';\nimport fs from ''fs/promises'';\nimport Store from ''electron-store'';\n\nconst store = new Store();\n\nexport function registerIpcHandlers() {\n  // Get app version\n  ipcMain.handle(''app:get-version'', () => {\n    return app.getVersion();\n  });\n\n  // File operations\n  ipcMain.handle(''file:read'', async (_, { path }) => {\n    try {\n      const content = await fs.readFile(path, ''utf-8'');\n      return { content };\n    } catch (error) {\n      return { error: (error as Error).message };\n    }\n  });\n\n  ipcMain.handle(''file:write'', async (_, { path, content }) => {\n    try {\n      await fs.writeFile(path, content, ''utf-8'');\n      return { success: true };\n    } catch {\n      return { success: false };\n    }\n  });\n\n  // Native dialogs\n  ipcMain.handle(''dialog:open-file'', async (_, { filters }) => {\n    const result = await dialog.showOpenDialog({\n      properties: [''openFile''],\n      filters: filters || [{ name: ''All Files'', extensions: [''*''] }],\n    });\n    return result.canceled ? null : result.filePaths[0];\n  });\n\n  // Persistent storage\n  ipcMain.handle(''store:get'', (_, { key }) => {\n    return store.get(key);\n  });\n\n  ipcMain.handle(''store:set'', (_, { key, value }) => {\n    store.set(key, value);\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Example 3: React Hook for IPC\n\n```typescript\n// renderer/src/hooks/useIPC.ts\nimport { useCallback, useEffect, useState } from ''react'';\n\nexport function useIPC<T>(\n  channel: string,\n  initialValue: T\n): [T, boolean, Error | null] {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<T>(initialValue);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    let mounted = true;\n\n    window.electron\n      .invoke(channel, undefined)\n      .then((result) => {\n        if (mounted) {\n          setData(result as T);\n          setLoading(false);\n        }\n      })\n      .catch((err) => {\n        if (mounted) {\n          setError(err);\n          setLoading(false);\n        }\n      });\n\n    return () => {\n      mounted = false;\n    };\n  }, [channel]);\n\n  return [data, loading, error];\n}\n\n// Hook for IPC subscriptions\nexport function useIPCListener<T>(\n  channel: string,\n  callback: (data: T) => void\n) {\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const unsubscribe = window.electron.on(channel, callback);\n    return unsubscribe;\n  }, [channel, callback]);\n}\n\n// Hook for IPC mutations\nexport function useIPCMutation<TRequest, TResponse>(channel: string) {\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null);\n\n  const mutate = useCallback(\n    async (data: TRequest): Promise<TResponse | null> => {\n      setLoading(true);\n      setError(null);\n      try {\n        const result = await window.electron.invoke(channel, data);\n        return result as TResponse;\n      } catch (err) {\n        setError(err as Error);\n        return null;\n      } finally {\n        setLoading(false);\n      }\n    },\n    [channel]\n  );\n\n  return { mutate, loading, error };\n}\n```\n\n### Example 4: Auto-Updater Setup\n\n```typescript\n// main/services/updater.ts\nimport { autoUpdater } from ''electron-updater'';\nimport { BrowserWindow } from ''electron'';\nimport log from ''electron-log'';\n\nexport function setupAutoUpdater(mainWindow: BrowserWindow) {\n  autoUpdater.logger = log;\n  autoUpdater.autoDownload = false;\n  autoUpdater.autoInstallOnAppQuit = true;\n\n  autoUpdater.on(''checking-for-update'', () => {\n    mainWindow.webContents.send(''updater:checking'');\n  });\n\n  autoUpdater.on(''update-available'', (info) => {\n    mainWindow.webContents.send(''updater:available'', info);\n  });\n\n  autoUpdater.on(''update-not-available'', () => {\n    mainWindow.webContents.send(''updater:not-available'');\n  });\n\n  autoUpdater.on(''download-progress'', (progress) => {\n    mainWindow.webContents.send(''updater:progress'', progress);\n  });\n\n  autoUpdater.on(''update-downloaded'', () => {\n    mainWindow.webContents.send(''updater:downloaded'');\n  });\n\n  autoUpdater.on(''error'', (error) => {\n    mainWindow.webContents.send(''updater:error'', error.message);\n  });\n\n  // Check for updates on startup (with delay)\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    autoUpdater.checkForUpdates();\n  }, 5000);\n}\n\n// IPC handlers for updater\nexport function registerUpdaterHandlers() {\n  ipcMain.handle(''updater:check'', () => autoUpdater.checkForUpdates());\n  ipcMain.handle(''updater:download'', () => autoUpdater.downloadUpdate());\n  ipcMain.handle(''updater:install'', () => autoUpdater.quitAndInstall());\n}\n```\n\n### Example 5: Native Menu Setup\n\n```typescript\n// main/menu.ts\nimport { Menu, shell, app, BrowserWindow } from ''electron'';\n\nexport function createMenu(mainWindow: BrowserWindow) {\n  const isMac = process.platform === ''darwin'';\n\n  const template: Electron.MenuItemConstructorOptions[] = [\n    ...(isMac\n      ? [{\n          label: app.name,\n          submenu: [\n            { role: ''about'' as const },\n            { type: ''separator'' as const },\n            { role: ''services'' as const },\n            { type: ''separator'' as const },\n            { role: ''hide'' as const },\n            { role: ''hideOthers'' as const },\n            { role: ''unhide'' as const },\n            { type: ''separator'' as const },\n            { role: ''quit'' as const },\n          ],\n        }]\n      : []),\n    {\n      label: ''File'',\n      submenu: [\n        {\n          label: ''Open File'',\n          accelerator: ''CmdOrCtrl+O'',\n          click: () => mainWindow.webContents.send(''menu:open-file''),\n        },\n        {\n          label: ''Save'',\n          accelerator: ''CmdOrCtrl+S'',\n          click: () => mainWindow.webContents.send(''menu:save''),\n        },\n        { type: ''separator'' },\n        isMac ? { role: ''close'' } : { role: ''quit'' },\n      ],\n    },\n    {\n      label: ''Edit'',\n      submenu: [\n        { role: ''undo'' },\n        { role: ''redo'' },\n        { type: ''separator'' },\n        { role: ''cut'' },\n        { role: ''copy'' },\n        { role: ''paste'' },\n        { role: ''selectAll'' },\n      ],\n    },\n    {\n      label: ''View'',\n      submenu: [\n        { role: ''reload'' },\n        { role: ''forceReload'' },\n        { role: ''toggleDevTools'' },\n        { type: ''separator'' },\n        { role: ''togglefullscreen'' },\n      ],\n    },\n    {\n      label: ''Help'',\n      submenu: [\n        {\n          label: ''Documentation'',\n          click: () => shell.openExternal(''https://example.com/docs''),\n        },\n      ],\n    },\n  ];\n\n  Menu.setApplicationMenu(Menu.buildFromTemplate(template));\n}\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### Don''t: Enable nodeIntegration\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ DANGEROUS - Never do this\nconst win = new BrowserWindow({\n  webPreferences: {\n    nodeIntegration: true,    // Security vulnerability!\n    contextIsolation: false,  // Security vulnerability!\n  },\n});\n\n// ✅ Safe - Always use contextIsolation with preload\nconst win = new BrowserWindow({\n  webPreferences: {\n    preload: path.join(__dirname, ''preload.js''),\n    contextIsolation: true,\n    nodeIntegration: false,\n    sandbox: true,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Don''t: Use Remote Module\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Bad - remote is deprecated and insecure\nconst { BrowserWindow } = require(''@electron/remote'');\n\n// ✅ Good - Use IPC for all main process access\n// In renderer:\nconst result = await window.electron.invoke(''dialog:open-file'', {});\n```\n\n### Don''t: Expose Entire ipcRenderer\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Bad - exposes everything\ncontextBridge.exposeInMainWorld(''electron'', {\n  ipcRenderer: ipcRenderer, // Never expose the entire module!\n});\n\n// ✅ Good - expose only specific, typed methods\ncontextBridge.exposeInMainWorld(''electron'', {\n  invoke: (channel: string, data: unknown) => {\n    const allowedChannels = [''app:get-version'', ''file:read''];\n    if (allowedChannels.includes(channel)) {\n      return ipcRenderer.invoke(channel, data);\n    }\n    throw new Error(`Channel ${channel} not allowed`);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Pattern |\n|------|---------|\n| Create project | `npm create electron-vite@latest` |\n| Main process file access | Use Node.js `fs` module in main |\n| Renderer file access | IPC through preload |\n| Persistent storage | `electron-store` in main process |\n| Auto-updates | `electron-updater` |\n| Native notifications | `new Notification()` in main |\n| System tray | `Tray` class in main |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | `globalShortcut.register()` |\n| Deep linking | `app.setAsDefaultProtocolClient()` |\n| Code signing | `electron-builder` config |\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Electron Documentation](https://www.electronjs.org/docs/latest)\n- [Electron Forge](https://www.electronforge.io/)\n- [electron-vite](https://electron-vite.org/)\n- [electron-builder](https://www.electron.build/)\n- [Electron Security Checklist](https://www.electronjs.org/docs/latest/tutorial/security)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:28:21.744Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cross-Platform Agents needing to build desktop applications with Electron''s main and renderer processes","zh":"适合需要使用 Electron 的主进程和渲染器进程构建跨平台桌面应用的代理","ja":"Electron のメインプロセスとレンダラープロセスを使用してデスクトップアプリケーションを構築する必要があるクロスプラットフォームエージェントに最適","ko":"Electron의 메인 프로세스와 렌더러 프로세스를 사용하여 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 구축해야 하는 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de plataforma cruzada que necesitan crear aplicaciones de escritorio con los procesos principales y de representación de Electron","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de plateforme croisée ayant besoin de créer des applications de bureau avec les processus principaux et de rendu d''Electron","de":"Ideal für Cross-Platform-Agents, die Desktop-Anwendungen mit Electrons Haupt- und Renderer-Prozessen erstellen müssen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de plataforma cruzada que precisam criar aplicativos de desktop com os processos principais e de renderização do Electron","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов с поддержкой нескольких платформ, которым необходимо создавать настольные приложения с основным и рендеринговым процессами Electron","ar":"مثالي لعميل متعددة المنصات الذي يحتاج إلى بناء تطبيقات سطح المكتب باستخدام عملية Electron الرئيسية وعملية العرض"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate native OS features like menus, notifications, and file system access, while configuring auto-updates and app distribution using IPC and frameworks like React or Vue","zh":"赋予代理集成本机操作系统功能的能力，如菜单、通知和文件系统访问，同时使用IPC和React或Vue等框架配置自动更新和应用程序分发","ja":"エージェントにメニュー、通知、ファイルシステムアクセスなどのネイティブOS機能を統合する機能を与え、IPCおよびReactまたはVueなどのフレームワークを使用して自動更新とアプリケーションの配布を構成","ko":"에이전트가 메뉴, 알림, 파일 시스템 액세스와 같은 네이티브 OS 기능을 통합할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며 IPC 및 React 또는 Vue와 같은 프레임워크를 사용하여 자동 更新 및 애플리케이션 배포를 구성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar características nativas del sistema operativo como menús, notificaciones y acceso al sistema de archivos, mientras configura actualizaciones automáticas y distribución de aplicaciones utilizando IPC y frameworks como React o Vue","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer des fonctionnalités natives du système d''exploitation comme des menus, des notifications et un accès au système de fichiers, tout en configurant des mises à jour automatiques et une distribution d''applications à l''aide de l''IPC et de frameworks comme React ou Vue","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, native Betriebssystemfunktionen wie Menüs, Benachrichtigungen und Dateisystemzugriff zu integrieren, während sie Auto-Updates und App-Verteilung mit IPC und Frameworks wie React oder Vue konfigurieren","pt":"Permite que os agentes integrem recursos nativos do sistema operacional, como menus, notificações e acesso ao sistema de arquivos, enquanto configuram atualizações automáticas e distribuição de aplicativos usando IPC e estruturas como React ou Vue","ru":"Позволяет агентам интегрировать родные функции операционной системы, такие как меню, уведомления и доступ к файловой системе, а также настраивать автоматические обновления и распространение приложений с помощью IPC и фреймворков типа React или Vue","ar":"يمكن للعميل دمج الميزات الأصلية لنظام التشغيل مثل القوائم والاشعارات ووصول نظام الملفات، مع تكوين التحديثات التلقائية وتوزيع التطبيقات باستخدام IPC والإطارات مثل React أو Vue"},"useCases":{"en":["Building cross-platform desktop applications","Implementing Inter-Process Communication (IPC)","Setting up Electron with popular frameworks like React or Vue"],"zh":["构建跨平台桌面应用程序","实现进程间通信（IPC）","使用React或Vue等流行框架设置Electron"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームデスクトップアプリケーションの構築","Inter-Process Communication（IPC）の実装","ReactまたはVueなどの人気フレームワークを使用したElectronの設定"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 데스크톱 애플리케이션 구축","프로세스 간 통신 (IPC) 구현","React 또는 Vue와 같은 인기 있는 프레임워크를 사용하여 Electron 설정"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones de escritorio de plataforma cruzada","Implementación de la comunicación entre procesos (IPC)","Configuración de Electron con frameworks populares como React o Vue"],"fr":["Création d''applications de bureau multiplateforme","Mise en œuvre de la communication entre processus (IPC)","Configuration d''Electron avec des frameworks populaires comme React ou Vue"],"de":["Erstellung von Cross-Platform-Desktop-Anwendungen","Implementierung der Interprozesskommunikation (IPC)","Einrichtung von Electron mit beliebten Frameworks wie React oder Vue"],"pt":["Construção de aplicações de desktop multiplataforma","Implementação da Comunicação entre Processos (IPC)","Configuração do Electron com estruturas populares como React ou Vue"],"ru":["Создание кроссплатформенных настольных приложений","Реализация межпроцессного взаимодействия (IPC)","Настройка Electron с популярными фреймворками, такими как React или Vue"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات سطح المكتب متعددة المنصات","تنفيذ الاتصال بين العمليات (IPC)","ضبط إعدادات Electron مع الإطارات الشهيرة مثل React أو Vue"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js for main process","Limited to desktop applications"],"zh":["需要Node.js用于主进程","仅限于桌面应用程序"],"ja":["メインプロセスにはNode.jsが必要","デスクトップアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["메인 프로세스에 Node.js가 필요","데스크톱 애플리케이션에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere Node.js para el proceso principal","Limitado a aplicaciones de escritorio"],"fr":["Nécessite Node.js pour le processus principal","Limité aux applications de bureau"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js für den Hauptprozess","Begrenzt auf Desktop-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer Node.js para o processo principal","Limitado a aplicações de desktop"],"ru":["Требуется Node.js для основного процесса","Ограничен только настольными приложениями"],"ar":["يتطلب Node.js للعملية الرئيسية","محدود لتطبيقات سطح المكتب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
