 en Railway con la configuración adecuada","fr":"Créez des projets, des services et des bases de données sur Railway avec la configuration appropriée","de":"Erstellen Sie Railway-Projekte, -Dienste und -Datenbanken mit der richtigen Konfiguration","pt":"O recurso ''new'' permite criar projetos, serviços e bancos de dados Railway com configuração adequada. Inicie novos projetos e vincule serviços com facilidade.","ru":"Функция ''new'' позволяет создавать проекты, сервисы и базы данных Railway с правильной конфигурацией. Инициализируйте новые проекты и связывайте сервисы легко.","ar":"ميزة ''new'' تتيح إنشاء مشاريع وخدمات وقواعد بيانات Railway مع تكوين مناسب. ابدأ مشاريع جديدة واربط الخدمات بسهولة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速创建 Railway 项目","轻松部署服务和数据库","支持多种编程语言","自动配置和初始化","高性能和可扩展性"],"ja":["Railway プロジェクトの迅速な作成","サービスとデータベースの容易なデプロイ","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","自動設定と初期化","高パフォーマンスとスケーラビリティ"],"ko":["Railway 프로젝트의 빠른 생성","서비스와 데이터베이스의 쉬운 배포","여러 프로그래밍 언어 지원","자동 설정 및 초기화","高い 성능과 확장성"],"es":["Creación de proyectos en Railway","Configuración de servicios y bases de datos","Despliegue de aplicaciones y APIs","Conexión a Railway","Inicialización de proyectos y servicios","Creación de aplicaciones Vite y React"],"fr":["Création de projets sur Railway","Configuration de services et de bases de données","Déploiement d''applications et d''API","Connexion à Railway","Initialisation de projets et de services","Création d''applications Vite et React"],"de":["Erstellen von Railway-Projekten","Konfiguration von Diensten und Datenbanken","Bereitstellung von Anwendungen und APIs","Verbindung zu Railway","Initialisierung von Projekten und Diensten","Erstellen von Vite- und React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de projetos Railway","Iniciação de serviços","Configuração de bancos de dados","Vinculação de serviços","Inicialização de novos projetos","Criação de APIs e aplicativos"],"ru":["Создание проектов Railway","Инициализация сервисов","Конфигурация баз данных","Связывание сервисов","Инициализация новых проектов","Создание API и приложений"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاريع Railway","초기化 خدمات","تكوين قواعد البيانات","ربط الخدمات","초기化 مشاريع جديدة","إنشاء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات وتطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Railway 项目创建","Railway 项目部署","Railway 服务创建","Railway 数据库创建","快速开发","自动部署"],"ja":["Railway プロジェクトの作成","Railway プロジェクトのデプロイ","Railway サービスの作成","Railway データベースの作成","迅速な開発","自動デプロイ"],"ko":["Railway 프로젝트 생성","Railway 프로젝트 배포","Railway 서비스 생성","Railway 데이터베이스 생성","빠른 개발","자동 배포"],"es":["Railway","proyectos","servicios","bases de datos","despliegue","configuración","aplicaciones","APIs","Vite","React"],"fr":["Railway","projets","services","bases de données","déploiement","configuration","applications","API","Vite","React"],"de":["Railway","Projekte","Dienste","Datenbanken","Bereitstellung","Konfiguration","Anwendungen","APIs","Vite","React"],"pt":["Railway","projetos","serviços","bancos de dados","configuração","inicialização","vinculação","API","aplicativos","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Railway","проекты","сервисы","базы данных","конфигурация","инициализация","связывание","API","приложения","веб-разработка"],"ar":["Railway","مشاريع","خدمات","قواعد البيانات","تكوين","초기化","ربط","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","تطبيقات","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"matixlol","repo":"monitoreo-panama","repoPath":"matixlol/monitoreo-panama","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"new","description":"This skill should be used when the user says setup, deploy to railway, initialize, create project, create service, or wants to deploy from GitHub. Handles initial setup AND adding services to existing projects. For databases, use the database skill instead.","bodyPreview":"# New Project / Service / Database\n\nCreate Railway projects, services, and databases with proper configuration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User says \"deploy to railway\" (add service if linked, init if not)\n- User says \"create a railway project\", \"init\", \"new project\" (explicit new project)\n- User says \"link to railway\", \"connect to railway\"\n- User says \"create a service\", \"add a backend\", \"new api service\"\n- User says \"create a vite app\", \"create a react website\", \"make a python api\"\n- User says \"deploy","body":"# New Project / Service / Database\n\nCreate Railway projects, services, and databases with proper configuration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User says \"deploy to railway\" (add service if linked, init if not)\n- User says \"create a railway project\", \"init\", \"new project\" (explicit new project)\n- User says \"link to railway\", \"connect to railway\"\n- User says \"create a service\", \"add a backend\", \"new api service\"\n- User says \"create a vite app\", \"create a react website\", \"make a python api\"\n- User says \"deploy from github.com/user/repo\", \"create service from this repo\"\n- User says \"add postgres\", \"add a database\", \"add redis\", \"add mysql\", \"add mongo\"\n- User says \"connect to postgres\", \"wire up the database\", \"connect my api to redis\"\n- User says \"add postgres and connect to the server\"\n- Setting up code + Railway service together\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck CLI installed:\n\n```bash\ncommand -v railway\n```\n\nIf not installed:\n\n> Install Railway CLI:\n>\n> ```\n> npm install -g @railway/cli\n> ```\n>\n> or\n>\n> ```\n> brew install railway\n> ```\n\nCheck authenticated:\n\n```bash\nrailway whoami --json\n```\n\nIf not authenticated:\n\n> Run `railway login` to authenticate.\n\n## Decision Flow\n\n```\nrailway status --json (in current dir)\n     │\n┌────┴────┐\nLinked    Not Linked\n  │            │\n  │       Check parent: cd .. && railway status --json\n  │            │\n  │       ┌────┴────┐\n  │    Parent      Not linked\n  │    Linked      anywhere\n  │       │            │\n  │   Add service   railway list\n  │   Set rootDir      │\n  │   Deploy       ┌───┴───┐\n  │       │      Match?  No match\n  │       │        │        │\n  │       │      Link    Init new\n  └───────┴────────┴────────┘\n           │\n    User wants service?\n           │\n     ┌─────┴─────┐\n    Yes         No\n     │           │\nScaffold code   Done\n     │\nrailway add --service\n     │\nConfigure if needed\n     │\nReady to deploy\n```\n\n## Check Current State\n\n```bash\nrailway status --json\n```\n\n- **If linked**: Add a service to the existing project (see below)\n- **If not linked**: Check if a PARENT directory is linked (see below)\n\n### When Already Linked\n\n**Default behavior**: \"deploy to railway\" = add a service to the linked project.\n\nDo NOT create a new project unless user EXPLICITLY says:\n\n- \"new project\", \"create a project\", \"init a project\"\n- \"separate project\", \"different project\"\n\nApp names like \"flappy-bird\" or \"my-api\" are SERVICE names, not project names.\n\n```\nUser: \"create a vite app called foo and deploy to railway\"\nProject: Already linked to \"my-project\"\n\nWRONG: railway init -n foo\nRIGHT: railway add --service foo\n```\n\n### Parent Directory Linking\n\nRailway CLI walks up the directory tree to find a linked project. If you''re in a subdirectory:\n\n```bash\ncd .. && railway status --json\n```\n\n**If parent is linked**, you don''t need to init/link the subdirectory. Instead:\n\n1. Create service: `railway add --service <name>`\n2. Set `rootDirectory` to subdirectory path via environment skill\n3. Deploy from root: `railway up`\n\n**If no parent is linked**, proceed with init or link flow.\n\n## Init vs Link Decision\n\n**Skip this section if already linked** - just add a service instead.\n\nOnly use this section when NO project is linked (directly or via parent).\n\n### Check User''s Projects\n\nThe output can be large. Run in a subagent and extract only:\n- Project `id` and `name`\n- Workspace `id` and `name`\n\n```bash\nrailway list --json\n```\n\n### Decision Logic\n\n1. **User explicitly says \"new project\"** → Use `railway init`\n2. **User names an existing project** → Use `railway link`\n3. **Directory name matches existing project** → Ask: link existing or create new?\n4. **No matching projects** → Use `railway init`\n5. **Ambiguous** → Ask user\n\n## Create New Project\n\n```bash\nrailway init -n <name>\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n- `-n, --name` - Project name (auto-generated if omitted in non-interactive mode)\n- `-w, --workspace` - Workspace name or ID (required if multiple workspaces exist)\n\n### Multiple Workspaces\n\nIf the user has multiple workspaces, `railway init` requires the `--workspace` flag.\n\nGet workspace IDs from:\n\n```bash\nrailway whoami --json\n```\n\nThe `workspaces` array contains `{ id, name }` for each workspace.\n\n**Inferring workspace from user input:**\nIf user says \"deploy into xxx workspace\" or \"create project in my-team\", match the\nname against the workspaces array and use the corresponding ID:\n\n```bash\n# User says: \"create a project in my personal workspace\"\nrailway whoami --json | jq ''.workspaces[] | select(.name | test(\"personal\"; \"i\"))''\n# Use the matched ID: railway init -n myapp --workspace <matched-id>\n```\n\n## Link Existing Project\n\n```bash\nrailway link -p <project>\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n- `-p, --project` - Project name or ID\n- `-e, --environment` - Environment (default: production)\n- `-s, --service` - Service to link\n- `-t, --team` - Team/workspace\n\n## Create Service\n\nAfter project is linked, create a service:\n\n```bash\nrailway add --service <name>\n```\n\n**For GitHub repo sources**: Create an empty service, then invoke the `environment` skill to configure the source via staged changes API. Do NOT use `railway add --repo` - it requires GitHub app integration which often fails.\n\nFlow:\n\n1. `railway add --service my-api`\n2. Invoke `environment` skill to set `source.repo` and `source.branch`\n3. Apply changes to trigger deployment\n\n### Configure Based on Project Type\n\nReference [railpack.md](references/railpack.md) for build configuration.\nReference [monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md) for monorepo patterns.\n\n**Static site (Vite, CRA, Astro static):**\n\n- Railpack auto-detects common output dirs (dist, build)\n- If non-standard output dir: invoke `environment` skill to set `RAILPACK_STATIC_FILE_ROOT`\n- Do NOT use `railway variables` CLI - always use the environment skill\n\n**Node.js SSR (Next.js, Nuxt, Express):**\n\n- Verify `start` script exists in package.json\n- If custom start needed: invoke `environment` skill to set `startCommand`\n\n**Python (FastAPI, Django, Flask):**\n\n- Verify `requirements.txt` or `pyproject.toml` exists\n- Auto-detected by Railpack, usually no config needed\n\n**Go:**\n\n- Verify `go.mod` exists\n- Auto-detected, no config needed\n\n### Monorepo Configuration\n\n**Critical decision:** Root directory vs custom commands.\n\n**Isolated monorepo** (apps don''t share code):\n\n- Set Root Directory to the app''s subdirectory (e.g., `/frontend`)\n- Only that directory''s code is available during build\n\n**Shared monorepo** (TypeScript workspaces, shared packages):\n\n- Do NOT set root directory\n- Set custom build/start commands to filter the package:\n  - pnpm: `pnpm --filter <package> build`\n  - npm: `npm run build --workspace=packages/<package>`\n  - yarn: `yarn workspace <package> build`\n  - Turborepo: `turbo run build --filter=<package>`\n- Set watch paths to prevent unnecessary rebuilds\n\nSee [monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md) for detailed patterns.\n\n## Project Setup Guidance\n\nAnalyze the codebase to ensure Railway compatibility.\n\n### Analyze Codebase\n\nCheck for existing project files:\n\n- `package.json` → Node.js project\n- `requirements.txt`, `pyproject.toml` → Python project\n- `go.mod` → Go project\n- `Cargo.toml` → Rust project\n- `index.html` → Static site\n- None → Guide scaffolding\n\n**Monorepo detection:**\n\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml` → pnpm workspace (shared monorepo)\n- `package.json` with `workspaces` field → npm/yarn workspace (shared monorepo)\n- `turbo.json` → Turborepo (shared monorepo)\n- Multiple subdirs with separate `package.json` but no workspace config → isolated monorepo\n\n### Scaffolding Hints\n\nIf no code exists, suggest minimal patterns from [railpack.md](references/railpack.md):\n\n**Static site:**\n\n> Create an `index.html` file in the root directory.\n\n**Vite React:**\n\n```bash\nnpm create vite@latest . -- --template react\n```\n\n**Astro:**\n\n```bash\nnpm create astro@latest\n```\n\n**Python FastAPI:**\n\n> Create `main.py` with FastAPI app and `requirements.txt` with dependencies.\n\n**Go:**\n\n> Create `main.go` with HTTP server listening on `PORT` env var.\n\n## Databases\n\nFor adding databases (Postgres, Redis, MySQL, MongoDB), use the `database` skill.\n\nThe `database` skill handles:\n- Creating database services\n- Connection variable references\n- Wiring services to databases\n\n## Composability\n\n- **After service created**: Use `deploy` skill to push code\n- **For advanced config**: Use `environment` skill (buildCommand, startCommand)\n- **For domains**: Use `domain` skill\n- **For status checks**: Use `status` skill\n- **For service operations** (rename, delete, status): Use `service` skill\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### CLI Not Installed\n\n```\nRailway CLI not installed. Install with:\n  npm install -g @railway/cli\nor\n  brew install railway\n```\n\n### Not Authenticated\n\n```\nNot logged in to Railway. Run: railway login\n```\n\n### No Workspaces\n\n```\nNo workspaces found. Create one at railway.com or verify authentication.\n```\n\n### Project Name Taken\n\n```\nProject name already exists. Either:\n- Link to existing: railway link -p <name>\n- Use different name: railway init -n <other-name>\n```\n\n### Service Name Taken\n\n```\nService name already exists in this project. Use a different name:\n  railway add --service <other-name>\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Create HTML Static Site\n\n```\nUser: \"create a simple html site and deploy to railway\"\n\n1. Check status → not linked\n2. railway init -n my-site\n3. Guide: create index.html\n4. railway add --service my-site\n5. No config needed (index.html in root auto-detected)\n6. Use deploy skill: railway up\n7. Use domain skill for public URL\n```\n\n### Create Vite React Service\n\n```\nUser: \"create a vite react service\"\n\n1. Check status → linked (or init/link first)\n2. Scaffold: npm create vite@latest frontend -- --template react\n3. railway add --service frontend\n4. No config needed (Vite dist output auto-detected)\n5. Use deploy skill: railway up\n```\n\n### Add Python API to Project\n\n```\nUser: \"add a python api to my project\"\n\n1. Check status → linked\n2. Guide: create main.py with FastAPI, requirements.txt\n3. railway add --service api\n4. No config needed (FastAPI auto-detected)\n5. Use deploy skill\n```\n\n### Link and Add Service\n\n```\nUser: \"connect to my backend project and add a worker service\"\n\n1. railway list --json → find \"backend\"\n2. railway link -p backend\n3. railway add --service worker\n4. Guide setup based on worker type\n```\n\n### Deploy to Railway (Ambiguous)\n\n```\nUser: \"deploy to railway\"\n\n1. railway status → not linked\n2. railway list → has projects\n3. Directory is \"my-app\", found project \"my-app\"\n4. Ask: \"Found existing project ''my-app''. Link to it or create new?\"\n5. User: \"link\"\n6. railway link -p my-app\n7. Ask: \"Create a service for this code?\"\n```\n\n### Add Service to Isolated Monorepo\n\n```\nUser: \"create a static site in the frontend directory\"\n\n1. Check: /frontend has its own package.json, no workspace config\n2. This is isolated monorepo → use root directory\n3. railway add --service frontend\n4. Invoke environment skill to set rootDirectory: /frontend\n5. Set watch paths: /frontend/**\n```\n\n### Add Service to TypeScript Monorepo\n\n```\nUser: \"add a new api package to this turborepo\"\n\n1. Check: turbo.json exists, pnpm-workspace.yaml exists\n2. This is shared monorepo → use custom commands, NOT root directory\n3. Guide: create packages/api with package.json\n4. railway add --service api\n5. Invoke environment skill to set buildCommand and startCommand (do NOT set rootDirectory)\n6. Set watch paths: /packages/api/**, /packages/shared/**\n```\n\n### Deploy Existing pnpm Workspace Package\n\n```\nUser: \"deploy the backend package to railway\"\n\n1. Check: pnpm-workspace.yaml exists → shared monorepo\n2. railway add --service backend\n3. Invoke environment skill to set buildCommand and startCommand\n4. Set watch paths for backend + any shared deps\n```\n\n### Deploy Subdirectory of Linked Project\n\n```\nUser: \"create a vite app in my-app directory and deploy to railway\"\nCWD: ~/projects/my-project/my-app (parent already linked to \"my-project\")\n\n1. Check status in my-app → not linked\n2. Check parent: cd .. && railway status → IS linked to \"my-project\"\n3. DON''T init/link the subdirectory\n4. Scaffold: bun create vite my-app --template react-ts\n5. cd my-app && bun install\n6. railway add --service my-app\n7. Invoke environment skill to set rootDirectory: /my-app\n8. Deploy from root: railway up\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:27:52.080Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Deployment Agents needing streamlined project initialization and configuration on Railway.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Railway 上简化项目初始化和配置的部署代理。","ja":"Railway でプロジェクトの初期化と設定を簡素化する必要があるデプロイ エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Railway에서 프로젝트 초기화 및 구성이 간소화되는 배포 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de implementación que necesitan una inicialización y configuración de proyectos optimizadas en Railway.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de déploiement qui ont besoin d''une initialisation et d''une configuration de projet rationalisées sur Railway.","de":"Perfekt für Deployment-Agents, die eine optimierte Projektinitialisierung und -konfiguration auf Railway benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Implantação que necessitam de inicialização e configuração de projeto simplificadas no Railway.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов развертывания, которым необходима упрощенная инициализация и конфигурация проекта на Railway.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التثبيت الذين يحتاجون إلى تهيئة وتكوين مشروع مبسط على سكة حديدية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create Railway projects, services, and databases with proper configuration, supporting protocols like API deployment and frameworks such as Vite and React, while also handling backend initialization and linking to Railway.","zh":"赋予代理创建 Railway 项目、服务和数据库的能力，并配置正确的设置，支持 API 部署和 Vite、React 等框架，同时处理后端初始化和链接到 Railway。","ja":"エージェントが Railway プロジェクト、サービス、データベースを作成し、設定を正しく構成できるようにし、API デプロイや Vite、React などのフレームワークをサポートし、同時にバックエンドの初期化と Railway へのリンクを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 Railway 프로젝트, 서비스 및 데이터베이스를 생성하고 올바른 설정을 구성할 수 있도록 하며, API 배포 및 Vite, React와 같은 프레임워크를 지원하며, 동시에 백엔드 초기화 및 Railway 연결을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear proyectos, servicios y bases de datos de Railway con una configuración adecuada, soportando protocolos como la implementación de API y frameworks como Vite y React, y también maneja la inicialización de backend y el enlace a Railway.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des projets, des services et des bases de données Railway avec une configuration appropriée, en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que le déploiement d''API et des frameworks tels que Vite et React, tout en gérant l''initialisation du backend et le lien vers Railway.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Railway-Projekte, -Dienste und -Datenbanken mit ordnungsgemäßer Konfiguration zu erstellen, unterstützt Protokolle wie API-Implementierung und Frameworks wie Vite und React und verwaltet auch die Initialisierung der Backend- und die Verknüpfung mit Railway.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar projetos, serviços e bancos de dados do Railway com configuração adequada, dando suporte a protocolos como implantação de API e estruturas como Vite e React, além de lidar com a inicialização de backend e vinculação ao Railway.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать проекты, сервисы и базы данных Railway с правильной конфигурацией, поддерживая протоколы, такие как развертывание API, и фреймворки, такие как Vite и React, а также обрабатывая инициализацию бэкенда и связь с Railway.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء مشاريع وخدمات وقواعد بيانات ريلوي مع تكوين مناسب ، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل نشر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وإطارات مثل فايت وري액ت ، بالإضافة إلى التعامل مع تهيئة الخلفية وربطها بسكة حديدية."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new Railway projects","Deploying services to Railway","Creating backend APIs on Railway"],"zh":["在 Railway 上初始化新项目","将服务部署到 Railway","在 Railway 上创建后端 API"],"ja":["Railway で新しいプロジェクトを初期化する","サービスを Railway にデプロイする","Railway でバックエンド API を作成する"],"ko":["Railway에서 새로운 프로젝트 초기화","서비스를 Railway에 배포","Railway에서 백엔드 API 생성"],"es":["Inicialización de nuevos proyectos de Railway","Implementación de servicios en Railway","Creación de API de backend en Railway"],"fr":["Initialisation de nouveaux projets Railway","Déploiement de services sur Railway","Création d''API de backend sur Railway"],"de":["Initialisierung neuer Railway-Projekte","Bereitstellung von Diensten in Railway","Erstellung von Backend-APIs in Railway"],"pt":["Inicialização de novos projetos Railway","Implantação de serviços no Railway","Criação de APIs de backend no Railway"],"ru":["Инициализация новых проектов Railway","Развертывание сервисов на Railway","Создание бэкенд-API на Railway"],"ar":["تهيئة مشاريع ريلوي الجديدة","نشر خدمات على سكة حديدية","إنشاء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات الخلفية على سكة حديدية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway account and configuration","Dependent on user input for project and service names"],"zh":["需要 Railway 账户和配置","依赖于用户输入项目和服务名称"],"ja":["Railway アカウントと設定が必要","プロジェクト名とサービス名の入力に依存する"],"ko":["Railway 계정 및 구성이 필요","프로젝트 이름 및 서비스 이름 입력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y configuración de Railway","Dependiente de la entrada del usuario para los nombres de proyecto y servicio"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et une configuration Railway","Dépend de la saisie utilisateur pour les noms de projet et de service"],"de":["Benötigt ein Railway-Konto und eine Konfiguration","Abhängig von der Benutzereingabe für Projekt- und Servicenamen"],"pt":["Requer conta e configuração do Railway","Dependente da entrada do usuário para nomes de projeto e serviço"],"ru":["Требуется учетная запись и конфигурация Railway","Зависит от ввода пользователя для имен проекта и сервиса"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب وتكوين ريلوي","يعتمد على إدخال المستخدم لأسماء المشروع والخدمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
