ara mejorar la velocidad de búsqueda","Estrategias de caché para reducir la latencia","Operaciones por lotes para mejorar la eficiencia","Compatibilidad con Node.js 18+ y AgentDB v1.0.7+"],"fr":["Techniques de quantification pour réduire l''utilisation de la mémoire","Index HNSW pour améliorer la vitesse de recherche","Stratégies de cache pour réduire la latence","Opérations par lots pour améliorer l''efficacité","Compatibilité avec Node.js 18+ et AgentDB v1.0.7+"],"de":["Quantisierungstechniken zur Reduzierung des Speicherbedarfs","HNSW-Indizes zur Verbesserung der Suchgeschwindigkeit","Cachestrategien zur Reduzierung der Latenz","Batch-Operationen zur Verbesserung der Effizienz","Kompatibilität mit Node.js 18+ und AgentDB v1.0.7+"],"pt":["Técnicas de quantização para melhoria de desempenho","Indexação HNSW para busca rápida de vetores","Estratégias de cache para redução do uso de memória","Operações em lote para inserção eficiente de vetores","Suporte ao protocolo MCP para integração com Claude Code"],"ru":["Техники квантования для повышения производительности","Индексация HNSW для быстрого поиска векторов","Стратегии кэширования для снижения использования памяти","Операции пакетной вставки векторов для повышения эффективности","Поддержка протокола MCP для интеграции с Claude Code"],"ar":["تقنيات الكم لتحسين الأداء","ترميز HNSW للبحث السريع للمتجهات","استراتيجيات الذاكرة المؤقتة لتقليل استخدام الذاكرة","عمليات الدفعة لإدخال المتجهات بكفاءة","دعم بروتوكول MCP للتكامل مع Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AgentDB","性能优化","量化","HNSW 索引","缓存策略","批量操作","开发者工具"],"ja":["AgentDB","パフォーマンス最適化","量化","HNSW インデックス","キャッシュ戦略","バッチ操作","開発者ツール"],"ko":["AgentDB","성능 최적화","양자화","HNSW 인덱싱","캐싱 전략","배치 작업","개발자 도구"],"es":["optimización de rendimiento","AgentDB","bases de datos vectoriales","cuantización","índices HNSW","caché","operaciones por lotes","Node.js","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["optimisation des performances","AgentDB","bases de données vectorielles","quantification","index HNSW","cache","opérations par lots","Node.js","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Leistungsoptimierung","AgentDB","Vektor-Datenbanken","Quantisierung","HNSW-Indizes","Cachestrategien","Batch-Operationen","Node.js","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho do AgentDB","Banco de dados de vetores","Quantização","Indexação HNSW","Estratégias de cache","Operações em lote","Suporte ao protocolo MCP","Integração com Claude Code"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности AgentDB","Векторная база данных","Квантование","Индексация HNSW","Стратегии кэширования","Операции пакетной вставки","Поддержка протокола MCP","Интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["تحسين أداء AgentDB","قاعدة البيانات المتجهة","تقنيات الكم","ترميز HNSW","استراتيجيات الذاكرة المؤقتة","عمليات الدفعة","دعم بروتوكول MCP","التكامل مع Claude Code"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"claude-flow","repoPath":"ruvnet/claude-flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"AgentDB Performance Optimization","description":"Optimize AgentDB performance with quantization (4-32x memory reduction), HNSW indexing (150x faster search), caching, and batch operations. Use when optimizing memory usage, improving search speed, or scaling to millions of vectors.","bodyPreview":"# AgentDB Performance Optimization\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nProvides comprehensive performance optimization techniques for AgentDB vector databases. Achieve 150x-12,500x performance improvements through quantization, HNSW indexing, caching strategies, and batch operations. Reduce memory usage by 4-32x while maintaining accuracy.\n\n**Performance**: <100µs vector search, <1ms pattern retrieval, 2ms batch insert for 100 vectors.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js 18+\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow)","body":"# AgentDB Performance Optimization\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nProvides comprehensive performance optimization techniques for AgentDB vector databases. Achieve 150x-12,500x performance improvements through quantization, HNSW indexing, caching strategies, and batch operations. Reduce memory usage by 4-32x while maintaining accuracy.\n\n**Performance**: <100µs vector search, <1ms pattern retrieval, 2ms batch insert for 100 vectors.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js 18+\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow)\n- Existing AgentDB database or application\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Run Performance Benchmarks\n\n```bash\n# Comprehensive performance benchmarking\nnpx agentdb@latest benchmark\n\n# Results show:\n# ✅ Pattern Search: 150x faster (100µs vs 15ms)\n# ✅ Batch Insert: 500x faster (2ms vs 1s for 100 vectors)\n# ✅ Large-scale Query: 12,500x faster (8ms vs 100s at 1M vectors)\n# ✅ Memory Efficiency: 4-32x reduction with quantization\n```\n\n### Enable Optimizations\n\n```typescript\nimport { createAgentDBAdapter } from ''agentic-flow$reasoningbank'';\n\n// Optimized configuration\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb$optimized.db'',\n  quantizationType: ''binary'',   // 32x memory reduction\n  cacheSize: 1000,               // In-memory cache\n  enableLearning: true,\n  enableReasoning: true,\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quantization Strategies\n\n### 1. Binary Quantization (32x Reduction)\n\n**Best For**: Large-scale deployments (1M+ vectors), memory-constrained environments\n**Trade-off**: ~2-5% accuracy loss, 32x memory reduction, 10x faster\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''binary'',\n  // 768-dim float32 (3072 bytes) → 96 bytes binary\n  // 1M vectors: 3GB → 96MB\n});\n```\n\n**Use Cases**:\n- Mobile$edge deployment\n- Large-scale vector storage (millions of vectors)\n- Real-time search with memory constraints\n\n**Performance**:\n- Memory: 32x smaller\n- Search Speed: 10x faster (bit operations)\n- Accuracy: 95-98% of original\n\n### 2. Scalar Quantization (4x Reduction)\n\n**Best For**: Balanced performance$accuracy, moderate datasets\n**Trade-off**: ~1-2% accuracy loss, 4x memory reduction, 3x faster\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''scalar'',\n  // 768-dim float32 (3072 bytes) → 768 bytes (uint8)\n  // 1M vectors: 3GB → 768MB\n});\n```\n\n**Use Cases**:\n- Production applications requiring high accuracy\n- Medium-scale deployments (10K-1M vectors)\n- General-purpose optimization\n\n**Performance**:\n- Memory: 4x smaller\n- Search Speed: 3x faster\n- Accuracy: 98-99% of original\n\n### 3. Product Quantization (8-16x Reduction)\n\n**Best For**: High-dimensional vectors, balanced compression\n**Trade-off**: ~3-7% accuracy loss, 8-16x memory reduction, 5x faster\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''product'',\n  // 768-dim float32 (3072 bytes) → 48-96 bytes\n  // 1M vectors: 3GB → 192MB\n});\n```\n\n**Use Cases**:\n- High-dimensional embeddings (>512 dims)\n- Image$video embeddings\n- Large-scale similarity search\n\n**Performance**:\n- Memory: 8-16x smaller\n- Search Speed: 5x faster\n- Accuracy: 93-97% of original\n\n### 4. No Quantization (Full Precision)\n\n**Best For**: Maximum accuracy, small datasets\n**Trade-off**: No accuracy loss, full memory usage\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''none'',\n  // Full float32 precision\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## HNSW Indexing\n\n**Hierarchical Navigable Small World** - O(log n) search complexity\n\n### Automatic HNSW\n\nAgentDB automatically builds HNSW indices:\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb$vectors.db'',\n  // HNSW automatically enabled\n});\n\n// Search with HNSW (100µs vs 15ms linear scan)\nconst results = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  k: 10,\n});\n```\n\n### HNSW Parameters\n\n```typescript\n// Advanced HNSW configuration\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb$vectors.db'',\n  hnswM: 16,              // Connections per layer (default: 16)\n  hnswEfConstruction: 200, // Build quality (default: 200)\n  hnswEfSearch: 100,       // Search quality (default: 100)\n});\n```\n\n**Parameter Tuning**:\n- **M** (connections): Higher = better recall, more memory\n  - Small datasets (<10K): M = 8\n  - Medium datasets (10K-100K): M = 16\n  - Large datasets (>100K): M = 32\n- **efConstruction**: Higher = better index quality, slower build\n  - Fast build: 100\n  - Balanced: 200 (default)\n  - High quality: 400\n- **efSearch**: Higher = better recall, slower search\n  - Fast search: 50\n  - Balanced: 100 (default)\n  - High recall: 200\n\n---\n\n## Caching Strategies\n\n### In-Memory Pattern Cache\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  cacheSize: 1000,  // Cache 1000 most-used patterns\n});\n\n// First retrieval: ~2ms (database)\n// Subsequent: <1ms (cache hit)\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  k: 10,\n});\n```\n\n**Cache Tuning**:\n- Small applications: 100-500 patterns\n- Medium applications: 500-2000 patterns\n- Large applications: 2000-5000 patterns\n\n### LRU Cache Behavior\n\n```typescript\n// Cache automatically evicts least-recently-used patterns\n// Most frequently accessed patterns stay in cache\n\n// Monitor cache performance\nconst stats = await adapter.getStats();\nconsole.log(''Cache Hit Rate:'', stats.cacheHitRate);\n// Aim for >80% hit rate\n```\n\n---\n\n## Batch Operations\n\n### Batch Insert (500x Faster)\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ SLOW: Individual inserts\nfor (const doc of documents) {\n  await adapter.insertPattern({ /* ... */ });  // 1s for 100 docs\n}\n\n// ✅ FAST: Batch insert\nconst patterns = documents.map(doc => ({\n  id: '''',\n  type: ''document'',\n  domain: ''knowledge'',\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\n    embedding: doc.embedding,\n    text: doc.text,\n  }),\n  confidence: 1.0,\n  usage_count: 0,\n  success_count: 0,\n  created_at: Date.now(),\n  last_used: Date.now(),\n}));\n\n// Insert all at once (2ms for 100 docs)\nfor (const pattern of patterns) {\n  await adapter.insertPattern(pattern);\n}\n```\n\n### Batch Retrieval\n\n```typescript\n// Retrieve multiple queries efficiently\nconst queries = [queryEmbedding1, queryEmbedding2, queryEmbedding3];\n\n// Parallel retrieval\nconst results = await Promise.all(\n  queries.map(q => adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(q, { k: 5 }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Memory Optimization\n\n### Automatic Consolidation\n\n```typescript\n// Enable automatic pattern consolidation\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''documents'',\n  optimizeMemory: true,  // Consolidate similar patterns\n  k: 10,\n});\n\nconsole.log(''Optimizations:'', result.optimizations);\n// {\n//   consolidated: 15,  // Merged 15 similar patterns\n//   pruned: 3,         // Removed 3 low-quality patterns\n//   improved_quality: 0.12  // 12% quality improvement\n// }\n```\n\n### Manual Optimization\n\n```typescript\n// Manually trigger optimization\nawait adapter.optimize();\n\n// Get statistics\nconst stats = await adapter.getStats();\nconsole.log(''Before:'', stats.totalPatterns);\nconsole.log(''After:'', stats.totalPatterns);  // Reduced by ~10-30%\n```\n\n### Pruning Strategies\n\n```typescript\n// Prune low-confidence patterns\nawait adapter.prune({\n  minConfidence: 0.5,     // Remove confidence < 0.5\n  minUsageCount: 2,       // Remove usage_count < 2\n  maxAge: 30 * 24 * 3600, // Remove >30 days old\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Monitoring\n\n### Database Statistics\n\n```bash\n# Get comprehensive stats\nnpx agentdb@latest stats .agentdb$vectors.db\n\n# Output:\n# Total Patterns: 125,430\n# Database Size: 47.2 MB (with binary quantization)\n# Avg Confidence: 0.87\n# Domains: 15\n# Cache Hit Rate: 84%\n# Index Type: HNSW\n```\n\n### Runtime Metrics\n\n```typescript\nconst stats = await adapter.getStats();\n\nconsole.log(''Performance Metrics:'');\nconsole.log(''Total Patterns:'', stats.totalPatterns);\nconsole.log(''Database Size:'', stats.dbSize);\nconsole.log(''Avg Confidence:'', stats.avgConfidence);\nconsole.log(''Cache Hit Rate:'', stats.cacheHitRate);\nconsole.log(''Search Latency (avg):'', stats.avgSearchLatency);\nconsole.log(''Insert Latency (avg):'', stats.avgInsertLatency);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Optimization Recipes\n\n### Recipe 1: Maximum Speed (Sacrifice Accuracy)\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''binary'',  // 32x memory reduction\n  cacheSize: 5000,             // Large cache\n  hnswM: 8,                    // Fewer connections = faster\n  hnswEfSearch: 50,            // Low search quality = faster\n});\n\n// Expected: <50µs search, 90-95% accuracy\n```\n\n### Recipe 2: Balanced Performance\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''scalar'',  // 4x memory reduction\n  cacheSize: 1000,             // Standard cache\n  hnswM: 16,                   // Balanced connections\n  hnswEfSearch: 100,           // Balanced quality\n});\n\n// Expected: <100µs search, 98-99% accuracy\n```\n\n### Recipe 3: Maximum Accuracy\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''none'',    // No quantization\n  cacheSize: 2000,             // Large cache\n  hnswM: 32,                   // Many connections\n  hnswEfSearch: 200,           // High search quality\n});\n\n// Expected: <200µs search, 100% accuracy\n```\n\n### Recipe 4: Memory-Constrained (Mobile/Edge)\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''binary'',  // 32x memory reduction\n  cacheSize: 100,              // Small cache\n  hnswM: 8,                    // Minimal connections\n});\n\n// Expected: <100µs search, ~10MB for 100K vectors\n```\n\n---\n\n## Scaling Strategies\n\n### Small Scale (<10K vectors)\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''none'',    // Full precision\n  cacheSize: 500,\n  hnswM: 8,\n});\n```\n\n### Medium Scale (10K-100K vectors)\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''scalar'',  // 4x reduction\n  cacheSize: 1000,\n  hnswM: 16,\n});\n```\n\n### Large Scale (100K-1M vectors)\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''binary'',  // 32x reduction\n  cacheSize: 2000,\n  hnswM: 32,\n});\n```\n\n### Massive Scale (>1M vectors)\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''product'',  // 8-16x reduction\n  cacheSize: 5000,\n  hnswM: 48,\n  hnswEfConstruction: 400,\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Issue: High memory usage\n\n```bash\n# Check database size\nnpx agentdb@latest stats .agentdb$vectors.db\n\n# Enable quantization\n# Use ''binary'' for 32x reduction\n```\n\n### Issue: Slow search performance\n\n```typescript\n// Increase cache size\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  cacheSize: 2000,  // Increase from 1000\n});\n\n// Reduce search quality (faster)\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  k: 5,  // Reduce from 10\n});\n```\n\n### Issue: Low accuracy\n\n```typescript\n// Disable or use lighter quantization\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''scalar'',  // Instead of ''binary''\n  hnswEfSearch: 200,           // Higher search quality\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Benchmarks\n\n**Test System**: AMD Ryzen 9 5950X, 64GB RAM\n\n| Operation | Vector Count | No Optimization | Optimized | Improvement |\n|-----------|-------------|-----------------|-----------|-------------|\n| Search | 10K | 15ms | 100µs | 150x |\n| Search | 100K | 150ms | 120µs | 1,250x |\n| Search | 1M | 100s | 8ms | 12,500x |\n| Batch Insert (100) | - | 1s | 2ms | 500x |\n| Memory Usage | 1M | 3GB | 96MB | 32x (binary) |\n\n---\n\n## Learn More\n\n- **Quantization Paper**: docs$quantization-techniques.pdf\n- **HNSW Algorithm**: docs$hnsw-index.pdf\n- **GitHub**: https:/$github.com$ruvnet$agentic-flow$tree$main$packages$agentdb\n- **Website**: https:/$agentdb.ruv.io\n\n---\n\n**Category**: Performance / Optimization\n**Difficulty**: Intermediate\n**Estimated Time**: 20-30 minutes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:28:29.964Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude, Cursor, and Windsurf needing high-performance vector database optimization for autonomous workflows and conversational AI systems.","zh":"非常适合 Claude、Cursor 和 Windsurf 等需要高性能向量数据库优化的 AI 代理，以实现自主工作流和对话式 AI 系统。","ja":"Claude、Cursor、Windsurf などの高パフォーマンスベクトルデータベース最適化が必要な AI エージェントに最適で、自律的なワークフローと会話型 AI システムを実現します。","ko":"고성능 벡터 데이터베이스 최적화를 필요로 하는 Claude, Cursor, Windsurf 등의 AI 에이전트에 적합하여 자율적인 워크플ロー와 대화형 AI 시스템을 구현하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude, Cursor y Windsurf que necesitan una optimización de base de datos de vectores de alto rendimiento para flujos de trabajo autónomos y sistemas de IA conversacional.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude, Cursor et Windsurf qui nécessitent une optimisation de base de données de vecteurs haute performance pour les flux de travail autonomes et les systèmes de conversation IA.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten wie Claude, Cursor und Windsurf, die eine Hochleistungs-Optimierung der Vektordatenbank für autarke Workflows und konversationale KI-Systeme benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude, Cursor e Windsurf que necessitam de otimização de banco de dados de vetores de alto desempenho para fluxos de trabalho autônomos e sistemas de IA conversacional.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, Cursor и Windsurf, которым требуется оптимизация базы данных векторов с высокими производительными характеристиками для автономных рабочих процессов и систем разговорного ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude و Cursor و Windsurf الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين قاعدة بيانات متجهات الأداء العالي لأنظمة العمل المستقلة والذكاء الاصطناعي المحادثي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to achieve 150x-12,500x performance improvements through quantization, HNSW indexing, caching strategies, and batch operations, while reducing memory usage by 4-32x, utilizing Node.js 18+ and AgentDB v1.0.7+ via agentic-flow.","zh":"通过量化、HNSW 索引、缓存策略和批量操作，使代理能够实现 150x-12,500x 的性能改进，同时将内存使用量减少 4-32 倍，利用 Node.js 18+ 和 AgentDB v1.0.7+ 通过 agentic-flow。","ja":"量化、HNSW インデックス、キャッシュ戦略、バッチ操作を通じて、エージェントが 150x-12,500x のパフォーマンス改善を実現することを可能にし、同時にメモリ使用量を 4-32 倍削減し、Node.js 18+ と AgentDB v1.0.7+ を agentic-flow 経由で利用します。","ko":"량화, HNSW 인덱싱, 캐싱 전략 및 배치 작업을 통해 에이전트가 150x-12,500x 성능 개선을 달성할 수 있도록 하며,同時에 메모리 사용량을 4-32 배 줄이며, Node.js 18+ 및 AgentDB v1.0.7+를 agentic-flow를 통해 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes lograr mejoras de rendimiento de 150x-12.500x mediante cuantificación, indexación HNSW, estrategias de almacenamiento en caché y operaciones por lotes, mientras reduce el uso de memoria en 4-32x, utilizando Node.js 18+ y AgentDB v1.0.7+ a través de agentic-flow.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''atteindre des améliorations de performances de 150x-12 500x grâce à la quantification, à l''indexation HNSW, aux stratégies de mise en cache et aux opérations par lots, tout en réduisant l''utilisation de la mémoire de 4 à 32x, en utilisant Node.js 18+ et AgentDB v1.0.7+ via agentic-flow.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, 150x-12.500x bessere Leistungen durch Quantisierung, HNSW-Indexierung, Cachestrategien und Batch-Operationen zu erzielen, während der Speicherbedarf um 4-32x reduziert wird, wobei Node.js 18+ und AgentDB v1.0.7+ über agentic-flow verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes atinjam melhorias de desempenho de 150x-12.500x por meio da quantização, indexação HNSW, estratégias de cache e operações em lote, enquanto reduzem o uso de memória em 4-32x, utilizando o Node.js 18+ e o AgentDB v1.0.7+ via agentic-flow.","ru":"Позволяет агентам достичь повышения производительности в 150-12 500 раз за счет квантования, индексации HNSW, стратегий кэширования и пакетных операций, при этом сокращая использование памяти в 4-32 раза, используя Node.js 18+ и AgentDB v1.0.7+ через agentic-flow.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحقيق تحسينات في الأداء تتراوح من 150 ضعفًا إلى 12,500 ضعفًا من خلال الكمية، وفهرسة HNSW، وстратегيات التخزين المؤقت، وعمليات الدفع، في حين أنهم يقللون من استخدام الذاكرة في 4-32 مرة، باستخدام Node.js 18+ و AgentDB v1.0.7+ عبر agentic-flow."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing vector search performance to under 100µs","Improving pattern retrieval speed to less than 1ms","Enhancing batch insert operations for large vector datasets"],"zh":["优化向量搜索性能以达到 100µs 以下","提高模式检索速度以达到 1ms 以下","增强大型向量数据集的批量插入操作"],"ja":["ベクトル検索のパフォーマンスを 100µs 未満に最適化する","パターン検索の速度を 1ms 未満に高速化する","大規模なベクトルデータセットのバッチ挿入操作を強化する"],"ko":["벡터 검색 성능을 100µs 이하로 최적화하는 것","패턴检索 속도를 1ms 이하로 개선하는 것","대형 벡터 데이터셋의 배치 삽입 작업을 강화하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de la búsqueda de vectores a menos de 100µs","Mejorar la velocidad de recuperación de patrones a menos de 1ms","Mejorar las operaciones de inserción por lotes para grandes conjuntos de datos de vectores"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances de recherche de vecteurs à moins de 100µs","Améliorer la vitesse de récupération de modèles à moins de 1ms","Améliorer les opérations d''insertion par lots pour les grands ensembles de données de vecteurs"],"de":["Optimieren der Vektorsuchleistung auf unter 100µs","Verbesserung der Musterwiederherstellungszeit auf weniger als 1ms","Verbesserung der Batch-Einfügeoperationen für große Vektordatensätze"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho da busca de vetores para menos de 100µs","Melhorar a velocidade de recuperação de padrões para menos de 1ms","Aumentar as operações de inserção em lote para grandes conjuntos de dados de vetores"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность поиска векторов до менее 100 мкс","Улучшить скорость извлечения образов до менее 1 мс","Увеличить пакетные операции вставки для больших наборов данных векторов"],"ar":["تحسين أداء البحث عن المتجهات إلى أقل من 100 ميكرو ثانية","تحسين سرعة استرجاع الأنماط إلى أقل من 1 مللي ثانية","تعزيز عمليات الإدراج الدفعي لقطاعات بيانات المتجهات الكبيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js 18+","AgentDB v1.0.7+ via agentic-flow"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 18+","需要 AgentDB v1.0.7+ 通过 agentic-flow"],"ja":["Node.js 18+ が必要","AgentDB v1.0.7+ が agentic-flow 経由で必要"],"ko":["Node.js 18+가 필요합니다.","AgentDB v1.0.7+가 agentic-flow를 통해 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere Node.js 18+","AgentDB v1.0.7+ a través de agentic-flow"],"fr":["Nécessite Node.js 18+","AgentDB v1.0.7+ via agentic-flow"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js 18+","AgentDB v1.0.7+ über agentic-flow"],"pt":["Requer Node.js 18+","AgentDB v1.0.7+ via agentic-flow"],"ru":["Требуется Node.js 18+","AgentDB v1.0.7+ через agentic-flow"],"ar":["يتطلب Node.js 18+","AgentDB v1.0.7+ عبر agentic-flow"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tigrisdata/tigris-blog/using-inline-cta', 'community', 'tigrisdata', 'tigris-blog', 'tigrisdata/tigris-blog', 'using-inline-cta', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z', '2026-02-18T09:28:34.882Z', NULL, '{"id":"tigrisdata/tigris-blog/using-inline-cta","name":"using-inline-cta","description":{"zh":"InlineCta组件用于在博客文章末尾添加呼叫动作，提供一个可视化的卡片，包含标题、子标题和按钮，链接到文档或入门页面","ja":"インラインCTAコンポーネントは、ブログ記事の末尾に呼び出しを追加するために使用され、タイトル、サブタイトル、ボタンを含む視覚的に区別されたカードを提供し、ドキュメントまたは入門ページにリンクします","ko":"인라인 호출 동작(InlineCta) 컴포넌트는 블로그 게시물末尾에 호출을 추가하는 데 사용되며 제목, 부제목 및 버튼을 포함하는 시각적으로 구별된 카드를 제공하며 문서 또는 입문 페이지에 연결합니다","es":"El componente InlineCta es un elemento de React que permite agregar llamadas a la acción a las publicaciones de blog. Proporciona una tarjeta visualmente distinta con título, subtítulo y botón que enlaza a la documentación o páginas de inicio.","fr":"Le composant InlineCta est un élément React qui permet d''ajouter des appels à l''action aux publications de blog. Il fournit une carte visuellement distincte avec un titre, un sous-titre et un bouton qui relie à la documentation ou aux pages de démarrage.","de":"Die InlineCta-Komponente ist ein React-Element, das es ermöglicht, Calls-to-Action zu Blog-Beiträgen hinzuzufügen. Sie bietet eine visuell distinkte Karte mit Titel, Untertitel und Schaltfläche, die zur Dokumentation oder Startseiten verlinkt.","pt":"O componente InlineCta é um módulo React para adicionar uma chamada de ação ao final de posts de blog, fornecendo uma carta visualmente distinta com título, subtítulo e botão","ru":"Компонент InlineCta — это модуль React для добавления призыва к действию в конце блог-постов, предоставляющий визуально выделенную карточку с заголовком, подзаголовком и кнопкой","ar":"مكون InlineCta هو وحدة React لإضافة نداء للعمل في نهاية منشورات المدونة، يوفر بطاقة مرئية مميزة مع عنوان وعنوان 