amada a la acción","React","publicaciones de blog","experiencia del usuario","documentación","páginas de inicio"],"fr":["composant InlineCta","appel à l''action","React","publications de blog","expérience utilisateur","documentation","pages de démarrage"],"de":["InlineCta-Komponente","Call-to-Action","React","Blog-Beiträge","Benutzererfahrung","Dokumentation","Startseiten"],"pt":["componente InlineCta","chamada de ação","posts de blog","módulo React","direcionar leitores","ações específicas","personalização","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["компонент InlineCta","призыв к действию","блог-посты","модуль React","направлять читателей","конкретные действия","настройка","веб-разработка"],"ar":["مكون InlineCta","نداء للعمل","منشورات المدونة","وحدة React","توجيه القراء","إجراءات محددة","تخصيص","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"tigrisdata","repo":"tigris-blog","repoPath":"tigrisdata/tigris-blog","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-inline-cta","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Using InlineCta Component\n\n## Overview\n\nInlineCta is a React component for adding a call-to-action at the end of blog\nposts. It provides a visually distinct card with a title, subtitle, and button\nthat links to documentation or getting-started pages.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Add InlineCta at the very end of a blog post, after the conclusion\n- Use it to drive readers to take action: start using Tigris, read\n  documentation, or learn more\n\n## Import Statement\n\n```jsx\nimport InlineCta from \"@site/src/c","body":"# Using InlineCta Component\n\n## Overview\n\nInlineCta is a React component for adding a call-to-action at the end of blog\nposts. It provides a visually distinct card with a title, subtitle, and button\nthat links to documentation or getting-started pages.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Add InlineCta at the very end of a blog post, after the conclusion\n- Use it to drive readers to take action: start using Tigris, read\n  documentation, or learn more\n\n## Import Statement\n\n```jsx\nimport InlineCta from \"@site/src/components/InlineCta\";\n```\n\n## Props\n\n| Prop       | Type            | Required | Description                                                         |\n| ---------- | --------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `title`    | `string`        | Yes      | Short, punchy headline (often a question or value proposition)      |\n| `subtitle` | `string \\| JSX` | Yes      | 1-2 sentence description connecting blog topic to Tigris value prop |\n| `button`   | `string`        | Yes      | Call-to-action button text                                          |\n| `link`     | `string`        | No       | URL for button link (defaults to `tigrisConfig.getStartedUrl`)      |\n\n## Usage Pattern\n\nPlace InlineCta at the end of your blog post:\n\n```jsx\n<InlineCta\n  title=\"Ready to fork your data like code?\"\n  subtitle=\"Get instant, isolated copies of your data for development, testing, or experimentation.\"\n  button=\"Read the Bucket Forking Docs\"\n  link=\"https://www.tigrisdata.com/docs/buckets/snapshots-and-forks/\"\n/>\n```\n\n## Writing Guidelines\n\n### Title\n\n- Keep it short and punchy\n- Questions work well: \"Ready to...\", \"Want to...?\"\n- Value propositions: \"Global storage for...\", \"Experience...\"\n- Avoid generic titles like \"Get Started\"\n\n### Subtitle\n\n- Connect the blog post''s topic to Tigris value proposition\n- 1-2 sentences maximum\n- Can be a plain string or JSX (use JSX for formatting with `<p>` tags if\n  needed)\n\n### Button Text\n\nMatch button text to the link destination:\n\n- Documentation links → \"Read the docs\", \"Learn more\"\n- Getting started → \"Get started\", \"Start building\"\n- Product pages → \"Find out more\", \"See features\"\n\n### Link\n\n- Omit `link` prop to use default (getStartedUrl)\n- Provide specific URL for targeted destinations (docs, features, etc.)\n- Use full URLs including protocol (https://)\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mist                                         | Fix                                        |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| Placing CTA in middle of content             | Always put at end, after conclusion        |\n| Generic title like \"Get Started\"             | Use specific, compelling headline          |\n| Subtitle too long (3+ sentences)             | Keep to 1-2 sentences                      |\n| Missing `link` when sending to specific page | Always include `link` for non-default URLs |\n\n## Examples\n\n```jsx\n// Question-style title\n<InlineCta\n  title=\"Ready to fork your data like code?\"\n  subtitle=\"Get instant, isolated copies of your data for development, testing, or experimentation.\"\n  button=\"Read the Bucket Forking Docs\"\n  link=\"https://www.tigrisdata.com/docs/buckets/snapshots-and-forks/\"\n/>\n\n// Value proposition title\n<InlineCta\n  title=\"Global storage for your files and feeds\"\n  subtitle=\"Fast, global, reliable: pick three. Tigris lets you store your datasets, models, streams, backups, and more close to where they''re needed.\"\n  button=\"Read the Docs\"\n/>\n\n// JSX subtitle for formatting\n<InlineCta\n  title=\"Set and forget object storage\"\n  subtitle={\n    <p>\n      Configure your rules, then let Tigris handle the rest. Automatic lifecycle management keeps your storage costs predictable.\n    </p>\n  }\n  button=\"Get started\"\n/>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:28:34.882Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React component integration for call-to-action functionality.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React 组件集成来实现呼叫操作功能的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度な React コンポーネント統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 React 컴포넌트 통합을 통해 호출 작업 기능을 구현해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una integración avanzada de componentes de React para funcionalidad de llamada a la acción.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une intégration avancée de composants React pour la fonctionnalité d''appel à l''action.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Integration von React-Komponenten für Call-to-Action-Funktionalität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Frontend que necessitam de integração avançada de componentes React para funcionalidade de chamada para ação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима продвинутая интеграция компонентов React для функциональности вызова к действию.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متقدم لمكونات React للوظائف الفعلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to drive user engagement with visually distinct InlineCta components, utilizing React and linking to documentation or getting-started pages via JSX import statements like `import InlineCta from ''@site/src/c`.","zh":"赋予代理驱动用户参与的能力，使用视觉上不同的 InlineCta 组件，利用 React 并通过 JSX 导入语句链接到文档或入门页面，如 `import InlineCta from ''@site/src/c`。","ja":"エージェントにユーザー参与を促進する能力を与え、視覚的に異なる InlineCta コンポーネントを使用し、React を利用し、JSX インポートステートメントを介してドキュメントまたは入門ページにリンクします。例: `import InlineCta from ''@site/src/c`。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 참여를 주도할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 시각적으로 구별되는 InlineCta 컴포넌트를 사용하고 React를 활용하며 JSX 가져오기 문을 통해 문서 또는 시작 페이지에 연결합니다. 예: `import InlineCta from ''@site/src/c`.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a impulsar el compromiso del usuario con componentes InlineCta visualmente distintos, utilizando React y enlazando a la documentación o páginas de inicio mediante instrucciones de importación JSX como `import InlineCta from ''@site/src/c`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de stimuler l''engagement des utilisateurs avec des composants InlineCta visuellement distincts, en utilisant React et en faisant le lien vers la documentation ou les pages de démarrage via des instructions d''importation JSX comme `import InlineCta from ''@site/src/c`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Benutzerverbindung mit visuell eindeutigen InlineCta-Komponenten zu fördern, indem React verwendet und auf Dokumentation oder Startseiten via JSX-Importanweisungen wie `import InlineCta from ''@site/src/c` verlinkt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impulsionar o engajamento do usuário com componentes InlineCta visualmente distintos, utilizando React e vinculando à documentação ou páginas de início via instruções de importação JSX como `import InlineCta from ''@site/src/c`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью стимулировать вовлеченность пользователей с помощью визуально отличных компонентов InlineCta, используя React и связывая с документацией или страницами начала работы через операторы импорта JSX như `import InlineCta from ''@site/src/c`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تعزيز المشاركة الفعلية للمستخدمين باستخدام مكونات InlineCta متميزة بصريًا، مع استخدام React وربط الوثائق أو صفحات البدء عبر عبارات الاستيراد JSX مثل `import InlineCta from ''@site/src/c`."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding call-to-action cards at the end of blog posts","Driving readers to start using specific services or read documentation","Enhancing blog post conclusions with actionable buttons"],"zh":["在博客文章末尾添加呼叫操作卡片","驱动读者开始使用特定服务或阅读文档","通过可操作按钮增强博客文章结论"],"ja":["ブログ記事の末尾に呼び出しカードを追加する","読者が特定のサービスを使用したりドキュメントを読んだりするように促す","アクション可能なボタンでブログ記事の結論を強化する"],"ko":["블로그 게시물 끝에 호출 작업 카드를 추가하는 것","읽기가 특정 서비스를 사용하거나 문서를 읽도록 하는 것","실행 가능한 버튼으로 블로그 게시물 결론을 강화하는 것"],"es":["Agregar tarjetas de llamada a la acción al final de las publicaciones del blog","Impulsar a los lectores a comenzar a utilizar servicios específicos o leer la documentación","Mejorar las conclusiones de las publicaciones del blog con botones de acción"],"fr":["Ajouter des cartes d''appel à l''action à la fin des publications de blog","Inciter les lecteurs à commencer à utiliser des services spécifiques ou à lire la documentation","Améliorer les conclusions des publications de blog avec des boutons d''action"],"de":["Hinzufügen von Call-to-Action-Karten am Ende von Blog-Beiträgen","Leser dazu anregen, bestimmte Dienste zu nutzen oder Dokumentationen zu lesen","Verbessern der Blog-Beitrags-Schlussfolgerungen mit aktionsauslösenden Schaltflächen"],"pt":["Adicionar cartões de chamada para ação no final de posts de blog","Impulsionar leitores a começar a usar serviços específicos ou ler documentação","Melhorar as conclusões de posts de blog com botões ativos"],"ru":["Добавление карточек вызова к действию в конце блог-постов","Стимулирование читателей к началу использования конкретных услуг или чтению документации","Улучшение заключений блог-постов активными кнопками"],"ar":["إضافة بطاقات الفعل في نهاية منشورات المدونة","تحفيز القراء على البدء في استخدام خدمات محددة أو قراءة الوثائق","تحسين ختام مداخل المدونة بأزرار فعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React environment","Specific to blog post conclusions","Limited to adding call-to-action functionality"],"zh":["需要 React 环境","特定于博客文章结论","仅限于添加呼叫操作功能"],"ja":["React 環境が必要","ブログ記事の結論に特有","呼び出し操作機能の追加のみ"],"ko":["React 환경 필요","블로그 게시물 결론에 특정","호출 작업 기능 추가만 가능"],"es":["Requiere entorno de React","Específico para conclusiones de publicaciones de blog","Limitado a agregar funcionalidad de llamada a la acción"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React","Spécifique aux conclusions des publications de blog","Limité à l''ajout de la fonctionnalité d''appel à l''action"],"de":["Benötigt React-Umgebung","Spezifisch für Blog-Beitrags-Schlussfolgerungen","Begrenzt auf Hinzufügen von Call-to-Action-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer ambiente React","Específico para conclusões de posts de blog","Limitado à adição de funcionalidade de chamada para ação"],"ru":["Требуется среда React","Конкретно для заключений блог-постов","Ограничен добавлением функциональности вызова к действию"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React","محدد لختام منشورات المدونة","محدود بالإضافة إلى وظائف الفعل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
