 para respuestas contextuales","Configuración de almacenamiento de embeddings multi-modales","Búsqueda híbrida combinando vectores y búsqueda tradicional"],"fr":["Stockage d''embeddings pour les applications de génération améliorée","Récupération d''embeddings pour la recherche sémantique","Intégration avec les modèles de langage pour des réponses contextuelles","Configuration du stockage d''embeddings multi-modaux","Recherche hybride combinant des vecteurs et une recherche traditionnelle"],"de":["Speicherung von Embeddings für Retrieval-Augmented-Generation-Anwendungen","Abruf von Embeddings für semantische Suche","Integration mit Sprachmodellen für kontextuelle Antworten","Konfiguration von multi-modalem Embedding-Speicher","Hybride Suche, die Vektoren und traditionelle Suche kombiniert"],"pt":["Armazenamento de embeddings semânticos","Recuperação de embeddings para geração de texto","Integração com bancos de dados de vetores","Suporte à busca semântica em aplicações Java","Configuração de armazenamento de embeddings multi-modais"],"ru":["Хранение семантических вложений","Извлечение вложений для генерации текста","Интеграция с базами данных векторов","Поддержка семантического поиска в приложениях Java","Настройка хранения много-модальных вложений"],"ar":["تخزين التضمينات الدلالية","استرجاع التضمينات لتوليد النص","التكامل مع قواعد بيانات المتجهات","دعم البحث الدلالي في تطبيقات Java","تكوين تخزين التضمينات المتعددة الوضع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LangChain4J","向量存储配置","RAG 应用","嵌入存储","检索增强生成","多模态嵌入存储","混合搜索"],"ja":["LangChain4J","ベクトルストア設定","RAG アプリケーション","埋め込みストレージ","検索増強生成","多モーダル埋め込みストレージ","ハイブリッド検索"],"ko":["LangChain4J","벡터 저장소 구성","RAG 애플리케이션","임베딩 저장소","검색增强 생성","다중 모드 임베딩 저장소","하이브리드 검색"],"es":["LangChain4J","almacenes de vectores","generación mejorada","búsqueda semántica","modelos de lenguaje","embeddings","configuración de almacenamiento"],"fr":["LangChain4J","magasins de vecteurs","génération améliorée","recherche sémantique","modèles de langage","embeddings","configuration de stockage"],"de":["LangChain4J","Vektor-Speicher","Retrieval-Augmented-Generation","semantische Suche","Sprachmodelle","Embeddings","Konfiguration von Speicher"],"pt":["LangChain4J","lojas de vetores","armazenamento de embeddings","recuperação de embeddings","geração de texto","busca semântica","aplicações Java"],"ru":["LangChain4J","хранилища векторов","хранение вложений","извлечение вложений","генерация текста","семантический поиск","приложения Java"],"ar":["LangChain4J","مخازن المتجهات","تخزين التضمينات","استرجاع التضمينات","توليد النص","البحث الدلالي","تطبيقات Java"]}},"owner":"rcrock1978","repo":"Claude-RAG-Chatbot","repoPath":"rcrock1978/Claude-RAG-Chatbot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langchain4j-vector-stores-configuration","description":"Configure LangChain4J vector stores for RAG applications. Use when building semantic search, integrating vector databases (PostgreSQL/pgvector, Pinecone, MongoDB, Milvus, Neo4j), implementing embedding storage/retrieval, setting up hybrid search, or optimizing vector database performance for production AI applications.","version":"1.1.0","tags":["langchain4j","vector-stores","embeddings","rag","semantic-search","ai","llm","java","databases"],"bodyPreview":"# LangChain4J Vector Stores Configuration\n\nConfigure vector stores for Retrieval-Augmented Generation applications with LangChain4J.\n\n## When to Use\n\nTo configure vector stores when:\n\n- Building RAG applications requiring embedding storage and retrieval\n- Implementing semantic search in Java applications\n- Integrating LLMs with vector databases for context-aware responses\n- Configuring multi-modal embedding storage for text, images, or other data\n- Setting up hybrid search combining vector simil","body":"# LangChain4J Vector Stores Configuration\n\nConfigure vector stores for Retrieval-Augmented Generation applications with LangChain4J.\n\n## When to Use\n\nTo configure vector stores when:\n\n- Building RAG applications requiring embedding storage and retrieval\n- Implementing semantic search in Java applications\n- Integrating LLMs with vector databases for context-aware responses\n- Configuring multi-modal embedding storage for text, images, or other data\n- Setting up hybrid search combining vector similarity and full-text search\n- Migrating between different vector store providers\n- Optimizing vector database performance for production workloads\n- Building AI-powered applications with memory and persistence\n- Implementing document chunking and embedding pipelines\n- Creating recommendation systems based on vector similarity\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Set Up Basic Vector Store\n\nConfigure an embedding store for vector operations:\n\n```java\n@Bean\npublic EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> embeddingStore() {\n    return PgVectorEmbeddingStore.builder()\n        .host(\"localhost\")\n        .port(5432)\n        .database(\"vectordb\")\n        .user(\"username\")\n        .password(\"password\")\n        .table(\"embeddings\")\n        .dimension(1536) // OpenAI embedding dimension\n        .createTable(true)\n        .useIndex(true)\n        .build();\n}\n```\n\n### Configure Multiple Vector Stores\n\nUse different stores for different use cases:\n\n```java\n@Configuration\npublic class MultiVectorStoreConfiguration {\n\n    @Bean\n    @Qualifier(\"documentsStore\")\n    public EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> documentsEmbeddingStore() {\n        return PgVectorEmbeddingStore.builder()\n            .table(\"document_embeddings\")\n            .dimension(1536)\n            .build();\n    }\n\n    @Bean\n    @Qualifier(\"chatHistoryStore\")\n    public EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> chatHistoryEmbeddingStore() {\n        return MongoDbEmbeddingStore.builder()\n            .collectionName(\"chat_embeddings\")\n            .build();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Implement Document Ingestion\n\nUse EmbeddingStoreIngestor for automated document processing:\n\n```java\n@Bean\npublic EmbeddingStoreIngestor embeddingStoreIngestor(\n        EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> embeddingStore,\n        EmbeddingModel embeddingModel) {\n\n    return EmbeddingStoreIngestor.builder()\n        .documentSplitter(DocumentSplitters.recursive(\n            300,  // maxSegmentSizeInTokens\n            20,   // maxOverlapSizeInTokens\n            new OpenAiTokenizer(GPT_3_5_TURBO)\n        ))\n        .embeddingModel(embeddingModel)\n        .embeddingStore(embeddingStore)\n        .build();\n}\n```\n\n### Set Up Metadata Filtering\n\nConfigure metadata-based filtering capabilities:\n\n```java\n// MongoDB with metadata field mapping\nIndexMapping indexMapping = IndexMapping.builder()\n    .dimension(1536)\n    .metadataFieldNames(Set.of(\"category\", \"source\", \"created_date\", \"author\"))\n    .build();\n\n// Search with metadata filters\nEmbeddingSearchRequest request = EmbeddingSearchRequest.builder()\n    .queryEmbedding(queryEmbedding)\n    .maxResults(10)\n    .filter(and(\n        metadataKey(\"category\").isEqualTo(\"technical_docs\"),\n        metadataKey(\"created_date\").isGreaterThan(LocalDate.now().minusMonths(6))\n    ))\n    .build();\n```\n\n### Configure Production Settings\n\nImplement connection pooling and monitoring:\n\n```java\n@Bean\npublic EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> optimizedPgVectorStore() {\n    HikariConfig hikariConfig = new HikariConfig();\n    hikariConfig.setJdbcUrl(\"jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/vectordb\");\n    hikariConfig.setUsername(\"username\");\n    hikariConfig.setPassword(\"password\");\n    hikariConfig.setMaximumPoolSize(20);\n    hikariConfig.setMinimumIdle(5);\n    hikariConfig.setConnectionTimeout(30000);\n\n    DataSource dataSource = new HikariDataSource(hikariConfig);\n\n    return PgVectorEmbeddingStore.builder()\n        .dataSource(dataSource)\n        .table(\"embeddings\")\n        .dimension(1536)\n        .useIndex(true)\n        .build();\n}\n```\n\n### Implement Health Checks\n\nMonitor vector store connectivity:\n\n```java\n@Component\npublic class VectorStoreHealthIndicator implements HealthIndicator {\n\n    private final EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> embeddingStore;\n\n    @Override\n    public Health health() {\n        try {\n            embeddingStore.search(EmbeddingSearchRequest.builder()\n                .queryEmbedding(new Embedding(Collections.nCopies(1536, 0.0f)))\n                .maxResults(1)\n                .build());\n\n            return Health.up()\n                .withDetail(\"store\", embeddingStore.getClass().getSimpleName())\n                .build();\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            return Health.down()\n                .withDetail(\"error\", e.getMessage())\n                .build();\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Basic RAG Application Setup\n\n```java\n@Configuration\npublic class SimpleRagConfig {\n\n    @Bean\n    public EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> embeddingStore() {\n        return PgVectorEmbeddingStore.builder()\n            .host(\"localhost\")\n            .database(\"rag_db\")\n            .table(\"documents\")\n            .dimension(1536)\n            .build();\n    }\n\n    @Bean\n    public ChatLanguageModel chatModel() {\n        return OpenAiChatModel.withApiKey(System.getenv(\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"));\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Semantic Search Service\n\n```java\n@Service\npublic class SemanticSearchService {\n\n    private final EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> store;\n    private final EmbeddingModel embeddingModel;\n\n    public List<String> search(String query, int maxResults) {\n        Embedding queryEmbedding = embeddingModel.embed(query).content();\n\n        EmbeddingSearchRequest request = EmbeddingSearchRequest.builder()\n            .queryEmbedding(queryEmbedding)\n            .maxResults(maxResults)\n            .minScore(0.75)\n            .build();\n\n        return store.search(request).matches().stream()\n            .map(match -> match.embedded().text())\n            .toList();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Production Setup with Monitoring\n\n```java\n@Configuration\npublic class ProductionVectorStoreConfig {\n\n    @Bean\n    public EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> vectorStore(\n            @Value(\"${vector.store.host}\") String host,\n            MeterRegistry meterRegistry) {\n\n        EmbeddingStore<TextSegment> store = PgVectorEmbeddingStore.builder()\n            .host(host)\n            .database(\"production_vectors\")\n            .useIndex(true)\n            .indexListSize(200)\n            .build();\n\n        return new MonitoredEmbeddingStore<>(store, meterRegistry);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Choose the Right Vector Store\n\n**For Development:**\n- Use `InMemoryEmbeddingStore` for local development and testing\n- Fast setup, no external dependencies\n- Data lost on application restart\n\n**For Production:**\n- **PostgreSQL + pgvector**: Excellent for existing PostgreSQL environments\n- **Pinecone**: Managed service, good for rapid prototyping\n- **MongoDB Atlas**: Good integration with existing MongoDB applications\n- **Milvus/Zilliz**: High performance for large-scale deployments\n\n### Configure Appropriate Index Types\n\nChoose index types based on performance requirements:\n\n```java\n// For high recall requirements\n.indexType(IndexType.FLAT)  // Exact search, slower but accurate\n\n// For balanced performance\n.indexType(IndexType.IVF_FLAT)  // Good balance of speed and accuracy\n\n// For high-speed approximate search\n.indexType(IndexType.HNSW)  // Fastest, slightly less accurate\n```\n\n### Optimize Vector Dimensions\n\nMatch embedding dimensions to your model:\n\n```java\n// OpenAI text-embedding-3-small\n.dimension(1536)\n\n// OpenAI text-embedding-3-large\n.dimension(3072)\n\n// Sentence Transformers\n.dimension(384)  // all-MiniLM-L6-v2\n.dimension(768)  // all-mpnet-base-v2\n```\n\n### Implement Batch Operations\n\nUse batch operations for better performance:\n\n```java\n@Service\npublic class BatchEmbeddingService {\n\n    private static final int BATCH_SIZE = 100;\n\n    public void addDocumentsBatch(List<Document> documents) {\n        for (List<Document> batch : Lists.partition(documents, BATCH_SIZE)) {\n            List<TextSegment> segments = batch.stream()\n                .map(doc -> TextSegment.from(doc.text(), doc.metadata()))\n                .collect(Collectors.toList());\n\n            List<Embedding> embeddings = embeddingModel.embedAll(segments)\n                .content();\n\n            embeddingStore.addAll(embeddings, segments);\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Secure Configuration\n\nProtect sensitive configuration:\n\n```java\n// Use environment variables\n@Value(\"${vector.store.api.key:#{null}}\")\nprivate String apiKey;\n\n// Validate configuration\n@PostConstruct\npublic void validateConfiguration() {\n    if (StringUtils.isBlank(apiKey)) {\n        throw new IllegalStateException(\"Vector store API key must be configured\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## References\n\nFor comprehensive documentation and advanced configurations, see:\n\n- [API Reference](references/api-reference.md) - Complete API documentation\n- [Examples](references/examples.md) - Production-ready examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:28:31.228Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Java-based AI Agents requiring advanced vector store configuration for Retrieval-Augmented Generation applications","zh":"非常适合需要高级向量存储配置的基于Java的AI代理，用于增强检索生成应用","ja":"JavaベースのAIエージェントが高度なベクトルストア構成を必要とするRetrieval-Augmented Generationアプリケーションに最適","ko":"고급 벡터 저장소 구성이 필요한 자바 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합한 복원 강화 생성 애플리케이션","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Java que requieren una configuración avanzada de almacenamiento de vectores para aplicaciones de generación mejorada con recuperación","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Java nécessitant une configuration avancée de stockage de vecteurs pour les applications de génération améliorée par récupération","de":"Perfekt für Java-basierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Vektor-Speicher-Konfiguration für Anwendungen mit Retrieval-ergänzter Generierung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Java que requerem configuração avançada de armazenamento de vetores para aplicações de Geração Aumentada por Recuperação","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Java, требующих расширенной настройки хранилища векторов для приложений с генерацией, дополненной извлечением","ar":"مثالي لعميلة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تعتمد على جافا وتحتاج إلى تكوين متقدم لتخزين المتجهات لتطبيقات الجيل المعزز بالاسترجاع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure vector stores for semantic search, integrating LLMs with vector databases for context-aware responses, and setting up hybrid search combining vector similarity with LangChain4J, leveraging embedding storage and retrieval for text, images, or other data","zh":"赋予代理配置向量存储以进行语义搜索的能力，集成了大型语言模型（LLMs）与向量数据库，实现上下文感知响应，并设置混合搜索，结合向量相似度与LangChain4J，利用文本、图像或其他数据的嵌入存储和检索","ja":"エージェントにベクトルストアを構成してセマンティック検索を行う能力を与え、LLMをベクトルデータベースと統合してコンテキスト認識応答を実現し、LangChain4Jを利用したベクトル類似度とハイブリッド検索を組み合わせて設定する","ko":"에이전트가 벡터 저장소를 구성하여 의미 검색을 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 대형 언어 모델(LLM)을 벡터 데이터베이스와 통합하여 문맥 인식 응답을 구현하며, LangChain4J를 사용하여 벡터 유사성과 하이브리드 검색을 결합하여 설정","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar almacenes de vectores para búsqueda semántica, integrando LLM con bases de datos de vectores para respuestas conscientes del contexto, y configurando búsqueda híbrida que combina similitud de vectores con LangChain4J, aprovechando el almacenamiento y recuperación de incrustaciones para texto, imágenes u otros datos","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer des magasins de vecteurs pour la recherche sémantique, en intégrant les LLM avec les bases de données de vecteurs pour des réponses conscientes du contexte, et en configurant une recherche hybride combinant la similarité de vecteurs avec LangChain4J, en exploitant le stockage et la récupération d''incrustations pour le texte, les images ou d''autres données","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Vektor-Speicher für semantische Suche zu konfigurieren, indem LLMs mit Vektor-Datenbanken für kontextbewusste Antworten integriert und Hybrid-Suche konfiguriert wird, die Vektor-Ähnlichkeit mit LangChain4J kombiniert, wobei die Speicherung und Abrufbarkeit von Einbettungen für Text, Bilder oder andere Daten genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar armazenamentos de vetores para busca semântica, integrando LLMs com bancos de dados de vetores para respostas cientes do contexto e configurando busca híbrida que combina similaridade de vetores com LangChain4J, aproveitando armazenamento e recuperação de embeddings para texto, imagens ou outros dados","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность настроить хранилища векторов для семантического поиска, интегрируя Большие Языковые Модели (LLM) с хранилищами векторов для контекстно-зависимых ответов и настраивая гибридный поиск, сочетающий сходство векторов с LangChain4J, используя хранение и извлечение вложений для текста, изображений или других данных","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تكوين مخازن المتجهات للبحث الدلالي، ودمج نماذج اللغة الكبيرة مع قواعد بيانات المتجهات لاستجابات تتبع السياق، وتهيئة بحث هجين يجمع بين تشابه المتجهات مع LangChain4J، وافادة من تخزين واسترجاع التضمين للنصوص والصور أو البيانات الأخرى"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring multi-modal embedding storage for text and image data","Implementing semantic search in Java applications with vector databases","Integrating Large Language Models (LLMs) with vector stores for context-aware responses","Setting up hybrid search combining vector similarity for Retrieval-Augmented Generation applications"],"zh":["配置多模态嵌入存储以用于文本和图像数据","在Java应用程序中使用向量数据库实现语义搜索","将大型语言模型（LLMs）与向量存储集成以实现上下文感知响应","设置混合搜索，结合向量相似度以用于增强检索生成应用"],"ja":["テキストおよび画像データ用のマルチモーダル埋め込みストレージを構成する","Javaアプリケーションでベクトルデータベースを使用したセマンティック検索を実装する","LLMをベクトルストアと統合してコンテキスト認識応答を実現する","ベクトル類似度を組み合わせたハイブリッド検索を設定して、Retrieval-Augmented Generationアプリケーションで使用する"],"ko":["텍스트 및 이미지 데이터를 위한 멀티모달 임베딩 저장소를 구성","자바 애플리케이션에서 벡터 데이터베이스를 사용하여 의미 검색을 구현","대형 언어 모델(LLM)을 벡터 저장소와 통합하여 문맥 인식 응답을 구현","벡터 유사성을 결합한 하이브리드 검색을 설정하여 복원 강화 생성 애플리케이션에서 사용"],"es":["Configuración de almacenamiento de incrustaciones multi-modales para datos de texto e imagen","Implementación de búsqueda semántica en aplicaciones Java con bases de datos de vectores","Integración de Modelos de Lenguaje Grande (LLM) con almacenes de vectores para respuestas conscientes del contexto","Configuración de búsqueda híbrida que combina similitud de vectores para aplicaciones de generación mejorada con recuperación"],"fr":["Configuration d''un stockage d''incrustations multi-modales pour les données de texte et d''image","Mise en œuvre de la recherche sémantique dans les applications Java avec des bases de données de vecteurs","Intégration de Modèles de Langage Grande (LLM) avec des magasins de vecteurs pour des réponses conscientes du contexte","Configuration d''une recherche hybride combinant la similarité de vecteurs pour les applications de génération améliorée par récupération"],"de":["Konfiguration von multi-modalem Einbettungsspeicher für Text- und Bilddaten","Implementierung von semantischer Suche in Java-Anwendungen mit Vektor-Datenbanken","Integration von Large Language Models (LLM) mit Vektor-Speichern für kontextbewusste Antworten","Konfiguration von Hybrid-Suche, die Vektor-Ähnlichkeit für Anwendungen mit Retrieval-ergänzter Generierung kombiniert"],"pt":["Configurando armazenamento de embeddings multi-modais para dados de texto e imagem","Implementando busca semântica em aplicações Java com bancos de dados de vetores","Integrando Large Language Models (LLMs) com armazenamentos de vetores para respostas cientes do contexto","Configurando busca híbrida que combina similaridade de vetores para aplicações de Geração Aumentada por Recuperação"],"ru":["Настройка хранилища многомодальных вложений для текстовых и графических данных","Реализация семанти