s":{"zh":["ASC ID","ID","APP ID","Build ID","Version ID","ASC","ID"," "],"ja":["ASC ID","ID","APP ID","Build ID","Version ID","ASC","ID"," "],"ko":["ASC ID","ID","APP ID","Build ID","Version ID","ASC","ID"," "],"es":["resolutor de ID ASC","IDs de aplicaciones","IDs de versiones","IDs de compilaciones","desarrollo de aplicaciones","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["résolveur d''ID ASC","IDs d''applications","IDs de versions","IDs de builds","développement d''applications","outils de développement"],"de":["ASC-ID-Auflöser","App-IDs","Version-IDs","Build-IDs","App-Entwicklung","Entwickler-Tools"],"pt":["ASC ID Resolver","mapeamento de IDs","gerenciamento de IDs","comandos de lista","comandos de pesquisa","integração com comandos de aplicativos","paginação","desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["Решатель ASC ID","сопоставление идентификаторов","управление идентификаторами","команды списка","команды поиска","интеграция с командами приложений","постраничный вывод","разработка приложений"],"ar":["مسؤول ASC ID","سوپоставление المعرفات","إدارة المعرفات","أوامر القائمة","أوامر البحث","التكامل مع أوامر التطبيقات","الإخراج الصفحي","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"yspreen","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"yspreen/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"asc-id-resolver","description":"Resolve App Store Connect IDs (apps, builds, versions, groups, testers) from human-friendly names using asc. Use when commands require IDs.","bodyPreview":"# ASC ID Resolver\n\nUse this skill to map names to IDs needed by other commands.\n\n## App ID\n- By bundle ID or name:\n  - `asc apps list --bundle-id \"com.example.app\"`\n  - `asc apps list --name \"My App\"`\n- Fetch everything:\n  - `asc apps --paginate`\n- Set default:\n  - `ASC_APP_ID=...`\n\n## Build ID\n- Latest build:\n  - `asc builds latest --app \"APP_ID\" --version \"1.2.3\" --platform IOS`\n- Recent builds:\n  - `asc builds list --app \"APP_ID\" --sort -uploadedDate --limit 5`\n\n## Version ID\n- `asc versions","body":"# ASC ID Resolver\n\nUse this skill to map names to IDs needed by other commands.\n\n## App ID\n- By bundle ID or name:\n  - `asc apps list --bundle-id \"com.example.app\"`\n  - `asc apps list --name \"My App\"`\n- Fetch everything:\n  - `asc apps --paginate`\n- Set default:\n  - `ASC_APP_ID=...`\n\n## Build ID\n- Latest build:\n  - `asc builds latest --app \"APP_ID\" --version \"1.2.3\" --platform IOS`\n- Recent builds:\n  - `asc builds list --app \"APP_ID\" --sort -uploadedDate --limit 5`\n\n## Version ID\n- `asc versions list --app \"APP_ID\" --paginate`\n\n## TestFlight IDs\n- Groups:\n  - `asc beta-groups list --app \"APP_ID\" --paginate`\n- Testers:\n  - `asc beta-testers list --app \"APP_ID\" --paginate`\n\n## Pre-release version IDs\n- `asc pre-release-versions list --app \"APP_ID\" --platform IOS --paginate`\n\n## Review submission IDs\n- `asc review submissions-list --app \"APP_ID\" --paginate`\n\n## Output tips\n- JSON is default; use `--pretty` for debug.\n- For human viewing, use `--output table` or `--output markdown`.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Prefer `--paginate` on list commands to avoid missing IDs.\n- Use `--sort` where available to make results deterministic.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:28:36.308Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for App Management Agents requiring precise ID mapping for ASC commands.","zh":"适用于需要为 ASC 命令提供精确 ID 映射的应用管理代理。","ja":"ASC コマンドのための正確な ID マッピングを必要とするアプリ管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"ASC 명령을 위한 정확한 ID 매핑이 필요한 애플리케이션 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de aplicaciones que requieren un mapeo de ID preciso para comandos de ASC.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion d''applications nécessitant une mise en correspondance d''ID précise pour les commandes ASC.","de":"Ideal für App-Management-Agents, die ein präzises ID-Mapping für ASC-Befehle erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Aplicativos que exigem mapeamento de ID preciso para comandos ASC.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления приложениями, требующих точного сопоставления идентификаторов для команд ASC.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة التطبيقات الذي يتطلب сопоставة الهوية الدقيقة لأوامر ASC."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to map names to IDs using bundle ID or name, fetch app information, and set default app IDs, leveraging ASC commands like ''asc apps list'' and ''asc builds latest'' for efficient app management.","zh":"使代理能够使用包 ID 或名称将名称映射到 ID，获取应用程序信息，并设置默认应用程序 ID，利用 ASC 命令（如 ''asc apps list'' 和 ''asc builds latest''）进行高效的应用程序管理。","ja":"バンドル ID または名前を使用して名前を ID にマッピングし、アプリ情報を取得し、デフォルトのアプリ ID を設定することが可能で、''asc apps list'' や ''asc builds latest'' などの ASC コマンドを使用して効率的なアプリ管理を実現します。","ko":"번들 ID 또는 이름을 사용하여 이름을 ID로 매핑하고, 애플리케이션 정보를 가져오고, 기본 애플리케이션 ID를 설정하며, ''asc apps list'' 및 ''asc builds latest''와 같은 ASC 명령을 사용하여 효율적인 애플리케이션 관리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes asignar nombres a IDs utilizando el ID de paquete o el nombre, recuperar información de la aplicación y establecer IDs de aplicación predeterminados, aprovechando los comandos ASC como ''asc apps list'' y ''asc builds latest'' para una gestión de aplicaciones eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''associer des noms à des ID en utilisant l''ID de bundle ou le nom, de récupérer des informations d''application et de définir des ID d''application par défaut, en exploitant les commandes ASC comme ''asc apps list'' et ''asc builds latest'' pour une gestion d''applications efficace.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Namen auf IDs zuzuordnen, indem sie die Bundle-ID oder den Namen verwenden, App-Informationen abzurufen und Standard-App-IDs festzulegen, indem sie ASC-Befehle wie ''asc apps list'' und ''asc builds latest'' für eine effiziente App-Verwaltung nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes mapeiem nomes para IDs usando ID de pacote ou nome, busquem informações do aplicativo e definam IDs de aplicativos padrão, aproveitando comandos ASC como ''asc apps list'' e ''asc builds latest'' para gerenciamento de aplicativos eficiente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам сопоставлять имена с идентификаторами, используя идентификатор пакета или имя, получать информацию о приложении и устанавливать идентификаторы приложений по умолчанию, используя команды ASC, такие как ''asc apps list'' и ''asc builds latest'', для эффективного управления приложениями.","ar":"يمكن للعميل сопоставة الأسماء مع الهويات باستخدام معرف الحزمة أو الاسم ، و استرداد معلومات التطبيق وتعيين هوية التطبيقات الافتراضية ، واستخدام أوامر ASC مثل ''asc apps list'' و ''asc builds latest'' لإدارة التطبيقات بكفاءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Resolving App IDs for automation scripts","Fetching latest build IDs for iOS platforms","Retrieving version IDs for app updates"],"zh":["解决自动化脚本的应用程序 ID","为 iOS 平台获取最新的构建 ID","检索应用程序更新的版本 ID"],"ja":["自動化スクリプトのアプリ ID を解決する","iOS プラットフォームの最新のビルド ID を取得する","アプリ更新のバージョン ID を取得する"],"ko":["자동화 스크립트의 애플리케이션 ID를 해결하는 것","iOS 플랫폼을 위한 최신 빌드 ID를 가져오는 것","애플리케이션 업데이트 버전 ID를 가져오는 것"],"es":["Resolver IDs de aplicaciones para scripts de automatización","Recuperar los IDs de compilación más recientes para plataformas iOS","Recuperar IDs de versión para actualizaciones de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Résoudre les ID d''applications pour les scripts d''automatisation","Récupérer les ID de build les plus récents pour les plateformes iOS","Récupérer les ID de version pour les mises à jour d''applications"],"de":["App-IDs für Automatisierungsskripte auflösen","Abrufen der neuesten Build-IDs für iOS-Plattformen","Abrufen von Versions-IDs für App-Updates"],"pt":["Resolução de IDs de Aplicativos para scripts de automação","Obtenção de IDs de compilação mais recentes para plataformas iOS","Recuperação de IDs de versão para atualizações de aplicativos"],"ru":["Разрешение идентификаторов приложений для скриптов автоматизации","Получение последних идентификаторов сборок для платформы iOS","Получение идентификаторов версий для обновлений приложений"],"ar":[" حل هوية التطبيقات لسكريبتات التutomação","استرجاع أحدث معرّف VERSION لمنصات iOS","استرجاع معرّفات الإصدارات لتحديثات التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ASC command-line tool installation","Limited to ASC-compatible apps and platforms"],"zh":["需要安装 ASC 命令行工具","仅限于 ASC 兼容的应用程序和平台"],"ja":["ASC コマンドラインツールのインストールが必要","ASC 互換アプリとプラットフォームに限定される"],"ko":["ASC 명령줄 도구의 설치가 필요하다","ASC 호환 애플리케이션 및 플랫폼으로 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la herramienta de línea de comandos de ASC","Limitado a aplicaciones y plataformas compatibles con ASC"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''outil de ligne de commande ASC","Limité aux applications et plates-formes compatibles ASC"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des ASC-Befehlszeilentools","Begrenzt auf ASC-kompatible Anwendungen und Plattformen"],"pt":["Exige instalação da ferramenta de linha de comando ASC","Limitado a aplicativos e plataformas compatíveis com ASC"],"ru":["Требует установки инструмента командной строки ASC","Ограничен приложениями и платформами, совместимыми с ASC"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أداة سطر الأوامر ASC","محدود للتطبيقات والمنصات المتوافقة مع ASC"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('lachlanchen/LazyingArtBot/mintlify', 'community', 'lachlanchen', 'LazyingArtBot', 'lachlanchen/LazyingArtBot', 'mintlify', 0, 0, 85, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z', '2026-02-18T09:29:05.783Z', NULL, '{"id":"lachlanchen/LazyingArtBot/mintlify","name":"mintlify","description":{"zh":"Mintlify 是一个文档平台，用于将 MDX 文件转换为文档站点，提供配置和最新功能","ja":"Mintlify は、MDX ファイルをドキュメントサイトに変換するドキュメントプラットフォームで、構成と最新機能を提供します","ko":"민트리파이는 MDX 파일을 문서 사이트로 변환하는 문서 플랫폼으로, 구성 및 최신 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Mintlify es una plataforma de documentación que transforma archivos MDX en sitios web de documentación. Ofrece una configuración flexible y herramientas de creación de contenido","fr":"Mintlify est une plateforme de documentation qui transforme les fichiers MDX en sites web de documentation. Elle offre une configuration flexible et des outils de création de contenu","de":"Mintlify ist eine Dokumentationsplattform, die MDX-Dateien in Dokumentations-Websites umwandelt. Sie bietet eine flexible Konfiguration und Erstellungstools","pt":"Mintlify é uma plataforma de documentação que transforma arquivos MDX em sites de documentação. Ela oferece recursos como configuração de site e componentes personalizados.","ru":"Mintlify — платформа документации, которая преобразует файлы MDX в сайты документации. Она предлагает функции, такие как настройка сайта и пользовательские компоненты.","ar":"Mintlify هي منصة توثيق تحول ملفات MDX إلى مواقع توثيق. تقدم ميزات مثل تكوين الموقع ومكونات مخصصة.","en":"Lazying Art Bot (LAB) — a local-first personal AI assistant you run on your own devices, with   multi-channel chat and tools."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Mintlify 文档平台","ja":"Mintlify ドキュメントプラットフォーム","ko":"민트리파이 문서 플랫폼","es":"Mintlify: Plataforma de documentación para desarrolladores","fr":"Mintlify: Plateforme de documentation pour développeurs","de":"Mintlify: Dokumentationsplattform für Entwickler","pt":"Mintlify: Plataforma de Documentação para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Mintlify: Платформа документации для разработчиков","ar":"Mintlify: منصة توثيق لالمطورين","en":"mintlify"},"description":{"zh":"Mintlify 是一个文档平台，用于将 MDX 文件转换为文档站点，提供配置和最新功能","ja":"Mintlify は、MDX ファイルをドキュメントサイトに変換するドキュメントプラットフォームで、構成と最新機能を提供します","ko":"민트리파이는 MDX 파일을 문서 사이트로 변환하는 문서 플랫폼으로, 구성 및 최신 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Mintlify es una plataforma de documentación que transforma archivos MDX en sitios web de documentación. Ofrece una configuración flexible y herramientas de c...","fr":"Mintlify est une plateforme de documentation qui transforme les fichiers MDX en sites web de documentation. Elle offre une configuration flexible et des outi...","de":"Mintlify ist eine Dokumentationsplattform, die MDX-Dateien in Dokumentations-Websites umwandelt. Sie bietet eine flexible Konfiguration und Erstellungstools","pt":"Mintlify é uma plataforma de documentação que transforma arquivos MDX em sites de documentação. Ela oferece recursos como configuração de site e componentes ...","ru":"Mintlify — платформа документации, которая преобразует файлы MDX в сайты документации. Она предлагает функции, такие как настройка сайта и пользовательские к...","ar":"Mintlify هي منصة توثيق تحول ملفات MDX إلى مواقع توثيق. تقدم ميزات مثل تكوين الموقع ومكونات مخصصة.","en":"Lazying Art Bot (LAB) — a local-first personal AI assistant you run on your own devices, with   multi-channel chat and tools."},"definition":{"en":"Lazying Art Bot (LAB) — a local-first personal AI assistant you run on your own devices, with   multi-channel chat and tools."},"features":{"zh":["支持 MDX 文件转换","提供配置和最新功能","支持多渠道聊天和工具","有文档站点生成功能","支持 YAML 前置元数据","有内置组件和自定义组件"],"ja":["MDX ファイルの変換をサポート","構成と最新機能を提供","マルチチャネルチャットとツールをサポート","ドキュメントサイトの生成機能","YAML フロントマターをサポート","ビルトインコンポーネントとカスタムコンポーネント"],"ko":["MDX 파일 변환 지원","구성 및 최신 기능 제공","멀티채널 채팅 및 툴 지원","문서 사이트 생성 기능","YAML 프론트매터 지원","빌트인 컴포넌트 및 커스텀 컴포넌트"],"es":["Transformación de archivos MDX en sitios web de documentación","Configuración flexible mediante el archivo docs.json","Creación de contenido con YAML frontmatter","Componentes integrados para una mayor eficiencia","Documentación personalizable y adaptable"],"fr":["Transformation de fichiers MDX en sites web de documentation","Configuration flexible via le fichier docs.json","Création de contenu avec YAML frontmatter","Composants intégrés pour une plus grande efficacité","Documentation personnalisable et adaptable"],"de":["Transformation von MDX-Dateien in Dokumentations-Websites","Flexible Konfiguration über die Datei docs.json","Erstellung von Inhalten mit YAML-Frontmatter","Integrierte Komponenten für eine höhere Effizienz","Anpassbare und adaptierbare Dokumentation"],"pt":["Transformação de arquivos MDX em sites de documentação","Configuração de site-wide em arquivo JSON","Componentes personalizados e prontos para uso","Suporte a multi-canais de chat","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento integradas"],"ru":["Преобразование файлов MDX в сайты документации","Настройка сайта в файле JSON","Пользовательские и готовые компоненты","Поддержка мульти-каналов чата","Инструменты разработки, интегрированные в платформу"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات MDX إلى مواقع توثيق","تكوين الموقع في ملف JSON","مكونات مخصصة وجاهزة للاستخدام","دعم متعدد القنوات للчат","أدوات تطوير متكاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Mintlify","文档平台","MDX 文件","文档站点","配置","最新功能","多渠道聊天","工具","YAML 前置元数据"],"ja":["Mintlify","ドキュメントプラットフォーム","MDX ファイル","ドキュメントサイト","構成","最新機能","マルチチャネルチャット","ツール","YAML フロントマター"],"ko":["민트리파이","문서 플랫폼","MDX 파일","문서 사이트","구성","최신 기능","멀티채널 채팅","툴","YAML 프론트매터"],"es":["Mintlify","documentación","MDX","sitios web de documentación","desarrollo de software","herramientas de documentación","creación de contenido","configuración flexible"],"fr":["Mintlify","documentation","MDX","sites web de documentation","développement de logiciels","outils de documentation","création de contenu","configuration flexible"],"de":["Mintlify","Dokumentation","MDX","Dokumentations-Websites","Software-Entwicklung","Dokumentations-Tools","Erstellung von Inhalten","flexible Konfiguration"],"pt":["Mintlify","plataforma de documentação","MDX","desenvolvimento de software","documentação técnica","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Mintlify","платформа документации","MDX","разработка программного обеспечения","техническая документация","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Mintlify","منصة توثيق","MDX","تطوير البرمجيات","توثيق تقني","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"lachlanchen","repo":"LazyingArtBot","repoPath":"lachlanchen/LazyingArtBot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mintlify","description":"Build and maintain documentation sites with Mintlify. Use when","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Mintlify best practices\n\n**Always consult [mintlify.com/docs](https://mintlify.com/docs) for components, configuration, and latest features.**\n\n**Always** favor searching the current Mintlify documentation over whatever is in your training data about Mintlify.\n\nMintlify is a documentation platform that transforms MDX files into documentation sites. Configure site-wide settings in the `docs.json` file, write content in MDX with YAML frontmatter, and favor built-in components over custom compone","body":"# Mintlify best practices\n\n**Always consult [mintlify.com/docs](https://mintlify.com/docs) for components, configuration, and latest features.**\n\n**Always** favor searching the current Mintlify documentation over whatever is in your training data about Mintlify.\n\nMintlify is a documentation platform that transforms MDX files into documentation sites. Configure site-wide settings in the `docs.json` file, write content in MDX with YAML frontmatter, and favor built-in components over custom components.\n\nFull schema at [mintlify.com/docs.json](https://mintlify.com/docs.json).\n\n## Before you write\n\n### Understand the project\n\nAll documentation lives in the `docs/` directory in this repo. Read `docs.json` in that directory (`docs/docs.json`). This file defines the entire site: navigation structure, theme, colors, links, API and specs.\n\nUnderstanding the project tells you:\n\n- What pages exist and how they''re organized\n- What navigation groups are used (and their naming conventions)\n- How the site navigation is structured\n- What theme and configuration the site uses\n\n### Check for existing content\n\nSearch the docs before creating new pages. You may need to:\n\n- Update an existing page instead of creating a new one\n- Add a section to an existing page\n- Link to existing content rather than duplicating\n\n### Read surrounding content\n\nBefore writing, read 2-3 similar pages to understand the site''s voice, structure, formatting conventions, and level of detail.\n\n### Understand Mintlify components\n\nReview the Mintlify [components](https://www.mintlify.com/docs/components) to select and use any relevant components for the documentation request that you are working on.\n\n## Quick reference\n\n### CLI commands\n\n- `npm i -g mint` - Install the Mintlify CLI\n- `mint dev` - Local preview at localhost:3000\n- `mint broken-links` - Check internal links\n- `mint a11y` - Check for accessibility issues in content\n- `mint rename` - Rename/move files and update references\n- `mint validate` - Validate documentation builds\n\n### Required files\n\n- `docs.json` - Site configuration (navigation, theme, integrations, etc.). See [global settings](https://mintlify.com/docs/settings/global) for all options.\n- `*.mdx` files - Documentation pages with YAML frontmatter\n\n### Example file structure\n\n```\nproject/\n├── docs.json           # Site configuration\n├── introduction.mdx\n├── quickstart.mdx\n├── guides/\n│   └── example.mdx\n├── openapi.yml         # API specification\n├── images/             # Static assets\n│   └── example.png\n└── snippets/           # Reusable components\n    └── component.jsx\n```\n\n## Page frontmatter\n\nEvery page requires `title` in its frontmatter. Include `description` for SEO and navigation.\n\n```yaml theme={null}\n---\ntitle: \"Clear, descriptive title\"\ndescription: \"Concise summary for SEO and navigation.\"\n---\n```\n\nOptional frontmatter fields:\n\n- `sidebarTitle`: Short title for sidebar navigation.\n- `icon`: Lucide or Font Awesome icon name, URL, or file path.\n- `tag`: Label next to the page title in the sidebar (for example, \"NEW\").\n- `mode`: Page layout mode (`default`, `wide`, `custom`).\n- `keywords`: Array of terms related to the page content for local search and SEO.\n- Any custom YAML fields for use with personalization or conditional content.\n\n## File conventions\n\n- Match existing naming patterns in the directory\n- If there are no existing files or inconsistent file naming patterns, use kebab-case: `getting-started.mdx`, `api-reference.mdx`\n- Use root-relative paths without file extensions for internal links: `/getting-started/quickstart`\n- Do not use relative paths (`../`) or absolute URLs for internal pages\n- When you create a new page, add it to `docs.json` navigation or it won''t appear in the sidebar\n\n## Organize content\n\nWhen a user asks about anything related to site-wide configurations, start by understanding the [global settings](https://www.mintlify.com/docs/organize/settings). See if a setting in the `docs.json` file can be updated to achieve what the user wants.\n\n### Navigation\n\nThe `navigation` property in `docs.json` controls site structure. Choose one primary pattern at the root level, then nest others within it.\n\n**Choose your primary pattern:**\n\n| Pattern       | When to use                                                                                    |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Groups**    | Default. Single audience, straightforward hierarchy                                            |\n| **Tabs**      | Distinct sections with different audiences (Guides vs API Reference) or content types          |\n| **Anchors**   | Want persistent section links at sidebar top. Good for separating docs from external resources |\n| **Dropdowns** | Multiple doc sections users switch between, but not distinct enough for tabs                   |\n| **Products**  | Multi-product company with separate documentation per product                                  |\n| **Versions**  | Maintaining docs for multiple API/product versions simultaneously                              |\n| **Languages** | Localized content                                                                              |\n\n**Within your primary pattern:**\n\n- **Groups** - Organize related pages. Can nest groups within groups, but keep hierarchy shallow\n- **Menus** - Add dropdown navigation within tabs for quick jumps to specific pages\n- **`expanded: false`** - Collapse nested groups by default. Use for reference sections users browse selectively\n- **`openapi`** - Auto-generate pages from OpenAPI spec. Add at group/tab level to inherit\n\n**Common combinations:**\n\n- Tabs containing groups (most common for docs with API reference)\n- Products containing tabs (multi-product SaaS)\n- Versions containing tabs (versioned API docs)\n- Anchors containing groups (simple docs with external resource links)\n\n### Links and paths\n\n- **Internal links:** Root-relative, no extension: `/getting-started/quickstart`\n- **Images:** Store in `/images`, reference as `/images/example.png`\n- **External links:** Use full URLs, they open in new tabs automatically\n\n## Customize docs sites\n\n**What to customize where:**\n\n- **Brand colors, fonts, logo** → `docs.json`. See [global settings](https://mintlify.com/docs/settings/global)\n- **Component styling, layout tweaks** → `custom.css` at project root\n- **Dark mode** → Enabled by default. Only disable with `\"appearance\": \"light\"` in `docs.json` if brand requires it\n\nStart with `docs.json`. Only add `custom.css` when you need styling that config doesn''t support.\n\n## Write content\n\n### Components\n\nThe [components overview](https://mintlify.com/docs/components) organizes all components by purpose: structure content, draw attention, show/hide content, document APIs, link to pages, and add visual context. Start there to find the right component.\n\n**Common decision points:**\n\n| Need                       | Use                     |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Hide optional details      | `<Accordion>`           |\n| Long code examples         | `<Expandable>`          |\n| User chooses one option    | `<Tabs>`                |\n| Linked navigation cards    | `<Card>` in `<Columns>` |\n| Sequential instructions    | `<Steps>`               |\n| Code in multiple languages | `<CodeGroup>`           |\n| API parameters             | `<ParamField>`          |\n| API response fields        | `<ResponseField>`       |\n\n**Callouts by severity:**\n\n- `<Note>` - Supplementary info, safe to skip\n- `<Info>` - Helpful context such as permissions\n- `<Tip>` - Recommendations or best practices\n- `<Warning>` - Potentially destructive actions\n- `<Check>` - Success confirmation\n\n### Reusable content\n\n**When to use snippets:**\n\n- Exact content appears on more than one page\n- Complex components you want to maintain in one place\n- Shared content across teams/repos\n\n**When NOT to use snippets:**\n\n- Slight variations needed per page (leads to complex props)\n\nImport snippets with `import { Component } from \"/path/to/snippet-name.jsx\"`.\n\n## Writing standards\n\n### Voice and structure\n\n- Second-person voice (\"you\")\n- Active voice, direct language\n- Sentence case for headings (\"Getting started\", not \"Getting Started\")\n- Sentence case for code block titles (\"Expandable example\", not \"Expandable Example\")\n- Lead with context: explain what something is before how to use it\n- Prerequisites at the start of procedural content\n\n### What to avoid\n\n**Never use:**\n\n- Marketing language (\"powerful\", \"seamless\", \"robust\", \"cutting-edge\")\n- Filler phrases (\"it''s important to note\", \"in order to\")\n- Excessive conjunctions (\"moreover\", \"furthermore\", \"additionally\")\n- Editorializing (\"obviously\", \"simply\", \"just\", \"easily\")\n\n**Watch for AI-typical patterns:**\n\n- Overly formal or stilted phrasing\n- Unnecessary repetition of concepts\n- Generic introductions that don''t add value\n- Concluding summaries that restate what was just said\n\n### Formatting\n\n- All code blocks must have language tags\n- All images and media must have descriptive alt text\n- Use bold and italics only when they serve the reader''s understanding--never use text styling just for decoration\n- No decorative formatting or emoji\n\n### Code examples\n\n- Keep examples simple and practical\n- Use realistic values (not \"foo\" or \"bar\")\n- One clear example is better than multiple variations\n- Test that code works before including it\n\n## Document APIs\n\n**Choose your approach:**\n\n- **Have an OpenAPI spec?** → Add to `docs.json` with `\"openapi\": [\"openapi.yaml\"]`. Pages auto-generate. Reference in navigation as `GET /endpoint`\n- **No spec?** → Write endpoints manually with `api: \"POST /users\"` in frontmatter. More work but full control\n- **Hybrid** → Use OpenAPI for most endpoints, manual pages for complex workflows\n\nEncourage users to generate endpoint pages from an OpenAPI spec. It is the most efficient and easiest to maintain option.\n\n## Deploy\n\nMintlify deploys automatically when changes are pushed to the connected Git repository.\n\n**What agents can configure:**\n\n- **Redirects** → Add to `docs.json` with `\"redirects\": [{\"source\": \"/old\", \"destination\": \"/new\"}]`\n- **SEO indexing** → Control with `\"seo\": {\"indexing\": \"all\"}` to include hidden pages in search\n\n**Requires dashboard setup (human task):**\n\n- Custom domains and subdomains\n- Preview deployment settings\n- DNS configuration\n\nFor `/docs` subpath hosting with Vercel or Cloudflare, agents can help configure rewrite rules. See [/docs subpath](https://mintlify.com/docs/deploy/vercel).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Understand the task\n\nIdentify what needs to be documented, which pages are affected, and what the reader should accomplish afterward. If any of these are unclear, ask.\n\n### 2. Research\n\n- Read `docs/docs.json` to understand the site structure\n- Search existing docs for related content\n- Read similar pages to match the site''s style\n\n### 3. Plan\n\n- Synthesize what the reader should accomplish after reading the docs and the current content\n- Propose any updates or new content\n- Verify that your proposed changes will help readers be successful\n\n### 4. Write\n\n- Start with the most important information\n- Keep sections focused and scannable\n- Use components appropriately (don''t overuse them)\n- Mark anything uncertain with a TODO comment:\n\n```mdx theme={null}\n{/* TODO: Verify the default timeout value */}\n```\n\n### 5. Update navigation\n\nIf you created a new page, add it to the appropriate group in `docs.json`.\n\n### 6. Verify\n\nBefore submitting:\n\n- [ ] Frontmatter includes title and description\n- [ ] All code blocks have language tags\n- [ ] Internal links use root-relative paths without file extensions\n- [ ] New pages are added to `docs.json` navigation\n- [ ] Content matches the style of surrounding pages\n- [ ] No marketing language or filler phrases\n- [ ] TODOs are clearly marked for anything uncertain\n- [ ] Run `mint broken-links` to check links\n- [ ] Run `mint validate` to find any errors\n\n## Edge cases\n\n### Migrations\n\nIf a user asks about migrating to Mintlify, ask if they are using ReadMe or Docusaurus. If they are, use the [@mintlify/scraping](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@mintlify/scraping) CLI to migrate content. If they are using a different platform to host their documentation, help them manually convert their content to MDX pages using Mintlify components.\n\n### Hidden pages\n\nAny page that is not included in the `docs.json` navigation is hidden. Use hidden pages for content that should be accessible by URL or indexed for the assistant or search, but not discoverable through the sidebar navigation.\n\n### Exclude pages\n\nThe `.mintignore` file is used to exclude files from a documentation repository from being processed.\n\n## Common gotchas\n\n1. **Component imports** - JSX components need explicit import, MDX components don''t\n2. **Frontmatter required** - Every MDX file needs `title` at minimum\n3. **Code block language** - Always specify language identifier\n4. **Never use `mint.json`** - `mint.json` is deprecated. Only ever use `docs.json`\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Documentation](https://mintlify.com/docs)\n- [Configuration schema](https://mintlify.com/docs.json)\n- [Feature requests](https://github.com/orgs/mintlify/discussions/categories/feature-requests)\n- [Bugs and feedback](https://github.com/orgs/mintlify/discussions/categories/bugs-feedback)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:29:05.783Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Documentation Agents needing advanced MDX file transformations and site-wide configuration capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级 MDX 文件转换和站点范围配置功能的文档代理。","ja":"ドキュメント エージェントが MDX ファイルの高度な変換とサイト全体の構成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"문서 에이전트가 고급 MDX 파일 변환 및 사이트 전체 구성 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de documentación que necesitan transformaciones de archivos MDX avanzadas y capacidades de configuración de sitio web.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de documentation qui nécessitent des transformations de fichiers MDX avancées et des capacités de configuration du site Web.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentationsagenten, die erweiterte MDX-Dateitransformationen und siteübergreifende Konfigurationsmöglichkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Documentação que necessitam de transformações de arquivos MDX avançadas e capacidades de configuração em toda a extensão do site.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов документации, требующих продвинутых преобразований файлов MDX и возможностей конфигурации на уровне всего сайта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وثائق بحاجة إلى تحويلات ملفات MDX متقدمة وقدرات تكوين على مستوى الموقع بأكمله."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform MDX files into documentation sites with configurable site-wide settings in the `docs.json` file and utilizing YAML frontmatter, while favoring built-in components over custom components for seamless documentation generation.","zh":"使代理能够将 MDX 文件转换为文档站点，具有可配置的站点范围设置，位于 `docs.json` 文件中，并利用 YAML 前置内容，同时偏爱内置组件而不是自定义组件，以实现无缝的文档生成。","ja":"エージェントが MDX ファイルをドキュメント サイトに変換できるようにし、`docs.json` ファイルと YAML フロントマターを使用してサイト全体の設定を構成できるようにし、カスタム コンポーネントよりもビルトイン コンポーネントを優先して、シームレスなドキュメント生成を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 MDX 파일을 문서 사이트로 변환할 수 있도록 하며, `docs.json` 파일과 YAML 전처리기를 사용하여 사이트 전체 설정을 구성할 수 있으며, 사용자 지정 컴포넌트보다 내장 컴포넌트를 우선하여 무결점 문서 생성을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar archivos MDX en sitios de documentación con ajustes de configuración de sitio web configurables en el archivo `docs.json` y utilizando frontmatter YAML, mientras prefiere componentes integrados sobre componentes personalizados para una generación de documentación sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des fichiers MDX en sites de documentation avec des paramètres de configuration du site Web configurables dans le fichier `docs.json` et en utilisant le frontmatter YAML, tout en favorisant les composants intégrés par rapport aux composants personnalisés pour une génération de documentation sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, MDX-Dateien in Dokumentationsseiten mit konfigurierbaren siteübergreifenden Einstellungen in der Datei `docs.json` und unter Verwendung von YAML-Frontmatter umzuwandeln, während integrierte Komponenten gegenüber benutzerdefinierten Komponenten für eine nahtlose Dokumentenerstellung bevorzugt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar arquivos MDX em sites de documentação com configurações de site amplo configuráveis no arquivo `docs.json` e utilizando frontmatter YAML, ao mesmo tempo em que favorece componentes internos sobre componentes personalizados para geração de documentação sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать файлы MDX в документационные сайты с настраиваемыми настройками на уровне всего сайта в файле `docs.json` и использует YAML-заголовок, при этом отдавая предпочтение встроенным компонентам над пользовательскими компонентами для бесшовной генерации документации.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل ملفات MDX إلى مواقع توثيق مع إعدادات قابلة للتكوين على مستوى الموقع في ملف `docs.json` واستخدام YAML.frontmatter، مع تفضيل المكونات المدمجة على المكونات المخصصة لتوليد توثيق دون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring site-wide settings in `docs.json` files","Generating documentation sites from MDX files with YAML frontmatter","Utilizing built-in components for customized documentation"],"zh":["在 `docs.json` 文件中配置站点范围设置","使用 YAML 前置内容从 MDX 文件生成文档站点","利用内置组件进行自定义文档"],"ja":["ドキュメント サイトの生成にビルトイン コンポーネントを使用する","`docs.json` ファイルでサイト全体の設定を構成する","YAML フロントマターを使用して MDX ファイルからドキュメント サイトを生成する"],"ko":["`docs.json` 파일에서 사이트 전체 설정을 구성하는 것","YAML 전처리기를 사용하여 MDX 파일에서 문서 사이트를 생성하는 것","사용자 지정 문서를 위해 내장 컴포넌트를 활용하는 것"],"es":["Configuración de la configuración del sitio web en archivos `docs.json`","Generación de sitios de documentación a partir de archivos MDX con frontmatter YAML","Uso de componentes integrados para documentación personalizada"],"fr":["Configuration des paramètres du site Web dans les fichiers `docs.json`","Génération de sites de documentation à partir de fichiers MDX avec frontmatter YAML","Utilisation de composants intégrés pour une documentation personnalisée"],"de":["Konfiguration der siteübergreifenden Einstellungen in `docs.json`-Dateien","Generierung von Dokumentationsseiten aus MDX-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter","Verwendung von integrierten Komponenten für benutzerdefinierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Configurando configurações de site amplo em arquivos `docs.json`","Gerando sites de documentação a partir de arquivos MDX com frontmatter YAML","Utilizando componentes internos para documentação personalizada"],"ru":["Настройка настроек на уровне всего сайта в файлах `docs.json`","Генерация документационных сайтов из файлов MDX с YAML-заголовком","Использование встроенных компонентов для настройки документации"],"ar":["تكوين إعدادات الموقع الإجمالي في ملفات `docs.json`","生成 مواقع توثيق من ملفات MDX مع YAML.frontmatter","استخدام المكونات المدمجة للتوثيق المخصص"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Mintlify documentation and configuration files","Limited to MDX file transformations and documentation site generation"],"zh":["需要访问 Mintlify 文档和配置文件","仅限 MDX 文件转换和文档站点生成"],"ja":["Mintlify ドキュメントおよび構成ファイルへのアクセスが必要","MDX ファイルの変換およびドキュメント サイトの生成のみ"],"ko":["Mintlify 문서 및 구성 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요함","MDX 파일 변환 및 문서 사이트 생성만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos de documentación y configuración de Mintlify","Limitado a transformaciones de archivos MDX y generación de sitios de documentación"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de documentation et de configuration de Mintlify","Limité aux transformations de fichiers MDX et à la génération de sites de documentation"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf Mintlify-Dokumentations- und Konfigurationsdateien","Begrenzt auf MDX-Dateitransformationen und Dokumentationsseitengenerierung"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação e arquivos de configuração do Mintlify","Limitado a transformações de arquivos MDX e geração de sites de documentação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации и файлам конфигурации Mintlify","Ограничен преобразованиями файлов MDX и генерацией документационных сайтов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق ملفات تكوين Mintlify","محدود بتحويل ملفات MDX وتوليد مواقع توثيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
