ript en mode strict","Système de modules ESM","Linting et formatage avec @antfu/eslint-config","Tests avec Vitest","Crochets de Git avec simple-git-hooks et lint-staged"],"de":["Paket-Manager pnpm","Sprache TypeScript im Strict-Modus","Modul-System ESM","Linting und Formatierung mit @antfu/eslint-config","Tests mit Vitest","Git-Hooks mit simple-git-hooks und lint-staged"],"pt":["Gerenciador de pacotes pnpm","Linguagem TypeScript com modo estrito","Sistema de módulos ESM","Linting e formatação com @antfu/eslint-config","Testes com Vitest","Ganchos de Git com simple-git-hooks + lint-staged"],"ru":["Менеджер пакетов pnpm","Язык TypeScript с режимом строгой типизации","Система модулей ESM","Линтинг и форматирование с @antfu/eslint-config","Тестирование с Vitest","Гуки Git с simple-git-hooks + lint-staged"],"ar":["مدير حزم pnpm","لغة TypeScript مع الوضع الصارم","نظام الوحدات ESM","تنسيق وتنظيف مع @antfu/eslint-config","اختبارات مع Vitest","hooks Git مع simple-git-hooks + lint-staged"]},"keywords":{"zh":["antfu","现代化 Web 开发","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","代码检查","格式化","Vitest","Git 钩子"],"ja":["antfu","モダンな Web 開発","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","コードチェック","フォーマット","Vitest","Git フック"],"ko":["antfu","현대적인 웹 개발","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","코드 확인","포맷","Vitest","Git 훅"],"es":["desarrollo web","herramientas de desarrollo","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","pnpm","linting","formato","git hooks"],"fr":["développement web","outils de développement","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","pnpm","linting","formatage","crochets de Git"],"de":["Webentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","pnpm","Linting","Formatierung","Git-Hooks"],"pt":["desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","configurações de desenvolvimento","TypeScript","ESM","pnpm","Vitest","simple-git-hooks","lint-staged"],"ru":["веб-разработка","инструменты разработки","настройки разработки","TypeScript","ESM","pnpm","Vitest","simple-git-hooks","lint-staged"],"ar":["تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير","إعدادات التطوير","TypeScript","ESM","pnpm","Vitest","simple-git-hooks","lint-staged"]}},"owner":"peterWang123589","repo":"rubin_forum","repoPath":"peterWang123589/rubin_forum","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"antfu","description":"Anthony Fus {Opinionated} preferences and best practices for web development","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePres","body":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePress (in `docs/`) |\n\n---\n\n## Core Stack\n\n### Package Manager (pnpm)\n\nUse pnpm as the package manager.\n\nFor monorepo setups, use pnpm workspaces:\n\n```yaml\n# pnpm-workspace.yaml\npackages:\n  - ''packages/*''\n```\n\n\nUse pnpm named catalogs in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` to manage dependency versions:\n\n| Catalog | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `prod` | Production dependencies |\n| `inlined` | Dependencies inlined by bundler |\n| `dev` | Development tools (linter, bundler, testing, dev-server) |\n| `frontend` | Frontend libraries bundled into frontend |\n\nCatalog names are not limited to the above and can be adjusted based on needs. Avoid using default catalog.\n\n#### @antfu/ni\n\nUse `@antfu/ni` for unified package manager commands. It auto-detects the package manager (pnpm/npm/yarn/bun) based on lockfile.\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `ni` | Install dependencies |\n| `ni <pkg>` | Add dependency |\n| `ni -D <pkg>` | Add dev dependency |\n| `nr <script>` | Run script |\n| `nu` | Upgrade dependencies |\n| `nun <pkg>` | Uninstall dependency |\n| `nci` | Clean install (like `pnpm i --frozen-lockfile`) |\n| `nlx <pkg>` | Execute package (like `npx`) |\n\nInstall globally with `pnpm i -g @antfu/ni` if the commands are not found.\n\n### TypeScript (Strict Mode)\n\nAlways use TypeScript with strict mode enabled.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### ESM (ECMAScript Modules)\n\nAlways work in ESM mode. Set `\"type\": \"module\"` in `package.json`.\n\n---\n\n## Code Quality\n\n### ESLint (@antfu/eslint-config)\n\nUse `@antfu/eslint-config` for both formatting and linting. This eliminates the need for Prettier.\n\nCreate `eslint.config.js` with `// @ts-check` comment:\n\n```js\n// @ts-check\nimport antfu from ''@antfu/eslint-config''\n\nexport default antfu()\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"lint\": \"eslint .\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWhen getting linting errors, try to fix them with `nr lint --fix`. Don''t add `lint:fix` script.\n\n### Git Hooks (simple-git-hooks + lint-staged)\n\nUse `simple-git-hooks` with `lint-staged` for pre-commit linting:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"simple-git-hooks\": {\n    \"pre-commit\": \"pnpm i --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts --offline && npx lint-staged\"\n  },\n  \"lint-staged\": {\n    \"*\": \"eslint --fix\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"prepare\": \"npx simple-git-hooks\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Unit Testing (Vitest)\n\nUse Vitest for unit testing.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"vitest\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Conventions:**\n\n- Place test files next to source files: `foo.ts` → `foo.test.ts` (same directory)\n- High-level tests go in `tests/` directory in each package\n- Use `describe` and `it` API (not `test`)\n- Use `expect` API for assertions\n- Use `assert` only for TypeScript null assertions\n- Use `toMatchSnapshot` for complex output assertions\n- Use `toMatchFileSnapshot` with explicit file path and extension for language-specific output (exclude those files from linting)\n\n---\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Publishing (Library Projects)\n\nFor library projects, publish through GitHub Releases triggered by `bumpp`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"release\": \"bumpp -r\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Documentation (VitePress)\n\nUse VitePress for documentation. Place docs under `docs/` directory.\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── .vitepress/\n│   └── config.ts\n├── index.md\n└── guide/\n    └── getting-started.md\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"docs:dev\": \"vitepress dev docs\",\n    \"docs:build\": \"vitepress build docs\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n### Project Setup\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| @antfu/eslint-config | ESLint flat config for formatting and linting | [antfu-eslint-config](references/antfu-eslint-config.md) |\n| GitHub Actions | Preferred workflows using sxzz/workflows | [github-actions](references/github-actions.md) |\n| .gitignore | Preferred .gitignore for JS/TS projects | [gitignore](references/gitignore.md) |\n| VS Code Extensions | Recommended extensions for development | [vscode-extensions](references/vscode-extensions.md) |\n\n### Development\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| App Development | Preferences for Vue/Vite/Nuxt/UnoCSS web applications | [app-development](references/app-development.md) |\n| Library Development | Preferences for bundling and publishing TypeScript libraries | [library-development](references/library-development.md) |\n| Monorepo | pnpm workspaces, centralized alias, Turborepo | [monorepo](references/monorepo.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:29:29.234Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing strict TypeScript configurations and ESM module systems.","zh":"非常适合需要严格TypeScript配置和ESM模块系统的Web开发代理。","ja":"TypeScriptの厳格な構成とESMモジュールシステムが必要なWeb開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"엄격한 TypeScript 구성 및 ESM 모듈 시스템이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan configuraciones de TypeScript estrictas y sistemas de módulos ESM.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant des configurations TypeScript strictes et des systèmes de modules ESM.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die strenge TypeScript-Konfigurationen und ESM-Modulsysteme benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de configurações estritas do TypeScript e sistemas de módulos ESM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, требующих строгих конфигураций TypeScript и системы модулей ESM.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الويب الذي يحتاج إلى تكوينات TypeScript صارمة وأنظمة وحدات ESM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize pnpm for package management, Vitest for testing, and @antfu/eslint-config for linting and formatting, streamlining web development workflows with strict TypeScript and ESM standards.","zh":"赋予代理使用pnpm进行包管理、Vitest进行测试和@antfu/eslint-config进行linting和格式化，从而简化具有严格TypeScript和ESM标准的Web开发工作流程。","ja":"pnpmを使用したパッケージ管理、Vitestを使用したテスト、@antfu/eslint-configを使用したlintingとフォーマットを行うことで、厳格なTypeScriptとESM規格を持ったWeb開発ワークフローを効率化します。","ko":"pnpm을 사용한 패키지 관리, Vitest를 사용한 테스트, @antfu/eslint-config를 사용한 linting 및 형식화를 통해 엄격한 TypeScript 및 ESM 표준을 갖춘 웹 개발 워크플로우를 간소화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes utilizar pnpm para la gestión de paquetes, Vitest para pruebas y @antfu/eslint-config para análisis y formato, simplificando los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo web con normas estrictas de TypeScript y ESM.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser pnpm pour la gestion des paquets, Vitest pour les tests et @antfu/eslint-config pour l''analyse et le formatage, rationalisant les flux de travail de développement Web avec des normes TypeScript et ESM strictes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, pnpm für Paketverwaltung, Vitest für Tests und @antfu/eslint-config für Analyse und Formatierung zu verwenden, wodurch die Webentwicklungsworkflows mit strengen TypeScript- und ESM-Standards rationalisiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizar o pnpm para gerenciamento de pacotes, Vitest para testes e @antfu/eslint-config para análise e formatação, simplificando os fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento web com padrões TypeScript e ESM estritos.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность использовать pnpm для управления пакетами, Vitest для тестирования и @antfu/eslint-config для проверки и форматирования, оптимизируя рабочие процессы веб-разработки с помощью строгих стандартов TypeScript и ESM.","ar":"يتمكن العميل من استخدام pnpm لإدارة الحزم، وVitest للاختبار، و@antfu/eslint-config للتحليل والتنسيق، وبذلك يبسط عمليات العمل في تطوير الويب مع معايير TypeScript وESM الصارمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring web projects with pnpm and ESM","Implementing strict TypeScript linting with @antfu/eslint-config","Streamlining testing processes with Vitest"],"zh":["使用pnpm和ESM配置Web项目","使用@antfu/eslint-config实现严格的TypeScript linting","使用Vitest简化测试过程"],"ja":["pnpmとESMを使用したWebプロジェクトの構成","@antfu/eslint-configを使用した厳格なTypeScript lintingの実装","Vitestを使用したテストプロセスの効率化"],"ko":["pnpm 및 ESM을 사용한 웹 프로젝트 구성","@antfu/eslint-config를 사용한 엄격한 TypeScript linting 구현","Vitest를 사용한 테스트 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Configuración de proyectos web con pnpm y ESM","Implementación de análisis de TypeScript estricto con @antfu/eslint-config","Optimización de procesos de prueba con Vitest"],"fr":["Configuration de projets Web avec pnpm et ESM","Mise en œuvre d''un análisis TypeScript strict avec @antfu/eslint-config","Optimisation des processus de test avec Vitest"],"de":["Konfiguration von Webprojekten mit pnpm und ESM","Implementierung von strenger TypeScript-Analyse mit @antfu/eslint-config","Optimierung von Testprozessen mit Vitest"],"pt":["Configurando projetos web com pnpm e ESM","Implementando análise de TypeScript estrita com @antfu/eslint-config","Otimizando processos de teste com Vitest"],"ru":["Настройка веб-проектов с помощью pnpm и ESM","Реализация строгой проверки TypeScript с помощью @antfu/eslint-config","Оптимизация процессов тестирования с помощью Vitest"],"ar":["تهيئة مشاريع الويب مع pnpm و ESM","تنفيذ التحليل الصارم للنوعية مع @antfu/eslint-config","تحسين عمليات الاختبار مع Vitest"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript strict mode compatibility","ESM module system support necessary","VitePress required for documentation"],"zh":["需要TypeScript严格模式兼容性","需要ESM模块系统支持","需要VitePress用于文档"],"ja":["TypeScriptの厳格モードの互換性が必要","ESMモジュールシステムのサポートが必要","ドキュメントにVitePressが必要"],"ko":["TypeScript 엄격 모드 호환성이 필요함","ESM 모듈 시스템 지원이 필요함","문서에 VitePress가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con el modo estricto de TypeScript","Se requiere soporte para el sistema de módulos ESM","Se requiere VitePress para la documentación"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec le mode strict de TypeScript","Un support pour le système de modules ESM est nécessaire","VitePress est requis pour la documentation"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit dem strengen Modus von TypeScript","Unterstützung für das ESM-Modulsystem ist erforderlich","VitePress wird für die Dokumentation benötigt"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com o modo estrito do TypeScript","Suporte ao sistema de módulos ESM necessário","VitePress é necessário para documentação"],"ru":["Требует совместимости со строгим режимом TypeScript","Необходима поддержка системы модулей ESM","VitePress необходим для документации"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع الوضع الصارم للنوعية","دعم نظام الوحدات ESM ضروري","VitePress مطلوب للتدوين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
