pilation","Traitement et rétention des compilations","Recherche de la compilation la plus récente","Inspection de l''état de traitement","Flux de distribution d''applications","Publication sur TestFlight"],"de":["Verwaltung des Build-Status","Verarbeitung und Aufbewahrung von Builds","Suche nach dem neuesten Build","Überprüfung des Verarbeitungsstatus","Verteilungsflüsse von Anwendungen","Veröffentlichung auf TestFlight"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado de compilação","Inspecção do estado de processamento","Distribuição de fluxos de trabalho","Encontrar builds recentes","Publicação em TestFlight","Gerenciamento de retenção de builds"],"ru":["Управление состоянием сборки","Инспекция состояния обработки","Распределение рабочих процессов","Поиск недавних сборок","Публикация в TestFlight","Управление хранением сборок"],"ar":["إدارة حالة البناء","تفتيش حالة المعالجة","توزيع تدفقات العمل","العثور على البناءات الحديثة","النشر في TestFlight","إدارة الاحتفاظ بالبناءات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ASC 构建生命周期管理","构建状态管理","构建处理","构建保留","构建查询","构建状态检查"],"ja":["ASC ビルド ライフサイクル管理","ビルド状態管理","ビルド処理","ビルド保持","ビルド検索","ビルド状態確認"],"ko":["ASC 빌드 라이프사이클 관리","빌드 상태 관리","빌드 처리","빌드 보관","빌드 조회","빌드 상태 확인"],"es":["ASC Build Lifecycle","gestión de ciclo de vida de compilación","desarrollo de aplicaciones","compilación de aplicaciones","TestFlight","distribución de aplicaciones","build de aplicaciones","estado de compilación","procesamiento de compilaciones"],"fr":["ASC Build Lifecycle","gestion du cycle de vie de compilation","développement d''applications","compilation d''applications","TestFlight","distribution d''applications","build d''applications","état de compilation","traitement de compilations"],"de":["ASC Build Lifecycle","Build-Lebenszyklus-Verwaltung","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Anwendungs-Compilierung","TestFlight","Anwendungs-Verteilung","Build von Anwendungen","Build-Status","Compilierungs-Verarbeitung"],"pt":["ASC Build Lifecycle","gerenciamento de builds","estado de compilação","processamento de builds","distribuição de fluxos de trabalho","TestFlight","retenção de builds"],"ru":["ASC Build Lifecycle","управление сборками","состояние сборки","обработка сборок","распределение рабочих процессов","TestFlight","хранение сборок"],"ar":["دورة حياة البناء ASC","إدارة البناءات","حالة البناء","معالجة البناءات","توزيع تدفقات العمل","TestFlight","الاحتفاظ بالبناءات"]}},"owner":"SzymonNastaly","repo":"hauptgang","repoPath":"SzymonNastaly/hauptgang","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"asc-build-lifecycle","description":"Track build processing, find latest builds, and clean up old builds with asc. Use when managing build retention or waiting on processing.","bodyPreview":"# ASC Build Lifecycle\n\nUse this skill to manage build state, processing, and retention.\n\n## Find the right build\n- Latest build:\n  - `asc builds latest --app \"APP_ID\" --version \"1.2.3\" --platform IOS`\n- Recent builds:\n  - `asc builds list --app \"APP_ID\" --sort -uploadedDate --limit 10`\n\n## Inspect processing state\n- `asc builds info --build \"BUILD_ID\"`\n\n## Distribution flows\n- Prefer end-to-end:\n  - `asc publish testflight --app \"APP_ID\" --ipa \"./app.ipa\" --group \"GROUP_ID\" --wait`\n  - `asc publ","body":"# ASC Build Lifecycle\n\nUse this skill to manage build state, processing, and retention.\n\n## Find the right build\n- Latest build:\n  - `asc builds latest --app \"APP_ID\" --version \"1.2.3\" --platform IOS`\n- Recent builds:\n  - `asc builds list --app \"APP_ID\" --sort -uploadedDate --limit 10`\n\n## Inspect processing state\n- `asc builds info --build \"BUILD_ID\"`\n\n## Distribution flows\n- Prefer end-to-end:\n  - `asc publish testflight --app \"APP_ID\" --ipa \"./app.ipa\" --group \"GROUP_ID\" --wait`\n  - `asc publish appstore --app \"APP_ID\" --ipa \"./app.ipa\" --version \"1.2.3\" --wait --submit --confirm`\n\n## Cleanup\n- Preview expiration:\n  - `asc builds expire-all --app \"APP_ID\" --older-than 90d --dry-run`\n- Apply expiration:\n  - `asc builds expire-all --app \"APP_ID\" --older-than 90d --confirm`\n- Single build:\n  - `asc builds expire --build \"BUILD_ID\"`\n\n## Notes\n- `asc builds upload` prepares upload operations only; use `asc publish` for end-to-end flows.\n- For long processing times, use `--wait`, `--poll-interval`, and `--timeout` where supported.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:29:39.642Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing streamlined build lifecycle management and automation","zh":"非常适合需要简化构建生命周期管理和自动化的移动应用程序代理","ja":"モバイルアプリエージェント向けにビルドライフサイクル管理と自動化を簡素化するために最適","ko":"빌드 라이프사이클 관리 및 자동화를 간소화해야 하는 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que necesitan una gestión y automatización del ciclo de vida de compilación simplificada","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Applications Mobiles ayant besoin d''une gestion et d''une automation du cycle de vie de construction simplifiée","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Build-Lebenszyklusverwaltung und -automatisierung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de gerenciamento e automação de ciclo de vida de compilação otimizados","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, которым требуется упрощенное управление циклом сборки и автоматизация","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة دورة حياة البناء وآليتها المُستخدمة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage build states, process, and retention using ASC CLI commands, facilitating end-to-end distribution flows via TestFlight and IPA files, all while utilizing flags like --app, --version, and --platform for precise control","zh":"赋予代理管理构建状态、处理和保留使用ASC CLI命令的能力，通过TestFlight和IPA文件实现端到端的分发流程，同时利用--app、--version和--platform等标志实现精确控制","ja":"ASC CLIコマンドを使用してビルド状態、プロセス、保有を管理するエージェントを可能にし、TestFlightとIPAファイルを介したエンドツーエンドの配布フローを促進し、--app、--version、--platformなどのフラグを使用して正確な制御を実現","ko":"ASC CLI 명령을 사용하여 빌드 상태, 처리 및 보유를 관리하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, TestFlight 및 IPA 파일을 통해 최종 사용자에게 배포하는 흐름을促進하며, --app, --version, --platform 등의 플래그를 사용하여 정확한 제어를 실현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar estados de compilación, procesos y retención utilizando comandos de ASC CLI, facilitando flujos de distribución de extremo a extremo a través de TestFlight y archivos IPA, todo mientras se utilizan indicadores como --app, --version y --platform para un control preciso","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les états de construction, les processus et la rétention en utilisant des commandes ASC CLI, facilitant ainsi les flux de distribution de bout en bout via TestFlight et des fichiers IPA, le tout en utilisant des indicateurs tels que --app, --version et --platform pour un contrôle précis","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Build-Zustände, Prozesse und Aufbewahrung mithilfe von ASC-CLI-Befehlen zu verwalten, wodurch End-to-End-Verteilungsflüsse über TestFlight und IPA-Dateien erleichtert werden, und zwar unter Verwendung von Flags wie --app, --version und --platform für eine präzise Kontrolle","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar estados de compilação, processos e retenção usando comandos da ASC CLI, facilitando fluxos de distribuição de ponta a ponta via TestFlight e arquivos IPA, tudo isso utilizando bandeiras como --app, --version e --platform para controle preciso","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность управлять состояниями сборки, процессами и хранением с помощью команд ASC CLI, облегчая конечные потоки распространения через TestFlight и файлы IPA, все это при использовании флагов, таких как --app, --version и --platform, для точного контроля","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من إدارة حالات البناء والعمليات والاحتفاظ باستخدام أوامر ASC CLI، وتسهيل تدفقات التوزيع من النهاية إلى النهاية عبر TestFlight وملفات IPA، كل ذلك باستخدام أعلام مثل --app و --version و --platform للسيطرة الدقيقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating latest build retrieval for iOS apps","Inspecting processing states for specific build IDs","Streamlining distribution flows to TestFlight"],"zh":["自动获取iOS应用程序的最新构建","检查特定构建ID的处理状态","简化TestFlight的分发流程"],"ja":["iOSアプリの最新ビルドを自動取得する","特定のビルドIDの処理状態を確認する","TestFlightの配布フローを簡素化する"],"ko":["iOS 애플리케이션의 최신 빌드를 자동으로 가져오는 것","특정 빌드 ID의 처리 상태를 검사하는 것","TestFlight를 위한 배포 흐름을 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la recuperación de la última compilación para aplicaciones iOS","Inspección de los estados de procesamiento para IDs de compilación específicos","Optimización de los flujos de distribución a TestFlight"],"fr":["Automatisation de la récupération de la dernière construction pour les applications iOS","Inspection des états de traitement pour des IDs de construction spécifiques","Optimisation des flux de distribution vers TestFlight"],"de":["Automatisierung der Abrufung des letzten Builds für iOS-Apps","Untersuchung der Verarbeitungszustände für bestimmte Build-IDs","Optimierung der Verteilungsflüsse zu TestFlight"],"pt":["Automatizar a recuperação da compilação mais recente para aplicativos iOS","Inspecionar estados de processamento para IDs de compilação específicos","Otimizar fluxos de distribuição para TestFlight"],"ru":["Автоматизировать получение последней сборки для приложений iOS","Проверять состояния обработки для определенных идентификаторов сборки","Оптимизировать потоки распространения для TestFlight"],"ar":["توفير استرجاع أحدث بناء للتطبيقات التي تعمل بنظام iOS","فحص حالات المعالجة لأرقام البناء المحددة","تسهيل تدفقات التوزيع إلى تطبيق TestFlight"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ASC CLI installation and configuration","Limited to iOS platform with specified commands"],"zh":["需要安装和配置ASC CLI","仅限iOS平台且仅支持指定命令"],"ja":["ASC CLIのインストールと構成が必要","iOSプラットフォームに限定され、指定されたコマンドのみをサポート"],"ko":["ASC CLI 설치 및 구성이 필요","iOS 플랫폼으로 제한되며, 지정된 명령어만 지원"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de ASC CLI","Limitado a la plataforma iOS con comandos especificados"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de l''ASC CLI","Limité à la plate-forme iOS avec des commandes spécifiées"],"de":["Benötigt Installation und Konfiguration von ASC CLI","Begrenzt auf iOS-Plattform mit spezifizierten Befehlen"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração da ASC CLI","Limitado à plataforma iOS com comandos especificados"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации ASC CLI","Ограничен платформой iOS с указанными командами"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتهيئة ASC CLI","محدود منصة iOS مع أوامر محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('DanielShuguang/tool-box/antfu', 'community', 'DanielShuguang', 'tool-box', 'DanielShuguang/tool-box', 'antfu', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z', '2026-02-18T09:29:12.460Z', NULL, '{"id":"DanielShuguang/tool-box/antfu","name":"antfu","description":{"zh":"Antfu 技术栈涵盖了 Anthony Fu 的首选工具和配置，用于 Web 开发","ja":"Antfu 技術スタックは、Anthony Fu の推奨ツールと設定を網羅した Web 開発向けのソリューションです","ko":"Antfu 기술 스택은 Anthony Fu 의 추천 도구와 설정을 포함한 웹 개발을 위한 솔루션입니다","es":"antfu es una colección de herramientas y configuraciones para el desarrollo web, que incluye pnpm, TypeScript y Vitest","fr":"antfu est un ensemble d''outils et de configurations pour le développement web, comprenant pnpm, TypeScript et Vitest","de":"antfu ist eine Sammlung von Tools und Konfigurationen für die Web-Entwicklung, die pnpm, TypeScript und Vitest umfasst","pt":"Antfu é uma coleção de ferramentas e configurações preferidas de Anthony Fu para desenvolvimento web, incluindo TypeScript e Vitest","ru":"Antfu - это коллекция инструментов и конфигураций, предпочитаемых Anthony Fu для веб-разработки, включая TypeScript и Vitest","ar":"Antfu هو مجموعة من الأدوات وضبط تفضيلات أنتوني فو لتطوير الويب، بما في ذلك TypeScript وVitest","en":"一个小工具箱"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Antfu 技术栈","ja":"Antfu 技術スタック","ko":"Antfu 기술 스택","es":"Herramientas de antfu para desarrolladores web","fr":"Outils de développement web d''antfu","de":"antfu-Tools für Web-Entwickler","pt":"Antfu: Ferramentas de Desenvolvimento Web","ru":"Antfu: Инструменты для веб-разработки","ar":"Antfu: أدوات تطوير الويب","en":"antfu"},"description":{"zh":"Antfu 技术栈涵盖了 Anthony Fu 的首选工具和配置，用于 Web 开发","ja":"Antfu 技術スタックは、Anthony Fu の推奨ツールと設定を網羅した Web 開発向けのソリューションです","ko":"Antfu 기술 스택은 Anthony Fu 의 추천 도구와 설정을 포함한 웹 개발을 위한 솔루션입니다","es":"antfu es una colección de herramientas y configuraciones para el desarrollo web, que incluye pnpm, TypeScript y Vitest","fr":"antfu est un ensemble d''outils et de configurations pour le développement web, comprenant pnpm, TypeScript et Vitest","de":"antfu ist eine Sammlung von Tools und Konfigurationen für die Web-Entwicklung, die pnpm, TypeScript und Vitest umfasst","pt":"Antfu é uma coleção de ferramentas e configurações preferidas de Anthony Fu para desenvolvimento web, incluindo TypeScript e Vitest","ru":"Antfu - это коллекция инструментов и конфигураций, предпочитаемых Anthony Fu для веб-разработки, включая TypeScript и Vitest","ar":"Antfu هو مجموعة من الأدوات وضبط تفضيلات أنتوني فو لتطوير الويب، بما في ذلك TypeScript وVitest","en":"一个小工具箱"},"definition":{"en":"一个小工具箱"},"features":{"zh":["pnpm 包管理器","TypeScript 语法（严格模式）","ESM 模块系统","@antfu/eslint-config 代码风格检查","Vitest 测试框架","simple-git-hooks 和 lint-staged Git Hooks"],"ja":["pnpm パッケージマネージャー","TypeScript 構文（厳格モード）","ESM モジュールシステム","@antfu/eslint-config コードスタイルチェッカー","Vitest テストフレームワーク","simple-git-hooks と lint-staged Git Hooks"],"ko":["pnpm 패키지 매니저","TypeScript 문법（严格 모드）","ESM 모듈 시스템","@antfu/eslint-config 코드 스타일 체커","Vitest 테스트 프레임워크","simple-git-hooks 와 lint-staged Git Hooks"],"es":["Gestor de paquetes pnpm","Lenguaje TypeScript con modo estricto","Sistema de módulos ESM","Linting y formato con @antfu/eslint-config","Pruebas con Vitest","Ganchos de Git con simple-git-hooks y lint-staged"],"fr":["Gestionnaire de paquets pnpm","Langage TypeScript en mode strict","Système de modules ESM","Linting et formatage avec @antfu/eslint-config","Tests avec Vitest","Hooks de Git avec simple-git-hooks et lint-staged"],"de":["Paket-Manager pnpm","Sprache TypeScript im Strict-Modus","Modul-System ESM","Linting und Formatierung mit @antfu/eslint-config","Tests mit Vitest","Git-Hooks mit simple-git-hooks und lint-staged"],"pt":["Gerenciador de pacotes pnpm","Linguagem TypeScript com modo estrito","Sistema de módulos ESM","Testes com Vitest","Git Hooks com simple-git-hooks e lint-staged"],"ru":["Менеджер пакетов pnpm","Язык TypeScript с строгим режимом","Система модулей ESM","Тестирование с Vitest","Git Hooks с simple-git-hooks и lint-staged"],"ar":["مدير الحزم pnpm","لغة TypeScript مع الوضع الصارم","نظام الوحدات ESM","اختبارات مع Vitest","Git Hooks مع simple-git-hooks وlint-staged"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Antfu","Web 开发","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","Git Hooks","代码风格检查"],"ja":["Antfu","Web 開発","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","Git Hooks","コードスタイルチェッカー"],"ko":["Antfu","웹 개발","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","Git Hooks","코드 스타일 체커"],"es":["desarrollo web","herramientas de desarrollo","pnpm","TypeScript","Vitest","ESM","linting","formato","Git Hooks"],"fr":["développement web","outils de développement","pnpm","TypeScript","Vitest","ESM","linting","formatage","hooks de Git"],"de":["Web-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","pnpm","TypeScript","Vitest","ESM","Linting","Formatierung","Git-Hooks"],"pt":["desenvolvimento web","TypeScript","Vitest","pnpm","ESM","Git Hooks","simple-git-hooks","lint-staged"],"ru":["веб-разработка","TypeScript","Vitest","pnpm","ESM","Git Hooks","simple-git-hooks","lint-staged"],"ar":["تطوير الويب","TypeScript","Vitest","pnpm","ESM","Git Hooks","simple-git-hooks","lint-staged"]}},"owner":"DanielShuguang","repo":"tool-box","repoPath":"DanielShuguang/tool-box","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"antfu","description":"Anthony Fus {Opinionated} preferences and best practices for web development","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePres","body":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePress (in `docs/`) |\n\n---\n\n## Core Stack\n\n### Package Manager (pnpm)\n\nUse pnpm as the package manager.\n\nFor monorepo setups, use pnpm workspaces:\n\n```yaml\n# pnpm-workspace.yaml\npackages:\n  - ''packages/*''\n```\n\n\nUse pnpm named catalogs in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` to manage dependency versions:\n\n| Catalog | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `prod` | Production dependencies |\n| `inlined` | Dependencies inlined by bundler |\n| `dev` | Development tools (linter, bundler, testing, dev-server) |\n| `frontend` | Frontend libraries bundled into frontend |\n\nCatalog names are not limited to the above and can be adjusted based on needs. Avoid using default catalog.\n\n#### @antfu/ni\n\nUse `@antfu/ni` for unified package manager commands. It auto-detects the package manager (pnpm/npm/yarn/bun) based on lockfile.\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `ni` | Install dependencies |\n| `ni <pkg>` | Add dependency |\n| `ni -D <pkg>` | Add dev dependency |\n| `nr <script>` | Run script |\n| `nu` | Upgrade dependencies |\n| `nun <pkg>` | Uninstall dependency |\n| `nci` | Clean install (like `pnpm i --frozen-lockfile`) |\n| `nlx <pkg>` | Execute package (like `npx`) |\n\nInstall globally with `pnpm i -g @antfu/ni` if the commands are not found.\n\n### TypeScript (Strict Mode)\n\nAlways use TypeScript with strict mode enabled.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### ESM (ECMAScript Modules)\n\nAlways work in ESM mode. Set `\"type\": \"module\"` in `package.json`.\n\n---\n\n## Code Quality\n\n### ESLint (@antfu/eslint-config)\n\nUse `@antfu/eslint-config` for both formatting and linting. This eliminates the need for Prettier.\n\nCreate `eslint.config.js` with `// @ts-check` comment:\n\n```js\n// @ts-check\nimport antfu from ''@antfu/eslint-config''\n\nexport default antfu()\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"lint\": \"eslint .\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWhen getting linting errors, try to fix them with `nr lint --fix`. Don''t add `lint:fix` script.\n\n### Git Hooks (simple-git-hooks + lint-staged)\n\nUse `simple-git-hooks` with `lint-staged` for pre-commit linting:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"simple-git-hooks\": {\n    \"pre-commit\": \"pnpm i --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts --offline && npx lint-staged\"\n  },\n  \"lint-staged\": {\n    \"*\": \"eslint --fix\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"prepare\": \"npx simple-git-hooks\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Unit Testing (Vitest)\n\nUse Vitest for unit testing.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"vitest\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Conventions:**\n\n- Place test files next to source files: `foo.ts` → `foo.test.ts` (same directory)\n- High-level tests go in `tests/` directory in each package\n- Use `describe` and `it` API (not `test`)\n- Use `expect` API for assertions\n- Use `assert` only for TypeScript null assertions\n- Use `toMatchSnapshot` for complex output assertions\n- Use `toMatchFileSnapshot` with explicit file path and extension for language-specific output (exclude those files from linting)\n\n---\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Publishing (Library Projects)\n\nFor library projects, publish through GitHub Releases triggered by `bumpp`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"release\": \"bumpp -r\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Documentation (VitePress)\n\nUse VitePress for documentation. Place docs under `docs/` directory.\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── .vitepress/\n│   └── config.ts\n├── index.md\n└── guide/\n    └── getting-started.md\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"docs:dev\": \"vitepress dev docs\",\n    \"docs:build\": \"vitepress build docs\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n### Project Setup\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| @antfu/eslint-config | ESLint flat config for formatting and linting | [antfu-eslint-config](references/antfu-eslint-config.md) |\n| GitHub Actions | Preferred workflows using sxzz/workflows | [github-actions](references/github-actions.md) |\n| .gitignore | Preferred .gitignore for JS/TS projects | [gitignore](references/gitignore.md) |\n| VS Code Extensions | Recommended extensions for development | [vscode-extensions](references/vscode-extensions.md) |\n\n### Development\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| App Development | Preferences for Vue/Vite/Nuxt/UnoCSS web applications | [app-development](references/app-development.md) |\n| Library Development | Preferences for bundling and publishing TypeScript libraries | [library-development](references/library-development.md) |\n| Monorepo | pnpm workspaces, centralized alias, Turborepo | [monorepo](references/monorepo.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:29:12.460Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing opinionated configurations with pnpm, TypeScript, and ESM","zh":"非常适合需要使用pnpm、TypeScript和ESM的配置 opinated Web开发代理","ja":"pnpm、TypeScript、ESMの設定opininatedが必要なWeb開発エージェントに最適","ko":"pnpm, TypeScript 및 ESM 구성 opinated가 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan configuraciones con opiniones con pnpm, TypeScript y ESM","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant des configurations avec opinion avec pnpm, TypeScript et ESM","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die opinionierte Konfigurationen mit pnpm, TypeScript und ESM benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de configurações opinativas com pnpm, TypeScript e ESM","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым требуются предопределенные конфигурации с pnpm, TypeScript и ESM","ar":"مثالي لويب Agents التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوينات ذات آراء مع pnpm و TypeScript و ESM"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop web applications with strict TypeScript mode, utilizing @antfu/eslint-config for linting and formatting, and Vitest for testing, all while leveraging the simplicity of simple-git-hooks and lint-staged for Git hooks","zh":"赋予代理开发Web应用程序的能力，使用严格的TypeScript模式，利用@antfu/eslint-config进行linting和格式化，并使用Vitest进行测试，同时利用simple-git-hooks和lint-staged的简单性进行Git hooks","ja":"エージェントが厳格なTypeScriptモードでWebアプリケーションを開発できるようにし、@antfu/eslint-configを使用したlintingとフォーマット、Vitestを使用したテストを行い、simple-git-hooksとlint-stagedのシンプルさを活用したGit hooks","ko":"엄격한 TypeScript 모드를 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 에이전트를赋予하고, @antfu/eslint-config를 사용한 linting 및 formatting, Vitest를 사용한 테스트를 수행하며, simple-git-hooks와 lint-staged의 단순성을 利用한 Git hooks","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones web con el modo estricto de TypeScript, utilizando @antfu/eslint-config para la verificación y el formato, y Vitest para las pruebas, todo mientras aprovecha la simplicidad de simple-git-hooks y lint-staged para ganchos de Git","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications Web avec le mode strict de TypeScript, en utilisant @antfu/eslint-config pour la mise en forme et la vérification, et Vitest pour les tests, le tout en exploitant la simplicité de simple-git-hooks et lint-staged pour les hooks Git","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Webanwendungen mit dem strikten TypeScript-Modus zu entwickeln, indem @antfu/eslint-config für die Überprüfung und Formatierung sowie Vitest für Tests verwendet wird, all dies unter Ausnutzung der Einfachheit von simple-git-hooks und lint-staged für Git-Hooks","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicações web com modo TypeScript rigoroso, utilizando @antfu/eslint-config para linting e formatação, e Vitest para testes, tudo isso aproveitando a simplicidade do simple-git-hooks e lint-staged para hooks do Git","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать веб-приложения в строгом режиме TypeScript, используя @antfu/eslint-config для проверки и форматирования кода, и Vitest для тестирования, все это при помощи простоты simple-git-hooks и lint-staged для хуков Git","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير تطبيقات الويب مع وضع TypeScript الصارم، باستخدام @antfu/eslint-config للتنسيق والتنسيق، وVitest للاختبار، مع الاستفادة من بساطة simple-git-hooks وlint-staged لمصائد Git"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring web projects with pnpm and ESM for modular development","Implementing strict TypeScript mode for enhanced code quality and maintainability","Streamlining development workflows with Vitest and @antfu/eslint-config"],"zh":["使用pnpm和ESM进行模块化开发的Web项目配置","实现严格的TypeScript模式以提高代码质量和可维护性","使用Vitest和@antfu/eslint-config简化开发工作流"],"ja":["pnpmとESMを使用したモジュラー開発のためのWebプロジェクトの構成","厳格なTypeScriptモードを実装してコードの品質とメンテナンス性を高める","Vitestと@antfu/eslint-configを使用して開発ワークフローを簡素化する"],"ko":["pnpm과 ESM를 사용한 모듈화 개발을 위한 웹 프로젝트 구성","엄격한 TypeScript 모드를 구현하여 코드 품질과 유지 보수성을 향상","Vitest와 @antfu/eslint-config를 사용하여 개발 워크플ロー簡素化"],"es":["Configuración de proyectos web con pnpm y ESM para el desarrollo modular","Implementación del modo estricto de TypeScript para una mayor calidad y mantenibilidad del código","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con Vitest y @antfu/eslint-config"],"fr":["Configuration de projets Web avec pnpm et ESM pour le développement modulaire","Mise en œuvre du mode strict de TypeScript pour une qualité et une maintenabilité de code améliorées","Optimisation des flux de travail de développement avec Vitest et @antfu/eslint-config"],"de":["Konfiguration von Webprojekten mit pnpm und ESM für modularen Entwicklung","Implementierung des strikten TypeScript-Modus für eine verbesserte Codequalität und Wartbarkeit","Optimierung von Entwicklungsworkflows mit Vitest und @antfu/eslint-config"],"pt":["Configurando projetos web com pnpm e ESM para desenvolvimento modular","Implementando modo TypeScript rigoroso para melhorar a qualidade e manutenção do código","Otimizando fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com Vitest e @antfu/eslint-config"],"ru":["Настройка веб-проектов с pnpm и ESM для модульной разработки","Реализация строгого режима TypeScript для повышения качества и поддержки кода","Оптимизация рабочих процессов разработки с помощью Vitest и @antfu/eslint-config"],"ar":["تكوين مشاريع الويب مع pnpm و ESM لتطوير مودولار","تنفيذ وضع TypeScript الصارم لتحسين جودة و صيانة الكود","تحسين تدفقات عمل التطوير مع Vitest و @antfu/eslint-config"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pnpm as the package manager","Limited to TypeScript and ESM for development","Dependent on @antfu/eslint-config for linting and formatting"],"zh":["需要pnpm作为包管理器","仅限于TypeScript和ESM进行开发","依赖@antfu/eslint-config进行linting和格式化"],"ja":["pnpmをパッケージマネージャーとして必要","開発はTypeScriptとESMのみ","lintingとフォーマットに@antfu/eslint-configに依存"],"ko":["pnpm을 패키지 관리자로 필요","개발은 TypeScript와 ESM만","@antfu/eslint-config에 의존하여 linting 및 formatting"],"es":["Requiere pnpm como administrador de paquetes","Limitado a TypeScript y ESM para el desarrollo","Dependiente de @antfu/eslint-config para la verificación y el formato"],"fr":["Nécessite pnpm en tant que gestionnaire de paquets","Limité à TypeScript et ESM pour le développement","Dépendant de @antfu/eslint-config pour la vérification et la mise en forme"],"de":["Erfordert pnpm als Paket-Manager","Begrenzt auf TypeScript und ESM für die Entwicklung","Abhängig von @antfu/eslint-config für die Überprüfung und Formatierung"],"pt":["Exige pnpm como gerenciador de pacotes","Limitado a TypeScript e ESM para desenvolvimento","Dependente de @antfu/eslint-config para linting e formatação"],"ru":["Требует pnpm в качестве менеджера пакетов","Ограничен TypeScript и ESM для разработки","Зависит от @antfu/eslint-config для проверки и форматирования кода"],"ar":["يتطلب pnpm كمدير حزم","محدود بالنوع النصي و ESM لتطوير","يعتمد على @antfu/eslint-config للتنسيق والتنسيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
