مع ميزات موسعة","en":"antfu"},"description":{"zh":"antfu 是一个基于 Vitesse 主题的个人网站主题，提供了更多的功能和工具","ja":"antfu は Vitesse テーマをフォークした個人ポートフォリオテーマで、さらに多くの機能とツールを提供します","ko":"antfu는 Vitesse 테마를 포크한 개인 포트폴리오 테마로 더 많은 기능과 도구를 제공합니다","es":"Antfu es un tema de portfolio personal con características extendidas para desarrolladores web, que incluye herramientas como pnpm, TypeScript y Vitest","fr":"Antfu est un thème de portfolio personnel avec des fonctionnalités étendues pour les développeurs web, qui inclut des outils tels que pnpm, TypeScript et Vitest","de":"Antfu ist ein schönes persönliches Portfolio-Thema mit erweiterten Funktionen für Webentwickler, das Tools wie pnpm, TypeScript und Vitest enthält","pt":"Antfu é um tema de portfólio pessoal com recursos avançados, incluindo configurações personalizadas e ferramentas de desenvolvimento web","ru":"Antfu - это красивая тема личного портфолио с расширенными функциями, включая настраиваемые конфигурации и инструменты веб-разработки","ar":"أنتفو هو موضوع محفظة شخصية جميل مع ميزات متقدمة، بما في ذلك ضبطات قابلة للتخصيص وأدوات تطوير الويب","en":"A beautiful personal portfolio theme forked from the Vitesse theme with extended features"},"definition":{"en":"A beautiful personal portfolio theme forked from the Vitesse theme with extended features"},"features":{"zh":["pnpm 包管理","TypeScript(strict mode) 语言支持","ESM 模块系统","@antfu/eslint-config 代码风格检查","Vitest 测试框架","simple-git-hooks + lint-staged Git Hooks"],"ja":["pnpm パッケージマネージャー","TypeScript(strict mode) 言語サポート","ESM モジュールシステム","@antfu/eslint-config コードスタイルチェック","Vitest テストフレームワーク","simple-git-hooks + lint-staged Git Hooks"],"ko":["pnpm 패키지 매니저","TypeScript(strict mode) 언어 지원","ESM 모듈 시스템","@antfu/eslint-config 코드 스타일 체크","Vitest 테스트 프레임워크","simple-git-hooks + lint-staged Git Hooks"],"es":["Gestor de paquetes pnpm","Lenguaje TypeScript en modo estricto","Sistema de módulos ESM","Linting y formato con @antfu/eslint-config","Pruebas con Vitest","Ganchos de Git con simple-git-hooks y lint-staged"],"fr":["Gestionnaire de paquets pnpm","Langage TypeScript en mode strict","Système de modules ESM","Linting et formatage avec @antfu/eslint-config","Tests avec Vitest","Hooks de Git avec simple-git-hooks et lint-staged"],"de":["Paket-Manager pnpm","Sprache TypeScript im Strict-Modus","Modul-System ESM","Linting und Formatierung mit @antfu/eslint-config","Tests mit Vitest","Git-Hooks mit simple-git-hooks und lint-staged"],"pt":["Suporte a pnpm como gerenciador de pacotes","Suporte a TypeScript com modo estrito","Suporte a ESM com \"type\": \"module\"","Integração com @antfu/eslint-config para linting e formatação","Suporte a Vitest para testes","Suporte a simple-git-hooks e lint-staged para hooks de git"],"ru":["Поддержка pnpm в качестве менеджера пакетов","Поддержка TypeScript с строгим режимом","Поддержка ESM с \"type\": \"module\"","Интеграция с @antfu/eslint-config для линтинга и форматирования","Поддержка Vitest для тестирования","Поддержка simple-git-hooks и lint-staged для хуков git"],"ar":["دعم pnpm كمدير حزم","دعم TypeScript مع الوضع الصارم","دعم ESM مع \"type\": \"module\"","التكامل مع @antfu/eslint-config لتحليل وتنسيق الشفرة","دعم Vitest للاختبارات","دعم simple-git-hooks وlint-staged لتحقق git"]},"keywords":{"zh":["antfu","个人网站主题","Vitesse 主题","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","Git Hooks"],"ja":["antfu","個人的なポートフォリオテーマ","Vitesse テーマ","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","Git Hooks"],"ko":["antfu","개인 포트폴리오 테마","Vitesse 테마","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","Git Hooks"],"es":["antfu","portfolio personal","desarrollo web","pnpm","TypeScript","Vitest","ESM","linting","formato"],"fr":["antfu","portfolio personnel","développement web","pnpm","TypeScript","Vitest","ESM","linting","formatage"],"de":["antfu","persönliches Portfolio","Webentwicklung","pnpm","TypeScript","Vitest","ESM","Linting","Formatierung"],"pt":["antfu","tema de portfólio pessoal","desenvolvimento web","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","simple-git-hooks","lint-staged"],"ru":["antfu","тема личного портфолио","веб-разработка","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","simple-git-hooks","lint-staged"],"ar":["أنتفو","موضوع محفظة شخصية","تطوير الويب","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","simple-git-hooks","lint-staged"]}},"owner":"UmmItKin","repo":"ummit.dev","repoPath":"UmmItKin/ummit.dev","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"antfu","description":"Anthony Fus {Opinionated} preferences and best practices for web development","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePres","body":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePress (in `docs/`) |\n\n---\n\n## Core Stack\n\n### Package Manager (pnpm)\n\nUse pnpm as the package manager.\n\nFor monorepo setups, use pnpm workspaces:\n\n```yaml\n# pnpm-workspace.yaml\npackages:\n  - ''packages/*''\n```\n\n\nUse pnpm named catalogs in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` to manage dependency versions:\n\n| Catalog | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `prod` | Production dependencies |\n| `inlined` | Dependencies inlined by bundler |\n| `dev` | Development tools (linter, bundler, testing, dev-server) |\n| `frontend` | Frontend libraries bundled into frontend |\n\nCatalog names are not limited to the above and can be adjusted based on needs. Avoid using default catalog.\n\n#### @antfu/ni\n\nUse `@antfu/ni` for unified package manager commands. It auto-detects the package manager (pnpm/npm/yarn/bun) based on lockfile.\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `ni` | Install dependencies |\n| `ni <pkg>` | Add dependency |\n| `ni -D <pkg>` | Add dev dependency |\n| `nr <script>` | Run script |\n| `nu` | Upgrade dependencies |\n| `nun <pkg>` | Uninstall dependency |\n| `nci` | Clean install (like `pnpm i --frozen-lockfile`) |\n| `nlx <pkg>` | Execute package (like `npx`) |\n\nInstall globally with `pnpm i -g @antfu/ni` if the commands are not found.\n\n### TypeScript (Strict Mode)\n\nAlways use TypeScript with strict mode enabled.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### ESM (ECMAScript Modules)\n\nAlways work in ESM mode. Set `\"type\": \"module\"` in `package.json`.\n\n---\n\n## Code Quality\n\n### ESLint (@antfu/eslint-config)\n\nUse `@antfu/eslint-config` for both formatting and linting. This eliminates the need for Prettier.\n\nCreate `eslint.config.js` with `// @ts-check` comment:\n\n```js\n// @ts-check\nimport antfu from ''@antfu/eslint-config''\n\nexport default antfu()\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"lint\": \"eslint .\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWhen getting linting errors, try to fix them with `nr lint --fix`. Don''t add `lint:fix` script.\n\n### Git Hooks (simple-git-hooks + lint-staged)\n\nUse `simple-git-hooks` with `lint-staged` for pre-commit linting:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"simple-git-hooks\": {\n    \"pre-commit\": \"pnpm i --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts --offline && npx lint-staged\"\n  },\n  \"lint-staged\": {\n    \"*\": \"eslint --fix\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"prepare\": \"npx simple-git-hooks\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Unit Testing (Vitest)\n\nUse Vitest for unit testing.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"vitest\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Conventions:**\n\n- Place test files next to source files: `foo.ts` → `foo.test.ts` (same directory)\n- High-level tests go in `tests/` directory in each package\n- Use `describe` and `it` API (not `test`)\n- Use `expect` API for assertions\n- Use `assert` only for TypeScript null assertions\n- Use `toMatchSnapshot` for complex output assertions\n- Use `toMatchFileSnapshot` with explicit file path and extension for language-specific output (exclude those files from linting)\n\n---\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Publishing (Library Projects)\n\nFor library projects, publish through GitHub Releases triggered by `bumpp`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"release\": \"bumpp -r\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Documentation (VitePress)\n\nUse VitePress for documentation. Place docs under `docs/` directory.\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── .vitepress/\n│   └── config.ts\n├── index.md\n└── guide/\n    └── getting-started.md\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"docs:dev\": \"vitepress dev docs\",\n    \"docs:build\": \"vitepress build docs\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n### Project Setup\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| @antfu/eslint-config | ESLint flat config for formatting and linting | [antfu-eslint-config](references/antfu-eslint-config.md) |\n| GitHub Actions | Preferred workflows using sxzz/workflows | [github-actions](references/github-actions.md) |\n| .gitignore | Preferred .gitignore for JS/TS projects | [gitignore](references/gitignore.md) |\n| VS Code Extensions | Recommended extensions for development | [vscode-extensions](references/vscode-extensions.md) |\n\n### Development\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| App Development | Preferences for Vue/Vite/Nuxt/UnoCSS web applications | [app-development](references/app-development.md) |\n| Library Development | Preferences for bundling and publishing TypeScript libraries | [library-development](references/library-development.md) |\n| Monorepo | pnpm workspaces, centralized alias, Turborepo | [monorepo](references/monorepo.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:29:26.363Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring streamlined web development workflows with pnpm, TypeScript, and ESM","zh":"适用于需要简化 Web 开发工作流的前端代理，支持 pnpm、TypeScript 和 ESM","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがストリームライン化された Web 開発ワークフローを必要とする場合に最適で、pnpm、TypeScript、ESM がサポートされる","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 웹 개발 워크플ロー 최적화를 필요로 할 때 적합하며, pnpm, TypeScript 및 ESM를 지원한다","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren flujos de trabajo de desarrollo web optimizados con pnpm, TypeScript y ESM","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant des flux de travail de développement web rationalisés avec pnpm, TypeScript et ESM","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die optimierte Webentwicklungs-Workflows mit pnpm, TypeScript und ESM benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento web otimizados com pnpm, TypeScript e ESM","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, требующих оптимизированных потоков веб-разработки с pnpm, TypeScript и ESM","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم التي تتطلب تدفقات عمل تطوير الويب المُبسطة مع pnpm، TypeScript، و ESM"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Anthony Fu''s preferred configurations, including @antfu/eslint-config for linting and Vitest for testing, while utilizing VitePres for documentation and simple-git-hooks for Git workflow automation","zh":"赋予代理使用 Anthony Fu 推荐的配置，包括 @antfu/eslint-config 进行 linting 和 Vitest 进行测试，同时利用 VitePres 进行文档和 simple-git-hooks 进行 Git 工作流自动化","ja":"Anthony Fu が推奨する構成をエージェントが利用できるようにし、@antfu/eslint-config を使用した linting と Vitest を使用したテストを行い、VitePres を使用したドキュメントと simple-git-hooks を使用した Git ワークフローの自動化を活用する","ko":"에이전트가 안소니 푸가 추천하는 설정을 사용할 수 있도록 해주며, @antfu/eslint-config를 사용한 린팅과 Vitest를 사용한 테스트를 진행하고, VitePres를 사용한 문서화와 simple-git-hooks를 사용한 Git 워크플로 자동화를 활용한다","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar las configuraciones preferidas de Anthony Fu, incluyendo @antfu/eslint-config para la verificación y Vitest para las pruebas, mientras utiliza VitePres para la documentación y simple-git-hooks para la automatización del flujo de trabajo de Git","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti des configurations préférées d''Anthony Fu, y compris @antfu/eslint-config pour le linting et Vitest pour les tests, tout en utilisant VitePres pour la documentation et simple-git-hooks pour l''automatisation du flux de travail Git","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die bevorzugten Konfigurationen von Anthony Fu zu nutzen, einschließlich @antfu/eslint-config für die Überprüfung und Vitest für die Tests, während VitePres für die Dokumentation und simple-git-hooks für die Automatisierung des Git-Workflows verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem as configurações preferidas de Anthony Fu, incluindo @antfu/eslint-config para verificação e Vitest para teste, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza VitePres para documentação e simple-git-hooks para automação de fluxo de trabalho do Git","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать предпочитаемые конфигурации Энтони Фу, включая @antfu/eslint-config для проверки и Vitest для тестирования, а также использовать VitePres для документации и simple-git-hooks для автоматизации рабочего процесса Git","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من الاستفادة من التكوينات المفضلة لأنثوني فو، بما في ذلك @antfu/eslint-config للتحقق وVitest للاختبار، في نفس الوقت الذي يستخدم فيه VitePres للتوثيق و simple-git-hooks لتحسين سير عمل جيت"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring web projects with pnpm and TypeScript strict mode","Implementing ESM module system for efficient code organization","Streamlining code quality with @antfu/eslint-config and Vitest"],"zh":["使用 pnpm 和 TypeScript 严格模式配置 Web 项目","实现 ESM 模块系统以实现高效的代码组织","使用 @antfu/eslint-config 和 Vitest 进行代码质量优化"],"ja":["pnpm と TypeScript 厳格モードを使用した Web プロジェクトの構成","ESM モジュールシステムの実装による効率的なコード組織","@antfu/eslint-config と Vitest を使用したコード品質の向上"],"ko":["pnpm과 TypeScript 엄격 모드를 사용한 웹 프로젝트 구성","ESM 모듈 시스템을 구현하여 효율적인 코드 조직화를 달성","@antfu/eslint-config와 Vitest를 사용한 코드 품질 최적화"],"es":["Configuración de proyectos web con pnpm y modo estricto de TypeScript","Implementación del sistema de módulos ESM para una organización de código eficiente","Optimización de la calidad del código con @antfu/eslint-config y Vitest"],"fr":["Configuration de projets web avec pnpm et mode strict de TypeScript","Mise en œuvre du système de modules ESM pour une organisation de code efficace","Optimisation de la qualité du code avec @antfu/eslint-config et Vitest"],"de":["Konfiguration von Webprojekten mit pnpm und TypeScript-Strict-Modus","Implementierung des ESM-Modulsystems für eine effiziente Codeorganisation","Optimierung der Codequalität mit @antfu/eslint-config und Vitest"],"pt":["Configurando projetos web com pnpm e modo estrito do TypeScript","Implementando sistema de módulos ESM para organização de código eficiente","Otimizando a qualidade do código com @antfu/eslint-config e Vitest"],"ru":["Настройка веб-проектов с pnpm и строгим режимом TypeScript","Реализация системы модулей ESM для эффективной организации кода","Оптимизация качества кода с помощью @antfu/eslint-config и Vitest"],"ar":["تكوين مشاريع الويب مع pnpm ووضع صارم من TypeScript","تنفيذ نظام الوحدات ESM لتنظيم الكود بكفاءة","تحسين جودة الكود باستخدام @antfu/eslint-config وVitest"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pnpm installation","TypeScript strict mode may enforce stricter coding standards","ESM module system compatibility issues with older browsers or environments"],"zh":["需要 pnpm 安装","TypeScript 严格模式可能会强制执行更严格的编码标准","ESM 模块系统与旧浏览器或环境的兼容性问题"],"ja":["pnpm のインストールが必要","TypeScript 厳格モードはより厳格なコーディング規約を強制する可能性がある","ESM モジュールシステムと古いブラウザまたは環境の互換性の問題"],"ko":["pnpm 설치가 필요","TypeScript 엄격 모드에서는 더 엄격한 코딩 표준을 강제할 수 있다","ESM 모듈 시스템과 구형 브라우저 또는 환경의 호환성 문제"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de pnpm","El modo estricto de TypeScript puede aplicar normas de codificación más estrictas","Problemas de compatibilidad del sistema de módulos ESM con navegadores o entornos más antiguos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pnpm","Le mode strict de TypeScript peut appliquer des normes de codage plus strictes","Problèmes de compatibilité du système de modules ESM avec les anciens navigateurs ou environnements"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von pnpm","Der TypeScript-Strict-Modus kann strengere Kodierungsstandards durchsetzen","Kompatibilitätsprobleme des ESM-Modulsystems mit älteren Browsern oder Umgebungen"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do pnpm","O modo estrito do TypeScript pode impor normas de codificação mais rigorosas","Problemas de compatibilidade do sistema de módulos ESM com navegadores ou ambientes mais antigos"],"ru":["Требует установки pnpm","Строгий режим TypeScript может навязать более строгие стандарты кодирования","Проблемы совместимости системы модулей ESM со старыми браузерами или средами"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت pnpm","يمكن أن يفرض وضع صارم من TypeScript معايير ترميز أكثر صرامة","مشاكل في التوافق بين نظام الوحدات ESM والمتصفحات أو البيئات القديمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
