caching","Validating route parameters using Zod for enhanced type safety"],"zh":["实现路由级数据加载以优化性能","集成TanStack Query实现无缝数据获取和缓存","使用Zod验证路由参数以增强类型安全性"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの最適化のためにルートレベルのデータロードを実装する","TanStack Queryを統合してシームレスなデータ取得とキャッシングを行う","Zod検証を使用してルートパラメータを検証し、タイプセーフティを強化する"],"ko":["성능을 최적화하기 위해 라우트 수준의 데이터 로딩을 구현하는 것","TanStack Query를 통합하여 무결점 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱을 수행하는 것","Zod 검증을 사용하여 라우트 매개 변수를 검증하고 타입 안전성을增强하는 것"],"es":["Implementar carga de datos a nivel de ruta para un rendimiento optimizado","Integrar TanStack Query para una extracción y almacenamiento en caché de datos sin problemas","Validar parámetros de ruta utilizando Zod para una mayor seguridad de tipos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre un chargement de données au niveau de la route pour un rendement optimisé","Intégrer TanStack Query pour une récupération et un stockage en cache de données sans problème","Valider les paramètres de route à l''aide de Zod pour une sécurité de type améliorée"],"de":["Implementierung der Datenladefunktion auf Routenebene für optimale Leistung","Integration von TanStack Query für eine nahtlose Datenabfrage und Zwischenspeicherung","Validierung von Routenparametern mit Zod für eine verbesserte Typsicherheit"],"pt":["Implementing route-level data loading for optimized performance","Integrating TanStack Query for seamless data fetching and caching","Validating route parameters using Zod for enhanced type safety"],"ru":["Implementing route-level data loading for optimized performance","Integrating TanStack Query for seamless data fetching and caching","Validating route parameters using Zod for enhanced type safety"],"ar":["Implementing route-level data loading for optimized performance","Integrating TanStack Query for seamless data fetching and caching","Validating route parameters using Zod for enhanced type safety"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React environment","Dependent on @tanstack/react-router and @tanstack/router-devtools libraries","Optional Zod validation adapter requires additional installation"],"zh":["需要React环境","依赖@tanstack/react-router和@tanstack/router-devtools库","可选的Zod验证适配器需要额外安装"],"ja":["React環境が必要","@tanstack/react-routerと@tanstack/router-devtoolsライブラリに依存する","オプションのZod検証アダプターには追加のインストールが必要"],"ko":["React 환경이 필요합니다","@tanstack/react-router 및 @tanstack/router-devtools 라이브러리에 의존합니다","선택적 Zod 검증 어댑터는 추가 설치가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno de React","Dependiente de las bibliotecas @tanstack/react-router y @tanstack/router-devtools","El adaptador de validación opcional Zod requiere una instalación adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React","Dépend des bibliothèques @tanstack/react-router et @tanstack/router-devtools","L''adaptateur de validation optionnel Zod nécessite une installation supplémentaire"],"de":["Benötigt eine React-Umgebung","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken @tanstack/react-router und @tanstack/router-devtools","Der optionale Zod-Validierungsadapter erfordert eine zusätzliche Installation"],"pt":["Requires React environment","Dependent on @tanstack/react-router and @tanstack/router-devtools libraries","Optional Zod validation adapter requires additional installation"],"ru":["Requires React environment","Dependent on @tanstack/react-router and @tanstack/router-devtools libraries","Optional Zod validation adapter requires additional installation"],"ar":["Requires React environment","Dependent on @tanstack/react-router and @tanstack/router-devtools libraries","Optional Zod validation adapter requires additional installation"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
