ching task outputs to improve development efficiency","Running tasks in parallel to enhance code execution performance"],"zh":["为JavaScript/TypeScript单体仓库自动化构建过程","缓存任务输出以提高开发效率","并行运行任务以增强代码执行性能"],"ja":["JavaScript/TypeScriptモノレポのビルドプロセスを自動化する","タスク出力をキャッシュして開発効率を向上させる","依存関係グラフに基づいてタスクを並列で実行してコードの実行性能を向上させる"],"ko":["JavaScript/TypeScript 모노리포의 빌드 프로세스를 자동화하는 것","태스크 출력을 캐시하여 개발 효율성을 높이는 것","의존성 그래프를 기반으로 태스크를 병렬로 실행하여 코드 실행 성능을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Automatización de procesos de compilación para monorepos de JavaScript/TypeScript","Almacenamiento en caché de salidas de tareas para mejorar la eficiencia del desarrollo","Ejecución de tareas en paralelo para mejorar el rendimiento de la ejecución del código"],"fr":["Automatisation des processus de construction pour les monorepos JavaScript/TypeScript","Mise en cache des sorties de tâche pour améliorer l''efficacité du développement","Exécution de tâches en parallèle pour améliorer les performances d''exécution du code"],"de":["Automatisierung von Build-Prozessen für JavaScript/TypeScript-Monorepos","Cachen von Task-Ausgaben zur Verbesserung der Entwicklungseffizienz","Ausführen von Tasks parallel zur Verbesserung der Code-Ausführungsleistung"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de compilação para monorepos JavaScript/TypeScript","Armazenar em cache as saídas das tarefas para melhorar a eficiência do desenvolvimento","Executar tarefas em paralelo para melhorar o desempenho da execução do código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процессы сборки для монорепозиториев JavaScript/TypeScript","Кэшировать выходные данные задач для повышения эффективности разработки","Выполнять задачи параллельно для повышения производительности выполнения кода"],"ar":["تحسين عمليات البناء التلقائي لمشاريع مونوربو JavaScript/TypeScript","تخزين مخرجات المهام في ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت لتحسين كفاءة التطوير","تشغيل المهام بالتوازي لتحسين أداء تشغيل الرموز"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires proper configuration of turbo.json and package.json files","Must create package tasks, not root tasks","Limited to JavaScript/TypeScript ecosystems"],"zh":["需要正确配置turbo.json和package.json文件","必须创建包任务，而不是根任务","仅限于JavaScript/TypeScript生态系统"],"ja":["turbo.jsonとpackage.jsonファイルを正しく構成する必要がある","パッケージタスクを作成する必要があり、ルートタスクではない","JavaScript/TypeScriptエコシステムのみに限定される"],"ko":["터보.json 및 패키지.json 파일을 올바르게 구성해야 함","루트 태스크가 아닌 패키지 태스크를 생성해야 함","JavaScript/TypeScript 에코시스템에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una configuración adecuada de los archivos turbo.json y package.json","Deben crearse tareas de paquete, no tareas de raíz","Limitado a los ecosistemas de JavaScript/TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration appropriée des fichiers turbo.json et package.json","Des tâches de package doivent être créées, et non des tâches de racine","Limité aux écosystèmes JavaScript/TypeScript"],"de":["Erfordert eine ordnungsgemäße Konfiguration der Dateien turbo.json und package.json","Paket-Tasks müssen erstellt werden, nicht Root-Tasks","Begrenzt auf JavaScript/TypeScript-Ökosysteme"],"pt":["Exige configuração adequada dos arquivos turbo.json e package.json","Deve criar tarefas de pacote, não tarefas de raiz","Limitado aos ecossistemas JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует правильной настройки файлов turbo.json и package.json","Должно создавать задачи пакета, а не задачи корня","Ограничен экосистемами JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب ضبط ملفات turbo.json و package.json بشكل صحيح","يجب إنشاء مهام حزمة، وليس مهام الجذر","محدود بنطاق النظام البيئي JavaScript/TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Clecio013/lumes/popup-cro', 'community', 'Clecio013', 'lumes', 'Clecio013/lumes', 'popup-cro', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z', '2026-02-18T09:31:31.051Z', NULL, '{"id":"Clecio013/lumes/popup-cro","name":"popup-cro","description":{"zh":"弹出窗口CRO优化是提高转化率和用户体验的关键。了解弹出窗口的目的和最佳实践","ja":"ポップアップCRO最適化はコンバージョン率とユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる鍵です。ポップアップの目的とベストプラクティスを学びましょう","ko":"팝업 CRO 최적화는 전환율과 사용자 경험을 높이는 핵심입니다. 팝업의 목적과 최적화 방법을 알아보세요","es":"El popup CRO es una técnica para optimizar los popups y mejorar la experiencia del usuario. Aprende a crear popups efectivos.","fr":"Le popup CRO est une technique pour optimiser les popups et améliorer l''expérience utilisateur. Découvrez comment créer des popups efficaces.","de":"Das Popup-CRO ist eine Technik, um Popups zu optimieren und die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Popups erstellen.","pt":"O popup-cro é uma habilidade que visa criar popups que convertem sem danificar a percepção da marca.","ru":"Попап CRO - это навык, целью которого является создание попапов, которые конвертируют без нанесения ущерба восприятию бренда.","ar":"팝업 CRO는 브랜드 인식에 손상을 주지 않고 팝업을 생성하는 데 중점을 둔 기술입니다.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"弹出窗口CRO优化专家","ja":"ポップアップCRO最適化","ko":"팝업 CRO 최적화 전문가","es":"Optimización de popups para CRO","fr":"Optimisation des popups pour CRO","de":"Popup-Optimierung für CRO","pt":"Otimização de Popups para CRO","ru":"Попап CRO: оптимизация для конверсии","ar":"تحسين 팝업 لتحويل","en":"popup-cro"},"description":{"zh":"弹出窗口CRO优化是提高转化率和用户体验的关键。了解弹出窗口的目的和最佳实践","ja":"ポップアップCRO最適化はコンバージョン率とユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる鍵です。ポップアップの目的とベストプラクティスを学びましょう","ko":"팝업 CRO 최적화는 전환율과 사용자 경험을 높이는 핵심입니다. 팝업의 목적과 최적화 방법을 알아보세요","es":"El popup CRO es una técnica para optimizar los popups y mejorar la experiencia del usuario. Aprende a crear popups efectivos.","fr":"Le popup CRO est une technique pour optimiser les popups et améliorer l''expérience utilisateur. Découvrez comment créer des popups efficaces.","de":"Das Popup-CRO ist eine Technik, um Popups zu optimieren und die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Popups erstellen.","pt":"O popup-cro é uma habilidade que visa criar popups que convertem sem danificar a percepção da marca.","ru":"Попап CRO - это навык, целью которого является создание попапов, которые конвертируют без нанесения ущерба восприятию бренда.","ar":"팝업 CRO는 브랜드 인식에 손상을 주지 않고 팝업을 생성하는 데 중점을 둔 기술입니다.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["弹出窗口设计优化","内容策略制定","转化率提高","用户体验优化","品牌知名度提升"],"ja":["ポップアップデザイン最適化","コンテンツ戦略の立案","コンバージョン率の向上","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化","ブランド認知度の向上"],"ko":["팝업 디자인 최적화","콘텐츠 전략 수립","전환율 향상","사용자 경험 최적화","브랜드 인지도 향상"],"es":["Optimización de popups para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","Creación de popups que conviertan sin molestar a los usuarios","Mejora de la tasa de conversión","Análisis de la efectividad de los popups","Personalización de los popups para diferentes segmentos de usuarios"],"fr":["Optimisation des popups pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","Création de popups qui convertissent sans agacer les utilisateurs","Amélioration du taux de conversion","Analyse de l''efficacité des popups","Personnalisation des popups pour différents segments d''utilisateurs"],"de":["Optimierung von Popups, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern","Erstellung von Popups, die konvertieren, ohne die Benutzer zu stören","Verbesserung der Konversionsrate","Analyse der Effektivität von Popups","Anpassung von Popups an verschiedene Benutzertypen"],"pt":["Otimização de popups para conversão","Criação de popups personalizados","Análise de desempenho de popups","Otimização para dispositivos móveis","Integração com marketing de produto"],"ru":["Оптимизация попапов для конверсии","Создание индивидуальных попапов","Анализ производительности попапов","Оптимизация для мобильных устройств","Интеграция с маркетингом продукта"],"ar":["تحسين 팝업ات لتحويل","إنشاء 팝업ات مخصصة","تحليل أداء 팝업ات","تحسين للهواتف المحمولة","التكامل مع تسويق المنتج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["弹出窗口CRO优化","转化率提高","用户体验优化","弹出窗口设计","内容策略","品牌知名度提升"],"ja":["ポップアップCRO最適化","コンバージョン率の向上","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化","ポップアップデザイン","コンテンツ戦略","ブランド認知度の向上"],"ko":["팝업 CRO 최적화","전환율 향상","사용자 경험 최적화","팝업 디자인","콘텐츠 전략","브랜드 인지도 향상"],"es":["popup CRO","optimización de popups","experiencia del usuario","conversión","marketing digital","popups efectivos"],"fr":["popup CRO","optimisation des popups","expérience utilisateur","conversion","marketing digital","popups efficaces"],"de":["Popup-CRO","Optimierung von Popups","Benutzererfahrung","Konversion","digitales Marketing","effektive Popups"],"pt":["popup cro","otimização de popups","conversão de popups","marketing de produto","análise de desempenho","otimização para dispositivos móveis"],"ru":["попап cro","оптимизация попапов","конверсия попапов","маркетинг продукта","анализ производительности","оптимизация для мобильных устройств"],"ar":["팝업 cro","تحسين 팝업ات","تحويل 팝업ات","تسويق المنتج","تحليل الأداء","تحسين للهواتف المحمولة"]}},"owner":"Clecio013","repo":"lumes","repoPath":"Clecio013/lumes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:31:31.051Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO) Agents needing advanced popup and modal optimization strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要高级弹出窗口和模态优化策略的转化率优化（CRO）代理。","ja":"高度なポップアップとモーダル最適化戦略を必要とする転換率最適化（CRO）エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 팝업 및 모달 최적화 전략이 필요한 전환율 최적화(CRO) 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Optimización de Tasa de Conversión (CRO) que necesitan estrategias avanzadas de optimización de ventanas emergentes y modales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''Optimisation du Taux de Conversion (CRO) ayant besoin de stratégies avancées d''optimisation des fenêtres contextuelles et modales.","de":"Perfekt für CRO-Agents (Optimierung der Konvertierungsrate), die erweiterte Strategien für die Optimierung von Popups und Modals benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Taxa de Conversão (CRO) que necessitam de estratégias avançadas de otimização de popups e modais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации коэффициента конверсии (CRO), которым необходимы продвинутые стратегии оптимизации всплывающих окон и модальных окон.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحسين معدل التحويل (CRO) التي تحتاج إلى استراتيجيات متقدمة لتحسين النوافذ المنبثقة والنمطية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-converting popups using context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, optimizing for email/newsletter capture without damaging brand perception, and leveraging popup purpose analysis for targeted user engagement.","zh":"赋予代理创建高转化率的弹出窗口的能力，利用 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 中的上下文，优化电子邮件/新闻稿捕获而不损害品牌认知，并利用弹出窗口目的分析进行有针对性的用户参与。","ja":"`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` のコンテキストを使用して、高転換率のポップアップを作成するエージェントを可能にし、電子メール/ニュースレターのキャプチャを最適化し、ブランド認知を損なわずに、ターゲットユーザー参与のためのポップアップ目的分析を利用します。","ko":"`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`의 contexto를 사용하여 높은 전환률의 팝업을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 이메일/뉴스레ター 캡처를 최적화하고 브랜드 인지도를 손상하지 않으면서 목표 사용자 참여를 위한 팝업 목적 분석을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ventanas emergentes de alta conversión utilizando el contexto de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, optimizando para la captura de correos electrónicos y boletines sin dañar la percepción de la marca, y aprovechando el análisis del propósito de las ventanas emergentes para un compromiso de usuario dirigido.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fenêtres contextuelles à forte conversion en utilisant le contexte de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, en optimisant pour la capture d''adresses e-mail et de newsletters sans endommager la perception de la marque, et en exploitant l''analyse de l''objectif des fenêtres contextuelles pour un engagement ciblé des utilisateurs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Popups mit hoher Konvertierungsrate zu erstellen, indem sie den Kontext von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` nutzen, die E-Mail- und Newsletter-Erfassung optimieren, ohne die Markenwahrnehmung zu beeinträchtigen, und die Analyse des Popup-Zwecks für gezielte Benutzerbindung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar popups de alta conversão usando o contexto de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, otimizando para captura de e-mail/informativo sem danificar a percepção da marca e aproveitando a análise de propósito de popup para engajamento de usuário direcionado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокоэффективные всплывающие окна с использованием контекста из `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, оптимизируя для сбора электронной почты/новостей без ущерба для восприятия бренда и используя анализ цели всплывающего окна для целевого взаимодействия с пользователями.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة ذات تحويل عالٍ باستخدام السياق من `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`، وتحسينها لالتقاط البريد الإلكتروني/النشرة الإخبارية دون الإضرار باصطفاف العلامة التجارية، وتوظيف تحليل غرض النافذة المنبثقة للتفاعل المستهدف للمستخدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing popup placement for maximum conversion","Generating targeted popup content based on product marketing context","Analyzing popup purpose for effective email/newsletter capture"],"zh":["优化弹出窗口位置以实现最大转化","根据产品营销上下文生成有针对性的弹出窗口内容","分析弹出窗口目的以实现有效的电子邮件/新闻稿捕获"],"ja":["最大転換率を実現するためのポップアップ配置の最適化","製品マーケティングコンテキストに基づいてターゲットを絞ったポップアップコンテンツを生成する","電子メール/ニュースレターのキャプチャを効果的に実現するためのポップアップ目的の分析"],"ko":["최대 전환률을 달성하기 위한 팝업 배치 최적화","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트에 기초하여 목표를 좁힌 팝업 컨텐츠 생성","이메일/뉴스레ター 캡처를 효과적으로 달성하기 위한 팝업 목적 분석"],"es":["Optimizar la colocación de ventanas emergentes para una máxima conversión","Generar contenido de ventanas emergentes dirigido en función del contexto de marketing de productos","Analizar el propósito de las ventanas emergentes para una captura efectiva de correos electrónicos y boletines"],"fr":["Optimiser le positionnement des fenêtres contextuelles pour une conversion maximale","Générer du contenu de fenêtres contextuelles ciblé en fonction du contexte de marketing de produits","Analyser l''objectif des fenêtres contextuelles pour une capture efficace d''adresses e-mail et de newsletters"],"de":["Optimierung der Platzierung von Popups für eine maximale Konvertierung","Erzeugen von zielgerichtetem Popup-Inhalt auf der Grundlage des Produktmarketing-Kontexts","Analyse des Popup-Zwecks für eine effektive E-Mail- und Newsletter-Erfassung"],"pt":["Otimizando a colocação de popups para conversão máxima","Gerando conteúdo de popup direcionado com base no contexto de marketing de produtos","Analisando o propósito de popup para captura eficaz de e-mail/informativo"],"ru":["Оптимизация размещения всплывающих окон для максимальной конверсии","Генерация целевого контента всплывающих окон на основе контекста маркетинга продукта","Анализ цели всплывающего окна для эффективной сборки электронной почты/новостей"],"ar":["تحسين وضع النافذة المنبثقة لتحقيق أقصى تحويل","توليد محتوى نافذة منبثقة مستهدف بناءً على سياق تسويق المنتج","تحليل目的 النافذة المنبثقة للالتقاط الفعال للبريد الإلكتروني/النشرة الإخبارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existence of `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for context","Focuses on popup and modal optimization only"],"zh":["需要 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 的存在以获取上下文","仅关注弹出窗口和模态优化"],"ja":["コンテキストを取得するために `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` の存在が必要","ポップアップとモーダルの最適化のみに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["컨텍스트를 얻기 위해 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`의 존재가 필요","팝업 및 모달 최적화에만 초점을 맞추고 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere la existencia de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para el contexto","Se centra solo en la optimización de ventanas emergentes y modales"],"fr":["Nécessite l''existence de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour le contexte","Se concentre uniquement sur l''optimisation des fenêtres contextuelles et modales"],"de":["Erfordert die Existenz von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für den Kontext","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf die Optimierung von Popups und Modals"],"pt":["Exige a existência de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto","Concentra-se apenas na otimização de popups e modais"],"ru":["Требует существования `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для контекста","Фокусируется только на оптимизации всплывающих окон и модальных окон"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` للسياق","يركز فقط على تحسين النوافذ المنبثقة والنمطية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
