ara melhorar a taxa de conversão","Criação de popups personalizados para atender às necessidades do usuário","Análise de desempenho de popups para identificar áreas de melhoria","Implementação de estratégias de popup para aumentar a engajamento do usuário","Otimização de popups para dispositivos móveis e desktop"],"ru":["Оптимизация попапов для улучшения коэффициента конверсии","Создание индивидуальных попапов для удовлетворения потребностей пользователей","Анализ производительности попапов для выявления областей улучшения","Реализация стратегий попапов для увеличения вовлеченности пользователей","Оптимизация попапов для мобильных и настольных устройств"],"ar":["تحسين نوافذ منبثقة لتحسين معدل التحويل","إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة مخصصة لتلبي احتياجات المستخدم","تحليل أداء نوافذ منبثقة لتحديد المجالات التي يمكن تحسينها","تنفيذ استراتيجيات نوافذ منبثقة لزيادة مشاركة المستخدم","تحسين نوافذ منبثقة للأجهزة المحمولة وأجهزة المكتب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["弹出窗口CRO","转化率优化","用户体验优化","品牌形象保护","电子邮件营销","新闻稿营销"],"ja":["ポップアップCRO","コンバージョン率最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンス最適化","ブランドイメージ保護","メールマーケティング","ニュースレターマーケティング"],"ko":["팝업 CRO","전환률 최적화","사용자 경험 최적화","브랜드 이미지 보호","이메일 마케팅","뉴스레터 마케팅"],"es":["popup CRO","optimización de popups","mejora de la conversión","experiencia del usuario","tasas de conversión","marketing digital","publicidad en línea"],"fr":["popup CRO","optimisation des popups","amélioration de la conversion","expérience utilisateur","taux de conversion","marketing digital","publicité en ligne"],"de":["Popup-CRO","Optimierung von Popups","Verbesserung der Konvertierung","Benutzererfahrung","Konvertierungsraten","digitales Marketing","Online-Werbung"],"pt":["popup cro","otimização de popups","conversão de popups","experiência do usuário","percepção da marca","desenvolvimento web","marketing digital"],"ru":["попап cro","оптимизация попапов","конверсия попапов","пользовательский опыт","восприятие бренда","веб-разработка","цифровой маркетинг"],"ar":["تحويل 팝업","تحسين نوافذ منبثقة","تحويل نوافذ منبثقة","تجربة المستخدم","إدراك العلامة التجارية","تطوير الويب","تسويق رقمي"]}},"owner":"mateocostab","repo":"roi-calculator","repoPath":"mateocostab/roi-calculator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:31:41.025Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced popup and modal optimization techniques to boost conversion rates without compromising user experience.","zh":"非常适合需要高级弹出窗口和模态优化技术的营销代理，以提高转化率而不损害用户体验。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度なポップアップとモーダル最適化技術を使用してコンバージョン率を向上させるときに最適です。","ko":"고급 팝업 및 모달 최적화 기술을 사용하여 전환率을 높이고 사용자 경험을 손상하지 않는 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan técnicas avanzadas de optimización de ventanas emergentes y modales para aumentar las tasas de conversión sin comprometer la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing qui ont besoin de techniques avancées d''optimisation des fenêtres contextuelles et des modaux pour augmenter les taux de conversion sans compromettre l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für Marketingagenten, die erweiterte Techniken zur Optimierung von Popups und Modals benötigen, um die Konversionsraten zu steigern, ohne die Benutzererfahrung zu beeinträchtigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de técnicas avançadas de otimização de popups e modais para aumentar as taxas de conversão sem comprometer a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые методы оптимизации всплывающих окон и модальных окон для увеличения коэффициентов конверсии без ухудшения пользовательского опыта.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين أداء النوافذ المنبثقة والمدخلات لتعزيز معدلات التحويل دون المساس بتجربة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create targeted popups for email/newsletter capture, leveraging product marketing context to optimize modal designs and improve brand perception, all while avoiding user annoyance through strategic placement and timing, utilizing context from files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","zh":"赋予代理创建针对电子邮件/新闻稿采集的定向弹出窗口的能力，利用产品营销背景优化模态设计并提高品牌知名度，同时通过战略性放置和时机避免用户烦恼，利用文件如 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 中的背景信息。","ja":"エージェントがメール/ニュースレターの収集のためのターゲットポップアップを作成する機能を提供し、製品マーケティングのコンテキストを利用してモーダルのデザインを最適化し、ブランド認知度を向上させ、戦略的な配置とタイミングを使用してユーザーの苛立を避け、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` のようなファイルからのコンテキストを利用します。","ko":"이메일/뉴스레터 수집을 위한 타겟팅 팝업을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하고, 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하여 모달 디자인을 최적화하고 브랜드 인식을 향상시키며, 전략적인 배치와 타이밍을 사용하여 사용자의 불편을 피하고, `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일의 컨텍스트를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ventanas emergentes dirigidas para la captura de correos electrónicos y boletines, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos para optimizar los diseños de modales y mejorar la percepción de la marca, todo ello evitando la molestia del usuario a través de una colocación y temporización estratégicas, utilizando el contexto de archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","fr":"Habilite les agents à créer des fenêtres contextuelles ciblées pour la capture d''e-mails et de newsletters, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits pour optimiser les conceptions de modaux et améliorer la perception de la marque, le tout en évitant les annoyances des utilisateurs grâce à une placement et une temporisation stratégiques, en utilisant le contexte de fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gezielte Popups für die Erfassung von E-Mails und Newslettern zu erstellen, den Kontext des Produktmarketings nutzend, um Modaldesigns zu optimieren und die Markenwahrnehmung zu verbessern, all dies, während die Vermeidung von Benutzerärgernissen durch strategische Platzierung und Zeitplanung sichergestellt wird, unter Nutzung des Kontexts von Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar popups direcionados para captura de e-mails/boletins, aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produtos para otimizar os designs de modais e melhorar a percepção da marca, tudo isso evitando o incômodo do usuário por meio de posicionamento e temporização estratégicos, utilizando contexto de arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать целевые всплывающие окна для захвата электронной почты/новостей, используя контекст продуктивного маркетинга для оптимизации модальных дизайнов и улучшения восприятия бренда, все это избегая раздражения пользователя посредством стратегического размещения и тайминга, используя контекст из файлов типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة موجهة لالتقاط البريد الإلكتروني/النشرة الإخبارية، مستفيدة من سياق تسويق المنتج لتحسين تصميمات المدخلات وتحسين تصور العلامة التجارية، كل ذلك مع تجنب إزعاج المستخدم من خلال وضع واستخدام استراتيجي، باستخدام السياق من الملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing popup placement for maximum conversion","Designing modals that enhance brand perception","Automating popup content based on product marketing context"],"zh":["优化弹出窗口放置以实现最大转化率","设计增强品牌知名度的模态","根据产品营销背景自动化弹出窗口内容"],"ja":["コンバージョン率の最大化のためのポップアップの配置を最適化する","ブランド認知度を高めるモーダルを設計する","製品マーケティングのコンテキストに基づいてポップアップのコンテンツを自動化する"],"ko":["최대 전환율을实现하기 위한 팝업 배치 최적화","브랜드 인식을 향상시키는 모달 디자인","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트에 따라 팝업 콘텐츠 자동화"],"es":["Optimización del posicionamiento de ventanas emergentes para una máxima conversión","Diseño de modales que mejoran la percepción de la marca","Automatización del contenido de ventanas emergentes en función del contexto de marketing de productos"],"fr":["Optimisation du positionnement des fenêtres contextuelles pour une conversion maximale","Conception de modaux qui améliorent la perception de la marque","Automatisation du contenu des fenêtres contextuelles en fonction du contexte de marketing de produits"],"de":["Optimierung der Platzierung von Popups für eine maximale Konversion","Entwurf von Modals, die die Markenwahrnehmung verbessern","Automatisierung des Popup-Inhalts basierend auf dem Produktmarketing-Kontext"],"pt":["Otimização do posicionamento de popups para conversão máxima","Desenvolvimento de modais que melhorem a percepção da marca","Automatização do conteúdo de popups com base no contexto de marketing de produtos"],"ru":["Оптимизация размещения всплывающих окон для максимальной конверсии","Разработка модальных окон, повышающих восприятие бренда","Автоматизация содержания всплывающих окон на основе контекста продуктивного маркетинга"],"ar":["تحسين وضع النوافذ المنبثقة لتحقيق أقصى تحويل","تصميم مدخلات تحسن من تصور العلامة التجارية","توفير المحتوى التلقائي للنوافذ المنبثقة على أساس سياق تسويق المنتج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context for optimal performance","Dependent on specific task details for tailored recommendations"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景以实现最佳性能","需要具体任务细节以提供定制化建议"],"ja":["最適なパフォーマンスを実現するために製品マーケティングのコンテキストが必要","カスタマイズされた推奨事項を提供するために具体的なタスクの詳細が必要"],"ko":["최적의 성능을实现하기 위해 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트가 필요","사용자 맞춤형 추천을 제공하기 위해 구체적인 작업 세부 정보가 필요"],"es":["Requiere contexto de marketing de productos para un rendimiento óptimo","Depende de detalles de tareas específicas para recomendaciones personalizadas"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de marketing de produits pour des performances optimales","Dépend de détails de tâches spécifiques pour des recommandations personnalisées"],"de":["Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontext für optimale Leistung","Hängt von spezifischen Aufgabendetails für maßgeschneiderte Empfehlungen ab"],"pt":["Exige contexto de marketing de produtos para desempenho ótimo","Depende de detalhes específicos da tarefa para recomendações personalizadas"],"ru":["Требует контекста продуктивного маркетинга для оптимальной производительности","Зависит от конкретных деталей задачи для индивидуальных рекомендаций"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تسويق المنتج لأداء مثالي","يعتمد على تفاصيل محددة للمهمة لتقديم توصيات مخصصة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
