Notre guide couvre la structure et la création de fichiers","de":"JSON Canvas ist ein offenes Dateiformat für Daten von unendlichen Zeichentafeln. Unsere Anleitung behandelt die Struktur und Erstellung von Dateien","pt":"O JSON Canvas é um formato de arquivo aberto para dados de canvas infinito, permitindo a criação e edição de arquivos .canvas.","ru":"JSON Canvas — это открытый формат файла для бесконечных данных(canvas), позволяющий создавать и редактировать файлы .canvas.","ar":"JSON Canvas هو تنسيق ملف مفتوح للبيانات الشبكية غير المحدودة، يسمح بإنشاء وتحرير ملفات .canvas.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["JSON ","JSON ","Obsidian","JSON 1.0","JSON "],"ja":["JSON ","JSON ","Obsidian","JSON 1.0","JSON "],"ko":["JSON ","JSON ","Obsidian","JSON 1.0","JSON "],"es":["Creación y edición de archivos JSON Canvas","Compatibilidad con Obsidian y otras aplicaciones","Estructura de archivo basada en JSON","Soporte para nodos y aristas","Seguimiento de la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0"],"fr":["Création et édition de fichiers JSON Canvas","Compatibilité avec Obsidian et d''autres applications","Structure de fichier basée sur JSON","Prise en charge des nœuds et des arêtes","Suivi de la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0"],"de":["Erstellung und Bearbeitung von JSON-Canvas-Dateien","Kompatibilität mit Obsidian und anderen Anwendungen","Dateistruktur basierend auf JSON","Unterstützung für Knoten und Kanten","Einhaltung der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0"],"pt":["Criação e edição de arquivos .canvas","Compatibilidade com o Obsidian e outras aplicações","Estrutura de arquivo em formato JSON","Suporte a nós e arestas","Extensão de arquivo .canvas"],"ru":["Создание и редактирование файлов .canvas","Совместимость с Obsidian и другими приложениями","Формат файла в формате JSON","Поддержка узлов и ребер","Расширение файла .canvas"],"ar":["إنشاء وتحرير ملفات .canvas","التوافق مع تطبيق Obsidian وتطبيقات أخرى","هيكل الملف بصيغة JSON","دعم العقد والEdges","امتداد الملف .canvas"]},"keywords":{"zh":["JSON","JSON ","Obsidian","JSON 1.0","JSON ","JSON API"],"ja":["JSON","JSON ","Obsidian","JSON 1.0","JSON ","JSON API"],"ko":["JSON","JSON ","Obsidian","JSON 1.0","JSON ","JSON API"],"es":["JSON Canvas","Obsidian","lienzo infinito","archivo JSON","creación de archivos","edición de archivos","desarrollo de software","formatos de archivo"],"fr":["JSON Canvas","Obsidian","canevas infini","fichier JSON","création de fichiers","édition de fichiers","développement de logiciels","formats de fichiers"],"de":["JSON Canvas","Obsidian","unendliche Zeichentafel","JSON-Datei","Erstellung von Dateien","Bearbeitung von Dateien","Softwareentwicklung","Dateiformate"],"pt":["JSON Canvas","arquivo canvas","dados de canvas","formato de arquivo aberto","criação de arquivos","edição de arquivos"],"ru":["JSON Canvas","файл canvas","данные(canvas)","открытый формат файла","создание файлов","редактирование файлов"],"ar":["JSON Canvas","ملف الشبكة","بيانات الشبكة","تنسيق ملف مفتوح","إنشاء ملفات","تحرير ملفات"]}},"owner":"giwankim","repo":"obsidian-vault","repoPath":"giwankim/obsidian-vault","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"json-canvas","description":"Create and edit JSON Canvas files (.canvas) with nodes, edges, groups, and connections. Use when working with .canvas files, creating visual canvases, mind maps, flowcharts, or when the user mentions Canvas files in Obsidian.","bodyPreview":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optio","body":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optional): Array of node objects\n- `edges` (optional): Array of edge objects connecting nodes\n\n## Nodes\n\nNodes are objects placed on the canvas. There are four node types:\n- `text` - Text content with Markdown\n- `file` - Reference to files/attachments\n- `link` - External URL\n- `group` - Visual container for other nodes\n\n### Z-Index Ordering\n\nNodes are ordered by z-index in the array:\n- First node = bottom layer (displayed below others)\n- Last node = top layer (displayed above others)\n\n### Generic Node Attributes\n\nAll nodes share these attributes:\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | Unique identifier for the node |\n| `type` | Yes | string | Node type: `text`, `file`, `link`, or `group` |\n| `x` | Yes | integer | X position in pixels |\n| `y` | Yes | integer | Y position in pixels |\n| `width` | Yes | integer | Width in pixels |\n| `height` | Yes | integer | Height in pixels |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | Node color (see Color section) |\n\n### Text Nodes\n\nText nodes contain Markdown content.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"text\": \"# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown** content.\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Newline Escaping (Common Pitfall)\n\nIn JSON, newline characters inside strings **must** be represented as `\\n`. Do **not** use the literal sequence `\\\\n` in a `.canvas` file—Obsidian will render it as the characters `\\` and `n` instead of a line break.\n\nExamples:\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `text` | Yes | string | Plain text with Markdown syntax |\n\n### File Nodes\n\nFile nodes reference files or attachments (images, videos, PDFs, notes, etc.).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 400,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Notes/Project Overview.md\",\n  \"subpath\": \"#Implementation\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `file` | Yes | string | Path to file within the system |\n| `subpath` | No | string | Link to heading or block (starts with `#`) |\n\n### Link Nodes\n\nLink nodes display external URLs.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"c3d4e5f678901234\",\n  \"type\": \"link\",\n  \"x\": 1000,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"url\": \"https://obsidian.md\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `url` | Yes | string | External URL |\n\n### Group Nodes\n\nGroup nodes are visual containers for organizing other nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"d4e5f6789012345a\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": -50,\n  \"y\": -50,\n  \"width\": 1000,\n  \"height\": 600,\n  \"label\": \"Project Overview\",\n  \"color\": \"4\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"e5f67890123456ab\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 700,\n  \"width\": 800,\n  \"height\": 500,\n  \"label\": \"Resources\",\n  \"background\": \"Attachments/background.png\",\n  \"backgroundStyle\": \"cover\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `label` | No | string | Text label for the group |\n| `background` | No | string | Path to background image |\n| `backgroundStyle` | No | string | Background rendering style |\n\n#### Background Styles\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `cover` | Fills entire width and height of node |\n| `ratio` | Maintains aspect ratio of background image |\n| `repeat` | Repeats image as pattern in both directions |\n\n## Edges\n\nEdges are lines connecting nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"f67890123456789a\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"toNode\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"0123456789abcdef\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n  \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n  \"toNode\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"toSide\": \"left\",\n  \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n  \"color\": \"1\",\n  \"label\": \"leads to\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | - | Unique identifier for the edge |\n| `fromNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection starts |\n| `fromSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge starts |\n| `fromEnd` | No | string | `none` | Shape at edge start |\n| `toNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection ends |\n| `toSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge ends |\n| `toEnd` | No | string | `arrow` | Shape at edge end |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | - | Line color |\n| `label` | No | string | - | Text label for the edge |\n\n### Side Values\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `top` | Top edge of node |\n| `right` | Right edge of node |\n| `bottom` | Bottom edge of node |\n| `left` | Left edge of node |\n\n### End Shapes\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `none` | No endpoint shape |\n| `arrow` | Arrow endpoint |\n\n## Colors\n\nThe `canvasColor` type can be specified in two ways:\n\n### Hex Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"#FF0000\"\n}\n```\n\n### Preset Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"1\"\n}\n```\n\n| Preset | Color |\n|--------|-------|\n| `\"1\"` | Red |\n| `\"2\"` | Orange |\n| `\"3\"` | Yellow |\n| `\"4\"` | Green |\n| `\"5\"` | Cyan |\n| `\"6\"` | Purple |\n\nNote: Specific color values for presets are intentionally undefined, allowing applications to use their own brand colors.\n\n## Complete Examples\n\n### Simple Canvas with Text and Connections\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"text\": \"# Main Idea\\n\\nThis is the central concept.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": -100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point A\\n\\nDetails here.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point B\\n\\nMore details.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Project Board with Groups\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"To Do\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 350,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"In Progress\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 700,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"Done\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 20,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 1\\n\\nImplement feature X\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 370,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 2\\n\\nReview PR #123\",\n      \"color\": \"2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 720,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 3\\n\\n~~Setup CI/CD~~\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n### Research Canvas with Files and Links\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 300,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 400,\n      \"height\": 200,\n      \"text\": \"# Research Topic\\n\\n## Key Questions\\n\\n- How does X affect Y?\\n- What are the implications?\",\n      \"color\": \"5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Literature/Paper A.pdf\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Notes/Meeting Notes.md\",\n      \"subpath\": \"#Key Insights\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"type\": \"link\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 400,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"url\": \"https://example.com/research\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 750,\n      \"y\": 150,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 250,\n      \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6d7e8f9a0b1c2d3e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"supports\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7e8f9a0b1c2d3e4f\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"informs\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8f9a0b1c2d3e4f5a\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n      \"color\": \"6\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"visualized by\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Flowchart\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**Start**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Step 1:\\nGather data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"**Decision**\\n\\nIs data valid?\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Process data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Request new data\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 320,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**End**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a6b7c8d9e0f1a2b3\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b7c8d9e0f1a2b3c4\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c8d9e0f1a2b3c4d5\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"Yes\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d9e0f1a2b3c4d5e6\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"toSide\": \"right\",\n      \"label\": \"No\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e0f1a2b3c4d5e6f7\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"top\",\n      \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## ID Generation\n\nNode and edge IDs must be unique strings. Obsidian generates 16-character hexadecimal IDs:\n\n```json\n\"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\"\n\"id\": \"a3b2c1d0e9f8g7h6\"\n\"id\": \"1234567890abcdef\"\n```\n\nThis format is a 16-character lowercase hex string (64-bit random value).\n\n## Layout Guidelines\n\n### Positioning\n\n- Coordinates can be negative (canvas extends infinitely)\n- `x` increases to the right\n- `y` increases downward\n- Position refers to top-left corner of node\n\n### Recommended Sizes\n\n| Node Type | Suggested Width | Suggested Height |\n|-----------|-----------------|------------------|\n| Small text | 200-300 | 80-150 |\n| Medium text | 300-450 | 150-300 |\n| Large text | 400-600 | 300-500 |\n| File preview | 300-500 | 200-400 |\n| Link preview | 250-400 | 100-200 |\n| Group | Varies | Varies |\n\n### Spacing\n\n- Leave 20-50px padding inside groups\n- Space nodes 50-100px apart for readability\n- Align nodes to grid (multiples of 10 or 20) for cleaner layouts\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n1. All `id` values must be unique across nodes and edges\n2. `fromNode` and `toNode` must reference existing node IDs\n3. Required fields must be present for each node type\n4. `type` must be one of: `text`, `file`, `link`, `group`\n5. `backgroundStyle` must be one of: `cover`, `ratio`, `repeat`\n6. `fromSide`, `toSide` must be one of: `top`, `right`, `bottom`, `left`\n7. `fromEnd`, `toEnd` must be one of: `none`, `arrow`\n8. Color presets must be `\"1\"` through `\"6\"` or valid hex color\n\n## References\n\n- [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/)\n- [JSON Canvas GitHub](https://github.com/obsidianmd/jsoncanvas)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:32:25.776Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Visualization Agents needing to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files for Obsidian and other applications.","zh":"非常适合需要创建和编辑Obsidian和其他应用程序的有效JSON画布文件的数据可视化代理。","ja":"Obsidianおよびその他のアプリケーション用の有効なJSONキャンバスファイルを作成および編集する必要があるデータ視覚化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Obsidian 및 기타 애플리케이션에 대해 유효한 JSON 캔버스 파일을 생성 및 편집해야 하는 데이터 시각화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Visualización de Datos que necesitan crear y editar archivos de lienzo JSON válidos para Obsidian y otras aplicaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Visualisation de Données ayant besoin de créer et de modifier des fichiers de canevas JSON valides pour Obsidian et d''autres applications.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Visualisierungsagenten, die gültige JSON-Canvas-Dateien für Obsidian und andere Anwendungen erstellen und bearbeiten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Visualização de Dados que precisam criar e editar arquivos de Canvas JSON válidos para Obsidian e outras aplicações.","ru":"Идеально для агентов визуализации данных, которым необходимо создавать и редактировать действительные файлы JSON Canvas для Obsidian и других приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المرئيين للبيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء وتحرير ملفات JSON Canvas صالحة لبرامج Obsidian وأخرى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and manipulate infinite canvas data using the JSON Canvas Spec 1.0, enabling advanced data visualization capabilities with valid JSON files containing nodes and edges, and utilizing the .canvas file extension.","zh":"赋予代理生成和操作无限画布数据的能力，使用JSON画布规范1.0，实现高级数据可视化能力，使用包含节点和边的有效JSON文件，并利用.canvas文件扩展名。","ja":"JSONキャンバス仕様1.0を使用して、エージェントが無限のキャンバスデータを生成および操作できるようにし、有効なJSONファイル（ノードとエッジを含む）を使用して、高度なデータ視覚化機能を実現し、.canvasファイル拡張子を利用する。","ko":"JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0을 사용하여 에이전트가 무한 캔버스 데이터를 생성 및 조작할 수 있도록 하여 유효한 JSON 파일(노드 및 에지 포함)을 사용하여 고급 데이터 시각화 기능을 구현하고 .canvas 파일 확장자를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y manipular datos de lienzo infinito utilizando la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0, lo que permite capacidades de visualización de datos avanzadas con archivos JSON válidos que contienen nodos y aristas, y utilizando la extensión de archivo .canvas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de manipuler des données de canevas infinies en utilisant la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0, ce qui permet des capacités de visualisation de données avancées avec des fichiers JSON valides contenant des nœuds et des arêtes, et en utilisant l''extension de fichier .canvas.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, unendliche Canvas-Daten mit der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0 zu generieren und zu manipulieren, wodurch erweiterte Datenvisualisierungsfunktionen mit gültigen JSON-Dateien möglich werden, die Knoten und Kanten enthalten und die Dateierweiterung .canvas verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e manipular dados de canvas infinitos usando a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0, permitindo capacidades avançadas de visualização de dados com arquivos JSON válidos que contenham nós e arestas, e utilizando a extensão de arquivo .canvas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и манипулировать данными бесконечного холста с использованием спецификации JSON Canvas 1.0, что позволяет осуществлять расширенные возможности визуализации данных с помощью действительных файлов JSON, содержащих узлы и ребра, и использующих расширение файла .canvas.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على生成 ومانيبولेशन بيانات الشبكة اللانهائية باستخدام مواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0، مما يتيح إمكانيات متقدمة لمرئية البيانات باستخدام ملفات JSON صالحة تحتوي على عقد و حواف، و باستخدام ملحق الملف .canvas."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating JSON Canvas files for Obsidian notes","Editing existing .canvas files for data visualization","Creating custom nodes and edges for infinite canvas data"],"zh":["为Obsidian笔记生成JSON画布文件","编辑现有的.canvas文件以进行数据可视化","为无限画布数据创建自定义节点和边"],"ja":["Obsidianノート用のJSONキャンバスファイルを生成する","既存の.canvasファイルを編集してデータ視覚化を行う","無限のキャンバスデータ用にカスタムノードとエッジを作成する"],"ko":["Obsidian 노트에 대한 JSON 캔버스 파일 생성","既存의 .canvas 파일 편집을 통한 데이터 시각화","무한 캔버스 데이터를 위한 사용자 정의 노드 및 에지 생성"],"es":["Generación de archivos de lienzo JSON para notas de Obsidian","Edición de archivos .canvas existentes para visualización de datos","Creación de nodos y aristas personalizados para datos de lienzo infinito"],"fr":["Génération de fichiers de canevas JSON pour les notes Obsidian","Édition de fichiers .canvas existants pour la visualisation de données","Création de nœuds et d''arêtes personnalisés pour les données de canevas infinies"],"de":["Erstellung von JSON-Canvas-Dateien für Obsidian-Notizen","Bearbeitung von vorhandenen .canvas-Dateien für die Datenvisualisierung","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Knoten und Kanten für unendliche Canvas-Daten"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos JSON Canvas para notas do Obsidian","Edição de arquivos .canvas existentes para visualização de dados","Criação de nós e arestas personalizados para dados de canvas infinitos"],"ru":["Генерация файлов JSON Canvas для заметок Obsidian","Редактирование существующих файлов .canvas для визуализации данных","Создание пользовательских узлов и ребер для данных бесконечного холста"],"ar":["جعل ملفات JSON Canvas لملحوظات برامج Obsidian","تحرير ملفات .canvas الحالية لمرئية البيانات","إنشاء عقد و حواف مخصصة لبيانات الشبكة اللانهائية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compliance with JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Limited to .canvas file format"],"zh":["需要遵守JSON画布规范1.0","仅限.canvas文件格式"],"ja":["JSONキャンバス仕様1.0への準拠が必要",".canvasファイル形式のみ"],"ko":["JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0을 준수해야 함",".canvas 파일 형식만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la conformidad con la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado al formato de archivo .canvas"],"fr":["Nécessite la conformité avec la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0","Limité au format de fichier .canvas"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0","Begrenzt auf das Dateiformat .canvas"],"pt":["Exige conformidade com a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado ao formato de arquivo .canvas"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения спецификации JSON Canvas 1.0","Ограничен форматом файла .canvas"],"ar":["يتطلب соблюд مواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0","محدود بملحق الملف .canvas"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
