n Sie unendliche Canv...","pt":"JSON Canvas: Crie e Edite Arquivos de Canvas","ru":"JSON Canvas: Создание и редактирование файлов Canvas","ar":"JSON Canvas: إنشاء وتحرير ملفات Canvas","en":"json-canvas"},"description":{"zh":"JSON画布技能允许开发人员创建和编辑Obsidian和其他应用程序中的有效JSON Canvas文件","ja":"JSON Canvasスキルは、開発者がObsidianおよびその他のアプリケーションで使用される有効なJSON Canvasファイルを作成および編集できるようにします","ko":"JSON 캔버스 스킬은 개발자가 Obsidian 및 기타 애플리케이션에서 사용되는 유효한 JSON 캔버스 파일을 생성 및 편집할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"JSON Canvas es un formato de archivo abierto para datos de lienzo infinito, que permite crear y editar archivos .canvas para Obsidian y otras aplicaciones.","fr":"JSON Canvas est un format de fichier ouvert pour les données de canevas infini, qui permet de créer et d''éditer des fichiers .canvas pour Obsidian et d''autre...","de":"JSON Canvas ist ein offenes Dateiformat für unendliche Canvas-Daten, das das Erstellen und Bearbeiten von .canvas-Dateien für Obsidian und andere Anwendungen...","pt":"O JSON Canvas é um formato de arquivo aberto para dados de canvas infinito, permitindo a criação e edição de arquivos .canvas para uso em Obsidian e outras a...","ru":"JSON Canvas — это открытый формат файла для бесконечных данных канваса, позволяющий создавать и редактировать файлы .canvas для использования в Obsidian и др...","ar":"JSON Canvas هو تنسيق ملف مفتوح لبيانات Canvas اللانهائية، مما يسمح بإنشاء وتحرير ملفات .canvas لاستخدامها في برامج Obsidian وغيرها.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建和编辑有效的JSON Canvas文件","支持Obsidian和其他应用程序","遵循JSON Canvas Spec 1.0规范","包含节点和边的顶级数组","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["有効なJSON Canvasファイルを作成および編集","Obsidianおよびその他のアプリケーションをサポート","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0規格に準拠","ノードとエッジのトップレベル配列を含む","使用および統合が容易"],"ko":["유효한 JSON 캔버스 파일 생성 및 편집","Obsidian 및 기타 애플리케이션 지원","JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0 규격 준수","노드 및 에지의 최상위 배열 포함","사용 및 통합이 쉬움"],"es":["Crea y edita archivos .canvas para Obsidian y otras aplicaciones","Almacena datos de lienzo infinito en formato JSON","Seguimiento de la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0","Estructura de archivo con dos matrices principales: nodos y bordes","Compatibilidad con habilidades de agentes"],"fr":["Créez et éditez des fichiers .canvas pour Obsidian et d''autres applications","Stockez des données de canevas infini au format JSON","Suivi de la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0","Structure de fichier avec deux tableaux principaux : nœuds et arêtes","Compatibilité avec les compétences des agents"],"de":["Erstellen und bearbeiten Sie .canvas-Dateien für Obsidian und andere Anwendungen","Speichern Sie unendliche Canvas-Daten im JSON-Format","Verfolgen der JSON Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0","Dateistruktur mit zwei Hauptmatrizen: Knoten und Kanten","Kompatibilität mit Agentenfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Criação e edição de arquivos .canvas","Compatibilidade com Obsidian e outras aplicações","Formato de arquivo aberto para dados de canvas infinito","Estrutura de arquivo baseada em JSON","Suporte a nós e arestas"],"ru":["Создание и редактирование файлов .canvas","Совместимость с Obsidian и другими приложениями","Открытый формат файла для бесконечных данных канваса","Структура файла на основе JSON","Поддержка узлов и ребер"],"ar":["إنشاء وتحرير ملفات .canvas","التوافق مع برامج Obsidian وغيرها","تنسيق ملف مفتوح لبيانات Canvas اللانهائية","هيكل الملف بالتنسيق JSON","دعم العقد والedges"]},"keywords":{"zh":["JSON画布","Obsidian","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","无限画布数据","文件格式","开发工具"],"ja":["JSON Canvas","Obsidian","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","無限キャンバスデータ","ファイル形式","開発ツール"],"ko":["JSON 캔버스","Obsidian","JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0","무한 캔버스 데이터","파일 형식","개발 도구"],"es":["JSON Canvas","lienzo infinito","Obsidian","formato de archivo abierto","datos de lienzo","JSON","agentes compatibles","especificación JSON Canvas 1.0"],"fr":["JSON Canvas","canevas infini","Obsidian","format de fichier ouvert","données de canevas","JSON","agents compatibles","spécification JSON Canvas 1.0"],"de":["JSON Canvas","unendliche Canvas","Obsidian","offenes Dateiformat","Canvas-Daten","JSON","Agentenkompatibilität","JSON Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0"],"pt":["JSON Canvas","arquivos .canvas","Obsidian","dados de canvas infinito","formato de arquivo aberto","JSON","nós","arestas"],"ru":["JSON Canvas","файлы .canvas","Obsidian","бесконечные данные канваса","открытый формат файла","JSON","узлы","ребра"],"ar":["JSON Canvas","ملفات .canvas","برامج Obsidian","بيانات Canvas اللانهائية","تنسيق ملف مفتوح","JSON","عقد","edges"]}},"owner":"malinkang","repo":"notes","repoPath":"malinkang/notes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"json-canvas","description":"Create and edit JSON Canvas files (.canvas) with nodes, edges, groups, and connections. Use when working with .canvas files, creating visual canvases, mind maps, flowcharts, or when the user mentions Canvas files in Obsidian.","bodyPreview":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optio","body":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optional): Array of node objects\n- `edges` (optional): Array of edge objects connecting nodes\n\n## Nodes\n\nNodes are objects placed on the canvas. There are four node types:\n- `text` - Text content with Markdown\n- `file` - Reference to files/attachments\n- `link` - External URL\n- `group` - Visual container for other nodes\n\n### Z-Index Ordering\n\nNodes are ordered by z-index in the array:\n- First node = bottom layer (displayed below others)\n- Last node = top layer (displayed above others)\n\n### Generic Node Attributes\n\nAll nodes share these attributes:\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | Unique identifier for the node |\n| `type` | Yes | string | Node type: `text`, `file`, `link`, or `group` |\n| `x` | Yes | integer | X position in pixels |\n| `y` | Yes | integer | Y position in pixels |\n| `width` | Yes | integer | Width in pixels |\n| `height` | Yes | integer | Height in pixels |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | Node color (see Color section) |\n\n### Text Nodes\n\nText nodes contain Markdown content.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"text\": \"# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown** content.\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Newline Escaping (Common Pitfall)\n\nIn JSON, newline characters inside strings **must** be represented as `\\n`. Do **not** use the literal sequence `\\\\n` in a `.canvas` file—Obsidian will render it as the characters `\\` and `n` instead of a line break.\n\nExamples:\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `text` | Yes | string | Plain text with Markdown syntax |\n\n### File Nodes\n\nFile nodes reference files or attachments (images, videos, PDFs, notes, etc.).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 400,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Notes/Project Overview.md\",\n  \"subpath\": \"#Implementation\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `file` | Yes | string | Path to file within the system |\n| `subpath` | No | string | Link to heading or block (starts with `#`) |\n\n### Link Nodes\n\nLink nodes display external URLs.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"c3d4e5f678901234\",\n  \"type\": \"link\",\n  \"x\": 1000,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"url\": \"https://obsidian.md\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `url` | Yes | string | External URL |\n\n### Group Nodes\n\nGroup nodes are visual containers for organizing other nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"d4e5f6789012345a\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": -50,\n  \"y\": -50,\n  \"width\": 1000,\n  \"height\": 600,\n  \"label\": \"Project Overview\",\n  \"color\": \"4\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"e5f67890123456ab\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 700,\n  \"width\": 800,\n  \"height\": 500,\n  \"label\": \"Resources\",\n  \"background\": \"Attachments/background.png\",\n  \"backgroundStyle\": \"cover\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `label` | No | string | Text label for the group |\n| `background` | No | string | Path to background image |\n| `backgroundStyle` | No | string | Background rendering style |\n\n#### Background Styles\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `cover` | Fills entire width and height of node |\n| `ratio` | Maintains aspect ratio of background image |\n| `repeat` | Repeats image as pattern in both directions |\n\n## Edges\n\nEdges are lines connecting nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"f67890123456789a\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"toNode\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"0123456789abcdef\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n  \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n  \"toNode\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"toSide\": \"left\",\n  \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n  \"color\": \"1\",\n  \"label\": \"leads to\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | - | Unique identifier for the edge |\n| `fromNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection starts |\n| `fromSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge starts |\n| `fromEnd` | No | string | `none` | Shape at edge start |\n| `toNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection ends |\n| `toSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge ends |\n| `toEnd` | No | string | `arrow` | Shape at edge end |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | - | Line color |\n| `label` | No | string | - | Text label for the edge |\n\n### Side Values\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `top` | Top edge of node |\n| `right` | Right edge of node |\n| `bottom` | Bottom edge of node |\n| `left` | Left edge of node |\n\n### End Shapes\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `none` | No endpoint shape |\n| `arrow` | Arrow endpoint |\n\n## Colors\n\nThe `canvasColor` type can be specified in two ways:\n\n### Hex Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"#FF0000\"\n}\n```\n\n### Preset Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"1\"\n}\n```\n\n| Preset | Color |\n|--------|-------|\n| `\"1\"` | Red |\n| `\"2\"` | Orange |\n| `\"3\"` | Yellow |\n| `\"4\"` | Green |\n| `\"5\"` | Cyan |\n| `\"6\"` | Purple |\n\nNote: Specific color values for presets are intentionally undefined, allowing applications to use their own brand colors.\n\n## Complete Examples\n\n### Simple Canvas with Text and Connections\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"text\": \"# Main Idea\\n\\nThis is the central concept.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": -100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point A\\n\\nDetails here.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point B\\n\\nMore details.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Project Board with Groups\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"To Do\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 350,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"In Progress\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 700,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"Done\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 20,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 1\\n\\nImplement feature X\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 370,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 2\\n\\nReview PR #123\",\n      \"color\": \"2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 720,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 3\\n\\n~~Setup CI/CD~~\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n### Research Canvas with Files and Links\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 300,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 400,\n      \"height\": 200,\n      \"text\": \"# Research Topic\\n\\n## Key Questions\\n\\n- How does X affect Y?\\n- What are the implications?\",\n      \"color\": \"5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Literature/Paper A.pdf\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Notes/Meeting Notes.md\",\n      \"subpath\": \"#Key Insights\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"type\": \"link\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 400,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"url\": \"https://example.com/research\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 750,\n      \"y\": 150,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 250,\n      \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6d7e8f9a0b1c2d3e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"supports\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7e8f9a0b1c2d3e4f\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"informs\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8f9a0b1c2d3e4f5a\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n      \"color\": \"6\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"visualized by\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Flowchart\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**Start**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Step 1:\\nGather data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"**Decision**\\n\\nIs data valid?\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Process data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Request new data\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 320,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**End**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a6b7c8d9e0f1a2b3\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b7c8d9e0f1a2b3c4\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c8d9e0f1a2b3c4d5\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"Yes\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d9e0f1a2b3c4d5e6\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"toSide\": \"right\",\n      \"label\": \"No\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e0f1a2b3c4d5e6f7\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"top\",\n      \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## ID Generation\n\nNode and edge IDs must be unique strings. Obsidian generates 16-character hexadecimal IDs:\n\n```json\n\"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\"\n\"id\": \"a3b2c1d0e9f8g7h6\"\n\"id\": \"1234567890abcdef\"\n```\n\nThis format is a 16-character lowercase hex string (64-bit random value).\n\n## Layout Guidelines\n\n### Positioning\n\n- Coordinates can be negative (canvas extends infinitely)\n- `x` increases to the right\n- `y` increases downward\n- Position refers to top-left corner of node\n\n### Recommended Sizes\n\n| Node Type | Suggested Width | Suggested Height |\n|-----------|-----------------|------------------|\n| Small text | 200-300 | 80-150 |\n| Medium text | 300-450 | 150-300 |\n| Large text | 400-600 | 300-500 |\n| File preview | 300-500 | 200-400 |\n| Link preview | 250-400 | 100-200 |\n| Group | Varies | Varies |\n\n### Spacing\n\n- Leave 20-50px padding inside groups\n- Space nodes 50-100px apart for readability\n- Align nodes to grid (multiples of 10 or 20) for cleaner layouts\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n1. All `id` values must be unique across nodes and edges\n2. `fromNode` and `toNode` must reference existing node IDs\n3. Required fields must be present for each node type\n4. `type` must be one of: `text`, `file`, `link`, `group`\n5. `backgroundStyle` must be one of: `cover`, `ratio`, `repeat`\n6. `fromSide`, `toSide` must be one of: `top`, `right`, `bottom`, `left`\n7. `fromEnd`, `toEnd` must be one of: `none`, `arrow`\n8. Color presets must be `\"1\"` through `\"6\"` or valid hex color\n\n## References\n\n- [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/)\n- [JSON Canvas GitHub](https://github.com/obsidianmd/jsoncanvas)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:31:57.785Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Visualization Agents needing to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files for Obsidian and other applications.","zh":"适合需要创建和编辑有效的JSON画布文件以供Obsidian和其他应用程序使用的数据可视化代理。","ja":"Obsidianやその他のアプリケーションで使用する有効なJSONキャンバスファイルを作成して編集する必要があるデータ可視化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Obsidian 및 기타 애플리케이션에서 사용할 수 있는 유효한 JSON 캔버스 파일을 생성 및 편집해야 하는 데이터 시각화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de visualización de datos que necesitan crear y editar archivos de lienzo JSON válidos para Obsidian y otras aplicaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de visualisation de données ayant besoin de créer et de modifier des fichiers de canevas JSON valides pour Obsidian et d''autres applications.","de":"Perfekt für Datenvisualisierungsagenten, die gültige JSON-Canvas-Dateien für Obsidian und andere Anwendungen erstellen und bearbeiten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Visualização de Dados que precisam criar e editar arquivos de Canvas JSON válidos para Obsidian e outras aplicações.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов визуализации данных, которым необходимо создавать и редактировать действительные файлы JSON Canvas для Obsidian и других приложений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل एजنتات التصور البياني الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء وتحرير ملفات Canvas JSON صالحة لبرامج مثل Obsidian وغيرها من التطبيقات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and manipulate infinite canvas data using the JSON Canvas Spec 1.0, creating and editing .canvas files with nodes and edges arrays, and leveraging JSON format for seamless integration with various tools and platforms.","zh":"使代理能够使用JSON画布规范1.0生成和操作无限画布数据，创建和编辑具有节点和边数组的.canvas文件，并利用JSON格式实现与各种工具和平台的无缝集成。","ja":"JSONキャンバス仕様1.0を使用して無限のキャンバスデータを生成して操作することで、エージェントを活用し、ノードとエッジの配列を備えた.canvasファイルを作成して編集し、JSON形式を使用してさまざまなツールやプラットフォームとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0을 사용하여 무한한 캔버스 데이터를 생성 및 조작하여 에이전트를 강화하고 노드 및 에지 배열을 갖춘 .canvas 파일을 생성 및 편집하며 JSON 형식을 사용하여 다양한 도구 및 플랫폼과无缝하게 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y manipular datos de lienzo infinito utilizando la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0, creando y editando archivos .canvas con matrices de nodos y bordes, y aprovechando el formato JSON para una integración sin problemas con diversas herramientas y plataformas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de manipuler des données de canevas infinies en utilisant la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0, en créant et en éditant des fichiers .canvas avec des tableaux de nœuds et de bordures, et en exploitant le format JSON pour une intégration transparente avec divers outils et plateformes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, unendliche Canvas-Daten mit der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0 zu generieren und zu manipulieren, .canvas-Dateien mit Knoten- und Kanten-Arrays zu erstellen und zu bearbeiten und das JSON-Format für eine nahtlose Integration mit verschiedenen Tools und Plattformen zu nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e manipular dados de canvas infinitos usando a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0, criando e editando arquivos .canvas com matrizes de nós e arestas e aproveitando o formato JSON para integração perfeita com várias ferramentas e plataformas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и манипулировать бесконечными данными холста с использованием спецификации JSON Canvas 1.0, создавая и редактируя файлы .canvas с массивами узлов и ребер, и используя формат JSON для бесшовной интеграции с различными инструментами и платформами.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من إنشاء وتعديل بيانات الشبكة غير المحدودة باستخدام مواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0، وإنشاء وتحرير ملفات .canvas بأبعاد العقد والحدود، واستخدام تنسيق JSON للتكامل السلس مع أدوات وبرامج متنوعة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating interactive canvas visualizations","Editing existing .canvas files for Obsidian","Generating nodes and edges arrays for custom canvas data"],"zh":["创建交互式画布可视化","编辑现有的Obsidian .canvas文件","为自定义画布数据生成节点和边数组"],"ja":["インタラクティブなキャンバス可視化を作成する","既存のObsidian .canvasファイルを編集する","カスタムキャンバスデータのノードとエッジの配列を生成する"],"ko":["대화형 캔버스 시각화를 생성","기존의 Obsidian .canvas 파일을 편집","사용자 지정 캔버스 데이터의 노드 및 에지 배열을 생성"],"es":["Crear visualizaciones de lienzo interactivas","Editar archivos .canvas existentes para Obsidian","Generar matrices de nodos y bordes para datos de lienzo personalizados"],"fr":["Créer des visualisations de canevas interactives","Modifier des fichiers .canvas existants pour Obsidian","Générer des tableaux de nœuds et de bordures pour des données de canevas personnalisées"],"de":["Interaktive Canvas-Visualisierungen erstellen","Vorhandene .canvas-Dateien für Obsidian bearbeiten","Knoten- und Kanten-Arrays für benutzerdefinierte Canvas-Daten generieren"],"pt":["Criar visualizações de canvas interativas","Editar arquivos .canvas existentes para Obsidian","Gerar matrizes de nós e arestas para dados de canvas personalizados"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных визуализаций холста","Редактирование существующих файлов .canvas для Obsidian","Генерация массивов узлов и ребер для пользовательских данных холста"],"ar":["إنشاء تصورات شبكة تفاعلية","تحرير ملفات .canvas الحالية لبرامج مثل Obsidian","إنشاء مصفوفات العقد والحدود لبيانات الشبكة المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Limited to .canvas file format"],"zh":["需要遵守JSON画布规范1.0","仅限.canvas文件格式"],"ja":["JSONキャンバス仕様1.0への準拠が必要",".canvasファイル形式のみ"],"ko":["JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0을 준수해야 함",".canvas 파일 형식만"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado al formato de archivo .canvas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0","Limité au format de fichier .canvas"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0","Begrenzt auf das .canvas-Dateiformat"],"pt":["Exige aderência à Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado ao formato de arquivo .canvas"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения спецификации JSON Canvas 1.0","Ограничен форматом файла .canvas"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0","محدود بتنسيق ملف .canvas"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Dknight203/AesopIDE/nx-workspace-patterns', 'community', 'Dknight203', 'AesopIDE', 'Dknight203/AesopIDE', 'nx-workspace-patterns', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z', '2026-02-18T09:32:39.001Z', NULL, '{"id":"Dknight203/AesopIDE/nx-workspace-patterns","name":"nx-workspace-patterns","description":{"zh":"Nx 工作空间模式提供了一系列生产模式，用于管理 Nx monorepo，包括设置新工作空间、配置项目边界、优化 CI 等","ja":"Nx ワークスペース パターンは、Nx monorepo を管理するための生産パターンのシリーズを提供します。新しいワークスペースの設定、プロジェクト境界の構成、CI の最適化などが含まれます","ko":"Nx 작업공간 패턴은 Nx 모노리포를 관리하기 위한 생산 패턴 시리즈를 제공합니다. 새로운 작업공간 설정, 프로젝트 경계 구성, CI 최적화 등이 포함됩니다","es":"Los patrones de espacio de trabajo Nx facilitan la gestión de monorepos. Configure proyectos, optimice la integración continua y administre dependencias de manera efectiva","fr":"Les modèles d''espace de travail Nx facilitent la gestion des monorepos. Configurez des projets, optimisez l''intégration continue et gérez les dépendances de manière efficace","de":"Die Nx-Arbeitsbereichsmuster erleichtern die Verwaltung von Monorepos. Konfigurieren Sie Projekte, optimieren Sie die kontinuierliche Integration und verwalten Sie Abhängigkeiten effektiv","pt":"Os padrões de espaço de trabalho Nx ajudam a gerenciar monorepos de forma eficiente. Fornece orientações para configuração de projetos e otimização de fluxos de trabalho.","ru":"Шаблоны рабочего пространства Nx помогают эффективно управлять монорепозиториями. Предоставляют рекомендации по настройке проектов и оптимизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"نماط مساحة العمل Nx تساعد في إدارة مونوريبوز بفعالية. توفر إرشادات لتكوين المشاريع وتحسين تدفقات العمل.","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Nx 工作空间模式","ja":"Nx ワークスペース パターン","ko":"Nx 작업공간 패턴","es":"Patrones de espacio de trabajo Nx para monorepos","fr":"Modèles d''espace de travail Nx pour monorepos","de":"Nx-Arbeitsbereichsmuster für Monorepos","pt":"Padrões de Espaço de Trabalho Nx","ru":"Шаблоны рабочего пространства Nx","ar":"نماط مساحة العمل Nx","en":"nx-workspace-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Nx 工作空间模式提供了一系列生产模式，用于管理 Nx monorepo，包括设置新工作空间、配置项目边界、优化 CI 等","ja":"Nx ワークスペース パターンは、Nx monorepo を管理するための生産パターンのシリーズを提供します。新しいワークスペースの設定、プロジェクト境界の構成、CI の最適化などが含まれます","ko":"Nx 작업공간 패턴은 Nx 모노리포를 관리하기 위한 생산 패턴 시리즈를 제공합니다. 새로운 작업공간 설정, 프로젝트 경계 구성, CI 최적화 등이 포함됩니다","es":"Los patrones de espacio de trabajo Nx facilitan la gestión de monorepos. Configure proyectos, optimice la integración continua y administre dependencias de m...","fr":"Les modèles d''espace de travail Nx facilitent la gestion des monorepos. Configurez des projets, optimisez l''intégration continue et gérez les dépendances de ...","de":"Die Nx-Arbeitsbereichsmuster erleichtern die Verwaltung von Monorepos. Konfigurieren Sie Projekte, optimieren Sie die kontinuierliche Integration und verwalt...","pt":"Os padrões de espaço de trabalho Nx ajudam a gerenciar monorepos de forma eficiente. Fornece orientações para configuração de projetos e otimização de fluxos...","ru":"Шаблоны рабочего пространства Nx помогают эффективно управлять монорепозиториями. Предоставляют рекомендации по настройке проектов и оптимизации рабочих проц...","ar":"نماط مساحة العمل Nx تساعد في إدارة مونوريبوز بفعالية. توفر إرشادات لتكوين المشاريع وتحسين تدفقات العمل.","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["设置新工作空间","配置项目边界","优化 CI","实现远程缓存","管理项目依赖","迁移至 Nx"],"ja":["新しいワークスペースの設定","プロジェクト境界の構成","CI の最適化","リモート キャッシュの実装","プロジェクト依存関係の管理","Nx への移行"],"ko":["새로운 작업공간 설정","프로젝트 경계 구성","CI 최적화","원격 캐싱 구현","프로젝트 종속성 관리","Nx로의 마이그레이션"],"es":["Configuración de proyectos","Optimización de la integración continua","Administración de dependencias","Implementación de caché remota","Migración a Nx"],"fr":["Configuration de projets","Optimisation de l''intégration continue","Gestion des dépendances","Mise en œuvre d''un cache distant","Migration vers Nx"],"de":["Projekt-Konfiguration","Optimierung der kontinuierlichen Integration","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten","Implementierung von Remote-Caching","Migration zu Nx"],"pt":["Configuração de projetos","Otimização de fluxos de trabalho","Gerenciamento de dependências","Implementação de cache remoto","Migração para Nx"],"ru":["Настройка проектов","Оптимизация рабочих процессов","Управление зависимостями","Реализация удаленного кэширования","Миграция на Nx"],"ar":["تكوين المشاريع","تحسين تدفقات العمل","إدارة التبعيات","تنفيذ التخزين المؤقت عن بعد","هجرة إلى Nx"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nx","monorepo","工作空间模式","生产模式","CI 优化","远程缓存","项目依赖管理"],"ja":["Nx","monorepo","ワークスペース パターン","生産パターン","CI 最適化","リモート キャッシュ","プロジェクト依存関係管理"],"ko":["Nx","모노리포","작업공간 패턴","생산 패턴","CI 최적화","원격 캐싱","프로젝트 종속성 관리"],"es":["nx workspace","monorepo","gestión de proyectos","integración continua","dependencias","caché remota","migración a nx"],"fr":["nx workspace","monorepo","gestion de projets","intégration continue","dépendances","cache distant","migration vers nx"],"de":["nx-arbeitsbereich","monorepo","projektverwaltung","kontinuierliche integration","abhängigkeiten","remote-caching","migration zu nx"],"pt":["nx workspace","monorepo","gerenciamento de projetos","otimização de ci","cache remoto","migração para nx"],"ru":["nx рабочее пространство","монорепозиторий","управление проектами","оптимизация ci","удаленное кэширование","миграция на nx"],"ar":["مساحة عمل nx","مونوريبوز","إدارة المشاريع","تحسين سي","التخزين المؤقت عن بعد","هجرة إلى nx"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.478Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nx-workspace-patterns","description":"Configure and optimize Nx monorepo workspaces. Use when setting up Nx, configuring project boundaries, optimizing build caching, or implementing affected commands.","bodyPreview":"# Nx Workspace Patterns\n\nProduction patterns for Nx monorepo management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new Nx workspaces\n- Configuring project boundaries\n- Optimizing CI with affected commands\n- Implementing remote caching\n- Managing dependencies between projects\n- Migrating to Nx\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Nx Architecture\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── apps/              # Deployable applications\n│   ├── web/\n│   └── api/\n├── libs/              # Shared libraries\n│   ├── shared/\n│   │   ├── ui/","body":"# Nx Workspace Patterns\n\nProduction patterns for Nx monorepo management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new Nx workspaces\n- Configuring project boundaries\n- Optimizing CI with affected commands\n- Implementing remote caching\n- Managing dependencies between projects\n- Migrating to Nx\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Nx Architecture\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── apps/              # Deployable applications\n│   ├── web/\n│   └── api/\n├── libs/              # Shared libraries\n│   ├── shared/\n│   │   ├── ui/\n│   │   └── utils/\n│   └── feature/\n│       ├── auth/\n│       └── dashboard/\n├── tools/             # Custom executors/generators\n├── nx.json            # Nx configuration\n└── workspace.json     # Project configuration\n```\n\n### 2. Library Types\n\n| Type            | Purpose                          | Example             |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **feature**     | Smart components, business logic | `feature-auth`      |\n| **ui**          | Presentational components        | `ui-buttons`        |\n| **data-access** | API calls, state management      | `data-access-users` |\n| **util**        | Pure functions, helpers          | `util-formatting`   |\n| **shell**       | App bootstrapping                | `shell-web`         |\n\n## Templates\n\n### Template 1: nx.json Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"./node_modules/nx/schemas/nx-schema.json\",\n  \"npmScope\": \"myorg\",\n  \"affected\": {\n    \"defaultBase\": \"main\"\n  },\n  \"tasksRunnerOptions\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"runner\": \"nx/tasks-runners/default\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"cacheableOperations\": [\n          \"build\",\n          \"lint\",\n          \"test\",\n          \"e2e\",\n          \"build-storybook\"\n        ],\n        \"parallel\": 3\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"targetDefaults\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"inputs\": [\"production\", \"^production\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"^production\", \"{workspaceRoot}/jest.preset.js\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"{workspaceRoot}/.eslintrc.json\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"e2e\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"^production\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"namedInputs\": {\n    \"default\": [\"{projectRoot}/**/*\", \"sharedGlobals\"],\n    \"production\": [\n      \"default\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/**/?(*.)+(spec|test).[jt]s?(x)?(.snap)\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/tsconfig.spec.json\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/jest.config.[jt]s\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/.eslintrc.json\"\n    ],\n    \"sharedGlobals\": [\n      \"{workspaceRoot}/babel.config.json\",\n      \"{workspaceRoot}/tsconfig.base.json\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"generators\": {\n    \"@nx/react\": {\n      \"application\": {\n        \"style\": \"css\",\n        \"linter\": \"eslint\",\n        \"bundler\": \"webpack\"\n      },\n      \"library\": {\n        \"style\": \"css\",\n        \"linter\": \"eslint\"\n      },\n      \"component\": {\n        \"style\": \"css\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Template 2: Project Configuration\n\n```json\n// apps/web/project.json\n{\n  \"name\": \"web\",\n  \"$schema\": \"../../node_modules/nx/schemas/project-schema.json\",\n  \"sourceRoot\": \"apps/web/src\",\n  \"projectType\": \"application\",\n  \"tags\": [\"type:app\", \"scope:web\"],\n  \"targets\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/webpack:webpack\",\n      \"outputs\": [\"{options.outputPath}\"],\n      \"defaultConfiguration\": \"production\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"compiler\": \"babel\",\n        \"outputPath\": \"dist/apps/web\",\n        \"index\": \"apps/web/src/index.html\",\n        \"main\": \"apps/web/src/main.tsx\",\n        \"tsConfig\": \"apps/web/tsconfig.app.json\",\n        \"assets\": [\"apps/web/src/assets\"],\n        \"styles\": [\"apps/web/src/styles.css\"]\n      },\n      \"configurations\": {\n        \"development\": {\n          \"extractLicenses\": false,\n          \"optimization\": false,\n          \"sourceMap\": true\n        },\n        \"production\": {\n          \"optimization\": true,\n          \"outputHashing\": \"all\",\n          \"sourceMap\": false,\n          \"extractLicenses\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"serve\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/webpack:dev-server\",\n      \"defaultConfiguration\": \"development\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"buildTarget\": \"web:build\"\n      },\n      \"configurations\": {\n        \"development\": {\n          \"buildTarget\": \"web:build:development\"\n        },\n        \"production\": {\n          \"buildTarget\": \"web:build:production\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/jest:jest\",\n      \"outputs\": [\"{workspaceRoot}/coverage/{projectRoot}\"],\n      \"options\": {\n        \"jestConfig\": \"apps/web/jest.config.ts\",\n        \"passWithNoTests\": true\n      }\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@nx/eslint:lint\",\n      \"outputs\": [\"{options.outputFile}\"],\n      \"options\": {\n        \"lintFilePatterns\": [\"apps/web/**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Template 3: Module Boundary Rules\n\n```json\n// .eslintrc.json\n{\n  \"root\": true,\n  \"ignorePatterns\": [\"**/*\"],\n  \"plugins\": [\"@nx\"],\n  \"overrides\": [\n    {\n      \"files\": [\"*.ts\", \"*.tsx\", \"*.js\", \"*.jsx\"],\n      \"rules\": {\n        \"@nx/enforce-module-boundaries\": [\n          \"error\",\n          {\n            \"enforceBuildableLibDependency\": true,\n            \"allow\": [],\n            \"depConstraints\": [\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:app\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\n                  \"type:feature\",\n                  \"type:ui\",\n                  \"type:data-access\",\n                  \"type:util\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:feature\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\n                  \"type:ui\",\n                  \"type:data-access\",\n                  \"type:util\"\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:ui\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"type:ui\", \"type:util\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:data-access\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"type:data-access\", \"type:util\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"type:util\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"type:util\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"scope:web\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"scope:web\", \"scope:shared\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"scope:api\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"scope:api\", \"scope:shared\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"sourceTag\": \"scope:shared\",\n                \"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags\": [\"scope:shared\"]\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Template 4: Custom Generator\n\n```typescript\n// tools/generators/feature-lib/index.ts\nimport {\n  Tree,\n  formatFiles,\n  generateFiles,\n  joinPathFragments,\n  names,\n  readProjectConfiguration,\n} from \"@nx/devkit\";\nimport { libraryGenerator } from \"@nx/react\";\n\ninterface FeatureLibraryGeneratorSchema {\n  name: string;\n  scope: string;\n  directory?: string;\n}\n\nexport default async function featureLibraryGenerator(\n  tree: Tree,\n  options: FeatureLibraryGeneratorSchema,\n) {\n  const { name, scope, directory } = options;\n  const projectDirectory = directory\n    ? `${directory}/${name}`\n    : `libs/${scope}/feature-${name}`;\n\n  // Generate base library\n  await libraryGenerator(tree, {\n    name: `feature-${name}`,\n    directory: projectDirectory,\n    tags: `type:feature,scope:${scope}`,\n    style: \"css\",\n    skipTsConfig: false,\n    skipFormat: true,\n    unitTestRunner: \"jest\",\n    linter: \"eslint\",\n  });\n\n  // Add custom files\n  const projectConfig = readProjectConfiguration(\n    tree,\n    `${scope}-feature-${name}`,\n  );\n  const projectNames = names(name);\n\n  generateFiles(\n    tree,\n    joinPathFragments(__dirname, \"files\"),\n    projectConfig.sourceRoot,\n    {\n      ...projectNames,\n      scope,\n      tmpl: \"\",\n    },\n  );\n\n  await formatFiles(tree);\n}\n```\n\n### Template 5: CI Configuration with Affected\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/ci.yml\nname: CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\nenv:\n  NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}\n\njobs:\n  main:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: 20\n          cache: \"npm\"\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Derive SHAs for affected commands\n        uses: nrwl/nx-set-shas@v4\n\n      - name: Run affected lint\n        run: npx nx affected -t lint --parallel=3\n\n      - name: Run affected test\n        run: npx nx affected -t test --parallel=3 --configuration=ci\n\n      - name: Run affected build\n        run: npx nx affected -t build --parallel=3\n\n      - name: Run affected e2e\n        run: npx nx affected -t e2e --parallel=1\n```\n\n### Template 6: Remote Caching Setup\n\n```typescript\n// nx.json with Nx Cloud\n{\n  \"tasksRunnerOptions\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"runner\": \"nx-cloud\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"cacheableOperations\": [\"build\", \"lint\", \"test\", \"e2e\"],\n        \"accessToken\": \"your-nx-cloud-token\",\n        \"parallel\": 3,\n        \"cacheDirectory\": \".nx/cache\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"nxCloudAccessToken\": \"your-nx-cloud-token\"\n}\n\n// Self-hosted cache with S3\n{\n  \"tasksRunnerOptions\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"runner\": \"@nx-aws-cache/nx-aws-cache\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"cacheableOperations\": [\"build\", \"lint\", \"test\"],\n        \"awsRegion\": \"us-east-1\",\n        \"awsBucket\": \"my-nx-cache-bucket\",\n        \"awsProfile\": \"default\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Generate new library\nnx g @nx/react:lib feature-auth --directory=libs/web --tags=type:feature,scope:web\n\n# Run affected tests\nnx affected -t test --base=main\n\n# View dependency graph\nnx graph\n\n# Run specific project\nnx build web --configuration=production\n\n# Reset cache\nnx reset\n\n# Run migrations\nnx migrate latest\nnx migrate --run-migrations\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Use tags consistently** - Enforce with module boundaries\n- **Enable caching early** - Significant CI savings\n- **Keep libs focused** - Single responsibility\n- **Use generators** - Ensure consistency\n- **Document boundaries** - Help new developers\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t create circular deps** - Graph should be acyclic\n- **Don''t skip affected** - Test only what changed\n- **Don''t ignore boundaries** - Tech debt accumulates\n- **Don''t over-granularize** - Balance lib count\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Nx Documentation](https://nx.dev/getting-started/intro)\n- [Module Boundaries](https://nx.dev/core-features/enforce-module-boundaries)\n- [Nx Cloud](https://nx.app/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:32:39.001Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for monorepo management agents needing advanced Nx workspace configuration and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Nx工作区配置和优化能力的单仓库管理代理。","ja":"Nxワークスペースの高度な構成と最適化機能を必要とするモノレポ管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Nx 작업 영역 구성 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 모노레포 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de monorepo que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de configuración y optimización del espacio de trabajo de Nx.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de monorepo ayant besoin de capacités de configuration et d''optimisation avancées de l''espace de travail Nx.","de":"Perfekt für Monorepo-Management-Agenten, die erweiterte Nx-Arbeitsbereichskonfigurations- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de gerenciamento de monorepo que precisam de configuração e capacidades de otimização avançadas do espaço de trabalho Nx.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления монорепозиторием, требующих расширенной настройки и возможностей оптимизации рабочего пространства Nx.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة مونوربو الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوين متقدم وخصائص تحسين空间 العمل Nx."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize CI with affected commands, implement remote caching, and manage dependencies between projects using Nx monorepo management, leveraging libraries and project boundaries for efficient development.","zh":"赋予代理优化CI的能力，使用受影响的命令，实现远程缓存，并使用Nx单仓库管理来管理项目之间的依赖，利用库和项目边界进行高效开发。","ja":"エージェントにCIの最適化を可能にし、影響を受けるコマンドを使用してリモートキャッシュを実装し、Nxモノレポ管理を使用してプロジェクト間の依存関係を管理し、ライブラリとプロジェクトの境界を使用して効率的な開発を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에 CI를 최적화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 영향을 받는 명령을 사용하여 원격 캐싱을 구현하고 Nx 모노레포 관리를 사용하여 프로젝트 간의 종속성을 관리하며 라이브러리와 프로젝트 경계를 사용하여 효율적인 개발을 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar la integración continua con comandos afectados, implementar la memorización remota y gestionar las dependencias entre proyectos mediante la gestión de monorepo de Nx, aprovechando las bibliotecas y los límites de proyecto para un desarrollo eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser l''intégration continue avec des commandes affectées, de mettre en œuvre la mise en cache distante et de gérer les dépendances entre les projets à l''aide de la gestion de monorepo Nx, en exploitant les bibliothèques et les limites de projet pour un développement efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die kontinuierliche Integration mit betroffenen Befehlen zu optimieren, Remote-Caching zu implementieren und Abhängigkeiten zwischen Projekten mithilfe der Nx-Monorepo-Verwaltung zu verwalten, indem Bibliotheken und Projektgrenzen für eine effiziente Entwicklung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o CI com comandos afetados, implementar cache remoto e gerenciar dependências entre projetos usando o gerenciamento de monorepo Nx, aproveitando bibliotecas e limites de projeto para desenvolvimento eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать CI с помощью пострадавших команд, реализовать удаленный кэш и управлять зависимостями между проектами с помощью управления монорепозиторием Nx, используя библиотеки и границы проекта для эффективной разработки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين سي مع أوامر المتضررين، وتطبيق ذاكرة مؤقتة عن بعد، وإدارة التبعيات بين المشاريع باستخدام إدارة مونوربو Nx، واستخدام المكتبات وحدود المشروع من أجل التطوير الفعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up new Nx workspaces with optimized project structures","Configuring project boundaries for efficient dependency management","Optimizing CI pipelines with affected commands for faster build times"],"zh":["使用优化的项目结构设置新的Nx工作区","为高效的依赖管理配置项目边界","使用受影响的命令优化CI管道以实现更快的构建时间"],"ja":["最適化されたプロジェクト構造で新しいNxワークスペースを設定する","効率的な依存関係管理のためにプロジェクトの境界を構成する","影響を受けるコマンドを使用してCIパイプラインを最適化し、ビルド時間を短縮する"],"ko":["최적화된 프로젝트 구조로新的 Nx 작업 영역을 설정","효율적인 종속성 관리를 위한 프로젝트 경계를 구성","영향을 받는 명령을 사용하여 CI 파이프라인을 최적화하여 빌드 시간을 단축"],"es":["Configuración de nuevos espacios de trabajo de Nx con estructuras de proyecto optimizadas","Configuración de límites de proyecto para una gestión eficiente de dependencias","Optimización de tuberías de integración continua con comandos afectados para tiempos de compilación más rápidos"],"fr":["Configuration de nouveaux espaces de travail Nx avec des structures de projet optimisées","Configuration des limites de projet pour une gestion efficace des dépendances","Optimisation des pipelines d''intégration continue avec des commandes affectées pour des temps de construction plus rapides"],"de":["Einrichtung neuer Nx-Arbeitsbereiche mit optimierten Projektstrukturen","Konfiguration von Projektgrenzen für eine effiziente Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Optimierung von CI-Pipelines mit betroffenen Befehlen für schnellere Build-Zeiten"],"pt":["Configuração de novos espaços de trabalho Nx com estruturas de projeto otimizadas","Configuração de limites de projeto para gerenciamento eficiente de dependências","Otimização de pipelines de CI com comandos afetados para tempos de compilação mais rápidos"],"ru":["Настройка новых рабочих пространств Nx с оптимизированной структурой проектов","Настройка границ проекта для эффективного управления зависимостями","Оптимизация конвейеров CI с пострадавшими командами для более быстрого времени сборки"],"ar":["تهيئة مساحات العمل الجديدة Nx مع هيكل مشروع محسّن","تهيئة حدود المشروع لإدارة التبعيات الفعالة","تحسين أنابيب سي مع أوامر المتضررين لأوقات بناء أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nx monorepo setup","Limited to Nx workspace management","Familiarity with Nx architecture and libraries required"],"zh":["需要Nx单仓库设置","仅限于Nx工作区管理","需要熟悉Nx架构和库"],"ja":["Nxモノレポの設定が必要","Nxワークスペース管理のみに限定","Nxアーキテクチャとライブラリの知識が必要"],"ko":["Nx 모노레포 설정이 필요","Nx 작업 영역 관리에만 한정","Nx 아키텍처 및 라이브러리 熟悉が 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de monorepo de Nx","Limitado a la gestión del espacio de trabajo de Nx","Se requiere familiaridad con la arquitectura y las bibliotecas de Nx"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de monorepo Nx","Limité à la gestion de l''espace de travail Nx","Une connaissance de l''architecture et des bibliothèques Nx est requise"],"de":["Benötigt Nx-Monorepo-Setup","Begrenzt auf Nx-Arbeitsbereichsverwaltung","Kenntnisse der Nx-Architektur und -Bibliotheken erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração de monorepo Nx","Limitado ao gerenciamento de espaço de trabalho Nx","Necessário conhecimento da arquitetura e bibliotecas Nx"],"ru":["Требует настройки монорепозитория Nx","Ограничен управлением рабочим пространством Nx","Требуется знание архитектуры и библиотек Nx"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مونوربو Nx","محدود بإدارة مساحة العمل Nx","يتطلب معرفة بنية وسمات Nx"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
