 site web","Identification des problèmes d''indexation","Optimisation des métadonnées et des titres","Analyse du contenu et de la qualité","Recommandations pour améliorer les performances de recherche"],"de":["Analyse der Website-Struktur","Identifizierung von Indexierungsproblemen","Optimierung von Meta-Tags und Titeln","Inhalts- und Qualitätsanalyse","Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Suchleistung"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas de otimização","Análise de desempenho de busca orgânica","Recomendações para melhorar a presença online","Análise de estrutura de site","Otimização de conteúdo","Análise de links"],"ru":["Выявление проблем оптимизации","Анализ органического поиска","Рекомендации для улучшения онлайн-присутствия","Анализ структуры сайта","Оптимизация контента","Анализ ссылок"],"ar":["تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث","تحليل أداء البحث العضوي","توصيات لتحسين الحضور عبر الإنترنت","تحليل هيكل الموقع","تحسين المحتوى","تحليل الروابط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审计","搜索引擎优化","网站优化","关键词研究","内容优化","链接建设"],"ja":["SEO オーディット","検索エンジン最適化","Web サイト最適化","キーワードリサーチ","コンテンツ最適化","リンクビルディング"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","웹 사이트 최적화","키워드 연구","콘텐츠 최적화","링크 빌딩"],"es":["análisis SEO","optimización de sitio web","mejora del rendimiento de búsqueda","recomendaciones para desarrolladores","identificación de problemas de indexación","optimización de metaetiquetas"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation de site web","amélioration des performances de recherche","recommandations pour les développeurs","identification des problèmes d''indexation","optimisation des métadonnées"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Website-Optimierung","Verbesserung der Suchleistung","Empfehlungen für Entwickler","Identifizierung von Indexierungsproblemen","Optimierung von Meta-Tags"],"pt":["auditoria de seo","otimização de site","desempenho de busca orgânica","presença online","recomendações de seo","análise de site","otimização de conteúdo","links de qualidade"],"ru":["аудит seo","оптимизация сайта","органический поиск","онлайн-присутствие","рекомендации по seo","анализ сайта","оптимизация контента","качественные ссылки"],"ar":["تدقيق محركات البحث","تحسين موقع","البحث العضوي","الحضور عبر الإنترنت","توصيات محركات البحث","تحليل الموقع","تحسين المحتوى","روابط جودة"]}},"owner":"santipdmonte","repo":"CIVetRosario-LandingPage-Tailwind","repoPath":"santipdmonte/CIVetRosario-LandingPage-Tailwind","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:33:23.088Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for SEO Analysis Agents seeking to identify optimization opportunities in website structures and content.","zh":"适合于寻求在网站结构和内容中识别优化机会的SEO分析代理","ja":"SEO分析エージェントがWebサイトの構造とコンテンツの中で最適化の機会を特定しようとしている場合に適しています","ko":"웹사이트 구조와 콘텐츠에서 최적화 기회를 식별하려는 SEO 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de SEO que buscan identificar oportunidades de optimización en estructuras y contenido de sitios web.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de SEO qui cherchent à identifier les opportunités d''optimisation dans les structures et le contenu des sites Web.","de":"Ideal für SEO-Analyse-Agenten, die Optimierungsmöglichkeiten in Website-Strukturen und -Inhalten identifizieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de SEO que buscam identificar oportunidades de otimização em estruturas e conteúdo de sites.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа SEO, стремящихся выявить возможности оптимизации в структурах и содержании веб-сайтов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل SEO الذين يبحثون عن تحديد فرص تحسين في هياكل ومحتوى المواقع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough SEO audits, analyzing site context, product marketing context, and providing actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance, utilizing files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and understanding site types and structures.","zh":"赋予代理进行彻底的SEO审计的能力，分析网站背景、产品营销背景，并利用诸如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`的文件，了解网站类型和结构，为改善有机搜索性能提供可行的建议","ja":"SEOオーディットを徹底的に実施するエージェントの能力を付与し、サイトのコンテキスト、製品マーケティングのコンテキストを分析し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などのファイルを利用してサイトの種類と構造を理解し、有機検索性能の改善に役立つ実行可能な推奨事項を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 웹 사이트 컨텍스트, 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 분석하고 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일을 사용하여 웹 사이트 유형과 구조를 이해하여 유기적 검색 성능을 개선하기 위한 실행 가능한 권장 사항을 제공하는 것을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de SEO exhaustivas, analizando el contexto del sitio, el contexto de marketing de productos y proporcionando recomendaciones acciones para mejorar el rendimiento de la búsqueda orgánica, utilizando archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y comprendiendo los tipos y estructuras de sitios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des audits de SEO exhaustifs, en analysant le contexte du site, le contexte de marketing de produits et en fournissant des recommandations actionnables pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique, en utilisant des fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en comprenant les types et les structures de sites.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende SEO-Audits durchzuführen, indem sie den Kontext der Website, den Kontext des Produktmarketings analysieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der organischen Suchleistung bereitstellen, unter Verwendung von Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` und unter Berücksichtigung von Website-Typen und -Strukturen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de SEO abrangentes, analisando o contexto do site, o contexto de marketing de produtos e fornecendo recomendações eficazes para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica, utilizando arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e entendendo os tipos e estruturas de sites.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить всесторонние аудиты SEO, анализируя контекст сайта, контекст маркетинга продукции и предоставляя действенные рекомендации для улучшения органического поискового результата, используя файлы типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и понимая типы и структуры сайтов.","ar":"تمكين العميل من إجراء تدقيقات شاملة لتحليل SEO، وتحليل سياق الموقع وسياق تسويق المنتج، وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي، باستخدام ملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وفهم أنواع وهياكل المواقع"},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website landing pages for SEO issues","Analyzing site context to inform optimization strategies","Generating actionable recommendations for improving organic search rankings"],"zh":["为SEO问题审核网站着陆页","分析网站背景以指导优化策略","生成改善有机搜索排名的可行建议"],"ja":["SEOの問題を解決するためのウェブサイトのランディングページをオーディットする","最適化戦略を導くためにサイトのコンテキストを分析する","有機検索ランキングを改善するための実行可能な推奨事項を生成する"],"ko":["SEO 문제를 해결하기 위한 웹사이트 랜딩 페이지 감사","최적화 전략을 안내하기 위한 사이트 컨텍스트 분석","유기적 검색 순위를 개선하기 위한 실행 가능한 제안 생성"],"es":["Auditoría de páginas de destino de sitios web para problemas de SEO","Análisis del contexto del sitio para informar estrategias de optimización","Generación de recomendaciones acciónables para mejorar los rankings de búsqueda orgánica"],"fr":["Audit des pages de destination de sites Web pour les problèmes de SEO","Analyse du contexte du site pour éclairer les stratégies d''optimisation","Génération de recommandations actionnables pour améliorer les classements de recherche organique"],"de":["Prüfung der Website-Landingpages auf SEO-Probleme","Analyse des Website-Kontexts, um Optimierungsstrategien zu informieren","Erstellung von handhabbaren Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der organischen Suchrankings"],"pt":["Auditoria de páginas de destino de sites para problemas de SEO","Análise do contexto do site para informar estratégias de otimização","Geração de recomendações eficazes para melhorar os rankings de busca orgânica"],"ru":["Проверка страниц сайта на наличие проблем с SEO","Анализ контекста сайта для информирования стратегий оптимизации","Генерация эффективных рекомендаций для улучшения органического поискового результата"],"ar":["تدقيق صفحات الوجهة للمواقع لمشاكل تحليل SEO","تحليل سياق الموقع لإعلام استراتيجيات التحسين","توليد توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين ترتيب البحث العضوي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site context information","Dependent on the existence of specific files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for product marketing context"],"zh":["需要访问网站背景信息","依赖于诸如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`的特定文件来获得产品营销背景"],"ja":["サイトのコンテキスト情報へのアクセスが必要","`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などの特定のファイルの存在に依存して製品マーケティングのコンテキストを取得する"],"ko":["사이트 컨텍스트 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요함",".claude/product-marketing-context.md와 같은 특정 파일의 존재에 의존하여 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 얻음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la información del contexto del sitio","Depende de la existencia de archivos específicos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para el contexto de marketing de productos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux informations de contexte du site","Dépend de l''existence de fichiers spécifiques tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour le contexte de marketing de produits"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Website-Kontextinformationen","Hängt von der Existenz spezifischer Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für den Produktmarketing-Kontext ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso a informações de contexto do site","Dependente da existência de arquivos específicos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto de marketing de produtos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к информации контекста сайта","Зависит от существования конкретных файлов типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для контекста маркетинга продукции"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معلومات سياق الموقع","يعتمد على وجود ملفات محددة مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لسياق تسويق المنتج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
