"SEO 감사 도구는 의료 수송 CRM의 SEO 문제를 식별하고 개선 전략을 제공합니다","es":"Nuestro análisis de SEO identifica problemas y proporciona recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda de tu CRM de transporte médico","fr":"Notre audit SEO identifie les problèmes et fournit des recommandations pour améliorer les performances de recherche de votre CRM de transport médical","de":"Unser SEO-Audit identifiziert Probleme und liefert Empfehlungen, um die Suchleistung Ihres medizinischen Transport-CRM zu verbessern","pt":"Nossa auditoria de SEO para CRM de transporte médico identifica problemas e fornece recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca","ru":"Наша аудит SEO для CRM медицинского транспорта выявляет проблемы и предоставляет рекомендации для улучшения поискового трафика","ar":"تدقيقنا لمحركات البحث لبرنامج إدارة علاقات العملاء للنقل الطبي يحدد المشاكل ويوفر توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث","en":"medical transportaion crm"},"definition":{"en":"medical transportaion crm"},"features":{"zh":["网站分析","SEO 问题识别","优化建议","搜索引擎排名提升","网站可见度提高"],"ja":["ウェブサイト分析","SEO 問題の特定","最適化提案","検索エンジンランキングの向上","ウェブサイトの可視性の向上"],"ko":["웹 사이트 분석","SEO 문제 식별","최적화 제안","검색 엔진 순위 향상","웹 사이트 가시성 향상"],"es":["Análisis de estructura de sitio web","Optimización de contenido y metadatos","Identificación de problemas técnicos","Recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda","Análisis de competidores y oportunidades de mejora","Informes personalizados y seguimiento de progreso"],"fr":["Analyse de la structure du site web","Optimisation du contenu et des métadonnées","Identification des problèmes techniques","Recommandations pour améliorer les performances de recherche","Analyse des concurrents et des opportunités d''amélioration","Rapports personnalisés et suivi des progrès"],"de":["Analyse der Website-Struktur","Optimierung von Inhalt und Metadaten","Identifizierung von technischen Problemen","Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Suchleistung","Analyse von Wettbewerbern und Verbesserungsmöglichkeiten","Individuelle Berichte und Verlaufsüberwachung"],"pt":["Análise de palavras-chave","Otimização de meta tags","Análise de links internos e externos","Avaliação de conteúdo de qualidade","Recomendações personalizadas para melhorar o desempenho de busca"],"ru":["Анализ ключевых слов","Оптимизация мета-тегов","Анализ внутренних и внешних ссылок","Оценка качественного контента","Индивидуальные рекомендации для улучшения поискового трафика"],"ar":["تحليل الكلمات المفتاحية","تحسين وسوم الميتا","تحليل الروابط الداخلية والخارجية","تقييم المحتوى ذو الجودة","توصيات مخصصة لتحسين أداء البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审计","医疗运输 CRM","搜索引擎优化","网站分析","SEO 问题识别","优化建议"],"ja":["SEO オーディット","医療輸送 CRM","検索エンジン最適化","ウェブサイト分析","SEO 問題の特定","最適化提案"],"ko":["SEO 감사","의료 수송 CRM","검색 엔진 최적화","웹 사이트 분석","SEO 문제 식별","최적화 제안"],"es":["análisis de SEO","CRM de transporte médico","optimización de búsqueda","mejora de rendimiento de búsqueda","análisis de competidores","informes de SEO","recomendaciones de SEO","soluciones de SEO","herramientas de SEO"],"fr":["audit SEO","CRM de transport médical","optimisation de recherche","amélioration des performances de recherche","analyse des concurrents","rapports SEO","recommandations SEO","solutions SEO","outils SEO"],"de":["SEO-Audit","medizinisches Transport-CRM","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung","Verbesserung der Suchleistung","Wettbewerbsanalyse","SEO-Berichte","SEO-Empfehlungen","SEO-Lösungen","SEO-Tools"],"pt":["auditoria de SEO","CRM de transporte médico","otimização de motores de busca","desempenho de busca orgânica","recomendações de SEO","análise de palavras-chave"],"ru":["аудит SEO","CRM медицинского транспорта","оптимизация поисковых систем","органический поисковый трафик","рекомендации SEO","анализ ключевых слов"],"ar":["تدقيق محركات البحث","برنامج إدارة علاقات العملاء للنقل الطبي","تحسين محركات البحث","أداء محركات البحث العضوية","توصيات لمحركات البحث","تحليل الكلمات المفتاحية"]}},"owner":"Yahia89","repo":"meditrans","repoPath":"Yahia89/meditrans","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:33:36.097Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing advanced SEO analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO分析和优化功能的数字营销代理。","ja":"高度なSEO分析および最適化機能を必要とするデジタルマーケティングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 분석 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan un análisis y capacidades de optimización de SEO avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique qui ont besoin d''une analyse et de capacités d''optimisation de SEO avancées.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte SEO-Analyse- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que necessitam de análise e capacidades de otimização de SEO avançadas.","ru":"Идеально для цифровых маркетинговых агентов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности анализа и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الرقميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم وقدرات تحسين محركات البحث"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance using product marketing context and site assessment, including understanding site type and context.","zh":"赋予代理商识别SEO问题并提供可行建议的能力，以提高有机搜索性能，利用产品营销背景和站点评估，包括了解站点类型和背景。","ja":"エージェントにSEOの問題を特定し、製品マーケティングのコンテキストとサイトの評価を使用して、有機検索のパフォーマンスを改善するための実行可能な推奨事項を提供する能力を与えます。これには、サイトの種類とコンテキストを理解することも含まれます。","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 문제를 식별하고 제품 마케팅 맥락 및 사이트 평가를 사용하여 유기적 검색 성능을 개선하기 위한 실행 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 이는 사이트 유형 및 맥락을 이해하는 것도 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones con acciones para mejorar el rendimiento de la búsqueda orgánica utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos y la evaluación del sitio, incluyendo la comprensión del tipo y contexto del sitio.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations avec des actions pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits et l''évaluation du site, y compris la compréhension du type et du contexte du site.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und umsetzbare Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der organischen Suchleistung unter Verwendung des Produktmarketing-Kontexts und der Standortbewertung bereitzustellen, einschließlich des Verständnisses der Standortart und des Kontexts.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações concretas para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica usando contexto de marketing de produtos e avaliação do site, incluindo a compreensão do tipo e contexto do site.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации для улучшения органического поискового показателя с использованием контекста маркетинга продукта и оценки сайта, включая понимание типа и контекста сайта.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتجات وتقييم الموقع ، بما في ذلك فهم نوع السياق الموقع"},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website SEO performance","Generating recommendations for search engine optimization","Analyzing site context for product marketing"],"zh":["审计网站SEO性能","生成搜索引擎优化建议","分析产品营销的站点背景"],"ja":["ウェブサイトのSEOパフォーマンスを監査する","検索エンジン最適化の推奨事項を生成する","製品マーケティングのサイトコンテキストを分析する"],"ko":["웹사이트 SEO 성능 감사","검색 엔진 최적화에 대한 제안 생성","제품 마케팅을 위한 사이트 Context 분석"],"es":["Auditoría del rendimiento de SEO del sitio web","Generación de recomendaciones para la optimización del motor de búsqueda","Análisis del contexto del sitio para el marketing de productos"],"fr":["Audit des performances de SEO du site Web","Génération de recommandations pour l''optimisation du moteur de recherche","Analyse du contexte du site pour le marketing de produits"],"de":["Prüfung der SEO-Leistung der Website","Generierung von Empfehlungen für die Suchmaschinenoptimierung","Analyse des Kontexts der Website für das Produktmarketing"],"pt":["Auditoria do desempenho de SEO do site","Geração de recomendações para otimização de mecanismos de busca","Análise do contexto do site para marketing de produtos"],"ru":["Аудит показателей SEO сайта","Генерация рекомендаций для оптимизации поисковых систем","Анализ контекста сайта для маркетинга продукта"],"ar":["مراجعة أداء محركات البحث للเว็บไซต","توليد التوصيات لتحسين محركات البحث","تحليل سياق الموقع لتسويق المنتج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site context and product marketing information","Limited to organic search performance optimization"],"zh":["需要访问站点背景和产品营销信息","仅限于有机搜索性能优化"],"ja":["サイトのコンテキストと製品マーケティング情報へのアクセスが必要","有機検索パフォーマンスの最適化のみ"],"ko":["사이트 Context 및 제품 마케팅 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요함","유기적 검색 성능 최적화에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al contexto del sitio y a la información de marketing de productos","Limitado a la optimización del rendimiento de la búsqueda orgánica"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au contexte du site et aux informations de marketing de produits","Limité à l''optimisation des performances de recherche organique"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf den Kontext der Website und die Produktmarketing-Informationen","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung der organischen Suchleistung"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao contexto do site e informações de marketing de produtos","Limitado à otimização do desempenho de busca orgânica"],"ru":["Требует доступа к контексту сайта и информации о маркетинге продукта","Ограничен оптимизацией органического поискового показателя"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سياق الموقع ومعلومات تسويق المنتج","محدود بتحسين أداء البحث العضوي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
