적인 보안 감사를 제공합니다","es":"El auditoría de seguridad Convex es un conjunto de patrones de revisión de seguridad para aplicaciones Convex.","fr":"L''audit de sécurité Convex est un ensemble de modèles de révision de sécurité pour les applications Convex.","de":"Der Convex-Sicherheitsaudit ist eine Sammlung von Sicherheitsprüfmustern für Convex-Anwendungen.","pt":"A auditoria de segurança Convex é um processo de revisão de segurança abrangente para aplicações Convex, incluindo lógica de autorização e isolamento de ações","ru":"Аудит безопасности Convex - это комплексный процесс проверки безопасности для приложений Convex, включая логику авторизации и изоляцию действий","ar":"تدقيق أمن كونفكس هو عملية مراجعة أمان شاملة لتطبيقات كونفكس، بما في ذلك منطق التصريح وعزل الإجراءات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["授权逻辑审计","数据访问边界审计","动作隔离审计","速率限制审计","敏感操作保护审计"],"ja":["認証ロジック監査","データアクセス境界監査","アクション分離監査","レート制限監査","機密操作保護監査"],"ko":["인증 논리 감사","데이터 액세스 경계 감사","액션 분리 감사","속도 제한 감사","민감한 작업 보호 감사"],"es":["Lógica de autorización","Límites de acceso a datos","Aislamiento de acciones","Limitación de velocidad","Protección de operaciones sensibles"],"fr":["Logique d''autorisation","Limites d''accès aux données","Isolement des actions","Limitation de vitesse","Protection des opérations sensibles"],"de":["Autorisierungslogik","Datenzugriffsbegrenzungen","Aktionstrennung","Rate Limiting","Schutz sensibler Operationen"],"pt":["Análise de lógica de autorização","Verificação de limites de acesso a dados","Isolamento de ações","Limitação de taxa","Proteção de operações sensíveis"],"ru":["Анализ логики авторизации","Проверка границ доступа к данным","Изоляция действий","Ограничение скорости","Защита чувствительных операций"],"ar":["تحليل منطق التصريح","التحقق من حدود الوصول إلى البيانات","عزل الإجراءات","تحديد الحد الأقصى للسرعة","حماية العمليات الحساسة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 安全审计","Convex 应用程序安全","授权逻辑审计","数据访问边界审计","速率限制审计","Convex 安全最佳实践"],"ja":["Convex セキュリティ監査","Convex アプリケーションセキュリティ","認証ロジック監査","データアクセス境界監査","レート制限監査","Convex セキュリティベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Convex 보안 감사","Convex 애플리케이션 보안","인증 논리 감사","데이터 액세스 경계 감사","속도 제한 감사","Convex 보안最佳实践"],"es":["seguridad Convex","auditoría de seguridad","aplicaciones Convex","autorización","acceso a datos","aislamiento de acciones"],"fr":["sécurité Convex","audit de sécurité","applications Convex","autorisation","accès aux données","isolement des actions"],"de":["Convex-Sicherheit","Sicherheitsaudit","Convex-Anwendungen","Autorisierung","Datenzugriff","Aktionstrennung"],"pt":["auditoria de segurança convex","segurança de aplicações","autorização","acesso a dados","isolamento de ações","limitação de taxa"],"ru":["аудит безопасности convex","безопасность приложений","авторизация","доступ к данным","изоляция действий","ограничение скорости"],"ar":["تدقيق أمن كونفكس","أمان التطبيقات","التصريح","وصول إلى البيانات","عزل الإجراءات","تحديد الحد الأقصى للسرعة"]}},"owner":"gursheyss","repo":"styx","repoPath":"gursheyss/styx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-security-audit","description":"Deep security review patterns for authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","security","audit","authorization","rate-limiting","protection"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Security Audit\n\nComprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications including authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n###","body":"# Convex Security Audit\n\nComprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications including authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Security Audit Areas\n\n1. **Authorization Logic** - Who can do what\n2. **Data Access Boundaries** - What data users can see\n3. **Action Isolation** - Protecting external API calls\n4. **Rate Limiting** - Preventing abuse\n5. **Sensitive Operations** - Protecting critical functions\n\n### Authorization Logic Audit\n\n#### Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```typescript\n// convex/lib/auth.ts\nimport { QueryCtx, MutationCtx } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { Doc } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n\ntype UserRole = \"user\" | \"moderator\" | \"admin\" | \"superadmin\";\n\nconst roleHierarchy: Record<UserRole, number> = {\n  user: 0,\n  moderator: 1,\n  admin: 2,\n  superadmin: 3,\n};\n\nexport async function getUser(ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx): Promise<Doc<\"users\"> | null> {\n  const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n  if (!identity) return null;\n\n  return await ctx.db\n    .query(\"users\")\n    .withIndex(\"by_tokenIdentifier\", (q) => q.eq(\"tokenIdentifier\", identity.tokenIdentifier))\n    .unique();\n}\n\nexport async function requireRole(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx,\n  minRole: UserRole,\n): Promise<Doc<\"users\">> {\n  const user = await getUser(ctx);\n\n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\",\n      message: \"Authentication required\",\n    });\n  }\n\n  const userRoleLevel = roleHierarchy[user.role as UserRole] ?? 0;\n  const requiredLevel = roleHierarchy[minRole];\n\n  if (userRoleLevel < requiredLevel) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: `Role ''${minRole}'' or higher required`,\n    });\n  }\n\n  return user;\n}\n\n// Permission-based check\ntype Permission = \"read:users\" | \"write:users\" | \"delete:users\" | \"admin:system\";\n\nconst rolePermissions: Record<UserRole, Permission[]> = {\n  user: [\"read:users\"],\n  moderator: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\"],\n  admin: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\", \"delete:users\"],\n  superadmin: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\", \"delete:users\", \"admin:system\"],\n};\n\nexport async function requirePermission(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx,\n  permission: Permission,\n): Promise<Doc<\"users\">> {\n  const user = await getUser(ctx);\n\n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({ code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\", message: \"Authentication required\" });\n  }\n\n  const userRole = user.role as UserRole;\n  const permissions = rolePermissions[userRole] ?? [];\n\n  if (!permissions.includes(permission)) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: `Permission ''${permission}'' required`,\n    });\n  }\n\n  return user;\n}\n```\n\n### Data Access Boundaries Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/data.ts\nimport { query, mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { getUser, requireRole } from \"./lib/auth\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// Audit: Users can only see their own data\nexport const getMyData = query({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.array(\n    v.object({\n      _id: v.id(\"userData\"),\n      content: v.string(),\n    }),\n  ),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    if (!user) return [];\n\n    // SECURITY: Filter by userId\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"userData\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", user._id))\n      .collect();\n  },\n});\n\n// Audit: Verify ownership before returning sensitive data\nexport const getSensitiveItem = query({\n  args: { itemId: v.id(\"sensitiveItems\") },\n  returns: v.union(\n    v.object({\n      _id: v.id(\"sensitiveItems\"),\n      secret: v.string(),\n    }),\n    v.null(),\n  ),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    if (!user) return null;\n\n    const item = await ctx.db.get(args.itemId);\n\n    // SECURITY: Verify ownership\n    if (!item || item.ownerId !== user._id) {\n      return null; // Don''t reveal if item exists\n    }\n\n    return item;\n  },\n});\n\n// Audit: Shared resources with access list\nexport const getSharedDocument = query({\n  args: { docId: v.id(\"documents\") },\n  returns: v.union(\n    v.object({\n      _id: v.id(\"documents\"),\n      content: v.string(),\n      accessLevel: v.string(),\n    }),\n    v.null(),\n  ),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    const doc = await ctx.db.get(args.docId);\n\n    if (!doc) return null;\n\n    // Public documents\n    if (doc.visibility === \"public\") {\n      return { ...doc, accessLevel: \"public\" };\n    }\n\n    // Must be authenticated for non-public\n    if (!user) return null;\n\n    // Owner has full access\n    if (doc.ownerId === user._id) {\n      return { ...doc, accessLevel: \"owner\" };\n    }\n\n    // Check shared access\n    const access = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"documentAccess\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_doc_and_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"documentId\", args.docId).eq(\"userId\", user._id))\n      .unique();\n\n    if (!access) return null;\n\n    return { ...doc, accessLevel: access.level };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Action Isolation Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/actions.ts\n\"use node\";\n\nimport { action, internalAction } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { api, internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// SECURITY: Never expose API keys in responses\nexport const callExternalAPI = action({\n  args: { query: v.string() },\n  returns: v.object({ result: v.string() }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Verify user is authenticated\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    if (!identity) {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n    }\n\n    // Get API key from environment (not hardcoded)\n    const apiKey = process.env.EXTERNAL_API_KEY;\n    if (!apiKey) {\n      throw new Error(\"API key not configured\");\n    }\n\n    // Log usage for audit trail\n    await ctx.runMutation(internal.audit.logAPICall, {\n      userId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      endpoint: \"external-api\",\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n\n    const response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/query\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: {\n        Authorization: `Bearer ${apiKey}`,\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ query: args.query }),\n    });\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      // Don''t expose external API error details\n      throw new ConvexError(\"External service unavailable\");\n    }\n\n    const data = await response.json();\n\n    // Sanitize response before returning\n    return { result: sanitizeResponse(data) };\n  },\n});\n\n// Internal action - not exposed to clients\nexport const _processPayment = internalAction({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    amount: v.number(),\n    paymentMethodId: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ success: v.boolean(), transactionId: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const stripeKey = process.env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY;\n\n    // Process payment with Stripe\n    // This should NEVER be exposed as a public action\n\n    return { success: true, transactionId: \"txn_xxx\" };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Rate Limiting Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/rateLimit.ts\nimport { mutation, query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\nconst RATE_LIMITS = {\n  message: { requests: 10, windowMs: 60000 }, // 10 per minute\n  upload: { requests: 5, windowMs: 300000 }, // 5 per 5 minutes\n  api: { requests: 100, windowMs: 3600000 }, // 100 per hour\n};\n\nexport const checkRateLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.string(),\n    action: v.union(v.literal(\"message\"), v.literal(\"upload\"), v.literal(\"api\")),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ allowed: v.boolean(), retryAfter: v.optional(v.number()) }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const limit = RATE_LIMITS[args.action];\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - limit.windowMs;\n\n    // Count requests in window\n    const requests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"rateLimits\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user_and_action\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", args.userId).eq(\"action\", args.action))\n      .filter((q) => q.gt(q.field(\"timestamp\"), windowStart))\n      .collect();\n\n    if (requests.length >= limit.requests) {\n      const oldestRequest = requests[0];\n      const retryAfter = oldestRequest.timestamp + limit.windowMs - now;\n\n      return { allowed: false, retryAfter };\n    }\n\n    // Record this request\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"rateLimits\", {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      action: args.action,\n      timestamp: now,\n    });\n\n    return { allowed: true };\n  },\n});\n\n// Use in mutations\nexport const sendMessage = mutation({\n  args: { content: v.string() },\n  returns: v.id(\"messages\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    if (!identity) throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n\n    // Check rate limit\n    const rateCheck = await checkRateLimit(ctx, {\n      userId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      action: \"message\",\n    });\n\n    if (!rateCheck.allowed) {\n      throw new ConvexError({\n        code: \"RATE_LIMITED\",\n        message: `Too many requests. Try again in ${Math.ceil(rateCheck.retryAfter! / 1000)} seconds`,\n      });\n    }\n\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"messages\", {\n      content: args.content,\n      authorId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Sensitive Operations Protection\n\n```typescript\n// convex/admin.ts\nimport { mutation, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { requireRole, requirePermission } from \"./lib/auth\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\n// Two-factor confirmation for dangerous operations\nexport const deleteAllUserData = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    confirmationCode: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Require superadmin\n    const admin = await requireRole(ctx, \"superadmin\");\n\n    // Verify confirmation code\n    const confirmation = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"confirmations\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_admin_and_code\", (q) =>\n        q.eq(\"adminId\", admin._id).eq(\"code\", args.confirmationCode),\n      )\n      .filter((q) => q.gt(q.field(\"expiresAt\"), Date.now()))\n      .unique();\n\n    if (!confirmation || confirmation.action !== \"delete_user_data\") {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Invalid or expired confirmation code\");\n    }\n\n    // Delete confirmation to prevent reuse\n    await ctx.db.delete(confirmation._id);\n\n    // Schedule deletion (don''t do it inline)\n    await ctx.scheduler.runAfter(0, internal.admin._performDeletion, {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      requestedBy: admin._id,\n    });\n\n    // Audit log\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"auditLogs\", {\n      action: \"delete_user_data\",\n      targetUserId: args.userId,\n      performedBy: admin._id,\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\n// Generate confirmation code for sensitive action\nexport const requestDeletionConfirmation = mutation({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.string(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const admin = await requireRole(ctx, \"superadmin\");\n\n    const code = generateSecureCode();\n\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"confirmations\", {\n      adminId: admin._id,\n      code,\n      action: \"delete_user_data\",\n      targetUserId: args.userId,\n      expiresAt: Date.now() + 5 * 60 * 1000, // 5 minutes\n    });\n\n    // In production, send code via secure channel (email, SMS)\n    return code;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Complete Audit Trail System\n\n```typescript\n// convex/audit.ts\nimport { mutation, query, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { getUser, requireRole } from \"./lib/auth\";\n\nconst auditEventValidator = v.object({\n  _id: v.id(\"auditLogs\"),\n  _creationTime: v.number(),\n  action: v.string(),\n  userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n  resourceType: v.string(),\n  resourceId: v.string(),\n  details: v.optional(v.any()),\n  ipAddress: v.optional(v.string()),\n  timestamp: v.number(),\n});\n\n// Internal: Log audit event\nexport const logEvent = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    action: v.string(),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n    resourceType: v.string(),\n    resourceId: v.string(),\n    details: v.optional(v.any()),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"auditLogs\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"auditLogs\", {\n      ...args,\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\n// Admin: View audit logs\nexport const getAuditLogs = query({\n  args: {\n    resourceType: v.optional(v.string()),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(auditEventValidator),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await requireRole(ctx, \"admin\");\n\n    let query = ctx.db.query(\"auditLogs\");\n\n    if (args.resourceType) {\n      query = query.withIndex(\"by_resource_type\", (q) => q.eq(\"resourceType\", args.resourceType));\n    }\n\n    return await query.order(\"desc\").take(args.limit ?? 100);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Implement defense in depth (multiple security layers)\n- Log all sensitive operations for audit trails\n- Use confirmation codes for destructive actions\n- Rate limit all user-facing endpoints\n- Never expose internal API keys or errors\n- Review access patterns regularly\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Single point of failure** - Implement multiple auth checks\n2. **Missing audit logs** - Log all sensitive operations\n3. **Trusting client data** - Always validate server-side\n4. **Exposing error details** - Sanitize error messages\n5. **No rate limiting** - Always implement rate limits\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Functions Auth: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:34:25.989Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Security Agents needing comprehensive Convex application audits with authorization logic and data access boundary reviews.","zh":"非常适合需要对 Convex 应用程序进行全面审计的云安全代理，包括授权逻辑和数据访问边界审查。","ja":"Convex アプリケーションの包括的な監査が必要なクラウド セキュリティ エージェントに最適です。認証ロジックおよびデータ アクセス境界のレビューが含まれます。","ko":"Convex 애플리케이션을 위한 포괄적인 감사를 필요로 하는 클라우드 보안 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 인증 로직 및 데이터 액세스 경계 검토가 포함됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Seguridad en la Nube que necesitan auditorías de aplicaciones Convex integrales con lógica de autorización y revisiones de límites de acceso a datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Sécurité Cloud nécessitant des audits d''applications Convex complets avec une logique d''autorisation et des examens des limites d''accès aux données.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Sicherheitsagenten, die umfassende Convex-Anwendungsaudits mit Autorisierungslogik und Datenzugriffsgrenzprüfungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança em Nuvem que necessitam de auditorias abrangentes de aplicações Convex com lógica de autorização e revisões de limites de acesso de dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности в облаке, которым требуются всесторонние аудиты приложений Convex с логикой авторизации и обзорами границ доступа к данным.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل أمن السحابة التي تحتاج إلى تدقيقات شاملة لتطبيقات Convex مع منطق المصادقة ومراجعة حدود الوصول إلى البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough security audits of Convex applications, including action isolation, rate limiting, and protection of sensitive operations, leveraging the latest Convex documentation and security best practices from https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth and https://docs.convex.dev/production.","zh":"赋予代理执行 Convex 应用程序的彻底安全审计的能力，包括操作隔离、速率限制和敏感操作的保护，利用来自 https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth 和 https://docs.convex.dev/production 的最新 Convex 文档和安全最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントが Convex アプリケーションの包括的なセキュリティ監査を実行することを可能にします。操作の分離、レート制限、および機密操作の保護が含まれ、https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth および https://docs.convex.dev/production から最新の Convex ドキュメントおよびセキュリティのベスト プラクティスを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Convex 애플리케이션의 철저한 보안 감사를 수행하도록 허용합니다. 작업 분리, 속도 제한 및 민감한 작업의 보호가 포함되며, https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth 및 https://docs.convex.dev/production에서 최신 Convex 문서 및 보안 모범 사례를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de seguridad exhaustivas de aplicaciones Convex, incluyendo aislamiento de acciones, limitación de velocidad y protección de operaciones sensibles, aprovechando la última documentación de Convex y las mejores prácticas de seguridad de https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth y https://docs.convex.dev/production.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de sécurité complets des applications Convex, y compris l''isolement des actions, la limitation de débit et la protection des opérations sensibles, en exploitant la dernière documentation Convex et les meilleures pratiques de sécurité de https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth et https://docs.convex.dev/production.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Sicherheitsaudits von Convex-Anwendungen durchzuführen, einschließlich Aktionstrennung, Rate Limiting und Schutz sensibler Operationen, unter Nutzung der neuesten Convex-Dokumentation und Sicherheitsbest-Practices von https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth und https://docs.convex.dev/production.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de segurança abrangentes de aplicações Convex, incluindo isolamento de ações, limitação de taxa e proteção de operações sensíveis, aproveitando a documentação mais recente do Convex e as melhores práticas de segurança de https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth e https://docs.convex.dev/production.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные аудиты безопасности приложений Convex, включая изоляцию действий, ограничение скорости и защиту чувствительных операций, используя последнюю документацию Convex и лучшие практики безопасности с https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth и https://docs.convex.dev/production.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إجراء تدقيقات أمن شاملة لتطبيقات Convex، بما في ذلك عزل الإجراءات وحدّ التعرض و حماية العمليات الحساسة، مستفيداً من أحدث توثيق Convex وأفضل الممارسات الأمنية من https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth و https://docs.convex.dev/production."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing Convex application authorization logic for security vulnerabilities","Implementing rate limiting to prevent abuse and denial-of-service attacks","Isolating sensitive operations to protect against unauthorized access"],"zh":["针对安全漏洞进行 Convex 应用程序授权逻辑的审计","实施速率限制以防止滥用和拒绝服务攻击","隔离敏感操作以保护免受未经授权的访问"],"ja":["セキュリティ脆弱性に対する Convex アプリケーションの認証ロジックの監査","悪用やサービス拒否攻撃を防ぐためのレート制限の実施","未認証アクセスから保護するための機密操作の分離"],"ko":["보안 취약성에 대한 Convex 애플리케이션 인증 로직의 감사","남용 및 서비스 거부 공격을 방지하기 위한 속도 제한의 구현","인증되지 않은 액세스로부터 보호하기 위한 민감한 작업의 분리"],"es":["Auditoría de la lógica de autorización de aplicaciones Convex para vulnerabilidades de seguridad","Implementación de limitación de velocidad para prevenir abusos y ataques de denegación de servicio","Aislamiento de operaciones sensibles para proteger contra acceso no autorizado"],"fr":["Audit de la logique d''autorisation des applications Convex pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité","Mise en œuvre de la limitation de débit pour prévenir les abus et les attaques de déni de service","Isolement des opérations sensibles pour protéger contre l''accès non autorisé"],"de":["Prüfung der Autorisierungslogik von Convex-Anwendungen auf Sicherheitslücken","Implementierung von Rate Limiting, um Missbrauch und Denial-of-Service-Angriffe zu verhindern","Trennung sensibler Operationen, um sie vor unbefugtem Zugriff zu schützen"],"pt":["Auditoria da lógica de autorização de aplicações Convex para vulnerabilidades de segurança","Implementação de limitação de taxa para prevenir abusos e ataques de negação de serviço","Isolamento de operações sensíveis para proteger contra acessos não autorizados"],"ru":["Аудит логики авторизации приложений Convex на наличие уязвимостей безопасности","Реализация ограничения скорости для предотвращения злоупотреблений и атак типа \"отказ в обслуживании\"","Изоляция чувствительных операций для защиты от неавторизованных доступов"],"ar":["تدقيق منطق المصادقة لتطبيقات Convex للكشف عن الثغرات الأمنية","تنفيذ حدد التعرض لمنع الإساءة والهجمات التي تؤدي إلى انكار الخدمة","عزل العمليات الحساسة لحماية ضد الوصول غير المصرح به"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex application code and documentation"," Assumes familiarity with Convex security features and best practices","Limited to Convex applications, not applicable to other platforms"],"zh":["需要访问 Convex 应用程序代码和文档","假设熟悉 Convex 安全功能和最佳实践","仅适用于 Convex 应用程序，不适用于其他平台"],"ja":["Convex アプリケーション コードおよびドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Convex のセキュリティ機能およびベスト プラクティスに精通していることが前提","Convex アプリケーションにのみ適用され、他のプラットフォームには適用されない"],"ko":["Convex 애플리케이션 코드 및 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","Convex 보안 기능 및 모범 사례에 익숙하다고 가정합니다","Convex 애플리케이션에만 적용되며 다른 플랫폼에는 적용되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código y documentación de la aplicación Convex","Supone familiaridad con las características y mejores prácticas de seguridad de Convex","Limitado a aplicaciones Convex, no aplicable a otras plataformas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code et à la documentation de l''application Convex","Suppose une familiarité avec les fonctionnalités et les meilleures pratiques de sécurité de Convex","Limité aux applications Convex, non applicable à d''autres plateformes"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Convex-Anwendungscode und -dokumentation","Geht von Vertrautheit mit Convex-Sicherheitsfunktionen und -best-practices aus","Befristet auf Convex-Anwendungen, nicht auf andere Plattformen anwendbar"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código e documentação da aplicação Convex","Pressupõe familiaridade com recursos e melhores práticas de segurança do Convex","Limitado a aplicações Convex, não se aplica a outras plataformas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к коду и документации приложения Convex","Предполагает знакомство с функциями безопасности и лучшими практиками Convex","Ограничен приложениями Convex, не применимо к другим платформам"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى شفرة وثائق تطبيق Convex","يفترض إلمامًا بمميزات وأفضل الممارسات الأمنية لتطبيق Convex","محدود بتطبيقات Convex، لا ينطبق على منصات أخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
