en":"systematic-debugging"},"description":{"zh":"系统调试是一种通过找到问题根源来解决技术问题的方法，避免随机的修复和新bug","ja":"体系的デバッグは、問題の根本原因を特定して技術的な問題を解決する方法で、ランダムな修復と新しいバグを避けます","ko":"시스템 디버깅은 문제의 근본 원인을 tìm아 기술적인 문제를 해결하는 방법으로, 임의의 수정과 새로운 버그를 방지","es":"La depuración sistemática es un enfoque para identificar y solucionar problemas técnicos de manera eficiente, encontrando siempre la causa raíz antes de prop...","fr":"Le débogage systématique est une approche pour identifier et résoudre les problèmes techniques de manière efficace, en trouvant toujours la cause profonde av...","de":"Die systematische Fehlersuche ist ein Ansatz, um technische Probleme effizient zu identifizieren und zu lösen, indem immer die Ursache gefunden wird, bevor L...","pt":"A depuração sistemática é uma abordagem metódica para identificar e resolver problemas técnicos, garantindo que as soluções sejam eficazes e duradouras","ru":"Системная отладка - это методический подход к выявлению и решению технических проблем, гарантирующий, что решения будут эффективными и долговечными","ar":"الإصلاح المنهجي هو نهج منهجي لتحديد ومعالجة المشاكل الفنية، مما يضمن أن تكون الحلول فعالة ومستدامة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["找到问题根源","避免新bug","节省时间","提高代码质量","减少随机修复"],"ja":["問題の根本原因を特定","新しいバグを避け","時間を節約","コード品質を向上","ランダムな修復を減らす"],"ko":["문제의 근본 원인을 찾기","新的 버그를 방지","시간을 절약","코드 품질을 향상","임의의 수정을 줄이기"],"es":["Identificar la causa raíz de los problemas técnicos","Evitar soluciones temporales y parches","Proporcionar un enfoque estructurado para la depuración","Reducir el tiempo de depuración y mejorar la eficiencia","Garantizar la calidad y la estabilidad de los sistemas"],"fr":["Identifier la cause profonde des problèmes techniques","Éviter les solutions temporaires et les correctifs","Fournir une approche structurée pour le débogage","Réduire le temps de débogage et améliorer l''efficacité","Garantir la qualité et la stabilité des systèmes"],"de":["Die Ursache von technischen Problemen finden","Temporäre Lösungen und Patches vermeiden","Ein strukturierten Ansatz für die Fehlersuche bieten","Die Fehlersuchezeit reduzieren und die Effizienz verbessern","Die Qualität und Stabilität der Systeme gewährleisten"],"pt":["Identificação da causa raiz dos problemas","Abordagem metódica para resolução de problemas","Garantia de soluções eficazes e duradouras","Redução do tempo de depuração","Melhoria da qualidade do código"],"ru":["Выявление корневой причины проблем","Методический подход к решению проблем","Гарантия эффективных и долговечных решений","Сокращение времени отладки","Улучшение качества кода"],"ar":["تحديد السبب الجذري للمشاكل","نهج منهجي لمعالجة المشاكل","ضمان حلول فعالة ومستدامة","تقليل وقت الإصلاح","تحسين جودة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["系统调试","软件开发","技术问题","问题根源","新bug","代码质量","随机修复"],"ja":["体系的デバッグ","ソフトウェア開発","技術的な問題","根本原因","新しいバグ","コード品質","ランダムな修復"],"ko":["시스템 디버깅","소프트웨어 개발","기술적인 문제","근본 원인","新的 버그","코드 품질","임의의 수정"],"es":["depuración sistemática","causa raíz","solución de problemas técnicos","eficiencia en la depuración","calidad del software","estabilidad de los sistemas"],"fr":["débogage systématique","cause profonde","résolution de problèmes techniques","efficacité du débogage","qualité du logiciel","stabilité des systèmes"],"de":["systematische Fehlersuche","Ursache finden","Lösung von technischen Problemen","Effizienz in der Fehlersuche","Qualität der Software","Stabilität der Systeme"],"pt":["depuração sistemática","resolução de problemas","causa raiz","soluções eficazes","qualidade do código","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["системная отладка","решение проблем","корневая причина","эффективные решения","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إصلاح منهجي","معالجة المشاكل","السبب الجذري","حلول فعالة","جودة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Alexod24","repo":"portfolio","repoPath":"Alexod24/portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"systematic-debugging","description":"Use when encountering any bug, test failure, or unexpected behavior, before proposing fixes","bodyPreview":"# Systematic Debugging\n\n## Overview\n\nRandom fixes waste time and create new bugs. Quick patches mask underlying issues.\n\n**Core principle:** ALWAYS find root cause before attempting fixes. Symptom fixes are failure.\n\n**Violating the letter of this process is violating the spirit of debugging.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO FIXES WITHOUT ROOT CAUSE INVESTIGATION FIRST\n```\n\nIf you haven''t completed Phase 1, you cannot propose fixes.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse for ANY technical issue:\n- Test failures\n- Bugs","body":"# Systematic Debugging\n\n## Overview\n\nRandom fixes waste time and create new bugs. Quick patches mask underlying issues.\n\n**Core principle:** ALWAYS find root cause before attempting fixes. Symptom fixes are failure.\n\n**Violating the letter of this process is violating the spirit of debugging.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO FIXES WITHOUT ROOT CAUSE INVESTIGATION FIRST\n```\n\nIf you haven''t completed Phase 1, you cannot propose fixes.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse for ANY technical issue:\n- Test failures\n- Bugs in production\n- Unexpected behavior\n- Performance problems\n- Build failures\n- Integration issues\n\n**Use this ESPECIALLY when:**\n- Under time pressure (emergencies make guessing tempting)\n- \"Just one quick fix\" seems obvious\n- You''ve already tried multiple fixes\n- Previous fix didn''t work\n- You don''t fully understand the issue\n\n**Don''t skip when:**\n- Issue seems simple (simple bugs have root causes too)\n- You''re in a hurry (rushing guarantees rework)\n- Manager wants it fixed NOW (systematic is faster than thrashing)\n\n## The Four Phases\n\nYou MUST complete each phase before proceeding to the next.\n\n### Phase 1: Root Cause Investigation\n\n**BEFORE attempting ANY fix:**\n\n1. **Read Error Messages Carefully**\n   - Don''t skip past errors or warnings\n   - They often contain the exact solution\n   - Read stack traces completely\n   - Note line numbers, file paths, error codes\n\n2. **Reproduce Consistently**\n   - Can you trigger it reliably?\n   - What are the exact steps?\n   - Does it happen every time?\n   - If not reproducible → gather more data, don''t guess\n\n3. **Check Recent Changes**\n   - What changed that could cause this?\n   - Git diff, recent commits\n   - New dependencies, config changes\n   - Environmental differences\n\n4. **Gather Evidence in Multi-Component Systems**\n\n   **WHEN system has multiple components (CI → build → signing, API → service → database):**\n\n   **BEFORE proposing fixes, add diagnostic instrumentation:**\n   ```\n   For EACH component boundary:\n     - Log what data enters component\n     - Log what data exits component\n     - Verify environment/config propagation\n     - Check state at each layer\n\n   Run once to gather evidence showing WHERE it breaks\n   THEN analyze evidence to identify failing component\n   THEN investigate that specific component\n   ```\n\n   **Example (multi-layer system):**\n   ```bash\n   # Layer 1: Workflow\n   echo \"=== Secrets available in workflow: ===\"\n   echo \"IDENTITY: ${IDENTITY:+SET}${IDENTITY:-UNSET}\"\n\n   # Layer 2: Build script\n   echo \"=== Env vars in build script: ===\"\n   env | grep IDENTITY || echo \"IDENTITY not in environment\"\n\n   # Layer 3: Signing script\n   echo \"=== Keychain state: ===\"\n   security list-keychains\n   security find-identity -v\n\n   # Layer 4: Actual signing\n   codesign --sign \"$IDENTITY\" --verbose=4 \"$APP\"\n   ```\n\n   **This reveals:** Which layer fails (secrets → workflow ✓, workflow → build ✗)\n\n5. **Trace Data Flow**\n\n   **WHEN error is deep in call stack:**\n\n   See `root-cause-tracing.md` in this directory for the complete backward tracing technique.\n\n   **Quick version:**\n   - Where does bad value originate?\n   - What called this with bad value?\n   - Keep tracing up until you find the source\n   - Fix at source, not at symptom\n\n### Phase 2: Pattern Analysis\n\n**Find the pattern before fixing:**\n\n1. **Find Working Examples**\n   - Locate similar working code in same codebase\n   - What works that''s similar to what''s broken?\n\n2. **Compare Against References**\n   - If implementing pattern, read reference implementation COMPLETELY\n   - Don''t skim - read every line\n   - Understand the pattern fully before applying\n\n3. **Identify Differences**\n   - What''s different between working and broken?\n   - List every difference, however small\n   - Don''t assume \"that can''t matter\"\n\n4. **Understand Dependencies**\n   - What other components does this need?\n   - What settings, config, environment?\n   - What assumptions does it make?\n\n### Phase 3: Hypothesis and Testing\n\n**Scientific method:**\n\n1. **Form Single Hypothesis**\n   - State clearly: \"I think X is the root cause because Y\"\n   - Write it down\n   - Be specific, not vague\n\n2. **Test Minimally**\n   - Make the SMALLEST possible change to test hypothesis\n   - One variable at a time\n   - Don''t fix multiple things at once\n\n3. **Verify Before Continuing**\n   - Did it work? Yes → Phase 4\n   - Didn''t work? Form NEW hypothesis\n   - DON''T add more fixes on top\n\n4. **When You Don''t Know**\n   - Say \"I don''t understand X\"\n   - Don''t pretend to know\n   - Ask for help\n   - Research more\n\n### Phase 4: Implementation\n\n**Fix the root cause, not the symptom:**\n\n1. **Create Failing Test Case**\n   - Simplest possible reproduction\n   - Automated test if possible\n   - One-off test script if no framework\n   - MUST have before fixing\n   - Use the `superpowers:test-driven-development` skill for writing proper failing tests\n\n2. **Implement Single Fix**\n   - Address the root cause identified\n   - ONE change at a time\n   - No \"while I''m here\" improvements\n   - No bundled refactoring\n\n3. **Verify Fix**\n   - Test passes now?\n   - No other tests broken?\n   - Issue actually resolved?\n\n4. **If Fix Doesn''t Work**\n   - STOP\n   - Count: How many fixes have you tried?\n   - If < 3: Return to Phase 1, re-analyze with new information\n   - **If ≥ 3: STOP and question the architecture (step 5 below)**\n   - DON''T attempt Fix #4 without architectural discussion\n\n5. **If 3+ Fixes Failed: Question Architecture**\n\n   **Pattern indicating architectural problem:**\n   - Each fix reveals new shared state/coupling/problem in different place\n   - Fixes require \"massive refactoring\" to implement\n   - Each fix creates new symptoms elsewhere\n\n   **STOP and question fundamentals:**\n   - Is this pattern fundamentally sound?\n   - Are we \"sticking with it through sheer inertia\"?\n   - Should we refactor architecture vs. continue fixing symptoms?\n\n   **Discuss with your human partner before attempting more fixes**\n\n   This is NOT a failed hypothesis - this is a wrong architecture.\n\n## Red Flags - STOP and Follow Process\n\nIf you catch yourself thinking:\n- \"Quick fix for now, investigate later\"\n- \"Just try changing X and see if it works\"\n- \"Add multiple changes, run tests\"\n- \"Skip the test, I''ll manually verify\"\n- \"It''s probably X, let me fix that\"\n- \"I don''t fully understand but this might work\"\n- \"Pattern says X but I''ll adapt it differently\"\n- \"Here are the main problems: [lists fixes without investigation]\"\n- Proposing solutions before tracing data flow\n- **\"One more fix attempt\" (when already tried 2+)**\n- **Each fix reveals new problem in different place**\n\n**ALL of these mean: STOP. Return to Phase 1.**\n\n**If 3+ fixes failed:** Question the architecture (see Phase 4.5)\n\n## your human partner''s Signals You''re Doing It Wrong\n\n**Watch for these redirections:**\n- \"Is that not happening?\" - You assumed without verifying\n- \"Will it show us...?\" - You should have added evidence gathering\n- \"Stop guessing\" - You''re proposing fixes without understanding\n- \"Ultrathink this\" - Question fundamentals, not just symptoms\n- \"We''re stuck?\" (frustrated) - Your approach isn''t working\n\n**When you see these:** STOP. Return to Phase 1.\n\n## Common Rationalizations\n\n| Excuse | Reality |\n|--------|---------|\n| \"Issue is simple, don''t need process\" | Simple issues have root causes too. Process is fast for simple bugs. |\n| \"Emergency, no time for process\" | Systematic debugging is FASTER than guess-and-check thrashing. |\n| \"Just try this first, then investigate\" | First fix sets the pattern. Do it right from the start. |\n| \"I''ll write test after confirming fix works\" | Untested fixes don''t stick. Test first proves it. |\n| \"Multiple fixes at once saves time\" | Can''t isolate what worked. Causes new bugs. |\n| \"Reference too long, I''ll adapt the pattern\" | Partial understanding guarantees bugs. Read it completely. |\n| \"I see the problem, let me fix it\" | Seeing symptoms ≠ understanding root cause. |\n| \"One more fix attempt\" (after 2+ failures) | 3+ failures = architectural problem. Question pattern, don''t fix again. |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Phase | Key Activities | Success Criteria |\n|-------|---------------|------------------|\n| **1. Root Cause** | Read errors, reproduce, check changes, gather evidence | Understand WHAT and WHY |\n| **2. Pattern** | Find working examples, compare | Identify differences |\n| **3. Hypothesis** | Form theory, test minimally | Confirmed or new hypothesis |\n| **4. Implementation** | Create test, fix, verify | Bug resolved, tests pass |\n\n## When Process Reveals \"No Root Cause\"\n\nIf systematic investigation reveals issue is truly environmental, timing-dependent, or external:\n\n1. You''ve completed the process\n2. Document what you investigated\n3. Implement appropriate handling (retry, timeout, error message)\n4. Add monitoring/logging for future investigation\n\n**But:** 95% of \"no root cause\" cases are incomplete investigation.\n\n## Supporting Techniques\n\nThese techniques are part of systematic debugging and available in this directory:\n\n- **`root-cause-tracing.md`** - Trace bugs backward through call stack to find original trigger\n- **`defense-in-depth.md`** - Add validation at multiple layers after finding root cause\n- **`condition-based-waiting.md`** - Replace arbitrary timeouts with condition polling\n\n**Related skills:**\n- **superpowers:test-driven-development** - For creating failing test case (Phase 4, Step 1)\n- **superpowers:verification-before-completion** - Verify fix worked before claiming success\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\nFrom debugging sessions:\n- Systematic approach: 15-30 minutes to fix\n- Random fixes approach: 2-3 hours of thrashing\n- First-time fix rate: 95% vs 40%\n- New bugs introduced: Near zero vs common\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:33:55.582Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Agents needing structured issue resolution and root cause analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化问题解决和根因分析能力的技术代理。","ja":"技術エージェントが構造化された問題解決と根本原因分析の機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 문제 해결 및 근본 원인 분석 기능을 필요로 하는 기술 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes técnicos que necesitan una resolución de problemas estructurada y capacidades de análisis de causa raíz.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents techniques qui ont besoin d''une résolution de problèmes structurée et de capacités d''analyse de cause profonde.","de":"Perfekt für technische Agenten, die eine strukturierte Problemlösung und Fähigkeiten zur Analyse der Ursache benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Técnicos que necessitam de resolução de problemas estruturada e capacidades de análise de causa raiz.","ru":"Идеально подходит для технических агентов, которым необходимы структурированное решение проблем и возможности анализа коренной причины.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الفنيين الذين يحتاجون إلى حل مشكلة منظم و قدرات تحليل السبب الجذري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to investigate root causes using the Iron Law of NO FIXES WITHOUT ROOT CAUSE INVESTIGATION FIRST, ensuring symptom fixes are avoided and underlying issues are addressed, promoting systematic debugging for test failures and bugs.","zh":"赋予代理调查根因的能力，使用铁律，即在进行任何修复之前必须进行根因调查，确保避免症状修复并解决潜在问题，促进系统调试以解决测试失败和错误。","ja":"エージェントが根本原因を調査する能力を付与し、鉄則である「根本原因調査なしに修正は行わない」を使用して、症状の修正を回避し、根本的な問題に対処し、テストの失敗やバグに対する体系的なデバッグを促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 근본 원인을 조사할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, ''근본 원인 조사 없이 수정은 없다''라는 철칙을 사용하여 증상 수정을 피하고 근본적인 문제를 해결하며, 테스트 실패 및 버그에 대한 체계적인 디버깅을 촉진합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a investigar las causas raíz utilizando la Ley de Hierro de NO SOLUCIONES SIN INVESTIGACIÓN DE CAUSA RAÍZ PRIMERO, asegurando que se eviten soluciones de síntomas y se aborden los problemas subyacentes, promoviendo la depuración sistemática para fallos de prueba y errores.","fr":"Habilite les agents à enquêter sur les causes profondes en utilisant la Loi de fer de PAS DE CORRECTIONS SANS ENQUÊTE SUR LA CAUSE PROFONDE D''ABORD, en s''assurant que les corrections des symptômes soient évitées et que les problèmes sous-jacents soient abordés, en promouvant la débogage systématique pour les échecs de test et les bogues.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Ursachen zu untersuchen, indem sie das Eisernes Gesetz von KEINE REPARATUREN OHNE URSAChENANALYSE ZUERST anwenden, sicherzustellen, dass Symptome behoben werden und zugrunde liegende Probleme angegangen werden, indem sie systematisches Debugging für Testfehler und Fehler fördern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a investigar as causas raiz usando a Lei de Ferro de NENHUMA CORREÇÃO SEM INVESTIGAÇÃO DA CAUSA RAIZ EM PRIMEIRO LUGAR, garantindo que as correções de sintomas sejam evitadas e os problemas subjacentes sejam abordados, promovendo depuração sistemática para falhas de teste e bugs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расследовать коренные причины с помощью Железного закона НЕТ ИСПРАВЛЕНИЙ БЕЗ РАССЛЕДОВАНИЯ КОРЕННОЙ ПРИЧИНЫ СНАЧАЛА, гарантируя, что исправления симптомов избегаются и основные проблемы решаются, способствуя систематической отладке для сбоев тестирования и ошибок.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية التحقيق في الأسباب الجذريّة باستخدام قانون الحديد لاي تصحيح بدون تحقيق في السبب الجذري أولا، مما يضمن تجنّب إصلاحات الأعراض ومعالجة القضايا الأساسية، وتعزيز التصحيح المنهجي لفشل الاختبار والحُبوب."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex test failures","Identifying root causes of recurring bugs","Implementing systematic issue resolution for technical issues"],"zh":["调试复杂的测试失败","识别反复出现的错误的根因","为技术问题实施系统化的问题解决"],"ja":["複雑なテストの失敗をデバッグする","再発するバグの根本原因を特定する","技術的な問題に対する体系的な問題解決を実施する"],"ko":["복잡한 테스트 실패를 디버깅하는 것","반복되는 버그의 근본 원인을 식별하는 것","기술적인 문제에 대한 체계적인 문제 해결을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de fallos de prueba complejos","Identificación de las causas raíz de errores recurrentes","Implementación de una resolución sistemática de problemas para problemas técnicos"],"fr":["Débogage de défaillances de test complexes","Identification des causes profondes des bogues récurrents","Mise en œuvre d''une résolution systématique des problèmes pour les problèmes techniques"],"de":["Debugging komplexer Testfehler","Identifizierung der Ursachen von wiederkehrenden Fehlern","Implementierung einer systematischen Problemlösung für technische Probleme"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de teste complexas","Identificação de causas raiz de bugs recorrentes","Implementação de resolução sistemática de problemas técnicos"],"ru":["Отладка сложных сбоев тестирования","Определение коренных причин повторяющихся ошибок","Реализация системного решения технических проблем"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء الاختبار المعقدة","تحديد الأسباب الجذريّة للأخطاء المتكررة","تنفيذ حلّ منهجي للمشاكل الفنية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the Iron Law","Violating the process may lead to incomplete debugging"],"zh":["需要遵守铁律","违反流程可能导致调试不完全"],"ja":["鉄則に従う必要がある","プロセスを違反するとデバッグが不完全になる可能性がある"],"ko":["철칙을 준수해야 함","프로세스를 위반하면 디버깅이 불완전할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere adherirse a la Ley de Hierro","Violación del proceso puede llevar a una depuración incompleta"],"fr":["Exige l''adhésion à la Loi de fer","La violation du processus peut conduire à un débogage incomplet"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des Eisernen Gesetzes","Verletzung des Prozesses kann zu einer unvollständigen Fehlersuche führen"],"pt":["Exige adesão à Lei de Ferro","Violar o processo pode levar a depuração incompleta"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения Железного закона","Нарушение процесса может привести к неполному отладке"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بقانون الحديد","خرق العملية قد يؤدي إلى تصحيح غير كامل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('not-ani/elevated-school-takehome/convex-security-audit', 'community', 'not-ani', 'elevated-school-takehome', 'not-ani/elevated-school-takehome', 'convex-security-audit', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z', '2026-02-18T09:34:29.298Z', NULL, '{"id":"not-ani/elevated-school-takehome/convex-security-audit","name":"convex-security-audit","description":{"zh":"Convex 安全审计是一种综合安全审查，确保 Convex 应用的安全和合规","ja":"Convex セキュリティ監査は、Convex アプリケーションのセキュリティとコンプライアンスを確保するための包括的なセキュリティレビューです","ko":"Convex 보안 감사는 Convex 애플리케이션의 보안 및 컴플라이언스를 보장하는 포괄적인 보안 리뷰입니다","es":"El análisis de seguridad convexo es una revisión exhaustiva de la seguridad de las aplicaciones Convex, que incluye lógica de autorización y límites de acceso","fr":"L''audit de sécurité convex est un examen approfondi de la sécurité des applications Convex, qui inclut la logique d''autorisation et les limites d''accès","de":"Die konvexe Sicherheitsprüfung ist eine umfassende Sicherheitsüberprüfung von Convex-Anwendungen, die Autorisierungsmuster und Zugriffsgrenzen umfasst","pt":"A auditoria de segurança Convex é um processo de revisão de segurança abrangente para aplicações Convex, incluindo lógica de autorização, limites de acesso a dados e isolamento de ações","ru":"Аудит безопасности Convex - это комплексный процесс проверки безопасности для приложений Convex, включая логику авторизации, границы доступа к данным и изоляцию действий","ar":"تدقيق أمني Convex هو عملية مراجعة أمنية شاملة لبرامج Convex، بما في ذلك 논理 التأشير، حدود الوصول إلى البيانات وفصل الإجراءات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Convex 安全审计 - 保障应用安全","ja":"Convex セキュリティ監査 - アプリケーションのセキュリティを確保","ko":"Convex 보안 감사 - 애플리케이션 보안 강화","es":"Análisis de seguridad convexo: revisión de patrones de se...","fr":"Audit de sécurité convex : examen des modèles de sécurité","de":"Konvexe Sicherheitsprüfung: umfassende Sicherheitsüberprü...","pt":"Auditoria de Segurança Convex","ru":"Аудит Безопасности Convex","ar":"تدقيق أمني Convex","en":"convex-security-audit"},"description":{"zh":"Convex 安全审计是一种综合安全审查，确保 Convex 应用的安全和合规","ja":"Convex セキュリティ監査は、Convex アプリケーションのセキュリティとコンプライアンスを確保するための包括的なセキュリティレビューです","ko":"Convex 보안 감사는 Convex 애플리케이션의 보안 및 컴플라이언스를 보장하는 포괄적인 보안 리뷰입니다","es":"El análisis de seguridad convexo es una revisión exhaustiva de la seguridad de las aplicaciones Convex, que incluye lógica de autorización y límites de acceso","fr":"L''audit de sécurité convex est un examen approfondi de la sécurité des applications Convex, qui inclut la logique d''autorisation et les limites d''accès","de":"Die konvexe Sicherheitsprüfung ist eine umfassende Sicherheitsüberprüfung von Convex-Anwendungen, die Autorisierungsmuster und Zugriffsgrenzen umfasst","pt":"A auditoria de segurança Convex é um processo de revisão de segurança abrangente para aplicações Convex, incluindo lógica de autorização, limites de acesso a...","ru":"Аудит безопасности Convex - это комплексный процесс проверки безопасности для приложений Convex, включая логику авторизации, границы доступа к данным и изоля...","ar":"تدقيق أمني Convex هو عملية مراجعة أمنية شاملة لبرامج Convex، بما في ذلك 논理 التأشير، حدود الوصول إلى البيانات وفصل الإجراءات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["授权逻辑安全审查","数据访问边界保护","动作隔离","速率限制","敏感操作保护"],"ja":["認証ロジックのセキュリティレビュー","データアクセス境界の保護","アクションの隔離","レート制限","機密操作の保護"],"ko":["인증 로직 보안 리뷰","데이터 액세스 경계 보호","액션 격리","속도 제한","민감한 작업 보호"],"es":["Revisión de lógica de autorización","Límites de acceso a datos","Aislamiento de acciones","Límites de velocidad","Protección de operaciones sensibles"],"fr":["Examen de la logique d''autorisation","Limites d''accès aux données","Isolement des actions","Limites de débit","Protection des opérations sensibles"],"de":["Überprüfung von Autorisierungsmustern","Zugriffsgrenzen für Daten","Aktionen-Isolierung","Rate-Limits","Schutz von sensiblen Operationen"],"pt":["Revisão de lógica de autorização","Limites de acesso a dados","Isolamento de ações","Limitação de taxa","Proteção de operações sensíveis"],"ru":["Проверка логики авторизации","Границы доступа к данным","Изоляция действий","Ограничение скорости","Защита чувствительных операций"],"ar":["مراجعة 논理 التأشير","حدود الوصول إلى البيانات","فصل الإجراءات","تحديد معدل","حماية العمليات الحساسة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 安全审计","Convex 应用安全","授权逻辑安全","数据访问边界保护","Convex 安全最佳实践","Convex 开发安全"],"ja":["Convex セキュリティ監査","Convex アプリケーションのセキュリティ","認証ロジックのセキュリティ","データアクセス境界の保護","Convex セキュリティベストプラクティス","Convex 開発のセキュリティ"],"ko":["Convex 보안 감사","Convex 애플리케이션 보안","인증 로직 보안","데이터 액세스 경계 보호","Convex 보안 최선의 관행","Convex 개발 보안"],"es":["seguridad convexa","análisis de seguridad","aplicaciones Convex","autorización","límites de acceso","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["sécurité convex","audit de sécurité","applications Convex","autorisation","limites d''accès","développement d''applications"],"de":["konvexe Sicherheit","Sicherheitsprüfung","Convex-Anwendungen","Autorisierung","Zugriffsgrenzen","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["auditoria de segurança Convex","segurança de aplicações","revisão de segurança","lógica de autorização","limites de acesso a dados","isolamento de ações"],"ru":["Аудит безопасности Convex","безопасность приложений","проверка безопасности","логика авторизации","границы доступа к данным","изоляция действий"],"ar":["تدقيق أمني Convex","أمن التطبيقات","مراجعة أمنية","논理 التأشير","حدود الوصول إلى البيانات","فصل الإجراءات"]}},"owner":"not-ani","repo":"elevated-school-takehome","repoPath":"not-ani/elevated-school-takehome","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-security-audit","description":"Deep security review patterns for authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","security","audit","authorization","rate-limiting","protection"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Security Audit\n\nComprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications including authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n###","body":"# Convex Security Audit\n\nComprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications including authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Security Audit Areas\n\n1. **Authorization Logic** - Who can do what\n2. **Data Access Boundaries** - What data users can see\n3. **Action Isolation** - Protecting external API calls\n4. **Rate Limiting** - Preventing abuse\n5. **Sensitive Operations** - Protecting critical functions\n\n### Authorization Logic Audit\n\n#### Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```typescript\n// convex/lib/auth.ts\nimport { QueryCtx, MutationCtx } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { Doc } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n\ntype UserRole = \"user\" | \"moderator\" | \"admin\" | \"superadmin\";\n\nconst roleHierarchy: Record<UserRole, number> = {\n  user: 0,\n  moderator: 1,\n  admin: 2,\n  superadmin: 3,\n};\n\nexport async function getUser(ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx): Promise<Doc<\"users\"> | null> {\n  const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n  if (!identity) return null;\n\n  return await ctx.db\n    .query(\"users\")\n    .withIndex(\"by_tokenIdentifier\", (q) => q.eq(\"tokenIdentifier\", identity.tokenIdentifier))\n    .unique();\n}\n\nexport async function requireRole(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx,\n  minRole: UserRole,\n): Promise<Doc<\"users\">> {\n  const user = await getUser(ctx);\n\n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\",\n      message: \"Authentication required\",\n    });\n  }\n\n  const userRoleLevel = roleHierarchy[user.role as UserRole] ?? 0;\n  const requiredLevel = roleHierarchy[minRole];\n\n  if (userRoleLevel < requiredLevel) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: `Role ''${minRole}'' or higher required`,\n    });\n  }\n\n  return user;\n}\n\n// Permission-based check\ntype Permission = \"read:users\" | \"write:users\" | \"delete:users\" | \"admin:system\";\n\nconst rolePermissions: Record<UserRole, Permission[]> = {\n  user: [\"read:users\"],\n  moderator: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\"],\n  admin: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\", \"delete:users\"],\n  superadmin: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\", \"delete:users\", \"admin:system\"],\n};\n\nexport async function requirePermission(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx,\n  permission: Permission,\n): Promise<Doc<\"users\">> {\n  const user = await getUser(ctx);\n\n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({ code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\", message: \"Authentication required\" });\n  }\n\n  const userRole = user.role as UserRole;\n  const permissions = rolePermissions[userRole] ?? [];\n\n  if (!permissions.includes(permission)) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: `Permission ''${permission}'' required`,\n    });\n  }\n\n  return user;\n}\n```\n\n### Data Access Boundaries Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/data.ts\nimport { query, mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { getUser, requireRole } from \"./lib/auth\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// Audit: Users can only see their own data\nexport const getMyData = query({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.array(\n    v.object({\n      _id: v.id(\"userData\"),\n      content: v.string(),\n    }),\n  ),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    if (!user) return [];\n\n    // SECURITY: Filter by userId\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"userData\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", user._id))\n      .collect();\n  },\n});\n\n// Audit: Verify ownership before returning sensitive data\nexport const getSensitiveItem = query({\n  args: { itemId: v.id(\"sensitiveItems\") },\n  returns: v.union(\n    v.object({\n      _id: v.id(\"sensitiveItems\"),\n      secret: v.string(),\n    }),\n    v.null(),\n  ),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    if (!user) return null;\n\n    const item = await ctx.db.get(args.itemId);\n\n    // SECURITY: Verify ownership\n    if (!item || item.ownerId !== user._id) {\n      return null; // Don''t reveal if item exists\n    }\n\n    return item;\n  },\n});\n\n// Audit: Shared resources with access list\nexport const getSharedDocument = query({\n  args: { docId: v.id(\"documents\") },\n  returns: v.union(\n    v.object({\n      _id: v.id(\"documents\"),\n      content: v.string(),\n      accessLevel: v.string(),\n    }),\n    v.null(),\n  ),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    const doc = await ctx.db.get(args.docId);\n\n    if (!doc) return null;\n\n    // Public documents\n    if (doc.visibility === \"public\") {\n      return { ...doc, accessLevel: \"public\" };\n    }\n\n    // Must be authenticated for non-public\n    if (!user) return null;\n\n    // Owner has full access\n    if (doc.ownerId === user._id) {\n      return { ...doc, accessLevel: \"owner\" };\n    }\n\n    // Check shared access\n    const access = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"documentAccess\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_doc_and_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"documentId\", args.docId).eq(\"userId\", user._id))\n      .unique();\n\n    if (!access) return null;\n\n    return { ...doc, accessLevel: access.level };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Action Isolation Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/actions.ts\n\"use node\";\n\nimport { action, internalAction } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { api, internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// SECURITY: Never expose API keys in responses\nexport const callExternalAPI = action({\n  args: { query: v.string() },\n  returns: v.object({ result: v.string() }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Verify user is authenticated\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    if (!identity) {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n    }\n\n    // Get API key from environment (not hardcoded)\n    const apiKey = process.env.EXTERNAL_API_KEY;\n    if (!apiKey) {\n      throw new Error(\"API key not configured\");\n    }\n\n    // Log usage for audit trail\n    await ctx.runMutation(internal.audit.logAPICall, {\n      userId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      endpoint: \"external-api\",\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n\n    const response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/query\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: {\n        Authorization: `Bearer ${apiKey}`,\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ query: args.query }),\n    });\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      // Don''t expose external API error details\n      throw new ConvexError(\"External service unavailable\");\n    }\n\n    const data = await response.json();\n\n    // Sanitize response before returning\n    return { result: sanitizeResponse(data) };\n  },\n});\n\n// Internal action - not exposed to clients\nexport const _processPayment = internalAction({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    amount: v.number(),\n    paymentMethodId: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ success: v.boolean(), transactionId: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const stripeKey = process.env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY;\n\n    // Process payment with Stripe\n    // This should NEVER be exposed as a public action\n\n    return { success: true, transactionId: \"txn_xxx\" };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Rate Limiting Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/rateLimit.ts\nimport { mutation, query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\nconst RATE_LIMITS = {\n  message: { requests: 10, windowMs: 60000 }, // 10 per minute\n  upload: { requests: 5, windowMs: 300000 }, // 5 per 5 minutes\n  api: { requests: 100, windowMs: 3600000 }, // 100 per hour\n};\n\nexport const checkRateLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.string(),\n    action: v.union(v.literal(\"message\"), v.literal(\"upload\"), v.literal(\"api\")),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ allowed: v.boolean(), retryAfter: v.optional(v.number()) }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const limit = RATE_LIMITS[args.action];\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - limit.windowMs;\n\n    // Count requests in window\n    const requests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"rateLimits\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user_and_action\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", args.userId).eq(\"action\", args.action))\n      .filter((q) => q.gt(q.field(\"timestamp\"), windowStart))\n      .collect();\n\n    if (requests.length >= limit.requests) {\n      const oldestRequest = requests[0];\n      const retryAfter = oldestRequest.timestamp + limit.windowMs - now;\n\n      return { allowed: false, retryAfter };\n    }\n\n    // Record this request\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"rateLimits\", {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      action: args.action,\n      timestamp: now,\n    });\n\n    return { allowed: true };\n  },\n});\n\n// Use in mutations\nexport const sendMessage = mutation({\n  args: { content: v.string() },\n  returns: v.id(\"messages\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    if (!identity) throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n\n    // Check rate limit\n    const rateCheck = await checkRateLimit(ctx, {\n      userId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      action: \"message\",\n    });\n\n    if (!rateCheck.allowed) {\n      throw new ConvexError({\n        code: \"RATE_LIMITED\",\n        message: `Too many requests. Try again in ${Math.ceil(rateCheck.retryAfter! / 1000)} seconds`,\n      });\n    }\n\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"messages\", {\n      content: args.content,\n      authorId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Sensitive Operations Protection\n\n```typescript\n// convex/admin.ts\nimport { mutation, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { requireRole, requirePermission } from \"./lib/auth\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\n// Two-factor confirmation for dangerous operations\nexport const deleteAllUserData = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    confirmationCode: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Require superadmin\n    const admin = await requireRole(ctx, \"superadmin\");\n\n    // Verify confirmation code\n    const confirmation = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"confirmations\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_admin_and_code\", (q) =>\n        q.eq(\"adminId\", admin._id).eq(\"code\", args.confirmationCode),\n      )\n      .filter((q) => q.gt(q.field(\"expiresAt\"), Date.now()))\n      .unique();\n\n    if (!confirmation || confirmation.action !== \"delete_user_data\") {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Invalid or expired confirmation code\");\n    }\n\n    // Delete confirmation to prevent reuse\n    await ctx.db.delete(confirmation._id);\n\n    // Schedule deletion (don''t do it inline)\n    await ctx.scheduler.runAfter(0, internal.admin._performDeletion, {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      requestedBy: admin._id,\n    });\n\n    // Audit log\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"auditLogs\", {\n      action: \"delete_user_data\",\n      targetUserId: args.userId,\n      performedBy: admin._id,\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\n// Generate confirmation code for sensitive action\nexport const requestDeletionConfirmation = mutation({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.string(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const admin = await requireRole(ctx, \"superadmin\");\n\n    const code = generateSecureCode();\n\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"confirmations\", {\n      adminId: admin._id,\n      code,\n      action: \"delete_user_data\",\n      targetUserId: args.userId,\n      expiresAt: Date.now() + 5 * 60 * 1000, // 5 minutes\n    });\n\n    // In production, send code via secure channel (email, SMS)\n    return code;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Complete Audit Trail System\n\n```typescript\n// convex/audit.ts\nimport { mutation, query, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { getUser, requireRole } from \"./lib/auth\";\n\nconst auditEventValidator = v.object({\n  _id: v.id(\"auditLogs\"),\n  _creationTime: v.number(),\n  action: v.string(),\n  userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n  resourceType: v.string(),\n  resourceId: v.string(),\n  details: v.optional(v.any()),\n  ipAddress: v.optional(v.string()),\n  timestamp: v.number(),\n});\n\n// Internal: Log audit event\nexport const logEvent = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    action: v.string(),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n    resourceType: v.string(),\n    resourceId: v.string(),\n    details: v.optional(v.any()),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"auditLogs\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"auditLogs\", {\n      ...args,\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\n// Admin: View audit logs\nexport const getAuditLogs = query({\n  args: {\n    resourceType: v.optional(v.string()),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(auditEventValidator),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await requireRole(ctx, \"admin\");\n\n    let query = ctx.db.query(\"auditLogs\");\n\n    if (args.resourceType) {\n      query = query.withIndex(\"by_resource_type\", (q) => q.eq(\"resourceType\", args.resourceType));\n    }\n\n    return await query.order(\"desc\").take(args.limit ?? 100);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Implement defense in depth (multiple security layers)\n- Log all sensitive operations for audit trails\n- Use confirmation codes for destructive actions\n- Rate limit all user-facing endpoints\n- Never expose internal API keys or errors\n- Review access patterns regularly\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Single point of failure** - Implement multiple auth checks\n2. **Missing audit logs** - Log all sensitive operations\n3. **Trusting client data** - Always validate server-side\n4. **Exposing error details** - Sanitize error messages\n5. **No rate limiting** - Always implement rate limits\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Functions Auth: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:34:29.298Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security Audit Agents needing comprehensive Convex application security reviews with authorization logic and data access boundary analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要对 Convex 应用程序进行全面安全审计的安全审计代理，包括授权逻辑和数据访问边界分析。","ja":"Convex アプリケーションの包括的なセキュリティレビューが必要なセキュリティ監査エージェントに最適です。認可ロジックとデータアクセス境界分析を含みます。","ko":"Convex 애플리케이션의 종합적인 보안 리뷰가 필요한 보안 감사 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 인증 로직 및 데이터 액세스 경계 분석을 포함합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Auditoría de Seguridad que necesitan revisiones de seguridad de aplicaciones Convex integrales con lógica de autorización y análisis de límites de acceso a datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Audit de Sécurité ayant besoin d''examens de sécurité d''applications Convex complets avec logique d''autorisation et analyse des limites d''accès aux données.","de":"Perfekt für Sicherheitsaudit-Agents, die umfassende Sicherheitsprüfungen von Convex-Anwendungen mit Autorisierungslogik und Datenzugriffsgrenzenanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Auditoria de Segurança que necessitam de revisões abrangentes de segurança de aplicativos Convex com lógica de autorização e análise de limites de acesso a dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов аудита безопасности, которым необходимы комплексные обзоры безопасности приложений Convex с логикой авторизации и анализом границ доступа к данным.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تدقيق الأمن الذين يحتاجون إلى مراجعات شاملة لأمان تطبيقات Convex مع منطق المصادقة وتحليل حدود الوصول إلى البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform in-depth security audits of Convex applications, including action isolation, rate limiting, and protection of sensitive operations, leveraging documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth and https://docs.convex.dev/production.","zh":"赋予代理执行 Convex 应用程序的深入安全审计的能力，包括操作隔离、速率限制和保护敏感操作，利用 https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth 和 https://docs.convex.dev/production 中的文档。","ja":"エージェントが Convex アプリケーションの包括的なセキュリティ監査を実行できるようにし、操作の分離、レート制限、機密操作の保護などを実現します。https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth および https://docs.convex.dev/production のドキュメントを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Convex 애플리케이션의 심층 보안 감사를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 동작 분리, 속도 제한 및 민감한 동작 보호 등을 제공합니다. https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth 및 https://docs.convex.dev/production의 문서를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de seguridad exhaustivas de aplicaciones Convex, incluyendo aislamiento de acciones, limitación de velocidad y protección de operaciones sensibles, aprovechando la documentación de https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth y https://docs.convex.dev/production.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des audits de sécurité approfondis d''applications Convex, notamment l''isolement des actions, la limitation de débit et la protection des opérations sensibles, en exploitant la documentation de https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth et https://docs.convex.dev/production.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Sicherheitsaudits von Convex-Anwendungen durchzuführen, einschließlich Aktionstrennung, Rate Limiting und Schutz sensibler Operationen, unter Nutzung der Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth und https://docs.convex.dev/production.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de segurança aprofundadas de aplicativos Convex, incluindo isolamento de ações, limitação de taxa e proteção de operações sensíveis, aproveitando a documentação de https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth e https://docs.convex.dev/production.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить углубленные аудиты безопасности приложений Convex, включая изоляцию действий, ограничение скорости и защиту чувствительных операций, используя документацию с https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth и https://docs.convex.dev/production.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إجراء تدقيقات أمنية متعمقة لتطبيقات Convex، بما في ذلك عزل الإجراءات وقيود معدل الحماية وعمليات الحساسة، باستخدام المستندات من https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth و https://docs.convex.dev/production."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing authorization logic for Convex functions","Identifying data access boundary vulnerabilities","Implementing rate limiting to prevent abuse","Protecting sensitive operations in Convex applications"],"zh":["分析 Convex 函数的授权逻辑","识别数据访问边界漏洞","实施速率限制以防止滥用","保护 Convex 应用程序中的敏感操作"],"ja":["Convex 関数の認可ロジックを分析する","データアクセス境界の脆弱性を特定する","乱用を防ぐためにレート制限を実施する","Convex アプリケーションの機密操作を保護する"],"ko":["Convex 함수의 인증 로직 분석","데이터 액세스 경계의 취약점 식별","남용을 방지하기 위한 속도 제한 시행","Convex 애플리케이션의 민감한 동작 보호"],"es":["Análisis de lógica de autorización para funciones Convex","Identificación de vulnerabilidades de límites de acceso a datos","Implementación de limitación de velocidad para prevenir el abuso","Protección de operaciones sensibles en aplicaciones Convex"],"fr":["Analyse de la logique d''autorisation pour les fonctions Convex","Identification des vulnérabilités des limites d''accès aux données","Mise en œuvre de la limitation de débit pour prévenir les abus","Protection des opérations sensibles dans les applications Convex"],"de":["Analyse der Autorisierungslogik für Convex-Funktionen","Identifizierung von Schwachstellen bei den Datenzugriffsgrenzen","Implementierung von Rate Limiting, um Missbrauch zu verhindern","Schutz sensibler Operationen in Convex-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Analisar a lógica de autorização para funções Convex","Identificar vulnerabilidades de limites de acesso a dados","Implementar limitação de taxa para prevenir abusos","Proteger operações sensíveis em aplicativos Convex"],"ru":["Анализировать логику авторизации для функций Convex","Определять уязвимости границ доступа к данным","Реализовывать ограничение скорости для предотвращения злоупотреблений","Защищать чувствительные операции в приложениях Convex"],"ar":["تحليل منطق المصادقة لتطبيقات Convex","تحديد الثغرات في حدود الوصول إلى البيانات","تنفيذ قيود معدل لمنع الإساءة","حماية العمليات الحساسة في تطبيقات Convex"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex application documentation","Limited to Convex applications only","Needs up-to-date documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/"],"zh":["需要访问 Convex 应用程序文档","仅限 Convex 应用程序","需要从 https://docs.convex.dev/ 获取最新文档"],"ja":["Convex アプリケーションのドキュメントにアクセスする必要がある","Convex アプリケーションのみに限定される","https://docs.convex.dev/ から最新のドキュメントを取得する必要がある"],"ko":["Convex 애플리케이션 문서에 액세스해야 함","Convex 애플리케이션에만 제한됨","https://docs.convex.dev/ 에서 최신 문서를 얻어야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de la aplicación Convex","Limitado a aplicaciones Convex únicamente","Necesita documentación actualizada de https://docs.convex.dev/"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à la documentation de l''application Convex","Limité aux applications Convex uniquement","Nécessite une documentation à jour de https://docs.convex.dev/"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Dokumentation der Convex-Anwendung","Begrenzt auf Convex-Anwendungen nur","Benötigt aktuelle Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação do aplicativo Convex","Limitado a aplicativos Convex apenas","Necessita de documentação atualizada de https://docs.convex.dev/"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации приложения Convex","Ограничен только приложениями Convex","Требует актуальной документации с https://docs.convex.dev/"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق تطبيق Convex","محدود بتطبيقات Convex فقط","يحتاج إلى وثائق محدثة من https://docs.convex.dev/"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
