ndre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fal-platform","description":"Platform APIs for model management, pricing, and usage tracking","bodyPreview":"# Fal Platform\n\n## Overview\n\nPlatform APIs for model management, pricing, and usage tracking\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to work with platform apis for model management, pricing, and usage tracking.\n\n## Instructions\n\nThis skill provides guidance and patterns for platform apis for model management, pricing, and usage tracking.\n\nFor more information, see the [source repository](https://github.com/fal-ai-community/skills/blob/main/skills/claude.ai/fal-platform/SKILL.md)","body":"# Fal Platform\n\n## Overview\n\nPlatform APIs for model management, pricing, and usage tracking\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to work with platform apis for model management, pricing, and usage tracking.\n\n## Instructions\n\nThis skill provides guidance and patterns for platform apis for model management, pricing, and usage tracking.\n\nFor more information, see the [source repository](https://github.com/fal-ai-community/skills/blob/main/skills/claude.ai/fal-platform/SKILL.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:34:40.466Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Model Management Agents requiring advanced platform APIs for pricing and usage tracking.","zh":"适用于需要高级平台API进行价格和使用情况跟踪的模型管理代理。","ja":"モデル管理エージェントが価格や使用状況の追跡に高度なプラットフォームAPIを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"가격 및 사용량 추적을 위한 고급 플랫폼 API가 필요한 모델 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de modelos que requieren plataformas de API avanzadas para seguimiento de precios y uso.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de modèles nécessitant des API de plateforme avancées pour le suivi des prix et de l''utilisation.","de":"Ideal für Model-Management-Agents, die erweiterte Plattform-APIs für Preis- und Nutzungsverfolgung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Modelos que requerem APIs de plataforma avançadas para acompanhamento de preços e uso.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления моделями, требующих продвинутых платформенных API для отслеживания цен и использования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة النماذج التي تتطلب واجهات برمجة تطبيقات متقدمة للأصول من أجل تتبع الأسعار والاستخدام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage models, track usage, and handle pricing through platform APIs, utilizing APIs for model management, pricing, and usage tracking, and integrating with GitHub repositories like https://github.com/fal-ai-community/skills.","zh":"赋予代理管理模型、跟踪使用情况、通过平台API处理价格的能力，利用API进行模型管理、价格和使用情况跟踪，并与GitHub存储库（如https://github.com/fal-ai-community/skills）集成。","ja":"エージェントがモデルを管理し、使用状況を追跡し、プラットフォームAPIを使用して価格を処理する能力を提供し、モデル管理、価格、使用状況の追跡のためのAPIを利用し、GitHubリポジトリ（例：https://github.com/fal-ai-community/skills）と統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 모델을 관리하고 사용량을 추적하고 플랫폼 API를 사용하여 가격을 처리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 모델 관리, 가격 및 사용량 추적을 위한 API를 활용하고, GitHub 저장소(예: https://github.com/fal-ai-community/skills)와 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar modelos, realizar un seguimiento del uso y gestionar los precios a través de API de plataforma, utilizando API para la administración de modelos, precios y seguimiento de uso, e integrándose con repositorios de GitHub como https://github.com/fal-ai-community/skills.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les modèles, de suivre l''utilisation et de gérer les prix via les API de plateforme, en utilisant les API pour la gestion de modèles, les prix et le suivi de l''utilisation, et en s''intégrant avec les référentiels GitHub comme https://github.com/fal-ai-community/skills.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Modelle zu verwalten, die Nutzung zu verfolgen und Preise über Plattform-APIs zu handhaben, indem APIs für die Modellverwaltung, Preisgestaltung und Nutzungsverfolgung verwende