 увеличить спрос. Он включает в себя этап рынка, открытие меха...","ar":"تموضع الزوايا هو مهارة تساعد في العثور على الزاوية التسويقية الصحيحة لزيادة الطلب. إنه يتضمن مرحلة السوق واكتشاف الآليات واختيار الزوايا.","en":"Light Keepers 災防平台 - Taiwan Xiwang Lighthouse Association"},"definition":{"en":"Light Keepers 災防平台 - Taiwan Xiwang Lighthouse Association"},"features":{"zh":["市场阶段匹配","机制发现","角度选择","测试和优化","提高销量"],"ja":["市場段階のマッチング","メカニズムの発見","角度の選択","テストと最適化","売上の向上"],"ko":["시장 단계 매칭","메커니즘 발견","각도 선택","테스트 및 최적화","판매 증대"],"pt":["Análise de etapa de mercado","Descoberta de mecanismos","Seleção de ângulos","Testes e otimização","Aumento da demanda"],"ru":["Анализ этапа рынка","Открытие механизмов","Выбор углов","Тестирование и оптимизация","Увеличение спроса"],"ar":["تحليل مرحلة السوق","اكتشاف الآليات","اختيار الزوايا","اختبارات وتحسين","زيادة الطلب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["定位角度","营销策略","市场阶段匹配","机制发现","角度选择","测试和优化"],"ja":["ポジショニング 角度","マーケティング戦略","市場段階のマッチング","メカニズムの発見","角度の選択","テストと最適化"],"ko":["포지셔닝 각도","마케팅 전략","시장 단계 매칭","메커니즘 발견","각도 선택","테스트 및 최적화"],"pt":["posicionamento de ângulos","marketing de ângulos","aumento da demanda","análise de mercado","otimização de ângulos"],"ru":["позиционирование углов","маркетинг углов","увеличение спроса","анализ рынка","оптимизация углов"],"ar":["تموضع الزوايا","تسويق الزوايا","زيادة الطلب","تحليل السوق","تحسين الزوايا"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"light-keepers","repoPath":"xiangteng007/light-keepers","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"positioning-angles","description":"Use this skill when users need to find their unique marketing angle, differentiate from competitors, or transform their positioning. Activates for find my angle, how do I stand out, why isnt this selling, we sound like everyone else, or positioning strategy questions.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Positioning Angles - Find Your Unique Angle\n\n## Overview\n\nAct as a positioning strategist. Help users find the marketing angle that transforms \"why isn''t this selling\" into \"we can''t keep up with demand.\" Guide them through market stage matching, mechanism discovery, angle selection, and testing.\n\n**Core Principle:** \"One angle will outperform others 3-10x. Test, don''t guess.\"\n\n**Role:** Find angles. Name mechanisms. Differentiate positioning.\n\n## When This Activates\n\nThis skill auto-activates","body":"# Positioning Angles - Find Your Unique Angle\n\n## Overview\n\nAct as a positioning strategist. Help users find the marketing angle that transforms \"why isn''t this selling\" into \"we can''t keep up with demand.\" Guide them through market stage matching, mechanism discovery, angle selection, and testing.\n\n**Core Principle:** \"One angle will outperform others 3-10x. Test, don''t guess.\"\n\n**Role:** Find angles. Name mechanisms. Differentiate positioning.\n\n## When This Activates\n\nThis skill auto-activates when:\n\n- User says \"why isn''t this selling\"\n- User asks \"how do I stand out\"\n- User says \"we sound like everyone else\"\n- User asks \"what''s my unique angle\"\n- User mentions \"I need differentiation\"\n- User asks \"how do I position this\"\n- User says \"competitors are saying the same thing\"\n- User mentions low conversion or sales issues\n\n## The Framework: Positioning Angles\n\n**The 4-Step Process:**\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     POSITIONING ANGLES                          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  1. MATCH MARKET STAGE  →  What promise fits your market?      │\n│  2. FIND MECHANISM      →  What do you do that others skip?    │\n│  3. PICK ANGLE          →  Which angle type differentiates?    │\n│  4. TEST IT             →  Specific? Differentiated? Believable?│\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Execution Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Match Your Market Stage\n\nAsk the user:\n\n> **Tell me about your market:**\n>\n> 1. What do you sell? (Quick description)\n> 2. How aware is your audience of solutions like yours?\n> 3. How many competitors are saying similar things?\n> 4. Has your audience been burned before by similar promises?\n\n**Market Stage Matrix:**\n\n| Stage | Description | Promise Strategy | Template |\n|-------|-------------|------------------|----------|\n| **NEW** | Audience doesn''t know solution exists | Simple promise | \"Now you can [X]\" |\n| **GROWING** | Audience knows solution, few competitors | Bigger claim | \"[X] in [specific time]\" |\n| **CROWDED** | Many competitors, similar claims | Show mechanism | \"The [method] that works\" |\n| **JADED** | Audience skeptical, been burned before | Prove it | \"[Data/proof] that shows\" |\n| **MATURE** | Solution commoditized, price wars | Sell identity | \"For [people who are X]\" |\n\n**Stage Indicators:**\n\n| Stage | Signs You''re Here |\n|-------|-------------------|\n| NEW | \"What is this?\" / Little competition / Educating market |\n| GROWING | Competition emerging / Claims escalating / Features matter |\n| CROWDED | \"I''ve seen this before\" / Many alternatives / Trust declining |\n| JADED | \"I''ve tried everything\" / Cynicism / Needs proof |\n| MATURE | Price is main factor / Commoditized / Identity-based buying |\n\n**Discovery Questions:**\n\n- When you describe what you do, do people say \"what''s that?\" (NEW) or \"oh yeah, like [competitor]\" (CROWDED)?\n- Are competitors making bold claims, or is everyone cautious?\n- Has your audience tried and failed with similar solutions?\n\n### Step 2: Find Your Mechanism\n\nThe mechanism is what you do that competitors skip.\n\n> **What makes your approach different:**\n>\n> 1. What''s one thing you do that others don''t bother with?\n> 2. What step do competitors skip that you insist on?\n> 3. What would your best customer say about why you''re different?\n> 4. What''s the \"unfair advantage\" in your process?\n\n**Mechanism Discovery Framework:**\n\n```\nCOMPETITORS DO:         YOU DO:\n────────────────        ────────────\n[Generic approach]  →   [Your specific thing]\n[Skip this step]    →   [You always do this]\n[Rush this part]    →   [You spend extra time here]\n```\n\n**Naming Your Mechanism:**\n\n| Bad (Generic) | Good (Specific) |\n|---------------|-----------------|\n| \"Our unique approach\" | \"The [X] Method\" |\n| \"Our proven system\" | \"The [X] Framework\" |\n| \"Our special process\" | \"The [X] Protocol\" |\n| \"What we do differently\" | \"[Name] Technique\" |\n\n**Mechanism Formula:**\n\n```\n\"The [Descriptive Adjective] [Core Action] [Framework Type]\"\n\nExamples:\n- \"The Reverse Funnel Framework\"\n- \"The 3-Layer Positioning Protocol\"\n- \"The Rapid Validation Method\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Pick Your Angle\n\nPresent 5 angle types. Generate variations for their situation.\n\n**Angle Types:**\n\n| Angle | When to Use | Template | Example |\n|-------|-------------|----------|---------|\n| **CONTRARIAN** | Audience believes wrong thing | \"Everything you know about [X] is wrong\" | \"Everything you know about dieting is wrong—it''s not about eating less\" |\n| **TRANSFORMATION** | Clear before/after exists | \"From [painful state] to [desired state]\" | \"From scattered freelancer to $20k/month agency owner\" |\n| **ENEMY** | External blame resonates | \"Stop letting [X] steal your [Y]\" | \"Stop letting algorithm changes steal your traffic\" |\n| **SPEED** | Time is the constraint | \"[Outcome] in [time] without [sacrifice]\" | \"Launch in 7 days without hiring developers\" |\n| **SPECIFICITY** | Crowded market, need niche | \"For [exact person] who wants [exact thing]\" | \"For B2B SaaS founders who want enterprise clients\" |\n\n**Angle Selection Questions:**\n\n- Does your audience believe something wrong? → CONTRARIAN\n- Is there a clear before/after? → TRANSFORMATION\n- Can you blame something external? → ENEMY\n- Is speed a key desire? → SPEED\n- Is your market crowded? → SPECIFICITY\n\n**Generate 3 Variations:**\n\nFor each angle type that fits, generate a specific version:\n\n```\nANGLE 1 (Primary recommendation):\n\"[Complete angle statement]\"\nType: [Angle Type]\nWhy: [Why this fits their situation]\n\nANGLE 2 (Alternative):\n\"[Complete angle statement]\"\nType: [Angle Type]\nWhy: [Why this could work]\n\nANGLE 3 (Alternative):\n\"[Complete angle statement]\"\nType: [Angle Type]\nWhy: [Why this could work]\n```\n\n### Step 4: Test It\n\nRun each angle through the 3-point test:\n\n**The 3-Point Angle Test:**\n\n| Test | Question | Pass Criteria | Fail Example |\n|------|----------|---------------|--------------|\n| **Specific?** | Can I visualize the result? | Numbers, timeframes, concrete outcomes | \"Better results\" (vague) |\n| **Differentiated?** | Can a competitor say the same? | Only this brand can make this claim | \"We help you grow\" (anyone can say) |\n| **Believable?** | Does mechanism/proof support it? | Evidence backs the claim | \"10x your business overnight\" (no proof) |\n\n**Scoring:**\n\n| Score | Rating | Action |\n|-------|--------|--------|\n| 3/3 | Strong | Test this angle |\n| 2/3 | Weak | Strengthen the failing point |\n| 1/3 | Very Weak | Pick different angle |\n| 0/3 | Don''t Use | Complete rework needed |\n\n**Specificity Upgrade Examples:**\n\n| Before (Vague) | After (Specific) |\n|----------------|------------------|\n| \"Better results\" | \"20 lbs in 6 weeks\" |\n| \"More revenue\" | \"$50k MRR in 90 days\" |\n| \"Save time\" | \"2 hours back every day\" |\n| \"Grow your business\" | \"Add 10 enterprise clients this quarter\" |\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# Positioning Angle Analysis: [Product/Service]\n\n## Market Stage Assessment\n\n**Current Stage:** [NEW/GROWING/CROWDED/JADED/MATURE]\n\n**Evidence:**\n- [Sign 1]\n- [Sign 2]\n- [Sign 3]\n\n**Recommended Promise Strategy:** [Strategy from matrix]\n\n---\n\n## Your Mechanism\n\n**What You Do That Others Skip:**\n> [Description of unique approach]\n\n**Mechanism Name:** \"The [X] [Method/Framework/Protocol]\"\n\n**Why This Works:**\n> [Brief explanation]\n\n---\n\n## Angle Recommendations\n\n### Primary Angle (Recommended)\n\n**Statement:**\n> \"[Complete angle statement]\"\n\n**Type:** [Angle Type]\n\n**Test Results:**\n| Test | Result | Notes |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| Specific? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Differentiated? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Believable? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n\n**Score:** [X/3]\n\n---\n\n### Alternative Angle 1\n\n**Statement:**\n> \"[Complete angle statement]\"\n\n**Type:** [Angle Type]\n\n**Test Results:**\n| Test | Result | Notes |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| Specific? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Differentiated? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Believable? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n\n**Score:** [X/3]\n\n---\n\n### Alternative Angle 2\n\n**Statement:**\n> \"[Complete angle statement]\"\n\n**Type:** [Angle Type]\n\n**Test Results:**\n| Test | Result | Notes |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| Specific? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Differentiated? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Believable? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n\n**Score:** [X/3]\n\n---\n\n## Testing Recommendation\n\n**Angle to Test First:** [Primary recommendation]\n\n**Why:** [Rationale]\n\n**How to Test:**\n1. [ ] Use in headline A/B test\n2. [ ] Test in cold outreach subject lines\n3. [ ] Try in social media hooks\n4. [ ] Use in ad copy\n\n**Success Metrics:**\n- Click-through rate improvement\n- Conversion rate improvement\n- Response rate improvement\n\n---\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. [ ] Test primary angle in [specific context]\n2. [ ] If underperforms, test alternative angles\n3. [ ] Once validated, use in all messaging\n4. [ ] Build offer around winning angle with `offer-architect`\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Before/After Transformations\n\n**❌ Before (Weak Angles):**\n\n| Product | Weak Angle | Problem |\n|---------|-----------|---------|\n| Marketing agency | \"We help you grow\" | Generic, anyone can say it |\n| Fitness app | \"Get fit faster\" | Vague, not specific |\n| SaaS tool | \"Save time on [task]\" | No differentiation |\n| Course | \"Learn [skill]\" | No transformation shown |\n\n**✅ After (Strong Angles):**\n\n| Product | Strong Angle | Why It Works |\n|---------|-------------|--------------|\n| Marketing agency | \"For B2B SaaS founders who want enterprise clients in 90 days using the Account Penetration Method\" | SPECIFICITY + SPEED + MECHANISM |\n| Fitness app | \"20 lbs in 6 weeks without giving up the foods you love, using the Metabolic Reset Protocol\" | SPEED + MECHANISM + SPECIFIC |\n| SaaS tool | \"Stop letting manual data entry steal 2 hours of your day\" | ENEMY + SPECIFIC |\n| Course | \"From complete beginner to first paid client in 30 days\" | TRANSFORMATION + SPEED |\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n| Skill | When to Use Together |\n|-------|---------------------|\n| `offer-architect` | After finding angle, build complete offer around it |\n| `copywriter` | Write headlines and copy using the angle |\n| `expert-architect` | Build authority positioning that supports the angle |\n| `funnel-architect` | Design funnel messaging using the angle |\n| `channel-validator` | Validate where to distribute the angle |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n1. **Skipping market stage analysis** - Different stages need different promise types\n2. **Generic mechanisms** - \"Our unique approach\" tells nothing\n3. **Testing only one angle** - One angle outperforms by 3-10x, multiple tests are required\n4. **Vague specificity** - \"Better results\" isn''t an angle\n5. **Claims without proof** - JADED markets need evidence\n6. **Identity-selling too early** - Save this for MATURE markets\n7. **Copying competitor angles** - If they say it, differentiation is impossible\n\n## When to Route Elsewhere\n\n- If user needs to **build complete expert positioning** → `expert-architect`\n- If user needs to **validate their positioning** → `expert-validator`\n- If user needs to **build the offer** → `offer-architect`\n- If user needs to **write copy** → `copywriter`\n- If user is **stuck on execution** → `execution-accelerator`\n- If user needs to **validate market size** → `market-sizer`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:35:26.027Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Strategy Agents needing advanced market analysis and positioning capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级市场分析和定位能力的营销策略代理","ja":"マーケティング戦略エージェントが高度な市場分析およびポジショニング機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 시장 분석 및 위치 지정 기능이 필요한 마케팅 전략 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de estrategia de marketing que necesitan capacidades de análisis y posicionamiento de mercado avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de stratégie marketing ayant besoin d''une analyse et de capacités de positionnement de marché avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Strategie-Agents, die erweiterte Marktanalyse- und Positionierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Estratégia de Marketing que precisam de análise de mercado avançada e capacidades de posicionamento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по маркетинговой стратегии, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа рынка и позиционирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل استراتيجية التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم للسوق و_FUNCIONALIDADES من أجل التموضع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover unique marketing angles using mechanism discovery and angle selection, leveraging market stage matching and testing to outperform others 3-10x, all while utilizing core principles like ''One angle will outperform others 3-10x'' and ''Test, don''t guess''.","zh":"赋予代理发现独特的营销角度的能力，利用机制发现和角度选择，利用市场阶段匹配和测试来超越他人 3-10 倍，同时利用核心原则如 ''一个角度将超越其他 3-10 倍'' 和 ''测试，不要猜测''","ja":"エージェントに独自のマーケティングの視点を発見する能力を与え、メカニズムの発見と視点の選択を利用し、マーケットステージのマッチングとテストを利用して他者を 3-10 倍上回り、同時に ''1 つの視点は他者を 3-10 倍上回る'' や ''テストを実施し、推測しない'' などの基本原則を利用","ko":"에이전트가 고유한 마케팅 角度를 발견할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 메커니즘 발견 및 角度 선택을 활용하고 시장 단계 일치 및 테스트를 통해 다른 사람을 3-10 배 능가하고 ''하나의 角度는 다른 사람을 3-10 배 능가한다'' 또는 ''테스트를 수행하고 추측하지 마세요''와 같은 핵심 원칙을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descubrir ángulos de marketing únicos utilizando el descubrimiento de mecanismos y la selección de ángulos, aprovechando la coincidencia de etapas de mercado y las pruebas para superar a los demás 3-10 veces, todo mientras utiliza principios básicos como ''Un ángulo superará a los demás 3-10 veces'' y ''Probar, no adivinar''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir des angles de marketing uniques en utilisant la découverte de mécanismes et la sélection d''angles, en exploitant la correspondance des étapes de marché et les tests pour surpasser les autres 3-10 fois, tout en utilisant des principes de base comme ''Un angle surpassera les autres 3-10 fois'' et ''Tester, ne pas deviner''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, einzigartige Marketingwinkel mithilfe von Mechanismus-Entdeckung und Winkel-Auswahl zu entdecken, indem sie die Marktplatz-Phasen-Übereinstimmung und Tests nutzen, um andere um 3-10 Mal zu überbieten, und dabei grundlegende Prinzipien wie ''Ein Winkel wird andere um 3-10 Mal überbieten'' und ''Testen, nicht raten'' verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrir ângulos de marketing exclusivos usando descoberta de mecanismos e seleção de ângulos, aproveitando a correspondência de estágios de mercado e testes para superar os outros 3-10x, tudo isso utilizando princípios básicos como ''Um ângulo superará os outros 3-10x'' e ''Teste, não adivinhe''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью открывать уникальные маркетинговые углы с помощью открытия механизмов и выбора углов, используя сопоставление стадий рынка и тестирование для превосходства над другими в 3-10 раз, все это при использовании основных принципов, таких как ''Один угол превосходит другие в 3-10 раз'' и ''Тестируйте, не угадывайте''.","ar":"يمكن للعميل اكتشاف زوايا تسويقية فريدة من نوعها باستخدام اكتشاف الآليات واختيار الزوايا، واستغلال مطابقة مرحلة السوق والاختبارات لتتفوق على الآخرين 3-10 مرات، وكل ذلك باستخدام المبادئ الأساسية مثل ''زاوية واحدة سوف تتفوق على الأخرى 3-10 مرات'' و ''اختبر، لا تخمن''."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating market stage matching for optimal product placement","Generating unique marketing angles through mechanism discovery","Testing and validating marketing strategies to maximize demand"],"zh":["自动化市场阶段匹配以实现最佳产品摆放","通过机制发现生成独特的营销角度","测试和验证营销策略以最大化需求"],"ja":["最適な製品の配置のためのマーケットステージのマッチングの自動化","メカニズムの発見を通じて独自のマーケティングの視点を生成","マーケティング戦略のテストと検証を通じて需要を最大化"],"ko":["최적의 제품 배치 위한 시장 단계 일치 자동화","메커니즘 발견을 통해 고유한 마케팅 角度 생성","테스트 및 검증을 통해 마케팅 전략의 수요 최대화"],"es":["Automatización de la coincidencia de etapas de mercado para una colocación óptima de productos","Generación de ángulos de marketing únicos a través del descubrimiento de mecanismos","Pruebas y validación de estrategias de marketing para maximizar la demanda"],"fr":["Automatisation de la correspondance des étapes de marché pour un placement de produits optimal","Génération d''angles de marketing uniques via la découverte de mécanismes","Tests et validation de stratégies de marketing pour maximiser la demande"],"de":["Automatisierung der Marktplatz-Phasen-Übereinstimmung für eine optimale Produktplatzierung","Erzeugung einzigartiger Marketingwinkel durch Mechanismus-Entdeckung","Tests und Validierung von Marketingstrategien, um die Nachfrage zu maximieren"],"pt":["Automatizar a correspondência de estágios de mercado para o posicionamento ótimo de produtos","Gerar ângulos de marketing exclusivos por meio da descoberta de mecanismos","Testar e validar estratégias de marketing para maximizar a demanda"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сопоставление стадий рынка для оптимального позиционирования продуктов","Генерировать уникальные маркетинговые углы с помощью открытия механизмов","Тестировать и проверять маркетинговые стратегии для максимизации спроса"],"ar":["تأتمة مطابقة مرحلة السوق من أجل وضع المنتجات الأمثل","توليد زوايا تسويقية فريدة من خلال اكتشاف الآليات","اختبار وتأكيد استراتيجيات التسويق لتوسيع الطلب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires market data and analysis capabilities","Limited to marketing and sales strategy applications"],"zh":["需要市场数据和分析能力","仅限于营销和销售策略应用"],"ja":["マーケットデータと分析能力が必要","マーケティングおよびセールス戦略への適用のみ"],"ko":["시장 데이터 및 분석 능력이 필요","마케팅 및 판매 전략 적용에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere datos y capacidades de análisis de mercado","Limitado a aplicaciones de estrategia de marketing y ventas"],"fr":["Nécessite des données et des capacités d''analyse de marché","Limité aux applications de stratégie marketing et vente"],"de":["Benötigt Marktdaten und Analysefähigkeiten","Begrenzt auf Marketing- und Verkaufsstrategie-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige dados de mercado e capacidades de análise","Limitado a aplicações de estratégia de marketing e vendas"],"ru":["Требует данных рынка и возможностей анализа","Ограничен приложениями маркетинговой и продажной стратегии"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات السوق والقدرات التحليلية","محدود لتطبيقات استراتيجية التسويق والمبيعات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
