age de figma y creara un tema wordpres con los textox configurables"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"实现设计 - Figma 到 WordPress 的无缝转换","ja":"デザインの実装 - Figma から WordPress へのシームレスな変換","ko":"디자인 구현 - Figma에서 WordPress로의 무缝 전환","es":"Implementar Diseño con IA: Crea Temas WordPress","fr":"Mettre en œuvre la conception avec l''IA: Créez des thèmes...","de":"Designimplementierung mit KI: Erstellen Sie WordPress-Themes","pt":"Implemente Design: Crie Temas WordPress com Figma","ru":"Реализуйте Дизайн: Создайте Темы WordPress с Figma","ar":"نفذ التصميم: أنشئ موضوعات ووردبريس مع فيجما","en":"implement-design"},"description":{"zh":"此技能提供了一种结构化的工作流程，将Figma设计转换为生产就绪的代码，确保了一致的集成和设计令牌的使用","ja":"このスキルは、Figmaデザインを生产就绪のコードに変換するための構造化されたワークフローを提供します。一貫した統合とデザイントークンの使用を保証します","ko":"이 스킬은 Figma 디자인을 생산 준비 코드로 변환하는 구조화된 워크플로우를 제공합니다. 일관된 통합 및 디자인 토큰 사용을 보장합니다","es":"Nuestra habilidad de implementación de diseño ofrece un flujo de trabajo estructurado para traducir diseños de Figma en código listo para producción con prec...","fr":"Notre compétence de mise en œuvre de la conception offre un flux de travail structuré pour convertir les conceptions Figma en code prêt pour la production av...","de":"Unsere Designimplementierungsfähigkeit bietet einen strukturierten Workflow, um Figma-Designs in produktionsbereiten Code mit pixelgenauer Präzision umzuwand...","pt":"O skill Implement Design permite criar temas WordPress personalizados com precisão pixel-perfeita a partir de designs Figma. Ele garante a integração consist...","ru":"Навык Реализуйте Дизайн позволяет создать индивидуальные темы WordPress с точностью пикселя из дизайнов Figma. Он обеспечивает последовательную интеграцию с ...","ar":"مهارة تنفيذ التصميم تسمح بإنشاء موضوعات ووردبريس مخصصة بدقة بكسل مثالية من تصاميم Figma. إنها تضمن التكامل المستمر مع خادم Figma MCP واستخدام رموز التصميم ال...","en":"Con ayuda de IA, va a obtener una ladingpage de figma y creara un tema wordpres con los textox configurables"},"definition":{"en":"Con ayuda de IA, va a obtener una ladingpage de figma y creara un tema wordpres con los textox configurables"},"features":{"zh":["支持Figma设计到WordPress主题的自动转换","配置文本和设计令牌","确保一致的集成和设计令牌的使用","生产就绪的代码输出","支持Figma MCP服务器连接"],"ja":["FigmaデザインをWordPressテーマに自動変換する機能","テキストとデザイントークンの設定","一貫した統合とデザイントークンの使用を保証","生产就绪のコード出力","Figma MCPサーバーの接続をサポート"],"ko":["Figma 디자인을 WordPress 테마로 자동 변환하는 기능","텍스트 및 디자인 토큰 설정","일관된 통합 및 디자인 토큰 사용을 보장","생산 준비 코드 출력","Figma MCP 서버 연결 지원"],"es":["Conversión de diseños de Figma en código listo para producción","Integración con el servidor Figma MCP","Uso de tokens de diseño para una mayor flexibilidad","Paridad visual 1:1 con los diseños","Tema WordPress configurable"],"fr":["Conversion de conceptions Figma en code prêt pour la production","Intégration avec le serveur Figma MCP","Utilisation de jetons de conception pour une plus grande flexibilité","Parité visuelle 1:1 avec les conceptions","Thème WordPress configurable"],"de":["Umwandlung von Figma-Designs in produktionsbereiten Code","Integration mit dem Figma-MCP-Server","Verwendung von Designtoken für eine größere Flexibilität","Visuelle Parität 1:1 mit den Designs","Konfigurierbares WordPress-Thema"],"pt":["Criação de temas WordPress personalizados","Integração com servidor Figma MCP","Uso de tokens de design","Precisão pixel-perfeita","Fluxo de trabalho estruturado","Código de produção pronto"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных тем WordPress","Интеграция с сервером Figma MCP","Использование токенов дизайна","Точность пикселя","Структурированный рабочий процесс","Готовый код производства"],"ar":["إنشاء موضوعات ووردبريس مخصصة","التكامل مع خادم Figma MCP","استخدام رموز التصميم","الدقة بكسل مثالية","تدفق عمل منظم","كود إنتاج جاهز"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Figma","WordPress","AI","设计转换","生产就绪代码","设计令牌","一致集成"],"ja":["Figma","WordPress","AI","デザイン変換","生产就绪コード","デザイントークン","一貫統合"],"ko":["Figma","WordPress","AI","디자인 변환","생산 준비 코드","디자인 토큰","일관 통합"],"es":["implementación de diseño","Figma","WordPress","diseño de interfaz de usuario","desarrollo web","IA","conversión de diseño","integración con Figma MCP"],"fr":["mise en œuvre de la conception","Figma","WordPress","conception d''interface utilisateur","développement web","IA","conversion de conception","intégration avec Figma MCP"],"de":["Designimplementierung","Figma","WordPress","Benutzeroberflächendesign","Webentwicklung","KI","Designumwandlung","Integration mit Figma MCP"],"pt":["Implement Design","Figma","WordPress","desenvolvimento web","design de UI","tokens de design","precisão pixel-perfeita","código de produção"],"ru":["Реализуйте Дизайн","Figma","WordPress","веб-разработка","дизайн интерфейса","токены дизайна","точность пикселя","код производства"],"ar":["تنفيذ التصميم","Figma","ووردبريس","تطوير الويب","تصميم الواجهة","رموز التصميم","الدقة بكسل","كود الإنتاج"]}},"owner":"ErickAguilar95","repo":"full_wordpress_figma_creator","repoPath":"ErickAguilar95/full_wordpress_figma_creator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implement-design","description":"Translates Figma designs into production-ready code with 1:1 visual fidelity. Use when implementing UI from Figma files, when user mentions implement design, generate code, implement component, build Figma design, provides Figma URLs, or asks to build components matching Figma specs. Requires Figma MCP server connection.","bodyPreview":"# Implement Design\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides a structured workflow for translating Figma designs into production-ready code with pixel-perfect accuracy. It ensures consistent integration with the Figma MCP server, proper use of design tokens, and 1:1 visual parity with designs.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Figma MCP server must be connected and accessible\n- User must provide a Figma URL in the format: `https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2`\n  - `:fileKey` is the file key\n  - `1","body":"# Implement Design\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides a structured workflow for translating Figma designs into production-ready code with pixel-perfect accuracy. It ensures consistent integration with the Figma MCP server, proper use of design tokens, and 1:1 visual parity with designs.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Figma MCP server must be connected and accessible\n- User must provide a Figma URL in the format: `https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2`\n  - `:fileKey` is the file key\n  - `1-2` is the node ID (the specific component or frame to implement)\n- **OR** when using `figma-desktop` MCP: User can select a node directly in the Figma desktop app (no URL required)\n- Project should have an established design system or component library (preferred)\n\n## Required Workflow\n\n**Follow these steps in order. Do not skip steps.**\n\n### Step 1: Get Node ID\n\n#### Option A: Parse from Figma URL\n\nWhen the user provides a Figma URL, extract the file key and node ID to pass as arguments to MCP tools.\n\n**URL format:** `https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2`\n\n**Extract:**\n\n- **File key:** `:fileKey` (the segment after `/design/`)\n- **Node ID:** `1-2` (the value of the `node-id` query parameter)\n\n**Note:** When using the local desktop MCP (`figma-desktop`), `fileKey` is not passed as a parameter to tool calls. The server automatically uses the currently open file, so only `nodeId` is needed.\n\n**Example:**\n\n- URL: `https://figma.com/design/kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF/DesignSystem?node-id=42-15`\n- File key: `kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF`\n- Node ID: `42-15`\n\n#### Option B: Use Current Selection from Figma Desktop App (figma-desktop MCP only)\n\nWhen using the `figma-desktop` MCP and the user has NOT provided a URL, the tools automatically use the currently selected node from the open Figma file in the desktop app.\n\n**Note:** Selection-based prompting only works with the `figma-desktop` MCP server. The remote server requires a link to a frame or layer to extract context. The user must have the Figma desktop app open with a node selected.\n\n### Step 2: Fetch Design Context\n\nRun `get_design_context` with the extracted file key and node ID.\n\n```\nget_design_context(fileKey=\":fileKey\", nodeId=\"1-2\")\n```\n\nThis provides the structured data including:\n\n- Layout properties (Auto Layout, constraints, sizing)\n- Typography specifications\n- Color values and design tokens\n- Component structure and variants\n- Spacing and padding values\n\n**If the response is too large or truncated:**\n\n1. Run `get_metadata(fileKey=\":fileKey\", nodeId=\"1-2\")` to get the high-level node map\n2. Identify the specific child nodes needed from the metadata\n3. Fetch individual child nodes with `get_design_context(fileKey=\":fileKey\", nodeId=\":childNodeId\")`\n\n### Step 3: Capture Visual Reference\n\nRun `get_screenshot` with the same file key and node ID for a visual reference.\n\n```\nget_screenshot(fileKey=\":fileKey\", nodeId=\"1-2\")\n```\n\nThis screenshot serves as the source of truth for visual validation. Keep it accessible throughout implementation.\n\n### Step 4: Download Required Assets\n\nDownload any assets (images, icons, SVGs) returned by the Figma MCP server.\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Follow these asset rules:\n\n- If the Figma MCP server returns a `localhost` source for an image or SVG, use that source directly\n- DO NOT import or add new icon packages - all assets should come from the Figma payload\n- DO NOT use or create placeholders if a `localhost` source is provided\n- Assets are served through the Figma MCP server''s built-in assets endpoint\n\n### Step 5: Translate to Project Conventions\n\nTranslate the Figma output into this project''s framework, styles, and conventions.\n\n**Key principles:**\n\n- Treat the Figma MCP output (typically React + Tailwind) as a representation of design and behavior, not as final code style\n- Replace Tailwind utility classes with the project''s preferred utilities or design system tokens\n- Reuse existing components (buttons, inputs, typography, icon wrappers) instead of duplicating functionality\n- Use the project''s color system, typography scale, and spacing tokens consistently\n- Respect existing routing, state management, and data-fetch patterns\n\n### Step 6: Achieve 1:1 Visual Parity\n\nStrive for pixel-perfect visual parity with the Figma design.\n\n**Guidelines:**\n\n- Prioritize Figma fidelity to match designs exactly\n- Avoid hardcoded values - use design tokens from Figma where available\n- When conflicts arise between design system tokens and Figma specs, prefer design system tokens but adjust spacing or sizes minimally to match visuals\n- Follow WCAG requirements for accessibility\n- Add component documentation as needed\n\n### Step 7: Validate Against Figma\n\nBefore marking complete, validate the final UI against the Figma screenshot.\n\n**Validation checklist:**\n\n- [ ] Layout matches (spacing, alignment, sizing)\n- [ ] Typography matches (font, size, weight, line height)\n- [ ] Colors match exactly\n- [ ] Interactive states work as designed (hover, active, disabled)\n- [ ] Responsive behavior follows Figma constraints\n- [ ] Assets render correctly\n- [ ] Accessibility standards met\n\n## Implementation Rules\n\n### Component Organization\n\n- Place UI components in the project''s designated design system directory\n- Follow the project''s component naming conventions\n- Avoid inline styles unless truly necessary for dynamic values\n\n### Design System Integration\n\n- ALWAYS use components from the project''s design system when possible\n- Map Figma design tokens to project design tokens\n- When a matching component exists, extend it rather than creating a new one\n- Document any new components added to the design system\n\n### Code Quality\n\n- Avoid hardcoded values - extract to constants or design tokens\n- Keep components composable and reusable\n- Add TypeScript types for component props\n- Include JSDoc comments for exported components\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Implementing a Button Component\n\nUser says: \"Implement this Figma button component: https://figma.com/design/kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF/DesignSystem?node-id=42-15\"\n\n**Actions:**\n\n1. Parse URL to extract fileKey=`kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF` and nodeId=`42-15`\n2. Run `get_design_context(fileKey=\"kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF\", nodeId=\"42-15\")`\n3. Run `get_screenshot(fileKey=\"kL9xQn2VwM8pYrTb4ZcHjF\", nodeId=\"42-15\")` for visual reference\n4. Download any button icons from the assets endpoint\n5. Check if project has existing button component\n6. If yes, extend it with new variant; if no, create new component using project conventions\n7. Map Figma colors to project design tokens (e.g., `primary-500`, `primary-hover`)\n8. Validate against screenshot for padding, border radius, typography\n\n**Result:** Button component matching Figma design, integrated with project design system.\n\n### Example 2: Building a Dashboard Layout\n\nUser says: \"Build this dashboard: https://figma.com/design/pR8mNv5KqXzGwY2JtCfL4D/Dashboard?node-id=10-5\"\n\n**Actions:**\n\n1. Parse URL to extract fileKey=`pR8mNv5KqXzGwY2JtCfL4D` and nodeId=`10-5`\n2. Run `get_metadata(fileKey=\"pR8mNv5KqXzGwY2JtCfL4D\", nodeId=\"10-5\")` to understand the page structure\n3. Identify main sections from metadata (header, sidebar, content area, cards) and their child node IDs\n4. Run `get_design_context(fileKey=\"pR8mNv5KqXzGwY2JtCfL4D\", nodeId=\":childNodeId\")` for each major section\n5. Run `get_screenshot(fileKey=\"pR8mNv5KqXzGwY2JtCfL4D\", nodeId=\"10-5\")` for the full page\n6. Download all assets (logos, icons, charts)\n7. Build layout using project''s layout primitives\n8. Implement each section using existing components where possible\n9. Validate responsive behavior against Figma constraints\n\n**Result:** Complete dashboard matching Figma design with responsive layout.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Always Start with Context\n\nNever implement based on assumptions. Always fetch `get_design_context` and `get_screenshot` first.\n\n### Incremental Validation\n\nValidate frequently during implementation, not just at the end. This catches issues early.\n\n### Document Deviations\n\nIf you must deviate from the Figma design (e.g., for accessibility or technical constraints), document why in code comments.\n\n### Reuse Over Recreation\n\nAlways check for existing components before creating new ones. Consistency across the codebase is more important than exact Figma replication.\n\n### Design System First\n\nWhen in doubt, prefer the project''s design system patterns over literal Figma translation.\n\n## Common Issues and Solutions\n\n### Issue: Figma output is truncated\n\n**Cause:** The design is too complex or has too many nested layers to return in a single response.\n**Solution:** Use `get_metadata` to get the node structure, then fetch specific nodes individually with `get_design_context`.\n\n### Issue: Design doesn''t match after implementation\n\n**Cause:** Visual discrepancies between the implemented code and the original Figma design.\n**Solution:** Compare side-by-side with the screenshot from Step 3. Check spacing, colors, and typography values in the design context data.\n\n### Issue: Assets not loading\n\n**Cause:** The Figma MCP server''s assets endpoint is not accessible or the URLs are being modified.\n**Solution:** Verify the Figma MCP server''s assets endpoint is accessible. The server serves assets at `localhost` URLs. Use these directly without modification.\n\n### Issue: Design token values differ from Figma\n\n**Cause:** The project''s design system tokens have different values than those specified in the Figma design.\n**Solution:** When project tokens differ from Figma values, prefer project tokens for consistency but adjust spacing/sizing to maintain visual fidelity.\n\n## Understanding Design Implementation\n\nThe Figma implementation workflow establishes a reliable process for translating designs to code:\n\n**For designers:** Confidence that implementations will match their designs with pixel-perfect accuracy.\n**For developers:** A structured approach that eliminates guesswork and reduces back-and-forth revisions.\n**For teams:** Consistent, high-quality implementations that maintain design system integrity.\n\nBy following this workflow, you ensure that every Figma design is implemented with the same level of care and attention to detail.\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- [Figma MCP Server Documentation](https://developers.figma.com/docs/figma-mcp-server/)\n- [Figma MCP Server Tools and Prompts](https://developers.figma.com/docs/figma-mcp-server/tools-and-prompts/)\n- [Figma Variables and Design Tokens](https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/15339657135383-Guide-to-variables-in-Figma)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:34:59.872Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents needing to translate Figma designs into production-ready WordPress themes with pixel-perfect accuracy.","zh":"适用于需要将 Figma 设计转换为生产就绪的 WordPress 主题的前端代理，具有像素级准确性。","ja":"Figma のデザインを生产向けの WordPress テーマに変換する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。ピクセルレベルの精度を備えています。","ko":"픽셀 단위의 정확도로 Figma 디자인을 생산 준비가 된 워드프레스 테마로 변환해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que necesitan traducir diseños de Figma a temas de WordPress listos para producción con precisión de píxel perfecta.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de traduire des conceptions Figma en thèmes WordPress prêts pour la production avec une précision de pixel parfaite.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die Figma-Designs in produktionsreife WordPress-Themes mit pixelgenauer Genauigkeit übersetzen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que precisam traduzir designs do Figma em temas do WordPress prontos para produção com precisão perfeita de pixel.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо переводить дизайны Figma в готовые к производству темы WordPress с точностью до пикселя.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى ترجمة تصاميم Figma إلى مواضيع WordPress جاهزة للإنتاج بدقة بكسل مثالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create customizable WordPress themes from Figma designs using design tokens and ensuring 1:1 visual parity, while integrating with the Figma MCP server and utilizing Figma URLs for seamless design import.","zh":"赋予代理创建可自定义的 WordPress 主题的能力，使用设计令牌从 Figma 设计中创建，并确保 1:1 的视觉一致性，同时与 Figma MCP 服务器集成并利用 Figma URL 实现无缝的设计导入。","ja":"エージェントがデザイン トークンを使用して Figma のデザインからカスタマイズ可能な WordPress テーマを作成し、1:1 の視覚的一貫性を確保する能力を提供します。Figma MCP サーバーとの統合と Figma URL を使用したシームレスなデザインのインポートも可能です。","ko":"에이전트가 디자인 토큰을 사용하여 피그마 디자인에서 사용자 지정 가능한 워드프레스 테마를 생성하고 1:1의 시각적 일관성을 보장하는 기능을 제공합니다. 피그마 MCP 서버와의 통합 및 피그마 URL을 사용한 무縫한 디자인 가져오기도 가능합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear temas personalizables de WordPress a partir de diseños de Figma utilizando tokens de diseño y asegurando una paridad visual 1:1, al mismo tiempo que se integra con el servidor Figma MCP y se utilizan URLs de Figma para una importación de diseño sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des thèmes WordPress personnalisables à partir de conceptions Figma en utilisant des jetons de conception et en assurant une parité visuelle 1:1, tout en s''intégrant au serveur Figma MCP et en utilisant des URLs Figma pour une importation de conception sans accroc.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, anpassbare WordPress-Themes aus Figma-Designs zu erstellen, indem Design-Tokens verwendet und eine 1:1-Visueller-Paritäts-Garantie gewährleistet wird, während gleichzeitig die Integration mit dem Figma-MCP-Server und die Verwendung von Figma-URLs für eine nahtlose Designimport gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar temas personalizáveis do WordPress a partir de designs do Figma usando tokens de design e garantindo paridade visual 1:1, ao mesmo tempo em que se integra ao servidor Figma MCP e utiliza URLs do Figma para importação de design sem interrupção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать настраиваемые темы WordPress из дизайнов Figma с использованием токенов дизайна и обеспечением визуального паритета 1:1, а также интегрируется с сервером Figma MCP и использует URLs Figma для бесшовного импорта дизайна.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على إنشاء مواضيع قابلة للتخصيص من WordPress من تصاميم Figma باستخدام رموز التصميم وضمان التماثل البصري 1: 1، مع التكامل مع خادم Figma MCP واستخدام عناوين URL من Figma لأهمية التصميم المتواصلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating Figma designs into WordPress themes","Creating customizable WordPress themes with configurable text boxes","Ensuring design consistency through Figma MCP server integration"],"zh":["将 Figma 设计转换为 WordPress 主题","创建具有可配置文本框的可自定义 WordPress 主题","通过 Figma MCP 服务器集成确保设计的一致性"],"ja":["Figma のデザインを WordPress テーマに変換する","カスタマイズ可能なテキスト ボックスを備えたカスタマイズ可能な WordPress テーマを作成する","Figma MCP サーバーの統合を通じてデザインの一貫性を確保する"],"ko":["피그마 디자인을 워드프레스 테마로 변환하는 것","사용자 지정 가능한 텍스트 상자를 갖춘 사용자 지정 가능한 워드프레스 테마를 생성하는 것","피그마 MCP 서버 통합을 통해 디자인의 일관성을 보장하는 것"],"es":["Traducir diseños de Figma a temas de WordPress","Crear temas personalizables de WordPress con cuadros de texto configurables","Garantizar la consistencia del diseño a través de la integración con el servidor Figma MCP"],"fr":["Traduire des conceptions Figma en thèmes WordPress","Créer des thèmes WordPress personnalisables avec des cases de texte configurables","Assurer la cohérence de la conception via l''intégration au serveur Figma MCP"],"de":["Figma-Designs in WordPress-Themes übersetzen","Anpassbare WordPress-Themes mit konfigurierbaren Textboxen erstellen","Durch die Integration mit dem Figma-MCP-Server die Designkonsistenz gewährleisten"],"pt":["Traduzir designs do Figma em temas do WordPress","Criar temas personalizáveis do WordPress com caixas de texto configuráveis","Garantir a consistência do design por meio da integração com o servidor Figma MCP"],"ru":["Перевод дизайнов Figma в темы WordPress","Создание настраиваемых тем WordPress с конфигурируемыми текстовыми полями","Обеспечение согласованности дизайна посредством интеграции с сервером Figma MCP"],"ar":["ترجمة تصاميم Figma إلى مواضيع WordPress","إنشاء مواضيع قابلة للتخصيص من WordPress مع مربعات نص متوفرة للتكوين","ضمان συνέافة التصميم من خلال التكامل مع خادم Figma MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Figma MCP server connection and accessibility","Needs a valid Figma URL in the format https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2"],"zh":["需要 Figma MCP 服务器连接和可访问性","需要格式为 https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2 的有效 Figma URL"],"ja":["Figma MCP サーバーへの接続とアクセスが必要","https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2 の形式の有効な Figma URL が必要"],"ko":["피그마 MCP 서버 연결 및 접근이 필요","https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2 형식의 유효한 피그마 URL이 필요"],"es":["Requiere conexión y accesibilidad al servidor Figma MCP","Necesita una URL de Figma válida en el formato https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion et une accessibilité au serveur Figma MCP","Nécessite une URL Figma valide au format https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2"],"de":["Benötigt eine Verbindung und Zugriff auf den Figma-MCP-Server","Benötigt eine gültige Figma-URL im Format https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2"],"pt":["Exige conexão com o servidor Figma MCP e acessibilidade","Necessita de uma URL válida do Figma no formato https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2"],"ru":["Требует подключения к серверу Figma MCP и доступности","Требует действительной URL Figma в формате https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال بخادم Figma MCP والوصول إليه","يحتاج إلى عنوان URL صالح من Figma بالتنسيق https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/:fileName?node-id=1-2"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
