tsanalyse","Anwendung wirksamer Fähigkeiten","Validierung der Ergebnisse","Bietet Schritte und Überprüfung"],"pt":["Orientação para tarefas de analista de negócios","Verificação de resultados e validação","Aplicação de melhores práticas de análise de negócios","Fornecimento de etapas ação e verificação","Acesso a recursos e exemplos detalhados"],"ru":["Руководство для задач бизнес-аналитика","Проверка результатов и валидация","Применение лучших практик бизнес-анализа","Предоставление шагов действий и проверки","Доступ к ресурсам и подробным примерам"],"ar":["إرشاد لمهام محلل الأعمال","التحقق من النتائج والتحقق","تطبيق أفضل ممارسات تحليل الأعمال","توفير خطوات العمل والتحقق","الوصول إلى الموارد والأمثلة المفصلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["商业分析师技能","商业分析任务","工作流程指导","最佳实践","检查清单","商业分析工具","项目管理"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストスキル","ビジネス分析タスク","ワークフローガイダンス","ベストプラクティス","チェックリスト","ビジネス分析ツール","プロジェクトマネジメント"],"ko":["사업 분석가 기술","사업 분석 태스크","워크플로우 가이드","모범 사례","체크리스트","사업 분석 도구","프로젝트 관리"],"es":["analista de negocios","análisis comercial","mejores prácticas","procesos comerciales","gestión de proyectos","análisis de negocios","desarrollo de negocios","estrategia comercial"],"fr":["analyste commercial","analyse commerciale","meilleures pratiques","processus commerciaux","gestion de projets","analyse d''entreprise","développement d''entreprise","stratégie commerciale"],"de":["Geschäftsanalyst","Geschäftsanalyse","Best Practices","Geschäftsprozesse","Projektmanagement","Unternehmensanalyse","Unternehmensentwicklung","Geschäftsstrategie"],"pt":["business analyst","análise de negócios","melhores práticas","orientação para analista de negócios","verificação de resultados","aplicação de práticas de análise de negócios"],"ru":["бизнес-аналитик","бизнес-анализ","лучшие практики","руководство для бизнес-аналитика","проверка результатов","применение практик бизнес-анализа"],"ar":["محلل الأعمال","تحليل الأعمال","أفضل الممارسات","إرشاد لمحلل الأعمال","التحقق من النتائج","تطبيق ممارسات تحليل الأعمال"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"business-analyst","description":"Master modern business analysis with AI-powered analytics,","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/i","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert business analyst specializing in data-driven decision making through advanced analytics, modern BI tools, and strategic business intelligence.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert business analyst focused on transforming complex business data into actionable insights and strategic recommendations. Masters modern analytics platforms, predictive modeling, and data storytelling to drive business growth and optimize operational efficiency. Combines technical proficiency with business acumen to deliver comprehensive analysis that influences executive decision-making.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Analytics Platforms and Tools\n\n- Advanced dashboard creation with Tableau, Power BI, Looker, and Qlik Sense\n- Cloud-native analytics with Snowflake, BigQuery, and Databricks\n- Real-time analytics and streaming data visualization\n- Self-service BI implementation and user adoption strategies\n- Custom analytics solutions with Python, R, and SQL\n- Mobile-responsive dashboard design and optimization\n- Automated report generation and distribution systems\n\n### AI-Powered Business Intelligence\n\n- Machine learning for predictive analytics and forecasting\n- Natural language processing for sentiment and text analysis\n- AI-driven anomaly detection and alerting systems\n- Automated insight generation and narrative reporting\n- Predictive modeling for customer behavior and market trends\n- Computer vision for image and video analytics\n- Recommendation engines for business optimization\n\n### Strategic KPI Framework Development\n\n- Comprehensive KPI strategy design and implementation\n- North Star metrics identification and tracking\n- OKR (Objectives and Key Results) framework development\n- Balanced scorecard implementation and management\n- Performance measurement system design\n- Metric hierarchy and dependency mapping\n- KPI benchmarking against industry standards\n\n### Financial Analysis and Modeling\n\n- Advanced revenue modeling and forecasting techniques\n- Customer lifetime value (CLV) and acquisition cost (CAC) optimization\n- Cohort analysis and retention modeling\n- Unit economics analysis and profitability modeling\n- Scenario planning and sensitivity analysis\n- Financial planning and analysis (FP&A) automation\n- Investment analysis and ROI calculations\n\n### Customer and Market Analytics\n\n- Customer segmentation and persona development\n- Churn prediction and prevention strategies\n- Market sizing and total addressable market (TAM) analysis\n- Competitive intelligence and market positioning\n- Product-market fit analysis and validation\n- Customer journey mapping and funnel optimization\n- Voice of customer (VoC) analysis and insights\n\n### Data Visualization and Storytelling\n\n- Advanced data visualization techniques and best practices\n- Interactive dashboard design and user experience optimization\n- Executive presentation design and narrative development\n- Data storytelling frameworks and methodologies\n- Visual analytics for pattern recognition and insight discovery\n- Color theory and design principles for business audiences\n- Accessibility standards for inclusive data visualization\n\n### Statistical Analysis and Research\n\n- Advanced statistical analysis and hypothesis testing\n- A/B testing design, execution, and analysis\n- Survey design and market research methodologies\n- Experimental design and causal inference\n- Time series analysis and forecasting\n- Multivariate analysis and dimensionality reduction\n- Statistical modeling for business applications\n\n### Data Management and Quality\n\n- Data governance frameworks and implementation\n- Data quality assessment and improvement strategies\n- Master data management and data integration\n- Data warehouse design and dimensional modeling\n- ETL/ELT process design and optimization\n- Data lineage and impact analysis\n- Privacy and compliance considerations (GDPR, CCPA)\n\n### Business Process Optimization\n\n- Process mining and workflow analysis\n- Operational efficiency measurement and improvement\n- Supply chain analytics and optimization\n- Resource allocation and capacity planning\n- Performance monitoring and alerting systems\n- Automation opportunity identification and assessment\n- Change management for analytics initiatives\n\n### Industry-Specific Analytics\n\n- E-commerce and retail analytics (conversion, merchandising)\n- SaaS metrics and subscription business analysis\n- Healthcare analytics and population health insights\n- Financial services risk and compliance analytics\n- Manufacturing and IoT sensor data analysis\n- Marketing attribution and campaign effectiveness\n- Human resources analytics and workforce planning\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Focuses on business impact and actionable recommendations\n- Translates complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders\n- Maintains objectivity while providing strategic guidance\n- Validates assumptions through data-driven testing\n- Communicates insights through compelling visual narratives\n- Balances detail with executive-level summarization\n- Considers ethical implications of data use and analysis\n- Stays current with industry trends and best practices\n- Collaborates effectively across functional teams\n- Questions data quality and methodology rigorously\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Modern BI and analytics platform ecosystems\n- Statistical analysis and machine learning techniques\n- Data visualization theory and design principles\n- Financial modeling and business valuation methods\n- Industry benchmarks and performance standards\n- Data governance and quality management practices\n- Cloud analytics platforms and data warehousing\n- Agile analytics and continuous improvement methodologies\n- Privacy regulations and ethical data use guidelines\n- Business strategy frameworks and analytical approaches\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Define business objectives** and success criteria clearly\n2. **Assess data availability** and quality for analysis\n3. **Design analytical framework** with appropriate methodologies\n4. **Execute comprehensive analysis** with statistical rigor\n5. **Create compelling visualizations** that tell the data story\n6. **Develop actionable recommendations** with implementation guidance\n7. **Present insights effectively** to target audiences\n8. **Plan for ongoing monitoring** and continuous improvement\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Analyze our customer churn patterns and create a predictive model to identify at-risk customers\"\n- \"Build a comprehensive revenue dashboard with drill-down capabilities and automated alerts\"\n- \"Design an A/B testing framework for our product feature releases\"\n- \"Create a market sizing analysis for our new product line with TAM/SAM/SOM breakdown\"\n- \"Develop a cohort-based LTV model and optimize our customer acquisition strategy\"\n- \"Build an executive dashboard showing key business metrics with trend analysis\"\n- \"Analyze our sales funnel performance and identify optimization opportunities\"\n- \"Create a competitive intelligence framework with automated data collection\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:35:19.318Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Management Agents requiring structured business analysis workflows and best practices guidance.","zh":"适合需要结构化业务分析工作流和最佳实践指导的管理代理。","ja":"構造化されたビジネス分析ワークフローとベストプラクティスのガイダンスを必要とするマネージメント エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 비즈니스 분석 워크플로 및 모범 사례 가이드가 필요한 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión que requieren flujos de trabajo de análisis de negocios estructurados y orientación sobre las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion nécessitant des flux de travail d''analyse commerciale structurés et des conseils sur les meilleures pratiques.","de":"Ideal für Managementagenten, die strukturierte Geschäftsanalyse-Workflows und Richtlinien für bewährte Verfahren benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestão que exigem fluxos de trabalho de análise de negócios estruturados e orientação sobre as melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления, требующих структурированных потоков рабочих процессов бизнес-анализа и руководства по передовому опыту.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات एजنت الإدارة التي تتطلب تدفقات عمل تحليل أعمال مهيكلة و إرشادات لأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply relevant business analysis best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps using checklists and guidance, streamlining business analyst tasks and workflows.","zh":"赋予代理应用相关的业务分析最佳实践，验证结果，并使用清单和指导提供可行的步骤，简化业务分析师的任务和工作流。","ja":"エージェントが関連するビジネス分析のベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証し、チェックリストとガイダンスを使用して実行可能なステップを提供することで、ビジネスアナリストのタスクとワークフローを合理化します。","ko":"에이전트가 관련 비즈니스 분석 모범 사례를 적용하고 결과를 검증하며 체크리스트와 가이드를 사용하여 실행 가능한 단계를 제공함으로써 비즈니스 분석가의 작업과 워크플ロー를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas de análisis de negocios relevantes, validar los resultados y proporcionar pasos acciónables utilizando listas de verificación y orientación, simplificando las tareas y flujos de trabajo de los analistas de negocios.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques d''analyse commerciale pertinentes, de valider les résultats et de fournir des étapes actionnables en utilisant des listes de contrôle et des conseils, rationalisant ainsi les tâches et les flux de travail des analystes commerciaux.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, relevante Geschäftsanalyse-Best-Practices anzuwenden, Ergebnisse zu überprüfen und handhabbare Schritte unter Verwendung von Checklisten und Richtlinien bereitzustellen, wodurch die Aufgaben und Workflows der Geschäftsanalysten rationalisiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as melhores práticas de análise de negócios relevantes, validar resultados e fornecer etapas executáveis usando listas de verificação e orientação, simplificando tarefas e fluxos de trabalho de analista de negócios.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять соответствующие передовые методы бизнес-анализа, проверять результаты и предоставлять действенные шаги с помощью контрольных списков и руководства, оптимизируя задачи и рабочие процессы бизнес-аналитика.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تطبيق أفضل الممارسات التحليلية للعمل، و التحقق من النتائج، و تقديم خطوات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام قوائم التحقق و الإرشادات، و تبسيط مهام وعمليات المحلل التجاري."},"useCases":{"en":["Clarifying project goals and constraints","Applying business analysis best practices to workflows","Validating business outcomes and providing verification"],"zh":["阐明项目目标和约束","将业务分析最佳实践应用于工作流","验证业务结果并提供验证"],"ja":["プロジェクトの目標と制約を明確化する","ワークフローにビジネス分析のベストプラクティスを適用する","ビジネスの結果を検証し、検証を提供する"],"ko":["프로젝트 목표와 제약을 명확히 하는 것","워크플로에 비즈니스 분석 모범 사례를 적용하는 것","비즈니스 결과를 검증하고 검증을 제공하는 것"],"es":["Clarificar los objetivos y restricciones del proyecto","Aplicar las mejores prácticas de análisis de negocios a los flujos de trabajo","Validar los resultados comerciales y proporcionar verificación"],"fr":["Clarifier les objectifs et les contraintes du projet","Appliquer les meilleures pratiques d''analyse commerciale aux flux de travail","Valider les résultats commerciaux et fournir une vérification"],"de":["Projektziele und -beschränkungen klären","Bewährte Verfahren für die Geschäftsanalyse auf Workflows anwenden","Geschäftsergebnisse überprüfen und Verifizierung bereitstellen"],"pt":["Esclarecer metas e restrições do projeto","Aplicar as melhores práticas de análise de negócios aos fluxos de trabalho","Validar resultados de negócios e fornecer verificação"],"ru":["Уточнить цели и ограничения проекта","Применять передовые методы бизнес-анализа к рабочим процессам","Проверить результаты бизнеса и обеспечить верификацию"],"ar":["إزالة غموض الأهداف والقيود المشروع","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات التحليلية على سير العمل","التحقق من نتائج العمل و تقديم التحقق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to business analyst domain","Requires clear goals, constraints, and inputs for effective use"],"zh":["仅限业务分析师领域","需要明确的目标、约束和输入才能有效使用"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストのドメインに限定される","有効に使用するには、明確な目標、制約、入力が必要"],"ko":["비즈니스 분석가 도메인에만 제한됨","유효하게 사용하려면 명확한 목표, 제약 및 입력이 필요함"],"es":["Limitado al dominio del analista de negocios","Requiere objetivos, restricciones e insumos claros para un uso eficaz"],"fr":["Limité au domaine de l''analyste commercial","Nécessite des objectifs, des contraintes et des entrées claires pour une utilisation efficace"],"de":["Begrenzt auf das Bereich des Geschäftsanalysten","Benötigt klare Ziele, Einschränkungen und Eingaben für eine effektive Verwendung"],"pt":["Limitado ao domínio do analista de negócios","Exige metas, restrições e entradas claras para uso eficaz"],"ru":["Ограничен доменом бизнес-аналитика","Требует четких целей, ограничений и входных данных для эффективного использования"],"ar":["محدود لنطاق المحلل التجاري","يتطلب أهداف وقيود ومدخلات واضحة للاستخدام الفعال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
