ão e Cache","ru":"Контекстная Оптимизация: Техники Компактации и Кэширования","ar":"تحسين السياق: تقنيات الضغط والكاش","en":"context-optimization"},"description":{"zh":"上下文优化技术通过压缩、掩码、缓存和分区等策略，扩大有限上下文窗口的有效容量","ja":"コンテキスト最適化技術は、圧縮、 マスキング、キャッシング、パーティショニングなどの戦略を使用して、制限されたコンテキストウィンドウの有効容量を拡大","ko":"컨텍스트 최적화 기술은 압축, 마스킹, 캐싱, 파티셔닝 등의 전략을 사용하여 제한된 컨텍스트 창의有效 용량을 늘립니다","es":"La optimización de contexto mejora la capacidad efectiva de ventanas de contexto limitadas mediante técnicas de compresión y caché","fr":"L''optimisation de contexte améliore la capacité effective des fenêtres de contexte limitées grâce à des techniques de compression et de cache","de":"Die Kontext-Optimierung verbessert die effektive Kapazität begrenzter Kontextfenster durch Komprimierungs- und Cachetechniken","pt":"A otimização de contexto é uma técnica que visa melhorar a capacidade do modelo com compactação, mascaramento e caching. Isso permite um uso mais eficaz do c...","ru":"Контекстная оптимизация - это техника, целью которой является улучшение емкости модели за счет компактации, маскирования и кэширования. Это позволяет более э...","ar":"تحسين السياق هو تقنية تهدف إلى تحسين سعة النموذج من خلال تقنيات الضغط والإخفاء والكاش. هذا يسمح bằng استخدام более فعال للسياق المتاح.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["压缩策略","掩码技术","缓存机制","分区管理","上下文窗口优化"],"ja":["圧縮戦略","マスキング技術","キャッシングメカニズム","パーティショニング管理","コンテキストウィンドウ最適化"],"ko":["압축 전략","마스킹 기술","캐싱 메커니즘","파티셔닝 관리","컨텍스트 창 최적화"],"es":["Técnicas de compresión","Masking y caché","Particionado de contexto","Mejora del rendimiento","Optimización de ventanas de contexto"],"fr":["Techniques de compression","Masquage et cache","Partitionnement de contexte","Amélioration des performances","Optimisation des fenêtres de contexte"],"de":["Komprimierungs- und Cachetechniken","Masking und Partitionierung","Kontext-Partitionierung","Leistungsverbesserung","Optimierung von Kontextfenstern"],"pt":["Compactação de contexto","Mascaramento de contexto","Caching de contexto","Partitioning de contexto","Técnicas de compressão"],"ru":["Компактация контекста","Маскирование контекста","Кэширование контекста","Разделение контекста","Техники сжатия"],"ar":["ضغط السياق","إخفاء السياق","كاش السياق","تقسيم السياق","تقنيات الضغط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文优化","压缩策略","掩码技术","缓存机制","分区管理","限上下文窗口","有效容量"],"ja":["コンテキスト最適化","圧縮戦略","マスキング技術","キャッシングメカニズム","パーティショニング管理","制限コンテキストウィンドウ","有効容量"],"ko":["컨텍스트 최적화","압축 전략","마스킹 기술","캐싱 메커니즘","파티셔닝 관리","제한 컨텍스트 창","有效 용량"],"es":["optimización de contexto","técnicas de compresión","masking y caché","particionado de contexto","mejora del rendimiento","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["optimisation de contexte","techniques de compression","masquage et cache","partitionnement de contexte","amélioration des performances","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Kontext-Optimierung","Komprimierungs- und Cachetechniken","Masking und Partitionierung","Kontext-Partitionierung","Leistungsverbesserung","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["otimização de contexto","compactação de contexto","mascaramento de contexto","caching de contexto","técnicas de contexto","desenvolvimento de modelos"],"ru":["контекстная оптимизация","компактация контекста","маскирование контекста","кэширование контекста","техники контекста","разработка моделей"],"ar":["تحسين السياق","ضغط السياق","إخفاء السياق","كاش السياق","تقنيات السياق","تطوير النماذج"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-optimization","description":"Apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies","bodyPreview":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective con","body":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective context capacity without requiring larger models or longer contexts.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Context limits constrain task complexity\n- Optimizing for cost reduction (fewer tokens = lower costs)\n- Reducing latency for long conversations\n- Implementing long-running agent systems\n- Needing to handle larger documents or conversations\n- Building production systems at scale\n\n## Core Concepts\n\nContext optimization extends effective capacity through four primary strategies: compaction (summarizing context near limits), observation masking (replacing verbose outputs with references), KV-cache optimization (reusing cached computations), and context partitioning (splitting work across isolated contexts).\n\nThe key insight is that context quality matters more than quantity. Optimization preserves signal while reducing noise. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard, and when to apply each technique.\n\n## Detailed Topics\n\n### Compaction Strategies\n\n**What is Compaction**\nCompaction is the practice of summarizing context contents when approaching limits, then reinitializing a new context window with the summary. This distills the contents of a context window in a high-fidelity manner, enabling the agent to continue with minimal performance degradation.\n\nCompaction typically serves as the first lever in context optimization. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard.\n\n**Compaction Implementation**\nCompaction works by identifying sections that can be compressed, generating summaries that capture essential points, and replacing full content with summaries. Priority for compression goes to tool outputs (replace with summaries), old turns (summarize early conversation), retrieved docs (summarize if recent versions exist), and never compress system prompt.\n\n**Summary Generation**\nEffective summaries preserve different elements depending on message type:\n\nTool outputs: Preserve key findings, metrics, and conclusions. Remove verbose raw output.\n\nConversational turns: Preserve key decisions, commitments, and context shifts. Remove filler and back-and-forth.\n\nRetrieved documents: Preserve key facts and claims. Remove supporting evidence and elaboration.\n\n### Observation Masking\n\n**The Observation Problem**\nTool outputs can comprise 80%+ of token usage in agent trajectories. Much of this is verbose output that has already served its purpose. Once an agent has used a tool output to make a decision, keeping the full output provides diminishing value while consuming significant context.\n\nObservation masking replaces verbose tool outputs with compact references. The information remains accessible if needed but does not consume context continuously.\n\n**Masking Strategy Selection**\nNot all observations should be masked equally:\n\nNever mask: Observations critical to current task, observations from the most recent turn, observations used in active reasoning.\n\nConsider masking: Observations from 3+ turns ago, verbose outputs with key points extractable, observations whose purpose has been served.\n\nAlways mask: Repeated outputs, boilerplate headers/footers, outputs already summarized in conversation.\n\n### KV-Cache Optimization\n\n**Understanding KV-Cache**\nThe KV-cache stores Key and Value tensors computed during inference, growing linearly with sequence length. Caching the KV-cache across requests sharing identical prefixes avoids recomputation.\n\nPrefix caching reuses KV blocks across requests with identical prefixes using hash-based block matching. This dramatically reduces cost and latency for requests with common prefixes like system prompts.\n\n**Cache Optimization Patterns**\nOptimize for caching by reordering context elements to maximize cache hits. Place stable elements first (system prompt, tool definitions), then frequently reused elements, then unique elements last.\n\nDesign prompts to maximize cache stability: avoid dynamic content like timestamps, use consistent formatting, keep structure stable across sessions.\n\n### Context Partitioning\n\n**Sub-Agent Partitioning**\nThe most aggressive form of context optimization is partitioning work across sub-agents with isolated contexts. Each sub-agent operates in a clean context focused on its subtask without carrying accumulated context from other subtasks.\n\nThis approach achieves separation of concerns—the detailed search context remains isolated within sub-agents while the coordinator focuses on synthesis and analysis.\n\n**Result Aggregation**\nAggregate results from partitioned subtasks by validating all partitions completed, merging compatible results, and summarizing if still too large.\n\n### Budget Management\n\n**Context Budget Allocation**\nDesign explicit context budgets. Allocate tokens to categories: system prompt, tool definitions, retrieved docs, message history, and reserved buffer. Monitor usage against budget and trigger optimization when approaching limits.\n\n**Trigger-Based Optimization**\nMonitor signals for optimization triggers: token utilization above 80%, degradation indicators, and performance drops. Apply appropriate optimization techniques based on context composition.\n\n## Practical Guidance\n\n### Optimization Decision Framework\n\nWhen to optimize:\n- Context utilization exceeds 70%\n- Response quality degrades as conversations extend\n- Costs increase due to long contexts\n- Latency increases with conversation length\n\nWhat to apply:\n- Tool outputs dominate: observation masking\n- Retrieved documents dominate: summarization or partitioning\n- Message history dominates: compaction with summarization\n- Multiple components: combine strategies\n\n### Performance Considerations\n\nCompaction should achieve 50-70% token reduction with less than 5% quality degradation. Masking should achieve 60-80% reduction in masked observations. Cache optimization should achieve 70%+ hit rate for stable workloads.\n\nMonitor and iterate on optimization strategies based on measured effectiveness.\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Compaction Trigger**\n```python\nif context_tokens / context_limit > 0.8:\n    context = compact_context(context)\n```\n\n**Example 2: Observation Masking**\n```python\nif len(observation) > max_length:\n    ref_id = store_observation(observation)\n    return f\"[Obs:{ref_id} elided. Key: {extract_key(observation)}]\"\n```\n\n**Example 3: Cache-Friendly Ordering**\n```python\n# Stable content first\ncontext = [system_prompt, tool_definitions]  # Cacheable\ncontext += [reused_templates]  # Reusable\ncontext += [unique_content]  # Unique\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. Measure before optimizing—know your current state\n2. Apply compaction before masking when possible\n3. Design for cache stability with consistent prompts\n4. Partition before context becomes problematic\n5. Monitor optimization effectiveness over time\n6. Balance token savings against quality preservation\n7. Test optimization at production scale\n8. Implement graceful degradation for edge cases\n\n## Integration\n\nThis skill builds on context-fundamentals and context-degradation. It connects to:\n\n- multi-agent-patterns - Partitioning as isolation\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization effectiveness\n- memory-systems - Offloading context to memory\n\n## References\n\nInternal reference:\n- [Optimization Techniques Reference](./references/optimization_techniques.md) - Detailed technical reference\n\nRelated skills in this collection:\n- context-fundamentals - Context basics\n- context-degradation - Understanding when to optimize\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization\n\nExternal resources:\n- Research on context window limitations\n- KV-cache optimization techniques\n- Production engineering guides\n\n---\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n**Created**: 2025-12-20\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-20\n**Author**: Agent Skills for Context Engineering Contributors\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:35:31.301Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing strategic context window management through compaction, masking, and caching strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要通过压缩、掩码和缓存策略进行战略性上下文窗口管理的高级AI代理。","ja":"戦略的コンテキストウィンドウ管理を通じて圧縮、マスキング、キャッシング戦略を必要とする高度なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"압축, 마스킹, 캐싱 전략을 통해 전략적인 문맥 창 관리가 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Avanzados que necesitan gestión de ventanas de contexto estratégico a través de estrategias de compactación, enmascaramiento y caché.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents IA Avancés ayant besoin d''une gestion stratégique de fenêtres de contexte via des stratégies de compactage, de masquage et de mise en cache.","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte KI-Agents, die eine strategische Kontextfensterverwaltung durch Compact-, Maskierungs- und Cachestrategien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de gerenciamento de janela de contexto estratégico por meio de estratégias de compactação, mascaramento e cache.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым требуется стратегическое управление контекстным окном через стратегии компактирования, маскирования и кэширования.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين بحاجة إلى إدارة نافذة السياق الاستراتيجية من خلال استراتيجيات الضغط والتخفي والتفعيل المؤقت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning, effectively doubling or tripling effective context utilization using techniques like compaction and caching.","zh":"赋予代理扩展有限上下文窗口的有效容量的能力，通过战略性的压缩、掩码、缓存和分区，有效地将有效上下文利用率提高一倍或两倍，使用压缩和缓存等技术。","ja":"戦略的な圧縮、マスキング、キャッシング、パーティショニングを使用して、エージェントが限られたコンテキストウィンドウの有効容量を拡張する能力を付与し、圧縮やキャッシングなどの技術を使用して、有効なコンテキスト利用率を2倍または3倍に効果的に増やす。","ko":"전략적인 압축, 마스킹, 캐싱, 파티셔닝을 사용하여 에이전트가 제한된 문맥 창의有效 용량을 확장할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 압축 또는 캐싱 등의 기술을 사용하여 효과적으로 문맥 활용률을 2배 또는 3배로 늘립니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extender la capacidad efectiva de ventanas de contexto limitadas a través de la compresión estratégica, enmascaramiento, caché y particionado, duplicando o triplicando efectivamente la utilización del contexto utilizando técnicas como compactación y caché.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre la capacité effective des fenêtres de contexte limitées via une compression stratégique, un masquage, un cache et un partitionnement, doublant ou triplant efficacement l''utilisation du contexte en utilisant des techniques comme le compactage et la mise en cache.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die effektive Kapazität begrenzter Kontextfenster durch strategische Komprimierung, Maskierung, Caching und Partitionierung zu erweitern, effektiv die Kontextnutzung durch Techniken wie Compactierung und Caching zu verdoppeln oder zu verdreifachen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender a capacidade eficaz de janelas de contexto limitadas por meio da compressão estratégica, mascaramento, cache e particionamento, efetivamente dobrando ou triplicando a utilização eficaz do contexto usando técnicas como compactação e cache.","ru":"Позволяет агентам расширить эффективную емкость ограниченных контекстных окон путем стратегического сжатия, маскирования, кэширования и разделения, эффективно удваивая или утраивая эффективное использование контекста с помощью методов компактирования и кэширования.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توسيع السعة الفعلية لنوافذ السياق المحدودة من خلال الضغط الاستراتيجي والتخفي والتفعيل المؤقت والتقسيم، وبذلك يزيد بشكل فعال استخدام السياق الفعلي بمعامل يصل إلى ضعف أو ثلاثة أضعاف باستخدام تقنيات مثل الضغط والتفعيل المؤقت."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying compaction strategies to optimize context windows","Implementing masking techniques to focus on relevant context","Utilizing caching to reduce redundant context processing"],"zh":["应用压缩策略来优化上下文窗口","实现掩码技术以关注相关上下文","利用缓存来减少冗余上下文处理"],"ja":["コンテキストウィンドウを最適化するための圧縮戦略の適用","関連するコンテキストに焦点を当てるためのマスキング技術の実装","冗長なコンテキスト処理を減らすためのキャッシングの利用"],"ko":["문맥 창을 최적화하기 위한 압축 전략의 적용","관련 문맥에 초점을 맞추기 위한 마스킹 기술의 구현","중복된 문맥 처리를 줄이기 위한 캐싱의 활용"],"es":["Aplicar estrategias de compactación para optimizar ventanas de contexto","Implementar técnicas de enmascaramiento para centrarse en el contexto relevante","Utilizar caché para reducir el procesamiento redundante de contexto"],"fr":["Appliquer des stratégies de compactage pour optimiser les fenêtres de contexte","Mettre en œuvre des techniques de masquage pour se concentrer sur le contexte pertinent","Utiliser le cache pour réduire le traitement redondant du contexte"],"de":["Compactierungsstrategien anwenden, um Kontextfenster zu optimieren","Maskierungstechniken implementieren, um sich auf relevanten Kontext zu konzentrieren","Caching nutzen, um redundanten Kontextverarbeitung zu reduzieren"],"pt":["Aplicar estratégias de compactação para otimizar janelas de contexto","Implementar técnicas de mascaramento para focar no contexto relevante","Utilizar cache para reduzir o processamento redundante de contexto"],"ru":["Применение стратегий компактирования для оптимизации контекстных окон","Реализация методов маскирования для сосредоточения внимания на релевантном контексте","Использование кэша для уменьшения избыточной обработки контекста"],"ar":["تطبيق استراتيجيات الضغط لتحسين نوافذ السياق","تنفيذ تقنيات التخفي للتركيز على السياق ذي الصلة","استخدام التفعيل المؤقت لتقليل المعالجة الزائدة للسياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to optimizing existing context window capacity","Requires strategic application of compression, masking, caching, and partitioning techniques"],"zh":["仅限于优化现有的上下文窗口容量","需要战略性的压缩、掩码、缓存和分区技术的应用"],"ja":["既存のコンテキストウィンドウ容量の最適化のみ","圧縮、マスキング、キャッシング、パーティショニング技術の戦略的な適用が必要"],"ko":["既存의 문맥 창 용량을 최적화하는 것만 가능","압축, 마스킹, 캐싱, 파티셔닝 기술의 전략적인 적용이 필요"],"es":["Limitado a optimizar la capacidad existente de la ventana de contexto","Requiere una aplicación estratégica de técnicas de compresión, enmascaramiento, caché y particionado"],"fr":["Limité à l''optimisation de la capacité existante de la fenêtre de contexte","Nécessite une application stratégique de techniques de compression, de masquage, de cache et de partitionnement"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Optimierung der bestehenden Kontextfensterkapazität","Erfordert eine strategische Anwendung von Komprimierungs-, Maskierungs-, Caching- und Partitionierungstechniken"],"pt":["Limitado à otimização da capacidade da janela de contexto existente","Exige aplicação estratégica de técnicas de compressão, mascaramento, cache e particionamento"],"ru":["Ограничен оптимизацией существующей емкости контекстного окна","Требует стратегического применения методов сжатия, маскирования, кэширования и разделения"],"ar":["محدود بتحسين سعة نافذة السياق الحالية","يتطلب تطبيق استراتيجي لتقنيات الضغط والتخفي والتفعيل المؤقت والتقسيم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
