 experiencia del usuario","Integración con EAS para CI/CD","Soporte para pruebas beta en TestFlight","Gestión de metadatos de la App Store","Publicación en la Play Store"],"fr":["Déploiement automatique sur toutes les plateformes","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Intégration avec EAS pour CI/CD","Prise en charge des tests bêta sur TestFlight","Gestion des métadonnées de l''App Store","Publication sur la Play Store"],"de":["Automatisierte Bereitstellung auf allen Plattformen","Optimierung der Benutzererfahrung","Integration mit EAS für CI/CD","Unterstützung für Beta-Tests in TestFlight","Verwaltung von App-Store-Metadaten","Veröffentlichung im Play Store"],"pt":["Implantação automática de aplicativos","Otimização de metadados da App Store","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Integração com fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD","Pré-visualização de lançamentos","Otimização para lojas de aplicativos"],"ru":["Автоматическое развертывание приложений","Оптимизация метаданных App Store","Поддержка нескольких платформ","Интеграция с рабочими процессами CI/CD","Предварительный просмотр выпусков","Оптимизация для магазинов приложений"],"ar":["توزيع تطبيقات آلي","تحسين بيانات متجر التطبيقات","دعم منصات متعددة","تكامل مع سير عمل آلي","معاينة الإصدارات","تحسين متاجر التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo 部署","EAS","跨平台部署","自动化部署","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play","ASO 优化"],"ja":["Expo デプロイメント","EAS","マルチプラットフォーム デプロイ","自動デプロイ","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play","ASO 最適化"],"ko":["Expo 배포","EAS","멀티 플랫폼 배포","자동 배포","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play","ASO 최적화"],"es":["despliegue de Expo","EAS","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Play Store","desarrollo de aplicaciones","automatización de despliegues","optimización de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["déploiement Expo","EAS","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Play Store","développement d''applications","automatisation des déploiements","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Expo-Deployment","EAS","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Play Store","Anwendungsentwicklung","Automatisierung der Bereitstellung","Optimierung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["expo deployment","eas","implantação de aplicativos","otimização de metadados","ci/cd","pré-visualização de lançamentos","lojas de aplicativos","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["expo deployment","eas","развертывание приложений","оптимизация метаданных","ci/cd","предварительный просмотр выпусков","магазины приложений","разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["توزيع إكسبو","خدمات إكسبو التطبيقية","توزيع التطبيقات","تحسين بيانات التطبيقات","سير عمل آلي","معاينة الإصدارات","متاجر التطبيقات","تطوير التطبيقات المحمولة"]}},"owner":"budgie-at","repo":"budgie","repoPath":"budgie-at/budgie","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expo-deployment","description":"Deploying Expo apps to iOS App Store, Android Play Store, web hosting, and API routes","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Goog","body":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Google Play Store\n- ./references/ios-app-store.md -- iOS App Store submission and review process\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Install EAS CLI\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g eas-cli\neas login\n```\n\n### Initialize EAS\n\n```bash\nnpx eas-cli@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `eas.json` with build profiles.\n\n## Build Commands\n\n### Production Builds\n\n```bash\n# iOS App Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production\n\n# Android Play Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production\n\n# Both platforms\nnpx eas-cli@latest build --profile production\n```\n\n### Submit to Stores\n\n```bash\n# iOS: Build and submit to App Store Connect\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production --submit\n\n# Android: Build and submit to Play Store\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production --submit\n\n# Shortcut for iOS TestFlight\nnpx testflight\n```\n\n## Web Deployment\n\nDeploy web apps using EAS Hosting:\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to production\nnpx expo export -p web\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy --prod\n\n# Deploy PR preview\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy\n```\n\n## EAS Configuration\n\nStandard `eas.json` for production deployments:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"cli\": {\n    \"version\": \">= 16.0.1\",\n    \"appVersionSource\": \"remote\"\n  },\n  \"build\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"autoIncrement\": true,\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"resourceClass\": \"m-medium\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"development\": {\n      \"developmentClient\": true,\n      \"distribution\": \"internal\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"submit\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"appleId\": \"your@email.com\",\n        \"ascAppId\": \"1234567890\"\n      },\n      \"android\": {\n        \"serviceAccountKeyPath\": \"./google-service-account.json\",\n        \"track\": \"internal\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Platform-Specific Guides\n\n### iOS\n\n- Use `npx testflight` for quick TestFlight submissions\n- Configure Apple credentials via `eas credentials`\n- See ./reference/testflight.md for credential setup\n- See ./reference/ios-app-store.md for App Store submission\n\n### Android\n\n- Set up Google Play Console service account\n- Configure tracks: internal → closed → open → production\n- See ./reference/play-store.md for detailed setup\n\n### Web\n\n- EAS Hosting provides preview URLs for PRs\n- Production deploys to your custom domain\n- See ./reference/workflows.md for CI/CD automation\n\n## Automated Deployments\n\nUse EAS Workflows for CI/CD:\n\n```yaml\n# .eas/workflows/release.yml\nname: Release\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build-ios:\n    type: build\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n\n  submit-ios:\n    type: submit\n    needs: [build-ios]\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n```\n\nSee ./reference/workflows.md for more workflow examples.\n\n## Version Management\n\nEAS manages version numbers automatically with `appVersionSource: \"remote\"`:\n\n```bash\n# Check current versions\neas build:version:get\n\n# Manually set version\neas build:version:set -p ios --build-number 42\n```\n\n## Monitoring\n\n```bash\n# List recent builds\neas build:list\n\n# Check build status\neas build:view\n\n# View submission status\neas submit:list\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:35:54.357Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing streamlined deployment across iOS and Android platforms using EAS","zh":"非常适合需要在iOS和Android平台上使用EAS实现简化部署的移动应用代理","ja":"EASを使用してiOSとAndroidプラットフォームでストリームライン化された展開が必要なモバイルアプリエージェントに最適","ko":"EAS를 사용하여 iOS 및 Android 플랫폼에서 스트림 라인화 된 배포가 필요한 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de aplicaciones móviles que necesitan una implementación simplificada en las plataformas iOS y Android utilizando EAS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''applications mobiles nécessitant un déploiement rationalisé sur les plateformes iOS et Android en utilisant EAS","de":"Ideal für Mobile-App-Agents, die eine optimierte Bereitstellung auf iOS- und Android-Plattformen mit EAS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de implantação simplificada em plataformas iOS e Android usando EAS","ru":"Идеально подходит для мобильных агентов, которым требуется упрощенная развертка на платформах iOS и Android с помощью EAS","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق الجوال الذين يحتاجون إلى نشر مبسط عبر منصات iOS و Android باستخدام EAS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate deployments and PR previews using CI/CD workflows, submit iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing, and manage App Store metadata for ASO optimization, all while utilizing Expo Application Services (EAS) and handling Android builds submission to Google Play Store","zh":"能够让代理自动化部署和PR预览，使用CI/CD工作流提交iOS构建到TestFlight进行beta测试，并管理App Store元数据以优化ASO，同时利用Expo Application Services (EAS)处理Android构建提交到Google Play Store","ja":"エージェントがCI/CDワークフローを使用して自動化された展開とPRプレビューを行い、iOSビルドをTestFlightに提出してベータテストを行い、App Storeメタデータを管理してASOを最適化し、Expo Application Services (EAS)を使用してAndroidビルドをGoogle Play Storeに提出することを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 CI/CD 워크플로를 사용하여 자동화된 배포 및 PR预览을 수행하고, iOS 빌드를 TestFlight에 제출하여 베타 테스트를 수행하고, App Store 메타데이터를 관리하여 ASO를 최적화하며, Expo Application Services(EAS)를 사용하여 Android 빌드를 Google Play Store에 제출할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar implementaciones y vistas previas de PR utilizando flujos de trabajo de CI/CD, enviar compilaciones de iOS a TestFlight para pruebas beta y gestionar los metadatos de App Store para la optimización de ASO, todo mientras se utilizan los Expo Application Services (EAS) y se gestiona el envío de compilaciones de Android a Google Play Store","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les déploiements et les prévisualisations de PR en utilisant les workflows CI/CD, de soumettre les builds iOS à TestFlight pour les tests bêta et les retours, et de gérer les métadonnées de l''App Store pour l''optimisation de l''ASO, le tout en utilisant les Expo Application Services (EAS) et en gérant la soumission des builds Android sur le Google Play Store","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, Bereitstellungen und PR-Vorschauen mithilfe von CI/CD-Workflows zu automatisieren, iOS-Builds zur Betatestung an TestFlight zu übermitteln und App Store-Metadaten zur ASO-Optimierung zu verwalten, wobei gleichzeitig Expo Application Services (EAS) genutzt und die Übermittlung von Android-Builds an den Google Play Store behandelt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar implantações e pré-visualizações de PR usando fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD, enviar compilações do iOS para o TestFlight para testes beta e gerenciar metadados da App Store para otimização do ASO, tudo isso utilizando os Serviços de Aplicativos Expo (EAS) e lidando com a submissão de compilações do Android para a Google Play Store","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать развертку и предварительный просмотр PR с помощью рабочих процессов CI/CD, отправлять сборки iOS в TestFlight для бета-тестирования и управлять метаданными App Store для оптимизации ASO, все это при использовании сервисов приложений Expo (EAS) и обработке подачи сборок Android в Google Play Store","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير عمليات النشر وتحسينات_PR باستخدام تدفقات العمل CI/CD، وإرسال نسخ iOS إلى TestFlight لأغراض الاختبار التجريبي، وإدارة بيانات التطبيق في متجر التطبيقات لتحسين التميز في نتائج البحث، كل ذلك باستخدام خدمات تطبيقات Expo (EAS) ومعالجة إرسال نسخ Android إلى متجر Google Play"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Expo application deployments across all platforms","Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing and feedback","Managing and optimizing App Store metadata for better visibility"],"zh":["跨所有平台自动化Expo应用程序部署","将iOS构建提交到TestFlight进行beta测试和反馈","管理和优化App Store元数据以提高可见性"],"ja":["すべてのプラットフォームでExpoアプリケーションの自動化された展開","iOSビルドをTestFlightに提出してベータテストとフィードバックを行う","App Storeメタデータを管理して可視性を高めるために最適化する"],"ko":["모든 플랫폼에서 Expo 애플리케이션 자동화 배포","iOS 빌드를 TestFlight에 제출하여 베타 테스트 및 피드백 수행","App Store 메타데이터 관리 및 최적화를 통한 가시성 향상"],"es":["Automatización de implementaciones de aplicaciones Expo en todas las plataformas","Envío de compilaciones de iOS a TestFlight para pruebas beta y retroalimentación","Gestión y optimización de metadatos de App Store para una mejor visibilidad"],"fr":["Automatisation des déploiements d''applications Expo sur toutes les plateformes","Soumission des builds iOS à TestFlight pour les tests bêta et les retours","Gestion et optimisation des métadonnées de l''App Store pour une meilleure visibilité"],"de":["Automatisierung von Expo-Anwendungsbereitstellungen über alle Plattformen hinweg","Übermittlung von iOS-Builds an TestFlight für Betatests und Feedback","Verwalten und Optimieren von App Store-Metadaten für eine bessere Sichtbarkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de aplicações Expo em todas as plataformas","Enviar compilações do iOS para o TestFlight para testes beta e feedback","Gerenciar e otimizar metadados da App Store para melhor visibilidade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертку приложений Expo на всех платформах","Отправлять сборки iOS в TestFlight для бета-тестирования и обратной связи","Управлять и оптимизировать метаданные App Store для лучшей видимости"],"ar":["توفير عمليات نشر تطبيقات Expo على جميع المنصات","إرسال نسخ iOS إلى TestFlight لأغراض الاختبار التجريبي والتعليقات","إدارة وتحسين بيانات التطبيق في متجر التطبيقات لتحسين الرؤية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo Application Services (EAS) setup","Limited to Expo applications","Needs specific configuration for CI/CD workflows and TestFlight submissions"],"zh":["需要Expo Application Services (EAS) 设置","仅限Expo应用程序","需要CI/CD工作流和TestFlight提交的特定配置"],"ja":["Expo Application Services (EAS) の設定が必要","Expoアプリケーションのみ","CI/CDワークフローとTestFlight提出の特定の構成が必要"],"ko":["Expo Application Services(EAS) 설정이 필요","Expo 애플리케이션만 해당","CI/CD 워크플로 및 TestFlight 제출을 위한 특정 구성 필요"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de Expo Application Services (EAS)","Limitado a aplicaciones Expo","Necesita una configuración específica para los flujos de trabajo de CI/CD y los envíos a TestFlight"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration des Expo Application Services (EAS)","Limité aux applications Expo","Nécessite une configuration spécifique pour les workflows CI/CD et les soumissions TestFlight"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung von Expo Application Services (EAS)","Beschränkt auf Expo-Anwendungen","Erfordert eine spezifische Konfiguration für CI/CD-Workflows und TestFlight-Übermittlungen"],"pt":["Requer configuração dos Serviços de Aplicativos Expo (EAS)","Limitado a aplicações Expo","Necessita de configuração específica para fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD e submissões do TestFlight"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервисов приложений Expo (EAS)","Ограничен приложениями Expo","Требует специальной конфигурации для рабочих процессов CI/CD и подачи в TestFlight"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خدمات تطبيقات Expo (EAS)","محدود بتطبيقات Expo","يتطلب إعدادًا محددًا لتدفقات العمل CI/CD وإرسال نسخ إلى TestFlight"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
