o 배포 스킬은 EAS를 사용하여 Expo 앱을 모든 플랫폼에 배포하는 방법을 제공합니다","es":"El despliegue de aplicaciones Expo con EAS permite la implementación en todas las plataformas. Incluye flujos de trabajo de CI/CD y optimización de metadatos.","fr":"Le déploiement d''applications Expo avec EAS permet la mise en œuvre sur toutes les plateformes. Il inclut des flux de travail CI/CD et l''optimisation des mét...","de":"Das Deployment von Expo-Apps mit EAS ermöglicht die Bereitstellung auf allen Plattformen. Es umfasst CI/CD-Workflows und Metadaten-Optimierung.","pt":"O skill de implantação Expo aborda a implantação de aplicativos Expo em todas as plataformas usando EAS.","ru":"Навык экспо-развертывания охватывает развертывание приложений Expo на всех платформах с помощью EAS.","ar":"مهارة توزيع إكسبو تغطي نشر تطبيقات إكسبو على جميع المنصات باستخدام EAS.","en":"sprout app"},"definition":{"en":"sprout app"},"features":{"zh":["使用 EAS 部署 Expo 应用","自动化部署和测试","提交 iOS 构建到 TestFlight","提交 Android 构建到 Google Play","管理 App Store 元数据和 ASO 优化"],"ja":["EAS を使用して Expo アプリをデプロイ","自動化されたデプロイとテスト","iOS ビルドを TestFlight に提出","Android ビルドを Google Play に提出","App Store メタデータと ASO 最適化の管理"],"ko":["EAS를 사용하여 Expo 앱 배포","자동화된 배포 및 테스트","iOS 빌드를 TestFlight에 제출","Android 빌드를 Google Play에 제출","앱 스토어 메타데이터 및 ASO 최적화 관리"],"es":["Despliegue en todas las plataformas","Flujos de trabajo de CI/CD","Optimización de metadatos","Previsualización de PR","Envío a TestFlight","Envío a la tienda de Google Play"],"fr":["Déploiement sur toutes les plateformes","Flux de travail CI/CD","Optimisation des métadonnées","Prévisualisation de PR","Envoi à TestFlight","Envoi sur le Google Play Store"],"de":["Bereitstellung auf allen Plattformen","CI/CD-Workflows","Metadaten-Optimierung","PR-Vorschau","Einreichung bei TestFlight","Einreichung im Google Play Store"],"pt":["Implantação automática de aplicativos","Otimização de metadados da App Store","Envio de builds para o TestFlight","Navegação pelo Google Play","Uso de fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD","Pré-visualização de PR"],"ru":["Автоматическое развертывание приложений","Оптимизация метаданных App Store","Отправка сборок в TestFlight","Навигация по Google Play","Использование рабочих процессов CI/CD","Предварительный просмотр PR"],"ar":["نشر تطبيقات آلي","تحسين بيانات متجر التطبيقات","إرسال المجمعات إلى تيست فلايت","التنقل في جوجل بلاي","استخدام سير عمل سي/سي دي","معاينة إس آر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo 部署","EAS","自动化部署","TestFlight","Google Play","App Store 优化"],"ja":["Expo デプロイ","EAS","自動化デプロイ","TestFlight","Google Play","App Store 最適化"],"ko":["Expo 배포","EAS","자동화된 배포","TestFlight","Google Play","앱 스토어 최적화"],"es":["despliegue de aplicaciones Expo","EAS","CI/CD","optimización de metadatos","TestFlight","Google Play Store","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","expo-deployment"],"fr":["déploiement d''applications Expo","EAS","CI/CD","optimisation des métadonnées","TestFlight","Google Play Store","développement d''applications mobiles","expo-deployment"],"de":["Expo-App-Deployment","EAS","CI/CD","Metadaten-Optimierung","TestFlight","Google Play Store","Mobile-App-Entwicklung","expo-deployment"],"pt":["implantação expo","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","EAS","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play","otimização de metadados"],"ru":["экспо-развертывание","разработка приложений","EAS","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play","оптимизация метаданных"],"ar":["توزيع إكسبو","تطوير التطبيقات","EAS","سي/سي دي","تيست فلايت","متجر التطبيقات","جوجل بلاي","تحسين بيانات التطبيق"]}},"owner":"Dillind","repo":"sprout-expo","repoPath":"Dillind/sprout-expo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expo-deployment","description":"Deploying Expo apps to iOS App Store, Android Play Store, web hosting, and API routes","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Goog","body":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Google Play Store\n- ./references/ios-app-store.md -- iOS App Store submission and review process\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Install EAS CLI\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g eas-cli\neas login\n```\n\n### Initialize EAS\n\n```bash\nnpx eas-cli@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `eas.json` with build profiles.\n\n## Build Commands\n\n### Production Builds\n\n```bash\n# iOS App Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production\n\n# Android Play Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production\n\n# Both platforms\nnpx eas-cli@latest build --profile production\n```\n\n### Submit to Stores\n\n```bash\n# iOS: Build and submit to App Store Connect\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production --submit\n\n# Android: Build and submit to Play Store\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production --submit\n\n# Shortcut for iOS TestFlight\nnpx testflight\n```\n\n## Web Deployment\n\nDeploy web apps using EAS Hosting:\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to production\nnpx expo export -p web\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy --prod\n\n# Deploy PR preview\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy\n```\n\n## EAS Configuration\n\nStandard `eas.json` for production deployments:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"cli\": {\n    \"version\": \">= 16.0.1\",\n    \"appVersionSource\": \"remote\"\n  },\n  \"build\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"autoIncrement\": true,\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"resourceClass\": \"m-medium\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"development\": {\n      \"developmentClient\": true,\n      \"distribution\": \"internal\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"submit\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"appleId\": \"your@email.com\",\n        \"ascAppId\": \"1234567890\"\n      },\n      \"android\": {\n        \"serviceAccountKeyPath\": \"./google-service-account.json\",\n        \"track\": \"internal\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Platform-Specific Guides\n\n### iOS\n\n- Use `npx testflight` for quick TestFlight submissions\n- Configure Apple credentials via `eas credentials`\n- See ./reference/testflight.md for credential setup\n- See ./reference/ios-app-store.md for App Store submission\n\n### Android\n\n- Set up Google Play Console service account\n- Configure tracks: internal → closed → open → production\n- See ./reference/play-store.md for detailed setup\n\n### Web\n\n- EAS Hosting provides preview URLs for PRs\n- Production deploys to your custom domain\n- See ./reference/workflows.md for CI/CD automation\n\n## Automated Deployments\n\nUse EAS Workflows for CI/CD:\n\n```yaml\n# .eas/workflows/release.yml\nname: Release\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build-ios:\n    type: build\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n\n  submit-ios:\n    type: submit\n    needs: [build-ios]\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n```\n\nSee ./reference/workflows.md for more workflow examples.\n\n## Version Management\n\nEAS manages version numbers automatically with `appVersionSource: \"remote\"`:\n\n```bash\n# Check current versions\neas build:version:get\n\n# Manually set version\neas build:version:set -p ios --build-number 42\n```\n\n## Monitoring\n\n```bash\n# List recent builds\neas build:list\n\n# Check build status\neas build:view\n\n# View submission status\neas submit:list\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:35:49.889Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing streamlined Expo application deployments across all platforms","zh":"非常适合需要在所有平台上简化 Expo 应用程序部署的移动应用程序代理","ja":"すべてのプラットフォームで Expo アプリケーションの展開を簡素化する必要があるモバイル アプリ エージェントに最適","ko":"모든 플랫폼에서 Expo 애플리케이션 배포를 간소화해야 하는 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de aplicaciones móviles que necesitan implementaciones de aplicaciones de Expo optimizadas en todas las plataformas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''applications mobiles ayant besoin de déploiements d''applications Expo rationalisés sur toutes les plateformes","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die optimierte Expo-Anwendungs-Deployments auf allen Plattformen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de implantações de aplicativos Expo otimizadas em todas as plataformas","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, которым необходимы упрощенные развертывания приложений Expo на всех платформах","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق الجوال الذي يحتاج إلى توزيع تطبيقات Expo المتدفقة عبر جميع المنصات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate deployments using EAS, manage App Store metadata for ASO optimization, and submit iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing, all while leveraging CI/CD workflows for seamless integration","zh":"使代理能够使用 EAS 自动化部署、管理应用商店元数据以进行 ASO 优化，并将 iOS构建提交到 TestFlight 进行 beta 测试，同时利用 CI/CD 工作流实现无缝集成","ja":"EAS を使用して展開を自動化し、ASO 最適化のための App Store メタデータを管理し、TestFlight に iOS ビルドを送信してベータ テストを行うなど、CI/CD ワークフローを利用して無駄のない統合を行うエージェントをEmpowerする","ko":"에이전트가 EAS를 사용하여 배포를 자동화하고, ASO 최적화를 위한 앱 스토어 메타데이터를 관리하며, TestFlight에 iOS 빌드를 제출하여 베타 테스트를 수행하는 등, CI/CD 워크플로를 활용하여 무중단 통합을 구현할 수 있도록 Empower한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar los despliegues mediante EAS, gestionar metadatos de la App Store para la optimización de ASO y enviar compilaciones de iOS a TestFlight para pruebas beta, todo mientras aprovecha los flujos de trabajo de CI/CD para una integración sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les déploiements à l''aide d''EAS, de gérer les métadonnées de l''App Store pour l''optimisation de l''ASO et de soumettre les builds iOS à TestFlight pour les tests bêta, le tout en exploitant les workflows CI/CD pour une intégration sans accroc","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Deployments mit EAS zu automatisieren, App Store-Metadaten für ASO-Optimierung zu verwalten und iOS-Builds an TestFlight für Betatests zu senden, und zwar unter Ausschöpfung von CI/CD-Workflows für eine nahtlose Integration","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar implantações usando EAS, gerenciar metadados da App Store para otimização do ASO e enviar compilações do iOS para o TestFlight para testes beta, tudo isso aproveitando fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD para integração perfeita","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать развертывания с помощью EAS, управлять метаданными App Store для оптимизации ASO и отправлять сборки iOS в TestFlight для бета-тестирования, все это при использовании рабочих процессов CI/CD для бесшовной интеграции","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توفير عمليات النشر الآلية باستخدام EAS وإدارة بيانات التعريف المتجر التطبيق لتحسين تحسين آو و إرسال المجمعات آي أو إس إلى تيست فلايت لأغراض الاختبار التجريبي، كل ذلك مع الاستفادة من سير العمل المتواصل والتحديث المستمر من أجل التكامل السلس"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Expo application deployments to multiple platforms","Submitting Android builds to the Google Play Store","Managing App Store metadata for optimization and ASO","Configuring CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews"],"zh":["自动将Expo应用程序部署到多个平台","将Android构建提交到Google Play Store","管理应用商店元数据以进行优化和ASO","配置CI/CD工作流以进行自动化部署和PR预览"],"ja":["複数のプラットフォームに Expo アプリケーションを自動展開する","Android ビルドを Google Play ストアに送信する","App Store メタデータを管理して最適化と ASO を実施する","CI/CD ワークフローを構成して自動展開と PR プレビューを行う"],"ko":["여러 플랫폼에 Expo 애플리케이션을 자동으로 배포하는 것","Android 빌드를 Google Play 스토어에 제출하는 것","앱 스토어 메타데이터를 관리하여 최적화와 ASO를 수행하는 것","CI/CD 워크플로를 구성하여 자동 배포와 PR 미리 보기를 수행하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar los despliegues de aplicaciones de Expo en varias plataformas","Enviar compilaciones de Android a la Google Play Store","Gestionar metadatos de la App Store para la optimización y el ASO","Configurar flujos de trabajo de CI/CD para despliegues automatizados y vistas previas de PR"],"fr":["Automatiser les déploiements d''applications Expo sur plusieurs plateformes","Soumettre les builds Android à la Google Play Store","Gérer les métadonnées de l''App Store pour l''optimisation et l''ASO","Configurer les workflows CI/CD pour des déploiements automatisés et des aperçus de PR"],"de":["Automatisieren von Expo-Anwendungs-Deployments auf mehreren Plattformen","Android-Builds an den Google Play Store senden","App Store-Metadaten für Optimierung und ASO verwalten","CI/CD-Workflows für automatisierte Deployments und PR-Vorschauen konfigurieren"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de aplicativos Expo em várias plataformas","Enviar compilações Android para a Google Play Store","Gerenciar metadados da App Store para otimização e ASO","Configurar fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD para implantações automatizadas e visualizações de PR"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывания приложений Expo на нескольких платформах","Отправлять сборки Android в Google Play Store","Управлять метаданными App Store для оптимизации и ASO","Настроить рабочие процессы CI/CD для автоматизированных развертываний и предварительных просмотров PR"],"ar":["توفير عمليات النشر الآلية لتطبيقات إكسبو على عدة منصات","إرسال المجمعات أندرويد إلى متجر جوجل بلاي","إدارة بيانات التعريف لمتجر التطبيقات من أجل التحسين وآو","تكوين سير العمل المتواصل والتحديث المستمر من أجل النشر الآلي ومعاينة(PR)"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires EAS (Expo Application Services) setup","Limited to Expo applications","Needs access to App Store and Google Play Store accounts for submission"],"zh":["需要 EAS（Expo 应用程序服务）设置","仅限 Expo 应用程序","需要访问 App Store 和 Google Play Store 账户以进行提交"],"ja":["EAS（Expo アプリケーション サービス）の設定が必要","Expo アプリケーションに限定される","送信のために App Store と Google Play ストア アカウントへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["EAS(Expo 애플리케이션 서비스) 설정이 필요하다","Expo 애플리케이션만 해당된다","제출을 위해 앱 스토어와 Google Play 스토어 계정에 접근할 수 있어야 한다"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de EAS (Servicios de aplicaciones de Expo)","Limitado a aplicaciones de Expo","Necesita acceso a las cuentas de la App Store y la Google Play Store para la presentación"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''EAS (Expo Application Services)","Limité aux applications Expo","Nécessite l''accès aux comptes de l''App Store et de la Google Play Store pour la soumission"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung von EAS (Expo-Anwendungsdiensten)","Begrenzt auf Expo-Anwendungen","Benötigt Zugriff auf App Store- und Google Play Store-Konten für die Einreichung"],"pt":["Exige configuração do EAS (Serviços de Aplicativos Expo)","Limitado a aplicativos Expo","Necessita acesso às contas da App Store e Google Play Store para envio"],"ru":["Требует настройки EAS (Службы приложений Expo)","Ограничен приложениями Expo","Требует доступа к учетным записям App Store и Google Play Store для отправки"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد الخدمات التطبيقية إكسبو (EAS)","محصور بتطبيقات إكسبو","يتطلب الوصول إلى حسابات متجر التطبيقات وجوجل بلاي من أجل الإرسال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
