 应用部署解决方案，使用 EAS 跨平台部署 Expo 应用","ja":"Expo アプリケーションのデプロイ ソリューション、EAS を使用して複数のプラットフォームにデプロイ","ko":"Expo 애플리케이션 배포 솔루션, EAS를 사용하여 여러 플랫폼에 배포","es":"El despliegue de aplicaciones Expo con EAS permite la implementación en todas las plataformas. Incluye flujos de trabajo de CI/CD y optimización de metadatos.","fr":"Le déploiement d''applications Expo avec EAS permet la mise en œuvre sur toutes les plateformes. Il inclut des flux de travail CI/CD et l''optimisation des mét...","de":"Das Deployment von Expo-Apps mit EAS ermöglicht die Bereitstellung auf allen Plattformen. Es umfasst CI/CD-Workflows und die Optimierung von Metadaten.","pt":"Este skill aborda a implantação de aplicativos Expo em todas as plataformas usando o EAS. Aprenda a automatizar implantações e gerenciar metadados da App Store.","ru":"Этот навык охватывает развертывание приложений Expo на всех платформах с помощью EAS. Узнайте, как автоматизировать развертывания и управлять метаданными App...","ar":"يغطي هذا المهارة توزيع تطبيقات إكسبو على جميع المنصات باستخدام إي إيه إس. تعلم كيفية自动 الإصدارات وإدارة بيانات المتجر","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化部署","跨平台支持","CI/CD 工作流","TestFlight 集成","App Store metadata 管理","Google Play 提交"],"ja":["自動化デプロイ","複数プラットフォーム対応","CI/CD ワークフロー","TestFlight 統合","App Store メタデータ管理","Google Play 提出"],"ko":["자동화 배포","複数 플랫폼 지원","CI/CD 작업 흐름","TestFlight 통합","App Store 메타데이터 관리","Google Play 제출"],"es":["Despliegue en todas las plataformas","Flujos de trabajo de CI/CD","Optimización de metadatos","Automatización de despliegues","Previsualización de solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["Déploiement sur toutes les plateformes","Flux de travail CI/CD","Optimisation des métadonnées","Automatisation des déploiements","Prévisualisation des demandes d''extraction"],"de":["Bereitstellung auf allen Plattformen","CI/CD-Workflows","Optimierung von Metadaten","Automatisierung von Bereitstellungen","Vorschau von Pull-Anfragen"],"pt":["Implantação automática de aplicativos","Gerenciamento de metadados da App Store","Otimização para a App Store","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Integração com workflows de CI/CD","Pré-visualização de implantações"],"ru":["Автоматическое развертывание приложений","Управление метаданными App Store","Оптимизация для App Store","Поддержка нескольких платформ","Интеграция с рабочими процессами CI/CD","Предварительный просмотр развертываний"],"ar":["الإصدار الآلي للتطبيقات","إدارة بيانات المتجر","تحسين أداء المتجر","دعم منصات متعددة","تكامل مع سير العمل آلي","معاينة الإصدارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo 应用部署","EAS","跨平台部署","自动化部署","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play"],"ja":["Expo アプリケーションのデプロイ","EAS","複数プラットフォームデプロイ","自動化デプロイ","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play"],"ko":["Expo 애플리케이션 배포","EAS","複数 플랫폼 배포","자동화 배포","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play"],"es":["despliegue de aplicaciones Expo","EAS","CI/CD","optimización de metadatos","automatización de despliegues","Expo Application Services"],"fr":["déploiement d''applications Expo","EAS","CI/CD","optimisation des métadonnées","automatisation des déploiements","Expo Application Services"],"de":["Expo-App-Deployment","EAS","CI/CD","Optimierung von Metadaten","Automatisierung von Bereitstellungen","Expo Application Services"],"pt":["expo deployment","eas","implantação de aplicativos","automatização de implantações","gerenciamento de metadados","otimização para app store","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","expo application services"],"ru":["expo deployment","eas","развертывание приложений","автоматизация развертываний","управление метаданными","оптимизация для app store","разработка мобильных приложений","expo application services"],"ar":["إكسبو ديبلويمنت","إي إيه إس","توزيع التطبيقات","أتمتة الإصدار","إدارة بيانات المتجر","تحسين أداء المتجر","تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول","خدمات تطبيق إكسبو"]}},"owner":"dannyhw","repo":"demo-design-system","repoPath":"dannyhw/demo-design-system","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expo-deployment","description":"Deploying Expo apps to iOS App Store, Android Play Store, web hosting, and API routes","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Goog","body":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Google Play Store\n- ./references/ios-app-store.md -- iOS App Store submission and review process\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Install EAS CLI\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g eas-cli\neas login\n```\n\n### Initialize EAS\n\n```bash\nnpx eas-cli@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `eas.json` with build profiles.\n\n## Build Commands\n\n### Production Builds\n\n```bash\n# iOS App Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production\n\n# Android Play Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production\n\n# Both platforms\nnpx eas-cli@latest build --profile production\n```\n\n### Submit to Stores\n\n```bash\n# iOS: Build and submit to App Store Connect\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production --submit\n\n# Android: Build and submit to Play Store\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production --submit\n\n# Shortcut for iOS TestFlight\nnpx testflight\n```\n\n## Web Deployment\n\nDeploy web apps using EAS Hosting:\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to production\nnpx expo export -p web\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy --prod\n\n# Deploy PR preview\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy\n```\n\n## EAS Configuration\n\nStandard `eas.json` for production deployments:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"cli\": {\n    \"version\": \">= 16.0.1\",\n    \"appVersionSource\": \"remote\"\n  },\n  \"build\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"autoIncrement\": true,\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"resourceClass\": \"m-medium\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"development\": {\n      \"developmentClient\": true,\n      \"distribution\": \"internal\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"submit\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"appleId\": \"your@email.com\",\n        \"ascAppId\": \"1234567890\"\n      },\n      \"android\": {\n        \"serviceAccountKeyPath\": \"./google-service-account.json\",\n        \"track\": \"internal\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Platform-Specific Guides\n\n### iOS\n\n- Use `npx testflight` for quick TestFlight submissions\n- Configure Apple credentials via `eas credentials`\n- See ./reference/testflight.md for credential setup\n- See ./reference/ios-app-store.md for App Store submission\n\n### Android\n\n- Set up Google Play Console service account\n- Configure tracks: internal → closed → open → production\n- See ./reference/play-store.md for detailed setup\n\n### Web\n\n- EAS Hosting provides preview URLs for PRs\n- Production deploys to your custom domain\n- See ./reference/workflows.md for CI/CD automation\n\n## Automated Deployments\n\nUse EAS Workflows for CI/CD:\n\n```yaml\n# .eas/workflows/release.yml\nname: Release\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build-ios:\n    type: build\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n\n  submit-ios:\n    type: submit\n    needs: [build-ios]\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n```\n\nSee ./reference/workflows.md for more workflow examples.\n\n## Version Management\n\nEAS manages version numbers automatically with `appVersionSource: \"remote\"`:\n\n```bash\n# Check current versions\neas build:version:get\n\n# Manually set version\neas build:version:set -p ios --build-number 42\n```\n\n## Monitoring\n\n```bash\n# List recent builds\neas build:list\n\n# Check build status\neas build:view\n\n# View submission status\neas submit:list\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:36:21.024Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing seamless Expo application deployment across iOS and Android platforms using EAS","zh":"非常适合需要在 iOS 和 Android 平台上使用 EAS 实现无缝 Expo 应用程序部署的移动应用程序代理","ja":"EAS を使用して iOS と Android プラットフォームのシームレスな Expo アプリケーションのデプロイが必要なモバイル アプリ エージェントに最適","ko":"EAS를 사용하여 iOS 및 Android 플랫폼에서 무제한 Expo 애플리케이션 배포가 필요한 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de aplicaciones móviles que necesitan una implementación de aplicaciones Expo sin problemas en plataformas iOS y Android utilizando EAS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''applications mobiles ayant besoin d''un déploiement d''applications Expo sans rupture sur les plateformes iOS et Android en utilisant EAS","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die eine nahtlose Expo-Anwendungsbereitstellung auf iOS- und Android-Plattformen mithilfe von EAS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que precisam de implantação de aplicativos Expo sem interrupções em plataformas iOS e Android usando EAS","ru":"Идеально для Мобильных Агентов Приложений, которым необходима бесшовная развертка приложений Expo на платформах iOS и Android с использованием EAS","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الجوال الذين يحتاجون إلى تثبيت تطبيق Expo دون انقطاع عبر منصات iOS و Android باستخدام EAS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate deployments and PR previews using CI/CD workflows, submit iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing, and manage App Store metadata for ASO optimization, all while leveraging Expo Application Services (EAS) for streamlined cross-platform deployment","zh":"赋予代理人使用 CI/CD 工作流自动化部署和 PR 预览的能力，提交 iOS 构建到 TestFlight 进行 beta 测试，并管理 App Store 元数据以进行 ASO 优化，同时利用 Expo 应用程序服务 (EAS) 实现跨平台部署的简化","ja":"エージェントに CI/CD ワークフローを使用してデプロイと PR プレビューを自動化する機能を提供し、iOS ビルドを TestFlight に提出してベータテストを行い、ASO 最適化のために App Store メタデータを管理し、同時に Expo アプリケーションサービス (EAS) を使用してクロスプラットフォーム デプロイを簡素化する","ko":"에이전트가 CI/CD 워크플ロー를 사용하여 배포 및 PR 미리 보기를 자동화하도록 하는 기능을 제공하며, iOS 빌드를 TestFlight에 제출하여 베타 테스트를 수행하고, ASO 최적화를 위해 앱 스토어 메타데이터를 관리하며,同時に Expo 애플리케이션 서비스(EAS)를 사용하여 크로스 플랫폼 배포를 간소화","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar implementaciones y vistas previas de PR utilizando flujos de trabajo de CI/CD, enviar compilaciones de iOS a TestFlight para pruebas beta y administrar metadatos de la App Store para la optimización de ASO, todo mientras aprovecha los Servicios de Aplicaciones Expo (EAS) para una implementación transversal simplificada","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les déploiements et les aperçus de PR en utilisant des flux de travail CI/CD, de soumettre des builds iOS à TestFlight pour les tests bêta et de gérer les métadonnées de l''App Store pour l''optimisation ASO, le tout en exploitant les Services d''Application Expo (EAS) pour un déploiement transversal simplifié","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Bereitstellungen und PR-Vorschauen mithilfe von CI/CD-Workflows zu automatisieren, iOS-Builds an TestFlight für Betatests zu übermitteln und App-Store-Metadaten für ASO-Optimierung zu verwalten, während sie die Expo-Anwendungsdienste (EAS) für eine gestraffte Bereitstellung auf mehreren Plattformen nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar implantações e visualizações de PR usando fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD, enviar compilações do iOS para o TestFlight para testes beta e gerenciar metadados da App Store para otimização do ASO, tudo isso aproveitando os Serviços de Aplicativos Expo (EAS) para implantação cruzada de plataformas simplificada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать развертку и просмотр PR с помощью рабочих процессов CI/CD, отправлять сборки iOS в TestFlight для бета-тестирования и управлять метаданными App Store для оптимизации ASO, все это при использовании Услуг Приложений Expo (EAS) для упрощенной跨платформенной развертки","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من ت自動ية عمليات النشر ومراجعة PR باستخدام سير عمل CI/CD، وإرسال بنية iOS إلى TestFlight للاختبار التجريبي وإدارة بيانات التطبيق في متجر التطبيقات لتحسين ASO، كل ذلك مع الاستفادة من خدمات تطبيقات Expo (EAS) لنشر متجاوز المنصات المبسطة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Expo application deployments across all platforms","Submitting Android builds to Google Play Store","Managing App Store metadata for ASO optimization and beta testing through TestFlight"],"zh":["跨所有平台自动化 Expo 应用程序部署","将 Android 构建提交到 Google Play Store","通过 TestFlight 进行 beta 测试和 ASO 优化来管理 App Store 元数据"],"ja":["すべてのプラットフォームでの Expo アプリケーションの自動化デプロイ","Android ビルドを Google Play ストアに提出","TestFlight を使用したベータテストと ASO 最適化のために App Store メタデータを管理"],"ko":["모든 플랫폼에서 Expo 애플리케이션 배포 자동화","Android 빌드를 Google Play 스토어에 제출","TestFlight를 사용한 베타 테스트 및 ASO 최적화를 위해 앱 스토어 메타데이터 관리"],"es":["Automatizar implementaciones de aplicaciones Expo en todas las plataformas","Enviar compilaciones de Android a Google Play Store","Administrar metadatos de la App Store para la optimización de ASO y pruebas beta a través de TestFlight"],"fr":["Automatiser les déploiements d''applications Expo sur toutes les plateformes","Soumettre des builds Android à Google Play Store","Gérer les métadonnées de l''App Store pour l''optimisation ASO et les tests bêta via TestFlight"],"de":["Automatisieren von Expo-Anwendungs-Bereitstellungen auf allen Plattformen","Übermitteln von Android-Builds an Google Play Store","Verwalten von App-Store-Metadaten für ASO-Optimierung und Betatests über TestFlight"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de aplicativos Expo em todas as plataformas","Enviar compilações do Android para a Google Play Store","Gerenciar metadados da App Store para otimização do ASO e testes beta por meio do TestFlight"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертку приложений Expo на всех платформах","Отправлять сборки Android в Google Play Store","Управлять метаданными App Store для оптимизации ASO и бета-тестирования через TestFlight"],"ar":["ت自动ية نشر تطبيقات Expo على جميع المنصات","إرسال بنية Android إلى Google Play Store","إدارة بيانات التطبيق في متجر التطبيقات لتحسين ASO والاختبار التجريبي من خلال TestFlight"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo Application Services (EAS) setup","Limited to Expo applications","Needs specific configuration for CI/CD workflows and App Store metadata management"],"zh":["需要 Expo 应用程序服务 (EAS) 设置","仅限 Expo 应用程序","需要 CI/CD 工作流和 App Store 元数据管理的特定配置"],"ja":["Expo アプリケーションサービス (EAS) のセットアップが必要","Expo アプリケーションのみ","CI/CD ワークフローと App Store メタデータ管理の特定の構成が必要"],"ko":["Expo 애플리케이션 서비스(EAS) 설정이 필요","Expo 애플리케이션만 해당","CI/CD 워크플ロー 및 앱 스토어 메타데이터 관리를 위한 특정 구성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Servicios de Aplicaciones Expo (EAS)","Limitado a aplicaciones Expo","Necesita configuración específica para flujos de trabajo de CI/CD y administración de metadatos de la App Store"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration des Services d''Application Expo (EAS)","Limité aux applications Expo","Nécessite une configuration spécifique pour les flux de travail CI/CD et la gestion des métadonnées de l''App Store"],"de":["Benötigt eine Einrichtung der Expo-Anwendungsdienste (EAS)","Begrenzt auf Expo-Anwendungen","Benötigt eine spezifische Konfiguration für CI/CD-Workflows und App-Store-Metadaten-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Exige configuração dos Serviços de Aplicativos Expo (EAS)","Limitado a aplicativos Expo","Necessita de configuração específica para fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD e gerenciamento de metadados da App Store"],"ru":["Требует настройки Услуг Приложений Expo (EAS)","Ограничен приложениями Expo","Требует специальной конфигурации для рабочих процессов CI/CD и управления метаданными App Store"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خدمات تطبيقات Expo (EAS)","محدود لتطبيقات Expo","يحتاج إلى تكوين محدد لسير عمل CI/CD وإدارة بيانات التطبيق في متجر التطبيقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
