","de":"Expo-App-Veröffentlichung mit EAS","pt":"Implantação Expo: Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos","ru":"Экспо-развертывание: разработка приложений","ar":"توزيع إكسبو: تطوير التطبيقات","en":"expo-deployment"},"description":{"zh":"本技能介绍使用 Expo Application Services (EAS) 在所有平台上部署 Expo 应用程序，包括自动化部署和测试","ja":"このスキルでは、Expo Application Services (EAS) を使用してすべてのプラットフォームに Expo アプリケーションをデプロイする方法を紹介します","ko":"이 스킬은 Expo Application Services (EAS)를 사용하여 모든 플랫폼에 Expo 애플리케이션을 배포하는 방법을介绍합니다","es":"El despliegue de aplicaciones Expo con EAS permite la publicación en todas las plataformas. Aprende a automatizar despliegues y a optimizar la tienda de apli...","fr":"Le déploiement d''applications Expo avec EAS permet la publication sur toutes les plateformes. Découvrez comment automatiser les déploiements et optimiser le ...","de":"Die Veröffentlichung von Expo-Anwendungen mit EAS ermöglicht die Veröffentlichung auf allen Plattformen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Veröffentlichung automatis...","pt":"A implantação Expo permite que os desenvolvedores implantem aplicativos em todas as plataformas com facilidade. Aprenda a usar o EAS para automatizar implant...","ru":"Экспо-развертывание позволяет разработчикам развертывать приложения на всех платформах легко. Узнайте, как использовать EAS для автоматизации развертываний и...","ar":"توزيع إكسبو يسمح للمطورين بنشر التطبيقات على جميع المنصات بسهولة. تعلم كيفية استخدام EAS لتلقين النشر وتحسين البيانات الوصفية.","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["使用 EAS 自动化部署","支持多个平台部署","集成 CI/CD 工作流","支持 TestFlight 和 App Store 提交","支持 Google Play 提交"],"ja":["EAS を使用した自動デプロイ","複数のプラットフォームへのデプロイをサポート","CI/CD ワークフローとの統合","TestFlight と App Store への提出をサポート","Google Play への提出をサポート"],"ko":["EAS를 사용한 자동 배포","複数의 플랫폼에 배포를 지원","CI/CD 워크플로와의 통합","TestFlight와 App Store에 제출을 지원","Google Play에 제출을 지원"],"es":["Despliegue automático en todas las plataformas","Optimización de la tienda de aplicaciones","Pruebas de vuelo para iOS","Despliegue en la tienda de Google Play","Gestión de metadatos de la tienda de aplicaciones","Flujos de trabajo de CI/CD"],"fr":["Déploiement automatique sur toutes les plateformes","Optimisation du magasin d''applications","Tests de vol pour iOS","Déploiement sur le Google Play Store","Gestion des métadonnées du magasin d''applications","Flux de travail de CI/CD"],"de":["Automatisierte Veröffentlichung auf allen Plattformen","Optimierung des App-Stores","Testflüge für iOS","Veröffentlichung im Google Play Store","Verwaltung von App-Store-Metadaten","CI/CD-Workflows"],"pt":["Implantação automática de aplicativos","Otimização de metadados da App Store","Suporte a CI/CD","Pré-visualização de pull requests","Nuvem de testes para iOS e Android"],"ru":["Автоматическое развертывание приложений","Оптимизация метаданных App Store","Поддержка CI/CD","Предварительный просмотр запросов на вытягивание","Облачные тесты для iOS и Android"],"ar":["نشر التطبيقات تلقائيًا","تحسين بيانات وصف متجر التطبيقات","دعم CI/CD","معاينة طلبات السحب","اختبارات سحابية لآي أو إس وأندرويد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo 部署","EAS","自动化部署","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play","移动应用程序部署"],"ja":["Expo デプロイ","EAS","自動デプロイ","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play","モバイル アプリケーション デプロイ"],"ko":["Expo 배포","EAS","자동 배포","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Google Play","모바일 애플리케이션 배포"],"es":["despliegue de aplicaciones Expo","EAS","automatización de despliegues","optimización de la tienda de aplicaciones","pruebas de vuelo para iOS","despliegue en la tienda de Google Play","gestión de metadatos de la tienda de aplicaciones","flujos de trabajo de CI/CD"],"fr":["déploiement d''applications Expo","EAS","automatisation des déploiements","optimisation du magasin d''applications","tests de vol pour iOS","déploiement sur le Google Play Store","gestion des métadonnées du magasin d''applications","flux de travail de CI/CD"],"de":["Expo-Anwendungsveröffentlichung","EAS","Automatisierung der Veröffentlichung","Optimierung des App-Stores","Testflüge für iOS","Veröffentlichung im Google Play Store","Verwaltung von App-Store-Metadaten","CI/CD-Workflows"],"pt":["implantação expo","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","EAS","CI/CD","otimização de metadados","App Store","Google Play","testes de aplicativos"],"ru":["экспо-развертывание","разработка приложений","EAS","CI/CD","оптимизация метаданных","App Store","Google Play","тестирование приложений"],"ar":["توزيع إكسبو","تطوير التطبيقات","EAS","CI/CD","تحسين البيانات الوصفية","متجر التطبيقات","جوجل بلاي","اختبارات التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expo-deployment","description":"Deploying Expo apps to iOS App Store, Android Play Store, web hosting, and API routes","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Goog","body":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Google Play Store\n- ./references/ios-app-store.md -- iOS App Store submission and review process\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Install EAS CLI\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g eas-cli\neas login\n```\n\n### Initialize EAS\n\n```bash\nnpx eas-cli@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `eas.json` with build profiles.\n\n## Build Commands\n\n### Production Builds\n\n```bash\n# iOS App Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production\n\n# Android Play Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production\n\n# Both platforms\nnpx eas-cli@latest build --profile production\n```\n\n### Submit to Stores\n\n```bash\n# iOS: Build and submit to App Store Connect\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production --submit\n\n# Android: Build and submit to Play Store\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production --submit\n\n# Shortcut for iOS TestFlight\nnpx testflight\n```\n\n## Web Deployment\n\nDeploy web apps using EAS Hosting:\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to production\nnpx expo export -p web\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy --prod\n\n# Deploy PR preview\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy\n```\n\n## EAS Configuration\n\nStandard `eas.json` for production deployments:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"cli\": {\n    \"version\": \">= 16.0.1\",\n    \"appVersionSource\": \"remote\"\n  },\n  \"build\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"autoIncrement\": true,\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"resourceClass\": \"m-medium\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"development\": {\n      \"developmentClient\": true,\n      \"distribution\": \"internal\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"submit\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"appleId\": \"your@email.com\",\n        \"ascAppId\": \"1234567890\"\n      },\n      \"android\": {\n        \"serviceAccountKeyPath\": \"./google-service-account.json\",\n        \"track\": \"internal\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Platform-Specific Guides\n\n### iOS\n\n- Use `npx testflight` for quick TestFlight submissions\n- Configure Apple credentials via `eas credentials`\n- See ./reference/testflight.md for credential setup\n- See ./reference/ios-app-store.md for App Store submission\n\n### Android\n\n- Set up Google Play Console service account\n- Configure tracks: internal → closed → open → production\n- See ./reference/play-store.md for detailed setup\n\n### Web\n\n- EAS Hosting provides preview URLs for PRs\n- Production deploys to your custom domain\n- See ./reference/workflows.md for CI/CD automation\n\n## Automated Deployments\n\nUse EAS Workflows for CI/CD:\n\n```yaml\n# .eas/workflows/release.yml\nname: Release\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build-ios:\n    type: build\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n\n  submit-ios:\n    type: submit\n    needs: [build-ios]\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n```\n\nSee ./reference/workflows.md for more workflow examples.\n\n## Version Management\n\nEAS manages version numbers automatically with `appVersionSource: \"remote\"`:\n\n```bash\n# Check current versions\neas build:version:get\n\n# Manually set version\neas build:version:set -p ios --build-number 42\n```\n\n## Monitoring\n\n```bash\n# List recent builds\neas build:list\n\n# Check build status\neas build:view\n\n# View submission status\neas submit:list\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:36:10.736Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cross-Platform Agents needing streamlined Expo application deployment across iOS and Android using EAS","zh":"非常适合需要跨平台代理简化 Expo 应用程序部署到 iOS 和 Android 的 EAS","ja":"クロスプラットフォームエージェントがExpoアプリケーションの展開をiOSとAndroidで簡素化する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"iOS와 Android에서 EAS를 사용하여 Expo 애플리케이션 배포를简化해야 하는 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de plataforma cruzada que necesitan una implementación de aplicaciones Expo optimizada en iOS y Android mediante EAS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de plateforme croisée nécessitant un déploiement d''applications Expo simplifié sur iOS et Android à l''aide d''EAS","de":"Perfekt für Cross-Platform-Agents, die eine optimierte Expo-Anwendungsverteilung auf iOS und Android über EAS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cross-Platform que precisam de uma implantação de aplicativos Expo estruturada em iOS e Android usando EAS","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов с поддержкой нескольких платформ, которым необходима оптимизированная развертка приложений Expo на iOS и Android с использованием EAS","ar":"مثالي لعميل متوافق عبر المنصات الذي يحتاج إلى نشر تطبيقات Expo المتنقلة عبر أنظمة iOS و Android باستخدام EAS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate deployments and PR previews with CI/CD workflows, manage App Store metadata for ASO optimization, and submit builds to TestFlight and Google Play Store using Expo Application Services (EAS) and protocols like iOS and Android builds","zh":"赋予代理人使用CI/CD工作流程自动化部署和PR预览、管理应用商店元数据以优化ASO、使用Expo应用程序服务（EAS）和iOS和Android构建等协议将构建提交到TestFlight和Google Play Store的能力","ja":"CI/CDワークフローを使用して展開とPRプレビューを自動化し、App Storeのメタデータを管理してASOを最適化し、Expoアプリケーションサービス（EAS）やiOSおよびAndroidビルドなどのプロトコルを使用してビルドをTestFlightおよびGoogle Playストアに提出する能力をエージェントに与える","ko":"CI/CD 워크플ロー를 사용하여 배포 및 PR 미리 보기를 자동화하고 앱 스토어 메타데이터를 관리하여 ASO를 최적화하고 EAS 및 iOS 및 Android 빌드 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 빌드를 TestFlight 및 Google Play 스토어에 제출할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar implementaciones y vistas previas de PR con flujos de trabajo de CI/CD, administrar metadatos de la App Store para la optimización de ASO y enviar compilaciones a TestFlight y Google Play Store mediante los servicios de aplicación Expo (EAS) y protocolos como compilaciones de iOS y Android","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les déploiements et les prévisualisations de PR avec des flux de travail CI/CD, de gérer les métadonnées de l''App Store pour l''optimisation de l''ASO et de soumettre des builds à TestFlight et au Google Play Store en utilisant les services d''application Expo (EAS) et des protocoles tels que les builds iOS et Android","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Bereitstellungen und PR-Vorschauen mit CI/CD-Workflows zu automatisieren, App-Store-Metadaten für ASO-Optimierung zu verwalten und Builds an TestFlight und Google Play Store mithilfe von Expo-Anwendungsdiensten (EAS) und Protokollen wie iOS- und Android-Builds zu senden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar implantações e visualizações de PR com fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD, gerenciar metadados da App Store para otimização do ASO e enviar compilações para o TestFlight e a Google Play Store usando os Serviços de Aplicativos Expo (EAS) e protocolos como compilações de iOS e Android","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать развертку и предварительные просмотры PR с помощью рабочих процессов CI/CD, управлять метаданными App Store для оптимизации ASO и отправлять сборки в TestFlight и Google Play Store с использованием сервисов приложений Expo (EAS) и протоколов, таких как сборки iOS и Android","ar":"يمكن للعميل تفعيل الوكلاء لتحقيق آلي لنشر التطبيقات ومعاينة طلبات السحب باستخدام تدفقات العمل CI/CD، وإدارة بيانات التطبيق في متجر التطبيقات لتحسين تحسين محركات البحث وتسليم بنية التطبيقات إلى خدمة اختبار بيتا TestFlight ومتجر جوجل بلاي باستخدام خدمة تطبيقات إكسبو EAS وبروتوكولات مثل بناء نظامiOS و Android"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Expo application deployments across all platforms","Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing and managing App Store metadata","Optimizing Android builds for submission to the Google Play Store","Configuring CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews"],"zh":["跨所有平台自动化Expo应用程序部署","将iOS构建提交到TestFlight进行beta测试并管理App Store元数据","优化Android构建以提交到Google Play Store","配置CI/CD工作流程以实现自动化部署和PR预览"],"ja":["すべてのプラットフォームでExpoアプリケーションの展開を自動化する","iOSビルドをTestFlightに提出してベータテストを行い、App Storeのメタデータを管理する","AndroidビルドをGoogle Playストアに提出するために最適化する","CI/CDワークフローを自動化された展開とPRプレビューのために構成する"],"ko":["모든 플랫폼에서 Expo 애플리케이션 배포를 자동화","TestFlight에서 베타 테스트를 위해 iOS 빌드를 제출하고 앱 스토어 메타데이터를 관리","Google Play 스토어에 제출하기 위해 Android 빌드를 최적화","자동화된 배포 및 PR 미리 보기를 위해 CI/CD 워크플ロー 구성"],"es":["Automatizar implementaciones de aplicaciones Expo en todas las plataformas","Enviar compilaciones de iOS a TestFlight para pruebas beta y administrar metadatos de la App Store","Optimizar compilaciones de Android para su presentación en Google Play Store","Configurar flujos de trabajo de CI/CD para implementaciones y vistas previas automatizadas"],"fr":["Automatiser les déploiements d''applications Expo sur toutes les plateformes","Soumettre des builds iOS à TestFlight pour des tests bêta et gérer les métadonnées de l''App Store","Optimiser les builds Android pour les soumettre au Google Play Store","Configurer des flux de travail CI/CD pour des déploiements et des prévisualisations automatisés"],"de":["Automatisieren von Expo-Anwendungsverteilungen auf allen Plattformen","Senden von iOS-Builds an TestFlight für Betatests und Verwalten von App-Store-Metadaten","Optimieren von Android-Builds für die Einreichung im Google Play Store","Konfigurieren von CI/CD-Workflows für automatisierte Bereitstellungen und Vorschauen"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de aplicativos Expo em todas as plataformas","Enviar compilações de iOS para o TestFlight para testes beta e gerenciar metadados da App Store","Otimizar compilações de Android para envio à Google Play Store","Configurar fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD para implantações automatizadas e visualizações de PR"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертку приложений Expo на всех платформах","Отправлять сборки iOS в TestFlight для бета-тестирования и управлять метаданными App Store","Оптимизировать сборки Android для отправки в Google Play Store","Настроить рабочие процессы CI/CD для автоматизированной развертки и предварительных просмотров PR"],"ar":["تحقيق آلي لنشر تطبيقات إكسبو عبر جميع المنصات","تسليم بنية نظام iOS إلى خدمة اختبار بيتا TestFlight وإدارة بيانات التطبيقات في متجر التطبيقات","تحسين بنية التطبيقات الخاصة بنظام Android لنشرها في متجر جوجل بلاي","تكوين تدفقات العمل CI/CD لنشر آلي وتحقيق معاينة طلبات السحب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo Application Services (EAS) setup","Limited to Expo applications only","Needs specific configuration for iOS and Android builds"],"zh":["需要Expo应用程序服务（EAS）设置","仅限Expo应用程序","需要为iOS和Android构建进行特定配置"],"ja":["Expoアプリケーションサービス（EAS）設定が必要","Expoアプリケーションのみに対応","iOSおよびAndroidビルドの特定の構成が必要"],"ko":["EAS 설정이 필요","Expo 애플리케이션만 해당","iOS 및 Android 빌드에 대한 특정 구성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de los servicios de aplicación Expo (EAS)","Limitado a aplicaciones Expo solamente","Necesita configuración específica para compilaciones de iOS y Android"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration des services d''application Expo (EAS)","Limité aux applications Expo uniquement","Nécessite une configuration spécifique pour les builds iOS et Android"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration der Expo-Anwendungsdienste (EAS)","Begrenzt auf Expo-Anwendungen nur","Benötigt eine spezifische Konfiguration für iOS- und Android-Builds"],"pt":["Requer configuração dos Serviços de Aplicativos Expo (EAS)","Limitado a aplicativos Expo apenas","Necessita de configuração específica para compilações de iOS e Android"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервисов приложений Expo (EAS)","Ограничен только приложениями Expo","Требует специальной настройки для сборок iOS и Android"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خدمة تطبيقات إكسبو EAS","محدود بتطبيقات إكسبو فقط","يحتاج إلى إعداد خاص لبنية نظام iOS و Android"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
