usca de dados","Diretrizes para refatoração de código","Otimização de bundles para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["45 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации оптимизации","Руководство для реализации поиска данных","Рекомендации для рефакторинга кода","Оптимизация пакетов для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات للترتيب الأولوي لتحسين الأداء","دليل لتنفيذ بحث البيانات","إرشادات لتحسين الكود","تحسين الحزم لتحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成"],"ja":["Vercel React","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成"],"ko":["버셀 리액트","리액트 최적화","넥스트js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성"],"es":["React","Next.js","Vercel","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","bundling","refactorización automática"],"fr":["React","Next.js","Vercel","optimisation des performances","meilleures pratiques","développement d''applications","bundling","réfactoring automatique"],"de":["React","Next.js","Vercel","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","Anwendungsentwicklung","Bundling","automatische Refaktorierung"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho react","melhores práticas vercel react","guia de otimização next.js","react performance optimization","vercel react best practices","next.js optimization guide"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности react","лучшие практики vercel react","руководство по оптимизации next.js","react производительность оптимизация","vercel react лучшие практики","next.js руководство по оптимизации"],"ar":["تحسين أداء رياكت","أفضل الممارسات لتفعيل فيرسيل رياكت","دليل تحسين أداء نكست.جس","رياكت تحسين الأداء","أفضل الممارسات لتفعيل فيرسيل رياكت","نكست.جس دليل تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"JuanAntonioHR","repo":"cozy-room-portfolio","repoPath":"JuanAntonioHR/cozy-room-portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:36:24.099Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents focused on optimizing React and Next.js applications for performance and scalability.","zh":"适用于专注于优化 React 和 Next.js 应用程序以实现性能和可扩展性的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js アプリケーションのパフォーマンスとスケーラビリティを最適化することに重点を置くフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Next.js 애플리케이션의 성능과 확장성을 최적화하는 데 중점을 둔 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend centrados en optimizar aplicaciones React y Next.js para rendimiento y escalabilidad.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend axés sur l''optimisation des applications React et Next.js pour les performances et la scalabilité.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die auf die Optimierung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen für Leistung und Skalierbarkeit ausgerichtet sind.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de frontend focados na otimização de aplicativos React e Next.js para desempenho e escalabilidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов frontend, ориентированных на оптимизацию приложений React и Next.js для производительности и масштабируемости.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يركزون على تحسين أداء تطبيقات React و Next.js وتوسيع نطاقها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 45 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel''s guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理人自动重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 45 条规则和 8 个类别的综合性能优化，包括使用 Vercel 指南的数据获取和包优化。","ja":"React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成をエージェントに可能にし、Vercel のガイドラインを使用したデータ取得とバンドル最適化を含む、45 のルールと 8 つのカテゴリの総合的なパフォーマンス最適化を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 React 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, Vercel 가이드라인을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함하여 45개의 규칙 및 8개의 카테고리의 종합적인 성능 최적화를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la reestructuración y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, aprovechando 45 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización de rendimiento integral, incluida la optimización de la recuperación de datos y la agrupación utilizando las pautas de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la réorganisation et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 45 règles dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation des performances complète, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement en utilisant les directives de Vercel.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Neustrukturierung und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem es 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung nutzt, einschließlich der Optimierung der Datenabfrage und des Bundling unter Verwendung der Richtlinien von Vercel.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 45 regras em 8 categorias para otimização abrangente de desempenho, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando as diretrizes do Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях для всесторонней оптимизации производительности, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и пакетирования с использованием руководства Vercel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير آلي لتحديث وتوليد رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، باستخدام 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الأداء الشامل، بما في ذلك تحسين جلب البيانات وتحزيم باستخدام إرشادات Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React and Next.js codebases","Generating optimized React components and Next.js pages with improved data fetching strategies","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance and maintainability"],"zh":["自动化 React 和 Next.js 代码库的代码审查以发现性能问题","生成具有改进的数据获取策略的优化 React 组件和 Next.js 页面","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能和可维护性"],"ja":["React と Next.js コードベースのパフォーマンスの問題に対するコードレビューの自動化","改善されたデータ取得戦略を使用した最適化された React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの生成","既存の React と Next.js コードのリファクタリングによるパフォーマンスとメンテナンス性の向上"],"ko":["React와 Next.js 코드베이스의 성능 문제에 대한 코드 리뷰 자동화","개선된 데이터 가져오기 전략을 사용한 최적화된 React 컴포넌트 및 Next.js 페이지 생성","기존 React 및 Next.js 코드의 리팩토링을 통한 성능 및 유지보수성 향상"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento en bases de código React y Next.js","Generar componentes de React y páginas de Next.js optimizados con estrategias de recuperación de datos mejoradas","Reestructurar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento y mantenimiento"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances dans les bases de code React et Next.js","Générer des composants React et des pages Next.js optimisés avec des stratégies d''extraction de données améliorées","Réorganiser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances et une meilleure maintenabilité"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme in React- und Next.js-Codebasen","Generieren optimierter React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten mit verbesserten Datenabfragemethoden","Neustrukturieren des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für bessere Leistung und Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho em codebases React e Next.js","Gerar componentes React e páginas Next.js otimizados com estratégias de busca de dados aprimoradas","Refatorar código existente React e Next.js para melhor desempenho e manutenção"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью в кодовых базах React и Next.js","Генерировать оптимизированные компоненты React и страницы Next.js с улучшенными стратегиями извлечения данных","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности и поддержки"],"ar":["توفير آلي لاستعراض الشفرة ل مشاكل الأداء في قواعد الشفرة React و Next.js","توليد مكونات React وصفحات Next.js المُحسّنة مع استراتيجيات جلب البيانات المُحسّنة","إعادة هيكلة الشفرة الحالية React و Next.js لتحسين الأداء والصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js ecosystems","Limited to applications hosted on Vercel or using similar performance optimization guidelines"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Next.js 生态系统","仅限于托管在 Vercel 或使用类似性能优化指南的应用程序"],"ja":["React と Next.js のエコシステムの知識が必要","Vercel または同等のパフォーマンス最適化ガイドラインを使用するアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요","Vercel 또는 유사한 성능 최적화 가이드라인을 사용하는 애플리케이션에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones alojadas en Vercel o que utilizan pautas de optimización de rendimiento similares"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances des écosystèmes React et Next.js","Limité aux applications hébergées sur Vercel ou utilisant des directives d''optimisation des performances similaires"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der React- und Next.js-Ökosysteme","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die auf Vercel gehostet werden oder ähnliche Leistungsoptimierungsrichtlinien verwenden"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos ecossistemas React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações hospedadas no Vercel ou que utilizam diretrizes de otimização de desempenho semelhantes"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем React и Next.js","Ограничен приложениями, размещенными на Vercel или использующими аналогичные руководства по оптимизации производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ببيئات React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات المضيفة على Vercel أو التي تستخدم إرشادات تحسين الأداء المماثلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
