la verificación antes de completar","Integración con plugin marketplaces para instalación de skills","Garantía de integridad y calidad del código"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de la vérification avant achèvement dans les projets de développement","Utilisation de Claude Code pour garantir la qualité du code","Principes de vérification avant achèvement pour les développeurs","Bonnes pratiques pour la mise en œuvre de la vérification avant achèvement","Intégration avec les marketplaces de plugins pour l''installation de skills","Garantie d''intégrité et de qualité du code"],"de":["Umsetzung der Verifizierung vor Abschluss in Entwicklungsprojekten","Verwendung von Claude Code zur Gewährleistung der Code-Qualität","Prinzipien der Verifizierung vor Abschluss für Entwickler","Best Practices für die Umsetzung der Verifizierung vor Abschluss","Integration mit Plugin-Marketplaces für die Installation von Skills","Gewährleistung der Integrität und Qualität des Codes"],"pt":["Garantia de qualidade","Confiabilidade do resultado final","Eficiência no processo de desenvolvimento","Redução de erros e bugs","Melhoria da produtividade"],"ru":["Гарантия качества","Надежность конечного результата","Эффективность процесса разработки","Сокращение ошибок и багов","Улучшение производительности"],"ar":["ضمان الجودة","موثوقية النتيجة النهائية","كفاءة عملية التطوير","تقليل الأخطاء والعيوب","تحسين الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["验证前完成","Claude Code","项目技能安装","验证命令","项目管理","质量保证","开发团队","效率提高","生产力提高"],"ja":["Verification Before Completion","クロードコード","プロジェクトスキルのインストール","検証コマンド","プロジェクト管理","品質保証","開発チーム","効率提高","生産性提高"],"ko":["완료 전 검증","클로드 코드","프로젝트 스킬 설치","검증 명령","프로젝트 관리","품질 보증","개발 팀","효율성 향상","생산성 향상"],"es":["verificación antes de completar","desarrollo de software","calidad del código","Claude Code","plugin marketplaces","integridad del código","principios de verificación","mejores prácticas de desarrollo"],"fr":["vérification avant achèvement","développement de logiciels","qualité du code","Claude Code","marketplaces de plugins","intégrité du code","principes de vérification","bonnes pratiques de développement"],"de":["Verifizierung vor Abschluss","Softwareentwicklung","Code-Qualität","Claude Code","Plugin-Marketplaces","Integrität des Codes","Prinzipien der Verifizierung","Best Practices für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["verificação antes de conclusão","desenvolvimento de software","garantia de qualidade","confiabilidade","eficiência","produtividade"],"ru":["верификация перед завершением","разработка программного обеспечения","гарантия качества","надежность","эффективность","производительность"],"ar":["التحقق قبل الإكمال","تطوير البرمجيات","ضمان الجودة","موثوقية","كفاءة","إنتاجية"]}},"owner":"vgeshel","repo":"local-skills","repoPath":"vgeshel/local-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"verification-before-completion","description":"Use when about to claim work is complete, fixed, or passing, before committing or creating PRs - requires running verification commands and confirming output before making any success claims; evidence before assertions always","bodyPreview":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing sati","body":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing satisfaction:\n\n1. IDENTIFY: What command proves this claim?\n2. RUN: Execute the FULL command (fresh, complete)\n3. READ: Full output, check exit code, count failures\n4. VERIFY: Does output confirm the claim?\n   - If NO: State actual status with evidence\n   - If YES: State claim WITH evidence\n5. ONLY THEN: Make the claim\n\nSkip any step = lying, not verifying\n```\n\n## Common Failures\n\n| Claim                 | Requires                        | Not Sufficient                 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| Tests pass            | Test command output: 0 failures | Previous run, \"should pass\"    |\n| Linter clean          | Linter output: 0 errors         | Partial check, extrapolation   |\n| Build succeeds        | Build command: exit 0           | Linter passing, logs look good |\n| Bug fixed             | Test original symptom: passes   | Code changed, assumed fixed    |\n| Regression test works | Red-green cycle verified        | Test passes once               |\n| Agent completed       | VCS diff shows changes          | Agent reports \"success\"        |\n| Requirements met      | Line-by-line checklist          | Tests passing                  |\n\n## Red Flags - STOP\n\n- Using \"should\", \"probably\", \"seems to\"\n- Expressing satisfaction before verification (\"Great!\", \"Perfect!\", \"Done!\", etc.)\n- About to commit/push/PR without verification\n- Trusting agent success reports\n- Relying on partial verification\n- Thinking \"just this once\"\n- Tired and wanting work over\n- **ANY wording implying success without having run verification**\n\n## Rationalization Prevention\n\n| Excuse                                  | Reality                |\n| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| \"Should work now\"                       | RUN the verification   |\n| \"I''m confident\"                         | Confidence ≠ evidence  |\n| \"Just this once\"                        | No exceptions          |\n| \"Linter passed\"                         | Linter ≠ compiler      |\n| \"Agent said success\"                    | Verify independently   |\n| \"I''m tired\"                             | Exhaustion ≠ excuse    |\n| \"Partial check is enough\"               | Partial proves nothing |\n| \"Different words so rule doesn''t apply\" | Spirit over letter     |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n**Tests:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run test command] [See: 34/34 pass] \"All tests pass\"\n❌ \"Should pass now\" / \"Looks correct\"\n```\n\n**Regression tests (TDD Red-Green):**\n\n```\n✅ Write → Run (pass) → Revert fix → Run (MUST FAIL) → Restore → Run (pass)\n❌ \"I''ve written a regression test\" (without red-green verification)\n```\n\n**Build:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run build] [See: exit 0] \"Build passes\"\n❌ \"Linter passed\" (linter doesn''t check compilation)\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n```\n✅ Re-read plan → Create checklist → Verify each → Report gaps or completion\n❌ \"Tests pass, phase complete\"\n```\n\n**Agent delegation:**\n\n```\n✅ Agent reports success → Check VCS diff → Verify changes → Report actual state\n❌ Trust agent report\n```\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nFrom 24 failure memories:\n\n- your human partner said \"I don''t believe you\" - trust broken\n- Undefined functions shipped - would crash\n- Missing requirements shipped - incomplete features\n- Time wasted on false completion → redirect → rework\n- Violates: \"Honesty is a core value. If you lie, you''ll be replaced.\"\n\n## When To Apply\n\n**ALWAYS before:**\n\n- ANY variation of success/completion claims\n- ANY expression of satisfaction\n- ANY positive statement about work state\n- Committing, PR creation, task completion\n- Moving to next task\n- Delegating to agents\n\n**Rule applies to:**\n\n- Exact phrases\n- Paraphrases and synonyms\n- Implications of success\n- ANY communication suggesting completion/correctness\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**No shortcuts for verification.**\n\nRun the command. Read the output. THEN claim the result.\n\nThis is non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:36:20.478Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Quality Assurance Agents requiring rigorous verification protocols before completion.","zh":"非常适合需要在完成之前进行严格验证协议的质量保证代理。","ja":"完了前に厳格な検証プロトコルを必要とする品質保証エージェントに最適です。","ko":"완료 전에 엄격한 검증 프로토콜을 요구하는 품질 보증 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aseguramiento de Calidad que requieren protocolos de verificación rigurosos antes de la finalización.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''assurance qualité qui nécessitent des protocoles de vérification rigoureux avant l''achèvement.","de":"Perfekt für Qualitäts-Sicherungs-Agenten, die vor dem Abschluss strenge Überprüfungsprotokolle erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Garantia de Qualidade que exigem protocolos de verificação rigorosos antes da conclusão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по контролю качества, требующих строгих протоколов проверки перед завершением.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات ضمان الجودة التي تتطلب بروتوكولات التحقق الصارمة قبل الاستكمال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure claims are backed by fresh verification evidence, enforcing the core principle of evidence before claims through the iron law of no completion claims without verification, utilizing protocols like verification commands and gate functions to prevent dishonesty.","zh":"赋予代理人确保索赔有最新的验证证据的能力，强制执行在索赔之前需要证据的核心原则，通过无验证不完成索赔的铁律，利用验证命令和阀函数等协议防止不诚实行为。","ja":"エージェントが請求を最新の検証証拠で裏付けることを保証し、証拠のない請求を許可しない鉄則を遵守することで核となる原則を強制実行し、検証コマンドやゲート関数などのプロトコルを使用して不誠実な行為を防止します。","ko":"에이전트가 청구를最新의 검증 증거로 뒷받침 할 수 있도록 하고, 증거 없이 청구를 허용하지 않는 철칙을 준수하여 핵심 원칙을 강제로 실행하며, 검증 명령 및 게이트 함수 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 부정직한 행위를 방지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a asegurarse de que las reclamaciones estén respaldadas por evidencia de verificación fresca, aplicando el principio fundamental de evidencia antes de las reclamaciones a través de la ley de hierro de no reclamaciones de finalización sin verificación, utilizando protocolos como comandos de verificación y funciones de puerta para prevenir la deshonestidad.","fr":"Habilite les agents à s''assurer que les réclamations sont étayées par des preuves de vérification fraîches, en appliquant le principe fondamental de preuve avant les réclamations à travers la loi de fer de non-réclamation d''achèvement sans vérification, en utilisant des protocoles tels que des commandes de vérification et des fonctions de portail pour prévenir la malhonnêteté.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sicherzustellen, dass die Ansprüche durch frische Überprüfungsbeweise gestützt werden, indem es das Kernprinzip der Beweise vor den Ansprüchen durch das Eisengesetz des Nichtabschlusses von Ansprüchen ohne Überprüfung durchsetzt, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Überprüfungsbefehlen und Torfunktionen, um Unehrlichkeit zu verhindern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir que as reclamações sejam respaldadas por evidências de verificação recente, aplicando o princípio básico de evidência antes de reclamações por meio da lei de ferro de não reclamações de conclusão sem verificação, utilizando protocolos como comandos de verificação e funções de portão para prevenir desonestidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить, чтобы претензии подтверждались свежими доказательствами проверки, применяя основной принцип доказательств до претензий посредством железного закона о невозможности завершения претензий без проверки, используя протоколы, такие как команды проверки и функции шлюза, для предотвращения нечестности.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ضمان دعم المطالبات بأدلة تحقق حديثة، وتطبيق المبدأ الأساسي للأدلة قبل المطالبات من خلال قانون الحديد لعدم وجود مطالبات إنهاء بدون التحقق، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل أوامر التحقق ووظائف البوابة لمنع الغش."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying completion claims with fresh evidence","Enforcing the iron law in project workflows","Implementing gate functions to prevent premature status updates"],"zh":["使用最新证据验证完成索赔","在项目工作流中强制执行铁律","实施阀函数以防止过早的状态更新"],"ja":["最新の証拠で完了請求を検証する","プロジェクトのワークフローで鉄則を強制実行する","ゲート関数を実装して早期のステータス更新を防止する"],"ko":["최신 증거로 완료 청구를 검증하는 것","프로젝트 워크플ロー에서 철칙을 강제로 실행하는 것","게이트 함수를 구현하여 조기 상태 업데이트를 방지하는 것"],"es":["Verificar las reclamaciones de finalización con evidencia fresca","Aplicar la ley de hierro en los flujos de trabajo del proyecto","Implementar funciones de puerta para prevenir actualizaciones de estado prematuras"],"fr":["Vérifier les réclamations d''achèvement avec des preuves fraîches","Appliquer la loi de fer dans les flux de travail du projet","Mettre en œuvre des fonctions de portail pour prévenir les mises à jour de statut prématurées"],"de":["Überprüfen von Fertigstellungsansprüchen mit frischen Beweisen","Durchsetzen des Eisengesetzes in den Projektabläufen","Implementieren von Torfunktionen, um vorzeitige Statusaktualisierungen zu verhindern"],"pt":["Verificar reclamações de conclusão com evidências recentes","Aplicar a lei de ferro nos fluxos de trabalho do projeto","Implementar funções de portão para evitar atualizações de status prematuras"],"ru":["Проверка претензий на завершение с помощью свежих доказательств","Применение железного закона в рабочих потоках проекта","Реализация функций шлюза для предотвращения преждевременных обновлений статуса"],"ar":["التحقق من مطالبات الاستكمال بإدلة حديثة","تطبيق قانون الحديد في سير عمل المشروع","تنفيذ وظائف البوابة لمنع التحديثات المسبقة للوضع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to the iron law","Violations of the rule are considered dishonesty"],"zh":["需要严格遵守铁律","违反规则将被视为不诚实行为"],"ja":["鉄則を厳格に遵守する必要がある","規則の違反は不誠実な行為とみなされる"],"ko":["철칙을 엄격히 준수해야 함","규칙 위반은 부정직한 행위로 간주됨"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adherencia a la ley de hierro","Las violaciones de la regla se consideran deshonestidad"],"fr":["Nécessite une stricte adhésion à la loi de fer","Les violations de la règle sont considérées comme de la malhonnêteté"],"de":["Erfordert eine strenge Einhaltung des Eisengesetzes","Verletzungen der Regel gelten als Unehrlichkeit"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita à lei de ferro","Violações da regra são consideradas desonestidade"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения железного закона","Нарушения правила считаются нечестностью"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام الصارم بقانون الحديد","يُعتبر انتهاك القاعدة غشًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
