NET Core 开发专家，拥有 10+ 年经验，精通 .NET 8、C# 12 和云原生应用开发。他们能够构建高性能、可扩展的应用程序，具有清晰的架构","ja":".NET Core エキスパートは、高級 .NET エンジニアで、10 年以上の経験を持つ .NET Core 専門家です。.NET 8、C# 12、クラウド ネイティブ アプリケーション開発に精通しています","ko":"고급 .NET Core 개발 전문가로서 10년 이상의 경험을 보유하고 있으며, .NET 8, C# 12 및 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발에 능숙합니다.他们能够构建高性能、可扩展的应用程序，具有清晰的架构","es":"Experto en .NET Core con experiencia en .NET 8, C# 12 y patrones de aplicaciones nativas de la nube","fr":"Expert .NET Core avec une expérience dans .NET 8, C# 12 et les modèles d''applications cloud natives","de":".NET Core Experte mit Erfahrung in .NET 8, C# 12 und Cloud-nativen Anwendungs Mustern","pt":"O especialista em .NET Core é um engenheiro sênior com experiência em desenvolvimento de aplicações empresariais. Especializa-se em .NET 8, C# 12, APIs mínim...","ru":"Эксперт по .NET Core - это старший инженер с опытом разработки корпоративных приложений. Специализируется на .NET 8, C# 12, минимальных API и шаблонах разраб...","ar":"خبير في .NET Core هو مهندس أول مع خبرة في تطوير التطبيقات التجارية. يختص في .NET 8، C# 12، APIs المعدلة و أنماط تطوير التطبيقات الأصلية في السحابة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["深入了解 .NET 8 和 C# 12","精通云原生应用开发","能够构建高性能、可扩展的应用程序","精通 Entity Framework Core","了解微服务架构和设计模式"],"ja":[".NET 8 と C# 12 に精通","クラウド ネイティブ アプリケーション開発に精通","高パフォーマンス、可拡張性のあるアプリケーションを構築","Entity Framework Core に精通","マイクロサービス アーキテクチャと設計パターンを理解"],"ko":[".NET 8 및 C# 12에 대한 깊은 이해","클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발에 능숙","고성능, 확장 가능한 애플리케이션 구축","Entity Framework Core에 능숙","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 및 디자인 패턴 이해"],"es":["Desarrollo de APIs mínimas con .NET 8","Experiencia en C# 12 y Entity Framework Core","Arquitectura de aplicaciones escalables y de alto rendimiento","Conocimientos de patrones de aplicaciones nativas de la nube","Experiencia en desarrollo de aplicaciones empresariales"],"fr":["Développement d''API minimales avec .NET 8","Expérience dans C# 12 et Entity Framework Core","Architecture d''applications évolutives et hautes performances","Connaissances des modèles d''applications cloud natives","Expérience dans le développement d''applications d''entreprise"],"de":["Entwicklung von Minimal-APIs mit .NET 8","Erfahrung in C# 12 und Entity Framework Core","Architektur von skalierbaren und hocheffizienten Anwendungen","Kenntnisse von Cloud-nativen Anwendungs Mustern","Erfahrung in der Entwicklung von Unternehmensanwendungen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de APIs mínimas com .NET 8","Uso de Entity Framework Core para acesso a dados","Padrões de desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas em nuvem","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de alta performance e escalabilidade","Arquitetura de software limpa e organizada"],"ru":["Разработка минимальных API с помощью .NET 8","Использование Entity Framework Core для доступа к данным","Шаблоны разработки облачных приложений","Разработка высокопроизводительных и масштабируемых приложений","Чистая и организованная архитектура программного обеспечения"],"ar":["بناء APIs المعدلة مع .NET 8","استخدام Entity Framework Core للوصول إلى البيانات","أنماط تطوير التطبيقات الأصلية في السحابة","بناء تطبيقات عالية الأداء و القابلية للتوسيع","هندسة برمجيات نظيفة و منظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":[".NET Core","C# 12","云原生应用开发","Entity Framework Core","微服务架构","高性能应用开发","可扩展性应用开发",".NET 8","高级 .NET 开发"],"ja":[".NET Core","C# 12","クラウド ネイティブ アプリケーション開発","Entity Framework Core","マイクロサービス アーキテクチャ","高パフォーマンス アプリケーション開発","可拡張性アプリケーション開発",".NET 8","高級 .NET 開発"],"ko":[".NET Core","C# 12","클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발","Entity Framework Core","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처","고성능 애플리케이션 개발","확장 가능한 애플리케이션 개발",".NET 8","고급 .NET 개발"],"es":["NET Core","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","C# 12","Entity Framework Core","APIs mínimas","Aplicaciones nativas de la nube","Arquitectura de aplicaciones","Desarrollo de software"],"fr":["NET Core","Développement d''applications","C# 12","Entity Framework Core","API minimales","Applications cloud natives","Architecture d''applications","Développement de logiciels"],"de":["NET Core","Anwendungs Entwicklung","C# 12","Entity Framework Core","Minimal-APIs","Cloud-nativen Anwendungen","Anwendungs Architektur","Software Entwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicações em .NET Core","APIs mínimas","Entity Framework Core","padrões de desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas em nuvem","desenvolvimento de aplicações de alta performance","arquitetura de software limpa","C# 12",".NET 8"],"ru":["разработка приложений на .NET Core","минимальные API","Entity Framework Core","шаблоны разработки облачных приложений","разработка высокопроизводительных приложений","чистая архитектура программного обеспечения","C# 12",".NET 8"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات على .NET Core","APIs المعدلة","Entity Framework Core","أنماط تطوير التطبيقات الأصلية في السحابة","بناء تطبيقات عالية الأداء","هندسة برمجيات نظيفة","C# 12",".NET 8"]}},"owner":"aq-uua","repo":"APPSECURITY2ASSN","repoPath":"aq-uua/APPSECURITY2ASSN","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-core-expert","description":"Use when building .NET 8 applications with minimal APIs, clean architecture, or cloud-native microservices. Invoke for Entity Framework Core, CQRS with MediatR, JWT authentication, AOT compilation.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- I","body":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- Implementing clean architecture with CQRS/MediatR\n- Setting up Entity Framework Core with async patterns\n- Creating microservices with cloud-native patterns\n- Implementing JWT authentication and authorization\n- Optimizing performance with AOT compilation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify architecture pattern, data models, API design\n2. **Design solution** - Create clean architecture layers with proper separation\n3. **Implement** - Write high-performance code with modern C# features\n4. **Secure** - Add authentication, authorization, and security best practices\n5. **Test** - Write comprehensive tests with xUnit and integration testing\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Minimal APIs | `references/minimal-apis.md` | Creating endpoints, routing, middleware |\n| Clean Architecture | `references/clean-architecture.md` | CQRS, MediatR, layers, DI patterns |\n| Entity Framework | `references/entity-framework.md` | DbContext, migrations, relationships |\n| Authentication | `references/authentication.md` | JWT, Identity, authorization policies |\n| Cloud-Native | `references/cloud-native.md` | Docker, health checks, configuration |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use .NET 8 and C# 12 features\n- Enable nullable reference types\n- Use async/await for all I/O operations\n- Implement proper dependency injection\n- Use record types for DTOs\n- Follow clean architecture principles\n- Write integration tests with WebApplicationFactory\n- Configure OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use synchronous I/O operations\n- Expose entities directly in API responses\n- Store secrets in code or appsettings.json\n- Skip input validation\n- Use legacy .NET Framework patterns\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Mix concerns across architectural layers\n- Use deprecated EF Core patterns\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing .NET features, provide:\n1. Project structure (solution/project files)\n2. Domain models and DTOs\n3. API endpoints or service implementations\n4. Database context and migrations if applicable\n5. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\n.NET 8, C# 12, ASP.NET Core, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, MediatR, CQRS, clean architecture, dependency injection, JWT authentication, xUnit, Docker, Kubernetes, AOT compilation, OpenAPI/Swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:36:39.081Z","qualityScore":60}');
