croservices. Invoke for Entity Framework Core, CQRS with MediatR, JWT authentication, AOT compilation.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- I","body":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- Implementing clean architecture with CQRS/MediatR\n- Setting up Entity Framework Core with async patterns\n- Creating microservices with cloud-native patterns\n- Implementing JWT authentication and authorization\n- Optimizing performance with AOT compilation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify architecture pattern, data models, API design\n2. **Design solution** - Create clean architecture layers with proper separation\n3. **Implement** - Write high-performance code with modern C# features\n4. **Secure** - Add authentication, authorization, and security best practices\n5. **Test** - Write comprehensive tests with xUnit and integration testing\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Minimal APIs | `references/minimal-apis.md` | Creating endpoints, routing, middleware |\n| Clean Architecture | `references/clean-architecture.md` | CQRS, MediatR, layers, DI patterns |\n| Entity Framework | `references/entity-framework.md` | DbContext, migrations, relationships |\n| Authentication | `references/authentication.md` | JWT, Identity, authorization policies |\n| Cloud-Native | `references/cloud-native.md` | Docker, health checks, configuration |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use .NET 8 and C# 12 features\n- Enable nullable reference types\n- Use async/await for all I/O operations\n- Implement proper dependency injection\n- Use record types for DTOs\n- Follow clean architecture principles\n- Write integration tests with WebApplicationFactory\n- Configure OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use synchronous I/O operations\n- Expose entities directly in API responses\n- Store secrets in code or appsettings.json\n- Skip input validation\n- Use legacy .NET Framework patterns\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Mix concerns across architectural layers\n- Use deprecated EF Core patterns\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing .NET features, provide:\n1. Project structure (solution/project files)\n2. Domain models and DTOs\n3. API endpoints or service implementations\n4. Database context and migrations if applicable\n5. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\n.NET 8, C# 12, ASP.NET Core, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, MediatR, CQRS, clean architecture, dependency injection, JWT authentication, xUnit, Docker, Kubernetes, AOT compilation, OpenAPI/Swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:36:24.904Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud-Native Agents requiring expertise in .NET Core, C# 12, and minimal APIs for scalable application development.","zh":"适用于需要 .NET Core、C# 12 和最小 API 的云原生代理的专业知识，用于可扩展的应用程序开发。","ja":"Cloud-Native エージェントに .NET Core、C# 12、最小 API の専門知識を必要とする可搬性のあるアプリケーション開発に最適。","ko":"클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 .NET Core, C# 12 및 최소 API의 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 확장 가능한 애플리케이션 개발에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes nativos de la nube que requieren experiencia en .NET Core, C# 12 y APIs minimales para el desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud-Native nécessitant une expertise en .NET Core, C# 12 et en API minimales pour le développement d''applications évolutives.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Native-Agents, die Expertenwissen in .NET Core, C# 12 und minimalen APIs für die Entwicklung von skalierbaren Anwendungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes Cloud-Native que exigem especialização em .NET Core, C# 12 e APIs mínimas para desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих экспертизы в области .NET Core, C# 12 и минимальных API для разработки масштабируемых приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين السحابيين الذين يتطلبون الخبرة في .NET Core و C# 12 و واجهات برمجة التطبيقات القصوى لتطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build high-performance, cloud-native applications using .NET 8, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and clean architecture, leveraging modern C# features for efficient development.","zh":"赋予代理使用 .NET 8、最小 API、Entity Framework Core 和干净的架构构建高性能、云原生应用程序的能力，利用现代 C# 功能实现高效的开发。","ja":".NET 8、最小 API、Entity Framework Core、クリーン アーキテクチャを使用して、高パフォーマンスのクラウド ネイティブ アプリケーションを構築するエージェントをEmpowerし、モダンな C# 機能を使用して効率的な開発を実現する。","ko":"에이전트가 .NET 8, 최소 API, Entity Framework Core 및 깨끗한 아키텍처를 사용하여 고성능, 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하며, 최신 C# 기능을 사용하여 효율적인 개발을 달성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones nativas de la nube de alto rendimiento utilizando .NET 8, APIs minimales, Entity Framework Core y arquitectura limpia, aprovechando las características modernas de C# para un desarrollo eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications cloud-natives à haute performance en utilisant .NET 8, des API minimales, Entity Framework Core et une architecture propre, en exploitant les fonctionnalités modernes de C# pour un développement efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, leistungsstarke, cloud-native Anwendungen mit .NET 8, minimalen APIs, Entity Framework Core und sauberer Architektur zu erstellen, indem moderne C#-Funktionen für effizientes Entwickeln genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações nativas em nuvem de alto desempenho usando .NET 8, APIs mínimas, Entity Framework Core e arquitetura limpa, aproveitando recursos modernos do C# para desenvolvimento eficiente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать облачные приложения с высокими показателями производительности, используя .NET 8, минимальные API, Entity Framework Core и чистую архитектуру, используя современные функции C# для эффективной разработки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء بناء تطبيقات سحابية أصلية عالية الأداء باستخدام .NET 8 و واجهات برمجة التطبيقات القصوى و Entity Framework Core و هندسة نظيفة ، واستغلال ميزات C# الحديثة من أجل تطوير فعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Building minimal APIs with .NET 8 for microservices architecture","Developing scalable, cloud-native applications with Entity Framework Core","Implementing clean architecture patterns for maintainable and testable codebases"],"zh":["使用 .NET 8 为微服务架构构建最小 API","使用 Entity Framework Core 开发可扩展的云原生应用程序","实现干净的架构模式以获得可维护和可测试的代码库"],"ja":["マイクロサービスのアーキテクチャ用に .NET 8 で最小 API を構築する","Entity Framework Core を使用して可搬性のあるクラウド ネイティブ アプリケーションを開発する","メンテナンス可能でテスト可能なコードベースを取得するためのクリーン アーキテクチャ パターンの実装"],"ko":["마이크로서비스 아키텍처를 위한 .NET 8에서 최소 API를 구축하는 것","Entity Framework Core를 사용하여 확장 가능한 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것","유지 관리 가능한 코드베이스와 테스트 가능한 코드베이스를 얻기 위해 깨끗한 아키텍처 패턴을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Construir APIs minimales con .NET 8 para arquitectura de microservicios","Desarrollar aplicaciones nativas de la nube escalables con Entity Framework Core","Implementar patrones de arquitectura limpia para bases de código mantenibles y probables"],"fr":["Construire des API minimales avec .NET 8 pour une architecture de microservices","Développer des applications cloud-natives évolutives avec Entity Framework Core","Mettre en œuvre des modèles d''architecture propre pour des bases de code maintenables et testables"],"de":["Erstellen von minimalen APIs mit .NET 8 für Mikroservices-Architektur","Entwickeln von skalierbaren, cloud-nativen Anwendungen mit Entity Framework Core","Implementieren von Mustern für saubere Architektur für wartbare und testbare Codebasen"],"pt":["Construção de APIs mínimas com .NET 8 para arquitetura de microserviços","Desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas em nuvem escaláveis com Entity Framework Core","Implementação de padrões de arquitetura limpa para repositórios de código manejáveis e testáveis"],"ru":["Создание минимальных API с помощью .NET 8 для архитектуры микросервисов","Разработка масштабируемых облачных приложений с помощью Entity Framework Core","Реализация шаблонов чистой архитектуры для поддерживаемых и тестируемых баз кода"],"ar":["بناء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات القصوى مع .NET 8 من أجل هندسة ميكروسيرفس","تطوير تطبيقات سحابية قابلة للتوسيع مع Entity Framework Core","تنفيذ أنماط هندسة نظيفة من أجل قواعد код قابلة للصيانة والاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET 8 and C# 12 compatibility","Limited to Windows, Linux, and macOS platforms supported by .NET Core"],"zh":[".NET 8 和 C# 12 兼容性要求","仅限 .NET Core 支持的 Windows、Linux 和 macOS 平台"],"ja":[".NET 8 と C# 12 の互換性の要件",".NET Core でサポートされている Windows、Linux、macOS プラットフォームに限定"],"ko":[".NET 8 및 C# 12 호환성 요구 사항",".NET Core에서 지원하는 Windows, Linux 및 macOS 플랫폼으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con .NET 8 y C# 12","Limitado a las plataformas Windows, Linux y macOS compatibles con .NET Core"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec .NET 8 et C# 12","Limité aux plates-formes Windows, Linux et macOS prises en charge par .NET Core"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit .NET 8 und C# 12","Begrenzt auf Windows-, Linux- und macOS-Plattformen, die von .NET Core unterstützt werden"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com .NET 8 e C# 12","Limitado às plataformas Windows, Linux e macOS suportadas pelo .NET Core"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с .NET 8 и C# 12","Ограничен платформами Windows, Linux и macOS, поддерживаемыми .NET Core"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع .NET 8 و C# 12","محدود بمنصات Windows و Linux و macOS المدعومة من قبل .NET Core"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
