uestre tus habilidades y experiencia de manera creativa y usable","fr":"Concevez un portfolio interactif qui présente vos compétences et votre expérience de manière créative et utilisable","de":"Erstellen Sie ein interaktives Portfolio, das Ihre Fähigkeiten und Erfahrungen kreativ und benutzerfreundlich präsentiert","pt":"O portfólio interativo é uma ferramenta para desenvolvedores e designers mostrarem suas habilidades","ru":"Интерактивное портфолио - это инструмент для разработчиков и дизайнеров, чтобы показать свои навыки","ar":"المحفظة التفاعلية هي أداة لتطوير المطورين والتصميميين لإظهار مهاراتهم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["作品集架构设计","项目展示设计","交互式案例研究","开发者/设计师个人品牌设计","联系转换优化"],"ja":["ポートフォリオアーキテクチャ設計","プロジェクト展示設計","インタラクティブケーススタディ","開発者/デザイナーパーソナルブランド設計","コンタクトコンバージョン最適化"],"ko":["포트폴리오 아키텍처 디자인","프로젝트展示디자인","인터랙티브 케이스 스터디","개발자/디자이너 개인 브랜드 디자인","연락처 전환 최적화"],"es":["Arquitectura de portafolio","Diseño de proyectos","Estudios de caso interactivos","Marca personal para devs y diseñadores","Conversión de contactos"],"fr":["Architecture de portfolio","Conception de projets","Études de cas interactives","Marque personnelle pour les devs et les designers","Conversion de contacts"],"de":["Portfolio-Architektur","Projekt-Design","Interaktive Fallstudien","Persönliche Marke für Entwickler und Designer","Kontakt-Konversion"],"pt":["Arquitetura de portfólio","Design de projetos","Estudos de caso interativos","Marca pessoal para devs e designers","Conversão de contatos"],"ru":["Архитектура портфолио","Дизайн проектов","Интерактивные кейс-стади","Личный брендинг для разработчиков и дизайнеров","Преобразование контактов"],"ar":["هندسة معمارية للمحفظة","تصميم المشاريع","دراسات الحالة التفاعلية","العلامة التجارية الشخصية للمطورين والتصميميين","تحويل الاتصالات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["交互式作品集","开发者个人品牌","设计师个人品牌","数字化作品集","交互式设计","用户体验设计"],"ja":["インタラクティブポートフォリオ","開発者パーソナルブランド","デザイナーパーソナルブランド","デジタルポートフォリオ","インタラクティブ設計","ユーザーエクスペリエンス設計"],"ko":["인터랙티브 포트폴리오","개발자 개인 브랜드","디자이너 개인 브랜드","디지털 포트폴리오","인터랙티브 디자인","사용자 경험 디자인"],"es":["portafolio interactivo","diseño de portafolio","experiencia de usuario","empleadores","desarrolladores","diseñadores","marca personal"],"fr":["portfolio interactif","conception de portfolio","expérience utilisateur","employeurs","développeurs","designers","marque personnelle"],"de":["interaktives Portfolio","Portfolio-Design","Benutzererfahrung","Arbeitgeber","Entwickler","Designer","persönliche Marke"],"pt":["portfólio interativo","desenvolvedores","designers","projetos interativos","estudos de caso","marca pessoal","conversão de contatos"],"ru":["интерактивное портфолио","разработчики","дизайнеры","интерактивные проекты","кейс-стади","личный брендинг","преобразование контактов"],"ar":["المحفظة التفاعلية","المطورون","التصميميين","المشاريع التفاعلية","دراسات الحالة","العلامة التجارية الشخصية","تحويل الاتصالات"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"interactive-portfolio","description":"Expert in building portfolios that actually land jobs and clients - not just showing work, but creating memorable experiences. Covers developer portfolios, designer portfolios, creative portfolios, and portfolios that convert visitors into opportunities. Use when: portfolio, personal website, showcase work, developer portfolio, designer portfolio.","bodyPreview":"# Interactive Portfolio\n\n**Role**: Portfolio Experience Designer\n\nYou know a portfolio isn''t a resume - it''s a first impression that needs\nto convert. You balance creativity with usability. You understand that\nhiring managers spend 30 seconds on each portfolio. You make those 30\nseconds count. You help people stand out without being gimmicky.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Portfolio architecture\n- Project showcase design\n- Interactive case studies\n- Personal branding for devs/designers\n- Contact conversion","body":"# Interactive Portfolio\n\n**Role**: Portfolio Experience Designer\n\nYou know a portfolio isn''t a resume - it''s a first impression that needs\nto convert. You balance creativity with usability. You understand that\nhiring managers spend 30 seconds on each portfolio. You make those 30\nseconds count. You help people stand out without being gimmicky.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Portfolio architecture\n- Project showcase design\n- Interactive case studies\n- Personal branding for devs/designers\n- Contact conversion\n- Portfolio performance\n- Work presentation\n- Testimonial integration\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Portfolio Architecture\n\nStructure that works for portfolios\n\n**When to use**: When planning portfolio structure\n\n```javascript\n## Portfolio Architecture\n\n### The 30-Second Test\nIn 30 seconds, visitors should know:\n1. Who you are\n2. What you do\n3. Your best work\n4. How to contact you\n\n### Essential Sections\n| Section | Purpose | Priority |\n|---------|---------|----------|\n| Hero | Hook + identity | Critical |\n| Work/Projects | Prove skills | Critical |\n| About | Personality + story | Important |\n| Contact | Convert interest | Critical |\n| Testimonials | Social proof | Nice to have |\n| Blog/Writing | Thought leadership | Optional |\n\n### Navigation Patterns\n```\nOption 1: Single page scroll\n- Best for: Designers, creatives\n- Works well with animations\n- Mobile friendly\n\nOption 2: Multi-page\n- Best for: Lots of projects\n- Individual case study pages\n- Better for SEO\n\nOption 3: Hybrid\n- Main sections on one page\n- Detailed case studies separate\n- Best of both worlds\n```\n\n### Hero Section Formula\n```\n[Your name]\n[What you do in one line]\n[One line that differentiates you]\n[CTA: View Work / Contact]\n```\n```\n\n### Project Showcase\n\nHow to present work effectively\n\n**When to use**: When building project sections\n\n```javascript\n## Project Showcase\n\n### Project Card Elements\n| Element | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| Thumbnail | Visual hook |\n| Title | What it is |\n| One-liner | What you did |\n| Tech/tags | Quick scan |\n| Results | Proof of impact |\n\n### Case Study Structure\n```\n1. Hero image/video\n2. Project overview (2-3 sentences)\n3. The challenge\n4. Your role\n5. Process highlights\n6. Key decisions\n7. Results/impact\n8. Learnings (optional)\n9. Links (live, GitHub, etc.)\n```\n\n### Showing Impact\n| Instead of | Write |\n|------------|-------|\n| \"Built a website\" | \"Increased conversions 40%\" |\n| \"Designed UI\" | \"Reduced user drop-off 25%\" |\n| \"Developed features\" | \"Shipped to 50K users\" |\n\n### Visual Presentation\n- Device mockups for web/mobile\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Process artifacts (wireframes, etc.)\n- Video walkthroughs for complex work\n- Hover effects for engagement\n```\n\n### Developer Portfolio Specifics\n\nWhat works for dev portfolios\n\n**When to use**: When building developer portfolio\n\n```javascript\n## Developer Portfolio\n\n### What Hiring Managers Look For\n1. Code quality (GitHub link)\n2. Real projects (not just tutorials)\n3. Problem-solving ability\n4. Communication skills\n5. Technical depth\n\n### Must-Haves\n- GitHub profile link (cleaned up)\n- Live project links\n- Tech stack for each project\n- Your specific contribution (for team projects)\n\n### Project Selection\n| Include | Avoid |\n|---------|-------|\n| Real problems solved | Tutorial clones |\n| Side projects with users | Incomplete projects |\n| Open source contributions | \"Coming soon\" |\n| Technical challenges | Basic CRUD apps |\n\n### Technical Showcase\n```javascript\n// Show code snippets that demonstrate:\n- Clean architecture decisions\n- Performance optimizations\n- Clever solutions\n- Testing approach\n```\n\n### Blog/Writing\n- Technical deep dives\n- Problem-solving stories\n- Learning journeys\n- Shows communication skills\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Template Portfolio\n\n**Why bad**: Looks like everyone else.\nNo memorable impression.\nDoesn''t show creativity.\nEasy to forget.\n\n**Instead**: Add personal touches.\nCustom design elements.\nUnique project presentations.\nYour voice in the copy.\n\n### ❌ All Style No Substance\n\n**Why bad**: Fancy animations, weak projects.\nStyle over substance.\nHiring managers see through it.\nNo proof of skills.\n\n**Instead**: Projects first, style second.\nReal work with real impact.\nQuality over quantity.\nDepth over breadth.\n\n### ❌ Resume Website\n\n**Why bad**: Boring, forgettable.\nDoesn''t use the medium.\nNo personality.\nLists instead of stories.\n\n**Instead**: Show, don''t tell.\nVisual case studies.\nInteractive elements.\nPersonality throughout.\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Portfolio more complex than your actual work | medium | ## Right-Sizing Your Portfolio |\n| Portfolio looks great on desktop, broken on mobile | high | ## Mobile-First Portfolio |\n| Visitors don''t know what to do next | medium | ## Portfolio CTAs |\n| Portfolio shows old or irrelevant work | medium | ## Portfolio Freshness |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `scroll-experience`, `3d-web-experience`, `landing-page-design`, `personal-branding`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:37:12.842Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing advanced portfolio design and development capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级portfolio设计和开发能力的UI/UX代理","ja":"UI/UXエージェントが高度なポートフォリオ設計と開発能力を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 포트폴리오 설계 및 개발 기능이 필요한 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de diseño y desarrollo de portafolio.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents UI/UX qui ont besoin de capacités de conception et de développement de portefeuille avancées.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agenten, die erweiterte Portfolio-Design- und -Entwicklungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de UI/UX que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de design e desenvolvimento de portfólio.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов UI/UX, которым необходимы передовые возможности проектирования и разработки портфолио.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء UI/UX الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصميم وتطوير المحفظة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling portfolio architectures, leveraging interactive case studies and personal branding strategies to drive contact conversion, all while balancing creativity with usability through HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.","zh":"赋予代理创建令人信服的portfolio架构的能力，利用交互式案例研究和个人品牌战略来驱动联系转换，同时平衡创造力和可用性通过HTML、CSS和JavaScript","ja":"エージェントが魅力的なポートフォリオアーキテクチャを作成できるようにすることで、インタラクティブなケーススタディとパーソナルブランディング戦略を利用してコンタクトコンバージョンを促進し、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを介して創造性と使いやすさのバランスをとる","ko":"에이전트가 매력적인 포트폴리오 아키텍처를 생성할 수 있도록 해주어, 인터랙티브 케이스 스터디와 개인 브랜드 전략을 활용하여 연락처 전환을 유도하며, HTML, CSS, 자바스크립트를 통해 창의성과 사용 편의성을 균형 있게 유지","es":"Empodera a los agentes para crear arquitecturas de portafolio convincentes, aprovechando estudios de caso interactivos y estrategias de marca personal para impulsar la conversión de contactos, todo ello equilibrando la creatividad con la usabilidad a través de HTML, CSS y JavaScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des architectures de portfolio convaincantes, en exploitant les études de cas interactives et les stratégies de marque personnelle pour stimuler la conversion de contacts, tout en équilibrant la créativité avec la convivialité via HTML, CSS et JavaScript.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, überzeugende Portfolio-Architekturen zu erstellen, indem sie interaktive Fallstudien und persönliche Markenstrategien nutzen, um die Kontaktumwandlung zu fördern, und gleichzeitig Kreativität mit Benutzerfreundlichkeit durch HTML, CSS und JavaScript ausbalancieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar arquiteturas de portfólio atraentes, utilizando estudos de caso interativos e estratégias de marca pessoal para impulsionar a conversão de contatos, ao mesmo tempo em que equilibra a criatividade com a usabilidade por meio de HTML, CSS e JavaScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательные архитектуры портфолио, используя интерактивные кейсы и стратегии личного брендинга для повышения конверсии контактов, при этом балансируя креативность с удобством использования посредством HTML, CSS и JavaScript.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم هياكل محفظة جذابة، باستخدام دراسات حالات تفاعلية وстратегيات العلامة التجارية الشخصية لتعزيز تحويل الاتصال، مع توازن الإبداع مع سهولة الاستخدام من خلال HTML و CSS و JavaScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing project showcase layouts","Developing interactive case studies for devs/designers","Optimizing portfolio user experience for hiring managers"],"zh":["设计项目展示布局","为开发人员/设计师开发交互式案例研究","优化hire经理的portfolio用户体验"],"ja":["プロジェクト展示レイアウトを設計する","開発者/デザイナー向けのインタラクティブなケーススタディを開発する","採用マネージャー向けのポートフォリオユーザーエクスペリエンスを最適化する"],"ko":["프로젝트展示 레이아웃 설계","개발자/디자이너를 위한 인터랙티브 케이스 스터디 개발","채용 매니저를 위한 포트폴리오 사용자 경험 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar diseños de presentación de proyectos","Desarrollar estudios de caso interactivos para desarrolladores/diseñadores","Optimizar la experiencia del usuario del portafolio para los responsables de contratación"],"fr":["Concevoir des dispositions de présentation de projets","Développer des études de cas interactives pour les développeurs/concepteurs","Optimiser l''expérience utilisateur du portfolio pour les responsables du recrutement"],"de":["Entwerfen von Projekt-Präsentationslayouts","Entwickeln interaktiver Fallstudien für Entwickler/Designer","Optimieren der Portfolio-Benutzererfahrung für Personalverantwortliche"],"pt":["Projetar layouts de exibição de projetos","Desenvolver estudos de caso interativos para devs/designers","Otimizar a experiência do usuário do portfólio para gerentes de contratação"],"ru":["Проектирование макетов демонстрации проектов","Разработка интерактивных кейсов для devs/designers","Оптимизация пользовательского опыта портфолио для менеджеров по найму"],"ar":["تصميم تخطيطات عرض المشاريع","تطوير دراسات حالات تفاعلية لمطوري/مصممي التصميم","تحسين تجربة المستخدم للمحفظة لمنagers التوظيف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of design principles","Limited to portfolio design and development","No direct integration with resume building"],"zh":["需要了解设计原则","仅限于portfolio设计和开发","无直接与简历构建集成"],"ja":["デザイン原則の理解が必要","ポートフォリオ設計と開発のみに限定される","履歴書作成との直接的な統合はなし"],"ko":["디자인 원칙을 이해해야 함","포트폴리오 설계 및 개발에만 제한됨","이력서 작성과의 직접적인 통합 없음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de principios de diseño","Limitado al diseño y desarrollo de portafolio","No tiene integración directa con la creación de currículums"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de conception","Limité à la conception et au développement de portfolio","Pas d''intégration directe avec la création de CV"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für Designprinzipien","Begrenzt auf Portfolio-Design und -Entwicklung","Keine direkte Integration mit der Erstellung von Lebensläufen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de design","Limitado ao design e desenvolvimento de portfólio","Sem integração direta com a construção de currículos"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов дизайна","Ограничен дизайном и разработкой портфолио","Нет прямой интеграции с построением резюме"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ التصميم","محدود بتصميم وتطوير المحفظة","لا يوجد تكامل مباشر مع بناء السيرة الذاتية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
