","de":"Interaktives Portfolio-Design für Entwickler und Designer, mit Fokus auf die Konvertierung","pt":"O portfólio interativo é uma experiência de design que combina criatividade e usabilidade para impressionar em 30 segundos.","ru":"Интерактивный портфолио - это опыт дизайна, который сочетает креативность и удобство использования, чтобы произвести впечатление за 30 секунд.","ar":"المحفظة التفاعلية هي تجربة تصميم تجمع بين الإبداع وسهولة الاستخدام لتُبهر في 30 ثانية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["作品集架构","项目展示设计","交互式案例研究","开发者/设计师个人品牌","联系转化"],"ja":["ポートフォリオアーキテクチャ","プロジェクト展示設計","インタラクティブケーススタディ","デベロッパー/デザイナー個人ブランド","コンタクトコンバージョン"],"ko":["포트폴리오 아키텍처","프로젝트展示디자인","인터랙티브 케이스 스터디","개발자/디자이너 개인 브랜드","연락 전환"],"es":["Arquitectura de portafolio","Diseño de proyectos","Estudios de caso interactivos","Marcas personales para desarrolladores y diseñadores","Conversión de contactos"],"fr":["Architecture de portfolio","Conception de projets","Études de cas interactives","Marques personnelles pour les développeurs et les designers","Conversion de contacts"],"de":["Portfolio-Architektur","Projekt-Design","Interaktive Fallstudien","Persönliche Marken für Entwickler und Designer","Kontakt-Konvertierung"],"pt":["Arquitetura de portfólio","Design de showcase de projetos","Estudos de caso interativos","Brand pessoal para devs/designers","Conversão de contato"],"ru":["Архитектура портфолио","Дизайн проектного шоу","Интерактивные кейсы","Личный бренд для разработчиков/дизайнеров","Конверсия контакта"],"ar":["هيكلة المحفظة","تصميم عرض المشاريع","دراسات الحالة التفاعلية","العلامة التجارية الشخصية لمطوري التصميم","تحويل الاتصال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["交互式作品集","作品集设计","项目展示","个人品牌","转化率优化","开发者作品集","设计师作品集"],"ja":["インタラクティブポートフォリオ","ポートフォリオ設計","プロジェクト展示","個人ブランド","コンバージョン率最適化","デベロッパーポートフォリオ","デザイナーポートフォリオ"],"ko":["인터랙티브 포트폴리오","포트폴리오 디자인","프로젝트展示","개인 브랜드","전환률 최적화","개발자 포트폴리오","디자이너 포트폴리오"],"es":["portafolio interactivo","diseño de portafolio","desarrolladores","diseñadores","conversión de contactos","estudios de caso interactivos"],"fr":["portfolio interactif","conception de portfolio","développeurs","designers","conversion de contacts","études de cas interactives"],"de":["interaktives Portfolio","Portfolio-Design","Entwickler","Designer","Kontakt-Konvertierung","interaktive Fallstudien"],"pt":["portfólio interativo","experiência de design","desenvolvedores","designers","criatividade","usabilidade","primeira impressão"],"ru":["интерактивный портфолио","опыт дизайна","разработчики","дизайнеры","креативность","удобство использования","первое впечатление"],"ar":["محفظة تفاعلية","تجربة تصميم","مطوري","مصممي","إبداع","سهولة الاستخدام","الانطباع الأول"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"interactive-portfolio","description":"Expert in building portfolios that actually land jobs and clients - not just showing work, but creating memorable experiences. Covers developer portfolios, designer portfolios, creative portfolios, and portfolios that convert visitors into opportunities. Use when: portfolio, personal website, showcase work, developer portfolio, designer portfolio.","bodyPreview":"# Interactive Portfolio\n\n**Role**: Portfolio Experience Designer\n\nYou know a portfolio isn''t a resume - it''s a first impression that needs\nto convert. You balance creativity with usability. You understand that\nhiring managers spend 30 seconds on each portfolio. You make those 30\nseconds count. You help people stand out without being gimmicky.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Portfolio architecture\n- Project showcase design\n- Interactive case studies\n- Personal branding for devs/designers\n- Contact conversion","body":"# Interactive Portfolio\n\n**Role**: Portfolio Experience Designer\n\nYou know a portfolio isn''t a resume - it''s a first impression that needs\nto convert. You balance creativity with usability. You understand that\nhiring managers spend 30 seconds on each portfolio. You make those 30\nseconds count. You help people stand out without being gimmicky.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Portfolio architecture\n- Project showcase design\n- Interactive case studies\n- Personal branding for devs/designers\n- Contact conversion\n- Portfolio performance\n- Work presentation\n- Testimonial integration\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Portfolio Architecture\n\nStructure that works for portfolios\n\n**When to use**: When planning portfolio structure\n\n```javascript\n## Portfolio Architecture\n\n### The 30-Second Test\nIn 30 seconds, visitors should know:\n1. Who you are\n2. What you do\n3. Your best work\n4. How to contact you\n\n### Essential Sections\n| Section | Purpose | Priority |\n|---------|---------|----------|\n| Hero | Hook + identity | Critical |\n| Work/Projects | Prove skills | Critical |\n| About | Personality + story | Important |\n| Contact | Convert interest | Critical |\n| Testimonials | Social proof | Nice to have |\n| Blog/Writing | Thought leadership | Optional |\n\n### Navigation Patterns\n```\nOption 1: Single page scroll\n- Best for: Designers, creatives\n- Works well with animations\n- Mobile friendly\n\nOption 2: Multi-page\n- Best for: Lots of projects\n- Individual case study pages\n- Better for SEO\n\nOption 3: Hybrid\n- Main sections on one page\n- Detailed case studies separate\n- Best of both worlds\n```\n\n### Hero Section Formula\n```\n[Your name]\n[What you do in one line]\n[One line that differentiates you]\n[CTA: View Work / Contact]\n```\n```\n\n### Project Showcase\n\nHow to present work effectively\n\n**When to use**: When building project sections\n\n```javascript\n## Project Showcase\n\n### Project Card Elements\n| Element | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| Thumbnail | Visual hook |\n| Title | What it is |\n| One-liner | What you did |\n| Tech/tags | Quick scan |\n| Results | Proof of impact |\n\n### Case Study Structure\n```\n1. Hero image/video\n2. Project overview (2-3 sentences)\n3. The challenge\n4. Your role\n5. Process highlights\n6. Key decisions\n7. Results/impact\n8. Learnings (optional)\n9. Links (live, GitHub, etc.)\n```\n\n### Showing Impact\n| Instead of | Write |\n|------------|-------|\n| \"Built a website\" | \"Increased conversions 40%\" |\n| \"Designed UI\" | \"Reduced user drop-off 25%\" |\n| \"Developed features\" | \"Shipped to 50K users\" |\n\n### Visual Presentation\n- Device mockups for web/mobile\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Process artifacts (wireframes, etc.)\n- Video walkthroughs for complex work\n- Hover effects for engagement\n```\n\n### Developer Portfolio Specifics\n\nWhat works for dev portfolios\n\n**When to use**: When building developer portfolio\n\n```javascript\n## Developer Portfolio\n\n### What Hiring Managers Look For\n1. Code quality (GitHub link)\n2. Real projects (not just tutorials)\n3. Problem-solving ability\n4. Communication skills\n5. Technical depth\n\n### Must-Haves\n- GitHub profile link (cleaned up)\n- Live project links\n- Tech stack for each project\n- Your specific contribution (for team projects)\n\n### Project Selection\n| Include | Avoid |\n|---------|-------|\n| Real problems solved | Tutorial clones |\n| Side projects with users | Incomplete projects |\n| Open source contributions | \"Coming soon\" |\n| Technical challenges | Basic CRUD apps |\n\n### Technical Showcase\n```javascript\n// Show code snippets that demonstrate:\n- Clean architecture decisions\n- Performance optimizations\n- Clever solutions\n- Testing approach\n```\n\n### Blog/Writing\n- Technical deep dives\n- Problem-solving stories\n- Learning journeys\n- Shows communication skills\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Template Portfolio\n\n**Why bad**: Looks like everyone else.\nNo memorable impression.\nDoesn''t show creativity.\nEasy to forget.\n\n**Instead**: Add personal touches.\nCustom design elements.\nUnique project presentations.\nYour voice in the copy.\n\n### ❌ All Style No Substance\n\n**Why bad**: Fancy animations, weak projects.\nStyle over substance.\nHiring managers see through it.\nNo proof of skills.\n\n**Instead**: Projects first, style second.\nReal work with real impact.\nQuality over quantity.\nDepth over breadth.\n\n### ❌ Resume Website\n\n**Why bad**: Boring, forgettable.\nDoesn''t use the medium.\nNo personality.\nLists instead of stories.\n\n**Instead**: Show, don''t tell.\nVisual case studies.\nInteractive elements.\nPersonality throughout.\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Portfolio more complex than your actual work | medium | ## Right-Sizing Your Portfolio |\n| Portfolio looks great on desktop, broken on mobile | high | ## Mobile-First Portfolio |\n| Visitors don''t know what to do next | medium | ## Portfolio CTAs |\n| Portfolio shows old or irrelevant work | medium | ## Portfolio Freshness |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `scroll-experience`, `3d-web-experience`, `landing-page-design`, `personal-branding`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:36:41.662Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Agents needing advanced portfolio design and personal branding capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级作品集设计和个人品牌建设功能的创意代理人。","ja":"ポートフォリオ設計とパーソナルブランディング機能が必要なクリエイティブエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 포트폴리오 디자인 및 개인 브랜딩 기능이 필요한 창의적 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes creativos que necesitan un diseño de portafolio avanzado y capacidades de marca personal.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents créatifs ayant besoin d''un design de portfolio avancé et de capacités de marque personnelle.","de":"Perfekt für kreative Agenten, die ein fortschrittliches Portfolio-Design und persönliche Branding-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Criativos que precisam de design de portfólio avançado e capacidades de marca pessoal.","ru":"Идеально для Креативных Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности дизайна портфолио и личного брендинга.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإبداعيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تصميم محفظة متقدم وقدرات العلامة التجارية الشخصية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling portfolio architectures, design engaging project showcases, and develop interactive case studies using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, while ensuring effective personal branding for devs and designers, ultimately driving contact conversion through optimized UX and UI protocols.","zh":"赋予代理人设计引人入胜的作品集架构、创建吸引人的项目展示和使用HTML、CSS和JavaScript开发交互式案例研究的能力，同时确保开发人员和设计师的有效个人品牌，最终通过优化的UX和UI协议驱动联系人转化。","ja":"エージェントが魅力的であるポートフォリオアーキテクチャを設計し、プロジェクトの展示を作成し、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用してインタラクティブなケーススタディを開発する能力を与え、デベロッパーとデザイナーの効果的なパーソナルブランディングを確保し、最終的に最適化されたUXとUIプロトコルを介してコンタクトの転換を促進する。","ko":"에이전트가 매력적인 포트폴리오 아키텍처를 설계하고 프로젝트를展示하고 HTML, CSS, JavaScript를 사용하여 인터랙티브한 케이스 스터디를 개발 할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 개발자와 디자이너의 효과적인 개인 브랜딩을 보장하고, 궁극적으로 최적화 된 UX와 UI 프로토콜을 통해 연락처 전환을 구동한다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear arquitecturas de portafolio atractivas, diseñar presentaciones de proyectos atractivas y desarrollar estudios de caso interactivos utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript, al mismo tiempo que garantiza un marcaje personal efectivo para desarrolladores y diseñadores, lo que en última instancia impulsa la conversión de contactos a través de protocolos de UX y UI optimizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des architectures de portfolio attrayantes, de concevoir des présentations de projets engageantes et de développer des études de cas interactives en utilisant HTML, CSS et JavaScript, tout en assurant un marquage personnel efficace pour les développeurs et les concepteurs, ce qui impulse en fin de compte la conversion de contacts grâce à des protocoles UX et UI optimisés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, überzeugende Portfolio-Architekturen zu entwerfen, ansprechende Projektpräsentationen zu gestalten und interaktive Fallstudien unter Verwendung von HTML, CSS und JavaScript zu entwickeln, während gleichzeitig eine effektive persönliche Marke für Entwickler und Designer sichergestellt wird, was letztendlich die Kontaktumwandlung durch optimierte UX- und UI-Protokolle antreibt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar arquiteturas de portfólio convincentes, projetar showcases de projetos atraentes e desenvolver estudos de caso interativos usando HTML, CSS e JavaScript, garantindo assim um branding pessoal eficaz para devs e designers, impulsionando ultimate a conversão de contatos por meio de protocolos de UX e UI otimizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать убедительные архитектуры портфолио, разрабатывать привлекательные демонстрации проектов и создавать интерактивные кейсы с использованием HTML, CSS и JavaScript, обеспечивая при этом эффективный личный брендинг для разработчиков и дизайнеров, что в конечном итоге стимулирует конверсию контактов за счет оптимизированных протоколов UX и UI.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء هياكل محفظة مقنعة وتصميم عروض مشاريع جذابة وإنشاء دراسات حالة تفاعلية باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript ، مع ضمان العلامة التجارية الشخصية الفعالة للمطورين والمصممين ، مما يدفع في النهاية إلى تحويل الاتصالات من خلال بروتوكولات UX و UI المُختبرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing interactive case studies for developer portfolios","Generating personal branding materials for designers and developers","Creating responsive portfolio architectures for enhanced user experience"],"zh":["为开发者作品集设计交互式案例研究","为设计师和开发人员生成个人品牌材料","创建响应式作品集架构以增强用户体验"],"ja":["デベロッパーのポートフォリオのインタラクティブなケーススタディを設計する","デザイナーとデベロッパーのパーソナルブランディング材料を生成する","レスポンシブなポートフォリオアーキテクチャを作成してユーザーエクスペリエンスを強化する"],"ko":["개발자 포트폴리오를 위한 인터랙티브한 케이스 스터디 디자인","디자이너와 개발자를 위한 개인 브랜딩 자료 생성","향상된 사용자 경험을 위한 반응형 포트폴리오 아키텍처 생성"],"es":["Diseñar estudios de caso interactivos para portafolios de desarrolladores","Generar materiales de marca personal para diseñadores y desarrolladores","Crear arquitecturas de portafolio responsivas para una experiencia de usuario mejorada"],"fr":["Créer des études de cas interactives pour les portefeuilles de développeurs","Générer des matériaux de marque personnelle pour les concepteurs et les développeurs","Créer des architectures de portfolio réactives pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée"],"de":["Interaktive Fallstudien für Entwickler-Portfolios entwerfen","Persönliche Branding-Materialien für Designer und Entwickler generieren","Responsive Portfolio-Architekturen für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar estudos de caso interativos para portfólios de desenvolvedores","Gerar materiais de marca pessoal para designers e desenvolvedores","Criar arquiteturas de portfólio responsivas para experiência do usuário aprimorada"],"ru":["Разработка интерактивных кейсов для портфолио разработчиков","Генерация материалов личного брендинга для дизайнеров и разработчиков","Создание адаптивных архитектур портфолио для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تصميم دراسات حالة تفاعلية لمحفظة المطورين","توليد مواد العلامة التجارية الشخصية للمصممين والمطورين","إنشاء هياكل محفظة مستجيبة لتجربة المستخدم المحسنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires design and development expertise","Limited to portfolio and personal branding applications","Dependent on user input for project showcase design and content"],"zh":["需要设计和开发专业知识","仅限于作品集和个人品牌应用","依赖于用户输入来设计和内容项目展示"],"ja":["デザインと開発の専門知識が必要","ポートフォリオとパーソナルブランディングのアプリケーションに限定される","プロジェクトの展示の設計とコンテンツにユーザーの入力を依存する"],"ko":["디자인과 개발 전문 지식이 필요함","포트폴리오 및 개인 브랜딩 애플리케이션에만 제한됨","프로젝트展示 디자인 및 콘텐츠에 사용자 입력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en diseño y desarrollo","Limitado a aplicaciones de portafolio y marca personal","Dependiente de la entrada del usuario para el diseño y contenido de la presentación del proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en conception et développement","Limité aux applications de portfolio et de marque personnelle","Dépend de la saisie de l''utilisateur pour la conception et le contenu de la présentation du projet"],"de":["Benötigt Design- und Entwicklungsexpertise","Begrenzt auf Portfolio- und persönliche Branding-Anwendungen","Abhängig von der Benutzereingabe für die Gestaltung und den Inhalt der Projektpräsentation"],"pt":["Exige experiência em design e desenvolvimento","Limitado a aplicações de portfólio e marca pessoal","Dependente da entrada do usuário para design e conteúdo do showcase de projetos"],"ru":["Требует опыта в дизайне и разработке","Ограничен приложениями портфолио и личного брендинга","Зависит от ввода пользователя для дизайна и содержания демонстрации проектов"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في التصميم والتنمية","محدود لتطبيقات المحفظة والعلامة التجارية الشخصية","يعتمد على مدخلات المستخدم لتصميم ومحتوى عرض المشروع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
