backend .NET pour développer des API et des serveurs de production avec C# et les meilleures pratiques modernes","de":"Meistern Sie .NET-Backend-Muster, um Produktions-APIs und -Server mit C# und modernen Best Practices zu entwickeln","pt":"Domine padrões de desenvolvimento backend .NET para construir APIs de produção e servidores MCP com as melhores práticas modernas.","ru":"Освойте шаблоны разработки бэкенда .NET для создания производственных API и серверов MCP с современными лучшими практиками.","ar":"استخدم أنماط تطوير الخلفية .NET لبناء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات وخادم الإنتاج مع أفضل الممارسات الحديثة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":[".NET Web API","MCP ","Dependency Injection","Redis","EF Core/Dapper"],"ja":[".NET Web API","MCP","Dependency Injection","Redis","EF Core/Dapper"],"ko":[".NET Web API","MCP ","Dependency Injection","Redis","EF Core/Dapper"],"es":["Desarrollo de APIs y servidores de producción con C#","Inyección de dependencias y arquitecturas de servicios","Estrategias de caché con Redis","Pruebas unitarias e integradas","Optimización de acceso a bases de datos con EF Core o Dapper","Configuración de servidores y APIs"],"fr":["Développement d''API et de serveurs de production avec C#","Injection de dépendances et architectures de services","Stratégies de cache avec Redis","Tests unitaires et d''intégration","Optimisation de l''accès aux bases de données avec EF Core ou Dapper","Configuration de serveurs et d''API"],"de":["Entwicklung von Produktions-APIs und -Servern mit C#","Dependency Injection und Service-Architekturen","Caching-Strategien mit Redis","Unit- und Integrations-Tests","Optimierung des Datenbankzugriffs mit EF Core oder Dapper","Konfiguration von Servern und APIs"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de APIs Web .NET","Revisão de código C# para qualidade e desempenho","Arquitetura de serviço com injeção de dependência","Estratégias de cache com Redis","Testes unitários e de integração","Otimização do acesso ao banco de dados com EF Core ou Dapper"],"ru":["Разработка веб-API .NET","Проверка кода C# на качество и производительность","Сервисная архитектура с внедрением зависимостей","Стратегии кэширования с Redis","Юнит-тесты и интеграционные тесты","Оптимизация доступа к базе данных с EF Core или Dapper"],"ar":["تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات Web .NET","مراجعة код C# لجودة الأداء","هندسة الخدمة مع الحقن التبعي","استراتيجيات التخزين المؤقت مع Redis","اختبارات الوحدة واختبارات التكامل","تحسين الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات مع EF Core أو Dapper"]},"keywords":{"zh":[".NET",".NET Web API","MCP","C#",".NET ","Dependency Injection","Redis","EF Core","Dapper"],"ja":[".NET",".NET Web API","MCP","C#",".NET ","Dependency Injection","Redis","EF Core","Dapper"],"ko":[".NET",".NET Web API","MCP","C#",".NET ","Dependency Injection","Redis","EF Core","Dapper"],"es":["patrones de backend .NET","desarrollo de APIs","servidores de producción","C#","inyección de dependencias","caché con Redis","pruebas unitarias","optimización de bases de datos","EF Core","Dapper"],"fr":["modèles de backend .NET","développement d''API","serveurs de production","C#","injection de dépendances","cache avec Redis","tests unitaires","optimisation des bases de données","EF Core","Dapper"],"de":[".NET-Backend-Muster","Entwicklung von APIs","Produktions-Server","C#","Dependency Injection","Caching mit Redis","Unit-Tests","Optimierung von Datenbanken","EF Core","Dapper"],"pt":["padrões de desenvolvimento backend .NET","desenvolvimento de APIs .NET","C#","injeção de dependência","Redis","testes unitários","EF Core","Dapper","otimização de banco de dados"],"ru":["шаблоны разработки бэкенда .NET","разработка API .NET","C#","внедрение зависимостей","Redis","юнит-тесты","EF Core","Dapper","оптимизация базы данных"],"ar":["نماذج تطوير الخلفية .NET","تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات .NET","C#","الحقن التبعي","Redis","اختبارات الوحدة","EF Core","Dapper","تحسين قاعدة البيانات"]}},"owner":"aq-uua","repo":"APPSECURITY2ASSN","repoPath":"aq-uua/APPSECURITY2ASSN","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-backend-patterns","description":"Master C#/.NET backend development patterns for building robust APIs, MCP servers, and enterprise applications. Covers async/await, dependency injection, Entity Framework Core, Dapper, configuration, caching, and testing with xUnit. Use when developing .NET backends, reviewing C# code, or designing API architectures.","bodyPreview":"# .NET Backend Development Patterns\n\nMaster C#/.NET patterns for building production-grade APIs, MCP servers, and enterprise backends with modern best practices (2024/2025).\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Developing new .NET Web APIs or MCP servers\n- Reviewing C# code for quality and performance\n- Designing service architectures with dependency injection\n- Implementing caching strategies with Redis\n- Writing unit and integration tests\n- Optimizing database access with EF Core or Dapper\n- Configuring","body":"# .NET Backend Development Patterns\n\nMaster C#/.NET patterns for building production-grade APIs, MCP servers, and enterprise backends with modern best practices (2024/2025).\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Developing new .NET Web APIs or MCP servers\n- Reviewing C# code for quality and performance\n- Designing service architectures with dependency injection\n- Implementing caching strategies with Redis\n- Writing unit and integration tests\n- Optimizing database access with EF Core or Dapper\n- Configuring applications with IOptions pattern\n- Handling errors and implementing resilience patterns\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The project is not using .NET or C#\n- You only need frontend or client guidance\n- The task is unrelated to backend architecture\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Define architecture boundaries, modules, and layering.\n- Apply DI, async patterns, and resilience strategies.\n- Validate data access performance and caching.\n- Add tests and observability for critical flows.\n- If detailed patterns are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed .NET patterns and examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:38:19.766Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for C# Agents needing advanced .NET backend development patterns for building production-grade APIs and enterprise backends","zh":"适用于需要高级 .NET 后端开发模式的 C# 代理，用于构建生产级 API 和企业后端","ja":"C# エージェントが高度な .NET バックエンド開発パターンを必要とする場合に適しています。生産レベルの API とエンタープライズ バックエンドを構築するために","ko":"고급 .NET 백엔드 개발 패턴이 필요한 C# 에이전트에 적합합니다. 프로덕션급 API 및 엔터프라이즈 백엔드를 구축하는 데 사용","es":"Perfecto para agentes de C# que necesitan patrones de desarrollo de backend avanzados de .NET para construir APIs y backend de nivel de producción","fr":"Parfait pour les agents C# ayant besoin de modèles de développement de backend .NET avancés pour construire des API et des backend d''entreprise de niveau de production","de":"Perfekt für C#-Agenten, die fortgeschrittene .NET-Backend-Entwicklungsmuster für den Bau von Produktions-Grade-APIs und Unternehmens-Backends benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes C# que precisam de padrões avançados de desenvolvimento de backend .NET para construir APIs e backends de produção de classe empresarial","ru":"Идеально для агентов C#, которым требуются продвинутые шаблоны разработки бэкенда .NET для создания производственных API и корпоративных бэкендов","ar":"مثالي لعميل C# الذي يحتاج إلى أنماط متقدمة لتنمية الخلفية .NET لإنشاء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات وضخمة الأعمال من الدرجة الأولى"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design service architectures with dependency injection, implement caching strategies with Redis, and optimize database access with EF Core or Dapper, leveraging modern best practices and C#/.NET patterns","zh":"赋予代理设计服务架构的能力，使用依赖注入，实现 Redis 的缓存策略，并使用 EF Core 或 Dapper 优化数据库访问，利用现代最佳实践和 C#/.NET 模式","ja":"エージェントがサービスアーキテクチャを設計する能力を与え、依存性の注入を使用し、Redis のキャッシュ戦略を実装し、EF Core または Dapper を使用してデータベースアクセスを最適化する、モダンなベストプラクティスと C#/.NET パターンを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 서비스 아키텍처를 설계할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 의존성 주입을 사용하고 Redis의 캐싱 전략을 구현하며 EF Core 또는 Dapper를 사용하여 데이터베이스 액세스를 최적화하여 현대적인 모범 사례와 C#/.NET 패턴을 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar arquitecturas de servicio con inyección de dependencias, implementar estrategias de caché con Redis y optimizar el acceso a la base de datos con EF Core o Dapper, aprovechando las mejores prácticas y patrones modernos de C#/.NET","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des architectures de service avec injection de dépendances, de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de mise en cache avec Redis et d''optimiser l''accès à la base de données avec EF Core ou Dapper, en exploitant les meilleures pratiques et les modèles modernes de C#/.NET","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Service-Architekturen mit Abhängigkeitsinjektion zu entwerfen, Cachestrategien mit Redis umzusetzen und den Datenbankzugriff mit EF Core oder Dapper zu optimieren, indem moderne Best Practices und C#/.NET-Muster genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar arquiteturas de serviço com injeção de dependência, implementar estratégias de cache com Redis e otimizar o acesso ao banco de dados com EF Core ou Dapper, aproveitando as melhores práticas e padrões modernos de C#/.NET","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать сервисные архитектуры с внедрением зависимостей, реализовывать стратегии кэширования с Redis и оптимизировать доступ к базе данных с помощью EF Core или Dapper, используя современные лучшие практики и шаблоны C#/.NET","ar":"يمكن للعميل تصميم هندسة الخدمة مع حقن التبعية، وتنفيذ استراتيجيات التخزين المؤقت مع Redis، وتنظيم الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات مع EF Core أو Dapper، واستخدام أفضل الممارسات والأنمطة الحديثة ل C#/.NET"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing new .NET Web APIs or MCP servers with quality and performance in mind","Reviewing C# code for adherence to best practices and optimizing performance","Implementing unit and integration tests for .NET backend applications"],"zh":["使用质量和性能作为考虑因素开发新的 .NET Web API 或 MCP 服务器","审查 C# 代码以确保遵循最佳实践并优化性能","为 .NET 后端应用程序实现单元测试和集成测试"],"ja":["品質とパフォーマンスを考慮して新しい .NET Web API または MCP サーバーを開発する","C# コードをレビューしてベストプラクティスに従っており、パフォーマンスを最適化する",".NET バックエンドアプリケーションに対してユニットテストと統合テストを実装する"],"ko":["품질과 성능을 고려하여 새로운 .NET 웹 API 또는 MCP 서버를 개발","C# 코드를 검토하여 모범 사례를 따르고 성능을 최적화",".NET 백엔드 애플리케이션에 대한 단위 테스트와 통합 테스트를 구현"],"es":["Desarrollar nuevos Web APIs o servidores MCP de .NET con calidad y rendimiento en mente","Revisar el código C# para garantizar el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas y optimizar el rendimiento","Implementar pruebas unitarias e de integración para aplicaciones de backend de .NET"],"fr":["Développer de nouvelles Web API ou des serveurs MCP .NET avec qualité et performance en tête","Examiner le code C# pour s''assurer du respect des meilleures pratiques et optimiser les performances","Mettre en œuvre des tests unitaires et d''intégration pour les applications de backend .NET"],"de":["Entwicklung neuer .NET-Web-APIs oder MCP-Server mit Qualität und Leistung im Blick","Überprüfung des C#-Codes auf Einhaltung der Best Practices und Leistungsoptimierung","Implementierung von Einheits- und Integrations-tests für .NET-Backend-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Desenvolver novas APIs Web .NET ou servidores MCP com qualidade e desempenho em mente","Revisar o código C# para aderência às melhores práticas e otimizar o desempenho","Implementar testes unitários e de integração para aplicativos de backend .NET"],"ru":["Разрабатывать новые веб-API .NET или серверы MCP с учетом качества и производительности","Проверять код C# на соответствие лучшим практикам и оптимизировать производительность","Реализовывать модульные и интеграционные тесты для приложений бэкенда .NET"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الجديدة أو خوادم MCP مع جودة وأداء في الاعتبار","مراجعة رمز C# لالتزام بأفضل الممارسات وتنظيم الأداء","تنفيذ الاختبارات الموحدة وتكامل للتطبيقات الخلفية .NET"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET framework knowledge","C# programming language required","Focused on .NET backend development patterns, not frontend or full-stack development"],"zh":[".NET 框架知识是必需的","需要 C# 编程语言","专注于 .NET 后端开发模式，不是前端或全栈开发"],"ja":[".NET フレームワークの知識が必要","C# プログラミング言語が必要",".NET バックエンド開発パターンに焦点を当てており、フロントエンドやフルスタック開発ではありません"],"ko":[".NET 프레임워크 지식이 필요","C# 프로그래밍 언어가 필요",".NET 백엔드 개발 패턴에 중점을 두고 있으며, 프론트엔드 또는 풀스택 개발이 아님"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del marco .NET","Se requiere el lenguaje de programación C#","Se centra en patrones de desarrollo de backend de .NET, no en desarrollo frontend o full-stack"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur le framework .NET","Le langage de programmation C# est requis","Se concentre sur les modèles de développement de backend .NET, et non sur le développement frontend ou full-stack"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des .NET-Frameworks","Die Programmiersprache C# ist erforderlich","Konzentriert sich auf .NET-Backend-Entwicklungsmuster, nicht auf Frontend- oder Full-Stack-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento do framework .NET","Linguagem de programação C# necessária","Focado em padrões de desenvolvimento de backend .NET, não em desenvolvimento frontend ou full-stack"],"ru":["Требуется знание фреймворка .NET","Требуется язык программирования C#","Фокусируется на шаблонах разработки бэкенда .NET, а не на разработке frontend или full-stack"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة الإطار .NET","مطلوب لغة البرمجة C#","يركز على أنماط تطبيق الخلفية .NET، وليس على تطبيق الواجهة أو تطبيق الكل في الكل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('wichops/racha/new', 'community', 'wichops', 'racha', 'wichops/racha', 'new', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z', '2026-02-18T09:38:22.100Z', NULL, '{"id":"wichops/racha/new","name":"new","description":{"zh":"Railway 项目创建与部署工具，支持快速创建和部署项目、服务和数据库","ja":"Railway プロジェクトの作成とデプロイツール、プロジェクト、サービス、データベースの迅速な作成とデプロイをサポート","ko":"Railway 프로젝트 생성 및 배포 도구, 프로젝트, 서비스, 데이터베이스의 빠른 생성 및 배포를 지원","es":"Railway es una plataforma para crear y desplegar proyectos, servicios y bases de datos con facilidad. Crea aplicaciones web y API con configuración adecuada","fr":"Railway est une plateforme pour créer et déployer des projets, des services et des bases de données avec facilité. Créez des applications web et des API avec une configuration appropriée","de":"Railway ist eine Plattform zum Erstellen und Bereitstellen von Projekten, Diensten und Datenbanken mit Leichtigkeit. Erstellen Sie Webanwendungen und APIs mit richtiger Konfiguration","pt":"Crie projetos, serviços e bancos de dados Railway com configuração adequada para desenvolvedores. Inicie novos projetos e serviços com facilidade","ru":"Создайте проекты, сервисы и базы данных Railway с правильной конфигурацией для разработчиков. Инициализируйте новые проекты и сервисы с легкостью","ar":"أنشئ مشاريع وخدمات وقواعد بيانات Railway مع تكوين مناسب للمطوّرين. ابدأ مشاريع وخدمات جديدة بسهولة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Railway 项目创建与部署","ja":"Railway プロジェクトの作成とデプロイ","ko":"Railway 프로젝트 생성 및 배포","es":"Crear Proyectos y Servicios en Railway","fr":"Créer des Projets et des Services sur Railway","de":"Erstellen von Projekten und Diensten in Railway","pt":"Crie Projetos Railway com Configuração Apropriada","ru":"Создайте Проекты Railway с Правильной Конфигурацией","ar":"أنشئ مشاريع Railway مع تكوين مناسب","en":"new"},"description":{"zh":"Railway 项目创建与部署工具，支持快速创建和部署项目、服务和数据库","ja":"Railway プロジェクトの作成とデプロイツール、プロジェクト、サービス、データベースの迅速な作成とデプロイをサポート","ko":"Railway 프로젝트 생성 및 배포 도구, 프로젝트, 서비스, 데이터베이스의 빠른 생성 및 배포를 지원","es":"Railway es una plataforma para crear y desplegar proyectos, servicios y bases de datos con facilidad. Crea aplicaciones web y API con configuración adecuada","fr":"Railway est une plateforme pour créer et déployer des projets, des services et des bases de données avec facilité. Créez des applications web et des API avec...","de":"Railway ist eine Plattform zum Erstellen und Bereitstellen von Projekten, Diensten und Datenbanken mit Leichtigkeit. Erstellen Sie Webanwendungen und APIs mi...","pt":"Crie projetos, serviços e bancos de dados Railway com configuração adequada para desenvolvedores. Inicie novos projetos e serviços com facilidade","ru":"Создайте проекты, сервисы и базы данных Railway с правильной конфигурацией для разработчиков. Инициализируйте новые проекты и сервисы с легкостью","ar":"أنشئ مشاريع وخدمات وقواعد بيانات Railway مع تكوين مناسب للمطوّرين. ابدأ مشاريع وخدمات جديدة بسهولة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速创建项目","支持服务和数据库的创建","实现快速部署","支持多种开发框架","提供灵活的配置选项"],"ja":["プロジェクトの迅速な作成","サービスとデータベースの作成をサポート","迅速なデプロイを実現","多種の開発フレームワークをサポート","柔軟な設定オプションを提供"],"ko":["프로젝트의 빠른 생성","서비스와 데이터베이스의 생성을 지원","빠른 배포를 실현","다양한 개발 프레임워크를 지원","유연한 설정 옵션을 제공"],"es":["Creación de proyectos y servicios","Despliegue de aplicaciones web y API","Configuración adecuada para proyectos y servicios","Integración con bases de datos","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación","Facilidad de uso y despliegue"],"fr":["Création de projets et de services","Déploiement d''applications web et d''API","Configuration appropriée pour les projets et les services","Intégration avec des bases de données","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation","Facilité d''utilisation et de déploiement"],"de":["Erstellung von Projekten und Diensten","Bereitstellung von Webanwendungen und APIs","Richtige Konfiguration für Projekte und Dienste","Integration mit Datenbanken","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Criação de projetos Railway","Configuração de serviços","Inicialização de bancos de dados","Integração com plataformas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a linguagens de programação variadas","Facilidade de deploy"],"ru":["Создание проектов Railway","Конфигурация сервисов","Инициализация баз данных","Интеграция с платформами разработки","Поддержка различных языков программирования","Легкость развертывания"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاريع Railway","تكوين الخدمات","初期 бросة قواعد البيانات","التكامل مع منصات التطوير","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة","سهولة التPLOY"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Railway 项目创建","Railway 项目部署","快速开发","快速部署","项目管理","服务管理","数据库管理"],"ja":["Railway プロジェクトの作成","Railway プロジェクトのデプロイ","迅速な開発","迅速なデプロイ","プロジェクト管理","サービス管理","データベース管理"],"ko":["Railway 프로젝트 생성","Railway 프로젝트 배포","빠른 개발","빠른 배포","프로젝트 관리","서비스 관리","데이터베이스 관리"],"es":["Railway","creación de proyectos","despliegue de aplicaciones","configuración de proyectos","integración con bases de datos","desarrollo web","API","lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["Railway","création de projets","déploiement d''applications","configuration de projets","intégration avec des bases de données","développement web","API","langages de programmation"],"de":["Railway","Erstellung von Projekten","Bereitstellung von Webanwendungen","Konfiguration von Projekten","Integration mit Datenbanken","Webentwicklung","API","Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Railway","projetos","serviços","bancos de dados","desenvolvimento","configuração","deploy","linguagens de programação","plataformas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Railway","проекты","сервисы","базы данных","разработка","конфигурация","развертывание","языки программирования","платформы разработки"],"ar":["Railway","مشاريع","خدمات","قواعد البيانات","التطوير","التكوين","النشر","لغات البرمجة","منصات التطوير"]}},"owner":"wichops","repo":"racha","repoPath":"wichops/racha","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"new","description":"This skill should be used when the user says setup, deploy to railway, initialize, create project, create service, or wants to deploy from GitHub. Handles initial setup AND adding services to existing projects. For databases, use the database skill instead.","bodyPreview":"# New Project / Service / Database\n\nCreate Railway projects, services, and databases with proper configuration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User says \"deploy to railway\" (add service if linked, init if not)\n- User says \"create a railway project\", \"init\", \"new project\" (explicit new project)\n- User says \"link to railway\", \"connect to railway\"\n- User says \"create a service\", \"add a backend\", \"new api service\"\n- User says \"create a vite app\", \"create a react website\", \"make a python api\"\n- User says \"deploy","body":"# New Project / Service / Database\n\nCreate Railway projects, services, and databases with proper configuration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User says \"deploy to railway\" (add service if linked, init if not)\n- User says \"create a railway project\", \"init\", \"new project\" (explicit new project)\n- User says \"link to railway\", \"connect to railway\"\n- User says \"create a service\", \"add a backend\", \"new api service\"\n- User says \"create a vite app\", \"create a react website\", \"make a python api\"\n- User says \"deploy from github.com/user/repo\", \"create service from this repo\"\n- User says \"add postgres\", \"add a database\", \"add redis\", \"add mysql\", \"add mongo\"\n- User says \"connect to postgres\", \"wire up the database\", \"connect my api to redis\"\n- User says \"add postgres and connect to the server\"\n- Setting up code + Railway service together\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck CLI installed:\n\n```bash\ncommand -v railway\n```\n\nIf not installed:\n\n> Install Railway CLI:\n>\n> ```\n> npm install -g @railway/cli\n> ```\n>\n> or\n>\n> ```\n> brew install railway\n> ```\n\nCheck authenticated:\n\n```bash\nrailway whoami --json\n```\n\nIf not authenticated:\n\n> Run `railway login` to authenticate.\n\n## Decision Flow\n\n```\nrailway status --json (in current dir)\n     │\n┌────┴────┐\nLinked    Not Linked\n  │            │\n  │       Check parent: cd .. && railway status --json\n  │            │\n  │       ┌────┴────┐\n  │    Parent      Not linked\n  │    Linked      anywhere\n  │       │            │\n  │   Add service   railway list\n  │   Set rootDir      │\n  │   Deploy       ┌───┴───┐\n  │       │      Match?  No match\n  │       │        │        │\n  │       │      Link    Init new\n  └───────┴────────┴────────┘\n           │\n    User wants service?\n           │\n     ┌─────┴─────┐\n    Yes         No\n     │           │\nScaffold code   Done\n     │\nrailway add --service\n     │\nConfigure if needed\n     │\nReady to deploy\n```\n\n## Check Current State\n\n```bash\nrailway status --json\n```\n\n- **If linked**: Add a service to the existing project (see below)\n- **If not linked**: Check if a PARENT directory is linked (see below)\n\n### When Already Linked\n\n**Default behavior**: \"deploy to railway\" = add a service to the linked project.\n\nDo NOT create a new project unless user EXPLICITLY says:\n\n- \"new project\", \"create a project\", \"init a project\"\n- \"separate project\", \"different project\"\n\nApp names like \"flappy-bird\" or \"my-api\" are SERVICE names, not project names.\n\n```\nUser: \"create a vite app called foo and deploy to railway\"\nProject: Already linked to \"my-project\"\n\nWRONG: railway init -n foo\nRIGHT: railway add --service foo\n```\n\n### Parent Directory Linking\n\nRailway CLI walks up the directory tree to find a linked project. If you''re in a subdirectory:\n\n```bash\ncd .. && railway status --json\n```\n\n**If parent is linked**, you don''t need to init/link the subdirectory. Instead:\n\n1. Create service: `railway add --service <name>`\n2. Set `rootDirectory` to subdirectory path via environment skill\n3. Deploy from root: `railway up`\n\n**If no parent is linked**, proceed with init or link flow.\n\n## Init vs Link Decision\n\n**Skip this section if already linked** - just add a service instead.\n\nOnly use this section when NO project is linked (directly or via parent).\n\n### Check User''s Projects\n\nThe output can be large. Run in a subagent and extract only:\n- Project `id` and `name`\n- Workspace `id` and `name`\n\n```bash\nrailway list --json\n```\n\n### Decision Logic\n\n1. **User explicitly says \"new project\"** → Use `railway init`\n2. **User names an existing project** → Use `railway link`\n3. **Directory name matches existing project** → Ask: link existing or create new?\n4. **No matching projects** → Use `railway init`\n5. **Ambiguous** → Ask user\n\n## Create New Project\n\n```bash\nrailway init -n <name>\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n- `-n, --name` - Project name (auto-generated if omitted in non-interactive mode)\n- `-w, --workspace` - Workspace name or ID (required if multiple workspaces exist)\n\n### Multiple Workspaces\n\nIf the user has multiple workspaces, `railway init` requires the `--workspace` flag.\n\nGet workspace IDs from:\n\n```bash\nrailway whoami --json\n```\n\nThe `workspaces` array contains `{ id, name }` for each workspace.\n\n**Inferring workspace from user input:**\nIf user says \"deploy into xxx workspace\" or \"create project in my-team\", match the\nname against the workspaces array and use the corresponding ID:\n\n```bash\n# User says: \"create a project in my personal workspace\"\nrailway whoami --json | jq ''.workspaces[] | select(.name | test(\"personal\"; \"i\"))''\n# Use the matched ID: railway init -n myapp --workspace <matched-id>\n```\n\n## Link Existing Project\n\n```bash\nrailway link -p <project>\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n- `-p, --project` - Project name or ID\n- `-e, --environment` - Environment (default: production)\n- `-s, --service` - Service to link\n- `-t, --team` - Team/workspace\n\n## Create Service\n\nAfter project is linked, create a service:\n\n```bash\nrailway add --service <name>\n```\n\n**For GitHub repo sources**: Create an empty service, then invoke the `environment` skill to configure the source via staged changes API. Do NOT use `railway add --repo` - it requires GitHub app integration which often fails.\n\nFlow:\n\n1. `railway add --service my-api`\n2. Invoke `environment` skill to set `source.repo` and `source.branch`\n3. Apply changes to trigger deployment\n\n### Configure Based on Project Type\n\nReference [railpack.md](references/railpack.md) for build configuration.\nReference [monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md) for monorepo patterns.\n\n**Static site (Vite, CRA, Astro static):**\n\n- Railpack auto-detects common output dirs (dist, build)\n- If non-standard output dir: invoke `environment` skill to set `RAILPACK_STATIC_FILE_ROOT`\n- Do NOT use `railway variables` CLI - always use the environment skill\n\n**Node.js SSR (Next.js, Nuxt, Express):**\n\n- Verify `start` script exists in package.json\n- If custom start needed: invoke `environment` skill to set `startCommand`\n\n**Python (FastAPI, Django, Flask):**\n\n- Verify `requirements.txt` or `pyproject.toml` exists\n- Auto-detected by Railpack, usually no config needed\n\n**Go:**\n\n- Verify `go.mod` exists\n- Auto-detected, no config needed\n\n### Monorepo Configuration\n\n**Critical decision:** Root directory vs custom commands.\n\n**Isolated monorepo** (apps don''t share code):\n\n- Set Root Directory to the app''s subdirectory (e.g., `/frontend`)\n- Only that directory''s code is available during build\n\n**Shared monorepo** (TypeScript workspaces, shared packages):\n\n- Do NOT set root directory\n- Set custom build/start commands to filter the package:\n  - pnpm: `pnpm --filter <package> build`\n  - npm: `npm run build --workspace=packages/<package>`\n  - yarn: `yarn workspace <package> build`\n  - Turborepo: `turbo run build --filter=<package>`\n- Set watch paths to prevent unnecessary rebuilds\n\nSee [monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md) for detailed patterns.\n\n## Project Setup Guidance\n\nAnalyze the codebase to ensure Railway compatibility.\n\n### Analyze Codebase\n\nCheck for existing project files:\n\n- `package.json` → Node.js project\n- `requirements.txt`, `pyproject.toml` → Python project\n- `go.mod` → Go project\n- `Cargo.toml` → Rust project\n- `index.html` → Static site\n- None → Guide scaffolding\n\n**Monorepo detection:**\n\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml` → pnpm workspace (shared monorepo)\n- `package.json` with `workspaces` field → npm/yarn workspace (shared monorepo)\n- `turbo.json` → Turborepo (shared monorepo)\n- Multiple subdirs with separate `package.json` but no workspace config → isolated monorepo\n\n### Scaffolding Hints\n\nIf no code exists, suggest minimal patterns from [railpack.md](references/railpack.md):\n\n**Static site:**\n\n> Create an `index.html` file in the root directory.\n\n**Vite React:**\n\n```bash\nnpm create vite@latest . -- --template react\n```\n\n**Astro:**\n\n```bash\nnpm create astro@latest\n```\n\n**Python FastAPI:**\n\n> Create `main.py` with FastAPI app and `requirements.txt` with dependencies.\n\n**Go:**\n\n> Create `main.go` with HTTP server listening on `PORT` env var.\n\n## Databases\n\nFor adding databases (Postgres, Redis, MySQL, MongoDB), use the `database` skill.\n\nThe `database` skill handles:\n- Creating database services\n- Connection variable references\n- Wiring services to databases\n\n## Composability\n\n- **After service created**: Use `deploy` skill to push code\n- **For advanced config**: Use `environment` skill (buildCommand, startCommand)\n- **For domains**: Use `domain` skill\n- **For status checks**: Use `status` skill\n- **For service operations** (rename, delete, status): Use `service` skill\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### CLI Not Installed\n\n```\nRailway CLI not installed. Install with:\n  npm install -g @railway/cli\nor\n  brew install railway\n```\n\n### Not Authenticated\n\n```\nNot logged in to Railway. Run: railway login\n```\n\n### No Workspaces\n\n```\nNo workspaces found. Create one at railway.com or verify authentication.\n```\n\n### Project Name Taken\n\n```\nProject name already exists. Either:\n- Link to existing: railway link -p <name>\n- Use different name: railway init -n <other-name>\n```\n\n### Service Name Taken\n\n```\nService name already exists in this project. Use a different name:\n  railway add --service <other-name>\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Create HTML Static Site\n\n```\nUser: \"create a simple html site and deploy to railway\"\n\n1. Check status → not linked\n2. railway init -n my-site\n3. Guide: create index.html\n4. railway add --service my-site\n5. No config needed (index.html in root auto-detected)\n6. Use deploy skill: railway up\n7. Use domain skill for public URL\n```\n\n### Create Vite React Service\n\n```\nUser: \"create a vite react service\"\n\n1. Check status → linked (or init/link first)\n2. Scaffold: npm create vite@latest frontend -- --template react\n3. railway add --service frontend\n4. No config needed (Vite dist output auto-detected)\n5. Use deploy skill: railway up\n```\n\n### Add Python API to Project\n\n```\nUser: \"add a python api to my project\"\n\n1. Check status → linked\n2. Guide: create main.py with FastAPI, requirements.txt\n3. railway add --service api\n4. No config needed (FastAPI auto-detected)\n5. Use deploy skill\n```\n\n### Link and Add Service\n\n```\nUser: \"connect to my backend project and add a worker service\"\n\n1. railway list --json → find \"backend\"\n2. railway link -p backend\n3. railway add --service worker\n4. Guide setup based on worker type\n```\n\n### Deploy to Railway (Ambiguous)\n\n```\nUser: \"deploy to railway\"\n\n1. railway status → not linked\n2. railway list → has projects\n3. Directory is \"my-app\", found project \"my-app\"\n4. Ask: \"Found existing project ''my-app''. Link to it or create new?\"\n5. User: \"link\"\n6. railway link -p my-app\n7. Ask: \"Create a service for this code?\"\n```\n\n### Add Service to Isolated Monorepo\n\n```\nUser: \"create a static site in the frontend directory\"\n\n1. Check: /frontend has its own package.json, no workspace config\n2. This is isolated monorepo → use root directory\n3. railway add --service frontend\n4. Invoke environment skill to set rootDirectory: /frontend\n5. Set watch paths: /frontend/**\n```\n\n### Add Service to TypeScript Monorepo\n\n```\nUser: \"add a new api package to this turborepo\"\n\n1. Check: turbo.json exists, pnpm-workspace.yaml exists\n2. This is shared monorepo → use custom commands, NOT root directory\n3. Guide: create packages/api with package.json\n4. railway add --service api\n5. Invoke environment skill to set buildCommand and startCommand (do NOT set rootDirectory)\n6. Set watch paths: /packages/api/**, /packages/shared/**\n```\n\n### Deploy Existing pnpm Workspace Package\n\n```\nUser: \"deploy the backend package to railway\"\n\n1. Check: pnpm-workspace.yaml exists → shared monorepo\n2. railway add --service backend\n3. Invoke environment skill to set buildCommand and startCommand\n4. Set watch paths for backend + any shared deps\n```\n\n### Deploy Subdirectory of Linked Project\n\n```\nUser: \"create a vite app in my-app directory and deploy to railway\"\nCWD: ~/projects/my-project/my-app (parent already linked to \"my-project\")\n\n1. Check status in my-app → not linked\n2. Check parent: cd .. && railway status → IS linked to \"my-project\"\n3. DON''T init/link the subdirectory\n4. Scaffold: bun create vite my-app --template react-ts\n5. cd my-app && bun install\n6. railway add --service my-app\n7. Invoke environment skill to set rootDirectory: /my-app\n8. Deploy from root: railway up\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:38:22.100Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Deployment Agents needing streamlined project initialization and service configuration on Railway.","zh":"适合需要在 Railway 上简化项目初始化和服务配置的部署代理。","ja":"Railway でプロジェクトの初期化とサービス構成をストリームライン化する必要があるデプロイ エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Railway에서 프로젝트 초기화 및 서비스 구성이 간소화된 배포 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de implementación que necesitan una inicialización de proyecto y configuración de servicio simplificadas en Railway.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de déploiement ayant besoin d''une initialisation de projet et d''une configuration de service rationalisées sur Railway.","de":"Perfekt für Deployment-Agents, die eine strukturierte Projektinitialisierung und Dienstkonfiguration auf Railway benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Implantação que necessitam de inicialização de projeto e configuração de serviço simplificadas no Railway.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов развертывания, которым необходима упрощенная инициализация проектов и настройка сервисов на Railway.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإنشاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تبسيط 초기化 المشروع وتكوين الخدمة على سكة حديدية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create Railway projects, services, and databases with proper configuration, supporting protocols like init and deploy, and integrating with frameworks such as Vite and React.","zh":"赋予代理创建 Railway 项目、服务和数据库的能力，并支持 init 和 deploy 等协议，并与 Vite 和 React 等框架集成。","ja":"エージェントが Railway プロジェクト、サービス、データベースを作成し、init および deploy プロトコルをサポートし、Vite および React などのフレームワークと統合することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Railway 프로젝트, 서비스 및 데이터베이스를 생성하고 init 및 deploy 프로토콜을 지원하며 Vite 및 React와 같은 프레임워크와 통합할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear proyectos, servicios y bases de datos de Railway con una configuración adecuada, que admiten protocolos como init y deploy, e integran frameworks como Vite y React.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des projets, des services et des bases de données Railway avec une configuration appropriée, en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que init et deploy, et en intégrant des frameworks tels que Vite et React.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Railway-Projekte, -Dienste und -Datenbanken mit ordnungsgemäßer Konfiguration zu erstellen, die Protokolle wie init und deploy unterstützen und Frameworks wie Vite und React integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar projetos, serviços e bancos de dados do Railway com a configuração adequada, suportando protocolos como init e deploy, e integrando com estruturas como Vite e React.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать проекты, сервисы и базы данных Railway с правильной конфигурацией, поддерживая протоколы như init и deploy, и интегрируя с фреймворками таких как Vite и React.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من إنشاء مشاريع سكة حديدية وخدمات وقواعد بيانات مع تكوين مناسب، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل الإنشاء والنشر، وتكامل مع الهياكل مثل فيت ورياكت."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new Railway projects","Configuring services for backend deployment","Creating databases with optimized settings"],"zh":["初始化新的 Railway 项目","为后端部署配置服务","创建具有优化设置的数据库"],"ja":["新しい Railway プロジェクトの初期化","バックエンド デプロイ用のサービス構成","最適化された設定を使用したデータベースの作成"],"ko":["새로운 Railway 프로젝트 초기화","백엔드 배포를 위한 서비스 구성","최적화된 설정을 사용한 데이터베이스 생성"],"es":["Inicialización de nuevos proyectos de Railway","Configuración de servicios para la implementación de backend","Creación de bases de datos con ajustes optimizados"],"fr":["Initialisation de nouveaux projets Railway","Configuration de services pour le déploiement de backend","Création de bases de données avec des paramètres optimisés"],"de":["Initialisierung neuer Railway-Projekte","Konfiguration von Diensten für die Backend-Implementierung","Erstellung von Datenbanken mit optimierten Einstellungen"],"pt":["Inicialização de novos projetos Railway","Configuração de serviços para implantação de backend","Criação de bancos de dados com configurações otimizadas"],"ru":["Инициализация новых проектов Railway","Настройка сервисов для развертывания бэкенда","Создание баз данных с оптимизированными настройками"],"ar":["تشرين مشاريع سكة حديدية جديدة","تكوين الخدمات لنشر الخلفية","إنشاء قواعد بيانات مع إعدادات محسنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway account and project setup","Dependent on user input for project and service configuration"],"zh":["需要 Railway 账户和项目设置","依赖于用户输入来配置项目和服务"],"ja":["Railway アカウントとプロジェクト設定の必要性","プロジェクトおよびサービス構成のためにユーザー入力を依存"],"ko":["Railway 계정 및 프로젝트 설정 필요","프로젝트 및 서비스 구성에 대한 사용자 입력 의존"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y configuración de proyecto de Railway","Depende de la entrada del usuario para la configuración del proyecto y del servicio"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et une configuration de projet Railway","Dépend de la saisie de l''utilisateur pour la configuration du projet et du service"],"de":["Benötigt ein Railway-Konto und eine Projektkonfiguration","Hängt von der Benutzereingabe für die Projekt- und Dienstkonfiguration ab"],"pt":["Exige conta Railway e configuração de projeto","Dependente da entrada do usuário para configuração de projeto e serviço"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Railway и настройки проекта","Зависит от ввода пользователя для конфигурации проекта и сервиса"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب سكة حديدية وتشكيل مشروع","يعتمد على مدخلات المستخدم لتكوين المشروع والخدمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sethdavis512/quick-landing-page/new', 'community', 'sethdavis512', 'quick-landing-page', 'sethdavis512/quick-landing-page', 'new', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z', '2026-02-18T09:38:22.726Z', NULL, '{"id":"sethdavis512/quick-landing-page/new","name":"new","description":{"zh":"Turborepo Monorepo 解决方案集成了 Astro 登陆页、Hono 注册 API 和 Postgres 数据库，提供一站式开发服务","ja":"Turborepo モノレポ ソリューションは Astro ランディング ページ、Hono サインアップ API、Postgres データベースを統合し、一貫した開発サービスを提供","ko":"Turborepo Monorepo 솔루션은 Astro 랜딩 페이지, Hono 가입 API 및 Postgres 데이터베이스를 통합하여 일관된 개발 서비스를 제공","es":"Turborepo monorepo combina Astro landing pages, Hono signup API y Postgres para desplegar proyectos de Railway de manera eficiente.","fr":"Turborepo monorepo combine des pages d''accueil Astro, une API d''inscription Hono et Postgres pour déployer des projets Railway de manière efficace.","de":"Turborepo Monorepo kombiniert Astro-Landingpages, Hono-Signup-API und Postgres, um Railway-Projekte effizient bereitzustellen.","pt":"Turborepo monorepo com Astro landing pages, Hono signup API e Postgres para desenvolvedores","ru":"Turborepo монорепо с Astro landing pages, Hono signup API и Postgres для разработчиков","ar":"Turborepo مونوربو مع Astro landing pages و Hono signup API و Postgres لمطوري البرمجيات","en":"Turborepo monorepo: Astro landing pages + Hono signup API + Postgres"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Turborepo Monorepo 解决方案：Astro 登陆页 + Hono 注册 API + Postgres","ja":"Turborepo モノレポ ソリューション：Astro ランディング ページ + Hono サインアップ API...","ko":"Turborepo Monorepo 솔루션: Astro 랜딩 페이지 + Hono 가입 API + Post...","es":"Turborepo Monorepo: Despliegue de Páginas de Aterrizaje d...","fr":"Turborepo Monorepo: Déploiement de Pages d''Accueil Astro","de":"Turborepo Monorepo: Bereitstellung von Astro-Landingpages","pt":"Crie Projetos Turborepo com Astro e Hono","ru":"Создайте Проекты Turbo