icace de projets"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Astro-Landingpages","Hono-Signup-API","Integration mit Postgres","Konfiguration von Railway-Projekten","Erstellung von Diensten und Datenbanken","Effiziente Bereitstellung von Projekten"],"pt":["Criação de projetos Turborepo com Astro","Integração com Hono signup API","Suporte a Postgres","Desenvolvimento de landing pages","Criação de serviços de backend","Deploy em Railway"],"ru":["Создание проектов Turborepo с Astro","Интеграция с Hono signup API","Поддержка Postgres","Разработка landing pages","Создание сервисов backend","Развертывание на Railway"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاريع Turborepo مع Astro","التكامل مع Hono signup API","دعم Postgres","تطوير صفحات الهبوط","إنشاء خدمات خلفية","نشر على منصة Railway"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Turborepo Monorepo","Astro 登陆页","Hono 注册 API","Postgres 数据库","开发解决方案","一站式开发服务","开发流程简化","开发效率提高"],"ja":["Turborepo モノレポ","Astro ランディング ページ","Hono サインアップ API","Postgres データベース","開発ソリューション","一貫した開発サービス","開発プロセス簡素化","開発効率向上"],"ko":["Turborepo Monorepo","Astro 랜딩 페이지","Hono 가입 API","Postgres 데이터베이스","개발 솔루션","일관된 개발 서비스","개발 프로세스 간소화","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Turborepo monorepo","Astro landing pages","Hono signup API","Postgres","Railway proyectos","despliegue de proyectos","configuración de proyectos","creación de servicios","bases de datos"],"fr":["Turborepo monorepo","pages d''accueil Astro","API d''inscription Hono","Postgres","projets Railway","déploiement de projets","configuration de projets","création de services","bases de données"],"de":["Turborepo Monorepo","Astro-Landingpages","Hono-Signup-API","Postgres","Railway-Projekte","Bereitstellung von Projekten","Konfiguration von Projekten","Erstellung von Diensten","Datenbanken"],"pt":["Turborepo","Astro","Hono","Postgres","monorepo","landing pages","signup API","desenvolvimento de software","Railway"],"ru":["Turborepo","Astro","Hono","Postgres","монорепо","landing pages","signup API","разработка программного обеспечения","Railway"],"ar":["Turborepo","Astro","Hono","Postgres","مونوربو","صفحات الهبوط","signup API","تطوير البرمجيات","Railway"]}},"owner":"sethdavis512","repo":"quick-landing-page","repoPath":"sethdavis512/quick-landing-page","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"new","description":"This skill should be used when the user says setup, deploy to railway, initialize, create project, create service, or wants to deploy from GitHub. Handles initial setup AND adding services to existing projects. For databases, use the database skill instead.","bodyPreview":"# New Project / Service / Database\n\nCreate Railway projects, services, and databases with proper configuration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User says \"deploy to railway\" (add service if linked, init if not)\n- User says \"create a railway project\", \"init\", \"new project\" (explicit new project)\n- User says \"link to railway\", \"connect to railway\"\n- User says \"create a service\", \"add a backend\", \"new api service\"\n- User says \"create a vite app\", \"create a react website\", \"make a python api\"\n- User says \"deploy","body":"# New Project / Service / Database\n\nCreate Railway projects, services, and databases with proper configuration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User says \"deploy to railway\" (add service if linked, init if not)\n- User says \"create a railway project\", \"init\", \"new project\" (explicit new project)\n- User says \"link to railway\", \"connect to railway\"\n- User says \"create a service\", \"add a backend\", \"new api service\"\n- User says \"create a vite app\", \"create a react website\", \"make a python api\"\n- User says \"deploy from github.com/user/repo\", \"create service from this repo\"\n- User says \"add postgres\", \"add a database\", \"add redis\", \"add mysql\", \"add mongo\"\n- User says \"connect to postgres\", \"wire up the database\", \"connect my api to redis\"\n- User says \"add postgres and connect to the server\"\n- Setting up code + Railway service together\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck CLI installed:\n\n```bash\ncommand -v railway\n```\n\nIf not installed:\n\n> Install Railway CLI:\n>\n> ```\n> npm install -g @railway/cli\n> ```\n>\n> or\n>\n> ```\n> brew install railway\n> ```\n\nCheck authenticated:\n\n```bash\nrailway whoami --json\n```\n\nIf not authenticated:\n\n> Run `railway login` to authenticate.\n\n## Decision Flow\n\n```\nrailway status --json (in current dir)\n     │\n┌────┴────┐\nLinked    Not Linked\n  │            │\n  │       Check parent: cd .. && railway status --json\n  │            │\n  │       ┌────┴────┐\n  │    Parent      Not linked\n  │    Linked      anywhere\n  │       │            │\n  │   Add service   railway list\n  │   Set rootDir      │\n  │   Deploy       ┌───┴───┐\n  │       │      Match?  No match\n  │       │        │        │\n  │       │      Link    Init new\n  └───────┴────────┴────────┘\n           │\n    User wants service?\n           │\n     ┌─────┴─────┐\n    Yes         No\n     │           │\nScaffold code   Done\n     │\nrailway add --service\n     │\nConfigure if needed\n     │\nReady to deploy\n```\n\n## Check Current State\n\n```bash\nrailway status --json\n```\n\n- **If linked**: Add a service to the existing project (see below)\n- **If not linked**: Check if a PARENT directory is linked (see below)\n\n### When Already Linked\n\n**Default behavior**: \"deploy to railway\" = add a service to the linked project.\n\nDo NOT create a new project unless user EXPLICITLY says:\n\n- \"new project\", \"create a project\", \"init a project\"\n- \"separate project\", \"different project\"\n\nApp names like \"flappy-bird\" or \"my-api\" are SERVICE names, not project names.\n\n```\nUser: \"create a vite app called foo and deploy to railway\"\nProject: Already linked to \"my-project\"\n\nWRONG: railway init -n foo\nRIGHT: railway add --service foo\n```\n\n### Parent Directory Linking\n\nRailway CLI walks up the directory tree to find a linked project. If you''re in a subdirectory:\n\n```bash\ncd .. && railway status --json\n```\n\n**If parent is linked**, you don''t need to init/link the subdirectory. Instead:\n\n1. Create service: `railway add --service <name>`\n2. Set `rootDirectory` to subdirectory path via environment skill\n3. Deploy from root: `railway up`\n\n**If no parent is linked**, proceed with init or link flow.\n\n## Init vs Link Decision\n\n**Skip this section if already linked** - just add a service instead.\n\nOnly use this section when NO project is linked (directly or via parent).\n\n### Check User''s Projects\n\nThe output can be large. Run in a subagent and extract only:\n- Project `id` and `name`\n- Workspace `id` and `name`\n\n```bash\nrailway list --json\n```\n\n### Decision Logic\n\n1. **User explicitly says \"new project\"** → Use `railway init`\n2. **User names an existing project** → Use `railway link`\n3. **Directory name matches existing project** → Ask: link existing or create new?\n4. **No matching projects** → Use `railway init`\n5. **Ambiguous** → Ask user\n\n## Create New Project\n\n```bash\nrailway init -n <name>\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n- `-n, --name` - Project name (auto-generated if omitted in non-interactive mode)\n- `-w, --workspace` - Workspace name or ID (required if multiple workspaces exist)\n\n### Multiple Workspaces\n\nIf the user has multiple workspaces, `railway init` requires the `--workspace` flag.\n\nGet workspace IDs from:\n\n```bash\nrailway whoami --json\n```\n\nThe `workspaces` array contains `{ id, name }` for each workspace.\n\n**Inferring workspace from user input:**\nIf user says \"deploy into xxx workspace\" or \"create project in my-team\", match the\nname against the workspaces array and use the corresponding ID:\n\n```bash\n# User says: \"create a project in my personal workspace\"\nrailway whoami --json | jq ''.workspaces[] | select(.name | test(\"personal\"; \"i\"))''\n# Use the matched ID: railway init -n myapp --workspace <matched-id>\n```\n\n## Link Existing Project\n\n```bash\nrailway link -p <project>\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n- `-p, --project` - Project name or ID\n- `-e, --environment` - Environment (default: production)\n- `-s, --service` - Service to link\n- `-t, --team` - Team/workspace\n\n## Create Service\n\nAfter project is linked, create a service:\n\n```bash\nrailway add --service <name>\n```\n\n**For GitHub repo sources**: Create an empty service, then invoke the `environment` skill to configure the source via staged changes API. Do NOT use `railway add --repo` - it requires GitHub app integration which often fails.\n\nFlow:\n\n1. `railway add --service my-api`\n2. Invoke `environment` skill to set `source.repo` and `source.branch`\n3. Apply changes to trigger deployment\n\n### Configure Based on Project Type\n\nReference [railpack.md](references/railpack.md) for build configuration.\nReference [monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md) for monorepo patterns.\n\n**Static site (Vite, CRA, Astro static):**\n\n- Railpack auto-detects common output dirs (dist, build)\n- If non-standard output dir: invoke `environment` skill to set `RAILPACK_STATIC_FILE_ROOT`\n- Do NOT use `railway variables` CLI - always use the environment skill\n\n**Node.js SSR (Next.js, Nuxt, Express):**\n\n- Verify `start` script exists in package.json\n- If custom start needed: invoke `environment` skill to set `startCommand`\n\n**Python (FastAPI, Django, Flask):**\n\n- Verify `requirements.txt` or `pyproject.toml` exists\n- Auto-detected by Railpack, usually no config needed\n\n**Go:**\n\n- Verify `go.mod` exists\n- Auto-detected, no config needed\n\n### Monorepo Configuration\n\n**Critical decision:** Root directory vs custom commands.\n\n**Isolated monorepo** (apps don''t share code):\n\n- Set Root Directory to the app''s subdirectory (e.g., `/frontend`)\n- Only that directory''s code is available during build\n\n**Shared monorepo** (TypeScript workspaces, shared packages):\n\n- Do NOT set root directory\n- Set custom build/start commands to filter the package:\n  - pnpm: `pnpm --filter <package> build`\n  - npm: `npm run build --workspace=packages/<package>`\n  - yarn: `yarn workspace <package> build`\n  - Turborepo: `turbo run build --filter=<package>`\n- Set watch paths to prevent unnecessary rebuilds\n\nSee [monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md) for detailed patterns.\n\n## Project Setup Guidance\n\nAnalyze the codebase to ensure Railway compatibility.\n\n### Analyze Codebase\n\nCheck for existing project files:\n\n- `package.json` → Node.js project\n- `requirements.txt`, `pyproject.toml` → Python project\n- `go.mod` → Go project\n- `Cargo.toml` → Rust project\n- `index.html` → Static site\n- None → Guide scaffolding\n\n**Monorepo detection:**\n\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml` → pnpm workspace (shared monorepo)\n- `package.json` with `workspaces` field → npm/yarn workspace (shared monorepo)\n- `turbo.json` → Turborepo (shared monorepo)\n- Multiple subdirs with separate `package.json` but no workspace config → isolated monorepo\n\n### Scaffolding Hints\n\nIf no code exists, suggest minimal patterns from [railpack.md](references/railpack.md):\n\n**Static site:**\n\n> Create an `index.html` file in the root directory.\n\n**Vite React:**\n\n```bash\nnpm create vite@latest . -- --template react\n```\n\n**Astro:**\n\n```bash\nnpm create astro@latest\n```\n\n**Python FastAPI:**\n\n> Create `main.py` with FastAPI app and `requirements.txt` with dependencies.\n\n**Go:**\n\n> Create `main.go` with HTTP server listening on `PORT` env var.\n\n## Databases\n\nFor adding databases (Postgres, Redis, MySQL, MongoDB), use the `database` skill.\n\nThe `database` skill handles:\n- Creating database services\n- Connection variable references\n- Wiring services to databases\n\n## Composability\n\n- **After service created**: Use `deploy` skill to push code\n- **For advanced config**: Use `environment` skill (buildCommand, startCommand)\n- **For domains**: Use `domain` skill\n- **For status checks**: Use `status` skill\n- **For service operations** (rename, delete, status): Use `service` skill\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### CLI Not Installed\n\n```\nRailway CLI not installed. Install with:\n  npm install -g @railway/cli\nor\n  brew install railway\n```\n\n### Not Authenticated\n\n```\nNot logged in to Railway. Run: railway login\n```\n\n### No Workspaces\n\n```\nNo workspaces found. Create one at railway.com or verify authentication.\n```\n\n### Project Name Taken\n\n```\nProject name already exists. Either:\n- Link to existing: railway link -p <name>\n- Use different name: railway init -n <other-name>\n```\n\n### Service Name Taken\n\n```\nService name already exists in this project. Use a different name:\n  railway add --service <other-name>\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Create HTML Static Site\n\n```\nUser: \"create a simple html site and deploy to railway\"\n\n1. Check status → not linked\n2. railway init -n my-site\n3. Guide: create index.html\n4. railway add --service my-site\n5. No config needed (index.html in root auto-detected)\n6. Use deploy skill: railway up\n7. Use domain skill for public URL\n```\n\n### Create Vite React Service\n\n```\nUser: \"create a vite react service\"\n\n1. Check status → linked (or init/link first)\n2. Scaffold: npm create vite@latest frontend -- --template react\n3. railway add --service frontend\n4. No config needed (Vite dist output auto-detected)\n5. Use deploy skill: railway up\n```\n\n### Add Python API to Project\n\n```\nUser: \"add a python api to my project\"\n\n1. Check status → linked\n2. Guide: create main.py with FastAPI, requirements.txt\n3. railway add --service api\n4. No config needed (FastAPI auto-detected)\n5. Use deploy skill\n```\n\n### Link and Add Service\n\n```\nUser: \"connect to my backend project and add a worker service\"\n\n1. railway list --json → find \"backend\"\n2. railway link -p backend\n3. railway add --service worker\n4. Guide setup based on worker type\n```\n\n### Deploy to Railway (Ambiguous)\n\n```\nUser: \"deploy to railway\"\n\n1. railway status → not linked\n2. railway list → has projects\n3. Directory is \"my-app\", found project \"my-app\"\n4. Ask: \"Found existing project ''my-app''. Link to it or create new?\"\n5. User: \"link\"\n6. railway link -p my-app\n7. Ask: \"Create a service for this code?\"\n```\n\n### Add Service to Isolated Monorepo\n\n```\nUser: \"create a static site in the frontend directory\"\n\n1. Check: /frontend has its own package.json, no workspace config\n2. This is isolated monorepo → use root directory\n3. railway add --service frontend\n4. Invoke environment skill to set rootDirectory: /frontend\n5. Set watch paths: /frontend/**\n```\n\n### Add Service to TypeScript Monorepo\n\n```\nUser: \"add a new api package to this turborepo\"\n\n1. Check: turbo.json exists, pnpm-workspace.yaml exists\n2. This is shared monorepo → use custom commands, NOT root directory\n3. Guide: create packages/api with package.json\n4. railway add --service api\n5. Invoke environment skill to set buildCommand and startCommand (do NOT set rootDirectory)\n6. Set watch paths: /packages/api/**, /packages/shared/**\n```\n\n### Deploy Existing pnpm Workspace Package\n\n```\nUser: \"deploy the backend package to railway\"\n\n1. Check: pnpm-workspace.yaml exists → shared monorepo\n2. railway add --service backend\n3. Invoke environment skill to set buildCommand and startCommand\n4. Set watch paths for backend + any shared deps\n```\n\n### Deploy Subdirectory of Linked Project\n\n```\nUser: \"create a vite app in my-app directory and deploy to railway\"\nCWD: ~/projects/my-project/my-app (parent already linked to \"my-project\")\n\n1. Check status in my-app → not linked\n2. Check parent: cd .. && railway status → IS linked to \"my-project\"\n3. DON''T init/link the subdirectory\n4. Scaffold: bun create vite my-app --template react-ts\n5. cd my-app && bun install\n6. railway add --service my-app\n7. Invoke environment skill to set rootDirectory: /my-app\n8. Deploy from root: railway up\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:38:22.726Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing Turborepo monorepo integration with Astro, Hono, and Postgres for streamlined project deployment.","zh":"非常适合需要将 Turborepo 单仓库集成到 Astro、Hono 和 Postgres 以实现项目部署流程化的全栈代理。","ja":"Turborepo のモノレポ統合と Astro、Hono、Postgres を使用してプロジェクトのデプロイをストリームライン化する必要があるフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Turborepo 모노레포 통합과 Astro, Hono, Postgres를 사용하여 프로젝트 배포를 간소화하는 데 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan integración de monorepo de Turborepo con Astro, Hono y Postgres para una implementación de proyecto optimizada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''une intégration de monorepo Turborepo avec Astro, Hono et Postgres pour un déploiement de projet rationalisé.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine Turborepo-Monorepo-Integration mit Astro, Hono und Postgres für eine optimierte Projektbereitstellung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de integração de monorepo Turborepo com Astro, Hono e Postgres para implantação de projeto otimizada.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходима интеграция монорепозитория Turborepo с Astro, Hono и Postgres для оптимизированной развертки проекта.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتكاملين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج مونوريبو Turborepo مع Astro و Hono و Postgres لتحسين نشر المشروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create Railway projects, services, and databases with proper configuration, utilizing Turborepo for monorepo management, Astro for landing pages, Hono for signup APIs, and Postgres for database management, all while supporting protocols like initialization and linking to Railway.","zh":"赋予代理创建 Railway 项目、服务和数据库的能力，并利用 Turborepo 进行单仓库管理，Astro 进行着陆页管理，Hono 进行注册 API 管理，Postgres 进行数据库管理，同时支持诸如初始化和链接到 Railway 的协议。","ja":"エージェントが Railway プロジェクト、サービス、データベースを作成する機能を提供し、Turborepo を使用したモノレポ管理、Astro を使用したランディングページ管理、Hono を使用したサインアップ API 管理、Postgres を使用したデータベース管理を行い、初期化や Railway へのリンクなどのプロトコルもサポートします。","ko":"Railway 프로젝트, 서비스 및 데이터베이스를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 기능을 제공하며, Turborepo를 사용한 모노레포 관리, Astro를 사용한 랜딩 페이지 관리, Hono를 사용한 가입 API 관리, Postgres를 사용한 데이터베이스 관리를 수행하며, 초기화 또는 Railway에 연결하는 것과 같은 프로토콜도 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear proyectos, servicios y bases de datos de Railway con una configuración adecuada, utilizando Turborepo para la administración de monorepo, Astro para páginas de aterrizaje, Hono para APIs de registro y Postgres para la administración de bases de datos, todo mientras admite protocolos como inicialización y enlace a Railway.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des projets, des services et des bases de données Railway avec une configuration appropriée, en utilisant Turborepo pour la gestion de monorepo, Astro pour les pages de destination, Hono pour les API d''inscription et Postgres pour la gestion de base de données, le tout en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que l''initialisation et le lien vers Railway.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Railway-Projekte, -Dienste und -Datenbanken mit richtiger Konfiguration zu erstellen, indem Turborepo für die Monorepo-Verwaltung, Astro für Landeseiten, Hono für Registrierungs-APIs und Postgres für die Datenbankverwaltung verwendet werden, und unterstützt dabei Protokolle wie Initialisierung und Verknüpfung mit Railway.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar projetos Railway, serviços e bancos de dados com configuração apropriada, utilizando Turborepo para gerenciamento de monorepo, Astro para páginas de destino, Hono para APIs de cadastro e Postgres para gerenciamento de banco de dados, tudo isso enquanto suporta protocolos como inicialização e vinculação ao Railway.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать проекты Railway, сервисы и базы данных с правильной конфигурацией, используя Turborepo для управления монорепозиторием, Astro для страниц приземления, Hono для API регистрации и Postgres для управления базой данных, все это при поддержке протоколов, таких как инициализация и связывание с Railway.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء مشاريع Railway وخدمات وقواعد بيانات مع تكوين مناسب، باستخدام Turborepo لإدارة مونوريبو، و Astro للصفحات الناظمة، و Hono لخدمات تسجيل الدخول، و Postgres لإدارة قاعدة البيانات، مع دعم البروتوكولات مثل التمهيد والربط بالسكة الحديدية."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new projects with Turborepo and Astro","Deploying Hono signup APIs to Railway","Creating and configuring Postgres databases for services"],"zh":["使用 Turborepo 和 Astro 初始化新项目","将 Hono 注册 API 部署到 Railway","为服务创建和配置 Postgres 数据库"],"ja":["Turborepo と Astro を使用して新しいプロジェクトを初期化する","Hono サインアップ API を Railway にデプロイする","サービス用の Postgres データベースを作成して構成する"],"ko":["Turborepo와 Astro를 사용하여 새로운 프로젝트 초기화","Hono 가입 API를 Railway에 배포","서비스를 위한 Postgres 데이터베이스 생성 및 구성"],"es":["Inicializar nuevos proyectos con Turborepo y Astro","Implementar APIs de registro de Hono en Railway","Crear y configurar bases de datos de Postgres para servicios"],"fr":["Initialiser de nouveaux projets avec Turborepo et Astro","Déployer des API d''inscription Hono sur Railway","Créer et configurer des bases de données Postgres pour les services"],"de":["Neue Projekte mit Turborepo und Astro initialisieren","Hono-Registrierungs-APIs in Railway bereitstellen","Postgres-Datenbanken für Dienste erstellen und konfigurieren"],"pt":["Inicializar novos projetos com Turborepo e Astro","Implantar APIs de cadastro Hono no Railway","Criar e configurar bancos de dados Postgres para serviços"],"ru":["Инициализировать новые проекты с Turborepo и Astro","Развертывать API регистрации Hono на Railway","Создавать и настраивать базы данных Postgres для сервисов"],"ar":["ت初يز مشاريع جديدة مع Turborepo و Astro","نشر خدمات تسجيل الدخول Hono على السكة الحديدية","إنشاء وتكوين قواعد بيانات Postgres للخدمات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway account and configuration","Dependent on Turborepo, Astro, Hono, and Postgres compatibility"],"zh":["需要 Railway 账户和配置","依赖于 Turborepo、Astro、Hono 和 Postgres 的兼容性"],"ja":["Railway アカウントと設定が必要","Turborepo、Astro、Hono、Postgres の互換性に依存する"],"ko":["Railway 계정 및 구성이 필요","Turborepo, Astro, Hono, Postgres의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y configuración de Railway","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de Turborepo, Astro, Hono y Postgres"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et une configuration Railway","Dépend de la compatibilité de Turborepo, Astro, Hono et Postgres"],"de":["Benötigt ein Railway-Konto und -Konfiguration","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität von Turborepo, Astro, Hono und Postgres"],"pt":["Exige conta Railway e configuração","Dependente da compatibilidade de Turborepo, Astro, Hono e Postgres"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Railway и конфигурации","Зависит от совместимости Turborepo, Astro, Hono и Postgres"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب السكة الحديدية والتكوين","يعتمد على توافق Turborepo و Astro و Hono و Postgres"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Cancey-Dejean/nuxt-starter-clean/nuxt-seo', 'community', 'Cancey-Dejean', 'nuxt-starter-clean', 'Cancey-Dejean/nuxt-starter-clean', 'nuxt-seo', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z', '2026-02-18T09:38:13.471Z', NULL, '{"id":"Cancey-Dejean/nuxt-starter-clean/nuxt-seo","name":"nuxt-seo","description":{"zh":"Nuxt SEO 模块提供了一种简单的方式来配置和优化您的网站 SEO 设置，包括站点配置、robots.txt 和 sitemap.xml 生成等","ja":"Nuxt SEO モジュールは、サイトの SEO 設定を簡単に設定および最適化する方法を提供します","ko":"Nuxt SEO 모듈은 웹사이트의 SEO 설정을 쉽게 구성하고 최적화하는 방법을 제공합니다","es":"Nuxt SEO es un módulo para mejorar el SEO de tus sitios web creados con Nuxt.js","fr":"Nuxt SEO est un module pour améliorer le SEO de vos sites web créés avec Nuxt.js","de":"Nuxt SEO ist ein Modul zur Verbesserung des SEO von Websites, die mit Nuxt.js erstellt wurden","pt":"O módulo Nuxt SEO ajuda a melhorar a visibilidade do seu site nas buscas. Configure facilmente o SEO do seu site","ru":"Модуль Nuxt SEO помогает улучшить видимость вашего сайта в поисковых системах. Легко настройте SEO вашего сайта","ar":"مكون Nuxt SEO يساعد على تحسين وضوح موقعك على الإنترنت. 구성 بسهولة SEO لموقعك","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Nuxt SEO 模块 - 提升您的网站搜索引擎排名","ja":"Nuxt SEO モジュール - ウェブサイトの検索エンジンランキングを向上させる","ko":"Nuxt SEO 모듈 - 웹사이트 검색 엔진 순위를 높여라","es":"Nuxt SEO: Optimiza tu sitio web","fr":"Nuxt SEO : Optimisez votre site web","de":"Nuxt SEO: Optimieren Sie Ihre Website","pt":"Otimização SEO com Nuxt","ru":"Nuxt SEO Оптимизация","ar":"تحسين محركات البحث مع Nuxt","en":"nuxt-seo"},"description":{"zh":"Nuxt SEO 模块提供了一种简单的方式来配置和优化您的网站 SEO 设置，包括站点配置、robots.txt 和 sitemap.xml 生成等","ja":"Nuxt SEO モジュールは、サイトの SEO 設定を簡単に設定および最適化する方法を提供します","ko":"Nuxt SEO 모듈은 웹사이트의 SEO 설정을 쉽게 구성하고 최적화하는 방법을 제공합니다","es":"Nuxt SEO es un módulo para mejorar el SEO de tus sitios web creados con Nuxt.js","fr":"Nuxt SEO est un module pour améliorer le SEO de vos sites web créés avec Nuxt.js","de":"Nuxt SEO ist ein Modul zur Verbesserung des SEO von Websites, die mit Nuxt.js erstellt wurden","pt":"O módulo Nuxt SEO ajuda a melhorar a visibilidade do seu site nas buscas. Configure facilmente o SEO do seu site","ru":"Модуль Nuxt SEO помогает улучшить видимость вашего сайта в поисковых системах. Легко настройте SEO вашего сайта","ar":"مكون Nuxt SEO يساعد على تحسين وضوح موقعك على الإنترنت. 구성 بسهولة SEO لموقعك","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["SEO 配置","robots.txt 和 sitemap.xml 生成","动态 OG 图像生成","JSON-LD 结构化数据（schema.org）","面包屑和规范 URL"],"ja":["SEO 設定","robots.txt と sitemap.xml の生成","動的な OG 画像の生成","JSON-LD 構造化データ（schema.org）","パンくずと正規 URL"],"ko":["SEO 구성","robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml 생성","동적 OG 이미지 생성","JSON-LD 구조화 데이터（schema.org）","브레드크럼과 표준 URL"],"es":["Configuración de SEO","Generación de robots.txt y sitemap.xml","Generación dinámica de imágenes OG","Datos estructurados JSON-LD","Breadcrumbs y URLs canónicas"],"fr":["Configuration SEO","Génération de robots.txt et sitemap.xml","Génération dynamique d''images OG","Données structurées JSON-LD","Breadcrumbs et URLs canoniques"],"de":["SEO-Konfiguration","Generierung von robots.txt und sitemap.xml","Dynamische Generierung von OG-Bildern","Strukturierte Daten im JSON-LD-Format","Breadcrumbs und kanonische URLs"],"pt":["Configuração de SEO do site","Geração de robots.txt e sitemap.xml","Geração de imagem OG dinâmica","Dados estruturados JSON-LD (schema.org)","Breadcrumbs e URLs canônicas"],"ru":["Настройка SEO сайта","Генерация robots.txt и sitemap.xml","Генерация динамической OG изображения","Структурированные данные JSON-LD (schema.org)","Хлебные крошки и канонические URL"],"ar":["تكوين SEO لموقعك","توليد ملفات robots.txt و sitemap.xml","توليد صورة OG ديناميكية","بيانات JSON-LD المنظمة (schema.org)","breadcrumbs و URLs القائمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nuxt SEO","SEO 优化","Nuxt.js","网站优化","搜索引擎排名","robots.txt","sitemap.xml","JSON-LD"],"ja":["Nuxt SEO","SEO 最適化","Nuxt.js","ウェブサイト最適化","検索エンジンランキング","robots.txt","sitemap.xml","JSON-LD"],"ko":["Nuxt SEO","SEO 최적화","Nuxt.js","웹사이트 최적화","검색 엔진 순위","robots.txt","sitemap.xml","JSON-LD"],"es":["Nuxt SEO","SEO en Nuxt.js","Optimización de sitios web","Posicionamiento en motores de búsqueda","Configuración de SEO","Generación de sitemap.xml"],"fr":["Nuxt SEO","SEO avec Nuxt.js","Optimisation de sites web","Référencement dans les moteurs de recherche","Configuration SEO","Génération de sitemap.xml"],"de":["Nuxt SEO","SEO mit Nuxt.js","Optimierung von Websites","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung","SEO-Konfiguration","Generierung von sitemap.xml"],"pt":["Nuxt SEO","Otimização de site","SEO","Configuração de SEO","Robots.txt","Sitemap.xml","OG image","JSON-LD","Breadcrumbs"],"ru":["Nuxt SEO","Оптимизация сайта","SEO","Настройка SEO","Robots.txt","Sitemap.xml","OG изображение","JSON-LD","Хлебные крошки"],"ar":["Nuxt SEO","تحسين موقعك","SEO","تكوين SEO","ملفات robots.txt","ملفات sitemap.xml","صورة OG","JSON-LD","breadcrumbs"]}},"owner":"Cancey-Dejean","repo":"nuxt-starter-clean","repoPath":"Cancey-Dejean/nuxt-starter-clean","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nuxt-seo","description":"Nuxt SEO meta-module with robots, sitemap, og-image, schema-org. Use when configuring SEO, generating sitemaps, creating OG images, or adding structured data.","bodyPreview":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Usage Pattern\n\n**Progressive loading - only read what you need:**\n\n- Configuring site? → [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md)\n- Setting up robots/sitemap? → [references/crawlability.md](references/","body":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Usage Pattern\n\n**Progressive loading - only read what you need:**\n\n- Configuring site? → [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md)\n- Setting up robots/sitemap? → [references/crawlability.md](references/crawlability.md)\n- Generating OG images? → [references/og-image.md](references/og-image.md)\n- Adding JSON-LD? → [references/schema-org.md](references/schema-org.md)\n- Breadcrumbs, links, icons? → [references/utilities.md](references/utilities.md)\n\n## Site Config\n\nFoundation for all SEO modules. Configure `site` in `nuxt.config.ts`, access via `useSiteConfig()`. See [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) for full options.\n\n## Module Overview\n\n| Module            | Purpose         | Key API                       |\n| ----------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| nuxt-site-config  | Shared config   | `useSiteConfig()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/robots    | robots.txt      | `useRobotsRule()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/sitemap   | sitemap.xml     | `defineSitemapEventHandler()` |\n| nuxt-og-image     | OG images       | `defineOgImage()`             |\n| nuxt-schema-org   | JSON-LD         | `useSchemaOrg()`              |\n| nuxt-seo-utils    | Meta utilities  | `useBreadcrumbItems()`        |\n| nuxt-link-checker | Link validation | Build-time checks             |\n\n## Nuxt Content v3\n\nUse `asSeoCollection()` for automatic sitemap, og-image, and schema-org from frontmatter:\n\n```ts\n// content.config.ts\nimport { defineCollection, defineContentConfig } from ''@nuxt/content''\nimport { asSeoCollection } from ''@nuxtjs/seo/content''\n\nexport default defineContentConfig({\n  collections: {\n    posts: defineCollection(asSeoCollection({ type: ''page'', source: ''posts/**'' }))\n  }\n})\n```\n\n**Important:** Load `@nuxtjs/seo` before `@nuxt/content` in modules array:\n\n```ts\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''@nuxtjs/seo'', ''@nuxt/content'']\n})\n```\n\nFrontmatter fields: `ogImage`, `sitemap`, `robots`, `schemaOrg`.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [nuxt-content](../nuxt-content/SKILL.md) - For MDC rendering with SEO frontmatter\n\n## Links\n\n- [Documentation](https://nuxtseo.com)\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/harlan-zw/nuxt-seo)\n\n## Token Efficiency\n\nMain skill: ~250 tokens. Each sub-file: ~400-600 tokens. Only load files relevant to current task.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:38:13.471Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Development Agents focusing on search engine optimization and dynamic content generation with Nuxt.js.","zh":"适合专注于搜索引擎优化和使用 Nuxt.js 生成动态内容的 Web 开发代理。","ja":"Nuxt.js を使用した検索エンジン最適化と動的コンテンツ生成に特化した Web 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Nuxt.js를 사용한 검색 엔진 최적화 및 동적 콘텐츠 생성에 중점을 둔 Web 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo web que se centran en la optimización de motores de búsqueda y la generación de contenido dinámico con Nuxt.js.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Web se concentrant sur l''optimisation des moteurs de recherche et la génération de contenu dynamique avec Nuxt.js.","de":"Ideal für Webentwicklungsagenten, die sich auf die Suchmaschinenoptimierung und die Erstellung von dynamischen Inhalten mit Nuxt.js konzentrieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que se concentram na otimização para motores de busca e geração de conteúdo dinâmico com Nuxt.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке веб-приложений, которые фокусируются на оптимизации для поисковых систем и динамической генерации контента с помощью Nuxt.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الوب الذي يركز على تحسين محركات البحث وتوليد المحتوى الديناميكي باستخدام Nuxt.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure SEO settings, generate robots.txt and sitemap.xml files, and create dynamic OG images using Nuxt.js, while also supporting JSON-LD structured data and canonical URLs.","zh":"赋予代理配置 SEO 设置、生成 robots.txt 和 sitemap.xml 文件以及使用 Nuxt.js 创建动态 OG 图像的能力，同时支持 JSON-LD 结构化数据和规范化 URL。","ja":"エージェントに、Nuxt.js を使用して SEO 設定を構成し、robots.txt および sitemap.xml ファイルを生成し、動的 OG 画像を作成する機能を付与し、JSON-LD 構造化データおよび正規化 URL もサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Nuxt.js를 사용하여 SEO 설정을 구성하고 robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml 파일을 생성하고 동적 OG 이미지를 생성하는 기능을 제공하며 JSON-LD 구조화 데이터 및 표준 URL도 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes configurar la configuración de SEO, generar archivos robots.txt y sitemap.xml, y crear imágenes OG dinámicas utilizando Nuxt.js, y también admite datos estructurados JSON-LD y URLs canónicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer les paramètres de référencement, de générer des fichiers robots.txt et sitemap.xml, et de créer des images OG dynamiques à l''aide de Nuxt.js, tout en prenant en charge les données structurées JSON-LD et les URL canoniales.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, SEO-Einstellungen zu konfigurieren, robots.txt- und sitemap.xml-Dateien zu generieren und dynamische OG-Bilder mit Nuxt.js zu erstellen, und unterstützt auch strukturierte JSON-LD-Daten und kanonische URLs.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar as configurações de SEO, gerar arquivos robots.txt e sitemap.xml, e criar imagens OG dinâmicas usando Nuxt.js, além de suportar dados estruturados JSON-LD e URLs canônicas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настраивать параметры SEO, генерировать файлы robots.txt и sitemap.xml, а также создавать динамические изображения OG с помощью Nuxt.js, при этом поддерживая структурированные данные JSON-LD и канонические URL.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تكوين إعدادات تحسين محركات البحث، وتوليد ملفات robots.txt وسitemap.xml، وإنشاء صور OG ديناميكية باستخدام Nuxt.js، مع دعم البيانات المهيكلة JSON-LD والرابط المعياري."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring site metadata for improved search engine ranking","Automating robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation for enhanced crawlability","Generating dynamic OG images for social media sharing","Implementing JSON-LD structured data for schema.org compliance","Managing breadcrumbs and canonical URLs for better site navigation"],"zh":["配置网站元数据以提高搜索引擎排名","自动生成 robots.txt 和 sitemap.xml 以提高爬行性","生成动态 OG 图像以用于社交媒体分享","实现 JSON-LD 结构化数据以遵循 schema.org 标准","管理面包屑和规范化 URL 以提高网站导航"],"ja":["検索エンジンランキングの向上のためにサイトメタデータを構成する","クロール性の向上のために robots.txt および sitemap.xml を自動生成する","ソーシャルメディア共有用の動的 OG 画像を生成する","schema.org 準拠のために JSON-LD 構造化データを実装する","サイトナビゲーションの向上のためにパンくずと正規化 URL を管理する"],"ko":["검색 엔진 순위 개선을 위한 사이트 메타데이터 구성","크롤링 성능 개선을 위한 자동으로 생성된 robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml","소셜 미디어 공유를 위한 동적 OG 이미지 생성","schema.org 준수를 위한 JSON-LD 구조화 데이터 구현","사이트 내비게이션 개선을 위한 브레드크럼 및 표준 URL 관리"],"es":["Configurar los metadatos del sitio para mejorar el posicionamiento en los motores de búsqueda","Automatizar la generación de archivos robots.txt y sitemap.xml para una mejor accesibilidad","Generar imágenes OG dinámicas para compartir en las redes sociales","Implementar datos estructurados JSON-LD para cumplir con la norma schema.org","Administrar migas de pan y URLs canónicas para una mejor navegación por el sitio"],"fr":["Configurer les métadonnées du site pour améliorer le référencement","Automatiser la génération des fichiers robots.txt et sitemap.xml pour une meilleure crawlabilité","Générer des images OG dynamiques pour le partage sur les réseaux sociaux","Implémenter des données structurées JSON-LD pour se conformer à la norme schema.org","Gérer les fil d''ariane et les URL canoniales pour une meilleure navigation sur le site"],"de":["Konfigurieren der Metadaten der Website zur Verbesserung der Suchmaschinenplatzierung","Automatisieren der Generierung von robots.txt- und sitemap.xml-Dateien für eine verbesserte Crawlfähigkeit","Erstellen von dynamischen OG-Bildern für das Teilen in sozialen Netzwerken","Implementieren von strukturierten JSON-LD-Daten für die Einhaltung der schema.org-Norm","Verwalten von Brotkrumen und kanonischen URLs für eine bessere Seitenavigation"],"pt":["Configurar metadados do site para melhorar o ranqueamento do mecanismo de busca","Automatizar a geração de arquivos robots.txt e sitemap.xml para melhorar a capacidade de indexação","Gerar imagens OG dinâmicas para compartilhamento em redes sociais","Implementar dados estruturados JSON-LD para conformidade com schema.org","Gerenciar migalhas de pão e URLs canônicas para melhor navegação no site"],"ru":["Настроить метаданные сайта для улучшения рейтинга поисковой системы","Автоматизировать генерацию файлов robots.txt и sitemap.xml для повышения индексируемости","Генерировать динамические изображения OG для обмена в социальных сетях","Реализовать структурированные данные JSON-LD для соответствия schema.org","Управлять хлебными крошками и каноническими URL для лучшей навигации по сайту"],"ar":["تكوين بيانات الموقع لتحسين ترتيب محرك البحث","تحسين توليد ملفات robots.txt وسitemap.xml لتحسين القدرة على الفهرسة","توليد صور OG ديناميكية لمشاركتها على منصات التواصل الاجتماعي","تنفيذ البيانات المهيكلة JSON-LD للامتثال لschema.org","إدارة الرسوم البيانية والرابط المعياري لتحسين التنقل في الموقع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nuxt.js project setup","Limited to Nuxt.js ecosystem","Dependent on @nuxtjs/seo module installation"],"zh":["需要 Nuxt.js 项目设置","仅限于 Nuxt.js 生态系统","依赖于 @nuxtjs/seo 模块安装"],"ja":["Nuxt.js プロジェクトの設定が必要","Nuxt.js エコシステムに限定される","@nuxtjs/seo モジュールのインストールに依存する"],"ko":["Nuxt.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요합니다","Nuxt.js 생태계에만 국한됩니다","@nuxtjs/seo 모듈 설치에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere la configuración del proyecto Nuxt.js","Limitado al ecosistema Nuxt.js","Dependiente de la instalación del módulo @nuxtjs/seo"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''un projet Nuxt.js","Limité à l''écosystème Nuxt.js","Dépend de l''installation du module @nuxtjs/seo"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung eines Nuxt.js-Projekts","Begrenzt auf das Nuxt.js-Ökosystem","Abhängig von der Installation des @nuxtjs/seo-Moduls"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto 