nementList","Пагинация результатов с usePagination","Доступ к полному состоянию с useInstantSearch"],"ar":["React InstantSearch مع Hooks","Server-Side Rendering مع Next.js","تصفية القوائم مع useRefinementList","تنقلة النتائج مع usePagination","دخول الحالة الكاملة مع useInstantSearch"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Algolia 搜索","React InstantSearch","Next.js","搜索集成","类型提示搜索","可定制的搜索"],"ja":["Algolia 検索","React InstantSearch","Next.js","検索統合","型ヒント検索","カスタマイズ可能な検索"],"ko":["Algolia 검색","React InstantSearch","Next.js","검색 통합","유형 힌트 검색","커스터마이즈 가능한 검색"],"es":["algolia","búsqueda instantánea","react instantsearch","next.js","integración de búsqueda","personalización de la búsqueda","filtrado de facetas","paginación de resultados"],"fr":["algolia","recherche instantanée","react instantsearch","next.js","intégration de recherche","personnalisation de la recherche","filtrage de facettes","pagination des résultats"],"de":["algolia","instantane suche","react instantsearch","next.js","suchintegration","anpassung der suche","faktor-filterung","seitenaufteilung der ergebnisse"],"pt":["integração de busca algolia","react instantsearch","next.js server-side rendering","busca personalizada","desenvolvimento web","algolia search"],"ru":["интеграция поиска algolia","react instantsearch","next.js серверный рендеринг","персонализированный поиск","веб-разработка","algolia поиск"],"ar":["تكامل بحث algolia","react instantsearch","next.js server-side rendering","بحث مخصص","تطوير ويب","algolia بحث"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.479Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"algolia-search","description":"Expert patterns for Algolia search implementation, indexing strategies, React InstantSearch, and relevance tuning Use when: adding search to, algolia, instantsearch, search api, search functionality.","bodyPreview":"# Algolia Search Integration\n\n## Patterns\n\n### React InstantSearch with Hooks\n\nModern React InstantSearch setup using hooks for type-ahead search.\n\nUses react-instantsearch-hooks-web package with algoliasearch client.\nWidgets are components that can be customized with classnames.\n\nKey hooks:\n- useSearchBox: Search input handling\n- useHits: Access search results\n- useRefinementList: Facet filtering\n- usePagination: Result pagination\n- useInstantSearch: Full state access\n\n\n### Next.js Server-Side","body":"# Algolia Search Integration\n\n## Patterns\n\n### React InstantSearch with Hooks\n\nModern React InstantSearch setup using hooks for type-ahead search.\n\nUses react-instantsearch-hooks-web package with algoliasearch client.\nWidgets are components that can be customized with classnames.\n\nKey hooks:\n- useSearchBox: Search input handling\n- useHits: Access search results\n- useRefinementList: Facet filtering\n- usePagination: Result pagination\n- useInstantSearch: Full state access\n\n\n### Next.js Server-Side Rendering\n\nSSR integration for Next.js with react-instantsearch-nextjs package.\n\nUse <InstantSearchNext> instead of <InstantSearch> for SSR.\nSupports both Pages Router and App Router (experimental).\n\nKey considerations:\n- Set dynamic = ''force-dynamic'' for fresh results\n- Handle URL synchronization with routing prop\n- Use getServerState for initial state\n\n\n### Data Synchronization and Indexing\n\nIndexing strategies for keeping Algolia in sync with your data.\n\nThree main approaches:\n1. Full Reindexing - Replace entire index (expensive)\n2. Full Record Updates - Replace individual records\n3. Partial Updates - Update specific attributes only\n\nBest practices:\n- Batch records (ideal: 10MB, 1K-10K records per batch)\n- Use incremental updates when possible\n- partialUpdateObjects for attribute-only changes\n- Avoid deleteBy (computationally expensive)\n\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:38:41.938Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced search integration with Algolia''s API, particularly those utilizing React or Next.js frameworks.","zh":"适合需要与Algolia API集成高级搜索功能的前端代理，尤其是那些使用React或Next.js框架的代理。","ja":"Algolia APIとの高度な検索統合が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。特に、ReactまたはNext.jsフレームワークを使用するエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Algolia API와의 고급 검색 통합이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 React 또는 Next.js 프레임워크를 사용하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan una integración de búsqueda avanzada con la API de Algolia, especialmente aquellos que utilizan los marcos de React o Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui ont besoin d''une intégration de recherche avancée avec l''API d''Algolia, en particulier ceux qui utilisent les frameworks React ou Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Suche-Integration mit der Algolia-API benötigen, insbesondere solche, die die Frameworks React oder Next.js verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de integração de busca avançada com a API da Algolia, particularmente aqueles que utilizam os frameworks React ou Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется продвинутая интеграция поиска с API Algolia, особенно для тех, кто использует фреймворки React или Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج بحث متقدم مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Algolia، ولا سيما أولئك الذين يستخدمون إطار العمل React أو Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate seamless search functionalities using react-instantsearch-hooks-web and algoliasearch client, enabling features like type-ahead search, facet filtering, and result pagination through key hooks such as useSearchBox, useHits, and useInstantSearch.","zh":"赋予代理集成无缝搜索功能的能力，使用react-instantsearch-hooks-web和algoliasearch客户端，实现诸如输入提示搜索、分面过滤和结果分页等功能，通过关键钩子如useSearchBox、useHits和useInstantSearch。","ja":"エージェントにシームレスな検索機能を統合する能力を与えます。react-instantsearch-hooks-webとalgoliasearchクライアントを使用して、入力予測検索、ファセットフィルタリング、結果のページネーションなどの機能を実現します。キーフックであるuseSearchBox、useHits、useInstantSearchを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 무정지 검색 기능을 통합할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. react-instantsearch-hooks-web와 algoliasearch 클라이언트를 사용하여 입력 예측 검색, 패싯 필터링, 결과 페이지네이션 등의 기능을 구현할 수 있습니다. 주요 훅으로는 useSearchBox, useHits, useInstantSearch가 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar funcionalidades de búsqueda sin problemas utilizando react-instantsearch-hooks-web y el cliente algoliasearch, lo que permite características como búsqueda de tipo adelantado, filtrado de facetas y paginación de resultados a través de ganchos clave como useSearchBox, useHits y useInstantSearch.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer des fonctionnalités de recherche sans problème en utilisant react-instantsearch-hooks-web et le client algoliasearch, ce qui permet des fonctionnalités telles que la recherche de type avant, le filtrage de facettes et la pagination des résultats via des crochets clés tels que useSearchBox, useHits et useInstantSearch.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, nahtlose Suchfunktionen mithilfe von react-instantsearch-hooks-web und dem algoliasearch-Client zu integrieren, wodurch Funktionen wie Vorwärts-Tippen-Suche, Facettenfilterung und Ergebnisseitennummerierung über Schlüsselhaken wie useSearchBox, useHits und useInstantSearch ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrarem funcionalidades de busca transparentes usando react-instantsearch-hooks-web e cliente algoliasearch, permitindo recursos como busca de pré-visualização, filtragem de facetas e paginação de resultados por meio de ganchos importantes como useSearchBox, useHits e useInstantSearch.","ru":"Позволяет агентам интегрировать бесшовные функции поиска с помощью react-instantsearch-hooks-web и клиента algoliasearch, обеспечивая функции, такие как поиск с предпросмотром, фильтрация по фасетам и постраничная разбивка результатов через ключевые крючки, такие как useSearchBox, useHits и useInstantSearch.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من دمج وظائف بحث прозрач باستخدام react-instantsearch-hooks-web وعميل algoliasearch، مما يتيح ميزات مثل بحث مسبق، وتحسين resultados بواسطة facetas وتنقية النتائج بواسطةHooks مثل useSearchBox و useHits و useInstantSearch."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing type-ahead search with React InstantSearch","Integrating facet filtering for search results refinement","Customizing search result pagination with usePagination"],"zh":["使用React InstantSearch实现输入提示搜索","集成分面过滤以改进搜索结果","使用usePagination自定义搜索结果分页"],"ja":["React InstantSearchを使用した入力予測検索の実装","検索結果の改善のためのファセットフィルタリングの統合","usePaginationを使用した検索結果のページネーションのカスタマイズ"],"ko":["React InstantSearch를 사용한 입력 예측 검색 구현","검색 결과 개선 위한 패싯 필터링 통합","usePagination을 사용한 검색 결과 페이지네이션 커스터마이즈"],"es":["Implementar la búsqueda de tipo adelantado con React InstantSearch","Integrar el filtrado de facetas para la refinación de los resultados de búsqueda","Personalizar la paginación de los resultados de búsqueda con usePagination"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la recherche de type avant avec React InstantSearch","Intégrer le filtrage de facettes pour l''affinement des résultats de recherche","Personnaliser la pagination des résultats de recherche avec usePagination"],"de":["Implementierung der Vorwärts-Tippen-Suche mit React InstantSearch","Integration der Facettenfilterung für die Verfeinerung der Suchergebnisse","Anpassung der Ergebnisseitennummerierung mit usePagination"],"pt":["Implementar busca de pré-visualização com React InstantSearch","Integrar filtragem de facetas para refinar resultados de busca","Personalizar paginação de resultados de busca com usePagination"],"ru":["Реализовать поиск с предпросмотром с помощью React InstantSearch","Интегрировать фильтрацию по фасетам для уточнения результатов поиска","Настроить постраничную разбивку результатов поиска с помощью usePagination"],"ar":["تنفيذ بحث مسبق مع React InstantSearch","دمج تصفية النتائج بواسطة facetas لتحسين نتائج البحث","تخصيص تنقية النتائج بواسطة usePagination"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Algolia account and API key","Specifically designed for React and Next.js applications"],"zh":["需要Algolia账户和API密钥","专门为React和Next.js应用程序设计"],"ja":["AlgoliaアカウントとAPIキーが必要","ReactとNext.jsアプリケーション専用に設計"],"ko":["Algolia 계정과 API 키가 필요합니다","React와 Next.js 애플리케이션을 위한専用 설계"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Algolia y una clave de API","Diseñado específicamente para aplicaciones de React y Next.js"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Algolia et une clé API","Conçu spécifiquement pour les applications React et Next.js"],"de":["Benötigt ein Algolia-Konto und einen API-Schlüssel","Speziell für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen konzipiert"],"pt":["Exige conta Algolia e chave API","Especificamente projetado para aplicações React e Next.js"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Algolia и ключа API","Специально разработан для приложений React и Next.js"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Algolia ومفتاح API","صمم خصيصًا لتطبيقات React و Next.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('langgenius/dify/component-refactoring', 'community', 'langgenius', 'dify', 'langgenius/dify', 'component-refactoring', 0, 0, 100, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:39:05.545Z', NULL, '{"id":"langgenius/dify/component-refactoring","name":"component-refactoring","description":{"zh":"Dify 组件重构技能是用于重构高复杂性 React 组件的生产就绪平台","ja":"Dify コンポーネントリファクタリングスキルは、高複雑性の React コンポーネントをリファクタリングするための生産就緒プラットフォームです","ko":"Dify 컴포넌트 리팩토링 스킬은 높은 복잡성의 React 컴포넌트를 리팩토링하기 위한 생산 준비 플랫폼입니다","es":"Dify Component Refactoring es una plataforma para refactorizar componentes React complejos y mejorar la eficiencia del código","fr":"Dify Component Refactoring est une plateforme pour réorganiser des composants React complexes et améliorer l''efficacité du code","de":"Dify Component Refactoring ist eine Plattform zum Refactorisieren komplexer React-Komponenten und zur Verbesserung der Code-Effizienz","pt":"O skill de refatoração de componentes Dify é uma plataforma de desenvolvimento de fluxo de trabalho agente pronta para produção","ru":"Навык рефакторинга компонентов Dify — это платформа для разработки агентского рабочего процесса, готова к производству","ar":"مهارة إعادة هيكلة مكونات Dify هي منصة لتنمية تدفق عمل وكلاء جاهزة للإنتاج","en":"Production-ready platform for agentic workflow development."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Dify 组件重构技能","ja":"Dify コンポーネントリファクタリングスキル","ko":"Dify 컴포넌트 리팩토링 스킬","es":"Refactorización de Componentes","fr":"Réorganisation de Composants","de":"Komponenten-Refactoring","pt":"Refatoração de Componentes Dify","ru":"Рефакторинг Компонентов Dify","ar":"إعادة هيكلة مكونات Dify","en":"component-refactoring"},"description":{"zh":"Dify 组件重构技能是用于重构高复杂性 React 组件的生产就绪平台","ja":"Dify コンポーネントリファクタリングスキルは、高複雑性の React コンポーネントをリファクタリングするための生産就緒プラットフォームです","ko":"Dify 컴포넌트 리팩토링 스킬은 높은 복잡성의 React 컴포넌트를 리팩토링하기 위한 생산 준비 플랫폼입니다","es":"Dify Component Refactoring es una plataforma para refactorizar componentes React complejos y mejorar la eficiencia del código","fr":"Dify Component Refactoring est une plateforme pour réorganiser des composants React complexes et améliorer l''efficacité du code","de":"Dify Component Refactoring ist eine Plattform zum Refactorisieren komplexer React-Komponenten und zur Verbesserung der Code-Effizienz","pt":"O skill de refatoração de componentes Dify é uma plataforma de desenvolvimento de fluxo de trabalho agente pronta para produção","ru":"Навык рефакторинга компонентов Dify — это платформа для разработки агентского рабочего процесса, готова к производству","ar":"مهارة إعادة هيكلة مكونات Dify هي منصة لتنمية تدفق عمل وكلاء جاهزة للإنتاج","en":"Production-ready platform for agentic workflow development."},"definition":{"en":"Production-ready platform for agentic workflow development."},"features":{"zh":["支持高复杂性 React 组件的重构","提供简单易用的重构工作流","支持使用 pnpm analyze-component 进行复杂性分析","支持使用 refactor-component 进行重构提示","支持使用 analyze-component 进行测试提示和指标分析"],"ja":["高複雑性の React コンポーネントのリファクタリングをサポート","簡単に使用できるリファクタリングワークフローを提供","pnpm analyze-component を使用した複雑性分析をサポート","refactor-component を使用したリファクタリングのヒントをサポート","analyze-component を使用したテストのヒントとメトリクス分析をサポート"],"ko":["높은 복잡성의 React 컴포넌트를 리팩토링하는 것을 지원","간단하게 사용할 수 있는 리팩토링 워크플로를 제공","pnpm analyze-component를 사용한 복잡성 분석을 지원","refactor-component를 사용한 리팩토링 힌트를 지원","analyze-component를 사용한 테스트 힌트와 메트릭스 분석을 지원"],"es":["Refactorización de componentes React complejos","Análisis de componentes con pnpm","Umbral de complejidad para refactorización","Comandos para refactorización y análisis","Mejora de la eficiencia del código","Compatibilidad con Dify"],"fr":["Réorganisation de composants React complexes","Analyse de composants avec pnpm","Seuil de complexité pour la réorganisation","Commandes pour la réorganisation et l''analyse","Amélioration de l''efficacité du code","Compatibilité avec Dify"],"de":["Refactorisierung komplexer React-Komponenten","Analyse von Komponenten mit pnpm","Komplexitätsschwellenwert für Refactorisierung","Befehle für Refactorisierung und Analyse","Verbesserung der Code-Effizienz","Kompatibilität mit Dify"],"pt":["Refatoração de componentes React complexos","Análise de complexidade de componentes","Otimização de desempenho","Melhoria da manutenibilidade","Suporte a fluxo de trabalho agente"],"ru":["Рефакторинг сложных компонентов React","Анализ сложности компонентов","Оптимизация производительности","Улучшение поддерживаемости","Поддержка агентского рабочего процесса"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة مكونات React المعقدة","تحليل تعقيد المكونات","تحسين الأداء","تحسين الصيانة","دعم تدفق العمل الوكيل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Dify","组件重构","React","复杂性分析","重构工作流","pnpm","refactor-component","analyze-component"],"ja":["Dify","コンポーネントリファクタリング","React","複雑性分析","リファクタリングワークフロー","pnpm","refactor-component","analyze-component"],"ko":["Dify","컴포넌트 리팩토링","React","복잡성 분석","리팩토링 워크플로","pnpm","refactor-component","analyze-component"],"es":["refactorización de componentes","react","dify","pnpm","análisis de componentes","eficiencia del código","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["réorganisation de composants","react","dify","pnpm","analyse de composants","efficacité du code","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["refactorisierung von komponenten","react","dify","pnpm","analyse von komponenten","code-effizienz","software-entwicklung","software-ingeneering"],"pt":["refatoração de componentes","desenvolvimento de fluxo de trabalho agente","componentes React","análise de complexidade","otimização de desempenho","manutenibilidade de código"],"ru":["рефакторинг компонентов","разработка агентского рабочего процесса","компоненты React","анализ сложности","оптимизация производительности","поддерживаемость кода"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة المكونات","تنمية تدفق العمل الوكيل","مكونات React","تحليل التعقيد","تحسين الأداء","صيانة الكود"]}},"owner":"langgenius","repo":"dify","repoPath":"langgenius/dify","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"component-refactoring","description":"Refactor high-complexity React components in Dify frontend. Use when `pnpm analyze-component --json` shows complexity > 50 or lineCount > 300, when the user asks for code splitting, hook extraction, or complexity reduction, or when `pnpm analyze-component` warns to refactor before testing; avoid for simple/well-structured components, third-party wrappers, or when the user explicitly wants testing without refactoring.","bodyPreview":"# Dify Component Refactoring Skill\n\nRefactor high-complexity React components in the Dify frontend codebase with the patterns and workflow below.\n\n> **Complexity Threshold**: Components with complexity > 50 (measured by `pnpm analyze-component`) should be refactored before testing.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Commands (run from `web/`)\n\nUse paths relative to `web/` (e.g., `app/components/...`).\nUse `refactor-component` for refactoring prompts and `analyze-component` for testing prompts and metrics.","body":"# Dify Component Refactoring Skill\n\nRefactor high-complexity React components in the Dify frontend codebase with the patterns and workflow below.\n\n> **Complexity Threshold**: Components with complexity > 50 (measured by `pnpm analyze-component`) should be refactored before testing.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Commands (run from `web/`)\n\nUse paths relative to `web/` (e.g., `app/components/...`).\nUse `refactor-component` for refactoring prompts and `analyze-component` for testing prompts and metrics.\n\n```bash\ncd web\n\n# Generate refactoring prompt\npnpm refactor-component <path>\n\n# Output refactoring analysis as JSON\npnpm refactor-component <path> --json\n\n# Generate testing prompt (after refactoring)\npnpm analyze-component <path>\n\n# Output testing analysis as JSON\npnpm analyze-component <path> --json\n```\n\n### Complexity Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Analyze component complexity\npnpm analyze-component <path> --json\n\n# Key metrics to check:\n# - complexity: normalized score 0-100 (target < 50)\n# - maxComplexity: highest single function complexity\n# - lineCount: total lines (target < 300)\n```\n\n### Complexity Score Interpretation\n\n| Score | Level | Action |\n|-------|-------|--------|\n| 0-25 | 🟢 Simple | Ready for testing |\n| 26-50 | 🟡 Medium | Consider minor refactoring |\n| 51-75 | 🟠 Complex | **Refactor before testing** |\n| 76-100 | 🔴 Very Complex | **Must refactor** |\n\n## Core Refactoring Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Extract Custom Hooks\n\n**When**: Component has complex state management, multiple `useState`/`useEffect`, or business logic mixed with UI.\n\n**Dify Convention**: Place hooks in a `hooks/` subdirectory or alongside the component as `use-<feature>.ts`.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: Complex state logic in component\nconst Configuration: FC = () => {\n  const [modelConfig, setModelConfig] = useState<ModelConfig>(...)\n  const [datasetConfigs, setDatasetConfigs] = useState<DatasetConfigs>(...)\n  const [completionParams, setCompletionParams] = useState<FormValue>({})\n  \n  // 50+ lines of state management logic...\n  \n  return <div>...</div>\n}\n\n// ✅ After: Extract to custom hook\n// hooks/use-model-config.ts\nexport const useModelConfig = (appId: string) => {\n  const [modelConfig, setModelConfig] = useState<ModelConfig>(...)\n  const [completionParams, setCompletionParams] = useState<FormValue>({})\n  \n  // Related state management logic here\n  \n  return { modelConfig, setModelConfig, completionParams, setCompletionParams }\n}\n\n// Component becomes cleaner\nconst Configuration: FC = () => {\n  const { modelConfig, setModelConfig } = useModelConfig(appId)\n  return <div>...</div>\n}\n```\n\n**Dify Examples**:\n- `web/app/components/app/configuration/hooks/use-advanced-prompt-config.ts`\n- `web/app/components/app/configuration/debug/hooks.tsx`\n- `web/app/components/workflow/hooks/use-workflow.ts`\n\n### Pattern 2: Extract Sub-Components\n\n**When**: Single component has multiple UI sections, conditional rendering blocks, or repeated patterns.\n\n**Dify Convention**: Place sub-components in subdirectories or as separate files in the same directory.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: Monolithic JSX with multiple sections\nconst AppInfo = () => {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {/* 100 lines of header UI */}\n      {/* 100 lines of operations UI */}\n      {/* 100 lines of modals */}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\n// ✅ After: Split into focused components\n// app-info/\n//   ├── index.tsx           (orchestration only)\n//   ├── app-header.tsx      (header UI)\n//   ├── app-operations.tsx  (operations UI)\n//   └── app-modals.tsx      (modal management)\n\nconst AppInfo = () => {\n  const { showModal, setShowModal } = useAppInfoModals()\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      <AppHeader appDetail={appDetail} />\n      <AppOperations onAction={handleAction} />\n      <AppModals show={showModal} onClose={() => setShowModal(null)} />\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**Dify Examples**:\n- `web/app/components/app/configuration/` directory structure\n- `web/app/components/workflow/nodes/` per-node organization\n\n### Pattern 3: Simplify Conditional Logic\n\n**When**: Deep nesting (> 3 levels), complex ternaries, or multiple `if/else` chains.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: Deeply nested conditionals\nconst Template = useMemo(() => {\n  if (appDetail?.mode === AppModeEnum.CHAT) {\n    switch (locale) {\n      case LanguagesSupported[1]:\n        return <TemplateChatZh />\n      case LanguagesSupported[7]:\n        return <TemplateChatJa />\n      default:\n        return <TemplateChatEn />\n    }\n  }\n  if (appDetail?.mode === AppModeEnum.ADVANCED_CHAT) {\n    // Another 15 lines...\n  }\n  // More conditions...\n}, [appDetail, locale])\n\n// ✅ After: Use lookup tables + early returns\nconst TEMPLATE_MAP = {\n  [AppModeEnum.CHAT]: {\n    [LanguagesSupported[1]]: TemplateChatZh,\n    [LanguagesSupported[7]]: TemplateChatJa,\n    default: TemplateChatEn,\n  },\n  [AppModeEnum.ADVANCED_CHAT]: {\n    [LanguagesSupported[1]]: TemplateAdvancedChatZh,\n    // ...\n  },\n}\n\nconst Template = useMemo(() => {\n  const modeTemplates = TEMPLATE_MAP[appDetail?.mode]\n  if (!modeTemplates) return null\n  \n  const TemplateComponent = modeTemplates[locale] || modeTemplates.default\n  return <TemplateComponent appDetail={appDetail} />\n}, [appDetail, locale])\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Extract API/Data Logic\n\n**When**: Component directly handles API calls, data transformation, or complex async operations.\n\n**Dify Convention**: Use `@tanstack/react-query` hooks from `web/service/use-*.ts` or create custom data hooks.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: API logic in component\nconst MCPServiceCard = () => {\n  const [basicAppConfig, setBasicAppConfig] = useState({})\n  \n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (isBasicApp && appId) {\n      (async () => {\n        const res = await fetchAppDetail({ url: ''/apps'', id: appId })\n        setBasicAppConfig(res?.model_config || {})\n      })()\n    }\n  }, [appId, isBasicApp])\n  \n  // More API-related logic...\n}\n\n// ✅ After: Extract to data hook using React Query\n// use-app-config.ts\nimport { useQuery } from ''@tanstack/react-query''\nimport { get } from ''@/service/base''\n\nconst NAME_SPACE = ''appConfig''\n\nexport const useAppConfig = (appId: string, isBasicApp: boolean) => {\n  return useQuery({\n    enabled: isBasicApp && !!appId,\n    queryKey: [NAME_SPACE, ''detail'', appId],\n    queryFn: () => get<AppDetailResponse>(`/apps/${appId}`),\n    select: data => data?.model_config || {},\n  })\n}\n\n// Component becomes cleaner\nconst MCPServiceCard = () => {\n  const { data: config, isLoading } = useAppConfig(appId, isBasicApp)\n  // UI only\n}\n```\n\n**React Query Best Practices in Dify**:\n- Define `NAME_SPACE` for query key organization\n- Use `enabled` option for conditional fetching\n- Use `select` for data transformation\n- Export invalidation hooks: `useInvalidXxx`\n\n**Dify Examples**:\n- `web/service/use-workflow.ts`\n- `web/service/use-common.ts`\n- `web/service/knowledge/use-dataset.ts`\n- `web/service/knowledge/use-document.ts`\n\n### Pattern 5: Extract Modal/Dialog Management\n\n**When**: Component manages multiple modals with complex open/close states.\n\n**Dify Convention**: Modals should be extracted with their state management.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: Multiple modal states in component\nconst AppInfo = () => {\n  const [showEditModal, setShowEditModal] = useState(false)\n  const [showDuplicateModal, setShowDuplicateModal] = useState(false)\n  const [showConfirmDelete, setShowConfirmDelete] = useState(false)\n  const [showSwitchModal, setShowSwitchModal] = useState(false)\n  const [showImportDSLModal, setShowImportDSLModal] = useState(false)\n  // 5+ more modal states...\n}\n\n// ✅ After: Extract to modal management hook\ntype ModalType = ''edit'' | ''duplicate'' | ''delete'' | ''switch'' | ''import'' | null\n\nconst useAppInfoModals = () => {\n  const [activeModal, setActiveModal] = useState<ModalType>(null)\n  \n  const openModal = useCallback((type: ModalType) => setActiveModal(type), [])\n  const closeModal = useCallback(() => setActiveModal(null), [])\n  \n  return {\n    activeModal,\n    openModal,\n    closeModal,\n    isOpen: (type: ModalType) => activeModal === type,\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 6: Extract Form Logic\n\n**When**: Complex form validation, submission handling, or field transformation.\n\n**Dify Convention**: Use `@tanstack/react-form` patterns from `web/app/components/base/form/`.\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Use existing form infrastructure\nimport { useAppForm } from ''@/app/components/base/form''\n\nconst ConfigForm = () => {\n  const form = useAppForm({\n    defaultValues: { name: '''', description: '''' },\n    onSubmit: handleSubmit,\n  })\n  \n  return <form.Provider>...</form.Provider>\n}\n```\n\n## Dify-Specific Refactoring Guidelines\n\n### 1. Context Provider Extraction\n\n**When**: Component provides complex context values with multiple states.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: Large context value object\nconst value = {\n  appId, isAPIKeySet, isTrailFinished, mode, modelModeType,\n  promptMode, isAdvancedMode, isAgent, isOpenAI, isFunctionCall,\n  // 50+ more properties...\n}\nreturn <ConfigContext.Provider value={value}>...</ConfigContext.Provider>\n\n// ✅ After: Split into domain-specific contexts\n<ModelConfigProvider value={modelConfigValue}>\n  <DatasetConfigProvider value={datasetConfigValue}>\n    <UIConfigProvider value={uiConfigValue}>\n      {children}\n    </UIConfigProvider>\n  </DatasetConfigProvider>\n</ModelConfigProvider>\n```\n\n**Dify Reference**: `web/context/` directory structure\n\n### 2. Workflow Node Components\n\n**When**: Refactoring workflow node components (`web/app/components/workflow/nodes/`).\n\n**Conventions**:\n- Keep node logic in `use-interactions.ts`\n- Extract panel UI to separate files\n- Use `_base` components for common patterns\n\n```\nnodes/<node-type>/\n  ├── index.tsx              # Node registration\n  ├── node.tsx               # Node visual component\n  ├── panel.tsx              # Configuration panel\n  ├── use-interactions.ts    # Node-specific hooks\n  └── types.ts               # Type definitions\n```\n\n### 3. Configuration Components\n\n**When**: Refactoring app configuration components.\n\n**Conventions**:\n- Separate config sections into subdirectories\n- Use existing patterns from `web/app/components/app/configuration/`\n- Keep feature toggles in dedicated components\n\n### 4. Tool/Plugin Components\n\n**When**: Refactoring tool-related components (`web/app/components/tools/`).\n\n**Conventions**:\n- Follow existing modal patterns\n- Use service hooks from `web/service/use-tools.ts`\n- Keep provider-specific logic isolated\n\n## Refactoring Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Generate Refactoring Prompt\n\n```bash\npnpm refactor-component <path>\n```\n\nThis command will:\n- Analyze component complexity and features\n- Identify specific refactoring actions needed\n- Generate a prompt for AI assistant (auto-copied to clipboard on macOS)\n- Provide detailed requirements based on detected patterns\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Details\n\n```bash\npnpm analyze-component <path> --json\n```\n\nIdentify:\n- Total complexity score\n- Max function complexity\n- Line count\n- Features detected (state, effects, API, etc.)\n\n### Step 3: Plan\n\nCreate a refactoring plan based on detected features:\n\n| Detected Feature | Refactoring Action |\n|------------------|-------------------|\n| `hasState: true` + `hasEffects: true` | Extract custom hook |\n| `hasAPI: true` | Extract data/service hook |\n| `hasEvents: true` (many) | Extract event handlers |\n| `lineCount > 300` | Split into sub-components |\n| `maxComplexity > 50` | Simplify conditional logic |\n\n### Step 4: Execute Incrementally\n\n1. **Extract one piece at a time**\n2. **Run lint, type-check, and tests after each extraction**\n3. **Verify functionality before next step**\n\n```\nFor each extraction:\n  ┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ 1. Extract code                        │\n  │ 2. Run: pnpm lint:fix                  │\n  │ 3. Run: pnpm type-check:tsgo           │\n  │ 4. Run: pnpm test                      │\n  │ 5. Test functionality manually         │\n  │ 6. PASS? → Next extraction             │\n  │    FAIL? → Fix before continuing       │\n  └────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Step 5: Verify\n\nAfter refactoring:\n\n```bash\n# Re-run refactor command to verify improvements\npnpm refactor-component <path>\n\n# If complexity < 25 and lines < 200, you''ll see:\n# ✅ COMPONENT IS WELL-STRUCTURED\n\n# For detailed metrics:\npnpm analyze-component <path> --json\n\n# Target metrics:\n# - complexity < 50\n# - lineCount < 300\n# - maxComplexity < 30\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n### ❌ Over-Engineering\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Too many tiny hooks\nconst useButtonText = () => useState(''Click'')\nconst useButtonDisabled = () => useState(false)\nconst useButtonLoading = () => useState(false)\n\n// ✅ Cohesive hook with related state\nconst useButtonState = () => {\n  const [text, setText] = useState(''Click'')\n  const [disabled, setDisabled] = useState(false)\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false)\n  return { text, setText, disabled, setDisabled, loading, setLoading }\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Breaking Existing Patterns\n\n- Follow existing directory structures\n- Maintain naming conventions\n- Preserve export patterns for compatibility\n\n### ❌ Premature Abstraction\n\n- Only extract when there''s clear complexity benefit\n- Don''t create abstractions for single-use code\n- Keep refactored code in the same domain area\n\n## References\n\n### Dify Codebase Examples\n\n- **Hook extraction**: `web/app/components/app/configuration/hooks/`\n- **Component splitting**: `web/app/components/app/configuration/`\n- **Service hooks**: `web/service/use-*.ts`\n- **Workflow patterns**: `web/app/components/workflow/hooks/`\n- **Form patterns**: `web/app/components/base/form/`\n\n### Related Skills\n\n- `frontend-testing` - For testing refactored components\n- `web/docs/test.md` - Testing specification\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:39:05.545Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React component optimization and refactoring capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React 组件优化和重构能力的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度なReactコンポーネントの最適化とリファクタリング能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 React 컴포넌트 최적화 및 리팩토링 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización y refactorización de componentes React.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation et de refactoring de composants React.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte React-Komponenten-Optimierungs- und Refactoring-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização e refatoração de componentes React.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности оптимизации и рефакторинга компонентов React.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين وتحديث مكونات React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to refactor high-complexity React components using patterns and workflows, with metrics analysis via `pnpm analyze-component`, facilitating efficient codebase maintenance and optimization with protocols like `refactor-component` and `analyze-component` commands.","zh":"使代理能够使用模式和工作流重构高复杂度的React组件，并通过`pnpm analyze-component`进行指标分析，从而通过诸如`refactor-component`和`analyze-component`命令的协议实现高效的代码库维护和优化。","ja":"エージェントがパターンとワークフローを使用して高複雑度のReactコンポーネントをリファクタリングし、`pnpm analyze-component`を介したメトリクス分析を実行できるようにし、`refactor-component`および`analyze-component`コマンドなどのプロトコルを使用して効率的なコードベースの維持と最適化を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 패턴과 워크플로를 사용하여 높은 복잡도의 React 컴포넌트를 리팩토링하고 `pnpm analyze-component`를 통해 메트릭스 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 하여 `refactor-component` 및 `analyze-component` 명령과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 효율적인 코드베이스 유지 및 최적화를实现합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a refactorizar componentes React de alta complejidad utilizando patrones y flujos de trabajo, con análisis de métricas a través de `pnpm analyze-component`, lo que facilita el mantenimiento y la optimización eficientes del código con protocolos como los comandos `refactor-component` y `analyze-component`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de refactoriser des composants React à complexité élevée en utilisant des modèles et des flux de travail, avec analyse des métriques via `pnpm analyze-component`, facilitant ainsi la maintenance et l''optimisation efficientes du code avec des protocoles tels que les commandes `refactor-component` et `analyze-component`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, React-Komponenten mit hoher Komplexität mithilfe von Mustern und Workflows zu refactorizen, mit Metrikanalyse über `pnpm analyze-component`, wodurch eine effiziente Codebasis-Wartung und -Optimierung mit Protokollen wie `refactor-component`- und `analyze-component`-Befehlen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a refatorar componentes React de alta complexidade usando padrões e fluxos de trabalho, com análise de métricas via `pnpm analyze-component`, facilitando a manutenção e otimização eficientes do código com protocolos como comandos `refactor-component` e `analyze-component`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью рефакторинга компонентов React с высокой сложностью, используя шаблоны и рабочие процессы, с анализом метрик через `pnpm analyze-component`, облегчая эффективное обслуживание и оптимизацию кода с протоколами, такими как команды `refactor-component` и `analyze-component`.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إعادة هيكلة مكونات React معقدة باستخدام أنماط وسلاسل عمل، مع تحليل المقاييس عبر `pnpm analyze-component`، مما يسهل صيانة وتحسين الكود الفعال مع بروتوكولات مثل أوامر `refactor-component` و `analyze-component`."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring complex React components with complexity > 50","Analyzing component metrics for testing and optimization","Streamlining Dify frontend codebase workflow development"],"zh":["复杂度 > 50 的 React 组件重构","测试和优化的组件指标分析","Dify 前端代码库工作流开发的简化"],"ja":["複雑度 > 50 のReactコンポーネントのリファクタリング","テストと最適化のコンポーネントメトリクス分析","Difyフロントエンドコードベースのワークフロ開発の簡素化"],"ko":["복잡도 > 50인 React 컴포넌트 리팩토링","테스트 및 최적화 위한 컴포넌트 메트릭스 분석","Dify 프론트엔드 코드베이스 워크플로 개발의 간소화"],"es":["Refactorización de componentes React complejos con una complejidad > 50","Análisis de métricas de componentes para pruebas y optimización","Optimización del flujo de trabajo de desarrollo de la base de código frontend de Dify"],"fr":["Refactorisation de composants React complexes avec une complexité > 50","Analyse des métriques de composants pour les tests et l''optimisation","Optimisation du flux de travail de développement de la base de code frontend de Dify"],"de":["Refactoring komplexer React-Komponenten mit einer Komplexität > 50","Analyse von Komponentenmetriken für Tests und Optimierung","Optimierung des Workflow-Entwicklungsprozesses der Dify-Frontend-Codebasis"],"pt":["Refatorar componentes React complexos com complexidade > 50","Analizar métricas de componentes para teste e otimização","Otimizar o fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento da base de código Dify frontend"],"ru":["Рефакторинг сложных компонентов React с сложностью > 50","Анализ метрик компонентов для тестирования и оптимизации","Оптимизация рабочего процесса разработки базы кода Dify frontend"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة مكونات React معقدة مع معقدة > 50","تحليل مقاييس المكونات للاختبار والتحسين","تحسين سير عمل تطوير قاعدة الكود الأمامية Dify"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `pnpm` installation","React components only","Complexity threshold > 50 for refactoring"],"zh":["需要 `pnpm` 安装","仅限 React 组件","复杂度阈值 > 50 的重构"],"ja":["`pnpm`のインストールが必要","Reactコンポーネントのみ","複雑度のしきい値 > 50 のリファクタリング"],"ko":["`pnpm` 설치 필요","React 컴포넌트만","복잡도 임계값 > 50의 리팩토링"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de `pnpm`","Solo componentes React","Umbral de complejidad > 50 para refactorizar"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de `pnpm`","Composants React uniquement","Seuil de complexité > 50 pour le refactoring"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von `pnpm`","Nur React-Komponenten","Komplexitätsschwelle > 50 für Refactoring"],"pt":["Requer instalação do `pnpm`","Apenas componentes React","Limiar de complexidade > 50 para refatoração"],"ru":["Требуется установка `pnpm`","Только компоненты React","Порог сложности > 50 для рефакторинга"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت `pnpm`","مكونات React فقط","عتبة معقدة > 50 لإعادة الهيكلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":100}');
