h verbessern","pt":"Commits: Padrão de Mensagens para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Коммиты: Стандартные Сообщения для Разработчиков","ar":"التزامات: معايير الرسائل للمطورين","en":"commits"},"description":{"zh":"Commits 格式指南为 IntelliJ IDEA 和 IntelliJ Platform 提供了生产和非生产变更的提交消息格式要求。","ja":"Commits 形式ガイドでは、IntelliJ IDEA および IntelliJ Platform の生産および非生産変更のコミット メッセージの形式要件を提供します。","ko":"Commits 형식 안내서는 IntelliJ IDEA 및 IntelliJ Platform의 생산 및 비생산 변경에 대한 커밋 메시지 형식 요구 사항을 제공합니다.","es":"SafePush valida los mensajes de commit antes de permitir fusiones, mejorando la calidad del código en IntelliJ IDEA y Platform.","fr":"SafePush valide les messages de commit avant de permettre les fusions, améliorant ainsi la qualité du code dans IntelliJ IDEA et Platform.","de":"SafePush validiert Commit-Messages vor der Merge-Freigabe, um die Code-Qualität in IntelliJ IDEA und Platform zu verbessern.","pt":"O formato de commit padrão é crucial para desenvolvedores em IntelliJ IDEA e Platform, garantindo a validação de mensagens e a eficiência do processo de dese...","ru":"Стандартный формат коммитов имеет решающее значение для разработчиков в IntelliJ IDEA и Platform, обеспечивающий проверку сообщений и эффективность процесса ...","ar":"معيار رسائل الالتزام هو أمر بالغ الأهمية للمطورين في IntelliJ IDEA و Platform، حيث يضمن التحقق من الرسائل وفعالية عملية التطوير","en":"IntelliJ IDEA & IntelliJ Platform"},"definition":{"en":"IntelliJ IDEA & IntelliJ Platform"},"features":{"zh":["生产变更提交消息格式要求","非生产变更提交消息格式要求","允许使用的标签（cleanup、refactor、docs、tests、test）","提交消息格式验证","CI 资源的节约"],"ja":["生産変更のコミット メッセージ形式要件","非生産変更のコミット メッセージ形式要件","使用可能なラベル（cleanup、refactor、docs、tests、test）","コミット メッセージ形式の検証","CI リソースの節約"],"ko":["생산 변경의 커밋 메시지 형식 요구 사항","비생산 변경의 커밋 메시지 형식 요구 사항","사용 가능한 레이블（cleanup、refactor、docs、tests、test）","커밋 메시지 형식 검증","CI 리소스의 절약"],"es":["Validación de mensajes de commit","Formato específico para cambios de producción y no producción","Etiquetas permitidas para cambios no producción","Integración con IntelliJ IDEA y Platform","Mejora de la calidad del código","Reducción de errores de CI"],"fr":["Validation des messages de commit","Format spécifique pour les modifications de production et de non-production","Étiquettes autorisées pour les modifications de non-production","Intégration avec IntelliJ IDEA et Platform","Amélioration de la qualité du code","Réduction des erreurs de CI"],"de":["Validierung von Commit-Messages","Spezifisches Format für Produktions- und Nicht-Produktionsänderungen","Erlaubte Labels für Nicht-Produktionsänderungen","Integration mit IntelliJ IDEA und Platform","Verbesserung der Code-Qualität","Reduzierung von CI-Fehlern"],"pt":["Validação de mensagens de commit","Formato padrão para produção e não produção","Uso de rótulos para categorizar alterações","Exemplos de mensagens de commit válidas","Integração com IntelliJ IDEA e Platform"],"ru":["Проверка сообщений коммитов","Стандартный формат для производства и не производства","Использование меток для категоризации изменений","Примеры допустимых сообщений коммитов","Интеграция с IntelliJ IDEA и Platform"],"ar":["التحقق من رسائل الالتزام","معيار الشكل للانتاج و غير الانتاج","استخدام العلامات لتصنيف التغييرات","أمثلة على رسائل الالتزام الصالحة","التكامل مع IntelliJ IDEA و Platform"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Commits 格式","IntelliJ IDEA","IntelliJ Platform","代码提交","提交消息格式","CI 资源节约"],"ja":["Commits 形式","IntelliJ IDEA","IntelliJ Platform","コード提出","コミット メッセージ形式","CI リソース節約"],"ko":["Commits 형식","IntelliJ IDEA","IntelliJ Platform","코드 제출","커밋 메시지 형식","CI 리소스 절약"],"es":["commits","SafePush","IntelliJ IDEA","IntelliJ Platform","calidad del código","validación de commits","formato de commits","etiquetas de commits","integración con CI"],"fr":["commits","SafePush","IntelliJ IDEA","IntelliJ Platform","qualité du code","validation des commits","format des commits","étiquettes de commits","intégration avec CI"],"de":["Commits","SafePush","IntelliJ IDEA","IntelliJ Platform","Code-Qualität","Commit-Validierung","Commit-Format","Commit-Labels","Integration mit CI"],"pt":["commits","formato de commit","intellij idea","intellij platform","desenvolvimento de software","validação de mensagens","rótulos de commit","produção de software"],"ru":["коммиты","формат коммитов","intellij idea","intellij platform","разработка программного обеспечения","проверка сообщений","метки коммитов","производство программного обеспечения"],"ar":["التزامات","معيار الرسائل","intellij idea","intellij platform","تطوير البرمجيات","التحقق من الرسائل","علمات الالتزام","انتاج البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"JetBrains","repo":"intellij-community","repoPath":"JetBrains/intellij-community","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commits","description":"Commit message format and conventions for IntelliJ repository. Use when creating git commits.","bodyPreview":"# Commits\n\n> **CRITICAL:** SafePush/Patronus validates commit messages BEFORE allowing merges.\n> Invalid format = robot failure (wastes 30-60 seconds + CI resources).\n\n## Required Format\n\n- **Production changes**: `<YouTrack ticket ID> <subsystem>: <subject>`\n  - Example: `IDEA-125730 Groovy: declare explicit type`\n- **Non-production changes**: `<label> <subsystem>: <subject>`\n  - Example: `cleanup webstorm: remove old test code`\n  - Allowed labels: `cleanup`, `refactor`, `docs`, `tests`, `test`","body":"# Commits\n\n> **CRITICAL:** SafePush/Patronus validates commit messages BEFORE allowing merges.\n> Invalid format = robot failure (wastes 30-60 seconds + CI resources).\n\n## Required Format\n\n- **Production changes**: `<YouTrack ticket ID> <subsystem>: <subject>`\n  - Example: `IDEA-125730 Groovy: declare explicit type`\n- **Non-production changes**: `<label> <subsystem>: <subject>`\n  - Example: `cleanup webstorm: remove old test code`\n  - Allowed labels: `cleanup`, `refactor`, `docs`, `tests`, `test`, `format`, `style`, `typo`, `setup`, `misc`\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**Conventional commit format** (NOT valid for IntelliJ):\n- `fix(test): Fix JUnit 5 migration` - Wrong format\n- `feat(editor): Add new feature` - Wrong format\n\n**Correct format:**\n- `test cidr: migrate to JUnit 5` - Use non-production label\n- `IJPL-12345 editor: add new feature` - Use YouTrack ticket\n\n**Missing subsystem:**\n- `IJPL-123 fix the bug` - Missing subsystem before colon\n- `IJPL-123 editor: fix the bug` - Correct\n\n## Restrictions\n\n- Commits starting with `WIP`, `fixup!`, `squash!`, or `amend!` are not allowed\n- Isolate commits: do not mix refactoring with business logic changes\n\n## Safe Push\n\n- **ALWAYS specify target branch:** `./safePush.cmd HEAD:master`\n- **NEVER use default:** `./safePush.cmd` ← Will fail (uses current branch name)\n\n## Full Documentation\n\n- [Commit Message Format (comprehensive)](../../docs/IntelliJ-Platform/0_Intro/2_Commits.md)\n- [Online: YouTrack Article IJPL-A-217](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/articles/IJPL-A-217/Commits)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:39:24.603Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing standardized commit message validation and formatting.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交消息验证和格式化的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが標準化されたコミットメッセージの検証とフォーマットが必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 메시지 유효성 검사 및 형식이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una validación y formato de mensajes de confirmación estandarizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une validation et un formatage de messages de commit standardisés.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine standardisierte Validierung und Formatierung von Commit-Mitteilungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de validação e formatação de mensagens de compromisso padronizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, требующих стандартизированной проверки и форматирования сообщений о фиксации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق والتنسيق الموحد لرسائل الالتزام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce consistent commit message formats using YouTrack ticket IDs and specific labels like ''cleanup'', ''refactor'', ''docs'', ''tests'', and ''test'', ensuring SafePush/Patronus validation and reducing robot failures and CI resource waste.","zh":"赋予代理人使用YouTrack票据ID和特定标签（如''cleanup''、''refactor''、''docs''、''tests''和''test''）执行一致的提交消息格式，从而确保SafePush/Patronus验证并减少机器人故障和CI资源浪费。","ja":"YouTrackのチケットIDと特定のラベル（''cleanup''、''refactor''、''docs''、''tests''、''test''など）を使用して一貫したコミットメッセージのフォーマットを強制することで、エージェントに権限を付与し、SafePush/Patronusの検証を確実にし、ロボットの故障とCIリソースの浪費を減らします。","ko":"YouTrack 티켓 ID 및 특정 레이블(''cleanup'', ''refactor'', ''docs'', ''tests'', ''test'' 등)을 사용하여 일관된 커밋 메시지 형식을 적용하여 에이전트를 강화하고 SafePush/Patronus 검증을 보장하며 로봇 오류와 CI 리소스 낭비를 줄입니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar formatos de mensajes de commit coherentes utilizando IDs de tickets de YouTrack y etiquetas específicas como ''cleanup'', ''refactor'', ''docs'', ''tests'' y ''test'', lo que garantiza la validación de SafePush/Patronus y reduce los fallos del robot y el desperdicio de recursos de CI.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des formats de messages de commit cohérents en utilisant des IDs de tickets YouTrack et des libellés spécifiques tels que ''cleanup'', ''refactor'', ''docs'', ''tests'' et ''test'', garantissant ainsi la validation SafePush/Patronus et réduisant les défaillances des robots et le gaspillage des ressources CI.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konsistente Commit-Mitteilungsformate unter Verwendung von YouTrack-Ticket-IDs und bestimmten Labels wie ''cleanup'', ''refactor'', ''docs'', ''tests'' und ''test'' durchzusetzen, was die SafePush/Patronus-Validierung sicherstellt und Roboterfehler und CI-Ressourcenverschwendung reduziert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor formatos de mensagem de compromisso consistentes usando IDs de bilhete do YouTrack e rótulos específicos como ''limpeza'', ''reestruturação'', ''documentação'', ''testes'' e ''teste'', garantindo a validação do SafePush/Patronus e reduzindo falhas de robô e desperdício de recursos de CI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать последовательные форматы сообщений о фиксации с помощью идентификаторов тикетов YouTrack и специальных меток, таких как ''очистка'', ''перестройка'', ''документация'', ''тесты'' и ''тест'', обеспечивая валидацию SafePush/Patronus и снижая неисправности роботов и浪费 ресурсов CI.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على فرض تنسيقات رسائل الالتزام المتسقة باستخدام معرّفات تذاكر YouTrack والملصقات المحددة مثل ''تنظيف''، ''إعادة هيكلة''، ''توثيق''، ''اختبارات'' و ''اختبار''، مما يضمن التحقق من صحة SafePush/Patronus وتقليل فشل الروبوت وتبديد موارد CI."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating commit messages against required formats","Automating commit message formatting for production changes","Generating non-production change commit messages with allowed labels"],"zh":["验证提交消息是否符合所需格式","自动为生产更改格式化提交消息","为非生产更改生成允许的标签的提交消息"],"ja":["必要なフォーマットに従ったコミットメッセージの検証","プロダクション変更のコミットメッセージの自動フォーマット","非プロダクション変更のコミットメッセージの生成（許可されたラベルを使用）"],"ko":["所需 형식과 일치하는 커밋 메시지의 유효성 검사","생산 변경에 대한 커밋 메시지의 자동 형식화","비생산 변경에 대한 커밋 메시지의 생성(허용된 레이블 사용)"],"es":["Validar mensajes de commit frente a formatos requeridos","Automatizar el formato de mensajes de commit para cambios de producción","Generar mensajes de commit de cambios no de producción con etiquetas permitidas"],"fr":["Valider les messages de commit par rapport aux formats requis","Automatiser le formatage des messages de commit pour les modifications de production","Générer des messages de commit de modifications non de production avec des libellés autorisés"],"de":["Commit-Mitteilungen gegen erforderliche Formate überprüfen","Commit-Mitteilungsformatierung für Produktionsänderungen automatisieren","Commit-Mitteilungen für nicht-Produktionsänderungen mit zugelassenen Labels generieren"],"pt":["Validar mensagens de compromisso contra formatos necessários","Automatizar a formatação de mensagens de compromisso para alterações de produção","Gerar mensagens de compromisso de alterações não de produção com rótulos permitidos"],"ru":["Проверка сообщений о фиксации на соответствие необходимым форматам","Автоматизация форматирования сообщений о фиксации для производственных изменений","Генерация сообщений о фиксации для не производственных изменений с разрешенными метками"],"ar":["التحقق من رسائل الالتزام مقابل التنسيقات المطلوبة","توفير تنسيق رسائل الالتزام آليًا لتحديثات الإنتاج","توليد رسائل الالتزام لتحديثات غير الإنتاج مع تسميات مسموح بها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires YouTrack ticket ID for production changes","Limited to specific allowed labels for non-production changes","IntelliJ IDEA & IntelliJ Platform compatibility required"],"zh":["生产更改需要YouTrack票据ID","非生产更改仅限于特定允许的标签","需要IntelliJ IDEA和IntelliJ Platform兼容性"],"ja":["プロダクション変更にはYouTrackのチケットIDが必要","非プロダクション変更では特定の許可されたラベルのみが使用可能","IntelliJ IDEAおよびIntelliJ Platformの互換性が必要"],"ko":["생산 변경에는 YouTrack 티켓 ID가 필요합니다","비생산 변경은 특정 허용된 레이블만 사용할 수 있습니다","IntelliJ IDEA 및 IntelliJ Platform 호환성이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere ID de ticket de YouTrack para cambios de producción","Limitado a etiquetas permitidas específicas para cambios no de producción","Compatibilidad con IntelliJ IDEA y plataforma IntelliJ requerida"],"fr":["Nécessite un ID de ticket YouTrack pour les modifications de production","Limité à des libellés spécifiques autorisés pour les modifications non de production","Compatibilité avec IntelliJ IDEA et la plateforme IntelliJ requise"],"de":["Benötigt YouTrack-Ticket-ID für Produktionsänderungen","Begrenzt auf bestimmte zugelassene Labels für Nicht-Produktionsänderungen","Kompatibilität mit IntelliJ IDEA und IntelliJ-Plattform erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer ID de bilhete do YouTrack para alterações de produção","Limitado a rótulos específicos permitidos para alterações não de produção","Compatibilidade com IntelliJ IDEA e IntelliJ Platform necessária"],"ru":["Требуется идентификатор тикета YouTrack для производственных изменений","Ограничен до специальных разрешенных меток для не производственных изменений","Требуется совместимость с IntelliJ IDEA и IntelliJ Platform"],"ar":["يتطلب معرف تذكرة YouTrack لتحديثات الإنتاج","محدود بالملصقات المسموح بها المحددة لتحديثات غير الإنتاج","متطلبات التوافق مع IntelliJ IDEA و منصة IntelliJ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('MoonshotAI/kimi-cli/codex-worker', 'community', 'MoonshotAI', 'kimi-cli', 'MoonshotAI/kimi-cli', 'codex-worker', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:39:38.100Z', NULL, '{"id":"MoonshotAI/kimi-cli/codex-worker","name":"codex-worker","description":{"zh":"codex-worker 是一个可以并行执行多个 Codex CLI 代理的工具，每个代理在自己的 git 工作树和 tmux 会话中运行","ja":"codex-worker は、複数の Codex CLI エージェントを並列実行するツールであり、各エージェントは独自の git ワークツリーと tmux セッションで実行されます","ko":"codex-worker는 여러 개의 Codex CLI 에이전트를 병렬로 실행하는 도구로, 각 에이전트는 자신의 git 작업 트리와 tmux 세션에서 실행됩니다","es":"Codex Worker es una herramienta para orquestar múltiples agentes CLI en paralelo, mejorando la eficiencia en tareas complejas","fr":"Codex Worker est un outil pour orchestrer plusieurs agents CLI en parallèle, améliorant l''efficacité dans les tâches complexes","de":"Codex Worker ist ein Tool zur Orchestrierung mehrerer CLI-Agents in Parallels, um die Effizienz bei komplexen Aufgaben zu verbessern","pt":"O codex-worker é uma ferramenta para orquestrar múltiplos agentes Codex CLI em paralelo, cada um em sua própria árvore de trabalho Git e sessão Tmux.","ru":"codex-worker - это инструмент для оркестрации нескольких агентов Codex CLI в параллели, каждый в своей собственной рабочей области Git и сессии Tmux.","ar":"codex-worker هو أداة لتنسيق العديد من وكلاء Codex CLI بشكل متوازي، كل واحد في شجرة العمل الخاصة به في Git وجلسة Tmux.","en":"Kimi Code CLI is your next CLI agent."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"codex-worker 并行执行 CLI 代理","ja":"codex-worker: CLI エージェントの並列実行","ko":"codex-worker: CLI 에이전트의 병렬 실행","es":"Codex Worker: Orquestación de Tareas en Paralelo","fr":"Codex Worker : Orchestration de Tâches en Parallèle","de":"Codex Worker: Aufgaben-Orchestrierung in Parallels","pt":"codex-worker: Orquestração de Tarefas em Paralelo","ru":"codex-worker: Оркестрация параллельных задач","ar":"codex-worker: تنسيق المهام المتوازية","en":"codex-worker"},"description":{"zh":"codex-worker 是一个可以并行执行多个 Codex CLI 代理的工具，每个代理在自己的 git 工作树和 tmux 会话中运行","ja":"codex-worker は、複数の Codex CLI エージェントを並列実行するツールであり、各エージェントは独自の git ワークツリーと tmux セッションで実行されます","ko":"codex-worker는 여러 개의 Codex CLI 에이전트를 병렬로 실행하는 도구로, 각 에이전트는 자신의 git 작업 트리와 tmux 세션에서 실행됩니다","es":"Codex Worker es una herramienta para orquestar múltiples agentes CLI en paralelo, mejorando la eficiencia en tareas complejas","fr":"Codex Worker est un outil pour orchestrer plusieurs agents CLI en parallèle, améliorant l''efficacité dans les tâches complexes","de":"Codex Worker ist ein Tool zur Orchestrierung mehrerer CLI-Agents in Parallels, um die Effizienz bei komplexen Aufgaben zu verbessern","pt":"O codex-worker é uma ferramenta para orquestrar múltiplos agentes Codex CLI em paralelo, cada um em sua própria árvore de trabalho Git e sessão Tmux.","ru":"codex-worker - это инструмент для оркестрации нескольких агентов Codex CLI в параллели, каждый в своей собственной рабочей области Git и сессии Tmux.","ar":"codex-worker هو أداة لتنسيق العديد من وكلاء Codex CLI بشكل متوازي، كل واحد في شجرة العمل الخاصة به في Git وجلسة Tmux.","en":"Kimi Code CLI is your next CLI agent."},"definition":{"en":"Kimi Code CLI is your next CLI agent."},"features":{"zh":["并行执行多个 Codex CLI 代理","每个代理在自己的 git 工作树中运行","每个代理在自己的 tmux 会话中运行","提高任务处理效率","支持多个任务的并行执行"],"ja":["複数の Codex CLI エージェントを並列実行","各エージェントは独自の git ワークツリーで実行","各エージェントは独自の tmux セッションで実行","タスク処理の効率を向上","複数のタスクの並列実行をサポート"],"ko":["여러 개의 Codex CLI 에이전트를 병렬로 실행","각 에이전트는 자신의 git 작업 트리에서 실행","각 에이전트는 자신의 tmux 세션에서 실행","작업 처리 효율을 향상","여러 개의 작업의 병렬 실행을 지원"],"es":["Orquestación de tareas en paralelo","Ejecución de múltiples agentes CLI","Integración con git worktree y tmux","División de tareas en subprocesos independientes","Mejora de la eficiencia en tareas complejas"],"fr":["Orchestration de tâches en parallèle","Exécution de plusieurs agents CLI","Intégration avec git worktree et tmux","Division des tâches en sous-processus indépendants","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans les tâches complexes"],"de":["Orchestrierung von Aufgaben in Parallels","Ausführung mehrerer CLI-Agents","Integration mit git worktree und tmux","Aufteilung von Aufgaben in unabhängige Subprozesse","Verbesserung der Effizienz bei komplexen Aufgaben"],"pt":["Orquestração de múltiplos agentes Codex CLI","Execução em paralelo de subtarefas independentes","Integração com Git e Tmux","Divisão automática de tarefas em subtarefas","Melhoria da eficiência e produtividade"],"ru":["Оркестрация нескольких агентов Codex CLI","Параллельное выполнение независимых подзадач","Интеграция с Git и Tmux","Автоматическое разделение задач на подзадачи","Повышение эффективности и производительности"],"ar":["تنسيق العديد من وكلاء Codex CLI","تنفيذ متوازي للمهام المستقلة","التكامل مع Git و Tmux","تقسيم تلقائي للمهام إلى مهام فرعية","تحسين الكفاءة والإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["codex-worker","CLI 代理","并行执行","git 工作树","tmux 会话","任务处理效率","多任务并行执行"],"ja":["codex-worker","CLI エージェント","並列実行","git ワークツリー","tmux セッション","タスク処理の効率","複数のタスクの並列実行"],"ko":["codex-worker","CLI 에이전트","병렬 실행","git 작업 트리","tmux 세션","작업 처리 효율","여러 개의 작업의 병렬 실행"],"es":["codex worker","orquestación de tareas","agentes CLI","paralelismo","git worktree","tmux","desarrollo de software","eficiencia en tareas"],"fr":["codex worker","orchestration de tâches","agents CLI","parallélisme","git worktree","tmux","développement de logiciels","efficacité dans les tâches"],"de":["codex worker","orchestrierung von aufgaben","CLI-agents","parallels","git worktree","tmux","software-entwicklung","effizienz bei aufgaben"],"pt":["codex-worker","orquestração de tarefas","execução em paralelo","subtarefas independentes","Git","Tmux","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade","eficiência"],"ru":["codex-worker","оркестрация задач","параллельное выполнение","независимые подзадачи","Git","Tmux","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность","эффективность"],"ar":["codex-worker","تنسيق المهام","تنفيذ متوازي","مهام مستقلة","Git","Tmux","تطوير البرمجيات","الإنتاجية","الكفاءة"]}},"owner":"MoonshotAI","repo":"kimi-cli","repoPath":"MoonshotAI/kimi-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"codex-worker","description":"Spawn and manage multiple Codex CLI agents via tmux to work on tasks in parallel. Use whenever a task can be decomposed into independent subtasks (e.g. batch triage, parallel fixes, multi-file refactors). When codex and tmux are available, prefer this over the built-in Task tool for parallelism.","bodyPreview":"# codex-worker\n\nOrchestrate multiple Codex CLI (`codex`) agents running in parallel, each in its\nown git worktree and tmux session.\n\n**When to use:** Whenever you identify that a task can be split into independent\nsubtasks — don''t wait for the user to ask for parallelism. Examples:\n- User says \"triage all open issues updated in the last 7 days\" → fetch the\n  issue list, then spawn one codex worker per issue.\n- User says \"refactor these 5 modules\" → one worker per module.\n- User says \"fix lint er","body":"# codex-worker\n\nOrchestrate multiple Codex CLI (`codex`) agents running in parallel, each in its\nown git worktree and tmux session.\n\n**When to use:** Whenever you identify that a task can be split into independent\nsubtasks — don''t wait for the user to ask for parallelism. Examples:\n- User says \"triage all open issues updated in the last 7 days\" → fetch the\n  issue list, then spawn one codex worker per issue.\n- User says \"refactor these 5 modules\" → one worker per module.\n- User says \"fix lint errors across packages\" → one worker per package.\n\n**Replaces Task tool:** When `codex` and `tmux` are available in the\nenvironment, use codex workers instead of the built-in Task (subagent) tool.\nCodex workers are full-featured agents with their own file system access, shell,\nand isolated worktree — far more capable than subagents.\n\n## Preflight check\n\n```bash\ncommand -v codex && codex login status && command -v tmux\n```\n\nAll three must succeed. The project must be a git repository.\n\n## Naming convention\n\nGit branch and worktree directory share a **task name**:\n\n```\n<type>-<issue number (optional)>-<short description>\n```\n\nThe tmux session adds a `codex-worker-` prefix so workers are easy to filter:\n\n| | Format | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| Task name | `<type>-<number>-<desc>` | `issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign` |\n| Git branch | same as task name | `issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign` |\n| Worktree dir | `<project>.worktrees/<task>` | `kimi-cli.worktrees/issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign` |\n| tmux session | `codex-worker-<task>` | `codex-worker-issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign` |\n\nMore examples:\n- `issue-518-mcp-config-isolation`\n- `fix-share-dir-skills-path`\n- `feat-ask-user-tool`\n- `refactor-jinja-templates`\n\nList only codex workers: `tmux ls | grep ^codex-worker-`\n\n## Usage\n\nPrefer tmux + interactive codex for all tasks. It supports multi-turn dialogue,\nthe user can `tmux attach` to inspect or intervene, and you can send follow-up\nprompts from outside.\n\n### Spawn a worker\n\n```bash\nNAME=\"issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign\"        # task name\nSESSION=\"codex-worker-$NAME\"               # tmux session name\nPROJECT_DIR=\"$(pwd)\"\nWORKTREE_DIR=\"$PROJECT_DIR.worktrees\"\n\n# 1. Create worktree (skip if exists)\ngit worktree add \"$WORKTREE_DIR/$NAME\" -b \"$NAME\" main 2>/dev/null\n\n# 2. Launch interactive codex inside tmux\ntmux new-session -d -s \"$SESSION\" -x 200 -y 50 \\\n  \"cd $WORKTREE_DIR/$NAME && codex --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox\"\n```\n\n### Send a prompt\n\nThe Codex TUI needs time to initialize before it accepts input.\nAfter launching a session, **wait at least 5 seconds** before sending\na prompt. Then send the text followed by `Enter`. If the prompt stays\nin the input field without being submitted, send an additional `Enter`.\n\n```bash\nsleep 5  # wait for Codex TUI to initialize\ntmux send-keys -t \"$SESSION\" \"Your prompt here\" Enter\n# If it doesn''t submit, send another Enter:\n# tmux send-keys -t \"$SESSION\" Enter\n```\n\n### Peek at output\n\n```bash\ntmux capture-pane -t \"$SESSION\" -p | tail -30\n```\n\n### Attach for hands-on interaction\n\n```bash\ntmux attach -t \"$SESSION\"\n```\n\n### Parallel fan-out\n\n```bash\nTASKS=(\n  \"issue-518-mcp-config-isolation|Triage #518: MCP config 被子 agent 继承的隔离问题。分析根因，给出修复方案。\"\n  \"issue-836-prompt-dollar-sign|Triage #836: prompt 包含 $ 时启动静默失败。分析根因，给出修复方案。\"\n)\n\nPROJECT_DIR=\"$(pwd)\"\nWORKTREE_DIR=\"$PROJECT_DIR.worktrees\"\n\nfor entry in \"${TASKS[@]}\"; do\n  NAME=\"${entry%%|*}\"\n  PROMPT=\"${entry#*|}\"\n  SESSION=\"codex-worker-$NAME\"\n  git worktree add \"$WORKTREE_DIR/$NAME\" -b \"$NAME\" main 2>/dev/null\n  tmux new-session -d -s \"$SESSION\" -x 200 -y 50 \\\n    \"cd $WORKTREE_DIR/$NAME && codex --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox\"\n  sleep 5  # wait for Codex TUI to fully initialize\n  tmux send-keys -t \"$SESSION\" \"$PROMPT\" Enter\ndone\n```\n\n### Fallback: `codex exec`\n\nOnly use `codex exec` when you explicitly don''t need follow-up (e.g. CI, pure\nanalysis with `-o` output). It does not support multi-turn dialogue.\n\n```bash\ncodex exec --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox \\\n  -o \"/tmp/$NAME-result.md\" \\\n  \"Your prompt here\"\n```\n\n## Lifecycle management\n\nList active workers:\n\n```bash\ntmux ls | grep ^codex-worker-\n```\n\nKill a finished worker:\n\n```bash\ntmux kill-session -t \"codex-worker-$NAME\"\n```\n\nClean up worktree after merging:\n\n```bash\ntmux kill-session -t \"codex-worker-$NAME\" 2>/dev/null\ngit worktree remove \"$WORKTREE_DIR/$NAME\"\ngit branch -d \"$NAME\"\n```\n\nBatch cleanup of dead sessions:\n\n```bash\ntmux list-sessions -F ''#{session_name}:#{pane_dead}'' \\\n  | grep '':1$'' \\\n  | cut -d: -f1 \\\n  | xargs -I{} tmux kill-session -t {}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:39:38.100Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multi-Tasking Agents needing parallel execution of independent subtasks using Codex CLI and tmux sessions.","zh":"适用于需要使用 Codex CLI 和 tmux 会话并行执行独立子任务的多任务代理。","ja":"Codex CLI と tmux セッションを使用して独立したサブタスクを並列に実行する必要があるマルチタスキング エージェントに最適。","ko":"Codex CLI와 tmux 세션을 사용하여 독립적인 서브 태스크를 병렬로 실행해야 하는 멀티 태스킹 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de multitarea que necesitan ejecución paralela de subtareas independientes utilizando Codex CLI y sesiones de tmux.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de multitâche nécessitant une exécution parallèle de sous-tâches indépendantes à l''aide de Codex CLI et de sessions tmux.","de":"Ideal für Multi-Tasking-Agents, die eine parallele Ausführung von unabhängigen Unteraufgaben mit Codex CLI und tmux-Sitzungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de multi-tarefa que necessitam de execução paralela de subtarefas independentes usando Codex CLI e sessões tmux.","ru":"Идеально для многозадачных агентов, требующих параллельного выполнения независимых подзадач с использованием Codex CLI и сеансов tmux.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتعددة المهام الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ متوازي لل görevات الفرعية المستقلة باستخدام Codex CLI و جلسات tmux."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate multiple Codex CLI agents running in parallel, each in its own git worktree and tmux session, utilizing protocols like git and leveraging libraries for task automation, thereby enhancing productivity and efficiency in tasks such as triaging issues or refactoring modules.","zh":"赋予代理同时运行多个 Codex CLI 代理的能力，每个代理在其自己的 git 工作树和 tmux 会话中运行，利用 git 等协议和任务自动化库，从而提高任务的生产力和效率，例如处理问题或重构模块。","ja":"エージェントが複数の Codex CLI エージェントを同時に実行できるようにし、それぞれが独自の git ワークツリーと tmux セッションで実行され、git などのプロトコルやタスク自動化ライブラリを利用して、問題のトリアージやモジュールのリファクタリングなどのタスクの生産性と効率を向上させる。","ko":"에이전트가 여러 개의 Codex CLI 에이전트를 동시에 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 각 에이전트가 자신의 깃 작업 트리와 tmux 세션에서 실행되며, 깃과 같은 프로토콜 및 태스크 자동화 라이브러리를 활용하여, 이슈 트리아지 또는 모듈 리팩토링과 같은 태스크의 생산성과 효율성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes orquestar múltiples agentes de Codex CLI que se ejecutan en paralelo, cada uno en su propio árbol de trabajo de git y sesión de tmux, utilizando protocolos como git y aprovechando bibliotecas para la automatización de tareas, lo que mejora la productividad y la eficiencia en tareas como la clasificación de problemas o la reestructuración de módulos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer plusieurs agents Codex CLI s''exécutant en parallèle, chacun dans son propre espace de travail git et session tmux, en utilisant des protocoles comme git et en exploitant des bibliothèques pour l''automatisation des tâches, ce qui améliore la productivité et l''efficacité dans des tâches telles que la classification des problèmes ou la réorganisation de modules.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehrere Codex-CLI-Agents auszuführen, die parallel laufen, jeweils in seinem eigenen Git-Arbeitsverzeichnis und tmux-Sitzung, indem Protokolle wie Git verwendet und Bibliotheken für die Aufgabenautomatisierung genutzt werden, wodurch die Produktivität und Effizienz bei Aufgaben wie der Klassifizierung von Problemen oder der Neustrukturierung von Modulen verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilite os agentes a orquestrar vários agentes Codex CLI em execução paralela, cada um em sua própria árvore de trabalho git e sessão tmux, utilizando protocolos como git e aproveitando bibliotecas para automação de tarefas, melhorando assim a produtividade e a eficiência em tarefas como triagem de problemas ou reestruturação de módulos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать несколько агентов Codex CLI, работающих параллельно, каждый в своей собственной рабочей области git и сеансе tmux, используя протоколы, такие как git, и использует библиотеки для автоматизации задач, тем самым повышая производительность и эффективность при выполнении задач, таких как устранение неполадок или рефакторинг модулей.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تشغيل عدة وكلاء Codex CLI في وقت واحد، كل واحد في شجرة العمل الخاصة به و جلسة tmux، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل git واستخدام مكتبات لتحسين إنتاجية وكفاءة المهام مثل فحص المشاكل أو إعادة هيكلة الوحدات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue triage for multiple open issues","Refactoring large codebases by spawning workers per module","Debugging complex workflows by executing tasks in parallel"],"zh":["自动化多个打开问题的问题分诊","通过为每个模块生成工作进程来重构大型代码库","通过并行执行任务来调试复杂的工作流"],"ja":["複数のオープン問題の問題トリアージを自動化する","モジュールごとにワーカーを生成して大規模なコードベースをリファクタリングする","タスクを並列に実行して複雑なワークフローをデバッグする"],"ko":["여러 개의 열린 문제에 대한 이슈 트리아지를 자동화하는 것","모듈별로 작업자를 생성하여 대규모 코드베이스를 리팩토링하는 것","태스크를 병렬로 실행하여 복잡한 워크플로우를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la clasificación de problemas para varios problemas abiertos","Reestructuración de grandes bases de código mediante la creación de trabajadores por módulo","Depuración de flujos de trabajo complejos mediante la ejecución de tareas en paralelo"],"fr":["Automatisation de la classification des problèmes pour plusieurs problèmes ouverts","Réorganisation de grandes bases de code en faisant apparaître des travailleurs par module","Débogage de flux de travail complexes en exécutant des tâches en parallèle"],"de":["Automatisierung der Klassifizierung von Problemen für mehrere offene Probleme","Neustrukturierung großer Codebasen durch Erzeugen von Arbeitern pro Modul","Fehlerbehebung komplexer Workflows durch parallele Ausführung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Automatizar a triagem de problemas para vários problemas abertos","Reestruturar grandes bases de código criando trabalhadores por módulo","Depurar fluxos de trabalho complexos executando tarefas em paralelo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать устранение неполадок для нескольких открытых проблем","Перестроить большие кодовые базы, создавая рабочие процессы для каждого модуля","Отладить сложные рабочие процессы, выполняя задачи параллельно"],"ar":["تأتمتة فحص المشاكل للعديد من المشاكل المفتوحة","إعادة هيكلة قواعد البيانات الكبيرة من خلال إنشاء عمال لكل وحدة","تصحيح الأعطال في عمليات العمل المعقدة من خلال تشغيل المهام بالتوازي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Codex CLI installation","Dependent on git and tmux for worktree and session management","Limited to tasks that can be split into independent subtasks"],"zh":["需要 Codex CLI 安装","依赖 git 和 tmux 进行工作树和会话管理","仅限于可以拆分为独立子任务的任务"],"ja":["Codex CLI のインストールが必要","git と tmux に依存してワークツリーとセッションを管理する","独立したサブタスクに分割できるタスクのみ"],"ko":["Codex CLI 설치가 필요합니다","깃 및 tmux에 의존하여 작업 트리 및 세션을 관리합니다","독립적인 서브 태스크로 분할할 수 있는 태스크만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Codex CLI","Dependiente de git y tmux para la gestión del árbol de trabajo y la sesión","Limitado a tareas que se pueden dividir en subtareas independientes"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Codex CLI","Dépendant de git et tmux pour la gestion de l''espace de travail et de la session","Limité aux tâches qui peuvent être divisées en sous-tâches indépendantes"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Codex CLI","Abhängig von Git und tmux für die Verwaltung des Arbeitsverzeichnisses und der Sitzung","Begrenzt auf Aufgaben, die in unabhängige Unteraufgaben unterteilt werden können"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do Codex CLI","Depende do git e tmux para gerenciamento de árvore de trabalho e sessão","Limitado a tarefas que possam ser divididas em subtarefas independentes"],"ru":["Требует установки Codex CLI","Зависит от git и tmux для управления рабочей областью и сеанса","Ограничен задачами, которые можно разделить на независимые подзадачи"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Codex CLI","يعتمد على git و tmux لإدارة شجرة العمل و الجلسة","محدود بالمهام التي يمكن تقسيمها إلى مهام فرعية مستقلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ruvnet/claude-flow/AgentDB Advanced Features', 'community', 'ruvnet', 'claude-flow', 'ruvnet/claude-flow', 'AgentDB Advanced Features', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:39:31.610Z', NULL, '{"id":"ruvnet/claude-flow/AgentDB Advanced Features","name":"AgentDB Advanced Features","description":{"zh":"AgentDB 高级功能提供了分布式系统、多数据库协调、自定义距离度量等能力，帮助开发者构建具有子毫秒级跨节点通信和高级搜索能力的 AI 系统","ja":"AgentDB の高度な機能は、分散システム、複数のデータベースの調整、カスタム距離尺度などを提供し、開発者がサブミリ秒レベルのノード間通信と高度な検索機能を持つ AI システムを構築できるようにします","ko":"AgentDB의 고급 기능은 분산 시스템, 다중 데이터베이스 조정, 사용자 정의 거리 측정 등과 같은 기능을 제공하여 개발자가 서브 밀리초 수준의 노드 간 통신 및 고급 검색 기능을 갖춘 지능형 멀티 에이전트 시스템을 구축할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"AgentDB ofrece capacidades avanzadas para sistemas distribuidos y búsqueda híbrida, permitiendo la creación de sistemas de inteligencia artificial sofisticados","fr":"AgentDB propose des fonctionnalités avancées pour les systèmes distribués et la recherche hybride, permettant la création de systèmes d''intelligence artificielle sophistiqués","de":"AgentDB bietet erweiterte Funktionen für verteilte Systeme und hybride Suche, ermöglicht die Erstellung von komplexen künstlichen Intelligenz-Systemen","pt":"O AgentDB é uma plataforma de orquestração de agentes líder para Claude, permitindo a implantação de enxames de agentes inteligentes e a coordenação de fluxos de trabalho autônomos.","ru":"AgentDB — это ведущая платформа оркестровки агентов для Claude, позволяющая развертывать интеллектуальные рои агентов и координировать автономные рабочие процессы.","ar":"AgentDB هو منصة رائدة لتنسيق الوكلاء لمنصة Claude، مما يسمح بتشغيل أسراب وكلاء ذكية وتنسيق سلاسل العمل المستقلة.","en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI systems. Features    enterprise-grade architecture, distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code support via MCP p..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AgentDB 高级功能 - 构建智能多代理系统","ja":"AgentDB Advanced Features - インテリジェントなマルチエージェントシステムを構築","ko":"AgentDB 고급 기능 - 지능형 멀티 에이전트 시스템 구축","es":"Características avanzadas de AgentDB","fr":"Fonctionnalités avancées d''AgentDB","de":"Erweiterte Funktionen von AgentDB","pt":"Recursos Avançados do AgentDB","ru":"Расширенные функции AgentDB","ar":"ميزات متقدمة من AgentDB","en":"AgentDB Advanced Features"},"description":{"zh":"AgentDB 高级功能提供了分布式系统、多数据库协调、自定义距离度量等能力，帮助开发者构建具有子毫秒级跨节点通信和高级搜索能力的 AI 系统","ja":"AgentDB の高度な機能は、分散システム、複数のデータベースの調整、カスタム距離尺度などを提供し、開発者がサブミリ秒レベルのノード間通信と高度な検索機能を持つ AI システムを構築できるようにします","ko":"AgentDB의 고급 기능은 분산 시스템, 다중 데이터베이스 조정, 사용자 정의 거리 측정 등과 같은 기능을 제공하여 개발자가 서브 밀리초 수준의 노드 간 통신 및 고급 검색 기능을 갖춘 지능형 멀티 에이전트 시스템을 구축할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"AgentDB ofrece capacidades avanzadas para sistemas distribuidos y búsqueda híbrida, permitiendo la creación de sistemas de inteligencia artificial sofisticados","fr":"AgentDB propose des fonctionnalités avancées pour les systèmes distribués et la recherche hybride, permettant la création de systèmes d''intelligence artifici...","de":"AgentDB bietet erweiterte Funktionen für verteilte Systeme und hybride Suche, ermöglicht die Erstellung von komplexen künstlichen Intelligenz-Systemen","pt":"O AgentDB é uma plataforma de orquestração de agentes líder para Claude, permitindo a implantação de enxames de agentes inteligentes e a coordenação de fluxo...","ru":"AgentDB — это ведущая платформа оркестровки агентов для Claude, позволяющая развертывать интеллектуальные рои агентов и координировать автономные рабочие про...","ar":"AgentDB هو منصة رائدة لتنسيق الوكلاء لمنصة Claude، مما يسمح بتشغيل أسراب وكلاء ذكية وتنسيق سلاسل العمل المستقلة.","en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI s..."},"definition":{"en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI systems. Features    enterprise-grade architecture, distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code support via MCP protocol. Ranked #1 in agent-based frameworks."},"features":{"zh":["分布式系统","多数据库协调","自定义距离度量","混合搜索（向量 + 元数据）","QUIC 同步","生产部署模式"],"ja":["分散システム","複数のデータベースの調整","カスタム距離尺度","ハイブリッド検索（ベクトル + メタデータ）","QUIC 同期","生産デプロイパターン"],"ko":["분산 시스템","다중 데이터베이스 조정","사용자 정의 거리 측정","하이브리드 검색（벡터 + 메타데이터）","QUIC 동기화","생산 배포 패턴"],"es":["Sistemas distribuidos","Búsqueda híbrida","Métricas de distancia personalizadas","Sincronización QUIC","Despliegue de producción"],"fr":["Systèmes distribués","Recherche hybride","Métriques de distance personnalisées","Synchronisation QUIC","Déploiement de production"],"de":["Verteilte Systeme","Hybride Suche","Benutzerdefinierte Distanzmetriken","QUIC-Synchronisation","Produktionsbereitstellung"],"pt":["Arquitetura de nível empresarial","Inteligência de enxame distribuída","Integração com RAG","Suporte nativo a Claude Code via protocolo MCP","Comunicação entre nós em sub-milissegundos","Pesquisa híbrida com filtros"],"ru":["Корпоративная архитектура","Распределенный интеллект роев","Интеграция с RAG","Нативная поддержка Claude Code через протокол MCP","Коммуникация между узлами за субмиллисекунды","Гибридный поиск с фильтрами"],"ar":["هندسة معمارية على مستوى المؤسسة","ذكاء سرب موزع","إدماج مع RAG","دعم أصلي لبرنامج Claude Code عبر بروتوكول MCP","اتصال بين العقد في أقل من ملي ثانية","بحث هجين مع مرشحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AgentDB","代理编排","分布式系统","多数据库协调","自定义距离度量","混合搜索","QUIC 同步","生产部署模式","AI 系统"],"ja":["AgentDB","エージェントオーケストレーション","分散システム","複数のデータベースの調整","カスタム距離尺度","ハイブリッド検索","QUIC 同期","生産デプロイパターン","AI システム"],"ko":["AgentDB","에이전트 오케스트레이션","분산 시스템","다중 데이터베이스 조정","사용자 정의 거리 측정","하이브리드 검색","QUIC 동기화","생산 배포 패턴","AI 시스템"],"es":["AgentDB","sistemas distribuidos","búsqueda híbrida","inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de software","Node.js","QUIC","sincronización"],"fr":["AgentDB","systèmes distribués","recherche hybride","intelligence artificielle","développement de logiciels","Node.js","QUIC","synchronisation"],"de":["AgentDB","verteilte Systeme","hybride Suche","künstliche Intelligenz","Softwareentwicklung","Node.js","QUIC","Synchronisation"],"pt":["AgentDB","orquestração de agentes","sistemas de IA","inteligência artificial","desenvolvimento de software","plataforma de orquestração","Claude","RAG","MCP","comunicação entre nós"],"ru":["AgentDB","оркестровка агентов","системы ИИ","искусственный интеллект","разработка программного обеспечения","платформа оркестровки","Claude","RAG","MCP","коммуникация между узлами"],"ar":["AgentDB","تنسيق الوكلاء","أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","منصة التنسيق","Claude","RAG","MCP","اتصال بين العقد"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"claude-flow","repoPath":"ruvnet/claude-flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"AgentDB Advanced Features","description":"Master advanced AgentDB features including QUIC synchronization, multi-database management, custom distance metrics, hybrid search, and distributed systems integration. Use when building distributed AI systems, multi-agent coordination, or advanced vector search applications.","bodyPreview":"# AgentDB Advanced Features\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nCovers advanced AgentDB capabilities for distributed systems, multi-database coordination, custom distance metrics, hybrid search (vector + metadata), QUIC synchronization, and production deployment patterns. Enables building sophisticated AI systems with sub-millisecond cross-node communication and advanced search capabilities.\n\n**Performance**: <1ms QUIC sync, hybrid search with filters, custom distance metrics.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js","body":"# AgentDB Advanced Features\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nCovers advanced AgentDB capabilities for distributed systems, multi-database coordination, custom distance metrics, hybrid search (vector + metadata), QUIC synchronization, and production deployment patterns. Enables building sophisticated AI systems with sub-millisecond cross-node communication and advanced search capabilities.\n\n**Performance**: <1ms QUIC sync, hybrid search with filters, custom distance metrics.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js 18+\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow)\n- Understanding of distributed systems (for QUIC sync)\n- Vector search fundamentals\n\n---\n\n## QUIC Synchronization\n\n### What is QUIC Sync?\n\nQUIC (Quick UDP Internet Connections) enables sub-millisecond latency synchronization between AgentDB instances across network boundaries with automatic retry, multiplexing, and encryption.\n\n**Benefits**:\n- <1ms latency between nodes\n- Multiplexed streams (multiple operations simultaneously)\n- Built-in encryption (TLS 1.3)\n- Automatic retry and recovery\n- Event-based broadcasting\n\n### Enable QUIC Sync\n\n```typescript\nimport { createAgentDBAdapter } from ''agentic-flow$reasoningbank'';\n\n// Initialize with QUIC synchronization\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb$distributed.db'',\n  enableQUICSync: true,\n  syncPort: 4433,\n  syncPeers: [\n    ''192.168.1.10:4433'',\n    ''192.168.1.11:4433'',\n    ''192.168.1.12:4433'',\n  ],\n});\n\n// Patterns automatically sync across all peers\nawait adapter.insertPattern({\n  // ... pattern data\n});\n\n// Available on all peers within ~1ms\n```\n\n### QUIC Configuration\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  enableQUICSync: true,\n  syncPort: 4433,              // QUIC server port\n  syncPeers: [''host1:4433''],   // Peer addresses\n  syncInterval: 1000,          // Sync interval (ms)\n  syncBatchSize: 100,          // Patterns per batch\n  maxRetries: 3,               // Retry failed syncs\n  compression: true,           // Enable compression\n});\n```\n\n### Multi-Node Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Node 1 (192.168.1.10)\nAGENTDB_QUIC_SYNC=true \\\nAGENTDB_QUIC_PORT=4433 \\\nAGENTDB_QUIC_PEERS=192.168.1.11:4433,192.168.1.12:4433 \\\nnode server.js\n\n# Node 2 (192.168.1.11)\nAGENTDB_QUIC_SYNC=true \\\nAGENTDB_QUIC_PORT=4433 \\\nAGENTDB_QUIC_PEERS=192.168.1.10:4433,192.168.1.12:4433 \\\nnode server.js\n\n# Node 3 (192.168.1.12)\nAGENTDB_QUIC_SYNC=true \\\nAGENTDB_QUIC_PORT=4433 \\\nAGENTDB_QUIC_PEERS=192.168.1.10:4433,192.168.1.11:4433 \\\nnode server.js\n```\n\n---\n\n## Distance Metrics\n\n### Cosine Similarity (Default)\n\nBest for normalized vectors, semantic similarity:\n\n```bash\n# CLI\nnpx agentdb@latest query .$vectors.db \"[0.1,0.2,...]\" -m cosine\n\n# API\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  metric: ''cosine'',\n  k: 10,\n});\n```\n\n**Use Cases**:\n- Text embeddings (BERT, GPT, etc.)\n- Semantic search\n- Document similarity\n- Most general-purpose applications\n\n**Formula**: `cos(θ) = (A · B) / (||A|| × ||B||)`\n**Range**: [-1, 1] (1 = identical, -1 = opposite)\n\n### Euclidean Distance (L2)\n\nBest for spatial data, geometric similarity:\n\n```bash\n# CLI\nnpx agentdb@latest query .$vectors.db \"[0.1,0.2,...]\" -m euclidean\n\n# API\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  metric: ''euclidean'',\n  k: 10,\n});\n```\n\n**Use Cases**:\n- Image embeddings\n- Spatial data\n- Computer vision\n- When vector magnitude matters\n\n**Formula**: `d = √(Σ(ai - bi)²)`\n**Range**: [0, ∞] (0 = identical, ∞ = very different)\n\n### Dot Product\n\nBest for pre-normalized vectors, fast computation:\n\n```bash\n# CLI\nnpx agentdb@latest query .$vectors.db \"[0.1,0.2,...]\" -m dot\n\n# API\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  metric: ''dot'',\n  k: 10,\n});\n```\n\n**Use Cases**:\n- Pre-normalized embeddings\n- Fast similarity computation\n- When vectors are already unit-length\n\n**Formula**: `dot = Σ(ai × bi)`\n**Range**: [-∞, ∞] (higher = more similar)\n\n### Custom Distance Metrics\n\n```typescript\n// Implement custom distance function\nfunction customDistance(vec1: number[], vec2: number[]): number {\n  // Weighted Euclidean distance\n  const weights = [1.0, 2.0, 1.5, ...];\n  let sum = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < vec1.length; i++) {\n    sum += weights[i] * Math.pow(vec1[i] - vec2[i], 2);\n  }\n  return Math.sqrt(sum);\n}\n\n// Use in search (requires custom implementation)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Hybrid Search (Vector + Metadata)\n\n### Basic Hybrid Search\n\nCombine vector similarity with metadata filtering:\n\n```typescript\n// Store documents with metadata\nawait adapter.insertPattern({\n  id: '''',\n  type: ''document'',\n  domain: ''research-papers'',\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\n    embedding: documentEmbedding,\n    text: documentText,\n    metadata: {\n      author: ''Jane Smith'',\n      year: 2025,\n      category: ''machine-learning'',\n      citations: 150,\n    }\n  }),\n  confidence: 1.0,\n  usage_count: 0,\n  success_count: 0,\n  created_at: Date.now(),\n  last_used: Date.now(),\n});\n\n// Hybrid search: vector similarity + metadata filters\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''research-papers'',\n  k: 20,\n  filters: {\n    year: { $gte: 2023 },          // Published 2023 or later\n    category: ''machine-learning'',   // ML papers only\n    citations: { $gte: 50 },       // Highly cited\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Advanced Filtering\n\n```typescript\n// Complex metadata queries\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''products'',\n  k: 50,\n  filters: {\n    price: { $gte: 10, $lte: 100 },      // Price range\n    category: { $in: [''electronics'', ''gadgets''] },  // Multiple categories\n    rating: { $gte: 4.0 },                // High rated\n    inStock: true,                        // Available\n    tags: { $contains: ''wireless'' },      // Has tag\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Weighted Hybrid Search\n\nCombine vector and metadata scores:\n\n```typescript\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''content'',\n  k: 20,\n  hybridWeights: {\n    vectorSimilarity: 0.7,  // 70% weight on semantic similarity\n    metadataScore: 0.3,     // 30% weight on metadata match\n  },\n  filters: {\n    category: ''technology'',\n    recency: { $gte: Date.now() - 30 * 24 * 3600000 },  // Last 30 days\n  },\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Database Management\n\n### Multiple Databases\n\n```typescript\n// Separate databases for different domains\nconst knowledgeDB = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb$knowledge.db'',\n});\n\nconst conversationDB = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb$conversations.db'',\n});\n\nconst codeDB = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb$code.db'',\n});\n\n// Use appropriate database for each task\nawait knowledgeDB.insertPattern({ /* knowledge */ });\nawait conversationDB.insertPattern({ /* conversation */ });\nawait codeDB.insertPattern({ /* code */ });\n```\n\n### Database Sharding\n\n```typescript\n// Shard by domain for horizontal scaling\nconst shards = {\n  ''domain-a'': await createAgentDBAdapter({ dbPath: ''.agentdb$shard-a.db'' }),\n  ''domain-b'': await createAgentDBAdapter({ dbPath: ''.agentdb$shard-b.db'' }),\n  ''domain-c'': await createAgentDBAdapter({ dbPath: ''.agentdb$shard-c.db'' }),\n};\n\n// Route queries to appropriate shard\nfunction getDBForDomain(domain: string) {\n  const shardKey = domain.split(''-'')[0];  // Extract shard key\n  return shards[shardKey] || shards[''domain-a''];\n}\n\n// Insert to correct shard\nconst db = getDBForDomain(''domain-a-task'');\nawait db.insertPattern({ /* ... */ });\n```\n\n---\n\n## MMR (Maximal Marginal Relevance)\n\nRetrieve diverse results to avoid redundancy:\n\n```typescript\n// Without MMR: Similar results may be redundant\nconst standardResults = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  k: 10,\n  useMMR: false,\n});\n\n// With MMR: Diverse, non-redundant results\nconst diverseResults = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  k: 10,\n  useMMR: true,\n  mmrLambda: 0.5,  // Balance relevance (0) vs diversity (1)\n});\n```\n\n**MMR Parameters**:\n- `mmrLambda = 0`: Maximum relevance (may be redundant)\n- `mmrLambda = 0.5`: Balanced (default)\n- `mmrLambda = 1`: Maximum diversity (may be less relevant)\n\n**Use Cases**:\n- Search result diversification\n- Recommendation systems\n- Avoiding echo chambers\n- Exploratory search\n\n---\n\n## Context Synthesis\n\nGenerate rich context from multiple memories:\n\n```typescript\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''problem-solving'',\n  k: 10,\n  synthesizeContext: true,  // Enable context synthesis\n});\n\n// ContextSynthesizer creates coherent narrative\nconsole.log(''Synthesized Context:'', result.context);\n// \"Based on 10 similar problem-solving attempts, the most effective\n//  approach involves: 1) analyzing root cause, 2) brainstorming solutions,\n//  3) evaluating trade-offs, 4) implementing incrementally. Success rate: 85%\"\n\nconsole.log(''Patterns:'', result.patterns);\n// Extracted common patterns across memories\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Patterns\n\n### Connection Pooling\n\n```typescript\n// Singleton pattern for shared adapter\nclass AgentDBPool {\n  private static instance: AgentDBAdapter;\n\n  static async getInstance() {\n    if (!this.instance) {\n      this.instance = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n        dbPath: ''.agentdb$production.db'',\n        quantizationType: ''scalar'',\n        cacheSize: 2000,\n      });\n    }\n    return this.instance;\n  }\n}\n\n// Use in application\nconst db = await AgentDBPool.getInstance();\nconst results = await db.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, { k: 10 });\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n\n```typescript\nasync function safeRetrieve(queryEmbedding: number[], options: any) {\n  try {\n    const result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, options);\n    return result;\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error.code === ''DIMENSION_MISMATCH'') {\n      console.error(''Query embedding dimension mismatch'');\n      // Handle dimension error\n    } else if (error.code === ''DATABASE_LOCKED'') {\n      // Retry with exponential backoff\n      await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 100));\n      return safeRetrieve(queryEmbedding, options);\n    }\n    throw error;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Monitoring and Logging\n\n```typescript\n// Performance monitoring\nconst startTime = Date.now();\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, { k: 10 });\nconst latency = Date.now() - startTime;\n\nif (latency > 100) {\n  console.warn(''Slow query detected:'', latency, ''ms'');\n}\n\n// Log statistics\nconst stats = await adapter.getStats();\nconsole.log(''Database Stats:'', {\n  totalPatterns: stats.totalPatterns,\n  dbSize: stats.dbSize,\n  cacheHitRate: stats.cacheHitRate,\n  avgSearchLatency: stats.avgSearchLatency,\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLI Advanced Operations\n\n### Database Import/Export\n\n```bash\n# Export with compression\nnpx agentdb@latest export .$vectors.db .$backup.json.gz --compress\n\n# Import from backup\nnpx agentdb@latest import .$backup.json.gz --decompress\n\n# Merge databases\nnpx agentdb@latest merge .$db1.sqlite .$db2.sqlite .$merged.sqlite\n```\n\n### Database Optimization\n\n```bash\n# Vacuum database (reclaim space)\nsqlite3 .agentdb$vectors.db \"VACUUM;\"\n\n# Analyze for query optimization\nsqlite3 .agentdb$vectors.db \"ANALYZE;\"\n\n# Rebuild indices\nnpx agentdb@latest reindex .$vectors.db\n```\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\n# AgentDB configuration\nAGENTDB_PATH=.agentdb$reasoningbank.db\nAGENTDB_ENABLED=true\n\n# Performance tuning\nAGENTDB_QUANTIZATION=binary     # binary|scalar|product|none\nAGENTDB_CACHE_SIZE=2000\nAGENTDB_HNSW_M=16\nAGENTDB_HNSW_EF=100\n\n# Learning plugins\nAGENTDB_LEARNING=true\n\n# Reasoning agents\nAGENTDB_REASONING=true\n\n# QUIC synchronization\nAGENTDB_QUIC_SYNC=true\nAGENTDB_QUIC_PORT=4433\nAGENTDB_QUIC_PEERS=host1:4433,host2:4433\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Issue: QUIC sync not working\n\n```bash\n# Check firewall allows UDP port 4433\nsudo ufw allow 4433$udp\n\n# Verify peers are reachable\nping host1\n\n# Check QUIC logs\nDEBUG=agentdb:quic node server.js\n```\n\n### Issue: Hybrid search returns no results\n\n```typescript\n// Relax filters\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  k: 100,  // Increase k\n  filters: {\n    // Remove or relax filters\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Issue: Memory consolidation too aggressive\n\n```typescript\n// Disable automatic optimization\nconst result = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  optimizeMemory: false,  // Disable auto-consolidation\n  k: 10,\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Learn More\n\n- **QUIC Protocol**: docs$quic-synchronization.pdf\n- **Hybrid Search**: docs$hybrid-search-guide.md\n- **GitHub**: https:/$github.com$ruvnet$agentic-flow$tree$main$packages$agentdb\n- **Website**: https:/$agentdb.ruv.io\n\n---\n\n**Category**: Advanced / Distributed Systems\n**Difficulty**: Advanced\n**Estimated Time**: 45-60 minutes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:39:31.610Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents requiring distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code support via MCP","zh":"适用于需要分布式集群智能、RAG集成和通过MCP支持本地Claude Code的高级AI代理","ja":"分散型スウォームインテリジェンス、RAG統合、MCPを介したネイティブClaude Codeサポートを必要とする高度なAIエージェントに最適","ko":"분산형 스웜 인텔리전스, RAG 통합, MCP를 통해 네이티브 Claude Code 지원이 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial avanzados que requieren inteligencia de enjambre distribuida, integración de RAG y soporte nativo para Claude Code a través de MCP","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle