tibilité avec Claude Code et Cursor","Mise à jour des directives de développement pour les projets","Utilisation de commandes d''intégration pour des compétences spécifiques"],"de":["Umfassendes AI-Framework und -Toolkit","Integration von Claude-Fähigkeiten in Entwicklungsrichtlinien","Verbesserung von Entwicklungsworkflows","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code und Cursor","Aktualisierung von Entwicklungsrichtlinien für Projekte","Verwendung von Integrationsbefehlen für spezifische Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Adaptação de habilidades globais de Claude","Integração em diretrizes de desenvolvimento de projetos","Utiliza o framework Claude Code e Cursor","Atualiza as diretrizes de desenvolvimento, não o código do projeto","Permite a utilização de habilidades pré-construídas"],"ru":["Адаптация глобальных навыков Claude","Интеграция в руководства по разработке проектов","Использует фреймворк Claude Code и Cursor","Обновляет руководства по разработке, не код проекта","Позволяет использовать предварительно построенные навыки"],"ar":["تعديل مهارات Claude العالمية","دمج في إرشادات تطوير المشاريع","يستخدم إطار عمل Claude Code و Cursor","يحدث إرشادات التطوير، لا رمز المشروع","يسمح باستخدام مهارات مسبقة البناء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["集成技能","Claude 全球技能","项目开发指南","开发效率","技能集成","代码生成"],"ja":["スキルの統合","Claude グローバルスキル","プロジェクトの開発ガイドライン","開発効率","スキル統合","コード生成"],"ko":["스킬 통합","클라우드 글로벌 스킬","프로젝트 개발 가이드라인","개발 효율성","스킬 통합","코드 생성"],"es":["integración de habilidades de Claude","marco de IA","herramientas de IA","desarrollo de proyectos","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","Claude Code","Cursor","integración de habilidades de IA"],"fr":["intégration de compétences de Claude","cadre d''IA","outils d''IA","développement de projets","flux de travail de développement","Claude Code","Cursor","intégration de compétences d''IA"],"de":["Integration von Claude-Fähigkeiten","AI-Framework","AI-Toolkit","Projektentwicklung","Entwicklungsworkflow","Claude Code","Cursor","Integration von KI-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["integração de skill de IA","desenvolvimento de projetos","framework Claude Code","Cursor","habilidades globais de Claude","diretrizes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["интеграция навыка ИИ","разработка проектов","фреймворк Claude Code","Cursor","глобальные навыки Claude","руководства по разработке"],"ar":["دمج مهارة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير المشاريع","إطار عمل Claude Code","Cursor","مهارات Claude العالمية","إرشادات التطوير"]}},"owner":"mindfold-ai","repo":"Trellis","repoPath":"mindfold-ai/Trellis","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"integrate-skill","description":"Integrate Claude Skill into Project Guidelines","bodyPreview":"# Integrate Claude Skill into Project Guidelines\n\nAdapt and integrate a Claude global skill into your project''s development guidelines (not directly into project code).\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/trellis:integrate-skill <skill-name>\n```\n\n**Examples**:\n```\n/trellis:integrate-skill frontend-design\n/trellis:integrate-skill mcp-builder\n```\n\n## Core Principle\n\n> [!] **Important**: The goal of skill integration is to update **development guidelines**, not to generate project code directly.\n>\n> - Guidelines conte","body":"# Integrate Claude Skill into Project Guidelines\n\nAdapt and integrate a Claude global skill into your project''s development guidelines (not directly into project code).\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/trellis:integrate-skill <skill-name>\n```\n\n**Examples**:\n```\n/trellis:integrate-skill frontend-design\n/trellis:integrate-skill mcp-builder\n```\n\n## Core Principle\n\n> [!] **Important**: The goal of skill integration is to update **development guidelines**, not to generate project code directly.\n>\n> - Guidelines content -> Write to `.trellis/spec/{target}/doc.md`\n> - Code examples -> Place in `.trellis/spec/{target}/examples/skills/<skill-name>/`\n> - Example files -> Use `.template` suffix (e.g., `component.tsx.template`) to avoid IDE errors\n>\n> Where `{target}` is `frontend` or `backend`, determined by skill type.\n\n## Execution Steps\n\n### 1. Read Skill Content\n\n```bash\nopenskills read <skill-name>\n```\n\nIf the skill doesn''t exist, prompt user to check available skills:\n```bash\n# Available skills are listed in AGENTS.md under <available_skills>\n```\n\n### 2. Determine Integration Target\n\nBased on skill type, determine which guidelines to update:\n\n| Skill Category | Integration Target |\n|----------------|-------------------|\n| UI/Frontend (`frontend-design`, `web-artifacts-builder`) | `.trellis/spec/frontend/` |\n| Backend/API (`mcp-builder`) | `.trellis/spec/backend/` |\n| Documentation (`doc-coauthoring`, `docx`, `pdf`) | `.trellis/` or create dedicated guidelines |\n| Testing (`webapp-testing`) | `.trellis/spec/frontend/` (E2E) |\n\n### 3. Analyze Skill Content\n\nExtract from the skill:\n- **Core concepts**: How the skill works and key concepts\n- **Best practices**: Recommended approaches\n- **Code patterns**: Reusable code templates\n- **Caveats**: Common issues and solutions\n\n### 4. Execute Integration\n\n#### 4.1 Update Guidelines Document\n\nAdd a new section to the corresponding `doc.md`:\n\n```markdown\n@@@section:skill-<skill-name>\n## # <Skill Name> Integration Guide\n\n### Overview\n[Core functionality and use cases of the skill]\n\n### Project Adaptation\n[How to use this skill in the current project]\n\n### Usage Steps\n1. [Step 1]\n2. [Step 2]\n\n### Caveats\n- [Project-specific constraints]\n- [Differences from default behavior]\n\n### Reference Examples\nSee `examples/skills/<skill-name>/`\n\n@@@/section:skill-<skill-name>\n```\n\n#### 4.2 Create Examples Directory (if code examples exist)\n\n```bash\n# Directory structure ({target} = frontend or backend)\n.trellis/spec/{target}/\n|-- doc.md                      # Add skill-related section\n|-- index.md                    # Update index\n+-- examples/\n    +-- skills/\n        +-- <skill-name>/\n            |-- README.md               # Example documentation\n            |-- example-1.ts.template   # Code example (use .template suffix)\n            +-- example-2.tsx.template\n```\n\n**File naming conventions**:\n- Code files: `<name>.<ext>.template` (e.g., `component.tsx.template`)\n- Config files: `<name>.config.template` (e.g., `tailwind.config.template`)\n- Documentation: `README.md` (normal suffix)\n\n#### 4.3 Update Index File\n\nAdd to the Quick Navigation table in `index.md`:\n\n```markdown\n| <Skill-related task> | <Section name> | `skill-<skill-name>` |\n```\n\n### 5. Generate Integration Report\n\n---\n\n## Skill Integration Report: `<skill-name>`\n\n### # Overview\n- **Skill description**: [Functionality description]\n- **Integration target**: `.trellis/spec/{target}/`\n\n### # Tech Stack Compatibility\n\n| Skill Requirement | Project Status | Compatibility |\n|-------------------|----------------|---------------|\n| [Tech 1] | [Project tech] | [OK]/[!]/[X] |\n\n### # Integration Locations\n\n| Type | Path |\n|------|------|\n| Guidelines doc | `.trellis/spec/{target}/doc.md` (section: `skill-<name>`) |\n| Code examples | `.trellis/spec/{target}/examples/skills/<name>/` |\n| Index update | `.trellis/spec/{target}/index.md` |\n\n> `{target}` = `frontend` or `backend`\n\n### # Dependencies (if needed)\n\n```bash\n# Install required dependencies (adjust for your package manager)\nnpm install <package>\n# or\npnpm add <package>\n# or\nyarn add <package>\n```\n\n### [OK] Completed Changes\n\n- [ ] Added `@@@section:skill-<name>` section to `doc.md`\n- [ ] Added index entry to `index.md`\n- [ ] Created example files in `examples/skills/<name>/`\n- [ ] Example files use `.template` suffix\n\n### # Related Guidelines\n\n- [Existing related section IDs]\n\n---\n\n## 6. Optional: Create Usage Command\n\nIf this skill is frequently used, create a shortcut command:\n\n```bash\n/trellis:create-command use-<skill-name> Use <skill-name> skill following project guidelines\n```\n\n## Common Skill Integration Reference\n\n| Skill | Integration Target | Examples Directory |\n|-------|-------------------|-------------------|\n| `frontend-design` | `frontend` | `examples/skills/frontend-design/` |\n| `mcp-builder` | `backend` | `examples/skills/mcp-builder/` |\n| `webapp-testing` | `frontend` | `examples/skills/webapp-testing/` |\n| `doc-coauthoring` | `.trellis/` | N/A (documentation workflow only) |\n\n## Example: Integrating `mcp-builder` Skill\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n```\n.trellis/spec/backend/\n|-- doc.md                           # Add MCP section\n|-- index.md                         # Add index entry\n+-- examples/\n    +-- skills/\n        +-- mcp-builder/\n            |-- README.md\n            |-- server.ts.template\n            |-- tools.ts.template\n            +-- types.ts.template\n```\n\n### New Section in doc.md\n\n```markdown\n@@@section:skill-mcp-builder\n## # MCP Server Development Guide\n\n### Overview\nCreate LLM-callable tool services using MCP (Model Context Protocol).\n\n### Project Adaptation\n- Place services in a dedicated directory\n- Follow existing TypeScript and type definition conventions\n- Use project''s logging system\n\n### Reference Examples\nSee `examples/skills/mcp-builder/`\n\n@@@/section:skill-mcp-builder\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:40:00.268Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and Cursor requiring streamlined development guideline integration and project setup.","zh":"适用于Claude Code和Cursor等AI代理，需要简化开发指南集成和项目设置的代理。","ja":"Claude CodeやCursorなどのAIエージェントに適しており、開発ガイドラインの統合とプロジェクト設定を簡素化する必要があるエージェント。","ko":"클라우드 코드 및 커서와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 개발 지침 통합 및 프로젝트 설정을 간소화하는 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y Cursor que requieren una integración de directrices de desarrollo y configuración de proyecto optimizada.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et Cursor nécessitant une intégration de directives de développement et de configuration de projet rationalisée.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und Cursor, die eine optimierte Integration von Entwicklungsrichtlinien und Projektsetup erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code e Cursor que exigem integração de diretrizes de desenvolvimento simplificada e configuração de projeto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и Cursor, требующих упрощенной интеграции руководящих принципов разработки и настройки проекта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل الذكي مثل كلود كود وكيرسور الذي يتطلب توجيهات تطوير مبسطة وتأسيس مشروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to adapt and integrate global skills into project development guidelines using the /trellis:integrate-skill command, facilitating seamless project setup and skill incorporation through protocols like trellis, while ensuring guidelines are updated rather than directly generating project code.","zh":"赋予代理通过/trellis：integrate-skill命令将全球技能适应和集成到项目开发指南中，通过trellis等协议实现项目设置和技能纳入的无缝对接，同时确保指南更新而不是直接生成项目代码。","ja":"エージェントに、/trellis：integrate-skillコマンドを使用して、グローバルスキルをプロジェクト開発ガイドラインに適応させ、統合させ、trellisなどのプロトコルを介してプロジェクト設定とスキルの取り込みをスムーズに行い、ガイドラインを更新することを可能にし、直接プロジェクトコードを生成しない。","ko":"에이전트가 /trellis：integrate-skill 명령을 사용하여 글로벌 스킬을 프로젝트 개발 지침에 적응시키고 통합하고, 트렐리스와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 프로젝트 설정 및 스킬 통합을 무결점으로 수행하며, 지침을 업데이트하고 직접 프로젝트 코드를 생성하지 않는다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a adaptar e integrar habilidades globales en las directrices de desarrollo de proyectos utilizando el comando /trellis:integrate-skill, lo que facilita una configuración de proyecto y una incorporación de habilidades sin problemas a través de protocolos como trellis, garantizando que las directrices se actualicen en lugar de generar directamente el código del proyecto.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''adapter et d''intégrer des compétences mondiales dans les directives de développement de projet en utilisant la commande /trellis:integrate-skill, ce qui facilite une configuration de projet et une intégration de compétences sans heurts via des protocoles comme trellis, tout en garantissant que les directives sont mises à jour plutôt que de générer directement le code de projet.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, globale Fähigkeiten in Projektentwicklungsrichtlinien mit dem Befehl /trellis:integrate-skill zu adaptieren und zu integrieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Projektkonfiguration und Fähigkeitsintegration durch Protokolle wie trellis ermöglicht wird, während sichergestellt wird, dass die Richtlinien aktualisiert werden, anstatt direkt Projektcode zu generieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes se adaptem e integrem habilidades globais nas diretrizes de desenvolvimento de projetos usando o comando /trellis:integrate-skill, facilitando a configuração do projeto e a incorporação de habilidades através de protocolos como trellis, garantindo que as diretrizes sejam atualizadas em vez de gerar diretamente o código do projeto.","ru":"Позволяет агентам адаптироваться и интегрировать глобальные навыки в руководящие принципы разработки проектов с помощью команды /trellis:integrate-skill, облегчая настройку проекта и включение навыков через протоколы, такие как trellis, гарантируя, что руководящие принципы обновляются, а не напрямую генерируя код проекта.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بالتعديل وتكامل المهارات العالمية في إرشادات تطوير المشروع باستخدام أمر /trellis:integrate-skill، ويسهم في تبسيط إعداد المشروع ودمج المهارات من خلال بروتوكولات مثل trellis، مع ضمان تحديث الإرشادات بدلاً من توليد رمز المشروع مباشرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating frontend design skills into project guidelines","Automating the incorporation of MCP builder skills into development workflows","Updating project guidelines with new skills using the trellis protocol"],"zh":["将前端设计技能集成到项目指南中","自动将MCP构建者技能纳入开发工作流程中","使用trellis协议将新技能更新到项目指南中"],"ja":["プロジェクトガイドラインにフロントエンド設計スキルを統合する","開発ワークフローにMCPビルダースキルを自動的に統合する","trellisプロトコルを使用して新しいスキルをプロジェクトガイドラインに更新する"],"ko":["프로젝트 지침에 프론트엔드 디자인 스킬을 통합する","개발 워크플로우에 MCP 빌더 스킬을 자동으로 통합하는 것","트렐리스 프로토콜을 사용하여 새로운 스킬을 프로젝트 지침에 업데이트하는 것"],"es":["Integrar habilidades de diseño frontend en las directrices del proyecto","Automatizar la incorporación de habilidades del constructor MCP en flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","Actualizar las directrices del proyecto con nuevas habilidades utilizando el protocolo trellis"],"fr":["Intégrer des compétences de conception frontend dans les directives de projet","Automatiser l''intégration de compétences de constructeur MCP dans les flux de travail de développement","Mettre à jour les directives de projet avec de nouvelles compétences en utilisant le protocole trellis"],"de":["Frontend-Designfähigkeiten in Projektrichtlinien integrieren","Die Einbindung von MCP-Builder-Fähigkeiten in Entwicklungsworkflows automatisieren","Projekt-Richtlinien mit neuen Fähigkeiten mithilfe des Trellis-Protokolls aktualisieren"],"pt":["Integrar habilidades de design de frontend nas diretrizes do projeto","Automatizar a incorporação de habilidades de construtor MCP nos fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento","Atualizar as diretrizes do projeto com novas habilidades usando o protocolo trellis"],"ru":["Интегрировать навыки дизайна frontend в руководящие принципы проекта","Автоматизировать включение навыков строителя MCP в рабочие процессы разработки","Обновлять руководящие принципы проекта с новыми навыками с помощью протокола trellis"],"ar":["دمج مهارات تصميم الواجهة الأمامية في إرشادات المشروع","تأتمتة دمج مهارات بناء MCP في سير عمل التطوير","تحديث إرشادات المشروع بمهارات جديدة باستخدام بروتوكول trellis"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires trellis protocol compatibility","Does not directly generate project code","Limited to integrating skills into development guidelines"],"zh":["需要trellis协议兼容性","不直接生成项目代码","仅限集成技能到开发指南中"],"ja":["trellisプロトコルとの互換性が必要","直接プロジェクトコードを生成しない","開発ガイドラインへのスキル統合のみに限定される"],"ko":["트렐리스 프로토콜 호환성이 필요함","직접 프로젝트 코드를 생성하지 않음","개발 지침에 대한 스킬 통합에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con el protocolo trellis","No genera directamente el código del proyecto","Limitado a la integración de habilidades en las directrices de desarrollo"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec le protocole trellis","Ne génère pas directement le code de projet","Limité à l''intégration de compétences dans les directives de développement"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit dem Trellis-Protokoll","Generiert keinen Projektcode direkt","Begrenzt auf die Integration von Fähigkeiten in Entwicklungsrichtlinien"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com o protocolo trellis","Não gera diretamente o código do projeto","Limitado à integração de habilidades nas diretrizes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с протоколом trellis","Не генерирует напрямую код проекта","Ограничен интеграцией навыков в руководящие принципы разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع بروتوكول trellis","لا يولد مباشرة رمز المشروع","محدود بتكامل المهارات في إرشادات التطوير"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sanity-io/next-sanity/vitest', 'community', 'sanity-io', 'next-sanity', 'sanity-io/next-sanity', 'vitest', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:40:07.072Z', NULL, '{"id":"sanity-io/next-sanity/vitest","name":"vitest","description":{"zh":"Vitest是由Vite驱动的下一代测试框架，提供Jest兼容的API和原生ESM、TypeScript、JSX支持","ja":"VitestはViteによって駆動される次世代テストフレームワークで、Jest互換のAPIとネイティブESM、TypeScript、JSXサポートを提供","ko":"Vitest는 Vite에 의해 구동되는 다음 세대 테스트 프레임워크로 Jest 호환 API 및 네이티브 ESM, TypeScript, JSX 지원을 제공합니다","es":"Vitest es un framework de pruebas de próxima generación impulsado por Vite, compatible con Jest y con soporte nativo para ESM, TypeScript y JSX.","fr":"Vitest est un framework de test de nouvelle génération propulsé par Vite, compatible avec Jest et avec un support natif pour ESM, TypeScript et JSX.","de":"Vitest ist ein Test-Framework der nächsten Generation, das von Vite angetrieben wird, mit Jest-kompatibler API und natives Support für ESM, TypeScript und JSX.","pt":"Vitest é uma ferramenta de testes para Next.js, com suporte nativo a ESM, TypeScript e JSX. Ele fornece uma API compatível com Jest e compartilha a mesma configuração com o aplicativo Vite.","ru":"Vitest - это инструмент для тестирования Next.js, с родной поддержкой ESM, TypeScript и JSX. Он предоставляет API, совместимый с Jest, и разделяет одну и ту же конфигурацию с приложением Vite.","ar":"Vitest هي أداة اختبار للنكست جيه إس، مع دعم أصلي ل ESM و TypeScript و JSX. توفر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Jest وتشترك في نفس الإعدادات مع تطبيق Vite.","en":"Sanity toolkit for Next.js"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Vitest：下一代测试框架","ja":"Vitest：次世代テストフレームワーク","ko":"Vitest: 다음 세대 테스트 프레임워크","es":"Vitest: Framework de pruebas para Next.js","fr":"Vitest: Outil de test pour Next.js","de":"Vitest: Test-Framework für Next.js","pt":"Vitest: Ferramenta de Testes para Next.js","ru":"Vitest: Инструмент для тестирования Next.js","ar":"Vitest: أداة اختبار للنكست جيه إس","en":"vitest"},"description":{"zh":"Vitest是由Vite驱动的下一代测试框架，提供Jest兼容的API和原生ESM、TypeScript、JSX支持","ja":"VitestはViteによって駆動される次世代テストフレームワークで、Jest互換のAPIとネイティブESM、TypeScript、JSXサポートを提供","ko":"Vitest는 Vite에 의해 구동되는 다음 세대 테스트 프레임워크로 Jest 호환 API 및 네이티브 ESM, TypeScript, JSX 지원을 제공합니다","es":"Vitest es un framework de pruebas de próxima generación impulsado por Vite, compatible con Jest y con soporte nativo para ESM, TypeScript y JSX.","fr":"Vitest est un framework de test de nouvelle génération propulsé par Vite, compatible avec Jest et avec un support natif pour ESM, TypeScript et JSX.","de":"Vitest ist ein Test-Framework der nächsten Generation, das von Vite angetrieben wird, mit Jest-kompatibler API und natives Support für ESM, TypeScript und JSX.","pt":"Vitest é uma ferramenta de testes para Next.js, com suporte nativo a ESM, TypeScript e JSX. Ele fornece uma API compatível com Jest e compartilha a mesma con...","ru":"Vitest - это инструмент для тестирования Next.js, с родной поддержкой ESM, TypeScript и JSX. Он предоставляет API, совместимый с Jest, и разделяет одну и ту ...","ar":"Vitest هي أداة اختبار للنكست جيه إس، مع دعم أصلي ل ESM و TypeScript و JSX. توفر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Jest وتشترك في نفس الإعدادات مع تطبيق Vite.","en":"Sanity toolkit for Next.js"},"definition":{"en":"Sanity toolkit for Next.js"},"features":{"zh":["使用Vite的转换管道实现快速的HMR-like测试更新","Jest兼容的API","智能监视模式：仅重新运行受影响的测试","原生ESM、TypeScript、JSX支持"],"ja":["Viteの変換パイプラインを使用して高速なHMRのようなテスト更新を実現","Jest互換のAPI","スマートウォッチモード：影響を受けるテストのみを再実行","ネイティブESM、TypeScript、JSXサポート"],"ko":["Vite의 변환 파이프라인을 사용하여 빠른 HMR 같은 테스트 업데이트를 구현","Jest 호환 API","스마트 감시 모드: 영향을 받는 테스트만 다시 실행","네이티브 ESM, TypeScript, JSX 지원"],"es":["Compatible con Jest","Soporte nativo para ESM, TypeScript y JSX","Actualizaciones de pruebas rápidas con Vite","Modo de vigilancia inteligente","Comparte configuración con Vite"],"fr":["Compatible avec Jest","Support natif pour ESM, TypeScript et JSX","Mises à jour de tests rapides avec Vite","Mode de surveillance intelligent","Partage de configuration avec Vite"],"de":["Jest-kompatibel","Native Unterstützung für ESM, TypeScript und JSX","Schnelle Test-Updates mit Vite","Intelligenter Wachmodus","Konfigurationsfreigabe mit Vite"],"pt":["Suporte nativo a ESM, TypeScript e JSX","API compatível com Jest","Modo de assistir inteligente","Atualizações de teste rápidas com HMR","Compartilha configuração com o aplicativo Vite"],"ru":["Родная поддержка ESM, TypeScript и JSX","API, совместимый с Jest","Умный режим просмотра","Быстрые обновления тестов с HMR","Разделяет конфигурацию с приложением Vite"],"ar":["دعم أصلي ل ESM و TypeScript و JSX","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Jest","وضع مراقبة ذكي","تحديثات اختبار سريعة مع HMR","تشارك الإعدادات مع تطبيق Vite"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vitest","Next.js测试","Vite测试框架","Jest兼容","ESM支持","TypeScript支持","JSX支持"],"ja":["Vitest","Next.jsテスト","Viteテストフレームワーク","Jest互換","ESMサポート","TypeScriptサポート","JSXサポート"],"ko":["Vitest","Next.js 테스트","Vite 테스트 프레임워크","Jest 호환","ESM 지원","TypeScript 지원","JSX 지원"],"es":["Vitest","Next.js","pruebas","testing","Jest","Vite","ESM","TypeScript","JSX"],"fr":["Vitest","Next.js","tests","testing","Jest","Vite","ESM","TypeScript","JSX"],"de":["Vitest","Next.js","Tests","Testing","Jest","Vite","ESM","TypeScript","JSX"],"pt":["Vitest","Next.js","Testes","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","Jest","Vite","Desenvolvimento web","Ferramentas de testes"],"ru":["Vitest","Next.js","Тестирование","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","Jest","Vite","Веб-разработка","Инструменты для тестирования"],"ar":["Vitest","النكست جيه إس","الاختبارات","ESM","TypeScript","JSX","Jest","Vite","تطوير الويب","أدوات الاختبار"]}},"owner":"sanity-io","repo":"next-sanity","repoPath":"sanity-io/next-sanity","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vitest","description":"Vitest fast unit testing framework powered by Vite with Jest-compatible API. Use when writing tests, mocking, configuring coverage, or working with test filtering and fixtures.","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"Vitest is a next-generation testing framework powered by Vite. It provides a Jest-compatible API with native ESM, TypeScript, and JSX support out of the box. Vitest shares the same config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins with your Vite app.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n- Vite-native: Uses Vite''s transformation pipeline for fast HMR-like test updates\n- Jest-compatible: Drop-in replacement for most Jest test suites\n- Smart watch mode: Only reruns affected tests based on module graph\n- Native ESM, Type","body":"Vitest is a next-generation testing framework powered by Vite. It provides a Jest-compatible API with native ESM, TypeScript, and JSX support out of the box. Vitest shares the same config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins with your Vite app.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n- Vite-native: Uses Vite''s transformation pipeline for fast HMR-like test updates\n- Jest-compatible: Drop-in replacement for most Jest test suites\n- Smart watch mode: Only reruns affected tests based on module graph\n- Native ESM, TypeScript, JSX support without configuration\n- Multi-threaded workers for parallel test execution\n- Built-in coverage via V8 or Istanbul\n- Snapshot testing, mocking, and spy utilities\n\n> The skill is based on Vitest 3.x, generated at 2026-01-28.\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic         | Description                                                     | Reference                                    |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| Configuration | Vitest and Vite config integration, defineConfig usage          | [core-config](references/core-config.md)     |\n| CLI           | Command line interface, commands and options                    | [core-cli](references/core-cli.md)           |\n| Test API      | test/it function, modifiers like skip, only, concurrent         | [core-test-api](references/core-test-api.md) |\n| Describe API  | describe/suite for grouping tests and nested suites             | [core-describe](references/core-describe.md) |\n| Expect API    | Assertions with toBe, toEqual, matchers and asymmetric matchers | [core-expect](references/core-expect.md)     |\n| Hooks         | beforeEach, afterEach, beforeAll, afterAll, aroundEach          | [core-hooks](references/core-hooks.md)       |\n\n## Features\n\n| Topic        | Description                                                    | Reference                                                  |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Mocking      | Mock functions, modules, timers, dates with vi utilities       | [features-mocking](references/features-mocking.md)         |\n| Snapshots    | Snapshot testing with toMatchSnapshot and inline snapshots     | [features-snapshots](references/features-snapshots.md)     |\n| Coverage     | Code coverage with V8 or Istanbul providers                    | [features-coverage](references/features-coverage.md)       |\n| Test Context | Test fixtures, context.expect, test.extend for custom fixtures | [features-context](references/features-context.md)         |\n| Concurrency  | Concurrent tests, parallel execution, sharding                 | [features-concurrency](references/features-concurrency.md) |\n| Filtering    | Filter tests by name, file patterns, tags                      | [features-filtering](references/features-filtering.md)     |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic        | Description                                             | Reference                                                    |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Vi Utilities | vi helper: mock, spyOn, fake timers, hoisted, waitFor   | [advanced-vi](references/advanced-vi.md)                     |\n| Environments | Test environments: node, jsdom, happy-dom, custom       | [advanced-environments](references/advanced-environments.md) |\n| Type Testing | Type-level testing with expectTypeOf and assertType     | [advanced-type-testing](references/advanced-type-testing.md) |\n| Projects     | Multi-project workspaces, different configs per project | [advanced-projects](references/advanced-projects.md)         |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:40:07.072Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Next.js Development Agents needing fast and efficient testing frameworks with Jest-compatible API and native ESM support.","zh":"非常适合需要快速高效测试框架的 Next.js 开发代理，支持 Jest 兼容 API 和原生 ESM。","ja":"Jest 互換 API とネイティブ ESM サポートを備えた高速で効率的なテスト フレームワークが必要な Next.js 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Jest 호환 API 및 네이티브 ESM 지원과 같은 빠르고 효율적인 테스트 프레임워크가 필요한 Next.js 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de Next.js que necesitan frameworks de prueba rápidos y eficientes con API compatible con Jest y soporte nativo para ESM.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Next.js ayant besoin de frameworks de test rapides et efficaces avec une API compatible Jest et un support natif ESM.","de":"Perfekt für Next.js-Entwicklungsagenten, die schnelle und effiziente Testframeworks mit Jest-kompatibler API und nativer ESM-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento Next.js que necessitam de estruturas de teste rápidas e eficientes com API compatível com Jest e suporte nativo ao ESM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Next.js, которым требуются быстрые и эффективные фреймворки тестирования с API, совместимым с Jest, и родной поддержкой ESM.","ar":"مثالي لوجوهات تطوير Next.js التي تحتاج إلى إطارات اختبار سريعة وفعالة مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Jest ودعم صحيحي لل ESM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Vite-native testing with fast HMR-like test updates, smart watch mode, and native support for TypeScript and JSX, streamlining the testing process with Vitest''s drop-in replacement for Jest test suites.","zh":"赋予代理快速的 HMR 类型测试更新、智能监视模式以及对 TypeScript 和 JSX 的原生支持，简化了 Vitest 替换 Jest 测试套件的测试过程。","ja":"Vite ネイティブのテストを活用し、迅速な HMR のようなテスト更新、スマートなウォッチ モード、TypeScript と JSX のネイティブ サポートを提供し、Vitest で Jest テスト スイートを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 빠른 HMR 형식의 테스트 업데이트를 사용할 수 있도록 해주고 스마트 워치 모드 및 TypeScript 및 JSX에 대한 네이티브 지원을 제공하여 Vitest로 Jest 테스트 스위트를 대체하여 테스트 과정을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar las pruebas nativas de Vite con actualizaciones de pruebas rápidas similares a HMR, modo de vigilancia inteligente y soporte nativo para TypeScript y JSX, lo que simplifica el proceso de prueba con el reemplazo integral de Vitest para suites de pruebas de Jest.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les tests natifs Vite avec des mises à jour de tests rapides similaires à HMR, un mode de surveillance intelligent et un support natif pour TypeScript et JSX, ce qui rationalise le processus de test avec le remplacement intégral de Vitest pour les suites de tests Jest.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Vite-native Tests mit schnellen HMR-ähnlichen Testaktualisierungen, intelligentem Wachmodus und nativer Unterstützung für TypeScript und JSX zu nutzen, wodurch der Testprozess mit Vitests 1:1-Ersetzung für Jest-Test-Suiten rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar os testes nativos do Vite com atualizações de teste rápidas semelhantes ao HMR, modo de observação inteligente e suporte nativo para TypeScript e JSX, simplificando o processo de teste com o substituto drop-in do Vitest para suites de teste do Jest.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать родное тестирование Vite с быстрыми обновлениями тестов, подобными HMR, умным режимом наблюдения и родной поддержкой TypeScript и JSX, упрощая процесс тестирования с помощью замены drop-in Vitest для наборов тестов Jest.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من استخدام اختبار　Vite الأصلي مع تحديثات اختبار سريعة تشبه HMR ووضع مراقبة ذكي ودعم أصلي لنوعية النص البرمجي و JSX، مبسطًا عملية الاختبار مع بديل الإسقاط ل　Vitest لملفات اختبار Jest."},"useCases":{"en":["Rerunning affected tests based on module graph with smart watch mode","Utilizing Jest-compatible API for seamless test suite integration","Enabling fast test updates with Vite''s transformation pipeline"],"zh":["基于模块图的智能监视模式重新运行受影响的测试","使用 Jest 兼容 API 实现无缝测试套件集成","利用 Vite 的转换管道启用快速测试更新"],"ja":["スマート ウォッチ モードでモジュール グラフに基づいて影響を受けたテストを再実行する","Jest 互換 API を使用して無縫なテスト スイート統合を実現する","Vite の変換パイプラインを使用して高速なテスト更新を有効にする"],"ko":["스마트 워치 모드를 사용하여 모듈 그래프에 기반하여 영향을 받는 테스트를 다시 실행하는 것","Jest 호환 API를 사용하여 무縫한 테스트 스위트 통합을 구현하는 것","Vite의 변환 파이프라인을 사용하여 빠른 테스트 업데이트를 활성화하는 것"],"es":["Volver a ejecutar las pruebas afectadas en función del gráfico de módulos con el modo de vigilancia inteligente","Utilizar la API compatible con Jest para una integración sin problemas de la suite de pruebas","Habilitar actualizaciones de pruebas rápidas con la canalización de transformación de Vite"],"fr":["Réexécuter les tests affectés en fonction du graphique de modules avec le mode de surveillance intelligent","Utiliser l''API compatible Jest pour une intégration transparente de la suite de tests","Activer les mises à jour de tests rapides avec la pipeline de transformation de Vite"],"de":["Erneutes Ausführen betroffener Tests basierend auf dem Modulgraphen mit intelligentem Wachmodus","Verwendung der Jest-kompatiblen API für eine nahtlose Integration der Test-Suite","Aktivieren von schnellen Testaktualisierungen mit Vites Transformationspipeline"],"pt":["Reexecutar testes afetados com base no gráfico de módulos com modo de observação inteligente","Utilizar API compatível com Jest para integração perfeita da suite de testes","Habilitar atualizações de teste rápidas com o pipeline de transformação do Vite"],"ru":["Перезапустить затронутые тесты на основе графа модулей с умным режимом наблюдения","Использовать API, совместимую с Jest, для бесшовной интеграции набора тестов","Включить быстрые обновления тестов с помощью конвейера трансформации Vite"],"ar":["إعادة تشغيل الاختبارات المتأثرة بناءً على مخطط الوحدات مع وضع المراقبة الذكي","استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المتوافقة مع Jest لدمج اختبار المجموعة بشكل مثالي","تمكين تحديثات اختبار سريعة باستخدام خط أنابيب التحويل　Vite"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite app configuration","Limited to Next.js ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 Vite 应用程序配置","仅限 Next.js 生态系统"],"ja":["Vite アプリケーションの構成が必要","Next.js 生態系に限定される"],"ko":["Vite 애플리케이션 구성이 필요함","Next.js 생태계에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de la aplicación Vite","Limitado al ecosistema de Next.js"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de l''application Vite","Limité à l''écosystème Next.js"],"de":["Benötigt Vite-App-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf das Next.js-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Exige configuração de aplicativo Vite","Limitado ao ecossistema Next.js"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения Vite","Ограничен экосистемой Next.js"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين تطبيق　Vite","محدود بنظام بيئة Next.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
