ation. It simplifies tasks such as adding, editing, deleting, and exporting translations. The package also includes a handy search feature and the ability to invite collaborators for easy translation management"},"features":{"zh":["页面组件","表单处理","客户端导航","v2 特性","deferred props","prefetching"],"ja":["ページコンポーネント","フォーム処理","クライアントサイドナビゲーション","v2 機能","deferred props","prefetching"],"ko":["페이지 컴포넌트","폼 처리","클라이언트측 내비게이션","v2 기능","deferred props","prefetching"],"es":["Creación de componentes de página para Inertia","Trabajo con formularios en React","Implementación de navegación de cliente con enlaces","Uso de características de v2 como propiedades diferidas y prefetching","Creación de características específicas de React con el protocolo Inertia"],"fr":["Création de composants de page pour Inertia","Travail avec des formulaires en React","Mise en œuvre de la navigation côté client avec des liens","Utilisation de fonctionnalités de v2 comme des propriétés différées et du prefetching","Création de fonctionnalités spécifiques à React avec le protocole Inertia"],"de":["Erstellung von Seitkomponenten für Inertia","Arbeit mit Formularen in React","Implementierung von Client-Navigation mit Links","Verwendung von v2-Funktionen wie aufgeschobenen Eigenschaften und Prefetching","Erstellung von React-spezifischen Funktionen mit dem Inertia-Protokoll"],"pt":["Criação de componentes de página React","Trabalho com formulários em React","Navegação cliente com Link ou router","Uso de recursos v2: props diferidos, pré-carregamento e polling","Construção de recursos específicos do React com o protocolo Inertia"],"ru":["Создание компонентов страницы React","Работа с формами в React","Клиентская навигация с Link или router","Использование функций v2: отсроченные свойства, предварительная загрузка и опрос","Строительство функций, специфичных для React, с протоколом Inertia"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات صفحة رياكت","العمل مع الاستمارات في رياكت","التوجيه العميل مع الرابط أو الموجه","استخدام الميزات v2: الخصائص المؤجلة والتحميل المسبق والاستطلاع","بناء الميزات الخاصة برياكت مع بروتوكول إنيرتيا"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Inertia React","React 开发","页面组件","表单处理","客户端导航","v2 特性","deferred props","prefetching"],"ja":["Inertia React","React 開発","ページコンポーネント","フォーム処理","クライアントサイドナビゲーション","v2 機能","deferred props","prefetching"],"ko":["Inertia React","React 개발","페이지 컴포넌트","폼 처리","클라이언트측 내비게이션","v2 기능","deferred props","prefetching"],"es":["Inertia React","desarrollo de aplicaciones React","componentes de página","formularios en React","navegación de cliente","características de v2","protocolo Inertia","React development"],"fr":["Inertia React","développement d''applications React","composants de page","formulaires en React","navigation côté client","fonctionnalités de v2","protocole Inertia","React development"],"de":["Inertia React","Entwicklung von React-Anwendungen","Seitkomponenten","Formulare in React","Client-Navigation","v2-Funktionen","Inertia-Protokoll","React development"],"pt":["Inertia React","Desenvolvimento React","Componentes de página React","Formulários em React","Navegação cliente React","Recursos v2 Inertia","Protocolo Inertia","React avançado"],"ru":["Inertia React","Разработка React","Компоненты страницы React","Формы в React","Клиентская навигация React","Функции v2 Inertia","Протокол Inertia","React расширенный"],"ar":["إنيرتيا رياكت","تطوير رياكت","مكونات صفحة رياكت","الاستمارات في رياكت","التوجيه العميل رياكت","ميزات v2 إنيرتيا","بروتوكول إنيرتيا","رياكت متقدم"]}},"owner":"MohmmedAshraf","repo":"laravel-translations","repoPath":"MohmmedAshraf/laravel-translations","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"inertia-react-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Inertia React Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Creating or modifying React page components for Inertia\n- Working with forms in React (using `<Form>` or `useForm`)\n- Implementing client-side navigation with `<Link>` or `router`\n- Using v2 features: deferred props, prefetching, or polling\n- Building React-specific features with the Inertia protocol\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Inertia v2 React patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Page C","body":"# Inertia React Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Creating or modifying React page components for Inertia\n- Working with forms in React (using `<Form>` or `useForm`)\n- Implementing client-side navigation with `<Link>` or `router`\n- Using v2 features: deferred props, prefetching, or polling\n- Building React-specific features with the Inertia protocol\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Inertia v2 React patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Page Components Location\n\nReact page components should be placed in the `resources/js/pages` directory.\n\n### Page Component Structure\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Basic React Page Component\" lang=\"react\">\n\nexport default function UsersIndex({ users }) {\n    return (\n        <div>\n            <h1>Users</h1>\n            <ul>\n                {users.map(user => <li key={user.id}>{user.name}</li>)}\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Client-Side Navigation\n\n### Basic Link Component\n\nUse `<Link>` for client-side navigation instead of traditional `<a>` tags:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Inertia React Navigation\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Link, router } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\n<Link href=\"/\">Home</Link>\n<Link href=\"/users\">Users</Link>\n<Link href={`/users/${user.id}`}>View User</Link>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Link with Method\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Link with POST Method\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Link } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\n<Link href=\"/logout\" method=\"post\" as=\"button\">\n    Logout\n</Link>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Prefetching\n\nPrefetch pages to improve perceived performance:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Prefetch on Hover\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Link } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\n<Link href=\"/users\" prefetch>\n    Users\n</Link>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Programmatic Navigation\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Router Visit\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { router } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\nfunction handleClick() {\n    router.visit(''/users'')\n}\n\n// Or with options\nrouter.visit(''/users'', {\n    method: ''post'',\n    data: { name: ''John'' },\n    onSuccess: () => console.log(''Success!''),\n})\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Form Handling\n\n### Form Component (Recommended)\n\nThe recommended way to build forms is with the `<Form>` component:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Form Component Example\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Form } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\nexport default function CreateUser() {\n    return (\n        <Form action=\"/users\" method=\"post\">\n            {({ errors, processing, wasSuccessful }) => (\n                <>\n                    <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" />\n                    {errors.name && <div>{errors.name}</div>}\n\n                    <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" />\n                    {errors.email && <div>{errors.email}</div>}\n\n                    <button type=\"submit\" disabled={processing}>\n                        {processing ? ''Creating...'' : ''Create User''}\n                    </button>\n\n                    {wasSuccessful && <div>User created!</div>}\n                </>\n            )}\n        </Form>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Form Component With All Props\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Form Component Full Example\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Form } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\n<Form action=\"/users\" method=\"post\">\n    {({\n        errors,\n        hasErrors,\n        processing,\n        progress,\n        wasSuccessful,\n        recentlySuccessful,\n        clearErrors,\n        resetAndClearErrors,\n        defaults,\n        isDirty,\n        reset,\n        submit\n    }) => (\n        <>\n            <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" defaultValue={defaults.name} />\n            {errors.name && <div>{errors.name}</div>}\n\n            <button type=\"submit\" disabled={processing}>\n                {processing ? ''Saving...'' : ''Save''}\n            </button>\n\n            {progress && (\n                <progress value={progress.percentage} max=\"100\">\n                    {progress.percentage}%\n                </progress>\n            )}\n\n            {wasSuccessful && <div>Saved!</div>}\n        </>\n    )}\n</Form>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Form Component Reset Props\n\nThe `<Form>` component supports automatic resetting:\n\n- `resetOnError` - Reset form data when the request fails\n- `resetOnSuccess` - Reset form data when the request succeeds\n- `setDefaultsOnSuccess` - Update default values on success\n\nUse the `search-docs` tool with a query of `form component resetting` for detailed guidance.\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Form with Reset Props\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { Form } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\n<Form\n    action=\"/users\"\n    method=\"post\"\n    resetOnSuccess\n    setDefaultsOnSuccess\n>\n    {({ errors, processing, wasSuccessful }) => (\n        <>\n            <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" />\n            {errors.name && <div>{errors.name}</div>}\n\n            <button type=\"submit\" disabled={processing}>\n                Submit\n            </button>\n        </>\n    )}\n</Form>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\nForms can also be built using the `useForm` helper for more programmatic control. Use the `search-docs` tool with a query of `useForm helper` for guidance.\n\n### `useForm` Hook\n\nFor more programmatic control or to follow existing conventions, use the `useForm` hook:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"useForm Hook Example\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { useForm } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\nexport default function CreateUser() {\n    const { data, setData, post, processing, errors, reset } = useForm({\n        name: '''',\n        email: '''',\n        password: '''',\n    })\n\n    function submit(e) {\n        e.preventDefault()\n        post(''/users'', {\n            onSuccess: () => reset(''password''),\n        })\n    }\n\n    return (\n        <form onSubmit={submit}>\n            <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                value={data.name}\n                onChange={e => setData(''name'', e.target.value)}\n            />\n            {errors.name && <div>{errors.name}</div>}\n\n            <input\n                type=\"email\"\n                value={data.email}\n                onChange={e => setData(''email'', e.target.value)}\n            />\n            {errors.email && <div>{errors.email}</div>}\n\n            <input\n                type=\"password\"\n                value={data.password}\n                onChange={e => setData(''password'', e.target.value)}\n            />\n            {errors.password && <div>{errors.password}</div>}\n\n            <button type=\"submit\" disabled={processing}>\n                Create User\n            </button>\n        </form>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Inertia v2 Features\n\n### Deferred Props\n\nUse deferred props to load data after initial page render:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Deferred Props with Empty State\" lang=\"react\">\n\nexport default function UsersIndex({ users }) {\n    // users will be undefined initially, then populated\n    return (\n        <div>\n            <h1>Users</h1>\n            {!users ? (\n                <div className=\"animate-pulse\">\n                    <div className=\"h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-3/4 mb-2\"></div>\n                    <div className=\"h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-1/2\"></div>\n                </div>\n            ) : (\n                <ul>\n                    {users.map(user => (\n                        <li key={user.id}>{user.name}</li>\n                    ))}\n                </ul>\n            )}\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Polling\n\nAutomatically refresh data at intervals:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Polling Example\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { router } from ''@inertiajs/react''\nimport { useEffect } from ''react''\n\nexport default function Dashboard({ stats }) {\n    useEffect(() => {\n        const interval = setInterval(() => {\n            router.reload({ only: [''stats''] })\n        }, 5000) // Poll every 5 seconds\n\n        return () => clearInterval(interval)\n    }, [])\n\n    return (\n        <div>\n            <h1>Dashboard</h1>\n            <div>Active Users: {stats.activeUsers}</div>\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### WhenVisible (Infinite Scroll)\n\nLoad more data when user scrolls to a specific element:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Infinite Scroll with WhenVisible\" lang=\"react\">\n\nimport { WhenVisible } from ''@inertiajs/react''\n\nexport default function UsersList({ users }) {\n    return (\n        <div>\n            {users.data.map(user => (\n                <div key={user.id}>{user.name}</div>\n            ))}\n\n            {users.next_page_url && (\n                <WhenVisible\n                    data=\"users\"\n                    params={{ page: users.current_page + 1 }}\n                    fallback={<div>Loading more...</div>}\n                />\n            )}\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using traditional `<a>` links instead of Inertia''s `<Link>` component (breaks SPA behavior)\n- Forgetting to add loading states (skeleton screens) when using deferred props\n- Not handling the `undefined` state of deferred props before data loads\n- Using `<form>` without preventing default submission (use `<Form>` component or `e.preventDefault()`)\n- Forgetting to check if `<Form>` component is available in your Inertia version"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:40:18.880Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in React and Inertia.js development, needing streamlined client-side navigation and form handling.","zh":"适合专注于React和Inertia.js开发的前端代理，需要简化客户端导航和表单处理。","ja":"ReactとInertia.js開発に特化したフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、クライアント側のナビゲーションとフォームハンドリングを簡素化する必要があります。","ko":"React와 Inertia.js 개발에 전문적인 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 클라이언트 측 내비게이션과 폼 처리를 간소화하는 것이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que se especializan en desarrollo de React e Inertia.js, que necesitan una navegación y manipulación de formularios en el lado del cliente optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend spécialisés dans le développement React et Inertia.js, ayant besoin d''une navigation et d''une gestion de formulaire côté client rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf die Entwicklung von React und Inertia.js spezialisieren und eine optimierte Client-Seitennavigation und Formularverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de frontend especializados em desenvolvimento React e Inertia.js, necessitando de navegação e manipulação de formulários no lado do cliente de forma simplificada.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов фронтенда, специализирующихся на разработке React и Inertia.js, которым необходима упрощенная навигация и обработка форм на стороне клиента.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين ي专ون في تطوير React و Inertia.js ، وهم بحاجة إلى تنقل côté العميل ومعالجة النموذج المبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build robust React applications with Inertia.js, leveraging features like deferred props, prefetching, and polling, while simplifying tasks such as creating and modifying React page components and working with forms using `<Form>` or `useForm`.","zh":"赋予代理构建强大的React应用程序的能力，利用Inertia.js的功能，如延迟道具、预取和轮询，同时简化创建和修改React页面组件以及使用`<Form>`或`useForm`处理表单等任务。","ja":"エージェントがInertia.jsの機能を利用して堅牢なReactアプリケーションを構築できるようにし、遅延プロパティ、事前取得、ポーリングなどの機能を利用しながら、Reactページコンポーネントの作成や修正、`<Form>`または`useForm`を使用したフォームの処理などのタスクを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 강력한 React 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하는데, Inertia.js의 기능을 활용하여 지연된 속성, 事前 가져오기 및 폴링과 같은 기능을 활용하면서, React 페이지 컴포넌트의 생성 및 수정, `<Form>` 또는 `useForm`를 사용한 폼 처리와 같은 작업을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones React robustas con Inertia.js, aprovechando características como propiedades diferidas, precarga y sondeo, mientras simplifica tareas como la creación y modificación de componentes de página de React y el trabajo con formularios usando `<Form>` o `useForm`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications React robustes avec Inertia.js, en exploitant des fonctionnalités comme les propriétés différées, le préchargement et l''interrogation, tout en simplifiant des tâches telles que la création et la modification de composants de page React et le travail avec des formulaires à l''aide de `<Form>` ou `useForm`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, robuste React-Anwendungen mit Inertia.js zu erstellen, indem es Funktionen wie aufgeschobene Eigenschaften, Vorabladung und Abfragen nutzt, während es Aufgaben wie die Erstellung und Änderung von React-Seitenkomponenten und die Arbeit mit Formularen unter Verwendung von `<Form>` oder `useForm` vereinfacht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos React robustos com Inertia.js, aproveitando recursos como props adiados, pré-carregamento e polling, ao mesmo tempo em que simplifica tarefas como criar e modificar componentes de página React e trabalhar com formulários usando `<Form>` ou `useForm`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать прочные приложения React с помощью Inertia.js, используя такие функции, как отложенные свойства, предварительная загрузка и опрос, а также упрощая задачи, такие как создание и изменение компонентов страниц React и работа с формами с помощью `<Form>` или `useForm`.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على بناء تطبيقات React قوية مع Inertia.js ، واستخدام الميزات مثل الخصائص المؤجلة ، والتحميل المسبق ، والاستطلاع ، وفي الوقت نفسه يبسط المهام مثل إنشاء وتعديل مكونات صفحة React والعمل مع النماذج باستخدام `<Form>` أو `useForm`."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing client-side navigation with `<Link>` or `router`","Building React-specific features with the Inertia protocol","Creating or modifying React page components for Inertia","Working with forms in React using `<Form>` or `useForm`"],"zh":["使用`<Link>`或`router`实现客户端导航","使用Inertia协议构建React特定功能","为Inertia创建或修改React页面组件","在React中使用`<Form>`或`useForm`处理表单"],"ja":["`<Link>`または`router`を使用したクライアント側のナビゲーションの実装","Inertiaプロトコルを使用したReact特有の機能の構築","Inertia用のReactページコンポーネントの作成または修正","Reactで`<Form>`または`useForm`を使用したフォームの処理"],"ko":["`<Link>` 또는 `router`를 사용하여 클라이언트 측 내비게이션 구현","Inertia 프로토콜을 사용하여 React 특정 기능 구축","Inertia를 위한 React 페이지 컴포넌트 생성 또는 수정","React에서 `<Form>` 또는 `useForm`를 사용하여 폼 처리"],"es":["Implementar la navegación en el lado del cliente con `<Link>` o `router`","Crear características específicas de React con el protocolo Inertia","Crear o modificar componentes de página de React para Inertia","Trabajar con formularios en React usando `<Form>` o `useForm`"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la navigation côté client avec `<Link>` ou `router`","Créer des fonctionnalités spécifiques à React avec le protocole Inertia","Créer ou modifier des composants de page React pour Inertia","Travailler avec des formulaires dans React en utilisant `<Form>` ou `useForm`"],"de":["Implementierung der Client-Seitennavigation mit `<Link>` oder `router`","Erstellung von React-spezifischen Funktionen mit dem Inertia-Protokoll","Erstellen oder Ändern von React-Seitenkomponenten für Inertia","Arbeiten mit Formularen in React unter Verwendung von `<Form>` oder `useForm`"],"pt":["Implementar navegação lado cliente com `<Link>` ou `router`","Construir recursos específicos do React com o protocolo Inertia","Criar ou modificar componentes de página React para Inertia","Trabalhar com formulários no React usando `<Form>` ou `useForm`"],"ru":["Реализация навигации на стороне клиента с помощью `<Link>` или `router`","Создание функций, специфичных для React, с помощью протокола Inertia","Создание или изменение компонентов страниц React для Inertia","Работа с формами в React с помощью `<Form>` или `useForm`"],"ar":["تنفيذ التنقل lado العميل باستخدام `<Link>` أو `router`","بناء الميزات الخاصة بالreact باستخدام بروتوكول Inertia","إنشاء أو تعديل مكونات صفحة react ل Inertia","العمل مع النماذج في react باستخدام `<Form>` أو `useForm`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Inertia.js and React setup","Limited to React applications","Inertia v2 features required for full functionality"],"zh":["需要Inertia.js和React设置","仅限React应用程序","需要Inertia v2功能以实现全部功能"],"ja":["Inertia.jsとReactの設定が必要","Reactアプリケーションに限定される","Inertia v2の機能が必要であるため、すべての機能を実現するには制限される"],"ko":["Inertia.js 및 React 설정이 필요합니다.","React 애플리케이션에만 적용됩니다.","Inertia v2 기능이 필요하므로 모든 기능을 구현하는 데 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de Inertia.js y React","Limitado a aplicaciones React","Se requieren características de Inertia v2 para la funcionalidad completa"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Inertia.js et React","Limité aux applications React","Des fonctionnalités Inertia v2 sont requises pour une fonctionnalité complète"],"de":["Benötigt Inertia.js- und React-Setup","Begrenzt auf React-Anwendungen","Inertia v2-Funktionen werden für die volle Funktionalität benötigt"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Inertia.js e React","Limitado a aplicações React","Recursos do Inertia v2 necessários para funcionalidade completa"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Inertia.js и React","Ограничен для приложений React","Функции Inertia v2 необходимы для полной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Inertia.js و React","محدود للتطبيقات React","ميزات Inertia v2 مطلوبة للوظائف الكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
