faktorierung und Codegenerierung","Priorisierung der Regeln nach Auswirkung auf die Leistung","Kompatibilität mit Composition API und Options API","Verbesserung der Leistung der Renderung und der Re-Renderungen","Optimierung des reaktiven Zustands und der berechneten Eigenschaften"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho para aplicações Vue.js","Mais de 40 regras em 8 categorias","Guia para refatoração automática e geração de código","Priorização por impacto para guiar a otimização","Compatibilidade com Composition API e Options API"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для приложений Vue.js","Более 40 правил в 8 категориях","Руководство для автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода","Приоритизация по влиянию для руководства оптимизацией","Совместимость с Composition API и Options API"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات فيو جيه إس","أكثر من 40 قاعدة في 8 فئات","دليل لإعادة هيكلة التطبيقات وتوليد الشفرة","التحديد الأولوي لتحسين الأداء","التوافق مع واجهة تركيبة وواجهة الخيارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vue最佳实践","Vue.js性能优化","Vue组件优化","Vue应用优化","Vue开发最佳实践","Vue.js自动重构"],"ja":["Vue.jsベストプラクティス","Vue.jsパフォーマンス最適化","Vueコンポーネント最適化","Vueアプリ最適化","Vue開発ベストプラクティス","Vue.js自動リファクタリング"],"ko":["Vue 최적화","Vue.js 성능 최적화","Vue 컴포넌트 최적화","Vue 애플리케이션 최적화","Vue 개발 최적화","Vue.js 자동 리팩토링"],"es":["mejores prácticas de Vue.js","optimización de rendimiento","refactorización automática","generación de código","Composition API","Options API","estado reactivo","propiedades computadas","renderización","re-renderizaciones"],"fr":["bonnes pratiques Vue.js","optimisation des performances","refactorisation automatique","génération de code","Composition API","Options API","état réactif","propriétés calculées","renderisation","re-renderisations"],"de":["Vue.js Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","automatische Refaktorierung","Codegenerierung","Composition API","Options API","reaktiver Zustand","berechnete Eigenschaften","Renderung","Re-Renderungen"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho vue","melhores práticas vue","desempenho vue js","vue js otimização","refatoração automática","geração de código"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности vue","лучшие практики vue","производительность vue js","vue js оптимизация","автоматическая рефакторинга","генерация кода"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء فيو","أفضل الممارسات لفيو","أداء فيو جيه إس","فيو جيه إس تحسين","إعادة هيكلة التطبيقات","توليد الشفرة"]}},"owner":"vinayakkulkarni","repo":"v-offline","repoPath":"vinayakkulkarni/v-offline","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vue-best-practices","description":"Vue.js performance optimization guidelines for building fast, maintainable applications. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring Vue.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving Vue components, reactivity, Composition API, state management, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vue Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Vue.js applications. Contains 40+ rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new Vue components\n- Implementing reactive state and computed properties\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing Vue code\n- Optimizing rendering and re-renders\n- Working with Composition API or Options API\n\n##","body":"# Vue Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Vue.js applications. Contains 40+ rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new Vue components\n- Implementing reactive state and computed properties\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing Vue code\n- Optimizing rendering and re-renders\n- Working with Composition API or Options API\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Reactivity Fundamentals | CRITICAL | `reactivity-` |\n| 2 | Component Performance | CRITICAL | `component-` |\n| 3 | Computed & Watchers | HIGH | `computed-` |\n| 4 | Template Optimization | MEDIUM-HIGH | `template-` |\n| 5 | Composition API Patterns | MEDIUM | `composable-` |\n| 6 | State Management | MEDIUM | `state-` |\n| 7 | Async & Data Fetching | LOW-MEDIUM | `async-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Reactivity Fundamentals (CRITICAL)\n\n- `reactivity-ref-vs-reactive` - Use ref() for primitives, reactive() for objects\n- `reactivity-avoid-destructure` - Don''t destructure reactive objects\n- `reactivity-toRefs` - Use toRefs() when destructuring is needed\n- `reactivity-shallowRef` - Use shallowRef() for large non-reactive data\n- `reactivity-raw-values` - Use toRaw() for read-only operations on large data\n\n### 2. Component Performance (CRITICAL)\n\n- `component-v-once` - Use v-once for static content\n- `component-v-memo` - Use v-memo for expensive list items\n- `component-async` - Use defineAsyncComponent for heavy components\n- `component-keep-alive` - Cache component state with KeepAlive\n- `component-functional` - Prefer functional components for stateless UI\n\n### 3. Computed & Watchers (HIGH)\n\n- `computed-cache` - Use computed() for derived values, not methods\n- `computed-getter-only` - Avoid setters in computed when possible\n- `computed-dependencies` - Minimize computed dependencies\n- `watch-immediate` - Avoid immediate watchers, use computed instead\n- `watch-deep-avoid` - Avoid deep watchers on large objects\n- `watch-cleanup` - Always cleanup async watchers\n\n### 4. Template Optimization (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `template-v-show-vs-if` - v-show for frequent toggles, v-if for rare\n- `template-key-attribute` - Always use unique keys in v-for\n- `template-avoid-v-if-v-for` - Never use v-if and v-for on same element\n- `template-static-hoisting` - Let compiler hoist static content\n- `template-event-modifiers` - Use event modifiers instead of JS handlers\n\n### 5. Composition API Patterns (MEDIUM)\n\n- `composable-single-responsibility` - One concern per composable\n- `composable-return-refs` - Return refs, not reactive objects\n- `composable-cleanup` - Handle cleanup in composables\n- `composable-lazy-init` - Lazy initialize expensive resources\n- `composable-provide-inject` - Use provide/inject for deep prop drilling\n\n### 6. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `state-pinia-stores` - Split stores by domain\n- `state-getters` - Use getters for computed state\n- `state-actions-mutations` - Keep mutations simple, logic in actions\n- `state-subscription-cleanup` - Cleanup store subscriptions\n\n### 7. Async & Data Fetching (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `async-suspense` - Use Suspense for async component loading\n- `async-error-boundaries` - Handle async errors gracefully\n- `async-stale-while-revalidate` - Implement SWR pattern for data fetching\n- `async-abort-controller` - Cancel pending requests on unmount\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-custom-directives` - Create directives for DOM manipulation\n- `advanced-render-functions` - Use render functions for dynamic templates\n- `advanced-teleport` - Use Teleport for modals and overlays\n- `advanced-transition-groups` - Optimize list transitions\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/reactivity-ref-vs-reactive.md\nrules/component-v-memo.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:40:12.420Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Vue.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Vue.js性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度なVue.jsパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Vue.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización del rendimiento de Vue.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui ont besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de Vue.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Leistungsoptimierungsfähigkeiten für Vue.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do Vue.js.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности оптимизации производительности Vue.js.","ar":"مثالي لويب فرنت اند الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين أداء فيو.جس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to refactor and generate optimized Vue.js code using 40+ rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Composition API or Options API for automated refactoring and code generation.","zh":"赋予代理人员使用40多条规则跨8个类别、按影响力优先、并利用组合API或选项API进行自动重构和代码生成来重构和生成优化的Vue.js代码的能力。","ja":"エージェントは、40を超えるルールを8つのカテゴリにわたって影響度に優先順位を付けて利用し、Composition APIまたはOptions APIを利用して自動的にリファクタリングとコード生成を行うことで、最適化されたVue.jsコードをリファクタリングおよび生成する能力を与えます。","ko":"40개 이상의 규칙을 8개 범주에 걸쳐 영향력에 따라 우선순위를 매기고, 컴포지션 API 또는 옵션 API를 활용하여 자동 리팩터링과 코드 생성을 수행하여 최적화된 Vue.js 코드를 리팩터링하고 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a refactorizar y generar código de Vue.js optimizado utilizando más de 40 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, y aprovechando la Composition API o Options API para la refactorización y generación de código automatizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de refactoriser et de générer du code Vue.js optimisé en utilisant plus de 40 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, et en exploitant l''API Composition ou l''API Options pour la refactorisation et la génération de code automatisées.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Vue.js-Code zu refactorisieren und optimierten Code zu generieren, indem sie mehr als 40 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwenden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert sind, und die Composition API oder die Options API für automatisierte Refactorisierung und Codegenerierung nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes reestruturem e gerem código Vue.js otimizado usando 40+ regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, e utilizando Composition API ou Options API para reestruturação e geração de código automatizadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью перерабатывать и генерировать оптимизированный код Vue.js, используя 40+ правил в 8 категориях, отсортированных по степени воздействия, и использующих Composition API или Options API для автоматизированной переработки и генерации кода.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إعادة هيكلة وتوليد رمز فيو.جس محسن باستخدام 40+ قاعدة في 8 فئات، مصنفة حسب الأثر، وتستخدم واجهة تركيبة أو خيارات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للتحديث التلقائي وتوليد الرمز."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing rendering and re-renders in Vue components","Implementing reactive state and computed properties for better performance","Refactoring existing Vue code for improved maintainability and efficiency"],"zh":["在Vue组件中优化渲染和重新渲染","实现响应式状态和计算属性以提高性能","重构现有的Vue代码以提高可维护性和效率"],"ja":["Vueコンポーネントでのレンダリングと再レンダリングの最適化","パフォーマンスの向上のためのリアクティブな状態と計算されたプロパティの実装","既存のVueコードのリファクタリングによるメンテナンス性と効率の向上"],"ko":["Vue 컴포넌트에서 렌더링 및 재렌더링 최적화","성능 개선을 위한 반응형 상태 및 계산된 속성 구현","기존 Vue 코드의 리팩터링을 통한 유지보수성 및 효율성 향상"],"es":["Optimizar la representación y las nuevas representaciones en componentes de Vue","Implementar estado reactivo y propiedades computadas para un mejor rendimiento","Refactorizar código de Vue existente para mejorar su mantenibilidad y eficiencia"],"fr":["Optimiser le rendu et les re-rendus dans les composants Vue","Mettre en œuvre un état réactif et des propriétés calculées pour de meilleures performances","Refactoriser le code Vue existant pour améliorer sa maintenabilité et son efficacité"],"de":["Optimieren des Renderns und der Neurenderung in Vue-Komponenten","Implementieren reaktiven Zustands und berechneter Eigenschaften für bessere Leistung","Refactorisieren von bestehendem Vue-Code, um Wartbarkeit und Effizienz zu verbessern"],"pt":["Otimizando a renderização e re-renderização em componentes Vue","Implementando estado reativo e propriedades computadas para melhor desempenho","Reestruturando o código Vue existente para melhor manutenção e eficiência"],"ru":["Оптимизация рендеринга и перерендеринга в компонентах Vue","Реализация реактивного состояния и вычисляемых свойств для лучшей производительности","Переработка существующего кода Vue для лучшей поддержки и эффективности"],"ar":["تحسين العرض والاعادة في مكونات فيو","تنفيذ حالة تفاعلية وخصائص محسوبة لتحسين الأداء","إعادة هيكلة رمز فيو الحالي لتحسين الصيانة والكفاءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Vue.js and its ecosystem","Specific to Vue.js applications only"],"zh":["需要Vue.js及其生态系统的知识","仅适用于Vue.js应用程序"],"ja":["Vue.jsとそのエコシステムの知識が必要","Vue.jsアプリケーションのみに特有"],"ko":["Vue.js 및 그 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요","Vue.js 애플리케이션 전용"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Vue.js y su ecosistema","Específico para aplicaciones de Vue.js solamente"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances de Vue.js et de son écosystème","Spécifique aux applications Vue.js uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Vue.js und seinem Ökosystem","Spezifisch für Vue.js-Anwendungen only"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de Vue.js e seu ecossistema","Específico para aplicações Vue.js apenas"],"ru":["Требует знания Vue.js и его экосистемы","Относится только к приложениям Vue.js"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة فيو.جس وبيئته","محدود لتطبيقات فيو.جس فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
