figuración de autenticación","Gestión de rutas y controladores"],"fr":["Authentification pour les applications TypeScript/JavaScript","Intégration avec Better Auth","Configuration étape par étape","Prise en charge des bases de données","Installation et configuration de l''authentification","Gestion des routes et des contrôleurs"],"de":["Authentifizierung für TypeScript/JavaScript-Anwendungen","Integration mit Better Auth","Schritt-für-Schritt-Konfiguration","Unterstützung für Datenbanken","Installation und Konfiguration der Authentifizierung","Verwaltung von Routen und Controllern"],"pt":["Configuração de projeto novo","Instalação do Better Auth","Criação de arquivos de autenticação","Configuração de roteador","Execução de migração e geração de código","Adição de recursos via plugins"],"ru":["Настройка нового проекта","Установка Better Auth","Создание файлов аутентификации","Настройка маршрутизатора","Выполнение миграции и генерации кода","Добавление функций через плагины"],"ar":["إعداد مشروع جديد","تثبيت Better Auth","إنشاء ملفات المصادقة","إعداد مسار","تشغيل هجرة و إنشاء رمز","إضافة ميزات عبر الإضافات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["身份验证","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","应用程序安全","认证技能","代码示例","语法","API","数据库"],"ja":["認証","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","アプリケーションセキュリティ","認証スキル","コード例","構文","API","データベース"],"ko":["인증","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","애플리케이션 보안","인증 스킬","코드 예시","구문","API","데이터베이스"],"es":["autenticación TypeScript","autenticación JavaScript","Better Auth","Create Auth Skill","seguridad de aplicaciones","protección de proyectos","desarrollo de software","TypeScript","JavaScript"],"fr":["authentification TypeScript","authentification JavaScript","Better Auth","Create Auth Skill","sécurité des applications","protection des projets","développement de logiciels","TypeScript","JavaScript"],"de":["Authentifizierung TypeScript","Authentifizierung JavaScript","Better Auth","Create Auth Skill","Sicherheit von Anwendungen","Schutz von Projekten","Software-Entwicklung","TypeScript","JavaScript"],"pt":["autenticação","TypeScript","JavaScript","Better Auth","Create Auth Skill","desenvolvimento de aplicações","segurança de aplicações","proteção de dados"],"ru":["аутентификация","TypeScript","JavaScript","Better Auth","Create Auth Skill","разработка приложений","безопасность приложений","защита данных"],"ar":["مصادقة","TypeScript","JavaScript","Better Auth","مهارة Create Auth","تطوير التطبيقات","أمان التطبيقات","حماية البيانات"]}},"owner":"husamql3","repo":"pstrack","repoPath":"husamql3/pstrack","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-auth-skill","description":"Skill for creating auth layers in TypeScript/JavaScript apps using Better Auth.","bodyPreview":"# Create Auth Skill\n\nGuide for adding authentication to TypeScript/JavaScript applications using Better Auth.\n\n**For code examples and syntax, see [better-auth.com/docs](https://better-auth.com/docs).**\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nIs this a new/empty project?\n├─ YES → New project setup\n│   1. Identify framework\n│   2. Choose database\n│   3. Install better-auth\n│   4. Create auth.ts + auth-client.ts\n│   5. Set up route handler\n│   6. Run CLI migrate/generate\n│   7. Add features via plugins\n│\n└─ N","body":"# Create Auth Skill\n\nGuide for adding authentication to TypeScript/JavaScript applications using Better Auth.\n\n**For code examples and syntax, see [better-auth.com/docs](https://better-auth.com/docs).**\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nIs this a new/empty project?\n├─ YES → New project setup\n│   1. Identify framework\n│   2. Choose database\n│   3. Install better-auth\n│   4. Create auth.ts + auth-client.ts\n│   5. Set up route handler\n│   6. Run CLI migrate/generate\n│   7. Add features via plugins\n│\n└─ NO → Does project have existing auth?\n    ├─ YES → Migration/enhancement\n    │   • Audit current auth for gaps\n    │   • Plan incremental migration\n    │   • See migration guides in docs\n    │\n    └─ NO → Add auth to existing project\n        1. Analyze project structure\n        2. Install better-auth\n        3. Create auth config\n        4. Add route handler\n        5. Run schema migrations\n        6. Integrate into existing pages\n```\n\n---\n\n## Installation\n\n**Core:** `npm install better-auth`\n\n**Scoped packages (as needed):**\n| Package | Use case |\n|---------|----------|\n| `@better-auth/passkey` | WebAuthn/Passkey auth |\n| `@better-auth/sso` | SAML/OIDC enterprise SSO |\n| `@better-auth/stripe` | Stripe payments |\n| `@better-auth/scim` | SCIM user provisioning |\n| `@better-auth/expo` | React Native/Expo |\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```env\nBETTER_AUTH_SECRET=<32+ chars, generate with: openssl rand -base64 32>\nBETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000\nDATABASE_URL=<your database connection string>\n```\n\nAdd OAuth secrets as needed: `GITHUB_CLIENT_ID`, `GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`, etc.\n\n---\n\n## Server Config (auth.ts)\n\n**Location:** `lib/auth.ts` or `src/lib/auth.ts`\n\n**Minimal config needs:**\n\n- `database` - Connection or adapter\n- `emailAndPassword: { enabled: true }` - For email/password auth\n\n**Standard config adds:**\n\n- `socialProviders` - OAuth providers (google, github, etc.)\n- `emailVerification.sendVerificationEmail` - Email verification handler\n- `emailAndPassword.sendResetPassword` - Password reset handler\n\n**Full config adds:**\n\n- `plugins` - Array of feature plugins\n- `session` - Expiry, cookie cache settings\n- `account.accountLinking` - Multi-provider linking\n- `rateLimit` - Rate limiting config\n\n**Export types:** `export type Session = typeof auth.$Infer.Session`\n\n---\n\n## Client Config (auth-client.ts)\n\n**Import by framework:**\n| Framework | Import |\n|-----------|--------|\n| React/Next.js | `better-auth/react` |\n| Vue | `better-auth/vue` |\n| Svelte | `better-auth/svelte` |\n| Solid | `better-auth/solid` |\n| Vanilla JS | `better-auth/client` |\n\n**Client plugins** go in `createAuthClient({ plugins: [...] })`.\n\n**Common exports:** `signIn`, `signUp`, `signOut`, `useSession`, `getSession`\n\n---\n\n## Route Handler Setup\n\n| Framework          | File                             | Handler                                          |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| Next.js App Router | `app/api/auth/[...all]/route.ts` | `toNextJsHandler(auth)` → export `{ GET, POST }` |\n| Next.js Pages      | `pages/api/auth/[...all].ts`     | `toNextJsHandler(auth)` → default export         |\n| Express            | Any file                         | `app.all(\"/api/auth/*\", toNodeHandler(auth))`    |\n| SvelteKit          | `src/hooks.server.ts`            | `svelteKitHandler(auth)`                         |\n| SolidStart         | Route file                       | `solidStartHandler(auth)`                        |\n| Hono               | Route file                       | `auth.handler(c.req.raw)`                        |\n\n**Next.js Server Components:** Add `nextCookies()` plugin to auth config.\n\n---\n\n## Database Migrations\n\n| Adapter         | Command                                                                                            |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Built-in Kysely | `npx @better-auth/cli@latest migrate` (applies directly)                                           |\n| Prisma          | `npx @better-auth/cli@latest generate --output prisma/schema.prisma` then `npx prisma migrate dev` |\n| Drizzle         | `npx @better-auth/cli@latest generate --output src/db/auth-schema.ts` then `npx drizzle-kit push`  |\n\n**Re-run after adding plugins.**\n\n---\n\n## Database Adapters\n\n| Database   | Setup                                                                                  |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| SQLite     | Pass `better-sqlite3` or `bun:sqlite` instance directly                                |\n| PostgreSQL | Pass `pg.Pool` instance directly                                                       |\n| MySQL      | Pass `mysql2` pool directly                                                            |\n| Prisma     | `prismaAdapter(prisma, { provider: \"postgresql\" })` from `better-auth/adapters/prisma` |\n| Drizzle    | `drizzleAdapter(db, { provider: \"pg\" })` from `better-auth/adapters/drizzle`           |\n| MongoDB    | `mongodbAdapter(db)` from `better-auth/adapters/mongodb`                               |\n\n---\n\n## Common Plugins\n\n| Plugin         | Server Import          | Client Import        | Purpose           |\n| -------------- | ---------------------- | -------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `twoFactor`    | `better-auth/plugins`  | `twoFactorClient`    | 2FA with TOTP/OTP |\n| `organization` | `better-auth/plugins`  | `organizationClient` | Teams/orgs        |\n| `admin`        | `better-auth/plugins`  | `adminClient`        | User management   |\n| `bearer`       | `better-auth/plugins`  | -                    | API token auth    |\n| `openAPI`      | `better-auth/plugins`  | -                    | API docs          |\n| `passkey`      | `@better-auth/passkey` | `passkeyClient`      | WebAuthn          |\n| `sso`          | `@better-auth/sso`     | -                    | Enterprise SSO    |\n\n**Plugin pattern:** Server plugin + client plugin + run migrations.\n\n---\n\n## Auth UI Implementation\n\n**Sign in flow:**\n\n1. `signIn.email({ email, password })` or `signIn.social({ provider, callbackURL })`\n2. Handle `error` in response\n3. Redirect on success\n\n**Session check (client):** `useSession()` hook returns `{ data: session, isPending }`\n\n**Session check (server):** `auth.api.getSession({ headers: await headers() })`\n\n**Protected routes:** Check session, redirect to `/sign-in` if null.\n\n---\n\n## Security Checklist\n\n- [ ] `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` set (32+ chars)\n- [ ] `advanced.useSecureCookies: true` in production\n- [ ] `trustedOrigins` configured\n- [ ] Rate limits enabled\n- [ ] Email verification enabled\n- [ ] Password reset implemented\n- [ ] 2FA for sensitive apps\n- [ ] CSRF protection NOT disabled\n- [ ] `account.accountLinking` reviewed\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue                           | Fix                                                           |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| \"Secret not set\"                | Add `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` env var                              |\n| \"Invalid Origin\"                | Add domain to `trustedOrigins`                                |\n| Cookies not setting             | Check `baseURL` matches domain; enable secure cookies in prod |\n| OAuth callback errors           | Verify redirect URIs in provider dashboard                    |\n| Type errors after adding plugin | Re-run CLI generate/migrate                                   |\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Docs](https://better-auth.com/docs)\n- [Examples](https://github.com/better-auth/examples)\n- [Plugins](https://better-auth.com/docs/concepts/plugins)\n- [CLI](https://better-auth.com/docs/concepts/cli)\n- [Migration Guides](https://better-auth.com/docs/guides)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:40:54.861Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript/JavaScript Agents needing seamless authentication integration using Better Auth.","zh":"适用于需要使用Better Auth实现无缝身份验证集成的TypeScript/JavaScript代理。","ja":"Better Authを使用したシームレスな認証統合が必要なTypeScript/JavaScriptエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Better Auth를 사용하여无缝한 인증 통합이 필요한 TypeScript/JavaScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de TypeScript/JavaScript que necesitan una integración de autenticación sin problemas usando Better Auth.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents TypeScript/JavaScript nécessitant une intégration d''authentification transparente à l''aide de Better Auth.","de":"Perfekt für TypeScript/JavaScript-Agents, die eine nahtlose AuthentifizierungsinTEGRATION mit Better Auth benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes TypeScript/JavaScript que necessitam de integração de autenticação sem problemas usando Better Auth.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов TypeScript/JavaScript, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция аутентификации с помощью Better Auth.","ar":"مثالي لعميل TypeScript/JavaScript الذي يحتاج إلى تكامل مصادقة بدون مشاكل باستخدام Better Auth."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to securely authenticate users via Better Auth, leveraging TypeScript/JavaScript and handling route setup, database choice, and plugin features for enhanced security and flexibility, including setup of auth.ts and auth-client.ts files.","zh":"赋予代理安全地通过Better Auth对用户进行身份验证的能力，利用TypeScript/JavaScript，并处理路由设置、数据库选择和插件功能，以实现增强的安全性和灵活性，包括设置auth.ts和auth-client.ts文件。","ja":"Better Authを使用して、エージェントがユーザーを安全に認証できるようにし、TypeScript/JavaScriptを活用して、ルート設定、データベースの選択、プラグイン機能など、セキュリティと柔軟性の向上を実現する。また、auth.tsとauth-client.tsファイルの設定も行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Better Auth를 통해 사용자를 안전하게 인증할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, TypeScript/JavaScript를 활용하여 라우팅 설정, 데이터베이스 선택 및 플러그인 기능 등을 처리하여 보안 및 유연성을 향상하며, auth.ts 및 auth-client.ts 파일 설정도 포함한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a autenticar a los usuarios de forma segura a través de Better Auth, aprovechando TypeScript/JavaScript y manejando la configuración de rutas, la elección de base de datos y las características de los plugins para una mayor seguridad y flexibilidad, incluyendo la configuración de los archivos auth.ts y auth-client.ts.","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''authentifier de manière sécurisée via Better Auth, en exploitant TypeScript/JavaScript et en gérant la configuration des routes, le choix de la base de données et les fonctionnalités des plugins pour une sécurité et une flexibilité accrues, y compris la configuration des fichiers auth.ts et auth-client.ts.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Benutzer über Better Auth sicher zu authentifizieren, indem es TypeScript/JavaScript nutzt und die Routenkonfiguration, die Datenbankwahl und die Pluginfunktionen für eine erhöhte Sicherheit und Flexibilität handhabt, einschließlich der Einrichtung der Dateien auth.ts und auth-client.ts.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a autenticar usuários de forma segura via Better Auth, aproveitando TypeScript/JavaScript e lidando com configuração de rota, escolha de banco de dados e recursos de plugin para segurança e flexibilidade aprimoradas, incluindo configuração de arquivos auth.ts e auth-client.ts.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасной аутентификации пользователей через Better Auth, используя TypeScript/JavaScript и обрабатывая настройку маршрутов, выбор базы данных и функции плагина для повышения безопасности и гибкости, включая настройку файлов auth.ts и auth-client.ts.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على مصادقة المستخدمين بشكل آمن من خلال Better Auth، مع استخدام TypeScript/JavaScript وتحديد إعداد مسار قاعدة البيانات وميزات البرنامج المساعد لتعزيز الأمان والمرونة، بما في ذلك إعداد ملفات auth.ts و auth-client.ts."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring new project authentication","Integrating Better Auth with existing projects","Setting up route handlers for secure user authentication","Managing user authentication via auth.ts and auth-client.ts"],"zh":["配置新项目的身份验证","将Better Auth集成到现有项目中","设置安全用户身份验证的路由处理程序","通过auth.ts和auth-client.ts管理用户身份验证"],"ja":["新規プロジェクトの認証を構成する","既存のプロジェクトにBetter Authを統合する","安全なユーザー認証のルートハンドラーを設定する","auth.tsとauth-client.tsを介してユーザー認証を管理する"],"ko":["새 프로젝트의 인증을 구성하는 것","기존 프로젝트에 Better Auth를 통합하는 것","안전한 사용자 인증을 위한 라우트 핸들러 설정","auth.ts 및 auth-client.ts를 통해 사용자 인증 관리"],"es":["Configuración de la autenticación de nuevos proyectos","Integración de Better Auth con proyectos existentes","Configuración de controladores de rutas para la autenticación de usuarios segura","Gestión de la autenticación de usuarios a través de auth.ts y auth-client.ts"],"fr":["Configuration de l''authentification de nouveaux projets","Intégration de Better Auth avec des projets existants","Configuration des gestionnaires de routes pour une authentification utilisateur sécurisée","Gestion de l''authentification des utilisateurs via auth.ts et auth-client.ts"],"de":["Konfiguration der Authentifizierung neuer Projekte","Integration von Better Auth in bestehende Projekte","Einrichtung von Routen-Handlern für eine sichere Benutzerauthentifizierung","Verwaltung der Benutzerauthentifizierung über auth.ts und auth-client.ts"],"pt":["Configurando autenticação de projeto novo","Integrando Better Auth com projetos existentes","Configurando manipuladores de rota para autenticação de usuário segura","Gerenciando autenticação de usuário via auth.ts e auth-client.ts"],"ru":["Настройка аутентификации нового проекта","Интеграция Better Auth с существующими проектами","Настройка обработчиков маршрутов для безопасной аутентификации пользователей","Управление аутентификацией пользователей через auth.ts и auth-client.ts"],"ar":["تكوين مصادقة مشروع جديد","دمج Better Auth مع المشاريع الحالية","تكوين معالجات المسار للمصادقة الآمنة للمستخدم","إدارة مصادقة المستخدم من خلال auth.ts و auth-client.ts"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Better Auth installation","Limited to TypeScript/JavaScript applications","Needs database selection and setup"],"zh":["需要安装Better Auth","仅限于TypeScript/JavaScript应用程序","需要数据库选择和设置"],"ja":["Better Authのインストールが必要","TypeScript/JavaScriptアプリケーションに限定される","データベースの選択と設定が必要"],"ko":["Better Auth 설치가 필요","TypeScript/JavaScript 애플리케이션에만 한정","데이터베이스 선택 및 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Better Auth","Limitado a aplicaciones de TypeScript/JavaScript","Necesita la selección y configuración de la base de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Better Auth","Limité aux applications TypeScript/JavaScript","Nécessite la sélection et la configuration de la base de données"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Better Auth","Begrenzt auf TypeScript/JavaScript-Anwendungen","Benötigt die Auswahl und Einrichtung der Datenbank"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Better Auth","Limitado a aplicações TypeScript/JavaScript","Necessita de seleção e configuração de banco de dados"],"ru":["Требует установки Better Auth","Ограничен для приложений TypeScript/JavaScript","Требует выбора и настройки базы данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Better Auth","محدود للتطبيقات TypeScript/JavaScript","يحتاج إلى اختيار وإعداد قاعدة البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('NuclearPlayer/nuclear-xrd/creating-components', 'community', 'NuclearPlayer', 'nuclear-xrd', 'NuclearPlayer/nuclear-xrd', 'creating-components', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:40:34.043Z', NULL, '{"id":"NuclearPlayer/nuclear-xrd/creating-components","name":"creating-components","description":{"zh":"本文介绍创建 UI 组件的方法，包括组件结构和实现模式","ja":"本文では、UI コンポーネントの作成方法を紹介し、コンポーネント構造と実装パターンについて説明","ko":"본 문서는 UI 컴포넌트를 생성하는 방법을 소개하며, 컴포넌트 구조 및 구현 패턴에 대해 설명","es":"Crear componentes UI personalizados con React y Class Variance Authority para mejorar la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Créer des composants UI sur mesure avec React et Class Variance Authority pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Erstellen von benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten mit React und Class Variance Authority für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung.","pt":"Criar componentes UI é fundamental para desenvolver interfaces de usuário eficazes. Aprenda a estrutura e os padrões de implementação","ru":"Создание компонентов UI является фундаментальным для разработки эффективных пользовательских интерфейсов. Узнайте о структуре и шаблонах реализации","ar":"إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم هو أساسي لتطوير واجهات المستخدم الفعالة. تعلم الهيكل ونمط التنفيذ","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"创建 UI 组件","ja":"UI コンポーネントの作成","ko":"UI 컴포넌트 만들기","es":"Crear Componentes UI Personalizados","fr":"Créer des Composants UI Sur Mesure","de":"Erstellen von Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten","pt":"Criando Componentes UI","ru":"Создание Компонентов UI","ar":"إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم","en":"creating-components"},"description":{"zh":"本文介绍创建 UI 组件的方法，包括组件结构和实现模式","ja":"本文では、UI コンポーネントの作成方法を紹介し、コンポーネント構造と実装パターンについて説明","ko":"본 문서는 UI 컴포넌트를 생성하는 방법을 소개하며, 컴포넌트 구조 및 구현 패턴에 대해 설명","es":"Crear componentes UI personalizados con React y Class Variance Authority para mejorar la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Créer des composants UI sur mesure avec React et Class Variance Authority pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Erstellen von benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten mit React und Class Variance Authority für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung.","pt":"Criar componentes UI é fundamental para desenvolver interfaces de usuário eficazes. Aprenda a estrutura e os padrões de implementação","ru":"Создание компонентов UI является фундаментальным для разработки эффективных пользовательских интерфейсов. Узнайте о структуре и шаблонах реализации","ar":"إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم هو أساسي لتطوير واجهات المستخدم الفعالة. تعلم الهيكل ونمط التنفيذ","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["组件结构","实现模式","导出组件","单元测试","代码片段"],"ja":["コンポーネント構造","実装パターン","コンポーネントのエクスポート","ユニットテスト","コードスニペット"],"ko":["컴포넌트 구조","구현 패턴","컴포넌트 내보내기","유닛 테스트","코드 스니펫"],"es":["Estructura de componentes reutilizables","Implementación con React y Class Variance Authority","Pruebas unitarias con Vitest","Exportación de componentes desde un índice centralizado","Patrón de implementación para componentes personalizados"],"fr":["Structure de composants réutilisables","Implémentation avec React et Class Variance Authority","Tests unitaires avec Vitest","Exportation de composants depuis un index centralisé","Modèle d''implémentation pour composants sur mesure"],"de":["Struktur wiederverwendbarer Komponenten","Implementierung mit React und Class Variance Authority","Einheitliche Tests mit Vitest","Export von Komponenten aus einem zentralen Index","Implementierungsmuster für benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten"],"pt":["Estrutura de componente","Padrões de implementação","Reutilização de código","Testes unitários","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Структура компонента","Шаблоны реализации","Переиспользование кода","Юнит-тесты","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["هيكل المكون","نمط التنفيذ","إعادة استخدام الكود","اختبارات الوحدة","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI 组件","React","组件结构","实现模式","导出组件","单元测试"],"ja":["UI コンポーネント","React","コンポーネント構造","実装パターン","コンポーネントのエクスポート","ユニットテスト"],"ko":["UI 컴포넌트","React","컴포넌트 구조","구현 패턴","컴포넌트 내보내기","유닛 테스트"],"es":["componentes UI","React","Class Variance Authority","desarrollo front-end","patrones de implementación","pruebas unitarias","Vitest"],"fr":["composants UI","React","Class Variance Authority","développement front-end","modèles d''implémentation","tests unitaires","Vitest"],"de":["benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten","React","Class Variance Authority","Front-End-Entwicklung","Implementierungsmuster","Einheitliche Tests","Vitest"],"pt":["componentes ui","desenvolvimento de interfaces","react","typescript","testes unitários","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["компоненты ui","разработка интерфейсов","react","typescript","юнит-тесты","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["مكونات واجهة المستخدم","تطوير واجهات","ري액ت","تايب سكريبت","اختبارات الوحدة","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"NuclearPlayer","repo":"nuclear-xrd","repoPath":"NuclearPlayer/nuclear-xrd","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"creating-components","description":"Use when creating new UI components in packages/ui. Covers component structure, tests, stories, and what to avoid.","bodyPreview":"# Creating UI Components\n\n## Component Structure\n\n```\npackages/ui/src/components/MyComponent/\n├── MyComponent.tsx      # Implementation\n├── MyComponent.test.tsx # Tests\n├── index.ts             # Re-exports\n└── __snapshots__/       # Vitest snapshots (auto-generated)\n```\n\nAfter creating, export from `packages/ui/src/components/index.ts`.\n\n## Implementation Pattern\n\n```tsx\nimport { cva, VariantProps } from ''class-variance-authority'';\nimport { ComponentProps, FC } from ''react'';\nimport { cn } from","body":"# Creating UI Components\n\n## Component Structure\n\n```\npackages/ui/src/components/MyComponent/\n├── MyComponent.tsx      # Implementation\n├── MyComponent.test.tsx # Tests\n├── index.ts             # Re-exports\n└── __snapshots__/       # Vitest snapshots (auto-generated)\n```\n\nAfter creating, export from `packages/ui/src/components/index.ts`.\n\n## Implementation Pattern\n\n```tsx\nimport { cva, VariantProps } from ''class-variance-authority'';\nimport { ComponentProps, FC } from ''react'';\nimport { cn } from ''../../utils'';\n\nconst variants = cva(''base-classes'', {\n  variants: { /* ... */ },\n  defaultVariants: { /* ... */ },\n});\n\ntype MyComponentProps = ComponentProps<''div''> & VariantProps<typeof variants>;\n\nexport const MyComponent: FC<MyComponentProps> = ({\n  className,\n  variant,\n  ...props\n}) => (\n  <div className={cn(variants({ variant, className }))} {...props} />\n);\n```\n\n## Tests\n\n**What to test:**\n- Snapshots (1-2 covering key variants)\n- User interactions\n- Behavior (callbacks called with correct args)\n\n**What NOT to test:**\n- CSS classes, attributes (use snapshots instead)\n- Internal state\n- Things TypeScript already enforces\n\n**Consolidate tests.** One test can cover multiple related assertions. An exception to that is snapshot tests - one snapshot per variant/state.\n\n## Stories\n\nCreate `packages/storybook/src/MyComponent.stories.tsx`.\n\n**One story can show multiple related variants.** For example, it''s wasteful to create a story for each variant of a button. Put them all together in one place. Don''t create separate stories for each variant:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Meta, StoryObj } from ''@storybook/react-vite'';\nimport { useState } from ''react'';\nimport { MyComponent } from ''@nuclearplayer/ui'';\n\nconst meta = {\n  title: ''Components/MyComponent'',\n  component: MyComponent,\n  tags: [''autodocs''],\n} satisfies Meta<typeof MyComponent>;\n\nexport default meta;\ntype Story = StoryObj<typeof MyComponent>;\n\nexport const AllVariants: Story = {\n  render: () => {\n    const [state, setState] = useState(initialState);\n    return (\n      <div className=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n        {/* Show all variants, states, interactions */}\n      </div>\n    );\n  },\n};\n```\n\nThis isn''t an iron rule, sometimes it will make more sense to have separate stories.\n\nDon''t run storybook build checks.\n\n## Avoiding Duplication\n\nBefore creating a new component, check if an existing one can be extended.\n\n**Pattern: Discriminated unions for mode variants**\n\nExample: Instead of creating `SingleSelect` and `MultiSelect` components:\n\n```tsx\ntype Props = \n  | { multiple?: false; selected: string; onChange: (id: string) => void }\n  | { multiple: true; selected: string[]; onChange: (ids: string[]) => void };\n```\n\nTypeScript enforces correct types based on the `multiple` prop.\n\n## Classes for customization\n\nWhere it''s likely that a component will need custom styling, expose a `className` prop.\n\nIf there are many parts that may need styling, consider exposing a `classes` prop with specific class names for each part. Define a type for the `classes` prop. Refer to `packages/ui/src/components/TrackTable/types.ts` for an example.\n\n## Strings\n\nAll user-facing strings go through i18n - no hardcoded UI text.\nIf a new component in the ui package needs labels and other kinds of localized text, it should accept a `labels` prop with the relevant strings. The prop should have its own type defined. Refer to `packages/ui/src/components/QueueItem/types.ts` for an example.\n\n## Accessibility\n\nWe don''t care about that. If there''s an opportunity to handle that easily, do it, but don''t go out of your way.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Component in `packages/ui/src/components/MyComponent/`\n- [ ] Exported from `packages/ui/src/components/index.ts`\n- [ ] Tests cover behavior, not implementation\n- [ ] Tests consolidated (not one per variant)\n- [ ] One story showing all variants\n- [ ] No CSS class assertions in tests\n- [ ] No duplicate component when extending existing one works\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:40:34.043Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring structured UI component development with React and TypeScript.","zh":"适用于需要使用 React 和 TypeScript 进行结构化 UI 组件开发的前端代理。","ja":"React と TypeScript を使用した構造化された UI コンポーネント開発を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに適しています。","ko":"React와 TypeScript를 사용하여 구조화된 UI 컴포넌트 개발을 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que requieren desarrollo de componentes de interfaz de usuario estructurados con React y TypeScript.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant un développement de composants d''interface utilisateur structurés avec React et TypeScript.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die strukturierte Entwicklung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit React und TypeScript erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem desenvolvimento de componentes de interface do usuário estruturados com React e TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, требующих структурированного разработки компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с использованием React и TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يتطلبون تطوير مكونات واجهة المستخدم الهيكلية مع React و TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate reusable UI components using class-variance-authority and React, with seamless integration of Vitest snapshots for testing and validation, while leveraging TypeScript for type safety and maintainability.","zh":"赋予代理生成可重用 UI 组件的能力，使用类变量权限和 React，并结合 Vitest 快照进行测试和验证，同时利用 TypeScript 实现类型安全和可维护性。","ja":"クラス変数権限と React を使用して再利用可能な UI コンポーネントを生成するエージェントを可能にし、Vitest スナップショットを使用したテストと検証のシームレスな統合を提供し、TypeScript を使用して型の安全性と保守性を実現します。","ko":"클래스 변수 권한과 React를 사용하여 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, Vitest 스냅샷을 사용한 테스트 및 검증의 무결한 통합을 제공하고, TypeScript를 사용하여 유형 안전성 및 유지 보수성을 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables utilizando class-variance-authority y React, con integración perfecta de instantáneas de Vitest para pruebas y validación, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha TypeScript para la seguridad y mantenibilidad de tipos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables à l''aide de class-variance-authority et de React, avec une intégration fluide des instantanés Vitest pour les tests et la validation, tout en exploitant TypeScript pour la sécurité et la maintenabilité des types.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, wiederverwendbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit class-variance-authority und React zu erstellen, mit nahtloser Integration von Vitest-Snapshot-Tests und -Validierung, während gleichzeitig TypeScript für die Typsicherheit und Wartbarkeit genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar componentes de interface do usuário reutilizáveis usando class-variance-authority e React, com integração transparente de instantâneos do Vitest para testes e validação, aproveitando o TypeScript para segurança de tipo e manutenção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать многократно используемые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса с использованием class-variance-authority и React, с бесшовной интеграцией снимков Vitest для тестирования и проверки, используя TypeScript для безопасности типов и поддержки.","ar":"يُمنح الوكلاء القدرة على生成 مكونات واجهة المستخدم قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام باستخدام class-variance-authority و React، مع تكامل متواصل لصور Vitest للاختبار والتحقق، مع الاستفادة من TypeScript لأمان النوع والصيانة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating customizable UI components with VariantProps","Implementing component-driven development with index.ts re-exports","Debugging component snapshots using Vitest"],"zh":["使用 VariantProps 创建可定制的 UI 组件","使用 index.ts 再导出实现组件驱动的开发","使用 Vitest 调试组件快照"],"ja":["VariantProps を使用してカスタマイズ可能な UI コンポーネントを作成する","index.ts の再エクスポートを使用してコンポーネント駆動の開発を実現する","Vitest を使用してコンポーネントのスナップショットをデバッグする"],"ko":["VariantProps를 사용하여 사용자 정의 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","index.ts의 재수출을 사용하여 컴포넌트 주도 개발을 구현하는 것","Vitest를 사용하여 컴포넌트의 스냅샷을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizables con VariantProps","Implementar un desarrollo impulsado por componentes con re-exportaciones de index.ts","Depurar instantáneas de componentes con Vitest"],"fr":["Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables avec VariantProps","Mettre en œuvre un développement piloté par les composants avec des réexportations index.ts","Déboguer les instantanés de composants avec Vitest"],"de":["Erstellen von anpassbaren Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit VariantProps","Implementierung eines komponentengetriebenen Entwicklungsprozesses mit index.ts-Reexporten","Fehlerbehebung von Komponentensnapshots mit Vitest"],"pt":["Criação de componentes de interface do usuário personalizáveis com VariantProps","Implementação do desenvolvimento orientado a componentes com re-exportações de index.ts","Depuração de instantâneos de componentes usando Vitest"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с помощью VariantProps","Реализация компонент-ориентированного развития с помощью перезаписи index.ts","Отладка снимков компонентов с помощью Vitest"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم قابلة للتعديل مع VariantProps","تنفيذ التطوير الموجه للمكونات مع إعادة التصدير index.ts","تصحيح أخطاء صور المكونات باستخدام Vitest"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and TypeScript setup","Limited to UI component development","Dependent on class-variance-authority library"],"zh":["需要 React 和 TypeScript 的设置","仅限 UI 组件开发","依赖于类变量权限库"],"ja":["React と TypeScript の設定が必要","UI コンポーネント開発のみ","クラス変数権限ライブラリに依存"],"ko":["React와 TypeScript 설정이 필요","UI 컴포넌트 개발만","클래스 변수 권한 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de React y TypeScript","Limitado al desarrollo de componentes de interfaz de usuario","Dependiente de la biblioteca class-variance-authority"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration React et TypeScript","Limité au développement de composants d''interface utilisateur","Dépend de la bibliothèque class-variance-authority"],"de":["Benötigt React- und TypeScript-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Abhängig von der class-variance-authority-Bibliothek"],"pt":["Exige configuração do React e TypeScript","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de componentes de interface do usuário","Dependente da biblioteca class-variance-authority"],"ru":["Требует настройки React и TypeScript","Ограничен разработкой компонентов пользовательского интерфейса","Зависит от библиотеки class-variance-authority"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد React و TypeScript","محدود بتطوير مكونات واجهة المستخدم","يعتمد على مكتبة class-variance-authority"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('iheanyi/tasuku/tasuku', 'community', 'iheanyi', 'tasuku', 'iheanyi/tasuku', 'tasuku', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:40:51.159Z', NULL, '{"id":"iheanyi/tasuku/tasuku","name":"tasuku","description":{"zh":"Tasuku是一种轻量级的多代理任务管理系统，支持持久和Git友好的任务管理，适用于AI代理在代码库中的工作","ja":"Tasukuは、コードベースにおけるAIエージェントの作業に適した、持続性とGit 친화的なタスク管理を提供する軽量マルチエージェントタスク管理システムです","ko":"Tasuku는 코드베이스에서 AI 에이전트의 작업을 위한 지속성과 Git 친화적인 작업 관리를 제공하는 경량 다중 에이전트 작업 관리 시스템입니다","es":"Tasuku es una herramienta de gestión de tareas diseñada para agentes de IA que trabajan en codebases, con funcionalidades como la persistencia de tareas y la captura de conocimiento","fr":"Tasuku est un outil de gestion de tâches conçu pour les agents IA qui travaillent sur des codebases, avec des fonctionnalités telles que la persistance des tâches et la capture de connaissances","de":"Tasuku ist ein Task-Management-Tool, das für IA-Agenten entwickelt wurde, die an Codebasen arbeiten, mit Funktionen wie der Persistenz von Tasks und der Erfassung von Wissen","pt":"Tasuku é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de tarefas projetada para agentes de IA que trabalham em código","ru":"Tasuku - это инструмент управления задачами, предназначенный для агентов ИИ, работающих с кодом","ar":"Tasuku هي أداة إدارة مهام مصممة للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي العاملين على الكود","en":"Lightweight multi-agent task management that promotes agentic knowledge capture "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tasuku - 轻量级多代理任务管理","ja":"Tasuku - ライトウェイトマルチエージェントタスク管理","ko":"Tasuku - 경량 다중 에이전트 작업 관리","es":"Tasuku: Gestión de tareas para agentes de IA","fr":"Tasuku : Gestion de tâches pour agents IA","de":"Tasuku: Agenten-Task-Management","pt":"Tasuku: Gerenciamento de Tarefas para Agentes de IA","ru":"Tasuku: Управление задачами для агентов ИИ","ar":"Tasuku: إدارة المهام للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"tasuku"},"description":{"zh":"Tasuku是一种轻量级的多代理任务管理系统，支持持久和Git友好的任务管理，适用于AI代理在代码库中的工作","ja":"Tasukuは、コードベースにおけるAIエージェントの作業に適した、持続性とGit 친화的なタスク管理を提供する軽量マルチエージェントタスク管理システムです","ko":"Tasuku는 코드베이스에서 AI 에이전트의 작업을 위한 지속성과 Git 친화적인 작업 관리를 제공하는 경량 다중 에이전트 작업 관리 시스템입니다","es":"Tasuku es una herramienta de gestión de tareas diseñada para agentes de IA que trabajan en codebases, con funcionalidades como la persistencia de tareas y la...","fr":"Tasuku est un outil de gestion de tâches conçu pour les agents IA qui travaillent sur des codebases, avec des fonctionnalités telles que la persistance des t...","de":"Tasuku ist ein Task-Management-Tool, das für IA-Agenten entwickelt wurde, die an Codebasen arbeiten, mit Funktionen wie der Persistenz von Tasks und der Erfa...","pt":"Tasuku é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de tarefas projetada para agentes de IA que trabalham em código","ru":"Tasuku - это инструмент управления задачами, предназначенный для агентов ИИ, работающих с кодом","ar":"Tasuku هي أداة إدارة مهام مصممة للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي العاملين على الكود","en":"Lightweight multi-agent task management that promotes agentic knowledge capture "},"definition":{"en":"Lightweight multi-agent task management that promotes agentic knowledge capture "},"features":{"zh":["持久任务管理","Git友好","多会话工作","任务依赖","知识捕获"],"ja":["持続的なタスク管理","Git親和性","マルチセッション作業","タスク依存","知識の取得"],"ko":["지속적인 작업 관리","Git 친화성","다중 세션 작업","작업 의존성","지식 캡처"],"es":["Gestión de tareas multi-agente","Persistencia de tareas","Captura de conocimiento","Dependencias de tareas","Resumen de proyecto"],"fr":["Gestion de tâches multi-agents","Persistance des tâches","Capture de connaissances","Dépendances de tâches","Résumé de projet"],"de":["Multi-Agenten-Task-Management","Persistenz von Tasks","Erfassung von Wissen","Task-Abhängigkeiten","Projektzusammenfassung"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de tarefas persistente","Dependências de tarefas","Captura de conhecimento","Resumo do estado do projeto"],"ru":["ПERSISTентное управление задачами","Зависимости задач","Захват знаний","Сводка состояния проекта"],"ar":["إدارة مهام مستدامة","اعتماديات المهام","التقاط المعرفة","ملخص حالة المشروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tasuku","多代理任务管理","AI代理","代码库","持久任务管理","Git友好","任务依赖","知识捕获"],"ja":["Tasuku","マルチエージェントタスク管理","AIエージェント","コードベース","持続的なタスク管理","Git親和性","タスク依存","知識の取得"],"ko":["Tasuku","다중 에이전트 작업 관리","AI 에이전트","코드베이스","지속적인 작업 관리","Git 친화성","작업 의존성","지식 캡처"],"es":["gestión de tareas","agentes de IA","codebases","captura de conocimiento","persistencia de tareas","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["gestion de tâches","agents IA","codebases","capture de connaissances","persistance des tâches","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Task-Management","IA-Agenten","Codebasen","Erfassung von Wissen","Persistenz von Tasks","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["gerenciamento de tarefas","agentes de IA","captura de conhecimento","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de produtividade","gerenciamento de projeto"],"ru":["управление задачами","агенты ИИ","захват знаний","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты производительности","управление проектом"],"ar":["إدارة المهام","الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","التقاط المعرفة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الإنتاجية","إدارة المشروع"]}},"owner":"iheanyi","repo":"tasuku","repoPath":"iheanyi/tasuku","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tasuku","description":"Agent-first task management. Use when tracking multi-session work, recording learnings/decisions, managing task dependencies, or persisting context across sessions. Provides tk_list, tk_add, tk_done, tk_start, tk_learn, tk_decide, tk_note, tk_show, tk_find, tk_ready, tk_context, tk_stats, tk_block, tk_task, tk_metadata, tk_manage, tk_health, tk_suggest, tk_deps, and tk_help tools.","bodyPreview":"# Tasuku — Agent-First Task Management\n\nTasuku provides persistent, git-friendly task management designed for AI agents working on codebases.\n\n## When to Use Tasuku\n\n- **Multi-session work**: Tasks, learnings, and decisions persist across sessions\n- **Task dependencies**: Block/unblock tasks, track what''s ready to work on\n- **Knowledge capture**: Record learnings (\"Never X\", \"Always Y\") and architectural decisions\n- **Project context**: Get a summary of project state at any time\n\n## Quick Start","body":"# Tasuku — Agent-First Task Management\n\nTasuku provides persistent, git-friendly task management designed for AI agents working on codebases.\n\n## When to Use Tasuku\n\n- **Multi-session work**: Tasks, learnings, and decisions persist across sessions\n- **Task dependencies**: Block/unblock tasks, track what''s ready to work on\n- **Knowledge capture**: Record learnings (\"Never X\", \"Always Y\") and architectural decisions\n- **Project context**: Get a summary of project state at any time\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Check project state\nUse `tk_context` to get a full overview of tasks, learnings, and decisions.\n\n### Pick up work\nUse `tk_ready` to see tasks ready to work on, then `tk_start` to begin.\n\n### Track progress\n- `tk_add` — Create new tasks\n- `tk_note` — Add progress notes to tasks\n- `tk_done` — Mark tasks complete\n\n### Capture knowledge\n- `tk_learn` — Record insights, gotchas, rules (\"Never manually edit ANSI strings\")\n- `tk_decide` — Record architectural decisions with alternatives and reasoning\n\n## Task vs Session Scope\n\nUse Tasuku for **project-level** work that spans sessions:\n- Features, bugs, milestones\n- Architectural decisions\n- Cross-cutting learnings\n\nUse your editor''s built-in task list for **session-level** steps:\n- Implementation steps within a single session\n- Temporary checklists\n\n## Workflow Commands\n\n### Starting a Session\n1. `tk_context` — See project overview\n2. `tk_ready` — Find next task to work on\n3. `tk_start` — Begin working on a task\n\n### During Work\n- `tk_note` — Record progress, blockers, or findings\n- `tk_learn` — Capture insights as you discover them\n- `tk_block` — Mark tasks blocked by other tasks\n\n### Completing Work\n1. `tk_done` — Mark task complete\n2. `tk_learn` — Capture what you learned (don''t skip this!)\n3. `tk_ready` — See what''s unblocked and ready next\n\n### Finding Information\n- `tk_find` — Search across tasks, learnings, and decisions\n- `tk_show` — Get full details on a specific task\n- `tk_deps` — See task dependency graph\n- `tk_stats` — Project health metrics\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:40:51.159Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Agent Systems needing lightweight, git-friendly task management with persistent knowledge capture.","zh":"非常适合需要轻量级、git友好任务管理和持久知识捕获的多智能体系统。","ja":"マルチエージェントシステムで軽量のタスク管理と永続的なナレッジのキャプチャが必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"가벼운 태스크 관리와 지속적인 지식 캡처가 필요한 멀티 에이전트 시스템에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para sistemas de múltiples agentes que necesitan una gestión de tareas ligera y amigable con git, con captura de conocimiento persistente.","fr":"Parfait pour les systèmes multi-agents nécessitant une gestion de tâches légère et compatible avec git, avec une capture de connaissances persistante.","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Agenten-Systeme, die eine leichte, git-freundliche Aufgabenverwaltung mit persistenter Wissensspeicherung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Sistemas de Múltiplos Agentes que necessitam de gerenciamento de tarefas leve, amigável ao git, com captura de conhecimento persistente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Мультиагентных Систем, которым необходим легкий, дружественный к git, менеджмент задач с постоянной фиксацией знаний.","ar":"مثالي لأنظمة الوكلاء المتعددة التي تحتاج إلى إدارة مهام خفيفة وقابلة للتكامل مع جيت مع التقاط المعرفة المستدام"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage tasks across sessions with features like task dependencies, knowledge capture, and project context summaries, utilizing git for version control and persistence.","zh":"赋予代理管理任务的能力，支持会话间的任务管理，具有任务依赖、知识捕获和项目上下文摘要等功能，利用git实现版本控制和持久化。","ja":"エージェントにタスクを管理する能力を与え、セッション間のタスク管理をサポートします。タスク依存関係、ナレッジのキャプチャ、プロジェクトのコンテキスト要約などの機能を備え、gitを使用してバージョン管理と永続化を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 태스크를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 세션 간의 태스크 관리를 지원하며, 태스크 종속성, 지식 캡처, 프로젝트 컨텍스트 요약 등의 기능을 제공하고 git을 사용하여 버전 관리와 영속화를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar tareas a través de sesiones con características como dependencias de tareas, captura de conocimiento y resúmenes de contexto de proyecto, utilizando git para el control de versiones y la persistencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des tâches à travers les sessions avec des fonctionnalités telles que les dépendances de tâches, la capture de connaissances et les résumés de contexte de projet, en utilisant git pour le contrôle de version et la persistance.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Aufgaben über Sitzungen hinweg zu verwalten, mit Funktionen wie Aufgabenabhängigkeiten, Wissensspeicherung und Projektzusammenfassungen, unter Verwendung von git für Versionskontrolle und Persistenz.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar tarefas entre sessões com recursos como dependências de tarefas, captura de conhecimento e resumos de contexto de projeto, utilizando o git para controle de versão e persistência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять задачами на протяжении сеансов с функциями как зависимости задач, фиксация знаний и сводки контекста проекта, используя git для контроля версий и постоянного хранения.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة المهام عبر الجلسات مع ميزات مثل зависимости المهام والتقاط المعرفة وموجزات سياق المشروع، باستخدام جيت للتحكم في الإصدار والمثابرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Managing multi-session work with persistent task tracking","Tracking task dependencies to optimize workflow","Capturing architectural decisions and learnings for knowledge retention"],"zh":["持久任务跟踪的多会话工作管理","跟踪任务依赖以优化工作流","捕获架构决策和经验以实现知识保留"],"ja":["永続的なタスク追跡によるマルチセッションワークの管理","タスク依存関係の追跡によるワークフローの最適化","アーキテクチャ上の決定と学習のキャプチャによるナレッジの保持"],"ko":["지속적인 태스크 추적을 통한 멀티 세션 작업 관리","태스크 종속성을追踪하여 워크플ロー 최적화","아키텍처 결정 및 학습의 캡처를 통한 지식 보존"],"es":["Gestión de trabajo en varias sesiones con seguimiento de tareas persistente","Seguimiento de dependencias de tareas para optimizar el flujo de trabajo","Captura de decisiones arquitectónicas y aprendizajes para la retención de conocimiento"],"fr":["Gestion de travail en plusieurs sessions avec suivi de tâches persistant","Suivi des dépendances de tâches pour optimiser le flux de travail","Capture de décisions architecturales et d''apprentissages pour la rétention de connaissances"],"de":["Verwaltung von Mehrsitzungsarbeit mit persistenter Aufgabenverfolgung","Verfolgung von Aufgabenabhängigkeiten zur Optimierung des Arbeitsflusses","Erfassung von Architekturentscheidungen und Lernergebnissen für die Wissensspeicherung"],"pt":["Gerenciar trabalho de sessão múltipla com acompanhamento de tarefas persistente","Acompanhar dependências de tarefas para otimizar o fluxo de trabalho","Capturar decisões arquiteturais e aprendizados para retenção de conhecimento"],"ru":["Управление работой в нескольких сессиях с постоянным отслеживанием задач","Отслеживание зависимостей задач для оптимизации рабочего процесса","Фиксация архитектурных решений и знаний для сохранения знаний"],"ar":["إدارة العمل على جلسات متعددة مع تتبع مستدام للمهام","تتبع зависимости المهام لتحسين تدفق العمل","التقاط قرارات الهندسة المعمارية والتعلم للاحتفاظ بالمعرفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git integration for version control","Designed specifically for AI agents working on codebases"],"zh":["需要git集成以实现版本控制","专门为在代码库上工作的AI代理设计"],"ja":["バージョン管理のためにgitの統合が必要","コードベース上で作業するAIエージェントのために特別に設計されている"],"ko":["버전 관리를 위해 git 통합이 필요","코드베이스에서 작업하는 AI 에이전트를 위해 특별히 설계됨"],"es":["Requiere integración con git para el control de versiones","Diseñado específicamente para agentes de IA que trabajan en bases de código"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec git pour le contrôle de version","Conçu spécifiquement pour les agents d''IA travaillant sur des bases de code"],"de":["Erfordert git-Integration für die Versionskontrolle","Speziell für KI-Agenten entwickelt, die an Codebasen arbeiten"],"pt":["Requer integração com o git para controle de versão","Projetado especificamente para agentes de IA que trabalham em repositórios de código"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с git для контроля версий","Разработан специально для агентов ИИ, работающих с кодовыми базами"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع جيت للتحكم في الإصدار","صُمم خصيصًا لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يعملون على قواعد الشفرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
