웹 표준을 사용하여 빌드나 부풀림이 없는 스택으로 자유로운 사용 감을 제공합니다","es":"Depuración de Bknd para diagnosticar y solucionar problemas comunes utilizando herramientas de línea de comandos y análisis de errores","fr":"Débogage Bknd pour diagnostiquer et résoudre les problèmes courants en utilisant des outils de ligne de commande et d''analyse d''erreurs","de":"Bknd-Debugging zum Diagnose und Beheben häufiger Probleme mit Befehlszeilenwerkzeugen und Fehleranalyse","pt":"O Bknd é uma pilha leve e flexível que permite depuração eficaz de problemas comuns.","ru":"Bknd - это легкая и гибкая стек, которая позволяет эффективно отлаживать распространенные проблемы.","ar":"Bknd هي مجموعة خفيفة ومرنة تمكن من تصحيح أخطاء المشكلات الشائعة بشكل فعال.","en":"A no-build, un-bloated stack built upon Web Standards that feels freeing to use and can be deployed anywhere."},"definition":{"en":"A no-build, un-bloated stack built upon Web Standards that feels freeing to use and can be deployed anywhere."},"features":{"zh":["使用CLI工具进行调试","错误分析和系统性故障排除","支持HTTP状态码","提供UI模式和代码模式","支持实体schema可视化","支持CRUD操作测试"],"ja":["CLIツールを使用したデバッグ","エラーアナリシスと体系的なトラブルシューティング","HTTPステータスコードのサポート","UIモードとコードモードの提供","エンティティスキーマの可視化のサポート","CRUD操作のテストのサポート"],"ko":["CLI 도구를 사용한 디버깅","오류 분석 및 체계적인 문제 해결","HTTP 상태 코드 지원","UI 모드 및 코드 모드 제공","엔티티 스키마 시각화 지원","CRUD 연산 테스트 지원"],"es":["Depuración de problemas comunes con herramientas de línea de comandos","Análisis de errores y registro de depuración","Pruebas de operaciones CRUD manualmente","Verificación de esquemas de entidad visualmente","Configuración de usuarios y roles"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes courants avec des outils de ligne de commande","Analyse d''erreurs et journal de débogage","Tests d''opérations CRUD manuelles","Vérification des schémas d''entité visuellement","Configuration des utilisateurs et des rôles"],"de":["Debugging von häufigen Problemen mit Befehlszeilenwerkzeugen","Fehleranalyse und Debug-Protokoll","Manuelle Tests von CRUD-Operationen","Visuelle Überprüfung von Entitätsschemata","Benutzer- und Rollenkonfiguration"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas comuns","Uso de ferramentas CLI","Análise de erros","Solução de problemas sistemáticos","Acesso ao painel de administração","Teste de operações CRUD"],"ru":["Отладка распространенных проблем","Использование инструментов CLI","Анализ ошибок","Систематическое решение проблем","Доступ к панели администратора","Тестирование операций CRUD"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء المشكلات الشائعة","استخدام أدوات CLI","تحليل الأخطاء","حل المشكلات بشكل منهجي","الدخول إلى لوحة التحكم","اختبار عمليات CRUD"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Bknd调试","Web标准","CLI工具","错误分析","系统性故障排除","HTTP状态码","UI模式","代码模式","实体schema","CRUD操作"],"ja":["Bkndデバッグ","Web標準","CLIツール","エラーアナリシス","体系的なトラブルシューティング","HTTPステータスコード","UIモード","コードモード","エンティティスキーマ","CRUD操作"],"ko":["Bknd 디버깅","웹 표준","CLI 도구","오류 분석","체계적인 문제 해결","HTTP 상태 코드","UI 모드","코드 모드","엔티티 스키마","CRUD 연산"],"es":["depuración de Bknd","herramientas de línea de comandos","análisis de errores","pruebas de operaciones CRUD","esquemas de entidad","configuración de usuarios y roles","debugging de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["débogage Bknd","outils de ligne de commande","analyse d''erreurs","tests d''opérations CRUD","schémas d''entité","configuration des utilisateurs et des rôles","débogage d''applications web"],"de":["Bknd-Debugging","Befehlszeilenwerkzeuge","Fehleranalyse","CRUD-Operationen testen","Entitätsschemata","Benutzer- und Rollenkonfiguration","Webanwendungs-Debugging"],"pt":["depuração bknd","ferramentas cli","análise de erros","solução de problemas","desenvolvimento web","padrões web","bknd debugging"],"ru":["отладка bknd","инструменты cli","анализ ошибок","решение проблем","веб-разработка","веб-стандарты","bknd отладка"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء bknd","أدوات cli","تحليل الأخطاء","حل المشكلات","تطوير الويب","معايير الويب","تصحيح أخطاء bknd"]}},"owner":"cameronapak","repo":"freedom-stack-v3","repoPath":"cameronapak/freedom-stack-v3","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bknd-debugging","description":"Use when troubleshooting Bknd issues, debugging errors, fixing common problems, or diagnosing why something isnt working. Covers CLI debug commands, error codes, logging, common issues and solutions.","bodyPreview":"# Debugging Common Issues\n\nDiagnose and fix common Bknd problems using CLI tools, error analysis, and systematic troubleshooting.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Bknd project set up locally\n- Terminal/command line access\n- Basic understanding of HTTP status codes\n\n## When to Use UI Mode\n\n- Inspecting data in admin panel (`/admin`)\n- Verifying entity schema visually\n- Testing CRUD operations manually\n- Checking user/role configurations\n\n## When to Use Code Mode\n\n- Running debug CLI commands\n- Analyzing API","body":"# Debugging Common Issues\n\nDiagnose and fix common Bknd problems using CLI tools, error analysis, and systematic troubleshooting.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Bknd project set up locally\n- Terminal/command line access\n- Basic understanding of HTTP status codes\n\n## When to Use UI Mode\n\n- Inspecting data in admin panel (`/admin`)\n- Verifying entity schema visually\n- Testing CRUD operations manually\n- Checking user/role configurations\n\n## When to Use Code Mode\n\n- Running debug CLI commands\n- Analyzing API response errors\n- Checking route registration\n- Inspecting configuration paths\n- Reviewing server logs\n\n## CLI Debug Commands\n\n### Show All Registered Routes\n\n```bash\nnpx bknd debug routes\n```\n\nOutput shows every HTTP endpoint:\n- API routes (`/api/data/*`, `/api/auth/*`, `/api/media/*`)\n- Admin routes (`/admin/*`)\n- Custom Flow HTTP triggers\n- Plugin routes\n\nUse when: endpoint returns 404, verifying custom routes registered.\n\n### Show Internal Paths\n\n```bash\nnpx bknd debug paths\n```\n\nOutput:\n```\n[PATHS] {\n  rootpath: ''/path/to/bknd'',\n  distPath: ''/path/to/dist'',\n  relativeDistPath: ''./dist'',\n  cwd: ''/your/project'',\n  dir: ''/path/to/cli'',\n  resolvedPkg: ''/path/to/package.json''\n}\n```\n\nUse when: config file not loading, path resolution issues.\n\n### CLI Help\n\n```bash\nnpx bknd --help\nnpx bknd run --help\nnpx bknd types --help\n```\n\n## HTTP Error Codes\n\n| Code | Meaning | Common Causes |\n|------|---------|---------------|\n| 400 | Bad Request | Invalid JSON, missing required fields, validation error |\n| 401 | Unauthorized | Missing/invalid/expired token |\n| 403 | Forbidden | Valid token but insufficient permissions |\n| 404 | Not Found | Wrong endpoint, entity doesn''t exist, record not found |\n| 409 | Conflict | Duplicate unique field, user already exists |\n| 413 | Payload Too Large | File upload exceeds `body_max_size` |\n| 500 | Server Error | Unhandled exception, database error |\n\n## Common Issues & Solutions\n\n### Config File Not Loading\n\n**Symptoms:** \"Config file could not be resolved\" error\n\n**Diagnose:**\n```bash\n# Check config exists\nls bknd.config.*\n\n# Check current directory\npwd\n\n# Check what bknd sees\nnpx bknd debug paths\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n```bash\n# Ensure correct extension\nmv bknd.config.js bknd.config.ts\n\n# Specify explicitly\nnpx bknd run -c ./bknd.config.ts\n\n# Check supported extensions: .ts, .js, .mjs, .cjs, .json\n```\n\n### Database Not Persisting\n\n**Symptoms:** Data disappears on server restart\n\n**Diagnose:**\n```bash\n# Check if using memory mode\n# Look for \"Using in-memory\" in startup output\nnpx bknd run\n\n# Check for database file\nls *.db\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n```bash\n# Use file-based database\nnpx bknd run --db-url \"file:data.db\"\n\n# NOT memory mode\nnpx bknd run --memory  # Data will be lost!\n\n# Verify in config:\n# connection: { url: \"file:data.db\" }  ✓\n# connection: { url: \":memory:\" }      ✗\n```\n\n### Port Already in Use\n\n**Symptoms:** `EADDRINUSE: address already in use`\n\n**Diagnose:**\n```bash\n# Find process using port\nlsof -i :3000\n\n# Or on Windows\nnetstat -ano | findstr :3000\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n```bash\n# Use different port\nnpx bknd run --port 3001\n\n# Kill existing process\nkill -9 <PID>\n\n# Or on Windows\ntaskkill /PID <PID> /F\n```\n\n### Authentication Not Working\n\n**Symptoms:** 401 errors, token not persisting, user always null\n\n**Diagnose:**\n```bash\n# Test login endpoint\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/password/login \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"email\":\"test@example.com\",\"password\":\"password\"}''\n\n# Check auth configuration\n# Look for \"strategy\" in response errors\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Auth not enabled:**\n```typescript\nexport default {\n  app: {\n    auth: { enabled: true },  // Required!\n  }\n}\n```\n\n2. **Wrong strategy path:**\n```bash\n# Password auth endpoint:\nPOST /api/auth/password/login    # ✓\nPOST /api/auth/login             # ✗ 404\n```\n\n3. **JWT secret not set (production):**\n```typescript\nauth: {\n  jwt: {\n    secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET,  // Required for production\n  }\n}\n```\n\n4. **Cookie not set (CORS):**\n```typescript\nauth: {\n  cookie: {\n    secure: false,     // Set true only for HTTPS\n    sameSite: \"lax\",   // Not \"strict\" for OAuth\n  }\n}\n```\n\n5. **Token not persisting (frontend):**\n```typescript\nconst api = new Api({\n  host: \"http://localhost:3000\",\n  storage: localStorage,  // Required for token persistence\n});\n```\n\n### Permission Denied (403)\n\n**Symptoms:** Valid token but 403 Forbidden\n\n**Diagnose:**\n```bash\n# Check user''s role\ncurl http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\"\n\n# Check role permissions in config\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Guard not enabled:**\n```typescript\nexport default {\n  app: {\n    auth: {\n      guard: { enabled: true },  // Required for permissions\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n2. **No default role (anonymous access):**\n```typescript\nauth: {\n  guard: {\n    roles: {\n      anonymous: {\n        is_default: true,  // Allow unauthenticated access\n        permissions: [\"data.entity.read\"],\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n3. **Role missing permission:**\n```typescript\nroles: {\n  user: {\n    permissions: [\n      \"data.entity.read\",\n      \"data.entity.create\",  // Add if needed\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n4. **Entity-specific permission needed:**\n```typescript\npermissions: [\n  { permission: \"data.entity.read\", entity: \"posts\" },\n]\n```\n\n### Entity/Record Not Found (404)\n\n**Symptoms:** 404 on data endpoints\n\n**Diagnose:**\n```bash\n# List all entities\ncurl http://localhost:3000/api/data\n\n# Check entity name (case-sensitive)\ncurl http://localhost:3000/api/data/Posts    # ✗\ncurl http://localhost:3000/api/data/posts    # ✓\n\n# Verify routes\nnpx bknd debug routes | grep data\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Schema not synced:**\n```bash\n# Restart server to sync schema\nnpx bknd run\n```\n\n2. **Entity name case mismatch:**\n```typescript\n// Schema defines lowercase\nentity(\"posts\", { ... })\n\n// API call must match exactly\napi.data.readMany(\"posts\");     // ✓\napi.data.readMany(\"Posts\");     // ✗ 404\n```\n\n3. **Record doesn''t exist:**\n```typescript\nconst result = await api.data.readOne(\"posts\", 999);\nif (!result.ok) {\n  console.log(\"Not found:\", result.status);  // 404\n}\n```\n\n### Type Errors with em()\n\n**Symptoms:** TypeScript errors using schema object\n\n**Problem:** `em()` returns schema definition, NOT queryable EntityManager.\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - this will fail\nconst schema = em({\n  posts: entity(\"posts\", { title: text() }),\n});\nschema.repo(\"posts\").find();  // ✗ Error!\n\n// CORRECT - use SDK for queries\nconst api = new Api({ url: \"http://localhost:3000\" });\nawait api.data.readMany(\"posts\");  // ✓\n```\n\nFor direct database access (server-side only):\n```typescript\nconst app = new App(config);\nawait app.build();\nconst posts = await app.em.repo(\"posts\").findMany();  // ✓\n```\n\n### Schema Sync Issues\n\n**Symptoms:** Entity exists in code but not in database, or vice versa\n\n**Diagnose:**\n```bash\n# Check admin panel -> Schema view\n# Or query directly\ncurl http://localhost:3000/api/system/schema\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Restart server** - schema syncs on startup:\n```bash\nnpx bknd run\n```\n\n2. **Force sync** (may drop data):\n```typescript\noptions: {\n  sync: {\n    force: true,  // Dangerous! Can drop tables\n  }\n}\n```\n\n3. **Check mode** - Database Mode ignores code schema:\n```typescript\n// Code Mode (default) - schema from code\nmode: \"code\"\n\n// Hybrid Mode - merges code + database\nmode: \"hybrid\"\n```\n\n### File Upload Failing\n\n**Symptoms:** 413 error, upload silently fails\n\n**Diagnose:**\n```bash\n# Check file size\nls -la myfile.jpg\n\n# Test upload\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/media/upload \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\" \\\n  -F \"file=@myfile.jpg\"\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **File too large:**\n```typescript\nmedia: {\n  body_max_size: 10 * 1024 * 1024,  // 10MB\n}\n```\n\n2. **Storage not configured:**\n```typescript\nmedia: {\n  adapter: {\n    type: \"s3\",\n    // ... S3 config\n  }\n}\n```\n\n3. **Local storage (dev only):**\n```typescript\nimport { registerLocalMediaAdapter } from \"bknd/adapter/node\";\nconst local = registerLocalMediaAdapter();\n\nexport default {\n  app: {\n    media: { adapter: local }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### CORS Errors\n\n**Symptoms:** \"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\" errors in browser console\n\n**Diagnose:**\n```bash\n# Check CORS headers\ncurl -I http://localhost:3000/api/data/posts \\\n  -H \"Origin: http://localhost:5173\"\n```\n\n**Solutions:**\n```typescript\nexport default {\n  app: {\n    server: {\n      cors: {\n        origin: [\"http://localhost:5173\", \"https://myapp.com\"],\n        credentials: true,  // For cookies\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nFor development (allow all):\n```typescript\nserver: {\n  cors: {\n    origin: \"*\",\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Headless Environment Crash\n\n**Symptoms:** `spawn xdg-open ENOENT` on server without display\n\n**Solution:**\n```bash\nnpx bknd run --no-open\n```\n\n### Windows ESM Errors\n\n**Symptoms:** `ERR_UNSUPPORTED_ESM_URL_SCHEME` on Windows\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Use Node.js 18+\n2. Ensure `\"type\": \"module\"` in package.json\n3. Use `.mjs` extension for config\n\n### TypeScript Types Not Updating\n\n**Symptoms:** IDE shows old types, autocomplete wrong\n\n**Solutions:**\n```bash\n# Regenerate types\nnpx bknd types\n\n# Restart TypeScript server (VS Code)\n# Cmd/Ctrl + Shift + P -> \"TypeScript: Restart TS Server\"\n\n# Clear cache\nrm -rf node_modules/.cache\n```\n\n## Debug Script Pattern\n\nCreate a debug helper for systematic troubleshooting:\n\n```typescript\n// debug.ts\nimport { Api } from \"bknd/client\";\n\nasync function debug() {\n  const api = new Api({ host: \"http://localhost:3000\" });\n\n  // 1. Check server health\n  console.log(\"=== Health Check ===\");\n  const entities = await fetch(\"http://localhost:3000/api/data\");\n  console.log(\"Status:\", entities.status);\n  console.log(\"Entities:\", await entities.json());\n\n  // 2. Check auth\n  console.log(\"\\n=== Auth Check ===\");\n  const me = await api.auth.me();\n  console.log(\"Auth status:\", me.ok ? \"authenticated\" : \"not authenticated\");\n  if (me.data) console.log(\"User:\", me.data);\n\n  // 3. Check schema\n  console.log(\"\\n=== Schema Check ===\");\n  const schema = await fetch(\"http://localhost:3000/api/system/schema\");\n  console.log(\"Schema:\", await schema.json());\n\n  // 4. Test entity access\n  console.log(\"\\n=== Entity Access ===\");\n  const posts = await api.data.readMany(\"posts\", { limit: 1 });\n  console.log(\"Posts access:\", posts.ok ? \"success\" : `failed (${posts.status})`);\n}\n\ndebug().catch(console.error);\n```\n\nRun with:\n```bash\nnpx tsx debug.ts\n```\n\n## Logging Patterns\n\n### Server-Side Logging\n\n```typescript\n// In seed function or plugin\noptions: {\n  seed: async (ctx) => {\n    console.log(\"[SEED] Starting...\");\n    console.log(\"[SEED] Entities:\", Object.keys(ctx.em.entities));\n\n    try {\n      await ctx.em.mutator(\"posts\").insertOne({ title: \"Test\" });\n      console.log(\"[SEED] Created post\");\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.error(\"[SEED] Error:\", e);\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### API Response Logging\n\n```typescript\nconst api = new Api({\n  host: \"http://localhost:3000\",\n  verbose: true,  // Logs all requests/responses\n});\n\n// Or manual logging\nconst result = await api.data.readMany(\"posts\");\nconsole.log(\"Request result:\", {\n  ok: result.ok,\n  status: result.status,\n  data: result.data,\n  error: result.error,\n});\n```\n\n### Custom Fetcher with Logging\n\n```typescript\nconst api = new Api({\n  host: \"http://localhost:3000\",\n  fetcher: async (url, options) => {\n    console.log(\"→\", options?.method || \"GET\", url);\n    const start = Date.now();\n    const response = await fetch(url, options);\n    console.log(\"←\", response.status, `(${Date.now() - start}ms)`);\n    return response;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Flow/Task Debugging\n\n### HTTP Trigger Errors\n\nSync mode returns errors in response:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"errors\": [\n    {\n      \"task\": \"fetchUser\",\n      \"error\": \"Failed to fetch user: 404 Not Found\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"2024-01-15T10:30:00Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Task Error Handling\n\n```typescript\nimport { Task, Condition } from \"bknd/flows\";\n\nconst flow = new Flow(\"myFlow\", [\n  mainTask,\n  errorTask.connect(mainTask, Condition.error()),  // Handle errors\n]);\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nWhen debugging, check these in order:\n\n1. **Server running?**\n   ```bash\n   curl http://localhost:3000/api/data\n   ```\n\n2. **Config loaded?**\n   - Check startup logs for \"Using config from\"\n\n3. **Schema synced?**\n   - Check admin panel or `/api/system/schema`\n\n4. **Auth enabled?** (if needed)\n   - Check `auth: { enabled: true }` in config\n\n5. **Permissions set?** (if 403)\n   - Check `guard: { enabled: true }` and roles\n\n6. **CORS configured?** (if browser errors)\n   - Check `server: { cors: {...} }`\n\n## DOs and DON''Ts\n\n**DO:**\n- Check server logs first\n- Use `npx bknd debug routes` for 404s\n- Verify entity names match exactly (case-sensitive)\n- Test with curl before debugging frontend\n- Use `verbose: true` in Api for request logging\n- Restart server after schema changes\n\n**DON''T:**\n- Assume `em()` returns a queryable EntityManager\n- Forget `--no-open` on headless servers\n- Use `:memory:` database for persistent data\n- Skip checking HTTP status codes in responses\n- Ignore CORS when debugging frontend issues\n- Use `sync: { force: true }` in production\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **bknd-local-setup** - Initial project setup\n- **bknd-env-config** - Environment variables\n- **bknd-setup-auth** - Authentication configuration\n- **bknd-assign-permissions** - Permission troubleshooting\n- **bknd-api-discovery** - Explore available endpoints\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:40:56.135Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI-focused Agents needing systematic troubleshooting and error analysis capabilities for Bknd projects.","zh":"非常适合需要系统性故障排除和错误分析能力的CLI聚焦代理，特别适用于Bknd项目。","ja":"CLIに焦点を当てたエージェントがBkndプロジェクトのための体系的なトラブルシューティングとエラーアナリシス機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"CLI에 중점을 둔 에이전트가 Bknd 프로젝트를 위한 체계적인 문제 해결 및 오류 분석 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes enfocados en CLI que necesitan capacidades de depuración y análisis de errores sistemáticos para proyectos Bknd.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur CLI nécessitant des capacités de débogage et d''analyse d''erreurs systématiques pour les projets Bknd.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-fokussierte Agenten, die systematische Fehlersuche- und Analysefunktionen für Bknd-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em CLI que necessitam de capacidades de solução de problemas e análise de erros sistemáticos para projetos Bknd.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на CLI, которым необходимы системные возможности поиска и устранения неисправностей, а также анализа ошибок для проектов Bknd.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل CLI التي تحتاج إلى قابليات فحص و تحليل الأخطاء المنهجية لمشاريع Bknd."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to diagnose and fix common Bknd problems using CLI tools, error analysis, and systematic troubleshooting, leveraging HTTP status codes and API analysis for efficient debugging.","zh":"赋予代理诊断和修复常见Bknd问题的能力，使用CLI工具、错误分析和系统性故障排除，利用HTTP状态代码和API分析进行高效的调试。","ja":"エージェントがCLIツール、エラーアナリシス、および体系的なトラブルシューティングを使用して一般的なBkndの問題を診断して修復できるようにします。HTTPステータスコードとAPI分析を使用して効率的なデバッグを行います。","ko":"에이전트가 CLI 도구, 오류 분석 및 체계적인 문제 해결을 사용하여 일반적인 Bknd 문제를 진단 및 수정할 수 있도록 합니다. HTTP 상태 코드 및 API 분석을 사용하여 효율적인 디버깅을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diagnosticar y solucionar problemas comunes de Bknd utilizando herramientas de CLI, análisis de errores y depuración sistemática, aprovechando los códigos de estado HTTP y el análisis de API para un depuración eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer et de corriger des problèmes courants de Bknd en utilisant des outils CLI, une analyse d''erreurs et une débogage systématique, en exploitant les codes d''état HTTP et l''analyse d''API pour un débogage efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gängige Bknd-Probleme mithilfe von CLI-Tools, Fehlersuche und systematischer Fehlersuche zu diagnostizieren und zu beheben, indem HTTP-Statuscodes und API-Analyse für effizientes Debugging genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a diagnosticar e corrigir problemas comuns do Bknd usando ferramentas de CLI, análise de erros e solução de problemas sistemáticos, aproveitando códigos de status HTTP e análise de API para depuração eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью диагностировать и исправлять общие проблемы Bknd с помощью инструментов CLI, анализа ошибок и системного поиска и устранения неисправностей, используя коды состояния HTTP и анализ API для эффективной отладки.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تشخيص و إصلاح مشاكل Bknd الشائعة باستخدام أدوات CLI و تحليل الأخطاء و فحص منهجي ، مستفيدا من رموز حالة HTTP و تحليل API للتصحيح الفعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging common Bknd issues via CLI commands","Analyzing API responses for error identification","Inspecting data in the admin panel for entity schema verification"],"zh":["通过CLI命令调试常见的Bknd问题","分析API响应以识别错误","在管理面板中检查数据以验证实体模式"],"ja":["CLIコマンドを使用して一般的なBkndの問題をデバッグする","APIのレスポンスを分析してエラーを特定する","管理パネルでデータを検査してエンティティスキーマを検証する"],"ko":["CLI 명령을 사용하여 일반적인 Bknd 문제를 디버깅하는 것","API 응답을 분석하여 오류를 식별하는 것","관리 패널에서 데이터를 검사하여 엔터티 스키마를 확인하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de problemas comunes de Bknd a través de comandos de CLI","Análisis de respuestas de API para la identificación de errores","Inspección de datos en el panel de administración para la verificación del esquema de entidad"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes courants de Bknd via des commandes CLI","Analyse des réponses d''API pour l''identification d''erreurs","Inspection des données dans le panneau d''administration pour la vérification du schéma d''entité"],"de":["Fehlersuche bei gängigen Bknd-Problemen über CLI-Befehle","Analyse von API-Antworten zur Fehleridentifizierung","Überprüfung von Daten im Admin-Panel zur Überprüfung des Entitätsschemas"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas comuns do Bknd via comandos CLI","Análise de respostas de API para identificação de erros","Inspecionar dados no painel de administração para verificação do esquema de entidades"],"ru":["Отладка общих проблем Bknd с помощью команд CLI","Анализ ответов API для выявления ошибок","Осмотр данных в панели администрирования для проверки схемы сущностей"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء Bknd الشائعة عبر أوامر CLI","تحليل استجابات API للتعرف على الأخطاء","فحص البيانات في لوحة التحكم لأغراض التحقق من مخطط الكائنات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Bknd project set up locally","Needs terminal/command line access","Basic understanding of HTTP status codes is necessary"],"zh":["需要在本地设置Bknd项目","需要终端/命令行访问","需要基本的HTTP状态代码知识"],"ja":["ローカルにBkndプロジェクトをセットアップする必要がある","ターミナル/コマンドラインアクセスが必要","基本的なHTTPステータスコードの知識が必要"],"ko":["로컬에 Bknd 프로젝트를 설정해야 함","터미널/명령줄 액세스가 필요","기본적인 HTTP 상태 코드 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración del proyecto Bknd de forma local","Necesita acceso a la terminal/línea de comandos","Conocimiento básico de los códigos de estado HTTP es necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du projet Bknd en local","Nécessite un accès à la terminal/ligne de commande","Connaissance de base des codes d''état HTTP est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt lokale Einrichtung des Bknd-Projekts","Benötigt Terminal/Kommandozeilen-Zugriff","Grundlegendes Verständnis von HTTP-Statuscodes ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto Bknd local","Necessita acesso a terminal/linha de comando","Conhecimento básico de códigos de status HTTP é necessário"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Bknd на локальном компьютере","Требует доступа к терминалу/командной строке","Базовое понимание кодов состояния HTTP необходимо"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Bknd محلي","يحتاج إلى وصول إلى الطرفية / سطر الأوامر","المعرفة الأساسية لأكواد حالة HTTP ضرورية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
