elay 变更模式提供声明式更新数据的方式，具有自动缓存更新、乐观响应和错误回滚等功能","ja":"Relay 変更パターンは、宣言的なデータ更新方法を提供し、自動キャッシュ更新、楽観的なレスポンス、エラーのロールバックなどを備えています","ko":"Relay 변형 패턴은 데이터를 선언적으로 업데이트하는 방법을 제공하며 자동 캐시 업데이트, 낙관적 응답 및 오류 롤백 등이 포함됩니다","es":"Relay mutations proporciona una forma declarativa de actualizar datos con actualizaciones automáticas de caché y respuestas optimistas","fr":"Les mutations Relay offrent une façon déclarative de mettre à jour des données avec des mises à jour automatiques de cache et des réponses optimistes","de":"Relay-Mutationen bieten eine deklarative Möglichkeit, Daten mit automatischen Cache-Updates und optimistischen Antworten zu aktualisieren","pt":"As mutações do Relay fornecem uma forma declarativa de atualizar dados com atualizações automáticas de cache e respostas otimistas","ru":"Мутации Relay предоставляют декларативный способ обновления данных с автоматическими обновлениями кэша и оптимистичными ответами","ar":"توفّر الطفرات في Relay طريقة إعلانية لتحديث البيانات مع تحديثات التخزين المؤقت الأوتوماتيكي والاستجابات المتفائلة","en":"Log your transactions. Build your dam."},"definition":{"en":"Log your transactions. Build your dam."},"features":{"zh":["自动缓存更新","乐观响应","错误回滚","连接处理","声明式数据更新"],"ja":["自動キャッシュ更新","楽観的なレスポンス","エラーのロールバック","接続ハンドリング","宣言的なデータ更新"],"ko":["자동 캐시 업데이트","낙관적 응답","오류 롤백","연결 처리","선언적 데이터 업데이트"],"es":["Actualizaciones optimistas","Control de caché automático","Integración con el protocolo de conexión de Relay","Declarative data updates","Rollback en caso de error"],"fr":["Mises à jour optimistes","Gestion de cache automatique","Intégration au protocole de connexion Relay","Mises à jour de données déclaratives","Annulation en cas d''erreur"],"de":["Optimistische Updates","Automatische Cache-Steuerung","Integration mit dem Relay-Verbindungsprotokoll","Deklarative Datenaktualisierungen","Rückgängigstellung im Fehlerfall"],"pt":["Atualizações otimistas","Cache automático","Integração com o protocolo de conexão do Relay","Rollback em caso de erro","Atualizações de dados declarativas"],"ru":["Оптимистичные обновления","Автоматический кэш","Интеграция с протоколом подключения Relay","Откат в случае ошибки","Декларативные обновления данных"],"ar":["التحديثات المتفائلة","التخزين المؤقت الأوتوماتيكي","التكامل مع بروتوكول الاتصال في Relay","التراجع في حالة الخطأ","تحديثات البيانات الإعلانية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Relay 变更模式","声明式数据更新","自动缓存更新","乐观响应","错误回滚","连接处理","交互式应用程序"],"ja":["Relay 変更パターン","宣言的なデータ更新","自動キャッシュ更新","楽観的なレスポンス","エラーのロールバック","接続ハンドリング","インタラクティブなアプリケーション"],"ko":["Relay 변형 패턴","선언적 데이터 업데이트","자동 캐시 업데이트","낙관적 응답","오류 롤백","연결 처리","대화형 애플리케이션"],"es":["relay mutations","aplicaciones interactivas","actualizaciones optimistas","control de caché","desarrollo de software","patrones de diseño"],"fr":["mutations Relay","applications interactives","mises à jour optimistes","gestion de cache","développement de logiciels","modèles de conception"],"de":["Relay-Mutationen","interaktive Anwendungen","optimistische Updates","Cache-Steuerung","Software-Entwicklung","Entwurfsmuster"],"pt":["Relay mutations","atualizações otimistas","cache automático","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","padrões de design"," Relay JavaScript"],"ru":["Мутации Relay","оптимистичные обновления","автоматический кэш","разработка приложений","шаблоны проектирования","Relay JavaScript"],"ar":["طفرات Relay","التحديثات المتفائلة","التخزين المؤقت الأوتوماتيكي","تطوير التطبيقات","أنماط التصميم","Relay JavaScript"]}},"owner":"beavermoney","repo":"beavermoney","repoPath":"beavermoney/beavermoney","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"relay-mutations-patterns","description":"Use when relay mutations with optimistic updates, connections, declarative mutations, and error handling.","bodyPreview":"# Relay Mutations Patterns\n\nMaster Relay mutations for building interactive applications with optimistic\nupdates, connection handling, and declarative data updates.\n\n## Overview\n\nRelay mutations provide a declarative way to update data with automatic cache\nupdates, optimistic responses, and rollback on error. Mutations integrate\nseamlessly with Relay''s normalized cache and connection protocol.\n\n## Installation and Setup\n\n### Mutation Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// mutations/CreatePostMutation.j","body":"# Relay Mutations Patterns\n\nMaster Relay mutations for building interactive applications with optimistic\nupdates, connection handling, and declarative data updates.\n\n## Overview\n\nRelay mutations provide a declarative way to update data with automatic cache\nupdates, optimistic responses, and rollback on error. Mutations integrate\nseamlessly with Relay''s normalized cache and connection protocol.\n\n## Installation and Setup\n\n### Mutation Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// mutations/CreatePostMutation.js\nimport { graphql, commitMutation } from ''react-relay'';\nimport environment from ''../RelayEnvironment'';\n\nconst mutation = graphql`\n  mutation CreatePostMutation($input: CreatePostInput!) {\n    createPost(input: $input) {\n      postEdge {\n        __typename\n        cursor\n        node {\n          id\n          title\n          body\n          createdAt\n          author {\n            id\n            name\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nexport default function createPost(title, body) {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    commitMutation(environment, {\n      mutation,\n      variables: {\n        input: { title, body }\n      },\n      onCompleted: (response, errors) => {\n        if (errors) {\n          reject(errors);\n        } else {\n          resolve(response);\n        }\n      },\n      onError: reject\n    });\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### 1. Basic Mutation\n\n```javascript\n// CreatePost.jsx\nimport { graphql, useMutation } from ''react-relay'';\n\nconst CreatePostMutation = graphql`\n  mutation CreatePostMutation($input: CreatePostInput!) {\n    createPost(input: $input) {\n      post {\n        id\n        title\n        body\n        author {\n          id\n          name\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction CreatePost() {\n  const [commit, isInFlight] = useMutation(CreatePostMutation);\n\n  const handleSubmit = (title, body) => {\n    commit({\n      variables: {\n        input: { title, body }\n      },\n      onCompleted: (response, errors) => {\n        if (errors) {\n          console.error(''Errors:'', errors);\n        } else {\n          console.log(''Post created:'', response.createPost.post);\n        }\n      },\n      onError: (error) => {\n        console.error(''Network error:'', error);\n      }\n    });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={(e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      handleSubmit(e.target.title.value, e.target.body.value);\n    }}>\n      <input name=\"title\" placeholder=\"Title\" disabled={isInFlight} />\n      <textarea name=\"body\" placeholder=\"Body\" disabled={isInFlight} />\n      <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isInFlight}>\n        {isInFlight ? ''Creating...'' : ''Create Post''}\n      </button>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Optimistic Updates\n\n```javascript\n// LikeButton.jsx\nimport { graphql, useMutation } from ''react-relay'';\n\nconst LikePostMutation = graphql`\n  mutation LikePostMutation($input: LikePostInput!) {\n    likePost(input: $input) {\n      post {\n        id\n        likesCount\n        viewerHasLiked\n      }\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction LikeButton({ post }) {\n  const [commit, isInFlight] = useMutation(LikePostMutation);\n\n  const handleLike = () => {\n    commit({\n      variables: {\n        input: { postId: post.id }\n      },\n\n      // Optimistic response\n      optimisticResponse: {\n        likePost: {\n          post: {\n            id: post.id,\n            likesCount: post.likesCount + 1,\n            viewerHasLiked: true\n          }\n        }\n      },\n\n      // Optimistic updater\n      optimisticUpdater: (store) => {\n        const postRecord = store.get(post.id);\n        if (postRecord) {\n          postRecord.setValue(post.likesCount + 1, ''likesCount'');\n          postRecord.setValue(true, ''viewerHasLiked'');\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <button onClick={handleLike} disabled={isInFlight}>\n      {post.viewerHasLiked ? ''Unlike'' : ''Like''} ({post.likesCount})\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Connection Updates\n\n```javascript\n// CreateComment.jsx\nconst CreateCommentMutation = graphql`\n  mutation CreateCommentMutation(\n    $input: CreateCommentInput!\n    $connections: [ID!]!\n  ) {\n    createComment(input: $input) {\n      commentEdge @appendEdge(connections: $connections) {\n        cursor\n        node {\n          id\n          body\n          createdAt\n          author {\n            id\n            name\n            avatar\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction CreateComment({ postId, connectionID }) {\n  const [commit, isInFlight] = useMutation(CreateCommentMutation);\n\n  const handleSubmit = (body) => {\n    commit({\n      variables: {\n        input: { postId, body },\n        connections: [connectionID]\n      },\n\n      // No manual updater needed, @appendEdge handles it\n\n      optimisticResponse: {\n        createComment: {\n          commentEdge: {\n            cursor: ''temp-cursor'',\n            node: {\n              id: `temp-${Date.now()}`,\n              body,\n              createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n              author: {\n                id: currentUser.id,\n                name: currentUser.name,\n                avatar: currentUser.avatar\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={(e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      handleSubmit(e.target.body.value);\n      e.target.reset();\n    }}>\n      <textarea name=\"body\" placeholder=\"Add a comment...\" />\n      <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isInFlight}>Post</button>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n\n// Usage with connection ID\nfunction Post({ post }) {\n  const data = useFragment(\n    graphql`\n      fragment Post_post on Post {\n        id\n        comments(first: 10)\n        @connection(key: \"Post_comments\") {\n          edges {\n            node {\n              id\n              ...Comment_comment\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    `,\n    post\n  );\n\n  const connectionID = ConnectionHandler.getConnectionID(\n    post.id,\n    ''Post_comments''\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <CommentsList comments={data.comments.edges} />\n      <CreateComment postId={post.id} connectionID={connectionID} />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Manual Cache Updates\n\n```javascript\n// DeletePost.jsx\nconst DeletePostMutation = graphql`\n  mutation DeletePostMutation($input: DeletePostInput!) {\n    deletePost(input: $input) {\n      deletedPostId\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction DeletePost({ postId, onDelete }) {\n  const [commit] = useMutation(DeletePostMutation);\n\n  const handleDelete = () => {\n    commit({\n      variables: {\n        input: { id: postId }\n      },\n\n      updater: (store) => {\n        // Remove from connection\n        const root = store.getRoot();\n        const connection = ConnectionHandler.getConnection(\n          root,\n          ''PostsList_posts''\n        );\n\n        if (connection) {\n          ConnectionHandler.deleteNode(connection, postId);\n        }\n\n        // Delete the record\n        store.delete(postId);\n      },\n\n      optimisticUpdater: (store) => {\n        const root = store.getRoot();\n        const connection = ConnectionHandler.getConnection(\n          root,\n          ''PostsList_posts''\n        );\n\n        if (connection) {\n          ConnectionHandler.deleteNode(connection, postId);\n        }\n      },\n\n      onCompleted: () => {\n        onDelete?.();\n      }\n    });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <button onClick={handleDelete} className=\"delete-button\">\n      Delete\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Complex Updater Functions\n\n```javascript\n// UpdatePost.jsx\nconst UpdatePostMutation = graphql`\n  mutation UpdatePostMutation($input: UpdatePostInput!) {\n    updatePost(input: $input) {\n      post {\n        id\n        title\n        body\n        status\n        updatedAt\n      }\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction UpdatePost({ post }) {\n  const [commit] = useMutation(UpdatePostMutation);\n\n  const handleUpdate = (title, body, status) => {\n    commit({\n      variables: {\n        input: {\n          id: post.id,\n          title,\n          body,\n          status\n        }\n      },\n\n      updater: (store, data) => {\n        const updatedPost = data.updatePost.post;\n        const postRecord = store.get(updatedPost.id);\n\n        if (postRecord) {\n          postRecord.setValue(updatedPost.title, ''title'');\n          postRecord.setValue(updatedPost.body, ''body'');\n          postRecord.setValue(updatedPost.status, ''status'');\n          postRecord.setValue(updatedPost.updatedAt, ''updatedAt'');\n\n          // Update related records\n          const author = postRecord.getLinkedRecord(''author'');\n          if (author) {\n            const postsCount = author.getValue(''postsCount'') || 0;\n            author.setValue(postsCount, ''postsCount'');\n          }\n        }\n      },\n\n      optimisticResponse: {\n        updatePost: {\n          post: {\n            id: post.id,\n            title,\n            body,\n            status,\n            updatedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  };\n\n  return <EditForm post={post} onSubmit={handleUpdate} />;\n}\n```\n\n### 6. Multiple Mutations\n\n```javascript\n// PublishPost.jsx\nconst PublishPostMutation = graphql`\n  mutation PublishPostMutation($input: PublishPostInput!) {\n    publishPost(input: $input) {\n      post {\n        id\n        status\n        publishedAt\n      }\n      edge @prependEdge(connections: $connections) {\n        cursor\n        node {\n          id\n          ...PostCard_post\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction PublishPost({ post, draftConnectionID, publishedConnectionID }) {\n  const [commit] = useMutation(PublishPostMutation);\n\n  const handlePublish = () => {\n    commit({\n      variables: {\n        input: { id: post.id },\n        connections: [publishedConnectionID]\n      },\n\n      updater: (store) => {\n        // Remove from drafts\n        const draftConnection = store.get(draftConnectionID);\n        if (draftConnection) {\n          ConnectionHandler.deleteNode(draftConnection, post.id);\n        }\n\n        // Update post status\n        const postRecord = store.get(post.id);\n        if (postRecord) {\n          postRecord.setValue(''PUBLISHED'', ''status'');\n          postRecord.setValue(new Date().toISOString(), ''publishedAt'');\n        }\n      },\n\n      optimisticUpdater: (store) => {\n        const draftConnection = store.get(draftConnectionID);\n        if (draftConnection) {\n          ConnectionHandler.deleteNode(draftConnection, post.id);\n        }\n\n        const postRecord = store.get(post.id);\n        if (postRecord) {\n          postRecord.setValue(''PUBLISHED'', ''status'');\n          postRecord.setValue(new Date().toISOString(), ''publishedAt'');\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <button onClick={handlePublish}>\n      Publish\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 7. Error Handling\n\n```javascript\n// CreatePostWithValidation.jsx\nfunction CreatePostWithValidation() {\n  const [commit, isInFlight] = useMutation(CreatePostMutation);\n  const [errors, setErrors] = useState(null);\n\n  const handleSubmit = (title, body) => {\n    setErrors(null);\n\n    commit({\n      variables: {\n        input: { title, body }\n      },\n\n      onCompleted: (response, errors) => {\n        if (errors) {\n          // GraphQL errors\n          setErrors(errors.map(e => e.message));\n        } else if (response.createPost.errors) {\n          // Application errors\n          setErrors(response.createPost.errors);\n        } else {\n          // Success\n          console.log(''Post created successfully'');\n        }\n      },\n\n      onError: (error) => {\n        // Network or runtime errors\n        setErrors([''Network error. Please try again.'']);\n        console.error(''Mutation error:'', error);\n      }\n    });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {errors && (\n        <div className=\"error-list\">\n          {errors.map((error, i) => (\n            <div key={i} className=\"error\">{error}</div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      <form onSubmit={(e) => {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        handleSubmit(\n          e.target.title.value,\n          e.target.body.value\n        );\n      }}>\n        <input name=\"title\" required disabled={isInFlight} />\n        <textarea name=\"body\" required disabled={isInFlight} />\n        <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isInFlight}>\n          Create Post\n        </button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 8. Batched Mutations\n\n```javascript\n// BulkActions.jsx\nfunction BulkActions({ selectedPostIds }) {\n  const [deletePosts] = useMutation(DeletePostsMutation);\n  const [archivePosts] = useMutation(ArchivePostsMutation);\n\n  const handleBulkDelete = () => {\n    deletePosts({\n      variables: {\n        input: { ids: selectedPostIds }\n      },\n\n      updater: (store) => {\n        const root = store.getRoot();\n        const connection = ConnectionHandler.getConnection(\n          root,\n          ''PostsList_posts''\n        );\n\n        selectedPostIds.forEach(id => {\n          if (connection) {\n            ConnectionHandler.deleteNode(connection, id);\n          }\n          store.delete(id);\n        });\n      },\n\n      optimisticUpdater: (store) => {\n        const root = store.getRoot();\n        const connection = ConnectionHandler.getConnection(\n          root,\n          ''PostsList_posts''\n        );\n\n        selectedPostIds.forEach(id => {\n          if (connection) {\n            ConnectionHandler.deleteNode(connection, id);\n          }\n        });\n      }\n    });\n  };\n\n  const handleBulkArchive = () => {\n    archivePosts({\n      variables: {\n        input: { ids: selectedPostIds }\n      },\n\n      updater: (store) => {\n        selectedPostIds.forEach(id => {\n          const postRecord = store.get(id);\n          if (postRecord) {\n            postRecord.setValue(''ARCHIVED'', ''status'');\n          }\n        });\n      }\n    });\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <button onClick={handleBulkDelete}>Delete Selected</button>\n      <button onClick={handleBulkArchive}>Archive Selected</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 9. Declarative Mutation Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// mutations/configs.js\nimport { ConnectionHandler } from ''relay-runtime'';\n\nexport const createPostConfig = {\n  mutation: CreatePostMutation,\n\n  getVariables(input) {\n    return { input };\n  },\n\n  getOptimisticResponse(input) {\n    return {\n      createPost: {\n        postEdge: {\n          node: {\n            id: `temp-${Date.now()}`,\n            title: input.title,\n            body: input.body,\n            createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n            author: {\n              id: currentUser.id,\n              name: currentUser.name\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    };\n  },\n\n  getConfigs() {\n    return [{\n      type: ''RANGE_ADD'',\n      parentID: ''client:root'',\n      connectionInfo: [{\n        key: ''PostsList_posts'',\n        rangeBehavior: ''prepend''\n      }],\n      edgeName: ''postEdge''\n    }];\n  },\n\n  onSuccess(response) {\n    console.log(''Post created:'', response.createPost.postEdge.node);\n  },\n\n  onFailure(errors) {\n    console.error(''Failed to create post:'', errors);\n  }\n};\n\n// Usage\nfunction CreatePost() {\n  const [commit] = useMutation(createPostConfig.mutation);\n\n  const handleSubmit = (input) => {\n    commit({\n      variables: createPostConfig.getVariables(input),\n      optimisticResponse: createPostConfig.getOptimisticResponse(input),\n      configs: createPostConfig.getConfigs(),\n      onCompleted: (response, errors) => {\n        if (errors) {\n          createPostConfig.onFailure(errors);\n        } else {\n          createPostConfig.onSuccess(response);\n        }\n      }\n    });\n  };\n\n  return <CreatePostForm onSubmit={handleSubmit} />;\n}\n```\n\n### 10. Subscription-Like Mutations\n\n```javascript\n// RealtimeComments.jsx\nimport { requestSubscription, graphql } from ''react-relay'';\n\nconst CommentAddedSubscription = graphql`\n  subscription CommentAddedSubscription($postId: ID!) {\n    commentAdded(postId: $postId) {\n      commentEdge {\n        cursor\n        node {\n          id\n          body\n          createdAt\n          author {\n            id\n            name\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction RealtimeComments({ postId }) {\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const subscription = requestSubscription(environment, {\n      subscription: CommentAddedSubscription,\n      variables: { postId },\n\n      updater: (store) => {\n        const payload = store.getRootField(''commentAdded'');\n        const edge = payload.getLinkedRecord(''commentEdge'');\n        const node = edge.getLinkedRecord(''node'');\n\n        // Add to connection\n        const post = store.get(postId);\n        if (post) {\n          const connection = ConnectionHandler.getConnection(\n            post,\n            ''Post_comments''\n          );\n\n          if (connection) {\n            ConnectionHandler.insertEdgeAfter(connection, edge);\n          }\n        }\n      },\n\n      onNext: (response) => {\n        console.log(''New comment:'', response.commentAdded);\n      },\n\n      onError: (error) => {\n        console.error(''Subscription error:'', error);\n      }\n    });\n\n    return () => subscription.dispose();\n  }, [postId]);\n\n  return null; // This component just manages the subscription\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use optimistic updates** - Improve perceived performance\n2. **Handle errors gracefully** - Provide user feedback on failures\n3. **Update connections properly** - Use @appendEdge/@prependEdge directives\n4. **Implement proper validation** - Validate before committing mutations\n5. **Clean up after deletions** - Remove deleted items from cache\n6. **Use declarative configs** - Centralize mutation configuration\n7. **Batch related mutations** - Reduce network overhead\n8. **Implement retry logic** - Handle transient failures\n9. **Track mutation state** - Show loading indicators\n10. **Test mutation updaters** - Ensure cache updates work correctly\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Missing updaters** - Not updating cache after mutations\n2. **Incorrect optimistic updates** - Optimistic data doesn''t match reality\n3. **Memory leaks** - Not disposing subscriptions\n4. **Race conditions** - Multiple concurrent mutations\n5. **Stale connection IDs** - Using wrong connection identifiers\n6. **Missing error handling** - Not handling mutation failures\n7. **Over-optimistic updates** - Optimistic updates for unsafe operations\n8. **Cache inconsistencies** - Manual updates causing data mismatches\n9. **Missing rollbacks** - Not reverting failed optimistic updates\n10. **Poor UX during mutations** - No loading or error feedback\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating, updating, or deleting data\n- Implementing user interactions\n- Building real-time collaborative features\n- Developing form submissions\n- Creating like/favorite functionality\n- Implementing comment systems\n- Building shopping carts\n- Developing social features\n- Creating admin interfaces\n- Implementing bulk operations\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Relay Mutations Guide](https://relay.dev/docs/guided-tour/updating-data/graphql-mutations/)\n- [Relay Updater Functions](https://relay.dev/docs/guided-tour/updating-data/imperatively-modifying-store-data/)\n- [Optimistic Updates](https://relay.dev/docs/guided-tour/updating-data/client-only-data/)\n- [Connection Handler](https://relay.dev/docs/api-reference/store/#connectionhandler)\n- [Relay Examples](https://github.com/relayjs/relay-examples)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:40:54.291Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing declarative data updates and automatic cache management with Relay mutations.","zh":"适用于需要声明式数据更新和自动缓存管理的全栈代理，通过Relay变异实现。","ja":"宣言的なデータ更新と自動キャッシュ管理が必要なフルスタックエージェントに適しています。Relay変異を使用します。","ko":"선언적 데이터 업데이트 및 자동 캐시 관리가 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Relay 변이를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full-Stack que necesitan actualizaciones de datos declarativas y administración de caché automática con mutaciones de Relay.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack ayant besoin de mises à jour de données déclaratives et de gestion de cache automatique avec des mutations Relay.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die deklarative Datenaktualisierungen und automatische Cache-Verwaltung mit Relay-Mutationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full-Stack que precisam de atualizações de dados declarativas e gerenciamento de cache automático com mutações do Relay.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, которым необходимы декларативные обновления данных и автоматическое управление кэшем с помощью мутаций Relay.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرمجيات الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى تحديثات بيانات إعلانية وإدارة ذاكرة مؤقتة تلقائية مع طفرات Relay."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build interactive applications with optimistic updates, connection handling, and seamless integration with Relay''s normalized cache and connection protocol, utilizing Relay mutations for automatic cache updates and rollback on error.","zh":"赋予代理构建交互式应用的能力，具有乐观更新、连接处理和与Relay的标准化缓存和连接协议的无缝集成，利用Relay变异进行自动缓存更新和错误回滚。","ja":"エージェントが相互作用するアプリケーションを構築する能力を付与します。楽観的な更新、接続ハンドリング、およびRelayの標準化されたキャッシュと接続プロトコルとのシームレスな統合を提供します。Relay変異を使用して自動キャッシュ更新とエラー時のロールバックを行います。","ko":"에이전트가 상호작용형 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다. 낙관적 업데이트, 연결 처리 및 Relay의 표준화된 캐시 및 연결 프로토콜과无缝한 통합을 제공합니다. Relay 변이를 사용하여 자동 캐시 업데이트 및 오류 발생 시 롤백을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones interactivas con actualizaciones optimistas, manejo de conexiones y una integración sin problemas con la caché normalizada de Relay y el protocolo de conexión, utilizando mutaciones de Relay para actualizaciones de caché automáticas y reversión en caso de error.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications interactives avec des mises à jour optimistes, une gestion de connexions et une intégration transparente avec la cache normalisée de Relay et le protocole de connexion, en utilisant des mutations Relay pour des mises à jour de cache automatiques et un retour en arrière en cas d''erreur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, interaktive Anwendungen mit optimistischen Updates, Verbindungshandling und nahtloser Integration mit Relays normalisierter Cache und Verbindungprotokoll zu erstellen, indem Relay-Mutationen für automatische Cache-Updates und Rückgängigstellung bei Fehlern verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações interativas com atualizações otimistas, tratamento de conexão e integração transparente com o cache normalizado do Relay e protocolo de conexão, utilizando mutações do Relay para atualizações de cache automáticas e reversão em caso de erro.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать интерактивные приложения с оптимистическими обновлениями, обработкой подключения и бесшовной интеграцией с нормализованным кэшем Relay и протоколом подключения, используя мутации Relay для автоматических обновлений кэша и отмены при ошибке.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من بناء تطبيقات تفاعلية مع تحديثات متفائلة ومعالجة الاتصال والتكامل السلس مع ذاكرة التخزين المؤقتة المعيارية لبرنامج Relay وبروتوكول الاتصال، باستخدام طفرات برنامج Relay لتحديثات ذاكرة التخزين المؤقتة الآلية والتراجع في حالة الخطأ."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing optimistic updates for real-time data synchronization","Handling connection protocol for seamless data fetching and caching","Building declarative data updates for efficient and scalable application development"],"zh":["实现实时数据同步的乐观更新","处理连接协议以实现无缝数据获取和缓存","构建声明式数据更新以实现高效且可扩展的应用程序开发"],"ja":["リアルタイムデータ同期のための楽観的な更新の実装","シームレスなデータ取得とキャッシュのための接続プロトコルのハンドリング","効率的かつスケーラブルなアプリケーション開発のための宣言的なデータ更新の構築"],"ko":["실시간 데이터 동기화를 위한 낙관적 업데이트 구현","无缝한 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱을 위한 연결 프로토콜 처리","효율적이고 확장 가능한 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 선언적 데이터 업데이트 구축"],"es":["Implementación de actualizaciones optimistas para la sincronización de datos en tiempo real","Manejo del protocolo de conexión para una recuperación y almacenamiento en caché de datos sin problemas","Construcción de actualizaciones de datos declarativas para un desarrollo de aplicaciones eficiente y escalable"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de mises à jour optimistes pour la synchronisation de données en temps réel","Gestion du protocole de connexion pour une récupération et un stockage en cache de données transparents","Conception de mises à jour de données déclaratives pour un développement d''applications efficace et évolutif"],"de":["Implementierung von optimistischen Updates für die Synchronisierung von Echtzeit-Daten","Handhabung des Verbindungprotokolls für eine nahtlose Datenabfrage und -cachung","Erstellung deklarativer Datenaktualisierungen für eine effiziente und skalierbare Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Implementação de atualizações otimistas para sincronização de dados em tempo real","Tratamento do protocolo de conexão para obtenção e cache de dados transparentes","Construção de atualizações de dados declarativas para desenvolvimento de aplicações eficientes e escaláveis"],"ru":["Реализация оптимистических обновлений для синхронизации данных в режиме реального времени","Обработка протокола подключения для бесшовной загрузки и кэширования данных","Создание декларативных обновлений данных для эффективного и масштабируемого разработки приложений"],"ar":["تنفيذ تحديثات متفائلة لتزامن البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","معالجة بروتوكول الاتصال لجلب البيانات وذاكرة التخزين المؤقتة السلس","بناء تحديثات بيانات إعلانية لتطوير التطبيقات الفعالة والقابلة للتوسعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Relay setup and configuration","Limited to applications using Relay''s normalized cache and connection protocol"],"zh":["需要Relay设置和配置","仅限于使用Relay的标准化缓存和连接协议的应用程序"],"ja":["Relayの設定と構成が必要","Relayの標準化されたキャッシュと接続プロトコルを使用するアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["Relay 설정 및 구성이 필요","Relay의 표준화된 캐시 및 연결 프로토콜을 사용하는 애플리케이션으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración y instalación de Relay","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan la caché normalizada de Relay y el protocolo de conexión"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une installation de Relay","Limité aux applications utilisant la cache normalisée de Relay et le protocole de connexion"],"de":["Benötigt Relay-Setup und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die Relays normalisierten Cache und Verbindungprotokoll verwenden"],"pt":["Exige configuração e instalação do Relay","Limitado a aplicações que usam o cache normalizado e protocolo de conexão do Relay"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации Relay","Ограничен для приложений, использующих нормализованный кэш и протокол подключения Relay"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادًا وتثبيتًا لبرنامج Relay","محدود للتطبيقات التي تستخدم ذاكرة التخزين المؤقتة المعيارية وبروتوكول الاتصال لبرنامج Relay"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
