الأمامية: قم بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","en":"frontend-build"},"description":{"zh":"前端构建协议是一种创建响应式和移动友好的UI组件的方法，使用Tailwind、React和Next.js等技术","ja":"フロントエンドビルドプロトコルは、Tailwind、React、Next.jsなどの技術を使用してレスポンシブでモバイルフレンドリーなUIコンポーネントを作成する方法です","ko":"프론트엔드 빌드 프로토콜은 Tailwind, React, Next.js 등을 사용하여 반응형 및 모바일 친화적인 UI 컴포넌트를 생성하는 방법입니다","es":"El protocolo de construcción de frontend te permite crear componentes personalizados con un enfoque en la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Le protocole de construction de frontend vous permet de créer des composants personnalisés avec un focus sur l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Das Frontend-Bauprotokoll ermöglicht es Ihnen, individuelle Komponenten mit Fokus auf die Benutzererfahrung zu erstellen.","pt":"Construa componentes de frontend personalizados com facilidade. Aprenda a criar interfaces de usuário responsivas e móveis com React, Next.js e Tailwind.","ru":"Создавайте индивидуальные компоненты фронтенда без проблем. Узнайте, как создавать адаптивные и мобильные интерфейсы пользователя с помощью React, Next.js и ...","ar":"ابني مكونات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة بسهولة. تعلم كيفية إنشاء واجهات مستخدم قابلة للتحجيم ومobilة باستخدام React و Next.js و Tailwind","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["响应式设计","移动友好性","Tailwind集成","React支持","Next.js兼容"],"ja":["レスポンシブデザイン","モバイルフレンドリー","Tailwind統合","Reactサポート","Next.js互換"],"ko":["반응형 디자인","모바일 친화성","Tailwind 통합","React 지원","Next.js 호환"],"es":["Creación de componentes personalizados","Diseño de interfaces de usuario responsivas","Uso de Tailwind y otros frameworks de estilo","Integración con React y Next.js","Enfoque en la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Création de composants personnalisés","Conception d''interfaces utilisateur responsives","Utilisation de Tailwind et d''autres frameworks de style","Intégration avec React et Next.js","Focus sur l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung von individuellen Komponenten","Entwurf von responsiven Benutzeroberflächen","Verwendung von Tailwind und anderen Styling-Frameworks","Integration mit React und Next.js","Fokus auf die Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Criação de componentes de frontend personalizados","Desenvolvimento de interfaces de usuário responsivas e móveis","Utilização de React, Next.js e Tailwind para construção de frontend","Estabelecimento de uma direção estética ousada","Definição de propósito e tom para a interface de usuário","Utilização de bibliotecas de estilo para uma aparência personalizada"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных компонентов фронтенда","Разработка адаптивных и мобильных интерфейсов пользователя","Использование React, Next.js и Tailwind для фронтенд-разработки","Установление смелого эстетического направления","Определение цели и тона для интерфейса пользователя","Использование библиотек стилей для индивидуального вида"],"ar":["بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة","إنشاء واجهات مستخدم قابلة للتحجيم ومobilة","استخدام React و Next.js و Tailwind لبناء واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","تحديد اتجاه جمالي وجريء","تعريف الغرض والطون لواجهة المستخدم","استخدام مكتبات الأنماط لشكل مخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端构建","响应式设计","移动友好性","Tailwind","React","Next.js","UI组件"],"ja":["フロントエンドビルド","レスポンシブデザイン","モバイルフレンドリー","Tailwind","React","Next.js","UIコンポーネント"],"ko":["프론트엔드 빌드","반응형 디자인","모바일 친화성","Tailwind","React","Next.js","UI 컴포넌트"],"es":["frontend","construcción de frontend","componentes personalizados","diseño de interfaces de usuario","Tailwind","React","Next.js","experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["frontend","construction de frontend","composants personnalisés","conception d''interfaces utilisateur","Tailwind","React","Next.js","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Frontend","Frontend-Bau","individuelle Komponenten","Entwurf von Benutzeroberflächen","Tailwind","React","Next.js","Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["construção de frontend","desenvolvimento de frontend","React","Next.js","Tailwind","interfaces de usuário responsivas","móveis","estilo personalizado","bibliotecas de estilo"],"ru":["фронтенд-разработка","создание фронтенда","React","Next.js","Tailwind","адаптивные интерфейсы пользователя","мобильные","индивидуальный стиль","библиотеки стилей"],"ar":["بناء واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","React","Next.js","Tailwind","واجهات مستخدم قابلة للتحجيم","مobilة","نمط مخصص","مكتبات الأنماط"]}},"owner":"abdullah1854","repo":"MCPGateway","repoPath":"abdullah1854/MCPGateway","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-build","description":"Production-grade frontend development with distinctive design. Activates for build UI, create component, landing page, dashboard, form, responsive, tailwind, frontend, design, React, Next.js requests.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Build Protocol\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n- \"Build a component\", \"create UI\", \"design this\"\n- \"Landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\"\n- \"Make it responsive\", \"mobile-friendly\"\n- \"Tailwind\", \"shadcn\", \"styling\"\n- \"React\", \"Next.js\", \"frontend\"\n\n## BEFORE WRITING CODE\n\nEstablish a **bold aesthetic direction**. Ask yourself:\n\n1. **Purpose**: What problem does this solve? Who uses it?\n2. **Tone**: Minimalist? Maximalist? Retro? Brutalist? Warm? Clinical?\n3. **Differentiator**: What ONE thi","body":"# Frontend Build Protocol\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n- \"Build a component\", \"create UI\", \"design this\"\n- \"Landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\"\n- \"Make it responsive\", \"mobile-friendly\"\n- \"Tailwind\", \"shadcn\", \"styling\"\n- \"React\", \"Next.js\", \"frontend\"\n\n## BEFORE WRITING CODE\n\nEstablish a **bold aesthetic direction**. Ask yourself:\n\n1. **Purpose**: What problem does this solve? Who uses it?\n2. **Tone**: Minimalist? Maximalist? Retro? Brutalist? Warm? Clinical?\n3. **Differentiator**: What ONE thing makes this memorable?\n4. **Constraints**: Technical limitations? Brand guidelines?\n\n> \"A design with clear intent—whether maximalist or minimal—always beats scattered, unfocused choices.\"\n\n## Design Philosophy\n\n### The Core Principle\n**Distinctive, production-grade interfaces that avoid generic AI aesthetics.**\n\nEvery design choice should be intentional:\n- If it''s minimal, it should feel *deliberately* restrained\n- If it''s bold, it should feel *confidently* expressive\n- Never default to \"safe\" choices\n\n### Anti-Patterns (AI Slop to Avoid)\n\n| DON''T | DO INSTEAD |\n|-------|------------|\n| Center everything | Asymmetric, purposeful alignment |\n| Purple gradients everywhere | Restrained color with sharp accents |\n| Uniform rounded-lg on all | Mix radiuses intentionally |\n| Inter font (default) | System fonts or distinctive choices |\n| Blue-500 for everything | Custom accent that fits context |\n| Generic card grids | Varied, hierarchical layouts |\n| Over-animated everything | Strategic motion for key moments |\n| Predictable \"hero → features → CTA\" | Unexpected flow that serves content |\n\n## Typography That Elevates\n\n### Font Pairings (Non-Default)\n```css\n/* Option 1: Modern Professional */\n--font-heading: ''Satoshi'', system-ui;\n--font-body: ''Inter'', system-ui;\n\n/* Option 2: Editorial */\n--font-heading: ''Playfair Display'', Georgia;\n--font-body: ''Source Sans 3'', system-ui;\n\n/* Option 3: Technical */\n--font-heading: ''Space Grotesk'', system-ui;\n--font-body: ''IBM Plex Sans'', system-ui;\n\n/* Option 4: System (fast, still good) */\n--font-heading: system-ui;\n--font-body: system-ui;\n```\n\n### Type Scale\n```tsx\n// Limit to 4-5 sizes max\n<h1 className=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight\" />\n<h2 className=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold\" />\n<h3 className=\"text-xl font-medium\" />\n<p className=\"text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed\" />\n<small className=\"text-sm text-neutral-500\" />\n```\n\n## Color as Atmosphere\n\n### Curated Palettes (Not Defaults)\n\n**Warm Professional:**\n```\nBackground: #FAF9F7 (warm white)\nSurface:    #FFFFFF\nText:       #1A1A19\nAccent:     #D97757 (terracotta)\nMuted:      #9A9590\nBorder:     #E8E6E3\n```\n\n**Cool Technical:**\n```\nBackground: #F8FAFC\nSurface:    #FFFFFF\nText:       #0F172A\nAccent:     #3B82F6 (clear blue)\nMuted:      #64748B\nBorder:     #E2E8F0\n```\n\n**Dark Mode Done Right:**\n```\nBackground: #0A0A0A\nSurface:    #141414\nText:       #FAFAFA\nAccent:     #22D3EE (cyan)\nMuted:      #71717A\nBorder:     #27272A\n```\n\n### Color Application\n```tsx\n// Primary actions: accent color\n<button className=\"bg-[#D97757] hover:bg-[#C4684A]\">\n\n// Secondary: subtle, don''t compete\n<button className=\"bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-900 hover:bg-neutral-200\">\n\n// Destructive: red but not alarming\n<button className=\"bg-red-600/90 hover:bg-red-600\">\n```\n\n## Spatial Composition\n\n### Break the Grid (Intentionally)\n```tsx\n// Instead of equal columns, use weighted grids\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr,1fr] gap-12\">\n\n// Overlap elements for depth\n<div className=\"relative\">\n  <div className=\"absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-24 h-24 bg-accent/10 rounded-full\" />\n  <div className=\"relative bg-white p-8 rounded-xl\">Content</div>\n</div>\n\n// Negative space as design element\n<section className=\"py-32 lg:py-48\">  {/* Generous vertical space */}\n```\n\n### Asymmetric Hero\n```tsx\nexport function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"relative min-h-[80vh] flex items-center overflow-hidden\">\n      {/* Background texture */}\n      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-950 via-neutral-900 to-neutral-950\" />\n\n      <div className=\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24\">\n        <div className=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr,1fr] gap-16 items-center\">\n          <div className=\"space-y-8\">\n            <div className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\n                          bg-white/10 text-white/80 text-sm\">\n              <span className=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\" />\n              Now available\n            </div>\n\n            <h1 className=\"text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">\n              Build products\n              <br />\n              <span className=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r\n                             from-orange-400 to-amber-400\">\n                that matter.\n              </span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <p className=\"text-lg text-neutral-400 max-w-lg leading-relaxed\">\n              Ship in days, not months. Focus on what matters while we\n              handle the complexity.\n            </p>\n\n            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4\">\n              <button className=\"px-6 py-3 bg-white text-neutral-900 rounded-lg\n                               font-medium hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors\">\n                Get Started\n              </button>\n              <button className=\"px-6 py-3 text-white border border-white/20 rounded-lg\n                               font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                Learn More\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"hidden lg:block relative\">\n            {/* Visual element - not just an image placeholder */}\n            <div className=\"aspect-square rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br\n                          from-orange-500/20 to-amber-500/20 backdrop-blur-3xl\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Motion with Purpose\n\n### When to Animate\n- **Hover states**: Subtle feedback (150-200ms)\n- **State changes**: Loading → loaded, collapsed → expanded\n- **Entrances**: First-time visibility (staggered, not all at once)\n- **High-impact moments**: Success, celebration, key actions\n\n### When NOT to Animate\n- Every scroll event\n- All elements at once\n- Continuous loops (distracting)\n- Required interactions (don''t delay users)\n\n### Motion Patterns\n```tsx\n// Micro-interaction: subtle scale\nclassName=\"transition-transform duration-150 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]\"\n\n// State transition: smooth height\nclassName=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-out overflow-hidden\"\n\n// Entrance: fade up (use sparingly)\nconst variants = {\n  hidden: { opacity: 0, y: 20 },\n  visible: { opacity: 1, y: 0, transition: { duration: 0.4 } }\n};\n```\n\n## Component Library\n\n### Card (Refined)\n```tsx\ninterface CardProps {\n  title: string;\n  description: string;\n  highlight?: boolean;\n}\n\nexport function Card({ title, description, highlight }: CardProps) {\n  return (\n    <div className={`\n      group relative p-6 rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-200\n      ${highlight\n        ? ''bg-neutral-900 text-white border-neutral-800 hover:border-neutral-700''\n        : ''bg-white border-neutral-200 hover:border-neutral-300 hover:shadow-lg''}\n    `}>\n      <h3 className={`text-lg font-semibold ${highlight ? ''text-white'' : ''text-neutral-900''}`}>\n        {title}\n      </h3>\n      <p className={`mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed ${highlight ? ''text-neutral-400'' : ''text-neutral-600''}`}>\n        {description}\n      </p>\n      <span className={`\n        mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium\n        group-hover:gap-2 transition-all\n        ${highlight ? ''text-orange-400'' : ''text-orange-600''}\n      `}>\n        Learn more\n        <span aria-hidden>→</span>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Button System\n```tsx\nconst variants = {\n  primary: `\n    bg-neutral-900 text-white border border-transparent\n    hover:bg-neutral-800 active:scale-[0.98]\n  `,\n  secondary: `\n    bg-white text-neutral-900 border border-neutral-200\n    hover:bg-neutral-50 hover:border-neutral-300\n  `,\n  ghost: `\n    text-neutral-600 hover:text-neutral-900 hover:bg-neutral-100\n  `,\n  accent: `\n    bg-orange-500 text-white border border-transparent\n    hover:bg-orange-600 active:scale-[0.98]\n  `,\n};\n\nconst sizes = {\n  sm: ''px-3 py-1.5 text-sm'',\n  md: ''px-4 py-2 text-sm'',\n  lg: ''px-6 py-3 text-base'',\n};\n\nexport function Button({\n  variant = ''primary'',\n  size = ''md'',\n  children,\n  ...props\n}) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      className={`\n        inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg font-medium\n        transition-all duration-150 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\n        ${variants[variant]} ${sizes[size]}\n      `}\n      {...props}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Input with Polish\n```tsx\nexport function Input({ label, error, hint, ...props }) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"space-y-1.5\">\n      {label && (\n        <label className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-700\">\n          {label}\n        </label>\n      )}\n      <input\n        className={`\n          w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border bg-white text-neutral-900\n          placeholder:text-neutral-400 transition-all duration-150\n          focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-1\n          ${error\n            ? ''border-red-500 focus:ring-red-500/20''\n            : ''border-neutral-200 hover:border-neutral-300 focus:border-neutral-900 focus:ring-neutral-900/10''}\n        `}\n        {...props}\n      />\n      {error && <p className=\"text-sm text-red-600\">{error}</p>}\n      {hint && !error && <p className=\"text-sm text-neutral-500\">{hint}</p>}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Dashboard Layout\n```tsx\nexport function DashboardLayout({ children }) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"min-h-screen bg-neutral-50\">\n      {/* Sidebar */}\n      <aside className=\"fixed inset-y-0 left-0 w-64 bg-white border-r border-neutral-200\">\n        <div className=\"h-16 flex items-center px-6 border-b border-neutral-200\">\n          <span className=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Dashboard</span>\n        </div>\n        <nav className=\"p-4 space-y-1\">\n          <NavItem icon=\"home\" label=\"Overview\" active />\n          <NavItem icon=\"chart\" label=\"Analytics\" />\n          <NavItem icon=\"users\" label=\"Customers\" />\n          <NavItem icon=\"settings\" label=\"Settings\" />\n        </nav>\n      </aside>\n\n      {/* Main */}\n      <main className=\"pl-64\">\n        <header className=\"sticky top-0 z-10 h-16 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm\n                         border-b border-neutral-200 flex items-center px-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex-1\" />\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <button className=\"p-2 hover:bg-neutral-100 rounded-lg transition-colors\">\n              <BellIcon />\n            </button>\n            <div className=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-neutral-200\" />\n          </div>\n        </header>\n        <div className=\"p-6 lg:p-8\">\n          {children}\n        </div>\n      </main>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Responsive Strategy\n\n**Mobile-first, breakpoint-intentional:**\n```tsx\n// Not just \"add columns at breakpoints\"\n// Consider what changes at each size\n\n<section className=\"\n  py-12         // Mobile: tighter\n  md:py-16      // Tablet: medium\n  lg:py-24      // Desktop: generous\n\n  px-4          // Mobile: edge-to-edge\n  md:px-8       // Tablet: some breathing room\n  lg:px-0       // Desktop: centered container\n\">\n```\n\n## Accessibility Checklist\n\n- [ ] Semantic HTML (button for actions, a for links)\n- [ ] Heading hierarchy (h1 → h2 → h3, no skips)\n- [ ] Color contrast ≥ 4.5:1 (use WebAIM checker)\n- [ ] Focus states visible (focus-visible, not just focus)\n- [ ] Alt text for meaningful images\n- [ ] Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Escape)\n- [ ] aria-labels on icon-only buttons\n- [ ] Reduced motion support (@media (prefers-reduced-motion))\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Frontend Build: [Component/Page Name]\n\n### Design Direction\n- Tone: [Minimal/Bold/Warm/etc.]\n- Key differentiator: [One memorable choice]\n\n### Components Created\n1. [Component 1] - [Purpose]\n2. [Component 2] - [Purpose]\n\n### Styling Approach\n- Colors: [Palette used]\n- Typography: [Fonts, scale]\n- Motion: [Key animations]\n\n### Accessibility\n- [ ] Semantic HTML\n- [ ] Keyboard nav\n- [ ] Contrast checked\n\n### Files\n- [path/to/component.tsx]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:41:15.845Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI-focused Agents requiring responsive frontend development capabilities with React and Next.js","zh":"适用于需要响应式前端开发能力的 UI 集中型代理，支持 React 和 Next.js","ja":"React および Next.js を使用したレスポンシブなフロントエンド開発機能を必要とする UI 重視のエージェントに最適","ko":"React와 Next.js를 사용한 반응형 프론트엔드 개발 기능을 필요로 하는 UI 중심 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes enfocados en UI que requieren capacidades de desarrollo de frontend responsivo con React y Next.js","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur l''UI nécessitant des capacités de développement de frontend réactif avec React et Next.js","de":"Ideal für UI-fokussierte Agenten, die anspruchsvolle Frontend-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit React und Next.js erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes focados em UI que requerem capacidades de desenvolvimento de frontend responsivo com React e Next.js","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на UI, требующих возможностей для разработки frontend с помощью React и Next.js","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعنيين بواجهة المستخدم التي تتطلب قدرات على تطوير الواجهة الأمامية الاستجابة مع React و Next.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and build mobile-friendly, Tailwind-styled components, leveraging aesthetic direction principles to create bold and purpose-driven user interfaces with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript","zh":"赋予代理设计和构建移动友好、Tailwind 风格的组件的能力，利用美学指导原则创建大胆且有目的的用户界面，使用 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript","ja":"エージェントに、HTML、CSS、JavaScript を使用して、美学の指針原則に基づいて大胆で目的のあるユーザーインターフェイスを作成する、モバイルフレンドリーで Tailwind スタイルのコンポーネントを設計および構築する能力を付与","ko":"에이전트에게 HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 미적 지침 원칙에 따라 대담하고 목적 지향적인 사용자 인터페이스를 생성하여 모바일 친화적이고 Tailwind 스타일의 컴포넌트를 설계 및 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y construir componentes con estilo de Tailwind, amigables con dispositivos móviles, aprovechando los principios de dirección estética para crear interfaces de usuario atrevidas y con propósito con HTML, CSS y JavaScript","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de créer des composants de style Tailwind, conviviaux avec les appareils mobiles, en exploitant les principes de direction esthétique pour créer des interfaces utilisateur audacieuses et axées sur un objectif avec HTML, CSS et JavaScript","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mobile-freundliche, mit Tailwind gestaltete Komponenten zu entwerfen und zu erstellen, indem sie auf ästhetische Richtlinien zurückgreifen, um mutige und zielgerichtete Benutzeroberflächen mit HTML, CSS und JavaScript zu schaffen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem e construírem componentes amigáveis para dispositivos móveis, estilizados com Tailwind, aproveitando princípios de direção estética para criar interfaces do usuário ousadas e orientadas por propósito com HTML, CSS e JavaScript","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и создавать компоненты, дружественные для мобильных устройств, стилизованные с помощью Tailwind, используя принципы эстетического руководства для создания смелых и целенаправленных интерфейсов пользователя с помощью HTML, CSS и JavaScript","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم وإنشاء مكونات дружة مع الأجهزة المحمولة ومصممة مع Tailwind ، واستخدام مبادئ التوجيه الجمالي لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم جريئة ومتوجة بالغرض مع HTML و CSS و JavaScript"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating responsive landing pages with React","Creating customizable dashboard components using Next.js","Designing minimalist forms with Tailwind CSS"],"zh":["使用 React 生成响应式着陆页","使用 Next.js 创建可定制的仪表盘组件","使用 Tailwind CSS 设计极简主义表单"],"ja":["React を使用してレスポンシブなランディングページを生成","Next.js を使用してカスタマイズ可能なダッシュボードコンポーネントを作成","Tailwind CSS を使用してミニ