ienta de automatización de navegador que permite interactuar con páginas web de manera programática.","fr":"playwright-cli est un outil d''automatisation de navigateur qui permet d''interagir avec des pages web de manière programmatique.","de":"playwright-cli ist ein Browser-Automatisierungstool, das die programmatische Interaktion mit Webseiten ermöglicht.","pt":"O playwright-cli é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite interagir com páginas web de forma programática.","ru":"Playwright-cli - это инструмент для автоматизации браузера, который позволяет взаимодействовать с веб-страницами программно.","ar":"playwright-cli هو أداة أتمتة متصفح تسمح بالتفاعل مع صفحات الويب بشكل برمجي.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持多种浏览器","自动化浏览器操作","命令行工具","快捷键支持","多语言支持"],"ja":["複数のブラウザをサポート","ブラウザ操作の自動化","コマンドラインツール","ショートカットキー対応","多言語対応"],"ko":["여러 브라우저 지원","브라우저 동작 자동화","명령줄 도구","단축키 지원","다국어 지원"],"es":["Automatización de navegación","Interacción con elementos de página","Captura de instantáneas de la página","Repetición de acciones","Soporte para múltiples navegadores"],"fr":["Automatisation de la navigation","Interaction avec des éléments de page","Capture d''instantanés de page","Répétition d''actions","Prise en charge de plusieurs navigateurs"],"de":["Automatisierung der Navigation","Interaktion mit Seitenelementen","Erstellung von Seiten-Schnappschüssen","Wiederholung von Aktionen","Unterstützung für mehrere Browser"],"pt":["Abre URLs específicas","Executa ações de clique e digitação","Permite interagir com elementos da página","Tira snapshots da página","Repete ações com base em referências"],"ru":["Открывает конкретные URL-адреса","Выполняет действия клика и ввода","Позволяет взаимодействовать с элементами страницы","Делает снимки страницы","Повторяет действия на основе ссылок"],"ar":["فتح عناوين URL محددة","تنفيذ إجراءات النقر والكتابة","السماح بالتفاعل مع عناصر الصفحة","التقط صور لصفحة","تكرار الإجراءات بناءً على المراجع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["playwright-cli","浏览器自动化","命令行工具","自动化测试","开发效率","浏览器操作"],"ja":["playwright-cli","ブラウザ自動化","コマンドラインツール","自動テスト","開発効率","ブラウザ操作"],"ko":["playwright-cli","브라우저 자동화","명령줄 도구","自动화 테스트","개발 효율성","브라우저 동작"],"es":["automatización de navegador","playwright-cli","automatización de tareas","interacción con páginas web","programación de navegador","herramientas de automatización"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","playwright-cli","automatisation de tâches","interaction avec des pages web","programmation de navigateur","outils d''automatisation"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","playwright-cli","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Interaktion mit Webseiten","Browser-Programmierung","Automatisierungstools"],"pt":["automação de navegador","playwright-cli","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","teste de software","automação de teste"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","playwright-cli","веб-разработка","инструменты разработки","тестирование программного обеспечения","автоматизация тестирования"],"ar":["أتمتة المتصفح","playwright-cli","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير","اختبار البرمجيات","أتمتة الاختبار"]}},"owner":"digitarald","repo":"product-brain","repoPath":"digitarald/product-brain","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright-cli","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://playwright.dev\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `playwright-cli open https://example.com`\n2. Interact using refs from the snapshot\n3. Re-snapshot after significant changes\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/\nplaywright-cli close\nplaywright-cli type \"search query\"\nplaywright-cli cl","body":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://playwright.dev\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `playwright-cli open https://example.com`\n2. Interact using refs from the snapshot\n3. Re-snapshot after significant changes\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/\nplaywright-cli close\nplaywright-cli type \"search query\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli dblclick e7\nplaywright-cli fill e5 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli drag e2 e8\nplaywright-cli hover e4\nplaywright-cli select e9 \"option-value\"\nplaywright-cli upload ./document.pdf\nplaywright-cli check e12\nplaywright-cli uncheck e12\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli snapshot --filename=after-click.yaml\nplaywright-cli eval \"document.title\"\nplaywright-cli eval \"el => el.textContent\" e5\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept \"confirmation text\"\nplaywright-cli dialog-dismiss\nplaywright-cli resize 1920 1080\n```\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli go-back\nplaywright-cli go-forward\nplaywright-cli reload\n```\n\n### Keyboard\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli press Enter\nplaywright-cli press ArrowDown\nplaywright-cli keydown Shift\nplaywright-cli keyup Shift\n```\n\n### Mouse\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli mousemove 150 300\nplaywright-cli mousedown\nplaywright-cli mousedown right\nplaywright-cli mouseup\nplaywright-cli mouseup right\nplaywright-cli mousewheel 0 100\n```\n\n### Save as\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli screenshot\nplaywright-cli screenshot e5\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=page.png\nplaywright-cli pdf --filename=page.pdf\n```\n\n### Tabs\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-new\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/page\nplaywright-cli tab-close\nplaywright-cli tab-close 2\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\n```\n\n### Storage\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli state-save\nplaywright-cli state-save auth.json\nplaywright-cli state-load auth.json\n\n# Cookies\nplaywright-cli cookie-list\nplaywright-cli cookie-list --domain=example.com\nplaywright-cli cookie-get session_id\nplaywright-cli cookie-set session_id abc123\nplaywright-cli cookie-set session_id abc123 --domain=example.com --httpOnly --secure\nplaywright-cli cookie-delete session_id\nplaywright-cli cookie-clear\n\n# LocalStorage\nplaywright-cli localstorage-list\nplaywright-cli localstorage-get theme\nplaywright-cli localstorage-set theme dark\nplaywright-cli localstorage-delete theme\nplaywright-cli localstorage-clear\n\n# SessionStorage\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-list\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-get step\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-set step 3\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-delete step\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-clear\n```\n\n### Network\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli route \"**/*.jpg\" --status=404\nplaywright-cli route \"https://api.example.com/**\" --body=''{\"mock\": true}''\nplaywright-cli route-list\nplaywright-cli unroute \"**/*.jpg\"\nplaywright-cli unroute\n```\n\n### DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli console warning\nplaywright-cli network\nplaywright-cli run-code \"async page => await page.context().grantPermissions([''geolocation''])\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\nplaywright-cli video-start\nplaywright-cli video-stop video.webm\n```\n\n### Install\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli install-browser\nplaywright-cli install-skills\n```\n\n### Configuration\n\n```bash\n# Use specific browser when creating session\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chrome\nplaywright-cli open --browser=firefox\nplaywright-cli open --browser=webkit\nplaywright-cli open --browser=msedge\n\n# Connect to browser via extension\nplaywright-cli open --extension\n\n# Configure the session\nplaywright-cli config --config my-config.json\nplaywright-cli config --headed --in-memory --browser=firefox\n\n# Configure named session\nplaywright-cli --session=mysession config my-config.json\n\n# Start with configured session\nplaywright-cli open --config=my-config.json\n```\n\n### Sessions\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli --session=mysession open example.com\nplaywright-cli --session=mysession click e6\nplaywright-cli session-list\nplaywright-cli session-stop mysession\nplaywright-cli session-restart mysession\nplaywright-cli session-stop-all\nplaywright-cli session-delete\nplaywright-cli session-delete mysession\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/form\nplaywright-cli snapshot\n\nplaywright-cli fill e1 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli fill e2 \"password123\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli snapshot\n```\n\n## Example: Multi-tab workflow\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/other\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\nplaywright-cli snapshot\n```\n\n## Example: Debugging with DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli network\n```\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\n```\n\n## Specific tasks\n\n* **Request mocking** [references/request-mocking.md](references/request-mocking.md)\n* **Running Playwright code** [references/running-code.md](references/running-code.md)\n* **Session management** [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md)\n* **Storage state (cookies, localStorage)** [references/storage-state.md](references/storage-state.md)\n* **Test generation** [references/test-generation.md](references/test-generation.md)\n* **Tracing** [references/tracing.md](references/tracing.md)\n* **Video recording** [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:41:37.346Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing advanced browser interaction capabilities with playwright-cli","zh":"非常适合需要高级浏览器交互能力的自动化代理，特别是与playwright-cli集成使用","ja":"Playwright-cliを使用した高度なブラウザ操作能力を必要とする自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"playwright-cli와 함께 사용하는 고급 브라우저 상호작용 기능이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización que necesitan capacidades de interacción avanzada con el navegador con playwright-cli","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant des capacités d''interaction avancée avec le navigateur avec playwright-cli","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte Browser-Interaktionsfunktionen mit playwright-cli benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que precisam de capacidades avançadas de interação com navegador com playwright-cli","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, требующих расширенных возможностей взаимодействия с браузером с помощью playwright-cli","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للتفاعل مع المتصفح باستخدام playwright-cli"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using commands like open, click, and type, enabling seamless navigation and interaction with web pages via HTTPS protocol","zh":"赋予代理执行浏览器交互的能力，使用诸如打开、点击和输入等命令，实现无缝导航和通过HTTPS协议与网页交互","ja":"エージェントに、開く、クリックする、入力するなどのコマンドを使用してブラウザ操作を自動化する機能を提供し、HTTPSプロトコルを介したWebページとのシームレスなナビゲーションと相互作用を可能に","ko":"에이전트에게 열기, 클릭, 입력 등의 명령을 사용하여 브라우저 상호작용을 자동화하는 능력을 부여하고, HTTPS 프로토콜을 통해 웹 페이지와의 무결점 탐색 및 상호작용을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las interacciones del navegador utilizando comandos como abrir, hacer clic y escribir, lo que permite una navegación y una interacción sin problemas con páginas web a través del protocolo HTTPS","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions du navigateur en utilisant des commandes comme ouvrir, cliquer et taper, permettant ainsi une navigation et une interaction sans problème avec les pages web via le protocole HTTPS","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Browser-Interaktionen mithilfe von Befehlen wie Öffnen, Klicken und Tippen zu automatisieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Navigation und Interaktion mit Webseiten über das HTTPS-Protokoll ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações de navegador usando comandos como abrir, clicar e digitar, permitindo uma navegação e interação sem problemas com páginas da web via protocolo HTTPS","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера с помощью команд như открыть, кликнуть и ввести, обеспечивая бесперебойную навигацию и взаимодействие с веб-страницами через протокол HTTPS","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح باستخدام أوامر مثل فتح والنقر والكتابة، وتمكين الملاحة الخالية من الأعطال والتفاعل مع صفحات الويب عبر بروتوكول HTTPS"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web page interactions","Generating browser automation scripts","Debugging web application functionality"],"zh":["自动化网页交互","生成浏览器自动化脚本","调试Web应用程序功能"],"ja":["Webページの操作の自動化","ブラウザ自動化スクリプトの生成","Webアプリケーションの機能のデバッグ"],"ko":["웹 페이지 상호작용 자동화","브라우저 자동화 스크립트 생성","웹 애플리케이션 기능 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar interacciones de páginas web","Generar scripts de automatización de navegador","Depurar la funcionalidad de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions de pages web","Générer des scripts d''automatisation de navigateur","Déboguer la fonctionnalité des applications web"],"de":["Automatisierung von Webseiten-Interaktionen","Generierung von Browser-Automatisierungsskripten","Fehlerbehebung der Funktionalität von Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar interações de página da web","Gerar scripts de automação de navegador","Depurar funcionalidade de aplicativos da web"],"ru":["Автоматизировать взаимодействия с веб-страницами","Генерировать скрипты автоматизации браузера","Отладить функциональность веб-приложений"],"ar":["أتمتة التفاعلات مع صفحات الويب","جعل نصوص أتمتة المتصفح","تصحيح أخطاء في وظائف التطبيقات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires playwright-cli installation","Limited to browser automation tasks"],"zh":["需要安装playwright-cli","仅限于浏览器自动化任务"],"ja":["Playwright-cliのインストールが必要","ブラウザ自動化タスクのみに限定"],"ko":["playwright-cli 설치 필요","브라우저 자동화 작업만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de playwright-cli","Limitado a tareas de automatización de navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de playwright-cli","Limité aux tâches d''automatisation de navigateur"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von playwright-cli","Begrenzt auf Browser-Automatisierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer instalação do playwright-cli","Limitado a tarefas de automação de navegador"],"ru":["Требует установки playwright-cli","Ограничен задачами автоматизации браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت playwright-cli","محدود بمهام أتمتة المتصفح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ruvnet/claude-flow/agent-project-board-sync', 'community', 'ruvnet', 'claude-flow', 'ruvnet/claude-flow', 'agent-project-board-sync', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:41:39.322Z', NULL, '{"id":"ruvnet/claude-flow/agent-project-board-sync","name":"agent-project-board-sync","description":{"zh":"agent-project-board-sync是Claude的领先代理编排平台，支持智能多代理群、自治工作流和对话式AI系统","ja":"agent-project-board-syncはClaudeの先端的なエージェントオーケストレーションプラットフォームであり、インテリジェントなマルチエージェントスウォーム、自律的なワークフロー、および会話式AIシステムをサポート","ko":"agent-project-board-sync는 Claude의 선도적인 에이전트 오케스트레이션 플랫폼으로, 지능형 멀티 에이전트 스ウォーム, 자율 워크플ロー 및 대화형 AI 시스템을 지원합니다","es":"La sincronización de tablero de proyectos permite la gestión visual de tareas y el seguimiento del progreso para swarms de IA","fr":"La synchronisation de tableau de projet permet la gestion visuelle des tâches et le suivi des progrès pour les essaims d''IA","de":"Die Projekt-Board-Synchronisierung ermöglicht die visuelle Aufgabenverwaltung und die Fortschrittsverfolgung für KI-Schwärme","pt":"A sincronização de quadro de projeto de agente permite a coordenação de swarms de IA com GitHub Projects para gerenciamento de tarefas visuais e progresso","ru":"Синхронизация доски проекта агента позволяет координировать рои ИИ с GitHub Projects для визуального управления задачами и отслеживания прогресса","ar":"مزامنة لوحة المشروع الإعتياني تمكن من تنسيق السوارم الذكية مع مشاريع GitHub لإدارة المهام المرئية وتتبع التقدم","en":"🌊 The leading agent orchestration platform for Claude. Deploy intelligent multi-agent swarms, coordinate autonomous workflows, and build conversational AI systems. Features    enterprise-grade architecture, distributed swarm intelligence, RAG integration, and native Claude Code support via MCP p..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":" Claude AI 代理项目板同步","ja":"Claude AI エージェントプロジェクトボード同期","ko":