s conventions pour créer des commits pour les projets Sentry de manière efficace.","de":"Folgen Sie diesen Konventionen, um Commits für Sentry-Projekte effektiv zu erstellen.","pt":"As convenções de commit para projetos Sentry garantem uma organização eficaz do código. Siga as diretrizes para criar commits claros e concisos.","ru":"Конвенции коммитов для проектов Sentry обеспечивают эффективную организацию кода. Следуйте рекомендациям для создания ясных и лаконичных коммитов.","ar":"اتفاقيات Commit لمشاريع Sentry تضمن تنظيمًا فعالًا للكود. اتبع الإرشادات لإنشاء Commits واضحة وموجزة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["标准化提交消息","提高代码可读性","简化代码审查","提高团队合作效率","确保代码质量"],"ja":["コミットメッセージを標準化する","コードの可読性を向上させる","コードレビューを簡素化する","チームコラボレーションの効率を向上させる","コード品質を確保する"],"ko":["커밋 메시지 표준화","코드 가독성 향상","코드 리뷰 단순화","팀 협업 효율성 향상","코드 품질 보장"],"es":["Creación de ramas de características","Uso de la convención de nombres de ramas","Verificación de la rama actual","Creación y cambio a una nueva rama","Seguimiento de convenciones de commit"],"fr":["Création de branches de fonctionnalités","Utilisation de la convention de nommage de branches","Vérification de la branche actuelle","Création et basculement vers une nouvelle branche","Suivi des conventions de commit"],"de":["Erstellung von Feature-Branches","Verwendung der Branch-Namenskonvention","Überprüfung der aktuellen Branch","Erstellung und Umschalten auf einen neuen Branch","Einhalten der Commit-Konventionen"],"pt":["Criação de branchs de recursos","Uso de mensagens de commit claras","Seguimento de convenções de nomenclatura de branchs","Verificação da branch atual","Criação e alteração de branchs"],"ru":["Создание фич-веток","Использование ясных сообщений коммитов","Следование конвенциям именования веток","Проверка текущей ветки","Создание и переключение между ветками"],"ar":["إنشاء فروع الميزات","استخدام رسائل Commit واضحة","متابعة اتفاقيات تسمية الفروع","فحص الفرع الحالي","إنشاء وتبديل الفروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Sentry","提交消息","代码质量","可维护性","开发最佳实践","代码审查","团队合作"],"ja":["Sentry","コミットメッセージ","コード品質","保守性","開発ベストプラクティス","コードレビュー","チームコラボレーション"],"ko":["Sentry","커밋 메시지","코드 품질","유지 보수성","개발 모범 사례","코드 리뷰","팀 협업"],"es":["commit","sentry","convenciones de commit","ramas de características","git","control de versiones","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["commit","sentry","conventions de commit","branches de fonctionnalités","git","contrôle de version","développement de logiciels"],"de":["commit","sentry","commit-konventionen","feature-branches","git","versionskontrolle","software-entwicklung"],"pt":["commit","projetos Sentry","convenções de commit","branchs de recursos","mensagens de commit","desenvolvimento de software","controle de versão"],"ru":["коммит","проекты Sentry","конвенции коммитов","фич-ветки","сообщения коммитов","разработка программного обеспечения","контроль версий"],"ar":["Commit","مشاريع Sentry","اتفاقيات Commit","فروع الميزات","رسائل Commit","تطوير البرمجيات","مراقبة الإصدار"]}},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"webvitals.com","repoPath":"getsentry/webvitals.com","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit","description":"Create commit messages following Sentry conventions. Use when committing code changes, writing commit messages, or formatting git history. Follows conventional commits with Sentry-specific issue references.","bodyPreview":"# Sentry Commit Messages\n\nFollow these conventions when creating commits for Sentry projects.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore committing, ensure you''re working on a feature branch, not the main branch.\n\n```bash\n# Check current branch\ngit branch --show-current\n```\n\nIf you''re on `main` or `master`, create a new branch first:\n\n```bash\n# Create and switch to a new branch\ngit checkout -b <type>/<short-description>\n```\n\nBranch naming should follow the pattern: `<type>/<short-description>` where type matches","body":"# Sentry Commit Messages\n\nFollow these conventions when creating commits for Sentry projects.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore committing, ensure you''re working on a feature branch, not the main branch.\n\n```bash\n# Check current branch\ngit branch --show-current\n```\n\nIf you''re on `main` or `master`, create a new branch first:\n\n```bash\n# Create and switch to a new branch\ngit checkout -b <type>/<short-description>\n```\n\nBranch naming should follow the pattern: `<type>/<short-description>` where type matches the commit type (e.g., `feat/add-user-auth`, `fix/null-pointer-error`, `ref/extract-validation`).\n\n## Format\n\n```\n<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n\n<body>\n\n<footer>\n```\n\nThe header is required. Scope is optional. All lines must stay under 100 characters.\n\n## Commit Types\n\n| Type | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `feat` | New feature |\n| `fix` | Bug fix |\n| `ref` | Refactoring (no behavior change) |\n| `perf` | Performance improvement |\n| `docs` | Documentation only |\n| `test` | Test additions or corrections |\n| `build` | Build system or dependencies |\n| `ci` | CI configuration |\n| `chore` | Maintenance tasks |\n| `style` | Code formatting (no logic change) |\n| `meta` | Repository metadata |\n| `license` | License changes |\n\n## Subject Line Rules\n\n- Use imperative, present tense: \"Add feature\" not \"Added feature\"\n- Capitalize the first letter\n- No period at the end\n- Maximum 70 characters\n\n## Body Guidelines\n\n- Explain **what** and **why**, not how\n- Use imperative mood and present tense\n- Include motivation for the change\n- Contrast with previous behavior when relevant\n\n## Footer: Issue References\n\nReference issues in the footer using these patterns:\n\n```\nFixes GH-1234\nFixes #1234\nFixes SENTRY-1234\nRefs LINEAR-ABC-123\n```\n\n- `Fixes` closes the issue when merged\n- `Refs` links without closing\n\n## AI-Generated Changes\n\nWhen changes were primarily generated by a coding agent (like Claude Code), include the Co-Authored-By attribution in the commit footer:\n\n```\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n```\n\nThis is the only indicator of AI involvement that should appear in commits. Do not add phrases like \"Generated by AI\", \"Written with Claude\", or similar markers in the subject, body, or anywhere else in the commit message.\n\n## Examples\n\n### Simple fix\n\n```\nfix(api): Handle null response in user endpoint\n\nThe user API could return null for deleted accounts, causing a crash\nin the dashboard. Add null check before accessing user properties.\n\nFixes SENTRY-5678\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n```\n\n### Feature with scope\n\n```\nfeat(alerts): Add Slack thread replies for alert updates\n\nWhen an alert is updated or resolved, post a reply to the original\nSlack thread instead of creating a new message. This keeps related\nnotifications grouped together.\n\nRefs GH-1234\n```\n\n### Refactor\n\n```\nref: Extract common validation logic to shared module\n\nMove duplicate validation code from three endpoints into a shared\nvalidator class. No behavior change.\n```\n\n### Breaking change\n\n```\nfeat(api)!: Remove deprecated v1 endpoints\n\nRemove all v1 API endpoints that were deprecated in version 23.1.\nClients should migrate to v2 endpoints.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: v1 endpoints no longer available\nFixes SENTRY-9999\n```\n\n## Revert Format\n\n```\nrevert: feat(api): Add new endpoint\n\nThis reverts commit abc123def456.\n\nReason: Caused performance regression in production.\n```\n\n## Principles\n\n- Each commit should be a single, stable change\n- Commits should be independently reviewable\n- The repository should be in a working state after each commit\n\n## References\n\n- [Sentry Commit Messages](https://develop.sentry.dev/engineering-practices/commit-messages/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:40:58.723Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing standardized commit message generation and Git branch management.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交消息生成和Git分支管理的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが標準化されたコミットメッセージ生成とGitブランチ管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 메시지 생성 및 Git 브랜치 관리가 필요한 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de control de versiones que necesitan generación de mensajes de confirmación estandarizados y administración de ramas Git.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contrôle de version nécessitant une génération de messages de commit standardisés et une gestion de branches Git.","de":"Perfekt für Version Control Agents, die eine standardisierte Commit-Nachrichtengenerierung und Git-Zweigverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Controle de Versão que precisam de geração de mensagens de commit padronizadas e gerenciamento de branches do Git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля версий, которым необходима стандартизированная генерация сообщений о коммитах и управление ветками Git.","ar":"مثالي لعميليات التحكم في الإصدار التي تحتاج إلى توليد رسائل الالتزام المعيارية وإدارة فروع الجيت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create consistent commit messages following Sentry conventions, utilizing Git commands like ''git branch'' and ''git checkout'' to manage feature branches, and adhering to the <type>/<short-description> branch naming pattern.","zh":"赋予代理创建一致的提交消息的能力，遵循Sentry约定，利用Git命令（如''git branch''和''git checkout''）管理功能分支，并遵循<类型>/<简要描述>分支命名模式。","ja":"Sentryの規約に従って一貫したコミットメッセージを作成するエージェントを可能にし、機能ブランチを管理するために''git branch''や''git checkout''などのGitコマンドを使用し、<タイプ>/<簡単な説明>ブランチ命名パターンに従います。","ko":"에이전트가 센트리 규칙을 따르는 일관된 커밋 메시지를 생성하도록 하며, ''git branch'' 및 ''git checkout''와 같은 Git 명령을 사용하여 기능 브랜치를 관리하고 <유형>/<간단한 설명> 브랜치 이름 패턴을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear mensajes de confirmación coherentes siguiendo las convenciones de Sentry, utilizando comandos de Git como ''git branch'' y ''git checkout'' para administrar ramas de características, y ajustándose al patrón de nomenclatura de ramas <tipo>/<descripción_corta>.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des messages de commit cohérents en suivant les conventions de Sentry, en utilisant des commandes Git comme ''git branch'' et ''git checkout'' pour gérer les branches de fonctionnalités, et en respectant le modèle de nommage de branche <type>/<description_courte>.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konsistente Commit-Nachrichten gemäß den Sentry-Konventionen zu erstellen, indem Git-Befehle wie ''git branch'' und ''git checkout'' zur Verwaltung von Feature-Zweigen verwendet werden und dem Zweigbenennungsmuster <Typ>/<Kurzbeschreibung> entsprochen wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem mensagens de commit consistentes seguindo as convenções do Sentry, utilizando comandos Git como ''git branch'' e ''git checkout'' para gerenciar branches de recursos e seguir o padrão de nomenclatura de branches <tipo>/<descrição-curta>.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать последовательные сообщения о коммитах в соответствии с конвенциями Sentry, используя команды Git, такие как ''git branch'' и ''git checkout'', для управления функциональными ветками и соблюдения шаблона именования веток <тип>/<краткое-описание>.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء رسائل الالتزام المُتطابقة ตาม اتفاقيات سينتري، باستخدام أوامر الجيت مثل ''git branch'' و ''git checkout'' لإدارة فروع الميزات والالتزام بنمط تسمية الفرع <نوع>/<وصف قصير>"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating feature branches with descriptive names","Generating commit messages for Sentry projects","Switching between Git branches for collaborative development"],"zh":["创建具有描述性名称的功能分支","为Sentry项目生成提交消息","在协作开发中在Git分支之间切换"],"ja":["説明的な名前を持つ機能ブランチを作成する","Sentryプロジェクトのコミットメッセージを生成する","共同開発でGitブランチ間を切り替える"],"ko":["설명적인 이름을 가진 기능 브랜치를 생성하는 것","센트리 프로젝트를 위한 커밋 메시지 생성","협력 개발에서 Git 브랜치 사이를 전환"],"es":["Crear ramas de características con nombres descriptivos","Generar mensajes de confirmación para proyectos Sentry","Cambiar entre ramas Git para desarrollo colaborativo"],"fr":["Créer des branches de fonctionnalités avec des noms descriptifs","Générer des messages de commit pour les projets Sentry","Basculer entre les branches Git pour le développement collaboratif"],"de":["Erstellen von Feature-Zweigen mit beschreibenden Namen","Generieren von Commit-Nachrichten für Sentry-Projekte","Wechseln zwischen Git-Zweigen für kollaborative Entwicklung"],"pt":["Criar branches de recursos com nomes descritivos","Gerar mensagens de commit para projetos Sentry","Alternar entre branches Git para desenvolvimento colaborativo"],"ru":["Создание функциональных веток с описательными именами","Генерация сообщений о коммитах для проектов Sentry","Переключение между ветками Git для совместной разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء فروع للميزات بأسماء وصفية","توليد رسائل الالتزام لمشاريع سينتري","تبديل بين فروع الجيت لتطوير تعاوني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Specific to Sentry project commit conventions"],"zh":["需要Git安装和配置","特定于Sentry项目的提交约定"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと設定が必要","Sentryプロジェクトのコミット規約に特異的"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요함","센트리 프로젝트 커밋 규칙에 특정적"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Específico para las convenciones de confirmación de proyectos Sentry"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Spécifique aux conventions de commit des projets Sentry"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Spezifisch für die Commit-Konventionen von Sentry-Projekten"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Git","Específico para convenções de commit de projetos Sentry"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Git","Конкретно для конвенций коммитов проектов Sentry"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت الجيت وتفصيله","محدد لاتفاقيات الالتزام لمشاريع سينتري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
