s d''emploi","Calcul du taux de correspondance","Recommandations pour adapter le CV","Préparation pour les entretiens","Optimisation pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures"],"de":["Analyse von Stellenbeschreibungen","Berechnung der Übereinstimmungsrate","Empfehlungen zur Anpassung des Lebenslaufs","Vorbereitung auf Vorstellungsgespräche","Optimierung für Bewerber-Management-Systeme"],"pt":["Análise de descrições de trabalho","Otimização de currículos","Preparação para entrevistas","Avaliação de compatibilidade","Sugestões de melhoria"],"ru":["Анализ описаний работы","Оптимизация резюме","Подготовка к интервью","Оценка совместимости","Предложения по улучшению"],"ar":["تحليل وصف الوظيفة","تحسين السيرة الذاتية","الإعداد للمقابلات","تقييم التوافق","اقتراحات التحسين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Job Description Analyzer","Resume Optimization","Job Applications","Career Development","ATS Optimization","Interview Prep"],"ja":["Job Description Analyzer","Resume Optimization","Job Applications","Career Development","ATS","Interview Prep"],"ko":["Job Description Analyzer","Resume Optimization","Job Applications","Career Development","ATS","Interview Prep"],"es":["analizador de descripciones de trabajo","optimización de solicitudes de empleo","currículum personalizado","preparación para entrevistas","sistemas de seguimiento de aplicaciones","inteligencia artificial en recursos humanos"],"fr":["analyseur de descriptions d''emploi","optimisation de candidatures","CV personnalisé","préparation pour les entretiens","systèmes de suivi des candidatures","intelligence artificielle en ressources humaines"],"de":["Stellenbeschreibung-Analyse-Tool","Optimierung von Bewerbungen","personalisierter Lebenslauf","Vorbereitung auf Vorstellungsgespräche","Bewerber-Management-Systeme","Künstliche Intelligenz in Personalwesen"],"pt":["analisador de descrição de trabalho","otimização de currículos","preparação para entrevistas","carreira","desenvolvimento profissional","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["анализатор описания работы","оптимизация резюме","подготовка к интервью","карьера","профессиональное развитие","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["محلل وصف الوظيفة","تحسين السيرة الذاتية","الإعداد للمقابلات","المسار الوظيفي","التطوير المهني","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Paramchoudhary","repo":"ResumeSkills","repoPath":"Paramchoudhary/ResumeSkills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Job Description Analyzer","description":"Analyze job postings, calculate match scores, identify gaps, and create application strategy","bodyPreview":"# Job Description Analyzer\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Wants to analyze a job posting\n- Asks \"should I apply to this job?\"\n- Wants to know their match percentage for a role\n- Needs help understanding job requirements\n- Wants to tailor their resume for a specific position\n- Mentions: \"analyze this job\", \"am I qualified\", \"match score\", \"should I apply\"\n\nUse this BEFORE resume tailoring to ensure effort is worth it.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n- Extract and categorize jo","body":"# Job Description Analyzer\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Wants to analyze a job posting\n- Asks \"should I apply to this job?\"\n- Wants to know their match percentage for a role\n- Needs help understanding job requirements\n- Wants to tailor their resume for a specific position\n- Mentions: \"analyze this job\", \"am I qualified\", \"match score\", \"should I apply\"\n\nUse this BEFORE resume tailoring to ensure effort is worth it.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n- Extract and categorize job requirements (must-have vs nice-to-have)\n- Calculate match score between user''s experience and job requirements\n- Identify skill gaps and strengths\n- Detect red flags in job postings\n- Prioritize which experiences to highlight\n- Generate resume tailoring strategy\n- Create cover letter talking points\n- Assess company culture fit indicators\n\n## The Strategic Problem\n\nMost job seekers waste time on:\n- Jobs they''re under-qualified for (<60% match)\n- Jobs they''re over-qualified for (flight risk)\n- Jobs with red flags (high turnover, toxic culture)\n- Applying to 50+ jobs blindly hoping something sticks\n\nBetter approach:\n- Apply to 10-15 jobs strategically\n- Target 70-90% match jobs\n- Customize deeply for each\n- Higher response rate, less burnout\n\n## Analysis Process\n\n### Step 1: Extract Requirements\n\nBreak job description into categories:\n\n**Required (Must-Have)**\n- Education requirements\n- Years of experience\n- Specific technical skills\n- Certifications/licenses\n- Industry experience\n\n**Preferred (Nice-to-Have)**\n- \"Bonus\" skills\n- Advanced certifications\n- Domain expertise\n- Specific tool experience\n\n**Soft Skills/Culture**\n- Communication style\n- Work environment\n- Team structure\n- Company values\n\n### Step 2: Keyword Extraction\n\nIdentify three types:\n\n**Hard Skills** (Technical abilities)\n- Tools: Salesforce, Python, AWS, Excel\n- Methodologies: Agile, Six Sigma, SDLC\n- Certifications: PMP, CPA, AWS Certified\n\n**Soft Skills** (Interpersonal)\n- Leadership, collaboration, communication\n- Problem-solving, critical thinking\n- Adaptability, initiative\n\n**Industry/Domain Knowledge**\n- B2B SaaS, healthcare, fintech\n- Enterprise vs SMB\n- Regulatory knowledge (HIPAA, SOX, GDPR)\n\n### Step 3: Calculate Match Score\n\n```\nMATCH CALCULATION:\n\nRequired Skills:\n- User has 8 out of 10 required = 80%\n\nPreferred Skills:\n- User has 3 out of 5 preferred = 60%\n\nOverall Match:\n- Weight required 70%, preferred 30%\n- (80% × 0.7) + (60% × 0.3) = 74%\n\nINTERPRETATION:\n90-100% = Overqualified (may be flight risk)\n75-89% = Excellent fit (apply immediately)\n60-74% = Good fit (apply with strong cover letter)\n50-59% = Stretch role (apply if passionate)\n<50% = Under-qualified (skip unless dream job)\n```\n\n### Step 4: Gap Analysis\n\nFor each missing requirement:\n- **Critical gap**: Deal-breaker (don''t apply)\n- **Major gap**: Significant but addressable (mention in cover letter)\n- **Minor gap**: Easy to learn (downplay or emphasize related skills)\n\n### Step 5: Red Flag Detection\n\nScan for warning signs:\n\n**Workload Red Flags:**\n- \"Wear many hats\"\n- \"Fast-paced environment\"\n- \"Hit the ground running\"\n- \"Self-starter in ambiguous situations\"\n\n**Culture Red Flags:**\n- \"Rockstar/Ninja/Guru\"\n- \"We work hard, play hard\"\n- \"Unlimited vacation\"\n- \"Like a family\"\n\n**Compensation Red Flags:**\n- \"Competitive salary\" (won''t tell you range)\n- \"Equity-heavy\" (low cash compensation)\n- \"Commission-based\" (no base salary)\n- \"DOE\" with no range\n\n## Match Score Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# JOB ANALYSIS REPORT\n\n**Position:** Senior Product Manager\n**Company:** TechCorp Inc.\n**Location:** San Francisco, CA (Hybrid)\n**Salary Range:** $140K-$180K + equity\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\n## OVERALL MATCH SCORE: 78% ✅\n\n**Recommendation:** STRONG FIT - Apply within 48 hours\n\n**Application Priority:** HIGH\n**Estimated Competition:** Medium (Posted 2 days ago)\n**Time to Tailor Resume:** 30-45 minutes\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\n## REQUIREMENTS BREAKDOWN\n\n### Required Skills - 8/10 ✅\n\n✅ 5+ years product management (You have: 6 years)\n✅ B2B SaaS experience (You have: 4 years)\n✅ Agile/Scrum (You have: 5 years)\n✅ Cross-functional leadership (You have: Strong experience)\n✅ Data-driven decision making (You have: 3 years analytics)\n✅ API products (You have: 2 years)\n✅ Roadmap planning (You have: Extensive)\n✅ User research (You have: 2 years)\n❌ SQL/data analysis (You have: Basic Excel only) ⚠️\n❌ Mobile product experience (You don''t have) ⚠️\n\n### Preferred Skills - 4/6 ✅\n\n✅ MBA or equivalent (You have: MBA from UC Berkeley)\n✅ Developer tools experience (You have: 2 years)\n✅ Payment systems (You have: 1 year)\n✅ International markets (You have: Worked with EU teams)\n❌ E-commerce background (You don''t have)\n❌ Machine learning products (You don''t have)\n\n### Soft Skills - 5/5 ✅\n\n✅ Stakeholder management (Strong mentions in your resume)\n✅ Communication (You present regularly)\n✅ Strategic thinking (MBA + senior experience)\n✅ Influence without authority (You''ve done this)\n✅ Customer empathy (User research experience)\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\n## STRENGTHS TO EMPHASIZE\n\n**Your Top 3 Selling Points:**\n\n1. **B2B SaaS PM Experience**\n   - 4 years in SaaS, exactly what they want\n   - Lead with this in resume summary\n\n2. **API Product Background**\n   - Your developer tools experience is highly relevant\n   - This differentiates you from other candidates\n\n3. **Data-Driven Approach**\n   - Your analytics background addresses their need\n   - Emphasize metrics and data in every bullet\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\n## GAPS TO ADDRESS\n\n**Critical Gaps:** None ✅\n\n**Major Gaps:**\n⚠️ **SQL/Data Analysis**\n- They mention this 5x in job description\n- They want PM who can query data independently\n\n**Strategy:**\n- Don''t avoid this gap\n- Address in cover letter: \"While my primary analytics work has been in Excel and BI tools, I''m actively learning SQL through DataCamp and can currently write basic queries\"\n- Emphasize your data-driven mindset and collaboration with data team\n\n**Minor Gaps:**\n- Mobile product experience (mentioned 2x)\n- Not a dealbreaker - they want \"any product,\" mobile just a plus\n\n**Strategy:**\n- Don''t mention this gap\n- If asked in interview, pivot to \"transferable product skills\"\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\n## RESUME CUSTOMIZATION STRATEGY\n\n### Priority 1: Lead with Most Relevant Experience\n\n**Current Resume Order:**\n1. Company ABC - General PM work\n2. Company XYZ - Your developer tools role\n3. Company 123 - Early career\n\n**Recommended Order:**\n1. Company XYZ - Developer tools role (MOST RELEVANT)\n2. Company ABC - B2B SaaS work\n3. Company 123 - Only if space allows\n\n### Priority 2: Keyword Integration\n\n**Add These Exact Phrases:**\n- \"SQL and data analysis\" (mentioned 5x in JD)\n- \"API product management\" (mentioned 4x)\n- \"Developer-focused products\" (mentioned 3x)\n- \"Stakeholder alignment\" (mentioned 3x)\n\n**Where to Add:**\n- Professional Summary: Mention \"API products\" and \"data-driven\"\n- Skills Section: Add \"SQL (basic), Data Analysis, API Design\"\n- Experience: Weave into existing bullets\n\n### Priority 3: Quantify Everything\n\nThey mention \"metrics\" and \"KPIs\" 7 times total.\n\n**Enhance These Bullets:**\n\nCurrent: \"Led product roadmap\"\nBetter: \"Defined product roadmap based on analysis of 50+ customer interviews and usage data from 100K+ users\"\n\nCurrent: \"Launched new features\"\nBetter: \"Launched 8 features in 12 months, increasing user engagement by 35% and reducing churn by 20%\"\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\n## COVER LETTER TALKING POINTS\n\n### Opening Hook (Choose One):\n\n**Option 1 - Specific Company Knowledge:**\n\"I noticed TechCorp recently launched your API marketplace - I''ve spent the last 2 years as PM for a developer tools platform, and I''m excited about the opportunity to bring that experience to your growing API ecosystem.\"\n\n**Option 2 - Mutual Connection:**\n\"[Name] on your product team mentioned you''re looking for a PM to lead the API product line - my 2 years in developer tools and B2B SaaS background would be a strong fit.\"\n\n**Option 3 - Problem-Solver:**\n\"Your JD mentions challenges in stakeholder alignment across technical teams - I''ve navigated this exact challenge at my current role, aligning engineering, design, and sales teams across 6 concurrent product initiatives.\"\n\n### Body - Address the Match:\n- \"Your requirement for B2B SaaS experience: I have 4 years with...\" \n- \"Your focus on data-driven decisions: In my current role, I...\"\n- \"Your need for API product expertise: At [Company], I...\"\n\n### Addressing SQL Gap (Optional):\n\"While my data analysis has primarily been in Excel and Tableau, I''m expanding my SQL skills and can currently write basic queries. More importantly, I''ve built strong partnerships with data teams and consistently use data to inform product decisions.\"\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\n## RED FLAGS ANALYSIS\n\n### Potential Concerns: ⚠️ MINOR\n\n**Flag 1:** \"Fast-paced environment\"\n- Appears 2x in description\n- Interpretation: Likely startup or high-growth\n- May mean: Long hours, ambiguity, rapid changes\n\n**Flag 2:** Salary range is wide ($140K-$180K)\n- 29% spread\n- May indicate: Experience range is flexible, or negotiation room\n\n### Positive Signals: ✅\n\n**Signal 1:** Detailed job description\n- Shows company knows what they want\n- Well-organized role\n\n**Signal 2:** Mentions specific tools (JIRA, Amplitude)\n- Shows operational maturity\n\n**Signal 3:** Hybrid flexibility mentioned\n- Modern workplace practices\n\n### Company Research Needed:\n\nBefore applying, check:\n- Glassdoor reviews (look for patterns in 1-2 star reviews)\n- Recent funding/news (layoffs? growth?)\n- LinkedIn: Check how long people stay (high turnover?)\n- Levels.fyi: Verify salary range is accurate\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\n## APPLICATION TIMELINE\n\n**✅ Day 1 (Today):**\n- Customize resume (30-45 minutes)\n- Write cover letter (30 minutes)\n\n**✅ Day 1-2:**\n- Submit application\n- Connect with 2-3 current employees on LinkedIn\n- Research company more deeply\n\n**✅ Week 1:**\n- Follow up if no response after 7 days\n\n**📊 Expected Response Time:** 1-2 weeks\n\n**📊 Interview Process (from job posting):**\n1. Recruiter screen (30 min)\n2. Hiring manager (1 hour)\n3. Product case study (take-home)\n4. Team interviews (3-4 hours)\n5. Executive interview (1 hour)\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════\n\n## DECISION FACTORS\n\n### Reasons to Apply ✅\n\n1. Strong match (78%) - You meet most requirements\n2. Role aligns with career goals\n3. Salary range is appropriate for your experience\n4. Company stage fits your preferences\n5. You have unique relevant experience (developer tools)\n\n### Reasons to Hesitate ⚠️\n\n1. SQL gap is real - prepare to address this\n2. \"Fast-paced\" may mean high pressure\n3. Need to research company culture more\n\n### Overall Recommendation:\n\n**APPLY - This is a strong opportunity**\n\nYou meet 80% of required skills and 67% of preferred skills. Your developer tools and B2B SaaS experience makes you a differentiated candidate. The SQL gap is addressable with honesty and emphasis on your analytical skills. Apply within 48 hours while posting is fresh.\n```\n\n## Requirement Classification Guide\n\n### Identifying \"Must Have\" vs \"Nice to Have\"\n\n**Language indicating REQUIRED:**\n- \"Must have...\"\n- \"Required: X years of...\"\n- \"You have...\"\n- \"Essential qualifications\"\n- Listed under \"Requirements\"\n- Mentioned 3+ times in description\n\n**Language indicating PREFERRED:**\n- \"Nice to have...\"\n- \"Bonus if you have...\"\n- \"Preferred qualifications\"\n- \"Ideally, you''d have...\"\n- \"A plus if...\"\n- Mentioned only 1-2 times\n\n### Dealbreaker Detection\n\n**Absolute dealbreakers (don''t apply):**\n- Required license you don''t have (medical, legal, CPA)\n- Required clearance you can''t get\n- Years of experience 50%+ below requirement\n- Required degree you don''t have (when stated as \"required\")\n- Location requirement you can''t meet\n\n**Not dealbreakers (apply anyway):**\n- Years of experience slightly below (e.g., 3 years when they want 5)\n- \"Preferred\" degree you don''t have\n- Nice-to-have tools/skills you can learn\n- Industry experience when you have transferable skills\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\nWhen analyzing a job:\n\n1. ✅ Extract all requirements (required vs preferred)\n2. ✅ Identify all keywords (hard skills, soft skills, industry terms)\n3. ✅ Calculate match score\n4. ✅ Identify strengths to emphasize\n5. ✅ Identify gaps and strategies to address\n6. ✅ Detect red flags\n7. ✅ Create resume customization plan\n8. ✅ Generate cover letter talking points\n9. ✅ Research company\n10. ✅ Provide application recommendation and timeline\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n### Vague Job Descriptions\n- Flag as potential red flag\n- Extract what keywords you can\n- Recommend reaching out for clarity before applying\n- Use industry standard requirements as baseline\n\n### Multiple Roles in One JD\n- Identify the core role vs \"other duties\"\n- Focus match score on primary responsibilities\n- Flag scope creep concerns\n\n### Internal Postings (Already Working There)\n- Different strategy - emphasize internal knowledge\n- Highlight cross-team relationships\n- Reference specific company initiatives\n\n### Reposted Jobs\n- May indicate: Previous hire didn''t work out, role expanded, or first search failed\n- Worth applying, but research why it was reposted\n- Check if requirements changed from original posting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:42:02.319Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Career Development Agents needing advanced job description parsing and resume optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级职位描述解析和简历优化能力的职业发展代理。","ja":"キャリア開発エージェントが高度なジョブ記述解析と履歴書の最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"진급을 원하는 에이전트에게 적합하며, 고급 직무 설명 분석 및 이력서 최적화 기능을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de carrera que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis de descripciones de trabajo y optimización de currículums.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de carrière ayant besoin d''une analyse avancée de descriptions de poste et de capacités d''optimisation de CV.","de":"Perfekt für Karriereentwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Stellenbeschreibungsanalyse- und Lebenslauf-Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Carreira que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise de descrições de trabalho e otimização de currículos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по развитию карьеры, которым требуются продвинутые возможности парсинга описаний работы и оптимизации резюме.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل تطوير المسار الوظيفي التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل وصفات العمل وضبط سير ذاتية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract and categorize job requirements, providing match percentage analysis and strategic job search guidance using natural language processing and machine learning protocols.","zh":"使代理能够提取和分类工作要求，提供匹配百分比分析和使用自然语言处理和机器学习协议的战略性工作搜索指导。","ja":"エージェントがジョブ要件を抽出して分類し、自然言語処理と機械学習プロトコルを使用した戦略的なジョブ検索ガイダンスと一致率分析を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 일자리 요구 사항을 추출하고 분류하여 자연어 처리 및 기계 학습 프로토콜을 사용한 전략적 일자리 검색 지침과 일치 퍼센트 분석을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer y categorizar los requisitos del trabajo, proporcionando un análisis de porcentaje de coincidencia y una orientación estratégica de búsqueda de trabajo utilizando protocolos de procesamiento de lenguaje natural y aprendizaje automático.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire et de catégoriser les exigences du poste, fournissant une analyse de pourcentage de correspondance et des conseils de recherche d''emploi stratégiques à l''aide de protocoles de traitement du langage naturel et d''apprentissage automatique.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Jobanforderungen zu extrahieren und zu kategorisieren und bietet eine Analyse des Übereinstimmungsprozentsatzes und strategische Job-Suchhilfe unter Verwendung von Protokollen für die natürliche Sprachverarbeitung und maschinelles Lernen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair e categorizar os requisitos do trabalho, fornecendo análise de porcentagem de compatibilidade e orientação estratégica de busca de emprego usando protocolos de processamento de linguagem natural e aprendizado de máquina.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать и категоризировать требования к работе, предоставляя анализ процента совпадения и стратегическое руководство по поиску работы с использованием протоколов обработки естественного языка и машинного обучения.","ar":"تمكّن الوسائل من استخراج وتصنيف متطلبات العمل، وتقديم تحليل نسبة المطابقة وتوجيه بحث استراتيجي للعثور على عمل باستخدام بروتوكولات معالجة اللغة الطبيعية وبروتوكولات التعلم الآلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing job postings for qualification matches","Generating tailored resumes for specific positions","Calculating match scores for job seekers"],"zh":["分析职位发布的资格匹配","为特定职位生成定制简历","计算求职者的匹配评分"],"ja":["資格一致性を分析するための求人投稿","特定のポジション用にカスタマイズされた履歴書を生成する","求職者のマッチスコアを計算する"],"ko":["자격증 일치 분석을 위한 구인 공고 분석","특정 직위에 대한 맞춤형 이력서 생성","구직자의 일치 점수 계산"],"es":["Análisis de ofertas de trabajo para coincidencias de calificaciones","Generación de currículums personalizados para puestos específicos","Cálculo de puntuaciones de coincidencia para buscadores de trabajo"],"fr":["Analyse d''offres d''emploi pour les correspondances de qualifications","Génération de CV personnalisés pour des postes spécifiques","Calcul des scores de correspondance pour les chercheurs d''emploi"],"de":["Analyse von Stellenangeboten für Qualifikationsübereinstimmungen","Erstellung von maßgeschneiderten Lebensläufen für bestimmte Positionen","Berechnung von Übereinstimmungspunktzahlen für Stellensuchende"],"pt":["Analisar anúncios de emprego para correspondência de qualificações","Gerar currículos personalizados para posições específicas","Calcular escores de correspondência para candidatos a emprego"],"ru":["Анализ вакансий для соответствия квалификации","Генерация индивидуальных резюме для конкретных позиций","Расчет баллов совпадения для соискателей работы"],"ar":["تحليل إعلانات العمل للتفقّات في المؤهلات","إنتاج سير ذاتية مُصممة خصيصاً لمواقع محددة","حساب الدرجات المطابقة للباحثين عن عمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires job description text input","Limited to job search and career development domains"],"zh":["需要职位描述文本输入","仅限于求职和职业发展领域"],"ja":["ジョブ記述テキスト入力を必要とする","ジョブ検索とキャリア開発のドメインに限定される"],"ko":["직무 설명 텍스트 입력이 필요하다","구직 및 경력 개발 영역에 한정된다"],"es":["Requiere entrada de texto de descripción de trabajo","Limitado a los dominios de búsqueda de trabajo y desarrollo de carrera"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de texte de description de poste","Limité aux domaines de recherche d''emploi et de développement de carrière"],"de":["Benötigt Texteingabe für Stellenbeschreibung","Begrenzt auf die Bereiche Stellensuche und Karriereentwicklung"],"pt":["Requer entrada de texto de descrição do trabalho","Limitado a domínios de busca de emprego e desenvolvimento de carreira"],"ru":["Требует ввода текста описания работы","Ограничен доменами поиска работы и развития карьеры"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال نصوص وصفات العمل","محدود بنطاق بحث العمل وتطوير المسار الوظيفي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('acquia/nebula/canvas-component-metadata', 'community', 'acquia', 'nebula', 'acquia/nebula', 'canvas-component-metadata', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:41:51.472Z', NULL, '{"id":"acquia/nebula/canvas-component-metadata","name":"canvas-component-metadata","description":{"zh":"Canvas 组件元数据规范定义了组件的基本结构和属性，包括名称、机器名称、状态和所需属性等","ja":"Canvas コンポーネントメタデータ規格は、コンポーネントの基本構造とプロパティを定義します","ko":"Canvas 컴포넌트 메타데이터 규격은 컴포넌트의 기본 구조와 속성을 정의합니다","es":"Los metadatos de componentes de lienzo permiten definir nombres, estados y propiedades para una mejor integración. Aprende a estructurar tus componentes.","fr":"Les métadonnées de composants de canevas permettent de définir des noms, des états et des propriétés pour une meilleure intégration. Découvrez comment structurer vos composants.","de":"Die Canvas-Komponenten-Metadaten ermöglichen die Definition von Namen, Zuständen und Eigenschaften für eine bessere Integration. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Ihre Komponenten strukturieren.","pt":"Os componentes Canvas exigem uma estrutura de arquivo específica, incluindo nomes de máquina e propriedades. Saiba mais sobre como configurar seus componentes.","ru":"Компоненты Canvas требуют определенной структуры файла, включая имена машин и свойства. Узнайте больше о том, как настроить ваши компоненты.","ar":"مكونات Canvas تتطلب هيكلاً ملفياً محدداً ، بما في ذلك أسماء الآلة والخصائص. تعرف على المزيد حول كيفية تكوين مكوناتك.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Canvas 组件元数据规范","ja":"キャンバスコンポーネントメタデータ","ko":"캔버스 컴포넌트 메타데이터","es":"Metadatos de componentes de lienzo","fr":"Métadonnées de composants de canevas","de":"Canvas-Komponenten-Metadaten","pt":"Metadados de Componentes Canvas","ru":"Метаданные компонентов Canvas","ar":"بيانات تعريف مكونات Canvas","en":"canvas-component-metadata"},"description":{"zh":"Canvas 组件元数据规范定义了组件的基本结构和属性，包括名称、机器名称、状态和所需属性等","ja":"Canvas コンポーネントメタデータ規格は、コンポーネントの基本構造とプロパティを定義します","ko":"Canvas 컴포넌트 메타데이터 규격은 컴포넌트의 기본 구조와 속성을 정의합니다","es":"Los metadatos de componentes de lienzo permiten definir nombres, estados y propiedades para una mejor integración. Aprende a estructurar tus componentes.","fr":"Les métadonnées de composants de canevas permettent de définir des noms, des états et des propriétés pour une meilleure intégration. Découvrez comment struct...","de":"Die Canvas-Komponenten-Metadaten ermöglichen die Definition von Namen, Zuständen und Eigenschaften für eine bessere Integration. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Ihre K...","pt":"Os componentes Canvas exigem uma estrutura de arquivo específica, incluindo nomes de máquina e propriedades. Saiba mais sobre como configurar seus componentes.","ru":"Компоненты Canvas требуют определенной структуры файла, включая имена машин и свойства. Узнайте больше о том, как настроить ваши компоненты.","ar":"مكونات Canvas تتطلب هيكلاً ملفياً محدداً ، بما في ذلك أسماء الآلة والخصائص. تعرف على المزيد حول كيفية تكوين مكوناتك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["定义组件的基本结构","指定组件的名称和机器名称","确定组件的状态和所需属性","支持属性和插槽的定义","优化组件的开发和使用体验"],"ja":["コンポーネントの基本構造を定義","コンポーネントの名前と機械名を指定","コンポーネントの状態と必要なプロパティを決定","プロパティとスロットの定義をサポート","コンポーネントの開発と使用の体験を最適化"],"ko":["컴포넌트의 기본 구조를 정의","컴포넌트의 이름과 기계 이름을 지정","컴포넌트의 상태와 필요한 속성을 결정","속성과 슬롯의 정의를 지원","컴포넌트의 개발과 사용 경험을 최적화"],"es":["Definición de nombres y estados de componentes","Especificación de propiedades y requisitos","Uso de slots para una mayor flexibilidad","Mejora de la integración con metadatos estructurados","Compatibilidad con formatos de archivo estándar"],"fr":["Définition des noms et des états des composants","Spécification des propriétés et des exigences","Utilisation de slots pour une plus grande flexibilité","Amélioration de l''intégration avec des métadonnées structurées","Compatibilité avec les formats de fichier standard"],"de":["Definition von Namen und Zuständen von Komponenten","Spezifikation von Eigenschaften und Anforderungen","Verwendung von Slots für eine größere Flexibilität","Verbesserung der Integration mit strukturierten Metadaten","Kompatibilität mit Standard-Dateiformaten"],"pt":["Estrutura de arquivo componente.yml","Nomes de máquina em kebab-case","Propriedades e slots personalizáveis","Requisitos de propriedade","Habilitação e desabilitação de componentes"],"ru":["Структура файла компонента.yml","Имена машин в kebab-case","Настраиваемые свойства и слоты","Требования к свойствам","Включение и выключение компонентов"],"ar":["هيكل ملف مكون.yml","أسماء الآلة في kebab-case","خصائص وفتحات قابلة للتعديل","متطلبات الخصائص","تمكين وإلغاء تمكين المكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Canvas 组件","元数据规范","组件开发","属性定义","插槽定义","开发体验优化"],"ja":["Canvas コンポーネント","メタデータ規格","コンポーネント開発","プロパティ定義","スロット定義","開発体験最適化"],"ko":["Canvas 컴포넌트","메타데이터 규격","컴포넌트 개발","속성 정의","슬롯 정의","개발 경험 최적화"],"es":["metadatos de componentes","estructura de componentes","definición de propiedades","requerimientos de componentes","slots en componentes","integración de componentes","formatos de archivo estándar","desarrollo de componentes"],"fr":["métadonnées de composants","structure de composants","définition de propriétés","exigences de composants","slots dans les composants","intégration de composants","formats de fichier standard","développement de composants"],"de":["Metadaten von Komponenten","Struktur von Komponenten","Definition von Eigenschaften","Anforderungen von Komponenten","Slots in Komponenten","Integration von Komponenten","Standard-Dateiformate","Entwicklung von Komponenten"],"pt":["metadados de componentes","canvas component","componente.yml","estrutura de arquivo","propriedades personalizáveis","requisitos de propriedade"],"ru":["метаданные компонентов","компонент Canvas","компонент.yml","структура файла","настраиваемые свойства","требования к свойствам"],"ar":["بيانات تعريف مكونات","مكون Canvas","مكون.yml","هيكل الملف","خصائص قابلة للتعديل","متطلبات الخصائص"]}},"owner":"acquia","repo":"nebula","repoPath":"acquia/nebula","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"canvas-component-metadata","description":"","bodyPreview":"## File structure\n\nEvery `component.yml` must include these top-level keys:\n\n```yaml\nname: Component Name # Human-readable display name\nmachineName: component-name # Machine name in kebab-case\nstatus: true # Whether the component is enabled\nrequired: [] # Array of required prop names\nprops:\n  properties:\n    # ... prop definitions\nslots: [] # Use [] only when there are no slots; otherwise use an object map\n```\n\n## Props\n\n### Requirements\n\nEvery prop definition must include a `title` for the UI l","body":"## File structure\n\nEvery `component.yml` must include these top-level keys:\n\n```yaml\nname: Component Name # Human-readable display name\nmachineName: component-name # Machine name in kebab-case\nstatus: true # Whether the component is enabled\nrequired: [] # Array of required prop names\nprops:\n  properties:\n    # ... prop definitions\nslots: [] # Use [] only when there are no slots; otherwise use an object map\n```\n\n## Props\n\n### Requirements\n\nEvery prop definition must include a `title` for the UI label. The `examples`\narray is required for required props and recommended for all others. Only the\nfirst example value is used by Drupal Canvas.\n\n```yaml\nprops:\n  properties:\n    heading:\n      title: Heading\n      type: string\n      examples:\n        - Enter a heading...\n```\n\n**Prop IDs must be camelCase versions of their titles.**\n\nThe prop ID (the key under `properties`) must be the camelCase conversion of the\n`title` value.\n\nOnly include user-facing, Canvas-editable props in `component.yml`.\nImplementation-only React props must stay in JSX and must not be added to\nmetadata.\n\n**Never include `className` in `component.yml`.** Treat it as a composition prop\nfor developers, not a Canvas editor control.\n\n```yaml\n# Correct\nprops:\n  properties:\n    buttonText:           # camelCase of \"Button Text\"\n      title: Button Text\n      type: string\n    backgroundColor:      # camelCase of \"Background Color\"\n      title: Background Color\n      type: string\n    isVisible:            # camelCase of \"Is Visible\"\n      title: Is Visible\n      type: boolean\n\n# Wrong\nprops:\n  properties:\n    btn_text:             # should be \"buttonText\" for title \"Button Text\"\n      title: Button Text\n    bgColor:              # should be \"backgroundColor\" for title \"Background Color\"\n      title: Background Color\n```\n\n### Prop types\n\n#### Text\n\nBasic text input. Stored as a string value.\n\n```yaml\ntype: string\nexamples:\n  - Hello, world!\n```\n\n#### Formatted text\n\nRich text content with HTML formatting support, displayed in a block context.\n\n```yaml\ntype: string\ncontentMediaType: text/html\nx-formatting-context: block\nexamples:\n  - <p>This is <strong>formatted</strong> text with HTML.</p>\n```\n\n#### Link\n\nURL or URI reference for links to internal or external resources.\n\n```yaml\ntype: string\nformat: uri-reference\nexamples:\n  - /about/contact\n```\n\n**Note:** The format can be either `uri` (accepts only absolute URLs) or\n`uri-reference` (accepts both absolute and relative URLs).\n\n**IMPORTANT: Use proper path examples for URL props.** Do not use `#` as an\nexample value for `uri-reference` props—it can cause validation failures during\nupload. Always use realistic path-like examples:\n\n```yaml\n# Correct\nexamples:\n  - /resources\n  - /about/team\n  - https://example.com/page\n\n# Wrong\nexamples:\n  - \"#\"\n  - \"\"\n```\n\n#### Image\n\nReference to an image object with metadata like alt text, dimensions, and file\nURL. Only the file URL is required to exist, all other metadata is always\noptional.\n\n```yaml\ntype: object\n$ref: json-schema-definitions://canvas.module/image\nexamples:\n  - src: >-\n      https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1484959014842-cd1d967a39cf?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&ixid=MnwxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1770&q=80\n    alt: Woman playing the violin\n    width: 1770\n    height: 1180\n```\n\n#### Video\n\nReference to a video object with metadata like dimensions and file URL. Only the\nfile URL is required to exist, all other metadata is always optional.\n\n```yaml\ntype: object\n$ref: json-schema-definitions://canvas.module/video\nexamples:\n  - src: https://media.istockphoto.com/id/1340051874/video/aerial-top-down-view-of-a-container-cargo-ship.mp4?s=mp4-640x640-is&k=20&c=5qPpYI7TOJiOYzKq9V2myBvUno6Fq2XM3ITPGFE8Cd8=\n    poster: https://example.com/600x400.png\n```\n\n#### Boolean\n\nTrue or false value.\n\n```yaml\ntype: boolean\nexamples:\n  - false\n```\n\n#### Integer\n\nWhole number value without decimal places.\n\n```yaml\ntype: integer\nexamples:\n  - 42\n```\n\n#### Number\n\nNumeric value that can include decimal places.\n\n```yaml\ntype: number\nexamples:\n  - 3.14\n```\n\n#### List: text\n\nA predefined list of text options that the user can select from.\n\n```yaml\ntype: string\nenum:\n  - option1\n  - option2\n  - option3\nmeta:enum:\n  option1: Option 1\n  option2: Option 2\n  option3: Option 3\nexamples:\n  - option1\n```\n\n#### List: integer\n\nA predefined list of integer options that the user can select from.\n\n```yaml\ntype: integer\nenum:\n  - 1\n  - 2\n  - 3\nmeta:enum:\n  1: Option 1\n  2: Option 2\n  3: Option 3\nexamples:\n  - 1\n```\n\n## Enums\n\nEnum values must use lowercase, machine-friendly identifiers. Use `meta:enum` to\nprovide human-readable display labels for the UI.\n\n**Note:** Enum values cannot contain dots.\n\n```yaml\n# Correct\nenum:\n  - left_aligned\n  - center_aligned\nmeta:enum:\n  left_aligned: Left aligned\n  center_aligned: Center aligned\nexamples:\n  - left_aligned\n\n# Wrong\nenum:\n  - Left aligned\n  - Center aligned\n```\n\nThe `examples` value must be the enum value, not the display label.\n\n### Enum values must match JSX component variants\n\nWhen using class-variance-authority (CVA) or similar libraries in the JSX\ncomponent, the variant keys must exactly match the enum values defined in\n`component.yml`.\n\n```jsx\n// component.yml defines: enum: [left_aligned, center_aligned]\n// CVA variants must match:\nconst variants = cva(\"base-classes\", {\n  variants: {\n    layout: {\n      left_aligned: \"text-left\", // matches enum value\n      center_aligned: \"text-center\", // matches enum value\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Slots\n\nSlots allow other components to be embedded within a component. In React, each\nslot is received as a named prop that matches the slot key.\n\nThis section is the slot schema source of truth. Other skills should reference\nthese rules instead of redefining slot schema details.\n\nBefore creating slots, confirm with the user unless the use case is clearly\ncompositional (for example, rich nested content, or repeatable embedded\ncomponents). For simple text-like values, prefer a prop.\n\n**Important:** Do not map Canvas slots to the `children` prop by default. If the\nslot key is `content`, consume it as `content` in JSX.\n\nUsing a slot key named `children` is technically possible, but it is not\nrecommended because slot naming often flows into user-facing Canvas labels.\nPrefer explicit slot keys such as `content`, `media`, or `actions`.\n\n`slots` must be either:\n\n1. An object map keyed by slot name (`content`, `sidebar`, etc.)\n2. `[]` when the component has no slots\n\n```yaml\nslots:\n  content:\n    title: Content\n  buttons:\n    title: Buttons\n```\n\nIn the JSX component, slots are destructured as named props and rendered\ndirectly:\n\n```jsx\nconst Section = ({ width, content }) => {\n  return <div className={sectionVariants({ width })}>{content}</div>;\n};\n```\n\n```jsx\n// Wrong when the slot key is `content`: this does not consume the named slot.\nconst Section = ({ children }) => {\n  return <div>{children}</div>;\n};\n```\n\nUse `slots: []` only when the component has no slots:\n\n```yaml\nslots: []\n```\n\nDo not use arrays of slot objects:\n\n```yaml\n# Wrong\nslots:\n  - name: content\n    title: Content\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:41:51.472Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing standardized component metadata management.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化组件元数据管理的前端代理。","ja":"標準化されたコンポーネントメタデータ管理を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 컴포넌트 메타데이터 관리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan una gestión de metadatos de componentes estandarizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une gestion de métadonnées de composants standardisées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die eine standardisierte Verwaltung von Komponentenmetadaten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de gerenciamento de metadados de componentes padronizados.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходим стандартизированный менеджмент метаданных компонентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة بيانات مكونات معيارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define and manage component configurations using YAML files, providing a structured approach to component properties and slots, and ensuring consistency across applications with machineName in kebab-case and human-readable display names.","zh":"赋予代理定义和管理组件配置的能力，使用YAML文件提供结构化的组件属性和插槽方法，并确保在kebab-case的machineName和人性化显示名称中应用程序的一致性。","ja":"エージェントにコンポーネント構成を定義して管理する能力を与え、YAMLファイルを使用して構造化されたコンポーネントのプロパティとスロットを提供し、kebab-caseのmachineNameと人間が読みやすい表示名でアプリケーション間の一貫性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 컴포넌트 구성 정의 및 관리 기능을 가지는 것을 가능하게 하며, YAML 파일을 사용하여 구조화된 컴포넌트 속성 및 슬롯을 제공하고, 기계 이름의 케이밥ケース 및 인간이 읽기 쉬운 표시 이름에서 일관성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir y gestionar configuraciones de componentes utilizando archivos YAML, proporcionando un enfoque estructurado para las propiedades y ranuras de los componentes, y garantizando la consistencia en todas las aplicaciones con machineName en kebab-case y nombres de pantalla legibles para humanos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir et de gérer des configurations de composants à l''aide de fichiers YAML, fournissant une approche structurée pour les propriétés et les emplacements de composants, et garantissant la cohérence à travers les applications avec machineName en kebab-case et des noms d''affichage lisibles par l''homme.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Komponentenkonfigurationen mithilfe von YAML-Dateien zu definieren und zu verwalten, wodurch ein strukturierter Ansatz für Komponenteneigenschaften und -schlote bereitgestellt wird und die Konsistenz über alle Anwendungen mit machineName in kebab-case und menschenlesbaren Anzeigename sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir e gerenciar configurações de componentes usando arquivos YAML, fornecendo uma abordagem estruturada para propriedades e slots de componentes e garantindo consistência em aplicativos com machineName em kebab-case e nomes de exibição legíveis por humanos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять и управлять конфигурациями компонентов с помощью файлов YAML, обеспечивая структурированный подход к свойствам и слотам компонентов, и гарантируя согласованность во всех приложениях с machineName в kebab-case и читаемыми людьми именами отображения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تعريف وإدارة تكوينات المكونات باستخدام ملفات YAML، مما يوفر نهجًا منظمًا لخصائص وفواصل المكونات، وضمان الاتساق عبر التطبيقات مع machineName في kebab-case وأسماء عرض قابلة للقراءة من قبل الإنسان."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining reusable UI components","Managing component dependencies with required props","Validating component metadata against a standardized schema"],"zh":["定义可重用的UI组件","管理具有必需道具的组件依赖关系","验证组件元数据是否符合标准化模式"],"ja":["再利用可能なUIコンポーネントを定義する","必須のプロパティを伴うコンポーネントの依存関係を管理する","コンポーネントのメタデータを標準化されたスキーマに対して検証する"],"ko":["재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 정의","필수 속성을 갖는 컴포넌트 의존성 관리","컴포넌트 메타데이터를 표준화된 스키마에 대한 유효성 검사"],"es":["Definir componentes de UI reutilizables","Gestionar dependencias de componentes con props requeridas","Validar metadatos de componentes contra un esquema estandarizado"],"fr":["Définir des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables","Gérer les dépendances de composants avec des props requises","Valider les métadonnées de composants contre un schéma standardisé"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare UI-Komponenten definieren","Komponentenabhängigkeiten mit erforderlichen Props verwalten","Komponentenmetadaten gegen ein standardisiertes Schema validieren"],"pt":["Definir componentes de interface do usuário reutilizáveis","Gerenciar dependências de componentes com propriedades necessárias","Validar metadados de componentes contra um esquema padronizado"],"ru":["Определение многократно используемых компонентов пользовательского интерфейса","Управление зависимостями компонентов с необходимыми свойствами","Проверка метаданных компонентов против стандартизированной схемы"],"ar":["تعريف مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","إدارة التبعيات الخاصة بالمكونات مع الخصائص المطلوبة","التحقق من صحة بيانات المكونات مقابل مخطط معياري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires YAML file structure compliance","Limited to component metadata management"],"zh":["需要遵守YAML文件结构","仅限于组件元数据管理"],"ja":["YAMLファイル構造への準拠が必要","コンポーネントメタデータ管理に限定される"],"ko":["YAML 파일 구조 준수 필요","컴포넌트 메타데이터 관리로 제한"],"es":["Requiere cumplimiento de la estructura de archivos YAML","Limitado a la gestión de metadatos de componentes"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect de la structure de fichiers YAML","Limité à la gestion des métadonnées de composants"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der YAML-Dateistruktur","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von Komponentenmetadaten"],"pt":["Exige conformidade com a estrutura do arquivo YAML","Limitado ao gerenciamento de metadados de componentes"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения структуры файла YAML","Ограничен менеджментом метаданных компонентов"],"ar":["يتطلب مطابقة هيكل ملف YAML","محدود بإدارة بيانات المكونات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('shunta-sato/agent-instructions-playbook/dev-workflow', 'community', 'shunta-sato', 'agent-instructions-playbook', 'shunta-sato/agent-instructions-playbook', 'dev-workflow', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:41:55.585Z', NULL, '{"id":"shunta-sato/agent-instructions-playbook/dev-workflow","name":"dev-workflow","description":{"zh":"dev-workflow技能是代码变更的标准操作程序，确保变更的可行性和结果的可验证性。","ja":"dev-workflowスキルはコード変更の標準手順であり、変更の実行可能性と結果の検証可能性を保証する。","ko":"dev-workflow 스킬은 코드 변경의 표준 운영 절차로서 변경의 실행 가능성과 결과의 검증 가능성을 보장한다.","es":"El flujo de trabajo de desarrollo es el procedimiento operativo estándar para implementar cambios en este repositorio, convirtiendo solicitudes en planes implementables con resultados verificables.","fr":"Le flux de travail de développement est la procédure opérationnelle standard pour mettre en œuvre des modifications dans ce référentiel, transformant des demandes en plans exécutables avec des résultats vérifiables.","de":"Der Entwicklungsarbeitsablauf ist das Standard-Betriebsverfahren zur Umsetzung von Änderungen in diesem Repository, indem Anfragen in ausführbare Pläne mit überprüfbaren Ergebnissen umgewandelt werden.","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento é um procedimento padrão para implementar mudanças no repositório, transformando solicitações em planos implementáveis com resultados verificáveis.","ru":"Разработка рабочего процесса - это стандартная процедура для реализации изменений в репозитории, превращающая запросы в реализуемые планы с проверяемыми результатами.","ar":"تدفق عمل التطوير هو إجراء قياسي لتنفيذ التغييرات في المستودع، يتحول الطلبات إلى خطط قابلة للتنفيذ مع نتائج قابلة للتحقق.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"dev-workflow技能：代码变更的标准操作程序","ja":"dev-workflowスキル：コード変更の標準手順","ko":"dev-workflow 스킬: 코드 변경의 표준 운영 절차","es":"Flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","fr":"Flux de travail de développement","de":"Entwicklungsarbeitsablauf","pt":"Fluxo de Trabalho de Desenvolvimento","ru":"Разработка рабочего процесса","ar":"تدفق عمل التطوير","en":"dev-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"dev-workflow技能是代码变更的标准操作程序，确保变更的可行性和结果的可验证性。","ja":"dev-workflowスキルはコード変更の標準手順であり、変更の実行可能性と結果の検証可能性を保証する。","ko":"dev-workflow 스킬은 코드 변경의 표준 운영 절차로서 변경의 실행 가능성과 결과의 검증 가능성을 보장한다.","es":"El flujo de trabajo de desarrollo es el procedimiento operativo estándar para implementar cambios en este repositorio, convirtiendo solicitudes en planes imp...","fr":"Le flux de travail de développement est la procédure opérationnelle standard pour mettre en œuvre des modifications dans ce référentiel, transformant des dem...","de":"Der Entwicklungsarbeitsablauf ist das Standard-Betriebsverfahren zur Umsetzung von Änderungen in diesem Repository, indem Anfragen in ausführbare Pläne mit ü...","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento é um procedimento padrão para implementar mudanças no repositório, transformando solicitações em planos implementáveis...","ru":"Разработка рабочего процесса - это стандартная процедура для реализации изменений в репозитории, превращающая запросы в реализуемые планы с проверяемыми резу...","ar":"تدفق عمل التطوير هو إجراء قياسي لتنفيذ التغييرات في المستودع، يتحول الطلبات إلى خطط قابلة للتنفيذ مع نتائج قابلة للتحقق.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["代码变更的标准操作程序","需求和设计的明确","测试设计和实现的可行性","结果的可验证性","开发效率的提升"],"ja":["コード変更の標準手順","要件と設計の明確化","テスト設計と実装の実行可能性","結果の検証可能性","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["코드 변경의 표준 운영 절차","요구사항과 설계의 명확화","테스트 설계와 구현의 실행 가능성","결과의 검증 가능성","개발 효율성의 향상"],"es":["Implementación de cambios en el repositorio","Creación de un plan de implementación","Verificación de resultados","Requisitos y diseño de pruebas","Implementación y verificación","Puerta de control final"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de modifications dans le référentiel","Création d''un plan de mise en œuvre","Vérification des résultats","Exigences et conception de tests","Mise en œuvre et vérification","Porte de contrôle finale"],"de":["Umsetzung von Änderungen im Repository","Erstellung eines Umsetzungsplans","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse","Anforderungen und Testdesign","Umsetzung und Überprüfung","Endgültige Kontrollschwelle"],"pt":["Transforma solicitações em planos implementáveis","Fornece resultados verificáveis","É um procedimento padrão para implementar mudanças","Inclui design, teste e implementação","É obrigatório para tarefas que alteram código e/ou testes"],"ru":["Преобразует запросы в реализуемые планы","Предоставляет проверяемые результаты","Это стандартная процедура для реализации изменений","Включает в себя проектирование, тестирование и реализацию","Является обязательным для задач, изменяющих код и/или тесты"],"ar":["يتحول الطلبات إلى خطط قابلة للتنفيذ","يوفر نتائج قابلة للتحقق","هو إجراء قياسي لتنفيذ التغييرات","يشمل التصميم والاختبار والتنفيذ","يجب استخدامه للtasks التي تتغير فيها الأكواد و/أو الاختبارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["dev-workflow","代码变更","标准操作程序","开发效率","代码测试","软件开发流程"],"ja":["dev-workflow","コード変更","標準手順","開発効率","コードテスト","ソフトウェア開発プロセス"],"ko":["dev-workflow","코드 변경","표준 운영 절차","개발 효율성","코드 테스트","소프트웨어 개발 프로세스"],"es":["flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","desarrollo de software","implementación de cambios","plan de implementación","verificación de resultados","requisitos y diseño de pruebas","desarrollo ágil","metodologías de desarrollo"],"fr":["flux de travail de développement","développement de logiciels","mise en œuvre de modifications","plan de mise en œuvre","vérification des résultats","exigences et conception de tests","développement agile","méthodologies de développement"],"de":["Entwicklungsarbeitsablauf","Softwareentwicklung","Umsetzung von Änderungen","Umsetzungsplan","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse","Anforderungen und Testdesign","agiles Entwicklung","Entwicklungsmethoden"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","procedimento padrão","implementação de mudanças","resultados verificáveis","desenvolvimento de código"],"ru":["разработка рабочего процесса","разработка программного обеспечения","стандартная процедура","реализация изменений","проверяемые результаты","разработка кода"],"ar":["تدفق عمل التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","إجراء قياسي","تنفيذ التغييرات","نتائج قابلة للتحقق","تطوير الكود"]}},"owner":"shunta-sato","repo":"agent-instructions-playbook","repoPath":"shunta-sato/agent-instructions-playbook","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dev-workflow","description":"MANDATORY end-to-end workflow for any code/test change: requirements → design → test list/TDD → implement → verify (build/format/static-analysis/tests) → quality gate. Enforces code-readability, modularity, architecture-boundaries, and error-handling from the start.","bodyPreview":"## Purpose\n\nThis skill is the default operating procedure for implementing changes in this repository.\n\nIt turns a request into an implementable plan with verifiable outcomes:\n\nrequirements → design → test design → implementation → verification → final gate.\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill **for any task that changes code and/or tests**. It is mandatory.\n\n## How to use\n\n0) Open `references/dev-workflow.md` and follow it step-by-step.\n\n1) Write the Change Brief and the Requirements (EARS “shall”","body":"## Purpose\n\nThis skill is the default operating procedure for implementing changes in this repository.\n\nIt turns a request into an implementable plan with verifiable outcomes:\n\nrequirements → design → test design → implementation → verification → final gate.\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill **for any task that changes code and/or tests**. It is mandatory.\n\n## How to use\n\n0) Open `references/dev-workflow.md` and follow it step-by-step.\n\n1) Write the Change Brief and the Requirements (EARS “shall” + acceptance criteria).\n\n1.5) If runtime behavior changes, add an Observability Plan (logs/metrics/traces) and invoke `$observability` when unsure.\n\n1.6) **Bugfix mode (required when task is a bug/regression/flaky/crash/hang):**\n   - Invoke `$bug-investigation-and-rca`.\n   - Do **not** implement the fix until reproduction/evidence is captured, a leading hypothesis is stated, and a verification plan exists.\n   - If only a workaround is proposed, include a follow-up prevention task.\n\n1.75) If the change is structural (new modules, boundary changes, refactors across layers), invoke `$code-smells-and-antipatterns`.\n\n2) Create a Test List (3–10). Decide whether to proceed with TDD.\n   - If doing TDD, explicitly invoke `$test-driven-development`.\n\n2.5) **Concurrency & Performance check (mandatory):**\n   - If concurrency/parallelism is introduced or changed: invoke `$concurrency-core` and `$thread-safety-tooling`.\n   - If ROS2 code is affected: also invoke `$concurrency-ros2`.\n   - If Android code is affected: also invoke `$concurrency-android`.\n   - If runtime behavior changes: invoke `$observability`.\n   - If performance targets are part of the goal: invoke `$nfr-iso25010`.\n\n2.6) **Constrained / low-level synthesis check (mandatory when relevant):**\n   - If you are implementing strict-constraint code (alignment/padding, SIMD/intrinsics, kernels, DSL/codegen, strict ABI/hardware APIs),\n     or if the task repeatedly fails to compile/test: invoke `$staged-lowering` before large edits.\n\n3) **Legacy check (mandatory):** if tests are missing or behavior is nondeterministic, explicitly invoke `$working-with-legacy-code` *before* refactoring.\n\n4) **C++ header gate (mandatory):** if `.hpp` / `.h` is in scope, explicitly invoke `$code-readability` and apply the mandatory Doxygen rules.\n\n5) Implementation:\n   - For readability: invoke `$code-readability` when you need concrete guidance.\n   - For modularity / coupling / boundaries: invoke `$modularity`.\n   - For Clean Architecture boundaries: invoke `$architecture-boundaries`.\n   - For error paths: invoke `$error-handling`.\n   - For NFRs: invoke `$nfr-iso25010` when relevant.\n   - If requirements docs must be updated: invoke `$requirements-documentation`.\n\n6) Verification: run the repo’s canonical commands for build / format / static analysis / tests until green.\n\n6.5) **UI verification (mandatory when UI changes):**\n   - Invoke `$visual-regression-testing`.\n   - Invoke the matching platform skill(s): `$visual-regression-ios`, `$visual-regression-android`, and/or `$visual-regression-web`.\n   - Run repo-defined UI verify/record commands and include a UI Visual Verification Report with artifact paths.\n\n7) Before submitting, explicitly invoke `$quality-gate` and keep fixing until it reports 0 findings.\n\n## Output expectation\n\n- Your final output must follow AGENTS.md “Required final output”.\n- Any skipped checks must include a reason and a reproducible procedure.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:41:55.585Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured repository change management and verification.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化仓库变更管理和验证的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが構造化されたリポジトリ変更管理と検証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 저장소 변경 관리 및 검증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de cambios de repositorio estructurada y verificación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de changements de référentiel structurée et de vérification.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine strukturierte Änderungsverwaltung von Repositorys und Überprüfung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de alterações de repositório estruturado e verificação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходим структурированный менеджмент изменений репозитория и верификация.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل تطوير المستندة إلى إدارة تغييرات المستودع المنظمة والتحقق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to turn requests into implementable plans with verifiable outcomes, following a strict requirements-to-verification workflow, utilizing Change Briefs, EARS ''shall'' requirements, and test design implementations.","zh":"赋予代理人将请求转化为可实施计划的能力，具有可核实的结果，遵循严格的需求到验证工作流程，利用变更简报、EARS ''shall'' 要求和测试设计实现。","ja":"要求を検証可能な成果とともに実施可能な計画に変換するエージェントをEmpowerし、厳格な要求から検証までのワークフローに従い、変更要約、EARS ''shall'' 要求、テスト設計実装を利用します。","ko":"요청을 검증 가능한 결과와 함께 수행 가능한 계획으로 변환할 수 있는 에이전트를赋予权限하고, 엄격한 요구 사항에서 검증까지의 워크플로를 따르고, 변경 요약, EARS ''shall'' 요구 사항 및 테스트 설계 구현을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir solicitudes en planes implementables con resultados verificables, siguiendo un estricto flujo de trabajo de requisitos a verificación, utilizando Informes de Cambio, requisitos ''debe'' de EARS y implementaciones de diseño de pruebas.","fr":"Habilite les agents à convertir les demandes en plans réalisables avec des résultats vérifiables, en suivant un flux de travail strict de exigences à vérification, en utilisant des briefs de changement, des exigences ''doit'' d''EARS et des implementations de conception de tests.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Anfragen in umsetzbare Pläne mit überprüfbaren Ergebnissen umzuwandeln, indem sie einem strengen Workflow von Anforderungen zu Überprüfung folgen, unter Nutzung von Änderungsvorlagen, EARS-''soll''-Anforderungen und Testdesignimplementierungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar solicitações em planos implementáveis com resultados verificáveis, seguindo um fluxo de trabalho estrito de requisitos para verificação, utilizando Briefs de Alteração, requisitos ''shall'' do EARS e implementações de design de teste.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить запросы в реализуемые планы с проверяемыми результатами, следуя строгому рабочему процессу требований к верификации, используя краткие изложения изменений, требования ''shall'' EARS и реализации тестового проектирования.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل الطلبات إلى خطط قابلة للتنفيذ مع نتائج قابلة للتحقق، اتباعًا لسير عمل متطلبات صارم للتحقق، باستخدام ملخصات التغييرات ومتطلبات ''shall'' لبرنامج EARS وتنفيذ تصميم الاختبار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the implementation of code changes with verifiable outcomes","Generating detailed Change Briefs and Requirements documents","Debugging and verifying test designs for repository changes"],"zh":["使用可核实的结果自动实现代码更改","生成详细的变更简报和需求文档","调试和验证存储库更改的测试设计"],"ja":["検証可能な成果を使用してコード変更を自動化する","詳細な変更要約と要件文書を生成する","リポジトリ変更のテスト設計をデバッグし検証する"],"ko":["검증 가능한 결과를 사용하여 코드 변경을 자동화합니다.","상세한 변경 요약 및 요구 사항 문서를 생성합니다.","저장소 변경에 대한 테스트 설계를 디버깅하고 검증합니다."],"es":["Automatizar la implementación de cambios de código con resultados verificables","Generar informes de cambio y documentos de requisitos detallados","Depurar y verificar diseños de pruebas para cambios de repositorio"],"fr":["Automatiser la mise en œuvre de modifications de code avec des résultats vérifiables","Générer des briefs de changement et des documents de spécifications détaillés","Déboguer et vérifier les conceptions de tests pour les modifications de référentiel"],"de":["Automatisieren der Implementierung von Codeänderungen mit überprüfbaren Ergebnissen","Erstellen detaillierter Änderungsvorlagen und Anforderungsdokumente","Fehlerbehebung und Überprüfung von Testdesigns für Repository-Änderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a implementação de alterações de código com resultados verificáveis","Gerar Change Briefs e documentos de requisitos detalhados","Depurar e verificar projetos de teste para alterações de repositório"],"ru":["Автоматизировать реализацию изменений кода с проверяемыми результатами","Генерировать подробные краткие изложения изменений и документы требований","Отлаживать и проверять проекты тестирования для изменений репозитория"],"ar":["تحويل التغييرات في الكود إلى خطط قابلة للتنفيذ مع نتائج قابلة للتحقق","إعداد ملخصات التغييرات ووثائق متطلبات مفصلة","تصحيح أخطاء ومراجعة تصاميم الاختبار للتغييرات في المستودع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Mandatory for tasks that change code and/or tests","Requires adherence to the dev-workflow procedure outlined in references/dev-workflow.md"],"zh":["代码和/或测试更改任务时是强制性的","需要遵守参考文献/dev-workflow.md中概述的开发工作流程"],"ja":["コードと/またはテストの変更タスクの場合、必須です","参考文献/dev-workflow.mdに概述されている開発ワークフロー手順に従う必要があります"],"ko":["코드 및/또는 테스트 변경 작업의 경우 필수입니다.","참고문서/dev-workflow.md에概述된 개발 워크플로우 절차를 따라야 합니다."],"es":["Obligatorio para tareas que cambian el código y/o las pruebas","Requiere la adherencia al procedimiento de flujo de trabajo de desarrollo descrito en references/dev-workflow.md"],"fr":["Obligatoire pour les tâches qui modifient le code et/ou les tests","Nécessite le respect de la procédure de flux de travail de développement décrite dans references/dev-workflow.md"],"de":["Obligatorisch für Aufgaben, die Code und/oder Tests ändern","Erfordert die Einhaltung des in references/dev-workflow.md beschriebenen Entwicklungs-Workflow-Verfahrens"],"pt":["Obrigatório para tarefas que alteram código e/ou testes","Exige aderência ao procedimento de fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento descrito em references/dev-workflow.md"],"ru":["Обязательно для задач, которые изменяют код и/или тесты","Требует соблюдения процедуры рабочего процесса разработки, описанной в references/dev-workflow.md"],"ar":["إلزامي لل مهام التي تغير الشفرة و/أو الاختبارات","يتطلب اتباع إجراء سير عمل التطوير المحدد في references/dev-workflow.md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('JUVOJustin/wordpress-plugin-boilerplate/plugin-translations-update', 'community', 'JUVOJustin', 'wordpress-plugin-boilerplate', 'JUVOJustin/wordpress-plugin-boilerplate', 'plugin-translations-update', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:42:17.394Z', NULL, '{"id":"JUVOJustin/wordpress-plugin-boilerplate/plugin-translations-update","name":"plugin-translations-update","description":{"zh":"这是一个专为WordPress插件开发者设计的翻译管理工具，通过标准化流程自动化提取、更新和编译翻译文件，简化多语言插件开发。","ja":"WordPressプラグイン開発者向けの翻訳管理ツールで、標準化されたプロセスにより翻訳ファイルの抽出、更新、コンパイルを自動化します。","ko":"WordPress 플러그인 개발자를 위한 번역 관리 도구로, 표준화된 프로세스를 통해 번역 파일 추출, 업데이트 및 컴파일을 자동화합니다.","es":"Gestiona la internacionalización de tus plugins de WordPress con nuestro boilerplate y actualiza tus traducciones de manera efectiva.","fr":"Gérez l''internationalisation de vos plugins WordPress avec notre boilerplate et mettez à jour vos traductions de manière efficace.","de":"Verwalten Sie die Internationalisierung Ihrer WordPress-Plugins mit unserem Boilerplate und aktualisieren Sie Ihre Übersetzungen effektiv.","pt":"Gerencie a internacionalização do seu plugin WordPress com este boilerplate opinativo.","ru":"Управляйте интернационализацией вашего плагина WordPress с помощью этого opinativo boilerplate.","ar":"ادخل على إدارة التدويل لبرنامج المساعد لنظام ووردبريس باستخدام هذا الإعداد التوجيهي.","en":"WordPress Plugin Boilerplate with opinionated setup. "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"WordPress插件翻译更新工具：自动化i18n工作流","ja":"WordPressプラグイン翻訳更新：i18nワークフロー自動化","ko":"WordPress 플러그인 번역 업데이트: i18n 워크플로우 자동화","es":"Actualización de traducciones de plugins de WordPress","fr":"Mise à jour des traductions de plugins WordPress","de":"WordPress-Plugin-Übersetzungs-Update","pt":"Atualize Traduções de Plugin WordPress","ru":"Обновление переводов плагина WordPress","ar":"تحديث ترجمات البرنامج المساعد لنظام ووردبريس","en":"plugin-translations-update"},"description":{"zh":"这是一个专为WordPress插件开发者设计的翻译管理工具，通过标准化流程自动化提取、更新和编译翻译文件，简化多语言插件开发。","ja":"WordPressプラグイン開発者向けの翻訳管理ツールで、標準化されたプロセスにより翻訳ファイルの抽出、更新、コンパイルを自動化します。","ko":"WordPress 플러그인 개발자를 위한 번역 관리 도구로, 표준화된 프로세스를 통해 번역 파일 추출, 업데이트 및 컴파일을 자동화합니다.","es":"Gestiona la internacionalización de tus plugins de WordPress con nuestro boilerplate y actualiza tus traducciones de manera efectiva.","fr":"Gérez l''internationalisation de vos plugins WordPress avec notre boilerplate et mettez à jour vos traductions de manière efficace.","de":"Verwalten Sie die Internationalisierung Ihrer WordPress-Plugins mit unserem Boilerplate und aktualisieren Sie Ihre Übersetzungen effektiv.","pt":"Gerencie a internacionalização do seu plugin WordPress com este boilerplate opinativo.","ru":"Управляйте интернационализацией вашего плагина WordPress с помощью этого opinativo boilerplate.","ar":"ادخل على إدارة التدويل لبرنامج المساعد لنظام ووردبريس باستخدام هذا الإعداد التوجيهي.","en":"WordPress Plugin Boilerplate with opinionated setup. "},"definition":{"en":"WordPress Plugin Boilerplate with opinionated setup. "},"features":{"zh":["自动化提取翻译字符串生成POT文件","自动更新现有PO翻译文件","支持npm build脚本构建流程","基于composer的i18n命令执行","标准化语言文件目录结构","简化多语言插件维护工作流"],"ja":["翻訳文字列の自動抽出とPOTファイル生成","既存PO翻訳ファイルの自動更新","npm buildスクリプトのビルドプロセス対応","composerベースのi18nコマンド実行","標準化された言語ファイルディレクトリ構造","多言語プラグインメンテナンスの効率化"],"ko":["번역 문자열 자동 추출 및 POT 파일 생성","기존 PO 번역 파일 자동 업데이트","npm build 스크립트 빌드 프로세스 지원","composer 기반 i18n 명령어 실행","표준화된 언어 파일 디렉토리 구조","다국어 플러그인 유지보수 워크플로우 간소화"],"es":["Extracción de cadenas para traducir","Actualización de archivos de traducción","Compilación de archivos de traducción","Validación de configuración","Generación de archivos .pot y .po","Integración con npm y Composer"],"fr":["Extraction de chaînes à traduire","Mise à jour des fichiers de traduction","Compilation des fichiers de traduction","Validation de la configuration","Génération de fichiers .pot et .po","Intégration avec npm et Composer"],"de":["Extraktion von Zeichenfolgen zur Übersetzung","Aktualisierung von Übersetzungsdateien","Kompilierung von Übersetzungsdateien","Validierung der Konfiguration","Generierung von .pot- und .po-Dateien","Integration mit npm und Composer"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de internacionalização","Extração de strings","Tradução de arquivos","Compilação de arquivos de tradução","Validação de configuração","Scripts de build"],"ru":["Управление интернационализацией","Извлечение строк","Перевод файлов","Компиляция файлов перевода","Валидация настройки","Скрипты сборки"],"ar":["إدارة التدويل","استخراج السلاسل","ترجمة الملفات","تجميع ملفات الترجمة","التحقق من الإعداد","스크립تات البناء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["wordpress插件翻译","i18n国际化工具","po文件更新","pot文件生成","wordpress多语言","composer i18n命令","npm构建脚本","翻译文件编译"],"ja":["wordpressプラグイン翻訳","i18n国際化ツール","poファイル更新","potファイル生成","wordpress多言語","composer i18nコマンド","npmビルドスクリプト","翻訳ファイルコンパイル"],"ko":["wordpress 플러그인 번역","i18n 국제화 도구","po 파일 업데이트","pot 파일 생성","wordpress 다국어","composer i18n 명령어","npm 빌드 스크립트","번역 파일 컴파일"],"es":["plugin de WordPress","internacionalización","traducciones","boilerplate","npm","Composer","i18n","wordpress plugin translations","wordpress internacionalización"],"fr":["plugin WordPress","internationalisation","traductions","boilerplate","npm","Composer","i18n","wordpress plugin traductions","wordpress internationalisation"],"de":["WordPress-Plugin","Internationalisierung","Übersetzungen","Boilerplate","npm","Composer","i18n","wordpress plugin übersetzungen","wordpress internationalisierung"],"pt":["plugin wordpress","traduções","internacionalização","i18n","wordpress plugin boilerplate","desenvolvimento de plugin","gerenciamento de traduções"],"ru":["плагин wordpress","переводы","интернационализация","i18n","wordpress плагин boilerplate","разработка плагина","управление переводами"],"ar":["برنامج مساعد ووردبريس","ترجمات","تدويل","i18n","قالب برنامج مساعد ووردبريس","تطوير برنامج مساعد","إدارة الترجمات"]}},"owner":"JUVOJustin","repo":"wordpress-plugin-boilerplate","repoPath":"JUVOJustin/wordpress-plugin-boilerplate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plugin-translations-update","description":"Update or create WordPress plugin translations. Use when working with i18n, translations, .po/.pot files, or when user asks to translate plugin strings into specific languages.","bodyPreview":"# WordPress Plugin Translations\n\nManage internationalization (i18n) for WordPress plugins by extracting, translating, and compiling translation files.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Build scripts**: Build the scripts using `npm run build`\n2. **Validate setup**: Read `languages/` to check existing translation files\n3. **Extract strings**: Run `composer run i18n:extract` to generate `.pot` and update `.po` files\n4. **Translate**: Based on arguments:\n   - **No arguments**: Update existing `.po` files with miss","body":"# WordPress Plugin Translations\n\nManage internationalization (i18n) for WordPress plugins by extracting, translating, and compiling translation files.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Build scripts**: Build the scripts using `npm run build`\n2. **Validate setup**: Read `languages/` to check existing translation files\n3. **Extract strings**: Run `composer run i18n:extract` to generate `.pot` and update `.po` files\n4. **Translate**: Based on arguments:\n   - **No arguments**: Update existing `.po` files with missing translations. Check the files for untranslated strings and provide translations.\n   - **With languages** (e.g., `de_DE fr_FR`): Create `.po` files for specified languages if missing, then translate\n5. **Compile**: Run `composer run i18n:compile` to generate `.mo`, `.json`, and `.php` files\n\n## Translation Guidelines\n\n- Use one subtask/subagent per `.po` file for parallel processing\n- Ensure textdomain matches the one defined in main plugin file\n- Requires `wp-cli` and a working WordPress installation\n\n## Reference\n\nFor detailed i18n documentation, see [i18n](../../../docs/i18n.mdx).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:42:17.394Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for WordPress Development Agents requiring streamlined internationalization and translation management for plugins.","zh":"Ideal for WordPress Development Agents requiring streamlined internationalization and translation management for plugins.","ja":"Ideal for WordPress Development Agents requiring streamlined internationalization and translation management for plugins.","ko":"Ideal for WordPress Development Agents requiring streamlined internationalization and translation management for plugins.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de WordPress que requieren una internacionalización y gestión de traducciones de plugins optimizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement WordPress nécessitant une internationalisation et une gestion de traduction de plugins rationalisées.","de":"Ideal für WordPress-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Internationalisierung und Übersetzungsbereitstellung für Plugins benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do WordPress que exigem internacionalização e gerenciamento de traduções de plugins de forma otimizada.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке WordPress, требующих упрощенного управления интернационализацией и переводами плагинов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير ووردبريس الذي يتطلب تحسينًا لتنسيق الترجمة وتحديث الإدارة الدولية للبرامج الإضافية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate WordPress plugin translations by extracting, translating, and compiling translation files using composer and npm, leveraging .pot and .po files for seamless i18n integration.","zh":"Empowers agents to automate WordPress plugin translations by extracting, translating, and compiling translation files using composer and npm, leveraging .pot and .po files for seamless i18n integration.","ja":"Empowers agents to automate WordPress plugin translations by extracting, translating, and compiling translation files using composer and npm, leveraging .pot and .po files for seamless i18n integration.","ko":"Empowers agents to automate WordPress plugin translations by extracting, translating, and compiling translation files using composer and npm, leveraging .pot and .po files for seamless i18n integration.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las traducciones de plugins de WordPress extrayendo, traduciendo y compilando archivos de traducción utilizando composer y npm, aprovechando los archivos .pot y .po para una integración i18n sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les traductions de plugins WordPress en extrayant, traduisant et compilant des fichiers de traduction à l''aide de composer et npm, en exploitant les fichiers .pot et .po pour une intégration i18n transparente.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, WordPress-Plugin-Übersetzungen zu automatisieren, indem sie Übersetzungsdateien mithilfe von composer und npm extrahieren, übersetzen und compilieren und auf .pot- und .po-Dateien für eine nahtlose i18n-Integration setzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatem as traduções de plugins do WordPress, extrair, traduzir e compilar arquivos de tradução usando o composer e o npm, aproveitando arquivos .pot e .po para uma integração i18n perfeita.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать переводы плагинов WordPress, извлекая, переводя и компилируя файлы перевода с помощью composer и npm, используя файлы .pot и .po для бесшовной интеграции i18n.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على توفير ترجمات البرامج الإضافية لوردبريس عن طريق استخراج وترجمة وتجميع ملفات الترجمة باستخدام المنجم و npm، واستخدام ملفات .pot و .po من أجل دمج i18n دون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating translation file updates for WordPress plugins","Generating and compiling .pot and .po files for internationalization","Validating and updating existing translation setups in WordPress plugins"],"zh":["Automating translation file updates for WordPress plugins","Generating and compiling .pot and .po files for internationalization","Validating and updating existing translation setups in WordPress plugins"],"ja":["Automating translation file updates for WordPress plugins","Generating and compiling .pot and .po files for internationalization","Validating and updating existing translation setups in WordPress plugins"],"ko":["Automating translation file updates for WordPress plugins","Generating and compiling .pot and .po files for internationalization","Validating and updating existing translation setups in WordPress plugins"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de archivos de traducción para plugins de WordPress","Generar y compilar archivos .pot y .po para la internacionalización","Validar y actualizar configuraciones de traducción existentes en plugins de WordPress"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour des fichiers de traduction pour les plugins WordPress","Générer et compiler les fichiers .pot et .po pour l''internationalisation","Valider et mettre à jour les configurations de traduction existantes dans les plugins WordPress"],"de":["Automatisieren von Updates für Übersetzungsdateien von WordPress-Plugins","Erzeugen und Compilieren von .pot- und .po-Dateien für die Internationalisierung","Überprüfen und Aktualisieren von bestehenden Übersetzungskonfigurationen in WordPress-Plugins"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de arquivos de tradução para plugins do WordPress","Gerar e compilar arquivos .pot e .po para internacionalização","Validar e atualizar configurações de tradução existentes em plugins do WordPress"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления файлов перевода для плагинов WordPress","Генерировать и компилировать файлы .pot и .po для интернационализации","Проверять и обновлять существующие настройки перевода в плагинах WordPress"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات ملفات الترجمة للبرامج الإضافية لوردبريس","إنتاج وتجميع ملفات .pot و .po من أجل التحديث الدولي","التحقق من صحة وإعادة تحديث إعدادات الترجمة الحالية في البرامج الإضافية لوردبريس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm and composer installation","WordPress plugin development environment necessary","Dependent on languages/ directory setup for translation files"],"zh":["Requires npm and composer installation","WordPress plugin development environment necessary","Dependent on languages/ directory setup for translation files"],"ja":["Requires npm and composer installation","WordPress plugin development environment necessary","Dependent on languages/ directory setup for translation files"],"ko":["Requires npm and composer installation","WordPress plugin development environment necessary","Dependent on languages/ directory setup for translation files"],"es":["Requiere instalación de npm y composer","Entorno de desarrollo de plugins de WordPress necesario","Dependiente de la configuración del directorio de lenguajes para archivos de traducción"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm et composer","Environnement de développement de plugins WordPress nécessaire","Dépend de la configuration du répertoire de langues pour les fichiers de traduction"],"de":["Benötigt npm- und composer-Installation","WordPress-Plugin-Entwicklungsumgebung erforderlich","Abhängig von der Einrichtung des Sprachverzeichnisses für Übersetzungsdateien"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do npm e do composer","Ambiente de desenvolvimento de plugins do WordPress necessário","Dependente da configuração do diretório languages/ para arquivos de tradução"],"ru":["Требует установки npm и composer","Необходимо окружение для разработки плагинов WordPress","Зависит от настройки директории languages/ для файлов перевода"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm و المنجم","بيئة تطوير البرامج الإضافية لوردبريس ضرورية","يعتمد على إعداد دليل languages/ لملفات الترجمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
