eure compréhension des demandes","Facilite la communication entre les équipes"],"de":["Klärt wichtige Details in Entwicklungsprojekten","Vermeidet falsche Arbeiten","Optimiert die Effizienz in der Entwicklung","Ermöglicht ein besseres Verständnis der Anfragen","Erleichtert die Kommunikation zwischen Teams"],"pt":["Esclarece requisições ambíguas","Evita trabalhos errados","Melhora a precisão","Reduz riscos","Otimiza o processo de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Уточняет неоднозначные запросы","Избегает неправильной работы","Повышает точность","Снижает риски","Оптимизирует процесс разработки"],"ar":["توضيح الطلبات الغامضة","تجنب الأخطاء","تحسين الدقة","تقليل المخاطر","تحسين عملية التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ask Questions If Underspecified","SettleMint agent","开发工具","请求明确","开发效率","错误避免"],"ja":["Ask Questions If Underspecified","SettleMint エージェント","開発ツール","リクエスト明確化","開発効率","誤った作業回避"],"ko":["Ask Questions If Underspecified","SettleMint 에이전트","개발자 툴","요청 명확화","개발 효율성","잘못된 작업 피하기"],"es":["desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","clarificación de solicitudes","eficiencia en el desarrollo","comunicación en equipo","gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["développement de logiciels","outils de développement","clarification des demandes","efficacité dans le développement","communication en équipe","gestion de projets"],"de":["Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Klärung von Anfragen","Effizienz in der Entwicklung","Teamkommunikation","Projektmanagement"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","requisições ambíguas","esclarecimento de detalhes","evitar trabalhos errados","melhorar precisão","otimizar processo de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","неоднозначные запросы","уточнение деталей","избегать неправильной работы","повысить точность","оптимизировать процесс разработки"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","الطلبات الغامضة","توضيح التفاصيل","تجنب الأخطاء","تحسين الدقة","تحسين عملية التطوير"]}},"owner":"settlemint","repo":"agent-marketplace","repoPath":"settlemint/agent-marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ask-questions-if-underspecified","description":"Clarify requirements before implementing. Use when serious doubts araise.","bodyPreview":"# Ask Questions If Underspecified\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when a request has multiple plausible interpretations or key details (objective, scope, constraints, environment, or safety) are unclear.\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\nDo not use this skill when the request is already clear, or when a quick, low-risk discovery read can answer the missing details.\n\n## Goal\n\nAsk the minimum set of clarifying questions needed to avoid wrong work; do not start implementing until the must-have questions are ans","body":"# Ask Questions If Underspecified\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when a request has multiple plausible interpretations or key details (objective, scope, constraints, environment, or safety) are unclear.\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\nDo not use this skill when the request is already clear, or when a quick, low-risk discovery read can answer the missing details.\n\n## Goal\n\nAsk the minimum set of clarifying questions needed to avoid wrong work; do not start implementing until the must-have questions are answered (or the user explicitly approves proceeding with stated assumptions).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Decide whether the request is underspecified\n\nTreat a request as underspecified if after exploring how to perform the work, some or all of the following are not clear:\n- Define the objective (what should change vs stay the same)\n- Define \"done\" (acceptance criteria, examples, edge cases)\n- Define scope (which files/components/users are in/out)\n- Define constraints (compatibility, performance, style, deps, time)\n- Identify environment (language/runtime versions, OS, build/test runner)\n- Clarify safety/reversibility (data migration, rollout/rollback, risk)\n\nIf multiple plausible interpretations exist, assume it is underspecified.\n\n### 2) Ask must-have questions first (keep it small)\n\nAsk 1-5 questions in the first pass. Prefer questions that eliminate whole branches of work.\n\nMake questions easy to answer:\n- Optimize for scannability (short, numbered questions; avoid paragraphs)\n- Offer multiple-choice options when possible\n- Suggest reasonable defaults when appropriate (mark them clearly as the default/recommended choice; bold the recommended choice in the list, or if you present options in a code block, put a bold \"Recommended\" line immediately above the block and also tag defaults inside the block)\n- Include a fast-path response (e.g., reply `defaults` to accept all recommended/default choices)\n- Include a low-friction \"not sure\" option when helpful (e.g., \"Not sure - use default\")\n- Separate \"Need to know\" from \"Nice to know\" if that reduces friction\n- Structure options so the user can respond with compact decisions (e.g., `1b 2a 3c`); restate the chosen options in plain language to confirm\n\n### 3) Pause before acting\n\nUntil must-have answers arrive:\n- Do not run commands, edit files, or produce a detailed plan that depends on unknowns\n- Do perform a clearly labeled, low-risk discovery step only if it does not commit you to a direction (e.g., inspect repo structure, read relevant config files)\n\nIf the user explicitly asks you to proceed without answers:\n- State your assumptions as a short numbered list\n- Ask for confirmation; proceed only after they confirm or correct them\n\n### 4) Confirm interpretation, then proceed\n\nOnce you have answers, restate the requirements in 1-3 sentences (including key constraints and what success looks like), then start work.\n\n## Question templates\n\n- \"Before I start, I need: (1) ..., (2) ..., (3) .... If you don''t care about (2), I will assume ....\"\n- \"Which of these should it be? A) ... B) ... C) ... (pick one)\"\n- \"What would you consider ''done''? For example: ...\"\n- \"Any constraints I must follow (versions, performance, style, deps)? If none, I will target the existing project defaults.\"\n- Use numbered questions with lettered options and a clear reply format\n\n```text\n1) Scope?\na) Minimal change (default)\nb) Refactor while touching the area\nc) Not sure - use default\n2) Compatibility target?\na) Current project defaults (default)\nb) Also support older versions: <specify>\nc) Not sure - use default\n\nReply with: defaults (or 1a 2a)\n```\n\n## Anti-patterns\n\n- Don''t ask questions you can answer with a quick, low-risk discovery read (e.g., configs, existing patterns, docs).\n- Don''t ask open-ended questions if a tight multiple-choice or yes/no would eliminate ambiguity faster.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:42:48.901Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced clarification capabilities to handle underspecified requests.","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的对话式代理，需要高级的澄清能力来处理不明确的请求。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの会話エージェントに適しており、未指定のリクエストを処理するための高度な明確化機能が必要です。","ko":"클라우드 코드 및 오토지피티와 같은 대화형 에이전트에 적합하며, 불명확한 요청을 처리하기 위한 고급澄명 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de conversación como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades de aclaración avanzadas para manejar solicitudes poco especificadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de conversation comme Claude Code et AutoGPT qui nécessitent des capacités de clarification avancées pour gérer les demandes peu spécifiées.","de":"Ideal für Konversationsagenten wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte Klärungsfähigkeiten benötigen, um unvollständig spezifizierte Anfragen zu bearbeiten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conversação como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de esclarecimento para lidar com solicitações subespecificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разговорных агентов, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым требуются расширенные возможности уточнения для обработки неоднозначных запросов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحادثين مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات توضيح متقدمة لمعالجة الطلبات غير المحددة بدقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently resolve ambiguity by asking targeted, clarifying questions, ensuring accurate objective, scope, constraints, environment, and safety details are obtained through protocols like SettleMint agent orchestration, thus preventing wrong work.","zh":"赋予代理高效地通过提出有针对性的、澄清的问题来解决模糊性，确保通过诸如 SettleMint 代理编排等协议获取准确的目标、范围、约束、环境和安全细节，从而防止错误的工作。","ja":"エージェントがターゲットを絞った明確化の質問を通じて曖昧性を効率的に解決できるようにし、SettleMint エージェントのオーケストレーションなどのプロトコルを通じて、正確な目的、範囲、制約、環境、および安全性の詳細を取得することで、誤った作業を防止します。","ko":"에이전트가 효율적으로 불명확성을 해결할 수 있도록 해주어, 목적, 범위, 제약, 환경 및 안전성의 세부 정보를 얻기 위한 프로토콜인 SettleMint 에이전트 오케스트레이션과 같은 프로토콜을 통해, 정확한 목표 및 세부 정보를 얻을 수 있도록 하여, 잘못된 작업을 방지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes resolver eficientemente la ambigüedad formulando preguntas dirigidas y aclaratorias, asegurando que se obtengan detalles precisos sobre el objetivo, el alcance, las restricciones, el entorno y la seguridad a través de protocolos como la orquestación de agentes SettleMint, lo que evita un trabajo incorrecto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre efficacement l''ambiguïté en posant des questions ciblées et clarificatrices, garantissant que des détails précis sur l''objectif, la portée, les contraintes, l''environnement et la sécurité soient obtenus grâce à des protocoles tels que l''orchestration d''agents SettleMint, ce qui prévient un travail incorrect.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Ambiguitäten effizient durch gezielte und klärende Fragen zu lösen, sicherzustellen, dass genaue Details zu Ziel, Umfang, Einschränkungen, Umgebung und Sicherheit durch Protokolle wie die SettleMint-Agenten-Orchestrierung erhalten werden, wodurch falsche Arbeit verhindert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resolver a ambiguidade de forma eficiente, formulando perguntas clarificadoras direcionadas, garantindo que sejam obtidos detalhes precisos sobre objetivo, escopo, restrições, ambiente e segurança por meio de protocolos como a orquestração de agentes SettleMint, evitando assim trabalhos errados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно разрешать неоднозначности, задавая целевые, уточняющие вопросы, обеспечивая точное получение деталей об объекте, объеме, ограничениях, среде и безопасности посредством протоколов, таких как оркестровка агентов SettleMint, тем самым предотвращая неправильную работу.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من حل الغموض بفعالية من خلال طرح أسئلة توضيحية محددة، مما يضمن الحصول على تفاصيل دقيقة حول الهدف والنطاق والقيود والبيئة والمعلومات المتعلقة بالسلامة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل تنسيق وكلاء SettleMint، وبالتالي منع العمل الخاطئ."},"useCases":{"en":["Clarifying user requests with multiple plausible interpretations","Gathering key details for task implementation","Avoiding incorrect task execution due to unclear objectives or constraints"],"zh":["澄清具有多种合理解释的用户请求","收集任务实现的关键细节","避免由于不明确的目标或约束而导致的错误任务执行"],"ja":["複数の妥当な解釈を持つユーザーのリクエストを明確化する","タスクの実装に必要な重要な詳細を収集する","不明確な目的や制約による不正確なタスクの実行を回避する"],"ko":["여러 가지 가능한 해석을 가진 사용자 요청을澄명하는 것","작업 구현을 위한 주요 세부 정보 수집","불분명한 목표 또는 제약 조건으로 인한 잘못된 작업 실행을 피하는 것"],"es":["Aclarar solicitudes de usuario con múltiples interpretaciones plausibles","Recopilar detalles clave para la implementación de tareas","Evitar la ejecución incorrecta de tareas debido a objetivos o restricciones poco claros"],"fr":["Clarifier les demandes des utilisateurs ayant plusieurs interprétations plausibles","Recueillir des détails clés pour la mise en œuvre des tâches","Éviter l''exécution incorrecte des tâches en raison d''objectifs ou de contraintes peu clairs"],"de":["Benutzeranfragen mit mehreren plausiblen Interpretationen klären","Schlüsseldaten für die Aufgabenimplementierung sammeln","Falsche Aufgabenausführung aufgrund unklarer Ziele oder Einschränkungen vermeiden"],"pt":["Esclarecer solicitações de usuário com múltiplas interpretações plausíveis","Coletar detalhes-chave para implementação de tarefas","Evitar execução de tarefas incorretas devido a objetivos ou restrições não claros"],"ru":["Уточнение запросов пользователей с несколькими правдоподобными интерпретациями","Сбор ключевых деталей для реализации задач","Избежание неправильного выполнения задач из-за неясных целей или ограничений"],"ar":["توضيح طلبات المستخدمين ذات التفسيرات المتعددة والمقنعة","جمع تفاصيل رئيسية لتنفيذ المهام","تجنب تنفيذ المهام بشكل غير صحيح بسبب أهداف أو قيود غير واضحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Should not be used when requests are already clear","Not applicable for quick, low-risk discovery reads"],"zh":["不应在请求已经明确时使用","不适用于快速、低风险的发现读取"],"ja":["リクエストがすでに明確な場合には使用しないでください","迅速で低リスクの発見読み取りには適用されません"],"ko":["요청이 이미 명확한 경우 사용하지 않아야 합니다","빠른 저위험도 검색 읽기에 적용되지 않습니다"],"es":["No debe utilizarse cuando las solicitudes ya estén claras","No es aplicable para lecturas de descubrimiento rápidas y de bajo riesgo"],"fr":["Ne doit pas être utilisé lorsque les demandes sont déjà claires","N''est pas applicable pour les lectures de découverte rapides et à faible risque"],"de":["Sollte nicht verwendet werden, wenn die Anfragen bereits klar sind","Nicht anwendbar für schnelle, risikoarme Entdeckungslektüren"],"pt":["Não deve ser usado quando as solicitações já estão claras","Não se aplica a leituras de descoberta rápida e de baixo risco"],"ru":["Не следует использовать, когда запросы уже ясны","Не применимо для быстрых, низкорисковых исследований"],"ar":["لا ينبغي استخدامه عندما تكون الطلبات واضحة بالفعل","لا يتم تطبيقه على عمليات اكتشاف سريعة ومنخفضة المخاطر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
