ón de agentes de IA con comandos de tubería de estilo Unix","Adaptación de cualquier agente de CLI con esquemas personalizados","Captura de trayectorias y métricas de paso","Comparación de múltiples ejecuciones","No requiere código, solo define un esquema JSON"],"fr":["Évaluation des agents d''IA avec des commandes de pipeline de style Unix","Adaptation de n''importe quel agent CLI avec des schémas personnalisés","Capture de trajectoires et de métriques de passage","Comparaison de plusieurs exécutions","Nécessite aucun code, définissez simplement un schéma JSON"],"de":["Bewertung von KI-Agents mit Unix-Style-Pipeline-Befehlen","Anpassung jedes CLI-Agents mit benutzerdefinierten Schemata","Aufzeichnung von Trajectorien und Schrittmetriken","Vergleich von mehreren Ausführungen","Benötigt keinen Code, definieren Sie einfach ein JSON-Schema"],"pt":["Avaliação de agentes CLI com comandos de pipeline Unix-style","Captura de trajectória e métricas de desempenho","Criação de novos esquemas sem necessidade de codificação","Comparação de múltiplas execuções","Integração com a API do Anthropics"],"ru":["Оценка агентов CLI с командами Unix-style","Захват траектории и метрики производительности","Создание новых схем без необходимости кодирования","Сравнение нескольких запусков","Интеграция с API Anthropics"],"ar":["تقييم عميل CLI مع أوامر أنابيب Unix-style","التقاط المسار وقياس الأداء","إنشاء مخططات جديدة دون الحاجة إلى كتابة الكود","مقارنة عدة تشغيل","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Anthropics"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Headless 适配器","CLI 代理评估","Unix 风格的管道命令","JSON 模式","无代码开发","AI 代理评估"],"ja":["ヘッドレスアダプター","CLIエージェント評価","Unixスタイルのパイプラインコマンド","JSONスキーマ","コード不要","AIエージェント評価"],"ko":["헤드리스 어댑터","CLI 에이전트 평가","유닉스 스타일의 파이프라인 명령","JSON 스키마","코드 없음","AI 에이전트 평가"],"es":["adaptadores headless","agentes de IA","comandos de tubería de estilo Unix","esquemas personalizados","CLI","evaluación de agentes","captura de trayectorias","métricas de paso","comparación de ejecuciones"],"fr":["adaptateurs headless","agents d''IA","commandes de pipeline de style Unix","schémas personnalisés","CLI","évaluation des agents","capture de trajectoires","métriques de passage","comparaison d''exécutions"],"de":["Headless-Adapter","KI-Agents","Unix-Style-Pipeline-Befehle","benutzerdefinierte Schemata","CLI","Bewertung von Agents","Aufzeichnung von Trajectorien","Schrittmetriken","Vergleich von Ausführungen"],"pt":["adaptadores headless","agentes CLI","comandos de pipeline Unix-style","captura de trajectória","métricas de desempenho","desenvolvimento de software","API do Anthropics"],"ru":["бес头ые адаптеры","агенты CLI","команды Unix-style","захват траектории","метрики производительности","разработка программного обеспечения","API Anthropics"],"ar":["الموصلات بدون رأس","عميل CLI","أوامر أنابيب Unix-style","التقاط المسار","قياس الأداء","تطوير البرمجيات","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Anthropics"]}},"owner":"plaited","repo":"agent-eval-harness","repoPath":"plaited/agent-eval-harness","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"headless-adapters","description":"Discover, create, and validate headless adapters for agent integration. Includes scaffolding tools and schema-driven compliance testing.","bodyPreview":"# Headless Adapters\n\n## Purpose\n\nSchema-driven adapter for headless CLI agents. **No code required** - just define a JSON schema describing how to interact with the CLI.\n\n| Use Case | Tool |\n|----------|------|\n| Wrap headless CLI agent | `headless` command |\n| Create new schemas | [Schema Creation Guide](references/schema-creation-guide.md) |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Check if a schema exists** in [schemas/](schemas/)\n2. **Run the adapter:**\n   ```bash\n   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... bunx @plaited/agent-e","body":"# Headless Adapters\n\n## Purpose\n\nSchema-driven adapter for headless CLI agents. **No code required** - just define a JSON schema describing how to interact with the CLI.\n\n| Use Case | Tool |\n|----------|------|\n| Wrap headless CLI agent | `headless` command |\n| Create new schemas | [Schema Creation Guide](references/schema-creation-guide.md) |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Check if a schema exists** in [schemas/](schemas/)\n2. **Run the adapter:**\n   ```bash\n   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... bunx @plaited/agent-eval-harness headless --schema .claude/skills/headless-adapters/schemas/claude-headless.json\n   ```\n\n## CLI Commands\n\n### headless\n\nSchema-driven adapter for ANY headless CLI agent.\n\n```bash\nbunx @plaited/agent-eval-harness headless --schema <path>\n```\n\n**Options:**\n| Flag | Description | Required |\n|------|-------------|----------|\n| `-s, --schema` | Path to adapter schema (JSON) | Yes |\n\n**Schema Format:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"my-agent\",\n  \"command\": [\"my-agent-cli\"],\n  \"sessionMode\": \"stream\",\n  \"prompt\": { \"flag\": \"-p\" },\n  \"output\": { \"flag\": \"--output-format\", \"value\": \"stream-json\" },\n  \"autoApprove\": [\"--allow-all\"],\n  \"outputEvents\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": { \"path\": \"$.type\", \"value\": \"message\" },\n      \"emitAs\": \"message\",\n      \"extract\": { \"content\": \"$.text\" }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"result\": {\n    \"matchPath\": \"$.type\",\n    \"matchValue\": \"result\",\n    \"contentPath\": \"$.content\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Session Modes:**\n\n| Mode | Description | Use When |\n|------|-------------|----------|\n| `stream` | Keep process alive, multi-turn via stdin | CLI supports session resume |\n| `iterative` | New process per turn, accumulate history | CLI is stateless |\n\n## Pre-built Schemas\n\nTested schemas are available in [schemas/](schemas/):\n\n| Schema | Agent | Mode | Auth Env Var | Status |\n|--------|-------|------|--------------|--------|\n| `claude-headless.json` | Claude Code | stream | `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | Tested |\n| `gemini-headless.json` | Gemini CLI | iterative | `GEMINI_API_KEY` | Tested |\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n# Claude Code\nANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... bunx @plaited/agent-eval-harness headless --schema .claude/skills/headless-adapters/schemas/claude-headless.json\n\n# Gemini CLI\nGEMINI_API_KEY=... bunx @plaited/agent-eval-harness headless --schema .claude/skills/headless-adapters/schemas/gemini-headless.json\n```\n\n## Creating a Schema\n\n1. Explore the CLI''s `--help` to identify prompt, output, and auto-approve flags\n2. Capture sample JSON output from the CLI\n3. Map JSONPath patterns to output events\n4. Create schema file based on an existing template\n5. Test with `headless` command\n\nSee [Schema Creation Guide](references/schema-creation-guide.md) for the complete workflow.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Likely Cause | Solution |\n|-------|--------------|----------|\n| Tool calls not captured | JSONPath not iterating arrays | Use `[*]` wildcard syntax - [see guide](references/troubleshooting-guide.md#tool-calls-not-appearing) |\n| \"unexpected argument\" error | Stdin mode misconfigured | Use `stdin: true` - [see guide](references/troubleshooting-guide.md#stdin-mode-issues) |\n| 401 Authentication errors | API key not properly configured | Set the correct API key environment variable (see Pre-built Schemas table) |\n| Timeout on prompt | JSONPath not matching | Capture raw CLI output, verify paths - [see guide](references/troubleshooting-guide.md#jsonpath-debugging) |\n| Empty responses | Content extraction failing | Check extract paths - [see guide](references/troubleshooting-guide.md#output-event-matching) |\n\n**Complete troubleshooting documentation:** [Troubleshooting Guide](references/troubleshooting-guide.md)\n\n## External Resources\n\n- **AgentSkills Spec**: [agentskills.io](https://agentskills.io)\n\n## Related\n\n- **[agent-eval-harness skill](../agent-eval-harness/SKILL.md)** - Running evaluations against adapters\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:42:48.843Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI-based AI Agents needing Unix-style pipeline command evaluation and schema-driven adapter integration.","zh":"非常适合需要Unix样式管道命令评估和基于模式的适配器集成的CLI基于AI代理。","ja":"Unixスタイルのパイプラインコマンド評価とスキーマ駆動のアダプタ統合を必要とするCLIベースのAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"유닉스 스타일 파이프라인 명령 평가 및 스키마 기반 어댑터 통합이 필요한 CLI 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en CLI que necesitan evaluación de comandos de tubería de estilo Unix y integración de adaptadores dirigida por esquemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur CLI nécessitant une évaluation de commandes de pipeline de style Unix et une intégration d''adaptateurs pilotée par schéma.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-basierte KI-Agents, die eine Unix-Style-Pipeline-Befehlsauswertung und eine schemagetriebene Adapterintegration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em CLI que necessitam de avaliação de comandos de pipeline de estilo Unix e integração de adaptadores dirigida por esquema.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе CLI, которым необходима оценка команд 管道 в стиле Unix и интеграция адаптеров на основе схемы.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تعتمد على واجهة سطر الأوامر وتحتاج إلى تقييم أوامر أنابيب بنمط يونكس وتكامل موفر بقيادة مخطط"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly interact with headless CLI agents using JSON schema definitions, enabling trajectory capture, pass@k metrics, and multi-run comparison through Unix-style pipeline commands.","zh":"赋予代理无缝地与无头CLI代理交互，使用JSON模式定义，实现轨迹捕获、传递@k指标和多次运行比较，通过Unix样式管道命令。","ja":"JSONスキーマ定義を使用して、ヘッドレスCLIエージェントとのシームレスなやりとりを可能にし、軌跡のキャプチャ、パス@kメトリクス、マルチランの比較を実現します。","ko":"JSON 스키마 정의를 사용하여 헤드리스 CLI 에이전트와의 무결점 상호 작용을 가능하게 하여 경로 캡처, 전달 @k 메트릭 및 멀티런 비교를 유닉스 스타일 파이프라인 명령을 통해 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar de forma transparente con agentes CLI sin interfaz gráfica utilizando definiciones de esquema JSON, lo que permite la captura de trayectorias, métricas pass@k y comparación de varias ejecuciones a través de comandos de tubería de estilo Unix.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir de manière transparente avec les agents CLI sans interface graphique en utilisant des définitions de schéma JSON, ce qui permet la capture de trajectoires, les métriques pass@k et la comparaison de plusieurs exécutions via des commandes de pipeline de style Unix.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, nahtlos mit headless CLI-Agents unter Verwendung von JSON-Schemadefinitionen zu interagieren, wodurch die Erfassung von Traektorien, Pass@k-Metriken und der Vergleich mehrerer Läufe durch Unix-Style-Pipeline-Befehle ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir sem problemas com agentes CLI headless usando definições de esquema JSON, permitindo a captura de trajetória, métricas de pass@k e comparação de várias execuções por meio de comandos de pipeline de estilo Unix.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовного взаимодействия с безголовыми агентами CLI с использованием определений схемы JSON, что позволяет захватить траекторию, метрики pass@k и сравнить несколько запусков агентов CLI с помощью команд管道 в стиле Unix.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التفاعل بسلاسة مع وكلاء واجهة سطر الأوامر بدون رأس باستخدام تعريفات مخطط JSON، مما يتيح.capture مسار، مقاييس pass@k ومقارنة تشغيل متعدد لوكلاء واجهة سطر الأوامر من خلال أوامر الأنابيب بنمط يونكس"},"useCases":{"en":["Evaluating AI agents with custom schema-driven adapters","Capturing and analyzing trajectory data from CLI agents","Comparing performance metrics across multiple runs of CLI agents"],"zh":["使用自定义模式驱动适配器评估AI代理","从CLI代理捕获和分析轨迹数据","比较多次CLI代理运行的性能指标"],"ja":["カスタムスキーマ駆動アダプタを使用したAIエージェントの評価","CLIエージェントからの軌跡データのキャプチャと分析","CLIエージェントの複数回の実行のパフォーマンスメトリクスの比較"],"ko":["사용자 지정 스키마 기반 어댑터를 사용한 AI 에이전트 평가","CLI 에이전트에서 트레일 데이터를 캡처 및 분석","CLI 에이전트의 여러 번의 실행의 성능 메트릭 비교"],"es":["Evaluación de agentes de IA con adaptadores personalizados dirigidos por esquemas","Captura y análisis de datos de trayectoria de agentes CLI","Comparación de métricas de rendimiento en varias ejecuciones de agentes CLI"],"fr":["Évaluation d''agents d''IA avec des adaptateurs personnalisés pilotés par schéma","Capture et analyse de données de trajectoire d''agents CLI","Comparaison de métriques de performance sur plusieurs exécutions d''agents CLI"],"de":["Bewertung von KI-Agents mit benutzerdefinierten schemagetriebenen Adaptern","Erfassung und Analyse von Traektoriendaten von CLI-Agents","Vergleich von Leistungsmetriken über mehrere Läufe von CLI-Agents"],"pt":["Avaliando agentes de IA com adaptadores personalizados dirigidos por esquema","Capturando e analisando dados de trajetória de agentes CLI","Comparando métricas de desempenho em várias execuções de agentes CLI"],"ru":["Оценка агентов ИИ с использованием адаптеров на основе схемы","Захват и анализ данных траектории агентов CLI","Сравнение метрик производительности при нескольких запусках агентов CLI"],"ar":["تقييم عمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام موفر بقيادة مخطط مخصص","التقاط وتحليل بيانات المسار من وكلاء واجهة سطر الأوامر","مقارنة مقاييس الأداء عبر عمليات تشغيل متعددة لوكلاء واجهة سطر الأوامر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JSON schema definition for CLI agent interaction","Limited to Unix-style pipeline command compatibility"],"zh":["需要JSON模式定义与CLI代理交互","仅限Unix样式管道命令兼容性"],"ja":["CLIエージェントとのやりとりにJSONスキーマ定義が必要","Unixスタイルのパイプラインコマンドとの互換性のみ"],"ko":["CLI 에이전트와 상호 작용하기 위한 JSON 스키마 정의가 필요","유닉스 스타일 파이프라인 명령과 호환성만"],"es":["Requiere definición de esquema JSON para la interacción con agentes CLI","Limitado a la compatibilidad de comandos de tubería de estilo Unix"],"fr":["Nécessite une définition de schéma JSON pour l''interaction avec les agents CLI","Limité à la compatibilité des commandes de pipeline de style Unix"],"de":["Benötigt eine JSON-Schemadefinition für die Interaktion mit CLI-Agents","Begrenzt auf die Kompatibilität von Unix-Style-Pipeline-Befehlen"],"pt":["Exige definição de esquema JSON para interação com agente CLI","Limitado à compatibilidade de comandos de pipeline de estilo Unix"],"ru":["Требует определения схемы JSON для взаимодействия с агентом CLI","Ограничен совместимостью команд管道 в стиле Unix"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريف مخطط JSON للتفاعل مع وكيل واجهة سطر الأوامر","محدود بالتوافق مع أوامر الأنابيب بنمط يونكس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('specture-system/specture/specture', 'community', 'specture-system', 'specture', 'specture-system/specture', 'specture', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z', '2026-02-18T09:42:08.825Z', NULL, '{"id":"specture-system/specture/specture","name":"specture","description":{"zh":"Specture是一个基于规格的软件开发系统，帮助开发者高效管理软件架构","ja":"Spectureは仕様駆動のソフトウェア開発システムで、開発者がソフトウェアアーキテクチャを効率的に管理できます","ko":"Specture는 사양 기반의 소프트웨어 개발 시스템으로 개발자가 소프트웨어 아키텍처를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있습니다","es":"Specture es un sistema de desarrollo basado en especificaciones que mejora la arquitectura de software y el proceso de diseño","fr":"Specture est un système de développement basé sur des spécifications qui améliore l''architecture logicielle et le processus de conception","de":"Specture ist ein spezifikationsgetriebenes Entwicklungssystem, das die Software-Architektur und den Designprozess verbessert","pt":"O Specture é um sistema de desenvolvimento baseado em especificações que visa criar software mais eficiente. Ele utiliza documentos de design para descrever mudanças planejadas.","ru":"Specture - это система разработки программного обеспечения на основе спецификаций, целью которой является создание более эффективного программного обеспечения. Она использует документы проектирования для описания запланированных изменений.","ar":"Specture هو نظام هندسة البرمجيات الموجه بالمواصفات الذي يهدف إلى إنشاء برمجيات أكثر كفاءة. يستخدم وثائق التصميم لوصف التغييرات المخططة.","en":"Spec-driven software architecture system"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Specture系统：基于规格的软件架构","ja":"Spectureシステム：仕様駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャ","ko":"Specture 시스템: 사양 기반 소프트웨어 아키텍처","es":"Specture: Arquitectura de software basada en especificaci...","fr":"Specture : Système d''architecture logicielle basé sur des...","de":"Specture: Spezifikationsbasierendes Software-Architektur-...","pt":"Specture: Arquitetura de Software Dirigida por Especifica...","ru":"Specture: Система разработки программного обеспечения на ...","ar":"Specture: نظام هندسة البرمجيات الموجه بالمواصفات","en":"specture"},"description":{"zh":"Specture是一个基于规格的软件开发系统，帮助开发者高效管理软件架构","ja":"Spectureは仕様駆動のソフトウェア開発システムで、開発者がソフトウェアアーキテクチャを効率的に管理できます","ko":"Specture는 사양 기반의 소프트웨어 개발 시스템으로 개발자가 소프트웨어 아키텍처를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있습니다","es":"Specture es un sistema de desarrollo basado en especificaciones que mejora la arquitectura de software y el proceso de diseño","fr":"Specture est un système de développement basé sur des spécifications qui améliore l''architecture logicielle et le processus de conception","de":"Specture ist ein spezifikationsgetriebenes Entwicklungssystem, das die Software-Architektur und den Designprozess verbessert","pt":"O Specture é um sistema de desenvolvimento baseado em especificações que visa criar software mais eficiente. Ele utiliza documentos de design para descrever ...","ru":"Specture - это система разработки программного обеспечения на основе спецификаций, целью которой является создание более эффективного программного обеспечени...","ar":"Specture هو نظام هندسة البرمجيات الموجه بالمواصفات الذي يهدف إلى إنشاء برمجيات أكثر كفاءة. يستخدم وثائق التصميم لوصف التغييرات المخططة.","en":"Spec-driven software architecture system"},"definition":{"en":"Spec-driven software architecture system"},"features":{"zh":["基于规格的软件开发","高效管理软件架构","设计文档管理","实现任务列表","YAML前置字段支持"],"ja":["仕様駆動のソフトウェア開発","ソフトウェアアーキテクチャの効率的な管理","設計文書の管理","実装タスク一覧","YAML前置フィールドのサポート"],"ko":["사양 기반의 소프트웨어 개발","소프트웨어 아키텍처의 효율적인 관리","설계 문서 관리","구현 작업 목록","YAML 전위 필드 지원"],"es":["Desarrollo basado en especificaciones","Mejora de la arquitectura de software","Proceso de diseño estructurado","Documentación de diseño en el directorio specs/","Uso de números de especificación en la parte delantera de YAML"],"fr":["Développement basé sur des spécifications","Amélioration de l''architecture logicielle","Processus de conception structuré","Documentation de conception dans le répertoire specs/","Utilisation de numéros de spécification dans le YAML frontmatter"],"de":["Spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung","Verbesserung der Software-Architektur","Strukturierter Designprozess","Designdokumentation im specs/-Verzeichnis","Verwendung von Spezifikationsnummern im YAML-Frontmatter"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento baseado em especificações","Documentos de design para mudanças planejadas","Utilização de números de especificação para organização","Suporte a nomes de arquivo em slug-only e NNN-slug"],"ru":["Разработка на основе спецификаций","Документы проектирования для запланированных изменений","Использование номеров спецификаций для организации","Поддержка имен файлов в формате slug-only и NNN-slug"],"ar":["التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات","وثائق التصميم للتغييرات المخططة","استخدام أرقام المواصفات للتنظيم","دعم أسماء الملفات في صيغة slug-only و NNN-slug"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Specture","规格驱动","软件架构","软件开发","设计文档","YAML","开发工具"],"ja":["Specture","仕様駆動","ソフトウェアアーキテクチャ","ソフトウェア開発","設計文書","YAML","開発ツール"],"ko":["Specture","사양 기반","소프트웨어 아키텍처","소프트웨어 개발","설계 문서","YAML","개발 도구"],"es":["arquitectura de software","desarrollo basado en especificaciones","proceso de diseño","documentación de diseño","especificaciones de software","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["architecture logicielle","développement basé sur des spécifications","processus de conception","documentation de conception","spécifications logicielles","développement logiciel","ingénierie logicielle"],"de":["Software-Architektur","spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung","Designprozess","Designdokumentation","Software-Spezifikationen","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["Specture","arquitetura de software","desenvolvimento baseado em especificações","documentos de design","números de especificação","slug-only","NNN-slug","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Specture","система разработки программного обеспечения","разработка на основе спецификаций","документы проектирования","номера спецификаций","slug-only","NNN-slug","создание программного обеспечения"],"ar":["Specture","نظام هندسة البرمجيات","التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات","وثائق التصميم","أرقام المواصفات","slug-only","NNN-slug","إنشاء البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"specture-system","repo":"specture","repoPath":"specture-system/specture","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"specture","description":"Follow the Specture System for spec-driven development. Use when creating, implementing, or managing specs.","bodyPreview":"# Specture System\n\nSpecture is a spec-driven development system. Specs are design documents in the `specs/` directory that describe planned changes — features, refactors, redesigns, tooling improvements. Each spec contains the design rationale, decisions, and an implementation task list.\n\nSpec numbers are stored in the YAML frontmatter `number` field. New specs use slug-only filenames (e.g., `my-feature.md`). Older specs may retain `NNN-slug.md` filenames — both naming patterns are valid.\n\n## Im","body":"# Specture System\n\nSpecture is a spec-driven development system. Specs are design documents in the `specs/` directory that describe planned changes — features, refactors, redesigns, tooling improvements. Each spec contains the design rationale, decisions, and an implementation task list.\n\nSpec numbers are stored in the YAML frontmatter `number` field. New specs use slug-only filenames (e.g., `my-feature.md`). Older specs may retain `NNN-slug.md` filenames — both naming patterns are valid.\n\n## Implementation Workflow\n\nWhen implementing a spec, follow this loop:\n\n1. Run `specture status` to see the current spec and next task\n2. Complete one or more tasks from the task list\n3. Edit the spec file: change `- [ ]` to `- [x]` for every task completed in this commit\n4. Stage both the implementation files **and** the spec file update\n5. Commit together with a conventional commit message (e.g., `feat: implement feature X`)\n6. Push the changes\n7. Repeat from step 1\n\n**Critical rules:**\n\n- Every commit that completes a task MUST include the spec file checkbox update alongside the implementation changes. Never commit implementation without the corresponding `- [x]` update. This is the most important rule.\n- If a single commit completes multiple tasks, check off all of them in that same commit. Do NOT make separate empty commits just to check off tasks that were already implemented.\n- Do NOT edit spec design decisions or descriptions without explicit user permission. You may only mark tasks complete and add/remove tasks during implementation.\n- When editing a spec, keep the design decisions section and task list in sync. If a description is updated, update all corresponding task descriptions to match, and vice versa.\n- When all tasks are checked off, update the frontmatter `status` to `completed`.\n\n## CLI Commands\n\nAlways use non-interactive flags. Interactive mode will hang waiting for input.\n\n### specture list and specture status\n\nUse `list` to see all specs at a glance, then `status` to drill into a specific one.\n\n**`specture list`** — overview of all specs (number, status, progress, name).\n\n```bash\nspecture list                            # All specs\nspecture list --status in-progress       # Filter by status\nspecture list --status draft,approved    # Multiple statuses\nspecture list -f json                    # JSON output with full metadata\n```\n\nAliases: `list`, `ls`\n\n**`specture status`** — detailed view of one spec, including tasks and current task.\n\n```bash\nspecture status                          # Current in-progress spec\nspecture status --spec 3                 # Specific spec by number\nspecture status -f json                  # JSON output\n```\n\nTypical workflow: run `specture list` to find the spec you need, then `specture status --spec N` to see its tasks and progress.\n\n### specture new\n\nCreate a new spec file with automatic numbering and branch.\n\n```bash\n# Non-interactive: provide title via flag (required for agents)\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\"\n\n# Pipe full body content\ncat spec-body.md | specture new --title \"Feature name\"\n\n# Skip branch creation\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --no-branch\n\n# Skip opening editor\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --no-editor\n\n# Preview without creating anything\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --dry-run\n```\n\nAliases: `new`, `n`, `add`, `a`\n\n### specture validate\n\nValidate that specs follow the Specture System format.\n\n```bash\n# Validate all specs\nspecture validate\n\n# Validate a specific spec by number\nspecture validate --spec 3\nspecture validate -s 42\n```\n\nChecks: valid frontmatter (number and status), no duplicate numbers, description present, task list present. Warns on number/filename mismatch.\n\nAliases: `validate`, `v`\n\n### specture setup\n\nInitialize or update the Specture System in a repository.\n\n```bash\n# Non-interactive setup\nspecture setup --yes\n\n# Preview without changes\nspecture setup --dry-run\n\n# Force AGENTS.md update prompt\nspecture setup --update-agents --yes\n```\n\nAliases: `setup`, `update`, `u`\n\n### specture rename\n\nRename a spec file and update all markdown links in the specs directory.\n\n```bash\n# Rename spec 3 to status-command.md\nspecture rename --spec 3 status-command\n\n# Preview changes\nspecture rename --spec 3 status-command --dry-run\n```\n\n## Spec Status Workflow\n\nSpecs move through these statuses:\n\n1. **draft** — Being written and refined\n2. **approved** — Ready for implementation\n3. **in-progress** — Implementation underway (tasks being checked off)\n4. **completed** — All tasks done\n5. **rejected** — Reviewed and rejected\n\nIf a spec has no explicit `status` in frontmatter, it is inferred from tasks:\n- No task list or no complete tasks → `draft`\n- Mix of complete and incomplete → `in-progress`\n- All tasks complete → `completed`\n\n## Commit Messages\n\nUse conventional commits:\n\n- `feat:` — new features\n- `fix:` — bug fixes\n- `refactor:` — code restructuring\n- `docs:` — documentation\n- `test:` — test changes\n\n## Precedence\n\nHigher-numbered specs take precedence over lower-numbered ones when they conflict. Completed specs are historical records — do not retroactively update them (except to fix typos or factual errors).\n\n## Spec Format Reference\n\nFor detailed spec file format (frontmatter fields, sections, naming conventions), see [references/spec-format.md](references/spec-format.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:42:08.825Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured spec-driven software architecture capabilities.","zh":"适合需要结构化规格驱动软件架构能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが構造化された仕様駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 사양 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de arquitectura de software estructurada y basada en especificaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités d''architecture logicielle structurée et basée sur des spécifications.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die strukturierte, spezifikationsgetriebene Software-Architektur-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de capacidades de arquitetura de software baseadas em especificações estruturadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы возможности структурированной архитектуры программного обеспечения, основанные на спецификациях.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات هيكلية لبرمجة البرمجيات المعتمدة على المواصفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage design documents in YAML format, utilizing spec numbers and implementation task lists for efficient development workflows, leveraging Markdown files for spec documentation.","zh":"赋予代理管理 YAML 格式的设计文档的能力，利用规格编号和实现任务列表实现高效的开发工作流，并利用 Markdown 文件进行规格文档。","ja":"エージェントが YAML 形式の設計文書を管理し、仕様番号と実装タスクリストを使用して効率的な開発ワークフローを実現し、Markdown ファイルを使用して仕様文書を作成することができます。","ko":"에이전트가 YAML 형식의 설계 문서를 관리하고 사양 번호 및 구현 작업 목록을 사용하여 효율적인 개발 워크플ロー를 구현하며 Markdown 파일을 사용하여 사양 문서를 작성할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar documentos de diseño en formato YAML, utilizando números de especificación y listas de tareas de implementación para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo eficientes, aprovechando archivos Markdown para la documentación de especificaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des documents de conception au format YAML, en utilisant des numéros de spécification et des listes de tâches d''implémentation pour des flux de travail de développement efficaces, en exploitant les fichiers Markdown pour la documentation des spécifications.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Designdokumente im YAML-Format zu verwalten, indem sie Spezifikationsnummern und Implementierungsaufgabenlisten für effiziente Entwicklungsworkflows nutzen und Markdown-Dateien für die Spezifikationsdokumentation verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar documentos de design no formato YAML, utilizando números de especificação e listas de tarefas de implementação para fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento eficientes, aproveitando arquivos Markdown para documentação de especificações.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять документами дизайна в формате YAML, используя номера спецификаций и списки задач реализации для эффективных потоков разработки, используя файлы Markdown для документации спецификаций.","ar":"تمكين العميل من إدارة مستندات التصميم بالتنسيق YAML، باستخدام أرقام المواصفات وقوائم مهام التنفيذ من أجل سير عمل تطوير فعال، واستخدام ملفات Markdown لتوثيق المواصفات."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing spec documents in the specs/ directory","Generating implementation task lists from spec designs","Validating spec numbers in YAML frontmatter"],"zh":["在 specs/ 目录中管理规格文档","从规格设计生成实现任务列表","验证 YAML 前置内容中的规格编号"],"ja":["specs/ ディレクトリ内の仕様文書を管理する","仕様設計から実装タスクリストを生成する","YAML フロントマター内の仕様番号を検証する"],"ko":["specs/ 디렉토리에서 사양 문서 관리","사양 설계에서 구현 작업 목록 생성","YAML 프론트매터에서 사양 번호 검증"],"es":["Gestión de documentos de especificación en el directorio specs/","Generación de listas de tareas de implementación a partir de diseños de especificación","Validación de números de especificación en el frontmatter de YAML"],"fr":["Gestion des documents de spécification dans le répertoire specs/","Génération de listes de tâches d''implémentation à partir de conceptions de spécification","Validation des numéros de spécification dans le frontmatter YAML"],"de":["Verwaltung von Spezifikationsdokumenten im Verzeichnis specs/","Erzeugung von Implementierungsaufgabenlisten aus Spezifikationsdesigns","Validierung von Spezifikationsnummern im YAML-Frontmatter"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de documentos de especificação no diretório specs/","Geração de listas de tarefas de implementação a partir de projetos de especificação","Validação de números de especificação no frontmatter YAML"],"ru":["Управление документами спецификации в директории specs/","Генерация списков задач реализации из проектов спецификации","Проверка номеров спецификации в YAML frontmatter"],"ar":["إدارة مستندات المواصفات في الدليل specs /","توليد قوائم مهام التنفيذ من تصاميم المواصفات","التحقق من أرقام المواصفات في YAML frontmatter"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specs/ directory for design documents","Limited to Markdown files with YAML frontmatter"],"zh":["需要 specs/ 目录来存储设计文档","仅限于具有 YAML 前置内容的 Markdown 文件"],"ja":["設計文書を保存するために specs/ ディレクトリが必要","YAML フロントマターを持つ Markdown ファイルのみに対応"],"ko":["설계 문서를 저장하기 위해 specs/ 디렉토리가 필요","YAML 프론트매터가 있는 Markdown 파일만 해당"],"es":["Requiere el directorio specs/ para los documentos de diseño","Limitado a archivos Markdown con frontmatter de YAML"],"fr":["Nécessite le répertoire specs/ pour les documents de conception","Limité aux fichiers Markdown avec frontmatter YAML"],"de":["Benötigt das Verzeichnis specs/ für Designdokumente","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter"],"pt":["Requer diretório specs/ para documentos de design","Limitado a arquivos Markdown com frontmatter YAML"],"ru":["Требуется директория specs/ для документов дизайна","Ограничен файлами Markdown с YAML frontmatter"],"ar":["يتطلب دليل specs / لمستندات التصميم","محدود بملفات Markdown ذات YAML frontmatter"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
