"zh":"本文概述了在 Astro 和 Vue 项目中使用 Zod 4 的最佳实践，涵盖 schema 定义、解析、转换、错误处理和表单集成","ja":"このドキュメントでは、Astro と Vue プロジェクトで Zod 4 を使用するためのベストプラクティスを概説し、スキーマ定義、パース、変換、エラーハンドリング、フォーム統合について説明します","ko":"본 문서는 Astro 및 Vue 프로젝트에서 Zod 4를 사용하는 최적의 방법을 설명하며, 스키마 정의, 파싱, 변환, 에러 처리, 폼 통합 등에 대해 다룹니다","es":"Zod 4 es una biblioteca para la validación de datos en Astro y Vue, que ofrece funcionalidades para definir esquemas y manejar errores de manera eficiente","fr":"Zod 4 est une bibliothèque de validation de données pour Astro et Vue, qui propose des fonctionnalités pour définir des schémas et gérer les erreurs de maniè...","de":"Zod 4 ist eine Bibliothek für die Datavalidierung in Astro und Vue, die Funktionen für die Definition von Schemata und die Fehlerbehandlung bietet","pt":"Este guia apresenta as melhores práticas para usar Zod 4 em projetos Astro e Vue, cobrindo definição de esquemas, parsing, transformações e tratamento de erros","ru":"Этот гид представляет лучшие практики для использования Zod 4 в проектах Astro и Vue, охватывающие определение схем, парсинг, трансформации и обработку ошибок","ar":"هذا الدليل يقدم أفضل الممارسات لاستخدام زود 4 في مشاريع أسترو وفو، يشمل تعريف مخططات البارسينج والتحويلات ومعالجة الأخطاء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["schema 定义","解析和转换","错误处理","表单集成","兼容 Astro 和 Vue 项目"],"ja":["スキーマ定義","パースと変換","エラーハンドリング","フォーム統合","Astro と Vue プロジェクトとの互換性"],"ko":["스키마 정의","파싱 및 변환","에러 처리","폼 통합","Astro 및 Vue 프로젝트와의 호환성"],"es":["Definición de esquemas personalizados","Validación de datos en tiempo de ejecución","Manejo de errores y excepciones","Integración con formularios y campos de entrada","Compatibilidad con Astro y Vue"],"fr":["Définition de schémas personnalisés","Validation de données en temps d''exécution","Gestion des erreurs et des exceptions","Intégration avec les formulaires et les champs de saisie","Compatibilité avec Astro et Vue"],"de":["Definition von benutzerdefinierten Schemata","Datavalidierung in Echtzeit","Fehlerbehandlung und Ausnahmen","Integration mit Formularen und Eingabefeldern","Kompatibilität mit Astro und Vue"],"pt":["Definição de esquemas personalizados","Parsing e validação de dados","Transformações de dados","Tratamento de erros personalizado","Integração com formulários"],"ru":["Определение пользовательских схем","Парсинг и валидация данных","Трансформации данных","Пользовательская обработка ошибок","Интеграция с формами"],"ar":["تعريف مخططات مخصصة","بارسينج و التحقق من البيانات","تحويلات البيانات","معالجة الأخطاء المخصصة","التكامل مع النماذج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Zod 4","schema 定义","解析和转换","错误处理","表单集成","Astro","Vue","JavaScript"],"ja":["Zod 4","スキーマ定義","パースと変換","エラーハンドリング","フォーム統合","Astro","Vue","JavaScript"],"ko":["Zod 4","스키마 정의","파싱 및 변환","에러 처리","폼 통합","Astro","Vue","JavaScript"],"es":["Zod 4","validación de datos","Astro","Vue","esquemas personalizados","manejo de errores","formularios","campos de entrada"],"fr":["Zod 4","validation de données","Astro","Vue","schémas personnalisés","gestion des erreurs","formulaires","champs de saisie"],"de":["Zod 4","Datavalidierung","Astro","Vue","benutzerdefinierte Schemata","Fehlerbehandlung","Formulare","Eingabefelder"],"pt":["Zod 4","validação de esquemas","JavaScript","Astro","Vue","desenvolvimento web","melhores práticas"," parsing","transformações"],"ru":["Zod 4","валидация схем","JavaScript","Astro","Vue","веб-разработка","лучшие практики","парсинг","трансформации"],"ar":["زود 4","تحقق مخططات","جافاسكريبت","أسترو","فو","تطوير الويب","أفضل الممارسات","بارسينج","تحويلات"]}},"owner":"dallay","repo":"cvix","repoPath":"dallay/cvix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zod-4","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Zod 4 Best Practices\n\nThis document outlines best practices for using Zod 4 in Astro and Vue projects, focusing on schema\ndefinitions, parsing, transformations, error handling, and form integration.\n\n## Migration Guide from Zod 3 to Zod 4\n\n```typescript\n// ⚠️ Deprecated (still works in v4, will be removed in v5)\nz.string().email()\nz.string().uuid()\nz.string().url()\nz.string().nonempty()\nz.string().min(5, { message: \"Too short\" })\n\n// ✅ Recommended (better performance, tree-shaking)\nz.email()\nz","body":"# Zod 4 Best Practices\n\nThis document outlines best practices for using Zod 4 in Astro and Vue projects, focusing on schema\ndefinitions, parsing, transformations, error handling, and form integration.\n\n## Migration Guide from Zod 3 to Zod 4\n\n```typescript\n// ⚠️ Deprecated (still works in v4, will be removed in v5)\nz.string().email()\nz.string().uuid()\nz.string().url()\nz.string().nonempty()\nz.string().min(5, { message: \"Too short\" })\n\n// ✅ Recommended (better performance, tree-shaking)\nz.email()\nz.uuid()\nz.url()\nz.string().min(1)\nz.string().min(5, { error: \"Too short\" })\n\n// Note: Old patterns still work in v4 for backward compatibility\n```\n\n## Error Message Parameters\n\n```typescript\n// Both work in Zod 4, but ''error'' is preferred\nz.string().min(5, { message: \"Too short\" })  // ⚠️ Deprecated\nz.string().min(5, { error: \"Too short\" })    // ✅ Preferred\n\n// Error can be a function for dynamic messages\nz.string({\n  error: (issue) => issue.input === undefined\n    ? \"Field is required\"\n    : \"Invalid string\"\n})\n```\n\n## Basic Schemas\n\n```typescript\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\n// Primitives\nconst stringSchema = z.string();\nconst numberSchema = z.number();\nconst booleanSchema = z.boolean();\nconst dateSchema = z.date();\n\n// Top-level validators (Zod 4)\nconst emailSchema = z.email();\nconst uuidSchema = z.uuid();\nconst urlSchema = z.url();\n\n// With constraints\nconst nameSchema = z.string().min(1).max(100);\nconst ageSchema = z.number().int().positive().max(150);\nconst priceSchema = z.number().min(0).multipleOf(0.01);\n```\n\n## Object Schemas\n\n```typescript\nconst userSchema = z.object({\n  id: z.uuid(),\n  email: z.email({ error: \"Invalid email address\" }),\n  name: z.string().min(1, { error: \"Name is required\" }),\n  age: z.number().int().positive().optional(),\n  role: z.enum([\"admin\", \"user\", \"guest\"]),\n  metadata: z.record(z.string(), z.unknown()).optional(),\n});\n\ntype User = z.infer<typeof userSchema>;\n\n// Parsing\nconst user = userSchema.parse(data);  // Throws on error\nconst result = userSchema.safeParse(data);  // Returns { success, data/error }\n\nif (result.success) {\n  console.log(result.data);\n} else {\n  console.log(result.error.issues);\n}\n```\n\n## Arrays and Records\n\n```typescript\n// Arrays\nconst tagsSchema = z.array(z.string()).min(1).max(10);\nconst numbersSchema = z.array(z.number()).min(1);\n\n// Records (objects with dynamic keys)\nconst scoresSchema = z.record(z.string(), z.number());\n// { [key: string]: number }\n\n// Tuples\nconst coordinatesSchema = z.tuple([z.number(), z.number()]);\n// [number, number]\n```\n\n## Unions and Discriminated Unions\n\n```typescript\n// Simple union\nconst stringOrNumber = z.union([z.string(), z.number()]);\n\n// Discriminated union (more efficient)\nconst resultSchema = z.discriminatedUnion(\"status\", [\n  z.object({ status: z.literal(\"success\"), data: z.unknown() }),\n  z.object({ status: z.literal(\"error\"), error: z.string() }),\n]);\n```\n\n## Transformations\n\n```typescript\n// Transform during parsing\nconst lowercaseEmail = z.email().transform(email => email.toLowerCase());\n\n// Coercion (convert types)\nconst numberFromString = z.coerce.number();  // \"42\" → 42\nconst dateFromString = z.coerce.date();      // \"2024-01-01\" → Date\n\n// Preprocessing\nconst trimmedString = z.preprocess(\n  val => typeof val === \"string\" ? val.trim() : val,\n  z.string()\n);\n```\n\n## Refinements\n\n```typescript\nconst passwordSchema = z.string()\n  .min(8)\n  .refine(val => /[A-Z]/.test(val), {\n    message: \"Must contain uppercase letter\",\n  })\n  .refine(val => /[0-9]/.test(val), {\n    message: \"Must contain number\",\n  });\n\n// With superRefine for multiple errors\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  password: z.string(),\n  confirmPassword: z.string(),\n}).superRefine((data, ctx) => {\n  if (data.password !== data.confirmPassword) {\n    ctx.addIssue({\n      code: z.ZodIssueCode.custom,\n      message: \"Passwords don''t match\",\n      path: [\"confirmPassword\"],\n    });\n  }\n});\n```\n\n## Optional and Nullable\n\n```typescript\n// Optional (T | undefined)\nz.string().optional()\n\n// Nullable (T | null)\nz.string().nullable()\n\n// Both (T | null | undefined)\nz.string().nullish()\n\n// Default values\nz.string().default(\"unknown\")\nz.number().default(() => Math.random())\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```typescript\n// Zod 4: Use ''error'' param instead of ''message''\nconst schema = z.object({\n  name: z.string({ error: \"Name must be a string\" }),\n  email: z.email({ error: \"Invalid email format\" }),\n  age: z.number().min(18, { error: \"Must be 18 or older\" }),\n});\n\n// Custom error map\nconst customSchema = z.string({\n  error: (issue) => {\n    if (issue.code === \"too_small\") {\n      return \"String is too short\";\n    }\n    return \"Invalid string\";\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Form Validation in Vue\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref, computed } from ''vue'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\nconst loginSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.email({ error: ''Invalid email address'' }),\n  password: z.string().min(8, { error: ''Password must be at least 8 characters'' }),\n});\n\ntype LoginForm = z.infer<typeof loginSchema>;\n\nconst formData = ref<Partial<LoginForm>>({\n  email: '''',\n  password: '''',\n});\n\nconst errors = ref<Partial<Record<keyof LoginForm, string>>>({});\n\nconst validateField = (field: keyof LoginForm) => {\n  const schema = loginSchema.pick({ [field]: true });\n  const result = schema.safeParse({ [field]: formData.value[field] });\n\n  if (!result.success) {\n    errors.value[field] = result.error.issues[0]?.message;\n  } else {\n    delete errors.value[field];\n  }\n};\n\nconst handleSubmit = async () => {\n  const result = loginSchema.safeParse(formData.value);\n\n  if (!result.success) {\n    errors.value = {};\n    result.error.issues.forEach(issue => {\n      const field = issue.path[0] as keyof LoginForm;\n      errors.value[field] = issue.message;\n    });\n    return;\n  }\n\n  console.log(''Form submitted:'', result.data);\n  // Send to API\n};\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <form @submit.prevent=\"handleSubmit\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n    <div>\n      <input\n        v-model=\"formData.email\"\n        type=\"email\"\n        placeholder=\"Email\"\n        @blur=\"validateField(''email'')\"\n        :class=\"{ ''border-red-500'': errors.email }\"\n      />\n      <span v-if=\"errors.email\" class=\"text-red-500 text-sm\">{{ errors.email }}</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <input\n        v-model=\"formData.password\"\n        type=\"password\"\n        placeholder=\"Password\"\n        @blur=\"validateField(''password'')\"\n        :class=\"{ ''border-red-500'': errors.password }\"\n      />\n      <span v-if=\"errors.password\" class=\"text-red-500 text-sm\">{{ errors.password }}</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded\">\n      Login\n    </button>\n  </form>\n</template>\n```\n\n## Form Validation in Astro\n\n```astro\n---\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\nconst loginSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.email({ error: ''Invalid email address'' }),\n  password: z.string().min(8, { error: ''Password must be at least 8 characters'' }),\n});\n\ntype LoginForm = z.infer<typeof loginSchema>;\n\nlet errors: Partial<Record<keyof LoginForm, string>> = {};\nlet submittedData: LoginForm | null = null;\n\nif (Astro.request.method === ''POST'') {\n  const formData = await Astro.request.formData();\n  const data = {\n    email: formData.get(''email''),\n    password: formData.get(''password''),\n  };\n\n  const result = loginSchema.safeParse(data);\n\n  if (!result.success) {\n    result.error.issues.forEach(issue => {\n      const field = issue.path[0] as keyof LoginForm;\n      errors[field] = issue.message;\n    });\n  } else {\n    submittedData = result.data;\n    // Process form: send to API, create session, etc.\n  }\n}\n---\n\n{submittedData && (\n  <div class=\"bg-green-100 border border-green-400 text-green-700 px-4 py-3 rounded\">\n    Successfully logged in as {submittedData.email}\n  </div>\n)}\n\n<form method=\"POST\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n  <div>\n    <input\n      name=\"email\"\n      type=\"email\"\n      placeholder=\"Email\"\n      defaultValue=\"\"\n      class={errors.email ? ''border-red-500'' : ''''}\n    />\n    {errors.email && <span class=\"text-red-500 text-sm\">{errors.email}</span>}\n  </div>\n\n  <div>\n    <input\n      name=\"password\"\n      type=\"password\"\n      placeholder=\"Password\"\n      defaultValue=\"\"\n      class={errors.password ? ''border-red-500'' : ''''}\n    />\n    {errors.password && <span class=\"text-red-500 text-sm\">{errors.password}</span>}\n  </div>\n\n  <button type=\"submit\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded\">\n    Login\n  </button>\n</form>\n```\n\n## Server-side Validation (Shared)\n\nFor both Vue and Astro, validate on server before processing:\n\n```typescript\n// Shared validation utility\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\nexport const loginSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.email(),\n  password: z.string().min(8),\n});\n\nexport type LoginData = z.infer<typeof loginSchema>;\n\nexport async function validateLogin(data: unknown) {\n  return loginSchema.safeParse(data);\n}\n\n// Usage in API endpoint or action\nexport async function POST({ request }) {\n  const data = await request.json();\n  const result = await validateLogin(data);\n\n  if (!result.success) {\n    // Use flattenError for better form handling\n    // Returns: { formErrors: string[], fieldErrors: Record<string, string[]> }\n    return new Response(\n      JSON.stringify({ errors: z.flattenError(result.error) }),\n      { status: 400 }\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Process validated data\n  return new Response(JSON.stringify({ success: true }));\n}\n```\n\n## Client-side Validation with Fetch (Vue)\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref } from ''vue'';\n\nconst email = ref('''');\nconst password = ref('''');\nconst errors = ref<Record<string, string>>({});\nconst loading = ref(false);\n\nconst handleSubmit = async () => {\n  loading.value = true;\n  errors.value = {};\n\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(''/api/login'', {\n      method: ''POST'',\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ email: email.value, password: password.value }),\n    });\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      const { errors: serverErrors } = await response.json();\n      if (serverErrors?.fieldErrors) {\n        Object.entries(serverErrors.fieldErrors).forEach(([field, messages]) => {\n          const firstMessage = Array.isArray(messages) ? messages[0] : messages;\n          if (firstMessage) {\n            errors.value[field] = firstMessage;\n          }\n        });\n      }\n      return;\n    }\n\n    // Success: redirect or update state\n    window.location.href = ''/dashboard'';\n  } catch (error) {\n    errors.value.submit = ''Network error. Please try again.'';\n  } finally {\n    loading.value = false;\n  }\n};\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <form @submit.prevent=\"handleSubmit\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n    <div v-if=\"errors.submit\" class=\"text-red-600 text-sm\">{{ errors.submit }}</div>\n\n    <div>\n      <input v-model=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n      <span v-if=\"errors.email\" class=\"text-red-500 text-sm\">{{ errors.email }}</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <input v-model=\"password\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"Password\" />\n      <span v-if=\"errors.password\" class=\"text-red-500 text-sm\">{{ errors.password }}</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <button :disabled=\"loading\" type=\"submit\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded disabled:opacity-50\">\n      {{ loading ? ''Logging in...'' : ''Login'' }}\n    </button>\n  </form>\n</template>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:42:42.749Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing robust schema validation and parsing in Astro and Vue projects.","zh":"非常适合需要在Astro和Vue项目中进行强大的模式验证和解析的前端代理。","ja":"AstroとVueのプロジェクトで強力なスキーマの検証と解析が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Astro와 Vue 프로젝트에서 강력한 스키마 유효성 검사 및 파싱이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una validación de esquema robusta y análisis en proyectos Astro y Vue.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une validation de schéma robuste et d''une analyse dans les projets Astro et Vue.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine robuste Schema-Validierung und Analyse in Astro- und Vue-Projekten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de validação de esquema robusta e parsing em projetos Astro e Vue.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходима прочная валидация схем и парсинг в проектах Astro и Vue.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق من صحة مخطط قوي وتصريف في مشاريع Astro و Vue."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define and validate schemas using Zod 4''s improved parsing and transformation capabilities, including email, UUID, and URL validation, while also providing better performance and tree-shaking through recommended methods like z.email() and z.uuid().","zh":"赋予代理定义和验证模式的能力，使用Zod 4的改进解析和转换功能，包括电子邮件、UUID和URL验证，同时也通过推荐的方法（如z.email()和z.uuid()）提供更好的性能和树抖动。","ja":"Zod 4の改良された解析および変換機能を使用して、エージェントがスキーマを定義および検証する機能を提供します。電子メール、UUID、およびURLの検証を含み、z.email()やz.uuid()などの推奨方法を使用して、パフォーマンスとツリーのシェーキングを改善します。","ko":"Zod 4의 향상된 파싱 및 변환 기능을 사용하여 에이전트가 스키마를 정의하고 유효성 검사할 수 있도록 합니다. 이메일, UUID 및 URL 유효성 검증을 포함하며 z.email() 및 z.uuid()와 같은 추천 방법을 통해 성능과 트리シェ이킹을 개선합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes definir y validar esquemas utilizando las capacidades de análisis y transformación mejoradas de Zod 4, incluida la validación de correo electrónico, UUID y URL, al tiempo que proporciona un mejor rendimiento y tree-shaking a través de métodos recomendados como z.email() y z.uuid().","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir et de valider des schémas en utilisant les capacités de parsing et de transformation améliorées de Zod 4, y compris la validation d''e-mail, d''UUID et d''URL, tout en offrant de meilleures performances et un tree-shaking grâce à des méthodes recommandées comme z.email() et z.uuid().","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Schemata mithilfe der verbesserten Analyse- und Transformationsfunktionen von Zod 4 zu definieren und zu validieren, einschließlich E-Mail-, UUID- und URL-Validierung, während auch ein besseres Leistungsverhalten und Tree-Shaking durch empfohlene Methoden wie z.email() und z.uuid() bereitgestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir e validar esquemas usando as capacidades de parsing e transformação aprimoradas do Zod 4, incluindo validação de email, UUID e URL, além de fornecer melhor desempenho e tree-shaking por meio de métodos recomendados como z.email() e z.uuid().","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять и проверять схемы с помощью улучшенных возможностей парсинга и трансформации Zod 4, включая проверку электронной почты, UUID и URL, а также обеспечивает лучшую производительность и tree-shaking посредством рекомендуемых методов, таких как z.email() и z.uuid().","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تعريف مخططات والتحقق منها باستخدام قدرات التحليل والتحويل المحسنة من Zod 4، بما في ذلك التحقق من البريد الإلكتروني والمتوافق الفريد والرابط، بالإضافة إلى توفير أداء أفضل وtree-shaking من خلال أساليب موصى بها مثل z.email() و z.uuid()."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating from Zod 3 to Zod 4 for improved schema validation","Defining and validating complex schemas for form integration","Optimizing error handling for robust user input validation","Transforming and parsing data using Zod 4''s advanced features"],"zh":["从Zod 3迁移到Zod 4以获得改进的模式验证","定义和验证复杂的模式以实现表单集成","优化错误处理以实现强大的用户输入验证","使用Zod 4的高级功能转换和解析数据"],"ja":["Zod 3からZod 4への移行により、スキーマの検証が改善される","フォーム統合のために複雑なスキーマを定義および検証する","強力なユーザー入力の検証のためにエラー処理を最適化する","Zod 4の高度な機能を使用してデータを変換および解析する"],"ko":["Zod 3에서 Zod 4로 마이그레이션하여 개선된 스키마 유효성 검사를 수행합니다.","폼 통합을 위한 복잡한 스키마를 정의하고 유효성 검사합니다.","강력한 사용자 입력 유효성 검사를 위해 오류 처리를 최적화합니다.","Zod 4의 고급 기능을 사용하여 데이터를 변환하고 파싱합니다."],"es":["Migrar de Zod 3 a Zod 4 para una validación de esquema mejorada","Definir y validar esquemas complejos para la integración de formularios","Optimizar el manejo de errores para una validación robusta de la entrada del usuario","Transformar y analizar datos utilizando las características avanzadas de Zod 4"],"fr":["Migrer de Zod 3 à Zod 4 pour une validation de schéma améliorée","Définir et valider des schémas complexes pour l''intégration de formulaires","Optimiser la gestion des erreurs pour une validation robuste de la saisie utilisateur","Transformer et analyser des données en utilisant les fonctionnalités avancées de Zod 4"],"de":["Von Zod 3 auf Zod 4 migrieren, um eine verbesserte Schemavalidierung zu erzielen","Komplexe Schemata für die Formularintegration definieren und validieren","Fehlerbehandlung optimieren, um eine robuste Benutzereingabevalidierung zu gewährleisten","Daten mit den erweiterten Funktionen von Zod 4 transformieren und analysieren"],"pt":["Migrando do Zod 3 para o Zod 4 para uma validação de esquema aprimorada","Definindo e validando esquemas complexos para integração de formulários","Otimizando o tratamento de erros para uma validação de entrada de usuário robusta","Transformando e analisando dados usando os recursos avançados do Zod 4"],"ru":["Миграция с Zod 3 на Zod 4 для улучшенной проверки схем","Определение и проверка сложных схем для интеграции форм","Оптимизация обработки ошибок для прочной валидации пользовательского ввода","Преобразование и парсинг данных с помощью продвинутых функций Zod 4"],"ar":["الانتقال من Zod 3 إلى Zod 4 للحصول على تحقق مخطط محسّن","تعريف مخططات معقدة والتحقق منها لتكامل النماذج","تحسين معالجة الأخطاء للحصول على تحقق من المدخلات المستخدمة بشكل قوي","تحويل وتصريف البيانات باستخدام الميزات المتقدمة من Zod 4"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of TypeScript and Astro or Vue project structures","Deprecated methods will be removed in Zod 5"],"zh":["需要TypeScript和Astro或Vue项目结构的知识","废弃的方法将在Zod 5中删除"],"ja":["TypeScriptおよびAstroまたはVueのプロジェクト構造に関する知識が必要","非推奨のメソッドはZod 5で削除される"],"ko":["TypeScript 및 Astro 또는 Vue 프로젝트 구조에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","사용되지 않는 메서드는 Zod 5에서 제거됩니다."],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de TypeScript y estructuras de proyecto Astro o Vue","Los métodos en desuso se eliminarán en Zod 5"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en TypeScript et des structures de projet Astro ou Vue","Les méthodes obsolètes seront supprimées dans Zod 5"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von TypeScript und Astro- oder Vue-Projektstrukturen","Veraltete Methoden werden in Zod 5 entfernt"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de TypeScript e estruturas de projeto Astro ou Vue","Métodos obsoletos serão removidos no Zod 5"],"ru":["Требуется знание TypeScript и структур проектов Astro или Vue","Устаревшие методы будут удалены в Zod 5"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة TypeScript وهيكل مشروع Astro أو Vue","سيتم إزالة الطرق المهجورة في Zod 5"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
