板代码","ja":"Zustandステート管理は、最小限のステート管理を実現するソリューションです。プロバイダーとボイラープレートコードを最小限に抑えます","ko":"Zustand 상태 관리는 최소한의 상태 관리를 구현하는 솔루션으로, 제공자와 보일러 플레이트 코드가 최소화됩니다","es":"Zustand es una biblioteca de gestión de estado minimalista que elimina la necesidad de proveedores y reduce el código boilerplate","fr":"Zustand est une bibliothèque de gestion d''état minimaliste qui élimine la nécessité de fournisseurs et réduit le code boilerplate","de":"Zustand ist eine minimalistische Bibliothek für die Zustandsverwaltung, die die Notwendigkeit von Anbietern eliminiert und den Boilerplate-Code reduziert","pt":"O Zustand é uma biblioteca de gerenciamento de estado minimalista que fornece uma solução simples e eficaz para gerenciar o estado das aplicações JavaScript.","ru":"Zustand - это минималистская библиотека управления состоянием, которая предоставляет простое и эффективное решение для управления состоянием приложений JavaS...","ar":"Zustand هي مكتبة إدارة الحالة المتنقلة التي توفر حلًا بسيطًا وفعالًا لإدارة الحالة لتطبيقات JavaScript.","en":"ZPLC - One Execution Core, Any Runtime. Portable PLC Runtime powered by Zephyr RTOS."},"definition":{"en":"ZPLC - One Execution Core, Any Runtime. Portable PLC Runtime powered by Zephyr RTOS."},"features":{"zh":["最小化状态管理","无需提供者","减少样板代码","易于使用","高性能"],"ja":["最小限のステート管理","プロバイダー不要","ボイラープレートコード削減","使いやすい","高性能"],"ko":["최소한의 상태 관리","제공자 필요 없음","보일러 플레이트 코드 최소화","사용하기 쉬움","고성능"],"es":["Gestión de estado minimalista","Sin proveedores necesarios","Código boilerplate reducido","Fácil de usar y configurar","Compatible con TypeScript"],"fr":["Gestion d''état minimaliste","Pas de fournisseurs nécessaires","Code boilerplate réduit","Facile à utiliser et à configurer","Compatible avec TypeScript"],"de":["Minimalistische Zustandsverwaltung","Keine Anbieter erforderlich","Boilerplate-Code reduziert","Einfach zu verwenden und zu konfigurieren","Kompatibel mit TypeScript"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado minimalista","Sem provedores","Boilerplate mínimo","Fácil de usar","Personalizável"],"ru":["Минималистское управление состоянием","Без провайдеров","Минимальный boilerplate","Легко использовать","Настраиваемый"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة المتنقلة","بدون مزودين","الحد الأدنى من Boilerplate","سهل الاستخدام","قابل للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Zustand","状态管理","最小化状态管理","无需提供者","减少样板代码","前端开发","状态管理解决方案"],"ja":["Zustand","ステート管理","最小限のステート管理","プロバイダー不要","ボイラープレートコード削減","フロントエンド開発","ステート管理ソリューション"],"ko":["Zustand","상태 관리","최소한의 상태 관리","제공자 필요 없음","보일러 플레이트 코드 최소화","프론트엔드 개발","상태 관리 솔루션"],"es":["gestión de estado","zustand","react","state management","typescript","javascript","desarrollo de aplicaciones","bibliotecas de javascript"],"fr":["gestion d''état","zustand","react","state management","typescript","javascript","développement d''applications","bibliothèques javascript"],"de":["zustandsverwaltung","zustand","react","state management","typescript","javascript","anwendungsentwicklung","javascript-bibliotheken"],"pt":["Zustand","Gerenciamento de estado","JavaScript","Biblioteca","Minimalista","Desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Zustand","Управление состоянием","JavaScript","Библиотека","Минималистская","Веб-разработка"],"ar":["Zustand","إدارة الحالة","JavaScript","مكتبة","متنقلة","تطوير ويب"]}},"owner":"eduardojvieira","repo":"ZPLC","repoPath":"eduardojvieira/ZPLC","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zustand-state","description":"Zustand state management for React and vanilla JavaScript. Use when creating stores, using selectors, persisting state to localStorage, integrating devtools, or managing global state without Redux complexity. Triggers on zustand, create(), createStore, useStore, persist, devtools, immer middleware.","bodyPreview":"# Zustand State Management\n\nMinimal state management - no providers, minimal boilerplate.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```typescript\nimport { create } from ''zustand''\n\ninterface BearState {\n  bears: number\n  increase: (by: number) => void\n}\n\nconst useBearStore = create<BearState>()((set) => ({\n  bears: 0,\n  increase: (by) => set((state) => ({ bears: state.bears + by })),\n}))\n\n// In component - select only what you need\nconst bears = useBearStore((state) => state.bears)\nconst increase = useBearStore((stat","body":"# Zustand State Management\n\nMinimal state management - no providers, minimal boilerplate.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```typescript\nimport { create } from ''zustand''\n\ninterface BearState {\n  bears: number\n  increase: (by: number) => void\n}\n\nconst useBearStore = create<BearState>()((set) => ({\n  bears: 0,\n  increase: (by) => set((state) => ({ bears: state.bears + by })),\n}))\n\n// In component - select only what you need\nconst bears = useBearStore((state) => state.bears)\nconst increase = useBearStore((state) => state.increase)\n```\n\n## State Updates\n\n```typescript\n// Flat updates (auto-merged at one level)\nset({ bears: 5 })\nset((state) => ({ bears: state.bears + 1 }))\n\n// Nested objects (manual spread required)\nset((state) => ({\n  nested: { ...state.nested, count: state.nested.count + 1 }\n}))\n\n// Replace entire state (no merge)\nset({ bears: 0 }, true)\n```\n\n## Selectors & Performance\n\n```typescript\n// Good - subscribes only to bears\nconst bears = useBearStore((state) => state.bears)\n\n// Bad - rerenders on any change\nconst state = useBearStore()\n\n// Multiple values with useShallow (prevents rerenders with shallow comparison)\nimport { useShallow } from ''zustand/react/shallow''\n\nconst { bears, fish } = useBearStore(\n  useShallow((state) => ({ bears: state.bears, fish: state.fish }))\n)\n\n// Array destructuring also works\nconst [bears, fish] = useBearStore(\n  useShallow((state) => [state.bears, state.fish])\n)\n```\n\n## Access Outside Components\n\n```typescript\n// Get current state (non-reactive)\nconst state = useBearStore.getState()\n\n// Update state\nuseBearStore.setState({ bears: 5 })\n\n// Subscribe to changes\nconst unsub = useBearStore.subscribe((state) => console.log(state))\nunsub() // unsubscribe\n```\n\n## Vanilla Store (No React)\n\n```typescript\nimport { createStore } from ''zustand/vanilla''\n\nconst store = createStore((set) => ({\n  bears: 0,\n  increase: (by) => set((state) => ({ bears: state.bears + by })),\n}))\n\nstore.getState().bears\nstore.setState({ bears: 10 })\nstore.subscribe((state) => console.log(state))\n```\n\n## Additional Documentation\n\n- **Middleware**: See [references/middleware.md](references/middleware.md) for persist, devtools, immer\n- **Patterns**: See [references/patterns.md](references/patterns.md) for slices, testing, best practices\n- **TypeScript**: See [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md) for advanced typing patterns\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n| Pattern | When to Use |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Single selector | One piece of state needed |\n| `useShallow` | Multiple values, avoid rerenders |\n| `getState()` | Outside React, event handlers |\n| `subscribe()` | External systems, logging |\n| Vanilla store | Non-React environments |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:43:30.994Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing minimal state management with Zustand''s portable PLC runtime","zh":"非常适合需要最小状态管理的前端代理，使用Zustand的便携式PLC运行时","ja":"最小限りのステート管理が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、ZustandのポータブルPLCランタイムを使用","ko":"최소한의 상태 관리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, Zustand의 포터블 PLC 런타임을 사용","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan un manejo de estado mínimo con el tiempo de ejecución PLC portátil de Zustand","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une gestion d''état minimale avec le runtime PLC portable de Zustand","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die ein minimales Statusmanagement mit der portablen PLC-Laufzeit von Zustand benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de gerenciamento de estado mínimo com o tempo de execução PLC portátil do Zustand","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуется минимальное управление состоянием с помощью портативной среды выполнения PLC Zustand","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة الحالة الدنيا مع وقت تشغيل PLC قابل للنقل من Zustand"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage state with minimal boilerplate using Zustand''s create method and Zephyr RTOS, enabling seamless integration with TypeScript and React components through libraries like ''zustand''","zh":"赋予代理使用Zustand的create方法和Zephyr RTOS，实现与TypeScript和React组件的无缝集成，通过类似''zustand''的库","ja":"ZustandのcreateメソッドとZephyr RTOSを使用して、エージェントがステートを最小限のボイラープレートで管理できるようにし、TypeScriptとReactコンポーネントとのシームレスな統合を可能にし、''zustand''などのライブラリを介して","ko":"Zustand의 create 메서드와 Zephyr RTOS를 사용하여 에이전트가 최소한의 보일러 플레이트로 상태를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, TypeScript와 React 컴포넌트와의无缝 통합을 가능하게 하며, ''zustand''와 같은 라이브러리를 통해","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado con un mínimo código de configuración utilizando el método create de Zustand y Zephyr RTOS, lo que permite una integración fluida con componentes TypeScript y React a través de bibliotecas como ''zustand''","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état avec un minimum de code de configuration en utilisant la méthode create de Zustand et Zephyr RTOS, ce qui permet une intégration fluide avec les composants TypeScript et React via des bibliothèques comme ''zustand''","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, den Status mit minimalem Boilerplate-Code zu verwalten, indem sie die Create-Methode von Zustand und Zephyr RTOS verwenden, was eine nahtlose Integration mit TypeScript- und React-Komponenten über Bibliotheken wie ''zustand'' ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o estado com o mínimo de código boilerplate usando o método create do Zustand e o Zephyr RTOS, permitindo uma integração sem problemas com componentes TypeScript e React por meio de bibliotecas como ''zustand''","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять состоянием с минимальным кодом boilerplate, используя метод create Zustand и Zephyr RTOS, что позволяет обеспечить бесшовную интеграцию с компонентами TypeScript и React через библиотеки, такие как ''zustand''","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة الحالة بأقل كمية من код البرنامج الثابت باستخدام طريقة create من Zustand و Zephyr RTOS ، مما يسمح بالتكامل السلس مع مكونات TypeScript و React من خلال مكتبات مثل ''zustand''"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating portable state management solutions","Building minimal boilerplate React applications","Integrating Zustand with Zephyr RTOS for efficient state handling"],"zh":["创建便携式状态管理解决方案","构建最小限的React应用程序","将Zustand与Zephyr RTOS集成，实现高效的状态处理"],"ja":["ポータブルなステート管理ソリューションを作成する","最小限のボイラープレートのReactアプリケーションを構築する","ZustandとZephyr RTOSを統合して効率的なステートハンドリングを実現する"],"ko":["포터블 상태 관리 솔루션 만들기","최소한의 보일러 플레이트 React 애플리케이션 구축","Zustand와 Zephyr RTOS를 통합하여 효율적인 상태 처리를 구현"],"es":["Crear soluciones de gestión de estado portátiles","Crear aplicaciones React con un mínimo código de configuración","Integrar Zustand con Zephyr RTOS para un manejo de estado eficiente"],"fr":["Créer des solutions de gestion d''état portables","Construire des applications React avec un minimum de code de configuration","Intégrer Zustand avec Zephyr RTOS pour une gestion d''état efficace"],"de":["Erstellen von portablen Statusmanagementlösungen","Erstellen von React-Anwendungen mit minimalem Boilerplate-Code","Integrieren von Zustand mit Zephyr RTOS für eine effiziente Statusverwaltung"],"pt":["Criação de soluções de gerenciamento de estado portáteis","Construção de aplicações React com código boilerplate mínimo","Integração do Zustand com o Zephyr RTOS para manipulação eficiente de estado"],"ru":["Создание портативных решений для управления состоянием","Построение приложений React с минимальным кодом boilerplate","Интеграция Zustand с Zephyr RTOS для эффективного xử lý состояния"],"ar":["إنشاء حلول إدارة الحالة القابلة للنقل","بناء تطبيقات React بأقل كمية من البرنامج الثابت","دمج Zustand مع Zephyr RTOS للتعامل الفعال مع الحالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Zustand library","TypeScript compatibility needed","Limited to React-based applications"],"zh":["需要Zustand库","需要TypeScript兼容性","仅限于React-based应用"],"ja":["Zustandライブラリが必要","TypeScriptの互換性が必要","Reactベースのアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["Zustand 라이브러리가 필요","TypeScript 호환성이 필요","React 기반 애플리케이션에限定"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca Zustand","Se necesita compatibilidad con TypeScript","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en React"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque Zustand","La compatibilité avec TypeScript est nécessaire","Limité aux applications basées sur React"],"de":["Benötigt die Zustand-Bibliothek","TypeScript-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Begrenzt auf React-basierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer a biblioteca Zustand","Compatibilidade com TypeScript necessária","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em React"],"ru":["Требует библиотеки Zustand","Необходима совместимость с TypeScript","Ограничен для приложений на основе React"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة Zustand","يتطلب توافقًا مع TypeScript","محدود للتطبيقات القائمة على React"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
