":["GCP App Engine","Plataforma como serviço","Implantação de aplicações","Gerenciamento de recursos","Escalabilidade previsível","Runtime personalizado","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Nuvem computacional"],"ru":["GCP App Engine","Платформа как сервис","Развертывание приложений","Управление ресурсами","Предсказуемая масштабируемость","Пользовательский runtime","Разработка приложений","Облачные вычисления"],"ar":["GCP App Engine","منصة كخدمة","نشر التطبيقات","إدارة الموارد","التوسع المتوقع","وقت تشغيل مخصص","تطوير التطبيقات","حوسبة سحابية"]}},"owner":"KrystianYCSilva","repo":"hefesto-skill-generator","repoPath":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.480Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gcp-app-engine","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# GCP App Engine\n\nApp Engine was one of the first major PaaS offerings and established many modern managed deployment practices. This skill helps the agent choose the right environment, configure deployments safely, and operate services with predictable scaling.\n\n## How to choose Standard vs Flexible\n\n1. Prefer Standard for faster startup, stronger platform constraints, and lower ops overhead.\n2. Use Flexible when you need custom runtime/container behavior.\n3. Decide based on runtime constraints","body":"# GCP App Engine\n\nApp Engine was one of the first major PaaS offerings and established many modern managed deployment practices. This skill helps the agent choose the right environment, configure deployments safely, and operate services with predictable scaling.\n\n## How to choose Standard vs Flexible\n\n1. Prefer Standard for faster startup, stronger platform constraints, and lower ops overhead.\n2. Use Flexible when you need custom runtime/container behavior.\n3. Decide based on runtime constraints, scaling profile, and networking requirements.\n4. Keep environment choice explicit in architecture docs.\n\n## How to configure `app.yaml` correctly\n\n1. Set runtime (`java17` or supported runtime) and entrypoint strategy.\n2. Define instance class and scaling mode (automatic/basic/manual).\n3. Keep env vars externalized and secret values managed outside source.\n4. Add health check and resource settings aligned with workload characteristics.\n\n## How to manage versions and safe rollouts\n\n1. Deploy each release as a new version.\n2. Use traffic splitting for canary and phased rollout.\n3. Keep rollback path documented before promotion.\n4. Label versions with commit/release metadata.\n\n## How to structure services, routing, and schedules\n\n1. Split bounded services when independent scaling is needed.\n2. Use `dispatch.yaml` for centralized route control.\n3. Use `cron.yaml` for scheduled jobs and verify idempotency.\n4. For queued background workloads, prefer managed task services where appropriate.\n\n## How to operate App Engine in production\n\n1. Monitor latency, error rate, and instance behavior per version.\n2. Set alerts for quota, cold starts, and elevated error budgets.\n3. Validate IAM/service identity for outbound dependencies.\n4. Automate deployment through CI/CD with approval gates.\n\n## Common Warnings & Pitfalls\n\n- Treating App Engine as static infrastructure instead of versioned runtime.\n- Deploying without traffic split and rollback strategy.\n- Putting long CPU-intensive jobs in request path.\n- Hardcoding project IDs and environment-specific URLs.\n- Ignoring region and quota constraints during scale events.\n\n## Common Errors and Fixes\n\n| Symptom | Root Cause | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| Deployment succeeds but app fails health checks | Runtime/entrypoint mismatch | Align runtime config and verify startup command |\n| Unexpected costs after release | Oversized instance class or scaling policy | Re-tune scaling limits and right-size instances |\n| Requests routed to wrong service | Dispatch rules overlap | Review `dispatch.yaml` order and specificity |\n| Cron jobs duplicate work | Non-idempotent job logic | Add idempotency key/state guard in scheduled task |\n\n## Advanced Tips\n\n- Use gradual traffic migration with observability checkpoints per step.\n- Keep release notes linked to App Engine version labels.\n- Build synthetic probes for critical routes before traffic cutover.\n- For multi-service systems, define platform SLOs and ownership by service.\n\n## How to use extended references\n\n- Read [Version History](references/version-history.md) before upgrades, migrations, or compatibility decisions.\n- Read [Java and Kotlin Examples](references/java-kotlin-examples.md) for implementation-ready snippets and language-specific guidance.\n- Read [Advanced Techniques](references/advanced-techniques.md) for specialist playbooks, incident tactics, and performance patterns.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:43:46.112Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Deployment Agents requiring efficient management of Google Cloud Platform App Engine resources.","zh":"适用于需要高效管理 Google Cloud Platform App Engine 资源的云部署代理的理想选择。","ja":"Google Cloud Platform App Engine リソースの効率的な管理を必要とするクラウド デプロイ エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Google Cloud Platform App Engine 리소스의 효율적인 관리가 필요한 클라우드 배포 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de implementación en la nube que requieren una gestión eficiente de los recursos de Google Cloud Platform App Engine.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de déploiement Cloud nécessitant une gestion efficace des ressources de Google Cloud Platform App Engine.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Deployment-Agents, die eine effiziente Verwaltung von Google Cloud Platform App Engine-Ressourcen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de implantação em nuvem que exigem gerenciamento eficiente de recursos do Google Cloud Platform App Engine.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачной развертки, требующих эффективного управления ресурсами Google Cloud Platform App Engine.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق الوكيل السحابي الذي يتطلب إدارة فعالة لموارد منصة تطبيق جوجل كلاود"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure deployments safely, operate services with predictable scaling, and choose between Standard and Flexible environments based on runtime constraints, leveraging App Engine''s managed deployment practices and platform constraints.","zh":"赋予代理配置部署的安全能力、以可预测的方式扩展服务，并根据运行时约束在标准和灵活环境之间进行选择，利用 App Engine 的托管部署实践和平台约束。","ja":"エージェントにデプロイを安全に構成し、サービスを予測可能なスケーリングで操作し、ランタイムの制約に基づいて標準環境と柔軟な環境の間で選択する能力を与え、App Engine のマネージド デプロイの実践とプラットフォームの制約を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 배포를 안전하게 구성하고, 서비스를 예측 가능한 확장으로 운영하며, 런타임 제약에 따라 표준 환경과 유연한 환경 사이에서 선택할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, App Engine의 관리 배포 관행과 플랫폼 제약을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar implementaciones de forma segura, operar servicios con escalado predecible y elegir entre entornos Estándar y Flexibles en función de las restricciones de tiempo de ejecución, aprovechando las prácticas de implementación administrada de App Engine y las restricciones de plataforma.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer des déploiements de manière sécurisée, d''exploiter des services avec un scaling prévisible et de choisir entre des environnements Standard et Flexibles en fonction des contraintes de runtime, en exploitant les pratiques de déploiement gérées d''App Engine et les contraintes de plateforme.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Bereitstellungen sicher zu konfigurieren, Dienste mit vorhersehbarem Skalieren zu betreiben und zwischen Standard- und Flexiblen Umgebungen basierend auf Laufzeitbeschränkungen zu wählen, indem es die verwalteten Bereitstellungspraktiken von App Engine und die Plattformbeschränkungen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar implantações com segurança, operar serviços com dimensionamento previsível e escolher entre ambientes Padrão e Flexível com base em restrições de tempo de execução, aproveitando as práticas de implantação gerenciada do App Engine e restrições de plataforma.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настраивать развертки безопасно, эксплуатировать сервисы с предсказуемым масштабированием и выбирать между средами Standard и Flexible на основе ограничений времени выполнения, используя практики управления разверткой App Engine и ограничения платформы.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل تكوين التطبيقات بأمان وتشغيل الخدمات بتمديد متوقع واختيار بيئات بين معايير ومحددة وفقاً للقيود الزمنية لتشغيل، مستفيداً من ممارسات تطبيق الإدارة المدارة والإعتبارات المنصة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating deployment choices between Standard and Flexible environments","Configuring secure deployments with strong platform constraints","Optimizing service scaling for predictable performance"],"zh":["自动在标准和灵活环境之间进行部署选择","使用强大的平台约束配置安全部署","优化服务扩展以获得可预测的性能"],"ja":["標準環境と柔軟な環境の間でデプロイの選択を自動化する","強力なプラットフォームの制約を使用してセキュアなデプロイを構成する","サービスを予測可能なパフォーマンスでスケーリングするための最適化"],"ko":["표준 환경과 유연한 환경 사이에서 배포 선택을 자동화하는 것","강력한 플랫폼 제약을 사용하여 보안 배포를 구성하는 것","예측 가능한 성능을 위한 서비스 확장 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar elecciones de implementación entre entornos Estándar y Flexibles","Configurar implementaciones seguras con fuertes restricciones de plataforma","Optimizar el escalado de servicios para un rendimiento predecible"],"fr":["Automatiser les choix de déploiement entre les environnements Standard et Flexibles","Configurer des déploiements sécurisés avec des contraintes de plateforme fortes","Optimiser le scaling des services pour des performances prévisibles"],"de":["Automatisieren von Bereitstellungsentscheidungen zwischen Standard- und Flexiblen Umgebungen","Konfigurieren von sicheren Bereitstellungen mit starken Plattformbeschränkungen","Optimieren des Skalierens von Diensten für vorhersehbare Leistung"],"pt":["Automatizar escolhas de implantação entre ambientes Padrão e Flexível","Configurar implantações seguras com fortes restrições de plataforma","Otimizar dimensionamento de serviço para desempenho previsível"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выбор развертки между средами Standard и Flexible","Настроить безопасные развертки с сильными ограничениями платформы","Оптимизировать масштабирование сервиса для предсказуемой производительности"],"ar":["تحويل خيارات التطبيق بين بيئات معايير ومحددة","تكوين التطبيقات الآمنة بقواعد منصة قوية","تحسين التمديد الخدمي لأداء متوقع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google Cloud Platform account","Limited to App Engine''s managed deployment practices"],"zh":["需要 Google Cloud Platform 账户","仅限 App Engine 的托管部署实践"],"ja":["Google Cloud Platform アカウントが必要","App Engine のマネージド デプロイの実践のみに限定される"],"ko":["Google Cloud Platform 계정이 필요","App Engine의 관리 배포 관행만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Google Cloud Platform","Limitado a las prácticas de implementación administrada de App Engine"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Google Cloud Platform","Limité aux pratiques de déploiement gérées d''App Engine"],"de":["Erfordert ein Google Cloud Platform-Konto","Begrenzt auf die verwalteten Bereitstellungspraktiken von App Engine"],"pt":["Exige conta do Google Cloud Platform","Limitado às práticas de implantação gerenciada do App Engine"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Google Cloud Platform","Ограничен практиками управления разверткой App Engine"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب منصة جوجل كلاود","محدود بممارسات تطبيق الإدارة المدارة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
