","Contratos explícitos para interfaces y flujos de datos"],"fr":["Principes de conception de logiciels","Modèles de conception","Attributs de qualité","Raisonnement de compensation","Définition d''architecture et de limites","Contrats explicites pour les interfaces et les flux de données"],"de":["Software-Design-Prinzipien","Entwurfsmuster","Qualitätsattribute","Abwägungsraisonnement","Definition von Architektur und Grenzen","Explizite Verträge für Schnittstellen und Datenflüsse"],"pt":["Princípios de desenho de software","Padrões de desenho de software","Atributos de qualidade","Raciocínio de troca","Definição de arquitetura e limites","Compatibilidade e infraestrutura"],"ru":["Принципы проектирования программного обеспечения","Шаблоны проектирования программного обеспечения","Атрибуты качества","Обоснование компромиссов","Определение архитектуры и границ","Совместимость и инфраструктура"],"ar":["مبادئ تصميم البرمجيات","أنماط تصميم البرمجيات","سمات الجودة","منطق التبادل","تعريف الهندسة والحدود","التوافق والبنية التحتية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["软件设计","设计原则","模式适配","质量属性","架构决策","实现一致性","操作可靠性","软件开发"],"ja":["ソフトウェア設計","設計原則","パターン適合","品質属性","設計の決定","実装の一貫性","操作の信頼性","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["소프트웨어 디자인","디자인 원칙","패턴 적합","품질 속성","아키텍처 결정","구현 일관성","운영 신뢰성","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["diseño de software","arquitectura de software","principios de diseño","patrones de diseño","atributos de calidad","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","diseño de sistemas"],"fr":["conception de logiciels","architecture de logiciels","principes de conception","modèles de conception","attributs de qualité","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","conception de systèmes"],"de":["Software-Design","Software-Architektur","Design-Prinzipien","Entwurfsmuster","Qualitätsattribute","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","System-Design"],"pt":["desenho de software","arquitetura de software","padrões de desenho","princípios de desenho","atributos de qualidade","raciocínio de troca","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["проектирование программного обеспечения","архитектура программного обеспечения","шаблоны проектирования","принципы проектирования","атрибуты качества","обоснование компромиссов","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تصميم البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","أنماط تصميم","مبادئ تصميم","سمات الجودة","منطق التبادل","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"KrystianYCSilva","repo":"hefesto-skill-generator","repoPath":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"software-design","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Software Design\n\nThis skill supports professional execution in: design principles, pattern fit, quality attributes, and tradeoff reasoning.\nUse it to keep architecture decisions explicit, implementation consistent, and operations reliable.\n\n## How to define architecture and boundaries\n\n- Establish explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership.\n- Keep domain behavior separate from infrastructure details and framework glue.\n- Define compatibility policy before introducing sch","body":"# Software Design\n\nThis skill supports professional execution in: design principles, pattern fit, quality attributes, and tradeoff reasoning.\nUse it to keep architecture decisions explicit, implementation consistent, and operations reliable.\n\n## How to define architecture and boundaries\n\n- Establish explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership.\n- Keep domain behavior separate from infrastructure details and framework glue.\n- Define compatibility policy before introducing schema or contract changes.\n- Document tradeoffs and decisions in architecture records.\n\n## How to implement with Java and Kotlin\n\n- Prefer constructor injection and explicit DTOs in service boundaries.\n- Enforce nullability and serialization consistency between Java and Kotlin modules.\n- Keep cross-module interfaces small, typed, and version-aware.\n- Add contract tests for external integrations and critical internal boundaries.\n\n## How to operate and harden in production\n\n- Define SLOs and alert thresholds tied to user-facing outcomes.\n- Implement staged rollout and rollback strategy for every critical change.\n- Track dependency saturation, retries, and failure amplification indicators.\n- Keep runbooks updated with tested mitigation steps.\n\n## How to use extended references\n\n- Read [Version History](references/version-history.md) before upgrades, migrations, or compatibility decisions.\n- Read [Java and Kotlin Examples](references/java-kotlin-examples.md) for implementation-ready snippets and language-specific guidance.\n- Read [Advanced Techniques](references/advanced-techniques.md) for specialist playbooks, incident tactics, and performance patterns.\n\n## Common Warnings & Pitfalls\n\n- Architecture decisions are implicit and undocumented, causing long-term drift.\n- Operational controls are added late, increasing incident recovery time.\n- Compatibility strategy is missing for evolving integrations and schemas.\n- Quality gates are inconsistent across environments and release stages.\n\n## Common Errors and Fixes\n\n| Symptom | Root Cause | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| Production regression after deployment | Configuration or contract drift across environments | Add compatibility checks, staged rollout, and rollback criteria. |\n| Latency spikes under load | Missing timeout and backpressure policies | Define budgets, tune pools, and monitor saturation indicators. |\n| Integration failures after change | Versioning and contract tests not enforced | Apply contract governance and CI compatibility gates. |\n\n## Keywords\n\n- SOLID\n- cohesion\n- coupling\n- design patterns\n- architecture decisions\n\n## References\n\n- [Official Documentation](https://martinfowler.com/architecture/)\n- [Official Documentation](https://refactoring.guru/design-patterns)\n- [Official Documentation](https://c4model.com/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:44:25.988Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Architecture Agents requiring standardized design principles and pattern fit analysis.","zh":"适用于需要标准化设计原则和模式拟合分析的架构代理。","ja":"標準化された設計原則とパターンフィット分析を必要とするアーキテクチャエージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 디자인 원칙과 패턴 피팅 분석이 필요한 아키텍처 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitectura que requieren principios de diseño estandarizados y análisis de ajuste de patrones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''architecture nécessitant des principes de conception standardisés et une analyse d''ajustement de modèles.","de":"Ideal für Architekturagenten, die standardisierte Designprinzipien und Musteranpassungsanalyse erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitetura que requerem princípios de design padronizados e análise de ajuste de padrão.","ru":"Идеально для Архитектурных Агентов, требующих стандартизированных принципов дизайна и анализа соответствия шаблонов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الهيكلة الذي يتطلب مبادئ تصميم معيارية وتحليل تناسب الأنماط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership, ensuring consistent implementation and reliable operations through quality attributes and tradeoff reasoning, all following the agentskills.io standard.","zh":"赋予代理定义核心接口、数据流和所有权的明确合同，通过质量属性和权衡推理确保一致的实现和可靠的操作，所有这些都遵循agentskills.io标准。","ja":"コアインターフェイス、データフロー、および所有権の明示的な契約を定義することで、エージェントをエンパワーメントし、品質属性およびトレードオフの推論を通じて、一貫した実装および信頼性の高い運用を確保します。これらはすべて、agentskills.io標準に従います。","ko":"코어 인터페이스, 데이터 흐름 및 소유권에 대한 명시적인 계약을 정의함으로써 에이전트를 강화하여, 품질 속성 및 트레이드 오프 추론을 통해 일관된 구현 및 신뢰할 수 있는 작동을 보장합니다. 모든 것은 에이전츠 스킬즈 아이오 표준을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir contratos explícitos para interfaces principales, flujos de datos y propiedad, garantizando una implementación coherente y operaciones fiables a través de atributos de calidad y razonamiento de compensaciones, todo siguiendo el estándar agentskills.io.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des contrats explicites pour les interfaces principales, les flux de données et la propriété, garantissant une mise en œuvre cohérente et des opérations fiables via des attributs de qualité et un raisonnement de compensation, le tout suivant la norme agentskills.io.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, explizite Verträge für Kernschnittstellen, Datenflüsse und Eigentum zu definieren, wodurch eine konsistente Implementierung und zuverlässige Betriebsabläufe durch Qualitätsmerkmale und Kompromissbetrachtungen sichergestellt werden, und all dies unter Einhaltung des agentskills.io-Standards.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir contratos explícitos para interfaces centrais, fluxos de dados e propriedade, garantindo implementação consistente e operações confiáveis por meio de atributos de qualidade e raciocínio de compromisso, todos seguindo o padrão agentskills.io.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять явные контракты для основных интерфейсов, потоков данных и владения, обеспечивая последовательную реализацию и надежные операции посредством атрибутов качества и рассуждений о компромиссах, все в соответствии со стандартом agentskills.io.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تحديد عقود صريحة ل_interfaces المركزية و تدفقات البيانات و الملكية، و ضمان التنفيذ الثابت و العمليات الموثوقة من خلال سمات الجودة و التفكير في المساومة، و كل ذلك يتبع معيار agentskills.io."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining architecture and boundaries for multi-CLI IA systems","Establishing explicit contracts for core interfaces and data flows","Keeping domain behavior separate from infrastructure details and framework glue"],"zh":["为多CLI IA系统定义架构和边界","为核心接口和数据流建立明确的合同","将域行为与基础设施详细信息和框架胶水分开"],"ja":["マルチCLI IAシステムのアーキテクチャと境界の定義","コアインターフェイスとデータフローの明示的な契約の確立","ドメインの動作をインフラストラクチャの詳細とフレームワークのグルの詳細から分離する"],"ko":["다중 CLI IA 시스템을 위한 아키텍처 및 경계의 정의","코어 인터페이스 및 데이터 흐름에 대한 명시적인 계약의 설정","도메인 행동을 인프라스트럭처 세부 정보 및 프레임워크 글루와 분리"],"es":["Definir arquitectura y límites para sistemas de IA multi-CLI","Establecer contratos explícitos para interfaces principales y flujos de datos","Mantener el comportamiento de dominio separado de los detalles de infraestructura y pegamento de framework"],"fr":["Définir l''architecture et les limites pour les systèmes IA multi-CLI","Établir des contrats explicites pour les interfaces principales et les flux de données","Garder le comportement de domaine séparé des détails d''infrastructure et de la colle de framework"],"de":["Architektur und Grenzen für Multi-CLI-KI-Systeme definieren","Explizite Verträge für Kernschnittstellen und Datenflüsse festlegen","Domänenverhalten von Infrastrukturdetails und Framework-Klebstoff trennen"],"pt":["Definir arquitetura e limites para sistemas IA de multi-CLI","Estabelecer contratos explícitos para interfaces centrais e fluxos de dados","Manter comportamento de domínio separado de detalhes de infraestrutura e cola de framework"],"ru":["Определение архитектуры и границ для систем ИИ с несколькими CLI","Установление явных контрактов для основных интерфейсов и потоков данных","Сохранение поведения домена отдельно от деталей инфраструктуры и склеивания фреймворка"],"ar":["تحديد هيكلة و حدود لنظم الذكاء الاصطناعي متعددة CLI","إعداد عقود صريحة لمواجهات المركزية و تدفقات البيانات","الحفاظ على سلوك المجال منفصل عن تفاصيل البنية التحتية و لاصق الإطار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to agentskills.io standard","Assumes knowledge of design principles and pattern fit analysis"],"zh":["需要遵循agentskills.io标准","假设对设计原则和模式拟合分析有所了解"],"ja":["agentskills.io標準に従う必要がある","設計原則とパターンフィット分析の知識を前提とする"],"ko":["에이전츠 스킬즈 아이오 표준을 따라야 함","디자인 원칙 및 패턴 피팅 분석에 대한 지식을 전제로 함"],"es":["Requiere adherirse al estándar agentskills.io","Supone conocimiento de principios de diseño y análisis de ajuste de patrones"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à la norme agentskills.io","Suppose une connaissance des principes de conception et de l''analyse d''ajustement de modèles"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des agentskills.io-Standards","Geht von Kenntnissen in Designprinzipien und Musteranpassungsanalyse aus"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao padrão agentskills.io","Pressupõe conhecimento de princípios de design e análise de ajuste de padrão"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения стандарта agentskills.io","Предполагает знание принципов дизайна и анализа соответствия шаблонов"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمعيار agentskills.io","يفترض معرفة مبادئ التصميم وتحليل تناسب الأنماط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('simorgh3196/tsuzulint/m07-concurrency', 'community', 'simorgh3196', 'tsuzulint', 'simorgh3196/tsuzulint', 'm07-concurrency', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z', '2026-02-18T09:44:32.952Z', NULL, '{"id":"simorgh3196/tsuzulint/m07-concurrency","name":"m07-concurrency","description":{"zh":"m07-concurrency是一种高性能自然语言校验工具，使用Rust编写，灵感来自textlint","ja":"m07-concurrencyは、高性能な自然言語リントツールで、Rustで記述されており、textlintにインスパイアされています","ko":"m07-concurrency는 고성능 자연어 린터로 Rust로 작성되었으며 textlint에서 영감을 받았습니다","es":"La concurrencia en Rust es crucial para el rendimiento. Aprende a elegir los primitivos de concurrencia adecuados para tu workload","fr":"La concurrence dans Rust est essentielle pour les performances. Apprenez à choisir les primitives de concurrence appropriées pour votre workload","de":"Konkurrenz in Rust ist entscheidend für die Leistung. Lernen Sie, die richtigen Konkurrenzprimitiven für Ihre Workload auszuwählen","pt":"O m07-concurrency é uma ferramenta de linting de linguagem natural de alto desempenho, escrita em Rust, inspirada no textlint.","ru":"M07-concurrency - это высокопроизводительный инструмент для проверки языка, написанный на Rust, вдохновленный textlint.","ar":"m07-concurrency هو أداة فحص لغة طبيعية عالية الأداء، مكتوبة بلغة روست، مستوحاة من textlint.","en":"A high-performance natural language linter written in Rust, inspired by textlint."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"并发性m07-concurrency：高性能自然语言校验","ja":"m07-concurrency：高性能自然言語リント","ko":"m07-concurrency: 고성능 자연어 린터","es":"Concurrencia en Rust: Optimización de Rendimiento","fr":"Concurrence en Rust: Optimisation des Performances","de":"Konkurrenz in Rust: Leistungsoptimierung","pt":"Concorrência de Alto Desempenho com m07-concurrency","ru":"Высокопроизводительная конкуренция с m07-concurrency","ar":"تزامن أداء عالٍ مع m07-concurrency","en":"m07-concurrency"},"description":{"zh":"m07-concurrency是一种高性能自然语言校验工具，使用Rust编写，灵感来自textlint","ja":"m07-concurrencyは、高性能な自然言語リントツールで、Rustで記述されており、textlintにインスパイアされています","ko":"m07-concurrency는 고성능 자연어 린터로 Rust로 작성되었으며 textlint에서 영감을 받았습니다","es":"La concurrencia en Rust es crucial para el rendimiento. Aprende a elegir los primitivos de concurrencia adecuados para tu workload","fr":"La concurrence dans Rust est essentielle pour les performances. Apprenez à choisir les primitives de concurrence appropriées pour votre workload","de":"Konkurrenz in Rust ist entscheidend für die Leistung. Lernen Sie, die richtigen Konkurrenzprimitiven für Ihre Workload auszuwählen","pt":"O m07-concurrency é uma ferramenta de linting de linguagem natural de alto desempenho, escrita em Rust, inspirada no textlint.","ru":"M07-concurrency - это высокопроизводительный инструмент для проверки языка, написанный на Rust, вдохновленный textlint.","ar":"m07-concurrency هو أداة فحص لغة طبيعية عالية الأداء، مكتوبة بلغة روست، مستوحاة من textlint.","en":"A high-performance natural language linter written in Rust, inspired by textlint."},"definition":{"en":"A high-performance natural language linter written in Rust, inspired by textlint."},"features":{"zh":["高性能自然语言校验","Rust编写","灵感来自textlint","并发性检查","线程安全要求"],"ja":["高性能な自然言語リント","Rustで記述","textlintにインスパイア","並行性チェック","スレッドセーフ要件"],"ko":["고성능 자연어 린터","Rust로 작성","textlint에서 영감","병렬성 확인","스레드 안전 요구 사항"],"es":["Elegir los primitivos de concurrencia adecuados","Comprender el modelo de compartición de datos","Garantizar la seguridad del hilo","Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación","Manejar errores comunes de concurrencia"],"fr":["Choisir les primitives de concurrence appropriées","Comprendre le modèle de partage de données","Assurer la sécurité du thread","Optimiser les performances de l''application","Gérer les erreurs courantes de concurrence"],"de":["Auswahl der richtigen Konkurrenzprimitiven","Verständnis des Datenfreigabemodells","Sicherstellung der Thread-Sicherheit","Optimierung der Anwendungsleistung","Behandlung von häufigen Konkurrenzfehlern"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho","Identificação de problemas de concorrência","Compartilhamento de dados seguro","Suporte a threads","Escrita em Rust","Inspirada no textlint"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности","Обнаружение проблем конкуренции","Безопасное обмен данными","Поддержка потоков","Написана на Rust","Вдохновлена textlint"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","تحديد مشاكل التزامن","مشاركة البيانات بأمان","دعم الخيوط","مكتوبة بلغة روست","مستوحاة من textlint"]},"keywords":{"zh":["m07-concurrency","自然语言校验","Rust","并发性","线程安全","高性能","textlint"],"ja":["m07-concurrency","自然言語リント","Rust","並行性","スレッドセーフ","高性能","textlint"],"ko":["m07-concurrency","자연어 린터","Rust","병렬성","스레드 안전","고성능","textlint"],"es":["concurrencia en Rust","programación paralela","primitivas de concurrencia","seguridad del hilo","optimización de rendimiento","errores de concurrencia","Rust y concurrencia"],"fr":["concurrence dans Rust","programmation parallèle","primitives de concurrence","sécurité du thread","optimisation des performances","erreurs de concurrence","Rust et concurrence"],"de":["Konkurrenz in Rust","parallele Programmierung","Konkurrenzprimitiven","Thread-Sicherheit","Leistungsoptimierung","Konkurrenzfehler","Rust und Konkurrenz"],"pt":["concorrência","desempenho","linting","linguagem natural","Rust","textlint","otimização","threads","compartilhamento de dados"],"ru":["конкуренция","производительность","linting","естественный язык","Rust","textlint","оптимизация","потоки","обмен данными"],"ar":["تزامن","أداء","فحص","لغة طبيعية","روست","textlint","تحسين","خيوط","مشاركة البيانات"]}},"owner":"simorgh3196","repo":"tsuzulint","repoPath":"simorgh3196/tsuzulint","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m07-concurrency","description":"CRITICAL: Use for concurrency/async. Triggers: E0277 Send Sync, cannot be sent between threads, thread, spawn, channel, mpsc, Mutex, RwLock, Atomic, async, await, Future, tokio, deadlock, race condition, 并发, 线程, 异步, 死锁","bodyPreview":"# Concurrency\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Is this CPU-bound or I/O-bound, and what''s the sharing model?**\n\nBefore choosing concurrency primitives:\n- What''s the workload type?\n- What data needs to be shared?\n- What''s the thread safety requirement?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0277 Send | \"Add Send bound\" | Should this type cross threads? |\n| E0277 Sync | \"Wrap in Mutex\" | Is share","body":"# Concurrency\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Is this CPU-bound or I/O-bound, and what''s the sharing model?**\n\nBefore choosing concurrency primitives:\n- What''s the workload type?\n- What data needs to be shared?\n- What''s the thread safety requirement?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0277 Send | \"Add Send bound\" | Should this type cross threads? |\n| E0277 Sync | \"Wrap in Mutex\" | Is shared access really needed? |\n| Future not Send | \"Use spawn_local\" | Is async the right choice? |\n| Deadlock | \"Reorder locks\" | Is the locking design correct? |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore adding concurrency:\n\n1. **What''s the workload?**\n   - CPU-bound → threads (std::thread, rayon)\n   - I/O-bound → async (tokio, async-std)\n   - Mixed → hybrid approach\n\n2. **What''s the sharing model?**\n   - No sharing → message passing (channels)\n   - Immutable sharing → Arc<T>\n   - Mutable sharing → Arc<Mutex<T>> or Arc<RwLock<T>>\n\n3. **What are the Send/Sync requirements?**\n   - Cross-thread ownership → Send\n   - Cross-thread references → Sync\n   - Single-thread async → spawn_local\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑ (MANDATORY)\n\n**CRITICAL**: Don''t just fix the error. Trace UP to find domain constraints.\n\n### Domain Detection Table\n\n| Context Keywords | Load Domain Skill | Key Constraint |\n|-----------------|-------------------|----------------|\n| Web API, HTTP, axum, actix, handler | **domain-web** | Handlers run on any thread |\n| 交易, 支付, trading, payment | **domain-fintech** | Audit + thread safety |\n| gRPC, kubernetes, microservice | **domain-cloud-native** | Distributed tracing |\n| CLI, terminal, clap | **domain-cli** | Usually single-thread OK |\n\n### Example: Web API + Rc Error\n\n```\n\"Rc cannot be sent between threads\" in Web API context\n    ↑ DETECT: \"Web API\" → Load domain-web\n    ↑ FIND: domain-web says \"Shared state must be thread-safe\"\n    ↑ FIND: domain-web says \"Rc in state\" is Common Mistake\n    ↓ DESIGN: Use Arc<T> with State extractor\n    ↓ IMPL: axum::extract::State<Arc<AppConfig>>\n```\n\n### Generic Trace\n\n```\n\"Send not satisfied for my type\"\n    ↑ Ask: What domain is this? Load domain-* skill\n    ↑ Ask: Does this type need to cross thread boundaries?\n    ↑ Check: m09-domain (is the data model correct?)\n```\n\n| Situation | Trace To | Question |\n|-----------|----------|----------|\n| Send/Sync in Web | **domain-web** | What''s the state management pattern? |\n| Send/Sync in CLI | **domain-cli** | Is multi-thread really needed? |\n| Mutex vs channels | m09-domain | Shared state or message passing? |\n| Async vs threads | m10-performance | What''s the workload profile? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nFrom design to implementation:\n\n```\n\"Need parallelism for CPU work\"\n    ↓ Use: std::thread or rayon\n\n\"Need concurrency for I/O\"\n    ↓ Use: async/await with tokio\n\n\"Need to share immutable data across threads\"\n    ↓ Use: Arc<T>\n\n\"Need to share mutable data across threads\"\n    ↓ Use: Arc<Mutex<T>> or Arc<RwLock<T>>\n    ↓ Or: channels for message passing\n\n\"Need simple atomic operations\"\n    ↓ Use: AtomicBool, AtomicUsize, etc.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Send/Sync Markers\n\n| Marker | Meaning | Example |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `Send` | Can transfer ownership between threads | Most types |\n| `Sync` | Can share references between threads | `Arc<T>` |\n| `!Send` | Must stay on one thread | `Rc<T>` |\n| `!Sync` | No shared refs across threads | `RefCell<T>` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern | Thread-Safe | Blocking | Use When |\n|---------|-------------|----------|----------|\n| `std::thread` | Yes | Yes | CPU-bound parallelism |\n| `async/await` | Yes | No | I/O-bound concurrency |\n| `Mutex<T>` | Yes | Yes | Shared mutable state |\n| `RwLock<T>` | Yes | Yes | Read-heavy shared state |\n| `mpsc::channel` | Yes | Optional | Message passing |\n| `Arc<Mutex<T>>` | Yes | Yes | Shared mutable across threads |\n\n## Decision Flowchart\n\n```\nWhat type of work?\n├─ CPU-bound → std::thread or rayon\n├─ I/O-bound → async/await\n└─ Mixed → hybrid (spawn_blocking)\n\nNeed to share data?\n├─ No → message passing (channels)\n├─ Immutable → Arc<T>\n└─ Mutable →\n   ├─ Read-heavy → Arc<RwLock<T>>\n   └─ Write-heavy → Arc<Mutex<T>>\n   └─ Simple counter → AtomicUsize\n\nAsync context?\n├─ Type is Send → tokio::spawn\n├─ Type is !Send → spawn_local\n└─ Blocking code → spawn_blocking\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| E0277 `Send` not satisfied | Non-Send in async | Use Arc or spawn_local |\n| E0277 `Sync` not satisfied | Non-Sync shared | Wrap with Mutex |\n| Deadlock | Lock ordering | Consistent lock order |\n| `future is not Send` | Non-Send across await | Drop before await |\n| `MutexGuard` across await | Guard held during suspend | Scope guard properly |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Why Bad | Better |\n|--------------|---------|--------|\n| Arc<Mutex<T>> everywhere | Contention, complexity | Message passing |\n| thread::sleep in async | Blocks executor | tokio::time::sleep |\n| Holding locks across await | Blocks other tasks | Scope locks tightly |\n| Ignoring deadlock risk | Hard to debug | Lock ordering, try_lock |\n\n---\n\n## Async-Specific Patterns\n\n### Avoid MutexGuard Across Await\n\n```rust\n// Bad: guard held across await\nlet guard = mutex.lock().await;\ndo_async().await;  // guard still held!\n\n// Good: scope the lock\n{\n    let guard = mutex.lock().await;\n    // use guard\n}  // guard dropped\ndo_async().await;\n```\n\n### Non-Send Types in Async\n\n```rust\n// Rc is !Send, can''t cross await in spawned task\n// Option 1: use Arc instead\n// Option 2: use spawn_local (single-thread runtime)\n// Option 3: ensure Rc is dropped before .await\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Smart pointer choice | m02-resource |\n| Interior mutability | m03-mutability |\n| Performance tuning | m10-performance |\n| Domain concurrency needs | domain-* |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:44:32.952Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multithreaded Agents needing high-performance concurrency control with Rust","zh":"非常适合需要高性能并发控制的多线程代理，使用Rust语言","ja":"マルチスレッドエージェントが高性能なコンカレンシーコントロールを必要とする場合に最適です。Rustを使用します","ko":"고성능 병렬 제어가 필요한 멀티스레드 에이전트에게 적합하며, Rust를 사용합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes multihilo que necesitan un control de concurrencia de alto rendimiento con Rust","fr":"Parfait pour les agents multithreads nécessitant un contrôle de concurrence haute performance avec Rust","de":"Perfekt für multithreaded Agents, die eine Hochleistungs-Konkurrenzsteuerung mit Rust benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Multithreaded que necessitam de controle de concorrência de alto desempenho com Rust","ru":"Идеально для многопоточных агентов, требующих высокопроизводительного контроля согласованности с помощью Rust","ar":"مثالي للموكلين المتعددين الخيوط الذين يحتاجون إلى تحكم متوازي عالي الأداء مع Rust"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage CPU-bound and I/O-bound workloads using concurrency primitives, ensuring thread safety with Send and Sync bounds, and leveraging libraries like textlint for natural language linting","zh":"赋予代理管理CPU绑定和I/O绑定工作负载的能力，使用并发原语，确保线程安全性通过Send和Sync边界，并利用类似textlint的库进行自然语言linting","ja":"エージェントがCPUバウンドとI/Oバウンドのワークロードを管理する機能を提供します。コンカレンシープリミティブを使用して、SendとSyncの境界でスレッドセーフティを確保し、textlintなどのライブラリを使用して自然言語のlintingを行います","ko":"에이전트가 CPU 바운드와 I/O 바운드 작업負荷를 관리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 동시성 원시를 사용하여 Send와 Sync 경계에서 스레드 안전성을 보장하며, textlint와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 자연어 linting을 수행합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar cargas de trabajo limitadas por CPU y E/S utilizando primitivas de concurrencia, garantizando la seguridad de los hilos con límites Send y Sync, y aprovechando bibliotecas como textlint para la revisión de lenguaje natural","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les charges de travail liées au processeur et à l''E/S en utilisant des primitives de concurrence, en garantissant la sécurité des threads avec les limites Send et Sync, et en exploitant des bibliothèques comme textlint pour la mise en forme de langage naturel","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, CPU- und E/A-gebundene Arbeitslasten mithilfe von Konkurrenzprimitiven zu verwalten, die Thread-Sicherheit mit Send- und Sync-Grenzen sicherzustellen und Bibliotheken wie textlint für die Überprüfung von Natürlichen Sprachen zu nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar cargas de trabalho limitadas por CPU e E/S usando primitivas de concorrência, garantindo a segurança do thread com limites Send e Sync, e utilizando bibliotecas como textlint para linting de linguagem natural","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять задачами, ограниченными CPU и вводом/выводом, с помощью примитивов согласованности, обеспечивая безопасность потоков с помощью ограничений Send и Sync, и использует библиотеки zoals textlint для проверки自然ного языка","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة حمولة العمل المحددة بواسطة وحدة المعالجة المركزية والإدخال/الإخراج باستخدام بدائيات التزامن، وضمان سلامة الخيط مع حدود الإرسال والتنظيم، واستخدام المكتبات مثل textlint للتحقق من اللغة الطبيعية"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging concurrency-related errors with E0277 Send and Sync","Optimizing workload performance by identifying CPU-bound or I/O-bound tasks","Ensuring thread safety in multithreaded applications with Mutex and Rust"],"zh":["使用E0277 Send和Sync调试与并发性相关的错误","通过识别CPU绑定或I/O绑定任务来优化工作负载性能","使用Mutex和Rust在多线程应用中确保线程安全性"],"ja":["E0277 SendとSyncを使用してコンカレンシーエラーをデバッグする","CPUバウンドまたはI/Oバウンドのタスクを識別してワークロードのパフォーマンスを最適化する","MutexとRustを使用してマルチスレッドアプリケーションでスレッドセーフティを確保する"],"ko":["E0277 Send와 Sync를 사용하여 병렬성 관련 오류를 디버깅합니다","CPU 바운드 또는 I/O 바운드 작업을 식별하여 작업負荷 성능을 최적화합니다","Mutex와 Rust를 사용하여 멀티스레드 애플리케이션에서 스레드 안전성을 보장합니다"],"es":["Depuración de errores relacionados con la concurrencia con E0277 Send y Sync","Optimización del rendimiento de la carga de trabajo identificando tareas limitadas por CPU o E/S","Garantía de la seguridad de los hilos en aplicaciones multihilo con Mutex y Rust"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs liés à la concurrence avec E0277 Send et Sync","Optimisation des performances de la charge de travail en identifiant les tâches liées au processeur ou à l''E/S","Assurance de la sécurité des threads dans les applications multithreads avec Mutex et Rust"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Konkurrenzfehlern mit E0277 Send und Sync","Optimierung der Arbeitslastenleistung durch Identifizierung von CPU- oder E/A-gebundenen Aufgaben","Sicherstellung der Thread-Sicherheit in multithreaded Anwendungen mit Mutex und Rust"],"pt":["Depurar erros relacionados à concorrência com E0277 Send e Sync","Otimizar o desempenho da carga de trabalho identificando tarefas limitadas por CPU ou E/S","Garantir a segurança do thread em aplicações multithreaded com Mutex e Rust"],"ru":["Отладка ошибок, связанных с согласованностью, с помощью E0277 Send и Sync","Оптимизация производительности рабочей нагрузки путем определения задач, ограниченных CPU или вводом/выводом","Обеспечение безопасности потоков в многопоточных приложениях с помощью Mutex и Rust"],"ar":["تصحيح الأخطاء المتعلقة بالتزامن باستخدام E0277 Send و Sync","تحسين أداء حمولة العمل بالتحقق من المهام المحددة بواسطة وحدة المعالجة المركزية أو الإدخال/الإخراج","ضمان سلامة الخيط في التطبيقات متعددة الخيوط مع Mutex و Rust"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming knowledge","Limited to CPU-bound and I/O-bound workloads","Textlint library dependency"],"zh":["需要Rust编程知识","仅限CPU绑定和I/O绑定工作负载","依赖textlint库"],"ja":["Rustプログラミングの知識が必要","CPUバウンドとI/Oバウンドのワークロードのみ","textlintライブラリの依存"],"ko":["Rust 프로그래밍 지식이 필요합니다","CPU 바운드와 I/O 바운드 작업負荷만 해당합니다","textlint 라이브러리 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de programación en Rust","Limitado a cargas de trabajo limitadas por CPU y E/S","Dependencia de la biblioteca textlint"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en programmation Rust","Limité aux charges de travail liées au processeur et à l''E/S","Dépendance de la bibliothèque textlint"],"de":["Benötigt Rust-Programmierkenntnisse","Begrenzt auf CPU- und E/A-gebundene Arbeitslasten","Abhängigkeit von der Bibliothek textlint"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de programação Rust","Limitado a cargas de trabalho limitadas por CPU e E/S","Dependência da biblioteca textlint"],"ru":["Требует знаний программирования на Rust","Ограничен задачами, ограниченными CPU и вводом/выводом","Зависимость от библиотеки textlint"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة لغة برمجة Rust","محدود بحمولة العمل المحددة بواسطة وحدة المعالجة المركزية والإدخال/الإخراج","اعتماد المكتبة textlint"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('heinschulie/babylon/domain', 'community', 'heinschulie', 'babylon', 'heinschulie/babylon', 'domain', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z', '2026-02-18T09:44:44.497Z', NULL, '{"id":"heinschulie/babylon/domain","name":"domain","description":{"zh":"Railway域管理工具允许开发者添加、查看或删除服务域，支持自定义域名和生成Railway提供的域名","ja":"Railwayドメイン管理ツールは、開発者がサービスドメインを追加、表示、または削除できるようにし、カスタムドメインとRailway提供のドメインの生成をサポートします","ko":"Railway 도메인 관리 도구는 개발자가 서비스 도메인을 추가, 보기 또는 삭제할 수 있도록 하며, 커스텀 도메인 및 Railway에서 제공하는 도메인 생성을 지원합니다","es":"La gestión de dominios para Railway permite agregar, ver o eliminar dominios para servicios. Puedes generar dominios personalizados y obtener URLs","fr":"La gestion de domaines pour Railway permet d''ajouter, d''afficher ou de supprimer des domaines pour les services. Vous pouvez générer des domaines personnalisés et obtenir des URL","de":"Das Domain-Management für Railway ermöglicht es, Domains für Dienste hinzuzufügen, anzuzeigen oder zu entfernen. Sie können benutzerdefinierte Domains generieren und URLs abrufen","pt":"O gerenciamento de domínio Railway permite adicionar, visualizar ou remover domínios para serviços Railway de forma eficiente.","ru":"Управление доменами Railway позволяет добавлять, просматривать или удалять домены для сервисов Railway эффективно.","ar":"تتيح إدارة المجال Railway إضافة أو عرض أو إزالة المجالات لخدمات Railway بفعالية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"域管理工具：添加、查看或删除Railway服务域","ja":"ドメイン管理ツール：Railwayサービスドメインの追加、表示、削除","ko":"도메인 관리 도구: Railway 서비스 도메인 추가, 보기, 삭제","es":"Gestión de dominios para Railway","fr":"Gestion de domaines pour Railway","de":"Domain-Management für Railway","pt":"Gerenciamento de Domínio Railway","ru":"Управление доменами Railway","ar":"إدارة المجال Railway","en":"domain"},"description":{"zh":"Railway域管理工具允许开发者添加、查看或删除服务域，支持自定义域名和生成Railway提供的域名","ja":"Railwayドメイン管理ツールは、開発者がサービスドメインを追加、表示、または削除できるようにし、カスタムドメインとRailway提供のドメインの生成をサポートします","ko":"Railway 도메인 관리 도구는 개발자가 서비스 도메인을 추가, 보기 또는 삭제할 수 있도록 하며, 커스텀 도메인 및 Railway에서 제공하는 도메인 생성을 지원합니다","es":"La gestión de dominios para Railway permite agregar, ver o eliminar dominios para servicios. Puedes generar dominios personalizados y obtener URLs","fr":"La gestion de domaines pour Railway permet d''ajouter, d''afficher ou de supprimer des domaines pour les services. Vous pouvez générer des domaines personnalis...","de":"Das Domain-Management für Railway ermöglicht es, Domains für Dienste hinzuzufügen, anzuzeigen oder zu entfernen. Sie können benutzerdefinierte Domains generi...","pt":"O gerenciamento de domínio Railway permite adicionar, visualizar ou remover domínios para serviços Railway de forma eficiente.","ru":"Управление доменами Railway позволяет добавлять, просматривать или удалять домены для сервисов Railway эффективно.","ar":"تتيح إدارة المجال Railway إضافة أو عرض أو إزالة المجالات لخدمات Railway بفعالية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["添加Railway提供的域名","支持自定义域名","查看服务域名","删除服务域名","生成URL"],"ja":["Railway提供のドメインの追加","カスタムドメインのサポート","サービスドメインの表示","サービスドメインの削除","URLの生成"],"ko":["Railway에서 제공하는 도메인 추가","커스텀 도메인 지원","서비스 도메인 보기","서비스 도메인 삭제","URL 생성"],"es":["Agregar dominios personalizados","Generar dominios proporcionados por Railway","Obtener URLs para servicios","Eliminar dominios","Gestión de dominios para servicios específicos","Soporte para servicios de backend"],"fr":["Ajouter des domaines personnalisés","Générer des domaines fournis par Railway","Obtenir des URL pour les services","Supprimer des domaines","Gestion de domaines pour les services spécifiques","Prise en charge des services de backend"],"de":["Hinzufügen von benutzerdefinierten Domains","Generieren von Railway-bereitgestellten Domains","Abrufen von URLs für Dienste","Entfernen von Domains","Verwaltung von Domains für bestimmte Dienste","Unterstützung für Backend-Dienste"],"pt":["Adicionar domínios personalizados","Gerar domínios proporcionados pelo Railway","Visualizar domínios existentes","Remover domínios desnecessários","Suporte a múltiplos serviços","Interface de linha de comando intuitiva"],"ru":["Добавлять пользовательские домены","Генерировать домены, предоставленные Railway","Просматривать существующие домены","Удалять ненужные домены","Поддержка нескольких сервисов","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс командной строки"],"ar":["إضافة مجالات مخصصة","توليد مجالات مقدمة من Railway","عرض المجالات الحالية","إزالة المجالات غير ضرورية","دعم خدمات متعددة","واجهة سطر الأوامر المتوافقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Railway域管理","添加域名","查看域名","删除域名","自定义域名","生成URL"],"ja":["Railwayドメイン管理","ドメインの追加","ドメインの表示","ドメインの削除","カスタムドメイン","URLの生成"],"ko":["Railway 도메인 관리","도메인 추가","도메인 보기","도메인 삭제","커스텀 도메인","URL 생성"],"es":["gestión de dominios","Railway","dominios personalizados","generar dominios","obtener URLs","eliminar dominios","desarrollo web","servicios en línea"],"fr":["gestion de domaines","Railway","domaines personnalisés","générer des domaines","obtenir des URL","supprimer des domaines","développement web","services en ligne"],"de":["Domain-Management","Railway","benutzerdefinierte Domains","generieren von Domains","abrufen von URLs","entfernen von Domains","Webentwicklung","Online-Dienste"],"pt":["gerenciamento de domínio Railway","adicionar domínio","visualizar domínio","remover domínio","domínio personalizado","serviços Railway","desenvolvimento web","infraestrutura de nuvem"],"ru":["управление доменами Railway","добавлять домен","просматривать домен","удалять домен","пользовательский домен","сервисы Railway","веб-разработка","облачная инфраструктура"],"ar":["إدارة المجال Railway","إضافة مجال","عرض المجال","إزالة المجال","المجال المخصص","خدمات Railway","تطوير الويب","بنية تحتية سحابية"]}},"owner":"heinschulie","repo":"babylon","repoPath":"heinschulie/babylon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"domain","description":"This skill should be used when the user wants to add a domain, generate a railway domain, check current domains, get the URL for a service, or remove a domain.","bodyPreview":"# Domain Management\n\nAdd, view, or remove domains for Railway services.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"add a domain\", \"generate a domain\", \"get a URL\"\n- User wants to add a custom domain\n- User asks \"what''s the URL for my service\"\n- User wants to remove a domain\n\n## Add Railway Domain\n\nGenerate a railway-provided domain (max 1 per service):\n\n```bash\nrailway domain --json\n```\n\nFor a specific service:\n```bash\nrailway domain --json --service backend\n```\n\n### Response\nReturns the generated domain","body":"# Domain Management\n\nAdd, view, or remove domains for Railway services.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"add a domain\", \"generate a domain\", \"get a URL\"\n- User wants to add a custom domain\n- User asks \"what''s the URL for my service\"\n- User wants to remove a domain\n\n## Add Railway Domain\n\nGenerate a railway-provided domain (max 1 per service):\n\n```bash\nrailway domain --json\n```\n\nFor a specific service:\n```bash\nrailway domain --json --service backend\n```\n\n### Response\nReturns the generated domain URL. Service must have a deployment.\n\n## Add Custom Domain\n\n```bash\nrailway domain example.com --json\n```\n\n### Response\nReturns required DNS records:\n```json\n{\n  \"domain\": \"example.com\",\n  \"dnsRecords\": [\n    { \"type\": \"CNAME\", \"host\": \"@\", \"value\": \"...\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nTell user to add these records to their DNS provider.\n\n## Read Current Domains\n\nUse `environment` skill to see configured domains, or query directly:\n\n```graphql\nquery domains($envId: String!) {\n  environment(id: $envId) {\n    config(decryptVariables: false)\n  }\n}\n```\n\nDomains are in `config.services.<serviceId>.networking`:\n- `serviceDomains` - Railway-provided domains\n- `customDomains` - User-provided domains\n\n## Remove Domain\n\nUse `environment` skill to remove domains:\n\n### Remove custom domain\n```json\n{\n  \"services\": {\n    \"<serviceId>\": {\n      \"networking\": {\n        \"customDomains\": { \"<domainId>\": null }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Remove railway domain\n```json\n{\n  \"services\": {\n    \"<serviceId>\": {\n      \"networking\": {\n        \"serviceDomains\": { \"<domainId>\": null }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThen use `environment` skill to apply and commit the change.\n\n## CLI Options\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `[DOMAIN]` | Custom domain to add (omit for railway domain) |\n| `-p, --port <PORT>` | Port to connect |\n| `-s, --service <NAME>` | Target service (defaults to linked) |\n| `--json` | JSON output |\n\n## Composability\n\n- **Read domains**: Use `environment` skill\n- **Remove domains**: Use `environment` skill\n- **Apply removal**: Use `environment` skill\n- **Check service**: Use `service` skill\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### No Service Linked\n```\nNo service linked. Use --service flag or run `railway service` to select one.\n```\n\n### Domain Already Exists\n```\nService already has a railway-provided domain. Maximum 1 per service.\n```\n\n### No Deployment\n```\nService has no deployment. Deploy first with `railway up`.\n```\n\n### Invalid Domain\n```\nInvalid domain format. Use a valid domain like \"example.com\" or \"api.example.com\".\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:44:44.497Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Management Agents needing automated domain configuration and Railway service integration.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化域配置和Railway服务集成的云管理代理。","ja":"自動ドメイン構成とRailwayサービス統合が必要なクラウド管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 도메인 구성 및 Railway 서비스 통합이 필요한 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión en la nube que necesitan configuración de dominio automatizada y integración del servicio Railway.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion cloud ayant besoin d''une configuration de domaine automatisée et d''une intégration du service Railway.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Management-Agents, die eine automatisierte Domain-Konfiguration und eine Railway-Service-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Nuvem que necessitam de configuração de domínio automatizada e integração de serviço de Railway.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления облаком, которым требуется автоматическая настройка домена и интеграция с сервисом Railway.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة السحابة التي تحتاج إلى تكوين نطاق تلقائي وتكامل خدمة سكة حديد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Railway domains using JSON output, enabling seamless addition, viewing, and removal of custom domains for specific services via the Railway CLI protocol.","zh":"赋予代理管理Railway域的能力，使用JSON输出，能够通过Railway CLI协议无缝地添加、查看和删除特定服务的自定义域。","ja":"エージェントがRailwayドメインを管理できるようにし、JSON出力を使用して、Railway CLIプロトコルを介して特定のサービスに対するカスタムドメインの追加、表示、削除をシームレスに実行できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 Railway 도메인을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, JSON 출력을 사용하여 Railway CLI 프로토콜을 통해 특정 서비스에 대한 사용자 지정 도메인의 추가, 보기 및 삭제를无缝하게 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar dominios de Railway utilizando la salida JSON, lo que permite una adición, visualización y eliminación sin problemas de dominios personalizados para servicios específicos a través del protocolo CLI de Railway.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des domaines Railway en utilisant la sortie JSON, ce qui permet une ajout, une visualisation et une suppression sans heurts de domaines personnalisés pour des services spécifiques via le protocole CLI Railway.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Railway-Domains mithilfe der JSON-Ausgabe zu verwalten, wodurch eine nahtlose Hinzufügung, Anzeige und Entfernung von benutzerdefinierten Domains für bestimmte Dienste über das Railway-CLI-Protokoll ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar domínios Railway usando saída JSON, permitindo adição, visualização e remoção sem problemas de domínios personalizados para serviços específicos via protocolo Railway CLI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять доменами Railway с помощью вывода JSON, что позволяет бесшовно добавлять, просматривать и удалять пользовательские домены для конкретных сервисов через протокол Railway CLI.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إدارة مجالات سكة حديد باستخدام إخراج JSON، مما يسمح بالإضافة والاستعراض والإزالة دون مشاكل لمجالات مخصصة لخدمات محددة عبر بروتوكول سكة حديد CLI"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating domain setup for Railway services","Generating custom domains for backend services","Removing unused domains for service optimization"],"zh":["为Railway服务自动化域设置","为后端服务生成自定义域","删除未使用的域以优化服务"],"ja":["Railwayサービスのドメイン設定を自動化する","バックエンドサービス用のカスタムドメインを生成する","サービス最適化のために使用されていないドメインを削除する"],"ko":["Railway 서비스를 위한 도메인 설정 자동화","백엔드 서비스를 위한 사용자 지정 도메인 생성","서비스 최적화를 위한 사용되지 않는 도메인 삭제"],"es":["Automatización de la configuración de dominios para servicios Railway","Generación de dominios personalizados para servicios de backend","Eliminación de dominios no utilizados para la optimización de servicios"],"fr":["Automatisation de la configuration de domaines pour les services Railway","Génération de domaines personnalisés pour les services backend","Suppression de domaines inutilisés pour l''optimisation des services"],"de":["Automatisierung der Domain-Konfiguration für Railway-Dienste","Generierung von benutzerdefinierten Domains für Backend-Dienste","Entfernung nicht genutzter Domains für die Serviceoptimierung"],"pt":["Automatizar configuração de domínio para serviços Railway","Gerar domínios personalizados para serviços de backend","Remover domínios não utilizados para otimização de serviço"],"ru":["Автоматизация настройки домена для сервисов Railway","Генерация пользовательских доменов для сервисов бэкэнда","Удаление неиспользуемых доменов для оптимизации сервиса"],"ar":["توفير إعداد نطاق تلقائي لخدمات سكة حديد","توليد مجالات مخصصة لخدمات الخلفية","إزالة مجالات غير مستخدمة لتحسين الخدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway CLI access","Limited to one generated domain per service","Specific to Railway services"],"zh":["需要Railway CLI访问","每个服务仅限一个生成的域","仅适用于Railway服务"],"ja":["Railway CLIへのアクセスが必要","サービスごとに生成されるドメインは1つだけ","Railwayサービス専用"],"ko":["Railway CLI 액세스가 필요하다","서비스당 생성된 도메인은 하나만 허용","Railway 서비스 전용"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la CLI de Railway","Limitado a un dominio generado por servicio","Específico para los servicios Railway"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la CLI Railway","Limité à un domaine généré par service","Spécifique aux services Railway"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Railway-CLI","Begrenzt auf ein pro Dienst generiertes Domain","Spezifisch für Railway-Dienste"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao Railway CLI","Limitado a um domínio gerado por serviço","Específico para serviços Railway"],"ru":["Требует доступа к Railway CLI","Ограничен один генерируемый домен на сервис","Специфичен для сервисов Railway"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سكة حديد CLI","محدود بمجال واحد تم إنشاؤه لكل خدمة","محدد لخدمات سكة حديد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
