,"de":["Senden von E-Mails","Erstellen von Problemen","Veröffentlichen von Nachrichten","Aktualisieren von Datenbanken","Automatisieren von Aufgaben","Integration mit externen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Envio de emails","Criação de issues","Publicação de mensagens","Atualização de bancos de dados","Integração com aplicativos","Aumento da produtividade"],"ru":["Отправка писем","Создание задач","Публикация сообщений","Обновление баз данных","Интеграция с приложениями","Увеличение производительности"],"ar":["إرسال البريد الإلكتروني","إنشاء المشكلات","نشر الرسائل","تحديث قواعد البيانات","التكامل مع التطبيقات","زيادة الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["连接技能","Claude","自动化","开发效率","应用连接","工作流程","开发工具","自动化工具","效率提升"],"ja":["接続スキル","Claude","自動化","開発効率","アプリ接続","ワークフロー","開発ツール","自動化ツール","効率向上"],"ko":["연결 스킬","Claude","자동화","개발 효율성","애플리케이션 연결","워크플로우","개발 도구","자동화 도구","효율성 향상"],"es":["conectar claude","automatizar tareas","integración con aplicaciones","envío de correos electrónicos","creación de problemas","publicación de mensajes","actualización de bases de datos","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["connecter claude","automatiser des tâches","intégration avec des applications","envoi de courriels","création de problèmes","publication de messages","mise à jour de bases de données","développement d''applications"],"de":["claude verbinden","aufgaben automatisieren","integration mit anwendungen","e-mails senden","probleme erstellen","nachrichten veröffentlichen","datenbanken aktualisieren","anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["skill connect","claude","aplicativos","produtividade","integração","automatização","desenvolvimento","tecnologia","inovação"],"ru":["умение connect","claude","приложения","производительность","интеграция","автоматизация","разработка","технологии","инновации"],"ar":["مهارة الاتصال","كلود","التطبيقات","الإنتاجية","التكامل","الآلية","التطوير","التكنولوجيا","الابتكار"]}},"owner":"CuCryptos","repo":"sixroundsdeep","repoPath":"CuCryptos/sixroundsdeep","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"connect","description":"Connect Claude to any app. Send emails, create issues, post messages, update databases - take real actions across Gmail, Slack, GitHub, Notion, and 1000+ services.","bodyPreview":"# Connect\n\nConnect Claude to any app. Stop generating text about what you could do - actually do it.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need Claude to:\n\n- **Send that email** instead of drafting it\n- **Create that issue** instead of describing it\n- **Post that message** instead of suggesting it\n- **Update that database** instead of explaining how\n\n## What Changes\n\n| Without Connect | With Connect |\n|-----------------|--------------|\n| \"Here''s a draft email...\" | Sends the email","body":"# Connect\n\nConnect Claude to any app. Stop generating text about what you could do - actually do it.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need Claude to:\n\n- **Send that email** instead of drafting it\n- **Create that issue** instead of describing it\n- **Post that message** instead of suggesting it\n- **Update that database** instead of explaining how\n\n## What Changes\n\n| Without Connect | With Connect |\n|-----------------|--------------|\n| \"Here''s a draft email...\" | Sends the email |\n| \"You should create an issue...\" | Creates the issue |\n| \"Post this to Slack...\" | Posts it |\n| \"Add this to Notion...\" | Adds it |\n\n## Supported Apps\n\n**1000+ integrations** including:\n\n- **Email:** Gmail, Outlook, SendGrid\n- **Chat:** Slack, Discord, Teams, Telegram\n- **Dev:** GitHub, GitLab, Jira, Linear\n- **Docs:** Notion, Google Docs, Confluence\n- **Data:** Sheets, Airtable, PostgreSQL\n- **CRM:** HubSpot, Salesforce, Pipedrive\n- **Storage:** Drive, Dropbox, S3\n- **Social:** Twitter, LinkedIn, Reddit\n\n## Setup\n\n### 1. Get API Key\n\nGet your free key at [platform.composio.dev](https://platform.composio.dev/?utm_source=Github&utm_content=AwesomeSkills)\n\n### 2. Set Environment Variable\n\n```bash\nexport COMPOSIO_API_KEY=\"your-key\"\n```\n\n### 3. Install\n\n```bash\npip install composio          # Python\nnpm install @composio/core    # TypeScript\n```\n\nDone. Claude can now connect to any app.\n\n## Examples\n\n### Send Email\n```\nEmail sarah@acme.com - Subject: \"Shipped!\" Body: \"v2.0 is live, let me know if issues\"\n```\n\n### Create GitHub Issue\n```\nCreate issue in my-org/repo: \"Mobile timeout bug\" with label:bug\n```\n\n### Post to Slack\n```\nPost to #engineering: \"Deploy complete - v2.4.0 live\"\n```\n\n### Chain Actions\n```\nFind GitHub issues labeled \"bug\" from this week, summarize, post to #bugs on Slack\n```\n\n## How It Works\n\nUses Composio Tool Router:\n\n1. **You ask** Claude to do something\n2. **Tool Router finds** the right tool (1000+ options)\n3. **OAuth handled** automatically\n4. **Action executes** and returns result\n\n### Code\n\n```python\nfrom composio import Composio\nfrom claude_agent_sdk.client import ClaudeSDKClient\nfrom claude_agent_sdk.types import ClaudeAgentOptions\nimport os\n\ncomposio = Composio(api_key=os.environ[\"COMPOSIO_API_KEY\"])\nsession = composio.create(user_id=\"user_123\")\n\noptions = ClaudeAgentOptions(\n    system_prompt=\"You can take actions in external apps.\",\n    mcp_servers={\n        \"composio\": {\n            \"type\": \"http\",\n            \"url\": session.mcp.url,\n            \"headers\": {\"x-api-key\": os.environ[\"COMPOSIO_API_KEY\"]},\n        }\n    },\n)\n\nasync with ClaudeSDKClient(options) as client:\n    await client.query(\"Send Slack message to #general: Hello!\")\n```\n\n## Auth Flow\n\nFirst time using an app:\n```\nTo send emails, I need Gmail access.\nAuthorize here: https://...\nSay \"connected\" when done.\n```\n\nConnection persists after that.\n\n## Framework Support\n\n| Framework | Install |\n|-----------|---------|\n| Claude Agent SDK | `pip install composio claude-agent-sdk` |\n| OpenAI Agents | `pip install composio openai-agents` |\n| Vercel AI | `npm install @composio/core @composio/vercel` |\n| LangChain | `pip install composio-langchain` |\n| Any MCP Client | Use `session.mcp.url` |\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **Auth required** → Click link, authorize, say \"connected\"\n- **Action failed** → Check permissions in target app\n- **Tool not found** → Be specific: \"Slack #general\" not \"send message\"\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>Join 20,000+ developers building agents that ship</b>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://platform.composio.dev/?utm_source=Github&utm_content=AwesomeSkills\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Get_Started_Free-4F46E5?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Get Started\"/>\n  </a>\n</p>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:45:03.690Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents like Claude needing seamless integration with external applications via protocols and APIs.","zh":"非常适合需要与外部应用程序通过协议和API实现无缝集成的高级AI代理，如Claude。","ja":"Claudeのような外部アプリケーションとのプロトコルやAPIを介したシームレスな統合を必要とする高度なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"외부 애플리케이션과 프로토콜 및 API를 통해无缝한 통합을 필요로 하는 고급 AI 에이전트인 Claude에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Avanzados como Claude que necesitan una integración perfecta con aplicaciones externas a través de protocolos y API.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de IA avancés comme Claude nécessitant une intégration transparente avec des applications externes via des protocoles et des API.","de":"Perfekt für fortschrittliche KI-Agents wie Claude, die eine nahtlose Integration mit externen Anwendungen über Protokolle und APIs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados, como Claude, que necessitam de integração perfeita com aplicações externas via protocolos e APIs.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, которые требуют бесшовной интеграции с внешними приложениями через протоколы и API.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين المتقدمين مثل Claude الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل متكامل مع التطبيقات الخارجية عبر البروتوكولات وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to send emails, create issues, post messages, and update databases directly, leveraging APIs and HTTP protocols for automation, thereby streamlining workflows and enhancing productivity.","zh":"赋予代理发送电子邮件、创建问题、发布消息和直接更新数据库的能力，利用API和HTTP协议实现自动化，从而简化工作流程并提高生产力。","ja":"APIとHTTPプロトコルを利用して自動化を行い、ワークフローを合理化し、生産性を高めることで、エージェントが電子メールを送信したり、問題を作成したり、メッセージを投稿したり、データベースを直接更新したりできるようにします。","ko":"API와 HTTP 프로토콜을 활용하여 자동화를 통해 워크플로를 최적화하고 생산성을 향상시킴으로써, 에이전트가 이메일을 보낸다거나, 이슈를 생성한다거나, 메시지를 게시한다거나, 데이터베이스를 직접 업데이트한다던지 하는 기능을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes enviar correos electrónicos, crear problemas, publicar mensajes y actualizar bases de datos directamente, aprovechando las API y los protocolos HTTP para la automatización, lo que permite optimizar los flujos de trabajo y mejorar la productividad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''envoyer des e-mails, de créer des problèmes, de publier des messages et de mettre à jour des bases de données directement, en exploitant les API et les protocoles HTTP pour l''automatisation, ce qui permet de rationaliser les flux de travail et d''améliorer la productivité.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, E-Mails zu senden, Probleme zu erstellen, Nachrichten zu posten und Datenbanken direkt zu aktualisieren, indem es APIs und HTTP-Protokolle für die Automatisierung nutzt, wodurch die Arbeitsabläufe optimiert und die Produktivität verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a enviar e-mails, criar problemas, publicar mensagens e atualizar bancos de dados diretamente, aproveitando as APIs e os protocolos HTTP para automação, o que simplifica os fluxos de trabalho e melhora a produtividade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отправлять электронные письма, создавать задачи, публиковать сообщения и обновлять базы данных напрямую, используя API и протоколы HTTP для автоматизации, тем самым оптимизируя рабочие процессы и повышая производительность.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إرسال البريد الإلكتروني وإنشاء مشاكل ونشر رسائل وتحديث قواعد البيانات مباشرة، مستفيداً من واجهات برمجة التطبيقات وبروتوكولات HTTP للتحكم الآلي، مما يبسّط سير العمل ويعزز الإنتاجية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating email notifications","Generating and posting updates on social media platforms","Creating and managing issues on project management tools"],"zh":["自动发送电子邮件通知","在社交媒体平台上生成和发布更新","在项目管理工具上创建和管理问题"],"ja":["電子メール通知の自動送信","ソーシャルメディアプラットフォームでの更新の生成と投稿","プロジェクト管理ツールでの問題の作成と管理"],"ko":["이메일 알림 자동 송신","소셜 미디어 플랫폼에서 업데이트를 생성 및 게시","프로젝트 관리 도구에서 이슈 생성 및 관리"],"es":["Automatización de notificaciones por correo electrónico","Generación y publicación de actualizaciones en plataformas de redes sociales","Creación y administración de problemas en herramientas de gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["Automatisation des notifications par e-mail","Génération et publication de mises à jour sur les plateformes de réseaux sociaux","Création et gestion de problèmes sur les outils de gestion de projet"],"de":["Automatisierung von E-Mail-Benachrichtigungen","Erstellung und Veröffentlichung von Updates auf sozialen Medienplattformen","Erstellung und Verwaltung von Problemen in Projektmanagement-Tools"],"pt":["Automatizar notificações por e-mail","Gerar e publicar atualizações em plataformas de mídia social","Criar e gerenciar problemas em ferramentas de gerenciamento de projetos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать уведомления по электронной почте","Генерировать и публиковать обновления на платформах социальных сетей","Создавать и управлять задачами в инструментах управления проектами"],"ar":["تutomation إشعارات البريد الإلكتروني","генерировать ونشر التحديثات على منصات الوسائط الاجتماعية","إنشاء وإدارة المشاكل في أدوات إدارة المشاريع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires API keys or access tokens for connected apps","Dependent on app-specific API availability and compatibility"],"zh":["需要连接应用程序的API密钥或访问令牌","依赖于应用程序特定的API可用性和兼容性"],"ja":["接続アプリケーションのAPIキーまたはアクセストークンが必要","アプリケーション特有のAPIの可用性と互換性に依存する"],"ko":["연결된 애플리케이션의 API 키 또는 액세스 토큰이 필요","애플리케이션 특정 API의 가용성 및 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere claves de API o tokens de acceso para aplicaciones conectadas","Depende de la disponibilidad y compatibilidad de la API específica de la aplicación"],"fr":["Nécessite des clés d''API ou des jetons d''accès pour les applications connectées","Dépend de la disponibilité et de la compatibilité de l''API spécifique à l''application"],"de":["Benötigt API-Schlüssel oder Zugriffstoken für verbundene Apps","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit und Kompatibilität der app-spezifischen API ab"],"pt":["Requer chaves de API ou tokens de acesso para aplicativos conectados","Dependente da disponibilidade e compatibilidade da API específica do aplicativo"],"ru":["Требует ключей API или токенов доступа для подключенных приложений","Зависит от наличия и совместимости API конкретного приложения"],"ar":["يتطلب مفاتيح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات أو رموز الوصول للتطبيقات المتصلة","يعتمد على توافر واستدامة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الخاصة للتطبيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
