line-first et de synchronisation de données"],"de":["Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen mit modernen Frameworks","Implementierung von mobilen Design- und UX-Mustern","Optimierung für mobile Einschränkungen","Entscheidungen über native und multiplattformübergreifende Technologien","Implementierung von Offline-First-Architektur und Daten-Synchronisation"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis com frameworks modernos","Implementação de design e UX móvel","Otimização para restrições móveis","Tomada de decisões sobre tecnologia nativa vs cross-plataforma","Implementação de arquitetura offline-first e sincronização de dados","Seguimento de diretrizes específicas de plataforma"],"ru":["Разработка мобильных приложений с современными фреймворками","Реализация мобильного дизайна и UX","Оптимизация для мобильных ограничений","Принятие решений о технологии native vs cross-платформенной","Реализация архитектуры offline-first и синхронизации данных","Следование специфическим рекомендациям платформы"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات الهواتف المحمولة باستخدام إطارات حديثة","تنفيذ تصميم و UX الهواتف المحمولة","تحسين الأداء للقيود الهواتف المحمولة","اتخاذ قرارات حول التكنولوجيا الأصلية مقابل التكنولوجيا متعددة المنصات","تنفيذ هندسة البنية الأولية دون اتصال و مزامنة البيانات","متابعة الإرشادات المحددة للمنصات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动开发","现代框架","移动优先设计","离线优先架构","数据同步","平台特定指南"],"ja":["モバイル開発","モダンなフレームワーク","モバイルファースト設計","オフラインファーストアーキテクチャ","データ同期","プラットフォーム特有のガイドライン"],"ko":["모바일 개발","최신 프레임워크","모바일 우선 디자인","오프라인 우선 아키텍처","데이터 동기화","플랫폼 특有的 지침"],"es":["desarrollo móvil","frameworks móviles","mejores prácticas de desarrollo móvil","diseño móvil","UX móvil","optimización para móviles","tecnologías nativas","tecnologías multiplataforma","arquitectura offline-first"],"fr":["développement mobile","frameworks mobiles","meilleures pratiques de développement mobile","conception mobile","UX mobile","optimisation pour mobiles","technologies natives","technologies multiplateformes","architecture offline-first"],"de":["mobile Entwicklung","mobile Frameworks","beste Praktiken für mobile Entwicklung","mobile Design","mobile UX","Optimierung für mobile Geräte","native Technologien","multiplattformübergreifende Technologien","Offline-First-Architektur"],"pt":["desenvolvimento móvel","aplicativos móveis","frameworks modernos","melhores práticas","design móvel","UX móvel","otimização para restrições móveis","tecnologia nativa","tecnologia cross-plataforma","arquitetura offline-first"],"ru":["мобильная разработка","мобильные приложения","современные фреймворки","лучшие практики","мобильный дизайн","мобильный UX","оптимизация для мобильных ограничений","технология native","технология cross-платформенная","архитектура offline-first"],"ar":["تطوير الهواتف المحمولة","تطبيقات الهواتف المحمولة","إطارات حديثة","أفضل الممارسات","تصميم الهواتف المحمولة","UX الهواتف المحمولة","تحسين الأداء للقيود الهواتف المحمولة","التكنولوجيا الأصلية","التكنولوجيا متعددة المنصات","هندسة البنية الأولية دون اتصال"]}},"owner":"iFor-Lux","repo":"LuxuryCheats","repoPath":"iFor-Lux/LuxuryCheats","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-development","description":"Cross-platform and native mobile development. Frameworks: React Native, Flutter, Swift/SwiftUI, Kotlin/Jetpack Compose. Capabilities: mobile UI, offline-first architecture, push notifications, deep linking, biometrics, app store deployment. Actions: build, create, implement, optimize, test, deploy mobile apps. Keywords: iOS, Android, React Native, Flutter, Swift, Kotlin, mobile app, offline sync, push notification, deep link, biometric auth, App Store, Play Store, iOS HIG, Material Design, battery optimization, memory management, mobile performance. Use when: building mobile apps, implementing mobile-first UX, choosing native vs cross-platform, optimizing battery/memory/network, deploying to app stores, handling mobile-specific features.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Development Skill\n\nProduction-ready mobile development with modern frameworks, best practices, and mobile-first thinking patterns.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building mobile applications (iOS, Android, or cross-platform)\n- Implementing mobile-first design and UX patterns\n- Optimizing for mobile constraints (battery, memory, network, small screens)\n- Making native vs cross-platform technology decisions\n- Implementing offline-first architecture and data sync\n- Following platform-specific guidelin","body":"# Mobile Development Skill\n\nProduction-ready mobile development with modern frameworks, best practices, and mobile-first thinking patterns.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building mobile applications (iOS, Android, or cross-platform)\n- Implementing mobile-first design and UX patterns\n- Optimizing for mobile constraints (battery, memory, network, small screens)\n- Making native vs cross-platform technology decisions\n- Implementing offline-first architecture and data sync\n- Following platform-specific guidelines (iOS HIG, Material Design)\n- Optimizing mobile app performance and user experience\n- Implementing mobile security and authentication\n- Testing mobile applications (unit, integration, E2E)\n- Deploying to App Store and Google Play\n\n## Technology Selection Guide\n\n**Cross-Platform Frameworks:**\n- **React Native**: JavaScript expertise, web code sharing, mature ecosystem (121K stars, 67% familiarity)\n- **Flutter**: Performance-critical apps, complex animations, fastest-growing (170K stars, 46% adoption)\n\n**Native Development:**\n- **iOS (Swift/SwiftUI)**: Maximum iOS performance, latest features, Apple ecosystem integration\n- **Android (Kotlin/Jetpack Compose)**: Maximum Android performance, Material Design 3, platform optimization\n\nSee: `references/mobile-frameworks.md` for detailed framework comparisons\n\n## Mobile Development Mindset\n\n**The 10 Commandments of Mobile Development:**\n\n1. **Performance is Foundation, Not Feature** - 70% abandon apps >3s load time\n2. **Every Kilobyte, Every Millisecond Matters** - Mobile constraints are real\n3. **Offline-First by Default** - Network is unreliable, design for it\n4. **User Context > Developer Environment** - Think real-world usage scenarios\n5. **Platform Awareness Without Platform Lock-In** - Respect platform conventions\n6. **Iterate, Don''t Perfect** - Ship, measure, improve cycle is survival\n7. **Security and Accessibility by Design** - Not afterthoughts\n8. **Test on Real Devices** - Simulators lie about performance\n9. **Architecture Scales with Complexity** - Don''t over-engineer simple apps\n10. **Continuous Learning is Survival** - Mobile landscape evolves rapidly\n\nSee: `references/mobile-mindset.md` for thinking patterns and decision frameworks\n\n## Reference Navigation\n\n**Core Technologies:**\n- `mobile-frameworks.md` - React Native, Flutter, Swift, Kotlin, framework comparison matrices, when to use each\n- `mobile-ios.md` - Swift 6, SwiftUI, iOS architecture patterns, HIG, App Store requirements, platform capabilities\n- `mobile-android.md` - Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material Design 3, Play Store, Android-specific features\n\n**Best Practices & Development Mindset:**\n- `mobile-best-practices.md` - Mobile-first design, performance optimization, offline-first architecture, security, testing, accessibility, deployment, analytics\n- `mobile-debugging.md` - Debugging tools, performance profiling, crash analysis, network debugging, platform-specific debugging\n- `mobile-mindset.md` - Thinking patterns, decision frameworks, platform-specific thinking, common pitfalls, debugging strategies\n\n## Key Best Practices (2024-2025)\n\n**Performance Targets:**\n- App launch: <2 seconds (70% abandon if >3s)\n- Memory usage: <100MB for typical screens\n- Network requests: Batch and cache aggressively\n- Battery impact: Respect Doze Mode and background restrictions\n- Animation: 60 FPS (16.67ms per frame)\n\n**Architecture:**\n- MVVM for small-medium apps (clean separation, testable)\n- MVVM + Clean Architecture for large enterprise apps\n- Offline-first with hybrid sync (push + pull)\n- State management: Zustand (React Native), Riverpod 3 (Flutter), StateFlow (Android)\n\n**Security (OWASP Mobile Top 10):**\n- OAuth 2.0 + JWT + Biometrics for authentication\n- Keychain (iOS) / KeyStore (Android) for sensitive data\n- Certificate pinning for network security\n- Never hardcode credentials or API keys\n- Implement proper session management\n\n**Testing Strategy:**\n- Unit tests: 70%+ coverage for business logic\n- Integration tests: Critical user flows\n- E2E tests: Detox (React Native), Appium (cross-platform), XCUITest (iOS), Espresso (Android)\n- Real device testing mandatory before release\n\n**Deployment:**\n- Fastlane for automation across platforms\n- Staged rollouts: Internal → Closed → Open → Production\n- Mandatory: iOS 17 SDK (2024), Android 15 API 35 (Aug 2025)\n- CI/CD saves 20% development time\n\n## Quick Decision Matrix\n\n| Need | Choose |\n|------|--------|\n| JavaScript team, web code sharing | React Native |\n| Performance-critical, complex animations | Flutter |\n| Maximum iOS performance, latest features | Swift/SwiftUI native |\n| Maximum Android performance, Material 3 | Kotlin/Compose native |\n| Rapid prototyping | React Native + Expo |\n| Desktop + mobile | Flutter |\n| Enterprise with JavaScript skills | React Native |\n| Startup with limited resources | Flutter or React Native |\n| Gaming or heavy graphics | Native (Swift/Kotlin) or Unity |\n\n## Framework Quick Comparison (2024-2025)\n\n| Criterion | React Native | Flutter | Swift/SwiftUI | Kotlin/Compose |\n|-----------|--------------|---------|---------------|----------------|\n| **Stars** | 121K | 170K | N/A | N/A |\n| **Adoption** | 35% | 46% | iOS only | Android only |\n| **Performance** | 80-90% native | 85-95% native | 100% native | 100% native |\n| **Dev Speed** | Fast (hot reload) | Very fast (hot reload) | Fast (Xcode Previews) | Fast (Live Edit) |\n| **Learning Curve** | Easy (JavaScript) | Medium (Dart) | Medium (Swift) | Medium (Kotlin) |\n| **UI Paradigm** | Component-based | Widget-based | Declarative | Declarative |\n| **Community** | Huge (npm) | Growing | Apple ecosystem | Android ecosystem |\n| **Best For** | JS teams, web sharing | Performance, animations | iOS-only apps | Android-only apps |\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\n**Project Setup:**\n- Choose framework → Initialize project → Configure dev environment → Setup version control → Configure CI/CD → Team standards\n\n**Architecture:**\n- Choose pattern (MVVM/Clean) → Setup folders → State management → Navigation → API layer → Error handling → Logging\n\n**Core Features:**\n- Authentication → Data persistence → API integration → Offline sync → Push notifications → Deep linking → Analytics\n\n**UI/UX:**\n- Design system → Platform guidelines → Accessibility → Responsive layouts → Dark mode → Localization → Animations\n\n**Performance:**\n- Image optimization → Lazy loading → Memory profiling → Network optimization → Battery testing → Launch time optimization\n\n**Quality:**\n- Unit tests (70%+) → Integration tests → E2E tests → Accessibility testing → Performance testing → Security audit\n\n**Security:**\n- Secure storage → Authentication flow → Network security → Input validation → Session management → Encryption\n\n**Deployment:**\n- App icons/splash → Screenshots → Store listings → Privacy policy → TestFlight/Internal testing → Staged rollout → Monitoring\n\n## Platform-Specific Guidelines\n\n**iOS (Human Interface Guidelines):**\n- Native navigation patterns (tab bar, navigation bar)\n- iOS design patterns (pull to refresh, swipe actions)\n- San Francisco font, iOS color system\n- Haptic feedback, 3D Touch/Haptic Touch\n- Respect safe areas and notch\n\n**Android (Material Design 3):**\n- Material navigation (bottom nav, navigation drawer)\n- Floating action buttons, material components\n- Roboto font, Material You dynamic colors\n- Touch feedback (ripple effects)\n- Respect system bars and gestures\n\n## Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n\n1. **Testing only on simulators** - Real devices show true performance\n2. **Ignoring platform conventions** - Users expect platform-specific patterns\n3. **No offline handling** - Network failures will happen\n4. **Poor memory management** - Leads to crashes and poor UX\n5. **Hardcoded credentials** - Security vulnerability\n6. **No accessibility** - Excludes 15%+ of users\n7. **Premature optimization** - Optimize based on metrics, not assumptions\n8. **Over-engineering** - Start simple, scale as needed\n9. **Skipping real device testing** - Simulators don''t show battery/network issues\n10. **Not respecting battery** - Background processing must be justified\n\n## Performance Budgets\n\n**Recommended Targets:**\n- **App size**: <50MB initial download, <200MB total\n- **Launch time**: <2 seconds to interactive\n- **Screen load**: <1 second for cached data\n- **Network request**: <3 seconds for API calls\n- **Memory**: <100MB for typical screens, <200MB peak\n- **Battery**: <5% drain per hour of active use\n- **Frame rate**: 60 FPS (16.67ms per frame)\n\n## Resources\n\n**Official Documentation:**\n- React Native: https://reactnative.dev/\n- Flutter: https://flutter.dev/\n- iOS HIG: https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/\n- Material Design: https://m3.material.io/\n- OWASP Mobile: https://owasp.org/www-project-mobile-top-10/\n\n**Tools & Testing:**\n- Detox E2E: https://wix.github.io/Detox/\n- Appium: https://appium.io/\n- Fastlane: https://fastlane.tools/\n- Firebase: https://firebase.google.com/\n\n**Community:**\n- React Native Directory: https://reactnative.directory/\n- Pub.dev (Flutter packages): https://pub.dev/\n- Awesome React Native: https://github.com/jondot/awesome-react-native\n- Awesome Flutter: https://github.com/Solido/awesome-flutter\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:45:15.005Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cross-Platform Agents needing production-ready mobile development with modern frameworks and mobile-first thinking patterns.","zh":"适用于需要生产就绪的移动开发和现代框架以及移动优先思维模式的跨平台代理。","ja":"クロスプラットフォームエージェントが生産就緒のモバイル開発とモダンフレームワークおよびモバイルファースト思考パターンを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"프로덕션 준비가 된 모바일 개발 및 현대적인 프레임워크와 모바일 우선 사고 패턴이 필요한 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de plataforma cruzada que necesitan desarrollo móvil listo para producción con frameworks modernos y patrones de pensamiento de primera plataforma móvil.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de plateforme croisée qui ont besoin d''un développement mobile prêt pour la production avec des frameworks modernes et des modèles de réflexion mobiles première.","de":"Ideal für Cross-Platform-Agents, die ein produktionsbereites Mobile-Development mit modernen Frameworks und mobile-erst-Denkmustern benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Cross-Platform que necessitam de desenvolvimento móvel pronto para produção com frameworks modernos e padrões de pensamento mobile-first.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Cross-Platform, которым требуется производственная мобильная разработка с современными фреймворками и шаблонами мышления mobile-first.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Cross-Platform الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير الهاتف المحمول جاهز للإنتاج مع الإطارات الحديثة وأنماط التفكير أولاً الهاتف المحمول."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build mobile applications with native and cross-platform technologies, implementing offline-first architecture and data sync using protocols like REST and GraphQL, while following platform-specific guidelines for iOS and Android.","zh":"赋予代理构建移动应用程序的能力，使用原生和跨平台技术，实现离线优先架构和使用REST和GraphQL等协议的数据同步，同时遵循iOS和Android的平台特定指南。","ja":"エージェントがネイティブおよびクロスプラットフォーム技術を使用してモバイルアプリケーションを構築できるようにし、オフライン優先アーキテクチャとRESTおよびGraphQLなどのプロトコルを使用したデータ同期を実装し、同時にiOSとAndroidのプラットフォーム固有のガイドラインに従う。","ko":"에이전트가 네이티브 및 크로스 플랫폼 기술을 사용하여 모바일 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하며, 오프라인優先 아키텍처 및 REST 및 GraphQL 등의 프로토콜을 사용한 데이터 동기화를 구현하며,同時に iOS 및 Android의 플랫폼 고유 지침을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones móviles con tecnologías nativas y de plataforma cruzada, implementando arquitectura de primero sin conexión y sincronización de datos utilizando protocolos como REST y GraphQL, siguiendo pautas específicas de plataforma para iOS y Android.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications mobiles avec des technologies natives et de plateforme croisée, en mettant en œuvre une architecture de première sans connexion et une synchronisation de données à l''aide de protocoles tels que REST et GraphQL, en suivant les directives spécifiques à la plateforme pour iOS et Android.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten zum Erstellen von Mobile-Anwendungen mit nativen und Cross-Platform-Technologien, indem Offline-First-Architektur und Daten-Synchronisierung unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie REST und GraphQL implementiert werden, unter Einhaltung plattform-spezifischer Richtlinien für iOS und Android.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem aplicações móveis com tecnologias nativas e cross-platform, implementando arquitetura offline-first e sincronização de dados usando protocolos como REST e GraphQL, seguindo diretrizes específicas de plataforma para iOS e Android.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать мобильные приложения с помощью родных и кроссплатформенных технологий, реализуя архитектуру offline-first и синхронизацию данных с помощью протоколов như REST и GraphQL, следуя руководствам, специфичным для платформы, для iOS и Android.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من إنشاء تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول باستخدام التكنولوجيا الأصلية وتكنولوجيا متعددة المنصات، وتنفيذ هندسة الهاتف المحمول أولاً وسينكرونات البيانات باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل REST وGraphQL، متبعة إرشادات محددة للمنصة للهاتف المحمول iOS و Android."},"useCases":{"en":["Building cross-platform mobile applications with React Native or Flutter","Implementing mobile-first design and UX patterns for optimal user experience","Optimizing mobile applications for battery, memory, and network constraints"],"zh":["使用React Native或Flutter构建跨平台移动应用程序","实现移动优先设计和UX模式以获得最佳用户体验","优化移动应用程序以适应电池、内存和网络约束"],"ja":["React NativeまたはFlutterを使用してクロスプラットフォームモバイルアプリケーションを構築する","モバイルファースト設計とUXパターンを実装して最適なユーザーエクスペリエンスを実現する","モバイルアプリケーションをバッテリー、メモリ、ネットワークの制約に最適化する"],"ko":["React Native 또는 Flutter를 사용하여 크로스 플랫폼 모바일 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","모바일 우선 설계 및 UX 패턴을 구현하여 최적의 사용자 경험을 달성하는 것","모바일 애플리케이션을 배터리, 메모리, 네트워크 제약 조건에 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones móviles de plataforma cruzada con React Native o Flutter","Implementación de patrones de diseño y UX de primera plataforma móvil para una experiencia de usuario óptima","Optimización de aplicaciones móviles para restricciones de batería, memoria y red"],"fr":["Création d''applications mobiles de plateforme croisée avec React Native ou Flutter","Mise en œuvre de modèles de conception et d''UX de première plateforme mobile pour une expérience utilisateur optimale","Optimisation des applications mobiles pour les contraintes de batterie, de mémoire et de réseau"],"de":["Erstellung von Mobile-Anwendungen für Cross-Platform mit React Native oder Flutter","Implementierung von Design- und UX-Mustern für erste Mobile-Plattform für optimale Benutzererfahrung","Optimierung von Mobile-Anwendungen für Einschränkungen von Batterie, Speicher und Netzwerk"],"pt":["Construção de aplicações móveis cross-platform com React Native ou Flutter","Implementação de padrões de design e UX mobile-first para experiência do usuário ótima","Otimização de aplicações móveis para restrições de bateria, memória e rede"],"ru":["Создание кроссплатформенных мобильных приложений с помощью React Native или Flutter","Реализация шаблонов дизайна и UX mobile-first для оптимального пользовательского опыта","Оптимизация мобильных приложений для ограничений батареи, памяти и сети"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول متعددة المنصات باستخدام React Native أو Flutter","تنفيذ أنماط التصميم والواجهة المستخدمة أولاً الهاتف المحمول لتحقيق تجربة المستخدم المثلى","تحسين تطبيق