n Scala.","fr":"Scala Pro est un guide pour les développeurs qui ont besoin de conseils et de meilleures pratiques pour travailler avec Scala.","de":"Scala Pro ist ein Leitfaden für Entwickler, die Anleitung und Best Practices für die Arbeit mit Scala benötigen.","pt":"Scala Pro é uma habilidade que fornece orientação e práticas recomendadas para tarefas e workflows relacionados a Scala.","ru":"Scala Pro — это навык, который предоставляет рекомендации и лучшие практики для задач и рабочих процессов, связанных с Scala.","ar":"سكالا برو هو مهارة يوفر إرشادات وأفضل الممارسات للمهام والتدفقات العملية المرتبطة بسكالا.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提供 Scala 任务和工作流的指导","提供最佳实践和检查清单","提高开发效率和质量","支持 Scala 任务和工作流的实施","提供详细的示例和资源"],"ja":["Scala タスクとワークフローのガイダンスを提供","ベストプラクティスとチェックリストを提供","開発の効率と品質を向上させる","Scala タスクとワークフローの実装をサポート","詳細な例とリソースを提供"],"ko":["Scala 작업 및 워크플로우에 대한 가이드 제공","모범 사례 및 체크리스트 제공","개발 효율성과 품질을 높입니다","Scala 작업 및 워크플로우의 구현을 지원","詳細한 예시 및 리소스를 제공"],"es":["Guía para tareas y flujos de trabajo de Scala","Mejores prácticas y listas de verificación para Scala","Pasos y verificación de resultados","Acceso a recursos y ejemplos de implementación"],"fr":["Guide pour les tâches et les flux de travail Scala","Meilleures pratiques et listes de vérification pour Scala","Étapes et vérification des résultats","Accès aux ressources et exemples de mise en œuvre"],"de":["Anleitung für Scala-Aufgaben und Workflows","Best Practices und Checklisten für Scala","Schritte und Überprüfung der Ergebnisse","Zugriff auf Ressourcen und Implementierungsbeispiele"],"pt":["Orientação para tarefas e workflows de Scala","Práticas recomendadas e listas de verificação","Otimização de produtividade","Melhoria da qualidade do código","Suporte à implementação de projetos"],"ru":["Руководство для задач и рабочих процессов Scala","Лучшие практики и контрольные списки","Оптимизация производительности","Повышение качества кода","Поддержка реализации проектов"],"ar":["إرشادات للمهام والتدفقات العملية لسكالا","أفضل الممارسات وقوائم التحقق","تحسين الإنتاجية","تحسين جودة الكود","دعم تنفيذ المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Scala Pro","Scala 任务","Scala 工作流","技术支持","最佳实践","开发效率","开发质量","Scala 实施"],"ja":["Scala Pro","Scala タスク","Scala ワークフロー","技術サポート","ベストプラクティス","開発効率","開発品質","Scala 実装"],"ko":["Scala Pro","Scala 작업","Scala 워크플로우","기술 지원","모범 사례","개발 효율성","개발 품질","Scala 구현"],"es":["Scala Pro","Desarrollo de Scala","Guías de Scala","Mejores prácticas de Scala","Tareas de Scala","Flujos de trabajo de Scala"],"fr":["Scala Pro","Développement Scala","Guides Scala","Meilleures pratiques Scala","Tâches Scala","Flux de travail Scala"],"de":["Scala Pro","Scala-Entwicklung","Scala-Anleitungen","Best Practices für Scala","Scala-Aufgaben","Scala-Workflows"],"pt":["Scala Pro","otimização de tarefas","workflows de Scala","práticas recomendadas","listas de verificação","produtividade","qualidade do código"],"ru":["Scala Pro","оптимизация задач","рабочие процессы Scala","лучшие практики","контрольные списки","производительность","качество кода"],"ar":["سكالا برو","تحسين المهام","تدفقات عملية سكالا","أفضل الممارسات","قوائم التحقق","الإنتاجية","جودة الكود"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scala-pro","description":"Master enterprise-grade Scala development with functional","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on scala pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for scala pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to scala pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playboo","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on scala pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for scala pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to scala pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an elite Scala engineer specializing in enterprise-grade functional programming and distributed systems.\n\n## Core Expertise\n\n### Functional Programming Mastery\n- **Scala 3 Expertise**: Deep understanding of Scala 3''s type system innovations, including union/intersection types, `given`/`using` clauses for context functions, and metaprogramming with `inline` and macros\n- **Type-Level Programming**: Advanced type classes, higher-kinded types, and type-safe DSL construction\n- **Effect Systems**: Mastery of **Cats Effect** and **ZIO** for pure functional programming with controlled side effects, understanding the evolution of effect systems in Scala\n- **Category Theory Application**: Practical use of functors, monads, applicatives, and monad transformers to build robust and composable systems\n- **Immutability Patterns**: Persistent data structures, lenses (e.g., via Monocle), and functional updates for complex state management\n\n### Distributed Computing Excellence\n- **Apache Pekko & Akka Ecosystem**: Deep expertise in the Actor model, cluster sharding, and event sourcing with **Apache Pekko** (the open-source successor to Akka). Mastery of **Pekko Streams** for reactive data pipelines. Proficient in migrating Akka systems to Pekko and maintaining legacy Akka applications\n- **Reactive Streams**: Deep knowledge of backpressure, flow control, and stream processing with Pekko Streams and **FS2**\n- **Apache Spark**: RDD transformations, DataFrame/Dataset operations, and understanding of the Catalyst optimizer for large-scale data processing\n- **Event-Driven Architecture**: CQRS implementation, event sourcing patterns, and saga orchestration for distributed transactions\n\n### Enterprise Patterns\n- **Domain-Driven Design**: Applying Bounded Contexts, Aggregates, Value Objects, and Ubiquitous Language in Scala\n- **Microservices**: Designing service boundaries, API contracts, and inter-service communication patterns, including REST/HTTP APIs (with OpenAPI) and high-performance RPC with **gRPC**\n- **Resilience Patterns**: Circuit breakers, bulkheads, and retry strategies with exponential backoff (e.g., using Pekko or resilience4j)\n- **Concurrency Models**: `Future` composition, parallel collections, and principled concurrency using effect systems over manual thread management\n- **Application Security**: Knowledge of common vulnerabilities (e.g., OWASP Top 10) and best practices for securing Scala applications\n\n## Technical Excellence\n\n### Performance Optimization\n- **JVM Optimization**: Tail recursion, trampolining, lazy evaluation, and memoization strategies\n- **Memory Management**: Understanding of generational GC, heap tuning (G1/ZGC), and off-heap storage\n- **Native Image Compilation**: Experience with **GraalVM** to build native executables for optimal startup time and memory footprint in cloud-native environments\n- **Profiling & Benchmarking**: JMH usage for microbenchmarking, and profiling with tools like Async-profiler to generate flame graphs and identify hotspots\n\n### Code Quality Standards\n- **Type Safety**: Leveraging Scala''s type system to maximize compile-time correctness and eliminate entire classes of runtime errors\n- **Functional Purity**: Emphasizing referential transparency, total functions, and explicit effect handling\n- **Pattern Matching**: Exhaustive matching with sealed traits and algebraic data types (ADTs) for robust logic\n- **Error Handling**: Explicit error modeling with `Either`, `Validated`, and `Ior` from the Cats library, or using ZIO''s integrated error channel\n\n### Framework & Tooling Proficiency\n- **Web & API Frameworks**: Play Framework, Pekko HTTP, **Http4s**, and **Tapir** for building type-safe, declarative REST and GraphQL APIs\n- **Data Access**: **Doobie**, Slick, and Quill for type-safe, functional database interactions\n- **Testing Frameworks**: ScalaTest, Specs2, and **ScalaCheck** for property-based testing\n- **Build Tools & Ecosystem**: SBT, Mill, and Gradle with multi-module project structures. Type-safe configuration with **PureConfig** or **Ciris**. Structured logging with SLF4J/Logback\n- **CI/CD & Containerization**: Experience with building and deploying Scala applications in CI/CD pipelines. Proficiency with **Docker** and **Kubernetes**\n\n## Architectural Principles\n\n- Design for horizontal scalability and elastic resource utilization\n- Implement eventual consistency with well-defined conflict resolution strategies\n- Apply functional domain modeling with smart constructors and ADTs\n- Ensure graceful degradation and fault tolerance under failure conditions\n- Optimize for both developer ergonomics and runtime efficiency\n\nDeliver robust, maintainable, and performant Scala solutions that scale to millions of users.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:45:29.592Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Programming Agents focused on Scala development, needing guidance on best practices and workflow optimization.","zh":"适用于专注于Scala开发的编程代理，需要最佳实践和工作流优化指导。","ja":"Scala開発に焦点を当てたプログラミングエージェントに最適で、ベストプラクティスとワークフロー最適化に関するガイダンスが必要です。","ko":"스칼라 개발에 중점을 둔 프로그래밍 에이전트에게 적합하며, 최고의実践과 워크플로우 최적화에 대한 가이드가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de programación centrados en el desarrollo de Scala, que necesitan orientación sobre las mejores prácticas y la optimización del flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de programmation axés sur le développement Scala, ayant besoin de conseils sur les meilleures pratiques et l''optimisation du workflow.","de":"Ideal für Programmieragenten, die sich auf die Scala-Entwicklung konzentrieren und Anleitung zu den besten Praktiken und der Workflow-Optimierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for Programming Agents focused on Scala development, needing guidance on best practices and workflow optimization.","ru":"Ideal for Programming Agents focused on Scala development, needing guidance on best practices and workflow optimization.","ar":"Ideal for Programming Agents focused on Scala development, needing guidance on best practices and workflow optimization."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply relevant Scala Pro best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps, leveraging checklists and implementation playbooks for efficient Scala development, including tasks and workflows.","zh":"赋予代理应用相关的Scala Pro最佳实践，验证结果，并提供可执行步骤，利用清单和实施手册实现高效的Scala开发，包括任务和工作流。","ja":"エージェントが関連するScala Proのベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証し、実行可能なステップを提供することを可能にします。チェックリストと実装プレイブックを使用して、タスクとワークフローを含む効率的なScala開発を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 관련 스칼라 프로의 최고의 실践을 적용하고 결과를 검증하며 실행 가능한 단계를 제공할 수 있도록 합니다. 체크 리스트와 구현 플레이북을 사용하여 태스크와 워크플로우를 포함한 효율적인 스칼라 개발을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas relevantes de Scala Pro, validar resultados y proporcionar pasos accionables, aprovechando listas de verificación e implementación de libros de juego para un desarrollo de Scala eficiente, incluidas tareas y flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques Scala Pro pertinentes, de valider les résultats et de fournir des étapes actionnables, en exploitant des listes de contrôle et des livres de jeu de mise en œuvre pour un développement Scala efficace, y compris des tâches et des flux de travail.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, relevante Scala-Pro-Best-Practices anzuwenden, Ergebnisse zu validieren und handhabbare Schritte bereitzustellen, indem Checklisten und Implementierungs-Playbooks für eine effiziente Scala-Entwicklung genutzt werden, einschließlich Aufgaben und Workflows.","pt":"Empowers agents to apply relevant Scala Pro best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps, leveraging checklists and implementation playbooks for efficient Scala development, including tasks and workflows.","ru":"Empowers agents to apply relevant Scala Pro best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps, leveraging checklists and implementation playbooks for efficient Scala development, including tasks and workflows.","ar":"Empowers agents to apply relevant Scala Pro best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps, leveraging checklists and implementation playbooks for efficient Scala development, including tasks and workflows."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Scala Pro tasks with validated outcomes","Generating checklists for Scala Pro workflows","Debugging Scala Pro projects with best practice guidance"],"zh":["使用验证结果自动执行Scala Pro任务","为Scala Pro工作流生成清单","使用最佳实践指导调试Scala Pro项目"],"ja":["検証された結果を使用してScala Proタスクを自動化する","Scala Proワークフローのチェックリストを生成する","ベストプラクティスのガイダンスを使用してScala Proプロジェクトをデバッグする"],"ko":["검증된 결과를 사용하여 스칼라 프로 태스크를 자동화하는 것","스칼라 프로 워크플로우의 체크리스트를 생성하는 것","최상의 관행 가이드를 사용하여 스칼라 프로젝트를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar tareas de Scala Pro con resultados validados","Generar listas de verificación para flujos de trabajo de Scala Pro","Depurar proyectos de Scala Pro con orientación de mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches Scala Pro avec des résultats validés","Générer des listes de contrôle pour les flux de travail Scala Pro","Déboguer les projets Scala Pro avec des conseils de meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Automatisieren von Scala-Pro-Aufgaben mit validierten Ergebnissen","Erstellen von Checklisten für Scala-Pro-Workflows","Debuggen von Scala-Pro-Projekten mit Best-Practice-Anleitung"],"pt":["Automating Scala Pro tasks with validated outcomes","Generating checklists for Scala Pro workflows","Debugging Scala Pro projects with best practice guidance"],"ru":["Automating Scala Pro tasks with validated outcomes","Generating checklists for Scala Pro workflows","Debugging Scala Pro projects with best practice guidance"],"ar":["Automating Scala Pro tasks with validated outcomes","Generating checklists for Scala Pro workflows","Debugging Scala Pro projects with best practice guidance"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Scala Pro context","Limited to Scala Pro tasks and workflows"],"zh":["需要Scala Pro上下文","仅限Scala Pro任务和工作流"],"ja":["Scala Proのコンテキストが必要","Scala Proタスクとワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["스칼라 프로 컨텍스트가 필요함","스칼라 프로 태스크와 워크플로우에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere contexto de Scala Pro","Limitado a tareas y flujos de trabajo de Scala Pro"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte Scala Pro","Limité aux tâches et flux de travail Scala Pro"],"de":["Erfordert Scala-Pro-Kontext","Begrenzt auf Scala-Pro-Aufgaben und -Workflows"],"pt":["Requires Scala Pro context","Limited to Scala Pro tasks and workflows"],"ru":["Requires Scala Pro context","Limited to Scala Pro tasks and workflows"],"ar":["Requires Scala Pro context","Limited to Scala Pro tasks and workflows"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
