React und TypeScript","pt":"FSD Checker: Validador de Arquitetura para Desenvolvedores","ru":"FSD Checker: Проверка Архитектуры для Разработчиков","ar":"فسد تشيكر: مدقق بنية للمطورين","en":"fsd-check"},"description":{"zh":"FSD 检查工具用于验证代码库的特性切片设计，确保代码的可维护性和可扩展性。它检查代码库是否遵循严格的 FSD 方法论","ja":"FSD チェックツールは、コードベースの機能スライス設計を検証し、コードの維持可能性と拡張可能性を確保します。コードベースが厳格な FSD 方法論に準拠していることを確認します","ko":"FSD 검사 도구는 코드베이스의 기능 슬라이스 설계를 검증하여 코드의 유지 보수성과 확장성을 보장합니다. 코드베이스가 엄격한 FSD 방법론에 따라 작성되었는지 확인합니다","es":"El comprobador de arquitectura FSD es una herramienta para validar el cumplimiento de la metodología FSD en tu código. Ayuda a mantener una arquitectura limp...","fr":"Le vérificateur d''architecture FSD est un outil pour valider le respect de la méthodologie FSD dans votre code. Il aide à maintenir une architecture propre e...","de":"Der FSD-Architektur-Prüfer ist ein Werkzeug zum Validieren der Einhaltung der FSD-Methodologie in Ihrem Code. Es hilft, eine saubere und skalierbare Architek...","pt":"O FSD Checker é uma ferramenta para validar a arquitetura Feature-Sliced Design em seu código, garantindo uma organização clara e escalável","ru":"FSD Checker - это инструмент для проверки архитектуры Feature-Sliced Design в вашем коде, обеспечивающий ясную и масштабируемую организацию","ar":"فسد تشيكر هو أداة للتحقق من بنية تصميم الفeatures المقطعة في الكود الخاص بك، مما يضمن التنظيم الواضح والقابل للتطوير","en":"Modern blogging platform built with React, TypeScript and Mantine"},"definition":{"en":"Modern blogging platform built with React, TypeScript and Mantine"},"features":{"zh":["验证代码库的特性切片设计","检查代码库是否遵循严格的 FSD 方法论","确保代码的可维护性和可扩展性","支持 React、TypeScript 和 Mantine","提供详细的检查报告"],"ja":["コードベースの機能スライス設計を検証","コードベースが厳格な FSD 方法論に準拠していることを確認","コードの維持可能性と拡張可能性を確保","React、TypeScript、Mantine をサポート","詳細なチェックレポートを提供"],"ko":["코드베이스의 기능 슬라이스 설계를 검증","코드베이스가 엄격한 FSD 방법론에 따라 작성되었는지 확인","코드의 유지 보수성과 확장성을 보장","React, TypeScript, Mantine을 지원","詳細한 검사 보고서를 제공"],"es":["Validación de la jerarquía de capas FSD","Comprobación de importaciones entre capas","Uso de imports absolutos con alias @/*","Respeto de la metodología FSD","Mejora de la arquitectura del código"],"fr":["Validation de la hiérarchie des couches FSD","Vérification des importations entre couches","Utilisation d''imports absolus avec alias @/*","Respect de la méthodologie FSD","Amélioration de l''architecture du code"],"de":["Validierung der FSD-Schichten-Hierarchie","Überprüfung von Importen zwischen Schichten","Verwendung von absoluten Importen mit Alias @/*","Einhaltung der FSD-Methodologie","Verbesserung der Code-Architektur"],"pt":["Validação de arquitetura Feature-Sliced Design","Verificação de importações entre camadas","Uso de imports absolutos com alias @/*","Compatibilidade com React, TypeScript e Mantine","Melhoria da organização do código"],"ru":["Проверка архитектуры Feature-Sliced Design","Проверка импортов между слоями","Использование абсолютных импортов с псевдонимом @/*","Совместимость с React, TypeScript и Mantine","Улучшение организации кода"],"ar":["التحقق من بنية تصميم الفeatures المقطعة","التحقق من الاستيرادات بين الطبقات","استخدام الاستيرادات المطلقة مع الاسم المستعار @/*","التوافق مع React و TypeScript و Mantine","تحسين تنظيم الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["FSD 检查工具","特性切片设计","代码库验证","React","TypeScript","Mantine","代码可维护性","代码可扩展性"],"ja":["FSD チェックツール","機能スライス設計","コードベース検証","React","TypeScript","Mantine","コードの維持可能性","コードの拡張可能性"],"ko":["FSD 검사 도구","기능 슬라이스 설계","코드베이스 검증","React","TypeScript","Mantine","코드 유지 보수성","코드 확장성"],"es":["FSD","arquitectura FSD","React","TypeScript","comprobador de arquitectura","metodología FSD","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["FSD","architecture FSD","React","TypeScript","vérificateur d''architecture","méthodologie FSD","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["FSD","FSD-Architektur","React","TypeScript","Architektur-Prüfer","FSD-Methodologie","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["FSD Checker","arquitetura Feature-Sliced Design","validação de código","organização de código","React","TypeScript","Mantine","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["FSD Checker","архитектура Feature-Sliced Design","проверка кода","организация кода","React","TypeScript","Mantine","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["فسد تشيكر","بنية تصميم الفeatures المقطعة","التحقق من الكود","تنظيم الكود","رياكت","تايب سكريبت","مانتين","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"riedel28","repo":"article-space","repoPath":"riedel28/article-space","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fsd-check","description":"Validate Feature-Sliced Design architecture compliance. Checks layer imports, public API usage, and cross-slice violations. Use when asked to check FSD, validate architecture, check imports, or FSD audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# FSD Architecture Checker\n\nValidates Feature-Sliced Design compliance for this codebase.\n\n## FSD Layer Hierarchy\n\nThe project follows strict FSD methodology:\n\n```\napp → pages → widgets → features → entities → shared\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n\n- Layers can ONLY import from layers below them\n- No cross-imports within the same layer (features cannot import other features)\n- All imports must go through public API (`index.ts`)\n- Use absolute imports with `@/*` alias\n\n## Checks Performed\n\n### 1. Layer Import V","body":"# FSD Architecture Checker\n\nValidates Feature-Sliced Design compliance for this codebase.\n\n## FSD Layer Hierarchy\n\nThe project follows strict FSD methodology:\n\n```\napp → pages → widgets → features → entities → shared\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n\n- Layers can ONLY import from layers below them\n- No cross-imports within the same layer (features cannot import other features)\n- All imports must go through public API (`index.ts`)\n- Use absolute imports with `@/*` alias\n\n## Checks Performed\n\n### 1. Layer Import Violations\n\nCheck that imports respect the hierarchy:\n\n- `app` can import: pages, widgets, features, entities, shared\n- `pages` can import: widgets, features, entities, shared\n- `widgets` can import: features, entities, shared\n- `features` can import: entities, shared\n- `entities` can import: shared, other entities (same layer allowed)\n- `shared` can only import: shared\n\n### 2. Public API Violations\n\nAll imports from `entities`, `features`, `pages`, `widgets` must go through `index.ts`\n\n```typescript\n// CORRECT\nimport { Article } from ''@/entities/Article'';\n\n// WRONG - bypasses public API\nimport { Article } from ''@/entities/Article/model/types'';\n```\n\n### 3. Cross-Slice Violations\n\nWithin the same layer, slices should not import each other directly:\n\n```typescript\n// In features/AuthByUsername - WRONG\nimport { something } from ''@/features/AnotherFeature'';\n```\n\n### 4. Missing Public API\n\nCheck if slices have proper `index.ts` exports.\n\n## How to Run Checks\n\n### Option A: Run ESLint FSD Rules\n\n```bash\nnpx eslint \"src/**/*.{ts,tsx}\" --rule ''ulbi-tv-plugin/layer-imports: error'' --rule ''ulbi-tv-plugin/public-api-imports: error'' --rule ''ulbi-tv-plugin/path-checker: error''\n```\n\n### Option B: Manual Analysis\n\n1. Use Grep to find problematic import patterns\n2. Check specific layers or slices\n\n## Analysis Workflow\n\nWhen user invokes `/fsd-check`:\n\n1. **If argument provided** (e.g., `/fsd-check features`):\n   - Focus analysis on that specific layer or path\n   - Run targeted checks\n\n2. **If no argument**:\n   - Ask user what to check: full codebase, specific layer, or specific slice\n   - Or run quick overview of all layers\n\n3. **For each check**:\n   - Search for violation patterns using Grep\n   - Report findings in format: `file:line - violation description`\n\n4. **Output summary**:\n   - Total violations by category\n   - Most problematic files/slices\n   - Suggested fixes\n\n## Common Violation Patterns to Search\n\n### Layer violations (Grep patterns)\n\n```\n# Features importing from pages/widgets\npath: src/features/\npattern: from [''\"]@/(pages|widgets)/\n\n# Entities importing from features/pages/widgets\npath: src/entities/\npattern: from [''\"]@/(features|pages|widgets)/\n\n# Shared importing from any other layer\npath: src/shared/\npattern: from [''\"]@/(entities|features|pages|widgets|app)/\n```\n\n### Public API violations\n\n```\n# Deep imports into slices (more than 2 segments after @/)\npattern: from [''\"]@/(entities|features|pages|widgets)/[^''\"]+/[^''\"]+\n```\n\n### Cross-slice violations\n\n```\n# Feature importing another feature (check current file path vs import)\n# This requires analyzing file location context\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nReport findings as:\n\n```\n## FSD Violations Found\n\n### Layer Import Violations (X found)\n- `src/features/Auth/ui/LoginForm.tsx:15` - features cannot import from widgets\n- `src/entities/User/model/slice.ts:3` - entities cannot import from features\n\n### Public API Violations (X found)\n- `src/widgets/Sidebar/ui/Sidebar.tsx:8` - import should be `@/entities/User` not `@/entities/User/model/types`\n\n### Cross-Slice Violations (X found)\n- `src/features/Auth/ui/Form.tsx:12` - feature should not import from another feature\n\n### Summary\n- Total: X violations\n- Critical: X (layer violations)\n- Fixable: X (public API - has autofix via ESLint)\n```\n\n## Quick Commands\n\nFor the user''s reference:\n\n```bash\n# Run all FSD ESLint rules\nnpm run lint:ts -- --rule ''ulbi-tv-plugin/layer-imports: error''\n\n# Check specific layer\nnpx eslint \"src/features/**/*.{ts,tsx}\" --rule ''ulbi-tv-plugin/layer-imports: error''\n\n# Auto-fix public API imports\nnpx eslint \"src/**/*.{ts,tsx}\" --rule ''ulbi-tv-plugin/public-api-imports: error'' --fix\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:45:30.458Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing Feature-Sliced Design compliance validation for React and TypeScript projects.","zh":"非常适合需要对 React 和 TypeScript 项目进行特性分片设计合规性验证的代码分析代理。","ja":"React と TypeScript プロジェクトの機能スライス設計のコンプライアンス検証が必要なコード分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 및 TypeScript 프로젝트의 기능 분할 설계 규정 준수 검증이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan validación de cumplimiento del diseño Feature-Sliced para proyectos de React y TypeScript.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant une validation de conformité au design Feature-Sliced pour les projets React et TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine Validierung der Feature-Sliced Design-Konformität für React- und TypeScript-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing Feature-Sliced Design compliance validation for React and TypeScript projects.","ru":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing Feature-Sliced Design compliance validation for React and TypeScript projects.","ar":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing Feature-Sliced Design compliance validation for React and TypeScript projects."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce strict FSD methodology, ensuring layers only import from layers below them, with absolute imports using the `@/*` alias, and validating compliance through public API (`index.ts`) imports. It analyzes the layer hierarchy, including `app`, `pages`, `widgets`, `features`, `entities`, and `shared` layers, to prevent cross-imports within the same layer.","zh":"赋予代理强制执行严格的特性分片设计方法，确保层只从下面的层导入，使用绝对导入和 `@/*` 别名，并通过公共 API（`index.ts`）导入验证合规性。它分析层次结构，包括 `app`、`pages`、`widgets`、`features`、`entities` 和 `shared` 层，以防止同一层内的交叉导入。","ja":"エージェントに厳格な機能スライス設計方法を適用させ、下位層からののみのインポートを保証し、絶対インポートと `@/*` エイリアスを使用し、パブリック API（`index.ts`）でのインポートを介してコンプライアンスを検証する。`app`、`pages`、`widgets`、`features`、`entities`、`shared` 層を含む層階層を分析し、同一層内でのクロスインポートを防止する。","ko":"에이전트가 엄격한 기능 분할 설계 방법론을 시행하도록 허용하여, 계层이 하위 계층에서만 가져오도록 하고, 절대 가져오기 및 `@/*` 별칭을 사용하며, 공용 API(`index.ts`) 가져오기를 통해 규정 준수를 검증합니다. `app`, `pages`, `widgets`, `features`, `entities`, `shared` 계층을 포함한 계층 계층을 분석하여 동일한 계층 내의 교차 가져오기를 방지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar una metodología FSD estricta, asegurando que las capas solo importen desde capas inferiores, con importaciones absolutas utilizando el alias `@/*`, y validando el cumplimiento a través de importaciones de API pública (`index.ts`). Analiza la jerarquía de capas, incluyendo las capas `app`, `pages`, `widgets`, `features`, `entities` y `shared`, para prevenir importaciones cruzadas dentro de la misma capa.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer une méthodologie FSD stricte, en veillant à ce que les couches n''importent que depuis les couches inférieures, avec des imports absolus utilisant l''alias `@/*`, et en validant la conformité via les imports d''API publique (`index.ts`). Il analyse la hiérarchie des couches, y compris les couches `app`, `pages`, `widgets`, `features`, `entities` et `shared`, pour empêcher les imports croisés au sein de la même couche.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, eine strikte FSD-Methodologie durchzusetzen, um sicherzustellen, dass Ebenen nur von untergeordneten Ebenen importieren, mit absoluten Importen unter Verwendung des `@/*`-Alias, und validiert die Konformität durch Imports der öffentlichen API (`index.ts`). Es analysiert die Ebenenhierarchie, einschließlich der `app`-, `pages`-, `widgets`-, `features`-, `entities`- und `shared`-Ebenen, um Querimporte innerhalb derselben Ebene zu verhindern.","pt":"Empowers agents to enforce strict FSD methodology, ensuring layers only import from layers below them, with absolute imports using the `@/*` alias, and validating compliance through public API (`index.ts`) imports. It analyzes the layer hierarchy, including `app`, `pages`, `widgets`, `features`, `entities`, and `shared` layers, to prevent cross-imports within the same layer.","ru":"Empowers agents to enforce strict FSD methodology, ensuring layers only import from layers below them, with absolute imports using the `@/*` alias, and validating compliance through public API (`index.ts`) imports. It analyzes the layer hierarchy, including `app`, `pages`, `widgets`, `features`, `entities`, and `shared` layers, to prevent cross-imports within the same layer.","ar":"Empowers agents to enforce strict FSD methodology, ensuring layers only import from layers below them, with absolute imports using the `@/*` alias, and validating compliance through public API (`index.ts`) imports. It analyzes the layer hierarchy, including `app`, `pages`, `widgets`, `features`, `entities`, and `shared` layers, to prevent cross-imports within the same layer."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating Feature-Sliced Design compliance for React projects","Enforcing strict layer import rules for TypeScript codebases","Analyzing layer hierarchy for potential import violations"],"zh":["验证 React 项目的特性分片设计合规性","强制执行 TypeScript 代码库的严格层导入规则","分析层次结构以查找潜在的导入违规"],"ja":["React プロジェクトの機能スライス設計のコンプライアンスを検証する","TypeScript コードベースの厳格な層インポート規則を適用する","潜在的なインポート違反を検知するための層階層の分析"],"ko":["React 프로젝트의 기능 분할 설계 규정 준수 검증","TypeScript 코드베이스의 엄격한 계층 가져오기 규칙 시행","潜在적인 가져오기 위반을 탐지하기 위한 계층 계층 분석"],"es":["Validación del cumplimiento del diseño Feature-Sliced para proyectos React","Aplicación de reglas estrictas de importación de capas para bases de código TypeScript","Análisis de la jerarquía de capas para detectar posibles violaciones de importación"],"fr":["Validation de la conformité au design Feature-Sliced pour les projets React","Application de règles strictes d''importation de couches pour les bases de code TypeScript","Analyse de la hiérarchie des couches pour détecter d''éventuelles violations d''importation"],"de":["Validierung der Feature-Sliced Design-Konformität für React-Projekte","Durchsetzung strenger Ebenen-Importregeln für TypeScript-Codebasen","Analyse der Ebenenhierarchie auf potenzielle Importverstöße"],"pt":["Validating Feature-Sliced Design compliance for React projects","Enforcing strict layer import rules for TypeScript codebases","Analyzing layer hierarchy for potential import violations"],"ru":["Validating Feature-Sliced Design compliance for React projects","Enforcing strict layer import rules for TypeScript codebases","Analyzing layer hierarchy for potential import violations"],"ar":["Validating Feature-Sliced Design compliance for React projects","Enforcing strict layer import rules for TypeScript codebases","Analyzing layer hierarchy for potential import violations"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and TypeScript project setup","Only supports Feature-Sliced Design architecture","Must use absolute imports with `@/*` alias"],"zh":["需要 React 和 TypeScript 项目设置","仅支持特性分片设计架构","必须使用绝对导入和 `@/*` 别名"],"ja":["React と TypeScript プロジェクトの設定が必要","機能スライス設計アーキテクチャのみをサポート","絶対インポートと `@/*` エイリアスを使用する必要がある"],"ko":["React 및 TypeScript 프로젝트 설정이 필요","기능 분할 설계 아키텍처만 지원","절대 가져오기 및 `@/*` 별칭을 사용해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de proyecto React y TypeScript","Solo admite la arquitectura de diseño Feature-Sliced","Debe utilizar importaciones absolutas con el alias `@/*`"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React et TypeScript","Prend uniquement en charge l''architecture Feature-Sliced Design","Doit utiliser des imports absolus avec l''alias `@/*`"],"de":["Erfordert eine React- und TypeScript-Projekteinrichtung","Unterstützt nur die Feature-Sliced Design-Architektur","Muss absolute Importe mit dem `@/*`-Alias verwenden"],"pt":["Requires React and TypeScript project setup","Only supports Feature-Sliced Design architecture","Must use absolute imports with `@/*` alias"],"ru":["Requires React and TypeScript project setup","Only supports Feature-Sliced Design architecture","Must use absolute imports with `@/*` alias"],"ar":["Requires React and TypeScript project setup","Only supports Feature-Sliced Design architecture","Must use absolute imports with `@/*` alias"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('StarKnightt/MineCraft/web-games', 'community', 'StarKnightt', 'MineCraft', 'StarKnightt/MineCraft', 'web-games', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z', '2026-02-18T09:46:01.068Z', NULL, '{"id":"StarKnightt/MineCraft/web-games","name":"web-games","description":{"zh":"Web","ja":"Web","ko":"Web ","es":"El desarrollo de juegos web requiere una selección cuidadosa de frameworks. Aprende a elegir el adecuado para tu proyecto","fr":"Le développement de jeux web nécessite une sélection minutieuse de frameworks. Découvrez comment choisir le bon pour votre projet","de":"Die Entwicklung von Web-Spielen erfordert eine sorgfältige Auswahl von Frameworks. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie das richtige für Ihr Projekt auswählen","pt":"Desenvolvimento de jogos para web envolve a seleção de frameworks e princípios específicos do navegador. Aprenda a escolher o framework certo para o seu projeto.","ru":"Разработка веб-игр включает в себя выбор фреймворков и браузер-специфичных принципов. Узнайте, как выбрать правильный фреймворк для вашего проекта.","ar":"يتضمن تطوير ألعاب الويب اختيار الإطارات والمبادئ المحددة للمتصفح. تعلم كيفية اختيار الإطار الصحيح لمشروعك.","en":"Nothing just craft mine with vibe "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"web-","ja":"Web","ko":"Web ","es":"Desarrollo de juegos web: selección de frameworks","fr":"Développement de jeux web : sélection de frameworks","de":"Web-Spiele-Entwicklung: Framework-Auswahl","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Jogos para Web","ru":"Разработка веб-игр","ar":"تطوير ألعاب الويب","en":"web-games"},"description":{"zh":"Web","ja":"Web","ko":"Web ","es":"El desarrollo de juegos web requiere una selección cuidadosa de frameworks. Aprende a elegir el adecuado para tu proyecto","fr":"Le développement de jeux web nécessite une sélection minutieuse de frameworks. Découvrez comment choisir le bon pour votre projet","de":"Die Entwicklung von Web-Spielen erfordert eine sorgfältige Auswahl von Frameworks. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie das richtige für Ihr Projekt auswählen","pt":"Desenvolvimento de jogos para web envolve a seleção de frameworks e princípios específicos do navegador. Aprenda a escolher o framework certo para o seu proj...","ru":"Разработка веб-игр включает в себя выбор фреймворков и браузер-специфичных принципов. Узнайте, как выбрать правильный фреймворк для вашего проекта.","ar":"يتضمن تطوير ألعاب الويب اختيار الإطارات والمبادئ المحددة للمتصفح. تعلم كيفية اختيار الإطار الصحيح لمشروعك.","en":"Nothing just craft mine with vibe "},"definition":{"en":"Nothing just craft mine with vibe "},"features":{"zh":["2D","3D","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js"],"ja":["2D","3D","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js"],"ko":["2D","3D","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js"],"es":["Selección de frameworks para juegos web en 2D y 3D","Uso de Phaser para juegos web con características de motor completo","Uso de PixiJS para juegos web con renderizado raw","Uso de Babylon.js para juegos web con física y realidad virtual","Uso de Three.js para juegos web con renderizado enfocado"],"fr":["Sélection de frameworks pour les jeux web en 2D et 3D","Utilisation de Phaser pour les jeux web avec des fonctionnalités de moteur complet","Utilisation de PixiJS pour les jeux web avec un rendu brut","Utilisation de Babylon.js pour les jeux web avec de la physique et de la réalité virtuelle","Utilisation de Three.js pour les jeux web avec un rendu ciblé"],"de":["Auswahl von Frameworks für Web-Spiele in 2D und 3D","Verwendung von Phaser für Web-Spiele mit Vollmotor-Funktionen","Verwendung von PixiJS für Web-Spiele mit Rohrendering","Verwendung von Babylon.js für Web-Spiele mit Physik und virtueller Realität","Verwendung von Three.js für Web-Spiele mit renderorientierter Ausgabe"],"pt":["Seleção de frameworks","Princípios específicos do navegador","Desenvolvimento de jogos 2D e 3D","Uso de bibliotecas como Phaser e PixiJS","Otimização para dispositivos móveis"],"ru":["Выбор фреймворков","Браузер-специфичные принципы","Разработка 2D и 3D игр","Использование библиотек như Phaser и PixiJS","Оптимизация для мобильных устройств"],"ar":["اختيار الإطارات","مبادئ محددة للمتصفح","تطوير ألعاب 2D و 3D","استخدام المكتبات مثل Phaser و PixiJS","تحسين الأداء للأجهزة المحمولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web","2D","3D","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js","WebGL","Canvas"],"ja":["Web","2D","3D","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js","WebGL","Canvas"],"ko":["Web","2D","3D","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js","WebGL","Canvas"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos web","frameworks para juegos web","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js","juegos web en 2D","juegos web en 3D"],"fr":["développement de jeux web","frameworks pour les jeux web","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js","jeux web en 2D","jeux web en 3D"],"de":["Web-Spiele-Entwicklung","Frameworks für Web-Spiele","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js","Web-Spiele in 2D","Web-Spiele in 3D"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos para web","frameworks de jogos","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js","jogos 2D","jogos 3D"],"ru":["разработка веб-игр","фреймворки игр","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js","2D игры","3D игры"],"ar":["تطوير ألعاب الويب","إطارات ألعاب","Phaser","PixiJS","Babylon.js","Three.js","ألعاب 2D","ألعاب 3D"]}},"owner":"StarKnightt","repo":"MineCraft","repoPath":"StarKnightt/MineCraft","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web-games","description":"Web browser game development principles. Framework selection, WebGPU, optimization, PWA.","bodyPreview":"# Web Browser Game Development\n\n> Framework selection and browser-specific principles.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Framework Selection\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat type of game?\n│\n├── 2D Game\n│   ├── Full game engine features? → Phaser\n│   └── Raw rendering power? → PixiJS\n│\n├── 3D Game\n│   ├── Full engine (physics, XR)? → Babylon.js\n│   └── Rendering focused? → Three.js\n│\n└── Hybrid / Canvas\n    └── Custom → Raw Canvas/WebGL\n```\n\n### Comparison (2025)\n\n| Framework | Type | Best For |\n|-----------|------|------","body":"# Web Browser Game Development\n\n> Framework selection and browser-specific principles.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Framework Selection\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat type of game?\n│\n├── 2D Game\n│   ├── Full game engine features? → Phaser\n│   └── Raw rendering power? → PixiJS\n│\n├── 3D Game\n│   ├── Full engine (physics, XR)? → Babylon.js\n│   └── Rendering focused? → Three.js\n│\n└── Hybrid / Canvas\n    └── Custom → Raw Canvas/WebGL\n```\n\n### Comparison (2025)\n\n| Framework | Type | Best For |\n|-----------|------|----------|\n| **Phaser 4** | 2D | Full game features |\n| **PixiJS 8** | 2D | Rendering, UI |\n| **Three.js** | 3D | Visualizations, lightweight |\n| **Babylon.js 7** | 3D | Full engine, XR |\n\n---\n\n## 2. WebGPU Adoption\n\n### Browser Support (2025)\n\n| Browser | Support |\n|---------|---------|\n| Chrome | ✅ Since v113 |\n| Edge | ✅ Since v113 |\n| Firefox | ✅ Since v131 |\n| Safari | ✅ Since 18.0 |\n| **Total** | **~73%** global |\n\n### Decision\n\n- **New projects**: Use WebGPU with WebGL fallback\n- **Legacy support**: Start with WebGL\n- **Feature detection**: Check `navigator.gpu`\n\n---\n\n## 3. Performance Principles\n\n### Browser Constraints\n\n| Constraint | Strategy |\n|------------|----------|\n| No local file access | Asset bundling, CDN |\n| Tab throttling | Pause when hidden |\n| Mobile data limits | Compress assets |\n| Audio autoplay | Require user interaction |\n\n### Optimization Priority\n\n1. **Asset compression** - KTX2, Draco, WebP\n2. **Lazy loading** - Load on demand\n3. **Object pooling** - Avoid GC\n4. **Draw call batching** - Reduce state changes\n5. **Web Workers** - Offload heavy computation\n\n---\n\n## 4. Asset Strategy\n\n### Compression Formats\n\n| Type | Format |\n|------|--------|\n| Textures | KTX2 + Basis Universal |\n| Audio | WebM/Opus (fallback: MP3) |\n| 3D Models | glTF + Draco/Meshopt |\n\n### Loading Strategy\n\n| Phase | Load |\n|-------|------|\n| Startup | Core assets, <2MB |\n| Gameplay | Stream on demand |\n| Background | Prefetch next level |\n\n---\n\n## 5. PWA for Games\n\n### Benefits\n\n- Offline play\n- Install to home screen\n- Full screen mode\n- Push notifications\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Service worker for caching\n- Web app manifest\n- HTTPS\n\n---\n\n## 6. Audio Handling\n\n### Browser Requirements\n\n- Audio context requires user interaction\n- Create AudioContext on first click/tap\n- Resume context if suspended\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Use Web Audio API\n- Pool audio sources\n- Preload common sounds\n- Compress with WebM/Opus\n\n---\n\n## 7. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Load all assets upfront | Progressive loading |\n| Ignore tab visibility | Pause when hidden |\n| Block on audio load | Lazy load audio |\n| Skip compression | Compress everything |\n| Assume fast connection | Handle slow networks |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Browser is the most accessible platform. Respect its constraints.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:46:01.068Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents tasked with selecting and implementing browser-based game frameworks.","zh":"适用于负责选择和实现基于浏览器的游戏框架的代码生成代理。","ja":"ブラウザベースのゲームフレームワークを選択して実装するコード生成エージェントに適しています。","ko":"브라우저 기반 게임 프레임워크를 선택하고 구현하는 코드 생성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de código encargados de seleccionar e implementar frameworks de juegos basados en navegador.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de code chargés de sélectionner et de mettre en œuvre des frameworks de jeux basés sur navigateur.","de":"Ideal für Code-Generierungsagenten, die mit der Auswahl und Implementierung von browserbasierten Spiel-Frameworks betraut sind.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de geração de código incumbidos de selecionar e implementar estruturas de jogos baseadas em navegador.","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации кода, задачей которых является выбор и реализация фреймворков игр на основе браузера.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات توليد الكود المكلفة بتحديد وإضافة إطارات ألعاب قائمة على متصفح الإنترنت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze project requirements and recommend optimal web game frameworks like Phaser, PixiJS, Babylon.js, or Three.js based on 2D/3D needs, rendering power, and engine feature requirements.","zh":"赋予代理分析项目需求并根据2D/3D需求、渲染能力和引擎功能需求推荐像Phaser、PixiJS、Babylon.js或Three.js这样的最佳Web游戏框架的能力。","ja":"2D/3Dの要件、レンダリング能力、エンジンの機能要件に基づいて、Phaser、PixiJS、Babylon.js、またはThree.jsなどの最適なWebゲームフレームワークを分析して推奨するエージェントの能力を提供します。","ko":"2D/3D 요구 사항, 렌더링 성능 및 엔진 기능 요구 사항에 따라 Phaser, PixiJS, Babylon.js 또는 Three.js와 같은 최적의 웹 게임 프레임워크를 분석하여 추천하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar los requisitos del proyecto y recomendar frameworks de juegos web óptimos como Phaser, PixiJS, Babylon.js o Three.js en función de las necesidades 2D/3D, la potencia de renderizado y los requisitos de características del motor.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les exigences du projet et de recommander des frameworks de jeux web optimaux comme Phaser, PixiJS, Babylon.js ou Three.js en fonction des besoins 2D/3D, de la puissance de rendu et des exigences de fonctionnalités du moteur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Projektanforderungen zu analysieren und optimale Web-Game-Frameworks wie Phaser, PixiJS, Babylon.js oder Three.js basierend auf 2D/3D-Anforderungen, Renderleistung und Motorfunktionserfordernissen zu empfehlen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar os requisitos do projeto e recomendar estruturas de jogos web ótimas, como Phaser, PixiJS, Babylon.js ou Three.js, com base nas necessidades 2D/3D, potência de renderização e requisitos de recursos do mecanismo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать требования проекта и рекомендовать оптимальные фреймворки веб-игр, такие как Phaser, PixiJS, Babylon.js или Three.js, на основе 2D/3D потребностей, мощности рендеринга и требований функций движка.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل متطلبات المشروع وتقديم إطارات ألعاب إنترنت مثالية مثل Phaser و PixiJS و Babylon.js أو Three.js بناءً على احتياجات 2D/3D وقوة العرض ومتطلبات ميزات المحرك."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating framework selection logic based on game type","Creating boilerplate code for Canvas/WebGL implementations","Optimizing rendering performance for browser environments"],"zh":["根据游戏类型生成框架选择逻辑","为Canvas/WebGL实现创建样板代码","优化浏览器环境的渲染性能"],"ja":["ゲームの種類に基づいてフレームワーク選択ロジックを生成する","Canvas/WebGL実装のためのボイラープレートコードを作成する","ブラウザ環境のレンダリング性能を最適化する"],"ko":["게임 유형에 따라 프레임워크 선택 로직을 생성하는 것","Canvas/WebGL 구현을 위한 보일러プレ이트 코드 생성","브라우저 환경의 렌더링 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Generar lógica de selección de framework en función del tipo de juego","Crear código de implementación básica para implementaciones de Canvas/WebGL","Optimizar el rendimiento de renderizado para entornos de navegador"],"fr":["Générer une logique de sélection de framework en fonction du type de jeu","Créer du code de base pour les implémentations de Canvas/WebGL","Optimiser les performances de rendu pour les environnements de navigateur"],"de":["Erzeugen von Framework-Auswahllogik basierend auf dem Spieltyp","Erstellen von Grundcode für Canvas-/WebGL-Implementierungen","Optimieren der Renderleistung für Browserumgebungen"],"pt":["Gerar lógica de seleção de estrutura com base no tipo de jogo","Criar código de inicialização para implementações de Canvas/WebGL","Otimizar o desempenho de renderização para ambientes de navegador"],"ru":["Генерировать логику выбора фреймворка на основе типа игры","Создавать код инициализации для реализаций Canvas/WebGL","Оптимизировать производительность рендеринга для среды браузера"],"ar":["توليد منطق اختيار الإطار بناءً على نوع اللعبة","إنشاء код البداية لتنفيذات Canvas / WebGL","تحسين أداء العرض في بيئات متصفح الإنترنت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Browser-specific compatibility considerations required","Limited to JavaScript/TypeScript ecosystem frameworks"],"zh":["需要考虑浏览器特定的兼容性问题","仅限于JavaScript/TypeScript生态系统框架"],"ja":["ブラウザ固有の互換性の考慮が必要","JavaScript/TypeScriptエコシステムのフレームワークのみ"],"ko":["브라우저별 호환성 문제 고려 필요","JavaScript/TypeScript 생태계 프레임워크에만 제한"],"es":["Se requieren consideraciones de compatibilidad específicas del navegador","Limitado a frameworks del ecosistema JavaScript/TypeScript"],"fr":["Des considérations de compatibilité spécifiques au navigateur sont requises","Limité aux frameworks de l''écosystème JavaScript/TypeScript"],"de":["Browser-spezifische Kompatibilitätsaspekte sind erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Frameworks des JavaScript/TypeScript-Ökosystems"],"pt":["Considerações de compatibilidade específicas do navegador são necessárias","Limitado a estruturas do ecossistema JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ru":["Требуются браузер-специфические соображения совместимости","Ограничен фреймворками экосистемы JavaScript/TypeScript"],"ar":["يُشترط أخذ الاعتبارات المتعلقة بالتوافق النوعي للمتصفح","محدود بالإطارات النمطية من بيئة جافا سكريبت/تايب سكريبت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
