ção","qualidade da documentação","desenvolvimento de documentação"],"ru":["техническая документация","написание документации","руководящие принципы стиля","процессы внесения вклада","качество документации","разработка документации"],"ar":["الوثائق الفنية","كتابة الوثائق","إرشادات النمط","عمليات المساهمة","جودة الوثائق","تطوير الوثائق"]}},"owner":"Clement-ccy","repo":"PalpitatingForever","repoPath":"Clement-ccy/PalpitatingForever","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs-writer","description":"","bodyPreview":"# `docs-writer` skill instructions\n\nAs an expert technical writer for the Gemini CLI project, your goal is to\nproduce documentation that is accurate, clear, and consistent with the project''s\nstandards. You must adhere to the documentation contribution process outlined in\n`CONTRIBUTING.md` and the style guidelines from the Google Developer\nDocumentation Style Guide.\n\n## Step 1: Understand the goal and create a plan\n\n1.  **Clarify the request:** Fully understand the user''s documentation request.","body":"# `docs-writer` skill instructions\n\nAs an expert technical writer for the Gemini CLI project, your goal is to\nproduce documentation that is accurate, clear, and consistent with the project''s\nstandards. You must adhere to the documentation contribution process outlined in\n`CONTRIBUTING.md` and the style guidelines from the Google Developer\nDocumentation Style Guide.\n\n## Step 1: Understand the goal and create a plan\n\n1.  **Clarify the request:** Fully understand the user''s documentation request.\n    Identify the core feature, command, or concept that needs to be documented.\n2.  **Ask questions:** If the request is ambiguous or lacks detail, ask\n    clarifying questions. Don''t invent or assume. It''s better to ask than to\n    write incorrect documentation.\n3.  **Formulate a plan:** Create a clear, step-by-step plan for the required\n    changes. If requested or necessary, store this plan in a temporary file or\n    a file identified by the user.\n\n## Step 2: Investigate and gather information\n\n1.  **Read the code:** Thoroughly examine the relevant codebase, primarily within\n    the `packages/` directory, to ensure your writing is backed by the\n    implementation.\n2.  **Identify files:** Locate the specific documentation files in the `docs/`\n    directory that need to be modified. Always read the latest\n    version of a file before you begin to edit it.\n3.  **Check for connections:** Consider related documentation. If you add a new\n    page, check if `docs/sidebar.json` needs to be updated. If you change a\n    command''s behavior, check for other pages that reference it. Make sure links\n    in these pages are up to date.\n\n## Step 3: Draft the documentation\n\n1.  **Follow the style guide:**\n    - Text must be wrapped at 80 characters. Exceptions are long links or\n      tables, unless otherwise stated by the user.\n    - Use sentence case for headings, titles, and bolded text.\n    - Address the reader as \"you\".\n    - Use contractions to keep the tone more casual.\n    - Use simple, direct, and active language and the present tense.\n    - Keep paragraphs short and focused.\n    - Always refer to Gemini CLI as `Gemini CLI`, never `the Gemini CLI`.\n2.  **Use `replace` and `write_file`:** Use the file system tools to apply your\n    planned changes precisely. For small edits, `replace` is preferred. For new\n    files or large rewrites, `write_file` is more appropriate.\n\n## Step 4: Verify and finalize\n\n1.  **Review your work:** After making changes, re-read the files to ensure the\n    documentation is well-formatted, content is correct and based on existing\n    code, and that all new links are valid.\n2.  **Offer to run npm format:** Once all changes are complete and the user\n    confirms they have no more requests, offer to run the project''s formatting\n    script to ensure consistency. Propose the following command:\n    `npm run format`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:46:46.681Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing to produce accurate and clear documentation following the Google Developer Documentation Style Guide.","zh":"非常适合需要生成准确清晰文档的技术写作代理，遵循Google开发者文档风格指南。","ja":"Google Developer Documentation Style Guideに従って正確で明確な文書を生成する必要があるテクニカルライティングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구글 개발자 문서 스타일 가이드를 따라 정확하고 명확한 문서를 생성해야 하는 기술 작성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de escritura técnica que necesitan producir documentación precisa y clara siguiendo la Guía de estilo de documentación para desarrolladores de Google.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rédaction technique qui ont besoin de produire une documentation précise et claire en suivant le Guide de style de documentation des développeurs Google.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die genaue und klare Dokumentationen erstellen müssen, die dem Google-Entwickler-Dokumentationsstilhandbuch entsprechen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que precisam produzir documentação precisa e clara seguindo o Guia de Estilo de Documentação do Google Developer.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технической документации, которым необходимо создавать точную и ясную документацию в соответствии с Руководством по стилю документации Google Developer.","ar":"مثالي لوفاء وكلاء الكتابة الفنية الحاجة إلى إنتاج توثيق دقيق وواضح يتبع دليل أسلوب توثيق مطور جوجل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality documentation by adhering to the CONTRIBUTING.md guidelines and utilizing the Google Developer Documentation Style Guide for consistency and clarity in technical writing, including markdown formatting and semantic HTML.","zh":"使代理能够通过遵循CONTRIBUTING.md指南和利用Google开发者文档风格指南来生成高质量的文档，从而确保技术写作的一致性和清晰度，包括markdown格式和语义HTML。","ja":"CONTRIBUTING.mdガイドラインに従い、Google Developer Documentation Style Guideを使用することで、高品質のドキュメントを生成し、技術文書の一貫性と明確性を確保することができます。マークダウン形式やセマンティックHTMLも含みます。","ko":"CONTRIBUTING.md 지침을 준수하고 구글 개발자 문서 스타일 가이드를 사용하여 일관성과 명확성을 보장하는 높은 품질의 문서를 생성할 수 있습니다. 마크다운 형식 및 시맨틱 HTML도 포함됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentación de alta calidad al adherirse a las pautas de CONTRIBUTING.md y utilizar la Guía de estilo de documentación para desarrolladores de Google para la consistencia y claridad en la escritura técnica, incluyendo el formato markdown y HTML semántico.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer une documentation de haute qualité en respectant les directives de CONTRIBUTING.md et en utilisant le Guide de style de documentation des développeurs Google pour la cohérence et la clarté dans la rédaction technique, y compris le formatage markdown et le HTML sémantique.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige Dokumentationen zu erstellen, indem sie den Richtlinien von CONTRIBUTING.md folgen und den Google-Entwickler-Dokumentationsstilhandbuch für Konsistenz und Klarheit im technischen Schreiben verwenden, einschließlich Markdown-Formatierung und semantischen HTML.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentação de alta qualidade, aderindo às diretrizes do CONTRIBUTING.md e utilizando o Guia de Estilo de Documentação do Google Developer para consistência e clareza na escrita técnica, incluindo formatação markdown e HTML semântico.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать документацию высокого качества, соблюдая рекомендации CONTRIBUTING.md и используя Руководство по стилю документации Google Developer для обеспечения согласованности и ясности технической документации, включая форматирование markdown и семантический HTML.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد توثيق عالي الجودة من خلال اتباع إرشادات CONTRIBUTING.md واستخدام دليل أسلوب توثيق مطور جوجل لضمان الاتساق والوضوح في الكتابة الفنية، بما في ذلك تنسيق markdown وHTML المсемاري."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation updates for Gemini CLI project","Generating user manuals with clear instructions and examples","Creating release notes following the project''s standards"],"zh":["自动更新Gemini CLI项目文档","生成清晰的用户手册和示例","按照项目标准创建发布说明"],"ja":["Gemini CLIプロジェクトのドキュメントを自動更新する","明確なユーザーマニュアルと例を生成する","プロジェクトの標準に従ってリリースノートを作成する"],"ko":["Gemini CLI 프로젝트 문서 자동 업데이트","명확한 사용자 매뉴얼 및 예제 생성","프로젝트 표준에 따라 릴리스 노트 생성"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de documentación para el proyecto Gemini CLI","Generar manuales de usuario con instrucciones claras y ejemplos","Crear notas de lanzamiento siguiendo los estándares del proyecto"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de la documentation pour le projet Gemini CLI","Générer des manuels d''utilisation avec des instructions claires et des exemples","Créer des notes de publication en suivant les normes du projet"],"de":["Automatisierung von Dokumentenaktualisierungen für das Gemini-CLI-Projekt","Erstellung von Benutzerhandbüchern mit klaren Anweisungen und Beispielen","Erstellung von Versionshinweisen unter Einhaltung der Projektstandards"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação para o projeto Gemini CLI","Gerar manuais do usuário com instruções e exemplos claros","Criar notas de lançamento seguindo os padrões do projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации для проекта Gemini CLI","Генерировать руководства пользователя с ясными инструкциями и примерами","Создавать заметки о выпуске в соответствии со стандартами проекта"],"ar":["توسيع تحديثات التوثيق آليًا لمشروع Gemini CLI","توليد كُتُب إرشادية للمستخدم مع تعليمات وأمثلة واضحة","إنشاء ملاحظات الإصدارات تابعًا لمعايير المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to CONTRIBUTING.md and Google Developer Documentation Style Guide","Specific to Gemini CLI project documentation"],"zh":["需要遵循CONTRIBUTING.md和Google开发者文档风格指南","仅适用于Gemini CLI项目文档"],"ja":["CONTRIBUTING.mdとGoogle Developer Documentation Style Guideに従う必要がある","Gemini CLIプロジェクトのドキュメントのみに適用される"],"ko":["CONTRIBUTING.md 및 구글 개발자 문서 스타일 가이드를 따라야 함","Gemini CLI 프로젝트 문서에만 적용됨"],"es":["Requiere adherirse a CONTRIBUTING.md y a la Guía de estilo de documentación para desarrolladores de Google","Específico para la documentación del proyecto Gemini CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite de suivre les directives de CONTRIBUTING.md et le Guide de style de documentation des développeurs Google","Spécifique à la documentation du projet Gemini CLI"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung von CONTRIBUTING.md und dem Google-Entwickler-Dokumentationsstilhandbuch","Spezifisch für die Dokumentation des Gemini-CLI-Projekts"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao CONTRIBUTING.md e ao Guia de Estilo de Documentação do Google Developer","Específico para a documentação do projeto Gemini CLI"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения рекомендаций CONTRIBUTING.md и Руководства по стилю документации Google Developer","Конкретно для документации проекта Gemini CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع إرشادات CONTRIBUTING.md ودليل أسلوب توثيق مطور جوجل","محدد لتوثيق مشروع Gemini CLI"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('JoSaint13/zai-voice-2/git-commit', 'community', 'JoSaint13', 'zai-voice-2', 'JoSaint13/zai-voice-2', 'git-commit', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z', '2026-02-18T09:46:45.716Z', NULL, '{"id":"JoSaint13/zai-voice-2/git-commit","name":"git-commit","description":{"zh":"Git Commit 创建标准化的 Git 提交，遵循 Conventional Commits 格式，帮助开发者更好地管理代码","ja":"Git Commit は Conventional Commits 形式で標準化された Git コミットを作成することで、開発者がコードをより効率的に管理できるようにします","ko":"Git Commit은 Conventional Commits 형식으로 표준화된 Git 커밋을 생성하여 개발자가 코드를 더 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"El commit de Git es una herramienta fundamental para los desarrolladores. Aprende a usarlo de manera efectiva con nuestro tutorial.","fr":"Le commit Git est un outil fondamental pour les développeurs. Apprenez à l''utiliser de manière efficace avec notre tutoriel.","de":"Der Git-Commit ist ein grundlegendes Werkzeug für Entwickler. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es effektiv nutzen können, mit unserem Tutorial.","pt":"O Git Commit é um padrão de committer que segue o formato Conventional Commits, facilitando a organização e a manutenção de projetos.","ru":"Git Commit - это стандарт коммитеров, следующий конвенциональному формату, что облегчает организацию и поддержку проектов.","ar":"التزام Git هو معيار لالتزامات التي تتبع تنسيق التزامات المتوافق، مما يسهل تنظيم المشاريع ودعمها.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Git Commit 格式化提交","ja":"Git Commit 標準フォーマット","ko":"Git Commit 표준 형식","es":"Commit de Git: Guía para Desarrolladores","fr":"Git Commit : Guide pour les Développeurs","de":"Git-Commit: Anleitung für Entwickler","pt":"Git Commit: Padrão de Commits Conventional","ru":"Git Commit: Конвенциональный формат коммитов","ar":"التزام Git: تنسيق التزامات متوافق","en":"git-commit"},"description":{"zh":"Git Commit 创建标准化的 Git 提交，遵循 Conventional Commits 格式，帮助开发者更好地管理代码","ja":"Git Commit は Conventional Commits 形式で標準化された Git コミットを作成することで、開発者がコードをより効率的に管理できるようにします","ko":"Git Commit은 Conventional Commits 형식으로 표준화된 Git 커밋을 생성하여 개발자가 코드를 더 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"El commit de Git es una herramienta fundamental para los desarrolladores. Aprende a usarlo de manera efectiva con nuestro tutorial.","fr":"Le commit Git est un outil fondamental pour les développeurs. Apprenez à l''utiliser de manière efficace avec notre tutoriel.","de":"Der Git-Commit ist ein grundlegendes Werkzeug für Entwickler. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es effektiv nutzen können, mit unserem Tutorial.","pt":"O Git Commit é um padrão de committer que segue o formato Conventional Commits, facilitando a organização e a manutenção de projetos.","ru":"Git Commit - это стандарт коммитеров, следующий конвенциональному формату, что облегчает организацию и поддержку проектов.","ar":"التزام Git هو معيار لالتزامات التي تتبع تنسيق التزامات المتوافق، مما يسهل تنظيم المشاريع ودعمها.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 Conventional Commits 格式","创建标准化的 Git 提交","提高代码管理效率","支持多行提交","支持自定义提交类型"],"ja":["Conventional Commits 形式をサポート","標準化された Git コミットを作成","コード管理の効率を向上させる","複数行のコミットをサポート","カスタムコミットタイプをサポート"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 형식 지원","표준화된 Git 커밋 생성","코드 관리 효율성 향상","다중 행 커밋 지원","사용자 정의 커밋 유형 지원"],"es":["Seguimiento del formato Conventional Commits","Creación de commits con mensajes estructurados","Uso de scopes y tipos personalizados","Compatibilidad con commits multilinea","Integración con la línea de comandos de Git"],"fr":["Suivi du format Conventional Commits","Création de commits avec des messages structurés","Utilisation de scopes et de types personnalisés","Compatibilité avec les commits multilignes","Intégration avec la ligne de commande Git"],"de":["Verfolgung des Conventional-Commits-Formats","Erstellung von Commits mit strukturierten Nachrichten","Verwendung von benutzerdefinierten Scopes und Typen","Kompatibilität mit mehrzeiligen Commits","Integration mit der Git-Kommandozeile"],"pt":["Criação de commmits no formato Conventional Commits","Suporte a scopes em kebab-case","Tipos de commmits adicionais, como segurança","Suporte a commmits multi-linha com HEREDOC","Integração com o comando git log"],"ru":["Создание коммитов в конвенциональном формате","Поддержка scopes в kebab-case","Дополнительные типы коммитов, такие как безопасность","Поддержка многострочных коммитов с HEREDOC","Интеграция с командой git log"],"ar":["إنشاء التزامات بتنسيق التزامات المتوافق","دعم نطاقات بالشكل kebab-case","أنواع التزامات الإضافية، مثل الأمان","دعم التزامات متعددة الأسطر مع HEREDOC","التكامل مع أمر git log"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git Commit","Conventional Commits","标准化提交","代码管理","Git 工具","开发者工具"],"ja":["Git Commit","Conventional Commits","標準コミット","コード管理","Git ツール","開発者ツール"],"ko":["Git Commit","Conventional Commits","표준 커밋","코드 관리","Git 도구","개발자 도구"],"es":["git commit","conventional commits","desarrollo de software","colaboración en equipo","gestión de versiones","git tutorial","commit mensaje","scopes y tipos"],"fr":["git commit","conventional commits","développement de logiciels","collaboration d''équipe","gestion de versions","tutoriel git","message de commit","scopes et types"],"de":["git commit","conventional commits","softwareentwicklung","teamkollaboration","versionsverwaltung","git tutorial","commitnachricht","scopes und typen"],"pt":["Git Commit","Conventional Commits","padrão de committer","organização de projetos","commits legíveis","scopes em kebab-case","segurança em commmits"],"ru":["Git Commit","Конвенциональный формат коммитов","стандарт коммитеров","организация проектов","читаемые коммиты","scopes в kebab-case","безопасность в коммитах"],"ar":["التزام Git","تنسيق التزامات المتوافق","معيار لالتزامات","تنظيم المشاريع","التزامات قابلة للقراءة","نطاقات بالشكل kebab-case","أمان في التزامات"]}},"owner":"JoSaint13","repo":"zai-voice-2","repoPath":"JoSaint13/zai-voice-2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-commit","description":"Creates git commits following Conventional Commits format with type/scope/subject. Use when user wants to commit changes, create commit, save work, or stage and commit. Enforces project-specific conventions from CLAUDE.md.","bodyPreview":"# Git commit\n\nCreates git commits following Conventional Commits format.\n\n## Recent project commits\n\n!`git log --oneline -5 2>/dev/null`\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# 1. Stage changes\ngit add <files>\n\n# 2. Create commit\ngit commit -m \"type(scope): subject\"\n```\n\n## Project conventions\n\n- Scope is **required** (kebab-case): `validation`, `auth`, `cookie-service`, `api`\n- Additional type beyond standard CC: `security` (vulnerability fixes or hardening)\n- HEREDOC for multi-line commits:\n\n```bash\ngit co","body":"# Git commit\n\nCreates git commits following Conventional Commits format.\n\n## Recent project commits\n\n!`git log --oneline -5 2>/dev/null`\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# 1. Stage changes\ngit add <files>\n\n# 2. Create commit\ngit commit -m \"type(scope): subject\"\n```\n\n## Project conventions\n\n- Scope is **required** (kebab-case): `validation`, `auth`, `cookie-service`, `api`\n- Additional type beyond standard CC: `security` (vulnerability fixes or hardening)\n- HEREDOC for multi-line commits:\n\n```bash\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\nfeat(validation): add URLValidator with domain whitelist\n\nImplement URLValidator class supporting:\n- Domain whitelist enforcement\n- Dangerous scheme blocking\n\nAddresses Requirement 31\nPart of Task 5.1\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n## Important rules\n\n- **ALWAYS** check CLAUDE.md conventions first - use project format if it differs\n- **ALWAYS** include scope in parentheses\n- **ALWAYS** use present tense imperative verb for the subject\n- **NEVER** end subject with a period\n- **NEVER** exceed 50 chars in the subject line\n- **NEVER** use generic messages (\"update code\", \"fix bug\", \"changes\")\n- Group related changes into a single focused commit\n\n## References\n\n- `references/commit_examples.md` - Extended examples by type, good/bad comparisons\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:46:45.716Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring structured version control through Conventional Commits format.","zh":"适合需要通过常规提交格式进行结构化版本控制的开发代理。","ja":"Conventional Commits形式を介した構造化されたバージョン管理を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"규칙적인 커밋 형식을 통한 구조화된 버전 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren control de versiones estructurado a través del formato de Commits Convencionales.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant un contrôle de version structuré au format de Commits Conventionnels.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine strukturierte Versionskontrolle im Conventional Commits-Format erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem controle de versão estruturado por meio do formato Conventional Commits.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих структурированного контроля версий через формат Conventional Commits.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يتطلبون التحكم في الإصدارات المنظم عبر تنسيق الالتزامات التقليدية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create standardized git commits with required scopes and custom types like security, utilizing kebab-case for consistency and HEREDOC for multi-line commit messages, all while adhering to Conventional Commits specifications.","zh":"使代理能够创建标准化的git提交，具有必要的范围和自定义类型，如安全性，使用短横线命名法以保持一致性，并使用HEREDOC进行多行提交消息，同时遵循Conventional Commits规范。","ja":"エージェントが、スコープとカスタムタイプ（セキュリティなど）を必要とする標準化されたgitコミットを作成できるようにし、ケバブケースを一貫性のために、HEREDOCを複数行コミットメッセージのために使用し、Conventional Commitsの仕様に従う。","ko":"에이전트가 범위 및 사용자 지정 유형(보안 등)이 필요한 표준화된 깃 커밋을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 일관성을 유지하기 위해 케밥 케이스를 사용하고 여러 줄 커밋 메시지를 위해 HEREDOC를 사용하여 Conventional Commits 사양을 준수합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear commits de git estandarizados con ámbitos y tipos personalizados como seguridad, utilizando kebab-case para la consistencia y HEREDOC para mensajes de commit de varias líneas, todo mientras se adhiere a las especificaciones de Commits Convencionales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des commits git standardisés avec des portées et des types personnalisés comme la sécurité, en utilisant kebab-case pour la cohérence et HEREDOC pour les messages de commit multilignes, tout en respectant les spécifications des Commits Conventionnels.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, standardisierte Git-Commits mit erforderlichen Bereichen und benutzerdefinierten Typen wie Sicherheit zu erstellen, indem sie kebab-case für Konsistenz und HEREDOC für mehrzeilige Commit-Mitteilungen verwenden, und zwar unter Einhaltung der Conventional Commits-Spezifikationen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar commits standardizados do git com escopos e tipos personalizados necessários, como segurança, utilizando kebab-case para consistência e HEREDOC para mensagens de commit de várias linhas, tudo isso seguindo as especificações do Conventional Commits.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать стандартизированные коммиты git с необходимыми областями и пользовательскими типами, такими как безопасность, используя kebab-case для согласованности и HEREDOC для многострочных сообщений коммитов, все это при соблюдении спецификаций Conventional Commits.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء التزامات git معيارية مع نطاقات وأنواع مخصصة مطلوبة مثل الأمان، باستخدام kebab-case من أجل الاتساق وHEREDOC من أجل رسائل الالتزام متعددة الأسطر، وكل ذلك مع اتباع مواصفات الالتزامات التقليدية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit messages for vulnerability fixes","Generating commits with specific scopes like validation or auth","Creating multi-line commits for detailed change explanations"],"zh":["自动为漏洞修复创建提交消息","生成具有特定范围（如验证或身份验证）的提交","创建多行提交以进行详细的更改说明"],"ja":["脆弱性修正のコミットメッセージを自動化する","検証や認証などの特定のスコープを持つコミットを生成する","詳細な変更説明のための複数行コミットを作成する"],"ko":["취약점 수정을 위한 커밋 메시지를 자동화하는 것","검증 또는 인증과 같은 특정 범위가 있는 커밋을 생성하는 것","상세한 변경 설명을 위한 여러 줄 커밋을 만드는 것"],"es":["Automatizar mensajes de commit para correcciones de vulnerabilidades","Generar commits con ámbitos específicos como validación o autenticación","Crear commits de varias líneas para explicaciones detalladas de cambios"],"fr":["Automatiser les messages de commit pour les correctifs de vulnérabilités","Générer des commits avec des portées spécifiques comme validation ou authentification","Créer des commits multilignes pour des explications détaillées des modifications"],"de":["Automatisieren von Commit-Mitteilungen für Schwachstellenbehebungen","Erstellen von Commits mit bestimmten Bereichen wie Validierung oder Authentifizierung","Erstellen von Commit-Mitteilungen mit mehreren Zeilen für detaillierte Erklärungen von Änderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar mensagens de commit para correções de vulnerabilidades","Gerar commits com escopos específicos como validação ou autenticação","Criar commits de várias linhas para explicações detalhadas de alterações"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сообщения коммитов для исправления уязвимостей","Генерировать коммиты с конкретными областями, такими как валидация или аутентификация","Создавать многострочные коммиты для подробных объяснений изменений"],"ar":["توفير رسائل الالتزام الآلي للتصحيحات الأمنية","توليد التزامات مع نطاقات محددة مثل التحقق أو المصادقة","إنشاء التزامات متعددة الأسطر لتوضيحات مفصلة للتغييرات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git installation and configuration","Scope is mandatory in kebab-case","Limited to Conventional Commits format"],"zh":["需要git安装和配置","范围在短横线命名法中是必需的","仅限于Conventional Commits格式"],"ja":["gitのインストールと設定が必要","ケバブケースのスコープは必須","Conventional Commits形式に限定"],"ko":["깃 설치 및 구성이 필요","케밥 케이스의 범위는 필수","Conventional Commits 형식으로만 제한"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de git","El ámbito es obligatorio en kebab-case","Limitado al formato de Commits Convencionales"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de git","La portée est obligatoire en kebab-case","Limité au format des Commits Conventionnels"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von Git","Der Bereich ist in kebab-case obligatorisch","Begrenzt auf das Conventional Commits-Format"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do git","O escopo é obrigatório no kebab-case","Limitado ao formato Conventional Commits"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки git","Область обязательна в kebab-case","Ограничен форматом Conventional Commits"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وضبط git","النطاق إلزامي في kebab-case","محدود بتنسيق الالتزامات التقليدية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
