ür Jetpack Compose","pt":"Compose UI: Melhores Práticas para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Compose UI: Лучшие практики для разработчиков","ar":"Compose UI: أفضل الممارسات للdevelopers","en":"compose-ui"},"description":{"zh":"Jetpack Compose 最佳实践指南，帮助您创建高性能、可重用和可测试的 Composables","ja":"Jetpack Compose のベストプラクティスガイドを使用して、高パフォーマンス、再利用可能、テスト可能な Composables を作成します","ko":"Jetpack Compose 최적화 가이드를 사용하여 높은 성능과 재사용 가능하며 테스트 가능한 Composables를 생성합니다","es":"Jetpack Compose es un conjunto de herramientas para crear interfaces de usuario en Android. Sigue nuestras mejores prácticas para crear componentes reutiliza...","fr":"Jetpack Compose est un ensemble d''outils pour créer des interfaces utilisateur sur Android. Suivez nos meilleures pratiques pour créer des composants réutili...","de":"Jetpack Compose ist eine Sammlung von Tools zur Erstellung von Benutzeroberflächen unter Android. Folgen Sie unseren Best Practices, um wiederverwendbare und...","pt":"O Compose UI é uma biblioteca de interface do usuário para Android que permite criar Composables performáticos e reutilizáveis. Aprenda a usá-la com as melho...","ru":"Compose UI — это библиотека пользовательского интерфейса для Android, которая позволяет создавать производительные и многократно используемые Composables. Уз...","ar":"Compose UI هي مكتبة واجهة المستخدم ل Android التي تسمح بإنشاء Composables ذو أداء عالٍ ومتعدد الاستخدامات. تعرف على كيفية استخدامها بأفضل الممارسات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["状态提升（Unidirectional Data Flow）","可重用和可测试的 Composables","高性能的 UI 组件","简单易用的 API","支持 Kotlin 语言"],"ja":["状態の昇格（Unidirectional Data Flow）","再利用可能でテスト可能な Composables","高パフォーマンスの UI コンポーネント","シンプルで使いやすい API","Kotlin 言語のサポート"],"ko":["상태 상승（Unidirectional Data Flow）","재사용 가능하며 테스트 가능한 Composables","높은 성능의 UI 컴포넌트","简单易用的 API","Kotlin 언어 지원"],"es":["State Hoisting (Unidirectional Data Flow)","Creación de componentes reutilizables","Mejora del rendimiento de la app","Pruebas unitarias y de integración","Compatibilidad con Kotlin"],"fr":["State Hoisting (Unidirectional Data Flow)","Création de composants réutilisables","Amélioration des performances de l''application","Tests unitaires et d''intégration","Compatibilité avec Kotlin"],"de":["State Hoisting (Unidirectional Data Flow)","Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Komponenten","Leistungsverbesserung der App","Einheitliche und Integrations tests","Kompatibilität mit Kotlin"],"pt":["Criação de Composables stateless","Uso de state hoisting para fluxo de dados unidirecional","Padrão de função para Composables","Testabilidade e reutilização de Composables","Otimização de desempenho para Composables"],"ru":["Создание stateless Composables","Использование state hoisting для однонаправленного потока данных","Функциональный шаблон для Composables","Тестируемость и многократное использование Composables","Оптимизация производительности для Composables"],"ar":["إنشاء Composables غير محتوية على حالة","استخدام state hoisting لتدفق البيانات أحادي الاتجاه","نمط الوظيفة لل Composables","اختبار واعادة استخدام Composables","تحسين أداء Composables"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jetpack Compose","Android UI","Kotlin","状态提升","可重用 Composables","高性能 UI","Android 开发","移动应用开发"],"ja":["Jetpack Compose","Android UI","Kotlin","状態の昇格","再利用可能な Composables","高パフォーマンスの UI","Android 開発","モバイル アプリ開発"],"ko":["Jetpack Compose","Android UI","Kotlin","상태 상승","재사용 가능 Composables","높은 성능의 UI","Android 개발","모바일 앱 개발"],"es":["Jetpack Compose","Mejores prácticas","Desarrollo de Android","Kotlin","UI","Componentes reutilizables","Rendimiento de la app","Pruebas unitarias","State Hoisting"],"fr":["Jetpack Compose","Meilleures pratiques","Développement Android","Kotlin","UI","Composants réutilisables","Performances de l''application","Tests unitaires","State Hoisting"],"de":["Jetpack Compose","Best Practices","Android-Entwicklung","Kotlin","UI","Wiederverwendbare Komponenten","Leistung der App","Einheitliche Tests","State Hoisting"],"pt":["Jetpack Compose","Compose UI","Desenvolvimento Android","Interface do usuário","Composables","State hoisting","Testabilidade","Reutilização de código"],"ru":["Jetpack Compose","Compose UI","Разработка Android","Пользовательский интерфейс","Composables","State hoisting","Тестируемость","Многократное использование кода"],"ar":["Jetpack Compose","Compose UI","تطوير Android","واجهة المستخدم","Composables","state hoisting","اختبار","إعادة استخدام الكود"]}},"owner":"polidog","repo":"atotoX10-drive","repoPath":"polidog/atotoX10-drive","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"compose-ui","description":"Best practices for building UI with Jetpack Compose, focusing on state hoisting, detailed performance optimizations, and theming. Use this when writing or refactoring Composable functions.","bodyPreview":"# Jetpack Compose Best Practices\n\n## Instructions\n\nFollow these guidelines to create performant, reusable, and testable Composables.\n\n### 1. State Hoisting (Unidirectional Data Flow)\nMake Composables **stateless** whenever possible by moving state to the caller.\n\n*   **Pattern**: Function signature should usually look like:\n    ```kotlin\n    @Composable\n    fun MyComponent(\n        value: String,              // State flows down\n        onValueChange: (String) -> Unit, // Events flow up","body":"# Jetpack Compose Best Practices\n\n## Instructions\n\nFollow these guidelines to create performant, reusable, and testable Composables.\n\n### 1. State Hoisting (Unidirectional Data Flow)\nMake Composables **stateless** whenever possible by moving state to the caller.\n\n*   **Pattern**: Function signature should usually look like:\n    ```kotlin\n    @Composable\n    fun MyComponent(\n        value: String,              // State flows down\n        onValueChange: (String) -> Unit, // Events flow up\n        modifier: Modifier = Modifier // Standard modifier parameter\n    )\n    ```\n*   **Benefit**: Decouples the UI from simple state storage, making it easier to preview and test.\n*   **ViewModel Integration**: The screen-level Composable retrieves state from the ViewModel (`viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()`) and passes it down.\n\n### 2. Modifiers\n*   **Default Parameter**: Always provide a `modifier: Modifier = Modifier` as the first optional parameter.\n*   **Application**: Apply this `modifier` to the *root* layout element of your Composable.\n*   **Ordering matters**: `padding().clickable()` is different from `clickable().padding()`. Generally apply layout-affecting modifiers (like padding) *after* click listeners if you want the padding to be clickable.\n\n### 3. Performance Optimization\n*   **`remember`**: Use `remember { ... }` to cache expensive calculations across recompositions.\n*   **`derivedStateOf`**: Use `derivedStateOf { ... }` when a state changes frequently (like scroll position) but the UI only needs to react to a threshold or summary (e.g., show \"Jump to Top\" button). This prevents unnecessary recompositions.\n    ```kotlin\n    val showButton by remember {\n        derivedStateOf { listState.firstVisibleItemIndex > 0 }\n    }\n    ```\n*   **Lambda Stability**: Prefer method references (e.g., `viewModel::onEvent`) or remembered lambdas to prevent unstable types from triggering recomposition of children.\n\n### 4. Theming and Resources\n*   Use `MaterialTheme.colorScheme` and `MaterialTheme.typography` instead of hardcoded colors or text styles.\n*   Organize simple UI components into specific files (e.g., `DesignSystem.kt` or `Components.kt`) if they are shared across features.\n\n### 5. Previews\n*   Create a private preview function for every public Composable.\n*   Use `@Preview(showBackground = true)` and include Light/Dark mode previews if applicable.\n*   Pass dummy data (static) to the stateless Composable for the preview.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:46:23.851Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Android UI Agent Architects building performant, testable composable systems.","zh":"适用于Android UI代理架构师构建高性能、可测试的组合系统。","ja":"Android UIエージェントアーキテクトがパフォーマンスの高い、テスト可能な組み立て可能なシステムを構築するために不可欠です。","ko":"안드로이드 UI 에이전트 아키텍트가 성능이 좋은 테스트 가능한 조합 시스템을 구축하는 데 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los arquitectos de Agentes de IU de Android que construyen sistemas componibles, probables y de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Essentiel pour les architectes d''agents d''interface utilisateur Android qui construisent des systèmes composables, testables et performants.","de":"Wesentlich für Android-UI-Agent-Architekten, die performante, testbare und komponierbare Systeme erstellen.","pt":"Essential for Android UI Agent Architects building performant, testable composable systems.","ru":"Essential for Android UI Agent Architects building performant, testable composable systems.","ar":"Essential for Android UI Agent Architects building performant, testable composable systems."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to architect stateless Composables using state hoisting and unidirectional data flow patterns, ensuring events flow up and state flows down for optimal reusability and testability.","zh":"使代理能够使用状态提升和单向数据流模式构建无状态的组合项，确保事件向上流动，状态向下流动，以实现最佳的可重用性和可测试性。","ja":"エージェントが状態ホイストと単方向データフローパターンを使用してステートレスなコンポーザブルをアーキテクチャ化できるようにし、イベントが上方向に流れ、状態が下方向に流れ、再利用性とテスト可能性を最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 상태提升과 단방향 데이터 흐름 패턴을 사용하여 상태가 없는 조합 가능한 항목을 아키텍처화 할 수 있도록하여 이벤트가 위로 흐르고 상태가 아래로 흐르는 최적의 재사용성과 테스트 가능성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar Composables sin estado utilizando patrones de elevación de estado y flujo de datos unidireccional, asegurando que los eventos fluyan hacia arriba y el estado fluya hacia abajo para una reutilización y probabilidad óptimas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des Composables sans état en utilisant des modèles d''hanchement d''état et de flux de données unidirectionnel, en garantissant que les événements s''écoulent vers le haut et que l''état s''écoule vers le bas pour une réutilisation et une testabilité optimales.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, stateless Composables unter Verwendung von Mustern zur State-Hoisting und einrichtungsweisem Datenfluss zu entwerfen, wodurch sichergestellt wird, dass Ereignisse nach oben und der Zustand nach unten fließen, um optimale Wiederverwendbarkeit und Testbarkeit zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Enables agents to architect stateless Composables using state hoisting and unidirectional data flow patterns, ensuring events flow up and state flows down for optimal reusability and testability.","ru":"Enables agents to architect stateless Composables using state hoisting and unidirectional data flow patterns, ensuring events flow up and state flows down for optimal reusability and testability.","ar":"Enables agents to architect stateless Composables using state hoisting and unidirectional data flow patterns, ensuring events flow up and state flows down for optimal reusability and testability."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring stateful Composables into stateless components","Generating testable Composable function signatures","Enforcing unidirectional data flow architecture in UI code"],"zh":["将有状态的组合项重构为无状态的组件","生成可测试的组合函数签名","在UI代码中强制执行单向数据流架构"],"ja":["ステートフルなコンポーザブルをステートレスなコンポーネントにリファクタリングする","テスト可能なコンポーザブル関数シグネチャを生成する","UIコードで単方向データフロー・アーキテクチャを強制する"],"ko":["상태가 있는 조합 가능한 항목을 상태가 없는 컴포넌트로 리팩토링하는 것","테스트 가능한 조합 함수 시그니처를 생성하는 것","UI 코드에서 단방향 데이터 흐름 아키텍처를 강제하는 것"],"es":["Reestructuración de Composables con estado en componentes sin estado","Generación de firmas de función Composable probables","Aplicación de arquitectura de flujo de datos unidireccional en el código de IU"],"fr":["Réorganisation de Composables avec état en composants sans état","Génération de signatures de fonction Composable testables","Application d''une architecture de flux de données unidirectionnel dans le code d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Umgestaltung von Composables mit Zustand in zustandslose Komponenten","Generierung von testbaren Composable-Funktionssignaturen","Durchsetzung einer einrichtungsweisen Datenflussarchitektur im UI-Code"],"pt":["Refactoring stateful Composables into stateless components","Generating testable Composable function signatures","Enforcing unidirectional data flow architecture in UI code"],"ru":["Refactoring stateful Composables into stateless components","Generating testable Composable function signatures","Enforcing unidirectional data flow architecture in UI code"],"ar":["Refactoring stateful Composables into stateless components","Generating testable Composable function signatures","Enforcing unidirectional data flow architecture in UI code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Jetpack Compose-specific (Android UI toolkit only)","Requires understanding of Kotlin and Composable semantics"],"zh":["仅适用于Jetpack Compose（Android UI工具包）","需要了解Kotlin和组合语义"],"ja":["Jetpack Compose（Android UIツールキット）専用","Kotlinとコンポーザブルのセマンティクスの理解が必要"],"ko":["Jetpack Compose（Android UI 툴킷）専用","코틀린과 조합 가능 세マン틱의 이해가 필요"],"es":["Específico de Jetpack Compose (kit de herramientas de IU de Android solo)","Requiere comprensión de Kotlin y semántica Composable"],"fr":["Spécifique à Jetpack Compose (kit d''outils d''interface utilisateur Android uniquement)","Nécessite une compréhension de Kotlin et de la sémantique Composable"],"de":["Spezifisch für Jetpack Compose (nur Android-UI-Toolkit)","Erfordert Verständnis von Kotlin und Composable-Semantik"],"pt":["Jetpack Compose-specific (Android UI toolkit only)","Requires understanding of Kotlin and Composable semantics"],"ru":["Jetpack Compose-specific (Android UI toolkit only)","Requires understanding of Kotlin and Composable semantics"],"ar":["Jetpack Compose-specific (Android UI toolkit only)","Requires understanding of Kotlin and Composable semantics"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
