"zh":["准确的文档撰写","清晰的文档结构","一致的文档格式","专业的文档编辑","实时的文档更新","严格的文档标准"],"ja":["正確な文書作成","明瞭な文書構造","一貫性のある文書フォーマット","専門的な文書編集","リアルタイムの文書更新","厳格な文書基準"],"ko":["정확한 문서 작성","명확한 문서 구조","일관된 문서 형식","전문적인 문서 편집","실시간 문서 업데이트","엄격한 문서 기준"],"es":["Cumplimiento estricto de los estándares de documentación","Edición y revisión de documentación","Contribución a la base de código","Seguimiento de carpetas en tiempo real","Soporte para formatos profesionales","Lógica de metadatos avanzada"],"fr":["Respect des normes de documentation","Édition et révision de la documentation","Contribution à la base de code","Suivi de dossiers en temps réel","Prise en charge de formats professionnels","Logique de métadonnées avancée"],"de":["Strenger Einhaltung der Dokumentationsstandards","Bearbeitung und Überprüfung von Dokumentationen","Beitrag zur Codebasis","Echtzeit-Ordnerüberwachung","Unterstützung für professionelle Formate","Erweiterte Metadatenlogik"],"pt":["Criação de documentação técnica clara e concisa","Adesão a padrões de documentação","Revisão e edição de conteúdo","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo","Integração com processos de contribuição"],"ru":["Создание технической документации, ясной и краткой","Соблюдение стандартов документации","Проверка и редактирование содержания","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Интеграция с процессами внесения вклада"],"ar":["إنشاء توثيق فني واضح وموجز","الامتثال لمعايير التوثيق","مراجعة وتنقيح المحتوى","دعم صيغ الملفات المتعددة","التكامل مع عمليات المساهمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技术文档撰写","docs-writer","文档编辑","文档标准","技术写作","文档管理","开发者文档","代码文档"],"ja":["技術文書作成","docs-writer","文書編集","文書基準","技術ライティング","文書管理","開発者向け文書","コード文書"],"ko":["기술 문서 작성","docs-writer","문서 편집","문서 기준","기술 작성","문서 관리","개발자 문서","코드 문서"],"es":["documentación técnica","estándares de contribución","desarrollo de software","herramientas de documentación","documentación de código","desarrolladores de software","documentación para desarrolladores","creación de documentación","edición de documentación"],"fr":["documentation technique","normes de contribution","développement de logiciels","outils de documentation","documentation de code","développeurs de logiciels","documentation pour développeurs","création de documentation","édition de documentation"],"de":["technische Dokumentation","Beitragstandards","Softwareentwicklung","Dokumentationswerkzeuge","Code-Dokumentation","Softwareentwickler","Dokumentation für Entwickler","Erstellung von Dokumentationen","Bearbeitung von Dokumentationen"],"pt":["documentação técnica","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de documentação","padrões de documentação","contribuição de código","desenvolvedores de software"],"ru":["техническая документация","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты документации","стандарты документации","внесение вклада в код","разработчики программного обеспечения"],"ar":["توثيق فني","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التوثيق","معايير التوثيق","مساهمة في الكود","مطورو البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"marcusagm","repo":"Mundam","repoPath":"marcusagm/Mundam","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs-writer","description":"","bodyPreview":"# `docs-writer` skill instructions\n\nAs an expert technical writer and editor for the Gemini CLI project, you produce\naccurate, clear, and consistent documentation. When asked to write, edit, or\nreview documentation, you must ensure the content strictly adheres to the\nprovided documentation standards and accurately reflects the current codebase.\nAdhere to the contribution process in `CONTRIBUTING.md` and the following\nproject standards.\n\n## Phase 1: Documentation standards\n\nAdhering to these prin","body":"# `docs-writer` skill instructions\n\nAs an expert technical writer and editor for the Gemini CLI project, you produce\naccurate, clear, and consistent documentation. When asked to write, edit, or\nreview documentation, you must ensure the content strictly adheres to the\nprovided documentation standards and accurately reflects the current codebase.\nAdhere to the contribution process in `CONTRIBUTING.md` and the following\nproject standards.\n\n## Phase 1: Documentation standards\n\nAdhering to these principles and standards when writing, editing, and reviewing.\n\n### Voice and tone\nAdopt a tone that balances professionalism with a helpful, conversational\napproach.\n\n- **Perspective and tense:** Address the reader as \"you.\" Use active voice and\n  present tense (e.g., \"The API returns...\").\n- **Tone:** Professional, friendly, and direct. \n- **Clarity:** Use simple vocabulary. Avoid jargon, slang, and marketing hype.\n- **Global Audience:** Write in standard US English. Avoid idioms and cultural\n  references.\n- **Requirements:** Be clear about requirements (\"must\") vs. recommendations\n  (\"we recommend\"). Avoid \"should.\"\n- **Word Choice:** Avoid \"please\" and anthropomorphism (e.g., \"the server\n  thinks\"). Use contractions (don''t, it''s).\n\n### Language and grammar\nWrite precisely to ensure your instructions are unambiguous.\n\n- **Abbreviations:** Avoid Latin abbreviations; use \"for example\" (not \"e.g.\")\n  and \"that is\" (not \"i.e.\").\n- **Punctuation:** Use the serial comma. Place periods and commas inside\n  quotation marks.\n- **Dates:** Use unambiguous formats (e.g., \"January 22, 2026\").\n- **Conciseness:** Use \"lets you\" instead of \"allows you to.\" Use precise,\n  specific verbs.\n- **Examples:** Use meaningful names in examples; avoid placeholders like\n  \"foo\" or \"bar.\"\n\n### Formatting and syntax\nApply consistent formatting to make documentation visually organized and\naccessible.\n\n- **Overview paragraphs:** Every heading must be followed by at least one\n  introductory overview paragraph before any lists or sub-headings.\n- **Text wrap:** Wrap text at 80 characters (except long links or tables).\n- **Casing:** Use sentence case for headings, titles, and bolded text.\n- **Naming:** Always refer to the project as `Gemini CLI` (never\n  `the Gemini CLI`).\n- **Lists:** Use numbered lists for sequential steps and bulleted lists\n  otherwise. Keep list items parallel in structure.\n- **UI and code:** Use **bold** for UI elements and `code font` for filenames,\n  snippets, commands, and API elements. Focus on the task when discussing\n  interaction.\n- **Links:** Use descriptive anchor text; avoid \"click here.\" Ensure the link\n  makes sense out of context.\n- **Accessibility:** Use semantic HTML elements correctly (headings, lists, \n  tables).\n- **Media:** Use lowercase hyphenated filenames. Provide descriptive alt text\n  for all images.\n\n### Structure\n- **BLUF:** Start with an introduction explaining what to expect.\n- **Experimental features:** If a feature is clearly noted as experimental,\nadd the following note immediately after the introductory paragraph:\n  `> **Note:** This is a preview feature currently under active development.`\n- **Headings:** Use hierarchical headings to support the user journey.\n- **Procedures:** \n  - Introduce lists of steps with a complete sentence.\n  - Start each step with an imperative verb.\n  - Number sequential steps; use bullets for non-sequential lists.\n  - Put conditions before instructions (e.g., \"On the Settings page, click...\").\n  - Provide clear context for where the action takes place.\n  - Indicate optional steps clearly (e.g., \"Optional: ...\").\n- **Elements:** Use bullet lists, tables, notes (`> **Note:**`), and warnings \n  (`> **Warning:**`).\n- **Avoid using a table of contents:** If a table of contents is present, remove\n  it.\n- **Next steps:** Conclude with a \"Next steps\" section if applicable.\n\n## Phase 2: Preparation\nBefore modifying any documentation, thoroughly investigate the request and the\nsurrounding context. \n\n1.  **Clarify:** Understand the core request. Differentiate between writing new\n    content and editing existing content. If the request is ambiguous (e.g.,\n    \"fix the docs\"), ask for clarification.\n2.  **Investigate:** Examine relevant code (primarily in `packages/`) for\n    accuracy.\n3.  **Audit:** Read the latest versions of relevant files in `docs/`.\n4.  **Connect:** Identify all referencing pages if changing behavior. Check if\n    `docs/sidebar.json` needs updates.\n5.  **Plan:** Create a step-by-step plan before making changes.\n\n## Phase 3: Execution\nImplement your plan by either updating existing files or creating new ones\nusing the appropriate file system tools. Use `replace` for small edits and\n`write_file` for new files or large rewrites.\n\n### Editing existing documentation\nFollow these additional steps when asked to review or update existing\ndocumentation.\n\n- **Gaps:** Identify areas where the documentation is incomplete or no longer\n  reflects existing code.\n- **Structure:** Apply \"Structure (New Docs)\" rules (BLUF, headings, etc.) when \n  adding new sections to existing pages.\n- **Tone:** Ensure the tone is active and engaging. Use \"you\" and contractions.\n- **Clarity:** Correct awkward wording, spelling, and grammar. Rephrase\n  sentences to make them easier for users to understand.\n- **Consistency:** Check for consistent terminology and style across all edited\n  documents.\n\n\n## Phase 4: Verification and finalization\nPerform a final quality check to ensure that all changes are correctly formatted\nand that all links are functional.\n\n1.  **Accuracy:** Ensure content accurately reflects the implementation and\n  technical behavior.\n2.  **Self-review:** Re-read changes for formatting, correctness, and flow.\n3.  **Link check:** Verify all new and existing links leading to or from modified\n    pages.\n4.  **Format:** Once all changes are complete, ask to execute `npm run format`\n    to ensure consistent formatting across the project. If the user confirms,\n    execute the command.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:46:58.643Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing precise documentation generation and editing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要精确文档生成和编辑功能的技术写作代理。","ja":"技術文書作成エージェントが正確な文書作成と編集機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"정확한 문서 생성 및 편집 기능이 필요한 기술 작성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de escritura técnica que necesitan una generación y edición de documentación precisa.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin d''une génération et d''édition de documentation précise.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die eine präzise Dokumentenerstellung und -bearbeitung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que necessitam de capacidades de geração e edição de documentação precisas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технической документации, требующих точных возможностей генерации и редактирования документации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الفنية الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات دقيقة لإنشاء وتحرير المستندات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce accurate, clear, and consistent documentation adhering to provided documentation standards, such as those outlined in CONTRIBUTING.md, and utilizing metadata logic for real-time folder watching and advanced asset management.","zh":"赋予代理生成准确、清晰、连贯的文档的能力，遵守提供的文档标准，例如在CONTRIBUTING.md中概述的标准，并利用元数据逻辑进行实时文件夹监视和高级资产管理。","ja":"エージェントが提供された文書規格（CONTRIBUTING.mdに概説されているものなど）に従って、正確で明確で一貫性のある文書を生成する能力を提供し、メタデータロジックを使用してリアルタイムのフォルダ監視と高度なアセット管理を実行します。","ko":"제공된 문서 표준(예: CONTRIBUTING.md에 정리된 표준)을 준수하여 정확하고 명확하고 일관된 문서를 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 메타데이터 논리를 사용하여 실시간 폴더 감시 및 고급 자산 관리를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir documentación precisa, clara y coherente que se ajusta a los estándares de documentación proporcionados, como los que se describen en CONTRIBUTING.md, y que utiliza la lógica de metadatos para la vigilancia de carpetas en tiempo real y la gestión avanzada de activos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire une documentation précise, claire et cohérente qui respecte les normes de documentation fournies, comme celles décrites dans CONTRIBUTING.md, et qui utilise la logique de métadonnées pour la surveillance de dossiers en temps réel et la gestion avancée d''actifs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, präzise, klare und konsistente Dokumentationen zu erstellen, die den bereitgestellten Dokumentationsstandards entsprechen, wie in CONTRIBUTING.md beschrieben, und die Metadatenlogik für die Echtzeit-Ordnerüberwachung und das erweiterte Vermögensmanagement nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir documentação precisa, clara e consistente que atende aos padrões de documentação fornecidos, como aqueles descritos em CONTRIBUTING.md, e que utiliza lógica de metadados para monitoramento de pastas em tempo real e gerenciamento avançado de ativos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью производить точную, ясную и последовательную документацию, соответствующую предоставленным стандартам документации, таким как те, которые описаны в CONTRIBUTING.md, и использующую логiku метаданных для наблюдения за папками в режиме реального времени и расширенного управления активами.","ar":"يُمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنتاج مستندات دقيقة وواضحة ومتسقة تتوافق مع معايير المستندات المقدمة، مثل تلك الموصوفة في CONTRIBUTING.md، وتستخدم منطق البيانات الوصفية لمراقبة المجلدات في الوقت الفعلي وإدارة الأصول المتقدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating high-quality documentation for CLI projects","Editing and reviewing technical documents for consistency and accuracy","Creating documentation that adheres to specific project standards and contribution processes"],"zh":["为CLI项目生成高质量的文档","编辑和审查技术文档以确保一致性和准确性","创建遵守特定项目标准和贡献流程的文档"],"ja":["CLIプロジェクトのための高品質な文書を生成する","技術文書を一貫性と正確性のために編集およびレビューする","特定のプロジェクト規格と貢献プロセスに従った文書を作成する"],"ko":["CLI 프로젝트를 위한 고품질 문서 생성","일관성 및 정확성을 위해 기술 문서 편집 및 검토","특정 프로젝트 표준 및 기여 프로세스를 준수하는 문서 생성"],"es":["Generación de documentación de alta calidad para proyectos de CLI","Edición y revisión de documentos técnicos para coherencia y precisión","Creación de documentación que se ajusta a los est