mento de workspace adequado","Integração com pipelines de CI/CD"],"ru":["Проверка конфигурации рабочего пространства Bun","Предотвращение общих проблем в монорепозиториях","Обеспечение соблюдения стандартов Bun 1.3+","Правильная изоляция рабочего пространства","Интеграция с конвейерами CI/CD"],"ar":["التحقق من cấuture مساحة عمل بَن","منع المشاكل الشائعة في_MONOREPOS","ضمان نمط بَن 1.3+","عزل مساحة العمل بشكل صحيح","التكامل مع أنابيب CI/CD"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Bun Validator","workspace","Bun 1.3","monorepo","CI/CD","package.json","workspace","Bun"],"ja":["Bun","Bun Validator","1.3","monorepo","CI/CD","package.json","workspace","Bun"],"ko":["Bun ","Bun Validator","1.3","monorepo","CI/CD","package.json","workspace","Bun"],"es":["validador de Bun","monorepo","Bun 1.3+","workspace de Bun","problemas comunes en monorepos","integración con CI/CD","generación de package.json","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["validateur Bun","monorepo","Bun 1.3+","workspace Bun","problèmes courants dans les monorepos","intégration avec les CI/CD","génération de package.json","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Bun-Validator","Monorepo","Bun 1.3+","Bun-Workspace","häufige Probleme in Monorepos","Integration mit CI/CD","Generierung von package.json","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["Bun Validator","validação de espaço de trabalho","monorepo","Bun 1.3+","isolamento de workspace","CI/CD","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Bun Validator","проверка рабочего пространства","монорепозиторий","Bun 1.3+","изоляция рабочего пространства","CI/CD","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مُصَحِّح بَن","التحقق من مساحة العمل","MONOREPOS","بَن 1.3+","عزل مساحة العمل","CI/CD","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Clecio013","repo":"lumes","repoPath":"Clecio013/lumes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bun-validator","description":"Validate Bun workspace configuration and detect common monorepo issues. Ensures proper workspace setup, dependency catalogs, isolated installs, and Bun 1.3+ best practices.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Bun Validator\n\nValidates Bun workspace configuration and prevents common monorepo issues. Ensures Bun 1.3+ patterns and proper workspace isolation.\n\n## When This Activates\n\n- Setting up a new Bun monorepo\n- Before adding dependencies to workspaces\n- Auditing existing Bun workspaces\n- After AI generates package.json files\n- CI/CD pipeline validation\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/bun-validator/scripts/validate.py --root .\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/bun-validator/scripts/validat","body":"# Bun Validator\n\nValidates Bun workspace configuration and prevents common monorepo issues. Ensures Bun 1.3+ patterns and proper workspace isolation.\n\n## When This Activates\n\n- Setting up a new Bun monorepo\n- Before adding dependencies to workspaces\n- Auditing existing Bun workspaces\n- After AI generates package.json files\n- CI/CD pipeline validation\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/bun-validator/scripts/validate.py --root .\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/bun-validator/scripts/validate.py --root . --strict\n```\n\n## What Gets Checked\n\n### 1. Bun Version\n\n```bash\n# GOOD: v1.3+\nbun --version  # 1.3.0 or higher\n\n# BAD: v1.2 or earlier\nbun --version  # 1.2.x\n```\n\n### 2. Root package.json\n\n**GOOD - Monorepo root:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-monorepo\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"workspaces\": [\"apps/*\", \"packages/*\"]\n}\n```\n\n**BAD - Dependencies in root:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"workspaces\": [\"apps/*\"],\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \"^19.0.0\"  // BAD: Don''t put deps in root\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Workspace Structure\n\n**GOOD:**\n\n```\nmy-monorepo/\n├── package.json          # Root with workspaces, private: true\n├── bun.lockb             # Single lockfile at root\n├── apps/\n│   ├── web/\n│   │   └── package.json  # Own dependencies\n│   └── api/\n│       └── package.json  # Own dependencies\n└── packages/\n    ├── ui/\n    │   └── package.json  # Shared package\n    └── config/\n        └── package.json  # Shared config\n```\n\n**BAD:**\n\n```\nmy-monorepo/\n├── package.json\n├── apps/\n│   └── web/\n│       ├── package.json\n│       └── bun.lockb     # BAD: Lockfile in workspace\n```\n\n### 4. Workspace Dependencies\n\n**GOOD - Using workspace protocol:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@myorg/ui\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@myorg/config\": \"workspace:^1.0.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**BAD - Hardcoded versions:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@myorg/ui\": \"1.0.0\"  // BAD: Use workspace:*\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Dependency Catalogs (Bun 1.3+)\n\n**GOOD - Centralized versions:**\n\n```json\n// Root package.json\n{\n  \"catalog\": {\n    \"react\": \"^19.0.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.7.0\",\n    \"@types/node\": \"^22.0.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n```json\n// apps/web/package.json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \"catalog:\"  // Uses version from catalog\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 6. Isolated Installs\n\n**GOOD - Default in Bun 1.3:**\nPackages can only access dependencies they explicitly declare.\n\n**BAD - Hoisted dependencies:**\n\n```json\n// Don''t disable isolation\n{\n  \"workspaces\": {\n    \"packages\": [\"apps/*\"],\n    \"nohoist\": [\"**\"]  // Don''t do this\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Bun 1.3+ Features\n\n### Dependency Catalogs\n\nCentralize version management:\n\n```json\n// Root package.json\n{\n  \"catalog\": {\n    \"react\": \"^19.0.0\",\n    \"next\": \"^16.0.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.7.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Interactive Updates\n\n```bash\nbun update --interactive  # Selectively update deps\n```\n\n### Dependency Chains\n\n```bash\nbun why react  # Explain why a package is installed\n```\n\n### Workspace Commands\n\n```bash\n# Install in specific workspace\nbun add express --cwd apps/api\n\n# Run script in workspace\nbun run --cwd apps/web dev\n\n# Run in all workspaces\nbun run --filter ''*'' build\n```\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### Issue: \"Cannot find module\"\n\n**Cause:** Dependency not declared in workspace package.json\n\n**Fix:**\n\n```bash\nbun add <package> --cwd <workspace>\n```\n\n### Issue: Multiple lockfiles\n\n**Cause:** Running `bun install` in workspace directory\n\n**Fix:**\n\n```bash\nrm apps/*/bun.lockb packages/*/bun.lockb\nbun install  # From root only\n```\n\n### Issue: Version conflicts\n\n**Cause:** Same package with different versions across workspaces\n\n**Fix:** Use dependency catalogs:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"catalog\": {\n    \"problematic-package\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Validation Output\n\n```\n=== Bun Workspace Validation Report ===\n\nBun Version: 1.3.2 ✓\n\nRoot package.json:\n  ✓ private: true\n  ✓ workspaces defined\n  ✗ Found dependencies in root (should be empty)\n\nWorkspace Structure:\n  ✓ apps/web - valid workspace\n  ✓ apps/api - valid workspace\n  ✓ packages/ui - valid workspace\n  ✗ apps/web/bun.lockb - lockfile should only be at root\n\nDependencies:\n  ✓ Using workspace:* protocol\n  ✗ @myorg/ui uses hardcoded version \"1.0.0\"\n\nCatalogs:\n  ✗ No dependency catalog found (recommended for Bun 1.3+)\n\nSummary: 3 issues found\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. Always use workspace protocol\n\n```json\n\"@myorg/shared\": \"workspace:*\"\n```\n\n### 2. Use --cwd for workspace operations\n\n```bash\nbun add lodash --cwd apps/web  # NOT: cd apps/web && bun add\n```\n\n### 3. Single lockfile at root\n\n```bash\n# Only run bun install from root\nbun install\n```\n\n### 4. Use catalogs for shared dependencies\n\n```json\n{\n  \"catalog\": {\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.7.0\",\n    \"vitest\": \"^3.0.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Declare all dependencies explicitly\n\nEach workspace should list all its dependencies - don''t rely on hoisting.\n\n## CI/CD Integration\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/validate.yml\n- name: Validate Bun Workspace\n  run: |\n    python3 ~/.claude/skills/bun-validator/scripts/validate.py \\\n      --root . \\\n      --strict \\\n      --ci\n```\n\n## Integration\n\n- `linter-formatter-init` - Sets up Biome with Bun\n- `project-scaffold` - Creates workspace structure\n- `nextjs-validator` - Validates Next.js in workspace\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:47:07.296Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Monorepo Management Agents needing Bun workspace validation and configuration optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要Bun工作空间验证和配置优化的Monorepo管理代理。","ja":"Bunワークスペースの検証と設定の最適化が必要なMonorepo管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Bun 작업 공간 검증 및 구성 최적화가 필요한 Monorepo 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de administración de Monorepo que necesitan validación y optimización de configuración del espacio de trabajo de Bun.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de Monorepo ayant besoin de validation et d''optimisation de la configuration de l''espace de travail de Bun.","de":"Perfekt für Monorepo-Management-Agents, die eine Validierung und Optimierung der Bun-Arbeitsbereichskonfiguration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de gerenciamento de Monorepo que precisam de validação e otimização de configuração do workspace do Bun.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления Monorepo, которым необходима проверка и оптимизация конфигурации рабочего пространства Bun.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المستودع الواحد التي تحتاج إلى التحقق من صحة وتحسين تشكيل مساحة العمل Bun."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate Bun workspace configurations, preventing common monorepo issues and ensuring proper workspace isolation, utilizing Bun 1.3+ patterns and Python scripting for automation, particularly in CI/CD pipeline validation and package.json file auditing.","zh":"赋予代理验证Bun工作空间配置的能力，防止常见的Monorepo问题，确保工作空间的正确隔离，利用Bun 1.3+模式和Python脚本进行自动化，特别是在CI/CD管道验证和package.json文件审计中。","ja":"エージェントにBunワークスペース構成を検証する能力を与え、一般的なMonorepoの問題を防ぎ、ワークスペースの適切な分離を確保し、Bun 1.3+パターンとPythonスクリプトを使用して自動化を行い、特にCI/CDパイプラインの検証とpackage.jsonファイルの監査で。","ko":"에이전트가 Bun 작업 공간 구성을 검증할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 일반적인 Monorepo 문제를 방지하고 작업 공간의 올바른 분리를 보장하며, Bun 1.3+ 패턴 및 Python 스크립팅을 사용하여 자동화를 수행하여, 특히 CI/CD 파이프라인 검증 및 package.json 파일 감사를 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar las configuraciones del espacio de trabajo de Bun, evitando problemas comunes de monorepo y asegurando una adecuada isolación del espacio de trabajo, utilizando patrones de Bun 1.3+ y scripting de Python para la automatización, particularmente en la validación de la canalización CI/CD y la auditoría del archivo package.json.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider les configurations de l''espace de travail de Bun, évitant les problèmes courants de monorepo et assurant une isolation appropriée de l''espace de travail, en utilisant les modèles de Bun 1.3+ et le scripting Python pour l''automatisation, en particulier pour la validation de la pipeline CI/CD et l''audit du fichier package.json.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, die Konfigurationen des Bun-Arbeitsbereichs zu validieren, vermeidet gängige Monorepo-Probleme und stellt eine ordnungsgemäße Arbeitsbereichisolierung sicher, indem es Muster von Bun 1.3+ und Python-Skripting für die Automatisierung nutzt, insbesondere für die Validierung der CI/CD-Pipeline und die Prüfung der package.json-Datei.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validarem as configurações do workspace do Bun, prevenindo problemas comuns de monorepo e garantindo a isolamento adequado do workspace, utilizando padrões do Bun 1.3+ e script em Python para automação, particularmente na validação de pipeline CI/CD e auditoria do arquivo package.json.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять конфигурации рабочего пространства Bun, предотвращая общие проблемы monorepo и обеспечивая правильное изоляцию рабочего пространства, используя шаблоны Bun 1.3+ и скрипты Python для автоматизации, особенно при проверке конвейера CI/CD и аудите файла package.json.","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من التحقق من صحة تشكيل مساحة العمل Bun، ومنع المشاكل الشائعة في مستودع واحد، وضمان العزل الصحيح لمساحة العمل، باستخدام أنماط Bun 1.3+ وبرمجة Python للتحكم الآلي، ولا سيما في التحقق من خط أنابيب CI/CD ومراجعة ملف package.json."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating Bun monorepo setups","Auditing existing workspaces for compatibility","Automating package.json file validation after AI generation","Debugging workspace configuration issues"],"zh":["验证Bun Monorepo设置","审计现有工作空间以检查兼容性","自动验证AI生成后的package.json文件","调试工作空间配置问题"],"ja":["Bun Monorepo設定の検証","既存のワークスペースを互換性のために監査する","AI生成後のpackage.jsonファイルの自動検証","ワークスペース構成の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["Bun Monorepo 설정 검증","기존 작업 공간을 호환성을 위해 감사","AI 생성 후 package.json 파일 자동 검증","작업 공간 구성 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Validar configuraciones de monorepo de Bun","Auditar espacios de trabajo existentes para la compatibilidad","Automatizar la validación del archivo package.json después de la generación de IA","Depurar problemas de configuración del espacio de trabajo"],"fr":["Valider les configurations de monorepo de Bun","Auditer les espaces de travail existants pour la compatibilité","Automatiser la validation du fichier package.json après la génération de l''IA","Déboguer les problèmes de configuration de l''espace de travail"],"de":["Bun-Monorepo-Setup validieren","Vorhandene Arbeitsbereiche auf Kompatibilität prüfen","Automatisierung der package.json-Dateivalidierung nach der KI-Generierung","Arbeitsbereichskonfigurationsprobleme debuggen"],"pt":["Validar configurações de monorepo do Bun","Auditar workspaces existentes para compatibilidade","Automatizar a validação do arquivo package.json após geração de IA","Depurar problemas de configuração do workspace"],"ru":["Проверка конфигураций monorepo Bun","Аудит существующих рабочих пространств на совместимость","Автоматизация проверки файла package.json после генерации ИИ","Отладка проблем конфигурации рабочего пространства"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة إعدادات مستودع واحد Bun","مراجعة مساحات العمل الحالية للتأكد من التوافق","التحكم الآلي في التحقق من ملف package.json بعد توليد الذكاء الاصطناعي","تصحيح مشاكل تشكيل مساحة العمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x","Bun 1.3+ compatibility","Limited to Bun workspace configurations"],"zh":["需要Python 3.x","Bun 1.3+兼容性","仅限Bun工作空间配置"],"ja":["Python 3.xが必要","Bun 1.3+の互換性","Bunワークスペース構成に限定"],"ko":["Python 3.x 필요","Bun 1.3+ 호환성","Bun 작업 공간 구성에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.x","Compatibilidad con Bun 1.3+","Limitado a configuraciones del espacio de trabajo de Bun"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.x","Compatibilité avec Bun 1.3+","Limité aux configurations de l''espace de travail de Bun"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.x","Kompatibilität mit Bun 1.3+","Begrenzt auf Konfigurationen des Bun-Arbeitsbereichs"],"pt":["Requer Python 3.x","Compatibilidade com Bun 1.3+","Limitado a configurações de workspace do Bun"],"ru":["Требует Python 3.x","Совместимость с Bun 1.3+","Ограничен конфигурациями рабочего пространства Bun"],"ar":["يتطلب Python 3.x","متوافق مع Bun 1.3+","محدود بتشكيل مساحة العمل Bun"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
