ação de Consultas em React","ru":"TanStack Query: Оптимизация запросов в React","ar":"TanStack Query: تحسين الاستعلامات في React","en":"tanstack-query"},"description":{"zh":"TanStack Query 是一个用于优化前端应用的数据获取的库，它提供了 useSuspenseQuery 钩子函数来简化数据获取过程","ja":"TanStack Query は、フロントエンドアプリケーションのデータ取得を最適化するためのライブラリです。useSuspenseQuery フック関数を使用してデータ取得プロセスを簡素化します","ko":"TanStack Query는 프론트엔드 애플리케이션의 데이터 가져오기를 최적화하기 위한 라이브러리입니다. useSuspenseQuery 훅 함수를 사용하여 데이터 가져오기 프로세스를 단순화합니다","es":"TanStack Query es una biblioteca para carga de datos en React. Mejora la experiencia del usuario con carga diferida y caché","fr":"TanStack Query est une bibliothèque pour le chargement de données dans React. Améliorez l''expérience utilisateur avec un chargement différé et un cache","de":"TanStack Query ist eine Bibliothek für Datenladefunktionen in React. Verbessern Sie die Benutzererfahrung mit verzögerter Ladefunktion und Cache","pt":"O TanStack Query é uma biblioteca para gerenciamento de estado e cache em React. Ele fornece uma forma padrão de usar a suspensão de consultas.","ru":"TanStack Query — это библиотека для управления состоянием и кэшем в React. Она предоставляет стандартизированный способ использования задержки запросов.","ar":"TanStack Query هو مكتبة لإدارة الحالة والแคش في React. يوفر طريقة معيارية لاستخدام تعليق الاستعلامات.","en":"Example Turbo Repo with shadcn & next.js"},"definition":{"en":"Example Turbo Repo with shadcn & next.js"},"features":{"zh":["使用 useSuspenseQuery 钩子函数简化数据获取","支持数据缓存和刷新","提供简单的数据获取和错误处理 API","与 React 和 Next.js 兼容","支持 TypeScript 和 JavaScript"],"ja":["useSuspenseQuery フック関数を使用してデータ取得を簡素化","データキャッシュとリフレッシュをサポート","シンプルなデータ取得とエラーハンドリング API を提供","React と Next.js と互換性あり","TypeScript と JavaScript をサポート"],"ko":["useSuspenseQuery 훅 함수를 사용하여 데이터 가져오기를 단순화","데이터 캐싱과 새로고침을 지원","간단한 데이터 가져오기와 오류 처리 API를 제공","React와 Next.js와 호환","TypeScript와 JavaScript를 지원"],"es":["Carga de datos diferida con useSuspenseQuery","Caché integrado para reducir solicitudes","Compatibilidad con React Query","Personalización de la clave de consulta","Soporte para parámetros de consulta"],"fr":["Chargement de données différé avec useSuspenseQuery","Cache intégré pour réduire les requêtes","Compatibilité avec React Query","Personnalisation de la clé de requête","Prise en charge des paramètres de requête"],"de":["Verzögertes Datenladen mit useSuspenseQuery","Integrierter Cache zur Reduzierung von Anfragen","Kompatibilität mit React Query","Anpassung der Abfrage-Schlüssel","Unterstützung für Abfrage-Parameter"],"pt":["Uso de suspensão de consultas","Gerenciamento de estado e cache","Padrão de uso para consultas","Integração com React Query","Suporte a parâmetros de consulta"],"ru":["Использование задержки запросов","Управление состоянием и кэшем","Шаблон использования для запросов","Интеграция с React Query","Поддержка параметров запроса"],"ar":["استخدام تعليق الاستعلامات","إدارة الحالة والแคش","نمط الاستخدام للمسائل","التكامل مع React Query","دعم معلمات الاستعلام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TanStack Query","useSuspenseQuery","React Query","数据获取","数据缓存","前端优化","JavaScript 库","React 和 Next.js"],"ja":["TanStack Query","useSuspenseQuery","React Query","データ取得","データキャッシュ","フロントエンド最適化","JavaScript ライブラリ","React と Next.js"],"ko":["TanStack Query","useSuspenseQuery","React Query","데이터 가져오기","데이터 캐싱","프론트엔드 최적화","JavaScript 라이브러리","React와 Next.js"],"es":["TanStack Query","React Query","carga de datos","useSuspenseQuery","caché","React","desarrollo web","bibliotecas JavaScript","optimización de rendimiento"],"fr":["TanStack Query","React Query","chargement de données","useSuspenseQuery","cache","React","développement web","bibliothèques JavaScript","optimisation des performances"],"de":["TanStack Query","React Query","Datenladefunktion","useSuspenseQuery","Cache","React","Webentwicklung","JavaScript-Bibliotheken","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["TanStack Query","React Query","Gerenciamento de estado","Cache em React","Suspensão de consultas","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos React"],"ru":["TanStack Query","React Query","Управление состоянием","Кэш в React","Задержка запросов","Разработка приложений React"],"ar":["TanStack Query","React Query","إدارة الحالة","الแคش في React","تعليق الاستعلامات","تنمية تطبيقات React"]}},"owner":"jhs88","repo":"my-shadcn-app-monorepo","repoPath":"jhs88/my-shadcn-app-monorepo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tanstack-query","description":"","bodyPreview":"The skill is for consistently using useSuspenseQuery from TanStack Query (React\nQuery) in a standardized way across all frontend applications. Here''s the\npattern observed:\n\n## Basic Usage Pattern\n\n```javascript\nconst { data } = useSuspenseQuery({\n  queryKey: [\"query-key\", parameter1, parameter2],\n  queryFn: () => fetchFunction(parameter1, parameter2),\n});\n```\n\n## Common Examples from the Codebase\n\n1. Simple data fetching:\n\n```javascript\nconst { data: bids } = useSuspenseQuery({\n  queryKey: [\"bid","body":"The skill is for consistently using useSuspenseQuery from TanStack Query (React\nQuery) in a standardized way across all frontend applications. Here''s the\npattern observed:\n\n## Basic Usage Pattern\n\n```javascript\nconst { data } = useSuspenseQuery({\n  queryKey: [\"query-key\", parameter1, parameter2],\n  queryFn: () => fetchFunction(parameter1, parameter2),\n});\n```\n\n## Common Examples from the Codebase\n\n1. Simple data fetching:\n\n```javascript\nconst { data: bids } = useSuspenseQuery({\n  queryKey: [\"bids\", filters, type],\n  queryFn: () => fetchBids(filters, type),\n});\n```\n\n2. Specific data:\n\n```javascript\nconst { data } = useSuspenseQuery({\n  queryKey: [\"key\", id],\n  queryFn: () => fetchData(id),\n});\n```\n\n## Key Characteristics Observed\n\n1. Consistent naming: The hook result is destructured with data as the variable\n   name (e.g., const { data: w9Data } = useSuspenseQuery(...))\n2. Query key patterns:\n   - Simple strings for static queries: [\"vendors\"]\n   - Parameterized keys for dynamic queries: [\"vendor\", vendorId]\n   - Complex keys with multiple parameters: [\"bids\", filters, type]\n3. Integration with React Query utilities:\n   - Often used alongside getQueryClient for cache invalidation on both server\n     and client-side\n   - Combined with useMutation for CRUD operations\n   - Used in conjunction with error handling and loading states\n4. Error handling:\n   - Some components check for errors explicitly (like in\n     flh-traffic-module-frontend)\n   - Often combined with toast notifications for user feedback\n5. Testing patterns:\n   - Mocked in test files using vi.fn() to simulate data fetching\n   - Tests typically mock the query key and return expected data structures\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n1. Loading data on page load: Used in component initialization to fetch required\n   data\n2. Content-specific information: Fetching data for specific records.\n3. Table/list data: Loading data for dynamic grids and tables\n\n## Best Practices Observed\n\nLooking at the existing codebase, you should also ensure that:\n\n1. Query keys are consistently structured with a predictable pattern that\n   includes the resource type and identifiers\n2. Error handling is implemented where appropriate, particularly in traffic/FLH\n   modules\n3. Integration with mutations is common - query invalidation happens after\n   mutations to keep data fresh\n4. The query is properly prefetched on the server-side in the page component (as\n   shown in `page.tsx` files):\n\n```javascript\nvoid queryClient.prefetchQuery({\n  queryKey: [\"resource\", id],\n  queryFn: () => fetchResource(id),\n});\n```\n\n5. Use the same query key pattern that''s already established in the codebase:\n   - [\"resource\", id] for resource data\n   - This maintains consistency with how other queries are handled\n\n## Key Points to Remember\n\n1. Always use proper import: Import getQueryClient() from\n   \"~/app/get-query-client\" over useSuspenseQuery from \"@tanstack/react-query\".\n2. Use consistent query keys: Follow the pattern [\"resource\", id]\n3. Error handling: The suspense query will automatically handle loading states\n   and errors\n4. Type safety: Make sure your action function returns proper data types that\n   match your expectations\n5. Integration with existing code: The modules already have a pattern of using\n   this approach, so maintain consistency\n\n# useMutation Pattern\n\nThis project uses a standardized pattern for data mutations (create, update,\ndelete operations) with TanStack Query. The pattern ensures consistent error\nhandling, loading states, and cache management.\n\n## Basic Mutation Structure\n\n```javascript\nconst { mutate: actionMutate, isPending: isActionPending } = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: (params) => actionFunction(params),\n  onSuccess: async () => {\n    // Success handling\n    toast.success(\"Success message\");\n\n    // Refresh related queries\n    await queryClient.invalidateQueries({\n      queryKey: [\"query-key\", parameter],\n    });\n\n    // Update UI state and navigate\n    setLocalState(updatedValue);\n    closeModal();\n    router.push(`/path/${parameter}`);\n  },\n  onError: (error) => {\n    // Error handling\n    console.error(\"Error:\", error);\n    toast.error(\n      error instanceof Error ? error.message : \"Generic error message\",\n    );\n    router.refresh();\n  },\n  onSettled: () => {\n    // Cleanup\n    form.reset();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Consistent Naming**:\n\n   - Mutation functions follow `actionMutate` pattern\n   - Loading states use descriptive names like `isCreating`, `isUpdating`\n   - Destructure from useMutation for clarity\n\n2. **Error Handling**:\n\n   - Always check `error instanceof Error` before accessing properties\n   - Provide generic fallback messages\n   - Log errors and show user-friendly notifications\n\n3. **Success Flow**:\n\n   - Toast notifications for immediate feedback\n   - Query invalidation to refresh data\n   - Local state updates as needed\n   - Navigation or modal management\n\n4. **Loading States**:\n   - Individual states per mutation\n   - Combine states for complex operations\n   - Disable UI elements during mutations\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Integration\n\n```javascript\n<form\n  onSubmit={(e) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    mutationMutate({ param1: value1, param2: value2 });\n  }}\n>\n  {/* Form fields */}\n  <SubmitButton disabled={isPending}>Submit</SubmitButton>\n</form>\n```\n\n### Query Invalidation\n\n```javascript\n// Single query\nawait queryClient.invalidateQueries({\n  queryKey: [\"resource\", id],\n});\n\n// Multiple related queries\nawait queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [\"resource\", id] });\nawait queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [\"related-data\", id] });\n```\n\n### Combined Loading States\n\n```javascript\nconst isProcessing = isCreating || isUpdating || isDeleting;\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Type Safety**: Use TypeScript interfaces for mutation parameters\n2. **Server Actions**: Use \"use server\" directive for mutation functions\n3. **Consistent Messaging**: Follow predictable error message patterns\n4. **Loading Feedback**: Disable buttons and show indicators during mutations\n5. **Form Cleanup**: Use `onSettled` for form resets and cleanup\n6. **Navigation**: Handle redirects appropriately after mutations\n\n## Custom Hooks (Optional)\n\nFor reusable mutations, extract to custom hooks:\n\n```javascript\nexport const useCreateResource = (onSuccess?: () => void) =>\n  useMutation({\n    mutationFn: createResource,\n    onSuccess: (data) => {\n      toast.success(\"Successfully created resource.\");\n      onSuccess?.();\n    },\n    onError: (error: Error) => {\n      toast.error(error.message || \"Failed to create resource\");\n    },\n  });\n```\n\n## Key Characteristics\n\n1. **Consistent Naming**:\n\n   - Mutation function: `actionMutate` (e.g., `createContactMutate`,\n     `updateContactMutate`)\n   - Loading state: `isActionPending` (e.g., `isCreating`, `isUpdating`)\n   - Destructured from useMutation for clarity\n\n2. **Error Handling**:\n\n   - Always check `error instanceof Error` before accessing `error.message`\n   - Provide generic fallback messages\n   - Log errors to console for debugging\n   - Show user-friendly toast notifications\n\n3. **Success Flow**:\n\n   - Toast notifications for immediate feedback\n   - Query invalidation to refresh related data\n   - Local state updates when needed\n   - Navigation or modal closing\n\n4. **Loading States**:\n   - Individual loading states per mutation\n   - Combined loading states for complex operations:\n     `const isPending = isCreating || isUpdating || isRemoving;`\n   - UI elements disabled during mutations\n\n## Common Examples from Codebase\n\n### Create Mutation (VendorContacts.tsx)\n\n```javascript\nconst { mutate: createContactMutate, isPending: isCreating } = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: (data: ContactFormValues) =>\n    addVendorContact(vendorId, {\n      name: data.name,\n      role: data.role,\n      phone: data.phone || \"\",\n      cellNumber: data.cellNumber || \"\",\n      email: data.email,\n      isPrimary: data.isPrimary ?? false,\n    }),\n  onSuccess: async () => {\n    await queryClient.invalidateQueries({\n      queryKey: [\"vendor-contacts\", vendorId],\n    });\n    const primaryContactCount = await countPrimaryContacts(vendorId);\n    setHasPrimaryVendorContact(primaryContactCount === 1);\n    setFormModalState(false);\n    toast.success(\"Successfully added vendor contact!\");\n    router.push(`/vendors/${vendorId}`);\n  },\n  onError: (error) => {\n    console.error(\"Error updating contact:\", error);\n    toast.error(\n      error instanceof Error ? error.message : \"Error saving contact!\",\n    );\n    router.refresh();\n  },\n  onSettled: () => form.reset(),\n});\n```\n\n### Delete Mutation Pattern\n\n```javascript\nconst { mutate: removeContactMutate, isPending: isRemoving } = useMutation({\n  mutationFn: async (contactId: string) => {\n    await removeVendorContact(contactId);\n    return contactId;\n  },\n  onSuccess: async (contactId: string) => {\n    toast.success(\"Successfully removed vendor contact!\");\n\n    await queryClient.invalidateQueries({\n      queryKey: [\"vendor-contacts\", vendorId],\n    });\n\n    const primaryContactCount = await countPrimaryContacts(vendorId);\n    setHasPrimaryVendorContact(primaryContactCount === 1);\n    router.push(`/vendors/${vendorId}`);\n  },\n  onError: (error) => {\n    console.error(\"Error removing contact:\", error);\n    toast.error(\n      error instanceof Error ? error.message : \"Failed to remove contact\",\n    );\n    router.refresh();\n  },\n  onSettled: () => setRemoveModalState(false),\n});\n```\n\n### Form Integration Pattern\n\n```javascript\n<form\n  onSubmit={(e) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    mutationMutate({ param1: value1, param2: value2 });\n  }}\n>\n  <Field>\n    <FieldContent>\n      <Textarea\n        value={notes}\n        onChange={(e) => setNotes(e.target.value)}\n        required\n        placeholder=\"Enter notes...\"\n      />\n      <DialogFooter>\n        <DialogClose asChild>\n          <Button variant=\"outline\">Close</Button>\n        </DialogClose>\n        <SubmitButton variant=\"destructive\" disabled={isPending}>\n          Submit Action\n        </SubmitButton>\n      </DialogFooter>\n    </FieldContent>\n  </Field>\n</form>\n```\n\n## Query Invalidation Patterns\n\n1. **Targeted Invalidation**: Always use specific query keys\n\n   ```javascript\n   await queryClient.invalidateQueries({\n     queryKey: [\"vendor-documents\", vendorId],\n   });\n   ```\n\n2. **Multiple Related Queries**: When mutations affect multiple data types\n\n   ```javascript\n   await queryClient.invalidateQueries({\n     queryKey: [\"vendor-documents\", vendorId],\n   });\n   await queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [\"audit-logs\", vendorId] });\n   await queryClient.invalidateQueries({\n     queryKey: [\"vendor-document-counts\", vendorId],\n   });\n   ```\n\n3. **Sequential Operations**: Perform invalidations in order, sometimes with\n   additional async operations\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Type Safety**: Define proper TypeScript interfaces for mutation parameters\n2. **Server Actions**: All mutation functions should be server actions with \"use\n   server\" directive\n3. **Consistent Error Messages**: Use predictable error message patterns\n4. **Loading State Management**: Disable buttons and show loading indicators\n   during mutations\n5. **Form Reset**: Use `onSettled` callback to clean up form state\n6. **Navigation**: Use `router.push()` or `router.refresh()` appropriately after\n   mutations\n\n## Custom Hook Pattern (Advanced)\n\nFor reusable mutations, create custom hooks:\n\n```javascript\nexport const useCreateBid = (onSuccess?: () => void) =>\n  useMutation({\n    mutationFn: createBid,\n    onSuccess: (data) => {\n      toast.success(\"Successfully created bid.\");\n      onSuccess?.();\n    },\n    onError: (error: Error) => {\n      toast.error(error.message || \"Failed to create bid\", {\n        duration: Infinity,\n        action: {\n          label: \"Dismiss\",\n          onClick: () => console.log(\"Error was dismissed\"),\n        },\n      });\n    },\n  });\n```\n\n## Summary\n\nThe implementation in the modules follows a consistent pattern where:\n\n- Server-side prefetching is used to pre-load queries\n- Client-side getQueryClient or useSuspenseQuery is used for components that\n  need to fetch data\n- useMutation follows standardized patterns for all CRUD operations\n- Query keys follow a predictable naming convention\n- The same fetch action function is used consistently\n\nThis approach ensures proper hydration, loading states, consistent caching\nbehavior, and maintainable mutation logic across the application.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:47:53.235Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents utilizing React Query for standardized data fetching and caching.","zh":"非常适合使用 React Query 进行标准化数据获取和缓存的前端代理。","ja":"React Query を使用した標準化されたデータ取得およびキャッシュに最適なフロントエンド エージェントに適しています。","ko":"React Query를 사용한 표준화된 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱에 적합한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que utilizan React Query para la obtención y almacenamiento en caché de datos estandarizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend utilisant React Query pour une récupération et un mise en cache de données standardisées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die React Query für standardisierte Datenabruf und Caching verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que utilizam React Query para busca e cache de dados padronizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов frontend, использующих React Query для стандартизации запросов и кэширования данных.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامي الذين يستخدمون React Query لاستدعاء البيانات ومخزنها المؤقت بشكل معياري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to consistently use useSuspenseQuery from TanStack Query, providing standardized data fetching and caching with queryKey and queryFn, leveraging Next.js and shadcn for optimized frontend applications.","zh":"赋予代理以一致地使用 TanStack Query 中的 useSuspenseQuery，提供具有 queryKey 和 queryFn 的标准化数据获取和缓存，利用 Next.js 和 shadcn 优化前端应用程序。","ja":"TanStack Query の useSuspenseQuery を一貫して使用することで、エージェントに queryKey および queryFn を備えた標準化されたデータ取得およびキャッシュを提供し、Next.js および shadcn を使用してフロントエンド アプリケーションを最適化します。","ko":"TanStack Query의 useSuspenseQuery를 일관되게 사용하여 에이전트에 queryKey 및 queryFn을 갖춘 표준화된 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱을 제공하며, Next.js 및 shadcn을 사용하여 프론트엔드 애플리케이션을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar consistentemente useSuspenseQuery de TanStack Query, proporcionando una obtención y almacenamiento en caché de datos estandarizados con queryKey y queryFn, aprovechando Next.js y shadcn para aplicaciones frontend optimizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser de manière cohérente useSuspenseQuery de TanStack Query, fournissant une récupération et un mise en cache de données standardisées avec queryKey et queryFn, en exploitant Next.js et shadcn pour des applications frontend optimisées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, useSuspenseQuery von TanStack Query konsistent zu verwenden, wodurch standardisierte Datenabruf und Caching mit queryKey und queryFn bereitgestellt werden, wobei Next.js und shadcn für optimierte Frontend-Anwendungen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a usar consistentemente useSuspenseQuery do TanStack Query, fornecendo busca e cache de dados padronizados com queryKey e queryFn, aproveitando Next.js e shadcn para aplicações frontend otimizadas.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность последовательно использовать useSuspenseQuery из TanStack Query, обеспечивая стандартизированную загрузку и кэширование данных с queryKey и queryFn, используя Next.js и shadcn для оптимизированных frontend-приложений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استخدام useSuspenseQuery من TanStack Query باستمرار، مع تقديم استدعاء البيانات ومخزنها المؤقت بشكل معياري مع queryKey و queryFn، واستخدام Next.js و shadcn من أجل تطبيقات أمامية محسّنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing data fetching across applications","Implementing suspenseful query handling with useSuspenseQuery","Caching query results for improved performance"],"zh":["跨应用程序标准化数据获取","使用 useSuspenseQuery 实现悬念查询处理","缓存查询结果以提高性能"],"ja":["アプリケーション全体でデータ取得を標準化する","useSuspenseQuery を使用したサスペンスフルなクエリハンドリングの実装","パフォーマンスの向上のためにクエリ結果をキャッシュする"],"ko":["애플리케이션 전반에 걸쳐 데이터 가져오기를 표준화하는 것","useSuspenseQuery를 사용하여 서스펜스풀한 쿼리 처리 구현","성능 개선을 위해 쿼리 결과를 캐싱하는 것"],"es":["Estandarizar la obtención de datos en varias aplicaciones","Implementar el manejo de consultas con suspense con useSuspenseQuery","Almacenar en caché los resultados de las consultas para mejorar el rendimiento"],"fr":["Standardiser la récupération de données à travers plusieurs applications","Mettre en œuvre la gestion de requêtes avec suspense à l''aide de useSuspenseQuery","Mettre en cache les résultats de requêtes pour améliorer les performances"],"de":["Standardisieren des Datenabrufs über mehrere Anwendungen hinweg","Implementieren der Verarbeitung von Anfragen mit Verzögerung mit useSuspenseQuery","Zwischenspeichern der Abfrageergebnisse zur Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["Padronizar a busca de dados em toda a aplicação","Implementar tratamento de consulta com suspense com useSuspenseQuery","Armazenar resultados de consulta em cache para melhorar o desempenho"],"ru":["Стандартизировать запросы данных во всех приложениях","Реализовать обработку запросов с ожиданием с помощью useSuspenseQuery","Кэшировать результаты запросов для улучшения производительности"],"ar":["تقييس استدعاء البيانات عبر التطبيقات","تنفيذ معالجة الاستفسار مع تعليق باستخدام useSuspenseQuery"," تخزين نتائج الاستفسار في المخزن المؤقت لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and Next.js integration","Limited to frontend applications using TanStack Query"],"zh":["需要 React 和 Next.js 集成","仅限使用 TanStack Query 的前端应用程序"],"ja":["React および Next.js の統合が必要","TanStack Query を使用するフロントエンド アプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js 통합이 필요","TanStack Query를 사용하는 프론트엔드 애플리케이션으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración con React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones frontend que utilizan TanStack Query"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec React et Next.js","Limité aux applications frontend utilisant TanStack Query"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf Frontend-Anwendungen, die TanStack Query verwenden"],"pt":["Requer integração com React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações frontend que usam TanStack Query"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с React и Next.js","Ограничен frontend-приложениями, использующими TanStack Query"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات الأمامية التي تستخدم TanStack Query"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jhonatan-cyber/nuwefarma-front/agent-browser', 'community', 'jhonatan-cyber', 'nuwefarma-front', 'jhonatan-cyber/nuwefarma-front', 'agent-browser', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z', '2026-02-18T09:47:06.382Z', NULL, '{"id":"jhonatan-cyber/nuwefarma-front/agent-browser","name":"agent-browser","description":{"zh":"Agentic Browser . Playwright ","ja":"Agentic Browser . Playwright ","ko":"Agentic Browser . Playwright ","es":"Agentic Browser es una herramienta de automatización de navegador para agentes AI que utiliza Playwright y un sistema de referencia simple para la interacción de elementos","fr":"Agentic Browser est un outil d''automatisation de navigateur pour les agents IA qui utilise Playwright et un système de référence simple pour l''interaction d''éléments","de":"Agentic Browser ist ein Tool für die Automatisierung von Browsern für KI-Agents, das Playwright und ein einfaches Referenzsystem für die Interaktion von Elementen verwendet","pt":"O Agentic Browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador para agentes de IA que utiliza Playwright e inference.sh","ru":"Agentic Browser — это инструмент для автоматизации браузера для агентов ИИ, использующий Playwright и inference.sh","ar":"متصفح إيجنتيك هو أداة أتمتة متصفح للوكلاء الذكية التي تستخدم بلاي رايت وإنفرنس.ش","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Agentic Browser - AI","ja":"Agentic Browser - AI","ko":"Agentic Browser - AI","es":"Agentic Browser: Automatización de navegador para agentes AI","fr":"Agentic Browser : Automatisation du navigateur pour les a...","de":"Agentic Browser: Browser-Automatisierung für KI-Agents","pt":"Agentic Browser: Automação de Navegador para Agentes de IA","ru":"Agentic Browser: Автоматизация браузера для агентов ИИ","ar":"متصفح إيجنتيك: أتمتة متصفح للوكلاء الذكية","en":"agent-browser"},"description":{"zh":"Agentic Browser . Playwright ","ja":"Agentic Browser . Playwright ","ko":"Agentic Browser . Playwright ","es":"Agentic Browser es una herramienta de automatización de navegador para agentes AI que utiliza Playwright y un sistema de referencia simple para la interacció...","fr":"Agentic Browser est un outil d''automatisation de navigateur pour les agents IA qui utilise Playwright et un système de référence simple pour l''interaction d''...","de":"Agentic Browser ist ein Tool für die Automatisierung von Browsern für KI-Agents, das Playwright und ein einfaches Referenzsystem für die Interaktion von Elem...","pt":"O Agentic Browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador para agentes de IA que utiliza Playwright e inference.sh","ru":"Agentic Browser — это инструмент для автоматизации браузера для агентов ИИ, использующий Playwright и inference.sh","ar":"متصفح إيجنتيك هو أداة أتمتة متصفح للوكلاء الذكية التي تستخدم بلاي رايت وإنفرنس.ش","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Playwright","inference.sh","CLI","API","Browser"],"ja":["Playwright","inference.sh","CLI","API","Browser"],"ko":["Playwright","inference.sh","CLI","API","Browser"],"es":["Automatización de navegador para agentes AI","Utiliza Playwright para la automatización","Sistema de referencia simple para la interacción de elementos","Permite la interacción con elementos de una página web de manera automatizada","Integración con inference.sh para la ejecución de funciones"],"fr":["Automatisation de navigateur pour les agents IA","Utilise Playwright pour l''automatisation","Système de référence simple pour l''interaction d''éléments","Permet l''interaction avec des éléments d''une page web de manière automatisée","Intégration avec inference.sh pour l''exécution de fonctions"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browsern für KI-Agents","Verwendet Playwright für die Automatisierung","Einfaches Referenzsystem für die Interaktion von Elementen","Ermöglicht die Interaktion mit Elementen einer Webseite auf automatisierte Weise","Integration mit inference.sh für die Ausführung von Funktionen"],"pt":["Automação de navegador com Playwright","Integração com inference.sh","Sistema de referência simples @e","Interatividade com elementos da página","Instalação via CLI"],"ru":["Автоматизация браузера с помощью Playwright","Интеграция с inference.sh","Простая система ссылок @e","Взаимодействие с элементами страницы","Установка через CLI"],"ar":["أتمتة متصفح مع بلاي رايت","التكامل مع إنفرنس.ش","نظام إحالة بسيط @e","التفاعل مع عناصر الصفحة","التثبيت عبر CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","Agentic Browser","Playwright","inference.sh","Browser","Automation","CLI","API","Developer"],"ja":["AI","Agentic Browser","Playwright","inference.sh","Browser","Automation","CLI","API","Developer"],"ko":["AI","Agentic Browser","Playwright","inference.sh","Browser","Automation","CLI","API","Developer"],"es":["Agentic Browser","automatización de navegador","agentes AI","Playwright","inference.sh","automatización de elementos","interacción con elementos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Agentic Browser","automatisation de navigateur","agents IA","Playwright","inference.sh","automatisation d''éléments","interaction avec des éléments","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Agentic Browser","Automatisierung von Browsern","KI-Agents","Playwright","inference.sh","Automatisierung von Elementen","Interaktion mit Elementen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["automação de navegador","agentes de IA","Playwright","inference.sh","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de IA","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","агенты ИИ","Playwright","inference.sh","разработка программного обеспечения","технология ИИ","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["أتمتة متصفح","الوكلاء الذكية","بلاي رايت","إنفرنس.ش","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"jhonatan-cyber","repo":"nuwefarma-front","repoPath":"jhonatan-cyber/nuwefarma-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-browser","description":"Browser automation for AI agents via inference.sh. Navigate web pages, interact with elements using @e refs, take screenshots, record video. Capabilities: web scraping, form filling, clicking, typing, drag-drop, file upload, JavaScript execution. Use for: web automation, data extraction, testing, agent browsing, research. Triggers: browser, web automation, scrape, navigate, click, fill form, screenshot, browse web, playwright, headless browser, web agent, surf internet, record video","bodyPreview":"# Agentic Browser\n\nBrowser automation for AI agents via [inference.sh](https://inference.sh). Uses Playwright under the hood with a simple `@e` ref system for element interaction.\n\n![Agentic Browser](https://cloud.inference.sh/app/files/u/4mg21r6ta37mpaz6ktzwtt8krr/01kgjw8atdxgkrsr8a2t5peq7b.jpeg)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Install CLI\ncurl -fsSL https://cli.inference.sh | sh && infsh login\n\n# Open a page and get interactive elements\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function open --input ''{\"url\": \"","body":"# Agentic Browser\n\nBrowser automation for AI agents via [inference.sh](https://inference.sh). Uses Playwright under the hood with a simple `@e` ref system for element interaction.\n\n![Agentic Browser](https://cloud.inference.sh/app/files/u/4mg21r6ta37mpaz6ktzwtt8krr/01kgjw8atdxgkrsr8a2t5peq7b.jpeg)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Install CLI\ncurl -fsSL https://cli.inference.sh | sh && infsh login\n\n# Open a page and get interactive elements\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function open --input ''{\"url\": \"https://example.com\"}'' --session new\n```\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nEvery browser automation follows this pattern:\n\n1. **Open** - Navigate to URL, get `@e` refs for elements\n2. **Interact** - Use refs to click, fill, drag, etc.\n3. **Re-snapshot** - After navigation/changes, get fresh refs\n4. **Close** - End session (returns video if recording)\n\n```bash\n# 1. Start session\nRESULT=$(infsh app run agent-browser --function open --session new --input ''{\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com/login\"\n}'')\nSESSION_ID=$(echo $RESULT | jq -r ''.session_id'')\n# Elements: @e1 [input] \"Email\", @e2 [input] \"Password\", @e3 [button] \"Sign In\"\n\n# 2. Fill and submit\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION_ID --input ''{\n  \"action\": \"fill\", \"ref\": \"@e1\", \"text\": \"user@example.com\"\n}''\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION_ID --input ''{\n  \"action\": \"fill\", \"ref\": \"@e2\", \"text\": \"password123\"\n}''\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION_ID --input ''{\n  \"action\": \"click\", \"ref\": \"@e3\"\n}''\n\n# 3. Re-snapshot after navigation\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function snapshot --session $SESSION_ID --input ''{}''\n\n# 4. Close when done\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function close --session $SESSION_ID --input ''{}''\n```\n\n## Functions\n\n| Function | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `open` | Navigate to URL, configure browser (viewport, proxy, video recording) |\n| `snapshot` | Re-fetch page state with `@e` refs after DOM changes |\n| `interact` | Perform actions using `@e` refs (click, fill, drag, upload, etc.) |\n| `screenshot` | Take page screenshot (viewport or full page) |\n| `execute` | Run JavaScript code on the page |\n| `close` | Close session, returns video if recording was enabled |\n\n## Interact Actions\n\n| Action | Description | Required Fields |\n|--------|-------------|-----------------|\n| `click` | Click element | `ref` |\n| `dblclick` | Double-click element | `ref` |\n| `fill` | Clear and type text | `ref`, `text` |\n| `type` | Type text (no clear) | `text` |\n| `press` | Press key (Enter, Tab, etc.) | `text` |\n| `select` | Select dropdown option | `ref`, `text` |\n| `hover` | Hover over element | `ref` |\n| `check` | Check checkbox | `ref` |\n| `uncheck` | Uncheck checkbox | `ref` |\n| `drag` | Drag and drop | `ref`, `target_ref` |\n| `upload` | Upload file(s) | `ref`, `file_paths` |\n| `scroll` | Scroll page | `direction` (up/down/left/right), `scroll_amount` |\n| `back` | Go back in history | - |\n| `wait` | Wait milliseconds | `wait_ms` |\n| `goto` | Navigate to URL | `url` |\n\n## Element Refs\n\nElements are returned with `@e` refs:\n\n```\n@e1 [a] \"Home\" href=\"/\"\n@e2 [input type=\"text\"] placeholder=\"Search\"\n@e3 [button] \"Submit\"\n@e4 [select] \"Choose option\"\n@e5 [input type=\"checkbox\"] name=\"agree\"\n```\n\n**Important:** Refs are invalidated after navigation. Always re-snapshot after:\n- Clicking links/buttons that navigate\n- Form submissions\n- Dynamic content loading\n\n## Features\n\n### Video Recording\n\nRecord browser sessions for debugging or documentation:\n\n```bash\n# Start with recording enabled (optionally show cursor indicator)\nSESSION=$(infsh app run agent-browser --function open --session new --input ''{\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com\",\n  \"record_video\": true,\n  \"show_cursor\": true\n}'' | jq -r ''.session_id'')\n\n# ... perform actions ...\n\n# Close to get the video file\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function close --session $SESSION --input ''{}''\n# Returns: {\"success\": true, \"video\": <File>}\n```\n\n### Cursor Indicator\n\nShow a visible cursor in screenshots and video (useful for demos):\n\n```bash\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function open --session new --input ''{\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com\",\n  \"show_cursor\": true,\n  \"record_video\": true\n}''\n```\n\nThe cursor appears as a red dot that follows mouse movements and shows click feedback.\n\n### Proxy Support\n\nRoute traffic through a proxy server:\n\n```bash\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function open --session new --input ''{\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com\",\n  \"proxy_url\": \"http://proxy.example.com:8080\",\n  \"proxy_username\": \"user\",\n  \"proxy_password\": \"pass\"\n}''\n```\n\n### File Upload\n\nUpload files to file inputs:\n\n```bash\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION --input ''{\n  \"action\": \"upload\",\n  \"ref\": \"@e5\",\n  \"file_paths\": [\"/path/to/file.pdf\"]\n}''\n```\n\n### Drag and Drop\n\nDrag elements to targets:\n\n```bash\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION --input ''{\n  \"action\": \"drag\",\n  \"ref\": \"@e1\",\n  \"target_ref\": \"@e2\"\n}''\n```\n\n### JavaScript Execution\n\nRun custom JavaScript:\n\n```bash\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function execute --session $SESSION --input ''{\n  \"code\": \"document.querySelectorAll(\\\"h2\\\").length\"\n}''\n# Returns: {\"result\": \"5\", \"screenshot\": <File>}\n```\n\n## Deep-Dive Documentation\n\n| Reference | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| [references/commands.md](references/commands.md) | Full function reference with all options |\n| [references/snapshot-refs.md](references/snapshot-refs.md) | Ref lifecycle, invalidation rules, troubleshooting |\n| [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md) | Session persistence, parallel sessions |\n| [references/authentication.md](references/authentication.md) | Login flows, OAuth, 2FA handling |\n| [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md) | Recording workflows for debugging |\n| [references/proxy-support.md](references/proxy-support.md) | Proxy configuration, geo-testing |\n\n## Ready-to-Use Templates\n\n| Template | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [templates/form-automation.sh](templates/form-automation.sh) | Form filling with validation |\n| [templates/authenticated-session.sh](templates/authenticated-session.sh) | Login once, reuse session |\n| [templates/capture-workflow.sh](templates/capture-workflow.sh) | Content extraction with screenshots |\n\n## Examples\n\n### Form Submission\n\n```bash\nSESSION=$(infsh app run agent-browser --function open --session new --input ''{\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com/contact\"\n}'' | jq -r ''.session_id'')\n\n# Get elements: @e1 [input] \"Name\", @e2 [input] \"Email\", @e3 [textarea], @e4 [button] \"Send\"\n\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION --input ''{\"action\": \"fill\", \"ref\": \"@e1\", \"text\": \"John Doe\"}''\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION --input ''{\"action\": \"fill\", \"ref\": \"@e2\", \"text\": \"john@example.com\"}''\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION --input ''{\"action\": \"fill\", \"ref\": \"@e3\", \"text\": \"Hello!\"}''\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION --input ''{\"action\": \"click\", \"ref\": \"@e4\"}''\n\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function snapshot --session $SESSION --input ''{}''\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function close --session $SESSION --input ''{}''\n```\n\n### Search and Extract\n\n```bash\nSESSION=$(infsh app run agent-browser --function open --session new --input ''{\n  \"url\": \"https://google.com\"\n}'' | jq -r ''.session_id'')\n\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION --input ''{\"action\": \"fill\", \"ref\": \"@e1\", \"text\": \"weather today\"}''\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION --input ''{\"action\": \"press\", \"text\": \"Enter\"}''\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function interact --session $SESSION --input ''{\"action\": \"wait\", \"wait_ms\": 2000}''\n\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function snapshot --session $SESSION --input ''{}''\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function close --session $SESSION --input ''{}''\n```\n\n### Screenshot with Video\n\n```bash\nSESSION=$(infsh app run agent-browser --function open --session new --input ''{\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com\",\n  \"record_video\": true\n}'' | jq -r ''.session_id'')\n\n# Take full page screenshot\ninfsh app run agent-browser --function screenshot --session $SESSION --input ''{\n  \"full_page\": true\n}''\n\n# Close and get video\nRESULT=$(infsh app run agent-browser --function close --session $SESSION --input ''{}'')\necho $RESULT | jq ''.video''\n```\n\n## Sessions\n\nBrowser state persists within a session. Always:\n\n1. Start with `--session new` on first call\n2. Use returned `session_id` for subsequent calls\n3. Close session when done\n\n## Related Skills\n\n```bash\n# Web search (for research + browse)\nnpx skills add inferencesh/skills@web-search\n\n# LLM models (analyze extracted content)\nnpx skills add inferencesh/skills@llm-models\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n- [inference.sh Sessions](https://inference.sh/docs/extend/sessions) - Session management\n- [Multi-function Apps](https://inference.sh/docs/extend/multi-function-apps) - How functions work\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:47:06.382Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated browser interactions via Playwright and inference.sh","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Playwright 和 inference.sh 进行自动化浏览器交互的 AI Agents","ja":"Playwright と inference.sh を使用した自動化ブラウザインタラクションが必要な AI エージェントに最適","ko":"Playwright와 inference.sh를 통해 자동화된 브라우저 상호작용이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan interacciones de navegador automatizadas a través de Playwright e inference.sh","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des interactions de navigateur automatisées via Playwright et inference.sh","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die automatisierte Browser-Interaktionen über Playwright und inference.sh benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de interações de navegador automatizadas via Playwright e inference.sh","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, требующих автоматизированных взаимодействий браузера через Playwright и inference.sh","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى تفاعلات متصفح آلية عبر Playwright و inference.sh"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser tasks using a simple `@e` ref system for element interaction, leveraging Playwright under the hood and inference.sh for seamless integration, supporting protocols like HTTPS and file formats like JSON","zh":"赋予代理自动化浏览器任务的能力，使用简单的 `@e` 引用系统进行元素交互，利用 Playwright 并结合 inference.sh 实现无缝集成，支持 HTTPS 等协议和 JSON 等文件格式","ja":"エージェントに、Playwright を利用し、`@e` 参照システムを使用して要素とやり取りすることで、ブラウザーのタスクを自動化する能力を与え、inference.sh により無縫に統合され、HTTPS などのプロトコルや JSON などのファイル形式をサポート","ko":"에이전트에 브라우저 작업을 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여함으로써, `@e` 참조 시스템을 사용하여 요소와 상호 작용하고, Playwright를 활용하여 inference.sh와의 무리없는 통합을 지원하며, HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜 및 JSON과 같은 파일 형식을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar tareas del navegador utilizando un sistema de referencia `@e` simple para la interacción de elementos, aprovechando Playwright en segundo plano y inference.sh para una integración sin problemas, que admite protocolos como HTTPS y formatos de archivo como JSON","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre l''automatisation des tâches de navigateur en utilisant un système de référence `@e` simple pour l''interaction d''éléments, en exploitant Playwright sous le capot et inference.sh pour une intégration transparente, en prenant en charge des protocoles comme HTTPS et des formats de fichiers comme JSON","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Browser-Aufgaben zu automatisieren, indem sie ein einfaches `@e`-Referenzsystem für die Elementinteraktion verwenden, Playwright im Hintergrund nutzen und inference.sh für eine nahtlose Integration, unterstützt Protokolle wie HTTPS und Dateiformate wie JSON","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar tarefas do navegador usando um sistema de referência `@e` simples para interação de elementos, aproveitando o Playwright por baixo dos panos e inference.sh para integração sem problemas, suportando protocolos como HTTPS e formatos de arquivo como JSON","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать задачи браузера, используя простую систему ссылок `@e` для взаимодействия с элементами, опираясь на Playwright под капотом и inference.sh для беспрепятственной интеграции, поддерживая протоколы, такие как HTTPS, и форматы файлов, такие как JSON","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توفير مهام المتصفح باستخدام نظام المراجع `@e` البسيط للتفاعل مع العناصر، والاستفادة من Playwright في الخلفية و inference.sh من أجل التكامل السلس، ودعم البروتوكولات مثل HTTPS والتنسيقات الملفية مثل JSON"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web page interactions","Debugging browser-based applications","Generating interactive web content using inference.sh"],"zh":["自动化网页交互","调试基于浏览器的应用程序","使用 inference.sh 生成交互式网页内容"],"ja":["Web ページのインタラクションを自動化","ブラウザー ベースのアプリケーションのデバッグ","inference.sh を使用してインタラクティブな Web コンテンツを生成"],"ko":["웹 페이지 상호작용 자동화","브라우저 기반 애플리케이션 디버깅","inference.sh를 사용하여 상호작용형 웹 콘텐츠 생성"],"es":["Automatizar interacciones de páginas web","Depurar aplicaciones basadas en navegador","Generar contenido web interactivo utilizando inference.sh"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions de pages web","Déboguer des applications basées sur le navigateur","Générer du contenu web interactif en utilisant inference.sh"],"de":["Automatisierung von Webseiten-Interaktionen","Debuggen von browserbasierten Anwendungen","Erzeugen von interaktivem Web-Inhalt mit Hilfe von inference.sh"],"pt":["Automatizar interações de página web","Depurar aplicações baseadas em navegador","Gerar conteúdo web interativo usando inference.sh"],"ru":["Автоматизировать взаимодействия с веб-страницами","Отлаживать приложения на основе браузера","Генерировать интерактивный веб-контент, используя inference.sh"],"ar":["أتمتة تفاعلات صفحة الويب","تصحيح الأخطاء في التطبيقات المعتمدة على المتصفح","توليد محتوى ويب تفاعلي باستخدام inference.sh"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires inference.sh CLI installation and login","Playwright dependency","Limited to browser automation tasks"],"zh":["需要 inference.sh CLI 安装和登录","Playwright 依赖","仅限浏览器自动化任务"],"ja":["inference.sh CLI のインストールとログインが必要","Playwright への依存","ブラウザーの自動化タスクに限定"],"ko":["inference.sh CLI 설치 및 로그인이 필요","Playwright 의존","브라우저 자동화 작업으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y el inicio de sesión de la CLI de inference.sh","Dependencia de Playwright","Limitado a tareas de automatización de navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la connexion à la CLI d''inference.sh","Dépendance de Playwright","Limité aux tâches d''automatisation de navigateur"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Anmeldung der inference.sh-CLI","Playwright-Abhängigkeit","Begrenzt auf Browser-Automatisierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Exige instalação e login do CLI do inference.sh","Dependência do Playwright","Limitado a tarefas de automação de navegador"],"ru":["Требует установки и входа в CLI inference.sh","Зависимость от Playwright","Ограничен задачами автоматизации браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتسجيل الدخول إلى واجهة سطر الأوامر inference.sh","اعتمادية على Playwright","محدود بمهام أتمتة المتصفح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
