목입니다. 코드가 수락 기준을 충족하고 빌드 및 회귀 테스트에 통과하는지 확인합니다","es":"La lista de verificación de revisión es una herramienta esencial para desarrolladores que necesitan evaluar el trabajo de un agente de manera exhaustiva","fr":"La check-list de révision est un outil essentiel pour les développeurs qui doivent évaluer le travail d''un agent de manière exhaustive","de":"Die Überprüfungs-Checkliste ist ein wesentliches Tool für Entwickler, die die Arbeit eines Agenten umfassend bewerten müssen","pt":"A lista de verificação de revisão de agente é uma ferramenta essencial para garantir a qualidade do trabalho de um agente.","ru":"Чек-лист проверки агента является важнейшим инструментом для обеспечения качества работы агента.","ar":"قائمة مراجعة وكيل المراجعة هي أداة أساسية لضمان جودة عمل الوكيل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["接受标准检查","边界检查","构建检查","回归测试","代码质量评估"],"ja":["受け入れ基準のチェック","境界のチェック","ビルドのチェック","リグレッションテスト","コード品質の評価"],"ko":["수락 기준 체크","경계 체크","빌드 체크","회귀 테스트","코드 품질 평가"],"es":["Criterios de aceptación","Archivos dentro del límite del agente","No violaciones de límites","Construcción sin errores","No regresiones"],"fr":["Critères d''acceptation","Fichiers dans les limites de l''agent","Pas de violations de limites","Construction sans erreurs","Pas de régressions"],"de":["Akzeptanzkriterien","Dateien innerhalb der Agentengrenzen","Keine Grenzverletzungen","Fehlerfreie Konstruktion","Keine Rückentwicklungen"],"pt":["Verificação de critérios de aceitação","Verificação de arquivos dentro do domínio do agente","Verificação de violações de limite","Verificação de build de projeto","Verificação de regressões"],"ru":["Проверка критериев приемки","Проверка файлов в пределах домена агента","Проверка нарушений границ","Проверка сборки проекта","Проверка регрессий"],"ar":["التحقق من معايير القبول","التحقق من الملفات داخل مجال الوكيل","التحقق من انتهاكات الحدود","التحقق من بناء المشروع","التحقق من الانحدارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","代码质量","接受标准","边界检查","构建检查","回归测试","代码评估"],"ja":["コードレビュー","コード品質","受け入れ基準","境界チェック","ビルドチェック","リグレッションテスト","コード評価"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","코드 품질","수락 기준","경계 체크","빌드 체크","회귀 테스트","코드 평가"],"es":["lista de verificación de revisión","desarrollo de software","evaluación de trabajo","criterios de aceptación","límites del agente","construcción sin errores"],"fr":["check-list de révision","développement de logiciels","évaluation de travail","critères d''acceptation","limites de l''agent","construction sans erreurs"],"de":["Überprüfungs-Checkliste","Software-Entwicklung","Arbeitsbewertung","Akzeptanzkriterien","Agentengrenzen","fehlerfreie Konstruktion"],"pt":["revisão de agente","lista de verificação","critérios de aceitação","arquivos dentro do domínio","violações de limite","build de projeto","regressões"],"ru":["проверка агента","чек-лист","критерии приемки","файлы в пределах домена","нарушения границ","сборка проекта","регрессии"],"ar":["مراجعة الوكيل","قائمة مراجعة","معايير القبول","الملفات داخل مجال","انتهاكات الحدود","بناء المشروع","الانحدارات"]}},"owner":"AgentArtel","repo":"Open-RPG","repoPath":"AgentArtel/Open-RPG","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-checklist","description":"Code review standards for Open Artel multi-agent projects. Defines the review checklist, verdict types, boundary violation detection, regression checking, and review file format.","bodyPreview":"## Review Checklist\n\nWhen reviewing an agent''s submitted work, check every item:\n\n### Required Checks\n\n- [ ] **Acceptance criteria met** — Every criterion from the task brief is satisfied\n- [ ] **Files within agent boundary** — Agent only modified files in their domain (per AGENTS.md)\n- [ ] **No boundary violations** — No changes to files owned by other agents\n- [ ] **Build passes** — Project builds without errors (if applicable)\n- [ ] **No regressions** — Existing functionality still works\n- [","body":"## Review Checklist\n\nWhen reviewing an agent''s submitted work, check every item:\n\n### Required Checks\n\n- [ ] **Acceptance criteria met** — Every criterion from the task brief is satisfied\n- [ ] **Files within agent boundary** — Agent only modified files in their domain (per AGENTS.md)\n- [ ] **No boundary violations** — No changes to files owned by other agents\n- [ ] **Build passes** — Project builds without errors (if applicable)\n- [ ] **No regressions** — Existing functionality still works\n- [ ] **Consistent with conventions** — Code follows project style and patterns\n- [ ] **Commit message format** — Uses `[AGENT:x] [ACTION:y] [TASK:z]` header\n- [ ] **Task brief updated** — Task status reflects current state\n\n### Optional Checks (when applicable)\n\n- [ ] **Tests pass** — All existing tests still pass\n- [ ] **New tests added** — New functionality has test coverage\n- [ ] **Types correct** — TypeScript types are accurate, no `any` usage\n- [ ] **Error handling** — Async operations have proper error handling\n- [ ] **Documentation updated** — Relevant docs reflect changes\n\n## Verdict Types\n\n| Verdict | Meaning | Next Action |\n|---------|---------|-------------|\n| **APPROVED** | All required checks pass | Merge to `pre-mortal`, assign next task |\n| **CHANGES REQUESTED** | Minor issues found, fixable | Agent addresses feedback, re-submits |\n| **REJECTED** | Fundamental problems, wrong approach | Task re-scoped or reassigned |\n\n### Decision Criteria\n\n- **APPROVED**: All required checks pass. Minor style issues can be noted but don''t block.\n- **CHANGES REQUESTED**: One or more required checks fail, but the approach is sound. Provide specific feedback on what to fix.\n- **REJECTED**: Approach is fundamentally wrong, boundary violations are severe, or work doesn''t match the task brief at all.\n\n## Boundary Violation Detection\n\n### How to Check\n\n1. **Read the task brief** — Check which files are in scope\n2. **Read the diff** — `git diff HEAD~1` or `git diff <branch>`\n3. **Compare against AGENTS.md** — Verify each modified file is in the agent''s domain\n4. **Check `.ai/boundaries.md`** — For detailed ownership rules\n\n### Common Violations\n\n| Violation | Example | Severity |\n|-----------|---------|----------|\n| Cursor modifies UI components | `src/components/ui/Button.tsx` | High — Lovable''s domain |\n| Lovable modifies hooks with logic | `src/hooks/use-gateway-api.ts` | High — Cursor''s domain |\n| Any agent modifies config | `package.json`, `tsconfig.json` | Medium — Claude Code''s domain |\n| Any agent modifies `.ai/` files | `.ai/tasks/TASK-001.md` | Low — usually Claude Code''s domain |\n\n### Response to Violations\n\n- **High severity**: REJECT — agent must not modify other agents'' files\n- **Medium severity**: CHANGES REQUESTED — remove unauthorized changes\n- **Low severity**: Note in review, approve if changes are minor and correct\n\n## Regression Checking\n\n### What to Check\n\n1. **Build status** — Does the project still build?\n2. **Test suite** — Do existing tests still pass?\n3. **Related features** — Do features that depend on changed code still work?\n4. **UI consistency** — Do visual components still render correctly?\n\n### How to Check\n\n```bash\n# Build check\nnpm run build\n\n# Test check\nnpm run test\n\n# Type check\nnpx tsc --noEmit\n\n# Lint check\nnpm run lint\n```\n\n### Regression Response\n\n- If build breaks: REJECT immediately\n- If tests fail: CHANGES REQUESTED with specific test failures\n- If related features break: CHANGES REQUESTED with reproduction steps\n- If UI inconsistency: CHANGES REQUESTED with screenshots or descriptions\n\n## Review File Format\n\nReviews are written to `.ai/reviews/<task-id>-review.md`.\n\nSee `.ai/templates/review.md` for the complete template.\n\nKey sections:\n- **Checklist** — All items checked/unchecked\n- **Files Reviewed** — Table of files with assessments\n- **Findings** — Numbered list of observations\n- **Feedback** — Specific guidance for the agent\n- **Decision** — Verdict and next action\n\n## Review Commit Format\n\nAfter completing a review, commit with:\n\n```\n[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:approve] [TASK:TASK-XXX] Brief summary\n```\n\nor\n\n```\n[AGENT:kimi] [ACTION:reject] [TASK:TASK-XXX] Brief reason\n\nSee .ai/reviews/TASK-XXX-review.md for details.\n```\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:48:01.114Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing rigorous acceptance criteria validation and boundary checks.","zh":"非常适合需要严格的验收标准验证和边界检查的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが厳格な受け入れ基準の検証と境界チェックを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 엄격한 수용 기준 검증 및 경계 점검을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan una validación rigurosa de criterios de aceptación y comprobaciones de límites.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Révision de Code nécessitant une validation rigoureuse des critères d''acceptation et des vérifications de limites.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine strenge Überprüfung der Akzeptanzkriterien und Grenzprüfungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de revisão de código que precisam de validação rigorosa de critérios de aceitação e verificações de limites.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, требующих строгой проверки критериев приемки и границ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق الصارم لمعايير القبول والفحص الحدي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify acceptance criteria met, ensure files are within agent boundaries, and check for boundary violations, all while validating build passes and preventing regressions, utilizing protocols like AGENTS.md for domain management.","zh":"赋予代理验证接受标准，确保文件在代理边界内，检查边界违规，同时验证构建通过并防止回归，使用诸如AGENTS.md的协议进行域管理。","ja":"エージェントが受け入れ基準を満たしていることを検証し、ファイルがエージェントの境界内にあることを保証し、境界違反をチェックし、ビルドのパスを検証し、回帰を防止するためにAGENTS.mdなどのプロトコルを使用してドメイン管理を実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 수용 기준을 충족하는지 확인하고, 파일이 에이전트 경계 내에 있는지 확인하고, 경계 위반을 확인하며, 빌드 통과 및 회귀 방지를 위해 AGENTS.md와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 도메인 관리를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar que se cumplan los criterios de aceptación, asegurarse de que los archivos estén dentro de los límites del agente y comprobar las violaciones de límites, todo mientras se validan los pasos de compilación y se evitan las regresiones, utilizando protocolos como AGENTS.md para la gestión de dominios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que les critères d''acceptation sont respectés, de s''assurer que les fichiers sont dans les limites de l''agent et de vérifier les violations de limites, le tout en validant les étapes de compilation et en prévenant les régressions, en utilisant des protocoles comme AGENTS.md pour la gestion de domaine.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Erfüllung der Akzeptanzkriterien zu überprüfen, sicherzustellen, dass Dateien innerhalb der Agentengrenzen liegen und Grenzverletzungen zu prüfen, während die Build-Schritte validiert und Regressionsverluste verhindert werden, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie AGENTS.md für die Domänenverwaltung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar se os critérios de aceitação foram atendidos, garantir que os arquivos estejam dentro dos limites do agente e verificar violações de limites, tudo isso enquanto valida a compilação e impede regressões, utilizando protocolos como AGENTS.md para gerenciamento de domínio.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить выполнение критериев приемки, обеспечить, чтобы файлы находились в пределах границ агента, и проверить на нарушения границ, все это при проверке сборки и предотвращении регрессий, используя протоколы, такие как AGENTS.md для управления доменом.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من معايير القبول، وضمان أن يتماشى الملفات مع حدود الوكيل، والتحقق من انتهاكات الحدود، كل ذلك أثناء التحقق من بناء وتحديثات وتجنب الانحدارات، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل AGENTS.md لإدارة النطاق"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating task brief satisfaction","Detecting boundary violations in file modifications","Ensuring build integrity and preventing regressions"],"zh":["验证任务简报满意度","检测文件修改中的边界违规","确保构建完整性并防止回归"],"ja":["タスクブリーフの満足度を検証する","ファイルの変更における境界違反の検出","ビルドの完全性を確保し、回帰を防止する"],"ko":["작업 요약 만족도 확인","파일 수정의 경계 위반 탐지","빌드 무결성 보장 및 회귀 방지"],"es":["Validar la satisfacción del resumen de la tarea","Detectar violaciones de límites en las modificaciones de archivos","Asegurar la integridad de la compilación y prevenir regresiones"],"fr":["Valider la satisfaction du résumé de la tâche","Détecter les violations de limites dans les modifications de fichiers","Assurer l''intégrité de la compilation et prévenir les régressions"],"de":["Die Erfüllung der Aufgabenbeschreibung validieren","Grenzverletzungen in Dateiänderungen erkennen","Die Integrität des Builds sicherstellen und Regressionsverluste verhindern"],"pt":["Validar a satisfação do resumo da tarefa","Detectar violações de limites em modificações de arquivos","Garantir a integridade da compilação e prevenir regressões"],"ru":["Проверить удовлетворение краткого описания задачи","Обнаружить нарушения границ при изменении файлов","Обеспечить целостность сборки и предотвратить регрессии"],"ar":["التحقق من رضا ملخص المهمة","كشف انتهاكات الحدود في تعديلات الملفات","ضمان سلامة البناء وتحديثات وتجنب الانحدارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to task brief and AGENTS.md","Limited to project builds with applicable error checking"],"zh":["需要访问任务简报和AGENTS.md","仅限具有适用错误检查的项目构建"],"ja":["タスクブリーフとAGENTS.mdへのアクセスが必要","エラー検査の対象となるプロジェクトビルドのみ"],"ko":["작업 요약 및 AGENTS.md에 대한 액세스가 필요","적용 가능한 오류 확인을 갖춘 프로젝트 빌드에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al resumen de la tarea y AGENTS.md","Limitado a compilaciones de proyecto con comprobación de errores aplicable"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au résumé de la tâche et AGENTS.md","Limité aux compilations de projet avec vérification d''erreurs applicable"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Aufgabenbeschreibung und AGENTS.md","Begrenzt auf Projektbuilds mit anwendbarer Fehlersuche"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao resumo da tarefa e ao AGENTS.md","Limitado a compilações de projeto com verificação de erros aplicável"],"ru":["Требует доступа к краткому описанию задачи и AGENTS.md","Ограничен сборками проекта с применением проверки ошибок"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملخص المهمة و AGENTS.md","محدود لبناء المشروع مع فحص الأخطاء القابل للتطبيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
