 pour les problèmes de runtime, les avertissements et les échecs async","de":"Fehlerbehebung und Fehlerhandling in Vue 3 für Laufzeitprobleme, Warnungen und asynchrone Fehler","pt":"O Vue 3 oferece recursos de depuração e tratamento de erros para problemas de tempo de execução, avisos, falhas assíncronas e bugs de hidratação","ru":"Vue 3 предоставляет средства отладки и обработки ошибок для проблем runtime, предупреждений, асинхронных сбоев и ошибок гидратации","ar":"Vue 3 يوفر أدوات تصحيح أخطاء وتحليل الأخطاء لمشاكل وقت التشغيل والتحذيرات والفشل المتزامن وأخطاء التهيئة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["运行时问题调试","错误处理和警告","异步失败和水化 Bug 解决","Reactivity 问题追踪","Watchers 异步操作"],"ja":["ランタイムの問題のデバッグ","エラー処理と警告","非同期の失敗とハイドレーション バグの解決","Reactivity の問題の追跡","Watchers の非同期操作"],"ko":["런타임 문제 디버깅","오류 처리 및 경고","비동기 실패 및 수화 버그 해결","Reactivity 문제 추적","Watchers 비동기 작업"],"es":["Depuración de errores en tiempo de ejecución","Manejo de advertencias y fallos asíncronos","Solución de problemas de hidratación","Uso de hooks de depuración de reactividad","Limpieza de operaciones asíncronas en watchers"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs de runtime","Gestion des avertissements et des échecs async","Résolution des problèmes d''hydratation","Utilisation des hooks de débogage de réactivité","Nettoyage des opérations async dans les watchers"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Laufzeitfehlern","Handhabung von Warnungen und asynchronen Fehlern","Lösung von Hydratationsproblemen","Verwendung von Hooks zur Fehlersuche bei Reaktivität","Bereinigung asynchroner Operationen in Watchern"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de tempo de execução","Tratamento de erros assíncronos","Análise de bugs de hidratação","Otimização de desempenho","Melhores práticas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Отладка проблем runtime","Обработка асинхронных ошибок","Анализ ошибок гидратации","Оптимизация производительности","Лучшие практики разработки"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء وقت التشغيل","معالجة الأخطاء المتزامنة","تحليل أخطاء التهيئة","تحسين الأداء","أفضل الممارسات للتطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vue 3 调试","Vue 3 错误处理","Vue 3 运行时问题","Vue 3 异步失败","Vue 3 水化 Bug","Vue 3 Reactivity","Vue 3 Watchers"],"ja":["Vue 3 デバッグ","Vue 3 エラー処理","Vue 3 ランタイムの問題","Vue 3 非同期の失敗","Vue 3 ハイドレーション バグ","Vue 3 Reactivity","Vue 3 Watchers"],"ko":["Vue 3 디버깅","Vue 3 오류 처리","Vue 3 런타임 문제","Vue 3 비동기 실패","Vue 3 수화 버그","Vue 3 Reactivity","Vue 3 Watchers"],"es":["depuración vue 3","errores en tiempo de ejecución","manejo de errores","fallos asíncronos","hidratación","reactividad","watchers","hooks de depuración","desarrollo de aplicaciones vue"],"fr":["débogage vue 3","erreurs de runtime","gestion des erreurs","échecs async","hydratation","réactivité","watchers","hooks de débogage","développement d''applications vue"],"de":["Fehlersuche in Vue 3","Laufzeitfehler","Fehlerbehebung","asynchrone Fehler","Hydratation","Reaktivität","Watcher","Hooks zur Fehlersuche","Entwicklung von Vue-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Depuração Vue 3","Tratamento de erros Vue 3","Desenvolvimento Vue 3","Otimização de desempenho Vue 3","Melhores práticas de desenvolvimento Vue 3","Erros assíncronos Vue 3","Bugs de hidratação Vue 3"],"ru":["Отладка Vue 3","Обработка ошибок Vue 3","Разработка Vue 3","Оптимизация производительности Vue 3","Лучшие практики разработки Vue 3","Асинхронные ошибки Vue 3","Ошибки гидратации Vue 3"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء Vue 3","معالجة الأخطاء Vue 3","تطوير Vue 3","تحسين الأداء Vue 3","أفضل الممارسات للتطوير Vue 3","الأخطاء المتزامنة Vue 3","أخطاء التهيئة Vue 3"]}},"owner":"1zumIQ","repo":"asched_frontend","repoPath":"1zumIQ/asched_frontend","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vue-debug-guides","description":"Vue 3 debugging and error handling for runtime errors, warnings, async failures, and SSR/hydration issues. Use when diagnosing or fixing Vue issues.","bodyPreview":"Vue 3 debugging and error handling for runtime issues, warnings, async failures, and hydration bugs.\nFor development best practices and common gotchas, use `vue-best-practices`.\n\n### Reactivity\n- Tracing unexpected re-renders and state updates → See [reactivity-debugging-hooks](reference/reactivity-debugging-hooks.md)\n\n### Watchers\n- Async operations overwriting with stale data → See [watch-async-cleanup](reference/watch-async-cleanup.md)\n- Creating watchers inside async callbacks → See [watch-a","body":"Vue 3 debugging and error handling for runtime issues, warnings, async failures, and hydration bugs.\nFor development best practices and common gotchas, use `vue-best-practices`.\n\n### Reactivity\n- Tracing unexpected re-renders and state updates → See [reactivity-debugging-hooks](reference/reactivity-debugging-hooks.md)\n\n### Watchers\n- Async operations overwriting with stale data → See [watch-async-cleanup](reference/watch-async-cleanup.md)\n- Creating watchers inside async callbacks → See [watch-async-creation-memory-leak](reference/watch-async-creation-memory-leak.md)\n\n### Components\n- Child component throws \"component not found\" error → See [local-components-not-in-descendants](reference/local-components-not-in-descendants.md)\n- Click listener doesn''t fire on custom component → See [click-events-on-components](reference/click-events-on-components.md)\n- Parent can''t access child ref data in script setup → See [component-ref-requires-defineexpose](reference/component-ref-requires-defineexpose.md)\n- HTML template parsing breaks Vue component syntax → See [in-dom-template-parsing-caveats](reference/in-dom-template-parsing-caveats.md)\n- Wrong component renders due to naming collisions → See [component-naming-conflicts](reference/component-naming-conflicts.md)\n- Parent styles don''t apply to multi-root component → See [multi-root-component-class-attrs](reference/multi-root-component-class-attrs.md)\n\n### Props & Emits\n- Variables referenced in defineProps cause errors → See [prop-defineprops-scope-limitation](reference/prop-defineprops-scope-limitation.md)\n- Component emits undeclared event causing warnings → See [declare-emits-for-documentation](reference/declare-emits-for-documentation.md)\n- defineEmits used inside function or conditional → See [defineEmits-must-be-top-level](reference/defineEmits-must-be-top-level.md)\n- defineEmits has both type and runtime arguments → See [defineEmits-no-runtime-and-type-mixed](reference/defineEmits-no-runtime-and-type-mixed.md)\n- Native event listeners not responding to clicks → See [native-event-collision-with-emits](reference/native-event-collision-with-emits.md)\n- Component event fires twice when clicking → See [undeclared-emits-double-firing](reference/undeclared-emits-double-firing.md)\n\n### Templates\n- Getting template compilation errors with statements → See [template-expressions-restrictions](reference/template-expressions-restrictions.md)\n- \"Cannot read property of undefined\" runtime errors → See [v-if-null-check-order](reference/v-if-null-check-order.md)\n- Dynamic directive arguments not working properly → See [dynamic-argument-constraints](reference/dynamic-argument-constraints.md)\n- v-else elements rendering unconditionally always → See [v-else-must-follow-v-if](reference/v-else-must-follow-v-if.md)\n- Child components in loops showing undefined data → See [v-for-component-props](reference/v-for-component-props.md)\n- Array order changing after sorting or reversing → See [v-for-computed-reverse-sort](reference/v-for-computed-reverse-sort.md)\n- List items disappearing or swapping state unexpectedly → See [v-for-key-attribute](reference/v-for-key-attribute.md)\n- Getting off-by-one errors with range iteration → See [v-for-range-starts-at-one](reference/v-for-range-starts-at-one.md)\n- v-show or v-else not working on template elements → See [v-show-template-limitation](reference/v-show-template-limitation.md)\n\n### Template Refs\n- Ref becomes null when element is conditionally hidden → See [template-ref-null-with-v-if](reference/template-ref-null-with-v-if.md)\n- Ref array indices don''t match data array in loops → See [template-ref-v-for-order](reference/template-ref-v-for-order.md)\n- Refactoring template ref names breaks silently in code → See [use-template-ref-vue35](reference/use-template-ref-vue35.md)\n\n### Forms & v-model\n- Initial form values not showing when using v-model → See [v-model-ignores-html-attributes](reference/v-model-ignores-html-attributes.md)\n- Textarea content changes not updating the ref → See [textarea-no-interpolation](reference/textarea-no-interpolation.md)\n- iOS users cannot select dropdown first option → See [select-initial-value-ios-bug](reference/select-initial-value-ios-bug.md)\n- Parent and child components have different values → See [define-model-default-value-sync](reference/define-model-default-value-sync.md)\n- Object property changes not syncing to parent → See [definemodel-object-mutation-no-emit](reference/definemodel-object-mutation-no-emit.md)\n- Real-time search/validation broken for Chinese/Japanese input → See [v-model-ime-composition](reference/v-model-ime-composition.md)\n- Number input returns empty string instead of zero → See [v-model-number-modifier-behavior](reference/v-model-number-modifier-behavior.md)\n- Custom checkbox values not submitted in forms → See [checkbox-true-false-value-form-submission](reference/checkbox-true-false-value-form-submission.md)\n\n### Events & Modifiers\n- Chaining multiple event modifiers produces unexpected results → See [event-modifier-order-matters](reference/event-modifier-order-matters.md)\n- Keyboard shortcuts don''t fire with system modifier keys → See [keyup-modifier-timing](reference/keyup-modifier-timing.md)\n\n### Lifecycle\n- Memory leaks from unremoved event listeners → See [cleanup-side-effects](reference/cleanup-side-effects.md)\n- DOM access fails before component mounts → See [lifecycle-dom-access-timing](reference/lifecycle-dom-access-timing.md)\n- DOM reads return stale values after state changes → See [dom-update-timing-nexttick](reference/dom-update-timing-nexttick.md)\n- SSR rendering differs from client hydration → See [lifecycle-ssr-awareness](reference/lifecycle-ssr-awareness.md)\n\n### Slots\n- Wrapper components breaking child slot functionality → See [slot-forwarding-to-child-components](reference/slot-forwarding-to-child-components.md)\n\n### Provide/Inject\n- Calling provide after async operations fails silently → See [provide-inject-synchronous-setup](reference/provide-inject-synchronous-setup.md)\n- Tracing where provided values come from → See [provide-inject-debugging-challenges](reference/provide-inject-debugging-challenges.md)\n- Injected values not updating when provider changes → See [provide-inject-reactivity-not-automatic](reference/provide-inject-reactivity-not-automatic.md)\n- Multiple components share same default object → See [provide-inject-default-value-factory](reference/provide-inject-default-value-factory.md)\n\n### Attrs\n- Both internal and fallthrough event handlers execute → See [attrs-event-listener-merging](reference/attrs-event-listener-merging.md)\n- Explicit attributes overwritten by fallthrough values → See [fallthrough-attrs-overwrite-vue3](reference/fallthrough-attrs-overwrite-vue3.md)\n- Attributes applying to wrong element in wrappers → See [inheritattrs-false-for-wrapper-components](reference/inheritattrs-false-for-wrapper-components.md)\n\n### Composables\n- Composable called outside setup context or asynchronously → See [composable-call-location-restrictions](reference/composable-call-location-restrictions.md)\n- Composable reactive dependency not updating when input changes → See [composable-tovalue-inside-watcheffect](reference/composable-tovalue-inside-watcheffect.md)\n\n### Composition API\n- Lifecycle hooks failing silently after async operations → See [composition-api-script-setup-async-context](reference/composition-api-script-setup-async-context.md)\n- Parent component refs unable to access exposed properties → See [define-expose-before-await](reference/define-expose-before-await.md)\n\n### Async Components\n- Network failures or timeouts loading components → See [async-component-error-handling](reference/async-component-error-handling.md)\n- Template refs undefined after component reactivation → See [async-component-keepalive-ref-issue](reference/async-component-keepalive-ref-issue.md)\n\n### Teleport\n- Teleport target element not found in DOM → See [teleport-target-must-exist](reference/teleport-target-must-exist.md)\n- Teleported content breaks SSR hydration → See [teleport-ssr-hydration](reference/teleport-ssr-hydration.md)\n\n### Suspense\n- Need to handle async errors from Suspense components → See [suspense-no-builtin-error-handling](reference/suspense-no-builtin-error-handling.md)\n- Using Suspense with server-side rendering → See [suspense-ssr-hydration-issues](reference/suspense-ssr-hydration-issues.md)\n\n### SSR\n- HTML differs between server and client renders → See [ssr-hydration-mismatch-causes](reference/ssr-hydration-mismatch-causes.md)\n\n### SFC (Single File Components)\n- Trying to use named exports from component script blocks → See [sfc-named-exports-forbidden](reference/sfc-named-exports-forbidden.md)\n- Variables not updating in template after changes → See [sfc-script-setup-reactivity](reference/sfc-script-setup-reactivity.md)\n\n### Plugins\n- Debugging why global properties cause naming conflicts → See [plugin-global-properties-sparingly](reference/plugin-global-properties-sparingly.md)\n- Plugin not working or inject returns undefined → See [plugin-install-before-mount](reference/plugin-install-before-mount.md)\n\n### App Configuration\n- App configuration methods not working after mount call → See [configure-app-before-mount](reference/configure-app-before-mount.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:48:05.614Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Vue 3 debugging and error handling capabilities for runtime issues, warnings, async failures, and hydration bugs.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Vue 3调试和错误处理功能的前端代理，用于解决运行时问题、警告、异步失败和水化错误。","ja":"Vue 3の高度なデバッグとエラーハンドリング機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。ランタイムの問題、警告、非同期の失敗、水和バグに対処します。","ko":"고급 Vue 3 디버깅 및 오류 처리 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 런타임 문제, 경고, 비동기 실패 및 수화 버그를 처리합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de depuración y manejo de errores de Vue 3 para problemas de tiempo de ejecución, advertencias, fallos asíncronos y errores de hidratación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de fonctionnalités avancées de débogage et de gestion d''erreurs Vue 3 pour les problèmes d''exécution, les avertissements, les défaillances asynchrones et les bogues d''hydratation.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Vue 3-Debugging- und Fehlerbehandlungsfunktionen für Laufzeitprobleme, Warnungen, asynchrone Fehler und Hydratationsfehler benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de depuração e tratamento de erros do Vue 3 para problemas de tempo de execução, avisos, falhas assíncronas e bugs de hidratação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности отладки и обработки ошибок Vue 3 для проблем времени выполнения, предупреждений, асинхронных сбоев и ошибок гидратации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى возможات متقدمة لتصحيح الأخطاء والمعالجة الفنية لVue 3 لمشاكل وقت التشغيل والتحذيرات والفشل غير المتزامن وأخطاء الري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to debug reactivity issues, handle async operations, and resolve watcher-related problems using Vue 3''s reactivity-debugging-hooks and watch-async-cleanup techniques, ensuring robust and efficient application development.","zh":"赋予代理调试响应性问题、处理异步操作和使用Vue 3的响应性调试钩子和监视异步清理技术解决监视相关问题的能力，确保强大高效的应用开发。","ja":"Vue 3のリアクティブデバッグフックとウォッチャーの非同期クリーンアップテクニックを使用して、リアクティビティの問題をデバッグし、非同期操作を処理し、ウォッチャー関連の問題を解決するエージェントの能力を提供します。強力で効率的なアプリケーション開発を保証します。","ko":"Vue 3의 반응성 디버깅 후크와 워처 비동기 정리 기술을 사용하여 반응성 문제를 디버깅하고 비동기 작업을 처리하며 워처 관련 문제를 해결할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다. 강력하고 효율적인 애플리케이션 개발을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a depurar problemas de reactividad, manejar operaciones asíncronas y resolver problemas relacionados con los watchers utilizando los hooks de depuración de reactividad de Vue 3 y las técnicas de limpieza asíncrona de watchers, garantizando un desarrollo de aplicaciones robusto y eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déboguer les problèmes de réactivité, de gérer les opérations asynchrones et de résoudre les problèmes liés aux watchers en utilisant les hooks de débogage de réactivité de Vue 3 et les techniques de nettoyage asynchrone des watchers, garantissant un développement d''applications robuste et efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Reaktivitätsprobleme zu debuggen, asynchrone Operationen zu handhaben und Watcher-bezogene Probleme mithilfe der Reaktivitäts-Debugging-Hooks von Vue 3 und der Watch-Async-Cleanup-Techniken zu lösen, um so einen robusten und effizienten Anwendungsentwicklung zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a depurar problemas de reatividade, lidar com operações assíncronas e resolver problemas relacionados a watchers usando hooks de depuração de reatividade do Vue 3 e técnicas de limpeza assíncrona de watchers, garantindo o desenvolvimento de aplicações robustas e eficientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отлаживать проблемы реактивности, обрабатывать асинхронные операции и решать проблемы, связанные с watchers, используя отладочные крючки реактивности Vue 3 и техники асинхронной очистки watchers, обеспечивая надежное и эффективное развитие приложений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصحيح أخطاء التفاعل والمعالجة الفنية للعمليات غير المتزامنة وحل مشاكل متعلقة بالمراقبين باستخدام مشابك تصحيح الأخطاء التفاعلية لVue 3 وتقنيات تنظيف المراقبين غير المتزامن، مما يضمن تطوير تطبيقات قوية وفعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging unexpected re-renders and state updates in Vue 3 applications","Handling async operations overwriting with stale data in watchers","Creating and managing watchers inside async callbacks for optimal performance"],"zh":["在Vue 3应用程序中调试意外的重新渲染和状态更新","在监视器中处理异步操作覆盖过时数据","在异步回调中创建和管理监视器以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["Vue 3アプリケーションの予期せぬ再描画と状態更新をデバッグする","ウォッチャー内の非同期操作が古いデータで上書きされるのを処理する","非同期コールバック内でウォッチャーを作成および管理して、最適なパフォーマンスを実現する"],"ko":["Vue 3 애플리케이션의 예상치 못한 다시 그리기 및 상태 업데이트 디버깅","ウォ처 내 비동기 작업이 구식 데이터로 덮어써지는 것을 처리","비동기 콜백 내에서 워처를 생성 및 관리하여 최적의 성능을 달성"],"es":["Depuración de renderizaciones y actualizaciones de estado inesperadas en aplicaciones Vue 3","Manejo de operaciones asíncronas que sobrescriben con datos obsoletos en los watchers","Creación y gestión de watchers dentro de las llamadas asíncronas para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Débogage des rendus et des mises à jour d''état inattendus dans les applications Vue 3","Gestion des opérations asynchrones qui écrasent les données obsolètes dans les watchers","Création et gestion de watchers à l''intérieur des appels asynchrones pour un rendement optimal"],"de":["Debugging unerwarteter Neurenderings und Statusaktualisierungen in Vue 3-Anwendungen","Handhabung asynchroner Operationen, die mit veralteten Daten in Watchern überschreiben","Erstellen und Verwalten von Watchern innerhalb asynchroner Callbacks für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Depuração de re-renderizações e atualizações de estado inesperadas em aplicações Vue 3","Manipulação de operações assíncronas que sobrescrevem dados obsoletos em watchers","Criação e gerenciamento de watchers dentro de callbacks assíncronos para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Отладка непредвиденных повторных рендеров и обновлений состояния в приложениях Vue 3","Обработка асинхронных операций, перезаписывающих устаревшие данные в watchers","Создание и управление watchers внутри асинхронных callback-функций для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء إعادة التصيير والتحديثات غير المتوقعة للحالة في تطبيقات Vue 3","معالجة العمليات غير المتزامنة التي تكتب بيانات قديمة في المراقبين","إنشاء وإدارة المراقبين داخل دوال الإعادة غير المتزامنة للحصول على أداء مثالي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Vue 3 and its ecosystem","Focused on Vue 3, not compatible with older Vue versions"],"zh":["需要Vue 3及其生态系统的知识","专注于Vue 3，不兼容旧版本的Vue"],"ja":["Vue 3とそのエコシステムの知識が必要","Vue 3に焦点を当てているため、古いバージョンのVueと互換性がない"],"ko":["Vue 3 및 그 생태계 지식이 필요","Vue 3에 초점을 맞추고 있으므로 이전 버전의 Vue와 호환되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Vue 3 y su ecosistema","Se centra en Vue 3, no es compatible con versiones anteriores de Vue"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de Vue 3 et de son écosystème","Se concentre sur Vue 3, n''est pas compatible avec les versions antérieures de Vue"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Vue 3 und seinem Ökosystem","Konzentriert sich auf Vue 3, nicht kompatibel mit älteren Vue-Versionen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento do Vue 3 e seu ecossistema","Focado no Vue 3, não compatível com versões anteriores do Vue"],"ru":["Требует знания Vue 3 и его экосистемы","Ориентирован на Vue 3, не совместим с более ранними версиями Vue"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Vue 3 وبيئته","موجه نحو Vue 3، غير متوافق مع الإصدارات السابقة من Vue"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
