nit des utilitaires et des connaissances pour créer des GIF animés optimisés pour la plateforme.","de":"Der Slack GIF Ersteller ist ein Toolkit, das Utilities und Know-how für die Erstellung von animierten GIFs, optimiert für die Plattform, bereitstellt.","pt":"O slack-gif-creator é uma ferramenta que fornece utilitários e conhecimentos para criar GIFs animados otimizados para o Slack.","ru":"Slack-gif-creator - это набор инструментов, который предоставляет утилиты и знания для создания анимированных GIF-файлов, оптимизированных для Slack.","ar":"slack-gif-creator هو أداة توفر أدوات ومعارف لإنشاء ملفات GIF متحركة مُحسنة لاسلاك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["128x128","480x480","10-30FPS","48-128","3"],"ja":["128x128","480x480","10-30FPS","48-128","3"],"ko":["128x128","480x480","10-30FPS","48-128","3"],"es":["Dimensiones personalizables","Parámetros de FPS y colores ajustables","Duración configurable","Compatibilidad con la biblioteca PIL","Flujo de trabajo simplificado con GIFBuilder"],"fr":["Dimensions personnalisables","Paramètres de FPS et de couleurs ajustables","Durée configurable","Compatibilité avec la bibliothèque PIL","Flux de travail simplifié avec GIFBuilder"],"de":["Anpassbare Dimensionen","Einstellbare FPS- und Farbparameter","Konfigurierbare Dauer","Kompatibilität mit der PIL-Bibliothek","Vereinfachter Workflow mit GIFBuilder"],"pt":["Criação de GIFs animados","Otimização para o Slack","Dimensões personalizáveis","Parâmetros de FPS e cores ajustáveis","Duração de GIFs configurável"],"ru":["Создание анимированных GIF-файлов","Оптимизация для Slack","Настройка размеров","Настройка параметров FPS и цвета","Настройка продолжительности GIF-файлов"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات GIF متحركة","تحسين لاسلاك","أحجام مخصصة","معايير FPS و ألوان قابلة للتعديل","مدة ملفات GIF قابلة للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Slack GIF","GIF","Slack","Python","PIL","GIF"],"ja":["SlackGIF","GIF","Slack","Python","PIL","GIF"],"ko":["Slack GIF","GIF","Slack","Python","PIL","GIF"],"es":["GIF para Slack","Creador de GIF","GIF animado","Desarrollo de Slack","Herramientas de desarrollo","GIF personalizado","Optimización de GIF","Dimensiones de GIF","Parámetros de GIF"],"fr":["GIF pour Slack","Créateur de GIF","GIF animé","Développement de Slack","Outils de développement","GIF personnalisé","Optimisation de GIF","Dimensions de GIF","Paramètres de GIF"],"de":["GIF für Slack","GIF Ersteller","Animiertes GIF","Slack-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Benutzerdefiniertes GIF","GIF-Optimierung","GIF-Dimensionen","GIF-Parameter"],"pt":["slack-gif-creator","GIFs para Slack","criação de GIFs","otimização de GIFs","desenvolvimento de Slack","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["slack-gif-creator","GIF-файлы для Slack","создание GIF-файлов","оптимизация GIF-файлов","разработка для Slack","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["slack-gif-creator","ملفات GIF لاسلاك","إنشاء ملفات GIF","تحسين ملفات GIF","تطوير لاسلاك","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Mona-kecil","repo":"kecildotdev","repoPath":"Mona-kecil/kecildotdev","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slack-gif-creator","description":"Knowledge and utilities for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack. Provides constraints, validation tools, and animation concepts. Use when users request animated GIFs for Slack like make me a GIF of X doing Y for Slack.","bodyPreview":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GI","body":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\n\n# 2. Generate frames\nfor i in range(12):\n    frame = Image.new(''RGB'', (128, 128), (240, 248, 255))\n    draw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n    # Draw your animation using PIL primitives\n    # (circles, polygons, lines, etc.)\n\n    builder.add_frame(frame)\n\n# 3. Save with optimization\nbuilder.save(''output.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True)\n```\n\n## Drawing Graphics\n\n### Working with User-Uploaded Images\nIf a user uploads an image, consider whether they want to:\n- **Use it directly** (e.g., \"animate this\", \"split this into frames\")\n- **Use it as inspiration** (e.g., \"make something like this\")\n\nLoad and work with images using PIL:\n```python\nfrom PIL import Image\n\nuploaded = Image.open(''file.png'')\n# Use directly, or just as reference for colors/style\n```\n\n### Drawing from Scratch\nWhen drawing graphics from scratch, use PIL ImageDraw primitives:\n\n```python\nfrom PIL import ImageDraw\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n# Circles/ovals\ndraw.ellipse([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Stars, triangles, any polygon\npoints = [(x1, y1), (x2, y2), (x3, y3), ...]\ndraw.polygon(points, fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Lines\ndraw.line([(x1, y1), (x2, y2)], fill=(r, g, b), width=5)\n\n# Rectangles\ndraw.rectangle([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n```\n\n**Don''t use:** Emoji fonts (unreliable across platforms) or assume pre-packaged graphics exist in this skill.\n\n### Making Graphics Look Good\n\nGraphics should look polished and creative, not basic. Here''s how:\n\n**Use thicker lines** - Always set `width=2` or higher for outlines and lines. Thin lines (width=1) look choppy and amateurish.\n\n**Add visual depth**:\n- Use gradients for backgrounds (`create_gradient_background`)\n- Layer multiple shapes for complexity (e.g., a star with a smaller star inside)\n\n**Make shapes more interesting**:\n- Don''t just draw a plain circle - add highlights, rings, or patterns\n- Stars can have glows (draw larger, semi-transparent versions behind)\n- Combine multiple shapes (stars + sparkles, circles + rings)\n\n**Pay attention to colors**:\n- Use vibrant, complementary colors\n- Add contrast (dark outlines on light shapes, light outlines on dark shapes)\n- Consider the overall composition\n\n**For complex shapes** (hearts, snowflakes, etc.):\n- Use combinations of polygons and ellipses\n- Calculate points carefully for symmetry\n- Add details (a heart can have a highlight curve, snowflakes have intricate branches)\n\nBe creative and detailed! A good Slack GIF should look polished, not like placeholder graphics.\n\n## Available Utilities\n\n### GIFBuilder (`core.gif_builder`)\nAssembles frames and optimizes for Slack:\n```python\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\nbuilder.add_frame(frame)  # Add PIL Image\nbuilder.add_frames(frames)  # Add list of frames\nbuilder.save(''out.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True, remove_duplicates=True)\n```\n\n### Validators (`core.validators`)\nCheck if GIF meets Slack requirements:\n```python\nfrom core.validators import validate_gif, is_slack_ready\n\n# Detailed validation\npasses, info = validate_gif(''my.gif'', is_emoji=True, verbose=True)\n\n# Quick check\nif is_slack_ready(''my.gif''):\n    print(\"Ready!\")\n```\n\n### Easing Functions (`core.easing`)\nSmooth motion instead of linear:\n```python\nfrom core.easing import interpolate\n\n# Progress from 0.0 to 1.0\nt = i / (num_frames - 1)\n\n# Apply easing\ny = interpolate(start=0, end=400, t=t, easing=''ease_out'')\n\n# Available: linear, ease_in, ease_out, ease_in_out,\n#           bounce_out, elastic_out, back_out\n```\n\n### Frame Helpers (`core.frame_composer`)\nConvenience functions for common needs:\n```python\nfrom core.frame_composer import (\n    create_blank_frame,         # Solid color background\n    create_gradient_background,  # Vertical gradient\n    draw_circle,                # Helper for circles\n    draw_text,                  # Simple text rendering\n    draw_star                   # 5-pointed star\n)\n```\n\n## Animation Concepts\n\n### Shake/Vibrate\nOffset object position with oscillation:\n- Use `math.sin()` or `math.cos()` with frame index\n- Add small random variations for natural feel\n- Apply to x and/or y position\n\n### Pulse/Heartbeat\nScale object size rhythmically:\n- Use `math.sin(t * frequency * 2 * math.pi)` for smooth pulse\n- For heartbeat: two quick pulses then pause (adjust sine wave)\n- Scale between 0.8 and 1.2 of base size\n\n### Bounce\nObject falls and bounces:\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''bounce_out''` for landing\n- Use `easing=''ease_in''` for falling (accelerating)\n- Apply gravity by increasing y velocity each frame\n\n### Spin/Rotate\nRotate object around center:\n- PIL: `image.rotate(angle, resample=Image.BICUBIC)`\n- For wobble: use sine wave for angle instead of linear\n\n### Fade In/Out\nGradually appear or disappear:\n- Create RGBA image, adjust alpha channel\n- Or use `Image.blend(image1, image2, alpha)`\n- Fade in: alpha from 0 to 1\n- Fade out: alpha from 1 to 0\n\n### Slide\nMove object from off-screen to position:\n- Start position: outside frame bounds\n- End position: target location\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''ease_out''` for smooth stop\n- For overshoot: use `easing=''back_out''`\n\n### Zoom\nScale and position for zoom effect:\n- Zoom in: scale from 0.1 to 2.0, crop center\n- Zoom out: scale from 2.0 to 1.0\n- Can add motion blur for drama (PIL filter)\n\n### Explode/Particle Burst\nCreate particles radiating outward:\n- Generate particles with random angles and velocities\n- Update each particle: `x += vx`, `y += vy`\n- Add gravity: `vy += gravity_constant`\n- Fade out particles over time (reduce alpha)\n\n## Optimization Strategies\n\nOnly when asked to make the file size smaller, implement a few of the following methods:\n\n1. **Fewer frames** - Lower FPS (10 instead of 20) or shorter duration\n2. **Fewer colors** - `num_colors=48` instead of 128\n3. **Smaller dimensions** - 128x128 instead of 480x480\n4. **Remove duplicates** - `remove_duplicates=True` in save()\n5. **Emoji mode** - `optimize_for_emoji=True` auto-optimizes\n\n```python\n# Maximum optimization for emoji\nbuilder.save(\n    ''emoji.gif'',\n    num_colors=48,\n    optimize_for_emoji=True,\n    remove_duplicates=True\n)\n```\n\n## Philosophy\n\nThis skill provides:\n- **Knowledge**: Slack''s requirements and animation concepts\n- **Utilities**: GIFBuilder, validators, easing functions\n- **Flexibility**: Create the animation logic using PIL primitives\n\nIt does NOT provide:\n- Rigid animation templates or pre-made functions\n- Emoji font rendering (unreliable across platforms)\n- A library of pre-packaged graphics built into the skill\n\n**Note on user uploads**: This skill doesn''t include pre-built graphics, but if a user uploads an image, use PIL to load and work with it - interpret based on their request whether they want it used directly or just as inspiration.\n\nBe creative! Combine concepts (bouncing + rotating, pulsing + sliding, etc.) and use PIL''s full capabilities.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```bash\npip install pillow imageio numpy\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:48:39.483Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing to create optimized animated GIFs for Slack","zh":"非常适合需要创建优化的动画GIF以用于Slack的视觉内容代理","ja":"Slackに最適化されたアニメーションGIFを作成する必要があるビジュアルコンテンツエージェントに最適","ko":"슬랙에서 최적화된 애니메이션 GIF를 생성해야 하는 시각적 콘텐츠 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Contenido Visual que necesitan crear GIFs animados optimizados para Slack","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contenu visuel ayant besoin de créer des GIFs animés optimisés pour Slack","de":"Perfekt für Visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die optimierte animierte GIFs für Slack erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que precisam criar GIFs animados otimizados para o Slack","ru":"Идеально для Визуальных Контент Агентов, которым необходимо создавать оптимизированные анимированные GIF для Slack","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحتوى المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء صور GIF المتحركة المُحسّنة لل슬랙"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate animated GIFs with optimized dimensions, FPS, and colors using Python and the PIL library, ensuring seamless integration with Slack''s messaging platform","zh":"赋予代理生成具有优化尺寸、FPS和颜色的动画GIF的能力，使用Python和PIL库，确保与Slack消息平台的无缝集成","ja":"PythonとPILライブラリを使用して、最適化された寸法、FPS、色を持つアニメーションGIFを生成するエージェントを可能にし、Slackのメッセージングプラットフォームとの無縫な統合を確保する","ko":"Python과 PIL 라이브러리를 사용하여 최적화된 크기, FPS, 색상을 가진 애니메이션 GIF를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 슬랙 메시지 플랫폼과의 무결점 통합을 보장한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar GIFs animados con dimensiones, FPS y colores optimizados utilizando Python y la biblioteca PIL, garantizando una integración sin problemas con la plataforma de mensajería de Slack","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des GIFs animés avec des dimensions, des FPS et des couleurs optimisés en utilisant Python et la bibliothèque PIL, assurant une intégration sans problème avec la plateforme de messagerie de Slack","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, animierte GIFs mit optimierten Dimensionen, FPS und Farben zu erstellen, indem sie Python und die PIL-Bibliothek verwenden, und stellt so eine nahtlose Integration mit der Slack-Messaging-Plattform sicher","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar GIFs animados com dimensões, FPS e cores otimizados usando Python e a biblioteca PIL, garantindo integração perfeita com a plataforma de mensagens do Slack","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать анимированные GIF с оптимизированными размерами, FPS и цветами, используя Python и библиотеку PIL, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с платформой обмена сообщениями Slack","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء صور GIF متحركة بأبعاد وFPS وألوان مُحسّنة باستخدام Python ومكتبة PIL، مما đảmر التكامل السلس مع منصة مراسلة السلاك"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating animated emoji GIFs with recommended 128x128 dimensions","Generating message GIFs with optimized 480x480 dimensions and 10-30 FPS","Optimizing GIF file size by adjusting colors and duration"],"zh":["创建具有推荐的128x128尺寸的动画表情GIF","生成具有优化的480x480尺寸和10-30 FPS的消息GIF","通过调整颜色和持续时间来优化GIF文件大小"],"ja":["推奨される128x128の寸法を持つアニメーション絵文字GIFを作成する","最適化された480x480の寸法と10-30 FPSのメッセージGIFを生成する","色と時間を調整してGIFファイルサイズを最適化する"],"ko":["권장되는 128x128 크기의 애니메이션 이모티콘 GIF를 생성한다","최적화된 480x480 크기와 10-30 FPS의 메시지 GIF를 생성한다","색상과 지속 시간을 조정하여 GIF 파일 크기를 최적화한다"],"es":["Creación de GIFs de emoji animados con dimensiones recomendadas de 128x128","Generación de GIFs de mensaje con dimensiones optimizadas de 480x480 y 10-30 FPS","Optimización del tamaño del archivo GIF ajustando colores y duración"],"fr":["Création de GIFs d''emoji animés avec des dimensions recommandées de 128x128","Génération de GIFs de message avec des dimensions optimisées de 480x480 et 10-30 FPS","Optimisation de la taille du fichier GIF en ajustant les couleurs et la durée"],"de":["Erstellung von animierten Emoji-GIFs mit empfohlenen Dimensionen von 128x128","Generierung von Nachrichten-GIFs mit optimierten Dimensionen von 480x480 und 10-30 FPS","Optimierung der GIF-Dateigröße durch Anpassen von Farben und Dauer"],"pt":["Criação de GIFs de emoji animados com dimensões recomendadas de 128x128","Geração de GIFs de mensagens com dimensões otimizadas de 480x480 e 10-30 FPS","Otimização do tamanho do arquivo GIF ajustando cores e duração"],"ru":["Создание анимированных эмодзи-GIF с рекомендуемыми размерами 128x128","Генерация GIF-сообщений с оптимизированными размерами 480x480 и 10-30 FPS","Оптимизация размера файла GIF, регулируя цвета и продолжительность"],"ar":["إنشاء صور GIF متحركة للرموز التعبيرية بأبعاد مقترحة 128x128","إنشاء صور GIF للرسائل بأبعاد مُحسّنة 480x480 و 10-30 إطار في الثانية","تحسين حجم ملف GIF عن طريق تعديل الألوان والمدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python and PIL library","GIF duration limited to under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs","Specific dimension and parameter requirements for Slack compatibility"],"zh":["需要Python和PIL库","GIF持续时间限制在表情GIF的3秒以内","特定的尺寸和参数要求以适应Slack兼容性"],"ja":["PythonとPILライブラリが必要","絵文字GIFのGIFの長さは3秒以下に制限される","Slackと互換性を持つために特定の寸法とパラメーターの要件"],"ko":["Python과 PIL 라이브러리가 필요하다","이모티콘 GIF의 GIF 길이는 3초 이하로 제한된다","슬랙과 호환되는 특정 크기와 매개변수 요구 사항"],"es":["Requiere Python y la biblioteca PIL","La duración del GIF está limitada a menos de 3 segundos para GIFs de emoji","Requisitos de dimensiones y parámetros específicos para la compatibilidad con Slack"],"fr":["Nécessite Python et la bibliothèque PIL","La durée du GIF est limitée à moins de 3 secondes pour les GIFs d''emoji","Exigences de dimensions et de paramètres spécifiques pour la compatibilité avec Slack"],"de":["Benötigt Python und die PIL-Bibliothek","Die Dauer des GIFs ist auf unter 3 Sekunden für Emoji-GIFs begrenzt","Spezifische Dimension- und Parameteranforderungen für die Slack-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Requer Python e biblioteca PIL","Duração do GIF limitada a menos de 3 segundos para GIFs de emoji","Requisitos de dimensão e parâmetro específicos para compatibilidade com o Slack"],"ru":["Требует Python и библиотеку PIL","Продолжительность GIF ограничена менее 3 секундами для эмодзи-GIF","Конкретные требования к размеру и параметрам для совместимости со Slack"],"ar":["يتطلب Python ومكتبة PIL","مدة الصورة GIF محدودة بأقل من 3 ثوانٍ لصور GIF للرموز التعبيرية","متطلبات للحجم والمعاملات المحددة للتوافق مع السلاك"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('allthingslinux/atl.services/grafana-dashboard', 'community', 'allthingslinux', 'atl.services', 'allthingslinux/atl.services', 'grafana-dashboard', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z', '2026-02-18T09:48:52.083Z', NULL, '{"id":"allthingslinux/atl.services/grafana-dashboard","name":"grafana-dashboard","description":{"zh":"Grafana, JSON, ","ja":"GrafanaJSON","ko":"Grafana, JSON, ","es":"Diseñe e implemente paneles de Grafana integrales con varias visualizaciones y capacidades de perforación para la monitorización operativa.","fr":"Concevez et mettez en œuvre des tableaux de bord Grafana complets avec plusieurs visualisations et des capacités de forage pour la surveillance opérationnelle.","de":"Entwerfen und implementieren Sie umfassende Grafana-Dashboards mit mehreren Visualisierungen und Drill-Down-Funktionen für die Betriebsüberwachung.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Grafana ","ja":"Grafana","ko":"Grafana ","es":"Crear paneles de Grafana personalizados","fr":"Créer des tableaux de bord Grafana personnalisés","de":"Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte Grafana-Dashboards","en":"grafana-dashboard"},"description":{"zh":"Grafana, JSON, ","ja":"GrafanaJSON","ko":"Grafana, JSON, ","es":"Diseñe e implemente paneles de Grafana integrales con varias visualizaciones y capacidades de perforación para la monitorización operativa.","fr":"Concevez et mettez en œuvre des tableaux de bord Grafana complets avec plusieurs visualisations et des capacités de forage pour la surveillance opérationnelle.","de":"Entwerfen und implementieren Sie umfassende Grafana-Dashboards mit mehreren Visualisierungen und Drill-Down-Funktionen für die Betriebsüberwachung.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Grafana","JSON","","",""],"ja":["Grafana","JSON","","",""],"ko":["Grafana","JSON","","",""],"es":["Diseño de paneles personalizados","Múltiples tipos de visualización","Capacidades de perforación","Variables y parámetros configurables","Compatibilidad con datos de series temporales"],"fr":["Conception de tableaux de bord personnalisés","Plusieurs types de visualisation","Capacités de forage","Variables et paramètres configurables","Compatibilité avec les données de séries chronologiques"],"de":["Benutzerdefiniertes Dashboard-Design","Mehrere Visualisierungstypen","Drill-Down-Funktionen","Konfigurierbare Variablen und Parameter","Unterstützung für Zeitreihendaten"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Grafana","Grafana","JSON","","Grafana","Grafana"],"ja":["Grafana","Grafana","JSON","","Grafana","Grafana"],"ko":["Grafana","Grafana","JSON","","Grafana","Grafana"],"es":["Grafana","paneles de monitorización","visualización de datos","desarrollo de software","dashboards personalizados","series temporales","monitoreo operativo"],"fr":["Grafana","tableaux de bord de surveillance","visualisation de données","développement de logiciels","tableaux de bord personnalisés","séries chronologiques","surveillance opérationnelle"],"de":["Grafana","Überwachungs-Dashboards","Datenvisualisierung","Software-Entwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Dashboards","Zeitreihen","Betriebsüberwachung"]}},"owner":"allthingslinux","repo":"atl.services","repoPath":"allthingslinux/atl.services","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"grafana-dashboard","description":"Create professional Grafana dashboards with visualizations, templating, and alerts. Use when building monitoring dashboards, creating data visualizations, or setting up operational insights.","bodyPreview":"# Grafana Dashboard\n\n## Overview\n\nDesign and implement comprehensive Grafana dashboards with multiple visualization types, variables, and drill-down capabilities for operational monitoring.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating monitoring dashboards\n- Building operational insights\n- Visualizing time-series data\n- Creating drill-down dashboards\n- Sharing metrics with stakeholders\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **Grafana Dashboard JSON**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dashboard\": {\n    \"title\": \"Application Performance\",\n    \"des","body":"# Grafana Dashboard\n\n## Overview\n\nDesign and implement comprehensive Grafana dashboards with multiple visualization types, variables, and drill-down capabilities for operational monitoring.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating monitoring dashboards\n- Building operational insights\n- Visualizing time-series data\n- Creating drill-down dashboards\n- Sharing metrics with stakeholders\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **Grafana Dashboard JSON**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dashboard\": {\n    \"title\": \"Application Performance\",\n    \"description\": \"Real-time application metrics\",\n    \"tags\": [\"production\", \"performance\"],\n    \"timezone\": \"UTC\",\n    \"refresh\": \"30s\",\n    \"templating\": {\n      \"list\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"datasource\",\n          \"type\": \"datasource\",\n          \"datasource\": \"prometheus\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"service\",\n          \"type\": \"query\",\n          \"datasource\": \"prometheus\",\n          \"query\": \"label_values(requests_total, service)\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"panels\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"title\": \"Request Rate\",\n        \"type\": \"graph\",\n        \"gridPos\": {\"x\": 0, \"y\": 0, \"w\": 12, \"h\": 8},\n        \"targets\": [\n          {\n            \"expr\": \"sum(rate(requests_total{service=\\\"$service\\\"}[5m]))\",\n            \"legendFormat\": \"{{ method }}\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"yaxes\": [\n          {\n            \"format\": \"rps\",\n            \"label\": \"Requests per Second\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": 2,\n        \"title\": \"Error Rate\",\n        \"type\": \"graph\",\n        \"gridPos\": {\"x\": 12, \"y\": 0, \"w\": 12, \"h\": 8},\n        \"targets\": [\n          {\n            \"expr\": \"sum(rate(requests_total{status_code=~\\\"5..\\\",service=\\\"$service\\\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(requests_total{service=\\\"$service\\\"}[5m]))\",\n            \"legendFormat\": \"Error Rate\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": 3,\n        \"title\": \"Response Latency (p95)\",\n        \"type\": \"graph\",\n        \"gridPos\": {\"x\": 0, \"y\": 8, \"w\": 12, \"h\": 8},\n        \"targets\": [\n          {\n            \"expr\": \"histogram_quantile(0.95, rate(request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\\\"$service\\\"}[5m]))\",\n            \"legendFormat\": \"p95\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": 4,\n        \"title\": \"Active Connections\",\n        \"type\": \"stat\",\n        \"gridPos\": {\"x\": 12, \"y\": 8, \"w\": 12, \"h\": 8},\n        \"targets\": [\n          {\n            \"expr\": \"sum(active_connections{service=\\\"$service\\\"})\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. **Grafana Provisioning Configuration**\n\n```yaml\n# /etc/grafana/provisioning/dashboards/dashboards.yaml\napiVersion: 1\n\nproviders:\n  - name: ''Dashboards''\n    orgId: 1\n    folder: ''Production''\n    type: file\n    disableDeletion: false\n    updateIntervalSeconds: 10\n    options:\n      path: /var/lib/grafana/dashboards\n```\n\n```yaml\n# /etc/grafana/provisioning/datasources/prometheus.yaml\napiVersion: 1\n\ndatasources:\n  - name: Prometheus\n    type: prometheus\n    access: proxy\n    orgId: 1\n    url: http://prometheus:9090\n    isDefault: true\n    editable: true\n    jsonData:\n      timeInterval: ''30s''\n```\n\n### 3. **Grafana Alert Configuration**\n\n```yaml\n# /etc/grafana/provisioning/alerting/alerts.yaml\ngroups:\n  - name: application_alerts\n    interval: 1m\n    rules:\n      - uid: alert_high_error_rate\n        title: High Error Rate\n        condition: B\n        data:\n          - refId: A\n            model:\n              expr: ''sum(rate(requests_total{status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))''\n          - refId: B\n            conditions:\n              - evaluator:\n                  params: [0.05]\n                  type: gt\n                query:\n                  params: [A, 5m, now]\n        for: 5m\n        annotations:\n          description: ''Error rate is {{ $values.A }}''\n        labels:\n          severity: critical\n          team: platform\n```\n\n### 4. **Grafana API Client**\n\n```javascript\n// grafana-api-client.js\nconst axios = require(''axios'');\n\nclass GrafanaClient {\n  constructor(baseUrl, apiKey) {\n    this.baseUrl = baseUrl;\n    this.client = axios.create({\n      baseURL: baseUrl,\n      headers: {\n        ''Authorization'': `Bearer ${apiKey}`,\n        ''Content-Type'': ''application/json''\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  async createDashboard(dashboard) {\n    const response = await this.client.post(''/api/dashboards/db'', {\n      dashboard: dashboard,\n      overwrite: true\n    });\n    return response.data;\n  }\n\n  async getDashboard(uid) {\n    const response = await this.client.get(`/api/dashboards/uid/${uid}`);\n    return response.data;\n  }\n\n  async createAlert(alert) {\n    const response = await this.client.post(''/api/alerts'', alert);\n    return response.data;\n  }\n\n  async listDashboards() {\n    const response = await this.client.get(''/api/search?query='');\n    return response.data;\n  }\n}\n\nmodule.exports = GrafanaClient;\n```\n\n### 5. **Docker Compose Setup**\n\n```yaml\nversion: ''3.8''\nservices:\n  grafana:\n    image: grafana/grafana:latest\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:3000\"\n    environment:\n      GF_SECURITY_ADMIN_PASSWORD: ${GRAFANA_PASSWORD:-admin}\n      GF_USERS_ALLOW_SIGN_UP: ''false''\n      GF_SERVER_ROOT_URL: http://grafana.example.com\n    volumes:\n      - ./provisioning:/etc/grafana/provisioning\n      - grafana_storage:/var/lib/grafana\n    depends_on:\n      - prometheus\n\n  prometheus:\n    image: prom/prometheus:latest\n    ports:\n      - \"9090:9090\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./prometheus.yml:/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml\n      - prometheus_storage:/prometheus\n\nvolumes:\n  grafana_storage:\n  prometheus_storage:\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n- Use meaningful dashboard titles\n- Add documentation panels\n- Implement row-based organization\n- Use variables for flexibility\n- Set appropriate refresh intervals\n- Include runbook links in alerts\n- Test alerts before deploying\n- Use consistent color schemes\n- Version control dashboard JSON\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n- Overload dashboards with too many panels\n- Mix different time ranges without justification\n- Create without runbooks\n- Ignore alert noise\n- Use inconsistent metric naming\n- Set refresh too frequently\n- Forget to configure datasources\n- Leave default passwords\n\n## Visualization Types\n\n- **Graph**: Time-series trends\n- **Stat**: Single value with thresholds\n- **Gauge**: Percentage or usage\n- **Heatmap**: Pattern detection\n- **Bar Chart**: Category comparison\n- **Pie Chart**: Composition\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:48:52.083Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Monitoring Agents needing advanced data visualization and operational insights through Grafana dashboards.","zh":"非常适合需要通过Grafana仪表盘进行高级数据可视化和运营洞察的监控代理。","ja":"Grafanaダッシュボードを通じて高度なデータ視覚化と運用インサイトが必要な監視エージェントに最適。","ko":"Grafana 대시보드를 통해 고급 데이터 시각화와 운영 통찰력이 필요한 모니터링 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de monitoreo que necesitan una visualización de datos avanzada y conocimientos operativos a través de paneles de Grafana.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de surveillance nécessitant une visualisation de données avancée et des connaissances opérationnelles via des tableaux de bord Grafana.","de":"Perfekt für Überwachungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Datenvisualisierung und betriebliche Erkenntnisse über Grafana-Dashboards benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Monitoramento que necessitam de visualização de dados avançada e informações operacionais por meio de dashboards do Grafana.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мониторинга, которым необходима расширенная визуализация данных и операционные идеи через панели Grafana.","ar":"مثالي لعمال المراقبة الذين يحتاجون إلى تصور بيانات متقدم واطلاعات تشغيلية من خلال لوحات Grafana."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement comprehensive Grafana dashboards with multiple visualization types, variables, and drill-down capabilities for operational monitoring, utilizing JSON configurations and time-series data.","zh":"赋予代理设计和实施包含多种视觉化类型、变量和下钻功能的全面Grafana仪表盘的能力，用于运营监控，利用JSON配置和时间序列数据。","ja":"エージェントが、複数の視覚化タイプ、変数、ドリルダウン機能を含む包括的なGrafanaダッシュボードを設計して実装できるようにし、JSON構成と時系列データを利用して運用モニタリングを行う。","ko":"에이전트가 다중 시각화 유형, 변수 및 드릴 다운 기능을 포함한 포괄적인 Grafana 대시보드를 설계 및 구현 할 수 있도록 하여 JSON 구성 및 시계열 데이터를 사용하여 운영 모니터링을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar paneles de Grafana integrales con múltiples tipos de visualización, variables y capacidades de perforación para la supervisión operativa, utilizando configuraciones JSON y datos de series temporales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des tableaux de bord Grafana complets avec plusieurs types de visualisation, des variables et des capacités de forage pour la surveillance opérationnelle, en utilisant des configurations JSON et des données de séries chronologiques.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Grafana-Dashboards mit mehreren Visualisierungstypen, Variablen und Drill-Down-Funktionen für die betriebliche Überwachung zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, indem JSON-Konfigurationen und Zeitreihendaten verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e implementem dashboards do Grafana abrangentes com vários tipos de visualização, variáveis e capacidades de drill-down para monitoramento operacional, utilizando configurações JSON e dados em série temporal.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать комплексные панели Grafana с несколькими типами визуализации, переменными и возможностями drill-down для операционного мониторинга, используя конфигурации JSON и временные ряды данных.","ar":"يُمكن العمال من تصميم وتنفيذ لوحات Grafana شاملة مع أنواع متعددة من التصوير، ومتغيرات، وقدرات الحفر لمراقبة تشغيلية، مع استخدام تكوينات JSON وبيانات السلاسل الزمنية."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating monitoring dashboards for application performance","Building operational insights with drill-down capabilities","Visualizing time-series data for stakeholder metrics"],"zh":["为应用程序性能创建监控仪表盘","使用下钻功能构建运营洞察","可视化时序数据以获取利益相关者指标"],"ja":["アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを監視するダッシュボードの作成","ドリルダウン機能を使用した運用インサイトの構築","ステークホルダーの指標を取得するための時系列データの視覚化"],"ko":["애플리케이션 성능을 모니터링하는 대시보드 생성","드릴 다운 기능을 사용한 운영 통찰력 구축","주주 메트릭을 얻기 위한 시계열 데이터 시각화"],"es":["Crear paneles de monitoreo para el rendimiento de aplicaciones","Construir conocimientos operativos con capacidades de perforación","Visualizar datos de series temporales para métricas de partes interesadas"],"fr":["Créer des tableaux de bord de surveillance pour les performances des applications","Construire des connaissances opérationnelles avec des capacités de forage","Visualiser des données de séries chronologiques pour les métriques des parties prenantes"],"de":["Erstellung von Überwachungsdashboards für die Leistung von Anwendungen","Erstellung von betrieblichen Erkenntnissen mit Drill-Down-Funktionen","Visualisierung von Zeitreihendaten für Stakeholder-Metriken"],"pt":["Criação de dashboards de monitoramento para desempenho de aplicativos","Construção de informações operacionais com capacidades de drill-down","Visualização de dados em série temporal para métricas de partes interessadas"],"ru":["Создание панелей мониторинга для производительности приложений","Построение операционных идей с возможностями drill-down","Визуализация временных рядов данных для метрик заинтересованных сторон"],"ar":["إنشاء لوحات مراقبة لأداء التطبيقات","بناء رؤى تشغيلية بقدرات الحفر","تصوير بيانات السلاسل الزمنية لأرقام أصحاب المصلحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Grafana installation and configuration","Limited to time-series data visualization"],"zh":["需要Grafana的安装和配置","仅限时序数据可视化"],"ja":["Grafanaのインストールと設定が必要","時系列データの視覚化のみ"],"ko":["Grafana 설치 및 구성이 필요함","시계열 데이터 시각화만 가능"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Grafana","Limitado a la visualización de datos de series temporales"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Grafana","Limité à la visualisation de données de séries chronologiques"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von Grafana","Begrenzt auf die Visualisierung von Zeitreihendaten"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Grafana","Limitado à visualização de dados em série temporal"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Grafana","Ограничен визуализацией временных рядов данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Grafana","محدود بتصوير بيانات السلاسل الزمنية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/data-storytelling', 'community', 'xiangteng007', 'XXT-AGENT', 'xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT', 'data-storytelling', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z', '2026-02-18T09:48:51.449Z', NULL, '{"id":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/data-storytelling","name":"data-storytelling","description":{"zh":"数据故事讲述是将数据转化为有意义的叙述，驱动业务决策和行动。它涉及数据分析、可视化和沟通","ja":"データストーリーテリングは、データを意味のある物語に変えることで、ビジネス上の意思決定と行動を促進する技術です。データ分析、可視化、コミュニケーションが含まれます","ko":"데이터 스토리 텔링은 데이터를 의미 있는 이야기로 변환하여 비즈니스 의사 결정과 행동을 이끌어내는 기술입니다. 데이터 분석, 시각화, 커뮤니케이션이 포함됩니다","es":"Data storytelling es el proceso de transformar datos en historias convincentes que impulsan decisiones y acciones. Aprende a aplicar mejores prácticas y a validar resultados.","fr":"Le data storytelling est le processus de transformation des données en récits convaincants qui stimulent les décisions et les actions. Apprenez à appliquer les meilleures pratiques et à valider les résultats.","de":"Data Storytelling ist der Prozess der Umwandlung von Rohdaten in überzeugende Erzählungen, die Entscheidungen und Aktionen beeinflussen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie bewährte Methoden anwenden und Ergebnisse überprüfen.","pt":"A habilidade de contar histórias com dados permite transformar dados crus em narrativas convincentes. Aprenda a aplicar essa habilidade para impulsionar decisões e inspirar ação.","ru":"Навык рассказывания историй с данными позволяет превратить сырые данные в убедительные истории. Узнайте, как применить этот навык для стимулирования принятия решений и вдохновения на действие.","ar":"مهارة سرد القصص بالبيانات تمكن من تحويل البيانات الخام إلى سرد قصصي مقنع. تعلم كيفية تطبيق هذه المهارة ل驱ز القرارات وتهيئ للعمل.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"数据故事讲述 - 将数据转化为决策驱动的叙述","ja":"データストーリーテリング - データを決定を促す物語に変える","ko":"데이터 스토리 텔링 - 데이터를 의사 결정에 영향을 미치는 이야기로 변환","es":"Cuentacuentos de 