de narrativas que impulsan acciones","Uso de herramientas y técnicas de visualización de datos"],"fr":["Transformation des données en récits convaincants","Application des meilleures pratiques pour la prise de décision","Validation des résultats pour assurer la précision","Création de récits qui stimulent les actions","Utilisation d''outils et de techniques de visualisation de données"],"de":["Umwandlung von Rohdaten in überzeugende Erzählungen","Anwendung bewährter Methoden für die Entscheidungsfindung","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse, um die Genauigkeit zu gewährleisten","Erstellung von Erzählungen, die Aktionen auslösen","Verwendung von Tools und Techniken zur Datenvisualisierung"],"pt":["Transformação de dados crus em narrativas","Criação de histórias convincentes","Aplicação de práticas recomendadas","Validação de resultados","Fornecimento de etapas ação"],"ru":["Преобразование сырых данных в истории","Создание убедительных историй","Применение лучших практик","Валидация результатов","Предоставление шагов действий"],"ar":["تحويل البيانات الخام إلى سرد قصصي","إنشاء سرد قصصي مقنع","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات","التحقق من النتائج","توفير خطوات العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据故事讲述","数据分析","数据可视化","业务决策","数据洞察","有效沟通","数据驱动决策","商业智能"],"ja":["データストーリーテリング","データ分析","データ可視化","ビジネス上の意思決定","データの洞察","効果的なコミュニケーション","データドリブンの意思決定","ビジネスインテリジェンス"],"ko":["데이터 스토리 텔링","데이터 분석","데이터 시각화","비즈니스 의사 결정","데이터의 통찰","효과적인 커뮤니케이션","데이터 주도 의사 결정","비즈니스 인텔리전스"],"es":["data storytelling","transformación de datos","historias de datos","toma de decisiones","visualización de datos","análisis de datos","informes de datos","narrativas de datos"],"fr":["data storytelling","transformation de données","récits de données","prise de décision","visualisation de données","analyse de données","rapports de données","récits de données"],"de":["data storytelling","Umwandlung von Rohdaten","Erzählungen aus Daten","Entscheidungsfindung","Datenvisualisierung","Datenanalyse","Datenberichte","Daten-Erzählungen"],"pt":["contar histórias com dados","narrativas de dados","transformação de dados","análise de dados","visualização de dados","práticas recomendadas de dados"],"ru":["рассказывание историй с данными","истории с данными","преобразование данных","анализ данных","визуализация данных","лучшие практики данных"],"ar":["سرد القصص بالبيانات","سرد قصصي بالبيانات","تحويل البيانات","تحليل البيانات","تصوير البيانات","أفضل ممارسات البيانات"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"data-storytelling","description":"Transform data into compelling narratives using visualization, context, and persuasive structure. Use when presenting analytics to stakeholders, creating data reports, or building executive presentations.","bodyPreview":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to data storytelling\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use","body":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to data storytelling\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Presenting analytics to executives\n- Creating quarterly business reviews\n- Building investor presentations\n- Writing data-driven reports\n- Communicating insights to non-technical audiences\n- Making recommendations based on data\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Story Structure\n\n```\nSetup → Conflict → Resolution\n\nSetup: Context and baseline\nConflict: The problem or opportunity\nResolution: Insights and recommendations\n```\n\n### 2. Narrative Arc\n\n```\n1. Hook: Grab attention with surprising insight\n2. Context: Establish the baseline\n3. Rising Action: Build through data points\n4. Climax: The key insight\n5. Resolution: Recommendations\n6. Call to Action: Next steps\n```\n\n### 3. Three Pillars\n\n| Pillar        | Purpose  | Components                       |\n| ------------- | -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Data**      | Evidence | Numbers, trends, comparisons     |\n| **Narrative** | Meaning  | Context, causation, implications |\n| **Visuals**   | Clarity  | Charts, diagrams, highlights     |\n\n## Story Frameworks\n\n### Framework 1: The Problem-Solution Story\n\n```markdown\n# Customer Churn Analysis\n\n## The Hook\n\n\"We''re losing $2.4M annually to preventable churn.\"\n\n## The Context\n\n- Current churn rate: 8.5% (industry average: 5%)\n- Average customer lifetime value: $4,800\n- 500 customers churned last quarter\n\n## The Problem\n\nAnalysis of churned customers reveals a pattern:\n\n- 73% churned within first 90 days\n- Common factor: < 3 support interactions\n- Low feature adoption in first month\n\n## The Insight\n\n[Show engagement curve visualization]\nCustomers who don''t engage in the first 14 days\nare 4x more likely to churn.\n\n## The Solution\n\n1. Implement 14-day onboarding sequence\n2. Proactive outreach at day 7\n3. Feature adoption tracking\n\n## Expected Impact\n\n- Reduce early churn by 40%\n- Save $960K annually\n- Payback period: 3 months\n\n## Call to Action\n\nApprove $50K budget for onboarding automation.\n```\n\n### Framework 2: The Trend Story\n\n```markdown\n# Q4 Performance Analysis\n\n## Where We Started\n\nQ3 ended with $1.2M MRR, 15% below target.\nTeam morale was low after missed goals.\n\n## What Changed\n\n[Timeline visualization]\n\n- Oct: Launched self-serve pricing\n- Nov: Reduced friction in signup\n- Dec: Added customer success calls\n\n## The Transformation\n\n[Before/after comparison chart]\n| Metric | Q3 | Q4 | Change |\n|----------------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Trial → Paid | 8% | 15% | +87% |\n| Time to Value | 14 days| 5 days | -64% |\n| Expansion Rate | 2% | 8% | +300% |\n\n## Key Insight\n\nSelf-serve + high-touch creates compound growth.\nCustomers who self-serve AND get a success call\nhave 3x higher expansion rate.\n\n## Going Forward\n\nDouble down on hybrid model.\nTarget: $1.8M MRR by Q2.\n```\n\n### Framework 3: The Comparison Story\n\n```markdown\n# Market Opportunity Analysis\n\n## The Question\n\nShould we expand into EMEA or APAC first?\n\n## The Comparison\n\n[Side-by-side market analysis]\n\n### EMEA\n\n- Market size: $4.2B\n- Growth rate: 8%\n- Competition: High\n- Regulatory: Complex (GDPR)\n- Language: Multiple\n\n### APAC\n\n- Market size: $3.8B\n- Growth rate: 15%\n- Competition: Moderate\n- Regulatory: Varied\n- Language: Multiple\n\n## The Analysis\n\n[Weighted scoring matrix visualization]\n\n| Factor      | Weight | EMEA Score | APAC Score |\n| ----------- | ------ | ---------- | ---------- |\n| Market Size | 25%    | 5          | 4          |\n| Growth      | 30%    | 3          | 5          |\n| Competition | 20%    | 2          | 4          |\n| Ease        | 25%    | 2          | 3          |\n| **Total**   |        | **2.9**    | **4.1**    |\n\n## The Recommendation\n\nAPAC first. Higher growth, less competition.\nStart with Singapore hub (English, business-friendly).\nEnter EMEA in Year 2 with localization ready.\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n\n- Timezone coverage: Hire 24/7 support\n- Cultural fit: Local partnerships\n- Payment: Multi-currency from day 1\n```\n\n## Visualization Techniques\n\n### Technique 1: Progressive Reveal\n\n```markdown\nStart simple, add layers:\n\nSlide 1: \"Revenue is growing\" [single line chart]\nSlide 2: \"But growth is slowing\" [add growth rate overlay]\nSlide 3: \"Driven by one segment\" [add segment breakdown]\nSlide 4: \"Which is saturating\" [add market share]\nSlide 5: \"We need new segments\" [add opportunity zones]\n```\n\n### Technique 2: Contrast and Compare\n\n```markdown\nBefore/After:\n┌─────────────────┬─────────────────┐\n│ BEFORE │ AFTER │\n│ │ │\n│ Process: 5 days│ Process: 1 day │\n│ Errors: 15% │ Errors: 2% │\n│ Cost: $50/unit │ Cost: $20/unit │\n└─────────────────┴─────────────────┘\n\nThis/That (emphasize difference):\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ CUSTOMER A vs B │\n│ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ │\n│ │ ████████ │ │ ██ │ │\n│ │ $45,000 │ │ $8,000 │ │\n│ │ LTV │ │ LTV │ │\n│ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ │\n│ Onboarded No onboarding │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Technique 3: Annotation and Highlight\n\n```python\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport pandas as pd\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 6))\n\n# Plot the main data\nax.plot(dates, revenue, linewidth=2, color=''#2E86AB'')\n\n# Add annotation for key events\nax.annotate(\n    ''Product Launch\\n+32% spike'',\n    xy=(launch_date, launch_revenue),\n    xytext=(launch_date, launch_revenue * 1.2),\n    fontsize=10,\n    arrowprops=dict(arrowstyle=''->'', color=''#E63946''),\n    color=''#E63946''\n)\n\n# Highlight a region\nax.axvspan(growth_start, growth_end, alpha=0.2, color=''green'',\n           label=''Growth Period'')\n\n# Add threshold line\nax.axhline(y=target, color=''gray'', linestyle=''--'',\n           label=f''Target: ${target:,.0f}'')\n\nax.set_title(''Revenue Growth Story'', fontsize=14, fontweight=''bold'')\nax.legend()\n```\n\n## Presentation Templates\n\n### Template 1: Executive Summary Slide\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  KEY INSIGHT                                                │\n│  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════│\n│                                                             │\n│  \"Customers who complete onboarding in week 1              │\n│   have 3x higher lifetime value\"                           │\n│                                                             │\n├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                      │                                      │\n│  THE DATA            │  THE IMPLICATION                     │\n│                      │                                      │\n│  Week 1 completers:  │  ✓ Prioritize onboarding UX         │\n│  • LTV: $4,500       │  ✓ Add day-1 success milestones     │\n│  • Retention: 85%    │  ✓ Proactive week-1 outreach        │\n│  • NPS: 72           │                                      │\n│                      │  Investment: $75K                    │\n│  Others:             │  Expected ROI: 8x                    │\n│  • LTV: $1,500       │                                      │\n│  • Retention: 45%    │                                      │\n│  • NPS: 34           │                                      │\n│                      │                                      │\n└──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Template 2: Data Story Flow\n\n```\nSlide 1: THE HEADLINE\n\"We can grow 40% faster by fixing onboarding\"\n\nSlide 2: THE CONTEXT\nCurrent state metrics\nIndustry benchmarks\nGap analysis\n\nSlide 3: THE DISCOVERY\nWhat the data revealed\nSurprising finding\nPattern identification\n\nSlide 4: THE DEEP DIVE\nRoot cause analysis\nSegment breakdowns\nStatistical significance\n\nSlide 5: THE RECOMMENDATION\nProposed actions\nResource requirements\nTimeline\n\nSlide 6: THE IMPACT\nExpected outcomes\nROI calculation\nRisk assessment\n\nSlide 7: THE ASK\nSpecific request\nDecision needed\nNext steps\n```\n\n### Template 3: One-Page Dashboard Story\n\n```markdown\n# Monthly Business Review: January 2024\n\n## THE HEADLINE\n\nRevenue up 15% but CAC increasing faster than LTV\n\n## KEY METRICS AT A GLANCE\n\n┌────────┬────────┬────────┬────────┐\n│ MRR │ NRR │ CAC │ LTV │\n│ $125K │ 108% │ $450 │ $2,200 │\n│ ▲15% │ ▲3% │ ▲22% │ ▲8% │\n└────────┴────────┴────────┴────────┘\n\n## WHAT''S WORKING\n\n✓ Enterprise segment growing 25% MoM\n✓ Referral program driving 30% of new logos\n✓ Support satisfaction at all-time high (94%)\n\n## WHAT NEEDS ATTENTION\n\n✗ SMB acquisition cost up 40%\n✗ Trial conversion down 5 points\n✗ Time-to-value increased by 3 days\n\n## ROOT CAUSE\n\n[Mini chart showing SMB vs Enterprise CAC trend]\nSMB paid ads becoming less efficient.\nCPC up 35% while conversion flat.\n\n## RECOMMENDATION\n\n1. Shift $20K/mo from paid to content\n2. Launch SMB self-serve trial\n3. A/B test shorter onboarding\n\n## NEXT MONTH''S FOCUS\n\n- Launch content marketing pilot\n- Complete self-serve MVP\n- Reduce time-to-value to < 7 days\n```\n\n## Writing Techniques\n\n### Headlines That Work\n\n```markdown\nBAD: \"Q4 Sales Analysis\"\nGOOD: \"Q4 Sales Beat Target by 23% - Here''s Why\"\n\nBAD: \"Customer Churn Report\"\nGOOD: \"We''re Losing $2.4M to Preventable Churn\"\n\nBAD: \"Marketing Performance\"\nGOOD: \"Content Marketing Delivers 4x ROI vs. Paid\"\n\nFormula:\n[Specific Number] + [Business Impact] + [Actionable Context]\n```\n\n### Transition Phrases\n\n```markdown\nBuilding the narrative:\n• \"This leads us to ask...\"\n• \"When we dig deeper...\"\n• \"The pattern becomes clear when...\"\n• \"Contrast this with...\"\n\nIntroducing insights:\n• \"The data reveals...\"\n• \"What surprised us was...\"\n• \"The inflection point came when...\"\n• \"The key finding is...\"\n\nMoving to action:\n• \"This insight suggests...\"\n• \"Based on this analysis...\"\n• \"The implication is clear...\"\n• \"Our recommendation is...\"\n```\n\n### Handling Uncertainty\n\n```markdown\nAcknowledge limitations:\n• \"With 95% confidence, we can say...\"\n• \"The sample size of 500 shows...\"\n• \"While correlation is strong, causation requires...\"\n• \"This trend holds for [segment], though [caveat]...\"\n\nPresent ranges:\n• \"Impact estimate: $400K-$600K\"\n• \"Confidence interval: 15-20% improvement\"\n• \"Best case: X, Conservative: Y\"\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Start with the \"so what\"** - Lead with insight\n- **Use the rule of three** - Three points, three comparisons\n- **Show, don''t tell** - Let data speak\n- **Make it personal** - Connect to audience goals\n- **End with action** - Clear next steps\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t data dump** - Curate ruthlessly\n- **Don''t bury the insight** - Front-load key findings\n- **Don''t use jargon** - Match audience vocabulary\n- **Don''t show methodology first** - Context, then method\n- **Don''t forget the narrative** - Numbers need meaning\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Storytelling with Data (Cole Nussbaumer)](https://www.storytellingwithdata.com/)\n- [The Pyramid Principle (Barbara Minto)](https://www.amazon.com/Pyramid-Principle-Logic-Writing-Thinking/dp/0273710516)\n- [Resonate (Nancy Duarte)](https://www.duarte.com/resonate/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:48:51.449Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Analytics Agents needing advanced data visualization and narrative capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据可视化和叙事能力的分析代理。","ja":"高度なデータ視覚化とナレーション能力が必要な分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 데이터 시각화 및 내레이션 기능이 필요한 분석 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos avanzadas y narrativas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse ayant besoin de capacités de visualisation de données avancées et de narration.","de":"Perfekt für Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Datenvisualisierungs- und Erzählungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise que precisam de visualização de dados avançada e capacidades narrativas.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Аналитики, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации данных и повествования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التحليل التي تحتاج إلى تصور بيانات متقدم وcapabilities قصصية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform raw data into compelling narratives using best practices, driving decisions and inspiring action with validated outcomes and actionable steps, leveraging data visualization protocols and libraries.","zh":"赋予代理将原始数据转化为令人信服的故事的能力，利用最佳实践，驱动决策和激发行动，通过验证的结果和可行的步骤，利用数据可视化协议和库。","ja":"エージェントに、ベストプラクティスを使用して、生データを説得力のある物語に変換する能力を与え、検証された成果と実行可能なステップを使用して意思決定を推進し、行動を促進し、データ視覚化プロトコルとライブラリを利用します。","ko":"에이전트에게 원시 데이터를 설득력 있는故事로 변환할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 최고의 실践을 사용하여 의사 결정을 주도하고 행동을 영감을 불어 넣으며 검증된 결과와 실행 가능한 단계를 사용하여 데이터 시각화 프로토콜 및 라이브러리를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar datos sin procesar en narrativas convincentes utilizando las mejores prácticas, impulsando decisiones e inspirando acciones con resultados validados y pasos acciónables, aprovechando protocolos y bibliotecas de visualización de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les données brutes en récits convaincants en utilisant les meilleures pratiques, en impulsant les décisions et en inspirant l''action avec des résultats validés et des étapes actionnables, en exploitant les protocoles et les bibliothèques de visualisation de données.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, rohe Daten in überzeugende Erzählungen umzuwandeln, indem sie die besten Praktiken verwenden, Entscheidungen vorantreiben und Handlungen inspirieren, mit validierten Ergebnissen und handhabbaren Schritten, die Datenvisualisierungsprotokolle und -bibliotheken nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar dados brutos em narrativas convincentes usando as melhores práticas, impulsionando decisões e inspirando ações com resultados validados e etapas executáveis, aproveitando protocolos e bibliotecas de visualização de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить сырые данные в убедительные нарративы с использованием лучших практик, стимулируя принятие решений и вдохновляя действия с проверенными результатами и осуществимыми шагами, используя протоколы и библиотеки визуализации данных.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل البيانات الخام إلى روايات مقنعة باستخدام أفضل الممارسات ، مما يدفع القرارات ويلهم الإجراءات بنتائج مدققة وخطوات قابلة للتنفيذ ، واستخدام بروتوكولات ومكتبات تصور البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating report generation with data-driven insights","Generating interactive dashboards for stakeholder engagement","Creating data-backed presentations for business decision-making"],"zh":["使用数据驱动的洞察力自动生成报告","为利益相关者参与生成交互式仪表盘","创建数据支持的演示文稿以进行商业决策"],"ja":["データ駆動の洞察を使用してレポートを自動生成する","ステークホルダーへのエンゲージメントのためにインタラクティブなダッシュボードを生成する","ビジネス上の意思決定のためのデータを裏付けたプレゼンテーションを作成する"],"ko":["데이터 주도형 통찰력을 사용하여 보고서를 자동 생성하는 것","利害 관계자 참여를 위한 대시보드를 생성하는 것","비즈니스 의사 결정에 대한 데이터 지원 프레ゼンテ이션을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de informes con perspectivas basadas en datos","Generar paneles interactivos para la participación de las partes interesadas","Crear presentaciones respaldadas por datos para la toma de decisiones comerciales"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de rapports avec des perspectives basées sur les données","Générer des tableaux de bord interactifs pour l''engagement des parties prenantes","Créer des présentations étayées par des données pour la prise de décision commerciale"],"de":["Automatisieren der Berichterstellung mit datengetriebenen Erkenntnissen","Erzeugen interaktiver Dashboards für die Einbindung der Stakeholder","Erstellen von datengestützten Präsentationen für die Geschäftsentscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de relatórios com insights baseados em dados","Gerar dashboards interativos para engajamento de stakeholders","Criar apresentações baseadas em dados para tomada de decisões de negócios"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию отчетов с данными, основанными на инсайтах","Генерировать интерактивные панели для вовлечения заинтересованных сторон","Создавать презентации, основанные на данных, для принятия бизнес-решений"],"ar":["آليّة إنتاج التقارير مع رؤى مدفوعة بالبيانات","إنتاج لوحات تحكم تفاعلية لالتزام أصحاب المصلحة","إنشاء عروض مدعومة بالبيانات لاتخاذ قرارات الأعمال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires relevant data inputs and context","Limited to data storytelling scope and tools"],"zh":["需要相关数据输入和上下文","仅限于数据故事范围和工具"],"ja":["関連するデータ入力とコンテキストが必要","データストーリーテリングの範囲とツールに限定される"],"ko":["관련 데이터 입력 및 컨텍스트가 필요","데이터 스토리 텔링 범위 및 도구로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entradas de datos y contexto relevantes","Limitado al alcance y las herramientas de narración de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite des entrées de données et un contexte pertinents","Limité à la portée et aux outils de narration de données"],"de":["Benötigt relevante Dateneingaben und Kontext","Begrenzt auf den Bereich und die Werkzeuge der Datenstory-Erstellung"],"pt":["Exige entradas de dados relevantes e contexto","Limitado ao escopo e às ferramentas de storytelling de dados"],"ru":["Требует соответствующих входных данных и контекста","Ограничен сферой повествования и инструментами данных"],"ar":["يتطلب مدخلات بيانات ذات صلة والسياق","محدود بنطاق أدوات وقصص البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
