. Aprende sobre Express Checkout, IPN y facturación recurrente.","fr":"Intégrez PayPal dans vos projets avec facilité. Découvrez Express Checkout, IPN et facturation récurrente.","de":"Integrieren Sie PayPal in Ihre Projekte mit Leichtigkeit. Erfahren Sie über Express Checkout, IPN und wiederkehrende Abrechnung.","pt":"Integre o PayPal em sua aplicação com facilidade, incluindo Express Checkout e faturamento recorrente","ru":"Интегрируйте PayPal в ваше приложение с легкостью, включая Express Checkout и регулярное выставление счетов","ar":"دمج باي بال في تطبيقك بسهولة، بما في ذلك الدفع السريع ووصول الفواتير المتكرر","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Express Checkout","IPN处理","循环计费","退款工作流","安全支付处理"],"ja":["Express Checkout","IPN処理","定期請求","返金ワークフロー","安全な決済処理"],"ko":["Express Checkout","IPN 처리","정기 청구","환불 워크플로우","안전한 결제 처리"],"es":["Express Checkout","IPN (Instant Payment Notification)","Facturación recurrente","Flujos de reembolso","Mejores prácticas de integración","Validación de resultados"],"fr":["Express Checkout","IPN (Notification de paiement instantanée)","Facturation récurrente","Flux de remboursement","Meilleures pratiques d''intégration","Validation des résultats"],"de":["Express Checkout","IPN (Instant Payment Notification)","Wiederkehrende Abrechnung","Rückzahlungsflüsse","Beste Praktiken für die Integration","Validierung der Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Express Checkout","IPN (Instant Payment Notification)","Faturamento recorrente","Fluxo de reembolso","Validação de pagamentos","Integração com aplicativos"],"ru":["Express Checkout","IPN (Мгновенное уведомление о платеже)","Регулярное выставление счетов","Поток возврата","Валидация платежей","Интеграция с приложениями"],"ar":["الدفع السريع","IPN (إشعار الفوري للدفع)","وصول الفواتير المتكرر","تدفق الاسترداد","التحقق من المدفوعات","التكامل مع التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PayPal集成","在线支付","安全支付","Express Checkout","IPN处理","循环计费"],"ja":["PayPal統合","オンライン決済","安全な決済","Express Checkout","IPN処理","定期請求"],"ko":["PayPal 통합","온라인 결제","안전한 결제","Express Checkout","IPN 처리","정기 청구"],"es":["integración de paypal","express checkout","ipn paypal","facturación recurrente","desarrollo de aplicaciones","pagos en línea","seguridad de pagos","mejores prácticas de integración"],"fr":["intégration de paypal","express checkout","ipn paypal","facturation récurrente","développement d''applications","paiements en ligne","sécurité des paiements","meilleures pratiques d''intégration"],"de":["paypal-integration","express checkout","ipn paypal","wiederkehrende abrechnung","anwendungsentwicklung","online-zahlungen","zahlungssicherheit","beste praktiken für die integration"],"pt":["integração paypal","pagamento online","express checkout","ipn","faturamento recorrente","reembolso","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","pagamento seguro"],"ru":["интеграция paypal","онлайн-платежи","экспресс-оплата","ipn","регулярное выставление счетов","возврат","разработка приложений","безопасный платеж"],"ar":["تكامل باي بال","مدفوعات عبر الإنترنت","الدفع السريع","ipn","وصول الفواتير المتكرر","استرداد","تطوير التطبيقات","دفع آمن"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paypal-integration","description":"Integrate PayPal payment processing with support for express checkout, subscriptions, and refund management. Use when implementing PayPal payments, processing online transactions, or building e-commerce checkout flows.","bodyPreview":"# PayPal Integration\n\nMaster PayPal payment integration including Express Checkout, IPN handling, recurring billing, and refund workflows.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to paypal integration\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/impl","body":"# PayPal Integration\n\nMaster PayPal payment integration including Express Checkout, IPN handling, recurring billing, and refund workflows.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to paypal integration\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Integrating PayPal as a payment option\n- Implementing express checkout flows\n- Setting up recurring billing with PayPal\n- Processing refunds and payment disputes\n- Handling PayPal webhooks (IPN)\n- Supporting international payments\n- Implementing PayPal subscriptions\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Payment Products\n**PayPal Checkout**\n- One-time payments\n- Express checkout experience\n- Guest and PayPal account payments\n\n**PayPal Subscriptions**\n- Recurring billing\n- Subscription plans\n- Automatic renewals\n\n**PayPal Payouts**\n- Send money to multiple recipients\n- Marketplace and platform payments\n\n### 2. Integration Methods\n**Client-Side (JavaScript SDK)**\n- Smart Payment Buttons\n- Hosted payment flow\n- Minimal backend code\n\n**Server-Side (REST API)**\n- Full control over payment flow\n- Custom checkout UI\n- Advanced features\n\n### 3. IPN (Instant Payment Notification)\n- Webhook-like payment notifications\n- Asynchronous payment updates\n- Verification required\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```javascript\n// Frontend - PayPal Smart Buttons\n<div id=\"paypal-button-container\"></div>\n\n<script src=\"https://www.paypal.com/sdk/js?client-id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID&currency=USD\"></script>\n<script>\n  paypal.Buttons({\n    createOrder: function(data, actions) {\n      return actions.order.create({\n        purchase_units: [{\n          amount: {\n            value: ''25.00''\n          }\n        }]\n      });\n    },\n    onApprove: function(data, actions) {\n      return actions.order.capture().then(function(details) {\n        // Payment successful\n        console.log(''Transaction completed by '' + details.payer.name.given_name);\n\n        // Send to backend for verification\n        fetch(''/api/paypal/capture'', {\n          method: ''POST'',\n          headers: {''Content-Type'': ''application/json''},\n          body: JSON.stringify({orderID: data.orderID})\n        });\n      });\n    }\n  }).render(''#paypal-button-container'');\n</script>\n```\n\n```python\n# Backend - Verify and capture order\nfrom paypalrestsdk import Payment\nimport paypalrestsdk\n\npaypalrestsdk.configure({\n    \"mode\": \"sandbox\",  # or \"live\"\n    \"client_id\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_ID\",\n    \"client_secret\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET\"\n})\n\ndef capture_paypal_order(order_id):\n    \"\"\"Capture a PayPal order.\"\"\"\n    payment = Payment.find(order_id)\n\n    if payment.execute({\"payer_id\": payment.payer.payer_info.payer_id}):\n        # Payment successful\n        return {\n            ''status'': ''success'',\n            ''transaction_id'': payment.id,\n            ''amount'': payment.transactions[0].amount.total\n        }\n    else:\n        # Payment failed\n        return {\n            ''status'': ''failed'',\n            ''error'': payment.error\n        }\n```\n\n## Express Checkout Implementation\n\n### Server-Side Order Creation\n```python\nimport requests\nimport json\n\nclass PayPalClient:\n    def __init__(self, client_id, client_secret, mode=''sandbox''):\n        self.client_id = client_id\n        self.client_secret = client_secret\n        self.base_url = ''https://api-m.sandbox.paypal.com'' if mode == ''sandbox'' else ''https://api-m.paypal.com''\n        self.access_token = self.get_access_token()\n\n    def get_access_token(self):\n        \"\"\"Get OAuth access token.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v1/oauth2/token\"\n        headers = {\"Accept\": \"application/json\", \"Accept-Language\": \"en_US\"}\n\n        response = requests.post(\n            url,\n            headers=headers,\n            data={\"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\"},\n            auth=(self.client_id, self.client_secret)\n        )\n\n        return response.json()[''access_token'']\n\n    def create_order(self, amount, currency=''USD''):\n        \"\"\"Create a PayPal order.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        payload = {\n            \"intent\": \"CAPTURE\",\n            \"purchase_units\": [{\n                \"amount\": {\n                    \"currency_code\": currency,\n                    \"value\": str(amount)\n                }\n            }]\n        }\n\n        response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n        return response.json()\n\n    def capture_order(self, order_id):\n        \"\"\"Capture payment for an order.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders/{order_id}/capture\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        response = requests.post(url, headers=headers)\n        return response.json()\n\n    def get_order_details(self, order_id):\n        \"\"\"Get order details.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders/{order_id}\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        response = requests.get(url, headers=headers)\n        return response.json()\n```\n\n## IPN (Instant Payment Notification) Handling\n\n### IPN Verification and Processing\n```python\nfrom flask import Flask, request\nimport requests\nfrom urllib.parse import parse_qs\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route(''/ipn'', methods=[''POST''])\ndef handle_ipn():\n    \"\"\"Handle PayPal IPN notifications.\"\"\"\n    # Get IPN message\n    ipn_data = request.form.to_dict()\n\n    # Verify IPN with PayPal\n    if not verify_ipn(ipn_data):\n        return ''IPN verification failed'', 400\n\n    # Process IPN based on transaction type\n    payment_status = ipn_data.get(''payment_status'')\n    txn_type = ipn_data.get(''txn_type'')\n\n    if payment_status == ''Completed'':\n        handle_payment_completed(ipn_data)\n    elif payment_status == ''Refunded'':\n        handle_refund(ipn_data)\n    elif payment_status == ''Reversed'':\n        handle_chargeback(ipn_data)\n\n    return ''IPN processed'', 200\n\ndef verify_ipn(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Verify IPN message authenticity.\"\"\"\n    # Add ''cmd'' parameter\n    verify_data = ipn_data.copy()\n    verify_data[''cmd''] = ''_notify-validate''\n\n    # Send back to PayPal for verification\n    paypal_url = ''https://ipnpb.sandbox.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr''  # or production URL\n\n    response = requests.post(paypal_url, data=verify_data)\n\n    return response.text == ''VERIFIED''\n\ndef handle_payment_completed(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Process completed payment.\"\"\"\n    txn_id = ipn_data.get(''txn_id'')\n    payer_email = ipn_data.get(''payer_email'')\n    mc_gross = ipn_data.get(''mc_gross'')\n    item_name = ipn_data.get(''item_name'')\n\n    # Check if already processed (prevent duplicates)\n    if is_transaction_processed(txn_id):\n        return\n\n    # Update database\n    # Send confirmation email\n    # Fulfill order\n    print(f\"Payment completed: {txn_id}, Amount: ${mc_gross}\")\n\ndef handle_refund(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Handle refund.\"\"\"\n    parent_txn_id = ipn_data.get(''parent_txn_id'')\n    mc_gross = ipn_data.get(''mc_gross'')\n\n    # Process refund in your system\n    print(f\"Refund processed: {parent_txn_id}, Amount: ${mc_gross}\")\n\ndef handle_chargeback(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Handle payment reversal/chargeback.\"\"\"\n    txn_id = ipn_data.get(''txn_id'')\n    reason_code = ipn_data.get(''reason_code'')\n\n    # Handle chargeback\n    print(f\"Chargeback: {txn_id}, Reason: {reason_code}\")\n```\n\n## Subscription/Recurring Billing\n\n### Create Subscription Plan\n```python\ndef create_subscription_plan(name, amount, interval=''MONTH''):\n    \"\"\"Create a subscription plan.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v1/billing/plans\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {\n        \"product_id\": \"PRODUCT_ID\",  # Create product first\n        \"name\": name,\n        \"billing_cycles\": [{\n            \"frequency\": {\n                \"interval_unit\": interval,\n                \"interval_count\": 1\n            },\n            \"tenure_type\": \"REGULAR\",\n            \"sequence\": 1,\n            \"total_cycles\": 0,  # Infinite\n            \"pricing_scheme\": {\n                \"fixed_price\": {\n                    \"value\": str(amount),\n                    \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n                }\n            }\n        }],\n        \"payment_preferences\": {\n            \"auto_bill_outstanding\": True,\n            \"setup_fee\": {\n                \"value\": \"0\",\n                \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n            },\n            \"setup_fee_failure_action\": \"CONTINUE\",\n            \"payment_failure_threshold\": 3\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    return response.json()\n\ndef create_subscription(plan_id, subscriber_email):\n    \"\"\"Create a subscription for a customer.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v1/billing/subscriptions\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {\n        \"plan_id\": plan_id,\n        \"subscriber\": {\n            \"email_address\": subscriber_email\n        },\n        \"application_context\": {\n            \"return_url\": \"https://yourdomain.com/subscription/success\",\n            \"cancel_url\": \"https://yourdomain.com/subscription/cancel\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    subscription = response.json()\n\n    # Get approval URL\n    for link in subscription.get(''links'', []):\n        if link[''rel''] == ''approve'':\n            return {\n                ''subscription_id'': subscription[''id''],\n                ''approval_url'': link[''href'']\n            }\n```\n\n## Refund Workflows\n\n```python\ndef create_refund(capture_id, amount=None, note=None):\n    \"\"\"Create a refund for a captured payment.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v2/payments/captures/{capture_id}/refund\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {}\n    if amount:\n        payload[\"amount\"] = {\n            \"value\": str(amount),\n            \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n        }\n\n    if note:\n        payload[\"note_to_payer\"] = note\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    return response.json()\n\ndef get_refund_details(refund_id):\n    \"\"\"Get refund details.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v2/payments/refunds/{refund_id}\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    response = requests.get(url, headers=headers)\n    return response.json()\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```python\nclass PayPalError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"Custom PayPal error.\"\"\"\n    pass\n\ndef handle_paypal_api_call(api_function):\n    \"\"\"Wrapper for PayPal API calls with error handling.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        result = api_function()\n        return result\n    except requests.exceptions.RequestException as e:\n        # Network error\n        raise PayPalError(f\"Network error: {str(e)}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        # Other errors\n        raise PayPalError(f\"PayPal API error: {str(e)}\")\n\n# Usage\ntry:\n    order = handle_paypal_api_call(lambda: client.create_order(25.00))\nexcept PayPalError as e:\n    # Handle error appropriately\n    log_error(e)\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n```python\n# Use sandbox credentials\nSANDBOX_CLIENT_ID = \"...\"\nSANDBOX_SECRET = \"...\"\n\n# Test accounts\n# Create test buyer and seller accounts at developer.paypal.com\n\ndef test_payment_flow():\n    \"\"\"Test complete payment flow.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(SANDBOX_CLIENT_ID, SANDBOX_SECRET, mode=''sandbox'')\n\n    # Create order\n    order = client.create_order(10.00)\n    assert ''id'' in order\n\n    # Get approval URL\n    approval_url = next((link[''href''] for link in order[''links''] if link[''rel''] == ''approve''), None)\n    assert approval_url is not None\n\n    # After approval (manual step with test account)\n    # Capture order\n    # captured = client.capture_order(order[''id''])\n    # assert captured[''status''] == ''COMPLETED''\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/express-checkout.md**: Express Checkout implementation guide\n- **references/ipn-handling.md**: IPN verification and processing\n- **references/refund-workflows.md**: Refund handling patterns\n- **references/billing-agreements.md**: Recurring billing setup\n- **assets/paypal-client.py**: Production PayPal client\n- **assets/ipn-processor.py**: IPN webhook processor\n- **assets/recurring-billing.py**: Subscription management\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always Verify IPN**: Never trust IPN without verification\n2. **Idempotent Processing**: Handle duplicate IPN notifications\n3. **Error Handling**: Implement robust error handling\n4. **Logging**: Log all transactions and errors\n5. **Test Thoroughly**: Use sandbox extensively\n6. **Webhook Backup**: Don''t rely solely on client-side callbacks\n7. **Currency Handling**: Always specify currency explicitly\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Not Verifying IPN**: Accepting IPN without verification\n- **Duplicate Processing**: Not checking for duplicate transactions\n- **Wrong Environment**: Mixing sandbox and production URLs/credentials\n- **Missing Webhooks**: Not handling all payment states\n- **Hardcoded Values**: Not making configurable for different environments\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:48:56.557Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for E-commerce Agents needing seamless PayPal payment processing integration, including Express Checkout and recurring billing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝PayPal支付处理集成的电子商务代理，包括Express Checkout和重复计费功能。","ja":"PayPalの支払い処理の統合、Express Checkout、およびリクーリング請求 기능を必要とするECエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Express Checkout 및 반복 결제 기능을 포함하여 무제한 PayPal 결제 처리 통합이 필요한 전자 상거래 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio electrónico que necesitan una integración de procesamiento de pagos de PayPal sin problemas, incluyendo pago Express Checkout y capacidades de facturación recurrente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce électronique ayant besoin d''une intégration de traitement de paiement PayPal sans accroc, y compris la fonctionnalité de paiement Express Checkout et les capacités de facturation récurrente.","de":"Perfekt für E-Commerce-Agents, die eine nahtlose PayPal-Zahlungsverarbeitungsintegration benötigen, einschließlich Express-Checkout und wiederkehrender Abrechnungsfunktionen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comércio Eletrônico que precisam de integração de processamento de pagamento do PayPal sem interrupções, incluindo Checkout Express e capacidades de faturamento recorrente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электронной коммерции, которым необходима бесперебойная интеграция обработки платежей PayPal, включая Express Checkout и возможности регулярного выставления счетов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تجارة إلكترونية تتطلب إعدادات دفع paypal متكاملة بدون انقطاع، بما في ذلك الدفع السريع وتدفقات الفواتير المتكررة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle IPN handling, refund workflows, and secure payment transactions using PayPal''s API, enabling robust e-commerce solutions with Express Checkout and recurring billing protocols.","zh":"赋予代理人使用PayPal的API处理IPN处理、退款工作流程和安全的支付交易的能力，使得Express Checkout和重复计费协议能够实现强大的电子商务解决方案。","ja":"PayPalのAPIを使用して、IPNハンドリング、返金ワークフロー、および安全な支払いトランザクションを処理することで、エージェントをEmpowerし、Express Checkoutとリクーリング請求のプロトコルを使用した堅牢なECソリューションを実現します。","ko":"PayPal의 API를 사용하여 IPN 처리, 환불 워크플로 및 보안 결제 거래를 처리하여 에이전트를 강화하고 Express Checkout 및 반복 결제 프로토콜을 사용한 강력한 전자 상거래 솔루션을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar el manejo de IPN, flujos de trabajo de reembolsos y transacciones de pago seguras utilizando la API de PayPal, lo que permite soluciones de comercio electrónico robustas con protocolos de pago Express Checkout y facturación recurrente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer la gestion des IPN, les flux de travail de remboursement et les transactions de paiement sécurisées à l''aide de l''API PayPal, permettant ainsi des solutions de commerce électronique robustes avec des protocoles de paiement Express Checkout et de facturation récurrente.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, IPN-Handhabung, Erstattungsworkflows und sichere Zahlungstransaktionen mithilfe der PayPal-API zu handhaben, wodurch robuste E-Commerce-Lösungen mit Express-Checkout- und wiederkehrender Abrechnungsprotokollen ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com o manuseio de IPN, fluxos de trabalho de reembolso e transações de pagamento seguras usando a API do PayPal, permitindo soluções de comércio eletrônico robustas com Checkout Express e protocolos de faturamento recorrente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать обработку IPN, рабочие процессы возврата средств и безопасные транзакции платежей с использованием API PayPal, обеспечивающую надежные решения электронной коммерции с Express Checkout и протоколами регулярного выставления счетов.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التعامل مع معالجة إشعارات الدفع الفورية، وعمليات سير العمل لاسترجاع الأموال، والمعاملات المالية الآمنة باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات paypal، مما يتيح حلول تجارة إلكترونية قوية مع الدفع السريع وبروتوكولات الفواتير المتكررة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Express Checkout for streamlined payments","Handling Instant Payment Notifications (IPN) for real-time updates","Managing recurring billing and subscription services"],"zh":["为简化支付实施Express Checkout","处理即时支付通知（IPN）以实现实时更新","管理重复计费和订阅服务"],"ja":["ストリームライン化された支払いのためにExpress Checkoutを実装する","リアルタイムの更新のために即時支払い通知（IPN）を処理する","リクーリング請求およびサブスクリプションサービスを管理する"],"ko":["결제를 간소화하기 위해 Express Checkout을 구현하는 것","실시간 업데이트를 위해 즉시 결제 알림(IPN)을 처리하는 것","반복 결제 및 구독 서비스를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Implementación de Express Checkout para pagos optimizados","Manejo de notificaciones de pago instantáneo (IPN) para actualizaciones en tiempo real","Gestión de facturación recurrente y servicios de suscripción"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre du paiement Express Checkout pour des paiements rationalisés","Gestion des notifications de paiement instantanées (IPN) pour des mises à jour en temps réel","Gestion de la facturation récurrente et des services d''abonnement"],"de":["Implementierung von Express-Checkout für optimierte Zahlungen","Handhabung von Instant Payment Notifications (IPN) für Echtzeit-Updates","Verwaltung von wiederkehrender Abrechnung und Abonnementservices"],"pt":["Implementação do Checkout Express para pagamentos simplificados","Manipulação de Notificações de Pagamento Instantâneas (IPN) para atualizações em tempo real","Gerenciamento de faturamento recorrente e serviços de assinatura"],"ru":["Реализация Express Checkout для упрощенных платежей","Обработка уведомлений об мгновенных платежах (IPN) для обновлений в реальном времени","Управление регулярным выставлением счетов и услугами подписки"],"ar":["تنفيذ الدفع السريع لعمليات دفع مبسطة","معالجة إشعارات الدفع الفوري (IPN) لتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي","إدارة الفواتير المتكررة وخدمات الاشتراك"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PayPal API credentials","Limited to PayPal payment integration only"],"zh":["需要PayPal API凭证","仅限PayPal支付集成"],"ja":["PayPal APIの資格情報が必要","PayPal支払い統合のみに限定"],"ko":["PayPal API 자격 증명이 필요함","PayPal 결제 통합만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere credenciales de API de PayPal","Limitado solo a la integración de pago de PayPal"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations d''identification d''API PayPal","Limité à l''intégration de paiement PayPal uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt PayPal-API-Zugangsdaten","Begrenzt auf die PayPal-Zahlungsintegration nur"],"pt":["Exige credenciais de API do PayPal","Limitado apenas à integração de pagamento do PayPal"],"ru":["Требует учетных данных API PayPal","Ограничен только интеграцией платежей PayPal"],"ar":["يتطلب أوراق اعتبار واجهة برمجة تطبيقات paypal","محدود فقط بتكامل دفع paypal"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vorluno/Vorluno-Planilla/clean-architecture', 'community', 'vorluno', 'Vorluno-Planilla', 'vorluno/Vorluno-Planilla', 'clean-architecture', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z', '2026-02-18T09:49:17.473Z', NULL, '{"id":"vorluno/Vorluno-Planilla/clean-architecture","name":"clean-architecture","description":{"es":"La Arquitectura Limpia es un patrón de diseño que separa las preocupaciones en capas distintas con dependencias hacia el interior","fr":"L''Architecture Propre est un modèle de conception qui sépare les préoccupations en couches distinctes avec des dépendances vers l''intérieur","de":"Die Clean Architecture ist ein Entwurfsmuster, das die Besorgnisse in separate Schichten mit Abhängigkeiten nach innen unterteilt","pt":"A Arquitetura Limpa é um padrão de design de software que separa as preocupações em camadas distintas, permitindo uma maior flexibilidade e manutenção","ru":"Чистая Архитектура - это шаблон проектирования программного обеспечения, который разделяет проблемы на отдельные слои, обеспечивая большую гибкость и обслуживание","ar":"هندسة النظافة هي نمط تصميم برنامج يفصل الاهتمامات إلى طبقات منفصلة، مما يسمح بمرونة أكبر وصيانة","en":"🏢 Sistema empresarial de gestión de nómina para Panamá | Cumplimiento total CSS, Seguro Educativo e ISR | Clean Architecture con .NET 9 + React 19 | VOR-PLAN"},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Arquitectura Limpia para Desarrolladores","fr":"Architecture Propre pour les Développeurs","de":"Clean Architecture für Entwickler","pt":"Arquitetura Limpa para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Чистая Архитектура для Разработчиков","ar":"هندسة نظيفة للمطورين","en":"clean-architecture"},"description":{"es":"La Arquitectura Limpia es un patrón de diseño que separa las preocupaciones en capas distintas con dependencias hacia el interior","fr":"L''Architecture Propre est un modèle de conception qui sépare les préoccupations en couches distinctes avec des dépendances vers l''intérieur","de":"Die Clean Architecture ist ein Entwurfsmuster, das die Besorgnisse in separate Schichten mit Abhängigkeiten nach innen unterteilt","pt":"A Arquitetura Limpa é um padrão de design de software que separa as preocupações em camadas distintas, permitindo uma maior flexibilidade e manutenção","ru":"Чистая Архитектура - это шаблон проектирования программного обеспечения, который разделяет проблемы на отдельные слои, обеспечивая большую гибкость и обслужи...","ar":"هندسة النظافة هي نمط تصميم برنامج يفصل الاهتمامات إلى طبقات منفصلة، مما يسمح بمرونة أكبر وصيانة","en":"🏢 Sistema empresarial de gestión de nómina para Panamá | Cumplimiento total CSS, Seguro Educativo e ISR | Clean Architecture con .NET 9 + React 19 | VOR-PLAN"},"definition":{"en":"🏢 Sistema empresarial de gestión de nómina para Panamá | Cumplimiento total CSS, Seguro Educativo e ISR | Clean Architecture con .NET 9 + React 19 | VOR-PLAN"},"features":{"es":["Separación de preocupaciones en capas","Dependencias hacia el interior","Lógica de negocio en la capa de dominio","Uso de casos y lógica de aplicación en la capa de aplicación","Infraestructura en la capa de infraestructura","Interfaz de usuario en la capa de presentación"],"fr":["Séparation des préoccupations en couches","Dépendances vers l''intérieur","Logique métier dans la couche de domaine","Cas d''utilisation et logique d''application dans la couche d''application","Infrastructure dans la couche d''infrastructure","Interface utilisateur dans la couche de présentation"],"de":["Trennung von Besorgnissen in Schichten","Abhängigkeiten nach innen","Geschäftslogik in der Domänen-Schicht","Anwendungslogik und Anwendungsfälle in der Anwendungs-Schicht","Infrastruktur in der Infrastruktur-Schicht","Benutzeroberfläche in der Präsentations-Schicht"],"pt":["Separação de preocupações em camadas distintas","Permite uma maior flexibilidade e manutenção","Compatível com .NET e React","Melhora a organização e a estrutura do código","Reduz a complexidade e os erros"],"ru":["Разделение проблем на отдельные слои","Обеспечивает большую гибкость и обслуживание","Совместим с .NET и React","Улучшает организацию и структуру кода","Снижает сложность и ошибки"],"ar":["فصل الاهتمامات إلى طبقات منفصلة","يسمح بمرونة أكبر وصيانة","متوافق مع .NET و React","يحسن تنظيم و结构 الكود","يقلل من التعقيد والأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"es":["Arquitectura Limpia","Desarrollo de software","Patrón de diseño","Separación de preocupaciones","Capas de software","Lógica de negocio","Infraestructura","Interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Architecture Propre","Développement de logiciels","Modèle de conception","Séparation des préoccupations","Couches de logiciels","Logique métier","Infrastructure","Interface utilisateur"],"de":["Clean Architecture","Software-Entwicklung","Entwurfsmuster","Trennung von Besorgnissen","Schichten von Software","Geschäftslogik","Infrastruktur","Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Arquitetura Limpa","Desenvolvimento de software","Padrão de design","Camadas de software","Flexibilidade e manutenção","NET","React"],"ru":["Чистая Архитектура","Разработка программного обеспечения","Шаблон проектирования","Слои программного обеспечения","Гибкость и обслуживание","NET","React"],"ar":["هندسة النظافة","تطوير البرمجيات","نمط تصميم","طبقات البرمجيات","مرونة وصيانة","NET","React"]}},"owner":"vorluno","repo":"Vorluno-Planilla","repoPath":"vorluno/Vorluno-Planilla","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clean-architecture","description":"Guidelines for implementing Clean Architecture patterns in Flutter and Go applications, with emphasis on separation of concerns, dependency rules, and testability.","bodyPreview":"# Clean Architecture\n\nYou are an expert in Clean Architecture patterns for application development.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nClean Architecture enforces separation of concerns through distinct layers with dependencies pointing inward:\n\n1. **Domain Layer** (innermost) - Business logic and entities\n2. **Application Layer** - Use cases and application-specific logic\n3. **Infrastructure Layer** - External concerns (databases, APIs, frameworks)\n4. **Presentation Layer** (outermost) - UI and user interact","body":"# Clean Architecture\n\nYou are an expert in Clean Architecture patterns for application development.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nClean Architecture enforces separation of concerns through distinct layers with dependencies pointing inward:\n\n1. **Domain Layer** (innermost) - Business logic and entities\n2. **Application Layer** - Use cases and application-specific logic\n3. **Infrastructure Layer** - External concerns (databases, APIs, frameworks)\n4. **Presentation Layer** (outermost) - UI and user interaction\n\nThe fundamental rule: inner layers must never depend on outer layers.\n\n## Flutter + Clean Architecture\n\n### Architecture Layers\n- **Presentation**: Widgets, BLoCs, and UI components\n- **Domain**: Entities, use cases, and repository interfaces\n- **Data**: Repository implementations, data sources, and models\n\n### Feature-first Organization\n```\nfeature/\n  data/\n    datasources/\n    models/\n    repositories/\n  domain/\n    entities/\n    repositories/\n    usecases/\n  presentation/\n    bloc/\n    pages/\n    widgets/\n```\n\n### State Management with flutter_bloc\n- Use flutter_bloc for state management\n- Implement immutable states via Freezed\n- Handle events and states with proper patterns\n- Keep BLoCs focused on single responsibilities\n\n### Error Handling\n- Implement Either<Failure, Success> pattern from Dartz\n- Use functional error handling without exceptions\n- Define clear Failure types for different error scenarios\n\n### Key Libraries\n- `flutter_bloc` - State management\n- `freezed` - Immutable classes and unions\n- `get_it` - Service locator for DI\n- `dartz` - Functional programming utilities\n\n## Go Backend Clean Architecture\n\n### Layer Separation\n- **Handlers** - HTTP/gRPC request handling\n- **Services** - Business logic and use cases\n- **Repositories** - Data access abstractions\n- **Domain Models** - Core business entities\n\n### Interface-driven Development\n- Define interfaces for all dependencies\n- Implement dependency injection through constructors\n- Keep interfaces small and focused\n- Allow easy mocking for tests\n\n### Project Structure\n```\nproject/\n  cmd/              # Application entry points\n  internal/\n    domain/         # Business entities and interfaces\n    service/        # Business logic implementation\n    repository/     # Data access implementation\n    handler/        # HTTP/gRPC handlers\n  pkg/              # Shared utilities\n```\n\n### Testing Strategy\n- Write table-driven unit tests with mocks\n- Separate fast unit tests from integration tests\n- Use interfaces to inject test doubles\n- Achieve high coverage of business logic\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:49:17.473Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing to implement scalable and maintainable software systems using Clean Architecture patterns with .NET and React","zh":"非常适合需要使用Clean Architecture模式和.NET以及React实现可扩展和可维护的软件系统的全栈代理","ja":"Clean Architectureパターンと.NETおよびReactを使用してスケーラブルでメンテナンス可能なソフトウェアシステムを実装する必要があるフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"Clean Architecture 패턴 및 .NET 및 React를 사용하여 확장 가능하고 유지 보수 가능한 소프트웨어 시스템을 구현해야 하는 풀 스택 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full-Stack que necesitan implementar sistemas de software escalables y mantenibles utilizando patrones de Arquitectura Limpia con .NET y React","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack ayant besoin de mettre en œuvre des systèmes de logiciels évolutifs et maintenables en utilisant des modèles d''Architecture Propre avec .NET et React","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agenten, die skalierbare und wartbare Software-Systeme unter Verwendung von Clean-Architecture-Mustern mit .NET und React implementieren müssen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Full-Stack que precisam implementar sistemas de software escaláveis e mantenedores usando padrões de Arquitetura Limpa com .NET e React","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов, которым необходимо реализовать масштабируемые и поддерживаемые программные системы с использованием шаблонов Чистой Архитектуры и .NET и React","ar":"مثالي لعميل.Full-Stack الذي يحتاج إلى تنفيذ أنظمة برمجية قابلة للتوسيع وقابلة للصيانة باستخدام أنماط هندسة نظيفة مع .NET و React"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce separation of concerns through distinct layers with dependencies pointing inward, utilizing Domain Layer for business logic, Application Layer for use cases, Infrastructure Layer for external concerns like databases and APIs, and Presentation Layer for UI, all while leveraging .NET 9 and React 19 for robust application development","zh":"赋予代理人通过不同的层次实现关注点分离的能力，依赖关系指向内部，利用领域层进行业务逻辑，应用层进行用例，基础设施层进行外部关注点如数据库和API，表现层进行UI，同时利用.NET 9和React 19进行强大的应用程序开发","ja":"エージェントに、依存関係が内部を向く異なるレイヤーを通じて、関心の分離を実施する能力を付与します。ドメインレイヤーをビジネスロジックに、応用レイヤーをユースケースに、インフラストラクチャレイヤーを外部の関心事 such as データベースとAPIに、プレゼンテーションレイヤーをUIに使用します。また、.NET 9とReact 19を使用して堅牢なアプリケーション開発を実現します","ko":"에이전트에게 내부로指向하는 별도의 계층을 통해 관심사 분리를 강제하는 기능을 부여합니다. 도메인 계층을 비즈니스 논리에, 애플리케이션 계층을 사용 사례에, 인프라스트ラク처 계층을 외부 관심사 such as 데이터베이스 및 API에, 프레젠테이션 계층을 UI에 사용합니다. 또한 .NET 9 및 React 19를 사용하여 강력한 애플리케이션 개발을 구현합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes hacer cumplir la separación de preocupaciones a través de capas distintas con dependencias que apuntan hacia el interior, utilizando la Capa de Dominio para la lógica empresarial, la Capa de Aplicación para los casos de uso, la Capa de Infraestructura para preocupaciones externas como bases de datos y API, y la Capa de Presentación para la interfaz de usuario, todo mientras se aprovechan .NET 9 y React 19 para un desarrollo de aplicaciones robusto","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter la séparation des préoccupations à travers des couches distinctes avec des dépendances pointant vers l''intérieur, en utilisant la Couche de Domaine pour la logique métier, la Couche d''Application pour les cas d''utilisation, la Couche d''Infrastructure pour les préoccupations externes comme les bases de données et les API, et la Couche de Présentation pour l''interface utilisateur, le tout en exploitant .NET 9 et React 19 pour un développement d''applications robuste","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Trennung von Bedenken durch separate Schichten mit Abhängigkeiten, die nach innen zeigen, durchzusetzen, indem sie die Domänen-Schicht für die Geschäftslogik, die Anwendungs-Schicht für Anwendungsfälle, die Infrastruktur-Schicht für externe Belange wie Datenbanken und APIs und die Präsentations-Schicht für die Benutzeroberfläche verwenden, all dies unter Ausnutzung von .NET 9 und React 19 für eine robuste Anwendungsentwicklung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar a separação de preocupações por meio de camadas distintas com dependências apontando para dentro, utilizando a Camada de Domínio para lógica de negócios, a Camada de Aplicação para casos de uso, a Camada de Infraestrutura para preocupações externas como bancos de dados e APIs e a Camada de Apresentação para interface do usuário, tudo isso aproveitando .NET 9 e React 19 para desenvolvimento de aplicativos robustos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить разделение проблем через отдельные слои с зависимостями, указывающими внутрь, используя Слой Домена для бизнес-логики, Слой Приложения для случаев использования, Слой Инфраструктуры для внешних проблем, таких как базы данных и API, и Слой Презентации для пользовательского интерфейса, все это при использовании .NET 9 и React 19 для разработки надежных приложений","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تطبيق فصل الاهتمامات من خلال طبقات متميزة ذات závisимости موجهة إلى الداخل، باستخدام طبقة النطاق لمنطق الأعمال، وطبقة التطبيق لحالات الاستخدام، وطبقة البنية التحتية للقضايا الخارجية مثل قواعد البيانات وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات، وطبقة العرض لواجهة المستخدم، كل ذلك بالاستفادة من .NET 9 و React 19 لتطوير تطبيقات قوية"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing modular enterprise applications","Implementing separation of concerns in complex systems","Developing scalable payroll management systems with Clean Architecture"],"zh":["设计模块化企业应用程序","在复杂系统中实现关注点分离","使用Clean Architecture开发可扩展的工资管理系统"],"ja":["モジュラー企業アプリケーションの設計","複雑なシステムでの関心の分離の実施","Clean Architectureを使用したスケーラブルな給与管理システムの開発"],"ko":["모듈형 엔터프라이즈 애플리케이션 설계","복잡한 시스템에서 관심사 분리 구현","Clean Architecture를 사용한 확장 가능한 급여 관리 시스템 개발"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones empresariales modulares","Implementar la separación de preocupaciones en sistemas complejos","Desarrollar sistemas de gestión de nómina escalables con Arquitectura Limpia"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications d''entreprise modulaires","Mettre en œuvre la séparation des préoccupations dans des systèmes complexes","Développer des systèmes de gestion de paie évolutifs avec Architecture Propre"],"de":["Entwicklung modularer Unternehmensanwendungen","Implementierung der Trennung von Bedenken in komplexen Systemen","Entwicklung skalierbarer Lohnverwaltungssysteme mit Clean Architecture"],"pt":["Projeto de aplicações empresariais modulares","Implementação da separação de preocupações em sistemas complexos","Desenvolvimento de sistemas de gestão de folha de pagamento escaláveis com Arquitetura Limpa"],"ru":["Проектирование модульных корпоративных приложений","Реализация разделения проблем в сложных системах","Разработка масштабируемых систем управления зарплатой с Чистой Архитектурой"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات مؤسسية قابلة للتوسيع","تنفيذ فصل الاهتمامات في النظم المعقدة","تطوير أنظمة إدارة الرواتب القابلة للتوسيع مع هندسة نظيفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET 9 and React 19 compatibility","Dependent on specific infrastructure and presentation layer technologies"],"zh":[".NET 9和React 19兼容性要求","依赖于特定的基础设施和表现层技术"],"ja":[".NET 9およびReact 19の互換性要件","特定のインフラストラクチャおよびプレゼンテーションレイヤー技術への依存"],"ko":[".NET 9 및 React 19 호환성 요구 사항","특정 인프라 및 프레젠테이션 계층 기술 зависимости"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con .NET 9 y React 19","Depende de tecnologías de capa de infraestructura y presentación específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec .NET 9 et React 19","Dépend de technologies de couche d''infrastructure et de présentation spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit .NET 9 und React 19","Hängt von spezifischen Infrastruktur- und Präsentationstechnologien ab"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com .NET 9 e React 19","Depende de tecnologias de infraestrutura e apresentação específicas"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с .NET 9 и React 19","Зависит от конкретных технологий инфраструктуры и представления"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع .NET 9 و React 19","يعتمد على تقنيات بنية تحتية وعرض محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jackychenlu/skill-demo/frontend-patterns', 'community', 'jackychenlu', 'skill-demo', 'jackychenlu/skill-demo', 'frontend-patterns', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z', '2026-02-18T09:48:56.522Z', NULL, '{"id":"jackychenlu/skill-demo/frontend-patterns","name":"frontend-patterns","description":{"zh":"现代前端开发模式是指一系列的设计原则和最佳实践，用于构建高性能、可维护和可扩展的前端应用","ja":"モダンフロントエンド開発パターンは、高速なパフォーマンス、メンテナンス性、拡張性を持つフロントエンドアプリケーションを構築するための設計原則とベストプラクティス","ko":"최신 프론트엔드 개발 패턴은 고성능, 유지 보수 및 확장 가능한 프론트엔드 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 설계 원칙 및 모범 사례","es":"Patrones de desarrollo frontend para crear interfaces de usuario performantes con React y Next.js","fr":"Modèles de développement frontend pour créer des interfaces utilisateur performantes avec React et Next.js","de":"Frontend-Entwicklungs-Muster für die Erstellung von performanten Benutzeroberflächen mit React und Next.js","pt":"Padrões de frontend modernos para React, Next.js e interfaces de usuário performáticas. Aprenda a melhorar suas habilidades de desenvolvimento web.","ru":"Современные фронтенд-шаблоны для React, Next.js и производительных пользовательских интерфейсов. Узнайте, как улучшить свои навыки веб-разработки.","ar":"نماذج واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الحديثة ل React و Next.js وواجهات المستخدم عالية الأداء. تعلم كيف تحسين مهاراتك في تطوير الويب.","en":"skill-demo"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"前端开发模式-React、Next.js最佳实践","ja":"フロントエンド開発パターン-React、Next.jsのベストプラクティス","ko":"프론트엔드 개발 패턴-React, Next.js를 위한 모던 프론트엔드 개발","es":"Patrones de Desarrollo Frontend","fr":"Modèles de Développement Frontend","de":"Frontend-Entwicklungs-Muster","pt":"Padrões de Frontend para React e Next.js","ru":"Фронтенд-шаблоны для React и Next.js","ar":"نماذج واجهة المستخدم الأمامية ل React و Next.js","en":"frontend-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"现代前端开发模式是指一系列的设计原则和最佳实践，用于构建高性能、可维护和可扩展的前端应用","ja":"モダンフロントエンド開発パターンは、高速なパフォーマンス、メンテナンス性、拡張性を持つフロントエンドアプリケーションを構築するための設計原則とベストプラクティス","ko":"최신 프론트엔드 개발 패턴은 고성능, 유지 보수 및 확장 가능한 프론트엔드 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 설계 원칙 및 모범 사례","es":"Patrones de desarrollo frontend para crear interfaces de usuario performantes con React y Next.js","fr":"Modèles de développement frontend pour créer des interfaces utilisateur performantes avec React et Next.js","de":"Frontend-Entwicklungs-Muster für die Erstellung von performanten Benutzeroberflächen mit React und Next.js","pt":"Padrões de frontend modernos para React, Next.js e interfaces de usuário performáticas. Aprenda a melhorar suas habilidades de desenvolvimento web.","ru":"Современные фронтенд-шаблоны для React, Next.js и производительных пользовательских интерфейсов. Узнайте, как улучшить свои навыки веб-разработки.","ar":"نماذج واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الحديثة ل React و Next.js وواجهات المستخدم عالية الأداء. تعلم كيف تحسين مهاراتك في تطوير الويب.","en":"skill-demo"},"definition":{"en":"skill-demo"},"features":{"zh":["组件组合模式","React和Next.js的最佳实践","高性能和可维护的前端应用","可扩展和灵活的组件设计","用户体验优化"],"ja":["コンポーネントの組み合わせパターン","ReactとNext.jsのベストプラクティス","高速なパフォーマンスとメンテナンス性のあるフロントエンドアプリ","拡張性と柔軟性のあるコンポーネント設計","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化"],"ko":["컴포넌트 구성 패턴","React와 Next.js를 위한 모범 사례","고성능 및 유지 보수 가능한 프론트엔드 애플리케이션","확장 가능하고 유연한 컴포넌트 설계","사용자 경험 최적화"],"es":["Componentes reutilizables","Patrones de composición","Interfaces de usuario performantes","Soporte para React y Next.js","Código TypeScript"],"fr":["Composants réutilisables","Modèles de composition","Interfaces utilisateur performantes","Prise en charge de React et Next.js","Code TypeScript"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare Komponenten","Kompositions-Muster","Performante Benutzeroberflächen","Unterstützung für React und Next.js","TypeScript-Code"],"pt":["Componentes reutilizáveis","Padrões de composição","Interfaces de usuário performáticas","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos web escaláveis","Técnicas de otimização de rendimento"],"ru":["Многократно используемые компоненты","Шаблоны композиции","Производительные пользовательские интерфейсы","Разработка масштабируемых веб-приложений","Техники оптимизации производительности"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","نماذج التكوين","واجهات المستخدم عالية الأداء","تطوير تطبيقات الويب القابلة للتوسيع","تقنيات تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端开发模式","React","Next.js","组件组合","高性能","可维护","用户体验优化"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発パターン","React","Next.js","コンポーネントの組み合わせ","高速なパフォーマンス","メンテナンス性","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발 패턴","React","Next.js","컴포넌트 구성","고성능","유지 보수","사용자 경험 최적화"],"es":["patrones de desarrollo frontend","react","next.js","interfaces de usuario performantes","componentes reutilizables","typescript"],"fr":["modèles de développement frontend","react","next.js","interfaces utilisateur performantes","composants réutilisables","typescript"],"de":["frontend-entwicklungs-muster","react","next.js","performante benutzeroberflächen","wiederverwendbare komponenten","typescript"],"pt":["padrões de frontend","react","next.js","desenvolvimento web","interfaces de usuário","performáticas","escaláveis","componentes reutilizáveis"],"ru":["фронтенд-шаблоны","react","next.js","веб-разработка","пользовательские интерфейсы","производительные","масштабируемые","многократно используемые компоненты"],"ar":["نماذج واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","react","next.js","تطوير الويب","واجهات المستخدم","عالية الأداء","قابلة للتوسيع","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]}},"owner":"jackychenlu","repo":"skill-demo","repoPath":"jackychenlu/skill-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-patterns","description":"Frontend development patterns for React, Next.js, state management, performance optimization, and UI best practices.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Development Patterns\n\nModern frontend patterns for React, Next.js, and performant user interfaces.\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Composition Over Inheritance\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Component composition\ninterface CardProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  variant?: ''default'' | ''outlined''\n}\n\nexport function Card({ children, variant = ''default'' }: CardProps) {\n  return <div className={`card card-${variant}`}>{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardHeader({ children }: { children: React.","body":"# Frontend Development Patterns\n\nModern frontend patterns for React, Next.js, and performant user interfaces.\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Composition Over Inheritance\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Component composition\ninterface CardProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  variant?: ''default'' | ''outlined''\n}\n\nexport function Card({ children, variant = ''default'' }: CardProps) {\n  return <div className={`card card-${variant}`}>{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardHeader({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"card-header\">{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardBody({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"card-body\">{children}</div>\n}\n\n// Usage\n<Card>\n  <CardHeader>Title</CardHeader>\n  <CardBody>Content</CardBody>\n</Card>\n```\n\n### Compound Components\n\n```typescript\ninterface TabsContextValue {\n  activeTab: string\n  setActiveTab: (tab: string) => void\n}\n\nconst TabsContext = createContext<TabsContextValue | undefined>(undefined)\n\nexport function Tabs({ children, defaultTab }: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  defaultTab: string\n}) {\n  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState(defaultTab)\n\n  return (\n    <TabsContext.Provider value={{ activeTab, setActiveTab }}>\n      {children}\n    </TabsContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function TabList({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"tab-list\">{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function Tab({ id, children }: { id: string, children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const context = useContext(TabsContext)\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''Tab must be used within Tabs'')\n\n  return (\n    <button\n      className={context.activeTab === id ? ''active'' : ''''}\n      onClick={() => context.setActiveTab(id)}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </button>\n  )\n}\n\n// Usage\n<Tabs defaultTab=\"overview\">\n  <TabList>\n    <Tab id=\"overview\">Overview</Tab>\n    <Tab id=\"details\">Details</Tab>\n  </TabList>\n</Tabs>\n```\n\n### Render Props Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface DataLoaderProps<T> {\n  url: string\n  children: (data: T | null, loading: boolean, error: Error | null) => React.ReactNode\n}\n\nexport function DataLoader<T>({ url, children }: DataLoaderProps<T>) {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<T | null>(null)\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true)\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetch(url)\n      .then(res => res.json())\n      .then(setData)\n      .catch(setError)\n      .finally(() => setLoading(false))\n  }, [url])\n\n  return <>{children(data, loading, error)}</>\n}\n\n// Usage\n<DataLoader<Market[]> url=\"/api/markets\">\n  {(markets, loading, error) => {\n    if (loading) return <Spinner />\n    if (error) return <Error error={error} />\n    return <MarketList markets={markets!} />\n  }}\n</DataLoader>\n```\n\n## Custom Hooks Patterns\n\n### State Management Hook\n\n```typescript\nexport function useToggle(initialValue = false): [boolean, () => void] {\n  const [value, setValue] = useState(initialValue)\n\n  const toggle = useCallback(() => {\n    setValue(v => !v)\n  }, [])\n\n  return [value, toggle]\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst [isOpen, toggleOpen] = useToggle()\n```\n\n### Async Data Fetching Hook\n\n```typescript\ninterface UseQueryOptions<T> {\n  onSuccess?: (data: T) => void\n  onError?: (error: Error) => void\n  enabled?: boolean\n}\n\nexport function useQuery<T>(\n  key: string,\n  fetcher: () => Promise<T>,\n  options?: UseQueryOptions<T>\n) {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<T | null>(null)\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null)\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false)\n\n  const refetch = useCallback(async () => {\n    setLoading(true)\n    setError(null)\n\n    try {\n      const result = await fetcher()\n      setData(result)\n      options?.onSuccess?.(result)\n    } catch (err) {\n      const error = err as Error\n      setError(error)\n      options?.onError?.(error)\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(false)\n    }\n  }, [fetcher, options])\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (options?.enabled !== false) {\n      refetch()\n    }\n  }, [key, refetch, options?.enabled])\n\n  return { data, error, loading, refetch }\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst { data: markets, loading, error, refetch } = useQuery(\n  ''markets'',\n  () => fetch(''/api/markets'').then(r => r.json()),\n  {\n    onSuccess: data => console.log(''Fetched'', data.length, ''markets''),\n    onError: err => console.error(''Failed:'', err)\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### Debounce Hook\n\n```typescript\nexport function useDebounce<T>(value: T, delay: number): T {\n  const [debouncedValue, setDebouncedValue] = useState<T>(value)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handler = setTimeout(() => {\n      setDebouncedValue(value)\n    }, delay)\n\n    return () => clearTimeout(handler)\n  }, [value, delay])\n\n  return debouncedValue\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst [searchQuery, setSearchQuery] = useState('''')\nconst debouncedQuery = useDebounce(searchQuery, 500)\n\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (debouncedQuery) {\n    performSearch(debouncedQuery)\n  }\n}, [debouncedQuery])\n```\n\n## State Management Patterns\n\n### Context + Reducer Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface State {\n  markets: Market[]\n  selectedMarket: Market | null\n  loading: boolean\n}\n\ntype Action =\n  | { type: ''SET_MARKETS''; payload: Market[] }\n  | { type: ''SELECT_MARKET''; payload: Market }\n  | { type: ''SET_LOADING''; payload: boolean }\n\nfunction reducer(state: State, action: Action): State {\n  switch (action.type) {\n    case ''SET_MARKETS'':\n      return { ...state, markets: action.payload }\n    case ''SELECT_MARKET'':\n      return { ...state, selectedMarket: action.payload }\n    case ''SET_LOADING'':\n      return { ...state, loading: action.payload }\n    default:\n      return state\n  }\n}\n\nconst MarketContext = createContext<{\n  state: State\n  dispatch: Dispatch<Action>\n} | undefined>(undefined)\n\nexport function MarketProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const [state, dispatch] = useReducer(reducer, {\n    markets: [],\n    selectedMarket: null,\n    loading: false\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <MarketContext.Provider value={{ state, dispatch }}>\n      {children}\n    </MarketContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function useMarkets() {\n  const context = useContext(MarketContext)\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''useMarkets must be used within MarketProvider'')\n  return context\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Memoization\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ useMemo for expensive computations\nconst sortedMarkets = useMemo(() => {\n  return markets.sort((a, b) => b.volume - a.volume)\n}, [markets])\n\n// ✅ useCallback for functions passed to children\nconst handleSearch = useCallback((query: string) => {\n  setSearchQuery(query)\n}, [])\n\n// ✅ React.memo for pure components\nexport const MarketCard = React.memo<MarketCardProps>(({ market }) => {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"market-card\">\n      <h3>{market.name}</h3>\n      <p>{market.description}</p>\n    </div>\n  )\n})\n```\n\n### Code Splitting & Lazy Loading\n\n```typescript\nimport { lazy, Suspense } from ''react''\n\n// ✅ Lazy load heavy components\nconst HeavyChart = lazy(() => import(''./HeavyChart''))\nconst ThreeJsBackground = lazy(() => import(''./ThreeJsBackground''))\n\nexport function Dashboard() {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Suspense fallback={<ChartSkeleton />}>\n        <HeavyChart data={data} />\n      </Suspense>\n\n      <Suspense fallback={null}>\n        <ThreeJsBackground />\n      </Suspense>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Virtualization for Long Lists\n\n```typescript\nimport { useVirtualizer } from ''@tanstack/react-virtual''\n\nexport function VirtualMarketList({ markets }: { markets: Market[] }) {\n  const parentRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null)\n\n  const virtualizer = useVirtualizer({\n    count: markets.length,\n    getScrollElement: () => parentRef.current,\n    estimateSize: () => 100,  // Estimated row height\n    overscan: 5  // Extra items to render\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div ref={parentRef} style={{ height: ''600px'', overflow: ''auto'' }}>\n      <div\n        style={{\n          height: `${virtualizer.getTotalSize()}px`,\n          position: ''relative''\n        }}\n      >\n        {virtualizer.getVirtualItems().map(virtualRow => (\n          <div\n            key={virtualRow.index}\n            style={{\n              position: ''absolute'',\n              top: 0,\n              left: 0,\n              width: ''100%'',\n              height: `${virtualRow.size}px`,\n              transform: `translateY(${virtualRow.start}px)`\n            }}\n          >\n            <MarketCard market={markets[virtualRow.index]} />\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Form Handling Patterns\n\n### Controlled Form with Validation\n\n```typescript\ninterface FormData {\n  name: string\n  description: string\n  endDate: string\n}\n\ninterface FormErrors {\n  name?: string\n  description?: string\n  endDate?: string\n}\n\nexport function CreateMarketForm() {\n  const [formData, setFormData] = useState<FormData>({\n    name: '''',\n    description: '''',\n    endDate: ''''\n  })\n\n  const [errors, setErrors] = useState<FormErrors>({})\n\n  const validate = (): boolean => {\n    const newErrors: FormErrors = {}\n\n    if (!formData.name.trim()) {\n      newErrors.name = ''Name is required''\n    } else if (formData.name.length > 200) {\n      newErrors.name = ''Name must be under 200 characters''\n    }\n\n    if (!formData.description.trim()) {\n      newErrors.description = ''Description is required''\n    }\n\n    if (!formData.endDate) {\n      newErrors.endDate = ''End date is required''\n    }\n\n    setErrors(newErrors)\n    return Object.keys(newErrors).length === 0\n  }\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {\n    e.preventDefault()\n\n    if (!validate()) return\n\n    try {\n      await createMarket(formData)\n      // Success handling\n    } catch (error) {\n      // Error handling\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n      <input\n        value={formData.name}\n        onChange={e => setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, name: e.target.value }))}\n        placeholder=\"Market name\"\n      />\n      {errors.name && <span className=\"error\">{errors.name}</span>}\n\n      {/* Other fields */}\n\n      <button type=\"submit\">Create Market</button>\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Error Boundary Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface ErrorBoundaryState {\n  hasError: boolean\n  error: Error | null\n}\n\nexport class ErrorBoundary extends React.Component<\n  { children: React.ReactNode },\n  ErrorBoundaryState\n> {\n  state: ErrorBoundaryState = {\n    hasError: false,\n    error: null\n  }\n\n  static getDerivedStateFromError(error: Error): ErrorBoundaryState {\n    return { hasError: true, error }\n  }\n\n  componentDidCatch(error: Error, errorInfo: React.ErrorInfo) {\n    console.error(''Error boundary caught:'', error, errorInfo)\n  }\n\n  render() {\n    if (this.state.hasError) {\n      return (\n        <div className=\"error-fallback\">\n          <h2>Something went wrong</h2>\n          <p>{this.state.error?.message}</p>\n          <button onClick={() => this.setState({ hasError: false })}>\n            Try again\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      )\n    }\n\n    return this.props.children\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\n<ErrorBoundary>\n  <App />\n</ErrorBoundary>\n```\n\n## Animation Patterns\n\n### Framer Motion Animations\n\n```typescript\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from ''framer-motion''\n\n// ✅ List animations\nexport function AnimatedMarketList({ markets }: { markets: Market[] }) {\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {markets.map(market => (\n        <motion.div\n          key={market.id}\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\n          animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n          exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.3 }}\n        >\n          <MarketCard market={market} />\n        </motion.div>\n      ))}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  )\n}\n\n// ✅ Modal animations\nexport function Modal({ isOpen, onClose, children }: ModalProps) {\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {isOpen && (\n        <>\n          <motion.div\n            className=\"modal-overlay\"\n            initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n            onClick={onClose}\n          />\n          <motion.div\n            className=\"modal-content\"\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.9, y: 20 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1, y: 0 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.9, y: 20 }}\n          >\n            {children}\n          </motion.div>\n        </>\n      )}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Accessibility Patterns\n\n### Keyboard Navigation\n\n```typescript\nexport function Dropdown({ options, onSelect }: DropdownProps) {\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false)\n  const [activeIndex, setActiveIndex] = useState(0)\n\n  const handleKeyDown = (e: React.KeyboardEvent) => {\n    switch (e.key) {\n      case ''ArrowDown'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        setActiveIndex(i => Math.min(i + 1, options.length - 1))\n        break\n      case ''ArrowUp'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        setActiveIndex(i => Math.max(i - 1, 0))\n        break\n      case ''Enter'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        onSelect(options[activeIndex])\n        setIsOpen(false)\n        break\n      case ''Escape'':\n        setIsOpen(false)\n        break\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      role=\"combobox\"\n      aria-expanded={isOpen}\n      aria-haspopup=\"listbox\"\n      onKeyDown={handleKeyDown}\n    >\n      {/* Dropdown implementation */}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Focus Management\n\n```typescript\nexport function Modal({ isOpen, onClose, children }: ModalProps) {\n  const modalRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null)\n  const previousFocusRef = useRef<HTMLElement | null>(null)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (isOpen) {\n      // Save currently focused element\n      previousFocusRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement\n\n      // Focus modal\n      modalRef.current?.focus()\n    } else {\n      // Restore focus when closing\n      previousFocusRef.current?.focus()\n    }\n  }, [isOpen])\n\n  return isOpen ? (\n    <div\n      ref={modalRef}\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      tabIndex={-1}\n      onKeyDown={e => e.key === ''Escape'' && onClose()}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </div>\n  ) : null\n}\n```\n\n**Remember**: Modern frontend patterns enable maintainable, performant user interfaces. Choose patterns that fit your project complexity."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:48:56.522Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing expertise in modern frontend development patterns for React and Next.js","zh":"非常适合需要在React和Next.js现代前端开发模式上拥有专业知识的UI专注代理","ja":"ReactとNext.jsのモダンなフロントエンド開発パターンに精通する必要があるUIに焦点を当てたエージェントに最適","ko":"React와 Next.js의 현대적 프런트엔드 개발 패턴에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 UI 중심 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes enfocados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan experiencia en patrones de desarrollo de frontend modernos para React y Next.js","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant une expertise dans les modèles de développement de frontend moderne pour React et Next.js","de":"Perfekt für benutzeroberflächengesteuerte Agenten, die Expertenwissen in modernen Frontend-Entwicklungsmustern für React und Next.js benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI que precisam de expertise em padrões de desenvolvimento de frontend modernos para React e Next.js","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым необходимы знания в области современных шаблонов разработки frontend для React и Next.js","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعنيين بواجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى خبرة في أنماط تطوير واجهة المستخدم الحديثة ل React و Next.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft performant user interfaces using composition over inheritance, leveraging TypeScript for type safety and React for component-driven development, while optimizing for variant-based component design","zh":"赋予代理创建高性能用户界面的能力，使用组合代替继承，利用TypeScript实现类型安全，并使用React进行组件驱动开发，同时优化基于变体的组件设计","ja":"エージェントが、組み合わせを継承に代えて使用し、TypeScriptを使用して型の安全性を確保し、Reactを使用してコンポーネント駆動開発を行い、バリアントベースのコンポーネント設計を最適化して、高パフォーマンスのユーザーインターフェイスを作成できるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 합성 대신 상속을 사용하고, TypeScript를 사용하여 유형 안전성을 보장하며, React를 사용하여 컴포넌트 주도 개발을 수행하고, 변형 기반의 컴포넌트 설계를 최적화하여 고성능 사용자 인터페이스를 제작할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces de usuario de alto rendimiento utilizando la composición sobre la herencia, aprovechando TypeScript para la seguridad de tipos y React para el desarrollo de componentes, mientras se optimiza para el diseño de componentes basados en variantes","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces utilisateur performantes en utilisant la composition plutôt que l''héritage, en exploitant TypeScript pour la sécurité des types et React pour le développement de composants, tout en optimisant pour la conception de composants basés sur les variantes","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, leistungsstarke Benutzeroberflächen zu erstellen, indem sie die Zusammensetzung über die Vererbung nutzen, TypeScript für die Typsicherheit und React für die komponentenbasierte Entwicklung verwenden und dabei das variantenbasierte Komponentendesign optimieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces de usuário performáticas usando composição em vez de herança, aproveitando o TypeScript para segurança de tipo e React para desenvolvimento baseado em componentes, enquanto otimiza o design de componentes baseado em variantes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокопроизводительные пользовательские интерфейсы, используя композицию вместо наследования, используя TypeScript для безопасности типов и React для компонентно-ориентированного развития, а также оптимизируя проектирование компонентов на основе вариантов","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء واجهات المستخدم عالية الأداء باستخدام التكوين بدلاً من الوراثة، واستخدام TypeScript لأمان النوع و React لتطوير المكونات، مع تحسين تصميم المكونات القائمة على المتغيرات"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing composition over inheritance for reusable UI components","Optimizing React component performance with efficient rendering techniques","Designing responsive and variant-based user interfaces with Next.js"],"zh":["为可重用UI组件实现组合代替继承","使用高效渲染技术优化React组件性能","使用Next.js设计响应式和变体基于用户界面"],"ja":["再利用可能なUIコンポーネントのための組み合わせを継承に代えて実装する","効率的なレンダリング技術を使用してReactコンポーネントのパフォーマンスを最適化する","Next.jsを使用してレスポンシブでバリアントベースのユーザーインターフェイスを設計する"],"ko":["재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 위한 합성을 상속으로 대체하여 구현","효율적인 렌더링 기술을 사용하여 React 컴포넌트 성능을 최적화","Next.js를 사용하여 반응형 및 변형 기반의 사용자 인터페이스를 설계"],"es":["Implementar la composición sobre la herencia para componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables","Optimizar el rendimiento de los componentes de React con técnicas de representación eficientes","Diseñar interfaces de usuario responsivas y basadas en variantes con Next.js"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la composition plutôt que l''héritage pour des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables","Optimiser les performances des composants React avec des techniques de rendu efficaces","Concevoir des interfaces utilisateur réactives et basées sur les variantes avec Next.js"],"de":["Die Zusammensetzung über die Vererbung für wiederverwendbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten 