ription":{"zh":"本指南帮助您使用现代语法模式生成 Neo4j Cypher 读取查询，避免废弃特性，并专注于图遍历和数据检索的高效查询模式","ja":"このガイドは、モダンなシンタックスパターンを使用してNeo4j Cypherの読み取りクエリを生成し、廃止された機能を回避し、グラフのトラバースとデータの取得のための効率的なクエリパターンに焦点を当てます","ko":"이 가이드는 최신 문법 패턴을 사용하여 Neo4j Cypher 읽기 쿼리를 생성하고废弃된 기능을 피하며, 그래프遍历와 데이터 가져오기의 효율적인 쿼리 패턴에 중점을 둡니다","es":"Esta habilidad ayuda a generar consultas Cypher de Neo4j de lectura utilizando patrones de sintaxis modernos y evitando características obsoletas","fr":"Cette compétence aide à générer des requêtes Cypher Neo4j de lecture en utilisant des modèles de syntaxe modernes et en évitant les fonctionnalités obsolètes","de":"Diese Fähigkeit hilft bei der Generierung von Cypher-Abfragen für Neo4j mit modernen Syntaxmustern und vermeidet veraltete Funktionen","pt":"Este guia ajuda a gerar consultas Cypher de leitura do Neo4j usando padrões de sintaxe moderna e evitando recursos obsoletos","ru":"Это руководство помогает генерировать запросы Cypher для чтения Neo4j, используя современные синтаксические шаблоны и избегая устаревших функций","ar":"يدعم هذا الدليل توليد استفسارات كوبر لقراءة نيو4ج باستخدام أنماط بناء الجملة الحديثة وتجنب الميزات المهجورة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用现代语法模式","避免废弃特性","高效的图遍历查询模式","数据检索的优化","使用 elementId() 代替 id()","使用显式 WITH 子句"],"ja":["モダンなシンタックスパターンの使用","廃止された機能の回避","グラフのトラバースのための効率的なクエリパターン","データの取得のための最適化","elementId() を使用して id() を置き換える","明示的な WITH 子句の使用"],"ko":["최신 문법 패턴 사용","폐기된 기능 피하기","그래프遍历을 위한 효율적인 쿼리 패턴","데이터 가져오기를 위한 최적화","elementId()를 사용하여 id()를 대체","명시적 WITH 절 사용"],"es":["Generación de consultas Cypher de Neo4j con patrones de sintaxis modernos","Evitación de características obsoletas","Patrones de consulta eficientes para el recorrido de grafos y la recuperación de datos","Uso de la función elementId() en lugar de id()","Uso de cláusulas WITH explícitas en lugar de claves de agrupación implícitas","Uso de comprensión de patrones o COLLECT en lugar de expresiones de patrones para listas"],"fr":["Génération de requêtes Cypher Neo4j avec des modèles de syntaxe modernes","Évitement des fonctionnalités obsolètes","Modèles de requête efficaces pour le parcours de graphes et la récupération de données","Utilisation de la fonction elementId() au lieu de id()","Utilisation de clauses WITH explicites au lieu de clés de regroupement implicites","Utilisation de la compréhension de modèles ou COLLECT au lieu d''expressions de modèles pour les listes"],"de":["Generierung von Cypher-Abfragen für Neo4j mit modernen Syntaxmustern","Vermeidung von veralteten Funktionen","Effiziente Abfragepattern für Graph-Traversierung und Datenrückgewinnung","Verwendung der Funktion elementId() anstelle von id()","Verwendung von expliziten WITH-Klauseln anstelle von impliziten Gruppierungsschlüsseln","Verwendung von Pattern-Comprehension oder COLLECT anstelle von Pattern-Ausdrücken für Listen"],"pt":["Geração de consultas Cypher de leitura com sintaxe moderna","Evitação de recursos obsoletos","Padrões de consulta eficientes para travessia de grafos e recuperação de dados","Uso de elementId() em vez de id()","Uso de cláusulas WITH explícitas em vez de chaves de agrupamento implícitas","Uso de compreensão de padrões ou COLLECT em vez de expressões de padrão para listas"],"ru":["Генерация запросов Cypher для чтения с современной синтаксисой","Избегание устаревших функций","Эффективные шаблоны запросов для遍历 графов и извлечения данных","Использование elementId() вместо id()","Использование явных предложений WITH вместо неявных ключей группировки","Использование понимания шаблонов или COLLECT вместо выражений шаблонов для списков"],"ar":["توليد استفسارات كوبر لقراءة مع بناء الجملة الحديثة","تجنب الميزات المهجورة","أنماط استفسار فعالة لتحويل الرسومات واسترجاع البيانات","استخدام elementId() بدلاً من id()","استخدام عبارات WITH الصريحة بدلاً من مفاتيح التجميع غير الصريحة","استخدام فهم الأنماط أو COLLECT بدلاً من تعابير النمط للقوائم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Neo4j Cypher","图形数据库","查询语言","现代语法模式","废弃特性","图遍历","数据检索","elementId","WITH 子句"],"ja":["Neo4j Cypher","グラフデータベース","クエリ言語","モダンなシンタックスパターン","廃止された機能","グラフのトラバース","データの取得","elementId","WITH 子句"],"ko":["Neo4j Cypher","그래프 데이터베이스","쿼리 언어","최신 문법 패턴","폐기된 기능","그래프遍历","데이터 가져오기","elementId","WITH 절"],"es":["neo4j","cypher","consultas cypher","patrones de sintaxis modernos","eficiencia en la consulta","recorrido de grafos","recuperación de datos","elementId","cláusulas WITH","comprensión de patrones"],"fr":["neo4j","cypher","requêtes cypher","modèles de syntaxe modernes","efficacité de la requête","parcours de graphes","récupération de données","elementId","clauses WITH","compréhension de modèles"],"de":["neo4j","cypher","cypher-abfragen","moderne syntaxmuster","abfrageeffizienz","graph-traversierung","datenrückgewinnung","elementId","WITH-Klauseln","Pattern-Comprehension"],"pt":["Neo4j","Cypher","Consulta eficiente","Sintaxe moderna","Recursos obsoletos","Grafos","Recuperação de dados","Desenvolvimento de software","Banco de dados gráfico"],"ru":["Neo4j","Cypher","Эффективный запрос","Современная синтаксиса","Устаревшие функции","Графы","Извлечение данных","Разработка программного обеспечения","Графовая база данных"],"ar":["نيو4ج","كوبر","استفسار فعال","بناء الجملة الحديث","الميزات المهجورة","الرسومات","استرجاع البيانات","تطوير البرمجيات","قاعدة بيانات الرسومات"]}},"owner":"mosabsayyed","repo":"josoorfe","repoPath":"mosabsayyed/josoorfe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"neo4j-cypher-guide","description":"Comprehensive guide for writing modern Neo4j Cypher read queries. Essential for text2cypher MCP tools and LLMs generating Cypher queries. Covers removed/deprecated syntax, modern replacements, CALL subqueries for reads, COLLECT patterns, sorting best practices, and Quantified Path Patterns (QPP) for efficient graph traversal.","bodyPreview":"# Neo4j Modern Cypher Query Guide\n\nThis skill helps generate Neo4j Cypher read queries using modern syntax patterns and avoiding deprecated features. It focuses on efficient query patterns for graph traversal and data retrieval.\n\n## Quick Compatibility Check\n\nWhen generating Cypher queries, immediately avoid these REMOVED features:\n- ❌ `id()` function → Use `elementId()`\n- ❌ Implicit grouping keys → Use explicit WITH clauses\n- ❌ Pattern expressions for lists → Use pattern comprehension or COLLEC","body":"# Neo4j Modern Cypher Query Guide\n\nThis skill helps generate Neo4j Cypher read queries using modern syntax patterns and avoiding deprecated features. It focuses on efficient query patterns for graph traversal and data retrieval.\n\n## Quick Compatibility Check\n\nWhen generating Cypher queries, immediately avoid these REMOVED features:\n- ❌ `id()` function → Use `elementId()`\n- ❌ Implicit grouping keys → Use explicit WITH clauses\n- ❌ Pattern expressions for lists → Use pattern comprehension or COLLECT subqueries\n- ❌ Repeated relationship variables → Use unique variable names\n- ❌ Automatic list to boolean coercion → Use explicit checks\n\n## Core Principles for Query Generation\n\n1. **Use modern syntax patterns** - QPP for complex traversals, CALL subqueries for complex reads\n2. **Optimize during traversal** - Filter early within patterns, not after expansion\n3. **Always filter nulls when sorting** - Add IS NOT NULL checks for sorted properties\n4. **Explicit is better than implicit** - Always use explicit grouping and type checking\n\n## Critical Sorting Rule\n\n**ALWAYS filter NULL values when sorting:**\n```cypher\n// WRONG - May include null values\nMATCH (n:Node)\nRETURN n.name, n.value\nORDER BY n.value\n\n// CORRECT - Filter nulls before sorting\nMATCH (n:Node)\nWHERE n.value IS NOT NULL\nRETURN n.name, n.value\nORDER BY n.value\n```\n\n## Query Pattern Selection Guide\n\n### For Simple Queries\nUse standard Cypher patterns with modern syntax:\n```cypher\nMATCH (n:Label {property: value})\nWHERE n.otherProperty IS :: STRING\nRETURN n\n```\n\n### For Variable-Length Paths\nConsider Quantified Path Patterns (QPP) for better performance:\n```cypher\n// Instead of: MATCH (a)-[*1..5]->(b)\n// Use: MATCH (a)-[]-{1,5}(b)\n\n// With filtering:\nMATCH (a)((n WHERE n.active)-[]->(m)){1,5}(b)\n```\n\n### For Aggregations\nUse COUNT{}, EXISTS{}, and COLLECT{} subqueries:\n```cypher\nMATCH (p:Person)\nWHERE count{(p)-[:KNOWS]->()} > 5\nRETURN p.name, \n       exists{(p)-[:MANAGES]->()} AS isManager\n```\n\n### For Complex Read Operations\nUse CALL subqueries for sophisticated data retrieval:\n```cypher\nMATCH (d:Department)\nCALL (d) {\n  MATCH (d)<-[:WORKS_IN]-(p:Person)\n  WHERE p.salary IS NOT NULL  // Filter nulls\n  WITH p ORDER BY p.salary DESC\n  LIMIT 3\n  RETURN collect(p.name) AS topEarners\n}\nRETURN d.name, topEarners\n```\n\n## Common Query Transformations\n\n### Counting Patterns\n```cypher\n// Old: RETURN size((n)-[]->())\n// Modern: RETURN count{(n)-[]->()}\n```\n\n### Checking Existence\n```cypher\n// Old: WHERE exists((n)-[:REL]->())\n// Modern: WHERE EXISTS {MATCH (n)-[:REL]->()}\n// Also valid: WHERE exists{(n)-[:REL]->()}\n```\n\n### Element IDs\n```cypher\n// Old: WHERE id(n) = 123\n// Modern: WHERE elementId(n) = \"4:abc123:456\"\n// Note: elementId returns a string, not integer\n```\n\n### Sorting with Null Handling\n```cypher\n// Always add null check\nMATCH (n:Node)\nWHERE n.sortProperty IS NOT NULL\nRETURN n\nORDER BY n.sortProperty\n\n// Or use NULLS LAST\nMATCH (n:Node)\nRETURN n\nORDER BY n.sortProperty NULLS LAST\n```\n\n## When to Load Reference Documentation\n\nLoad the appropriate reference file when:\n\n### references/deprecated-syntax.md\n- Migrating queries from older Neo4j versions\n- Encountering syntax errors with legacy queries\n- Need complete list of removed/deprecated features\n\n### references/subqueries.md\n- Working with CALL subqueries for reads\n- Using COLLECT or COUNT subqueries\n- Handling complex aggregations\n- Implementing sorting with null filtering\n\n### references/qpp.md\n- Optimizing variable-length path queries\n- Need early filtering during traversal\n- Working with paths longer than 3-4 hops\n- Complex pattern matching requirements\n\n## Query Generation Checklist\n\nBefore finalizing any generated query:\n\n1. ✅ No deprecated functions (id, btree indexes, etc.)\n2. ✅ Explicit grouping for aggregations\n3. ✅ NULL filters for all sorted properties\n4. ✅ Appropriate subquery patterns for reads\n5. ✅ Consider QPP for paths with filtering needs\n6. ✅ Use COUNT{} instead of size() for pattern counting\n7. ✅ Variable scope clauses in CALL subqueries\n8. ✅ Unique variable names for relationships\n\n## Error Resolution Patterns\n\n### \"Implicit grouping key\" errors\n```cypher\n// Problem: RETURN n.prop, count(*) + n.other\n// Solution: WITH n.prop AS prop, n.other AS other, count(*) AS cnt\n//          RETURN prop, cnt + other\n```\n\n### \"id() function not found\"\n```cypher\n// Use elementId() but note it returns a string, not integer\n```\n\n### \"Repeated variable\" errors\n```cypher\n// Problem: MATCH (a)-[r*]->(), (b)-[r*]->()\n// Solution: MATCH (a)-[r1*]->(), (b)-[r2*]->()\n```\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n1. **Start with indexed properties** - Always anchor patterns with indexed lookups\n2. **Filter early in QPP** - Apply WHERE clauses within the pattern\n3. **Filter nulls before sorting** - Prevent unexpected results and improve performance\n4. **Limit expansion depth** - Use reasonable upper bounds in quantifiers\n5. **Use EXISTS for existence checks** - More efficient than counting\n6. **Profile queries** - Use PROFILE to identify bottlenecks\n\n## Modern Cypher Features\n\n### Label Expressions\n```cypher\nWHERE n:Label1|Label2  // OR\nWHERE n:Label1&Label2  // AND\nWHERE n:!Archived      // NOT\n```\n\n### Type Predicates\n```cypher\nWHERE n.prop IS :: STRING\nWHERE n.value IS :: INTEGER NOT NULL\nWHERE n.data IS :: LIST<STRING>\n```\n\n### Subquery Patterns for Reads\n- COUNT{} - Count patterns efficiently\n- EXISTS{} - Check pattern existence\n- COLLECT{} - Collect complex results\n- CALL{} - Execute subqueries for complex reads\n\n### Quantified Path Patterns\n- Inline filtering during traversal\n- Access to nodes and relationships in patterns\n- Significant performance improvements (up to 1000x)\n- Support for complex, multi-hop patterns\n\nAlways prefer modern syntax patterns for better performance and maintainability.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:49:12.824Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing efficient Neo4j Cypher query generation and graph traversal capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效Neo4j Cypher查询生成和图遍历能力的数据分析代理。","ja":"Neo4j Cypher クエリ生成およびグラフのトラバーサル能力が効率的なデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"효율적인 Neo4j Cypher 쿼리 생성 및 그래프 탐색 기능이 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de datos que necesitan una generación eficiente de consultas Neo4j Cypher y capacidades de travesía de gráficos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données nécessitant une génération efficace de requêtes Neo4j Cypher et des capacités de parcours de graphique.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die eine effiziente Erstellung von Neo4j Cypher-Abfragen und Graph-Traversier-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de geração eficiente de consultas Neo4j Cypher e capacidades de travessia de gráficos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, требующих эффективной генерации запросов Neo4j Cypher и возможностей遍历 графа.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى генера eficiente من استفسارات Neo4j Cypher وقدرات عبور الرسوم البيانية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate modern Neo4j Cypher read queries using efficient syntax patterns, avoiding deprecated features like the `id()` function and implicit grouping keys, while leveraging explicit WITH clauses, pattern comprehension, and COLLECT for robust data retrieval.","zh":"赋予代理生成现代Neo4j Cypher读取查询的能力，使用高效的语法模式，避免过时的特性，如 `id()` 函数和隐式分组键，同时利用显式的WITH子句、模式综合和COLLECT进行强大的数据检索。","ja":"エージェントに効率的な構文パターンを使用して、現代のNeo4j Cypher 読み取りクエリを生成する機能を提供します。`id()` 関数や暗黙のグループ化キーなどの非推奨の機能を避けながら、明示的なWITH子句、パターンコンプレヘンション、COLLECTを利用して堅牢なデータの取得を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 효율적인 구문 패턴을 사용하여 최신 Neo4j Cypher 읽기 쿼리를 생성하도록 하는 기능을 제공합니다. `id()` 함수 및 암시적 그룹화 키와 같은 사용되지 않는 기능을 피하면서도 명시적 WITH 절, 패턴 컴프리헨션 및 COLLECT를 활용하여 강력한 데이터 검색을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar consultas de lectura Neo4j Cypher modernas utilizando patrones de sintaxis eficientes, evitando características obsoletas como la función `id()` y las claves de agrupación implícitas, mientras aprovecha cláusulas WITH explícitas, comprensión de patrones y COLLECT para una recuperación de datos robusta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des requêtes de lecture Neo4j Cypher modernes en utilisant des modèles de syntaxe efficaces, en évitant les fonctionnalités obsolètes comme la fonction `id()` et les clés de regroupement implicites, tout en exploitant des clauses WITH explicites, la compréhension de modèles et COLLECT pour une récupération de données robuste.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, moderne Neo4j Cypher-Leseabfragen mit effizienten Syntaxmustern zu erstellen, veraltete Funktionen wie die `id()`-Funktion und implizite Gruppierungsschlüssel zu vermeiden, während explizite WITH-Klauseln, Musterkomprehension und COLLECT für eine robuste Datenerfassung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar consultas de leitura modernas do Neo4j Cypher usando padrões de sintaxe eficientes, evitando recursos obsoletos como a função `id()` e chaves de agrupamento implícitas, aproveitando cláusulas WITH explícitas, compreensão de padrões e COLLECT para recuperação robusta de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать современные запросы Neo4j Cypher для чтения, используя эффективные синтаксические шаблоны, избегая устаревших функций, таких как функция `id()` и неявные ключи группировки, используя явные предложения WITH, понимание шаблонов и COLLECT для надежного извлечения данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على генера استفسارات قراءة moderne من Neo4j Cypher باستخدام أنماط متقدمة من البنية، وتجنب الميزات المهجورة مثل دالة `id()` والمفاتيح التجميعية الضمنية، واستخدام عبارات WITH الصريحة وفهم الأنماط و COLLECT لاسترجاع البيانات بشكل قوي."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating efficient Cypher queries for graph data retrieval","Avoiding deprecated features in existing Neo4j queries","Optimizing graph traversal patterns for better performance"],"zh":["为图数据检索生成高效的Cypher查询","避免在现有的Neo4j查询中使用过时的特性","优化图遍历模式以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["グラフデータの取得のために効率的なCypherクエリを生成する","既存のNeo4jクエリで非推奨の機能を避ける","パフォーマンスの向上のためにグラフトラバーサルパターンを最適化する"],"ko":["그래프 데이터 검색을 위한 효율적인 Cypher 쿼리 생성","기존 Neo4j 쿼리에서 사용되지 않는 기능 피하기","성능 개선을 위한 그래프 탐색 패턴 최적화"],"es":["Generación de consultas Cypher eficientes para la recuperación de datos de gráficos","Evitación de características obsoletas en consultas Neo4j existentes","Optimización de patrones de travesía de gráficos para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Génération de requêtes Cypher efficaces pour la récupération de données de graphiques","Évitement des fonctionnalités obsolètes dans les requêtes Neo4j existantes","Optimisation des modèles de parcours de graphiques pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Erstellung effizienter Cypher-Abfragen für die Datenerfassung in Graphen","Vermeidung veralteter Funktionen in bestehenden Neo4j-Abfragen","Optimierung von Graph-Traversier-Mustern für bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Geração de consultas Cypher eficientes para recuperação de dados de gráficos","Evitar recursos obsoletos em consultas Neo4j existentes","Otimização de padrões de travessia de gráficos para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Генерация эффективных запросов Cypher для извлечения данных графа","Избежание устаревших функций в существующих запросах Neo4j","Оптимизация шаблонов遍历 графа для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["genera استفسارات Cypher الكفءة لاسترجاع بيانات الرسوم البيانية","تجنب الميزات المهجورة في استفسارات Neo4j الحالية","تحسين أنماط عبور الرسوم البيانية لأداء أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Neo4j Cypher query language","Limited to generating read queries, not write operations","Avoids deprecated features, which may not be suitable for legacy systems"],"zh":["需要了解Neo4j Cypher查询语言","仅限生成读取查询，不支持写操作","避免使用过时的特性，这可能不适合遗留系统"],"ja":["Neo4j Cypher クエリ言語の知識が必要","読み取りクエリの生成のみをサポートし、書き込み操作はサポートしない","非推奨の機能を避けるため、レガシーシステムでは不適切な場合がある"],"ko":["Neo4j Cypher 쿼리 언어에 대한 이해가 필요","읽기 쿼리 생성만 지원하며, 쓰기 작업은 지원하지 않음","사용되지 않는 기능을 피하므로, 레거시 시스템에서는 적합하지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del lenguaje de consulta Neo4j Cypher","Limitado a la generación de consultas de lectura, no operaciones de escritura","Evita características obsoletas, que pueden no ser adecuadas para sistemas heredados"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du langage de requête Neo4j Cypher","Limité à la génération de requêtes de lecture, et non aux opérations d''écriture","Évite les fonctionnalités obsolètes, qui peuvent ne pas être adaptées aux systèmes hérités"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Neo4j Cypher-Abfragesprache","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Leseabfragen, nicht von Schreiboperationen","Vermeidet veraltete Funktionen, die für Legacy-Systeme möglicherweise nicht geeignet sind"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento da linguagem de consulta Neo4j Cypher","Limitado à geração de consultas de leitura, não operações de gravação","Evita recursos obsoletos, que podem não ser adequados para sistemas legados"],"ru":["Требует знания языка запросов Neo4j Cypher","Ограничен генерацией запросов на чтение, не операций записи","Избегает устаревших функций, которые могут быть не подходящими для устаревших систем"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة لغة استفسار Neo4j Cypher","محدود بتوليد استفسارات القراءة، وليس عمليات الكتابة","يتجنب الميزات المهجورة، والتي قد لا تكون مناسبة لأنظمة الإرث"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
