la herramienta de búsqueda de awal. Utiliza el comando `npx awal@latest x402 baza...","fr":"La recherche de services sur x402 permet de trouver des services payants à l''aide de l''outil de recherche awal. Utilisez la commande `npx awal@latest x402 ba...","de":"Die Dienstsuche in x402 ermöglicht die Suche nach kostenpflichtigen Diensten mithilfe des Suchtools awal. Verwenden Sie den Befehl `npx awal@latest x402 baza...","pt":"O Legasi SKALE x402 fornece uma plataforma para descobrir e inspecionar pontos de extremidade de API pagos no mercado x402 Bazaar","ru":"Legasi SKALE x402 предоставляет платформу для обнаружения и инспекции платных конечных точек API на рынке x402 Bazaar","ar":"يوفر Legasi SKALE x402 منصة لاكتشاف وفحص نقاط النهاية المدفوعة API في سوق x402 Bazaar","en":"Legasi — SKALE x402 Hackathon (EVM port)"},"definition":{"en":"Legasi — SKALE x402 Hackathon (EVM port)"},"features":{"zh":["BM25","x402","API","npx awal","x402 "],"ja":["BM25","x402","API","npx awal","x402 "],"ko":["BM25","x402","API","npx awal","x402 "],"es":["Búsqueda de servicios pagos en el mercado x402","Uso de la herramienta de búsqueda de awal","Comando `npx awal@latest x402 bazaar search` para buscar servicios","Opción de búsqueda por palabra clave con BM25","Opción de actualización forzada con `--force-refresh`","Opción de salida en formato JSON con `--json`"],"fr":["Recherche de services payants sur le marché x402","Utilisation de l''outil de recherche awal","Commande `npx awal@latest x402 bazaar search` pour rechercher des services","Option de recherche par mot-clé avec BM25","Option de rafraîchissement forcé avec `--force-refresh`","Option de sortie au format JSON avec `--json`"],"de":["Suche nach kostenpflichtigen Diensten im x402-Markt","Verwendung des Suchtools awal","Befehl `npx awal@latest x402 bazaar search` zum Suchen von Diensten","Option zur Suche nach Schlüsselwörtern mit BM25","Option zur erzwungenen Aktualisierung mit `--force-refresh`","Option zur Ausgabe im JSON-Format mit `--json`"],"pt":["Busca de serviços por palavra-chave","Suporte a BM25 para busca por relevância","Comandos para inspecionar pontos de extremidade de API","Não requer autenticação ou saldo para busca","Suporte a formato JSON para saída"],"ru":["Поиск услуг по ключевому слову","Поддержка BM25 для поиска по релевантности","Команды для инспекции конечных точек API","Не требует аутентификации или баланса для поиска","Поддержка формата JSON для вывода"],"ar":["بحث الخدمات بواسطة كلمة رئيسية","دعم BM25 للبحث حسب الأهمية","أوامر لفحص نقاط النهاية API","لا يتطلب مصادقة أو رصيد للبحث","دعم تنسيق JSON للخروج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["x402","SKALE","EVM","BM25","x402 ","API","npx awal"],"ja":["x402","SKALE","EVM","BM25","x402 ","API","npx awal"],"ko":["x402","SKALE","EVM","BM25","x402 ","API","npx awal"],"es":["búsqueda de servicios","x402","awal","mercado x402","servicios pagos","BM25","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["recherche de services","x402","awal","marché x402","services payants","BM25","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Dienstsuche","x402","awal","x402-Markt","kostenpflichtige Dienste","BM25","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["x402 Bazaar","Legasi SKALE","busca de serviços","pontos de extremidade de API","BM25","autenticação","saldo","formato JSON"],"ru":["x402 Bazaar","Legasi SKALE","поиск услуг","конечные точки API","BM25","аутентификация","баланс","формат JSON"],"ar":["x402 Bazaar","Legasi SKALE","بحث الخدمات","نقاط النهاية API","BM25","مصادقة","رصيد","تنسيق JSON"]}},"owner":"legasicrypto","repo":"skale-hackathon","repoPath":"legasicrypto/skale-hackathon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"search-for-service","description":"Search and browse the x402 bazaar marketplace for paid API services. Use when you or the user want to find available services, see whats available, discover APIs, or need an external service to accomplish a task. Also use as a fallback when no other skill clearly matches — search the bazaar to see if a paid service exists. Covers what can I do?, find me an API for..., what services are available?, search for..., browse the bazaar.","bodyPreview":"# Searching the x402 Bazaar\n\nUse the `npx awal@latest x402` commands to discover and inspect paid API endpoints available on the x402 bazaar marketplace. No authentication or balance is required for searching.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Search the Bazaar\n\nFind paid services by keyword using BM25 relevance search:\n\n```bash\nnpx awal@latest x402 bazaar search <query> [-k <n>] [--force-refresh] [--json]\n```\n\n| Option            | Description                          |\n| ----------------- | ------------------","body":"# Searching the x402 Bazaar\n\nUse the `npx awal@latest x402` commands to discover and inspect paid API endpoints available on the x402 bazaar marketplace. No authentication or balance is required for searching.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Search the Bazaar\n\nFind paid services by keyword using BM25 relevance search:\n\n```bash\nnpx awal@latest x402 bazaar search <query> [-k <n>] [--force-refresh] [--json]\n```\n\n| Option            | Description                          |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `-k, --top <n>`   | Number of results (default: 5)       |\n| `--force-refresh` | Re-fetch resource index from CDP API |\n| `--json`          | Output as JSON                       |\n\nResults are cached locally at `~/.config/awal/bazaar/` and auto-refresh after 12 hours.\n\n### List Bazaar Resources\n\nBrowse all available resources:\n\n```bash\nnpx awal@latest x402 bazaar list [--network <network>] [--full] [--json]\n```\n\n| Option             | Description                             |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| `--network <name>` | Filter by network (base, base-sepolia)  |\n| `--full`           | Show complete details including schemas |\n| `--json`           | Output as JSON                          |\n\n### Discover Payment Requirements\n\nInspect an endpoint''s x402 payment requirements without paying:\n\n```bash\nnpx awal@latest x402 details <url> [--json]\n```\n\nAuto-detects the correct HTTP method (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH) by trying each until it gets a 402 response, then displays price, accepted payment schemes, network, and input/output schemas.\n\n## Examples\n\n```bash\n# Search for weather-related paid APIs\nnpx awal@latest x402 bazaar search \"weather\"\n\n# Search with more results\nnpx awal@latest x402 bazaar search \"sentiment analysis\" -k 10\n\n# Browse all bazaar resources with full details\nnpx awal@latest x402 bazaar list --full\n\n# Check what an endpoint costs\nnpx awal@latest x402 details https://example.com/api/weather\n```\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- No authentication needed for search, list, or details commands\n\n## Next Steps\n\nOnce you''ve found a service you want to use, use the `pay-for-service` skill to make a paid request to the endpoint.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- \"CDP API returned 429\" - Rate limited; cached data will be used if available\n- \"No X402 payment requirements found\" - URL may not be an x402 endpoint\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:49:08.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for EVM-based Agents needing to discover paid API endpoints on the x402 bazaar marketplace","zh":"非常适合需要在 x402 Bazzaar 市场上发现付费 API 端点的 EVM 基础代理","ja":"EVM ベースのエージェントが x402 バザール マーケットプレイスで有料 API エンドポイントを発見する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"x402 바자 시장에서 유료 API 엔드포인트를 발견해야 하는 EVM 기반 에이전트에게 완벽한 솔루션","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en EVM que necesitan descubrir puntos de conexión de API de pago en el mercado x402 bazaar","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur EVM ayant besoin de découvrir des points de terminaison d''API payants sur le marché x402 bazaar","de":"Perfekt für auf EVM basierende Agenten, die paid API-Endpunkte auf dem x402 Bazaar-Marktplatz entdecken müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes baseados em EVM que precisam descobrir pontos de extremidade de API pagos no mercado x402 bazaar","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов на основе EVM, которым необходимо обнаруживать платные конечные точки API на рынке x402 bazaar","ar":"مثالي لعميل إيف إم الذي يحتاج إلى اكتشاف نقاط النهاية المدفوعة لبروتوكول الويب في سوق x402 بزار"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize BM25 relevance search for finding paid services by keyword, leveraging the `npx awal@latest x402` command with options like `--force-refresh` and `--json` for customized results","zh":"使代理能够利用 BM25 相关性搜索通过关键词查找付费服务，利用 `npx awal@latest x402` 命令和选项如 `--force-refresh` 和 `--json` 进行自定义结果","ja":"BM25 関連性検索を使用してエージェントがキーワードで有料サービスを検索できるようにし、`npx awal@latest x402` コマンドと `--force-refresh` および `--json` のようなオプションを使用してカスタマイズされた結果を取得する","ko":"에이전트가 키워드를 사용하여 유료 서비스를 tìm kiếm하기 위해 BM25 관련성 검색을 사용하도록 하며, `npx awal@latest x402` 명령과 `--force-refresh` 및 `--json` 같은 옵션을 사용하여 사용자 지정 결과를 얻을 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar la búsqueda de relevancia BM25 para encontrar servicios de pago por palabra clave, utilizando el comando `npx awal@latest x402` con opciones como `--force-refresh` y `--json` para resultados personalizados","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser la recherche de pertinence BM25 pour trouver des services payants par mot-clé, en utilisant la commande `npx awal@latest x402` avec des options telles que `--force-refresh` et `--json` pour des résultats personnalisés","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die BM25-Relevanzsuche zu nutzen, um paid Dienste nach Schlüsselwörtern zu finden, indem sie den Befehl `npx awal@latest x402` mit Optionen wie `--force-refresh` und `--json` für individualisierte Ergebnisse verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizarem a busca de relevância BM25 para encontrar serviços pagos por palavra-chave, aproveitando o comando `npx awal@latest x402` com opções como `--force-refresh` e `--json` para resultados personalizados","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать поиск релевантности BM25 для нахождения платных услуг по ключевым словам, используя команду `npx awal@latest x402` с опциями как `--force-refresh` и `--json` для настраиваемых результатов","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من استخدام بحث الأهمية BM25 لإيجاد الخدمات المدفوعة بواسطة الكلمات الرئيسية، مستفيداً من الأمر `npx awal@latest x402` مع خيارات مثل `--force-refresh` و `--json` للحصول على نتائج مخصصة"},"useCases":{"en":["Searching the x402 Bazaar for specific paid API endpoints","Discovering new services using keyword search","Inspecting available paid APIs without requiring authentication or balance"],"zh":["在 x402 Bazzaar 中搜索特定的付费 API 端点","使用关键词搜索发现新的服务","在不需要身份验证或余额的情况下检查可用的付费 API"],"ja":["x402 バザールで特定の有料 API エンドポイントを検索する","キーワード検索を使用して新しいサービスを発見する","認証または残高を必要とせずに利用可能な有料 API を調べる"],"ko":["x402 바자에서 특정 유료 API 엔드포인트를 검색","키워드 검색을 사용하여 새로운 서비스를 발견","인증 또는 잔액을 필요로 하지 않고 사용 가능한 유료 API를 조사"],"es":["Buscar puntos de conexión de API de pago específicos en el x402 Bazaar","Descubrir nuevos servicios utilizando la búsqueda por palabra clave","Inspeccionar las API de pago disponibles sin requerir autenticación o saldo"],"fr":["Rechercher des points de terminaison d''API payants spécifiques sur le x402 Bazaar","Découvrir de nouveaux services en utilisant la recherche par mot-clé","Inspecter les API payantes disponibles sans nécessité d''authentification ou de solde"],"de":["Spezifische paid API-Endpunkte auf dem x402 Bazaar suchen","Neue Dienste mithilfe der Schlüsselwortsuche entdecken","Verfügbare paid APIs untersuchen, ohne Authentifizierung oder Guthaben zu benötigen"],"pt":["Pesquisar o x402 Bazaar por pontos de extremidade de API pagos específicos","Descobrir novos serviços usando busca por palavra-chave","Inspecionar APIs pagas disponíveis sem exigir autenticação ou saldo"],"ru":["Поиск в x402 Bazaar конкретных платных конечных точек API","Обнаружение новых услуг с помощью поиска по ключевым словам","Осмотр доступных платных API без требования аутентификации или баланса"],"ar":["بحث سوق x402 بزار عن نقاط نهاية مدفوعة لبروتوكول الويب محددة","اكتشاف خدمات جديدة باستخدام بحث الكلمات الرئيسية","فحص واي فاي مدفوعة متاحة بدون الحاجة إلى المصادقة أو الرصيد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `npx awal@latest` installation","Limited to x402 bazaar marketplace","No authentication or balance required for searching, but may be needed for other interactions"],"zh":["需要 `npx awal@latest` 安装","仅限 x402 Bazzaar 市场","搜索时不需要身份验证或余额，但可能需要其他交互"],"ja":["`npx awal@latest` のインストールが必要","x402 バザール マーケットプレイスのみ","検索には認証または残高が必要ないが、他の操作では必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["`npx awal@latest` 설치 필요","x402 바자 시장만 해당","검색에는 인증 또는 잔액이 필요하지 않지만, 다른 상호작용에는 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de `npx awal@latest`","Limitado al mercado x402 bazaar","No se requiere autenticación o saldo para la búsqueda, pero puede ser necesario para otras interacciones"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de `npx awal@latest`","Limité au marché x402 bazaar","Aucune authentification ou solde n''est requis pour la recherche, mais peut être nécessaire pour d''autres interactions"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von `npx awal@latest`","Begrenzt auf den x402 Bazaar-Marktplatz","Keine Authentifizierung oder Guthaben erforderlich für die Suche, aber möglicherweise für andere Interaktionen erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige instalação de `npx awal@latest`","Limitado ao mercado x402 bazaar","Nenhuma autenticação ou saldo é necessário para a busca, mas pode ser necessário para outras interações"],"ru":["Требует установки `npx awal@latest`","Ограничен рынком x402 bazaar","Нет аутентификации или баланса требуется для поиска, но может быть необходим для других взаимодействий"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت `npx awal@latest`","محدود بسوق x402 بزار","لا توجد مصادقة أو رصيد مطلوب للبحث، ولكن قد تكون مطلوبة لأ взаємодействия الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
