yuden a los humanos a tomar decisiones rápidas y precisas","fr":"Concevoir des tableaux de bord qui aident les humains à prendre des décisions rapides et précises","de":"Erstellung von Dashboards, die den Menschen helfen, schnelle und präzise Entscheidungen zu treffen","pt":"Desenvolva painéis de controle eficazes que ajudam os usuários a tomar decisões informadas, com foco em ação e clareza","ru":"Разработайте эффективные панели дашборда, которые помогают пользователям принимать обоснованные решения, с фокусом на действии и ясности","ar":"طور لوحات تحكم فعالة تساعد المستخدمين على اتخاذ قرارات مدروسة، مع التركيز على العمل والوضوح","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["决定优先","概览、钻取、证据","速率和百分位优先于平均值","简单胜于密集"],"ja":["決定を優先する","概要、ドリルダウン、証拠","レートとパーセンタイルを平均よりも優先する","シンプルが密集よりも勝つ"],"ko":["결정 우선","개요, 드릴다운, 증거","비율과 백분위가 평균보다 우선","단순이 밀도가 우선"],"es":["Decisión en primer lugar","Resumen y análisis detallado","Tasas y percentiles en lugar de promedios","Diseño simple y minimalista"],"fr":["Décision en premier lieu","Vue d''ensemble et analyse détaillée","Taux et percentiles plutôt que moyennes","Conception simple et minimaliste"],"de":["Entscheidung an erster Stelle","Überblick und detaillierte Analyse","Raten und Percentile anstelle von Durchschnitten","Einfaches und minimalistisches Design"],"pt":["Decisões primeiro","Visão geral para detalhes","Taxas e percentis em vez de médias","Simplesza sobre densidade"],"ru":["Решения прежде всего","Обзор для деталей","Ставки и процентили вместо средних","Простота над плотностью"],"ar":["القرارات أولاً","نظرة عامة إلى تفاصيل","معدلات و百ينات بدلاً من المتوسطات","البساطة على الكثافة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["仪表盘设计","数据可视化","决策支持","用户体验","交互设计","信息架构"],"ja":["ダッシュボード設計","データ可視化","決定支援","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","インタラクション設計","情報アーキテクチャ"],"ko":["대시보드 설계","데이터 시각화","결정 지원","사용자 경험","인터랙션 설계","정보 아키텍처"],"es":["paneles de control","diseño de dashboards","toma de decisiones","análisis de datos","visualización de datos","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["tableaux de bord","conception de dashboards","prise de décision","analyse de données","visualisation de données","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Dashboards","Erstellung von Dashboards","Entscheidungsfindung","Datenanalyse","Datenvisualisierung","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["painel de controle","desenvolvimento de painéis","tomada de decisões","análise de dados","visualização de dados","design de painéis"],"ru":["панель дашборда","разработка панелей","принятие решений","анализ данных","визуализация данных","дизайн панелей"],"ar":["لوحة التحكم","تطوير اللوحات","اتخاذ القرارات","تحليل البيانات","تجسير البيانات","تصميم اللوحات"]}},"owner":"mosabsayyed","repo":"josoorfe","repoPath":"mosabsayyed/josoorfe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"building-dashboards","description":"Designs and builds Axiom dashboards via API. Covers chart types, APL patterns, SmartFilters, layout, and configuration options. Use when creating dashboards, migrating from Splunk, or configuring chart options.","bodyPreview":"# Building Dashboards\n\nYou design dashboards that help humans make decisions quickly. Dashboards are products: audience, questions, and actions matter more than chart count.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n1. **Decisions first.** Every panel answers a question that leads to an action.\n2. **Overview → drilldown → evidence.** Start broad, narrow on click/filter, end with raw logs.\n3. **Rates and percentiles over averages.** Averages hide problems; p95/p99 expose them.\n4. **Simple beats dense.** One question per p","body":"# Building Dashboards\n\nYou design dashboards that help humans make decisions quickly. Dashboards are products: audience, questions, and actions matter more than chart count.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n1. **Decisions first.** Every panel answers a question that leads to an action.\n2. **Overview → drilldown → evidence.** Start broad, narrow on click/filter, end with raw logs.\n3. **Rates and percentiles over averages.** Averages hide problems; p95/p99 expose them.\n4. **Simple beats dense.** One question per panel. No chart junk.\n5. **Validate with data.** Never guess fields—discover schema first.\n\n---\n\n## Entry Points\n\nChoose your starting point:\n\n| Starting from | Workflow |\n|---------------|----------|\n| **Vague description** | Intake → design blueprint → APL per panel → deploy |\n| **Template** | Pick template → customize dataset/service/env → deploy |\n| **Splunk dashboard** | Extract SPL → translate via spl-to-apl → map to chart types → deploy |\n| **Exploration** | Use axiom-sre to discover schema/signals → productize into panels |\n\n---\n\n## Intake: What to Ask First\n\nBefore designing, clarify:\n\n1. **Audience & decision**\n   - Oncall triage? (fast refresh, error-focused)\n   - Team health? (daily trends, SLO tracking)\n   - Exec reporting? (weekly summaries, high-level)\n\n2. **Scope**\n   - Service, environment, region, cluster, endpoint?\n   - Single service or cross-service view?\n\n3. **Datasets**\n   - Which Axiom datasets contain the data?\n   - Run `getschema` to discover fields—never guess:\n   ```apl\n   [''dataset''] | where _time between (ago(1h) .. now()) | getschema\n   ```\n\n4. **Golden signals**\n   - Traffic: requests/sec, events/min\n   - Errors: error rate, 5xx count\n   - Latency: p50, p95, p99 duration\n   - Saturation: CPU, memory, queue depth, connections\n\n5. **Drilldown dimensions**\n   - What do users filter/group by? (service, route, status, pod, customer_id)\n\n---\n\n## Dashboard Blueprint\n\nUse this 4-section structure as the default:\n\n### 1. At-a-Glance (Statistic panels)\nSingle numbers that answer \"is it broken right now?\"\n- Error rate (last 5m)\n- p95 latency (last 5m)\n- Request rate (last 5m)\n- Active alerts (if applicable)\n\n### 2. Trends (TimeSeries panels)\nTime-based patterns that answer \"what changed?\"\n- Traffic over time\n- Error rate over time\n- Latency percentiles over time\n- Stacked by status/service for comparison\n\n### 3. Breakdowns (Table/Pie panels)\nTop-N analysis that answers \"where should I look?\"\n- Top 10 failing routes\n- Top 10 error messages\n- Worst pods by error rate\n- Request distribution by status\n\n### 4. Evidence (LogStream + SmartFilter)\nRaw events that answer \"what exactly happened?\"\n- LogStream filtered to errors\n- SmartFilter for service/env/route\n- Key fields projected for readability\n\n---\n\n## Chart Types\n\n**Note:** Dashboard queries inherit time from the UI picker—no explicit `_time` filter needed.\n\n**Validation:** TimeSeries, Statistic, Table, Pie, LogStream, Note, MonitorList are fully validated by `dashboard-validate`. Heatmap, ScatterPlot, SmartFilter work but may trigger warnings.\n\n### Statistic\n**When:** Single KPI, current value, threshold comparison.\n\n```apl\n[''logs'']\n| where service == \"api\"\n| summarize \n    total = count(),\n    errors = countif(status >= 500)\n| extend error_rate = round(100.0 * errors / total, 2)\n| project error_rate\n```\n\n**Pitfalls:** Don''t use for time series; ensure query returns single row.\n\n### TimeSeries\n**When:** Trends over time, before/after comparison, rate changes.\n\n```apl\n// Single metric - use bin_auto for automatic sizing\n[''logs'']\n| summarize [''req/min''] = count() by bin_auto(_time)\n\n// Latency percentiles - use percentiles_array for proper overlay\n[''logs'']\n| summarize percentiles_array(duration_ms, 50, 95, 99) by bin_auto(_time)\n```\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Use `bin_auto(_time)` instead of fixed `bin(_time, 1m)` — auto-adjusts to time window\n- Use `percentiles_array()` instead of multiple `percentile()` calls — renders as one chart\n- Too many series = unreadable; use `top N` or filter\n\n### Table\n**When:** Top-N lists, detailed breakdowns, exportable data.\n\n```apl\n[''logs'']\n| where status >= 500\n| summarize errors = count() by route, error_message\n| top 10 by errors\n| project route, error_message, errors\n```\n\n**Pitfalls:**\n- Always use `top N` to prevent unbounded results\n- Use `project` to control column order and names\n\n### Pie\n**When:** Share-of-total for LOW cardinality dimensions (≤6 slices).\n\n```apl\n[''logs'']\n| summarize count() by status_class = case(\n    status < 300, \"2xx\",\n    status < 400, \"3xx\",\n    status < 500, \"4xx\",\n    \"5xx\"\n  )\n```\n\n**Pitfalls:**\n- Never use for high cardinality (routes, user IDs)\n- Prefer tables for >6 categories\n- Always aggregate to reduce slices\n\n### LogStream\n**When:** Raw event inspection, debugging, evidence gathering.\n\n```apl\n[''logs'']\n| where service == \"api\" and status >= 500\n| project-keep _time, trace_id, route, status, error_message, duration_ms\n| take 100\n```\n\n**Pitfalls:**\n- Always include `take N` (100-500 max)\n- Use `project-keep` to show relevant fields only\n- Filter aggressively—raw logs are expensive\n\n### Heatmap\n**When:** Distribution visualization, latency patterns, density analysis.\n\n```apl\n[''logs'']\n| summarize histogram(duration_ms, 15) by bin_auto(_time)\n```\n\n**Best for:** Latency distributions, response time patterns, identifying outliers.\n\n### Scatter Plot\n**When:** Correlation between two metrics, identifying patterns.\n\n```apl\n[''logs'']\n| summarize avg(duration_ms), avg(resp_size_bytes) by route\n```\n\n**Best for:** Response size vs latency correlation, resource usage patterns.\n\n### SmartFilter (Filter Bar)\n**When:** Interactive filtering for the entire dashboard.\n\nSmartFilter is a **chart type** that creates dropdown/search filters. Requires:\n1. A `SmartFilter` chart with filter definitions\n2. `declare query_parameters` in each panel query\n\n**Filter types:**\n- `selectType: \"apl\"` — Dynamic dropdown from APL query\n- `selectType: \"list\"` — Static dropdown with predefined options\n- `type: \"search\"` — Free-text input\n\n**Panel query pattern:**\n```apl\ndeclare query_parameters (country_filter:string = \"\");\n[''logs''] | where isempty(country_filter) or [''geo.country''] == country_filter\n```\n\nSee `reference/smartfilter.md` for full JSON structure and cascading filter examples.\n\n### Monitor List\n**When:** Display monitor status on operational dashboards.\n\nNo APL needed—select monitors from the UI. Shows:\n- Monitor status (normal/triggered/off)\n- Run history (green/red squares)\n- Dataset, type, notifiers\n\n### Note\n**When:** Context, instructions, section headers.\n\nUse GitHub Flavored Markdown for:\n- Dashboard purpose and audience\n- Runbook links\n- Section dividers\n- On-call instructions\n\n---\n\n## Chart Configuration\n\nCharts support JSON configuration options beyond the query. See `reference/chart-config.md` for full details.\n\n**Quick reference:**\n\n| Chart Type | Key Options |\n|------------|-------------|\n| Statistic | `colorScheme`, `customUnits`, `unit`, `showChart` (sparkline), `errorThreshold`/`warningThreshold` |\n| TimeSeries | `aggChartOpts`: `variant` (line/area/bars), `scaleDistr` (linear/log), `displayNull` |\n| LogStream/Table | `tableSettings`: `columns`, `fontSize`, `highlightSeverity`, `wrapLines` |\n| Pie | `hideHeader` |\n| Note | `text` (markdown), `variant` |\n\n**Common options (all charts):**\n- `overrideDashboardTimeRange`: boolean\n- `overrideDashboardCompareAgainst`: boolean  \n- `hideHeader`: boolean\n\n---\n\n## APL Patterns\n\n### Time Filtering in Dashboards vs Ad-hoc Queries\n\n**Dashboard panel queries do NOT need explicit time filters.** The dashboard UI time picker automatically scopes all queries to the selected time window.\n\n```apl\n// DASHBOARD QUERY — no time filter needed\n[''logs'']\n| where service == \"api\"\n| summarize count() by bin_auto(_time)\n```\n\n**Ad-hoc queries (Axiom Query tab, axiom-sre exploration) MUST have explicit time filters:**\n\n```apl\n// AD-HOC QUERY — always include time filter\n[''logs'']\n| where _time between (ago(1h) .. now())\n| where service == \"api\"\n| summarize count() by bin_auto(_time)\n```\n\n### Bin Size Selection\n\n**Prefer `bin_auto(_time)`** — it automatically adjusts to the dashboard time window.\n\nManual bin sizes (only when auto doesn''t fit your needs):\n\n| Time window | Bin size |\n|-------------|----------|\n| 15m | 10s–30s |\n| 1h | 1m |\n| 6h | 5m |\n| 24h | 15m–1h |\n| 7d | 1h–6h |\n\n### Cardinality Guardrails\nPrevent query explosion:\n\n```apl\n// GOOD: bounded\n| summarize count() by route | top 10 by count_\n\n// BAD: unbounded high-cardinality grouping\n| summarize count() by user_id  // millions of rows\n```\n\n### Field Escaping\nFields with dots need bracket notation:\n\n```apl\n| where [''kubernetes.pod.name''] == \"frontend\"\n```\n\nFields with dots IN the name (not hierarchy) need escaping:\n\n```apl\n| where [''kubernetes.labels.app\\\\.kubernetes\\\\.io/name''] == \"frontend\"\n```\n\n### Golden Signal Queries\n\n**Traffic:**\n```apl\n| summarize requests = count() by bin_auto(_time)\n```\n\n**Errors (as rate %):**\n```apl\n| summarize total = count(), errors = countif(status >= 500) by bin_auto(_time)\n| extend error_rate = iff(total > 0, round(100.0 * errors / total, 2), 0.0)\n| project _time, error_rate\n```\n\n**Latency (use percentiles_array for proper chart overlay):**\n```apl\n| summarize percentiles_array(duration_ms, 50, 95, 99) by bin_auto(_time)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Layout Composition\n\n### Grid Principles\n- Dashboard width = 12 units\n- Typical panel: w=3 (quarter), w=4 (third), w=6 (half), w=12 (full)\n- Stats row: 4 panels × w=3, h=2\n- TimeSeries row: 2 panels × w=6, h=4\n- Tables: w=6 or w=12, h=4–6\n- LogStream: w=12, h=6–8\n\n### Section Layout Pattern\n\n```\nRow 0-1:  [Stat w=3] [Stat w=3] [Stat w=3] [Stat w=3]\nRow 2-5:  [TimeSeries w=6, h=4] [TimeSeries w=6, h=4]\nRow 6-9:  [Table w=6, h=4] [Pie w=6, h=4]\nRow 10+:  [LogStream w=12, h=6]\n```\n\n### Naming Conventions\n- Use question-style titles: \"Error rate by route\" not \"Errors\"\n- Prefix with context if multi-service: \"[API] Error rate\"\n- Include units: \"Latency (ms)\", \"Traffic (req/s)\"\n\n---\n\n## Dashboard Settings\n\n### Refresh Rate\nDashboard auto-refreshes at configured interval. Options: 15s, 30s, 1m, 5m, etc.\n\n**⚠️ Query cost warning:** Short refresh (15s) + long time range (90d) = expensive queries running constantly.\n\nRecommendations:\n| Use case | Refresh rate |\n|----------|-------------|\n| Oncall/real-time | 15s–30s |\n| Team health | 1m–5m |\n| Executive/weekly | 5m–15m |\n\n### Sharing\n- **Just Me**: Private, only you can access\n- **Group**: Specific team/group in your org\n- **Everyone**: All users in your Axiom org\n\nData visibility is still governed by dataset permissions—users only see data from datasets they can access.\n\n### URL Time Range Parameters\n\n`?t_qr=24h` (quick range), `?t_ts=...&t_te=...` (custom), `?t_against=-1d` (comparison)\n\n---\n\n## Setup\n\nRun `scripts/setup` to check requirements (curl, jq, ~/.axiom.toml).\n\nConfig in `~/.axiom.toml` (shared with axiom-sre):\n```toml\n[deployments.prod]\nurl = \"https://api.axiom.co\"\ntoken = \"xaat-your-token\"\norg_id = \"your-org-id\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Deployment\n\n### Scripts\n\n| Script | Usage |\n|--------|-------|\n| `scripts/get-user-id <deploy>` | Get your user ID for `owner` field |\n| `scripts/dashboard-list <deploy>` | List all dashboards |\n| `scripts/dashboard-get <deploy> <id>` | Fetch dashboard JSON |\n| `scripts/dashboard-validate <file>` | Validate JSON structure |\n| `scripts/dashboard-create <deploy> <file>` | Create dashboard |\n| `scripts/dashboard-update <deploy> <id> <file>` | Update (needs version) |\n| `scripts/dashboard-copy <deploy> <id>` | Clone dashboard |\n| `scripts/dashboard-link <deploy> <id>` | Get shareable URL |\n| `scripts/dashboard-delete <deploy> <id>` | Delete (with confirm) |\n| `scripts/axiom-api <deploy> <method> <path>` | Low-level API calls |\n\n### Workflow\n\n**⚠️ CRITICAL: Always validate queries BEFORE deploying.**\n\n1. Design dashboard (sections + panels)\n2. Write APL for each panel\n3. Build JSON (from template or manually)\n4. **Validate queries** using axiom-sre with explicit time filter\n5. `dashboard-validate` to check structure\n6. `dashboard-create` or `dashboard-update` to deploy\n7. **`dashboard-link` to get URL** — NEVER construct Axiom URLs manually (org IDs and base URLs vary per deployment)\n8. Share link with user\n\n---\n\n## Sibling Skill Integration\n\n**spl-to-apl:** Translate Splunk SPL → APL. Map `timechart` → TimeSeries, `stats` → Statistic/Table. See `reference/splunk-migration.md`.\n\n**axiom-sre:** Discover schema with `getschema`, explore baselines, identify dimensions, then productize into panels.\n\n---\n\n## Templates\n\nPre-built templates in `reference/templates/`:\n\n| Template | Use case |\n|----------|----------|\n| `service-overview.json` | Single service oncall dashboard with Heatmap |\n| `service-overview-with-filters.json` | Same with SmartFilter (route/status dropdowns) |\n| `api-health.json` | HTTP API with traffic/errors/latency |\n| `blank.json` | Minimal skeleton |\n\n**Placeholders:** `{{owner_id}}`, `{{service}}`, `{{dataset}}`\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\nUSER_ID=$(scripts/get-user-id prod)\nscripts/dashboard-from-template service-overview \"my-service\" \"$USER_ID\" \"my-dataset\" ./dashboard.json\nscripts/dashboard-validate ./dashboard.json\nscripts/dashboard-create prod ./dashboard.json\n```\n\n**⚠️ Templates assume field names** (`service`, `status`, `route`, `duration_ms`). Discover your schema first and use `sed` to fix mismatches.\n\n---\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n| Problem | Cause | Solution |\n|---------|-------|----------|\n| \"unable to find dataset\" errors | Dataset name doesn''t exist in your org | Check available datasets in Axiom UI |\n| \"creating dashboards for other users\" 403 | Owner ID doesn''t match your token | Use `scripts/get-user-id prod` to get your UUID |\n| All panels show errors | Field names don''t match your schema | Discover schema first, use sed to fix field names |\n| Dashboard shows no data | Service filter too restrictive | Remove or adjust `where service == ''x''` filters |\n| Queries time out | Missing time filter or too broad | Dashboard inherits time from picker; ad-hoc queries need explicit time filter |\n| Wrong org in dashboard URL | Manually constructed URL | **Always use `dashboard-link <deploy> <id>`** — never guess org IDs or base URLs |\n\n---\n\n## Reference\n\n- `reference/chart-config.md` — All chart configuration options (JSON)\n- `reference/smartfilter.md` — SmartFilter/FilterBar full configuration\n- `reference/chart-cookbook.md` — APL patterns per chart type\n- `reference/layout-recipes.md` — Grid layouts and section blueprints\n- `reference/splunk-migration.md` — Splunk panel → Axiom mapping\n- `reference/design-playbook.md` — Decision-first design principles\n- `reference/templates/` — Ready-to-use dashboard JSON files\n\nFor APL syntax: https://axiom.co/docs/apl/introduction\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:49:37.959Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced dashboard creation capabilities with a focus on decision-driven design.","zh":"适合需要高级仪表盘创建功能的数据分析代理，重点关注决策驱动的设计。","ja":"高度なダッシュボード作成機能を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに適しています。設計の重点は意思決定に基づくものです。","ko":"데이터 분석 에이전트가 고급 대시보드 생성 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합하며, 의사 결정 주도 설계에 중점을 둡니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de datos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación de paneles de control con un enfoque en diseño orientado a decisiones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données ayant besoin de capacités avancées de création de tableaux de bord avec un focus sur la conception orientée vers la prise de décision.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die erweiterte Dashboard-Erstellungsfähigkeiten mit Fokus auf entscheidungsgetriebenes Design benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação de dashboards com foco em design orientado a decisões.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа данных, которым требуются расширенные возможности создания панелей управления с фокусом на принятии решений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء لوحات القيادة مع التركيز على تصميم مدفوع بالقرار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design informative dashboards using rates and percentiles, simplifying complex data into actionable insights with overview, drilldown, and evidence-based panels, leveraging principles like ''Decisions first'' and ''Simple beats dense'' to drive user action.","zh":"赋予代理设计信息丰富的仪表盘的能力，利用比率和百分位数，将复杂的数据简化为可行的见解，包括概述、下钻和基于证据的面板，利用“先决策”和“简单优于密集”等原则来驱动用户行动。","ja":"レートやパーセンタイルを使用して、複雑なデータをアクション可能なインサイトに簡素化し、概要、ドリルダウン、エビデンスベースのパネルを使用し、「意思決定優先」や「シンプルは密度よりも優れる」という原則を利用してユーザーの行動を促進する、情報豊富なダッシュボードを設計するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"비율 및 百分位를 사용하여 복잡한 데이터를 행동 가능한 통찰력으로 단순화하고 요약, 드릴다운 및 증거 기반 패널을 사용하여 ''의사 결정 우선'' 및 ''단순함이 복잡함을 이긴다''와 같은 원칙을 활용하여 사용자 동작을 구동하는 정보가 풍부한 대시보드를 설계할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar paneles de control informativos utilizando tasas y percentiles, simplificando datos complejos en conocimientos acciónables con paneles de visión general, análisis detallado y basados en la evidencia, aprovechando principios como ''Decisiones primero'' y ''Simple supera a denso'' para impulsar la acción del usuario.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des tableaux de bord informatifs en utilisant des taux et des percentiles, en simplifiant des données complexes en connaissances actionnables avec des panneaux de vue d''ensemble, de forage et fondés sur des preuves, en exploitant des principes comme ''Décisions d''abord'' et ''Simple bat dense'' pour stimuler l''action de l''utilisateur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, informative Dashboards mithilfe von Raten und Percentilen zu entwerfen, komplexe Daten in handhabbare Erkenntnisse mit Überblicks-, Drilldown- und evidenzbasierten Panels zu vereinfachen, Prinzipien wie ''Entscheidungen zuerst'' und ''Einfach übertrumpft dicht'' nutzt, um die Benutzeraktion zu fördern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar painéis informativos usando taxas e percentis, simplificando dados complexos em insights ações com visão geral, capacidade de drilldown e painéis baseados em evidências, aproveitando princípios como ''Decisões primeiro'' e ''Simples vence denso'' para impulsionar a ação do usuário.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать информативные панели управления, используя ставки и процентили, упрощая сложные данные в рабочие идеи с обзором, возможностью детального анализа и панелями, основанными на доказательствах, используя принципы, такие как ''Решения прежде всего'' и ''Простое лучше плотного'', чтобы стимулировать действие пользователя.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم لوحات إعلامية باستخدام معدلات والنسب المئوية، وبذلك يبسط البيانات المعقدة إلى رؤى يمكن تنفيذها مع نظرة عامة وقدرة على الحفر ولوحات قائمة على الأدلة، مستفيدا من مبادئ مثل ''القرارات أولا'' و ''البسيط يفوز بالكثافة'' لتحفيز إجراء المستخدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating decision-focused dashboards for business stakeholders","Designing overview panels for high-level insights and drilldown capabilities for detailed analysis","Implementing data visualization best practices such as using percentiles over averages for more accurate representations"],"zh":["为业务利益相关者创建以决策为中心的仪表盘","设计用于高级见解和详细分析的下钻功能的概述面板","实施数据可视化最佳实践，例如使用百分位代替平均值以获得更准确的表示"],"ja":["ビジネスステークホルダー向けの意思決定中心のダッシュボードを作成する","詳細分析のためのドリルダウン機能を持つ概要パネルを設計する","パーセンタイルを平均値よりも優先するなどのデータ可視化のベストプラクティスを実装する"],"ko":["비즈니스 이해관계자를 위한 의사 결정 중심의 대시보드를 생성합니다.","상세 분석을 위한 드릴다운 기능을 갖춘 요약 패널을 설계합니다.","백분위수를 평균보다 우선하는 것과 같은 데이터 시각화 모범 사례를 구현합니다."],"es":["Crear paneles de control enfocados en la toma de decisiones para partes interesadas empresariales","Diseñar paneles de visión general para conocimientos de alto nivel y capacidades de análisis detallado","Implementar las mejores prácticas de visualización de datos, como el uso de percentiles en lugar de promedios para representaciones más precisas"],"fr":["Créer des tableaux de bord axés sur la prise de décision pour les parties prenantes de l''entreprise","Concevoir des panneaux de vue d''ensemble pour des connaissances de haut niveau et des capacités d''analyse détaillée","Mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques de visualisation de données, telles que l''utilisation de percentiles plutôt que de moyennes pour des représentations plus précises"],"de":["Erstellen von entscheidungsorientierten Dashboards für Geschäftsbeteiligte","Entwerfen von Überblickspanels für hochwertige Erkenntnisse und detaillierte Analysefähigkeiten","Implementierung von Best-Practice-Methoden für Datenvisualisierung, wie z.B. die Verwendung von Percentilen anstelle von Durchschnittswerten für genauere Darstellungen"],"pt":["Criar dashboards focados em decisões para partes interessadas empresariais","Projetar painéis de visão geral para insights de alto nível e capacidades de drilldown para análise detalhada","Implementar as melhores práticas de visualização de dados, como usar percentis em vez de médias para representações mais precisas"],"ru":["Создание панелей управления, ориентированных на принятие решений, для деловых заинтересованных сторон","Проектирование панелей обзора для получения информации высокого уровня и возможностей детального анализа для подробного анализа","Реализация лучших практик визуализации данных, таких как использование процентилей вместо средних значений для более точных представлений"],"ar":["إنشاء لوحات القيادة الموجهة بالقرار للمشاركين في الأعمال","تصميم لوحات لمحة عامة للحصول على رؤى عالية المستوى وقدرات الحفر للتحليل المفصل","تنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لتصور البيانات، مثل استخدام النسب المئوية بدلاً من المتوسطات للحصول على تمثيلات أكثر دقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of the target audience and their questions","Needs clear definition of actions to be taken based on dashboard insights","Design simplicity and clarity are crucial for effective dashboard use"],"zh":["需要了解目标受众及其问题","需要明确定义基于仪表盘见解采取的行动","设计的简单性和清晰度对于有效的仪表盘使用至关重要"],"ja":["ターゲットオーディエンスとその質問を理解する必要がある","ダッシュボードのインサイトに基づいて行われるアクションを明確に定義する必要がある","効果的なダッシュボード使用のための設計のシンプルさと明確さが重要"],"ko":["대상 청중及其 질문을 이해해야 합니다.","대시보드 통찰력을 기반으로 수행할 동작을 명확하게 정의해야 합니다.","효과적인 대시보드 사용을 위한 설계의 단순성 및 명확성이 중요합니다."],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la audiencia objetivo y sus preguntas","Necesita una definición clara de las acciones que se deben tomar basadas en los conocimientos del panel de control","La simplicidad y claridad del diseño son cruciales para un uso eficaz del panel de control"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du public cible et de leurs questions","A besoin d''une définition claire des actions à prendre sur la base des connaissances du tableau de bord","La simplicité et la clarté de la conception sont cruciales pour une utilisation efficace du tableau de bord"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis der Zielgruppe und ihrer Fragen","Benötigt eine klare Definition der Maßnahmen, die auf der Grundlage der Dashboard-Erkenntnisse zu ergreifen sind","Einfachheit und Klarheit des Designs sind für eine effektive Nutzung des Dashboards von entscheidender Bedeutung"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do público-alvo e de suas perguntas","Necessita de definição clara das ações a serem tomadas com base nas informações do dashboard","A simplicidade e a clareza do design são cruciais para o uso eficaz do dashboard"],"ru":["Требует понимания целевой аудитории и их вопросов","Требует четкого определения действий, которые необходимо предпринять на основе сведений с панели управления","Простота и ясность конструкции имеют решающее значение для эффективного использования панели управления"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم الجمهور المستهدف وأسئلتهم","يحتاج إلى تعريف واضح للإجراءات التي يجب اتخاذها بناءً على información من لوحة القيادة","ال بساطة ووضوح التصميم من الأمور الحاسمة لاستخدام لوحة القيادة الفعال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator/retrieval-augmented-generation', 'community', 'KrystianYCSilva', 'hefesto-skill-generator', 'KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator', 'retrieval-augmented-generation', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z', '2026-02-18T09:49:53.029Z', NULL, '{"id":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator/retrieval-augmented-generation","name":"retrieval-augmented-generation","description":{"zh":"增强检索生成（RAG）技术通过结合大语言模型（LLM）和外部检索系统，实现了高效的信息检索和生成。该技术可以将传统的‘闭卷’考试转变为‘开卷’考试","ja":"リトリーバル増強生成（RAG）技術は、大規模言語モデル（LLM）と外部の検索システムを組み合わせて、高度な情報の検索と生成を実現します。この技術は、従来の『閉じた本』の試験を『開いた本』の試験に変えることができます","ko":"검색 증강 생성(RAG) 기술은 대규모 언어 모델(LLM)과 외부 검색 시스템을 결합하여 효율적인 정보 검색과 생성을 thực現합니다. 이 기술은 전통적인 ''닫은 책'' 시험을 ''열린 책'' 시험으로 변환할 수 있습니다","es":"Retrieval-Augmented Generation combina capacidades de razonamiento de LLMs con precisión factual de sistemas de recuperación externos","fr":"La Génération améliorée avec récupération combine les capacités de raisonnement des LLM avec la précision factuelle des systèmes de récupération externes","de":"Die erweiterte Generierung mit Retrieval kombiniert die Fähigkeiten von LLMs mit der faktischen Genauigkeit externer Retrieval-Systeme","pt":"A Geração Aumentada por Recuperação combina capacidades de raciocínio de LLMs com precisão factual de sistemas de recuperação externos, transformando exames de \"livro fechado\" em \"livro aberto\".","ru":"Усиленная генерация с помощью извлечения объединяет возможности рассуждения LLM с точностью фактов внешних систем извлечения, превращая \"закрытые\" экзамены в \"открытые\".","ar":"التوليد المعزز بالاسترجاع يدمج قدرات الاستدلال من LLM مع دقة фактиة لأنظمة الاسترجاع الخارجية، مما يحول الامتحانات \"المغلق\" إلى \"مفتوح\".","en":"Hefesto e um gerador de skills que cria Agent Skills padronizadas para multiplos CLIs de IA, seguindo o padrao aberto agentskills.io e as melhores praticas academicamente consolidadas."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"增强检索生成（RAG）技术","ja":"リトリーバル増強生成（RAG）技術","ko":"검색 증강 생성(RAG) 기술","es":"Generación mejorada con recuperación","fr":"Génération améliorée avec récupération","de":"Erweiterte Generierung mit Retrieval","pt":"Geração Aumentada por Recuperação","ru":"Усиленная генерация с помощью извлечения","ar":"التوليد المعزز بالاسترجاع","en":"retrieval-augmented-generation"},"description":{"zh":"增强检索生成（RAG）技术通过结合大语言模型（LLM）和外部检索系统，实现了高效的信息检索和生成。该技术可以将传统的‘闭卷’考试转变为‘开卷’考试","ja":"リトリーバル増強生成（RAG）技術は、大規模言語モデル（LLM）と外部の検索システムを組み合わせて、高度な情報の検索と生成を実現します。この技術は、従来の『閉じた本』の試験を『開いた本』の試験に変えることができます","ko":"검색 증강 생성(RAG) 기술은 대규모 언어 모델(LLM)과 외부 검색 시스템을 결합하여 효율적인 정보 검색과 생성을 thực現합니다. 이 기술은 전통적인 ''닫은 책'' 시험을 ''열린 책'' 시험으로 변환할 수 있습니다","es":"Retrieval-Augmented Generation combina capacidades de razonamiento de LLMs con precisión factual de sistemas de recuperación externos","fr":"La Génération améliorée avec récupération combine les capacités de raisonnement des LLM avec la précision factuelle des systèmes de récupération externes","de":"Die erweiterte Generierung mit Retrieval kombiniert die Fähigkeiten von LLMs mit der faktischen Genauigkeit externer Retrieval-Systeme","pt":"A Geração Aumentada por Recuperação combina capacidades de raciocínio de LLMs com precisão factual de sistemas de recuperação externos, transformando exames ...","ru":"Усиленная генерация с помощью извлечения объединяет возможности рассуждения LLM с точностью фактов внешних систем извлечения, превращая \"закрытые\" экзамены в...","ar":"التوليد المعزز بالاسترجاع يدمج قدرات الاستدلال من LLM مع دقة фактиة لأنظمة الاسترجاع الخارجية، مما يحول الامتحانات \"المغلق\" إلى \"مفتوح\".","en":"Hefesto e um gerador de skills que cria Agent Skills padronizadas para multiplos CLIs de IA, seguindo o padrao aberto agentskills.io e as melhores praticas a..."},"definition":{"en":"Hefesto e um gerador de skills que cria Agent Skills padronizadas para multiplos CLIs de IA, seguindo o padrao aberto agentskills.io e as melhores praticas academicamente consolidadas."},"features":{"zh":["提高信息检索效率","增强生成能力","支持多种数据格式","可应用于各种领域"],"ja":["情報の検索効率の向上","生成能力の強化","多様なデータ形式のサポート","様々な分野への適用"],"ko":["정보 검색 효율 향상","생성 능력 강화","다양한 데이터 형식 지원","다양한 분야 적용"],"es":["Combina LLMs y sistemas de recuperación externos","Mejora la precisión factual de la generación de texto","Permite la indexación de datos de manera eficiente","Soporta diferentes métodos de chunking","Es compatible con múltiples CLIs de IA","Sigue el estándar abierto agentskills.io"],"fr":["Combine les LLM et les systèmes de récupération externes","Améliore la précision factuelle de la génération de texte","Permet l''indexation de données de manière efficace","Prend en charge différents méthodes de chunking","Est compatible avec plusieurs CLIs d''IA","Suive le standard ouvert agentskills.io"],"de":["Kombiniert LLMs und externe Retrieval-Systeme","Verbessert die faktische Genauigkeit der Textgenerierung","Ermöglicht eine effiziente Indexierung von Daten","Unterstützt verschiedene Chunking-Methoden","Ist kompatibel mit mehreren CLIs von KI","Folgt dem offenen Standard agentskills.io"],"pt":["Combinação de capacidades de raciocínio de LLMs com precisão factual de sistemas de recuperação externos","Transformação de exames de \"livro fechado\" em \"livro aberto\"","Indexação de dados por meio de técnicas de chunking","Suporte a múltiplos CLIs de IA","Padrão aberto agentskills.io","Melhores práticas academicamente consolidadas"],"ru":["Объединение возможностей рассуждения LLM с точностью фактов внешних систем извлечения","Превращение \"закрытых\" экзаменов в \"открытые\"","Индексация данных с помощью техник chunking","Поддержка нескольких CLI IA","Открытый стандарт agentskills.io","Лучшие практики, закрепленные академически"],"ar":["دمج قدرات الاستدلال من LLM مع دقة фактиة لأنظمة الاسترجاع الخارجية","تحويل الامتحانات \"المغلق\" إلى \"مفتوح\"","فهرسة البيانات من خلال تقنيات chunking","دعم عدة CLI IA","معايير مفتوحة agentskills.io","أفضل الممارسات المثبتة أكاديميا"]},"keywords":{"zh":["增强检索生成","RAG技术","LLM","外部检索系统","信息检索","生成模型"],"ja":["リトリーバル増強生成","RAG技術","LLM","外部の検索システム","情報の検索","生成モデル"],"ko":["검색 증강 생성","RAG 기술","LLM","외부 검색 시스템","정보 검색","생성 모델"],"es":["Retrieval-Augmented Generation","LLMs","sistemas de recuperación externos","generación de texto","indexación de datos","chunking","CLIs de IA","agentskills.io"],"fr":["Génération améliorée avec récupération","LLM","systèmes de récupération externes","génération de texte","indexation de données","chunking","CLIs d''IA","agentskills.io"],"de":["erweiterte Generierung mit Retrieval","LLMs","externe Retrieval-Systeme","Textgenerierung","Indexierung von Daten","Chunking","CLIs von KI","agentskills.io"],"pt":["Geração Aumentada por Recuperação","LLMs","sistemas de recuperação externos","indexação de dados","chunking","CLI de IA","agentskills.io","melhores práticas","desenvolvimento de IA","tecnologia de IA"],"ru":["Усиленная генерация с помощью извлечения","LLM","внешние системы извлечения","индексация данных","chunking","CLI IA","agentskills.io","лучшие практики","разработка ИИ","технология ИИ"],"ar":["التوليد المعزز بالاسترجاع","LLM","أنظمة الاسترجاع الخارجية","فهرسة البيانات","chunking","CLI IA","agentskills.io","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"KrystianYCSilva","repo":"hefesto-skill-generator","repoPath":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"retrieval-augmented-generation","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)\n\nRAG combines the reasoning capabilities of LLMs with the factual precision of external retrieval systems. It transforms \"closed-book\" exams into \"open-book\" ones.\n\n## How to Index Data\n\nThe quality of retrieval depends on how data is ingested.\n\n1.  **Chunking**:\n    -   *Fixed-Size*: Simple, but splits semantic units (sentences/paragraphs).\n    -   *Recursive Character*: Respects separators (`\n\n`, `\n`, `.`). **Preferred**.\n    -   *Semantic*: Splits based","body":"# Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)\n\nRAG combines the reasoning capabilities of LLMs with the factual precision of external retrieval systems. It transforms \"closed-book\" exams into \"open-book\" ones.\n\n## How to Index Data\n\nThe quality of retrieval depends on how data is ingested.\n\n1.  **Chunking**:\n    -   *Fixed-Size*: Simple, but splits semantic units (sentences/paragraphs).\n    -   *Recursive Character*: Respects separators (`\n\n`, `\n`, `.`). **Preferred**.\n    -   *Semantic*: Splits based on embedding similarity changes.\n2.  **Overlap**: Always include 10-20% overlap between chunks to preserve context at boundaries.\n3.  **Embeddings**: Choose models based on domain (e.g., `text-embedding-3-small` for general, `biobert` for medical).\n4.  **Metadata**: Attach `source`, `date`, `author` to chunks for pre-filtering.\n\n## How to Retrieve Context\n\nDon''t rely solely on basic vector search.\n\n-   **Hybrid Search**: Combine Dense (Vector) + Sparse (BM25/Keyword). Weights: `0.7` Vector / `0.3` Keyword usually works best.\n-   **Pre-Filtering**: Use metadata (e.g., `year > 2023`) to narrow the search space before calculating similarity.\n-   **Re-Ranking**: Retrieve $N$ (e.g., 50) documents, then use a Cross-Encoder (e.g., Cohere Rerank) to sort the top $K$ (e.g., 5) by true relevance.\n\n## How to Generate Responses\n\n1.  **Context Window**: Use strict templates. Put context *before* the question or in a dedicated system message section.\n2.  **Citation**: Instruct model to reference chunk IDs (e.g., `[Doc 1]`) in the response.\n3.  **Fallback**: Explicitly instruct: \"If the context contains no relevant information, answer ''I don''t know''.\"\n\n> See [Advanced Patterns](references/advanced-patterns.md) for techniques like HyDE and Parent Document Retrieval.\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n| Issue | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| **Hallucination** | Irrelevant context forced into prompt. | Use Re-ranking and \"I don''t know\" instruction. |\n| **Lost in the Middle** | Key info buried in long context. | Put most relevant chunks at start/end of context window. |\n| **Outdated Info** | Old docs rank higher. | Recency weighting in search or metadata filtering. |\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example: Standard RAG Prompt\n\n**Input:** Query \"How do I reset my password?\" + 3 retrieved chunks.\n\n**Prompt Template:**\n```text\nYou are a helpful support assistant. Use the following pieces of retrieved context to answer the user''s question.\nIf the answer is not in the context, say \"I don''t know\".\n\nContext:\n---\n[Doc 1] To reset password, go to settings...\n[Doc 2] Passwords must be 8 chars...\n---\n\nQuestion: How do I reset my password?\n```\n\n## References\n\n-   [Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Knowledge-Intensive NLP Tasks (Lewis et al.)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.11401)\n-   [LangChain RAG Documentation](https://python.langchain.com/docs/expression_language/cookbook/retrieval)\n-   [Advanced Patterns](references/advanced-patterns.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:49:53.029Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research and Analysis Agents needing factual accuracy and contextual depth in their responses.","zh":"非常适合需要在响应中提供事实准确性和背景深度的研究和分析代理。","ja":"事実の正確性と文脈の深さが必要な研究と分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"응답에서 事実의 정확성과 컨텍스트의 깊이가 필요한 연구 및 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Investigación y Análisis que necesitan precisión factual y profundidad contextual en sus respuestas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche et d''analyse ayant besoin de précision factuelle et de profondeur contextuelle dans leurs réponses.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungs- und Analyseagenten, die in ihren Antworten genaue tatsächliche Angaben und kontextuelle Tiefe benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa e Análise que necessitam de precisão factual e profundidade contextual em suas respostas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов исследований и анализа, которым необходима фактическая точность и контекстная глубина в их ответах.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحث والتحليل الذين يحتاجون إلى دقة фактиة وعمق سياقي في استجاباتهم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enhances LLM reasoning with precise external data retrieval, transforming closed-book exams into open-book ones. It implements academic best practices for chunking including recursive character and semantic splitting to maintain data integrity.","zh":"通过精确的外部数据检索增强LLM的推理能力，将闭卷考试转变为开卷考试。它实现了学术领域的最佳实践，包括递归字符和语义分割，以维护数据的完整性。","ja":"正確な外部データの取得により、LLMの推論能力を強化し、閉じた本の試験を開いた本の試験に変換します。学術的なベストプラクティスを実装しており、データの完全性を維持するために、再帰的な文字とセマンティック分割を含みます。","ko":"정확한 외부 데이터 검색을 통해 LLM의 추론 능력을 강화하여 폐쇄형 시험을 개방형 시험으로 변환합니다. 학술 분야의 최선의 관행을 구현하며, 데이터 무결성을 유지하기 위해 재귀적 문자 및 의미 분할을 포함합니다.","es":"Mejora el razonamiento de LLM con recuperación de datos externos precisos, transformando exámenes de libro cerrado en exámenes de libro abierto. Implementa las mejores prácticas académicas para dividir en partes, incluyendo división recursiva de caracteres y semántica para mantener la integridad de los datos.","fr":"Améliore la raisonnement de LLM avec une récupération de données externes précises, transformant les examens de livre fermé en examens de livre ouvert. Il met en œuvre les meilleures pratiques académiques pour la division en parties, y compris la division récursive de caractères et sémantique pour maintenir l''intégrité des données.","de":"Verbessert die Argumentation von LLM durch präzise externe Datenerfassung, indem es geschlossene Buchprüfungen in offene Buchprüfungen umwandelt. Es implementiert akademische Best Practices für das Aufteilen, einschließlich rekursiver Zeichen- und semantischer Aufteilung, um die Datenintegrität zu wahren.","pt":"Aprimora o raciocínio do LLM com recuperação de dados externos precisos, transformando exames de livro fechado em exames de livro aberto. Ele implementa as melhores práticas acadêmicas para divisão em pedaços, incluindo divisão de caractere recursiva e semântica para manter a integridade dos dados.","ru":"Усиливает рассуждение LLM с помощью точной внешней выборки данных, превращая экзамены с закрытой книгой в экзамены с открытой книгой. Он реализует лучшие академические практики для разделения на части, включая рекурсивное разделение символов и семантику для поддержания целостности данных.","ar":"يعزز التفكير LLM مع استرجاع البيانات الخارجية الدقيقة، مما يtransform يتحول من الاختبارات الكتاب المفتوح إلى الكتاب المفتوح. يطبق أفضل الممارسات الأكاديمية لقسم التشريح بما في ذلك الانقسام التكراري والانقسام الدلالي للحفاظ على سلامة البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Indexing technical documentation for accurate query responses","Augmenting research reports with retrieved factual data","Processing large datasets through optimized chunking strategies"],"zh":["为技术文档建立索引以实现准确的查询响应","使用检索的事实数据增强研究报告","通过优化的分块策略处理大型数据集"],"ja":["技術文書のインデックスを作成して正確なクエリ応答を実現する","取得した事実データを使用して研究報告書を強化する","最適化されたチャンキング戦略を使用して大規模なデータセットを処理する"],"ko":["기술 문서의 색인을 생성하여 정확한 쿼리 응답을 구현하는 것","检출된 事实 데이터를 사용하여 연구 보고서를 강화하는 것","최적화된 청킹 전략을 사용하여 대규모 데이터셋을 처리하는 것"],"es":["Indexación de documentación técnica para respuestas de consulta precisas","Ampliación de informes de investigación con datos factuales recuperados","Procesamiento de grandes conjuntos de datos a través de estrategias de división optimizadas"],"fr":["Indexation de la documentation technique pour des réponses de requête précises","Augmentation des rapports de recherche avec des données factuelles récupérées","Traitement de grands ensembles de données via des stratégies de division optimisées"],"de":["Indizierung von technischer Dokumentation für genaue Abfrageantworten","Ergänzung von Forschungsberichten mit abgerufenen faktischen Daten","Verarbeitung großer Datensätze durch optimierte Aufteilungsstrategien"],"pt":["Indexação de documentação técnica para respostas de consulta precisas","Augmentação de relatórios de pesquisa com dados factuais recuperados","Processamento de grandes conjuntos de dados por meio de estratégias de divisão em pedaços otimizadas"],"ru":["Индексация технической документации для точных ответов на запросы","Усиление отчетов исследований с помощью извлеченных фактических данных","Обработка больших наборов данных с помощью оптимизированных стратегий разделения на части"],"ar":["فهرسة الوثائق الفنية لاستجابات الاستعلامات الدقيقة","تعزيز تقارير البحث بالبيانات الفعلية المستعادة","معالجة مجموعات البيانات الكبيرة من خلال استراتيجيات القسم الأمثل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires proper data preprocessing and chunking","Retrieval quality depends on ingestion methods","Semantic splitting implementation needed for optimal results"],"zh":["需要适当的数据预处理和分块","检索质量取决于摄取方法","需要语义分割实现来获得最佳结果"],"ja":["適切なデータの前処理とチャンキングが必要","取得の品質は摂取方法に依存する","最適な結果を得るためにセマンティック分割の実装が必要"],"ko":["적절한 데이터 전처리 및 청킹이 필요함","검색 품질은 摂取 방법에 따라 다름","최적의 결과를 얻기 위해 의미 분할 구현이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere un preprocesamiento de datos y división adecuados","La calidad de recuperación depende de los métodos de ingesta","Se necesita implementación de división semántica para resultados óptimos"],"fr":["Nécessite un prétraitement de données et une division appropriés","La qualité de récupération dépend des méthodes d''ingestion","Une mise en œuvre de division sémantique est nécessaire pour des résultats optimaux"],"de":["Benötigt eine angemessene Datenvorverarbeitung und Aufteilung","Die Qualität der Erfassung hängt von den Aufnahmemethoden ab","Eine Implementierung der semantischen Aufteilung ist für optimale Ergebnisse erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer pré-processamento de dados adequado e divisão em pedaços","A qualidade da recuperação depende dos métodos de ingestão","Implementação da divisão semântica necessária para resultados ótimos"],"ru":["Требует правильной предварительной обработки данных и разделения на части","Качество выборки зависит от методов ингестии","Необходимо реализовать семантическое разделение для оптимальных результатов"],"ar":["يتطلب معالجة بيانات مناسبة وقسم","تعتمد جودة الاسترجاع على أساليب الهضم","필요한 구현 الانقسام الدلالي للحصول على نتائج مثالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
