量索引优化是指调整索引参数以实现高性能搜索，特别是在处理大量数据时","ja":"ベクトルインデックスチューニングは、高速検索を実現するためにインデックスパラメータを調整すること","ko":"벡터 인덱스 최적화는 높은 성능의 검색을 구현하기 위해 인덱스 파라미터를 조정하는 것","es":"Guía para optimizar índices vectoriales para un rendimiento de producción óptimo. Aprenda a ajustar parámetros HNSW y a implementar la cuantización","fr":"Guide pour optimiser les index vectoriels pour des performances de production optimales. Apprenez à ajuster les paramètres HNSW et à implémenter la quantific...","de":"Leitfaden zur Optimierung von Vektor-Indizes für eine optimale Produktionsleistung. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie HNSW-Parameter anpassen und die Quantisierung imple...","pt":"Otimização de índices vetoriais para produção, abordando tópicos como ajuste de parâmetros HNSW, quantização e otimização de uso de memória.","ru":"Настройка векторных индексов для производительности, включая調整 параметров HNSW, квантование и оптимизацию использования памяти.","ar":"تحسين فهرس المتجهات للإنتاج، يشمل مواضيع مثل ضبط 매개변س HNSW والكمية وتحسين استخدام الذاكرة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["HNSW 参数调优","量化实现","内存优化","搜索延迟减少","召回与速度平衡","扩展至数十亿向量"],"ja":["HNSW パラメータチューニング","量子化の実装","メモリ最適化","検索遅延の削減","リコールとスピードのバランス","数十億のベクトルへの拡張"],"ko":["HNSW 파라미터 조정","양자화 구현","메모리 최적화","검색 지연 감소","리콜과 속도의 균형","수십억개의 벡터로 확장"],"es":["Ajuste de parámetros HNSW","Implementación de la cuantización","Optimización del uso de memoria","Reducción de la latencia de búsqueda","Equilibrio entre recall y velocidad","Escalabilidad a miles de millones de vectores"],"fr":["Ajustement des paramètres HNSW","Implémentation de la quantification","Optimisation de l''utilisation de la mémoire","Réduction de la latence de recherche","Équilibre entre rappel et vitesse","Evolutivité à des milliards de vecteurs"],"de":["Anpassung von HNSW-Parametern","Implementierung der Quantisierung","Optimierung des Speicherverbrauchs","Reduzierung der Suchlatenz","Ausgleich zwischen Recall und Geschwindigkeit","Skalierbarkeit auf Milliarden von Vektoren"],"pt":["Ajuste de parâmetros HNSW","Implementação de quantização","Otimização de uso de memória","Redução da latência de busca","Equilíbrio entre recall e velocidade","Escala para bilhões de vetores"],"ru":["Настройка параметров HNSW","Реализация квантования","Оптимизация использования памяти","Снижение задержки поиска","Балансировка между полнотой и скоростью","Масштабирование до миллиардов векторов"],"ar":["ضبط 매개변س HNSW","تنفيذ الكمية","تحسين استخدام الذاكرة","تقليل تأخر البحث","ترجيح بين الاسترجاع والسرعة","التنمية إلى مليارات من المتجهات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["矢量索引优化","高性能搜索","HNSW","量化","内存优化","搜索延迟","召回与速度平衡"],"ja":["ベクトルインデックスチューニング","高速検索","HNSW","量子化","メモリ最適化","検索遅延","リコールとスピードのバランス"],"ko":["벡터 인덱스 최적화","고성능 검색","HNSW","양자화","메모리 최적화","검색 지연","리콜과 속도의 균형"],"es":["ajuste de índice vectorial","optimización de búsqueda","rendimiento de producción","parámetros HNSW","cuantización","uso de memoria","latencia de búsqueda","recall y velocidad"],"fr":["réglage de l''index vectoriel","optimisation de recherche","performances de production","paramètres HNSW","quantification","utilisation de la mémoire","latence de recherche","rappel et vitesse"],"de":["Feinabstimmung des Vektor-Index","Optimierung der Suche","Produktionsleistung","HNSW-Parameter","Quantisierung","Speicherverbrauch","Suchlatenz","Recall und Geschwindigkeit"],"pt":["otimização de índices vetoriais","desempenho em produção","redução da latência de busca","equilíbrio entre recall e velocidade","ajuste de parâmetros HNSW","quantização","otimização de uso de memória"],"ru":["настройка векторных индексов","производительность в производстве","снижение задержки поиска","балансировка между полнотой и скоростью","настройка параметров HNSW","квантование","оптимизация использования памяти"],"ar":["تحسين فهرس المتجهات","أداء الإنتاج","تقليل تأخر البحث","ترجيح بين الاسترجاع والسرعة","ضبط 매개변س HNSW","الكمية","تحسين استخدام الذاكرة"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vector-index-tuning","description":"Optimize vector index performance for latency, recall, and memory. Use when tuning HNSW parameters, selecting quantization strategies, or scaling vector search infrastructure.","bodyPreview":"# Vector Index Tuning\n\nGuide to optimizing vector indexes for production performance.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Tuning HNSW parameters\n- Implementing quantization\n- Optimizing memory usage\n- Reducing search latency\n- Balancing recall vs speed\n- Scaling to billions of vectors\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need exact search on small datasets (use a flat index)\n- You lack workload metrics or ground truth to validate recall\n- You need end-to-end retrieval system design beyond index tun","body":"# Vector Index Tuning\n\nGuide to optimizing vector indexes for production performance.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Tuning HNSW parameters\n- Implementing quantization\n- Optimizing memory usage\n- Reducing search latency\n- Balancing recall vs speed\n- Scaling to billions of vectors\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need exact search on small datasets (use a flat index)\n- You lack workload metrics or ground truth to validate recall\n- You need end-to-end retrieval system design beyond index tuning\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Gather workload targets (latency, recall, QPS), data size, and memory budget.\n2. Choose an index type and establish a baseline with default parameters.\n3. Benchmark parameter sweeps using real queries and track recall, latency, and memory.\n4. Validate changes on a staging dataset before rolling out to production.\n\nRefer to `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns, checklists, and templates.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Avoid reindexing in production without a rollback plan.\n- Validate changes under realistic load before applying globally.\n- Track recall regressions and revert if quality drops.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns, checklists, and templates.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:49:45.874Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced vector search optimization, particularly those working with large datasets and requiring low-latency query performance.","zh":"非常适合需要高级向量搜索优化的AI代理，特别是那些处理大型数据集并需要低延迟查询性能的代理。","ja":"大規模データセットを扱い、低遅延のクエリパフォーマンスを必要とするAIエージェントに最適化されたベクトル検索最適化を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"대규모 데이터셋을 처리하고 낮은 지연 시간의 쿼리 성능을 요구하는 고급 벡터 검색 최적화를 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una optimización de búsqueda de vectores avanzada, particularmente aquellos que trabajan con grandes conjuntos de datos y requieren un rendimiento de consulta de baja latencia.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une optimisation de recherche de vecteurs avancée, en particulier ceux travaillant avec de grands ensembles de données et nécessitant des performances de requête à faible latence.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Vektor-Suchoptimierung benötigen, insbesondere solche, die mit großen Datensätzen arbeiten und eine geringe Latenz bei Abfrageleistung erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de otimização de busca de vetor avançada, particularmente aqueles que trabalham com grandes conjuntos de dados e requerem desempenho de consulta de baixa latência.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется продвинутая оптимизация векторного поиска, особенно для тех, кто работает с большими наборами данных и требует низкозадержечного выполнения запросов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين بحث متقدم للเวكتور، خاصة تلك التي تعمل مع مجموعات بيانات كبيرة وتتطلب أداء استعلام منخفض الزمن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fine-tune HNSW parameters, implement quantization, and optimize memory usage for production environments, reducing search latency and balancing recall vs speed through efficient vector index tuning, leveraging workload metrics and ground truth for validation.","zh":"使代理能够微调HNSW参数，实现量化并优化生产环境中的内存使用，通过高效的向量索引调优减少搜索延迟并平衡召回与速度，并利用工作负载指标和真实数据进行验证。","ja":"エージェントがHNSWパラメータを微調整し、量化を実装し、プロダクション環境でのメモリ使用量を最適化することで、検索待ち時間を短縮し、効率的なベクトルインデックスの調整によりリコールと速度のバランスをとり、ワークロードメトリクスとグラウンドトゥルースを使用して検証します。","ko":"에이전트가 HNSW 파라미터를 세부 조정하고 양자화를 구현하며 프로덕션 환경에서 메모리 사용량을 최적화하여 효율적인 벡터 인덱스 튜닝을 통해 검색 지연 시간을 줄이고 리콜과 속도의 균형을 맞추고 작업 부하 메트릭스와 그라운드 트루스를 사용하여 검증합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ajustar los parámetros de HNSW, implementar la cuantización y optimizar el uso de memoria para entornos de producción, reduciendo la latencia de búsqueda y equilibrando la recopilación frente a la velocidad a través de un ajuste eficiente del índice de vectores, aprovechando las métricas de carga de trabajo y la verdad fundamental para la validación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de peaufiner les paramètres HNSW, de mettre en œuvre la quantification et d''optimiser l''utilisation de la mémoire pour les environnements de production, en réduisant la latence de recherche et en équilibrant le rappel par rapport à la vitesse grâce à un réglage efficace de l''index de vecteurs, en exploitant les métriques de charge de travail et la vérité de base pour la validation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, HNSW-Parameter fein abzustimmen, Quantisierung zu implementieren und den Speicherbedarf für Produktionsumgebungen zu optimieren, wodurch die Suchlatenz verringert und die Wiedererinnerung im Verhältnis zur Geschwindigkeit durch effizientes Vektorindex-Tuning ausgeglichen wird, wobei die Arbeitslastmetriken und die Grundwahrheit für die Validierung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a ajustar os parâmetros HNSW, implementar quantização e otimizar o uso de memória para ambientes de produção, reduzindo a latência de busca e equilibrando a recall versus velocidade por meio de ajuste eficiente do índice de vetor, utilizando métricas de carga de trabalho e verdade fundamentada para validação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настраивать параметры HNSW, реализовывать квантование и оптимизировать использование памяти для производственных сред, снижая задержку поиска и балансируя припоминание versus скорость посредством эффективной настройки векторного индекса, используя метрики рабочей нагрузки и основную истину для проверки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ضبط 매개 चर HNSW وتنفيذ الكمية وتحسين استخدام الذاكرة للبيئات الإنتاجية، مما يقلل من زمن البحث ويوازن بين استدعاء السرعة من خلال ضبط دقيق لفهرس المتجه، باستخدام مقاييس حمولة العمل والحقيقة الأساسية للتأكيد."},"useCases":{"en":["Tuning HNSW parameters for optimal search performance","Implementing quantization to reduce memory footprint","Optimizing vector indexes for large-scale datasets with billions of vectors"],"zh":["为获得最佳搜索性能而调整HNSW参数","实现量化以减少内存占用","优化大规模数据集的向量索引，处理数十亿个向量"],"ja":["最適な検索パフォーマンスを得るためのHNSWパラメータの調整","メモリフットプリントを削減するための量化の実装","数十億のベクトルを扱う大規模データセットのベクトルインデックスの最適化"],"ko":["최적의 검색 성능을 얻기 위한 HNSW 파라미터 조정","메모리 フットプリント를 줄이기 위한 양자화 구현","수십억 개의 벡터를 처리하는 대규모 데이터셋의 벡터 인덱스 최적화"],"es":["Ajustar los parámetros de HNSW para un rendimiento de búsqueda óptimo","Implementar la cuantización para reducir la huella de memoria","Optimizar los índices de vectores para conjuntos de datos a gran escala con billones de vectores"],"fr":["Réglage des paramètres HNSW pour un rendement de recherche optimal","Mise en œuvre de la quantification pour réduire l''empreinte mémoire","Optimisation des index de vecteurs pour des ensembles de données à grande échelle avec des milliards de vecteurs"],"de":["Feinabstimmung der HNSW-Parameter für optimale Suchleistung","Implementierung der Quantisierung zur Reduzierung des Speicherbedarfs","Optimierung der Vektorindizes für große Datensätze mit Milliarden von Vektoren"],"pt":["Ajuste de parâmetros HNSW para desempenho de busca ótimo","Implementação de quantização para reduzir a pegada de memória","Otimização de índices de vetor para conjuntos de dados de grande escala com bilhões de vetores"],"ru":["Настройка параметров HNSW для оптимального поискового производительности","Реализация квантования для уменьшения следа памяти","Оптимизация векторных индексов для крупномасштабных наборов данных с миллиардами векторов"],"ar":["ضبط 매개 चर HNSW لأداء بحث مثالي","تنفيذ الكمية لتقليل بصمة الذاكرة","تحسين فهارس المتجهات لمجموعات بيانات كبيرة النطاق مع مليارات المتجهات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Not suitable for exact search on small datasets, where a flat index is recommended","Requires workload metrics or ground truth to validate recall","Limited to vector index tuning, not end-to-end retrieval system design"],"zh":["不适合小型数据集的精确搜索，推荐使用平面索引","需要工作负载指标或真实数据来验证召回","仅限于向量索引调优，不是端到端检索系统设计"],"ja":["小規模データセットの正確な検索には適さない。フラットインデックスが推奨される","リコールの検証にはワークロードメトリクスまたはグラウンドトゥルースが必要","ベクトルインデックスの調整のみ。エンドツーエンドの検索システム設計ではない"],"ko":["소규모 데이터셋의 정확한 검색에는 적합하지 않음. 평면 인덱스가 권장됨","리콜의 검증을 위해 작업 부하 메트릭스 또는 그라운드 트루스가 필요","벡터 인덱스 튜닝만 해당함. 종단간 검색 시스템 설계 아님"],"es":["No es adecuado para la búsqueda exacta en pequeños conjuntos de datos, donde se recomienda un índice plano","Requiere métricas de carga de trabajo o verdad fundamental para validar el recuerdo","Limitado al ajuste del índice de vectores, no al diseño de sistemas de recuperación de extremo a extremo"],"fr":["N''est pas adapté pour la recherche exacte sur de petits ensembles de données, où un index plat est recommandé","Nécessite des métriques de charge de travail ou une vérité de base pour valider le rappel","Limité au réglage de l''index de vecteurs, et non à la conception de systèmes de récupération de bout en bout"],"de":["Nicht geeignet für exakte Suche in kleinen Datensätzen, wo ein flacher Index empfohlen wird","Benötigt Arbeitslastmetriken oder Grundwahrheit, um die Wiedererinnerung zu validieren","Begrenzt auf das Feintuning des Vektorindex, nicht auf das Design von End-to-End-Retrieval-Systemen"],"pt":["Não é adequado para busca exata em pequenos conjuntos de dados, onde um índice plano é recomendado","Exige métricas de carga de trabalho ou verdade fundamentada para validar a recall","Limitado ao ajuste de índice de vetor, não ao design de sistema de recuperação de ponta a ponta"],"ru":["Не подходит для точного поиска на небольших наборах данных, где рекомендуется плоский индекс","Требует метрик рабочей нагрузки или основной истины для проверки припоминания","Ограничен настройкой векторного индекса, а не проектированием системы извлечения данных от начала до конца"],"ar":["غير مناسب للبحث الدقيق في مجموعات بيانات صغيرة، حيث يوصى بفهرس مسطح","يتطلب مقاييس حمولة العمل أو الحقيقة الأساسية لتحقق استدعاء","محدود بضبط فهرس المتجه، وليس بتصميم نظام استرجاع من النهاية إلى النهاية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/langchain-architecture', 'community', 'xiangteng007', 'XXT-AGENT', 'xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT', 'langchain-architecture', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z', '2026-02-18T09:50:18.074Z', NULL, '{"id":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/langchain-architecture","name":"langchain-architecture","description":{"zh":"LangChain 框架用于构建复杂的 LLM 应用，包括代理、链、内存和工具集成","ja":"LangChain フレームワークは、エージェント、チェーン、メモリ、ツール統合を使用して複雑な LLM アプリケーションを構築する","ko":"LangChain 프레임워크는 에이전트, 체인, 메모리, 툴 통합을 사용하여 복잡한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축","es":"La arquitectura LangChain es un marco para construir aplicaciones LLM avanzadas. Aprende a aprovechar su potencial.","fr":"L''architecture LangChain est un cadre pour créer des applications LLM avancées. Apprenez à exploiter son potentiel.","de":"Die LangChain-Architektur ist ein Rahmenwerk für die Erstellung von fortgeschrittenen LLM-Anwendungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ihr Potenzial nutzen können.","pt":"A arquitetura LangChain é um framework para construir aplicações LLM avançadas. Aprenda a dominá-la com agentes, cadeias, memória e integração de ferramentas","ru":"Архитектура LangChain - это фреймворк для создания сложных приложений LLM. Освойте ее с помощью агентов, цепочек, памяти и интеграции инструментов","ar":"هندسة LangChain هي إطار لبناء تطبيقات LLM متقدمة. تعلم كيفية السيطرة عليها مع وكلاء وتمديدات وذاكرة وتكامل أدوات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"LangChain 架构指南","ja":"LangChain アーキテクチャのマスター","ko":"LangChain 아키텍처 가이드","es":"Arquitectura LangChain: Desarrollo de Aplicaciones LLM","fr":"Architecture LangChain : Création d''applications LLM","de":"LangChain-Architektur: Entwicklung von LLM-Anwendungen","pt":"Arquitetura LangChain: Desenvolva Aplicativos LLM Avançados","ru":"Архитектура LangChain: Создание Sophisticated LLM Приложений","ar":"هندسة LangChain: بناء تطبيقات LLM متقدمة","en":"langchain-architecture"},"description":{"zh":"LangChain 框架用于构建复杂的 LLM 应用，包括代理、链、内存和工具集成","ja":"LangChain フレームワークは、エージェント、チェーン、メモリ、ツール統合を使用して複雑な LLM アプリケーションを構築する","ko":"LangChain 프레임워크는 에이전트, 체인, 메모리, 툴 통합을 사용하여 복잡한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축","es":"La arquitectura LangChain es un marco para construir aplicaciones LLM avanzadas. Aprende a aprovechar su potencial.","fr":"L''architecture LangChain est un cadre pour créer des applications LLM avancées. Apprenez à exploiter son potentiel.","de":"Die LangChain-Architektur ist ein Rahmenwerk für die Erstellung von fortgeschrittenen LLM-Anwendungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ihr Potenzial nutzen können.","pt":"A arquitetura LangChain é um framework para construir aplicações LLM avançadas. Aprenda a dominá-la com agentes, cadeias, memória e integração de ferramentas","ru":"Архитектура LangChain - это фреймворк для создания сложных приложений LLM. Освойте ее с помощью агентов, цепочек, памяти и интеграции инструментов","ar":"هندسة LangChain هي إطار لبناء تطبيقات LLM متقدمة. تعلم كيفية السيطرة عليها مع وكلاء وتمديدات وذاكرة وتكامل أدوات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["代理","链","内存","工具集成","LLM 应用构建"],"ja":["エージェント","チェーン","メモリ","ツール統合","LLM アプリケーション構築"],"ko":["에이전트","체인","메모리","툴 통합","LLM 애플리케이션 구축"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones LLM avanzadas","Integración de agentes y cadenas","Uso de memoria y herramientas","Aplicación de mejores prácticas","Verificación de resultados"],"fr":["Création d''applications LLM avancées","Intégration d''agents et de chaînes","Utilisation de la mémoire et des outils","Application des meilleures pratiques","Vérification des résultats"],"de":["Erstellung von fortgeschrittenen LLM-Anwendungen","Integration von Agenten und Ketten","Nutzung von Speicher und Werkzeugen","Anwendung von Best Practices","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações LLM avançadas","Integração de agentes e cadeias","Utilização de memória para processamento de dados","Integração de ferramentas para aumento da produtividade","Flexibilidade e personalização para atender às necessidades do desenvolvedor"],"ru":["Создание сложных приложений LLM","Интеграция агентов и цепочек","Использование памяти для обработки данных","Интеграция инструментов для повышения производительности","Гибкость и настройка для удовлетворения потребностей разработчика"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات LLM متقدمة","دمج وكلاء وتمديدات","استخدام الذاكرة لمعالجة البيانات","دمج أدوات لزيادة الإنتاجية","المرونة والتخصيص ل 满 اطلبات المطور"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LangChain","LLM","代理","链","内存","工具集成","应用构建"],"ja":["LangChain","LLM","エージェント","チェーン","メモリ","ツール統合","アプリケーション構築"],"ko":["LangChain","LLM","에이전트","체인","메모리","툴 통합","애플리케이션 구축"],"es":["arquitectura LangChain","desarrollo de aplicaciones LLM","agentes y cadenas","memoria y herramientas","mejores prácticas","verificación de resultados"],"fr":["architecture LangChain","création d''applications LLM","agents et chaînes","mémoire et outils","meilleures pratiques","vérification des résultats"],"de":["LangChain-Architektur","Erstellung von LLM-Anwendungen","Agenten und Ketten","Speicher und Werkzeuge","Best Practices","Überprüfung der Ergebnisse"],"pt":["arquitetura LangChain","desenvolvimento de aplicações LLM","agentes e cadeias","memória e processamento de dados","integração de ferramentas","produtividade e flexibilidade","desenvolvedores de software","tecnologias de inteligência artificial"],"ru":["архитектура LangChain","создание приложений LLM","агенты и цепочки","память и обработка данных","интеграция инструментов","производительность и гибкость","разработчики программного обеспечения","технологии искусственного интеллекта"],"ar":["هندسة LangChain","بناء تطبيقات LLM","وكلاء وتمديدات","ذاكرة ومعالجة البيانات","دمج أدوات","إنتاجية ومرونة","مطورو البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langchain-architecture","description":"Design LLM applications using the LangChain framework with agents, memory, and tool integration patterns. Use when building LangChain applications, implementing AI agents, or creating complex LLM workflows.","bodyPreview":"# LangChain Architecture\n\nMaster the LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to langchain architecture\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, ope","body":"# LangChain Architecture\n\nMaster the LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to langchain architecture\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building autonomous AI agents with tool access\n- Implementing complex multi-step LLM workflows\n- Managing conversation memory and state\n- Integrating LLMs with external data sources and APIs\n- Creating modular, reusable LLM application components\n- Implementing document processing pipelines\n- Building production-grade LLM applications\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Agents\nAutonomous systems that use LLMs to decide which actions to take.\n\n**Agent Types:**\n- **ReAct**: Reasoning + Acting in interleaved manner\n- **OpenAI Functions**: Leverages function calling API\n- **Structured Chat**: Handles multi-input tools\n- **Conversational**: Optimized for chat interfaces\n- **Self-Ask with Search**: Decomposes complex queries\n\n### 2. Chains\nSequences of calls to LLMs or other utilities.\n\n**Chain Types:**\n- **LLMChain**: Basic prompt + LLM combination\n- **SequentialChain**: Multiple chains in sequence\n- **RouterChain**: Routes inputs to specialized chains\n- **TransformChain**: Data transformations between steps\n- **MapReduceChain**: Parallel processing with aggregation\n\n### 3. Memory\nSystems for maintaining context across interactions.\n\n**Memory Types:**\n- **ConversationBufferMemory**: Stores all messages\n- **ConversationSummaryMemory**: Summarizes older messages\n- **ConversationBufferWindowMemory**: Keeps last N messages\n- **EntityMemory**: Tracks information about entities\n- **VectorStoreMemory**: Semantic similarity retrieval\n\n### 4. Document Processing\nLoading, transforming, and storing documents for retrieval.\n\n**Components:**\n- **Document Loaders**: Load from various sources\n- **Text Splitters**: Chunk documents intelligently\n- **Vector Stores**: Store and retrieve embeddings\n- **Retrievers**: Fetch relevant documents\n- **Indexes**: Organize documents for efficient access\n\n### 5. Callbacks\nHooks for logging, monitoring, and debugging.\n\n**Use Cases:**\n- Request/response logging\n- Token usage tracking\n- Latency monitoring\n- Error handling\n- Custom metrics collection\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.agents import AgentType, initialize_agent, load_tools\nfrom langchain.llms import OpenAI\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory\n\n# Initialize LLM\nllm = OpenAI(temperature=0)\n\n# Load tools\ntools = load_tools([\"serpapi\", \"llm-math\"], llm=llm)\n\n# Add memory\nmemory = ConversationBufferMemory(memory_key=\"chat_history\")\n\n# Create agent\nagent = initialize_agent(\n    tools,\n    llm,\n    agent=AgentType.CONVERSATIONAL_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n    memory=memory,\n    verbose=True\n)\n\n# Run agent\nresult = agent.run(\"What''s the weather in SF? Then calculate 25 * 4\")\n```\n\n## Architecture Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: RAG with LangChain\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import TextLoader\nfrom langchain.text_splitter import CharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\nfrom langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\n\n# Load and process documents\nloader = TextLoader(''documents.txt'')\ndocuments = loader.load()\n\ntext_splitter = CharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=1000, chunk_overlap=200)\ntexts = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)\n\n# Create vector store\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = Chroma.from_documents(texts, embeddings)\n\n# Create retrieval chain\nqa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n    llm=llm,\n    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(),\n    return_source_documents=True\n)\n\n# Query\nresult = qa_chain({\"query\": \"What is the main topic?\"})\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Custom Agent with Tools\n```python\nfrom langchain.agents import Tool, AgentExecutor\nfrom langchain.agents.react.base import ReActDocstoreAgent\nfrom langchain.tools import tool\n\n@tool\ndef search_database(query: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Search internal database for information.\"\"\"\n    # Your database search logic\n    return f\"Results for: {query}\"\n\n@tool\ndef send_email(recipient: str, content: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Send an email to specified recipient.\"\"\"\n    # Email sending logic\n    return f\"Email sent to {recipient}\"\n\ntools = [search_database, send_email]\n\nagent = initialize_agent(\n    tools,\n    llm,\n    agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n    verbose=True\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Multi-Step Chain\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import LLMChain, SequentialChain\nfrom langchain.prompts import PromptTemplate\n\n# Step 1: Extract key information\nextract_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"text\"],\n    template=\"Extract key entities from: {text}\\n\\nEntities:\"\n)\nextract_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=extract_prompt, output_key=\"entities\")\n\n# Step 2: Analyze entities\nanalyze_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"entities\"],\n    template=\"Analyze these entities: {entities}\\n\\nAnalysis:\"\n)\nanalyze_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=analyze_prompt, output_key=\"analysis\")\n\n# Step 3: Generate summary\nsummary_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"entities\", \"analysis\"],\n    template=\"Summarize:\\nEntities: {entities}\\nAnalysis: {analysis}\\n\\nSummary:\"\n)\nsummary_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=summary_prompt, output_key=\"summary\")\n\n# Combine into sequential chain\noverall_chain = SequentialChain(\n    chains=[extract_chain, analyze_chain, summary_chain],\n    input_variables=[\"text\"],\n    output_variables=[\"entities\", \"analysis\", \"summary\"],\n    verbose=True\n)\n```\n\n## Memory Management Best Practices\n\n### Choosing the Right Memory Type\n```python\n# For short conversations (< 10 messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory\nmemory = ConversationBufferMemory()\n\n# For long conversations (summarize old messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationSummaryMemory\nmemory = ConversationSummaryMemory(llm=llm)\n\n# For sliding window (last N messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferWindowMemory\nmemory = ConversationBufferWindowMemory(k=5)\n\n# For entity tracking\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationEntityMemory\nmemory = ConversationEntityMemory(llm=llm)\n\n# For semantic retrieval of relevant history\nfrom langchain.memory import VectorStoreRetrieverMemory\nmemory = VectorStoreRetrieverMemory(retriever=retriever)\n```\n\n## Callback System\n\n### Custom Callback Handler\n```python\nfrom langchain.callbacks.base import BaseCallbackHandler\n\nclass CustomCallbackHandler(BaseCallbackHandler):\n    def on_llm_start(self, serialized, prompts, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM started with prompts: {prompts}\")\n\n    def on_llm_end(self, response, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM ended with response: {response}\")\n\n    def on_llm_error(self, error, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM error: {error}\")\n\n    def on_chain_start(self, serialized, inputs, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"Chain started with inputs: {inputs}\")\n\n    def on_agent_action(self, action, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"Agent taking action: {action}\")\n\n# Use callback\nagent.run(\"query\", callbacks=[CustomCallbackHandler()])\n```\n\n## Testing Strategies\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom unittest.mock import Mock\n\ndef test_agent_tool_selection():\n    # Mock LLM to return specific tool selection\n    mock_llm = Mock()\n    mock_llm.predict.return_value = \"Action: search_database\\nAction Input: test query\"\n\n    agent = initialize_agent(tools, mock_llm, agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION)\n\n    result = agent.run(\"test query\")\n\n    # Verify correct tool was selected\n    assert \"search_database\" in str(mock_llm.predict.call_args)\n\ndef test_memory_persistence():\n    memory = ConversationBufferMemory()\n\n    memory.save_context({\"input\": \"Hi\"}, {\"output\": \"Hello!\"})\n\n    assert \"Hi\" in memory.load_memory_variables({})[''history'']\n    assert \"Hello!\" in memory.load_memory_variables({})[''history'']\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### 1. Caching\n```python\nfrom langchain.cache import InMemoryCache\nimport langchain\n\nlangchain.llm_cache = InMemoryCache()\n```\n\n### 2. Batch Processing\n```python\n# Process multiple documents in parallel\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n\nloader = DirectoryLoader(''./docs'')\ndocs = loader.load()\n\ndef process_doc(doc):\n    return text_splitter.split_documents([doc])\n\nwith ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=4) as executor:\n    split_docs = list(executor.map(process_doc, docs))\n```\n\n### 3. Streaming Responses\n```python\nfrom langchain.callbacks.streaming_stdout import StreamingStdOutCallbackHandler\n\nllm = OpenAI(streaming=True, callbacks=[StreamingStdOutCallbackHandler()])\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/agents.md**: Deep dive on agent architectures\n- **references/memory.md**: Memory system patterns\n- **references/chains.md**: Chain composition strategies\n- **references/document-processing.md**: Document loading and indexing\n- **references/callbacks.md**: Monitoring and observability\n- **assets/agent-template.py**: Production-ready agent template\n- **assets/memory-config.yaml**: Memory configuration examples\n- **assets/chain-example.py**: Complex chain examples\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Memory Overflow**: Not managing conversation history length\n2. **Tool Selection Errors**: Poor tool descriptions confuse agents\n3. **Context Window Exceeded**: Exceeding LLM token limits\n4. **No Error Handling**: Not catching and handling agent failures\n5. **Inefficient Retrieval**: Not optimizing vector store queries\n\n## Production Checklist\n\n- [ ] Implement proper error handling\n- [ ] Add request/response logging\n- [ ] Monitor token usage and costs\n- [ ] Set timeout limits for agent execution\n- [ ] Implement rate limiting\n- [ ] Add input validation\n- [ ] Test with edge cases\n- [ ] Set up observability (callbacks)\n- [ ] Implement fallback strategies\n- [ ] Version control prompts and configurations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:50:18.074Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like LangChain, AutoGPT, and Claude Code requiring advanced framework integration for building sophisticated LLM applications","zh":"适用于像 LangChain、AutoGPT 和 Claude Code 的 AI 代理，需要高级框架集成来构建复杂的 LLM 应用程序","ja":"LangChain、AutoGPT、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに適しており、洗練された LLM アプリケーションを構築するための高度なフレームワーク統合を必要とする","ko":"LangChain, AutoGPT, Claude Code 등의 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 복잡한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 고급 프레임워크 통합을 요구함","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como LangChain, AutoGPT y Claude Code que requieren una integración de marco avanzada para construir aplicaciones LLM sofisticadas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme LangChain, AutoGPT et Claude Code nécessitant une intégration de framework avancée pour construire des applications LLM sophistiquées","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie LangChain, AutoGPT und Claude Code, die eine erweiterte Framework-Integration für die Erstellung von komplexen LLM-Anwendungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como LangChain, AutoGPT e Claude Code que requerem integração avançada de framework para construir aplicações LLM sofisticadas","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как LangChain, AutoGPT и Claude Code, требующих расширенной интеграции фреймворка для создания сложных приложений LLM","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوسائط الذكية مثل LangChain و AutoGPT و Claude Code التي تتطلب تكامل إطار متقدم لإنشاء تطبيقات LLM متقدمة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master the LangChain framework, leveraging agents, chains, memory, and tool integration for seamless LLM application development, utilizing protocols and libraries specific to LangChain architecture","zh":"赋予代理掌握 LangChain 框架的能力，利用代理、链、内存和工具集成，实现无缝的 LLM 应用程序开发，利用特定于 LangChain 架构的协议和库","ja":"エージェントが LangChain フレームワークをマスターすることを可能にし、エージェント、チェーン、メモリ、ツールの統合を利用して、LangChain アーキテクチャ固有のプロトコルとライブラリを使用して、無縫の LLM アプリケーション開発を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 LangChain 프레임워크를 마스터할 수 있도록 하며, 에이전트, 체인, 메모리 및 툴 통합을 활용하여, LangChain 아키텍처 고유의 프로토콜 및 라이브러리를 사용하여 무결점의 LLM 애플리케이션 개발을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar el marco LangChain, aprovechando a los agentes, cadenas, memoria y la integración de herramientas para un desarrollo de aplicaciones LLM sin problemas, utilizando protocolos y bibliotecas específicos de la arquitectura LangChain","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser le framework LangChain, en exploitant les agents, les chaînes, la mémoire et l''intégration d''outils pour un développement d''applications LLM sans problème, en utilisant des protocoles et des bibliothèques spécifiques à l''architecture LangChain","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, das LangChain-Framework zu meistern, indem es Agents, Ketten, Speicher und Tool-Integration für eine reibungslose LLM-Anwendungsentwicklung nutzt, unter Verwendung von Protokollen und Bibliotheken, die speziell für die LangChain-Architektur konzipiert sind","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar o framework LangChain, aproveitando agentes, cadeias, memória e integração de ferramentas para desenvolvimento de aplicações LLM sem interrupções, utilizando protocolos e bibliotecas específicos da arquitetura LangChain","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить фреймворк LangChain, используя агентов, цепочки, память и интеграцию инструментов для бесшовного разработки приложений LLM, используя протоколы и библиотеки, специфичные для архитектуры LangChain","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من إتقان إطار LangChain، واستخدام الوكلاء والسلاسل والذاكرة وتكامل الأدوات لتطوير تطبيقات LLM دون انقطاع، باستخدام بروتوكولات ومكتبات محددة لمعمارية LangChain"},"useCases":{"en":["Building sophisticated LLM applications with multi-agent interactions","Designing memory-augmented chains for enhanced application performance","Integrating external tools with LangChain for expanded functionality"],"zh":["构建具有多代理交互的复杂 LLM 应用程序","设计增强应用程序性能的内存增强链","将外部工具集成到 LangChain 中以扩展功能"],"ja":["マルチエージェントのやり取りを備えた洗練された LLM アプリケーションを構築する","アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを向上させるためのメモリ増強チェーンを設計する","LangChain に外部ツールを統合して機能を拡張する"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 상호작용을 갖춘 복잡한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축함","애플리케이션 성능 개선을 위한 메모리 증강 체인을 설계함","기능 확장을 위해 LangChain에 외부 툴을 통합함"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones LLM sofisticadas con interacciones de multiagentes","Diseñar cadenas con memoria mejorada para un rendimiento de aplicación mejorado","Integrar herramientas externas con LangChain para una funcionalidad expandida"],"fr":["Construire des applications LLM sophistiquées avec des interactions multi-agents","Concevoir des chaînes à mémoire améliorée pour une performance d''application améliorée","Intégrer des outils externes avec LangChain pour une fonctionnalité étendue"],"de":["Erstellen von komplexen LLM-Anwendungen mit Multi-Agenten-Interaktionen","Entwerfen von Ketten mit verbesserter Speicherfunktion für eine verbesserte Anwendungsleistung","Integration externer Tools mit LangChain für eine erweiterte Funktionalität"],"pt":["Construir aplicações LLM sofisticadas com interações multi-agente","Projetar cadeias com memória aumentada para melhorar o desempenho da aplicação","Integrar ferramentas externas com LangChain para funcionalidade expandida"],"ru":["Создание сложных приложений LLM с взаимодействием多 агентов","Проектирование цепочек с增强енной памятью для улучшения производительности приложения","Интеграция внешних инструментов с LangChain для расширенной функциональности"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات LLM متقدمة مع تفاعلات متعددة الوكلاء","تصميم سلاسل مع ذاكرة محسنة لتحسين أداء التطبيق","دمج أدوات خارجية مع LangChain من أجل وظيفية موسعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with LangChain framework and ecosystem","Limited to applications within the LangChain architecture scope"],"zh":["需要熟悉 LangChain 框架和生态系统","仅限于 LangChain 架构范围内的应用程序"],"ja":["LangChain フレームワークとエコシステムの知識が必要","LangChain アーキテクチャの範囲内でのみ使用可能"],"ko":["LangChain 프레임워크 및 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요함","LangChain 아키텍처의 범위 내에서만 사용 가능함"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con el marco y el ecosistema LangChain","Limitado a aplicaciones dentro del alcance de la arquitectura LangChain"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du framework et de l''écosystème LangChain","Limité aux applications dans la portée de l''architecture LangChain"],"de":["Erfordert Vertrautheit mit dem LangChain-Framework und -Ökosystem","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen im Umfang der LangChain-Architektur"],"pt":["Requer familiaridade com o framework LangChain e seu ecossistema","Limitado a aplicações dentro do escopo da arquitetura LangChain"],"ru":["Требует знакомства с фреймворком LangChain и его экосистемой","Ограничен приложениями в рамках объема архитектуры LangChain"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بإطار LangChain ونظامه البيئي","محدود للتطبيقات في نطاق معمارية LangChain"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
