e":["Umwandlung von URLs in Markdown","Verwendet Chrome CDP für die Umwandlung","Enthält benutzerdefinierte Skripte","Flexible Ausführung","Kompatibel mit verschiedenen Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["Conversão de URL para markdown limpo","Uso do Chrome CDP para fetch de URLs","Scripts localizados no diretório scripts/","Suporte à execução de scripts personalizados","Facilidade de integração em projetos"],"ru":["Преобразование URL в чистый markdown","Использование Chrome CDP для fetch URL","Скрипты расположены в директории scripts/","Поддержка выполнения пользовательских скриптов","Легкость интеграции в проекты"],"ar":["تحويل URL إلى markdown نظيف","استخدام Chrome CDP لاسترجاع URLs","السكربتات موجودة في الدليل scripts/","دعم تنفيذ سكربتات مخصصة","سهولة الدمج في المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["URL转Markdown","Chrome CDP","HTML转换","Markdown生成","技能开发","脚本执行"],"ja":["URLをMarkdownに変換","Chrome CDP","HTML変換","Markdown生成","スキル開発","スクリプト実行"],"ko":["URL을 Markdown로 변환","Chrome CDP","HTML 변환","Markdown 생성","스킬 개발","스크립트 실행"],"es":["conversión de URL a markdown","Chrome CDP","scripts personalizados","desarrollo web","markdown","URL","conversión de contenido"],"fr":["conversion d''URL en markdown","Chrome CDP","scripts personnalisés","développement web","markdown","URL","conversion de contenu"],"de":["Umwandlung von URLs in Markdown","Chrome CDP","benutzerdefinierte Skripte","Webentwicklung","Markdown","URL","Inhaltskonvertierung"],"pt":["conversor de url para markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","chrome cdp","markdown limpo","ferramenta de conversão","desenvolvimento web","programação"],"ru":["преобразователь url в markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","chrome cdp","чистый markdown","инструмент преобразования","веб-разработка","программирование"],"ar":["مُحَوِّل url إلى markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","chrome cdp","markdown نظيف","أداة تحويل","تطوير ويب","برمجة"]}},"owner":"lisposter","repo":"creator","repoPath":"lisposter/creator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-url-to-markdown","description":"Fetch any URL and convert to markdown using Chrome CDP. Supports two modes - auto-capture on page load, or wait for user signal (for pages requiring login). Use when user wants to save a webpage as markdown.","bodyPreview":"# URL to Markdown\n\nFetches any URL via Chrome CDP and converts HTML to clean markdown.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.t","body":"# URL to Markdown\n\nFetches any URL via Chrome CDP and converts HTML to clean markdown.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | CLI entry point for URL fetching |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                          Path                          │     Location      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default output directory | Default capture mode | Timeout settings\n\n## Features\n\n- Chrome CDP for full JavaScript rendering\n- Two capture modes: auto or wait-for-user\n- Clean markdown output with metadata\n- Handles login-required pages via wait mode\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto mode (default) - capture when page loads\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url>\n\n# Wait mode - wait for user signal before capture\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url> --wait\n\n# Save to specific file\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url> -o output.md\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `<url>` | URL to fetch |\n| `-o <path>` | Output file path (default: auto-generated) |\n| `--wait` | Wait for user signal before capturing |\n| `--timeout <ms>` | Page load timeout (default: 30000) |\n\n## Capture Modes\n\n| Mode | Behavior | Use When |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| Auto (default) | Capture on network idle | Public pages, static content |\n| Wait (`--wait`) | User signals when ready | Login-required, lazy loading, paywalls |\n\n**Wait mode workflow**:\n1. Run with `--wait` → script outputs \"Press Enter when ready\"\n2. Ask user to confirm page is ready\n3. Send newline to stdin to trigger capture\n\n## Output Format\n\nYAML front matter with `url`, `title`, `description`, `author`, `published`, `captured_at` fields, followed by converted markdown content.\n\n## Output Directory\n\n```\nurl-to-markdown/<domain>/<slug>.md\n```\n\n- `<slug>`: From page title or URL path (kebab-case, 2-6 words)\n- Conflict resolution: Append timestamp `<slug>-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md`\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `URL_CHROME_PATH` | Custom Chrome executable path |\n| `URL_DATA_DIR` | Custom data directory |\n| `URL_CHROME_PROFILE_DIR` | Custom Chrome profile directory |\n\n**Troubleshooting**: Chrome not found → set `URL_CHROME_PATH`. Timeout → increase `--timeout`. Complex pages → try `--wait` mode.\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:50:08.556Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Scraping Agents needing to convert HTML content to clean markdown via Chrome CDP.","zh":"非常适合需要通过Chrome CDP将HTML内容转换为干净markdown的Web Scraping Agents","ja":"Chrome CDPを使用してHTMLコンテンツをクリーンなMarkdownに変換する必要があるWeb Scrapingエージェントに最適","ko":"Chrome CDP를 사용하여 HTML 내용을 깨끗한 마크다운으로 변환해야 하는 웹 스크레이핑 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Scraping Web que necesitan convertir contenido HTML a markdown limpio a través de Chrome CDP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de scraping Web ayant besoin de convertir le contenu HTML en markdown propre via Chrome CDP.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Scraping-Agents, die HTML-Inhalt in sauberes Markdown über Chrome CDP umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Scraping Web que precisam converter conteúdo HTML em markdown limpo via Chrome CDP.","ru":"Идеально для веб-скрейпинговых агентов, которым необходимо преобразовывать содержимое HTML в чистый markdown через Chrome CDP.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التخليص الويب التي تحتاج إلى تحويل المحتوى HTML إلى markdown نظيف من خلال Chrome CDP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch URLs and convert HTML to markdown, leveraging Chrome CDP for seamless content preview and transformation, supporting HTML to markdown conversion for web scraping tasks.","zh":"赋予代理程序获取URL和将HTML转换为Markdown的能力，利用Chrome CDP实现无缝的内容预览和转换，支持HTML到Markdown的转换以用于网页抓取任务","ja":"エージェントにURLを取得し、HTMLをMarkdownに変換する機能を付与し、Chrome CDPを使用してシームレスなコンテンツプレビューと変換を実現し、Webスクレイピングタスク用のHTMLからMarkdownへの変換をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 URL을 가져오고 HTML을 마크다운으로 변환하는 기능을 제공하며 Chrome CDP를 사용하여 무결점의 콘텐츠 미리보기 및 변환을 지원하고 웹 스크레이핑 작업을 위한 HTML에서 마크다운으로의 변환을 지원","es":"Permite a los agentes recuperar URLs y convertir HTML a markdown, aprovechando Chrome CDP para una vista previa de contenido y transformación sin problemas, y admitiendo la conversión de HTML a markdown para tareas de scraping web.","fr":"Autorise les agents à récupérer des URL et à convertir le HTML en markdown, en exploitant Chrome CDP pour une prévisualisation de contenu et une transformation sans problème, et en prenant en charge la conversion de HTML en markdown pour les tâches de scraping Web.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, URLs abzurufen und HTML in Markdown umzuwandeln, indem Chrome CDP für eine nahtlose Vorschau und Umwandlung von Inhalten genutzt wird, und unterstützt die Umwandlung von HTML in Markdown für Web-Scraping-Aufgaben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar URLs e converter HTML para markdown, aproveitando o Chrome CDP para uma pré-visualização e transformação de conteúdo sem interrupções, com suporte à conversão de HTML para markdown para tarefas de scraping web.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать URL-адреса и преобразовывать HTML в markdown, используя Chrome CDP для бесшовного просмотра и преобразования контента, с поддержкой преобразования HTML в markdown для задач веб-скрейпинга.","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من استخراج عنوان URL وتحويل HTML إلى markdown، مستفيدة من Chrome CDP لمعاينة المحتوى وتحويله بسلاسة، مع دعم تحويل HTML إلى markdown لمهام التخليص الويب."},"useCases":{"en":["Fetching and converting web pages to markdown for data analysis","Generating clean markdown documentation from HTML-based APIs","Converting HTML content to markdown for text-based AI model training"],"zh":["获取网页并将其转换为Markdown以进行数据分析","从基于HTML的API生成干净的Markdown文档","将HTML内容转换为Markdown以用于基于文本的人工智能模型训练"],"ja":["データ分析のためにWebページを取得し、Markdownに変換する","HTMLベースのAPIからクリーンなMarkdownドキュメントを生成する","テキストベースのAIモデルトレーニングのためにHTMLコンテンツをMarkdownに変換する"],"ko":["데이터 분석을 위해 웹 페이지를 가져와 마크다운으로 변환","HTML 기반 API에서 깨끗한 마크다운 문서를 생성","텍스트 기반 인공 지능 모델 훈련을 위해 HTML 내용을 마크다운으로 변환"],"es":["Recuperar y convertir páginas web a markdown para análisis de datos","Generar documentación de markdown limpia a partir de APIs basadas en HTML","Convertir contenido HTML a markdown para la formación de modelos de inteligencia artificial basados en texto"],"fr":["Récupérer et convertir des pages Web en markdown pour l''analyse de données","Générer une documentation markdown propre à partir d''API basées sur HTML","Convertir le contenu HTML en markdown pour la formation de modèles d''intelligence artificielle basés sur le texte"],"de":["Abrufen und Umwandeln von Webseiten in Markdown für Datenanalyse","Erstellen von sauberer Markdown-Dokumentation aus HTML-basierten APIs","Umwandeln von HTML-Inhalten in Markdown für die Schulung von textbasierten KI-Modellen"],"pt":["Buscar e converter páginas web em markdown para análise de dados","Gerar documentação markdown limpa a partir de APIs baseadas em HTML","Converter conteúdo HTML em markdown para treinamento de modelo de IA baseado em texto"],"ru":["Извлечение и преобразование веб-страниц в markdown для анализа данных","Генерация чистой markdown-документации из HTML-основанных API","Преобразование содержимого HTML в markdown для обучения текстовых моделей ИИ"],"ar":["استخراج صفحات الويب وتحويلها إلى markdown لتحليل البيانات","генерация وثائق markdown نظيفة من واجهات برمجة تطبيقات HTML","تحويل المحتوى HTML إلى markdown لتدريب نموذج ذكاء اصطناعي قائم على النص"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome CDP setup","Limited to HTML to markdown conversion","Script execution dependent on SKILL_DIR path resolution"],"zh":["需要设置Chrome CDP","仅限HTML到Markdown的转换","脚本执行依赖于SKILL_DIR路径解析"],"ja":["Chrome CDPの設定が必要","HTMLからMarkdownへの変換のみ","スクリプトの実行はSKILL_DIRパスの解決に依存"],"ko":["Chrome CDP 설정이 필요","HTML에서 마크다운으로의 변환만 가능","스크립트 실행은 SKILL_DIR 경로 해석에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Chrome CDP","Limitado a la conversión de HTML a markdown","La ejecución de scripts depende de la resolución de la ruta SKILL_DIR"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Chrome CDP","Limité à la conversion de HTML en markdown","L''exécution de scripts dépend de la résolution du chemin SKILL_DIR"],"de":["Benötigt Chrome CDP-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Umwandlung von HTML in Markdown","Die Skriptausführung hängt von der Auflösung des Pfads SKILL_DIR ab"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Chrome CDP","Limitado à conversão de HTML para markdown","Execução de script dependente da resolução do caminho SKILL_DIR"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Chrome CDP","Ограничен преобразованием HTML в markdown","Выполнение скрипта зависит от разрешения пути SKILL_DIR"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Chrome CDP","محدود بالتحويل من HTML إلى markdown","تنفيذ البرنامج النصي يعتمد على حل مسار SKILL_DIR"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('blockmatic-icebox/basilic-old/ahooks', 'community', 'blockmatic-icebox', 'basilic-old', 'blockmatic-icebox/basilic-old', 'ahooks', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z', '2026-02-18T09:50:21.592Z', NULL, '{"id":"blockmatic-icebox/basilic-old/ahooks","name":"ahooks","description":{"zh":"ahooks 是一个全栈 Web3 和 AI 项目启动器，提供 React 状态管理和数据持久化解决方案","ja":"ahooks はフルスタック Web3 と AI プロジェクトスターターであり、React ステート管理とデータ永続化の解決策を提供","ko":"ahooks는 풀스택 Web3 및 AI 프로젝트 시작기로서 React 상태 관리 및 데이터 지속성 솔루션을 제공","es":"ahooks es una colección de hooks de utilidad para la gestión de estado en React. Permite actualizaciones de estado agrupadas y persistencia en localStorage","fr":"ahooks est une collection d''outils de hook pour la gestion d''état dans React. Il permet des mises à jour d''état regroupées et une persistence dans localStorage","de":"ahooks ist eine Sammlung von Utility-Hooks für die Zustandsverwaltung in React. Es ermöglicht gruppierte Zustandsaktualisierungen und Persistence in localStorage","pt":"ahooks é uma ferramenta para gerenciamento de estado em React, permitindo atualizações de estado em grupo e persistência em localStorage","ru":"ahooks — это инструмент для управления состоянием в React, позволяющий обновлять состояние группой и сохранять его в localStorage","ar":"ahooks هي أداة لإدارة الحالة في React، وهي تسمح بالتحديثات المجموعة للحالة وذاكرة التخزين المحلية","en":"FullStack Web3 & AI Project Starter "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ahooks：React 状态管理和全栈 Web3 项目启动器","ja":"ahooks：React ステート管理とフルスタック Web3 プロジェクトスターター","ko":"ahooks: React 상태 관리 및 풀스택 Web3 프로젝트 시작기","es":"ahooks: Herramientas de estado para React","fr":"ahooks : Outils d''état pour React","de":"ahooks: State-Tools für React","pt":"ahooks: Ferramenta de Gerenciamento de Estado para React","ru":"ahooks: Инструмент для управления состоянием в React","ar":"ahooks: أداة لإدارة الحالة في React","en":"ahooks"},"description":{"zh":"ahooks 是一个全栈 Web3 和 AI 项目启动器，提供 React 状态管理和数据持久化解决方案","ja":"ahooks はフルスタック Web3 と AI プロジェクトスターターであり、React ステート管理とデータ永続化の解決策を提供","ko":"ahooks는 풀스택 Web3 및 AI 프로젝트 시작기로서 React 상태 관리 및 데이터 지속성 솔루션을 제공","es":"ahooks es una colección de hooks de utilidad para la gestión de estado en React. Permite actualizaciones de estado agrupadas y persistencia en localStorage","fr":"ahooks est une collection d''outils de hook pour la gestion d''état dans React. Il permet des mises à jour d''état regroupées et une persistence dans localStorage","de":"ahooks ist eine Sammlung von Utility-Hooks für die Zustandsverwaltung in React. Es ermöglicht gruppierte Zustandsaktualisierungen und Persistence in localSto...","pt":"ahooks é uma ferramenta para gerenciamento de estado em React, permitindo atualizações de estado em grupo e persistência em localStorage","ru":"ahooks — это инструмент для управления состоянием в React, позволяющий обновлять состояние группой и сохранять его в localStorage","ar":"ahooks هي أداة لإدارة الحالة في React، وهي تسمح بالتحديثات المجموعة للحالة وذاكرة التخزين المحلية","en":"FullStack Web3 & AI Project Starter "},"definition":{"en":"FullStack Web3 & AI Project Starter "},"features":{"zh":["支持 React 18+ 和 hooks","提供用 SetState 和 localStorage 持久化","支持 TypeScript v5+ 类型推断","适用于客户端","简化复杂状态管理"],"ja":["React 18+ と hooks をサポート","useSetState と localStorage を使用した永続化","TypeScript v5+ の型推論をサポート","クライアントサイド向け","複雑なステート管理を簡素化"],"ko":["React 18+ 및 hooks 지원","useSetState 및 localStorage를 통한 지속성","TypeScript v5+ 형식 추론 지원","클라이언트 사이드용","복잡한 상태 관리를 단순화"],"es":["Gestión de estado para React","Actualizaciones de estado agrupadas","Persistencia en localStorage","Compatibilidad con React 18+","Compatibilidad con TypeScript v5+"],"fr":["Gestion d''état pour React","Mises à jour d''état regroupées","Persistance dans localStorage","Compatibilité avec React 18+","Compatibilité avec TypeScript v5+"],"de":["Zustandsverwaltung für React","Gruppierte Zustandsaktualisierungen","Persistence in localStorage","Kompatibilität mit React 18+","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript v5+"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado em grupo","Persistência em localStorage","Compatibilidade com React 18+","Suporte a TypeScript v5+","Utilização de useSetState para atualizações de estado"],"ru":["Управление состоянием группой","Сохранение в localStorage","Совместимость с React 18+","Поддержка TypeScript v5+","Использование useSetState для обновления состояния"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة المجموعة","الاستمرار في ذاكرة التخزين المحلية","التوافق مع React 18+","دعم TypeScript v5+","استخدام useSetState للتحديثات الحالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ahooks","React 状态管理","全栈 Web3","AI 项目启动器","localStorage 持久化","TypeScript"],"ja":["ahooks","React ステート管理","フルスタック Web3","AI プロジェクトスターター","localStorage 永続化","TypeScript"],"ko":["ahooks","React 상태 관리","풀스택 Web3","AI 프로젝트 시작기","localStorage 지속성","TypeScript"],"es":["ahooks","React","gestión de estado","hooks de utilidad","localStorage","TypeScript","React 18+"],"fr":["ahooks","React","gestion d''état","outils de hook","localStorage","TypeScript","React 18+"],"de":["ahooks","React","Zustandsverwaltung","Utility-Hooks","localStorage","TypeScript","React 18+"],"pt":["ahooks","gerenciamento de estado","React","localStorage","TypeScript","useSetState","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["ahooks","управление состоянием","React","localStorage","TypeScript","useSetState","веб-разработка"],"ar":["ahooks","إدارة الحالة","React","ذاكرة التخزين المحلية","TypeScript","useSetState","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"blockmatic-icebox","repo":"basilic-old","repoPath":"blockmatic-icebox/basilic-old","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ahooks","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Skill: ahooks\n\n## Scope\n\n- Applies to: ahooks v3+ utility hooks for React state management, grouped state updates, localStorage persistence\n- Does NOT cover: Data fetching (use TanStack Query), URL state management (use nuqs), complex state machines, async operations\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- ahooks v3+\n- React 18+ with hooks support\n- TypeScript v5+ (for type inference)\n- Client-side only (hooks require browser APIs for localStorage)\n\n## Principles\n\n- Use `useSetState` for grouped state that changes","body":"# Skill: ahooks\n\n## Scope\n\n- Applies to: ahooks v3+ utility hooks for React state management, grouped state updates, localStorage persistence\n- Does NOT cover: Data fetching (use TanStack Query), URL state management (use nuqs), complex state machines, async operations\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- ahooks v3+\n- React 18+ with hooks support\n- TypeScript v5+ (for type inference)\n- Client-side only (hooks require browser APIs for localStorage)\n\n## Principles\n\n- Use `useSetState` for grouped state that changes together (not URL-shareable)\n- Use `useLocalStorageState` for persistent state across browser sessions\n- Prefer nuqs for URL-shareable state over localStorage\n- Prefer TanStack Query for async operations and loading states\n- Use `useState` only for simple independent state (rare)\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST\n\n- Use `useSetState` for grouped state not in URL (form state, game engine state, ephemeral UI state)\n- Use `useLocalStorageState` for localStorage persistence\n\n### SHOULD\n\n- Prefer nuqs for URL-shareable state over localStorage\n- Prefer TanStack Query for async operations and loading states\n- Use TypeScript generics for type-safe state: `useLocalStorageState<boolean>(''key'', { defaultValue: false })`\n\n### AVOID\n\n- Using for URL state (use nuqs instead)\n- Using for loading/error states (use TanStack Query instead)\n- Using for complex async operations (use TanStack Query instead)\n- Mixing URL state with localStorage without explicit sync logic\n\n## Interactions\n\n- Complements nuqs for URL state management (can sync bidirectionally)\n- Complements TanStack Query for async operations (use TanStack Query for data fetching)\n- Part of state management decision tree (see React rules)\n- Works with React 18+ hooks architecture\n\n## Patterns\n\n### useSetState Pattern\n\nUse for grouped state that updates together:\n\n```typescript\nimport { useSetState } from ''ahooks''\n\nconst [state, setState] = useSetState({\n  name: '''',\n  email: '''',\n  age: 0,\n})\n\n// Partial updates (shallow merge)\nsetState({ name: ''John'' })\nsetState(prev => ({ ...prev, email: ''john@example.com'' }))\n```\n\n**When to use**: Form state, game engine state, UI state that changes together (if not URL-shareable)\n\n**When NOT to use**: URL-shareable state (use nuqs), loading states (use TanStack Query)\n\n### useLocalStorageState Pattern\n\nUse for state that persists across browser sessions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { useLocalStorageState } from ''ahooks''\n\nconst [value, setValue] = useLocalStorageState<boolean>(''key'', {\n  defaultValue: false,\n})\n\n// Type-safe with generics\nconst [settings, setSettings] = useLocalStorageState<Settings>(''settings'', {\n  defaultValue: { theme: ''light'', fontSize: 14 },\n})\n```\n\n**When to use**: User preferences, debug flags, settings that should persist across sessions\n\n**When NOT to use**: URL-shareable state (use nuqs), sensitive data (use secure storage)\n\n### Integration with nuqs\n\nBidirectional sync between URL and localStorage:\n\n```typescript\nimport { useLocalStorageState } from ''ahooks''\nimport { useQueryState } from ''nuqs''\nimport { useEffect, useRef } from ''react''\n\nconst [queryState, setQueryState] = useQueryState(''debug'')\nconst [storageState, setStorageState] = useLocalStorageState<boolean>(''debug'', {\n  defaultValue: false,\n})\nconst isFirstMount = useRef(true)\n\n// Sync on mount: localStorage → URL\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (isFirstMount.current) {\n    isFirstMount.current = false\n    if (storageState && queryState !== ''true'') {\n      setQueryState(''true'')\n      return\n    }\n  }\n  // Sync changes: URL → localStorage\n  if (queryState === ''true'' && !storageState) {\n    setStorageState(true)\n  } else if (queryState === ''false'' && storageState) {\n    setStorageState(false)\n  }\n}, [queryState, storageState, setQueryState, setStorageState])\n```\n\n**Use case**: Debug flags, feature toggles that should be both URL-shareable and persistent\n\n### State Management Decision Tree\n\n1. **URL-shareable state** → Use `nuqs` (filters, search, tabs, pagination)\n2. **Grouped state not in URL** → Use `useSetState` (form state, game engine, ephemeral UI)\n3. **Async operations** → Use TanStack Query (data fetching, mutations, caching)\n4. **localStorage persistence** → Use `useLocalStorageState` (preferences, settings)\n5. **Simple independent state** → Use `useState` (rare, prefer other options)\n\n## References\n\n- [ahooks documentation](https://ahooks.js.org/) - Official documentation\n- React rules - State management decision tree and patterns\n- TanStack Query - Async operations and data fetching patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:50:21.592Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents utilizing React 18+ and requiring advanced state management capabilities with ahooks v3+","zh":"适用于使用 React 18+ 并需要高级状态管理功能的 ahooks v3+ 前端代理","ja":"React 18+ および ahooks v3+ を使用して高度な状態管理機能を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに適しています","ko":"React 18+ 및 ahooks v3+를 사용하여 고급 상태 관리 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que utilizan React 18+ y requieren capacidades de administración de estado avanzadas con ahooks v3+","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend utilisant React 18+ et nécessitant des capacités de gestion d''état avancées avec ahooks v3+","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die React 18+ verwenden und erweiterte Statusverwaltungsfunktionen mit ahooks v3+ benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que utilizam React 18+ e requerem capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de estado com ahooks v3+","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, использующих React 18+ и требующих продвинутых возможностей управления состоянием с ahooks v3+","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يستخدم React 18+ ويتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة الحالة مع ahooks v3+"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage React state with utilities like useSetState for grouped state updates and localStorage persistence, leveraging TypeScript v5+ for robust type inference and React hooks support","zh":"赋予代理高效管理 React 状态的能力，具有 useSetState 等实用工具，用于分组状态更新和 localStorage 持久性，并利用 TypeScript v5+ 进行强大的类型推断和 React Hooks 支持","ja":"useSetState などのユーティリティを使用して、React 状態を効率的に管理し、localStorage の永続性を利用し、TypeScript v5+ を使用して強力な型推論と React Hooks サポートを提供します","ko":"useSetState 등의 유틸리티를 사용하여 React 상태를 효율적으로 관리하고 localStorage의 영속성을 利用하며, TypeScript v5+를 사용하여 강력한 타입 추론과 React Hooks 지원을 제공합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar eficientemente el estado de React con utilidades como useSetState para actualizaciones de estado agrupadas y persistencia de localStorage, aprovechando TypeScript v5+ para una inferencia de tipo robusta y soporte para hooks de React","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement l''état de React avec des utilités comme useSetState pour les mises à jour d''état regroupées et la persistance de localStorage, en exploitant TypeScript v5+ pour une inférence de type robuste et un support pour les hooks de React","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den React-Status effizient mit Utilities wie useSetState für gruppierte Statusaktualisierungen und localStorage-Persistenz zu verwalten, indem es TypeScript v5+ für robuste Typinferenz und React-Hooks-Unterstützung nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar eficientemente o estado do React com utilitários como useSetState para atualizações de estado em grupo e persistência do localStorage, aproveitando o TypeScript v5+ para inferência de tipo robusta e suporte a hooks do React","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять состоянием React с помощью утилит, таких как useSetState для групповых обновлений состояния и сохранения данных в localStorage, используя TypeScript v5+ для прочной типизации и поддержки хуков React","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة حالة React بفعالية باستخدام أدوات مثل useSetState لتحديثات الحالة المجمعة وثبات localStorage، واستخدام TypeScript v5+ لاستدلال أنواع قوي ودعم hooks React"},"useCases":{"en":["Simplifying complex state updates with useSetState","Implementing localStorage persistence for client-side data","Optimizing React application performance with grouped state management"],"zh":["使用 useSetState 简化复杂的状态更新","实现 localStorage 持久性以存储客户端数据","通过分组状态管理优化 React 应用程序性能"],"ja":["useSetState を使用して複雑な状態の更新を簡素化する","クライアント側のデータを保存するために localStorage の永続性を実装する","状態のグループ管理を使用して React アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["useSetState를 사용하여 복잡한 상태 업데이트를 간소화한다","클라이언트 측 데이터를 저장하기 위해 localStorage의 영속성을 구현한다","상태 그룹 관리를 사용하여 React 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화한다"],"es":["Simplificar actualizaciones de estado complejas con useSetState","Implementar persistencia de localStorage para datos del lado del cliente","Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación React con administración de estado agrupada"],"fr":["Simplifier les mises à jour d''état complexes avec useSetState","Mettre en œuvre la persistance de localStorage pour les données côté client","Optimiser les performances de l''application React avec une gestion d''état regroupée"],"de":["Komplexe Statusaktualisierungen mit useSetState vereinfachen","Implementierung von localStorage-Persistenz für Client-seitige Daten","Optimieren der React-Anwendungsleistung mit gruppiertem Statusmanagement"],"pt":["Simplificando atualizações de estado complexas com useSetState","Implementando persistência do localStorage para dados do lado do cliente","Otimizando o desempenho do aplicativo React com gerenciamento de estado em grupo"],"ru":["Упрощение сложных обновлений состояния с помощью useSetState","Реализация сохранения данных в localStorage для клиентских данных","Оптимизация производительности приложения React с помощью группового управления состоянием"],"ar":["تبسيط تحديثات الحالة المعقدة مع useSetState","تنفيذ ثبات localStorage للبيانات على جانب العميل","تحسين أداء تطبيق React بإدارة الحالة المجمعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ahooks v3+ and React 18+ with hooks support","Limited to client-side applications due to browser API dependencies","Does not cover data fetching or URL state management"],"zh":["需要 ahooks v3+ 和 React 18+ 以及 Hooks 支持","由于浏览器 API 依赖项，仅限于客户端应用程序","不包括数据获取或 URL 状态管理"],"ja":["ahooks v3+ と React 18+ および Hooks サポートが必要","ブラウザ API 依存関係により、クライアント側アプリケーションに限定される","データ取得または URL 状態管理は含まない"],"ko":["ahooks v3+ 및 React 18+ 및 Hooks 지원이 필요합니다","브라우저 API 종속성으로 인해 클라이언트측 애플리케이션에만 제한됩니다","데이터 가져오기 또는 URL 상태 관리는 포함하지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere ahooks v3+ y React 18+ con soporte para hooks","Limitado a aplicaciones del lado del cliente debido a dependencias de la API del navegador","No cubre la recuperación de datos o la administración del estado de la URL"],"fr":["Nécessite ahooks v3+ et React 18+ avec un support pour les hooks","Limité aux applications côté client en raison des dépendances de l''API du navigateur","Ne couvre pas la récupération de données ou la gestion de l''état de l''URL"],"de":["Erfordert ahooks v3+ und React 18+ mit Hooks-Unterstützung","Begrenzt auf Client-seitige Anwendungen aufgrund von Browser-API-Abhängigkeiten","Deckt weder die Datenabfrage noch die URL-Statusverwaltung ab"],"pt":["Exige ahooks v3+ e React 18+ com suporte a hooks","Limitado a aplicações do lado do cliente devido às dependências da API do navegador","Não cobre busca de dados ou gerenciamento de estado de URL"],"ru":["Требует ahooks v3+ и React 18+ с поддержкой хуков","Ограничен клиентскими приложениями из-за зависимостей от браузерного API","Не покрывает получение данных или управление состоянием URL"],"ar":["يتطلب ahooks v3+ و React 18+ مع دعم hooks","محدود للتطبيقات على جانب العميل بسبب الاعتماد على واجهة برمجة تطبيقات المتصفح","لا يغطي استرجاع البيانات أو إدارة حالة URL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
