,"package.json 종속성 없음"],"es":["Componentes reutilizables y accesibles","Personalización y control total","Construidos con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","No requiere dependencia de package.json","Ideal para aplicaciones React con Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Composants réutilisables et accessibles","Personnalisation et contrôle total","Construits avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Nécessite pas de dépendance à package.json","Idéal pour les applications React avec Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare und zugängliche Komponenten","Vollständige Anpassung und Kontrolle","Erstellt mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Benötigt keine Abhängigkeit von package.json","Ideal für React-Anwendungen mit Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Componentes reutilizáveis e acessíveis","Personalização total com Tailwind CSS","Não requer dependência no package.json","Construído com Radix UI","Ideial para aplicações React"],"ru":["Повторно используемые и доступные компоненты","Полная настраиваемость с Tailwind CSS","Не требует зависимости в package.json","Построен на основе Radix UI","Идеален для реактивных приложений"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والوصول إليها","التخصيص الكامل مع Tailwind CSS","لا يتطلب الاعتماد على package.json","مبني على Radix UI","مثالي للتطبيقات الرايكت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn/ui","React组件","可访问的Web应用","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","自定义控制","无需依赖"],"ja":["shadcn/ui","Reactコンポーネント","アクセシブルなWebアプリケーション","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","カスタマイズ制御","依存関係不要"],"ko":["shadcn/ui","React 컴포넌트","접근 가능한 웹 애플리케이션","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","사용자 지정 제어","종속성 없음"],"es":["shadcn/ui","React","Tailwind CSS","componentes personalizables","accesibilidad","Radix UI","desarrollo de aplicaciones","bibliotecas de componentes"],"fr":["shadcn/ui","React","Tailwind CSS","composants personnalisables","accessibilité","Radix UI","développement d''applications","bibliothèques de composants"],"de":["shadcn/ui","React","Tailwind CSS","benutzerdefinierte Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit","Radix UI","Anwendungsentwicklung","Komponentenbibliotheken"],"pt":["shadcn/ui","biblioteca de componentes react","tailwind css","radix ui","componentes acessíveis","personalização de componentes","desenvolvimento de aplicações react"],"ru":["shadcn/ui","библиотека реактивных компонентов","tailwind css","radix ui","доступные компоненты","настраиваемые компоненты","разработка реактивных приложений"],"ar":["shadcn/ui","مكتبة مكونات ري액ت","tailwind css","radix ui","مكونات قابلة للوصول","تخصيص المكونات","تطوير تطبيقات ري액ت"]}},"owner":"shinnytech","repo":"caiwenqiang-member-rank","repoPath":"shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-shadcn-ui","description":"Use when building React UI components, implementing design systems, or needing pre-built accessible components - leverages shadcn/ui primitives and shadcnblocks.com (829 production-ready blocks) for rapid interface development","bodyPreview":"# Using shadcn/ui\n\n## Overview\n\nshadcn/ui is a collection of re-usable, accessible React components built on Radix UI and Tailwind CSS. Unlike traditional component libraries, shadcn/ui copies components directly into your project, giving you full ownership and customization control.\n\n**Core principle:** Components live in your codebase. You own the code. No package.json dependency.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use shadcn/ui when:**\n- Building React applications with Tailwind CSS\n- Need accessible, custom","body":"# Using shadcn/ui\n\n## Overview\n\nshadcn/ui is a collection of re-usable, accessible React components built on Radix UI and Tailwind CSS. Unlike traditional component libraries, shadcn/ui copies components directly into your project, giving you full ownership and customization control.\n\n**Core principle:** Components live in your codebase. You own the code. No package.json dependency.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use shadcn/ui when:**\n- Building React applications with Tailwind CSS\n- Need accessible, customizable UI components\n- Want pre-built patterns without library lock-in\n- Implementing common UI patterns (forms, dialogs, dropdowns, etc.)\n- Starting new projects that need design system foundation\n- Need production-ready blocks for hero sections, pricing, testimonials, etc.\n\n**shadcnblocks.com integration:**\n- 829 blocks across 42 categories\n- Production-ready sections (Hero, Navbar, Footer, Pricing, Testimonials, etc.)\n- Copy-paste directly into your project\n- Built with same shadcn/ui primitives\n\n**Don''t use for:**\n- Non-React projects\n- Projects without Tailwind CSS\n- When you need a locked, versioned component library\n- Simple HTML/CSS projects\n\n## Installation Workflow\n\n### 1. Initialize shadcn/ui\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\n**Configuration prompts:**\n- Style: Default or New York\n- Color: Slate, Gray, Zinc, etc.\n- CSS variables: Yes (recommended)\n- Tailwind config: Use CSS variables for colors\n\n### 2. Add Components\n\n```bash\n# Add specific components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog\nnpx shadcn@latest add form\n\n# Add multiple at once\nnpx shadcn@latest add button card dialog dropdown-menu\n```\n\n**Components install to:** `components/ui/`\n\n### 3. Using shadcnblocks.com\n\n**Visit:** https://www.shadcnblocks.com/blocks\n\n**Workflow:**\n1. Browse category (Hero, Pricing, Testimonial, etc.)\n2. Find desired block\n3. Click \"Copy Code\"\n4. Paste into your component file\n5. Install any missing shadcn/ui dependencies\n6. Customize colors, text, and layout\n\n## Component Categories Reference\n\n| Category | Common Use Cases | Example Components |\n|----------|------------------|-------------------|\n| **Forms** | User input, validation | Input, Textarea, Select, Checkbox, Radio Group |\n| **Overlays** | Modals, popovers | Dialog, Popover, Tooltip, Sheet |\n| **Navigation** | Menus, dropdowns | Dropdown Menu, Navigation Menu, Tabs |\n| **Feedback** | User notifications | Alert, Toast, Progress, Skeleton |\n| **Data Display** | Tables, cards, badges | Table, Card, Badge, Avatar |\n| **Layout** | Containers, separators | Separator, Aspect Ratio, Scroll Area |\n\n## shadcnblocks.com Categories (829 blocks)\n\n### Layout & Navigation (200 blocks)\n- **Hero** (162 blocks): Landing page headers with CTAs\n- **Navbar** (13 blocks): Navigation headers\n- **Footer** (18 blocks): Page footers\n- **Banner** (7 blocks): Announcement bars\n\n### Content Sections (367 blocks)\n- **Feature** (266 blocks): Product feature showcases\n- **Blog** (22 blocks): Blog layouts and cards\n- **Gallery** (47 blocks): Image galleries\n- **Timeline** (14 blocks): Event timelines\n- **Team** (10 blocks): Team member profiles\n- **About** (10 blocks): About us sections\n\n### Business Components (116 blocks)\n- **Pricing** (35 blocks): Pricing tables and cards\n- **Testimonial** (28 blocks): Customer testimonials\n- **Case Studies** (9 blocks): Success stories\n- **Integration** (16 blocks): Integration showcases\n- **Service/Services** (21 blocks): Service offerings\n- **Stats** (17 blocks): Statistics displays\n\n### User Engagement (64 blocks)\n- **CTA** (25 blocks): Call-to-action sections\n- **Contact** (13 blocks): Contact forms\n- **Signup/Login** (17 blocks): Authentication forms\n- **Waitlist** (2 blocks): Email capture\n- **Community** (7 blocks): Community features\n\n### Information Display (82 blocks)\n- **FAQ** (15 blocks): Frequently asked questions\n- **Comparison** (10 blocks): Feature comparisons\n- **Logos** (11 blocks): Logo grids\n- **Resources** (4 blocks): Resource libraries\n- **Download** (12 blocks): Download sections\n- **Changelog** (7 blocks): Update logs\n- **Careers** (9 blocks): Job listings\n- **Compliance** (3 blocks): Legal/privacy sections\n\n## Quick Start Example\n\n```typescript\n// 1. Add button component\n// $ npx shadcn@latest add button\n\n// 2. Import and use\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function MyComponent() {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Button variant=\"default\">Click me</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"destructive\">Delete</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"ghost\">Subtle</Button>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Form Pattern with shadcn/ui\n\n```typescript\n// Install: npx shadcn@latest add form input button\n\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(\"Invalid email address\"),\n  password: z.string().min(8, \"Password must be at least 8 characters\"),\n})\n\nexport function LoginForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      email: \"\",\n      password: \"\",\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    console.log(values)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"password\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Password</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"password\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <Button type=\"submit\">Sign In</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Dialog/Modal Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// Install: npx shadcn@latest add dialog button\n\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ConfirmDialog() {\n  return (\n    <Dialog>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"destructive\">Delete Account</Button>\n      </DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent>\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>Are you absolutely sure?</DialogTitle>\n          <DialogDescription>\n            This action cannot be undone. This will permanently delete your\n            account and remove your data from our servers.\n          </DialogDescription>\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"flex justify-end gap-3\">\n          <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n          <Button variant=\"destructive\">Delete</Button>\n        </div>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Using Blocks from shadcnblocks.com\n\n### Example: Adding a Hero Section\n\n**1. Visit:** https://www.shadcnblocks.com/blocks\n**2. Navigate to:** Hero category\n**3. Select a design**\n**4. Click \"Copy Code\"**\n**5. Create component:**\n\n```typescript\n// app/components/hero.tsx\n// (Paste copied code from shadcnblocks.com)\n\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"container flex flex-col items-center gap-8 pt-20 pb-12\">\n      <h1 className=\"text-6xl font-bold text-center\">\n        Build amazing products\n      </h1>\n      <p className=\"text-xl text-muted-foreground text-center max-w-2xl\">\n        Get started with production-ready components built with shadcn/ui\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n        <Button size=\"lg\">Get Started</Button>\n        <Button size=\"lg\" variant=\"outline\">Learn More</Button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**6. Install missing components:**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n```\n\n**7. Import and use:**\n```typescript\nimport { Hero } from \"@/components/hero\"\n\nexport default function Home() {\n  return <Hero />\n}\n```\n\n### Example: Adding a Pricing Section\n\n```typescript\n// Install: npx shadcn@latest add card button badge\n\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { Badge } from \"@/components/ui/badge\"\n\nexport function Pricing() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"container py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">\n        Simple, transparent pricing\n      </h2>\n      <div className=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n        <Card>\n          <CardHeader>\n            <CardTitle>Starter</CardTitle>\n            <CardDescription>Perfect for trying out</CardDescription>\n          </CardHeader>\n          <CardContent>\n            <div className=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-2\">$9</div>\n            <p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">per month</p>\n          </CardContent>\n          <CardFooter>\n            <Button className=\"w-full\">Get Started</Button>\n          </CardFooter>\n        </Card>\n\n        <Card className=\"border-primary\">\n          <CardHeader>\n            <Badge className=\"w-fit mb-2\">Most Popular</Badge>\n            <CardTitle>Pro</CardTitle>\n            <CardDescription>For growing businesses</CardDescription>\n          </CardHeader>\n          <CardContent>\n            <div className=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-2\">$29</div>\n            <p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">per month</p>\n          </CardContent>\n          <CardFooter>\n            <Button className=\"w-full\">Get Started</Button>\n          </CardFooter>\n        </Card>\n\n        <Card>\n          <CardHeader>\n            <CardTitle>Enterprise</CardTitle>\n            <CardDescription>For large organizations</CardDescription>\n          </CardHeader>\n          <CardContent>\n            <div className=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-2\">Custom</div>\n            <p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">contact us</p>\n          </CardContent>\n          <CardFooter>\n            <Button className=\"w-full\" variant=\"outline\">Contact Sales</Button>\n          </CardFooter>\n        </Card>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Customization\n\n### Theme Colors\n\nEdit `app/globals.css` or `styles/globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... more CSS variables */\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... dark mode colors */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Component Variants\n\nComponents use `class-variance-authority` for variants:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\n// Available variants:\n<Button variant=\"default\">Default</Button>\n<Button variant=\"destructive\">Destructive</Button>\n<Button variant=\"outline\">Outline</Button>\n<Button variant=\"secondary\">Secondary</Button>\n<Button variant=\"ghost\">Ghost</Button>\n<Button variant=\"link\">Link</Button>\n\n// Available sizes:\n<Button size=\"default\">Default</Button>\n<Button size=\"sm\">Small</Button>\n<Button size=\"lg\">Large</Button>\n<Button size=\"icon\">Icon</Button>\n```\n\n### Extending Components\n\nEdit the component file directly in `components/ui/`:\n\n```typescript\n// components/ui/button.tsx\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center...\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground...\",\n        destructive: \"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground...\",\n        // Add custom variant:\n        success: \"bg-green-600 text-white hover:bg-green-700\",\n      },\n      // ... rest of variants\n    }\n  }\n)\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Loading States\n\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nexport function LoadingButton() {\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(false)\n\n  return (\n    <Button disabled={isLoading}>\n      {isLoading && <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />}\n      {isLoading ? \"Loading...\" : \"Submit\"}\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Toast Notifications\n\n```typescript\n// Install: npx shadcn@latest add toast\n\nimport { useToast } from \"@/hooks/use-toast\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ToastExample() {\n  const { toast } = useToast()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      onClick={() => {\n        toast({\n          title: \"Success!\",\n          description: \"Your changes have been saved.\",\n        })\n      }}\n    >\n      Show Toast\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Data Tables\n\n```typescript\n// Install: npx shadcn@latest add table\n\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n\nconst invoices = [\n  { invoice: \"INV001\", status: \"Paid\", amount: \"$250.00\" },\n  { invoice: \"INV002\", status: \"Pending\", amount: \"$150.00\" },\n]\n\nexport function InvoiceTable() {\n  return (\n    <Table>\n      <TableHeader>\n        <TableRow>\n          <TableHead>Invoice</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Status</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Amount</TableHead>\n        </TableRow>\n      </TableHeader>\n      <TableBody>\n        {invoices.map((invoice) => (\n          <TableRow key={invoice.invoice}>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.invoice}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.status}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.amount}</TableCell>\n          </TableRow>\n        ))}\n      </TableBody>\n    </Table>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Installing as npm package | shadcn/ui copies code. Run `npx shadcn@latest add [component]` |\n| Importing from `shadcn` | Import from `@/components/ui/[component]` |\n| Not installing dependencies | Each component may need additional packages (listed in CLI) |\n| Modifying in node_modules | Components live in your `components/ui/` - edit directly |\n| Forgetting Tailwind config | Run `npx shadcn@latest init` to configure properly |\n| Skipping shadcnblocks.com | Don''t build common sections from scratch - use 829 ready blocks |\n\n## Workflow Summary\n\n**Starting new project:**\n1. `npx shadcn@latest init`\n2. Add needed components: `npx shadcn@latest add button card dialog`\n3. Browse shadcnblocks.com for section blocks\n4. Copy blocks, install dependencies, customize\n\n**Adding new feature:**\n1. Identify needed components (form, dialog, etc.)\n2. `npx shadcn@latest add [components]`\n3. Check shadcnblocks.com for similar patterns\n4. Build or adapt from block\n5. Customize colors and content\n\n**Customizing:**\n1. Edit component files in `components/ui/` directly\n2. Modify `globals.css` for theme colors\n3. Add variants using `class-variance-authority` patterns\n\n## Resources\n\n- **Official Docs:** https://ui.shadcn.com\n- **shadcnblocks.com:** https://www.shadcnblocks.com/blocks (829 blocks)\n- **Components:** https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components\n- **Themes:** https://ui.shadcn.com/themes\n- **Examples:** https://ui.shadcn.com/examples\n\n## Integration with Other Tools\n\n**Works seamlessly with:**\n- Next.js (App Router or Pages)\n- Remix\n- Astro\n- Vite + React\n- React Hook Form\n- Zod validation\n- Tailwind CSS\n- Radix UI (under the hood)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:50:54.375Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents building React applications with Tailwind CSS needing accessible and customizable UI components.","zh":"非常适合构建使用Tailwind CSS的React应用的前端代理，需要可访问和可定制的UI组件。","ja":"Tailwind CSSを使用したReactアプリケーションを構築するフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、アクセス可能且つカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントが必要です。","ko":"Tailwind CSS를 사용하는 React 애플리케이션을 구축하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 접근 가능하고 사용자 정의 가능한 UI 컴포넌트가 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que construyen aplicaciones React con Tailwind CSS y necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizables y accesibles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui construisent des applications React avec Tailwind CSS et ont besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables et accessibles.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die React-Anwendungen mit Tailwind CSS erstellen und anpassbare sowie zugängliche Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que constroem aplicações React com Tailwind CSS e necessitam de componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Фронтенд-агентов, строящих приложения React с Tailwind CSS, требующих доступных и настраиваемых компонентов интерфейса пользователя.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يبني تطبيقات React باستخدام Tailwind CSS ويحتاج إلى مكونات واجهة مستخدم قابلة لل الوصول والتعديل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build reusable, accessible React components using Radix UI and Tailwind CSS, giving full ownership and customization control without package.json dependency, enabling the creation of custom and accessible UI components for React applications.","zh":"赋予代理构建可重用、可访问的React组件的能力，使用Radix UI和Tailwind CSS，提供完全的所有权和自定义控制，不依赖package.json，实现为React应用创建自定义和可访问的UI组件。","ja":"Radix UIとTailwind CSSを使用して、再利用可能でアクセス可能なReactコンポーネントを構築するエージェントの能力を付与し、package.jsonへの依存関係なく完全な所有権とカスタマイズ制御を提供し、Reactアプリケーションのカスタムでアクセス可能なUIコンポーネントを作成することを可能にします。","ko":"Radix UI와 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 재사용 가능한 접근 가능한 React 컴포넌트를 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, package.json에 대한 의존성 없이 완전한 소유권과 사용자 정의 제어를 제공하여 React 애플리케이션의 사용자 정의 가능한 접근 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear componentes de React reutilizables y accesibles utilizando Radix UI y Tailwind CSS, lo que proporciona el control total de propiedad y personalización sin dependencia de package.json, lo que permite la creación de componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados y accesibles para aplicaciones React.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants React réutilisables et accessibles en utilisant Radix UI et Tailwind CSS, ce qui donne un contrôle total de propriété et de personnalisation sans dépendance de package.json, permettant ainsi la création de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés et accessibles pour les applications React.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, wiederverwendbare und zugängliche React-Komponenten mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS zu erstellen, was die vollständige Kontrolle über Eigentum und Anpassung ohne Abhängigkeit von package.json bietet, wodurch die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten und zugänglichen Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für React-Anwendungen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem componentes React reutilizáveis e acessíveis usando Radix UI e Tailwind CSS, concedendo total propriedade e controle de personalização sem dependência do package.json, possibilitando a criação de componentes de UI personalizados e acessíveis para aplicações React.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать многократно используемые и доступные компоненты React, используя Radix UI и Tailwind CSS, предоставляя полную собственность и контроль над настройкой без зависимости от package.json, что позволяет создавать пользовательские и доступные компоненты интерфейса пользователя для приложений React.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء مكونات React قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام وقابلة للوصول باستخدام Radix UI و Tailwind CSS، ويتحكم الكامل في الملكية والتخصيص بدون الاعتماد على package.json، مما يتيح إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة وقابلة للوصول لتطبيقات React."},"useCases":{"en":["Building accessible and customizable React components for member holding rank pages","Creating reusable UI components with Tailwind CSS for consistent styling","Customizing Radix UI components for specific application needs"],"zh":["为会员持有排名页面构建可访问和可定制的React组件","使用Tailwind CSS创建一致的样式的可重用UI组件","为特定应用程序需求定制Radix UI组件"],"ja":["メンバーのランクページ用にアクセス可能でカスタマイズ可能なReactコンポーネントを構築する","Tailwind CSSを使用して一貫したスタイリングの再利用可能なUIコンポーネントを作成する","特定のアプリケーションのニーズに応じてRadix UIコンポーネントをカスタマイズする"],"ko":["회원 보유 순위 페이지용으로 접근 가능하고 사용자 정의 가능한 React 컴포넌트 구축","Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 일관된 스타일의 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 생성","특정 애플리케이션 요구 사항에 따라 Radix UI 컴포넌트 사용자 정의"],"es":["Construir componentes de React accesibles y personalizables para páginas de rangos de miembros","Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables con Tailwind CSS para un estilo coherente","Personalizar componentes de Radix UI para necesidades de aplicaciones específicas"],"fr":["Construire des composants React accessibles et personnalisables pour les pages de rangs de membres","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables avec Tailwind CSS pour un style cohérent","Personnaliser les composants de Radix UI pour les besoins spécifiques des applications"],"de":["Erstellen von zugänglichen und anpassbaren React-Komponenten für Mitgliederrangseiten","Erstellen von wiederverwendbaren Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Tailwind CSS für ein konsistentes Styling","Anpassen von Radix-UI-Komponenten für spezifische Anwendungsanforderungen"],"pt":["Construir componentes React acessíveis e personalizáveis para páginas de classificação de membros","Criar componentes de UI reutilizáveis com Tailwind CSS para estilização consistente","Personalizar componentes Radix UI para necessidades de aplicação específicas"],"ru":["Создание доступных и настраиваемых компонентов React для страниц ранжирования членов","Создание многократно используемых компонентов интерфейса пользователя с Tailwind CSS для последовательного стиля","Настройка компонентов Radix UI для конкретных потребностей приложения"],"ar":["بناء مكونات React قابلة للوصول والتعديل للصفحات ذات تصنيف الأعضاء","إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع Tailwind CSS للأسلوب الثابت","تخصيص مكونات Radix UI لاحتياجات التطبيق المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and Tailwind CSS setup","No package.json dependency, components are copied directly into the project"],"zh":["需要React和Tailwind CSS设置","无package.json依赖，组件直接复制到项目中"],"ja":["ReactとTailwind CSSの設定が必要","package.jsonへの依存関係なし、コンポーネントは直接プロジェクトにコピーされる"],"ko":["React 및 Tailwind CSS 설정이 필요","package.json 의존성 없음, 컴포넌트는 직접 프로젝트에 복사됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de React y Tailwind CSS","No tiene dependencia de package.json, los componentes se copian directamente en el proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de React et de Tailwind CSS","N''a pas de dépendance de package.json, les composants sont copiés directement dans le projet"],"de":["Benötigt eine React- und Tailwind-CSS-Konfiguration","Hat keine Abhängigkeit von package.json, Komponenten werden direkt in das Projekt kopiert"],"pt":["Requer configuração do React e Tailwind CSS","Não há dependência do package.json, os componentes são copiados diretamente para o projeto"],"ru":["Требуется настройка React и Tailwind CSS","Нет зависимости от package.json, компоненты копируются напрямую в проект"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد React و Tailwind CSS","لا يوجد الاعتماد على package.json، حيث يتم نسخ المكونات مباشرة إلى المشروع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank/mermaid', 'community', 'shinnytech', 'caiwenqiang-member-rank', 'shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank', 'mermaid', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z', '2026-02-18T09:50:50.005Z', NULL, '{"id":"shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank/mermaid","name":"mermaid","description":{"zh":"Mermaid图表技能帮助您创建、验证和渲染Mermaid图表。它支持从自然语言描述、代码分析或编辑现有图表中创建图表","ja":"Mermaidダイアグラムスキルは、自然言語の説明、コード分析、または既存の図表の編集からMermaid図表を作成、検証、レンダリングするのに役立ちます","ko":"머메이드 다이어그램 스킬은 자연어 설명, 코드 분석 또는 기존 다이어그램 편집에서 머메이드 다이어그램을 생성, 검증 및 렌더링하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"La habilidad Mermaid te permite crear, validar y renderizar diagramas Mermaid desde descripciones de lenguaje natural o análisis de código.","fr":"La compétence Mermaid vous permet de créer, de valider et de rendre des diagrammes Mermaid à partir de descriptions de langage naturel ou d''analyses de code.","de":"Die Mermaid-Fähigkeit ermöglicht es Ihnen, Mermaid-Diagramme aus natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen oder Codeanalysen zu erstellen, zu überprüfen und zu rendern.","pt":"O skill Mermaid ajuda a criar, validar e renderizar diagramas Mermaid.","ru":"Навык Mermaid помогает создавать, проверять и отображать диаграммы Mermaid.","ar":"مهارة ميرميد تساعد على إنشاء مخططات ميرميد و التحقق منها و عرضها.","en":"会员持仓排行榜页面设计"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Mermaid图表技能-创建和渲染图表","ja":"Mermaidダイアグラムスキル-図表の作成とレンダリング","ko":"머메이드 다이어그램 스킬 - 다이어그램 생성 및 렌더링","es":"Crear diagramas Mermaid con habilidades de diseño","fr":"Créer des diagrammes Mermaid avec des compétences de conc...","de":"Erstellen von Mermaid-Diagrammen mit Designfähigkeiten","pt":"Criar Diagramas Mermaid","ru":"Создание диаграмм Mermaid","ar":"إنشاء مخططات ميرميد","en":"mermaid"},"description":{"zh":"Mermaid图表技能帮助您创建、验证和渲染Mermaid图表。它支持从自然语言描述、代码分析或编辑现有图表中创建图表","ja":"Mermaidダイアグラムスキルは、自然言語の説明、コード分析、または既存の図表の編集からMermaid図表を作成、検証、レンダリングするのに役立ちます","ko":"머메이드 다이어그램 스킬은 자연어 설명, 코드 분석 또는 기존 다이어그램 편집에서 머메이드 다이어그램을 생성, 검증 및 렌더링하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"La habilidad Mermaid te permite crear, validar y renderizar diagramas Mermaid desde descripciones de lenguaje natural o análisis de código.","fr":"La compétence Mermaid vous permet de créer, de valider et de rendre des diagrammes Mermaid à partir de descriptions de langage naturel ou d''analyses de code.","de":"Die Mermaid-Fähigkeit ermöglicht es Ihnen, Mermaid-Diagramme aus natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen oder Codeanalysen zu erstellen, zu überprüfen und zu rendern.","pt":"O skill Mermaid ajuda a criar, validar e renderizar diagramas Mermaid.","ru":"Навык Mermaid помогает создавать, проверять и отображать диаграммы Mermaid.","ar":"مهارة ميرميد تساعد على إنشاء مخططات ميرميد و التحقق منها و عرضها.","en":"会员持仓排行榜页面设计"},"definition":{"en":"会员持仓排行榜页面设计"},"features":{"zh":["创建Mermaid图表","验证Mermaid图表","渲染Mermaid图表","支持自然语言描述","支持代码分析","支持编辑现有图表"],"ja":["Mermaid図表の作成","Mermaid図表の検証","Mermaid図表のレンダリング","自然言語の説明のサポート","コード分析のサポート","既存の図表の編集のサポート"],"ko":["머메이드 다이어그램 생성","머메이드 다이어그램 검증","머메이드 다이어그램 렌더링","자연어 설명 지원","코드 분석 지원","기존 다이어그램 편집 지원"],"es":["Creación de diagramas Mermaid desde descripciones de lenguaje natural","Validación y renderizado de diagramas","Edición de diagramas existentes","Análisis de código para generar diagramas","Soporte para diferentes tipos de diagramas"],"fr":["Création de diagrammes Mermaid à partir de descriptions de langage naturel","Validation et rendu de diagrammes","Édition de diagrammes existants","Analyse de code pour générer des diagrammes","Prise en charge de différents types de diagrammes"],"de":["Erstellen von Mermaid-Diagrammen aus natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen","Überprüfung und Rendern von Diagrammen","Bearbeiten bestehender Diagramme","Codeanalyse zur Generierung von Diagrammen","Unterstützung für verschiedene Diagrammtypen"],"pt":["Criação de diagramas a partir de descrições naturais","Validação de diagramas","Renderização de diagramas","Edição de diagramas existentes","Análise de código para geração de diagramas"],"ru":["Создание диаграмм из естественных описаний","Проверка диаграмм","Отображение диаграмм","Редактирование существующих диаграмм","Анализ кода для генерации диаграмм"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات من وصفات طبيعية","التحقق من مخططات","عرض مخططات","تعديل مخططات موجودة","تحليل الكود لإنشاء مخططات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Mermaid图表","图表创建","图表验证","图表渲染","自然语言描述","代码分析","编辑现有图表"],"ja":["Mermaid図表","図表の作成","図表の検証","図表のレンダリング","自然言語の説明","コード分析","既存の図表の編集"],"ko":["머메이드 다이어그램","다이어그램 생성","다이어그램 검증","다이어그램 렌더링","자연어 설명","코드 분석","기존 다이어그램 편집"],"es":["Mermaid","diagramas","lenguaje natural","análisis de código","creación de diagramas","validación de diagramas","renderizado de diagramas"],"fr":["Mermaid","diagrammes","langage naturel","analyse de code","création de diagrammes","validation de diagrammes","rendu de diagrammes"],"de":["Mermaid","Diagramme","natürliche Sprache","Codeanalyse","Erstellung von Diagrammen","Überprüfung von Diagrammen","Rendern von Diagrammen"],"pt":["Mermaid","diagramas","descrições naturais","análise de código","edição de diagramas","renderização de diagramas","validação de diagramas"],"ru":["Mermaid","диаграммы","естественные описания","анализ кода","редактирование диаграмм","отображение диаграмм","проверка диаграмм"],"ar":["ميرميد","مخططات","وصفات طبيعية","تحليل الكود","تعديل مخططات","عرض مخططات","التحقق من مخططات"]}},"owner":"shinnytech","repo":"caiwenqiang-member-rank","repoPath":"shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mermaid","description":"Guide for creating mermaid diagrams. This skill should be used when users want to create a mermaid diagram (or update an existing diagram).","bodyPreview":"# Mermaid Diagram Skill\n\nThis skill helps you create, validate, and render Mermaid diagrams from natural language descriptions, code analysis, or by editing existing diagrams.\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nFollow these steps for every diagram creation/modification:\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n- Identify the diagram type needed (flowchart, sequence, class, etc.)\n- Extract key elements: entities, relationships, flow, hierarchy\n- Determine if creating new, editing existing, or generating from code\n\n### 2.","body":"# Mermaid Diagram Skill\n\nThis skill helps you create, validate, and render Mermaid diagrams from natural language descriptions, code analysis, or by editing existing diagrams.\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nFollow these steps for every diagram creation/modification:\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n- Identify the diagram type needed (flowchart, sequence, class, etc.)\n- Extract key elements: entities, relationships, flow, hierarchy\n- Determine if creating new, editing existing, or generating from code\n\n### 2. Generate Mermaid Code\n- Create syntactically correct Mermaid diagram code\n- Use appropriate diagram type syntax\n- Apply consistent naming and styling\n- Refer to `examples/` directory for type-specific syntax (load on-demand)\n\n### 3. Save to File\n- Write code to `.mmd` file\n- Generate meaningful filename based on diagram purpose (e.g., `user-authentication-flow.mmd`, `database-schema.mmd`)\n- Use kebab-case for filenames\n\n### 4. Validate with CLI\n- **ALWAYS** validate using: `mmdc -i <filename>.mmd`\n- Check for syntax errors and warnings\n- If validation fails, proceed to step 5\n\n### 5. Auto-Correct Errors\n- Analyze error messages from `mmdc`\n- Common issues:\n  - Invalid syntax or keywords\n  - Missing quotes around labels with spaces\n  - Incorrect arrow syntax\n  - Malformed node definitions\n- Automatically fix the code\n- Re-save and re-validate\n- Repeat until validation succeeds\n\n### 6. Render on Request\n- Default format: **SVG**\n- Command: `mmdc -i <filename>.mmd -o <filename>.svg`\n- Alternative formats: PNG (`-o <filename>.png`), PDF (`-o <filename>.pdf`)\n- Only render when user explicitly requests a preview/image\n\n## Supported Diagram Types\n\nLoad examples from `examples/` directory as needed:\n\n**Basic Diagrams:**\n- Flowchart (`examples/flowchart.md`)\n- Sequence Diagram (`examples/sequence.md`)\n- Class Diagram (`examples/class.md`)\n- State Diagram (`examples/state.md`)\n- Entity Relationship (`examples/er.md`)\n\n**Planning & Management:**\n- Gantt Chart (`examples/gantt.md`)\n- User Journey (`examples/journey.md`)\n- Timeline (`examples/timeline.md`)\n- Kanban (`examples/kanban.md`)\n\n**Data Visualization:**\n- Pie Chart (`examples/pie.md`)\n- XY Chart (`examples/xy-chart.md`)\n- Quadrant Chart (`examples/quadrant.md`)\n- Sankey (`examples/sankey.md`)\n- Radar (`examples/radar.md`)\n- Treemap (`examples/treemap.md`)\n\n**Technical Diagrams:**\n- Git Graph (`examples/git.md`)\n- C4 Diagram (`examples/c4.md`)\n- Requirement Diagram (`examples/requirement.md`)\n- Architecture (`examples/architecture.md`)\n- Block Diagram (`examples/block.md`)\n- Packet (`examples/packet.md`)\n\n**Organizational:**\n- Mindmap (`examples/mindmap.md`)\n- ZenUML (`examples/zenuml.md`)\n\n## Code Analysis → Diagram\n\nWhen analyzing code to create diagrams:\n\n**Class Diagrams:**\n- Extract classes, methods, properties, inheritance, interfaces\n- Show relationships: inheritance, composition, aggregation\n\n**Sequence Diagrams:**\n- Track function calls, async operations, API interactions\n- Show actors, lifelines, activation boxes\n\n**Flowcharts:**\n- Map control flow, conditionals, loops\n- Show function entry/exit points\n\n**State Diagrams:**\n- Identify states from enums, state machines, status fields\n- Map transitions and events\n\n## Templates\n\nCommon patterns available in `templates/common-patterns.md` (load on-demand):\n- Standard flowchart structures\n- API sequence patterns\n- Database ER patterns\n- Microservice architecture layouts\n- State machine templates\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Styling:**\n- Use meaningful node IDs\n- Add clear, concise labels\n- Apply subgraphs for grouping related elements\n- Use classDefs for visual consistency\n\n**Readability:**\n- Keep diagrams focused (split large diagrams into smaller ones)\n- Use top-to-bottom or left-to-right orientation consistently\n- Add comments in code for complex sections\n\n**Validation:**\n- NEVER skip validation step\n- Always fix errors before presenting to user\n- Test rendered output when in doubt\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf `mmdc` validation fails:\n1. Read error message carefully\n2. Identify line number and issue\n3. Apply fix (common fixes in examples)\n4. Re-validate\n5. Inform user only if repeated attempts fail\n\n## Output Format\n\nPresent to user:\n```\nCreated: <filename>.mmd\n\n<Show the mermaid code in a code block>\n\n✓ Validated successfully with mermaid-cli\n```\n\nIf rendered:\n```\nCreated: <filename>.mmd\nRendered: <filename>.svg\n\n[Show file paths]\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Assume `mmdc` (mermaid-cli) is installed and available\n- Default output format: SVG\n- Always validate before presenting\n- Fix errors autonomously\n- Only load example files when needed for specific diagram type\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:50:50.005Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing advanced diagramming and visualization capabilities for code analysis and documentation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级图表和可视化功能的开发者代理，以用于代码分析和文档编制。","ja":"コード分析およびドキュメントのための高度な図表化および視覚化機能を必要とするDeveloperエージェントに最適です。","ko":"코드 분석 및 문서화를 위해 고급 도표 및 시각화를 필요로 하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan capacidades de diagramación y visualización avanzadas para el análisis y documentación de código.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin de capacités de diagramme et de visualisation avancées pour l''analyse et la documentation de code.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die erweiterte Diagramm- und Visualisierungsfunktionen für Code-Analyse und -Dokumentation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de diagramação e visualização para análise e documentação de código.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-разработчиков, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности диаграммирования и визуализации для анализа и документации кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لترسيم البيانات وتحليلها للتحليل والتوثيق الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, validate, and render Mermaid diagrams from natural language descriptions, code analysis, or by editing existing diagrams, leveraging Mermaid''s flowchart, sequence, and class diagram capabilities, and generating diagrams in SVG format.","zh":"使代理能够从自然语言描述、代码分析或编辑现有图表中创建、验证和渲染Mermaid图表，利用Mermaid的流程图、序列图和类图功能，并以SVG格式生成图表。","ja":"エージェントが自然言語の説明、コード分析、または既存の図表の編集からMermaid図表を作成、検証、レンダリングできるようにし、Mermaidのフローチャート、シーケンス図、クラス図の機能を活用し、SVG形式で図表を生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 자연어 설명, 코드 분석 또는 기존 도표 편집에서 Mermaid 도표를 생성, 검증 및 렌더링 할 수 있도록 하며, Mermaid의 흐름도, 시퀀스도, 클래스 도면 기능을 활용하여 SVG 형식으로 도표를 생성합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear, validar y renderizar diagramas Mermaid a partir de descripciones en lenguaje natural, análisis de código o editando diagramas existentes, aprovechando las capacidades de diagrama de flujo, secuencia y diagrama de clase de Mermaid, y generando diagramas en formato SVG.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, valider et de rendre des diagrammes Mermaid à partir de descriptions en langage naturel, d''analyse de code ou en éditant des diagrammes existants, en exploitant les capacités de diagramme de flux, de séquence et de diagramme de classe de Mermaid, et en générant des diagrammes au format SVG.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Mermaid-Diagramme aus natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen, Code-Analysen oder durch Bearbeiten vorhandener Diagramme zu erstellen, zu validieren und zu rendern, indem es die Flussdiagramm-, Sequenz- und Klassendiagramm-Funktionen von Mermaid nutzt und Diagramme im SVG-Format generiert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, validar e renderizar diagramas Mermaid a partir de descrições em linguagem natural, análise de código ou editando diagramas existentes, aproveitando as capacidades de fluxograma, sequência e diagrama de classe do Mermaid, e gerando diagramas no formato SVG.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать, проверять и отображать диаграммы Mermaid из описаний на естественном языке, анализа кода или редактирования существующих диаграмм, используя возможности Mermaid для диаграмм потока, последовательности и классов, и генерируя диаграммы в формате SVG.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء و التحقق و عرض رسوم ميرميد من وصف اللغة الطبيعية أو تحليل الشفرة أو przez تحرير الرسوم الموجودة ، مستفيدة من إمكانيات ميرميد لرسوم تدفق و متوالية و فئة ، و جنرال رسوم في تنسيق SVG."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating flowchart generation for complex algorithms","Generating sequence diagrams for system interactions","Editing existing Mermaid diagrams for documentation purposes"],"zh":["为复杂算法自动生成流程图","为系统交互生成序列图","编辑现有Mermaid图表以用于文档目的"],"ja":["複雑なアルゴリズムの自動フローチャート生成","システムの相互作用のシーケンス図の生成","ドキュメント目的のための既存のMermaid図表の編集"],"ko":["복잡한 알고리즘을 위한 자동 흐름도 생성","시스템 상호작용을 위한 시퀀스도 생성","문서 목적을 위한 기존 Mermaid 도표 편집"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de diagramas de flujo para algoritmos complejos","Generación de diagramas de secuencia para interacciones del sistema","Edición de diagramas Mermaid existentes para fines de documentación"],"fr":["Automation de la génération de diagrammes de flux pour les algorithmes complexes","Génération de diagrammes de séquence pour les interactions du système","Édition de diagrammes Mermaid existants pour des fins de documentation"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Flussdiagrammen für komplexe Algorithmen","Generierung von Sequenzdiagrammen für Systeminteraktionen","Bearbeiten vorhandener Mermaid-Diagramme für Dokumentationszwecke"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de fluxogramas para algoritmos complexos","Gerar diagramas de sequência para interações de sistema","Editar diagramas Mermaid existentes para fins de documentação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию блок-схем для сложных алгоритмов","Генерировать диаграммы последовательности для взаимодействий системы","Редактировать существующие диаграммы Mermaid для целей документации"],"ar":["توتوماشن جيل الخرائط للخوارزميات المعقدة","توليد مخططات التتابع للمتفاعلات النظام","تحرير مخططات ميرميد الحالية لأغراض التوثيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Mermaid syntax knowledge","Limited to Mermaid-supported diagram types"],"zh":["需要Mermaid语法知识","仅限Mermaid支持的图表类型"],"ja":["Mermaid構文の知識が必要","Mermaidがサポートする図表のタイプのみ"],"ko":["Mermaid 구문 지식이 필요","Mermaid에서 지원하는 도표 유형만 해당"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la sintaxis Mermaid","Limitado a los tipos de diagramas compatibles con Mermaid"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en syntaxe Mermaid","Limité aux types de diagrammes pris en charge par Mermaid"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Mermaid-Syntax","Begrenzt auf Mermaid-Unterstützte Diagrammtypen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da sintaxe Mermaid","Limitado a tipos de diagramas suportados pelo Mermaid"],"ru":["Требует знания синтаксиса Mermaid","Ограничен типами диаграмм, поддерживаемыми Mermaid"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بنية ميرميد","محدود بنوعيات الرسوم المدعومة من ميرميد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('hurley87/kings-mini/ralph', 'community', 'hurley87', 'kings-mini', 'hurley87/kings-mini', 'ralph', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z', '2026-02-18T09:50:43.848Z', NULL, '{"id":"hurley87/kings-mini/ralph","name":"ralph","description":{"zh":"Ralph是一个迭代构建代理，通过收集需求和生成测试来实现构建过程的自动化","ja":"Ralphはイテレーティブビルドエージェントで、要求の収集とテストの生成を通じてビルドプロセスの自動化を実現します","ko":"Ralph는 반복 빌드 에이전트로, 요구사항 수집과 테스트 생성을 통해 빌드 프로세스의 자동화를实现합니다","es":"Ralph es un agente de construcción iterativa que trabaja hasta completar el trabajo, generando pruebas de aceptación funcionales y creando un archivo de configuración","fr":"Ralph est un agent de construction itérative qui travaille jusqu''à ce que le travail soit terminé, en générant des tests d''acceptation fonctionnels et en créant un fichier de configuration","de":"Ralph ist ein iteratives Build-Agent, der bis zur Fertigstellung arbeitet, indem er funktionale Akzeptanztests generiert und eine Konfigurationsdatei erstellt","pt":"Ralph é um agente de construção iterativa que trabalha persistentemente até que o trabalho esteja concluído, ajudando nos processos de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Ralph - итеративный сборочный агент, который работает настойчиво до тех пор, пока работа не будет выполнена, помогая в процессах разработки.","ar":"رالف هو وكلاء بناء تكراري يعمل بثبات حتى يتم إنجاز العمل، مما يساعد في عمليات التطوير.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Ralph迭代构建代理","ja":"Ralph - イテレーティブビルドエージェント","ko":"Ralph 반복 빌드 에이전트","es":"Ralph: Agente de construcción iterativa para desarrolladores","fr":"Ralph : Agent de construction itérative pour développeurs","de":"Ralph: Iteratives Build-Agent für Entwickler","pt":"Ralph: Agente de Construção Iterativa para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Ralph: Итеративный сборочный агент для разработчиков","ar":"رالف: وكلاء بناء تكراري للמطورين","en":"ralph"},"description":{"zh":"Ralph是一个迭代构建代理，通过收集需求和生成测试来实现构建过程的自动化","ja":"Ralphはイテレーティブビルドエージェントで、要求の収集とテストの生成を通じてビルドプロセスの自動化を実現します","ko":"Ralph는 반복 빌드 에이전트로, 요구사항 수집과 테스트 생성을 통해 빌드 프로세스의 자동화를实现합니다","es":"Ralph es un agente de construcción iterativa que trabaja hasta completar el trabajo, generando pruebas de aceptación funcionales y creando un archivo de conf...","fr":"Ralph est un agent de construction itérative qui travaille jusqu''à ce que le travail soit terminé, en générant des tests d''acceptation fonctionnels et en cré...","de":"Ralph ist ein iteratives Build-Agent, der bis zur Fertigstellung arbeitet, indem er funktionale Akzeptanztests generiert und eine Konfigurationsdatei erstellt","pt":"Ralph é um agente de construção iterativa que trabalha persistentemente até que o trabalho esteja concluído, ajudando nos processos de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Ralph - итеративный сборочный агент, который работает настойчиво до тех пор, пока работа не будет выполнена, помогая в процессах разработки.","ar":"رالف هو وكلاء بناء تكراري يعمل بثبات حتى يتم إنجاز العمل، مما يساعد في عمليات التطوير.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["收集需求和生成测试","自动化构建过程","支持迭代构建","生成功能性验收测试","创建.agent/tests.json文件"],"ja":["要求の収集とテストの生成","ビルドプロセスの自動化","イテレーティブビルドのサポート","機能性受け入れテストの生成",".agent/tests.jsonファイルの作成"],"ko":["요구사항 수집과 테스트 생성","빌드 프로세스의 자동화","반복 빌드 지원","기능性 수용 테스트 생성",".agent/tests.json 파일 생성"],"es":["Enfoque iterativo para completar tareas","Generación de pruebas de aceptación funcionales","Creación de un archivo de configuración"," Trabaja hasta completar el trabajo","Ideal para desarrolladores que buscan automatizar procesos"],"fr":["Approche itérative pour terminer les tâches","Génération de tests d''acceptation fonctionnels","Création d''un fichier de configuration","Travail jusqu''à ce que le travail soit terminé","Idéal pour les développeurs qui cherchent à automatiser les processus"],"de":["Iterativer Ansatz für die Erledigung von Aufgaben","Generierung funktionaler Akzeptanztests","Erstellung einer Konfigurationsdatei","Arbeit bis zur Fertigstellung","Ideal für Entwickler, die Prozesse automatisieren möchten"],"pt":["Gather de requisitos","Geração de testes de aceitação","Criação de arquivo de teste","Iteração até a conclusão do trabalho","Suporte ao desenvolvimento de projetos"],"ru":["Сбор требований","Генерация тестов на приемку","Создание файла тестирования","Итерация до завершения работы","Поддержка разработки проектов"],"ar":["جمع المتطلبات","توليد اختبارات القبول","إنشاء ملف الاختبار","التكرار حتى إكمال العمل","دعم تطوير المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ralph","迭代构建代理","自动化构建","功能性验收测试","构建过程","测试生成"],"ja":["Ralph","イテレーティブビルドエージェント","ビルド自動化","機能性受け入れテスト","ビルドプロセス","テスト生成"],"ko":["Ralph","반복 빌드 에이전트","빌드 자동화","기능性 수용 테스트","빌드 프로세스","테스트 생성"],"es":["agente de construcción","construcción iterativa","pruebas de aceptación","automatización de procesos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["agent de construction","construction itérative","tests d''acceptation","automatisation de processus","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Build-Agent","iteratives Builden","Akzeptanztests","Automatisierung von Prozessen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["agente de construção","desenvolvimento de software","testes de aceitação","iteração de construção","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","projetos de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["сборочный агент","разработка программного обеспечения","тесты на приемку","итерация сборки","инструменты разработки","проекты разработки"],"ar":["وكلاء البناء","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات القبول","تكرار البناء","أدوات التطوير","مشاريع التطوير"]}},"owner":"hurley87","repo":"kings-mini","repoPath":"hurley87/kings-mini","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph","description":"Build features iteratively until all functional tests pass","bodyPreview":"# Ralph - Iterative Build Agent\n\nYou are a persistent build agent that works until the job is done.\n\n## Phase 1: Gather Requirements\n\nIf `.agent/tests.json` does not exist:\n\n1. Ask the user: \"What would you like me to build?\"\n2. Once you understand the requirements, generate functional acceptance tests\n3. Create `.agent/tests.json` with this structure:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"feature\": \"Description of what user wants to build\",\n  \"iteration\": 0,\n  \"maxIterations\": 10,\n  \"tests\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,","body":"# Ralph - Iterative Build Agent\n\nYou are a persistent build agent that works until the job is done.\n\n## Phase 1: Gather Requirements\n\nIf `.agent/tests.json` does not exist:\n\n1. Ask the user: \"What would you like me to build?\"\n2. Once you understand the requirements, generate functional acceptance tests\n3. Create `.agent/tests.json` with this structure:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"feature\": \"Description of what user wants to build\",\n  \"iteration\": 0,\n  \"maxIterations\": 10,\n  \"tests\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"description\": \"Clear description of test criterion\",\n      \"passed\": false\n    },\n    { \"id\": 2, \"description\": \"Another test criterion\", \"passed\": false }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nCreate 5-10 meaningful functional tests that verify the feature works correctly.\n\n## Phase 2: Build and Verify\n\n1. Read `.agent/tests.json` to understand current state\n2. Increment the `iteration` counter\n3. Implement or fix code to make failing tests pass\n4. After making changes, manually verify each test criterion\n5. Update `passed: true` for any tests that now pass\n6. Save the updated `.agent/tests.json`\n\n## Phase 3: Report Status\n\nAfter each iteration, update `.agent/scratchpad.md` with:\n\n```markdown\n# Ralph Progress\n\n## Current Status\n\n- Iteration: X of Y\n- Tests Passing: N of M\n\n## Recently Completed\n\n- [List tests that passed this iteration]\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [What needs to be done next]\n```\n\n## Important Rules\n\n- Be thorough when verifying tests - actually check that each criterion is met\n- Don''t mark a test as passed unless you''ve verified it works\n- If you''ve tried multiple approaches and a test still fails, note it in the scratchpad\n- Stop gracefully if you reach maxIterations\n\n## Hook: afterStop\n\nWhen the agent stops, the `ralph-continue.sh` hook will:\n\n- Check `.agent/tests.json` for remaining failing tests\n- If tests remain and iterations < max, it will prompt you to continue\n- Keep working until all tests pass or max iterations reached\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:50:43.848Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Iterative Build Agents requiring persistent job execution and functional acceptance testing.","zh":"适用于需要持久性作业执行和功能验收测试的迭代构建代理。","ja":"永続的なジョブの実行と機能受け入れテストを必要とするイテレーティブビルドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"지속적인 작업 실행 및 기능 수용 테스트가 필요한 반복 빌드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de construcción iterativa que requieren ejecución de trabajos persistente y pruebas de aceptación funcionales.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de construction itérative nécessitant une exécution de tâches persistante et des tests d''acceptation fonctionnelle.","de":"Ideal für iterative Build-Agents, die eine persistente Job-Ausführung und funktionale Akzeptanztests erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Construção Iterativa que requerem execução de trabalho persistente e teste de aceitação funcional.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Итеративных Сборочных Агентов, требующих постоянного выполнения заданий и функционального тестирования принятия.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإنشاء التكراري الذي يتطلب تنفيذ عمل متواصل واختبار قبول وظيفي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate functional acceptance tests and manage iterative build processes using JSON-based test structures, creating `.agent/tests.json` files to track progress and requirements.","zh":"赋予代理生成功能验收测试和使用基于JSON的测试结构管理迭代构建过程的能力，创建 `.agent/tests.json` 文件以跟踪进度和要求。","ja":"エージェントに機能受け入れテストを生成し、JSONベースのテスト構造を使用してイテレーティブビルドプロセスを管理する機能を付与し、進度と要件を追跡するために `.agent/tests.json` ファイルを作成します。","ko":"에이전트가 기능 수용 테스트를 생성하고 JSON 기반 테스트 구조를 사용하여 반복 빌드 프로세스를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 진행 상황과 요구 사항을 추적하기 위해 `.agent/tests.json` 파일을 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar pruebas de aceptación funcionales y gestionar procesos de construcción iterativos mediante estructuras de prueba basadas en JSON, creando archivos `.agent/tests.json` para realizar un seguimiento del progreso y los requisitos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des tests d''acceptation fonctionnelle et de gérer les processus de construction itératifs à l''aide de structures de test basées sur JSON, en créant des fichiers `.agent/tests.json` pour suivre les progrès et les exigences.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, funktionale Akzeptanztests zu generieren und iterative Build-Prozesse mithilfe von JSON-basierten Teststrukturen zu verwalten, indem sie `.agent/tests.json`-Dateien erstellen, um den Fortschritt und die Anforderungen zu verfolgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar testes de aceitação funcional e gerenciar processos de construção iterativa usando estruturas de teste baseadas em JSON, criando arquivos `.agent/tests.json` para rastrear o progresso e os requisitos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать функциональные тесты принятия и управлять итеративными сборочными процессами с помощью тестовых структур на основе JSON, создавая файлы `.agent/tests.json` для отслеживания прогресса и требований.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنتاج اختبارات قبول وظيفية وإدارة عمليات البناء التكراري باستخدام هياكل الاختبار القائمة على JSON، مما يؤدي إلى إنشاء ملفات `.agent/tests.json` لتتبع التقدم والمتطلبات."},"useCases":{"en":["Gathering user requirements for custom builds","Generating functional acceptance tests for iterative development","Managing build iterations with JSON-based test tracking"],"zh":["收集自定义构建的用户需求","为迭代开发生成功能验收测试","使用基于JSON的测试跟踪管理构建迭代"],"ja":["カスタムビルドのユーザー要件を収集する","イテレーティブ開発の機能受け入れテストを生成する","JSONベースのテスト追跡を使用してビルドイテレーションを管理する"],"ko":["사용자 정의 빌드에 대한 사용자 요구 사항 수집","반복 개발을 위한 기능 수용 테스트 생성","JSON 기반 테스트 추적을 사용한 빌드 반복 관리"],"es":["Recopilación de requisitos de usuario para construcciones personalizadas","Generación de pruebas de aceptación funcionales para el desarrollo iterativo","Gestión de iteraciones de construcción con seguimiento de pruebas basado en JSON"],"fr":["Collecte des exigences utilisateur pour les constructions personnalisées","Génération de tests d''acceptation fonctionnelle pour le développement itératif","Gestion des itérations de construction avec un suivi de tests basé sur JSON"],"de":["Erfassung von Benutzeranforderungen für benutzerdefinierte Builds","Generierung von funktionalen Akzeptanztests für die iterative Entwicklung","Verwaltung von Build-Iterationen mit JSON-basiertem Test-Tracking"],"pt":["Coletar requisitos do usuário para compilações personalizadas","Gerar testes de aceitação funcional para desenvolvimento iterativo","Gerenciar iterações de compilação com rastreamento de teste baseado em JSON"],"ru":["Сбор требований пользователя для индивидуальных сборок","Генерация функциональных тестов принятия для итеративного развития","Управление итерациями сборки с помощью отслеживания тестов на основе JSON"],"ar":["جمع متطلبات المستخدم للتركيبات المخصصة","إنتاج اختبارات قبول وظيفية لتطوير متكرر","إدارة تكرارات التركيب باستخدام تتبع الاختبار القائم على JSON"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for initial requirements gathering","Limited to 10 iterations as defined by `maxIterations`"],"zh":["需要用户输入以收集初始需求","受 `maxIterations` 定义的限制，仅限10次迭代"],"ja":["初期要件の収集にはユーザー入力が必要","`maxIterations` で定義された限制により、10 イテレーションに限定される"],"ko":["초기 요구 사항 수집에는 사용자 입력이 필요합니다.","`maxIterations`로 정의된 제한으로 인해 10번의 반복으로 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere la entrada del usuario para la recopilación inicial de requisitos","Limitado a 10 iteraciones según lo definido por `maxIterations`"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour la collecte initiale des exigences","Limité à 10 itérations tel que défini par `maxIterations`"],"de":["Benutzerinput für die anfängliche Erfassung von Anforderungen erforderlich","Begrenzt auf 10 Iterationen wie durch `maxIterations` definiert"],"pt":["Requer entrada do usuário para coleta inicial de requisitos","Limitado a 10 iterações conforme definido por `maxIterations`"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для первоначального сбора требований","Ограничен 10 итерациями, как определено в `maxIterations`"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لجمع المتطلبات الأولي","محدد بـ 10 تكرارات كما هو محدد بواسطة `maxIterations`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
