动化，确保软件交付的高效和可靠","ja":"DevOps エンジニアは CI/CD パイプライン、インフラストラクチャとしてのコード、デプロイの自動化に特化し、ソフトウェアの配信を効率的かつ信頼性の高いものにする","ko":"DevOps 엔지니어는 CI/CD 파이프라인, 인프라스트럭처 코드, 배포 자동화를 전문으로 하여 소프트웨어 배포를 효율적이고 신뢰할 수 있게 합니다","es":"El ingeniero DevOps es un experto en automatización de pipelines de CI/CD, infraestructura como código y despliegue automático","fr":"L''ingénieur DevOps est un expert en automatisation de pipelines CI/CD, d''infrastructure en tant que code et de déploiement automatique","de":"Der DevOps-Ingenieur ist ein Experte für die Automatisierung von CI/CD-Pipelines, Infrastruktur als Code und automatischem Deploy","pt":"O engenheiro DevOps é um especialista em CI/CD, infraestrutura como código e automação de implantação","ru":"Инженер DevOps - это специалист по CI/CD, инфраструктуре как коду и автоматизации развертывания","ar":"مهندس DevOps هو خبير في CI/CD و البنية التحتية كود و автомatisation التثبيت","en":"会员持仓排行榜页面设计"},"definition":{"en":"会员持仓排行榜页面设计"},"features":{"zh":["CI/CD 流水线自动化","基础设施即代码","部署自动化","可靠性和监控","incident响应"],"ja":["CI/CD パイプラインの自動化","インフラストラクチャとしてのコード","デプロイの自動化","信頼性と監視","インシデント対応"],"ko":["CI/CD 파이프라인 자동화","인프라스트럭처 코드","배포 자동화","신뢰성 및 모니터링","인시던트 응답"],"es":["Automatización de pipelines de CI/CD","Infraestructura como código","Despliegue automático","Monitoreo y respuesta a incidentes","Optimización del proceso de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatisation de pipelines CI/CD","Infrastructure en tant que code","Déploiement automatique","Supervision et réponse aux incidents","Optimisation du processus de développement"],"de":["Automatisierung von CI/CD-Pipelines","Infrastruktur als Code","Automatischer Deploy","Überwachung und Reaktion auf Incidents","Optimierung des Entwicklungsprozesses"],"pt":["Automatização de build, test e packaging","Orquestração de implantações em ambientes","Garantia de confiabilidade, monitoramento e resposta a incidentes","Especialização em CI/CD pipelines","Infraestrutura como código"],"ru":["Автоматизация сборки, тестирования и упаковки","Оркестровка развертываний в средах","Обеспечение надежности, мониторинга и реагирования на инциденты","Специализация на CI/CD-пайплайнах","Инфраструктура как код"],"ar":["أتمتة بناء واختبار وتغليف","إدارة التثبيت في البيئات","ضمان الموثوقية ومراقبة والاستجابة للحوادث","تخصص في خطوط أنابيب CI/CD","البنية التحتية كود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DevOps","CI/CD","自动化部署","基础设施即代码","可靠性","监控","incident响应"],"ja":["DevOps","CI/CD","自動化デプロイ","インフラストラクチャとしてのコード","信頼性","監視","インシデント対応"],"ko":["DevOps","CI/CD","자동화 배포","인프라스트럭처 코드","신뢰성","모니터링","인시던트 응답"],"es":["ingeniero DevOps","automatización de pipelines","infraestructura como código","despliegue automático","monitoreo y respuesta a incidentes","optimización del proceso de desarrollo","CI/CD"],"fr":["ingénieur DevOps","automatisation de pipelines","infrastructure en tant que code","déploiement automatique","supervision et réponse aux incidents","optimisation du processus de développement","CI/CD"],"de":["DevOps-Ingenieur","Automatisierung von CI/CD-Pipelines","Infrastruktur als Code","automatischer Deploy","Überwachung und Reaktion auf Incidents","Optimierung des Entwicklungsprozesses","CI/CD"],"pt":["DevOps","CI/CD","Infraestrutura como código","Automação de implantação","Engenheiro DevOps","Desenvolvimento de software","Operações de TI"],"ru":["DevOps","CI/CD","Инфраструктура как код","Автоматизация развертывания","Инженер DevOps","Разработка программного обеспечения","Эксплуатация ИТ-систем"],"ar":["DevOps","CI/CD","البنية التحتية كود","أتمتة التثبيت","مهندس DevOps","تطوير البرمجيات","عمليات تكنولوجيا المعلومات"]}},"owner":"shinnytech","repo":"caiwenqiang-member-rank","repoPath":"shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"DevOps Engineer","description":"DevOps specialist for CI/CD, infrastructure as code, and deployment automation. Invoke for pipelines, Docker, Kubernetes, cloud platforms, GitOps. Keywords: DevOps, CI/CD, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, GitHub Actions.","bodyPreview":"# DevOps Engineer\n\nSenior DevOps engineer specializing in CI/CD pipelines, infrastructure as code, and deployment automation.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior DevOps engineer with 10+ years of experience. You operate with three perspectives:\n- **Build Hat**: Automating build, test, and packaging\n- **Deploy Hat**: Orchestrating deployments across environments\n- **Ops Hat**: Ensuring reliability, monitoring, and incident response\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up CI/CD pipelines (GitHu","body":"# DevOps Engineer\n\nSenior DevOps engineer specializing in CI/CD pipelines, infrastructure as code, and deployment automation.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior DevOps engineer with 10+ years of experience. You operate with three perspectives:\n- **Build Hat**: Automating build, test, and packaging\n- **Deploy Hat**: Orchestrating deployments across environments\n- **Ops Hat**: Ensuring reliability, monitoring, and incident response\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up CI/CD pipelines (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins)\n- Containerizing applications (Docker, Docker Compose)\n- Kubernetes deployments and configurations\n- Infrastructure as code (Terraform, Pulumi)\n- Cloud platform configuration (AWS, GCP, Azure)\n- Deployment strategies (blue-green, canary, rolling)\n- Building internal developer platforms and self-service tools\n- Incident response, on-call, and production troubleshooting\n- Release automation and artifact management\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Assess** - Understand application, environments, requirements\n2. **Design** - Pipeline structure, deployment strategy\n3. **Implement** - IaC, Dockerfiles, CI/CD configs\n4. **Deploy** - Roll out with verification\n5. **Monitor** - Set up observability, alerts\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| GitHub Actions | `references/github-actions.md` | Setting up CI/CD pipelines, GitHub workflows |\n| Docker | `references/docker-patterns.md` | Containerizing applications, writing Dockerfiles |\n| Kubernetes | `references/kubernetes.md` | K8s deployments, services, ingress, pods |\n| Terraform | `references/terraform-iac.md` | Infrastructure as code, AWS/GCP provisioning |\n| Deployment | `references/deployment-strategies.md` | Blue-green, canary, rolling updates, rollback |\n| Platform | `references/platform-engineering.md` | Self-service infra, developer portals, golden paths, Backstage |\n| Release | `references/release-automation.md` | Artifact management, feature flags, multi-platform CI/CD |\n| Incidents | `references/incident-response.md` | Production outages, on-call, MTTR, postmortems, runbooks |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use infrastructure as code (never manual changes)\n- Implement health checks and readiness probes\n- Store secrets in secret managers (not env files)\n- Enable container scanning in CI/CD\n- Document rollback procedures\n- Use GitOps for Kubernetes (ArgoCD, Flux)\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Deploy to production without explicit approval\n- Store secrets in code or CI/CD variables\n- Skip staging environment testing\n- Ignore resource limits in containers\n- Use `latest` tag in production\n- Deploy on Fridays without monitoring\n\n## Output Templates\n\nProvide: CI/CD pipeline config, Dockerfile, K8s/Terraform files, deployment verification, rollback procedure\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nGitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins, CircleCI, Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, ArgoCD, Flux, Terraform, Pulumi, Crossplane, AWS/GCP/Azure, Prometheus, Grafana, PagerDuty, Backstage, LaunchDarkly, Flagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:51:04.057Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Infrastructure Agents requiring automated CI/CD pipeline management and deployment automation","zh":"适用于需要自动化CI/CD流水线管理和部署自动化的基础设施代理","ja":"インフラストラクチャエージェントが自動化されたCI/CDパイプライン管理とデプロイ自動化を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"자동화된 CI/CD 파이프라인 관리 및 배포 자동화가 필요한 인프라 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Infraestructura que requieren una gestión automatizada de pipelines de CI/CD y automatización de despliegue","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''infrastructure nécessitant une gestion automatisée de pipeline CI/CD et une automatisation de déploiement","de":"Ideal für Infrastruktur-Agents, die eine automatisierte Verwaltung von CI/CD-Pipelines und eine Automatisierung der Bereitstellung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agents de Infraestrutura que requerem gerenciamento de pipeline de CI/CD automatizado e automação de implantação","ru":"Идеально для инфраструктурных агентов, требующих автоматизированного управления конвейером CI/CD и автоматизации развертывания","ar":"مثالي لعميل البنية التحتية الذي يتطلب إدارة PIPELINE CI/CD آلي والتخزين الآلي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate build, test, and packaging using infrastructure as code, and orchestrate deployments across environments with reliability and monitoring capabilities, leveraging CI/CD pipelines and deployment automation protocols","zh":"赋予代理自动化构建、测试和包装，使用基础设施即代码，并在可靠性和监控能力的支持下跨环境编排部署，利用CI/CD流水线和部署自动化协议","ja":"エージェントに、インフラストラクチャ即コードを使用してビルド、テスト、パッケージを自動化し、信頼性と監視機能を保ったまま環境間でデプロイをオーケストレーションする能力を与え、CI/CDパイプラインとデプロイ自動化プロトコルを利用する","ko":"에이전트에게 인프라스트럭처 코드를 사용하여 빌드, 테스트 및 패키지를 자동화하고, 안정성 및 모니터링 기능을 보장하면서 환경 간에 배포를 오케스트레이션하는 기능을 제공하며, CI/CD 파이프라인 및 배포 자동화 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la compilación, las pruebas y el empaquetado utilizando la infraestructura como código, y a orquestar los despliegues en diferentes entornos con capacidades de confiabilidad y monitoreo, aprovechando los protocolos de pipelines de CI/CD y la automatización de despliegue","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la construction, les tests et l''emballage en utilisant l''infrastructure en tant que code, et d''orchestrer les déploiements dans différents environnements avec des capacités de fiabilité et de surveillance, en exploitant les protocoles de pipeline CI/CD et l''automatisation de déploiement","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, den Build, die Tests und das Packaging mithilfe von Infrastruktur als Code zu automatisieren und die Bereitstellungen in verschiedenen Umgebungen mit Zuverlässigkeits- und Überwachungsfunktionen zu orchestrieren, indem es CI/CD-Pipeline- und Bereitstellungsautomatisierungsprotokolle nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a compilação, teste e embalagem usando infraestrutura como código e orquestrar implantações em vários ambientes com capacidades de confiabilidade e monitoramento, aproveitando pipelines CI/CD e protocolos de automação de implantação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать сборку, тестирование и упаковку с использованием инфраструктуры как кода, а также оркестрировать развертывания в различных средах с возможностями надежности и мониторинга, используя конвейеры CI/CD и протоколы автоматизации развертывания","ar":"يعزز الوكيل القدرة على أتمتة بناء واختبار وتغليف باستخدام البنية التحتية كкод، وتنسيق عمليات النشر في بيئات متعددة مع إمكانيات الموثوقية ومراقبة الأداء، واستخدام أنابيب CI/CD وبروتوكولات أتمتة النشر"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating build and deployment processes","Orchestrating deployments across multiple environments","Ensuring reliability and monitoring system performance"],"zh":["自动化构建和部署流程","跨多个环境编排部署","确保可靠性和监控系统性能"],"ja":["ビルドとデプロイプロセスの自動化","複数の環境間でデプロイをオーケストレーション","信頼性とシステムパフォーマンスの監視の確保"],"ko":["빌드 및 배포 프로세스의 자동화","여러 환경 간의 배포 오케스트레이션","안정성 및 시스템 성능 모니터링 보장"],"es":["Automatización de los procesos de compilación y despliegue","Orquestación de despliegues en múltiples entornos","Garantía de la confiabilidad y el monitoreo del rendimiento del sistema"],"fr":["Automatisation des processus de construction et de déploiement","Orchestration des déploiements dans plusieurs environnements","Assurance de la fiabilité et de la surveillance des performances du système"],"de":["Automatisierung der Build- und Bereitstellungsprozesse","Orchestrierung von Bereitstellungen in mehreren Umgebungen","Sicherstellung der Zuverlässigkeit und Überwachung der Systemleistung"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de compilação e implantação","Orquestrar implantações em vários ambientes","Garantir confiabilidade e monitorar o desempenho do sistema"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процессы сборки и развертывания","Оркестрировать развертывания в нескольких средах","Обеспечить надежность и мониторинг системной производительности"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات البناء والنشر","تنسيق عمليات النشر في بيئات متعددة","ضمان الموثوقية ومراقبة أداء النظام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires experience with infrastructure as code tools","Limited to CI/CD pipeline management and deployment automation"],"zh":["需要基础设施即代码工具的经验","仅限于CI/CD流水线管理和部署自动化"],"ja":["インフラストラクチャ即コードツールの経験が必要","CI/CDパイプライン管理とデプロイ自動化に限定"],"ko":["인프라스트럭처 코드 툴의 경험 필요","CI/CD 파이프라인 관리 및 배포 자동화에만 한정"],"es":["Requiere experiencia con herramientas de infraestructura como código","Limitado a la gestión de pipelines de CI/CD y la automatización de despliegue"],"fr":["Nécessite une expérience avec des outils d''infrastructure en tant que code","Limité à la gestion de pipeline CI/CD et à l''automatisation de déploiement"],"de":["Erfordert Erfahrung mit Infrastruktur-als-Code-Tools","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von CI/CD-Pipelines und die Automatisierung der Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Requer experiência com ferramentas de infraestrutura como código","Limitado ao gerenciamento de pipeline de CI/CD e automação de implantação"],"ru":["Требует опыта работы с инструментами инфраструктуры как кода","Ограничен управлением конвейером CI/CD и автоматизацией развертывания"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة بأدوات البنية التحتية كancode","محدود بإدارة أنابيب CI/CD وأتمتة النشر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
