방안을 제시하는 전문가용 검색 엔진 최적화 도구입니다","es":"El análisis de SEO ayuda a identificar problemas y proporciona recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica","fr":"L''audit SEO aide à identifier les problèmes et fournit des recommandations pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique","de":"Das SEO-Audit hilft bei der Identifizierung von Problemen und liefert Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Organischen-Suchleistung","pt":"A análise de SEO ajuda a identificar problemas e melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica. Nossa ferramenta fornece recomendações para desenvolvedores","ru":"Анализ SEO помогает выявить проблемы и улучшить органический поиск. Наша инструментов предоставляет рекомендации для разработчиков","ar":"تحليل محركات البحث يساعد على تحديد المشاكل وتحسين أداء البحث العضوي. أداة التحليل الخاصة بنا توفر توصيات للمطورين","en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"definition":{"en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"features":{"zh":["网站分析","SEO 问题检测","优化建议","性能改进","搜索引擎排名提升"],"ja":["ウェブサイト分析","SEO 問題検出","最適化提案","パフォーマンス改善","検索エンジンランキング向上"],"ko":["웹사이트 분석","SEO 문제 감지","최적화 제안","성능 향상","검색 엔진 순위 상승"],"es":["Identificación de problemas de SEO","Análisis de la estructura del sitio web","Optimización de contenido y metadatos","Mejora del rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica","Recomendaciones personalizadas para mejorar el SEO"],"fr":["Identification des problèmes de SEO","Analyse de la structure du site web","Optimisation du contenu et des métadonnées","Amélioration des performances de recherche organique","Recommandations personnalisées pour améliorer le SEO"],"de":["Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Analyse der Website-Struktur","Optimierung von Inhalten und Metadaten","Verbesserung der Organischen-Suchleistung","Persönliche Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung des SEO"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas de SEO","Recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca","Análise de site e conteúdo","Otimização de palavras-chave","Melhoria da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Определение проблем с SEO","Рекомендации для улучшения поиска","Анализ сайта и контента","Оптимизация ключевых слов","Улучшение пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تحديد مشاكل محركات البحث","توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث","تحليل الموقع والمحتوى","تحسين الكلمات الرئيسية","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审计","搜索引擎优化","网站分析","SEO 问题","优化建议","性能改进","搜索引擎排名"],"ja":["SEO オーディット","検索エンジン最適化","ウェブサイト分析","SEO 問題","最適化提案","パフォーマンス改善","検索エンジンランキング"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","웹사이트 분석","SEO 문제","최적화 제안","성능 향상","검색 엔진 순위"],"es":["análisis de SEO","optimización de sitio web","mejora del rendimiento de búsqueda","recomendaciones de SEO","desarrollo web","SEO para desarrolladores"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation de site web","amélioration des performances de recherche","recommandations SEO","développement web","SEO pour les développeurs"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Website-Optimierung","Verbesserung der Organischen-Suchleistung","SEO-Empfehlungen","Webentwicklung","SEO für Entwickler"],"pt":["análise de SEO","otimização de site","desempenho de busca","recomendações de SEO","ferramenta de análise de SEO","desenvolvedores de SEO"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация сайта","поиск","рекомендации SEO","инструмент анализа SEO","разработчики SEO"],"ar":["تحليل محركات البحث","تحسين الموقع","بحث","توصيات محركات البحث","أداة تحليل محركات البحث","مطورو محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"faint45","repo":"zhewei-ai-chat-01","repoPath":"faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:51:43.102Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing advanced SEO analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO分析和优化能力的数字营销代理。","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが高度なSEO分析および最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 분석 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan capacidades de análisis y optimización de SEO avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin d''une analyse et d''optimisation de SEO avancées.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte SEO-Analyse- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que necessitam de análise e capacidades de otimização de SEO avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов цифрового маркетинга, которым требуются продвинутые возможности анализа и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الرقميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم وقدرات تحسين SEO."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations using product marketing context, site context analysis, and understanding of organic search performance, leveraging Markdown files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for informed decision-making.","zh":"赋予代理识别SEO问题的能力，并利用产品营销背景、网站背景分析和对有机搜索性能的理解，提供可行的建议，利用Markdown文件（如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）进行明智的决策。","ja":"エージェントがSEOの問題を特定し、製品マーケティングのコンテキスト、サイトのコンテキスト分析、および有機検索パフォーマンスの理解を利用して、実行可能な推奨事項を提供することを可能にします。Markdownファイル（例：`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）を利用して、情報に基づいた意思決定を行います。","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 문제를 식별하고 제품 마케팅.context, 사이트 컨텍스트 분석 및 유기적 검색 성능에 대한 이해를 사용하여 行動 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다. Markdown 파일(예: `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`)을 사용하여 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 내릴 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones accionables utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos, el análisis del contexto del sitio y la comprensión del rendimiento de la búsqueda orgánica, aprovechando archivos Markdown como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para la toma de decisiones informadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations actionnables en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits, l''analyse du contexte du site et la compréhension de la performance de la recherche organique, en exploitant les fichiers Markdown tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen bereitzustellen, indem sie den Produktmarketing-Kontext, die Kontextanalyse der Website und das Verständnis der organischen Suchleistung nutzen und auf Markdown-Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für fundierte Entscheidungen zurückgreifen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações eficazes usando o contexto de marketing de produtos, análise de contexto do site e compreensão do desempenho de busca orgânica, aproveitando arquivos Markdown como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para tomada de decisões informadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации, используя контекст маркетинга продукции, анализ контекста сайта и понимание результатов органического поиска, опираясь на файлы Markdown, такие как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, для принятия обоснованных решений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحديد مشاكل SEO وتقديم توصيات يمكن تنفيذها باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج وتحليل سياق الموقع وفهم أداء البحث العضوي، مستفيدا من ملفات Markdown مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` للاتخاذ القرارات على أساس معلومات دقيقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website structure for SEO compliance","Analyzing product marketing context for optimization opportunities","Generating actionable recommendations for improving organic search performance"],"zh":["审核网站结构以确保SEO合规性","分析产品营销背景以寻找优化机会","生成可行的建议以提高有机搜索性能"],"ja":["SEOコンプライアンスのためのウェブサイト構造の監査","最適化の機会を探すための製品マーケティングのコンテキスト分析","有機検索パフォーマンスの向上のための実行可能な推奨事項の生成"],"ko":["SEO 규정 준수审核를 위한 웹사이트 구조 감사","최적화 기회를 찾기 위한 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 분석","유기적 검색 성능 개선을 위한 行動 가능한 추천 생성"],"es":["Auditoría de la estructura del sitio web para el cumplimiento de SEO","Análisis del contexto de marketing de productos para oportunidades de optimización","Generación de recomendaciones accionables para mejorar el rendimiento de la búsqueda orgánica"],"fr":["Audit de la structure du site web pour la conformité aux normes SEO","Analyse du contexte de marketing de produits pour les opportunités d''optimisation","Génération de recommandations actionnables pour améliorer la performance de la recherche organique"],"de":["Prüfung der Website-Struktur auf SEO-Konformität","Analyse des Produktmarketing-Kontexts für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten","Erstellung handhabbarer Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der organischen Suchleistung"],"pt":["Auditoria da estrutura do site para conformidade com o SEO","Análise do contexto de marketing de produtos para oportunidades de otimização","Geração de recomendações eficazes para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica"],"ru":["Аудит структуры сайта для соответствия требованиям SEO","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукции для выявления возможностей оптимизации","Генерация действенных рекомендаций для улучшения результатов органического поиска"],"ar":["فحص هيكل الموقع للامتثال لسياق SEO","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج لفرص التحسين","توليد توصيات يمكن تنفيذها لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site context information","Dependent on existence of `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` file for product marketing context"],"zh":["需要访问网站背景信息","依赖于`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`文件的存在以获取产品营销背景"],"ja":["サイトのコンテキスト情報へのアクセスが必要","`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`ファイルの存在に依存して製品マーケティングのコンテキストを取得する"],"ko":["사이트 컨텍스트 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일의 존재에 의존하여 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를取得합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la información del contexto del sitio","Depende de la existencia del archivo `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para el contexto de marketing de productos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''information de contexte du site","Dépend de l''existence du fichier `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour le contexte de marketing de produits"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Kontextinformationen der Website","Hängt von der Existenz der Datei `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für den Produktmarketing-Kontext ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso às informações de contexto do site","Depende da existência do arquivo `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto de marketing de produtos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к информации контекста сайта","Зависит от существования файла `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для контекста маркетинга продукции"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معلومات سياق الموقع","يعتمد على وجود ملف `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لسياق تسويق المنتج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('f/prompts.chat/book-translation', 'community', 'f', 'prompts.chat', 'f/prompts.chat', 'book-translation', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z', '2026-02-18T09:51:33.422Z', NULL, '{"id":"f/prompts.chat/book-translation","name":"book-translation","description":{"zh":"Book Translation Skill","ja":"Book Translation Skill","ko":"Book Translation Skill","es":"La traducción de libros es un proceso que requiere MDX y archivos JSON. Aprende a hacerlo","fr":"La traduction de livres nécessite des fichiers MDX et JSON. Découvrez comment procéder","de":"Die Buchübersetzung erfordert MDX- und JSON-Dateien. Erfahren Sie, wie es geht","en":"a.k.a. Awesome ChatGPT Prompts. Share, discover, and collect prompts from the community. Free and open source — self-host for your organization with complete privacy."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Book Translation Skill","ja":"Book Translation Skill","ko":"Book Translation Skill","es":"Traducción de Libros para Desarrolladores","fr":"Traduction de Livres pour Développeurs","de":"Buchübersetzung für Entwickler","en":"book-translation"},"description":{"zh":"Book Translation Skill","ja":"Book Translation Skill","ko":"Book Translation Skill","es":"La traducción de libros es un proceso que requiere MDX y archivos JSON. Aprende a hacerlo","fr":"La traduction de livres nécessite des fichiers MDX et JSON. Découvrez comment procéder","de":"Die Buchübersetzung erfordert MDX- und JSON-Dateien. Erfahren Sie, wie es geht","en":"a.k.a. Awesome ChatGPT Prompts. Share, discover, and collect prompts from the community. Free and open source — self-host for your organization with complete..."},"definition":{"en":"a.k.a. Awesome ChatGPT Prompts. Share, discover, and collect prompts from the community. Free and open source — self-host for your organization with complete privacy."},"features":{"zh":["25","MDX","JSON","UI","Chapter","Description"],"ja":["25","MDX","JSON","UI","Chapter","Description"],"ko":["25","MDX","JSON","UI","Chapter","Description"],"es":["Compatibilidad con MDX","Soporte para archivos JSON","Guía paso a paso para la traducción","Compatibilidad con múltiples idiomas","Código abierto y gratuito"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec MDX","Prise en charge des fichiers JSON","Guide étape par étape pour la traduction","Compatibilité avec plusieurs langues","Code ouvert et gratuit"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit MDX","Unterstützung für JSON-Dateien","Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitung für die Übersetzung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Sprachen","Open-Source- und kostenlos"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Book Translation","MDX","JSON","Translation","Localization","Internationalization"],"ja":["Book Translation","MDX","JSON","Translation","Localization","Internationalization"],"ko":["Book Translation","MDX","JSON","Translation","Localization","Internationalization"],"es":["traducción de libros","MDX","JSON","traducción de texto","desarrollo de software","localización de idiomas"],"fr":["traduction de livres","MDX","JSON","traduction de texte","développement de logiciels","localisation de langues"],"de":["Buchübersetzung","MDX","JSON","Textübersetzung","Softwareentwicklung","Sprachlokalisierung"]}},"owner":"f","repo":"prompts.chat","repoPath":"f/prompts.chat","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"book-translation","description":"Translate The Interactive Book of Prompting chapters and UI strings to a new language","bodyPreview":"# Book Translation Skill\n\nThis skill guides translation of book content for **The Interactive Book of Prompting** at prompts.chat.\n\n## Overview\n\nThe book has **25 chapters** across 7 parts. Translation requires:\n1. **MDX content files** - Full chapter content in `src/content/book/{locale}/`\n2. **JSON translation keys** - UI strings, chapter titles, and descriptions in `messages/{locale}.json`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting, identify:\n- **Target locale code** (e.g., `de`, `fr`, `es`, `ja`, `k","body":"# Book Translation Skill\n\nThis skill guides translation of book content for **The Interactive Book of Prompting** at prompts.chat.\n\n## Overview\n\nThe book has **25 chapters** across 7 parts. Translation requires:\n1. **MDX content files** - Full chapter content in `src/content/book/{locale}/`\n2. **JSON translation keys** - UI strings, chapter titles, and descriptions in `messages/{locale}.json`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting, identify:\n- **Target locale code** (e.g., `de`, `fr`, `es`, `ja`, `ko`, `zh`)\n- Check if locale exists in `messages/` directory\n- Check if `src/content/book/{locale}/` folder exists\n\n## Step 1: Copy Turkish Folder as Base\n\nThe Turkish (`tr`) translation is complete and well-tested. **Copy it as your starting point** instead of translating from English:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p src/content/book/{locale}\ncp -r src/content/book/*.mdx src/content/book/{locale}/\ncp src/components/book/elements/locales/en.ts src/components/book/elements/locales/{locale}.ts\n```\n\n**⚠️ IMPORTANT: After copying, you MUST register the new locale in `src/components/book/elements/locales/index.ts`:**\n1. Add import: `import {locale} from \"./{locale}\";`\n2. Add to `locales` object: `{locale},`\n3. Add to named exports: `export { en, tr, az, {locale} };`\n\nThis is faster because:\n- Turkish and many languages share similar sentence structures\n- All JSX/React components are already preserved correctly\n- File structure is already set up\n- You only need to translate the prose, not recreate the structure\n\n## Step 2: Translate MDX Content Files\n\nEdit each copied file in `src/content/book/{locale}/` to translate from Turkish to your target language.\n\nProcess files one by one:\n\n### Chapter List (in order)\n\n| Slug | English Title |\n|------|---------------|\n| `00a-preface` | Preface |\n| `00b-history` | History |\n| `00c-introduction` | Introduction |\n| `01-understanding-ai-models` | Understanding AI Models |\n| `02-anatomy-of-effective-prompt` | Anatomy of an Effective Prompt |\n| `03-core-prompting-principles` | Core Prompting Principles |\n| `04-role-based-prompting` | Role-Based Prompting |\n| `05-structured-output` | Structured Output |\n| `06-chain-of-thought` | Chain of Thought |\n| `07-few-shot-learning` | Few-Shot Learning |\n| `08-iterative-refinement` | Iterative Refinement |\n| `09-json-yaml-prompting` | JSON & YAML Prompting |\n| `10-system-prompts-personas` | System Prompts & Personas |\n| `11-prompt-chaining` | Prompt Chaining |\n| `12-handling-edge-cases` | Handling Edge Cases |\n| `13-multimodal-prompting` | Multimodal Prompting |\n| `14-context-engineering` | Context Engineering |\n| `15-common-pitfalls` | Common Pitfalls |\n| `16-ethics-responsible-use` | Ethics & Responsible Use |\n| `17-prompt-optimization` | Prompt Optimization |\n| `18-writing-content` | Writing & Content |\n| `19-programming-development` | Programming & Development |\n| `20-education-learning` | Education & Learning |\n| `21-business-productivity` | Business & Productivity |\n| `22-creative-arts` | Creative Arts |\n| `23-research-analysis` | Research & Analysis |\n| `24-future-of-prompting` | The Future of Prompting |\n| `25-agents-and-skills` | Agents & Skills |\n\n### MDX Translation Guidelines\n\n1. **Preserve all JSX/React components** - Keep `<div>`, `<img>`, `className`, etc. unchanged\n2. **Preserve code blocks** - Code examples should remain in English (variable names, keywords)\n3. **Translate prose content** - Headings, paragraphs, lists\n4. **Keep Markdown syntax** - `##`, `**bold**`, `*italic*`, `[links](url)`\n5. **Preserve component imports** - Any `import` statements at the top\n\n## Step 3: Translate JSON Keys\n\nIn `messages/{locale}.json`, translate the `\"book\"` section. Key areas:\n\n### Book Metadata\n```json\n\"book\": {\n  \"title\": \"The Interactive Book of Prompting\",\n  \"subtitle\": \"An Interactive Guide to Crafting Clear and Effective Prompts\",\n  \"metaTitle\": \"...\",\n  \"metaDescription\": \"...\",\n  ...\n}\n```\n\n### Chapter Titles (`book.chapters`)\n```json\n\"chapters\": {\n  \"00a-preface\": \"Preface\",\n  \"00b-history\": \"History\",\n  \"00c-introduction\": \"Introduction\",\n  ...\n}\n```\n\n### Chapter Descriptions (`book.chapterDescriptions`)\n```json\n\"chapterDescriptions\": {\n  \"00a-preface\": \"A personal note from the author\",\n  \"00b-history\": \"The story of Awesome ChatGPT Prompts\",\n  ...\n}\n```\n\n### Part Names (`book.parts`)\n```json\n\"parts\": {\n  \"introduction\": \"Introduction\",\n  \"foundations\": \"Foundations\",\n  \"techniques\": \"Techniques\",\n  \"advanced\": \"Advanced Strategies\",\n  \"bestPractices\": \"Best Practices\",\n  \"useCases\": \"Use Cases\",\n  \"conclusion\": \"Conclusion\"\n}\n```\n\n### Interactive Demo Examples (`book.interactive.demoExamples`)\nLocalize example text for demos (tokenizer samples, temperature examples, etc.):\n```json\n\"demoExamples\": {\n  \"tokenPrediction\": {\n    \"tokens\": [\"The\", \" capital\", \" of\", \" France\", \" is\", \" Paris\", \".\"],\n    \"fullText\": \"The capital of France is Paris.\"\n  },\n  \"temperature\": {\n    \"prompt\": \"What is the capital of France?\",\n    ...\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Book Elements Locales (REQUIRED)\n\n**⚠️ DO NOT SKIP THIS STEP** - The interactive demos will not work in the new language without this.\n\nTranslate the locale data file at `src/components/book/elements/locales/{locale}.ts`:\n- Temperature examples, token predictions, embedding words\n- Capabilities list, sample conversations, strategies\n- Tokenizer samples, builder fields, chain types\n- Frameworks (CRISPE, BREAK, RTF), exercises\n- Image/video prompt options, validation demos\n\n**Then register it in `src/components/book/elements/locales/index.ts`:**\n```typescript\nimport {locale} from \"./{locale}\";\n\nconst locales: Record<string, LocaleData> = {\n  en,\n  tr,\n  az,\n  {locale},  // Add your new locale here\n};\n\nexport { en, tr, az, {locale} };  // Add to exports\n```\n\n### UI Strings (`book.interactive.*`, `book.chapter.*`, `book.search.*`)\nTranslate all interactive component labels and navigation strings.\n\n## Step 4: Verify Translation\n\n1. Run the check script:\n   ```bash\n   node scripts/check-translations.js\n   ```\n\n2. Start dev server and test:\n   ```bash\n   npm run dev\n   ```\n\n3. Navigate to `/book` with the target locale to verify content loads\n\n## Reference: English Translation\n\nThe English (`en`) translation is complete and serves as the **base template** for all new translations:\n- MDX files: `src/content/book/*.mdx` — copy this files to `src/content/book/{locale}/*.mdx`\n- JSON keys: `messages/en.json` → `book` section — use as reference for structure\n\n### Recommended Workflow\n\n1. Copy `src/content/book/*.mdx` to `src/content/book/{locale}/*.mdx`\n2. Copy the `\"book\"` section from `messages/en.json` to `messages/{locale}.json`. Translate these in multiple agentic session instead of single time (token limit may exceed at once)\n3. Edit each file, translating English → target language\n4. Keep all JSX components, code blocks, and Markdown syntax intact\n\n## Quality Guidelines\n\n- **Consistency**: Use consistent terminology throughout (e.g., always translate \"prompt\" the same way)\n- **Technical terms**: Some terms like \"AI\", \"ChatGPT\", \"API\" may stay in English\n- **Cultural adaptation**: Adapt examples to be relevant for the target audience where appropriate\n- **Natural language**: Prioritize natural-sounding translations over literal ones\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:51:33.422Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multilingual Agents needing advanced book translation capabilities for MDX content files and JSON translation keys.","zh":"非常适合需要高级书籍翻译功能的多语言代理，特别是用于MDX内容文件和JSON翻译密钥。","ja":"多言語エージェントがMDXコンテンツファイルとJSON翻訳キーを使用したブック翻訳の高度な機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"MDX 콘텐츠 파일 및 JSON 번역 키를 사용한 책 번역의 고급 기능이 필요한 다국어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes multilingües que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de traducción de libros para archivos de contenido MDX y claves de traducción JSON.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents multilingues ayant besoin de capacités de traduction de livres avancées pour les fichiers de contenu MDX et les clés de traduction JSON.","de":"Perfekt für mehrsprachige Agenten, die erweiterte Buchübersetzungsfunktionen für MDX-Inhaltsdateien und JSON-Übersetzungsschlüssel benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Multilíngues que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de tradução de livros para arquivos de conteúdo MDX e chaves de tradução JSON.","ru":"Идеально для мультиязычных агентов, требующих расширенных возможностей перевода книг для файлов контента MDX и ключей перевода JSON.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتعددة اللغات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لترجمة الكتب لملفات المحتوى MDX ومفاتيح الترجمة JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to translate book content using MDX files and JSON translation keys, supporting multiple locale codes like ''de'', ''fr'', ''es'', ''ja'', and more, with complete privacy in self-hosted environments.","zh":"赋予代理使用MDX文件和JSON翻译密钥翻译书籍内容的能力，支持多个区域代码，如''de''、''fr''、''es''、''ja''等，并在自托管环境中提供完全的隐私保护。","ja":"エージェントがMDXファイルとJSON翻訳キーを使用してブックコンテンツを翻訳する機能を提供し、''de''、''fr''、''es''、''ja''などの複数のロケールコードをサポートし、セルフホスティング環境では完全なプライバシーを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 MDX 파일과 JSON 번역 키를 사용하여 책 내용을 번역할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며 여러 로케일 코드(''de'', ''fr'', ''es'', ''ja'' 등)를 지원하고, 자체 호스팅 환경에서 완전한 개인 정보 보호를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a traducir contenido de libros utilizando archivos MDX y claves de traducción JSON, con soporte para múltiples códigos de ubicación como ''de'', ''fr'', ''es'', ''ja'' y más, con privacidad completa en entornos autohospedados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traduire le contenu des livres en utilisant des fichiers MDX et des clés de traduction JSON, en prenant en charge plusieurs codes de localisation tels que ''de'', ''fr'', ''es'', ''ja'' et plus, avec une confidentialité complète dans les environnements auto-hébergés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Buchinhalte mithilfe von MDX-Dateien und JSON-Übersetzungsschlüsseln zu übersetzen, mit Unterstützung für mehrere Ländercodes wie ''de'', ''fr'', ''es'', ''ja'' und mehr, mit vollständiger Privatsphäre in selbstgehosteten Umgebungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a traduzir o conteúdo do livro usando arquivos MDX e chaves de tradução JSON, suportando vários códigos de localização como ''de'', ''fr'', ''es'', ''ja'' e mais, com privacidade completa em ambientes auto-hospedados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью переводить контент книг с помощью файлов MDX и ключей перевода JSON, поддерживая множество кодов локализации, таких как ''de'', ''fr'', ''es'', ''ja'' и т. д., с полной приватностью в само-хостинговых средах.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ترجمة محتوى الكتاب باستخدام ملفات MDX ومفاتيح الترجمة JSON، مع دعم العديد من رموز الموقع الجغرافي مثل ''de'' و ''fr'' و ''es'' و ''ja'' وغيرها، مع خصوصية كاملة في البيئات المضيفة الذاتية."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating chapter content for The Interactive Book of Prompting","Managing UI strings and chapter titles in messages/{locale}.json files","Supporting multiple locale codes for global audience reach"],"zh":["为交互式提示书的章节内容进行翻译","在messages/{locale}.json文件中管理UI字符串和章节标题","支持多个区域代码以实现全球受众范围"],"ja":["インタラクティブなプロンプトブックの章のコンテンツを翻訳する","messages/{locale}.jsonファイルでUI文字列と章のタイトルを管理する","グローバルなオーディエンスのリーチを実現するために複数のロケールコードをサポートする"],"ko":["대화형 프롬프트 북의 장 내용을 번역하는 것","messages/{locale}.json 파일에서 UI 문자열과 장 제목을 관리하는 것","글로벌 대상範囲에 도달하기 위해 여러 로케일 코드를 지원하는 것"],"es":["Traducir contenido de capítulos para El libro interactivo de prompting","Administrar cadenas de interfaz de usuario y títulos de capítulos en archivos messages/{locale}.json","Soportar múltiples códigos de ubicación para llegar a una audiencia global"],"fr":["Traduire le contenu des chapitres pour Le livre interactif de prompting","Gérer les chaînes d''interface utilisateur et les titres de chapitres dans les fichiers messages/{locale}.json","Prendre en charge plusieurs codes de localisation pour atteindre un public mondial"],"de":["Inhalte von Kapiteln für das interaktive Buch der Prompting übersetzen","Verwalten von Benutzeroberflächenzeichenfolgen und Kapiteltiteln in Dateien messages/{locale}.json","Unterstützung mehrerer Ländercodes für die globale Reichweite"],"pt":["Traduzir o conteúdo do capítulo para O Livro Interativo de Prompting","Gerenciar strings de UI e títulos de capítulos em arquivos messages/{locale}.json","Suportar vários códigos de localização para alcance de público global"],"ru":["Переводить контент главы для Интерактивной книги подсказок","Управлять строками UI и названиями глав в файлах messages/{locale}.json","Поддерживать множество кодов локализации для глобального охвата аудитории"],"ar":["ترجمة محتوى الفصل من أجل الكتاب التفاعلي للتحفيز","إدارة سلاسل واجهة المستخدم وأسماء الفصول في ملفات messages/{locale}.json","دعم العديد من رموز الموقع الجغرافي للوصول إلى جمهور عالمي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires identification of target locale code","Limited to MDX content files and JSON translation keys","Self-hosting required for complete privacy"],"zh":["需要识别目标区域代码","仅限MDX内容文件和JSON翻译密钥","需要自托管以实现完全隐私"],"ja":["ターゲットロケールコードの識別が必要","MDXコンテンツファイルとJSON翻訳キーのみ","完全なプライバシーを実現するためにセルフホスティングが必要"],"ko":["대상 로케일 코드의 식별이 필요함","MDX 콘텐츠 파일 및 JSON 번역 키만 지원","완전한 개인 정보 보호를 구현하기 위해 자체 호스팅이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere la identificación del código de ubicación objetivo","Limitado a archivos de contenido MDX y claves de traducción JSON","Se requiere autohosting para una privacidad completa"],"fr":["Nécessite l''identification du code de localisation cible","Limité aux fichiers de contenu MDX et aux clés de traduction JSON","L''hébergement auto-hébergé est requis pour une confidentialité complète"],"de":["Erfordert die Identifizierung des Ziel-Ländercodes","Begrenzt auf MDX-Inhaltsdateien und JSON-Übersetzungsschlüssel","Selbsthosting ist erforderlich für eine vollständige Privatsphäre"],"pt":["Exige a identificação do código de localização de destino","Limitado a arquivos de conteúdo MDX e chaves de tradução JSON","Auto-hospedagem necessária para privacidade completa"],"ru":["Требует идентификации целевого кода локализации","Ограничен файлами контента MDX и ключами перевода JSON","Само-хостинг необходим для полной приватности"],"ar":["يتطلب تحديد رمز الموقع الجغرافي المستهدف","محدود بملفات المحتوى MDX ومفاتيح الترجمة JSON","الاستضافة الذاتية مطلوبة للخصوصية الكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('congwa/wdm/skill-creator', 'community', 'congwa', 'wdm', 'congwa/wdm', 'skill-creator', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z', '2026-02-18T09:51:47.811Z', NULL, '{"id":"congwa/wdm/skill-creator","name":"skill-creator","description":{"zh":"Skill Creator是一款智能数据管理工具，提供AI对话暂停反馈、智能存储清理和全面数据分析功能，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"スキルクリエイターは、AI対話の一時停止フィードバック、スマートストレージクリーンアップ、全面的データ分析機能を提供する智能データ管理ツールです","ko":"스킬 크리에이터는 인공지능 대화 일시 중지 피드백, 스마트 스토리지 클리닝, 종합 데이터 분석 기능을 제공하는智能 데이터 관리 도구입니다","es":"La herramienta de creación de habilidades ofrece funcionalidades de análisis de datos y gestión de almacenamiento para Windsurf AI","fr":"L''outil de création de compétences offre des fonctionnalités d''analyse de données et de gestion de stockage pour Windsurf AI","de":"Das Tool für die Erstellung von Fähigkeiten bietet Funktionen zur Datenanalyse und Speicherung für Windsurf AI","pt":"O Criador de Habilidades é uma ferramenta de gestão de dados inteligente projetada para o ambiente de desenvolvimento Windsurf AI, oferecendo recursos como pausa de conversa AI e análise de dados.","ru":"Создатель Навыков - это интеллектуальный инструмент управления данными, разработанный для среды разработки Windsurf AI, предлагающий такие функции, как пауза разговора AI и анализ данных.","ar":"مبدع المهارات هو أداة إدارة بيانات ذكية مصممة للبيئة التطويرية Windsurf AI، وتقدم ميزات مثل التعليق المحادثة AI وتحليل البيانات.","en":"款专为 Windsurf AI 开发环境打造的智能数据管理工具，提供 **AI 对话暂停反馈**、**智能存储清理** 和 **全面数据分析** 功能"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Skill Creator智能数据管理工具","ja":"スキルクリエイター：AI対話管理ツール","ko":"스킬 크리에이터: 인공지능 데이터 관리 도구","es":"Herramienta de creación de habilidades para Windsurf AI","fr":"Outil de création de compétences pour Windsurf AI","de":"Tool für die Erstellung von Fähigkeiten für Windsurf AI","pt":"Criador de Habilidades: Ferramenta de Gestão de Dados Int...","ru":"Со