la duplicación de código","Referencia a archivos fuente en lugar de copiar contenido","Incluye fragmentos de configuración cortos","Describe la arquitectura y el propósito del proyecto","Explica cómo usar el paquete o aplicación","Mantiene la documentación actualizada"],"fr":["Évitez la duplication de code","Référez les fichiers source au lieu de copier le contenu","Incluez des extraits de configuration courts","Décrivez l''architecture et le but du projet","Expliquez comment utiliser le paquet ou l''application","Maintenez la documentation à jour"],"de":["Vermeiden Sie Code-Duplizierung","Verweisen Sie auf Quelldateien anstelle von Inhalten","Schließen Sie kurze Konfigurationsfragmente ein","Beschreiben Sie die Architektur und den Zweck des Projekts","Erklären Sie, wie das Paket oder die Anwendung verwendet wird","Halten Sie die Dokumentation aktuell"]},"keywords":{"zh":["README 文件","软件包文档","应用说明","代码重复","代码片段","软件开发","文档编写"],"ja":["README ファイル","ソフトウェアパッケージのドキュメント","アプリの説明","コードの重複","コードスニペット","ソフトウェア開発","ドキュメントの作成"],"ko":["README 파일","소프트웨어 패키지 문서","애플리케이션 설명","코드 중복","코드 스니펫","소프트웨어 개발","문서 작성"],"es":["README","guía de estilo","documentación de proyecto","arquitectura de software","desarrollo de software","mejora de la documentación","claridad en la documentación","eficacia en la documentación"],"fr":["README","guide de style","documentation de projet","architecture de logiciel","développement de logiciel","amélioration de la documentation","clarté dans la documentation","efficacité dans la documentation"],"de":["README","Stilguide","Projektdokumentation","Software-Architektur","Software-Entwicklung","Verbesserung der Dokumentation","Klarheit in der Dokumentation","Effizienz in der Dokumentation"]}},"owner":"skrischer","repo":"structcms","repoPath":"skrischer/structcms","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"write-readme","description":"Write or update a README.md file following project conventions. Use when creating, updating, or reviewing any README in the StructCMS monorepo.","bodyPreview":"# README Style Guide\n\n## Principle\n\nREADMEs describe **architecture, purpose, and how to use** a package or app. They do **not** duplicate source code. Code changes should never require a README update unless the architecture itself changes.\n\n## Rules\n\n### No Code Duplication\n\n- **Never** copy full file contents into a README\n- Reference source files instead: *\"See `lib/adapters.ts` for the adapter configuration.\"*\n- Exception: Short setup snippets (`.env` examples, CLI commands) that don''t exis","body":"# README Style Guide\n\n## Principle\n\nREADMEs describe **architecture, purpose, and how to use** a package or app. They do **not** duplicate source code. Code changes should never require a README update unless the architecture itself changes.\n\n## Rules\n\n### No Code Duplication\n\n- **Never** copy full file contents into a README\n- Reference source files instead: *\"See `lib/adapters.ts` for the adapter configuration.\"*\n- Exception: Short setup snippets (`.env` examples, CLI commands) that don''t exist elsewhere\n\n### What Belongs in a README\n\n- **Description & Purpose** — What is this package/app and why does it exist?\n- **Architecture Overview** — High-level diagram or bullet points (changes rarely)\n- **File Structure** — Tree view with one-line comments per file (update when files are added/removed)\n- **Setup Instructions** — Concrete steps to get running (`cp .env.example`, `pnpm install`, `pnpm dev`)\n- **Environment Variables** — Required env vars with placeholder values\n- **Key Concepts** — Short prose explaining patterns and design decisions, with file references\n- **Test Overview** — One line per test file describing what it covers\n\n### What Does NOT Belong in a README\n\n- Full function implementations (they live in source files)\n- Complete type definitions (they live in source files)\n- Seed data contents (reference the seed file instead)\n- Detailed test step-by-step specifications (they live in the spec files)\n- Dependency version lists (they live in `package.json`)\n\n### File Structure Section\n\n- Must reflect the **actual** file system (keep in sync when adding/removing files)\n- Use tree format with inline `#` comments\n- Include all non-trivial files; skip generated files (`.next/`, `node_modules/`, `*.tsbuildinfo`)\n\n### Referencing Code\n\nWhen explaining a concept, use this pattern:\n\n```\nSection definitions are created using `defineSection` from `@structcms/core`\nand registered via `createRegistry`. See `lib/registry.ts` for the full setup.\n```\n\nDo **not** paste the contents of the referenced file into the README.\n\n### Language\n\n- README content is written in **English**\n- Keep sections concise — prefer short paragraphs and bullet points over long prose\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Read the existing README (if any) and the actual source files in the target directory\n2. Verify the file structure section matches the real file system\n3. Remove any code blocks that duplicate source files — replace with file references\n4. Ensure all required sections are present (Description, File Structure, Setup, Key Concepts)\n5. Verify all referenced files actually exist\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:52:32.765Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Documentation Agents needing standardized README file generation with adherence to architecture and purpose description","zh":"Perfect for Documentation Agents needing standardized README file generation with adherence to architecture and purpose description","ja":"Perfect for Documentation Agents needing standardized README file generation with adherence to architecture and purpose description","ko":"Perfect for Documentation Agents needing standardized README file generation with adherence to architecture and purpose description","es":"Ideal para agentes de documentación que necesitan generar archivos README estandarizados con adherencia a la descripción de arquitectura y propósito","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de documentation ayant besoin de générer des fichiers README standardisés avec adhérence à la description d''architecture et de but","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentationsagenten, die standardisierte README-Dateien mit Einhaltung der Architektur- und Zweckbeschreibung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Documentação que necessitam de geração de arquivos README padronizados com aderência à descrição de arquitetura e propósito","ru":"Идеально для агентов документации, которым необходима стандартизированная генерация файлов README с соблюдением описания архитектуры и цели","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الوثائق التي تحتاج إلى إنشاء ملفات README معيار مع الالتزام بوصف الهيكل والغرض"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create concise and informative READMEs by referencing source files, avoiding code duplication, and including short setup snippets for configuration files like `.env` and CLI commands","zh":"Empowers agents to create concise and informative READMEs by referencing source files, avoiding code duplication, and including short setup snippets for configuration files like `.env` and CLI commands","ja":"Empowers agents to create concise and informative READMEs by referencing source files, avoiding code duplication, and including short setup snippets for configuration files like `.env` and CLI commands","ko":"Empowers agents to create concise and informative READMEs by referencing source files, avoiding code duplication, and including short setup snippets for configuration files like `.env` and CLI commands","es":"Permite a los agentes crear READMEs concisos e informativos haciendo referencia a archivos de origen, evitando la duplicación de código y incluyendo breves fragmentos de configuración para archivos como `.env` y comandos de CLI","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des READMEs concis et informatifs en référençant les fichiers sources, en évitant la duplication de code et en incluant de courtes instructions de configuration pour les fichiers tels que `.env` et les commandes CLI","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, präzise und informative READMEs zu erstellen, indem sie auf Quelldateien verweisen, Code-Duplizierung vermeiden und kurze Konfigurations-Snippets für Dateien wie `.env` und CLI-Befehle einbeziehen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar READMEs concisos e informativos, referenciando arquivos de origem, evitando duplicação de código e incluíndo trechos de configuração curtos para arquivos como `.env` e comandos CLI","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать краткие и информативные README, ссылаясь на исходные файлы, избегая дублирования кода и включая короткие фрагменты конфигурации для файлов типа `.env` и команд CLI","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إنشاء ملفات README واضحة ومعلوماتية من خلال الإشارة إلى الملفات المصدرية وتجنب تكرار الشفرة وضم نماذج قصيرة من ملفات التهيئة مثل `.env` وأوامر CLI"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating README files for new package releases","Updating existing READMEs to reflect architecture changes","Creating setup instructions with CLI commands and `.env` examples"],"zh":["Generating README files for new package releases","Updating existing READMEs to reflect architecture changes","Creating setup instructions with CLI commands and `.env` examples"],"ja":["Generating README files for new package releases","Updating existing READMEs to reflect architecture changes","Creating setup instructions with CLI commands and `.env` examples"],"ko":["Generating README files for new package releases","Updating existing READMEs to reflect architecture changes","Creating setup instructions with CLI commands and `.env` examples"],"es":["Generación de archivos README para nuevos lanzamientos de paquetes","Actualización de READMEs existentes para reflejar cambios en la arquitectura","Creación de instrucciones de configuración con comandos CLI y ejemplos de `.env`"],"fr":["Génération de fichiers README pour les nouveaux lancements de paquets","Mise à jour des READMEs existants pour refléter les changements d''architecture","Création d''instructions de configuration avec des commandes CLI et des exemples de `.env`"],"de":["Erstellung von README-Dateien für neue Paket-Veröffentlichungen","Aktualisierung bestehender READMEs, um Änderungen an der Architektur widerzuspiegeln","Erstellung von Konfigurationsanweisungen mit CLI-Befehlen und `.env`-Beispielen"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos README para novos lançamentos de pacotes","Atualização de READMEs existentes para refletir alterações na arquitetura","Criação de instruções de configuração com comandos CLI e exemplos de `.env`"],"ru":["Генерация файлов README для новых релизов пакетов","Обновление существующих README для отражения изменений в архитектуре","Создание инструкций по настройке с командами CLI и примерами `.env`"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات README لطرح حزم جديدة","تحديث ملفات README الحالية لتعكس التغييرات في الهيكل","إنشاء تعليمات الإعداد باستخدام أوامر CLI وأمثلة من `.env`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of package architecture and purpose","Should not duplicate source code","Limited to referencing source files and including short setup snippets"],"zh":["Requires knowledge of package architecture and purpose","Should not duplicate source code","Limited to referencing source files and including short setup snippets"],"ja":["Requires knowledge of package architecture and purpose","Should not duplicate source code","Limited to referencing source files and including short setup snippets"],"ko":["Requires knowledge of package architecture and purpose","Should not duplicate source code","Limited to referencing source files and including short setup snippets"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la arquitectura y propósito del paquete","No debe duplicar el código de origen","Limitado a hacer referencia a archivos de origen e incluir breves fragmentos de configuración"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de l''architecture et du but du paquet","Ne doit pas dupliquer le code source","Limité à la référence aux fichiers sources et à l''inclusion de courtes instructions de configuration"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über die Architektur und den Zweck des Pakets","Sollte keinen Quellcode duplizieren","Begrenzt auf die Verweisung auf Quelldateien und die Einbeziehung kurzer Konfigurations-Snippets"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento da arquitetura e propósito do pacote","Não deve duplicar código de origem","Limitado a referenciar arquivos de origem e incluir trechos de configuração curtos"],"ru":["Требует знания архитектуры и цели пакета","Не должен дублировать исходный код","Ограничен ссылками на исходные файлы и включением коротких фрагментов конфигурации"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة هيكل الحزمة وغرضها","لا ينبغي أن يكرر الشفرة المصدرية","محدود بالإشارة إلى الملفات المصدرية وضم نماذج قصيرة من ملفات التهيئة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
