script frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-sync-specs：Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 前端模板","ja":"openspec-sync-specs：Vite + GraphQL + Typescript フロントエンドテン...","ko":"openspec-sync-specs：Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 프론트엔드 템플릿","es":"openspec-sync-specs: Plantilla de frontend con Vite + Gra...","fr":"openspec-sync-specs : Modèle de frontend avec Vite + Grap...","de":"openspec-sync-specs: Frontend-Boilerplate mit Vite + Grap...","pt":"Openspec-Sync-Specs: Boilerplate Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","ru":"Openspec-Sync-Specs: Бойлерплейт Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","ar":"openspec-sync-specs: قوالب Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","en":"openspec-sync-specs"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-sync-specs是一个使用Vite + GraphQL + Typescript的前端模板，采用Feature-Sliced Design作为项目架构方法论。它可以同步delta specs到主specs，实现智能合并和高效开发","ja":"openspec-sync-specsはVite + GraphQL + Typescriptを使用したフロントエンドテンプレートであり、Feature-Sliced Designをプロジェクトアーキテクチャ方法論として採用しています。delta specsをメインspecsに同期し、智能マージと効率的な開発を実...","ko":"openspec-sync-specs는 Vite + GraphQL + Typescript를 사용한 프론트엔드 템플릿으로, Feature-Sliced Design를 프로젝트 아키텍처 방법론으로 채택했습니다. 델타 스펙을 메인 스펙에 동기화하여智能 병합 및 효율적인 개발을 구현합니다","es":"openspec-sync-specs es una plantilla de frontend que utiliza Vite, GraphQL y Typescript con Feature-Sliced Design como arquitectura de proyecto, permitiendo ...","fr":"openspec-sync-specs est un modèle de frontend qui utilise Vite, GraphQL et Typescript avec Feature-Sliced Design comme architecture de projet, permettant la ...","de":"openspec-sync-specs ist ein Frontend-Boilerplate, das Vite, GraphQL und Typescript mit Feature-Sliced Design als Projektarchitektur verwendet, um die Synchro...","pt":"O openspec-sync-specs é um boilerplate de frontend que utiliza Vite, GraphQL e Typescript, com arquitetura de projeto baseada em Feature-Sliced Design","ru":"Openspec-sync-specs - это бойлерплейт для frontend, использующий Vite, GraphQL и Typescript, с архитектурой проекта на основе Feature-Sliced Design","ar":"openspec-sync-specs هو قوالب أمامية يستخدم Vite و GraphQL و Typescript، مع هندسة مشروع تستند إلى تصميم ميزات مقطعة","en":"A Vite + GraphQL + Typescript frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"definition":{"en":"A Vite + GraphQL + Typescript frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"features":{"zh":["使用Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","采用Feature-Sliced Design作为项目架构方法论","同步delta specs到主specs","实现智能合并","高效开发"],"ja":["Vite + GraphQL + Typescriptを使用","Feature-Sliced Designをプロジェクトアーキテクチャ方法論として採用","delta specsをメインspecsに同期","智能マージを実現","効率的な開発"],"ko":["Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 사용","Feature-Sliced Design를 프로젝트 아키텍처 방법론으로 채택","델타 스펙을 메인 스펙에 동기화","智能 병합 구현","효율적인 개발"],"es":["Plantilla de frontend con Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","Arquitectura de proyecto basada en Feature-Sliced Design","Sincronización de especificaciones delta","Operación de agente impulsada","Permite la fusión inteligente de escenarios"],"fr":["Modèle de frontend avec Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","Architecture de projet basée sur Feature-Sliced Design","Synchronisation des spécifications delta","Opération impulsée par agent","Permet la fusion intelligente de scénarios"],"de":["Frontend-Boilerplate mit Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","Projektarchitektur basierend auf Feature-Sliced Design","Synchronisierung von Delta-Spezifikationen","Agentengetriebene Operation","Ermöglicht intelligente Merge von Szenarien"],"pt":["Boilerplate de frontend com Vite, GraphQL e Typescript","Arquitetura de projeto baseada em Feature-Sliced Design","Sincronização de especificações delta","Edição direta de especificações principais","Suporte a inteligente mesclagem"],"ru":["Бойлерплейт для frontend с Vite, GraphQL и Typescript","Архитектура проекта на основе Feature-Sliced Design","Синхронизация спецификаций delta","Прямое редактирование основных спецификаций","Поддержка интеллектуального слияния"],"ar":["قوالب أمامية مع Vite و GraphQL و Typescript","هندسة مشروع تستند إلى تصميم ميزات مقطعة","سynchronizer مواصفات دلتا","تحرير مباشر لمواصفات رئيسية","دعم لدمج ذكي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-sync-specs","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","前端模板","同步delta specs","智能合并","高效开发"],"ja":["openspec-sync-specs","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","フロントエンドテンプレート","delta specs同期","智能マージ","効率的な開発"],"ko":["openspec-sync-specs","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","프론트엔드 템플릿","델타 스펙 동기화","智能 병합","효율적인 개발"],"es":["openspec-sync-specs","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","sincronización de especificaciones delta","frontend","desarrollo de software","arquitectura de proyecto"],"fr":["openspec-sync-specs","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","synchronisation des spécifications delta","frontend","développement de logiciels","architecture de projet"],"de":["openspec-sync-specs","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","Synchronisierung von Delta-Spezifikationen","Frontend","Softwareentwicklung","Projektarchitektur"],"pt":["openspec-sync-specs","boilerplate frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","sincronização de especificações"],"ru":["openspec-sync-specs","бойлерплейт для frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","синхронизация спецификаций"],"ar":["openspec-sync-specs","قوالب أمامية","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","تصميم ميزات مقطعة","سynchronizer مواصفات"]}},"owner":"uxname","repo":"litefront","repoPath":"uxname/litefront","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-sync-specs","description":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs. Use when the user wants to update main specs with changes from a delta spec, without archiving the change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selectio","body":"Sync delta specs from a change to main specs.\n\nThis is an **agent-driven** operation - you will read delta specs and directly edit main specs to apply the changes. This allows intelligent merging (e.g., adding a scenario without copying the entire requirement).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have delta specs (under `specs/` directory).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Find delta specs**\n\n   Look for delta spec files in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/*/spec.md`.\n\n   Each delta spec file contains sections like:\n   - `## ADDED Requirements` - New requirements to add\n   - `## MODIFIED Requirements` - Changes to existing requirements\n   - `## REMOVED Requirements` - Requirements to remove\n   - `## RENAMED Requirements` - Requirements to rename (FROM:/TO: format)\n\n   If no delta specs found, inform user and stop.\n\n3. **For each delta spec, apply changes to main specs**\n\n   For each capability with a delta spec at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/<capability>/spec.md`:\n\n   a. **Read the delta spec** to understand the intended changes\n\n   b. **Read the main spec** at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md` (may not exist yet)\n\n   c. **Apply changes intelligently**:\n\n      **ADDED Requirements:**\n      - If requirement doesn''t exist in main spec → add it\n      - If requirement already exists → update it to match (treat as implicit MODIFIED)\n\n      **MODIFIED Requirements:**\n      - Find the requirement in main spec\n      - Apply the changes - this can be:\n        - Adding new scenarios (don''t need to copy existing ones)\n        - Modifying existing scenarios\n        - Changing the requirement description\n      - Preserve scenarios/content not mentioned in the delta\n\n      **REMOVED Requirements:**\n      - Remove the entire requirement block from main spec\n\n      **RENAMED Requirements:**\n      - Find the FROM requirement, rename to TO\n\n   d. **Create new main spec** if capability doesn''t exist yet:\n      - Create `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n      - Add Purpose section (can be brief, mark as TBD)\n      - Add Requirements section with the ADDED requirements\n\n4. **Show summary**\n\n   After applying all changes, summarize:\n   - Which capabilities were updated\n   - What changes were made (requirements added/modified/removed/renamed)\n\n**Delta Spec Format Reference**\n\n```markdown\n## ADDED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: New Feature\nThe system SHALL do something new.\n\n#### Scenario: Basic case\n- **WHEN** user does X\n- **THEN** system does Y\n\n## MODIFIED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Existing Feature\n#### Scenario: New scenario to add\n- **WHEN** user does A\n- **THEN** system does B\n\n## REMOVED Requirements\n\n### Requirement: Deprecated Feature\n\n## RENAMED Requirements\n\n- FROM: `### Requirement: Old Name`\n- TO: `### Requirement: New Name`\n```\n\n**Key Principle: Intelligent Merging**\n\nUnlike programmatic merging, you can apply **partial updates**:\n- To add a scenario, just include that scenario under MODIFIED - don''t copy existing scenarios\n- The delta represents *intent*, not a wholesale replacement\n- Use your judgment to merge changes sensibly\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Specs Synced: <change-name>\n\nUpdated main specs:\n\n**<capability-1>**:\n- Added requirement: \"New Feature\"\n- Modified requirement: \"Existing Feature\" (added 1 scenario)\n\n**<capability-2>**:\n- Created new spec file\n- Added requirement: \"Another Feature\"\n\nMain specs are now updated. The change remains active - archive when implementation is complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Read both delta and main specs before making changes\n- Preserve existing content not mentioned in delta\n- If something is unclear, ask for clarification\n- Show what you''re changing as you go\n- The operation should be idempotent - running twice should give same result\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:51:44.256Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents utilizing Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript, needing streamlined spec synchronization and intelligent merging.","zh":"适用于使用 Vite、GraphQL 和 Typescript 的前端代理，需要简化规格同步和智能合并。","ja":"Vite、GraphQL、TypeScriptを使用するフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。規格の同期と智能的なマージをストリームライン化する必要があります。","ko":"Vite, GraphQL 및 Typescript를 사용하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다. 규격 동기화 및 지능형 병합을 간소화하는 데 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que utilizan Vite, GraphQL y Typescript, y necesitan una sincronización de especificaciones optimizada y una fusión inteligente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui utilisent Vite, GraphQL et Typescript, et qui ont besoin d''une synchronisation de spécifications rationalisée et d''un regroupement intelligent.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die Vite, GraphQL und Typescript verwenden und eine optimierte Spezifikationssynchronisierung und intelligente Zusammenführung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que utilizam Vite, GraphQL e Typescript, necessitando de sincronização de especificações otimizada e mesclagem inteligente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, использующих Vite, GraphQL и Typescript, которым необходима оптимизированная синхронизация спецификаций и интеллектуальное слияние.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يستخدمون Vite و GraphQL و Typescript، وهم بحاجة إلى تحسين التزامن للمواصفات والدمج الذكي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to sync delta specs with main specs using Feature-Sliced Design, enabling efficient and targeted updates with intelligent merging capabilities, leveraging Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript for robust frontend development.","zh":"赋予代理人使用特性分片设计与主规格同步delta规格的能力，实现高效且有针对性的更新，并利用Vite、GraphQL和Typescript进行强大的前端开发。","ja":"エージェントに、Feature-Sliced Designを使用してメインスペックとdeltaスペックを同期する機能を付与します。Vite、GraphQL、TypeScriptを利用した強力なフロントエンド開発で、効率的かつターゲットを絞った更新を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트에게 기능 분할 설계를 사용하여 메인 규격과 델타 규격을 동기화하는 기능을 부여합니다. Vite, GraphQL 및 Typescript를 활용한 강력한 프론트엔드 개발에서 효율적이고 목표를 명확히 하는 업데이트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a sincronizar especifikaciones delta con las especifikaciones principales utilizando el diseño Feature-Sliced, lo que permite actualizaciones eficientes y dirigidas con capacidades de fusión inteligente, aprovechando Vite, GraphQL y Typescript para un desarrollo de frontend robusto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de synchroniser les spécifications delta avec les spécifications principales en utilisant la conception Feature-Sliced, ce qui permet des mises à jour efficaces et ciblées avec des capacités de regroupement intelligent, en exploitant Vite, GraphQL et Typescript pour un développement de frontend robuste.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Delta-Spezifikationen mit den Haupt-Spezifikationen mithilfe des Feature-Sliced-Designs zu synchronisieren, was effiziente und gezielte Updates mit intelligenten Zusammenführungsfunktionen ermöglicht, indem Vite, GraphQL und Typescript für eine robuste Frontend-Entwicklung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a sincronizar especificações delta com especificações principais usando Design em Fatias de Recursos, permitindo atualizações eficientes e direcionadas com capacidades de mesclagem inteligente, aproveitando Vite, GraphQL e Typescript para desenvolvimento de frontend robusto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью синхронизировать спецификации дельта с основными спецификациями, используя дизайн, нарезанный на функциональные части, что позволяет выполнять эффективные и целенаправленные обновления с возможностями интеллектуального слияния, используя Vite, GraphQL и Typescript для прочной разработки frontend.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على مزامنة المواصفات دلتا مع المواصفات الرئيسية باستخدام تصميم مقطّع الميزة، مما يسمح بالتحديثات الفعالة والاستهداف مع القدرات المدمجة الذكية، مستفيداً من Vite و GraphQL و Typescript لتحقيق تنمية واجهة المستخدم الأمامية قوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Synchronizing delta specs with main specs for efficient project updates","Applying intelligent merging to avoid redundant requirement copying","Streamlining frontend development with Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript"],"zh":["用于高效项目更新的delta规格与主规格同步","应用智能合并以避免冗余要求复制","使用Vite、GraphQL和Typescript简化前端开发"],"ja":["効率的なプロジェクト更新のためのdeltaスペックとメインスペックの同期","冗長な要件のコピーを避けるための智能的なマージの適用","Vite、GraphQL、TypeScriptを使用したフロントエンド開発のストリームライン化"],"ko":["효율적인 프로젝트 업데이트를 위한 델타 규격과 메인 규격의 동기화","중복된 요구사항 복사를 피하기 위한 지능형 병합의 적용","Vite, GraphQL 및 Typescript를 사용한 프론트엔드 개발의 간소화"],"es":["Sincronizar especifikaciones delta con las especifikaciones principales para actualizaciones de proyecto eficientes","Aplicar una fusión inteligente para evitar la copia redundante de requisitos","Optimizar el desarrollo de frontend con Vite, GraphQL y Typescript"],"fr":["Synchroniser les spécifications delta avec les spécifications principales pour des mises à jour de projet efficaces","Appliquer un regroupement intelligent pour éviter la copie redondante des exigences","Optimiser le développement de frontend avec Vite, GraphQL et Typescript"],"de":["Delta-Spezifikationen mit den Haupt-Spezifikationen für effiziente Projekt-Updates synchronisieren","Intelligente Zusammenführung anwenden, um redundante Anforderungskopien zu vermeiden","Frontend-Entwicklung mit Vite, GraphQL und Typescript optimieren"],"pt":["Sincronizar especificações delta com especificações principais para atualizações de projeto eficientes","Aplicar mesclagem inteligente para evitar cópia redundante de requisitos","Otimizar o desenvolvimento de frontend com Vite, GraphQL e Typescript"],"ru":["Синхронизировать спецификации дельта с основными спецификациями для эффективного обновления проекта","Применять интеллектуальное слияние, чтобы избежать ненужной копии требований","Оптимизировать разработку frontend с помощью Vite, GraphQL и Typescript"],"ar":["مزامنة المواصفات دلتا مع المواصفات الرئيسية من أجل تحديثات مشروع فعالة","تطبيق الدمج الذكي لتجنب نسخ متكررة للمتطلبات","تحسين تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية باستخدام Vite و GraphQL و Typescript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript setup","Dependent on Feature-Sliced Design project architecture methodology","Needs clear change name specification or inferable conversation context"],"zh":["需要Vite、GraphQL和Typescript的设置","依赖于特性分片设计项目架构方法论","需要清晰的更改名称规范或可推断的对话上下文"],"ja":["Vite、GraphQL、TypeScriptの設定が必要","Feature-Sliced Designプロジェクトアーキテクチャ方法論に依存","明確な変更名の指定または推論可能な会話コンテキストが必要"],"ko":["Vite, GraphQL 및 Typescript 설정이 필요합니다","기능 분할 설계 프로젝트 아키텍처 방법론에 의존합니다","명확한 변경 이름 규격 또는 추론 가능한 대화 문脈이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Vite, GraphQL y Typescript","Dependiente de la metodología de arquitectura de proyecto Feature-Sliced Design","Necesita una especificación clara de nombres de cambios o un contexto de conversación inferible"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Vite, GraphQL et Typescript","Dépend de la méthodologie d''architecture de projet Feature-Sliced Design","Nécessite une spécification claire de noms de changements ou un contexte de conversation déductible"],"de":["Benötigt Vite-, GraphQL- und Typescript-Setup","Abhängig von der Projektarchitekturmethodik Feature-Sliced Design","Benötigt eine klare Änderungsbezeichnung oder einen ableitbaren Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Exige configuração de Vite, GraphQL e Typescript","Depende da metodologia de arquitetura de projeto do Design em Fatias de Recursos","Necessita de especificação clara de nome de alteração ou contexto de conversa inferível"],"ru":["Требует настройки Vite, GraphQL и Typescript","Зависит от методологии проектной архитектуры дизайна, нарезанного на функциональные части","Требует чёткого указания имени изменения илиinferируемого контекста разговора"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Vite و GraphQL و Typescript","يعتمد على منهجية الهندسة المعمارية لمشروع تصميم مقطّع الميزة","يحتاج إلى تحديد واضح لاسم التغيير أو سياق محادثة يمكن استخلاصه"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
