증 라이브러리입니다. 이 가이드는 43개의 규칙과 8개의 카테고리의 최적화 방법을 제공합니다","es":"Guía completa de validación de esquemas para Zod en aplicaciones TypeScript, con 43 reglas en 8 categorías","fr":"Guide complet de validation de schémas pour Zod dans les applications TypeScript, avec 43 règles dans 8 catégories","de":"Umfassende Schemavalidierungsanleitung für Zod in TypeScript-Anwendungen, mit 43 Regeln in 8 Kategorien","pt":"Zod é uma biblioteca de validação de esquemas para TypeScript que ajuda a garantir a consistência dos dados. Aprenda a usá-la com eficácia.","ru":"Zod — это библиотека валидации схем для TypeScript, которая помогает обеспечить согласованность данных. Узнайте, как ею эффективно пользоваться.","ar":"Zod هي مكتبة للتحقق من صحة مخططات لتطبيقات TypeScript التي تساعد على ضمان الاتساق للبيانات. تعلم كيفية استخدامها بفعالية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["43 条规则和 8 个类别的最佳实践","自动重构和代码生成","类型推断和错误处理","复杂对象 schema 的组成","优化和性能改进"],"ja":["43 のルールと 8 つのカテゴリのベストプラクティス","自動リファクタリングとコード生成","型推論とエラー処理","複雑なオブジェクトスキーマの構成","最適化とパフォーマンスの向上"],"ko":["43개의 규칙과 8개의 카테고리의 최적화 방법","자동 리팩토링과 코드 생성","타입 추론과 오류 처리","복잡한 객체 schema의 구성","최적화와 성능 개선"],"es":["Validación de esquemas avanzada","43 reglas en 8 categorías","Type inference con z.infer","Composición de esquemas complejos","Refinamientos y transformaciones","Optimización de la validación"],"fr":["Validation de schémas avancée","43 règles dans 8 catégories","Inférence de type avec z.infer","Composition de schémas complexes","Affinements et transformations","Optimisation de la validation"],"de":["Erweiterte Schemavalidierung","43 Regeln in 8 Kategorien","Type-Inferenz mit z.infer","Zusammensetzung komplexer Schemata","Verfeinerungen und Transformationen","Optimierung der Validierung"],"pt":["Validação de esquemas personalizados","Tratamento de erros personalizado","Inferência de tipos com z.infer","Composição de esquemas complexos","Otimização do desempenho"],"ru":["Валидация пользовательских схем","Пользовательское обработка ошибок","Вывод типов с z.infer","Составление сложных схем","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة مخططات مخصصة","معالجة الأخطاء المخصصة","استدلال النوع مع z.infer","تركيب مخططات معقدة","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Zod","TypeScript","schema 验证","自动重构","代码生成","类型推断","错误处理","复杂对象 schema"],"ja":["Zod","TypeScript","スキーマ検証","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","型推論","エラー処理","複雑なオブジェクトスキーマ"],"ko":["Zod","TypeScript","schema 검증","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","타입 추론","오류 처리","복잡한 객체 schema"],"es":["Zod","validación de esquemas","TypeScript","esquemas complejos","type inference","refinamientos","transformaciones","optimización de la validación"],"fr":["Zod","validation de schémas","TypeScript","schémas complexes","inférence de type","affinements","transformations","optimisation de la validation"],"de":["Zod","Schemavalidierung","TypeScript","komplexe Schemata","Type-Inferenz","Verfeinerungen","Transformationen","Optimierung der Validierung"],"pt":["Zod","Validação de esquemas","TypeScript","Desenvolvimento de software","Programação","Bibliotecas JavaScript","Tratamento de erros","Inferência de tipos"],"ru":["Zod","Валидация схем","TypeScript","Разработка программного обеспечения","Программирование","Библиотеки JavaScript","Обработка ошибок","Вывод типов"],"ar":["Zod","التحقق من صحة مخططات","TypeScript","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","مكتبات JavaScript","معالجة الأخطاء","استدلال النوع"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zod","description":"Zod schema validation best practices for type safety, parsing, and error handling. This skill should be used when defining z.object schemas, using z.string validations, safeParse, or z.infer. This skill does NOT cover React Hook Form integration patterns (use react-hook-form skill) or OpenAPI client generation (use orval skill).","bodyPreview":"# Zod Best Practices\n\nComprehensive schema validation guide for Zod in TypeScript applications. Contains 43 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new Zod schemas\n- Choosing between parse() and safeParse()\n- Implementing type inference with z.infer\n- Handling validation errors for user feedback\n- Composing complex object schemas\n- Using refinements and transforms\n- Optimizi","body":"# Zod Best Practices\n\nComprehensive schema validation guide for Zod in TypeScript applications. Contains 43 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new Zod schemas\n- Choosing between parse() and safeParse()\n- Implementing type inference with z.infer\n- Handling validation errors for user feedback\n- Composing complex object schemas\n- Using refinements and transforms\n- Optimizing bundle size and validation performance\n- Reviewing Zod code for best practices\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Schema Definition | CRITICAL | `schema-` |\n| 2 | Parsing & Validation | CRITICAL | `parse-` |\n| 3 | Type Inference | HIGH | `type-` |\n| 4 | Error Handling | HIGH | `error-` |\n| 5 | Object Schemas | MEDIUM-HIGH | `object-` |\n| 6 | Schema Composition | MEDIUM | `compose-` |\n| 7 | Refinements & Transforms | MEDIUM | `refine-` |\n| 8 | Performance & Bundle | LOW-MEDIUM | `perf-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Schema Definition (CRITICAL)\n\n- `schema-use-primitives-correctly` - Use correct primitive schemas for each type\n- `schema-use-unknown-not-any` - Use z.unknown() instead of z.any() for type safety\n- `schema-avoid-optional-abuse` - Avoid overusing optional fields\n- `schema-string-validations` - Apply string validations at schema definition\n- `schema-use-enums` - Use enums for fixed string values\n- `schema-coercion-for-form-data` - Use coercion for form and query data\n\n### 2. Parsing & Validation (CRITICAL)\n\n- `parse-use-safeparse` - Use safeParse() for user input\n- `parse-async-for-async-refinements` - Use parseAsync for async refinements\n- `parse-handle-all-issues` - Handle all validation issues not just first\n- `parse-validate-early` - Validate at system boundaries\n- `parse-avoid-double-validation` - Avoid validating same data twice\n- `parse-never-trust-json` - Never trust JSON.parse output\n\n### 3. Type Inference (HIGH)\n\n- `type-use-z-infer` - Use z.infer instead of manual types\n- `type-input-vs-output` - Distinguish z.input from z.infer for transforms\n- `type-export-schemas-and-types` - Export both schemas and inferred types\n- `type-branded-types` - Use branded types for domain safety\n- `type-enable-strict-mode` - Enable TypeScript strict mode\n\n### 4. Error Handling (HIGH)\n\n- `error-custom-messages` - Provide custom error messages\n- `error-use-flatten` - Use flatten() for form error display\n- `error-path-for-nested` - Use issue.path for nested error location\n- `error-i18n` - Implement internationalized error messages\n- `error-avoid-throwing-in-refine` - Return false instead of throwing in refine\n\n### 5. Object Schemas (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `object-strict-vs-strip` - Choose strict() vs strip() for unknown keys\n- `object-partial-for-updates` - Use partial() for update schemas\n- `object-pick-omit` - Use pick() and omit() for schema variants\n- `object-extend-for-composition` - Use extend() for adding fields\n- `object-optional-vs-nullable` - Distinguish optional() from nullable()\n- `object-discriminated-unions` - Use discriminated unions for type narrowing\n\n### 6. Schema Composition (MEDIUM)\n\n- `compose-shared-schemas` - Extract shared schemas into reusable modules\n- `compose-intersection` - Use intersection() for type combinations\n- `compose-lazy-recursive` - Use z.lazy() for recursive schemas\n- `compose-preprocess` - Use preprocess() for data normalization\n- `compose-pipe` - Use pipe() for multi-stage validation\n\n### 7. Refinements & Transforms (MEDIUM)\n\n- `refine-vs-superrefine` - Choose refine() vs superRefine() correctly\n- `refine-transform-coerce` - Distinguish transform() from refine() and coerce()\n- `refine-add-path` - Add path to refinement errors\n- `refine-defaults` - Use default() for optional fields with defaults\n- `refine-catch` - Use catch() for fault-tolerant parsing\n\n### 8. Performance & Bundle (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `perf-cache-schemas` - Cache schema instances\n- `perf-zod-mini` - Use Zod Mini for bundle-sensitive applications\n- `perf-avoid-dynamic-creation` - Avoid dynamic schema creation in hot paths\n- `perf-lazy-loading` - Lazy load large schemas\n- `perf-arrays` - Optimize large array validation\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual reference files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [Section definitions](references/_sections.md) - Category structure and impact levels\n- [Rule template](assets/templates/_template.md) - Template for adding new rules\n- Individual rules: `references/{prefix}-{slug}.md`\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- For React Hook Form integration, see `react-hook-form` skill\n- For API client generation, see `orval` skill\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Zod Official Documentation](https://zod.dev/)\n- [Zod v4 Release Notes](https://zod.dev/v4)\n- [Zod GitHub Repository](https://github.com/colinhacks/zod)\n- [Zod Mini](https://zod.dev/packages/mini)\n- [Total TypeScript Zod Tutorial](https://www.totaltypescript.com/tutorials/zod)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:52:20.316Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript Agents needing robust schema validation and automated refactoring capabilities with Zod.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的模式验证和自动重构能力的TypeScript代理，使用Zod。","ja":"Zodを使用して強力なスキーマ検証および自動リファクタリング機能を必要とするTypeScriptエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Zod를 사용하여 강력한 스키마 유효성 검사 및 자동 리팩터링 기능이 필요한 TypeScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de TypeScript que necesitan una validación de esquemas robusta y capacidades de refactorización automatizada con Zod.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents TypeScript ayant besoin d''une validation de schéma robuste et de capacités de refactorisation automatisée avec Zod.","de":"Perfekt für TypeScript-Agents, die eine robuste Schemavalidierung und automatisierte Refactoring-Funktionen mit Zod benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes TypeScript que necessitam de validação de esquema robusta e capacidades de refatoração automática com Zod.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов TypeScript, которым необходима надежная проверка схемы и автоматические возможности рефакторинга с помощью Zod.","ar":"مثالي لعميل TypeScript الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق من مخطط قوي وقدرات إعادة الهيكلة التلقائية مع Zod."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce strict type safety and validation using Zod''s parse() and safeParse() methods, while also optimizing code generation and automated refactoring with z.infer and refinements.","zh":"赋予代理人使用Zod的parse()和safeParse()方法执行严格的类型安全和验证，同时使用z.infer和精化功能优化代码生成和自动重构。","ja":"Zodのparse()およびsafeParse()メソッドを使用して厳格な型安全性および検証を実施し、z.inferおよび精製機能を使用してコード生成および自動リファクタリングを最適化することでエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"Zod의 parse() 및 safeParse() 메서드를 사용하여 엄격한 유형 안전성 및 유효성을 강화하면서 z.infer 및 정련 기능을 사용하여 코드 생성 및 자동 리팩터링을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar una seguridad y validación de tipos estrictas utilizando los métodos parse() y safeParse() de Zod, al mismo tiempo que optimiza la generación de código y la refactorización automática con z.infer y refinamientos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer une sécurité et une validation de types strictes en utilisant les méthodes parse() et safeParse() de Zod, tout en optimisant la génération de code et la refactorisation automatisée avec z.infer et des raffinements.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, eine strenge Typsicherheit und -validierung mithilfe der parse()- und safeParse()-Methoden von Zod durchzusetzen, während auch die Codegenerierung und automatisierte Refactoring mit z.infer und Verfeinerungen optimiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor segurança de tipo estrita e validação usando os métodos parse() e safeParse() do Zod, além de otimizar a geração de código e a refatoração automática com z.infer e refinamentos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обеспечивать строгую безопасность типов и проверку с помощью методов parse() и safeParse() Zod, а также оптимизировать генерацию кода и автоматическую рефакторинг с помощью z.infer и усовершенствований.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من فرض سلامة النوع الصارمة والتحقق باستخدام طرق parse() و safeParse() من Zod، بالإضافة إلى تحسين توليد الكود وإعادة هيكلة تلقائية مع z.infer وتصحيحات."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating complex object schemas with Zod''s composability features","Automating error handling and user feedback with Zod''s validation errors","Implementing type inference and code generation with z.infer"],"zh":["使用Zod的组合功能验证复杂对象模式","使用Zod的验证错误自动处理错误处理和用户反馈","使用z.infer实现类型推断和代码生成"],"ja":["Zodの組み合わせ機能を使用して複雑なオブジェクトスキーマを検証する","Zodの検証エラーを使用してエラー処理およびユーザー フィードバックを自動化する","z.inferを使用して型推論およびコード生成を実装する"],"ko":["Zod의 조합 기능을 사용하여 복잡한 객체 스키마를 유효성 검사합니다.","Zod의 유효성 검사 오류를 사용하여 오류 처리 및 사용자 피드백을 자동화합니다.","z.infer를 사용하여 유형 추론 및 코드 생성을 구현합니다."],"es":["Validar esquemas de objetos complejos con las características de composabilidad de Zod","Automatizar el control de errores y la retroalimentación del usuario con los errores de validación de Zod","Implementar la inferencia de tipos y la generación de código con z.infer"],"fr":["Valider des schémas d''objets complexes avec les fonctionnalités de composition de Zod","Automatiser la gestion des erreurs et la rétroaction utilisateur avec les erreurs de validation de Zod","Mettre en œuvre l''inférence de types et la génération de code avec z.infer"],"de":["Validieren komplexer Objektschemata mit den Kompositionsfeatures von Zod","Automatisieren der Fehlerbehandlung und Benutzerfeedback mit den Validierungsfehlern von Zod","Implementieren der Typinferenz und Codegenerierung mit z.infer"],"pt":["Validar esquemas de objeto complexos com recursos de composabilidade do Zod","Automatizar tratamento de erros e feedback do usuário com erros de validação do Zod","Implementar inferência de tipo e geração de código com z.infer"],"ru":["Проверка сложных схем объектов с помощью функций составления Zod","Автоматизация обработки ошибок и обратной связи пользователя с помощью ошибок проверки Zod","Реализация вывода типа и генерации кода с помощью z.infer"],"ar":["التحقق من مخططات الكائنات المعقدة باستخدام ميزات التكوين من Zod","توفير تلقائي لمعالجة الأخطاء واعادة توجيه المستخدم مع أخطاء التحقق من Zod","تنفيذ استنتاج النوع وتوليد الكود مع z.infer"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript environment","Limited to Zod schema validation and related features"],"zh":["需要TypeScript环境","仅限Zod模式验证和相关功能"],"ja":["TypeScript環境が必要","Zodスキーマ検証および関連機能に限定"],"ko":["TypeScript 환경이 필요합니다.","Zod 스키마 유효성 검사 및 관련 기능으로 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de TypeScript","Limitado a la validación de esquemas de Zod y características relacionadas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript","Limité à la validation de schéma de Zod et aux fonctionnalités associées"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Schemavalidierung von Zod und verwandte Funktionen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente TypeScript","Limitado à validação de esquema Zod e recursos relacionados"],"ru":["Требуется среда TypeScript","Ограниченная проверка схемы Zod и связанные функции"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript","محدود بالتحقق من مخطط Zod والميزات ذات الصلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
