"openspec-new-change是一款VS Code扩展，用于打开Markdown和AsciiDoc文件","ja":"openspec-new-changeは、MarkdownとAsciiDocファイルを開くためのVS Code拡張です","ko":"openspec-new-change는 마크다운 및 AsciiDoc 파일을 열기 위한 VS Code 확장입니다","es":"La extensión openspec-new-change de VS Code abre archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc en Marked 2","fr":"L''extension openspec-new-change de VS Code ouvre des fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc dans Marked 2","de":"Die VS Code-Erweiterung openspec-new-change öffnet Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien in Marked 2","pt":"A extensão openspec-new-change do VS Code permite abrir arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc no Marked 2, melhorando a experiência de desenvolvimento","ru":"Расширение openspec-new-change для VS Code позволяет открывать файлы Markdown и AsciiDoc в Marked 2, улучшая опыт разработки","ar":"يمكنك استخدام امتداد openspec-new-change في كود VS لفتح ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc في Marked 2 وتحسين تجربة التطوير","en":"VS Code extension to open Markdown and AsciiDoc files in Marked 2"},"definition":{"en":"VS Code extension to open Markdown and AsciiDoc files in Marked 2"},"features":{"zh":["支持Markdown文件","支持AsciiDoc文件","使用VS Code扩展","轻松打开文件","提高开发效率"],"ja":["Markdownファイルをサポート","AsciiDocファイルをサポート","VS Code拡張を使用","ファイルを簡単に開く","開発効率を向上させる"],"ko":["마크다운 파일 지원","AsciiDoc 파일 지원","VS Code 확장을 사용","파일을 쉽게 열기","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Abre archivos Markdown en Marked 2","Abre archivos AsciiDoc en Marked 2","Integración con VS Code","Soporte para kebab-case","Deriva nombres de cambios a partir de descripciones","Utiliza la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Ouvre des fichiers Markdown dans Marked 2","Ouvre des fichiers AsciiDoc dans Marked 2","Intégration avec VS Code","Prise en charge de kebab-case","Déduit des noms de changements à partir de descriptions","Utilise l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Öffnet Markdown-Dateien in Marked 2","Öffnet AsciiDoc-Dateien in Marked 2","Integration mit VS Code","Unterstützung für kebab-case","Leitet Changenamen aus Beschreibungen ab","Verwendet das Tool AskUserQuestion"],"pt":["Abre arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc no Marked 2","Melhora a experiência de desenvolvimento","Permite a edição de arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc","Integração com o VS Code","Suporte a kebab-case e descrições de alterações"],"ru":["Открывает файлы Markdown и AsciiDoc в Marked 2","Улучшает опыт разработки","Позволяет редактировать файлы Markdown и AsciiDoc","Интегрируется с VS Code","Поддерживает kebab-case и описания изменений"],"ar":["يفتح ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc في Marked 2","يحسن تجربة التطوير","يسمح بتحرير ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc","يتكامل مع كود VS","يدعم kebab-case ووصف التغييرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-new-change","VS Code扩展","Markdown","AsciiDoc","文件打开","开发工具","效率提高"],"ja":["openspec-new-change","VS Code拡張","Markdown","AsciiDoc","ファイルを開く","開発ツール","効率向上"],"ko":["openspec-new-change","VS Code 확장","마크다운","AsciiDoc","파일 열기","개발 도구","효율성 향상"],"es":["VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","extensión de VS Code","abrir archivos","integración con VS Code"],"fr":["VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","extension VS Code","ouvrir des fichiers","intégration avec VS Code"],"de":["VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","VS Code-Erweiterung","Öffnen von Dateien","Integration mit VS Code"],"pt":["VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","Desenvolvimento","Extensão","Openspec-new-change","Kebab-case","Descrição de alterações"],"ru":["VS Code","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","Разработка","Расширение","Openspec-new-change","Kebab-case","Описание изменений"],"ar":["كود VS","Markdown","AsciiDoc","Marked 2","التطوير","امتداد","Openspec-new-change","كباب كيس","وصف التغييرات"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"vscode-open-in-marked2","repoPath":"gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-new-change","description":"Start a new OpenSpec change using the experimental artifact workflow. Use when the user wants to create a new feature, fix, or modification with a structured step-by-step approach.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentic","body":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Determine the workflow schema**\n\n   Use the default schema (omit `--schema`) unless the user explicitly requests a different workflow.\n\n   **Use a different schema only if the user mentions:**\n   - A specific schema name → use `--schema <name>`\n   - \"show workflows\" or \"what workflows\" → run `openspec schemas --json` and let them choose\n\n   **Otherwise**: Omit `--schema` to use the default.\n\n3. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   Add `--schema <name>` only if the user requested a specific workflow.\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/` with the selected schema.\n\n4. **Show the artifact status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This shows which artifacts need to be created and which are ready (dependencies satisfied).\n\n5. **Get instructions for the first artifact**\n   The first artifact depends on the schema (e.g., `proposal` for spec-driven).\n   Check the status output to find the first artifact with status \"ready\".\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions <first-artifact-id> --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This outputs the template and context for creating the first artifact.\n\n6. **STOP and wait for user direction**\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing the steps, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- Schema/workflow being used and its artifact sequence\n- Current status (0/N artifacts complete)\n- The template for the first artifact\n- Prompt: \"Ready to create the first artifact? Just describe what this change is about and I''ll draft it, or ask me to continue.\"\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Do NOT create any artifacts yet - just show the instructions\n- Do NOT advance beyond showing the first artifact template\n- If the name is invalid (not kebab-case), ask for a valid name\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Pass --schema if using a non-default workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:52:34.100Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents utilizing VS Code and Marked 2 for streamlined documentation workflows, particularly those working with Markdown and AsciiDoc files.","zh":"适用于使用VS Code和Marked 2进行流程文档工作的开发者代理，尤其是那些处理Markdown和AsciiDoc文件的代理。","ja":"VS CodeとMarked 2を使用して文書化ワークフローを効率化する開発者エージェントに最適です。特に、MarkdownとAsciiDocファイルを扱うエージェントに適しています。","ko":"VS Code와 Marked 2를 사용하여 문서화 워크플ロー를 효율적으로 처리하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 Markdown 및 AsciiDoc 파일을 처리하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que utilizan VS Code y Marked 2 para flujos de trabajo de documentación optimizados, particularmente aquellos que trabajan con archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement utilisant VS Code et Marked 2 pour des flux de travail de documentation rationalisés, en particulier ceux qui travaillent avec des fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc.","de":"Ideal für Entwickleragenten, die VS Code und Marked 2 für optimierte Dokumentationsworkflows verwenden, insbesondere für diejenigen, die mit Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien arbeiten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que utilizam o VS Code e o Marked 2 para fluxos de trabalho de documentação otimizados, particularmente aqueles que trabalham com arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков, использующих VS Code и Marked 2 для оптимизации потоков документации, особенно для тех, кто работает с файлами Markdown и AsciiDoc.","ar":"مثالية لوكلاء المطورين الذين يستخدمون VS Code و Marked 2 لتحسين تدفقات العمل في المستندات، ولا سيما أولئك الذين يعملون مع ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage and open Markdown and AsciiDoc files directly in Marked 2, leveraging the experimental artifact-driven approach for new changes, and utilizing tools like AskUserQuestion for clarifying user requests, all while handling file formats and content previews seamlessly.","zh":"赋予代理高效地管理和直接在Marked 2中打开Markdown和AsciiDoc文件的能力，利用实验性基于工件的方法处理新变化，并使用诸如AskUserQuestion等工具来澄清用户请求，同时无缝地处理文件格式和内容预览。","ja":"エージェントがMarked 2でMarkdownとAsciiDocファイルを効率的に管理および開くことを可能にし、新しい変更に対して実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチを利用し、AskUserQuestionなどのツールを使用してユーザーのリクエストを明確化し、ファイル形式とコンテンツプレビューをシームレスに処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 Marked 2에서 Markdown 및 AsciiDoc 파일을 효율적으로 관리하고 열 수 있도록 하며, 새로운 변경 사항에 대해 실험적인 아티팩트 기반 접근 방식을 활용하고, AskUserQuestion 같은 도구를 사용하여 사용자의 요청을 명확히 하며, 파일 형식과 콘텐츠 미리 보기 처리를 원활하게 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar y abrir archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc directamente en Marked 2 de manera eficiente, aprovechando el enfoque experimental basado en artefactos para nuevos cambios, y utilizando herramientas como AskUserQuestion para aclarar solicitudes de usuario, todo mientras se manejan formatos de archivo y vistas previas de contenido de manera transparente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer et d''ouvrir des fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc directement dans Marked 2 de manière efficace, en exploitant l''approche expérimentale basée sur les artefacts pour les nouveaux changements, et en utilisant des outils comme AskUserQuestion pour clarifier les demandes des utilisateurs, le tout en gérant de manière transparente les formats de fichiers et les aperçus de contenu.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien direkt in Marked 2 effizient zu verwalten und zu öffnen, indem sie den experimentellen ansatzbasierenden Ansatz für neue Änderungen nutzen und Tools wie AskUserQuestion verwenden, um Benutzeranfragen zu klären, während sie Dateiformate und Inhaltsvorschauen nahtlos verwalten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem e abram arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc diretamente no Marked 2 de forma eficiente, utilizando a abordagem experimental baseada em artefatos para novas alterações e utilizando ferramentas como AskUserQuestion para esclarecer solicitações de usuário, além de lidar com formatos de arquivo e visualizações de conteúdo de forma transparente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно управлять и открывать файлы Markdown и AsciiDoc напрямую в Marked 2, используя экспериментальный подход, основанный на артефактах, для новых изменений, и используя инструменты, такие как AskUserQuestion, для уточнения запросов пользователя, при этом обеспечивая бесшовное xử lý форматов файлов и предварительных просмотров контента.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إدارة ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc وفتحها مباشرة في Marked 2 بطريقة فعالة، واستخدام النهج التجريبي القائم على المكونات للتعديلات الجديدة، واستخدام أدوات مثل AskUserQuestion لتوضيح طلبات المستخدم، مع معالجة تنسيقات الملفات ومعاينة المحتوى بطريقة متصلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Initiating new changes with descriptive 