ise en œuvre de solutions vérifiées","Maintenance de la fonctionnalité existante"],"de":["Aktivierung des Debug-Modus","Identifizierung von Fehlern und Ausnahmen","Analyse von Protokollen und Verfolgung von Fehlern","Implementierung von verifizierten Lösungen","Beibehaltung der bestehenden Funktionalität"],"pt":["Identificação de erros","Correção de bugs","Análise de logs","Depuração de código","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Выявление ошибок","Исправление багов","Анализ логов","Отладка кода","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["تحديد الأخطاء","تصحيح العيوب","تحليل السجلات","فحص الكود","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AIAgent","角色调试器","调试模式","IDE编码","vibe编码","错误修复","开发效率"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ロールデバッガー","デバッグモード","IDEコーディング","vibeコーディング","エラー修正","開発効率"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","역할 디버거","디버깅 모드","IDE 코딩","vibe 코딩","오류 수정","개발 효율성"],"es":["depurador de roles","debugging","errores de código","análisis de registros","solución de errores","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["débogueur de rôles","débogage","erreurs de code","analyse de journaux","résolution d''erreurs","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Rollen-Debugger","Debugging","Fehler im Code","Protokollanalyse","Fehlerbehebung","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["depurador de código","debugging","correção de erros","análise de logs","otimização de desempenho","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["отладчик роли","debugging","исправление ошибок","анализ логов","оптимизация производительности","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مُحلل الأدوار","فحص الأخطاء","تصحيح العيوب","تحليل السجلات","تحسين الأداء","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"teodevlor","repo":"agent-kit-skill","repoPath":"teodevlor/agent-kit-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"role-debugger","description":"Activate Debugger mode for systematic bug fixing. Use when debugging errors, investigating issues, or fixing bugs.","bodyPreview":"# Role: Debugger (The Fixer)\n\nThis skill activates Debugger mode for AI agent behavior.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when debugging errors\n- Use this skill when investigating issues\n- Use this skill when fixing bugs\n- Use this skill when the user shares error messages or stack traces\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Goal\nIdentify root causes, isolate issues, and implement verified fixes without breaking existing functionality.\n\n### Required Behaviors\n\n1. **Log First**\n   Do not guess. Read the error lo","body":"# Role: Debugger (The Fixer)\n\nThis skill activates Debugger mode for AI agent behavior.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when debugging errors\n- Use this skill when investigating issues\n- Use this skill when fixing bugs\n- Use this skill when the user shares error messages or stack traces\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Goal\nIdentify root causes, isolate issues, and implement verified fixes without breaking existing functionality.\n\n### Required Behaviors\n\n1. **Log First**\n   Do not guess. Read the error logs/stack trace carefully first.\n   - What is the exact error message?\n   - What file and line?\n   - What is the call stack?\n\n2. **Reproduce**\n   Establish a reliable reproduction step before fixing.\n   - What triggers the bug?\n   - Can you reproduce it consistently?\n   - What are the inputs?\n\n3. **Variable Isolation**\n   Verify assumptions by examining variables at failure points.\n   - What values are unexpected?\n   - What is null/undefined when it shouldn''t be?\n   - What state is incorrect?\n\n4. **Minimal Change**\n   The fix should be the smallest change possible to resolve the issue.\n   - Don''t refactor unrelated code\n   - Don''t add features\n   - Focus only on the bug\n\n### Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze Log**\n   - Identify Error Type\n   - Identify Location (File/Line)\n   - Identify Context (What was happening?)\n\n2. **Hypothesize**\n   Form a clear hypothesis: \"If X is null, then Y crashes.\"\n\n3. **Verify**\n   Check the hypothesis with logs, tests, or inspection.\n\n4. **Fix & Test**\n   Apply the minimal fix and ensure regression tests pass.\n\n### Response Format\n\nWhen acting as Debugger, structure responses as:\n\n```markdown\n## Error Analysis\n- **Error Type:** [TypeError/NullPointer/etc.]\n- **Location:** `file.ts:line`\n- **Message:** [Exact error message]\n\n## Root Cause\n[Explanation of why the error occurs]\n\n## Hypothesis\n[What I believe is causing the issue]\n\n## Fix\n[Code fix with explanation]\n\n## Verification\n[How to verify the fix works]\n```\n\n### Debugging Techniques\n\n#### 1. Stack Trace Reading\n```\nTypeError: Cannot read property ''name'' of undefined\n    at getUserName (user.ts:15)\n    at renderProfile (profile.tsx:42)\n    at App (app.tsx:10)\n```\n- Start from the top (most recent call)\n- `user.ts:15` is where it crashed\n- `profile.tsx:42` is what called it\n\n#### 2. Binary Search Debugging\nWhen unsure where the bug is:\n1. Add log at the middle of the function\n2. If error before log → bug is in first half\n3. If error after log → bug is in second half\n4. Repeat until isolated\n\n#### 3. Rubber Duck Debugging\nExplain the code line by line. Often reveals the bug.\n\n### Example Debug Session\n\nError:\n```\nTypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''id'')\n    at updateUser (user.service.ts:25)\n```\n\nResponse:\n```markdown\n## Error Analysis\n- **Error Type:** TypeError\n- **Location:** `user.service.ts:25`\n- **Message:** Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''id'')\n\n## Root Cause\nThe `user` object is undefined when trying to access `.id`. This happens when the database query returns no results.\n\n## Hypothesis\nWhen a user is not found in the database, `findUserById` returns `undefined`, but the code doesn''t check for this before accessing `.id`.\n\n## Fix\n```typescript\n// Before\nasync function updateUser(id: string, data: UpdateUserDto) {\n  const user = await this.userRepository.findOneBy({ id });\n  await this.userRepository.update(user.id, data); // Crashes here\n}\n\n// After\nasync function updateUser(id: string, data: UpdateUserDto) {\n  const user = await this.userRepository.findOneBy({ id });\n  \n  if (!user) {\n    throw new NotFoundException(`User with ID ${id} not found`);\n  }\n  \n  await this.userRepository.update(user.id, data);\n}\n```\n\n## Verification\n1. Test with valid user ID → should update successfully\n2. Test with invalid user ID → should throw NotFoundException\n3. Run existing unit tests → should pass\n```\n\n### Common Bug Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Symptom | Common Cause |\n|---------|---------|--------------|\n| Null Reference | `Cannot read X of undefined` | Missing null check |\n| Race Condition | Intermittent failures | Async ordering issue |\n| Off-by-One | Index out of bounds | Loop boundary wrong |\n| Type Mismatch | Unexpected type error | Wrong assumption about data |\n| State Bug | Works first time, fails second | Shared mutable state |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:54:02.786Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced error analysis and debugging capabilities for IDE coding and vibe coding.","zh":"适合需要高级错误分析和调试功能的AI代理，用于IDE编码和vibe编码。","ja":"IDEコーディングとvibeコーディングのための高度なエラーアナリシスとデバッグ機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"IDE 코딩 및 vibe 코딩을 위한 고급 오류 분석 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis y depuración de errores para codificación en IDE y codificación de vibe.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''analyse et de débogage d''erreurs pour la codification dans l''IDE et la codification de vibe.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Fehleranalyse- und Debugging-Funktionen für die Codierung in der IDE und die Vibe-Codierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise e depuração de erros para codificação em IDE e vibe coding.","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа и отладки ошибок для кодирования в IDE и vibe coding.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى قدرات تحليل متقدمة وتصحيح الأخطاء لترميز IDE وترميز الاهتزاز."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify root causes, isolate issues, and implement verified fixes without breaking existing functionality, utilizing error logs, stack traces, and bug fixing protocols.","zh":"赋予代理识别根本原因、隔离问题并实施经过验证的修复方案的能力，而不会破坏现有的功能，利用错误日志、堆栈跟踪和错误修复协议。","ja":"エージェントに根本原因を特定し、問題を分離し、バグ修正プロトコル、エラーログ、スタックトレースを利用して既存の機能を破壊せずに検証済みの修正を実装する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 근본 원인을 식별하고, 문제를 분리하고, 에러 로그, 스택 트레이스 및 버그 수정 프로토콜을 사용하여 기존 기능을 깨지 않고 검증된 수정을 구현 할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar las causas raíz, aislar problemas e implementar soluciones verificadas sin romper la funcionalidad existente, utilizando registros de errores, seguimientos de pila y protocolos de solución de errores.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les causes profondes, d''isoler les problèmes et de mettre en œuvre des correctifs vérifiés sans casser la fonctionnalité existante, en utilisant les journaux d''erreurs, les traces de pile et les protocoles de correction de bogue.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Ursachen zu identifizieren, Probleme zu isolieren und überprüfte Lösungen zu implementieren, ohne die bestehende Funktionalität zu beeinträchtigen, indem sie Fehlerprotokolle, Stack-Traces und Bug-Behebungsprotokolle nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar as causas raiz, isolar problemas e implementar soluções verificadas sem quebrar a funcionalidade existente, utilizando registros de erros, rastreamentos de pilha e protocolos de correção de bugs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять коренные причины, изолировать проблемы и реализовывать проверенные исправления без нарушения существующей функциональности, используя журналы ошибок, трассировки стека и протоколы исправления ошибок.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تحديد الأسباب الجذرية وعزل المشكلات وتنفيذ إصلاحات تم التحقق منها دون كسر الوظيفة الحالية، باستخدام سجلات الأخطاء وتحليلات السبب والإجراءات التصحيحية للعيب."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging errors in code","Investigating issues with stack traces","Fixing bugs without breaking existing functionality"],"zh":["代码中的错误调试","使用堆栈跟踪调查问题","在不破坏现有功能的情况下修复错误"],"ja":["コード内のエラーデバッグ","スタックトレースを使用した問題の調査","既存の機能を破壊せずにバグを修正"],"ko":["코드 내의 오류 디버깅","스택 트레이스를 사용한 문제 조사","기존 기능을 깨지 않고 버그를 수정"],"es":["Depuración de errores en el código","Investigación de problemas con seguimientos de pila","Corrección de errores sin romper la funcionalidad existente"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs dans le code","Investigation de problèmes avec des traces de pile","Correction de bogues sans casser la fonctionnalité existante"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung in Code","Untersuchung von Problemen mit Stack-Traces","Behebung von Fehlern ohne die bestehende Funktionalität zu beeinträchtigen"],"pt":["Depuração de erros no código","Investigação de problemas com rastreamentos de pilha","Correção de bugs sem quebrar a funcionalidade existente"],"ru":["Отладка ошибок в коде","Расследование проблем со стек-трассами","Исправление ошибок без нарушения существующей функциональности"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء في الكود","تحقيق مشكلات مع تحليلات السبب","إصلاح العيوب دون كسر الوظيفة الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires error messages or stack traces from the user","Limited to debugging and fixing bugs, not code optimization or improvement"],"zh":["需要用户提供错误消息或堆栈跟踪","仅限于调试和修复错误，不包括代码优化或改进"],"ja":["ユーザーからエラーメッセージまたはスタックトレースが必要","デバッグとバグ修正のみ、コードの最適化や改良は含まれません"],"ko":["사용자로부터 오류 메시지 또는 스택 트레이스가 필요","디버깅 및 버그 수정만 해당되며, 코드 최적화 또는 개선은 포함되지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere mensajes de error o seguimientos de pila del usuario","Limitado a la depuración y corrección de errores, no a la optimización o mejora del código"],"fr":["Nécessite des messages d''erreur ou des traces de pile de l''utilisateur","Limité au débogage et à la correction de bogues, et non à l''optimisation ou à l''amélioration du code"],"de":["Benötigt Fehlermeldungen oder Stack-Traces vom Benutzer","Begrenzt auf Fehlerbehebung und Debugging, nicht auf Code-Optimierung oder -Verbesserung"],"pt":["Exige mensagens de erro ou rastreamentos de pilha do usuário","Limitado à depuração e correção de bugs, não otimização ou melhoria de código"],"ru":["Требует сообщений об ошибках или трассировок стека от пользователя","Ограничен отладкой и исправлением ошибок, не оптимизацией или улучшением кода"],"ar":["يتطلب رسائل خطأ أو تحليلات السبب من المستخدم","محدود بتصحيح الأخطاء وإصلاح العيوب، وليس تحسين أو تحسين الكود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
