ct-standards","Entwicklung von skalierbaren Backend-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Arquitetura Modular Monolith","Estrutura de módulos separados por recursos","Utilização de serviços e controladores","Integração com outras habilidades de desenvolvimento","Suporte a TypeScript","Desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis"],"ru":["Модульная монолитная архитектура","Структура модулей, разделенных по ресурсам","Использование сервисов и контроллеров","Интеграция с другими навыками разработки","Поддержка TypeScript","Разработка масштабируемых приложений"],"ar":["هندسة معمارية متوضعة","هيكل الوحدات المنفصلة حسب الموارد","استخدام الخدمات والمراقبين","التكامل مع مهارات التطوير الأخرى","دعم لغة TypeScript","تطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NestJS","后端开发","模块化","单体架构","开发效率","代码质量","项目标准"],"ja":["NestJS","バックエンド開発","モジュラー","モノリシックアーキテクチャ","開発効率","コード品質","プロジェクト標準"],"ko":["NestJS","백엔드 개발","모듈화","모놀리식 아키텍처","개발 효율성","코드 품질","프로젝트 표준"],"es":["NestJS","Desarrollo backend","Aplicaciones escalables","Arquitectura Modular Monolith","Node.js","JavaScript","Desarrollo de software"],"fr":["NestJS","Développement backend","Applications évolutives","Architecture Monolithique Modulaire","Node.js","JavaScript","Développement de logiciels"],"de":["NestJS","Backend-Entwicklung","Skalierbare Anwendungen","Modular Monolith-Architektur","Node.js","JavaScript","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["NestJS","desenvolvimento backend","arquitetura modular","TypeScript","desenvolvimento de aplicações","escalabilidade","codificação","programação"],"ru":["NestJS","разработка бэкенда","модульная архитектура","TypeScript","разработка приложений","масштабируемость","кодирование","программирование"],"ar":["NestJS","تطوير الباك إند","هندسة معمارية متوضعة","TypeScript","تطوير التطبيقات","قابلية للتوسعة","البرمجة","التطوير"]}},"owner":"teodevlor","repo":"agent-kit-skill","repoPath":"teodevlor/agent-kit-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"backend-nestjs","description":"NestJS backend development conventions. Use when working on NestJS/Node.js TypeScript backend projects.","bodyPreview":"# Backend NestJS Conventions\n\nThis skill provides specific conventions for NestJS backend development.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when working on NestJS projects\n- Use this skill when creating new NestJS modules, services, or controllers\n- This skill builds upon `project-standards` skill\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Architecture\n- Adhere to **Modular Monolith** architecture.\n- Each Feature is a separate Module (`AuthModule`, `UserModule`).\n\n### 2. Module Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── modules/\n│   ├──","body":"# Backend NestJS Conventions\n\nThis skill provides specific conventions for NestJS backend development.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when working on NestJS projects\n- Use this skill when creating new NestJS modules, services, or controllers\n- This skill builds upon `project-standards` skill\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Architecture\n- Adhere to **Modular Monolith** architecture.\n- Each Feature is a separate Module (`AuthModule`, `UserModule`).\n\n### 2. Module Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── modules/\n│   ├── auth/\n│   │   ├── auth.module.ts\n│   │   ├── auth.controller.ts\n│   │   ├── auth.service.ts\n│   │   ├── dto/\n│   │   │   ├── login.dto.ts\n│   │   │   └── register.dto.ts\n│   │   ├── entities/\n│   │   │   └── user.entity.ts\n│   │   └── guards/\n│   │       └── jwt.guard.ts\n```\n\n### 3. DTO (Data Transfer Object)\n- **MUST** use `class-validator` to validate input.\n- File naming: `create-user.dto.ts`, `update-user.dto.ts`.\n\n```typescript\nimport { IsEmail, IsString, MinLength } from ''class-validator'';\n\nexport class CreateUserDto {\n  @IsEmail()\n  email: string;\n\n  @IsString()\n  @MinLength(8)\n  password: string;\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Services\n- Business Logic **MUST** reside in the Service, not in the Controller.\n- Define Interfaces for Services to facilitate Mock testing.\n\n```typescript\n// user.service.interface.ts\nexport interface IUserService {\n  findById(id: string): Promise<User>;\n  create(dto: CreateUserDto): Promise<User>;\n}\n\n// user.service.ts\n@Injectable()\nexport class UserService implements IUserService {\n  constructor(\n    @InjectRepository(User)\n    private readonly userRepository: Repository<User>,\n  ) {}\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Controllers\n- Controllers should be thin - only handle HTTP concerns.\n- Use appropriate decorators for routes.\n\n```typescript\n@Controller(''users'')\nexport class UserController {\n  constructor(private readonly userService: UserService) {}\n\n  @Get('':id'')\n  async findOne(@Param(''id'') id: string): Promise<User> {\n    return this.userService.findById(id);\n  }\n\n  @Post()\n  @HttpCode(HttpStatus.CREATED)\n  async create(@Body() dto: CreateUserDto): Promise<User> {\n    return this.userService.create(dto);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 6. Exception Handling\n- Use NestJS built-in exceptions (`NotFoundException`, `BadRequestException`).\n- Create custom exceptions for domain-specific errors.\n\n```typescript\nthrow new NotFoundException(`User with ID ${id} not found`);\nthrow new BadRequestException(''Invalid email format'');\n```\n\n### 7. Dependency Injection\n- Always use constructor injection.\n- Register providers in the module''s `providers` array.\n\n### 8. Configuration\n- Use `@nestjs/config` for environment variables.\n- Never hardcode secrets or URLs.\n\n### 9. Testing\n- Unit tests for Services (mock repositories).\n- E2E tests for Controllers (test HTTP layer).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:54:38.693Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Agents specializing in TypeScript and Node.js, seeking to master NestJS backend development conventions.","zh":"适合专注于TypeScript和Node.js的全栈代理商，旨在掌握NestJS后端开发惯例的代理商。","ja":"TypeScriptとNode.jsを専門とするフルスタックエージェントが、NestJSバックエンド開発の規範をマスターすることを目指す場合に適しています。","ko":"TypeScript와 Node.js를専門으로 하는 풀스택 에이전트가 NestJS 백엔드 개발 규칙을 마스터하려고 하는 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Full-Stack que se especializan en TypeScript y Node.js, y buscan dominar las convenciones de desarrollo de backend de NestJS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full-Stack spécialisés dans TypeScript et Node.js, souhaitant maîtriser les conventions de développement de backend NestJS.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die sich auf TypeScript und Node.js spezialisieren und die Backend-Entwicklungskonventionen von NestJS meistern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack especializados em TypeScript e Node.js, que buscam dominar as convenções de desenvolvimento de backend do NestJS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Full-Stack, специализирующихся на TypeScript и Node.js, стремящихся освоить соглашения о разработке бэкэнда NestJS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل_full-Stack المتخصص في TypeScript و Node.js ، يسعى إلى إتقان اتفاقيات تطوير الخلفية ل_nestjs."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to architect modular monoliths, leveraging NestJS modules, services, and controllers, while adhering to project standards and conventions, utilizing a Modular Monolith architecture.","zh":"赋予代理商构建模块化单体应用的能力，利用NestJS模块、服务和控制器，同时遵循项目标准和惯例，采用模块化单体架构。","ja":"エージェントに、NestJSモジュール、サービス、コントローラーを利用してモジュラーモノリシックアーキテクチャを採用し、プロジェクトの規範と規則に従ってモジュラーモノリシックアプリケーションを設計する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트에게 NestJS 모듈, 서비스, 컨트롤러를 활용하여 모듈러 모노리스 아키텍처를採用하고 프로젝트 표준 및 규칙을遵守하여 모듈러 모노리스 애플리케이션을 설계할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar monolitos modulares, aprovechando los módulos, servicios y controladores de NestJS, y ajustándose a los estándares y convenciones del proyecto, utilizando una arquitectura de Monolito Modular.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des monolithes modulaires, en exploitant les modules, services et contrôleurs de NestJS, tout en respectant les normes et conventions de projet, en utilisant une architecture de Monolithe Modulaire.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, modulare Monolithen zu entwerfen, indem sie die Module, Dienste und Controller von NestJS nutzen und sich an die Projektstandards und -konventionen halten, unter Verwendung einer Modular Monolith-Architektur.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquitetar monolitos modulares, aproveitando módulos, serviços e controladores do NestJS, enquanto adere aos padrões e convenções do projeto, utilizando uma arquitetura de Monolito Modular.","ru":"Наделяет агентов способностью проектировать модульные монолиты, используя модули, сервисы и контроллеры NestJS, при этом соблюдая стандарты и соглашения проекта, используя архитектуру Модульного Монолита.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تصميم المونوليتات الموديولرية ، باستخدام وحدات وخدمات ومحكات nestjs ، مع الالتزام بمعايير ومواصفات المشروع ، باستخدام هندسة المونوليت الموديولري."},"useCases":{"en":["Building scalable NestJS modules","Creating reusable services and controllers","Implementing feature-based separation of concerns"],"zh":["构建可扩展的NestJS模块","创建可重用的服务和控制器","实现基于功能的关注点分离"],"ja":["スケーラブルなNestJSモジュールの構築","再利用可能なサービスとコントローラーの作成","機能ベースの関心の分離の実装"],"ko":["확장 가능한 NestJS 모듈 구축","재사용 가능한 서비스 및 컨트롤러 생성","기능 기반 관심사 분리의 구현"],"es":["Creación de módulos escalables de NestJS","Creación de servicios y controladores reutilizables","Implementación de separación de preocupaciones basada en características"],"fr":["Construction de modules NestJS évolutifs","Création de services et de contrôleurs réutilisables","Mise en œuvre d''une séparation de préoccupations basée sur les fonctionnalités"],"de":["Erstellung von skalierbaren NestJS-Modulen","Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Diensten und Controllern","Implementierung einer featuresbasierten Trennung von Bedenken"],"pt":["Construção de módulos escaláveis do NestJS","Criação de serviços e controladores reutilizáveis","Implementação da separação de preocupações baseada em recursos"],"ru":["Построение масштабируемых модулей NestJS","Создание многоразовых сервисов и контроллеров","Реализация разделения проблем на основе функций"],"ar":["بناء وحدات nestjs القابلة للتوسيع","إنشاء خدمات ومحكات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تنفيذ فصل الاهتمامات القائمة على الميزات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires prior knowledge of NestJS and TypeScript","Limited to backend development with NestJS framework"],"zh":["需要预先了解NestJS和TypeScript","仅限于使用NestJS框架进行后端开发"],"ja":["NestJSとTypeScriptの事前の知識が必要","NestJSフレームワークを使用したバックエンド開発に限定される"],"ko":["NestJS 및 TypeScript에 대한 사전 지식이 필요함","NestJS 프레임워크를 사용한 백엔드 개발에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos previos de NestJS y TypeScript","Limitado al desarrollo de backend con el framework NestJS"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances préalables de NestJS et de TypeScript","Limité au développement de backend avec le framework NestJS"],"de":["Benötigt Vorkenntnisse in NestJS und TypeScript","Begrenzt auf die Backend-Entwicklung mit dem NestJS-Framework"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento prévio do NestJS e TypeScript","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de backend com o framework NestJS"],"ru":["Требует предварительных знаний NestJS и TypeScript","Ограничен разработкой бэкэнда с использованием фреймворка NestJS"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة سابقة بنestjs و typescript","محدود بتطوير الخلفية باستخدام إطار nestjs"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
