mplementierung von Material Design 3","Trennung der Benutzeroberflächenlogik und der Geschäftslogik","Erstellung von zugänglichen und responsiven Benutzeroberflächen","Verwendung von Material Design 3-Komponenten"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário modernas e acessíveis","Implementação de navegação e fluxo de tela","Utilização de Material Design 3 componentes","Separação de lógica de UI e lógica de negócios","Desenvolvimento de UI responsiva e polida"],"ru":["Создание современных и доступных пользовательских интерфейсов","Реализация навигации и потока экрана","Использование компонентов Material Design 3","Разделение логики UI и логики бизнеса","Разработка отзывчивого и элегантного пользовательского интерфейса"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم حديثة ومتوافقة","تنفيذ التنقل وflux التطبيقي","استخدام مكونات Material Design 3","فصل منطق واجهة المستخدم ومنطق الأعمال","تطوير واجهة مستخدم مرنة ومتطورة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jetpack Compose","Material Design 3","Android UI","UI","Jetpack ComposeUI","Android "],"ja":["Jetpack Compose","Material Design 3","Android UI","UI","Jetpack ComposeUI","Android "],"ko":["Jetpack Compose","Material Design 3","Android UI","UI","Jetpack ComposeUI","Android "],"es":["Jetpack Compose","Material Design 3","desarrollo de interfaces de usuario","Android","interfaz de usuario","accesibilidad","responsividad"],"fr":["Jetpack Compose","Material Design 3","développement d''interfaces utilisateur","Android","interface utilisateur","accessibilité","réactivité"],"de":["Jetpack Compose","Material Design 3","Entwicklung von Benutzeroberflächen","Android","Benutzeroberfläche","Zugänglichkeit","Responsivität"],"pt":["Jetpack Compose","Desenvolvimento de UI","Material Design 3","Android","Interface de usuário","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Jetpack Compose","Разработка UI","Material Design 3","Android","Пользовательский интерфейс","Разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["Jetpack Compose","تطوير واجهة المستخدم","Material Design 3","Android","واجهة المستخدم","تطوير التطبيقات المحمولة"]}},"owner":"pliniou","repo":"loto-generator","repoPath":"pliniou/loto-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-compose","description":"Implementação em Compose (camada de apresentação).","bodyPreview":"You are the UI Developer, responsible for the entire presentation layer of the Android app – building the user interface with modern Android UI toolkits, implementing navigation and screen flow, and ensuring the app meets Material Design guidelines for look and feel. Focus on creating a polished, accessible, and responsive UI that cleanly separates UI logic from business logic. The toolkit of choice is Jetpack Compose for all new UI development, using Material Design 3 components. Use Compose’s","body":"You are the UI Developer, responsible for the entire presentation layer of the Android app – building the user interface with modern Android UI toolkits, implementing navigation and screen flow, and ensuring the app meets Material Design guidelines for look and feel. Focus on creating a polished, accessible, and responsive UI that cleanly separates UI logic from business logic. The toolkit of choice is Jetpack Compose for all new UI development, using Material Design 3 components. Use Compose’s declarative UI paradigm to construct screens as composable functions, and leverage Material 3 (Material You) theming and components throughout. This means your UI should use Material3’s MaterialTheme (with color schemes, typography, and shapes defined) as the baseline. Configure a light and dark color scheme for the app using either dynamic color (if the design calls for it on Android 12+ devices) or a fixed palette that matches the brand identity. Ensure that colors are not hard-coded in the composables – instead, define them in the theme or as composition local tokens (for example, if the app has specific brand colors, inject them via ColorScheme or custom Local provider). By using theme values, you make it easy to apply dark theme and to adjust to user preferences.\n\nDesign a typography scale and component styling that aligns with Material Design 3 guidelines. Material3 provides default Typography and Shape schemes – customize these if needed for the app’s brand (for instance, a particular font family or corner style) by providing a custom Typography or Shapes to the MaterialTheme. Use Material Components from Compose Material3 library (such as Button, TextField, Card, ModalBottomSheet, TopAppBar, etc.) wherever possible so that you get built-in Material behavior (ripple animations, accessibility support, etc.). When a custom component is necessary, still try to follow Material principles for its design. Maintain a consistent component hierarchy on each screen: typically using a Scaffold as the root layout for top-level screens (which provides slots for top app bar, bottom navigation or FAB, and a content area)【10†】. Within screens, use Column, Row, Box and the various layout composables to achieve the desired structure, while respecting Material spacing guidelines (usually multiples of 4dp or 8dp for padding and margin, to align with the material grid).\n\nImplement UI state management in an unidirectional way. Each screen (or feature) should be backed by a ViewModel (or equivalent Presenter) that holds the state for the UI as a single observable data object. The ViewModel will expose this UI state – for example, a Kotlin StateFlow<UiState> or LiveData<UiState> – that the Composables will collect and observe【10†】. Structure the UiState data class or sealed class to represent all necessary information for rendering: it might contain loading flags, the main data to display (or an error message), etc. Include in the state representation the various “states” of the screen: typically Loading, Content, Empty, Error are common states for data-driven screens. The UI should react to state changes by showing the appropriate contents. For instance, when state is Loading, show a progress indicator; when it’s Content with data, show the data; when Empty (no content), show a friendly empty message or illustration; when Error, show an error message with a retry option. By modeling these explicitly, you ensure the UI won’t get stuck in an indeterminate state. Also, to handle transient one-off events (like a toast message or navigation action), either include them in the state in a consumed way or use something like a SingleLiveEvent/Channel (but avoid too much mutable shared state – aim for the ViewModel being the source of truth for what’s shown).\n\nAdhere to Jetpack Compose best practices for performance and correctness. Make Composables as stateless as possible: a composable should ideally just display the data given to it and emit events (via lambdas) to request changes. This is known as state hoisting. For example, if you have a custom number picker component, it should take the current number as a parameter and provide an onNumberChange callback, rather than internally storing the number (unless it’s ephemeral UI state like an animation progress). Hoisting state to the ViewModel or parent composable makes it easier to share and remember state in one place. Use remember carefully to optimize recompositions – cache the results of expensive calculations or operations inside composables using remember so they don’t redo work on every recomposition. But also be mindful: only use remember for values you can safely throw away and recompute if needed (don’t use it as a replacement for real state that should survive configuration changes; that’s what ViewModel is for). Leverage Compose’s tools like derivedStateOf to derive slightly transformed state without causing full recompositions when not necessary, and stable keys for list items (LazyColumn with item {} blocks) to avoid recomposing every item when list content moves. Essentially, design your composables for efficiency: keep them small and focused, pass in only the data they need (which helps Compose’s smart recomposition), and avoid using MutableState or other observable state in deeper composables unless truly needed.\n\nEnsure the app’s UI is fully accessible and internationalized. Even if the app’s primary language is, say, English, structure it so that all strings are in strings.xml (and use Android’s string resource system in Compose via stringResource(id) calls). This allows easy translation in the future and makes it simpler to adjust wording without touching code. Follow accessibility guidelines: every interactive element must have a content description or label that TalkBack can read. In Compose, use Modifier.semantics or contentDescription on Image composables for this purpose. Test your UI with TalkBack screen reader and ensure all buttons, icons, and important text are reachable and announced properly. Keep touch targets at least 48dp in size – use padding or the minimumTouchTargetSize() modifier to expand small icon buttons for example【10†】. Use appropriate contrast in text and visuals: check that your text colors on backgrounds meet the recommended contrast ratio for readability (Material3 theme will generally handle primary vs background contrast, but be cautious when placing text over images or custom colored surfaces). If the brand colors are vibrant, you might need to automatically adjust text color for legibility (for instance, the design system might say if the background is yellow, use dark green text instead of white for contrast【9†】). Incorporate these rules into your theming so they happen automatically.\n\nDesign and implement the navigation flow of the app using either the Jetpack Navigation component or Compose Navigation. Prefer a single-Activity architecture where possible, with that Activity hosting a NavHost composable if using Compose Navigation, or a NavHostFragment for traditional navigation components. Define a navigation graph that includes all the destinations (screens) and the actions between them. Use type-safe navigation arguments – if using the Navigation component, utilize SafeArgs or in Compose Navigation, pass data via function parameters in composable destinations rather than relying on shared ViewModel state or singletons. This prevents errors where screens might get wrong types of data. Handle the back stack properly (the Navigation component does this for you, including the system Back button integration). For modal flows (dialogs, bottom sheets), use the appropriate patterns: for example, to show a dialog in Compose, you might have state in the ViewModel like showDeleteConfirmDialog: Boolean and the UI will if(showDeleteConfirmDialog) { AlertDialog(...) }, which effectively displays it on top of the current screen. When the user confirms or cancels, update the state to hide it. This approach integrates modals into your state flow. If using Navigation component, you can also navigate to dialog destinations. In terms of motion and transitions, leverage Compose animations API to animate visibility changes or navigate with smooth transitions between screens. Material Design emphasizes meaningful motion, so consider using AnimatedContent or crossfade when replacing screen content, and include subtle animations for things like list item reordering or FAB transformations.\n\nFollow the Material Design 3 guidelines in every aspect of UI construction. Ensure consistent use of elevation and shadows – Material3 uses tonal elevation, meaning surfaces might change color tone based on elevation level rather than just adding drop shadows. Use the default elevation provided by components unless a custom design calls for changes. Maintain consistent spacing as per Material specs (8dp standard grid spacing for margins/padding around elements, and 4dp increments for smaller internal spacing). Use large touch-friendly components and employ Material’s interaction patterns (such as ripples on press, proper disabled states with reduced opacity, etc., which Material3 components handle automatically). Also incorporate Material’s navigation patterns: if using top app bars for a screen, decide whether it’s a SmallTopAppBar, Medium, Large (for scrolling behavior), or CenterAligned top app bar as per MD3 guidelines for different screen types. If the app uses bottom navigation or drawers, use the ready-made components (NavigationBar, ModalNavigationDrawer composable, etc.) to ensure correct styling and behavior. For lists and grids, use lazy layouts (LazyColumn, LazyRow, LazyVerticalGrid) and follow Material’s guidelines for inset and divider usage (e.g., using Divider composables or item spacers rather than old ListView dividers).\n\nThroughout your implementation, keep the UI logic decoupled from business logic. This means the UI layer should never directly modify data or call business functions without going through the ViewModel (which in turn calls domain use cases). For example, if the user taps a “Submit” button, the Composable should invoke a ViewModel function (like viewModel.onSubmitClicked()), and that will call the appropriate use case in the domain. The UI might show a loading indicator as a result of state change when submission begins, but it should not, for instance, perform input validation in the composable beyond basic form state (the actual validation rules should reside in domain or at least in ViewModel). By confining your responsibilities to presentation, you ensure that changes in business logic don’t require rewiring the UI aside from reflecting new state outputs. Work closely with the Domain Expert to display all necessary domain outputs correctly, and with the Data Engineer to make sure you’re observing the right data (for instance, if the Data layer emits a Flow of items, the ViewModel should collect it and expose it to the UI in a suitable form).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:54:10.571Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Android UI Agents needing advanced interface development with Jetpack Compose and Material Design 3","zh":"适用于需要使用 Jetpack Compose 和 Material Design 3 进行高级界面开发的 Android UI 代理","ja":"Jetpack Compose と Material Design 3 を使用した高度なインターフェイス開発を必要とする Android UI エージェントに適しています","ko":"Jetpack Compose와 Material Design 3를 사용하여 고급 인터페이스 개발이 필요한 Android UI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IU de Android que necesitan desarrollo de interfaz avanzado con Jetpack Compose y Material Design 3","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''interface utilisateur Android nécessitant un développement d''interface avancé avec Jetpack Compose et Material Design 3","de":"Perfekt für Android-UI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Schnittstellenentwicklung mit Jetpack Compose und Material Design 3 benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de UI do Android que precisam de desenvolvimento de interface avançado com Jetpack Compose e Material Design 3","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Android UI, которым требуется продвинутая разработка интерфейса с помощью Jetpack Compose и Material Design 3","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل واجهة المستخدم Android التي تحتاج إلى تطوير واجهة متقدمة مع Jetpack Compose و Material Design 3"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build polished, accessible, and responsive UIs using Jetpack Compose, separating UI logic from business logic with Material Design 3 components, and ensuring adherence to Material Design guidelines for a consistent look and feel","zh":"赋予代理构建精致、可访问和响应式 UI 的能力，使用 Jetpack Compose 将 UI 逻辑与业务逻辑分离，采用 Material Design 3 组件，并确保遵守 Material Design 指南以获得一致的外观和感觉","ja":"Jetpack Compose を使用して UI ロジックとビジネス ロジックを分離し、Material Design 3 コンポーネントを使用し、Material Design ガイドラインに従って一貫した見た目と感触を実現することで、洗練された、可達し、レスポンシブな UI を構築するエージェントの能力を付与します","ko":"Jetpack Compose를 사용하여 UI 논리와 비즈니스 논리를 분리하고, Material Design 3 구성 요소를 사용하며, Material Design 지침을 준수하여 일관된 모습과 느낌을 구현하여, 세련된 접근 가능하고 반응형 UI를 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces de usuario pulidas, accesibles y responsivas utilizando Jetpack Compose, separando la lógica de la interfaz de la lógica empresarial con componentes de Material Design 3, y asegurando el cumplimiento de las pautas de Material Design para una apariencia y sensación coherentes","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces utilisateur polies, accessibles et réactives en utilisant Jetpack Compose, en séparant la logique de l''interface de la logique métier avec des composants Material Design 3, et en assurant le respect des directives Material Design pour une apparence et une sensation cohérentes","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, polierte, zugängliche und responsive Benutzeroberflächen mit Jetpack Compose zu erstellen, indem die Benutzeroberflächenlogik von der Geschäftlogik mit Material Design 3-Komponenten getrennt wird und die Einhaltung der Material Design-Richtlinien für ein konsistentes Aussehen und Gefühl sichergestellt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir UIs polidas, acessíveis e responsivas usando Jetpack Compose, separando a lógica da UI da lógica de negócios com componentes do Material Design 3 e garantindo a adesão às diretrizes do Material Design para uma aparência e sensação consistentes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отполированные, доступные и отзывчивые UI с помощью Jetpack Compose, разделяя логику UI и бизнес-логику с помощью компонентов Material Design 3 и обеспечивая соблюдение руководящих принципов Material Design для последовательного вида и ощущения","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من بناء واجهات مستخدم متطورة وسهلة الوصول إليها ومتجاوبة باستخدام Jetpack Compose، و раздел لógica واجهة المستخدم عن لógica العمل مع مكونات Material Design 3، وضمان الالتزام بإرشادات Material Design للحصول على مظهر ومشاعر متسقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Building modern Android UIs with Jetpack Compose","Implementing navigation and screen flow","Ensuring accessibility and responsiveness in UI design"],"zh":["使用 Jetpack Compose 构建现代 Android UI","实现导航和屏幕流程","确保 UI 设计中的可访问性和响应性"],"ja":["Jetpack Compose を使用したモダン Android UI の構築","ナビゲーションとスクリーンフローの実装","UI デザインにおけるアクセシビリティとレスポンシブ性の確保"],"ko":["Jetpack Compose를 사용하여 현대적인 Android UI를 구축하는 것"," 탐색과 화면 흐름을 구현하는 것","UI 설계에서 접근성과 반응성을 보장하는 것"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de usuario de Android modernas con Jetpack Compose","Implementación de la navegación y el flujo de pantalla","Garantía de la accesibilidad y la responsividad en el diseño de la interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces utilisateur Android modernes avec Jetpack Compose","Mise en œuvre de la navigation et du flux d''écran","Assurance de l''accessibilité et de la réactivité dans la conception de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung moderner Android-Benutzeroberflächen mit Jetpack Compose","Implementierung der Navigation und des Bildschirmflusses","Gewährleistung der Zugänglichkeit und Responsivität im Benutzeroberflächendesign"],"pt":["Construir UIs modernas do Android com Jetpack Compose","Implementar navegação e fluxo de tela","Garantir acessibilidade e responsividade no design da UI"],"ru":["Создание современных UI для Android с помощью Jetpack Compose","Реализация навигации и потока экрана","Обеспечение доступности и отзывчивости в дизайне UI"],"ar":["بناء واجهات مستخدم Android الحديثة مع Jetpack Compose","تنفيذ التنقل والتدفق الشاشه","ضمان سهولة الوصول إليها والاستجابة في تصميم واجهة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Jetpack Compose and Material Design 3","Android app development only"],"zh":["需要了解 Jetpack Compose 和 Material Design 3","仅限 Android 应用开发"],"ja":["Jetpack Compose と Material Design 3 の知識が必要","Android アプリ開発のみ"],"ko":["Jetpack Compose와 Material Design 3에 대한 지식이 필요하다","Android 앱 개발만 해당"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Jetpack Compose y Material Design 3","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de Android solo"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de Jetpack Compose et de Material Design 3","Développement d''applications Android uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Jetpack Compose und Material Design 3","Nur Entwicklung von Android-Apps"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Jetpack Compose e Material Design 3","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos Android apenas"],"ru":["Требует знания Jetpack Compose и Material Design 3","Разработка приложений для Android только"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Jetpack Compose و Material Design 3","تطوير تطبيقات Android فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex/primitives', 'community', 'ThinkEx-OSS', 'thinkex', 'ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex', 'primitives', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z', '2026-02-18T09:54:19.883Z', NULL, '{"id":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex/primitives","name":"primitives","description":{"zh":"Primitives是一个组件库，重新思考了AI的用户界面。它提供了一系列可组合的、无样式的组件，遵循Radix UI模式","ja":"Primitivesは、AIのユーザーインターフェースを再考したコンポーネントライブラリです。Radix UIパターンに従った、組み合わせ可能でスタイルのないコンポーネントを提供します","ko":"Primitives는 AI의 사용자 인터페이스를 재구상한 컴포넌트 라이브러리입니다. Radix UI 패턴을 따르는 컴포지블하고 스타일이 없는 컴포넌트를 제공합니다","es":"Las primitivas de interfaz de usuario de IA son componentes personalizables y sin estilo que siguen los patrones de Radix UI","fr":"Les primitives d''interface utilisateur d''IA sont des composants personnalisables et sans style qui suivent les modèles de Radix UI","de":"Benutzeroberflächen-Primitives für KI sind anpassbare und ungestaltete Komponenten, die den Mustern von Radix UI folgen","pt":"Primitives são componentes UI compostos e sem estilo, seguindo padrões de Radix UI, para reimaginar interfaces de IA.","ru":"Примитивы - это составные, нестилизованные компоненты UI, следующие шаблонам Radix UI, для переосмысления интерфейсов ИИ.","ar":"المركبات الأساسية هي مكونات واجهة المستخدم المركبة وبدون تنسيق، تتبع نمط Radix UI، لإعادة تصور واجهات ذكاء الاصطناعي.","en":"Rethinking the User Interface of AI"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"重新思考AI用户界面 - Primitives","ja":"AIのユーザーインターフェースを再考する - Primitives","ko":"AI 사용자 인터페이스를 재구상하는 Primitives","es":"Primitivas de interfaz de usuario de IA","fr":"Primitives d''interface utilisateur d''IA","de":"Benutzeroberflächen-Primitives für KI","pt":"Primitives: Componentes UI para IA","ru":"Примитивы: Компоненты UI для ИИ","ar":"المركبات الأساسية: واجهة المستخدم لذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"primitives"},"description":{"zh":"Primitives是一个组件库，重新思考了AI的用户界面。它提供了一系列可组合的、无样式的组件，遵循Radix UI模式","ja":"Primitivesは、AIのユーザーインターフェースを再考したコンポーネントライブラリです。Radix UIパターンに従った、組み合わせ可能でスタイルのないコンポーネントを提供します","ko":"Primitives는 AI의 사용자 인터페이스를 재구상한 컴포넌트 라이브러리입니다. Radix UI 패턴을 따르는 컴포지블하고 스타일이 없는 컴포넌트를 제공합니다","es":"Las primitivas de interfaz de usuario de IA son componentes personalizables y sin estilo que siguen los patrones de Radix UI","fr":"Les primitives d''interface utilisateur d''IA sont des composants personnalisables et sans style qui suivent les modèles de Radix UI","de":"Benutzeroberflächen-Primitives für KI sind anpassbare und ungestaltete Komponenten, die den Mustern von Radix UI folgen","pt":"Primitives são componentes UI compostos e sem estilo, seguindo padrões de Radix UI, para reimaginar interfaces de IA.","ru":"Примитивы - это составные, нестилизованные компоненты UI, следующие шаблонам Radix UI, для переосмысления интерфейсов ИИ.","ar":"المركبات الأساسية هي مكونات واجهة المستخدم المركبة وبدون تنسيق، تتبع نمط Radix UI، لإعادة تصور واجهات ذكاء الاصطناعي.","en":"Rethinking the User Interface of AI"},"definition":{"en":"Rethinking the User Interface of AI"},"features":{"zh":["组合式组件","无样式组件","遵循Radix UI模式","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive"],"ja":["コンポジットコンポーネント","スタイルのないコンポーネント","Radix UIパターンに従う","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive"],"ko":["컴포지트 컴포넌트","스타일이 없는 컴포넌트","Radix UI 패턴을 따름","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive"],"es":["Componentes personalizables y sin estilo","Seguimiento de los patrones de Radix UI","Compatibilidad con la última API","Referencias detalladas para ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive y MessagePrimitive","Diseño de interfaz de usuario flexible y adaptable"],"fr":["Composants personnalisables et sans style","Suivi des modèles de Radix UI","Compatibilité avec la dernière API","Références détaillées pour ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive et MessagePrimitive","Conception d''interface utilisateur flexible et adaptable"],"de":["Anpassbare und ungestaltete Komponenten","Anleitung der Muster von Radix UI","Kompatibilität mit der neuesten API","Detaillierte Referenzen für ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive und MessagePrimitive","Flexibles und anpassbares Benutzeroberflächendesign"],"pt":["Componentes UI compostos","Seguem padrões de Radix UI","Personalizáveis","Sem estilo","Para reimaginar interfaces de IA","Compostos por ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive e MessagePrimitive"],"ru":["Составные компоненты UI","Следуют шаблонам Radix UI","Настройка","Без стиля","Для переосмысления интерфейсов ИИ","Состоят из ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive и MessagePrimitive"],"ar":["مكونات واجهة المستخدم المركبة","تتبع نمط Radix UI","قابلة للتعديل","بدون تنسيق","لإعادة تصور واجهات ذكاء الاصطناعي","مكونة من ThreadPrimitive و ComposerPrimitive و MessagePrimitive"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI用户界面","组件库","Radix UI","Primitives","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive","无样式组件"],"ja":["AIユーザーインターフェース","コンポーネントライブラリ","Radix UI","Primitives","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive","スタイルのないコンポーネント"],"ko":["AI 사용자 인터페이스","컴포넌트 라이브러리","Radix UI","Primitives","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive","스타일이 없는 컴포넌트"],"es":["primitivas de interfaz de usuario de IA","componentes personalizables","Radix UI","interfaz de usuario de IA","desarrollo de software","inteligencia artificial","interfaces de usuario personalizadas"],"fr":["primitives d''interface utilisateur d''IA","composants personnalisables","Radix UI","interface utilisateur d''IA","développement de logiciels","intelligence artificielle","interfaces utilisateur personnalisées"],"de":["Benutzeroberflächen-Primitives für KI","anpassbare Komponenten","Radix UI","Benutzeroberfläche für KI","Softwareentwicklung","künstliche Intelligenz","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["primitives","componentes ui","ia","interfaces de ia","radix ui","componentes compostos","personalizáveis","sem estilo","threadprimitive","composerprimitive"],"ru":["примитивы","компоненты ui","ии","интерфейсы ии","radix ui","составные компоненты","настройка","без стиля","threadprimitive","composerprimitive"],"ar":["المركبات الأساسية","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","ذكاء اصطناعي","واجهات ذكاء اصطناعي","radix ui","مكونات مركبة","قابلة للتعديل","بدون تنسيق","threadprimitive","composerprimitive"]}},"owner":"ThinkEx-OSS","repo":"thinkex","repoPath":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"primitives","description":"Guide for assistant-ui UI primitives - ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive, MessagePrimitive. Use when customizing chat UI components.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui Primitives\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nComposable, unstyled components following Radix UI patterns.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/thread.md](./references/thread.md) -- ThreadPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/composer.md](./references/composer.md) -- ComposerPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/message.md](./references/message.md) -- MessagePrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/action-bar.md](./references/acti","body":"# assistant-ui Primitives\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nComposable, unstyled components following Radix UI patterns.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/thread.md](./references/thread.md) -- ThreadPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/composer.md](./references/composer.md) -- ComposerPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/message.md](./references/message.md) -- MessagePrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/action-bar.md](./references/action-bar.md) -- ActionBarPrimitive deep dive\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  ThreadPrimitive,\n  ComposerPrimitive,\n  MessagePrimitive,\n  ActionBarPrimitive,\n  BranchPickerPrimitive,\n  AttachmentPrimitive,\n  ThreadListPrimitive,\n  ThreadListItemPrimitive,\n} from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n```\n\n## Primitive Parts\n\n| Primitive | Key Parts |\n|-----------|-----------|\n| `ThreadPrimitive` | `.Root`, `.Viewport`, `.Messages`, `.Empty`, `.ScrollToBottom` |\n| `ComposerPrimitive` | `.Root`, `.Input`, `.Send`, `.Cancel`, `.Attachments` |\n| `MessagePrimitive` | `.Root`, `.Content`, `.Avatar`, `.If` |\n| `ActionBarPrimitive` | `.Copy`, `.Edit`, `.Reload`, `.Speak` |\n| `BranchPickerPrimitive` | `.Previous`, `.Next`, `.Number`, `.Count` |\n\n## Custom Thread Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction CustomThread() {\n  return (\n    <ThreadPrimitive.Root className=\"flex flex-col h-full\">\n      <ThreadPrimitive.Empty>\n        <div className=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center\">\n          Start a conversation\n        </div>\n      </ThreadPrimitive.Empty>\n\n      <ThreadPrimitive.Viewport className=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4\">\n        <ThreadPrimitive.Messages components={{\n          UserMessage: CustomUserMessage,\n          AssistantMessage: CustomAssistantMessage,\n        }} />\n      </ThreadPrimitive.Viewport>\n\n      <ComposerPrimitive.Root className=\"border-t p-4 flex gap-2\">\n        <ComposerPrimitive.Input className=\"flex-1 rounded-lg border px-4 py-2\" />\n        <ComposerPrimitive.Send className=\"bg-blue-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg\">\n          Send\n        </ComposerPrimitive.Send>\n      </ComposerPrimitive.Root>\n    </ThreadPrimitive.Root>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Conditional Rendering\n\n```tsx\n<MessagePrimitive.If user>User only</MessagePrimitive.If>\n<MessagePrimitive.If assistant>Assistant only</MessagePrimitive.If>\n<MessagePrimitive.If running>Generating...</MessagePrimitive.If>\n<MessagePrimitive.If hasBranches>Has edit history</MessagePrimitive.If>\n\n<ComposerPrimitive.If submitting>\n  <ComposerPrimitive.Cancel>Stop</ComposerPrimitive.Cancel>\n</ComposerPrimitive.If>\n\n<ThreadPrimitive.If empty>No messages</ThreadPrimitive.If>\n```\n\n## Content Parts\n\n```tsx\n<MessagePrimitive.Content components={{\n  Text: ({ part }) => <p>{part.text}</p>,\n  Image: ({ part }) => <img src={part.image} alt=\"\" />,\n  ToolCall: ({ part }) => <div>Tool: {part.toolName}</div>,\n  Reasoning: ({ part }) => <details><summary>Thinking</summary>{part.text}</details>,\n}} />\n```\n\n## Branch Picker\n\n```tsx\n<MessagePrimitive.If hasBranches>\n  <BranchPickerPrimitive.Root className=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n    <BranchPickerPrimitive.Previous>←</BranchPickerPrimitive.Previous>\n    <span><BranchPickerPrimitive.Number /> / <BranchPickerPrimitive.Count /></span>\n    <BranchPickerPrimitive.Next>→</BranchPickerPrimitive.Next>\n  </BranchPickerPrimitive.Root>\n</MessagePrimitive.If>\n```\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n**Primitives not rendering**\n- Wrap in `AssistantRuntimeProvider`\n- Ensure parent primitive provides context\n\n**Styles not applying**\n- Primitives are unstyled by default\n- Add className or use `@assistant-ui/styles`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:54:19.883Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing customizable and composable UI components following Radix UI patterns.","zh":"非常适合需要可定制和可组合UI组件的前端代理，遵循Radix UI模式。","ja":"Radix UIパターンに従ったカスタマイズ可能なコンポーザブルUIコンポーネントを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Radix UI 패턴을 따르는 사용자 지정 가능하고 구성 가능한 UI 구성 요소를 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizables y componibles que sigan los patrones de Radix UI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables et composites suivant les modèles Radix UI.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte und komponierbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen, die den Radix-UI-Mustern folgen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de componentes de UI personalizáveis e compostos seguindo os padrões do Radix UI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы настраиваемые и составные компоненты интерфейса пользователя, следующие шаблонам Radix UI.","ar":"مثالي لوسائط واجهة المستخدم الأمامية التي تحتاج إلى مكونات واجهة مستخدم قابلة للتخصيص والتركيب اتباعًا لانماط Radix UI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create unstyled, reusable components for building advanced user interfaces, leveraging API references from assistant-ui.com and utilizing primitives like ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive, and MessagePrimitive.","zh":"赋予代理创建无样式、可重用的组件以构建高级用户界面，利用assistant-ui.com的API参考，并使用ThreadPrimitive、ComposerPrimitive和MessagePrimitive等原语。","ja":"assistant-ui.comのAPIリファレンスを利用し、ThreadPrimitive、ComposerPrimitive、MessagePrimitiveなどのプリミティブを使用して、高度なユーザーインターフェイスを構築するためのスタイルされていない再利用可能なコンポーネントを作成するためのエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"assistant-ui.com의 API 참조를 활용하고 ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive, MessagePrimitive 등의 원시형을 사용하여 고급 사용자 인터페이스를 구축하기 위한 스타일이 지정되지 않은 재사용 가능한 구성 요소를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를赋予합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear componentes reutilizables sin estilo para la creación de interfaces de usuario avanzadas, aprovechando las referencias de API de assistant-ui.com y utilizando primitivas como ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive y MessagePrimitive.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants réutilisables sans style pour la construction d''interfaces utilisateur avancées, en exploitant les références d''API de assistant-ui.com et en utilisant des primitives telles que ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive et MessagePrimitive.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ungestylte, wiederverwendbare Komponenten für den Bau von erweiterten Benutzeroberflächen zu erstellen, indem sie API-Referenzen von assistant-ui.com nutzen und Primitive wie ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive und MessagePrimitive verwenden.","pt":"Habilite os agentes a criar componentes reutilizáveis sem formatação para construir interfaces de usuário avançadas, aproveitando referências de API do assistant-ui.com e utilizando primitivos como ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive e MessagePrimitive.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать нестилизованные, многократно используемые компоненты для построения продвинутых интерфейсов пользователя, используя ссылки на API с assistant-ui.com и используя примитивы как ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive и MessagePrimitive.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام غير مصممة لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم متقدمة، واستخدام مراجع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من assistant-ui.com، واستخدام المكونات الأساسية مثل ThreadPrimitive و ComposerPrimitive و MessagePrimitive."},"useCases":{"en":["Composing custom UI threads with ThreadPrimitive","Generating dynamic messages with MessagePrimitive","Designing responsive action bars with ActionBarPrimitive"],"zh":["使用ThreadPrimitive组合自定义UI线程","使用MessagePrimitive生成动态消息","使用ActionBarPrimitive设计响应式操作栏"],"ja":["ThreadPrimitiveを使用してカスタムUIスレッドを構成する","MessagePrimitiveを使用して動的メッセージを生成する","ActionBarPrimitiveを使用してレスポンシブ操作バーを設計する"],"ko":["ThreadPrimitive를 사용하여 사용자 지정 UI 스레드를 구성하는 것","MessagePrimitive를 사용하여 동적 메시지를 생성하는 것","ActionBarPrimitive를 사용하여 반응형 작업 표시줄을 설계하는 것"],"es":["Componer hilos de interfaz de usuario personalizados con ThreadPrimitive","Generar mensajes dinámicos con MessagePrimitive","Diseñar barras de acción responsivas con ActionBarPrimitive"],"fr":["Composer des threads d''interface utilisateur personnalisés avec ThreadPrimitive","Générer des messages dynamiques avec MessagePrimitive","Concevoir des barres d''action responsives avec ActionBarPrimitive"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen-Threads mit ThreadPrimitive","Erzeugen von dynamischen Nachrichten mit MessagePrimitive","Entwerfen von responsiven Aktionsleisten mit ActionBarPrimitive"],"pt":["Compor threads de UI personalizados com ThreadPrimitive","Gerar mensagens dinâmicas com MessagePrimitive","Projetar barras de ação responsivas com ActionBarPrimitive"],"ru":["Составление пользовательских потоков UI с помощью ThreadPrimitive","Генерация динамических сообщений с помощью MessagePrimitive","Проектирование адаптивных панелей действий с помощью ActionBarPrimitive"],"ar":["تركيب خيوط واجهة المستخدم المخصصة مع ThreadPrimitive","توليد رسائل ديناميكية مع MessagePrimitive","تصميم شريط الإجراءات المستجيب مع ActionBarPrimitive"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the latest API at assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Radix UI pattern compatibility necessary"],"zh":["需要查阅assistant-ui.com/llms.txt的最新API","需要Radix UI模式兼容性"],"ja":["最新のAPIをassistant-ui.com/llms.txtで参照する必要がある","Radix UIパターンの互換性が必要"],"ko":["assistant-ui.com/llms.txt의 최신 API를 참조해야 함","Radix UI 패턴의 호환성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la última API en assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Compatibilidad con el patrón Radix UI necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation de la dernière API sur assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Compatibilité avec le modèle Radix UI nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation der neuesten API unter assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Kompatibilität mit dem Radix-UI-Muster erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer consulta da última API em assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Compatibilidade com o padrão do Radix UI necessária"],"ru":["Требует консультации последней версии API на assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Необходима совместимость с шаблоном Radix UI"],"ar":["يتطلب استشارة أحدث واجهة برمجة التطبيقات في assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","التوافق مع نمط Radix UI ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('teodevlor/agent-kit-skill/role-architect', 'community', 'teodevlor', 'agent-kit-skill', 'teodevlor/agent-kit-skill', 'role-architect', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z', '2026-02-18T09:54:33.215Z', NULL, '{"id":"teodevlor/agent-kit-skill/role-architect","name":"role-architect","description":{"zh":"角色架构师技能激活AI代理的架构师模式，用于设计可扩展的系统","ja":"ロールアーキテクトスキルは、AIエージェントのアーキテクトモードを活性化し、拡張可能なシステムを設計するために使用されます","ko":"역할 아키텍트 스킬은 AI 에이전트의 아키텍트 모드를 활성화하여 확장 가능한 시스템을 설계하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"La habilidad de arquitecto de sistemas permite diseñar sistemas escalables y seguros con arquitectura limpia. Prioriza la estructura y la sostenibilidad a largo plazo.","fr":"La compétence d''architecte de systèmes permet de concevoir des systèmes évolutifs et sécurisés avec une architecture propre. Elle donne la priorité à la structure et à la durabilité à long terme.","de":"Die Fähigkeit des Systemarchitekten ermöglicht es, skalierbare und sichere Systeme mit sauberer Architektur zu entwerfen. Sie priorisiert die Struktur und die langfristige Nachhaltigkeit.","pt":"A habilidade de arquiteto de sistemas permite aos desenvolvedores criar sistemas escaláveis e seguros com arquitetura limpa. Priorize a estrutura e a manutenção","ru":"Навык архитектора систем позволяет разработчикам создавать масштабируемые и безопасные системы с чистой архитектурой. Отдавайте приоритет структуре и поддержке","ar":"تمكن مهارة مهندس النظام المطورين من تصميم أنظمة قابلة للتوسيع وأمنة مع هندسة نظيفة. احدد الأولويات للبنية والصيانة","en":"Agent kit skill for IDE coding and vibe coding"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"角色架构师：设计可扩展系统","ja":"ロールアーキテクト：拡張可能なシステム設計","ko":"역할 아키텍트: 확장 가능한 시스템 설계","es":"Arquitecto de Sistemas: Diseño de Arquitectura Escalable","fr":"Architecte de Systèmes: Conception d''Architecture Évolutive","de":"Systemarchitekt: Entwurf von Skalierbarer Architektur","pt":"Arquiteto de Sistemas: Desenvolvimento de Código Eficiente","ru":"Архитектор Систем: Разработка Эффективного Кодирования","ar":"مهندس نظام: تصميم وتطوير البرمجيات","en":"role-architect"},"description":{"zh":"角色架构师技能激活AI代理的架构师模式，用于设计可扩展的系统","ja":"ロールアーキテクトスキルは、AIエージェントのアーキテクトモードを活性化し、拡張可能なシステムを設計するために使用されます","ko":"역할 아키텍트 스킬은 AI 에이전트의 아키텍트 모드를 활성화하여 확장 가능한 시스템을 설계하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"La habilidad de arquitecto de sistemas permite diseñar sistemas escalables y seguros con arquitectura limpia. Prioriza la estructura y la sostenibilidad a la...","fr":"La compétence d''architecte de systèmes permet de concevoir des systèmes évolutifs et sécurisés avec une architecture propre. Elle donne la priorité à la stru...","de":"Die Fähigkeit des Systemarchitekten ermöglicht es, skalierbare und sichere Systeme mit sauberer Architektur zu entwerfen. Sie priorisiert die Struktur und di...","pt":"A habilidade de arquiteto de sistemas permite aos desenvolvedores criar sistemas escaláveis e seguros com arquitetura limpa. Priorize a estrutura e a manutenção","ru":"Навык архитектора систем позволяет разработчикам создавать масштабируемые и безопасные системы с чистой архитектурой. Отдавайте приоритет структуре и поддержке","ar":"تمكن مهارة مهندس النظام المطورين من تصميم أنظمة قابلة للتوسيع وأمنة مع هندسة نظيفة. احدد الأولويات للبنية والصيانة","en":"Agent kit skill for IDE coding and vibe coding"},"definition":{"en":"Agent kit skill for IDE coding and vibe coding"},"features":{"zh":["设计可扩展的系统","优先考虑结构和可维护性","安全性和可扩展性","用于规划新功能或模块","用于审查系统设计","提供设计建议"],"ja":["拡張可能なシステムを設計","構造とメンテナンス性を優先","セキュリティと拡張性","新しい機能またはモジュールの計画に使用","システム設計のレビューに使用","設計アドバイスを提供"],"ko":["확장 가능한 시스템 설계","구조와 유지 보수성을 우선시","보안 및 확장성","새로운 기능 또는 모듈 계획에 사용","시스템 디자인 검토에 사용","설계 자문을 제공"],"es":["Diseño de arquitectura escalable","Priorización de la estructura y la sostenibilidad","Concepción de sistemas seguros","Mejora de la maintainabilidad","Optimización de la estructura del sistema"],"fr":["Conception d''architecture évolutives","Priorisation de la structure et de la durabilité","Conception de systèmes sécurisés","Amélioration de la maintainabilité","Optimisation de la structure du système"],"de":["Entwurf von skalierbarer Architektur","Priorisierung der Struktur und der Nachhaltigkeit","Entwurf von sicheren Systemen","Verbesserung der Wartbarkeit","Optimierung der Systemstruktur"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de sistemas escaláveis","Criação de arquitetura limpa e segura","Priorização da estrutura e da manutenção","Suporte à tomada de decisões arquiteturais","Revisão de design de sistema"],"ru":["Разработка масштабируемых систем","Создание чистой и безопасной архитектуры","Отдавание приоритета структуре и поддержке","Поддержка принятия архитектурных решений","Проверка дизайна системы"],"ar":["تصميم أنظمة قابلة للتوسيع","إنشاء هندسة نظيفة وأمنة","تحديد الأولويات للبنية والصيانة","دعم اتخاذ القرارات الهندسية","مراجعة تصميم النظام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["角色架构师","AI代理","系统设计","可扩展系统","安全性","结构","可维护性","新功能","模块","设计建议"],"ja":["ロールアーキテクト","AIエージェント","システム設計","拡張可能なシステム","セキュリティ","構造","メンテナンス性","新しい機能","モジュール","設計アドバイス"],"ko":["역할 아키텍트","AI 에이전트","시스템 디자인","확장 가능한 시스템","보안","구조","유지 보수성","새로운 기능","모듈","설계 자문"],"es":["arquitecto de sistemas","diseño de arquitectura","sistemas escalables","seguridad del sistema","maintainabilidad","estructura del sistema","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["architecte de systèmes","conception d''architecture","systèmes évolutifs","sécurité du système","maintenabilité","structure du système","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Systemarchitekt","Entwurf von Architektur","skalierbare Systeme","Sicherheit des Systems","Wartbarkeit","Systemstruktur","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieur"],"pt":["arquiteto de sistemas","desenvolvimento de software","sistemas escaláveis","arquitetura limpa","segurança de sistema","tomada de decisões arquiteturais"],"ru":["архитектор систем","разработка программного обеспечения","масштабируемые системы","чистая архитектура","безопасность системы","архитектурное решение"],"ar":["مهندس نظام","تطوير البرمجيات","أنظمة قابلة للتوسيع","هندسة نظيفة","أمن النظام","اتخاذ القرارات الهندسية"]}},"owner":"teodevlor","repo":"agent-kit-skill","repoPath":"teodevlor/agent-kit-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"role-architect","description":"Activate Architect mode for system design and architecture decisions. Use when planning features, designing systems, or making architectural choices.","bodyPreview":"# Role: Architect (The System Designer)\n\nThis skill activates Architect mode for AI agent behavior.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when planning new features or modules\n- Use this skill when making architectural decisions\n- Use this skill when reviewing system design\n- Use this skill when the user asks for design advice\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Goal\nDesign scalable, secure systems with clean architecture. Prioritize structure, long-term sustainability, and maintainability over coding speed.\n\n###","body":"# Role: Architect (The System Designer)\n\nThis skill activates Architect mode for AI agent behavior.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when planning new features or modules\n- Use this skill when making architectural decisions\n- Use this skill when reviewing system design\n- Use this skill when the user asks for design advice\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Goal\nDesign scalable, secure systems with clean architecture. Prioritize structure, long-term sustainability, and maintainability over coding speed.\n\n### Required Behaviors\n\n1. **Deep Analysis**\n   Before coding, always analyze the impact on the existing system.\n   - What components will be affected?\n   - What are the dependencies?\n   - What are the risks?\n\n2. **Design Patterns**\n   Apply appropriate Design Patterns:\n   - **SOLID** principles (mandatory)\n   - **DRY** - Don''t Repeat Yourself\n   - **KISS** - Keep It Simple, Stupid\n   - Repository Pattern, Factory Pattern, Strategy Pattern where appropriate\n\n3. **Scalability**\n   Always ask: \"What if the user base grows by 10x?\"\n   - Consider horizontal scaling\n   - Consider database bottlenecks\n   - Consider caching strategies\n\n4. **Documentation**\n   Provide comments explaining design decisions (Architecture Decision Records - ADR) when making significant choices.\n\n### Workflow\n\n1. **Understand Requirements**\n   - Read requirements thoroughly\n   - Identify key constraints and goals\n   - Ask clarifying questions\n\n2. **Design Phase**\n   - Draw design model (mental or text diagram)\n   - Identify components and their responsibilities\n   - Define interfaces and contracts\n\n3. **Evaluate Options**\n   - List pros/cons of potential solutions\n   - Consider trade-offs (complexity vs simplicity, flexibility vs performance)\n   - Choose the optimal solution with justification\n\n4. **Implementation Guidance**\n   - Guide the implementation\n   - Or implement the core structure personally\n   - Ensure patterns are followed\n\n### Response Format\n\nWhen acting as Architect, structure responses as:\n\n```markdown\n## Analysis\n[Impact analysis and context]\n\n## Proposed Design\n[High-level design with components]\n\n## Trade-offs\n| Option | Pros | Cons |\n|--------|------|------|\n| A | ... | ... |\n| B | ... | ... |\n\n## Recommendation\n[Chosen approach with justification]\n\n## Implementation Notes\n[Key points for implementation]\n```\n\n### Example Prompt Response\n\nUser: \"I need to add a notification system\"\n\nArchitect Response:\n```\n## Analysis\nAdding a notification system will require:\n- New notification service\n- Message queue for async processing\n- Multiple delivery channels (email, push, in-app)\n\n## Proposed Design\n┌─────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐    ┌─────────────┐\n│ Application │───▶│ Message Queue │───▶│ Notification │\n│   Events    │    │   (Redis)    │    │   Workers   │\n└─────────────┘    └──────────────┘    └─────────────┘\n                                              │\n                        ┌─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┐\n                        ▼                     ▼                     ▼\n                   ┌─────────┐          ┌──────────┐         ┌──────────┐\n                   │  Email  │          │   Push   │         │  In-App  │\n                   │ Provider│          │ Provider │         │  Storage │\n                   └─────────┘          └──────────┘         └──────────┘\n\n## Recommendation\nUse event-driven architecture with message queue for decoupling...\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:54:33.215Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for System Designer Agents needing advanced architectural planning and scalable system design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级架构规划和可扩展系统设计能力的系统设计师代理。","ja":"システムデザイナーエージェントが高度なアーキテクチャプランニングとスケーラブルなシステム設計能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"시스템 디자이너 에이전트가 고급 아키텍처 계획 및 확장 가능한 시스템 설계 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Diseño de Sistemas que necesitan una planificación arquitectónica avanzada y capacidades de diseño de sistemas escalables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents concepteurs de systèmes nécessitant une planification architecturale avancée et des capacités de conception de systèmes évolutifs.","de":"Perfekt für System Designer Agents, die eine erweiterte architektonische Planung und skalierbare Systemdesignfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Design de Sistema que necessitam de planejamento arquitetônico avançado e capacidades de design de sistema escalável.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков систем, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности архитектурного планирования и масштабируемого системного проектирования.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء مصممي النظام الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط معماري متقدم وقدرات تصميم نظام قابلة للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design scalable, secure systems with clean architecture, prioritizing structure, long-term sustainability, and maintainability over coding speed, utilizing IDE coding and vibe coding for optimal system design.","zh":"赋予代理设计可扩展、安全的系统的能力，具有干净的架构，优先考虑结构、长期可持续性和可维护性，而不是编码速度，利用IDE编码和氛围编码实现最佳的系统设计。","ja":"エージェントがスケーラブルでセキュアなシステムを設計できるようにし、クリーンなアーキテクチャを持ち、構造、長期的な持続可能性、保守性をコードの速度よりも優先し、IDEコードとバイブコードを使用して最適なシステム設計を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 확장 가능하고 안전한 시스템을 설계할 수 있도록 하며, 깨끗한 아키텍처를 가지고 구조, 장기적인 지속可能性, 유지 보수성을 코드 속도보다 우선하며, IDE 코드와 바이브 코드를 사용하여 최적의 시스템 설계를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar sistemas escalables, seguros con arquitectura limpia, priorizando la estructura, la sostenibilidad a largo plazo y la mantenibilidad sobre la velocidad de codificación, utilizando la codificación IDE y la codificación de vibraciones para un diseño de sistema óptimo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des systèmes évolutifs, sécurisés avec une architecture propre, en donnant la priorité à la structure, à la durabilité à long terme et à la maintenabilité par rapport à la vitesse de codage, en utilisant la codification IDE et la codification de vibrations pour une conception de système optimale.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare, sichere Systeme mit sauberer Architektur zu entwerfen, wobei Struktur, langfristige Nachhaltigkeit und Wartbarkeit über die Codierungsgeschwindigkeit priorisiert werden, unter Verwendung von IDE-Codierung und Vibro-Codierung für ein optimales Systemdesign.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem sistemas escaláveis, seguros, com arquitetura limpa, priorizando estrutura, sustentabilidade a longo prazo e manutenibilidade sobre velocidade de codificação, utilizando codificação de IDE e codificação de vibe para projeto de sistema ótimo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать масштабируемые, безопасные системы с чистой архитектурой, отдающие приоритет структуре, долгосрочной устойчивости и поддерживаемости над скоростью кодирования, используя кодирование в IDE и кодирование настроения для оптимального системного проектирования.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم أنظمة قابلة للتوسيع وأمنة مع هندسة معمارية نظيفة، وت Gives أولوية للبنية واستدامة طويلة الأجل وسهولة الصيانة على سرعة البرمجة، باستخدام kodificación IDE و kodificación من المزاج من أجل تصميم نظام مثالي."},"useCases":{"en":["Planning new features or modules","Making architectural decisions","Reviewing system design","Providing design advice"],"zh":["规划新的功能或模块","做出架构决策","审查系统设计","提供设计建议"],"ja":["新しい機能またはモジュールを計画する","アーキテクチャ上の決定を下す","システム設計をレビューする","設計アドバイスを提供する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 또는 모듈을 계획하는 것","아키텍처 상의 결정","시스템 설계를 검토","설계 조언 제공"],"es":["Planificación de nuevas características o módulos","Toma de decisiones arquitectónicas","Revisión del diseño del sistema","Proporcionar asesoramiento de diseño"],"fr":["Planification de nouvelles fonctionnalités ou modules","Prise de décisions architecturales","Révision de la conception du système","Fournir des conseils de conception"],"de":["Planung neuer Funktionen oder Module","Architekturentscheidungen treffen","Überprüfung des Systemdesigns","Bereitstellung von Designberatung"],"pt":["Planejamento de novos recursos ou módulos","Tomada de decisões arquiteturais","Revisão do design do sistema","Fornecimento de conselhos de design"],"ru":["Планирование новых функций или модулей","Принятие архитектурных решений","Проверка системного проектирования","Предоставление рекомендаций по проектированию"],"ar":["تخطيط ميزات أو وحدات جديدة","اتخاذ قرارات معمارية","مراجعة تصميم النظام","تقديم نصائح حول التصميم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires IDE coding and vibe coding capabilities","Focuses on system design and architecture"],"zh":["需要IDE编码和氛围编码的能力","专注于系统设计和架构"],"ja":["IDEコードとバイブコードの機能が必要","システム設計とアーキテクチャに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["IDE 코드 및 바이브 코드 기능이 필요","시스템 설계 및 아키텍처에 초점"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de codificación IDE y codificación de vibraciones","Se centra en el diseño y la arquitectura del sistema"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de codage IDE et de codage de vibrations","Se concentre sur la conception et l''architecture du système"],"de":["Benötigt IDE-Codier- und Vibro-Codierfähigkeiten","Konzentriert sich auf Systemdesign und Architektur"],"pt":["Exige capacidades de codificação de IDE e codificação de vibe","Concentra-se em design e arquitetura de sistema"],"ru":["Требует возможностей кодирования в IDE и кодирования настроения","Сосредоточен на системном проектировании и архитектуре"],"ar":["يتطلب khảibilities من kodificación IDE و kodificación من المزاج","يركز على تصميم النظام والهندسة المعمارية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
