on de biomes","Variations et couches secondaires","Conception de rareté configurable"],"de":["Deterministische Biombänder","Kompatibilität mit globalen Welten","Strenge Regeln für die Biome-Generierung","Sekundäre Varianten und Ebenen","Konfigurierbare Raritätsauslegung"],"pt":["Bandas de biomas determinísticas baseadas em latitude","Mundos em estilo de globo","Compatibilidade com Minecraft Fabric","Regras estritas para geração de biomas","Variáveis e sobreposições secundárias"],"ru":["Определенные полосы биомов на основе широты","Глобальные миры","Совместимость с Minecraft Fabric","Строгие правила для генерации биомов","Второстепенные варианты и наложения"],"ar":["حزم حيوية محددة بشكل محدد على أساس خط العرض","عيون العالم على شكل كرة","التوافق مع فابريك ماين كرافت","قواعد صارمة لتوليد البيئات","متغيرات وطبقات ثانوية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft Fabric","Latitude Biome Authority","Vanilla Minecraft","Minecraft","Fabric","Biome","Latitude"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabric","Latitude Biome Authority","Vanilla Minecraft","Minecraft","Fabric","Biome","Latitude"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric","Latitude Biome Authority","Vanilla Minecraft","Minecraft","Fabric","Biome","Latitude"],"es":["Minecraft mod","Latitude Biome Authority","biomas determinísticos","mundos de estilo global","Minecraft Fabric","generación de biomas"],"fr":["mod Minecraft","Latitude Biome Authority","biomes déterministes","mondes de style global","Minecraft Fabric","génération de biomes"],"de":["Minecraft-Mod","Latitude Biome Authority","deterministische Biome","globale Welten","Minecraft Fabric","Biome-Generierung"],"pt":["Minecraft Fabric","Latitude Biome Authority","bandas de biomas","mundos em estilo de globo","biomas determinísticas","regras de geração de biomas","variáveis e sobreposições","mod Minecraft"],"ru":["Minecraft Fabric","Latitude Biome Authority","полосы биомов","глобальные миры","определенные биомы","правила генерации биомов","второстепенные варианты и наложения","мод Minecraft"],"ar":["فابريك ماين كرافت","latitude-biome-authority","حزم حيوية","عيون العالم على شكل كرة","بيئات محددة بشكل محدد","قواعد توليد البيئات","متغيرات وطبقات ثانوية","تعديل ماين كرافت"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"latitude","repoPath":"joolbits/latitude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"latitude-biome-authority","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Latitude Biome Authority — Vanilla Minecraft (Java 1.21.11)\n_Generated: 2026-01-31_\n\n## RULES (MANDATORY)\n- Every vanilla biome listed here **must exist** in at least one valid generation path.\n- Windsurf must **never invent, remove, or reassign** biomes outside this table.\n- If a biome is missing in-world, the cause is **tag omission or logic error**, not intentional rarity.\n- **Latitude bands are authoritative**; variants and overlays are secondary.\n- **Rarity is a design knob**, not a proba","body":"# Latitude Biome Authority — Vanilla Minecraft (Java 1.21.11)\n_Generated: 2026-01-31_\n\n## RULES (MANDATORY)\n- Every vanilla biome listed here **must exist** in at least one valid generation path.\n- Windsurf must **never invent, remove, or reassign** biomes outside this table.\n- If a biome is missing in-world, the cause is **tag omission or logic error**, not intentional rarity.\n- **Latitude bands are authoritative**; variants and overlays are secondary.\n- **Rarity is a design knob**, not a probability guarantee.\n- Caves, rivers, oceans, Nether, and End biomes are **not latitude-decided unless explicitly stated**.\n- Mountain / peak biomes are **overlays** and may restrict placement but **must not override latitude truth**.\n\n---\n\n## Latitude Bands\n\n* **Equator** — hottest + wettest  \n* **Tropics** — hot + wet-ish  \n* **Arid** — hot + dry  \n* **Temperate** — mild  \n* **Subpolar** — cold  \n* **Polar** — coldest  \n\n**Overlay: Mountain / Peaks**  \nOnly allowed when “mountainness” is true (height, slope, or climate params), regardless of latitude.\n\n---\n\n## Plains / general land\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Plains | Temperate | Common | Core mid-latitude flatland. |\n| Sunflower Plains | Temperate | Rare | Rare plains variant. |\n| Savanna | Arid ↔ Tropics | Uncommon | Warm transition biome. |\n| Savanna Plateau | Arid / Tropics | Uncommon | Highland warm biome. |\n| Snowy Plains | Subpolar | Common | Main cold flatland. |\n| Ice Spikes | Polar | Very rare | Cold extreme. |\n| Mushroom Fields | Any (special) | Very rare | Special-case island biome; not latitude-driven. |\n\n---\n\n## Forests / woodlands\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Forest | Temperate | Common | |\n| Birch Forest | Temperate | Common | |\n| Flower Forest | Temperate | Rare | Discovery biome. |\n| Dark Forest | Temperate | Uncommon | Dense canopy. |\n| Old Growth Birch Forest | Temperate | Rare | Large birch variant. |\n| Taiga | Temperate-high → Subpolar-low | Common | Key transition biome. |\n| Old Growth Pine Taiga | Temperate-high → Subpolar | Uncommon | |\n| Old Growth Spruce Taiga | Subpolar | Uncommon | |\n| Snowy Taiga | Subpolar | Uncommon | |\n| Pale Garden | Temperate (rare) | Very rare | Dark-forest-adjacent oddity. |\n\n---\n\n## Jungle family (warm + wet)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Jungle | Equator / Tropics | Uncommon | Dense near equator. |\n| Bamboo Jungle | Equator / Tropics | Rare | |\n| Sparse Jungle | Tropics | Uncommon | Transition biome. |\n| Mangrove Swamp | Equator / Tropics | Rare | Must not appear in cool bands. |\n\n---\n\n## Swamps / wetlands\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Swamp | Tropics ↔ Temperate-low | Uncommon | Warm temperate transition. |\n| Mangrove Swamp | Equator / Tropics | Rare | Warm-only swamp. |\n\n---\n\n## Sandy / dry / badlands\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Desert | Arid | Uncommon | |\n| Badlands | Arid | Rare | |\n| Wooded Badlands | Arid | Rare | |\n| Eroded Badlands | Arid | Very rare | Extreme terrain. |\n\n---\n\n## Mountains / highlands (overlay-only)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Meadow | Temperate (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n| Grove | Temperate-high / Subpolar (overlay) | Uncommon | Must be explicitly preserved. |\n| Cherry Grove | Temperate (overlay) | Rare | |\n| Windswept Hills | Temperate (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n| Windswept Forest | Temperate (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n| Windswept Gravelly Hills | Temperate (overlay) | Rare | |\n| Windswept Savanna | Arid / Tropics (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n| Stony Peaks | Arid / Tropics / Temperate (overlay) | Rare | |\n| Jagged Peaks | Subpolar / Polar (overlay) | Rare | |\n| Frozen Peaks | Subpolar / Polar (overlay) | Rare | |\n| Snowy Slopes | Subpolar / Polar (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n| Stony Shore | Any (adjacency overlay) | Uncommon | Mountains touching ocean only. |\n\n---\n\n## Caves (not latitude-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Lush Caves | Any | Uncommon | |\n| Dripstone Caves | Any | Uncommon | |\n| Deep Dark | Any | Rare | |\n\n---\n\n## Beaches / shores (adjacency-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Beach | Equator / Tropics / Arid / Temperate | Common | |\n| Snowy Beach | Subpolar / Polar | Uncommon | |\n| Stony Shore | Any (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n\n---\n\n## Rivers (temperature-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| River | Equator / Tropics / Arid / Temperate | Common | |\n| Frozen River | Subpolar / Polar | Uncommon | |\n\n---\n\n## Oceans (temperature-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Warm Ocean | Equator / Tropics | Uncommon | |\n| Lukewarm Ocean | Tropics / Temperate-low | Uncommon | |\n| Ocean | Temperate | Common | |\n| Cold Ocean | Subpolar | Uncommon | |\n| Frozen Ocean | Polar | Uncommon | |\n| Deep Lukewarm Ocean | Depth overlay | Uncommon | |\n| Deep Ocean | Depth overlay | Uncommon | |\n| Deep Cold Ocean | Depth overlay | Uncommon | |\n| Deep Frozen Ocean | Depth overlay | Uncommon | |\n\n---\n\n## The Nether (not latitude-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Nether Wastes | N/A | Common |\n| Crimson Forest | N/A | Common |\n| Warped Forest | N/A | Common |\n| Soul Sand Valley | N/A | Uncommon |\n| Basalt Deltas | N/A | Uncommon |\n\n---\n\n## The End (not latitude-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| The End | N/A | Special |\n| End Highlands | N/A | Common |\n| End Midlands | N/A | Common |\n| End Barrens | N/A | Common |\n| Small End Islands | N/A | Uncommon |\n| The Void | N/A | Special |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:54:26.741Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Minecraft Modding Agents needing deterministic latitude-based biome generation for globe-style worlds.","zh":"非常适合需要基于纬度确定性生物群落生成的Minecraft模组代理，用于球形世界。","ja":"Minecraft Moddingエージェントが、グローブスタイルの世界で緯度ベースのバイオーム生成を決定的に行う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"지구형 세계에서 위도 기반 바이오ーム 생성을 결정적으로 수행해야 하는 Minecraft 모딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modificación de Minecraft que necesitan una generación de biomas determinista basada en latitud para mundos de estilo global.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modification de Minecraft nécessitant une génération de biomes déterministe basée sur la latitude pour des mondes de style globe.","de":"Perfekt für Minecraft-Modding-Agents, die eine deterministische, latitudenbasierte Biomgenerierung für globale Welten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modding do Minecraft que necessitam de geração de biomas baseada em latitude determinística para mundos em estilo de globo.","ru":"Идеально для агентов моддинга Minecraft, которым требуется определённая генерация биомов на основе широты для миров в стиле глобуса.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تعديل ماين كرافت الذي يحتاج إلى توليد بيئات محددة بالخط العرض للعالم على غرار الكرة الأرضية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce authoritative latitude bands, ensuring vanilla biomes exist in at least one valid generation path, with Windsurf integration for consistent biome handling, using Java 1.21.11 and Minecraft Fabric mod.","zh":"赋予代理强制执行权威的纬度带，确保在至少一种有效的生成路径中存在原版生物群落，并集成了Windsurf以进行一致的生物群落处理，使用Java 1.21.11和Minecraft Fabric模组。","ja":"エージェントが権威のある緯度帯を強制実行できるようにし、少なくとも1つの有効な生成パスにバニラバイオームが存在することを保証し、Windsurfを統合して一貫したバイオーム処理を実現し、Java 1.21.11とMinecraft Fabric modを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 권위적인 위도帶을 강제로 실행할 수 있도록 하여 최소한 하나의 유효한 생성 경로에서 바닐라 바이오ーム이 존재하도록 보장하고, 일관된 바이오ーム 처리를 위해 Windsurf를 통합하여 Java 1.21.11과 Minecraft Fabric 모드를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar bandas de latitud autorizadas, garantizando que los biomas de vanilla existan en al menos una ruta de generación válida, con integración de Windsurf para un manejo de biomas coherente, utilizando Java 1.21.11 y el mod de Minecraft Fabric.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des bandes de latitude autoritaires, garantissant que les biomes de vanilla existent dans au moins un chemin de génération valide, avec une intégration de Windsurf pour une gestion de biomes cohérente, en utilisant Java 1.21.11 et le mod Minecraft Fabric.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, autoritative Breitenbänder durchzusetzen, um sicherzustellen, dass Vanilla-Biome in mindestens einem gültigen Generierungspfad existieren, mit Windsurf-Integration für konsistentes Biome-Handling, unter Verwendung von Java 1.21.11 und dem Minecraft Fabric-Mod.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor faixas de latitude autoritárias, garantindo que biomas vanilla existam em pelo menos um caminho de geração válido, com integração do Windsurf para manipulação de biomas consistente, usando Java 1.21.11 e mod do Minecraft Fabric.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью устанавливать авторитетные широтные полосы, гарантируя, что ванильные биомы существуют хотя бы в одном допустимом пути генерации, с интеграцией Windsurf для последовательной обработки биомов, используя Java 1.21.11 и мод Minecraft Fabric.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من فرض حزم خط عرض مسؤولة، مما يضمن وجود بيئات فانيللا على الأقل في مسار صالحة للتوليد، مع دمج Windsurf لمعالجة البيئات الثابتة، باستخدام Java 1.21.11 و تعديل Fabric الخاص بماين كرافت."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating deterministic latitude-based biome bands for custom Minecraft maps","Ensuring consistent biome placement across different world generations","Debugging tag omission or logic errors causing missing biomes in-world"],"zh":["为自定义Minecraft地图生成确定性的纬度基于生物群落带","在不同世界生成中确保一致的生物群落放置","调试标签省略或逻辑错误导致生物群落在世界中缺失"],"ja":["カスタムMinecraftマップの決定的な緯度ベースのバイオーム帯を生成する","異なるワールド生成間で一貫したバイオーム配置を確保する","バイオームがワールド内で欠けている原因となるタグの省略または論理エラーをデバッグする"],"ko":["사용자 지정 Minecraft 맵에 대해 결정적인 위도 기반 바이오ーム 띠를 생성합니다.","다른 세계 생성 간에 일관된 바이오ーム 배치를 보장합니다.","세계에서 바이오ーム가 누락되도록 하는 태그 생략 또는 논리 오류를 디버깅합니다."],"es":["Generación de bandas de biomas deterministas basadas en latitud para mapas personalizados de Minecraft","Garantizar una colocación de biomas coherente en diferentes generaciones de mundos","Depuración de omisiones de etiquetas o errores de lógica que causan biomas perdidos en el mundo"],"fr":["Génération de bandes de biomes déterministes basées sur la latitude pour des cartes Minecraft personnalisées","Assurer un placement de biomes cohérent dans différentes générations de mondes","Débogage des omissions de balises ou des erreurs de logique provoquant des biomes manquants dans le monde"],"de":["Generierung deterministischer, latitudenbasierter Biom-Bänder für benutzerdefinierte Minecraft-Karten","Sicherstellung einer konsistenten Biome-Platzierung in verschiedenen Weltgenerierungen","Fehlerbehebung bei fehlenden Tags oder Logikfehlern, die zu fehlenden Biomen in der Welt führen"],"pt":["Gerar faixas de biomas baseadas em latitude determinísticas para mapas personalizados do Minecraft","Garantir a colocação consistente de biomas em diferentes gerações de mundos","Depurar a omissão de tags ou erros de lógica que causam biomas ausentes no mundo"],"ru":["Генерировать определённые биомы на основе широты для пользовательских карт Minecraft","Обеспечивать последовательное размещение биомов в разных генерациях миров","Отлаживать пропуски тегов или ошибки логики, вызывающие отсутствие биомов в мире"],"ar":["توليد حزم بيئات محددة بالخط العرض للخرائط المخصصة في ماين كرافت","ضمان وضع البيئات بشكل متسق عبر مختلف إصدارات العالم","تصحيح أخطاء إغفال العلامات أو أخطاء المنطق التي تسبب في عدم وجود بيئات في العالم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Minecraft Fabric mod and Java 1.21.11","Limited to vanilla biomes, with no invention, removal, or reassignment allowed","Latitude bands take priority over variants and overlays"],"zh":["需要Minecraft Fabric模组和Java 1.21.11","仅限于原版生物群落，不允许发明、删除或重新分配","纬度带优先于变体和叠加层"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabric modとJava 1.21.11が必要","バニラバイオームのみに限定され、発明、削除、または再割り当ては許可されない","緯度帯がバリアントやオーバーレイよりも優先される"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드 및 Java 1.21.11이 필요합니다.","바닐라 바이오ーム에만 적용되며, 발명, 삭제 또는 재할당은 허용되지 않습니다.","위도带이 변형 및 오버레이보다 우선합니다."],"es":["Requiere el mod de Minecraft Fabric y Java 1.21.11","Limitado a biomas de vanilla, sin invención, eliminación o reasignación permitida","Las bandas de latitud tienen prioridad sobre variantes y superposiciones"],"fr":["Nécessite le mod Minecraft Fabric et Java 1.21.11","Limité aux biomes de vanilla, sans invention, suppression ou réaffectation autorisée","Les bandes de latitude ont la priorité sur les variantes et les superpositions"],"de":["Erfordert den Minecraft Fabric-Mod und Java 1.21.11","Begrenzt auf Vanilla-Biome, ohne Erfindung, Entfernung oder Neuweisung erlaubt","Breitenbänder haben Vorrang vor Varianten und Überlagerungen"],"pt":["Exige o mod do Minecraft Fabric e Java 1.21.11","Limitado a biomas vanilla, sem invenção, remoção ou reatribuição permitida","Faixas de latitude têm prioridade sobre variantes e sobreposições"],"ru":["Требует мода Minecraft Fabric и Java 1.21.11","Ограничен ванильными биомами, без изобретения, удаления или переназначения","Широтные полосы имеют приоритет над вариантами и наложениями"],"ar":["يتطلب تعديل Fabric الخاص بماين كرافت و Java 1.21.11","محدود بالبيئات الفانيللا، دون اختراع أو إزالة أو إعادة تعيين","أحزمة خط العرض لها أهمية على المتغيرات والتعديلات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
