cluyendo la optimización de imágenes y la configuración de docker-compose.","fr":"Ce skill fournit les meilleures pratiques pour la conteneurisation avec Docker, y compris l''optimisation des images et la configuration de docker-compose.","de":"Dieses Skill bietet die besten Praktiken für die Containerisierung mit Docker, einschließlich der Optimierung von Images und der Konfiguration von docker-com...","pt":"Este skill fornece as melhores práticas para containerização com Docker, incluindo builds multi-estágio e otimização de imagens.","ru":"Этот навык предоставляет лучшие практики для контейнеризации с помощью Docker, включая многоэтапную сборку и оптимизацию образов.","ar":"यह المهارة توفر أفضل الممارسات لتحويل البرمجيات إلى حاويات مع دوكر، بما في ذلك عمليات البناء متعددة المراحل وتحسين الصور.","en":"Agent kit skill for IDE coding and vibe coding"},"definition":{"en":"Agent kit skill for IDE coding and vibe coding"},"features":{"zh":["Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker"],"ja":["Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker"],"ko":["Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker"],"es":["Mejores prácticas para la creación de Dockerfiles","Optimización de imágenes de contenedores","Configuración de docker-compose","Uso de construcciones multi-etapa","Minimización del tamaño de la imagen final"],"fr":["Meilleures pratiques pour la création de Dockerfiles","Optimisation des images de conteneurs","Configuration de docker-compose","Utilisation de constructions multi-étapes","Minimisation de la taille de l''image finale"],"de":["Beste Praktiken für die Erstellung von Dockerfiles","Optimierung von Container-Images","Konfiguration von docker-compose","Verwendung von Multi-Stage-Builds","Minimierung der Größe des finalen Images"],"pt":["Builds multi-estágio para minimizar o tamanho da imagem final","Otimização de imagens para melhorar a eficiência","Configurações de docker-compose para orquestração de contêineres","Melhores práticas para criação e modificação de Dockerfiles","Redução do tamanho da imagem final para melhorar a eficiência"],"ru":["Многоэтапная сборка для минимизации размера окончательного образа","Оптимизация образов для повышения эффективности","Конфигурации docker-compose для оркестровки контейнеров","Лучшие практики для создания и модификации Dockerfiles","Сокращение размера окончательного образа для повышения эффективности"],"ar":["عمليات البناء متعددة المراحل لتقليل حجم الصورة النهائية","تحسين الصور لتحسين الكفاءة","إعدادات دوكر-كومبوز لتنسيق الحاويات","أفضل الممارسات لإنشاء وتعديل ملفات دوكر","تقليل حجم الصورة النهائية لتحسين الكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DevOps Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker"],"ja":["DevOps Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker"],"ko":["DevOps Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker","Docker"],"es":["DevOps","Docker","contenerización","docker-compose","optimización de imágenes","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","deploy de aplicaciones"],"fr":["DevOps","Docker","conteneurisation","docker-compose","optimisation des images","meilleures pratiques","développement d''applications","déploiement d''applications"],"de":["DevOps","Docker","Containerisierung","docker-compose","Optimierung von Images","beste Praktiken","Anwendungsentwicklung","Anwendungseinsatz"],"pt":["DevOps","Docker","containerização","builds multi-estágio","otimização de imagens","docker-compose","Dockerfiles"],"ru":["DevOps","Docker","контейнеризация","многоэтапная сборка","оптимизация образов","docker-compose","Dockerfiles"],"ar":["ديفوبس","دوكر","تحويل البرمجيات إلى حاويات","عمليات البناء متعددة المراحل","تحسين الصور","دوكر-كومبوز","ملفات دوكر"]}},"owner":"teodevlor","repo":"agent-kit-skill","repoPath":"teodevlor/agent-kit-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.482Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"devops-docker","description":"Docker containerization best practices. Use when creating Dockerfiles or docker-compose configurations.","bodyPreview":"# DevOps Docker Standards\n\nThis skill provides Docker containerization best practices.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when creating or modifying Dockerfiles\n- Use this skill when setting up docker-compose configurations\n- Use this skill when optimizing container images\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Dockerfile Best Practices\n\n#### Multi-Stage Builds (Mandatory)\nALWAYS use multi-stage builds to minimize final image size.\n\n```dockerfile\n# Stage 1: Builder\nFROM node:20-alpine AS builder\n\nWORKDIR /app","body":"# DevOps Docker Standards\n\nThis skill provides Docker containerization best practices.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when creating or modifying Dockerfiles\n- Use this skill when setting up docker-compose configurations\n- Use this skill when optimizing container images\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Dockerfile Best Practices\n\n#### Multi-Stage Builds (Mandatory)\nALWAYS use multi-stage builds to minimize final image size.\n\n```dockerfile\n# Stage 1: Builder\nFROM node:20-alpine AS builder\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm ci\n\nCOPY . .\nRUN npm run build\n\n# Stage 2: Runner\nFROM node:20-alpine AS runner\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\nENV NODE_ENV=production\n\n# Create non-root user\nRUN addgroup --system --gid 1001 nodejs\nRUN adduser --system --uid 1001 appuser\n\nCOPY --from=builder /app/dist ./dist\nCOPY --from=builder /app/node_modules ./node_modules\n\nUSER appuser\n\nEXPOSE 3000\n\nCMD [\"node\", \"dist/main.js\"]\n```\n\n#### Base Images\n- Use `alpine` or `slim` versions (e.g., `node:20-alpine`).\n- **NEVER** use `:latest` tag.\n- Pin specific versions for reproducibility.\n\n```dockerfile\n# Good\nFROM node:20.10.0-alpine\n\n# Bad\nFROM node:latest\n```\n\n#### User Permissions\nImplement a non-root user for security.\n\n```dockerfile\nRUN addgroup --system --gid 1001 appgroup\nRUN adduser --system --uid 1001 appuser\nUSER appuser\n```\n\n### 2. Layer Optimization\n\nOrder instructions from least to most frequently changed.\n\n```dockerfile\n# Good order (least changed first)\nFROM node:20-alpine\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Dependencies change less often\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm ci --only=production\n\n# Source changes more often\nCOPY . .\n\nCMD [\"node\", \"index.js\"]\n```\n\n### 3. .dockerignore (Mandatory)\n\nCreate `.dockerignore` to exclude unnecessary files.\n\n```\n# .dockerignore\n.git\n.gitignore\nnode_modules\nnpm-debug.log\nDockerfile\ndocker-compose*.yml\n.env\n.env.*\n*.md\n.vscode\n.idea\ncoverage\ndist\n.next\n```\n\n### 4. Docker Compose\n\n```yaml\n# docker-compose.yml\nversion: ''3.8''\n\nservices:\n  api:\n    container_name: myapp-api\n    build:\n      context: .\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:3000\"\n    environment:\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n      - DATABASE_URL=${DATABASE_URL}\n    depends_on:\n      db:\n        condition: service_healthy\n    networks:\n      - app-network\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  db:\n    container_name: myapp-db\n    image: postgres:15-alpine\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_USER: ${DB_USER}\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${DB_PASSWORD}\n      POSTGRES_DB: ${DB_NAME}\n    volumes:\n      - postgres-data:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U ${DB_USER}\"]\n      interval: 10s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 5\n    networks:\n      - app-network\n\nnetworks:\n  app-network:\n    driver: bridge\n\nvolumes:\n  postgres-data:\n```\n\n### 5. Key Docker Compose Rules\n\n- **Naming:** Explicitly name containers (`container_name: my-app-api`).\n- **Networks:** Define a custom bridge network; do not use the default.\n- **Healthchecks:** Define for dependent services.\n- **Volumes:** Use named volumes for data persistence.\n- **Restart Policy:** Use `unless-stopped` or `always`.\n\n### 6. Environment Variables\n\nNever hardcode secrets. Use `.env` file passing.\n\n```yaml\n# docker-compose.yml\nservices:\n  api:\n    env_file:\n      - .env\n    environment:\n      # Override or add specific vars\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n```\n\nCreate `.env.example` for documentation:\n\n```\n# .env.example\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/mydb\nJWT_SECRET=your-secret-here\n```\n\n### 7. Production Checklist\n\n- [ ] Multi-stage build used\n- [ ] Non-root user configured\n- [ ] Specific image versions (no `:latest`)\n- [ ] .dockerignore present\n- [ ] Health checks defined\n- [ ] Resource limits set (optional but recommended)\n- [ ] Secrets not hardcoded\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:54:19.533Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing advanced Docker containerization and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Docker容器化和优化能力的Cloud Agent。","ja":"高度なDockerコンテナ化および最適化機能を必要とするCloud Agentに最適です。","ko":"고급 Docker 컨테이너화 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 Cloud Agent에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Cloud que necesitan capacidades de contenedorización y optimización de Docker avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant des capacités de conteneurisation et d''optimisation de Docker avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die erweiterte Docker-Containerisierungs- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de contêinerização e otimização do Docker.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих расширенных возможностей контейнеризации и оптимизации Docker.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحاب الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين وعملية حاويات الدوكر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create efficient Dockerfiles using multi-stage builds, optimize container images, and setup docker-compose configurations for seamless deployment and management of containerized applications, leveraging Docker best practices and standards.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用多阶段构建的高效Dockerfile的能力，优化容器镜像，并为无缝部署和管理容器化应用程序设置docker-compose配置，利用Docker最佳实践和标准。","ja":"エージェントに、マルチステージビルドを使用した効率的なDockerfileの作成、コンテナイメージの最適化、およびコンテナ化アプリケーションのシームレスなデプロイと管理のためのdocker-compose構成の設定を行う機能を提供し、Dockerのベストプラクティスと規格を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 다단계 빌드를 사용하여 효율적인 Dockerfile을 생성하고 컨테이너 이미지를 최적화하며 컨테이너화된 애플리케이션의 무중단 배포 및 관리를 위한 docker-compose 구성 설정을 할 수 있도록 하며, Docker 최고 사례 및 표준을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear Dockerfiles eficientes utilizando construcciones de varias etapas, optimizar imágenes de contenedores y configurar configuraciones de docker-compose para una implementación y administración sin problemas de aplicaciones contenerizadas, aprovechando las mejores prácticas y estándares de Docker.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des Dockerfiles efficaces en utilisant des constructions multi-étapes, d''optimiser les images de conteneurs et de configurer les configurations de docker-compose pour un déploiement et une gestion sans problème d''applications conteneurisées, en exploitant les meilleures pratiques et les normes de Docker.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, effiziente Dockerfiles mit Hilfe von Mehrstufen-Builds zu erstellen, Container-Images zu optimieren und docker-compose-Konfigurationen für eine nahtlose Bereitstellung und Verwaltung von containterisierten Anwendungen einzurichten, wobei auf bewährte Docker-Praktiken und -Standards zurückgegriffen wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar Dockerfiles eficientes usando compilações em várias etapas, otimizar imagens de contêiner, e configurar configurações do docker-compose para implantação e gerenciamento sem interrupções de aplicativos contêinerizados, aproveitando as melhores práticas e padrões do Docker.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать эффективные Dockerfiles, используя многостадийную сборку, оптимизировать образы контейнеров и настраивать конфигурации docker-compose для бесшовного развертывания и управления контейнеризированными приложениями, используя лучшие практики и стандарты Docker.","ar":"يُمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء ملفات دوفير hiệu quả باستخدام عمليات بناء متعددة المراحل وتحسين صور الحاويات وضبط تكوينات دوفير-كومبوز للنشر والإدارة السلسة لتطبيقات الحاويات، مستفيداً من أفضل الممارسات والمعايير لدوفير."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating optimized Dockerfiles for reduced image sizes","Setting up and managing docker-compose configurations for complex applications","Debugging and optimizing existing Docker container deployments"],"zh":["创建用于减小镜像大小的优化Dockerfile","为复杂应用程序设置和管理docker-compose配置","调试和优化现有的Docker容器部署"],"ja":["イメージサイズの削減のための最適化Dockerfileの作成","複雑なアプリケーションのためのdocker-compose構成の設定と管理","既存のDockerコンテナデプロイのデバッグと最適化"],"ko":["이미지 크기 감소를 위한 최적화된 Dockerfile 생성","복잡한 애플리케이션을 위한 docker-compose 구성 설정 및 관리","기존 Docker 컨테이너 배포의 디버깅 및 최적화"],"es":["Crear Dockerfiles optimizados para reducir el tamaño de las imágenes","Configurar y administrar configuraciones de docker-compose para aplicaciones complejas","Depurar y optimizar implementaciones de contenedores de Docker existentes"],"fr":["Créer des Dockerfiles optimisés pour réduire la taille des images","Configurer et gérer des configurations de docker-compose pour des applications complexes","Déboguer et optimiser les déploiements de conteneurs Docker existants"],"de":["Erstellen von optimierten Dockerfiles für reduzierte Bildgrößen","Einrichten und Verwalten von docker-compose-Konfigurationen für komplexe Anwendungen","Debuggen und Optimieren von bestehenden Docker-Container-Implementierungen"],"pt":["Criar Dockerfiles otimizados para reduzir o tamanho da imagem","Configurar e gerenciar configurações do docker-compose para aplicações complexas","Depurar e otimizar implantações de contêineres do Docker existentes"],"ru":["Создание оптимизированных Dockerfiles для уменьшения размера образа","Настройка и управление конфигурациями docker-compose для сложных приложений","Отладка и оптимизация существующих развертываний контейнеров Docker"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات دوفير مُحسنة لتقليل حجم الصورة","ضبط وإدارة تكوينات دوفير-كومبوز لتطبيقات معقدة","تصحيح أخطاء وتحسين عمليات نشر حاويات دوفير الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker installation and configuration","Limited to Docker containerization ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Docker的安装和配置","仅限于Docker容器化生态系统"],"ja":["Dockerのインストールと構成が必要","Dockerコンテナ化エコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["Docker 설치 및 구성이 필요","Docker 컨테이너화 생태계에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Docker","Limitado al ecosistema de contenedorización de Docker"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Docker","Limité à l''écosystème de conteneurisation de Docker"],"de":["Benötigt Docker-Installation und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf das Docker-Containerisierung-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Docker","Limitado ao ecossistema de contêinerização do Docker"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Docker","Ограничен экосистемой контейнеризации Docker"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت دوفير وتفصيله","محدود بنظام حاويات دوفير"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
