der Cloud","Kompatibilität mit Assistant Cloud"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de conversas múltiplas","Interface de usuário personalizável","Interface de usuário pré-construída","Operações CRUD de conversas","Integração com Assistant Cloud"],"ru":["Управление несколькими разговорами","Настраиваемый пользовательский интерфейс","Предварительно созданный пользовательский интерфейс","Операции CRUD разговоров","Интеграция с Assistant Cloud"],"ar":["إدارة محادثات متعددة","واجهة مستخدم مخصصة","واجهة مستخدم مُسبقة البناء","عمليات CRUD للمحادثات","التكامل مع Assistant Cloud"]},"keywords":{"zh":["thread-list","AI界面管理","多线程聊天","自定义UI","useChatRuntime","cloud","API"],"ja":["スレッドリスト","AIインターフェースの管理","複数のスレッド","カスタムUI","useChatRuntime","cloud","API"],"ko":["스레드 리스트","AI 사용자 인터페이스 관리","다중 스레드 채팅","사용자 지정 UI","useChatRuntime","cloud","API"],"es":["lista de hilos de conversación","interfaz de usuario de IA","gestión de conversaciones","operaciones CRUD","personalización de la interfaz","integración con la nube","Assistant Cloud","desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA"],"fr":["liste de threads de conversation","interface utilisateur d''IA","gestion de conversations","opérations CRUD","personnalisation de l''interface","intégration avec le cloud","Assistant Cloud","développement d''applications d''IA"],"de":["Thread-Liste","Benutzeroberfläche für KI","Konversationsverwaltung","CRUD-Operationen","Anpassung der Oberfläche","Integration mit der Cloud","Assistant Cloud","Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen"],"pt":["thread list","interface de usuário","conversas","assistant cloud","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de ia","gerenciamento de conversas"],"ru":["список потоков","пользовательский интерфейс","разговоры","assistant cloud","разработка программного обеспечения","технология ии","управление разговорами"],"ar":["قائمة الخيط","واجهة المستخدم","المحادثات","Assistant Cloud","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","إدارة المحادثات"]}},"owner":"ThinkEx-OSS","repo":"thinkex","repoPath":"ThinkEx-OSS/thinkex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"thread-list","description":"Guide for multi-thread management in assistant-ui. Use when implementing thread lists, switching threads, or managing conversation history.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui Thread List\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nManage multiple chat threads with built-in or custom UI.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/management.md](./references/management.md) -- Thread CRUD operations\n- [./references/custom-ui.md](./references/custom-ui.md) -- Custom thread list UI\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThread list is available with `useChatRuntime` + cloud:\n\n```tsx\nimport { AssistantCloud } from \"assistant-cloud\";\nim","body":"# assistant-ui Thread List\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nManage multiple chat threads with built-in or custom UI.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/management.md](./references/management.md) -- Thread CRUD operations\n- [./references/custom-ui.md](./references/custom-ui.md) -- Custom thread list UI\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThread list is available with `useChatRuntime` + cloud:\n\n```tsx\nimport { AssistantCloud } from \"assistant-cloud\";\nimport { useChatRuntime, AssistantChatTransport } from \"@assistant-ui/react-ai-sdk\";\nimport { AssistantRuntimeProvider, Thread, ThreadList } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nconst cloud = new AssistantCloud({\n  baseUrl: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSISTANT_BASE_URL,\n  authToken: async () => getAuthToken(),\n});\n\nfunction Chat() {\n  const runtime = useChatRuntime({\n    transport: new AssistantChatTransport({ api: \"/api/chat\" }),\n    cloud,\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <AssistantRuntimeProvider runtime={runtime}>\n      <div className=\"flex h-screen\">\n        <ThreadList className=\"w-64 border-r\" />\n        <Thread className=\"flex-1\" />\n      </div>\n    </AssistantRuntimeProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Thread Operations\n\n```tsx\nimport { useAssistantApi, useAssistantState } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nconst api = useAssistantApi();\nconst { threads, mainThreadId } = useAssistantState(s => s.threadList);\n\n// Switch to thread\napi.threads().switchToThread(threadId);\n\n// Create new thread\napi.threads().switchToNewThread();\n\n// Thread item operations\nconst item = api.threads().item({ id: threadId });\nawait item.rename(\"New Title\");\nawait item.archive();\nawait item.delete();\n```\n\n## Custom Thread List\n\n```tsx\nimport { ThreadListPrimitive, ThreadListItemPrimitive } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nfunction CustomThreadList() {\n  return (\n    <ThreadListPrimitive.Root className=\"w-64\">\n      <ThreadListPrimitive.New className=\"w-full p-2 bg-blue-500 text-white\">\n        + New Chat\n      </ThreadListPrimitive.New>\n\n      <ThreadListPrimitive.Items>\n        <ThreadListItemPrimitive.Root className=\"flex p-2 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n          <ThreadListItemPrimitive.Trigger className=\"flex-1\">\n            <ThreadListItemPrimitive.Title />\n          </ThreadListItemPrimitive.Trigger>\n          <ThreadListItemPrimitive.Archive>Archive</ThreadListItemPrimitive.Archive>\n          <ThreadListItemPrimitive.Delete>Delete</ThreadListItemPrimitive.Delete>\n        </ThreadListItemPrimitive.Root>\n      </ThreadListPrimitive.Items>\n    </ThreadListPrimitive.Root>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Without Cloud (Local)\n\n```tsx\nimport { useRemoteThreadListRuntime, InMemoryThreadListAdapter } from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n\nconst runtime = useRemoteThreadListRuntime({\n  adapter: new InMemoryThreadListAdapter(),\n  runtimeHook: () => useLocalRuntime({ model: myModel }),\n});\n```\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n**ThreadList not showing**\n- Pass `cloud` to runtime\n- Check authentication\n\n**Threads not persisting**\n- Verify cloud connection\n- Check network requests\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:55:08.893Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational AI Agents seeking to manage multiple chat threads with custom UI capabilities.","zh":"适合用于会话式人工智能代理，旨在使用自定义 UI 功能管理多个聊天线程。","ja":"カスタム UI 機能を使用して複数のチャットスレッドを管理することを目指した会話型 AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"커스텀 UI 기능을 사용하여 여러 채팅 스레드를 관리하려는 대화형 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Conversacional que buscan administrar varios hilos de chat con capacidades de interfaz de usuario personalizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Conversationnelle cherchant à gérer plusieurs threads de chat avec des capacités d''interface utilisateur personnalisées.","de":"Ideal für Conversationale KI-Agents, die mehrere Chat-Threads mit benutzerdefinierten UI-Funktionen verwalten möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Conversacional que buscam gerenciar múltiplas threads de chat com capacidades de UI personalizadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разговорного ИИ, стремящихся управлять несколькими потоками чата с возможностями настраиваемого UI.","ar":"مثالية لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المحادثات التي تهدف إلى إدارة عدة خيوط الدردشة مع القدرات على واجهة المستخدم المخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently handle thread CRUD operations using `useChatRuntime` and cloud integration, while also supporting custom thread list UI development with references to `management.md` and `custom-ui.md` documentation.","zh":"通过使用 `useChatRuntime` 和云集成，能够高效地处理线程 CRUD 操作，同时支持使用 `management.md` 和 `custom-ui.md` 文档参考自定义线程列表 UI 开发。","ja":"`useChatRuntime` とクラウド統合を使用してスレッド CRUD 操作を効率的に処理し、`management.md` と `custom-ui.md` ドキュメントの参照を使用してカスタムスレッドリスト UI 開発をサポートします。","ko":"`useChatRuntime`과 클라우드 통합을 사용하여 스레드 CRUD 작업을 효율적으로 처리同时 `management.md` 및 `custom-ui.md` 문서 참조를 사용하여 커스텀 스레드 목록 UI 개발을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes manejar de forma eficiente las operaciones CRUD de hilos utilizando `useChatRuntime` y la integración en la nube, y también admite el desarrollo de interfaces de usuario de lista de hilos personalizados con referencias a la documentación `management.md` y `custom-ui.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les opérations CRUD de threads à l''aide de `useChatRuntime` et de l''intégration cloud, tout en prenant en charge le développement d''interfaces utilisateur de liste de threads personnalisées avec des références à la documentation `management.md` et `custom-ui.md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Thread-CRUD-Operationen effizient mit `useChatRuntime` und Cloud-Integration zu verwalten, und unterstützt auch die Entwicklung benutzerdefinierter Thread-Listen-Oberflächen mit Verweisen auf die Dokumentation `management.md` und `custom-ui.md`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar de forma eficiente com operações CRUD de thread usando `useChatRuntime` e integração em nuvem, além de suportar o desenvolvimento de UI de lista de threads personalizados com referências à documentação `management.md` e `custom-ui.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно обрабатывать операции CRUD потока с помощью `useChatRuntime` и облачной интеграции, а также поддерживает разработку настраиваемого UI списка потоков с ссылками на документацию `management.md` и `custom-ui.md`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من التعامل بفعالية مع عمليات CRUD للخيط باستخدام `useChatRuntime` والتكامل السحابي، بالإضافة إلى دعم تطوير واجهة مستخدم مخصصة لقائمة الخيوط مع المراجع إلى وثائق `management.md` و `custom-ui.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing multiple chat threads with built-in UI","Creating custom thread list UI for enhanced user experience","Implementing thread CRUD operations for robust conversation management"],"zh":["使用内置 UI 管理多个聊天线程","为增强用户体验创建自定义线程列表 UI","实现线程 CRUD 操作以进行强大的会话管理"],"ja":["組み込み UI を使用して複数のチャットスレッドを管理する","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるためにカスタムスレッドリスト UI を作成する","強力な会話管理のためにスレッド CRUD 操作を実装する"],"ko":["내장 UI를 사용하여 여러 채팅 스레드를 관리","사용자 경험을 향상시키기 위해 커스텀 스레드 목록 UIを作成","강력한 대화 관리를 위해 스레드 CRUD 작업을 구현"],"es":["Administración de varios hilos de chat con interfaz de usuario integrada","Creación de una interfaz de usuario de lista de hilos personalizada para una experiencia del usuario mejorada","Implementación de operaciones CRUD de hilos para una gestión de conversaciones robusta"],"fr":["Gestion de plusieurs threads de chat avec interface utilisateur intégrée","Création d''une interface utilisateur de liste de threads personnalisée pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","Mise en œuvre d''opérations CRUD de threads pour une gestion de conversations robuste"],"de":["Verwaltung mehrerer Chat-Threads mit integrierter Benutzeroberfläche","Erstellung einer benutzerdefinierten Thread-Listen-Oberfläche für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Implementierung von Thread-CRUD-Operationen für eine robuste Konversationsverwaltung"],"pt":["Gerenciando múltiplas threads de chat com UI incorporada","Criando UI de lista de threads personalizados para experiência do usuário aprimorada","Implementando operações CRUD de thread para gerenciamento de conversa robusto"],"ru":["Управление несколькими потоками чата с встроенным UI","Создание настраиваемого UI списка потоков для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Реализация операций CRUD потока для надежного управления разговором"],"ar":["إدارة عدة خيوط الدردشة مع واجهة المستخدم المدمجة","إنشاء واجهة مستخدم مخصصة لقائمة الخيوط لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","تنفيذ عمليات CRUD للخيط لإدارة محادثة قوية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `useChatRuntime` and cloud setup","Must consult `assistant-ui.com/llms.txt` for latest API information"],"zh":["需要 `useChatRuntime` 和云设置","必须查阅 `assistant-ui.com/llms.txt` 以获取最新的 API 信息"],"ja":["`useChatRuntime` とクラウド設定が必要","最新の API 情報を取得するために `assistant-ui.com/llms.txt` を参照する必要があります"],"ko":["`useChatRuntime` 및 클라우드 설정이 필요","최신 API 정보를 얻으려면 `assistant-ui.com/llms.txt`를 참조해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere `useChatRuntime` y configuración en la nube","Debes consultar `assistant-ui.com/llms.txt` para obtener la información más reciente de la API"],"fr":["Nécessite `useChatRuntime` et configuration cloud","Vous devez consulter `assistant-ui.com/llms.txt` pour obtenir les informations les plus récentes sur l''API"],"de":["Benötigt `useChatRuntime` und Cloud-Konfiguration","Sie müssen `assistant-ui.com/llms.txt` konsultieren, um die neuesten API-Informationen zu erhalten"],"pt":["Exige `useChatRuntime` e configuração em nuvem","Deve consultar `assistant-ui.com/llms.txt` para obter as informações de API mais recentes"],"ru":["Требует `useChatRuntime` и облачной настройки","Должен консультироваться с `assistant-ui.com/llms.txt` для получения последней информации об API"],"ar":["يتطلب `useChatRuntime` وإعداد السحابي","يجب الاستشارة مع `assistant-ui.com/llms.txt` للحصول على أحدث المعلومات حول واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
