Integrationsmustern von MCP","Dokumentation von Anforderungen und Ausführungsplan"],"pt":["Transformação de requisitos vagos em planos concretos","Avaliação de riscos e estratégia de execução faseada","Documentação de requisitos e implementação RE-Engine","Integração com padrões de integração MCP","Respeito à arquitetura RE-Engine e restrições de implantação em produção"],"ru":["Преобразование неясных требований в конкретные планы","Оценка рисков и фазовая стратегия выполнения","Документация требований и реализации RE-Engine","Интеграция с шаблонами интеграции MCP","Учет архитектуры RE-Engine и ограничений развертывания в производстве"],"ar":["تحويل المتطلبات الغامضة إلى خطط واضحة","تقييم المخاطر واستراتيجية التنفيذ المتدرجة","توثيق المتطلبات وتنفيذ RE-Engine","التكامل مع أنماط التكامل MCP","احترام هندسة RE-Engine وقيود النشر في الإنتاج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MCP 变更计划","RE-Engine 实现计划","风险评估","文档要求","分阶段执行策略","MCP 集成模式"],"ja":["MCP 変更計画","RE-Engine 実装計画","リスク評価","文書化要件","分阶段的な実行戦略","MCP 統合パターン"],"ko":["MCP 변경 계획","RE-Engine 구현 세부 계획","위험 평가","문서화 요구 사항","단계적 실행 전략","MCP 통합 패턴"],"es":["plan de cambio MCP","implementación de requisitos","evaluación de riesgos","estrategia de ejecución","RE-Engine","MCP","integración de patrones","documentación de requisitos"],"fr":["plan de changement MCP","mise en œuvre des exigences","évaluation des risques","stratégie d''exécution","RE-Engine","MCP","intégration de modèles","documentation des exigences"],"de":["MCP-Änderungsplan","Umsetzung von Anforderungen","Risikobewertung","Ausführungsstrategie","RE-Engine","MCP","Integration von Mustern","Dokumentation von Anforderungen"],"pt":["mcp-change-plan","requisitos de usuário","planos de implementação","RE-Engine","integração MCP","avaliação de riscos","estratégia de execução","documentação de requisitos"],"ru":["MCP-смены плана","требования пользователя","планы реализации","RE-Engine","интеграция MCP","оценка рисков","фазовая стратегия выполнения","документация требований"],"ar":["خطة تغيير MCP","متطلبات المستخدم","خطط التنفيذ","RE-Engine","التكامل MCP","تقييم المخاطر","استراتيجية التنفيذ المتدرجة","توثيق المتطلبات"]}},"owner":"stackconsult","repo":"RE-Engine","repoPath":"stackconsult/RE-Engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp-change-plan","description":"A brief description, shown to the model to help it understand when to use this skill","bodyPreview":"---\nname: mcp-change-plan\ndescription: Transform user requirements into detailed, RE-Engine-specific implementation plans with risk assessment, phased execution strategy, and documentation requirements\n---\n\n# Purpose\nConvert vague requirements into concrete, actionable plans that respect RE-Engine''s architecture, MCP integration patterns, and production deployment constraints.\n\n# Inputs Required\n- User''s natural language goal or requirement\n- Current state documentation (from @mcp-repo-scan):","body":"---\nname: mcp-change-plan\ndescription: Transform user requirements into detailed, RE-Engine-specific implementation plans with risk assessment, phased execution strategy, and documentation requirements\n---\n\n# Purpose\nConvert vague requirements into concrete, actionable plans that respect RE-Engine''s architecture, MCP integration patterns, and production deployment constraints.\n\n# Inputs Required\n- User''s natural language goal or requirement\n- Current state documentation (from @mcp-repo-scan):\n  - `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`\n  - `docs/FLOWS.md`\n  - `docs/OPERATIONS.md`\n  - `docs/MCP_SERVERS.md`\n- Acceptance criteria (if provided by user)\n\n# Classification Phase\n\n## 1. Requirement Analysis\nAnalyze user''s goal and classify into one of these categories:\n\n**Feature Development:**\n- New outreach channel integration\n- Enhanced approval workflow\n- Additional automation capabilities\n- Dashboard enhancements\n- MCP tool additions\n\n**Bug Fix:**\n- Message delivery failures\n- UI state management issues\n- Data synchronization problems\n- Authentication/authorization flaws\n- External API integration errors\n\n**Refactoring:**\n- Code organization improvements\n- Performance optimization\n- Dependency updates\n- Technical debt reduction\n- Pattern standardization\n\n**MCP Integration:**\n- New MCP server development\n- MCP tool expansion\n- MCP client enhancements\n- Cross-server communication\n- Tool composition\n\n**Infrastructure:**\n- CI/CD pipeline improvements\n- Deployment automation\n- Monitoring and logging\n- Security hardening\n- Database migrations\n\n**Hybrid:**\n- Combination of above categories\n- Multi-phase initiatives\n\n## 2. Impact Assessment\nFor the classified requirement, determine:\n\n### Affected Components\n- List specific directories/files impacted\n- Identify which of: engine, web-dashboard, playwright, mcp/*, scripts\n\n### Flow Disruption\n- Which end-to-end flows are affected?\n- Will existing users experience downtime?\n- Are there data migration requirements?\n\n### MCP Integration Points\n- Which MCP servers/tools are involved?\n- Are new MCP tools needed?\n- Does this affect existing MCP client usage?\n\n### Risk Factors\n- **High Risk:** Authentication, payment/data integrity, external API changes\n- **Medium Risk:** UI changes, new features, performance optimizations\n- **Low Risk:** Documentation, minor refactors, test improvements\n\n### Breaking Changes\n- Will this break existing API contracts?\n- Does it require database migrations?\n- Are there external service dependencies?\n\n## 3. Constraints Identification\nIdentify any constraints that affect the plan:\n\n**Technical Constraints:**\n- TypeScript strict mode requirements\n- Existing patterns and conventions\n- Third-party API rate limits\n- Database schema limitations\n\n**Operational Constraints:**\n- CI/CD pipeline requirements\n- Security scanning must pass\n- Test coverage thresholds\n- Deployment windows\n\n**Business Constraints:**\n- Approval-first system requirements\n- Audit logging requirements\n- User notification needs\n\n# Planning Phase\n\n## 4. Phased Implementation Plan\nCreate detailed plan with numbered phases. Save to `plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md`.\n\n### Phase 1: Discovery & Design\n**Objective:** Fully understand requirements and design solution\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Clarify ambiguous requirements with user questions\n2. Review relevant documentation and existing code\n3. Design architecture for new feature/refactor\n4. Define data structures and API contracts\n5. Document design decisions and alternatives considered\n6. Get user sign-off on design\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Design document\n- API specifications (if applicable)\n- Database schema changes (if applicable)\n- User interface mockups (if applicable)\n\n### Phase 2: Implementation\n**Objective:** Build the solution incrementally with testing\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Set up development environment\n2. Create necessary directories and files\n3. Implement core functionality (minimal viable)\n4. Add unit tests for new code\n5. Integrate with existing components\n6. Test integration points\n7. Refine implementation based on testing\n\n**Component-Specific Steps:**\n- **Engine:** Implement business logic, API endpoints, service layers\n- **Web-Dashboard:** Create React components, state management, API calls\n- **Playwright:** Write automation scripts, test scenarios\n- **MCP Servers:** Define tool schemas, implement handlers, add tests\n- **Scripts:** Create deployment/utility scripts\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Implemented code\n- Unit tests\n- Integration test stubs\n\n### Phase 3: Testing\n**Objective:** Verify functionality and quality\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Run component unit tests: `npm test`\n2. Run integration tests: `npm run test:integration`\n3. Run end-to-end tests (if applicable): Playwright tests\n4. Verify TypeScript type-checking: `npm run typecheck`\n5. Run linting: `npm run lint`\n6. Fix any failures or warnings\n7. Verify test coverage meets requirements\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- All tests passing\n- Code quality metrics met\n- Test coverage report\n\n### Phase 4: Documentation\n**Objective:** Update all relevant documentation\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Update `docs/CHANGELOG.md` with changes\n2. Update `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` if structure changed\n3. Update `docs/FLOWS.md` if workflows changed\n4. Update `docs/MCP_SERVERS.md` for MCP changes\n5. Update inline code documentation\n6. Update API documentation (if applicable)\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Updated documentation files\n- Code comments where necessary\n\n### Phase 5: Deployment Preparation\n**Objective:** Prepare for production deployment\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Verify CI/CD pipeline compatibility\n2. Ensure security scans will pass\n3. Prepare deployment scripts\n4. Document deployment procedure\n5. Identify rollback plan\n6. Get final user approval\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Deployment checklist\n- Rollback procedure\n- User documentation (if applicable)\n\n## 5. Assumptions & Open Questions\nDocument any assumptions made and questions requiring user clarification:\n\n**Assumptions:**\n- [List all assumptions about requirements, data, integrations]\n\n**Open Questions:**\n- [List questions that need user answers before proceeding]\n\n**Breaking Changes:**\n- [List any breaking changes and migration paths]\n\n# Approval Phase\n\n## 6. Present Plan to User\nProvide complete plan with:\n- Classification and impact assessment\n- Phased implementation strategy\n- Time estimates (if possible)\n- Resource requirements\n- Risk mitigation strategies\n- Open questions requiring answers\n\n**Request user approval before proceeding to implementation.**\n\n# Post-Approval Actions\nIf user approves:\n- Proceed to Phase 1: Discovery & Design\n- Begin implementation per plan\n\nIf user requests changes:\n- Revise plan based on feedback\n- Re-present for approval\n\nIf user has questions:\n- Answer questions\n- Clarify requirements\n- Update plan as needed\nSupporting Files:\n\n.windsurf/skills/mcp-change-plan/plan-template.md\n\n.windsurf/skills/mcp-change-plan/feature-checklist.md\n\n.windsurf/skills/mcp-change-plan/bugfix-checklist.md\n\n.windsurf/skills/mcp-change-plan/refactor-checklist.md\n\n.windsurf/skills/mcp-change-plan/mcp-integration-checklist.md"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:55:20.438Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Architectural Agents requiring precise transformation of user requirements into RE-Engine-specific implementation plans","zh":"适用于需要将用户需求精确转换为RE-Engine特定实现计划的架构代理","ja":"アーキテクチャエージェントがユーザーの要件をRE-Engine特有の実装計画に正確に変換する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"사용자 요구 사항을 RE-Engine 특정 구현 계획으로 정확하게 변환해야 하는 아키텍처 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitectura que requieren una transformación precisa de los requisitos del usuario en planes de implementación específicos de RE-Engine","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''architecture nécessitant une transformation précise des exigences de l''utilisateur en plans d''implémentation spécifiques à RE-Engine","de":"Ideal für Architekturagenten, die eine präzise Umwandlung der Benutzeranforderungen in RE-Engine-spezifische Implementierungspläne erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitetura que requerem transformação precisa de requisitos do usuário em planos de implementação específicos do RE-Engine","ru":"Идеально для архитектурных агентов, требующих точного преобразования требований пользователя в планы реализации, специфичные для RE-Engine","ar":"مثالية لعميل الهندسة المعمارية التي تتطلب تحويل دقيق لمتطلبات المستخدم إلى خطط تنفيذ محددة ل RE-Engine"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert vague requirements into concrete, actionable plans respecting RE-Engine''s architecture, MCP integration patterns, and production deployment constraints, utilizing risk assessment and phased execution strategies","zh":"赋予代理将模糊的要求转换为具体的、可执行的计划的能力，尊重RE-Engine的架构、MCP集成模式和生产部署约束，利用风险评估和分阶段执行策略","ja":"RE-Engineのアーキテクチャ、MCP統合パターン、および生産デプロイの制約を尊重し、リスク評価と段階的実行戦略を使用して、エージェントが漠然とした要件を具体的で実行可能な計画に変換できるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 모호한 요구 사항을 구체적이고 실행 가능한 계획으로 변환할 수 있도록 하는 동시에 RE-Engine의 아키텍처, MCP 통합 패턴 및 프로덕션 배포 제약을 존중하고, 위험 평가 및 단계적 실행 전략을 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes convertir requisitos vagos en planes concretos y ejecutables que respetan la arquitectura de RE-Engine, los patrones de integración de MCP y las restricciones de implementación de producción, utilizando la evaluación de riesgos y estrategias de ejecución por fases","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des exigences vagues en plans concrets et exécutables respectant l''architecture de RE-Engine, les modèles d''intégration de MCP et les contraintes de déploiement de production, en utilisant l''évaluation des risques et les stratégies d''exécution par phases","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, vage Anforderungen in konkrete, ausführbare Pläne umzuwandeln, die die Architektur von RE-Engine, die Integrationsmuster von MCP und die Produktionsbereitstellungsbeschränkungen respektieren, unter Verwendung von Risikobewertung und phasenweiser Ausführungsstrategie","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter requisitos vagos em planos concretos e ações que respeitam a arquitetura do RE-Engine, padrões de integração do MCP e restrições de implantação de produção, utilizando avaliação de riscos e estratégias de execução faseada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать неясные требования в конкретные, осуществимые планы, уважающие архитектуру RE-Engine, шаблоны интеграции MCP и ограничения производственной развертки, используя оценку рисков и стратегии фазовой реализации","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تحويل متطلبات غامضة إلى خطط ملموسة وقابلة للتنفيذ التي تحترم هندسة RE-Engine وأنماط تكامل MCP وقيود النشر الإنتاجي، باستخدام تقييم المخاطر واستراتيجيات التنفيذ المرحلي"},"useCases":{"en":["Transforming natural language goals into detailed implementation plans","Assessing risks associated with user requirements","Generating phased execution strategies for complex projects"],"zh":["将自然语言目标转换为详细的实现计划","评估与用户需求相关的风险","为复杂项目生成分阶段的执行策略"],"ja":["自然言語の目標を詳細な実装計画に変換する","ユーザーの要件に関連するリスクを評価する","複雑なプロジェクトのための段階的実行戦略を生成する"],"ko":["자연어 목표를 상세한 구현 계획으로 변환하는 것","사용자 요구 사항과 관련된 위험을 평가하는 것","복잡한 프로젝트를 위한 단계적 실행 전략을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Transformar metas de lenguaje natural en planes de implementación detallados","Evaluar los riesgos asociados con los requisitos del usuario","Generar estrategias de ejecución por fases para proyectos complejos"],"fr":["Transformer des objectifs de langage naturel en plans d''implémentation détaillés","Évaluer les risques associés aux exigences de l''utilisateur","Générer des stratégies d''exécution par phases pour les projets complexes"],"de":["Natürliche Sprachziele in detaillierte Implementierungspläne umwandeln","Risiken im Zusammenhang mit den Benutzeranforderungen bewerten","Phasenweise Ausführungsstrategien für komplexe Projekte generieren"],"pt":["Transformar metas de linguagem natural em planos de implementação detalhados","Avaliar riscos associados a requisitos do usuário","Gerar estratégias de execução faseada para projetos complexos"],"ru":["Преобразовывать цели естественного языка в подробные планы реализации","Оценивать риски, связанные с требованиями пользователя","Генерировать стратегии фазовой реализации для сложных проектов"],"ar":["تحويل أهداف اللغة الطبيعية إلى خطط تنفيذ مفصلة","تقييم المخاطر المرتبطة بمتطلبات المستخدم","توليد استراتيجيات التنفيذ المرحلي للمشاريع المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user''s natural language goal or requirement as input","Needs current state documentation from @mcp-repo-scan","Specific to RE-Engine''s architecture and MCP integration patterns"],"zh":["需要用户的自然语言目标或要求作为输入","需要来自@mcp-repo-scan的当前状态文档","特定于RE-Engine的架构和MCP集成模式"],"ja":["ユーザーの自然言語の目標または要件を入力として必要とする","@mcp-repo-scanからの現在の状態ドキュメントが必要","RE-EngineのアーキテクチャとMCP統合パターンに特有"],"ko":["사용자의 자연어 목표 또는 요구 사항을 입력으로 필요로 함","@mcp-repo-scan에서 현재 상태 문서가 필요","RE-Engine의 아키텍처 및 MCP 통합 패턴에 특정"],"es":["Requiere como entrada la meta o requisito de lenguaje natural del usuario","Necesita la documentación del estado actual de @mcp-repo-scan","Es específico de la arquitectura de RE-Engine y los patrones de integración de MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite en entrée l''objectif ou l''exigence de langage naturel de l''utilisateur","A besoin de la documentation de l''état actuel de @mcp-repo-scan","Est spécifique à l''architecture de RE-Engine et aux modèles d''intégration de MCP"],"de":["Benötigt als Eingabe das natürliche Sprachziel oder die Anforderung des Benutzers","Benötigt die aktuelle Statusdokumentation von @mcp-repo-scan","Ist spezifisch für die Architektur von RE-Engine und die Integrationsmuster von MCP"],"pt":["Requer meta ou requisito de linguagem natural do usuário como entrada","Necessita de documentação do estado atual do @mcp-repo-scan","Específico para a arquitetura do RE-Engine e padrões de integração do MCP"],"ru":["Требует естественного языка пользователя или требования в качестве входных данных","Требует текущей документации от @mcp-repo-scan","Специфичен для архитектуры RE-Engine и шаблонов интеграции MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب هدف أو متطلب اللغة الطبيعية للمستخدم كمدخل","يحتاج إلى توثيق الحالة الراهنة من @mcp-repo-scan","محدد لهندسة RE-Engine وأنماط تكامل MCP"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
