 com o skill de padrões de projeto","Melhoria da produtividade e qualidade do código"],"ru":["Архитектура и шаблоны дизайна","Конвенции для контроллеров, сервисов и моделей","Разделение сложной логики бизнеса на классы сервиса","Интеграция с скиллом padrões de projeto","Повышение производительности и качества кода"],"ar":["الهندسة المعمارية وأنماط التصميم","اتفاقيات للمتحكمات والخدمات والنماذج","فصل منطق العمل المعقد في فئات الخدمة","التكامل مع مهارة معايير المشروع","تحسين الإنتاجية وجودة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Laravel 后端开发","后端开发规范","Laravel 项目开发","代码可维护性","代码可扩展性","服务层","控制器","服务","模型"],"ja":["Laravel バックエンド開発","バックエンド開発規約","Laravel プロジェクト開発","コードメンテナンス性","コード拡張性","サービス層","コントローラー","サービス","モデル"],"ko":["Laravel 백엔드 개발","백엔드 개발 규칙","Laravel 프로젝트 개발","코드 유지보수성","코드 확장성","서비스 계층","컨트롤러","서비스","모델"],"es":["Laravel backend","Desarrollo de backend","Convenciones de Laravel","Arquitectura de software","Patrones de diseño","Lógica de negocio"],"fr":["Laravel backend","Développement backend","Conventions Laravel","Architecture logicielle","Modèles de conception","Logique métier"],"de":["Laravel Backend","Backend-Entwicklung","Laravel-Konventionen","Software-Architektur","Entwurfsmuster","Geschäftslogik"],"pt":["desenvolvimento backend laravel","convenções de desenvolvimento","arquitetura e padrões de design","laravel backend development","produtividade e qualidade do código","controllers e services e models"],"ru":["разработка backend на laravel","конвенции разработки","архитектура и шаблоны дизайна","laravel backend разработка","производительность и качество кода","контроллеры и сервисы и модели"],"ar":["تطوير الخلفية لارافيل","اتفاقيات التطوير","الهندسة المعمارية وأنماط التصميم","لارافيل تطوير الخلفية","الإنتاجية وجودة الكود","المتحكمات والخدمات والنماذج"]}},"owner":"teodevlor","repo":"agent-kit-skill","repoPath":"teodevlor/agent-kit-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"backend-laravel","description":"Laravel PHP backend development conventions. Use when working on Laravel/PHP projects.","bodyPreview":"# Backend Laravel Conventions\n\nThis skill provides specific conventions for Laravel backend development.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when working on Laravel projects\n- Use this skill when creating new controllers, services, or models\n- This skill builds upon `project-standards` skill\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Architecture & Design Pattern\n\n#### Service Layer\nComplex Business Logic **MUST** be separated into Service Classes.\n- Path: `app/Services/{Name}Service.php`\n\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(stri","body":"# Backend Laravel Conventions\n\nThis skill provides specific conventions for Laravel backend development.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when working on Laravel projects\n- Use this skill when creating new controllers, services, or models\n- This skill builds upon `project-standards` skill\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Architecture & Design Pattern\n\n#### Service Layer\nComplex Business Logic **MUST** be separated into Service Classes.\n- Path: `app/Services/{Name}Service.php`\n\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nnamespace App\\Services;\n\nclass UserService\n{\n    public function __construct(\n        private readonly UserRepository $userRepository,\n    ) {}\n\n    public function createUser(array $data): User\n    {\n        // Business logic here\n        return $this->userRepository->create($data);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### Repository Pattern (Optional)\nUse when strict separation of DB query logic is needed.\n- Path: `app/Repositories/{Name}Repository.php`\n\n#### Form Request\n**MUST** use FormRequest to validate input.\n\n```php\n<?php\n\nnamespace App\\Http\\Requests;\n\nuse Illuminate\\Foundation\\Http\\FormRequest;\n\nclass CreateUserRequest extends FormRequest\n{\n    public function rules(): array\n    {\n        return [\n            ''email'' => [''required'', ''email'', ''unique:users''],\n            ''password'' => [''required'', ''min:8''],\n        ];\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Coding Style (PSR-12)\n\n- Strictly adhere to PSR-12.\n- Use **Strict Types** at the beginning of new PHP files.\n\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n```\n\n#### Naming\n- Controller: `UserController` (Singular)\n- Model: `User` (Singular)\n- Table: `users` (Plural)\n- Variable: `$camelCase`\n- Migration: `create_users_table`\n\n### 3. Controllers\n\nControllers should be thin - delegate to Services.\n\n```php\n<?php\n\nnamespace App\\Http\\Controllers;\n\nuse App\\Http\\Requests\\CreateUserRequest;\nuse App\\Services\\UserService;\n\nclass UserController extends Controller\n{\n    public function __construct(\n        private readonly UserService $userService,\n    ) {}\n\n    public function store(CreateUserRequest $request)\n    {\n        $user = $this->userService->createUser($request->validated());\n        \n        return response()->json([\n            ''success'' => true,\n            ''data'' => new UserResource($user),\n        ], 201);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Eloquent Best Practices\n\n#### Relationships over Query Builder\nPrioritize using Eloquent Relationships instead of manual Query Builder.\n\n```php\n// Good\n$user->orders()->where(''status'', ''pending'')->get();\n\n// Avoid\nDB::table(''orders'')->where(''user_id'', $user->id)->where(''status'', ''pending'')->get();\n```\n\n#### N+1 Problem\n**ALWAYS** Eager Load with `with()`.\n\n```php\n// Bad - N+1 problem\n$users = User::all();\nforeach ($users as $user) {\n    echo $user->profile->name; // N additional queries\n}\n\n// Good - Eager loading\n$users = User::with(''profile'')->get();\n```\n\n### 5. API Resource\nUse API Resource to transform data returned as JSON.\n\n```php\n<?php\n\nnamespace App\\Http\\Resources;\n\nuse Illuminate\\Http\\Resources\\Json\\JsonResource;\n\nclass UserResource extends JsonResource\n{\n    public function toArray($request): array\n    {\n        return [\n            ''id'' => $this->id,\n            ''email'' => $this->email,\n            ''created_at'' => $this->created_at->toIso8601String(),\n        ];\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 6. Testing\n- Feature Tests for API endpoints.\n- Unit Tests for Services and Repositories.\n\n```php\npublic function test_user_can_be_created(): void\n{\n    $response = $this->postJson(''/api/users'', [\n        ''email'' => ''test@example.com'',\n        ''password'' => ''password123'',\n    ]);\n\n    $response->assertStatus(201)\n        ->assertJsonStructure([''success'', ''data'' => [''id'', ''email'']]);\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:55:40.154Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for PHP-based AI Agents needing standardized Laravel backend development conventions.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化Laravel后端开发规范的PHP基于AI代理。","ja":"Laravelの標準的なバックエンド開発規約が必要なPHPベースのAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 Laravel 백엔드 개발 규약이 필요한 PHP 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en PHP que necesitan convenciones de desarrollo de backend de Laravel estandarizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur PHP nécessitant des conventions de développement de backend Laravel standardisées.","de":"Perfekt für PHP-basierte KI-Agents, die standardisierte Laravel-Backend-Entwicklungskonventionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em PHP que necessitam de convenções de desenvolvimento de backend padrão do Laravel.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе PHP, требующих стандартизированных соглашений по разработке бэкенда Laravel.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يستند إلى PHP والذي يحتاج إلى اتفاقيات خلفية لمطور لارافيل معيارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce Service Layer architecture and design patterns, utilizing PHP and Laravel''s service classes for complex business logic, and following specific conventions for controllers, services, and models.","zh":"赋予代理人实施服务层架构和设计模式的能力，利用PHP和Laravel的服务类来处理复杂的业务逻辑，并遵循控制器、服务和模型的特定约定。","ja":"エージェントにサービス層アーキテクチャとデザインパターンを実施する機能を与え、PHPとLaravelのサービスクラスを使用して複雑なビジネスロジックを処理し、コントローラー、サービス、モデルに特定の規約を遵守します。","ko":"에이전트에 서비스 層 아키텍처와 디자인 패턴을 구현할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 PHP와 Laravel의 서비스 클래스를 사용하여 복잡한 비즈니스 로직을 처리하고 컨트롤러, 서비스, 모델에 특정 규약을 준수합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes hacer cumplir la arquitectura de la Capa de Servicio y los patrones de diseño, utilizando las clases de servicio de PHP y Laravel para la lógica de negocio compleja, y siguiendo convenciones específicas para controladores, servicios y modelos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''imposer l''architecture de la Couche de Service et les modèles de conception, en utilisant les classes de service PHP et Laravel pour une logique métier complexe, et en suivant des conventions spécifiques pour les contrôleurs, les services et les modèles.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Service-Schicht-Architektur und Entwurfsmuster durchzusetzen, indem PHP und Lavarels Service-Klassen für komplexe Geschäftlogik verwendet werden und spezifische Konventionen für Controller, Services und Modelle befolgt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem a arquitetura da Camada de Serviços e padrões de design, utilizando classes de serviço do PHP e do Laravel para lógica de negócios complexa, e seguindo convenções específicas para controladores, serviços e modelos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать архитектуру Сервисного Слоя и шаблоны проектирования, используя сервисные классы PHP и Laravel для сложной бизнес-логики, а также следуя определенным соглашениям для контроллеров, сервисов и моделей.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تنفيذ عمارة طبقة الخدمة وأنماط التصميم، باستخدام فصول خدمة PHP و لارافيل للوظائف التجارية المعقدة، و اتباع اتفاقيات محددة للمتحكمات و الخدمات و النماذج."},"useCases":{"en":["Separating complex business logic into Service Classes","Creating new controllers, services, or models following Laravel conventions","Enforcing project standards in Laravel projects"],"zh":["将复杂的业务逻辑分离到服务类中","创建新的控制器、服务或模型以遵循Laravel约定","在Laravel项目中强制执行项目标准"],"ja":["複雑なビジネスロジックをサービスクラスに分離する","Laravelの規約に従って新しいコントローラー、サービス、またはモデルを作成する","Laravelプロジェクトでプロジェクト標準を強制する"],"ko":["복잡한 비즈니스 로직을 서비스 클래스로 분리한다","Laravel의 규약에 따라 새로운 컨트롤러, 서비스 또는 모델을 생성한다","Laravel 프로젝트에서 프로젝트 표준을 강제한다"],"es":["Separar la lógica de negocio compleja en Clases de Servicio","Crear nuevos controladores, servicios o modelos siguiendo las convenciones de Laravel","Hacer cumplir los estándares del proyecto en proyectos de Laravel"],"fr":["Séparer la logique métier complexe en Classes de Service","Créer de nouveaux contrôleurs, services ou modèles en suivant les conventions de Laravel","Faire respecter les normes du projet dans les projets Laravel"],"de":["Komplexe Geschäftlogik in Service-Klassen trennen","Erstellen neuer Controller, Services oder Modelle unter Einhaltung der Laravel-Konventionen","Durchsetzen der Projektnormen in Laravel-Projekten"],"pt":["Separar lógica de negócios complexa em Classes de Serviço","Criar novos controladores, serviços ou modelos seguindo as convenções do Laravel","Impor padrões de projeto nos projetos Laravel"],"ru":["Разделение сложной бизнес-логики на Сервисные Классы","Создание новых контроллеров, сервисов или моделей в соответствии с соглашениями Laravel","Внедрение стандартов проекта в проектах Laravel"],"ar":["فصل المنطق التجاري المعقد إلى فصول خدمية","إنشاء متحكمات وخدمات ونماذج جديدة تتبع اتفاقيات لارافيل","تطبيق معايير المشروع في مشاريع لارافيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Laravel project setup","PHP knowledge necessary","Laravel-specific conventions may not apply to other frameworks"],"zh":["需要Laravel项目设置","需要PHP知识","Laravel特定的约定可能不适用于其他框架"],"ja":["Laravelプロジェクトの設定が必要","PHPの知識が必要","Laravel特有の規約は他のフレームワークに適用できない可能性がある"],"ko":["Laravel 프로젝트 설정이 필요하다","PHP 지식이 필요하다","Laravel 특정 규약은 다른 프레임워크에 적용되지 않을 수 있다"],"es":["Requiere configuración del proyecto Laravel","Conocimiento de PHP necesario","Las convenciones específicas de Laravel pueden no aplicarse a otros frameworks"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Laravel","Connaissances de PHP nécessaires","Les conventions spécifiques de Laravel peuvent ne pas s''appliquer à d''autres frameworks"],"de":["Benötigt Laravel-Projektsetup","PHP-Kenntnisse erforderlich","Laravel-spezifische Konventionen können nicht auf andere Frameworks anwendbar sein"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto Laravel","Conhecimento de PHP necessário","As convenções específicas do Laravel podem não se aplicar a outros frameworks"],"ru":["Требуется настройка проекта Laravel","Необходимо знание PHP","Конкретные соглашения Laravel могут не применяться к другим фреймворкам"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع لارافيل","مطلوب معرفة بليب","اتفاقيات لارافيل المحددة قد لا تنطبق على إطارات عمل أخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
