aces frontend distintivas y de alta calidad, evitando estéticas genéricas","fr":"Ce skill guide la création d''interfaces frontend distinctives et de haute qualité, évitant les esthétiques génériques","de":"Dieser Skill leitet die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten und hochwertigen Frontend-Schnittstellen, vermeidet generische Ästhetik","pt":"Este skill ajuda a criar interfaces de usuário distintas e de produção, evitando estéticas genéricas","ru":"Этот навык помогает создавать уникальные и готовые к производству интерфейсы пользователя, избегая общих эстетических решений","ar":"هذا المهارة يساعد على إنشاء واجهات مستخدم متميزة و جاهزة للانتاج، و تجنب الجماليات العامة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设计思维","实用代码实现","独特的生产级前端界面","避免通用AI风格","强调美学细节"],"ja":["デザイン思考","実用的コード実装","独自の生産レベルのフロントエンドインターフェイス","一般的なAIスタイルの回避","美学的な細部への注目"],"ko":["디자인 사고","실제 코드 구현","독특한 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스","일반적인 AI 스타일 피하기","미학적 세부 사항 강조"],"es":["Creación de interfaces frontend personalizadas","Atención al detalle y opciones creativas","Evitación de estéticas genéricas","Implementación de código funcional","Diseño de componentes y páginas web"],"fr":["Conception d''interfaces frontend sur mesure","Attention aux détails et options créatives","Évitement d''esthétiques génériques","Implémentation de code fonctionnel","Conception de composants et de pages web"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Frontend-Schnittstellen","Aufmerksamkeit für Details und kreative Optionen","Vermeidung von generischer Ästhetik","Implementierung von Funktionscode","Design von Komponenten und Webseiten"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Escolhas criativas","Desenvolvimento de componentes e páginas","Implementação de aplicações e interfaces"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя","Внимание к эстетическим деталям","Творческие решения","Разработка компонентов и страниц","Реализация приложений и интерфейсов"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","اهتمام بال细节 الجمالية","خيارات إبداعية","تطوير المكونات و الصفحات","تنفيذ التطبيقات و الواجهات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级前端界面","设计思维","实用代码实现","独特的前端设计","避免AI风格"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","生産レベルのフロントエンドインターフェイス","デザイン思考","実用的コード実装","独自のフロントエンドデザイン","AIスタイルの回避"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스","디자인 사고","실제 코드 구현","독특한 프론트엔드 디자인","AI 스타일 피하기"],"es":["diseño frontend","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo web","creación de sitios web","estéticas de diseño","desarrollo de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["conception frontend","interfaces utilisateur","développement web","création de sites web","esthétiques de design","développement d''applications web"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung","Erstellung von Webseiten","Designästhetik","Webanwendungs-Entwicklung"],"pt":["frontend design","desenvolvimento de frontend","interfaces de usuário","estéticas personalizadas","desenvolvimento de aplicações","componentes de frontend"],"ru":["фронтенд-дизайн","разработка фронтенда","интерфейсы пользователя","индивидуальные эстетические решения","разработка приложений","компоненты фронтенда"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","واجهات المستخدم","جماليات مخصصة","تطوير التطبيقات","مكونات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية"]}},"owner":"CElyousfi","repo":"PalntsScanner","repoPath":"CElyousfi/PalntsScanner","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, or applications. Generates creative, polished code that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:55:42.776Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual AI Agents needing advanced frontend interface design capabilities with attention to aesthetic details.","zh":"非常适合需要高级前端界面设计能力并注重美观细节的视觉AI代理。","ja":"高度なフロントエンドインターフェース設計能力と美観の細部への注意が必要なビジュアルAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 프런트엔드 인터페이스 디자인 기능과 미적 세부 사항에 주의가 필요한 시각 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA visuales que necesitan capacidades de diseño de interfaz de usuario avanzadas con atención a los detalles estéticos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA visuels ayant besoin de capacités de conception d''interface utilisateur avancées avec attention aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle KI-Agenten, die erweiterte Benutzeroberflächen-Designfunktionen mit Beachtung von ästhetischen Details benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Visuais que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de design de interface de frontend com atenção a detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Идеально для визуальных агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности проектирования интерфейса frontend с вниманием к эстетическим деталям.","ar":"مثالي لعميل イntelligence الاصطناعي البصري الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتصميم الواجهة الأمامية مع اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate production-grade frontend interfaces using real working code, with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices, leveraging HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics.","zh":"使代理能够使用真正的工作代码生成生产级的前端接口，并注意美观的细节和创造性的选择，利用HTML、CSS和JavaScript避免通用的''AI乱码''美学。","ja":"エージェントが実際の動作コードを使用してプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェースを生成できるようにし、美観の細部と創造的な選択に注目し、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用して汎用的な''AI汚れ''美学を避ける。","ko":"에이전트가 실제 작동하는 코드를 사용하여 프로덕션급 프런트엔드 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 미적 세부 사항과 창의적인 선택에 주의를 기울이고, HTML, CSS, 자바스크립트를 사용하여 일반적인 ''AI 비주얼 노이즈'' 미학을 피합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar interfaces de usuario de frontend de grado de producción utilizando código de trabajo real, con atención excepcional a los detalles estéticos y elecciones creativas, aprovechando HTML, CSS y JavaScript para evitar estéticas genéricas de ''suciedad de IA''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des interfaces utilisateur de frontend de grade de production en utilisant du code de travail réel, avec une attention exceptionnelle aux détails esthétiques et aux choix créatifs, en exploitant HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour éviter les esthétiques génériques de ''bazar d''IA''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, produktionsreife Benutzeroberflächen-Interfaces mit echtem Arbeitscode zu generieren, mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details und kreative Entscheidungen, indem HTML, CSS und JavaScript genutzt werden, um generische ''KI-Schund''-Ästhetik zu vermeiden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar interfaces de frontend de produção usando código de trabalho real, com atenção excepcional a detalhes estéticos e escolhas criativas, utilizando HTML, CSS e JavaScript para evitar estética genérica ''slop'' de IA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интерфейсы frontend уровня производства, используя реальный рабочий код, с исключительным вниманием к эстетическим деталям и творческим выбором, используя HTML, CSS и JavaScript, чтобы избежать.generic ''сlop'' эстетики ИИ.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إنشاء واجهات أمامية من الدرجة الأولى باستخدام رمز العمل الحقيقي مع اهتمام استثنائي بالتفاصيل الجمالية والخيارات الإبداعية، واستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript لتجنب جماليات ''سلو'' الاصطناعي العام."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing distinctive component interfaces for web applications","Building custom page layouts with creative typography and color schemes","Developing visually appealing application interfaces for specific audience needs"],"zh":["为Web应用程序设计独特的组件接口","使用创意字体和色彩方案构建自定义页面布局","为特定受众需求开发视觉上吸引人的应用程序接口"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションの独自のコンポーネントインターフェースを設計する","創造的な字体と色彩スキームを使用してカスタムページレイアウトを構築する","特定のオーディエンスのニーズに応じて視覚的に魅力的なアプリケーションインターフェースを開発する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션의 고유한 컴포넌트 인터페이스를 설계하는 것","창의적인 폰트와 색상 체계를 사용하여 사용자 정의 페이지 레이아웃을 구축하는 것","특정 대상의 요구 사항에 따라 시각적으로 매력적인 애플리케이션 인터페이스를 개발하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar interfaces de componentes distintivas para aplicaciones web","Crear diseños de página personalizados con tipografía y esquemas de color creativos","Desarrollar interfaces de aplicaciones visualmente atractivas para necesidades de audiencia específicas"],"fr":["Concevoir des interfaces de composants distinctives pour les applications Web","Créer des dispositions de page personnalisées avec une typographie et des schémas de couleur créatifs","Développer des interfaces d''applications visuellement attrayantes pour les besoins d''audience spécifiques"],"de":["Entwerfen von unterschiedlichen Komponenten-Schnittstellen für Webanwendungen","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Seiteneinrichtungen mit kreativer Typografie und Farbschemata","Entwickeln von visuell ansprechenden Anwendungsschnittstellen für spezifische Zielgruppenbedürfnisse"],"pt":["Projeto de interfaces de componentes distintas para aplicações web","Criação de layouts de página personalizados com tipografia e esquemas de cores criativos","Desenvolvimento de interfaces de aplicativos visualmente atraentes para necessidades de público específico"],"ru":["Проектирование отличительных интерфейсов компонентов для веб-приложений","Создание индивидуальных макетов страниц с творческой типографией и цветовыми схемами","Разработка визуально привлекательных интерфейсов приложений для конкретных потребностей аудитории"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات مكونات مميزة للتطبيقات الويب","بناء تخطيطات صفحة مخصصة ذات خطوط ورسومات ألوان إبداعية","تطوير واجهات تطبيقات بصرية جذابة لنوع معين من الجمهور"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires detailed frontend requirements from the user","May need additional technical constraints for optimal design"],"zh":["需要用户提供详细的前端要求","可能需要额外的技术约束以实现最佳设计"],"ja":["ユーザーから詳細なフロントエンド要件を提供する必要がある","最適な設計を実現するために追加の技術的制約が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["사용자로부터 자세한 프런트엔드 요구 사항을 제공할 필요가 있음","최적의 디자인을 달성하기 위해 추가적인 기술적 제약이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere requisitos de frontend detallados del usuario","Puede necesitar restricciones técnicas adicionales para un diseño óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences de frontend détaillées de l''utilisateur","Peut nécessiter des contraintes techniques supplémentaires pour une conception optimale"],"de":["Benötigt detaillierte Anforderungen an die Benutzeroberfläche vom Benutzer","Kann zusätzliche technische Einschränkungen für ein optimales Design benötigen"],"pt":["Exige requisitos de frontend detalhados do usuário","Pode precisar de restrições técnicas adicionais para design ótimo"],"ru":["Требует подробных требований frontend от пользователя","Может потребовать дополнительных технических ограничений для оптимального дизайна"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات واجهة أمامية مفصلة من المستخدم","قد يحتاج إلى قيود تقنية إضافية لتصميم مثالي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
