API-Routen","Erstellung von Seiten und Komponenten"],"pt":["Estratégia de roteamento de aplicativos","Componentes do servidor por padrão","Uso de \"use client\" para interatividade","Compatibilidade com projetos Next.js","Criação de páginas, componentes e rotas de API"],"ru":["Стратегия маршрутизации приложений","Серверные компоненты по умолчанию","Использование \"use client\" для интерактивности","Совместимость с проектами Next.js","Создание страниц, компонентов и маршрутов API"],"ar":["استراتيجية توجيه التطبيقات","مكونات الخادم افتراضيًا","استخدام \"use client\" للتفاعل","التوافق مع مشاريع Next.js","إنشاء صفحات ومكونات وطرق API"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","前端开发","开发规范","Server Components","use client","项目标准"],"ja":["Next.js","フロントエンド開発","開発規約","Server Components","use client","プロジェクト標準"],"ko":["Next.js","프론트엔드 개발","개발 규약","Server Components","use client","프로젝트 표준"],"es":["Next.js","desarrollo frontend","React","Server Components","API routes","convenciones de desarrollo","eficiencia del código","calidad del código"],"fr":["Next.js","développement frontend","React","composants serveur","routes API","conventions de développement","efficacité du code","qualité du code"],"de":["Next.js","Frontend-Entwicklung","React","Server-Komponenten","API-Routen","Konventionen für die Entwicklung","Code-Effizienz","Code-Qualität"],"pt":["Next.js","desenvolvimento frontend","convenções de desenvolvimento","roteamento de aplicativos","componentes do servidor","interatividade"],"ru":["Next.js","фронтенд-разработка","конвенции разработки","маршрутизация приложений","серверные компоненты","интерактивность"],"ar":["Next.js","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","معايير التطوير","توجيه التطبيقات","مكونات الخادم","التفاعل"]}},"owner":"teodevlor","repo":"agent-kit-skill","repoPath":"teodevlor/agent-kit-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-nextjs","description":"Next.js frontend development conventions. Use when working on Next.js/React projects with App Router.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Next.js Conventions\n\nThis skill provides specific conventions for Next.js frontend development.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when working on Next.js projects\n- Use this skill when creating new pages, components, or API routes\n- This skill builds upon `project-standards` skill\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. App Router Strategy\n\n#### Default to Server Components\nAll components in `app/` are Server Components by default. Only add `\"use client\"` when interactivity is strictly needed.\n\n```ts","body":"# Frontend Next.js Conventions\n\nThis skill provides specific conventions for Next.js frontend development.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill when working on Next.js projects\n- Use this skill when creating new pages, components, or API routes\n- This skill builds upon `project-standards` skill\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. App Router Strategy\n\n#### Default to Server Components\nAll components in `app/` are Server Components by default. Only add `\"use client\"` when interactivity is strictly needed.\n\n```tsx\n// Server Component (default) - No directive needed\nasync function UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {\n  const user = await getUser(userId); // Direct data fetching\n  return <div>{user.name}</div>;\n}\n\n// Client Component - Only when needed\n\"use client\";\n\nfunction Counter() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return <button onClick={() => setCount(c => c + 1)}>{count}</button>;\n}\n```\n\n#### Data Fetching\nFetch data directly in Server Components using `async/await`. Avoid `useEffect` for data fetching.\n\n### 2. File Structure & Naming\n\n```\napp/\n├── (auth)/                    # Route group (no URL impact)\n│   ├── login/\n│   │   └── page.tsx\n│   └── register/\n│       └── page.tsx\n├── (dashboard)/\n│   ├── layout.tsx             # Shared layout\n│   ├── page.tsx               # /dashboard\n│   └── settings/\n│       └── page.tsx           # /dashboard/settings\n├── api/\n│   └── users/\n│       └── route.ts           # API route\n├── _components/               # Private folder (excluded from routing)\n│   ├── Header.tsx\n│   └── Footer.tsx\n└── globals.css\n```\n\n#### Filenames\n- `page.tsx`: Route UI\n- `layout.tsx`: Shared UI (wrappers)\n- `loading.tsx`: Loading states (Suspense)\n- `error.tsx`: Error boundary\n- `not-found.tsx`: 404 page\n\n### 3. Performance & Optimization\n\n#### Images\n**STRICTLY** use `next/image` with defined dimensions.\n\n```tsx\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n\n// Good\n<Image\n  src=\"/hero.jpg\"\n  alt=\"Hero image\"\n  width={1200}\n  height={600}\n  priority // For above-the-fold images\n/>\n\n// With fill\n<div className=\"relative h-64 w-full\">\n  <Image src=\"/bg.jpg\" alt=\"Background\" fill className=\"object-cover\" />\n</div>\n```\n\n#### Fonts\nUse `next/font` to optimize loading.\n\n```tsx\nimport { Inter } from ''next/font/google'';\n\nconst inter = Inter({ subsets: [''latin''] });\n\nexport default function RootLayout({ children }) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" className={inter.className}>\n      <body>{children}</body>\n    </html>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Server Actions\n\nUse Server Actions for form submissions instead of API routes.\n\n```tsx\n// app/actions.ts\n\"use server\";\n\nexport async function createUser(formData: FormData) {\n  const email = formData.get(''email'');\n  // Server-side logic\n  await db.user.create({ data: { email } });\n  revalidatePath(''/users'');\n}\n\n// app/users/new/page.tsx\nimport { createUser } from ''../actions'';\n\nexport default function NewUserPage() {\n  return (\n    <form action={createUser}>\n      <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required />\n      <button type=\"submit\">Create</button>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 5. State Management\n\n#### URL as State\nPrioritize storing search parameters in the URL.\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { useSearchParams, useRouter } from ''next/navigation'';\n\nfunction ProductFilters() {\n  const searchParams = useSearchParams();\n  const router = useRouter();\n  \n  const setFilter = (key: string, value: string) => {\n    const params = new URLSearchParams(searchParams);\n    params.set(key, value);\n    router.push(`?${params.toString()}`);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <select onChange={(e) => setFilter(''category'', e.target.value)}>\n      {/* options */}\n    </select>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 6. Component Patterns\n\n```tsx\n// Component with Props interface\ninterface CardProps {\n  title: string;\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n  variant?: ''default'' | ''outlined'';\n}\n\nexport function Card({ title, children, variant = ''default'' }: CardProps) {\n  return (\n    <div className={cn(''rounded-lg p-4'', variants[variant])}>\n      <h3 className=\"font-bold\">{title}</h3>\n      {children}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 7. Dependencies\n\n- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS\n- **State:** TanStack Query + Zustand\n- **Forms:** React Hook Form + Zod\n- **UI:** shadcn/ui (recommended)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:55:45.344Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Next.js Development Agents specializing in App Router architecture and server-first component strategies.","zh":"非常适合专门从事 App Router 架构和服务器优先组件策略的 Next.js 开发代理。","ja":"Next.js開発エージェント向けに、App Routerアーキテクチャおよびサーバー優先コンポーネント戦略を専門とするものに最適。","ko":"App Router 아키텍처 및 서버 우선 컴포넌트 전략을 전문으로 하는 Next.js 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de Next.js especializados en arquitectura de App Router y estrategias de componentes servidor-primeros.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement Next.js spécialisés dans l''architecture App Router et les stratégies de composants serveur-premiers.","de":"Perfekt für Next.js-Entwicklungsagenten, die auf App-Router-Architektur und serverseitige Komponentenstrategien spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do Next.js especializados em arquitetura de App Router e estratégias de componentes servidor-primeiro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Next.js, специализирующихся на архитектуре App Router и стратегиях серверных компонентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يطورون Next.js والذين يختصون ببناء هيكل App Router واستراتيجيات المكونات الخادمة الأولى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to implement Next.js App Router conventions with automatic server component optimization, reducing client-side JavaScript overhead. Provides structured patterns for page creation, component organization, and API route development following modern Next.js standards.","zh":"使代理能够使用自动服务器组件优化来实现 Next.js App Router 约定，从而减少客户端 JavaScript 开销。为页面创建、组件组织和 API 路由开发提供了结构化的模式，以遵循现代 Next.js 标准。","ja":"エージェントが自動サーバーコンポーネント最適化を使用してNext.js App Routerの規約を実装できるようにし、クライアントサイドJavaScriptのオーバーヘッドを削減します。モダンなNext.jsの規範に従ったページ作成、コンポーネントの組織化、APIルートの開発のための構造化されたパターンを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 자동 서버 컴포넌트 최적화를 사용하여 Next.js App Router 규칙을 구현할 수 있도록 하여 클라이언트 측 JavaScript 오버헤드를 줄입니다. 최신 Next.js 표준을 따르는 페이지 생성, 컴포넌트 조직 및 API 루트 개발을 위한 구조화된 패턴을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar convenciones de App Router de Next.js con optimización automática de componentes del servidor, reduciendo la sobrecarga de JavaScript del lado del cliente. Proporciona patrones estructurados para la creación de páginas, la organización de componentes y el desarrollo de rutas de API siguiendo los estándares modernos de Next.js.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre les conventions App Router de Next.js avec une optimisation automatique des composants serveur, réduisant le surchargement JavaScript côté client. Fournit des modèles structurés pour la création de pages, l''organisation de composants et le développement de routes API suivant les normes modernes de Next.js.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Next.js-App-Router-Konventionen mit automatischer Server-Komponenten-Optimierung zu implementieren, wodurch der Overhead von Client-seitigem JavaScript reduziert wird. Bietet strukturierte Muster für die Erstellung von Seiten, die Organisation von Komponenten und die Entwicklung von API-Routen im Einklang mit den modernen Next.js-Standards.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem convenções do App Router do Next.js com otimização automática de componentes do servidor, reduzindo a sobrecarga de JavaScript do lado do cliente. Fornece padrões estruturados para criação de página, organização de componentes e desenvolvimento de rotas de API seguindo os padrões modernos do Next.js.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать конвенции App Router для Next.js с автоматической оптимизацией серверных компонентов, снижая нагрузку на клиентский JavaScript. Предоставляет структурированные шаблоны для создания страниц, организации компонентов и разработки маршрутов API в соответствии с современными стандартами Next.js.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتنفيذ اتفاقيات App Router من Next.js مع تحسين المكونات الخادمة تلقائيًا، مما يقلل من عبء جافا سكريبت على جانب العميل. يوفر أنماطًا منظمة لإنشاء الصفحة وتنظيم المكونات وتنمية مسارات API اتباعًا للمعايير الحديثة ل Next.js."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Server Components by default","Creating new App Router pages and layouts","Generating API routes with proper Next.js conventions","Converting legacy Pages Router components to App Router"],"zh":["默认实现服务器组件","创建新的App Router页面和布局","使用适当的Next.js约定生成API路由","将遗留的Pages Router组件转换为App Router"],"ja":["デフォルトでサーバーコンポーネントを実装する","新しいApp Routerページとレイアウトを作成する","適切なNext.js規約を使用してAPIルートを生成する","レガシーページルーターコンポーネントをApp Routerに変換する"],"ko":["기본적으로 서버 컴포넌트 구현","새로운 App Router 페이지 및 레이아웃 생성","적절한 Next.js 규칙을 사용하여 API 루트 생성","레거시 Pages Router 컴포넌트를 App Router로 변환"],"es":["Implementar componentes del servidor por defecto","Crear nuevas páginas y diseños de App Router","Generar rutas de API con convenciones de Next.js adecuadas","Convertir componentes de Pages Router legados a App Router"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des composants serveur par défaut","Créer de nouvelles pages et dispositions de App Router","Générer des routes API avec des conventions Next.js appropriées","Convertir des composants de Pages Router hérités en App Router"],"de":["Server-Komponenten standardmäßig implementieren","Neue App-Router-Seiten und -Layouts erstellen","API-Routen mit geeigneten Next.js-Konventionen generieren","Legacy-Pages-Router-Komponenten in App-Router umwandeln"],"pt":["Implementação de Componentes do Servidor por padrão","Criação de novas páginas e layouts do App Router","Geração de rotas de API com convenções adequadas do Next.js","Conversão de componentes legados do Pages Router para App Router"],"ru":["Реализация серверных компонентов по умолчанию","Создание новых страниц и макетов App Router","Генерация маршрутов API с правильными конвенциями Next.js","Преобразование устаревших компонентов Pages Router в App Router"],"ar":["تنفيذ المكونات الخادمة افتراضيًا","إنشاء صفحات وتصاميم جديدة ل App Router","توليد مسارات API مع اتفاقيات Next.js المناسبة","تحويل مكونات Pages Router القديمة إلى App Router"]},"limitations":{"en":["App Router specific (not for Pages Router)","Requires project-standards skill foundation","Limited to Next.js framework conventions"],"zh":["仅适用于 App Router（不适用于 Pages Router）","需要项目标准技能基础","仅限 Next.js 框架约定"],"ja":["App Router専用（Pages Routerには対応していない）","プロジェクト基準スキル基盤が必要","Next.jsフレームワーク規約に限定"],"ko":["App Router 전용(페이지 라우터에는 해당되지 않음)","프로젝트 표준 기술 기초 필요","Next.js 프레임워크 규약에만 국한"],"es":["Específico de App Router (no para Pages Router)","Requiere una base de habilidades de estándares de proyecto","Limitado a convenciones de framework de Next.js"],"fr":["Spécifique à App Router (pas pour Pages Router)","Nécessite une base de compétences en normes de projet","Limité aux conventions de framework Next.js"],"de":["App-Router-spezifisch (nicht für Pages Router)","Benötigt eine Grundlage an Projektstandards-Fähigkeiten","Begrenzt auf Next.js-Framework-Konventionen"],"pt":["Específico do App Router (não para Pages Router)","Exige base de habilidades de padrões de projeto","Limitado às convenções do framework Next.js"],"ru":["Специфичен для App Router (не для Pages Router)","Требует основы навыков проектных стандартов","Ограничен конвенциями фреймворка Next.js"],"ar":["محدد ل App Router (لا لل Pages Router)","يتطلب أساس مهارات معايير المشروع","محدود باتفاقيات إطار Next.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
