 Diese Best-Practices helfen Ihnen, seine Verwendung zu meistern.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["3D内容支持","动画技能","资产导入","音频支持","代码示例"],"ja":["3Dコンテンツ対応","アニメーションスキル","アセットのインポート","オーディオ対応","コード例"],"ko":["3D 콘텐츠 지원","애니메이션 스킬","자산 导入","오디오 지원","코드 예시"],"es":["Creación de contenido 3D con Three.js y React Three Fiber","Animaciones fundamentales para Remotion","Importación de imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes","Uso de audio en Remotion","Mejores prácticas para el desarrollo con Remotion"],"fr":["Création de contenu 3D avec Three.js et React Three Fiber","Animations fondamentales pour Remotion","Importation d''images, de vidéos, d''audio et de polices","Utilisation de l''audio dans Remotion","Meilleures pratiques pour le développement avec Remotion"],"de":["Erstellung von 3D-Inhalten mit Three.js und React Three Fiber","Grundlegende Animationen für Remotion","Importieren von Bildern, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten","Verwendung von Audio in Remotion","Best Practices für die Entwicklung mit Remotion"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion","最佳实践","代码质量","性能优化","3D内容","动画","资产导入","音频"],"ja":["Remotion","ベストプラクティス","コード品質","パフォーマンス最適化","3Dコンテンツ","アニメーション","アセットのインポート","オーディオ"],"ko":["Remotion","최적화 방법","코드 품질","성능 최적화","3D 콘텐츠","애니메이션","자산 导入","오디오"],"es":["Remotion","desarrollo de video","contenido 3D","animaciones","importación de activos","audio en Remotion","mejores prácticas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Remotion","développement de vidéo","contenu 3D","animations","importation de ressources","audio dans Remotion","meilleures pratiques de développement"],"de":["Remotion","Video-Entwicklung","3D-Inhalt","Animationen","Importieren von Ressourcen","Audio in Remotion","Best Practices für die Entwicklung"]}},"owner":"engrhammadkhurshid","repo":"removids","repoPath":"engrhammadkhurshid/removids","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:56:07.168Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing advanced Remotion capabilities with Three.js and React Three Fiber","zh":"非常适合需要使用Three.js和React Three Fiber进行高级Remotion功能的视频生成代理","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用した高度なRemotion機能を必要とするビデオ生成エージェントに最適","ko":"Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용한 고급 Remotion 기능이 필요한 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de video que necesitan capacidades de Remotion avanzadas con Three.js y React Three Fiber","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de vidéos nécessitant des capacités de Remotion avancées avec Three.js et React Three Fiber","de":"Perfekt für Video-Generierungsagenten, die erweiterte Remotion-Funktionen mit Three.js und React Three Fiber benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que precisam de capacidades avançadas de Remotion com Three.js e React Three Fiber","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации видео, которым требуются расширенные возможности Remotion с Three.js и React Three Fiber","ar":"مثالي لعميل توليد الفيديو الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة من Remotion مع Three.js و React Three Fiber"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex 3D content, fundamental animations, and manage assets like images, videos, audio, and fonts within Remotion projects using Three.js and React Three Fiber, enhancing their video generation capabilities with domain-specific knowledge","zh":"赋予代理创建复杂3D内容、基本动画，并在使用Three.js和React Three Fiber的Remotion项目中管理图像、视频、音频和字体等资产的能力，增强其视频生成能力和领域特定知识","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用するRemotionプロジェクト内で、複雑な3Dコンテンツ、基本的なアニメーションを作成し、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどのアセットを管理する能力をエージェントに与え、ビデオ生成機能とドメイン特有の知識を強化する","ko":"Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용하는 Remotion 프로젝트 내에서 복잡한 3D 콘텐츠, 기본 애니메이션을 생성하고 이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 폰트 등의 자산을 관리하는 기능을 에이전트에게 제공하여 비디오 생성 능력과 도메인 특정 지식을 향상","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear contenido 3D complejo, animaciones fundamentales y gestionar activos como imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes dentro de proyectos de Remotion utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber, mejorando sus capacidades de generación de video con conocimientos específicos del dominio","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu 3D complexe, des animations fondamentales et de gérer des ressources telles que des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices à l''intérieur de projets Remotion en utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber, améliorant ainsi leurs capacités de génération de vidéos avec des connaissances spécifiques au domaine","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe 3D-Inhalte, grundlegende Animationen und Ressourcen wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriften innerhalb von Remotion-Projekten mit Three.js und React Three Fiber zu erstellen und zu verwalten, wodurch ihre Video-Generierungsfähigkeiten mit domänenbezogenem Wissen verbessert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo 3D complexo, animações fundamentais e gerenciar ativos como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes dentro de projetos Remotion usando Three.js e React Three Fiber, melhorando suas capacidades de geração de vídeo com conhecimento específico de domínio","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложный 3D-контент, фундаментальные анимации и управлять активами, такими как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты, внутри проектов Remotion с использованием Three.js и React Three Fiber,增强ая их возможности генерации видео с домен-специфическими знаниями","ar":"يُمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء محتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد معقد والرسوم المتحركة الأساسية وإدارة الأصول مثل الصور والفيديو والصوت والخطوط داخل مشاريع Remotion باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber، مما يعزز قدراتهم على توليد الفيديو مع المعرفة المحددة للمجال"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations for explainer videos","Optimizing video asset imports for faster rendering","Creating interactive audio-visual experiences with Remotion"],"zh":["为解释视频生成3D动画","优化视频资产导入以实现更快的渲染","使用Remotion创建交互式音频视觉体验"],"ja":["解説動画のための3Dアニメーション生成","ビデオアセットのインポートを最適化してレンダリングを高速化","Remotionを使用したインタラクティブなオーディオビジュアル体験の作成"],"ko":["설명 비디오를 위한 3D 애니메이션 생성","비디오 자산 가져오기를 최적화하여 렌더링을 더 빠르게","Remotion을 사용한 상호 작용형 오디오 비주얼 경험 생성"],"es":["Generar animaciones 3D para videos explicativos","Optimizar la importación de activos de video para un renderizado más rápido","Crear experiencias audiovisuales interactivas con Remotion"],"fr":["Générer des animations 3D pour des vidéos explicatives","Optimiser l''importation de ressources vidéo pour un rendu plus rapide","Créer des expériences audiovisuelles interactives avec Remotion"],"de":["Erstellen von 3D-Animationen für Erklärvideos","Optimieren des Video-Asset-Imports für ein schnelleres Rendern","Erstellen interaktiver audiovisueller Erfahrungen mit Remotion"],"pt":["Geração de animações 3D para vídeos explicativos","Otimização da importação de ativos de vídeo para renderização mais rápida","Criação de experiências interativas áudio-visuais com Remotion"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-анимаций для видеороликов","Оптимизация импорта видео-активов для более быстрой рендеринга","Создание интерактивных аудио-визуальных опытов с Remotion"],"ar":["توليد الرسوم المتحركة ثلاثية الأبعاد لفيديوهاتشرح","تحسين استيراد أصول الفيديو من أجل تقديم أسرع","إنشاء تجارب سمعية بصرية تفاعلية مع Remotion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Familiarity with Three.js and React Three Fiber necessary"],"zh":["需要访问Remotion代码库","需要对Three.js和React Three Fiber熟悉"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Three.jsとReact Three Fiberへの熟練が必要"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 접근해야 함","Three.js와 React Three Fiber에 익숙해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código de Remotion","Se requiere familiaridad con Three.js y React Three Fiber"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code de Remotion","Une connaissance de Three.js et React Three Fiber est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebasis","Kenntnisse von Three.js und React Three Fiber sind erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código Remotion","Familiaridade com Three.js e React Three Fiber necessária"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кодовой базе Remotion","Необходимо знание Three.js и React Three Fiber"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات Remotion","الاطلاع على Three.js و React Three Fiber ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
