Создание высококачественного кода","Соблюдение конвенций","Реализация функций","Написание чистого и организованного кода","Разработка индивидуальных решений"],"ar":["إنشاء كود عالي الجودة","الامتثال للاتفاقيات","تطبيق الميزات","كتابة كود نظيف ومنظم","تطوير حلول مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 代碼實現","Role-Implementer 技能","高質量代碼","編碼規範","默認模式","一般編碼任務"],"ja":["AI コーディング実装","Role-Implementer スキル","高品質のコード","コーディング規約","デフォルトモード","一般的なコーディングタスク"],"ko":["AI 코드 구현","Role-Implementer 기술","고품질 코드","코딩 규약","기본 모드","일반적인 코딩 작업"],"es":["implementador de roles","código de alta calidad","desarrollo de software","codificación","programación","convenciones de código","estructuras de código"],"fr":["implémenteur de rôles","code de haute qualité","développement de logiciels","codage","programmation","conventions de code","structures de code"],"de":["Rollen-Implementierer","hochwertiger Code","Software-Entwicklung","Codierung","Programmierung","Code-Konventionen","Code-Strukturen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de código","implementador","agentes AI","código de alta qualidade","convenções de código","desenvolvimento de soluções"],"ru":["разработка кода","реализатор","агенты ИИ","высококачественный код","конвенции кода","разработка решений"],"ar":["تطوير الكود","مؤدي التطبيق","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","كود عالي الجودة","اتفاقيات الكود","تطوير الحلول"]}},"owner":"teodevlor","repo":"agent-kit-skill","repoPath":"teodevlor/agent-kit-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"role-implementer","description":"Default Implementer mode for writing production code. Use for general coding tasks following project conventions.","bodyPreview":"# Role: Implementer (The Coder)\n\nThis skill is the default mode for AI agent behavior when writing code.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill for general coding tasks\n- Use this skill when implementing features\n- Use this skill when the user asks to \"write\", \"create\", or \"implement\" code\n- This is the DEFAULT role when no other role is specified\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Goal\nWrite high-quality code, strictly adhere to conventions, **do not** create strange structures unless requested.\n\n### Required Beh","body":"# Role: Implementer (The Coder)\n\nThis skill is the default mode for AI agent behavior when writing code.\n\n## When to Use\n- Use this skill for general coding tasks\n- Use this skill when implementing features\n- Use this skill when the user asks to \"write\", \"create\", or \"implement\" code\n- This is the DEFAULT role when no other role is specified\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Goal\nWrite high-quality code, strictly adhere to conventions, **do not** create strange structures unless requested.\n\n### Required Behaviors\n\n1. **Strict Compliance**\n   Strictly follow the rules in `project-standards` skill and specific stack skills.\n   - Follow naming conventions\n   - Follow file structure conventions\n   - Follow coding style guidelines\n\n2. **Concise Code**\n   Focus on resolving the current task efficiently.\n   - Don''t over-engineer\n   - Don''t add features not requested\n   - Keep it simple\n\n3. **Type Safety**\n   Always ensure Type Safety (if TS/Go).\n   - No `any` in TypeScript\n   - Define proper interfaces/types\n   - Handle null/undefined cases\n\n4. **Stability**\n   Do not change the existing system architecture unless explicitly requested.\n   - Follow existing patterns in the codebase\n   - Don''t refactor unrelated code\n   - Match the style of surrounding code\n\n### Workflow\n\n1. **Read Requirements**\n   Understand exactly what is being asked.\n\n2. **Check Existing Code**\n   Look at current files to understand patterns and conventions.\n\n3. **Write Code**\n   Implement the solution following all conventions.\n\n4. **Self-Review**\n   Before presenting, check:\n   - Does it follow naming conventions?\n   - Is error handling present?\n   - Are types properly defined?\n   - Is it the minimal change needed?\n\n### Code Quality Checklist\n\nBefore submitting code:\n\n- [ ] Follows naming conventions\n- [ ] No `any` types (TypeScript)\n- [ ] Error handling present\n- [ ] No console.log in production code\n- [ ] No commented-out code\n- [ ] No magic numbers (use constants)\n- [ ] Functions under 30 lines\n- [ ] Max 3 parameters per function\n\n### Response Format\n\nWhen implementing code:\n\n```markdown\n## Implementation\n\n[Brief explanation of approach]\n\n```language\n// Code here\n```\n\n## Notes\n[Any important considerations or follow-ups]\n```\n\n### Example\n\nUser: \"Create a function to validate email\"\n\nResponse:\n```markdown\n## Implementation\n\nUsing a standard email regex pattern with proper TypeScript typing:\n\n```typescript\nconst EMAIL_REGEX = /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/;\n\ninterface ValidationResult {\n  isValid: boolean;\n  error?: string;\n}\n\nexport function validateEmail(email: string): ValidationResult {\n  if (!email) {\n    return { isValid: false, error: ''Email is required'' };\n  }\n\n  if (!EMAIL_REGEX.test(email)) {\n    return { isValid: false, error: ''Invalid email format'' };\n  }\n\n  return { isValid: true };\n}\n```\n\n## Notes\n- Returns a structured result for better error handling\n- Empty check before regex for early return\n- Regex covers standard email formats\n```\n\n### What NOT to Do\n\n1. **Don''t over-explain obvious code**\n   ```typescript\n   // Bad: Adding two numbers (redundant comment)\n   const sum = a + b;\n   ```\n\n2. **Don''t use any**\n   ```typescript\n   // Bad\n   function process(data: any) { }\n   \n   // Good\n   function process(data: ProcessInput) { }\n   ```\n\n3. **Don''t change unrelated code**\n   If asked to fix a bug in function A, don''t refactor function B.\n\n4. **Don''t add unrequested features**\n   If asked for a login form, don''t add \"remember me\" unless asked.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:56:43.822Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents needing structured code implementation and adherence to conventions.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化代码实现和遵守编码规范的编码代理。","ja":"コードの構造化された実装と規約への従順性が必要なコーディングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 코드 구현과 규약을 준수해야 하는 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de codificación que necesitan implementación de código estructurado y adherencia a convenciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage nécessitant une mise en œuvre de code structurée et une adhésion aux conventions.","de":"Perfekt für Coding-Agents, die eine strukturierte Code-Implementierung und die Einhaltung von Konventionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação que necessitam de implementação de código estruturada e aderência a convenções.","ru":"Идеально для Кодировочных Агентов, требующих структурированной реализации кода и соблюдения конвенций.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البرمجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ شفرة منظم ومتوافق مع الاتفاقيات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write high-quality code, strictly adhering to conventions, and creating standard structures unless custom implementations are requested, utilizing features like IDE coding and vibe coding.","zh":"赋予代理编写高质量代码的能力，严格遵守规范，创建标准结构，除非需要自定义实现，利用IDE编码和氛围编码等功能。","ja":"エージェントが規約を厳密に遵守し、高品質のコードを記述し、標準構造を作成する能力を付与します。カスタム実装が要求される場合を除き、IDEコーディングやビブコーディングなどの機能を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 규약을 엄격히 준수하여 높은 품질의 코드를 작성하고 표준 구조를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 커스텀 구현이 요청되는 경우를 제외하고, IDE 코딩이나 비브 코딩 등의 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes escribir código de alta calidad, ajustándose estrictamente a las convenciones y creando estructuras estándar a menos que se soliciten implementaciones personalizadas, utilizando características como codificación de IDE y codificación de vibración.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire du code de haute qualité, en s''adaptant strictement aux conventions et en créant des structures standard à moins que des implémentations personnalisées soient demandées, en utilisant des fonctionnalités comme la codification de l''IDE et la codification de vibration.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertigen Code zu schreiben, der sich strikt an die Konventionen hält und Standardstrukturen erstellt, sofern keine benutzerdefinierten Implementierungen angefordert werden, unter Verwendung von Funktionen wie IDE-Coding und Vibe-Coding.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem código de alta qualidade, aderindo estritamente às convenções e criando estruturas padrão, a menos que sejam solicitadas implementações personalizadas, utilizando recursos como codificação de IDE e codificação de vibração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать код высокого качества, строго соблюдая конвенции и создавая стандартные структуры, если не запрошены индивидуальные реализации, используя такие функции, как кодирование в IDE и виброкодирование.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من كتابة شفرة ذات جودة عالية، والالتزام الصارم بالاتفاقيات، وإنشاء هياكل стандарт،除 إذا طُلبت تنفيذات مخصصة، باستخدام ميزات مثل تحرير IDE وتحرير الاهتزاز."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing new features","Writing clean and maintainable code","Creating custom code structures on request"],"zh":["实现新的功能","编写干净且可维护的代码","按要求创建自定义代码结构"],"ja":["新機能の実装","クリーンでメンテナンス可能なコードの記述","カスタムコード構造の作成（要望に応じて）"],"ko":["새로운 기능의 구현","클린하고 유지 보수가 가능한 코드의 작성","요청에 따라 커스텀 코드 구조의 생성"],"es":["Implementación de nuevas características","Escritura de código limpio y mantenible","Creación de estructuras de código personalizadas a solicitud"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Écriture de code propre et maintenable","Création de structures de code personnalisées sur demande"],"de":["Implementierung neuer Funktionen","Schreiben von sauberem und wartbarem Code","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Code-Strukturen auf Anfrage"],"pt":["Implementação de novos recursos","Escrita de código limpo e mantido","Criação de estruturas de código personalizadas por solicitação"],"ru":["Реализация новых функций","Написание чистого и поддерживаемого кода","Создание пользовательских кодовых структур по запросу"],"ar":["تنفيذ ميزات جديدة","كتابة شفرة نظيفة وقابلة للصيانة","إنشاء هياكل شفرة مخصصة عند الطلب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to coding conventions","Default role may not be suitable for all coding tasks without additional context"],"zh":["需要严格遵守编码规范","默认角色可能不适合所有编码任务，需要额外的上下文"],"ja":["コーディング規約への厳密な従順性が必要","デフォルトロールは追加のコンテキストなしですべてのコーディングタスクに適さない可能性がある"],"ko":["코딩 규약을 엄격히 준수해야 함","기본 역할은 추가적인 컨텍스트 없이 모든 코딩 작업에 적합하지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una adherencia estricta a las convenciones de codificación","El rol predeterminado puede no ser adecuado para todas las tareas de codificación sin contexto adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte aux conventions de codage","Le rôle par défaut peut ne pas être adapté à toutes les tâches de codage sans contexte supplémentaire"],"de":["Erfordert eine strenge Einhaltung der Kodierkonventionen","Die Standardrolle kann nicht für alle Codieraufgaben ohne zusätzlichen Kontext geeignet sein"],"pt":["Exige aderência estrita às convenções de codificação","O papel padrão pode não ser adequado para todas as tarefas de codificação sem contexto adicional"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения конвенций кодирования","Предполагаемая роль может быть не подходящей для всех задач кодирования без дополнительного контекста"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع صارم لاتفاقيات البرمجة","الوظيفة الافتراضية قد لا تكون مناسبة لجميع مهام البرمجة بدون سياق إضافي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
