ation de code pour une plus grande efficacité","Guide pour la mise en œuvre du fetching de données","Optimisation des bundles pour un meilleur chargement"],"de":["45 Regeln zur Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien für eine bessere Organisation","Priorisierung nach Auswirkung für eine automatisierte Refactoring","Codegenerierung für eine höhere Effizienz","Leitfaden für die Implementierung von Datenabfragen","Optimierung von Bundles für eine bessere Ladezeit"],"pt":["45 regras de otimização de desempenho","8 categorias de otimização","Refatoração automatizada","Geração de código","Otimização de bundling","Melhoria de desempenho de aplicações React e Next.js"],"ru":["45 правил оптимизации производительности","8 категорий оптимизации","Автоматическая рефакторинга","Генерация кода","Оптимизация пакетирования","Улучшение производительности приложений React и Next.js"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحسين الأداء","تحسين تلقائي","توليد الكود","تحسين حزمة","تحسين أداء تطبيقات رياكت و نيكست.جس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成"],"ja":["Vercel React","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成"],"ko":["Vercel React","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성"],"es":["Vercel React","Mejores prácticas","Optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","Desarrollo web","Programación","Buenas prácticas de codificación"],"fr":["Vercel React","Meilleures pratiques","Optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","Développement web","Programmation","Bonnes pratiques de codage"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung","Programmierung","Gute Codierpraktiken"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Melhores práticas","Refatoração automatizada","Geração de código"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Разработка приложений","Лучшие практики","Автоматическая рефакторинга","Генерация кода"],"ar":["فيرسيل رياكت","تحسين الأداء","رياكت","نيكست.جس","تطوير التطبيقات","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين تلقائي","توليد الكود"]}},"owner":"builderbuilds123","repo":"gracestowel","repoPath":"builderbuilds123/gracestowel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:57:16.966Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React 和 Next.js 性能优化功能的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js のパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte React- und Next.js-Leistungsoptimierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуются продвинутые возможности оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications, leveraging 45 rules across 8 categories, including data fetching and bundling optimization, to enhance application performance.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 和 Next.js 应用程序，利用 45 条规则和 8 个类别，包括数据获取和打包优化，以提高应用程序性能。","ja":"React と Next.js アプリケーションに対する自動リファクタリングとコード生成をエージェントに可能にし、データ取得やバンドル最適化を含む 8 つのカテゴリにわたる 45 のルールを利用して、アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを向上させます。","ko":"리액트 및 넥스트.js 애플리케이션을 자동화된 리팩터링 및 코드 생성을 에이전트에 가능하게 하며, 8개의 범주에 걸쳐 45개의 규칙을活用하여 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함하여 애플리케이션 성능을 향상합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js, aprovechando 45 reglas en 8 categorías, incluida la optimización de la recuperación de datos y la agrupación, para mejorar el rendimiento de la aplicación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la réfactorisation et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js, en exploitant 45 règles dans 8 catégories, notamment l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement, pour améliorer les performances de l''application.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren und dabei 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien zu nutzen, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung, um die Anwendungsleistung zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para aplicativos React e Next.js, utilizando 45 regras em 8 categorias, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento, para melhorar o desempenho do aplicativo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и пакетирования, для повышения производительности приложения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تutomation إعادة هيكلة وتوليد رمز للتطبيقات React و Next.js، باستخدام 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحسين الحزم، لتحسين أداء التطبيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues","Generating optimized React components and Next.js pages","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以发现性能问题","生成优化的 React 组件和 Next.js 页面","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題を検出するためのコードレビューの自動化","最適化された React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの生成","既存の React と Next.js コードのリファクタリングによるパフォーマンスの向上"],"ko":["성능 문제를 발견하기 위한 코드 리뷰 자동화","최적화된 리액트 컴포넌트 및 넥스트.js 페이지 생성","기존 리액트 및 넥스트.js 코드의 리팩터링을 통한 성능 향상"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento","Generar componentes de React y páginas de Next.js optimizados","Refactorizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances","Générer des composants React et des pages Next.js optimisés","Réfactoriser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme","Generieren von optimierten React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten","Refactoring des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für eine bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho","Gerar componentes React e páginas Next.js otimizados","Refatorar código React e Next.js existente para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью","Генерировать оптимизированные компоненты React и страницы Next.js","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["التutomation مراجعة رمز للمشاكل المتعلقة بالأداء","توليد مكونات React وصفحات Next.js المُحسّنة","إعادة هيكلة رمز React و Next.js الحالي لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js application","Limited to JavaScript and TypeScript environments"],"zh":["需要 React 或 Next.js 应用程序","仅限 JavaScript 和 TypeScript 环境"],"ja":["React または Next.js アプリケーションが必要","JavaScript と TypeScript の環境のみ"],"ko":["리액트 또는 넥스트.js 애플리케이션이 필요","자바스크립트 및 타입스크립트 환경만 지원"],"es":["Requiere una aplicación de React o Next.js","Limitado a entornos de JavaScript y TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une application React ou Next.js","Limité aux environnements JavaScript et TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt eine React- oder Next.js-Anwendung","Begrenzt auf JavaScript- und TypeScript-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Requer aplicativo React ou Next.js","Limitado a ambientes JavaScript e TypeScript"],"ru":["Требуется приложение React или Next.js","Ограничен средами JavaScript и TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب تطبيق React أو Next.js","محدود بالبيئات JavaScript و TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
