c les demandes de changement en kebab-case ou les descriptions","Utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour demander des éclaircissements","Déduction d''un nom de changement à partir de la description de l''utilisateur","Automatisation du processus de création d''artéfacts"],"de":["Schnelle Generierung von Artefakten","Implementierung von Änderungen auf effiziente Weise","Kompatibilität mit Änderungsanfragen im kebab-case oder Beschreibungen","Verwendung des Tools AskUserQuestion zur Anfrage von Klarstellungen","Ableitung eines Änderungsnamens aus der Benutzerbeschreibung","Automatisierung des Artefakt-Erstellungsprozesses"],"pt":["Criação rápida de artefatos","Economia de tempo e esforço","Ferramenta de desenvolvimento eficiente","Suporte à criação de artefatos personalizados","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Быстрое создание артефактов","Экономия времени и усилий","Эффективный инструмент разработки","Поддержка создания индивидуальных артефактов","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء سريع للتحف","توفير الوقت والجهد","أداة تطوير فعالة","دعم إنشاء تحف مخصصة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-ff-change","快速生成","实现所需内容","代码生成","配置文件生成","开发流程","开发效率"],"ja":["openspec-ff-change","自動生成","実装に必要な内容","コード生成","設定ファイル生成","開発プロセス","開発効率"],"ko":["openspec-ff-change","자동 생성","구현에 필요한 내용","코드 생성","설정 파일 생성","개발 프로세스","개발 효율"],"es":["generación de artefactos","implementación de cambios","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","automatización de procesos","eficiencia en el desarrollo","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","desarrollo ágil"],"fr":["génération d''artéfacts","mise en œuvre de changements","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","automatisation de processus","efficacité dans le développement","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","développement agile"],"de":["Artefakt-Generierung","Implementierung von Änderungen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Automatisierung von Prozessen","Effizienz im Entwicklungsprozess","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","agiles Entwickeln"],"pt":["desenvolvimento rápido","criação de artefatos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","eficiência no desenvolvimento","openspec-ff-change","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["быстрое разработка","создание артефактов","инструменты разработки","эффективность разработки","openspec-ff-change","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["التطوير السريع","إنشاء التحف","أدوات التطوير","فعالية التطوير","أوبنسبك-إف إف-تغير","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"naija-conflict-tracker","repoPath":"Ejyke90/naija-conflict-tracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-ff-change","description":"Fast-forward through OpenSpec artifact creation. Use when the user wants to quickly create all artifacts needed for implementation without stepping through each one individually.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-c","body":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/`.\n\n3. **Get the artifact build order**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to get:\n   - `applyRequires`: array of artifact IDs needed before implementation (e.g., `[\"tasks\"]`)\n   - `artifacts`: list of all artifacts with their status and dependencies\n\n4. **Create artifacts in sequence until apply-ready**\n\n   Use the **TodoWrite tool** to track progress through the artifacts.\n\n   Loop through artifacts in dependency order (artifacts with no pending dependencies first):\n\n   a. **For each artifact that is `ready` (dependencies satisfied)**:\n      - Get instructions:\n        ```bash\n        openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n        ```\n      - The instructions JSON includes:\n        - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n        - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance for this artifact type\n        - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n        - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n      - Read any completed dependency files for context\n      - Create the artifact file using `template` as the structure\n      - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints - but do NOT copy them into the file\n      - Show brief progress: \"✓ Created <artifact-id>\"\n\n   b. **Continue until all `applyRequires` artifacts are complete**\n      - After creating each artifact, re-run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Check if every artifact ID in `applyRequires` has `status: \"done\"` in the artifacts array\n      - Stop when all `applyRequires` artifacts are done\n\n   c. **If an artifact requires user input** (unclear context):\n      - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to clarify\n      - Then continue with creation\n\n5. **Show final status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing all artifacts, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- List of artifacts created with brief descriptions\n- What''s ready: \"All artifacts created! Ready for implementation.\"\n- Prompt: \"Run `/opsx:apply` or ask me to implement to start working on the tasks.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\n- Follow the `instruction` field from `openspec instructions` for each artifact type\n- The schema defines what each artifact should contain - follow it\n- Read dependency artifacts for context before creating new ones\n- Use `template` as the structure for your output file - fill in its sections\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ALL artifacts needed for implementation (as defined by schema''s `apply.requires`)\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- If context is critically unclear, ask the user - but prefer making reasonable decisions to keep momentum\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Verify each artifact file exists after writing before proceeding to next\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:58:34.978Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring rapid artifact creation and implementation initialization.","zh":"适合需要快速创建和初始化实现的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが迅速にアーティファクトを作成し、実装の初期化を行う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 빠른 아티팩트 생성과 구현 초기화를 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren la creación rápida de artefactos y la inicialización de la implementación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une création rapide d''artefacts et une initialisation de la mise en œuvre.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine schnelle Erstellung von Artefakten und Initialisierung der Implementierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring rapid artifact creation and implementation initialization.","ru":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring rapid artifact creation and implementation initialization.","ar":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring rapid artifact creation and implementation initialization."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fast-forward through artifact creation, generating everything needed to start implementation in one go, using natural language input and kebab-case change names, while leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for unclear requests.","zh":"使代理能够快速创建所需的所有内容以开始实现，从而使用自然语言输入和短横线命名法更改名称，同时利用 AskUserQuestion 工具处理不明确的请求。","ja":"エージェントが実装を開始するために必要なすべてを一括で生成できるようにし、自然言語入力とケバブケースの変更名を使用し、不明確なリクエストの場合は AskUserQuestion ツールを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 자연어 입력 및 케밥 케이스 변경 이름을 사용하여 구현을 시작하는 데 필요한 모든 것을 한 번에 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 불명확한 요청의 경우 AskUserQuestion 도구를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes avanzar rápidamente en la creación de artefactos, generando todo lo necesario para iniciar la implementación de una sola vez, utilizando entrada de lenguaje natural y nombres de cambio en kebab-case, mientras aprovecha la herramienta AskUserQuestion para solicitudes poco claras.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire un saut en avant dans la création d''artefacts, en générant tout ce qui est nécessaire pour commencer la mise en œuvre en une seule fois, en utilisant une entrée de langage naturel et des noms de changement en kebab-case, tout en exploitant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour les demandes peu claires.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Erstellung von Artefakten zu beschleunigen, indem es alles Notwendige für den Start der Implementierung in einem Schritt generiert, unter Verwendung von natürlicher Spracheingabe und kebab-case-Änderungsnamen, während es das Tool AskUserQuestion für unklare Anfragen nutzt.","pt":"Empowers agents to fast-forward through artifact creation, generating everything needed to start implementation in one go, using natural language input and kebab-case change names, while leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for unclear requests.","ru":"Empowers agents to fast-forward through artifact creation, generating everything needed to start implementation in one go, using natural language input and kebab-case change names, while leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for unclear requests.","ar":"Empowers agents to fast-forward through artifact creation, generating everything needed to start implementation in one go, using natural language input and kebab-case change names, while leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for unclear requests."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project setup with generated artifacts","Generating implementation starters from user descriptions","Deriving kebab-case change names from open-ended user input"],"zh":["使用生成的アーティファクト来自动化项目设置","从用户描述中生成实现起始点","从开放式用户输入中推导出短横线命名法更改名称"],"ja":["生成されたアーティファクトを使用してプロジェクト設定を自動化する","ユーザー描述から実装スターターを生成する","オープンエンドユーザー入力からケバブケースの変更名を導出する"],"ko":["생성된 아티팩트를 사용하여 프로젝트 설정 자동화","사용자 설명에서 구현 시작점 생성","개방형 사용자 입력에서 케밥 케이스 변경 이름 도출"],"es":["Automatización de la configuración del proyecto con artefactos generados","Generación de iniciadores de implementación a partir de descripciones de usuarios","Derivación de nombres de cambio en kebab-case a partir de entrada de usuario de pregunta abierta"],"fr":["Automation de la configuration du projet avec des artefacts générés","Génération de démarreurs d''implémentation à partir de descriptions d''utilisateurs","Déduction de noms de changement en kebab-case à partir d''une entrée d''utilisateur de question ouverte"],"de":["Automatisierung der Projektkonfiguration mit generierten Artefakten","Generierung von Implementierungsstartern aus Benutzerbeschreibungen","Ableitung von kebab-case-Änderungsnamen aus offener Benutzereingabe"],"pt":["Automating project setup with generated artifacts","Generating implementation starters from user descriptions","Deriving kebab-case change names from open-ended user input"],"ru":["Automating project setup with generated artifacts","Generating implementation starters from user descriptions","Deriving kebab-case change names from open-ended user input"],"ar":["Automating project setup with generated artifacts","Generating implementation starters from user descriptions","Deriving kebab-case change names from open-ended user input"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear user input or descriptive text","Dependent on AskUserQuestion tool functionality"],"zh":["需要清晰的用户输入或描述性文本","依赖于 AskUserQuestion 工具的功能"],"ja":["明確なユーザー入力または記述的テキストが必要","AskUserQuestion ツールの機能に依存する"],"ko":["명확한 사용자 입력 또는 설명적 텍스트 필요","AskUserQuestion 도구의 기능에 종속"],"es":["Requiere una entrada de usuario clara o texto descriptivo","Dependiente de la funcionalidad de la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée d''utilisateur claire ou un texte descriptif","Dépend de la fonctionnalité de l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Benötigt eine klare Benutzereingabe oder beschreibenden Text","Abhängig von der Funktionalität des Tools AskUserQuestion"],"pt":["Requires clear user input or descriptive text","Dependent on AskUserQuestion tool functionality"],"ru":["Requires clear user input or descriptive text","Dependent on AskUserQuestion tool functionality"],"ar":["Requires clear user input or descriptive text","Dependent on AskUserQuestion tool functionality"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
