ar":"سلطة رياضيات المنطقة العرضية: تعديل ماين كرافت","en":"latitude-zone-math-authority"},"description":{"zh":"该技能确保 Minecraft Fabric mod 中每个系统使用相同的带数学，包括生物群系选择、温度/寒冷防护等","ja":"このスキルは、Minecraft Fabric mod のすべてのシステムが同じ帯数学を使用することを保証します","ko":"이 스킬은 Minecraft Fabric 모드에서 모든 시스템이 동일한帶數학을 사용하도록 합니다","es":"Latitude Zone Math Authority es un mod de Minecraft que asegura la consistencia en los cálculos de biome y bandas de latitud","fr":"Latitude Zone Math Authority est un mod Minecraft qui assure la cohérence dans les calculs de biome et de bandes de latitude","de":"Latitude Zone Math Authority ist ein Minecraft-Mod, der die Konsistenz in den Biome- und Längenberechnungen gewährleistet","pt":"O Latitude Zone Math Authority é um mod de Minecraft que garante a consistência em todo o sistema, usando a mesma matemática para bandas de bioma","ru":"Latitude Zone Math Authority — это мод для Minecraft, который гарантирует согласованность во всей системе, используя одну и ту же математику для биом-бэндов","ar":"سلطة رياضيات المنطقة العرضية هو تعديل ماين كرافت يضمن الاتساق في جميع أنحاء النظام، باستخدام نفس الرياضيات لحزم البيئة","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"definition":{"en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"features":{"zh":["确定性坐标带数学","生物群系选择","温度/寒冷防护","风暴雾边界","危险和效果","HUD 显示"],"ja":["決定性緯度帯数学","生物群系の選択","温度/寒冷防護","嵐の霧の境界","危険と効果","HUD 表示"],"ko":["결정적 위도대 수학","생물군계 선택","온도/寒冷 방어","폭풍 안개 경계","위험과 효과","HUD 표시"],"es":["Cálculos de biome determinísticos","Bandas de latitud consistentes","Eliminación de errores por inconsistentes cálculos","Compatibilidad con mundos de estilo globo","Uso de la fórmula radius = world.getWorldBorder().getSize() * 0.5"],"fr":["Calculs de biome déterministes","Bandes de latitude cohérentes","Élimination des erreurs dues à des calculs incohérents","Compatibilité avec les mondes de style globe","Utilisation de la formule radius = world.getWorldBorder().getSize() * 0.5"],"de":["Deterministische Biome-Berechnungen","Konsistente Längenberechnungen","Beseitigung von Fehlern durch inkonsistente Berechnungen","Kompatibilität mit Globus-Welten","Verwendung der Formel radius = world.getWorldBorder().getSize() * 0.5"],"pt":["Bandas de bioma determinísticas baseadas em latitude","Consistência em todo o sistema","Matemática única para todas as partes do código","Nenhuma codificação dura para o raio","Uso de `radius = world.getWorldBorder().getSize() * 0.5`"],"ru":["Детерминированные биом-бэнды на основе широты","Согласованность во всей системе","Единая математика для всех частей кода","Нет жесткой кодировки радиуса","Использование `radius = world.getWorldBorder().getSize() * 0.5`"],"ar":["حزم بيئية محددة بالعرض الجغرافي","الاتساق في جميع أنحاء النظام","رياضيات واحدة لجميع أجزاء الكود","لا يوجد ترميز صلب للنصف قطر","استخدام `radius = world.getWorldBorder().getSize() * 0.5`"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft Fabric mod","坐标带数学","全球风格世界","生物群系选择","温度/寒冷防护","风暴雾边界","危险和效果","HUD 显示"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabric mod","緯度帯数学","全球風格の世界","生物群系の選択","温度/寒冷防護","嵐の霧の境界","危険と効果","HUD 表示"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드","위도대 수학","전세계风格의 세계","생물군계 선택","온도/寒冷 방어","폭풍 안개 경계","위험과 효과","HUD 표시"],"es":["Minecraft mod","biome cálculos","bandas de latitud","determinístico","consistencia","mundos de estilo globo"],"fr":["mod Minecraft","calculs de biome","bandes de latitude","déterministe","cohérence","mondes de style globe"],"de":["Minecraft-Mod","Biome-Berechnungen","Längenberechnungen","deterministisch","Konsistenz","Globus-Welten"],"pt":["Minecraft mod","bioma","latitude","matemática","consistência","desenvolvimento de jogos","programação"],"ru":["мод для Minecraft","биом","широта","математика","согласованность","разработка игр","программирование"],"ar":["تعديل ماين كرافت","البيئة","العرض الجغرافي","الرياضيات","الاتساق","تطوير الألعاب","البرمجة"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"latitude","repoPath":"joolbits/latitude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"latitude-zone-math-authority","description":"Canonical authority for Latitude band math (radius, t, thresholds, and helpers). Prevents hardcoding, duplicated thresholds, or inconsistent warm/cold checks across worldgen, guards, fog, hazards, HUD, and features.","bodyPreview":"# Latitude — Zone Math Authority (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill ensures every system in Latitude uses the **same** band math:\n- biome picking\n- warm/cold guards (snow/ice/etc.)\n- E/W storm fog borders\n- hazards and effects\n- HUD displays\n\nIf different parts of the code use different math, the mod becomes inconsistent and bugs reappear.\n\n---\n\n## Primary invariant: derive radius from world border\n**Never hardcode radius.**\n\nUse:\n- `radius = world.getWorldBorder().getSize() * 0.5` \n\nNotes:\n- WorldBord","body":"# Latitude — Zone Math Authority (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill ensures every system in Latitude uses the **same** band math:\n- biome picking\n- warm/cold guards (snow/ice/etc.)\n- E/W storm fog borders\n- hazards and effects\n- HUD displays\n\nIf different parts of the code use different math, the mod becomes inconsistent and bugs reappear.\n\n---\n\n## Primary invariant: derive radius from world border\n**Never hardcode radius.**\n\nUse:\n- `radius = world.getWorldBorder().getSize() * 0.5` \n\nNotes:\n- WorldBorder size is a diameter-like value; radius is half.\n- All band logic must use the same radius for the same world.\n\n---\n\n## Canonical latitude coordinate\nLatitude is based on Z (north/south):\n\n- `absZ = Math.abs(pos.getZ())` \n- `t = absZ / radius` \n\nWhere:\n- `t` is normalized latitude from 0.0 (equator) to 1.0 (border/pole).\n\nRules:\n- Clamp t if needed: `t = Math.min(1.0, Math.max(0.0, t))` \n- Do not use X for latitude bands.\n- Any “zone label” shown to player must correspond to this same t.\n\n---\n\n## Single source of truth for thresholds\nThere must be exactly one implementation that maps `t -> zone/band`:\n- `LatitudeMath` or equivalent helper\n\nAll other systems must call that helper, not re-implement thresholds.\n\nAllowed call shapes (examples):\n- `LatitudeMath.zoneFor(world, pos)` \n- `LatitudeMath.zoneForT(t)` \n- `LatitudeZones.fromT(t)` \n\nIf the helper does not exist, the assistant must:\n1) locate where thresholds currently live, and\n2) refactor so thresholds live in one place, then\n3) update all call sites to reference it.\n\n---\n\n## Band naming contract\nBand names used across logs/HUD/guards must be consistent.\nExample canonical set:\n- EQUATOR\n- TROPICAL\n- SUBTROPICAL\n- TEMPERATE\n- SUBPOLAR\n- POLAR\n\nIf the project uses different names, mirror the project’s names exactly.\n\n---\n\n## Warm band / cold band predicates (required helpers)\nAdd and use helpers (names optional, behavior mandatory):\n\n- `isWarmBand(zone)` returns true for bands that must never produce snow family blocks.\n- `isColdBand(zone)` returns true for snow/ice-permitted bands.\n\nDo not duplicate “warm band = t < X” logic in random places.\n\n---\n\n## Sea level authority\nAvoid hardcoding y=63 unless intentionally matching vanilla sea level.\n\nPreferred:\n- `seaLevel = world.getSeaLevel()` (if available at the call site)\n\nIf not available, use a single project constant and document it.\n\n---\n\n## Debug output format requirements (when band math is involved)\nIf logging band math decisions, include:\n- x, z, absZ\n- radius\n- t\n- zone result\n\nExample:\n- `x=1514 z=-120 absZ=120 radius=10000 t=0.012 zone=EQUATOR` \n\nAll such logs must be gated behind a debug flag.\n\n---\n\n## Forbidden behaviors\n- Hardcoding radius (e.g., `radius=10000`) except in tests/tools\n- Copying threshold numbers into multiple files\n- Mixing X and Z for latitude decisions\n- Using different t formulas for different features\n- “Fixing” bugs by adjusting thresholds without referencing the authority helper\n\n---\n\n## Required assistant output when math is questioned\nWhen asked “why is zone X here?” or “why is guard firing?” the assistant must:\n1) show the formula used\n2) show the radius source\n3) show t computation\n4) point to the helper/constant location in code\n5) propose changes only in that single authority location\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:58:19.488Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Minecraft Fabric Mod Agents needing deterministic latitude-based biome band calculations.","zh":"非常适合需要确定性基于纬度的生物群落带计算的Minecraft Fabric Mod Agents。","ja":"Minecraft Fabric Mod Agentsが決定的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンド計算を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"결정적인 위도 기반의 바이옴 밴드 계산이 필요한 Minecraft Fabric Mod Agents에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modificación de Minecraft Fabric que necesitan cálculos de bandas de biomas basados en latitud deterministas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modification Minecraft Fabric nécessitant des calculs de bandes de biomes basés sur la latitude déterministes.","de":"Perfekt für Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Agenten, die deterministische Längenberechnungen für Biome benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Mod Fabric do Minecraft que precisam de cálculos de faixas de biomas baseados em latitude determinísticos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мода Fabric Minecraft, требующих детерминированных расчетов латитудных биомов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء مود فابريك مايكرافت الذين يحتاجون إلى حسابات حزم البيئة القائمة على خط العرض التقريري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain consistency across biome picking, warm/cold guards, storm fog borders, hazards, and HUD displays using authoritative zone math, ensuring a bug-free experience by deriving radius from world border size.","zh":"赋予代理以一致性，跨生物群落选择、温暖/寒冷防护、风暴雾边界、危险和HUD显示，使用权威区域数学，确保无错误的体验，通过从世界边界大小推导半径。","ja":"エージェントに一貫性をもたらすことで、バイオームの選択、暖かさ/寒さのガード、嵐の霧の境界、危険やHUDディスプレイなどの間での一貫性を保ち、権威あるゾーンの数学を使用してバグのない体験を提供し、世界の境界サイズから半径を導き出す。","ko":"에이전트가 일관성을 유지하도록하여 바이옴 선택, 따뜻한/차가운 가드, 폭풍 안개 경계, 위험 및 HUD 디스플레이 간의 일관성을 유지하고 권위적인 영역 수학을 사용하여 버그가 없는 경험을 제공하며, 세계 경계 크기에서 반지름을 도출합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mantener la coherencia en la selección de biomas, guardias cálidas/frías, bordes de niebla de tormenta, peligros y pantallas de visualización de HUD utilizando matemáticas de zona autorizadas, garantizando una experiencia sin errores al derivar el radio del tamaño del borde del mundo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir la cohérence dans la sélection de biomes, les gardes chaudes/froides, les frontières de brouillard de tempête, les dangers et les affichages de HUD en utilisant des mathématiques de zone autorisées, garantissant une expérience sans bogues en dérivant le rayon de la taille de la frontière du monde.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Konsistenz bei der Auswahl von Biomen, warmen/kalten Wächtern, Sturmnebelfronten, Gefahren und HUD-Anzeigen zu gewährleisten, indem autoritative Zonenmathematik verwendet wird, um so ein fehlerfreies Erlebnis zu gewährleisten, indem der Radius aus der Weltgrenzen-Größe abgeleitet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter a consistência em todo o processo de seleção de biomas, guardas quentes/frias, bordos de nevoeiro de tempestade, perigos e exibições de HUD, utilizando matemática de zona autoritativa, garantindo uma experiência sem bugs ao derivar o raio do tamanho da borda do mundo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать последовательность при выборе биомов, теплых/холодных охранников, границ тумана шторма, опасностей и дисплеев HUD, используя авторитетную зонную математику, обеспечивая опыт без ошибок путем получения радиуса от размера границы мира.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على الاتساق عبر اختيار البيئات، وحراس الدفء والبرودة، وأحزمة ضباب العاصفة، والأخطار، وعروض HUD، باستخدام رياضيات منطقة مرجعية، وضمان تجربة خالية من العيوب من خلال اشتقاق النصف من حجم حدود العالم."},"useCases":{"en":["Ensuring consistent biome generation","Calculating warm/cold guard placements","Determining storm fog border positions"],"zh":["确保一致的生物群落生成","计算温暖/寒冷防护的位置","确定风暴雾边界位置"],"ja":["一貫したバイオームの生成を確保する","暖かさ/寒さのガードの配置を計算する","嵐の霧の境界の位置を決定する"],"ko":["일관된 바이옴 생성 보장","따뜻한/차가운 가드 배치 계산","폭풍 안개 경계 위치 결정"],"es":["Garantizar la generación coherente de biomas","Calcular las posiciones de las guardias cálidas/frías","Determinar las posiciones de los bordes de niebla de tormenta"],"fr":["Assurer une génération cohérente de biomes","Calculer les positions des gardes chaudes/froides","Déterminer les positions des frontières de brouillard de tempête"],"de":["Konsistente Biome-Generierung sicherstellen","Platzierungen von warmen/kalten Wächtern berechnen","Sturmnebelfronten-Positionen bestimmen"],"pt":["Garantir geração de biomas consistente","Calcular colocação de guardas quentes/frias","Determinar posições de bordos de nevoeiro de tempestade"],"ru":["Обеспечить последовательную генерацию биомов","Рассчитать размещение теплых/холодных охранников","Определить позиции границ тумана шторма"],"ar":["ضمان توليد بيئات متسقة","حساب وضع حراس الدفء والبرودة","تحديد مواقف أحزمة ضباب العاصفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Minecraft Fabric mod environment","World border size must be accessible"],"zh":["需要Minecraft Fabric模组环境","世界边界大小必须是可访问的"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabricモッド環境が必要","世界の境界サイズがアクセス可能である必要がある"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드 환경 필요","세계 경계 크기가 접근 가능한 경우"],"es":["Requiere entorno de modificación de Minecraft Fabric","El tamaño del borde del mundo debe ser accesible"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de modification Minecraft Fabric","La taille de la frontière du monde doit être accessible"],"de":["Benötigt Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Umgebung","Die Weltgrenzen-Größe muss zugänglich sein"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de mod Fabric do Minecraft","O tamanho da borda do mundo deve ser acessível"],"ru":["Требует среды мода Fabric Minecraft","Размер границы мира должен быть доступным"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة مود فابريك مايكرافت","يجب أن يكون حجم حدود العالم قابلاً للوصول"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('joolbits/slabbed/slabbed-savepoint-discipline', 'community', 'joolbits', 'slabbed', 'joolbits/slabbed', 'slabbed-savepoint-discipline', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T09:58:08.732Z', NULL, '{"id":"joolbits/slabbed/slabbed-savepoint-discipline","name":"slabbed-savepoint-discipline","description":{"zh":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline是一种代码开发方法，旨在通过一致的提交和标签管理来确保代码的安全性和可逆性","ja":"Slabbed Savepoint Disciplineは、コードの安全性と可逆性を保つために一貫したコミットとタグ管理を実現する開発手法です","ko":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline는 일관된 커밋과 태그 관리를 통해 코드의 안전성과可逆성을 보장하는 개발 방법입니다","es":"La disciplina de punto de guardado Slabbed promueve la seguridad y reversibilidad en el desarrollo con principios como un cambio por commit y construcción exitosa","fr":"La discipline de point de sauvegarde Slabbed favorise la sécurité et la réversibilité dans le développement avec des principes tels qu''un changement par commit et une construction réussie","de":"Die Slabbed-Speicherpunktdisziplin fördert Sicherheit und Rückgängigheit in der Entwicklung mit Prinzipien wie einer Änderung pro Commit und erfolgreicher Konstruktion","pt":"O Slabbed Savepoint Discipline é uma abordagem para manter o desenvolvimento de código seguro e reversível.","ru":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline - это подход для поддержания безопасного и обратимого кодирования.","ar":"نظام الانضباط للحفظ على الصفيح هو نهج للحفاظ على سلامة واعادة التكرار للكود","en":"Put things on slabs!"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline：代码安全与可逆的开发方法","ja":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline：コードの安全性と可逆性を保つ開発手法","ko":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline: 코드 안전 및可逆 개발 방법","es":"Disciplina de Punto de Guardado Slabbed","fr":"Discipline de Point de Sauvegarde Slabbed","de":"Slabbed-Speicherpunktdisziplin","pt":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline: Melhorias na Segurança do C...","ru":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline: Безопасность Кодирования","ar":"نظام الانضباط للحفظ على الصفيح: سلامة الكود","en":"slabbed-savepoint-discipline"},"description":{"zh":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline是一种代码开发方法，旨在通过一致的提交和标签管理来确保代码的安全性和可逆性","ja":"Slabbed Savepoint Disciplineは、コードの安全性と可逆性を保つために一貫したコミットとタグ管理を実現する開発手法です","ko":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline는 일관된 커밋과 태그 관리를 통해 코드의 안전성과可逆성을 보장하는 개발 방법입니다","es":"La disciplina de punto de guardado Slabbed promueve la seguridad y reversibilidad en el desarrollo con principios como un cambio por commit y construcción ex...","fr":"La discipline de point de sauvegarde Slabbed favorise la sécurité et la réversibilité dans le développement avec des principes tels qu''un changement par comm...","de":"Die Slabbed-Speicherpunktdisziplin fördert Sicherheit und Rückgängigheit in der Entwicklung mit Prinzipien wie einer Änderung pro Commit und erfolgreicher Ko...","pt":"O Slabbed Savepoint Discipline é uma abordagem para manter o desenvolvimento de código seguro e reversível.","ru":"Slabbed Savepoint Discipline - это подход для поддержания безопасного и обратимого кодирования.","ar":"نظام الانضباط للحفظ على الصفيح هو نهج للحفاظ على سلامة واعادة التكرار للكود","en":"Put things on slabs!"},"definition":{"en":"Put things on slabs!"},"features":{"zh":["一致的提交管理","标签管理","代码安全性和可逆性","一变量一提交","构建必须在提交前通过"],"ja":["一貫したコミット管理","タグ管理","コードの安全性と可逆性","1変数1コミット","ビルドはコミット前に通過する必要がある"],"ko":["일관된 커밋 관리","태그 관리","코드 안전성과可逆성","1변수1커밋","빌드는 커밋 전에 통과해야 한다"],"es":["Un cambio por commit","Construcción exitosa antes de cada commit","Etiquetas para hitos y comportamientos funcionales","Nunca ''roturas misteriosas''","Verificación de estado de Git antes de editar","Informar en lugar de adivinar"],"fr":["Un changement par commit","Construction réussie avant chaque commit","Étiquettes pour les jalons et les comportements fonctionnels","Jamais de ''cassures mystérieuses''","Vérification de l''état de Git avant de modifier","Signaler plutôt que deviner"],"de":["Eine Änderung pro Commit","Erfolgreiche Konstruktion vor jedem Commit","Schlagwörter für Meilensteine und funktionale Verhaltensweisen","Niemals ''mysteriöse Fehler''","Überprüfung des Git-Status vor der Bearbeitung","Melden anstelle von Raten"],"pt":["Um commit por alteração","Compilação obrigatória antes do commit","Uso de tags para marcos","Proibição de ''quebras misteriosas''","Uso de `git status` limpo antes de editar","Relatório em caso de incerteza"],"ru":["Один коммит на изменение","Обязательная компиляция перед коммитом","Использование тегов для вех","Запрет на ''таинственные поломки''","Использование чистого `git status` перед редактированием","Отчет в случае неопределенности"],"ar":["التعديل في كل Commit","التجميع قبل Commit","استخدام Tags للتواريخ","منع الكسوف الغامض","استخدام git status قبل التعديل","التقرير في حالة الشك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码安全","可逆性","提交管理","标签管理","Slabbed Savepoint Discipline","代码开发方法"],"ja":["コードの安全性","可逆性","コミット管理","タグ管理","Slabbed Savepoint Discipline","コード開発手法"],"ko":["코드 안전","可逆성","커밋 관리","태그 관리","Slabbed Savepoint Discipline","코드 개발 방법"],"es":["desarrollo de software","seguridad en el desarrollo","reversibilidad en el desarrollo","commit de una sola variable","construcción exitosa","etiquetas de hitos","informes de errores","desarrollo de software ágil"],"fr":["développement de logiciels","sécurité dans le développement","réversibilité dans le développement","commit d''une seule variable","construction réussie","étiquettes de jalons","rapports d''erreurs","développement de logiciels agile"],"de":["Software-Entwicklung","Sicherheit in der Entwicklung","Rückgängigheit in der Entwicklung","Commit einer einzigen Variable","erfolgreiche Konstruktion","Schlagwörter für Meilensteine","Fehlerberichte","agile Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de código seguro","desenvolvimento reversível","Slabbed Savepoint Discipline","disciplina de desenvolvimento","segurança do código","reversibilidade do código","desenvolvimento de software","práticas de desenvolvimento","git"],"ru":["безопасное кодирование","обратимое кодирование","Slabbed Savepoint Discipline","дисциплина разработки","безопасность кода","обратимость кода","разработка программного обеспечения","практики разработки","git"],"ar":["سلامة الكود","اعادة التكرار للكود","نظام الانضباط للحفظ على الصفيح","نظام الانضباط لتطوير الكود","سلامة الكود","اعادة التكرار للكود","تطوير البرمجيات","ممارسات التطوير","git"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"slabbed","repoPath":"joolbits/slabbed","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slabbed-savepoint-discipline","description":"Enforce tiny-diff commits, clean builds, and tagged savepoints during Slabbed development.","bodyPreview":"# Slabbed — Savepoint Discipline (Tiny Diffs, Always Recoverable)\n\n## Goal\nKeep Slabbed development safe and reversible:\n- one change per commit\n- always runnable\n- tags for milestones\n- never “mystery breakage”\n\n## Core rules (non-negotiable)\n1) One variable per commit.\n2) Build must pass before commit.\n3) Tag every milestone and every “first working” behavior.\n4) If you’re unsure, stop and report instead of guessing.\n\n\n## Start-of-work checklist\nBefore any edits:\n- `git status` must be clean\n-","body":"# Slabbed — Savepoint Discipline (Tiny Diffs, Always Recoverable)\n\n## Goal\nKeep Slabbed development safe and reversible:\n- one change per commit\n- always runnable\n- tags for milestones\n- never “mystery breakage”\n\n## Core rules (non-negotiable)\n1) One variable per commit.\n2) Build must pass before commit.\n3) Tag every milestone and every “first working” behavior.\n4) If you’re unsure, stop and report instead of guessing.\n\n\n## Start-of-work checklist\nBefore any edits:\n- `git status` must be clean\n- record current branch name\n- record current HEAD hash\n- confirm `./gradlew build` currently passes (skip if already verified in last 10 minutes with no changes)\n\nIf any fail: stop and report.\n\n\n## Commit sizing\nA “normal” commit should:\n- touch ≤ 3 files (unless it’s generated metadata updates)\n- contain ≤ ~150 lines changed\n- implement exactly one narrow goal\n\nIf it exceeds these, split into multiple commits.\n\n\n## Mandatory pre-commit checks\nBefore every commit:\n- `./gradlew build` \n- if mixins changed: run client once (`./gradlew runClient`) until main menu\n- confirm no new warnings about mixin targets / refmap / access wideners\n\n\n## Tagging convention\nUse lightweight tags.\n\n### Milestone tags\n- `slabbed-bootstrap` (already used)\n- `slabbed-first-mixin-hook` \n- `slabbed-first-placement-pass` \n- `slabbed-first-survival-pass` \n- `slabbed-alpha-0.1.0` \n\n### Debug tags (temporary)\n- `tmp/<short-desc>` e.g. `tmp/dust-canplaceat` \n\nDelete tmp tags later if desired.\n\n\n## Commit message convention\nUse these prefixes:\n- `chore:` setup, formatting, build files\n- `feat:` new behavior\n- `fix:` bug fix\n- `test:` test infrastructure/world notes\n- `docs:` readme/changelog\n\nExamples:\n- `feat: allow floor torches on slab tops` \n- `fix: prevent redstone dust popping off on neighbor update` \n- `chore: add slab support helper predicates` \n\n\n## Rollback protocol\nIf something breaks:\n1) Do not keep editing randomly.\n2) Identify last known good tag/hash.\n3) `git reset --hard <tag>` \n4) Re-run `./gradlew build` to confirm.\n5) Re-apply changes in smaller pieces.\n\n\n## Output report format (required)\nAfter every unit of work, report:\n- What changed (1 sentence)\n- Files touched\n- Build status (pass/fail)\n- Commit hash + tag (if created)\n\nNo extra commentary.\n\n\n## Stop conditions\n- Build fails and you cannot fix in 1–2 focused edits → stop and report.\n- Any mixin “no targets” / mapping mismatch appears → stop and run `slabbed-mixin-target-discovery` next.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:58:08.732Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing strict commit discipline and tiny diffs for safe development.","zh":"非常适合需要严格提交纪律和微小差异以确保安全开发的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが厳格なコミット規律と安全な開発のための小さな差分を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":" 엄격한 커밋 규율과 안전한 개발을 위한 작은 차이를 필요로 하는 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Control de Versiones que necesitan una disciplina de compromiso estricta y diferencias pequeñas para un desarrollo seguro.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Contrôle de Version nécessitant une discipline de commit stricte et de petites différences pour un développement sécurisé.","de":"Perfekt für Version-Control-Agents, die eine strenge Commit-Disciplin und kleine Diffs für eine sichere Entwicklung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Controle de Versão que necessitam de disciplina de commit estrita e difs minúsculas para desenvolvimento seguro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов системы контроля версий, требующих строгой дисциплины коммитов и минимальных изменений для безопасной разработки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة الإصدار الذين يحتاجون إلى انضباط التزام صارم وتغييرات صغيرة لضمان سلامة التطوير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain a clean git history with one change per commit, ensuring always runnable code and recoverable milestones through tagging, while preventing mystery breakage by enforcing a strict stop and report policy when unsure, utilizing git status checks and build validation.","zh":"赋予代理维护干净的 Git 历史记录的能力，每次提交一个更改，确保始终可运行的代码和可恢复的里程碑通过标签，同时通过强制执行严格的停止和报告策略来防止神秘的中断，当不确定时，利用 Git 状态检查和构建验证。","ja":"エージェントが、1 つの変更ごとに 1 つのコミットを行い、タグ付けによって常に実行可能なコードと回復可能なマイルストーンを確保し、不確実な場合に厳格な停止および報告ポリシーを適用し、Git の状態チェックとビルドの検証を使用することで、きれいな Git 歴史を維持する能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 한 번에 하나의 변경 사항을 커밋하여 항상 실행 가능한 코드와 복구 가능한 마일스톤을 태그를 통해 보장하고, 불확실한 경우에 엄격한 중지 및 보고 정책을 적용하고, Git 상태 확인 및 빌드 검증을 사용하여 깨끗한 Git 기록을 유지할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para mantener un historial de git limpio con un cambio por commit, asegurando siempre un código ejecutable y hitos recuperables a través de la etiquetado, mientras previene la rotura misteriosa al aplicar una política estricta de detención y notificación cuando no esté seguro, utilizando verificaciones de estado de git y validación de compilación.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour maintenir un historique git propre avec un changement par commit, en garantissant toujours un code exécutable et des jalons récupérables via l''étiquetage, tout en prévenant les ruptures mystérieuses en imposant une politique stricte d''arrêt et de signalement lorsqu''ils sont incertains, en utilisant les vérifications d''état git et la validation de construction.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ein sauberes Git-Verlauf mit einer Änderung pro Commit zu pflegen, um immer ausführbaren Code und wiederherstellbare Meilensteine durch Tagging sicherzustellen, während es das mysteriöse Brechen durch die Durchsetzung einer strengen Stopp- und Berichtspolitik bei Unsicherheit verhindert, indem es Git-Status-Checks und Build-Validierung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter um histórico de git limpo com uma alteração por commit, garantindo sempre código executável e marcos recuperáveis por meio de marcação, enquanto impede a quebra de mistério ao impor uma política de parada e relatório estrita quando incerto, utilizando verificações de status do git e validação de compilação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам поддерживать чистую историю git с одним изменением на коммит, гарантируя всегда запускаемый код и восстанавливаемые вехи посредством тегирования, а также предотвращает загадочные сбои, обеспечивая строгую политику остановки и отчетности при неопределенности, используя проверки статуса git и валидацию сборки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على تاريخ تشغيل git نظيف مع تغيير واحد لكل عملية إصدار، مما يضمن دائمًا تشغيل رمز قابل للتشغيل ومراحل قابلة للاستعادة من خلال الترميز، في حين يمنع حدوث انكسار غامض من خلال فرض سياسة وقف تقرير صارمة عند الشك، باستخدام فحوصات حالة git وتصحيح بناء."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing one variable per commit for transparent code changes","Automating milestone tagging for easy version tracking","Debugging code issues with tiny diffs for efficient error resolution"],"zh":["强制每次提交一个变量以实现透明的代码更改","自动化里程碑标签以实现易于版本跟踪","使用微小的差异进行代码问题的调试以实现高效的错误解决"],"ja":["透明なコードの変更を実現するために、1 回のコミットにつき 1 つの変数を強制します","バージョンの追跡を容易にするために、マイルストーンのタグ付けを自動化します","効率的なエラー解決を実現するために、微小な差分を使用してコードの問題をデバッグします"],"ko":["투명한 코드 변경을 구현하기 위해 한 번의 커밋당 하나의 변수를 강제합니다","버전 추적을 쉽게 하기 위해 마일스톤 태그를 자동화합니다","효율적인 오류 해결을 위해 작은 차이를 사용하여 코드 문제를 디버깅합니다"],"es":["Forzar un cambio de variable por commit para cambios de código transparentes","Automatizar la etiquetado de hitos para un seguimiento de versiones fácil","Depurar problemas de código con diferencias pequeñas para una resolución eficiente de errores"],"fr":["Imposer un changement de variable par commit pour des modifications de code transparentes","Automatiser l''étiquetage des jalons pour un suivi de version facile","Déboguer les problèmes de code avec de petites différences pour une résolution efficace des erreurs"],"de":["Ein Commit pro Variable für transparente Code-Änderungen erzwingen","Automatisierung der Meilenstein-Tagging für einfache Version-Verfolgung","Fehlerbehebung mit kleinen Diffs für eine effiziente Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["Impor uma variável por commit para alterações de código transparentes","Automatizar marcação de marcos para acompanhamento fácil de versão","Depurar problemas de código com difs minúsculas para resolução eficiente de erros"],"ru":["Внедрение одной переменной на коммит для прозрачных изменений кода","Автоматизация тегирования вех для легкого отслеживания версий","Отладка проблем кода с минимальными изменениями для эффективного решения ошибок"],"ar":["إلزام المتغيرات واحدة لكل عملية إصدار لتحديثات شفافة","تأتمتية وضع علامات المراحل لتسهيل تتبع الإصدارات","تصحيح أخطاء الشفرة مع تغييرات صغيرة لحل効 الأخطاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git version control system","Mandatory clean git status before edits","Strict adherence to core rules"],"zh":["需要 Git 版本控制系统","编辑前必须有干净的 Git 状态","必须严格遵守核心规则"],"ja":["Git バージョン管理システムが必要です","編集前の Git 状態がクリーンである必要があります","コア ルールに厳格に従う必要があります"],"ko":["Git 버전 제어 시스템이 필요합니다","편집 전 깨끗한 Git 상태가 필요합니다","코어 규칙을 엄격히 따라야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere sistema de control de versiones git","Estado de git limpio obligatorio antes de las ediciones","Cumplimiento estricto de las reglas básicas"],"fr":["Nécessite le système de contrôle de version git","État git propre obligatoire avant les éditions","Conformité stricte aux règles de base"],"de":["Erfordert Git-Versionierungssystem","Sauberer Git-Status vor Bearbeitungen obligatorisch","Strenges Befolgen der Kernregeln"],"pt":["Exige sistema de controle de versão git","Estado de git limpo obrigatório antes das edições","Adesão estrita às regras principais"],"ru":["Требует системы контроля версий git","Обязательный чистый статус git перед редактированием","Строгое соблюдение основных правил"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام التحكم في الإصدارات git","حالة git نظيفة إجبارية قبل التحرير","الامتثال الصارم للقواعد الأساسية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
