estadas","Respeito à arquitetura do RE-Engine","Atendimento aos requisitos de deploy em produção","Uso de TypeScript strict mode","Execução de testes automatizados"],"ru":["Реализация утвержденных планов","Небольшие, протестированные изменения","Уважение архитектуры RE-Engine","Выполнение требований к развертыванию в производство","Использование TypeScript strict mode","Выполнение автоматических тестов"],"ar":["تنفيذ الخطط المعتمدة","تغييرات صغيرة ومتجربة","احترام هندسة RE-Engine","الامتثال لمتطلبات النشر في الإنتاج","استخدام نمط TypeScript strict","تشغيل الاختبارات الآلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MCP 实现计划","系统性的实施方法","小型、测试驱动的变化","RE-Engine 架构","TypeScript 严格模式","生产部署要求"],"ja":["MCP 実装計画","体系的な実施方法","小さなテスト駆動の変更","RE-Engine アーキテクチャ","TypeScript の厳格モード","プロダクション デプロイ要件"],"ko":["MCP 구현 계획","체계적인 구현 방법","작은 테스트 주도 변경","RE-Engine 아키텍처","TypeScript 엄격 모드","프로덕션 배포 요구 사항"],"es":["MCP","implementar plan","RE-Engine","TypeScript","pruebas","despliegue de producción","arquitectura de software"],"fr":["MCP","mettre en œuvre un plan","RE-Engine","TypeScript","tests","déploiement de production","architecture logicielle"],"de":["MCP","Plan umsetzen","RE-Engine","TypeScript","Tests","Produktionsbereitstellung","Softwarearchitektur"],"pt":["Implementação de plano MCP","Desenvolvimento de software","Testes automatizados","TypeScript strict mode","RE-Engine","Deploy em produção","Mudanças pequenas e testadas","Desenvolvimento ágil"],"ru":["Реализация плана MCP","Разработка программного обеспечения","Автоматические тесты","TypeScript strict mode","RE-Engine","Развертывание в производство","Небольшие, протестированные изменения","Гибкая разработка"],"ar":["تنفيذ خطة MCP","تطوير البرمجيات","الاختبارات الآلية","نمط TypeScript strict","RE-Engine","النشر في الإنتاج","تغييرات صغيرة ومتجربة","التطوير المرن"]}},"owner":"stackconsult","repo":"RE-Engine","repoPath":"stackconsult/RE-Engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp-implement-plan","description":"Execute approved implementation plans through iterative, test-backed development while maintaining RE-Engine architecture and MCP integration patterns","bodyPreview":"# Purpose\nSystematically implement approved plans using small, test-backed changes that respect RE-Engine''s architecture, TypeScript strict mode, and production deployment requirements.\n\n# Prerequisites\n- ✅ Approved plan exists in `plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md`\n- ✅ Repository documentation is current (run @mcp-repo-scan if uncertain)\n- ✅ No uncommitted changes exist\n- ✅ All tests pass on current state: `npm test && npm run test:integration`\n\n# Implementation Strategy\nFollow iterative, test-driven","body":"# Purpose\nSystematically implement approved plans using small, test-backed changes that respect RE-Engine''s architecture, TypeScript strict mode, and production deployment requirements.\n\n# Prerequisites\n- ✅ Approved plan exists in `plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md`\n- ✅ Repository documentation is current (run @mcp-repo-scan if uncertain)\n- ✅ No uncommitted changes exist\n- ✅ All tests pass on current state: `npm test && npm run test:integration`\n\n# Implementation Strategy\nFollow iterative, test-driven approach:\n1. Work one plan step at a time\n2. Make minimal, focused changes\n3. Test after each change\n4. Commit frequently with descriptive messages\n5. Document decisions inline\n\n# Execution Phase\n\n## 1. Environment Setup\n**Steps:**\n1. Ensure on correct branch (usually `develop`)\n2. Pull latest changes: `git pull origin develop`\n3. Install dependencies if needed: `npm install`\n4. Verify build: `npm run build`\n5. Verify tests: `npm test && npm run test:integration`\n\n## 2. Iterative Implementation\n**For each step in the approved plan:**\n\n### Step A: Code Changes\n1. Identify target files from plan\n2. Follow existing patterns and conventions:\n   - Respect TypeScript strict mode\n   - Follow error handling patterns\n   - Use existing utility functions where applicable\n   - Maintain consistent naming conventions\n\n3. Make minimal changes to achieve goal\n4. Add inline comments for complex logic\n5. Ensure code is testable\n\n### Step B: Unit Testing\n1. Create or update unit tests for changed code\n2. Test edge cases and error conditions\n3. Verify test coverage for new code\n4. Run tests: `npm test` in affected component\n5. Fix any failures before proceeding\n\n**Component-Specific Testing:**\n- **Engine:** Test service methods, API handlers, business logic\n- **Web-Dashboard:** Test React components, hooks, API calls\n- **Playwright:** Test automation scenarios, page interactions\n- **MCP Servers:** Test tool handlers, input validation, error responses\n\n### Step C: Integration Testing\n1. Test integration with other components\n2. Verify data flow between components\n3. Test API endpoints (if applicable)\n4. Run integration tests: `npm run test:integration`\n5. Fix any failures\n\n### Step D: Type Checking & Linting\n1. Run type checker: `npm run typecheck`\n2. Fix any TypeScript errors\n3. Run linter: `npm run lint`\n4. Fix any linting issues\n5. Run formatter: `npm run format`\n6. Verify code style compliance\n\n### Step E: Commit Changes\n1. Stage changed files: `git add <files>`\n2. Write descriptive commit message following conventional commits:\n   - `feat:` for new features\n   - `fix:` for bug fixes\n   - `refactor:` for code refactoring\n   - `docs:` for documentation changes\n   - `test:` for test changes\n   - `chore:` for maintenance tasks\n3. Commit: `git commit -m \"descriptive message\"`\n\n## 3. MCP Integration (If Applicable)\n\n### If Adding/Modifying MCP Tools:\n1. Define tool schema in MCP server\n2. Implement tool handler with error handling\n3. Add unit tests for tool logic\n4. Test tool invocation locally\n5. Document tool in `docs/MCP_SERVERS.md`\n\n### If Creating New MCP Server:\n1. Create directory: `mcp/mcp-reengine-<name>/`\n2. Initialize with package.json\n3. Define tool schemas\n4. Implement tool handlers\n5. Add test scripts\n6. Document in `docs/MCP_SERVERS.md`\n\n### MCP Testing:\n1. Start MCP servers: `npm run mcp:start`\n2. Test tool calls from Cascade or test scripts\n3. Verify tool responses match schema\n4. Test error conditions\n5. Document any changes needed\n\n## 4. Cross-Component Testing\n**After all component changes:**\n\n1. Run full test suite in each component:\n   ```bash\n   cd engine && npm test && cd -\n   cd web-dashboard && npm test && cd -\n   cd playwright && npm test && cd -\n   cd mcp/mcp-reengine-core && npm test && cd -\n   cd mcp/mcp-reengine-browser && npm test && cd -\n   cd mcp/mcp-reengine-tinyfish && npm test && cd -\n   ```\n2. Run integration tests: `npm run test:integration`\n3. Verify Playwright tests: `npm run test:e2e` (if applicable)\n4. Verify build: `npm run build`\n\n## 5. Documentation Updates\n\n### Update Documentation Files:\n1. Update `docs/CHANGELOG.md`:\n   - Add entry with date, category, and description\n   - Link to relevant PRs or commits\n   - Note any breaking changes\n\n2. Update `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` (if structure changed):\n   - Document new components or patterns\n   - Update component responsibilities\n   - Add diagrams if helpful\n\n3. Update `docs/FLOWS.md` (if workflows changed):\n   - Document new or modified flows\n   - Update flow diagrams\n   - Note any user-facing changes\n\n4. Update `docs/MCP_SERVERS.md` (if MCP changed):\n   - Document new tools or servers\n   - Update tool descriptions\n   - Add usage examples\n\n5. Update inline documentation:\n   - Add JSDoc comments for new public APIs\n   - Update existing comments for clarity\n   - Document complex algorithms\n\n## 6. Quality Gates\n\n### Verify All Quality Requirements:\n1. **TypeScript:** No type errors (`npm run typecheck`)\n2. **Linting:** No linting errors (`npm run lint`)\n3. **Tests:** All tests pass (`npm test && npm run test:integration`)\n4. **Build:** Successful build (`npm run build`)\n5. **Security:** No vulnerabilities (`npm audit`)\n\n### If Quality Gates Fail:\n- Analyze failures\n- Fix issues\n- Re-run tests\n- Document fixes in commit messages\n\n## 7. Commit & Push\n\n### Final Commit:\n1. Stage all changes: `git add .`\n2. Review changes: `git status`\n3. Create final commit:\n   ```bash\n   git commit -m \"feat: implement <feature>\n   \n   - Add <specific changes>\n   - Update <relevant files>\n   - Add tests for <new functionality>\n   \n   Closes: <issue number if applicable>\"\n   ```\n4. Push to branch: `git push origin <branch-name>`\n\n## 8. Pull Request Preparation\n\n### Create PR Description:\n- Use template from PR_DESCRIPTION.md\n- Link to plan: `plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md`\n- Summarize changes\n- List breaking changes (if any)\n- Note testing performed\n- Request specific review focus areas\n\n### PR Checklist:\n- ✅ All tests passing\n- ✅ Documentation updated\n- ✅ Type-checking clean\n- ✅ Linting clean\n- ✅ No security vulnerabilities\n- ✅ Build successful\n- ✅ Changes align with plan\n\n## 9. Post-Implementation Review\n\n### Verify Implementation:\nAfter implementation complete:\n1. Run full test suite again\n2. Verify all components build\n3. Test end-to-end flows\n4. Verify MCP integration (if applicable)\n5. Document any lessons learned\n\n### Present to User:\nProvide implementation summary:\n1. Changes made\n2. Tests passed\n3. Documentation updated\n4. Any deviations from plan\n5. Next steps (testing, review, deployment)\n6. Request user approval for next phase (testing, PR, or deployment)\n\n***\n\n**Supporting Files:**\n- `.windsurf/skills/mcp-implement-plan/commit-template.md`\n- `.windsurf/skills/mcp-implement-plan/test-strategy.md`\n- `.windsurf/skills/mcp-implement-plan/mcp-testing-guide.md`\n- `.windsurf/skills/mcp-implement-plan/quality-gate-checklist.md`"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:58:53.086Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-focused AI Agents requiring structured plan implementation and test-driven development in RE-Engine''s architecture","zh":"适用于需要结构化计划实施和测试驱动开发的TypeScript专注的AI代理，特别是在RE-Engine的架构中","ja":"TypeScriptに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが、RE-Engineのアーキテクチャで構造化された計画の実装とテスト駆動開発を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"TypeScript에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 구조화된 계획 구현 및 테스트 주도 개발을 RE-Engine 아키텍처에서 필요로 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial enfocados en TypeScript que requieren implementación de planes estructurados y desarrollo impulsado por pruebas en la arquitectura de RE-Engine","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur TypeScript nécessitant une mise en œuvre de plans structurés et un développement piloté par des tests dans l''architecture de RE-Engine","de":"Ideal für TypeScript-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine strukturierte Planimplementierung und testgetriebene Entwicklung in der RE-Engine-Architektur erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em TypeScript que requerem implementação de plano estruturado e desenvolvimento orientado a testes na arquitetura do RE-Engine","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на TypeScript, требующих реализации структурированного плана и разработки, управляемой тестами, в архитектуре RE-Engine","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على لغة TypeScript ويحتاج إلى تنفيذ خطة منظمة وتطوير مدفوع بالاختبارات في هندسة RE-Engine"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically implement approved plans using small, test-backed changes that respect TypeScript strict mode and production deployment requirements, leveraging iterative development and npm test scripts","zh":"赋予代理以系统的方式实施批准的计划，使用小的、测试支持的更改，尊重TypeScript严格模式和生产部署要求，利用迭代开发和npm测试脚本","ja":"エージェントが承認された計画を体系的に実装できるようにし、小さなテストをバックアップした変更を使用して、TypeScriptの厳格モードと本番環境へのデプロイ要件を尊重し、反復開発とnpmテストスクリプトを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 체계적으로 승인된 계획을 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 작은 테스트를 지원하는 변경 사항을 사용하여 TypeScript의 엄격한 모드 및 프로덕션 배포 요구 사항을尊重하며, 반복 개발 및 npm 테스트 스크립트를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar sistemáticamente planes aprobados utilizando cambios pequeños y respaldados por pruebas que respeten el modo estricto de TypeScript y los requisitos de implementación de producción, aprovechando el desarrollo iterativo y los scripts de prueba de npm","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre systématiquement des plans approuvés en utilisant de petits changements et des tests pour respecter le mode strict de TypeScript et les exigences de déploiement de production, en exploitant le développement itératif et les scripts de test npm","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, genehmigte Pläne systematisch umzusetzen, indem sie kleine, testgestützte Änderungen verwenden, die den Strict-Modus von TypeScript und die Produktionsbereitstellungsanforderungen respektieren, und iterative Entwicklung und npm-Testskripte nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar planos aprovados de forma sistemática, utilizando alterações pequenas e respaldadas por testes que respeitam o modo estrito do TypeScript e os requisitos de implantação em produção, aproveitando o desenvolvimento iterativo e scripts de teste do npm","ru":"Позволяет агентам систематически реализовывать утвержденные планы, используя небольшие изменения, подтвержденные тестами, которые уважают строгий режим TypeScript и требования к производственной среде, используя итеративную разработку и скрипты тестирования npm","ar":"تمكن العملاء من تنفيذ الخطط المعتمدة بطريقة منهجية، من خلال استخدام تغييرات صغيرة مدعومة باختبارات التي تحترم وضع TypeScript الصارم ومتطلبات النشر في الإنتاج، من خلال استخدام التطوير التكراري وبرامج اختبار npm"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing approved plans in RE-Engine","Executing test-driven development with npm test and integration tests","Ensuring compliance with production deployment requirements"],"zh":["在RE-Engine中实施批准的计划","使用npm测试和集成测试执行测试驱动开发","确保遵守生产部署要求"],"ja":["RE-Engineで承認された計画を実装する","npmテストと統合テストを使用してテスト駆動開発を実行する","本番環境へのデプロイ要件を遵守する"],"ko":["RE-Engine에서 승인된 계획을 구현","npm 테스트 및 통합 테스트를 사용하여 테스트 주도 개발을 수행","프로덕션 배포 요구 사항을 준수"],"es":["Implementar planes aprobados en RE-Engine","Ejecutar desarrollo impulsado por pruebas con npm test y pruebas de integración","Garantizar el cumplimiento de los requisitos de implementación de producción"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des plans approuvés dans RE-Engine","Exécuter le développement piloté par des tests avec npm test et des tests d''intégration","Assurer le respect des exigences de déploiement de production"],"de":["Genehmigte Pläne in RE-Engine umzusetzen","Testgetriebene Entwicklung mit npm-Test und Integrations-tests ausführen","Die Einhaltung der Produktionsbereitstellungsanforderungen sicherstellen"],"pt":["Implementação de planos aprovados no RE-Engine","Execução de desenvolvimento orientado a testes com npm test e testes de integração","Garantia de conformidade com os requisitos de implantação em produção"],"ru":["Реализация утвержденных планов в RE-Engine","Выполнение разработки, управляемой тестами, с помощью npm test и интеграционных тестов","Обеспечение соответствия требованиям производственной среды"],"ar":["تنفيذ الخطط المعتمدة في هندسة RE-Engine","تنفيذ التطوير الموجه بالاختبارات باستخدام npm test والاختبارات التكاملية","ضمان مطابقة متطلبات النشر في الإنتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires approved plan in plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md format","Needs current repository documentation and no uncommitted changes","Dependent on successful npm test and integration test runs"],"zh":["需要批准的计划在plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md格式中","需要当前存储库文档和没有未提交的更改","依赖于成功的npm测试和集成测试运行"],"ja":["plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md形式の承認された計画が必要","現在のリポジトリドキュメントとコミットされていない変更がなくなる","成功したnpmテストと統合テストの実行に依存する"],"ko":["plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md 형식의 승인된 계획이 필요","현재 저장소 문서 및 커밋되지 않은 변경 사항이 없는 경우","성공한 npm 테스트 및 통합 테스트 실행에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un plan aprobado en formato plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md","Necesita documentación actual del repositorio y no puede haber cambios no confirmados","Depende de la ejecución exitosa de npm test y pruebas de integración"],"fr":["Nécessite un plan approuvé au format plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md","Nécessite une documentation actuelle du référentiel et ne peut avoir de changements non validés","Dépend de l''exécution réussie de npm test et des tests d''intégration"],"de":["Benötigt einen genehmigten Plan im Format plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md","Benötigt aktuelle Repository-Dokumentation und keine uncommitteten Änderungen","Hängt von erfolgreichen npm-Test- und Integrations-Test-Läufen ab"],"pt":["Exige plano aprovado no formato plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md","Necessita de documentação do repositório atual e sem alterações não commitadas","Depende de execuções bem-sucedidas de npm test e testes de integração"],"ru":["Требует утвержденного плана в формате plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md","Требует текущей документации репозитория и отсутствия незафиксированных изменений","Зависит от успешного выполнения npm test и интеграционных тестов"],"ar":["يتطلب خطة معتمدة بصيغة plans/YYYY-MM-DD-target.md","يحتاج إلى توثيق للمستودع الحالي وبدون تغييرات غير موقعة","يعتمد على تشغيل ناجح لبرامج اختبار npm واختبارات التكامل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
