括的なガイドです","ko":"Emil Kowalski 애니메이션 최고의 관행은 웹 인터페이스의 애니메이션 효과를 최적화 하기 위한 포괄적인 가이드입니다","es":"Guía de animaciones para interfaces web con 43 reglas en 7 categorías, basada en las enseñanzas de Emil Kowalski","fr":"Guide d''animations pour les interfaces web avec 43 règles dans 7 catégories, basé sur les enseignements d''Emil Kowalski","de":"Animationsleitfaden für Webinterfaces mit 43 Regeln in 7 Kategorien, basierend auf Emil Kowalskis Lehren","pt":"Guia de animação abrangente para interfaces web com base nas lições de Emil Kowal e bibliotecas de código aberto","ru":"Комплексное руководство по анимации для веб-интерфейсов на основе учения Эмиля Ковальски и открытых библиотек","ar":"دليل شامل للتحريك لواجهات الويب بناءً على تعاليم إميل كووالسكي ومكتبات مفتوحة المصدر","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["涵盖 43 条动画规则","7 个动画分类","优化 web 界面动画效果","适用于 React 组件","包含 easing曲线和时序值选择指南"],"ja":["43 のアニメーション ルールを含む","7 つのアニメーション カテゴリー","Web インターフェイスのアニメーションを最適化","React コンポーネント対応","イージング曲線とタイミング値の選択ガイドを含む"],"ko":["43개의 애니메이션 규칙 포함","7개의 애니메이션 분류","웹 인터페이스의 애니메이션 효과를 최적화","React 컴포넌트 지원","이징 곡선과 타이밍 값 선택 가이드 포함"],"es":["43 reglas de animación en 7 categorías","Basado en las enseñanzas de Emil Kowalski","Incluye bibliotecas de código abierto como Sonner y Vaul","Guía para agregar animaciones a componentes React","Ejemplos de implementación de interacciones basadas en gestos","Priorización de reglas por impacto"],"fr":["43 règles d''animation dans 7 catégories","Basé sur les enseignements d''Emil Kowalski","Inclut des bibliothèques open source comme Sonner et Vaul","Guide pour ajouter des animations aux composants React","Exemples d''implémentation d''interactions basées sur les gestes","Priorisation des règles par impact"],"de":["43 Animationsregeln in 7 Kategorien","Basierend auf Emil Kowalskis Lehren","Enthält Open-Source-Bibliotheken wie Sonner und Vaul","Leitfaden zum Hinzufügen von Animationen zu React-Komponenten","Beispiele für die Implementierung von gestenbasierten Interaktionen","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Auswirkung"],"pt":["43 regras de animação em 7 categorias","Priorização por impacto","Guia de implementação de interações baseadas em gestos","Easing curves e valores de temporização","Integração com bibliotecas de código aberto"],"ru":["43 правила анимации в 7 категориях","Приоритезация по воздействию","Руководство по реализации жестовых взаимодействий","Кривые замедления и временные значения","Интеграция с открытыми библиотеками"],"ar":["43 قاعدة لتحريك في 7 فئات","التأثير الأولوي","دليل تنفيذ التفاعلات القائمة على الإشارة","منحنيات التباطؤ والقيم الزمنية","التكامل مع المكتبات مفتوحة المصدر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Emil Kowalski 动画","web 界面动画","React 动画","动画最佳实践","easing 曲线","时序值选择","动画优化"],"ja":["Emil Kowalski アニメーション","Web インターフェイス アニメーション","React アニメーション","アニメーション ベストプラクティス","イージング曲線","タイミング値選択","アニメーション最適化"],"ko":["Emil Kowalski 애니메이션","웹 인터페이스 애니메이션","React 애니메이션","애니메이션 최고의 관행","이징 곡선","타이밍 값 선택","애니메이션 최적화"],"es":["animaciones web","mejores prácticas de animación","Emil Kowalski","interfaces web","react","gestos","bibliotecas de código abierto","animaciones dev","guias de animación"],"fr":["animations web","meilleures pratiques d''animation","Emil Kowalski","interfaces web","react","gestes","bibliothèques open source","animations dev","guides d''animation"],"de":["Webanimationen","beste Animationspraktiken","Emil Kowalski","Webinterfaces","react","Gesten","Open-Source-Bibliotheken","Animationsleitfaden","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["animação web","melhores práticas de animação","Emil Kowal","bibliotecas de código aberto","interfaces web","desenvolvimento web","ux design","ui design"],"ru":["веб-анимация","лучшие практики анимации","Эмиль Ковальски","открытые библиотеки","веб-интерфейсы","веб-разработка","ux-дизайн","ui-дизайн"],"ar":["تحريك الويب","أفضل الممارسات لتحريك","إميل كووالسكي","مكتبات مفتوحة المصدر","واجهات الويب","تطوير الويب","تصميم ux","تصميم ui"]}},"owner":"Acadbek","repo":"personal-site","repoPath":"Acadbek/personal-site","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"emilkowal-animations","description":"Emil Kowalskis animation best practices for web interfaces. Use when writing, reviewing, or implementing animations in React, CSS, or Framer Motion. Triggers on tasks involving transitions, easing, gestures, toasts, drawers, or motion.","bodyPreview":"# Emil Kowalski Animation Best Practices\n\nComprehensive animation guide for web interfaces based on Emil Kowalski''s teachings, open-source libraries (Sonner, Vaul), and his [animations.dev](https://animations.dev) course. Contains 43 rules across 7 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Adding animations to React components\n- Choosing easing curves or timing values\n- Implementing gesture-based interactions (swipe, drag)\n- Building toast notificat","body":"# Emil Kowalski Animation Best Practices\n\nComprehensive animation guide for web interfaces based on Emil Kowalski''s teachings, open-source libraries (Sonner, Vaul), and his [animations.dev](https://animations.dev) course. Contains 43 rules across 7 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Adding animations to React components\n- Choosing easing curves or timing values\n- Implementing gesture-based interactions (swipe, drag)\n- Building toast notifications or drawer components\n- Optimizing animation performance\n- Ensuring animation accessibility\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Easing Selection | CRITICAL | `ease-` |\n| 2 | Timing & Duration | CRITICAL | `timing-` |\n| 3 | Property Selection | HIGH | `props-` |\n| 4 | Transform Techniques | HIGH | `transform-` |\n| 5 | Interaction Patterns | MEDIUM-HIGH | `interact-` |\n| 6 | Strategic Animation | MEDIUM | `strategy-` |\n| 7 | Accessibility & Polish | MEDIUM | `polish-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Easing Selection (CRITICAL)\n\n- [`ease-out-default`](references/ease-out-default.md) - Use ease-out as your default easing\n- [`ease-custom-curves`](references/ease-custom-curves.md) - Use custom cubic-bezier over built-in CSS\n- [`ease-in-out-onscreen`](references/ease-in-out-onscreen.md) - Use ease-in-out for on-screen movement\n- [`ease-spring-natural`](references/ease-spring-natural.md) - Use spring animations for natural motion\n- [`ease-ios-drawer`](references/ease-ios-drawer.md) - Use iOS-style easing for drawer components\n- [`ease-context-matters`](references/ease-context-matters.md) - Match easing to animation context\n\n### 2. Timing & Duration (CRITICAL)\n\n- [`timing-300ms-max`](references/timing-300ms-max.md) - Keep UI animations under 300ms\n- [`timing-faster-better`](references/timing-faster-better.md) - Faster animations improve perceived performance\n- [`timing-asymmetric`](references/timing-asymmetric.md) - Use asymmetric timing for press and release\n- [`timing-tooltip-delay`](references/timing-tooltip-delay.md) - Delay initial tooltips, instant subsequent ones\n- [`timing-drawer-500ms`](references/timing-drawer-500ms.md) - Use 500ms duration for drawer animations\n\n### 3. Property Selection (HIGH)\n\n- [`props-transform-opacity`](references/props-transform-opacity.md) - Animate only transform and opacity\n- [`props-hardware-accelerated`](references/props-hardware-accelerated.md) - Use hardware-accelerated animations when main thread is busy\n- [`props-will-change`](references/props-will-change.md) - Use will-change to prevent 1px shift\n- [`props-avoid-css-variables`](references/props-avoid-css-variables.md) - Avoid CSS variables for drag animations\n- [`props-clip-path-performant`](references/props-clip-path-performant.md) - Use clip-path for layout-free reveals\n\n### 4. Transform Techniques (HIGH)\n\n- [`transform-scale-097`](references/transform-scale-097.md) - Scale buttons to 0.97 on press\n- [`transform-never-scale-zero`](references/transform-never-scale-zero.md) - Never animate from scale(0)\n- [`transform-percentage-translate`](references/transform-percentage-translate.md) - Use percentage values for translateY\n- [`transform-origin-aware`](references/transform-origin-aware.md) - Make animations origin-aware\n- [`transform-scale-children`](references/transform-scale-children.md) - Scale transforms affect children\n- [`transform-3d-preserve`](references/transform-3d-preserve.md) - Use preserve-3d for 3D transform effects\n\n### 5. Interaction Patterns (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- [`interact-interruptible`](references/interact-interruptible.md) - Make animations interruptible\n- [`interact-momentum-dismiss`](references/interact-momentum-dismiss.md) - Use momentum-based dismissal\n- [`interact-damping`](references/interact-damping.md) - Damp drag at boundaries\n- [`interact-scroll-drag-conflict`](references/interact-scroll-drag-conflict.md) - Resolve scroll and drag conflicts\n- [`interact-snap-points`](references/interact-snap-points.md) - Implement velocity-aware snap points\n- [`interact-friction-upward`](references/interact-friction-upward.md) - Allow upward drag with friction\n- [`interact-pointer-capture`](references/interact-pointer-capture.md) - Use pointer capture for drag operations\n\n### 6. Strategic Animation (MEDIUM)\n\n- [`strategy-keyboard-no-animate`](references/strategy-keyboard-no-animate.md) - Never animate keyboard-initiated actions\n- [`strategy-frequency-matters`](references/strategy-frequency-matters.md) - Consider interaction frequency before animating\n- [`strategy-purpose-required`](references/strategy-purpose-required.md) - Every animation must have a purpose\n- [`strategy-feedback-immediate`](references/strategy-feedback-immediate.md) - Provide immediate feedback on all actions\n- [`strategy-marketing-exception`](references/strategy-marketing-exception.md) - Marketing sites are the exception\n\n### 7. Accessibility & Polish (MEDIUM)\n\n- [`polish-reduced-motion`](references/polish-reduced-motion.md) - Respect prefers-reduced-motion\n- [`polish-opacity-fallback`](references/polish-opacity-fallback.md) - Use opacity as reduced motion fallback\n- [`polish-framer-hook`](references/polish-framer-hook.md) - Use useReducedMotion hook in Framer Motion\n- [`polish-dont-remove-all`](references/polish-dont-remove-all.md) - Don''t remove all animation for reduced motion\n- [`polish-blur-bridge`](references/polish-blur-bridge.md) - Use blur to bridge animation states\n- [`polish-clip-path-tabs`](references/polish-clip-path-tabs.md) - Use clip-path for tab transitions\n- [`polish-toast-stacking`](references/polish-toast-stacking.md) - Implement toast stacking with scale and offset\n- [`polish-scroll-reveal`](references/polish-scroll-reveal.md) - Trigger scroll animations at appropriate threshold\n- [`polish-hover-gap-fill`](references/polish-hover-gap-fill.md) - Fill gaps between hoverable elements\n- [`polish-stagger-children`](references/polish-stagger-children.md) - Stagger child animations for orchestration\n\n## Key Values Reference\n\n| Value | Usage |\n|-------|-------|\n| `cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1)` | iOS-style drawer/sheet animation |\n| `scale(0.97)` | Button press feedback |\n| `scale(0.95)` | Minimum enter scale (never scale(0)) |\n| `200ms ease-out` | Standard UI transition |\n| `300ms` | Maximum duration for UI animations |\n| `500ms` | Drawer animation duration |\n| `0.11 px/ms` | Velocity threshold for momentum dismiss |\n| `100px` | Scroll-reveal viewport threshold |\n| `14px` | Toast stack offset |\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| [references/_sections.md](references/_sections.md) | Category definitions and ordering |\n| [assets/templates/_template.md](assets/templates/_template.md) | Template for new rules |\n| [metadata.json](metadata.json) | Version and reference information |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:59:45.706Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced web interface animation capabilities based on Emil Kowalski''s teachings.","zh":"非常适合需要高级网页接口动画能力的前端代理，基于Emil Kowalski的教导。","ja":"Emil Kowalskiの教えに基づいて、高度なWebインターフェイスのアニメーション機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適。","ko":"Emil Kowalski의 가르침을 기반으로 고급 웹 인터페이스 애니메이션 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de animación de interfaz web basadas en las enseñanzas de Emil Kowalski.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des capacités avancées d''animation d''interface web basées sur les enseignements d''Emil Kowalski.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Web-Oberflächen-Animationsfunktionen basierend auf den Lehren von Emil Kowalski benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades avançadas de animação de interface web com base nos ensinamentos de Emil Kowalski.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности анимации веб-интерфейса на основе учения Эмиля Ковальски.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للرسوم المتحركة لواجهة الويب على أساس تعاليم إميل كووالسكي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create engaging web interfaces using open-source libraries like Sonner and Vaul, and implementing best practices from animations.dev, including gesture-based interactions and easing curves optimization.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用开源库如Sonner和Vaul的吸引人网页接口的能力，并实施来自animations.dev的最佳实践，包括基于手势的交互和缓动曲线优化。","ja":"SonnerおよびVaulなどのオープンソースライブラリを使用した魅力的なWebインターフェイスを作成するエージェントをEmpower化し、animations.devからのベストプラクティスを実装し、ジェスチャーベースのインタラクションやイージング曲線の最適化を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Sonner 및 Vaulなどの 오픈소스 라이브러리를 사용하여 매력적인 웹 인터페이스를 생성하는 기능을 제공하고 animations.dev의 모범 사례를 구현하여 제스처 기반 상호 작용 및 이징 곡선 최적화를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces web atractivas utilizando bibliotecas de código abierto como Sonner y Vaul, e implementando las mejores prácticas de animations.dev, incluyendo interacciones basadas en gestos y optimización de curvas de suavización.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces web engageantes en utilisant des bibliothèques open-source comme Sonner et Vaul, et en mettant en œuvre les meilleures pratiques d''animations.dev, notamment les interactions basées sur les gestes et l''optimisation des courbes de lissage.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ansprechende Web-Oberflächen mit Hilfe von Open-Source-Bibliotheken wie Sonner und Vaul zu erstellen und bewährte Verfahren von animations.dev umzusetzen, einschließlich gestenbasierter Interaktionen und Optimierung von Beschleunigungskurven.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces web atraentes usando bibliotecas de código aberto como Sonner e Vaul, e implementando as melhores práticas do animations.dev, incluindo interações baseadas em gestos e otimização de curvas de suavização.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательные веб-интерфейсы, используя библиотеки с открытым исходным кодом, такие как Sonner и Vaul, и реализуя лучшие практики с animations.dev, включая жестовые взаимодействия и оптимизацию кривых сглаживания.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء واجهات ويب جذابة باستخدام مكتبات مفتوحة المصدر مثل Sonner و Vaul، وتنفيذ أفضل الممارسات من animations.dev، بما في ذلك التفاعلات القائمة على الإيماءات وتنظيم المنحنيات."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing swipe and drag interactions for React components","Optimizing animation timing and easing curves for toast notifications","Building animated interfaces with Sonner and Vaul libraries"],"zh":["为React组件实现滑动和拖动交互","为toast通知优化动画时间和缓动曲线","使用Sonner和Vaul库构建动画接口"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントのスワイプおよびドラッグインタラクションの実装","トースト通知のアニメーションタイミングとイージング曲線の最適化","SonnerおよびVaulライブラリを使用したアニメーションインターフェイスの構築"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트에 대한 스와이프 및 드래그 상호 작용 구현","토스트 알림에 대한 애니메이션 타이밍 및 이징 곡선 최적화","Sonner 및 Vaul 라이브러리를 사용한 애니메이션 인터페이스 구축"],"es":["Implementar interacciones deslizantes y de arrastre para componentes de React","Optimizar el tiempo de animación y las curvas de suavización para notificaciones emergentes","Crear interfaces animadas con las bibliotecas Sonner y Vaul"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des interactions de glissage et de déplacement pour les composants React","Optimiser le temps d''animation et les courbes de lissage pour les notifications émergentes","Construire des interfaces animées avec les bibliothèques Sonner et Vaul"],"de":["Implementierung von Wisch- und Ziehinteraktionen für React-Komponenten","Optimierung der Animationszeit und der Beschleunigungskurven für Toast-Benachrichtigungen","Erstellung animierter Schnittstellen mit den Bibliotheken Sonner und Vaul"],"pt":["Implementação de interações de deslizar e arrastar para componentes React","Otimização do tempo de animação e curvas de suavização para notificações por toast","Construção de interfaces animadas com bibliotecas Sonner e Vaul"],"ru":["Реализация взаимодействий свайп и 드раг для компонентов React","Оптимизация времени анимации и кривых сглаживания для уведомлений toast","Создание анимированных интерфейсов с использованием библиотек Sonner и Vaul"],"ar":["تنفيذ التفاعلات السحب والجذب لمكونات React","تحسين توقيت الرسوم المتحركة والمنحنيات للتنبيهات الساخنة","بناء واجهات متحركة باستخدام مكتبات Sonner و Vaul"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React components","Limited to web interface animations"],"zh":["需要React组件的知识","仅限于网页接口动画"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントの知識が必要","Webインターフェイスのアニメーションに限定"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트에 대한 지식이 필요","웹 인터페이스 애니메이션으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de componentes de React","Limitado a animaciones de interfaz web"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en composants React","Limité aux animations d''interface web"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React-Komponenten","Begrenzt auf Web-Oberflächen-Animationen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de componentes React","Limitado a animações de interface web"],"ru":["Требует знания компонентов React","Ограничен анимациями веб-интерфейса"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمكونات React","محدود بالرسوم المتحركة لواجهة الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('joolbits/slabbed/slabbed-mixin-target-discovery', 'community', 'joolbits', 'slabbed', 'joolbits/slabbed', 'slabbed-mixin-target-discovery', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T09:59:15.588Z', NULL, '{"id":"joolbits/slabbed/slabbed-mixin-target-discovery","name":"slabbed-mixin-target-discovery","description":{"zh":"Slabbed Mixin 目标发现是一项用于优化 Minecraft 模组的技术，专注于识别和锁定正确的 Yarn 命名类/方法","ja":"Slabbed Mixin ターゲット発見は、Minecraft モッドを最適化するための技術で、正しい Yarn 命名クラス/メソッドの識別とロックに焦点を当てています","ko":"Slabbed Mixin 대상 발견은 Minecraft 모드를 최적화하기 위한 기술로, 올바른 Yarn命名 클래스/메서드의 식별 및 잠금에 중점을 둡니다","es":"El skill Slabbed Mixin Target Discovery permite identificar y bloquear las clases y métodos correctos para el comportamiento principal de Slabbed en Minecraft 1.21.11.","fr":"Le skill Slabbed Mixin Target Discovery permet d''identifier et de verrouiller les classes et méthodes correctes pour le comportement principal de Slabbed dans Minecraft 1.21.11.","de":"Das Skill Slabbed Mixin Ziel-Erkennung ermöglicht die Identifizierung und Sperrung der richtigen Klassen und Methoden für das Kernverhalten von Slabbed in Minecraft 1.21.11.","pt":"O Slabbed é uma habilidade que permite colocar itens em cima de uma laje, mantendo-os no lugar devido a verificações de sobrevivência e atualizações de vizinhos","ru":"Slabbed - это навык, который позволяет размещать предметы на поверхности слэба, сохраняя их на месте благодаря проверкам на выживание и обновлениям соседей","ar":"Slabbed هو مهارة يسمح بوضع الأشياء على سطح الصفيحة ، مع الحفاظ عليها في المكان بسبب عمليات التحقق من البقاء و تحديث الجيران","en":"Put things on slabs!"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Slabbed Mixin 目标发现 - Minecraft 1.21.11","ja":"Slabbed Mixin ターゲット発見 - Minecraft 1.21.11","ko":"Slabbed Mixin 대상 발견 - Minecraft 1.21.11","es":"Descubrimiento de objetivos Slabbed Mixin","fr":"Découverte de cibles Slabbed Mixin","de":"Slabbed Mixin Ziel-Erkennung","pt":"Descoberta de Alvo de Mistura em Slabbed","ru":"Обнаружение Цели Смешивания в Slabbed","ar":"اكتشاف هدف مزيج في Slabbed","en":"slabbed-mixin-target-discovery"},"description":{"zh":"Slabbed Mixin 目标发现是一项用于优化 Minecraft 模组的技术，专注于识别和锁定正确的 Yarn 命名类/方法","ja":"Slabbed Mixin ターゲット発見は、Minecraft モッドを最適化するための技術で、正しい Yarn 命名クラス/メソッドの識別とロックに焦点を当てています","ko":"Slabbed Mixin 대상 발견은 Minecraft 모드를 최적화하기 위한 기술로, 올바른 Yarn命名 클래스/메서드의 식별 및 잠금에 중점을 둡니다","es":"El skill Slabbed Mixin Target Discovery permite identificar y bloquear las clases y métodos correctos para el comportamiento principal de Slabbed en Minecraf...","fr":"Le skill Slabbed Mixin Target Discovery permet d''identifier et de verrouiller les classes et méthodes correctes pour le comportement principal de Slabbed dan...","de":"Das Skill Slabbed Mixin Ziel-Erkennung ermöglicht die Identifizierung und Sperrung der richtigen Klassen und Methoden für das Kernverhalten von Slabbed in Mi...","pt":"O Slabbed é uma habilidade que permite colocar itens em cima de uma laje, mantendo-os no lugar devido a verificações de sobrevivência e atualizações de vizinhos","ru":"Slabbed - это навык, который позволяет размещать предметы на поверхности слэба, сохраняя их на месте благодаря проверкам на выживание и обновлениям соседей","ar":"Slabbed هو مهارة يسمح بوضع الأشياء على سطح الصفيحة ، مع الحفاظ عليها في المكان بسبب عمليات التحقق من البقاء و تحديث الجيران","en":"Put things on slabs!"},"definition":{"en":"Put things on slabs!"},"features":{"zh":["识别和锁定正确的 Yarn 命名类/方法","优化 Minecraft 模组的核心行为","保持物体在方块上的稳定性","避免由于生存检查和邻居更新导致的弹出问题"],"ja":["正しい Yarn 命名クラス/メソッドの識別とロック","Minecraft モッドの核心動作の最適化","オブジェクトのブロック上での安定性の保持","生存チェックおよび隣接更新によるポップアップ問題の回避"],"ko":["올바른 Yarn命名 클래스/메서드의 식별 및 잠금","Minecraft 모드의 핵심 동작 최적화","객체의 블록 위에서의 안정성 유지","생존 점검 및 이웃 업데이트에 의한 팝업 문제 회피"],"es":["Identificación de clases y métodos correctos","Bloqueo de clases y métodos para el comportamiento principal","Compatibilidad con Minecraft 1.21.11","Uso de Yarn mappings","Sin cambios de comportamiento","Sin inyecciones ni refactorizaciones"],"fr":["Identification des classes et méthodes correctes","Verrouillage des classes et méthodes pour le comportement principal","Compatibilité avec Minecraft 1.21.11","Utilisation des mappings Yarn","Pas de changements de comportement","Pas d''injections ni de refactorisations"],"de":["Identifizierung der richtigen Klassen und Methoden","Sperrung von Klassen und Methoden für das Kernverhalten","Kompatibilität mit Minecraft 1.21.11","Verwendung von Yarn-Mappings","Keine Verhaltensänderungen","Keine Injektionen oder Refactorisierungen"],"pt":["Identificação de classes e métodos para comportamento principal","Bloqueio de classes e métodos para manter itens no lugar","Compatibilidade com Minecraft 1.21.11 e Yarn","Não altera o comportamento existente","Gera uma lista de alvos e plano"],"ru":["Обнаружение классов и методов для основного поведения","Блокировка классов и методов для сохранения предметов на месте","Совместимость с Minecraft 1.21.11 и Yarn","Не изменяет существующее поведение","Генерирует список целей и план"],"ar":["تحديد الطبقات و الطرق للسلوك الأساسي","قفل الطبقات و الطرق للحفاظ على الأشياء في المكان","توافق مع Minecraft 1.21.11 و Yarn","لا يغير السلوك الحالي","ينشئ قائمة بأهداف و خطة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft 模组开发","Slabbed Mixin","Yarn 命名类/方法","模组优化","核心行为","生存检查","邻居更新"],"ja":["Minecraft モッド開発","Slabbed Mixin","Yarn 命名クラス/メソッド","モッド最適化","核心動作","生存チェック","隣接更新"],"ko":["Minecraft 모드 개발","Slabbed Mixin","Yarn命名 클래스/메서드","모드 최적화","핵심 동작","생존 점검","이웃 업데이트"],"es":["Slabbed Mixin","Minecraft 1.21.11","Yarn mappings","desarrollo de mods","programación de Minecraft","identificación de clases","bloqueo de métodos","compatibilidad de mods"],"fr":["Slabbed Mixin","Minecraft 1.21.11","Mappings Yarn","développement de mods","programmation Minecraft","identification de classes","verrouillage de méthodes","compatibilité de mods"],"de":["Slabbed Mixin","Minecraft 1.21.11","Yarn-Mappings","Mod-Entwicklung","Minecraft-Programmierung","Klassen-Identifizierung","Methoden-Sperre","Mod-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Slabbed","Mistura","Minecraft","Yarn","Desenvolvimento de jogos","Programação","Java","Modding"],"ru":["Slabbed","Смешивание","Minecraft","Yarn","Разработка игр","Программирование","Java","Моддинг"],"ar":["Slabbed","مزيج","Minecraft","Yarn","تطوير الألعاب","برمجة","جافا","تعدیل"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"slabbed","repoPath":"joolbits/slabbed","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slabbed-mixin-target-discovery","description":"Identify and lock correct Yarn targets for slab-top placement and survival before writing mixins.","bodyPreview":"# Slabbed — Mixin Target Discovery (MC 1.21.11 / Yarn)\n\n## Goal\nIdentify and lock the correct **Yarn-named** classes/methods to hook for Slabbed’s core behavior:\n- placing things “on top of a slab like ground”\n- keeping them from popping off due to survival checks / neighbor updates\n\nNo behavior changes in this skill. Output is a target list + plan.\n\n## Non-goals\n- No new mixins added\n- No injections performed\n- No refactors\n\n## Inputs / assumptions\n- MC: 1.21.11 (Fabric)\n- Yarn mappings in proj","body":"# Slabbed — Mixin Target Discovery (MC 1.21.11 / Yarn)\n\n## Goal\nIdentify and lock the correct **Yarn-named** classes/methods to hook for Slabbed’s core behavior:\n- placing things “on top of a slab like ground”\n- keeping them from popping off due to survival checks / neighbor updates\n\nNo behavior changes in this skill. Output is a target list + plan.\n\n## Non-goals\n- No new mixins added\n- No injections performed\n- No refactors\n\n## Inputs / assumptions\n- MC: 1.21.11 (Fabric)\n- Yarn mappings in project already working\n- Slab types: bottom slab / top slab / double slab\n- Rule: treat the **top face** of a slab as “ground”\n\n\n## Steps\n\n### 0) Safety checkpoint\n- `git status` must be clean. If not, stop.\n\n### 1) Make sure sources are available\nRun:\n- `./gradlew genSources` (if needed)\n- Confirm IDE can navigate into net.minecraft sources\n\n### 2) Locate vanilla “support” predicates\nUsing IDE “Find in files”, search for these terms (in `net.minecraft` sources):\n- `canPlaceAt` \n- `getPlacementState` \n- `canPlaceOn` \n- `canPlantOnTop` \n- `isSideSolidFullSquare` \n- `isFullCube` \n- `getCollisionShape` \n- `getOutlineShape` \n- `getSidesShape` \n- `getStateForNeighborUpdate` \n\nFor each promising hit, open call sites and trace who checks “solid top” or “full square”.\n\n### 3) Identify slab shape semantics\nLocate the SlabBlock implementation and record:\n- property names (e.g., TYPE)\n- how top/bottom/double shapes are represented\n- helper methods used to determine support on the upper face\n\nOutput:\n- SlabBlock class name (Yarn)\n- SlabType enum name (Yarn)\n- Methods used to compute shape/support\n\n### 4) Build a target matrix of “things that pop off”\nPick 6 canonical test blocks (don’t implement, just list):\n- torch (floor)\n- redstone dust\n- repeater\n- rail\n- pressure plate\n- carpet\n\nFor each, locate its survival predicate:\n- class + method that performs support check (usually `canPlaceAt` or neighbor update path)\n- what it checks on the block below (pos.down())\n\nRecord for each:\n- Yarn class name\n- method signature (Yarn)\n- the exact condition that fails on slabs\n\n### 5) Classify hooks into two buckets\nBucket A: **Placement-time** override points  \nBucket B: **Survival-time** override points\n\nFor each bucket, list 1–3 best candidate targets and explain why:\n- stability across versions\n- minimal invasiveness\n- avoids breaking vanilla rules\n\n### 6) Propose ONE primary strategy (pick one)\nChoose the most robust approach and write a short plan:\n\nPossible strategies (examples):\n- (S1) Patch “support test” helper(s) that most blocks rely on\n- (S2) Patch slab block to present a solid top face to support checks\n- (S3) Per-block targeted mixins (last resort; strict visuals may require)\n\nPick one as “Primary”, and list “Fallbacks”.\n\n### 7) Output deliverable\nProduce a **Target Plan** in this exact format:\n\n- **Primary strategy:** S?\n- **Placement hooks:**\n  - `YarnClass#method(signature)` — why\n- **Survival hooks:**\n  - `YarnClass#method(signature)` — why\n- **Per-block exceptions (if any):**\n  - block → target(s)\n- **Risk notes:**\n  - 3 bullets\n- **Next step mixins to create:**\n  - filenames under `src/main/java/com/slabbed/mixin/` \n\n### 8) Stop\nDo not implement changes. Do not create mixin files. No commits.\n\n\n## Pass criteria\n- At least 1 credible Primary strategy with concrete Yarn targets for both placement and survival\n- At least 6 block examples traced to their predicates\n- Output plan is complete and actionable\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:59:15.588Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Minecraft Modding Agents needing advanced mixin target discovery for Yarn-named classes and methods in Fabric mods","zh":"非常适合需要高级混淆目标发现的Minecraft模组代理，特别是针对Yarn命名的类和方法在Fabric模组中","ja":"Minecraft Moddingエージェントに適しており、Yarn命名のクラスとメソッドの高度なミックスインターゲット発見を必要とするFabric modsに適する","ko":"Minecraft 모드 에이전트에게 적합하며, Yarn 이름의 클래스와 메서드에 대한 고급 mixin 대상 발견이 필요한 Fabric 모드에 적합함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modificación de Minecraft que necesitan un descubrimiento avanzado de objetivos de mixin para clases y métodos con nombre Yarn en mods de Fabric","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modification de Minecraft ayant besoin d''une découverte avancée d''objectifs de mixin pour les classes et les méthodes nommées Yarn dans les mods Fabric","de":"Perfekt für Minecraft-Modding-Agents, die eine erweiterte Erkennung von Mixin-Zielen für Yarn-benommene Klassen und Methoden in Fabric-Mods benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modding do Minecraft que precisam de descoberta avançada de alvos de mixin para classes e métodos com nomes Yarn em mods Fabric","ru":"Идеально для агентов моддинга Minecraft, которым необходима продвинутая система обнаружения目标ов mixin для классов и методов с именами Yarn в модах Fabric","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء موددينغ ماين كرافت الذين بحاجة إلى اكتشاف متقدم لمixin लक्षية اكتشاف الفئات وأساليب أسماء Yarn في mods Fabric"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify and lock correct Yarn-named classes and methods for Slabbed''s core behavior, ensuring seamless integration with Minecraft 1.21.11 and Yarn mappings, all while preventing unwanted behavior changes or code injections","zh":"赋予代理识别和锁定Slabbed核心行为的正确Yarn命名类和方法的能力，确保与Minecraft 1.21.11和Yarn映射的无缝集成，同时防止不想要的行为变化或代码注入","ja":"Slabbedのコア動作の正しいYarn命名クラスとメソッドを識別およびロックするエージェントの能力を提供し、Minecraft 1.21.11およびYarnマッピングとのシームレスな統合を保証し、望ましくない動作の変更やコードの注入を防止する","ko":"에이전트에게 Slabbed의 핵심 동작을 위한 올바른 Yarn 이름의 클래스와 메서드를 식별하고 잠그는 능력을 부여하여, Minecraft 1.21.11 및 Yarn 매핑との無결점 통합을 보장하며, 원치 않는 동작의 변경이나 코드 주입을 방지함","es":"Habilita a los agentes para identificar y bloquear las clases y métodos con nombre Yarn correctos para el comportamiento principal de Slabbed, garantizando una integración fluida con Minecraft 1.21.11 y asignaciones Yarn, al mismo tiempo que evita cambios de comportamiento o inyecciones de código no deseados","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier et de verrouiller les classes et les méthodes nommées Yarn correctes pour le comportement principal de Slabbed, garantissant une intégration fluide avec Minecraft 1.21.11 et les mappings Yarn, tout en évitant les modifications de comportement ou les injections de code indésirables","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die richtigen Yarn-benommene Klassen und Methoden für das Kernverhalten von Slabbed zu identifizieren und zu sperren, um eine nahtlose Integration mit Minecraft 1.21.11 und Yarn-Zuordnungen sicherzustellen, während unerwünschte Verhaltensänderungen oder Codeinjektionen verhindert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar e bloquear as classes e métodos com nomes Yarn corretos para o comportamento central do Slabbed, garantindo uma integração perfeita com o Minecraft 1.21.11 e os mapeamentos Yarn, além de prevenir alterações indesejadas de comportamento ou injeções de código","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью идентифицировать и блокировать правильные классы и методы с именами Yarn для основного поведения Slabbed, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с Minecraft 1.21.11 и картами Yarn, а также предотвращая нежелательные изменения поведения или внедрения кода","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد والقفل الفئات وأساليب أسماء Yarn الصحيحين لسلوك Slabbed الأساسي، مما يضمن التكامل السلس مع Minecraft 1.21.11 وخرائط Yarn، مع منع التغييرات السلوكية غير المرغوب فيها أو الحقن الكود"},"useCases":{"en":["Discovering target classes and methods for Slabbed''s core behavior","Generating target lists and plans for mixin implementation","Analyzing Yarn mappings for compatible class and method hooks"],"zh":["发现Slabbed核心行为的目标类和方法","生成mixin实现的目标列表和计划","分析Yarn映射以查找兼容的类和方法hook"],"ja":["Slabbedのコア動作のターゲットクラスとメソッドの発見","ミックスイン実装のターゲットリストとプランの生成","Yarnマッピングの分析による互換性のあるクラスとメソッドhookの検出"],"ko":["Slabbed의 핵심 동작을 위한 대상 클래스와 메서드의 발견","mixin 구현을 위한 대상 목록과 계획의 생성","Yarn 매핑의 분석을 통해 호환되는 클래스와 메서드 hook의検出"],"es":["Descubrir clases y métodos de destino para el comportamiento principal de Slabbed","Generar listas y planes de destino para la implementación de mixin","Analizar los mappings Yarn para ganchos de clase y método compatibles"],"fr":["Découvrir les classes et les méthodes cibles pour le comportement principal de Slabbed","Générer des listes et des plans cibles pour la mise en œuvre de mixin","Analyser les mappings Yarn pour des crochets de classe et de méthode compatibles"],"de":["Zielklassen und -methoden für das Kernverhalten von Slabbed entdecken","Ziellisten und -pläne für die Implementierung von Mixin generieren","Yarn-Zuordnungen für kompatible Klassen- und Methoden-Hooks analysieren"],"pt":["Descobrir classes e métodos de destino para o comportamento central do Slabbed","Gerar listas e planos de destino para implementação de mixin","Analizar mapeamentos Yarn para ganchos de classe e método compatíveis"],"ru":["Обнаружение классов и методов-целей для основного поведения Slabbed","Генерация списков и планов целей для реализации mixin","Анализ карт Yarn для совместимых крючков класса и метода"],"ar":["اكتشاف الفئات وأساليب लक्षية لسلوك Slabbed الأساسي","توليد قوائم وخطط लकشية لتنفيذ mixin","تحليل خرائط Yarn لآرابعة فئوية وأسلوب متوافقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric) environment","Limited to Yarn mappings","No support for new mixin additions, injections, or refactors"],"zh":["需要Minecraft 1.21.11（Fabric）环境","仅限于Yarn映射","不支持新的mixin添加、注入或重构"],"ja":["Minecraft 1.21.11（Fabric）環境が必要","Yarnマッピングのみに限定される","新しいミックスインの追加、注入、またはリファクタリングはサポートされない"],"ko":["Minecraft 1.21.11（Fabric）환경이 필요함","Yarn 매핑만으로 제한됨","新的 mixin 추가, 주입, 또는 리팩토링은 지원되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere entorno Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric)","Limitado a asignaciones Yarn","No admite nuevas adiciones, inyecciones o refactorizaciones de mixin"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric)","Limité aux mappings Yarn","Ne prend pas en charge les nouvelles additions, injections ou refactorisations de mixin"],"de":["Benötigt Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric)-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Yarn-Zuordnungen","Unterstützt keine neuen Mixin-Hinzufügungen, -Injektionen oder -Refaktorisierungen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric)","Limitado a mapeamentos Yarn","Sem suporte para novas adições, injeções ou refatorações de mixin"],"ru":["Требуется среда Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric)","Ограничен картами Yarn","Нет поддержки для новых добавлений, внедрений или рефакторингов mixin"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric)","محدود بخرائط Yarn","لا دعم لإضافات mixin الجديدة أو الحقن أو إعادة هيكلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('joolbits/slabbed/slabbed-visual-alignment-audit', 'community', 'joolbits', 'slabbed', 'joolbits/slabbed', 'slabbed-visual-alignment-audit', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T09:59:24.839Z', NULL, '{"id":"joolbits/slabbed/slabbed-visual-alignment-audit","name":"slabbed-visual-alignment-audit","description":{"zh":"slabbed-visual-alignment-audit是一种技术，用于确保模型在slab顶表面上的可视化对齐","ja":"slabbed-visual-alignment-auditは、モデルをslabの表面に配置するための可視化対象技術です","ko":"slabbed-visual-alignment-audit는 모델을 slab의 표면에 배치하기 위한 시각적 정렬 기술입니다","es":"El audit de alineación visual slabbed garantiza que los objetos se vean correctamente alineados en superficies slabbed.","fr":"L''audit d''alignement visuel slabbed garantit que les objets soient correctement alignés sur les surfaces slabbed.","de":"Der Slabbed-Visual-Alignment-Audit stellt sicher, dass Objekte korrekt auf Slabbed-Oberflächen ausgerichtet werden.","pt":"A auditoria de alinhamento visual Slabbed garante que os objetos estejam corretamente alinhados na superfície do slab","ru":"Проверка визуального выравнивания Slabbed гарантирует, что объекты правильно выровнены на поверхности слэба","ar":"فحص المحاذاة البصرية Slabbed يضمن أن الكائنات تكون محاذاة بشكل صحيح على سطح Slab","en":"Put things on slabs!"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"slabbed-visual-alignment-audit 技术","ja":"slabbed-visual-alignment-audit 技術","ko":"slabbed-visual-alignment-audit 개발","es":"Audit de Alineación Visual Slabbed","fr":"Audit d''Alignement Visuel Slabbed","de":"Slabbed-Visual-Alignment-Audit","pt":"Auditoria de Alinhamento Visual Slabbed","ru":"Проверка визуального выравнивания Slabbed","ar":"فحص المحاذاة البصرية Slabbed","en":"slabbed-visual-alignment-audit"},"description":{"zh":"slabbed-visual-alignment-audit是一种技术，用于确保模型在slab顶表面上的可视化对齐","ja":"slabbed-visual-alignment-auditは、モデルをslabの表面に配置するための可視化対象技術です","ko":"slabbed-visual-alignment-audit는 모델을 slab의 표면에 배치하기 위한 시각적 정렬 기술입니다","es":"El audit de alineación visual slabbed garantiza que los objetos se vean correctamente alineados en superficies slabbed.","fr":"L''audit d''alignement visuel slabbed garantit que les objets soient correctement alignés sur les surfaces slabbed.","de":"Der Slabbed-Visual-Alignment-Audit stellt sicher, dass Objekte korrekt auf Slabbed-Oberflächen ausgerichtet werden.","pt":"A auditoria de alinhamento visual Slabbed garante que os objetos estejam corretamente alinhados na superfície do slab","ru":"Проверка визуального выравнивания Slabbed гарантирует, что объекты правильно выровнены на поверхности слэба","ar":"فحص المحاذاة البصرية Slabbed يضمن أن الكائنات تكون محاذاة بشكل صحيح على سطح Slab","en":"Put things on slabs!"},"definition":{"en":"Put things on slabs!"},"features":{"zh":["模型在slab顶表面上的可视化对齐","outline/selection box与表面对齐","hitbox/collision行为匹配预期","在新类别通过placement + survival后运行","在更改shapes、placement offsets或support predicates后运行"],"ja":["slabの表面におけるモデルの可視化対象","アウトライン/セレクションボックスの表面への対象","hitbox/衝突の動作が期待通り","新しいカテゴリが配置 + 生存を通過した後実行","形状、配置オフセット、またはサポート述語の変更後実行"],"ko":["slab의 표면에서 모델의 시각적 정렬","outline/selection box의 표면에 대한 정렬","hitbox/충돌 행동이 예상과 일치","새로운 카테고리가 배치 + 생존을 통과한 후 실행","모양, 배치 오프셋 또는 지원 술어의 변경 후 실행"],"es":["Alineación de modelos en superficies slabbed","Ajuste de cajas de selección y contornos","Comportamiento de colisiones y golpeo","Verificación de la posición y el tamaño de los objetos","Análisis de la alineación visual en diferentes categorías"],"fr":["Alignement de modèles sur les surfaces slabbed","Ajustement des boîtes de sélection et des contours","Comportement de collision et de frappe","Vérification de la position et de la taille des objets","Analyse de l''alignement visuel dans différentes catégories"],"de":["Ausrichtung von Modellen auf Slabbed-Oberflächen","Anpassung von Auswahlboxen und Konturen","Verhaltensweise von Kollisionen und Treffern","Überprüfung der Position und Größe von Objekten","Analyse der visuellen Ausrichtung in verschiedenen Kategorien"],"pt":["Verificação da posição do modelo na superfície do slab","Alinhamento da caixa de seleção com a superfície","Comportamento de colisão e hitbox","Execução após a criação de novas categorias","Execução antes da marcação de categorias","Verificação após alterações nos formatos ou suportes"],"ru":["Проверка положения модели на поверхности слэба","Выравнивание коробки выбора с поверхностью","Поведение столкновения и хитбокса","Выполнение после создания новых категорий","Выполнение перед пометкой категорий","Проверка после изменений форм или поддержек"],"ar":["فحص موقع النموذج على سطح Slab","محاذاة مربع الانتخاب مع السطح","سلوك الاصطدام والصندوق النقاطي","التشغيل بعد إنشاء فئات جديدة","التشغيل قبل وضع علامة على الفئات","فحص بعد تغييرات في الشكل أو الدعم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["slabbed-visual-alignment-audit","可视化对齐","slab顶表面","模型对齐","开发技术","游戏开发"],"ja":["slabbed-visual-alignment-audit","可視化対象","slabの表面","モデル対象","開発技術","ゲーム開発"],"ko":["slabbed-visual-alignment-audit","시각적 정렬","slab의 표면","모델 정렬","개발 기술","게임 개발"],"es":["audit de alineación visual","superficies slabbed","alineación de objetos","comportamiento de colisiones","análisis de alineación visual","desarrollo de juegos","realidad aumentada"],"fr":["audit d''alignement visuel","surfaces slabbed","alignement d''objets","comportement de collision","analyse d''alignement visuel","développement de jeux","réalité augmentée"],"de":["Visual-Alignment-Audit","Slabbed-Oberflächen","Ausrichtung von Objekten","Verhaltensweise von Kollisionen","Analyse der visuellen Ausrichtung","Spieleentwicklung","Erweiterte Realität"],"pt":["auditoria de alinhamento visual","alinhamento de objetos","superfície de slab","modelos 3D","desenvolvimento de jogos","realidade virtual","realidade aumentada"],"ru":["проверка визуального выравнивания","выравнивание объектов","поверхность слэба","3D-модели","разработка игр","виртуальная реальность","дополненная реальность"],"ar":["فحص المحاذاة البصرية","محاذاة الكائنات","سطح Slab","نماذج 3D","تطوير الألعاب","الواقع الافتراضي","الواقع المعزز"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"slabbed","repoPath":"joolbits/slabbed","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slabbed-visual-alignment-audit","description":"Audit and enforce strict visual alignment for slab-supported placements before tagging a category pass.","bodyPreview":"# Slabbed — Visual Alignment Audit (Strict)\n\n## Goal\nEnsure anything that “works” on slab tops also looks correct:\n- model sits on the slab top surface\n- outline/selection box aligns to the surface\n- hitbox/collision behavior matches expectation\nFunctional-but-visually-wrong is a failure.\n\n## When to run\n- After any new category passes placement + survival\n- Before tagging `slabbed-<category>-pass` \n- After any change touching shapes, placement offsets, or support predicates\n\n## Setup\nUse the st","body":"# Slabbed — Visual Alignment Audit (Strict)\n\n## Goal\nEnsure anything that “works” on slab tops also looks correct:\n- model sits on the slab top surface\n- outline/selection box aligns to the surface\n- hitbox/collision behavior matches expectation\nFunctional-but-visually-wrong is a failure.\n\n## When to run\n- After any new category passes placement + survival\n- Before tagging `slabbed-<category>-pass` \n- After any change touching shapes, placement offsets, or support predicates\n\n## Setup\nUse the standard repro world lanes:\n- Full blocks (baseline)\n- Bottom slabs\n- Top slabs\n\nTest each target in all three lanes.\n\n## Checklist (per target)\n\n### A) Placement height (must match slab top)\n- Bottom slab: object base should align at y + 0.5\n- Top slab: object base should align at y + 1.0\n- Double slab/full block: identical to vanilla\n\nPASS only if it visually appears grounded on the surface with no floating or clipping.\n\n### B) Outline/selection shape\nHover and verify the white outline box:\n- is not hovering above the slab\n- is not sunken into the slab\n- is consistent across camera angles\n- matches vanilla behavior on the full-block lane\n\nIf outline is wrong, treat as FAIL even if functionality works.\n\n### C) Interaction “feel”\nVerify interaction uses the expected aim point:\n- placing adjacent items isn’t unusually hard\n- breaking the object feels normal\n- no weird “must aim at air” placements\n\n### D) Block state transitions\nTrigger common state changes and re-check visuals:\n- neighbor update (place/break adjacent block)\n- chunk reload (fly away and return)\n- redstone toggle (if relevant)\n- water adjacency (if relevant)\n\n### E) Known offenders (extra scrutiny)\nPay extra attention to:\n- redstone dust height and connection visuals\n- rails shape and slope behavior\n- carpets level alignment\n- pressure plate height and click feel\n- torches and lantern attachment points\n\n## Evidence capture\nFor any FAIL:\n- take 1 screenshot showing the mismatch\n- note exact lane (full/bottom/top slab)\n- note exact reproduction steps\n\n## Stop conditions\n- Any visual FAIL blocks a `*-pass` tag\n- Do not “ship ugly” with strict visuals enabled\n- If the issue requires broad rendering hacks, stop and reassess hook strategy\n\n## Output report format\n- Category tested:\n- Results by lane (Full / BottomSlab / TopSlab):\n- Visual failures (if any):\n  - what looks wrong\n  - which lane\n  - screenshot name\n- Suspected cause (1–2 lines):\n- Next action:\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:59:24.839Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 3D Modeling Agents needing precise visual alignment and collision detection capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要精确视觉对齐和碰撞检测功能的 3D 建模代理。","ja":"3D モデリング エージェントが正確な視覚的な整列と衝突検出機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"정확한 시각적 정렬 및 충돌 감지 기능이 필요한 3D 모델링 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modelado 3D que necesitan un alineamiento visual preciso y capacidades de detección de colisiones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modélisation 3D nécessitant un alignement visuel précis et des capacités de détection de collision.","de":"Perfekt für 3D-Modellierungsagenten, die eine präzise visuelle Ausrichtung und Kollisionsdetektionsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelagem 3D que precisam de alinhamento visual preciso e capacidades de detecção de colisão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов 3D-моделирования, которым требуются точное визуальное выравнивание и возможности обнаружения столкновений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل النمذجة الثلاثية الأبعاد الذي يحتاج إلى محاذاة بصرية دقيقة وقدرات كشف الاصطدام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure accurate model placement and collision behavior on slab surfaces, leveraging strict visual alignment audits and hitbox analysis, with a focus on shape, placement offset, and support predicate validation.","zh":"赋予代理确保模块在板面上的准确放置和碰撞行为的能力，利用严格的视觉对齐审计和命中框分析，重点关注形状、放置偏移和支持谓词验证。","ja":"スラブ表面での正確なモデル配置と衝突動作をエージェントが保証できるようにし、厳格な視覚的な整列監査とヒットボックス分析を利用し、形状、配置オフセット、サポート述語の検証に焦点を当てています。","ko":"슬라브 표면에서 정확한 모델 배치 및 충돌 동작을 에이전트가 보장할 수 있도록 하며, 엄격한 시각적 정렬 감시 및 히트박스 분석을 활용하여 모양, 배치 오프셋 및 지원 술어 검증에 중점을 둡니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a garantizar una colocación de modelo precisa y un comportamiento de colisión en superficies de losas, aprovechando auditorías de alineación visual estrictas y análisis de hitbox, con un enfoque en forma, desplazamiento de colocación y validación de predicado de soporte.","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir un placement de modèle précis et un comportement de collision sur les surfaces de dalles, en exploitant des audits d''alignement visuel stricts et une analyse de hitbox, avec un focus sur la forme, le décalage de placement et la validation du prédicat de support.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine genaue Modellplatzierung und Kollisionsverhalten auf Plattenoberflächen sicherzustellen, indem sie strenge visuelle Ausrichtungsaudits und Hitboxanalysen nutzen, mit Fokus auf Form, Platzierungsversatz und Validierung des Trägheitsprädikats.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a colocação precisa do modelo e o comportamento de colisão em superfícies de laje, utilizando auditorias de alinhamento visual rigorosas e análise de caixa de acerto, com foco em forma, deslocamento de colocação e validação de predicado de suporte.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить точное размещение модели и поведение при столкновении на поверхностях плит, используя строгие аудиты визуального выравнивания и анализ хитбокса, с фокусом на форме, смещении размещения и проверке предиката поддержки.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على ضمان وضع نموذج دقيق وسلوك الاصطدام على أسطح البلاط، باستخدام عمليات تدقيق محاذاة بصرية صارمة وتحليل صندوق الضرب، مع التركيز على الشكل وازاحة الوضع وتحقق predicado الدعم."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating model placement on slab tops","Debugging outline and selection box alignment issues","Optimizing hitbox and collision behavior for slab-based interactions"],"zh":["验证模块在板面上的放置","调试轮廓和选择框的对齐问题","优化基于板面的交互的命中框和碰撞行为"],"ja":["スラブの上のモデル配置の検証","アウトラインと選択ボックスの整列問題のデバッグ","スラブベースのインタラクションのヒットボックスと衝突動作の最適化"],"ko":["슬라브 위의 모델 배치 검증","轮廓 및 선택 상자의 정렬 문제 디버깅","슬라브 기반 상호 작용의 히트박스 및 충돌 동작 최적화"],"es":["Validar la colocación de modelos en las partes superiores de las losas","Depurar problemas de alineación de contorno y casilla de selección","Optimizar el comportamiento de hitbox y colisión para interacciones basadas en losas"],"fr":["Valider le placement de modèles sur les dessus de dalles","Déboguer les problèmes d''alignement de contour et de boîte de sélection","Optimiser le comportement de hitbox et de collision pour les interactions basées sur les dalles"],"de":["Überprüfen der Modellplatzierung auf Plattenoberflächen","Beheben von Ausrichtungsproblemen von Kontur und Auswahlbox","Optimieren des Hitbox- und Kollisionsverhaltens für plattenbasierte Interaktionen"],"pt":["Validar a colocação do modelo em superfícies de laje","Depurar problemas de alinhamento de contorno e caixa de seleção","Otimizar o comportamento de caixa de acerto e colisão para interações baseadas em laje"],"ru":["Проверка размещения модели на поверхностях плит","Отладка проблем выравнивания контура и коробки выбора","Оптимизация поведения хитбокса и столкновения для взаимодействий на основе плит"],"ar":["تحقق من وضع النموذج على أسطح البلاط","تصحيح مشاكل محاذاة الحدود وصندوق الاختيار","تحسين سلوك صندوق الضرب والاصطدام للتفاعلات القائمة على البلاط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires 3D modeling and rendering capabilities","Limited to slab-based surfaces and interactions","Dependent on accurate shape, placement offset, and support predicate data"],"zh":["需要 3D 建模和渲染功能","仅限于板面和基于板面的交互","依赖于准确的形状、放置偏移和支持谓词数据"],"ja":["3D モデリングとレンダリング機能が必要","スラブ表面とスラブベースのインタラクションに限定","正確な形状、配置オフセット、サポート述語データに依存"],"ko":["3D 모델링 및 렌더링 기능이 필요","슬라브 표면 및 슬라브 기반 상호 작용에 제한","정확한 모양, 배치 오프셋 및 지원 술어 데이터에 의존"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de modelado y renderizado 3D","Limitado a superficies e interacciones basadas en losas","Dependiente de datos de forma, desplazamiento de colocación y predicado de soporte precisos"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de modélisation et de rendu 3D","Limité aux surfaces et interactions basées sur les dalles","Dépendant de données de forme, de décalage de placement et de prédicat de support précises"],"de":["Benötigt 3D-Modellierungs- und Renderfunktionen","Begrenzt auf plattenbasierte Oberflächen und Interaktionen","Abhängig von genauen Form-, Platzierungsversatz- und Trägheitsprädikatsdaten"],"pt":["Exige capacidades de modelagem e renderização 3D","Limitado a superfícies e interações baseadas em laje","Depende de dados precisos de forma, deslocamento de colocação e predicado de suporte"],"ru":["Требует возможностей 3D-моделирования и рендеринга","Ограничен поверхностями и взаимодействиями на основе плит","Зависит от точных данных о форме, смещении размещения и предикате поддержки"],"ar":["يتطلب قدرات نمذجة وتجسيد ثلاثي الأبعاد","محدود بالأسطح والتفاعلات القائمة على البلاط","يعتمد على بيانات دقيقة عن الشكل وازاحة الوضع وpredicado الدعم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claude4062024-afk/Wallify/web-design-guidelines', 'community', 'claude4062024-afk', 'Wallify', 'claude4062024-afk/Wallify', 'web-design-guidelines', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T09:59:54.528Z', NULL, '{"id":"claude4062024-afk/Wallify/web-design-guidelines","name":"web-design-guidelines","description":{"zh":"该工具自动检查 Web 界面是否符合最新的 Web 设计指南，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"このツールは、ウェブインターフェースが最新のウェブデザインガイドラインに準拠しているかを自動的にチェックし、開発者の効率を向上させるのに役立ちます","ko":"이 도구는 웹 인터페이스가 최신 웹 디자인 가이드라인을 준수하는지 자동으로 검사하여 개발자의 효율성을 높여줍니다","es":"Las pautas de diseño web proporcionan un conjunto de reglas para crear interfaces de usuario coherentes y fáciles de usar.","fr":"Les guidelines de conception web offrent un ensemble de règles pour créer des interfaces utilisateur cohérentes et faciles à utiliser.","de":"Die Web-Design-Richtlinien bieten einen Satz von Regeln, um konsistente und benutzerfreundliche Benutzeroberflächen zu erstellen.","pt":"As diretrizes de design web fornecem um conjunto de regras para criar interfaces web de alta qualidade","ru":"Руководство по веб-дизайну предоставляет набор правил для создания качественных веб-интерфейсов","ar":"إرشادات تصميم الويب توفر مجموعة من القواعد لإنشاء واجهات ويب عالية الجودة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Web 设计指南检查工具","ja":"ウェブデザインガイドラインチェックツール","ko":"웹 디자인 가이드라인 검사 도구","es":"Pautas de diseño web: Guías de interfaz","fr":"Guidelines de conception web : Interfaces","de":"Web-Design-Richtlinien: Benutzeroberflächen","pt":"Diretrizes de Design Web: Otimização de Interfaces","ru":"Руководство по веб-дизайну: создание удобных интерфейсов","ar":"إرشادات تصميم الويب: تحسين الواجهات","en":"web-design-guidelines"},"description":{"zh":"该工具自动检查 Web 界面是否符合最新的 Web 设计指南，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"このツールは、ウェブインターフェースが最新のウェブデザインガイドラインに準拠しているかを自動的にチェックし、開発者の効率を向上させるのに役立ちます","ko":"이 도구는 웹 인터페이스가 최신 웹 디자인 가이드라인을 준수하는지 자동으로 검사하여 개발자의 효율성을 높여줍니다","es":"Las pautas de diseño web proporcionan un conjunto de reglas para crear interfaces de usuario coherentes y fáciles de usar.","fr":"Les guidelines de conception web offrent un ensemble de règles pour créer des interfaces utilisateur cohérentes et faciles à utiliser.","de":"Die Web-Design-Richtlinien bieten einen Satz von Regeln, um konsistente und benutzerfreundliche Benutzeroberflächen zu erstellen.","pt":"As diretrizes de design web fornecem um conjunto de regras para criar interfaces web de alta qualidade","ru":"Руководство по веб-дизайну предоставляет набор правил для создания качественных веб-интерфейсов","ar":"إرشادات تصميم الويب توفر مجموعة من القواعد لإنشاء واجهات ويب عالية الجودة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动检查 Web 界面","最新指南更新","支持文件模式","terser 输出格式"],"ja":["ウェブインターフェースの自動チェック","最新ガイドラインの更新","ファイルパターンのサポート","terser 出力形式"],"ko":["웹 인터페이스의 자동 검사","최신 가이드라인 업데이트","파일 패턴 지원","terser 출력 형식"],"es":["Revisión de archivos para cumplimiento con pautas","Verificación contra reglas de diseño","Salida de resultados en formato conciso","Actualización automática de pautas desde URL de origen"],"fr":["Vérification des fichiers pour la conformité aux guidelines","Vérification contre les règles de conception","Sortie des résultats dans un format concis","Mise à jour automatique des guidelines à partir de l''URL source"],"de":["Überprüfung von Dateien auf Einhaltung der Richtlinien","Überprüfung gegen Designregeln","Ausgabe der Ergebnisse im knappen Format","Automatische Aktualisierung der Richtlinien von der Quell-URL"],"pt":["Verificação de conformidade com as diretrizes de design web","Análise de arquivos para garantir a usabilidade e acessibilidade","Saída de resultados em formato conciso","Integração com a ferramenta WebFetch"],"ru":["Проверка соответствия руководству по веб-дизайну","Анализ файлов для обеспечения удобства и доступности","Выдача результатов в кратком формате","Интеграция с инструментом WebFetch"],"ar":["التحقق من مطابقة إرشادات تصميم الويب","تحليل الملفات لضمان إمكانية استخدام وتوافق","إخراج النتائج في تنسيق مدمج","التكامل مع أداة WebFetch"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web 设计指南","自动检查工具","开发效率","Web 界面","设计指南","terser 输出"],"ja":["ウェブデザインガイドライン","自動チェックツール","開発効率","ウェブインターフェース","設計ガイドライン","terser 出力"],"ko":["웹 디자인 가이드라인","자동 검사 도구","개발 효율성","웹 인터페이스","디자인 가이드라인","terser 출력"],"es":["diseño web","pautas de diseño","interfaz de usuario","experiencia del usuario","desarrollo web","interfaces web"],"fr":["conception web","guidelines de conception","interface utilisateur","expérience utilisateur","développement web","interfaces web"],"de":["Web-Design","Web-Design-Richtlinien","Benutzeroberfläche","Benutzererfahrung","Web-Entwicklung","Web-Schnittstellen"],"pt":["diretrizes de design web","otimização de interfaces","usabilidade","acessibilidade","desenvolvimento web","web design guidelines"],"ru":["руководство по веб-дизайну","создание удобных интерфейсов","удобство","доступность","веб-разработка","web design guidelines"],"ar":["إرشادات تصميم الويب","تحسين الواجهات","إمكانية استخدام","توافق","تطوير الويب","web design guidelines"]}},"owner":"claude4062024-afk","repo":"Wallify","repoPath":"claude4062024-afk/Wallify","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web-design-guidelines","description":"Review UI code for Web Interface Guidelines compliance. Use when asked to review my UI, check accessibility, audit design, review UX, or check my site against best practices.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Web Interface Guidelines\n\nReview files for compliance with Web Interface Guidelines.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. Fetch the latest guidelines from the source URL below\n2. Read the specified files (or prompt user for files/pattern)\n3. Check against all rules in the fetched guidelines\n4. Output findings in the terse `file:line` format\n\n## Guidelines Source\n\nFetch fresh guidelines before each review:\n\n<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vercel-labs/web-interface-guidelines/main/command.md>\n\nUse WebFetch t","body":"# Web Interface Guidelines\n\nReview files for compliance with Web Interface Guidelines.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. Fetch the latest guidelines from the source URL below\n2. Read the specified files (or prompt user for files/pattern)\n3. Check against all rules in the fetched guidelines\n4. Output findings in the terse `file:line` format\n\n## Guidelines Source\n\nFetch fresh guidelines before each review:\n\n<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vercel-labs/web-interface-guidelines/main/command.md>\n\nUse WebFetch to retrieve the latest rules. The fetched content contains all the rules and output format instructions.\n\n## Usage\n\nWhen a user provides a file or pattern argument:\n\n1. Fetch guidelines from the source URL above\n2. Read the specified files\n3. Apply all rules from the fetched guidelines\n4. Output findings using the format specified in the guidelines\n\nIf no files specified, ask the user which files to review.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:59:54.528Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing automated web interface compliance checking.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化网页接口合规性检查的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが自動化されたWebインターフェイスのコンプライアンスチェックを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 웹 인터페이스 규정 준수 검사를 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan comprobación automática de cumplimiento de la interfaz web.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une vérification automatisée de la conformité de l''interface web.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine automatisierte Überprüfung der Webinterface-Konformität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de verificação automática de conformidade de interface web.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходима автоматическая проверка соответствия веб-интерфейса.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق التلقائي من مطابقة واجهة الويب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce web design consistency by fetching and applying the latest guidelines from source URLs, checking files against all rules, and outputting findings in a terse format, utilizing protocols like HTTPS and file formats like Markdown.","zh":"赋予代理执行网页设计一致性检查的能力，通过从源URL获取并应用最新的指南，检查文件对所有规则的遵守，并以简洁的格式输出结果，利用HTTPS等协议和Markdown等文件格式。","ja":"エージェントがWebデザインの一貫性を強制することを可能にします。ソースURLから最新のガイドラインを取得して適用し、ファイルをすべてのルールに照らしてチェックし、結果を簡潔な形式で出力します。HTTPSなどのプロトコルとMarkdownなどのファイル形式を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 웹 디자인의 일관성을 강제할 수 있도록 해줍니다. 소스 URL에서 최신 가이드라인을 가져와 적용하고 모든 규칙에 대해 파일을 확인하며 결과를 간결한 형식으로 출력합니다. HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜 및 Markdown와 같은 파일 형식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir la coherencia del diseño web al recuperar y aplicar las últimas directrices desde URLs de origen, comprobar archivos contra todas las reglas y generar resultados en un formato conciso, utilizando protocolos como HTTPS y formatos de archivo como Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer la cohérence de la conception web en récupérant et en appliquant les dernières directives à partir d''URL de source, en vérifiant les fichiers par rapport à toutes les règles et en générant les résultats dans un format concis, en utilisant des protocoles comme HTTPS et des formats de fichier comme Markdown.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Konsistenz des Webdesigns durch Abrufen und Anwenden der neuesten Richtlinien von Quell-URLs, Überprüfen von Dateien gegen alle Regeln und Ausgeben von Ergebnissen in einem knappen Format zu durchzusetzen, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie HTTPS und Dateiformaten wie Markdown.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor a consistência do design da web, buscando e aplicando as diretrizes mais recentes a partir de URLs de origem, verificando arquivos contra todas as regras e produzindo resultados em um formato conciso, utilizando protocolos como HTTPS e formatos de arquivo como Markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать согласованность веб-дизайна, получая и применяя последние руководства из исходных URL-адресов, проверяя файлы против всех правил и выводя результаты в кратком формате, используя протоколы như HTTPS и форматы файлов, такие как Markdown.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض συνέافة تصميم الويب عن طريق استرجاع وتطبيق الإرشادات الأخيرة من عناوين URL الأصلية، وفرض الملفات على جميع القواعد، وإخراج النتائج في تنسيق مختصر، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS وشكليات الملفات مثل Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web interface guideline compliance checks","Validating CSS and HTML files against design rules","Generating reports on design inconsistencies"],"zh":["自动化网页接口指南的合规性检查","验证CSS和HTML文件是否符合设计规则","生成关于设计不一致性的报告"],"ja":["Webインターフェイスガイドラインのコンプライアンスチェックを自動化する","CSSとHTMLファイルをデザインルールに照らして検証する","デザイン不一致に関するレポートを生成する"],"ko":["웹 인터페이스 가이드라인의 규정 준수 검사를 자동화하는 것","CSS 및 HTML 파일을 디자인 규칙에 따라 검증하는 것","디자인 불일치에 대한 보고서를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las comprobaciones de cumplimiento de las directrices de la interfaz web","Validar archivos CSS y HTML contra las reglas de diseño","Generar informes sobre las inconsistencias de diseño"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications de conformité des directives d''interface web","Valider les fichiers CSS et HTML par rapport aux règles de conception","Générer des rapports sur les incohérences de conception"],"de":["Automatisieren von Konformitätsprüfungen der Webinterface-Richtlinien","Validieren von CSS- und HTML-Dateien gegenüber Designregeln","Erstellen von Berichten über Designinkonsistenzen"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de conformidade de diretrizes de interface web","Validar arquivos CSS e HTML contra regras de design","Gerar relatórios sobre inconsistências de design"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку соответствия руководствам по веб-интерфейсу","Проверять файлы CSS и HTML против правил дизайна","Генерировать отчеты о несоответствиях дизайна"],"ar":["تحقيق آلي للتحقق من مطابقة إرشادات واجهة الويب","التحقق من صحة ملفات CSS و HTML مقابل قواعد التصميم","توليد تقارير عن عدم التطابق في التصميم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires internet access for fetching guidelines","Limited to guidelines available at the specified source URL","Output format is limited to terse ''file:line'' format"],"zh":["需要互联网访问来获取指南","仅限于指定的源URL上可用的指南","输出格式仅限于简洁的''文件:行''格式"],"ja":["ガイドラインを取得するためにインターネットアクセスが必要","指定されたソースURLで利用可能なガイドラインに限定される","出力形式は簡潔な''ファイル:行''形式に限定される"],"ko":["가이드라인을 가져오기 위해 인터넷 접근이 필요함","지정된 소스 URL에서 사용 가능한 가이드라인으로 제한됨","출력 형식은 간결한 ''파일:행'' 형식으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Internet para recuperar las directrices","Limitado a las directrices disponibles en la URL de origen especificada","El formato de salida está limitado al formato ''archivo:línea'' conciso"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Internet pour récupérer les directives","Limité aux directives disponibles à l''URL de source spécifiée","Le format de sortie est limité au format ''fichier:ligne'' concis"],"de":["Benötigt Internetzugang zum Abrufen der Richtlinien","Begrenzt auf die Richtlinien, die an der angegebenen Quell-URL verfügbar sind","Das Ausgabeformat ist auf das knappe ''Datei:Zeile''-Format beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer acesso à internet para buscar diretrizes","Limitado às diretrizes disponíveis no URL de origem especificado","Formato de saída limitado ao formato conciso ''arquivo:linha''"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к интернету для получения руководств","Ограничен руководствами, доступными по указанному исходному URL-адресу","Формат вывода ограничен кратким форматом ''файл:строка''"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الإنترنت لاسترجاع الإرشادات","محدود بالإرشادات المتاحة في عنوان URL الأصلي المحدد","تنسيق الإخراج محدود بتنسيق مختصر ''ملف:سطر''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('shaunsales/workspace-template/generate-html-report', 'community', 'shaunsales', 'workspace-template', 'shaunsales/workspace-template', 'generate-html-report', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T09:59:45.608Z', NULL, '{"id":"shaunsales/workspace-template/generate-html-report","name":"generate-html-report","description":{"zh":"generate-html-report技能允许开发者创建美丽、自包含的HTML报告，适用于比较表格、可视化摘要和演示文稿","ja":"generate-html-reportスキルは、開発者が比較表やビジュアルサマリー、プレゼンテーション用の美しく自包含的なHTMLレポートを作成できるようにします","ko":"generate-html-report 기능은 개발자가 비교 표, 시각적 요약 및 프레젠테이션용 美丽한 자체 포함 HTML 리포트를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다","pt":"O gerador de relatórios HTML cria relatórios personalizados e compartilháveis. Aprenda a usá-lo para criar conteúdo visual atraente.","ru":"Генератор HTML-отчетов создает индивидуальные и обменные отчеты. Узнайте, как им пользоваться для создания привлекательного визуального контента.","ar":"مولد تقارير HTML يولد تقارير مخصصة وقابلة للمشاركة. تعلم كيفية استخدامه لإنشاء محتوى مرئي جذاب.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"生成HTML报告工具","ja":"HTMLレポート生成ツール","ko":"HTML 리포트 생성 도구","pt":"Gereador de Relatórios HTML","ru":"Генератор HTML-отчетов","ar":"مولد تقارير HTML","en":"generate-html-report"},"description":{"zh":"generate-html-report技能允许开发者创建美丽、自包含的HTML报告，适用于比较表格、可视化摘要和演示文稿","ja":"generate-html-reportスキルは、開発者が比較表やビジュアルサマリー、プレゼンテーション用の美しく自包含的なHTMLレポートを作成できるようにします","ko":"generate-html-report 기능은 개발자가 비교 표, 시각적 요약 및 프레젠테이션용 美丽한 자체 포함 HTML 리포트를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다","pt":"O gerador de relatórios HTML cria relatórios personalizados e compartilháveis. Aprenda a usá-lo para criar conteúdo visual atraente.","ru":"Генератор HTML-отчетов создает индивидуальные и обменные отчеты. Узнайте, как им пользоваться для создания привлекательного визуального контента.","ar":"مولد تقارير HTML يولد تقارير مخصصة وقابلة للمشاركة. تعلم كيفية استخدامه لإنشاء محتوى مرئي جذاب.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建比较表格","生成可视化摘要","构建共享文档","创建演示文稿输出"],"ja":["比較表の作成","ビジュアルサマリーの生成","共有ドキュメントの構築","プレゼンテーション用出力の作成"],"ko":["비교 표 생성","시각적 요약 생성","공유 문서 구축","프레젠테이션용 출력 생성"],"pt":["Criação de relatórios personalizados","Compartilhamento como arquivos autônomos","Tabelas de comparação e gráficos","Resumos visuais","Documentação compartilhável"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных отчетов","Обмен как автономными файлами","Таблицы сравнения и графики","Визуальные сводки","Обменная документация"],"ar":["إنشاء تقارير مخصصة","المشاركة كملفات مستقلة","جداول المقارنة والرسوم البيانية","الملخصات البصرية","توثيق قابلة للمشاركة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["HTML报告","比较表格","可视化摘要","共享文档","演示文稿输出","generate-html-report"],"ja":["HTMLレポート","比較表","ビジュアルサマリー","共有ドキュメント","プレゼンテーション出力","generate-html-report"],"ko":["HTML 리포트","비교 표","시각적 요약","공유 문서","프레젠테이션 출력","generate-html-report"],"pt":["gerador de relatórios HTML","relatórios personalizados","compartilhamento de relatórios","tabelas de comparação","resumos visuais","documentação compartilhável"],"ru":["генератор HTML-отчетов","индивидуальные отчеты","обмен отчетами","таблицы сравнения","визуальные сводки","обменная документация"],"ar":["مولد تقارير HTML","تقارير مخصصة","مشاركة التقارير","جداول المقارنة","الملخصات البصرية","توثيق قابلة للمشاركة"]}},"owner":"shaunsales","repo":"workspace-template","repoPath":"shaunsales/workspace-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"generate-html-report","description":"Generate a self-contained HTML report with Tailwind CSS styling. Use when the user wants to create shareable HTML documents, comparison charts, or visual reports.","bodyPreview":"# Generate HTML Report\n\nCreate beautiful, self-contained HTML reports that can be shared as standalone files.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating comparison tables or charts\n- Generating visual summaries\n- Building shareable documentation\n- Creating presentation-ready outputs\n\n## How to Generate\n\n1. Ask the user what content they want in the report\n2. Use the template from `templates/report-template.html` as the base\n3. Customize the content while keeping the Tailwind CDN link\n4. Save to the current con","body":"# Generate HTML Report\n\nCreate beautiful, self-contained HTML reports that can be shared as standalone files.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating comparison tables or charts\n- Generating visual summaries\n- Building shareable documentation\n- Creating presentation-ready outputs\n\n## How to Generate\n\n1. Ask the user what content they want in the report\n2. Use the template from `templates/report-template.html` as the base\n3. Customize the content while keeping the Tailwind CDN link\n4. Save to the current conversation''s `outputs/html/` folder\n5. Name the file descriptively: `[description]-v[N].html`\n\n## Template Location\n\nSee `templates/report-template.html` for the base HTML structure with Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Styling Guidelines\n\n- Use Tailwind utility classes for all styling\n- Keep the design clean and professional\n- Use a consistent color scheme (slate/blue by default)\n- Ensure good contrast for readability\n- Include responsive classes for mobile viewing\n\n## Output Location\n\nAlways save generated reports to:\n```\n/conversations/[current-topic]/outputs/html/[name]-v1.html\n```\n\nIncrement the version number if a file with that name exists.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:59:45.608Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced HTML report generation capabilities with Tailwind CDN integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级HTML报告生成能力的Web开发代理，并且支持Tailwind CDN集成。","ja":"Web開発エージェントが高度なHTMLレポート生成機能とTailwind CDN統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 HTML 보고서 생성 기능과 Tailwind CDN 통합이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de informes HTML con integración de Tailwind CDN.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement web ayant besoin de capacités avancées de génération de rapports HTML avec une intégration de Tailwind CDN.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte HTML-Berichtsgenerierungsfunktionen mit Tailwind-CDN-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que precisam de capacidades avançadas de geração de relatórios HTML com integração do Tailwind CDN.","ru":"Идеально для агентов веб-разработки, которым требуются передовые возможности генерации отчетов HTML с интеграцией Tailwind CDN.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يطورون الويب ويتطلبون إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء تقارير HTML مع دمج Tailwind CDN."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate beautiful, self-contained HTML reports using a customizable template, ideal for creating comparison tables, charts, and visual summaries, all while leveraging the Tailwind CSS framework for styling and layout.","zh":"使代理能够生成美观、自包含的HTML报告，使用可定制的模板，非常适合创建比较表、图表和视觉摘要，同时利用Tailwind CSS框架进行样式和布局设置。","ja":"エージェントが美しい、自己完結的なHTMLレポートを生成できるようにし、カスタマイズ可能なテンプレートを使用して、比較表、チャート、視覚的な要約を作成し、スタイリングとレイアウトのためにTailwind CSSフレームワークを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 아름답고 자체 포함된 HTML 보고서를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 사용자 정의 가능한 템플릿을 사용하여 비교 표, 차트 및 시각적 요약을 생성하며, 스타일링 및 레이아웃을 위해 Tailwind CSS 프레임워크를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar hermosos informes HTML autocontenidos utilizando una plantilla personalizable, ideal para crear tablas de comparación, gráficos y resúmenes visuales, todo mientras aprovecha el marco de trabajo Tailwind CSS para el estilo y el diseño.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des rapports HTML magnifiques et autocontenus en utilisant un modèle personnalisable, idéal pour créer des tableaux de comparaison, des graphiques et des résumés visuels, le tout en exploitant le framework Tailwind CSS pour le style et la disposition.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, schöne, selbstenthaltene HTML-Berichte mit einer anpassbaren Vorlage zu generieren, ideal für die Erstellung von Vergleichstabellen, Diagrammen und visuellen Zusammenfassungen, und zwar unter Ausnutzung des Tailwind-CSS-Frameworks für Stil und Layout.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar relatórios HTML bonitos e autocontidos usando um modelo personalizável, ideal para criar tabelas de comparação, gráficos e resumos visuais, tudo isso aproveitando o framework Tailwind CSS para estilização e layout.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать красивые,自одостаточные отчеты HTML с помощью настраиваемого шаблона, идеального для создания таблиц сравнения, графиков и визуальных сводок, все это при использовании фреймворка Tailwind CSS для стилизации и макета.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء تقارير HTML جميلة ومتكاملة باستخدام قالب مخصص، مثالي لإنشاء جداول比較 ورسوم بيانية وملخصات بصرية، كل ذلك بالاستفادة من إطار Tailwind CSS للتنسيق والتخطيط."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating presentation-ready outputs","Creating shareable documentation with embedded charts","Building visual summaries for data analysis"],"zh":["生成演示就绪输出","创建带有嵌入图表的共享文档","构建数据分析的视觉摘要"],"ja":["プレゼンテーション就緒の出力を生成する","埋め込みチャートを含む共有可能なドキュメントを作成する","データ分析のための視覚的な要約を構築する"],"ko":["프레젠테이션 준비 출력 생성","내장 차트가 포함된 공유 가능한 문서 만들기","데이터 분석을 위한 시각적 요약 구축"],"es":["Generación de salidas listas para presentación","Creación de documentación compartible con gráficos incrustados","Creación de resúmenes visuales para análisis de datos"],"fr":["Génération de sorties prêtes pour la présentation","Création de documentation partageable avec des graphiques intégrés","Conception de résumés visuels pour l''analyse de données"],"de":["Generierung von präsentationsfertigen Ausgaben","Erstellung von teilerbare Dokumentation mit eingebetteten Diagrammen","Erstellung von visuellen Zusammenfassungen für Datenanalyse"],"pt":["Geração de saídas prontas para apresentação","Criação de documentação compartilhável com gráficos incorporados","Construção de resumos visuais para análise de dados"],"ru":["Генерация презентационно-готовых выходных данных","Создание документации, которую можно поделиться и в которой есть встроенные графики","Построение визуальных сводок для анализа данных"],"ar":["إنشاء مخرجات جاهزة للعرض","إنشاء توثيق يمكن مشاركته مع رسوم بيانية مدمجة","بناء ملخصات بصرية لتحليل البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the templates/report-template.html file","Dependent on Tailwind CDN for styling"],"zh":["需要访问templates/report-template.html文件","依赖于Tailwind CDN进行样式设置"],"ja":["templates/report-template.htmlファイルへのアクセスが必要","スタイリングのためにTailwind CDNに依存する"],"ko":["templates/report-template.html 파일에 접근해야 함","스타일링을 위해 Tailwind CDN에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo templates/report-template.html","Dependiente de Tailwind CDN para el estilo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au fichier templates/report-template.html","Dépendant de Tailwind CDN pour le style"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Datei templates/report-template.html","Abhängig von Tailwind CDN für das Layout"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo templates/report-template.html","Dependente do Tailwind CDN para estilização"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу templates/report-template.html","Зависит от Tailwind CDN для стилизации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف templates/report-template.html","يعتمد على Tailwind CDN للتنسيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Ejyke90/naija-conflict-tracker/openspec-apply-change', 'community', 'Ejyke90', 'naija-conflict-tracker', 'Ejyke90/naija-conflict-tracker', 'openspec-apply-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T09:59:55.025Z', NULL, '{"id":"Ejyke90/naija-conflict-tracker/openspec-apply-change","name":"openspec-apply-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-apply-change 任务实现 OpenSpec 变更，支持自动选择和手动指定变更","ja":"OpenSpec 変更適用タスクの実装方法","ko":"OpenSpec 변경 적용 태스크를 통해 변경을 자동 또는 수동으로 선택합니다","es":"La habilidad openspec-apply-change permite implementar tareas de OpenSpec y aplicar cambios de manera efectiva.","fr":"La compétence openspec-apply-change permet d''implémenter des tâches OpenSpec et d''appliquer des modifications de manière efficace.","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-apply-change ermöglicht die Implementierung von OpenSpec-Aufgaben und die Anwendung von Änderungen auf effektive Weise.","pt":"O openspec-apply-change é uma habilidade que implementa tarefas de alterações OpenSpec. Ele seleciona a alteração com base no nome fornecido ou no contexto da conversa.","ru":"openspec-apply-change — это навык, который реализует задачи изменений OpenSpec. Он выбирает изменение на основе предоставленного имени или контекста разговора.","ar":"openspec-apply-change هو مهارة تنفذ مهام تغييرات OpenSpec. يتم اختيار التغيير بناءً على الاسم المحدد أو سياق المحادثة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"OpenSpec 变更应用","ja":"OpenSpec 変更適用","ko":"OpenSpec 변경 적용","es":"Aplicar cambios con OpenSpec","fr":"Appliquer des modifications avec OpenSpec","de":"Änderungen mit OpenSpec anwenden","pt":"Aplicar Alterações OpenSpec","ru":"Применение изменений OpenSpec","ar":"تطبيق تغييرات OpenSpec","en":"openspec-apply-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-apply-change 任务实现 OpenSpec 变更，支持自动选择和手动指定变更","ja":"OpenSpec 変更適用タスクの実装方法","ko":"OpenSpec 변경 적용 태스크를 통해 변경을 자동 또는 수동으로 선택합니다","es":"La habilidad openspec-apply-change permite implementar tareas de OpenSpec y aplicar cambios de manera efectiva.","fr":"La compétence openspec-apply-change permet d''implémenter des tâches OpenSpec et d''appliquer des modifications de manière efficace.","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-apply-change ermöglicht die Implementierung von OpenSpec-Aufgaben und die Anwendung von Änderungen auf effektive Weise.","pt":"O openspec-apply-change é uma habilidade que implementa tarefas de alterações OpenSpec. Ele seleciona a alteração com base no nome fornecido ou no contexto d...","ru":"openspec-apply-change — это навык, который реализует задачи изменений OpenSpec. Он выбирает изменение на основе предоставленного имени или контекста разговора.","ar":"openspec-apply-change هو مهارة تنفذ مهام تغييرات OpenSpec. يتم اختيار التغيير بناءً على الاسم المحدد أو سياق المحادثة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动选择变更","手动指定变更","支持多个变更","对话上下文推断","可用的变更列表"],"ja":["自動で変更を選択","手動で変更を指定","複数の変更をサポート","会話のコンテキストから変更を推測","利用可能な変更の一覧"],"ko":["자동 변경 선택","수동 변경 지정","여러 변경 지원","대화 CONTEXT에서 변경 추론","사용 가능한 변경 목록"],"es":["Implementación de tareas de OpenSpec","Aplicación de cambios de manera efectiva","Selección de cambios según el contexto de la conversación","Compatibilidad con comandos de línea de comandos como openspec list --json","Inferencia de cambios si no se proporciona un nombre","Selección automática si solo existe un cambio activo"],"fr":["Implémentation de tâches OpenSpec","Application de modifications de manière efficace","Sélection de modifications en fonction du contexte de la conversation","Compatibilité avec des commandes de ligne de commande comme openspec list --json","Déduction de modifications si aucun nom n''est fourni","Sélection automatique si seule une modification active existe"],"de":["Implementierung von OpenSpec-Aufgaben","Anwendung von Änderungen auf effektive Weise","Auswahl von Änderungen basierend auf dem Konversationskontext","Kompatibilität mit Befehlen wie openspec list --json","Ableitung von Änderungen, wenn kein Name angegeben ist","Automatische Auswahl, wenn nur eine aktive Änderung existiert"],"pt":["Seleção de alterações com base no nome ou contexto","Implementação de tarefas de alterações OpenSpec","Suporte a inferência de alterações a partir do contexto da conversa","Capacidade de lidar com alterações ambíguas","Integração com o comando openspec list --json"],"ru":["Выбор изменений на основе имени или контекста","Реализация задач изменений OpenSpec","Поддержка вывода изменений из контекста разговора","Возможность справиться с неоднозначными изменениями","Интеграция с командой openspec list --json"],"ar":["اختيار التغييرات بناءً على الاسم أو السياق","تنفيذ مهام تغييرات OpenSpec","دعم استنتاج التغييرات من سياق المحادثة","القدرة على التعامل مع التغييرات الغامضة","التكامل مع الأمر openspec list --json"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenSpec","变更应用","自动选择","手动指定","对话上下文","openspec-apply-change"],"ja":["OpenSpec","変更適用","自動選択","手動指定","会話のコンテキスト","openspec-apply-change"],"ko":["OpenSpec","변경 적용","자동 선택","수동 지정","대화 CONTEXT","openspec-apply-change"],"es":["OpenSpec","aplicar cambios","implementar tareas","gestión de cambios","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","openspec-apply-change","cambios de software","desarrollo ágil"],"fr":["OpenSpec","appliquer des modifications","implémenter des tâches","gestion des modifications","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","openspec-apply-change","modifications de logiciels","développement agile"],"de":["OpenSpec","Änderungen anwenden","Aufgaben implementieren","Änderungsmanagement","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","openspec-apply-change","Softwareänderungen","Agiles Entwicklung"],"pt":["openspec-apply-change","alterações OpenSpec","implementação de tarefas","inferência de contexto","comando openspec list --json","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["openspec-apply-change","изменения OpenSpec","реализация задач","вывод контекста","команда openspec list --json","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["openspec-apply-change","تغيرات OpenSpec","تنفيذ مهام","استنتاج سياق","أمر openspec list --json","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"naija-conflict-tracker","repoPath":"Ejyke90/naija-conflict-tracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-apply-change","description":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change. Use when the user wants to start implementing, continue implementation, or work through tasks.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Select the change**\n\n   If a name is provided, use it. Otherwise:\n   - Infer from conversation context if the user mentioned a change\n   - Auto-select if only one active change exists\n   - If ambiguous, run `openspec list --json` to get available changes and use the *","body":"Implement tasks from an OpenSpec change.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Select the change**\n\n   If a name is provided, use it. Otherwise:\n   - Infer from conversation context if the user mentioned a change\n   - Auto-select if only one active change exists\n   - If ambiguous, run `openspec list --json` to get available changes and use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select\n\n   Always announce: \"Using change: <name>\" and how to override (e.g., `/opsx:apply <other>`).\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifact contains the tasks (typically \"tasks\" for spec-driven, check status for others)\n\n3. **Get apply instructions**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns:\n   - Context file paths (varies by schema - could be proposal/specs/design/tasks or spec/tests/implementation/docs)\n   - Progress (total, complete, remaining)\n   - Task list with status\n   - Dynamic instruction based on current state\n\n   **Handle states:**\n   - If `state: \"blocked\"` (missing artifacts): show message, suggest using openspec-continue-change\n   - If `state: \"all_done\"`: congratulate, suggest archive\n   - Otherwise: proceed to implementation\n\n4. **Read context files**\n\n   Read the files listed in `contextFiles` from the apply instructions output.\n   The files depend on the schema being used:\n   - **spec-driven**: proposal, specs, design, tasks\n   - Other schemas: follow the contextFiles from CLI output\n\n5. **Show current progress**\n\n   Display:\n   - Schema being used\n   - Progress: \"N/M tasks complete\"\n   - Remaining tasks overview\n   - Dynamic instruction from CLI\n\n6. **Implement tasks (loop until done or blocked)**\n\n   For each pending task:\n   - Show which task is being worked on\n   - Make the code changes required\n   - Keep changes minimal and focused\n   - Mark task complete in the tasks file: `- [ ]` → `- [x]`\n   - Continue to next task\n\n   **Pause if:**\n   - Task is unclear → ask for clarification\n   - Implementation reveals a design issue → suggest updating artifacts\n   - Error or blocker encountered → report and wait for guidance\n   - User interrupts\n\n7. **On completion or pause, show status**\n\n   Display:\n   - Tasks completed this session\n   - Overall progress: \"N/M tasks complete\"\n   - If all done: suggest archive\n   - If paused: explain why and wait for guidance\n\n**Output During Implementation**\n\n```\n## Implementing: <change-name> (schema: <schema-name>)\n\nWorking on task 3/7: <task description>\n[...implementation happening...]\n✓ Task complete\n\nWorking on task 4/7: <task description>\n[...implementation happening...]\n✓ Task complete\n```\n\n**Output On Completion**\n\n```\n## Implementation Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Progress:** 7/7 tasks complete ✓\n\n### Completed This Session\n- [x] Task 1\n- [x] Task 2\n...\n\nAll tasks complete! Ready to archive this change.\n```\n\n**Output On Pause (Issue Encountered)**\n\n```\n## Implementation Paused\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Progress:** 4/7 tasks complete\n\n### Issue Encountered\n<description of the issue>\n\n**Options:**\n1. <option 1>\n2. <option 2>\n3. Other approach\n\nWhat would you like to do?\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Keep going through tasks until done or blocked\n- Always read context files before starting (from the apply instructions output)\n- If task is ambiguous, pause and ask before implementing\n- If implementation reveals issues, pause and suggest artifact updates\n- Keep code changes minimal and scoped to each task\n- Update task checkbox immediately after completing each task\n- Pause on errors, blockers, or unclear requirements - don''t guess\n- Use contextFiles from CLI output, don''t assume specific file names\n\n**Fluid Workflow Integration**\n\nThis skill supports the \"actions on a change\" model:\n\n- **Can be invoked anytime**: Before all artifacts are done (if tasks exist), after partial implementation, interleaved with other actions\n- **Allows artifact updates**: If implementation reveals design issues, suggest updating artifacts - not phase-locked, work fluidly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:59:55.025Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated OpenSpec change implementation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化 OpenSpec 更改实现的开发代理。","ja":"OpenSpec の変更を自動実装する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"OpenSpec 변경 사항을 자동으로 구현해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de implementación de cambios de OpenSpec automatizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités d''implémentation automatique de changements OpenSpec.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die automatisierte OpenSpec-Änderungsimplementierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de capacidades de implementação automatizada de alterações do OpenSpec.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы автоматические возможности реализации изменений OpenSpec.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تطبيق تغييرات OpenSpec آليًا."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly integrate with OpenSpec by implementing tasks from changes, utilizing conversation context inference and auto-selection from available changes via the `openspec list --json` command, and handling ambiguous inputs by prompting for available changes.","zh":"赋予代理无缝集成 OpenSpec 的能力，通过从更改中实现任务，利用对话上下文推断和从可用更改中自动选择通过 `openspec list --json` 命令，并通过提示可用更改来处理模糊输入。","ja":"エージェントに OpenSpec とシームレスに統合する機能を与え、変更からタスクを実装し、会話のコンテキスト推論と `openspec list --json` コマンドを使用した利用可能な変更の自動選択を行い、曖昧な入力を利用可能な変更のプロンプトで処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 OpenSpec과 무결점으로 통합할 수 있도록 하며, 변경 사항에서 작업을 구현하고 대화 문脈 추론 및 `openspec list --json` 명령을 통해 사용 가능한 변경 사항을 자동으로 선택하며, 모호한 입력을 처리하기 위해 사용 가능한 변경 사항에 대한 프롬프트를 표시합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrarse de forma transparente con OpenSpec implementando tareas desde cambios, utilizando la inferencia del contexto de conversación y la selección automática desde cambios disponibles a través del comando `openspec list --json`, y manejando entradas ambiguas solicitando cambios disponibles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''intégrer en toute transparence avec OpenSpec en implémentant des tâches à partir de changements, en utilisant l''inférence du contexte de conversation et la sélection automatique à partir de changements disponibles via la commande `openspec list --json`, et en gérant les entrées ambiguës en demandant des changements disponibles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, sich nahtlos in OpenSpec zu integrieren, indem sie Aufgaben aus Änderungen implementieren, die Konversationskontextinferenz und die automatische Auswahl aus verfügbaren Änderungen über den Befehl `openspec list --json` nutzen und mehrdeutige Eingaben durch Aufforderung zu verfügbaren Änderungen verarbeiten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar-se perfeitamente com o OpenSpec, implementando tarefas a partir de alterações, utilizando inferência de contexto de conversa e seleção automática de alterações disponíveis via o comando `openspec list --json`, e lidando com entradas ambíguas solicitando alterações disponíveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовно интегрироваться с OpenSpec, реализуя задачи из изменений, используя вывод контекста разговора и автоматический выбор доступных изменений через команду `openspec list --json`, и обрабатывая неоднозначные входные данные, запрашивая доступные изменения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التكامل السلس مع OpenSpec من خلال تنفيذ المهام من التغييرات، واستخدام استنباط سياق المحادثة والاختيار التلقائي للتغييرات المتاحة عبر الأمر `openspec list --json`، ومعالجة المدخلات الغامضة من خلال الطلب التغييرات المتاحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing changes from OpenSpec","Automating task execution based on change names","Inferring change context from conversation history"],"zh":["从 OpenSpec 实现更改","基于更改名称自动执行任务","从对话历史中推断更改上下文"],"ja":["OpenSpec からの変更の実装","変更名に基づくタスクの自動実行","会話履歴から変更コンテキストの推論"],"ko":["OpenSpec에서 변경 사항을 구현하는 것","변경 이름을 기준으로 작업을 자동으로 실행하는 것","대화 기록에서 변경 문脈을 추론하는 것"],"es":["Implementación de cambios desde OpenSpec","Automatización de la ejecución de tareas en función de los nombres de los cambios","Inferencia del contexto de cambio desde el historial de conversación"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de changements à partir d''OpenSpec","Automatisation de l''exécution de tâches en fonction des noms de changements","Inférence du contexte de changement à partir de l''historique de conversation"],"de":["Implementierung von Änderungen aus OpenSpec","Automatisierung der Aufgabenausführung basierend auf Änderungsnamen","Ableitung des Änderungskontexts aus der Konversationshistorie"],"pt":["Implementar alterações do OpenSpec","Automatizar a execução de tarefas com base em nomes de alterações","Inferir contexto de alterações a partir do histórico de conversa"],"ru":["Реализация изменений OpenSpec","Автоматизация выполнения задач на основе имен изменений","Вывод контекста изменений из истории разговора"],"ar":["تنفيذ التغييرات من OpenSpec","تأتمة تنفيذ المهام بناءً على أسماء التغييرات","استنباط سياق التغييرات من تاريخ المحادثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenSpec installation and configuration","Limited to changes available in the OpenSpec context","May require user input for ambiguous change names"],"zh":["需要 OpenSpec 的安装和配置","仅限于 OpenSpec 上下文中可用的更改","可能需要用户输入以解决模糊的更改名称"],"ja":["OpenSpec のインストールと設定が必要","OpenSpec コンテキストで利用可能な変更のみに制限される","曖昧な変更名の解決にはユーザー入力が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["OpenSpec 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다.","OpenSpec 문脈에서 사용 가능한 변경 사항만 해당합니다.","모호한 변경 이름을 해결하기 위해 사용자 입력이 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de OpenSpec","Limitado a los cambios disponibles en el contexto de OpenSpec","Puede requerir la entrada del usuario para nombres de cambios ambiguos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''OpenSpec","Limité aux changements disponibles dans le contexte d''OpenSpec","Peut nécessiter une entrée utilisateur pour les noms de changements ambigus"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von OpenSpec","Begrenzt auf die im OpenSpec-Kontext verfügbaren Änderungen","Kann Benutzereingabe für mehrdeutige Änderungsnamen erfordern"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do OpenSpec","Limitado às alterações disponíveis no contexto do OpenSpec","Pode requerer entrada do usuário para nomes de alterações ambíguos"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации OpenSpec","Ограничен изменениями, доступными в контексте OpenSpec","Может требовать ввода пользователя для неоднозначных имен изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين OpenSpec","محدود بالتغييرات المتاحة في سياق OpenSpec","يمكن أن يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لأسماء التغييرات الغامضة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('joolbits/latitude/latitude-generation-order-rules', 'community', 'joolbits', 'latitude', 'joolbits/latitude', 'latitude-generation-order-rules', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T09:59:58.969Z', NULL, '{"id":"joolbits/latitude/latitude-generation-order-rules","name":"latitude-generation-order-rules","description":{"zh":"此技能定义了 Minecraft Fabric 模组中基于纬度的生物群系带生成的高级操作顺序，确保生成过程的确定性","ja":"このスキルは、Minecraft Fabric モッドにおける緯度ベースのバイオームバンド生成の高レベルな操作順序を定義し、生成プロセスの決定性を保証します","ko":"이 스킬은 마인크래프트 Fabric 모드에서 위도 기반 바이옴 밴드 생성의 고수준 작업 순서를 정의하여 생성 프로세스의 결정성을 보장합니다","es":"El skill ''latitude-generation-order-rules'' define el orden de operaciones para la generación de mundos de latitud en Minecraft. Establece reglas para prevenir la invención de nuevos pasos en el pipeline","fr":"Le skill ''latitude-generation-order-rules'' définit l''ordre des opérations pour la génération de mondes de latitude dans Minecraft. Il établit des règles pour prévenir l''invention de nouvelles étapes dans le pipeline","de":"Das Skill ''latitude-generation-order-rules'' definiert die Reihenfolge der Operationen für die Generierung von Latitudenwelten in Minecraft. Es legt Regeln fest, um die Erfindung neuer Schritte im Pipeline zu verhindern","pt":"As regras de ordem de geração de latitude são fundamentais para criar mundos de estilo global em Minecraft. Elas definem a ordem de operações para a geração de biomas.","ru":"Правила порядка генерации широты являются фундаментальными для создания глобальных миров в Minecraft. Они определяют порядок операций для генерации биомов.","ar":"قواعد ترتيب إنشاء خطوط العرض هي الأساسية لإنشاء عوالم من نمط العالَم في مايكرافت. وهي تحدد ترتيب العمليات لإنشاء البيئات","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Minecraft Fabric 模组：基于纬度的生物群系带生成规则","ja":"Minecraft Fabric モッド：緯度ベースのバイオームバンド生成ルール","ko":"마인크래프트 Fabric 모드: 위도 기반 바이옴 밴드 생성 규칙","es":"Reglas de orden de generación de latitud para Minecraft","fr":"Règles d''ordre de génération de latitude pour Minecraft","de":"Regeln für die Reihenfolge der Latitudengenerierung in Mi...","pt":"Regras de Ordem de Geração de Latitude para Minecraft","ru":"Правила порядка генерации широты для Minecraft","ar":"قواعد ترتيب إنشاء خطوط العرض لمايكرافت","en":"latitude-generation-order-rules"},"description":{"zh":"此技能定义了 Minecraft Fabric 模组中基于纬度的生物群系带生成的高级操作顺序，确保生成过程的确定性","ja":"このスキルは、Minecraft Fabric モッドにおける緯度ベースのバイオームバンド生成の高レベルな操作順序を定義し、生成プロセスの決定性を保証します","ko":"이 스킬은 마인크래프트 Fabric 모드에서 위도 기반 바이옴 밴드 생성의 고수준 작업 순서를 정의하여 생성 프로세스의 결정성을 보장합니다","es":"El skill ''latitude-generation-order-rules'' define el orden de operaciones para la generación de mundos de latitud en Minecraft. Establece reglas para preveni...","fr":"Le skill ''latitude-generation-order-rules'' définit l''ordre des opérations pour la génération de mondes de latitude dans Minecraft. Il établit des règles pour...","de":"Das Skill ''latitude-generation-order-rules'' definiert die Reihenfolge der Operationen für die Generierung von Latitudenwelten in Minecraft. Es legt Regeln fe...","pt":"As regras de ordem de geração de latitude são fundamentais para criar mundos de estilo global em Minecraft. Elas definem a ordem de operações para a geração ...","ru":"Правила порядка генерации широты являются фундаментальными для создания глобальных миров в Minecraft. Они определяют порядок операций для генерации биомов.","ar":"قواعد ترتيب إنشاء خطوط العرض هي الأساسية لإنشاء عوالم من نمط العالَم في مايكرافت. وهي تحدد ترتيب العمليات لإنشاء البيئات","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"definition":{"en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"features":{"zh":["确定性的基于纬度的生物群系带生成","适用于 globe 风格的世界","高级操作顺序","防止生成过程中的不确定性","基于代码、日志或授权表的生成"],"ja":["緯度ベースのバイオームバンド生成の決定性","グローブスタイルのワールドへの適合","高レベルな操作順序","生成プロセスの不確実性の防止","コード、ログ、または認可表に基づく生成"],"ko":["위도 기반 바이옴 밴드 생성의 결정성","글로브 스타일의 세계에 적합","고수준 작업 순서","생성 프로세스의 불확실성 방지","코드, 로그 또는 승인된 표에 기반한 생성"],"es":["Determinismo en la generación de biomas","Reglas para prevenir la invención de nuevos pasos","Protección contra la reordenación de etapas","Prevención de fugas de biomas","Mantenimiento de biomas vanilla"],"fr":["Déterminisme dans la génération de biomes","Règles pour prévenir l''invention de nouvelles étapes","Protection contre la réorganisation des étapes","Prévention des fuites de biomes","Maintenance des biomes vanilla"],"de":["Determinismus bei der Generierung von Biomen","Regeln zur Verhinderung der Erfindung neuer Schritte","Schutz vor der Neuanordnung von Stufen","Verhinderung von Biome-Lecks","Beibehaltung von Vanilla-Biomen"],"pt":["Geração de biomas determinística","Ordem de operações para geração de biomas","Prevenção de vazamentos de biomas","Manutenção de biomas vanilla","Compatibilidade com Minecraft Fabric mod"],"ru":["Детерминированная генерация биомов","Порядок операций для генерации биомов","Предотвращение утечек биомов","Сохранение биомов vanilla","Совместимость с Minecraft Fabric mod"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات محدد","ترتيب العمليات لإنشاء البيئات","منع تسرب البيئات","الحفاظ على البيئات الفانيللا","التوافق مع مود فابريك لمايكرافت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft Fabric 模组","基于纬度的生物群系带生成","globe 风格的世界","确定性的生成","高级操作顺序","生成规则","生物群系带"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabric モッド","緯度ベースのバイオームバンド生成","グローブスタイルのワールド","決定的な生成","高レベルな操作順序","生成ルール","バイオームバンド"],"ko":["마인크래프트 Fabric 모드","위도 기반 바이옴 밴드 생성","글로브 스타일의 세계","결정적인 생성","고수준 작업 순서","생성 규칙","바이옴 밴드"],"es":["Minecraft Fabric mod","generación de latitud","reglas de orden","biomas deterministas","protección contra fugas","mantenimiento de biomas vanilla","desarrollo de mods","Minecraft API"],"fr":["Mod Minecraft Fabric","génération de latitude","règles d''ordre","biomes déterministes","protection contre les fuites","maintenance des biomes vanilla","développement de mods","API Minecraft"],"de":["Minecraft Fabric-Mod","Latitudengenerierung","Reihenfolgeregel","deterministische Biome","Schutz vor Lecks","Beibehaltung von Vanilla-Biomen","Mod-Entwicklung","Minecraft-API"],"pt":["Minecraft","Latitude","Geração de biomas","Regras de ordem","Minecraft Fabric mod","Biomas determinísticos","Prevenção de vazamentos de biomas"],"ru":["Minecraft","Широта","Генерация биомов","Правила порядка","Minecraft Fabric mod","Детерминированные биомы","Предотвращение утечек биомов"],"ar":["مايكرافت","خطوط العرض","إنشاء البيئات","قواعد الترتيب","مود فابريك لمايكرافت","بيئات محددة","منع تسرب البيئات"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"latitude","repoPath":"joolbits/latitude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"latitude-generation-order-rules","description":"Canonical rules for how Latitude decides biomes and applies them across generation stages. Prevents the model from inventing steps, reordering pipeline stages, or “fixing” bugs by changing generation order.","bodyPreview":"# Latitude — Generation Order Rules (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill defines the **only allowed** high-level order of operations for Latitude worldgen and related runtime guards.\nIt exists to prevent the assistant from:\n- Inventing new pipeline steps\n- Reordering stages without evidence\n- “Fixing” biome leaks by guessing different order\n- Removing vanilla biomes or changing eligibility tables\n\nIf the assistant cannot prove a step from code, logs, or an attached authority table, it must say **UNKNOWN*","body":"# Latitude — Generation Order Rules (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill defines the **only allowed** high-level order of operations for Latitude worldgen and related runtime guards.\nIt exists to prevent the assistant from:\n- Inventing new pipeline steps\n- Reordering stages without evidence\n- “Fixing” biome leaks by guessing different order\n- Removing vanilla biomes or changing eligibility tables\n\nIf the assistant cannot prove a step from code, logs, or an attached authority table, it must say **UNKNOWN** and ask for the specific file / method signature.\n\n---\n\n## Primary authority files (must consult)\n- **Vanilla biome latitude eligibility table** (single source of truth):\n  - `.windsurf/skills/latitude-biome-authority/SKILL.md`\n- **Biome bands reference (if present in repo docs / exports):**\n  - `cc-latitude-comprehensive-2026-02-05.md` (project notes)\n- **Any “LatitudeBiomes” / picker implementation**:\n  - `src/main/java/com/example/globe/world/LatitudeBiomes.java` (or the current equivalent)\n\n> Rule: If there is any conflict between a guess and an authority file, the authority file wins.\n\n---\n\n## Non-negotiable invariants\n1) **All vanilla biomes must still exist** somewhere unless the authority list explicitly excludes them.\n2) **Latitude bands constrain selection**; variants/overlays are secondary and may only restrict, not invent.\n3) “Fixes” must not rely on changing worldgen order unless:\n   - a concrete call site is identified, and\n   - a targeted change is made with minimal surface area.\n4) If snow/cold artifacts appear in warm bands, the allowed fixes are **write-path guards** (ProtoChunk/ChunkRegion/Feature cancel) or **correct biome container propagation** — not “change band table.”\n\n---\n\n## Canonical generation pipeline (high level)\nWhen reasoning about how a block/biome appears, assume this order unless code proves otherwise:\n\n### Stage A — Base / vanilla biome resolution\n- Vanilla chooses a **base biome** (the “base=” shown in logs).\n- Latitude may log this (e.g. `[LAT_PICK] base=...`).\n\n### Stage B — Latitude selection and output biome override\n- Latitude computes:\n  - `radius = worldBorderSize / 2`\n  - `t = abs(z)/radius`\n  - `zone = band(t)`\n- Latitude chooses an **out biome** (the biome returned to the generator).\n- Latitude logs (example shape):\n  - `[LAT_PICK] zone=EQUATOR base=snowy_taiga out=jungle ...`\n- If the assistant proposes threshold changes, it must reference the exact helper/constants used.\n\n### Stage C — Surface rules / material placement\n- Surface rules (MaterialRules) place top blocks (grass/sand/snow_block, etc.) based on biome + noise.\n- If “out biome” is warm but cold blocks appear, suspect that:\n  - some placements still consult **base biome** temperature/precip flags, OR\n  - placements happen through features after surface rules.\n\n### Stage D — Feature placement / post-processing\n- Features can place blocks using region/world access (e.g. `FreezeTopLayerFeature`).\n- These may use biome temperature flags and can be triggered even when out biome is warm if base biome data leaks.\n\n### Stage E — Runtime & write-path guards (Latitude protections)\nAllowed guard layers (in order of preference for robustness):\n1) **Feature-level cancel** for known offenders (e.g., cancel `FreezeTopLayerFeature` in warm bands)\n2) **Write-path trap** at `ChunkRegion#setBlockState` during worldgen\n3) **ProtoChunk#setBlockState` trap** for direct chunk writes\n4) **Biome precipitation hooks** (only affect weather-driven snow layers, not worldgen blocks)\n\n> Rule: If a block is still appearing, identify which write path is used by logging/stack trace; do not guess.\n\n---\n\n## Debugging protocol (mandatory)\nWhen a worldgen artifact appears (snow/powder snow in warm bands, wrong biome, etc.):\n\n1) **Confirm out biome** (F3) and capture coords (x,y,z).\n2) Search logs for the decision record near that location:\n   - `[LAT_PICK] ... base=... out=... zone=...`\n3) Determine which system wrote the offending block:\n   - Feature hook logs (e.g., `[FREEZE_GUARD]`)\n   - Write-path logs (e.g., `[SNOWBLOCK_GUARD]`)\n4) Only then propose the smallest fix:\n   - cancel the feature, or\n   - rewrite the blockstate at the write choke point, gated by warm band logic.\n\nIf any of these steps lack evidence, the assistant must request the relevant file/method signature.\n\n---\n\n## Allowed outputs the assistant may produce\n- Exact “next step” commands (PowerShell) to locate call sites (`Select-String`, `git grep`, `jar tf`, etc.)\n- Minimal patch plans: 1–3 files, 1–2 commits, with revert path\n- Explicit “proof” instrumentation plans: single-shot logs, counters, or stack trace capture\n- Release discipline steps: build, jar verify, tag placement, and Modrinth upload checklist\n\n---\n\n## Forbidden behaviors\n- Inventing a “worldgen order” not supported by code/logs\n- Reassigning biomes to bands to “fix” bugs\n- Removing vanilla biomes because they’re “rare” or “problematic”\n- Proposing broad refactors when a write-path guard would solve the symptom\n- Shipping releases from branches polluted with extracted MC sources or tooling folders\n\n---\n\n## Reminder: one variable at a time\nWhen making changes:\n- One change per commit\n- Test\n- Tag savepoint if it touches generation\n- Then proceed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:59:58.969Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Minecraft Fabric Mod Agents requiring deterministic latitude-based biome generation and authoritative runtime guards.","zh":"适合需要确定性纬度基于生物群落生成和权威运行时守护的Minecraft Fabric Mod代理。","ja":"Minecraft Fabric Modエージェントが必要とする、決定論的な緯度ベースのバイオーム生成と権限のあるランタイムガードに最適です。","ko":"결정적 위도 기반 생물군계 생성 및 권한 있는 런타임 가드가 필요한 Minecraft Fabric Mod 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de modificación de Minecraft Fabric que requieren generación de biomas determinista basada en latitud y guardias de tiempo de ejecución autorizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de modification Minecraft Fabric nécessitant une génération de biomes déterministe basée sur la latitude et des gardes de runtime autorisés.","de":"Ideal für Minecraft Fabric Mod Agenten, die deterministische Breiten-basierte Biome-Generierung und autorisierte Laufzeitwächter erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mod Fabric do Minecraft que requerem geração de biomas baseada em latitude determinística e guardas de tempo de execução autoritários.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Minecraft Fabric Mod, требующих детерминированную генерацию биомов на основе широты и авторитетные 런타임-охранники.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Minecraft Fabric Mod الذي يتطلب توليدًا بيئيًا قائمًا على خط العرض إقصاديًا وحراس زمن تشغيل صريحين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce high-level order of operations for Latitude worldgen, preventing unauthorized pipeline steps and biome leaks, while ensuring compliance with attached authority tables and code-based evidence, utilizing Minecraft Fabric mod and related runtime guards protocols.","zh":"赋予代理人执行高级操作顺序的权力，用于纬度世界生成，防止未经授权的管道步骤和生物群落泄漏，同时确保遵守附加的权限表和基于代码的证据，利用Minecraft Fabric模块和相关的运行时守护协议。","ja":"エージェントに、高レベルの操作順序を執行する権限を付与し、緯度のワールドジェネレーションに対して、未承認のパイプラインステップやバイオームの漏洩を防止し、同時に、付属の権限テーブルやコードベースの証拠に従って、Minecraft Fabric modおよび関連するランタイムガードプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 고급 순서를 강제 실행할 수 있도록 하여, 위도 세계 생성을 위한 권한이 있는 파이프라인 단계와 생물군계 누수를 방지하며,同時に 부착된 권한 테이블 및 코드 기반 증거를 준수하도록 하며, Minecraft Fabric 모드 및 관련 런타임 가드 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un orden de operaciones de alto nivel para la generación de mundos de latitud, evitando pasos de tubería no autorizados y fugas de biomas, al mismo tiempo que garantiza el cumplimiento de las tablas de autoridad adjuntas y la evidencia basada en código, utilizando protocolos de modificación de Minecraft Fabric y guardias de tiempo de ejecución relacionados.","fr":"Habilite les agents à appliquer un ordre d''opérations de haut niveau pour la génération de monde de latitude, empêchant les étapes de pipeline non autorisées et les fuites de biomes, tout en garantissant la conformité avec les tableaux d''autorité joints et les preuves basées sur le code, en utilisant les protocoles de modification Minecraft Fabric et les gardes de runtime associés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine hohe Reihenfolge von Operationen für die Latitude-Weltgenerierung durchzusetzen, verhindert nicht autorisierte Pipeline-Schritte und Biome-Lecks, während gleichzeitig die Einhaltung der angehängten Autoritätstabellen und der codebasierten Beweise sichergestellt wird, unter Verwendung von Minecraft Fabric-Mod- und verwandten Laufzeitwächterprotokollen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor uma ordem de operações de alto nível para a geração de mundos Latitude, prevenindo etapas de pipeline não autorizadas e vazamentos de biomas, garantindo ao mesmo tempo a conformidade com tabelas de autoridade anexas e evidências baseadas em código, utilizando protocolos de mod Fabric do Minecraft e guardas de tempo de execução relacionados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить высокий уровень порядка операций для генерации мира Latitude, предотвращая неавторизованные шаги конвейера и утечки биомов, обеспечивая при этом соблюдение прикрепленных таблиц полномочий и кодовых доказательств, используя протоколы мода Minecraft Fabric и связанных с этим runtime-гвардов.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من فرض ترتيب 高级 من عمليات لجلب العالم Latitude ، ومنع خطوات أنابيب غير مصرح بها وتسرب البيئة ، وضمان امتثالها لجداول السلطة المرفقة والأدلة القائمة على الكود ، مستخدمًا بروتوكولات تعديل Minecraft Fabric وحراس وقت التشغيل ذات الصلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds","Preventing unauthorized pipeline steps and reordering of stages","Debugging biome leaks by adhering to authoritative generation order rules"],"zh":["执行全球风格世界的确定性纬度基于生物群落带","防止未经授权的管道步骤和阶段的重新排序","通过遵守权威生成顺序规则调试生物群落泄漏"],"ja":["グローブスタイルの世界の決定論的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンドを実行する","未承認のパイプラインステップやステージの再配置を防止する","権威のある生成順序ルールに従ってバイオームの漏洩をデバッグする"],"ko":["글로브 스타일 세계의 결정적 위도 기반 생물군계 대역을 강제하는 것","未承認の 파이프라인 단계 및 단계의 재정렬을 방지하는 것","권위 있는 생성 순서 규칙을 따르는 것에 의한 생물군계 누수 디버깅"],"es":["Aplicar bandas de biomas deterministas basadas en latitud para mundos de estilo globo","Prevenir pasos de tubería no autorizados y reordenar etapas","Depurar fugas de biomas al adherirse a reglas de orden de generación autoritativas"],"fr":["Appliquer des bandes de biomes déterministes basées sur la latitude pour les mondes de style globe","Empêcher les étapes de pipeline non autorisées et réorganiser les étapes","Déboguer les fuites de biomes en adhérant à des règles d''ordre de génération autoritaires"],"de":["Durchsetzen deterministischer Breiten-basierter Biome-Bänder für Globus-Style-Welten","Verhindern nicht autorisierter Pipeline-Schritte und Umordnen von Stufen","Beheben von Biome-Lecks durch Befolgen autoritativer Generierungsreihenfolgen-Regeln"],"pt":["Aplicar bandas de biomas baseadas em latitude determinística para mundos do tipo globo","Prevenir etapas de pipeline não autorizadas e reordenação de estágios","Depurar vazamentos de biomas aderindo a regras de ordem de geração autoritativa"],"ru":["Применение детерминированных биомных полос на основе широты для глобусоподобных миров","Предотвращение неавторизованных шагов конвейера и перестановки стадий","Отладка утечек биомов, следуя правилам авторитетного порядка генерации"],"ar":["تطبيق حزم بيئية قائمة على خط العرض إقصاديًا لأنماط العالم الكروي","منع خطوات труб غير مصرح بها واعادة ترتيب المراحل","تصحيح أخطاء تسرب البيئة بالتقيد بقواعد الترتيب الإقصادي للمولد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Minecraft Fabric mod environment","Must adhere to attached authority tables and code-based evidence","Cannot invent new pipeline steps or reorder stages without evidence"],"zh":["需要Minecraft Fabric模块环境","必须遵守附加的权限表和基于代码的证据","不能在没有证据的情况下创建新的管道步骤或重新排序阶段"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabric mod環境が必要","付属の権限テーブルやコードベースの証拠に従わなければならない","証拠なしで新しいパイプラインステップを作成したり、段階を再配置することはできない"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드 환경이 필요합니다.","부착된 권한 테이블 및 코드 기반 증거를 준수해야 합니다.","증거 없이 새로운 파이프라인 단계를 만들거나 단계를 재정렬할 수 없습니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de modificación de Minecraft Fabric","Debe adherirse a las tablas de autoridad adjuntas y la evidencia basada en código","No puede inventar nuevos pasos de tubería o reordenar etapas sin evidencia"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de modification Minecraft Fabric","Doit se conformer aux tableaux d''autorité joints et aux preuves basées sur le code","Ne peut pas inventer de nouvelles étapes de pipeline ou réorganiser les étapes sans preuve"],"de":["Benötigt Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Umgebung","Muss den angehängten Autoritätstabellen und den codebasierten Beweisen entsprechen","Kann keine neuen Pipeline-Schritte erfinden oder Stufen ohne Beweis umordnen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de mod Fabric do Minecraft","Deve aderir a tabelas de autoridade anexas e evidências baseadas em código","Não pode inventar novas etapas de pipeline ou reordenar estágios sem evidências"],"ru":["Требует среды мода Minecraft Fabric","Должно соблюдать прикрепленные таблицы полномочий и кодовые доказательства","Не может изобретать новые шаги конвейера или переставлять стадии без доказательств"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تعديل Minecraft Fabric","يجب الامتثال لجداول السلطة المرفقة والأدلة القائمة على الكود","لا يمكن اختراع خطوات أنابيب جديدة أو إعادة ترتيب المراحل دون أدلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
