ideos","Integration mit der Remotion-Bibliothek"],"pt":["Criação de vídeos personalizados em React","Uso de legendas e subtítulos","Uso de FFmpeg para operações de vídeo","Visualização de áudio","Melhores práticas para uso de Remotion"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных видео в React","Использование субтитров и титров","Использование FFmpeg для видеоопераций","Визуализация аудио","Лучшие практики использования Remotion"],"ar":["إنشاء فيديوهات مخصصة في React","استخدام الترجمات والعناوين","استخدام FFmpeg لعمليات الفيديو","تجسيد الصوت","أفضل الممارسات لاستخدام Remotion"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion","React","视频处理","音频可视化","FFmpeg","字幕","最佳实践"],"ja":["Remotion","React","ビデオ処理","オーディオ可視化","FFmpeg","字幕","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Remotion","React","비디오 처리","오디오 시각화","FFmpeg","자막","최상의 관행"],"es":["Remotion","React","videos personalizados","FFmpeg","visualización de audio","subtítulos","títulos","desarrollo de video","biblioteca de React"],"fr":["Remotion","React","vidéos personnalisées","FFmpeg","visualisation de l''audio","sous-titres","titres","développement de vidéo","bibliothèque React"],"de":["Remotion","React","benutzerdefinierte Videos","FFmpeg","Audio-Visualisierung","Untertitel","Titel","Videodevelopment","React-Bibliothek"],"pt":["Remotion","React","vídeos personalizados","legendas","subtítulos","FFmpeg","visualização de áudio"],"ru":["Remotion","React","индивидуальные видео","субтитры","титры","FFmpeg","визуализация аудио"],"ar":["Remotion","React","فيديوهات مخصصة","الترجمات","العناوين","FFmpeg","تجسيد الصوت"]}},"owner":"sandeepannandi","repo":"Remotion","repoPath":"sandeepannandi/Remotion","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## Captions\n\nWhen dealing with captions or subtitles, load the [./rules/subtitles.md](./rules/subtitles.md) file for more information.\n\n## Using FFmpeg\n\nFor some video operations, such as trimming videos or detecting silence, FFmpeg should be used. Load the [./rules/ffmpeg.md](./rules/ffmpeg.md) file for more information.\n\n## Audio visualization\n\nWhen needing to visualize audio (","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## Captions\n\nWhen dealing with captions or subtitles, load the [./rules/subtitles.md](./rules/subtitles.md) file for more information.\n\n## Using FFmpeg\n\nFor some video operations, such as trimming videos or detecting silence, FFmpeg should be used. Load the [./rules/ffmpeg.md](./rules/ffmpeg.md) file for more information.\n\n## Audio visualization\n\nWhen needing to visualize audio (spectrum bars, waveforms, bass-reactive effects), load the [./rules/audio-visualization.md](./rules/audio-visualization.md) file for more information.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion (bar, pie, line, stock charts)\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/light-leaks.md](rules/light-leaks.md) - Light leak overlay effects using @remotion/light-leaks\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/transparent-videos.md](rules/transparent-videos.md) - Rendering out a video with transparency\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:01:09.956Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing expertise in Remotion library and React","zh":"非常适合需要Remotion库和React专业知识的视频生成代理","ja":"RemotionライブラリとReactの専門知識が必要なビデオ生成エージェントに最適","ko":"Remotion 라이브러리 및 React 전문 지식이 필요한 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Generación de Video que necesitan experiencia en la biblioteca Remotion y React","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de vidéos ayant besoin d''expertise dans la bibliothèque Remotion et React","de":"Perfekt für Video-Generierungsagenten, die Expertenwissen in der Remotion-Bibliothek und React benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que necessitam de especialização na biblioteca Remotion e React","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации видео, которым необходимы знания в библиотеке Remotion и React","ar":"مثالي لوسائط العميل التي تطلب خبرة في مكتبة Remotion و React"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality videos using Remotion, leveraging domain-specific knowledge for captions, audio visualization, and FFmpeg operations, and providing best practices for video editing and processing","zh":"赋予代理创建高质量视频的能力，利用Remotion、字幕、音频可视化和FFmpeg操作的领域特定知识，并提供视频编辑和处理的最佳实践","ja":"エージェントがRemotion、キャプション、オーディオ視覚化、FFmpeg操作のドメイン固有の知識を利用して、高品質のビデオを作成する能力を付与し、ビデオ編集と処理のベストプラクティスを提供する","ko":"에이전트가 Remotion, 캡션, 오디오 시각화 및 FFmpeg 연산의 도메인 특정 지식을 활용하여 고품질의 비디오를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 비디오 편집 및 처리를 위한 최고의 실제 방법을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear vídeos de alta calidad utilizando Remotion, aprovechando el conocimiento específico del dominio para subtítulos, visualización de audio y operaciones de FFmpeg, y proporcionando las mejores prácticas para la edición y procesamiento de vídeos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des vidéos de haute qualité à l''aide de Remotion, en exploitant les connaissances spécifiques au domaine pour les légendes, la visualisation audio et les opérations FFmpeg, et en fournissant les meilleures pratiques pour le montage et le traitement vidéo","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hochwertige Videos mit Remotion zu erstellen, indem sie domänen-spezifisches Wissen für Untertitel, Audio-Visualisierung und FFmpeg-Operationen nutzen und bewährte Verfahren für Video-Bearbeitung und -Verarbeitung bereitstellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar vídeos de alta qualidade usando Remotion, aproveitando conhecimentos específicos do domínio para legendas, visualização de áudio e operações FFmpeg, e fornecendo as melhores práticas para edição e processamento de vídeo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высококачественные видео с помощью Remotion, используя знания конкретной области для подписей, визуализации аудио и операций FFmpeg, а также предоставляя лучшие практики для редактирования и обработки видео","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مقاطع فيديو عالية الجودة باستخدام Remotion، واستخدام المعرفة المحددة لقطاع معين للتعليقات الصوتية وتحويل الصوت إلى صور وعمليات FFmpeg، وتقديم أفضل الممارسات لتحرير الفيديو والمعالجة"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating videos with customized captions and subtitles","Automating video trimming and silence detection using FFmpeg","Visualizing audio for enhanced video engagement"],"zh":["生成带有自定义字幕和子标题的视频","使用FFmpeg自动视频修剪和静默检测","可视化音频以增强视频参与度"],"ja":["カスタマイズされたキャプションと字幕を付けたビデオを生成する","FFmpegを使用してビデオのトリミングと静音検出を自動化する","オーディオを視覚化してビデオのエンゲージメントを高める"],"ko":["사용자 지정 캡션 및 자막이 있는 비디오 생성","FFmpeg를 사용하여 비디오 트리밍 및 음소거 감지를 자동화","비디오 참여도 향상을 위한 오디오 시각화"],"es":["Generar vídeos con subtítulos y subtitulación personalizados","Automatizar el recorte de vídeo y la detección de silencio utilizando FFmpeg","Visualizar audio para mejorar el compromiso con el vídeo"],"fr":["Générer des vidéos avec des légendes et des sous-titres personnalisés","Automatiser le rognage de vidéo et la détection de silence à l''aide de FFmpeg","Visualiser l''audio pour améliorer l''engagement avec la vidéo"],"de":["Videos mit benutzerdefinierten Untertiteln und Untertitelungen generieren","Videoschneiden und Stille-Erkennung mithilfe von FFmpeg automatisieren","Audio visualisieren, um die Video-Interaktion zu verbessern"],"pt":["Gerar vídeos com legendas e subtítulos personalizados","Automatizar o corte de vídeo e detecção de silêncio usando FFmpeg","Visualizar áudio para engajamento de vídeo melhorado"],"ru":["Генерировать видео с настраиваемыми подписями и субтитрами","Автоматизировать обрезку видео и обнаружение тишины с помощью FFmpeg","Визуализировать аудио для улучшения вовлеченности видео"],"ar":["إنشاء مقاطع فيديو ذات تعليقات وترجمة مخصصة","توفير تقطيع الفيديو وتحديد الصمت تلقائيًا باستخدام FFmpeg","توفير الصوت لتعزيز المشاركة الفيديوية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion library and React setup","FFmpeg installation needed for advanced video operations"],"zh":["需要Remotion库和React设置","需要FFmpeg安装用于高级视频操作"],"ja":["RemotionライブラリとReactの設定が必要","高度なビデオ操作にはFFmpegのインストールが必要"],"ko":["Remotion 라이브러리 및 React 설정이 필요","고급 비디오 연산을 위한 FFmpeg 설치가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de la biblioteca Remotion y React","Se requiere la instalación de FFmpeg para operaciones de vídeo avanzadas"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de la bibliothèque Remotion et React","L''installation de FFmpeg est nécessaire pour les opérations de vidéo avancées"],"de":["Benötigt Remotion-Bibliothek- und React-Setup","FFmpeg-Installation erforderlich für erweiterte Video-Operationen"],"pt":["Requer configuração da biblioteca Remotion e React","Instalação do FFmpeg necessária para operações de vídeo avançadas"],"ru":["Требуется настройка библиотеки Remotion и React","Необходима установка FFmpeg для продвинутых операций с видео"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مكتبة Remotion و React","تثبيت FFmpeg ضروري لعمليات الفيديو المتقدمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('joolbits/latitude/latitude-compat-backport-playbook', 'community', 'joolbits', 'latitude', 'joolbits/latitude', 'latitude-compat-backport-playbook', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T10:01:12.581Z', NULL, '{"id":"joolbits/latitude/latitude-compat-backport-playbook","name":"latitude-compat-backport-playbook","description":{"es":"El Latitude Compat Backport Playbook es una herramienta para portar soluciones entre versiones de Minecraft de manera segura y determinística","fr":"Le Playbook de compatibilité de latitude est un outil pour porter des solutions entre les versions de Minecraft de manière sécurisée et déterministe","de":"Das Latitude-Kompatibilitäts-Backport-Playbook ist ein Tool zum Portieren von Lösungen zwischen Minecraft-Versionen auf sichere und deterministische Weise","pt":"O Latitude Compat Backport Playbook é um mod para Minecraft Fabric que visa tornar as portas de correções entre versões do Minecraft mais seguras e previsíveis.","ru":"Широта Compat Backport Playbook - это мод для Minecraft Fabric, целью которого является сделать портирование исправлений между версиями Minecraft более безопасным и предсказуемым.","ar":"كتاب أسلوب متوافق للخطوط العرض هو تعديل لمinecraft Fabric يهدف إلى جعل опера نقل الإصلاحات بين إصدارات مينكرافت أكثر أمانًا ويمكن التنبؤ بها.","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Latitude Compat Backport Playbook para Minecraft","fr":"Playbook de compatibilité de latitude pour Minecraft","de":"Latitude-Kompatibilitäts-Backport-Playbook für Minecraft","pt":"Latitude Compat Backport Playbook: Mod para Minecraft Fabric","ru":"Широта Compat Backport Playbook: мод для Minecraft Fabric","ar":"كتاب أسلوب متوافق للخطوط العرض: تعديلสำหรلماين كرافت فابريك","en":"latitude-compat-backport-playbook"},"description":{"es":"El Latitude Compat Backport Playbook es una herramienta para portar soluciones entre versiones de Minecraft de manera segura y determinística","fr":"Le Playbook de compatibilité de latitude est un outil pour porter des solutions entre les versions de Minecraft de manière sécurisée et déterministe","de":"Das Latitude-Kompatibilitäts-Backport-Playbook ist ein Tool zum Portieren von Lösungen zwischen Minecraft-Versionen auf sichere und deterministische Weise","pt":"O Latitude Compat Backport Playbook é um mod para Minecraft Fabric que visa tornar as portas de correções entre versões do Minecraft mais seguras e previsíveis.","ru":"Широта Compat Backport Playbook - это мод для Minecraft Fabric, целью которого является сделать портирование исправлений между версиями Minecraft более безоп...","ar":"كتاب أسلوب متوافق للخطوط العرض هو تعديل لمinecraft Fabric يهدف إلى جعل опера نقل الإصلاحات بين إصدارات مينكرافت أكثر أمانًا ويمكن التنبؤ بها.","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"definition":{"en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"features":{"es":["Portar soluciones entre versiones de Minecraft de manera determinística","Compatibilidad con versiones 1.21.x","Modo estricto para garantizar la seguridad","Documentación de excepciones en los commits y PR","Soporte para la creación de biomas en estilo de globo"],"fr":["Porter des solutions entre les versions de Minecraft de manière déterministe","Compatibilité avec les versions 1.21.x","Mode strict pour garantir la sécurité","Documentation des exceptions dans les commits et PR","Support pour la création de biomes dans le style de globe"],"de":["Lösungen zwischen Minecraft-Versionen deterministisch portieren","Kompatibilität mit Versionen 1.21.x","Strenger Modus für die Sicherheit","Dokumentation von Ausnahmen in Commits und PR","Unterstützung für die Erstellung von Biotopen im Globus-Stil"],"pt":["Fornece bandas de biomas determinísticas baseadas em latitude","Compatível com versões do Minecraft 1.21.x","Modo padrão: STRICT, comportamento deve ser idêntico em todos os alvos","Exceções permitidas apenas quando as assinaturas/vanilla comportamento realmente divergem entre as versões do MC","Documentação de exceções necessária nos commits/PRs"],"ru":["Обеспечивает детерминированные биомные полосы на основе широты","Совместим с версиями Minecraft 1.21.x","Стандартный режим: STRICT, поведение должно быть идентичным во всех целях","Исключения разрешены только тогда, когда подписи/поведение vanilla действительно расходятся между версиями MC","Необходима документация исключений в коммитах/PR"],"ar":["يتيح حزمًا بيئية محددة بالخطوط العرض","متوافق مع إصدارات مينكرافت 1.21.x","الوضع الافتراضي: STRICT، السلوك يجب أن يكون متطابقًا في جميع الأهداف","الاستثناءات مسموح بها فقط عندما تختلف التوقيعات/السلوك الفانيللي حقًا بين إصدارات مينكرافت","التوثيق اللازم للاستثناءات في التعديلات/PR"]},"keywords":{"es":["Minecraft mod","portar soluciones","compatibilidad","seguridad","determinística","biomas","globo","1.21.x"],"fr":["mod Minecraft","porter des solutions","compatibilité","sécurité","déterministe","biomes","globe","1.21.x"],"de":["Minecraft-Mod","Lösungen portieren","Kompatibilität","Sicherheit","deterministisch","Biotop","Globus","1.21.x"],"pt":["Minecraft Fabric","mod para Minecraft","biomas determinísticas","bandas de biomas","latitude","compatibilidade","portas de correções","versões do Minecraft"],"ru":["Minecraft Fabric","мод для Minecraft","детерминированные биомы","биомные полосы","широта","совместимость","портирование исправлений","версии Minecraft"],"ar":["مينكرافت فابريك","تعديل لمينكرافت","حزم بيئية محددة","حزم بيئية","خطوط العرض","التوافق","نقل الإصلاحات","إصدارات مينكرافت"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"latitude","repoPath":"joolbits/latitude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"latitude-compat-backport-playbook","description":"Step-by-step playbook for backporting Latitude changes across MC 1.21.x targets (e.g., 1.21.11 -> 1.21.1). Enforces one-variable-at-a-time, cherry-pick discipline, minimal tests, version/tag correctness, and prevents branch/build confusion.","bodyPreview":"# Latitude — Compat Backport Playbook (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill is used whenever porting fixes between Minecraft versions (1.21.x), especially:\n- main target: **1.21.11** (`main`)\n- compat target: **1.21.1** (`compat/1.21.1`)\n\nGoal: make backports boring and safe.\n\n**Default mode: STRICT** — behavior must match across targets.\n- Allowed exceptions only when vanilla signatures/behavior truly diverge between MC versions.\n- Any exception must be documented in the commit/PR as: `Pragmatic exceptio","body":"# Latitude — Compat Backport Playbook (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill is used whenever porting fixes between Minecraft versions (1.21.x), especially:\n- main target: **1.21.11** (`main`)\n- compat target: **1.21.1** (`compat/1.21.1`)\n\nGoal: make backports boring and safe.\n\n**Default mode: STRICT** — behavior must match across targets.\n- Allowed exceptions only when vanilla signatures/behavior truly diverge between MC versions.\n- Any exception must be documented in the commit/PR as: `Pragmatic exception: <why>` including the exact method signature difference.\n\n---\n\n## Golden rules\n1) **One variable at a time**: one fix, one commit, one test.\n2) Prefer **cherry-pick** of known-good commits over manual reimplementation.\n3) Do not mix backport fixes with unrelated refactors.\n4) Always confirm:\n   - branch\n   - mod_version\n   - jar name\n   - tags\n5) If a change touches worldgen, require at least one runtime proof.\n\n---\n\n## Prep checklist (must pass)\nOn source branch (e.g., `main`):\n- fix is committed and tested\n- commit(s) are small and focused\n- optional debug is gated and OFF by default\n\nOn target branch (e.g., `compat/1.21.1`):\n- baseline builds cleanly before backport\n- working tree is clean (or stash)\n\n---\n\n## Backport procedure (mandatory order)\n\n### Step 1 — Baseline build on target branch\n```powershell\ngit checkout compat/1.21.1\ngit pull\n$env:GRADLE_USER_HOME = \"$PWD\\.gradle-user-home\"\n.\\gradlew clean build --no-daemon\n```\n\nIf baseline fails, STOP and fix baseline first.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2 — Identify minimal commits to port\n\nPreferred: port only commits that touch:\n\n* the specific mixin/feature/fix\n* required config entries (mixins.json)\n* required debug gating\n\nAvoid porting:\n\n* docs\n* extracted sources\n* tooling folders\n* large unrelated refactors\n\nGather commit list using:\n\n* `git log --oneline <sourceBranch> -- <filePath>` \n* `git show <hash> --name-only` \n\n---\n\n### Step 3 — Cherry-pick onto target\n\nFrom target branch:\n\n```powershell\ngit cherry-pick <hash1> <hash2> ...\n```\n\nIf conflicts:\n\n* resolve by matching target MC signatures (method params/owners)\n* do not change fix behavior while resolving compile errors\n* keep edits minimal and localized\n\n---\n\n### Step 4 — Build on target\n\n```powershell\n$env:GRADLE_USER_HOME = \"$PWD\\.gradle-user-home\"\n.\\gradlew clean build --no-daemon\n```\n\nIf build fails:\n\n* paste first ~60 lines of error\n* adjust only signatures/descriptors until it compiles\n\n---\n\n### Step 5 — Minimal runtime proof (no “new world fatigue”)\n\nRequire exactly one proof run:\n\n* start client\n* generate a small area near a known test coordinate (or equator zone)\n* confirm the fix triggers (via visual result or gated logs/counters)\n\nIf old chunks contain the old bug:\n\n* delete only the relevant region file (`r.<x>.<z>.mca`) to regen\n\n---\n\n### Step 6 — Version + tag correctness (do NOT skip)\n\nOn the target branch, ensure `gradle.properties`:\n\n* `mod_version=<release>+<mcVersion>` \n\nThen:\n\n* build jars again\n* confirm jar names match `mod_version` \n\nTag must point to the commit that produces that jar:\n\n```powershell\ngit tag -f v<mod_version>\ngit push origin -f v<mod_version>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common failure patterns (and required fixes)\n\n### A) “I can’t checkout branch: gradle.properties would be overwritten”\n\nFix:\n\n* `git stash push -m \"temp: gradle.properties bump\"` \n* checkout\n* build\n* later `git stash pop` on the original branch\n\n### B) “I built but jar name is wrong”\n\nCause:\n\n* target branch still has old `mod_version` \n  Fix:\n* update `gradle.properties` on THAT branch\n* commit\n* rebuild\n\n### C) “Incompatible mods found” during dev run\n\nCause:\n\n* leftover jars in `run/mods` from a different MC target\n  Fix:\n* clear `run/mods/*` and `run/.fabric/processedMods/*` \n\n### D) Mixins apply failures on older target\n\nFix:\n\n* remove non-essential mixin (especially precipitation hooks) if it fails apply\n* keep the core guard/fix mixins\n* re-run, then optionally reintroduce later\n\n---\n\n## Required assistant output format\n\nWhen asked to backport:\n\n1. Source branch + target branch\n2. Commit list to cherry-pick (with reasons)\n3. Exact commands (PowerShell)\n4. Expected success outputs\n5. Minimal runtime proof steps\n6. Version/tag actions\n7. Rollback strategy\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:01:12.581Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Code Maintenance Agents specializing in deterministic backporting between Minecraft Fabric mod versions.","zh":"对于专门从事确定性回移的Minecraft Fabric模组版本的代码维护代理来说是必不可少的。","ja":"Minecraft Fabric modバージョンの決定的なバックポートに特化したコードメンテナンスエージェントにとって不可欠です。","ko":"결정적 백포팅을 전문으로 하는 Minecraft Fabric 모드 버전의 코드 유지 보수 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los Agentes de Mantenimiento de Código especializados en backporting determinista entre versiones de mods de Minecraft Fabric.","fr":"Essentiel pour les Agents de Maintenance de Code spécialisés dans le backporting déterministe entre les versions de mods Minecraft Fabric.","de":"Wesentlich für Code-Wartungsagenten, die sich auf deterministisches Backporting zwischen Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Versionen spezialisieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Manutenção de Código especializados em retro-portagem determinística entre versões de mod Minecraft Fabric.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов по техническому обслуживанию кода, специализирующихся на детерминированном бэкпорте между версиями мода Minecraft Fabric.","ar":"ضروري لعميل صيانة الشفرة المتخصص في إعادة نقل تحديدية بين إصدارات تعديل ماين كرافت فابريك."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to perform strict, behavior-matching backports between Minecraft versions like 1.21.11 and 1.21.1. It provides authoritative playbook rules for handling vanilla signature divergences while maintaining deterministic biome band generation.","zh":"使代理能够在Minecraft版本（如1.21.11和1.21.1）之间执行严格的、行为匹配的回移。它为处理纯净签名分歧提供了权威的游戏规则，同时保持确定性的群系带生成。","ja":"エージェントがMinecraftのバージョン（例：1.21.11と1.21.1）間で厳密な動作一致のバックポートを実行できるようにします。バニラ署名の相違を扱うための権威あるプレイブックルールを提供しながら、決定的なバイオームバンドの生成を維持します。","ko":"에이전트가 Minecraft 버전(예: 1.21.11 및 1.21.1) 사이에서 엄격한 동작 일치 백포팅을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.纯净 서명의 차이를 처리하기 위한 권위 있는 플레이북 규칙을 제공하면서 결정적 생물 군계 대역 생성을 유지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar backports estrictos y que coinciden con el comportamiento entre versiones de Minecraft como 1.21.11 y 1.21.1. Proporciona reglas de libro de jugadas autorizadas para manejar divergencias de firma de vanilla mientras mantiene la generación de bandas de bioma determinista.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des backports stricts et de comportement correspondant entre les versions de Minecraft comme 1.21.11 et 1.21.1. Il fournit des règles de livre de jeu autorisées pour gérer les divergences de signature de vanilla tout en maintenant la génération de bandes de biome déterministe.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, strikte, verhaltensübereinstimmende Backports zwischen Minecraft-Versionen wie 1.21.11 und 1.21.1 durchzuführen. Es bietet autorisierte Spielregel-Regeln für die Behandlung von Vanilla-Signatur-Abweichungen bei der Aufrechterhaltung der deterministischen Biom-Bandengenerierung.","pt":"Permite que os agentes realizem retro-portagens estritas, compatíveis com o comportamento, entre versões do Minecraft, como 1.21.11 e 1.21.1. Fornece regras de livro de jogadas autoritárias para lidar com divergências de assinatura vanilla, mantendo a geração de faixas de bioma determinística.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять строгие, совместимые с поведением, бэкпорты между версиями Minecraft, такими как 1.21.11 и 1.21.1. Предоставляет авторитетные правила книги игр для обработки расхождений подписей vanilla при сохранении детерминированного поколения биомных полос.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من أداء عمليات نقل خلفية صارمة ومتوافقة السلوك بين إصدارات ماين كرافت مثل 1.21.11 و 1.21.1. يوفر قواعد كتاب الألعاب الصريحة لمعالجة الانحرافات التواقيع الفانيللا مع الحفاظ على توليد حزم البيئات التحديدية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating backport operations between specified Minecraft versions","Enforcing STRICT mode compatibility checks across codebases","Documenting pragmatic exceptions for version-specific behavior divergences"],"zh":["自动执行指定的Minecraft版本之间的回移操作","强制跨代码库执行STRICT模式兼容性检查","记录版本特定行为差异的实用异常"],"ja":["指定されたMinecraftバージョン間のバックポート操作の自動化","コードベース全体でSTRICTモードの互換性チェックを強制する","バージョン特定の動作の相違に対する実用的例外を文書化する"],"ko":["지정된 Minecraft 버전 간의 백포팅 작업 자동화","코드베이스 전체에서 STRICT 모드 호환성 확인 강제","버전에 따른 동작의 차이를 위한 실용적인 예외 문서화"],"es":["Automatizar operaciones de backport entre versiones de Minecraft especificadas","Forzar comprobaciones de compatibilidad en modo estricto en varios codebases","Documentar excepciones pragmáticas para divergencias de comportamiento específicas de la versión"],"fr":["Automatiser les opérations de backport entre les versions de Minecraft spécifiées","Forcer les vérifications de compatibilité en mode strict dans plusieurs codebases","Documenter les exceptions pragmatiques pour les divergences de comportement spécifiques à la version"],"de":["Automatisieren von Backport-Operationen zwischen angegebenen Minecraft-Versionen","Durchsetzen von Kompatibilitätsprüfungen im strikten Modus über mehrere Codebases hinweg","Dokumentieren pragmatischer Ausnahmen für versionspezifische Verhaltensabweichungen"],"pt":["Automatizar operações de retro-portagem entre versões específicas do Minecraft","Impor verificações de compatibilidade no modo STRITO em todo o código","Documentar exceções práticas para divergências de comportamento específicas da versão"],"ru":["Автоматизировать операции бэкпорта между указанными версиями Minecraft","Внедрять проверки совместимости в режиме STRITO во всех кодах","Документировать практические исключения для расхождений поведения, специфичных для версии"],"ar":["توفير عمليات نقل خلفية بين إصدارات ماين كرافت المحددة","فرض التحقق من التوافق في وضع الصارمة عبر مجموعات الشفرة","توثيق الاستثناءات العقلانية لانحرافات السلوك الخاصة بالإصدار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Minecraft Fabric mod ecosystems only","Requires specific target versions (1.21.x series)","Demands explicit documentation for any behavioral exceptions"],"zh":["仅限于Minecraft Fabric模组生态系统","需要特定的目标版本（1.21.x系列）","要求对任何行为异常进行明确的文档记录"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabric modエコシステムのみに限定される","特定のターゲットバージョン（1.21.xシリーズ）を必要とする","振る舞い例外の場合は明示的な文書化を要求する"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드 에코システム에만 ograničeno","특정 대상 버전(1.21.x 시리즈) 필요","동작 예외의 경우 명시적인 문서화 필요"],"es":["Limitado solo a los ecosistemas de mods de Minecraft Fabric","Requiere versiones de destino específicas (serie 1.21.x)","Exige documentación explícita para cualquier excepción de comportamiento"],"fr":["Limité uniquement aux écosystèmes de mods Minecraft Fabric","Nécessite des versions cibles spécifiques (série 1.21.x)","Exige une documentation explicite pour toute exception de comportement"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Ökosysteme nur","Benötigt spezifische Zielversionen (1.21.x-Serie)","Verlangt explizite Dokumentation für alle Verhaltensausnahmen"],"pt":["Limitado apenas a ecossistemas de mod Minecraft Fabric","Exige versões de destino específicas (série 1.21.x)","Exige documentação explícita para quaisquer exceções de comportamento"],"ru":["Ограничен только экосистемами мода Minecraft Fabric","Требует определенных целевых версий (серия 1.21.x)","Требует явной документации для любых исключений поведения"],"ar":["محدود بنظام بيئي تعديل ماين كرافت فابريك فقط","يتطلب إصدارات hedef محددة (سلسلة 1.21.x)","يتطلب توثيق صريح لأي استثناءات سلوك"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('stackconsult/RE-Engine/build-agentic-workflow', 'community', 'stackconsult', 'RE-Engine', 'stackconsult/RE-Engine', 'build-agentic-workflow', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T10:00:54.608Z', NULL, '{"id":"stackconsult/RE-Engine/build-agentic-workflow","name":"build-agentic-workflow","description":{"zh":"构建智能工作流，实现B2B自动化","ja":"エージェントワークフローの設計と実装","ko":"智能 워크플로우 구축 및 B2B 자동화","es":"Diseño e implementación de flujos de trabajo automatizados B2B producción-listos y seguros","fr":"Conception et mise en œuvre de flux de travail d''automatisation B2B prêts pour la production et sécurisés","de":"Entwurf und Implementierung von produktionsbereiten und sicheren B2B-Automatisierungs-Workflows","pt":"Desenvolva fluxos de trabalho de automação B2B completos e seguros, seguindo regras globais de automação e convenções de agente.","ru":"Разработайте полные и безопасные рабочие потоки автоматизации B2B, следуя глобальным правилам автоматизации и соглашениям об агентах.","ar":"قم بإنشاء تدفقات عمل آلي كامل ومأمون لمشاريع العمل التجاري إلى العمل، متبعة القواعد العالمية للآلية والاتفاقيات الخاصة بالوكلاء","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"构建智能工作流","ja":"エージェントワークフローの構築","ko":"智能 워크플로우 구축","es":"Flujos de trabajo automatizados B2B","fr":"Workflows d''automatisation B2B","de":"B2B-Automatisierungs-Workflows","pt":"Crie Fluxos de Trabalho de Automação B2B Completo","ru":"Создание полных рабочих потоков автоматизации B2B","ar":"إنشاء تدفقات عمل آلي كامل لمشاريع العمل التجاري إلى العمل","en":"build-agentic-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"构建智能工作流，实现B2B自动化","ja":"エージェントワークフローの設計と実装","ko":"智能 워크플로우 구축 및 B2B 자동화","es":"Diseño e implementación de flujos de trabajo automatizados B2B producción-listos y seguros","fr":"Conception et mise en œuvre de flux de travail d''automatisation B2B prêts pour la production et sécurisés","de":"Entwurf und Implementierung von produktionsbereiten und sicheren B2B-Automatisierungs-Workflows","pt":"Desenvolva fluxos de trabalho de automação B2B completos e seguros, seguindo regras globais de automação e convenções de agente.","ru":"Разработайте полные и безопасные рабочие потоки автоматизации B2B, следуя глобальным правилам автоматизации и соглашениям об агентах.","ar":"قم بإنشاء تدفقات عمل آلي كامل ومأمون لمشاريع العمل التجاري إلى العمل، متبعة القواعد العالمية للآلية والاتفاقيات الخاصة بالوكلاء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设计和实施生产就绪的B2B自动化工作流","遵循全球自动化规则和代理友好约定","实现可观察和安全的工作流","支持多系统集成","评估风险等级"],"ja":["エージェントに優しい規則に従ったB2B自動化ワークフローの設計と実装","グローバルな自動化規則の遵守","可観測性と安全性の実現","複数システムの統合","リスクレベルの評価"],"ko":["생산 준비가 된 B2B 자동화 워크플로우의 설계 및 구현","에이전트 친화적 규약 및 세계 자동화 규칙의 준수","관찰 가능하고 안전한 워크플로우의 구현","다중 시스템 통합 지원","리스크 수준 평가"],"es":["Diseño de flujos de trabajo personalizados","Implementación de automatización de tareas","Integración con sistemas y aplicaciones","Seguimiento y monitoreo de procesos","Cumplimiento de las reglas de automatización globales"],"fr":["Conception de flux de travail personnalisés","Mise en œuvre de l''automatisation des tâches","Intégration avec les systèmes et les applications","Suivi et surveillance des processus","Respect des règles d''automatisation globales"],"de":["Entwurf von benutzerdefinierten Workflows","Implementierung von Aufgabenautomatisierung","Integration mit Systemen und Anwendungen","Verfolgung und Überwachung von Prozessen","Einhaltung der globalen Automatisierungsregeln"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de fluxos de trabalho de automação B2B completos","Segurança e observabilidade garantidas","Conformidade com regras globais de automação","Integração com sistemas e serviços de destino","Análise de requisitos e avaliação de riscos"],"ru":["Разработка полных рабочих потоков автоматизации B2B","Гарантия безопасности и наблюдаемости","Соблюдение глобальных правил автоматизации","Интеграция с целевыми системами и сервисами","Анализ требований и оценка рисков"],"ar":["إنشاء تدفقات عمل آلي كامل لمشاريع العمل التجاري إلى العمل","ضمان الأمان والمراقبة","امتثال القواعد العالمية للآلية","التكامل مع الأنظمة والخدمات المستهدفة","تحليل المتطلبات وتقييم المخاطر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能工作流","B2B自动化","全球自动化规则","代理友好约定","工作流设计","生产就绪","可观察性","安全性"],"ja":["エージェントワークフロー","B2B自動化","グローバルな自動化規則","エージェントに優しい規則","ワークフローの設計","生産準備","可観測性","安全性"],"ko":["智能 워크플로우","B2B 자동화","에이전트 친화적 규약","세계 자동화 규칙","워크플로우 설계","생산 준비","관찰 가능성","안전성"],"es":["automatización B2B","flujos de trabajo automatizados","integración de sistemas","seguimiento de procesos","reglas de automatización","diseño de flujos de trabajo","implementación de automatización"],"fr":["automatisation B2B","flux de travail automatisés","intégration de systèmes","suivi de processus","règles d''automatisation","conception de flux de travail","mise en œuvre de l''automatisation"],"de":["B2B-Automatisierung","automatisierte Workflows","Systemintegration","Prozessverfolgung","Automatisierungsregeln","Workflow-Entwurf","Automatisierungsimplementierung"],"pt":["automação B2B","fluxo de trabalho de automação","regras globais de automação","convenções de agente","desenvolvimento de software","integração de sistemas"],"ru":["автоматизация B2B","рабочий поток автоматизации","глобальные правила автоматизации","соглашения об агентах","разработка программного обеспечения","интеграция систем"],"ar":["الآلية التجاري إلى العمل","تدفق العمل الآلي","القواعد العالمية للآلية","الاتفاقيات الخاصة بالوكلاء","تطوير البرمجيات","التكامل بين الأنظمة"]}},"owner":"stackconsult","repo":"RE-Engine","repoPath":"stackconsult/RE-Engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"build-agentic-workflow","description":"From a business requirement, design and implement a production-grade B2B automation or agentic workflow (triggers, jobs, queues, observability, safety) following the global automation rules, with code, docs, and tests wired end-to-end.","bodyPreview":"# Purpose\nDesign and implement complete B2B automation workflows that are production-ready, observable, and safe, following global automation rules (Rule 3) and agent-friendly conventions (Rule 2).\n\n# Prerequisites\n- ✅ Business requirement clearly defined\n- ✅ Global rules reviewed (Rule 1, Rule 2, Rule 3)\n- ✅ Repository documentation current: `@mcp-repo-scan`\n- ✅ Target systems and integrations identified\n- ✅ Risk level assessed (Low/Medium/High)\n\n# Design Phase\n\n## 1. Requirements Analysis\n**St","body":"# Purpose\nDesign and implement complete B2B automation workflows that are production-ready, observable, and safe, following global automation rules (Rule 3) and agent-friendly conventions (Rule 2).\n\n# Prerequisites\n- ✅ Business requirement clearly defined\n- ✅ Global rules reviewed (Rule 1, Rule 2, Rule 3)\n- ✅ Repository documentation current: `@mcp-repo-scan`\n- ✅ Target systems and integrations identified\n- ✅ Risk level assessed (Low/Medium/High)\n\n# Design Phase\n\n## 1. Requirements Analysis\n**Steps:**\n1. Extract business context and success criteria\n2. Identify triggers, systems touched, and data flows\n3. Assess risk level and safety requirements\n4. Determine human-in-the-loop needs\n\n## 2. Architecture Design\n**Following Rule 3 principles:**\n- **Separation of concerns:** Triggers → Business logic → Persistence\n- **Idempotency:** Design safe retry mechanisms\n- **Durability:** Queue-based processing for long-running work\n- **Isolation:** External integration modules\n- **Observability:** Structured logging and metrics\n- **Safety:** Human checkpoints and auditability\n\n## 3. Workflow Documentation\n**Create workflow spec:**\n1. Use template: `.windsurf/workflows/work-flow-md.md`\n2. Complete all sections (no blanks allowed)\n3. Get human approval for High/Medium risk workflows\n4. Save as: `docs/workflows/<workflow-name>.md`\n\n# Implementation Phase\n\n## 4. Core Implementation\n**For each component:**\n\n### Triggers\n- Webhook handlers with validation\n- Scheduled jobs with cron expressions  \n- Message bus listeners\n- UI action handlers\n\n### Business Logic\n- Pure or mostly-pure functions\n- Clear error handling\n- Input validation and sanitization\n- Decision logic and branching\n\n### Persistence\n- Repository/DAO patterns\n- Database schemas and migrations\n- Cache strategies\n- Transaction handling\n\n### External Integrations\n- Dedicated integration modules\n- Timeout and retry logic\n- Secret management (environment variables)\n- Error handling and fallbacks\n\n## 5. Queue and Job Infrastructure\n**Following Rule 3 queue semantics:**\n- Job structure with clear schemas\n- Bounded retries with backoff\n- Dead-letter queue (DLQ) setup\n- Concurrency controls and locks\n\n## 6. Observability Implementation\n**Logging:**\n- Structured JSON logging\n- Correlation IDs across flows\n- Key events (start/finish/errors)\n- Non-sensitive metadata only\n\n**Metrics:**\n- Throughput and success rates\n- Latency measurements\n- Error rates by type\n- Queue depths and processing times\n\n## 7. Safety and Guardrails\n**Human-in-the-loop:**\n- Approval checkpoints for high-risk actions\n- Clear action summaries and rationale\n- Audit trails for all changes\n\n**Guardrails:**\n- No destructive operations without confirmation\n- Security/permission changes flagged\n- Bulk operations require safeguards\n\n# Testing Phase\n\n## 8. Test Strategy\n**Unit Tests:**\n- Business logic edge cases\n- Error handling paths\n- Validation logic\n- Integration module mocks\n\n**Integration Tests:**\n- End-to-end workflow simulation\n- External service mocking\n- Queue processing tests\n- Database transaction tests\n\n**Idempotency Tests:**\n- Duplicate request handling\n- Retry behavior verification\n- Partial failure recovery\n\n## 9. Test Implementation\n**Test locations:**\n- Unit: `tests/unit/workflows/<name>/`\n- Integration: `tests/integration/workflows/<name>/`\n- E2E: `tests/e2e/workflows/<name>/`\n\n**Test commands:**\n```bash\nnpm test                    # Unit tests\nnpm run test:integration    # Integration tests  \nnpm run test:e2e           # E2E tests\n```\n\n# Documentation Phase\n\n## 10. Documentation Updates\n**Required docs:**\n- `docs/workflows/<name>.md` - Complete workflow spec\n- `docs/OPERATIONS.md` - Runbook entries\n- `docs/plans/<name>-implementation.md` - Implementation plan\n- API documentation for new endpoints\n- Update `docs/DOC-MAP.md` with new components\n\n## 11. Runbook Creation\n**Operations runbook:**\n- Health check procedures\n- Common failure modes and responses\n- Manual intervention steps\n- Monitoring and alerting setup\n\n# Quality Gates\n\n## 12. Pre-deployment Checklist\n**Code Quality:**\n- ✅ TypeScript strict mode compliance\n- ✅ All tests passing\n- ✅ Code coverage > 80%\n- ✅ No linting errors\n- ✅ Security scan passed\n\n**Architecture Compliance:**\n- ✅ Follows Rule 1 (Qwen coding standards)\n- ✅ Follows Rule 2 (Repo conventions)\n- ✅ Follows Rule 3 (Automation principles)\n- ✅ No secrets in code\n- ✅ Proper error handling\n\n**Operational Readiness:**\n- ✅ Observability hooks implemented\n- ✅ Alerts configured\n- ✅ Runbooks documented\n- ✅ Rollback plan defined\n\n## 13. Deployment\n**Staged rollout:**\n1. Deploy to dev environment\n2. Run smoke tests: `@run-tests-and-fix`\n3. Deploy to staging (if exists)\n4. Final integration tests\n5. Production deployment with monitoring\n\n**Post-deployment:**\n- Monitor key metrics for 24 hours\n- Verify all alerts working\n- Update documentation with real-world learnings\n- Retrospective and improvements\n\n# References to Other Skills\n- `@mcp-repo-scan` - Initial repository analysis\n- `@mcp-change-plan` - Create implementation plan\n- `@mcp-implement-plan` - Execute implementation steps\n- `@reengine-coding-agent` - Code writing and refactoring\n- `@run-tests-and-fix` - Test execution and bug fixing\n\n# Global Rules Compliance\nThis skill explicitly follows:\n- **Rule 1:** Uses Qwen3-Coder-Next for coding tasks with test-driven approach\n- **Rule 2:** Maintains agent-friendly repo structure and conventions  \n- **Rule 3:** Implements automation with idempotency, queues, observability, and safety\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:00:54.608Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing to design and implement production-ready B2B workflows following global automation rules and agent-friendly conventions.","zh":"非常适合需要设计和实施符合全球自动化规则和代理友好约定的生产就绪B2B工作流的自动化代理。","ja":"グローバルオートメーションルールとエージェントに優しい規約に従うプロダクションレディのB2Bワークフローを設計して実装する必要があるオートメーションエージェントに最適です。","ko":"전 세계 자동화 규칙과 에이전트 친화적 규약을 따르는 생산 준비가 된 B2B 워크플ロー를 설계 및 구현해야 하는 자동화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan diseñar e implementar flujos de trabajo de automatización B2B listos para producción que sigan reglas de automatización globales y convenciones amigables para los agentes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation ayant besoin de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des flux de travail d''automatisation B2B prêts pour la production suivant les règles d''automatisation mondiales et les conventions favorables aux agents.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die Produktionsbereite B2B-Automatisierungsworkflows entwerfen und implementieren müssen, die globalen Automatisierungsregeln und agentenfreundlichen Konventionen folgen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que precisam projetar e implementar fluxos de trabalho B2B prontos para produção, seguindo regras de automação globais e convenções amigáveis ao agente.","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, которым необходимо проектировать и реализовывать рабочие процессы B2B, готовые к производству, следующие глобальным правилам автоматизации и соглашениям, дружественным к агенту.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التلقائية التي تحتاج إلى تصميم وتنفيذ سلاسل عمل أعمال إلى أعمال جاهزة للإنتاج ، متبعة القواعد التلقائية العالمية والاتفاقيات الصديقة للوكيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complete automation workflows that are observable, safe, and adhere to Rule 3 and Rule 2 conventions, utilizing repository documentation like `@mcp-repo-scan` and assessing risk levels for Low, Medium, or High impact workflows.","zh":"赋予代理创建完整的自动化工作流的能力，这些工作流是可观察的、安全的，并遵循规则3和规则2的约定，利用存储库文档（如`@mcp-repo-scan`）并评估低、中或高影响工作流的风险等级。","ja":"エージェントが、ルール3とルール2の規約に従い、観測可能で安全な自動化ワークフローを完全に作成できるようにします。リポジトリのドキュメント（例：`@mcp-repo-scan`）を利用し、低、中、または高の影響を受けるワークフローのリスクレベルを評価します。","ko":"에이전트가 규칙 3 및 규칙 2 규약을 따르는 완전한 자동화 워크플로를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 관찰 가능하고 안전하며, 저장소 문서(예: `@mcp-repo-scan`)를 활용하여 낮은, 중간 또는 높은 영향의 워크플로에 대한 위험 수준을 평가합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear flujos de trabajo de automatización completos que sean observables, seguros y que cumplan con las convenciones de la Regla 3 y la Regla 2, utilizando la documentación del repositorio como `@mcp-repo-scan` y evaluando los niveles de riesgo para flujos de trabajo de impacto bajo, mediano o alto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des flux de travail d''automatisation complets qui sont observables, sûrs et qui respectent les conventions de la Règle 3 et de la Règle 2, en utilisant la documentation du référentiel comme `@mcp-repo-scan` et en évaluant les niveaux de risque pour les flux de travail à impact faible, moyen ou élevé.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, vollständige Automatisierungsworkflows zu erstellen, die beobachtbar, sicher und den Konventionen der Regel 3 und Regel 2 entsprechen, indem sie die Repository-Dokumentation wie `@mcp-repo-scan` nutzen und die Risikostufen für Workflows mit geringem, mittlerem oder hohem Auswirkungsbereich bewerten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar fluxos de trabalho de automação completos que são observáveis, seguros e aderem às convenções da Regra 3 e Regra 2, utilizando documentação de repositório como `@mcp-repo-scan` e avaliando níveis de risco para fluxos de trabalho de impacto baixo, médio ou alto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать полные рабочие процессы автоматизации, которые являются наблюдаемыми, безопасными и соблюдают конвенции Правила 3 и Правила 2, используя документацию репозитория, такую как `@mcp-repo-scan`, и оценивая уровни риска для рабочих процессов автоматизации с низким, средним или высоким воздействием.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء سلاسل عمل تلقائية كاملة يمكن ملاحظتها وتأمينها والامتثال لاتفاقيات القاعدة 3 والقاعدة 2 ، باستخدام توثيق المستودع مثل `@mcp-repo-scan` وتقييم مستويات المخاطر لسلاسل العمل التلقائية ذات التأثير المنخفض أو المتوسط أو المرتفع."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing observable and safe B2B automation workflows","Implementing global automation rules for production-ready workflows","Assessing risk levels for automation workflows to ensure compliance"],"zh":["设计可观察和安全的B2B自动化工作流","为生产就绪工作流实施全球自动化规则","评估自动化工作流的风险等级以确保合规"],"ja":["観測可能で安全なB2B自動化ワークフローを設計する","プロダクションレディのワークフローにグローバルオートメーションルールを実装する","自動化ワークフローのリスクレベルを評価してコンプライアンスを確保する"],"ko":["관찰 가능하고 안전한 B2B 자동화 워크플ロー 설계","생산 준비가 된 워크플로에 대한 전역 자동화 규칙 구현","자동화 워크플로우의 위험 수준 평가를 통한 규정 준수 보장"],"es":["Diseñar flujos de trabajo de automatización B2B observables y seguros","Implementar reglas de automatización globales para flujos de trabajo listos para producción","Evaluar los niveles de riesgo para los flujos de trabajo de automatización para garantizar el cumplimiento"],"fr":["Concevoir des flux de travail d''automatisation B2B observables et sûrs","Mettre en œuvre des règles d''automatisation mondiales pour les flux de travail prêts pour la production","Évaluer les niveaux de risque pour les flux de travail d''automatisation afin de garantir la conformité"],"de":["Entwerfen von beobachtbaren und sicheren B2B-Automatisierungsworkflows","Implementierung globaler Automatisierungsregeln für produktionsbereite Workflows","Bewerten der Risikostufen für Automatisierungsworkflows, um die Einhaltung sicherzustellen"],"pt":["Projeto de fluxos de trabalho de automação de negócios para negócios observáveis e seguros","Implementação de regras de automação globais para fluxos de trabalho prontos para produção","Avaliação de níveis de risco para fluxos de trabalho de automação para garantir a conformidade"],"ru":["Проектирование наблюдаемых и безопасных рабочих процессов автоматизации бизнеса для бизнеса","Реализация глобальных правил автоматизации для рабочих процессов, готовых к производству","Оценка уровней риска для рабочих процессов автоматизации для обеспечения соблюдения требований"],"ar":["تصميم سلاسل عمل تلقائية أعمال إلى أعمال يمكن ملاحظتها وتأمينها","تنفيذ قواعد تلقائية عالمية لسلاسل عمل جاهزة للإنتاج","تقييم مستويات المخاطر لسلاسل العمل التلقائية لضمان الامتثال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clearly defined business requirements","Needs review of global rules (Rule 1, Rule 2, Rule 3)","Depends on current repository documentation and target system identification"],"zh":["需要明确定义的业务需求","需要审查全球规则（规则1，规则2，规则3）","依赖于当前存储库文档和目标系统标识"],"ja":["明確に定義されたビジネス要件が必要","グローバルルール（ルール1、ルール2、ルール3）のレビューが必要","現在のリポジトリドキュメントとターゲットシステムの識別に依存"],"ko":["명확하게 정의된 비즈니스 요구 사항이 필요함","전역 규칙(규칙 1, 규칙 2, 규칙 3)의 검토가 필요함","현재의 저장소 문서 및 대상 시스템 식별에 의존"],"es":["Requiere requisitos comerciales claramente definidos","Necesita revisar las reglas globales (Regla 1, Regla 2, Regla 3)","Depende de la documentación actual del repositorio y la identificación del sistema objetivo"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences commerciales clairement définies","Nécessite un examen des règles mondiales (Règle 1, Règle 2, Règle 3)","Dépend de la documentation actuelle du référentiel et de l''identification du système cible"],"de":["Benötigt klar definierte Geschäftsanforderungen","Benötigt eine Überprüfung der globalen Regeln (Regel 1, Regel 2, Regel 3)","Hängt von der aktuellen Repository-Dokumentation und der Identifizierung des Zielsystems ab"],"pt":["Exige requisitos comerciais claramente definidos","Necessita de revisão das regras globais (Regra 1, Regra 2, Regra 3)","Depende da documentação atual do repositório e da identificação do sistema de destino"],"ru":["Требует четко определенных бизнес-требований","Требует рассмотрения глобальных правил (Правило 1, Правило 2, Правило 3)","Зависит от текущей документации репозитория и идентификации целевой системы"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات تجارية محددة بوضوح","يحتاج إلى مراجعة القواعد العالمية (القاعدة 1 والقاعدة 2 والقاعدة 3)","يعتمد على توثيق المستودع الحالي وتحديد النظام المستهدف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('joolbits/latitude/latitude-biome-selection-contract', 'community', 'joolbits', 'latitude', 'joolbits/latitude', 'latitude-biome-selection-contract', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T10:01:16.570Z', NULL, '{"id":"joolbits/latitude/latitude-biome-selection-contract","name":"latitude-biome-selection-contract","description":{"zh":"Latitude 生物群落选择合约是一个 Minecraft Fabric 模组，提供确定性 Latitude 基础生物群落带","ja":"Latitude バイオーム選択契約は、Minecraft Fabric モッドであり、決定的な Latitude 基本バイオーム帯を提供する","ko":"Latitude 생물군계 선택 계약은 마인크래프트 Fabric 모드이며, 결정적 Latitude 기본 생물군계帶를 제공","pt":"O mod Latitude Biome para Minecraft Fabric fornece biomas determinísticos baseados em latitude para mundos em estilo globo, resolvendo erros comuns.","ru":"Мод Latitude Biome для Minecraft Fabric предоставляет определенные биомы на основе широты для глобальных миров, решая распространенные ошибки.","ar":"مود خط العرض البيومي لمinecraft Fabric يوفر بيئات معينة 기반 على خط العرض للعالم على شكل كرة أرض، وحل الأخطاء الشائعة.","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Minecraft Latitude 生物群落选择合约","ja":"Minecraft Latitude バイオーム選択契約","ko":"마인크래프트 Latitude 생물군계 선택 계약","pt":"Latitude Biome: Seleção de Biomas Determinística","ru":"Широта Биома: Определенный Выбор Биома","ar":"خط العرض البيومي: الاختيار البيومي المعين","en":"latitude-biome-selection-contract"},"description":{"zh":"Latitude 生物群落选择合约是一个 Minecraft Fabric 模组，提供确定性 Latitude 基础生物群落带","ja":"Latitude バイオーム選択契約は、Minecraft Fabric モッドであり、決定的な Latitude 基本バイオーム帯を提供する","ko":"Latitude 생물군계 선택 계약은 마인크래프트 Fabric 모드이며, 결정적 Latitude 기본 생물군계帶를 제공","pt":"O mod Latitude Biome para Minecraft Fabric fornece biomas determinísticos baseados em latitude para mundos em estilo globo, resolvendo erros comuns.","ru":"Мод Latitude Biome для Minecraft Fabric предоставляет определенные биомы на основе широты для глобальных миров, решая распространенные ошибки.","ar":"مود خط العرض البيومي لمinecraft Fabric يوفر بيئات معينة 기반 على خط العرض للعالم على شكل كرة أرض، وحل الأخطاء الشائعة.","en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"definition":{"en":"Minecraft Fabric mod — deterministic latitude-based biome bands for globe-style worlds."},"features":{"zh":["解决生物群落选择错误","提供确定性 Latitude 基础生物群落带","支持 Minecraft Fabric 模组","提高游戏体验","简化生物群落选择过程"],"ja":["バイオーム選択エラーを解決","決定的な Latitude 基本バイオーム帯を提供","Minecraft Fabric モッドをサポート","ゲーム体験を向上","バイオーム選択プロセスを簡素化"],"ko":["생물군계 선택 오류 해결","결정적 Latitude 기본 생물군계帶 제공","마인크래프트 Fabric 모드 지원","게임 경험 향상","생물군계 선택 과정 단순화"],"pt":["Biomas determinísticos baseados em latitude","Correção de erros comuns no Minecraft","Compatibilidade com mundos em estilo globo","Implementação fácil com o mod Fabric","Melhoria da experiência de jogo com biomas mais realistas"],"ru":["Определенные биомы на основе широты","Исправление распространенных ошибок в Minecraft","Совместимость с глобальными мирами","Простая установка с модом Fabric","Улучшение игрового опыта с более реалистичными биомами"],"ar":["بيئات معينة dựa على خط العرض","تصحيح الأخطاء الشائعة في minecraft","التوافق مع العالم على شكل كرة أرض","التثبيت البسيط مع مود Fabric","تحسين تجربة اللعب مع بيئات أكثر واقعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft","Latitude","生物群落选择","Fabric 模组","游戏开发","模组开发","Minecraft 模组","生物群落"],"ja":["Minecraft","Latitude","バイオーム選択","Fabric モッド","ゲーム開発","モッド開発","Minecraft モッド","バイオーム"],"ko":["마인크래프트","Latitude","생물군계 선택","Fabric 모드","게임 개발","모드 개발","마인크래프트 모드","생물군계"],"pt":["Minecraft mod","Latitude Biome","biomas determinísticos","mundos em estilo globo","mod Fabric","erros comuns no Minecraft","biomas mais realistas"],"ru":["Мод Minecraft","Широта Биома","определенные биомы","глобальные миры","мод Fabric","распространенные ошибки в Minecraft","более реалистичные биомы"],"ar":["مود ماینكرافت","خط العرض البيومي","بيئات معينة","العالم على شكل كرة أرض","مود Fabric","أخطاء شائعة في ماینكرافت","بيئات أكثر واقعية"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"latitude","repoPath":"joolbits/latitude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"latitude-biome-selection-contract","description":"Defines the contract between vanilla “base” biomes and Latitude “out” biomes. Prevents incorrect assumptions about F3 biome, temperature/precip flags, and feature placement. Provides the required debugging interpretation for LAT_PICK logs.","bodyPreview":"# Latitude — Biome Selection Contract (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill prevents a common error:\n> “F3 says biome = jungle, therefore cold/snow features cannot trigger.”\n\nThat is false when:\n- vanilla selects a cold **base** biome, and\n- Latitude overrides to a warm **out** biome, but\n- some vanilla systems still consult base-biome temperature/precip rules during placement.\n\n---\n\n## Definitions\n- **Base biome**: the vanilla biome prior to Latitude override. Logged as `base=...` in `[LAT_PICK]`.\n- **Ou","body":"# Latitude — Biome Selection Contract (Authoritative)\n\nThis skill prevents a common error:\n> “F3 says biome = jungle, therefore cold/snow features cannot trigger.”\n\nThat is false when:\n- vanilla selects a cold **base** biome, and\n- Latitude overrides to a warm **out** biome, but\n- some vanilla systems still consult base-biome temperature/precip rules during placement.\n\n---\n\n## Definitions\n- **Base biome**: the vanilla biome prior to Latitude override. Logged as `base=...` in `[LAT_PICK]`.\n- **Out biome**: the biome Latitude returns to worldgen. Logged as `out=...` and typically what F3 shows.\n- **Wrapper illusion**: you can see `out` while generation decisions still reference `base`.\n\n---\n\n## Contract rules (must be respected)\n1) Latitude may override biome output by latitude band (Z-based), but vanilla may still:\n   - consult base biome temperature,\n   - consult precipitation flags,\n   - run features keyed off base-biome climate.\n2) Therefore:\n   - Seeing cold blocks/features in a warm F3 biome implies **base leakage** or **write-path placement**, not that F3 is “wrong”.\n3) Fixes must be either:\n   - ensure temperature/precip checks use out-biome (harder), OR\n   - block the offending feature/write path in disallowed bands (preferred for robustness).\n\n---\n\n## How to interpret `[LAT_PICK]` logs\nGiven a log line like:\n- `zone=EQUATOR base=minecraft:snowy_taiga out=minecraft:jungle` \n\nInterpretation:\n- Vanilla asked for a biome and would have used `snowy_taiga`.\n- Latitude returned `jungle`.\n- Any system that still consults base-biome climate may try to place snow/ice even though out-biome is warm.\n\nThis is expected in the presence of base leakage and does not mean Latitude selection failed.\n\n### Representative `[LAT_PICK]` template\n\n```\n[LAT_PICK]\nx=<x> z=<z> absZ=<absZ> radius=<radius> t=<t>\nzone=<EQUATOR|TROPICS|ARID|TEMPERATE|SUBPOLAR|POLAR>\nbase=<minecraft:...>\nout=<minecraft:...>\nbeachOverride=<true|false>\nrareOverride=<true|false>\nmangroveDecision=<...> cont=<...> ero=<...> weird=<...>\n```\n\nHow to read it:\n- If `out` is warm but `base` is cold, vanilla temperature-driven features may still attempt cold placements unless guarded (e.g., FreezeTopLayer).\n- That’s not a biome-table bug; it’s a base-leakage / write-path issue.\n\n---\n\n## Debugging obligations\nWhen a “contradiction” occurs (warm biome but cold artifacts):\n1) Capture coords + F3 out-biome.\n2) Find nearby `[LAT_PICK]` entries:\n   - confirm `zone` and compare `base` vs `out`.\n3) Identify write path:\n   - feature hook logs (e.g., `FreezeTopLayerFeature`)\n   - ChunkRegion/ProtoChunk traps\n4) Apply minimal fix (feature cancel / write-path rewrite).\n\nDo not propose band-table changes based only on F3.\n\n---\n\n## Canonical example: warm-band snow\nObserved:\n- F3: `minecraft:jungle` \n- Snow blocks or powder snow appear at cave mouths.\n\nCommon cause:\n- `[LAT_PICK] base=snowy_plains out=jungle` \n- Vanilla `FreezeTopLayerFeature` consults base biome climate → attempts snow.\n- LatitudeSnowGuard blocks/cancels in warm bands.\n\n---\n\n## Forbidden assumptions\n- “Out biome implies all placements consult out biome.”\n- “If snow appears, Latitude chose the wrong biome.”\n- “Fix by moving snowy biomes out of authority table.”\n- “Fix by rewriting MaterialRules first.”\n\n---\n\n## Required assistant output when diagnosing biome contradictions\nThe assistant must provide:\n- base vs out interpretation\n- suspected offender (feature or write path)\n- the minimum guard/cancel plan\n- a proof plan (log/counter) gated behind a debug flag\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:01:16.570Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Minecraft Modding Agents requiring deterministic biome generation for globe-style worlds.","zh":"适用于需要确定性生物群落生成的Minecraft模组代理，特别适用于球形世界。","ja":"Minecraft Moddingエージェントが決定論的なバイオーム生成を必要とするグローブスタイルの世界に最適です。","ko":"결정적 생물군계 생성이 필요한 Minecraft 모드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 구형 세계에 특히 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de modificación de Minecraft que requieren una generación de biomas determinista para mundos de estilo global.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de modification de Minecraft nécessitant une génération de biomes déterministe pour les mondes de style globe.","de":"Ideal für Minecraft-Modding-Agents, die eine deterministische Biome-Generierung für globale Welten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de modding de Minecraft que exigem geração de biomas determinística para mundos no estilo globo.","ru":"Идеально для агентов моддинга Minecraft, требующих детерминированного генерации биомов для миров в стиле глобуса.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تعديل ماين كرافت الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد بيئات محددة لالعالم على شكل كرة أرض."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to override vanilla biome selections with latitude-based biome bands, ensuring consistent temperature and precipitation rules, and preventing errors like cold/snow features triggering in warm biomes, by utilizing Minecraft Fabric mod and logging base biome information as ''base=...'' in ''[LAT_PICK]''.","zh":"赋予代理重写vanilla生物群落选择的能力，使用基于纬度的生物群落带，确保一致的温度和降水规则，并防止冷雪特征在温暖的生物群落中触发等错误，通过利用Minecraft Fabric模组并记录基本生物群落信息为''base=...''在''[LAT_PICK]''中。","ja":"エージェントがバニラバイオームの選択を上書きし、緯度ベースのバイオームバンドを使用して一貫した温度と降水ルールを保証し、冷雪の特徴が暖かいバイオームでトリガーされるなどのエラーを防ぐことができるようにします。Minecraft Fabric modを使用し、''[LAT_PICK]''の中で基本的なバイオーム情報を''base=...''としてログします。","ko":"에이전트가 바닐라 생물군계 선택을 덮어씀으로써, 위도 기반 생물군계 대역을 사용하여 일관된 온도 및 강수 규칙을 보장하며, 차가운 눈 특성이 따뜻한 생물군계에서 트리거되는 등의 오류를 방지할 수 있습니다. Minecraft Fabric 모드를 사용하고 ''[LAT_PICK]''에서 기본 생물군계 정보를 ''base=...''으로 로깅합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes anular las selecciones de biomas de vainilla con bandas de biomas basadas en latitud, asegurando reglas de temperatura y precipitación consistentes y evitando errores como la activación de características de frío/nieve en biomas cálidos, mediante la utilización del mod Minecraft Fabric y la registrazione de la información del bioma base como ''base=...'' en ''[LAT_PICK]''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de remplacer les sélections de biomes de vanille par des bandes de biomes basées sur la latitude, assurant des règles de température et de précipitation cohérentes et évitant des erreurs comme la déclenchement de fonctionnalités froides/neigeuses dans des biomes chauds, en utilisant le mod Minecraft Fabric et en enregistrant les informations de base du biome comme ''base=...'' dans ''[LAT_PICK]''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Vanille-Biome-Auswahlen mit breitenbasierten Biome-Bändern zu überschreiben, um konsistente Temperatur- und Niederschlagsregeln sicherzustellen und Fehler wie das Auslösen von Kälte-/Schneefunktionen in warmen Biomen zu vermeiden, indem der Minecraft Fabric-Mod verwendet und die Basisbiominformationen als ''base=...'' in ''[LAT_PICK]'' protokolliert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a substituir as seleções de biomas vanilla com bandas de biomas baseadas em latitude, garantindo regras de temperatura e precipitação consistentes e prevenindo erros como recursos frios/neve acionados em biomas quentes, utilizando o mod Minecraft Fabric e registrando informações de bioma base como ''base=...'' em ''[LAT_PICK]''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью переопределить выбор биомов vanilla с помощью полос биомов на основе широты, обеспечивая последовательные правила температуры и осадков, и предотвращая ошибки, такие как срабатывание холодных/снежных функций в теплых биомах, используя мод Minecraft Fabric и регистрируя базовую информацию о биоме как ''base=...'' в ''[LAT_PICK]''.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تجاوز اختيار البيئات الفانيليا باستخدام حزم بيئات مبنية على خط العرض، مما يضمن قواعد متسقة لدرجة الحرارة والأمطار، ومنع الأخطاء مثل تشغيل ميزات باردة / ثلجية في بيئات دافئة، من خلال استخدام تعديل ماين كرافت فابر وتسجيل معلومات البيئة الأساسية على أنها ''base=...'' في ''[LAT_PICK]''."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging biome-related errors in Minecraft globe-style worlds","Generating deterministic latitude-based biome bands for custom worlds","Overriding vanilla biome selections to create unique Minecraft environments"],"zh":["调试Minecraft球形世界中的生物群落相关错误","为自定义世界生成确定性基于纬度的生物群落带","覆盖vanilla生物群落选择以创建独特的Minecraft环境"],"ja":["Minecraftグローブスタイル世界でのバイオーム関連エラーのデバッグ","カスタム世界のための決定論的な緯度ベースのバイオームバンドの生成","バニラバイオーム選択のオーバーライドによる独自のMinecraft環境の作成"],"ko":["Minecraft 구형 세계中的 생물군계 관련 오류 디버깅","사용자 정의 세계를 위한 결정적 위도 기반 생물군계 대역 생성","바닐라 생물군계 선택을 덮어씀으로써 고유한 Minecraft 환경 생성"],"es":["Depuración de errores relacionados con biomas en mundos de estilo global de Minecraft","Generación de bandas de biomas deterministas basadas en latitud para mundos personalizados","Anulación de selecciones de biomas de vainilla para crear entornos de Minecraft únicos"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs liées aux biomes dans les mondes de style globe de Minecraft","Génération de bandes de biomes déterministes basées sur la latitude pour des mondes personnalisés","Remplacement des sélections de biomes de vanille pour créer des environnements Minecraft uniques"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Biome-fehlern in Minecraft-Welten im Globus-Stil","Generierung deterministischer Breiten-basierter Biome-Bänder für benutzerdefinierte Welten","Überschreiben der Vanille-Biome-Auswahlen, um einzigartige Minecraft-Umgebungen zu erstellen"],"pt":["Depuração de erros relacionados a biomas em mundos de Minecraft no estilo globo","Geração de bandas de biomas determinísticas baseadas em latitude para mundos personalizados","Substituição de seleções de biomas vanilla para criar ambientes de Minecraft únicos"],"ru":["Отладка ошибок, связанных с биомами, в мирах Minecraft в стиле глобуса","Генерация детерминированных полос биомов на основе широты для пользовательских миров","Переопределение выбора биомов vanilla для создания уникальных сред Minecraft"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء متعلقة بالبيئات في عوالم ماين كرافت على شكل كرة أرض","توليد حزم بيئات محددة على أساس خط العرض للعالم المخصص","تجاوز اختيار البيئات الفانيليا لإنشاء بيئات فريدة لماين كرافت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Minecraft Fabric mod installation","Limited to globe-style worlds","Dependent on vanilla biome temperature and precipitation rules"],"zh":["需要Minecraft Fabric模组安装","仅限于球形世界","依赖于vanilla生物群落的温度和降水规则"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabric modのインストールが必要","グローブスタイルの世界のみ","バニラバイオームの温度と降水ルールに依存"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드 설치가 필요","구형 세계만 해당","바닐라 생물군계의 온도 및 강수 규칙에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del mod Minecraft Fabric","Limitado a mundos de estilo global","Dependiente de las reglas de temperatura y precipitación de los biomas de vainilla"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du mod Minecraft Fabric","Limité aux mondes de style globe","Dépendant des règles de température et de précipitation des biomes de vanille"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des Minecraft Fabric-Mods","Begrenzt auf globale Welten","Abhängig von den Temperatur- und Niederschlagsregeln der Vanille-Biome"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do mod Minecraft Fabric","Limitado a mundos no estilo globo","Dependente das regras de temperatura e precipitação de biomas vanilla"],"ru":["Требует установки мода Minecraft Fabric","Ограничен мирами в стиле глобуса","Зависит от правил температуры и осадков биомов vanilla"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت تعديل ماين كرافت فابر","محدود بالعالم على شكل كرة أرض","يعتمد على قواعد درجة الحرارة والأمطار للبيئات الفانيليا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Ejyke90/naija-conflict-tracker/openspec-archive-change', 'community', 'Ejyke90', 'naija-conflict-tracker', 'Ejyke90/naija-conflict-tracker', 'openspec-archive-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z', '2026-02-18T10:01:26.958Z', NULL, '{"id":"Ejyke90/naija-conflict-tracker/openspec-archive-change","name":"openspec-archive-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change技能用于存档实验性工作流中的完成更改，通过运行openspec list --json命令并让用户选择要存档的更改","ja":"openspec-archive-changeスキルは、実験的なワークフローの完了した変更をアーカイブ化するために使用され、openspec list --jsonコマンドを実行し、ユーザーがアーカイブ化する変更を選択する","ko":"openspec-archive-change 스킬은 실험적인 워크플로의 완료된 변경을 아카이브화하기 위해 사용되며 openspec list --json 명령을 실행하고 사용자가 아카이브화할 변경을 선택합니다","es":"El skill openspec-archive-change archiva los cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental","fr":"La compétence openspec-archive-change archive les modifications terminées dans le workflow expérimental","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-archive-change archiviert abgeschlossene Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow","pt":"A habilidade openspec-archive-change arquiva mudanças concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental.","ru":"Навык openspec-archive-change архивирует завершенные изменения в экспериментальном рабочем процессе.","ar":"مهارة openspec-archive-change تؤرشف التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"开源存档更改 - openspec-archive-change","ja":"オープンソースアーカイブ変更 - openspec-archive-change","ko":"오픈소스 아카이브 변경 - openspec-archive-change","es":"Archivo de cambio en openspec","fr":"Archive de modification openspec","de":"Änderungsarchiv in openspec","pt":"Arquivar Mudanças com openspec-archive-change","ru":"Архивирование изменений с openspec-archive-change","ar":"أرشفة التغييرات مع openspec-archive-change","en":"openspec-archive-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-archive-change技能用于存档实验性工作流中的完成更改，通过运行openspec list --json命令并让用户选择要存档的更改","ja":"openspec-archive-changeスキルは、実験的なワークフローの完了した変更をアーカイブ化するために使用され、openspec list --jsonコマンドを実行し、ユーザーがアーカイブ化する変更を選択する","ko":"openspec-archive-change 스킬은 실험적인 워크플로의 완료된 변경을 아카이브화하기 위해 사용되며 openspec list --json 명령을 실행하고 사용자가 아카이브화할 변경을 선택합니다","es":"El skill openspec-archive-change archiva los cambios completados en el flujo de trabajo experimental","fr":"La compétence openspec-archive-change archive les modifications terminées dans le workflow expérimental","de":"Die Fähigkeit openspec-archive-change archiviert abgeschlossene Änderungen im experimentellen Workflow","pt":"A habilidade openspec-archive-change arquiva mudanças concluídas no fluxo de trabalho experimental.","ru":"Навык openspec-archive-change архивирует завершенные изменения в экспериментальном рабочем процессе.","ar":"مهارة openspec-archive-change تؤرشف التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["存档完成的实验性工作流更改","运行openspec list --json命令获取可用更改","让用户选择要存档的更改","仅显示活动更改","使用AskUserQuestion工具"],"ja":["実験的なワークフローの完了した変更をアーカイブ化","openspec list --jsonコマンドを実行して利用可能な変更を取得","ユーザーがアーカイブ化する変更を選択","アクティブな変更のみを表示","AskUserQuestionツールを使用"],"ko":["실험적인 워크플로의 완료된 변경을 아카이브화","openspec list --json 명령을 실행하여 사용 가능한 변경을 가져옴","사용자가 아카이브화할 변경을 선택","활동 변경만 표시","AskUserQuestion 도구 사용"],"es":["Archiva cambios completados","Permite seleccionar cambios","Muestra solo cambios activos","Utiliza la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Ejecuta openspec list --json"],"fr":["Archive les modifications terminées","Permet de sélectionner des modifications","Affiche uniquement les modifications actives","Utilise l''outil AskUserQuestion","Exécute openspec list --json"],"de":["Archiviert abgeschlossene Änderungen","Ermöglicht die Auswahl von Änderungen","Zeigt nur aktive Änderungen an","Verwendet das Tool AskUserQuestion","Führt openspec list --json aus"],"pt":["Arquivar mudanças concluídas","Seleção de mudanças ativas","Uso da ferramenta AskUserQuestion","Execução de comandos openspec","Listagem de mudanças disponíveis"],"ru":["Архивирование завершенных изменений","Выбор активных изменений","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion","Выполнение команд openspec","Список доступных изменений"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة","تحديد التغييرات النشطة","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion","تشغيل أوامر openspec","قائمة التغييرات المتاحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-archive-change","实验性工作流","存档更改","openspec list --json","AskUserQuestion","活动更改"],"ja":["openspec-archive-change","実験的なワークフロー","変更をアーカイブ化","openspec list --json","AskUserQuestion","アクティブな変更"],"ko":["openspec-archive-change","실험적인 워크플로","변경을 아카이브화","openspec list --json","AskUserQuestion","활동 변경"],"es":["openspec","archive","cambios","flujo de trabajo","experimental","AskUserQuestion","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["openspec","archive","modifications","workflow","expérimental","AskUserQuestion","développement de logiciels"],"de":["openspec","archiv","änderungen","workflow","experimentell","AskUserQuestion","softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["openspec-archive-change","arquivar mudanças","fluxo de trabalho experimental","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","openspec"],"ru":["openspec-archive-change","архивирование изменений","экспериментальный рабочий процесс","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","openspec"],"ar":["openspec-archive-change","أرشفة التغييرات","تدفق العمل التجريبي","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","openspec"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"naija-conflict-tracker","repoPath":"Ejyke90/naija-conflict-tracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.483Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:01:26.958Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing to manage experimental workflows with openspec-archive-change functionality.","zh":"非常适合需要管理具有openspec-archive-change功能的实验工作流的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"openspec-archive-change機能を使用した実験ワークフローを管理する必要があるワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"openspec-archive-change 기능을 사용하는 실험 워크플로를 관리해야 하는 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de flujos de trabajo que necesitan gestionar flujos de trabajo experimentales con funcionalidad de cambio de archivo de especificación abierta.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de flux de travail qui ont besoin de gérer des flux de travail expérimentaux avec une fonctionnalité de modification d''archive d''ouverture de spécification.","de":"Perfekt für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die experimentelle Workflows mit Openspec-Archiv-Änderungsfunktion verwalten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que precisam gerenciar fluxos de trabalho experimentais com funcionalidade de alteração de arquivo aberto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, которым необходимо управлять экспериментальными рабочими процессами с функцией изменения открытого спецификации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل автомاتизации سير العمل الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة سير العمل التجريبي مع وظيفة تغيير الملف المفتوح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to archive completed changes in experimental workflows using the openspec list command and AskUserQuestion tool, ensuring seamless workflow management and providing active change selection capabilities via JSON output.","zh":"赋予代理使用openspec列表命令和AskUserQuestion工具在实验工作流中归档完成的更改的能力，确保无缝的工作流管理，并通过JSON输出提供主动更改选择的功能。","ja":"openspecリストコマンドとAskUserQuestionツールを使用して、実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブするエージェントの能力を提供し、シームレスなワークフローマネジメントを保証し、JSON出力によるアクティブな変更の選択機能を提供します。","ko":"실험 워크플로에서 완료된 변경을 아카이브하기 위해 openspec 목록 명령과 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여, 무결점의 워크플로 관리를 보증하고, JSON 출력을 통해 활성 변경 선택 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar los cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales utilizando el comando de lista de openspec y la herramienta AskUserQuestion, garantizando una gestión de flujo de trabajo sin problemas y proporcionando capacidades de selección de cambios activos a través de la salida JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver les modifications terminées dans les flux de travail expérimentaux en utilisant la commande de liste d''ouverture de spécification et l''outil AskUserQuestion, assurant une gestion de flux de travail sans accroc et fournissant des capacités de sélection de changements actifs via la sortie JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows mithilfe des Openspec-Listenbefehls und des AskUserQuestion-Tools zu archivieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Workflow-Verwaltung gewährleistet und eine aktive Änderungsauswahl über die JSON-Ausgabe ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais usando o comando de lista de especificações abertas e a ferramenta Perguntar ao Usuário, garantindo uma gestão de fluxo de trabalho sem interrupções e fornecendo capacidades de seleção de alterações ativas via saída JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальных рабочих процессах с помощью команды списка открытой спецификации и инструмента Задать вопрос пользователю, обеспечивая бесперебойное управление рабочим процессом и предоставляя возможности активного выбора изменений через выходные данные JSON.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سير العمل التجريبي باستخدام أمر قائمة المواصفات المفتوحة وأداة سؤال المستخدم، مما يضمن إدارة سير العمل بدون انقطاع وتوفير إمكانيات اختيار التغييرات النشطة عبر مخرجات JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed changes in experimental workflows","Managing active changes with openspec list","Prompting users for change selection with AskUserQuestion"],"zh":["在实验工作流中归档完成的更改","使用openspec列表管理活动更改","使用AskUserQuestion提示用户选择更改"],"ja":["実験ワークフローで完了した変更をアーカイブする","openspecリストを使用してアクティブな変更を管理する","AskUserQuestionを使用してユーザーに変更の選択を促す"],"ko":["실험 워크플로에서 완료된 변경을 아카이브하기","openspec 목록을 사용하여 활성 변경을 관리하기","AskUserQuestion을 사용하여 사용자에게 변경 선택을 요청하기"],"es":["Archivar cambios completados en flujos de trabajo experimentales","Gestionar cambios activos con la lista de openspec","Solicitar a los usuarios la selección de cambios con AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications terminées dans les flux de travail expérimentaux","Gérer les changements actifs avec la liste d''ouverture de spécification","Inviter les utilisateurs à sélectionner des changements avec AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Abgeschlossene Änderungen in experimentellen Workflows archivieren","Aktive Änderungen mit der Openspec-Liste verwalten","Benutzer auffordern, Änderungen mit AskUserQuestion auszuwählen"],"pt":["Arquivar alterações concluídas em fluxos de trabalho experimentais","Gerenciar alterações ativas com lista de especificações abertas","Solicitar que os usuários selecione alterações com Perguntar ao Usuário"],"ru":["Архивировать завершенные изменения в экспериментальных рабочих процессах","Управлять активными изменениями с помощью списка открытой спецификации","Привлекать пользователей для выбора изменений с помощью Задать вопрос пользователю"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في سير العمل التجريبي","إدارة التغييرات النشطة باستخدام قائمة المواصفات المفتوحة","تحفيز المستخدمين على اختيار التغييرات باستخدام سؤال المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to active changes only"],"zh":["需要openspec安装","依赖对话上下文来推断更改名称","仅限于活动更改"],"ja":["openspecのインストールが必要","対話コンテキストに依存して変更名を推論する","アクティブな変更のみに限定される"],"ko":["openspec 설치가 필요합니다","대화 문脈에 의존하여 변경 이름을 추론함","활성 변경만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de openspec","Depende del contexto de conversación para inferir el nombre del cambio","Limitado a cambios activos solamente"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''ouverture de spécification","Dépend du contexte de conversation pour déduire le nom du changement","Limité aux changements actifs uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Openspec","Hängt vom Konversationskontext ab, um den Änderungsnamen abzuleiten","Begrenzt auf aktive Änderungen nur"],"pt":["Exige instalação de especificações abertas","Depende do contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Limitado a alterações ativas apenas"],"ru":["Требует установки открытой спецификации","Зависит от контекста разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен только активными изменениями"],"ar":["يتطلب تركيب مواصفات مفتوحة","يعتمد على سياق المحادثة لاستدلال اسم التغيير","محدود بالتغييرات النشطة فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
