"ja":"Slabbed プロジェクトスケルトンは、Minecraft 1.21.11 と Java 21 向けの Fabric プロジェクトテンプレートであり、基本的なプロジェクト構造を提供します","ko":"Slabbed 프로젝트 스켈레톤은 Minecraft 1.21.11 및 Java 21을 위한 Fabric 프로젝트 템플릿으로, 기본 프로젝트 구조를 제공합니다","es":"Establece y verifica un esqueleto de proyecto Fabric Loom para Slabbed con MC 1.21.11 y Java 21","fr":"Établissez et vérifiez un modèle de base de projet Fabric Loom pour Slabbed avec MC 1.21.11 et Java 21","de":"Stellen Sie ein Fabric Loom-Projekt-Skelett für Slabbed mit MC 1.21.11 und Java 21 ein und verifizieren Sie es","pt":"Este projeto fornece um esqueleto de projeto Fabric Loom para Slabbed com Java 21 e MC 1.21.11, sem lógica de jogo.","ru":"Этот проект предоставляет скелет проекта Fabric Loom для Slabbed с Java 21 и MC 1.21.11, без игровой логики.","ar":"يوفّر هذا المشروع هيكلاً لمشروع Fabric Loom ل Slabbed مع Java 21 و MC 1.21.11، بدون منطق لعبة.","en":"Put things on slabs!"},"definition":{"en":"Put things on slabs!"},"features":{"zh":["基于 Fabric Loom 的项目骨架","支持 Minecraft 1.21.11 和 Java 21","无游戏逻辑","Mod ID: slabbed","Mod 名称: Slabbed","Entry point 类: com.slabbed.Slabbed"],"ja":["Fabric Loom ベースのプロジェクトスケルトン","Minecraft 1.21.11 と Java 21 をサポート","ゲームロジックなし","Mod ID: slabbed","Mod 名称: Slabbed","エントリーポイントクラス: com.slabbed.Slabbed"],"ko":["Fabric Loom 기반 프로젝트 스켈레톤","Minecraft 1.21.11 및 Java 21 지원","게임 로직 없음","Mod ID: slabbed","Mod 이름: Slabbed","Entry point 클래스: com.slabbed.Slabbed"],"es":["Esqueleto de proyecto Fabric Loom","Compatibilidad con MC 1.21.11","Compatibilidad con Java 21","Mod ID: slabbed","Nombre del mod: Slabbed","Punto de entrada: com.slabbed.Slabbed"],"fr":["Modèle de base de projet Fabric Loom","Compatibilité avec MC 1.21.11","Compatibilité avec Java 21","ID de mod: slabbed","Nom du mod: Slabbed","Point d''entrée: com.slabbed.Slabbed"],"de":["Fabric Loom-Projekt-Skelett","Kompatibilität mit MC 1.21.11","Kompatibilität mit Java 21","Mod-ID: slabbed","Mod-Name: Slabbed","Einstiegspunkt: com.slabbed.Slabbed"],"pt":["Esqueleto de projeto Fabric Loom","