ocumentation de manière rapide et efficace","de":"Der WDS-Dokumentationsnavigator ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Komponenten und Dokumentationen schnell und effizient zu finden","pt":"O Navegador de Documentação WDS é uma ferramenta para encontrar componentes por recurso ou palavra-chave.","ru":"Навигатор документации WDS - это инструмент для поиска компонентов по функции или ключевому слову.","ar":"متصفح وثائق WDS هو أداة للعثور على المكونات بواسطة ميزة أو كلمة مفتاحية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["组件搜索","关键词搜索","特性发现","文档导航","高效搜索"],"ja":["コンポーネント検索","キーワード検索","特性発見","ドキュメントナビゲーション","効率的な検索"],"ko":["컴포넌트 검색","키워드 검색","특성 발견","문서 탐색","효율적인 검색"],"es":["Búsqueda de componentes por función o palabra clave","Descubrimiento por etapas para una navegación eficiente","Resultados de búsqueda con nombre de componente, descripción y consejos","Compatibilidad con comandos de grep para búsqueda avanzada","Acceso a documentación detallada de componentes"],"fr":["Recherche de composants par fonction ou mot-clé","Découverte par étapes pour une navigation efficace","Résultats de recherche avec nom de composant, description et conseils","Compatibilité avec les commandes de grep pour une recherche avancée","Accès à la documentation détaillée des composants"],"de":["Suche nach Komponenten nach Funktion oder Schlüsselwort","Schrittweiser Entdeckungsprozess für eine effiziente Navigation","Suchergebnisse mit Komponentenname, Beschreibung und Tipps","Unterstützung von Grep-Befehlen für erweiterte Suche","Zugriff auf detaillierte Dokumentation von Komponenten"],"pt":["Pesquisa de componentes por palavra-chave","Navegação pela documentação oficial","Recursos para desenvolvedores","Descoberta de componentes por funcionalidade","Documentação de design de sistema"],"ru":["Поиск компонентов по ключевому слову","Пробег по официальной документации","Ресурсы для разработчиков","Обнаружение компонентов по функциональности","Документация по дизайну системы"],"ar":["ابحث عن مكونات بواسطة كلمة مفتاحية","استعرض الوثائق الرسمية","الموارد للمطورين","اكتشاف المكونات بواسطة الوظيفة","توثيق تصميم النظام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WDS","设计系统","文档导航","组件搜索","关键词搜索","开发工具","前端开发"],"ja":["WDS","設計システム","ドキュメントナビゲーション","コンポーネント検索","キーワード検索","開発ツール","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["WDS","디자인 시스템","문서 탐색","컴포넌트 검색","키워드 검색","개발 도구","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["WDS","documentación","navegador","componentes","desarrollo","grep","búsqueda","etapas","eficiencia"],"fr":["WDS","documentation","navigateur","composants","développement","grep","recherche","étapes","efficacité"],"de":["WDS","Dokumentation","Navigator","Komponenten","Entwicklung","Grep","Suche","Schritte","Effizienz"],"pt":["WDS","documentação","navegação","componentes","desenvolvedores","design de sistema","recursos para devs"],"ru":["WDS","документация","навигация","компоненты","разработчики","дизайн системы","ресурсы для разработчиков"],"ar":["WDS","وثائق","ملاحة","مكونات","مطورين","تصميم النظام","الموارد للمطورين"]}},"owner":"weunica","repo":"payboxCLI-App","repoPath":"weunica/payboxCLI-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wds-docs","description":"Wix Design System component reference. Use when building UI with @wix/design-system, choosing components, or checking props and examples. Triggers on what component, how do I make, WDS, show me props, or component names like Button, Card, Modal, Box, Text.","bodyPreview":"# WDS Documentation Navigator\n\n**Docs path:** `node_modules/@wix/design-system/dist/docs/`\n\n## CRITICAL: Never Read Entire Files\n\nFiles are 200-900+ lines. Follow the staged discovery flow below.\n\n---\n\n## Stage 1: Find Component\n\n**Goal:** Search for component by feature/keyword\n\n```bash\nGrep: \"table\" in components.md\nGrep: \"form\\|input\\|validation\" in components.md\nGrep: \"modal\\|dialog\\|popup\" in components.md\n```\n\n**Output:** Component name + description + do/don''ts\n\n**Next:** Go to Stage 2 wi","body":"# WDS Documentation Navigator\n\n**Docs path:** `node_modules/@wix/design-system/dist/docs/`\n\n## CRITICAL: Never Read Entire Files\n\nFiles are 200-900+ lines. Follow the staged discovery flow below.\n\n---\n\n## Stage 1: Find Component\n\n**Goal:** Search for component by feature/keyword\n\n```bash\nGrep: \"table\" in components.md\nGrep: \"form\\|input\\|validation\" in components.md\nGrep: \"modal\\|dialog\\|popup\" in components.md\n```\n\n**Output:** Component name + description + do/don''ts\n\n**Next:** Go to Stage 2 with component name\n\n---\n\n## Stage 2: Get Props + Example List\n\n**Goal:** Get props AND discover available examples\n\n```bash\n# 2a. Get props (small files OK to read, large files grep)\nRead: components/ButtonProps.md              # OK if <100 lines\nGrep: \"### disabled\" in components/BoxProps.md -A 3  # Box is huge\n\n# 2b. List available examples (ALWAYS grep, never read)\nGrep: \"^### \" in components/ButtonExamples.md -n\n```\n\n**Output from 2b:**\n```\n5:### Size\n17:### Skin\n71:### Affix\n123:### Disabled\n183:### Loading state\n```\n\n**Next:** Pick example(s) from list, go to Stage 3\n\n---\n\n## Stage 3: Fetch Specific Example\n\n**Goal:** Read only the example you need (~30-50 lines)\n\n```bash\n# Option A: Read with offset (line number from Stage 2)\nRead: components/ButtonExamples.md offset=183 limit=40\n\n# Option B: Grep with context\nGrep: \"### Loading state\" in components/ButtonExamples.md -A 40\n```\n\n**Output:** JSX code example for that specific feature\n\n---\n\n## Stage 4: Icons (when needed)\n\n```bash\nGrep: \"Add\\|Edit\\|Delete\\|Search\" in icons.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## Flow Summary\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Stage 1: Grep components.md for keyword                 │\n│          → finds: Button, Card, Table...                │\n└────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘\n                     ↓\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Stage 2a: Read/Grep {Component}Props.md                 │\n│           → gets: props with types & descriptions       │\n│                                                         │\n│ Stage 2b: Grep \"^### \" in {Component}Examples.md        │\n│           → gets: example names + line numbers          │\n│           \"5:### Size, 71:### Affix, 183:### Loading\"   │\n└────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘\n                     ↓\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Stage 3: Read offset=183 limit=40                       │\n│          → gets: specific example JSX code              │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Example Session: Product Page\n\n```bash\n# Stage 1: Find components\nGrep: \"image\\|card\\|price\" in components.md\n→ Image, Card, Text found\n\n# Stage 2a: Get Card props\nRead: components/CardProps.md\n\n# Stage 2b: List Card examples\nGrep: \"^### \" in components/CardExamples.md -n\n→ 5:### Basic, 25:### With media, 60:### Clickable\n\n# Stage 3: Fetch \"With media\" example\nRead: components/CardExamples.md offset=25 limit=35\n→ Gets Card with Image example code\n\n# Repeat Stage 2-3 for other components as needed\n```\n\n**Result:** ~80 lines read instead of 1500+\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Stage | Command | Output |\n|-------|---------|--------|\n| 1. Find | `Grep: \"keyword\" in components.md` | Component name |\n| 2a. Props | `Read: {Name}Props.md` | Props list |\n| 2b. Examples | `Grep: \"^### \" in {Name}Examples.md` | Example names + lines |\n| 3. Fetch | `Read: offset=N limit=40` | Example code |\n| 4. Icons | `Grep: \"IconName\" in icons.md` | Icon exists |\n\n---\n\n## File Sizes\n\n| File | Lines | Strategy |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| components.md | ~970 | Grep, never read fully |\n| icons.md | ~400 | Grep for specific icon |\n| Most Props.md | 30-100 | Read fully OK |\n| BoxProps.md | 8000+ | Grep only! |\n| Most Examples.md | 100-600 | Grep → offset read |\n| PageExamples.md | 940 | Grep → offset read |\n\n---\n\n## Grep Patterns by Use Case\n\n```bash\n# Forms\nGrep: \"form\\|input\\|validation\" in components.md\n\n# Layout\nGrep: \"layout\\|page\\|card\\|box\" in components.md\n\n# Data display\nGrep: \"table\\|list\\|badge\" in components.md\n\n# Feedback\nGrep: \"notification\\|toast\\|loader\" in components.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Component Mapping (Design → WDS)\n\n| Design Element | WDS Component | Notes |\n|----------------|---------------|-------|\n| Rectangle/container | `<Box>` | Layout wrapper |\n| Text button | `<TextButton>` | Secondary actions |\n| Input with label | `<FormField>` + `<Input>` | Wrap inputs |\n| Toggle | `<ToggleSwitch>` | On/off settings |\n| Modal | `<Modal>` + `<CustomModalLayout>` | Use together |\n| Grid | `<Layout>` + `<Cell>` | Responsive |\n\n---\n\n## Spacing (px → SP conversion)\n\nWhen designer specifies pixels, convert to the nearest SP token:\n\n| Token | Classic | Studio |\n|-------|---------|--------|\n| `SP1` | 6px | 4px |\n| `SP2` | 12px | 8px |\n| `SP3` | 18px | 12px |\n| `SP4` | 24px | 16px |\n| `SP5` | 30px | 20px |\n| `SP6` | 36px | 24px |\n\n```tsx\n<Box gap=\"SP2\" padding=\"SP3\">\n```\n\nOnly use SP tokens for `gap`, `padding`, `margin` - not for width/height.\n\n---\n\n## Imports\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button, Card, Image } from ''@wix/design-system'';\nimport { Add, Edit, Delete } from ''@wix/wix-ui-icons-common'';\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:02:16.124Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Documentation Analysis Agents needing efficient Wix Design System component discovery.","zh":"Perfect for Documentation Analysis Agents needing efficient Wix Design System component discovery.","ja":"Perfect for Documentation Analysis Agents needing efficient Wix Design System component discovery.","ko":"Perfect for Documentation Analysis Agents needing efficient Wix Design System component discovery.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de documentación que necesitan un descubrimiento eficiente de componentes del sistema de diseño de Wix.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de documentation ayant besoin d''une découverte efficace de composants du système de conception Wix.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentationsanalyse-Agenten, die eine effiziente Wix-Design-System-Komponenten-Erkennung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentação que precisam de descoberta eficiente de componentes do Wix Design System.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документации, которым требуется эффективное обнаружение компонентов Wix Design System.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الوثائق التي تحتاج إلى اكتشاف فعال لمكونات نظام التصميم Wix."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate Wix Design System documentation using staged discovery flow, grep commands, and parsing of markdown files, providing component names, descriptions, and do/don''ts, all while avoiding reading entire files due to their large size of 200-900+ lines.","zh":"Empowers agents to navigate Wix Design System documentation using staged discovery flow, grep commands, and parsing of markdown files, providing component names, descriptions, and do/don''ts, all while avoiding reading entire files due to their large size of 200-900+ lines.","ja":"Empowers agents to navigate Wix Design System documentation using staged discovery flow, grep commands, and parsing of markdown files, providing component names, descriptions, and do/don''ts, all while avoiding reading entire files due to their large size of 200-900+ lines.","ko":"Empowers agents to navigate Wix Design System documentation using staged discovery flow, grep commands, and parsing of markdown files, providing component names, descriptions, and do/don''ts, all while avoiding reading entire files due to their large size of 200-900+ lines.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a navegar por la documentación del sistema de diseño de Wix utilizando un flujo de descubrimiento por etapas, comandos grep y análisis de archivos markdown, proporcionando nombres de componentes, descripciones y consejos de uso, todo ello sin leer los archivos completos debido a su gran tamaño de 200-900+ líneas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans la documentation du système de conception Wix en utilisant un flux de découverte par étapes, des commandes grep et un parsing de fichiers markdown, fournissant des noms de composants, des descriptions et des conseils d''utilisation, le tout sans lire les fichiers complets en raison de leur grande taille de 200-900+ lignes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Wix-Design-System-Dokumentation mithilfe eines gestuften Entdeckungsflusses, Grep-Befehlen und Parsen von Markdown-Dateien zu navigieren, wodurch Komponentennamen, Beschreibungen und Hinweise zur Verwendung bereitgestellt werden, all dies ohne die gesamten Dateien zu lesen, da diese aufgrund ihrer Größe von 200-900+ Zeilen sehr groß sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar na documentação do Wix Design System usando fluxo de descoberta em estágios, comandos grep e análise de arquivos markdown, fornecendo nomes de componentes, descrições e diretrizes de uso, tudo isso sem precisar ler arquivos inteiros devido ao seu grande tamanho de 200-900+ linhas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью навигации по документации Wix Design System с помощью потoka обнаружения на нескольких стадиях, команд grep и парсинга файлов markdown, предоставляя имена компонентов, описания и рекомендации по использованию, все это без необходимости читать整个 файл из-за его большого размера в 200-900+ строк.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من التنقل في توثيق نظام التصميم Wix باستخدام تدفق اكتشاف من giai đoạn، وأوامر grep، وتصريف ملفات markdown، مع توفير أسماء المكونات ووصفها و إرشادات الاستخدام، كل ذلك بدون الحاجة إلى قراءة الملفات بالكامل بسبب حجمها الكبير من 200-900+ سطر."},"useCases":{"en":["Searching for components by feature or keyword","Parsing component documentation in markdown format","Generating component information including name, description, and usage guidelines"],"zh":["Searching for components by feature or keyword","Parsing component documentation in markdown format","Generating component information including name, description, and usage guidelines"],"ja":["Searching for components by feature or keyword","Parsing component documentation in markdown format","Generating component information including name, description, and usage guidelines"],"ko":["Searching for components by feature or keyword","Parsing component documentation in markdown format","Generating component information including name, description, and usage guidelines"],"es":["Buscar componentes por función o palabra clave","Analizar la documentación de componentes en formato markdown","Generar información de componentes, incluyendo nombre, descripción y pautas de uso"],"fr":["Rechercher des composants par fonctionnalité ou mot-clé","Analyser la documentation de composants au format markdown","Générer des informations de composants, y compris le nom, la description et les directives d''utilisation"],"de":["Suchen nach Komponenten nach Funktion oder Schlüsselwort","Analysieren der Komponentendokumentation im Markdown-Format","Generieren von Komponenteninformationen, einschließlich Name, Beschreibung und Nutzungsrichtlinien"],"pt":["Pesquisar componentes por recurso ou palavra-chave","Analise de documentação de componentes em formato markdown","Geração de informações de componentes, incluindo nome, descrição e diretrizes de uso"],"ru":["Поиск компонентов по функции или ключевому слову","Парсинг документации компонентов в формате markdown","Генерация информации о компонентах, включая имя, описание и рекомендации по использованию"],"ar":["البحث عن المكونات من خلال الميزة أو الكلمة الرئيسية","تحليل توثيق المكونات في تنسيق markdown","توليد معلومات المكونات، بما في ذلك الاسم و الوصف و إرشادات الاستخدام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Wix Design System documentation files","Limited to components listed in components.md file","Must follow staged discovery flow to avoid reading entire files"],"zh":["Requires access to Wix Design System documentation files","Limited to components listed in components.md file","Must follow staged discovery flow to avoid reading entire files"],"ja":["Requires access to Wix Design System documentation files","Limited to components listed in components.md file","Must follow staged discovery flow to avoid reading entire files"],"ko":["Requires access to Wix Design System documentation files","Limited to components listed in components.md file","Must follow staged discovery flow to avoid reading entire files"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos de documentación del sistema de diseño de Wix","Limitado a los componentes enumerados en el archivo components.md","Debe seguir el flujo de descubrimiento por etapas para evitar leer los archivos completos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de documentation du système de conception Wix","Limité aux composants répertoriés dans le fichier components.md","Doit suivre le flux de découverte par étapes pour éviter de lire les fichiers complets"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Dokumentationsdateien des Wix-Design-Systems","Begrenzt auf die in der Datei components.md aufgeführten Komponenten","Muss dem gestuften Entdeckungsfluss folgen, um das Lesen der gesamten Dateien zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos arquivos de documentação do Wix Design System","Limitado aos componentes listados no arquivo components.md","Deve seguir o fluxo de descoberta em estágios para evitar ler arquivos inteiros"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам документации Wix Design System","Ограничен компонентами, перечисленными в файле components.md","Должен следовать потоку обнаружения на нескольких стадиях, чтобы избежать чтения整个 файла"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات توثيق نظام التصميم Wix","محدود بالمكونات المذكورة في ملف components.md","يجب اتباع تدفق الاكتشاف من giai đoạn لتفادي قراءة الملفات بالكامل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Bald0Wang/DeepSeek-Oracle/oracle-actionizer', 'community', 'Bald0Wang', 'DeepSeek-Oracle', 'Bald0Wang/DeepSeek-Oracle', 'oracle-actionizer', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z', '2026-02-18T10:02:44.060Z', NULL, '{"id":"Bald0Wang/DeepSeek-Oracle/oracle-actionizer","name":"oracle-actionizer","description":{"zh":"Oracle Actionizer 是一个基于紫微斗数的任务规划系统，使用大语言模型解读指导并转化为可执行任务","ja":"Oracle Actionizer は占い分析を基にしたタスク管理システムであり、大規模言語モデルを使用して指導を解釈し、実行可能なタスクに変換します","ko":"Oracle Actionizer는 운명의 수를 기반으로 하는 작업 계획 시스템으로, 대규모 언어 모델을 이용하여 지침을 해석하고 실행 가능한 작업으로 변환합니다","es":"Oracle Actionizer es una herramienta que convierte orientación abstracta en tareas concretas que los usuarios pueden completar. Utiliza modelos de lenguaje avanzados para analizar la orientación y generar tareas.","fr":"Oracle Actionizer est un outil qui transforme des conseils abstraits en tâches concrètes que les utilisateurs peuvent effectuer. Il utilise des modèles de langage avancés pour analyser les conseils et générer des tâches.","de":"Oracle Actionizer ist ein Tool, das abstrakte Anweisungen in konkrete Aufgaben umwandelt, die die Benutzer ausführen können. Es verwendet fortschrittliche Sprachmodelle, um die Anweisungen zu analysieren und Aufgaben zu generieren.","pt":"O Oracle Actionizer é um sistema de análise de destino baseado em deep learning que converte orientações abstratas em tarefas concretas.","ru":"Oracle Actionizer — это система анализа судьбы на основе глубокого обучения, которая преобразует абстрактные рекомендации в конкретные задачи.","ar":"أوراكل أكشنايزر هو نظام تحليل المصير المستند إلى التعلم العميق الذي يحول التوجيهات المجردة إلى مهام ملموسة.","en":"基于紫微斗数的命理分析系统，使用deepseek等大语言模型进行解读。目前是情人节版本，支持姻缘推算。"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Oracle Actionizer：基于紫微斗数的任务规划系统","ja":"Oracle Actionizer：占い分析を基にしたタスク管理","ko":"Oracle Actionizer：운명의 수를 기반으로