 die automatisierte Refactoring und Codegenerierung","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Auswirkung","Anwendung auf neue Komponenten und Seiten"],"pt":["57 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias para priorizar refatoração e geração de código","Guia para escrever novos componentes React e páginas Next.js","Otimização de busca de dados","Refatoração de código existente"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации рефакторинга и генерации кода","Руководство для написания новых компонентов React и страниц Next.js","Оптимизация поиска данных","Рефакторинг существующего кода"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحديد أولوية إعادة هيكلة وتوليد الكود","دليل لكتابة مكونات React وصفحات Next.js جديدة","تحسين بحث البيانات","إعادة هيكلة الكود الموجود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React最佳实践","React性能优化","Next.js性能优化","代码优化","自动重构","代码生成","React开发","Next.js开发"],"ja":["Vercel Reactベストプラクティス","Reactパフォーマンス最適化","Next.jsパフォーマンス最適化","コード最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","React開発","Next.js開発"],"ko":["Vercel React最佳实践","React 성능 최적화","Next.js 성능 최적화","코드 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","React 개발","Next.js 개발"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Melhores práticas","Refatoração de código","Otimização de busca de dados"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Разработка приложений","Лучшие практики","Рефакторинг кода","Оптимизация поиска данных"],"ar":["Vercel React","تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","تطوير التطبيقات","أفضل الممارسات","إعادة هيكلة الكود","تحسين بحث البيانات"]}},"owner":"bakwankawa","repo":"lazy-code-skill","repoPath":"bakwankawa/lazy-code-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:02:59.050Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React 和 Next.js 性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js の高度なパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Leistungsoptimierungsfunktionen für React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعمال الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications, leveraging 57 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成能力，用于 React 和 Next.js 应用，利用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别进行全面性能优化，包括使用 Vercel 指南的数据获取和包优化。","ja":"エージェントに React と Next.js アプリケーションの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって使用して包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を実現し、Vercel ガイドラインを使用したデータ取得とバンドル最適化を含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션의 자동 리팩터링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 57개의 규칙을 8개 카테고리에 걸쳐 사용하여 포괄적인 성능 최적화를 실현하며, Vercel 가이드라인을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js, aprovechando 57 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización integral del rendimiento, incluida la optimización de la recuperación de datos y la agrupación utilizando las pautas de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js, en exploitant 57 règles dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation complète des performances, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement en utilisant les directives Vercel.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem es 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung nutzt, einschließlich der Optimierung der Datenabruf und Bündelung unter Verwendung der Vercel-Richtlinien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para aplicativos React e Next.js, aproveitando 57 regras em 8 categorias para uma otimização abrangente de desempenho, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando diretrizes do Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях для всесторонней оптимизации производительности, включая оптимизацию получения данных и упаковки с использованием рекомендаций Vercel.","ar":"تمكن العمال من تautomatisation إعادة هيكلة وتوليد رمز التطبيقات React و Next.js، مستفيدا من 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين أداء شامل، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحزيم باستخدام إرشادات Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with server-side rendering","Refactoring existing React code for better bundling and loading performance","Implementing data fetching best practices for client and server-side rendering"],"zh":["自动化 React 组件的代码审查以发现性能问题","使用服务器端渲染生成优化的 Next.js 页面","重构现有的 React 代码以获得更好的包和加载性能","实施数据获取最佳实践以进行客户端和服务器端渲染"],"ja":["React コンポーネントのパフォーマンスの問題を特定するためのコードレビューの自動化","サーバーサイドレンダリングを使用して最適化された Next.js ページを生成する","バンドルとロードのパフォーマンスを向上させるために既存の React コードをリファクタリングする","クライアントサイドレンダリングとサーバーサイドレンダリングの両方でデータ取得のベストプラクティスを実装する"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트의 성능 문제를 발견하기 위한 코드 리뷰 자동화","서버 사이드 렌더링을 사용하여 최적화된 Next.js 페이지를 생성합니다.","기존 React 코드를 리팩터링하여 더 나은 번들 및 로드 성능을 얻습니다.","클라이언트 사이드 및 서버 사이드 렌더링 모두에서 데이터 가져오기 모범 사례를实施합니다."],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento en componentes de React","Generar páginas de Next.js optimizadas con renderizado del lado del servidor","Refactorizar el código de React existente para una mejor agrupación y rendimiento de carga","Implementar las mejores prácticas de recuperación de datos para el renderizado del lado del cliente y del servidor"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances dans les composants React","Générer des pages Next.js optimisées avec un rendu serveur","Refactoriser le code React existant pour une meilleure regroupement et des performances de chargement","Mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques de récupération de données pour le rendu client et serveur"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme in React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit Server-Seitigem Rendering","Refaktorisieren des bestehenden React-Codes für eine bessere Bündelung und Ladeleistung","Implementieren der besten Praktiken für die Datenabruf für Client- und Server-Seitiges Rendering"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho em componentes React","Gerar páginas Next.js otimizadas com renderização no servidor","Refatorar código React existente para melhor desempenho de empacotamento e carregamento","Implementar práticas recomendadas de busca de dados para renderização do lado do cliente e do servidor"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью в компонентах React","Генерировать оптимизированные страницы Next.js с серверной отрисовкой","Рефакторить существующий код React для лучшей упаковки и загрузки","Реализовывать лучшие практики получения данных для клиентской и серверной отрисовки"],"ar":["تأتمتة مراجعة الشفرة لمشاكل الأداء في مكونات React","توليد صفحات Next.js متقدمة مع عرض الخادم","إعادة هيكلة رمز React الحالي لتحسين أداء التعبئة والتحميل","تنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لاسترجاع البيانات لعرض جانب العميل والخادم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js ecosystems","Limited to applications hosted on Vercel","Optimization rules are prioritized by impact, requiring agent judgment for implementation"],"zh":["需要 React 和 Next.js 生态系统的知识","仅限于托管在 Vercel 的应用","优化规则根据影响力进行优先排序，需要代理判断以实施"],"ja":["React と Next.js のエコシステムに関する知識が必要","Vercel にホストされているアプリケーションに限定","最適化ルールは影響度に基づいて優先順位付けされるため、実装にはエージェントの判断が必要"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","Vercel에 호스팅된 애플리케이션으로 제한됩니다.","최적화 규칙은 영향에 따라 우선 순위가 지정되므로 구현을 위해 에이전트의 판단이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones alojadas en Vercel","Las reglas de optimización se priorizan por impacto, lo que requiere el juicio del agente para la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des écosystèmes React et Next.js","Limité aux applications hébergées sur Vercel","Les règles d''optimisation sont prioritaires en fonction de l''impact, ce qui nécessite le jugement de l''agent pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der React- und Next.js-Ökosysteme","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die auf Vercel gehostet werden","Die Optimierungsregeln werden nach Auswirkung priorisiert, was das Urteil des Agents für die Implementierung erfordert"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento dos ecossistemas React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicativos hospedados no Vercel","Regras de otimização são priorizadas por impacto, exigindo julgamento do agente para implementação"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем React и Next.js","Ограничен приложениями, размещенными на Vercel","Правила оптимизации имеют приоритет по воздействию, требуя суждения агента для реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بيئات React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات المضيفة على Vercel","قواعد التحسين لها أهمية حسب التأثير، وتتطلب حكم العامل لتنفيذها"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
