,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:03:14.483Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化React和Next.js性能的前端代理。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsのパフォーマンスを最適化する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Next.js 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un rendimiento optimizado de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des performances optimisées de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes React- und Next.js-Verhalten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный React и Next.js.","ar":" مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء محسن ل React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, utilizing 45 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling.","zh":"赋予代理人自动重构和生成React组件和Next.js页面的代码的能力，利用45条规则跨8个类别进行全面性能优化，包括数据获取和打包。","ja":"ReactコンポーネントとNext.jsページのコードの自動リファクタリングと生成をエージェントに可能にすることで、データ取得やバンドルなど、8つのカテゴリにわたる45のルールを使用して包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を実現します。","ko":"리액트 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지의 코드 자동 리팩토링 및 생성을 에이전트에게 가능하게 함으로써, 데이터 가져오기 및 번들링 등을 포함한 8개의 카테고리에 걸친 45개의 규칙을 사용하여 포괄적인 성능 최적화를 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, utilizando 45 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización integral del rendimiento, incluida la recuperación de datos y la agrupación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en utilisant 45 règles dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation complète des performances, y compris la récupération de données et le regroupement.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung verwendet werden, einschließlich Datenabruf und Bündelung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 45 regras em 8 categorias para otimização de desempenho abrangente, incluindo busca de dados e empacotamento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях для всесторонней оптимизации производительности, включая получение данных и сборку.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تutomation إعادة هيكلة وإنشاء رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، باستخدام 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين أداء شامل، بما في ذلك استرجاع البيانات وتحزيم التطبيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing server-side data fetching for Next.js pages","Refactoring existing React code for improved performance","Optimizing bundling for faster application load times"],"zh":["为Next.js页面实现服务器端数据获取","重构现有的React代码以提高性能","优化打包以实现更快的应用程序加载时间"],"ja":["Next.jsページのサーバーサイドデータ取得の実装","既存のReactコードのリファクタリングによるパフォーマンスの向上","バンドルの最適化によるアプリケーションのロード時間の短縮"],"ko":["Next.js 페이지의 서버 측 데이터 가져오기 구현","기존 리액트 코드 리팩토링을 통한 성능 향상","번들의 최적화를 통한 애플리케이션 로드 시간 단축"],"es":["Implementar la recuperación de datos del lado del servidor para páginas de Next.js","Refactorizar el código React existente para mejorar el rendimiento","Optimizar la agrupación para tiempos de carga de aplicaciones más rápidos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la récupération de données côté serveur pour les pages Next.js","Refactoriser le code React existant pour améliorer les performances","Optimiser le regroupement pour des temps de chargement d''applications plus rapides"],"de":["Implementierung der serverseitigen Datenabruf für Next.js-Seiten","Refactoring des vorhandenen React-Codes für verbesserte Leistung","Optimierung der Bündelung für schnellere Ladezeiten von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Implementação de busca de dados no lado do servidor para páginas Next.js","Refatoração de código React existente para melhorar o desempenho","Otimização de empacotamento para tempos de carregamento de aplicativos mais rápidos"],"ru":["Реализация получения данных на стороне сервера для страниц Next.js","Рефакторинг существующего кода React для улучшения производительности","Оптимизация сборки для более быстрой загрузки приложений"],"ar":["تنفيذ استرجاع البيانات على جانب الخادم لصفحات Next.js","إعادة هيكلة رمز React الحالي لتحسين الأداء","تحسين تحزيم التطبيق لتحقيق أوقات تحميل أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js application","Limited to JavaScript ecosystem"],"zh":["需要React或Next.js应用程序","仅限于JavaScript生态系统"],"ja":["ReactまたはNext.jsアプリケーションの必要性","JavaScriptエコシステムへの限定"],"ko":["리액트 또는 Next.js 애플리케이션이 필요함","자바스크립트 생태계로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una aplicación React o Next.js","Limitado al ecosistema de JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une application React ou Next.js","Limité à l''écosystème JavaScript"],"de":["Benötigt eine React- oder Next.js-Anwendung","Begrenzt auf das JavaScript-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer aplicativo React ou Next.js","Limitado ao ecossistema JavaScript"],"ru":["Требуется приложение React или Next.js","Ограничен экосистемой JavaScript"],"ar":["يتطلب تطبيق React أو Next.js","محدود بنظام JavaScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
