r Leistung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen"],"pt":["45 regras de otimização em 8 categorias","Priorização por impacto para refatoração automática","Guia para escrita de componentes React e páginas Next.js","Otimização de busca de dados cliente e servidor","Refatoração de código existente"],"ru":["45 правил оптимизации в 8 категориях","Приоритизация по воздействию для автоматической рефакторинга","Руководство по написанию компонентов React и страниц Next.js","Оптимизация поиска данных на стороне клиента и сервера","Рефакторинг существующего кода"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء في 8 فئات","التحديد بالترتيب حسب التأثير لتحديث آلي","دليل لكتابة مكونات React وصفحات Next.js","تحسين بحث البيانات على جانب العميل والخادم","تحديث رمز موجود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React最佳实践","React性能优化","Next.js性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","性能最优化"],"ja":["Vercel Reactベストプラクティス","Reactパフォーマンス最適化","Next.jsパフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["Vercel React 최적화 가이드","React 성능 최적화","Next.js 성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","성능 최적화"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web","rendimiento de aplicaciones","refactorización automática"],"fr":["Vercel React","bonnes pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web","performances des applications","réorganisation automatique"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung","Anwendungsleistung","automatische Refaktorierung"],"pt":["otimização de performance","React","Next.js","Vercel","refatoração automática","melhorias de código","desenvolvimento web","guias de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Vercel","автоматическая рефакторинга","улучшение кода","веб-разработка","руководства по разработке"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","Vercel","تحديث آلي","تحسين الكود","تطوير الويب","دلائل التطوير"]}},"owner":"Kyo1M","repo":"pair-budget","repoPath":"Kyo1M/pair-budget","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:03:15.647Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in React and Next.js development, seeking to enhance performance optimization and automated refactoring capabilities.","zh":"适用于专注于 React 和 Next.js 开发的前端代理，旨在增强性能优化和自动重构能力。","ja":"React と Next.js 開発に特化したフロントエンド エージェントが、パフォーマンス最適化と自動リファクタリング機能を強化するために最適です。","ko":"React 및 Next.js 개발에 특화된 프론트엔드 에이전트가 성능 최적화 및 자동 리팩토링 기능을 향상시키는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend especializados en desarrollo de React y Next.js, que buscan mejorar la optimización del rendimiento y las capacidades de refactorización automatizada.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend spécialisés dans le développement React et Next.js, qui cherchent à améliorer l''optimisation des performances et les capacités de refactoring automatisé.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die auf React- und Next.js-Entwicklung spezialisiert sind und die Leistungsoptimierung und die automatisierte Refactoring-Fähigkeiten verbessern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que se especializam em desenvolvimento React e Next.js, buscando aprimorar a otimização de desempenho e as capacidades de refatoração automatizada.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на разработке React и Next.js, стремящихся повысить производительность оптимизации и автоматические возможности рефакторинга.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يركزون على تطوير React و Next.js، يبحثون عن تعزيز تحسين الأداء وقدرات إعادة الهيكلة التلقائية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage 45 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, guiding automated refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications, utilizing client and server-side data fetching, and optimizing bundling.","zh":"赋予代理使用 45 个规则跨 8 个类别进行全面性能优化，指导 React 和 Next.js 应用程序的自动重构和代码生成，利用客户端和服务器端数据获取，并优化捆绑。","ja":"エージェントが 8 つのカテゴリをまたぐ 45 のルールを使用して、React と Next.js アプリケーションの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を導き、クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのデータ取得を活用し、バンドルの最適化を行うための包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 8개의 카테고리를跨는 45개의 규칙을 사용하여 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 안내하고, 클라이언트측 및 서버측 데이터 가져오기를 사용하며, 번들의 최적화를 통해 포괄적인 성능 최적화를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar 45 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización de rendimiento integral, guiando el refactoring automático y la generación de código para aplicaciones React y Next.js, utilizando la recuperación de datos del lado del cliente y del servidor, y optimizando la agrupación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter 45 règles dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation des performances complète, guidant le refactoring automatisé et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js, en utilisant la récupération de données côté client et côté serveur, et en optimisant le regroupement.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung zu nutzen, die automatisierte Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen leitet, wobei Client- und Server-Daten abgerufen und die Bündelung optimiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar 45 regras em 8 categorias para uma otimização de desempenho abrangente, orientando a refatoração automatizada e a geração de código para aplicativos React e Next.js, utilizando a busca de dados do lado do cliente e do servidor e otimizando a embalagem.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать 45 правил в 8 категориях для всесторонней оптимизации производительности, руководящей автоматической рефакторингом и генерацией кода для приложений React и Next.js, использующих клиентскую и серверную выборку данных и оптимизирующей упаковку.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين أداء شامل، وإرشاد إعادة الهيكلة التلقائية وتوليد رمز التطبيقات React و Next.js، باستخدام استرجاع البيانات من جانب العميل وخادم، وتحسين التعبئة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with server-side rendering","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for improved performance and maintainability"],"zh":["自动化 React 组件的代码审查以查找性能问题","使用服务器端渲染生成优化的 Next.js 页面","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以提高性能和可维护性"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題を含む React コンポーネントのコードレビューを自動化する","サーバーサイドレンダリングを使用して最適化された Next.js ページを生成する","パフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を向上させるために既存の React と Next.js コードをリファクタリングする"],"ko":["성능 문제를 포함한 React 컴포넌트의 코드 리뷰를 자동화하는 것","서버측 렌더링을 사용하여 최적화된 Next.js 페이지를 생성하는 것","성능 및 유지보수성을 향상시키기 위해 기존의 React 및 Next.js 코드를 리팩토링하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento en componentes React","Generación de páginas Next.js optimizadas con renderizado del lado del servidor","Refactorización de código React y Next.js existente para mejorar el rendimiento y la mantenibilidad"],"fr":["Automatisation des examens de code pour les problèmes de performances dans les composants React","Génération de pages Next.js optimisées avec un rendu côté serveur","Refactoring du code React et Next.js existant pour améliorer les performances et la maintenabilité"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme in React-Komponenten","Generierung von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit Server-Seitigem Rendering","Refactoring von bestehendem React- und Next.js-Code für verbesserte Leistung und Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho em componentes React","Gerar páginas Next.js otimizadas com renderização do lado do servidor","Refatorar código existente React e Next.js para melhorar o desempenho e a manutenção"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью в компонентах React","Генерировать оптимизированные страницы Next.js с серверной отрисовкой","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для улучшения производительности и поддержки"],"ar":["تحويل مراجعة رمز التطبيقات لتحسين مشاكل الأداء في مكونات React","توليد صفحات Next.js مُحسّنة مع عرض جانب الخادم","إعادة هيكلة رمز التطبيقات الحالي React و Next.js لتحسين الأداء والصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js ecosystems","Limited to applications using Vercel for deployment and optimization"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Next.js 生态系统","仅限于使用 Vercel 进行部署和优化的应用程序"],"ja":["React と Next.js のエコシステムを理解する必要がある","Vercel を使用してデプロイと最適化を行うアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js 생태계를 이해해야 함","Vercel을 사용하여 배포 및 최적화를 수행하는 애플리케이션으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan Vercel para la implementación y la optimización"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des écosystèmes React et Next.js","Limité aux applications qui utilisent Vercel pour le déploiement et l''optimisation"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der React- und Next.js-Ökosysteme","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die Vercel für die Bereitstellung und Optimierung verwenden"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento dos ecossistemas React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações que usam Vercel para implantação e otimização"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем React и Next.js","Ограничен для приложений, использующих Vercel для развертывания и оптимизации"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بيئات React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات التي تستخدم Vercel لنشر وتحسين الأداء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Bald0Wang/DeepSeek-Oracle/oracle-daily-card-composer', 'community', 'Bald0Wang', 'DeepSeek-Oracle', 'Bald0Wang/DeepSeek-Oracle', 'oracle-daily-card-composer', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z', '2026-02-18T10:02:47.511Z', NULL, '{"id":"Bald0Wang/DeepSeek-Oracle/oracle-daily-card-composer","name":"oracle-daily-card-composer","description":{"zh":"Oracle Daily Card Composer是一个基于紫微斗数的命理分析系统，使用DeepSeek等大语言模型进行解读，目前支持情人节版本的姻缘推算","ja":"Oracle Daily Card Composerは紫微斗数に基づく運勢分析システムで、DeepSeekなどの大規模言語モデルを使用して解釈します。現在、バレンタインデーのバージョンでは姻缘の推算をサポート","ko":"Oracle Daily Card Composer는紫微斗数 기반의 사주 분석 시스템으로, DeepSeek와 같은 대규모 언어 모델을 사용하여 해석합니다. 현재 발렌타인 데이 버전에서는姻缘의 추정을 지원","es":"El generador de tarjetas diarias de Oracle crea tarjetas concisas con estructura estable y tono accionable, utilizando un sistema de análisis de destino basado en el modelo de lenguaje DeepSeek.","fr":"Le générateur de cartes quotidiennes Oracle crée des cartes concises avec une structure stable et un ton actionnable, en utilisant un système d''analyse de destin basé sur le modèle de langage DeepSeek.","de":"Der Oracle-Tageskarten-Generator erstellt präzise Tageskarten mit stabiler Struktur und handlungsbetonter Ausrichtung, der auf einem Schicksalsanalyse-System basiert, das das DeepSeek-Sprachmodell nutzt.","pt":"O criador de cartões diários Oracle é um sistema de análise de destino que gera cartões diários concisos com estrutura estável e tom ação","ru":"Создатель ежедневных карт Oracle - система анализа судьбы, генерирующая ежедневные карты с стабильной структурой и тоном действия","ar":"مصمم بطاقات أوراكل اليومية هو نظام تحليل المصير الذي يولد بطاقات يومية موجزة ذات هيكل مستقر وطون عمل","en":"基于紫微斗数的命理分析系统，使用deepseek等大语言模型进行解读。目前是情人节版本，支持姻缘推算。"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Oracle Daily Card Composer - 基于紫微斗数的命理分析","ja":"Oracle Daily Card Composer - 紫微斗数