sección de lanzamiento no publicada"],"fr":["Mettez à jour la section non publiée de CHANGELOG.md","Lisez la version actuelle du plugin depuis publishpress-hub-statistics.php","Suivez le format de journal des modifications du projet","Incluez la date actuelle dans le journal des modifications","Identifiez les entrées sous la section non publiée"],"de":["Aktualisieren Sie den unveröffentlichten Abschnitt von CHANGELOG.md","Lesen Sie die aktuelle Plugin-Version aus publishpress-hub-statistics.php","Befolgen Sie das Änderungsprotokoll-Format des Projekts","Schließen Sie das aktuelle Datum in das Änderungsprotokoll ein","Identifizieren Sie die Einträge unter dem unveröffentlichten Abschnitt"],"pt":["Atualiza a seção de lançamento não divulgada do CHANGELOG.md","Lê a versão atual do plugin de publishpress-hub-statistics.php","Lê CHANGELOG.md para identificar a seção de lançamento não divulgada","Segue o formato de changelog do projeto","Atualiza a data de lançamento","Melhora a organização do CHANGELOG.md"],"ru":["Обновляет неразвернутый раздел CHANGELOG.md","Читает текущую версию плагина из publishpress-hub-statistics.php","Читает CHANGELOG.md для определения неразвернутого раздела","Следует формату журнала изменений проекта","Обновляет дату выпуска","Улучшает организацию CHANGELOG.md"],"ar":["يحدّث القسم غير المنشور من CHANGELOG.md","يقرأ إصدار البرنامج المساعد الحالي من publishpress-hub-statistics.php","يقرأ CHANGELOG.md لتحديد القسم غير المنشور","يتبع تنسيق سجل التعديلات للمشروع","يحدّث تاريخ الإصدار","يحسن تنظيم CHANGELOG.md"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Prepare Changelog for Release","CHANGELOG.md","插件","变更日志","开发者工具","自动化","项目管理"],"ja":["Prepare Changelog for Release","CHANGELOG.md","プラグイン","変更ログ","開発者ツール","自動化","プロジェクト管理"],"ko":["Prepare Changelog for Release","CHANGELOG.md","플러그인","변경 로그","개발자 도구","자동화","프로젝트 관리"],"es":["registro de cambios","lanzamiento de plugin","CHANGELOG.md","publishpress","plugin de WordPress","desarrollo de plugins","herramientas de desarrollo","registro de versiones"],"fr":["journal des modifications","sortie de plugin","CHANGELOG.md","publishpress","plugin WordPress","développement de plugins","outils de développement","journal des versions"],"de":["Änderungsprotokoll","Plugin-Veröffentlichung","CHANGELOG.md","publishpress","WordPress-Plugin","Plugin-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Versionsprotokoll"],"pt":["Prepare Changelog para Lançamento","CHANGELOG.md","plugin","versão do plugin","data de lançamento","formato de changelog","organização do CHANGELOG.md","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Подготовка журнала изменений для выпуска","CHANGELOG.md","плагин","версия плагина","дата выпуска","формат журнала изменений","организация CHANGELOG.md","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["إعداد سجل التغييرات للإصدار","CHANGELOG.md","برنامج مساعد","إصدار البرنامج المساعد","تاريخ الإصدار","تنسيق سجل التعديلات","تنظيم CHANGELOG.md","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"publishpress","repo":"publishpress-future","repoPath":"publishpress/publishpress-future","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prepare-changelog-release","description":"Prepares the CHANGELOG.md file for release by updating the [Unreleased] section with the current plugin version and date. Use when the user asks to prepare changelog for release, update changelog for release, or finalize changelog entries.","bodyPreview":"# Prepare Changelog for Release\n\nUpdates the unreleased section of CHANGELOG.md with the current plugin version and date, following the project''s changelog format.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen preparing the changelog for release:\n\n1. **Read the current plugin version** from `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` (Version field in the file header)\n\n2. **Read CHANGELOG.md** to identify:\n   - The [Unreleased] section (typically starts at line 4)\n   - All entries under [Unreleased] (bullet points between [Unre","body":"# Prepare Changelog for Release\n\nUpdates the unreleased section of CHANGELOG.md with the current plugin version and date, following the project''s changelog format.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen preparing the changelog for release:\n\n1. **Read the current plugin version** from `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` (Version field in the file header)\n\n2. **Read CHANGELOG.md** to identify:\n   - The [Unreleased] section (typically starts at line 4)\n   - All entries under [Unreleased] (bullet points between [Unreleased] and the next version)\n\n3. **Update the changelog** by replacing the [Unreleased] header with:\n   ```\n   [VERSION] - DD MMM, YYYY\n   ```\n   Where:\n   - VERSION is the current version from the plugin file\n   - DD is the day (2 digits)\n   - MMM is the month (3-letter abbreviation: Jan, Feb, Mar, Apr, May, Jun, Jul, Aug, Sep, Oct, Nov, Dec)\n   - YYYY is the 4-digit year\n\n4. **Add a new [Unreleased] section** at the top (after line 3) with empty content:\n   ```\n   [Unreleased]\n\n   ```\n\n## Format Requirements\n\n- Use exactly one blank line between sections\n- Maintain the existing bullet point format for entries\n- Follow the format: `[VERSION] - DD MMM, YYYY` (e.g., `[1.0.0] - 02 Feb, 2026`)\n- Add comma after day in the date\n- Use 3-letter month abbreviation\n\n## Example Transformation\n\n**Before:**\n```markdown\nThe format is based on [Keep a Changelog](http://keepachangelog.com/)\nand this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).\n\n[Unreleased]\n\n- Added: New feature X\n- Fixed: Bug in feature Y\n\n[1.0.0] - 02 Feb, 2026\n```\n\n**After (assuming version 1.1.0 and date 05 Feb, 2026):**\n```markdown\nThe format is based on [Keep a Changelog](http://keepachangelog.com/)\nand this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).\n\n[Unreleased]\n\n[1.1.0] - 05 Feb, 2026\n\n- Added: New feature X\n- Fixed: Bug in feature Y\n\n[1.0.0] - 02 Feb, 2026\n```\n\n## Month Abbreviations Reference\n\n| Month | Abbreviation |\n|-------|--------------|\n| January | Jan |\n| February | Feb |\n| March | Mar |\n| April | Apr |\n| May | May |\n| June | Jun |\n| July | Jul |\n| August | Aug |\n| September | Sep |\n| October | Oct |\n| November | Nov |\n| December | Dec |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:04:25.450Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated changelog management and version control.","zh":"适用于需要自动化变更日志管理和版本控制的开发代理","ja":"自動化された変更ログ管理とバージョン管理を必要とする開発エージェントに最適","ko":"자동화된 변경 로그 관리 및 버전 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión automatizada de registros de cambios y control de versiones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion automatique des journaux des modifications et du contrôle de version.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Änderungsprotokollverwaltung und Versionskontrolle benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento de changelog automatizado e controle de versão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированного управления журналом изменений и управления версиями.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة سجل التغييرات الآلي وإدارة الإصدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to update the unreleased section of CHANGELOG.md with the current plugin version and date, following the project''s changelog format, utilizing file reading and writing capabilities for `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` and CHANGELOG.md.","zh":"赋予代理更新CHANGELOG.md中未发布部分的当前插件版本和日期，遵循项目的变更日志格式，利用文件读写能力为`publishpress-hub-statistics.php`和CHANGELOG.md","ja":"エージェントに、CHANGELOG.mdの未リリースセクションを現在のプラグインバージョンと日付で更新する権限を与え、プロジェクトの変更ログ形式に従い、`publishpress-hub-statistics.php`とCHANGELOG.mdのファイル読み書き能力を使用する","ko":"에이전트가 CHANGELOG.md의 미발행 섹션을 현재 플러그인 버전 및 날짜로 업데이트할 수 있도록 허용하고, 프로젝트의 변경 로그 형식을 따르며, `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` 및 CHANGELOG.md의 파일 읽기/쓰기 기능을 사용","es":"Permite a los agentes actualizar la sección de sin lanzar en CHANGELOG.md con la versión actual del plugin y la fecha, siguiendo el formato de registro de cambios del proyecto, utilizando capacidades de lectura y escritura de archivos para `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` y CHANGELOG.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour la section non publiée de CHANGELOG.md avec la version actuelle du plugin et la date, en suivant le format de journal des modifications du projet, en utilisant les capacités de lecture et d''écriture de fichiers pour `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` et CHANGELOG.md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den unveröffentlichten Abschnitt in CHANGELOG.md mit der aktuellen Plugin-Version und dem Datum zu aktualisieren, indem sie das Änderungsprotokollformat des Projekts befolgen und die Dateilese- und -schreibfunktionen für `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` und CHANGELOG.md nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a atualizar a seção não lançada do CHANGELOG.md com a versão atual do plug-in e data, seguindo o formato do changelog do projeto, utilizando capacidades de leitura e gravação de arquivos para `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` e CHANGELOG.md.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обновлять нерелизированную секцию CHANGELOG.md с текущей версией плагина и датой, следуя формату журнала изменений проекта, используя возможности чтения и записи файлов для `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` и CHANGELOG.md.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من تحديث القسم غير المنشور من CHANGELOG.md بالإصدار الحالي للبرنامج المساعد وتاريخه ، اتباعًا لتنسيق سجل التغييرات للمشروع ، باستخدام إمكانيات قراءة وكتابة الملفات لـ `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` و CHANGELOG.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating changelog updates for new releases","Generating version-specific entries in CHANGELOG.md","Parsing plugin versions from `publishpress-hub-statistics.php`"],"zh":["自动化新版本的变更日志更新","在CHANGELOG.md中生成特定版本的条目","从`publishpress-hub-statistics.php`解析插件版本"],"ja":["新しいリリースの変更ログを自動化する","CHANGELOG.mdにバージョン固有のエントリを生成する","`publishpress-hub-statistics.php`からプラグインバージョンを解析する"],"ko":["새 릴리스의 변경 로그 자동화","CHANGELOG.md에 버전별 항목 생성","`publishpress-hub-statistics.php`에서 플러그인 버전 파싱"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones del registro de cambios para nuevos lanzamientos","Generar entradas específicas de la versión en CHANGELOG.md","Analizar las versiones del plugin desde `publishpress-hub-statistics.php`"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour du journal des modifications pour les nouveaux lancements","Générer des entrées spécifiques à la version dans CHANGELOG.md","Analyser les versions du plugin à partir de `publishpress-hub-statistics.php`"],"de":["Automatisieren von Änderungsprotokoll-Updates für neue Veröffentlichungen","Erstellen von versionspezifischen Einträgen in CHANGELOG.md","Analysieren von Plugin-Versionen aus `publishpress-hub-statistics.php`"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de changelog para novos lançamentos","Gerar entradas específicas de versão em CHANGELOG.md","Analise de versões de plug-ins a partir de `publishpress-hub-statistics.php`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления журнала изменений для новых релизов","Генерировать версияспецифичные записи в CHANGELOG.md","Парсинг версий плагинов из `publishpress-hub-statistics.php`"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات سجل التغييرات آليًا لإصدارات جديدة","توليد إدخالات محددة بالإصدار في CHANGELOG.md","تحليل إصدارات البرامج المساعدة من `publishpress-hub-statistics.php`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` and CHANGELOG.md files","Limited to projects using the specified changelog format"],"zh":["需要访问`publishpress-hub-statistics.php`和CHANGELOG.md文件","仅限于使用指定变更日志格式的项目"],"ja":["`publishpress-hub-statistics.php`とCHANGELOG.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","指定された変更ログ形式を使用するプロジェクトのみに限定"],"ko":["`publishpress-hub-statistics.php` 및 CHANGELOG.md 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","지정된 변경 로그 형식을 사용하는 프로젝트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` y CHANGELOG.md","Limitado a proyectos que utilizan el formato de registro de cambios especificado"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` et CHANGELOG.md","Limité aux projets utilisant le format de journal des modifications spécifié"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Dateien `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` und CHANGELOG.md","Begrenzt auf Projekte, die das angegebene Änderungsprotokollformat verwenden"],"pt":["Exige acesso aos arquivos `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` e CHANGELOG.md","Limitado a projetos que utilizam o formato de changelog especificado"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` и CHANGELOG.md","Ограничен проектами, использующими указанный формат журнала изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الملفات `publishpress-hub-statistics.php` و CHANGELOG.md","محدود بمشاريع تستخدم تنسيق سجل التغييرات المحدد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
