Skills Skill Authoring","إنشاء مهارات","Rust","TS/Python","SKILL.md","تصريح المهارات","تطوير المهارات"]}},"owner":"Geeksfino","repo":"openskills","repoPath":"Geeksfino/openskills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openskills-skill-authoring","description":"Create and refine OpenSkills-compatible skills (SKILL.md + optional resources) with strong metadata, clear activation triggers, and reliable execution guidance.","bodyPreview":"# OpenSkills Skill Authoring\n\nUse this skill when creating or updating skills under `examples/skills` or any OpenSkills-compatible skill directory.\n\n## Authoring Standard\n\nEach skill directory should include:\n\n- `SKILL.md` (required)\n- optional `scripts/`, `references/`, `assets/`\n\n## SKILL.md Requirements\n\n- YAML frontmatter with:\n  - `name`\n  - `description`\n- Body with concise instructions and practical execution flow.\n- Description must include both:\n  - what the skill does\n  - when to activ","body":"# OpenSkills Skill Authoring\n\nUse this skill when creating or updating skills under `examples/skills` or any OpenSkills-compatible skill directory.\n\n## Authoring Standard\n\nEach skill directory should include:\n\n- `SKILL.md` (required)\n- optional `scripts/`, `references/`, `assets/`\n\n## SKILL.md Requirements\n\n- YAML frontmatter with:\n  - `name`\n  - `description`\n- Body with concise instructions and practical execution flow.\n- Description must include both:\n  - what the skill does\n  - when to activate it\n\n## Writing Guidance\n\n1. Keep core instructions short; move details to `references/`.\n2. Prefer deterministic scripts for fragile or repetitive steps.\n3. Include explicit input/output expectations.\n4. Avoid vague names and ambiguous activation phrases.\n\n## Validation Flow\n\n1. Ensure directory name matches skill `name` semantics.\n2. Verify skill discovery and activation behavior in runtime or example agent.\n3. If scripts are present, verify paths and execution assumptions.\n\n## Output Format\n\n- Skill metadata quality review\n- Instruction clarity review\n- Activation trigger quality review\n- Suggested revisions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:04:28.769Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing advanced skill authoring and management capabilities with progressive disclosure of skill metadata","zh":"非常适合Claude、AutoGPT和LangChain等需要高级技能编写和管理功能的AI代理，具有逐步披露技能元数据的功能","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの高度なスキルオーサリングと管理機能が必要なAIエージェントに最適であり、スキルメタデータの進歩的な開示機能を備えている","ko":"클라우드, 오토GPT, 랑체인 등과 같은 고급 스킬 작성 및 관리 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 스킬 메타데이터의渐进적 공개 기능을 갖추고 있다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación y administración de habilidades con divulgación progresiva de metadatos de habilidades","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités avancées de création et de gestion de compétences avec une divulgation progressive des métadonnées de compétences","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT und LangChain, die erweiterte Fähigkeitsautoren- und Managementfunktionen mit progressiver Offenlegung von Fähigkeitsmetadaten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de autorização e gerenciamento de habilidades com divulgação progressiva de metadados de habilidades","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, AutoGPT и LangChain, которые требуют продвинутых возможностей написания и управления навыками с постепенным раскрытием метаданных навыков","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتنفيذ المهارات وإدارتها مع إفصاح تدريجي عن بيانات وصف المهارات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage skills with YAML frontmatter, concise instructions, and practical execution flows, utilizing Rust runtime with TS/Python bindings, and supporting Seatbelt and WASM sandboxing","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理技能的能力，使用YAML前置内容、简洁的指令和实用的执行流程，利用Rust运行时和TS/Python绑定，并支持Seatbelt和WASM沙盒","ja":"エージェントにスキルを作成して管理する能力を与え、YAMLフロントマター、簡潔な指示、実用的実行フローを使用し、RustランタイムとTS/Pythonバインディングを利用し、SeatbeltとWASMサンドボックスをサポートする","ko":"에이전트가 스킬을 생성하고 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, YAML 프론트매터, 간결한 지시 및 실제 실행 흐름을 사용하고, 러스트 런타임 및 TS/파이썬 바인딩을 활용하며, 시트벨트 및 WASM 샌드박스를 지원한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y administrar habilidades con YAML frontmatter, instrucciones concisas y flujos de ejecución prácticos, utilizando tiempo de ejecución de Rust con enlaces TS/Python y compatible con Seatbelt y sandboxing de WASM","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des compétences avec YAML frontmatter, des instructions concises et des flux d''exécution pratiques, en utilisant le runtime Rust avec des liens TS/Python et en prenant en charge Seatbelt et le sandboxing de WASM","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Fähigkeiten mit YAML-Frontmatter, präzisen Anweisungen und praktischen Ausführungsflüssen zu erstellen und zu verwalten, wobei die Rust-Laufzeit mit TS/Python-Bindings verwendet wird und Seatbelt sowie WASM-Sandboxing unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar habilidades com YAML frontmatter, instruções concisas e fluxos de execução práticos, utilizando tempo de execução Rust com vinculações TS/Python e com suporte a Seatbelt e sandboxing WASM","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять навыками с помощью YAML-заголовков, кратких инструкций и практических потоков выполнения, используя среду выполнения Rust с привязками TS/Python и поддержкой Seatbelt и sandboxing WASM","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء إدارة المهارات باستخدام YAML frontmatter و تعليمات موجزة و تدفقات تنفيذ عملي، واستخدام وقت تشغيل Rust مع ربط TS/Python ودعم حزام الأمان و sandboxing WASM"},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring skills with structured metadata and content","Creating and updating skills 