.","de":"Das Monorepo von Podverse bietet eine schnelle Referenz für gängige Muster, die in der podverse-api-Anwendung verwendet werden.","pt":"O Podverse API fornece padrões de desenvolvimento para aplicações e infraestrutura. Aprenda sobre o monorepo e os módulos disponíveis","ru":"API Podverse предоставляет шаблоны разработки для приложений и инфраструктуры. Узнайте о монорепозитории и доступных модулях","ar":"توفر API Podverse أنماطًا لتطوير التطبيقات والبنية التحتية. تعرف على مونوريبوزيتوري والوحدات المتاحة","en":"Podverse monorepo for all infrastructure, modules, applications, and deployments"},"definition":{"en":"Podverse monorepo for all infrastructure, modules, applications, and deployments"},"features":{"zh":["API","ORM","Message Queue","Helper Packages","Monorepo"],"ja":["API","ORM","Message Queue","Helper Packages","Monorepo"],"ko":["API","ORM","Message Queue","Helper Packages","Monorepo"],"es":["API app location en `apps/api/`","Paquetes de ayuda como `@podverse/helpers`","Entidades de ORM en `@podverse/orm`","Cola de mensajes en `@podverse/mq`","Configuración de backend en `@podverse/helpers-backend`"],"fr":["Emplacement de l''application API en `apps/api/`","Paquets d''aide tels que `@podverse/helpers`","Entités de ORM en `@podverse/orm`","File d''attente de messages en `@podverse/mq`","Configuration de backend en `@podverse/helpers-backend`"],"de":["API-App-Location in `apps/api/`","Hilfspakete wie `@podverse/helpers`","ORM-Entitäten in `@podverse/orm`","Nachrichtenwarteschlange in `@podverse/mq`","Backend-Konfiguration in `@podverse/helpers-backend`"],"pt":["Monorepo para infraestrutura e aplicações","Módulos de ajuda para validação e requisições","Entidades de ORM para gerenciamento de dados","Fila de mensagens para processamento assíncrono","Configuração de backend para personalização"],"ru":["Монорепозиторий для инфраструктуры и приложений","Модули помощи для валидации и запросов","Сущности ORM для управления данными","Очередь сообщений для асинхронной обработки","Конфигурация бэкенда для настройки"],"ar":["مونوريبوزيتوري للبنية التحتية والتطبيقات","وحدات مساعدة للتحقق والطلبات","كيانات ORM لإدارة البيانات","طابور رسائل للمعالجة غير المتزامنة","تكوين الخلفية للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Podverse API","API","ORM","Message Queue","Helper Packages","Monorepo","API"],"ja":["Podverse API","API","ORM","Message Queue","Helper Packages","Monorepo","API"],"ko":["Podverse API","API","ORM","Message Queue","Helper Packages","Monorepo","API"],"es":["desarrollo de API","patrones de API","monorepo","podverse-api","ORM","cola de mensajes","configuración de backend"],"fr":["développement d''API","modèles d''API","monorepo","podverse-api","ORM","file d''attente de messages","configuration de backend"],"de":["API-Entwicklung","API-Muster","Monorepo","podverse-api","ORM","Nachrichtenwarteschlange","Backend-Konfiguration"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de api","monorepo","padrões de desenvolvimento","infraestrutura como código","aplicações de backend","orm","fila de mensagens","configuração de backend"],"ru":["разработка api","монорепозиторий","шаблоны разработки","инфраструктура как код","приложения бэкенда","orm","очередь сообщений","конфигурация бэкенда"],"ar":["تطوير api","مونوريبوزيتوري","أنماط التطوير","البنية التحتية كود","تطبيقات الخلفية","orm","طابور الرسائل","تكوين الخلفية"]}},"owner":"podverse","repo":"podverse","repoPath":"podverse/podverse","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"podverse-api-patterns","description":"Common patterns for the podverse-api Express application","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Podverse API Development Patterns\n\nThis skill provides quick reference for common patterns used in the podverse-api application.\n\n## Monorepo Context\n\n- **API app location**: `apps/api/`\n- **Helper packages** (from `packages/helpers*/`): `@podverse/helpers`, `@podverse/helpers-validation`, `@podverse/helpers-requests`, `@podverse/helpers-backend`, `@podverse/helpers-config`\n- **ORM entities**: `@podverse/orm` (from `packages/orm/`)\n- **Message queue**: `@podverse/mq` (from `packages/mq/`)\n- **","body":"# Podverse API Development Patterns\n\nThis skill provides quick reference for common patterns used in the podverse-api application.\n\n## Monorepo Context\n\n- **API app location**: `apps/api/`\n- **Helper packages** (from `packages/helpers*/`): `@podverse/helpers`, `@podverse/helpers-validation`, `@podverse/helpers-requests`, `@podverse/helpers-backend`, `@podverse/helpers-config`\n- **ORM entities**: `@podverse/orm` (from `packages/orm/`)\n- **Message queue**: `@podverse/mq` (from `packages/mq/`)\n- **Feed parsing**: `@podverse/parser` (from `packages/parser/`)\n\n## Key Dependencies\n\n| Package                       | Purpose                                    |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| Helper packages               | Types, DTOs, utilities, validation, config |\n| `@podverse/orm`               | Database entities and services             |\n| `@podverse/mq`                | Message queue operations                   |\n| `@podverse/parser`            | Feed parsing                               |\n| `@podverse/external-services` | Third-party service integrations           |\n| `@podverse/notifications`     | Push notifications                         |\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Route Definition\n\n```typescript\n// apps/api/src/routes/podcast.ts\nimport { Router } from ''express'';\nimport { PodcastController } from ''../controllers/podcast'';\nimport { asyncHandler } from ''../lib/asyncHandler'';\n\nconst router = Router();\n\nrouter.get(''/:id'', asyncHandler(PodcastController.getById));\nrouter.post(''/'', asyncHandler(PodcastController.create));\n\nexport default router;\n```\n\n### Controller Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// apps/api/src/controllers/podcast.ts\nimport { Request, Response } from ''express'';\nimport { PodcastService } from ''@podverse/orm'';\n\nexport const PodcastController = {\n  async getById(req: Request, res: Response): Promise<void> {\n    try {\n      const { id } = req.params;\n      const podcast = await PodcastService.getById(id);\n\n      if (!podcast) {\n        res.status(404).json({ error: ''Podcast not found'' });\n        return;\n      }\n\n      res.json(podcast);\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(''Error getting podcast:'', error);\n      res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal server error'' });\n      return;\n    }\n  },\n\n  async create(req: Request, res: Response): Promise<void> {\n    try {\n      const data = req.body;\n      const podcast = await PodcastService.create(data);\n      res.status(201).json(podcast);\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(''Error creating podcast:'', error);\n      res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal server error'' });\n      return;\n    }\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### TypeScript Express Patterns\n\n#### Route Handler Return Values\n\nExpress route handlers should be typed as `Promise<void>` (or `void` for sync). Since `res.json()` returns a `Response` object, avoid using `return` with response methods.\n\n**Correct patterns:**\n\n```typescript\n// Early exit with status (use return for control flow)\nif (!item) {\n  res.status(404).json({ error: ''Not found'' });\n  return; // Return void, not Response\n}\n\n// Success response (no return needed)\nres.json(data);\n```\n\n**Incorrect pattern:**\n\n```typescript\n// DON''T do this - returns Response instead of void\nreturn res.json(data);\nreturn res.status(404).json({ error: ''Not found'' });\n```\n\n#### Exception: Early Exit Convenience\n\nThe `return` keyword is acceptable for early exits when combined with response methods for single-line control flow:\n\n```typescript\nif (!user) {\n  res.status(401).json({ error: ''Unauthorized'' });\n  return;\n}\n```\n\n#### Catch Block Returns\n\nAlways return explicitly in catch blocks to satisfy TypeScript''s `noImplicitReturns`:\n\n```typescript\ntry {\n  // ... handler logic\n  res.json(result);\n} catch (error) {\n  handleError(res, error);\n  return; // Required even though handleError sends response\n}\n```\n\n**With conditional response:**\n\n```typescript\n} catch (error) {\n  console.error(''Error:'', error);\n  if (!res.headersSent) {\n    res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal error'' });\n  }\n  return;  // Required for all code paths\n}\n```\n\n### Rate Limiting\n\n```typescript\n// apps/api/src/lib/rateLimiter.ts\nimport { rateLimitAuthEndpoint, rateLimitEndpoint } from ''@api/lib/rateLimiter'';\n\n// For authenticated endpoints (per-user rate limiting)\nrouter.get(\n  ''/download-data'',\n  rateLimitAuthEndpoint({ windowMs: 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000, max: 3 }),\n  asyncHandler(AccountController.downloadData)\n);\n\n// For public endpoints (IP-based rate limiting)\nrouter.post(\n  ''/create'',\n  rateLimitEndpoint({ windowMs: 10 * 60 * 1000, max: 3 }),\n  asyncHandler(AccountController.create)\n);\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n\n```typescript\n// Use asyncHandler to catch errors automatically\nimport { asyncHandler } from ''../lib/asyncHandler'';\n\nrouter.get(\n  ''/:id'',\n  asyncHandler(async (req, res) => {\n    // Errors here are caught and passed to error middleware\n    const result = await riskyOperation();\n    res.json(result);\n  })\n);\n```\n\n### Environment Validation\n\nSee `apps/api/src/lib/startup/validation.ts` for environment variable validation patterns.\n\n**Lighthouse alignment:** When validation changes here, update\n`tools/web-perf/lighthouse/.env.api.example` and `.env.api` so the Lighthouse runner\nstays in sync with API startup validation.\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\napps/api/\n├── src/\n│   ├── controllers/     # Request handlers\n│   ├── routes/          # Route definitions\n│   ├── middleware/      # Express middleware\n│   ├── lib/             # Utilities and helpers\n│   │   ├── startup/     # App initialization\n│   │   └── rateLimiter.ts\n│   └── index.ts         # Entry point\n├── package.json\n└── tsconfig.json\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **[Web Patterns](../web/SKILL.md)** - Client-side patterns\n- **[ORM Patterns](../orm/SKILL.md)** - Database patterns\n- **[Global Patterns](../global/SKILL.md)** - Monorepo conventions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:04:58.927Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing structured monorepo patterns and advanced ORM entity management","zh":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing structured monorepo patterns and advanced ORM entity management","ja":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing structured monorepo patterns and advanced ORM entity management","ko":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing structured monorepo patterns and advanced ORM entity management","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de API que necesitan patrones de monorepo estructurados y gestión avanzada de entidades ORM","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''API nécessitant des modèles de monorepo structurés et une gestion avancée d''entités ORM","de":"Perfekt für API-Entwicklungsagenten, die strukturierte Monorepo-Muster und erweiterte ORM-Entitätsverwaltung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento de API que necessitam de padrões de monorepo estruturados e gerenciamento avançado de entidades ORM","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки API, которым требуются структурированные шаблоны monorepo и продвинутый менеджмент сущностей ORM","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الذي يحتاج إلى نمط مونوريبو منظم وادارة كيانات ORM متقدمة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Podverse API development patterns, utilizing helper packages like @podverse/helpers and @podverse/helpers-validation, and integrating with ORM entities from @podverse/orm, to streamline API application development and message queue management with @podverse/mq","zh":"Empowers agents to leverage Podverse API development patterns, utilizing helper packages like @podverse/helpers and @podverse/helpers-validation, and integrating with ORM entities from @podverse/orm, to streamline API application development and message queue management with @podverse/mq","ja":"Empowers agents to leverage Podverse API development patterns, utilizing helper packages like @podverse/helpers and @podverse/helpers-validation, and integrating with ORM entities from @podverse/orm, to streamline API application development and message queue management with @podverse/mq","ko":"Empowers agents to leverage Podverse API development patterns, utilizing helper packages like @podverse/helpers and @podverse/helpers-validation, and integrating with ORM entities from @podverse/orm, to streamline API application development and message queue management with @podverse/mq","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar los patrones de desarrollo de API de Podverse, utilizando paquetes de ayuda como @podverse/helpers y @podverse/helpers-validation, e integrándose con entidades ORM de @podverse/orm, para agilizar el desarrollo de aplicaciones de API y la administración de colas de mensajes con @podverse/mq","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les modèles de développement d''API de Podverse, en utilisant des packages d''assistance tels que @podverse/helpers et @podverse/helpers-validation, et en intégrant des entités ORM de @podverse/orm, pour rationaliser le développement d''applications d''API et la gestion de files d''attente de messages avec @podverse/mq","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Podverse-API-Entwicklungsmuster zu nutzen, indem sie Hilfspakete wie @podverse/helpers und @podverse/helpers-validation verwenden und sich in ORM-Entitäten von @podverse/orm integrieren, um die API-Anwendungsentwicklung und die Nachrichtenwarteschlangenverwaltung mit @podverse/mq zu rationalisieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem os padrões de desenvolvimento de API do Podverse, utilizando pacotes de ajuda como @podverse/helpers e @podverse/helpers-validation, e integrando com entidades ORM do @podverse/orm, para agilizar o desenvolvimento de aplicações de API e gerenciamento de filas de mensagens com @podverse/mq","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать шаблоны разработки API Podverse, используя помощники как @podverse/helpers и @podverse/helpers-validation, и интегрируя с сущностями ORM из @podverse/orm, для оптимизации разработки приложений API и управления очередями сообщений с @podverse/mq","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على الاستفادة من أنماط تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من Podverse، باستخدام حزم مساعدة مثل @podverse/helpers و @podverse/helpers-validation، وتكامل مع كيانات ORM من @podverse/orm، لتبسيط تطوير تطبيقات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وإدارة طوابير الرسائل مع @podverse/mq"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing consistent API app structures within the apps/api/ directory","Utilizing helper packages for validation and requests","Integrating with message queues for efficient task handling"],"zh":["Implementing consistent API app structures within the apps/api/ directory","Utilizing helper packages for validation and requests","Integrating with message queues for efficient task handling"],"ja":["Implementing consistent API app structures within the apps/api/ directory","Utilizing helper packages for validation and requests","Integrating with message queues for efficient task handling"],"ko":["Implementing consistent API app structures within the apps/api/ directory","Utilizing helper packages for validation and requests","Integrating with message queues for efficient task handling"],"es":["Implementar estructuras de aplicaciones de API coherentes dentro del directorio apps/api/","Utilizar paquetes de ayuda para la validación y las solicitudes","Integrarse con colas de mensajes para un manejo eficiente de tareas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des structures d''applications d''API cohérentes dans le répertoire apps/api/","Utiliser des packages d''assistance pour la validation et les requêtes","S''intégrer à des files d''attente de messages pour un traitement efficace des tâches"],"de":["Konsistente API-App-Strukturen innerhalb des Verzeichnisses apps/api/ implementieren","Hilfspakete für Validierung und Anfragen nutzen","Sich in Nachrichtenwarteschlangen integrieren, um Aufgaben effizient zu bearbeiten"],"pt":["Implementação de estruturas de aplicativos de API consistentes dentro do diretório apps/api/","Utilização de pacotes de ajuda para validação e solicitações","Integração com filas de mensagens para manipulação eficiente de tarefas"],"ru":["Реализация последовательных структур приложений API внутри директории apps/api/","Использование помощников для валидации и запросов","Интеграция с очередями сообщений для эффективного xử lý задач"],"ar":["تنفيذ هياكل تطبيقات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المتسقة داخل الدليل apps/api/","استخدام حزم المساعدة للتحقق والطلبات","التكامل مع طوابير الرسائل لمعالجة المهام بكفاءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Podverse monorepo setup","Specific to Podverse API application"],"zh":["Requires Podverse monorepo setup","Specific to Podverse API application"],"ja":["Requires Podverse monorepo setup","Specific to Podverse API application"],"ko":["Requires Podverse monorepo setup","Specific to Podverse API application"],"es":["Requiere configuración de monorepo de Podverse","Específico para la aplicación de API de Podverse"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de monorepo de Podverse","Spécifique à l''application d''API de Podverse"],"de":["Benötigt Podverse-Monorepo-Setup","Spezifisch für die Podverse-API-Anwendung"],"pt":["Exige configuração de monorepo do Podverse","Específico para aplicativos de API do Podverse"],"ru":["Требует настройки monorepo Podverse","Конкретно для приложений API Podverse"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مونوريبو من Podverse","محدد لتطبيقات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من Podverse"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
