할 수 있도록 단순하고 모듈화된 코드를 제공합니다","es":"Las reglas de API son un conjunto de pautas para desarrolladores que trabajan con LLM y Python","fr":"Les règles d''API sont un ensemble de lignes directrices pour les développeurs qui travaillent avec LLM et Python","de":"Die API-Regeln sind eine Sammlung von Richtlinien für Entwickler, die mit LLM und Python arbeiten","pt":"O assistente de programação Python ajuda a avaliar diferentes LLMs com regras de API","ru":"Помощник по программированию Python помогает оценивать различные LLM с правилами API","ar":"مساعد البرمجة بايثون يساعد في تقييم مختلف LLMs مع قواعد واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 OpenAI API","提供简单、模块化的代码","支持 Pandas 和 NumPy 库","用于评估不同 LLM 模型","提高开发效率"],"ja":["OpenAI API をサポート","シンプルでモジュラーなコードを提供","Pandas と NumPy ライブラリをサポート","さまざまな LLM モデルを評価","開発効率を向上させる"],"ko":["OpenAI API 지원","단순하고 모듈화된 코드 제공","Pandas 및 NumPy 라이브러리 지원","다양한 LLM 모델 평가","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Código Python bien documentado","Integración con OpenAI API","Uso de Pandas y NumPy","Evaluación de LLM","Código modular y limpio"],"fr":["Code Python bien documenté","Intégration avec OpenAI API","Utilisation de Pandas et NumPy","Évaluation de LLM","Code modulaire et propre"],"de":["Gut dokumentierter Python-Code","Integration mit OpenAI API","Verwendung von Pandas und NumPy","Auswertung von LLM","Modularer und sauberer Code"],"pt":["Suporte à OpenAI API","Trabalho com arquivos anexos","Uso de bibliotecas Pandas e NumPy","Avaliação de diferentes LLMs","Código Python bem documentado"],"ru":["Поддержка OpenAI API","Работа с файлами-приложениями","Использование библиотек Pandas и NumPy","Оценка различных LLM","Хорошо документированный код Python"],"ar":["دعم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات OpenAI","العمل مع الملفات المرفقة","استخدام مكتبات Pandas و NumPy","تقييم مختلف LLMs","كود بايثون مدون جيدًا"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API 规则","Python 编程助手","LLM 模型评估","OpenAI API","Pandas","NumPy","开发效率","编程助手"],"ja":["API ルール","Python プログラミング アシスタント","LLM モデル評価","OpenAI API","Pandas","NumPy","開発効率","プログラミング アシスタント"],"ko":["API 규칙","Python 프로그래밍 어시스턴트","LLM 모델 평가","OpenAI API","Pandas","NumPy","개발 효율성","프로그래밍 어시스턴트"],"es":["reglas de API","desarrollo de LLM","programación Python","OpenAI API","Pandas","NumPy","evaluación de LLM","código modular"],"fr":["règles d''API","développement de LLM","programmation Python","OpenAI API","Pandas","NumPy","évaluation de LLM","code modulaire"],"de":["API-Regeln","Entwicklung von LLM","Python-Programmierung","OpenAI API","Pandas","NumPy","Auswertung von LLM","modularer Code"],"pt":["regras de API","desenvolvedores","assistente de programação Python","OpenAI API","Pandas","NumPy","LLMs","código Python","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["правила API","разработчики","помощник по программированию Python","OpenAI API","Pandas","NumPy","LLMs","код Python","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["قواعد واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","المطورون","مساعد البرمجة بايثون","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات OpenAI","Pandas","NumPy","LLMs","كود بايثون","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"skysheng7","repo":"tech_summary_llm_arena","repoPath":"skysheng7/tech_summary_llm_arena","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-rules","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Python Programming Assistant\n\n## Your Role\n\nYou are a helpful coding assistant for a LLM-as-a-judge evaluation task. You will write well-documented, simple, modular, clean python code to help the user evaluate different LLMs.\n\n### Key Documentation\n\n- OpenAI API: <https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference>\n- OpenAI API file attachments: <https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/pdf-files>\n- Pandas: <https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/>\n- NumPy: <https://numpy.org/doc/stable/>\n\n### Model Inform","body":"# Python Programming Assistant\n\n## Your Role\n\nYou are a helpful coding assistant for a LLM-as-a-judge evaluation task. You will write well-documented, simple, modular, clean python code to help the user evaluate different LLMs.\n\n### Key Documentation\n\n- OpenAI API: <https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference>\n- OpenAI API file attachments: <https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/pdf-files>\n- Pandas: <https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/>\n- NumPy: <https://numpy.org/doc/stable/>\n\n### Model Information\n\n- **Current Model:** GPT-5.2 (released December 11, 2025)\n- **Model Name:** `gpt-5.2-2025-12-11`\n\n### Code Simplicity\n\n- Use the simplest code possible\n- Minimize package dependencies, only use what''s absolutely necessary\n- Avoid advanced Python features, no list comprehensions unless specifically taught, no complex lambda functions\n- Break down complex operations into simple, readable steps\n- Add clear comments explaining what code does\n- Use blank lines to separate logical sections\n- Keep lines under 88 characters when possible\n\n### Variable Naming\n\n- Use descriptive names: `generated_images` not `img` or `x`\n- Use snake_case: `api_key`, NOT `apiKey` NOT `ApiKey`\n- Make names meaningful: `user_prompts`, NOT `data1`\n\n### Function Design\n\n- Each function should do ONE thing\n- Write modular code, break complex tasks into small, reusable functions\n- Always include NumPy-style docstrings explaining purpose, parameters, and returns\n- Use type hints to make code clearer\n- Include default parameter values where appropriate\n\n### API Key Management\n\n**CRITICAL:** Never hardcode API keys in code! Reminder users of this when necessary.\n\n**You will:**\n\n1. Create a `.env` file in project root\n2. Add: `OPENAI_API_KEY=your-actual-key-here`\n3. Add `.env` to `.gitignore`\n4. Use `python-dotenv` to load it\n5. Prompt the user to create the API key and paste the key themselves to the `.env` file before proceeding.\n\nCorrect example of using API key:\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom dotenv import load_dotenv\n\n# Load environment variables from .env file\nload_dotenv()\napi_key = os.getenv(''OPENAI_API_KEY'')\n\nif not api_key:\n    raise ValueError(\"OPENAI_API_KEY not found in environment variables\")\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n\nAlways wrap API calls and file operations in try-except blocks:\n\n```python\ntry:\n    response = client.chat.completions.create(\n        model=\"gpt-5.2-2025-12-11\",\n        messages=[\n            {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpful assistant.\"},\n            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello!\"}\n        ]\n    )\n    result = response.choices[0].message.content\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"Error calling API: {e}\")\n    result = None\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:05:23.324Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to interact with OpenAI API for LLM evaluation tasks, utilizing libraries like Pandas and NumPy.","zh":"非常适合需要与 OpenAI API 交互以进行 LLM 评估任务的 AI 代理，使用像 Pandas 和 NumPy 的库。","ja":"OpenAI API を使用して LLM 評価タスクを実行する必要がある AI エージェントに最適です。Pandas や NumPy などのライブラリを使用します。","ko":"OpenAI API 와 상호 작용하여 LLM 평가 태스크를 수행해야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Pandas 및 NumPy 와 같은 라이브러리를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan interactuar con la API de OpenAI para tareas de evaluación de LLM, utilizando bibliotecas como Pandas y NumPy.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''interagir avec l''API OpenAI pour les tâches d''évaluation de LLM, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme Pandas et NumPy.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die mit der OpenAI-API für LLM-Bewertungsaufgaben interagieren müssen, unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie Pandas und NumPy.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam interagir com a API OpenAI para tarefas de avaliação de LLM, utilizando bibliotecas como Pandas e NumPy.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо взаимодействовать с API OpenAI для задач оценки LLM, используя библиотеки seperti Pandas и NumPy.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى التفاعل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI لأداء مهام تقييم LLM، باستخدام مكتبات مثل Pandas و NumPy."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage the OpenAI API for advanced natural language processing tasks, including file attachments and utilizing libraries like Pandas for data manipulation and NumPy for numerical computations, all while following strict API rules.","zh":"使代理能够利用 OpenAI API 进行高级自然语言处理任务，包括文件附件，并使用像 Pandas 的库进行数据操作和像 NumPy 的库进行数值计算，同时遵守严格的 API 规则。","ja":"エージェントが OpenAI API を使用して高度な自然言語処理タスクを実行できるようにし、ファイルの添付や Pandas を使用したデータ操作、NumPy を使用した数値計算などが可能になります。ただし、厳格な API ルールに従う必要があります。","ko":"에이전트가 OpenAI API를 사용하여 고급 자연어 처리 태스크를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 파일 첨부 및 Pandas를 사용한 데이터 조작과 NumPy를 사용한 수치 계산 등이 가능합니다. 그러나 엄격한 API 규칙을 따라야 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la API de OpenAI para tareas avanzadas de procesamiento de lenguaje natural, incluyendo archivos adjuntos y utilizando bibliotecas como Pandas para la manipulación de datos y NumPy para cálculos numéricos, todo mientras sigue las estrictas reglas de la API.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter l''API OpenAI pour des tâches de traitement avancé du langage naturel, y compris les pièces jointes et en utilisant des bibliothèques comme Pandas pour la manipulation de données et NumPy pour les calculs numériques, le tout en suivant les règles d''API strictes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die OpenAI-API für fortgeschrittene Aufgaben des natürlichen Sprachverarbeitung zu nutzen, einschließlich Dateianhängen und unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie Pandas für Datenmanipulation und NumPy für numerische Berechnungen, all dies unter Einhaltung der strengen API-Regeln.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar a API OpenAI para tarefas avançadas de processamento de linguagem natural, incluindo anexos de arquivos e utilizando bibliotecas como Pandas para manipulação de dados e NumPy para cálculos numéricos, seguindo regras de API estritas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать API OpenAI для продвинутых задач обработки естественного языка, включая файловые вложения и используя библиотеки seperti Pandas для манипуляции данными и NumPy для численных вычислений, при этом соблюдая строгие правила API.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من الاستفادة من واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI لأداء مهام متقدمة في معالجة اللغة الطبيعية، بما في ذلك مرفقات الملفات، واستخدام مكتبات مثل Pandas لتعامل البيانات و NumPy لحسابات رقمية، مع اتباع قواعد واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الصارمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating LLM evaluations with OpenAI API","Generating data visualizations using Pandas and NumPy","Debugging API requests for file attachments"],"zh":["使用 OpenAI API 自动化 LLM 评估","使用 Pandas 和 NumPy 生成数据可视化","调试 API 请求以附加文件"],"ja":["OpenAI API を使用した LLM 評価の自動化","Pandas と NumPy を使用したデータ可視化の生成","ファイルの添付を伴う API リクエストのデバッグ"],"ko":["OpenAI API를 사용한 LLM 평가 자동화","Pandas 및 NumPy를 사용한 데이터 시각화 생성","파일 첨부를伴う API 요청 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar evaluaciones de LLM con la API de OpenAI","Generar visualizaciones de datos usando Pandas y NumPy","Depurar solicitudes de API para archivos adjuntos"],"fr":["Automatiser les évaluations de LLM avec l''API OpenAI","Générer des visualisations de données à l''aide de Pandas et NumPy","Déboguer les requêtes d''API pour les pièces jointes"],"de":["Automatisieren von LLM-Bewertungen mit der OpenAI-API","Erzeugen von Datenvisualisierungen mit Pandas und NumPy","Debuggen von API-Anfragen für Dateianhänge"],"pt":["Automatizar avaliações de LLM com a API OpenAI","Gerar visualizações de dados usando Pandas e NumPy","Depurar solicitações de API para anexos de arquivos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оценку LLM с помощью API OpenAI","Генерировать визуализации данных с помощью Pandas и NumPy","Отладить запросы API для файловых вложений"],"ar":["أتمتة تقييم LLM مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI","генерировать تصورات البيانات باستخدام Pandas و NumPy","تصحيح أخطاء طلبات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للمرفقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI API Key","Python 3.x compatibility required","Dependent on Pandas and NumPy libraries"],"zh":["需要 OpenAI API 密钥","需要 Python 3.x 兼容性","依赖 Pandas 和 NumPy 库"],"ja":["OpenAI API キーが必要","Python 3.x との互換性が必要","Pandas と NumPy ライブラリに依存"],"ko":["OpenAI API 키가 필요합니다","Python 3.x 호환성이 필요합니다","Pandas 및 NumPy 라이브러리에 종속됩니다"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de OpenAI","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python 3.x","Dependiente de las bibliotecas Pandas y NumPy"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API OpenAI","La compatibilité Python 3.x est requise","Dépend des bibliothèques Pandas et NumPy"],"de":["Benötigt einen OpenAI-API-Schlüssel","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken Pandas und NumPy"],"pt":["Requer chave da API OpenAI","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária","Dependente das bibliotecas Pandas e NumPy"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API OpenAI","Требуется совместимость с Python 3.x","Зависит от библиотек Pandas и NumPy"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI","متوافق مع Python 3.x مطلوب","يعتمد على مكتبات Pandas و NumPy"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory/receive-updates', 'community', 'gitwalter', 'cursor-agent-factory', 'gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory', 'receive-updates', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z', '2026-02-18T10:05:42.403Z', NULL, '{"id":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory/receive-updates","name":"receive-updates","description":{"zh":"接收更新技能允许您从Cursor Agent Factory接收和应用更新，包括技能、知识和代理","ja":"更新を受け取るスキルを使用して、Cursor Agent Factoryから更新を取得して適用します","ko":"업데이트 받기 스킬을 사용하여 Cursor Agent Factory에서 업데이트를받고 적용합니다","es":"El skill ''receive-updates'' permite recibir y aplicar actualizaciones de habilidades, conocimiento y agentes desde Cursor Agent Factory. Soporta análisis de diferencias y resolución de conflictos","fr":"Le skill ''receive-updates'' permet de recevoir et d''appliquer des mises à jour de compétences, de connaissances et d''agents à partir de Cursor Agent Factory. Il prend en charge l''analyse de différences et la résolution de conflits","de":"Das Skill ''receive-updates'' ermöglicht das Erhalten und Anwenden von Updates von Fähigkeiten, Wissen und Agenten aus dem Cursor Agent Factory. Es unterstützt Differenzanalyse und Konfliktlösung","pt":"O recurso receive-updates permite que você receba e aplique atualizações do Agente Cursor Factory, incluindo habilidades, conhecimentos e agentes.","ru":"Функция receive-updates позволяет получать и применять обновления от фабрики агентов Cursor, включая навыки, знания и агентов.","ar":"ميزة receive-updates تمكنك من استلام وتطبيق التحديثات من مصنع وكلاء Cursor، بما في ذلك المهارات والمعرفة والوكلاء.","en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stack. Supports blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more. Includes refactoring capabilities for existing projects"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"接收更新 - Cursor Agent Factory 技术","ja":"更新を受け取る - Cursor Agent Factory 技術","ko":"업데이트 받기 - Cursor Agent Factory 기술","es":"Recibir actualizaciones de Cursor Agent Factory","fr":"Réception des mises à jour de Cursor Agent Factory","de":"Erhalten von Updates aus dem Cursor Agent Factory","pt":"Receba Atualizações do Agente Cursor","ru":"Получите обновления от агента Cursor","ar":"استلم التحديثات من وكيل Cursor","en":"receive-updates"},"description":{"zh":"接收更新技能允许您从Cursor Agent Factory接收和应用更新，包括技能、知识和代理","ja":"更新を受け取るスキルを使用して、Cursor Agent Factoryから更新を取得して適用します","ko":"업데이트 받기 스킬을 사용하여 Cursor Agent Factory에서 업데이트를받고 적용합니다","es":"El skill ''receive-updates'' permite recibir y aplicar actualizaciones de habilidades, conocimiento y agentes desde Cursor Agent Factory. Soporta análisis de d...","fr":"Le skill ''receive-updates'' permet de recevoir et d''appliquer des mises à jour de compétences, de connaissances et d''agents à partir de Cursor Agent Factory. ...","de":"Das Skill ''receive-updates'' ermöglicht das Erhalten und Anwenden von Updates von Fähigkeiten, Wissen und Agenten aus dem Cursor Agent Factory. Es unterstützt...","pt":"O recurso receive-updates permite que você receba e aplique atualizações do Agente Cursor Factory, incluindo habilidades, conhecimentos e agentes.","ru":"Функция receive-updates позволяет получать и применять обновления от фабрики агентов Cursor, включая навыки, знания и агентов.","ar":"ميزة receive-updates تمكنك من استلام وتطبيق التحديثات من مصنع وكلاء Cursor، بما في ذلك المهارات والمعرفة والوكلاء.","en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stac..."},"definition":{"en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stack. Supports blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more. Includes refactoring capabilities for existing projects"},"features":{"zh":["支持蓝图技术栈","支持diff分析和冲突解决","支持安全和兼容性补丁","支持模板和模式刷新"],"ja":["ブループリント技術スタックをサポート","diff分析とコンフリクト解決をサポート","セキュリティと互換性のパッチをサポート","テンプレートとパターンの更新をサポート"],"ko":["블루프린트 기술 스택 지원","diff 분석 및 충돌 해결 지원","보안 및 호환성 패치 지원","템플릿 및 패턴 새로고침 지원"],"es":["Recibir actualizaciones de habilidades y conocimiento","Análisis de diferencias y resolución de conflictos","Aplicación segura de actualizaciones","Soporte para varios tech stacks","Incluye refactoring de proyectos existentes"],"fr":["Recevoir des mises à jour de compétences et de connaissances","Analyse de différences et résolution de conflits","Application sécurisée des mises à jour","Prise en charge de plusieurs tech stacks","Inclut le refactoring de projets existants"],"de":["Erhalten von Updates von Fähigkeiten und Wissen","Differenzanalyse und Konfliktlösung","Sichere Anwendung von Updates","Unterstützung für verschiedene Tech-Stacks","Inklusive Refactoring von bestehenden Projekten"],"pt":["Receba atualizações de habilidades e conhecimentos","Aplicação de patches de segurança e compatibilidade","Atualização de agentes e definições de habilidades","Análise de diferenças e resolução de conflitos","Verificação de aplicação de atualizações"],"ru":["Получение обновлений навыков и знаний","Применение патчей безопасности и совместимости","Обновление агентов и определений навыков","Анализ различий и разрешение конфликтов","Проверка применения обновлений"],"ar":["استلام تحديثات المهارات والمعرفة","تطبيق تصحيحات الأمان والتوافق","تحديث الوكلاء وتعريفات المهارات","تحليل الفروق وحل النزاعات","التحقق من تطبيق التحديثات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cursor Agent Factory","接收更新","技能","知识","代理","蓝图","diff分析","冲突解决"],"ja":["Cursor Agent Factory","更新を受け取る","スキル","知識","エージェント","ブループリント","diff分析","コンフリクト解決"],"ko":["Cursor Agent Factory","업데이트 받기","스킬","지식","에이전트","블루프린트","diff 분석","충돌 해결"],"es":["receive-updates","Cursor Agent Factory","actualizaciones de habilidades","análisis de diferencias","resolución de conflictos","aplicación segura de actualizaciones","tech stacks","refactoring de proyectos"],"fr":["receive-updates","Cursor Agent Factory","mises à jour de compétences","analyse de différences","résolution de conflits","application sécurisée des mises à jour","tech stacks","refactoring de projets"],"de":["receive-updates","Cursor Agent Factory","Updates von Fähigkeiten","Differenzanalyse","Konfliktlösung","sichere Anwendung von Updates","Tech-Stacks","Refactoring von Projekten"],"pt":["atualizações do agente cursor","receber atualizações","aplicar atualizações","habilidades do agente cursor","conhecimentos do agente cursor","segurança do agente cursor"],"ru":["обновления агента cursor","получить обновления","применить обновления","навыки агента cursor","знания агента cursor","безопасность агента cursor"],"ar":["تحديثات وكيل cursor","استلم التحديثات","تطبيق التحديثات","مهارات وكيل cursor","معرفة وكيل cursor","أمان وكيل cursor"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"receive-updates","description":"Receive and apply updates from the Cursor Agent Factory including skills, knowledge, and agents","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Receive Updates\n\nReceive and apply updates from the Cursor Agent Factory including skills, knowledge, and agents. Supports diff analysis, conflict resolution, and verified application of updates.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Syncing with upstream Agent Factory releases\n- Updating skills, knowledge, or agent definitions\n- Applying security or compatibility patches\n- Refreshing templates and patterns\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install requests pyyaml\n```\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Update Check\n\n```pytho","body":"# Receive Updates\n\nReceive and apply updates from the Cursor Agent Factory including skills, knowledge, and agents. Supports diff analysis, conflict resolution, and verified application of updates.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Syncing with upstream Agent Factory releases\n- Updating skills, knowledge, or agent definitions\n- Applying security or compatibility patches\n- Refreshing templates and patterns\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install requests pyyaml\n```\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Update Check\n\n```python\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ndef check_for_updates(\n    factory_url: str,\n    current_version: str,\n) -> dict | None:\n    \"\"\"Check factory for available updates.\"\"\"\n    # In practice: GET factory_url/manifest.json\n    manifest = {\n        \"version\": \"1.2.0\",\n        \"skills\": [\"skill-a\", \"skill-b\"],\n        \"knowledge\": [\"patterns.json\"],\n    }\n    return manifest if manifest[\"version\"] != current_version else None\n```\n\n### Step 2: Diff Analysis\n\n```python\ndef compute_diff(local: dict, remote: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Compute diff between local and remote manifests.\"\"\"\n    return {\n        \"added\": set(remote.keys()) - set(local.keys()),\n        \"removed\": set(local.keys()) - set(remote.keys()),\n        \"modified\": [k for k in local if k in remote and local[k] != remote[k]],\n    }\n```\n\n### Step 3: Conflict Resolution\n\n```python\ndef resolve_conflicts(\n    diff: dict,\n    strategy: str = \"prefer_remote\",\n) -> list[tuple[str, str]]:\n    \"\"\"Resolve conflicts; return list of (path, action).\"\"\"\n    actions = []\n    for item in diff.get(\"modified\", []):\n        actions.append((item, \"update\" if strategy == \"prefer_remote\" else \"keep\"))\n    return actions\n```\n\n### Step 4: Application\n\n```python\ndef apply_update(\n    target_path: Path,\n    content: str,\n) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Apply update to file with backup.\"\"\"\n    backup = target_path.with_suffix(target_path.suffix + \".bak\")\n    if target_path.exists():\n        target_path.rename(backup)\n    target_path.write_text(content, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n```\n\n### Step 5: Verification\n\n```python\ndef verify_update(target_path: Path, expected_checksum: str | None = None) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Verify applied update is valid.\"\"\"\n    if not target_path.exists():\n        return False\n    # Add checksum validation if expected_checksum provided\n    return target_path.stat().st_size > 0\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Always backup before bulk updates\n- Use dry-run mode to preview changes\n- Resolve conflicts manually for customizations\n- Verify each update before committing\n- Log update history for rollback\n\n## References\n\n- {directories.knowledge}/factory-updates.json\n- Cursor Agent Factory documentation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:05:42.403Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cursor IDE Development Agents needing seamless integration with the Cursor Agent Factory for updates and refactoring","zh":"非常适合需要与Cursor Agent Factory实现无缝集成以获取更新和重构的Cursor IDE开发代理","ja":"Cursor Agent Factoryとの無縫な統合が必要なCursor IDE開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Cursor Agent Factory와의 무결점 통합이 필요한 Cursor IDE 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de IDE Cursor que necesitan una integración sin problemas con la fábrica de agentes Cursor para actualizaciones y refactorización","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''IDE Cursor nécessitant une intégration transparente avec l''usine d''agents Cursor pour les mises à jour et la refactoring","de":"Perfekt für Cursor-IDE-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Integration mit der Cursor-Agenten-Fabrik für Updates und Refactoring benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do Cursor IDE que necessitam de integração perfeita com a Fábrica de Agentes do Cursor para atualizações e refatoração","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке Cursor IDE, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с фабрикой агентов Cursor для обновлений и рефакторинга","ar":"مثالي لعميل Cursor IDE الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متكامل مع مصنع Cursor للعميل لتحديثات وإعادة هيكلة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to receive and apply updates from the Cursor Agent Factory, including skills, knowledge, and agents, using diff analysis and conflict resolution, while supporting blueprints for SAP, Python, and Cloud-Native tech stacks","zh":"赋予代理接收和应用来自Cursor Agent Factory的更新，包括技能、知识和代理，使用差异分析和冲突解决，同时支持SAP、Python和云原生技术栈的蓝图","ja":"Cursor Agent Factoryからの更新、スキル、知識、エージェントを受け取り適用することをエージェントに可能にし、差分分析とコンフリクト解決を使用しながら、SAP、Python、クラウドネイティブテクノロジースタックのブループリントをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 Cursor Agent Factory로부터 업데이트를 받고 적용할 수 있도록 하며, 이는差异 분석과 충돌 해결을 사용하고, SAP, Python 및 클라우드 네이티브 기술 스택의 블루프린트를 지원한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recibir y aplicar actualizaciones de la fábrica de agentes Cursor, incluyendo habilidades, conocimiento y agentes, utilizando análisis de diferencias y resolución de conflictos, mientras admite plantillas para SAP, Python y pilas de tecnología Cloud-Native","fr":"Permet aux agents de recevoir et d''appliquer des mises à jour de l''usine d''agents Cursor, y compris des compétences, des connaissances et des agents, en utilisant l''analyse des différences et la résolution des conflits, tout en prenant en charge des modèles pour SAP, Python et les piles de technologie Cloud-Native","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Updates von der Cursor-Agenten-Fabrik zu erhalten und anzuwenden, einschließlich Fähigkeiten, Wissen und Agenten, unter Verwendung von Differenzanalyse und Konfliktlösung, während es Blueprints für SAP, Python und Cloud-Native-Technologie-Stacks unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a receberem e aplicarem atualizações da Fábrica de Agentes do Cursor, incluindo habilidades, conhecimento e agentes, usando análise de diferenças e resolução de conflitos, além de suportar blueprints para pilhas de tecnologia SAP, Python e Cloud-Native","ru":"Позволяет агентам получать и применять обновления из фабрики агентов Cursor, включая навыки, знания и агентов, используя анализ различий и разрешение конфликтов, а также поддерживает чертежи для стэков технологий SAP, Python и Cloud-Native","ar":"تمكن العملاء من استلام وتطبيق التحديثات من مصنع Cursor للعميل، بما في ذلك المهارات والمعرفة والعملاء، باستخدام تحليل الفرق وحل النزاعات، بالإضافة إلى دعم مخططات لتقنيات SAP و Python و Cloud-Native"},"useCases":{"en":["Syncing with upstream Agent Factory releases","Updating skills and agent definitions","Applying security patches and compatibility updates"],"zh":["与上游代理工厂版本同步","更新技能和代理定义","应用安全补丁和兼容性更新"],"ja":["アップストリームエージェントファクトリーリリースと同期","スキルとエージェント定義を更新","セキュリティパッチと互換性更新を適用"],"ko":["업스트림 에이전트 팩토리 릴리즈와 동기화","스킬 및 에이전트 정의 업데이트","보안 패치 및 호환성 업데이트를 적용"],"es":["Sincronización con las versiones de la fábrica de agentes upstream","Actualización de habilidades y definiciones de agentes","Aplicación de parches de seguridad y actualizaciones de compatibilidad"],"fr":["Synchronisation avec les versions de l''usine d''agents en amont","Mise à jour des compétences et des définitions d''agents","Application de correctifs de sécurité et de mises à jour de compatibilité"],"de":["Synchronisierung mit den Versionen der Agenten-Fabrik upstream","Aktualisierung von Fähigkeiten und Agenten-Definitionen","Anwendung von Sicherheitspatches und Kompatibilitäts-Updates"],"pt":["Sincronização com lançamentos da fábrica de agentes upstream","Atualização de habilidades e definições de agentes","Aplicação de patches de segurança e atualizações de compatibilidade"],"ru":["Синхронизация с выпусками фабрики агентов upstream","Обновление навыков и определений агентов","Применение патчей безопасности и обновлений совместимости"],"ar":["التزامن مع إصدارات مصنع العميل المتدفق","تحديث المهارات وتعريفات العملاء","تطبيق تصحيحات أمان وتحديثات التوافق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pip installation of requests and pyyaml libraries","Compatibility with Cursor IDE development agent systems only"],"zh":["需要使用pip安装requests和pyyaml库","仅与Cursor IDE开发代理系统兼容"],"ja":["requestsとpyyamlライブラリのpipインストールが必要","Cursor IDE開発エージェントシステムのみとの互換性"],"ko":["requests 및 pyyaml 라이브러리를 pip로 설치해야 함","Cursor IDE 개발 에이전트 시스템만과 호환"],"es":["Requiere instalación de pip de las bibliotecas requests y pyyaml","Compatibilidad solo con sistemas de agentes de desarrollo de IDE Cursor"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pip des bibliothèques requests et pyyaml","Compatibilité uniquement avec les systèmes d''agents de développement d''IDE Cursor"],"de":["Erfordert pip-Installation der Bibliotheken requests und pyyaml","Kompatibilität nur mit Cursor-IDE-Entwicklungsagenten-Systemen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do pip das bibliotecas requests e pyyaml","Compatibilidade apenas com sistemas de agentes de desenvolvimento do Cursor IDE"],"ru":["Требует установки через pip библиотек requests и pyyaml","Совместимость только с системами агентов по разработке Cursor IDE"],"ar":["يتطلب تركيب مكتبات requests وpyyaml عبر pip","التوافق مع أنظمة عميل Cursor IDE فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
