"ko":"CI Preflight는 코드 제출 전 코드 품질 및 일관성을 확인하는 검증 도구입니다","es":"CI Preflight es una herramienta de validación de código que se ejecuta antes de commit. Ayuda a detectar errores y mejorar la calidad del código.","fr":"CI Preflight est un outil de validation de code qui s''exécute avant de commit. Il aide à détecter les erreurs et à améliorer la qualité du code.","de":"CI Preflight ist ein Code-Validierungstool, das vor dem Commit ausgeführt wird. Es hilft, Fehler zu erkennen und die Code-Qualität zu verbessern.","pt":"O CI Preflight é uma ferramenta que executa verificações de código antes do commit, garantindo a qualidade do código e reduzindo erros","ru":"CI Preflight - это инструмент, который выполняет проверки кода перед коммитом, гарантируя качество кода и снижая количество ошибок","ar":"CI Preflight هو أداة تقوم بتشغيل عمليات التحقق من الكود قبل الالتزام، مما يضمن جودة الكود ويقلل من الأخطاء","en":"Mumak on the WWW"},"definition":{"en":"Mumak on the WWW"},"features":{"zh":["代码检查","类型检查","格式检查","测试运行","自动化验证"],"ja":["コードチェック","タイプチェック","フォーマットチェック","テスト実行","自動検証"],"ko":["코드 확인","타입 확인","포맷 확인","테스트 실행","자동 검증"],"es":["Validación de tipos","Análisis de código","Verificación de formato","Ejecución de pruebas"],"fr":["Validation de types","Analyse de code","Vérification de format","Exécution de tests"],"de":["Typ-Validierung","Code-Analyse","Format-Überprüfung","Test-Ausführung"],"pt":["Verificação de tipo","Verificação de lint","Verificação de formato","Execução de testes","Suporte a múltiplos aplicativos","Integração com pipelines de CI"],"ru":["Проверка типов","Проверка линта","Проверка формата","Выполнение тестов","Поддержка нескольких приложений","Интеграция с конвейерами CI"],"ar":["التحقق من النوع","التحقق من لينت","التحقق من التنسيق","تشغيل الاختبارات","دعم تطبيقات متعددة","التكامل مع أنابيب CI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CI Preflight","代码检查","持续集成","自动化验证","代码质量","类型检查","格式检查","测试运行"],"ja":["CI Preflight","コードチェック","継続的インテグレーション","自動検証","コード品質","タイプチェック","フォーマットチェック","テスト実行"],"ko":["CI Preflight","코드 확인","지속적 통합","자동 검증","코드 품질","타입 확인","포맷 확인","테스트 실행"],"es":["CI Preflight","validación de código","commit","desarrollo de software","calidad de código","pruebas automatizadas"],"fr":["CI Preflight","validation de code","commit","développement de logiciels","qualité de code","tests automatisés"],"de":["CI Preflight","Code-Validierung","Commit","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität","automatisierte Tests"],"pt":["CI Preflight","verificação de código","commit","qualidade de código","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","testes automatizados","integração contínua"],"ru":["CI Preflight","проверка кода","коммит","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","автоматические тесты","непрерывная интеграция"],"ar":["CI Preflight","التحقق من الكود","الالتزام","جودة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","اختبارات آلية","التكامل المستمر"]}},"owner":"wannysim","repo":"mumak-www","repoPath":"wannysim/mumak-www","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ci-preflight","description":"코드 작성 완료 후 CI 검증을 로컬에서 수행합니다. 코드 변경 완료 시, 커밋 요청 시, PR 생성 요청 시 자동으로 적용됩니다.","bodyPreview":"# CI Preflight 검증\n\n코드 변경 후 커밋/PR 전에 CI에서 실행되는 검증을 로컬에서 먼저 수행합니다.\n\n## 필수: 코드 변경 완료 시 검증\n\n코드 작성을 완료하면 **반드시** 아래 검증을 순서대로 실행합니다.\n\n### 1. 변경된 앱 확인\n\n```bash\n# 현재 브랜치에서 변경된 파일 확인\ngit diff --name-only origin/develop...HEAD\n\n# 변경된 앱 파악 (apps/ 또는 packages/ 하위)\n```\n\n### 2. 검증 실행 (순서 중요)\n\n```bash\n# 1) Type Check - 가장 먼저 (타입 오류가 다른 검증에 영향)\npnpm turbo run check-types --filter=<app>\n\n# 2) Lint\npnpm turbo run lint --filter=<app>\n\n# 3) Format Check\npnpm turbo run format:check --filter=<app>\n\n# 4) Test\npnpm tur","body":"# CI Preflight 검증\n\n코드 변경 후 커밋/PR 전에 CI에서 실행되는 검증을 로컬에서 먼저 수행합니다.\n\n## 필수: 코드 변경 완료 시 검증\n\n코드 작성을 완료하면 **반드시** 아래 검증을 순서대로 실행합니다.\n\n### 1. 변경된 앱 확인\n\n```bash\n# 현재 브랜치에서 변경된 파일 확인\ngit diff --name-only origin/develop...HEAD\n\n# 변경된 앱 파악 (apps/ 또는 packages/ 하위)\n```\n\n### 2. 검증 실행 (순서 중요)\n\n```bash\n# 1) Type Check - 가장 먼저 (타입 오류가 다른 검증에 영향)\npnpm turbo run check-types --filter=<app>\n\n# 2) Lint\npnpm turbo run lint --filter=<app>\n\n# 3) Format Check\npnpm turbo run format:check --filter=<app>\n\n# 4) Test\npnpm turbo run test:ci --filter=<app>\n\n# 5) Build (선택적 - PR 전 권장)\npnpm turbo run build --filter=<app>\n```\n\n### 3. 빠른 전체 검증\n\n변경된 부분만 한번에 검증:\n\n```bash\n# develop 브랜치 대비 변경된 부분 검증\n# 주의: zsh에서는 반드시 따옴표로 감싸야 함 (bracket이 glob으로 해석됨)\npnpm turbo run check-types lint format:check test:ci --filter=''[origin/develop...HEAD]''\n```\n\n## Turbo 필터 팁\n\n### 자주 사용하는 패턴\n\n```bash\n# 특정 앱만\n--filter=blog\n--filter=mumak-next\n\n# 변경된 부분만 (CI와 동일)\n# zsh에서는 따옴표 필수\n--filter=''[origin/develop...HEAD]''\n\n# 특정 앱 + 의존성\n--filter=...blog\n```\n\n### 캐시 관련\n\n```bash\n# 캐시 무시 (이상한 동작 시)\npnpm turbo run check-types --force\n\n# 전체 캐시 삭제\npnpm turbo:clean && pnpm install\n```\n\n## 자주 발생하는 오류와 해결\n\n### Type Check 실패\n\n| 오류 유형            | 원인             | 해결                                                |\n| -------------------- | ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Cannot find module` | 빌드 순서 문제   | `pnpm turbo run build --filter=@mumak/ui` 먼저 실행 |\n| 타입 불일치          | 의존 패키지 변경 | 해당 패키지 `check-types` 먼저 확인                 |\n| `.d.ts` 없음         | 빌드 미실행      | 의존 패키지 빌드 후 재시도                          |\n\n### Lint 실패\n\n```bash\n# 자동 수정 가능한 것들\npnpm turbo run lint:fix --filter=<app>\n```\n\n### Format 실패\n\n```bash\n# 포맷 자동 적용\npnpm turbo run format --filter=<app>\n```\n\n## 검증 체크리스트\n\n코드 변경 완료 시 확인:\n\n- [ ] `check-types` 통과\n- [ ] `lint` 통과 (또는 `lint:fix` 실행)\n- [ ] `format:check` 통과 (또는 `format` 실행)\n- [ ] `test:ci` 통과\n- [ ] (PR 전) `build` 통과\n\n## 빠른 검증 스크립트\n\n전체 검증을 한번에 실행하려면:\n\n```bash\n./scripts/preflight.sh [app-name]\n```\n\n스크립트 없이 한줄로:\n\n```bash\npnpm turbo run check-types lint format:check test:ci --filter=''[origin/develop...HEAD]''\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:06:17.932Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automated Testing Agents needing pre-commit validation and Continuous Integration (CI) workflow optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要预提交验证和持续集成（CI）工作流优化的自动化测试代理。","ja":"自動テストエージェントが事前コミット検証と継続的インテグレーション（CI）ワークフロー最適化を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"사전 커밋 검증 및 지속적 통합(CI) 워크플로 최적화가 필요한 자동화 테스트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Pruebas Automatizadas que necesitan validación previa al compromiso y optimización del flujo de trabajo de Integración Continua (CI).","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Test Automatisés nécessitant une validation préalable à l''engagement et une optimisation du workflow d''Intégration Continue (CI).","de":"Perfekt für automatisierte Testagenten, die eine Validierung vor dem Commit und eine Optimierung des Continuous-Integration-(CI)-Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Testes Automatizados que necessitam de validação pré-commit e otimização do fluxo de trabalho de Integração Contínua (CI).","ru":"Идеально подходит для автоматических агентов тестирования, которым необходима предварительная проверка перед коммитом и оптимизация рабочего процесса непрерывной интеграции (CI).","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين للاختبار الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق من الصحة قبل الالتزام وتحسين تدفق العمل للتكامل المستمر (CI)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute pre-commit checks using git diff, type checking with pnpm turbo run check-types, linting, format checking, and testing, ensuring code quality and reducing CI pipeline failures by leveraging protocols like Git and tools like pnpm.","zh":"赋予代理执行预提交检查，使用git diff、pnpm turbo run check-types进行类型检查、linting、格式检查和测试，确保代码质量并通过Git等协议和pnpm等工具减少CI管道故障。","ja":"エージェントが事前コミットチェックを実行できるようにし、git diff、pnpm turbo run check-typesによるタイプチェック、linting、フォーマットチェック、およびテストを使用してコード品質を確保し、Gitやpnpmなどのプロトコルやツールを活用してCIパイプラインの故障を減らします。","ko":"에이전트가 사전 커밋 검사를 실행할 수 있도록 하고 git diff, pnpm turbo run check-types를 통한 타입 체크, 린팅, 형식 체크 및 테스트를 사용하여 코드 품질을 보장하며 Git 및 pnpm과 같은 프로토콜 및 도구를 활용하여 CI 파이프라인 오류를 줄입니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar controles previos al compromiso utilizando git diff, verificación de tipos con pnpm turbo run check-types, análisis de estilo, verificación de formato y pruebas, garantizando la calidad del código y reduciendo los errores en el flujo de trabajo de CI al aprovechar protocolos como Git y herramientas como pnpm.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des contrôles préalables à l''engagement en utilisant git diff, la vérification de types avec pnpm turbo run check-types, l''analyse de style, la vérification de format et les tests, garantissant la qualité du code et réduisant les erreurs dans le workflow CI en exploitant des protocoles comme Git et des outils comme pnpm.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Vorab-Prüfungen mit git diff, Typüberprüfung mit pnpm turbo run check-types, Stilanalyse, Formatprüfung und Tests durchzuführen, um die Codequalität sicherzustellen und CI-Workflow-Fehler durch Nutzung von Protokollen wie Git und Tools wie pnpm zu reduzieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar verificações pré-commit usando git diff, verificação de tipo com pnpm turbo run check-types, linting, verificação de formato e testes, garantindo a qualidade do código e reduzindo as falhas do pipeline de CI, aproveitando protocolos como Git e ferramentas como pnpm.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять предварительные проверки с помощью git diff, проверки типов с помощью pnpm turbo run check-types, linting, проверки формата и тестирования, обеспечивая качество кода и снижая количество сбоев в конвейере CI, используя протоколы, такие как Git, и инструменты, такие как pnpm.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل عمليات التحقق قبل الالتزام باستخدام git diff وعمليات التحقق من النوع مع pnpm turbo run check-types وlinting وعمليات التحقق من التنسيق والاختبارات، مما يضمن جودة الشفرة وتقليل فشل أنابيب CI، من خلال استخدام بروتوكولات مثل Git وأدوات مثل pnpm."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code validation before commit or PR creation","Debugging type errors and linting issues in JavaScript applications","Optimizing CI workflows by running format checks and tests locally"],"zh":["在提交或PR创建前自动化代码验证","调试JavaScript应用程序中的类型错误和linting问题","通过运行本地格式检查和测试来优化CI工作流"],"ja":["コミットまたはPR作成前にコード検証を自動化する","JavaScriptアプリケーションのタイプエラーとlintingの問題をデバッグする","ローカルでフォーマットチェックとテストを実行してCIワークフローを最適化する"],"ko":["커밋 또는 PR 생성 전에 코드를 자동으로 검증하는 것","JavaScript 애플리케이션의 유형 오류 및 린팅 문제를 디버깅하는 것","로컬에서 형식 체크 및 테스트를 실행하여 CI 워크플로를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la validación de código antes de la creación de un compromiso o PR","Depurar errores de tipo y problemas de estilo en aplicaciones JavaScript","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de CI ejecutando pruebas de formato y pruebas localmente"],"fr":["Automatiser la validation du code avant la création d''un engagement ou d''une PR","Déboguer les erreurs de type et les problèmes d''analyse de style dans les applications JavaScript","Optimiser les flux de travail CI en exécutant des tests de format et des tests localement"],"de":["Automatisieren der Code-Validierung vor der Erstellung eines Commits oder PR","Beheben von Typfehlern und Stilproblemen in JavaScript-Anwendungen","Optimieren von CI-Workflows durch lokale Ausführung von Format- und Testprüfungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação de código antes da criação de commit ou PR","Depurar erros de tipo e problemas de linting em aplicações JavaScript","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de CI executando verificações de formato e testes localmente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода перед созданием коммита или PR","Отлаживать ошибки типов и проблемы linting в приложениях JavaScript","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы CI, выполняя проверки формата и тесты локально"],"ar":["تحسين التحقق من الشفرة قبل إنشاء الالتزام أو PR","تصحيح أخطاء النوع ومشاكل linting في تطبيقات JavaScript","تحسين تدفقات العمل من CI عن طريق تشغيل عمليات التحقق من التنسيق والاختبارات محليًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git version control system","Dependent on pnpm for package management and turbo for task running","Limited to applications with compatible pnpm turbo run configurations"],"zh":["需要Git版本控制系统","依赖于pnpm进行包管理和turbo进行任务运行","仅适用于具有兼容pnpm turbo run配置的应用程序"],"ja":["Gitバージョン管理システムが必要","pnpmに依存してパッケージ管理とタスク実行を行う","pnpm turbo runの構成が互換性のあるアプリケーションにのみ対象"],"ko":["Git 버전 관리 시스템이 필요함","pnpm에 의존하여 패키지 관리 및 태스크 실행을 수행함","호환되는 pnpm 터보 런 구성이 있는 애플리케이션에만 적용됨"],"es":["Requiere el sistema de control de versiones Git","Dependiente de pnpm para la gestión de paquetes y turbo para la ejecución de tareas","Limitado a aplicaciones con configuraciones de pnpm turbo run compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite le système de contrôle de version Git","Dépendant de pnpm pour la gestion des packages et turbo pour l''exécution des tâches","Limité aux applications avec des configurations pnpm turbo run compatibles"],"de":["Erfordert das Versionskontrollsystem Git","Abhängig von pnpm für die Paketverwaltung und turbo für die Ausführung von Aufgaben","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen mit kompatiblen pnpm turbo run-Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Requer sistema de controle de versão Git","Dependente do pnpm para gerenciamento de pacotes e turbo para execução de tarefas","Limitado a aplicações com configurações compatíveis de pnpm turbo run"],"ru":["Требует систему контроля версий Git","Зависит от pnpm для управления пакетами и turbo для выполнения задач","Ограничен для приложений с совместимыми настройками pnpm turbo run"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام التحكم في الإصدار Git","يعتمد على pnpm لإدارة الحزم وturbo لتشغيل المهام","محدود للتطبيقات التي تحتوي على تكوينات متوافقة مع pnpm turbo run"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory/pm-configuration', 'community', 'gitwalter', 'cursor-agent-factory', 'gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory', 'pm-configuration', 0, 0, 85, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z', '2026-02-18T10:05:36.292Z', NULL, '{"id":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory/pm-configuration","name":"pm-configuration","description":{"zh":"PM 配置技能是一种可配置的工厂，用于生成 Cursor IDE 开发代理系统，支持多种技术栈","ja":"PM 構成スキルは、カスタマイズ可能なファクトリで、Cursor IDE 開発エージェント システムを生成し、複数のテクノロジー スタックをサポートします","ko":"PM 구성 스킬은 Cursor IDE 개발 에이전트 시스템을 생성하는 구성 가능한 팩토리이며 여러 기술 스택을 지원합니다","es":"La habilidad de configuración de proyecto permite a los equipos seleccionar backends y metodologías que se ajusten a su misión","fr":"La compétence de configuration de projet permet aux équipes de sélectionner des backends et des méthodologies qui correspondent à leur mission","de":"Die Projekt-Konfigurationsfähigkeit ermöglicht es Teams, Backends und Methoden auszuwählen, die zu ihrer Mission passen","pt":"A habilidade de configuração PM permite a criação de sistemas de desenvolvimento personalizados para qualquer pilha de tecnologia.","ru":"Навык настройки PM позволяет создавать индивидуальные системы разработки для любой технологической стека.","ar":"مهارة تكوين إدارة المشاريع تمكن من إنشاء أنظمة تطوير مخصصة لأي حزمة تقنية.","en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stack. Supports blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more. Includes refactoring capabilities for existing projects"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PM 配置技能 - 自定义项目管理系统","ja":"PM 構成スキル - プロジェクト管理システムのカスタマイズ","ko":"PM 구성 스킬 - 프로젝트 관리 시스템 맞춤형 구성","es":"Configuración de Proyecto para Desarrolladores","fr":"Configuration de Projet pour Développeurs","de":"Projekt-Konfiguration für Entwickler","pt":"PM Configuration: Otimização de Fluxos de Desenvolvimento","ru":"Настройка PM: Оптимизация Потоков Разработки","ar":"تكوين إدارة المشاريع: تحسين تدفقات التطوير","en":"pm-configuration"},"description":{"zh":"PM 配置技能是一种可配置的工厂，用于生成 Cursor IDE 开发代理系统，支持多种技术栈","ja":"PM 構成スキルは、カスタマイズ可能なファクトリで、Cursor IDE 開発エージェント システムを生成し、複数のテクノロジー スタックをサポートします","ko":"PM 구성 스킬은 Cursor IDE 개발 에이전트 시스템을 생성하는 구성 가능한 팩토리이며 여러 기술 스택을 지원합니다","es":"La habilidad de configuración de proyecto permite a los equipos seleccionar backends y metodologías que se ajusten a su misión","fr":"La compétence de configuration de projet permet aux équipes de sélectionner des backends et des méthodologies qui correspondent à leur mission","de":"Die Projekt-Konfigurationsfähigkeit ermöglicht es Teams, Backends und Methoden auszuwählen, die zu ihrer Mission passen","pt":"A habilidade de configuração PM permite a criação de sistemas de desenvolvimento personalizados para qualquer pilha de tecnologia.","ru":"Навык настройки PM позволяет создавать индивидуальные системы разработки для любой технологической стека.","ar":"مهارة تكوين إدارة المشاريع تمكن من إنشاء أنظمة تطوير مخصصة لأي حزمة تقنية.","en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stac..."},"definition":{"en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stack. Supports blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more. Includes refactoring capabilities for existing projects"},"features":{"zh":["支持多种技术栈，包括 SAP、Python、Cloud-Native 等","可生成 .cursorrules、agents、skills、workflows 和 templates","支持现有项目的重构","提供蓝图用于快速配置","提高开发团队的效率和生产性","可自定义项目管理系统"],"ja":["複数のテクノロジー スタックをサポート、SAP、Python、Cloud-Native など",".cursorrules、エージェント、スキル、ワークフロー、テンプレートを生成","既存のプロジェクトのリファクタリングをサポート","迅速に構成するためのブループリントを提供","開発チームの効率と生産性を向上させる","プロジェクト管理システムをカスタマイズ"],"ko":["여러 기술 스택 지원, SAP, Python, Cloud-Native 등",".cursorrules, 에이전트, 스킬, 워크플로, 템플릿 생성","기존 프로젝트의 리팩토링 지원","迅速한 구성 위한 블루프린트 제공","개발 팀의 효율성과 생산성 향상","프로젝트 관리 시스템 맞춤형 구성"],"es":["Generación de sistemas de agentes de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con varias tecnologías","Refactorización de proyectos existentes","Soporte para SAP, Python y Cloud-Native","Creación de reglas y flujos de trabajo personalizados"],"fr":["Génération de systèmes d''agents de développement","Compatibilité avec plusieurs technologies","Réfactorisation de projets existants","Support pour SAP, Python et Cloud-Native","Création de règles et de flux de travail personnalisés"],"de":["Generierung von Entwicklungsagentensystemen","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Technologien","Refaktorisierung von bestehenden Projekten","Unterstützung für SAP, Python und Cloud-Native","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Regeln und Workflows"],"pt":["Criação de sistemas de desenvolvimento personalizados","Suporte a várias pilhas de tecnologia","Recursos de refatoração para projetos existentes","Criação de workflows e templates","Suporte a blueprints para SAP, Python e Cloud-Native"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных систем разработки","Поддержка нескольких технологических стеков","Возможности рефакторинга для существующих проектов","Создание рабочих процессов и шаблонов","Поддержка шаблонов для SAP, Python и Cloud-Native"],"ar":["إنشاء أنظمة تطوير مخصصة","دعم لحزم تقنية متعددة","ميزات إعادة هيكلة للمشاريع الحالية","إنشاء سلاسل عمل وقوالب","دعم قوالب لمشاريع SAP و Python و Cloud-Native"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PM 配置技能","项目管理系统","Cursor IDE","开发代理系统","技术栈","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","重构","蓝图"],"ja":["PM 構成スキル","プロジェクト管理システム","Cursor IDE","開発エージェント システム","テクノロジー スタック","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","リファクタリング","ブループリント"],"ko":["PM 구성 스킬","프로젝트 관리 시스템","Cursor IDE","개발 에이전트 시스템","기술 스택","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","리팩토링","블루프린트"],"es":["configuración de proyecto","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de desarrollo","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","refactorización de proyectos"],"fr":["configuration de projet","développement de logiciels","technologies de développement","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","réfactorisation de projets"],"de":["Projekt-Konfiguration","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstechnologien","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","Refaktorisierung von Projekten"],"pt":["configuração pm","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de projetos","sistemas de desenvolvimento","tecnologia de desenvolvimento","otimização de fluxos","refatoração de código"],"ru":["настройка pm","разработка программного обеспечения","управление проектами","системы разработки","технология разработки","оптимизация потоков","рефакторинг кода"],"ar":["تكوين إدارة المشاريع","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المشاريع","أنظمة التطوير","تكنولوجيا التطوير","تحسين التدفقات","إعادة هيكلة الكود"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pm-configuration","description":"Configure project management system with backend and methodology selection","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# PM Configuration Skill\n\nConfigures project management systems that enhance development workflows without burdening teams. Grounded in Axiom 0: Love, Truth, and Beauty, this skill helps teams select backends and methodologies that serve their mission.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n> Project management should enhance development, not burden it.\n\nPM systems exist to help teams deliver value to stakeholders. When configured with care and aligned to team values, they become invisible infrastructure that supports","body":"# PM Configuration Skill\n\nConfigures project management systems that enhance development workflows without burdening teams. Grounded in Axiom 0: Love, Truth, and Beauty, this skill helps teams select backends and methodologies that serve their mission.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n> Project management should enhance development, not burden it.\n\nPM systems exist to help teams deliver value to stakeholders. When configured with care and aligned to team values, they become invisible infrastructure that supports rather than constrains. This skill ensures PM configuration flows from love for the team, truth in their process, and beauty in their work.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- During onboarding when setting up a new project\n- During workshops when teams are defining their workflow\n- Standalone PM setup when teams want to configure or reconfigure their project management\n- When teams mention \"PM system\", \"project tracking\", \"task management\", \"backlog\", \"sprints\"\n- When integrating with external tools (Jira, Linear, GitHub Projects, etc.)\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting PM configuration, ensure:\n1. Repository path is available (if configuring for a specific project)\n2. Backend credentials are available (if connecting to external PM systems)\n3. Team size and preferences are understood (or will be gathered during the process)\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Determine PM System Interest\n\nBegin by understanding the team''s needs and preferences:\n\n```\n\"I''d like to help you configure a project management system that supports\nyour development workflow.\n\nProject management should enhance development, not burden it. With that in mind,\nhow would you like to approach PM for this project?\n\nA) **Yes** - Full PM system with backend integration and methodology\nB) **Minimal** - Basic task tracking without external backend\nC) **No** - Skip PM configuration for now\n\nWhich option feels right for your team?\"\n```\n\n**Decision Logic:**\n- **Yes**: Proceed to Step 2 (Backend Selection)\n- **Minimal**: Skip to Step 4 (Basic Configuration), use local tracking\n- **No**: Acknowledge and skip PM configuration, document decision\n\n### Step 2: Present Backend Options\n\nIf user selected \"Yes\", present backend options with pros and cons:\n\n```\n\"Great! Let''s select a PM backend that fits your workflow. Here are your options:\n\n**1. Jira (Atlassian)**\n   ✓ Pros: Powerful, enterprise-grade, extensive integrations, customizable workflows\n   ✗ Cons: Can be complex, requires setup time, may be overkill for small teams\n   Best for: Teams needing formal processes, enterprise environments, complex projects\n\n**2. Linear**\n   ✓ Pros: Fast, beautiful UI, developer-friendly, great keyboard shortcuts\n   ✗ Cons: Newer platform, fewer integrations than Jira, primarily for software teams\n   Best for: Software development teams, fast-moving startups, teams valuing speed\n\n**3. GitHub Projects**\n   ✓ Pros: Native GitHub integration, simple, free for public repos, familiar to developers\n   ✗ Cons: Less powerful than dedicated PM tools, limited customization\n   Best for: Open source projects, teams already using GitHub heavily\n\n**4. Azure DevOps**\n   ✓ Pros: Full Microsoft ecosystem integration, comprehensive ALM features\n   ✗ Cons: Microsoft-centric, can be complex, requires Azure account\n   Best for: Microsoft shops, enterprise teams using Azure\n\n**5. Custom/None (Local Tracking)**\n   ✓ Pros: No external dependencies, full control, simple\n   ✗ Cons: No integrations, manual updates, limited visibility\n   Best for: Small teams, early-stage projects, teams preferring simplicity\n\nWhich backend resonates with your team''s needs?\"\n```\n\n**Decision Logic:**\n- If team mentions existing tool → Suggest that tool first\n- If team size < 5 → Lean toward Linear or GitHub Projects\n- If enterprise/compliance mentioned → Suggest Jira or Azure DevOps\n- If simplicity emphasized → Suggest Custom/None\n\n### Step 3: Present Methodology Options\n\nAfter backend selection, present methodology options:\n\n```\n\"Now let''s choose a development methodology that defines how work flows\nthrough your PM system.\n\n**1. Agile Scrum**\n   - Sprint-based iterations (typically 1-3 weeks)\n   - Defined roles: Product Owner, Scrum Master, Developers, QA\n   - Ceremonies: Daily Standup, Sprint Planning, Sprint Review, Retrospective\n   - Artifacts: Product Backlog, Sprint Backlog, Burndown Charts\n   - Best for: Product development, feature teams, teams needing structure\n\n**2. Kanban**\n   - Continuous flow with Work-In-Progress (WIP) limits\n   - Pull-based work selection\n   - Visual board: Backlog → Ready → In Progress → Review → Done\n   - Metrics: Lead time, cycle time, throughput\n   - Best for: Support teams, maintenance work, ops teams, continuous delivery\n\n**3. Research & Development**\n   - Experiment-based approach\n   - Focus on learning and discovery\n   - Knowledge mesh coordination\n   - Exploration vs. exploitation balance\n   - Best for: AI/ML projects, innovation labs, research teams\n\n**4. Enterprise Integration**\n   - Milestone-based delivery\n   - Formal architecture governance\n   - Compliance and audit focus\n   - Gate reviews and approvals\n   - Best for: Large-scale projects, compliance-driven work, enterprise systems\n\n**5. Hybrid/Custom**\n   - Mix elements from multiple methodologies\n   - Adapt to team''s unique needs\n   - Best for: Teams with specific requirements, evolving processes\n\nWhich methodology aligns with how your team works?\"\n```\n\n**Decision Logic:**\n- If purpose mentions \"research\", \"AI\", \"ML\" → Suggest R&D\n- If purpose mentions \"enterprise\", \"compliance\" → Suggest Enterprise Integration\n- If purpose mentions \"support\", \"maintenance\" → Suggest Kanban\n- Default → Suggest Agile Scrum\n- Always allow customization\n\n### Step 4: Collect Team Size and Preferences\n\nGather team-specific information:\n\n```\n\"Let''s customize this for your team. I need a few details:\n\n**Team Size:**\n[ ] 1-3 people (solo or small team)\n[ ] 4-6 people (small team)\n[ ] 7-10 people (medium team)\n[ ] 10+ people (large team)\n\n**Work Style:**\n[ ] Fully remote\n[ ] Hybrid (mix of remote and office)\n[ ] Fully in-office\n[ ] Distributed across time zones\n\n**Current PM Experience:**\n[ ] New to PM systems\n[ ] Some experience with PM tools\n[ ] Experienced, want to optimize\n[ ] Expert, configuring for team\n\n**Priority Values:**\nWhat matters most to your team? (Select top 3)\n[ ] Speed of delivery\n[ ] Quality and reliability\n[ ] Visibility and transparency\n[ ] Flexibility and adaptability\n[ ] Team collaboration\n[ ] Stakeholder communication\n```\n\n**Adaptive Questions Based on Methodology:**\n\n**If Agile Scrum selected:**\n```\n\"Sprint Configuration:\n- Sprint length: [ ] 1 week  [ ] 2 weeks  [ ] 3 weeks  [ ] 4 weeks\n- Daily standup time: [ ] 9:00 AM  [ ] 10:00 AM  [ ] Afternoon  [ ] Async\n- Sprint planning duration: [ ] 2 hours  [ ] 4 hours  [ ] Full day\n- Retrospective format: [ ] In-person  [ ] Async  [ ] Hybrid\"\n```\n\n**If Kanban selected:**\n```\n\"WIP Limits Configuration:\n- Ready column: [3] items max\n- In Progress: [2] items max\n- Review: [2] items max\n- Testing: [2] items max\n\nDo these limits feel right for your team size?\"\n```\n\n**If R&D selected:**\n```\n\"Exploration Balance:\n- Exploration (research, experiments): [70]%\n- Exploitation (implementation, delivery): [30]%\n\nAdjust these percentages to match your team''s focus.\"\n```\n\n**If Enterprise Integration selected:**\n```\n\"Governance Configuration:\n- Architecture review frequency: [ ] Weekly  [ ] Bi-weekly  [ ] Per milestone\n- Compliance checkpoints: [ ] Per sprint  [ ] Per milestone  [ ] Per release\n- Approval gates: [ ] Required  [ ] Advisory  [ ] None\"\n```\n\n### Step 5: Generate Configuration\n\nBased on all collected information, generate the PM configuration:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"pm\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"backend\": {\n      \"type\": \"{SELECTED_BACKEND}\",\n      \"credentials\": {\n        \"required\": true,\n        \"location\": \".env.pm\",\n        \"instructions\": \"Add {BACKEND}_API_KEY and {BACKEND}_PROJECT_ID\"\n      },\n      \"projectId\": \"{PROJECT_ID}\",\n      \"workspace\": \"{WORKSPACE_NAME}\"\n    },\n    \"methodology\": {\n      \"type\": \"{SELECTED_METHODOLOGY}\",\n      \"configuration\": {\n        \"teamSize\": \"{TEAM_SIZE}\",\n        \"workStyle\": \"{WORK_STYLE}\",\n        \"{METHODOLOGY_SPECIFIC_SETTINGS}\": \"{VALUES}\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"workflows\": {\n      \"enabled\": [\"{WORKFLOW_1}\", \"{WORKFLOW_2}\"],\n      \"triggers\": {\n        \"{TRIGGER_TYPE}\": \"{PATTERN}\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"tracked\": [\"{METRIC_1}\", \"{METRIC_2}\"],\n      \"dashboard\": \"{DASHBOARD_URL}\"\n    },\n    \"integration\": {\n      \"mcpServers\": [\"{REQUIRED_MCP_SERVER}\"],\n      \"webhooks\": {\n        \"enabled\": true,\n        \"endpoints\": [\"{ENDPOINT_1}\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Example Output (Agile Scrum with Jira):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"pm\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"backend\": {\n      \"type\": \"jira\",\n      \"credentials\": {\n        \"required\": true,\n        \"location\": \".env.pm\",\n        \"instructions\": \"Add JIRA_API_TOKEN and JIRA_PROJECT_KEY\"\n      },\n      \"projectId\": \"PROJ\",\n      \"workspace\": \"my-company\"\n    },\n    \"methodology\": {\n      \"type\": \"agile-scrum\",\n      \"configuration\": {\n        \"teamSize\": \"4-6\",\n        \"workStyle\": \"hybrid\",\n        \"sprintLength\": \"2_weeks\",\n        \"dailyStandup\": \"10:00_AM\",\n        \"sprintPlanning\": \"4_hours\",\n        \"retrospective\": \"in_person\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"workflows\": {\n      \"enabled\": [\"bugfix-workflow\", \"feature-workflow\", \"code-review\"],\n      \"triggers\": {\n        \"jira\": \"PROJ-{NUMBER}\",\n        \"github_pr\": \"pull_request\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"tracked\": [\"velocity\", \"burndown\", \"cycle_time\", \"defect_rate\"],\n      \"dashboard\": \"https://my-company.atlassian.net/secure/Dashboard.jspa\"\n    },\n    \"integration\": {\n      \"mcpServers\": [\"atlassian\"],\n      \"webhooks\": {\n        \"enabled\": true,\n        \"endpoints\": [\"/webhooks/jira\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Example Output (Kanban with Linear):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"pm\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"backend\": {\n      \"type\": \"linear\",\n      \"credentials\": {\n        \"required\": true,\n        \"location\": \".env.pm\",\n        \"instructions\": \"Add LINEAR_API_KEY and LINEAR_TEAM_ID\"\n      },\n      \"projectId\": \"team-id\",\n      \"workspace\": \"my-workspace\"\n    },\n    \"methodology\": {\n      \"type\": \"kanban\",\n      \"configuration\": {\n        \"teamSize\": \"1-3\",\n        \"workStyle\": \"fully_remote\",\n        \"wipLimits\": {\n          \"ready\": 3,\n          \"in_progress\": 2,\n          \"review\": 2,\n          \"testing\": 2\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"workflows\": {\n      \"enabled\": [\"bugfix-workflow\", \"feature-workflow\"],\n      \"triggers\": {\n        \"linear\": \"linear-issue-{ID}\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"tracked\": [\"lead_time\", \"cycle_time\", \"throughput\"],\n      \"dashboard\": \"https://linear.app/my-workspace/insights\"\n    },\n    \"integration\": {\n      \"mcpServers\": [],\n      \"webhooks\": {\n        \"enabled\": true,\n        \"endpoints\": [\"/webhooks/linear\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Example Output (Minimal Configuration):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"pm\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"backend\": {\n      \"type\": \"local\",\n      \"credentials\": {\n        \"required\": false\n      }\n    },\n    \"methodology\": {\n      \"type\": \"kanban\",\n      \"configuration\": {\n        \"teamSize\": \"1-3\",\n        \"workStyle\": \"fully_remote\",\n        \"wipLimits\": {\n          \"in_progress\": 3\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"workflows\": {\n      \"enabled\": [\"bugfix-workflow\"],\n      \"triggers\": {\n        \"github_issue\": \"issue-{NUMBER}\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"metrics\": {\n      \"tracked\": [\"cycle_time\"],\n      \"dashboard\": null\n    },\n    \"integration\": {\n      \"mcpServers\": [],\n      \"webhooks\": {\n        \"enabled\": false\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 6: Save Configuration and Provide Next Steps\n\nSave the configuration and provide guidance:\n\n```\n\"PM configuration complete! I''ve generated:\n\n📁 pm-config.json - Your PM system configuration\n📁 .env.pm.example - Template for backend credentials\n\n**Next Steps:**\n\n1. **Set up backend credentials** (if using external backend):\n   - Copy .env.pm.example to .env.pm\n   - Add your {BACKEND} API keys and project IDs\n   - Test connection: python cli/factory_cli.py --test-pm-connection\n\n2. **Review workflow triggers**:\n   - Your workflows will trigger on: {TRIGGER_LIST}\n   - Test by creating a {TRIGGER_EXAMPLE}\n\n3. **Configure MCP servers** (if needed):\n   - {MCP_SETUP_INSTRUCTIONS}\n\n4. **Set up metrics dashboard**:\n   - Access dashboard at: {DASHBOARD_URL}\n   - Configure alerts for: {METRIC_ALERTS}\n\n5. **Team onboarding**:\n   - Share pm-config.json with your team\n   - Walk through the methodology: {METHODOLOGY_SUMMARY}\n   - Set up first {SPRINT/BACKLOG/EXPERIMENT} together\n\nRemember: PM should enhance, not burden. If something feels wrong,\nlet''s adjust it together.\n\nQuestions? Just ask!\"\n```\n\n## Decision Logic Summary\n\n### Backend Selection Logic\n\n```python\ndef select_backend(team_size, existing_tools, complexity_tolerance, budget):\n    if existing_tools:\n        return existing_tools[0]  # Use what they have\n    \n    if team_size < 5 and complexity_tolerance == \"low\":\n        return \"linear\" or \"github-projects\"\n    \n    if team_size < 5 and budget == \"free\":\n        return \"github-projects\"\n    \n    if \"enterprise\" in requirements or \"compliance\" in requirements:\n        return \"jira\" or \"azure-devops\"\n    \n    if \"microsoft\" in tech_stack:\n        return \"azure-devops\"\n    \n    return \"linear\"  # Default for software teams\n```\n\n### Methodology Selection Logic\n\n```python\ndef select_methodology(purpose, project_type, team_size, work_style):\n    if \"research\" in purpose.lower() or \"ai\" in project_type.lower():\n        return \"research-development\"\n    \n    if \"enterprise\" in project_type.lower() or \"compliance\" in purpose.lower():\n        return \"enterprise-integration\"\n    \n    if \"support\" in purpose.lower() or \"maintenance\" in purpose.lower():\n        return \"kanban\"\n    \n    if team_size > 10:\n        return \"agile-scrum\"  # Better structure for large teams\n    \n    if work_style == \"fully_remote\" and team_size < 5:\n        return \"kanban\"  # Simpler for small remote teams\n    \n    return \"agile-scrum\"  # Default\n```\n\n### Adaptive Question Logic\n\n```python\ndef get_adaptive_questions(methodology, team_size):\n    base_questions = [\"team_size\", \"work_style\", \"pm_experience\", \"priority_values\"]\n    \n    if methodology == \"agile-scrum\":\n        return base_questions + [\"sprint_length\", \"standup_time\", \"planning_duration\", \"retro_format\"]\n    \n    if methodology == \"kanban\":\n        return base_questions + [\"wip_limits\"]\n    \n    if methodology == \"research-development\":\n        return base_questions + [\"exploration_ratio\"]\n    \n    if methodology == \"enterprise-integration\":\n        return base_questions + [\"governance_frequency\", \"compliance_checkpoints\", \"approval_gates\"]\n    \n    return base_questions\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n### Integration with Onboarding Flow\n\nWhen used during onboarding:\n\n```\n\"During onboarding, I''ll help you configure your PM system. This happens\nafter we''ve selected your blueprint and methodology.\n\nThe PM configuration will:\n- Connect to your selected backend (if any)\n- Configure workflows based on your methodology\n- Set up metrics tracking\n- Integrate with your development workflows\"\n```\n\n**Integration Points:**\n- After blueprint selection in onboarding-flow\n- Uses methodology from methodology-selection skill\n- Generates workflows using workflow-generation skill\n- Configures MCP servers using workflow-generation skill\n\n### Integration with Team Workshop Onboarding\n\nWhen used during team workshops:\n\n```\n\"During Workshop 3: Stack Safari, we''ll also configure your PM system.\nThis ensures your project management aligns with your technology choices\nand team values.\n\nWe''ll:\n- Select backend through team discussion\n- Choose methodology that matches your vision\n- Configure workflows that serve your stakeholders\n- Set up metrics that matter to your team\"\n```\n\n**Integration Points:**\n- Part of Workshop 3: Stack Safari\n- Uses team decisions from Vision Quest and Ethics Arena\n- Informs agent design in Workshop 4: Agent Assembly\n- Finalized in Workshop 5: Integration Celebration\n\n### Integration with Workflow Generation\n\nPM configuration informs workflow generation:\n\n```\n\"Based on your PM configuration:\n- Backend: {BACKEND}\n- Methodology: {METHODOLOGY}\n- Triggers: {TRIGGERS}\n\nI''ll generate workflows that:\n- Connect to your PM backend\n- Follow your methodology''s ceremonies\n- Trigger on your specified events\n- Track metrics you care about\"\n```\n\n## Fallback Procedures\n\n| Condition | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| User selects \"No\" | Acknowledge, skip PM config, document decision in project notes |\n| Backend credentials unavailable | Generate config with placeholder, provide setup instructions |\n| Backend connection fails | Test connection, provide troubleshooting steps, offer fallback to local |\n| Methodology unclear | Ask clarifying questions, provide examples, suggest default |\n| Team size unknown | Use \"small team\" defaults, allow adjustment later |\n| External backend unavailable | Fall back to local tracking, offer migration path |\n| MCP server not configured | Document required MCP setup, continue with manual triggers |\n| Workflow conflicts | Resolve conflicts, prioritize user preferences |\n\n## Conversation Examples\n\n### Example 1: Full PM Setup\n\n**User:** \"I want to set up Jira for our project\"\n\n**Agent:** \"I''d like to help you configure Jira for your project management.\n\nProject management should enhance development, not burden it. With that in mind,\nlet''s make sure Jira is configured to serve your team well.\n\nFirst, a quick question: Do you already have a Jira instance set up, or are we\nstarting from scratch?\"\n\n**User:** \"We have Jira Cloud already\"\n\n**Agent:** \"Perfect! Let''s configure it to work with your development workflow.\n\nI need a few details:\n1. Your Jira project key (e.g., ''PROJ'')\n2. Your Jira workspace URL (e.g., ''mycompany.atlassian.net'')\n3. Do you have an API token ready, or should I guide you through creating one?\n\nAlso, what development methodology does your team use?\n- Agile Scrum (sprint-based)\n- Kanban (continuous flow)\n- Something else?\"\n\n### Example 2: Minimal Setup\n\n**User:** \"We just need basic task tracking, nothing fancy\"\n\n**Agent:** \"Understood! Let''s set up minimal PM that doesn''t get in your way.\n\nFor minimal setup, I''ll configure:\n- Local task tracking (no external backend)\n- Simple Kanban workflow\n- Basic metrics (cycle time)\n\nThis will give you visibility without complexity.\n\nA few quick questions:\n- Team size? (1-3, 4-6, 7+)\n- Do you use GitHub Issues for tracking, or prefer something else?\n- What''s your main work style? (remote, hybrid, in-office)\"\n\n### Example 3: During Onboarding\n\n**User:** \"I''m onboarding my repo and want PM configured too\"\n\n**Agent:** \"Great! I''ll include PM configuration as part of your onboarding.\n\nDuring onboarding, I''ll:\n1. Analyze your repository\n2. Select appropriate blueprint\n3. Configure PM system (this step)\n4. Generate agents and workflows\n\nLet''s start with PM preferences:\n\nHow would you like to approach PM?\nA) Full PM system with backend (Jira, Linear, etc.)\nB) Minimal tracking (GitHub Issues, local)\nC) Skip PM for now\n\nWhich feels right?\"\n\n## Important Rules\n\n1. **Grounded in Axiom 0** - PM configuration flows from love for the team, truth in their process, and beauty in their work\n2. **Enhance, don''t burden** - If PM feels like overhead, simplify it\n3. **Ask, don''t assume** - Gather team preferences before configuring\n4. **Provide options** - Show pros/cons, let teams choose\n5. **Allow customization** - No one-size-fits-all, adapt to team needs\n6. **Test connections** - Verify backend connectivity before finalizing\n7. **Document decisions** - Save configuration and rationale\n8. **Provide fallbacks** - Always have a simpler option available\n9. **Integrate smoothly** - Connect PM to workflows and agents\n10. **Make it reversible** - Teams should be able to change their mind\n\n## CLI Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Test PM backend connection\npython cli/factory_cli.py --test-pm-connection\n\n# Generate PM configuration interactively\npython cli/factory_cli.py --configure-pm\n\n# Validate PM configuration\npython cli/factory_cli.py --validate-pm-config pm-config.json\n\n# Sync workflows with PM backend\npython cli/factory_cli.py --sync-pm-workflows\n```\n\n## References\n\n- `{directories.knowledge}/pm-metrics.json` - PM metrics definitions and tracking\n- `{directories.knowledge}/workflow-patterns.json` - Workflow patterns for PM integration\n- `{directories.knowledge}/stack-capabilities.json` - Technology stack capabilities\n- `{directories.patterns}/methodologies/*.json` - Methodology pattern definitions\n- `{directories.patterns}/workflows/*.json` - Workflow pattern definitions\n\n---\n\n*Generated by Cursor Agent Factory*\n*Skill: pm-configuration v1.0.0*\n*Grounded in Axiom 0: Love, Truth, and Beauty*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:05:36.292Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined project management workflows and customizable Cursor IDE systems","zh":"适用于需要简化项目管理工作流和可定制的Cursor IDE系统的开发代理","ja":"開発エージェントがプロジェクト管理ワークフローをストリームライン化し、Cursor IDEシステムをカスタマイズできるようにするために最適","ko":"프로젝트 관리 워크플ロー와 커스터마이즈 가능한 Cursor IDE 시스템을 필요로 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren flujos de trabajo de gestión de proyectos optimizados y sistemas de Cursor IDE personalizables","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des flux de travail de gestion de projet rationalisés et des systèmes de Cursor IDE personnalisables","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die optimierte Projektmanagement-Workflows und anpassbare Cursor-IDE-Systeme erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de projetos otimizados e sistemas de IDE Cursor personalizáveis","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих оптимизированных рабочих процессов управления проектами и настраиваемых систем Cursor IDE","ar":"مثالي لعميلة التطوير التي تتطلب مشاريع إدارة تدفق عمل مجهزة ونظم Cursor IDE قابلة للتخصيص"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate .cursorrules, configure agents, skills, and workflows for various tech stacks, including SAP and Cloud-Native, while supporting refactoring capabilities for existing projects through blueprints","zh":"赋予代理生成.cursorrules、配置代理、技能和工作流程，以适应各种技术栈，包括SAP和云原生，同时支持通过蓝图重构现有项目的能力","ja":"エージェントが.cursorrulesを生成し、エージェント、スキル、ワークフローを構成し、SAPやクラウドネイティブなどのさまざまなテクノロジースタックをサポートし、ブループリントを介した既存のプロジェクトのリファクタリング機能を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 .cursorrules를 생성하고 에이전트, 스킬, 워크플ロー 및 다양한 기술 스택(SAP 및 클라우드 네이티브 등)을 구성하고 블루프린트를 통해 기존 프로젝트를 리팩토링하는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar .cursorrules, configurar agentes, habilidades y flujos de trabajo para varios stacks tecnológicos, incluyendo SAP y Cloud-Nativo, mientras se admiten capacidades de refactorización para proyectos existentes a través de plantillas","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des .cursorrules, de configurer des agents, des compétence