es de código","patrones de refactoring","desarrollo de software","calidad del código","mejora del código"],"fr":["révision de code propre","principes SOLID","détection de mauvaises odeurs de code","modèles de refactoring","développement de logiciels","qualité du code","amélioration du code"],"de":["sauberer Code-Review","SOLID-Prinzipien","Code-Geruchserkennung","Refactoring-Muster","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität","Code-Optimierung"],"pt":["revisão de código limpo","análise de qualidade de código","princípios SOLID","detecção de cheiros de código","refatoração de código","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["чистый код обзор","анализ качества кода","принципы SOLID","обнаружение запахов кода","рефакторинг кода","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["استعراض الكود النظيف","تحليل جودة الكود","مبادئ SOLID","اكتشاف رائحة الكود","إعادة هيكلة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clean-code-review","description":"Dead code detection","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Clean Code Review Skill\n\nPerform systematic code quality review using SOLID principles, code smell detection, and refactoring patterns. Produces actionable feedback aligned with best-practices.json and design-patterns.json.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Pre-merge code review for quality gates\n- Identifying refactoring opportunities in legacy code\n- Enforcing SOLID and design pattern compliance\n- Detecting code smells and complexity hotspots\n- Generating review reports for team feedback\n\n## Prerequisites","body":"# Clean Code Review Skill\n\nPerform systematic code quality review using SOLID principles, code smell detection, and refactoring patterns. Produces actionable feedback aligned with best-practices.json and design-patterns.json.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Pre-merge code review for quality gates\n- Identifying refactoring opportunities in legacy code\n- Enforcing SOLID and design pattern compliance\n- Detecting code smells and complexity hotspots\n- Generating review reports for team feedback\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install ruff pylint radon vulture\n```\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Static Analysis\n\nRun linters and collect baseline metrics.\n\n```python\nimport subprocess\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ndef run_static_analysis(\n    path: Path,\n    tool: str = \"ruff\",\n) -> subprocess.CompletedProcess:\n    \"\"\"Run static analysis tool on codebase.\n\n    Args:\n        path: Path to file or directory.\n        tool: ''ruff'', ''pylint'', ''radon'', or ''vulture''.\n\n    Returns:\n        CompletedProcess with stdout/stderr.\n    \"\"\"\n    cmd = {\n        \"ruff\": [\"ruff\", \"check\", str(path)],\n        \"pylint\": [\"pylint\", str(path)],\n        \"radon\": [\"radon\", \"cc\", str(path), \"-a\"],\n        \"vulture\": [\"vulture\", str(path)],\n    }\n    return subprocess.run(cmd[tool], capture_output=True, text=True)\n```\n\n### Step 2: SOLID Check\n\nEvaluate classes against SOLID principles.\n\n```python\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import List\n\n@dataclass\nclass SolidViolation:\n    \"\"\"Recorded SOLID principle violation.\"\"\"\n    principle: str\n    location: str\n    description: str\n    suggestion: str\n\ndef check_single_responsibility(\n    class_body: str,\n    class_name: str,\n) -> List[SolidViolation]:\n    \"\"\"Check for Single Responsibility Principle violations.\n\n    Args:\n        class_body: Class source code.\n        class_name: Name of the class.\n\n    Returns:\n        List of violations found.\n    \"\"\"\n    violations = []\n    # Heuristic: multiple \"def\" doing unrelated things\n    methods = [m for m in class_body.split(\"def \") if \"(\" in m]\n    if len(methods) > 7:  # Arbitrary threshold\n        violations.append(SolidViolation(\n            principle=\"SRP\",\n            location=class_name,\n            description=\"Many methods suggest multiple responsibilities\",\n            suggestion=\"Consider splitting into smaller, focused classes\",\n        ))\n    return violations\n```\n\n### Step 3: Code Smell Detection\n\nIdentify common code smells using vulture and radon.\n\n```python\ndef detect_code_smells(\n    path: Path,\n) -> dict[str, list]:\n    \"\"\"Detect code smells via tooling.\n\n    Args:\n        path: Path to Python file or directory.\n\n    Returns:\n        Dict with ''dead_code'', ''complexity'' keys.\n    \"\"\"\n    vulture = subprocess.run(\n        [\"vulture\", str(path)],\n        capture_output=True,\n        text=True,\n    )\n    radon = subprocess.run(\n        [\"radon\", \"cc\", str(path), \"-a\", \"-j\"],\n        capture_output=True,\n        text=True,\n    )\n    return {\n        \"dead_code\": vulture.stdout.strip().split(\"\\n\") if vulture.stdout else [],\n        \"complexity\": radon.stdout.strip().split(\"\\n\") if radon.stdout else [],\n    }\n```\n\n### Step 4: Complexity Metrics\n\nCompute cyclomatic complexity and maintainability index.\n\n```python\ndef get_complexity_metrics(path: Path) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Extract complexity metrics via radon.\n\n    Args:\n        path: Path to Python file.\n\n    Returns:\n        Dict with avg_complexity, maintainability_index.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = subprocess.run(\n        [\"radon\", \"cc\", str(path), \"-a\", \"-s\"],\n        capture_output=True,\n        text=True,\n    )\n    mi_result = subprocess.run(\n        [\"radon\", \"mi\", str(path), \"-s\"],\n        capture_output=True,\n        text=True,\n    )\n    return {\n        \"cyclomatic_complexity\": result.stdout,\n        \"maintainability_index\": mi_result.stdout,\n    }\n```\n\n### Step 5: Refactoring Suggestions\n\nGenerate prioritized refactoring recommendations.\n\n```python\ndef generate_refactoring_suggestions(\n    violations: List[SolidViolation],\n    smells: dict,\n    complexity: dict,\n) -> List[str]:\n    \"\"\"Produce ordered refactoring suggestions.\n\n    Args:\n        violations: SOLID violations.\n        smells: Code smell findings.\n        complexity: Complexity metrics.\n\n    Returns:\n        List of suggestion strings.\n    \"\"\"\n    suggestions = []\n    for v in violations:\n        suggestions.append(f\"[{v.principle}] {v.location}: {v.suggestion}\")\n    if smells.get(\"dead_code\"):\n        suggestions.append(\"Remove dead code identified by vulture\")\n    return suggestions\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Run ruff with --fix for auto-fixable issues first\n- Use radon cc -n B to flag high complexity (B grade or worse)\n- Cross-reference findings with review-checklist.json\n- Prioritize SOLID violations over stylistic issues\n\n## References\n\n- {directories.knowledge}/design-patterns.json\n- {directories.knowledge}/best-practices.json\n- {directories.knowledge}/review-checklist.json\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:06:18.371Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing systematic code quality analysis using SOLID principles and design patterns","zh":"适合需要使用SOLID原则和设计模式进行系统化代码质量分析的代码审查代理","ja":"SOLID原則とデザインパターンを使用した体系的なコード品質分析が必要なコードレビュー代理に適しています","ko":"SOLID 원칙과 디자인 패턴을 사용하여 체계적인 코드 품질 분석이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan un análisis sistemático de la calidad del código utilizando principios SOLID y patrones de diseño","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant une analyse systématique de la qualité du code en utilisant les principes SOLID et les modèles de conception","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine systematische Codequalitätsanalyse unter Verwendung von SOLID-Prinzipien und Entwurfsmustern benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de análise sistemática da qualidade do código usando princípios SOLID e padrões de design","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым необходим системный анализ качества кода с использованием принципов SOLID и шаблонов проектирования","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل منهجي لجودة الكود باستخدام مبادئ SOLID وانماط التصميم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform refactoring capabilities and detect code smells using best-practices.json and design-patterns.json, enforcing compliance with industry standards like SOLID and generating actionable feedback for team review","zh":"赋予代理执行重构能力，并使用best-practices.json和design-patterns.json检测代码异味，强制遵守SOLID等行业标准，并为团队审查生成可执行的反馈","ja":"エージェントにリファクタリング機能を実行させ、best-practices.jsonとdesign-patterns.jsonを使用してコードの悪臭を検知し、SOLIDなどの業界標準に準拠させ、チームのレビューのための実行可能なフィードバックを生成する","ko":"에이전트가 리팩토링 기능을 수행하고 best-practices.json 및 design-patterns.json을 사용하여 코드 냄새를检测하며 SOLID 등의 산업 표준을 준수하도록 강제하고 팀 리뷰를 위한 실행 가능한 피드백을 생성합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar capacidades de refactorización y detectar olores de código utilizando best-practices.json y design-patterns.json, lo que garantiza el cumplimiento de los estándares de la industria como SOLID y genera comentarios accionables para la revisión del equipo","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des capacités de refactorisation et de détecter les odeurs de code en utilisant best-practices.json et design-patterns.json, garantissant ainsi le respect des normes du secteur comme SOLID et générant des commentaires exploitables pour la révision de l''équipe","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Refactoring-Fähigkeiten durchzuführen und Codegerüche zu erkennen, indem best-practices.json und design-patterns.json verwendet werden, um die Einhaltung von Branchenstandards wie SOLID sicherzustellen und handhabbare Feedback für die Teamüberprüfung zu generieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar capacidades de refatoração e detectar odores de código usando best-practices.json e design-patterns.json, garantindo conformidade com padrões da indústria como SOLID e gerando feedback ação para revisão da equipe","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять функции рефакторинга и обнаруживать запахи кода с использованием best-practices.json и design-patterns.json, обеспечивая соблюдение отраслевых стандартов, таких как SOLID, и генерируя действенные отзывы для обзора команды","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أداء قدرات إعادة هيكلة والكشف عن روائح الكود باستخدام best-practices.json وdesign-patterns.json، وضمان الامتثال لمعايير الصناعة مثل SOLID وتوليد تقارير المراجعة الفعالة لمراجعة الفريق"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-merge code reviews for quality gates","Identifying refactoring opportunities in legacy codebases","Generating review reports for team feedback and enforcing design pattern compliance"],"zh":["自动执行合并前代码审查的质量门","在遗留代码库中识别重构机会","为团队反馈生成审查报告并强制执行设计模式合规性"],"ja":["マージ前のコードレビューの品質ゲートの自動化","レガシーコードベースでのリファクタリングの機会の特定","チームのフィードバックのためのレビューレポートの生成とデザインパターンのコンプライアンスの強制"],"ko":["머지 전 코드 리뷰의 품질 게이트 자동화","레거시 코드베이스에서 리팩토링 기회 식별","팀 피드백을 위한 리뷰 보고서 생성 및 디자인 패턴 준수 강제"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de código pre-fusión para puertas de calidad","Identificación de oportunidades de refactorización en bases de código heredadas","Generación de informes de revisión para comentarios del equipo y cumplimiento de patrones de diseño"],"fr":["Automatisation des revues de code pré-fusion pour les portes de qualité","Identification des opportunités de refactorisation dans les bases de code héritées","Génération de rapports de révision pour les commentaires de l''équipe et le respect des modèles de conception"],"de":["Automatisierung von Vor-merge-Code-Reviews für Qualitäts-Tore","Identifizierung von Refactoring-Möglichkeiten in veralteten Codebasen","Generierung von Review-Berichten für Team-Feedback und Einhaltung von Entwurfsmustern"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código pré-fusão para portões de qualidade","Identificar oportunidades de refatoração em bases de código legadas","Gerar relatórios de revisão para feedback da equipe e garantir conformidade com padrões de design"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки кода перед слиянием для ворот качества","Определить возможности рефакторинга в устаревших кодовых базах","Генерировать отчеты об обзоре для обратной связи команды и обеспечить соблюдение стандартов проектирования"],"ar":["أتمتة مراجعة الكود trước الاندماج لبوابات الجودة","تحديد فرص إعادة الهيكلة في قواعد البيانات الكودية القديمة","توليد تقارير المراجعة لتعليقات الفريق وضمان الامتثال لمعايير التصميم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to codebase for analysis","Limited to supported tech stacks like SAP, Python, and Cloud-Native"],"zh":["需要访问代码库进行分析","仅限支持的技术栈，如SAP、Python和云原生"],"ja":["分析のためにコードベースへのアクセスが必要","SAP、Python、Cloud-Nativeなどのサポート対象テクノロジースタックに限定される"],"ko":["분석을 위해 코드베이스에 접근이 필요","SAP, Python, Cloud-Native 등의 지원 기술 스택에 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código para el análisis","Limitado a pilas de tecnología admitidas como SAP, Python y Cloud-Native"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code pour l''analyse","Limité aux piles de technologie prises en charge comme SAP, Python et Cloud-Native"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebasis für die Analyse","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Technologie-Stacks wie SAP, Python und Cloud-Native"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código para análise","Limitado a pilhas de tecnologia compatíveis como SAP, Python e Cloud-Native"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кодовой базе для анализа","Ограничен поддерживаемыми стеками технологий, такими как SAP, Python и Cloud-Native"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات الكودية للتحليل","محدود بمهارات التكنولوجيا المدعومة مثل SAP وPython وCloud-Native"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
