ration de version","Compatibilité avec yarn version check","Prise en charge des versions patch, minor et major","Intégration avec les workflows de développement"],"de":["Automatisierung von Änderungsprotokollen","Validierung der Versionskonfiguration","Kompatibilität mit yarn version check","Unterstützung für Versionen patch, minor und major","Integration mit Entwicklungswerkzeugen"],"pt":["Automação do preenchimento de entradas de changelog","Validação da configuração de versão","Suporte a comandos de versão como yarn version check","Integração com o fluxo de trabalho do desenvolvedor","Suporte a ajustes de versão usando yarn version patch/minor/major"],"ru":["Автоматизация заполнения записей журнала изменений","Валидация конфигурации версии","Поддержка команд версии, таких как yarn version check","Интеграция с рабочим процессом разработчика","Поддержка корректировки версии с помощью yarn version patch/minor/major"],"ar":["تعبئة تلقائية لسجل التغييرات","تحقق من صحة إعدادات الإصدار","دعم أوامر الإصدار مثل yarn version check","التكامل مع سير عمل المطور","دعم تعديل الإصدار باستخدام yarn version patch/minor/major"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自动填充变更日志","Fill Changelog","开发流程","版本检查","自动化","效率提高"],"ja":["自動で変更ログを埋める","Fill Changelog","開発プロセス","バージョンチェック","自動化","効率向上"],"ko":["자동으로 변경 로그를 채움","Fill Changelog","개발 프로세스","버전 체크","자동화","효율성 향상"],"es":["fill-changelog","automatización de registros de cambios","versiones de software","yarn version check","desarrollo de software","registros de cambios","gestión de versiones"],"fr":["fill-changelog","automatisation des journaux de modifications","versions de logiciel","yarn version check","développement de logiciel","journaux de modifications","gestion de versions"],"de":["fill-changelog","Automatisierung von Änderungsprotokollen","Softwareversionen","yarn version check","Softwareentwicklung","Änderungsprotokolle","Versionsverwaltung"],"pt":["fill-changelog","automação de changelog","versionamento","yarn version check","desenvolvimento de software","fluxo de trabalho do desenvolvedor","controle de versão"],"ru":["fill-changelog","автоматизация журнала изменений","управление версиями","yarn version check","разработка программного обеспечения","рабочий процесс разработчика","контроль версий"],"ar":["fill-changelog","تعبئة سجل التغييرات تلقائيًا","إدارة النسخة","yarn version check","تطوير البرمجيات","سير عمل المطور","مراقبة الإصدار"]}},"owner":"furystack","repo":"pi-rat","repoPath":"furystack/pi-rat","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fill-changelog","description":"Fill changelog entries for the current branch. Use when the user asks to fill changelog, write changelog entries, update changelog, or prepare changelog for a PR.","bodyPreview":"# fill-changelog\n\nAutomate filling changelog entries based on the changes in the current branch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nVersion bumps MUST be configured before running this skill. If `yarn version check` fails, version files need to be adjusted first using `yarn version patch/minor/major` or `yarn bumpVersions` (interactive).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Validate Version Configuration\n\nRun `yarn version check` to validate version manifests exist:\n\n```bash\nyarn version check\n```\n\n**If fails:** Stop and","body":"# fill-changelog\n\nAutomate filling changelog entries based on the changes in the current branch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nVersion bumps MUST be configured before running this skill. If `yarn version check` fails, version files need to be adjusted first using `yarn version patch/minor/major` or `yarn bumpVersions` (interactive).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Validate Version Configuration\n\nRun `yarn version check` to validate version manifests exist:\n\n```bash\nyarn version check\n```\n\n**If fails:** Stop and report error. The user must run `yarn version patch`, `yarn version minor`, `yarn version major`, or `yarn bumpVersions` first to configure version bumps.\n\n### Step 2: Create/Recreate Changelog Drafts\n\nRun with force flag to ensure all drafts are created or recreated:\n\n```bash\nyarn changelog create -f\n```\n\nThis creates files in `.yarn/changelogs/` with the pattern `{package-name}.{manifest-id}.md`.\n\n### Step 3: Analyze Branch Changes\n\nGather information about changes:\n\n```bash\ngit diff develop...HEAD --stat\ngit log develop...HEAD --oneline\n```\n\nRead the changed files to understand what was actually modified.\n\n### Step 4: Read Changelog Drafts\n\nUse Glob to find `.yarn/changelogs/*.md` files, then Read to load their content.\n\n### Step 5: Fill Changelog Entries\n\nMap changes to the appropriate sections and fill the changelog drafts.\n\n## Section Mapping\n\n| Section             | When to Use                                    |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| ✨ Features         | New functionality, new files, new capabilities |\n| 🐛 Bug Fixes        | Corrections to existing behavior               |\n| 📚 Documentation    | README, comments, documentation files          |\n| ⚡ Performance      | Optimizations                                  |\n| ♻️ Refactoring      | Code restructuring without behavior change     |\n| 🧪 Tests            | Test additions/modifications                   |\n| 📦 Build            | Build system, dependencies configuration       |\n| 👷 CI               | CI/CD configuration changes                    |\n| ⬆️ Dependencies     | Dependency updates                             |\n| 🔧 Chores           | Other maintenance tasks                        |\n| 💥 Breaking Changes | Major version only (REQUIRED)                  |\n| 🗑️ Deprecated       | Minor/Major versions only                      |\n\n## Quality Guidelines\n\n### Writing Style: Documentation, NOT Git Log\n\nWrite for package consumers, not as git history.\n\n**Avoid vague terms:**\n\n- \"improved\", \"updated\", \"refactored\", \"fixed bugs\", \"changed internal implementation\"\n\n**Use specific, actionable language:**\n\n- \"Added pagination support to `getUserList()` with page and limit parameters\"\n- \"Fixed date picker not respecting user timezone in profile settings\"\n\n### Version-Specific Requirements\n\n**Major Versions:**\n\n- Document ALL breaking changes with descriptive titles\n- Explain WHAT changed and WHY\n- Include before/after code examples using ❌/✅ markers\n- Provide migration guide with step-by-step instructions\n- Explain impact (who is affected)\n\n**Minor Versions:**\n\n- Document new features with descriptive titles\n- Provide usage examples\n- Explain benefits/use cases\n\n**Patch Versions:**\n\n- Be specific about bug fixes (not vague \"fixed bugs\")\n- Describe what was broken\n\n### List Items Need Descriptions\n\nWhen listing multiple items (features, agents, tools, etc.), each item should include a brief description of what it does and why it matters:\n\n```markdown\n// ❌ Bad - just names without context\n\n- Added `reviewer-changelog`\n- Added `reviewer-eslint`\n- Added `reviewer-prettier`\n\n// ✅ Good - each item explains its purpose\n\n- Added `reviewer-changelog` - Validates changelog entries have high-quality, descriptive content\n- Added `reviewer-eslint` - Runs ESLint checks to catch linting violations automatically\n- Added `reviewer-prettier` - Validates code formatting matches project standards\n```\n\nEven for simple list items, the reader should understand **what** the item does without needing to look elsewhere.\n\n## Entry Format Examples\n\n### Simple List (straightforward changes)\n\n```markdown\n## ✨ Features\n\n- Added `exportToCSV()` function for data export\n- Implemented multi-select filtering in list views\n```\n\n### Detailed Entry (complex changes)\n\n```markdown\n## ✨ Features\n\n### New Data Export Feature\n\nExport data in multiple formats for analysis and reporting.\n\n**Usage:**\n\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\nimport { exportData } from ''common'';\n\nconst result = await exportData(items, { format: ''csv'' });\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n### Breaking Changes (major versions)\n\n```markdown\n## 💥 Breaking Changes\n\n### API Methods Now Use Object Parameters\n\nMethods now accept object parameters instead of positional arguments.\n\n**Examples:**\n\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\n// ❌ Before\nawait injector.getInstance(MyService, arg1, arg2);\n\n// ✅ After\nawait injector.getInstance(MyService, { arg1, arg2 });\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n**Impact:** All callers of the affected methods need to be updated.\n\n**Migration:** Search for method calls with `grep -r \"getInstance\" service/` and update to object syntax.\n```\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter filling entries, run:\n\n```bash\nyarn changelog check\n```\n\nThis validates:\n\n- Every release has a changelog file\n- Major releases have filled \"💥 Breaking Changes\" section\n- At least one section has content\n- Version type matches the manifest\n\n## Reference\n\nFor detailed guidelines, see:\n\n- `.cursor/rules/` for coding guidelines\n- `.cursor/agents/reviewer-changelog.md` (will review the filled entries)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:06:32.351Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing automated changelog management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化变更日志管理功能的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが自動化された変更ログ管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 변경 로그 관리 기능이 필요한 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Control de Versiones que necesitan capacidades de gestión de registros de cambios automatizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Contrôle de Version nécessitant des capacités de gestion de journal des modifications automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Version Control Agents, die automatisierte Änderungsprotokoll-Verwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Controle de Versão que precisam de capacidades de gerenciamento de changelog automatizado.","ru":"Идеально для агентов контроля версий, которым необходимы автоматические возможности управления журналом изменений.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التحكم في الإصدار الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إدارة سجل التغييرات الآلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate filling changelog entries based on branch changes, leveraging version bumps and YAML manifests, and utilizing commands like `yarn version check` and `yarn version patch/minor/major` for seamless integration.","zh":"使代理能够自动填充基于分支更改的更改日志条目，利用版本升级和YAML清单，并利用命令如`yarn version check`和`yarn version patch/minor/major`以实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがブランチ変更に基づく変更ログエントリを自動的に埋めることができるようにし、バージョンアップとYAMLマニフェストを利用し、`yarn version check`および`yarn version patch/minor/major`などのコマンドを使用してシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 자동으로 브랜치 변경을 기반으로 하는 변경 로그 항목을 작성하도록 하며 버전 업그레이드와 YAML 매니페스트를 활용하고 `yarn version check` 및 `yarn version patch/minor/major`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar el llenado de entradas de registros de cambios en función de los cambios de rama, aprovechando los incrementos de versión y los manifiestos YAML, y utilizando comandos como `yarn version check` y `yarn version patch/minor/major` para una integración perfecta.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser le remplissage des entrées de journal des modifications en fonction des changements de branche, en exploitant les incrémentations de version et les manifestes YAML, et en utilisant des commandes comme `yarn version check` et `yarn version patch/minor/major` pour une intégration sans faille.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das Ausfüllen von Änderungsprotokoll-Einträgen basierend auf Branch-Änderungen zu automatisieren, indem es Versions-Sprünge und YAML-Manifeste nutzt und Befehle wie `yarn version check` und `yarn version patch/minor/major` für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar o preenchimento de entradas de changelog com base em alterações de branch, aproveitando aumentos de versão e manifestos YAML, e utilizando comandos como `yarn version check` e `yarn version patch/minor/major` para integração sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать заполнение записей журнала изменений на основе изменений веток, используя версионные обновления и манифесты YAML, и используя команды như `yarn version check` и `yarn version patch/minor/major` для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تلقين ملء مدخلات سجل التغييرات استنادا إلى تغييرات الفروع، واستغلال زيادات الإصدار والبيانات الوصفية YAML، وتشغيل أوامر مثل `yarn version check` و `yarn version patch/minor/major` من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating changelog updates for version releases","Validating version configurations before deployment","Streamlining branch management with automated changelog filling"],"zh":["自动更新版本发布的更改日志","部署前验证版本配置","使用自动填充更改日志来简化分支管理"],"ja":["バージョンリリースの変更ログを自動更新する","デプロイ前にバージョン構成を検証する","自動的な変更ログの埋め込みを使用してブランチ管理を簡素化する"],"ko":["버전 릴리스를 위한 변경 로그 자동 업데이트하기","배포 전 버전 구성 유효성 검사하기","자동 변경 로그 작성으로 브랜치 관리 단순화하기"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de registros de cambios para lanzamientos de versiones","Validar configuraciones de versión antes de la implementación","Optimizar la gestión de ramas con el llenado de registros de cambios automatizado"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour du journal des modifications pour les versions de publication","Valider les configurations de version avant le déploiement","Optimiser la gestion des branches avec le remplissage automatique du journal des modifications"],"de":["Automatisieren von Änderungsprotokoll-Updates für Version-Veröffentlichungen","Validieren von Versionskonfigurationen vor der Bereitstellung","Optimieren der Branch-Verwaltung mit automatisiertem Änderungsprotokoll-Ausfüllen"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de changelog para lançamentos de versão","Validar configurações de versão antes da implantação","Otimizar gerenciamento de branch com preenchimento de changelog automatizado"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления журнала изменений для выпусков версий","Проверять конфигурации версий перед развертыванием","Оптимизировать управление ветками с автоматическим заполнением журнала изменений"],"ar":["تلقين تحديثات سجل التغييرات للأصدارات","تحقق من.configurations الإصدار قبل التوزيع","تحسين إدارة الفروع بالملء الآلي لسجل التغييرات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires version bumps to be configured beforehand","Dependent on `yarn version check` and `yarn bumpVersions` commands","Limited to projects using YAML manifests for versioning"],"zh":["需要事先配置版本升级","依赖于`yarn version check`和`yarn bumpVersions`命令","仅限于使用YAML清单进行版本控制的项目"],"ja":["事前にバージョンアップを設定する必要がある","`yarn version check`および`yarn bumpVersions`コマンドに依存する","YAMLマニフェストを使用してバージョン管理を行うプロジェクトに限定される"],"ko":["事前に 버전 업그레이드를 구성해야 함","`yarn version check` 및 `yarn bumpVersions` 명령에 의존함","YAML 매니페스트를 사용하여 버전을 관리하는 프로젝트에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere que los incrementos de versión estén configurados de antemano","Dependiente de los comandos `yarn version check` y `yarn bumpVersions`","Limitado a proyectos que utilizan manifiestos YAML para la versión"],"fr":["Nécessite que les incrémentations de version soient configurées au préalable","Dépendant des commandes `yarn version check` et `yarn bumpVersions`","Limité aux projets utilisant des manifestes YAML pour la version"],"de":["Benötigt, dass Versions-Sprünge im Voraus konfiguriert werden","Abhängig von den Befehlen `yarn version check` und `yarn bumpVersions`","Begrenzt auf Projekte, die YAML-Manifeste für die Versionierung verwenden"],"pt":["Requer que os aumentos de versão sejam configurados previamente","Depende dos comandos `yarn version check` e `yarn bumpVersions`","Limitado a projetos que usam manifestos YAML para versionamento"],"ru":["Требует предварительной настройки версионных обновлений","Зависит от команд `yarn version check` и `yarn bumpVersions`","Ограничен проектами, использующими манифесты YAML для версионирования"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين زيادات الإصدار مسبقا","يعتمد على الأوامر `yarn version check` و `yarn bumpVersions`","محدود بمشاريع تستخدم البيانات الوصفية YAML للنسخ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
