iption":{"zh":"Tarkov.dev , GraphQL ","ja":"Tarkov.dev , GraphQL ","ko":"Tarkov.dev , GraphQL ","es":"Herramienta para calcular builds de armas óptimos en Escape from Tarkov. Actualiza el esquema GraphQL y regenera el cliente Go.","fr":"Outil pour calculer les builds d''armes optimaux dans Escape from Tarkov. Met à jour le schéma GraphQL et régénère le client Go.","de":"Werkzeug zum Berechnen optimaler Waffen-Builds in Escape from Tarkov. Aktualisiert das GraphQL-Schema und regeneriert den Go-Client.","pt":"O refresh-tarkovdev-schema é uma ferramenta para calcular builds de armas ótimas em Escape from Tarkov e atualizar o esquema GraphQL do Tarkov.dev","ru":"Refresh-tarkovdev-schema - это инструмент для расчета оптимальных построек оружия в Escape from Tarkov и обновления схемы GraphQL Tarkov.dev","ar":"refresh-tarkovdev-schema هو أداة لحساب بناء الأسلحة الأمثل في Escape from Tarkov وتحديث مخطط GraphQL الخاص بـ Tarkov.dev","en":"A tool for calculating optimal weapon builds in Escape from Tarkov."},"definition":{"en":"A tool for calculating optimal weapon builds in Escape from Tarkov."},"features":{"zh":["Tarkov.dev API","GraphQL","Go","API","Tarkov.dev "],"ja":["Tarkov.dev API","GraphQL","Go","API","Tarkov.dev "],"ko":["Tarkov.dev API","GraphQL","Go","API","Tarkov.dev "],"es":["Actualiza el esquema GraphQL de tarkov.dev","Regenera el cliente Go","Calcula builds de armas óptimos","Compatible con Escape from Tarkov","Fácil de usar y configurar"],"fr":["Mette à jour le schéma GraphQL de tarkov.dev","Régénère le client Go","Calcule les builds d''armes optimaux","Compatible avec Escape from Tarkov","Facile à utiliser et à configurer"],"de":["Aktualisiert das GraphQL-Schema von tarkov.dev","Regeneriert den Go-Client","Berechnet optimale Waffen-Builds","Kompatibel mit Escape from Tarkov","Einfach zu bedienen und zu konfigurieren"],"pt":["Atualiza o esquema GraphQL do Tarkov.dev","Resolve erros de campos desconhecidos","Permite o uso de novos dados disponíveis na API","Regenera o cliente Go","Útil para configurar o projeto pela primeira vez"],"ru":["Обновляет схему GraphQL Tarkov.dev","Решает ошибки неизвестных полей","Позволяет использовать новые данные, доступные в API","Перегенерирует клиент Go","Полезен для настройки проекта в первый раз"],"ar":["يحديث مخطط GraphQL الخاص بـ Tarkov.dev","يحل أخطاء الحقول المجهولة","يسمح باستخدام بيانات جديدة متاحة في واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","يعيد توليد عميل Go","مفيد لتهيئة المشروع لأول مرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tarkov.dev","GraphQL","Go","API","Tarkov.dev API","Escape from Tarkov"],"ja":["Tarkov.dev","GraphQL","Go","API","Tarkov.dev API","Escape from Tarkov"],"ko":["Tarkov.dev","GraphQL","Go","API","Tarkov.dev API","Escape from Tarkov"],"es":["refresh-tarkovdev-schema","tarkov.dev","GraphQL","Go","Escape from Tarkov","builds de armas","optimización de armas"],"fr":["refresh-tarkovdev-schema","tarkov.dev","GraphQL","Go","Escape from Tarkov","builds d''armes","optimisation des armes"],"de":["refresh-tarkovdev-schema","tarkov.dev","GraphQL","Go","Escape from Tarkov","Waffen-Builds","Waffen-Optimierung"],"pt":["refresh-tarkovdev-schema","Tarkov.dev","GraphQL","Escape from Tarkov","builds de armas","esquema GraphQL","erro de campos desconhecidos"],"ru":["refresh-tarkovdev-schema","Tarkov.dev","GraphQL","Escape from Tarkov","построек оружия","схема GraphQL","ошибка неизвестных полей"],"ar":["refresh-tarkovdev-schema","Tarkov.dev","GraphQL","Escape from Tarkov","بناء الأسلحة","مخطط GraphQL","خطأ الحقول المجهولة"]}},"owner":"sjtw","repo":"tarkov-build-optimiser","repoPath":"sjtw/tarkov-build-optimiser","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"refresh-tarkovdev-schema","description":"Update the tarkov.dev GraphQL schema and regenerate the Go client code","bodyPreview":"# Refresh Tarkov.dev Schema Skill\n\nUse this skill when updating the tarkov.dev GraphQL schema or regenerating the Go client.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Tarkov.dev API has added new fields or types you need\n- GraphQL queries are failing with \"unknown field\" errors\n- You want to use new data that''s available in the API\n- After a major tarkov.dev API update\n- Setting up the project for the first time (if schema is missing)\n\n## Quick Update\n\n```bash\n# Fetch latest schema and regenerate client\ntask tark","body":"# Refresh Tarkov.dev Schema Skill\n\nUse this skill when updating the tarkov.dev GraphQL schema or regenerating the Go client.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Tarkov.dev API has added new fields or types you need\n- GraphQL queries are failing with \"unknown field\" errors\n- You want to use new data that''s available in the API\n- After a major tarkov.dev API update\n- Setting up the project for the first time (if schema is missing)\n\n## Quick Update\n\n```bash\n# Fetch latest schema and regenerate client\ntask tarkovdev\n```\n\nThis runs two steps:\n1. `tarkovdev:get-schema` - Downloads the latest schema from tarkov.dev\n2. `tarkovdev:regenerate` - Regenerates Go code from your queries\n\n## Step-by-Step Process\n\n### Step 1: Fetch Latest Schema\n\n```bash\ntask tarkovdev:get-schema\n```\n\n**What it does:**\n- Introspects the tarkov.dev GraphQL API at `https://api.tarkov.dev/graphql`\n- Writes the schema to `internal/tarkovdev/schemas/schema.graphql`\n\n**Requirements:**\n- `graphql-inspector` CLI tool (installed via `task deps:install:node`)\n- Internet connection to reach api.tarkov.dev\n\n### Step 2: Update Your Queries (if needed)\n\nIf you want to use new fields, update your queries in:\n\n```\ninternal/tarkovdev/schemas/queries.graphql\n```\n\n**Example:** Adding a new field to an existing query\n\n```graphql\nquery GetWeapons {\n  items(type: weapon) {\n    id\n    name\n    # Add new fields here\n    weight\n    basePrice\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 3: Regenerate Go Client\n\n```bash\ntask tarkovdev:regenerate\n```\n\n**What it does:**\n- Runs `genqlient` code generator\n- Reads `genqlient.yaml` configuration\n- Generates Go types and functions in `internal/tarkovdev/generated-queries.go`\n\n**Configuration file:** `genqlient.yaml`\n\n```yaml\nschema: internal/tarkovdev/schemas/schema.graphql\noperations:\n  - internal/tarkovdev/schemas/queries.graphql\ngenerated: internal/tarkovdev/generated-queries.go\n```\n\n### Step 4: Verify the Changes\n\n```bash\n# Check what changed\ngit diff internal/tarkovdev/\n\n# Ensure it compiles\ngo build ./...\n\n# Run relevant tests\ngo test ./internal/tarkovdev/...\ngo test ./internal/importers/...\n```\n\n## What Gets Generated\n\nAfter regeneration, `internal/tarkovdev/generated-queries.go` contains:\n\n- **Go structs** for all GraphQL types used in your queries\n- **Query functions** like `GetWeapons(ctx, client)`, `GetMods(ctx, client)`, etc.\n- **Response types** with proper JSON unmarshaling\n\n**Example generated code:**\n\n```go\ntype GetWeaponsResponse struct {\n    Items []GetWeaponsItem `json:\"items\"`\n}\n\ntype GetWeaponsItem struct {\n    Id   string `json:\"id\"`\n    Name string `json:\"name\"`\n    // New fields appear here automatically\n}\n\nfunc GetWeapons(ctx context.Context, client graphql.Client) (*GetWeaponsResponse, error) {\n    // Generated query execution\n}\n```\n\n## Making Query Changes\n\n### Add a New Query\n\n1. Open `internal/tarkovdev/schemas/queries.graphql`\n2. Add your query:\n\n```graphql\nquery GetTraderOffers {\n  traders {\n    id\n    name\n    cashOffers {\n      item {\n        id\n        name\n      }\n      price\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n3. Regenerate:\n\n```bash\ntask tarkovdev:regenerate\n```\n\n4. Use the generated function:\n\n```go\nimport \"tarkov-build-optimiser/internal/tarkovdev\"\n\nresp, err := tarkovdev.GetTraderOffers(ctx, graphqlClient)\n```\n\n### Modify an Existing Query\n\n1. Edit the query in `queries.graphql`\n2. Regenerate: `task tarkovdev:regenerate`\n3. Update any code using the old structure (compiler will help find it)\n\n### Remove a Query\n\n1. Delete or comment out the query in `queries.graphql`\n2. Regenerate: `task tarkovdev:regenerate`\n3. Remove any code calling the deleted query function\n\n## Understanding the Schema\n\n### View the Schema\n\n```bash\n# Open in your editor\ncode internal/tarkovdev/schemas/schema.graphql\n```\n\nThe schema shows:\n- Available types (Item, Weapon, Mod, Trader, etc.)\n- Fields on each type\n- Query operations you can use\n- Enums and their values\n\n### Explore Available Fields\n\n```graphql\n# Look for the type you''re interested in\ntype Item {\n  id: ID!\n  name: String\n  weight: Float\n  types: [ItemType!]!\n  # ... many more fields\n}\n```\n\n### Check Query Operations\n\n```graphql\ntype Query {\n  items(type: ItemType): [Item]\n  item(id: ID!): Item\n  traders: [Trader]\n  # ... etc\n}\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Schema fetch fails\n\n**Error:** Can''t connect to api.tarkov.dev\n\n**Solutions:**\n- Check internet connection\n- Verify API is online: `curl https://api.tarkov.dev/graphql`\n- Check if API endpoint changed (update in Taskfile)\n- Try again later (API might be down)\n\n### Code generation fails\n\n**Error:** genqlient errors during regeneration\n\n**Check:**\n- Query syntax is valid GraphQL\n- Field names match the schema exactly (case-sensitive)\n- Types used in queries exist in the schema\n- Required fields are included in queries\n\n**Debug:**\n```bash\n# Validate your queries manually\ncat internal/tarkovdev/schemas/queries.graphql\n\n# Check genqlient version\ngo list -m github.com/Khan/genqlient\n```\n\n### Generated code has compilation errors\n\n**After regeneration, Go build fails**\n\n**Solutions:**\n- Update code using the changed types\n- Check if field names or types changed in the API\n- Verify your queries match the new schema\n- Look for breaking changes in tarkov.dev API\n\n### New fields not appearing\n\n**You fetched the schema but new fields aren''t available**\n\n**Check:**\n- Did you run `task tarkovdev:get-schema`?\n- Is the field added to your query in `queries.graphql`?\n- Did you run `task tarkovdev:regenerate` after updating queries?\n- Is the field actually in the schema? (Check `schema.graphql`)\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### When to Update\n\n- ✅ Before starting work that needs new API fields\n- ✅ When GraphQL errors mention unknown fields\n- ✅ Periodically to stay current with API changes\n- ❌ Not during active development unless needed\n- ❌ Not if your queries are working fine\n\n### After Updating\n\n1. Check the diff to understand what changed\n2. Update your queries if needed\n3. Rebuild and test\n4. Update importers if data structures changed\n5. Commit schema and generated code together\n\n### Query Design\n\n- Request only fields you actually use (performance)\n- Use fragments for reusable field sets\n- Keep queries focused and named clearly\n- Document complex queries with comments\n\n## Files Involved\n\n- **Schema source:** `https://api.tarkov.dev/graphql`\n- **Schema file:** `internal/tarkovdev/schemas/schema.graphql`\n- **Your queries:** `internal/tarkovdev/schemas/queries.graphql`\n- **Generated code:** `internal/tarkovdev/generated-queries.go`\n- **Config:** `genqlient.yaml`\n- **Client wrapper:** `internal/tarkovdev/tarkov-dev.go`\n\n## Dependencies\n\nInstalled via `task deps:install:node`:\n- `graphql-inspector` - For schema introspection\n\nInstalled via `task deps:install:go`:\n- `github.com/Khan/genqlient` - For code generation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:06:33.222Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Gaming Analysis Agents needing automated schema updates for Escape from Tarkov API integration.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化 schema 更新的逃离塔尔科夫 API 集成的游戏分析代理。","ja":"Escape from Tarkov API 統合の自動スキーマ更新が必要なゲーム分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 스키마 업데이트가 필요한 탈출 타르코프 API 통합을 위한 게임 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de juegos que necesitan actualizaciones de esquema automatizadas para la integración de la API de Escape from Tarkov.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de jeux ayant besoin de mises à jour de schéma automatisées pour l''intégration de l''API Escape from Tarkov.","de":"Perfekt für Gaming-Analyse-Agents, die automatisierte Schemataktualisierungen für die Escape from Tarkov API-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Jogos que precisam de atualizações de esquema automatizadas para integração com a API do Escape from Tarkov.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа игр, которым необходимы автоматические обновления схемы для интеграции с API Escape from Tarkov.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الألعاب الذي يحتاج إلى تحديثات مخطط автомاتيكية لدمج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Escape from Tarkov."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dynamically refresh and regenerate the tarkov.dev GraphQL schema, ensuring compatibility with the latest API updates and fields, while leveraging task automation with commands like ''task tark'' for seamless client regeneration.","zh":"赋予代理动态刷新和重新生成 tarkov.dev GraphQL 模式的能力，确保与最新的 API 更新和字段兼容，同时利用任务自动化和类似 ''task tark'' 的命令实现无缝的客户端重新生成。","ja":"エージェントに tarkov.dev GraphQL スキーマを動的に更新して再生成する能力を与え、最新の API 更新とフィールドとの互換性を確保し、''task tark'' のようなコマンドを使用したタスクの自動化を活用してクライアントの再生成を無停止で行う。","ko":"에이전트가 tarkov.dev GraphQL 스키마를 동적으로 업데이트하고 재생성할 수 있도록 하여 최신 API 업데이트 및 필드와의 호환성을 보장하고, ''task tark''와 같은 명령을 사용한 작업 자동화를 통해 클라이언트의 무중단 재생성을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes actualizar y regenerar dinámicamente el esquema GraphQL de tarkov.dev, garantizando la compatibilidad con las últimas actualizaciones y campos de la API, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha la automatización de tareas con comandos como ''task tark'' para una regeneración de clientes sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour et de régénérer dynamiquement le schéma GraphQL de tarkov.dev, en garantissant la compatibilité avec les dernières mises à jour et champs de l''API, tout en exploitant l''automatisation des tâches avec des commandes comme ''task tark'' pour une régénération de clients sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, das GraphQL-Schema von tarkov.dev dynamisch zu aktualisieren und neu zu generieren, um somit die Kompatibilität mit den neuesten API-Aktualisierungen und -Feldern zu gewährleisten, während es gleichzeitig die Aufgabenautomatisierung mit Befehlen wie ''task tark'' für eine nahtlose Client-Regenerierung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a atualizar dinamicamente e regenerar o esquema GraphQL do tarkov.dev, garantindo a compatibilidade com as últimas atualizações de API e campos, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita a automação de tarefas com comandos como ''task tark'' para regeneração de cliente sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью динамически обновлять и регенерировать схему GraphQL tarkov.dev, обеспечивая совместимость с последними обновлениями API и полями, а также использует автоматизацию задач с помощью команд типа ''task tark'' для бесшовной регенерации клиента.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحديث مخطط GraphQL الخاص بـ tarkov.dev ديناميكيًا وإعادة إنشائه، مما يضمن التوافق مع أحدث تحديثات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وحقولها، في الوقت نفسه يستفيد من تautomatización المهام باستخدام أوامر مثل ''task tark'' من أجل تجديد العميل بسلاسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Updating tarkov.dev API schema after major updates","Resolving ''unknown field'' errors in GraphQL queries","Regenerating the Go client for new data types"],"zh":["在主要更新后更新 tarkov.dev API 模式","解决 GraphQL 查询中的 ''未知字段'' 错误","为新数据类型重新生成 Go 客户端"],"ja":["主な更新後の tarkov.dev API スキーマの更新","GraphQL クエリでの ''未知のフィールド'' エラーの解決","新しいデータ型のための Go クライアントの再生成"],"ko":["메이저 업데이트 후 탈출 타르코프 API 스키마 업데이트","GraphQL 쿼리에서 ''unknown field'' 오류 해결","새 데이터 타입을 위한 Go 클라이언트 재생성"],"es":["Actualización del esquema de la API de tarkov.dev después de actualizaciones importantes","Resolución de errores de ''campo desconocido'' en consultas de GraphQL","Regeneración del cliente de Go para nuevos tipos de datos"],"fr":["Mise à jour du schéma de l''API de tarkov.dev après des mises à jour majeures","Résolution des erreu