mutation","Enregistrement de fonctions de mutation","Opérations de base de données","Modèles de programmation","Appels à des mutations à partir d''autres fonctions Convex"],"de":["Definition von Mutationsfunktionen","Registrierung von Mutationsfunktionen","Datenbankoperationen","Programmiermuster","Aufruf von Mutationen aus anderen Convex-Funktionen"],"pt":["Definição de funções de mutação","Registro de funções","Operações de banco de dados (inserir, patch, substituir, excluir)","Chamadas de mutações de outras funções Convex","Padrões de agendamento de mutações"],"ru":["Определение функций мутации","Регистрация функций","Операции с базой данных (вставка, патч, замена, удаление)","Вызовы мутаций из других функций Convex","Шаблоны планирования мутаций"],"ar":["تعريف دوال الطفرة","تسجيل الدوال","عمليات قاعدة البيانات (إدخال، باتش، استبدال، حذف)","استدعاء دوال الطفرة من دوال محدبة أخرى","أنماط جدولة الطفرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 变异函数","mutation 函数","Convex 数据库","函数定义","注册","数据库操作","调度模式"],"ja":["Convex 変異関数","mutation 関数","Convex データベース","関数定義","登録","データベース操作","スケジューリングパターン"],"ko":["Convex 변이 함수","mutation 함수","Convex 데이터베이스","함수 정의","등록","데이터베이스操作","스케줄링 패턴"],"es":["mutaciones convexas","funciones de mutación","base de datos convexas","definición de funciones","registro de funciones","operaciones de base de datos","patrones de programación","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["mutations convexes","fonctions de mutation","base de données convexes","définition de fonctions","enregistrement de fonctions","opérations de base de données","modèles de programmation","développement de logiciels"],"de":["konvexe Mutationen","Mutationsfunktionen","konvexe Datenbanken","Definition von Funktionen","Registrierung von Funktionen","Datenbankoperationen","Programmiermuster","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["mutações convexas","funções de mutação","banco de dados Convex","desenvolvimento de software","boas práticas de programação","padrões de agendamento"],"ru":["волновые мутации","функции мутации","база данных Convex","разработка программного обеспечения","лучшие практики программирования","шаблоны планирования"],"ar":["الطفرات المحدبة","دوال الطفرة","قاعدة بيانات محدبة","تطوير البرمجيات","أفضل الممارسات البرمجية","أنماط الجدولة"]}},"owner":"AbrahamX3","repo":"hivio","repoPath":"AbrahamX3/hivio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-mutations","description":"This skill should be used when implementing Convex mutation functions. It provides comprehensive guidelines for defining, registering, calling, and scheduling mutations, including database operations, transactions, and scheduled job patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Convex Mutations Skill\n\nThis skill provides specialized guidance for implementing Convex mutation functions, including best practices for function definition, registration, database operations, and scheduling patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Defining new mutation functions to write or modify data in the Convex database\n- Performing database operations (`insert`, `patch`, `replace`, `delete`)\n- Calling mutations from other Convex functions\n- Scheduling future mutatio","body":"# Convex Mutations Skill\n\nThis skill provides specialized guidance for implementing Convex mutation functions, including best practices for function definition, registration, database operations, and scheduling patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Defining new mutation functions to write or modify data in the Convex database\n- Performing database operations (`insert`, `patch`, `replace`, `delete`)\n- Calling mutations from other Convex functions\n- Scheduling future mutations with `ctx.scheduler.runAfter`\n- Handling transactional operations\n- Coordinating mutations with actions for background processing\n\n## Skill Resources\n\nThis skill includes comprehensive reference documentation in `references/mutation-guidelines.md` that covers:\n\n### Core Mutation Development\n- Function definition syntax using the new function syntax\n- Mutation registration (`mutation` and `internalMutation`)\n- Argument validators and their usage\n- Function calling patterns (`ctx.runQuery` and `ctx.runMutation`)\n- Function references (`api` and `internal` objects)\n- File-based routing for mutation paths\n\n### Database Operations\n- `ctx.db.insert()` - Create new documents\n- `ctx.db.patch()` - Shallow merge updates into existing documents\n- `ctx.db.replace()` - Fully replace existing documents\n- Error handling for missing documents\n- Transaction semantics and consistency guarantees\n\n### Advanced Mutation Features\n- **Scheduling**: Using `ctx.scheduler.runAfter()` to queue background jobs\n  - Scheduling mutations and actions for future execution\n  - Understanding that auth state does NOT propagate to scheduled jobs\n  - Using internal functions for scheduled jobs that need privileges\n  - Avoiding tight loops and respecting 10-second minimum intervals\n- **Transactional Behavior**: Understanding mutation transactions\n  - Enqueuing scheduler jobs is transactional within mutations\n  - Race condition prevention through transaction boundaries\n\n### Function Composition\n- Calling queries within mutations for validation\n- Calling mutations from mutations\n- Using return type annotations for same-file mutation calls\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n1. **Read the reference documentation** at `references/mutation-guidelines.md` to understand the complete mutation patterns\n2. **Follow the syntax examples** for defining mutation functions with proper validators\n3. **Use appropriate database operations** (`insert`, `patch`, `replace`) based on your needs\n4. **Schedule background work** using `ctx.scheduler.runAfter` for long-running operations\n5. **Remember auth state does NOT propagate** to scheduled jobs; use internal functions for privileged operations\n6. **Leverage transactions** for consistency across multiple operations\n\n## Key Mutation Guidelines\n\n- ALWAYS include argument validators for all mutation functions\n- Use `ctx.db.patch()` for partial updates and `ctx.db.replace()` for full replacements\n- Use `ctx.scheduler.runAfter()` to schedule actions (e.g., AI responses, notifications)\n- Remember that scheduled jobs have `null` auth state; use internal functions instead\n- Mutations execute for at most 1 second and can write up to 8192 documents\n- Return `null` implicitly if your mutation doesn''t have an explicit return value\n- Use return type annotations when calling mutations in the same file (TypeScript circularity workaround)\n\n## Example: Mutation with Database Operation and Scheduling\n\n```ts\nimport { mutation, internalAction } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nexport const sendMessage = mutation({\n  args: {\n    channelId: v.id(\"channels\"),\n    authorId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n  },\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Validate channel and user exist\n    const channel = await ctx.db.get(args.channelId);\n    if (!channel) {\n      throw new Error(\"Channel not found\");\n    }\n\n    // Insert message into database\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"messages\", {\n      channelId: args.channelId,\n      authorId: args.authorId,\n      content: args.content,\n    });\n\n    // Schedule AI response generation (transactional)\n    await ctx.scheduler.runAfter(0, internal.functions.generateResponse, {\n      channelId: args.channelId,\n    });\n\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const updateUserStatus = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    status: v.string(),\n  },\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Patch updates an existing document with shallow merge\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.userId, {\n      status: args.status,\n      lastUpdated: Date.now(),\n    });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\nFor more detailed information and additional patterns, refer to the complete reference documentation.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:07:29.808Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Convex-based AI Agents requiring advanced data mutation and database operation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级数据变异和数据库操作能力的基于Convex的AI代理。","ja":"ConvexベースのAIエージェントが高度なデータ変異とデータベース操作機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Convex 기반 AI 에이전트가 고급 데이터 변형 및 데이터베이스操作 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Convex que requieren capacidades de mutación de datos avanzadas y operaciones de base de datos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Convex nécessitant des capacités de mutation de données avancées et des opérations de base de données.","de":"Ideal für Convex-basierte KI-Agenten, die erweiterte Datenmutation und Datenbankvorgangsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Convex que exigem capacidades avançadas de mutação de dados e operações de banco de dados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Convex, требующих продвинутых возможностей мутации данных и операций с базой данных.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستندة إلى Convex الذين يتطلبون قدرات متقدمة لتحويل البيانات وعمليات قاعدة البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define and register custom mutation functions, perform database operations like insert, patch, replace, and delete, and schedule future mutations using Convex''s database operations and scheduling patterns.","zh":"赋予代理定义和注册自定义变异函数、执行 Convex 的数据库操作（如插入、修补、替换和删除）以及使用 Convex 的数据库操作和调度模式来安排将来的变异的能力。","ja":"エージェントがカスタム変異関数を定義して登録し、Convex のデータベース操作（挿入、修正、置換、削除など）を実行し、Convex のデータベース操作とスケジューリングパターンを使用して将来的に変異をスケジュールする機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 지정 변이 함수를 정의하고 등록하고 Convex의 데이터베이스操作(삽입, 패치, 대체, 삭제 등)을 수행하며 Convex의 데이터베이스 작업 및 예약 패턴을 사용하여 향후 변이를 예약할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir y registrar funciones de mutación personalizadas, realizar operaciones de base de datos como insertar, parchear, reemplazar y eliminar, y programar mutaciones futuras utilizando las operaciones de base de datos y los patrones de programación de Convex.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir et d''enregistrer des fonctions de mutation personnalisées, d''effectuer des opérations de base de données comme insérer, patcher, remplacer et supprimer, et de planifier des mutations futures en utilisant les opérations de base de données et les modèles de planification de Convex.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Mutationsfunktionen zu definieren und zu registrieren, Datenbankvorgänge wie Einfügen, Patchen, Ersetzen und Löschen durchzuführen und zukünftige Mutationen mithilfe der Datenbankvorgänge und Schedulingmuster von Convex zu planen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir e registrar funções de mutação personalizadas, realizar operações de banco de dados como inserir, patch, substituir e excluir, e agendar mutações futuras usando os padrões de operações e agendamento de banco de dados do Convex.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять и регистрировать пользовательские функции мутации, выполнять операции с базой данных, такие как вставка, патч, замена и удаление, а также планировать будущие мутации с помощью шаблонов операций и планирования базы данных Convex.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تعريف وتسجيل دوال تحويل مخصصة، وإجراء عمليات قاعدة البيانات مثل الإدراج والتحديث والاستبدال والحذف، وتحديد مواعيد التحويلات المستقبلية باستخدام أنماط عمليات قاعدة البيانات وتحديد الجدول من Convex."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining new mutation functions for custom data operations","Performing batch database updates using Convex''s patch operation","Scheduling recurring data mutations for automated workflows"],"zh":["为自定义数据操作定义新的变异函数","使用 Convex 的修补操作执行批处理数据库更新","使用 Convex 的数据库操作和调度模式安排重复数据变异以实现自动工作流"],"ja":["カスタムデータ操作のための新しい変異関数を定義する","Convex のパッチ操作を使用してバッチデータベース更新を実行する","Convex のデータベース操作とスケジューリングパターンを使用して繰り返しデータ変異をスケジュールし、自動化されたワークフローを実現する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 데이터 작업을 위한 새로운 변이 함수 정의","Convex의 패치 작업을 사용하여 배치 데이터베이스 업데이트를 수행","Convex의 데이터베이스 작업 및 예약 패턴을 사용하여 반복 데이터 변이를 예약하여 자동화된 워크플ロー 구현"],"es":["Definir nuevas funciones de mutación para operaciones de datos personalizadas","Realizar actualizaciones de base de datos por lotes utilizando la operación de parche de Convex","Programar mutaciones de datos recurrentes para flujos de trabajo automatizados"],"fr":["Définir de nouvelles fonctions de mutation pour des opérations de données personnalisées","Effectuer des mises à jour de base de données par lot en utilisant l''opération de patch de Convex","Planifier des mutations de données récurrentes pour des flux de travail automatisés"],"de":["Definieren neuer Mutationsfunktionen für benutzerdefinierte Datenoperationen","Durchführen von Batch-Datenbankaktualisierungen mithilfe der Patch-Operation von Convex","Planen wiederkehrender Datenmutationen für automatisierte Workflows"],"pt":["Definir novas funções de mutação para operações de dados personalizadas","Realizar atualizações em batch de banco de dados usando a operação de patch do Convex","Agendar mutações de dados recorrentes para fluxos de trabalho automatizados"],"ru":["Определение новых функций мутации для пользовательских операций с данными","Выполнение пакетных обновлений базы данных с помощью операции патча Convex","Планирование повторяющихся мутаций данных для автоматизированных рабочих процессов"],"ar":["تحديد دوال تحويل جديدة لعمليات البيانات المخصصة","إجراء تحديثات دفعة من قاعدة البيانات باستخدام عملية التحديث من Convex","تحديد مواعيد تحويلات البيانات المتكررة للتدفقات العملية الآلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex database setup","Limited to Convex''s mutation function definitions and registration"],"zh":["需要 Convex 数据库设置","仅限 Convex 的变异函数定义和注册"],"ja":["Convex データベースの設定が必要","Convex の変異関数の定義と登録に限定される"],"ko":["Convex 데이터베이스 설정이 필요","Convex의 변이 함수 정의 및 등록에만 한정"],"es":["Requiere configuración de base de datos de Convex","Limitado a las definiciones y registro de funciones de mutación de Convex"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de base de données Convex","Limité aux définitions et à l''enregistrement des fonctions de mutation de Convex"],"de":["Benötigt Convex-Datenbankkonfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Definitionen und Registrierung von Mutationsfunktionen von Convex"],"pt":["Exige configuração do banco de dados Convex","Limitado às definições e registro de funções de mutação do Convex"],"ru":["Требует настройки базы данных Convex","Ограничен определениями и регистрацией функций мутации Convex"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد قاعدة البيانات Convex","محدود بالتعريفات وتسجيل دوال التحويل من Convex"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HKTITAN/FediChess/fedichess-design', 'community', 'HKTITAN', 'FediChess', 'HKTITAN/FediChess', 'fedichess-design', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z', '2026-02-18T10:07:10.436Z', NULL, '{"id":"HKTITAN/FediChess/fedichess-design","name":"fedichess-design","description":{"zh":"FediChess 设计原则旨在打造简单、流畅和愉悦的去中心化国际象棋体验","ja":"FediChess のデザイン原則は、シンプルでフルイドでデライトした分散型チェスの体験を創り出すことを目指しています","ko":"FediChess 의 디자인 원칙은 단순성, 유연성, 즐거움을 통해 더 나은 분산형 체스 경험을 만드는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"FediChess es una plataforma de ajedrez descentralizada en el navegador, diseñada con simplicidad y fluidez","fr":"FediChess est une plateforme d''échecs décentralisée dans le navigateur, conçue avec simplicité et fluidité","de":"FediChess ist eine dezentrale Schachplattform im Browser, die für Einfachheit und Flüssigkeit konzipiert ist","pt":"O FediChess é um jogo de xadrez descentralizado que segue princípios de simplicidade, fluidez e deleite","ru":"FediChess - это децентрализованная шахматная игра, следующая принципам простоты, плавности и удовольствия","ar":"FediChess هي لعبة شطرنج لامركزية تتبع مبادئ البساطة والسلاسة والمتعة","en":"FediChess: The fediverse of chess. Decentralized P2P chess in the browser."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"FediChess 设计原则","ja":"FediChess デザイン原則","ko":"FediChess 디자인 원칙","es":"Diseño de FediChess: Ajedrez descentralizado","fr":"Conception FediChess: Échecs décentralisés","de":"FediChess-Design: Dezentrales Schach","pt":"FediChess Design: Interface de Xadrez Decentralizada","ru":"Дизайн FediChess: Децентрализованный шахматный интерфейс","ar":"تصميم FediChess: واجهة شطرنج لبيرية متوزعة","en":"fedichess-design"},"description":{"zh":"FediChess 设计原则旨在打造简单、流畅和愉悦的去中心化国际象棋体验","ja":"FediChess のデザイン原則は、シンプルでフルイドでデライトした分散型チェスの体験を創り出すことを目指しています","ko":"FediChess 의 디자인 원칙은 단순성, 유연성, 즐거움을 통해 더 나은 분산형 체스 경험을 만드는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"FediChess es una plataforma de ajedrez descentralizada en el navegador, diseñada con simplicidad y fluidez","fr":"FediChess est une plateforme d''échecs décentralisée dans le navigateur, conçue avec simplicité et fluidité","de":"FediChess ist eine dezentrale Schachplattform im Browser, die für Einfachheit und Flüssigkeit konzipiert ist","pt":"O FediChess é um jogo de xadrez descentralizado que segue princípios de simplicidade, fluidez e deleite","ru":"FediChess - это децентрализованная шахматная игра, следующая принципам простоты, плавности и удовольствия","ar":"FediChess هي لعبة شطرنج لامركزية تتبع مبادئ البساطة والسلاسة والمتعة","en":"FediChess: The fediverse of chess. Decentralized P2P chess in the browser."},"definition":{"en":"FediChess: The fediverse of chess. Decentralized P2P chess in the browser."},"features":{"zh":["简单的设计","流畅的过渡","愉悦的体验","进步式披露","元素复用"],"ja":["シンプルなデザイン","フルイドな遷移","デライトな体験","プログレッシブな開示","要素の再利用"],"ko":["단순한 디자인","유연한 전환","즐거운 경험","진행식 공개","요소 재사용"],"es":["Diseño minimalista y enfocado","Transiciones suaves y progresivas","Animaciones significativas y sin decoración","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva","Funcionalidad de redes sociales descentralizadas","Juego de ajedrez peer-to-peer en el navegador"],"fr":["Conception minimaliste et ciblée","Transitions fluides et progressives","Animations significatives et sans décoration","Interface utilisateur intuitive","Fonctionnalité de réseaux sociaux décentralisés","Jeu d''échecs pair-à-pair dans le navigateur"],"de":["Minimalistisches und fokussiertes Design","Flüssige und progressive Übergänge","Sinnvolle und dekorationsfreie Animationen","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche","Funktion dezentraler sozialer Netzwerke","Schachspiel peer-to-peer im Browser"],"pt":["Interface simples e intuitiva","Transições suaves e propositais","Reutilização de elementos para continuidade","Surpresas agradáveis em momentos de alto impacto","Design responsivo para dispositivos móveis","Integração com a fediversa"],"ru":["Простой и интуитивный интерфейс","Плавные и осмысленные переходы","Переиспользование элементов для непрерывности","Приятные сюрпризы в моменты высокого воздействия","Отзывчивый дизайн для мобильных устройств","Интеграция с федиверсом"],"ar":["واجهة بسيطة و直觉ية","انتقالات سلسة ومدروسة","إعادة استخدام العناصر من أجل الاستمرارية","مفاجآت سارة في لحظات التأثير العالي","تصميم مستجيب للاجهزة المحمولة","التكامل مع الفيديفيرس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["FediChess","去中心化国际象棋","设计原则","简单性","流畅性","愉悦性","进步式披露","元素复用"],"ja":["FediChess","分散型チェス","デザイン原則","シンプル性","フルイド性","デライト性","プログレッシブな開示","要素の再利用"],"ko":["FediChess","분산형 체스","디자인 원칙","단순성","유연성","즐거움","진행식 공개","요소 재사용"],"es":["ajedrez descentralizado","diseño de FediChess","ajedrez en el navegador","juego de ajedrez peer-to-peer","plataforma de ajedrez","desarrollo de juegos","tecnologías de redes sociales","diseño de interfaz de usuario","experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["échecs décentralisés","conception FediChess","échecs dans le navigateur","jeu d''échecs pair-à-pair","plateforme d''échecs","développement de jeux","technologies de réseaux sociaux","conception d''interface utilisateur","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["dezentrales Schach","FediChess-Design","Schach im Browser","Schachspiel peer-to-peer","Schachplattform","Spieleentwicklung","Soziale-Netzwerk-Technologien","Benutzeroberflächen-Design","Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["FediChess","xadrez descentralizado","jogo de xadrez peer-to-peer","design de interface de usuário","princípios de design","simplicidade","fluidez","deleite","fediversa"],"ru":["FediChess","децентрализованные шахматы","шахматная игра peer-to-peer","дизайн пользовательского интерфейса","принципы дизайна","простота","плавность","удовольствие","федиверс"],"ar":["FediChess","شطرنج لامركزي","لعبة شطرنج نقطة إلى نقطة","تصميم واجهة المستخدم","مبادئ التصميم","البساطة","السلاسة","المرح","الفيديفيرس"]}},"owner":"HKTITAN","repo":"FediChess","repoPath":"HKTITAN/FediChess","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fedichess-design","description":"Use when designing or changing UI, layout, or motion in FediChess.","bodyPreview":"# FediChess design\n\nApply when changing UI, layout, or motion in the app.\n\n## Principles\n\n- **Simplicity**: One primary focus per view. Use tray/overlay for secondary actions (settings, copy link). Progressive disclosure; avoid crowding the main screen.\n- **Fluidity**: Smooth, purposeful transitions (view changes, modals). Reuse or morph elements for continuity. Avoid static jumps and redundant or decorative animation.\n- **Delight**: Polish and small surprises in high-impact moments (landing CTA","body":"# FediChess design\n\nApply when changing UI, layout, or motion in the app.\n\n## Principles\n\n- **Simplicity**: One primary focus per view. Use tray/overlay for secondary actions (settings, copy link). Progressive disclosure; avoid crowding the main screen.\n- **Fluidity**: Smooth, purposeful transitions (view changes, modals). Reuse or morph elements for continuity. Avoid static jumps and redundant or decorative animation.\n- **Delight**: Polish and small surprises in high-impact moments (landing CTA, move confirmation, game end). Avoid sprinkling motion everywhere; follow a delight–impact curve.\n\n## Typography and brand\n\n- **Instrument Serif** for brand and headings (e.g. main \"FediChess\" title, section headings).\n- Body text: neutral sans for readability.\n- Reference `.agents/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md` for typography, color, and motion details. FediChess design principles are the project design language.\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill when the user asks to change or add UI, layout, animations, or styling in FediChess (landing, lobby, game, or shared components).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:07:10.436Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to implement simplicity, fluidity, and delight in UI design for decentralized P2P applications like FediChess.","zh":"非常适合需要在去中心化P2P应用程序（如FediChess）中实现简单、流畅和愉悦的UI设计的前端代理。","ja":"FediChessなどの分散型P2Pアプリケーションでシンプルさ、流暢さ、そしてUI設計の愉悦性を実現する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"FediChess와 같은 분산형 P2P 애플리케이션에서 단순성, 유연성, 그리고 UI 설계의 즐거움을 구현해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 최적입니다.","es":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to implement simplicity, fluidity, and delight in UI design for decentralized P2P applications like FediChess.","fr":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to implement simplicity, fluidity, and delight in UI design for decentralized P2P applications like FediChess.","de":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to implement simplicity, fluidity, and delight in UI design for decentralized P2P applications like FediChess.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam implementar simplicidade, fluidez e prazer no design de UI para aplicações P2P descentralizadas como o FediChess.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо реализовать простоту, плавность и удовольствие в дизайне интерфейса пользователя для децентрализованных приложений P2P, таких как FediChess.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ البساطة والسلاسة والبهجة في تصميم واجهة المستخدم للتطبيقات اللامركزية من النوع إلى النوع مثل FediChess."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create smooth, purposeful transitions and polished user interfaces using principles of progressive disclosure, avoiding crowding and static jumps, with a focus on high-impact moments and small surprises, leveraging tray/overlay for secondary actions.","zh":"赋予代理创建平滑、有目的的过渡和精致的用户界面，使用渐进式披露的原则，避免拥挤和静态跳转，关注高影响时刻和小惊喜，利用托盘/覆盖层进行次要操作。","ja":"エージェントがスムーズで目的のある遷移と洗練されたユーザーインターフェースを作成できるようにし、プログレッシブディスクロージャーの原則を使用して、混雑や静的ジャンプを避け、ハイインパクトな瞬間や小さな驚きに焦点を当て、トレイ/オーバーレイを使用して二次的なアクションを実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 매끄럽고 목적 있는 전환과 세련된 사용자 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 점진적 공개의 원칙을 사용하여 혼잡 및 정적 점프를 피하고, 높은 영향의 순간 및 작은 즐거움에 초점을 맞추며, 트레이/오버레이를 사용하여 보조 동작을 수행합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to create smooth, purposeful transitions and polished user interfaces using principles of progressive disclosure, avoiding crowding and static jumps, with a focus on high-impact moments and small surprises, leveraging tray/overlay for secondary actions.","fr":"Empowers agents to create smooth, purposeful transitions and polished user interfaces using principles of progressive disclosure, avoiding crowding and static jumps, with a focus on high-impact moments and small surprises, leveraging tray/overlay for secondary actions.","de":"Empowers agents to create smooth, purposeful transitions and polished user interfaces using principles of progressive disclosure, avoiding crowding and static jumps, with a focus on high-impact moments and small surprises, leveraging tray/overlay for secondary actions.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem transições suaves e intencionais e interfaces de usuário polidas usando princípios de divulgação progressiva, evitando aglomeração e saltos estáticos, com foco em momentos de alto impacto e pequenas surpresas, utilizando bandeja/sobreposição para ações secundárias.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать плавные и осмысленные переходы и отполированные интерфейсы пользователя, используя принципы постепенного раскрытия, избегая загромождения и статических прыжков, с фокусом на моменты высокого воздействия и небольшие сюрпризы, используя поддон/наложение для второстепенных действий.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء انتقالات سلسة وهادفة وواجهات مستخدم مصقولة باستخدام مبادئ الإفصاح التدريجي، وتجنب الازدحام والقفزات الثابتة، مع التركيز على اللحظات ذات التأثير العالي والصدمات الصغيرة، واستخدام الشريط/التغطية للإجراءات الثانوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing intuitive landing pages with clear calls-to-action","Implementing fluid motion in view changes and modals for FediChess","Enhancing user experience through simplicity and delight in decentralized applications"],"zh":["为FediChess设计直观的着陆页，具有清晰的行动号召","在视图更改和模态中实现流畅的动作","通过简单性和愉悦性增强去中心化应用程序的用户体验"],"ja":["FediChessのための直感的なランディングページを設計し、明確なコールツーアクションを実装する","ビューの変更やモーダルでスムーズな動きを実現する","シンプルさと愉悦性を通じて分散型アプリケーションのユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる"],"ko":["FediChess를 위한 직관적인 랜딩 페이지를 설계하고, 명확한 행동 호출을 구현하는こと","뷰 변경 및 모달에서 유연한 동작을 구현하는 것","단순성 및 즐거움을 통해 분산형 애플리케이션의 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Designing intuitive landing pages with clear calls-to-action","Implementing fluid motion in view changes and modals for FediChess","Enhancing user experience through simplicity and delight in decentralized applications"],"fr":["Designing intuitive landing pages with clear calls-to-action","Implementing fluid motion in view changes and modals for FediChess","Enhancing user experience through simplicity and delight in decentralized applications"],"de":["Designing intuitive landing pages with clear calls-to-action","Implementing fluid motion in view changes and modals for FediChess","Enhancing user experience through simplicity and delight in decentralized applications"],"pt":["Projetar páginas de destino intuitivas com chamadas para ação claras","Implementar movimento fluido em alterações de exibição e modais para FediChess","Melhorar a experiência do usuário por meio da simplicidade e do prazer em aplicações descentralizadas"],"ru":["Проектировать интуитивно понятные страницы назначения с четкими призывами к действию","Реализовывать плавное движение при изменениях вида и модальных окнах для FediChess","Улучшать опыт пользователя за счет простоты и удовольствия в децентрализованных приложениях"],"ar":["تصميم صفحات وجهة بديهية مع دعوات لاتخاذ إجراء واضحة","تنفيذ حركة سائلة في تغييرات العرض والشاشات المنبثقة لبرنامج FediChess","تحسين تجربة المستخدم من خلال البساطة والبهجة في التطبيقات اللامركزية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of UI/UX principles","Limited to browser-based applications","Focus on simplicity may limit complexity of design"],"zh":["需要了解UI/UX原则","仅限于基于浏览器的应用程序","对简单性的关注可能会限制设计的复杂性"],"ja":["UI/UXの原則を理解する必要がある","ブラウザーベースのアプリケーションに限定される","シンプルさに焦点を当てているため、設計の複雑さが制限される可能性がある"],"ko":["UI/UX 원칙을 이해해야 함","브라우저 기반 애플리케이션으로 제한됨","단순성에 초점을 맞추고 있으므로 디자인의 복잡성이 제한될 수 있음"],"es":["Requires understanding of UI/UX principles","Limited to browser-based applications","Focus on simplicity may limit complexity of design"],"fr":["Requires understanding of UI/UX principles","Limited to browser-based applications","Focus on simplicity may limit complexity of design"],"de":["Requires understanding of UI/UX principles","Limited to browser-based applications","Focus on simplicity may limit complexity of design"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de UI/UX","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em navegador","O foco na simplicidade pode limitar a complexidade do design"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов UI/UX","Ограничен для браузерных приложений","Фокус на простоте может ограничить сложность дизайна"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ واجهة المستخدم وخبرة المستخدم","محدود للتطبيقات المستندة إلى المتصفح","التركيز على البساطة قد يقيد تعقيد التصميم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
