:"add-stepスキルは、パイプラインステップの管理に使用されます。新しいステップを追加し、後のステップを再番号付けします","ko":"add-step 스킬은 파이프라인 단계를 관리하는 데 사용되며 새로운 단계를 추가하고 이후 단계를 다시 번호 매깁니다","es":"El skill ''add-step'' permite agregar pasos en p2cs_project, incluyendo la renumeración de pasos y una checklist para la creación de clases de paso y subpasos.","fr":"Le skill ''add-step'' permet d''ajouter des étapes dans p2cs_project, y compris la renumérotation des étapes et une checklist pour la création de classes d''étap...","de":"Das Skill ''add-step'' ermöglicht das Hinzufügen von Schritten in p2cs_project, einschließlich der Neunummerierung von Schritten und einer Checklist für die Er...","pt":"O skill add-step permite adicionar etapas ao pipeline do projeto p2cs_project, incluindo a criação de classes de etapa e sublistas.","ru":"Навык add-step позволяет добавлять шаги в pipeline проекта p2cs_project, включая создание классов шагов и подшагов.","ar":"تمكنك مهارة add-step من إضافة خطوات إلى pipeline لمشروع p2cs_project، بما في ذلك إنشاء فئات الخطوة والخطوات الفرعية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["添加新步骤","插入步骤","重编号后续步骤","创建步骤类","创建子步骤","创建README"],"ja":["新しいステップを追加","ステップを挿入","後のステップを再番号付け","ステップクラスを作成","サブステップを作成","READMEを作成"],"ko":["새로운 단계 추가","단계 삽입","이후 단계 다시 번호 매기기","단계 클래스 생성","서브 단계 생성","README 생성"],"es":["Agregar pasos en p2cs_project","Renumeración automática de pasos","Checklist para la creación de clases de paso y subpasos","Compatibilidad con la arquitectura de p2cs_project","Soporte para la creación de archivos README y explore.ipynb"],"fr":["Ajouter des étapes dans p2cs_project","Renommage automatique des étapes","Checklist pour la création de classes d''étape et de sous-étapes","Compatibilité avec l''architecture de p2cs_project","Prise en charge de la création de fichiers README et explore.ipynb"],"de":["Schritte in p2cs_project hinzufügen","Automatische Neunummerierung von Schritten","Checklist für die Erstellung von Schrittklassen und UnterSchritten","Kompatibilität mit der Architektur von p2cs_project","Unterstützung für die Erstellung von README- und explore.ipynb-Dateien"],"pt":["Adicionar etapas ao pipeline","Criar classes de etapa e sublistas","Inserir etapas entre etapas existentes","Renumerar etapas posteriores","Criar checklist para criação de etapas"],"ru":["Добавить шаги в pipeline","Создать классы шагов и подшагов","Вставить шаги между существующими шагами","Перенумеровать последующие шаги","Создать чек-лист для создания шагов"],"ar":["إضافة خطوات إلى Pipeline","إنشاء فئات الخطوة والخطوات الفرعية","إدراج خطوات بين خطوات موجودة","إعادة ترقيم الخطوات اللاحقة","إنشاء قائمة تحقق لإنشاء الخطوات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["管道步骤管理","add-step技能","管道步骤","步骤管理","代码管理","项目管理"],"ja":["パイプラインステップ管理","add-stepスキル","パイプラインステップ","ステップ管理","コード管理","プロジェクト管理"],"ko":["파이프라인 단계 관리","add-step 스킬","파이프라인 단계","단계 관리","코드 관리","프로젝트 관리"],"es":["p2cs_project","agregar pasos","renumeración de pasos","checklist para la creación de clases de paso","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["p2cs_project","ajouter des étapes","renommage des étapes","checklist pour la création de classes d''étape","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","automatisation de tâches"],"de":["p2cs_project","Schritte hinzufügen","Neunummerierung von Schritten","Checklist für die Erstellung von Schrittklassen","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["add-step","pipeline","etapa","projeto p2cs_project","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","pipeline de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["add-step","pipeline","шаг","проект p2cs_project","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","pipeline разработки"],"ar":["add-step","pipeline","خطوة","مشروع p2cs_project","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","pipeline التطوير"]}},"owner":"segal-noam","repo":"p2cs_project","repoPath":"segal-noam/p2cs_project","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-step","description":"Add or insert a new numbered pipeline step in the p2cs_project, following the standardized Step/DataFile/explore notebook patterns and safely renumbering subsequent steps (code, data, figures, tests, config, dependencies, and imports) when inserting in the middle of the pipeline. Use when creating a new step_* directory, inserting a step between existing ones, or updating step numbers across the project.","bodyPreview":"# Add Step (p2cs_project)\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- A new pipeline step needs to be added under `code/step_{N}_{name}/`.\n- A step should be **inserted between existing steps**, requiring **renumbering** of later steps.\n- You need a checklist for creating the step class, substeps, README, `explore.ipynb`, and wiring dependencies/config.\n\nThis skill is **project-specific** to `p2cs_project` and assumes the architecture described in the root `README.md`.\n\n---\n\n## Overview: Step Patte","body":"# Add Step (p2cs_project)\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- A new pipeline step needs to be added under `code/step_{N}_{name}/`.\n- A step should be **inserted between existing steps**, requiring **renumbering** of later steps.\n- You need a checklist for creating the step class, substeps, README, `explore.ipynb`, and wiring dependencies/config.\n\nThis skill is **project-specific** to `p2cs_project` and assumes the architecture described in the root `README.md`.\n\n---\n\n## Overview: Step Pattern\n\nEach numbered step follows the same high-level pattern:\n\n- Directory: `code/step_{N}_{snake_name}/`\n  - `step.py`: main `Step{N}{CamelName}` class inheriting from `base.Step`.\n  - `data_classes.py`: data classes inheriting from `DataFile` subclasses (when the step has new artifacts).\n  - `__init__.py`: re-exports the main step class (and sometimes helper symbols).\n  - `README.md`: step-specific documentation (inputs, outputs, substeps, external tools).\n  - `explore.ipynb`: exploration notebook following the **standard notebook structure** from the root `README.md`.\n  - Numbered substeps: `1_*.py`, `2_*.py`, etc., each implementing focused logic.\n- Outputs in `data/step_{N}_{snake_name}/` and figures in `figures/step_{N}_{snake_name}/` are routed via `base.paths`.\n- The step is registered in:\n  - `pipeline_config.yaml` under `steps: step_{N}_{snake_name}: ...`\n  - Tests in `code/tests/test_step_{N}.py`.\n\n**Good templates to copy from:**\n\n- Simple single-substep data step: `step_4_prepare_pairs/`\n- Multi-substep data/tooling step: `step_2_organism_distance/`\n- Modeling/evaluation step: `step_6_train_model/`, `step_7_crosstalk_estimation/`\n\n---\n\n## Workflow A: Append a New Step at the End\n\n1. **Determine the new step index and name**\n   - Inspect existing numbered steps under `code/step_*`.\n   - Let `N_max` be the largest index (currently `8` for `step_8_generate_paper`).\n   - Choose:\n     - New index: `N_new = N_max + 1`\n     - Snake name: `step_{N_new}_{snake_name}`\n     - Class name: `Step{N_new}{CamelName}`\n\n2. **Create the step directory**\n   - Create `code/step_{N_new}_{snake_name}/` with at least:\n     - `__init__.py` (re-export the main step class).\n     - `step.py` (main step implementation).\n     - `README.md` (step documentation).\n     - `explore.ipynb` (exploration notebook).\n     - One or more numbered substeps `1_*.py`, `2_*.py`, etc.\n     - `data_classes.py` and/or `config.json` if this step defines new data types or config.\n   - **Recommended pattern:** Copy the closest existing step directory (e.g., `step_4_prepare_pairs/`) and rename/trim to match the new step’s responsibilities.\n\n3. **Implement the main step class**\n   - In `step.py`:\n     - Import `Step` and path helpers from `code/base/step.py` and `code/base/paths.py`.\n     - Define a class like:\n       - `class Step{N_new}{CamelName}(Step):`\n     - Implement:\n       - `name` and `description` properties (or class attributes).\n       - `dependencies` property returning a `List[str]` of upstream steps, using canonical IDs like `\"step_1_get_p2cs_data\"`.\n       - `get_input_paths()` and `get_output_paths()` using data classes and `get_step_input_path` / `get_step_output_path`.\n       - `run()` orchestrating any substeps via `self.run_substeps(...)`.\n\n4. **Define data classes (if needed)**\n   - In `data_classes.py`:\n     - Inherit from appropriate `DataFile` subclasses (e.g., `PickleDataFile`, `CSVDataFile`, `NumpyDataFile`).\n     - Define schemas, descriptions, and default loaders/savers as in existing steps.\n   - Use these data classes in `get_input_paths()` / `get_output_paths()` and in substeps.\n\n5. **Create numbered substeps**\n   - Add scripts `1_*.py`, `2_*.py`, etc. inside the new step directory.\n   - Follow existing substep patterns:\n     - Each substep is a small class/function using the step’s data classes and `paths` helpers.\n     - The main step’s `run()` calls `self.run_substeps(...)` with:\n       - Substep objects\n       - `step_numbers=[1, 2, ...]`\n       - `descriptions=[...]`\n       - Appropriate `on_failure` mode (`\"strict\"` or `\"warning\"`).\n\n6. **Create the step README**\n   - In `README.md`, mirror the structure used in other steps:\n     - Short description.\n     - Inputs (data classes, upstream steps).\n     - Outputs and their data classes.\n     - Substeps and what they do.\n     - Any external tools / configs required.\n\n7. **Create the `explore.ipynb` notebook**\n   - Follow the standard structure from the root `README.md`:\n     - `# Imports` (path setup + step/data class imports).\n     - `# Load Data`\n       - `## Load Inputs` (using `step.get_input_paths()` + data classes).\n       - `## Load Outputs`.\n     - `# Plot`\n       - Display saved figures from visualization substeps first.\n       - Put any extra exploratory plots after those.\n     - `# Notes` (short list of exploration ideas).\n   - Respect the **collapsible headings rule** (heading-only markdown cells).\n\n8. **Wire the step into `pipeline_config.yaml`**\n   - Under `steps:`, add a new entry:\n     - Key: `step_{N_new}_{snake_name}:`\n     - Fields: `enabled`, `description`, `overwrite_outputs`, optional `fast_plots`, and `substeps:`.\n   - Add a `substeps:` section keyed by the filenames (without `.py`), matching patterns in other steps.\n\n9. **Add tests**\n   - Create `code/tests/test_step_{N_new}.py` by copying a nearby test (e.g., `test_step_4.py`) and adjusting:\n     - Imports to the new step and data classes.\n     - Test names and assertions to cover the new step’s behavior.\n\n10. **Run tests / pipeline checks**\n    - Run `pytest code/tests/test_step_{N_new}.py`.\n    - Optionally run the step via:\n      - `cd code && python run_pipeline.py --step step_{N_new}_{snake_name}`\n\n---\n\n## Workflow B: Insert a Step in the Middle (with Renumbering)\n\nUse this when inserting a new step **between** existing steps (e.g., between `step_3_embed_proteins` and `step_4_prepare_pairs`).\n\n### B1. Plan the new ordering\n\n1. **Identify current step order**\n   - List existing `code/step_*` directories and their indices (including `step_0_draw_theoretical`).\n\n2. **Choose insertion point**\n   - Let:\n     - `N_insert_after` = index of the step **before** the new one.\n     - `N_new = N_insert_after + 1`.\n   - All steps with index `> N_insert_after` must be shifted **up by 1**:\n     - Old `k` → new `k + 1` for all `k > N_insert_after`.\n\n3. **Decide the new step’s ID**\n   - Choose:\n     - New directory name: `step_{N_new}_{snake_name}`.\n     - New class name: `Step{N_new}{CamelName}`.\n\n### B2. Renumber existing steps (highest → lowest)\n\nPerform renaming **from highest index down to `N_insert_after + 1`** to avoid collisions.\n\nFor each step index `k` in descending order where `k > N_insert_after`:\n\n1. **Compute new index**\n   - `k_new = k + 1`.\n\n2. **Rename step directories**\n   - Code: `code/step_{k}_{name}/` → `code/step_{k_new}_{name}/`.\n   - Data: `data/step_{k}_{name}/` → `data/step_{k_new}_{name}/` (if exists).\n   - Figures: `figures/step_{k}_{name}/` → `figures/step_{k_new}_{name}/` (if exists).\n\n3. **Rename tests**\n   - `code/tests/test_step_{k}.py` → `code/tests/test_step_{k_new}.py`.\n\n4. **Update configuration keys**\n   - In `pipeline_config.yaml`, change:\n     - `step_{k}_{name}:` → `step_{k_new}_{name}:`.\n\n5. **Update string references and imports**\n   - Use text search for `step_{k}_{name}` and `test_step_{k}` across the repo and update to the new IDs:\n     - Imports like `from step_{k}_{name}...`.\n     - Dependency lists in `dependencies` properties (e.g., `return [\"step_{k}_{name}\", ...]`).\n     - Any key strings that reference `step_{k}_{name}`.\n\n6. **Update doc references**\n   - In `README.md` files and notebooks, update any textual references to the old step name or number, if present.\n\n### B3. Add the new step\n\nAfter all affected steps `k > N_insert_after` have been shifted to `k + 1`:\n\n1. **Create `code/step_{N_new}_{snake_name}/`**\n   - Follow **Workflow A, steps 2–7** to:\n     - Implement `step.py` and `data_classes.py`.\n     - Add numbered substeps.\n     - Add `README.md`.\n     - Add `explore.ipynb`.\n\n2. **Wire into `pipeline_config.yaml`**\n   - Under `steps:` add:\n     - `step_{N_new}_{snake_name}:` with its configuration and `substeps`.\n\n3. **Update dependencies**\n   - For the new step:\n     - Set `dependencies` to the upstream steps, using the **renumbered IDs**.\n   - For downstream steps:\n     - Review their `dependencies` properties:\n       - Replace any old IDs that were shifted, and add the new step as a dependency where appropriate.\n\n4. **Add test file**\n   - Create `code/tests/test_step_{N_new}.py` following neighboring step tests.\n\n5. **Sanity check references**\n   - Run a repo-wide search for any **old** step IDs (`step_{k}_{name}` where `k` was renumbered) and ensure:\n     - All references are either removed or updated to the new IDs.\n\n### B4. Validate after renumbering\n\n1. **Run targeted tests**\n   - Run:\n     - `cd code && pytest tests/test_step_{N_new}.py`\n     - Plus tests for all renumbered steps: `test_step_{k_new}.py`.\n\n2. **Run a dry pipeline**\n   - Optionally run:\n     - `cd code && python run_pipeline.py --list-steps` to confirm updated IDs and ordering.\n     - `cd code && python run_pipeline.py --step step_{N_new}_{snake_name}` to test the new step in context.\n\n---\n\n## Notebook Guidelines (Quick Reference)\n\nWhen creating or editing `explore.ipynb` for a step:\n\n- Follow the standard sections:\n  - `# Imports`\n  - `# Load Data`\n    - `## Load Inputs`\n    - `## Load Outputs`\n  - `# Plot`\n  - `# Notes`\n- Ensure each heading is in its **own markdown cell** to enable collapsible sections.\n- Use the data classes for loading inputs/outputs, not raw paths.\n- Display visualization substep figures first under `# Plot`; additional exploratory plots come after.\n\n---\n\n## Usage Summary\n\nWhen asked to **add a new step**:\n\n1. Decide whether it is an **append** (Workflow A) or **insert with renumbering** (Workflow B).\n2. Follow the appropriate workflow carefully, especially:\n   - Directory and file naming: `step_{N}_{snake_name}`, `test_step_{N}.py`.\n   - Dependency updates and imports.\n   - `pipeline_config.yaml` step and substep entries.\n   - `explore.ipynb` structure and data class usage.\n3. Always finish by running the relevant tests and, if feasible, a pipeline run of the new step.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:07:28.427Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Project Management Agents requiring pipeline step insertion and renumbering capabilities under Python-based architectures.","zh":"适用于需要在基于Python的架构中插入和重新编号流水线步骤的项目管理代理。","ja":"Pythonベースのアーキテクチャでパイプラインステップの挿入と再番号付け機能を必要とするプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適。","ko":"파이썬 기반 아키텍처에서 파이프라인 단계 삽입 및 다시 번호 매기기 기능을 필요로 하는 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Proyectos que requieren capacidades de inserción y renumeración de pasos de tubería bajo arquitecturas basadas en Python.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant des capacités d''insertion et de renumérotation d''étapes de pipeline sous des architectures basées sur Python.","de":"Ideal für Project-Management-Agents, die Pipeline-Schritt-Einfügungs- und Neunummerierungs-Funktionen unter Python-basierten Architekturen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que exigem capacidades de inserção e renumeração de etapas de pipeline em arquiteturas baseadas em Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, требующих возможности вставки и перенумерации шагов конвейера в архитектурах на основе Python.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المشاريع التي تتطلب إمكانيات إدراج واعادة ترقيم خطوات الأنابيب تحت الهياكل المعمارية القائمة على بايثون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dynamically insert new pipeline steps under code/step_{N}_{name}/, renumber subsequent steps, and create associated step classes, substeps, README files, and explore.ipynb notebooks, all while managing dependencies and configurations within the p2cs_project framework.","zh":"赋予代理在代码/步骤_{N}_{名称}/下动态插入新的流水线步骤、重新编号后续步骤、创建相关步骤类、子步骤、README文件和探索.ipynb笔记本的能力，同时在p2cs_project框架内管理依赖关系和配置。","ja":"コード/ステップ_{N}_{名前}/以下に新しいパイプラインステップを動的に挿入し、後のステップを再番号付けし、関連するステップクラス、サブステップ、READMEファイル、および探索.ipynbノートブックを作成し、p2cs_projectフレームワーク内で依存関係と構成を管理する能力をエージェントに付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 코드/단계_{N}_{이름}/ 아래에서 새로운 파이프라인 단계를 동적으로 삽입하고, 이후 단계를 다시 번호 매기고, 관련 단계 클래스, 서브 단계, README 파일 및 탐색.ipynb 노트북을 생성하며, p2cs_project 프레임워크 내에서 종속성 및 구성 관리를 수행하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes insertar dinámicamente nuevos pasos de tubería bajo code/step_{N}_{name}/, renumerar pasos posteriores, crear clases de paso, subpasos, archivos README y cuadernos explore.ipynb asociados, todo mientras se gestionan dependencias y configuraciones dentro del marco p2cs_project.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''insérer dynamiquement de nouvelles étapes de pipeline sous code/step_{N}_{name}/, de renuméroter les étapes suivantes, de créer des classes d''étape, des sous-étapes, des fichiers README et des cahiers explore.ipynb associés, le tout en gérant les dépendances et les configurations au sein du cadre p2cs_project.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Pipeline-Schritte unter code/step_{N}_{name}/ dynamisch einzufügen, nachfolgende Schritte neu zu nummerieren, Schritt-Klassen, Teilschritte, README-Dateien und explore.ipynb-Notebooks zu erstellen und Abhängigkeiten und Konfigurationen innerhalb des p2cs_project-Rahmens zu verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dinamicamente inserir novas etapas de pipeline em code/step_{N}_{name}/, renumerar etapas subsequentes, criar classes de etapas associadas, subetapas, arquivos README e notebooks explore.ipynb, tudo isso enquanto gerencia dependências e configurações dentro do framework p2cs_project.","ru":"Позволяет агентам динамически вставлять новые шаги конвейера в code/step_{N}_{name}/, перенумеровать последующие шаги, создавать связанные классы шагов, подшаги, файлы README и ноутбуки explore.ipynb, все это при управлении зависимостями и конфигурациями в рамках фреймворка p2cs_project.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إدراج خطوات أنابيب جديدة ديناميكيا في code/step_{N}_{name}/، وإعادة ترقيم الخطوات اللاحقة، وإنشاء فئات خطوات مرتبطة وخطوات فرعية وملفات README ومحوесп explore.ipynb، كل ذلك مع إدارة الاعتماديات والتكوين داخل إطار عمل p2cs_project."},"useCases":{"en":["Inserting pipeline steps with automatic renumbering of later steps","Creating step classes and substeps with accompanying README files","Generating explore.ipynb notebooks for new pipeline steps","Wiring dependencies and configurations for newly added steps"],"zh":["插入流水线步骤并自动重新编号后续步骤","创建步骤类和子步骤以及伴随的README文件","为新流水线步骤生成探索.ipynb笔记本","为新添加的步骤连接依赖关系和配置"],"ja":["パイプラインステップを挿入し、後のステップを自動的に再番号付けする","ステップクラスとサブステップを作成し、伴うREADMEファイルを作成する","新しいパイプラインステップのための探索.ipynbノートブックを生成する","新しく追加されたステップの依存関係と構成を接続する"],"ko":["파이프라인 단계 삽입 및 이후 단계 자동 다시 번호 매기기","단계 클래스 및 서브 단계 생성 및 README 파일 생성","새로운 파이프라인 단계에 대한 탐색.ipynb 노트북 생성","새로 추가된 단계의 종속성 및 구성 연결"],"es":["Inserción de pasos de tubería con renumeración automática de pasos posteriores","Creación de clases de paso y subpasos con archivos README acompañantes","Generación de cuadernos explore.ipynb para nuevos pasos de tubería","Conexión de dependencias y configuraciones para pasos recién agregados"],"fr":["Insertion d''étapes de pipeline avec renumérotation automatique des étapes suivantes","Création de classes d''étape et de sous-étapes avec des fichiers README accompagnants","Génération de cahiers explore.ipynb pour de nouvelles étapes de pipeline","Câblage de dépendances et de configurations pour les étapes nouvellement ajoutées"],"de":["Einfügen von Pipeline-Schritten mit automatischer Neunummerierung nachfolgender Schritte","Erstellung von Schritt-Klassen und Teilschritten mit begleitenden README-Dateien","Generierung von explore.ipynb-Notebooks für neue Pipeline-Schritte","Verdrahtung von Abhängigkeiten und Konfigurationen für neu hinzugefügte Schritte"],"pt":["Inserindo etapas de pipeline com renumeração automática de etapas posteriores","Criando classes de etapas e subetapas com arquivos README acompanhantes","Gerando notebooks explore.ipynb para novas etapas de pipeline","Conectando dependências e configurações para etapas adicionadas recentemente"],"ru":["Вставка шагов конвейера с автоматической перенумерацией последующих шагов","Создание классов шагов и подшагов с сопровождающими файлами README","Генерация ноутбуков explore.ipynb для новых шагов конвейера","Подключение зависимостей и конфигураций для недавно добавленных шагов"],"ar":["إدراج خطوات أنابيب مع إعادة ترقيم تلقائية للخطوات اللاحقة","إنشاء فئات خطوات وخطوات فرعية مع ملفات README المرافقة","توليد محوесп explore.ipynb لخطوات أنابيب جديدة","ربط الاعتماديات والتكوين للخطوات المضافة حديثا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Project-specific to p2cs_project","Assumes specific architecture described in the root README.md","Requires Python environment"],"zh":["特定于p2cs_project的项目","假设根README.md中描述的特定架构","需要Python环境"],"ja":["p2cs_projectのプロジェクトに特有","ルートREADME.mdに記載されている特定のアーキテクチャを前提とする","Python環境が必要"],"ko":["p2cs_project 프로젝트에 특정","루트 README.md에 설명된 특정 아키텍처를 가정","파이썬 환경이 필요"],"es":["Específico del proyecto para p2cs_project","Supone una arquitectura específica descrita en el archivo README.md raíz","Requiere un entorno Python"],"fr":["Spécifique au projet pour p2cs_project","Suppose une architecture spécifique décrite dans le fichier README.md racine","Nécessite un environnement Python"],"de":["Projekt-spezifisch für p2cs_project","Geht von einer bestimmten Architektur aus, die in der root-README.md-Datei beschrieben ist","Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung"],"pt":["Específico do projeto para p2cs_project","Pressupõe arquitetura específica descrita no arquivo README.md raiz","Exige ambiente Python"],"ru":["Проектно-специфичный для p2cs_project","Предполагает конкретную архитектуру, описанную в корневом файле README.md","Требует среды Python"],"ar":["محدد لمشروع p2cs_project","يفترض هيكلا معماريا محددا كما هو موضح في ملف README.md الجذري","يتطلب بيئة بايثون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('makaronz/agent66/ordercli', 'community', 'makaronz', 'agent66', 'makaronz/agent66', 'ordercli', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z', '2026-02-18T10:07:28.766Z', NULL, '{"id":"makaronz/agent66/ordercli","name":"ordercli","description":{"zh":"ordercli是一个命令行工具，用于检查过去的订单和跟踪Foodora的活跃订单状态","ja":"ordercliは、過去の注文を確認し、Foodoraのアクティブな注文状況を追跡するためのコマンドラインツールです","ko":"ordercli는 과거 주문 확인 및 Foodora의 활성 주문 상태 추적을 위한 명령어 도구입니다","es":"Ordercli es una herramienta para verificar pedidos pasados y rastrear el estado de los pedidos activos en Foodora","fr":"Ordercli est un outil pour vérifier les commandes passées et suivre l''état des commandes actives sur Foodora","de":"Ordercli ist ein Tool zum Überprüfen vergangener Bestellungen und Verfolgen des Status aktiver Bestellungen bei Foodora","pt":"O ordercli é uma ferramenta para rastrear pedidos ativos e verificar o histórico de pedidos na Foodora.","ru":"Ordercli - это инструмент для отслеживания активных заказов и проверки истории заказов в Foodora.","ar":"أوردر كلي هو أداة لتتبع الطلبات النشطة والتحقق من سجل الطلبات في فودورا.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ordercli命令行工具","ja":"ordercliコマンドラインツール","ko":"ordercli 명령어 도구","es":"Ordercli: Herramienta de seguimiento de pedidos","fr":"Ordercli: Outil de suivi de commandes","de":"Ordercli: Bestellverfolgungstool","pt":"Ordercli: Ferramenta de Rastreamento de Pedidos","ru":"Ordercli: Инструмент для отслеживания заказов","ar":"أوردر كلي: أداة تتبع الطلبات","en":"ordercli"},"description":{"zh":"ordercli是一个命令行工具，用于检查过去的订单和跟踪Foodora的活跃订单状态","ja":"ordercliは、過去の注文を確認し、Foodoraのアクティブな注文状況を追跡するためのコマンドラインツールです","ko":"ordercli는 과거 주문 확인 및 Foodora의 활성 주문 상태 추적을 위한 명령어 도구입니다","es":"Ordercli es una herramienta para verificar pedidos pasados y rastrear el estado de los pedidos activos en Foodora","fr":"Ordercli est un outil pour vérifier les commandes passées et suivre l''état des commandes actives sur Foodora","de":"Ordercli ist ein Tool zum Überprüfen vergangener Bestellungen und Verfolgen des Status aktiver Bestellungen bei Foodora","pt":"O ordercli é uma ferramenta para rastrear pedidos ativos e verificar o histórico de pedidos na Foodora.","ru":"Ordercli - это инструмент для отслеживания активных заказов и проверки истории заказов в Foodora.","ar":"أوردر كلي هو أداة لتتبع الطلبات النشطة والتحقق من سجل الطلبات في فودورا.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["检查过去的订单","跟踪Foodora的活跃订单状态","支持多个国家","配置文件设置","登录和密码输入"],"ja":["過去の注文を確認","Foodoraのアクティブな注文状況を追跡","複数の国のサポート","設定ファイルの設定","ログインとパスワード入力"],"ko":["과거 주문 확인","Foodora의 활성 주문 상태 추적","複数 국가 지원","설정 파일 설정","로그인 및 비밀번호 입력"],"es":["Verificación de pedidos pasados","Seguimiento del estado de los pedidos activos","Configuración de países y login","Historial de pedidos","Visualización de detalles de pedidos"],"fr":["Vérification des commandes passées","Suivi de l''état des commandes actives","Configuration des pays et connexion","Historique des commandes","Affichage des détails de commande"],"de":["Überprüfung vergangener Bestellungen","Verfolgung des Status aktiver Bestellungen","Konfiguration von Ländern und Login","Bestellhistorie","Anzeige von Bestelldetails"],"pt":["Rastreamento de pedidos ativos","Verificação do histórico de pedidos","Configuração de países e login","Listagem de pedidos com status de chegada","Observação de pedidos"],"ru":["Отслеживание активных заказов","Проверка истории заказов","Настройка стран и вход","Список заказов со статусом прибытия","Наблюдение за заказами"],"ar":["تتبع الطلبات النشطة","التحقق من سجل الطلبات","تكوين البلدان وتسجيل الدخول","قائمة الطلبات مع حالة الوصول","مراقبة الطلبات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ordercli","命令行工具","Foodora","订单跟踪","命令行界面","开发工具"],"ja":["ordercli","コマンドラインツール","Foodora","注文追跡","コマンドラインインターフェース","開発ツール"],"ko":["ordercli","명령어 도구","Foodora","주문 추적","명령어 인터페이스","개발 도구"],"es":["ordercli","seguimiento de pedidos","gestión de pedidos","Foodora","herramienta de línea de comandos","verificación de pedidos","historial de pedidos"],"fr":["ordercli","suivi de commandes","gestion de commandes","Foodora","outil en ligne de commande","vérification de commandes","historique de commandes"],"de":["ordercli","Bestellverfolgung","Bestellverwaltung","Foodora","Kommandozeilentool","Überprüfung von Bestellungen","Bestellhistorie"],"pt":["ordercli","rastreamento de pedidos","foodora","ferramenta de linha de comando","gerenciamento de pedidos","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["ordercli","отслеживание заказов","foodora","командная строка инструмент","управление заказами","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أوردر كلي","تتبع الطلبات","فودورا","أداة سطر الأوامر","إدارة الطلبات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"makaronz","repo":"agent66","repoPath":"makaronz/agent66","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ordercli","description":"Foodora-only CLI for checking past orders and active order status (Deliveroo WIP).","bodyPreview":"# ordercli\n\nUse `ordercli` to check past orders and track active order status (Foodora only right now).\n\nQuick start (Foodora)\n\n- `ordercli foodora countries`\n- `ordercli foodora config set --country AT`\n- `ordercli foodora login --email you@example.com --password-stdin`\n- `ordercli foodora orders`\n- `ordercli foodora history --limit 20`\n- `ordercli foodora history show <orderCode>`\n\nOrders\n\n- Active list (arrival/status): `ordercli foodora orders`\n- Watch: `ordercli foodora orders --watch`\n- Ac","body":"# ordercli\n\nUse `ordercli` to check past orders and track active order status (Foodora only right now).\n\nQuick start (Foodora)\n\n- `ordercli foodora countries`\n- `ordercli foodora config set --country AT`\n- `ordercli foodora login --email you@example.com --password-stdin`\n- `ordercli foodora orders`\n- `ordercli foodora history --limit 20`\n- `ordercli foodora history show <orderCode>`\n\nOrders\n\n- Active list (arrival/status): `ordercli foodora orders`\n- Watch: `ordercli foodora orders --watch`\n- Active order detail: `ordercli foodora order <orderCode>`\n- History detail JSON: `ordercli foodora history show <orderCode> --json`\n\nReorder (adds to cart)\n\n- Preview: `ordercli foodora reorder <orderCode>`\n- Confirm: `ordercli foodora reorder <orderCode> --confirm`\n- Address: `ordercli foodora reorder <orderCode> --confirm --address-id <id>`\n\nCloudflare / bot protection\n\n- Browser login: `ordercli foodora login --email you@example.com --password-stdin --browser`\n- Reuse profile: `--browser-profile \"$HOME/Library/Application Support/ordercli/browser-profile\"`\n- Import Chrome cookies: `ordercli foodora cookies chrome --profile \"Default\"`\n\nSession import (no password)\n\n- `ordercli foodora session chrome --url https://www.foodora.at/ --profile \"Default\"`\n- `ordercli foodora session refresh --client-id android`\n\nDeliveroo (WIP, not working yet)\n\n- Requires `DELIVEROO_BEARER_TOKEN` (optional `DELIVEROO_COOKIE`).\n- `ordercli deliveroo config set --market uk`\n- `ordercli deliveroo history`\n\nNotes\n\n- Use `--config /tmp/ordercli.json` for testing.\n- Confirm before any reorder or cart-changing action.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:07:28.766Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for E-commerce Agents requiring seamless integration with food delivery services like Foodora","zh":"适用于需要与Foodora等食品配送服务实现无缝集成的电子商务代理","ja":"Foodoraなどの食品配送サービスとのシームレスな統合を必要とする電子商取引エージェントに最適","ko":"Foodora와 같은 음식 배달 서비스와의無縫한統合을 필요로 하는 전자 상거래 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de comercio electrónico que requieren una integración sin problemas con servicios de entrega de comida como Foodora","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de commerce électronique nécessitant une intégration transparente avec des services de livraison de nourriture comme Foodora","de":"Ideal für E-Commerce-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Lebensmittellieferdiensten wie Foodora erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de comércio eletrônico que necessitam de integração perfeita com serviços de entrega de comida como Foodora","ru":"Идеально для агентов электронной коммерции, требующих бесшовной интеграции с сервисами доставки еды, такими как Foodora","ar":"مثالي لعمال التجارة الإلكترونية الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل بدون مشاكل مع خدمات توصيل الطعام مثل Foodora"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track active orders and retrieve past order history using command-line interfaces, supporting protocols like stdin for secure password input, and providing features like order watching and history limiting using flags like --watch and --limit","zh":"赋予代理跟踪活动订单和检索过去的订单历史的能力，使用支持stdin等协议的命令行接口进行安全密码输入，并提供诸如订单监视和历史限制等功能，使用--watch和--limit等标志","ja":"エージェントがアクティブな注文を追跡し、過去の注文履歴を取得する能力を提供する。コマンドラインインターフェイスを使用し、stdinなどのプロトコルをサポートしてセキュアなパスワード入力を実現し、--watchや--limitなどのフラグを使用して注文の監視や履歴の制限などの機能を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 활성 주문 추적 및 과거 주문 기록을 검색할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, stdin과 같은 프로토콜을 지원하는 명령줄 인터페이스를 사용하여 보안 비밀번호 입력을 제공하며, --watch 및 --limit와 같은 플래그를 사용하여 주문 감시 및 기록 제한 등의 기능을 제공","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar un seguimiento de los pedidos activos y recuperar el historial de pedidos anteriores utilizando interfaces de línea de comandos, que admiten protocolos como stdin para la entrada segura de contraseñas, y ofrecen características como la observación de pedidos y la limitación del historial utilizando indicadores como --watch y --limit","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre les commandes actives et de récupérer l''historique des commandes passées en utilisant des interfaces de ligne de commande, qui prennent en charge des protocoles comme stdin pour une saisie de mot de passe sécurisée, et offrent des fonctionnalités comme la surveillance des commandes et la limitation de l''historique en utilisant des indicateurs comme --watch et --limit","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, aktive Bestellungen zu verfolgen und die Bestellhistorie aus der Vergangenheit mithilfe von Befehlszeilen-Schnittstellen abzurufen, die Protokolle wie stdin für die sichere Eingabe von Passwörtern unterstützen und Funktionen wie Bestellüberwachung und Historienbegrenzung mithilfe von Flags wie --watch und --limit bieten","pt":"Permite que os agentes acompanhem pedidos ativos e recuperem o histórico de pedidos anteriores usando interfaces de linha de comando, suportando protocolos como stdin para entrada segura de senhas e fornecendo recursos como acompanhamento de pedidos e limitação de histórico usando sinalizadores como --watch e --limit","ru":"Позволяет агентам отслеживать активные заказы и получать историю прошлых заказов, используя интерфейсы командной строки, поддерживающие протоколы, такие как stdin для безопасного ввода пароля, и предоставляющие функции, такие как просмотр заказов и ограничение истории с помощью флагов, таких как --watch и --limit","ar":"يتمكن العمال من تتبع الطلبات النشطة واسترجاع تاريخ الطلبات السابقة باستخدام واجهات سطر الأوامر، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل stdin لإدخال كلمة المرور الآمنة، وتقديم ميزات مثل مشاهدة حالة الطلب في الوقت الفعلي وتحديد التاريخ باستخدام أعلام مثل --watch و --limit"},"useCases":{"en":["Tracking active Foodora orders","Retrieving past order history with customizable limits","Watching order status updates in real-time"],"zh":["跟踪活动的Foodora订单","检索过去的订单历史，具有可自定义的限制","实时监视订单状态更新"],"ja":["アクティブなFoodora注文の追跡","過去の注文履歴の取得、カスタマイズ可能な制限あり","注文ステータスのリアルタイム更新の監視"],"ko":["활성 Foodora 주문의 추적","과거 주문 기록의 검색, 사용자 지정 가능한 제한","주문 상태 업데이트의 실시간 감시"],"es":["Seguimiento de pedidos activos de Foodora","Recuperación del historial de pedidos pasados con límites personalizables","Observación de actualizaciones del estado del pedido en tiempo real"],"fr":["Suivi des commandes actives Foodora","Récupération de l''historique des commandes passées avec des limites personnalisables","Surveillance des mises à jour de l''état de la commande en temps réel"],"de":["Verfolgung aktiver Foodora-Bestellungen","Abruf der Bestellhistorie aus der Vergangenheit mit anpassbaren Grenzwerten","Beobachtung von Bestellstatus-Aktualisierungen in Echtzeit"],"pt":["Acompanhar pedidos ativos da Foodora","Recuperar histórico de pedidos anteriores com limites personalizáveis","Assistir atualizações de status de pedido em tempo real"],"ru":["Отслеживать активные заказы Foodora","Получать историю прошлых заказов с настраиваемыми ограничениями","Смотреть обновления статуса заказа в режиме реального времени"],"ar":["تتبع الطلبات النشطة من Foodora","استرجاع تاريخ الطلبات السابقة مع حدود قابلة للتعديل","مشاهدة تحديثات حالة الطلب في الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Currently only supports Foodora","Requires user credentials for login"],"zh":["目前仅支持Foodora","需要用户凭证进行登录"],"ja":["現在はFoodoraのみをサポート","ログインにはユーザー資格情報が必要"],"ko":["현재 Foodora만 지원","로그인에는 사용자 자격 증명이 필요"],"es":["Actualmente solo admite Foodora","Requiere credenciales de usuario para el inicio de sesión"],"fr":["Actuellement, ne prend en charge que Foodora","Nécessite des informations d''identification utilisateur pour la connexion"],"de":["Derzeit wird nur Foodora unterstützt","Benötigt Benutzeranmeldeinformationen für die Anmeldung"],"pt":["Atualmente suporta apenas a Foodora","Exige credenciais de usuário para login"],"ru":["В настоящее время поддерживает только Foodora","Требует учетных данных пользователя для входа"],"ar":["يدعم حاليًا فقط Foodora","يتطلب بيانات اعتماد المستخدم للتسجيل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('codingshot/sunnahsleep/pwa-audit-sunnahsleep', 'community', 'codingshot', 'sunnahsleep', 'codingshot/sunnahsleep', 'pwa-audit-sunnahsleep', 0, 0, 20, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z', '2026-02-18T10:08:20.893Z', NULL, '{"id":"codingshot/sunnahsleep/pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","name":"pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","description":{"zh":"PWA 审计：使用 Vite 插件和 Workbox 服务工作器，缓存古兰经音频以帮助失眠者","ja":"PWA オーディット：Vite プラグインと Workbox サービスワーカーを使用して、クルアーンのオーディオをキャッシュし、不眠症を治療します","ko":"PWA 감사: Vite 플러그인과 Workbox 서비스 워커를 사용하여 코란 오디오를 캐시하여 불면증을 치료합니다","es":"La auditoría de PWA para curar el insomnio con Islam es una herramienta que combina tecnología y espiritualidad para mejorar la calidad del sueño","fr":"L''audit PWA pour guérir l''insomnie avec l''Islam est un outil qui combine technologie et spiritualité pour améliorer la qualité du sommeil","de":"Die PWA-Audit für die Heilung von Schlaflosigkeit mit Islam ist ein Werkzeug, das Technologie und Spiritualität kombiniert, um die Schlafqualität zu verbessern","pt":"O PWA Audit SunnahSleep é uma ferramenta para otimizar aplicativos progressivos. Ele ajuda a melhorar a experiência do usuário em dispositivos móveis.","ru":"PWA Аудит SunnahSleep - это инструмент для оптимизации прогрессивных веб-приложений. Он помогает улучшить опыт пользователя на мобильных устройствах.","ar":"فحص تطبيق سنا سليب هو أداة لتحسين تطبيقات الويب التقدمية. يساعد على تحسين تجربة المستخدم على الأجهزة المحمولة.","en":"cure Insomnia with islam"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PWA 审计：缓解失眠以伊斯兰教为基础","ja":"PWA オーディット：イスラム教による不眠症の治療","ko":"PWA 감사: 이슬람을 기반으로 한 불면증 치료","es":"PWA de auditoría para curar el insomnio con Islam","fr":"Audit PWA pour guérir l''insomnie avec l''Islam","de":"PWA-Audit für die Heilung von Schlaflosigkeit mit Islam","pt":"PWA Audit SunnahSleep: Otimização de Aplicativos","ru":"PWA Аудит SunnahSleep: Оптимизация Про