n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) - if configuring site URL, name, or SEO foundation\n- [ ] [references/crawla","body":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) - if configuring site URL, name, or SEO foundation\n- [ ] [references/crawlability.md](references/crawlability.md) - if setting up robots.txt or sitemap.xml\n- [ ] [references/og-image.md](references/og-image.md) - if generating dynamic OG images\n- [ ] [references/schema-org.md](references/schema-org.md) - if adding JSON-LD structured data\n- [ ] [references/utilities.md](references/utilities.md) - if working with breadcrumbs, canonical URLs, or link checking\n\n**DO NOT load all files at once.** Load only what''s relevant to your current task.\n\n## Site Config\n\nFoundation for all SEO modules. Configure `site` in `nuxt.config.ts`, access via `useSiteConfig()`. See [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) for full options.\n\n## Module Overview\n\n| Module            | Purpose         | Key API                       |\n| ----------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| nuxt-site-config  | Shared config   | `useSiteConfig()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/robots    | robots.txt      | `useRobotsRule()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/sitemap   | sitemap.xml     | `defineSitemapEventHandler()` |\n| nuxt-og-image     | OG images       | `defineOgImage()`             |\n| nuxt-schema-org   | JSON-LD         | `useSchemaOrg()`              |\n| nuxt-seo-utils    | Meta utilities  | `useBreadcrumbItems()`        |\n| nuxt-link-checker | Link validation | Build-time checks             |\n\n## Nuxt Content v3\n\nUse `asSeoCollection()` for automatic sitemap, og-image, and schema-org from frontmatter:\n\n```ts\n// content.config.ts\nimport { defineCollection, defineContentConfig } from ''@nuxt/content''\nimport { asSeoCollection } from ''@nuxtjs/seo/content''\n\nexport default defineContentConfig({\n  collections: {\n    posts: defineCollection(asSeoCollection({ type: ''page'', source: ''posts/**'' }))\n  }\n})\n```\n\n**Important:** Load `@nuxtjs/seo` before `@nuxt/content` in modules array:\n\n```ts\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''@nuxtjs/seo'', ''@nuxt/content'']\n})\n```\n\nFrontmatter fields: `ogImage`, `sitemap`, `robots`, `schemaOrg`.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [nuxt-content](../nuxt-content/SKILL.md) - For MDC rendering with SEO frontmatter\n\n## Links\n\n- [Documentation](https://nuxtseo.com)\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/harlan-zw/nuxt-seo)\n\n## Token Efficiency\n\nMain skill: ~250 tokens. Each sub-file: ~400-600 tokens. Only load files relevant to current task.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:34:31.860Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing streamlined SEO configuration and optimization for Nuxt.js applications.","zh":"非常适合需要简化SEO配置和优化的Nuxt.js全栈代理","ja":"Nuxt.jsアプリケーションのストリームライン化されたSEO設定と最適化が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"스트리밍 SEO 구성 및 Nuxt.js 애플리케이션 최적화가 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 완벽","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full-Stack que necesitan una configuración y optimización de SEO simplificadas para aplicaciones Nuxt.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack qui ont besoin d''une configuration et d''une optimisation SEO simplifiées pour les applications Nuxt.js.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine vereinfachte SEO-Konfiguration und -Optimierung für Nuxt.js-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing streamlined SEO configuration and optimization for Nuxt.js applications.","ru":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing streamlined SEO configuration and optimization for Nuxt.js applications.","ar":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing streamlined SEO configuration and optimization for Nuxt.js applications."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dynamically generate OG images, manage robots.txt and sitemap.xml files, and integrate JSON-LD structured data using schema.org, all while configuring site URLs, names, and indexability for enhanced search engine visibility.","zh":"赋予代理动态生成OG图像、管理robots.txt和sitemap.xml文件，并使用schema.org集成JSON-LD结构化数据的能力，同时配置站点URL、名称和索引能力以提高搜索引擎可见性","ja":"OG画像の動的生成、robots.txtとsitemap.xmlファイルの管理、schema.orgを使用したJSON-LD構造化データの統合などを行うことで、サイトURL、名前、インデックス可能性の構成を通じて、検索エンジンの可視性を高めることができる","ko":"OG 이미지 동적 생성, robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml 파일 관리, schema.org를 사용한 JSON-LD 구조화 데이터 통합 등을 통해 사이트 URL, 이름, 인덱스 가능성을 구성하여 검색 엔진의 가시성을 향상","es":"Permite a los agentes generar dinámicamente imágenes OG, administrar archivos robots.txt y sitemap.xml, e integrar datos estructurados JSON-LD mediante schema.org, todo mientras configura las URLs del sitio, los nombres y la indexabilidad para una mayor visibilidad en los motores de búsqueda.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer dynamiquement des images OG, de gérer les fichiers robots.txt et sitemap.xml, et d''intégrer des données structurées JSON-LD via schema.org, le tout en configurant les URL du site, les noms et l''indexabilité pour une meilleure visibilité dans les moteurs de recherche.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, dynamisch OG-Bilder zu generieren, robots.txt- und sitemap.xml-Dateien zu verwalten und strukturierte JSON-LD-Daten über schema.org zu integrieren, während sie die Site-URLs, -namen und Indexierbarkeit für eine verbesserte Sichtbarkeit in Suchmaschinen konfigurieren.","pt":"Empowers agents to dynamically generate OG images, manage robots.txt and sitemap.xml files, and integrate JSON-LD structured data using schema.org, all while configuring site URLs, names, and indexability for enhanced search engine visibility.","ru":"Empowers agents to dynamically generate OG images, manage robots.txt and sitemap.xml files, and integrate JSON-LD structured data using schema.org, all while configuring site URLs, names, and indexability for enhanced search engine visibility.","ar":"Empowers agents to dynamically generate OG images, manage robots.txt and sitemap.xml files, and integrate JSON-LD structured data using schema.org, all while configuring site URLs, names, and indexability for enhanced search engine visibility."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SEO configuration for Nuxt.js marketing sites","Generating dynamic OG images for social media sharing","Creating and managing sitemap.xml and robots.txt files for improved crawlability"],"zh":["为Nuxt.js营销网站自动化SEO配置","为社交媒体分享生成动态OG图像","创建和管理sitemap.xml和robots.txt文件以提高爬行性"],"ja":["Nuxt.jsマーケティングサイトのSEO設定を自動化する","ソーシャルメディアの共有用に動的OG画像を生成する","クロール性を高めるためにsitemap.xmlとrobots.txtファイルを作成および管理する"],"ko":["Nuxt.js 마케팅 사이트의 SEO 구성 자동화","소셜 미디어 공유를 위한 동적 OG 이미지 생성","크롤링 가능성을 개선하기 위한 sitemap.xml 및 robots.txt 파일 생성 및 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la configuración de SEO para sitios de marketing Nuxt.js","Generación de imágenes OG dinámicas para compartir en redes sociales","Creación y administración de archivos sitemap.xml y robots.txt para una mejor accesibilidad"],"fr":["Automatisation de la configuration SEO pour les sites de marketing Nuxt.js","Génération d''images OG dynamiques pour le partage sur les réseaux sociaux","Création et gestion des fichiers sitemap.xml et robots.txt pour une meilleure accès"],"de":["Automatisierung der SEO-Konfiguration für Nuxt.js-Marketing-Websites","Generierung dynamischer OG-Bilder für das Teilen in sozialen Netzwerken","Erstellung und Verwaltung von sitemap.xml- und robots.txt-Dateien für eine verbesserte Crawling-Fähigkeit"],"pt":["Automating SEO configuration for Nuxt.js marketing sites","Generating dynamic OG images for social media sharing","Creating and managing sitemap.xml and robots.txt files for improved crawlability"],"ru":["Automating SEO configuration for Nuxt.js marketing sites","Generating dynamic OG images for social media sharing","Creating and managing sitemap.xml and robots.txt files for improved crawlability"],"ar":["Automating SEO configuration for Nuxt.js marketing sites","Generating dynamic OG images for social media sharing","Creating and managing sitemap.xml and robots.txt files for improved crawlability"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nuxt.js project setup","Dependent on @nuxtjs/seo module installation"],"zh":["需要Nuxt.js项目设置","依赖@nuxtjs/seo模块安装"],"ja":["Nuxt.jsプロジェクトの設定が必要","@nuxtjs/seoモジュールのインストールに依存"],"ko":["Nuxt.js 프로젝트 설정 필요","@nuxtjs/seo 모듈 설치 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración del proyecto Nuxt.js","Dependiente de la instalación del módulo @nuxtjs/seo"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du projet Nuxt.js","Dépend de l''installation du module @nuxtjs/seo"],"de":["Benötigt Nuxt.js-Projektsetup","Abhängig von der Installation des @nuxtjs/seo-Moduls"],"pt":["Requires Nuxt.js project setup","Dependent on @nuxtjs/seo module installation"],"ru":["Requires Nuxt.js project setup","Dependent on @nuxtjs/seo module installation"],"ar":["Requires Nuxt.js project setup","Dependent on @nuxtjs/seo module installation"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
