ector 操作","ko":"Three.js 씬의 디버깅과 최적화를 위한 Inspector 연산을 제공합니다","es":"Inspector-operations es una herramienta para inspeccionar, depurar y perfilar escenas three.js. Ofrece comandos para examinar entidades en detalle.","fr":"Inspector-operations est un outil pour inspecter, déboguer et profiler les scènes three.js. Il propose des commandes pour examiner les entités en détail.","de":"Inspector-operations ist ein Tool für die Inspektion, Fehlersuche und Leistungsoptimierung von three.js-Szenen. Es bietet Befehle zur detaillierten Untersuch...","pt":"O Inspetor é a espinha dorsal do 3Lens, permitindo a inspeção, depuração e perfil de cenas Three.js","ru":"Инспектор является основой 3Lens, позволяя инспектировать, отлаживать и профилировать сцены Three.js","ar":"المفتش هو العمود الفقري ل 3Lens ، مما يسمح بالفحص والتصحيح والتحليل لمشهد Three.js","en":"Developer tools for inspecting, debugging, and profiling three.js scenes"},"definition":{"en":"Developer tools for inspecting, debugging, and profiling three.js scenes"},"features":{"zh":["实体检查和分析","依赖关系分析","成本归因路径追踪","程序化实体选择"],"ja":["エンティティの検査と分析","依存関係の分析","コスト帰因パスの追跡","プログラムによるエンティティの選択"],"ko":["엔티티의 검사와 분석","의존 관계 분석","비용 귀인 경로 추적","프로그램에 의한 엔티티 선택"],"es":["Inspección de entidades","Depuración de escenas three.js","Análisis de dependencias y relaciones","Seguimiento de costos y atribución","Selección de entidades programática"],"fr":["Inspection d''entités","Débogage de scènes three.js","Analyse de dépendances et de relations","Suivi de coûts et d''attribution","Sélection d''entités programmatique"],"de":["Untersuchung von Entitäten","Fehlersuche in three.js-Szenen","Analyse von Abhängigkeiten und Beziehungen","Verfolgung von Kosten und Zuweisung","Programmatische Auswahl von Entitäten"],"pt":["Inspeção de entidades","Depuração de cenas Three.js","Perfil de desempenho","Seleção de entidades programaticamente","Análise de dependências e relacionamentos","Rastreamento de custos"],"ru":["Инспекция сущностей","Отладка сцен Three.js","Профилирование производительности","Программная выборка сущностей","Анализ зависимостей и отношений","Отслеживание затрат"],"ar":["فحص الكيانات","تصحيح أخطاء مشاهد Three.js","تحليل الأداء","اختيار الكيانات برمجيًا","تحليل التبعيات والعلاقات","تتبع التكاليف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Three.js","场景调试","实体检查","依赖关系分析","成本归因","程序化选择"],"ja":["Three.js","シーンのデバッグ","エンティティの検査","依存関係の分析","コスト帰因","プログラムによる選択"],"ko":["Three.js","씬 디버깅","엔티티의 검사","의존 관계 분석","비용 귀인","프로그램에 의한 선택"],"es":["inspector-operations","three.js","inspección de escenas","depuración de código","análisis de dependencias","seguimiento de costos","selección de entidades"],"fr":["inspector-operations","three.js","inspection de scènes","débogage de code","analyse de dépendances","suivi de coûts","sélection d''entités"],"de":["inspector-operations","three.js","Inspektion von Szenen","Fehlersuche im Code","Analyse von Abhängigkeiten","Verfolgung von Kosten","Auswahl von Entitäten"],"pt":["Three.js","inspetor","depuração","perfil","entidades","cenas","desempenho","programação","análise","otimização"],"ru":["Three.js","инспектор","отладка","профилирование","сущности","сцены","производительность","программирование","анализ","оптимизация"],"ar":["Three.js","مفتش","تصحيح أخطاء","تحليل","كيانات","مشاهد","أداء","برمجة","تحليل","تحسين"]}},"owner":"adriandarian","repo":"3Lens","repoPath":"adriandarian/3Lens","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"inspector-operations","description":"Navigate and inspect 3Lens entities including meshes, materials, textures, and shaders. Use when examining specific entities, understanding dependencies, tracing cost attribution, or selecting entities by query.","bodyPreview":"# Inspector Operations\n\nThe Inspector is the spine of 3Lens. All tools route through selection and entity inspection. Use these commands to examine entities in detail.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Examining a specific entity (mesh, material, texture, shader)\n- Understanding entity dependencies and relationships\n- Tracing cost attribution paths\n- Selecting entities programmatically via query\n\n## Commands\n\n### Inspect an Entity\n\n```bash\n# Basic entity inspection\n3lens inspect <entityId>\n\n# Include additiona","body":"# Inspector Operations\n\nThe Inspector is the spine of 3Lens. All tools route through selection and entity inspection. Use these commands to examine entities in detail.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Examining a specific entity (mesh, material, texture, shader)\n- Understanding entity dependencies and relationships\n- Tracing cost attribution paths\n- Selecting entities programmatically via query\n\n## Commands\n\n### Inspect an Entity\n\n```bash\n# Basic entity inspection\n3lens inspect <entityId>\n\n# Include additional data\n3lens inspect <entityId> --include edges,cost,diffs\n\n# Output as JSON\n3lens inspect <entityId> --format json\n```\n\n**Output includes:**\n\n- **Identity**: type, id, origin\n- **Dependencies**: incoming/outgoing edges\n- **Cost attribution**: weighted blame chains\n- **Lifecycle + diffs**: creation, updates, disposal\n\n### Select by Query\n\n```bash\n# Select top GPU cost entities\n3lens inspect --query \"top_gpu_cost\" --limit 5\n\n# Select materials using a specific texture\n3lens inspect --query \"materials_using_texture:tex123\"\n```\n\n## The 5 Inspector Questions\n\nEvery entity inspection should answer:\n\n1. **What is this?** (type, properties, origin)\n2. **What does it depend on?** (incoming edges)\n3. **What depends on it?** (outgoing edges)\n4. **How much does it cost?** (attributed metrics with blame chain)\n5. **How has it changed?** (diffs over time/traces)\n\n## Entity ID Format\n\nEntity IDs follow a stable, namespaced format:\n\n```\n<type>:<namespace>:<identifier>\n\nExamples:\n  mesh:scene:Player_Avatar\n  material:default:PBR_Metal_01\n  texture:loaded:albedo_diffuse.png\n  shader:compiled:StandardPBR_v123\n```\n\n## Agent Use Cases\n\n1. **Root cause analysis**: \"Inspect entity mesh:scene:Player to find why it''s expensive\"\n2. **Dependency tracking**: \"Show all materials that depend on this texture\"\n3. **Cost attribution**: \"Trace the blame chain for this GPU hotspot\"\n4. **Bulk selection**: \"Select all entities matching this query\"\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- For detailed command syntax, see [.cursor/commands/](../../commands/)\n- For Inspector contract, see [.cursor/contracts/inspector.md](../../../.cursor/contracts/inspector.md)\n- For entity graph rules, see [.cursor/contracts/entity-graph.md](../../../.cursor/contracts/entity-graph.md)\n- Inspector is runtime/UI; see addon-inspector for implementation\n- Contract: [attribution.md](../../../.cursor/contracts/attribution.md)\n- Contract: [fidelity.md](../../../.cursor/contracts/fidelity.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:08:27.109Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 3D Rendering Agents needing advanced scene inspection and debugging capabilities for three.js scenes","zh":"适合需要高级场景检查和调试功能的 3D 渲染代理，特别适用于 three.js 场景","ja":"three.js シーンの高度なシーンの検査とデバッグ機能を必要とする 3D レンダリング エージェントに最適","ko":"three.js 씬의 고급 시각 검사 및 디버깅 기능을 필요로하는 3D 렌더링 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de renderizado 3D que necesitan capacidades de inspección y depuración avanzadas para escenas de three.js","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rendu 3D nécessitant des capacités d''inspection et de débogage avancées pour les scènes three.js","de":"Perfekt für 3D-Rendering-Agents, die erweiterte Szenen-Inspektion- und Debugging-Funktionen für three.js-Szenen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Renderização 3D que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de inspeção e depuração de cenas para cenas three.js","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов 3D-рендеринга, которым необходимы расширенные возможности осмотра и отладки сцен three.js","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء لترndering 3D الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتفحص المشاهد وتصحيح الأخطاء للمشهد three.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to examine entities in detail, including mesh, material, texture, and shader, using commands like `3lens inspect <entityId>`, and understand entity dependencies and relationships through cost attribution paths and programmatic selection via query","zh":"赋予代理检查实体的详细功能，包括网格、材质、纹理和着色器，使用命令如 `3lens inspect <entityId>`，并通过成本归因路径和程序化选择来理解实体依赖和关系","ja":"エージェントにエンティティを詳細に検査する機能を付与し、メッシュ、材質、テクスチャ、シェーダーなどのコマンドを使用して `3lens inspect <entityId>` を実行し、コスト帰属パスとプログラムによる選択を通じてエンティティの依存関係と関係を理解する","ko":"에이전트에게 엔티티의 세부 사항을 조사하는 기능을 부여하여 메쉬, 재질, 텍스처 및 셰이더를 포함한 명령을 사용하여 `3lens inspect <entityId>`를 실행하고, 비용 귀속 경로와 프로그래밍 방식 선택을 통해 엔티티의 의존성 및 관계를 이해","es":"Habilita a los agentes a examinar entidades en detalle, incluyendo malla, material, textura y sombreador, utilizando comandos como `3lens inspect <entityId>` y comprender las dependencias y relaciones de las entidades a través de rutas de atribución de costos y selección programática a través de consulta","fr":"Permet aux agents d''examiner les entités en détail, y compris le maillage, le matériau, la texture et le shader, en utilisant des commandes comme `3lens inspect <entityId>` et de comprendre les dépendances et les relations entre les entités via les chemins d''attribution de coûts et la sélection programmatique via requête","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Entitäten im Detail zu untersuchen, einschließlich Mesh, Material, Textur und Shader, unter Verwendung von Befehlen wie `3lens inspect <entityId>` und Entitätsabhängigkeiten und -beziehungen über Kostenattributionspfade und programmatische Auswahl über Abfrage zu verstehen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a examinarem entidades em detalhe, incluindo malha, material, textura e sombreador, usando comandos como `3lens inspect <entityId>`, e entender dependências e relacionamentos de entidades através de caminhos de atribuição de custo e seleção programática via consulta","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью детально осматривать объекты, включая сетку, материал, текстуру и шейдер, используя команды типа `3lens inspect <entityId>`, и понимать зависимости и отношения объектов посредством путей атрибуции затрат и программного выбора через запрос","ar":"يُمكِّن الوكلاء من فحص الكيانات بالتفصيل، بما في ذلك الشبكة، والمادة، والنسيج، والشادر، باستخدام أوامر مثل `3lens inspect <entityId>`، وفهم التبعيات والعلاقات بين الكيانات من خلال مسارات归因 التكلفة والاختيار البرمجي عبر الاستعلام"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex three.js scenes","Inspecting entity dependencies and relationships","Tracing cost attribution paths for performance optimization","Selecting entities programmatically via query for automated testing"],"zh":["调试复杂的 three.js 场景","检查实体依赖和关系","追踪成本归因路径以进行性能优化","通过查询以编程方式选择实体进行自动化测试"],"ja":["複雑な three.js シーンのデバッグ","エンティティの依存関係と関係の検査","パフォーマンス最適化のためのコスト帰属パスの追跡","自動テストのためのプログラムによるエンティティの選択"],"ko":["복잡한 three.js 씬의 디버깅","엔티티 의존성 및 관계의 조사","성능 최적화를 위한 비용 귀속 경로의 추적","자동화 테스트를 위한 프로그래밍 방식의 엔티티 선택"],"es":["Depuración de escenas complejas de three.js","Inspección de dependencias y relaciones de entidades","Rastreo de rutas de atribución de costos para la optimización del rendimiento","Selección de entidades de forma programática a través de consulta para pruebas automatizadas"],"fr":["Débogage de scènes three.js complexes","Inspection des dépendances et relations entre les entités","Traçage des chemins d''attribution de coûts pour l''optimisation des performances","Sélection d''entités de manière programmatique via requête pour des tests automatisés"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung komplexer three.js-Szenen","Untersuchung von Entitätsabhängigkeiten und -beziehungen","Verfolgung von Kostenattributionspfaden für die Leistungsoptimierung","Auswahl von Entitäten programmgesteuert über Abfrage für automatisierte Tests"],"pt":["Depuração de cenas complexas three.js","Inspeção de dependências e relacionamentos de entidades","Rastreamento de caminhos de atribuição de custo para otimização de desempenho","Seleção de entidades programaticamente via consulta para teste automatizado"],"ru":["Отладка сложных сцен three.js","Осмотр зависимостей и отношений объектов","Отслеживание путей атрибуции затрат для оптимизации производительности","Выбор объектов программно через запрос для автоматизированного тестирования"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء المشاهد المعقدة three.js","فحص التبعيات والعلاقات بين الكيانات","تتبع مسارات归因 التكلفة لتحسين الأداء","اختيار الكيانات برمجيًا عبر الاستعلام للاختبار الآلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires three.js scene setup","Limited to inspecting entities within the 3Lens ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 three.js 场景设置","仅限于检查 3Lens 生态系统内的实体"],"ja":["three.js シーンの設定が必要","3Lens エコシステム内のエンティティのみを検査可能"],"ko":["three.js 씬 설정이 필요","3Lens 에코시스템 내의 엔티티만을 조사"],"es":["Requiere configuración de escena de three.js","Limitado a la inspección de entidades dentro del ecosistema 3Lens"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de scène three.js","Limité à l''inspection des entités au sein de l''écosystème 3Lens"],"de":["Benötigt three.js-Szeneneinrichtung","Begrenzt auf die Inspektion von Entitäten innerhalb des 3Lens-Ökosystems"],"pt":["Requer configuração de cena three.js","Limitado à inspeção de entidades dentro do ecossistema 3Lens"],"ru":["Требует настройки сцены three.js","Ограничен осмотром объектов внутри экосистемы 3Lens"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشهد three.js","محدود بفحص الكيانات داخل نظام 3Lens"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
