적인 AI 미학을 피하여卓越한 사용자 경험을 구현","es":"Este skill te guía en la creación de interfaces de frontend de alta calidad y personalizadas","fr":"Ce skill vous guide dans la création d''interfaces de frontend de haute qualité et personnalisées","de":"Dieser Skill führt Sie bei der Erstellung von hochwertigen und benutzerdefinierten Frontend-Schnittstellen","pt":"Este skill ajuda a criar interfaces frontend personalizadas e de alta qualidade","ru":"Этот навык помогает создавать уникальные и высококачественные интерфейсы frontend","ar":"هذا المهارة يساعد على إنشاء واجهات مستخدم أمامية مخصصة وعالية الجودة","en":"Fast, minimal token counter for LLMs. Count tokens for GPT-4, Claude & more."},"definition":{"en":"Fast, minimal token counter for LLMs. Count tokens for GPT-4, Claude & more."},"features":{"zh":["快速创建个性化界面","避免通用AI美学","实现卓越的用户体验","支持多种技术栈","提供设计灵感和创意"],"ja":["個性的なインターフェイスを迅速に作成","一般的なAI美学を避ける","卓越したユーザーエクスペリエンスを実現","多種のテクノロジースタックをサポート","デザインのインスピレーションと創造性を提供"],"ko":["고유한 인터페이스를 빠르게 생성","일반적인 AI 미학을 피함","卓越한 사용자 경험을 구현","다양한 기술 스택을 지원","디자인의 영감과 창의성을 제공"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Enfoque en la experiencia del usuario","Diseño de componentes y páginas web","Implementación de código de alta calidad","Atención al detalle estético"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Focus sur l''expérience utilisateur","Conception de composants et de pages web","Mise en œuvre de code de haute qualité","Attention aux détails esthétiques"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Benutzeroberflächen","Fokus auf die Benutzererfahrung","Design von Komponenten und Webseiten","Implementierung von hochwertigem Code","Achtung auf ästhetische Details"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces personalizadas","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Desenvolvimento de componentes e páginas","Implementação de designs responsivos","Integração com tecnologias de backend"],"ru":["Создание уникальных интерфейсов","Внимание к деталям и эстетике","Разработка компонентов и страниц","Реализация адаптивных дизайнов","Интеграция с бэкенд-технологиями"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","الاهتمام بال细节 والإبداع","تنفيذ مكونات وصفحات","تنفيذ تصاميم مستجيبة","التكامل مع تقنيات الخادم الخلفي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","个性化界面","AI美学","用户体验","设计灵感","创意","技术栈","快速开发","生产级界面"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","個性的なインターフェイス","AI美学","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","デザインのインスピレーション","創造性","テクノロジースタック","迅速な開発","プロダクションレベルのインターフェイス"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","고유한 인터페이스","AI 미학","사용자 경험","디자인의 영감","창의성","기술 스택","빠른 개발","생산급 인터페이스"],"es":["diseño frontend","desarrollo web","interfaces de usuario","experiencia del usuario","frontend developer","diseño de componentes","creación de páginas web"],"fr":["conception de frontend","développement web","interfaces utilisateur","expérience utilisateur","développeur frontend","conception de composants","création de pages web"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Webentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","Benutzererfahrung","Frontend-Entwickler","Komponenten-Design","Erstellung von Webseiten"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","interfaces personalizadas","design de interface","componentes frontend","desenvolvimento web","tecnologias frontend"],"ru":["разработка frontend","уникальные интерфейсы","дизайн интерфейса","компоненты frontend","веб-разработка","технологии frontend"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات المستخدم الأمامية","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تصميم الواجهة","مكونات واجهات المستخدم الأمامية","تطوير الويب","تقنيات واجهات المستخدم الأمامية"]}},"owner":"miketromba","repo":"tokencounter.space","repoPath":"miketromba/tokencounter.space","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- *","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Commit to a distinct direction: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, luxury/refined, lo-fi/zine, dark/moody, soft/pastel, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, retro-futuristic, handcrafted/artisanal, organic/natural, art deco/geometric, playful/whimsical, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are infinite varieties to start from and surpass. Use these as inspiration, but the final design should feel singular, with every detail working in service of one cohesive direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it vigorously. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade, functional, and responsive\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Typography carries the design''s singular voice. Choose fonts with interesting personality. Default fonts signal default thinking: skip Arial, Inter, Roboto, system stacks. Font choices should be inseparable from the aesthetic direction. Display type should be expressive, even risky. Body text should be legible, refined. Pair them like actors in a scene. Work the full typographic range: size, weight, case, spacing to establish hierarchy.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Palettes should take a clear position: bold and saturated, moody and restrained, or high-contrast and minimal. Lead with a dominant color, punctuate with sharp accents. Avoid timid, non-committal distributions. Use CSS variables for consistency.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap and z-depth. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Dramatic scale jumps. Full-bleed moments. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise and grain overlays, geometric patterns, layered transparencies and glassmorphism, dramatic or soft shadows and glows, parallax depth, decorative borders and clip-path shapes, print-inspired textures (halftone, duotone, stipple), knockout typography, and custom cursors.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, Space Grotesk, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter designs that lack context-specific character. \nINSTEAD: distinctive fonts. Bold, committed palettes. Layouts that surprise. Bespoke details. Every choice rooted in rich context.\n\nBuild creatively on the user''s intent, and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. Every design should feel distinct. Actively explore the full range: light and dark themes, unexpected font pairings, substantially varied aesthetic directions. Let the specific context drive choices, NOT familiar defaults. \n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, elegance, and precision. All designs need careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Excellence comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary, award-worthy creative work. Don''t hold back, show what''s truly possible, and commit relentlessly to a distinctive and unforgettable vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:10:18.403Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual AI Agents needing production-grade frontend interfaces with custom token counters for LLMs like GPT-4 and Claude.","zh":"非常适合需要生产级前端接口的视觉AI代理，具有针对LLMs（如GPT-4和Claude）的自定义令牌计数器。","ja":"GPT-4やClaudeなどのLLM用のカスタムトークンカウンターを備えたプロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイスを必要とするビジュアルAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"GPT-4 및 Claude와 같은 LLM에 대한 사용자 지정 토큰 카운터를 포함하는 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스가 필요한 시각적 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Visuales que necesitan interfaces de frontend de grado de producción con contadores de tokens personalizados para LLM como GPT-4 y Claude.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Visuels ayant besoin d''interfaces de frontend de production de haute qualité avec des compteurs de jetons personnalisés pour les LLM comme GPT-4 et Claude.","de":"Perfekt für Visuelle KI-Agents, die produktionsreife Frontend-Schnittstellen mit benutzerdefinierten Tokenzählern für LLMs wie GPT-4 und Claude benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Visuais que necessitam de interfaces de frontend de produção com contadores de tokens personalizados para LLMs como GPT-4 e Claude.","ru":"Идеально подходит для визуальных агентов ИИ, которым необходимы интерфейсы frontend уровня производства с пользовательскими счетчиками токенов для LLM, таких как GPT-4 и Claude.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل الإيصالي الذي يحتاج إلى واجهات أمامية من الدرجة الإنتاجية مععدادات رموز مخصصة للعاملين مثل GPT-4 و Claude."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, minimal, and fast frontend designs, leveraging real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices, utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics.","zh":"赋予代理创建独特、极简和快速的前端设计的能力，利用真正的工作代码，注重美学细节和创意选择，利用HTML、CSS和JavaScript避免通用的''AI slop''美学。","ja":"独自の、極めてシンプルで、高速なフロントエンド設計を作成するエージェントの能力を付与し、真正の動作コードを利用し、美学的な詳細と創造的な選択に注目し、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを利用して一般的な''AI slop''美学を避ける。","ko":"고유한 최소한의 빠른 프론트엔드 디자인を作成할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여 실제 작동 코드를 활용하고 미학적 세부 사항 및 창의적 선택에 주의를 기울이며 HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 일반적인 ''AI slop'' 미학을 피합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear diseños de frontend distintivos, mínimos y rápidos, aprovechando el código de trabajo real con una atención excepcional a los detalles estéticos y las opciones creativas, utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript para evitar una estética genérica de ''slop de IA''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions de frontend distinctives, minimales et rapides, en exploitant le code de travail réel avec une attention exceptionnelle aux détails esthétiques et aux choix créatifs, en utilisant HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour éviter une esthétique générique de ''slop d''IA''.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, einzigartige, minimale und schnelle Frontend-Designs zu erstellen, indem sie echten Arbeitscode mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details und kreative Entscheidungen nutzen, unter Verwendung von HTML, CSS und JavaScript, um eine generische ''KI-Slop''-Ästhetik zu vermeiden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar projetos de frontend distintos, minimalistas e rápidos, aproveitando o código de trabalho real com atenção excepcional aos detalhes estéticos e às escolhas criativas, utilizando HTML, CSS e JavaScript para evitar estética genérica de ''slop de IA''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отличительные, минималистические и быстрые дизайны frontend, опираясь на рабочий код с исключительным вниманием к эстетическим деталям и творческим решениям, используя HTML, CSS и JavaScript, чтобы избежать.generic эстетики ''AI-слоу''.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على创اء تصاميم واجهة مستخدم أمامية مميزة و мінімالیستية وسریعة، مستفيدة من الشفرة العملية الفعلية مع اهتمام استثنائي بالتفاصيل الجمالية والخيارات الإبداعية، باستخدام لغات HTML و CSS و JavaScript لتجنب جماليات ''سلو العقل الاصطناعي'' العامة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing custom interfaces for LLMs","Building production-grade web applications with token counters","Creating distinctive frontend components for AI-powered pages"],"zh":["为LLMs设计自定义接口","使用令牌计数器构建生产级Web应用程序","为AI驱动页面创建独特的前端组件"],"ja":["LLM用のカスタムインターフェイスを設計する","トークンカウンターを使用してプロダクショングレードのWebアプリケーションを構築する","AI駆動ページ用の独自のフロントエンドコンポーネントを作成する"],"ko":["LLM을 위한 사용자 지정 인터페이스 설계","토큰 카운터를 사용하여 프로덕션급 웹 애플리케이션 구축","AI 구동 페이지를 위한 고유한 프론트엔드 구성 요소 생성"],"es":["Diseñar interfaces personalizadas para LLM","Crear aplicaciones web de grado de producción con contadores de tokens","Crear componentes de frontend distintivos para páginas impulsadas por IA"],"fr":["Concevoir des interfaces personnalisées pour les LLM","Créer des applications web de production de haute qualité avec des compteurs de jetons","Créer des composants de frontend distinctifs pour les pages alimentées par l''IA"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Schnittstellen für LLMs entwerfen","Produktionsreife Webanwendungen mit Tokenzählern erstellen","Einzigartige Frontend-Komponenten für KI-gesteuerte Seiten erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar interfaces personalizadas para LLMs","Construir aplicações web de produção com contadores de tokens","Criar componentes de frontend distintos para páginas impulsionadas por IA"],"ru":["Проектирование пользовательских интерфейсов для LLM","Создание веб-приложений уровня производства с счетчиками токенов","Создание отличительных компонентов frontend для страниц, работающих на ИИ"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات مستخدم مخصصة للعاملين","بناء تطبيقات الويب من الدرجة الإنتاجية مععدادات رموز","إنشاء مكونات واجهة مستخدم أمامية مميزة للصفحات التي تعمل بالعقل الإصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires frontend development expertise","Limited to web-based applications"],"zh":["需要前端开发专业知识","仅限于基于Web的应用程序"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発の専門知識が必要","Webベースのアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발 전문 지식이 필요","웹 기반 애플리케이션으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en desarrollo de frontend","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en web"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en développement de frontend","Limité aux applications basées sur le web"],"de":["Benötigt Frontend-Entwicklungsexpertise","Begrenzt auf webbasierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige experiência em desenvolvimento de frontend","Limitado a aplicações baseadas na web"],"ru":["Требует опыта в разработке frontend","Ограничен веб-приложениями"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","محدود بالتطبيقات المبنية على الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
