 est un outil pour générer des fichiers llms.txt standardisés qui aident les systèmes d''IA à découvrir et à comprendre vos co...","de":"Der Ersteller von llms.txt-Dateien ist ein Tool zur Erstellung standardisierter llms.txt-Dateien, die KI-Systemen helfen, Ihre Inhalte genau zu entdecken und...","pt":"O criador de arquivos llms.txt ajuda os desenvolvedores a criar arquivos padrão para indexação de conteúdo por sistemas de IA","ru":"Генератор файлов llms.txt помогает разработчикам создавать стандартные файлы для индексации контента системами ИИ","ar":"مُنشئ ملفات llms.txt يساعد المطورين على إنشاء ملفات стандرد لفهارس محتوى أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"Kimmo Ihanus Next.js Site"},"definition":{"en":"Kimmo Ihanus Next.js Site"},"features":{"es":["Crea archivos llms.txt estandarizados","Mejora la descubierta y el entendimiento de tus contenidos por sistemas de IA","Proporciona información contextual sobre tu sitio web","Seguimiento de la especificación oficial de llmstxt.org","Facilita la indexación y la citación de tus contenidos"],"fr":["Crée des fichiers llms.txt standardisés","Améliore la découverte et la compréhension de vos contenus par les systèmes d''IA","Fournit des informations contextuelles sur votre site web","Suivi de la spécification officielle de llmstxt.org","Facilite l''indexation et la citation de vos contenus"],"de":["Erstellt standardisierte llms.txt-Dateien","Verbessert die Entdeckung und das Verständnis Ihrer Inhalte durch KI-Systeme","Bietet kontextuelle Informationen über Ihre Website","Befolgt die offizielle Spezifikation von llmstxt.org","Erleichtert die Indexierung und Zitierung Ihrer Inhalte"],"pt":["Criação de arquivos llms.txt padrão","Indexação de conteúdo por sistemas de IA","Fornecimento de resumo conciso do propósito do site","Inclusão de detalhes contextuais críticos sobre a marca/produto","Priorização de informações importantes"],"ru":["Создание стандартных файлов llms.txt","Индексация контента системами ИИ","Предоставление краткого описания цели сайта","Включение критических контекстных деталей о бренде/продукте","Приоритизация важной информации"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات llms.txt стандرد","فهارس محتوى أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","توفير ملخص موجز لغرض الموقع","إضافة تفاصيل سياقية حيوية حول العلامة التجارية / المنتج","أولوية المعلومات المهمة"]},"keywords":{"es":["llms.txt","creador de llms.txt","sitios web","sistemas de IA","indexación","citación","especificación oficial","llmstxt.org","contenido estandarizado"],"fr":["llms.txt","créateur de fichiers llms.txt","sites web","systèmes d''IA","indexation","citation","spécification officielle","llmstxt.org","contenu standardisé"],"de":["llms.txt","Ersteller von llms.txt-Dateien","Websites","KI-Systeme","Indexierung","Zitierung","offizielle Spezifikation","llmstxt.org","standardisierter Inhalt"],"pt":["llms.txt","arquivos llms.txt","indexação de conteúdo","sistemas de IA","desenvolvimento web","otimização para motores de busca"],"ru":["llms.txt","файлы llms.txt","индексация контента","системы ИИ","веб-разработка","оптимизация для поисковых систем"],"ar":["llms.txt","ملفات llms.txt","فهارس محتوى","أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير الويب","تحسين محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"ihmissuti","repo":"kimmoihanus-nextjs-site","repoPath":"ihmissuti/kimmoihanus-nextjs-site","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"llms-txt-creator","description":"Create and maintain llms.txt files for AI crawlers following the official specification. Use when setting up AI-friendly documentation indexes, creating machine-readable content maps, or helping websites become more discoverable by LLMs like ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini.","bodyPreview":"# llms.txt Creator\n\nCreate standardized llms.txt files that help AI systems discover, understand, and cite your content accurately, following the official llms.txt specification from llmstxt.org.\n\n## What is llms.txt?\n\nThe llms.txt file is a standardized markdown document hosted at a website''s root path (e.g., `https://example.com/llms.txt`). It serves as a curated index for LLMs, providing:\n\n- Concise summaries of the site''s purpose\n- Critical contextual details about the brand/product\n- Priori","body":"# llms.txt Creator\n\nCreate standardized llms.txt files that help AI systems discover, understand, and cite your content accurately, following the official llms.txt specification from llmstxt.org.\n\n## What is llms.txt?\n\nThe llms.txt file is a standardized markdown document hosted at a website''s root path (e.g., `https://example.com/llms.txt`). It serves as a curated index for LLMs, providing:\n\n- Concise summaries of the site''s purpose\n- Critical contextual details about the brand/product\n- Prioritized links to machine-readable resources\n\nThink of it as the third layer next to existing standards:\n\n| File          | Purpose                                                                     |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `robots.txt`  | Explains what crawlers may access                                           |\n| `sitemap.xml` | Lists URLs for indexing                                                     |\n| `llms.txt`    | Tells LLMs which content is most important and where to find clean versions |\n\n## Why llms.txt Matters\n\n- AI context windows are too small to handle most websites in their entirety\n- Converting complex HTML pages into LLM-friendly text is difficult\n- llms.txt provides curated, expert-level information in a single location\n- Particularly important for development environments where LLMs need quick access to documentation\n\n## Official Format Specification\n\nThe llms.txt file follows a specific markdown format (from llmstxt.org):\n\n```markdown\n# [Project/Company Name]\n\n> [One-sentence description - blockquote with key information]\n\n[Optional paragraphs with more detailed information]\n\n## [Section Name]\n\n- [Link title](https://url): Optional description\n\n## Optional\n\n- [Link title](https://url): Secondary resources that can be skipped\n```\n\n### Required Elements\n\n1. **H1 header** - The name of the project or site (only required element)\n2. **Blockquote** - Short summary with key information\n3. **File lists** - Markdown lists with hyperlinks under H2 headers\n\n### Section Types\n\n| Section      | Purpose                 | Example Content                      |\n| ------------ | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Docs**     | Technical documentation | API references, tutorials            |\n| **Product**  | Product information     | Features, pricing                    |\n| **Policies** | Terms and conditions    | Privacy, returns, SLAs               |\n| **Support**  | Help resources          | FAQs, troubleshooting                |\n| **Optional** | Secondary content       | Can be skipped if context is limited |\n\nThe \"Optional\" section has special meaning: URLs provided there can be skipped if a shorter context is needed.\n\n## Creating llms.txt Step-by-Step\n\n### Step 1: Audit High-Value Content\n\nIdentify the pages that matter most for AI-driven questions:\n\n**Ask:** \"If someone asked an AI about this topic, which pages should it read first?\"\n\n**Priority content:**\n\n- Core documentation and API references\n- Pricing, plans, and usage rules\n- Policies (returns, SLAs, compliance)\n- Critical onboarding or integration guides\n- Key product/feature pages\n\n### Step 2: Create Clean Markdown Versions\n\nllms.txt works best when linking to content that is:\n\n- Free of navigation clutter and cookie banners\n- Structured with headings, code blocks, and short paragraphs\n- Focused on a single topic or task\n\n**Recommended approach:**\nFor each priority page, create a `.md` version at the same path:\n\n- `/docs/api` → `/docs/api.md`\n- `/pricing` → `/pricing.md`\n\n### Step 3: Write the llms.txt File\n\n```markdown\n# [Brand Name]\n\n> [Clear one-sentence description of what you do]\n\nKey terms: [important concepts, product names, technologies]\n\n## Docs\n\n- [Getting Started](https://example.com/docs/quickstart.md): Quick setup guide\n- [API Reference](https://example.com/docs/api.md): Complete API documentation\n\n## Product\n\n- [Features](https://example.com/features.md): Platform capabilities\n- [Pricing](https://example.com/pricing.md): Current pricing tiers\n\n## Support\n\n- [FAQ](https://example.com/faq.md): Common questions answered\n- [Troubleshooting](https://example.com/troubleshooting.md): Issue resolution\n\n## Optional\n\n- [Blog](https://example.com/blog.md): Industry insights\n- [Changelog](https://example.com/changelog.md): Product updates\n```\n\n### Step 4: Deploy and Test\n\n1. Upload file to domain root: `https://yourdomain.com/llms.txt`\n2. Verify accessibility in browser\n3. Test by asking AI assistants about your product\n\n## Complete Examples\n\n### SaaS Company Example\n\n```markdown\n# Acme Analytics\n\n> Acme Analytics is a business intelligence platform that helps companies track, visualize, and act on their data in real-time.\n\nKey terms: BI, business intelligence, data visualization, dashboards, real-time analytics, data connectors, SQL queries.\n\n## Documentation\n\n- [Getting Started](https://acme.com/docs/quickstart.md): Set up your first dashboard in 5 minutes\n- [API Reference](https://acme.com/docs/api.md): Complete REST API documentation with authentication\n- [Data Connectors](https://acme.com/docs/connectors.md): Supported integrations and setup guides\n- [SQL Reference](https://acme.com/docs/sql.md): Custom query syntax and examples\n\n## Product\n\n- [Features](https://acme.com/features.md): Platform capabilities and use cases\n- [Pricing](https://acme.com/pricing.md): Current pricing tiers and features\n- [Integrations](https://acme.com/integrations.md): Available connectors and partners\n\n## Support\n\n- [FAQ](https://acme.com/faq.md): Frequently asked questions\n- [Troubleshooting](https://acme.com/troubleshooting.md): Common issues and solutions\n- [Status](https://status.acme.com): System status and uptime\n\n## Optional\n\n- [Blog](https://acme.com/blog.md): Industry insights and tutorials\n- [Changelog](https://acme.com/changelog.md): Product updates and release notes\n- [Case Studies](https://acme.com/cases.md): Customer success stories\n```\n\n### E-Commerce Company Example\n\n```markdown\n# Nordic Outdoor\n\n> Nordic Outdoor is a sustainable outdoor gear retailer specializing in hiking, camping, and winter sports equipment from Scandinavian brands.\n\nKey terms: outdoor gear, hiking equipment, camping gear, sustainable outdoor, Scandinavian design, winter sports.\n\n## Products\n\n- [Hiking Gear](https://nordicoutdoor.com/hiking.md): Backpacks, boots, trekking poles\n- [Camping Equipment](https://nordicoutdoor.com/camping.md): Tents, sleeping bags, cookware\n- [Winter Sports](https://nordicoutdoor.com/winter.md): Skis, snowboards, cold weather gear\n\n## Customer Support\n\n- [Shipping Info](https://nordicoutdoor.com/shipping.md): Delivery times and costs by region\n- [Returns Policy](https://nordicoutdoor.com/returns.md): 60-day return window and process\n- [Size Guide](https://nordicoutdoor.com/sizing.md): Measurement guides for all product types\n- [FAQ](https://nordicoutdoor.com/faq.md): Common questions answered\n\n## Sustainability\n\n- [Our Commitment](https://nordicoutdoor.com/sustainability.md): Environmental initiatives and goals\n- [Repair Service](https://nordicoutdoor.com/repair.md): Product repair and recycling programs\n\n## Optional\n\n- [Brand Stories](https://nordicoutdoor.com/brands.md): Partner brand backgrounds\n- [Gear Guides](https://nordicoutdoor.com/guides.md): How to choose equipment\n```\n\n### Documentation Site Example\n\n```markdown\n# FastAPI Framework\n\n> FastAPI is a modern, fast web framework for building APIs with Python based on standard Python type hints.\n\nKey terms: Python, API, REST, async, type hints, Pydantic, OpenAPI, Swagger, JSON Schema.\n\nImportant notes:\n\n- FastAPI is built on Starlette and Pydantic\n- Requires Python 3.8+\n- Async-first but supports sync operations\n\n## Getting Started\n\n- [Tutorial](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/index.html.md): Step-by-step guide to building your first API\n- [Installation](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/installation.html.md): Setup and requirements\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n- [Path Parameters](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/path-params.html.md): URL path variables\n- [Query Parameters](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/query-params.html.md): URL query string handling\n- [Request Body](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/body.html.md): JSON request parsing with Pydantic\n- [Response Model](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/response-model.html.md): Response serialization\n\n## Advanced\n\n- [Dependencies](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies.html.md): Dependency injection system\n- [Security](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/security.html.md): Authentication and authorization\n- [Background Tasks](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/background-tasks.html.md): Async task processing\n\n## Optional\n\n- [Deployment](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/deployment.html.md): Production deployment guides\n- [Alternatives](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/alternatives.html.md): Comparison with other frameworks\n```\n\n## Writing Effective Descriptions\n\nEach link should have a brief description (10-20 words) explaining:\n\n- What the page contains\n- When/why an AI should reference it\n\n**Good descriptions:**\n\n```markdown\n- [API Reference](url.md): Complete REST API documentation with authentication and rate limits\n- [Pricing](url.md): Current pricing tiers, features included, and enterprise options\n- [Returns Policy](url.md): 60-day return window, exceptions, and refund process\n```\n\n**Poor descriptions:**\n\n```markdown\n- [API Reference](url.md): API docs\n- [Pricing](url.md): Pricing information\n- [Returns](url.md): Return stuff\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do:\n\n1. **Keep it curated, not comprehensive** - Only include your most important pages\n2. **Update when docs change** - Stale llms.txt reduces trust\n3. **Use consistent terminology** - Match terms used in your actual content\n4. **Test with LLMs** - Ask AI assistants about your product and check if responses improve\n5. **Link to clean markdown** - Avoid linking to pages heavy with JavaScript/navigation\n\n### Don''t:\n\n1. **List every page** - This defeats the purpose of curation\n2. **Link to noisy HTML** - Full of layout code, ads, and navigation\n3. **Forget to update** - When documentation changes, update llms.txt\n4. **Use vague descriptions** - They don''t help AI understand content purpose\n5. **Include login-required pages** - AI can''t access authenticated content\n\n## Companion Files\n\n### llms-full.txt\n\nSome sites create an expanded version with full content:\n\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n\n> Description\n\n## Section\n\n<document>\n[Full content of linked document embedded here]\n</document>\n```\n\nThis is useful for providing complete context without requiring additional requests.\n\n### Markdown page versions\n\nCreate `.md` versions of key pages at the same URL with `.md` appended:\n\n- `/docs/api` → `/docs/api.md`\n- `/pricing` → `/pricing.md`\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nAfter creating llms.txt, verify:\n\n- [ ] File is accessible at `https://yourdomain.com/llms.txt`\n- [ ] H1 header contains brand/company name\n- [ ] Blockquote provides clear one-sentence description\n- [ ] Key terms include important concepts and product names\n- [ ] All linked URLs are valid and return 200\n- [ ] Linked content is clean, structured markdown\n- [ ] Optional section exists for secondary content\n- [ ] Descriptions are concise but informative (10-20 words)\n- [ ] File is valid markdown (no syntax errors)\n- [ ] No authentication-required pages included\n\n## Testing Your llms.txt\n\nAfter deployment, test effectiveness:\n\n1. **Direct verification**: Visit `https://yourdomain.com/llms.txt` in browser\n2. **AI testing**: Ask AI assistants questions about your product\n3. **Monitor changes**: Track if AI responses improve over time\n4. **Competitor comparison**: Check if competitors have llms.txt files\n\n## Integration with Other Standards\n\nllms.txt complements existing web standards:\n\n| Standard    | Relationship                                                         |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| robots.txt  | llms.txt provides content guidance; robots.txt provides access rules |\n| sitemap.xml | sitemap lists all pages; llms.txt curates the most important ones    |\n| Schema.org  | Schema describes page content; llms.txt links to documentation       |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:10:40.837Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Agents needing standardized markdown documentation for AI discoverability and citation accuracy.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化markdown文档的内容代理，以实现AI发现和引用准确性。","ja":"AIの発見と引用の正確性を実現するために標準化されたマークダウン文書が必要なコンテンツエージェントに最適です。","ko":"AI 발견 및 인용 정확성을 위해 표준화된 마크다운 문서가 필요한 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de contenido que necesitan documentación de markdown estandarizada para la descubrimiento de inteligencia artificial y la precisión de las citas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contenu ayant besoin de documentation markdown standardisée pour la découverte et la précision des citations d''intelligence artificielle.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Agents, die standardisierte Markdown-Dokumentation für die Entdeckung von künstlicher Intelligenz und die Genauigkeit von Zitaten benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Content Agents needing standardized markdown documentation for AI discoverability and citation accuracy.","ru":"Perfect for Content Agents needing standardized markdown documentation for AI discoverability and citation accuracy.","ar":"Perfect for Content Agents needing standardized markdown documentation for AI discoverability and citation accuracy."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create compliant llms.txt files following the official llmstxt.org specification, providing concise summaries and critical contextual details in markdown format, hosted at a website''s root path for seamless LLM integration.","zh":"赋予代理创建符合官方llmstxt.org规范的合规llms.txt文件的能力，提供markdown格式的简明摘要和关键上下文详细信息，并将其托管在网站的根路径中，以实现无缝的LLM集成。","ja":"公式のllmstxt.org仕様に従ったコンプライアントなllms.txtファイルを作成するエージェントをEmpowerし、マークダウンの形式で簡潔な要約と重要なコンテキストの詳細を提供し、ウェブサイトのルートパスにホストすることで、無摩擦のLLM統合を実現します。","ko":"공식 llmstxt.org 사양을 따르는 규제 준수 llms.txt 파일을 생성하여 에이전트를 강화하고, 마크다운 형식으로 간결한 요약과 중요한 맥락 세부 정보를 제공하며, 웹사이트의 루트 경로에 호스팅하여 무결점의 LLM 통합을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear archivos llms.txt conformes al especificación oficial de llmstxt.org, proporcionando resúmenes concisos y detalles contextuales críticos en formato markdown, alojados en la ruta raíz de un sitio web para una integración LLM sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fichiers llms.txt conformes à la spécification officielle de llmstxt.org, fournissant des résumés concis et des détails contextuels critiques au format markdown, hébergés à la racine d''un site web pour une intégration LLM sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konforme llms.txt-Dateien gemäß der offiziellen llmstxt.org-Spezifikation zu erstellen, die präzise Zusammenfassungen und kritische Kontextdetails im Markdown-Format bereitstellen, die im Stammverzeichnis einer Website gehostet werden, um eine nahtlose LLM-Integration zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Empowers agents to create compliant llms.txt files following the official llmstxt.org specification, providing concise summaries and critical contextual details in markdown format, hosted at a website''s root path for seamless LLM integration.","ru":"Empowers agents to create compliant llms.txt files following the official llmstxt.org specification, providing concise summaries and critical contextual details in markdown format, hosted at a website''s root path for seamless LLM integration.","ar":"Empowers agents to create compliant llms.txt files following the official llmstxt.org specification, providing concise summaries and critical contextual details in markdown format, hosted at a website''s root path for seamless LLM integration."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating standardized llms.txt files for brand websites","Creating curated indexes for LLMs with concise summaries and contextual details","Hosting llms.txt files at website root paths for AI system discoverability"],"zh":["为品牌网站生成标准化的llms.txt文件","为LLM创建具有简明摘要和上下文详细信息的策划索引","在网站根路径托管llms.txt文件以实现AI系统发现"],"ja":["ブランドウェブサイト用の標準化されたllms.txtファイルを生成する","LLM用に簡潔な要約とコンテキストの詳細を持つキュレーションインデックスを作成する","ウェブサイトのルートパスにllms.txtファイルをホストしてAIシステムの検出を実現する"],"ko":["브랜드 웹사이트용 표준화된 llms.txt 파일 생성","LLM용으로 요약과 맥락 세부 정보가 포함된 큐레이션 인덱스 생성","웹사이트 루트 경로에 llms.txt 파일 호스팅을 통해 AI 시스템 검색 가능"],"es":["Generación de archivos llms.txt estandarizados para sitios web de marca","Creación de índices curados para LLM con resúmenes concisos y detalles contextuales","Alojamiento de archivos llms.txt en la ruta raíz del sitio web para la descubrimiento del sistema de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Génération de fichiers llms.txt standardisés pour les sites web de marque","Création d''index curés pour les LLM avec des résumés concis et des détails contextuels","Hébergement de fichiers llms.txt à la racine du site web pour la découverte du système d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Erstellung standardisierter llms.txt-Dateien für Marken-Websites","Erstellung von kuratierten Indexen für LLM mit präzisen Zusammenfassungen und Kontextdetails","Bereitstellung von llms.txt-Dateien im Stammverzeichnis einer Website für die Entdeckung von KI-Systemen"],"pt":["Generating standardized llms.txt files for brand websites","Creating curated indexes for LLMs with concise summaries and contextual details","Hosting llms.txt files at website root paths for AI system discoverability"],"ru":["Generating standardized llms.txt files for brand websites","Creating curated indexes for LLMs with concise summaries and contextual details","Hosting llms.txt files at website root paths for AI system discoverability"],"ar":["Generating standardized llms.txt files for brand websites","Creating curated indexes for LLMs with concise summaries and contextual details","Hosting llms.txt files at website root paths for AI system discoverability"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires hosting at website root path","Compliance with official llmstxt.org specification necessary"],"zh":["需要托管在网站根路径","需要遵守官方llmstxt.org规范"],"ja":["ウェブサイトのルートパスにホストする必要がある","公式のllmstxt.org仕様に準拠する必要がある"],"ko":["웹사이트 루트 경로에 호스팅해야 함","공식 llmstxt.org 사양을 준수해야 함"],"es":["Requiere alojamiento en la ruta raíz del sitio web","Conformidad con la especificación oficial de llmstxt.org necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite un hébergement à la racine du site web","Conformité à la spécification officielle de llmstxt.org nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert Hosting im Stammverzeichnis der Website","Konformität mit der offiziellen llmstxt.org-Spezifikation erforderlich"],"pt":["Requires hosting at website root path","Compliance with official llmstxt.org specification necessary"],"ru":["Requires hosting at website root path","Compliance with official llmstxt.org specification necessary"],"ar":["Requires hosting at website root path","Compliance with official llmstxt.org specification necessary"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Matteo-Exp-Transformer/BHM-v.2/defense-in-depth', 'community', 'Matteo-Exp-Transformer', 'BHM-v.2', 'Matteo-Exp-Transformer/BHM-v.2', 'defense-in-depth', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z', '2026-02-18T10:10:26.279Z', NULL, '{"id":"Matteo-Exp-Transformer/BHM-v.2/defense-in-depth","name":"defense-in-depth","description":{"zh":"深度防御验证技术是通过在每个数据传递层添加验证，确保数据安全，防止bug和安全漏洞","ja":"ディフェンス・イン・デプス検証技術は、データの安全性を確保し、バグやセキュリティの脆弱性を防止するために、各データ伝達層に検証を追加する","ko":"방어 심화 검증 기술은 데이터의 보안을 강화하고 버그 및 보안 취약점을 방지하기 위해 각 데이터 전달 계층에 검증을 추가함","es":"La defensa en profundidad es una estrategia de seguridad que implica validar los datos en cada capa para prevenir vulnerabilidades","fr":"La défense en profondeur est une stratégie de sécurité qui consiste à valider les données à chaque couche pour prévenir les vulnérabilités","de":"Die Verteidigung in der Tiefe ist eine Sicherheitsstrategie, die die Validierung von Daten in jeder Ebene beinhaltet, um Schwachstellen zu verhindern","pt":"A defesa em profundidade é uma abordagem de segurança que envolve a validação de dados em cada camada do aplicativo.","ru":"Защита в глубину - это подход к безопасности, который включает в себя валидацию данных на каждом уровне приложения.","ar":"الدفاع في العمق هو نهج أمان ي涉ل التحقق من البيانات في كل طبقة من طبقات التطبيق.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"深度防御验证技术","ja":"ディフェンス・イン・デプス検証","ko":"방어 심화 검증 기술","es":"Defensa en profundidad: validación de seguridad","fr":"Défense en profondeur : validation de sécurité","de":"Verteidigung in der Tiefe: Validierung der Sicherheit","pt":"Defesa em Profundidade: Validação de Dados","ru":"Защита в Глубину: Валидация Данных","ar":"الدفاع في العمق: التحقق من البيانات","en":"defense-in-depth"},"description":{"zh":"深度防御验证技术是通过在每个数据传递层添加验证，确保数据安全，防止bug和安全漏洞","ja":"ディフェンス・イン・デプス検証技術は、データの安全性を確保し、バグやセキュリティの脆弱性を防止するために、各データ伝達層に検証を追加する","ko":"방어 심화 검증 기술은 데이터의 보안을 강화하고 버그 및 보안 취약점을 방지하기 위해 각 데이터 전달 계층에 검증을 추가함","es":"La defensa en profundidad es una estrategia de seguridad que implica validar los datos en cada capa para prevenir vulnerabilidades","fr":"La défense en profondeur est une stratégie de sécurité qui consiste à valider les données à chaque couche pour prévenir les vulnérabilités","de":"Die Verteidigung in der Tiefe ist eine Sicherheitsstrategie, die die Validierung von Daten in jeder Ebene beinhaltet, um Schwachstellen zu verhindern","pt":"A defesa em profundidade é uma abordagem de segurança que envolve a validação de dados em cada camada do aplicativo.","ru":"Защита в глубину - это подход к безопасности, который включает в себя валидацию данных на каждом уровне приложения.","ar":"الدفاع في العمق هو نهج أمان ي涉ل التحقق من البيانات في كل طبقة من طبقات التطبيق.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["多层验证","数据安全","bug防止","安全漏洞防止","代码健壮性"],"ja":["マルチレイヤー検証","データの安全性","バグ防止","セキュリティの脆弱性防止","コードの強健性"],"ko":["다중 계층 검증","데이터 보안","버그 방지","보안 취약점 방지","코드 강건성"],"es":["Validación de datos en cada capa","Prevención de vulnerabilidades","Implementación de seguridad en cada nivel","Detección de errores y excepciones","Mejora de la confiabilidad y la estabilidad"],"fr":["Validation des données à chaque couche","Prévention des vulnérabilités","Mise en œuvre de la sécurité à chaque niveau","Détection des erreurs et des exceptions","Amélioration de la fiabilité et de la stabilité"],"de":["Validierung von Daten in jeder Ebene","Verhinderung von Schwachstellen","Implementierung von Sicherheit auf jedem Level","Erkennung von Fehlern und Ausnahmen","Verbesserung der Zuverlässigkeit und Stabilität"],"pt":["Validação de dados em cada camada","Prevenção de bugs e erros","Melhoria da segurança do aplicativo","Redução do risco de ataques","Simplificação da depuração"],"ru":["Валидация данных на каждом уровне","Предотвращение ошибок и багов","Повышение безопасности приложения","Снижение риска атак","Упрощение отладки"],"ar":["التحقق من البيانات في كل طبقة","منع العيوب والأخطاء","تحسين أمان التطبيق","تقليل خطر الهجمات","تبسيط إصلاح الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["深度防御","验证技术","数据安全","软件开发","bug防止","安全漏洞防止"],"ja":["ディフェンス・イン・デプス","検証技術","データの安全性","ソフトウェア開発","バグ防止","セキュリティの脆弱性防止"],"ko":["방어 심화","검증 기술","데이터 보안","소프트웨어 개발","버그 방지","보안 취약점 방지"],"es":["defensa en profundidad","validación de seguridad","protección de aplicaciones","seguridad de datos","prevención de vulnerabilidades","desarrollo seguro"],"fr":["défense en profondeur","validation de sécurité","protection des applications","sécurité des données","prévention des vulnérabilités","développement sécurisé"],"de":["Verteidigung in der Tiefe","Validierung der Sicherheit","Schutz von Anwendungen","Sicherheit von Daten","Verhinderung von Schwachstellen","sichere Entwicklung"],"pt":["defesa em profundidade","validação de dados","segurança do aplicativo","prevenção de bugs","desenvolvimento de software","segurança cibernética"],"ru":["защита в глубину","валидация данных","безопасность приложения","предотвращение ошибок","разработка программного обеспечения","кибербезопасность"],"ar":["الدفاع في العمق","التحقق من البيانات","أمان التطبيق","منع العيوب","تطوير البرمجيات","الأمان السيبراني"]}},"owner":"Matteo-Exp-Transformer","repo":"BHM-v.2","repoPath":"Matteo-Exp-Transformer/BHM-v.2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"defense-in-depth","description":"Use when invalid data causes failures deep in execution, requiring validation at multiple system layers - validates at every layer data passes through to make bugs structurally impossible","bodyPreview":"# Defense-in-Depth Validation\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you fix a bug caused by invalid data, adding validation at one place feels sufficient. But that single check can be bypassed by different code paths, refactoring, or mocks.\n\n**Core principle:** Validate at EVERY layer data passes through. Make the bug structurally impossible.\n\n## Why Multiple Layers\n\nSingle validation: \"We fixed the bug\"\nMultiple layers: \"We made the bug impossible\"\n\nDifferent layers catch different cases:\n- Entry validation catch","body":"# Defense-in-Depth Validation\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you fix a bug caused by invalid data, adding validation at one place feels sufficient. But that single check can be bypassed by different code paths, refactoring, or mocks.\n\n**Core principle:** Validate at EVERY layer data passes through. Make the bug structurally impossible.\n\n## Why Multiple Layers\n\nSingle validation: \"We fixed the bug\"\nMultiple layers: \"We made the bug impossible\"\n\nDifferent layers catch different cases:\n- Entry validation catches most bugs\n- Business logic catches edge cases\n- Environment guards prevent context-specific dangers\n- Debug logging helps when other layers fail\n\n## The Four Layers\n\n### Layer 1: Entry Point Validation\n**Purpose:** Reject obviously invalid input at API boundary\n\n```typescript\nfunction createProject(name: string, workingDirectory: string) {\n  if (!workingDirectory || workingDirectory.trim() === '''') {\n    throw new Error(''workingDirectory cannot be empty'');\n  }\n  if (!existsSync(workingDirectory)) {\n    throw new Error(`workingDirectory does not exist: ${workingDirectory}`);\n  }\n  if (!statSync(workingDirectory).isDirectory()) {\n    throw new Error(`workingDirectory is not a directory: ${workingDirectory}`);\n  }\n  // ... proceed\n}\n```\n\n### Layer 2: Business Logic Validation\n**Purpose:** Ensure data makes sense for this operation\n\n```typescript\nfunction initializeWorkspace(projectDir: string, sessionId: string) {\n  if (!projectDir) {\n    throw new Error(''projectDir required for workspace initialization'');\n  }\n  // ... proceed\n}\n```\n\n### Layer 3: Environment Guards\n**Purpose:** Prevent dangerous operations in specific contexts\n\n```typescript\nasync function gitInit(directory: string) {\n  // In tests, refuse git init outside temp directories\n  if (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''test'') {\n    const normalized = normalize(resolve(directory));\n    const tmpDir = normalize(resolve(tmpdir()));\n\n    if (!normalized.startsWith(tmpDir)) {\n      throw new Error(\n        `Refusing git init outside temp dir during tests: ${directory}`\n      );\n    }\n  }\n  // ... proceed\n}\n```\n\n### Layer 4: Debug Instrumentation\n**Purpose:** Capture context for forensics\n\n```typescript\nasync function gitInit(directory: string) {\n  const stack = new Error().stack;\n  logger.debug(''About to git init'', {\n    directory,\n    cwd: process.cwd(),\n    stack,\n  });\n  // ... proceed\n}\n```\n\n## Applying the Pattern\n\nWhen you find a bug:\n\n1. **Trace the data flow** - Where does bad value originate? Where used?\n2. **Map all checkpoints** - List every point data passes through\n3. **Add validation at each layer** - Entry, business, environment, debug\n4. **Test each layer** - Try to bypass layer 1, verify layer 2 catches it\n\n## Example from Session\n\nBug: Empty `projectDir` caused `git init` in source code\n\n**Data flow:**\n1. Test setup → empty string\n2. `Project.create(name, '''')`\n3. `WorkspaceManager.createWorkspace('''')`\n4. `git init` runs in `process.cwd()`\n\n**Four layers added:**\n- Layer 1: `Project.create()` validates not empty/exists/writable\n- Layer 2: `WorkspaceManager` validates projectDir not empty\n- Layer 3: `WorktreeManager` refuses git init outside tmpdir in tests\n- Layer 4: Stack trace logging before git init\n\n**Result:** All 1847 tests passed, bug impossible to reproduce\n\n## Key Insight\n\nAll four layers were necessary. During testing, each layer caught bugs the others missed:\n- Different code paths bypassed entry validation\n- Mocks bypassed business logic checks\n- Edge cases on different platforms needed environment guards\n- Debug logging identified structural misuse\n\n**Don''t stop at one validation point.** Add checks at every layer.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:10:26.279Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security Agents needing robust data validation and sanitization capabilities through defense-in-depth strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要通过深度防御策略实现强大的数据验证和清理功能的安全代理。","ja":"セキュリティエージェントが、ディフェンス・イン・デプス戦略を通じて強力なデータ検証およびサニタイジング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"방어의 깊이 전략을 통해 강력한 데이터 유효성 검사 및 정제 기능을 필요로 하는 보안 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Security Agents needing robust data validation and sanitization capabilities through defense-in-depth strategies.","fr":"Perfect for Security Agents needing robust data validation and sanitization capabilities through defense-in-depth strategies.","de":"Perfect for Security Agents needing robust data validation and sanitization capabilities through defense-in-depth strategies.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança que necessitam de capacidades robustas de validação e sanitização de dados por meio de estratégias de defesa em profundidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности, которым необходимы надежные возможности проверки и очистки данных посредством стратегий защиты в глубину.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الأمني التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات التحقق الصارمة وتحسين البيانات من خلال استراتيجيات الدفاع في العمق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce multiple layers of validation, making bugs structurally impossible by catching different cases at entry points, refactoring, and mocks, utilizing core principles of defense-in-depth for enhanced security.","zh":"赋予代理人强制执行多层验证的能力，使得通过在入口点、重构和模拟中捕获不同的案例，利用防御的深度原则来增强安全性，从而使得bug在结构上变得不可能。","ja":"エージェントに複数の検証層を適用する能力を付与し、エントリポイント、リファクタリング、およびモックでさまざまなケースをキャッチすることで、ディフェンス・イン・デプス原則を利用してセキュリティを強化し、バグが構造的に不可能になるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 다중 계층 유효성 검증을 강제 적용할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여,入口 지점, 리팩토링 및 모의에서 다양한 경우를 捕获하여 방어의 깊이 원리를 활용하여 보안성을 강화하고, 버그가 구조적으로 불가능하게 만듭니다.","es":"Empowers agents to enforce multiple layers of validation, making bugs structurally impossible by catching different cases at entry points, refactoring, and mocks, utilizing core principles of defense-in-depth for enhanced security.","fr":"Empowers agents to enforce multiple layers of validation, making bugs structurally impossible by catching different cases at entry points, refactoring, and mocks, utilizing core principles of defense-in-depth for enhanced security.","de":"Empowers agents to enforce multiple layers of validation, making bugs structurally impossible by catching different cases at entry points, refactoring, and mocks, utilizing core principles of defense-in-depth for enhanced security.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor múltiplas camadas de validação, tornando bugs estruturalmente impossíveis ao capturar diferentes casos em pontos de entrada, refatoração e mocks, utilizando princípios fundamentais de defesa em profundidade para segurança aprimorada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать несколько слоев проверки, что делает баги структурно невозможными за счет выявления различных случаев на входных точках, рефакторинге и макетах, используя основные принципы защиты в глубину для повышения безопасности.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض طبقات متعددة من التحقق، مما يجعل العيوب مستحيلة هيكليًا من خلال التقاط حالات مختلفة في نقاط الدخول وإعادة الهيكلة والدمى، باستخدام المبادئ الأساسية للدفاع في العمق لتعزيز الأمان."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating user input at multiple layers","Implementing robust data sanitization protocols","Debugging code paths to prevent bypassing of single checks"],"zh":["在多个层面上验证用户输入","实施强大的数据清理协议","调试代码路径以防止单一检查的绕过"],"ja":["複数の層でユーザー入力を検証する","堅牢なデータサニタイジングプロトコルを実施する","コードパスをデバッグして単一のチェックのバイパスを防ぐ"],"ko":["다중 계층에서 사용자 입력을 유효성 검사하는 것","강력한 데이터 정제 프로토콜을 구현하는 것","코드 경로를 디버깅하여 단일 점검의 우회를 방지하는 것"],"es":["Validating user input at multiple layers","Implementing robust data sanitization protocols","Debugging code paths to prevent bypassing of single checks"],"fr":["Validating user input at multiple layers","Implementing robust data sanitization protocols","Debugging code paths to prevent bypassing of single checks"],"de":["Validating user input at multiple layers","Implementing robust data sanitization protocols","Debugging code paths to prevent bypassing of single checks"],"pt":["Validar a entrada do usuário em várias camadas","Implementar protocolos robustos de sanitização de dados","Depurar caminhos de código para prevenir contornos de verificações únicas"],"ru":["Проверка ввода пользователя на нескольких уровнях","Реализация надежных протоколов очистки данных","Отладка кода для предотвращения обхода единичных проверок"],"ar":["التحقق من إدخال المستخدم في طبقات متعددة","تنفيذ بروتوكولات قوية لتحسين البيانات","تصحيح أخطاء مسارات الشفرة لمنع التحايل على الفحوصات الفردية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires thorough understanding of code architecture","May introduce additional complexity in codebase"],"zh":["需要对代码架构有彻底的理解","可能会在代码库中引入额外的复杂性"],"ja":["コードアーキテクチャに対する徹底的な理解が必要","コードベースに追加の複雑性を導入する可能性がある"],"ko":["코드 아키텍처에 대한 철저한 이해가 필요","코드베이스에 추가적인 복잡성을 도입할 가능성이 있음"],"es":["Requires thorough understanding of code architecture","May introduce additional complexity in codebase"],"fr":["Requires thorough understanding of code architecture","May introduce additional complexity in codebase"],"de":["Requires thorough understanding of code architecture","May introduce additional complexity in codebase"],"pt":["Exige uma compreensão aprofundada da arquitetura de código","Pode introduzir complexidade adicional na base de código"],"ru":["Требует глубокого понимания архитектуры кода","Может ввести дополнительную сложность в кодовой базе"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا عميقًا لهيكلة الشفرة","قد يؤدي إلى إضافة تعقيد إضافي في قاعدة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Lynxgsm/waveos/frontend-design', 'community', 'Lynxgsm', 'waveos', 'Lynxgsm/waveos', 'frontend-design', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z', '2026-02-18T10:09:43.475Z', NULL, '{"id":"Lynxgsm/waveos/frontend-design","name":"frontend-design","description":{"zh":"该技能指导创建独特的生产级前端界面，避免通用的 AI 风格。实现具有卓越美观细节和创意选择的真实工作代码","ja":"このスキルは、独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェースを作成し、一般的な AI スタイルを避けることを指導します。卓越した美観の細部と創造的な選択を持つ実際の動作コードを実装する","ko":"이 스킬은 고유한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하고 일반적인 AI 스타일을 피하는 것을 가이드합니다.卓越한 미적 세부 사항과 창의적인 선택을 갖춘 실제 작동 코드를 구현합니다","es":"El skill de diseño de frontend te guía en la creación de interfaces de usuario distintivas y de alta calidad con TanStack Start, React 19 y PostgreSQL.","fr":"Le skill de conception de frontend vous guide dans la création d''interfaces utilisateur distinctives et de haute qualité avec TanStack Start, React 19 et PostgreSQL.","de":"Das Frontend-Design-Skill führt Sie bei der Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten und hochwertigen Benutzeroberflächen mit TanStack Start, React 19 und PostgreSQL.","pt":"Desenvolva interfaces frontend modernas e personalizadas com React 19 e PostgreSQL. Aprenda a criar soluções de alta qualidade com atenção aos detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Разработайте современные и индивидуальные фронтенд-интерфейсы с помощью React 19 и PostgreSQL. Изучите создание высококачественных решений с учетом эстетических деталей.","ar":"طور واجهات مستخدم أمامية حديثة و مخصصة باستخدام React 19 و PostgreSQL. تعلم كيفية إنشاء حلول عالية الجودة مع اهتمام بال细يات الجمالية.","en":"A modern, self-hosted music streaming application built with TanStack Start, React 19, and PostgreSQL."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"前端设计技能：创建独特的音乐流媒体应用","ja":"フロントエンド設計スキル：独自の音楽ストリーミングアプリを作成","ko":"프론트엔드 디자인 스킬: 고유한 음악 스트리밍 애플리케이션 생성","es":"Diseño de frontend moderno con TanStack Start","fr":"Conception de frontend 