ルのフロントエンドインターフェースを設計して実装","一般的な AI スタイルを避け、卓越した美観の細部を実現","創造的な選択と実用性を持つインターフェースを作成","React 19 を使用して高パフォーマンスのユーザーインターフェースを実現","PostgreSQL を使用して信頼性の高いデータストレージを実現"],"ko":["TanStack Start, React 19, PostgreSQL를 사용하여 현대적인 음악 스트리밍 애플리케이션을 생성","고유한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 설계하고 구현","일반적인 AI 스타일을 피하고,卓越한 미적 세부 사항을 구현","창의적인 선택과 실용성을 갖춘 인터페이스를 생성","React 19를 사용하여 고성능의 사용자 인터페이스를 구현","PostgreSQL를 사용하여 신뢰할 수 있는 데이터 저장소를 구현"],"es":["Diseño de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Uso de TanStack Start y React 19","Integración con PostgreSQL","Enfoque en la estética y la experiencia del usuario","Creación de interfaces de usuario únicas y de alta calidad"],"fr":["Conception d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Utilisation de TanStack Start et React 19","Intégration avec PostgreSQL","Accent sur l''esthétique et l''expérience utilisateur","Création d''interfaces utilisateur uniques et de haute qualité"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen","Verwendung von TanStack Start und React 19","Integration mit PostgreSQL","Fokus auf Ästhetik und Benutzererfahrung","Erstellung von einzigartigen und hochwertigen Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de interfaces frontend personalizadas","Uso de React 19 e PostgreSQL","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Criação de soluções de alta qualidade","Implementação de código de trabalho real"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных фронтенд-интерфейсов","Использование React 19 и PostgreSQL","Учет эстетических деталей","Создание высококачественных решений","Реализация рабочего кода"],"ar":["طور واجهات مستخدم أمامية مخصصة","استخدام React 19 و PostgreSQL","اهتمام بال细يات الجمالية","إنشاء حلول عالية الجودة","تنفيذ كود العمل الحقيقي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","音乐流媒体应用","TanStack Start","React 19","PostgreSQL","生产级前端界面","独特的用户界面","AI 风格","美观细节","创意选择"],"ja":["フロントエンド設計","音楽ストリーミングアプリ","TanStack Start","React 19","PostgreSQL","プロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェース","独自のユーザーインターフェース","AI スタイル","美観の細部","創造的な選択"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","음악 스트리밍 애플리케이션","TanStack Start","React 19","PostgreSQL","생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스","고유한 사용자 인터페이스","AI 스타일","미적 세부 사항","창의적인 선택"],"es":["diseño de frontend","TanStack Start","React 19","PostgreSQL","interfaces de usuario","estética","experiencia del usuario","desarrollo web"],"fr":["conception de frontend","TanStack Start","React 19","PostgreSQL","interfaces utilisateur","esthétique","expérience utilisateur","développement web"],"de":["Frontend-Design","TanStack Start","React 19","PostgreSQL","Benutzeroberflächen","Ästhetik","Benutzererfahrung","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["frontend design","desenvolvimento frontend","react 19","postgresql","interfaces de usuário personalizadas","soluções de alta qualidade","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologias web"],"ru":["фронтенд-дизайн","разработка фронтенда","react 19","postgresql","индивидуальные интерфейсы пользователя","высококачественные решения","разработка программного обеспечения","веб-технологии"],"ar":["تصميم الواجهة الأمامية","تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","react 19","postgresql","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","حلول عالية الجودة","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الويب"]}},"owner":"Lynxgsm","repo":"waveos","repoPath":"Lynxgsm/waveos","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.485Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications. Generates creative, polished code that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\n## Design Direction\n\nCommit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\n## Design Direction\n\nCommit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work—the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code that is:\n\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\n### Typography\n\n→ _Consult [typography reference](reference/typography.md) for scales, pairing, and loading strategies._\n\nChoose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n\n**DO**: Use a modular type scale with fluid sizing (clamp)\n**DO**: Vary font weights and sizes to create clear visual hierarchy\n**DON''T**: Use overused fonts—Inter, Roboto, Arial, Open Sans, system defaults\n**DON''T**: Use monospace typography as lazy shorthand for \"technical/developer\" vibes\n**DON''T**: Put large icons with rounded corners above every heading—they rarely add value and make sites look templated\n\n### Color & Theme\n\n→ _Consult [color reference](reference/color-and-contrast.md) for OKLCH, palettes, and dark mode._\n\nCommit to a cohesive palette. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n\n**DO**: Use modern CSS color functions (oklch, color-mix, light-dark) for perceptually uniform, maintainable palettes\n**DO**: Tint your neutrals toward your brand hue—even a subtle hint creates subconscious cohesion\n**DON''T**: Use gray text on colored backgrounds—it looks washed out; use a shade of the background color instead\n**DON''T**: Use pure black (#000) or pure white (#fff)—always tint; pure black/white never appears in nature\n**DON''T**: Use the AI color palette: cyan-on-dark, purple-to-blue gradients, neon accents on dark backgrounds\n**DON''T**: Use gradient text for \"impact\"—especially on metrics or headings; it''s decorative rather than meaningful\n**DON''T**: Default to dark mode with glowing accents—it looks \"cool\" without requiring actual design decisions\n\n### Layout & Space\n\n→ _Consult [spatial reference](reference/spatial-design.md) for grids, rhythm, and container queries._\n\nCreate visual rhythm through varied spacing—not the same padding everywhere. Embrace asymmetry and unexpected compositions. Break the grid intentionally for emphasis.\n\n**DO**: Create visual rhythm through varied spacing—tight groupings, generous separations\n**DO**: Use fluid spacing with clamp() that breathes on larger screens\n**DO**: Use asymmetry and unexpected compositions; break the grid intentionally for emphasis\n**DON''T**: Wrap everything in cards—not everything needs a container\n**DON''T**: Nest cards inside cards—visual noise, flatten the hierarchy\n**DON''T**: Use identical card grids—same-sized cards with icon + heading + text, repeated endlessly\n**DON''T**: Use the hero metric layout template—big number, small label, supporting stats, gradient accent\n**DON''T**: Center everything—left-aligned text with asymmetric layouts feels more designed\n**DON''T**: Use the same spacing everywhere—without rhythm, layouts feel monotonous\n\n### Visual Details\n\n**DO**: Use intentional, purposeful decorative elements that reinforce brand\n**DON''T**: Use glassmorphism everywhere—blur effects, glass cards, glow borders used decoratively rather than purposefully\n**DON''T**: Use rounded elements with thick colored border on one side—a lazy accent that almost never looks intentional\n**DON''T**: Use sparklines as decoration—tiny charts that look sophisticated but convey nothing meaningful\n**DON''T**: Use rounded rectangles with generic drop shadows—safe, forgettable, could be any AI output\n**DON''T**: Use modals unless there''s truly no better alternative—modals are lazy\n\n### Motion\n\n→ _Consult [motion reference](reference/motion-design.md) for timing, easing, and reduced motion._\n\nFocus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions.\n\n**DO**: Use motion to convey state changes—entrances, exits, feedback\n**DO**: Use exponential easing (ease-out-quart/quint/expo) for natural deceleration\n**DO**: For height animations, use grid-template-rows transitions instead of animating height directly\n**DON''T**: Animate layout properties (width, height, padding, margin)—use transform and opacity only\n**DON''T**: Use bounce or elastic easing—they feel dated and tacky; real objects decelerate smoothly\n\n### Interaction\n\n→ _Consult [interaction reference](reference/interaction-design.md) for forms, focus, and loading patterns._\n\nMake interactions feel fast. Use optimistic UI—update immediately, sync later.\n\n**DO**: Use progressive disclosure—start simple, reveal sophistication through interaction (basic options first, advanced behind expandable sections; hover states that reveal secondary actions)\n**DO**: Design empty states that teach the interface, not just say \"nothing here\"\n**DO**: Make every interactive surface feel intentional and responsive\n**DON''T**: Repeat the same information—redundant headers, intros that restate the heading\n**DON''T**: Make every button primary—use ghost buttons, text links, secondary styles; hierarchy matters\n\n### Responsive\n\n→ _Consult [responsive reference](reference/responsive-design.md) for mobile-first, fluid design, and container queries._\n\n**DO**: Use container queries (@container) for component-level responsiveness\n**DO**: Adapt the interface for different contexts—don''t just shrink it\n**DON''T**: Hide critical functionality on mobile—adapt the interface, don''t amputate it\n\n### UX Writing\n\n→ _Consult [ux-writing reference](reference/ux-writing.md) for labels, errors, and empty states._\n\n**DO**: Make every word earn its place\n**DON''T**: Repeat information users can already see\n\n---\n\n## The AI Slop Test\n\n**Critical quality check**: If you showed this interface to someone and said \"AI made this,\" would they believe you immediately? If yes, that''s the problem.\n\nA distinctive interface should make someone ask \"how was this made?\" not \"which AI made this?\"\n\nReview the DON''T guidelines above—they are the fingerprints of AI-generated work from 2024-2025.\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Principles\n\nMatch implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices across generations.\n\nRemember: the model is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back—show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:09:43.475Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX-focused Agents needing advanced frontend design capabilities with React 19 and TanStack Start.","zh":"非常适合需要高级前端设计能力的 UI/UX 集中型代理，支持 React 19 和 TanStack Start。","ja":"React 19 および TanStack Start を使用した高度なフロントエンド デザイン機能を必要とする UI/UX 重視エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 19 및 TanStack Start를 사용한 고급 프론트엔드 디자인 기능이 필요한 UI/UX 중심 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en UI/UX que necesitan capacidades de diseño avanzado de frontend con React 19 y TanStack Start.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''UI/UX ayant besoin de capacités de conception de frontend avancées avec React 19 et TanStack Start.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-orientierte Agenten, die erweiterte Frontend-Designfunktionen mit React 19 und TanStack Start benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI/UX que precisam de capacidades avançadas de design de frontend com React 19 e TanStack Start.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI/UX, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности дизайна frontend с React 19 и TanStack Start.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تصميم واجهة المستخدم المتقدمة مع React 19 و TanStack Start."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with exceptional attention to aesthetic details, utilizing PostgreSQL for data management and React 19 for component-driven design, all while avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics through bold design directions like brutally minimal or maximalist chaos.","zh":"赋予代理制作出独特的、生产级的前端界面，具有对美学细节的异常关注，利用 PostgreSQL 进行数据管理，利用 React 19 进行组件驱动的设计，同时通过大胆的设计方向避免通用的''AI slop''美学，如残酷极简或极度混乱。","ja":"PostgreSQL を使用したデータ管理と React 19 を使用したコンポーネント駆動のデザインにより、エージェントが独自の、生産性の高いフロントエンド インターフェイスを作成できるようにします。また、大胆なデザイン方向（例：無慈悲なミニマルやマキシマリストの混沌）を通じて、一般的な ''AI slop'' 美学を避けます。","ko":"PostgreSQL을 사용한 데이터 관리와 React 19를 사용한 컴포넌트 주도 디자인을 통해 에이전트가 독특한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 제작할 수 있도록 합니다. 또한 대담한 디자인 방향(예: 무자비한 최소주의 또는 최대주의 혼돈)을 통해 일반적인 ''AI slop'' 미학을 피합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces de frontend distintivas y de grado de producción con una atención excepcional a los detalles estéticos, utilizando PostgreSQL para la gestión de datos y React 19 para el diseño basado en componentes, todo mientras evita la estética genérica de ''suciedad de IA'' a través de direcciones de diseño audaces como minimalismo brutal o caos maximalista.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces de frontend distinctives et de grade de production avec une attention exceptionnelle aux détails esthétiques, en utilisant PostgreSQL pour la gestion des données et React 19 pour la conception basée sur les composants, le tout en évitant l''esthétique générique de ''slovie de l''IA'' à travers des directions de conception audacieuses comme le minimalisme brutal ou le chaos maximaliste.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, deutlich unterscheidbare, produktionsreife Frontend-Oberflächen mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details zu gestalten, wobei PostgreSQL für Datenverwaltung und React 19 für komponentenbasiertes Design verwendet werden, all dies, während die generische ''KI-Schlamperei''-Ästhetik durch kühne Designrichtungen wie brutalen Minimalismus oder maximalistischen Chaos vermieden wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces de frontend distintas e de classe de produção, com atenção excepcional aos detalhes estéticos, utilizando PostgreSQL para gerenciamento de dados e React 19 para design baseado em componentes, tudo isso evitando estéticas genéricas de ''slop de IA'' por meio de direções de design ousadas como minimalismo brutal ou caos maximalista.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отличительные, производственные интерфейсы frontend с исключительным вниманием к эстетическим деталям, используя PostgreSQL для управления данными и React 19 для компонентно-ориентированного дизайна, все это при избегании генерических ''сlop ИИ'' эстетики через смелые направления дизайна, такие как жесткий минимализм или максималистический хаос.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم قابلة للتخصيص وعالمية المستوى مع اهتمام استثنائي بالتفاصيل الجمالية، مستخدمين PostgreSQL لإدارة البيانات و React 19 لتصميم مكونات التوجيه، كل ذلك مع تجنب جماليات ''سلوك الذكاء الاصطناعي'' العامة من خلال اتجاهات التصميم الجريئة مثل التصميم المتطرف أو الفوضوي الأقصى."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing bespoke music streaming applications","Creating bold, maximalist UI components with React 19","Implementing retro-futuristic design themes with TanStack Start"],"zh":["为音乐流媒体应用设计定制界面","使用 React 19 创建大胆的最大化 UI 组件","使用 TanStack Start 实现复古未来主义设计主题"],"ja":["音楽ストリーミング アプリケーションのカスタム インターフェイスを設計する","React 19 を使用して大胆な最大化 UI コンポーネントを作成する","TanStack Start を使用してレトロ フューチャリスティック デザイン テーマを実装する"],"ko":["음악 스트리밍 애플리케이션을 위한 맞춤형 인터페이스 설계","React 19를 사용하여 대담한 최대화 UI 컴포넌트 생성","TanStack Start를 사용하여 레트로 퓨처리스틱 디자인 테마 구현"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones de streaming de música personalizadas","Crear componentes de UI atrevidos y maximalistas con React 19","Implementar temas de diseño retrofuturistas con TanStack Start"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications de streaming de musique sur mesure","Créer des composants d''UI audacieux et maximalistes avec React 19","Mettre en œuvre des thèmes de conception retro-futuristes avec TanStack Start"],"de":["Maßgeschneiderte Musik-Streaming-Anwendungen entwerfen","Kühne, maximalistische UI-Komponenten mit React 19 erstellen","Retro-futuristische Designtrends mit TanStack Start implementieren"],"pt":["Projetar aplicações de streaming de música personalizadas","Criar componentes de UI ousados e maximalistas com React 19","Implementar temas de design retrofuturistas com TanStack Start"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных приложений для потокового воспроизведения музыки","Создание смелых, максималистских компонентов UI с React 19","Реализация ретрофутуристических тем дизайна с TanStack Start"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات بث الموسيقى المخصصة","إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجريئة والفوضوية القصوى مع React 19","تنفيذ موضوعات تصميم مستقبلية قديمة مع TanStack Start"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React 19 and TanStack Start","PostgreSQL database setup necessary","Self-hosting environment needed"],"zh":["需要 React 19 和 TanStack Start","需要 PostgreSQL 数据库设置","需要自托管环境"],"ja":["React 19 および TanStack Start が必要","PostgreSQL データベースの設定が必要","セルフホスト環境が必要"],"ko":["React 19 및 TanStack Start가 필요","PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 설정이 필요","자체 호스팅 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere React 19 y TanStack Start","Configuración de base de datos PostgreSQL necesaria","Entorno de autoalojamiento necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite React 19 et TanStack Start","Configuration de base de données PostgreSQL nécessaire","Environnement d''autohébergement nécessaire"],"de":["React 19 und TanStack Start erforderlich","PostgreSQL-Datenbank-Setup erforderlich","Selbsthosting-Umgebung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer React 19 e TanStack Start","Configuração do banco de dados PostgreSQL necessária","Ambiente de auto-hospedagem necessário"],"ru":["Требуется React 19 и TanStack Start","Необходима настройка базы данных PostgreSQL","Требуется自охозяйственное окружение"],"ar":["يتطلب React 19 و TanStack Start","إعداد قاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL ضروري","بيئة استضافة خود ضرورية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
