s de auditoría y patrones de control de acceso","Identificación de operaciones privilegiadas y funciones restringidas por rol","Comprensión de las funciones que pueden modificar el contrato"],"fr":["Identification systématique des points d''entrée qui modifient l''état","Guide pour les audits de sécurité de contrats intelligents","Analyse des flux d''audit et des modèles de contrôle d''accès","Identification des opérations privilégiées et des fonctions restreintes par rôle","Compréhension des fonctions qui peuvent modifier le contrat"],"de":["Systematische Identifizierung von Einstiegspunkten, die den Zustand ändern","Leitfaden für Sicherheitsaudits von Smart Contracts","Analyse von Audit-Flüssen und Zugriffskontrollmustern","Identifizierung von privilegierten Operationen und rollenbeschränkten Funktionen","Verständnis der Funktionen, die den Vertrag ändern können"],"pt":["Identificação de pontos de entrada que alteram o estado","Mapeamento da superfície de ataque","Análise de fluxos de auditoria","Identificação de operações privilegiadas","Análise de padrões de controle de acesso"],"ru":["Определение точек входа, изменяющих состояние","Картографирование поверхности атаки","Анализ потоков аудита","Определение привилегированных операций","Анализ шаблонов контроля доступа"],"ar":["تحديد نقاط الدخول التي تتغير الحالة","خريطة سطح الهجوم","تحليل تدفقات التدقيق","تحديد العمليات المميزة","تحليل أنماط التحكم في الوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能合约安全审计","入口点分析","状态更改入口点","访问控制模式","特权操作","角色限制函数","合同状态修改函数"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトセキュリティ監査","エントリーポイント分析","状態変更エントリーポイント","アクセス制御パターン","特権操作","役割制限関数","契約状態変更関数"],"ko":["스마트 계약 보안 감사","엔트리 포인트 분석","상태 변경 엔트리 포인트","접근 제어 패턴","특권 연산","역할 제한 함수","계약 상태 변경 함수"],"es":["análisis de puntos de entrada","auditoría de seguridad","contratos inteligentes","control de acceso","seguridad de smart contracts","análisis de código"],"fr":["analyse de points d''entrée","audit de sécurité","contrats intelligents","contrôle d''accès","sécurité des smart contracts","analyse de code"],"de":["Einstiegspunkte-Analyse","Sicherheitsaudit","Smart Contracts","Zugriffskontrolle","Sicherheit von Smart Contracts","Code-Analyse"],"pt":["analisador de pontos de entrada","segurança de contrato inteligente","auditoria de contrato","pontos de entrada de estado","controle de acesso","operações privilegiadas"],"ru":["анализатор точек входа","безопасность смарт-контракта","аудит смарт-контракта","точки входа состояния","контроль доступа","привилегированные операции"],"ar":["محلل نقاط الدخول","أمان العقد الذكي","تدقيق العقد","نقاط الدخول الحالة","تحكم الوصول","عمليات المميزة"]}},"owner":"andrescardonas7","repo":"salchipapa-web","repoPath":"andrescardonas7/salchipapa-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"entry-point-analyzer","description":"Analyzes smart contract codebases to identify state-changing entry points for security auditing. Detects externally callable functions that modify state, categorizes them by access level (public, admin, role-restricted, contract-only), and generates structured audit reports. Excludes view/pure/read-only functions. Use when auditing smart contracts (Solidity, Vyper, Solana/Rust, Move, TON, CosmWasm) or when asked to find entry points, audit flows, external functions, access control patterns, or privileged operations.","bodyPreview":"# Entry Point Analyzer\n\nSystematically identify all **state-changing** entry points in a smart contract codebase to guide security audits.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Starting a smart contract security audit to map the attack surface\n- Asked to find entry points, external functions, or audit flows\n- Analyzing access control patterns across a codebase\n- Identifying privileged operations and role-restricted functions\n- Building an understanding of which functions can modify contract st","body":"# Entry Point Analyzer\n\nSystematically identify all **state-changing** entry points in a smart contract codebase to guide security audits.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Starting a smart contract security audit to map the attack surface\n- Asked to find entry points, external functions, or audit flows\n- Analyzing access control patterns across a codebase\n- Identifying privileged operations and role-restricted functions\n- Building an understanding of which functions can modify contract state\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\nDo NOT use this skill for:\n- Vulnerability detection (use audit-context-building or domain-specific-audits)\n- Writing exploit POCs (use solidity-poc-builder)\n- Code quality or gas optimization analysis\n- Non-smart-contract codebases\n- Analyzing read-only functions (this skill excludes them)\n\n## Scope: State-Changing Functions Only\n\nThis skill focuses exclusively on functions that can modify state. **Excluded:**\n\n| Language | Excluded Patterns |\n|----------|-------------------|\n| Solidity | `view`, `pure` functions |\n| Vyper | `@view`, `@pure` functions |\n| Solana | Functions without `mut` account references |\n| Move | Non-entry `public fun` (module-callable only) |\n| TON | `get` methods (FunC), read-only receivers (Tact) |\n| CosmWasm | `query` entry point and its handlers |\n\n**Why exclude read-only functions?** They cannot directly cause loss of funds or state corruption. While they may leak information, the primary audit focus is on functions that can change state.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Detect Language** - Identify contract language(s) from file extensions and syntax\n2. **Use Tooling (if available)** - For Solidity, check if Slither is available and use it\n3. **Locate Contracts** - Find all contract/module files (apply directory filter if specified)\n4. **Extract Entry Points** - Parse each file for externally callable, state-changing functions\n5. **Classify Access** - Categorize each function by access level\n6. **Generate Report** - Output structured markdown report\n\n## Slither Integration (Solidity)\n\nFor Solidity codebases, Slither can automatically extract entry points. Before manual analysis:\n\n### 1. Check if Slither is Available\n\n```bash\nwhich slither\n```\n\n### 2. If Slither is Detected, Run Entry Points Printer\n\n```bash\nslither . --print entry-points\n```\n\nThis outputs a table of all state-changing entry points with:\n- Contract name\n- Function name\n- Visibility\n- Modifiers applied\n\n### 3. Use Slither Output as Foundation\n\n- Parse the Slither output table to populate your analysis\n- Cross-reference with manual inspection for access control classification\n- Slither may miss some patterns (callbacks, dynamic access control)—supplement with manual review\n- If Slither fails (compilation errors, unsupported features), fall back to manual analysis\n\n### 4. When Slither is NOT Available\n\nIf `which slither` returns nothing, proceed with manual analysis using the language-specific reference files.\n\n## Language Detection\n\n| Extension | Language | Reference |\n|-----------|----------|-----------|\n| `.sol` | Solidity | [{baseDir}/references/solidity.md]({baseDir}/references/solidity.md) |\n| `.vy` | Vyper | [{baseDir}/references/vyper.md]({baseDir}/references/vyper.md) |\n| `.rs` + `Cargo.toml` with `solana-program` | Solana (Rust) | [{baseDir}/references/solana.md]({baseDir}/references/solana.md) |\n| `.move` | Move (Aptos/Sui) | [{baseDir}/references/move.md]({baseDir}/references/move.md) |\n| `.fc`, `.func`, `.tact` | TON (FunC/Tact) | [{baseDir}/references/ton.md]({baseDir}/references/ton.md) |\n| `.rs` + `Cargo.toml` with `cosmwasm-std` | CosmWasm | [{baseDir}/references/cosmwasm.md]({baseDir}/references/cosmwasm.md) |\n\nLoad the appropriate reference file(s) based on detected language before analysis.\n\n## Access Classification\n\nClassify each state-changing entry point into one of these categories:\n\n### 1. Public (Unrestricted)\nFunctions callable by anyone without restrictions.\n\n### 2. Role-Restricted\nFunctions limited to specific roles. Common patterns to detect:\n- Explicit role names: `admin`, `owner`, `governance`, `guardian`, `operator`, `manager`, `minter`, `pauser`, `keeper`, `relayer`, `lender`, `borrower`\n- Role-checking patterns: `onlyRole`, `hasRole`, `require(msg.sender == X)`, `assert_owner`, `#[access_control]`\n- When role is ambiguous, flag as **\"Restricted (review required)\"** with the restriction pattern noted\n\n### 3. Contract-Only (Internal Integration Points)\nFunctions callable only by other contracts, not by EOAs. Indicators:\n- Callbacks: `onERC721Received`, `uniswapV3SwapCallback`, `flashLoanCallback`\n- Interface implementations with contract-caller checks\n- Functions that revert if `tx.origin == msg.sender`\n- Cross-contract hooks\n\n## Output Format\n\nGenerate a markdown report with this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Entry Point Analysis: [Project Name]\n\n**Analyzed**: [timestamp]\n**Scope**: [directories analyzed or \"full codebase\"]\n**Languages**: [detected languages]\n**Focus**: State-changing functions only (view/pure excluded)\n\n## Summary\n\n| Category | Count |\n|----------|-------|\n| Public (Unrestricted) | X |\n| Role-Restricted | X |\n| Restricted (Review Required) | X |\n| Contract-Only | X |\n| **Total** | **X** |\n\n---\n\n## Public Entry Points (Unrestricted)\n\nState-changing functions callable by anyone—prioritize for attack surface analysis.\n\n| Function | File | Notes |\n|----------|------|-------|\n| `functionName(params)` | `path/to/file.sol:L42` | Brief note if relevant |\n\n---\n\n## Role-Restricted Entry Points\n\n### Admin / Owner\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n| `setFee(uint256)` | `Config.sol:L15` | `onlyOwner` |\n\n### Governance\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n\n### Guardian / Pauser\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n\n### Other Roles\n| Function | File | Restriction | Role |\n|----------|------|-------------|------|\n\n---\n\n## Restricted (Review Required)\n\nFunctions with access control patterns that need manual verification.\n\n| Function | File | Pattern | Why Review |\n|----------|------|---------|------------|\n| `execute(bytes)` | `Executor.sol:L88` | `require(trusted[msg.sender])` | Dynamic trust list |\n\n---\n\n## Contract-Only (Internal Integration Points)\n\nFunctions only callable by other contracts—useful for understanding trust boundaries.\n\n| Function | File | Expected Caller |\n|----------|------|-----------------|\n| `onFlashLoan(...)` | `Vault.sol:L200` | Flash loan provider |\n\n---\n\n## Files Analyzed\n\n- `path/to/file1.sol` (X state-changing entry points)\n- `path/to/file2.sol` (X state-changing entry points)\n```\n\n## Filtering\n\nWhen user specifies a directory filter:\n- Only analyze files within that path\n- Note the filter in the report header\n- Example: \"Analyze only `src/core/`\" → scope = `src/core/`\n\n## Analysis Guidelines\n\n1. **Be thorough**: Don''t skip files. Every state-changing externally callable function matters.\n2. **Be conservative**: When uncertain about access level, flag for review rather than miscategorize.\n3. **Skip read-only**: Exclude `view`, `pure`, and equivalent read-only functions.\n4. **Note inheritance**: If a function''s access control comes from a parent contract, note this.\n5. **Track modifiers**: List all access-related modifiers/decorators applied to each function.\n6. **Identify patterns**: Look for common patterns like:\n   - Initializer functions (often unrestricted on first call)\n   - Upgrade functions (high-privilege)\n   - Emergency/pause functions (guardian-level)\n   - Fee/parameter setters (admin-level)\n   - Token transfers and approvals (often public)\n\n## Common Role Patterns by Protocol Type\n\n| Protocol Type | Common Roles |\n|---------------|--------------|\n| DEX | `owner`, `feeManager`, `pairCreator` |\n| Lending | `admin`, `guardian`, `liquidator`, `oracle` |\n| Governance | `proposer`, `executor`, `canceller`, `timelock` |\n| NFT | `minter`, `admin`, `royaltyReceiver` |\n| Bridge | `relayer`, `guardian`, `validator`, `operator` |\n| Vault/Yield | `strategist`, `keeper`, `harvester`, `manager` |\n\n## Rationalizations to Reject\n\nWhen analyzing entry points, reject these shortcuts:\n- \"This function looks standard\" → Still classify it; standard functions can have non-standard access control\n- \"The modifier name is clear\" → Verify the modifier''s actual implementation\n- \"This is obviously admin-only\" → Trace the actual restriction; \"obvious\" assumptions miss subtle bypasses\n- \"I''ll skip the callbacks\" → Callbacks define trust boundaries; always include them\n- \"It doesn''t modify much state\" → Any state change can be exploited; include all non-view functions\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf a file cannot be parsed:\n1. Note it in the report under \"Analysis Warnings\"\n2. Continue with remaining files\n3. Suggest manual review for unparsable files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:11:15.615Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Smart Contract Analysis Agents needing advanced entry point identification and security audit capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级入口点识别和安全审计能力的智能合约分析代理。","ja":"高度なエントリーポイントの識別とセキュリティ監査機能が必要なスマートコントラクト分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 入口점 식별 및 보안 감사 기능이 필요한 스마트 계약 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de contratos inteligentes que necesitan una identificación avanzada de puntos de entrada y capacidades de auditoría de seguridad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de contrats intelligents nécessitant une identification avancée des points d''entrée et des capacités d''audit de sécurité.","de":"Perfekt für Smart-Contract-Analyse-Agents, die eine erweiterte Eingabepunkterkennung und Sicherheitsauditfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Contrato Inteligente que necessitam de identificação avançada de pontos de entrada e capacidades de auditoria de segurança.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа умных контрактов, которым необходима продвинутая идентификация точек входа и возможности аудита безопасности.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل العقد الذكية التي تحتاج إلى تحديد متقدم لنقاط الدخول وقدرات التدقيق الأمني."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically identify state-changing entry points in smart contract codebases, guiding security audits with access control pattern analysis and privileged operation identification using protocols like Solidity.","zh":"赋予代理系统地识别智能合约代码库中的状态更改入口点的能力，使用类似Solidity的协议指导安全审计，进行访问控制模式分析和特权操作识别。","ja":"エージェントにスマートコントラクトのコードベース内の状態を変更するエントリーポイントを体系的に識別する機能を付与し、Solidityなどのプロトコルを使用してアクセス制御パターンの分析と特権操作の識別によるセキュリティ監査を導きます。","ko":"에이전트가 스마트 계약 코드베이스 내의 상태 변경 엔트리 포인트를 체계적으로 식별할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Solidity와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 보안 감사를 안내하고, 접근 제어 패턴 분석 및 특권 연산 식별을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar sistemáticamente los puntos de entrada que cambian el estado en los codebases de contratos inteligentes, guiando las auditorías de seguridad con análisis de patrones de control de acceso e identificación de operaciones privilegiadas utilizando protocolos como Solidity.","fr":"Autorise les agents à identifier systématiquement les points d''entrée qui modifient l''état dans les bases de code de contrats intelligents, en guidant les audits de sécurité avec une analyse de modèles de contrôle d''accès et une identification d''opérations privilégiées en utilisant des protocoles comme Solidity.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, systematisch state-changing-Eingabepunkte in Smart-Contract-Codebasen zu identifizieren, indem sie Sicherheitsaudits mit Zugriffskontrollmusteranalyse und Identifizierung privilegierter Operationen mithilfe von Protokollen wie Solidity leiten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar sistematicamente os pontos de entrada que alteram o estado no código da base de contratos inteligentes, orientando auditorias de segurança com análise de padrões de controle de acesso e identificação de operações privilegiadas usando protocolos como Solidity.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически выявлять точки входа, меняющие состояние, в коде баз умных контрактов, направляя аудиты безопасности с помощью анализа шаблонов контроля доступа и определения привилегированных операций с использованием протоколов, таких как Solidity.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحديد نقاط الدخول التي تغير الحالة في قواعد بيانات العقود الذكية بطريقة منهجية، وتوجيه التدقيق الأمني باستخدام تحليل أنماط التحكم في الوصول وتحديد العمليات المميزة باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Solidity."},"useCases":{"en":["Identifying external functions and audit flows in smart contracts","Analyzing access control patterns across a codebase","Mapping the attack surface for smart contract security audits","Detecting privileged operations and role-restricted functions"],"zh":["识别智能合约中的外部函数和审计流程","分析代码库中的访问控制模式","为智能合约安全审计绘制攻击面","检测特权操作和角色限制函数"],"ja":["スマートコントラクト内の外部関数と監査フローを識別する","コードベース横断的なアクセス制御パターンを分析する","スマートコントラクトのセキュリティ監査のための攻撃面をマッピングする","特権操作とロール制限関数を検出する"],"ko":["스마트 계약 내의 외부 함수 및 감사 흐름 식별","코드베이스 전반의 접근 제어 패턴 분석","스마트 계약 보안 감사를 위한 공격 표면 매핑","특권 연산 및 역할 제한 함수 감지"],"es":["Identificar funciones externas y flujos de auditoría en contratos inteligentes","Analizar patrones de control de acceso en una base de código","Asignar la superficie de ataque para auditorías de seguridad de contratos inteligentes","Detectar operaciones privilegiadas y funciones restringidas por roles"],"fr":["Identifier les fonctions externes et les flux d''audit dans les contrats intelligents","Analyser les modèles de contrôle d''accès dans une base de code","Cartographier la surface d''attaque pour les audits de sécurité des contrats intelligents","Détecter les opérations privilégiées et les fonctions restreintes par rôles"],"de":["Identifizieren externer Funktionen und Audit-Flüsse in Smart-Contracts","Analyse von Zugriffskontrollmustern in einem Codebase","Zuordnen der Angriffsfläche für Smart-Contract-Sicherheitsaudits","Erkennen privilegierter Operationen und rollenbeschränkter Funktionen"],"pt":["Identificar funções externas e fluxos de auditoria em contratos inteligentes","Analizar padrões de controle de acesso em toda a base de código","Mapear a superfície de ataque para auditorias de segurança de contratos inteligentes","Detectar operações privilegiadas e funções restritas por papéis"],"ru":["Определение внешних функций и потоков аудита в умных контрактах","Анализ шаблонов контроля доступа по всей базе кода","Отображение поверхности атаки для аудитов безопасности умных контрактов","Обнаружение привилегированных операций и функций, ограниченных по ролям"],"ar":["تحديد الدوال الخارجية وتدفقات التدقيق في العقود الذكية","تحليل أنماط التحكم في الوصول في جميع قاعدة الشفرة","تمثيل سطح الهجوم للتدقيق الأمني للعقود الذكية","اكتشاف العمليات المميزة والدوال المقيدة بالدور"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires smart contract codebase access","Limited to state-changing entry points","Solidity protocol understanding necessary"],"zh":["需要智能合约代码库的访问权限","仅限于状态更改入口点","需要Solidity协议的理解"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトのコードベースへのアクセスが必要","状態を変更するエントリーポイントにのみ適用","Solidityプロトコルの理解が必要"],"ko":["스마트 계약 코드베이스 액세스가 필요합니다.","상태를 변경하는 엔트리 포인트에만 적용됩니다.","Solidity 프로토콜에 대한 이해가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código del contrato inteligente","Limitado a puntos de entrada que cambian el estado","Conocimiento del protocolo Solidity necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code du contrat intelligent","Limité aux points d''entrée qui modifient l''état","Compréhension du protocole Solidity nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebase des Smart-Contracts","Begrenzt auf state-changing-Eingabepunkte","Verständnis des Solidity-Protokolls erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código do contrato inteligente","Limitado a pontos de entrada que alteram o estado","Entendimento do protocolo Solidity necessário"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к базе кода умного контракта","Ограничен до точек входа, меняющих состояние","Необходимо понимание протокола Solidity"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات العقد الذكية","محدود بنقاط الدخول التي تغير الحالة","يجب فهم بروتوكول Solidity"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
