 desarrollo. Analiza y soluciona problemas de...","fr":"Améliorez les performances de construction Gradle pour réduire les temps de compilation et accélérer le développement. Analysez et résolvez les problèmes de ...","de":"Optimieren Sie die Build-Leistung von Gradle, um Build-Zeiten zu reduzieren und die Entwicklungseffizienz zu verbessern. Analysieren und beheben Sie Build-Le...","pt":"Otimize o desempenho de build do Gradle para reduzir os tempos de compilação e melhorar a eficiência do seu pipeline de CI/CD","ru":"Оптимизируйте производительность сборки Gradle, чтобы сократить время компиляции и улучшить эффективность вашего конвейера CI/CD","ar":"احسن أداء بناء جرادي لتقليل وقت الترجمة وتحسين كفاءة خط أنابيب CI/CD","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Gradle","CI/CD","Gradle","kapt/KSP","Gradle"],"ja":["Gradle","CI/CD","Gradle","kapt/KSP","Gradle"],"ko":["Gradle","CI/CD","Gradle","kapt/KSP","Gradle"],"es":["Análisis de tiempos de compilación","Optimización de la configuración de Gradle","Reduciendo la recompilación innecesaria","Depuración de procesamiento de anotaciones","Mejora de la eficiencia del desarrollo"],"fr":["Analyse des temps de construction","Optimisation de la configuration Gradle","Réduction de la recompilation injustifiée","Débogage du traitement des annotations","Amélioration de l''efficacité du développement"],"de":["Analyse der Build-Zeiten","Optimierung der Gradle-Konfiguration","Reduzierung der unnötigen Neukompilierung","Fehlerbehebung bei der Annotationenverarbeitung","Verbesserung der Entwicklungseffizienz"],"pt":["Análise de build scans","Otimização de tempos de compilação","Ativação do cache de configuração do Gradle","Redução de recompilação desnecessária","Depuração de processamento de anotações kapt/KSP"],"ru":["Анализ сборочных сканов","Оптимизация времени компиляции","Включение кэша конфигурации Gradle","Сокращение ненужной перекомпиляции","Отладка обработки аннотаций kapt/KSP"],"ar":["تحليل مسح البناء","تحسين وقت الترجمة","تمكين ذاكرة التخزين المؤقتة لتكوين جرادي","تقليل إعادة الترجمة غير الضرورية","تصحيح خطأ معالجة التعليقات kapt/KSP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Gradle","Gradle","CI/CD","Gradle","kapt/KSP","Gradle"],"ja":["Gradle","Gradle","CI/CD","Gradle","kapt/KSP","Gradle"],"ko":["Gradle","Gradle","CI/CD","Gradle","kapt/KSP","Gradle"],"es":["Gradle","optimización de rendimiento","tiempos de compilación","desarrollo de software","eficiencia del desarrollo","análisis de build","configuración de Gradle"],"fr":["Gradle","amélioration des performances","temps de construction","développement de logiciels","efficacité du développement","analyse de construction","configuration Gradle"],"de":["Gradle","Leistungsverbesserung","Build-Zeiten","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungseffizienz","Build-Analyse","Gradle-Konfiguration"],"pt":["otimização de build gradle","desempenho de compilação","ci/cd","gradle build scan","cache de configuração","recompilação"],"ru":["оптимизация сборки gradle","производительность компиляции","ci/cd","gradle build scan","кэш конфигурации","перекомпиляция"],"ar":["تحسين بناء جرادي","أداء الترجمة","ci/cd","مسح بناء جرادي","ذاكرة التخزين المؤقتة للتكوين","إعادة الترجمة"]}},"owner":"sahuadarsh0","repo":"Wallet","repoPath":"sahuadarsh0/Wallet","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gradle-build-performance","description":"Debug and optimize Android/Gradle build performance. Use when builds are slow, investigating CI/CD performance, analyzing build scans, or identifying compilation bottlenecks.","bodyPreview":"# Gradle Build Performance\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Build times are slow (clean or incremental)\n- Investigating build performance regressions\n- Analyzing Gradle Build Scans\n- Identifying configuration vs execution bottlenecks\n- Optimizing CI/CD build times\n- Enabling Gradle Configuration Cache\n- Reducing unnecessary recompilation\n- Debugging kapt/KSP annotation processing\n\n## Example Prompts\n\n- \"My builds are slow, how can I speed them up?\"\n- \"How do I analyze a Gradle build scan?\"\n- \"Why is configura","body":"# Gradle Build Performance\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Build times are slow (clean or incremental)\n- Investigating build performance regressions\n- Analyzing Gradle Build Scans\n- Identifying configuration vs execution bottlenecks\n- Optimizing CI/CD build times\n- Enabling Gradle Configuration Cache\n- Reducing unnecessary recompilation\n- Debugging kapt/KSP annotation processing\n\n## Example Prompts\n\n- \"My builds are slow, how can I speed them up?\"\n- \"How do I analyze a Gradle build scan?\"\n- \"Why is configuration taking so long?\"\n- \"Why does my project always recompile everything?\"\n- \"How do I enable configuration cache?\"\n- \"Why is kapt so slow?\"\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Measure Baseline** — Clean build + incremental build times\n2. **Generate Build Scan** — `./gradlew assembleDebug --scan`\n3. **Identify Phase** — Configuration? Execution? Dependency resolution?\n4. **Apply ONE optimization** — Don''t batch changes\n5. **Measure Improvement** — Compare against baseline\n6. **Verify in Build Scan** — Visual confirmation\n\n---\n\n## Quick Diagnostics\n\n### Generate Build Scan\n\n```bash\n./gradlew assembleDebug --scan\n```\n\n### Profile Build Locally\n\n```bash\n./gradlew assembleDebug --profile\n# Opens report in build/reports/profile/\n```\n\n### Build Timing Summary\n\n```bash\n./gradlew assembleDebug --info | grep -E \"^\\:.*\"\n# Or view in Android Studio: Build > Analyze APK Build\n```\n\n---\n\n## Build Phases\n\n| Phase | What Happens | Common Issues |\n|-------|--------------|---------------|\n| **Initialization** | `settings.gradle.kts` evaluated | Too many `include()` statements |\n| **Configuration** | All `build.gradle.kts` files evaluated | Expensive plugins, eager task creation |\n| **Execution** | Tasks run based on inputs/outputs | Cache misses, non-incremental tasks |\n\n### Identify the Bottleneck\n\n```\nBuild scan → Performance → Build timeline\n```\n\n- **Long configuration phase**: Focus on plugin and buildscript optimization\n- **Long execution phase**: Focus on task caching and parallelization\n- **Dependency resolution slow**: Focus on repository configuration\n\n---\n\n## 12 Optimization Patterns\n\n### 1. Enable Configuration Cache\n\nCaches configuration phase across builds (AGP 8.0+):\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.configuration-cache=true\norg.gradle.configuration-cache.problems=warn\n```\n\n### 2. Enable Build Cache\n\nReuses task outputs across builds and machines:\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.caching=true\n```\n\n### 3. Enable Parallel Execution\n\nBuild independent modules simultaneously:\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.parallel=true\n```\n\n### 4. Increase JVM Heap\n\nAllocate more memory for large projects:\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.jvmargs=-Xmx4g -XX:+UseParallelGC\n```\n\n### 5. Use Non-Transitive R Classes\n\nReduces R class size and compilation (AGP 8.0+ default):\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\nandroid.nonTransitiveRClass=true\n```\n\n### 6. Migrate kapt to KSP\n\nKSP is 2x faster than kapt for Kotlin:\n\n```kotlin\n// Before (slow)\nkapt(\"com.google.dagger:hilt-compiler:2.51.1\")\n\n// After (fast)\nksp(\"com.google.dagger:hilt-compiler:2.51.1\")\n```\n\n### 7. Avoid Dynamic Dependencies\n\nPin dependency versions:\n\n```kotlin\n// BAD: Forces resolution every build\nimplementation(\"com.example:lib:+\")\nimplementation(\"com.example:lib:1.0.+\")\n\n// GOOD: Fixed version\nimplementation(\"com.example:lib:1.2.3\")\n```\n\n### 8. Optimize Repository Order\n\nPut most-used repositories first:\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\ndependencyResolutionManagement {\n    repositories {\n        google()      // First: Android dependencies\n        mavenCentral() // Second: Most libraries\n        // Third-party repos last\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 9. Use includeBuild for Local Modules\n\nComposite builds are faster than `project()` for large monorepos:\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\nincludeBuild(\"shared-library\") {\n    dependencySubstitution {\n        substitute(module(\"com.example:shared\")).using(project(\":\"))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 10. Enable Incremental Annotation Processing\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\nkapt.incremental.apt=true\nkapt.use.worker.api=true\n```\n\n### 11. Avoid Configuration-Time I/O\n\nDon''t read files or make network calls during configuration:\n\n```kotlin\n// BAD: Runs during configuration\nval version = file(\"version.txt\").readText()\n\n// GOOD: Defer to execution\nval version = providers.fileContents(file(\"version.txt\")).asText\n```\n\n### 12. Use Lazy Task Configuration\n\nAvoid `create()`, use `register()`:\n\n```kotlin\n// BAD: Eagerly configured\ntasks.create(\"myTask\") { ... }\n\n// GOOD: Lazily configured\ntasks.register(\"myTask\") { ... }\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Bottleneck Analysis\n\n### Slow Configuration Phase\n\n**Symptoms**: Build scan shows long \"Configuring build\" time\n\n**Causes & Fixes**:\n| Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Eager task creation | Use `tasks.register()` instead of `tasks.create()` |\n| buildSrc with many dependencies | Migrate to Convention Plugins with `includeBuild` |\n| File I/O in build scripts | Use `providers.fileContents()` |\n| Network calls in plugins | Cache results or use offline mode |\n\n### Slow Compilation\n\n**Symptoms**: `:app:compileDebugKotlin` takes too long\n\n**Causes & Fixes**:\n| Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Non-incremental changes | Avoid `build.gradle.kts` changes that invalidate cache |\n| Large modules | Break into smaller feature modules |\n| Excessive kapt usage | Migrate to KSP |\n| Kotlin compiler memory | Increase `kotlin.daemon.jvmargs` |\n\n### Cache Misses\n\n**Symptoms**: Tasks always rerun despite no changes\n\n**Causes & Fixes**:\n| Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Unstable task inputs | Use `@PathSensitive`, `@NormalizeLineEndings` |\n| Absolute paths in outputs | Use relative paths |\n| Missing `@CacheableTask` | Add annotation to custom tasks |\n| Different JDK versions | Standardize JDK across environments |\n\n---\n\n## CI/CD Optimizations\n\n### Remote Build Cache\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\nbuildCache {\n    local { isEnabled = true }\n    remote<HttpBuildCache> {\n        url = uri(\"https://cache.example.com/\")\n        isPush = System.getenv(\"CI\") == \"true\"\n        credentials {\n            username = System.getenv(\"CACHE_USER\")\n            password = System.getenv(\"CACHE_PASS\")\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Gradle Enterprise / Develocity\n\nFor advanced build analytics:\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\nplugins {\n    id(\"com.gradle.develocity\") version \"3.17\"\n}\n\ndevelocity {\n    buildScan {\n        termsOfUseUrl.set(\"https://gradle.com/help/legal-terms-of-use\")\n        termsOfUseAgree.set(\"yes\")\n        publishing.onlyIf { System.getenv(\"CI\") != null }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Skip Unnecessary Tasks in CI\n\n```bash\n# Skip tests for UI-only changes\n./gradlew assembleDebug -x test -x lint\n\n# Only run affected module tests\n./gradlew :feature:login:test\n```\n\n---\n\n## Android Studio Settings\n\n### File → Settings → Build → Gradle\n\n- **Gradle JDK**: Match your project''s JDK\n- **Build and run using**: Gradle (not IntelliJ)\n- **Run tests using**: Gradle\n\n### File → Settings → Build → Compiler\n\n- **Compile independent modules in parallel**: ✅ Enabled\n- **Configure on demand**: ❌ Disabled (deprecated)\n\n---\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nAfter optimizations, verify:\n\n- [ ] Configuration cache enabled and working\n- [ ] Build cache hit rate > 80% (check build scan)\n- [ ] No dynamic dependency versions\n- [ ] KSP used instead of kapt where possible\n- [ ] Parallel execution enabled\n- [ ] JVM memory tuned appropriately\n- [ ] CI remote cache configured\n- [ ] No configuration-time I/O\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [Optimize Build Speed](https://developer.android.com/build/optimize-your-build)\n- [Gradle Configuration Cache](https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/configuration_cache.html)\n- [Gradle Build Cache](https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/build_cache.html)\n- [Migrate from kapt to KSP](https://developer.android.com/build/migrate-to-ksp)\n- [Gradle Build Scans](https://scans.gradle.com/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:12:07.892Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing to optimize Gradle build performance and analyze build scans.","zh":"非常适合需要优化Gradle构建性能和分析构建扫描的开发代理。","ja":"Gradleのビルド性能を最適化し、ビルドスキャンを分析する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Gradle 빌드 성능을 최적화하고 빌드 스캔을 분석해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan optimizar el rendimiento de la compilación de Gradle y analizar análisis de compilación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''optimiser les performances de construction de Gradle et d''analyser les analyses de construction.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die die Build-Leistung von Gradle optimieren und Build-Scans analysieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam otimizar o desempenho da compilação do Gradle e analisar varreduras de compilação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходимо оптимизировать производительность сборки Gradle и анализировать сканирование сборки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين أداء بناء Gradle وتحليل مسح البناء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify configuration vs execution bottlenecks, enable Gradle Configuration Cache, and reduce unnecessary recompilation, leveraging Gradle Build Scans for data-driven optimization.","zh":"赋予代理识别配置与执行瓶颈、启用Gradle配置缓存、减少不必要的重新编译的能力，利用Gradle构建扫描进行数据驱动的优化。","ja":"エージェントが構成と実行のボトルネックを識別し、Gradle構成キャッシュを有効にし、不要な再コンパイルを減らすことができるようにし、Gradleビルドスキャンを使用してデータ駆動の最適化を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 구성과 실행의 병목 현상을 식별하고 Gradle 구성 캐시를 활성화하며 불필요한 재컴파일을 줄이는 기능을 제공하며 Gradle 빌드 스캔을 사용하여 데이터 주도 최적화를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar cuellos de botella de configuración frente a cuellos de botella de ejecución, habilitar la caché de configuración de Gradle y reducir la recompilación innecesaria, aprovechando las análisis de compilación de Gradle para la optimización basada en datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les goulots d''étranglement de configuration par rapport aux goulots d''étranglement d''exécution, d''activer le cache de configuration de Gradle et de réduire la recompilation inutile, en exploitant les analyses de construction de Gradle pour l''optimisation basée sur les données.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, Konfigurations- gegen Ausführungsengpässe zu identifizieren, den Gradle-Konfigurationscache zu aktivieren und unnötige Neukompilierungen zu reduzieren, indem die Gradle-Build-Scans für die datengetriebene Optimierung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar gargalos de configuração versus execução, habilitar o Cache de Configuração do Gradle e reduzir a recompilação desnecessária, utilizando os Scans de Compilação do Gradle para otimização baseada em dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы конфигурации и выполнения, включать кэш конфигурации Gradle и сокращать ненужную перекомпиляцию, используя сканирование сборки Gradle для оптимизации на основе данных.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحديد معوقات التكوين مقابل معوقات التنفيذ، وتفعيل ذاكرة التخزين المؤقتة لتكوين Gradle، وتقليل إعادة الترجمة غير الضرورية، واستخدام فحوصات بناء Gradle لتحسين البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing Gradle build scans to pinpoint performance regressions","Debugging kapt/KSP annotation processing issues","Optimizing CI/CD build times by configuring Gradle for maximum efficiency"],"zh":["分析Gradle构建扫描以确定性能回归","调试kapt/KSP注解处理问题","通过为Gradle配置最大效率来优化CI/CD构建时间"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの低下を特定するためにGradleビルドスキャンを分析する","kapt/KSPアノテーション処理の問題をデバッグする","Gradleを最大効率で構成してCI/CDビルド時間を最適化する"],"ko":["성능 회귀를 식별하기 위해 Gradle 빌드 스캔을 분석합니다","kapt/KSP 어노테이션 처리 문제를 디버깅합니다","Gradle을 최대 효율로 구성하여 CI/CD 빌드 시간을 최적화합니다"],"es":["Analizar análisis de compilación de Gradle para detectar regresiones de rendimiento","Depurar problemas de procesamiento de anotaciones kapt/KSP","Optimizar los tiempos de compilación de CI/CD configurando Gradle para la máxima eficiencia"],"fr":["Analyser les analyses de construction de Gradle pour identifier les régressions de performances","Déboguer les problèmes de traitement d''annotations kapt/KSP","Optimiser les temps de construction de CI/CD en configurant Gradle pour une efficacité maximale"],"de":["Gradle-Build-Scans analysieren, um Leistungsregressionen zu identifizieren","Probleme bei der Verarbeitung von kapt/KSP-Anotierungen debuggen","CI/CD-Build-Zeiten optimieren, indem Gradle für die maximale Effizienz konfiguriert wird"],"pt":["Analisar varreduras de compilação do Gradle para identificar regressões de desempenho","Depurar problemas de processamento de anotações kapt/KSP","Otimizar tempos de compilação de CI/CD configurando o Gradle para eficiência máxima"],"ru":["Анализировать сканирование сборки Gradle для выявления регрессий производительности","Отлаживать проблемы обработки аннотаций kapt/KSP","Оптимизировать время сборки CI/CD, конфигурируя Gradle для максимальной эффективности"],"ar":["تحليل مسح البناء من Gradle للكشف عن انحدارات الأداء","تصحيح مشاكل معالجة التعليقات kapt/KSP","تحسين أوقات بناء CI/CD عن طريق تكوين Gradle لتحقيق أقصى كفاءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Gradle build environment","Limited to analyzing Gradle-based projects","May require additional setup for kapt/KSP annotation processing"],"zh":["需要Gradle构建环境","仅限于分析基于Gradle的项目","可能需要额外的设置来处理kapt/KSP注解"],"ja":["Gradleビルド環境が必要","Gradleベースのプロジェクトの分析のみ","kapt/KSPアノテーション処理には追加の設定が必要になる場合があります"],"ko":["Gradle 빌드 환경이 필요합니다","Gradle 기반 프로젝트의 분석만 가능합니다","kapt/KSP 어노테이션 처리에는 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de compilación de Gradle","Limitado al análisis de proyectos basados en Gradle","Puede requerir una configuración adicional para el procesamiento de anotaciones kapt/KSP"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de construction de Gradle","Limité à l''analyse de projets basés sur Gradle","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour le traitement d''annotations kapt/KSP"],"de":["Benötigt eine Gradle-Build-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Gradle-basierten Projekten","Kann eine zusätzliche Einrichtung für die Verarbeitung von kapt/KSP-Anotierungen erfordern"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de compilação do Gradle","Limitado à análise de projetos baseados no Gradle","Pode requerer configuração adicional para processamento de anotações kapt/KSP"],"ru":["Требуется среда сборки Gradle","Ограничен анализом проектов на основе Gradle","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для обработки аннотаций kapt/KSP"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بناء Gradle","محدود بتحليل المشاريع المستندة إلى Gradle","يمكن أن يتطلب إعدادًا إضافيًا لمعالجة التعليقات kapt/KSP"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
