e de edição para formulários existentes","Uso do enum FormMode para gerenciar modos de formulário","Adição de props à interface do componente de formulário","Suporte a criação e edição de formulários","Uso de tipos serializados de entidades para validação de dados"],"ru":["Реализация функции редактирования для существующих форм","Использование перечисления FormMode для управления режимами формы","Добавление свойств в интерфейс компонента формы","Поддержка создания и редактирования форм","Использование сериализованных типов сущностей для проверки данных"],"ar":["تنفيذ وظيفة التحرير لأنماط موجودة","استخدام تعداد FormMode لإدارة أوضاع النموذج","إضافة خصائص إلى واجهة مكون النموذج","دعم إنشاء وتحرير النماذج","استخدام أنواع الكيانات الممسوحة ضوئيًا للتحقق من البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Sima 表单","编辑模式","FormMode","表单创建","表单编辑","开发指南"],"ja":["Sima フォーム","編集モード","FormMode","フォーム作成","フォーム編集","開発ガイド"],"ko":["Sima 폼","편집 모드","FormMode","폼 생성","폼 편집","개발 가이드"],"es":["modo edición de formulario","Sima Board","FormMode","formulario react","edición de formulario","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["mode édition de formulaire","Sima Board","FormMode","formulaire react","édition de formulaire","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Formular-Editiermodus","Sima-Board","FormMode","React-Formular","Formularbearbeitung","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["modo de edição de formulário","Sima Board","FormMode","componente de formulário","desenvolvimento de software","edição de formulários","criação de formulários","validação de dados"],"ru":["режим редактирования формы","Sima Board","FormMode","компонент формы","разработка программного обеспечения","редактирование форм","создание форм","проверка данных"],"ar":["وضع تحرير النموذج","لوحة سيما","FormMode","مكون النموذج","تنمية البرمجيات","تحرير النماذج","إنشاء النماذج","التحقق من البيانات"]}},"owner":"RosenGray","repo":"sima","repoPath":"RosenGray/sima","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sima-form-edit-mode","description":"Form edit mode implementation guidelines","bodyPreview":"# Form Edit Mode Guidelines\n\n## Overview\n\nForms should support both create and edit modes using the `FormMode` enum. This guide covers implementing edit functionality for existing forms.\n\n## Component Props\n\n- Add props interface to form component:\n ```typescript\n interface FormNameProps {\n   entity?: SerializedEntity; // e.g., SerializedCar, SerializedProfessionalService\n   formMode: FormMode;\n }\n ```\n- Import `FormMode` from `@/components/Form/types/form.types`\n- Import serialized entity type","body":"# Form Edit Mode Guidelines\n\n## Overview\n\nForms should support both create and edit modes using the `FormMode` enum. This guide covers implementing edit functionality for existing forms.\n\n## Component Props\n\n- Add props interface to form component:\n ```typescript\n interface FormNameProps {\n   entity?: SerializedEntity; // e.g., SerializedCar, SerializedProfessionalService\n   formMode: FormMode;\n }\n ```\n- Import `FormMode` from `@/components/Form/types/form.types`\n- Import serialized entity type from appropriate types file (e.g., `SerializedCar` from `@/lib/vehicles/cars/types/cars.types`)\n- Component signature: `const FormName: FC<FormNameProps> = ({ entity, formMode }) => { ... }`\n\n## Form Mode Detection\n\n- Add mode check at the start of component:\n ```typescript\n const isCreateMode = formMode === FormMode.Create;\n ```\n- Use `isCreateMode` to conditionally render UI elements, change button text, or adjust validation\n\n## Required Imports for Edit Mode\n\n- `FormMode` from `@/components/Form/types/form.types`\n- `SerializedEntity` type from appropriate types file\n- `ExistingImageItem` from `@/lib/files/uploadFiles`\n- Edit action function (e.g., `editCarAd` from `@/lib/vehicles/cars/actions/editCarAd`)\n\n## Existing Images State Management\n\n- Initialize `existingImages` state from entity data:\n ```typescript\n const [existingImages, setExistingImages] = useState<ExistingImageItem[]>(\n   () => {\n     return (\n       entity?.images.map((image) => ({\n         ...image,\n         isExisting: true,\n         toBeDeleted: false,\n       })) || []\n     );\n   }\n );\n ```\n- Track images marked for deletion:\n ```typescript\n const imagesToDelete = useMemo(() => {\n   return existingImages.filter((image) => image.toBeDeleted);\n }, [existingImages]);\n ```\n- Check if all images are being deleted:\n ```typescript\n const allImagesShouldBeDeleted =\n   imagesToDelete.length === existingImages.length;\n ```\n\n## Action Binding for Edit Mode\n\n- Bind edit action with context for edit mode:\n ```typescript\n const updateEntityWithImagesToDelete = editEntityAd.bind(null, {\n   entityPublicId: entity?.publicId as string,\n   imagesToDelete,\n   allImagesShouldBeDeleted,\n });\n ```\n- Conditionally use create or edit action:\n ```typescript\n const [formState, formAction, isPending] = useActionState(\n   isCreateMode ? publishEntityAd : updateEntityWithImagesToDelete,\n   undefined\n );\n ```\n\n## Form Default Values for Edit Mode\n\n- Populate `defaultValue` object from entity data when in edit mode:\n ```typescript\n const [form, fields] = useForm({\n   defaultValue: {\n     // String fields\n     fieldName: entity?.fieldName || \"\",\n     \n     // Number fields - convert to string for form inputs\n     numericField: entity?.numericField?.toString() || \"\",\n     \n     // Price fields - convert to string (PriceFormField will format with commas)\n     price: entity?.price?.toString() || \"\",\n     \n     // Enum fields\n     enumField: entity?.enumField || \"\",\n     \n     // Optional fields with defaults\n     optionalField: entity?.optionalField || \"\",\n     \n     // Checkbox fields\n     acceptTerms: entity?.acceptTerms ? \"on\" : null,\n     \n     // Arrays\n     images: [],\n   },\n   // ... rest of form config\n });\n ```\n- Always provide fallback values (empty strings, null, empty arrays)\n- Convert numbers to strings for form inputs (they''ll be converted back by schema)\n- For checkboxes, use `\"on\"` if entity value is true, `null` if false/undefined\n\n## Image Handling in Edit Mode\n\n- Update `DropFilesInput` to account for existing images:\n ```typescript\n <DropFilesInput\n   // ... other props\n   existingFilesLength={\n     existingImages.filter((image) => !image.toBeDeleted).length\n   }\n />\n ```\n- Update `ImagesPreviewer` to handle existing images:\n ```typescript\n {(existingImages.length > 0 || selectedFiles.length > 0) && (\n   <Box>\n     <ImagesPreviewer\n       existingImages={existingImages}\n       images={selectedFiles}\n       setImages={setSelectedFiles}\n       setExistingImages={setExistingImages}\n       maxImages={MAX_FILES}\n     />\n   </Box>\n )}\n ```\n- Show preview when there are existing images OR new selected files\n\n## Validation Schema Adjustments\n\n- Adjust `minNumberOfImages` based on deletion state:\n ```typescript\n return parseWithZod(updatedFormData, {\n   schema: createEntitySchema({\n     minNumberOfImages: allImagesShouldBeDeleted ? 1 : 0,\n   }),\n });\n ```\n- In edit mode, if all existing images are deleted, require at least 1 new image\n- If some images remain, allow 0 new images (images are optional)\n\n## Submit Button Text\n\n- Conditionally set button text based on mode:\n ```typescript\n <SubmitButton\n   pending={isPending}\n   disabled={acceptTerms.value !== \"on\"}\n   text={isCreateMode ? \"Добавить объявление\" : \"Сохранить изменения\"}\n />\n ```\n\n## Page Component Updates\n\n### Create Page\n\n- Pass `formMode={FormMode.Create}` to form component:\n ```typescript\n <FormName formMode={FormMode.Create} />\n ```\n\n### Edit Page\n\n- Fetch entity data using repository:\n ```typescript\n const entity = await entityRepository.getByPublicId(id);\n if (!entity) return notFound();\n ```\n- Verify ownership:\n ```typescript\n const isOwner = await thisUserIsOwner(entity.user.id);\n if (!isOwner) return notFound();\n ```\n- Pass entity and formMode to form:\n ```typescript\n <FormName entity={entity} formMode={FormMode.Edit} />\n ```\n\n## Edit Action Server Function Structure\n\n- Edit action should accept context as first parameter:\n ```typescript\n export async function editEntityAd(\n   context: {\n     entityPublicId: string;\n     imagesToDelete: ExistingImageItem[];\n     allImagesShouldBeDeleted: boolean;\n   },\n   initialState: unknown,\n   formData: FormData\n ) {\n   // ... implementation\n }\n ```\n- Handle image deletion before processing new uploads\n- Merge remaining existing images with newly uploaded images\n- Use repository pattern to update entity\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Same error handling as create mode\n- Use `ErrorModal` component\n- Reset form on modal close (same as create mode)\n\n## Loading States\n\n- Same loading states as create mode\n- Show `Loader` when `isPending` is true\n- Disable all fields during submission\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Always check `isCreateMode` before accessing `entity` properties\n- Use optional chaining (`entity?.property`) when accessing entity data\n- Provide sensible defaults for all fields\n- Ensure edit action properly handles partial updates\n- Test both create and edit flows\n- Verify image deletion and upload work correctly together\n- Ensure validation works correctly in both modes\n- Follow the pattern established in `ProfessionalServicePublishForm` and `CarPublishForm`\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Conditional Rendering Based on Mode\n\n```typescript\n{isCreateMode ? (\n  <Text>Создание нового объявления</Text>\n) : (\n  <Text>Редактирование объявления</Text>\n)}\n```\n\n### Safe Entity Property Access\n\n```typescript\nconst defaultValue = entity?.property ?? fallbackValue;\n```\n\n### Number Field Conversion\n\n```typescript\n// In defaultValue\nnumericField: entity?.numericField?.toString() || \"\",\n\n// Schema handles conversion back to number via z.coerce.number()\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:13:00.468Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced form management capabilities with TypeScript and enum-based mode switching.","zh":"非常适合需要使用TypeScript和枚举基于模式切换的高级表单管理功能的前端代理。","ja":"TypeScriptとenumベースのモード切替機能を使用する高度なフォーム管理機能が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"TypeScript와 열거형 기반 모드 전환 기능을 사용하는 고급 폼 관리 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de administración de formularios con TypeScript y conmutación de modos basada en enumeraciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de fonctionnalités avancées de gestion de formulaires avec TypeScript et de commutation de mode basée sur des énumérations.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Formularverwaltungsfunktionen mit TypeScript und Enum-basiertem Moduswechsel benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de formulários com TypeScript e comutação de modos baseada em enum.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности управления формами с помощью TypeScript и переключения режимов на основе перечисления.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة النماذج باستخدام TypeScript وتبديل الوضع القائم على العدد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement edit functionality for existing forms using the FormMode enum and SerializedEntity types, while supporting both create and edit modes with props interface for form components.","zh":"赋予代理实现编辑功能以使用FormMode枚举和序列化实体类型的现有表单，同时支持创建和编辑模式，并为表单组件提供道具接口。","ja":"FormMode列挙型とシリアライズされたエンティティ型を使用して、既存のフォームの編集機能を実装し、作成モードと編集モードの両方をサポートし、フォームコンポーネントのためのpropsインターフェースを提供する。","ko":"FormMode 열거형과 직렬화된 엔티티 유형을 사용하여 기존 폼의 편집 기능을 구현하며 생성 모드와 편집 모드를 모두 지원하고 폼 컴포넌트를 위한 props 인터페이스를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar la funcionalidad de edición para formularios existentes utilizando el enum FormMode y los tipos SerializedEntity, al mismo tiempo que admite ambos modos de creación y edición con la interfaz de props para componentes de formularios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre la fonctionnalité d''édition pour les formulaires existants en utilisant l''énumération FormMode et les types SerializedEntity, tout en prenant en charge les deux modes de création et d''édition avec l''interface de props pour les composants de formulaire.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Editierfunktion für bestehende Formulare mithilfe der FormMode-Enum und der SerializedEntity-Typen zu implementieren, während sie sowohl Erstellungs- als auch Editiermodus mit der Props-Schnittstelle für Formularkomponenten unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar a funcionalidade de edição para formulários existentes usando o enum FormMode e tipos de entidade serializados, enquanto suporta ambos os modos de criação e edição com interface de props para componentes de formulário.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовать функцию редактирования для существующих форм, используя перечисление FormMode и типы сериализованных сущностей, при этом поддерживая оба режима создания и редактирования с помощью интерфейса props для компонентов формы.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ وظيفة التحرير للأشكال الحالية باستخدام تعداد FormMode وأشكال الكيانات المسلسلة، بينما يدعم كلا الوضعين من إنشاء وتحرير باستخدام واجهة props لمكونات النموذج."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing edit functionality for existing forms","Switching between create and edit modes using FormMode enum","Validating form data with SerializedEntity types"],"zh":["为现有表单实现编辑功能","使用FormMode枚举在创建和编辑模式之间切换","使用序列化实体类型验证表单数据"],"ja":["既存のフォームの編集機能を実装する","FormMode列挙型を使用して作成モードと編集モードを切り替える","シリアライズされたエンティティ型を使用してフォームデータを検証する"],"ko":["기존 폼의 편집 기능을 구현하는 것","FormMode 열거형을 사용하여 생성 모드와 편집 모드를 전환하는 것","직렬화된 엔티티 유형을 사용하여 폼 데이터를 검증하는 것"],"es":["Implementar la funcionalidad de edición para formularios existentes","Conmutar entre los modos de creación y edición utilizando el enum FormMode","Validar los datos del formulario con los tipos SerializedEntity"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la fonctionnalité d''édition pour les formulaires existants","Basculer entre les modes de création et d''édition en utilisant l''énumération FormMode","Valider les données de formulaire avec les types SerializedEntity"],"de":["Die Editierfunktion für bestehende Formulare implementieren","Zwischen Erstellungs- und Editiermodus mit der FormMode-Enum umschalten","Formulardaten mit den SerializedEntity-Typen validieren"],"pt":["Implementar funcionalidade de edição para formulários existentes","Comutar entre modos de criação e edição usando enum FormMode","Validar dados de formulário com tipos de entidade serializados"],"ru":["Реализовать функцию редактирования для существующих форм","Переключаться между режимами создания и редактирования, используя перечисление FormMode","Проверять данные формы с помощью типов сериализованных сущностей"],"ar":["تنفيذ وظيفة التحرير للأشكال الحالية","تبديل بين وضعي إنشاء وتحرير باستخدام تعداد FormMode","التحقق من بيانات النموذج باستخدام أشكال الكيانات المسلسلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires import of FormMode from @/components/Form/types/form.types","Needs import of serialized entity type","TypeScript compatibility required"],"zh":["需要从@/components/Form/types/form.types导入FormMode","需要导入序列化实体类型","需要TypeScript兼容性"],"ja":["@/components/Form/types/form.typesからFormModeをインポートする必要がある","シリアライズされたエンティティ型をインポートする必要がある","TypeScriptとの互換性が必要"],"ko":["@/components/Form/types/form.types에서 FormMode를導入해야 함","직렬화된 엔티티 유형을導入해야 함","TypeScript와의 호환성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la importación de FormMode desde @/components/Form/types/form.types","Necesita la importación del tipo de entidad serializada","Se requiere compatibilidad con TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite l''importation de FormMode depuis @/components/Form/types/form.types","A besoin de l''importation du type d''entité sérialisée","La compatibilité avec TypeScript est requise"],"de":["Benötigt die Importierung von FormMode aus @/components/Form/types/form.types","Benötigt die Importierung des serialisierten Entitätstyps","TypeScript-Kompatibilität ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer importação de FormMode de @/components/Form/types/form.types","Necessita importação do tipo de entidade serializado","Compatibilidade com TypeScript necessária"],"ru":["Требует импорта FormMode из @/components/Form/types/form.types","Требует импорта типа сериализованной сущности","Требуется совместимость с TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب استيراد FormMode من @/components/Form/types/form.types","يحتاج إلى استيراد نوع الكيان المسلسل","مطلوب توافق مع TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
