ription":{"zh":"本技能指导使用 Expo Router 和项目的屏幕/布局模式创建屏幕和路由配置","ja":"このスキルは、Expo Router とプロジェクトのスクリーン/レイアウト パターンを使用してスクリーンとルーティングを構成する方法を示します","ko":"이 스킬은 Expo Router와 프로젝트의 화면/레이아웃 패턴을 사용하여 화면 및 라우팅을 구성하는 방법을 가이드합니다","es":"Esta habilidad guía la creación de pantallas y configuración de rutas utilizando Expo Router y patrones de diseño de pantalla en React Native con TypeScript","fr":"Cette compétence guide la création d''écrans et la configuration de routes en utilisant Expo Router et des modèles de conception d''écran en React Native avec ...","de":"Diese Fähigkeit leitet die Erstellung von Bildschirmen und die Konfiguration von Routen mit Expo Router und Bildschirm-/Layout-Mustern in React Native mit Ty...","pt":"Este guia ensina a criar telas e configurar rotas com Expo Router e padrões de layout do projeto","ru":"Этот гид учит создавать экраны и настраивать маршрутизацию с помощью Expo Router и шаблонов макета проекта","ar":"يهدي هذا الدليل إلى إنشاء الشاشات وتكوين التوجيه باستخدام Expo Router وأنماط التصميم للمشروع","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用 Expo Router 实现文件 기반路由","支持 React Native 和 TypeScript","集成 Stack 和 Tabs 组件","使用 Safe Area 和 Theme 实现安全区域和主题化","提供核心组件和图标"],"ja":["Expo Router を使用したファイル ベースのルーティング","React Native と TypeScript のサポート","Stack と Tabs コンポーネントの統合","Safe Area と Theme を使用した安全エリアとテーマ化","コア コンポーネントとアイコンの提供"],"ko":["Expo Router를 사용한 파일 기반 라우팅","React Native와 TypeScript 지원","Stack과 Tabs 컴포넌트 통합","Safe Area와 Theme를 사용한 안전 영역과 테마화","코어 컴포넌트와 아이콘 제공"],"es":["Uso de Expo Router para la configuración de rutas","Diseño de pantallas con React Native y TypeScript","Implementación de Stack y Tabs con expo-router","Uso de Safe Area y Theme para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Incorporación de componentes core y íconos"],"fr":["Utilisation d''Expo Router pour la configuration de routes","Conception d''écrans avec React Native et TypeScript","Mise en œuvre de Stack et Tabs avec expo-router","Utilisation de Safe Area et Theme pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur","Intégration de composants core et d''icônes"],"de":["Verwendung von Expo Router für die Konfiguration von Routen","Entwurf von Bildschirmen mit React Native und TypeScript","Implementierung von Stack und Tabs mit expo-router","Verwendung von Safe Area und Theme für eine bessere Benutzererfahrung","Einbindung von Core-Komponenten und Symbolen"],"pt":["Uso de Expo Router para roteamento baseado em arquivos","Desenvolvimento com React Native e TypeScript","Utilização de Stack e Tabs do expo-router","Integração com react-native-safe-area-context para área segura","Uso de temas e estilos com useAppTheme e useStyles","Componentes core do src/ui/components/core/"],"ru":["Использование Expo Router для маршрутизации на основе файлов","Разработка с React Native и TypeScript","Использование Stack и Tabs из expo-router","Интеграция с react-native-safe-area-context для безопасной области","Использование тем и стилей с useAppTheme и useStyles","Основные компоненты из src/ui/components/core/"],"ar":["استخدام Expo Router لتوجيه الملفات","التطوير مع React Native و TypeScript","استخدام Stack و Tabs من expo-router","التكامل مع react-native-safe-area-context لمنطقة آمنة","استخدام السمات والأشكال مع useAppTheme و useStyles","المكونات الأساسية من src/ui/components/core/"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo Router","React Native","TypeScript","移动应用开发","屏幕和路由配置","文件 기반路由"],"ja":["Expo Router","React Native","TypeScript","モバイル アプリ開発","スクリーンとルーティング","ファイル ベースのルーティング"],"ko":["Expo Router","React Native","TypeScript","모바일 앱 개발","화면 및 라우팅","파일 기반 라우팅"],"es":["Expo Router","React Native","TypeScript","Creación de pantallas","Configuración de rutas","Diseño de aplicaciones móviles","Desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","Navegación en aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Expo Router","React Native","TypeScript","Création d''écrans","Configuration de routes","Conception d''applications mobiles","Développement d''applications mobiles","Navigation dans les applications mobiles"],"de":["Expo Router","React Native","TypeScript","Erstellung von Bildschirmen","Konfiguration von Routen","Entwurf von mobilen Anwendungen","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","Navigation in mobilen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Expo Router","React Native","TypeScript","roteamento baseado em arquivos","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","navegação de aplicativos","criação de telas","configuração de rotas"],"ru":["Expo Router","React Native","TypeScript","маршрутизация на основе файлов","разработка мобильных приложений","навигация приложений","создание экранов","настройка маршрутизации"],"ar":["Expo Router","React Native","TypeScript","توجيه الملفات","تطوير التطبيقات النقالة","ملاحة التطبيقات","إنشاء الشاشات","تكوين التوجيه"]}},"owner":"Vinicius-B-Leite","repo":"blcalisteniaV2","repoPath":"Vinicius-B-Leite/blcalisteniaV2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-screens-and-routing","description":"Creates screens and configures routing with Expo Router following project patterns: file-based routes, route groups, protected routes, screen components with hooks and theme styles. Use when adding new screens, tabs, layouts, or when the user asks about navigation and routing.","bodyPreview":"# Creating Screens and Routing\n\nThis skill guides the creation of screens and routing configuration using Expo Router and the project''s screen/layout patterns.\n\n## Technologies & Stack\n\n- **Expo Router** (file-based routing)\n- **React Native** with TypeScript\n- **Stack** and **Tabs** from `expo-router`\n- **Safe Area** via `react-native-safe-area-context`\n- **Theme** via `useAppTheme` and `useStyles`\n- **Core components** from `src/ui/components/core/` (Screen, Text, Button, Icon, etc.)\n- **Icons","body":"# Creating Screens and Routing\n\nThis skill guides the creation of screens and routing configuration using Expo Router and the project''s screen/layout patterns.\n\n## Technologies & Stack\n\n- **Expo Router** (file-based routing)\n- **React Native** with TypeScript\n- **Stack** and **Tabs** from `expo-router`\n- **Safe Area** via `react-native-safe-area-context`\n- **Theme** via `useAppTheme` and `useStyles`\n- **Core components** from `src/ui/components/core/` (Screen, Text, Button, Icon, etc.)\n- **Icons**: use only the core `Icon` component. Do not use `@expo/vector-icons`, `Ionicons`, or any other icon library directly.\n\n## Concepts\n\n### Route file vs Screen component\n\n- **Route file** (`src/app/...`): Thin entry point that only imports and renders the screen component. No layout/UI logic here.\n- **Screen component** (`src/ui/screens/...`): Actual UI, hooks, and styles. Reusable and testable.\n\n### Route groups\n\nParentheses create **groups** (no segment in URL): `(application)`, `(tabs)`.\n\n- Use for layout nesting without changing the URL.\n- Example: `(application)/(tabs)/home` → URL `/home`, not `/(application)/(tabs)/home`.\n\n## App structure (src/app)\n\n```\napp/\n├── _layout.tsx           # Root layout: ThemeProvider, SafeAreaProvider, AuthProvider, Stack\n├── index.tsx             # Entry route (e.g. onboarding) → renders OnboardingScreen\n└── (application)/        # Route group (protected)\n    ├── _layout.tsx       # Protected layout: redirect if not auth, Stack with (tabs)\n    └── (tabs)/           # Route group for tab navigation\n        ├── _layout.tsx   # Tabs layout\n        └── home.tsx      # Tab screen\n```\n\n## Route file pattern\n\nRoute files are minimal: default export that renders the screen component.\n\n```tsx\n// src/app/(application)/(tabs)/home.tsx\nimport { HomeScreen } from \"../../../ui/screens/Home/Home\"\n\nexport default function Home() {\n\treturn <HomeScreen />\n}\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n\n- One default export (the page component).\n- No business logic or layout in the route file; delegate to the screen.\n\n## Screen component structure (src/ui/screens)\n\nEach feature screen lives in its own folder:\n\n```\nScreenName/\n├── ScreenName.tsx      # Main screen component\n├── styles.ts           # Theme-based styles (stylesTheme)\n├── useScreenName.ts    # Hook: actions, states, refs (UI only)\n├── components/         # Optional: screen-specific components\n│   └── Header/\n│       ├── Header.tsx\n│       ├── styles.ts\n│       └── index.ts\n└── __tests__/          # Optional\n    └── ScreenName.test.tsx\n```\n\nA screen folder may include a **`components/`** subfolder for components used only by that screen. If a component is reused across screens, place it in `src/ui/components/core/` or a shared components folder instead.\n\n### Screen-specific components (components/)\n\nComponents in `components/` follow this structure:\n\n```\nScreenName/components/ComponentName/\n├── ComponentName.tsx\n├── styles.ts                 # Optional: stylesTheme(theme) when component has its own styles\n└── index.ts                  # export { ComponentName } from \"./ComponentName\"\n```\n\n**Patterns:**\n\n- Props receive data and callbacks from the parent screen (e.g. `userName`, `onNotificationsPress`). The screen hook provides `states` and `actions`; pass them down as props.\n- Use core components: `Text`, `Button`, **`Icon`** (never `Ionicons` or other icon libs directly).\n- Use `useAppTheme()` and `stylesTheme(theme)` in component styles when the component has its own styles.\n- Use theme tokens (`theme.action[\"brand-primary\"]`, `spacings`, `radius`) in styles.\n- Component styles file: `styles.ts` in the component folder, exporting `stylesTheme(theme: ThemeType)`.\n\n**Example: Header component (Home screen)**\n\n```\nHome/components/Header/\n├── Header.tsx\n├── styles.ts\n└── index.ts\n```\n\n```tsx\n// Header.tsx\nimport { Image, View } from \"react-native\"\nimport { Text } from \"../../../../components/core/Text/Text\"\nimport { Icon } from \"../../../../components/core/Icon\"\nimport { useAppTheme } from \"../../../../theme/hooks/useAppTheme\"\nimport { stylesTheme } from \"./styles\"\n\ntype HeaderProps = {\n\tuserName: string\n\tonNotificationsPress: () => void\n}\n\nexport function Header({ userName, onNotificationsPress }: HeaderProps) {\n\tconst { theme } = useAppTheme()\n\tconst styles = stylesTheme(theme)\n\n\treturn (\n\t\t<View style={styles.row}>\n\t\t\t<View style={styles.leftContent}>\n\t\t\t\t<View style={styles.avatarContainer}>\n\t\t\t\t\t<Image source={{ uri: \"...\" }} style={styles.avatar} />\n\t\t\t\t</View>\n\t\t\t\t<View style={styles.textContainer}>\n\t\t\t\t\t<Text variant=\"title-large-bold\">Olá, {userName}!</Text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<Text variant=\"title-small-reg\">Vamos treinar hoje?</Text>\n\t\t\t\t</View>\n\t\t\t</View>\n\t\t\t<Icon\n\t\t\t\tonPress={onNotificationsPress}\n\t\t\t\tpressableStyle={styles.bellButton}\n\t\t\t\tname=\"icon-notification\"\n\t\t\t\tsize={21}\n\t\t\t\tvariant=\"default\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</View>\n\t)\n}\n```\n\n```typescript\n// styles.ts\nimport { StyleSheet } from \"react-native\"\nimport { ThemeType } from \"../../../../theme\"\nimport { radius } from \"../../../../theme/tokens/sizes\"\nimport { spacings } from \"../../../../theme/tokens/spacings\"\n\nconst AVATAR_SIZE = 48\n\nexport const stylesTheme = (theme: ThemeType) =>\n\tStyleSheet.create({\n\t\trow: {\n\t\t\tflexDirection: \"row\",\n\t\t\talignItems: \"center\",\n\t\t\tjustifyContent: \"space-between\",\n\t\t\tgap: spacings.padding[8],\n\t\t},\n\t\tavatarContainer: {\n\t\t\twidth: AVATAR_SIZE,\n\t\t\theight: AVATAR_SIZE,\n\t\t\tborderRadius: AVATAR_SIZE / 2,\n\t\t\toverflow: \"hidden\",\n\t\t\tbackgroundColor: theme.action[\"brand-primary\"],\n\t\t},\n\t\tavatar: {\n\t\t\twidth: AVATAR_SIZE,\n\t\t\theight: AVATAR_SIZE,\n\t\t},\n\t})\n```\n\n**Usage in screen:**\n\n```tsx\n// Home.tsx\n<Header\n\tuserName={states.userName}\n\tonNotificationsPress={actions.handleNotificationsPress}\n/>\n```\n\n### Screen component\n\n- **Always use the core `Screen` component as the main container** of the screen. No other root wrapper (e.g. plain `View`) for the whole screen.\n- Receives no route params in the component signature unless the route passes them.\n- Uses a custom hook that returns `actions`, `states`, and `refs`.\n- Uses `useStyles` with a `stylesTheme(theme, ...)` function for styles.\n- Prefer core components: `Screen`, `Text`, `Button`, `Icon`, etc. **Icons must use the core `Icon` component only**—no `Ionicons`, `@expo/vector-icons`, or other icon libs.\n\n```tsx\n// ScreenName.tsx\nimport { View } from \"react-native\"\nimport { Text } from \"../../components/core/Text/Text\"\nimport { Screen } from \"../../components/core/Screen/Screen\"\nimport { useStyles } from \"../../theme/hooks/useStyles\"\nimport { stylesTheme } from \"./styles\"\nimport { useScreenName } from \"./useScreenName\"\n\nexport function ScreenNameScreen() {\n\tconst { actions, states, refs } = useScreenName()\n\tconst styles = useStyles((theme) => stylesTheme(theme, states.insets))\n\n\treturn (\n\t\t<Screen>\n\t\t\t<View style={styles.container} ref={refs.containerRef}>\n\t\t\t\t<Text variant=\"heading\">Title</Text>\n\t\t\t\t{/* ... */}\n\t\t\t</View>\n\t\t</Screen>\n\t)\n}\n```\n\n### styles.ts\n\n- Export a function `stylesTheme(theme: ThemeType, ...deps)` that returns a `StyleSheet.create(...)`.\n- Use theme tokens: `theme.surface.background`, `spacings`, etc.\n- Use safe area insets when needed (e.g. bottom padding).\n\n```typescript\n// styles.ts\nimport { StyleSheet } from \"react-native\"\nimport { ThemeType } from \"../../theme\"\nimport { spacings } from \"../../theme/tokens/spacings\"\nimport { EdgeInsets } from \"react-native-safe-area-context\"\n\nexport const stylesTheme = (theme: ThemeType, insets: EdgeInsets) =>\n\tStyleSheet.create({\n\t\tcontainer: {\n\t\t\tflex: 1,\n\t\t\tgap: spacings.gap[32],\n\t\t\tpaddingBottom:\n\t\t\t\tMath.max(insets.bottom, spacings.padding[20]) + spacings.padding[20],\n\t\t},\n\t})\n```\n\n### useScreenName hook\n\n- **Return always** `{ actions, states, refs }`. Even if one category is empty, expose the key (e.g. `refs: {}`).\n- **UI rules only**: no business logic. The hook handles only UI concerns: navigation (e.g. `useRouter`), safe area, theme, refs, local UI state (e.g. focus, visibility). Business rules (validation, API calls, domain logic) belong in domain/use cases, not in the screen hook.\n- `actions`: handlers for user interactions (e.g. navigate, toggle, submit that delegates to a service).\n- `states`: derived or reactive values for rendering (e.g. `insets`, `theme`, loading flags coming from props/context).\n- `refs`: refs for DOM/native elements used by the screen (e.g. scroll ref, input ref). Use `useRef` and expose them in `refs`.\n\n```typescript\n// useScreenName.ts\nimport { useRef } from \"react\"\nimport { View } from \"react-native\"\nimport { useSafeAreaInsets } from \"react-native-safe-area-context\"\nimport { useRouter } from \"expo-router\"\nimport { useAppTheme } from \"../../theme/hooks/useAppTheme\"\n\nexport const useScreenName = () => {\n\tconst router = useRouter()\n\tconst insets = useSafeAreaInsets()\n\tconst { theme } = useAppTheme()\n\tconst containerRef = useRef<View>(null)\n\n\tconst handleNavigate = () => {\n\t\trouter.navigate(\"/other-route\")\n\t}\n\n\treturn {\n\t\tactions: { handleNavigate },\n\t\tstates: { insets, theme },\n\t\trefs: { containerRef },\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n## Root layout (\\_layout.tsx)\n\n- Wraps app with: `ThemeProvider` → `SafeAreaProvider` → `AuthProvider` → routing.\n- Uses `Stack` from `expo-router`.\n- Uses `Stack.Protected` with `guard={!!auth?.id}` for protected routes.\n- Entry route: `name=\"index\"` with `headerShown: false`.\n\n```tsx\nconst Routes = () => {\n\tconst { auth } = useAuth()\n\treturn (\n\t\t<Stack>\n\t\t\t<Stack.Screen name=\"index\" options={{ headerShown: false }} />\n\t\t\t<Stack.Protected guard={!!auth?.id}>\n\t\t\t\t<Stack.Screen name=\"(application)\" />\n\t\t\t</Stack.Protected>\n\t\t</Stack>\n\t)\n}\n```\n\n## Protected layout (e.g. (application)/\\_layout.tsx)\n\n- Redirect to entry if not authenticated.\n- Use `Stack` with `screenOptions`: `headerShown: false`, `fullScreenGestureEnabled: true` as in the project.\n\n```tsx\nimport { Redirect, Stack } from \"expo-router\"\nimport { useAuth } from \"../../domain/auth/AuthContext\"\n\nexport default function ProtectedLayout() {\n\tconst { auth } = useAuth()\n\tif (!auth?.id) return <Redirect href=\"/\" />\n\treturn (\n\t\t<Stack screenOptions={{ headerShown: false, fullScreenGestureEnabled: true }}>\n\t\t\t<Stack.Screen name=\"(tabs)\" />\n\t\t</Stack>\n\t)\n}\n```\n\n## Tabs layout\n\n- Use `Tabs` from `expo-router`.\n- One `Tabs.Screen` per tab file (e.g. `home`, `profile`).\n\n```tsx\nimport { Tabs } from \"expo-router\"\n\nexport default function TabLayout() {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<Tabs>\n\t\t\t<Tabs.Screen name=\"home\" />\n\t\t\t<Tabs.Screen name=\"profile\" />\n\t\t</Tabs>\n\t)\n}\n```\n\n## Adding a new screen (step-by-step)\n\n### 1. Screen folder and files\n\n- Create `src/ui/screens/FeatureName/FeatureName.tsx` (export `FeatureNameScreen`).\n- Create `src/ui/screens/FeatureName/styles.ts` with `stylesTheme(theme, ...)`.\n- Create `src/ui/screens/FeatureName/useFeatureName.ts` with `useFeatureName()` returning `{ actions, states, refs }` (UI-only, no business logic).\n\n### 2. Route file\n\n- Create the route file in `src/app/` according to desired URL:\n    - Tab: `(application)/(tabs)/featureName.tsx`\n    - Stack inside app: `(application)/featureName.tsx`\n    - Entry-level: e.g. `someRoute.tsx` and register in root `_layout.tsx` if needed.\n- In the route file: import the screen and default-export a function that renders it.\n\n### 3. Register in layout (if needed)\n\n- New tab: add `<Tabs.Screen name=\"featureName\" />` in `(application)/(tabs)/_layout.tsx`.\n- New stack screen: add `<Stack.Screen name=\"featureName\" />` in the corresponding `_layout.tsx`.\n\n## Navigation\n\n- Use `useRouter()` from `expo-router`: `router.push(href)`, `router.replace(href)`, `router.back()`.\n- Use path strings: `\"/\"`, `\"/home\"`, `\"/(application)/(tabs)/profile\"` (group names don’t appear in URL).\n- Use `<Link href=\"...\">` for declarative navigation when appropriate.\n\n## Naming conventions\n\n- **Route files**: camelCase, e.g. `home.tsx`, `featureName.tsx`.\n- **Screen folder**: PascalCase, e.g. `Onboarding`, `Home`, `FeatureName`.\n- **Screen component**: `ScreenNameScreen` (e.g. `OnboardingScreen`, `HomeScreen`).\n- **Hook**: `useScreenName` (e.g. `useOnboarding`, `useHome`).\n- **Styles**: `stylesTheme` in `styles.ts`.\n\n## Checklist\n\nWhen creating a new screen and route:\n\n- [ ] Created folder `src/ui/screens/FeatureName/` with `FeatureName.tsx`, `styles.ts`, `useFeatureName.ts`.\n- [ ] Screen uses **core `Screen`** as the main container (root wrapper of the screen).\n- [ ] Screen hook returns `{ actions, states, refs }`; hook contains **only UI rules**, no business logic.\n- [ ] Styles use `stylesTheme(theme, ...)` and `useStyles`.\n- [ ] Used core components and theme tokens. **Icons only via core `Icon`** (no Ionicons/vector-icons directly).\n- [ ] Created route file in `src/app/` that only renders the screen component.\n- [ ] Registered the route in the correct `_layout.tsx` (Stack or Tabs).\n- [ ] Navigation uses `useRouter()` or `<Link>` with correct paths.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:13:03.078Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing advanced screen creation and routing configuration using Expo Router and React Native.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Expo Router 和 React Native 进行高级屏幕创建和路由配置的移动应用代理。","ja":"Expo Router と React Native を使用して高度な画面作成とルーティング構成が必要なモバイルアプリエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Expo Router와 React Native를 사용하여 고급 화면 생성 및 라우팅 구성이 필요한 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de aplicaciones móviles que necesitan creación de pantallas avanzadas y configuración de enrutamiento utilizando Expo Router y React Native.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''applications mobiles nécessitant une création d''écran avancée et une configuration de routage à l''aide d''Expo Router et React Native.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die eine erweiterte Bildschirm-Erstellung und Routing-Konfiguration mit Expo Router und React Native benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de criação avançada de telas e configuração de roteamento usando Expo Router e React Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, которым требуются продвинутые возможности создания экранов и настройки маршрутизации с помощью Expo Router и React Native.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء شاشات متقدم وتهيئة المسار باستخدام Expo Router و React Native."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement file-based routing with Expo Router, leveraging React Native and TypeScript for robust mobile app development, including integration with Stack, Tabs, and Safe Area via react-native-safe-area-context.","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现基于文件的路由配置，以 Expo Router 为基础，利用 React Native 和 TypeScript 进行强大的移动应用开发，包括与 Stack、Tabs 和 Safe Area 通过 react-native-safe-area-context 进行集成。","ja":"エージェントが Expo Router を使用してファイルベースのルーティングを設計および実装できるようにすることで、React Native と TypeScript を使用して堅牢なモバイルアプリ開発を可能にし、react-native-safe-area-context を使用して Stack、Tabs、Safe Area との統合も可能にする。","ko":"Expo Router를 사용하여 파일 기반 라우팅을 설계 및 구현할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 React Native와 TypeScript를 사용하여 강력한 모바일 앱 개발을 가능하게 하며, react-native-safe-area-context를 통해 Stack, Tabs 및 Safe Area와의 통합도 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar enrutamiento basado en archivos con Expo Router, aprovechando React Native y TypeScript para un desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles robusto, incluyendo la integración con Stack, Tabs y Safe Area a través de react-native-safe-area-context.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre un routage basé sur des fichiers avec Expo Router, en exploitant React Native et TypeScript pour un développement d''applications mobiles robuste, y compris l''intégration avec Stack, Tabs et Safe Area via react-native-safe-area-context.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Dateibasiertes Routing mit Expo Router zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, indem React Native und TypeScript für eine robuste Mobile-App-Entwicklung genutzt werden, einschließlich der Integration mit Stack, Tabs und Safe Area über react-native-safe-area-context.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar roteamento baseado em arquivos com Expo Router, aproveitando React Native e TypeScript para desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis robustos, incluindo integração com Stack, Tabs e Safe Area via react-native-safe-area-context.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать маршрутизацию на основе файлов с помощью Expo Router, используя React Native и TypeScript для надежного разработки мобильных приложений, включая интеграцию со Stack, Tabs и Safe Area через react-native-safe-area-context.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم وتنفيذ التوجيه القائم على الملفات باستخدام Expo Router، واستخدام React Native وTypeScript من أجل تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول القوي، بما في ذلك التكامل مع Stack و Tabs و Safe Area من خلال react-native-safe-area-context."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating navigation flows with Expo Router","Designing responsive screens with react-native-safe-area-context","Implementing theme-based layouts using useAppTheme and useStyles"],"zh":["使用 Expo Router 创建导航流程","使用 react-native-safe-area-context 设计响应式屏幕","使用 useAppTheme 和 useStyles 实现基于主题的布局"],"ja":["Expo Router を使用したナビゲーションフローの作成","react-native-safe-area-context を使用したレスポンシブ画面の設計","useAppTheme と useStyles を使用したテーマベースのレイアウトの実装"],"ko":["Expo Router를 사용하여 네비게이션 흐름 생성","react-native-safe-area-context를 사용하여 반응형 화면 디자인","useAppTheme 및 useStyles를 사용하여 테마 기반 레이아웃 구현"],"es":["Crear flujos de navegación con Expo Router","Diseñar pantallas responsivas con react-native-safe-area-context","Implementar diseños basados en temas utilizando useAppTheme y useStyles"],"fr":["Créer des flux de navigation avec Expo Router","Concevoir des écrans réactifs avec react-native-safe-area-context","Mettre en œuvre des mises en page basées sur des thèmes à l''aide de useAppTheme et useStyles"],"de":["Navigationsflüsse mit Expo Router erstellen","Reaktive Bildschirme mit react-native-safe-area-context entwerfen","Theme-basierte Layouts mit useAppTheme und useStyles implementieren"],"pt":["Criação de fluxos de navegação com Expo Router","Projeto de telas responsivas com react-native-safe-area-context","Implementação de layouts baseados em temas usando useAppTheme e useStyles"],"ru":["Создание потоков навигации с помощью Expo Router","Проектирование адаптивных экранов с помощью react-native-safe-area-context","Реализация макетов на основе тем с помощью useAppTheme и useStyles"],"ar":["إنشاء تدفقات الملاحة مع Expo Router","تصميم الشاشات المستجيبة مع react-native-safe-area-context","تنفيذ تخطيطات قائمة على السمات باستخدام useAppTheme و useStyles"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo Router and React Native setup","Limited to mobile app development with TypeScript"],"zh":["需要 Expo Router 和 React Native 设置","仅限于使用 TypeScript 进行移动应用开发"],"ja":["Expo Router と React Native の設定が必要","TypeScript を使用したモバイルアプリ開発のみに対応"],"ko":["Expo Router 및 React Native 설정이 필요","TypeScript를 사용한 모바일 앱 개발만 해당"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Expo Router y React Native","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles con TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''Expo Router et React Native","Limité au développement d''applications mobiles avec TypeScript"],"de":["Erfordert Expo Router- und React Native-Setup","Begrenzt auf Mobile-App-Entwicklung mit TypeScript"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Expo Router e React Native","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis com TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует настройки Expo Router и React Native","Ограничен разработкой мобильных приложений с помощью TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Expo Router و React Native","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول مع TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('allthingslinux/portal/shadcn-ui', 'community', 'allthingslinux', 'portal', 'allthingslinux/portal', 'shadcn-ui', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z', '2026-02-18T10:13:15.444Z', NULL, '{"id":"allthingslinux/portal/shadcn-ui","name":"shadcn-ui","description":{"zh":"shadcn-ui, Radix UI Tailwind CSS","ja":"shadcn-uiRadix UITailwind CSS","ko":"shadcn-ui, Radix UI, Tailwind CSS","es":"Guía experta para desarrolladores sobre cómo crear componentes UI accesibles y personalizables con shadcn/ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","fr":"Guide expert pour les développeurs sur la création de composants UI accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn/ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","de":"Expertenleitfaden für Entwickler zum Erstellen von zugänglichen und benutzerdefinierten UI-Komponenten mit shadcn/ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","pt":"shadcn-ui é uma biblioteca para criar componentes UI personalizáveis e acessíveis. Aprenda a usá-la com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"shadcn-ui - это библиотека для создания настраиваемых и доступных компонентов UI. Узнайте, как использовать ее с Radix UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"شادكن-يو آي هي مكتبة لإنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل والوصول. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع راديكس يو آي وتايلويند سي إس.","en":"Portal"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"shadcn-ui ","ja":"shadcn-ui","ko":"shadcn-ui","es":"Guía de componentes UI de shadcn para desarrolladores","fr":"Guide de composants UI shadcn pour développeurs","de":"shadcn-UI-Komponenten-Anleitung für Entwickler","pt":"shadcn-ui: Componentes UI Personalizáveis","ru":"shadcn-ui: Настраиваемые компоненты UI","ar":"شادكن-يو آي: مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل","en":"shadcn-ui"},"description":{"zh":"shadcn-ui, Radix UI Tailwind CSS","ja":"shadcn-uiRadix UITailwind CSS","ko":"shadcn-ui, Radix UI, Tailwind CSS","es":"Guía experta para desarrolladores sobre cómo crear componentes UI accesibles y personalizables con shadcn/ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","fr":"Guide expert pour les développeurs sur la création de composants UI accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn/ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","de":"Expertenleitfaden für Entwickler zum Erstellen von zugänglichen und benutzerdefinierten UI-Komponenten mit shadcn/ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","pt":"shadcn-ui é uma biblioteca para criar componentes UI personalizáveis e acessíveis. Aprenda a usá-la com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"shadcn-ui - это библиотека для создания настраиваемых и доступных компонентов UI. Узнайте, как использовать ее с Radix UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"شادكن-يو آي هي مكتبة لإنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل والوصول. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع راديكس يو آي وتايلويند سي إس.","en":"Portal"},"definition":{"en":"Portal"},"features":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","Form"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","Form"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","Form"],"es":["Componentes UI personalizables","Accesibilidad garantizada","Integración con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","Guía de inicio rápido","Configuración de proyectos","Componentes core como botones y formularios"],"fr":["Composants UI personnalisables","Accessibilité garantie","Intégration avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Guide de démarrage rapide","Configuration de projets","Composants core tels que boutons et formulaires"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte UI-Komponenten","Garantierte Zugänglichkeit","Integration mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Schnellstart-Anleitung","Projekt-Konfiguration","Core-Komponenten wie Schaltflächen und Formulare"],"pt":["Componentes UI personalizáveis","Acessibilidade garantida","Integração com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","Guia para desenvolvedores","Exemplos de código prático"],"ru":["Настраиваемые компоненты UI","Гарантированная доступность","Интеграция с Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","Руководство для разработчиков","Практические примеры кода"],"ar":["مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل","الوصول المضمون","التكامل مع راديكس يو آي وتايلويند سي إس","دليل للمطورين","أمثلة من التعليمات البرمجية العملية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","Form","shadcn-ui","UI","Web"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","Form","shadcn-ui","UI","Web"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","UI","Form","shadcn-ui","UI","Web"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes UI","accesibilidad","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","interfaces de usuario","personalización"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants UI","accessibilité","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","développement web","interfaces utilisateur","personnalisation"],"de":["shadcn-ui","UI-Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","Webentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","Anpassung"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes UI","acessibilidade","personalização","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","компоненты UI","доступность","настраиваемость","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS","веб-разработка"],"ar":["شادكن-يو آي","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","الوصول","التنظيم","راديكس يو آي","تايلويند سي إس","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"allthingslinux","repo":"portal","repoPath":"allthingslinux/portal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Complete shadcn/ui component library guide including installation, configuration, and implementation of accessible React components. Use when setting up shadcn/ui, installing components, building forms with React Hook Form and Zod, customizing themes with Tailwind CSS, or implementing UI patterns like buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, tables, and complex form layouts.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card]","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Patterns\n\nExpert guide for building accessible, customizable UI components with shadcn/ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [When to Use](#when-to-use)\n- [Quick Start](#quick-start)\n- [Installation & Setup](#installation--setup)\n- [Project Configuration](#project-configuration)\n- [Core Components](#core-components)\n  - [Button](#button-component)\n  - [Input & Form Fields](#input--form-fields)\n  - [Forms with Validation](#forms-with-validation)\n  - [Card](#card-component)\n  - [Dialog (Modal)](#dialog-modal-component)\n  - [Select (Dropdown)](#select-dropdown-component)\n  - [Sheet (Slide-over)](#sheet-slide-over-component)\n  - [Menubar & Navigation](#menubar--navigation)\n  - [Table](#table-component)\n  - [Toast Notifications](#toast-notifications)\n- [Advanced Patterns](#advanced-patterns)\n- [Customization](#customization)\n- [Next.js Integration](#nextjs-integration)\n- [Best Practices](#best-practices)\n- [Common Component Combinations](#common-component-combinations)\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Setting up a new project with shadcn/ui\n- Installing or configuring individual components\n- Building forms with React Hook Form and Zod validation\n- Creating accessible UI components (buttons, dialogs, dropdowns, sheets)\n- Customizing component styling with Tailwind CSS\n- Implementing design systems with shadcn/ui\n- Building Next.js applications with TypeScript\n- Creating complex layouts and data displays\n\n## Quick Start\n\nFor new projects, use the automated setup:\n\n```bash\n# Create Next.js project with shadcn/ui\nnpx create-next-app@latest my-app --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app\ncd my-app\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n\n# Install essential components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form card dialog select\n```\n\nFor existing projects:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install tailwindcss-animate class-variance-authority clsx tailwind-merge lucide-react\n\n# Initialize shadcn/ui\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\n## What is shadcn/ui?\n\nshadcn/ui is **not** a traditional component library or npm package. Instead:\n\n- It''s a **collection of reusable components** that you can copy into your project\n- Components are **yours to customize** - you own the code\n- Built with **Radix UI** primitives for accessibility\n- Styled with **Tailwind CSS** utilities\n- Includes CLI tool for easy component installation\n\n## Installation & Setup\n\n### Initial Setup\n\n```bash\n# Initialize shadcn/ui in your project\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nDuring setup, you''ll configure:\n- TypeScript or JavaScript\n- Style (Default, New York, etc.)\n- Base color theme\n- CSS variables or Tailwind CSS classes\n- Component installation path\n\n### Installing Individual Components\n\n```bash\n# Install a single component\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n\n# Install multiple components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button input form\n\n# Install all components\nnpx shadcn@latest add --all\n```\n\n### Manual Installation\n\nIf you prefer manual setup:\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies for a specific component\nnpm install @radix-ui/react-slot\n\n# Copy component code from ui.shadcn.com\n# Place in src/components/ui/\n```\n\n## Project Configuration\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@radix-ui/react-accordion\": \"^1.1.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-alert-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dialog\": \"^1.0.5\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu\": \"^2.0.6\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-label\": \"^2.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-select\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-separator\": \"^1.0.3\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-slot\": \"^1.0.2\",\n    \"@radix-ui/react-toast\": \"^1.1.5\",\n    \"class-variance-authority\": \"^0.7.0\",\n    \"clsx\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"lucide-react\": \"^0.294.0\",\n    \"tailwind-merge\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"tailwindcss-animate\": \"^1.0.7\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### TSConfig Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"es5\",\n    \"lib\": [\"dom\", \"dom.iterable\", \"es6\"],\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"module\": \"esnext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"node\",\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"preserve\",\n    \"incremental\": true,\n    \"plugins\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"next\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/components/*\": [\"./src/components/*\"],\n      \"@/lib/*\": [\"./src/lib/*\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"next-env.d.ts\", \"**/*.ts\", \"**/*.tsx\", \".next/types/**/*.ts\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\"]\n}\n```\n\n### Tailwind Configuration\n\n```js\n// tailwind.config.js\n/** @type {import(''tailwindcss'').Config} */\nmodule.exports = {\n  darkMode: [\"class\"],\n  content: [\n    ''./pages/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./components/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./app/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n    ''./src/**/*.{ts,tsx}'',\n  ],\n  prefix: \"\",\n  theme: {\n    container: {\n      center: true,\n      padding: \"2rem\",\n      screens: {\n        \"2xl\": \"1400px\",\n      },\n    },\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        border: \"hsl(var(--border))\",\n        input: \"hsl(var(--input))\",\n        ring: \"hsl(var(--ring))\",\n        background: \"hsl(var(--background))\",\n        foreground: \"hsl(var(--foreground))\",\n        primary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--primary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--primary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        secondary: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--secondary))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--secondary-foreground))\",\n        },\n        destructive: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--destructive))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--destructive-foreground))\",\n        },\n        muted: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--muted))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--muted-foreground))\",\n        },\n        accent: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--accent))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--accent-foreground))\",\n        },\n        popover: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--popover))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--popover-foreground))\",\n        },\n        card: {\n          DEFAULT: \"hsl(var(--card))\",\n          foreground: \"hsl(var(--card-foreground))\",\n        },\n      },\n      borderRadius: {\n        lg: \"var(--radius)\",\n        md: \"calc(var(--radius) - 2px)\",\n        sm: \"calc(var(--radius) - 4px)\",\n      },\n      keyframes: {\n        \"accordion-down\": {\n          from: { height: \"0\" },\n          to: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n        },\n        \"accordion-up\": {\n          from: { height: \"var(--radix-accordion-content-height)\" },\n          to: { height: \"0\" },\n        },\n      },\n      animation: {\n        \"accordion-down\": \"accordion-down 0.2s ease-out\",\n        \"accordion-up\": \"accordion-up 0.2s ease-out\",\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [require(\"tailwindcss-animate\")],\n}\n```\n\n### CSS Variables (globals.css)\n\n```css\n@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card: 0 0% 100%;\n    --card-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover: 0 0% 100%;\n    --popover-foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --card: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --card-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --popover: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --popover-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --secondary: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --muted: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215 20.2% 65.1%;\n    --accent: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --accent-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --destructive: 0 62.8% 30.6%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --input: 217.2 32.6% 17.5%;\n    --ring: 212.7 26.8% 83.9%;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer base {\n  * {\n    @apply border-border;\n  }\n  body {\n    @apply bg-background text-foreground;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Core Components\n\n### Button Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n```\n\nBasic usage:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonDemo() {\n  return <Button>Click me</Button>;\n}\n```\n\nButton variants:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\n\nexport function ButtonVariants() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n      <Button variant=\"default\">Default</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"destructive\">Destructive</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"outline\">Outline</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"secondary\">Secondary</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"ghost\">Ghost</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"link\">Link</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nButton sizes:\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n  <Button size=\"default\">Default</Button>\n  <Button size=\"sm\">Small</Button>\n  <Button size=\"lg\">Large</Button>\n  <Button size=\"icon\">\n    <Icon className=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n  </Button>\n</div>\n```\n\nWith loading state:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\";\n\nexport function ButtonLoading() {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled>\n      <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />\n      Please wait\n    </Button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Input & Form Fields\n\n#### Input Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add input\n```\n\nBasic input:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputDemo() {\n  return <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />;\n}\n```\n\nInput with label:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\";\n\nexport function InputWithLabel() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"grid w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <Label htmlFor=\"email\">Email</Label>\n      <Input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nInput with button:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\";\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\";\n\nexport function InputWithButton() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex w-full max-w-sm items-center gap-2\">\n      <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n      <Button type=\"submit\" variant=\"outline\">Subscribe</Button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Forms with Validation\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add form\n```\n\nThis installs React Hook Form, Zod, and form components.\n\nComplete form example:\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormDescription,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2, {\n    message: \"Username must be at least 2 characters.\",\n  }),\n  email: z.string().email({\n    message: \"Please enter a valid email address.\",\n  }),\n})\n\nexport function ProfileForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    toast({\n      title: \"You submitted the following values:\",\n      description: (\n        <pre className=\"mt-2 w-[340px] rounded-md bg-slate-950 p-4\">\n          <code className=\"text-white\">{JSON.stringify(values, null, 2)}</code>\n        </pre>\n      ),\n    })\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"shadcn\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormDescription>\n                This is your public display name.\n              </FormDescription>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        \n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Card Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add card\n```\n\nBasic card:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport function CardDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Card>\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Card Title</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Card Description</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <p>Card Content</p>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter>\n        <p>Card Footer</p>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nCard with form:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\nexport function CardWithForm() {\n  return (\n    <Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Create project</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Deploy your new project in one-click.</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <form>\n          <div className=\"grid w-full items-center gap-4\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5\">\n              <Label htmlFor=\"name\">Name</Label>\n              <Input id=\"name\" placeholder=\"Name of your project\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </CardContent>\n      <CardFooter className=\"flex justify-between\">\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n        <Button>Deploy</Button>\n      </CardFooter>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Dialog (Modal) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog\n```\n\nBasic dialog:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogFooter,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n\nexport function DialogDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Dialog>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Dialog</Button>\n      </DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent className=\"sm:max-w-[425px]\">\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>Edit profile</DialogTitle>\n          <DialogDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </DialogDescription>\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <DialogFooter>\n          <Button type=\"submit\">Save changes</Button>\n        </DialogFooter>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Sheet (Slide-over) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add sheet\n```\n\nBasic sheet:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Sheet,\n  SheetContent,\n  SheetDescription,\n  SheetHeader,\n  SheetTitle,\n  SheetTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/sheet\"\n\nexport function SheetDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Sheet>\n      <SheetTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Sheet</Button>\n      </SheetTrigger>\n      <SheetContent>\n        <SheetHeader>\n          <SheetTitle>Edit profile</SheetTitle>\n          <SheetDescription>\n            Make changes to your profile here. Click save when you''re done.\n          </SheetDescription>\n        </SheetHeader>\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 py-4\">\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"name\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Name\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"name\" value=\"Pedro Duarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-4\">\n            <Label htmlFor=\"username\" className=\"text-right\">\n              Username\n            </Label>\n            <Input id=\"username\" value=\"@peduarte\" className=\"col-span-3\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </SheetContent>\n    </Sheet>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSheet with side placement:\n\n```tsx\n<Sheet>\n  <SheetTrigger asChild>\n    <Button variant=\"outline\">Open Right Sheet</Button>\n  </SheetTrigger>\n  <SheetContent side=\"right\">\n    <SheetHeader>\n      <SheetTitle>Settings</SheetTitle>\n      <SheetDescription>\n        Configure your application settings here.\n      </SheetDescription>\n    </SheetHeader>\n    {/* Settings content */}\n  </SheetContent>\n</Sheet>\n```\n\n### Menubar & Navigation\n\n#### Menubar Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add menubar\n```\n\nBasic menubar:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Menubar,\n  MenubarContent,\n  MenubarItem,\n  MenubarMenu,\n  MenubarSeparator,\n  MenubarShortcut,\n  MenubarSub,\n  MenubarSubContent,\n  MenubarSubTrigger,\n  MenubarTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/menubar\"\n\nexport function MenubarDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Menubar>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>File</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Tab <MenubarShortcut>⌘T</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            New Window <MenubarShortcut>⌘N</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Share</MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarItem>Print</MenubarItem>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n      <MenubarMenu>\n        <MenubarTrigger>Edit</MenubarTrigger>\n        <MenubarContent>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Undo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Z</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarItem>\n            Redo <MenubarShortcut>⌘Y</MenubarShortcut>\n          </MenubarItem>\n          <MenubarSeparator />\n          <MenubarSub>\n            <MenubarSubTrigger>Find</MenubarSubTrigger>\n            <MenubarSubContent>\n              <MenubarItem>Search the web</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find...</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Next</MenubarItem>\n              <MenubarItem>Find Previous</MenubarItem>\n            </MenubarSubContent>\n          </MenubarSub>\n        </MenubarContent>\n      </MenubarMenu>\n    </Menubar>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Select (Dropdown) Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add select\n```\n\nBasic select:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Select,\n  SelectContent,\n  SelectItem,\n  SelectTrigger,\n  SelectValue,\n} from \"@/components/ui/select\"\n\nexport function SelectDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Select>\n      <SelectTrigger className=\"w-[180px]\">\n        <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a fruit\" />\n      </SelectTrigger>\n      <SelectContent>\n        <SelectItem value=\"apple\">Apple</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"banana\">Banana</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"orange\">Orange</SelectItem>\n      </SelectContent>\n    </Select>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nSelect in form:\n\n```tsx\n<FormField\n  control={form.control}\n  name=\"role\"\n  render={({ field }) => (\n    <FormItem>\n      <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n      <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n        <FormControl>\n          <SelectTrigger>\n            <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n          </SelectTrigger>\n        </FormControl>\n        <SelectContent>\n          <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n          <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n        </SelectContent>\n      </Select>\n      <FormMessage />\n    </FormItem>\n  )}\n/>\n```\n\n### Toast Notifications\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add toast\n```\n\nSetup toast provider in root layout:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({ children }) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\">\n      <body>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nUsing toast:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useToast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ToastDemo() {\n  const { toast } = useToast()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      onClick={() => {\n        toast({\n          title: \"Scheduled: Catch up\",\n          description: \"Friday, February 10, 2023 at 5:57 PM\",\n        })\n      }}\n    >\n      Show Toast\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nToast variants:\n\n```tsx\n// Success\ntoast({\n  title: \"Success\",\n  description: \"Your changes have been saved.\",\n})\n\n// Error\ntoast({\n  variant: \"destructive\",\n  title: \"Error\",\n  description: \"Something went wrong.\",\n})\n\n// With action\ntoast({\n  title: \"Uh oh! Something went wrong.\",\n  description: \"There was a problem with your request.\",\n  action: <ToastAction altText=\"Try again\">Try again</ToastAction>,\n})\n```\n\n### Table Component\n\nInstallation:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add table\n```\n\nBasic table:\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCaption,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n\nconst invoices = [\n  { invoice: \"INV001\", status: \"Paid\", method: \"Credit Card\", amount: \"$250.00\" },\n  { invoice: \"INV002\", status: \"Pending\", method: \"PayPal\", amount: \"$150.00\" },\n]\n\nexport function TableDemo() {\n  return (\n    <Table>\n      <TableCaption>A list of your recent invoices.</TableCaption>\n      <TableHeader>\n        <TableRow>\n          <TableHead>Invoice</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Status</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Method</TableHead>\n          <TableHead className=\"text-right\">Amount</TableHead>\n        </TableRow>\n      </TableHeader>\n      <TableBody>\n        {invoices.map((invoice) => (\n          <TableRow key={invoice.invoice}>\n            <TableCell className=\"font-medium\">{invoice.invoice}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.status}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.method}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell className=\"text-right\">{invoice.amount}</TableCell>\n          </TableRow>\n        ))}\n      </TableBody>\n    </Table>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Customization\n\n### Theming with CSS Variables\n\nshadcn/ui uses CSS variables for theming. Configure in `globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --secondary: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --secondary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --muted: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --muted-foreground: 215.4 16.3% 46.9%;\n    --accent: 210 40% 96.1%;\n    --accent-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    --destructive: 0 84.2% 60.2%;\n    --destructive-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --border: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --input: 214.3 31.8% 91.4%;\n    --ring: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary: 210 40% 98%;\n    --primary-foreground: 222.2 47.4% 11.2%;\n    /* ... other dark mode variables */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Customizing Components\n\nSince you own the code, customize directly:\n\n```tsx\n// components/ui/button.tsx\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90\",\n        destructive: \"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90\",\n        outline: \"border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent\",\n        // Add custom variant\n        custom: \"bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500 text-white\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n        lg: \"h-11 rounded-md px-8\",\n        // Add custom size\n        xl: \"h-14 rounded-md px-10 text-lg\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n\nexport interface ButtonProps\n  extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>,\n    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {\n  asChild?: boolean\n}\n\nconst Button = React.forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>(\n  ({ className, variant, size, asChild = false, ...props }, ref) => {\n    const Comp = asChild ? Slot : \"button\"\n    return (\n      <Comp\n        className={cn(buttonVariants({ variant, size, className }))}\n        ref={ref}\n        {...props}\n      />\n    )\n  }\n)\nButton.displayName = \"Button\"\n\nexport { Button, buttonVariants }\n```\n\n## Next.js Integration\n\n### App Router Setup\n\nFor Next.js 13+ with App Router, ensure components use `\"use client\"` directive:\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport * as React from \"react\"\nimport { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\"\nimport { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\n\n// ... rest of component\n```\n\n### Layout Integration\n\nAdd the Toaster to your root layout:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className=\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\">\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Server Components\n\nWhen using shadcn/ui components in Server Components, wrap them in a Client Component:\n\n```tsx\n// app/dashboard/page.tsx\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { ButtonClient } from \"@/components/ui/button-client\"\n\nexport default function DashboardPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto p-6\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>Dashboard</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <ButtonClient>Interactive Button</ButtonClient>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/button-client.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { Button } from \"./button\"\n\nexport function ButtonClient(props: React.ComponentProps<typeof Button>) {\n  return <Button {...props} />\n}\n```\n\n### Route Handlers with Forms\n\nCreate API routes for form submissions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/api/contact/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \"next/server\"\nimport { z } from \"zod\"\n\nconst contactSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nexport async function POST(request: NextRequest) {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json()\n    const validated = contactSchema.parse(body)\n\n    // Process form data\n    console.log(\"Form submission:\", validated)\n\n    return NextResponse.json({ success: true })\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n      return NextResponse.json(\n        { errors: error.errors },\n        { status: 400 }\n      )\n    }\n\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: \"Internal server error\" },\n      { status: 500 }\n    )\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Form with Server Action\n\nUsing Next.js 14+ Server Actions:\n\n```tsx\n// app/contact/page.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Textarea } from \"@/components/ui/textarea\"\nimport { toast } from \"@/components/ui/use-toast\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  message: z.string().min(10),\n})\n\nasync function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(\"/api/contact\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      body: JSON.stringify(values),\n    })\n\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(\"Failed to submit\")\n\n    toast({\n      title: \"Success!\",\n      description: \"Your message has been sent.\",\n    })\n  } catch (error) {\n    toast({\n      variant: \"destructive\",\n      title: \"Error\",\n      description: \"Failed to send message. Please try again.\",\n    })\n  }\n}\n\nexport default function ContactPage() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto max-w-2xl py-8\">\n      <Form {...form}>\n        <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-6\">\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"name\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Name</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input placeholder=\"Your name\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"email\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" {...field} />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <FormField\n            control={form.control}\n            name=\"message\"\n            render={({ field }) => (\n              <FormItem>\n                <FormLabel>Message</FormLabel>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <Textarea\n                    placeholder=\"Your message...\"\n                    className=\"resize-none\"\n                    {...field}\n                  />\n                </FormControl>\n                <FormMessage />\n              </FormItem>\n            )}\n          />\n\n          <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">\n            Send Message\n          </Button>\n        </form>\n      </Form>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Metadata with shadcn/ui\n\nUsing shadcn/ui components in metadata:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: {\n    default: \"My App\",\n    template: \"%s | My App\",\n  },\n  description: \"Built with shadcn/ui and Next.js\",\n}\n\n// app/about/page.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from \"next\"\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: \"About Us\",\n  description: \"Learn more about our company\",\n}\n\nexport default function AboutPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto py-8\">\n      <Card>\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle>About Our Company</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent>\n          <p>We build amazing products with modern web technologies.</p>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Font Optimization\n\nOptimize fonts with next/font:\n\n```tsx\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Inter } from \"next/font/google\"\nimport { Toaster } from \"@/components/ui/toaster\"\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\"\nimport \"./globals.css\"\n\nconst inter = Inter({ subsets: [\"latin\"] })\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className={cn(\"min-h-screen bg-background font-sans antialiased\", inter.className)}>\n        {children}\n        <Toaster />\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Form with Multiple Fields\n\n```tsx\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2).max(50),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  bio: z.string().max(160).min(4),\n  role: z.enum([\"admin\", \"user\", \"guest\"]),\n  notifications: z.boolean().default(false),\n})\n\nexport function AdvancedForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      username: \"\",\n      email: \"\",\n      bio: \"\",\n      role: \"user\",\n      notifications: false,\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    console.log(values)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-8\">\n        {/* Username field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"johndoe\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Email field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"john@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Textarea field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"bio\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Bio</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Textarea\n                  placeholder=\"Tell us about yourself\"\n                  className=\"resize-none\"\n                  {...field}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Select field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"role\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Role</FormLabel>\n              <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>\n                <FormControl>\n                  <SelectTrigger>\n                    <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a role\" />\n                  </SelectTrigger>\n                </FormControl>\n                <SelectContent>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"admin\">Admin</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"user\">User</SelectItem>\n                  <SelectItem value=\"guest\">Guest</SelectItem>\n                </SelectContent>\n              </Select>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        {/* Checkbox field */}\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"notifications\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem className=\"flex flex-row items-start space-x-3 space-y-0\">\n              <FormControl>\n                <Checkbox\n                  checked={field.value}\n                  onCheckedChange={field.onChange}\n                />\n              </FormControl>\n              <div className=\"space-y-1 leading-none\">\n                <FormLabel>Email notifications</FormLabel>\n                <FormDescription>\n                  Receive emails about your account activity.\n                </FormDescription>\n              </div>\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n\n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Accessibility**: Components use Radix UI primitives for ARIA compliance\n2. **Customization**: Modify components directly in your codebase\n3. **Type Safety**: Use TypeScript for type-safe props and state\n4. **Validation**: Use Zod schemas for form validation\n5. **Styling**: Leverage Tailwind utilities and CSS variables\n6. **Consistency**: Use the same component patterns across your app\n7. **Testing**: Components are testable with React Testing Library\n8. **Performance**: Components are optimized and tree-shakeable\n\n## Common Component Combinations\n\n### Login Form\n\n```tsx\n<Card className=\"w-[350px]\">\n  <CardHeader>\n    <CardTitle>Login</CardTitle>\n    <CardDescription>Enter your credentials to continue</CardDescription>\n  </CardHeader>\n  <CardContent>\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"password\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Password</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"password\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">Login</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  </CardContent>\n</Card>\n```\n\n## References\n\n- Official Docs: https://ui.shadcn.com\n- Radix UI: https://www.radix-ui.com\n- React Hook Form: https://react-hook-form.com\n- Zod: https://zod.dev\n- Tailwind CSS: https://tailwindcss.com\n- Examples: https://ui.shadcn.com/examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:13:15.444Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to build accessible and customizable UI components with shadcn-ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 shadcn-ui、Radix UI 和 Tailwind CSS 构建可访问和可定制的 UI 组件的前端代理。","ja":"shadcn-ui、Radix UI、Tailwind CSS を使用してアクセシブルでカスタマイズ可能な UI コンポーネントを構築する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"shadcn-ui, Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 접근성과 사용자 지정이 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 구축하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan crear componentes de UI accesibles y personalizables con shadcn-ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend qui ont besoin de créer des composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec shadcn-ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die zugängliche und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit shadcn-ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam criar componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis com shadcn-ui, Radix UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимо создавать доступные и настраиваемые компоненты UI с помощью shadcn-ui, Radix UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والقابلة للتخصيص مع shadcn-ui و Radix UI و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create reusable and responsive UI components using shadcn-ui''s component patterns, leveraging Radix UI and Tailwind CSS for styling and customization, and enabling features like form validation and card layouts.","zh":"赋予代理创建可重用和响应式 UI 组件的能力，使用 shadcn-ui 的组件模式，利用 Radix UI 和 Tailwind CSS 进行样式和定制，并实现表单验证和卡片布局等功能。","ja":"エージェントが shadcn-ui のコンポーネント パターンを使用して再利用可能でレスポンシブな UI コンポーネントを作成できるようにし、Radix UI と Tailwind CSS を使用してスタイリングとカスタマイズを行い、フォームの検証やカード レイアウトなどの機能を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 shadcn-ui의 컴포넌트 패턴을 사용하여 재사용 가능하고 반응형 UI 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 스타일링 및 사용자 지정を行하고, 양식 검증 및 카드 레이아웃과 같은 기능을 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de UI reutilizables y responsivos utilizando los patrones de componentes de shadcn-ui, aprovechando Radix UI y Tailwind CSS para el estilo y la personalización, y habilitando funciones como la validación de formularios y los diseños de tarjetas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables et responsifs en utilisant les modèles de composants de shadcn-ui, en exploitant Radix UI et Tailwind CSS pour le style et la personnalisation, et en activant des fonctionnalités comme la validation de formulaires et les dispositions de cartes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, wiederverwendbare und responsive Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten zu erstellen, indem sie die Komponentenmuster von shadcn-ui verwenden, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS für Stil und Anpassung nutzen und Funktionen wie Formularvalidierung und Kartenauslagen aktivieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes de UI reutilizáveis e responsivos usando os padrões de componentes do shadcn-ui, aproveitando o Radix UI e o Tailwind CSS para estilização e personalização, e habilitando recursos como validação de formulários e layouts de cartões.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать многократно используемые и адаптивные компоненты UI, используя шаблоны компонентов shadcn-ui, а также Radix UI и Tailwind CSS для стилизации и настройки, и включающие функции, такие как проверка форм и раскладки карточек.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والاستجابة باستخدام أنماط المكونات من shadcn-ui، وتحقيق التخصيص باستخدام Radix UI و Tailwind CSS، وتمكين الميزات مثل التحقق من صحة النماذج وتصميمات البطاقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Building accessible button components with shadcn-ui","Generating customizable form fields and validation using Radix UI and Tailwind CSS","Creating responsive card layouts with shadcn-ui and Tailwind CSS"],"zh":["使用 shadcn-ui 构建可访问的按钮组件","使用 Radix UI 和 Tailwind CSS 生成可定制的表单字段和验证","使用 shadcn-ui 和 Tailwind CSS 创建响应式卡片布局"],"ja":["shadcn-ui を使用してアクセシブルなボタン コンポーネントを構築する","Radix UI と Tailwind CSS を使用してカスタマイズ可能なフォーム フィールドと検証を生成する","shadcn-ui と Tailwind CSS を使用してレスポンシブなカード レイアウトを作成する"],"ko":["shadcn-ui를 사용하여 접근성 있는 버튼 컴포넌트를 구축한다","Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 사용자 지정 가능한 양식 필드 및 검증을 생성한다","shadcn-ui 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 반응형 카드 레이아웃을 생성한다"],"es":["Creación de componentes de botones accesibles con shadcn-ui","Generación de campos de formularios personalizables y validación utilizando Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","Creación de diseños de tarjetas responsivos con shadcn-ui y Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Création de composants de boutons accessibles avec shadcn-ui","Génération de champs de formulaires personnalisables et de validation en utilisant Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Création de dispositions de cartes responsives avec shadcn-ui et Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Erstellung von zugänglichen Schaltflächenkomponenten mit shadcn-ui","Erzeugung von anpassbaren Formularfeldern und Validierung unter Verwendung von Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Erstellung von responsiven Kartenauslagen mit shadcn-ui und Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Construir componentes de botão acessíveis com shadcn-ui","Gerar campos de formulário personalizáveis e validação usando Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","Criar layouts de cartões responsivos com shadcn-ui e Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Создание доступных компонентов кнопок с помощью shadcn-ui","Генерация настраиваемых полей формы и проверки с помощью Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","Создание адаптивных раскладок карточек с помощью shadcn-ui и Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات زر قابلة للوصول مع shadcn-ui","توليد حقول نموذج قابلة للتخصيص والتحقق باستخدام Radix UI و Tailwind CSS","إنشاء تخطيطات بطاقات مستجيب مع shadcn-ui و Tailwind CSS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of shadcn-ui, Radix UI, and Tailwind CSS","Limited to building UI components, not suitable for backend or full-stack development"],"zh":["需要了解 shadcn-ui、Radix UI 和 Tailwind CSS","仅限于构建 UI 组件，不适合后端或全栈开发"],"ja":["shadcn-ui、Radix UI、Tailwind CSS の知識が必要","UI コンポーネントの構築のみに限定されており、バックエンドやフルスタック開発には適していません"],"ko":["shadcn-ui, Radix UI 및 Tailwind CSS에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","UI 컴포넌트 구축에만 제한되어 있으며, 백엔드 또는 풀스택 개발에는 적합하지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de shadcn-ui, Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","Limitado a la creación de componentes de UI, no apto para el desarrollo de backend o full-stack"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en shadcn-ui, Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Limité à la création de composants d''interface utilisateur, non adapté au développement de backend ou full-stack"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von shadcn-ui, Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten, nicht geeignet für die Entwicklung von Backend oder Full-Stack"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de shadcn-ui, Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","Limitado à construção de componentes de UI, não é adequado para desenvolvimento backend ou full-stack"],"ru":["Требует знания shadcn-ui, Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","Ограничен созданием компонентов UI, не подходит для разработки бэкенда или полноценного стека"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة شاملة لشادكن-يو آي و راديكس يو آي وتايل ويند سي إس","محدود ببناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم، وليس مناسبًا لتطوير الخلفية أو الحزمة الكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sedarged/TikTok-AI-Agent/repo-audit', 'community', 'sedarged', 'TikTok-AI-Agent', 'sedarged/TikTok-AI-Agent', 'repo-audit', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z', '2026-02-18T10:13:42.379Z', NULL, '{"id":"sedarged/TikTok-AI-Agent/repo-audit","name":"repo-audit","description":{"zh":"repo-audit是一种代码仓库审计工具，帮助开发者提高代码质量和安全性。它运行验证管道，生成简洁的markdown报告","ja":"リポジトリ監査ツールはコードの品質とセキュリティを向上させるためのツールです。検証パイプラインを実行し、簡潔なmarkdownレポートを生成します","ko":"코드 저장소 감사 도구는 코드 품질과 보안을 향상시키는 도구입니다. 검증 파이프라인을 실행하고 간결한 markdown 보고서를 생성합니다","es":"El auditor de repositorio ejecuta la validación del pipeline y produce un informe de errores en markdown.","fr":"L''auditeur de référentiel exécute la validation du pipeline et produit un rapport d''erreurs en markdown.","de":"Der Repo-Auditor führt die Validierung des Pipelines aus und erstellt einen Fehlerbericht im Markdown-Format.","pt":"A auditoria de repositório é uma ferramenta que executa a pipeline de validação e gera um relatório em markdown, ajudando a melhorar a qualidade do código.","ru":"Аудит репозитория - это инструмент, который запускает конвейер валидации и генерирует отчет в формате markdown, giúpая улучшить качество кода.","ar":"تدقيق المستودع هو أداة تشغيل pipeline التحقق وتوليد تقرير بالتنسيق markdown، مما يساعد على تحسين جودة الكود.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码仓库审计工具","ja":"リポジトリ監査ツール","ko":"코드 저장소 감사 도구","es":"Auditoría de Repositorio: Validación y Informe","fr":"Audit de Référentiel: Validation et Rapport","de":"Repo-Audit: Validierung und Bericht","pt":"Auditoria de Repositório: Ferramenta de Validação","ru":"Аудит репозитория: инструмент валидации","ar":"تدقيق المستودع: أداة التحقق","en":"repo-audit"},"description":{"zh":"repo-audit是一种代码仓库审计工具，帮助开发者提高代码质量和安全性。它运行验证管道，生成简洁的markdown报告","ja":"リポジトリ監査ツールはコードの品質とセキュリティを向上させるためのツールです。検証パイプラインを実行し、簡潔なmarkdownレポートを生成します","ko":"코드 저장소 감사 도구는 코드 품질과 보안을 향상시키는 도구입니다. 검증 파이프라인을 실행하고 간결한 markdown 보고서를 생성합니다","es":"El auditor de repositorio ejecuta la validación del pipeline y produce un informe de errores en markdown.","fr":"L''auditeur de référentiel exécute la validation du pipeline et produit un rapport d''erreurs en markdown.","de":"Der Repo-Auditor führt die Validierung des Pipelines aus und erstellt einen Fehlerbericht im Markdown-Format.","pt":"A auditoria de repositório é uma ferramenta que executa a pipeline de validação e gera um relatório em markdown, ajudando a melhorar a qualidade do código.","ru":"Аудит репозитория - это инструмент, который запускает конвейер валидации и генерирует отчет в формате markdown, giúpая улучшить качество кода.","ar":"تدقيق المستودع هو أداة تشغيل pipeline التحقق وتوليد تقرير بالتنسيق markdown، مما يساعد على تحسين جودة الكود.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["运行验证管道","生成简洁的markdown报告","检查代码错误","检查安全漏洞","支持自定义范围"],"ja":["検証パイプラインを実行","簡潔なmarkdownレポートを生成","コードのエラーをチェック","セキュリティの脆弱性をチェック","カスタム範囲をサポート"],"ko":["검증 파이프라인을 실행","간결한 markdown 보고서를 생성","코드 오류를 확인","보안 취약점을 확인","사용자 정의 범위를 지원"],"es":["Ejecuta la validación del pipeline","Producción de un informe de errores en markdown","Soporte para pruebas unitarias y de integración","Validación de tipos y análisis de código","Informes personalizables"],"fr":["Exécute la validation du pipeline","Production d''un rapport d''erreurs en markdown","Prise en charge des tests unitaires et d''intégration","Validation des types et analyse de code","Rapports personnalisables"],"de":["Führt die Validierung des Pipelines aus","Erstellung eines Fehlerberichts im Markdown-Format","Unterstützung für Einheitstests und Integrationstests","Validierung von Typen und Code-Analyse","Anpassbare Berichte"],"pt":["Executa a pipeline de validação","Gera um relatório em markdown","Verifica a qualidade do código","Identifica erros e problemas","Melhora a manutenção do código"],"ru":["Запускает конвейер валидации","Генерирует отчет в формате markdown","Проверяет качество кода","Определяет ошибки и проблемы","Улучшает поддержку кода"],"ar":["تشغيل pipeline التحقق","توليد تقرير بالتنسيق markdown","تحقق من جودة الكود","تحديد الأخطاء والمشاكل","تحسين صيانة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审计","代码安全","代码质量","自动化测试","代码检查","代码优化","代码安全工具","代码审计工具"],"ja":["コード監査","コードセキュリティ","コード品質","自動化テスト","コードチェック","コード最適化","コードセキュリティツール","コード監査ツール"],"ko":["코드 감사","코드 보안","코드 품질","자동화 테스트","코드 확인","코드 최적화","코드 보안 도구","코드 감사 도구"],"es":["auditor de repositorio","validación de pipeline","informe de errores","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración","validación de tipos","análisis de código","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["auditeur de référentiel","validation du pipeline","rapport d''erreurs","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration","validation des types","analyse de code","développement de logiciel"],"de":["Repo-Auditor","Validierung des Pipelines","Fehlerbericht","Einheitstests","Integrationstests","Validierung von Typen","Code-Analyse","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["auditoria de repositório","validação de código","qualidade de código","pipeline de validação","relatório em markdown","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["аудит репозитория","валидация кода","качество кода","конвейер валидации","отчет в формате markdown","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تدقيق المستودع","التحقق من الكود","جودة الكود","pipeline التحقق","تقرير بالتنسيق markdown","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"sedarged","repo":"TikTok-AI-Agent","repoPath":"sedarged/TikTok-AI-Agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"repo-audit","description":"Run lint, typecheck, test, and test:render; collect results and produce a short audit report. Use when asked to audit the repo, check project health, or run full validation.","bodyPreview":"# Repo Audit\n\nRun the validation pipeline and produce a short markdown report.\n\n## Input\n\n- Open workspace (TikTok-AI-Agent). Optionally a \"scope\" (e.g. \"backend only\") – still run from root; you may skip `test:e2e` if scope is backend-only.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. From repo root, run in order:\n   - `npm run lint` – note pass or first ~5 lines of errors.\n   - `npm run typecheck` – note pass or first ~5 lines of errors.\n   - `npm run test` – note pass or failing test names/messages.\n   - `npm run test:rend","body":"# Repo Audit\n\nRun the validation pipeline and produce a short markdown report.\n\n## Input\n\n- Open workspace (TikTok-AI-Agent). Optionally a \"scope\" (e.g. \"backend only\") – still run from root; you may skip `test:e2e` if scope is backend-only.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. From repo root, run in order:\n   - `npm run lint` – note pass or first ~5 lines of errors.\n   - `npm run typecheck` – note pass or first ~5 lines of errors.\n   - `npm run test` – note pass or failing test names/messages.\n   - `npm run test:render` – note pass or failures.\n2. Optionally `npm run test:e2e` if full audit (requires Playwright browsers).\n3. Produce a **short markdown report** with:\n   - Each step: **ok** or **fail** + summary.\n   - Final line: **Audit: pass** or **Audit: fail** and list of failed steps.\n\n## Output\n\nA concise report, e.g.:\n\n```markdown\n## Repo audit\n\n- `npm run lint` – ok\n- `npm run typecheck` – ok\n- `npm run test` – ok\n- `npm run test:render` – ok\n\n**Audit: pass**\n```\n\nOr, on failure, which steps failed and the first few error lines.\n\n## References\n\n- [.cursor/commands/validate.md](.cursor/commands/validate.md) – validate command (same steps, no report format)\n- [docs/testing.md](../../docs/testing.md) – test setup, env, commands\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:13:42.379Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring automated validation and testing of JavaScript repositories using npm scripts.","zh":"适用于需要自动验证和测试使用npm脚本的JavaScript仓库的代码审查代理。","ja":"npmスクリプトを使用してJavaScriptリポジトリを自動検証およびテストするコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"npm 스크립트를 사용하여 자바스크립트 저장소를 자동으로 검증 및 테스트해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren validación y prueba automatizadas de repositorios de JavaScript utilizando scripts de npm.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant une validation et des tests automatisés de dépôts JavaScript utilisant des scripts npm.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agenten, die automatisierte Validierung und Tests von JavaScript-Repositorys unter Verwendung von npm-Skripten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem validação e teste automatizados de repositórios JavaScript usando scripts npm.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, требующих автоматизированной проверки и тестирования репозиториев JavaScript с использованием скриптов npm.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الشفرة التي تتطلب التحقق والاختبار التلقائي لمستودعات جافا سكريبت باستخدام نصوص npm."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run validation pipelines, executing npm commands like lint, typecheck, and test, to produce markdown reports on code quality and test results, utilizing protocols like npm run and markdown formatting.","zh":"赋予代理运行验证管道的能力，执行npm命令（如lint、typecheck和test），生成有关代码质量和测试结果的markdown报告，利用npm run和markdown格式化等协议。","ja":"npmコマンド（lint、typecheck、testなど）を実行して検証パイプラインを実行し、コード品質とテスト結果のMarkdownレポートを生成するようにエージェントに権限を与え、npm runやMarkdown形式などのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"npm 명령어(lint, typecheck, test 등)을 실행하여 검증 파이프라인을 실행하고 코드 품질 및 테스트 결과에 대한 마크다운 보고서를 생성하며, npm run 및 마크다운 형식화 등의 프로토콜을 활용하여 에이전트에 권한을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar pipelines de validación, ejecutando comandos de npm como lint, typecheck y test, para producir informes en markdown sobre la calidad del código y los resultados de las pruebas, utilizando protocolos como npm run y formato de markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des pipelines de validation, en exécutant des commandes npm comme lint, typecheck et test, pour produire des rapports markdown sur la qualité du code et les résultats des tests, en utilisant des protocoles tels que npm run et mise en forme markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Validierungspipelines auszuführen, indem npm-Befehle wie lint, typecheck und test ausgeführt werden, um Markdown-Berichte über die Codequalität und die Testergebnisse zu erstellen, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie npm run und Markdown-Formatierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar pipelines de validação, executando comandos npm como lint, typecheck e test, para produzir relatórios em markdown sobre a qualidade do código e os resultados dos testes, utilizando protocolos como npm run e formatação markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать конвейеры проверки, выполняя команды npm, такие как lint, typecheck и test, для получения отчетов в формате markdown о качестве кода и результатах тестирования, используя протоколы, такие как npm run и форматирование markdown.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تشغيل خطوط أنابيب التحقق ، والتشغيل الآلي للأوامر npm مثل lint و typecheck و test ، لإنتاج تقارير بالتنسيق markdown حول جودة الشفرة ونتائج الاختبار ، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تشغيل npm وتنسيق markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code quality checks with npm run lint","Validating JavaScript type definitions using npm run typecheck","Debugging failing tests with npm run test"],"zh":["使用npm run lint自动执行代码质量检查","使用npm run typecheck验证JavaScript类型定义","使用npm run test调试失败的测试"],"ja":["npm run lintを使用してコード品質チェックを自動化する","npm run typecheckを使用してJavaScriptの型定義を検証する","npm run testを使用して失敗したテストをデバッグする"],"ko":["npm run lint를 사용하여 코드 품질 검사를 자동화합니다","npm run typecheck를 사용하여 자바스크립트 유형 정의를 검증합니다","npm run test를 사용하여 실패한 테스트를 디버깅합니다"],"es":["Automatizar las comprobaciones de calidad del código con npm run lint","Validar definiciones de tipo de JavaScript utilizando npm run typecheck","Depurar pruebas fallidas con npm run test"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications de qualité de code avec npm run lint","Valider les définitions de type JavaScript en utilisant npm run typecheck","Déboguer les tests qui échouent avec npm run test"],"de":["Automatisierung von Codequalitätsprüfungen mit npm run lint","Validierung von JavaScript-Typdefinitionen unter Verwendung von npm run typecheck","Fehlerbehebung von fehlgeschlagenen Tests mit npm run test"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de qualidade de código com npm run lint","Validar definições de tipo JavaScript usando npm run typecheck","Depurar testes com falha com npm run test"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки качества кода с помощью npm run lint","Проверять определения типов JavaScript с помощью npm run typecheck","Отладить неудачные тесты с помощью npm run test"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في فحوصات جودة الشفرة باستخدام npm run lint","التحقق من تعريفات نوع جافا سكريبت باستخدام npm run typecheck","تصحيح الأعطال في الاختبارات باستخدام npm run test"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation","JavaScript repository only","Runs from repository root"],"zh":["需要npm安装","仅支持JavaScript仓库","仅从仓库根目录运行"],"ja":["npmのインストールが必要","JavaScriptリポジトリのみをサポート","リポジトリのルートディレクトリのみから実行"],"ko":["npm 설치가 필요합니다","자바스크립트 저장소만 지원합니다","저장소 루트 디렉토리에서만 실행됩니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación de npm","Solo repositorio de JavaScript","Se ejecuta desde la raíz del repositorio"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm","Dépôt JavaScript uniquement","S''exécute à partir de la racine du dépôt"],"de":["Benötigt npm-Installation","Nur JavaScript-Repository","Wird vom Repository-Stammverzeichnis aus ausgeführt"],"pt":["Exige instalação do npm","Repositório JavaScript apenas","Executa a partir da raiz do repositório"],"ru":["Требует установки npm","Только репозиторий JavaScript","Выполняется из корня репозитория"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm","مستودع جافا سكريبت فقط","يتشغيل من 根 المستودع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
