l''exécution des chaînes","Surveillance des performances en production","Analyse de l''efficacité des requêtes","Identification des goulets d''étranglement"],"de":["Fehlersuche im Verhalten von Agenten","Verfolgung der Ausführung von Ketten","Überwachung der Leistung in der Produktion","Analyse der Effektivität von Anfragen","Identifizierung von Engpässen"],"pt":["Geração de sistemas de agentes de IDE","Depuração e monitoramento de aplicações LangChain/LangGraph","Suporte a blueprints para SAP, Python e Cloud-Native","Recursos de refatoração para projetos existentes","Integração com LangChain e LangGraph"],"ru":["Создание систем агентов Cursor IDE","Отладка и мониторинг приложений LangChain/LangGraph","Поддержка.blueprints для SAP, Python и Cloud-Native","Возможности рефакторинга для существующих проектов","Интеграция с LangChain и LangGraph"],"ar":["إنشاء أنظمة وكلاء Cursor IDE","تصحيح الأخطاء ومراقبة تطبيقات LangChain/LangGraph","دعم قوالب ل SAP و Python و Cloud-Native","ميزات إعادة هيكلة للمشاريع الحالية","الدمج مع LangChain و LangGraph"]},"keywords":{"es":["LangSmith Tracing","depuración de aplicaciones","monitoreo de rendimiento","LangChain","LangGraph","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["LangSmith Tracing","débogage d''applications","surveillance des performances","LangChain","LangGraph","développement d''applications"],"de":["LangSmith Tracing","Fehlersuche in Anwendungen","Überwachung der Leistung","LangChain","LangGraph","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["LangSmith Tracing","Desenvolvimento de agentes de IDE","Depuração de aplicações LangChain/LangGraph","Monitoramento de aplicações LangChain/LangGraph","LangChain","LangGraph","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native"],"ru":["LangSmith Tracing","Создание систем агентов Cursor IDE","Отладка приложений LangChain/LangGraph","Мониторинг приложений LangChain/LangGraph","LangChain","LangGraph","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native"],"ar":["LangSmith Tracing","إنشاء أنظمة وكلاء Cursor IDE","تصحيح الأخطاء تطبيقات LangChain/LangGraph","مراقبة تطبيقات LangChain/LangGraph","LangChain","LangGraph","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langsmith-tracing","description":"Tracing and debugging for LangChain/LangGraph applications","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# LangSmith Tracing Skill\n\nDebug, trace, and monitor LangChain/LangGraph applications with LangSmith.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Debugging agent behavior\n- Tracing chain execution\n- Monitoring production performance\n- Analyzing prompt effectiveness\n- Identifying bottlenecks\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install langsmith\n```\n\nSet environment variables:\n```bash\nLANGSMITH_API_KEY=your_api_key\nLANGSMITH_PROJECT=your_project_name\nLANGSMITH_TRACING=true\n```\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Enable Automatic Tracing","body":"# LangSmith Tracing Skill\n\nDebug, trace, and monitor LangChain/LangGraph applications with LangSmith.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Debugging agent behavior\n- Tracing chain execution\n- Monitoring production performance\n- Analyzing prompt effectiveness\n- Identifying bottlenecks\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install langsmith\n```\n\nSet environment variables:\n```bash\nLANGSMITH_API_KEY=your_api_key\nLANGSMITH_PROJECT=your_project_name\nLANGSMITH_TRACING=true\n```\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Enable Automatic Tracing\n\n```python\nimport os\n\n# Enable tracing via environment\nos.environ[\"LANGSMITH_TRACING\"] = \"true\"\nos.environ[\"LANGSMITH_PROJECT\"] = \"langchain-agent-platform\"\n\n# All LangChain operations are now traced automatically\n```\n\n### Step 2: Use @traceable Decorator\n\n```python\nfrom langsmith import traceable\n\n@traceable(name=\"market_analysis\", tags=[\"trading\", \"analysis\"])\nasync def analyze_market(symbol: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Analyze market - this function is traced.\"\"\"\n    # Your analysis code\n    return {\"symbol\": symbol, \"recommendation\": \"buy\"}\n\n@traceable(run_type=\"chain\")\nasync def process_document(doc: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Process document - traced as a chain.\"\"\"\n    return await chain.ainvoke({\"input\": doc})\n\n@traceable(run_type=\"tool\")\ndef calculate_metrics(data: list) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Calculate metrics - traced as a tool.\"\"\"\n    return {\"mean\": sum(data) / len(data)}\n```\n\n### Step 3: Custom Tracing Context\n\n```python\nfrom langsmith import trace\nfrom langsmith.run_helpers import get_current_run_tree\n\n@traceable\nasync def complex_workflow(input_data: dict):\n    # Access current trace\n    run_tree = get_current_run_tree()\n    run_id = run_tree.id if run_tree else None\n    \n    # Add metadata to trace\n    if run_tree:\n        run_tree.extra[\"custom_field\"] = \"value\"\n    \n    # Nested traces\n    result1 = await step_one(input_data)\n    result2 = await step_two(result1)\n    \n    return result2\n\n# Manual trace context\nasync def manual_trace_example():\n    with trace(\n        name=\"manual_operation\",\n        run_type=\"chain\",\n        tags=[\"manual\", \"example\"],\n        metadata={\"version\": \"1.0\"}\n    ) as run:\n        # Your code here\n        run.end(outputs={\"result\": \"success\"})\n```\n\n### Step 4: Trace LangGraph Workflows\n\n```python\nfrom langgraph.graph import StateGraph\nfrom langsmith import traceable\n\n# Graph nodes are automatically traced\nasync def traced_node(state: dict) -> dict:\n    # This is traced as part of the graph\n    return state\n\n# Add custom tracing to nodes\n@traceable(name=\"custom_node\", tags=[\"langgraph\"])\nasync def custom_traced_node(state: dict) -> dict:\n    # Explicit tracing with custom name\n    return state\n\n# Compile with tracing\ngraph = StateGraph(AgentState)\ngraph.add_node(\"my_node\", traced_node)\napp = graph.compile()\n\n# Invoke - entire graph execution is traced\nresult = await app.ainvoke(\n    {\"messages\": []},\n    config={\"run_name\": \"my_workflow_run\"}\n)\n```\n\n### Step 5: MCP Integration for Debugging\n\nUse LangSmith MCP server for IDE-integrated debugging:\n\n```python\n# In aisuite with MCP\nimport aisuite as ai\n\nclient = ai.Client()\n\nresponse = client.chat.completions.create(\n    model=\"google:gemini-2.5-flash\",\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Debug this workflow\"}],\n    tools=[{\n        \"type\": \"mcp\",\n        \"name\": \"langsmith\",\n        \"command\": \"npx\",\n        \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@langchain/langsmith-mcp\"]\n    }],\n    max_turns=3\n)\n```\n\n### Step 6: Analyze Traces\n\n```python\nfrom langsmith import Client\n\nclient = Client()\n\n# Get recent runs\nruns = client.list_runs(\n    project_name=\"langchain-agent-platform\",\n    filter=''eq(status, \"error\")'',  # Filter for errors\n    limit=10\n)\n\nfor run in runs:\n    print(f\"Run: {run.name}\")\n    print(f\"  Status: {run.status}\")\n    print(f\"  Latency: {run.latency_ms}ms\")\n    print(f\"  Error: {run.error}\")\n\n# Get run details\nrun = client.read_run(run_id=\"...\")\nprint(f\"Inputs: {run.inputs}\")\nprint(f\"Outputs: {run.outputs}\")\nprint(f\"Trace: {run.trace_id}\")\n```\n\n### Step 7: Feedback and Evaluation\n\n```python\nfrom langsmith import Client\n\nclient = Client()\n\n# Add feedback to a run\nclient.create_feedback(\n    run_id=\"run_123\",\n    key=\"correctness\",\n    score=1.0,\n    comment=\"Response was accurate\"\n)\n\n# Create dataset for evaluation\ndataset = client.create_dataset(\"qa_pairs\")\nclient.create_example(\n    dataset_id=dataset.id,\n    inputs={\"question\": \"What is 2+2?\"},\n    outputs={\"answer\": \"4\"}\n)\n\n# Run evaluation\nfrom langsmith.evaluation import evaluate\n\ndef accuracy_evaluator(run, example):\n    return {\"score\": 1.0 if run.outputs == example.outputs else 0.0}\n\nresults = evaluate(\n    my_chain.invoke,\n    data=\"qa_pairs\",\n    evaluators=[accuracy_evaluator]\n)\n```\n\n## Tracing Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Decorator |\n|---------|-----------|\n| Function | `@traceable` |\n| Chain | `@traceable(run_type=\"chain\")` |\n| Tool | `@traceable(run_type=\"tool\")` |\n| LLM | `@traceable(run_type=\"llm\")` |\n| Retriever | `@traceable(run_type=\"retriever\")` |\n\n## Debugging Tips\n\n### Find Slow Operations\n```python\nruns = client.list_runs(\n    project_name=\"my_project\",\n    filter=''gt(latency_ms, 5000)'',  # > 5 seconds\n)\n```\n\n### Find Errors by Type\n```python\nruns = client.list_runs(\n    project_name=\"my_project\",\n    filter=''and(eq(status, \"error\"), contains(error, \"rate limit\"))'',\n)\n```\n\n### Compare Runs\n```python\n# Get similar runs for comparison\nrun_a = client.read_run(\"run_a_id\")\nrun_b = client.read_run(\"run_b_id\")\n\n# Compare latencies, outputs, etc.\nprint(f\"Run A: {run_a.latency_ms}ms\")\nprint(f\"Run B: {run_b.latency_ms}ms\")\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Always set `LANGSMITH_PROJECT` for organization\n- Use meaningful run names and tags\n- Add metadata for filtering\n- Create datasets for regression testing\n- Set up alerts for error rates\n- Review traces regularly during development\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Fix |\n|--------------|-----|\n| No project set | Always set `LANGSMITH_PROJECT` |\n| Missing tags | Add relevant tags for filtering |\n| No error handling | Wrap traced functions in try/catch |\n| Ignoring traces | Review traces during development |\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\n# Required\nLANGSMITH_API_KEY=lsv2_...\n\n# Recommended\nLANGSMITH_PROJECT=langchain-agent-platform\nLANGSMITH_TRACING=true\n\n# Optional\nLANGSMITH_ENDPOINT=https://api.smith.langchain.com\n```\n\n## Related\n\n- Knowledge: `{directories.knowledge}/mcp-patterns.json`\n- Skill: `langchain-usage`\n- Skill: `langgraph-agent-building`\n- MCP: LangSmith MCP Server\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:14:12.418Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for LangChain Agents needing advanced tracing and debugging capabilities for their applications","zh":"非常适合需要高级追踪和调试功能的 LangChain 代理应用程序","ja":"LangChain エージェントに高度なトレースとデバッグ機能を必要とするアプリケーションに最適","ko":"고급 추적 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 LangChain 에이전트 애플리케이션에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de LangChain que necesitan capacidades de rastreo y depuración avanzadas para sus aplicaciones","fr":"Parfait pour les agents LangChain ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de traçage et de débogage avancées pour leurs applications","de":"Perfekt für LangChain-Agents, die erweiterte Ablaufverfolgungs- und Debugging-Funktionen für ihre Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes LangChain que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de rastreamento e depuração para seus aplicativos","ru":"Идеально для агентов LangChain, которым требуются продвинутые возможности отслеживания и отладки для своих приложений","ar":"مثالي لعميل لانغ تشين الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتعقب وأخطاء لتنفيذ تطبيقاتهم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to debug, trace, and monitor LangChain/LangGraph applications with automatic tracing, supporting blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more, using the LangSmith library and environment variables like LANGSMITH_API_KEY and LANGSMITH_PROJECT","zh":"赋予代理调试、追踪和监视 LangChain/LangGraph 应用程序的能力，支持使用 LangSmith 库和环境变量如 LANGSMITH_API_KEY 和 LANGSMITH_PROJECT 的自动追踪，包括 SAP、Python、云原生等蓝图","ja":"LangChain/LangGraph アプリケーションをデバッグ、トレース、および監視するエージェントを可能にし、LangSmith ライブラリと環境変数 such as LANGSMITH_API_KEY と LANGSMITH_PROJECT を使用した自動トレースをサポート、SAP、Python、クラウドネイティブなどを含むブループリント","ko":"LangChain/LangGraph 애플리케이션을 디버깅, 추적 및 모니터링 할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, LangSmith 라이브러리와 환경 변수 such as LANGSMITH_API_KEY 및 LANGSMITH_PROJECT를 사용한 자동 추적을 지원, SAP, Python, 클라우드 네이티브 등을 포함한 블루프린트","es":"Habilita a los agentes a depurar, rastrear y monitorear aplicaciones de LangChain/LangGraph con un rastreo automático, que admite plantillas para SAP, Python, Cloud-Native y más, utilizando la biblioteca LangSmith y variables de entorno como LANGSMITH_API_KEY y LANGSMITH_PROJECT","fr":"Permet aux agents de déboguer, de traçer et de surveiller les applications LangChain/LangGraph avec un traçage automatique, en prenant en charge des modèles pour SAP, Python, Cloud-Native et plus, en utilisant la bibliothèque LangSmith et des variables d''environnement comme LANGSMITH_API_KEY et LANGSMITH_PROJECT","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, LangChain/LangGraph-Anwendungen mit automatischer Ablaufverfolgung zu debuggen, zu verfolgen und zu überwachen, wobei Vorlagen für SAP, Python, Cloud-Native und mehr unterstützt werden, unter Verwendung der LangSmith-Bibliothek und Umgebungsvariablen wie LANGSMITH_API_KEY und LANGSMITH_PROJECT","pt":"Habilita os agentes a depurar, rastrear e monitorar aplicações LangChain/LangGraph com rastreamento automático, suportando blueprints para SAP, Python, Cloud-Native e mais, usando a biblioteca LangSmith e variáveis de ambiente como LANGSMITH_API_KEY e LANGSMITH_PROJECT","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отлаживать, отслеживать и контролировать приложения LangChain/LangGraph с автоматическим отслеживанием, поддерживая чертежи для SAP, Python, Cloud-Native и многое другое, используя библиотеку LangSmith и переменные среды как LANGSMITH_API_KEY и LANGSMITH_PROJECT","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية اختبار، وتعقب، ورصد تطبيقات لانغ تشين/لانغ غراف مع التعقب التلقائي، ودعم مخططات ل sap، بايثون، سحابي أصلي، وأكثر، باستخدام مكتبة لانغ سميث ومتغيرات بيئة مثل لانغ سميث api مفتاح ولانغ سميث مشروع"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging agent behavior in LangChain applications","Tracing chain execution for performance optimization","Monitoring production performance with LangSmith","Analyzing prompt effectiveness in LangGraph workflows"],"zh":["调试 LangChain 应用程序中的代理行为","追踪链执行以优化性能","使用 LangSmith 监控生产性能","分析 LangGraph 工作流中的提示有效性"],"ja":["LangChain アプリケーション内のエージェントの動作をデバッグする","パフォーマンスの最適化のためのチェーンの実行をトレースする","LangSmith を使用して生産性のパフォーマンスを監視する","LangGraph ワークフロー内のヒントの有効性を分析する"],"ko":["LangChain 애플리케이션 내 에이전트 동작 디버깅","성능 최적화를 위한 체인 실행 추적","LangSmith를 사용한 생산성 성능 모니터링","LangGraph 워크플로우 내 힌트 효과 분석"],"es":["Depuración del comportamiento del agente en aplicaciones de LangChain","Rastreo de la ejecución de la cadena para la optimización del rendimiento","Monitoreo del rendimiento de producción con LangSmith","Análisis de la eficacia de las solicitudes en flujos de trabajo de LangGraph"],"fr":["Débogage du comportement de l''agent dans les applications LangChain","Traçage de l''exécution de la chaîne pour l''optimisation des performances","Surveillance des performances de production avec LangSmith","Analyse de l''efficacité des invitations dans les flux de travail LangGraph"],"de":["Debugging des Agent-Verhaltens in LangChain-Anwendungen","Ablaufverfolgung der Chain-Ausführung zur Leistungsoptimierung","Überwachung der Produktionsleistung mit LangSmith","Analyse der Effektivität von Anfragen in LangGraph-Workflows"],"pt":["Depuração do comportamento do agente em aplicações LangChain","Rastreamento da execução da cadeia para otimização de desempenho","Monitoramento do desempenho de produção com LangSmith","Análise da eficácia da solicitação em fluxos de trabalho LangGraph"],"ru":["Отладка поведения агента в приложениях LangChain","Отслеживание выполнения цепочки для оптимизации производительности","Мониторинг производительности с помощью LangSmith","Анализ эффективности запроса в рабочих процессах LangGraph"],"ar":["اختبار سلوك العميل في تطبيقات لانغ تشين","تعقب تنفيذ السلسلة لتحسين الأداء","رصد أداء الإنتاج مع لانغ سميث","تحليل فعالية الطلب في تدفقات عمل لانغ غراف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LangSmith installation via pip","Needs environment variables like LANGSMITH_API_KEY and LANGSMITH_PROJECT to be set","Limited to LangChain and LangGraph applications"],"zh":["需要通过 pip 安装 LangSmith","需要设置环境变量如 LANGSMITH_API_KEY 和 LANGSMITH_PROJECT","仅限 LangChain 和 LangGraph 应用程序"],"ja":["LangSmith を pip 経由でインストールする必要がある","環境変数 such as LANGSMITH_API_KEY と LANGSMITH_PROJECT を設定する必要がある","LangChain および LangGraph アプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["LangSmith를 pip를 통해 설치해야 함","환경 변수 such as LANGSMITH_API_KEY 및 LANGSMITH_PROJECT를 설정해야 함","LangChain 및 LangGraph 애플리케이션에 한정"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de LangSmith a través de pip","Necesita variables de entorno como LANGSMITH_API_KEY y LANGSMITH_PROJECT para ser configuradas","Limitado a aplicaciones de LangChain y LangGraph"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de LangSmith via pip","A besoin de variables d''environnement comme LANGSMITH_API_KEY et LANGSMITH_PROJECT pour être configurées","Limité aux applications LangChain et LangGraph"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von LangSmith über pip","Benötigt Umgebungsvariablen wie LANGSMITH_API_KEY und LANGSMITH_PROJECT, die konfiguriert werden müssen","Begrenzt auf LangChain- und LangGraph-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do LangSmith via pip","Necessita de variáveis de ambiente como LANGSMITH_API_KEY e LANGSMITH_PROJECT para serem definidas","Limitado a aplicações LangChain e LangGraph"],"ru":["Требует установки LangSmith через pip","Требует переменных среды как LANGSMITH_API_KEY и LANGSMITH_PROJECT для их определения","Ограничен приложениями LangChain и LangGraph"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت لانغ سميث عبر بايب","يحتاج إلى متغيرات بيئة مثل لانغ سميث api مفتاح ولانغ سميث مشروع لتحديدها","محدود بتطبيقات لانغ تشين و لانغ غراف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
