for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more. Includes refactoring capabilities for existing projects"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Anthropic Patterns 技术","ja":"Anthropic パターン スキル","ko":"인간형 패턴 기술","es":"Patrones Antropicos: Desarrolla Agentes con Claude","fr":"Modèles Anthropiques: Créez des Agents avec Claude","de":"Anthropische Muster: Entwickle Agenten mit Claude","pt":"Padrões Antropicos: Desenvolvimento de Agentes com Claude","ru":"Антропические узоры: разработка агентов с Claude","ar":"أنماط متجانسة: تطوير وكلاء مع Claude","en":"anthropic-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Anthropic Patterns是一个可配置的工厂，用于生成Cursor IDE开发代理系统，支持蓝图和重构","ja":"Anthropicパターンは、Cursor IDE開発エージェントシステムを生成する構成可能なファクトリーであり、ブループリントとリファクタリングをサポートします","ko":"인간형 패턴은 Cursor IDE 개발 에이전트 시스템을 생성하는 구성 가능한 팩토리이며, 블루프린트 및 리팩토링을 지원합니다","es":"Los patrones antropicos son una fábrica configurable para generar sistemas de agentes de desarrollo de Cursor IDE. Soporta tecnologías como SAP, Python y Clo...","fr":"Les modèles anthropiques sont une usine configurable pour générer des systèmes d''agents de développement de Cursor IDE. Ils prennent en charge des technologi...","de":"Die anthropischen Muster sind eine konfigurierbare Fabrik zur Erstellung von Entwicklungsagentensystemen für Cursor IDE. Sie unterstützen Technologien wie SA...","pt":"O padrão antropico é uma fábrica configurável para gerar sistemas de agentes de desenvolvimento para qualquer pilha de tecnologia. Ele suporta blueprints par...","ru":"Антропический узор - это настраиваемая фабрика для создания систем разработки агентов для любой технологической стека. Он поддерживает чертежи для SAP, Pytho...","ar":"النمط المتجانس هو مصنع قابل للتهيئة لإنشاء أنظمة وكلاء التطوير لأي حزمة تقنية. يدعم مخططات ل SAP و Python و Cloud-Native وأكثر","en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stac..."},"definition":{"en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stack. Supports blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more. Includes refactoring capabilities for existing projects"},"features":{"zh":["支持蓝图","可配置的开发代理系统","安全性和对齐控制","重构功能","集成LangChain工作流"],"ja":["ブループリントのサポート","構成可能な開発エージェントシステム","安全性と整列制御","リファクタリング機能","LangChainワークフローの統合"],"ko":["블루프린트 지원","구성 가능한 개발 에이전트 시스템","안전성 및 정렬 제어","리팩토링 기능","LangChain 워크플로우 통합"],"es":["Generación de sistemas de agentes de desarrollo de Cursor IDE","Soporte para tecnologías como SAP, Python y Cloud-Native","Capacidades de refactorización para proyectos existentes","Integración con flujos de trabajo de LangChain","Implementación de bucles de herramientas que continúan hasta la finalización","Seguridad y controles de alineación avanzados"],"fr":["Génération de systèmes d''agents de développement de Cursor IDE","Prise en charge des technologies comme SAP, Python et Cloud-Native","Capacités de réorganisation pour les projets existants","Intégration avec les flux de travail de LangChain","Mise en œuvre de boucles d''outils qui continuent jusqu''à la fin","Sécurité et contrôles d''alignement avancés"],"de":["Erstellung von Entwicklungsagentensystemen für Cursor IDE","Unterstützung für Technologien wie SAP, Python und Cloud-Native","Fähigkeiten zur Umstrukturierung bestehender Projekte","Integration mit LangChain-Workflows","Implementierung von Tool-Schleifen, die bis zur Fertigstellung fortgesetzt werden","Erweiterte Sicherheits- und Ausrichtungskontrollen"],"pt":["Criação de agentes personalizados com Claude","Suporte a blueprints para SAP, Python, Cloud-Native e mais","Implementação de loops de ferramentas e controls de segurança","Integração com LangChain workflows","Refatoração de projetos existentes"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных агентов с Claude","Поддержка чертежей для SAP, Python, Cloud-Native и более","Реализация циклов инструментов и контроли безопасности","Интеграция с LangChain workflows","Рефакторинг существующих проектов"],"ar":["إنشاء وكلاء مخصصين مع Claude","دعم مخططات ل SAP و Python و Cloud-Native وأكثر","تنفيذ حلقات أدوات وضوابط أمان","التكامل مع LangChain workflows","إعادة هيكلة المشاريع الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Anthropic Patterns","Cursor IDE","开发代理系统","安全性","对齐控制","LangChain","重构"],"ja":["Anthropicパターン","Cursor IDE","開発エージェントシステム","安全性","整列制御","LangChain","リファクタリング"],"ko":["인간형 패턴","Cursor IDE","개발 에이전트 시스템","안전성","정렬 제어","LangChain","리팩토링"],"es":["patrones antropicos","desarrollo de agentes","Cursor IDE","tecnologías de desarrollo","seguridad y alineación","refactorización de proyectos","flujos de trabajo de LangChain","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["modèles anthropiques","développement d''agents","Cursor IDE","technologies de développement","sécurité et alignement","réorganisation de projets","flux de travail de LangChain","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["anthropische Muster","Entwicklung von Agenten","Cursor IDE","Entwicklungstechnologien","Sicherheit und Ausrichtung","Umstrukturierung von Projekten","LangChain-Workflows","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["padrão antropico","desenvolvimento de agentes","Claude","LangChain","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","segurança","refatoração"],"ru":["антропический узор","разработка агентов","Claude","LangChain","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","безопасность","рефакторинг"],"ar":["النمط المتجانس","تطوير الوكلاء","Claude","LangChain","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","أمان","إعادة هيكلة"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"anthropic-patterns","description":"Claude agentic loop patterns - tool use until done, extended thinking for complex reasoning, safety and alignment patterns, LangChain ChatAnthropic integration","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Anthropic Patterns Skill\n\nImplement Claude-powered agents using Anthropic''s agentic loop patterns, extended thinking, and safety best practices.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building agents with Claude models (Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Opus, Haiku)\n- Implementing tool-use loops that continue until completion\n- Needing extended thinking for complex reasoning\n- Requiring safety and alignment controls\n- Integrating Claude with LangChain workflows\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install langchain-anthropic langchai","body":"# Anthropic Patterns Skill\n\nImplement Claude-powered agents using Anthropic''s agentic loop patterns, extended thinking, and safety best practices.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building agents with Claude models (Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Opus, Haiku)\n- Implementing tool-use loops that continue until completion\n- Needing extended thinking for complex reasoning\n- Requiring safety and alignment controls\n- Integrating Claude with LangChain workflows\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install langchain-anthropic langchain-core\n# Or\npip install anthropic\n```\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Basic Claude Agentic Loop\n\nImplement the tool-use-until-done pattern:\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_anthropic import ChatAnthropic\nfrom langchain_core.messages import HumanMessage, AIMessage, ToolMessage\nfrom langchain_core.tools import tool\nimport json\n\nllm = ChatAnthropic(\n    model=\"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022\",\n    temperature=0.7,\n    max_tokens=4096\n)\n\n# Define tools\n@tool\ndef get_weather(location: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Get current weather for a location.\n    \n    Args:\n        location: City name or coordinates\n    \"\"\"\n    # Implementation\n    return f\"Sunny, 72°F in {location}\"\n\n@tool\ndef search_database(query: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Search internal database for information.\n    \n    Args:\n        query: Search query\n    \"\"\"\n    # Implementation\n    return f\"Database results for: {query}\"\n\ntools = [get_weather, search_database]\nllm_with_tools = llm.bind_tools(tools)\n\n# Agentic loop - continue until done\nasync def claude_agentic_loop(user_query: str, max_iterations: int = 10):\n    \"\"\"Run Claude agentic loop until completion.\"\"\"\n    messages = [HumanMessage(content=user_query)]\n    iteration = 0\n    \n    while iteration < max_iterations:\n        # Get Claude''s response\n        response = await llm_with_tools.ainvoke(messages)\n        messages.append(response)\n        \n        # Check if Claude is done\n        if not response.tool_calls:\n            # No more tool calls - agent is finished\n            return response.content\n        \n        # Execute tool calls\n        for tool_call in response.tool_calls:\n            tool_name = tool_call[\"name\"]\n            tool_args = tool_call[\"args\"]\n            tool_id = tool_call[\"id\"]\n            \n            # Find and execute tool\n            tool_map = {t.name: t for t in tools}\n            if tool_name in tool_map:\n                tool_result = await tool_map[tool_name].ainvoke(tool_args)\n                messages.append(ToolMessage(\n                    content=str(tool_result),\n                    tool_call_id=tool_id\n                ))\n            else:\n                messages.append(ToolMessage(\n                    content=f\"Error: Tool {tool_name} not found\",\n                    tool_call_id=tool_id\n                ))\n        \n        iteration += 1\n    \n    # Max iterations reached\n    return \"Maximum iterations reached. Agent may not have completed the task.\"\n\n# Usage\nresult = await claude_agentic_loop(\"What''s the weather in NYC and search for AI articles?\")\nprint(result)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Extended Thinking Pattern\n\nUse Claude''s extended thinking for complex reasoning:\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_anthropic import ChatAnthropic\n\nllm_thinking = ChatAnthropic(\n    model=\"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022\",\n    temperature=0.7,\n    thinking={\n        \"type\": \"enabled\",  # Enable extended thinking\n        \"budget_tokens\": 10000  # Token budget for thinking\n    }\n)\n\nasync def complex_reasoning_task(problem: str):\n    \"\"\"Use extended thinking for complex problems.\"\"\"\n    prompt = f\"\"\"Solve this complex problem step by step. Think through\n    all aspects carefully before providing your answer.\n    \n    Problem: {problem}\n    \n    Show your reasoning process.\"\"\"\n    \n    response = await llm_thinking.ainvoke(prompt)\n    \n    # Access thinking content if available\n    if hasattr(response, ''thinking''):\n        print(\"Thinking process:\", response.thinking)\n    \n    return response.content\n\n# Usage\nresult = await complex_reasoning_task(\n    \"Design an optimal database schema for a multi-tenant SaaS application\"\n)\n```\n\n### Step 3: LangChain ChatAnthropic Integration\n\nIntegrate Claude with LangChain chains:\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_anthropic import ChatAnthropic\nfrom langchain_core.prompts import ChatPromptTemplate\nfrom langchain_core.output_parsers import StrOutputParser\nfrom langchain_core.runnables import RunnablePassthrough\n\n# Initialize Claude\nclaude = ChatAnthropic(\n    model=\"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022\",\n    temperature=0.7,\n    max_tokens=4096\n)\n\n# Create chain with Claude\nprompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([\n    (\"system\", \"You are a helpful AI assistant powered by Claude.\"),\n    (\"user\", \"{input}\")\n])\n\nchain = prompt | claude | StrOutputParser()\n\n# Use chain\nresult = await chain.ainvoke({\"input\": \"Explain quantum computing\"})\nprint(result)\n```\n\n### Step 4: Tool Use with Error Handling\n\nRobust tool execution with error handling:\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_core.messages import ToolMessage\nfrom langchain_core.tools import tool\nimport asyncio\n\n@tool\nasync def risky_api_call(endpoint: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Call an API that might fail.\"\"\"\n    import httpx\n    try:\n        async with httpx.AsyncClient(timeout=10) as client:\n            response = await client.get(endpoint)\n            response.raise_for_status()\n            return response.text\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"Error: {str(e)}\"\n\nasync def robust_agentic_loop(user_query: str):\n    \"\"\"Agentic loop with error handling.\"\"\"\n    messages = [HumanMessage(content=user_query)]\n    tools = [risky_api_call]\n    llm_with_tools = claude.bind_tools(tools)\n    \n    max_iterations = 10\n    iteration = 0\n    \n    while iteration < max_iterations:\n        try:\n            response = await llm_with_tools.ainvoke(messages)\n            messages.append(response)\n            \n            if not response.tool_calls:\n                return response.content\n            \n            # Execute tools with error handling\n            for tool_call in response.tool_calls:\n                tool_name = tool_call[\"name\"]\n                tool_args = tool_call[\"args\"]\n                tool_id = tool_call[\"id\"]\n                \n                tool_map = {t.name: t for t in tools}\n                if tool_name in tool_map:\n                    try:\n                        tool_result = await tool_map[tool_name].ainvoke(tool_args)\n                        messages.append(ToolMessage(\n                            content=str(tool_result),\n                            tool_call_id=tool_id\n                        ))\n                    except Exception as e:\n                        # Report error to Claude\n                        messages.append(ToolMessage(\n                            content=f\"Tool execution error: {str(e)}\",\n                            tool_call_id=tool_id\n                        ))\n                else:\n                    messages.append(ToolMessage(\n                        content=f\"Unknown tool: {tool_name}\",\n                        tool_call_id=tool_id\n                    ))\n            \n            iteration += 1\n            \n        except Exception as e:\n            # Handle LLM errors\n            messages.append(AIMessage(\n                content=f\"I encountered an error: {str(e)}. Let me try a different approach.\"\n            ))\n            iteration += 1\n    \n    return \"Task incomplete after maximum iterations.\"\n```\n\n### Step 5: Safety and Alignment Patterns\n\nImplement safety controls:\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_anthropic import ChatAnthropic\nfrom langchain_core.messages import SystemMessage\n\n# Claude with safety system message\nsafe_claude = ChatAnthropic(\n    model=\"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022\",\n    temperature=0.3,  # Lower temperature for more consistent behavior\n    max_tokens=2048\n)\n\n# Safety system prompt\nsafety_prompt = \"\"\"You are a helpful AI assistant. Follow these guidelines:\n\n1. Never provide harmful, illegal, or unethical information\n2. If asked to do something unsafe, politely decline and explain why\n3. Protect user privacy and data\n4. Be honest about your capabilities and limitations\n5. Cite sources when providing factual information\n\"\"\"\n\nasync def safe_agent_query(user_query: str):\n    \"\"\"Query Claude with safety controls.\"\"\"\n    messages = [\n        SystemMessage(content=safety_prompt),\n        HumanMessage(content=user_query)\n    ]\n    \n    response = await safe_claude.ainvoke(messages)\n    \n    # Check for safety concerns (custom logic)\n    if is_unsafe_response(response.content):\n        return \"I cannot help with that request as it may be unsafe or unethical.\"\n    \n    return response.content\n\ndef is_unsafe_response(content: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Check if response contains unsafe content.\"\"\"\n    unsafe_keywords = [\"hack\", \"exploit\", \"illegal\"]\n    content_lower = content.lower()\n    return any(keyword in content_lower for keyword in unsafe_keywords)\n```\n\n### Step 6: Structured Outputs with Claude\n\nUse Claude for structured data extraction:\n\n```python\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, Field\nfrom langchain_anthropic import ChatAnthropic\nfrom langchain_core.output_parsers import PydanticOutputParser\n\nclass AnalysisResult(BaseModel):\n    \"\"\"Analysis result structure.\"\"\"\n    summary: str = Field(description=\"Brief summary\")\n    key_points: list[str] = Field(description=\"List of key points\")\n    sentiment: str = Field(description=\"positive, negative, or neutral\")\n    confidence: float = Field(ge=0, le=1, description=\"Confidence score\")\n\nclaude = ChatAnthropic(\n    model=\"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022\",\n    temperature=0.3  # Lower temperature for structured outputs\n)\n\n# Bind structured output\nstructured_llm = claude.with_structured_output(AnalysisResult)\n\nasync def analyze_text(text: str) -> AnalysisResult:\n    \"\"\"Analyze text and return structured result.\"\"\"\n    prompt = f\"Analyze this text and provide structured analysis:\\n\\n{text}\"\n    result = await structured_llm.ainvoke(prompt)\n    return result\n\n# Usage\nanalysis = await analyze_text(\"This product is amazing! Highly recommend.\")\nprint(analysis.summary)\nprint(analysis.key_points)\n```\n\n### Step 7: Streaming Agentic Loop\n\nStream responses for better UX:\n\n```python\nasync def streaming_agentic_loop(user_query: str):\n    \"\"\"Stream Claude''s responses during agentic loop.\"\"\"\n    messages = [HumanMessage(content=user_query)]\n    tools = [get_weather, search_database]\n    llm_with_tools = claude.bind_tools(tools)\n    \n    async for chunk in llm_with_tools.astream(messages):\n        # Stream text content\n        if hasattr(chunk, ''content'') and chunk.content:\n            print(chunk.content, end=\"\", flush=True)\n        \n        # Handle tool calls as they arrive\n        if hasattr(chunk, ''tool_calls'') and chunk.tool_calls:\n            for tool_call in chunk.tool_calls:\n                print(f\"\\n[Calling tool: {tool_call[''name'']}]\")\n```\n\n### Step 8: Multi-Turn Conversation with Memory\n\nMaintain context across turns:\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_core.chat_history import InMemoryChatMessageHistory\nfrom langchain_core.runnables.history import RunnableWithMessageHistory\n\nclaude = ChatAnthropic(\n    model=\"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022\",\n    temperature=0.7\n)\n\n# Create chain\nprompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([\n    (\"system\", \"You are a helpful assistant. Remember our conversation.\"),\n    (\"placeholder\", \"{messages}\")\n])\n\nchain = prompt | claude | StrOutputParser()\n\n# Add memory\nstore = {}\n\ndef get_session_history(session_id: str):\n    if session_id not in store:\n        store[session_id] = InMemoryChatMessageHistory()\n    return store[session_id]\n\nchain_with_memory = RunnableWithMessageHistory(\n    chain,\n    get_session_history,\n    input_messages_key=\"messages\",\n    history_messages_key=\"messages\",\n)\n\n# Multi-turn conversation\nsession_id = \"user_123\"\n\n# Turn 1\nresult1 = await chain_with_memory.ainvoke(\n    {\"messages\": [HumanMessage(content=\"My name is Alice\")]},\n    config={\"configurable\": {\"session_id\": session_id}}\n)\n\n# Turn 2 - Claude remembers Alice\nresult2 = await chain_with_memory.ainvoke(\n    {\"messages\": [HumanMessage(content=\"What''s my name?\")]},\n    config={\"configurable\": {\"session_id\": session_id}}\n)\n```\n\n## Claude Model Variants\n\n| Model | Best For | Token Limit |\n|-------|----------|-------------|\n| `claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022` | General purpose, balanced | 200K context |\n| `claude-3-opus-20240229` | Complex reasoning | 200K context |\n| `claude-3-haiku-20240307` | Fast, cost-effective | 200K context |\n\n## Agentic Loop Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Description | Use Case |\n|---------|-------------|----------|\n| **Tool-Use-Until-Done** | Continue until no tool calls | Multi-step tasks |\n| **Iterative Refinement** | Multiple passes with feedback | Content generation |\n| **Parallel Tool Execution** | Execute multiple tools simultaneously | Data gathering |\n| **Conditional Tool Use** | Use tools based on conditions | Adaptive workflows |\n\n## Extended Thinking Configuration\n\n```python\n# Enable thinking with budget\nthinking_config = {\n    \"type\": \"enabled\",\n    \"budget_tokens\": 10000  # Max tokens for thinking\n}\n\nclaude_thinking = ChatAnthropic(\n    model=\"claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022\",\n    thinking=thinking_config\n)\n```\n\n## Safety Best Practices\n\n1. **System Prompts**: Define clear safety guidelines\n2. **Temperature Control**: Lower temperature (0.3-0.5) for consistent behavior\n3. **Output Validation**: Check responses for unsafe content\n4. **Rate Limiting**: Implement rate limits to prevent abuse\n5. **Error Handling**: Gracefully handle failures\n6. **User Feedback**: Allow users to report issues\n7. **Content Filtering**: Filter sensitive or harmful outputs\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Use `claude-3-5-sonnet` for best balance of capability and cost\n- Implement proper tool error handling in agentic loops\n- Set appropriate `max_iterations` to prevent infinite loops\n- Use extended thinking for complex reasoning tasks\n- Enable streaming for better user experience\n- Implement safety checks and validation\n- Use structured outputs for reliable data extraction\n- Maintain conversation context with memory\n- Monitor token usage and costs\n- Test agentic loops with various inputs\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Fix |\n|--------------|-----|\n| No iteration limit | Set `max_iterations` in loops |\n| Ignoring tool errors | Handle and report tool errors to Claude |\n| No safety checks | Implement safety validation |\n| High temperature for structured outputs | Use 0.3-0.5 for structured data |\n| No memory for multi-turn | Use `RunnableWithMessageHistory` |\n| Synchronous tool calls | Use async/await for I/O |\n| No error handling | Wrap tool calls in try/except |\n| Ignoring token limits | Monitor and handle token limits |\n\n## Related\n\n- Knowledge: `{directories.knowledge}/anthropic-patterns.json`\n- Skill: `langchain-usage`\n- Skill: `tool-usage`\n- Skill: `agentic-loops`\n- Skill: `memory-management`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:13:51.087Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing Claude-powered development with extended thinking and safety best practices.","zh":"适用于需要使用Claude功能开发的高级AI代理，具有扩展的思考和安全最佳实践。","ja":"Claudeによる開発が必要な高度なAIエージェントに適しています。思考と安全のベストプラクティスが拡張されています。","ko":"클라우드 기능 개발이 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 확장된 사고와 안전 모범 사례가 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial avanzados que necesitan desarrollo con Claude y pensamiento extendido y las mejores prácticas de seguridad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle avancés ayant besoin d''un développement alimenté par Claude avec une réflexion étendue et les meilleures pratiques de sécurité.","de":"Perfekt für fortgeschrittene KI-Agents, die eine Claude-basierte Entwicklung mit erweitertem Denken und Sicherheitsbest-Practices benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de desenvolvimento com tecnologia Claude, com pensamento estendido e melhores práticas de segurança.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым необходимы разработки на основе технологии Claude с расширенным мышлением и лучшими практиками безопасности.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي المتقدمة التي تحتاج إلى تطوير مدعوم من تقنية Claude مع التفكير الموسع وأفضل الممارسات الأمنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement tool-use loops and complex reasoning using Claude models, integrating with LangChain workflows and supporting blueprints for SAP, Python, and Cloud-Native tech stacks via .cursorrules and agents.","zh":"赋予代理实现使用Claude模型的工具使用循环和复杂推理的能力，集成了LangChain工作流，并通过.cursorrules和代理支持SAP、Python和云原生技术栈的蓝图。","ja":"Claudeモデルを使用したツール使用ループと複雑な推論を実装するためのエージェントの能力を提供します。LangChainワークフローと、.cursorrulesおよびエージェントを介したSAP、Python、およびクラウドネイティブテクノロジースタックのブループリントをサポートします。","ko":"클라우드 모델을 사용하여 툴 사용 루프와 복잡한 추론을 구현할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다. 랭체인 워크플로우와 .cursorrules 및 에이전트를 통해 SAP, Python 및 클라우드 네이티브 기술 스택의 블루프린트를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar bucles de uso de herramientas y razonamiento complejo utilizando modelos de Claude, integrándose con flujos de trabajo de LangChain y admitiendo plantillas para pilas tecnológicas de SAP, Python y Cloud-Native a través de .cursorrules y agentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des boucles d''utilisation d''outils et un raisonnement complexe en utilisant des modèles Claude, en intégrant des flux de travail LangChain et en prenant en charge des modèles pour les piles technologiques SAP, Python et Cloud-Native via .cursorrules et agents.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Werkzeug-Verwendungs-Schleifen und komplexe Argumentation mit Hilfe von Claude-Modellen umzusetzen, indem sie in LangChain-Workflows integriert werden und Unterstützung für SAP-, Python- und Cloud-Native-Technologie-Stacks über .cursorrules und Agents bieten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementarem loops de uso de ferramentas e raciocínio complexo usando modelos Claude, integrando-se com fluxos de trabalho LangChain e suportando blueprints para pilhas de tecnologia SAP, Python e Cloud-Native por meio de .cursorrules e agentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать циклы использования инструментов и сложные рассуждения с помощью моделей Claude, интегрируясь с рабочими процессами LangChain и поддерживая схемы для стэков технологий SAP, Python и Cloud-Native посредством .cursorrules и агентов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تنفيذ حلقات استخدام الأدوات والاستدلال المعقد باستخدام نماذج Claude، وتكاملها مع سير عمل LangChain ودعم مخططات لصفوف تكنولوجيا SAP و Python و Cloud-Native من خلال .cursorrules ووكلاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Building agents with Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Opus, Haiku models for advanced tasks","Implementing safety and alignment controls for autonomous agent operations","Generating and refactoring .cursorrules, agents, skills, and workflows for various tech stacks"],"zh":["使用Claude 3.5 Sonnet、Opus、Haiku模型构建代理以执行高级任务","实现自主代理操作的安全性和对齐控制","为各种技术栈生成和重构.cursorrules、代理、技能和工作流"],"ja":["Claude 3.5 Sonnet、Opus、Haikuモデルを使用して高度なタスクを実行するエージェントを構築する","自律エージェント操作の安全性と整合性コントロールを実装する",".cursorrules、エージェント、スキル、ワークフローを生成およびリファクタリングするためのさまざまなテクノロジースタック"],"ko":["클라우드 3.5 소네트, 오푸스, 하이쿠 모델을 사용하여 고급 작업을 수행하는 에이전트를 구축하는 것","자율 에이전트 작업의 안전성 및 정렬 제어를 구현하는 것","다양한 기술 스택의 .cursorrules, 에이전트, 스킬 및 워크플로우를 생성 및 리팩토링하는 것"],"es":["Construir agentes con modelos Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Opus, Haiku para tareas avanzadas","Implementar controles de seguridad y alineación para operaciones de agentes autónomos","Generar y refactorizar .cursorrules, agentes, habilidades y flujos de trabajo para varias pilas tecnológicas"],"fr":["Construire des agents avec des modèles Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Opus, Haiku pour des tâches avancées","Mettre en œuvre des contrôles de sécurité et d''alignement pour les opérations d''agents autonomes","Générer et réorganiser .cursorrules, agents, compétences et flux de travail pour différentes piles technologiques"],"de":["Agents mit Claude 3.5 Sonnet-, Opus-, Haiku-Modellen für fortgeschrittene Aufgaben erstellen","Sicherheits- und Ausrichtungskontrollen für autonome Agenten-Operationen implementieren","Erstellung und Umgestaltung von .cursorrules, Agents, Fähigkeiten und Workflows für verschiedene Technologie-Stacks"],"pt":["Construir agentes com modelos Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Opus, Haiku para tarefas avançadas","Implementar controles de segurança e alinhamento para operações de agentes autônomos","Gerar e refatorar .cursorrules, agentes, habilidades e fluxos de trabalho para várias pilhas de tecnologia"],"ru":["Строить агентов с использованием моделей Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Opus, Haiku для сложных задач","Реализовывать средства контроля безопасности и соответствия для автономных операций агентов","Генерировать и перерабатывать .cursorrules, агентов, навыков и рабочих процессов для различных стэков технологий"],"ar":["بناء وكلاء مع نماذج Claude 3.5 Sonnet و Opus و Haiku لأداء مهام متقدمة","تنفيذ ضوابط الأمان والتنسيق للعمليات التشغيلية للوكلاء الأوتوماتيكية","生的 وتحويل .cursorrules ووكلاء ومهارات وسير عمل لمختلف صفوف التكنولوجيا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of langchain-anthropic and langchain libraries","Specifically designed for use with Claude models and LangChain workflows"],"zh":["需要安装langchain-anthropic和langchain库","专门为使用Claude模型和LangChain工作流设计"],"ja":["langchain-anthropicとlangchainライブラリのインストールが必要","ClaudeモデルとLangChainワークフロー専用に設計"],"ko":["langchain-anthropic 및 langchain 라이브러리의 설치가 필요함","클라우드 모델 및 랭체인 워크플로우専用로 설계"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de bibliotecas langchain-anthropic y langchain","Diseñado específicamente para su uso con modelos de Claude y flujos de trabajo de LangChain"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation des bibliothèques langchain-anthropic et langchain","Conçu spécifiquement pour une utilisation avec des modèles Claude et des flux de travail LangChain"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von langchain-anthropic- und langchain-Bibliotheken","Speziell für den Einsatz mit Claude-Modellen und LangChain-Workflows konzipiert"],"pt":["Requer a instalação das bibliotecas langchain-anthropic e langchain","Especificamente projetado para uso com modelos Claude e fluxos de trabalho LangChain"],"ru":["Требует установки библиотек langchain-anthropic и langchain","Преимущественно предназначен для использования с моделями Claude и рабочими процессами LangChain"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت مكتبات langchain-anthropic و langchain","صمّم خصيصا للاستخدام مع نماذج Claude وسير عمل LangChain"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('makaronz/agent66/github', 'community', 'makaronz', 'agent66', 'makaronz/agent66', 'github', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z', '2026-02-18T10:14:15.918Z', NULL, '{"id":"makaronz/agent66/github","name":"github","description":{"zh":"使用 gh CLI 与 GitHub 交互，包括检查 PR 的 CI 状态、列出最近的工作流运行等","ja":"gh CLI を使用して GitHub とインタラクトし、PR の CI 状態を確認したり、最近のワークフロー実行をリストしたりします","ko":"gh CLI를 사용하여 GitHub과 상호작용하고 PR의 CI 상태를 확인하거나 최근의 워크플로 실행을 나열합니다","es":"La herramienta de GitHub te permite interactuar con repositorios y flujos de trabajo utilizando gh CLI. Verifica el estado de CI en solicitudes de extracción y lista los flujos de trabajo recientes","fr":"L''outil GitHub vous permet d''interagir avec les référentiels et les flux de travail en utilisant gh CLI. Vérifiez l''état de CI dans les demandes d''extraction et listez les flux de travail récents","de":"Das GitHub-Tool ermöglicht es Ihnen, mit Repositorys und Workflows über gh CLI zu interagieren. Überprüfen Sie den CI-Status in Pull-Anfragen und listen Sie die letzten Workflows auf","pt":"O GitHub Skill permite interagir com repositórios GitHub usando o CLI. Veja como verificar o status de CI em PRs e listar execuções recentes.","ru":"Навык GitHub позволяет взаимодействовать с репозиториями GitHub с помощью CLI. Узнайте, как проверить статус CI в запросах на включение и вывести список последних выполнений.","ar":"تمكن مهارة GitHub من التفاعل مع مستودعات GitHub باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر. تعلم كيفية التحقق من حالة CI في الطلبات السحابية وlisting التشغيل الأخير.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub 技能：使用 gh CLI 交互","ja":"GitHub スキル：gh CLI を使用して GitHub とインタラクト","ko":"GitHub 스킬: gh CLI를 사용하여 GitHub과 상호작용","es":"Herramienta de GitHub: Integração con gh CLI","fr":"Outil GitHub : Intégration avec gh CLI","de":"GitHub-Tool: Integration mit gh CLI","pt":"GitHub Skill: Integração com CLI","ru":"Навык GitHub: работа с CLI","ar":"مهارة GitHub: التفاعل مع CLI","en":"github"},"description":{"zh":"使用 gh CLI 与 GitHub 交互，包括检查 PR 的 CI 状态、列出最近的工作流运行等","ja":"gh CLI を使用して GitHub とインタラクトし、PR の CI 状態を確認したり、最近のワークフロー実行をリストしたりします","ko":"gh CLI를 사용하여 GitHub과 상호작용하고 PR의 CI 상태를 확인하거나 최근의 워크플로 실행을 나열합니다","es":"La herramienta de GitHub te permite interactuar con repositorios y flujos de trabajo utilizando gh CLI. Verifica el estado de CI en solicitudes de extracción...","fr":"L''outil GitHub vous permet d''interagir avec les référentiels et les flux de travail en utilisant gh CLI. Vérifiez l''état de CI dans les demandes d''extraction...","de":"Das GitHub-Tool ermöglicht es Ihnen, mit Repositorys und Workflows über gh CLI zu interagieren. Überprüfen Sie den CI-Status in Pull-Anfragen und listen Sie ...","pt":"O GitHub Skill permite interagir com repositórios GitHub usando o CLI. Veja como verificar o status de CI em PRs e listar execuções recentes.","ru":"Навык GitHub позволяет взаимодействовать с репозиториями GitHub с помощью CLI. Узнайте, как проверить статус CI в запросах на включение и вывести список посл...","ar":"تمكن مهارة GitHub من التفاعل مع مستودعات GitHub باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر. تعلم كيفية التحقق من حالة CI في الطلبات السحابية وlisting التشغيل الأخير.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用 gh CLI 与 GitHub 交互","检查 PR 的 CI 状态","列出最近的工作流运行","查看运行日志","查看失败步骤"],"ja":["gh CLI を使用して GitHub とインタラクト","PR の CI 状態を確認","最近のワークフロー実行をリスト","実行ログを表示","失敗したステップを確認"],"ko":["gh CLI를 사용하여 GitHub과 상호작용","PR의 CI 상태를 확인","최근의 워크플로 실행을 나열","실행 로그를 표시","실패한 단계를 확인"],"es":["Verificación del estado de CI en solicitudes de extracción","Lista de flujos de trabajo recientes","Visualización de los pasos que fallaron en un flujo de trabajo","Visualización de registros para pasos fallidos","Interacción con repositorios utilizando gh CLI"],"fr":["Vérification de l''état de CI dans les demandes d''extraction","Liste des flux de travail récents","Affichage des étapes qui ont échoué dans un flux de travail","Affichage des journaux pour les étapes échouées","Interaction avec les référentiels en utilisant gh CLI"],"de":["Überprüfung des CI-Status in Pull-Anfragen","Auflistung der letzten Workflows","Anzeige der Schritte, die in einem Workflow fehlgeschlagen sind","Anzeige der Protokolle für fehlgeschlagene Schritte","Interaktion mit Repositorys über gh CLI"],"pt":["Verificar status de CI em PRs","Listar execuções recentes de workflow","Visualizar detalhes de execução de workflow","Exibir logs de etapas com falha","Gerenciar pull requests de forma eficiente"],"ru":["Проверка статуса CI в запросах на включение","Вывод списка последних выполнений workflow","Просмотр деталей выполнения workflow","Отображение журналов шагов с ошибками","Эффективное управление запросами на включение"],"ar":["التحقق من حالة CI في الطلبات السحابية","إدراج قائمة التشغيل الأخير للعملية","عرض تفاصيل تشغيل العملية","عرض سجلات الخطوات الفاشلة","إدارة الطلبات السحابية بفعالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub","gh CLI","PR","CI","工作流","运行日志","开发效率"],"ja":["GitHub","gh CLI","PR","CI","ワークフロー","実行ログ","開発効率"],"ko":["GitHub","gh CLI","PR","CI","워크플로","실행 로그","개발 효율성"],"es":["GitHub","gh CLI","solicitudes de extracción","flujos de trabajo","estado de CI","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["GitHub","gh CLI","demandes d''extraction","flux de travail","état de CI","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["GitHub","gh CLI","Pull-Anfragen","Workflows","CI-Status","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["GitHub Skill","CLI do GitHub","Gerenciamento de repositórios","Pull requests","CI/CD","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Integração contínua"],"ru":["Навык GitHub","CLI GitHub","Управление репозиториями","Запросы на включение","CI/CD","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты разработки","Непрерывная интеграция"],"ar":["مهارة GitHub","واجهة سطر الأوامر في GitHub","إدارة المستودعات","الطلبات السحابية","CI/CD","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","التكامل المستمر"]}},"owner":"makaronz","repo":"agent66","repoPath":"makaronz/agent66","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github","description":"Interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI. Use `gh issue`, `gh pr`, `gh run`, and `gh api` for issues, PRs, CI runs, and advanced queries.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Skill\n\nUse the `gh` CLI to interact with GitHub. Always specify `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory, or use URLs directly.\n\n## Pull Requests\n\nCheck CI status on a PR:\n\n```bash\ngh pr checks 55 --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nList recent workflow runs:\n\n```bash\ngh run list --repo owner/repo --limit 10\n```\n\nView a run and see which steps failed:\n\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nView logs for failed steps only:\n\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo --log-fai","body":"# GitHub Skill\n\nUse the `gh` CLI to interact with GitHub. Always specify `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory, or use URLs directly.\n\n## Pull Requests\n\nCheck CI status on a PR:\n\n```bash\ngh pr checks 55 --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nList recent workflow runs:\n\n```bash\ngh run list --repo owner/repo --limit 10\n```\n\nView a run and see which steps failed:\n\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo\n```\n\nView logs for failed steps only:\n\n```bash\ngh run view <run-id> --repo owner/repo --log-failed\n```\n\n## API for Advanced Queries\n\nThe `gh api` command is useful for accessing data not available through other subcommands.\n\nGet PR with specific fields:\n\n```bash\ngh api repos/owner/repo/pulls/55 --jq ''.title, .state, .user.login''\n```\n\n## JSON Output\n\nMost commands support `--json` for structured output. You can use `--jq` to filter:\n\n```bash\ngh issue list --repo owner/repo --json number,title --jq ''.[] | \"\\(.number): \\(.title)\"''\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:14:15.918Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced GitHub repository management and automation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 GitHub 仓库管理和自动化功能的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの管理と自動化の高度な機能が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 GitHub 저장소 관리 및 자동화 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de gestión y automatización avanzadas de repositorios de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de gestion et d''automatisation avancées de référentiels GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die erweiterte GitHub-Repository-Verwaltungs- und Automatisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento e automação de repositórios do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы расширенные возможности управления и автоматизации репозиториев GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة وأتمتة مستودع GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI, enabling features like checking CI status on pull requests, listing recent workflow runs, and viewing logs for failed steps via protocols like `https` and commands such as `gh pr checks` and `gh run view`.","zh":"使代理能够使用 `gh` CLI 与 GitHub 交互，启用功能如检查拉取请求的 CI 状态、列出最近的工作流运行和通过协议如 `https` 以及命令如 `gh pr checks` 和 `gh run view` 查看失败步骤的日志。","ja":"エージェントが `gh` CLI を使用して GitHub とやり取りできるようにし、プルリクエストの CI 状態の確認、最近のワークフロー実行のリスト表示、`https` のようなプロトコルや `gh pr checks` および `gh run view` のようなコマンドを使用して失敗したステップのログを表示する機能を有効にします。","ko":"에이전트가 `gh` CLI를 사용하여 GitHub와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하여, 풀 리퀘스트의 CI 상태 확인, 최근 워크플로 실행 목록 표시, `https`와 같은 프로토콜 및 `gh pr checks` 및 `gh run view`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 실패한 단계의 로그를 표시하는 기능을 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con GitHub utilizando la CLI `gh`, lo que permite funciones como comprobar el estado de CI en solicitudes de extracción, enumerar ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo recientes y ver registros para pasos fallidos a través de protocolos como `https` y comandos como `gh pr checks` y `gh run view`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec GitHub en utilisant la CLI `gh`, ce qui permet des fonctionnalités telles que la vérification du statut de l''IC sur les demandes d''extraction, la liste des exécutions de workflow récentes et l''affichage des journaux pour les étapes ayant échoué via des protocoles tels que `https` et des commandes telles que `gh pr checks` et `gh run view`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mit GitHub über die `gh`-CLI zu interagieren, was Funktionen wie das Überprüfen des CI-Status für Pull-Requests, das Auflisten von aktuellen Workflow-Ausführungen und das Anzeigen von Protokollen für fehlgeschlagene Schritte über Protokolle wie `https` und Befehle wie `gh pr checks` und `gh run view` ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir com o GitHub usando a CLI `gh`, permitindo recursos como verificar o status do CI em solicitações de pull, listar execuções de fluxo de trabalho recentes e visualizar logs para etapas com falha via protocolos como `https` e comandos como `gh pr checks` e `gh run view`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью взаимодействовать с GitHub с помощью CLI `gh`, что позволяет использовать функции, такие как проверка статуса CI в запросах на слияние, перечисление недавних запусков рабочих процессов и просмотр журналов для неудавшихся шагов через протоколы, такие как `https`, и команды, такие как `gh pr checks` и `gh run view`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التفاعل مع GitHub باستخدام CLI `gh` ، مما يسمح بميزات مثل التحقق من حالة CI على طلبات السحب ، وlisting تشغيلات سير العمل الأخيرة ، وعرض سجلات الخطوات الفاشلة عبر بروتوكولات مثل `https` والأوامر مثل `gh pr checks` و `gh run view` ."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request checks for CI status","Debugging failed workflow runs using `gh run view`","Monitoring recent workflow runs with `gh run list`"],"zh":["自动化拉取请求的 CI 状态检查","使用 `gh run view` 调试失败的工作流运行","使用 `gh run list` 监控最近的工作流运行"],"ja":["プルリクエストの CI 状態の自動化检查","`gh run view` を使用して失敗したワークフロー実行をデバッグする","`gh run list` を使用して最近のワークフロー実行を監視する"],"ko":["풀 리퀘스트의 CI 상태 자동화 확인","`gh run view`를 사용하여 실패한 워크플로 실행 디버깅","`gh run list`를 사용하여 최근 워크플로 실행 모니터링"],"es":["Automatizar las comprobaciones de solicitudes de extracción para el estado de CI","Depurar ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo fallidas utilizando `gh run view`","Supervisar las ejecuciones de flujo de trabajo recientes con `gh run list`"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications des demandes d''extraction pour le statut de l''IC","Déboguer les exécutions de workflow ayant échoué en utilisant `gh run view`","Surveiller les exécutions de workflow récentes avec `gh run list`"],"de":["Automatisieren von Pull-Request-Checks für den CI-Status","Fehlerhafte Workflow-Ausführungen mithilfe von `gh run view` debuggen","Aktuelle Workflow-Ausführungen mit `gh run list` überwachen"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de solicitação de pull para status do CI","Depurar execuções de fluxo de trabalho com falha usando `gh run view`","Monitorar execuções de fluxo de trabalho recentes com `gh run list`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку запросов на слияние для статуса CI","Отлаживать неудавшиеся запуски рабочих процессов с помощью `gh run view`","Отслеживать недавние запуски рабочих процессов с помощью `gh run list`"],"ar":["تأتمة فحص طلبات السحب لتحقق حالة CI","تصحيح أخطاء تشغيل سير العمل الفاشلة باستخدام `gh run view`","مراقبة تشغيلات سير العمل الأخيرة باستخدام `gh run list`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `gh` CLI installation","Needs specification of `--repo owner/repo` when not in a git directory"],"zh":["需要 `gh` CLI 安装","未在 git 目录中时需要指定 `--repo owner/repo`"],"ja":["`gh` CLI のインストールが必要","Git ディレクトリ内でない場合に `--repo owner/repo` の指定が必要"],"ko":["`gh` CLI 설치 필요","git 디렉토리 내에 없는 경우 `--repo owner/repo` 지정 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI `gh`","Necesita la especificación de `--repo propietario/repo` cuando no se encuentra en un directorio git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI `gh`","Nécessite la spécification de `--repo propriétaire/repo` lorsque vous n''êtes pas dans un répertoire git"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der `gh`-CLI","Benötigt die Angabe von `--repo Besitzer/Repo`, wenn Sie sich nicht in einem Git-Verzeichnis befinden"],"pt":["Exige instalação da CLI `gh`","Necessita de especificação de `--repo dono/repo` quando não estiver em um diretório git"],"ru":["Требует установки CLI `gh`","Требует указания `--repo владелец/репозиторий` при отсутствии в директории git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت CLI `gh`","يحتاج إلى تحديد `--repo المالك / المستودع` عند عدم وجوده في دليل Git"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
