des de reestructuración para proyectos existentes","Plantillas y flujos de trabajo personalizables"],"fr":["Vérification à deux passes pour tout scénario de fondation de LLM","Détection de confabulations potentielles","Prise en charge de plusieurs tech stacks","Capacités de réorganisation pour les projets existants","Modèles et flux de travail personnalisables"],"de":["Zwei-Pass-Verifizierung für jedes LLM-Grounding-Szenario","Erkennung von potenziellen Konfabulationen","Unterstützung für verschiedene Tech-Stacks","Umstrukturierungsfähigkeiten für bestehende Projekte","Anpassbare Vorlagen und Workflows"],"pt":["Verificação em duas etapas para detectar confabulações","Comparação de confiança entre passos de evidência","Suporte para cenários de fundamentação de LLM","Detecção de potenciais confabulações","Verificação de evidências para respostas de LLM","Melhoria da precisão das respostas de LLM"],"ru":["Двухпроходная верификация для обнаружения выдумок","Сравнение уверенности между проходами доказательств","Поддержка сценариев основания LLM","Обнаружение потенциальных выдумок","Проверка доказательств для ответов LLM","Улучшение точности ответов LLM"],"ar":["التحقق في مرحلتين للكشف عن الخيال","المقارنة بين الثقة بين مراحل الأدلة","دعم لسيناريوهات التأسيس LLM","الكشف عن الخيال المحتمل","التحقق من الأدلة لاستجابات LLM","تحسين دقة استجابات LLM"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Grounding Verification","LLM","双重验证","防止虚构信息","开发项目","技术栈","重构"],"ja":["グラウンド検証","LLM","二重検証","虚構情報","開発プロジェクト","テクノロジー・スタック","リファクタリング"],"ko":["그라운드 검증","LLM","двойной 검증","허구 정보","개발 프로젝트","기술 스택","리팩토링"],"es":["verificación de fundamentación","modelos de lenguaje","LLM","confabulación","tech stacks","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["vérification de fondation","modèles de langage","LLM","confabulation","tech stacks","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Grounding-Verifizierung","Sprachmodelle","LLM","Konfabulation","Tech-Stacks","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["verificação de fundamentação","LLM","confabulação","evidência","verificação em duas etapas","desenvolvimento de IA","tecnologia de linguagem natural"],"ru":["верификация основания","LLM","выдумка","доказательство","двухпроходная верификация","разработка ИИ","технология естественного языка"],"ar":["تحقق التأسيس","LLM","الخيال","الأدلة","التحقق في مرحلتين","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكنولوجيا اللغة الطبيعية"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"grounding-verification","description":"Universal two-pass verification for LLM grounding using confidence delta comparison","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Grounding Verification Skill\n\nUniversal two-pass verification for any LLM grounding scenario. Detects when the LLM may be confabulating by comparing confidence between scrubbed and full evidence passes.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- When LLM responses contain factual claims that need verification against evidence\n- Before acting on critical information from grounding skills (database schemas, code structure, security claims)\n- To detect potential confabulation when confidence seems high but evidence may","body":"# Grounding Verification Skill\n\nUniversal two-pass verification for any LLM grounding scenario. Detects when the LLM may be confabulating by comparing confidence between scrubbed and full evidence passes.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- When LLM responses contain factual claims that need verification against evidence\n- Before acting on critical information from grounding skills (database schemas, code structure, security claims)\n- To detect potential confabulation when confidence seems high but evidence may not support the claim\n- When working with security-critical or data-critical domains that require high accuracy\n- To ensure transparency and verifiability in agent decision-making processes\n\n## Core Principle\n\n> **If removing specific identifiers from evidence doesn''t significantly change LLM confidence, the evidence may not have been used - indicating potential confabulation.**\n\n## How It Works\n\n```\n┌─────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────┐\n│ Scrubbed Pass   │     │ Full Pass       │\n│ (anonymized)    │     │ (complete)      │\n│                 │     │                 │\n│ [TABLE_1] has   │     │ users table has │\n│ [FIELD_1] of    │     │ email field of  │\n│ type [TYPE_1]   │     │ type VARCHAR    │\n└────────┬────────┘     └────────┬────────┘\n         │                       │\n         ▼                       ▼\n   confidence: 0.3         confidence: 0.95\n         │                       │\n         └───────────┬───────────┘\n                     │\n                     ▼\n              delta = 0.65\n              (>= 0.3 threshold)\n                     │\n                     ▼\n              ✓ VERIFIED\n        (evidence is essential)\n```\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Understanding of LLM confidence scores and how they indicate grounding\n- Familiarity with evidence-based reasoning and verification concepts\n- Knowledge of how to scrub/anonymize identifiers from evidence\n- Understanding of different verification profiles (strawberry, code, documentation, data, security)\n- Access to LLM API for two-pass comparison queries\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Select appropriate profile**: Choose the verification profile (strawberry, code, documentation, data, security) that matches your domain for optimal thresholds\n- **Use triggers wisely**: Configure triggers (always, on_medium_confidence, on_critical_claim, on_conflict) based on cost/latency trade-offs\n- **Scrub consistently**: Replace all domain-specific identifiers (table names, classes, functions) with typed placeholders to test evidence dependency\n- **Handle UNSURE gracefully**: UNSURE responses don''t always indicate failure - consider context and gather more evidence when needed\n- **Monitor verification costs**: Balance verification frequency with API costs - use selective triggers for non-critical claims\n- **Document violations**: When violations occur, log them for pattern analysis and system improvement\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Collect Evidence\nGather evidence spans from grounding skills or other sources that support the claim to be verified.\n\n### Step 2: Create Scrubbed Version\nReplace specific identifiers (table names, field names, classes, functions, etc.) with typed placeholders like `[TABLE_1]`, `[FIELD_1]`, `[CLASS_1]`.\n\n### Step 3: Run Scrubbed Pass\nQuery the LLM with scrubbed evidence and measure confidence in the claim. This tests whether the evidence structure alone supports the claim.\n\n### Step 4: Run Full Pass\nQuery the LLM with complete evidence containing all identifiers. Measure confidence again.\n\n### Step 5: Calculate Delta\nCompute the difference: `delta = full_confidence - scrubbed_confidence`. A high delta indicates the specific identifiers are essential.\n\n### Step 6: Determine Status\nCompare delta against profile thresholds to determine verification status (VERIFIED, PLAUSIBLE, SUSPICIOUS, or UNSUPPORTED).\n\n### Step 7: Take Action\nProceed with confidence, add warnings, or stop based on the verification status.\n\n## Available Profiles\n\nSkills opt-in to verification by selecting a profile that matches their domain:\n\n| Profile | Domain | Thresholds | Default Trigger |\n|---------|--------|------------|-----------------|\n| `strawberry` | General factual claims | Standard (delta >= 0.3) | on_medium_confidence |\n| `code` | Code structure, APIs, functions | Standard | on_medium_confidence |\n| `documentation` | External docs, API refs | Relaxed (delta >= 0.25) | on_conflict |\n| `data` | Database schemas, data models | Strict (delta >= 0.35) | on_medium_confidence |\n| `security` | Security-critical claims | Very strict (delta >= 0.4) | always |\n\n## Opting In\n\nSkills add verification to their frontmatter:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"frontmatter\": {\n    \"name\": \"your-skill\",\n    \"verification\": {\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"profile\": \"data\",\n      \"trigger\": \"on_medium_confidence\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Trigger Options\n\n| Trigger | When | Use Case |\n|---------|------|----------|\n| `always` | Every grounding result | Critical systems, security |\n| `on_medium_confidence` | Initial confidence is MEDIUM | Default for most skills |\n| `on_critical_claim` | Claims marked critical | Selective verification |\n| `on_conflict` | Sources conflict | Documentation lookups |\n| `manual` | Explicitly called | Exploratory queries |\n\n## Verification Statuses\n\n| Status | Meaning | Action |\n|--------|---------|--------|\n| **VERIFIED** | Evidence essential (high delta) | Proceed with confidence |\n| **PLAUSIBLE** | Evidence helpful (medium delta) | Proceed with caution |\n| **SUSPICIOUS** | Evidence may not be used (low delta) | Add warning, investigate |\n| **UNSUPPORTED** | Insufficient evidence | STOP - gather more or ask user |\n\n## Profile Details\n\n### Strawberry (General/Factual)\n\nThe canonical profile, inspired by Pythea/Strawberry.\n\n**Scrubbing:** Tables, fields, classes, functions, numbers, strings, paths, URLs\n\n**Thresholds:**\n- VERIFIED: confidence >= 0.8, delta >= 0.3\n- PLAUSIBLE: confidence >= 0.6, delta >= 0.15\n- SUSPICIOUS: confidence >= 0.6, delta < 0.15\n- UNSUPPORTED: confidence < 0.6\n\n### Code (Structure/APIs)\n\nFor verifying claims about code structure, APIs, and function behavior.\n\n**Scrubbing:** Classes, functions, methods, variables, types, paths, line numbers, modules, packages\n\n**Thresholds:** Same as strawberry\n\n### Documentation (External Docs)\n\nFor verifying claims from external documentation, API docs, configuration references.\n\n**Scrubbing:** Versions, endpoints, config keys, parameters, values, URLs, commands\n\n**Thresholds (relaxed):**\n- VERIFIED: confidence >= 0.75, delta >= 0.25\n- PLAUSIBLE: confidence >= 0.55, delta >= 0.1\n- Note: Documentation is often partial or version-specific\n\n### Data (Schemas/Models)\n\nFor verifying database schemas, data models, entity relationships.\n\n**Scrubbing:** Tables, columns, data types, constraints, indexes, schemas, databases\n\n**Thresholds (strict):**\n- VERIFIED: confidence >= 0.85, delta >= 0.35\n- Note: Data errors are costly and hard to detect\n\n### Security (Critical Claims)\n\nFor verifying security-critical claims, vulnerabilities, auth/authz.\n\n**Scrubbing:** CVEs, vulnerabilities, attack vectors, algorithms, keys, secrets, permissions, roles\n\n**Thresholds (very strict):**\n- VERIFIED: confidence >= 0.9, delta >= 0.4\n- PLAUSIBLE: confidence >= 0.75, delta >= 0.25\n- Note: Security errors can be catastrophic\n\n## Algorithm\n\n### Two-Pass Comparison\n\n1. **Scrubbed Pass**: Replace identifiers with typed placeholders\n2. **Full Pass**: Use complete evidence\n3. **Calculate Delta**: `delta = full_confidence - scrubbed_confidence`\n4. **Determine Status**: Compare delta against profile thresholds\n\n### Response Schema\n\n```json\n{\n  \"verdict\": \"ENTAILED | CONTRADICTED | UNSURE\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.0-1.0,\n  \"reasoning\": \"Brief explanation\"\n}\n```\n\n### Verdict Rules\n\n- **ENTAILED**: Claim explicitly supported by context\n- **CONTRADICTED**: Context explicitly contradicts claim\n- **UNSURE**: Context neither confirms nor denies\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Parse Failure\n- Retry with simplified prompt (max 2 retries)\n- Fallback: extract verdict via regex\n\n### Conflicting Verdicts\n- Mark as SUSPICIOUS\n- Require user confirmation\n\n### UNSURE Response\n- UNSURE on scrubbed + ENTAILED on full → VERIFIED\n- UNSURE on both → PLAUSIBLE (gather more evidence)\n\n## When NOT to Verify\n\nTo save cost/latency, skip verification when:\n\n- HIGH confidence from cached/pre-verified sources\n- Exploratory queries where precision isn''t critical\n- Time-sensitive operations where latency matters\n\n## Integration with Existing Skills\n\n| Skill | Profile | Trigger |\n|-------|---------|---------|\n| `grounding` | data | on_medium_confidence |\n| `security-audit` | security | always |\n| `code-review` | code | on_medium_confidence |\n| `mcp-results` | documentation | on_conflict |\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n### Grounding Verification Report\n\n**Profile:** {PROFILE}\n**Trigger:** {TRIGGER}\n**Claims Analyzed:** {COUNT}\n\n---\n\n#### Claim Verification\n\n| Claim | Scrubbed Conf | Full Conf | Delta | Status |\n|-------|---------------|-----------|-------|--------|\n| {CLAIM} | {0.XX} | {0.XX} | {0.XX} | {STATUS} |\n\n---\n\n### RECOMMENDATION: {PROCEED|PROCEED_WITH_WARNINGS|STOP|GATHER_MORE_EVIDENCE}\n\n**Rationale:** {RATIONALE}\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| Skill | Relationship |\n|-------|--------------|\n| `strawberry-verification` | Profile implementation (extends this base) |\n| `grounding` | Consumer (opts in with data profile) |\n| `security-audit` | Consumer (opts in with security profile) |\n\n## Axiom Alignment\n\n| Axiom | How This Skill Applies |\n|-------|------------------------|\n| A1 (Verifiability) | Mathematically verify claims against evidence |\n| A3 (Transparency) | Make verification reasoning visible |\n| A4 (Non-Harm) | Prevent acting on hallucinated claims |\n| A5 (Consistency) | Apply uniform verification across all grounding |\n\n## References\n\n- [Pythea/Strawberry](https://github.com/leochlon/pythea) - Original implementation by Leon Chlon\n- `{directories.patterns}/skills/grounding-verification.json` - Full pattern specification\n- `{directories.patterns}/skills/strawberry-verification.json` - Strawberry profile\n- `diagrams/verification-flow.md` - Flow diagrams\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:14:25.595Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing advanced grounding verification for Large Language Models (LLMs)","zh":"适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要为大型语言模型（LLM）提供高级接地验证","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しており、大規模言語モデル（LLM）に高度な接地検証が必要","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 대규모 언어 모델(LLM)에 고급 그라운드 검증이 필요","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una verificación de base avanzada para Modelos de Lenguaje Grande (LLMs)","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code qui ont besoin d''une vérification de base avancée pour les Modèles de Langage Grande (LLMs)","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine erweiterte Grundlegungsverifizierung für Large Language Models (LLMs) benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de verificação de fundamentação avançada para Grandes Modelos de Linguagem (LLMs)","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих продвинутой проверки обоснования для Больших Моделей Языка (LLM)","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى تحقق متقدم من التأصيل لنماذج اللغة الكبيرة (LLMs)"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect potential confabulation in LLM responses by comparing confidence between scrubbed and full evidence passes, utilizing universal two-pass verification for any LLM grounding scenario, and supporting blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more","zh":"赋予代理检测LLM响应中潜在的编造内容的能力，通过比较去噪和完整证据通行的置信度，利用任何LLM接地场景的通用双重验证，并支持SAP、Python、Cloud-Native等蓝图","ja":"LLM応答の中での潜在的なfabulationを検出するエージェントの能力を与え、ノイズ除去と完全な証拠パスの信頼度を比較し、任意のLLM接地シナリオのための汎用2パス検証を利用し、SAP、Python、Cloud-Nativeなどのブループリントをサポート","ko":"LLM 응답에서 잠재적인 허구를 감지할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여, 노이즈 제거 및 전체 증거 통행의 신뢰도를 비교하고,任意 LLM 그라운드 시나리오에 대한 범용 2차 검증을 활용하며, SAP, Python, Cloud-Native 등의 블루프린트를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a detectar la confabulación potencial en las respuestas de LLM comparando la confianza entre pases de evidencia limpiados y completos, utilizando la verificación de dos pasos universal para cualquier escenario de base de LLM y admitiendo plantillas para SAP, Python, Cloud-Native y más","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter la confabulation potentielle dans les réponses des LLM en comparant la confiance entre les passes d''évidence nettoyées et complètes, en utilisant la vérification à deux passes universelle pour tout scénario de base de LLM et en prenant en charge les modèles pour SAP, Python, Cloud-Native et plus","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, potenzielle Konfabulation in LLM-Antworten zu erkennen, indem sie die Zuversicht zwischen gereinigten und vollständigen Beweispassagen vergleichen, die universelle Zwei-Pass-Verifizierung für jedes LLM-Grundierungsszenario nutzen und Unterstützung für Blaupausen für SAP, Python, Cloud-Native und mehr bieten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar potencial confabulação nas respostas dos LLMs comparando a confiança entre passes de evidências limpas e completas, utilizando verificação universal de dois passes para qualquer cenário de fundamentação de LLM e suportando blueprints para SAP, Python, Cloud-Native e mais","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать потенциальную фабуляцию в ответах LLM, сравнивая уверенность между очищенными и полными проходами доказательств, используя универсальную двухпроходную проверку для любого сценария обоснования LLM и поддерживая планы для SAP, Python, Cloud-Native и более","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من اكتشاف الخيال المحتمل في استجابات LLMs من خلال مقارنة الثقة بين ممرات الأدلة المنظفة والكاملة ، واستخدام التحقق العالمي لمرور مزدوج لأي سيناريو لتأصيل LLM ، ودعم خطط لأجل SAP و Python و Cloud-Native وغيرها"},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying factual claims in LLM responses against evidence","Detecting potential confabulation in critical information from grounding skills","Refactoring existing projects to include grounding verification capabilities"],"zh":["验证LLM响应中的事实主张与证据","检测来自接地技能的关键信息中的潜在编造内容","重构现有项目以包含接地验证功能"],"ja":["LLM応答の中での事実主張を証拠と検証","GROUNDスキルからの重要な情報の中での潜在的なfabulationを検出","既存のプロジェクトをGROUND検証機能を含むようにリファクタ"],"ko":["LLM 응답에서 사실적 주장을 증거와 검증","그라운드 스킬에서 중요한 정보에서 잠재적인 허구를 감지","既存 프로젝트를 그라운드 검증 기능을 포함하도록 리팩토링"],"es":["Verificar afirmaciones factuales en respuestas de LLM contra la evidencia","Detectar la confabulación potencial en información crítica de habilidades de base","Reestructurar proyectos existentes para incluir capacidades de verificación de base"],"fr":["Vérifier les affirmations factuelles dans les réponses des LLM contre les preuves","Détecter la confabulation potentielle dans les informations critiques des compétences de base","Réorganiser les projets existants pour inclure les capacités de vérification de base"],"de":["Überprüfen von Tatsachenbehauptungen in LLM-Antworten gegen Beweise","Erkennen von potenzieller Konfabulation in kritischen Informationen von Grundlegungs-Fähigkeiten","Umstrukturieren bestehender Projekte, um Grundlegungs-Verifizierungsfähigkeiten einzuschließen"],"pt":["Verificar alegações factuais em respostas de LLMs contra evidências","Detectar confabulação potencial em informações críticas de habilidades de fundamentação","Reestruturar projetos existentes para incluir capacidades de verificação de fundamentação"],"ru":["Проверка фактических утверждений в ответах LLM по сравнению с доказательствами","Обнаружение потенциальной фабуляции в критической информации из навыков обоснования","Перестройка существующих проектов для включения возможностей проверки обоснования"],"ar":["التحقق من المطالبات الواقعية في استجابات LLMs مقابل الأدلة","اكتشاف الخيال المحتمل في المعلومات الحرجة من مهارات التأصيل","إعادة هيكلة المشاريع الحالية لتشمل القدرات على التحقق من التأصيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with LLMs","May require additional configuration for specific tech stacks"],"zh":["需要与LLM集成","可能需要为特定技术栈进行额外配置"],"ja":["LLMとの統合が必要","特定のテクノロジースタックのための追加の構成が必要になる可能性"],"ko":["LLM와 통합이 필요","특정 기술 스택에 대한 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere integración con LLM","Puede requerir configuración adicional para pilas de tecnología específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec les LLM","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour des piles de technologie spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Integration mit LLM","Kann eine zusätzliche Konfiguration für bestimmte Technologie-Stacks erfordern"],"pt":["Requer integração com LLMs","Pode requerer configuração adicional para pilhas de tecnologia específicas"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с LLM","Может требовать дополнительной настройки для конкретных стеков технологий"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع LLMs","يمكن أن يتطلب cấuture إضافية لمجموعات التكنولوجيا المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
