n Problemen der kontinuierlichen Integration","Unterstützung für Workflow-Dateien","Pipeline-Zusammenfassung"],"pt":["Análise de logs de CI","Identificação de erros em pipelines","Solução de problemas em workflows","Integração com GitHub Actions","Suporte a múltiplos repositórios"],"ru":["Анализ логов CI","Определение ошибок в конвейерах","Исправление проблем в рабочих процессах","Интеграция с GitHub Actions","Поддержка нескольких репозиториев"],"ar":["تحليل سجلات CI","تحديد الأخطاء في الأنابيب","معالجة المشكلات في سير العمل","التكامل مع GitHub Actions","دعم المستودعات المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CI 失败诊断","GitHub Actions","持续集成","xAI","投资组合管理","实时市场数据","扫描驱动警报"],"ja":["CI失敗診断","GitHub Actions","継続的インテグレーション","xAI","投資ポートフォリオ管理","リアルタイム マーケット データ","スキャン ドリブン アラート"],"ko":["CI 실패 진단","GitHub Actions","지속적인 통합","xAI","투자 포트폴리오 관리","실시간 시장 데이터","스キャ닝 드라이브 알림"],"es":["falla de CI","integración continua","GitHub Actions","análisis de fallas","desarrollo de software","devops","automatización de pruebas","depuración de código"],"fr":["échec de CI","intégration continue","GitHub Actions","analyse des échecs","développement de logiciels","devops","automatisation des tests","débogage de code"],"de":["CI-Fehler","kontinuierliche Integration","GitHub Actions","Fehleranalyse","Softwareentwicklung","devops","Automatisierung von Tests","Code-Debugging"],"pt":["diagnóstico de falha de CI","pipeline de desenvolvimento","GitHub Actions","análise de logs","identificação de erros","solução de problemas"],"ru":["диагностика неудач CI","конвейер разработки","GitHub Actions","анализ логов","определение ошибок","исправление проблем"],"ar":["تشخيص فشل CI","أنابيب التطوير","GitHub Actions","تحليل السجلات","تحديد الأخطاء","معالجة المشكلات"]}},"owner":"sperezintexas","repo":"fintech-app","repoPath":"sperezintexas/fintech-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ci-failure","description":"Diagnose GitHub Actions CI failures and suggest fixes. Use when the user reports CI failed, GitHub job failed, Actions failed, build failed on remote, upload artifact failed, or pastes a failure from the Actions tab.","bodyPreview":"# CI Failure Diagnosis\n\nWhen the user reports a **remote GitHub Actions / CI failure** (or pastes a failure from the Actions tab), apply this skill.\n\n## 1. Load Context First\n\nRead these files **immediately** to understand this repo’s CI:\n\n- **Workflow:** `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (and `.github/workflows/security.yml` if the failure mentions security)\n- **Pipeline summary:** `docs/ci.md`\n\nUse them to map the failure to a job and step and to apply repo-specific fixes.\n\n## 2. Identify Job and Ste","body":"# CI Failure Diagnosis\n\nWhen the user reports a **remote GitHub Actions / CI failure** (or pastes a failure from the Actions tab), apply this skill.\n\n## 1. Load Context First\n\nRead these files **immediately** to understand this repo’s CI:\n\n- **Workflow:** `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (and `.github/workflows/security.yml` if the failure mentions security)\n- **Pipeline summary:** `docs/ci.md`\n\nUse them to map the failure to a job and step and to apply repo-specific fixes.\n\n## 2. Identify Job and Step\n\nFrom the user’s message or pasted log, determine:\n\n- **Job name** (e.g. Lint, Type Check, Test, Build, Docker Build, Notify Slack)\n- **Step name** (e.g. \"Run ESLint\", \"Build application\", \"Upload build artifacts\")\n\nIf the user only pastes an error line (e.g. \"No files were found with the provided path: .next\"), infer the step from the message and the workflow.\n\n## 3. Map to Fix\n\n| Failure / Log | Job | Step | Action |\n|--------------|-----|------|--------|\n| ESLint error, file:line | Lint | Run ESLint | Fix the reported file/line; run `npm run lint` locally. |\n| Type error, tsc | Type Check | Run TypeScript compiler | Fix the type; run `npx tsc --noEmit` locally. |\n| Test failure, vitest | Test | Run tests | Fix test or app code; run `npm test` locally. |\n| Build error, Next.js, OOM | Build | Build application | Check \"Build application\" logs; confirm `NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=4096` in workflow; fix build error or increase memory. |\n| No files .next, upload artifact | Build | Build application / Upload | Build didn’t produce `.next`; check \"Build application\" step logs. Ensure workflow has List build output, \"Fail if build did not produce .next\", and conditional upload (see docs/ci.md). |\n| Docker build failed | Docker Build | Build Docker image | Check Dockerfile and build-args (MONGODB_URI, MONGODB_DB). |\n| Notify Slack / health | Notify Slack | — | Check Secrets (SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL) and Variables (APP_URL); see docs/ci.md and readme. |\n\n## 4. Respond\n\n1. **Say which job and step failed** (and link to workflow if helpful).\n2. **Give a short cause** (e.g. \"Build didn’t produce `.next`\" or \"ESLint error in `src/foo.ts`\").\n3. **Suggest a concrete fix** (workflow change, code change, or env/secret), using `docs/ci.md` and `.github/workflows/ci.yml` as the source of truth.\n4. If the user pasted only one line, **ask for the full job log** for the failing step if you need it to be precise (e.g. \"Paste the full ''Build application'' step log from the Build job\").\n\n## 5. Optional: Cursor Rule\n\nFor more detail on mapping failures and repo-specific CI, see `.cursor/rules/github-ci.mdc` (it aligns with this skill and docs/ci.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:14:34.255Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for DevOps Agents specializing in GitHub Actions troubleshooting and continuous integration pipeline maintenance.","zh":"适用于专门从事 GitHub Actions 故障排除和持续集成管道维护的 DevOps Agent。","ja":"GitHub Actions のトラブルシューティングと継続的インテグレーションパイプラインのメンテナンスを専門とする DevOps エージェントに不可欠。","ko":"GitHub Actions 문제 해결 및 지속적 통합 파이프라인 유지 관리를 전문으로 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de DevOps que se especializan en la solución de problemas de GitHub Actions y el mantenimiento de la integración continua de la canalización.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents DevOps spécialisés dans la résolution des problèmes de GitHub Actions et la maintenance de la canalisation d''intégration continue.","de":"Wesentlich für DevOps-Agents, die auf die Fehlerbehebung von GitHub Actions und die Wartung von Continuous-Integration-Pipelines spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes DevOps especializados em solução de problemas de GitHub Actions e manutenção de pipelines de integração contínua.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов DevOps, специализирующихся на устранении неполадок GitHub Actions и обслуживании конвейеров непрерывной интеграции.","ar":"ضروري لموكلات DevOps المتخصصة في تصحيح أخطاء GitHub Actions وصيانة أنابيب التكامل المستمر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to diagnose CI/CD failures by automatically parsing GitHub Actions workflows (.yml files) and correlating errors with specific job steps. Provides repo-specific context through documentation analysis (ci.md) for targeted fixes.","zh":"使代理能够通过自动解析 GitHub Actions 工作流 (.yml 文件) 并将错误与特定作业步骤关联来诊断 CI/CD 故障。通过文档分析 (ci.md) 为有针对性的修复提供存储库特定的上下文。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub Actions ワークフロー (.yml ファイル) を自動的に解析し、エラーを特定のジョブ ステップに相関することで CI/CD の障害を診断できるようにします。ドキュメント分析 (ci.md) により、ターゲットされた修正のためのリポジトリ固有のコンテキストを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub Actions 워크플ロー (.yml 파일)를 자동으로 파싱하여 오류를 특정 작업 단계와 상관시켜 CI/CD 오류를 진단할 수 있도록 합니다. 문서 분석 (ci.md)을 통해 대상 수정에 대한 리포지토리별 컨텍스트를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diagnosticar fallos de CI/CD analizando automáticamente los flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions (archivos .yml) y correlacionando los errores con pasos de trabajo específicos. Proporciona contexto específico del repositorio a través del análisis de documentación (ci.md) para soluciones dirigidas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer les défaillances de CI/CD en analysant automatiquement les flux de travail de GitHub Actions (fichiers .yml) et en corrélant les erreurs avec des étapes de travail spécifiques. Fournit un contexte spécifique au référentiel via l''analyse de la documentation (ci.md) pour des correctifs ciblés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, CI/CD-Ausfälle zu diagnostizieren, indem sie GitHub-Actions-Workflows (.yml-Dateien) automatisch parsen und Fehler mit bestimmten Job-Schritten in Beziehung setzen. Bietet repo-spezifischen Kontext durch Dokumentenanalyse (ci.md) für gezielte Fehlerbehebungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes diagnosticem falhas de CI/CD analisando automaticamente fluxos de trabalho do GitHub Actions (arquivos .yml) e correlacionando erros com etapas de trabalho específicas. Fornece contexto específico do repositório por meio da análise da documentação (ci.md) para soluções direcionadas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам диагностировать сбои CI/CD, автоматически анализируя рабочие процессы GitHub Actions (файлы .yml) и коррелируя ошибки с конкретными шагами задания. Предоставляет контекст, специфичный для репозитория, посредством анализа документации (ci.md) для целевых исправлений.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتشخيص فشل CI/CD من خلال تحليل سير عمل GitHub Actions (.yml) تلقائيًا وتوضيح الأخطاء مع خطوات العمل المحددة. يوفر سياقًا محددًا للمستودع من خلال تحليل الوثائق (ci.md) لتحديد الإصلاحات."},"useCases":{"en":["Diagnosing remote GitHub Actions failures","Mapping CI errors to specific workflow jobs and steps","Applying repository-specific CI fixes using local documentation"],"zh":["远程 GitHub Actions 故障诊断","将 CI 错误映射到特定工作流作业和步骤","使用本地文档应用存储库特定 CI 修复"],"ja":["リモート GitHub Actions の障害診断","CI エラーを特定のワークフロー ジョブとステップにマッピング","ローカル ドキュメントを使用したリポジトリ固有の CI 修正の適用"],"ko":["원격 GitHub Actions 오류 진단","CI 오류를 특정 워크플로 작업 및 단계에 매핑","로컬 문서를 사용한 리포지토리별 CI 수정 적용"],"es":["Diagnosticar fallos de GitHub Actions remotos","Asignar errores de CI a trabajos y pasos de flujo de trabajo específicos","Aplicar soluciones de CI específicas del repositorio utilizando la documentación local"],"fr":["Diagnostiquer les défaillances de GitHub Actions à distance","Mapper les erreurs de CI sur des travaux et des étapes de flux de travail spécifiques","Appliquer des correctifs de CI spécifiques au référentiel en utilisant la documentation locale"],"de":["Ferngesteuerte GitHub-Actions-Ausfälle diagnostizieren","CI-Fehler auf bestimmte Workflow-Jobs und -Schritte abbilden","Repository-spezifische CI-Korrektur mittels lokaler Dokumentation anwenden"],"pt":["Diagnóstico de falhas remotas do GitHub Actions","Mapeamento de erros de CI para trabalhos e etapas de fluxo de trabalho específicas","Aplicação de soluções de CI específicas do repositório usando documentação local"],"ru":["Диагностика удаленных сбоев GitHub Actions","Сопоставление ошибок CI с конкретными заданиями и шагами рабочего процесса","Применение исправлений CI, специфичных для репозитория, с помощью локальной документации"],"ar":["تشخيص فشل GitHub Actions عن بعد","تعيين أخطاء CI إلى وظائف وخطوات سير عمل محددة","تطبيق إصلاحات CI محددة للمستودع باستخدام الوثائق المحلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to .github/workflows directory","Depends on repo-specific ci.md documentation","GitHub Actions specific (not compatible with other CI platforms)"],"zh":[".github/workflows 目录的访问要求","依赖于存储库特定的 ci.md 文档","仅适用于 GitHub Actions (与其他 CI 平台不兼容)"],"ja":[".github/workflows ディレクトリへのアクセス要件","リポジトリ固有の ci.md ドキュメントへの依存","GitHub Actions 専用 (他の CI プラットフォームと互換性なし)"],"ko":[".github/workflows 디렉토리에 대한 액세스 요구 사항","리포지토리별 ci.md 문서의 의존성","GitHub Actions 전용 (다른 CI 플랫폼과 호환되지 않음)"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio .github/workflows","Depende de la documentación específica del repositorio ci.md","Específico de GitHub Actions (no compatible con otras plataformas de CI)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au répertoire .github/workflows","Dépend de la documentation spécifique au référentiel ci.md","Spécifique à GitHub Actions (non compatible avec d''autres plates-formes de CI)"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis .github/workflows","Hängt von der repo-spezifischen Dokumentation ci.md ab","Spezifisch für GitHub Actions (nicht kompatibel mit anderen CI-Plattformen)"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório .github/workflows","Depende da documentação ci.md específica do repositório","Especificamente para GitHub Actions (não compatível com outras plataformas de CI)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к директории .github/workflows","Зависит от документации ci.md, специфичной для репозитория","Специфичен для GitHub Actions (не совместим с другими платформами CI)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى دليل .github/workflows","يعتمد على توثيق ci.md محدد للمستودع","محدد ل GitHub Actions (غير متوافق مع منصات CI الأخرى)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('makaronz/agent66/spotify-player', 'community', 'makaronz', 'agent66', 'makaronz/agent66', 'spotify-player', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z', '2026-02-18T10:14:51.463Z', NULL, '{"id":"makaronz/agent66/spotify-player","name":"spotify-player","description":{"zh":"Spotify 播放器开发指南，使用 spogo 和 spotify_player 实现 Spotify 播放和搜索功能","ja":"Spotify プレーヤー開発ガイド、spogo と spotify_player を使用して Spotify をプレイバックおよび検索","ko":"스포티파이 플레이어 개발 가이드, spogo와 spotify_player를 사용하여 스포티파이를 재생하고 검색","es":"El reproductor de Spotify se controla con spogo y spotify_player. Requiere una cuenta premium y permite búsqueda, reproducción y gestión de dispositivos","fr":"Le lecteur Spotify est contrôlé par spogo et spotify_player. Il nécessite un compte premium et permet la recherche, la lecture et la gestion des appareils","de":"Der Spotify-Player wird mit spogo und spotify_player gesteuert. Er benötigt ein Premium-Konto und ermöglicht die Suche, Wiedergabe und Geräteverwaltung","pt":"O Spotify Player permite controle de música com Spogo. Requisitos incluem conta Spotify Premium e instalação de Spogo ou Spotify Player.","ru":"Плеер Spotify позволяет управлять музыкой с помощью Spogo. Требования включают аккаунт Spotify Premium и установку Spogo или Spotify Player.","ar":"مشغل سبوتيفاي يسمح بالسيطرة على الموسيقى مع Spogo. المتطلبات تشمل حساب سبوتيفاي 프리ميوم وتثبيت Spogo أو مشغل سبوتيفاي.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Spotify 播放器开发指南","ja":"Spotify プレーヤー開発ガイド","ko":"스포티파이 플레이어 개발 가이드","es":"Reproductor de Spotify: Controla tu música con spogo","fr":"Lecteur Spotify: Contrôle votre musique avec spogo","de":"Spotify-Player: Steuere deine Musik mit spogo","pt":"Spotify Player: Controle de Música com Spogo","ru":"Плеер Spotify: Управление музыкой с Spogo","ar":"مشغل سبوتيفاي: سيطرة الموسيقى مع Spogo","en":"spotify-player"},"description":{"zh":"Spotify 播放器开发指南，使用 spogo 和 spotify_player 实现 Spotify 播放和搜索功能","ja":"Spotify プレーヤー開発ガイド、spogo と spotify_player を使用して Spotify をプレイバックおよび検索","ko":"스포티파이 플레이어 개발 가이드, spogo와 spotify_player를 사용하여 스포티파이를 재생하고 검색","es":"El reproductor de Spotify se controla con spogo y spotify_player. Requiere una cuenta premium y permite búsqueda, reproducción y gestión de dispositivos","fr":"Le lecteur Spotify est contrôlé par spogo et spotify_player. Il nécessite un compte premium et permet la recherche, la lecture et la gestion des appareils","de":"Der Spotify-Player wird mit spogo und spotify_player gesteuert. Er benötigt ein Premium-Konto und ermöglicht die Suche, Wiedergabe und Geräteverwaltung","pt":"O Spotify Player permite controle de música com Spogo. Requisitos incluem conta Spotify Premium e instalação de Spogo ou Spotify Player.","ru":"Плеер Spotify позволяет управлять музыкой с помощью Spogo. Требования включают аккаунт Spotify Premium и установку Spogo или Spotify Player.","ar":"مشغل سبوتيفاي يسمح بالسيطرة على الموسيقى مع Spogo. المتطلبات تشمل حساب سبوتيفاي 프리ميوم وتثبيت Spogo أو مشغل سبوتيفاي.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Spotify Premium 账户支持","spogo 和 spotify_player 命令行工具","播放、暂停、下一首、上一首控制","设备列表和设置","播放状态查询"],"ja":["Spotify Premium アカウントサポート","spogo と spotify_player コマンドラインツール","再生、停止、次の曲、前の曲の制御","デバイスリストと設定","再生状態の照会"],"ko":["스포티파이 프리미엄 계정 지원","spogo와 spotify_player 명령줄 도구","재생, 일시停止, 다음 곡, 이전 곡 제어","장치 목록 및 설정","재생 상태 쿼리"],"es":["Búsqueda de pistas y álbumes","Reproducción y pausa de música","Gestión de dispositivos y selección","Estado de reproducción y control","Compatibilidad con Spotify Premium","Uso de comandos CLI para controlar Spotify"],"fr":["Recherche de pistes et d''albums","Lecture et pause de la musique","Gestion des appareils et sélection","État de lecture et contrôle","Compatibilité avec Spotify Premium","Utilisation de commandes CLI pour contrôler Spotify"],"de":["Suche nach Tracks und Alben","Wiedergabe und Pause von Musik","Geräteverwaltung und Auswahl","Wiedergabestatus und Steuerung","Kompatibilität mit Spotify Premium","Verwendung von CLI-Befehlen zur Steuerung von Spotify"],"pt":["Controle de playback com Spogo","Busca de faixas com Spogo","Gerenciamento de dispositivos com Spogo","Exibição de status de reprodução com Spogo","Compatibilidade com Spotify Premium"],"ru":["Управление воспроизведением с помощью Spogo","Поиск треков с помощью Spogo","Управление устройствами с помощью Spogo","Отображение статуса воспроизведения с помощью Spogo","Совместимость с Spotify Premium"],"ar":["سيطرة التشغيل مع Spogo","بحث المسارات مع Spogo","إدارة الأجهزة مع Spogo","عرض حالة التشغيل مع Spogo","التوافق مع سبوتيفاي 프리ميوم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Spotify","spogo","spotify_player","播放器开发","音乐开发","命令行工具"],"ja":["Spotify","spogo","spotify_player","プレーヤー開発","音楽開発","コマンドラインツール"],"ko":["스포티파이","spogo","spotify_player","플레이어 개발","음악 개발","명령줄 도구"],"es":["spogo","spotify_player","reproductor de spotify","control de spotify","búsqueda de música","reproducción de música","gestión de dispositivos","spotify premium","comandos cli"],"fr":["spogo","spotify_player","lecteur spotify","contrôle de spotify","recherche de musique","lecture de musique","gestion des appareils","spotify premium","commandes cli"],"de":["spogo","spotify_player","spotify-player","steuerung von spotify","musiksuche","musikwiedergabe","geräteverwaltung","spotify premium","cli-befehle"],"pt":["Spotify Player","Spogo","controle de música","playback","busca de faixas","Spotify Premium","desenvolvedores","tecnologia de música"],"ru":["Плеер Spotify","Spogo","управление музыкой","воспроизведение","поиск треков","Spotify Premium","разработчики","технология музыки"],"ar":["مشغل سبوتيفاي","Spogo","سيطرة الموسيقى","التشغيل","بحث المسارات","سبوتيفاي 프리ميوم","المطورون","تكنولوجيا الموسيقى"]}},"owner":"makaronz","repo":"agent66","repoPath":"makaronz/agent66","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"spotify-player","description":"Terminal Spotify playback/search via spogo (preferred) or spotify_player.","bodyPreview":"# spogo / spotify_player\n\nUse `spogo` **(preferred)** for Spotify playback/search. Fall back to `spotify_player` if needed.\n\nRequirements\n\n- Spotify Premium account.\n- Either `spogo` or `spotify_player` installed.\n\nspogo setup\n\n- Import cookies: `spogo auth import --browser chrome`\n\nCommon CLI commands\n\n- Search: `spogo search track \"query\"`\n- Playback: `spogo play|pause|next|prev`\n- Devices: `spogo device list`, `spogo device set \"<name|id>\"`\n- Status: `spogo status`\n\nspotify_player commands (f","body":"# spogo / spotify_player\n\nUse `spogo` **(preferred)** for Spotify playback/search. Fall back to `spotify_player` if needed.\n\nRequirements\n\n- Spotify Premium account.\n- Either `spogo` or `spotify_player` installed.\n\nspogo setup\n\n- Import cookies: `spogo auth import --browser chrome`\n\nCommon CLI commands\n\n- Search: `spogo search track \"query\"`\n- Playback: `spogo play|pause|next|prev`\n- Devices: `spogo device list`, `spogo device set \"<name|id>\"`\n- Status: `spogo status`\n\nspotify_player commands (fallback)\n\n- Search: `spotify_player search \"query\"`\n- Playback: `spotify_player playback play|pause|next|previous`\n- Connect device: `spotify_player connect`\n- Like track: `spotify_player like`\n\nNotes\n\n- Config folder: `~/.config/spotify-player` (e.g., `app.toml`).\n- For Spotify Connect integration, set a user `client_id` in config.\n- TUI shortcuts are available via `?` in the app.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:14:51.463Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Music-Centric Agents requiring seamless Spotify playback and search functionality.","zh":"适合需要无缝Spotify播放和搜索功能的音乐中心代理。","ja":"Spotifyの再生と検索機能を無制限に必要とするミュージック中心のエージェントに最適。","ko":"무결점의 Spotify 재생 및 검색 기능이 필요한 음악 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes centrados en música que requieren reproducción y funcionalidad de búsqueda de Spotify sin interrupciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur la musique nécessitant une lecture et une fonctionnalité de recherche Spotify sans interruption.","de":"Ideal für musikorientierte Agenten, die eine nahtlose Spotify-Wiedergabe und Suchfunktion benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Centrados em Música que exigem reprodução e funcionalidade de busca no Spotify sem interrupções.","ru":"Идеально подходит для музыкальных агентов, требующих бесшовного воспроизведения и функциональности поиска Spotify.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المُركّزين على الموسيقى الذين يتطلبون تشغيل Spotify واستخدام وظيفة البحث بسلاسة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to control Spotify playback using CLI commands like `spogo play|pause|next|prev`, search tracks with `spogo search track`, and manage devices via `spogo device list` and `spogo device set`, all while leveraging Spotify Premium account features and `spogo` or `spotify_player` libraries.","zh":"赋予代理控制Spotify播放的能力，使用CLI命令如`spogo play|pause|next|prev`，使用`spogo search track`搜索曲目，使用`spogo device list`和`spogo device set`管理设备，同时利用Spotify Premium账户功能和`spogo`或`spotify_player`库。","ja":"エージェントにSpotifyの再生をCLIコマンド(`spogo play|pause|next|prev`)で制御する機能を提供し、`spogo search track`で曲を検索し、`spogo device list`および`spogo device set`でデバイスを管理する。また、Spotify Premiumアカウントの機能と`spogo`または`spotify_player`ライブラリを利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 Spotify 재생을 CLI 명령어(`spogo play|pause|next|prev`)로 제어할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, `spogo search track`로 트랙을 검색하고, `spogo device list` 및 `spogo device set`로 디바이스를 관리할 수 있다. 또한 Spotify Premium 계정 기능과 `spogo` 또는 `spotify_player` 라이브러리를 활용할 수 있다.","es":"Permite a los agentes controlar la reproducción de Spotify utilizando comandos de CLI como `spogo play|pause|next|prev`, buscar pistas con `spogo search track`, y administrar dispositivos a través de `spogo device list` y `spogo device set`, todo mientras aprovecha las características de la cuenta de Spotify Premium y las bibliotecas `spogo` o `spotify_player`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contrôler la lecture Spotify à l''aide de commandes CLI comme `spogo play|pause|next|prev`, de rechercher des pistes avec `spogo search track`, et de gérer les appareils via `spogo device list` et `spogo device set`, le tout en exploitant les fonctionnalités du compte Spotify Premium et les bibliothèques `spogo` ou `spotify_player`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Spotify-Wiedergabe mithilfe von CLI-Befehlen wie `spogo play|pause|next|prev` zu steuern, Tracks mit `spogo search track` zu suchen und Geräte über `spogo device list` und `spogo device set` zu verwalten, während sie die Funktionen des Spotify-Premium-Kontos und der Bibliotheken `spogo` oder `spotify_player` nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes controlem a reprodução do Spotify usando comandos CLI como `spogo play|pause|next|prev`, procurem faixas com `spogo search track`, e gerenciem dispositivos via `spogo device list` e `spogo device set`, tudo isso aproveitando recursos da conta Spotify Premium e bibliotecas `spogo` ou `spotify_player`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам контролировать воспроизведение Spotify с помощью команд CLI, таких как `spogo play|pause|next|prev`, искать треки с помощью `spogo search track` и управлять устройствами через `spogo device list` и `spogo device set`, все это при использовании функций аккаунта Spotify Premium и библиотек `spogo` или `spotify_player`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التحكم في تشغيل Spotify باستخدام أوامر CLI مثل `spogo play|pause|next|prev` ، و البحث عن المسارات باستخدام `spogo search track` ، وإدارة الأجهزة من خلال `spogo device list` و `spogo device set` ، كل ذلك مع استخدام ميزات حساب Spotify Premium ومكتبات `spogo` أو `spotify_player`."},"useCases":{"en":["Controlling Spotify playback","Searching Spotify tracks","Managing Spotify devices"],"zh":["控制Spotify播放","搜索Spotify曲目","管理Spotify设备"],"ja":["Spotifyの再生を制御する","Spotifyの曲を検索する","Spotifyのデバイスを管理する"],"ko":["Spotify 재생 제어","Spotify 트랙 검색","Spotify 디바이스 관리"],"es":["Controlar la reproducción de Spotify","Buscar pistas de Spotify","Administrar dispositivos de Spotify"],"fr":["Contrôler la lecture Spotify","Rechercher des pistes Spotify","Gérer les appareils Spotify"],"de":["Spotify-Wiedergabe steuern","Spotify-Tracks suchen","Spotify-Geräte verwalten"],"pt":["Controle de reprodução do Spotify","Pesquisa de faixas do Spotify","Gerenciamento de dispositivos do Spotify"],"ru":["Контроль воспроизведения Spotify","Поиск треков Spotify","Управление устройствами Spotify"],"ar":["التحكم في تشغيل Spotify","البحث عن مسارات Spotify","إدارة أجهزة Spotify"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Spotify Premium account","Either `spogo` or `spotify_player` installed","Importing cookies via `spogo auth import` necessary for setup"],"zh":["需要Spotify Premium账户","需要安装`spogo`或`spotify_player`","需要通过`spogo auth import`导入Cookie进行设置"],"ja":["Spotify Premiumアカウントが必要","`spogo`または`spotify_player`のいずれかをインストールする必要がある","`spogo auth import`でCookieをインポートする必要がある"],"ko":["Spotify Premium 계정이 필요합니다","`spogo` 또는 `spotify_player`를 설치해야 합니다","`spogo auth import`로 쿠키를 가져와야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere cuenta de Spotify Premium","Se requiere `spogo` o `spotify_player` instalado","Importar cookies a través de `spogo auth import` es necesario para la configuración"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Spotify Premium","Nécessite `spogo` ou `spotify_player` installé","Importer des cookies via `spogo auth import` est nécessaire pour la configuration"],"de":["Benötigt ein Spotify-Premium-Konto","Benötigt `spogo` oder `spotify_player` installiert","Das Importieren von Cookies über `spogo auth import` ist für die Einrichtung erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige conta Spotify Premium","Ou `spogo` ou `spotify_player` instalado","Importação de cookies via `spogo auth import` necessária para configuração"],"ru":["Требуется аккаунт Spotify Premium","Установлен либо `spogo`, либо `spotify_player`","Необходимо импортировать куки через `spogo auth import` для настройки"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Spotify Premium","إما `spogo` أو `spotify_player` مثبت","يُشtrl استيراد الكوكيز عبر `spogo auth import` ضروري للإعداد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
