ном времени","Обновления прогресса","Уведомления","Прямые данные","Веб-разработка","Веб-технологии"],"ar":["أحداث الملقم","SSE","بث مباشر في الوقت الحقيقي","تحديثات التقدم","الإشعارات","تغذية البيانات الحية","تطوير الويب","تقنيات الويب"]}},"owner":"vuthuonghai-steve","repo":"KLTN","repoPath":"vuthuonghai-steve/KLTN","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"server-sent-events","description":"Server-Sent Events (SSE) for real-time progress updates in Next.js/Vercel. TransformStream patterns, client consumption, progress tracking.","bodyPreview":"# Server-Sent Events (SSE)\n\nReal-time server-to-client streaming for progress updates, notifications, and live data feeds.\n\n## When to Use SSE vs Alternatives\n\n| Technology | Use When | Limitations |\n|------------|----------|-------------|\n| **SSE** | Server → Client only, progress updates, live feeds | Unidirectional, limited connections |\n| **WebSockets** | Bidirectional chat, gaming, collaboration | More complex, stateful |\n| **Polling** | Simple updates, wide compatibility | Inefficient, lat","body":"# Server-Sent Events (SSE)\n\nReal-time server-to-client streaming for progress updates, notifications, and live data feeds.\n\n## When to Use SSE vs Alternatives\n\n| Technology | Use When | Limitations |\n|------------|----------|-------------|\n| **SSE** | Server → Client only, progress updates, live feeds | Unidirectional, limited connections |\n| **WebSockets** | Bidirectional chat, gaming, collaboration | More complex, stateful |\n| **Polling** | Simple updates, wide compatibility | Inefficient, latency |\n| **HTTP Streaming** | Large file downloads | No structured events |\n\n**Choose SSE for:** Progress bars, status updates, notifications, log streaming, live dashboards.\n\n---\n\n## Next.js App Router Implementation\n\n### Server-Side (Route Handler)\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/progress/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest } from ''next/server''\n\ninterface SSEMessage {\n  progress: number\n  message: string\n  status: ''progress'' | ''complete'' | ''error''\n}\n\nexport async function POST(req: NextRequest) {\n  const body = await req.json()\n\n  // SSE Response Headers\n  const headers = {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''text/event-stream'',\n    ''Cache-Control'': ''no-cache'',\n    ''Connection'': ''keep-alive'',\n  }\n\n  // Create transform stream for SSE\n  const stream = new TransformStream()\n  const writer = stream.writable.getWriter()\n  const encoder = new TextEncoder()\n\n  // Helper to send SSE messages\n  async function sendSSE(data: SSEMessage) {\n    await writer.write(encoder.encode(`data: ${JSON.stringify(data)}\\n\\n`))\n  }\n\n  // Execute work with progress updates (async, don''t await)\n  ;(async () => {\n    try {\n      await sendSSE({ progress: 0, message: ''Starting...'', status: ''progress'' })\n\n      // Simulate work with progress updates\n      for (let i = 1; i <= 10; i++) {\n        await doSomeWork(i)\n        await sendSSE({\n          progress: i * 10,\n          message: `Processing step ${i} of 10...`,\n          status: ''progress''\n        })\n      }\n\n      await sendSSE({ progress: 100, message: ''Complete!'', status: ''complete'' })\n    } catch (error) {\n      const message = error instanceof Error ? error.message : ''Unknown error''\n      await sendSSE({ progress: 0, message, status: ''error'' })\n    } finally {\n      await writer.close()\n    }\n  })()\n\n  return new Response(stream.readable, { headers })\n}\n```\n\n### Client-Side Consumption\n\n```typescript\n// React component\n''use client''\n\nimport { useState } from ''react''\n\ninterface ProgressState {\n  progress: number\n  message: string\n  status: ''idle'' | ''progress'' | ''complete'' | ''error''\n}\n\nexport function ProgressTracker() {\n  const [state, setState] = useState<ProgressState>({\n    progress: 0,\n    message: '''',\n    status: ''idle''\n  })\n\n  async function startProcess() {\n    setState({ progress: 0, message: ''Connecting...'', status: ''progress'' })\n\n    const response = await fetch(''/api/progress'', {\n      method: ''POST'',\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ /* request data */ })\n    })\n\n    if (!response.body) {\n      setState({ progress: 0, message: ''No response body'', status: ''error'' })\n      return\n    }\n\n    const reader = response.body.getReader()\n    const decoder = new TextDecoder()\n    let buffer = ''''\n\n    while (true) {\n      const { done, value } = await reader.read()\n      if (done) break\n\n      buffer += decoder.decode(value, { stream: true })\n\n      // Parse SSE messages from buffer\n      const lines = buffer.split(''\\n\\n'')\n      buffer = lines.pop() || '''' // Keep incomplete message in buffer\n\n      for (const line of lines) {\n        if (line.startsWith(''data: '')) {\n          const data = JSON.parse(line.slice(6))\n          setState({\n            progress: data.progress,\n            message: data.message,\n            status: data.status\n          })\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <button onClick={startProcess} disabled={state.status === ''progress''}>\n        Start Process\n      </button>\n      <progress value={state.progress} max={100} />\n      <p>{state.message}</p>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## SSE Message Format\n\n### Standard Format\n\n```\ndata: {\"key\": \"value\"}\\n\\n\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n- Each message ends with `\\n\\n` (double newline)\n- Data line starts with `data: `\n- Multiple data lines allowed per message\n- Optional `event:`, `id:`, `retry:` fields\n\n### Named Events\n\n```typescript\n// Server\nasync function sendNamedEvent(event: string, data: object) {\n  await writer.write(encoder.encode(\n    `event: ${event}\\ndata: ${JSON.stringify(data)}\\n\\n`\n  ))\n}\n\n// Send different event types\nawait sendNamedEvent(''progress'', { percent: 50 })\nawait sendNamedEvent(''log'', { message: ''Processing...'' })\nawait sendNamedEvent(''complete'', { result: ''success'' })\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Client with EventSource (for GET endpoints)\nconst source = new EventSource(''/api/events'')\n\nsource.addEventListener(''progress'', (e) => {\n  const data = JSON.parse(e.data)\n  console.log(''Progress:'', data.percent)\n})\n\nsource.addEventListener(''complete'', (e) => {\n  const data = JSON.parse(e.data)\n  console.log(''Done:'', data.result)\n  source.close()\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Vercel Considerations\n\n### Critical: Background Task Termination\n\n<EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\nOn Vercel, SSE works differently than traditional servers. The function stays alive while the stream is open, but you must manage the lifecycle carefully.\n</EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>\n\n```typescript\n// CORRECT: Stream keeps function alive until closed\n;(async () => {\n  try {\n    // Do all work here\n    for (const item of items) {\n      await processItem(item)\n      await sendSSE({ progress: calculateProgress(item) })\n    }\n    await sendSSE({ status: ''complete'' })\n  } finally {\n    await writer.close() // MUST close to end function\n  }\n})()\n\nreturn new Response(stream.readable, { headers })\n```\n\n### Timeout Limits\n\n| Plan | Max Duration |\n|------|--------------|\n| Hobby | 10 seconds |\n| Pro | 60 seconds |\n| Enterprise | 900 seconds |\n\nFor long operations, consider:\n- Breaking into smaller chunks\n- Using background jobs (Vercel Cron, external queue)\n- Providing estimated time warnings\n\n---\n\n## Progress Patterns\n\n### Percentage-Based\n\n```typescript\ninterface PercentageProgress {\n  progress: number  // 0-100\n  message: string\n  status: ''progress'' | ''complete'' | ''error''\n}\n\n// Calculate progress for known item count\nconst total = items.length\nfor (let i = 0; i < items.length; i++) {\n  await processItem(items[i])\n  await sendSSE({\n    progress: Math.floor(((i + 1) / total) * 100),\n    message: `Processing ${i + 1} of ${total}...`,\n    status: ''progress''\n  })\n}\n```\n\n### Phase-Based\n\n```typescript\ninterface PhaseProgress {\n  phase: string\n  phaseProgress: number\n  overallProgress: number\n  message: string\n}\n\nconst phases = [\n  { name: ''validate'', weight: 10 },\n  { name: ''process'', weight: 70 },\n  { name: ''finalize'', weight: 20 },\n]\n\n// Track progress across phases\nlet overallProgress = 0\nfor (const phase of phases) {\n  await sendSSE({\n    phase: phase.name,\n    phaseProgress: 0,\n    overallProgress,\n    message: `Starting ${phase.name}...`\n  })\n\n  // Do phase work...\n\n  overallProgress += phase.weight\n}\n```\n\n### Indeterminate with Logs\n\n```typescript\ninterface LogProgress {\n  type: ''log'' | ''warning'' | ''error'' | ''complete''\n  message: string\n  timestamp: string\n}\n\n// For operations where progress can''t be calculated\nawait sendSSE({\n  type: ''log'',\n  message: ''Connecting to external service...'',\n  timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Server-Side\n\n```typescript\n;(async () => {\n  try {\n    await riskyOperation()\n    await sendSSE({ status: ''complete'', message: ''Done!'' })\n  } catch (error) {\n    // Always send error to client before closing\n    await sendSSE({\n      status: ''error'',\n      message: error instanceof Error ? error.message : ''Unknown error'',\n      progress: 0\n    })\n  } finally {\n    // ALWAYS close the stream\n    await writer.close()\n  }\n})()\n```\n\n### Client-Side\n\n```typescript\nasync function consumeSSE(url: string, body: object) {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(url, {\n      method: ''POST'',\n      body: JSON.stringify(body)\n    })\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`)\n    }\n\n    // Process stream...\n  } catch (error) {\n    // Handle network errors, aborts, etc.\n    if (error.name === ''AbortError'') {\n      console.log(''Request cancelled'')\n    } else {\n      console.error(''SSE failed:'', error)\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Cancellation\n\n```typescript\n// Client with AbortController\nconst controller = new AbortController()\n\nconst response = await fetch(''/api/progress'', {\n  method: ''POST'',\n  body: JSON.stringify(data),\n  signal: controller.signal\n})\n\n// Cancel button handler\nfunction handleCancel() {\n  controller.abort()\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Real-World Example: Batch Processing\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/batch/route.ts\nexport async function POST(req: NextRequest) {\n  const { items } = await req.json()\n\n  const stream = new TransformStream()\n  const writer = stream.writable.getWriter()\n  const encoder = new TextEncoder()\n\n  const sendSSE = async (data: object) => {\n    await writer.write(encoder.encode(`data: ${JSON.stringify(data)}\\n\\n`))\n  }\n\n  ;(async () => {\n    const results = { success: 0, failed: 0, errors: [] as string[] }\n\n    try {\n      await sendSSE({\n        status: ''progress'',\n        progress: 0,\n        message: `Processing ${items.length} items...`\n      })\n\n      for (let i = 0; i < items.length; i++) {\n        try {\n          await processItem(items[i])\n          results.success++\n        } catch (err) {\n          results.failed++\n          results.errors.push(`Item ${i}: ${err.message}`)\n        }\n\n        await sendSSE({\n          status: ''progress'',\n          progress: Math.floor(((i + 1) / items.length) * 100),\n          message: `Processed ${i + 1} of ${items.length}`,\n          results: { ...results }\n        })\n      }\n\n      await sendSSE({\n        status: ''complete'',\n        progress: 100,\n        message: `Complete: ${results.success} succeeded, ${results.failed} failed`,\n        results\n      })\n    } catch (error) {\n      await sendSSE({\n        status: ''error'',\n        message: error instanceof Error ? error.message : ''Batch failed'',\n        results\n      })\n    } finally {\n      await writer.close()\n    }\n  })()\n\n  return new Response(stream.readable, {\n    headers: {\n      ''Content-Type'': ''text/event-stream'',\n      ''Cache-Control'': ''no-cache'',\n      ''Connection'': ''keep-alive'',\n    }\n  })\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```typescript\n// Minimal SSE endpoint\nexport async function POST(req: NextRequest) {\n  const stream = new TransformStream()\n  const writer = stream.writable.getWriter()\n  const encoder = new TextEncoder()\n\n  ;(async () => {\n    await writer.write(encoder.encode(`data: {\"message\":\"Hello\"}\\n\\n`))\n    await writer.close()\n  })()\n\n  return new Response(stream.readable, {\n    headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''text/event-stream'' }\n  })\n}\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Minimal client consumption\nconst res = await fetch(''/api/sse'', { method: ''POST'' })\nconst reader = res.body!.getReader()\nconst decoder = new TextDecoder()\n\nwhile (true) {\n  const { done, value } = await reader.read()\n  if (done) break\n  console.log(decoder.decode(value))\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [MDN: Server-Sent Events](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Server-sent_events)\n- [Vercel: Streaming](https://vercel.com/docs/functions/streaming)\n- [Web Streams API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Streams_API)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:15:58.519Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Real-Time Update Agents needing efficient server-to-client streaming for progress updates and live data feeds.","zh":"非常适合需要高效服务器到客户端流式传输进度更新和实时数据feed的实时更新代理。","ja":"リアルタイム更新エージェントが進度更新とライブデータフィードのための効率的なサーバーからクライアントへのストリーミングが必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"실시간 업데이트가 필요한 에이전트에게 효율적인 서버에서 클라이언트로의 스트리밍을 위한 진행 상황 업데이트와 라이브 데이터 피드에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Actualización en Tiempo Real que necesitan una transmisión eficiente del servidor al cliente para actualizaciones de progreso y feeds de datos en vivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Mise à Jour en Temps Réel ayant besoin d''un streaming efficace du serveur au client pour les mises à jour de progression et les flux de données en direct.","de":"Perfekt für Echtzeit-Update-Agents, die effizientes Server-zu-Client-Streaming für Fortschrittsupdates und Live-Daten-Feeds benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Atualização em Tempo Real que precisam de transmissão eficiente do servidor para o cliente para atualizações de progresso e feeds de dados ao vivo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обновления в реальном времени, которым необходима эффективная передача данных от сервера к клиенту для обновлений прогресса и прямых потоков данных.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحديث في الوقت الفعلي الذين يحتاجون إلى بث خادم-العميل فعال لتحديثات التقدم وتغذية البيانات المباشرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to establish unidirectional communication using Server-Sent Events (SSE) protocol, enabling real-time server-to-client streaming for progress updates, notifications, and live data feeds, leveraging HTTP connections for efficient data transfer.","zh":"使代理能够使用服务器发送事件（SSE）协议建立单向通信，从而实现进度更新、通知和实时数据feed的实时服务器到客户端流式传输，利用HTTP连接实现高效的数据传输。","ja":"サーバーセントイベント（SSE）プロトコルを使用してエージェントが単方向の通信を確立できるようにし、進度更新、通知、ライブデータフィードのためのリアルタイムサーバーからクライアントへのストリーミングを可能にし、HTTP接続を使用して効率的なデータ転送を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 서버 전송 이벤트(SSE) 프로토콜을 사용하여 단방향 통신을 설정할 수 있도록하여 진행 상황 업데이트와 알림 및 라이브 데이터 피드에 대한 실시간 서버에서 클라이언트로의 스트리밍을 가능하게 하며 HTTP 연결을 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 전송을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a establecer una comunicación unidireccional utilizando el protocolo Server-Sent Events (SSE), lo que permite el streaming en tiempo real del servidor al cliente para actualizaciones de progreso, notificaciones y feeds de datos en vivo, aprovechando las conexiones HTTP para una transferencia de datos eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''établir une communication unidirectionnelle en utilisant le protocole Server-Sent Events (SSE), permettant ainsi le streaming en temps réel du serveur au client pour les mises à jour de progression, les notifications et les flux de données en direct, en exploitant les connexions HTTP pour un transfert de données efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine unidirektionale Kommunikation mithilfe des Server-Sent-Events-Protokolls (SSE) herzustellen, wodurch ein Echtzeit-Streaming vom Server zum Client für Fortschrittsupdates, Benachrichtigungen und Live-Daten-Feeds ermöglicht wird, indem HTTP-Verbindungen für einen effizienten Datentransfer genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estabelecer comunicação unidirecional usando o protocolo Server-Sent Events (SSE), permitindo transmissão em tempo real do servidor para o cliente para atualizações de progresso, notificações e feeds de dados ao vivo, aproveitando conexões HTTP para transferência de dados eficiente.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность устанавливать одностороннюю связь с использованием протокола Server-Sent Events (SSE), что позволяет осуществлять передачу данных в реальном времени от сервера к клиенту для обновлений прогресса, уведомлений и прямых потоков данных, используя соединения HTTP для эффективной передачи данных.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من建立 اتصال أحادي الاتجاه باستخدام بروتوكول Server-Sent Events (SSE) ، مما يسمح بالبث في الوقت الفعلي من الخادم إلى العميل لتحديثات التقدم والإشعارات وتغذية البيانات المباشرة ، واستخدام الاتصالات HTTP لنقل البيانات بكفاءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Streaming live updates to clients","Sending real-time notifications","Providing progress updates for long-running tasks"],"zh":["将实时更新流式传输到客户端","发送实时通知","为长时间运行的任务提供进度更新"],"ja":["クライアントにリアルタイム更新をストリーミングする","リアルタイム通知を送信する","長時間実行されるタスクの進度更新を提供する"],"ko":["클라이언트에 실시간 업데이트를 스트리밍하는 것","실시간 알림을 보내는 것","오랜 시간 실행되는 작업에 대한 진행 상황 업데이트를 제공하는 것"],"es":["Transmisión de actualizaciones en vivo a los clientes","Envío de notificaciones en tiempo real","Proporcionar actualizaciones de progreso para tareas de larga duración"],"fr":["Diffusion de mises à jour en direct aux clients","Envoi de notifications en temps réel","Fournir des mises à jour de progression pour les tâches à longue durée"],"de":["Streaming von Live-Updates an Clients","Senden von Echtzeit-Benachrichtigungen","Bereitstellen von Fortschrittsupdates für lang laufende Aufgaben"],"pt":["Transmitir atualizações ao vivo para os clientes","Enviar notificações em tempo real","Fornecer atualizações de progresso para tarefas de longa duração"],"ru":["Передача обновлений в реальном времени клиентам","Отправка уведомлений в реальном времени","Предоставление обновлений прогресса для задач длительного выполнения"],"ar":["بث تحديثات مباشرة إلى العملاء","إرسال الإشعارات في الوقت الفعلي","توفير تحديثات التقدم للمهام التي تستغرق وقتًا طويلاً"]},"limitations":{"en":["Unidirectional communication only","Limited connections","Not suitable for bidirectional communication or stateful applications"],"zh":["仅支持单向通信","连接有限","不适合双向通信或有状态应用程序"],"ja":["単方向の通信のみをサポート","接続数が限られている","双方向の通信やステートフルなアプリケーションには不適"],"ko":["단방향 통신만 지원함","연결이 제한됨","양방향 통신 또는 상태가 있는 애플리케이션에 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Comunicación unidireccional solo","Conexiones limitadas","No adecuado para la comunicación bidireccional o aplicaciones con estado"],"fr":["Communication unidirectionnelle uniquement","Connexions limitées","Non adapté pour la communication bidirectionnelle ou les applications à état"],"de":["Nur unidirektionale Kommunikation","Begrenzte Verbindungen","Nicht geeignet für bidirektionale Kommunikation oder stateful-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Comunicação unidirecional apenas","Conexões limitadas","Não adequado para comunicação bidirecional ou aplicações com estado"],"ru":["Только односторонняя связь","Ограниченное количество соединений","Не подходит для двусторонней связи или приложений со сохранением состояния"],"ar":["التواصل أحادي الاتجاه فقط","اتصالات محدودة","لا يصلح للاتصال ثنائي الاتجاه أو التطبيقات الحالة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
