ring","ar":"بناء ميكروسيرفس مع سبرينج","en":"spring-microservices"},"description":{"zh":"Spring ","ja":"Spring","ko":"Spring ","es":"Construye arquitecturas de microservicios distribuidas con Spring Cloud Gateway y patrones de resiliencia. Crea sistemas escalables y flexibles","fr":"Construire des architectures de microservices distribuées avec Spring Cloud Gateway et des modèles de résilience. Créez des systèmes évolutifs et flexibles","de":"Erstellen Sie verteilte Microservice-Architekturen mit Spring Cloud Gateway und Resilienzmustern. Erstellen Sie skalierbare und flexible Systeme","pt":"O Skill Spring Microservices permite criar arquiteturas de microsserviços distribuídos com Spring Cloud Gateway e padrões de resiliência","ru":"Навык Spring Microservices позволяет создавать распределенные микросервисные архитектуры с помощью Spring Cloud Gateway и шаблонов резилиентности","ar":"مهارة سبرينج ميكروسيرفس تمكن من بناء هندسة ميكروسيرفس موزعة مع سبرينج كلاود جيتوي و أنماط متابعة","en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stac..."},"definition":{"en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stack. Supports blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more. Includes refactoring capabilities for existing projects"},"features":{"zh":["Spring Cloud Gateway","API","SAP","Python",""],"ja":["Spring Cloud Gateway","API","SAP","Python",""],"ko":["Spring Cloud Gateway","API","SAP","Python",""],"es":["Arquitecturas de microservicios distribuidas","Puerta de enlace API con Spring Cloud Gateway","Descubrimiento y registro de servicios","Gestión de configuración centralizada","Patrones de resiliencia y circuito breaker","Seguimiento distribuido de servicios"],"fr":["Architectures de microservices distribuées","Passerelle API avec Spring Cloud Gateway","Découverte et enregistrement de services","Gestion de configuration centralisée","Modèles de résilience et circuit breaker","Traçage distribué de services"],"de":["Verteilte Microservice-Architekturen","API-Gateway mit Spring Cloud Gateway","Service-Entdeckung und -Registrierung","Zentrale Konfigurationsverwaltung","Resilienzmuster und Schaltkreisbrecher","Verteilte Dienstnachverfolgung"],"pt":["Criação de arquiteturas de microsserviços distribuídos","Implementação de padrões de API Gateway","Descoberta e registro de serviços","Gerenciamento de configuração centralizado","Padrões de resiliência e circuit breaker","Rastreamento distribuído de serviços"],"ru":["Создание распределенных микросервисных архитектур","Реализация шаблонов API Gateway","Обнаружение и регистрация сервисов","Централизованное управление конфигурацией","Шаблоны резилиентности и цепной разрыв","Распределенный трейсинг сервисов"],"ar":["بناء هندسة ميكروسيرفس موزعة","تنفيذ أنماط البوابة_API","اكتشاف وتسجيل الخدمات","إدارة التهيئة المركزية","أنماط متابعة و كسر الدائرة","التحليل التistributed للخدمات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Spring ","Spring Cloud","Microservices","API","SAP","Python","Cloud Native"],"ja":["Spring ","Spring Cloud","Microservices","API","SAP","Python","Cloud Native"],"ko":["Spring ","Spring Cloud","Microservices","API","SAP","Python","Cloud Native"],"es":["Spring Microservices","arquitecturas de microservicios","Spring Cloud Gateway","patrones de resiliencia","microservicios distribuidos","desarrollo de software","arquitectura de software","diseño de sistemas"],"fr":["Spring Microservices","architectures de microservices","Spring Cloud Gateway","modèles de résilience","microservices distribués","développement de logiciels","architecture de logiciels","conception de systèmes"],"de":["Spring Microservices","Microservice-Architekturen","Spring Cloud Gateway","Resilienzmuster","vertteilte Microservices","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Architektur","System-Design"],"pt":["Spring Microservices","Microsserviços distribuídos","Spring Cloud Gateway","API Gateway","Resiliência","Circuit Breaker","Distributed Tracing","Arquitetura de microsserviços"],"ru":["Spring Microservices","Распределенные микросервисы","Spring Cloud Gateway","API Gateway","Резилиентность","Цепной разрыв","Распределенный трейсинг","Архитектура микросервисов"],"ar":["سبرينج ميكروسيرفس","ميكروسيرفس موزعة","سبرينج كلاود جيتوي","بوابة_API","متابعة","كسر الدائرة","التحليل التistributed","هندسة ميكروسيرفس"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"spring-microservices","description":"Spring Cloud microservices patterns with gateway, discovery, and resilience","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Spring Microservices Skill\n\nBuild distributed microservices architectures using Spring Cloud Gateway, service discovery, configuration management, and resilience patterns.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building distributed microservices systems\n- Implementing API gateway patterns\n- Service discovery and registration\n- Centralized configuration management\n- Circuit breaker and resilience patterns\n- Distributed tracing across services\n- Event-driven microservices architecture\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```xml\n<!--","body":"# Spring Microservices Skill\n\nBuild distributed microservices architectures using Spring Cloud Gateway, service discovery, configuration management, and resilience patterns.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building distributed microservices systems\n- Implementing API gateway patterns\n- Service discovery and registration\n- Centralized configuration management\n- Circuit breaker and resilience patterns\n- Distributed tracing across services\n- Event-driven microservices architecture\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```xml\n<!-- Spring Cloud Dependencies -->\n<dependencyManagement>\n    <dependencies>\n        <dependency>\n            <groupId>org.springframework.cloud</groupId>\n            <artifactId>spring-cloud-dependencies</artifactId>\n            <version>2023.0.0</version>\n            <type>pom</type>\n            <scope>import</scope>\n        </dependency>\n    </dependencies>\n</dependencyManagement>\n```\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Spring Cloud Gateway\n\nConfigure API Gateway for routing and cross-cutting concerns:\n\n```java\n// GatewayApplication.java\n@SpringBootApplication\npublic class GatewayApplication {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        SpringApplication.run(GatewayApplication.class, args);\n    }\n}\n\n// application.yml\nspring:\n  cloud:\n    gateway:\n      routes:\n        - id: user-service\n          uri: lb://user-service\n          predicates:\n            - Path=/api/users/**\n          filters:\n            - StripPrefix=1\n            - name: RequestRateLimiter\n              args:\n                redis-rate-limiter.replenishRate: 10\n                redis-rate-limiter.burstCapacity: 20\n        - id: order-service\n          uri: lb://order-service\n          predicates:\n            - Path=/api/orders/**\n          filters:\n            - StripPrefix=1\n            - name: CircuitBreaker\n              args:\n                name: orderServiceCircuitBreaker\n                fallbackUri: forward:/fallback/orders\n\n// GatewayConfig.java\n@Configuration\npublic class GatewayConfig {\n    \n    @Bean\n    public RouteLocator customRouteLocator(RouteLocatorBuilder builder) {\n        return builder.routes()\n            .route(\"user-service\", r -> r\n                .path(\"/api/users/**\")\n                .filters(f -> f\n                    .addRequestHeader(\"X-Gateway-Request\", \"true\")\n                    .retry(retryConfig -> retryConfig\n                        .setRetries(3)\n                        .setMethods(HttpMethod.GET)\n                        .setBackoff(Duration.ofMillis(100), Duration.ofSeconds(2), 2, false)\n                    )\n                )\n                .uri(\"lb://user-service\"))\n            .build();\n    }\n    \n    @Bean\n    public GlobalFilter customGlobalFilter() {\n        return (exchange, chain) -> {\n            ServerHttpRequest request = exchange.getRequest();\n            ServerHttpRequest modifiedRequest = request.mutate()\n                .header(\"X-Gateway-Timestamp\", String.valueOf(System.currentTimeMillis()))\n                .build();\n            return chain.filter(exchange.mutate().request(modifiedRequest).build());\n        };\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 2: Service Discovery with Eureka\n\nSet up Eureka server and client registration:\n\n```java\n// EurekaServerApplication.java\n@SpringBootApplication\n@EnableEurekaServer\npublic class EurekaServerApplication {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        SpringApplication.run(EurekaServerApplication.class, args);\n    }\n}\n\n// eureka-server application.yml\nserver:\n  port: 8761\neureka:\n  instance:\n    hostname: localhost\n  client:\n    register-with-eureka: false\n    fetch-registry: false\n\n// UserServiceApplication.java (Client)\n@SpringBootApplication\n@EnableEurekaClient\npublic class UserServiceApplication {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        SpringApplication.run(UserServiceApplication.class, args);\n    }\n}\n\n// user-service application.yml\nspring:\n  application:\n    name: user-service\neureka:\n  client:\n    service-url:\n      defaultZone: http://localhost:8761/eureka/\n  instance:\n    prefer-ip-address: true\n```\n\n### Step 3: Config Server\n\nCentralized configuration management:\n\n```java\n// ConfigServerApplication.java\n@SpringBootApplication\n@EnableConfigServer\npublic class ConfigServerApplication {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        SpringApplication.run(ConfigServerApplication.class, args);\n    }\n}\n\n// config-server application.yml\nspring:\n  cloud:\n    config:\n      server:\n        git:\n          uri: https://github.com/org/config-repo\n          search-paths: ''{application}''\n          clone-on-start: true\n\n// Client application.yml\nspring:\n  cloud:\n    config:\n      uri: http://localhost:8888\n      name: user-service\n      profile: dev\n```\n\n### Step 4: Circuit Breaker with Resilience4j\n\nImplement circuit breaker pattern:\n\n```java\n// UserServiceClient.java\n@Service\npublic class UserServiceClient {\n    \n    private final RestTemplate restTemplate;\n    private final CircuitBreaker circuitBreaker;\n    \n    public UserServiceClient(RestTemplate restTemplate, CircuitBreakerRegistry circuitBreakerRegistry) {\n        this.restTemplate = restTemplate;\n        this.circuitBreaker = circuitBreakerRegistry.circuitBreaker(\"userService\");\n    }\n    \n    @CircuitBreaker(name = \"userService\", fallbackMethod = \"getUserFallback\")\n    public User getUser(Long id) {\n        return circuitBreaker.executeSupplier(() -> \n            restTemplate.getForObject(\"http://user-service/api/users/{id}\", User.class, id)\n        );\n    }\n    \n    public User getUserFallback(Long id, Exception ex) {\n        return User.builder()\n            .id(id)\n            .name(\"Fallback User\")\n            .email(\"fallback@example.com\")\n            .build();\n    }\n}\n\n// Resilience4jConfig.java\n@Configuration\npublic class Resilience4jConfig {\n    \n    @Bean\n    public CircuitBreakerRegistry circuitBreakerRegistry() {\n        CircuitBreakerConfig config = CircuitBreakerConfig.custom()\n            .failureRateThreshold(50)\n            .waitDurationInOpenState(Duration.ofMillis(1000))\n            .slidingWindowSize(10)\n            .build();\n        \n        return CircuitBreakerRegistry.of(config);\n    }\n    \n    @Bean\n    public TimeLimiterRegistry timeLimiterRegistry() {\n        return TimeLimiterRegistry.of(TimeLimiterConfig.custom()\n            .timeoutDuration(Duration.ofSeconds(3))\n            .build());\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Distributed Tracing\n\nSet up Micrometer Tracing with Zipkin:\n\n```java\n// pom.xml\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>io.micrometer</groupId>\n    <artifactId>micrometer-tracing-bridge-brave</artifactId>\n</dependency>\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>io.zipkin.reporter2</groupId>\n    <artifactId>zipkin-reporter-brave</artifactId>\n</dependency>\n\n// application.yml\nmanagement:\n  tracing:\n    sampling:\n      probability: 1.0\n  zipkin:\n    tracing:\n      endpoint: http://localhost:9411/api/v2/spans\n\n// TracingConfig.java\n@Configuration\npublic class TracingConfig {\n    \n    @Bean\n    public Sender sender() {\n        return OkHttpSender.create(\"http://localhost:9411/api/v2/spans\");\n    }\n    \n    @Bean\n    public AsyncReporter<Span> spanReporter() {\n        return AsyncReporter.create(sender());\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 6: Event-Driven with Spring Cloud Stream\n\nImplement event-driven microservices:\n\n```java\n// OrderService.java\n@Service\npublic class OrderService {\n    \n    private final StreamBridge streamBridge;\n    \n    public OrderService(StreamBridge streamBridge) {\n        this.streamBridge = streamBridge;\n    }\n    \n    public void createOrder(Order order) {\n        // Process order\n        orderRepository.save(order);\n        \n        // Publish event\n        streamBridge.send(\"orderCreated-out-0\", OrderCreatedEvent.builder()\n            .orderId(order.getId())\n            .userId(order.getUserId())\n            .totalAmount(order.getTotalAmount())\n            .timestamp(Instant.now())\n            .build());\n    }\n}\n\n// NotificationService.java\n@SpringBootApplication\n@EnableBinding(Sink.class)\npublic class NotificationService {\n    \n    @StreamListener(Sink.INPUT)\n    public void handleOrderCreated(OrderCreatedEvent event) {\n        // Send notification\n        notificationService.sendEmail(event.getUserId(), \n            \"Order \" + event.getOrderId() + \" created\");\n    }\n}\n\n// application.yml\nspring:\n  cloud:\n    stream:\n      bindings:\n        orderCreated-out-0:\n          destination: order-created\n          binder: kafka\n        input:\n          destination: order-created\n          group: notification-service\n      kafka:\n        binder:\n          brokers: localhost:9092\n```\n\n## Output\n\n- Microservices with service discovery integration\n- API Gateway with routing and filtering\n- Centralized configuration server\n- Circuit breaker implementations\n- Distributed tracing setup\n- Event-driven communication patterns\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Use API Gateway for single entry point and cross-cutting concerns\n- Implement service discovery for dynamic service location\n- Use Config Server for centralized configuration management\n- Apply circuit breakers to prevent cascading failures\n- Implement distributed tracing for observability\n- Use event-driven patterns for loose coupling\n- Implement retry logic with exponential backoff\n- Use rate limiting to protect services\n- Monitor service health with health checks\n- Implement graceful degradation with fallbacks\n\n## Related\n\n- Knowledge: `{directories.knowledge}/spring-microservices-patterns.json`\n- Skill: `spring-boot-development` for service implementation\n- Skill: `spring-observability` for monitoring and metrics\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:16:03.991Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cursor IDE development agents specializing in enterprise Java microservices architecture generation.","zh":"非常适合Cursor IDE开发代理，专注于企业Java微服务架构生成。","ja":"Cursor IDE開発エージェントに最適で、企業向けJavaマイクロサービスアーキテクチャーの生成を専門としています。","ko":"Cursor IDE 개발 에이전트에 적합하며, 기업용 Java 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 생성을 전문으로 합니다.","es":"Perfect for Cursor IDE development agents specializing in enterprise Java microservices architecture generation.","fr":"Perfect for Cursor IDE development agents specializing in enterprise Java microservices architecture generation.","de":"Perfect for Cursor IDE development agents specializing in enterprise Java microservices architecture generation.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento do Cursor IDE especializados em geração de arquitetura de microsserviços Java empresariais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Cursor IDE, специализирующихся на создании архитектуры корпоративных микросервисов Java.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير وكلاء Cursor IDE المتخصصة في إنتاج بنية微خدمات جافا الشركات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to generate complete Spring Cloud microservices ecosystems including API Gateway configurations, service discovery setups, and distributed tracing implementations. Provides blueprint-based scaffolding for SAP integration, Python services, and cloud-native patterns with built-in refactoring capabilities for existing projects.","zh":"使代理能够生成完整的Spring Cloud微服务生态系统，包括API网关配置、服务发现设置和分布式跟踪实现。为SAP集成、Python服务和云原生模式提供了基于蓝图的脚手架，并具有对现有项目的重构能力。","ja":"エージェントがSpring Cloudマイクロサービスエコシステムを完全に生成できるようにします。APIゲートウェイ設定、サービス発見設定、分布トレーシング実装などを含みます。SAP統合、Pythonサービス、クラウドネイティブパターンに対するブループリントベースのスキャフォールディングを提供し、既存のプロジェクトのリファクタリング機能を備えています。","ko":"에이전트가 스프링 클라우드 마이크로 서비스 에코 시스템을 완전히 생성할 수 있도록 해줍니다. API 게이트웨이 설정, 서비스 발견 설정, 분산 추적 구현 등을 포함합니다. SAP 통합, 파이썬 서비스, 클라우드 네이티브 패턴을 위한 블루프린트 기반 스캐폴딩을 제공하며 기존 프로젝트의 리팩토링 기능을 갖추고 있습니다.","es":"Enables agents to generate complete Spring Cloud microservices ecosystems including API Gateway configurations, service discovery setups, and distributed tracing implementations. Provides blueprint-based scaffolding for SAP integration, Python services, and cloud-native patterns with built-in refactoring capabilities for existing projects.","fr":"Enables agents to generate complete Spring Cloud microservices ecosystems including API Gateway configurations, service discovery setups, and distributed tracing implementations. Provides blueprint-based scaffolding for SAP integration, Python services, and cloud-native patterns with built-in refactoring capabilities for existing projects.","de":"Enables agents to generate complete Spring Cloud microservices ecosystems including API Gateway configurations, service discovery setups, and distributed tracing implementations. Provides blueprint-based scaffolding for SAP integration, Python services, and cloud-native patterns with built-in refactoring capabilities for existing projects.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem ecossistemas de microsserviços Spring Cloud completos, incluindo configurações de API Gateway, configurações de descoberta de serviço e implementações de rastreamento distribuído. Fornece estrutura de blueprint para integração SAP, serviços Python e padrões nativos de nuvem com capacidades de refatoração incorporadas para projetos existentes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать полные экосистемы микросервисов Spring Cloud, включая конфигурации API Gateway, настройки обнаружения служб и реализации распределенного трассирования. Предоставляет базовую структуру для интеграции SAP, сервисов Python и облачных моделей с встроенными возможностями рефакторинга для существующих проектов.","ar":"يمكن للوكالات إنتاج بيئات микروخدمات سبرينج كلاود كاملة، بما في ذلك تكوين بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، وإعدادات اكتشاف الخدمة، وتنفيذ التتبع الموزع. يوفر هيكلاً مبدئياً لإدماج برنامج SAP، وخدمات بايثون، والأنماط الأصلية السحابية مع إمكانيات إعادة هيكلة مدمجة لمشاريع موجودة"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating Spring Cloud Gateway configurations","Implementing service discovery with Eureka or Consul","Setting up centralized configuration management","Adding circuit breaker resilience patterns","Refactoring monolithic applications to microservices"],"zh":["生成Spring Cloud Gateway配置","使用Eureka或Consul实现服务发现","设置集中式配置管理","添加电路断路器弹性模式","将单体应用程序重构为微服务"],"ja":["Spring Cloud Gateway設定の生成","EurekaまたはConsulを使用したサービス発見の実装","集中型設定管理の設定","サーキットブレーカー弾力性パターンの追加","モノリシックアプリケーションをマイクロサービスにリファクタリング"],"ko":["스프링 클라우드 게이트웨이 설정 생성","유레카 또는 컨설을 사용한 서비스 발견 구현","집중식 구성 관리 설정","서킷 브레이커 탄성 패턴 추가","단일체 애플리케이션을 마이크로 서비스로 리팩토링"],"es":["Generating Spring Cloud Gateway co