リッシャーとコンシューマーを設定します。モジュール実装ガイドの第9節に従います","ko":"이벤트 핸들러를 생성하고 RabbitMQ 이벤트 발행자 및 소비자를 설정합니다. 모듈 구현 가이드의 9번째 절에 따릅니다","es":"El skill ''create-event-handlers'' permite configurar publishers y consumidores de eventos de RabbitMQ de manera efectiva.","fr":"Le skill ''create-event-handlers'' permet de configurer des éditeurs et des consommateurs d''événements RabbitMQ de manière efficace.","de":"Das Skill ''create-event-handlers'' ermöglicht die effektive Konfiguration von RabbitMQ-Ereignisverlegern und -verbrauchern.","pt":"Configura publicadores e consumidores de eventos RabbitMQ seguindo o guia de implementação de módulos. Aprenda a criar tratadores de eventos com tenantId.","ru":"Настройте издателей и потребителей событий RabbitMQ, следуя руководству по реализации модулей. Узнайте, как создать обработчики событий с tenantId.","ar":"اضبط الناشرين ومستهلكي الأحداث من RabbitMQ باتباع دليل تنفيذ الوحدات. تعلم كيفية إنشاء معالجات للأحداث مع tenantId.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设置RabbitMQ事件发布者和消费者","按照模块实现指南第9节进行","使用tenantId进行事件上下文","遵循{domain}.{entity}.{action}的事件命名约定"],"ja":["RabbitMQイベントパブリッシャーとコンシューマーの設定","モジュール実装ガイドの第9節に従う","tenantIdを使用したイベントコンテキスト","{domain}.{entity}.{action}のイベント命名規則に従う"],"ko":["RabbitMQ 이벤트 발행자 및 소비자 설정","모듈 구현 가이드의 9번째 절에 따름","tenantId를 사용한 이벤트 컨텍스트","{domain}.{entity}.{action}의 이벤트 명명 규칙을 따름"],"es":["Configuración de publishers y consumidores de eventos de RabbitMQ","Uso de la convención de nombres de eventos {dominio}.{entidad}.{acción}","Soporte para eventos de tenant","Exclusión de organizationId en las cargas de eventos","Uso de tenantId para el contexto de tenant"],"fr":["Configuration d''éditeurs et de consommateurs d''événements RabbitMQ","Utilisation de la convention d''appellation d''événements {domaine}.{entité}.{action}","Prise en charge des événements de tenant","Exclusion de organizationId des charges d''événements","Utilisation de tenantId pour le contexte de tenant"],"de":["Konfiguration von RabbitMQ-Ereignisverlegern und -verbrauchern","Verwendung der Ereignisbenennungskonvention {Domäne}.{Entität}.{Aktion}","Unterstützung für Tenant-Ereignisse","Ausschluss von organizationId aus den Ereignisladungen","Verwendung von tenantId für den Tenant-Kontext"],"pt":["Configuração de publicadores e consumidores de eventos RabbitMQ","Uso de tenantId para contexto de tenant","Conformidade com o guia de implementação de módulos","Nomeação de eventos com formato {domain}.{entity}.{action}","Suporte a eventos de criação, login e notificação"],"ru":["Настройка издателей и потребителей событий RabbitMQ","Использование tenantId для контекста арендатора","Соответствие руководству по реализации модулей","Именование событий с форматом {domain}.{entity}.{action}","Поддержка событий создания, входа и уведомления"],"ar":["ضبط الناشرين ومستهلكي الأحداث من RabbitMQ","استخدام tenantId للسياق الإيجاري","الامتثال لدليل تنفيذ الوحدات","تسمية الأحداث بالتنسيق {domain}.{entity}.{action}","دعم أحداث الإنشاء والولوج والإشعار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["事件处理程序","RabbitMQ","事件发布者","事件消费者","tenantId","事件命名约定"],"ja":["イベントハンドラー","RabbitMQ","イベントパブリッシャー","イベントコンシューマー","tenantId","イベント命名規則"],"ko":["이벤트 핸들러","RabbitMQ","이벤트 발행자","이벤트 소비자","tenantId","이벤트 명명 규칙"],"es":["controladores de eventos","RabbitMQ","publicación de eventos","suscripción de eventos","convención de nombres de eventos","tenant","organizationId","tenantId"],"fr":["gestionnaires d''événements","RabbitMQ","publication d''événements","abonnement d''événements","convention d''appellation d''événements","tenant","organizationId","tenantId"],"de":["Ereignishandler","RabbitMQ","Ereignisveröffentlichung","Ereignisabonnement","Ereignisbenennungskonvention","Tenant","organizationId","tenantId"],"pt":["tratadores de eventos","RabbitMQ","tenantId","guia de implementação de módulos","nomeação de eventos","eventos de criação","eventos de login","eventos de notificação"],"ru":["обработчики событий","RabbitMQ","tenantId","руководство по реализации модулей","именование событий","события создания","события входа","события уведомления"],"ar":["معالجات الأحداث","RabbitMQ","tenantId","دليل تنفيذ الوحدات","تسمية الأحداث","أحداث الإنشاء","أحداث الولوج","أحداث الإشعار"]}},"owner":"Edgame2","repo":"castiel2","repoPath":"Edgame2/castiel2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-event-handlers","description":"Sets up RabbitMQ event publishers and consumers following ModuleImplementationGuide.md Section 9. RabbitMQ only (no Azure Service Bus). Creates publishers with DomainEvent (tenantId only; no organizationId), consumers with handlers, naming {domain}.{entity}.{action}, required fields (id, type, version, timestamp, tenantId, source, data). Use when adding event-driven communication, async workflows, or integrating via events.","bodyPreview":"# Create Event Handlers\n\nSets up RabbitMQ event publishers and consumers following ModuleImplementationGuide.md Section 9.\n\n**Tenant-only:** Events use `tenantId` only for tenant context. Do not include `organizationId` in event payloads or in `createBaseEvent`; use `tenantId` only.\n\n## Event Naming Convention\n\nReference: ModuleImplementationGuide.md Section 9.1\n\nFormat: `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`\n\n✅ **Correct:**\n- `user.created`\n- `auth.login.success`\n- `notification.email.sent`\n- `secret.rot","body":"# Create Event Handlers\n\nSets up RabbitMQ event publishers and consumers following ModuleImplementationGuide.md Section 9.\n\n**Tenant-only:** Events use `tenantId` only for tenant context. Do not include `organizationId` in event payloads or in `createBaseEvent`; use `tenantId` only.\n\n## Event Naming Convention\n\nReference: ModuleImplementationGuide.md Section 9.1\n\nFormat: `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`\n\n✅ **Correct:**\n- `user.created`\n- `auth.login.success`\n- `notification.email.sent`\n- `secret.rotated`\n\n❌ **Wrong:**\n- `userCreated`\n- `loginSuccess`\n- `emailSent`\n\n**Standard Actions:**\n- `created`, `updated`, `deleted`\n- `started`, `completed`, `failed`\n- `sent`, `received`, `expired`, `rotated`\n\n## Event Structure\n\nReference: ModuleImplementationGuide.md Section 9.2\n\n```typescript\ninterface DomainEvent<T = unknown> {\n  // Identity\n  id: string;                    // Unique event ID (UUID)\n  type: string;                  // Event type (domain.entity.action)\n  \n  // Metadata\n  timestamp: string;             // ISO 8601\n  version: string;               // Event schema version\n  source: string;                // Module that emitted\n  correlationId?: string;        // Request correlation\n  \n  // Context\n  tenantId: string;             // Tenant context (required; all users and data are scoped by tenant)\n  userId?: string;               // Actor\n  \n  // Payload\n  data: T;                       // Event-specific data\n}\n```\n\n## Event Publisher\n\nReference: containers/auth/src/events/publishers/AuthEventPublisher.ts\n\n### src/events/publishers/[Module]EventPublisher.ts\n\n```typescript\nimport { randomUUID } from ''crypto'';\nimport { EventPublisher, getChannel, closeConnection } from ''@coder/shared'';\nimport { log } from ''../../utils/logger'';\nimport { getConfig } from ''../../config'';\n\nlet publisher: EventPublisher | null = null;\n\nexport async function initializeEventPublisher(): Promise<void> {\n  if (publisher) return;\n  \n  const config = getConfig();\n  if (!config.rabbitmq?.url) {\n    log.warn(''RabbitMQ URL not configured, events will not be published'');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  try {\n    await getChannel();\n    publisher = new EventPublisher(config.rabbitmq.exchange || ''coder_events'');\n    log.info(''Event publisher initialized'', { exchange: config.rabbitmq.exchange });\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    log.error(''Failed to initialize event publisher'', error);\n  }\n}\n\nexport async function closeEventPublisher(): Promise<void> {\n  try {\n    await closeConnection();\n    publisher = null;\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    log.error(''Error closing event publisher'', error);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction getPublisher(): EventPublisher | null {\n  if (!publisher) {\n    const config = getConfig();\n    publisher = new EventPublisher(config.rabbitmq.exchange || ''coder_events'');\n  }\n  return publisher;\n}\n\nexport function createBaseEvent(\n  type: string,\n  userId?: string,\n  tenantId?: string,\n  correlationId?: string,\n  data?: any\n) {\n  return {\n    id: randomUUID(),\n    type,\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n    version: ''1.0'',\n    source: ''[module-name]'',\n    correlationId,\n    tenantId,\n    userId,\n    data: data || {},\n  };\n}\n\nexport async function publishEvent(event: any, routingKey?: string): Promise<void> {\n  const pub = getPublisher();\n  if (!pub) {\n    log.warn(''Event publisher not initialized, skipping event'', { type: event.type });\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  try {\n    await pub.publish(routingKey || event.type, event);\n    log.debug(''Event published'', { type: event.type, id: event.id });\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    log.error(''Failed to publish event'', error, { type: event.type });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Usage in Services\n\n```typescript\nimport { publishEvent, createBaseEvent } from ''../events/publishers/ModuleEventPublisher'';\n\n// Publish event (tenantId for tenant context)\nconst event = createBaseEvent(\n  ''resource.created'',\n  userId,\n  tenantId,\n  correlationId,\n  {\n    resourceId: resource.id,\n    name: resource.name,\n  }\n);\n\nawait publishEvent(event);\n```\n\n## Event Consumer\n\nReference: ModuleImplementationGuide.md Section 9.4\n\n### src/events/consumers/[Resource]Consumer.ts\n\n```typescript\nimport { EventConsumer } from ''@coder/shared'';\nimport { log } from ''../../utils/logger'';\nimport { getConfig } from ''../../config'';\n\nlet consumer: EventConsumer | null = null;\n\nexport async function initializeEventConsumer(): Promise<void> {\n  if (consumer) return;\n  \n  const config = getConfig();\n  if (!config.rabbitmq?.url) {\n    log.warn(''RabbitMQ URL not configured, events will not be consumed'');\n    return;\n  }\n  \n  try {\n    consumer = new EventConsumer({\n      queue: config.rabbitmq.queue || ''[module-name]_service'',\n      exchange: config.rabbitmq.exchange || ''coder_events'',\n      bindings: config.rabbitmq.bindings || [],\n    });\n    \n    // Register handlers\n    consumer.on(''other.resource.created'', handleResourceCreated);\n    consumer.on(''other.resource.updated'', handleResourceUpdated);\n    \n    await consumer.start();\n    log.info(''Event consumer initialized'', { queue: config.rabbitmq.queue });\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    log.error(''Failed to initialize event consumer'', error);\n  }\n}\n\nasync function handleResourceCreated(event: any): Promise<void> {\n  log.info(''Resource created event received'', { resourceId: event.data.resourceId });\n  // Handle the event\n}\n\nasync function handleResourceUpdated(event: any): Promise<void> {\n  log.info(''Resource updated event received'', { resourceId: event.data.resourceId });\n  // Handle the event\n}\n\nexport async function closeEventConsumer(): Promise<void> {\n  try {\n    if (consumer) {\n      await consumer.stop();\n      consumer = null;\n    }\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    log.error(''Error closing event consumer'', error);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Event Documentation\n\nReference: ModuleImplementationGuide.md Section 9.5\n\n### logs-events.md (if events are logged)\n\nCreate in module root if module publishes events that get logged:\n\n```markdown\n# [Module Name] - Logs Events\n\n## Published Events\n\n### {domain}.{entity}.{action}\n\n**Description**: When this event is triggered.\n\n**Triggered When**: \n- Condition 1\n- Condition 2\n\n**Event Type**: `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`\n\n**Event Schema**:\n\n\\`\\`\\`json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"id\", \"type\", \"timestamp\", \"version\", \"source\", \"data\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"uuid\" },\n    \"type\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"timestamp\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\" },\n    \"version\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"source\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"tenantId\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"uuid\" },\n    \"userId\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"uuid\" },\n    \"data\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"resourceId\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n### notifications-events.md (if events trigger notifications)\n\nCreate in module root if module publishes events that trigger notifications.\n\n## Configuration\n\nAdd to config/default.yaml:\n\n```yaml\nrabbitmq:\n  url: ${RABBITMQ_URL}\n  exchange: coder_events\n  queue: [module-name]_service\n  bindings:\n    - \"other.resource.created\"\n    - \"other.resource.updated\"\n```\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Event publisher created following pattern\n- [ ] Event consumer created (if consuming events)\n- [ ] Events follow naming convention: {domain}.{entity}.{action}\n- [ ] Events include all required fields (id, type, version, timestamp, source, data)\n- [ ] Events include tenantId when applicable (tenantId only; no organizationId in events)\n- [ ] RabbitMQ only; no Azure Service Bus\n- [ ] logs-events.md created (if events are logged)\n- [ ] notifications-events.md created (if events trigger notifications)\n- [ ] RabbitMQ config added to default.yaml\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:16:04.035Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Message Queue Agents requiring robust event handling capabilities with RabbitMQ","zh":"适用于需要使用RabbitMQ的消息队列代理的强健事件处理能力","ja":"RabbitMQを使用するメッセージキュー エージェントに適した堅牢なイベントハンドリング機能","ko":"RabbitMQ를 사용하는 메시지 큐 에이전트에 적합한 강력한 이벤트 처리 기능","es":"Ideal for Message Queue Agents requiring robust event handling capabilities with RabbitMQ","fr":"Ideal for Message Queue Agents requiring robust event handling capabilities with RabbitMQ","de":"Ideal for Message Queue Agents requiring robust event handling capabilities with RabbitMQ","pt":"Ideal for Message Queue Agents requiring robust event handling capabilities with RabbitMQ","ru":"Ideal for Message Queue Agents requiring robust event handling capabilities with RabbitMQ","ar":"Ideal for Message Queue Agents requiring robust event handling capabilities with RabbitMQ"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to publish and consume events following the ModuleImplementationGuide, utilizing a standardized event naming convention and tenant-only context with `tenantId`, while integrating with RabbitMQ event publishers and consumers","zh":"赋予代理发布和消费事件的能力，遵循模块实现指南，使用标准化的事件命名约定和租户仅上下文，集成RabbitMQ事件发布者和消费者","ja":"エージェントにイベントを公開および消費する能力を付与し、ModuleImplementationGuideに従い、標準化されたイベント命名規約とテナントのみのコンテキストを使用し、RabbitMQイベント発行者および消費者と統合する","ko":"에이전트에 이벤트를 발행하고 소비하는 능력을 부여하여 모듈 구현 가이드를 따르고 표준화된 이벤트 명명 규칙과 테넌트 전용 컨텍스트를 사용하며 RabbitMQ 이벤트 발행자 및 소비자와 통합","es":"Empowers agents to publish and consume events following the ModuleImplementationGuide, utilizing a standardized event naming convention and tenant-only context with `tenantId`, while integrating with RabbitMQ event publishers and consumers","fr":"Empowers agents to publish and consume events following the ModuleImplementationGuide, utilizing a standardized event naming convention and tenant-only context with `tenantId`, while integrating with RabbitMQ event publishers and consumers","de":"Empowers agents to publish and consume events following the ModuleImplementationGuide, utilizing a standardized event naming convention and tenant-only context with `tenantId`, while integrating with RabbitMQ event publishers and consumers","pt":"Empowers agents to publish and consume events following the ModuleImplementationGuide, utilizing a standardized event naming convention and tenant-only context with `tenantId`, while integrating with RabbitMQ event publishers and consumers","ru":"Empowers agents to publish and consume events following the ModuleImplementationGuide, utilizing a standardized event naming convention and tenant-only context with `tenantId`, while integrating with RabbitMQ event publishers and consumers","ar":"Empowers agents to publish and consume events following the ModuleImplementationGuide, utilizing a standardized event naming convention and tenant-only context with `tenantId`, while integrating with RabbitMQ event publishers and consumers"},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up event publishers for domain-specific entities","Consuming events with standardized naming conventions like `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`","Implementing tenant-only event handling with `tenantId` for secure context management"],"zh":["设置特定领域实体的事件发布者","使用标准化命名约定（如 `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`）来消费事件","使用 `tenantId` 实现租户仅事件处理以进行安全上下文管理"],"ja":["ドメイン固有のエンティティ用のイベント発行者を設定する","標準化された命名規約（例：`{domain}.{entity}.{action}`）を使用してイベントを消費する","`tenantId`を使用してテナントのみのイベントハンドリングを実装し、セキュアなコンテキスト管理を行う"],"ko":["도메인 특정 엔티티를 위한 이벤트 발행자를 설정","표준화된 명명 규칙 (`{domain}.{entity}.{action}`과 같은)을 사용하여 이벤트를 소비","`tenantId`를 사용하여 테넌트 전용 이벤트 처리를 구현하여 보안 컨텍스트 관리"],"es":["Setting up event publishers for domain-specific entities","Consuming events with standardized naming conventions like `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`","Implementing tenant-only event handling with `tenantId` for secure context management"],"fr":["Setting up event publishers for domain-specific entities","Consuming events with standardized naming conventions like `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`","Implementing tenant-only event handling with `tenantId` for secure context management"],"de":["Setting up event publishers for domain-specific entities","Consuming events with standardized naming conventions like `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`","Implementing tenant-only event handling with `tenantId` for secure context management"],"pt":["Setting up event publishers for domain-specific entities","Consuming events with standardized naming conventions like `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`","Implementing tenant-only event handling with `tenantId` for secure context management"],"ru":["Setting up event publishers for domain-specific entities","Consuming events with standardized naming conventions like `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`","Implementing tenant-only event handling with `tenantId` for secure context management"],"ar":["Setting up event publishers for domain-specific entities","Consuming events with standardized naming conventions like `{domain}.{entity}.{action}`","Implementing tenant-only event handling with `tenantId` for secure context management"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires RabbitMQ setup and configuration","Tenant-only context restricts the use of `organizationId` in event payloads"],"zh":["需要RabbitMQ的设置和配置","租户仅上下文限制了事件有效载荷中 `organizationId` 的使用"],"ja":["RabbitMQのセットアップと構成が必要","テナントのみのコンテキストは、イベントペイロード内の `organizationId` の使用を制限する"],"ko":["RabbitMQ 설정 및 구성이 필요","테넌트 전용 컨텍스트는 이벤트 페이로드 내의 `organizationId` 사용을 제한"],"es":["Requires RabbitMQ setup and configuration","Tenant-only context restricts the use of `organizationId` in event payloads"],"fr":["Requires RabbitMQ setup and configuration","Tenant-only context restricts the use of `organizationId` in event payloads"],"de":["Requires RabbitMQ setup and configuration","Tenant-only context restricts the use of `organizationId` in event payloads"],"pt":["Requires RabbitMQ setup and configuration","Tenant-only context restricts the use of `organizationId` in event payloads"],"ru":["Requires RabbitMQ setup and configuration","Tenant-only context restricts the use of `organizationId` in event payloads"],"ar":["Requires RabbitMQ setup and configuration","Tenant-only context restricts the use of `organizationId` in event payloads"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('shubhamtaywade82/repocontext/ruby-style', 'community', 'shubhamtaywade82', 'repocontext', 'shubhamtaywade82/repocontext', 'ruby-style', 0, 0, 20, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:16:22.176Z', NULL, '{"id":"shubhamtaywade82/repocontext/ruby-style","name":"ruby-style","description":{"zh":"Ruby Style Guide 是一个社区驱动的代码风格指南，用于保持 Ruby 代码的一致性和可读性","ja":"Ruby スタイルガイドは、Ruby コードの一貫性と可読性を保つためのコミュニティ主導のコードスタイルガイドです","ko":"루비 코드 스타일 가이드는 루비 코드의 일관성과 가독성을 유지하기 위한 커뮤니티 주도 코드 스타일 가이드입니다","es":"La guía de estilo Ruby es una guía comunitaria para escribir código Ruby consistente y legible","fr":"Le guide de style Ruby est un guide communautaire pour écrire du code Ruby cohérent et lisible","de":"Der Ruby-Style-Leitfaden ist ein Gemeinschaftsleitfaden für konsistenten und lesbaren Ruby-Code","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Ruby 代码风格指南","ja":"Ruby スタイルガイド","ko":"루비 코드 스타일 가이드","es":"Guía de estilo Ruby","fr":"Guide de style Ruby","de":"Ruby-Style-Leitfaden","en":"ruby-style"},"description":{"zh":"Ruby Style Guide 是一个社区驱动的代码风格指南，用于保持 Ruby 代码的一致性和可读性","ja":"Ruby スタイルガイドは、Ruby コードの一貫性と可読性を保つためのコミュニティ主導のコードスタイルガイドです","ko":"루비 코드 스타일 가이드는 루비 코드의 일관성과 가독성을 유지하기 위한 커뮤니티 주도 코드 스타일 가이드입니다","es":"La guía de estilo Ruby es una guía comunitaria para escribir código Ruby consistente y legible","fr":"Le guide de style Ruby est un guide communautaire pour écrire du code Ruby cohérent et lisible","de":"Der Ruby-Style-Leitfaden ist ein Gemeinschaftsleitfaden für konsistenten und lesbaren Ruby-Code","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["保持代码的一致性","提高代码的可读性","社区驱动的代码风格指南","与 RuboCop 兼容","适用于 Ruby 开发者"],"ja":["コードの一貫性を保つ","コードの可読性を向上させる","コミュニティ主導のコードスタイルガイド","RuboCop と互換性がある","Ruby 開発者向け"],"ko":["코드 일관성을 유지한다","코드 가독성을 향상한다","커뮤니티 주도 코드 스타일 가이드","RuboCop 과 호환된다","루비 개발자를 위한"],"es":["Guía de estilo comunitaria","Basado en RuboCop","Mejora la legibilidad del código","Fomenta la consistencia en el proyecto","Compatible con Ruby"],"fr":["Guide de style communautaire","Basé sur RuboCop","Améliore la lisibilité du code","Favorise la cohérence dans le projet","Compatible avec Ruby"],"de":["Gemeinschafts-Style-Leitfaden","Basierend auf RuboCop","Verbessert die Lesbarkeit des Codes","Fördert die Konsistenz im Projekt","Kompatibel mit Ruby"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ruby 代码风格","Ruby Style Guide","代码一致性","代码可读性","RuboCop","Ruby 开发"],"ja":["Ruby コードスタイル","Ruby スタイルガイド","コードの一貫性","コードの可読性","RuboCop","Ruby 開発"],"ko":["루비 코드 스타일","루비 코드 스타일 가이드","코드 일관성","코드 가독성","RuboCop","루비 개발"],"es":["Guía de estilo Ruby","RuboCop","Código Ruby","Legibilidad del código","Consistencia en el proyecto","Desarrollo de software","Programación Ruby"],"fr":["Guide de style Ruby","RuboCop","Code Ruby","Lisibilité du code","Cohérence dans le projet","Développement de logiciels","Programmation Ruby"],"de":["Ruby-Style-Leitfaden","RuboCop","Ruby-Code","Lesbarkeit des Codes","Konsistenz im Projekt","Software-Entwicklung","Ruby-Programmierung"]}},"owner":"shubhamtaywade82","repo":"repocontext","repoPath":"shubhamtaywade82/repocontext","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ruby-style","description":"Ruby Style Guide (rubystyle.guide) conventions. Use when writing, formatting, or reviewing Ruby code for layout, naming, flow of control, methods, classes, and idioms. Complements RuboCop.","bodyPreview":"# Ruby Style Guide\n\nThis skill applies the [Ruby Style Guide](https://rubystyle.guide/) — the community style guide that [RuboCop](https://github.com/rubocop/rubocop) is based on. Use when writing or reviewing Ruby for consistency and readability.\n\n## Guiding principle\n\n> \"Programs must be written for people to read, and only incidentally for machines to execute.\"\n\nConsistency within a project matters more than strict adherence; when in doubt, match surrounding code.\n\n---\n\n## Source code layout","body":"# Ruby Style Guide\n\nThis skill applies the [Ruby Style Guide](https://rubystyle.guide/) — the community style guide that [RuboCop](https://github.com/rubocop/rubocop) is based on. Use when writing or reviewing Ruby for consistency and readability.\n\n## Guiding principle\n\n> \"Programs must be written for people to read, and only incidentally for machines to execute.\"\n\nConsistency within a project matters more than strict adherence; when in doubt, match surrounding code.\n\n---\n\n## Source code layout\n\n- **Encoding:** UTF-8.\n- **Indentation:** Two spaces (no hard tabs).\n- **Line length:** Prefer 80 characters; teams may use up to 120.\n- **No trailing whitespace.** End files with a newline.\n- **No `;`** to terminate statements.\n- **One expression per line** (except e.g. `puts ''a'', ''b''`).\n- **Spaces around operators** (e.g. `sum = 1 + 2`). No space after `!`, inside range literals (`1..3`), or after `{`/before `}` in interpolations.\n- **Safe navigation:** Avoid long `&.` chains; prefer explicit checks or delegation.\n- **Empty lines:** One between method definitions; one around `private`/`protected`; none around method/class/module bodies.\n- **Multi-line method chains:** Use leading `.` or trailing `.` consistently (leading `.` preferred: continue on next line with `.method`).\n- **Method args alignment:** Align multi-line arguments or use single indent; be consistent.\n\n---\n\n## Naming\n\n- **Identifiers in English.** `snake_case` for symbols, methods, variables. `CapitalCase` for classes and modules (e.g. `SomeClass`, `SomeXML`). `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE` for other constants.\n- **Files and directories:** `snake_case` (e.g. `hello_world.rb`). One class per file; filename mirrors class name.\n- **Predicate methods:** end with `?` (e.g. `empty?`). Avoid prefixing with `is_`, `does_`, `can_`.\n- **Dangerous methods:** end with `!` only when a \"safe\" counterpart exists (e.g. `update!` vs `update`).\n- **Unused variables:** prefix with `_` (e.g. `_unused_var`, or `|_k, v|` in blocks).\n\n---\n\n## Flow of control\n\n- **Prefer iterators over `for`.** Use `each` etc., not `for elem in arr`.\n- **No `then`** for multi-line `if`/`unless`/`when`.\n- **Prefer ternary** for simple branches: `result = condition ? a : b`. Avoid nested ternaries; use `if/else`.\n- **Prefer `case` over `if/elsif`** when comparing the same value. Indent `when` as deep as `case` (outdented).\n- **Use `!` instead of `not`.** Avoid double negation `!!` unless you need an explicit boolean.\n- **Use `&&`/`||` in conditions.** Reserve `and`/`or` for control flow (e.g. `raise or return`) if at all.\n- **Prefer modifier form** for single-line: `do_something if condition`. Avoid modifier at end of long blocks.\n- **Prefer `unless` over `if !`.** Don''t use `else` with `unless`; rewrite with positive case first.\n- **No parentheses** around condition of `if`/`while`/`unless`.\n- **Prefer `loop do` with `break`** over `while true` or `begin...end while`.\n- **Avoid explicit `return`** where the last expression is the return value.\n- **Avoid explicit `self`** except for writers (`self.foo =`), reserved-word method names, or overloaded operators.\n- **Guard clauses:** Prefer early return/`next` over deep nesting. Use guard clauses to bail on invalid input.\n\n---\n\n## Exceptions\n\n- **Prefer `raise` over `fail`.** Use two-arg form: `raise SomeException, ''message''`. Don''t specify `RuntimeError` explicitly in two-arg `raise`.\n- **Don''t return from `ensure`.** Use implicit `begin` (rescue in method). Don''t suppress exceptions; handle or re-raise. Don''t use exceptions for flow of control.\n- **Rescue specific exceptions** (e.g. `StandardError`, `IOError`), not bare `Exception`. Put more specific rescues first.\n\n---\n\n## Methods\n\n- **Keep methods short** (e.g. under 10 LOC). Prefer keyword arguments over long option hashes or many positional args.\n- **Optional/boolean args:** Put required params first; use keyword args for optional/boolean (e.g. `def foo(bar:, baz: false)`).\n- **Omit parentheses** for `def` with no params; use them when there are params. Omit for method calls with no args and for \"keyword\" methods (e.g. `puts`, `raise`) per project convention.\n- **Use `...` for argument forwarding** when delegating (Ruby 2.7+). Use `&` for block forwarding (Ruby 3.1+).\n\n---\n\n## Classes and modules\n\n- **Consistent structure:** extend/include/prepend, inner classes, constants, attr macros, other macros, `def self.`, `initialize`, public methods, then `protected`/`private`.\n- **One mixin per line:** `include Foo` and `include Bar`, not `include Foo, Bar`.\n- **Prefer modules with `module_function`** for namespaces of class methods over classes with only `self.` methods.\n- **Duck typing:** Prefer interfaces (duck typing) over inheritance. No class variables (`@@`); use class instance variables or dependency injection.\n- **Access modifiers:** Use `private`/`protected`; indent them like method definitions with one blank line above and below.\n- **Define `to_s`** for domain objects. Use `attr_reader`/`attr_accessor`; avoid `attr`. Prefer `Struct.new` or `Data.define` for simple value holders (don''t extend them).\n- **Liskov and SOLID:** Subtypes must be substitutable; keep classes SOLID.\n\n---\n\n## Comments and annotations\n\n- **Prefer self-documenting code.** Comment only when explaining *why*. Use English. One space after `#`. Capitalize and punctuate full sentences.\n- **Annotations:** Place above the relevant line. Format as `KEYWORD: note` (e.g. `TODO:`, `FIXME:`, `OPTIMIZE:`, `HACK:`, `REVIEW:`).\n\n---\n\n## Collections and strings\n\n- **Use `[]` and `{}`** for literals. Prefer `%w[]`/`%i[]` for word/symbol arrays. Prefer `key:` over `:key =>` in hashes.\n- **Use `Hash#key?`/`value?`** not `has_key?`/`has_value?`. Use `fetch` for required keys; use block form for expensive defaults.\n- **Prefer `map`/`find`/`select`/`reduce`/`include?`/`size`** over `collect`/`detect`/`find_all`/`inject`/`member?`/`length` where it helps readability.\n- **Use `any?`/`none?`/`one?`** instead of `count > 0` etc. Don''t use `count` when `size`/`length` is enough (e.g. for Hash).\n- **Strings:** Prefer interpolation: `\"#{a} #{b}\"`. Use single quotes when no interpolation/special chars. Use `<<` for building large strings. Use `\\A` and `\\z` for full-string regex (not `^`/`$`).\n\n---\n\n## Other\n\n- **Use `require_relative`** for internal code; `require` for external libs. Omit `.rb` in `require`/`require_relative`.\n- **Prefer `predicate?` and `Comparable#between?`** over manual comparisons where it clarifies intent.\n- **Don''t mutate params** unless that''s the method''s purpose. Avoid more than ~3 levels of block nesting.\n- **Prefer `public_send`** over `send`; prefer `__send__` if the name might be overridden.\n\n---\n\n## Reference\n\n- [Ruby Style Guide](https://rubystyle.guide/) — full guide\n- [RuboCop](https://github.com/rubocop/rubocop) — linter and formatter based on this guide\n- [RSpec Style Guide](https://github.com/rubocop/rspec-style-guide) — complementary guide\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:16:22.176Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Ruby Development Agents requiring automated code style enforcement and consistency checking.","zh":"适用于需要自动代码样式强制和一致性检查的Ruby开发代理。","ja":"Ruby開発エージェントが自動コードスタイルの強制と一貫性のチェックを必要とする場合に不可欠です。","ko":"자동 코드 스타일 강제 및 일관성 확인이 필요한 Ruby 개발 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Essential for Ruby Development Agents requiring automated code style enforcement and consistency checking.","fr":"Essential for Ruby Development Agents requiring automated code style enforcement and consistency checking.","de":"Essential for Ruby Development Agents requiring automated code style enforcement and consistency checking.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Ruby que exigem aplicação automática de estilo de código e verificação de consistência.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов разработки Ruby, требующих автоматизированного обеспечения стиля кода и проверки согласованности.","ar":"ضروري لموكلات تطوير Ruby التي تتطلب تطبيقًا آليًا لتنسيق الشفرة والتحقق من الاتساق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated Ruby code formatting according to the community-standard RuboCop guidelines, ensuring readability and maintainability. Provides consistent style enforcement across projects while respecting local conventions through contextual analysis of surrounding code.","zh":"根据社区标准的RuboCop指南，实现自动的Ruby代码格式化，确保可读性和可维护性。通过对周围代码的上下文分析，提供项目间的一致性样式强制，同时尊重本地约定。","ja":"コミュニティ標準のRuboCopガイドラインに基づいて、自動的なRubyコードのフォーマットを可能にし、読みやすさと保守性を確保します。周囲のコードのコンテキスト分析を通じて、プロジェクト間の一貫したスタイルの強制を提供し、同時にローカル規約を尊重します。","ko":"커뮤니티 표준인 RuboCop 지침에 따라 자동 Ruby 코드 형식을 가능하게 해주며, 가독성과 유지 보수성을 보장합니다. 주변 코드의 문맥 분석을 통해 프로젝트 간에 일관된 스타일 강제를 제공하며, 동시에 로컬 규칙을尊重합니다.","es":"Enables automated Ruby code formatting according to the community-standard RuboCop guidelines, ensuring readability and maintainability. Provides consistent style enforcement across projects while respecting local conventions through contextual analysis of surrounding code.","fr":"Enables automated Ruby code formatting according to the community-standard RuboCop guidelines, ensuring readability and maintainability. Provides consistent style enforcement across projects while respecting local conventions through contextual analysis of surrounding code.","de":"Enables automated Ruby code formatting according to the community-standard RuboCop guidelines, ensuring readability and maintainability. Provides consistent style enforcement across projects while respecting local conventions through contextual analysis of surrounding code.","pt":"Permite a formatação automática de código Ruby de acordo com as diretrizes RuboCop padrão da comunidade, garantindo legibilidade e manutenibilidade. Fornece aplicação de estilo consistente em projetos, respeitando convenções locais por meio da análise contextual do código circundante.","ru":"Позволяет автоматически форматировать код Ruby в соответствии с руководящими принципами RuboCop, принятыми в сообществе, обеспечивая читаемость и поддерживаемость. Обеспечивает согласованное обеспечение стиля во всех проектах, уважая местные конвенции посредством контекстного анализа окружающего кода.","ar":"تمكن من تنسيق الشفرة البرمجية الآلي وفقًا لمعايير RuboCop القياسية للمجتمع، مما يضمن سهولة القراءة والصيانة. يوفر تنفيذًا موحدًا للأسلوب عبر المشاريع مع احترام الأعراف المحلية من خلال تحليل سياق الشفرة المحيطة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Ruby code style reviews","Enforcing RuboCop compliance in CI pipelines","Refactoring legacy Ruby code to modern standards","Generating style-consistent Ruby code snippets"],"zh":["自动化Ruby代码样式审查","在CI管道中强制执行RuboCop兼容性","将遗留Ruby代码重构为现代标准","生成样式一致的Ruby代码片段"],"ja":["Rubyコードのスタイルレビューの自動化","CIパイプラインでのRuboCop準拠の強制","レガシRubyコードを現代の標準にリファクタリング","スタイル一貫したRubyコードスニペットの生成"],"ko":["Ruby 코드 스타일 리뷰의 자동화","CI 파이프라인에서 RuboCop 호환性的 강제","레거시 Ruby 코드를 현대 표준으로 리팩토링","스타일 일관된 Ruby 코드 스니펫의 생성"],"es":["Automating Ruby code style reviews","Enforcing RuboCop compliance in CI pipelines","Refactoring legacy Ruby code to modern standards","Generating style-consistent Ruby code snippets"],"fr":["Automating Ruby code style reviews","Enforcing RuboCop compliance in CI pipelines","Refactoring legacy Ruby code to modern standards","Generating style-consistent Ruby code snippets"],"de":["Automating Ruby code style reviews","Enforcing RuboCop compliance in CI pipelines","Refactoring legacy Ruby code to modern standards","Generating style-consistent Ruby code snippets"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de estilo de código Ruby","Impor conformidade com RuboCop em pipelines de CI","Reestruturar código Ruby legado para padrões modernos","Gerar trechos de código Ruby consistentes em termos de estilo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обзоры стиля кода Ruby","Обеспечить соблюдение RuboCop в конвейерах CI","Перестроить устаревший код Ruby до современных стандартов","Генерировать фрагменты кода Ruby, согласованные по стилю"],"ar":["توفير آلية لمراجعة أسلوب الشفرة البرمجية Ruby","تنفيذ متطلبات RuboCop في أنابيب CI","إعادة هيكلة الشفرة البرمجية Ruby القديمة إلى معايير حديثة","توليد شفرة برمجية Ruby موحدة في الشكل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Ruby-specific only (not applicable to other languages)","Requires context analysis of surrounding code for consistency","Based on community conventions rather than absolute rules"],"zh":["仅适用于Ruby（不适用于其他语言）","需要对周围代码进行上下文分析以确保一致性","基于社区约定而不是绝对规则"],"ja":["Ruby専用（他の言語には適用されません）","一貫性を確保するために、周囲のコードのコンテキスト分析が必要","絶対的なルールではなく、コミュニティ規約に基づいています"],"ko":["Ruby 전용（다른 언어에는 적용되지 않음）","일관성을 보장하기 위해 주변 코드의 문맥 분석이 필요","絶對規則가 아닌 커뮤니티 규약을 기반으로 함"],"es":["Ruby-specific only (not applicable to other languages)","Requires context analysis of surrounding code for consistency","Based on community conventions rather than absolute rules"],"fr":["Ruby-specific only (not applicable to other languages)","Requires context analysis of surrounding code for consistency","Based on community conventions rather than absolute rules"],"de":["Ruby-specific only (not applicable to other languages)","Requires context analysis of surrounding code for consistency","Based on community conventions rather than absolute rules"],"pt":["Específico para Ruby (não se aplica a outras linguagens)","Exige análise de contexto do código circundante para garantir consistência","Baseado em convenções da comunidade em vez de regras absolutas"],"ru":["Только для Ruby (не применимо к другим языкам)","Требует контекстного анализа окружающего кода для согласованности","Основан на конвенциях сообщества, а не на абсолютных правилах"],"ar":["خاص بالشفرة البرمجية Ruby فقط (لا ينطبق على لغات أخرى)","يتطلب تحليل السياق للشفرة المحيطة من أجل الاتساق","يستند إلى أعراف المجتمع بدلاً من القواعد المطلقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Geeksfino/openskills/openskills-e2e-test-runbook', 'community', 'Geeksfino', 'openskills', 'Geeksfino/openskills', 'openskills-e2e-test-runbook', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:17:05.223Z', NULL, '{"id":"Geeksfino/openskills/openskills-e2e-test-runbook","name":"openskills-e2e-test-runbook","description":{"zh":"OpenSkills E2E 测试运行手册提供了运行时回归测试、沙盒测试、示例代理行为检查和绑定测试等功能，确保代码更改的正确性","ja":"OpenSkills E2E テストランブックは、ランタイムの回帰テスト、サンドボックステスト、エージェントの動作チェック、バインディングテストなどを提供し、コードの変更が正しいことを確認します","ko":"OpenSkills E2E 테스트 런북은 런타임 회귀 테스트, 샌드박스 테스트, 에이전트 동작 확인 및 바인딩 테스트 등을 제공하여 코드 변경 사항의 정확성을 확인합니다","pt":"O OpenSkills E2E Test Runbook é uma ferramenta para testes de confiança antes de mesclar alterações no runtime ou ferramentas","ru":"OpenSkills E2E Test Runbook — это инструмент для проверки перед слиянием изменений в runtime или инструментах","ar":"OpenSkills E2E Test Runbook هو أداة لاختبار الثقة قبل دمج التغييرات في Runtime أو الأدوات","en":"Rust runtime with TS/Python bindings for Claude Skills with progressive disclosure of skill metadata, full content and scripts/resources. Any agent can now own skills. Currently support Seatbelt and experimentally, WASM, sandboxing"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"OpenSkills E2E 测试运行手册","ja":"OpenSkills E2E テストランブック","ko":"OpenSkills E2E 테스트 런북","pt":"OpenSkills E2E: Testes de Runtime e Ferramentas","ru":"OpenSkills E2E: Тестирование Runtime и инструментов","ar":"OpenSkills E2E: اختبار Runtime وأدوات","en":"openskills-e2e-test-runbook"},"description":{"zh":"OpenSkills E2E 测试运行手册提供了运行时回归测试、沙盒测试、示例代理行为检查和绑定测试等功能，确保代码更改的正确性","ja":"OpenSkills E2E テストランブックは、ランタイムの回帰テスト、サンドボックステスト、エージェントの動作チェック、バインディングテストなどを提供し、コードの変更が正しいことを確認します","ko":"OpenSkills E2E 테스트 런북은 런타임 회귀 테스트, 샌드박스 테스트, 에이전트 동작 확인 및 바인딩 테스트 등을 제공하여 코드 변경 사항의 정확성을 확인합니다","pt":"O OpenSkills E2E Test Runbook é uma ferramenta para testes de confiança antes de mesclar alterações no runtime ou ferramentas","ru":"OpenSkills E2E Test Runbook — это инструмент для проверки перед слиянием изменений в runtime или инструментах","ar":"OpenSkills E2E Test Runbook هو أداة لاختبار الثقة قبل دمج التغييرات في Runtime أو الأدوات","en":"Rust runtime with TS/Python bindings for Claude Skills with progressive disclosure of skill metadata, full content and scripts/resources. Any agent can now o..."},"definition":{"en":"Rust runtime with TS/Python bindings for Claude Skills with progressive disclosure of skill metadata, full content and scripts/resources. Any agent can now own skills. Currently support Seatbelt and experimentally, WASM, sandboxing"},"features":{"zh":["运行时回归测试","沙盒测试","示例代理行为检查","绑定测试","支持 Seatbelt 和 WASM"],"ja":["ランタイムの回帰テスト","サンドボックステスト","エージェントの動作チェック","バインディングテスト","Seatbelt と WASM をサポート"],"ko":["런타임 회귀 테스트","샌드박스 테스트","에이전트 동작 확인","바인딩 테스트","Seatbelt 및 WASM 지원"],"pt":["Testes de regressão do runtime","Testes de sandbox","Verificação de comportamento do agente de exemplo","Testes de ligação opcional","Suporte a Seatbelt e WASM"],"ru":["Тесты регрессии runtime","Тесты sandbox","Проверка поведения примера агента","Опциональные тесты привязки","Поддержка Seatbelt и WASM"],"ar":["اختبارات انحدار Runtime","اختبارات Sandbox","تحقق من سلوك الوكيل المثال","اختبارات ربط اختياري","دعم Seatbelt و WASM"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenSkills","E2E 测试","运行时测试","沙盒测试","绑定测试","代码合并","自信检查"],"ja":["OpenSkills","E2E テスト","ランタイムテスト","サンドボックステスト","バインディングテスト","コードマージ","自信チェック"],"ko":["OpenSkills","E2E 테스트","런타임 테스트","샌드박스 테스트","바인딩 테스트","코드 병합","자신감 확인"],"pt":["OpenSkills E2E","testes de runtime","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","testes de confiança","Seatbelt","WASM","sandbox","agente de exemplo"],"ru":["OpenSkills E2E","тесты runtime","инструменты разработки","тесты уверенности","Seatbelt","WASM","sandbox","пример агента"],"ar":["OpenSkills E2E","اختبارات Runtime","أدوات التطوير","اختبارات الثقة","Seatbelt","WASM","Sandbox","وكيل مثال"]}},"owner":"Geeksfino","repo":"openskills","repoPath":"Geeksfino/openskills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openskills-e2e-test-runbook","description":"Run deterministic OpenSkills end-to-end validation across runtime tests and example agents, then report tool calls, activation behavior, and regressions.","bodyPreview":"# OpenSkills E2E Test Runbook\n\nUse this skill for confidence checks before merging runtime, tooling, or example-agent changes.\n\n## Test Layers\n\n1. Runtime regression tests\n2. Sandbox-focused tests\n3. Example-agent behavior checks\n4. Optional binding smoke tests\n\n## Baseline Commands\n\n```bash\ncargo test -p openskills-runtime\n```\n\nExample-agent checks (from example directories):\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm start \"What skills are available?\"\nnpm start \"Create a new skill called ''note-taker''.\"\n```\n\n##","body":"# OpenSkills E2E Test Runbook\n\nUse this skill for confidence checks before merging runtime, tooling, or example-agent changes.\n\n## Test Layers\n\n1. Runtime regression tests\n2. Sandbox-focused tests\n3. Example-agent behavior checks\n4. Optional binding smoke tests\n\n## Baseline Commands\n\n```bash\ncargo test -p openskills-runtime\n```\n\nExample-agent checks (from example directories):\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm start \"What skills are available?\"\nnpm start \"Create a new skill called ''note-taker''.\"\n```\n\n## E2E Expectations\n\n- Skills discover successfully.\n- Skill activation occurs for matching prompts.\n- Tool calls align with intent (activation, file reads/writes, script runs).\n- No unexpected sandbox failures.\n\n## Reporting Format\n\n- What was run\n- What passed\n- What failed\n- Repro command for each failure\n- Suggested next fix\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:17:05.223Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, or LangChain requiring comprehensive testing and validation of runtime, tooling, or example-agent changes.","zh":"适用于像 Claude、AutoGPT 或 LangChain 这样的高级 AI 代理，需要对运行时、工具或示例代理更改进行全面测试和验证。","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、または LangChain などの高度な AI エージェントに適しています。これらのエージェントでは、ランタイム、ツール、またはサンプル エージェントの変更の包括的なテストと検証が必要です。","ko":"Claude, AutoGPT 또는 LangChain과 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트에서는 런타임, 툴링 또는 예제 에이전트 변경에 대한 포괄적인 테스트 및 검증이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como Claude, AutoGPT o LangChain que requieren pruebas y validación exhaustivas de tiempo de ejecución, herramientas o cambios en el agente de ejemplo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA avancés comme Claude, AutoGPT ou LangChain nécessitant des tests et une validation complète du runtime, de l''outillage ou des modifications de l''agent d''exemple.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT oder LangChain, die eine umfassende Tests und Validierung von Laufzeit, Tooling oder Änderungen am Beispiel-Agent erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados, como Claude, AutoGPT ou LangChain, que exigem testes e validação abrangentes de tempo de execução, ferramentas ou alterações de exemplo de agente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, AutoGPT или LangChain, требующих комплексного тестирования и проверки изменений во время выполнения, инструментов или изменений примера агента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم مثل Claude و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يتطلبون اختبارات وتحقق شاملة لزمن التشغيل وأدوات أو تغييرات في وكيل المثال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform runtime regression tests, sandbox-focused tests, and example-agent behavior checks, ensuring confidence in code changes through cargo test and npm start commands, leveraging Rust runtime with TS/Python bindings.","zh":"赋予代理执行运行时回归测试、沙盒聚焦测试和示例代理行为检查的能力，通过 cargo test 和 npm start 命令确保代码更改的可信度，同时利用 Rust 运行时和 TS/Python 绑定。","ja":"エージェントにランタイムの回帰テスト、サンドボックスに焦点を当てたテスト、サンプル エージェントの動作の確認を実行する力を与え、cargo test および npm start コマンドを使用してコードの変更に対する信頼性を確保します。また、Rust ランタイムと TS/Python バインディングも利用します。","ko":"에이전트에 런타임 회归 테스트, 샌드박스 중심 테스트 및 예제 에이전트 동작 확인을 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 코드 변경에 대한 신뢰성을 보장하고, cargo test 및 npm start 명령과 Rust 런타임 및 TS/Python 바인딩을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar pruebas de regresión de tiempo de ejecución, pruebas centradas en sandbox y comprobaciones de comportamiento del agente de ejemplo, garantizando la confianza en los cambios de código a través de los comandos cargo test y npm start, aprovechando el tiempo de ejecución de Rust con enlaces TS/Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des tests de régression de runtime, des tests axés sur le sandbox et des vérifications de comportement de l''agent d''exemple, garantissant la confiance dans les modifications de code via les commandes cargo test et npm start, en exploitant le runtime Rust avec des liaisons TS/Python.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Laufzeit-Regressionstests, sandbox-fokussierte Tests und Überprüfungen des Beispiel-Agent-Verhaltens durchzuführen, um Vertrauen in Code-Änderungen durch die Befehle cargo test und npm start zu gewährleisten, indem es die Rust-Laufzeit mit TS/Python-Bindings nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizarem testes de regressão em tempo de execução, testes focados em sandbox e verificações de comportamento de exemplo de agente, garantindo confiança nas alterações de código por meio dos comandos cargo test e npm start, aproveitando o tempo de execução Rust com vinculações TS/Python.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять тесты регрессии во время выполнения, тесты, ориентированные на sandbox, и проверки поведения примера агента, обеспечивая уверенность в изменениях кода посредством команд cargo test и npm start, используя среду выполнения Rust с привязками TS/Python.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء أداء اختبارات انحدار في زمن التشغيل واختبارات مُركّزة على sandbox واختبارات سلوك وكيل المثال، مما يضمن الثقة في تغييرات التعليمات البرمجية من خلال أوامر cargo test وnpm start، واستخدام وقت تشغيل Rust مع ربط TS/Python."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating regression testing for runtime changes","Debugging sandbox-focused issues","Validating example-agent behavior with npm start commands"],"zh":["用于自动化运行时更改的回归测试","调试沙盒聚焦问题","使用 npm start 命令验证示例代理行为"],"ja":["ランタイムの変更の回帰テストの自動化","サンドボックスに焦点を当てた問題のデバッグ","npm start コマンドを使用したサンプル エージェントの動作の検証"],"ko":["런타임 변경의 회귀 테스트 자동화","샌드박스 중심 문제 디버깅","npm start 명령을 사용한 예제 에이전트 동작 확인"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de regresión para cambios de tiempo de ejecución","Depuración de problemas centrados en sandbox","Validación del comportamiento del agente de ejemplo con comandos npm start"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de régression pour les modifications de runtime","Débogage des problèmes axés sur le sandbox","Validation du comportement de l''agent d''exemple avec les commandes npm start"],"de":["Automatisierung von Regressionstests für Laufzeit-Änderungen","Fehlerbehebung bei sandbox-fokussierten Problemen","Validierung des Beispiel-Agent-Verhaltens mit npm start-Befehlen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de regressão para alterações em tempo de execução","Depurar problemas focados em sandbox","Validar comportamento de exemplo de agente com comandos npm start"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тесты регрессии для изменений во время выполнения","Отладить проблемы, ориентированные на sandbox","Проверить поведение примера агента с командами npm start"],"ar":["آليّة اختبارات الانحدار لتغييرات في زمن التشغيل","تصحيح أخطاء التركيز على sandbox","التحقق من سلوك وكيل المثال بأوامر npm start"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust and cargo installation","Experimental support for WASM and sandboxing","Limited to Seatbelt and experimental WASM support"],"zh":["需要 Rust 和 cargo 安装","实验性支持 WASM 和沙盒","仅限 Seatbelt 和实验性 WASM 支持"],"ja":["Rust と cargo のインストールが必要","WASM とサンドボックスの実験的なサポート","Seatbelt と実験的な WASM サポートのみ"],"ko":["Rust 및 cargo 설치가 필요합니다.","WASM 및 샌드박스의 실험적 지원","Seatbelt 및 실험적 WASM 지원만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Rust y cargo","Soporte experimental para WASM y sandboxing","Limitado a Seatbelt y soporte experimental WASM"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Rust et de cargo","Support expérimental pour WASM et le sandboxing","Limité à Seatbelt et au support expérimental WASM"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Rust und cargo","Experimenteller Support für WASM und Sandboxing","Begrenzt auf Seatbelt und experimentellen WASM-Support"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Rust e cargo","Suporte experimental para WASM e sandboxing","Limitado ao Seatbelt e suporte experimental WASM"],"ru":["Требует установки Rust и cargo","Экспериментальная поддержка WASM и sandboxing","Ограничен до Seatbelt и экспериментальной поддержки WASM"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Rust وcargo","دعم تجريبي لواسم وsandboxing","محدود إلى Seatbelt ودعم تجريبي لواسم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('AVRA-CADAVRA/avrai/test-template-generation', 'community', 'AVRA-CADAVRA', 'avrai', 'AVRA-CADAVRA/avrai', 'test-template-generation', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:16:57.546Z', NULL, '{"id":"AVRA-CADAVRA/avrai/test-template-generation","name":"test-template-generation","description":{"es":"La generación de plantillas de prueba de unidad es una herramienta para mejorar la eficiencia de tus tests. Incluye plantillas para tests de unidad, widgets y servicios.","fr":"La génération de modèles de test unitaire est un outil pour améliorer l''efficacité de vos tests. Elle inclut des modèles pour les tests d''unités, les widgets et les services.","de":"Die Erzeugung von Testvorlagen für Einheitstests ist ein Werkzeug, um die Effizienz Ihrer Tests zu verbessern. Sie umfasst Vorlagen für Einheitstests, Widgets und Dienste.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Generación de plantillas de prueba de unidad","fr":"Génération de modèles de test unitaire","de":"Erzeugung von Testvorlagen für Einheitstests","en":"test-template-generation"},"description":{"es":"La generación de plantillas de prueba de unidad es una herramienta para mejorar la eficiencia de tus tests. Incluye plantillas para tests de unidad, widgets ...","fr":"La génération de modèles de test unitaire est un outil pour améliorer l''efficacité de vos tests. Elle inclut des modèles pour les tests d''unités, les widgets...","de":"Die Erzeugung von Testvorlagen für Einheitstests ist ein Werkzeug, um die Effizienz Ihrer Tests zu verbessern. Sie umfasst Vorlagen für Einheitstests, Widget...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Plantillas de prueba de unidad predefinidas","Compatibilidad con tests de widgets y servicios","Estructuras de prueba personalizables","Mejora de la eficiencia de los tests","Integración con frameworks de testing populares"],"fr":["Modèles de test unitaire prédéfinis","Compatibilité avec les tests de widgets et de services","Structures de test personnalisables","Amélioration de l''efficacité des tests","Intégration avec les frameworks de testing populaires"],"de":["Vordefinierte Testvorlagen für Einheitstests","Kompatibilität mit Widget- und Diensttests","Anpassbare Teststrukturen","Verbesserung der Testeffizienz","Integration mit beliebten Testing-Frameworks"]},"keywords":{"es":["generación de plantillas de prueba de unidad","tests de unidad","pruebas de widgets","pruebas de servicios","eficiencia de tests","frameworks de testing"],"fr":["génération de modèles de test unitaire","tests d''unités","tests de widgets","tests de services","efficacité des tests","frameworks de testing"],"de":["Erzeugung von Testvorlagen für Einheitstests","Einheitstests","Widget-Tests","Diensttests","Testeffizienz","Testing-Frameworks"]}},"owner":"AVRA-CADAVRA","repo":"avrai","repoPath":"AVRA-CADAVRA/avrai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"test-template-generation","description":"Generates test templates: unit, widget, integration, service tests following project patterns. Use when creating new tests or ensuring tests follow project standards.","bodyPreview":"# Test Template Generation\n\n## Available Templates\n\nTest templates are located in `test/templates/`:\n- `unit_test_template.dart`\n- `widget_test_template.dart`\n- `integration_test_template.dart`\n- `service_test_template.dart`\n\n## Unit Test Template\n\n```dart\n/// SPOTS Component Unit Tests\n/// Date: [Current Date]\n/// Purpose: Test Component functionality\n/// \n/// Test Coverage:\n/// - Feature 1: [Description]\n/// - Feature 2: [Description]\n/// - Edge Cases: [Description]\n/// \n/// Dependencies:\n///","body":"# Test Template Generation\n\n## Available Templates\n\nTest templates are located in `test/templates/`:\n- `unit_test_template.dart`\n- `widget_test_template.dart`\n- `integration_test_template.dart`\n- `service_test_template.dart`\n\n## Unit Test Template\n\n```dart\n/// SPOTS Component Unit Tests\n/// Date: [Current Date]\n/// Purpose: Test Component functionality\n/// \n/// Test Coverage:\n/// - Feature 1: [Description]\n/// - Feature 2: [Description]\n/// - Edge Cases: [Description]\n/// \n/// Dependencies:\n/// - Mock 1: [Purpose]\n/// - Service 2: [Purpose]\n/// \n/// ⚠️  TEST QUALITY GUIDELINES:\n/// ❌ DON''T: Test property assignment (e.g., expect(model.id, equals(''1'')))\n/// ❌ DON''T: Test constructor-only (e.g., test(''should create'', () { expect(obj, isNotNull); }))\n/// ✅ DO: Test behavior, business logic, validation, error handling\n/// ✅ DO: Consolidate related checks into comprehensive test blocks\n/// \n/// See: docs/plans/test_refactoring/TEST_WRITING_GUIDE.md\n\nimport ''package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart'';\nimport ''package:mocktail/mocktail.dart'';\n\n// Import component under test\nimport ''package:avrai/core/path/component.dart'';\n\n// Mock dependencies\nclass MockDependency extends Mock implements Dependency {}\n\nvoid main() {\n  group(''Component'', () {\n    late Component component;\n    late MockDependency mockDependency;\n    \n    setUp(() {\n      mockDependency = MockDependency();\n      component = Component(dependency: mockDependency);\n    });\n    \n    group(''performAction'', () {\n      test(''should return success result when operation succeeds'', () async {\n        // Arrange\n        when(() => mockDependency.method()).thenAnswer((_) async => ''result'');\n        \n        // Act\n        final result = await component.performAction(''input'');\n        \n        // Assert\n        expect(result.value, equals(''result''));\n        expect(result.input, equals(''input''));\n        verify(() => mockDependency.method()).called(1);\n      });\n      \n      test(''should handle errors gracefully'', () async {\n        // Arrange\n        when(() => mockDependency.method()).thenThrow(Exception(''Error''));\n        \n        // Act & Assert\n        expect(\n          () => component.performAction(''input''),\n          throwsException,\n        );\n      });\n    });\n    \n    group(''calculateValue'', () {\n      test(''should throw ArgumentError for invalid input'', () {\n        expect(\n          () => component.calculateValue(-1),\n          throwsArgumentError,\n        );\n      });\n    });\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Widget Test Template\n\n```dart\n/// SPOTS Widget Tests\n/// Date: [Current Date]\n/// Purpose: Test Widget behavior\n/// \n/// Test Coverage:\n/// - User interactions: [Description]\n/// - State changes: [Description]\n/// - Error states: [Description]\n\nimport ''package:flutter/material.dart'';\nimport ''package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart'';\nimport ''package:flutter_bloc/flutter_bloc.dart'';\n\nimport ''package:avrai/presentation/widgets/my_widget.dart'';\n\nvoid main() {\n  group(''MyWidget'', () {\n    testWidgets(''should display widget content'', (tester) async {\n      // Arrange\n      await tester.pumpWidget(\n        MaterialApp(\n          home: MyWidget(),\n        ),\n      );\n      \n      // Assert\n      expect(find.text(''Expected Text''), findsOneWidget);\n    });\n    \n    testWidgets(''should handle user interaction'', (tester) async {\n      // Arrange\n      await tester.pumpWidget(\n        MaterialApp(\n          home: MyWidget(),\n        ),\n      );\n      \n      // Act\n      await tester.tap(find.byType(Button));\n      await tester.pump();\n      \n      // Assert\n      expect(find.text(''Updated Text''), findsOneWidget);\n    });\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Test Template\n\n```dart\n/// SPOTS Integration Tests\n/// Date: [Current Date]\n/// Purpose: Test complete workflows\n/// \n/// Test Coverage:\n/// - End-to-end workflow: [Description]\n/// - Integration points: [Description]\n\nimport ''package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart'';\nimport ''package:integration_test/integration_test.dart'';\n\nimport ''package:avrai/main.dart'' as app;\n\nvoid main() {\n  IntegrationTestWidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();\n  \n  group(''Complete Workflow'', () {\n    testWidgets(''should complete user journey'', (tester) async {\n      // Arrange\n      app.main();\n      await tester.pumpAndSettle();\n      \n      // Act & Assert\n      // Test complete user workflow\n    });\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Service Test Template\n\n```dart\n/// SPOTS Service Tests\n/// Date: [Current Date]\n/// Purpose: Test Service functionality\n/// \n/// Test Coverage:\n/// - Service methods: [Description]\n/// - Error handling: [Description]\n/// - Integration: [Description]\n\nimport ''package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart'';\nimport ''package:mocktail/mocktail.dart'';\n\nimport ''package:avrai/core/services/my_service.dart'';\n\n// Mock dependencies\nclass MockDependency extends Mock implements Dependency {}\n\nvoid main() {\n  group(''MyService'', () {\n    late MyService service;\n    late MockDependency mockDependency;\n    \n    setUp(() {\n      mockDependency = MockDependency();\n      service = MyService(dependency: mockDependency);\n    });\n    \n    group(''serviceMethod'', () {\n      test(''should perform operation successfully'', () async {\n        // Test implementation\n      });\n    });\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Using Templates\n\n1. Copy template from `test/templates/`\n2. Replace placeholder text\n3. Update imports\n4. Implement test cases\n5. Remove template comments\n\n## Reference\n\n- `test/templates/unit_test_template.dart`\n- `test/templates/widget_test_template.dart`\n- `test/templates/integration_test_template.dart`\n- `test/templates/service_test_template.dart`\n- `docs/plans/test_refactoring/TEST_WRITING_GUIDE.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:16:57.546Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated test template generation for Dart programming language","zh":"适用于需要自动化测试模板生成的Dart编程语言的开发代理","ja":"Dartプログラミング言語の自動テストテンプレート生成を必要とする開発エージェントに適しています","ko":"Dart 프로그래밍 언어의 자동화된 테스트 템플릿 생성이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren generación automática de plantillas de pruebas para el lenguaje de programación Dart","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une génération automatique de modèles de tests pour le langage de programmation Dart","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatische Generierung von Testvorlagen für die Programmiersprache Dart erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem geração automática de modelos de teste para a linguagem de programação Dart","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированного生成ения шаблонов тестирования для языка программирования Dart","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يتطلبون جيل قوالب اختبار آلي للغة برمجة Dart"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate unit tests, widget tests, integration tests, and service tests using predefined templates in Dart, streamlining test-driven development with features like test coverage and dependency management","zh":"赋予代理生成单元测试、widget测试、集成测试和服务测试，使用Dart中的预定义模板，通过测试覆盖和依赖管理等功能简化测试驱动开发","ja":"エージェントがDartの事前定義されたテンプレートを使用してユニットテスト、ウィジェットテスト、統合テスト、サービステストを生成することを可能にし、テストカバレッジや依存関係管理などの機能によりテスト駆動開発を簡素化する","ko":"에이전트가 Dart의 사전 정의된 템플릿을 사용하여 단위 테스트, 위젯 테스트, 통합 테스트 및 서비스 테스트를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 테스트 커버리지 및 의존성 관리 등의 기능으로 테스트 주도 개발을 간소화합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes generar pruebas unitarias, pruebas de widgets, pruebas de integración y pruebas de servicio utilizando plantillas predefinidas en Dart, simplificando el desarrollo dirigido por pruebas con características como cobertura de pruebas y administración de dependencias","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des tests unitaires, des tests de widgets, des tests d''intégration et des tests de service en utilisant des modèles prédéfinis dans Dart, en simplifiant le développement piloté par les tests avec des fonctionnalités comme la couverture de tests et la gestion des dépendances","de":"Ermächtigt Mittel, Einheitstests, Widget-Tests, Integrations- und Servicetests mit vordefinierten Vorlagen in Dart zu generieren, wodurch die testgetriebene Entwicklung mit Funktionen wie Testabdeckung und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung vereinfacht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar testes unitários, testes de widget, testes de integração e testes de serviço usando modelos predefinidos em Dart, racionalizando o desenvolvimento orientado a testes com recursos como cobertura de teste e gerenciamento de dependências","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать модульные тесты, тесты виджетов, тесты интеграции и тесты сервисов, используя предопределенные шаблоны в Dart, оптимизируя разработку, ориентированную на тестирование, с функциями, такими как покрытие тестирования и управление зависимостями","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء اختبارات وحدة واختبارات الويدجيت واختبارات التكامل واختبارات الخدمة باستخدام قوالب محددة مسبقا في Dart ، وتحسين تطوير قائم على الاختبار مع ميزات مثل تغطية الاختبار وإدارة التبعيات"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating unit test templates for SPOTS Component functionality","Creating widget test templates for user interface validation","Automating integration test template generation for service testing","Debugging test failures with edge case analysis"],"zh":["为SPOTS组件功能生成单元测试模板","为用户界面验证创建widget测试模板","自动化集成测试模板生成以进行服务测试","使用边缘情况分析调试测试失败"],"ja":["SPOTSコンポーネントの機能のためのユニットテストテンプレートを生成する","ユーザーインターフェースの検証のためのウィジェットテストテンプレートを作成する","サービステストのための統合テストテンプレートの自動生成","エッジケース分析を使用してテストの失敗をデバッグする"],"ko":["SPOTS 컴포넌트 기능을 위한 단위 테스트 템플릿 생성","사용자 인터페이스 유효성 검사 위한 위젯 테스트 템플릿 생성","서비스 테스트를 위한 통합 테스트 템플릿 자동 생성","엣지 케이스 분석을 사용한 테스트 실패 디버깅"],"es":["Generar plantillas de pruebas unitarias para la funcionalidad del componente SPOTS","Crear plantillas de pruebas de widgets para la validación de la interfaz de usuario","Automatizar la generación de plantillas de pruebas de integración para pruebas de servicio","Depurar fallos de pruebas con análisis de casos límite"],"fr":["Générer des modèles de tests unitaires pour la fonctionnalité du composant SPOTS","Créer des modèles de tests de widgets pour la validation de l''interface utilisateur","Automatiser la génération de modèles de tests d''intégration pour les tests de service","Déboguer les échecs de tests avec une analyse de cas limite"],"de":["Generieren von Vorlagen für Einheitstests für die Funktionalität der SPOTS-Komponente","Erstellen von Vorlagen für Widget-Tests zur Überprüfung der Benutzeroberfläche","Automatisieren der Generierung von Vorlagen für Integrations- und Servicetests","Fehlerbehebung bei Testfehlern mit einer Analyse von Randfällen"],"pt":["Geração de modelos de teste unitário para funcionalidade do componente SPOTS","Criação de modelos de teste de widget para validação da interface do usuário","Automatização da geração de modelos de teste de integração para teste de serviço","Depuração de falhas de teste com análise de caso de bordo"],"ru":["Генерация шаблонов модульного тестирования для функциональности компонента SPOTS","Создание шаблонов тестирования виджетов для проверки пользовательского интерфейса","Автоматизация генерации шаблонов тестирования интеграции для тестирования сервисов","Отладка сбоев тестирования с помощью анализа граничных случаев"],"ar":["إنشاء قوالب اختبار وحدة لتشغيل مكون SPOTS","إنشاء قوالب اختبار الويدجيت لتأكيد واجهة المستخدم","تأتمتة إنشاء قوالب اختبار التكامل لاختبار الخدمة","تصحيح أخطاء الاختبار مع تحليل الحالات الحدية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to test/templates/ directory","Limited to Dart programming language","Dependent on specific test template files (e.g., unit_test_template.dart, widget_test_template.dart)"],"zh":["需要访问test/templates/目录","仅限Dart编程语言","依赖于特定的测试模板文件（例如unit_test_template.dart, widget_test_template.dart）"],"ja":["test/templates/ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","Dartプログラミング言語のみ","特定のテストテンプレートファイル（例：unit_test_template.dart, widget_test_template.dart）に依存"],"ko":["test/templates/ 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","Dart 프로그래밍 언어만 해당됩니다","특정한 테스트 템플릿 파일(예: unit_test_template.dart, widget_test_template.dart)에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio test/templates/","Limitado al lenguaje de programación Dart","Dependiente de archivos de plantillas de pruebas específicos (por ejemplo, unit_test_template.dart, widget_test_template.dart)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au répertoire test/templates/","Limité au langage de programmation Dart","Dépendant de fichiers de modèles de tests spécifiques (par exemple, unit_test_template.dart, widget_test_template.dart)"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis test/templates/","Begrenzt auf die Programmiersprache Dart","Abhängig von bestimmten Testvorlagendateien (z. B. unit_test_template.dart, widget_test_template.dart)"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao diretório test/templates/","Limitado à linguagem de programação Dart","Dependente de arquivos de modelo de teste específicos (por exemplo, unit_test_template.dart, widget_test_template.dart)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу test/templates/","Ограничен языком программирования Dart","Зависит от конкретных файлов шаблонов тестирования (например, unit_test_template.dart, widget_test_template.dart)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل test/templates/","محدود بلغة برمجة Dart","يعتمد على ملفات قوالب اختبار محددة (على سبيل المثال ، unit_test_template.dart ، widget_test_template.dart)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('andrescardonas7/salchipapa-web/frontend-patterns', 'community', 'andrescardonas7', 'salchipapa-web', 'andrescardonas7/salchipapa-web', 'frontend-patterns', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:17:28.641Z', NULL, '{"id":"andrescardonas7/salchipapa-web/frontend-patterns","name":"frontend-patterns","description":{"zh":"现代前端开发模式，涵盖React、Next.js和高性能用户界面","ja":"モダンなフロントエンド開発パターン。React、Next.js、パフォーマンスの高いUIを含む","ko":"최신 프론트엔드 개발 패턴. React, Next.js, 고성능 UI 포함","pt":"Desenvolva interfaces de usuário performáticas com os padrões de frontend mais modernos para React e Next.js. Aprenda a criar componentes reutilizáveis e escaláveis.","ru":"Разрабатывайте высокопроизводительные пользовательские интерфейсы с помощью современных фронтенд-шаблонов для React и Next.js. Узнайте, как создавать повторно используемые и масштабируемые компоненты.","ar":"قم بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم عالية الأداء باستخدام أنماط واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الحديثة لرياكت ونيكست.جس. تعلم كيفية إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والتمكين","en":"Desafío Salchipapa - Votación por la mejor salchip"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"前端开发模式","ja":"フロントエンド開発パターン","ko":"프론트엔드 개발 패턴","pt":"Padrões de Frontend: Melhores Práticas para React e Next.js","ru":"Фронтенд-шаблоны: современные подходы для React и Next.js","ar":"نماذج واجهة المستخدم الأمامية: أفضل الممارسات لرياكت ونيك...","en":"frontend-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"现代前端开发模式，涵盖React、Next.js和高性能用户界面","ja":"モダンなフロントエンド開発パターン。React、Next.js、パフォーマンスの高いUIを含む","ko":"최신 프론트엔드 개발 패턴. React, Next.js, 고성능 UI 포함","pt":"Desenvolva interfaces de usuário performáticas com os padrões de frontend mais modernos para React e Next.js. Aprenda a criar componentes reutilizáveis e esc...","ru":"Разрабатывайте высокопроизводительные пользовательские интерфейсы с помощью современных фронтенд-шаблонов для React и Next.js. Узнайте, как создавать повторн...","ar":"قم بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم عالية الأداء باستخدام أنماط واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الحديثة لرياكت ونيكست.جس. تعلم كيفية إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والتمكين","en":"Desafío Salchipapa - Votación por la mejor salchip"},"definition":{"en":"Desafío Salchipapa - Votación por la mejor salchip"},"features":{"zh":["组件模式","组合优于继承","React和Next.js支持","高性能用户界面","现代前端开发最佳实践"],"ja":["コンポーネントパターン","コンポジションオーバー継承","ReactとNext.jsのサポート","パフォーマンスの高いUI","モダンなフロントエンド開発のベストプラクティス"],"ko":["컴포넌트 패턴","구성 위에 상속","React 및 Next.js 지원","고성능 UI","최신 프론트엔드 개발 모범 사례"],"pt":["Componentes reutilizáveis","Arquitetura escalável","Otimização de desempenho","Integração com React e Next.js","Padrões de design modernos"],"ru":["Повторно используемые компоненты","Масштабируемая архитектура","Оптимизация производительности","Интеграция с React и Next.js","Современные шаблоны дизайна"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","هيكل قابل للتوسيع","تحسين الأداء","التكامل مع رياكت ونيكست.جس","نماذج تصميم حديثة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端开发模式","React","Next.js","组件模式","组合优于继承","高性能用户界面","现代前端开发"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発パターン","React","Next.js","コンポーネントパターン","コンポジションオーバー継承","パフォーマンスの高いUI","モダンなフロントエンド開発"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발 패턴","React","Next.js","컴포넌트 패턴","구성 위에 상속","고성능 UI","최신 프론트엔드 개발"],"pt":["padrões de frontend","desenvolvimento de frontend","react","next.js","componentes reutilizáveis","arquitetura escalável","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["фронтенд-шаблоны","разработка фронтенда","react","next.js","повторно используемые компоненты","масштабируемая архитектура","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["نماذج واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","تنمية واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","رياكت","نيكست.جس","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","هيكل قابل للتوسيع","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"andrescardonas7","repo":"salchipapa-web","repoPath":"andrescardonas7/salchipapa-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-patterns","description":"Frontend development patterns for React, Next.js, state management, performance optimization, and UI best practices.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Development Patterns\n\nModern frontend patterns for React, Next.js, and performant user interfaces.\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Composition Over Inheritance\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Component composition\ninterface CardProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  variant?: ''default'' | ''outlined''\n}\n\nexport function Card({ children, variant = ''default'' }: CardProps) {\n  return <div className={`card card-${variant}`}>{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardHeader({ children }: { children: React.","body":"# Frontend Development Patterns\n\nModern frontend patterns for React, Next.js, and performant user interfaces.\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Composition Over Inheritance\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Component composition\ninterface CardProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  variant?: ''default'' | ''outlined''\n}\n\nexport function Card({ children, variant = ''default'' }: CardProps) {\n  return <div className={`card card-${variant}`}>{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardHeader({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"card-header\">{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardBody({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"card-body\">{children}</div>\n}\n\n// Usage\n<Card>\n  <CardHeader>Title</CardHeader>\n  <CardBody>Content</CardBody>\n</Card>\n```\n\n### Compound Components\n\n```typescript\ninterface TabsContextValue {\n  activeTab: string\n  setActiveTab: (tab: string) => void\n}\n\nconst TabsContext = createContext<TabsContextValue | undefined>(undefined)\n\nexport function Tabs({ children, defaultTab }: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  defaultTab: string\n}) {\n  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState(defaultTab)\n\n  return (\n    <TabsContext.Provider value={{ activeTab, setActiveTab }}>\n      {children}\n    </TabsContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function TabList({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"tab-list\">{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function Tab({ id, children }: { id: string, children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const context = useContext(TabsContext)\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''Tab must be used within Tabs'')\n\n  return (\n    <button\n      className={context.activeTab === id ? ''active'' : ''''}\n      onClick={() => context.setActiveTab(id)}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </button>\n  )\n}\n\n// Usage\n<Tabs defaultTab=\"overview\">\n  <TabList>\n    <Tab id=\"overview\">Overview</Tab>\n    <Tab id=\"details\">Details</Tab>\n  </TabList>\n</Tabs>\n```\n\n### Render Props Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface DataLoaderProps<T> {\n  url: string\n  children: (data: T | null, loading: boolean, error: Error | null) => React.ReactNode\n}\n\nexport function DataLoader<T>({ url, children }: DataLoaderProps<T>) {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<T | null>(null)\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true)\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetch(url)\n      .then(res => res.json())\n      .then(setData)\n      .catch(setError)\n      .finally(() => setLoading(false))\n  }, [url])\n\n  return <>{children(data, loading, error)}</>\n}\n\n// Usage\n<DataLoader<Market[]> url=\"/api/markets\">\n  {(markets, loading, error) => {\n    if (loading) return <Spinner />\n    if (error) return <Error error={error} />\n    return <MarketList markets={markets!} />\n  }}\n</DataLoader>\n```\n\n## Custom Hooks Patterns\n\n### State Management Hook\n\n```typescript\nexport function useToggle(initialValue = false): [boolean, () => void] {\n  const [value, setValue] = useState(initialValue)\n\n  const toggle = useCallback(() => {\n    setValue(v => !v)\n  }, [])\n\n  return [value, toggle]\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst [isOpen, toggleOpen] = useToggle()\n```\n\n### Async Data Fetching Hook\n\n```typescript\ninterface UseQueryOptions<T> {\n  onSuccess?: (data: T) => void\n  onError?: (error: Error) => void\n  enabled?: boolean\n}\n\nexport function useQuery<T>(\n  key: string,\n  fetcher: () => Promise<T>,\n  options?: UseQueryOptions<T>\n) {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<T | null>(null)\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null)\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false)\n\n  const refetch = useCallback(async () => {\n    setLoading(true)\n    setError(null)\n\n    try {\n      const result = await fetcher()\n      setData(result)\n      options?.onSuccess?.(result)\n    } catch (err) {\n      const error = err as Error\n      setError(error)\n      options?.onError?.(error)\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(false)\n    }\n  }, [fetcher, options])\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (options?.enabled !== false) {\n      refetch()\n    }\n  }, [key, refetch, options?.enabled])\n\n  return { data, error, loading, refetch }\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst { data: markets, loading, error, refetch } = useQuery(\n  ''markets'',\n  () => fetch(''/api/markets'').then(r => r.json()),\n  {\n    onSuccess: data => console.log(''Fetched'', data.length, ''markets''),\n    onError: err => console.error(''Failed:'', err)\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### Debounce Hook\n\n```typescript\nexport function useDebounce<T>(value: T, delay: number): T {\n  const [debouncedValue, setDebouncedValue] = useState<T>(value)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handler = setTimeout(() => {\n      setDebouncedValue(value)\n    }, delay)\n\n    return () => clearTimeout(handler)\n  }, [value, delay])\n\n  return debouncedValue\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst [searchQuery, setSearchQuery] = useState('''')\nconst debouncedQuery = useDebounce(searchQuery, 500)\n\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (debouncedQuery) {\n    performSearch(debouncedQuery)\n  }\n}, [debouncedQuery])\n```\n\n## State Management Patterns\n\n### Context + Reducer Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface State {\n  markets: Market[]\n  selectedMarket: Market | null\n  loading: boolean\n}\n\ntype Action =\n  | { type: ''SET_MARKETS''; payload: Market[] }\n  | { type: ''SELECT_MARKET''; payload: Market }\n  | { type: ''SET_LOADING''; payload: boolean }\n\nfunction reducer(state: State, action: Action): State {\n  switch (action.type) {\n    case ''SET_MARKETS'':\n      return { ...state, markets: action.payload }\n    case ''SELECT_MARKET'':\n      return { ...state, selectedMarket: action.payload }\n    case ''SET_LOADING'':\n      return { ...state, loading: action.payload }\n    default:\n      return state\n  }\n}\n\nconst MarketContext = createContext<{\n  state: State\n  dispatch: Dispatch<Action>\n} | undefined>(undefined)\n\nexport function MarketProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const [state, dispatch] = useReducer(reducer, {\n    markets: [],\n    selectedMarket: null,\n    loading: false\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <MarketContext.Provider value={{ state, dispatch }}>\n      {children}\n    </MarketContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function useMarkets() {\n  const context = useContext(MarketContext)\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''useMarkets must be used within MarketProvider'')\n  return context\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Memoization\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ useMemo for expensive computations\nconst sortedMarkets = useMemo(() => {\n  return markets.sort((a, b) => b.volume - a.volume)\n}, [markets])\n\n// ✅ useCallback for functions passed to children\nconst handleSearch = useCallback((query: string) => {\n  setSearchQuery(query)\n}, [])\n\n// ✅ React.memo for pure components\nexport const MarketCard = React.memo<MarketCardProps>(({ market }) => {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"market-card\">\n      <h3>{market.name}</h3>\n      <p>{market.description}</p>\n    </div>\n  )\n})\n```\n\n### Code Splitting & Lazy Loading\n\n```typescript\nimport { lazy, Suspense } from ''react''\n\n// ✅ Lazy load heavy components\nconst HeavyChart = lazy(() => import(''./HeavyChart''))\nconst ThreeJsBackground = lazy(() => import(''./ThreeJsBackground''))\n\nexport function Dashboard() {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Suspense fallback={<ChartSkeleton />}>\n        <HeavyChart data={data} />\n      </Suspense>\n\n      <Suspense fallback={null}>\n        <ThreeJsBackground />\n      </Suspense>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Virtualization for Long Lists\n\n```typescript\nimport { useVirtualizer } from ''@tanstack/react-virtual''\n\nexport function VirtualMarketList({ markets }: { markets: Market[] }) {\n  const parentRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null)\n\n  const virtualizer = useVirtualizer({\n    count: markets.length,\n    getScrollElement: () => parentRef.current,\n    estimateSize: () => 100,  // Estimated row height\n    overscan: 5  // Extra items to render\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div ref={parentRef} style={{ height: ''600px'', overflow: ''auto'' }}>\n      <div\n        style={{\n          height: `${virtualizer.getTotalSize()}px`,\n          position: ''relative''\n        }}\n      >\n        {virtualizer.getVirtualItems().map(virtualRow => (\n          <div\n            key={virtualRow.index}\n            style={{\n              position: ''absolute'',\n              top: 0,\n              left: 0,\n              width: ''100%'',\n              height: `${virtualRow.size}px`,\n              transform: `translateY(${virtualRow.start}px)`\n            }}\n          >\n            <MarketCard market={markets[virtualRow.index]} />\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Form Handling Patterns\n\n### Controlled Form with Validation\n\n```typescript\ninterface FormData {\n  name: string\n  description: string\n  endDate: string\n}\n\ninterface FormErrors {\n  name?: string\n  description?: string\n  endDate?: string\n}\n\nexport function CreateMarketForm() {\n  const [formData, setFormData] = useState<FormData>({\n    name: '''',\n    description: '''',\n    endDate: ''''\n  })\n\n  const [errors, setErrors] = useState<FormErrors>({})\n\n  const validate = (): boolean => {\n    const newErrors: FormErrors = {}\n\n    if (!formData.name.trim()) {\n      newErrors.name = ''Name is required''\n    } else if (formData.name.length > 200) {\n      newErrors.name = ''Name must be under 200 characters''\n    }\n\n    if (!formData.description.trim()) {\n      newErrors.description = ''Description is required''\n    }\n\n    if (!formData.endDate) {\n      newErrors.endDate = ''End date is required''\n    }\n\n    setErrors(newErrors)\n    return Object.keys(newErrors).length === 0\n  }\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {\n    e.preventDefault()\n\n    if (!validate()) return\n\n    try {\n      await createMarket(formData)\n      // Success handling\n    } catch (error) {\n      // Error handling\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n      <input\n        value={formData.name}\n        onChange={e => setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, name: e.target.value }))}\n        placeholder=\"Market name\"\n      />\n      {errors.name && <span className=\"error\">{errors.name}</span>}\n\n      {/* Other fields */}\n\n      <button type=\"submit\">Create Market</button>\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Error Boundary Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface ErrorBoundaryState {\n  hasError: boolean\n  error: Error | null\n}\n\nexport class ErrorBoundary extends React.Component<\n  { children: React.ReactNode },\n  ErrorBoundaryState\n> {\n  state: ErrorBoundaryState = {\n    hasError: false,\n    error: null\n  }\n\n  static getDerivedStateFromError(error: Error): ErrorBoundaryState {\n    return { hasError: true, error }\n  }\n\n  componentDidCatch(error: Error, errorInfo: React.ErrorInfo) {\n    console.error(''Error boundary caught:'', error, errorInfo)\n  }\n\n  render() {\n    if (this.state.hasError) {\n      return (\n        <div className=\"error-fallback\">\n          <h2>Something went wrong</h2>\n          <p>{this.state.error?.message}</p>\n          <button onClick={() => this.setState({ hasError: false })}>\n            Try again\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      )\n    }\n\n    return this.props.children\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\n<ErrorBoundary>\n  <App />\n</ErrorBoundary>\n```\n\n## Animation Patterns\n\n### Framer Motion Animations\n\n```typescript\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from ''framer-motion''\n\n// ✅ List animations\nexport function AnimatedMarketList({ markets }: { markets: Market[] }) {\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {markets.map(market => (\n        <motion.div\n          key={market.id}\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\n          animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n          exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.3 }}\n        >\n          <MarketCard market={market} />\n        </motion.div>\n      ))}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  )\n}\n\n// ✅ Modal animations\nexport function Modal({ isOpen, onClose, children }: ModalProps) {\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {isOpen && (\n        <>\n          <motion.div\n            className=\"modal-overlay\"\n            initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n            onClick={onClose}\n          />\n          <motion.div\n            className=\"modal-content\"\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.9, y: 20 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1, y: 0 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.9, y: 20 }}\n          >\n            {children}\n          </motion.div>\n        </>\n      )}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Accessibility Patterns\n\n### Keyboard Navigation\n\n```typescript\nexport function Dropdown({ options, onSelect }: DropdownProps) {\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false)\n  const [activeIndex, setActiveIndex] = useState(0)\n\n  const handleKeyDown = (e: React.KeyboardEvent) => {\n    switch (e.key) {\n      case ''ArrowDown'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        setActiveIndex(i => Math.min(i + 1, options.length - 1))\n        break\n      case ''ArrowUp'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        setActiveIndex(i => Math.max(i - 1, 0))\n        break\n      case ''Enter'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        onSelect(options[activeIndex])\n        setIsOpen(false)\n        break\n      case ''Escape'':\n        setIsOpen(false)\n        break\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      role=\"combobox\"\n      aria-expanded={isOpen}\n      aria-haspopup=\"listbox\"\n      onKeyDown={handleKeyDown}\n    >\n      {/* Dropdown implementation */}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Focus Management\n\n```typescript\nexport function Modal({ isOpen, onClose, children }: ModalProps) {\n  const modalRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null)\n  const previousFocusRef = useRef<HTMLElement | null>(null)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (isOpen) {\n      // Save currently focused element\n      previousFocusRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement\n\n      // Focus modal\n      modalRef.current?.focus()\n    } else {\n      // Restore focus when closing\n      previousFocusRef.current?.focus()\n    }\n  }, [isOpen])\n\n  return isOpen ? (\n    <div\n      ref={modalRef}\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      tabIndex={-1}\n      onKeyDown={e => e.key === ''Escape'' && onClose()}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </div>\n  ) : null\n}\n```\n\n**Remember**: Modern frontend patterns enable maintainable, performant user interfaces. Choose patterns that fit your project complexity.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:17:28.641Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js development patterns.","zh":"非常适合需要高级React和Next.js开发模式的前端代理。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsの高度な開発パターンを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適。","ko":"고급 React 및 Next.js 개발 패턴이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan patrones de desarrollo avanzados de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin de modèles de développement avancés React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte React- und Next.js-Entwicklungsmuster benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de padrões avançados de desenvolvimento React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые шаблоны разработки React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لموكلات واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى أنماط متقدمة من تطوير React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft performant user interfaces using composition over inheritance, leveraging React and Next.js for efficient component rendering and optimized user experience, while utilizing TypeScript for robust type safety and maintainability.","zh":"赋予代理创建高性能的用户界面，使用组合代替继承，利用React和Next.js进行高效的组件渲染和优化的用户体验，同时利用TypeScript进行强大的类型安全和可维护性。","ja":"エージェントが、組み合わせによる継承を使用してパフォーマンスの高いユーザーインターフェイスを作成できるようにし、ReactとNext.jsを使用して効率的なコンポーネントレンダリングと最適化されたユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供し、TypeScriptを使用して堅牢なタイプセーフティと保守性を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 컴포지션을 통해 상속을 사용하여 고성능의 사용자 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 React와 Next.js를 사용하여 효율적인 컴포넌트 렌더링 및 최적화된 사용자 경험을 제공하고, TypeScript를 사용하여 강력한 유형 안전성 및 유지 보수성을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces de usuario de alto rendimiento utilizando la composición en lugar de la herencia, aprovechando React y Next.js para una renderización de componentes eficiente y una experiencia del usuario optimizada, mientras utiliza TypeScript para una seguridad y mantenibilidad de tipos robustas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces utilisateur performantes en utilisant la composition plutôt que l''héritage, en exploitant React et Next.js pour un rendu de composants efficace et une expérience utilisateur optimisée, tout en utilisant TypeScript pour une sécurité et une maintenabilité de types robustes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, leistungsstarke Benutzeroberflächen zu erstellen, indem sie die Komposition anstelle von Vererbung verwenden, React und Next.js für eine effiziente Komponentenrendering und eine optimierte Benutzererfahrung nutzen und gleichzeitig TypeScript für eine robuste Typsicherheit und Wartbarkeit verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces do usuário de alto desempenho usando composição em vez de herança, aproveitando React e Next.js para renderização eficiente de componentes e experiência do usuário otimizada, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza TypeScript para segurança de tipo robusta e manutenibilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокопроизводительные пользовательские интерфейсы, используя композицию вместо наследования, используя React и Next.js для эффективного рендеринга компонентов и оптимизированного пользовательского опыта, а также используя TypeScript для прочной безопасности типов и поддерживаемости.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم عالية الأداء باستخدام التكوين بدلاً من الوراثة، واستغلال React و Next.js لتقديم مكونات فعالة وتجربة مستخدم محسنة، وفي الوقت نفسه استخدام TypeScript لأمان أنواع قوي وإدارة صيانة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing component-driven architecture for scalable frontend applications","Optimizing render performance using React memoization and Next.js server-side rendering","Debugging complex component hierarchies with TypeScript type checking and inference"],"zh":["实现可扩展的前端应用程序的组件驱动的架构","使用React记忆化和Next.js服务器端渲染优化渲染性能","使用TypeScript类型检查和推断调试复杂的组件层次结构"],"ja":["スケーラブルなフロントエンドアプリケーションのコンポーネント駆動のアーキテクチャを実装する","Reactのメモ化とNext.jsのサーバーサイドレンダリングを使用してレンダリングパフォーマンスを最適化する","TypeScriptの型チェックと推論を使用して複雑なコンポーネント階層をデバッグする"],"ko":["확장 가능한 프론트엔드 애플리케이션을 위한 컴포넌트 주도 아키텍처 구현","React 메모화 및 Next.js 서버측 렌더링을 사용하여 렌더링 성능 최적화","TypeScript 타입 검사 및 추론을 사용하여 복잡한 컴포넌트 계층구조 디버깅"],"es":["Implementar una arquitectura basada en componentes para aplicaciones frontend escalables","Optimizar el rendimiento de renderizado utilizando la memorización de React y el renderizado del lado del servidor de Next.js","Depurar jerarquías de componentes complejas con verificación y inferencia de tipos de TypeScript"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une architecture basée sur les composants pour des applications frontend escalables","Optimiser les performances de rendu en utilisant la mémorisation de React et le rendu côté serveur de Next.js","Déboguer des hiérarchies de composants complexes avec la vérification et l''inférence de types de TypeScript"],"de":["Implementierung einer komponentenbasierten Architektur für skalierbare Frontend-Anwendungen","Optimierung der Renderleistung durch Verwendung der React-Memoisierung und des Next.js-Server-Seitigen-Renderings","Fehlerbehebung komplexer Komponenten-Hierarchien mit TypeScript-Typ-Überprüfung und -Ableitung"],"pt":["Implementação de arquitetura orientada a componentes para aplicações frontend escaláveis","Otimização do desempenho de renderização usando memoização do React e renderização do lado do servidor do Next.js","Depuração de hierarquias de componentes complexas com verificação de tipo e inferência do TypeScript"],"ru":["Реализация компонентно-ориентированной архитектуры для масштабируемых приложений frontend","Оптимизация производительности рендеринга с использованием memoизации React и серверного рендеринга Next.js","Отладка сложных иерархий компонентов с помощью проверки типов и вывода типов в TypeScript"],"ar":["تنفيذ هندسة موجهة للمكونات لتطبيقات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتوسيع","تحسين أداء العرض باستخدام تذكير React وتصيير الخادم الجانبي لـ Next.js","تصحيح أخطاء هرميات المكونات المعقدة باستخدام التحقق من النوع والاستدلال في TypeScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and Next.js project setup","Limited to TypeScript-based projects","Focused on frontend development, not applicable to backend or full-stack development"],"zh":["需要React和Next.js项目设置","仅限于TypeScript基于的项目","专注于前端开发，不适用于后端或全栈开发"],"ja":["ReactとNext.jsのプロジェクト設定が必要","TypeScriptベースのプロジェクトのみに限定","フロントエンド開発に焦点を当てており、バックエンドまたはフルスタック開発には適用されない"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요합니다","TypeScript 기반 프로젝트에만 제한됩니다","프론트엔드 개발에 중점을 두고 있으며, 백엔드 또는 풀스택 개발에는 적용할 수 없습니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto React y Next.js","Limitado a proyectos basados en TypeScript","Centrado en el desarrollo frontend, no aplicable al desarrollo backend o full-stack"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React et Next.js","Limité aux projets basés sur TypeScript","Axé sur le développement frontend, non applicable au développement backend ou full-stack"],"de":["Benötigt React- und Next.js-Projektsetup","Begrenzt auf TypeScript-basierte Projekte","Konzentriert sich auf die Frontend-Entwicklung, nicht anwendbar auf die Backend- oder Full-Stack-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Requer configuração de projeto React e Next.js","Limitado a projetos baseados em TypeScript","Focado no desenvolvimento frontend, não aplicável ao desenvolvimento backend ou full-stack"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта React и Next.js","Ограничен проектами на основе TypeScript","Ориентирован на разработку frontend, не подходит для backend или full-stack разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع React و Next.js","محدود بمشاريع قائم على TypeScript","مركز على تطوير واجهة المستخدم، غير قابل للتطبيق على تطوير الخلفية أو كامل الحزمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
