 데이터입니다","es":"El marcado de esquema es crucial para mejorar la visibilidad en los resultados de búsqueda. Aprende a implementarlo correctamente","fr":"Les balises de schéma sont essentielles pour améliorer la visibilité dans les résultats de recherche. Découvrez comment les mettre en œuvre correctement","de":"Schema-Markup ist entscheidend für eine bessere Sichtbarkeit in den Suchergebnissen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es richtig implementieren","pt":"Implemente marcadores de esquema para ajudar os mecanismos de busca a entender o conteúdo e habilitar resultados ricos","ru":"Реализуйте маркировку схемы, чтобы помочь поисковым системам понять содержимое и включить богатые результаты","ar":"نفذ ماركرات مخطط للمساعدة في فهم محتوى محركات البحث وتفعيل النتائج الغنية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提高搜索引擎结果的可见性","增强搜索结果的丰富性","帮助搜索引擎理解您的内容","支持多种数据类型","易于实施和维护"],"ja":["検索結果の可視性を高める","検索結果の豊富性を高める","検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解するのを助ける","複数のデータタイプをサポート","実装とメンテナンスが容易"],"ko":["검색 결과의 가시성을 높인다","검색 결과의 풍부성을 높인다","검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하는 것을 도와준다","다양한 데이터 타입을 지원한다","구현과 유지 보수가 쉽다"],"es":["Mejora la comprensión de los motores de búsqueda","Habilita resultados ricos en los resultados de búsqueda","Proporciona información estructurada","Es compatible con schema.org","Puede ser utilizado en diferentes tipos de páginas"],"fr":["Améliore la compréhension des moteurs de recherche","Active les résultats riches dans les résultats de recherche","Fournit des informations structurées","Est compatible avec schema.org","Peut être utilisé sur différents types de pages"],"de":["Verbessert die Verständnis der Suchmaschinen","Aktiviert reiche Ergebnisse in den Suchergebnissen","Lieferet strukturierte Informationen","Ist kompatibel mit schema.org","Kann auf verschiedenen Seiten verwendet werden"],"pt":["Melhora a visibilidade nos resultados de busca","Fornece informações estruturadas sobre o conteúdo","Habilita resultados ricos nos resultados de busca","Ajuda os mecanismos de busca a entender o conteúdo","Aumenta a taxa de cliques nos resultados de busca","Melhora a experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Улучшает видимость в результатах поиска","Предоставляет структурированную информацию о содержимом","Включает богатые результаты в результатах поиска","Помогает поисковым системам понять содержимое","Увеличивает коэффициент кликов в результатах поиска","Улучшает опыт пользователя"],"ar":["تحسين ظهور نتائج البحث","توفر معلومات منظمة حول المحتوى","تفعيل النتائج الغنية في نتائج البحث","مساعدة محركات البحث على فهم المحتوى","زيادة معدل النقرات في نتائج البحث","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Schema 标记","结构化数据","搜索引擎优化","丰富搜索结果","Schema.org","微数据","JSON-LD"],"ja":["スキーマ マークアップ","構造化データ","検索エンジン最適化","豊富な検索結果","スキーマ オーグ","マイクロデータ","JSON-LD"],"ko":["스키마 마크업","구조화된 데이터","검색 엔진 최적화","풍부한 검색 결과","스키마 오그","마이크로데이터","JSON-LD"],"es":["marcado de esquema","schema.org","resultados ricos","optimización para motores de búsqueda","SEO","desarrollo web","estructura de datos"],"fr":["balises de schéma","schema.org","résultats riches","optimisation pour les moteurs de recherche","SEO","développement web","structure de données"],"de":["Schema-Markup","schema.org","reiche Ergebnisse","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung","SEO","Webentwicklung","Datenstruktur"],"pt":["marcadores de esquema","schema markup","resultados ricos","visibilidade nos resultados de busca","informações estruturadas","mecanismos de busca","otimização para mecanismos de busca","desenvolvimento web","SEO"],"ru":["маркировка схемы","schema markup","богатые результаты","видимость в результатах поиска","структурированная информация","поисковые системы","оптимизация для поисковых систем","веб-разработка","SEO"],"ar":["ماركرات مخطط","schema markup","نتائج غنية","ظهور نتائج البحث","معلومات منظمة","محركات البحث","تحسين محركات البحث","تطوير الويب","SEO"]}},"owner":"firstcreditunion","repo":"fcu-website-dev","repoPath":"firstcreditunion/fcu-website-dev","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"schema-markup","description":"When the user wants to add, fix, or optimize schema markup and structured data on their site. Also use when the user mentions schema markup, structured data, JSON-LD, rich snippets, schema.org, FAQ schema, product schema, review schema, or breadcrumb schema. For broader SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type","body":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type** - What kind of page? What''s the primary content? What rich results are possible?\n\n2. **Current State** - Any existing schema? Errors in implementation? Which rich results already appearing?\n\n3. **Goals** - Which rich results are you targeting? What''s the business value?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Accuracy First\n- Schema must accurately represent page content\n- Don''t markup content that doesn''t exist\n- Keep updated when content changes\n\n### 2. Use JSON-LD\n- Google recommends JSON-LD format\n- Easier to implement and maintain\n- Place in `<head>` or end of `<body>`\n\n### 3. Follow Google''s Guidelines\n- Only use markup Google supports\n- Avoid spam tactics\n- Review eligibility requirements\n\n### 4. Validate Everything\n- Test before deploying\n- Monitor Search Console\n- Fix errors promptly\n\n---\n\n## Common Schema Types\n\n| Type | Use For | Required Properties |\n|------|---------|-------------------|\n| Organization | Company homepage/about | name, url |\n| WebSite | Homepage (search box) | name, url |\n| Article | Blog posts, news | headline, image, datePublished, author |\n| Product | Product pages | name, image, offers |\n| SoftwareApplication | SaaS/app pages | name, offers |\n| FAQPage | FAQ content | mainEntity (Q&A array) |\n| HowTo | Tutorials | name, step |\n| BreadcrumbList | Any page with breadcrumbs | itemListElement |\n| LocalBusiness | Local business pages | name, address |\n| Event | Events, webinars | name, startDate, location |\n\n**For complete JSON-LD examples**: See [references/schema-examples.md](references/schema-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Organization (Company Page)\nRequired: name, url\nRecommended: logo, sameAs (social profiles), contactPoint\n\n### Article/BlogPosting\nRequired: headline, image, datePublished, author\nRecommended: dateModified, publisher, description\n\n### Product\nRequired: name, image, offers (price + availability)\nRecommended: sku, brand, aggregateRating, review\n\n### FAQPage\nRequired: mainEntity (array of Question/Answer pairs)\n\n### BreadcrumbList\nRequired: itemListElement (array with position, name, item)\n\n---\n\n## Multiple Schema Types\n\nYou can combine multiple schema types on one page using `@graph`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"Organization\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", ... }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation and Testing\n\n### Tools\n- **Google Rich Results Test**: https://search.google.com/test/rich-results\n- **Schema.org Validator**: https://validator.schema.org/\n- **Search Console**: Enhancements reports\n\n### Common Errors\n\n**Missing required properties** - Check Google''s documentation for required fields\n\n**Invalid values** - Dates must be ISO 8601, URLs fully qualified, enumerations exact\n\n**Mismatch with page content** - Schema doesn''t match visible content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Static Sites\n- Add JSON-LD directly in HTML template\n- Use includes/partials for reusable schema\n\n### Dynamic Sites (React, Next.js)\n- Component that renders schema\n- Server-side rendered for SEO\n- Serialize data to JSON-LD\n\n### CMS / WordPress\n- Plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, Schema Pro)\n- Theme modifications\n- Custom fields to structured data\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Schema Implementation\n```json\n// Full JSON-LD code block\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"...\",\n  // Complete markup\n}\n```\n\n### Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Validates in Rich Results Test\n- [ ] No errors or warnings\n- [ ] Matches page content\n- [ ] All required properties included\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of page is this?\n2. What rich results are you hoping to achieve?\n3. What data is available to populate the schema?\n4. Is there existing schema on the page?\n5. What''s your tech stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For overall SEO including schema review\n- **programmatic-seo**: For templated schema at scale\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:18:10.047Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO-focused Agents needing structured data implementation for rich search results.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化数据实现来获取丰富搜索结果的SEO专注代理","ja":"SEOに焦点を当てたエージェントが構造化データの実装を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"豊富한 검색 결과를 위한 구조화된 데이터 구현이 필요한 SEO 중점 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en SEO que necesitan implementación de datos estructurados para resultados de búsqueda ricos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur le SEO nécessitant une implémentation de données structurées pour des résultats de recherche riches.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-fokussierte Agenten, die eine Implementierung von strukturierten Daten für umfangreiche Suchergebnisse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em SEO que necessitam de implementação de dados estruturados para resultados de pesquisa ricos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на SEO, которым необходима реализация структурированных данных для получения богатых результатов поиска.","ar":"مثالي لعميل يركز على تحسين محركات البحث ويتطلب تنفيذ بيانات منسقة لنتائج بحث غنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results in search, utilizing protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata.","zh":"使得代理能够实施schema.org标记，从而使搜索引擎能够理解内容并在搜索中显示丰富的结果，利用JSON-LD和Microdata等协议","ja":"エージェントがschema.orgマークアップを実装できるようにし、検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解し、検索で豊富な結果を表示できるようにする。JSON-LDやMicrodataなどのプロトコルを使用","ko":"에이전트가 schema.org 마크업을 구현할 수 있도록 하여 검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 검색에서 풍부한 결과를 표시할 수 있게 한다. JSON-LD 및 Microdata 등의 프로토콜을 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar la marca schema.org, lo que permite a los motores de búsqueda comprender el contenido y mostrar resultados ricos en la búsqueda, utilizando protocolos como JSON-LD y Microdata.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''implémenter la balise schema.org, permettant ainsi aux moteurs de recherche de comprendre le contenu et d''afficher des résultats riches dans les recherches, en utilisant des protocoles tels que JSON-LD et Microdata.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Markierung schema.org zu implementieren, sodass Suchmaschinen den Inhalt verstehen und umfangreiche Ergebnisse in der Suche anzeigen können, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie JSON-LD und Microdata.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar marcação schema.org, permitindo que os mecanismos de busca entendam o conteúdo e exibam resultados ricos na pesquisa, utilizando protocolos como JSON-LD e Microdata.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать маркировку schema.org, что позволяет поисковым системам понимать контент и отображать богатые результаты поиска, используя протоколы như JSON-LD и Microdata.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بتنفيذ علامات schema.org، مما يتيح لمحركات البحث فهم المحتوى وعرض نتائج غنية في البحث، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل JSON-LD و Microdata."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing product markup for e-commerce sites","Generating schema for article and blog post types","Enhancing search engine results with review and rating snippets"],"zh":["电子商务网站的产品标记实现","为文章和博客帖子类型生成schema","使用评论和评分片段增强搜索引擎结果"],"ja":["電子商取引サイトの製品マークアップの実装","記事やブログ投稿タイプのスキーマを生成","レビューと評価スニペットを使用して検索エンジンの結果を強化"],"ko":["이커머스 사이트의 제품 마크업 구현","기사 및 블로그 게시물 유형에 대한 스키마 생성","리뷰 및 평가 스니펫을 사용한 검색 엔진 결과 강화"],"es":["Implementación de marca de producto para sitios de comercio electrónico","Generación de esquema para tipos de artículos y publicaciones de blog","Mejora de los resultados de los motores de búsqueda con fragmentos de reseñas y calificaciones"],"fr":["Mise en oeuvre de la balise de produit pour les sites de commerce électronique","Génération de schéma pour les types d''articles et de publications de blog","Amélioration des résultats des moteurs de recherche avec des extraits de critiques et de notes"],"de":["Implementierung von Produktmarkierungen für E-Commerce-Websites","Generierung von Schemas für Artikel- und Blogpost-Typen","Verbesserung der Suchmaschinenergebnisse mit Rezensions- und Bewertungsausschnitten"],"pt":["Implementação de marcação de produto para sites de comércio eletrônico","Geração de esquema para tipos de artigo e postagem de blog","Melhoria dos resultados da pesquisa com trechos de revisão e classificação"],"ru":["Реализация маркировки продукта для сайтов электронной коммерции","Генерация схемы для типов статей и постов в блоге","Улучшение результатов поиска с помощью отрывков обзоров и рейтингов"],"ar":["تنفيذ علامات المنتج لمواقع التجارة الإلكترونية","توليد مخطط لنوع المقالة ومنشورات المدونة","تحسين نتائج البحث باستخدام مقتطفات المراجعة والتقييم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of schema.org vocabulary","Dependent on page type and content context"],"zh":["需要schema.org词汇的知识","依赖于页面类型和内容上下文"],"ja":["schema.orgの語彙の知識が必要","ページの種類やコンテンツのコンテキストに依存"],"ko":["schema.org 어휘 지식이 필요","페이지 유형 및 콘텐츠 컨텍스트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del vocabulario schema.org","Depende del tipo de página y del contexto del contenido"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du vocabulaire schema.org","Dépend du type de page et du contexte du contenu"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des schema.org-Vokabulars","Hängt vom Seitentyp und vom Kontext des Inhalts ab"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do vocabulário schema.org","Depende do tipo de página e contexto de conteúdo"],"ru":["Требует знания словаря schema.org","Зависит от типа страницы и контекста контента"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة المصطلحات schema.org","يعتمد على نوع الصفحة وسياق المحتوى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank/convex-backend', 'community', 'shinnytech', 'caiwenqiang-member-rank', 'shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank', 'convex-backend', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:17:57.337Z', NULL, '{"id":"shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank/convex-backend","name":"convex-backend","description":{"zh":"Convex 后端是一个实时数据库和函数平台，用于构建实时协作应用和服务器端函数","ja":"Convex バックエンドはリアルタイム データベースと関数のプラットフォームで、リアルタイム コラボレーション アプリとサーバーレス関数を構築するために使用されます","ko":"Convex 백엔드는 실시간 데이터베이스와 함수 플랫폼으로 실시간 협업 애플리케이션과 서버리스 함수를 구축하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Convex Backend es una plataforma para desarrollar aplicaciones en tiempo real con bases de datos reactivas y funciones de backend sin servidor. Permite la creación de aplicaciones colaborativas y la implementación de actualizaciones de interfaz de usuario optimistas","fr":"Convex Backend est une plateforme pour développer des applications en temps réel avec des bases de données réactives et des fonctions de backend sans serveur. Elle permet la création d''applications collaboratives et la mise en œuvre de mises à jour d''interface utilisateur optimistes","de":"Convex Backend ist eine Plattform für die Entwicklung von Echtzeit-Anwendungen mit reaktiven Datenbanken und serverlosen Backend-Funktionen. Sie ermöglicht die Erstellung von Kollaborationsanwendungen und die Implementierung von optimistischen Benutzeroberflächen-Aktualisierungen","en":"会员持仓排行榜页面设计"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Convex 后端：实时数据库和函数","ja":"Convex バックエンド：リアルタイム データベースと関数","ko":"Convex 백엔드: 실시간 데이터베이스 및 함수","es":"Convex Backend: Base de Datos y Funciones en Tiempo Real","fr":"Convex Backend : Base de Données et Fonctions en Temps Réel","de":"Convex Backend: Echtzeit-Datenbank und Funktionen","en":"convex-backend"},"description":{"zh":"Convex 后端是一个实时数据库和函数平台，用于构建实时协作应用和服务器端函数","ja":"Convex バックエンドはリアルタイム データベースと関数のプラットフォームで、リアルタイム コラボレーション アプリとサーバーレス関数を構築するために使用されます","ko":"Convex 백엔드는 실시간 데이터베이스와 함수 플랫폼으로 실시간 협업 애플리케이션과 서버리스 함수를 구축하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Convex Backend es una plataforma para desarrollar aplicaciones en tiempo real con bases de datos reactivas y funciones de backend sin servidor. Permite la cr...","fr":"Convex Backend est une plateforme pour développer des applications en temps réel avec des bases de données réactives et des fonctions de backend sans serveur...","de":"Convex Backend ist eine Plattform für die Entwicklung von Echtzeit-Anwendungen mit reaktiven Datenbanken und serverlosen Backend-Funktionen. Sie ermöglicht d...","en":"会员持仓排行榜页面设计"},"definition":{"en":"会员持仓排行榜页面设计"},"features":{"zh":["实时数据库","服务器端函数","反应式数据","实时协作应用","服务器端渲染","文件上传和存储"],"ja":["リアルタイム データベース","サーバーレス関数","リアクティブ データ","リアルタイム コラボレーション アプリ","サーバーサイド レンダリング","ファイル アップロードとストレージ"],"ko":["실시간 데이터베이스","서버리스 함수","반응형 데이터","실시간 협업 애플리케이션","서버사이드 렌더링","파일 업로드 및 저장"],"es":["Bases de datos reactivas","Funciones de backend sin servidor","Actualizaciones de interfaz de usuario optimistas","Implementación de autenticación con Convex Auth","Diseño de esquemas de base de datos Convex","Subida de archivos con Convex Storage"],"fr":["Bases de données réactives","Fonctions de backend sans serveur","Mises à jour d''interface utilisateur optimistes","Mise en œuvre de l''authentification avec Convex Auth","Conception de schémas de base de données Convex","Téléchargement de fichiers avec Convex Storage"],"de":["Reaktive Datenbanken","Serverlose Backend-Funktionen","Optimistische Benutzeroberflächen-Aktualisierungen","Implementierung von Authentifizierung mit Convex Auth","Entwurf von Convex-Datenbankschemata","Datei-Upload mit Convex Storage"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 后端","实时数据库","服务器端函数","反应式数据","实时协作应用","Convex","后端开发","实时应用","服务器端渲染"],"ja":["Convex バックエンド","リアルタイム データベース","サーバーレス関数","リアクティブ データ","リアルタイム コラボレーション アプリ","Convex","バックエンド開発","リアルタイム アプリ","サーバーサイド レンダリング"],"ko":["Convex 백엔드","실시간 데이터베이스","서버리스 함수","반응형 데이터","실시간 협업 애플리케이션","Convex","백엔드 개발","실시간 애플리케이션","서버사이드 렌더링"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones en tiempo real","bases de datos reactivas","funciones de backend sin servidor","Convex Backend","aplicaciones colaborativas","autenticación con Convex Auth","diseño de esquemas de base de datos"],"fr":["développement d''applications en temps réel","bases de données réactives","fonctions de backend sans serveur","Convex Backend","applications collaboratives","authentification avec Convex Auth","conception de schémas de base de données"],"de":["Entwicklung von Echtzeit-Anwendungen","reaktive Datenbanken","serverlose Backend-Funktionen","Convex Backend","Kollaborationsanwendungen","Authentifizierung mit Convex Auth","Entwurf von Datenbankschemata"]}},"owner":"shinnytech","repo":"caiwenqiang-member-rank","repoPath":"shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-backend","description":"Build real-time, reactive backend applications with Convex using TypeScript queries, mutations, and actions with automatic reactivity and optimistic updates. Use when building real-time collaborative applications, implementing reactive data synchronization, writing serverless backend functions, creating queries that auto-update, implementing mutations with transactional guarantees, handling file uploads with Convex storage, implementing authentication with Convex Auth, designing reactive database schemas, or building applications requiring instant data synchronization.","bodyPreview":"# Convex Backend - Realtime Database & Functions\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Building real-time collaborative applications\n- Implementing reactive data that auto-updates\n- Writing Convex queries, mutations, and actions\n- Creating serverless backend functions with TypeScript\n- Implementing optimistic UI updates\n- Handling file uploads with Convex storage\n- Implementing authentication with Convex Auth\n- Designing Convex database schemas\n- Building chat applications or live dashboards\n- Creating","body":"# Convex Backend - Realtime Database & Functions\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Building real-time collaborative applications\n- Implementing reactive data that auto-updates\n- Writing Convex queries, mutations, and actions\n- Creating serverless backend functions with TypeScript\n- Implementing optimistic UI updates\n- Handling file uploads with Convex storage\n- Implementing authentication with Convex Auth\n- Designing Convex database schemas\n- Building chat applications or live dashboards\n- Creating applications with instant data sync\n- Implementing scheduled functions (crons)\n- Building backends without managing infrastructure\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Building realtime apps with Convex, implementing reactive queries, or managing backend logic with type-safe functions.\n- When working on related tasks or features\n- During development that requires this expertise\n\n**Use when**: Building realtime apps with Convex, implementing reactive queries, or managing backend logic with type-safe functions.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Queries (Read Data)\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\nimport { query } from ''./_generated/server'';\nimport { v } from ''convex/values'';\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {},\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    return await ctx.db.query(''users'').collect();\n  }\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { id: v.id(''users'') },\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.get(args.id);\n  }\n});\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### Mutations (Write Data)\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\nimport { mutation } from ''./_generated/server'';\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: { name: v.string(), email: v.string() },\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(''users'', args);\n  }\n});\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Resources\n- [Convex Docs](https://docs.convex.dev/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:17:57.337Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Real-time Collaborative Agents needing Convex backend integration for scalable and reactive data management.","zh":"非常适合需要Convex后端集成的实时协作代理，用于可扩展和响应式数据管理。","ja":"Convexバックエンド統合を必要とするリアルタイムコラボレーションエージェントに最適です。スケーラブルでリアクティブなデータ管理に使用します。","ko":"Convex 백엔드 통합이 필요한 실시간 협업 에이전트에 적합합니다. 확장 가능하고 반응형 데이터 관리를 위해 설계되었습니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Colaborativos en Tiempo Real que necesitan integración de backend Convex para una gestión de datos escalable y reactiva.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Collaboratifs en Temps Réel ayant besoin d''une intégration de backend Convex pour une gestion de données scalable et réactive.","de":"Perfekt für Echtzeit-Kollaborationsagenten, die eine Convex-Backend-Integration für eine skalierbare und reaktive Datenverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Colaborativos em Tempo Real que necessitam de integração de backend Convex para gerenciamento de dados escalável e reativo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов реального времени, сотрудничающих в режиме реального времени, требующих интеграции бэкенда Convex для масштабируемого и реактивного управления данными.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التعاونية في الوقت الحقيقي الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج Convex الخلفية للبيانات القابلة للتوسيع والإدارة الفعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build serverless backend functions with TypeScript, implement optimistic UI updates, and handle file uploads with Convex storage, leveraging Convex queries, mutations, and actions for seamless real-time collaboration and data synchronization over WebSocket protocols.","zh":"赋予代理构建无服务器后端函数、使用TypeScript实现乐观UI更新、处理文件上传使用Convex存储的能力，并利用Convex查询、变异和操作实现无缝的实时协作和数据同步，通过WebSocket协议实现。","ja":"エージェントがTypeScriptを使用してサーバーレスバックエンド関数を構築し、楽観的なUI更新を実装し、Convexストレージを使用してファイルのアップロードを処理し、Convexのクエリ、ミューテーション、アクションを利用してリアルタイムコラボレーションとデータの同期を実現することを可能にします。WebSocketプロトコルを介してシームレスに実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 TypeScript를 사용하여 서버리스 백엔드 함수를 구축하고, 낙관적인 UI 업데이트를 구현하며, Convex 스토리지를 사용하여 파일 업로드를 처리하고, Convex 쿼리, 뮤테이션, 액션을 활용하여 실시간 협업 및 데이터 동기화를 원활하게 수행하도록 합니다. WebSocket 프로토콜을 통해 원활하게 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir funciones de backend sin servidor con TypeScript, implementar actualizaciones de interfaz de usuario optimistas y manejar cargas de archivos con almacenamiento Convex, aprovechando las consultas, mutaciones y acciones de Convex para una colaboración en tiempo real y sincronización de datos sin problemas a través de protocolos WebSocket.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fonctions de backend sans serveur avec TypeScript, de mettre en œuvre des mises à jour d''interface utilisateur optimistes et de gérer les téléchargements de fichiers avec le stockage Convex, en exploitant les requêtes, mutations et actions Convex pour une collaboration en temps réel et une synchronisation de données sans problème via les protocoles WebSocket.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, serverlose Backend-Funktionen mit TypeScript zu erstellen, optimistische Benutzeroberflächen-Aktualisierungen zu implementieren und Datei-Uploads mit Convex-Speicherung zu verwalten, indem es Convex-Abfragen, -Mutationen und -Aktionen für eine nahtlose Echtzeit-Kollaboration und Daten-Synchronisierung über WebSocket-Protokolle nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir funções de backend sem servidor com TypeScript, implementar atualizações de UI otimistas e lidar com uploads de arquivos com armazenamento Convex, aproveitando consultas, mutações e ações Convex para colaboração em tempo real e sincronização de dados sem interrupção por meio de protocolos WebSocket.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать функции бэкенда без сервера с помощью TypeScript, реализовывать оптимистические обновления пользовательского интерфейса и обрабатывать загрузку файлов с помощью хранилища Convex, используя запросы, мутации и действия Convex для бесперебойного сотрудничества в реальном времени и синхронизации данных через протоколы WebSocket.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء وظائف الخلفية بدون خادم باستخدام TypeScript، وتنفيذ تحديثات واجهة المستخدم المتفائلة، ومعالجة تحميل الملفات باستخدام تخزين Convex، واستخدام استفسارات Convex والتحولات والافعال لتحقيق التعاون في الوقت الحقيقي وتناسق البيانات بشكل سلس عبر بروتوكولات WebSocket."},"useCases":{"en":["Building real-time collaborative applications with Convex database schemas","Implementing reactive data that auto-updates using Convex functions","Creating chat applications or live dashboards with Convex Auth for secure authentication"],"zh":["使用Convex数据库模式构建实时协作应用","使用Convex函数实现响应式数据的自动更新","使用Convex Auth实现安全认证的聊天应用或实时仪表盘"],"ja":["Convexデータベーススキーマを使用してリアルタイムコラボレーションアプリケーションを構築する","Convex関数を使用してリアクティブデータの自動更新を実装する","Convex Authを使用してセキュアな認証のチャットアプリケーションまたはリアルタイムダッシュボードを作成する"],"ko":["Convex 데이터베이스 스키마를 사용하여 실시간 협업 애플리케이션을 구축한다","Convex 함수를 사용하여 반응형 데이터의 자동 업데이트를 구현한다","Convex Auth를 사용하여 보안 인증聊天 애플리케이션 또는 실시간 대시보드를 생성한다"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones colaborativas en tiempo real con esquemas de base de datos Convex","Implementar datos reactivos que se actualizan automáticamente utilizando funciones Convex","Crear aplicaciones de chat o paneles de instrumentos en vivo con Convex Auth para una autenticación segura"],"fr":["Créer des applications collaboratives en temps réel avec des schémas de base de données Convex","Mettre en œuvre des données réactives qui se mettent à jour automatiquement à l''aide de fonctions Convex","Créer des applications de chat ou des tableaux de bord en temps réel avec Convex Auth pour une authentification sécurisée"],"de":["Erstellen von Echtzeit-Kollaborationsanwendungen mit Convex-Datenbank-Schemata","Implementieren reaktiver Daten, die automatisch mithilfe von Convex-Funktionen aktualisiert werden","Erstellen von Chat-Anwendungen oder Live-Dashboards mit Convex-Auth für eine sichere Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Construir aplicativos colaborativos em tempo real com esquemas de banco de dados Convex","Implementar dados reativos que se atualizam automaticamente usando funções Convex","Criar aplicativos de bate-papo ou painéis ao vivo com Convex Auth para autenticação segura"],"ru":["Создание приложений реального времени с помощью схем базы данных Convex","Реализация реактивных данных, которые автоматически обновляются с помощью функций Convex","Создание чат-приложений или живых панелей с помощью Convex Auth для безопасной аутентификации"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات تعاونية في الوقت الحقيقي باستخدام مخططات قاعدة بيانات Convex","تنفيذ بيانات تفاعلية تحديثها تلقائيًا باستخدام دوال Convex","إنشاء تطبيقات دردشة أو لوحات متحركة باستخدام Convex Auth لأغراض التحقق الآمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex account and project setup","Dependent on Convex storage for file handling","Optimized for TypeScript-based serverless functions"],"zh":["需要Convex账户和项目设置","依赖Convex存储用于文件处理","针对TypeScript的服务器无函数优化"],"ja":["Convexアカウントとプロジェクトの設定が必要","Convexストレージに依存してファイルハンドリングを行う","TypeScriptを使用したサーバーレス関数に最適化"],"ko":["Convex 계정 및 프로젝트 설정이 필요하다","Convex 스토리지에 의존하여 파일 처리를 수행한다","TypeScript를 사용한 서버리스 함수에 최적화됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de cuenta y proyecto Convex","Dependiente del almacenamiento Convex para el manejo de archivos","Optimizado para funciones serverless basadas en TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de compte et de projet Convex","Dépendant du stockage Convex pour la gestion des fichiers","Optimisé pour les fonctions sans serveur basées sur TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt eine Convex-Konten- und Projekt-Einrichtung","Abhängig von Convex-Speicherung für Dateihandling","Optimiert für TypeScript-basierte serverlose Funktionen"],"pt":["Exige configuração de conta e projeto Convex","Dependente do armazenamento Convex para manipulação de arquivos","Otimizado para funções sem servidor baseadas em TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует настройки учетной записи и проекта Convex","Зависит от хранилища Convex для обработки файлов","Оптимизирован для функций без сервера на основе TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد حساب و مشروع Convex","يعتمد على تخزين Convex لمعالجة الملفات","مُختبر لدوال بدون خادم dựa على TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/mobile-design', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front', 'mobile-design', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:18:22.496Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front/mobile-design","name":"mobile-design","description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种以用户体验为中心的设计方法，注重移动设备的独特约束和机遇。通过遵循核心原则和最佳实践，开发者可以创建高性能、用户友好的移动应用程序","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムは、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを中心に設計された方法で、モバイルデバイスの独自の制約と機会に焦点を当てています。核となる原則とベストプラクティスに従うことで、開発者は高パフォーマンスでユーザーに優しいモバイルアプリを作成できます","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 사용자 경험을 중심으로 설계된 방법으로 모바일 기기의 고유한 제약과 기회에 초점을 맞추고 있습니다. 핵심 원칙과 모바일 개발의 모범 사례를 따르면 개발자는 높은 성능과 사용자 친화적인 모바일 애플리케이션을 만들 수 있습니다","es":"El diseño móvil se centra en crear experiencias de usuario óptimas para dispositivos móviles, considerando restricciones y plataformas.","fr":"La conception mobile se concentre sur la création d''expériences utilisateur optimales pour les appareils mobiles, en tenant compte des contraintes et des plates-formes.","de":"Das mobile Design konzentriert sich auf die Erstellung optimaler Benutzererfahrungen für mobile Geräte, unter Berücksichtigung von Einschränkungen und Plattformen.","pt":"O desenvolvimento móvel é uma abordagem touch-first, battery-conscious e platform-respectful, com foco em offline-capable e mobile constraints","ru":"Мобильная разработка - это подход, ориентированный на сенсорный интерфейс, экономию батареи и уважение к платформе, с фокусом на offline-capable и мобильных ограничениях","ar":"تصميم الجوال هو نهج يركز على اللمس أولاً واهتمام بالبطارية والاحترام للمنصة، مع التركيز على القدرة على العمل بدون اتصال بالإنترنت وقيود الجوال","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"移动设计系统开发","ja":"モバイルデザインシステム開発","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템 개발","es":"Diseño Móvil: Principios y Mejores Prácticas","fr":"Conception Mobile: Principes et Bonnes Pratiques","de":"Mobile Design: Prinzipien und Best Practices","pt":"Desenvolvimento Móvel: Princípios e Ferramentas","ru":"Мобильная Разработка: Философия и Инструменты","ar":"تصميم الجوال: فلسفة وأدوات","en":"mobile-design"},"description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种以用户体验为中心的设计方法，注重移动设备的独特约束和机遇。通过遵循核心原则和最佳实践，开发者可以创建高性能、用户友好的移动应用程序","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムは、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを中心に設計された方法で、モバイルデバイスの独自の制約と機会に焦点を当てています。核となる原則とベストプラクティスに従うことで、開発者は高パフォーマンスでユーザーに優しいモバイルアプリを作成できます","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 사용자 경험을 중심으로 설계된 방법으로 모바일 기기의 고유한 제약과 기회에 초점을 맞추고 있습니다. 핵심 원칙과 모바일 개발의 모범 사례를 따르면 개발자는 높은 성능과 사용자 친화적인 모바일 애플리케이션을 만들 수 있습니다","es":"El diseño móvil se centra en crear experiencias de usuario óptimas para dispositivos móviles, considerando restricciones y plataformas.","fr":"La conception mobile se concentre sur la création d''expériences utilisateur optimales pour les appareils mobiles, en tenant compte des contraintes et des pla...","de":"Das mobile Design konzentriert sich auf die Erstellung optimaler Benutzererfahrungen für mobile Geräte, unter Berücksichtigung von Einschränkungen und Plattf...","pt":"O desenvolvimento móvel é uma abordagem touch-first, battery-conscious e platform-respectful, com foco em offline-capable e mobile constraints","ru":"Мобильная разработка - это подход, ориентированный на сенсорный интерфейс, экономию батареи и уважение к платформе, с фокусом на offline-capable и мобильных ...","ar":"تصميم الجوال هو نهج يركز على اللمس أولاً واهتمام بالبطارية والاحترام للمنصة، مع التركيز على القدرة على العمل بدون اتصال بالإنترنت وقيود الجوال","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["触摸优先的设计","电池寿命意识的设计","平台尊重的设计","离线能力的设计","移动UX和触摸审计脚本"],"ja":["タッチ優先の設計","バッテリー寿命意識の設計","プラットフォーム尊重の設計","オフライン能力の設計","モバイルUXとタッチ監査スクリプト"],"ko":["터치 우선의 디자인","배터리 수명의식 디자인","플랫폼 존중의 디자인","오프라인 기능의 디자인","모바일 UX 및 터치 감사 스크립트"],"es":["Diseño touch-first","Concientización de la batería","Respeto a la plataforma","Capacidad sin conexión","Validación de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Conception touch-first","Conscience de la batterie","Respect de la plate-forme","Capacité hors ligne","Validation de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Touch-first-Design","Batteriebewusstsein","Plattformrespekt","Offline-Fähigkeit","Validierung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Abordagem touch-first","Auditoria de UX e Touch","Scripts de validação","Foco em offline-capable","Respeito à plataforma"],"ru":["Ориентированный на сенсорный интерфейс подход","Аудит UX и сенсорного интерфейса","Скрипты валидации","Фокус на offline-capable","Уважение к платформе"],"ar":["النهج المعتمد على اللمس","تدقيق UX وواجهة اللمس","وسائل التحقق","التركيز على القدرة على العمل بدون اتصال بالإنترنت","الاحترام للمنصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动设计系统","移动应用程序开发","用户体验设计","移动UX","触摸优先设计","电池寿命意识设计","平台尊重设计","离线能力设计"],"ja":["モバイルデザインシステム","モバイルアプリ開発","ユーザーエクスペリエンス設計","モバイルUX","タッチ優先設計","バッテリー寿命意識設計","プラットフォーム尊重設計","オフライン能力設計"],"ko":["모바일 디자인 시스템","모바일 애플리케이션 개발","사용자 경험 디자인","모바일 UX","터치 우선 디자인","배터리 수명의식 디자인","플랫폼 존중 디자인","오프라인 기능 디자인"],"es":["diseño móvil","experiencia del usuario","dispositivos móviles","restricciones de diseño","plataformas móviles","validación de la UX"],"fr":["conception mobile","expérience utilisateur","appareils mobiles","contraintes de design","plates-formes mobiles","validation de l''UX"],"de":["mobiles Design","Benutzererfahrung","mobile Geräte","Design-Einschränkungen","mobile Plattformen","Validierung der UX"],"pt":["desenvolvimento móvel","auditoria de UX","scripts de validação","offline-capable","plataforma móvel","design de interface do usuário"],"ru":["мобильная разработка","аудит UX","скрипты валидации","offline-capable","мобильная платформа","дизайн интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["تصميم الجوال","تدقيق UX","وسائل التحقق","القدرة على العمل بدون اتصال بالإنترنت","منصة الجوال","تصميم واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-design","description":"Mobile-first design thinking and decision-making for iOS and Android apps. Touch interaction, performance patterns, platform conventions. Teaches principles, not fixed values. Use when building React Native, Flutter, or native mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference","body":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference Files Before Working!\n\n**⛔ DO NOT start development until you read the relevant files:**\n\n### Universal (Always Read)\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **[mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md)** | **⚠️ ANTI-MEMORIZATION: Forces thinking, prevents AI defaults** | **⬜ CRITICAL FIRST** |\n| **[touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)** | **Fitts'' Law, gestures, haptics, thumb zone** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)** | **RN/Flutter performance, 60fps, memory** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-backend.md](mobile-backend.md)** | **Push notifications, offline sync, mobile API** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-testing.md](mobile-testing.md)** | **Testing pyramid, E2E, platform-specific** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-debugging.md](mobile-debugging.md)** | **Native vs JS debugging, Flipper, Logcat** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Tab/Stack/Drawer, deep linking | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | System fonts, Dynamic Type, a11y | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED, dark mode, battery-aware | ⬜ Read |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework/state/storage selection | ⬜ Read |\n\n> 🧠 **mobile-design-thinking.md is PRIORITY!** This file ensures AI thinks instead of using memorized patterns.\n\n### Platform-Specific (Read Based on Target)\n\n| Platform | File | Content | When to Read |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| **iOS** | [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | Human Interface Guidelines, SF Pro, SwiftUI patterns | Building for iPhone/iPad |\n| **Android** | [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Material Design 3, Roboto, Compose patterns | Building for Android |\n| **Cross-Platform** | Both above | Platform divergence points | React Native / Flutter |\n\n> 🔴 **If building for iOS → Read platform-ios.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If building for Android → Read platform-android.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If cross-platform → Read BOTH and apply conditional platform logic!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: ASK BEFORE ASSUMING (MANDATORY)\n\n> **STOP! If the user''s request is open-ended, DO NOT default to your favorites.**\n\n### You MUST Ask If Not Specified:\n\n| Aspect | Ask | Why |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| **Platform** | \"iOS, Android, or both?\" | Affects EVERY design decision |\n| **Framework** | \"React Native, Flutter, or native?\" | Determines patterns and tools |\n| **Navigation** | \"Tab bar, drawer, or stack-based?\" | Core UX decision |\n| **State** | \"What state management? (Zustand/Redux/Riverpod/BLoC?)\" | Architecture foundation |\n| **Offline** | \"Does this need to work offline?\" | Affects data strategy |\n| **Target devices** | \"Phone only, or tablet support?\" | Layout complexity |\n\n### ⛔ AI MOBILE ANTI-PATTERNS (YASAK LİSTESİ)\n\n> 🚫 **These are AI default tendencies that MUST be avoided!**\n\n#### Performance Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **ScrollView for long lists** | Renders ALL items, memory explodes | Use `FlatList` / `FlashList` / `ListView.builder` |\n| **Inline renderItem function** | New function every render, all items re-render | `useCallback` + `React.memo` |\n| **Missing keyExtractor** | Index-based keys cause bugs on reorder | Unique, stable ID from data |\n| **Skip getItemLayout** | Async layout = janky scroll | Provide when items have fixed height |\n| **setState() everywhere** | Unnecessary widget rebuilds | Targeted state, `const` constructors |\n| **Native driver: false** | Animations blocked by JS thread | `useNativeDriver: true` always |\n| **console.log in production** | Blocks JS thread severely | Remove before release build |\n| **Skip React.memo/const** | Every item re-renders on any change | Memoize list items ALWAYS |\n\n#### Touch/UX Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Touch target < 44px** | Impossible to tap accurately, frustrating | Minimum 44pt (iOS) / 48dp (Android) |\n| **Spacing < 8px between targets** | Accidental taps on neighbors | Minimum 8-12px gap |\n| **Gesture-only interactions** | Motor impaired users excluded | Always provide button alternative |\n| **No loading state** | User thinks app crashed | ALWAYS show loading feedback |\n| **No error state** | User stuck, no recovery path | Show error with retry option |\n| **No offline handling** | Crash/block when network lost | Graceful degradation, cached data |\n| **Ignore platform conventions** | Users confused, muscle memory broken | iOS feels iOS, Android feels Android |\n\n#### Security Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Token in AsyncStorage** | Easily accessible, stolen on rooted device | `SecureStore` / `Keychain` / `EncryptedSharedPreferences` |\n| **Hardcode API keys** | Reverse engineered from APK/IPA | Environment variables, secure storage |\n| **Skip SSL pinning** | MITM attacks possible | Pin certificates in production |\n| **Log sensitive data** | Logs can be extracted | Never log tokens, passwords, PII |\n\n#### Architecture Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Business logic in UI** | Untestable, unmaintainable | Service layer separation |\n| **Global state for everything** | Unnecessary re-renders, complexity | Local state default, lift when needed |\n| **Deep linking as afterthought** | Notifications, shares broken | Plan deep links from day one |\n| **Skip dispose/cleanup** | Memory leaks, zombie listeners | Clean up subscriptions, timers |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Platform Decision Matrix\n\n### When to Unify vs Diverge\n\n```\n                    UNIFY (same on both)          DIVERGE (platform-specific)\n                    ───────────────────           ──────────────────────────\nBusiness Logic      ✅ Always                     -\nData Layer          ✅ Always                     -\nCore Features       ✅ Always                     -\n                    \nNavigation          -                             ✅ iOS: edge swipe, Android: back button\nGestures            -                             ✅ Platform-native feel\nIcons               -                             ✅ SF Symbols vs Material Icons\nDate Pickers        -                             ✅ Native pickers feel right\nModals/Sheets       -                             ✅ iOS: bottom sheet vs Android: dialog\nTypography          -                             ✅ SF Pro vs Roboto (or custom)\nError Dialogs       -                             ✅ Platform conventions for alerts\n```\n\n### Quick Reference: Platform Defaults\n\n| Element | iOS | Android |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |\n| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |\n| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |\n| **Bottom Tab Icons** | SF Symbols | Material Symbols |\n| **Action Sheet** | UIActionSheet from bottom | Bottom Sheet / Dialog |\n| **Progress** | Spinner | Linear progress (Material) |\n| **Pull to Refresh** | Native UIRefreshControl | SwipeRefreshLayout |\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Mobile UX Psychology (Quick Reference)\n\n### Fitts'' Law for Touch\n\n```\nDesktop: Cursor is precise (1px)\nMobile:  Finger is imprecise (~7mm contact area)\n\n→ Touch targets MUST be 44-48px minimum\n→ Important actions in THUMB ZONE (bottom of screen)\n→ Destructive actions AWAY from easy reach\n```\n\n### Thumb Zone (One-Handed Usage)\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│      HARD TO REACH          │ ← Navigation, menu, back\n│        (stretch)            │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      OK TO REACH            │ ← Secondary actions\n│       (natural)             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      EASY TO REACH          │ ← PRIMARY CTAs, tab bar\n│    (thumb''s natural arc)    │ ← Main content interaction\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n        [  HOME  ]\n```\n\n### Mobile-Specific Cognitive Load\n\n| Desktop | Mobile Difference |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| Multiple windows | ONE task at a time |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | Touch gestures |\n| Hover states | NO hover (tap or nothing) |\n| Large viewport | Limited space, scroll vertical |\n| Stable attention | Interrupted constantly |\n\nFor deep dive: [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Performance Principles (Quick Reference)\n\n### React Native Critical Rules\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoized renderItem + React.memo wrapper\nconst ListItem = React.memo(({ item }: { item: Item }) => (\n  <View style={styles.item}>\n    <Text>{item.title}</Text>\n  </View>\n));\n\nconst renderItem = useCallback(\n  ({ item }: { item: Item }) => <ListItem item={item} />,\n  []\n);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: FlatList with all optimizations\n<FlatList\n  data={items}\n  renderItem={renderItem}\n  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}  // Stable ID, NOT index\n  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({\n    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,\n    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,\n    index,\n  })}\n  removeClippedSubviews={true}\n  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}\n  windowSize={5}\n/>\n```\n\n### Flutter Critical Rules\n\n```dart\n// ✅ CORRECT: const constructors prevent rebuilds\nclass MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyWidget({super.key}); // CONST!\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return const Column( // CONST!\n      children: [\n        Text(''Static content''),\n        MyConstantWidget(),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Targeted state with ValueListenableBuilder\nValueListenableBuilder<int>(\n  valueListenable: counter,\n  builder: (context, value, child) => Text(''$value''),\n  child: const ExpensiveWidget(), // Won''t rebuild!\n)\n```\n\n### Animation Performance\n\n```\nGPU-accelerated (FAST):     CPU-bound (SLOW):\n├── transform               ├── width, height\n├── opacity                 ├── top, left, right, bottom\n└── (use these ONLY)        ├── margin, padding\n                            └── (AVOID animating these)\n```\n\nFor complete guide: [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📝 CHECKPOINT (MANDATORY Before Any Mobile Work)\n\n> **Before writing ANY mobile code, you MUST complete this checkpoint:**\n\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   [ iOS / Android / Both ]\nFramework:  [ React Native / Flutter / SwiftUI / Kotlin ]\nFiles Read: [ List the skill files you''ve read ]\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n3. _______________\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   iOS + Android (Cross-platform)\nFramework:  React Native + Expo\nFiles Read: touch-psychology.md, mobile-performance.md, platform-ios.md, platform-android.md\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. FlatList with React.memo + useCallback for all lists\n2. 48px touch targets, thumb zone for primary CTAs\n3. Platform-specific navigation (edge swipe iOS, back button Android)\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. ScrollView for lists → FlatList\n2. Inline renderItem → Memoized\n3. AsyncStorage for tokens → SecureStore\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Can''t fill the checkpoint? → GO BACK AND READ THE SKILL FILES.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Framework Decision Tree\n\n```\nWHAT ARE YOU BUILDING?\n        │\n        ├── Need OTA updates + rapid iteration + web team\n        │   └── ✅ React Native + Expo\n        │\n        ├── Need pixel-perfect custom UI + performance critical\n        │   └── ✅ Flutter\n        │\n        ├── Deep native features + single platform focus\n        │   ├── iOS only → SwiftUI\n        │   └── Android only → Kotlin + Jetpack Compose\n        │\n        ├── Existing RN codebase + new features\n        │   └── ✅ React Native (bare workflow)\n        │\n        └── Enterprise + existing Flutter codebase\n            └── ✅ Flutter\n```\n\nFor complete decision trees: [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Pre-Development Checklist\n\n### Before Starting ANY Mobile Project\n\n- [ ] **Platform confirmed?** (iOS / Android / Both)\n- [ ] **Framework chosen?** (RN / Flutter / Native)\n- [ ] **Navigation pattern decided?** (Tabs / Stack / Drawer)\n- [ ] **State management selected?** (Zustand / Redux / Riverpod / BLoC)\n- [ ] **Offline requirements known?**\n- [ ] **Deep linking planned from day one?**\n- [ ] **Target devices defined?** (Phone / Tablet / Both)\n\n### Before Every Screen\n\n- [ ] **Touch targets ≥ 44-48px?**\n- [ ] **Primary CTA in thumb zone?**\n- [ ] **Loading state exists?**\n- [ ] **Error state with retry exists?**\n- [ ] **Offline handling considered?**\n- [ ] **Platform conventions followed?**\n\n### Before Release\n\n- [ ] **console.log removed?**\n- [ ] **SecureStore for sensitive data?**\n- [ ] **SSL pinning enabled?**\n- [ ] **Lists optimized (memo, keyExtractor)?**\n- [ ] **Memory cleanup on unmount?**\n- [ ] **Tested on low-end devices?**\n- [ ] **Accessibility labels on all interactive elements?**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Reference Files\n\nFor deeper guidance on specific areas:\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| [mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md) | **FIRST! Anti-memorization, forces context-based thinking** |\n| [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md) | Understanding touch interaction, Fitts'' Law, gesture design |\n| [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md) | Optimizing RN/Flutter, 60fps, memory/battery |\n| [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | iOS-specific design, HIG compliance |\n| [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Android-specific design, Material Design 3 |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Navigation patterns, deep linking |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | Type scale, system fonts, accessibility |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED optimization, dark mode, battery |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework, state, storage decisions |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile users are impatient, interrupted, and using imprecise fingers on small screens. Design for the WORST conditions: bad network, one hand, bright sun, low battery. If it works there, it works everywhere.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:18:22.496Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing touch-first, mobile-optimized design principles.","zh":"适用于需要触摸优先、移动优化设计原则的 UI/UX 代理。","ja":"UI/UX エージェントがタッチファースト、モバイル最適化されたデザイン原則を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"터치 우선, 모바일 최적화된 디자인 원칙이 필요한 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan principios de diseño de primera interacción con el usuario y optimizados para móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX ayant besoin de principes de conception de première interaction avec l''utilisateur et optimisés pour les appareils mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agenten, die touch-first- und mobile-optimierte Designprinzipien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de UI/UX que necessitam de princípios de design otimizados para toque e móveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов UI/UX, требующих принципов дизайна, оптимизированных для сенсорных и мобильных устройств.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم / الخبرة التي تحتاج إلى مبادئ تصميم أولية لللمس وأجهزة الجوال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create platform-respectful, offline-capable, and battery-conscious mobile designs using Python scripts like mobile_audit.py for validation, ensuring a seamless user experience across various mobile platforms.","zh":"赋予代理创建平台尊重、离线功能和电池意识的移动设计的能力，使用 Python 脚本（如 mobile_audit.py）进行验证，确保在各个移动平台上提供无缝的用户体验。","ja":"エージェントがプラットフォームを尊重したオフライン対応のバッテリーに優しいモバイルデザインを作成する能力を与え、mobile_audit.py などの Python スクリプトを使用して検証し、さまざまなモバイルプラットフォームでシームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 플랫폼을尊重하고 오프라인 기능 및 배터리 인식이 가능한 모바일 디자인을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며 mobile_audit.py와 같은 Python 스크립트를 사용하여 검증하여 다양한 모바일 플랫폼에서 무결점의 사용자 경험을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear diseños móviles respetuosos con la plataforma, capaces de funcionar sin conexión y conscientes de la batería, utilizando scripts de Python como mobile_audit.py para la validación, garantizando una experiencia de usuario sin interrupciones en varias plataformas móviles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions mobiles respectueuses de la plate-forme, capables de fonctionner hors ligne et économes en batterie, en utilisant des scripts Python tels que mobile_audit.py pour la validation, garantissant une expérience utilisateur fluide sur diverses plateformes mobiles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, plattformrespektive, offline-fähige und batteriebewusste Mobile-Designs zu erstellen, indem Python-Skripte wie mobile_audit.py für die Validierung verwendet werden, um so eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung auf verschiedenen mobilen Plattformen zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem designs móveis respeitosos com a plataforma, capazes de funcionar offline e conscientes da bateria, utilizando scripts Python como mobile_audit.py para validação, garantindo uma experiência de usuário sem interrupções em várias plataformas móveis.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать мобильные дизайны, уважающие платформу, способные работать автономно и экономить батарею, используя скрипты Python, такие как mobile_audit.py для проверки, обеспечивая бесперебойный пользовательский опыт на различных мобильных платформах.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء تصاميم جوّالة محترمة للمنصة وقادرة على العمل بدون اتصال وواعية لاستهلاك البطارية، باستخدام نصوص برمجة بايثون مثل mobile_audit.py للتحقق، مما يضمن تجربة مستخدم بدون انقطاع عبر منصات جوّالة متعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating mobile UX and touch interactions","Auditing mobile applications for platform-specific design","Generating mobile design systems with Python"],"zh":["验证移动 UX 和触摸交互","审计移动应用程序的平台特定设计","使用 Python 生成移动设计系统"],"ja":["モバイル UX とタッチのインタラクションを検証する","モバイル アプリケーションのプラットフォーム固有のデザインを監査する","Python を使用してモバイル デザイン システムを生成する"],"ko":["모바일 UX 및 터치 상호작용을 검증하는 것","모바일 애플리케이션의 플랫폼별 디자인을 감사하는 것","Python을 사용하여 모바일 디자인 시스템을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Validar la experiencia de usuario móvil y las interacciones táctiles","Auditar aplicaciones móviles para el diseño específico de la plataforma","Generar sistemas de diseño móvil con Python"],"fr":["Valider l''expérience utilisateur mobile et les interactions tactiles","Auditer les applications mobiles pour la conception spécifique à la plate-forme","Générer des systèmes de conception mobile avec Python"],"de":["Überprüfen der mobilen Benutzeroberfläche und der Touch-Interaktionen","Auditing von Mobile-Anwendungen für plattformspezifisches Design","Generieren von Mobile-Design-Systemen mit Python"],"pt":["Validar a experiência do usuário móvel e interações por toque","Auditar aplicações móveis para design específico da plataforma","Gerar sistemas de design móvel com Python"],"ru":["Проверка мобильного пользовательского опыта и сенсорных взаимодействий","Аудит мобильных приложений для платформо-специфичного дизайна","Генерация мобильных систем дизайна с помощью Python"],"ar":["التحقق من تجربة المستخدم الجوال وتفاعلات اللمس","مراجعة التطبيقات الجوالة لتصميم محدد بالمنصة","توليد أنظمة تصميم جوّال باستخدام بايثون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment for script execution","Focused on mobile design principles, not desktop or web"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境来执行脚本","专注于移动设计原则，而不是桌面或 web"],"ja":["スクリプトの実行には Python 環境が必要","モバイル デザイン原則に焦点を当て、デスクトップや Web ではありません"],"ko":["스크립트 실행을 위해 Python 환경이 필요하다","모바일 디자인 원칙에 중점을 둔 것인 반면, 데스크톱이나 웹은 아님"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python para la ejecución de scripts","Se centra en los principios de diseño móvil, no en escritorio o web"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python pour l''exécution de scripts","Se concentre sur les principes de conception mobile, et non sur le bureau ou le web"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung für die Skriptausführung","Konzentriert sich auf die Prinzipien des mobilen Designs, nicht auf Desktop oder Web"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python para execução de scripts","Focado em princípios de design móvel, não em desktop ou web"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python для выполнения скриптов","Ориентирован на принципы мобильного дизайна, а не на настольные или веб-приложения"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون لتشغيل البرامج النصية","مركز على مبادئ تصميم الجوال، وليس سطح المكتب أو الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('creation22/remotion_video/remotion-best-practices', 'community', 'creation22', 'remotion_video', 'creation22/remotion_video', 'remotion-best-practices', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:19:09.587Z', NULL, '{"id":"creation22/remotion_video/remotion-best-practices","name":"remotion-best-practices","description":{"es":"Remotion es una herramienta para crear videos y animaciones. Estas mejores prácticas te ayudarán a dominar su uso.","fr":"Remotion est un outil pour créer des vidéos et des animations. Ces bonnes pratiques vous aideront à maîtriser son utilisation.","de":"Remotion ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von Videos und Animationen. Diese Best Practices helfen Ihnen, seine Verwendung zu meistern.","pt":"Remotion é uma ferramenta poderosa para criar conteúdo de vídeo personalizado. Aprenda as melhores práticas para trabalhar com Remotion","ru":"Remotion - это мощный инструмент для создания индивидуального видеоконтента. Узнайте лучшие практики работы с Remotion","ar":"ريموشن هي أداة قوية لإنشاء محتوى فيديو مخصص. تعلم أفضل الممارسات لاستخدام ريموشن","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Mejores prácticas de Remotion","fr":"Bonnes pratiques de Remotion","de":"Remotion Best Practices","pt":"Melhores Práticas de Remotion","ru":"Лучшие практики Remotion","ar":"أفضل الممارسات لريموشن","en":"remotion-best-practices"},"description":{"es":"Remotion es una herramienta para crear videos y animaciones. Estas mejores prácticas te ayudarán a dominar su uso.","fr":"Remotion est un outil pour créer des vidéos et des animations. Ces bonnes pratiques vous aideront à maîtriser son utilisation.","de":"Remotion ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von Videos und Animationen. Diese Best Practices helfen Ihnen, seine Verwendung zu meistern.","pt":"Remotion é uma ferramenta poderosa para criar conteúdo de vídeo personalizado. Aprenda as melhores práticas para trabalhar com Remotion","ru":"Remotion - это мощный инструмент для создания индивидуального видеоконтента. Узнайте лучшие практики работы с Remotion","ar":"ريموشن هي أداة قوية لإنشاء محتوى فيديو مخصص. تعلم أفضل الممارسات لاستخدام ريموشن","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Creación de contenido 3D con Three.js y React Three Fiber","Animaciones fundamentales para Remotion","Importación de imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes","Uso de audio en Remotion"," Mejores prácticas para el desarrollo de video y animaciones"],"fr":["Création de contenu 3D avec Three.js et React Three Fiber","Animations fondamentales pour Remotion","Importation d''images, de vidéos, d''audio et de polices","Utilisation de l''audio dans Remotion","Bonnes pratiques pour le développement de vidéo et d''animations"],"de":["Erstellung von 3D-Inhalten mit Three.js und React Three Fiber","Grundlegende Animationen für Remotion","Importieren von Bildern, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten","Verwendung von Audio in Remotion","Best Practices für die Entwicklung von Video und Animationen"],"pt":["Crie conteúdo 3D com Three.js e React Three Fiber","Desenvolva habilidades fundamentais de animação","Importe imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes para Remotion","Aprenda a usar áudio em Remotion","Entenda as regras de Remotion para melhorar seu workflow"],"ru":["Создавайте 3D-контент с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber","Разрабатывайте основные навыки анимации","Импортируйте изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты в Remotion","Узнайте, как использовать аудио в Remotion","Поймите правила Remotion, чтобы улучшить свой рабочий процесс"],"ar":["انشئ محتوى 3D باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","طور مهارات أساسية للرسوم المتحركة","استورد الصور و الفيديوهات و الصوت و الخطوط إلى ريموشن","تعلم كيفية استخدام الصوت في ريموشن","افهم قواعد ريموشن لتحسين سير العمل"]},"keywords":{"es":["Remotion","desarrollo de video","animaciones","Three.js","React Three Fiber","mejores prácticas","creación de contenido 3D","importación de activos"],"fr":["Remotion","développement de vidéo","animations","Three.js","React Three Fiber","bonnes pratiques","création de contenu 3D","importation de ressources"],"de":["Remotion","Videoentwicklung","Animationen","Three.js","React Three Fiber","Best Practices","Erstellung von 3D-Inhalten","Importieren von Ressourcen"],"pt":["Remotion","melhores práticas","desenvolvimento de vídeo","Three.js","React Three Fiber","animação","áudio","importação de ativos"],"ru":["Remotion","лучшие практики","разработка видео","Three.js","React Three Fiber","анимация","аудио","импорт активов"],"ar":["ريموشن","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير الفيديو","Three.js","React Three Fiber","الرسوم المتحركة","الصوت","استيراد الأصول"]}},"owner":"creation22","repo":"remotion_video","repoPath":"creation22/remotion_video","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:19:09.587Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing advanced Remotion capabilities with Three.js and React Three Fiber","zh":"非常适合需要使用Three.js和React Three Fiber的高级Remotion功能的视频生成代理","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberの高度なRemotion機能を必要とするビデオ生成エージェントに最適","ko":"Three.js와 React Three Fiber의 고급 Remotion 기능이 필요한 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de video que necesitan capacidades de Remotion avanzadas con Three.js y React Three Fiber","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de vidéos nécessitant des fonctionnalités Remotion avancées avec Three.js et React Three Fiber","de":"Perfekt für Video-Generierungsagenten, die erweiterte Remotion-Funktionen mit Three.js und React Three Fiber benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de Remotion com Three.js e React Three Fiber","ru":"Идеально для агентов видеогенерации, которым необходимы расширенные возможности Remotion с Three.js и React Three Fiber","ar":"مثالي لعميل توليد الفيديو الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة من Remotion مع Three.js و React Three Fiber"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex 3D content, fundamental animations, and manage various assets such as images, videos, audio, and fonts within Remotion projects, leveraging libraries like Three.js and React Three Fiber for enhanced visuals","zh":"赋予代理创建复杂的3D内容、基本动画和管理各种资产（如图像、视频、音频和字体）在Remotion项目中的能力，利用Three.js和React Three Fiber等库增强视觉效果","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberなどのライブラリを利用して視覚効果を高め、エージェントが複雑な3Dコンテンツ、基本的なアニメーション、Remotionプロジェクト内の画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどのさまざまな資産を作成、管理する機能を提供する","ko":"Three.js와 React Three Fiber 등의 라이브러리를 활용하여 시각적 효과를 강화하고, 에이전트가 복잡한 3D 콘텐츠, 기본 애니메이션 및 Remotion 프로젝트 내의 이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 글꼴 등의 다양한 자산을 생성 및 관리할 수 있는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear contenido 3D complejo, animaciones fundamentales y gestionar varios activos como imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes dentro de proyectos Remotion, aprovechando bibliotecas como Three.js y React Three Fiber para mejoras visuales","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu 3D complexe, des animations fondamentales et de gérer divers actifs tels que des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices au sein de projets Remotion, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme Three.js et React Three Fiber pour améliorer les visuels","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexen 3D-Inhalt, grundlegende Animationen und verschiedene Assets wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriften innerhalb von Remotion-Projekten zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem Bibliotheken wie Three.js und React Three Fiber für verbesserte visuelle Effekte genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo 3D complexo, animações fundamentais e gerenciar vários ativos, como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes dentro de projetos Remotion, aproveitando bibliotecas como Three.js e React Three Fiber para visuais aprimoradas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложный 3D-контент, фундаментальные анимации и управлять различными активами, такими как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты внутри проектов Remotion, используя библиотеки, такие как Three.js и React Three Fiber для улучшенной визуализации","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إنشاء محتوى 3D معقد ورسوم متحركة أساسية وإدارة أصول متعددة مثل الصور والفيديو والصوت والخطوط داخل مشاريع Remotion، واستخدام مكتبات مثل Three.js و React Three Fiber لتحسين العرض"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations for explainer videos","Optimizing video asset imports for faster rendering","Creating interactive audio-visual experiences with Remotion"],"zh":["为解释性视频生成3D动画","优化视频资产导入以实现更快的渲染","使用Remotion创建交互式音频-视觉体验"],"ja":["解説動画用の3Dアニメーションを生成する","ビデオアセットのインポートを最適化してレンダリングを高速化する","Remotionを使用してインタラクティブなオーディオ-ビジュアル体験を作成する"],"ko":["설명 비디오용 3D 애니메이션 생성","비디오 자산 가져오기를 최적화하여 렌더링 속도 향상","Remotion을 사용하여 상호작용형 오디오-시각적 경험 생성"],"es":["Generar animaciones 3D para vídeos explicativos","Optimizar la importación de activos de video para un renderizado más rápido","Crear experiencias audiovisuales interactivas con Remotion"],"fr":["Générer des animations 3D pour des vidéos explicatives","Optimiser l''importation d''actifs vidéo pour un rendu plus rapide","Créer des expériences audiovisuelles interactives avec Remotion"],"de":["Erzeugen von 3D-Animationen für Erklärvideos","Optimieren des Video-Asset-Imports für ein schnelleres Rendern","Erstellen interaktiver audiovisueller Erfahrungen mit Remotion"],"pt":["Gerar animações 3D para vídeos explicativos","Otimizar a importação de ativos de vídeo para renderização mais rápida","Criar experiências interativas de áudio e vídeo com Remotion"],"ru":["Генерировать 3D-анимации для экспликационных видео","Оптимизировать импорт видеоактивов для более быстрого рендеринга","Создавать интерактивные аудио-визуальные trải nghiệm с Remotion"],"ar":["توليد رسوم متحركة 3D لفيديوهات توضيحية","تحسين استيراد أصول الفيديو من أجل تقديم أسرع","إنشاء تجارب صوتية وبصرية تفاعلية مع Remotion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Limited to Remotion-specific use cases","Familiarity with Three.js and React Three Fiber recommended"],"zh":["需要访问Remotion代码库","仅限Remotion特定用例","建议熟悉Three.js和React Three Fiber"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Remotion特有のユースケースに限定される","Three.jsとReact Three Fiberの知識が推奨される"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","Remotion 전용 사용 사례로 제한","Three.js 및 React Three Fiber에 대한 지식이 권장"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código base de Remotion","Limitado a casos de uso específicos de Remotion","Se recomienda familiaridad con Three.js y React Three Fiber"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code base de Remotion","Limité à des cas d''utilisation spécifiques à Remotion","Il est recommandé d''avoir des connaissances en Three.js et React Three Fiber"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebase","Begrenzt auf Remotion-spezifische Anwendungsfälle","Kenntnisse von Three.js und React Three Fiber werden empfohlen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código base Remotion","Limitado a casos de uso específicos do Remotion","Recomenda-se familiaridade com Three.js e React Three Fiber"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кодовой базе Remotion","Ограничен до случаев использования Remotion","Рекомендуется знание Three.js и React Three Fiber"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة رمز Remotion","محدود لケース استخدام Remotion","ينصح بالمعرفة ب Three.js و React Three Fiber"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/mobile-design', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'IzaCenter', 'claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter', 'mobile-design', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:18:42.351Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/mobile-design","name":"mobile-design","description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种以用户体验为中心的设计方法，强调触摸优先、电池节能和平台尊重","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムはユーザーエクスペリエンスを中心とした設計方法であり、タッチ優先、バッテリー節約、プラットフォーム尊重を強調する","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 사용자 경험을 중심으로 하는 디자인 방법으로, 터치 우선, 배터리節約, 플랫폼尊重을 강조","es":"Nuestro sistema de diseño móvil se centra en la filosofía de ''primero el tacto'', considerando las limitaciones y capacidades de los dispositivos móviles.","fr":"Notre système de conception mobile repose sur la philosophie ''touch-first'', en tenant compte des contraintes et des capacités des appareils mobiles.","de":"Unser Mobiles Design-System basiert auf der Philosophie ''erst das Berühren'', wobei die Einschränkungen und Fähigkeiten mobiler Geräte berücksichtigt werden.","pt":"O design móvel é uma abordagem de desenvolvimento que prioriza a experiência do usuário em dispositivos móveis, considerando restrições e oportunidades únicas","ru":"Мобильный дизайн - это подход к разработке, который отдает приоритет опыту пользователя на мобильных устройствах, учитывая уникальные ограничения и возможности","ar":"تصميم الجوال هو نهج لتطوير يPrioritize تجربة المستخدم على أجهزة الجوال، مع الأخذ في الاعتبار القيود والفرص الفريدة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"移动设计系统开发","ja":"モバイルデザインシステム開発","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템 개발","es":"Diseño Móvil Eficiente","fr":"Conception Mobile Optimale","de":"Effizientes Mobiles Design","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Design Móvel","ru":"Мобильный дизайн системы","ar":"تصميم الجوال الشامل","en":"mobile-design"},"description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种以用户体验为中心的设计方法，强调触摸优先、电池节能和平台尊重","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムはユーザーエクスペリエンスを中心とした設計方法であり、タッチ優先、バッテリー節約、プラットフォーム尊重を強調する","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 사용자 경험을 중심으로 하는 디자인 방법으로, 터치 우선, 배터리節約, 플랫폼尊重을 강조","es":"Nuestro sistema de diseño móvil se centra en la filosofía de ''primero el tacto'', considerando las limitaciones y capacidades de los dispositivos móviles.","fr":"Notre système de conception mobile repose sur la philosophie ''touch-first'', en tenant compte des contraintes et des capacités des appareils mobiles.","de":"Unser Mobiles Design-System basiert auf der Philosophie ''erst das Berühren'', wobei die Einschränkungen und Fähigkeiten mobiler Geräte berücksichtigt werden.","pt":"O design móvel é uma abordagem de desenvolvimento que prioriza a experiência do usuário em dispositivos móveis, considerando restrições e oportunidades únicas","ru":"Мобильный дизайн - это подход к разработке, который отдает приоритет опыту пользователя на мобильных устройствах, учитывая уникальные ограничения и возможности","ar":"تصميم الجوال هو نهج لتطوير يPrioritize تجربة المستخدم على أجهزة الجوال، مع الأخذ في الاعتبار القيود والفرص الفريدة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["触摸优先设计","电池节能","平台尊重","离线能力","移动设备优化"],"ja":["タッチ優先設計","バッテリー節約","プラットフォーム尊重","オフライン対応","モバイル機器最適化"],"ko":["터치 우선 디자인","배터리節約","플랫폼尊重","오프라인 능력","모바일 기기 최적화"],"es":["Diseño táctil","Eficiencia de batería","Respeto a la plataforma","Capacidad sin conexión","Análisis de UX"],"fr":["Conception tactile","Efficacité de la batterie","Respect de la plateforme","Capacité hors ligne","Analyse de l''UX"],"de":["Touch-Design","Batterieeffizienz","Plattform-Respekt","Offline-Fähigkeit","UX-Analyse"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de UX móvel","Considerações de plataforma","Otimização de bateria","Suporte offline","Execução de scripts de validação"],"ru":["Разработка мобильного UX","Учет платформы","Оптимизация батареи","Поддержка offline","Выполнение скриптов проверки"],"ar":["تطوير تجربة المستخدم الجوال","الاعتبارات الخاصة بالمنصة","تحسين البطارية","دعم عدم الاتصال","تشغيل سكريبتات التحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动设计","触摸优先","电池节能","平台尊重","移动开发","用户体验"],"ja":["モバイルデザイン","タッチ優先","バッテリー節約","プラットフォーム尊重","モバイル開発","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["모바일 디자인","터치 우선","배터리節約","플랫폼尊重","모바일 개발","사용자 경험"],"es":["diseño móvil","experiencia del usuario","eficiencia de batería","dispositivos móviles","sistemas de diseño","desarrollo móvil"],"fr":["conception mobile","expérience utilisateur","efficacité de la batterie","appareils mobiles","systèmes de conception","développement mobile"],"de":["Mobiles Design","Benutzererfahrung","Batterieeffizienz","mobile Geräte","Design-Systeme","mobile Entwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de design móvel","ux móvel","considerações de plataforma","otimização de bateria","suporte offline","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["мобильный дизайн системы","мобильный UX","соображения платформы","оптимизация батареи","поддержка offline","разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["تصميم الجوال الشامل","تجربة المستخدم الجوال","اعتبارات المنصة","تحسين البطارية","دعم عدم الاتصال","تطوير تطبيقات الجوال"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-design","description":"Mobile-first design thinking and decision-making for iOS and Android apps. Touch interaction, performance patterns, platform conventions. Teaches principles, not fixed values. Use when building React Native, Flutter, or native mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference","body":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference Files Before Working!\n\n**⛔ DO NOT start development until you read the relevant files:**\n\n### Universal (Always Read)\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **[mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md)** | **⚠️ ANTI-MEMORIZATION: Forces thinking, prevents AI defaults** | **⬜ CRITICAL FIRST** |\n| **[touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)** | **Fitts'' Law, gestures, haptics, thumb zone** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)** | **RN/Flutter performance, 60fps, memory** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-backend.md](mobile-backend.md)** | **Push notifications, offline sync, mobile API** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-testing.md](mobile-testing.md)** | **Testing pyramid, E2E, platform-specific** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-debugging.md](mobile-debugging.md)** | **Native vs JS debugging, Flipper, Logcat** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Tab/Stack/Drawer, deep linking | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | System fonts, Dynamic Type, a11y | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED, dark mode, battery-aware | ⬜ Read |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework/state/storage selection | ⬜ Read |\n\n> 🧠 **mobile-design-thinking.md is PRIORITY!** This file ensures AI thinks instead of using memorized patterns.\n\n### Platform-Specific (Read Based on Target)\n\n| Platform | File | Content | When to Read |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| **iOS** | [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | Human Interface Guidelines, SF Pro, SwiftUI patterns | Building for iPhone/iPad |\n| **Android** | [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Material Design 3, Roboto, Compose patterns | Building for Android |\n| **Cross-Platform** | Both above | Platform divergence points | React Native / Flutter |\n\n> 🔴 **If building for iOS → Read platform-ios.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If building for Android → Read platform-android.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If cross-platform → Read BOTH and apply conditional platform logic!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: ASK BEFORE ASSUMING (MANDATORY)\n\n> **STOP! If the user''s request is open-ended, DO NOT default to your favorites.**\n\n### You MUST Ask If Not Specified:\n\n| Aspect | Ask | Why |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| **Platform** | \"iOS, Android, or both?\" | Affects EVERY design decision |\n| **Framework** | \"React Native, Flutter, or native?\" | Determines patterns and tools |\n| **Navigation** | \"Tab bar, drawer, or stack-based?\" | Core UX decision |\n| **State** | \"What state management? (Zustand/Redux/Riverpod/BLoC?)\" | Architecture foundation |\n| **Offline** | \"Does this need to work offline?\" | Affects data strategy |\n| **Target devices** | \"Phone only, or tablet support?\" | Layout complexity |\n\n### ⛔ AI MOBILE ANTI-PATTERNS (YASAK LİSTESİ)\n\n> 🚫 **These are AI default tendencies that MUST be avoided!**\n\n#### Performance Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **ScrollView for long lists** | Renders ALL items, memory explodes | Use `FlatList` / `FlashList` / `ListView.builder` |\n| **Inline renderItem function** | New function every render, all items re-render | `useCallback` + `React.memo` |\n| **Missing keyExtractor** | Index-based keys cause bugs on reorder | Unique, stable ID from data |\n| **Skip getItemLayout** | Async layout = janky scroll | Provide when items have fixed height |\n| **setState() everywhere** | Unnecessary widget rebuilds | Targeted state, `const` constructors |\n| **Native driver: false** | Animations blocked by JS thread | `useNativeDriver: true` always |\n| **console.log in production** | Blocks JS thread severely | Remove before release build |\n| **Skip React.memo/const** | Every item re-renders on any change | Memoize list items ALWAYS |\n\n#### Touch/UX Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Touch target < 44px** | Impossible to tap accurately, frustrating | Minimum 44pt (iOS) / 48dp (Android) |\n| **Spacing < 8px between targets** | Accidental taps on neighbors | Minimum 8-12px gap |\n| **Gesture-only interactions** | Motor impaired users excluded | Always provide button alternative |\n| **No loading state** | User thinks app crashed | ALWAYS show loading feedback |\n| **No error state** | User stuck, no recovery path | Show error with retry option |\n| **No offline handling** | Crash/block when network lost | Graceful degradation, cached data |\n| **Ignore platform conventions** | Users confused, muscle memory broken | iOS feels iOS, Android feels Android |\n\n#### Security Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Token in AsyncStorage** | Easily accessible, stolen on rooted device | `SecureStore` / `Keychain` / `EncryptedSharedPreferences` |\n| **Hardcode API keys** | Reverse engineered from APK/IPA | Environment variables, secure storage |\n| **Skip SSL pinning** | MITM attacks possible | Pin certificates in production |\n| **Log sensitive data** | Logs can be extracted | Never log tokens, passwords, PII |\n\n#### Architecture Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Business logic in UI** | Untestable, unmaintainable | Service layer separation |\n| **Global state for everything** | Unnecessary re-renders, complexity | Local state default, lift when needed |\n| **Deep linking as afterthought** | Notifications, shares broken | Plan deep links from day one |\n| **Skip dispose/cleanup** | Memory leaks, zombie listeners | Clean up subscriptions, timers |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Platform Decision Matrix\n\n### When to Unify vs Diverge\n\n```\n                    UNIFY (same on both)          DIVERGE (platform-specific)\n                    ───────────────────           ──────────────────────────\nBusiness Logic      ✅ Always                     -\nData Layer          ✅ Always                     -\nCore Features       ✅ Always                     -\n                    \nNavigation          -                             ✅ iOS: edge swipe, Android: back button\nGestures            -                             ✅ Platform-native feel\nIcons               -                             ✅ SF Symbols vs Material Icons\nDate Pickers        -                             ✅ Native pickers feel right\nModals/Sheets       -                             ✅ iOS: bottom sheet vs Android: dialog\nTypography          -                             ✅ SF Pro vs Roboto (or custom)\nError Dialogs       -                             ✅ Platform conventions for alerts\n```\n\n### Quick Reference: Platform Defaults\n\n| Element | iOS | Android |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |\n| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |\n| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |\n| **Bottom Tab Icons** | SF Symbols | Material Symbols |\n| **Action Sheet** | UIActionSheet from bottom | Bottom Sheet / Dialog |\n| **Progress** | Spinner | Linear progress (Material) |\n| **Pull to Refresh** | Native UIRefreshControl | SwipeRefreshLayout |\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Mobile UX Psychology (Quick Reference)\n\n### Fitts'' Law for Touch\n\n```\nDesktop: Cursor is precise (1px)\nMobile:  Finger is imprecise (~7mm contact area)\n\n→ Touch targets MUST be 44-48px minimum\n→ Important actions in THUMB ZONE (bottom of screen)\n→ Destructive actions AWAY from easy reach\n```\n\n### Thumb Zone (One-Handed Usage)\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│      HARD TO REACH          │ ← Navigation, menu, back\n│        (stretch)            │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      OK TO REACH            │ ← Secondary actions\n│       (natural)             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      EASY TO REACH          │ ← PRIMARY CTAs, tab bar\n│    (thumb''s natural arc)    │ ← Main content interaction\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n        [  HOME  ]\n```\n\n### Mobile-Specific Cognitive Load\n\n| Desktop | Mobile Difference |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| Multiple windows | ONE task at a time |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | Touch gestures |\n| Hover states | NO hover (tap or nothing) |\n| Large viewport | Limited space, scroll vertical |\n| Stable attention | Interrupted constantly |\n\nFor deep dive: [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Performance Principles (Quick Reference)\n\n### React Native Critical Rules\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoized renderItem + React.memo wrapper\nconst ListItem = React.memo(({ item }: { item: Item }) => (\n  <View style={styles.item}>\n    <Text>{item.title}</Text>\n  </View>\n));\n\nconst renderItem = useCallback(\n  ({ item }: { item: Item }) => <ListItem item={item} />,\n  []\n);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: FlatList with all optimizations\n<FlatList\n  data={items}\n  renderItem={renderItem}\n  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}  // Stable ID, NOT index\n  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({\n    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,\n    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,\n    index,\n  })}\n  removeClippedSubviews={true}\n  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}\n  windowSize={5}\n/>\n```\n\n### Flutter Critical Rules\n\n```dart\n// ✅ CORRECT: const constructors prevent rebuilds\nclass MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyWidget({super.key}); // CONST!\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return const Column( // CONST!\n      children: [\n        Text(''Static content''),\n        MyConstantWidget(),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Targeted state with ValueListenableBuilder\nValueListenableBuilder<int>(\n  valueListenable: counter,\n  builder: (context, value, child) => Text(''$value''),\n  child: const ExpensiveWidget(), // Won''t rebuild!\n)\n```\n\n### Animation Performance\n\n```\nGPU-accelerated (FAST):     CPU-bound (SLOW):\n├── transform               ├── width, height\n├── opacity                 ├── top, left, right, bottom\n└── (use these ONLY)        ├── margin, padding\n                            └── (AVOID animating these)\n```\n\nFor complete guide: [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📝 CHECKPOINT (MANDATORY Before Any Mobile Work)\n\n> **Before writing ANY mobile code, you MUST complete this checkpoint:**\n\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   [ iOS / Android / Both ]\nFramework:  [ React Native / Flutter / SwiftUI / Kotlin ]\nFiles Read: [ List the skill files you''ve read ]\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n3. _______________\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   iOS + Android (Cross-platform)\nFramework:  React Native + Expo\nFiles Read: touch-psychology.md, mobile-performance.md, platform-ios.md, platform-android.md\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. FlatList with React.memo + useCallback for all lists\n2. 48px touch targets, thumb zone for primary CTAs\n3. Platform-specific navigation (edge swipe iOS, back button Android)\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. ScrollView for lists → FlatList\n2. Inline renderItem → Memoized\n3. AsyncStorage for tokens → SecureStore\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Can''t fill the checkpoint? → GO BACK AND READ THE SKILL FILES.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Framework Decision Tree\n\n```\nWHAT ARE YOU BUILDING?\n        │\n        ├── Need OTA updates + rapid iteration + web team\n        │   └── ✅ React Native + Expo\n        │\n        ├── Need pixel-perfect custom UI + performance critical\n        │   └── ✅ Flutter\n        │\n        ├── Deep native features + single platform focus\n        │   ├── iOS only → SwiftUI\n        │   └── Android only → Kotlin + Jetpack Compose\n        │\n        ├── Existing RN codebase + new features\n        │   └── ✅ React Native (bare workflow)\n        │\n        └── Enterprise + existing Flutter codebase\n            └── ✅ Flutter\n```\n\nFor complete decision trees: [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Pre-Development Checklist\n\n### Before Starting ANY Mobile Project\n\n- [ ] **Platform confirmed?** (iOS / Android / Both)\n- [ ] **Framework chosen?** (RN / Flutter / Native)\n- [ ] **Navigation pattern decided?** (Tabs / Stack / Drawer)\n- [ ] **State management selected?** (Zustand / Redux / Riverpod / BLoC)\n- [ ] **Offline requirements known?**\n- [ ] **Deep linking planned from day one?**\n- [ ] **Target devices defined?** (Phone / Tablet / Both)\n\n### Before Every Screen\n\n- [ ] **Touch targets ≥ 44-48px?**\n- [ ] **Primary CTA in thumb zone?**\n- [ ] **Loading state exists?**\n- [ ] **Error state with retry exists?**\n- [ ] **Offline handling considered?**\n- [ ] **Platform conventions followed?**\n\n### Before Release\n\n- [ ] **console.log removed?**\n- [ ] **SecureStore for sensitive data?**\n- [ ] **SSL pinning enabled?**\n- [ ] **Lists optimized (memo, keyExtractor)?**\n- [ ] **Memory cleanup on unmount?**\n- [ ] **Tested on low-end devices?**\n- [ ] **Accessibility labels on all interactive elements?**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Reference Files\n\nFor deeper guidance on specific areas:\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| [mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md) | **FIRST! Anti-memorization, forces context-based thinking** |\n| [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md) | Understanding touch interaction, Fitts'' Law, gesture design |\n| [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md) | Optimizing RN/Flutter, 60fps, memory/battery |\n| [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | iOS-specific design, HIG compliance |\n| [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Android-specific design, Material Design 3 |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Navigation patterns, deep linking |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | Type scale, system fonts, accessibility |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED optimization, dark mode, battery |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework, state, storage decisions |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile users are impatient, interrupted, and using imprecise fingers on small screens. Design for the WORST conditions: bad network, one hand, bright sun, low battery. If it works there, it works everywhere.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:18:42.351Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents specializing in mobile-first, cross-platform user experience optimization.","zh":"非常适合专注于移动优先、跨平台用户体验优化的前端开发代理。","ja":"モバイルファースト、クロスプラットフォームのユーザーエクスペリエンス最適化を専門とするフロントエンド開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"모바일 우선, 크로스 플랫폼 사용자 경험 최적화를 전문으로 하는 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo frontend especializados en optimización de experiencia de usuario de plataforma cruzada y diseño para dispositivos móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement frontend spécialisés dans l''optimisation de l''expérience utilisateur pour les appareils mobiles et les plateformes multiplateformes.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die auf mobiles Erstentwicklung, plattformübergreifende Optimierung der Benutzeroberfläche spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend especializados em otimização de experiência do usuário mobile-first e cross-platform.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов фронтенд-разработки, специализирующихся на оптимизации пользовательского опыта для мобильных устройств и кроссплатформенной разработки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين ي专ون في تطوير الواجهة الأمامية وتحسين تجربة المستخدم على الهواتف المحمولة وأجهزة متعددة المنصات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct automated mobile UX audits with touch-first validation and platform-specific compliance checks. Provides battery-conscious design analysis and offline-capability assessment through executable Python scripts.","zh":"赋予代理进行自动化的移动UX审计的能力，具有触摸优先验证和平台特定合规检查。通过可执行的Python脚本提供电池意识设计分析和离线能力评估。","ja":"自動化されたモバイルUX監査を実行するエージェントを可能にし、タッチ優先の検証とプラットフォーム固有のコンプライアンスチェックを提供する。実行可能なPythonスクリプトを介して、バッテリー意識設計分析とオフライン機能評価を提供する。","ko":"자동화된 모바일 UX 감사를 수행할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 터치 우선 검증 및 플랫폼 특정 준수 확인을 제공한다. 실행 가능한 파이썬 스크립트를 통해 배터리 의식 디자인 분석 및 오프라인 기능 평가를 제공한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de experiencia de usuario móvil automatizadas con validación de primero a touch y controles de cumplimiento específicos de plataforma. Proporciona análisis de diseño consciente de la batería y evaluación de capacidad sin conexión a través de scripts de Python ejecutables.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits d''expérience utilisateur mobile automatisés avec validation tactile en premier et contrôles de conformité spécifiques à la plateforme. Fournit une analyse de conception économe en batterie et une évaluation de la capacité hors ligne via des scripts Python exécutables.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, automatisierte Mobile UX-Audits mit Touch-First-Validierung und plattformspezifischen Compliance-Checks durchzuführen. Bietet batteriebewusste Designanalyse und Offline-Fähigkeitsbewertung durch ausführbare Python-Skripte.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias automatizadas de UX móvel com validação de toque e verificações de conformidade específicas de plataforma. Fornece análise de design consciente da bateria e avaliação da capacidade offline por meio de scripts Python executáveis.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проводить автоматизированные аудиты мобильного UX с проверкой на основе сенсорных интерфейсов и платформо-специфическими проверками соответствия. Предоставляет анализ дизайна с учетом потребления батареи и оценку реализации离线-работы посредством исполняемых скриптов Python.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إجراء تدقيق آلي لجودة تجربة المستخدم على الهواتف المحمولة مع التحقق من واجهة اللمس والتحقق من الامتثال الخاص بالمنصة. يوفر تحليلًا للتصميم مع مراعاة استهلاك البطارية وتقييم التنفيذ دون اتصال عبر سكريبتات بايثون قابلة للتنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing mobile UX audits on project directories","Validating touch interface compliance for mobile applications","Assessing cross-platform design consistency","Analyzing offline capability implementation","Running battery-conscious design validations"],"zh":["在项目目录上执行移动UX审计","验证移动应用的触摸接口合规性","评估跨平台设计的一致性","分析离线功能实现","运行电池意识设计验证"],"ja":["プロジェクトディレクトリでモバイルUX監査を実行する","モバイルアプリケーションのタッチインターフェイスのコンプライアンスを検証する","クロスプラットフォーム設計の整合性を評価する","オフライン機能の実装を分析する","バッテリー意識設計の検証を実行する"],"ko":["프로젝트 디렉토리에서 모바일 UX 감사를 실행하는 것","모바일 애플리케이션의 터치 인터페이스 준수성을 검증하는 것","크로스 플랫폼 디자인의 일관성을 평가하는 것","오프라인 기능 구현을 분석하는 것","배터리 의식 디자인 검증을 실행하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar auditorías de experiencia de usuario móvil en directorios de proyectos","Validar la cumplimiento de la interfaz táctil para aplicaciones móviles","Evaluar la consistencia del diseño entre plataformas","Analizar la implementación de la capacidad sin conexión","Ejecutar validaciones de diseño consciente de la batería"],"fr":["Exécuter des audits d''expérience utilisateur mobile sur des répertoires de projets","Valider la conformité de l''interface tactile pour les applications mobiles","Évaluer la cohérence de la conception entre les plateformes","Analyser la mise en œuvre de la capacité hors ligne","Exécuter des validations de conception économe en batterie"],"de":["Mobile UX-Audits in Projektdirektiven ausführen","Touch-Interface-Compliance für Mobile-Anwendungen validieren","Plattformübergreifende Designkonsistenz bewerten","Offline-Fähigkeitsimplementierung analysieren","Batteriebewusste Designvalidierungen ausführen"],"pt":["Executar auditorias de UX móvel em diretórios de projetos","Validar conformidade de interface de toque para aplicativos móveis","Avaliar consistência de design em várias plataformas","Analizar implementação de capacidade offline","Executar validações de design consciente da bateria"],"ru":["Выполнение аудитов мобильного UX в директориях проектов","Проверка соответствия интерфейса сенсорного управления для мобильных приложений","Оценка последовательности дизайна на нескольких платформах","Анализ реализации离线-работы","Выполнение проверок дизайна с учетом потребления батареи"],"ar":["تشغيل تدقيق لجودة تجربة المستخدم على الهواتف المحمولة في مجلدات المشاريع","التحقق من امتثال واجهة اللمس للتطبيقات المحمولة","تقييم اتساق التصميم عبر منصات متعددة","تحليل تنفيذ العمل دون اتصال","تشغيل التحقق من صحة التصميم مع مراعاة استهلاك البطارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python runtime environment","Needs project path access for audit execution","Platform-specific validation limited to mobile constraints"],"zh":["需要Python运行环境","需要项目路径访问权限以执行审计","平台特定验证仅限于移动约束"],"ja":["Pythonランタイム環境が必要","監査の実行にはプロジェクトパスのアクセス権が必要","プラットフォーム固有の検証はモバイルの制約に限定される"],"ko":["파이썬 런타임 환경이 필요","감사를 실행하려면 프로젝트 경로에 대한 액세스 권한이 필요","플랫폼 특정 검증은 모바일 제약에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de tiempo de ejecución de Python","Necesita acceso al camino del proyecto para la ejecución de la auditoría","La validación específica de la plataforma se limita a las restricciones móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement d''exécution Python","A besoin d''un accès au chemin du projet pour l''exécution de l''audit","La validation spécifique à la plateforme est limitée aux contraintes mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Laufzeitumgebung","Benötigt Projektpfadzugriff für die Audit-Ausführung","Plattformspezifische Validierung ist auf mobile Einschränkungen beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de tempo de execução Python","Necessita acesso ao caminho do projeto para execução da auditoria","Validação específica de plataforma limitada a restrições móveis"],"ru":["Требует среды выполнения Python","Требует доступа к пути проекта для выполнения аудита","Платформо-специфическая проверка ограничена мобильными ограничениями"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة وقت تشغيل بايثون","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى مسار المشروع لتنفيذ التدقيق","التحقق الخاص بالمنصة مقيد بقيود الهواتف المحمولة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ollieb89/orchestrator/mobile-design', 'community', 'ollieb89', 'orchestrator', 'ollieb89/orchestrator', 'mobile-design', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:18:28.203Z', NULL, '{"id":"ollieb89/orchestrator/mobile-design","name":"mobile-design","description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种基于Touch-first、节能、平台尊重和离线能力的设计方法，帮助开发者创建更好的移动应用体验","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムは、タッチファースト、省エネルギー、プラットフォーム尊重、オフライン対応を基盤とした設計方法で、開発者がより優れたモバイルアプリのユーザーエクスペリエンスを生み出すのに役立ちます","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 터치 우선, 배터리 소모 최소화, 플랫폼尊重, 오프라인 기능을 기반으로 하는 디자인 방법으로 개발자가 더 나은 모바일 애플리케이션 사용자 경험을 만들 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"El diseño móvil se centra en la experiencia del usuario en dispositivos móviles, considerando limitaciones y oportunidades únicas","fr":"La conception mobile se concentre sur l''expérience utilisateur sur les appareils mobiles, en tenant compte des limitations et des opportunités uniques","de":"Das mobile Design konzentriert sich auf die Benutzererfahrung auf mobilen Geräten, unter Berücksichtigung der einzigartigen Einschränkungen und Möglichkeiten","pt":"O design móvel é uma abordagem de desenvolvimento que prioriza a experiência do usuário em dispositivos móveis","ru":"Мобильный дизайн - это подход к разработке, который отдает приоритет опыту пользователя на мобильных устройствах","ar":"تصميم الجوال هو نهج تطوير يركز على تجربة المستخدم على أجهزة الجوال","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"移动设计系统 - Touch-first 的移动开发解决方案","ja":"モバイルデザインシステム - タッチファーストのモバイル開発ソリューション","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템 - 터치 우선의 모바일 개발 솔루션","es":"Diseño Móvil: Principios y Herramientas","fr":"Conception Mobile: Principes et Outils","de":"Mobile Design: Prinzipien und Werkzeuge","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Design Móvel","ru":"Мобильный Дизайн Системы","ar":"تصميم الجوال","en":"mobile-design"},"description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种基于Touch-first、节能、平台尊重和离线能力的设计方法，帮助开发者创建更好的移动应用体验","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムは、タッチファースト、省エネルギー、プラットフォーム尊重、オフライン対応を基盤とした設計方法で、開発者がより優れたモバイルアプリのユーザーエクスペリエンスを生み出すのに役立ちます","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 터치 우선, 배터리 소모 최소화, 플랫폼尊重, 오프라인 기능을 기반으로 하는 디자인 방법으로 개발자가 더 나은 모바일 애플리케이션 사용자 경험을 만들 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"El diseño móvil se centra en la experiencia del usuario en dispositivos móviles, considerando limitaciones y oportunidades únicas","fr":"La conception mobile se concentre sur l''expérience utilisateur sur les appareils mobiles, en tenant compte des limitations et des opportunités uniques","de":"Das mobile Design konzentriert sich auf die Benutzererfahrung auf mobilen Geräten, unter Berücksichtigung der einzigartigen Einschränkungen und Möglichkeiten","pt":"O design móvel é uma abordagem de desenvolvimento que prioriza a experiência do usuário em dispositivos móveis","ru":"Мобильный дизайн - это подход к разработке, который отдает приоритет опыту пользователя на мобильных устройствах","ar":"تصميم الجوال هو نهج تطوير يركز على تجربة المستخدم على أجهزة الجوال","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Touch-first 设计","节能和性能优化","平台尊重和兼容性","离线能力和缓存","移动设备独特特征的支持"],"ja":["タッチファースト設計","省エネルギーとパフォーマンス最適化","プラットフォーム尊重と互換性","オフライン対応とキャッシュ","モバイルデバイス独自の特性のサポート"],"ko":["터치 우선 디자인","배터리 소모 최소화와 성능 최적화","플랫폼尊重과 호환성","오프라인 기능과 캐싱","모바일 기기 고유의 특성 지원"],"es":["Enfoque de diseño touch-first","Conscious de la batería y el rendimiento","Respeto por las plataformas y capacidades únicas","Capacidad para funcionar sin conexión","Herramientas de validación y auditoría"],"fr":["Approche de conception touch-first","Conscient de la batterie et des performances","Respect des plateformes et des capacités uniques","Capacité à fonctionner hors ligne","Outils de validation et d''audit"],"de":["Touch-first-Designansatz","Bewusstsein für Batterie und Leistung","Respekt für Plattformen und einzigartige Fähigkeiten","Fähigkeit, offline zu funktionieren","Validierungs- und Audit-Tools"],"pt":["Abordagem touch-first","Conscientização da bateria","Respeito à plataforma","Capacidade offline","Validação de UX móvel"],"ru":["Подход touch-first","Энергосбережение","Уважение к платформе","Возможность работы offline","Валидация мобильного UX"],"ar":["نهج اللمس أولاً","الوعي بالبطارية","احترام المنصة","القدرة على العمل离 الخط","تحقق من UX المتنقل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动设计系统","Touch-first","节能","平台尊重","离线能力","移动应用开发","用户体验"],"ja":["モバイルデザインシステム","タッチファースト","省エネルギー","プラットフォーム尊重","オフライン対応","モバイルアプリ開発","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["모바일 디자인 시스템","터치 우선","배터리 소모 최소화","플랫폼尊重","오프라인 기능","모바일 애플리케이션 개발","사용자 경험"],"es":["diseño móvil","experiencia del usuario","dispositivos móviles","limitaciones de diseño","principios de diseño","herramientas de validación","auditoría de UX","desarrollo móvil","diseño de aplicaciones"],"fr":["conception mobile","expérience utilisateur","appareils mobiles","limitations de design","principes de conception","outils de validation","audit de l''UX","développement mobile","conception d''applications"],"de":["mobiles Design","Benutzererfahrung","mobile Geräte","Design-Einschränkungen","Design-Prinzipien","Validierungs-Tools","UX-Audit","mobile Entwicklung","App-Design"],"pt":["design móvel","desenvolvimento móvel","experiência do usuário","dispositivos móveis","validação de UX","otimização de bateria","plataforma móvel"],"ru":["мобильный дизайн","мобильная разработка","опыт пользователя","мобильные устройства","валидация мобильного UX","оптимизация энергопотребления","мобильная платформа"],"ar":["تصميم الجوال","تطوير الجوال","تجربة المستخدم","أجهزة الجوال","تحقق من UX المتنقل","تحسين استهلاك البطارية","منصة الجوال"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-design","description":"Mobile-first design thinking and decision-making for iOS and Android apps. Touch interaction, performance patterns, platform conventions. Teaches principles, not fixed values. Use when building React Native, Flutter, or native mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference","body":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference Files Before Working!\n\n**⛔ DO NOT start development until you read the relevant files:**\n\n### Universal (Always Read)\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **[mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md)** | **⚠️ ANTI-MEMORIZATION: Forces thinking, prevents AI defaults** | **⬜ CRITICAL FIRST** |\n| **[touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)** | **Fitts'' Law, gestures, haptics, thumb zone** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)** | **RN/Flutter performance, 60fps, memory** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-backend.md](mobile-backend.md)** | **Push notifications, offline sync, mobile API** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-testing.md](mobile-testing.md)** | **Testing pyramid, E2E, platform-specific** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-debugging.md](mobile-debugging.md)** | **Native vs JS debugging, Flipper, Logcat** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Tab/Stack/Drawer, deep linking | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | System fonts, Dynamic Type, a11y | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED, dark mode, battery-aware | ⬜ Read |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework/state/storage selection | ⬜ Read |\n\n> 🧠 **mobile-design-thinking.md is PRIORITY!** This file ensures AI thinks instead of using memorized patterns.\n\n### Platform-Specific (Read Based on Target)\n\n| Platform | File | Content | When to Read |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| **iOS** | [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | Human Interface Guidelines, SF Pro, SwiftUI patterns | Building for iPhone/iPad |\n| **Android** | [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Material Design 3, Roboto, Compose patterns | Building for Android |\n| **Cross-Platform** | Both above | Platform divergence points | React Native / Flutter |\n\n> 🔴 **If building for iOS → Read platform-ios.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If building for Android → Read platform-android.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If cross-platform → Read BOTH and apply conditional platform logic!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: ASK BEFORE ASSUMING (MANDATORY)\n\n> **STOP! If the user''s request is open-ended, DO NOT default to your favorites.**\n\n### You MUST Ask If Not Specified:\n\n| Aspect | Ask | Why |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| **Platform** | \"iOS, Android, or both?\" | Affects EVERY design decision |\n| **Framework** | \"React Native, Flutter, or native?\" | Determines patterns and tools |\n| **Navigation** | \"Tab bar, drawer, or stack-based?\" | Core UX decision |\n| **State** | \"What state management? (Zustand/Redux/Riverpod/BLoC?)\" | Architecture foundation |\n| **Offline** | \"Does this need to work offline?\" | Affects data strategy |\n| **Target devices** | \"Phone only, or tablet support?\" | Layout complexity |\n\n### ⛔ AI MOBILE ANTI-PATTERNS (YASAK LİSTESİ)\n\n> 🚫 **These are AI default tendencies that MUST be avoided!**\n\n#### Performance Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **ScrollView for long lists** | Renders ALL items, memory explodes | Use `FlatList` / `FlashList` / `ListView.builder` |\n| **Inline renderItem function** | New function every render, all items re-render | `useCallback` + `React.memo` |\n| **Missing keyExtractor** | Index-based keys cause bugs on reorder | Unique, stable ID from data |\n| **Skip getItemLayout** | Async layout = janky scroll | Provide when items have fixed height |\n| **setState() everywhere** | Unnecessary widget rebuilds | Targeted state, `const` constructors |\n| **Native driver: false** | Animations blocked by JS thread | `useNativeDriver: true` always |\n| **console.log in production** | Blocks JS thread severely | Remove before release build |\n| **Skip React.memo/const** | Every item re-renders on any change | Memoize list items ALWAYS |\n\n#### Touch/UX Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Touch target < 44px** | Impossible to tap accurately, frustrating | Minimum 44pt (iOS) / 48dp (Android) |\n| **Spacing < 8px between targets** | Accidental taps on neighbors | Minimum 8-12px gap |\n| **Gesture-only interactions** | Motor impaired users excluded | Always provide button alternative |\n| **No loading state** | User thinks app crashed | ALWAYS show loading feedback |\n| **No error state** | User stuck, no recovery path | Show error with retry option |\n| **No offline handling** | Crash/block when network lost | Graceful degradation, cached data |\n| **Ignore platform conventions** | Users confused, muscle memory broken | iOS feels iOS, Android feels Android |\n\n#### Security Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Token in AsyncStorage** | Easily accessible, stolen on rooted device | `SecureStore` / `Keychain` / `EncryptedSharedPreferences` |\n| **Hardcode API keys** | Reverse engineered from APK/IPA | Environment variables, secure storage |\n| **Skip SSL pinning** | MITM attacks possible | Pin certificates in production |\n| **Log sensitive data** | Logs can be extracted | Never log tokens, passwords, PII |\n\n#### Architecture Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Business logic in UI** | Untestable, unmaintainable | Service layer separation |\n| **Global state for everything** | Unnecessary re-renders, complexity | Local state default, lift when needed |\n| **Deep linking as afterthought** | Notifications, shares broken | Plan deep links from day one |\n| **Skip dispose/cleanup** | Memory leaks, zombie listeners | Clean up subscriptions, timers |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Platform Decision Matrix\n\n### When to Unify vs Diverge\n\n```\n                    UNIFY (same on both)          DIVERGE (platform-specific)\n                    ───────────────────           ──────────────────────────\nBusiness Logic      ✅ Always                     -\nData Layer          ✅ Always                     -\nCore Features       ✅ Always                     -\n                    \nNavigation          -                             ✅ iOS: edge swipe, Android: back button\nGestures            -                             ✅ Platform-native feel\nIcons               -                             ✅ SF Symbols vs Material Icons\nDate Pickers        -                             ✅ Native pickers feel right\nModals/Sheets       -                             ✅ iOS: bottom sheet vs Android: dialog\nTypography          -                             ✅ SF Pro vs Roboto (or custom)\nError Dialogs       -                             ✅ Platform conventions for alerts\n```\n\n### Quick Reference: Platform Defaults\n\n| Element | iOS | Android |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |\n| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |\n| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |\n| **Bottom Tab Icons** | SF Symbols | Material Symbols |\n| **Action Sheet** | UIActionSheet from bottom | Bottom Sheet / Dialog |\n| **Progress** | Spinner | Linear progress (Material) |\n| **Pull to Refresh** | Native UIRefreshControl | SwipeRefreshLayout |\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Mobile UX Psychology (Quick Reference)\n\n### Fitts'' Law for Touch\n\n```\nDesktop: Cursor is precise (1px)\nMobile:  Finger is imprecise (~7mm contact area)\n\n→ Touch targets MUST be 44-48px minimum\n→ Important actions in THUMB ZONE (bottom of screen)\n→ Destructive actions AWAY from easy reach\n```\n\n### Thumb Zone (One-Handed Usage)\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│      HARD TO REACH          │ ← Navigation, menu, back\n│        (stretch)            │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      OK TO REACH            │ ← Secondary actions\n│       (natural)             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      EASY TO REACH          │ ← PRIMARY CTAs, tab bar\n│    (thumb''s natural arc)    │ ← Main content interaction\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n        [  HOME  ]\n```\n\n### Mobile-Specific Cognitive Load\n\n| Desktop | Mobile Difference |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| Multiple windows | ONE task at a time |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | Touch gestures |\n| Hover states | NO hover (tap or nothing) |\n| Large viewport | Limited space, scroll vertical |\n| Stable attention | Interrupted constantly |\n\nFor deep dive: [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Performance Principles (Quick Reference)\n\n### React Native Critical Rules\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoized renderItem + React.memo wrapper\nconst ListItem = React.memo(({ item }: { item: Item }) => (\n  <View style={styles.item}>\n    <Text>{item.title}</Text>\n  </View>\n));\n\nconst renderItem = useCallback(\n  ({ item }: { item: Item }) => <ListItem item={item} />,\n  []\n);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: FlatList with all optimizations\n<FlatList\n  data={items}\n  renderItem={renderItem}\n  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}  // Stable ID, NOT index\n  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({\n    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,\n    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,\n    index,\n  })}\n  removeClippedSubviews={true}\n  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}\n  windowSize={5}\n/>\n```\n\n### Flutter Critical Rules\n\n```dart\n// ✅ CORRECT: const constructors prevent rebuilds\nclass MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyWidget({super.key}); // CONST!\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return const Column( // CONST!\n      children: [\n        Text(''Static content''),\n        MyConstantWidget(),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Targeted state with ValueListenableBuilder\nValueListenableBuilder<int>(\n  valueListenable: counter,\n  builder: (context, value, child) => Text(''$value''),\n  child: const ExpensiveWidget(), // Won''t rebuild!\n)\n```\n\n### Animation Performance\n\n```\nGPU-accelerated (FAST):     CPU-bound (SLOW):\n├── transform               ├── width, height\n├── opacity                 ├── top, left, right, bottom\n└── (use these ONLY)        ├── margin, padding\n                            └── (AVOID animating these)\n```\n\nFor complete guide: [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📝 CHECKPOINT (MANDATORY Before Any Mobile Work)\n\n> **Before writing ANY mobile code, you MUST complete this checkpoint:**\n\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   [ iOS / Android / Both ]\nFramework:  [ React Native / Flutter / SwiftUI / Kotlin ]\nFiles Read: [ List the skill files you''ve read ]\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n3. _______________\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   iOS + Android (Cross-platform)\nFramework:  React Native + Expo\nFiles Read: touch-psychology.md, mobile-performance.md, platform-ios.md, platform-android.md\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. FlatList with React.memo + useCallback for all lists\n2. 48px touch targets, thumb zone for primary CTAs\n3. Platform-specific navigation (edge swipe iOS, back button Android)\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. ScrollView for lists → FlatList\n2. Inline renderItem → Memoized\n3. AsyncStorage for tokens → SecureStore\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Can''t fill the checkpoint? → GO BACK AND READ THE SKILL FILES.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Framework Decision Tree\n\n```\nWHAT ARE YOU BUILDING?\n        │\n        ├── Need OTA updates + rapid iteration + web team\n        │   └── ✅ React Native + Expo\n        │\n        ├── Need pixel-perfect custom UI + performance critical\n        │   └── ✅ Flutter\n        │\n        ├── Deep native features + single platform focus\n        │   ├── iOS only → SwiftUI\n        │   └── Android only → Kotlin + Jetpack Compose\n        │\n        ├── Existing RN codebase + new features\n        │   └── ✅ React Native (bare workflow)\n        │\n        └── Enterprise + existing Flutter codebase\n            └── ✅ Flutter\n```\n\nFor complete decision trees: [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Pre-Development Checklist\n\n### Before Starting ANY Mobile Project\n\n- [ ] **Platform confirmed?** (iOS / Android / Both)\n- [ ] **Framework chosen?** (RN / Flutter / Native)\n- [ ] **Navigation pattern decided?** (Tabs / Stack / Drawer)\n- [ ] **State management selected?** (Zustand / Redux / Riverpod / BLoC)\n- [ ] **Offline requirements known?**\n- [ ] **Deep linking planned from day one?**\n- [ ] **Target devices defined?** (Phone / Tablet / Both)\n\n### Before Every Screen\n\n- [ ] **Touch targets ≥ 44-48px?**\n- [ ] **Primary CTA in thumb zone?**\n- [ ] **Loading state exists?**\n- [ ] **Error state with retry exists?**\n- [ ] **Offline handling considered?**\n- [ ] **Platform conventions followed?**\n\n### Before Release\n\n- [ ] **console.log removed?**\n- [ ] **SecureStore for sensitive data?**\n- [ ] **SSL pinning enabled?**\n- [ ] **Lists optimized (memo, keyExtractor)?**\n- [ ] **Memory cleanup on unmount?**\n- [ ] **Tested on low-end devices?**\n- [ ] **Accessibility labels on all interactive elements?**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Reference Files\n\nFor deeper guidance on specific areas:\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| [mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md) | **FIRST! Anti-memorization, forces context-based thinking** |\n| [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md) | Understanding touch interaction, Fitts'' Law, gesture design |\n| [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md) | Optimizing RN/Flutter, 60fps, memory/battery |\n| [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | iOS-specific design, HIG compliance |\n| [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Android-specific design, Material Design 3 |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Navigation patterns, deep linking |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | Type scale, system fonts, accessibility |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED optimization, dark mode, battery |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework, state, storage decisions |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile users are impatient, interrupted, and using imprecise fingers on small screens. Design for the WORST conditions: bad network, one hand, bright sun, low battery. If it works there, it works everywhere.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:18:28.203Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing touch-first, battery-conscious, and platform-respectful mobile design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要触摸优先、电池节能和平台尊重的移动设计能力的UI/UX代理。","ja":"タッチファースト、バッテリー意識、プラットフォーム尊重のモバイルデザイン機能を必要とするUI/UXエージェントに最適です。","ko":"터치 우선, 배터리 효율, 플랫폼 존중의 모바일 디자인 기능이 필요한 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan capacidades de diseño móvil de primera generación, conscientes de la batería y respetuosas con la plataforma.","fr"