aplicaciones de voz en tiempo real con baja latencia y alta calidad de audio","fr":"Le développement d''IA vocale consiste à créer des applications vocales en temps réel avec une faible latence et une haute qualité audio","de":"Die Sprach-IA-Entwicklung beinhaltet die Erstellung von Echtzeit-Sprachanwendungen mit geringer Latenz und hoher Audioqualität","pt":"O desenvolvimento de IA de voz permite criar aplicações de voz em tempo real com alta qualidade e baixa latência","ru":"Разработка голосового ИИ позволяет создавать реальные приложения голоса с высокой качеством и низкой задержкой","ar":"تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي الصوتي يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات صوتية في الوقت الفعلي مع جودة عالية و ﾒطاء منخفضة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["OpenAI实时API","Vapi语音代理","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs语音合成","LiveKit实时通信"],"ja":["OpenAIリアルタイムAPI","Vapiボイスエージェント","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabsボイスシンセシス","LiveKitリアルタイムコミュニケーション"],"ko":["OpenAI 실시간 API","Vapi 보이스 에이전트","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs 보이스 합성","LiveKit 실시간 통신"],"es":["API de tiempo real de OpenAI","Agentes de voz de Vapi","STT/TTS de Deepgram","Síntesis de voz de ElevenLabs","LiveKit para aplicaciones de voz en tiempo real"],"fr":["API de temps réel d''OpenAI","Agents de voix de Vapi","STT/TTS de Deepgram","Synthèse de voix d''ElevenLabs","LiveKit pour des applications de voix en temps réel"],"de":["Echtzeit-API von OpenAI","Sprachagenten von Vapi","STT/TTS von Deepgram","Sprachsynthese von ElevenLabs","LiveKit für Echtzeit-Sprachanwendungen"],"pt":["OpenAI Realtime API","Vapi voice agents","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs voice synthesis","LiveKit real-time"],"ru":["OpenAI Realtime API","Vapi голосовые агенты","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs синтез голоса","LiveKit реального времени"],"ar":["OpenAI Realtime API","وكلاء صوت Vapi","Deepgram STT/TTS","ElevenLabs 합성 الصوت","LiveKit في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["语音AI开发","实时语音应用","OpenAI实时API","Vapi语音代理","Deepgram STT/TTS","语音合成","实时通信"],"ja":["ボイスAI開発","リアルタイムボイスアプリケーション","OpenAIリアルタイムAPI","Vapiボイスエージェント","Deepgram STT/TTS","ボイスシンセシス","リアルタイムコミュニケーション"],"ko":["보이스 AI 개발","실시간 보이스 애플리케이션","OpenAI 실시간 API","Vapi 보이스 에이전트","Deepgram STT/TTS","보이스 합성","실시간 통신"],"es":["desarrollo de IA de voz","aplicaciones de voz en tiempo real","latencia baja","calidad de audio alta","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"fr":["développement d''IA vocale","applications de voix en temps réel","faible latence","haute qualité audio","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"de":["Sprach-IA-Entwicklung","Echtzeit-Sprachanwendungen","geringe Latenz","hohe Audioqualität","OpenAI","Vapi","Deepgram","ElevenLabs","LiveKit"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de ia de voz","aplicações de voz em tempo real","ia de voz","voz artificial","desenvolvimento de voz","tecnologia de voz"],"ru":["разработка голосового ии","реальные приложения голоса","голосовой ии","искусственный голос","разработка голоса","голосовая технология"],"ar":["تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي الصوتي","تطبيقات صوتية في الوقت الفعلي","الذكاء الاصطناعي الصوتي","الصوت الاصطناعي","تطوير الصوت","تكنولوجيا الصوت"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"voice-ai-development","description":"Expert in building voice AI applications - from real-time voice agents to voice-enabled apps. Covers OpenAI Realtime API, Vapi for voice agents, Deepgram for transcription, ElevenLabs for synthesis, LiveKit for real-time infrastructure, and WebRTC fundamentals. Knows how to build low-latency, production-ready voice experiences. Use when: voice ai, voice agent, speech to text, text to speech, realtime voice.","bodyPreview":"# Voice AI Development\n\n**Role**: Voice AI Architect\n\nYou are an expert in building real-time voice applications. You think in terms of\nlatency budgets, audio quality, and user experience. You know that voice apps feel\nmagical when fast and broken when slow. You choose the right combination of providers\nfor each use case and optimize relentlessly for perceived responsiveness.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- OpenAI Realtime API\n- Vapi voice agents\n- Deepgram STT/TTS\n- ElevenLabs voice synthesis\n- LiveKit rea","body":"# Voice AI Development\n\n**Role**: Voice AI Architect\n\nYou are an expert in building real-time voice applications. You think in terms of\nlatency budgets, audio quality, and user experience. You know that voice apps feel\nmagical when fast and broken when slow. You choose the right combination of providers\nfor each use case and optimize relentlessly for perceived responsiveness.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- OpenAI Realtime API\n- Vapi voice agents\n- Deepgram STT/TTS\n- ElevenLabs voice synthesis\n- LiveKit real-time infrastructure\n- WebRTC audio handling\n- Voice agent design\n- Latency optimization\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python or Node.js\n- API keys for providers\n- Audio handling knowledge\n\n## Patterns\n\n### OpenAI Realtime API\n\nNative voice-to-voice with GPT-4o\n\n**When to use**: When you want integrated voice AI without separate STT/TTS\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nimport websockets\nimport json\nimport base64\n\nOPENAI_API_KEY = \"sk-...\"\n\nasync def voice_session():\n    url = \"wss://api.openai.com/v1/realtime?model=gpt-4o-realtime-preview\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {OPENAI_API_KEY}\",\n        \"OpenAI-Beta\": \"realtime=v1\"\n    }\n\n    async with websockets.connect(url, extra_headers=headers) as ws:\n        # Configure session\n        await ws.send(json.dumps({\n            \"type\": \"session.update\",\n            \"session\": {\n                \"modalities\": [\"text\", \"audio\"],\n                \"voice\": \"alloy\",  # alloy, echo, fable, onyx, nova, shimmer\n                \"input_audio_format\": \"pcm16\",\n                \"output_audio_format\": \"pcm16\",\n                \"input_audio_transcription\": {\n                    \"model\": \"whisper-1\"\n                },\n                \"turn_detection\": {\n                    \"type\": \"server_vad\",  # Voice activity detection\n                    \"threshold\": 0.5,\n                    \"prefix_padding_ms\": 300,\n                    \"silence_duration_ms\": 500\n                },\n                \"tools\": [\n                    {\n                        \"type\": \"function\",\n                        \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n                        \"description\": \"Get weather for a location\",\n                        \"parameters\": {\n                            \"type\": \"object\",\n                            \"properties\": {\n                                \"location\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                ]\n            }\n        }))\n\n        # Send audio (PCM16, 24kHz, mono)\n        async def send_audio(audio_bytes):\n            await ws.send(json.dumps({\n                \"type\": \"input_audio_buffer.append\",\n                \"audio\": base64.b64encode(audio_bytes).decode()\n            }))\n\n        # Receive events\n        async for message in ws:\n            event = json.loads(message)\n\n            if event[\"type\"] == \"resp\n```\n\n### Vapi Voice Agent\n\nBuild voice agents with Vapi platform\n\n**When to use**: Phone-based agents, quick deployment\n\n```python\n# Vapi provides hosted voice agents with webhooks\n\nfrom flask import Flask, request, jsonify\nimport vapi\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\nclient = vapi.Vapi(api_key=\"...\")\n\n# Create an assistant\nassistant = client.assistants.create(\n    name=\"Support Agent\",\n    model={\n        \"provider\": \"openai\",\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n        \"messages\": [\n            {\n                \"role\": \"system\",\n                \"content\": \"You are a helpful support agent...\"\n            }\n        ]\n    },\n    voice={\n        \"provider\": \"11labs\",\n        \"voiceId\": \"21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM\"  # Rachel\n    },\n    firstMessage=\"Hi! How can I help you today?\",\n    transcriber={\n        \"provider\": \"deepgram\",\n        \"model\": \"nova-2\"\n    }\n)\n\n# Webhook for conversation events\n@app.route(\"/vapi/webhook\", methods=[\"POST\"])\ndef vapi_webhook():\n    event = request.json\n\n    if event[\"type\"] == \"function-call\":\n        # Handle tool call\n        name = event[\"functionCall\"][\"name\"]\n        args = event[\"functionCall\"][\"parameters\"]\n\n        if name == \"check_order\":\n            result = check_order(args[\"order_id\"])\n            return jsonify({\"result\": result})\n\n    elif event[\"type\"] == \"end-of-call-report\":\n        # Call ended - save transcript\n        transcript = event[\"transcript\"]\n        save_transcript(event[\"call\"][\"id\"], transcript)\n\n    return jsonify({\"ok\": True})\n\n# Start outbound call\ncall = client.calls.create(\n    assistant_id=assistant.id,\n    customer={\n        \"number\": \"+1234567890\"\n    },\n    phoneNumber={\n        \"twilioPhoneNumber\": \"+0987654321\"\n    }\n)\n\n# Or create web call\nweb_call = client.calls.create(\n    assistant_id=assistant.id,\n    type=\"web\"\n)\n# Returns URL for WebRTC connection\n```\n\n### Deepgram STT + ElevenLabs TTS\n\nBest-in-class transcription and synthesis\n\n**When to use**: High quality voice, custom pipeline\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom deepgram import DeepgramClient, LiveTranscriptionEvents\nfrom elevenlabs import ElevenLabs\n\n# Deepgram real-time transcription\ndeepgram = DeepgramClient(api_key=\"...\")\n\nasync def transcribe_stream(audio_stream):\n    connection = deepgram.listen.live.v(\"1\")\n\n    async def on_transcript(result):\n        transcript = result.channel.alternatives[0].transcript\n        if transcript:\n            print(f\"Heard: {transcript}\")\n            if result.is_final:\n                # Process final transcript\n                await handle_user_input(transcript)\n\n    connection.on(LiveTranscriptionEvents.Transcript, on_transcript)\n\n    await connection.start({\n        \"model\": \"nova-2\",  # Best quality\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"smart_format\": True,\n        \"interim_results\": True,  # Get partial results\n        \"utterance_end_ms\": 1000,\n        \"vad_events\": True,  # Voice activity detection\n        \"encoding\": \"linear16\",\n        \"sample_rate\": 16000\n    })\n\n    # Stream audio\n    async for chunk in audio_stream:\n        await connection.send(chunk)\n\n    await connection.finish()\n\n# ElevenLabs streaming synthesis\neleven = ElevenLabs(api_key=\"...\")\n\ndef text_to_speech_stream(text: str):\n    \"\"\"Stream TTS audio chunks.\"\"\"\n    audio_stream = eleven.text_to_speech.convert_as_stream(\n        voice_id=\"21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM\",  # Rachel\n        model_id=\"eleven_turbo_v2_5\",  # Fastest\n        text=text,\n        output_format=\"pcm_24000\"  # Raw PCM for low latency\n    )\n\n    for chunk in audio_stream:\n        yield chunk\n\n# Or with WebSocket for lowest latency\nasync def tts_websocket(text_stream):\n    async with eleven.text_to_speech.stream_async(\n        voice_id=\"21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM\",\n        model_id=\"eleven_turbo_v2_5\"\n    ) as tts:\n        async for text_chunk in text_stream:\n            audio = await tts.send(text_chunk)\n            yield audio\n\n        # Flush remaining audio\n        final_audio = await tts.flush()\n        yield final_audio\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Non-streaming Pipeline\n\n**Why bad**: Adds seconds of latency.\nUser perceives as slow.\nLoses conversation flow.\n\n**Instead**: Stream everything:\n- STT: interim results\n- LLM: token streaming\n- TTS: chunk streaming\nStart TTS before LLM finishes.\n\n### ❌ Ignoring Interruptions\n\n**Why bad**: Frustrating user experience.\nFeels like talking to a machine.\nWastes time.\n\n**Instead**: Implement barge-in detection.\nUse VAD to detect user speech.\nStop TTS immediately.\nClear audio queue.\n\n### ❌ Single Provider Lock-in\n\n**Why bad**: May not be best quality.\nSingle point of failure.\nHarder to optimize.\n\n**Instead**: Mix best providers:\n- Deepgram for STT (speed + accuracy)\n- ElevenLabs for TTS (voice quality)\n- OpenAI/Anthropic for LLM\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Latency varies by provider\n- Cost per minute adds up\n- Quality depends on network\n- Complex debugging\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `langgraph`, `structured-output`, `langfuse`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:19:08.869Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Real-time Voice Agents needing expertise in latency optimization and audio quality enhancement using OpenAI Realtime API and Deepgram STT/TTS.","zh":"适合需要实时语音代理的_latency优化和音频质量增强的专长，使用OpenAI实时API和Deepgram STT/TTS。","ja":"OpenAI Realtime APIおよびDeepgram STT/TTSを使用した待ち時間の最適化とオーディオ品質の向上に特化したリアルタイムボイスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"OpenAI 실시간 API 및 Deepgram STT/TTS를 사용하는 대기 시간 최적화 및 오디오 품질 향상에 전문성을 필요로 하는 실시간 음성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Voz en Tiempo Real que necesitan experiencia en optimización de latencia y mejora de la calidad de audio utilizando la API de OpenAI en Tiempo Real y Deepgram STT/TTS.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Vocaux en Temps Réel nécessitant une expertise en optimisation de latence et en amélioration de la qualité audio en utilisant l''API OpenAI en Temps Réel et Deepgram STT/TTS.","de":"Ideal für Echtzeit-Sprachagenten, die Erfahrung in der Optimierung von Latenz und Verbesserung der Audioqualität mit der OpenAI-Echtzeit-API und Deepgram STT/TTS benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Voz em Tempo Real que necessitam de especialização em otimização de latência e melhoria da qualidade de áudio usando a API OpenAI Realtime e Deepgram STT/TTS.","ru":"Идеально для реальных агентов голоса, требующих экспертизы в оптимизации задержки и улучшении качества аудио с использованием OpenAI Realtime API и Deepgram STT/TTS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الصوتيين في الوقت الفعلي الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في تحسين التأخير وتحسين جودة الصوت باستخدام OpenAI Realtime API و Deepgram STT/TTS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft seamless voice experiences by leveraging Vapi voice agents, ElevenLabs voice synthesis, and LiveKit for real-time communication, optimizing for perceived responsiveness and latency budgets.","zh":"通过利用Vapi语音代理、ElevenLabs语音合成和LiveKit进行实时通信，优化感知响应性和延迟预算，从而使代理能够打造无缝的语音体验。","ja":"Vapiボイスエージェント、ElevenLabsボイス合成、LiveKitを使用したリアルタイムコミュニケーションにより、エージェントが無断のボイス体験を構築できるようにし、感知されたレスポンスと待ち時間予算を最適化します。","ko":"Vapi 음성 에이전트, ElevenLabs 음성 합성 및 LiveKit를 사용한 실시간 통신을 통해 에이전트가 무결점 음성 경험을 만들 수 있도록 하며, 지각된 대기 시간과 예산을 최적화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear experiencias de voz sin interrupciones aprovechando los agentes de voz Vapi, la síntesis de voz ElevenLabs y LiveKit para la comunicación en tiempo real, optimizando la respuesta percibida y los presupuestos de latencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences vocales sans interruption en exploitant les agents vocaux Vapi, la synthèse vocale ElevenLabs et LiveKit pour la communication en temps réel, en optimisant la réactivité perçue et les budgets de latence.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, nahtlose Sprachexperience zu erstellen, indem sie die Vapi-Sprachagenten, die ElevenLabs-Sprachsynthese und LiveKit für die Echtzeitkommunikation nutzen, die wahrgenommene Reaktionsfähigkeit und die Latenzbudgets optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar experiências de voz sem interrupções, aproveitando os agentes de voz Vapi, a síntese de voz ElevenLabs e o LiveKit para comunicação em tempo real, otimizando para responsividade percebida e orçamentos de latência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать бесшовные голосовые trải nghiệm, используя голосовых агентов Vapi, синтез голоса ElevenLabs и LiveKit для реального общения, оптимизируя для воспринимаемой отзывчивости и бюджетов задержки.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء تجارب صوتية متصلة، من خلال استخدام وكلاء الصوت Vapi وتركيب الصوت ElevenLabs و LiveKit للاتصالات في الوقت الفعلي، مع تحسين الاستجابة المتصورة وميزانيات التأخير."},"useCases":{"en":["Building real-time voice applications with OpenAI Realtime API","Optimizing audio quality using Deepgram STT/TTS and ElevenLabs voice synthesis","Developing low-latency voice agents with Vapi and LiveKit"],"zh":["使用OpenAI实时API构建实时语音应用程序","使用Deepgram STT/TTS和ElevenLabs语音合成优化音频质量","使用Vapi和LiveKit开发低延迟语音代理"],"ja":["OpenAI Realtime APIを使用したリアルタイムボイスアプリケーションの構築","Deepgram STT/TTSおよびElevenLabsボイス合成を使用したオーディオ品質の最適化","VapiおよびLiveKitを使用した低待ち時間ボイスエージェントの開発"],"ko":["OpenAI 실시간 API를 사용한 실시간 음성 애플리케이션 구축","Deepgram STT/TTS 및 ElevenLabs 음성 합성을 사용한 오디오 품질 최적화","Vapi 및 LiveKit를 사용한 저지연 음성 에이전트 개발"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones de voz en tiempo real con la API de OpenAI en Tiempo Real","Optimización de la calidad de audio utilizando Deepgram STT/TTS y la síntesis de voz ElevenLabs","Desarrollo de agentes de voz de baja latencia con Vapi y LiveKit"],"fr":["Création d''applications vocales en temps réel avec l''API OpenAI en Temps Réel","Optimisation de la qualité audio en utilisant Deepgram STT/TTS et la synthèse vocale ElevenLabs","Développement d''agents vocaux à faible latence avec Vapi et LiveKit"],"de":["Erstellung von Echtzeit-Sprachanwendungen mit der OpenAI-Echtzeit-API","Optimierung der Audioqualität mit Deepgram STT/TTS und der ElevenLabs-Sprachsynthese","Entwicklung von Sprachagenten mit geringer Latenz mit Vapi und LiveKit"],"pt":["Construção de aplicações de voz em tempo real com OpenAI Realtime API","Otimização da qualidade de áudio usando Deepgram STT/TTS e síntese de voz ElevenLabs","Desenvolvimento de agentes de voz de baixa latência com Vapi e LiveKit"],"ru":["Создание реальных приложений голоса с OpenAI Realtime API","Оптимизация качества аудио с использованием Deepgram STT/TTS и синтеза голоса ElevenLabs","Разработка агентов голоса с низкой задержкой с Vapi и LiveKit"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات صوتية في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام OpenAI Realtime API","تحسين جودة الصوت باستخدام Deepgram STT/TTS وتركيب الصوت ElevenLabs","تطوير وكلاء صوت منخفض التأخير باستخدام Vapi و LiveKit"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in latency budgeting and audio quality enhancement","Dependent on provider APIs such as OpenAI and Deepgram","Optimization for perceived responsiveness is crucial"],"zh":["需要延迟预算和音频质量增强的专业知识","依赖于提供商的API，如OpenAI和Deepgram","感知响应性的优化至关重要"],"ja":["待ち時間予算とオーディオ品質の向上に特化した専門知識が必要","OpenAIやDeepgramなどのプロバイダーのAPIに依存している","感知されたレスポンスの最適化が重要"],"ko":["대기 시간 예산 및 오디오 품질 향상에 전문적인 지식이 필요합니다.","OpenAI 및 Deepgram 같은 공급자 API에 의존합니다.","지각된 응답성 최적화가 중요합니다."],"es":["Requiere experiencia en presupuestos de latencia y mejora de la calidad de audio","Dependiente de las API de los proveedores como OpenAI y Deepgram","La optimización de la respuesta percibida es crucial"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en budgets de latence et en amélioration de la qualité audio","Dépendante des API des fournisseurs tels que OpenAI et Deepgram","L''optimisation de la réactivité perçue est cruciale"],"de":["Erfordert Erfahrung in der Latenzbudgetierung und der Verbesserung der Audioqualität","Abhängig von den APIs der Anbieter wie OpenAI und Deepgram","Die Optimierung der wahrgenommenen Reaktionsfähigkeit ist von entscheidender Bedeutung"],"pt":["Exige especialização em orçamento de latência e melhoria da qualidade de áudio","Dependente de APIs de provedores como OpenAI e Deepgram","Otimização para responsividade percebida é crucial"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в бюджете задержки и улучшении качества аудио","Зависит от API поставщиков, таких как OpenAI и Deepgram","Оптимизация для воспринимаемой отзывчивости имеет решающее значение"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في ميزانية التأخير وتحسين جودة الصوت","يعتمد على واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المقدمة من مزودي الخدمات مثل OpenAI و Deepgram","تحسين الاستجابة المتصورة أمر بالغ الأهمية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
