cisión de componente de servidor o cliente","Uso de useState, useEffect y controladores de eventos","Uso de la capa de datos para la recuperación de datos","Diseño de la interfaz de usuario con componentes de servidor y cliente"],"fr":["Utilisation de composants serveur et client","Principes pour le développement de la route de l''application","Décision de composant serveur ou client","Utilisation de useState, useEffect et gestionnaires d''événements","Utilisation de la couche de données pour la récupération de données","Conception de l''interface utilisateur avec des composants serveur et client"],"de":["Verwendung von Server- und Client-Komponenten","Prinzipien für die Entwicklung der Anwendungsroute","Entscheidung für Server- oder Client-Komponente","Verwendung von useState, useEffect und Ereignishandlern","Verwendung der Datenzugriffsschicht für die Datenerfassung","Entwurf der Benutzeroberfläche mit Server- und Client-Komponenten"],"pt":["Componentes do servidor e do cliente","Decisão de uso de componentes","Otimização de desempenho","Desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis","Uso de useState e useEffect"],"ru":["Серверные и клиентские компоненты","Принятие решений об использовании компонентов","Оптимизация производительности","Разработка масштабируемых приложений","Использование useState и useEffect"],"ar":["مكونات الخادم والعميل","قرار استخدام المكونات","تحسين الأداء","تطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسعة","استخدام useState و useEffect"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","最佳实践","应用程序路由器","服务器组件","客户端组件","性能优化","用户体验"],"ja":["Next.js","ベストプラクティス","アプリケーションルーター","サーバーコンポーネント","クライアントコンポーネント","パフォーマンス最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["Next.js","최적화 방법","애플리케이션 라우터","서버 컴포넌트","클라이언트 컴포넌트","성능 최적화","사용자 경험"],"es":["nextjs","desarrollo web","mejores prácticas","componentes de servidor","componentes de cliente","ruta de la aplicación","useState","useEffect","controladores de eventos"],"fr":["nextjs","développement web","bonnes pratiques","composants serveur","composants client","route de l''application","useState","useEffect","gestionnaires d''événements"],"de":["nextjs","webentwicklung","best practices","server-komponenten","client-komponenten","anwendungsroute","useState","useEffect","ereignishandler"],"pt":["Next.js","Práticas recomendadas","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Componentes do servidor","Componentes do cliente","Otimização de desempenho","Desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis"],"ru":["Next.js","Лучшие практики","Разработка приложений","Серверные компоненты","Клиентские компоненты","Оптимизация производительности","Разработка масштабируемых приложений"],"ar":["Next.js","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير التطبيقات","مكونات الخادم","مكونات العميل","تحسين الأداء","تطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسعة"]}},"owner":"JohnMarkCapones","repo":"Aralify","repoPath":"JohnMarkCapones/Aralify","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nextjs-best-practices","description":"Next.js App Router principles. Server Components, data fetching, routing patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles for Next.js App Router development.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Server vs Client Components\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nDoes it need...?\n│\n├── useState, useEffect, event handlers\n│   └── Client Component (''use client'')\n│\n├── Direct data fetching, no interactivity\n│   └── Server Component (default)\n│\n└── Both? \n    └── Split: Server parent + Client child\n```\n\n### By Default\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, layout, static content |\n| **Client** | Form","body":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles for Next.js App Router development.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Server vs Client Components\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nDoes it need...?\n│\n├── useState, useEffect, event handlers\n│   └── Client Component (''use client'')\n│\n├── Direct data fetching, no interactivity\n│   └── Server Component (default)\n│\n└── Both? \n    └── Split: Server parent + Client child\n```\n\n### By Default\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, layout, static content |\n| **Client** | Forms, buttons, interactive UI |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Data Fetching Patterns\n\n### Fetch Strategy\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| **Default** | Static (cached at build) |\n| **Revalidate** | ISR (time-based refresh) |\n| **No-store** | Dynamic (every request) |\n\n### Data Flow\n\n| Source | Pattern |\n|--------|---------|\n| Database | Server Component fetch |\n| API | fetch with caching |\n| User input | Client state + server action |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Routing Principles\n\n### File Conventions\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `page.tsx` | Route UI |\n| `layout.tsx` | Shared layout |\n| `loading.tsx` | Loading state |\n| `error.tsx` | Error boundary |\n| `not-found.tsx` | 404 page |\n\n### Route Organization\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Route groups `(name)` | Organize without URL |\n| Parallel routes `@slot` | Multiple same-level pages |\n| Intercepting `(.)` | Modal overlays |\n\n---\n\n## 4. API Routes\n\n### Route Handlers\n\n| Method | Use |\n|--------|-----|\n| GET | Read data |\n| POST | Create data |\n| PUT/PATCH | Update data |\n| DELETE | Remove data |\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Validate input with Zod\n- Return proper status codes\n- Handle errors gracefully\n- Use Edge runtime when possible\n\n---\n\n## 5. Performance Principles\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n- Use next/image component\n- Set priority for above-fold\n- Provide blur placeholder\n- Use responsive sizes\n\n### Bundle Optimization\n\n- Dynamic imports for heavy components\n- Route-based code splitting (automatic)\n- Analyze with bundle analyzer\n\n---\n\n## 6. Metadata\n\n### Static vs Dynamic\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Static export | Fixed metadata |\n| generateMetadata | Dynamic per-route |\n\n### Essential Tags\n\n- title (50-60 chars)\n- description (150-160 chars)\n- Open Graph images\n- Canonical URL\n\n---\n\n## 7. Caching Strategy\n\n### Cache Layers\n\n| Layer | Control |\n|-------|---------|\n| Request | fetch options |\n| Data | revalidate/tags |\n| Full route | route config |\n\n### Revalidation\n\n| Method | Use |\n|--------|-----|\n| Time-based | `revalidate: 60` |\n| On-demand | `revalidatePath/Tag` |\n| No cache | `no-store` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Server Actions\n\n### Use Cases\n\n- Form submissions\n- Data mutations\n- Revalidation triggers\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Mark with ''use server''\n- Validate all inputs\n- Return typed responses\n- Handle errors\n\n---\n\n## 9. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| ''use client'' everywhere | Server by default |\n| Fetch in client components | Fetch in server |\n| Skip loading states | Use loading.tsx |\n| Ignore error boundaries | Use error.tsx |\n| Large client bundles | Dynamic imports |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Project Structure\n\n```\napp/\n├── (marketing)/     # Route group\n│   └── page.tsx\n├── (dashboard)/\n│   ├── layout.tsx   # Dashboard layout\n│   └── page.tsx\n├── api/\n│   └── [resource]/\n│       └── route.ts\n└── components/\n    └── ui/\n```\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Server Components are the default for a reason. Start there, add client only when needed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:19:23.840Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Next.js App Router development and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Next.js 应用路由开发和优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"Next.js アプリケーション ルーターの開発と最適化の高度な機能が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Next.js 애플리케이션 라우터 개발 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de desarrollo y optimización de Next.js App Router.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités avancées de développement et d''optimisation de Next.js App Router.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte Next.js App Router-Entwicklungs- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento e otimização do Next.js App Router.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности разработки и оптимизации Next.js App Router.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى возможات متقدمة لتنمية وتحسين Next.js App Router."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop scalable Next.js applications using Server and Client Components, with capabilities for direct data fetching, state management, and event handling using useState, useEffect, and App Router principles.","zh":"赋予代理开发可扩展的 Next.js 应用程序的能力，使用服务器和客户端组件，具有直接数据获取、状态管理和事件处理的能力，使用 useState、useEffect 和应用程序路由器原则。","ja":"Server Components と Client Components を使用して、useState、useEffect、App Router の原則を使用して直接データ取得、状態管理、イベント処理を行うようにエージェントに権限を与え、拡張可能な Next.js アプリケーションを開発します。","ko":"에이전트가 useState, useEffect 및 앱 라우터 원칙을 사용하여 직접 데이터 가져오기, 상태 관리 및 이벤트 처리를 수행할 수 있는 서버 컴포넌트와 클라이언트 컴포넌트를 사용하여 확장 가능한 Next.js 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones Next.js escalables utilizando Componentes de servidor y cliente, con capacidades para la obtención directa de datos, gestión de estado y manejo de eventos utilizando useState, useEffect y principios de App Router.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications Next.js évolutives en utilisant des composants serveur et client, avec des capacités pour la récupération directe de données, la gestion d''état et la gestion d''événements en utilisant useState, useEffect et les principes de App Router.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, skalierbare Next.js-Anwendungen mit Server- und Clientkomponenten zu entwickeln, mit Funktionen für die direkte Datenabruf, Statusverwaltung und Ereignisbehandlung unter Verwendung von useState, useEffect und App Router-Prinzipien.","pt":"Permite que os agentes desenvolvam aplicações Next.js escaláveis usando Componentes de Servidor e Cliente, com capacidades para busca de dados direta, gerenciamento de estado e tratamento de eventos usando useState, useEffect e princípios do App Router.","ru":"Позволяет агентам разрабатывать масштабируемые приложения Next.js, используя компоненты сервера и клиента, с возможностями прямой выборки данных, управления состоянием и обработки событий с использованием useState, useEffect и принципов App Router.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تطوير تطبيقات Next.js قابلة للتوسع باستخدام مكونات الخادم والعميل، مع إمكانيات لاسترجاع البيانات المباشر وإدارة الحالة ومعالجة الأحداث باستخدام useState و useEffect ومبادئ App Router."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing server-side rendering for static content","Implementing client-side interactivity with useState and useEffect","Splitting components for hybrid server-client functionality"],"zh":["为静态内容优化服务器端渲染","使用 useState 和 useEffect 实现客户端交互性","将组件拆分为混合服务器-客户端功能"],"ja":["静的コンテンツのサーバーサイドレンダリングを最適化する","useState と useEffect を使用してクライアントサイドのインタラクティブ性を実現する","コンポーネントをサーバーとクライアントの両方の機能を持つハイドリッド機能に分割する"],"ko":["정적 콘텐츠를 위한 서버측 렌더링 최적화","useState 및 useEffect를 사용한 클라이언트측 상호작용 구현","하이브리드 서버-클라이언트 기능을 위한 컴포넌트 분할"],"es":["Optimización de la representación del lado del servidor para contenido estático","Implementación de interactividad del lado del cliente con useState y useEffect","División de componentes para funcionalidad híbrida servidor-cliente"],"fr":["Optimisation du rendu côté serveur pour le contenu statique","Mise en œuvre de l''interactivité côté client avec useState et useEffect","Division des composants pour une fonctionnalité hybride serveur-client"],"de":["Optimierung der Server-seitigen Rendering für statischen Inhalt","Implementierung der Client-seitigen Interaktivität mit useState und useEffect","Aufteilung von Komponenten für hybride Server-Client-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Otimização do renderização do lado do servidor para conteúdo estático","Implementação de interatividade do lado do cliente com useState e useEffect","Divisão de componentes para funcionalidade híbrida servidor-cliente"],"ru":["Оптимизация серверной отрисовки для статического контента","Реализация клиентской интерактивности с помощью useState и useEffect","Разделение компонентов для гибридной функциональности сервера и клиента"],"ar":["تحسين عرض الخادم لل내용 الثابت","تنفيذ التفاعل على сторة العميل باستخدام useState و useEffect","تقسيم المكونات لوظيفة هجينة للخادم والعميل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js framework","Limited to React-based applications"],"zh":["需要 Next.js 框架","仅限于基于 React 的应用程序"],"ja":["Next.js フレームワークが必要","React ベースのアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["Next.js 프레임워크 필요","리액트 기반 애플리케이션만 해당"],"es":["Requiere el framework Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en React"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Next.js","Limité aux applications basées sur React"],"de":["Benötigt das Next.js-Framework","Begrenzt auf React-basierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige estrutura Next.js","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em React"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Next.js","Ограничен для приложений на основе React"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات المبنية على React"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Industrial/streamweave-attractor/architecture-patterns', 'community', 'Industrial', 'streamweave-attractor', 'Industrial/streamweave-attractor', 'architecture-patterns', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:19:33.095Z', NULL, '{"id":"Industrial/streamweave-attractor/architecture-patterns","name":"architecture-patterns","description":{"zh":"后端架构模式用于构建可维护、可测试和可扩展的系统","ja":"バックエンドアーキテクチャパターンは、メンテナンス可能、テスト可能、スケーラブルなシステムを構築するために使用されます","ko":"백엔드 아키텍처 패턴은 유지 보수 가능, 테스트 가능, 확장 가능한 시스템을 구축하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Los patrones de arquitectura te permiten diseñar sistemas de backend mantenibles, testables y escalables.","fr":"Les modèles d''architecture vous permettent de concevoir des systèmes de backend maintenables, testables et évolutifs.","de":"Architekturmuster ermöglichen es Ihnen, wartbare, testbare und skalierbare Backend-Systeme zu entwerfen.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"后端架构模式","ja":"バックエンドアーキテクチャパターン","ko":"백엔드 아키텍처 패턴","es":"Patrones de Arquitectura: Diseña Sistemas Escalables","fr":"Modèles d''Architecture: Conception de Systèmes Évolutifs","de":"Architekturmuster: Entwurf von Skalierbaren Systemen","en":"architecture-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"后端架构模式用于构建可维护、可测试和可扩展的系统","ja":"バックエンドアーキテクチャパターンは、メンテナンス可能、テスト可能、スケーラブルなシステムを構築するために使用されます","ko":"백엔드 아키텍처 패턴은 유지 보수 가능, 테스트 가능, 확장 가능한 시스템을 구축하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Los patrones de arquitectura te permiten diseñar sistemas de backend mantenibles, testables y escalables.","fr":"Les modèles d''architecture vous permettent de concevoir des systèmes de backend maintenables, testables et évolutifs.","de":"Architekturmuster ermöglichen es Ihnen, wartbare, testbare und skalierbare Backend-Systeme zu entwerfen.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","可维护性","可测试性","可扩展性"],"ja":["Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","メンテナンス可能","テスト可能","スケーラブル"],"ko":["Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","유지 보수 가능","테스트 가능","확장 가능"],"es":["Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","Diseño de sistemas mantenibles","Refactorización de aplicaciones monolíticas","Establecimiento de estándares de arquitectura"],"fr":["Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","Conception de systèmes maintenables","Réfactorisation d''applications monolithiques","Établissement de normes d''architecture"],"de":["Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","Entwurf von wartbaren Systemen","Refaktorisierung von monolithischen Anwendungen","Festlegung von Architekturstandards"]},"keywords":{"zh":["后端架构模式","Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","可维护性","可测试性","可扩展性","系统设计"],"ja":["バックエンドアーキテクチャパターン","Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","メンテナンス可能","テスト可能","スケーラブル","システム設計"],"ko":["백엔드 아키텍처 패턴","Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","유지 보수 가능","테스트 가능","확장 가능","시스템 디자인"],"es":["patrones de arquitectura","diseño de backend","sistemas escalables","Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","arquitectura de software","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["modèles d''architecture","conception de backend","systèmes évolutifs","Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","architecture logicielle","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Architekturmuster","Backend-Entwurf","skalierbare Systeme","Clean Architecture","Hexagonal Architecture","Domain-Driven Design","Softwarearchitektur","Softwareentwicklung"]}},"owner":"Industrial","repo":"streamweave-attractor","repoPath":"Industrial/streamweave-attractor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architecture-patterns","description":"Implement proven backend architecture patterns including Clean Architecture, Hexagonal Architecture, and Domain-Driven Design. Use when architecting complex backend systems or refactoring existing applications for better maintainability.","bodyPreview":"# Architecture Patterns\n\nMaster proven backend architecture patterns including Clean Architecture, Hexagonal Architecture, and Domain-Driven Design to build maintainable, testable, and scalable systems.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Designing new backend systems from scratch\n- Refactoring monolithic applications for better maintainability\n- Establishing architecture standards for your team\n- Migrating from tightly coupled to loosely coupled architectures\n- Implementing domain-driven design principl","body":"# Architecture Patterns\n\nMaster proven backend architecture patterns including Clean Architecture, Hexagonal Architecture, and Domain-Driven Design to build maintainable, testable, and scalable systems.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Designing new backend systems from scratch\n- Refactoring monolithic applications for better maintainability\n- Establishing architecture standards for your team\n- Migrating from tightly coupled to loosely coupled architectures\n- Implementing domain-driven design principles\n- Creating testable and mockable codebases\n- Planning microservices decomposition\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need small, localized refactors\n- The system is primarily frontend with no backend architecture changes\n- You need implementation details without architectural design\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Clarify domain boundaries, constraints, and scalability targets.\n2. Select an architecture pattern that fits the domain complexity.\n3. Define module boundaries, interfaces, and dependency rules.\n4. Provide migration steps and validation checks.\n\nRefer to `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns, checklists, and templates.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns, checklists, and templates.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:19:33.095Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Software Architecture Agents requiring expertise in Clean Architecture, Hexagonal Architecture, and Domain-Driven Design for scalable systems.","zh":"适用于需要在Clean Architecture、Hexagonal Architecture和Domain-Driven Design方面拥有专长的软件架构代理，特别是对于可扩展系统。","ja":"Clean Architecture、Hexagonal Architecture、Domain-Driven Designを必要とするソフトウェアアーキテクチャエージェントに適しています。特にスケーラブルなシステムのための専門知識が必要です。","ko":"Clean Architecture, Hexagonal Architecture 및 Domain-Driven Design에 대한 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 소프트웨어 아키텍처 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 확장 가능한 시스템을 위한 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitectura de Software que requieren experiencia en Arquitectura Limpia, Arquitectura Hexagonal y Diseño Dirigido por Dominio para sistemas escalables.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Architecture Logicielle nécessitant une expertise en Architecture Propre, Architecture Hexagonale et Conception Dirigée par le Domaine pour des systèmes évolutifs.","de":"Ideal für Software-Architektur-Agenten, die Expertenwissen in Clean Architecture, Hexagonaler Architektur und Domain-Driven Design für skalierbare Systeme benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitetura de Software que exigem especialização em Arquitetura Limpa, Arquitetura Hexagonal e Projeto Orientado a Domínio para sistemas escaláveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов программной архитектуры, требующих опыта в области Чистой Архитектуры, Гексагональной Архитектуры и Domain-Driven Design для масштабируемых систем.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء معماريي البرمجيات الذين يطلبون الخبرة في الهندسة المعمارية النظيفة والهندسة السداسية والتصميم الموجه للنطاق من أجل النظم القابلة للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design maintainable, testable, and scalable backend systems using proven architecture patterns, including implementing domain-driven design principles and establishing architecture standards for teams, leveraging Clean Architecture and Hexagonal Architecture for loosely coupled systems.","zh":"赋予代理设计可维护、可测试和可扩展的后端系统的能力，使用已证实的架构模式，包括实施领域驱动设计原则和为团队建立架构标准，利用Clean Architecture和Hexagonal Architecture实现松散耦合的系统。","ja":"設計可能、テスト可能、スケーラブルなバックエンドシステムを設計するエージェントの能力を付与します。検証済みのアーキテクチャパターンを使用し、ドメイン駆動設計の原則を実施し、チームのためのアーキテクチャ標準を確立します。Clean ArchitectureとHexagonal Architectureを使用して疎結合システムを実現します。","ko":"유지 관리가 가능하고 테스트가 가능하며 확장 가능한 백엔드 시스템을 설계할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. 검증된 아키텍처 패턴을 사용하고 도메인 주도 설계 원칙을 구현하며 팀을 위한 아키텍처 표준을 설정합니다. Clean Architecture와 Hexagonal Architecture를 사용하여 느슨하게 결합된 시스템을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar sistemas backend mantenibles, probables y escalables utilizando patrones de arquitectura comprobados, incluyendo la implementación de principios de diseño dirigido por dominio y el establecimiento de estándares de arquitectura para equipos, aprovechando la Arquitectura Limpia y la Arquitectura Hexagonal para sistemas acoplados sueltamente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des systèmes backend maintenables, testables et évolutifs en utilisant des modèles d''architecture éprouvés, notamment en mettant en œuvre des principes de conception dirigée par le domaine et en établissant des normes d''architecture pour les équipes, en exploitant l''Architecture Propre et l''Architecture Hexagonale pour des systèmes dépendants librement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, wartbare, testbare und skalierbare Backend-Systeme unter Verwendung bewährter Architekturmuster zu entwerfen, einschließlich der Implementierung von Prinzipien des Domain-Driven Design und der Etablierung von Architekturstandards für Teams, indem Clean Architecture und Hexagonale Architektur für lose gekoppelte Systeme genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar sistemas de backend mantidos, testáveis e escaláveis usando padrões de arquitetura comprovados, incluindo a implementação de princípios de design orientado a domínio e o estabelecimento de padrões de arquitetura para equipes, aproveitando a Arquitetura Limpa e a Arquitetura Hexagonal para sistemas acoplados soltos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать поддерживаемые, тестируемые и масштабируемые бэкэнд-системы с использованием проверенных шаблонов архитектуры, включая реализацию принципов Domain-Driven Design и установление стандартов архитектуры для команд, используя Чистую Архитектуру и Гексагональную Архитектуру для слабо связанных систем.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم أنظمة خلفية قابلة للصيانة وقابلة للاختبار وقابلة للتوسيع باستخدام أنماط معمارية مثبتة، بما في ذلك تنفيذ مبادئ تصميم موجه للنطاق وإنشاء معايير معمارية للفرق، باستخدام الهندسة المعمارية النظيفة والهندسة السداسية من أجل أنظمة منفصلة بشكل مت 느ن."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new backend systems from scratch with scalable architecture","Refactoring monolithic applications for better maintainability using Domain-Driven Design","Establishing architecture standards for development teams with Clean Architecture"],"zh":["使用可扩展的架构从头开始设计新的后端系统","使用Domain-Driven Design重构单体应用程序以提高维护性","使用Clean Architecture为开发团队建立架构标准"],"ja":["スケーラブルなアーキテクチャを使用して新しいバックエンドシステムを設計する","ドメイン駆動設計を使用してモノリシックアプリケーションをリファクタリングしてメンテナンス性を向上させる","Clean Architectureを使用して開発チームのためのアーキテクチャ標準を確立する"],"ko":["확장 가능한 아키텍처를 사용하여 새로운 백엔드 시스템을 설계하는 것","도메인 주도 설계를 사용하여 모놀리식 응용 프로그램을 리팩토링하여 유지 보수성을 향상시키는 것","Clean Architecture를 사용하여 개발 팀을 위한 아키텍처 표준을 설정하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar nuevos sistemas backend desde cero con arquitectura escalable","Reestructurar aplicaciones monolíticas para una mejor mantenibilidad utilizando Diseño Dirigido por Dominio","Establecer estándares de arquitectura para equipos de desarrollo con Arquitectura Limpia"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux systèmes backend à partir de zéro avec une architecture évutive","Réaménager des applications monolithiques pour une meilleure maintenabilité en utilisant la Conception Dirigée par le Domaine","Établir des normes d''architecture pour les équipes de développement avec l''Architecture Propre"],"de":["Neue Backend-Systeme von Grund auf mit skalierbarer Architektur entwerfen","Monolithische Anwendungen für bessere Wartbarkeit unter Verwendung von Domain-Driven Design neu strukturieren","Architekturstandards für Entwicklungsteams mit Clean Architecture etablieren"],"pt":["Projetar novos sistemas de backend do zero com arquitetura escalável","Reestruturar aplicações monolíticas para melhor manutenibilidade usando Projeto Orientado a Domínio","Estabelecer padrões de arquitetura para equipes de desenvolvimento com Arquitetura Limpa"],"ru":["Проектировать новые бэкэнд-системы с нуля с масштабируемой архитектурой","Рефакторинг монолитных приложений для лучшей поддерживаемости с помощью Domain-Driven Design","Установление стандартов архитектуры для команд разработки с помощью Чистой Архитектуры"],"ar":["تصميم أنظمة خلفية جديدة من الصفر مع هندسة قابلة للتوسيع","إعادة هيكلة التطبيقات أحادية القطعة لتحسين الصيانة باستخدام تصميم موجه للنطاق","إنشاء معايير هندسية للفرق التطويرية باستخدام الهندسة المعمارية النظيفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of software development principles","Focused on backend architecture patterns only"],"zh":["需要软件开发原则的知识","仅关注后端架构模式"],"ja":["ソフトウェア開発の原則の知識が必要","バックエンドアーキテクチャパターンにのみ焦点を当てている"],"ko":["소프트웨어 개발 원리의 지식이 필요","백엔드 아키텍처 패턴에만 초점을 맞추고 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de principios de desarrollo de software","Se centra solo en patrones de arquitectura de backend"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en principes de développement de logiciels","Se concentre uniquement sur les modèles d''architecture de backend"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Software-Entwicklungsprinzipien","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf Backend-Architekturmuster"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de princípios de desenvolvimento de software","Focado apenas em padrões de arquitetura de backend"],"ru":["Требует знания принципов разработки программного обеспечения","Сосредоточен только на шаблонах бэкэнд-архитектуры"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمبادئ تطوير البرمجيات","يركز فقط على أنماط هندسة الخلفية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
