ez les meilleures pratiques pour développer des applications Next.js avec notre ensemble de principes pour App Router","de":"Erfahren Sie die besten Praktiken für die Entwicklung von Next.js-Anwendungen mit unserem Satz von Grundsätzen für App Router","pt":"Desenvolva aplicativos Next.js com as melhores práticas, incluindo a decisão entre componentes do servidor e do cliente","ru":"Разрабатывайте приложения Next.js с лучшими практиками, включая выбор между серверными и клиентскими компонентами","ar":"طور تطبيقات Next.js مع أفضل الممارسات، بما في ذلك الاختيار بين مكونات الخادم والعميل","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["服务器和客户端组件的区别","组件的选择和使用","性能优化","可维护性提高","最佳实践指南"],"ja":["サーバーとクライアントコンポーネントの違い","コンポーネントの選択と使用","パフォーマンス最適化","メンテナンス性の向上","ベストプラクティスガイド"],"ko":["서버와 클라이언트 구성 요소의 차이점","구성 요소의 선택과 사용","성능 최적화","유지 보수성 향상","최고의 실천 방법 가이드"],"es":["Diferenciación entre componentes del servidor y del cliente","Uso de useState, useEffect y controladores de eventos","Optimización de la carga de datos y el rendimiento","Desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables y eficientes","Uso de App Router para la navegación y la estructura de la aplicación"],"fr":["Différenciation entre les composants serveur et client","Utilisation de useState, useEffect et gestionnaires d''événements","Optimisation du chargement de données et des performances","Développement d''applications évolutives et efficientes","Utilisation d''App Router pour la navigation et la structure de l''application"],"de":["Unterscheidung zwischen Server- und Client-Komponenten","Verwendung von useState, useEffect und Ereignishandlern","Optimierung der Datenladung und Leistung","Entwicklung von skalierbaren und effizienten Anwendungen","Verwendung von App Router für die Navigation und Struktur der Anwendung"],"pt":["Decisão entre componentes do servidor e do cliente","Uso de componentes do servidor para fetching de dados","Uso de componentes do cliente para interatividade","Divisão de componentes em servidor e cliente","Otimização do desempenho com o App Router"],"ru":["Выбор между серверными и клиентскими компонентами","Использование серверных компонентов для получения данных","Использование клиентских компонентов для интерактивности","Разделение компонентов на серверные и клиентские","Оптимизация производительности с App Router"],"ar":["اختيار بين مكونات الخادم والعميل","استخدام مكونات الخادم لاسترجاع البيانات","استخدام مكونات العميل للتفاعل","تقسيم المكونات بين الخادم والعميل","تحسين الأداء باستخدام App Router"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","服务器组件","客户端组件","性能优化","可维护性","最佳实践"],"ja":["Next.js","サーバーコンポーネント","クライアントコンポーネント","パフォーマンス最適化","メンテナンス性","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Next.js","서버 구성 요소","클라이언트 구성 요소","성능 최적화","유지 보수성","최고의 실천 방법"],"es":["Next.js","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","App Router","componentes del servidor","componentes del cliente","optimización del rendimiento"],"fr":["Next.js","meilleures pratiques","développement d''applications","App Router","composants serveur","composants client","optimisation des performances"],"de":["Next.js","beste Praktiken","Anwendungsentwicklung","App Router","Server-Komponenten","Client-Komponenten","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Next.js","App Router","componentes do servidor","componentes do cliente","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","melhores práticas","otimização do desempenho"],"ru":["Next.js","App Router","серверные компоненты","клиентские компоненты","разработка приложений","лучшие практики","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["Next.js","App Router","مكونات الخادم","مكونات العميل","تطوير التطبيقات","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nextjs-best-practices","description":"Next.js App Router principles. Server Components, data fetching, routing patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles for Next.js App Router development.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Server vs Client Components\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nDoes it need...?\n│\n├── useState, useEffect, event handlers\n│   └── Client Component (''use client'')\n│\n├── Direct data fetching, no interactivity\n│   └── Server Component (default)\n│\n└── Both? \n    └── Split: Server parent + Client child\n```\n\n### By Default\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, layout, static content |\n| **Client** | Form","body":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles for Next.js App Router development.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Server vs Client Components\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nDoes it need...?\n│\n├── useState, useEffect, event handlers\n│   └── Client Component (''use client'')\n│\n├── Direct data fetching, no interactivity\n│   └── Server Component (default)\n│\n└── Both? \n    └── Split: Server parent + Client child\n```\n\n### By Default\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, layout, static content |\n| **Client** | Forms, buttons, interactive UI |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Data Fetching Patterns\n\n### Fetch Strategy\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| **Default** | Static (cached at build) |\n| **Revalidate** | ISR (time-based refresh) |\n| **No-store** | Dynamic (every request) |\n\n### Data Flow\n\n| Source | Pattern |\n|--------|---------|\n| Database | Server Component fetch |\n| API | fetch with caching |\n| User input | Client state + server action |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Routing Principles\n\n### File Conventions\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `page.tsx` | Route UI |\n| `layout.tsx` | Shared layout |\n| `loading.tsx` | Loading state |\n| `error.tsx` | Error boundary |\n| `not-found.tsx` | 404 page |\n\n### Route Organization\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Route groups `(name)` | Organize without URL |\n| Parallel routes `@slot` | Multiple same-level pages |\n| Intercepting `(.)` | Modal overlays |\n\n---\n\n## 4. API Routes\n\n### Route Handlers\n\n| Method | Use |\n|--------|-----|\n| GET | Read data |\n| POST | Create data |\n| PUT/PATCH | Update data |\n| DELETE | Remove data |\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Validate input with Zod\n- Return proper status codes\n- Handle errors gracefully\n- Use Edge runtime when possible\n\n---\n\n## 5. Performance Principles\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n- Use next/image component\n- Set priority for above-fold\n- Provide blur placeholder\n- Use responsive sizes\n\n### Bundle Optimization\n\n- Dynamic imports for heavy components\n- Route-based code splitting (automatic)\n- Analyze with bundle analyzer\n\n---\n\n## 6. Metadata\n\n### Static vs Dynamic\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Static export | Fixed metadata |\n| generateMetadata | Dynamic per-route |\n\n### Essential Tags\n\n- title (50-60 chars)\n- description (150-160 chars)\n- Open Graph images\n- Canonical URL\n\n---\n\n## 7. Caching Strategy\n\n### Cache Layers\n\n| Layer | Control |\n|-------|---------|\n| Request | fetch options |\n| Data | revalidate/tags |\n| Full route | route config |\n\n### Revalidation\n\n| Method | Use |\n|--------|-----|\n| Time-based | `revalidate: 60` |\n| On-demand | `revalidatePath/Tag` |\n| No cache | `no-store` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Server Actions\n\n### Use Cases\n\n- Form submissions\n- Data mutations\n- Revalidation triggers\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Mark with ''use server''\n- Validate all inputs\n- Return typed responses\n- Handle errors\n\n---\n\n## 9. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| ''use client'' everywhere | Server by default |\n| Fetch in client components | Fetch in server |\n| Skip loading states | Use loading.tsx |\n| Ignore error boundaries | Use error.tsx |\n| Large client bundles | Dynamic imports |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Project Structure\n\n```\napp/\n├── (marketing)/     # Route group\n│   └── page.tsx\n├── (dashboard)/\n│   ├── layout.tsx   # Dashboard layout\n│   └── page.tsx\n├── api/\n│   └── [resource]/\n│       └── route.ts\n└── components/\n    └── ui/\n```\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Server Components are the default for a reason. Start there, add client only when needed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:19:24.169Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing expertise in Next.js App Router development and optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Next.js 应用程序路由开发和优化方面拥有专业知识的前端代理。","ja":"Next.js アプリケーション ルーター開発および最適化の専門知識が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Next.js 애플리케이션 라우터 개발 및 최적화에 전문 지식이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan experiencia en desarrollo y optimización de Next.js App Router.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend qui ont besoin d''expertise dans le développement et l''optimisation de Next.js App Router.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die Erfahrung in der Entwicklung und Optimierung von Next.js App Router benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de especialização no desenvolvimento e otimização do Next.js App Router.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы знания в области разработки и оптимизации Next.js App Router.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في تطوير وتنقيح Next.js App Router."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop scalable and performant Next.js applications by applying best practices for Server and Client Components, utilizing techniques such as direct data fetching and splitting components for interactivity, all while leveraging the App Router for efficient routing and data management.","zh":"通过应用服务器和客户端组件的最佳实践，利用直接数据获取和拆分组件以实现交互性等技术，赋予代理开发可扩展和高性能的 Next.js 应用程序的能力，同时利用应用程序路由器实现高效的路由和数据管理。","ja":"サーバーとクライアントコンポーネントのベストプラクティスを適用し、直接データ取得やコンポーネントの分割によるインタラクティブ性などを使用して、Next.js アプリケーション ルーターを利用した効率的なルーティングとデータ管理を実現し、拡張性とパフォーマンスの高い Next.js アプリケーションを開発できる力をエージェントに与えます。","ko":"서버 및 클라이언트 컴포넌트에 대한 모범 사례를 적용하고 직접 데이터 가져오기 및 컴포넌트 분할을 통한 상호 작용성 등과 같은 기술을 사용하여 애플리케이션 라우터를 사용한 효율적인 라우팅 및 데이터 관리를 통해 확장 가능하고 고성능의 Next.js 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones Next.js escalables y de alto rendimiento aplicando las mejores prácticas para componentes de servidor y cliente, utilizando técnicas como la recuperación de datos directa y la división de componentes para la interactividad, todo mientras aprovecha el App Router para una enrutamiento y gestión de datos eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications Next.js évolutives et performantes en appliquant les meilleures pratiques pour les composants serveur et client, en utilisant des techniques telles que la récupération directe de données et la division de composants pour l''interactivité, le tout en exploitant le App Router pour un routage et une gestion de données efficaces.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Next.js-Anwendungen zu entwickeln, die skalierbar und leistungsstark sind, indem sie bewährte Verfahren für Server- und Client-Komponenten anwenden, Techniken wie direktes Datenabrufen und Komponentenaufteilung für Interaktivität verwenden und gleichzeitig den App Router für effizientes Routing und Datenmanagement nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicações Next.js escaláveis e de alto desempenho, aplicando as melhores práticas para Componentes de Servidor e Cliente, utilizando técnicas como busca de dados direta e divisão de componentes para interatividade, aproveitando ao máximo o App Router para roteamento e gerenciamento de dados eficientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать масштабируемые и производительные приложения Next.js, применяя лучшие практики для компонентов сервера и клиента, используя такие техники, как прямая выборка данных и разделение компонентов для интерактивности, все это при помощи App Router для эффективного маршрутизации и управления данными.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطوير تطبيقات Next.js قابلة للتطوير وأداء عالي من خلال تطبيق أفضل الممارسات لمكونات الخادم والعميل، واستخدام تقنيات مثل استرجاع البيانات المباشر وتقسيم المكونات للتفاعل، مع الاستفادة القصوى من App Router لتنظيم المسارات وإدارة البيانات بفعالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing Next.js application performance by strategically using Server and Client Components","Implementing efficient data fetching strategies using the App Router","Architecting scalable Next.js applications with modular, reusable components"],"zh":["通过战略性地使用服务器和客户端组件来优化 Next.js 应用程序性能","使用应用程序路由器实现高效的数据获取策略","使用模块化、可重用的组件来架构可扩展的 Next.js 应用程序"],"ja":["サーバーとクライアントコンポーネントを戦略的に使用して Next.js アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する","アプリケーション ルーターを使用して効率的なデータ取得戦略を実装する","モジュラーで再利用可能なコンポーネントを使用して拡張可能な Next.js アプリケーションを設計する"],"ko":["서버 및 클라이언트 컴포넌트를 전략적으로 사용하여 Next.js 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 것","애플리케이션 라우터를 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 가져오기 전략을 구현하는 것","모듈화 및 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트를 사용하여 확장 가능한 Next.js 애플리케이션을 설계하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de las aplicaciones Next.js mediante el uso estratégico de componentes de servidor y cliente","Implementar estrategias de recuperación de datos eficientes utilizando el App Router","Diseñar aplicaciones Next.js escalables con componentes modulares y reutilizables"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances des applications Next.js en utilisant de manière stratégique les composants serveur et client","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de récupération de données efficaces en utilisant le App Router","Concevoir des applications Next.js évolutives avec des composants modulaires et réutilisables"],"de":["Die Leistung von Next.js-Anwendungen optimieren, indem Server- und Client-Komponenten strategisch eingesetzt werden","Effiziente Datenabrufstrategien mit dem App Router implementieren","Skalierbare Next.js-Anwendungen mit modularen, wiederverwendbaren Komponenten entwerfen"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho da aplicação Next.js usando estrategicamente Componentes de Servidor e Cliente","Implementar estratégias de busca de dados eficientes usando o App Router","Arquitetar aplicações Next.js escaláveis com componentes modulares e reutilizáveis"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность приложения Next.js, стратегически используя компоненты сервера и клиента","Реализовать эффективные стратегии выборки данных, используя App Router","Проектировать масштабируемые приложения Next.js с модульными и многократно используемыми компонентами"],"ar":["تحسين أداء تطبيق Next.js من خلال استخدام استراتيجي لمكونات الخادم والعميل","تنفيذ استراتيجيات لاسترجاع البيانات بكفاءة باستخدام App Router","تصميم تطبيقات Next.js قابلة للتطوير باستخدام مكونات قابلة للتحديث والاستخدام المتكرر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Next.js fundamentals","Limited to Next.js framework","Dependent on App Router for routing and data management"],"zh":["需要了解 Next.js 基础知识","仅限 Next.js 框架","依赖于应用程序路由器进行路由和数据管理"],"ja":["Next.js の基礎知識を理解する必要がある","Next.js フレームワークのみに限定される","ルーティングとデータ管理にアプリケーション ルーターに依存する"],"ko":["Next.js 기본 지식을 이해해야 함","Next.js 프레임워크에만 محدود됨","라우팅 및 데이터 관리에 애플리케이션 라우터에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los conceptos básicos de Next.js","Limitado al marco de trabajo de Next.js","Dependiente del App Router para enrutamiento y gestión de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des notions de base de Next.js","Limité au framework Next.js","Dépendant du App Router pour le routage et la gestion de données"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für die Grundlagen von Next.js","Begrenzt auf das Next.js-Framework","Abhängig vom App Router für Routing und Datenmanagement"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos fundamentos do Next.js","Limitado ao framework Next.js","Dependente do App Router para roteamento e gerenciamento de dados"],"ru":["Требует понимания основ Next.js","Ограничен фреймворком Next.js","Зависит от App Router для маршрутизации и управления данными"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم أساسيات Next.js","محدود بإطار عمل Next.js","يعتمد على App Router لتنظيم المسارات وإدارة البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('thinhtt264/SnapletApp/gradle-build-performance', 'community', 'thinhtt264', 'SnapletApp', 'thinhtt264/SnapletApp', 'gradle-build-performance', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:20:10.812Z', NULL, '{"id":"thinhtt264/SnapletApp/gradle-build-performance","name":"gradle-build-performance","description":{"zh":"Gradle, ","ja":"Gradle","ko":"Gradle ","es":"Optimiza el rendimiento de compilación de Gradle para reducir los tiempos de compilación y mejorar la eficiencia del proyecto","fr":"Améliorez les performances de build Gradle pour réduire les temps de compilation et améliorer l''efficacité du projet","de":"Optimieren Sie die Gradle-Build-Performance, um die Build-Zeiten zu reduzieren und die Projekteffizienz zu verbessern","pt":"Otimização do desempenho de build do Gradle para desenvolvedores, incluindo dicas para reduzir tempos de build e melhorar a eficiência","ru":"Оптимизация производительности сборки Gradle для разработчиков, включая советы по снижению времени сборки и повышению эффективности","ar":"تحسين أداء بناء جرادل للمطورين، بما في ذلك نصائح لتقليل أوقات البناء وتحسين الكفاءة","en":"Locket Clone App using Kotlin Jetpack compose"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Gradle ","ja":"Gradle","ko":"Gradle ","es":"Mejora del rendimiento de compilación de Gradle","fr":"Améliorer les performances de build Gradle","de":"Gradle Build Performance Optimieren","pt":"Otimização de Desempenho de Build do Gradle","ru":"Оптимизация производительности сборки Gradle","ar":"تحسين أداء بناء جرادل","en":"gradle-build-performance"},"description":{"zh":"Gradle, ","ja":"Gradle","ko":"Gradle ","es":"Optimiza el rendimiento de compilación de Gradle para reducir los tiempos de compilación y mejorar la eficiencia del proyecto","fr":"Améliorez les performances de build Gradle pour réduire les temps de compilation et améliorer l''efficacité du projet","de":"Optimieren Sie die Gradle-Build-Performance, um die Build-Zeiten zu reduzieren und die Projekteffizienz zu verbessern","pt":"Otimização do desempenho de build do Gradle para desenvolvedores, incluindo dicas para reduzir tempos de build e melhorar a eficiência","ru":"Оптимизация производительности сборки Gradle для разработчиков, включая советы по снижению времени сборки и повышению эффективности","ar":"تحسين أداء بناء جرادل للمطورين، بما في ذلك نصائح لتقليل أوقات البناء وتحسين الكفاءة","en":"Locket Clone App using Kotlin Jetpack compose"},"definition":{"en":"Locket Clone App using Kotlin Jetpack compose"},"features":{"zh":["Gradle","CI/CD","Gradle","kapt/KSP","Gradle","Gradle"],"ja":["Gradle","CI/CD","Gradle","kapt/KSP","Gradle","Gradle"],"ko":["Gradle","CI/CD","Gradle","kapt/KSP","Gradle","Gradle"],"es":["Análisis de tiempos de compilación","Identificación de cuellos de botella","Optimización de la configuración de Gradle","Reducir la recompilación innecesaria","Depuración de procesamiento de anotaciones"],"fr":["Analyse des temps de compilation","Identification des goulots d''étranglement","Optimisation de la configuration de Gradle","Réduction de la recompilation injustifiée","Débogage du traitement des annotations"],"de":["Analyse der Build-Zeiten","Identifizierung von Engpässen","Optimierung der Gradle-Konfiguration","Reduzierung der unnötigen Neukompilierung","Fehlerbehebung bei der Annotationenverarbeitung"],"pt":["Análise de build do Gradle","Otimização de tempos de build","Identificação de gargalos de configuração e execução","Ativação do cache de configuração do Gradle","Redução da recompilação desnecessária"],"ru":["Анализ сборки Gradle","Оптимизация времени сборки","Выявление конфигурационных и исполнительных узких мест","Включение кэша конфигурации Gradle","Снижение ненужной перекомпиляции"],"ar":["تحليل بناء جرادل","تحسين وقت البناء","تحديد معوقات التكوين والتنفيذ","تمكين ذاكرة التخزين المؤقتة لتكوين جرادل","تقليل إعادة 编譯 غير الضرورية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Gradle","Gradle","CI/CD","Kotlin","Jetpack Compose","Gradle","kapt","KSP","Gradle"],"ja":["Gradle","Gradle","CI/CD","Kotlin","Jetpack Compose","Gradle","kapt","KSP","Gradle"],"ko":["Gradle","Gradle","CI/CD","Kotlin","Jetpack Compose","Gradle","kapt","KSP","Gradle"],"es":["Gradle","rendimiento de compilación","optimización de tiempos de compilación","análisis de build","identificación de cuellos de botella","desarrollo de software","eficiencia del proyecto"],"fr":["Gradle","performances de build","optimisation des temps de compilation","analyse de build","identification des goulots d''étranglement","développement de logiciels","efficacité du projet"],"de":["Gradle","Build-Performance","Optimierung der Build-Zeiten","Build-Analyse","Identifizierung von Engpässen","Software-Entwicklung","Projekteffizienz"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho de build do gradle","gradle build performance","desenvolvimento de software","eficiência de build","redução de tempo de build","análise de build do gradle"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности сборки gradle","gradle build performance","разработка программного обеспечения","эффективность сборки","снижение времени сборки","анализ сборки gradle"],"ar":["تحسين أداء بناء جرادل","gradle build performance","تطوير البرمجيات","كفاءة البناء","تقليل وقت البناء","تحليل بناء جرادل"]}},"owner":"thinhtt264","repo":"SnapletApp","repoPath":"thinhtt264/SnapletApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gradle-build-performance","description":"Debug and optimize Android/Gradle build performance. Use when builds are slow, investigating CI/CD performance, analyzing build scans, or identifying compilation bottlenecks.","bodyPreview":"# Gradle Build Performance\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Build times are slow (clean or incremental)\n- Investigating build performance regressions\n- Analyzing Gradle Build Scans\n- Identifying configuration vs execution bottlenecks\n- Optimizing CI/CD build times\n- Enabling Gradle Configuration Cache\n- Reducing unnecessary recompilation\n- Debugging kapt/KSP annotation processing\n\n## Example Prompts\n\n- \"My builds are slow, how can I speed them up?\"\n- \"How do I analyze a Gradle build scan?\"\n- \"Why is configura","body":"# Gradle Build Performance\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Build times are slow (clean or incremental)\n- Investigating build performance regressions\n- Analyzing Gradle Build Scans\n- Identifying configuration vs execution bottlenecks\n- Optimizing CI/CD build times\n- Enabling Gradle Configuration Cache\n- Reducing unnecessary recompilation\n- Debugging kapt/KSP annotation processing\n\n## Example Prompts\n\n- \"My builds are slow, how can I speed them up?\"\n- \"How do I analyze a Gradle build scan?\"\n- \"Why is configuration taking so long?\"\n- \"Why does my project always recompile everything?\"\n- \"How do I enable configuration cache?\"\n- \"Why is kapt so slow?\"\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Measure Baseline** — Clean build + incremental build times\n2. **Generate Build Scan** — `./gradlew assembleDebug --scan`\n3. **Identify Phase** — Configuration? Execution? Dependency resolution?\n4. **Apply ONE optimization** — Don''t batch changes\n5. **Measure Improvement** — Compare against baseline\n6. **Verify in Build Scan** — Visual confirmation\n\n---\n\n## Quick Diagnostics\n\n### Generate Build Scan\n\n```bash\n./gradlew assembleDebug --scan\n```\n\n### Profile Build Locally\n\n```bash\n./gradlew assembleDebug --profile\n# Opens report in build/reports/profile/\n```\n\n### Build Timing Summary\n\n```bash\n./gradlew assembleDebug --info | grep -E \"^\\:.*\"\n# Or view in Android Studio: Build > Analyze APK Build\n```\n\n---\n\n## Build Phases\n\n| Phase | What Happens | Common Issues |\n|-------|--------------|---------------|\n| **Initialization** | `settings.gradle.kts` evaluated | Too many `include()` statements |\n| **Configuration** | All `build.gradle.kts` files evaluated | Expensive plugins, eager task creation |\n| **Execution** | Tasks run based on inputs/outputs | Cache misses, non-incremental tasks |\n\n### Identify the Bottleneck\n\n```\nBuild scan → Performance → Build timeline\n```\n\n- **Long configuration phase**: Focus on plugin and buildscript optimization\n- **Long execution phase**: Focus on task caching and parallelization\n- **Dependency resolution slow**: Focus on repository configuration\n\n---\n\n## 12 Optimization Patterns\n\n### 1. Enable Configuration Cache\n\nCaches configuration phase across builds (AGP 8.0+):\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.configuration-cache=true\norg.gradle.configuration-cache.problems=warn\n```\n\n### 2. Enable Build Cache\n\nReuses task outputs across builds and machines:\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.caching=true\n```\n\n### 3. Enable Parallel Execution\n\nBuild independent modules simultaneously:\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.parallel=true\n```\n\n### 4. Increase JVM Heap\n\nAllocate more memory for large projects:\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.jvmargs=-Xmx4g -XX:+UseParallelGC\n```\n\n### 5. Use Non-Transitive R Classes\n\nReduces R class size and compilation (AGP 8.0+ default):\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\nandroid.nonTransitiveRClass=true\n```\n\n### 6. Migrate kapt to KSP\n\nKSP is 2x faster than kapt for Kotlin:\n\n```kotlin\n// Before (slow)\nkapt(\"com.google.dagger:hilt-compiler:2.51.1\")\n\n// After (fast)\nksp(\"com.google.dagger:hilt-compiler:2.51.1\")\n```\n\n### 7. Avoid Dynamic Dependencies\n\nPin dependency versions:\n\n```kotlin\n// BAD: Forces resolution every build\nimplementation(\"com.example:lib:+\")\nimplementation(\"com.example:lib:1.0.+\")\n\n// GOOD: Fixed version\nimplementation(\"com.example:lib:1.2.3\")\n```\n\n### 8. Optimize Repository Order\n\nPut most-used repositories first:\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\ndependencyResolutionManagement {\n    repositories {\n        google()      // First: Android dependencies\n        mavenCentral() // Second: Most libraries\n        // Third-party repos last\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 9. Use includeBuild for Local Modules\n\nComposite builds are faster than `project()` for large monorepos:\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\nincludeBuild(\"shared-library\") {\n    dependencySubstitution {\n        substitute(module(\"com.example:shared\")).using(project(\":\"))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 10. Enable Incremental Annotation Processing\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\nkapt.incremental.apt=true\nkapt.use.worker.api=true\n```\n\n### 11. Avoid Configuration-Time I/O\n\nDon''t read files or make network calls during configuration:\n\n```kotlin\n// BAD: Runs during configuration\nval version = file(\"version.txt\").readText()\n\n// GOOD: Defer to execution\nval version = providers.fileContents(file(\"version.txt\")).asText\n```\n\n### 12. Use Lazy Task Configuration\n\nAvoid `create()`, use `register()`:\n\n```kotlin\n// BAD: Eagerly configured\ntasks.create(\"myTask\") { ... }\n\n// GOOD: Lazily configured\ntasks.register(\"myTask\") { ... }\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Bottleneck Analysis\n\n### Slow Configuration Phase\n\n**Symptoms**: Build scan shows long \"Configuring build\" time\n\n**Causes & Fixes**:\n| Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Eager task creation | Use `tasks.register()` instead of `tasks.create()` |\n| buildSrc with many dependencies | Migrate to Convention Plugins with `includeBuild` |\n| File I/O in build scripts | Use `providers.fileContents()` |\n| Network calls in plugins | Cache results or use offline mode |\n\n### Slow Compilation\n\n**Symptoms**: `:app:compileDebugKotlin` takes too long\n\n**Causes & Fixes**:\n| Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Non-incremental changes | Avoid `build.gradle.kts` changes that invalidate cache |\n| Large modules | Break into smaller feature modules |\n| Excessive kapt usage | Migrate to KSP |\n| Kotlin compiler memory | Increase `kotlin.daemon.jvmargs` |\n\n### Cache Misses\n\n**Symptoms**: Tasks always rerun despite no changes\n\n**Causes & Fixes**:\n| Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Unstable task inputs | Use `@PathSensitive`, `@NormalizeLineEndings` |\n| Absolute paths in outputs | Use relative paths |\n| Missing `@CacheableTask` | Add annotation to custom tasks |\n| Different JDK versions | Standardize JDK across environments |\n\n---\n\n## CI/CD Optimizations\n\n### Remote Build Cache\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\nbuildCache {\n    local { isEnabled = true }\n    remote<HttpBuildCache> {\n        url = uri(\"https://cache.example.com/\")\n        isPush = System.getenv(\"CI\") == \"true\"\n        credentials {\n            username = System.getenv(\"CACHE_USER\")\n            password = System.getenv(\"CACHE_PASS\")\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Gradle Enterprise / Develocity\n\nFor advanced build analytics:\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\nplugins {\n    id(\"com.gradle.develocity\") version \"3.17\"\n}\n\ndevelocity {\n    buildScan {\n        termsOfUseUrl.set(\"https://gradle.com/help/legal-terms-of-use\")\n        termsOfUseAgree.set(\"yes\")\n        publishing.onlyIf { System.getenv(\"CI\") != null }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Skip Unnecessary Tasks in CI\n\n```bash\n# Skip tests for UI-only changes\n./gradlew assembleDebug -x test -x lint\n\n# Only run affected module tests\n./gradlew :feature:login:test\n```\n\n---\n\n## Android Studio Settings\n\n### File → Settings → Build → Gradle\n\n- **Gradle JDK**: Match your project''s JDK\n- **Build and run using**: Gradle (not IntelliJ)\n- **Run tests using**: Gradle\n\n### File → Settings → Build → Compiler\n\n- **Compile independent modules in parallel**: ✅ Enabled\n- **Configure on demand**: ❌ Disabled (deprecated)\n\n---\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nAfter optimizations, verify:\n\n- [ ] Configuration cache enabled and working\n- [ ] Build cache hit rate > 80% (check build scan)\n- [ ] No dynamic dependency versions\n- [ ] KSP used instead of kapt where possible\n- [ ] Parallel execution enabled\n- [ ] JVM memory tuned appropriately\n- [ ] CI remote cache configured\n- [ ] No configuration-time I/O\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [Optimize Build Speed](https://developer.android.com/build/optimize-your-build)\n- [Gradle Configuration Cache](https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/configuration_cache.html)\n- [Gradle Build Cache](https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/build_cache.html)\n- [Migrate from kapt to KSP](https://developer.android.com/build/migrate-to-ksp)\n- [Gradle Build Scans](https://scans.gradle.com/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:20:10.812Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Android Development Agents needing advanced Gradle build optimization and performance analysis capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级 Gradle 构建优化和性能分析能力的 Android 开发代理。","ja":"Android 開発エージェントが高度な Gradle ビルド最適化とパフォーマンス分析機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 Gradle 빌드 최적화 및 성능 분석 기능이 필요한 Android 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Android que necesitan una optimización avanzada de la compilación de Gradle y capacidades de análisis de rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Android ayant besoin d''une optimisation avancée de la construction Gradle et de capacités d''analyse de performances.","de":"Perfekt für Android-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Gradle-Build-Optimierung und Leistungsanalysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Android que necessitam de otimização avançada de compilação do Gradle e capacidades de análise de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Android, требующих продвинутой оптимизации сборки Gradle и возможностей анализа производительности.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير Android التي تحتاج إلى تحسين متقدم لعمليات بناء Gradle وقدرات تحليل الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze Gradle build scans, identify configuration vs execution bottlenecks, and optimize CI/CD build times using Gradle Configuration Cache and reducing unnecessary recompilation, while also debugging kapt/KSP annotation processing issues.","zh":"赋予代理分析 Gradle 构建扫描、识别配置与执行瓶颈、使用 Gradle 配置缓存优化 CI/CD 构建时间并减少不必要的重新编译的能力，同时也可以调试 kapt/KSP 注解处理问题。","ja":"エージェントが Gradle ビルドスキャンを分析し、構成と実行のボトルネックを特定し、Gradle 構成キャッシュを使用して CI/CD ビルド時間を最適化し、不要な再コンパイルを減らす機能を提供し、kapt/KSP アノテーション処理の問題をデバッグすることもできます。","ko":"에이전트가 Gradle 빌드 스캔을 분석하고 구성과 실행의 병목 현상을 식별하며 Gradle 구성 캐시를 사용하여 CI/CD 빌드 시간을 최적화하고 불필요한 재컴파일을 줄이는 기능을 제공하며 kapt/KSP 어노테이션 처리 문제를 디버깅할 수도 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar los análisis de compilación de Gradle, identificar cuellos de botella de configuración frente a cuellos de botella de ejecución y optimizar los tiempos de compilación de CI/CD utilizando la caché de configuración de Gradle y reduciendo la recompilación innecesaria, además de depurar problemas de procesamiento de anotaciones kapt/KSP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les analyses de construction Gradle, d''identifier les goulots d''étranglement de configuration par rapport aux goulots d''étranglement d''exécution et d''optimiser les temps de construction CI/CD en utilisant la mémoire cache de configuration Gradle et en réduisant la recompilation inutile, tout en déboguant les problèmes de traitement d''annotations kapt/KSP.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Gradle-Build-Scans zu analysieren, Konfigurations- gegen Ausführungs-Engpässe zu identifizieren und CI/CD-Build-Zeiten mit der Gradle-Konfigurationscache zu optimieren und unnötige Neukompilierungen zu reduzieren, während auch Probleme mit der Verarbeitung von kapt/KSP-Anmerkungen debuggt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar varreduras de compilação do Gradle, identificar gargalos de configuração versus execução e otimizar tempos de compilação de CI/CD usando o Cache de Configuração do Gradle e reduzir a recompilação desnecessária, além de depurar problemas de processamento de anotações kapt/KSP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать сканирование сборки Gradle, выявлять конфигурационные против выполнения узкие места и оптимизировать время сборки CI/CD с помощью кэша конфигурации Gradle и сокращения ненужной перекомпиляции, а также отлаживать проблемы обработки аннотаций kapt/KSP.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل مسح بناء Gradle وتحديد معوقات التكوين مقابل معوقات التنفيذ وتنظيم أوقات بناء CI/CD باستخدام ذاكرة التخزين التكوينية لبرنامج Gradle وتقليل إعادة الترجمة غير الضرورية، بالإضافة إلى تصحيح مشاكل معالجة التعليقات kapt/KSP."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing Gradle build performance regressions","Optimizing incremental and clean build times","Debugging kapt/KSP annotation processing issues","Enabling Gradle Configuration Cache for faster builds"],"zh":["分析 Gradle 构建性能回归","优化增量和清洁构建时间","调试 kapt/KSP 注解处理问题","启用 Gradle 配置缓存以实现更快的构建"],"ja":["Gradle ビルドパフォーマンスの後退を分析する","インクリメンタルビルドとクリーンビルド時間を最適化する","kapt/KSP アノテーション処理の問題をデバッグする","Gradle 構成キャッシュを有効にしてビルドを高速化する"],"ko":["Gradle 빌드 성능 회귀를 분석하는 것","증분 및 깨끗한 빌드 시간을 최적화하는 것","kapt/KSP 어노테이션 처리 문제를 디버깅하는 것","Gradle 구성 캐시를 활성화하여 빌드를 더 빠르게 하는 것"],"es":["Analizar las regresiones del rendimiento de la compilación de Gradle","Optimizar los tiempos de compilación incremental y de limpieza","Depurar problemas de procesamiento de anotaciones kapt/KSP","Habilitar la caché de configuración de Gradle para compilaciones más rápidas"],"fr":["Analyser les régressions des performances de construction Gradle","Optimiser les temps de construction incrémentiels et propres","Déboguer les problèmes de traitement d''annotations kapt/KSP","Activer la mémoire cache de configuration Gradle pour des constructions plus rapides"],"de":["Analyse von Leistungsregressionen bei der Gradle-Build","Optimierung von inkrementellen und sauberen Build-Zeiten","Debuggen von Problemen mit der Verarbeitung von kapt/KSP-Anmerkungen","Aktivieren der Gradle-Konfigurationscache für schnellere Builds"],"pt":["Analisar regressões de desempenho de compilação do Gradle","Otimizar tempos de compilação incremental e limpa","Depurar problemas de processamento de anotações kapt/KSP","Habilitar Cache de Configuração do Gradle para compilações mais rápidas"],"ru":["Анализировать регрессии производительности сборки Gradle","Оптимизировать время инкрементальной и чистой сборки","Отлаживать проблемы обработки аннотаций kapt/KSP","Включать кэш конфигурации Gradle для более быстрой сборки"],"ar":["تحليل انحدارات أداء بناء Gradle","تحسين أوقات البناء المتزايدة والنظيفة","تصحيح مشاكل معالجة التعليقات kapt/KSP","تمكين ذاكرة التخزين التكوينية لبرنامج Gradle من أجل بناء أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Gradle build setup","Kotlin and Jetpack Compose specific","Limited to Android app development"],"zh":["需要 Gradle 构建设置","特定于 Kotlin 和 Jetpack Compose","仅限 Android 应用开发"],"ja":["Gradle ビルド設定が必要","Kotlin と Jetpack Compose に特有","Android アプリ開発のみ"],"ko":["Gradle 빌드 설정이 필요","Kotlin 및 Jetpack Compose에 특정","Android 앱 개발만"],"es":["Requiere configuración de compilación de Gradle","Específico de Kotlin y Jetpack Compose","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones de Android"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de construction Gradle","Spécifique à Kotlin et Jetpack Compose","Limité au développement d''applications Android"],"de":["Benötigt eine Gradle-Build-Konfiguration","Spezifisch für Kotlin und Jetpack Compose","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Android-Apps"],"pt":["Exige configuração de compilação do Gradle","Específico para Kotlin e Jetpack Compose","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicativos Android"],"ru":["Требует настройки сборки Gradle","Спецефичен для Kotlin и Jetpack Compose","Ограничен разработкой приложений Android"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد بناء Gradle","محدد ل Kotlin و Jetpack Compose","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات Android"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('macho715/tr_dashboard/tr-dashboard-autopilot', 'community', 'macho715', 'tr_dashboard', 'macho715/tr_dashboard', 'tr-dashboard-autopilot', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.487Z', '2026-02-18T10:19:53.682Z', NULL, '{"id":"macho715/tr_dashboard/tr-dashboard-autopilot","name":"tr-dashboard-autopilot","description":{"zh":"TR仪表盘自动驾驶是一个自动化工具，用于简化TR仪表盘的流程，从计划到测试。","ja":"TRダッシュボード自動操縦は、TRダッシュボードのプロセスを自動化するツールです。","ko":"TR 대시보드 오토피럿은 TR 대시보드 프로세스를 자동화하는 도구로, 계획부터 테스트까지 단순화합니다.","es":"TR Dashboard Autopilot es una herramienta que automatiza la creación de planes y pruebas. Permite a los desarrolladores generar planes y verificar resultados de manera automática","fr":"TR Tableau de bord Autopilot est un outil qui automatise la création de plans et de tests. Il permet aux développeurs de générer des plans et de vérifier les résultats de manière automatisée","de":"TR Dashboard Autopilot ist ein Tool, das die Erstellung von Plänen und Tests automatisiert. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, Pläne und Ergebnisse automatisch zu generieren und zu überprüfen","pt":"O TR Dashboard Autopilot é uma ferramenta que automatiza a criação de planos e testes, tornando o processo mais eficiente.","ru":"TR Dashboard Autopilot - это инструмент, который автоматизирует создание планов и тестов, делая процесс более эффективным.","ar":"لوحة القيادة TR Autopilot هي أداة تلقائية لإنشاء خطط الاختبار، مما يجعل العملية أكثر كفاءة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"TR仪表盘自动驾驶","ja":"TRダッシュボード自動操縦","ko":"TR 대시보드 오토피럿","es":"TR Dashboard Autopilot: Automatización de planes y pruebas","fr":"TR Tableau de bord Autopilot : Automatisation des plans e...","de":"TR Dashboard Autopilot: Automatisierung von Plänen und Tests","pt":"TR Dashboard Autopilot: Automatize Planos e Testes","ru":"TR Dashboard Autopilot: Автоматизация Планов и Тестов","ar":"لوحة القيادة TR Autopi