marca"," Marcos de contenido específicos de plataforma","Desarrollo de calendarios de contenido","Estrategias de marketing de contenido","Planificación de contenido social"],"fr":["Analyse de voix de marque professionnelle","Optimisation du SEO pour le contenu de marque","Cadres de contenu spécifiques à la plateforme","Développement de calendriers de contenu","Stratégies de marketing de contenu","Planification de contenu social"],"de":["Professionelle Markenstimmenanalyse","SEO-Optimierung für Markeninhalt","Plattformspezifische Inhaltssysteme","Erstellung von Inhaltkalendern","Content-Marketing-Strategien","Sozialer Inhalt Planung"],"pt":["Análise de voz de marca profissional","Otimização de SEO para conteúdo","Frameworks de conteúdo para plataformas específicas","Desenvolvimento de estratégia de conteúdo eficaz","Criação de conteúdo de marca consistente","Planejamento de calendário de conteúdo"],"ru":["Профессиональный анализ голоса бренда","Оптимизация SEO для контента","Фреймворки контента для конкретных платформ","Разработка эффективной стратегии контента","Создание последовательного контента бренда","Планирование календаря контента"],"ar":["تحليل صوت العلامة التجارية الاحترافي","أداة تحسين محركات البحث للمحتوى","إطارات المحتوى لأنظمة معينة","تطوير استراتيجية محتوى فعالة","إنشاء محتوى العلامة التجارية المتسق","تخطيط تقويم المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["内容创作者","品牌语音分析","SEO优化","内容框架","社交媒体内容","内容日历","品牌一致性","内容策略","开发者工具"],"ja":["コンテンツクリエイター","ブランドボイス分析","SEO最適化","コンテンツフレームワーク","ソーシャルメディアコンテンツ","コンテンツカレンダー","ブランドの一貫性","コンテンツ戦略","開発者ツール"],"ko":["콘텐츠 크리에이터","브랜드 보이스 분석","SEO 최적화","콘텐츠 프레임워크","소셜 미디어 콘텐츠","콘텐츠 달력","브랜드 일관성","콘텐츠 전략","개발자 도구"],"es":["creador de contenido","análisis de voz de marca","optimización de SEO","marcos de contenido","calendarios de contenido","marketing de contenido","estrategias de contenido","contenido social","blog writing","content marketing"],"fr":["créateur de contenu","analyse de voix de marque","optimisation du SEO","cadres de contenu","calendriers de contenu","marketing de contenu","stratégies de contenu","contenu social","écriture de blog","marketing de contenu"],"de":["Content-Ersteller","Markenstimmenanalyse","SEO-Optimierung","Inhaltssysteme","Inhaltkalender","Content-Marketing","Inhaltsstrategien","sozialer Inhalt","Blog-Schreiben","Content-Marketing"],"pt":["criação de conteúdo","análise de voz de marca","otimização de SEO","estratégia de conteúdo","conteúdo de marca","calendário de conteúdo","marketing de conteúdo","otimização de conteúdo"],"ru":["создание контента","анализ голоса бренда","оптимизация SEO","стратегия контента","контент бренда","календарь контента","маркетинг контента","оптимизация контента"],"ar":["إنشاء المحتوى","تحليل صوت العلامة التجارية","أداة تحسين محركات البحث","استراتيجية المحتوى","محتوى العلامة التجارية","تقويم المحتوى","تسويق المحتوى","تحسين المحتوى"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/Sistema-de-narra-o-de-livro-front","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"content-creator","description":"Create SEO-optimized marketing content with consistent brand voice. Includes brand voice analyzer, SEO optimizer, content frameworks, and social media templates. Use when writing blog posts, creating social media content, analyzing brand voice, optimizing SEO, planning content calendars, or when user mentions content creation, brand voice, SEO optimization, social media marketing, or content strategy.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Content Creator\n\nProfessional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.\n\n## Keywords\ncontent creation, blog posts, SEO, brand voice, social media, content calendar, marketing content, content strategy, content marketing, brand consistency, content optimization, social media marketing, content planning, blog writing, content frameworks, brand guidelines, social media strategy\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### For Brand Voice Development\n1. Run `scripts/brand_voi","body":"# Content Creator\n\nProfessional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.\n\n## Keywords\ncontent creation, blog posts, SEO, brand voice, social media, content calendar, marketing content, content strategy, content marketing, brand consistency, content optimization, social media marketing, content planning, blog writing, content frameworks, brand guidelines, social media strategy\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### For Brand Voice Development\n1. Run `scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py` on existing content to establish baseline\n2. Review `references/brand_guidelines.md` to select voice attributes\n3. Apply chosen voice consistently across all content\n\n### For Blog Content Creation\n1. Choose template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n2. Research keywords for topic\n3. Write content following template structure\n4. Run `scripts/seo_optimizer.py [file] [primary-keyword]` to optimize\n5. Apply recommendations before publishing\n\n### For Social Media Content\n1. Review platform best practices in `references/social_media_optimization.md`\n2. Use appropriate template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n3. Optimize based on platform-specific guidelines\n4. Schedule using `assets/content_calendar_template.md`\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### Establishing Brand Voice (First Time Setup)\n\nWhen creating content for a new brand or client:\n\n1. **Analyze Existing Content** (if available)\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py existing_content.txt\n   ```\n   \n2. **Define Voice Attributes**\n   - Review brand personality archetypes in `references/brand_guidelines.md`\n   - Select primary and secondary archetypes\n   - Choose 3-5 tone attributes\n   - Document in brand guidelines\n\n3. **Create Voice Sample**\n   - Write 3 sample pieces in chosen voice\n   - Test consistency using analyzer\n   - Refine based on results\n\n### Creating SEO-Optimized Blog Posts\n\n1. **Keyword Research**\n   - Identify primary keyword (search volume 500-5000/month)\n   - Find 3-5 secondary keywords\n   - List 10-15 LSI keywords\n\n2. **Content Structure**\n   - Use blog template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n   - Include keyword in title, first paragraph, and 2-3 H2s\n   - Aim for 1,500-2,500 words for comprehensive coverage\n\n3. **Optimization Check**\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/seo_optimizer.py blog_post.md \"primary keyword\" \"secondary,keywords,list\"\n   ```\n\n4. **Apply SEO Recommendations**\n   - Adjust keyword density to 1-3%\n   - Ensure proper heading structure\n   - Add internal and external links\n   - Optimize meta description\n\n### Social Media Content Creation\n\n1. **Platform Selection**\n   - Identify primary platforms based on audience\n   - Review platform-specific guidelines in `references/social_media_optimization.md`\n\n2. **Content Adaptation**\n   - Start with blog post or core message\n   - Use repurposing matrix from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n   - Adapt for each platform following templates\n\n3. **Optimization Checklist**\n   - Platform-appropriate length\n   - Optimal posting time\n   - Correct image dimensions\n   - Platform-specific hashtags\n   - Engagement elements (polls, questions)\n\n### Content Calendar Planning\n\n1. **Monthly Planning**\n   - Copy `assets/content_calendar_template.md`\n   - Set monthly goals and KPIs\n   - Identify key campaigns/themes\n\n2. **Weekly Distribution**\n   - Follow 40/25/25/10 content pillar ratio\n   - Balance platforms throughout week\n   - Align with optimal posting times\n\n3. **Batch Creation**\n   - Create all weekly content in one session\n   - Maintain consistent voice across pieces\n   - Prepare all visual assets together\n\n## Key Scripts\n\n### brand_voice_analyzer.py\nAnalyzes text content for voice characteristics, readability, and consistency.\n\n**Usage**: `python scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py <file> [json|text]`\n\n**Returns**:\n- Voice profile (formality, tone, perspective)\n- Readability score\n- Sentence structure analysis\n- Improvement recommendations\n\n### seo_optimizer.py\nAnalyzes content for SEO optimization and provides actionable recommendations.\n\n**Usage**: `python scripts/seo_optimizer.py <file> [primary_keyword] [secondary_keywords]`\n\n**Returns**:\n- SEO score (0-100)\n- Keyword density analysis\n- Structure assessment\n- Meta tag suggestions\n- Specific optimization recommendations\n\n## Reference Guides\n\n### When to Use Each Reference\n\n**references/brand_guidelines.md**\n- Setting up new brand voice\n- Ensuring consistency across content\n- Training new team members\n- Resolving voice/tone questions\n\n**references/content_frameworks.md**\n- Starting any new content piece\n- Structuring different content types\n- Creating content templates\n- Planning content repurposing\n\n**references/social_media_optimization.md**\n- Platform-specific optimization\n- Hashtag strategy development\n- Understanding algorithm factors\n- Setting up analytics tracking\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Content Creation Process\n1. Always start with audience need/pain point\n2. Research before writing\n3. Create outline using templates\n4. Write first draft without editing\n5. Optimize for SEO\n6. Edit for brand voice\n7. Proofread and fact-check\n8. Optimize for platform\n9. Schedule strategically\n\n### Quality Indicators\n- SEO score above 75/100\n- Readability appropriate for audience\n- Consistent brand voice throughout\n- Clear value proposition\n- Actionable takeaways\n- Proper visual formatting\n- Platform-optimized\n\n### Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n- Writing before researching keywords\n- Ignoring platform-specific requirements\n- Inconsistent brand voice\n- Over-optimizing for SEO (keyword stuffing)\n- Missing clear CTAs\n- Publishing without proofreading\n- Ignoring analytics feedback\n\n## Performance Metrics\n\nTrack these KPIs for content success:\n\n### Content Metrics\n- Organic traffic growth\n- Average time on page\n- Bounce rate\n- Social shares\n- Backlinks earned\n\n### Engagement Metrics\n- Comments and discussions\n- Email click-through rates\n- Social media engagement rate\n- Content downloads\n- Form submissions\n\n### Business Metrics\n- Leads generated\n- Conversion rate\n- Customer acquisition cost\n- Revenue attribution\n- ROI per content piece\n\n## Integration Points\n\nThis skill works best with:\n- Analytics platforms (Google Analytics, social media insights)\n- SEO tools (for keyword research)\n- Design tools (for visual content)\n- Scheduling platforms (for content distribution)\n- Email marketing systems (for newsletter content)\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Analyze brand voice\npython scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py content.txt\n\n# Optimize for SEO\npython scripts/seo_optimizer.py article.md \"main keyword\"\n\n# Check content against brand guidelines\ngrep -f references/brand_guidelines.md content.txt\n\n# Create monthly calendar\ncp assets/content_calendar_template.md this_month_calendar.md\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:20:49.764Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Marketing Agents seeking advanced content optimization and brand voice development capabilities.","zh":"适合于寻求高级内容优化和品牌声音开发能力的营销代理商。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度なコンテンツ最適化とブランドボイス開発機能を求める場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 콘텐츠 최적화 및 브랜드 음성 개발 기능을 찾는 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de marketing que buscan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de contenido y desarrollo de voz de marca.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de marketing qui recherchent des capacités avancées d''optimisation de contenu et de développement de voix de marque.","de":"Ideal für Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte Inhaltsoptimierung und Markenstimmenentwicklungsfähigkeiten suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Marketing que buscam capacidades avançadas de otimização de conteúdo e desenvolvimento de voz de marca.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, ищущих расширенные возможности оптимизации контента и разработки бренд-голоса.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التسويق الذين يبحثون عن إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين المحتوى وتطوير صوت العلامة التجارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create professional-grade content with SEO optimization, platform-specific content frameworks, and brand consistency using keywords like content creation, SEO, and brand voice analysis, while leveraging content calendars and social media marketing strategies.","zh":"赋予代理商创建专业级别的内容的能力，具有SEO优化、平台特定内容框架和品牌一致性，使用内容创建、SEO和品牌声音分析等关键词，同时利用内容日历和社交媒体营销策略。","ja":"SEO最適化、プラットフォーム固有のコンテンツフレームワーク、ブランド一貫性を使用して、コンテンツ作成、SEO、ブランドボイス分析などのキーワードを使用し、コンテンツカレンダーとソーシャルメディアマーケティング戦略を活用して、プロフェッショナルグレードのコンテンツを作成するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"콘텐츠 생성, SEO, 브랜드 음성 분석 등의 키워드를 사용하여 SEO 최적화, 플랫폼 고유의 콘텐츠 프레임워크 및 브랜드 일관성을 사용하여 전문가급 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 콘텐츠 캘린더 및 소셜 미디어 마케팅 전략을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear contenido de grado profesional con optimización de SEO, marcos de contenido específicos de plataforma y coherencia de marca utilizando palabras clave como creación de contenido, SEO y análisis de voz de marca, mientras aprovecha calendarios de contenido y estrategias de marketing en redes sociales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu de niveau professionnel avec une optimisation du SEO, des cadres de contenu spécifiques à la plateforme et une cohérence de marque en utilisant des mots-clés tels que création de contenu, SEO et analyse de voix de marque, tout en exploitant les calendriers de contenu et les stratégies de marketing sur les réseaux sociaux.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, professionelles Inhaltsmaterial mit SEO-Optimierung, plattformspezifischen Inhaltsrahmen und Markenkonsequenz zu erstellen, indem Schlüsselwörter wie Inhaltserschaffung, SEO und Markenstimmenanalyse verwendet werden, während Inhaltskalender und soziale Medienmarketingstrategien genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo de nível profissional com otimização de SEO, estruturas de conteúdo específicas de plataforma e consistência de marca usando palavras-chave como criação de conteúdo, SEO e análise de voz de marca, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita calendários de conteúdo e estratégias de marketing de mídia social.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать профессиональный контент с оптимизацией SEO, платформо-специфическими контент-каркасами и бренд-консистенцией с использованием ключевых слов, таких как создание контента, SEO и анализ бренд-голоса, а также использует контент-календари и стратегии социального медиа-маркетинга.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء محتوى من الدرجة الأولى مع تحسين محركات البحث، وإطارات محتوى محددة المنصة، والاتساق العلامة التجارية باستخدام كلمات مفتاحية مثل إنشاء المحتوى، و تحسين محركات البحث، وتحليل صوت العلامة التجارية، وفي الوقت نفسه الاستفادة من تقويم المحتوى وستراتيجيات تسويق وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating blog post generation with optimized SEO","Developing platform-specific content frameworks for social media","Creating consistent brand voices across marketing content"],"zh":["使用优化的SEO自动化博客帖子生成","为社交媒体开发平台特定内容框架","在营销内容中创建一致的品牌声音"],"ja":["最適化されたSEOを使用してブログ投稿の自動生成","ソーシャルメディアのプラットフォーム固有のコンテンツフレームワークを開発","マーケティングコンテンツ全体で一貫したブランドボイスを作成"],"ko":["최적화된 SEO를 사용하여 블로그 게시물 자동 생성","소셜 미디어를 위한 플랫폼 고유의 콘텐츠 프레임워크 개발","마케팅 콘텐츠 전반에 걸쳐 일관된 브랜드 음성 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de publicaciones en blog con optimización de SEO","Desarrollo de marcos de contenido específicos de plataforma para redes sociales","Creación de voces de marca coherentes en todo el contenido de marketing"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de billets de blog avec optimisation du SEO","Développement de cadres de contenu spécifiques à la plateforme pour les réseaux sociaux","Création de voix de marque cohérentes dans tout le contenu marketing"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Blog-Beiträgen mit SEO-Optimierung","Entwicklung plattformspezifischer Inh