e tres fases: compilación, análisis estático y pruebas con cobertura","fr":"Le cycle de vérification Spring Boot comprend trois phases : construction, analyse statique et tests avec couverture","de":"Der Verifizierungszyklus von Spring Boot besteht aus drei Phasen: Build, statische Analyse und Tests mit Abdeckung","pt":"O Spring Boot Verification é um conjunto de configurações para garantir a qualidade do código. Ele inclui build, análise estática e testes.","ru":"Верификация Spring Boot - это набор конфигураций для обеспечения качества кода. Он включает сборку, статический анализ и тестирование.","ar":"تأكيد الربيع هو مجموعة من الإعدادات لضمان جودة الكود. يتضمن بناء ، تحليل إحصائي ، واختبارات.","en":"Complete Claude Code configuration collection - agents, skills, hooks, commands, rules, MCPs. Battle-tested configs from an Anthropic hackathon winner."},"definition":{"en":"Complete Claude Code configuration collection - agents, skills, hooks, commands, rules, MCPs. Battle-tested configs from an Anthropic hackathon winner."},"features":{"zh":["Spring Boot ","Maven Gradle"," "," "," "],"ja":["Spring Boot","Maven Gradle","","",""],"ko":["Spring Boot ","Maven Gradle"," "," "," "],"es":["Compilación y verificación del código","Análisis estático con herramientas como Spotbugs y Checkstyle","Pruebas unitarias y de integración con cobertura","Soporte para Maven y Gradle","Configuración personalizable para adaptarse a tus necesidades"],"fr":["Construction et vérification du code","Analyse statique avec des outils comme Spotbugs et Checkstyle","Tests unitaires et d''intégration avec couverture","Prise en charge de Maven et Gradle","Configuration personnalisable pour s''adapter à vos besoins"],"de":["Build und Verifizierung des Codes","Statische Analyse mit Tools wie Spotbugs und Checkstyle","Unit- und Integrations-tests mit Abdeckung","Unterstützung für Maven und Gradle","Anpassbare Konfiguration, um Ihren Bedürfnissen gerecht zu werden"],"pt":["Build automático","Análise estática de código","Testes e cobertura de código","Integração com Maven e Gradle","Configuração personalizável","Relatórios detalhados"],"ru":["Автоматическая сборка","Статический анализ кода","Тестирование и покрытие кода","Интеграция с Maven и Gradle","Настраиваемая конфигурация","Детальные отчеты"],"ar":["بناء آلي","تحليل إحصائي للكود","اختبارات وتغطية الكود","دمج مع Maven و Gradle","إعدادات قابلة للتعديل","تقارير مفصلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Spring Boot"," ","Maven","Gradle"," "," "],"ja":["Spring Boot","","Maven","Gradle","",""],"ko":["Spring Boot"," ","Maven","Gradle"," "," "],"es":["Spring Boot","verificación de código","análisis estático","pruebas unitarias","cobertura de código","Maven","Gradle","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Spring Boot","vérification de code","analyse statique","tests unitaires","couverture de code","Maven","Gradle","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Spring Boot","Code-Verifizierung","statische Analyse","Unit-Tests","Code-Abdeckung","Maven","Gradle","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Spring Boot","Verificação de código","Análise estática","Testes automatizados","Cobertura de código","Integração contínua","Desenvolvimento de software","Garantia de qualidade"],"ru":["Spring Boot","Верификация кода","Статический анализ","Автоматическое тестирование","Покрытие кода","Непрерывная интеграция","Разработка программного обеспечения","Обеспечение качества"],"ar":["الربيع","تأكيد الكود","تحليل إحصائي","اختبارات آلية","تغطية الكود","دمج مستمر","تطوير البرمجيات","ضمان الجودة"]}},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"springboot-verification","description":"Verification loop for Spring Boot projects: build, static analysis, tests with coverage, security scans, and diff review before release or PR.","bodyPreview":"# Spring Boot Verification Loop\n\nRun before PRs, after major changes, and pre-deploy.\n\n## Phase 1: Build\n\n```bash\nmvn -T 4 clean verify -DskipTests\n# or\n./gradlew clean assemble -x test\n```\n\nIf build fails, stop and fix.\n\n## Phase 2: Static Analysis\n\nMaven (common plugins):\n```bash\nmvn -T 4 spotbugs:check pmd:check checkstyle:check\n```\n\nGradle (if configured):\n```bash\n./gradlew checkstyleMain pmdMain spotbugsMain\n```\n\n## Phase 3: Tests + Coverage\n\n```bash\nmvn -T 4 test\nmvn jacoco:report   # veri","body":"# Spring Boot Verification Loop\n\nRun before PRs, after major changes, and pre-deploy.\n\n## Phase 1: Build\n\n```bash\nmvn -T 4 clean verify -DskipTests\n# or\n./gradlew clean assemble -x test\n```\n\nIf build fails, stop and fix.\n\n## Phase 2: Static Analysis\n\nMaven (common plugins):\n```bash\nmvn -T 4 spotbugs:check pmd:check checkstyle:check\n```\n\nGradle (if configured):\n```bash\n./gradlew checkstyleMain pmdMain spotbugsMain\n```\n\n## Phase 3: Tests + Coverage\n\n```bash\nmvn -T 4 test\nmvn jacoco:report   # verify 80%+ coverage\n# or\n./gradlew test jacocoTestReport\n```\n\nReport:\n- Total tests, passed/failed\n- Coverage % (lines/branches)\n\n### Unit Tests\n\nTest service logic in isolation with mocked dependencies:\n\n```java\n@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)\nclass UserServiceTest {\n\n  @Mock private UserRepository userRepository;\n  @InjectMocks private UserService userService;\n\n  @Test\n  void createUser_validInput_returnsUser() {\n    var dto = new CreateUserDto(\"Alice\", \"alice@example.com\");\n    var expected = new User(1L, \"Alice\", \"alice@example.com\");\n    when(userRepository.save(any(User.class))).thenReturn(expected);\n\n    var result = userService.create(dto);\n\n    assertThat(result.name()).isEqualTo(\"Alice\");\n    verify(userRepository).save(any(User.class));\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  void createUser_duplicateEmail_throwsException() {\n    var dto = new CreateUserDto(\"Alice\", \"existing@example.com\");\n    when(userRepository.existsByEmail(dto.email())).thenReturn(true);\n\n    assertThatThrownBy(() -> userService.create(dto))\n        .isInstanceOf(DuplicateEmailException.class);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Integration Tests with Testcontainers\n\nTest against a real database instead of H2:\n\n```java\n@SpringBootTest\n@Testcontainers\nclass UserRepositoryIntegrationTest {\n\n  @Container\n  static PostgreSQLContainer<?> postgres = new PostgreSQLContainer<>(\"postgres:16-alpine\")\n      .withDatabaseName(\"testdb\");\n\n  @DynamicPropertySource\n  static void configureProperties(DynamicPropertyRegistry registry) {\n    registry.add(\"spring.datasource.url\", postgres::getJdbcUrl);\n    registry.add(\"spring.datasource.username\", postgres::getUsername);\n    registry.add(\"spring.datasource.password\", postgres::getPassword);\n  }\n\n  @Autowired private UserRepository userRepository;\n\n  @Test\n  void findByEmail_existingUser_returnsUser() {\n    userRepository.save(new User(\"Alice\", \"alice@example.com\"));\n\n    var found = userRepository.findByEmail(\"alice@example.com\");\n\n    assertThat(found).isPresent();\n    assertThat(found.get().getName()).isEqualTo(\"Alice\");\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### API Tests with MockMvc\n\nTest controller layer with full Spring context:\n\n```java\n@WebMvcTest(UserController.class)\nclass UserControllerTest {\n\n  @Autowired private MockMvc mockMvc;\n  @MockBean private UserService userService;\n\n  @Test\n  void createUser_validInput_returns201() throws Exception {\n    var user = new UserDto(1L, \"Alice\", \"alice@example.com\");\n    when(userService.create(any())).thenReturn(user);\n\n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/api/users\")\n            .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)\n            .content(\"\"\"\n                {\"name\": \"Alice\", \"email\": \"alice@example.com\"}\n                \"\"\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isCreated())\n        .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.name\").value(\"Alice\"));\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  void createUser_invalidEmail_returns400() throws Exception {\n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/api/users\")\n            .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)\n            .content(\"\"\"\n                {\"name\": \"Alice\", \"email\": \"not-an-email\"}\n                \"\"\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isBadRequest());\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Phase 4: Security Scan\n\n```bash\n# Dependency CVEs\nmvn org.owasp:dependency-check-maven:check\n# or\n./gradlew dependencyCheckAnalyze\n\n# Secrets in source\ngrep -rn \"password\\s*=\\s*\\\"\" src/ --include=\"*.java\" --include=\"*.yml\" --include=\"*.properties\"\ngrep -rn \"sk-\\|api_key\\|secret\" src/ --include=\"*.java\" --include=\"*.yml\"\n\n# Secrets (git history)\ngit secrets --scan  # if configured\n```\n\n### Common Security Findings\n\n```\n# Check for System.out.println (use logger instead)\ngrep -rn \"System\\.out\\.print\" src/main/ --include=\"*.java\"\n\n# Check for raw exception messages in responses\ngrep -rn \"e\\.getMessage()\" src/main/ --include=\"*.java\"\n\n# Check for wildcard CORS\ngrep -rn \"allowedOrigins.*\\*\" src/main/ --include=\"*.java\"\n```\n\n## Phase 5: Lint/Format (optional gate)\n\n```bash\nmvn spotless:apply   # if using Spotless plugin\n./gradlew spotlessApply\n```\n\n## Phase 6: Diff Review\n\n```bash\ngit diff --stat\ngit diff\n```\n\nChecklist:\n- No debugging logs left (`System.out`, `log.debug` without guards)\n- Meaningful errors and HTTP statuses\n- Transactions and validation present where needed\n- Config changes documented\n\n## Output Template\n\n```\nVERIFICATION REPORT\n===================\nBuild:     [PASS/FAIL]\nStatic:    [PASS/FAIL] (spotbugs/pmd/checkstyle)\nTests:     [PASS/FAIL] (X/Y passed, Z% coverage)\nSecurity:  [PASS/FAIL] (CVE findings: N)\nDiff:      [X files changed]\n\nOverall:   [READY / NOT READY]\n\nIssues to Fix:\n1. ...\n2. ...\n```\n\n## Continuous Mode\n\n- Re-run phases on significant changes or every 30–60 minutes in long sessions\n- Keep a short loop: `mvn -T 4 test` + spotbugs for quick feedback\n\n**Remember**: Fast feedback beats late surprises. Keep the gate strict—treat warnings as defects in production systems.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:21:17.179Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Java Development Agents specializing in Spring Boot application quality assurance and CI/CD pipeline integration.","zh":"非常适合专注于 Spring Boot 应用程序质量保证和 CI/CD 流水线集成的 Java 开发代理。","ja":"Spring Boot アプリケーションの品質保証と CI/CD パイプライン統合に特化した Java 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Spring Boot 애플리케이션의 품질 보증과 CI/CD 파이프라인 통합에 전문적인 Java 개발 에이전트에게 최적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Java especializados en garantía de calidad de aplicaciones Spring Boot e integración de pipelines CI/CD.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement Java spécialisés dans l''assurance qualité des applications Spring Boot et l''intégration de pipelines CI/CD.","de":"Ideal für Java-Entwicklungsagenten, die sich auf die Qualitätssicherung von Spring Boot-Anwendungen und die Integration von CI/CD-Pipelines spezialisiert haben.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Java especializados em garantia de qualidade de aplicações Spring Boot e integração de pipeline CI/CD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Java, специализирующихся на обеспечении качества приложений Spring Boot и интеграции конвейера CI/CD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير جافا المتخصص في ضمان جودة تطبيقات سبرينج بوت وتكامل أنابيب CI/CD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to execute comprehensive Spring Boot verification loops including parallelized Maven/Gradle builds, static analysis with SpotBugs/PMD/CheckStyle, and test coverage reporting via JaCoCo. Provides battle-tested configurations from Anthropic hackathon winners for immediate production use.","zh":"使得代理能够执行全面的 Spring Boot 验证循环，包括并行化的 Maven/Gradle 构建、使用 SpotBugs/PMD/CheckStyle 的静态分析以及通过 JaCoCo 的测试覆盖报告。提供来自 Anthropic 黑客马拉松获胜者的实战配置，用于立即的生产使用。","ja":"エージェントが Spring Boot の包括的な検証ループを実行できるようにし、Maven/Gradle の並列ビルド、SpotBugs/PMD/CheckStyle を使用した静的分析、および JaCoCo を介したテストカバレッジレポートを提供します。Anthropic ハッカソン優勝者からの実戦テスト済みの設定を提供し、すぐに本番で使用できます。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 Spring Boot 검증 루프를 실행할 수 있도록 하며, Maven/Gradle의 병렬 빌드, SpotBugs/PMD/CheckStyle을 사용한 정적 분석 및 JaCoCo를 통한 테스트 커버리지 보고를 제공합니다. Anthropic 해커톤 우승자로부터의 전투 테스트된 구성이 제공되어 즉시 프로덕션에서 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar bucles de verificación completos de Spring Boot que incluyen builds paralelizados de Maven/Gradle, análisis estático con SpotBugs/PMD/CheckStyle y reportes de cobertura de pruebas mediante JaCoCo. Proporciona configuraciones probadas en batalla de ganadores de hackathons de Anthropic para uso inmediato en producción.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des boucles de vérification complètes de Spring Boot incluant des builds parallélisés Maven/Gradle, une analyse statique avec SpotBugs/PMD/CheckStyle et des rapports de couverture de tests via JaCoCo. Fournit des configurations éprouvées issues des gagnants des hackathons d''Anthropic pour une utilisation immédiate en production.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten die Ausführung umfassender Spring Boot-Verifizierungsschleifen, einschließlich parallelisierter Maven/Gradle-Builds, statischer Analyse mit SpotBugs/PMD/CheckStyle und Testabdeckungsberichten via JaCoCo. Bietet erprobte Konfigurationen von Gewinnern der Anthropic-Hackathons für den sofortigen Produktionseinsatz.","pt":"Permite que os agentes executem loops de verificação abrangentes do Spring Boot, incluindo compilações paralelas do Maven/Gradle, análise estática com SpotBugs/PMD/CheckStyle e relatórios de cobertura de teste via JaCoCo. Fornece configurações testadas em batalha dos vencedores do hackathon da Anthropic para uso imediato em produção.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять комплексные циклы проверки Spring Boot, включая параллельные сборки Maven/Gradle, статический анализ с помощью SpotBugs/PMD/CheckStyle и отчеты о покрытии тестов через JaCoCo. Предоставляет battle-тестированные конфигурации победителей хакатона Anthropic для немедленного использования в производстве.","ar":"يسمح للعميلين بتنفيذ حلقات التحقق الشاملة لتطبيق سبرينج بوت، بما في ذلك عمليات البناء الموازية لمافين/جradle، التحليل الثابت باستخدام SpotBugs/PMD/CheckStyle، وتقارير تغطية الاختبار عبر JaCoCo. يوفر إعدادات经过 اختبار القتال من الفائزين في هاكاثون أنثروبك للاستخدام الفوري في الإنتاج."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-PR verification workflows","Executing static code analysis with multiple quality tools","Generating test coverage reports for compliance","Running parallelized build processes with -T 4 optimization"],"zh":["自动化 pre-PR 验证工作流","使用多个质量工具执行静态代码分析","生成用于合规的测试覆盖报告","使用 -T 4 优化运行并行化构建过程"],"ja":["pre-PR 検証ワークフローの自動化","複数の品質ツールを使用した静的コード分析の実行","コンプライアンスのためのテストカバレッジレポートの生成","-T 4 最適化を使用した並列ビルドプロセスの実行"],"ko":["pre-PR 검증 워크플로 자동화","여러 가지 품질 도구를 사용한 정적 코드 분석 실행","준수 위한 테스트 커버리지 보고서 생성","-T 4 최적화를 사용한 병렬 빌드 프로세스 실행"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de verificación pre-PR","Ejecución de análisis de código estático con múltiples herramientas de calidad","Generación de informes de cobertura de pruebas para cumplimiento normativo","Ejecución de procesos de build paralelizados con optimización -T 4"],"fr":["Automatisation des workflows de vérification pré-PR","Exécution de l''analyse de code statique avec plusieurs outils de qualité","Génération de rapports de couverture de tests pour la conformité","Exécution de processus de build parallélisés avec l''optimisation -T 4"],"de":["Automatisierung von Pre-PR-Verifizierungsworkflows","Durchführung von statischer Codeanalyse mit mehreren Qualitätstools","Erstellung von Testabdeckungsberichten für Compliance-Zwecke","Ausführung parallelisierter Build-Prozesse mit -T 4-Optimierung"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de verificação pré-PR","Executar análise de código estático com várias ferramentas de qualidade","Gerar relatórios de cobertura de teste para conformidade","Executar processos de compilação paralelos com otimização -T 4"],"ru":["Автоматизация пред-PR рабочих процессов проверки","Выполнение статического анализа кода с помощью нескольких инструментов качества","Генерация отчетов о покрытии тестов для соответствия требованиям","Выполнение параллельных процессов сборки с оптимизацией -T 4"],"ar":["تأتمتة سير عمل التحقق قبل-PR","تنفيذ التحليل الثابت للكود باستخدام أدوات جودة متعددة","توليد تقارير تغطية الاختبار للامتثال","تشغيل عمليات البناء الموازية مع تحسين -T 4"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Maven or Gradle build system","Assumes pre-configured static analysis plugins","Java/Spring Boot projects only","Dependent on proper JaCoCo configuration for coverage"],"zh":["需要 Maven 或 Gradle 构建系统","假设预先配置的静态分析插件","仅限 Java/Spring Boot 项目","依赖于适当的 JaCoCo 配置以实现覆盖"],"ja":["Maven または Gradle ビルドシステムが必要","事前に構成された静的分析プラグインが前提","Java/Spring Boot プロジェクトのみ","カバレッジの実現には適切な JaCoCo 構成が必要"],"ko":["Maven 또는 Gradle 빌드 시스템이 필요함","事前に 구성된 정적 분석 플러그인이 전제됨","Java/Spring Boot 프로젝트만 해당","커버리지 실현을 위해 적절한 JaCoCo 구성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere el sistema de build Maven o Gradle","Asume plugins de análisis estático preconfigurados","Exclusivamente para proyectos Java/Spring Boot","Depende de una configuración adecuada de JaCoCo para la cobertura"],"fr":["Nécessite le système de build Maven ou Gradle","Suppose des plugins d''analyse statique préconfigurés","Projets Java/Spring Boot uniquement","Dépend d''une configuration correcte de JaCoCo pour la couverture"],"de":["Erfordert Maven- oder Gradle-Build-System","Geht von vorkonfigurierten Plugins für statische Analyse aus","Nur für Java/Spring Boot-Projekte","Abhängig von einer korrekten JaCoCo-Konfiguration für die Abdeckung"],"pt":["Exige sistema de compilação do Maven ou Gradle","Supõe plugins de análise estática pré-configurados","Projetos Java/Spring Boot apenas","Depende da configuração adequada do JaCoCo para cobertura"],"ru":["Требует системы сборки Maven или Gradle","Предполагает предварительно настроенные плагины статического анализа","Только проекты Java/Spring Boot","Зависит от правильной конфигурации JaCoCo для покрытия"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام بناء مافين أو جرادل","يفترض إعداد مسبق لملحقات التحليل الثابت","مشاريع جافا/سبرينج بوت فقط","يعتمد على إعداد مناسب لجاكوكو للتغطية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":100}');
