halts-Ersteller","Markenstimmenanalyse","SEO-Optimierung","Marketingstrategie","Marketing-Inhalt","Soziale Medien","Inhalts-Planung","Inhalts-Kalender","Blog"],"pt":["criação de conteúdo","análise de voz de marca","otimização de SEO","desenvolvimento de conteúdo","estratégia de conteúdo","marketing de conteúdo","redes sociais","conteúdo de alta qualidade"],"ru":["создание контента","анализ бренд-голоса","оптимизация SEO","разработка контента","стратегия контента","маркетинг контента","социальные сети","высококачественный контент"],"ar":["إنشاء المحتوى","تحليل صوت العلامة التجارية","تحسين محرك البحث","تطوير المحتوى","استراتيجية المحتوى","تسويق المحتوى","وسائل التواصل الاجتماعي","المحتوى عالي الجودة"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"content-creator","description":"Create SEO-optimized marketing content with consistent brand voice. Includes brand voice analyzer, SEO optimizer, content frameworks, and social media templates. Use when writing blog posts, creating social media content, analyzing brand voice, optimizing SEO, planning content calendars, or when user mentions content creation, brand voice, SEO optimization, social media marketing, or content strategy.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Content Creator\n\nProfessional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.\n\n## Keywords\ncontent creation, blog posts, SEO, brand voice, social media, content calendar, marketing content, content strategy, content marketing, brand consistency, content optimization, social media marketing, content planning, blog writing, content frameworks, brand guidelines, social media strategy\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### For Brand Voice Development\n1. Run `scripts/brand_voi","body":"# Content Creator\n\nProfessional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.\n\n## Keywords\ncontent creation, blog posts, SEO, brand voice, social media, content calendar, marketing content, content strategy, content marketing, brand consistency, content optimization, social media marketing, content planning, blog writing, content frameworks, brand guidelines, social media strategy\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### For Brand Voice Development\n1. Run `scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py` on existing content to establish baseline\n2. Review `references/brand_guidelines.md` to select voice attributes\n3. Apply chosen voice consistently across all content\n\n### For Blog Content Creation\n1. Choose template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n2. Research keywords for topic\n3. Write content following template structure\n4. Run `scripts/seo_optimizer.py [file] [primary-keyword]` to optimize\n5. Apply recommendations before publishing\n\n### For Social Media Content\n1. Review platform best practices in `references/social_media_optimization.md`\n2. Use appropriate template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n3. Optimize based on platform-specific guidelines\n4. Schedule using `assets/content_calendar_template.md`\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### Establishing Brand Voice (First Time Setup)\n\nWhen creating content for a new brand or client:\n\n1. **Analyze Existing Content** (if available)\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py existing_content.txt\n   ```\n   \n2. **Define Voice Attributes**\n   - Review brand personality archetypes in `references/brand_guidelines.md`\n   - Select primary and secondary archetypes\n   - Choose 3-5 tone attributes\n   - Document in brand guidelines\n\n3. **Create Voice Sample**\n   - Write 3 sample pieces in chosen voice\n   - Test consistency using analyzer\n   - Refine based on results\n\n### Creating SEO-Optimized Blog Posts\n\n1. **Keyword Research**\n   - Identify primary keyword (search volume 500-5000/month)\n   - Find 3-5 secondary keywords\n   - List 10-15 LSI keywords\n\n2. **Content Structure**\n   - Use blog template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n   - Include keyword in title, first paragraph, and 2-3 H2s\n   - Aim for 1,500-2,500 words for comprehensive coverage\n\n3. **Optimization Check**\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/seo_optimizer.py blog_post.md \"primary keyword\" \"secondary,keywords,list\"\n   ```\n\n4. **Apply SEO Recommendations**\n   - Adjust keyword density to 1-3%\n   - Ensure proper heading structure\n   - Add internal and external links\n   - Optimize meta description\n\n### Social Media Content Creation\n\n1. **Platform Selection**\n   - Identify primary platforms based on audience\n   - Review platform-specific guidelines in `references/social_media_optimization.md`\n\n2. **Content Adaptation**\n   - Start with blog post or core message\n   - Use repurposing matrix from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n   - Adapt for each platform following templates\n\n3. **Optimization Checklist**\n   - Platform-appropriate length\n   - Optimal posting time\n   - Correct image dimensions\n   - Platform-specific hashtags\n   - Engagement elements (polls, questions)\n\n### Content Calendar Planning\n\n1. **Monthly Planning**\n   - Copy `assets/content_calendar_template.md`\n   - Set monthly goals and KPIs\n   - Identify key campaigns/themes\n\n2. **Weekly Distribution**\n   - Follow 40/25/25/10 content pillar ratio\n   - Balance platforms throughout week\n   - Align with optimal posting times\n\n3. **Batch Creation**\n   - Create all weekly content in one session\n   - Maintain consistent voice across pieces\n   - Prepare all visual assets together\n\n## Key Scripts\n\n### brand_voice_analyzer.py\nAnalyzes text content for voice characteristics, readability, and consistency.\n\n**Usage**: `python scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py <file> [json|text]`\n\n**Returns**:\n- Voice profile (formality, tone, perspective)\n- Readability score\n- Sentence structure analysis\n- Improvement recommendations\n\n### seo_optimizer.py\nAnalyzes content for SEO optimization and provides actionable recommendations.\n\n**Usage**: `python scripts/seo_optimizer.py <file> [primary_keyword] [secondary_keywords]`\n\n**Returns**:\n- SEO score (0-100)\n- Keyword density analysis\n- Structure assessment\n- Meta tag suggestions\n- Specific optimization recommendations\n\n## Reference Guides\n\n### When to Use Each Reference\n\n**references/brand_guidelines.md**\n- Setting up new brand voice\n- Ensuring consistency across content\n- Training new team members\n- Resolving voice/tone questions\n\n**references/content_frameworks.md**\n- Starting any new content piece\n- Structuring different content types\n- Creating content templates\n- Planning content repurposing\n\n**references/social_media_optimization.md**\n- Platform-specific optimization\n- Hashtag strategy development\n- Understanding algorithm factors\n- Setting up analytics tracking\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Content Creation Process\n1. Always start with audience need/pain point\n2. Research before writing\n3. Create outline using templates\n4. Write first draft without editing\n5. Optimize for SEO\n6. Edit for brand voice\n7. Proofread and fact-check\n8. Optimize for platform\n9. Schedule strategically\n\n### Quality Indicators\n- SEO score above 75/100\n- Readability appropriate for audience\n- Consistent brand voice throughout\n- Clear value proposition\n- Actionable takeaways\n- Proper visual formatting\n- Platform-optimized\n\n### Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n- Writing before researching keywords\n- Ignoring platform-specific requirements\n- Inconsistent brand voice\n- Over-optimizing for SEO (keyword stuffing)\n- Missing clear CTAs\n- Publishing without proofreading\n- Ignoring analytics feedback\n\n## Performance Metrics\n\nTrack these KPIs for content success:\n\n### Content Metrics\n- Organic traffic growth\n- Average time on page\n- Bounce rate\n- Social shares\n- Backlinks earned\n\n### Engagement Metrics\n- Comments and discussions\n- Email click-through rates\n- Social media engagement rate\n- Content downloads\n- Form submissions\n\n### Business Metrics\n- Leads generated\n- Conversion rate\n- Customer acquisition cost\n- Revenue attribution\n- ROI per content piece\n\n## Integration Points\n\nThis skill works best with:\n- Analytics platforms (Google Analytics, social media insights)\n- SEO tools (for keyword research)\n- Design tools (for visual content)\n- Scheduling platforms (for content distribution)\n- Email marketing systems (for newsletter content)\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Analyze brand voice\npython scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py content.txt\n\n# Optimize for SEO\npython scripts/seo_optimizer.py article.md \"main keyword\"\n\n# Check content against brand guidelines\ngrep -f references/brand_guidelines.md content.txt\n\n# Create monthly calendar\ncp assets/content_calendar_template.md this_month_calendar.md\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:20:53.259Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Content Agents requiring professional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.","zh":"适用于需要专业级品牌声音分析、SEO优化和平台特定内容框架的AI内容代理。","ja":"AIコンテンツエージェントがプロフェッショナルグレードのブランドボイス分析、SEO最適化、プラットフォーム特有のコンテンツフレームワークを必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"프로페셔널급 브랜드 목소리 분석, SEO 최적화, 플랫폼 별 콘텐츠 프레임워크가 필요한 AI 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de contenido de IA que requieren un análisis de voz de marca de grado profesional, optimización de SEO y marcos de contenido específicos de plataforma.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contenu IA nécessitant une analyse de voix de marque de niveau professionnel, une optimisation du référencement et des cadres de contenu spécifiques à la plateforme.","de":"Ideal für AI-Inhaltsagenten, die eine professionelle Markenstimmenanalyse, SEO-Optimierung und plattformspezifische Inhaltsrahmen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conteúdo de IA que exigem análise de voz de marca de nível profissional, otimização de SEO e estruturas de conteúdo específicas de plataforma.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контента ИИ, требующих профессионального анализа брендового голоса, оптимизации SEO и платформо-специфических контентных рамок.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المحتوى الاصطناعي الذين يتطلبون تحليل صوت العلامة التجارية من الدرجة المهنية وتحسين محرك البحث وتقنيات الإطار المحتوى الخاص بالمنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling marketing content using brand guidelines, SEO optimization techniques, and content calendars, while ensuring brand consistency across social media platforms through effective content strategy and planning.","zh":"赋予代理人使用品牌指南、SEO优化技术和内容日历来制作引人入胜的营销内容的能力，同时通过有效的内容策略和规划来确保社交媒体平台上的一致品牌形象。","ja":"ブランドガイドライン、SEO最適化テクニック、コンテンツカレンダーを使用して、魅力的なマーケティングコンテンツを作成するためのエージェントをエンパワーメントします。また、効果的なコンテンツ戦略と計画を通じて、ソーシャルメディアプラットフォーム全体で一貫したブランドイメージを確保します。","ko":"브랜드 가이드라인, SEO 최적화 기법, 콘텐츠 달력을 사용하여 매력적인 마케팅 콘텐츠를 제작할 수 있는 에이전트의 역량을 강화합니다. 또한 효과적인 콘텐츠 전략 및 계획을 통해 소셜 미디어 플랫폼 전반에 걸쳐 일관된 브랜드 이미지를 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear contenido de marketing atractivo utilizando directrices de marca, técnicas de optimización de SEO y calendarios de contenido, asegurando al mismo tiempo la coherencia de la marca en plataformas de redes sociales a través de una estrategia y planificación de contenido efectivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un contenu marketing convaincant en utilisant des directives de marque, des techniques d''optimisation du référencement et des calendriers de contenu, tout en assurant la cohérence de la marque sur les plateformes de réseaux sociaux grâce à une stratégie et une planification de contenu efficaces.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, überzeugendes Marketing-Inhalt zu erstellen, indem sie Markenrichtlinien, SEO-Optimierungstechniken und Inhaltskalender verwenden und gleichzeitig die Markenkonsequenz auf sozialen Medienplattformen durch eine wirksame Inhaltsstrategie und -planung sicherstellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem conteúdo de marketing atraente usando diretrizes de marca, técnicas de otimização de SEO e calendários de conteúdo, garantindo a consistência da marca em plataformas de mídia social por meio de estratégia e planejamento de conteúdo eficazes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательный маркетинговый контент с использованием руководств по бренду, техник оптимизации SEO и календарей контента, обеспечивая последовательность бренда на платформах социальных сетей благодаря эффективной стратегии и планированию контента.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء محتوى تسويقي جذاب باستخدام إرشادات العلامة التجارية وтехники تحسين محرك البحث وتقويم المحتوى، مع ضمان συνέsluence العلامة التجارية على منصات وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية من خلال استراتيجية وتخطيط محتوى فعالين."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating blog posts with optimized SEO keywords","Developing platform-specific content frameworks for social media marketing","Creating content calendars to ensure consistent brand voice and messaging"],"zh":["生成带有优化SEO关键词的博客文章","为社交媒体营销开发平台特定内容框架","创建内容日历以确保一致的品牌声音和信息传递"],"ja":["最適化されたSEOキーワードを使用したブログ投稿の生成","ソーシャルメディアマーケティングのためのプラットフォーム特有のコンテンツフレームワークの開発","ブランドボイスとメッセージングの一貫性を確保するためのコンテンツカレンダーの作成"],"ko":["최적화된 SEO 키워드를 사용한 블로그 게시물 생성","소셜 미디어 마케팅을 위한 플랫폼 별 콘텐츠 프레임워크 개발","일관된 브랜드 목소리와 메시지를 보장하는 콘텐츠 달력 생성"],"es":["Generar publicaciones de blog con palabras clave de SEO optimizadas","Desarrollar marcos de contenido específicos de plataforma para marketing en redes sociales","Crear calendarios de contenido para garantizar una voz y mensaje de marca coherentes"],"fr":["Générer des billets de blog avec des mots-clés SEO optimisés","Développer des cadres de contenu spécifiques à la plateforme pour le marketing sur les réseaux sociaux","Créer des calendriers de contenu pour assurer une voix et un message de marque cohérents"],"de":["Erstellen von Blog-Beiträgen mit optimierten SEO-Schlüsselwörtern","Entwicklung plattformspezifischer Inhaltsrahmen für Social-Media-Marketing","Erstellung von Inhaltskalendern, um eine konsistente Markenstimme und -botschaft sicherzustellen"],"pt":["Gerar posts de blog com palavras-chave de SEO otimizadas","Desenvolver estruturas de conteúdo específicas de plataforma para marketing de mídia social","Criar calendários de conteúdo para garantir voz e mensagens de marca consistentes"],"ru":["Генерировать посты в блоге с оптимизированными ключевыми словами SEO","Разрабатывать платформо-специфические контентные рамки для маркетинга социальных сетей","Создавать календари контента для обеспечения последовательного брендового голоса и сообщений"],"ar":["جعل منشورات مدونة مع كلمات مفتاحية محسّنة لمحرك البحث","تطوير إطارات محتوى خاصة بالمنصة لتسويق وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية","إنشاء تقويم المحتوى لضمان صوت ومعلومات العلامة التجارية المتسقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires brand guidelines and voice analysis setup","Limited to text-based content creation","Needs integration with social media platforms for publishing"],"zh":["需要品牌指南和声音分析设置","仅限文本基于内容创建","需要与社交媒体平台集成以进行发布"],"ja":["ブランドガイドラインとボイス分析の設定が必要","テキストベースのコンテンツ作成のみ","公開のためにソーシャルメディアプラットフォームとの統合が必要"],"ko":["브랜드 가이드라인 및 음성 분석 설정이 필요합니다.","텍스트 기반 콘텐츠 생성만 가능합니다.","게시를 위해 소셜 미디어 플랫폼과 통합이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere la configuración de directrices y análisis de voz de marca","Limitado a la creación de contenido basado en texto","Necesita integración con plataformas de redes sociales para publicar"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration des directives et de l''analyse de voix de marque","Limité à la création de contenu basé sur du texte","Nécessite une intégration avec les plateformes de réseaux sociaux pour publier"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung von Markenrichtlinien und Stimmenanalyse","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von textbasiertem Inhalt","Benötigt Integration mit sozialen Medienplattformen für die Veröffentlichung"],"pt":["Exige configuração de diretrizes e análise de voz de marca","Limitado à criação de conteúdo baseado em texto","Necessita de integração com plataformas de mídia social para publicação"],