ent de stratégie de contenu et marketing"],"de":["Professionelle Marken-Stimmen-Analyse","SEO-Optimierung für Markeninhalt","Plattformspezifische Inhalts-Rahmen","Inhalts-Planung und -Kalender","Entwicklung von Inhalts- und Marketing-Strategie"],"pt":["Análise de voz de marca","Otimização SEO","Estrutura de conteúdo personalizada","Planejamento de conteúdo","Escrita de blog","Otimização de mídia social"],"ru":["Анализ бренд-голоса","Оптимизация SEO","Пользовательская структура контента","Планирование контента","Написание блогов","Оптимизация социальных медиа"],"ar":["تحليل صوت العلامة التجارية","تحسين SEO","هيكل محتوى مخصص","تخطيط المحتوى","كتابة المدونة","تحسين وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["内容创建","SEO优化","品牌声音","社交媒体营销","内容策略","内容营销","品牌一致性","内容日历","平台特定内容"],"ja":["コンテンツ作成","SEO最適化","ブランドボイス","ソーシャルメディアマーケティング","コンテンツ戦略","コンテンツマーケティング","ブランドの一貫性","コンテンツカレンダー","プラットフォーム固有のコンテンツ"],"ko":["콘텐츠 생성","SEO 최적화","브랜드 보이스","소셜 미디어 마케팅","콘텐츠 전략","콘텐츠 마케팅","브랜드 일관성","콘텐츠 캘린더","플랫폼 특정 콘텐츠"],"es":["creador de contenido","análisis de voz de marca","optimización de SEO","contenido de marca","plataforma de contenido","planificación de contenido","estrategia de contenido","marketing de contenido"],"fr":["créateur de contenu","analyse de voix de marque","optimisation du SEO","contenu de marque","plateforme de contenu","planification de contenu","stratégie de contenu","marketing de contenu"],"de":["Inhalts-Ersteller","Marken-Stimmen-Analyse","SEO-Optimierung","Markeninhalt","Inhalts-Plattform","Inhalts-Planung","Inhalts-Strategie","Inhalts-Marketing"],"pt":["criação de conteúdo","análise de voz de marca","otimização SEO","estratégia de conteúdo","marketing de conteúdo","planejamento de conteúdo","escrita de blog","otimização de mídia social"],"ru":["создание контента","анализ бренд-голоса","оптимизация SEO","стратегия контента","маркетинг контента","планирование контента","написание блогов","оптимизация социальных медиа"],"ar":["إنشاء المحتوى","تحليل صوت العلامة التجارية","تحسين SEO","استراتيجية المحتوى","تسويق المحتوى","تخطيط المحتوى","كتابة المدونة","تحسين وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية"]}},"owner":"Scrollico","repo":"scrolli-website-project","repoPath":"Scrollico/scrolli-website-project","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"content-creator","description":"Create SEO-optimized marketing content with consistent brand voice. Includes brand voice analyzer, SEO optimizer, content frameworks, and social media templates. Use when writing blog posts, creating social media content, analyzing brand voice, optimizing SEO, planning content calendars, or when user mentions content creation, brand voice, SEO optimization, social media marketing, or content strategy.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Content Creator\n\nProfessional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.\n\n## Keywords\ncontent creation, blog posts, SEO, brand voice, social media, content calendar, marketing content, content strategy, content marketing, brand consistency, content optimization, social media marketing, content planning, blog writing, content frameworks, brand guidelines, social media strategy\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### For Brand Voice Development\n1. Run `scripts/brand_voi","body":"# Content Creator\n\nProfessional-grade brand voice analysis, SEO optimization, and platform-specific content frameworks.\n\n## Keywords\ncontent creation, blog posts, SEO, brand voice, social media, content calendar, marketing content, content strategy, content marketing, brand consistency, content optimization, social media marketing, content planning, blog writing, content frameworks, brand guidelines, social media strategy\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### For Brand Voice Development\n1. Run `scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py` on existing content to establish baseline\n2. Review `references/brand_guidelines.md` to select voice attributes\n3. Apply chosen voice consistently across all content\n\n### For Blog Content Creation\n1. Choose template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n2. Research keywords for topic\n3. Write content following template structure\n4. Run `scripts/seo_optimizer.py [file] [primary-keyword]` to optimize\n5. Apply recommendations before publishing\n\n### For Social Media Content\n1. Review platform best practices in `references/social_media_optimization.md`\n2. Use appropriate template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n3. Optimize based on platform-specific guidelines\n4. Schedule using `assets/content_calendar_template.md`\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### Establishing Brand Voice (First Time Setup)\n\nWhen creating content for a new brand or client:\n\n1. **Analyze Existing Content** (if available)\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py existing_content.txt\n   ```\n   \n2. **Define Voice Attributes**\n   - Review brand personality archetypes in `references/brand_guidelines.md`\n   - Select primary and secondary archetypes\n   - Choose 3-5 tone attributes\n   - Document in brand guidelines\n\n3. **Create Voice Sample**\n   - Write 3 sample pieces in chosen voice\n   - Test consistency using analyzer\n   - Refine based on results\n\n### Creating SEO-Optimized Blog Posts\n\n1. **Keyword Research**\n   - Identify primary keyword (search volume 500-5000/month)\n   - Find 3-5 secondary keywords\n   - List 10-15 LSI keywords\n\n2. **Content Structure**\n   - Use blog template from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n   - Include keyword in title, first paragraph, and 2-3 H2s\n   - Aim for 1,500-2,500 words for comprehensive coverage\n\n3. **Optimization Check**\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/seo_optimizer.py blog_post.md \"primary keyword\" \"secondary,keywords,list\"\n   ```\n\n4. **Apply SEO Recommendations**\n   - Adjust keyword density to 1-3%\n   - Ensure proper heading structure\n   - Add internal and external links\n   - Optimize meta description\n\n### Social Media Content Creation\n\n1. **Platform Selection**\n   - Identify primary platforms based on audience\n   - Review platform-specific guidelines in `references/social_media_optimization.md`\n\n2. **Content Adaptation**\n   - Start with blog post or core message\n   - Use repurposing matrix from `references/content_frameworks.md`\n   - Adapt for each platform following templates\n\n3. **Optimization Checklist**\n   - Platform-appropriate length\n   - Optimal posting time\n   - Correct image dimensions\n   - Platform-specific hashtags\n   - Engagement elements (polls, questions)\n\n### Content Calendar Planning\n\n1. **Monthly Planning**\n   - Copy `assets/content_calendar_template.md`\n   - Set monthly goals and KPIs\n   - Identify key campaigns/themes\n\n2. **Weekly Distribution**\n   - Follow 40/25/25/10 content pillar ratio\n   - Balance platforms throughout week\n   - Align with optimal posting times\n\n3. **Batch Creation**\n   - Create all weekly content in one session\n   - Maintain consistent voice across pieces\n   - Prepare all visual assets together\n\n## Key Scripts\n\n### brand_voice_analyzer.py\nAnalyzes text content for voice characteristics, readability, and consistency.\n\n**Usage**: `python scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py <file> [json|text]`\n\n**Returns**:\n- Voice profile (formality, tone, perspective)\n- Readability score\n- Sentence structure analysis\n- Improvement recommendations\n\n### seo_optimizer.py\nAnalyzes content for SEO optimization and provides actionable recommendations.\n\n**Usage**: `python scripts/seo_optimizer.py <file> [primary_keyword] [secondary_keywords]`\n\n**Returns**:\n- SEO score (0-100)\n- Keyword density analysis\n- Structure assessment\n- Meta tag suggestions\n- Specific optimization recommendations\n\n## Reference Guides\n\n### When to Use Each Reference\n\n**references/brand_guidelines.md**\n- Setting up new brand voice\n- Ensuring consistency across content\n- Training new team members\n- Resolving voice/tone questions\n\n**references/content_frameworks.md**\n- Starting any new content piece\n- Structuring different content types\n- Creating content templates\n- Planning content repurposing\n\n**references/social_media_optimization.md**\n- Platform-specific optimization\n- Hashtag strategy development\n- Understanding algorithm factors\n- Setting up analytics tracking\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Content Creation Process\n1. Always start with audience need/pain point\n2. Research before writing\n3. Create outline using templates\n4. Write first draft without editing\n5. Optimize for SEO\n6. Edit for brand voice\n7. Proofread and fact-check\n8. Optimize for platform\n9. Schedule strategically\n\n### Quality Indicators\n- SEO score above 75/100\n- Readability appropriate for audience\n- Consistent brand voice throughout\n- Clear value proposition\n- Actionable takeaways\n- Proper visual formatting\n- Platform-optimized\n\n### Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n- Writing before researching keywords\n- Ignoring platform-specific requirements\n- Inconsistent brand voice\n- Over-optimizing for SEO (keyword stuffing)\n- Missing clear CTAs\n- Publishing without proofreading\n- Ignoring analytics feedback\n\n## Performance Metrics\n\nTrack these KPIs for content success:\n\n### Content Metrics\n- Organic traffic growth\n- Average time on page\n- Bounce rate\n- Social shares\n- Backlinks earned\n\n### Engagement Metrics\n- Comments and discussions\n- Email click-through rates\n- Social media engagement rate\n- Content downloads\n- Form submissions\n\n### Business Metrics\n- Leads generated\n- Conversion rate\n- Customer acquisition cost\n- Revenue attribution\n- ROI per content piece\n\n## Integration Points\n\nThis skill works best with:\n- Analytics platforms (Google Analytics, social media insights)\n- SEO tools (for keyword research)\n- Design tools (for visual content)\n- Scheduling platforms (for content distribution)\n- Email marketing systems (for newsletter content)\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Analyze brand voice\npython scripts/brand_voice_analyzer.py content.txt\n\n# Optimize for SEO\npython scripts/seo_optimizer.py article.md \"main keyword\"\n\n# Check content against brand guidelines\ngrep -f references/brand_guidelines.md content.txt\n\n# Create monthly calendar\ncp assets/content_calendar_template.md this_month_calendar.md\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:20:49.075Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing professional-grade content creation capabilities with SEO optimization and brand voice analysis.","zh":"适合需要专业级内容创建功能的语言代理，能够优化SEO和分析品牌声音。","ja":"SEO最適化およびブランドボイス分析機能を備えたプロフェッショナルグレードのコンテンツ作成機能を必要とする言語エージェントに最適。","ko":"SEO 최적화 및 브랜드 보이스 분석 기능을 갖춘 전문가급 콘텐츠 생성 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades de creación de contenido de nivel profesional con optimización de SEO y análisis de voz de marca.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin de capacités de création de contenu de niveau professionnel avec optimisation de SEO et analyse de voix de marque.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die professionelle Inhalteerstellungsfähigkeiten mit SEO-Optimierung und Markenstimmenanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades de criação de conteúdo de nível profissional com otimização de SEO e análise de voz de marca.","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, которым требуются возможности создания контента профессионального уровня с оптимизацией SEO и анализом бренд-voice.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اللغة الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات إنشاء محتوى من الدرجة المهنية مع تحسين محرك البحث وتحليل صوت العلامة التجارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality, platform-specific content using content frameworks, ensuring brand consistency and content optimization through SEO and social media marketing strategies, leveraging technical keywords like content calendars and brand guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量、特定平台的内容，使用内容框架，确保品牌一致性和内容优化，通过SEO和社交媒体营销策略，利用技术关键词，如内容日历和品牌指南。","ja":"コンテンツフレームワークを使用して、高品質のプラットフォーム固有のコンテンツを生成し、ブランドの一貫性とコンテンツの最適化を確保することでエージェントをEmpower化し、SEOおよびソーシャルメディアマーケティング戦略を通じてブランドの一貫性とコンテンツの最適化を実現し、コンテンツカレンダーやブランドガイドラインなどの技術キーワードを活用する。","ko":"콘텐츠 프레임워크를 사용하여 고품질의 플랫폼 고유의 콘텐츠를 생성하여 브랜드 일관성과 콘텐츠 최적화를 보장하고, SEO 및 소셜미디어 마케팅 전략을 통해 브랜드 일관성과 콘텐츠 최적화를 실현하며, 콘텐츠 달력이나 브랜드 가이드라인과 같은 기술 키워드를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar contenido de alta calidad, específico de la plataforma, utilizando marcos de contenido, garantizando la coherencia de la marca y la optimización del contenido a través de estrategias de marketing de SEO y redes sociales, aprovechando palabras clave técnicas como calendarios de contenido y directrices de marca.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du contenu de haute qualité, spécifique à la plateforme, en utilisant des cadres de contenu, garantissant la cohérence de la marque et l''optimisation du contenu via des stratégies de marketing de SEO et de médias sociaux, en exploitant des mots-clés techniques tels que des calendriers de contenu et des lignes directrices de marque.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hochwertigen, plattformsspezifischen Inhalt zu generieren, der Content-Frameworks verwendet, um Markenkonsequenz und Inhaltsoptimierung durch SEO- und Social-Media-Marketingstrategien sicherzustellen, indem technische Schlüsselwörter wie Inhaltskalender und Markenrichtlinien genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar conteúdo de alta qualidade, específico da plataforma, usando estruturas de conteúdo, garantindo a consistência da marca e a otimização do conteúdo por meio de estratégias de marketing de SEO e mídia social, aproveitando palavras-chave técnicas como calendários de conteúdo e diretrizes de marca.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать контент высокого качества, специфичный для платформы, используя контент-фреймворки, обеспечивая последовательность бренда и оптимизацию контента через стратегии SEO и маркетинга в социальных сетях, используя технические ключевые слова, такие как календари контента и руководства по бренду.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء محتوى عالي الجودة ومحدد للمنصة باستخدام إطارات المحتوى، مما يضمن συνέáfية العلامة التجارية وتحسين المحتوى من خلال استراتيجيات تحسين محرك البحث وتسويق وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية، مستفيداً من الكلمات الرئيسية الفنية مثل تقويمات المحتوى وإرشادات العلامة التجارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating blog post creation with optimized SEO","Generating social media content with consistent brand voice","Developing comprehensive content marketing strategies"],"zh":["使用优化的SEO自动创建博客文章","生成具有统一品牌声音的社交媒体内容","开发综合的内容营销策略"],"ja":["最適化されたSEOで自動的にブログ投稿を生成する","一貫したブランドボイスを持つソーシャルメディアコンテンツを生成する","包括的なコンテンツマーケティング戦略を開発する"],"ko":["최적화된 SEO로 자동으로 블로그 게시물 생성하기","일관된 브랜드 보이스를 가진 소셜미디어 콘텐츠 생성하기","포괄적인 콘텐츠 마케팅 전략 개발하기"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de publicaciones de blog con SEO optimizado","Generación de contenido de redes sociales con voz de marca coherente","Desarrollo de estrategias de marketing de contenido integrales"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de billets de blog avec SEO optimisé","Génération de contenu de médias sociaux avec voix de marque cohérente","Développement de stratégies de marketing de contenu intégrales"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Blog-Beiträgen mit optimiertem SEO","Generierung von Social-Media-Inhalt mit konsistenter Markenstimme","Entwicklung umfassender Content-Marketing-Strategien"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de posts de blog com SEO otimizado","Gerar conteúdo de mídia social com voz de marca consistente","Desenvolver estratégias de marketing de conteúdo abrangentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание постов в блоге с оптимизированным SEO","Генерировать контент социальных сетей с последовательным бренд-voice","Разрабатывать комплексные стратегии маркетинга контента"],"ar":["توفير إنشاء منشورات المدونة مع تحسين محرك البحث","إنشاء محتوى وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية مع صوت العلامة التجارية المتسق","تطوير استراتيجيات تسويق المحتوى ال