,"pt":["Processamento de conversas","Integração com o LangGraph","Trabalho com API endpoints","Extração de memórias","Integração com Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis"],"ru":["Обработка разговоров","Интеграция с LangGraph","Работа с API endpoints","Извлечение памяти","Интеграция с Firestore, Pinecone или Redis"],"ar":["معالجة المحادثات","تكامل اللانجغراف","العمل مع نقاط النهاية API","استخراج الذكريات","التكامل مع Firestore، Pinecone أو Redis"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Omi 后端模式","后端开发","对话处理","内存提取","聊天系统","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone"],"ja":["Omi バックエンドパターン","バックエンド開発","会話処理","メモリ抽出","チャットシステム","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone"],"ko":["오미 백엔드 패턴","백엔드 개발","대화 처리","메모리 추출","채팅 시스템","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone"],"es":["patrones de backend Omi","desarrollo de backend","procesamiento de conversaciones","extracción de memorias","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis"],"fr":["modèles de backend Omi","développement de backend","traitement des conversations","extraction des mémoires","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis"],"de":["Omi-Backend-Muster","Backend-Entwicklung","Konversationsverarbeitung","Gedächtnisextraktion","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis"],"pt":["Omi Backend Patterns","desenvolvimento de backend","processamento de conversas","integração com LangGraph","API endpoints","extração de memórias","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis"],"ru":["Шаблоны бэкенда Omi","разработка бэкенда","обработка разговоров","интеграция с LangGraph","API endpoints","извлечение памяти","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis"],"ar":["أنماط خلفية أومي","تطوير خلفية","معالجة المحادثات","تكامل اللانجغراف","نقاط النهاية API","استخراج الذكريات","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis"]}},"owner":"BasedHardware","repo":"omi","repoPath":"BasedHardware/omi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"omi-backend-patterns","description":"Omi backend patterns conversation processing memory extraction chat system LangGraph FastAPI Firestore Pinecone Redis","bodyPreview":"# Omi Backend Patterns Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for working with the Omi backend, including conversation processing, memory extraction, chat system, and LangGraph integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Working on backend Python code in `backend/`\n- Implementing new API endpoints\n- Processing conversations or extracting memories\n- Working with the LangGraph chat system\n- Integrating with Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Conversation Processing\n\nThe conv","body":"# Omi Backend Patterns Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for working with the Omi backend, including conversation processing, memory extraction, chat system, and LangGraph integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Working on backend Python code in `backend/`\n- Implementing new API endpoints\n- Processing conversations or extracting memories\n- Working with the LangGraph chat system\n- Integrating with Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Conversation Processing\n\nThe conversation processing pipeline follows this flow:\n\n1. **Audio arrives via WebSocket** (`/v4/listen`)\n2. **Transcription** via Deepgram/Soniox/Speechmatics\n3. **Conversation creation** in Firestore (status: \"in_progress\")\n4. **Processing trigger** via `POST /v1/conversations` or timeout\n5. **LLM extraction** of structured data:\n   - Title and overview\n   - Action items\n   - Calendar events\n   - Memories (user facts)\n6. **Storage** in Firestore and Pinecone\n\n**Key Function**: `utils/conversations/process_conversation.py::process_conversation()`\n\n### Memory Extraction\n\nMemories are extracted from conversations using LLM:\n\n```python\nfrom utils.llm.conversation_processing import _extract_memories\n\nmemories = await _extract_memories(\n    transcript=transcript,\n    existing_memories=existing_memories,\n)\n```\n\n**Categories**: personal, health, work, relationships, preferences\n\n### Chat System Architecture\n\nThe chat system uses LangGraph for routing:\n\n1. **Classification**: `requires_context()` determines path\n2. **Simple Path**: Direct LLM response (no context needed)\n3. **Agentic Path**: Full tool access with LangGraph ReAct agent\n4. **Persona Path**: Persona app responses\n\n**Key File**: `utils/retrieval/graph.py`\n\n### Module Hierarchy\n\n**CRITICAL**: Always follow the import hierarchy:\n\n1. `database/` - Data access (lowest)\n2. `utils/` - Business logic\n3. `routers/` - API endpoints\n4. `main.py` - Application entry\n\n**Never import from higher levels in lower levels!**\n\n### Database Patterns\n\n- **Firestore**: Primary database for conversations, memories, users\n- **Pinecone**: Vector embeddings for semantic search\n- **Redis**: Caching (speech profiles, enabled apps, user names)\n- **GCS**: Binary files (audio, photos, speech profiles)\n\n### API Endpoint Patterns\n\n- Use FastAPI routers in `routers/`\n- Keep routers thin - business logic in `utils/`\n- Use dependency injection for auth\n- Return consistent error formats\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Adding a New API Endpoint\n\n1. Create router function in appropriate `routers/*.py`\n2. Add business logic in `utils/`\n3. Use database functions from `database/`\n4. Follow error handling patterns\n5. Add to router in `main.py`\n\n### Processing Conversations\n\n1. Use `process_conversation()` from `utils/conversations/process_conversation.py`\n2. Handle extraction results\n3. Store in Firestore and Pinecone\n4. Trigger app webhooks if needed\n\n### Adding a Chat Tool\n\n1. Create tool function in `utils/retrieval/tools/`\n2. Use `@tool` decorator from LangChain\n3. Add to tool loading in `utils/retrieval/tools/app_tools.py`\n4. Tool will be available in agentic chat path\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n**The `docs/` folder is the single source of truth for all user-facing documentation, deployed at [docs.omi.me](https://docs.omi.me/).**\n\n- **Backend Deep Dive**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/backend_deepdive.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/backend_deepdive)\n- **Chat System**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/chat_system.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/chat_system)\n- **Data Storage**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/StoringConversations.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/StoringConversations)\n- **Transcription**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/transcription.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/transcription)\n- **Backend Setup**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/Backend_Setup.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/Backend_Setup)\n- **Backend Architecture**: `.cursor/rules/backend-architecture.mdc`\n\n## Related Cursor Resources\n\n### Rules\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-architecture.mdc` - System architecture and module hierarchy\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-api-patterns.mdc` - FastAPI router patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-database-patterns.mdc` - Database storage patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-llm-patterns.mdc` - LLM integration patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-testing.mdc` - Testing patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-imports.mdc` - Import rules\n- `.cursor/rules/memory-management.mdc` - Memory management\n\n### Subagents\n- `.cursor/agents/backend-api-developer/` - Uses this skill for API development\n- `.cursor/agents/backend-llm-engineer/` - Uses this skill for LLM integration\n- `.cursor/agents/backend-database-engineer/` - Uses this skill for database work\n\n### Commands\n- `/backend-setup` - Uses this skill for setup guidance\n- `/backend-test` - Uses this skill for testing patterns\n- `/backend-deploy` - Uses this skill for deployment patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:21:18.782Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational AI Agents needing advanced conversation processing and LangGraph integration capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级对话处理和 LangGraph 集成功能的对话式 AI 代理。","ja":"会話AIエージェントが高度な会話処理とLangGraph統合機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 대화 처리 및 LangGraph 통합 기능이 필요한 대화형 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Conversacional que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de conversación avanzadas y de integración con LangGraph.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA Conversationnels nécessitant un traitement de conversation avancé et des capacités d''intégration avec LangGraph.","de":"Perfekt für Conversational AI-Agents, die erweiterte Konversationsverarbeitungsfunktionen und LangGraph-Integrationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Conversacional que necessitam de processamento de conversa avançado e capacidades de integração com LangGraph.","ru":"Идеально для конверсационных агентов ИИ, требующих продвинутой обработки разговоров и возможностей интеграции с LangGraph.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للتعاملات التي تحتاج إلى معالجة محادثة متقدمة وقدرات تكامل مع LangGraph."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to process conversations, extract memories, and integrate with Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis using Python, while leveraging the LangGraph chat system for enhanced functionality.","zh":"使代理能够处理对话、提取记忆，并使用Python与Firestore、Pinecone或Redis集成，同时利用LangGraph聊天系统增强功能。","ja":"エージェントが会話を処理し、記憶を抽出し、Pythonを使用してFirestore、Pinecone、またはRedisと統合し、同時にLangGraphチャットシステムを使用して機能を強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 대화를 처리하고 기억을 추출하며 Python을 사용하여 Firestore, Pinecone 또는 Redis와 통합하고 LangGraph 채팅 시스템을 사용하여 기능을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a procesar conversaciones, extraer recuerdos e integrarse con Firestore, Pinecone o Redis utilizando Python, aprovechando al mismo tiempo el sistema de chat LangGraph para una funcionalidad mejorada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter les conversations, d''extraire des souvenirs et de s''intégrer avec Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis en utilisant Python, tout en exploitant le système de chat LangGraph pour une fonctionnalité améliorée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Konversationen zu verarbeiten, Erinnerungen zu extrahieren und sich mit Firestore, Pinecone oder Redis über Python zu integrieren, während sie gleichzeitig das LangGraph-Chatsystem für eine erweiterte Funktionalität nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar conversas, extrair memórias e integrar com Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis usando Python, aproveitando o sistema de chat LangGraph para funcionalidade aprimorada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать разговоры, извлекать воспоминания и интегрироваться с Firestore, Pinecone или Redis с помощью Python, используя систему чата LangGraph для расширенной функциональности.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من معالجة المحادثات واستخراج الذكريات وتكاملها مع Firestore أو Pinecone أو Redis باستخدام Python، مع استخدام نظام دردشة LangGraph لتحسين الوظيفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing new API endpoints for conversation processing","Extracting memories from user interactions","Integrating LangGraph with backend Python code"],"zh":["为对话处理实现新的 API 端点","从用户交互中提取记忆","将 LangGraph 与后端 Python 代码集成"],"ja":["会話処理のための新しいAPIエンドポイントを実装する","ユーザーのやり取りからメモリを抽出する","LangGraphをバックエンドPythonコードと統合する"],"ko":["대화 처리를 위한 새로운 API 엔드ポイント 구현","사용자 상호 작용에서 메모리 추출","LangGraph를 백엔드 Python 코드와 통합"],"es":["Implementar nuevos puntos de conexión de API para el procesamiento de conversaciones","Extraer recuerdos de las interacciones del usuario","Integrar LangGraph con el código Python de backend"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre de nouveaux points de terminaison d''API pour le traitement des conversations","Extraire des souvenirs des interactions utilisateur","Intégrer LangGraph avec le code Python de backend"],"de":["Implementierung neuer API-Endpunkte für die Konversationsverarbeitung","Extrahieren von Erinnerungen aus Benutzerinteraktionen","Integration von LangGraph mit dem Python-Backend-Code"],"pt":["Implementação de novos pontos de extremidade de API para processamento de conversa","Extração de memórias de interações do usuário","Integração do LangGraph com código Python de backend"],"ru":["Ре