a UI"],"fr":["Révision de PR dans le référentiel Razorpay","Vérification du diff et du statut de CI","Extraction de l''URL de l''aperçu Storybook","Option pour exécuter le navigateur en mode headed","Possibilité de demander des éclaircissements sur la révision de l''UI"],"de":["Überprüfung von PR im Razorpay-Repository","Überprüfung des Diff und des CI-Status","Extraktion der Storybook-Vorschau-URL","Option zum Ausführen des Browsers im headed-Modus","Möglichkeit zur Anfrage von Klarstellungen zur UI-Überprüfung"],"pt":["Revisão de PRs no repositório Razorpay/Blade","Verificação do diff e status do CI","Extração da URL de visualização do Storybook","Suporte a revisão de UI","Suporte a execução de navegador em modo headed"],"ru":["Проверка PR в репозитории Razorpay/Blade","Проверка diff и статуса CI","Извлечение URL-превью Storybook","Поддержка проверки UI","Поддержка запуска браузера в headed-режиме"],"ar":["مراجعة طلبات السحب في مستودع Razorpay/Blade","التحقق من الفرق والوضع المحدد","استخراج رابط المعاينة للstorybook","دعم مراجعة واجهة المستخدم","دعم تشغيل المتصفح في وضع المتصفح المتجه"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Review Changes 技术","Razorpay 设计系统","代码审查工具","CI 状态检查","Storybook 预览 URL","代码审查流程","开发效率"],"ja":["変更レビューティク","Razorpay デザインシステム","コードレビュー ツール","CI 状態の確認","Storybook プレビュー URL","コードレビューのプロセス","開発効率"],"ko":["변경 리뷰 기술","Razorpay 디자인 시스템","코드 리뷰 도구","CI 상태 확인","Storybook预览 URL","코드 리뷰 프로세스","개발 효율성"],"es":["revisar cambios","Razorpay","revisión de PR","diff","estado de CI","Storybook","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","revisión de código"],"fr":["vérifier les modifications","Razorpay","révision de PR","diff","statut de CI","Storybook","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","révision de code"],"de":["Änderungen überprüfen","Razorpay","PR-Überprüfung","Diff","CI-Status","Storybook","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Code-Überprüfung"],"pt":["revisão de alterações","Razorpay","Blade","PR","CI","storybook","revisão de UI","navegador headed"],"ru":["проверка изменений","Razorpay","Blade","PR","CI","storybook","проверка UI","headed-браузер"],"ar":["مراجعة التغييرات","Razorpay","Blade","طلبات السحب","الوضع المحدد","storybook","مراجعة واجهة المستخدم","متصفح متجه"]}},"owner":"razorpay","repo":"blade","repoPath":"razorpay/blade","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-changes","description":"Review blade PRs by fetching diff, checking CI status, and getting Storybook URL. Use when reviewing PRs, checking PR status, or getting preview links for razorpay/blade PRs.","bodyPreview":"# Review Blade PR\n\nReview PRs in the razorpay/blade repository by fetching the diff, checking CI status, and extracting the Storybook preview URL.\n\n## Arguments / Clarifications (Use Cursor''s AskQuestion tool to get clarifications)\n\n- PR: Link / Number of the PR to review\n- ShouldReviewUI: Whether UI should be reviewed or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n- ShouldRunHeadedBrowser: Whether to run the browser in headed mode or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- GitH","body":"# Review Blade PR\n\nReview PRs in the razorpay/blade repository by fetching the diff, checking CI status, and extracting the Storybook preview URL.\n\n## Arguments / Clarifications (Use Cursor''s AskQuestion tool to get clarifications)\n\n- PR: Link / Number of the PR to review\n- ShouldReviewUI: Whether UI should be reviewed or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n- ShouldRunHeadedBrowser: Whether to run the browser in headed mode or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- GitHub CLI (`gh`) must be installed and authenticated\n- `agent-browser` command must be installed (if ShouldReviewUI is true)\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Avoid printing intermediate commentary; only output the final review in the main chat\n\n## Steps (Create checklist for each step)\n\n### 1. Fetch the PR Diff and CI Status in Main Agent\n\n```\nhttps://patch-diff.githubusercontent.com/raw/razorpay/blade/pull/{PR_NUMBER}.diff\n```\n\n(Ignore the lock file changes from diff)\n\nFetch status checks once and extract both CI status and Storybook URL:\n\n```bash\ngh pr checks {PR_NUMBER} --repo razorpay/blade\n```\n\n#### If checks are failing / skipped, get the details from the checks on why they are failing / skipped\n\nUse the following command (replace `{JOB_ID}` with the job id from the previous `gh pr checks` output):\n\n```bash\ngh run view --job {JOB_ID} --repo razorpay/blade\n```\n\n### 2. UI Review the Changes (if ShouldReviewUI is true)\n\n- Using agent-browser (Do NOT use Playwright MCP), open the Storybook URL (returned by earlier subagent)\n  - `agent-browser --help` on docs on how to use it\n- Determine which URL to open based on the PR changes\n- `agent-browser close` to close any earlier opened browser instances\n- Open the URL with the agent-browser and test the functionality of the changes\n  ```sh\n  agent-browser open {storybook_url} --headed (if ShouldRunHeadedBrowser is true)\n  ```\n- Close the agent-browser at the end with `agent-browser close`\n\n#### How to Find Changes\n\n- You can open the story outside iframe using the `iframe.html` url of storybook\n  - E.g. `https://61c19ee8d3d282003ac1d81c-rzqbxanzgn.chromatic.com/?path=/story/components-datepicker--date-picker-presets-with-display-format-compact` this story can be opened as an iframe in `https://61c19ee8d3d282003ac1d81c-rzqbxanzgn.chromatic.com/iframe.html?args=&id=components-datepicker--date-picker-presets-with-display-format-compact&viewMode=story`\n  - If iframe is not working, open the storybook url directly and find the story in the sidebar\n- If changes are in svelte components, check the svelte version of storybook on `{storybook_base_url}/svelte/` route\n\nReport the flows / features that were tested, if they are working as expected or not, and the issues found.\n\n### 3. Code Review the Changes\n\nAnalyze the diff for:\n\n- Potential bugs or logic errors\n- TypeScript/type safety issues\n- Missing tests for new functionality\n- Accessibility concerns\n- Performance implications\n- API Breaking changes\n- Do not review the changes in the codebase, only review the changes in the diff.\n\n## Output Format\n\nThe subagent should return all the gathered information. Then in the main chat strictly following the output format mentioned in references/output-format.md\n\n- [Output Format](./references/output-format.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:21:39.342Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents automating PR analysis for Razorpay''s Blade design system.","zh":"非常适合代码审查代理自动化PR分析的Razorpay Blade设计系统。","ja":"RazorpayのBladeデザインシステムのPR分析の自動化に最適です。","ko":"Razorpay의 Blade 디자인 시스템의 PR 분석 자동화에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que automatizan el análisis de PR para el sistema de diseño Blade de Razorpay.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code qui automatisent l''analyse de PR pour le système de conception Blade de Razorpay.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die die PR-Analyse für Razorpay''s Blade-Designsystem automatisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que automatizam a análise de PR para o sistema de design Blade da Razorpay.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, автоматизирующих анализ PR для системы дизайна Blade от Razorpay.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يautomate تحليل PR لنظام التصميم Blade من Razorpay."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated PR review workflows by fetching GitHub diffs, checking CI status via GitHub API, and extracting Storybook preview URLs for visual component validation. Integrates directly with razorpay/blade repository infrastructure.","zh":"通过获取GitHub差异、检查CI状态通过GitHub API、提取Storybook预览URL进行视觉组件验证，实现自动化PR审查工作流。直接集成到razorpay/blade仓库基础设施中。","ja":"GitHubの差分を取得し、GitHub API経由でCIステータスを確認し、視覚的なコンポーネントの検証のためにStorybookのプレビューURLを抽出することで、自動化されたPRレビューのワークフローを可能にします。razorpay/bladeリポジトリのインフラストラクチャに直接統合します。","ko":"GitHub의 차이를 가져오고 GitHub API를 통해 CI 상태를 확인하고 시각적 컴포넌트 검증을 위한 Storybook 미리 보기 URL을 추출하여 자동화된 PR 리뷰 워크플로를 활성화합니다. razorpay/blade 저장소 인프라에 직접 통합됩니다.","es":"Habilita flujos de trabajo de revisión de PR automatizados al obtener diferencias de GitHub, verificar el estado de CI a través de la API de GitHub y extraer URLs de vista previa de Storybook para la validación de componentes visuales. Se integra directamente con la infraestructura del repositorio razorpay/blade.","fr":"Permet des flux de travail de révision de PR automatisés en récupérant les différences GitHub, en vérifiant le statut de CI via l''API GitHub et en extrayant les URL de prévisualisation Storybook pour la validation des composants visuels. S''intègre directement à l''infrastructure du référentiel razorpay/blade.","de":"Ermöglicht automatisierte PR-Überprüfungsworkflows durch Abrufen von GitHub-Diffs, Überprüfen des CI-Status über die GitHub-API und Extrahieren von Storybook-Vorschau-URLs für die visuelle Komponentenvalidierung. Integriert sich direkt in die Infrastruktur des razorpay/blade-Repositorys.","pt":"Permite fluxos de trabalho de revisão de PR automatizados, buscando diferenças do GitHub, verificando o status do CI por meio da API do GitHub e extraíndo URLs de visualização do Storybook para validação de componentes visuais. Integra-se diretamente com a infraestrutura do repositório razorpay/blade.","ru":"Позволяет автоматизировать рабочие процессы проверки PR, получая разницу из GitHub, проверяя статус CI через API GitHub и извлекая URLs предпросмотра Storybook для визуальной проверки компонентов. Интегрируется напрямую с инфраструктурой репозитория razorpay/blade.","ar":"يمكّن سير عمل المراجعة التلقائية لطلبات الدمج، من خلال استرجاع الفروقات من جيثب، وفحص حالة الاستمرار عبر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيثب، واستخراج عناوين URL لمعاينة ستوريبوك للمكونات المرئية. يمتزج بشكل مباشر مع بنية مستودع razorpay/blade."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating design system PR validation","Extracting Storybook URLs for visual testing","Checking CI status before manual review","Fetching GitHub diffs for code analysis"],"zh":["自动化设计系统PR验证","提取Storybook URL进行视觉测试","在手动审查之前检查CI状态","获取GitHub差异进行代码分析"],"ja":["デザインシステムのPR検証の自動化","視覚的なテストのためにStorybook URLを抽出する","手動レビューの前にCIステータスを確認する","コード分析のためにGitHubの差分を取得する"],"ko":["디자인 시스템의 PR 검증 자동화","시각적 테스트를 위한 Storybook URL 추출","수동 검토 전 CI 상태 확인","코드 분석을 위한 GitHub 차이 가져오기"],"es":["Automatización de la validación de PR del sistema de diseño","Extracción de URLs de Storybook para pruebas visuales","Comprobación del estado de CI antes de la revisión manual","Obtención de diferencias de GitHub para el análisis de código"],"fr":["Automatisation de la validation de PR du système de conception","Extraction des URL de Storybook pour les tests visuels","Vérification du statut de CI avant la révision manuelle","Récupération des différences GitHub pour l''analyse de code"],"de":["Automatisierung der PR-Validierung des Designsystems","Extraktion von Storybook-URLs für visuelle Tests","Überprüfung des CI-Status vor der manuellen Überprüfung","Abrufen von GitHub-Diffs für die Codeanalyse"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação de PR do sistema de design","Extrair URLs do Storybook para testes visuais","Verificar o status do CI antes da revisão manual","Buscar diferenças do GitHub para análise de código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку PR системы дизайна","Извлекать URLs Storybook для визуальных тестов","Проверять статус CI перед ручной проверкой","Получать разницу из GitHub для анализа кода"],"ar":["تحسين التلقائية لتحقق نظام التصميم لطلبات الدمج","استخراج عناوين URL من ستوريبوك لأغراض الاختبار المرئي","فحص حالة الاستمرار قبل المراجعة اليدوية","استرجاع الفروقات من جيثب لتحليل الكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub access credentials","Specific to razorpay/blade repository","Depends on Storybook deployment for preview URLs","Requires clarification prompts for UI/headed browser parameters"],"zh":["需要GitHub访问凭证","特定于razorpay/blade仓库","依赖于Storybook部署获取预览URL","需要澄清提示用于UI/头部浏览器参数"],"ja":["GitHubへのアクセス資格情報が必要","razorpay/bladeリポジトリに特有","プレビューURLの取得のためにStorybookのデプロイに依存","UI/ヘッドレスブラウザーのパラメータに使用するための明確なプロンプトが必要"],"ko":["GitHub에 대한 액세스 자격 증명이 필요합니다.","razorpay/blade 저장소에 특정","미리 보기 URL을 가져 오기 위해 Storybook 배포에 의존","UI/헤드리스 브라우저 매개 변수에 사용할 수있는 명확한 프롬프트가 필요"],"es":["Requiere credenciales de acceso a GitHub","Específico para el repositorio razorpay/blade","Depende de la implementación de Storybook para las URLs de vista previa","Requiere prompts de aclaración para los parámetros de navegador con interfaz gráfica de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations d''identification d''accès à GitHub","Spécifique au référentiel razorpay/blade","Dépend de la mise en œuvre de Storybook pour les URL de prévisualisation","Nécessite des invites de clarification pour les paramètres de navigateur avec interface graphique utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub-Zugriffsberechtigungen","Spezifisch für das razorpay/blade-Repository","Hängt von der Storybook-Bereitstellung für Vorschau-URLs ab","Benötigt Klärungsaufforderungen für UI- bzw. Browserparameter"],"pt":["Requer credenciais de acesso ao GitHub","Específico para o repositório razorpay/blade","Depende da implantação do Storybook para URLs de pré-visualização","Requer prompts de esclarecimento para parâmetros do navegador com UI/cabeçalho"],"ru":["Требует учетных данных доступа к GitHub","Конкретно для репозитория razorpay/blade","Зависит от развертывания Storybook для URLs предпросмотра","Требует подсказок для уточнения параметров браузера с UI/заголовком"],"ar":["يتطلب أوراق اعتماد الوصول إلى جيثب","محدد لمستودع razorpay/blade","يعتمد على نشر ستوريبوك لمعاينة عناوين URL","يتطلب إشارات توضيحية لمعلمات المتصفح مع واجهة المستخدم/الرأس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
