ajar ...","fr":"Élaborez des plans de mise en œuvre exhaustifs et documentez tout ce qui est nécessaire pour qu''un développeur ayant peu de connaissances sur votre base de c...","de":"Erstellen Sie umfassende Implementierungspläne und dokumentieren Sie alles, was ein Entwickler mit wenig Kenntnissen über Ihren Codebase benötigt, um effekti...","pt":"Plano de escrita para desenvolvedores com zero contexto sobre o código, incluindo tarefas, código, testes e documentação","ru":"План написания для разработчиков с нулевым контекстом кода, включая задачи, код, тесты и документацию","ar":"خطة الكتابة للمطورين الذين لديهم سياق صفر عن الشفرة، بما في ذلك المهام والشفرة والاختبارات والتوثيق","en":"Open Source Next.js Saas Boilerplate"},"definition":{"en":"Open Source Next.js Saas Boilerplate"},"features":{"zh":["Next.js SaaS","DRY","YAGNI","TDD",""],"ja":["Next.js SaaS","DRY","YAGNI","TDD",""],"ko":["Next.js SaaS","DRY","YAGNI","TDD",""],"es":["Documentación detallada","Tareas en tamaño bite","Pruebas frecuentes","Commits frecuentes","Seguimiento de principios DRY y YAGNI","Desarrollo orientado a pruebas"],"fr":["Documentation détaillée","Tâches de taille réduite","Testes fréquents","Commits fréquents","Suivi des principes DRY et YAGNI","Développement orienté vers les tests"],"de":["Detaillierte Dokumentation","Aufgaben in kleineren Schritten","Häufige Tests","Häufige Commits","Einhalten der Prinzipien DRY und YAGNI","Testgetriebene Entwicklung"],"pt":["Tarefas em tamanho reduzido","Código e testes","Documentação necessária","Commits frequentes","Princípios DRY e YAGNI"],"ru":["Задачи в уменьшенном размере","Код и тесты","Необходимая документация","Частые коммиты","Принципы DRY и YAGNI"],"ar":["مهام بحجم مصغر","الشفرة والاختبارات","التوثيق اللازم","الالتزامات المتكررة","مبادئ DRY و YAGNI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js SaaS","SaaS","Next.js","DRY","YAGNI","TDD",""],"ja":["Next.js SaaS","SaaS","Next.js","DRY","YAGNI","TDD",""],"ko":["Next.js SaaS","SaaS","Next.js","DRY","YAGNI","TDD",""],"es":["planificación de implementación","desarrollo de software","documentación técnica","pruebas de software","desarrollo ágil","principios DRY","principios YAGNI","desarrollo orientado a pruebas"],"fr":["planification de mise en œuvre","développement de logiciels","documentation technique","tests de logiciels","développement agile","principes DRY","principes YAGNI","développement orienté vers les tests"],"de":["Implementierungsplanung","Softwareentwicklung","technische Dokumentation","Softwaretests","agiles Entwicklung","DRY-Prinzipien","YAGNI-Prinzipien","testgetriebene Entwicklung"],"pt":["plano de escrita","desenvolvedores","código","testes","documentação","commits","DRY","YAGNI","TDD"],"ru":["план написания","разработчики","код","тесты","документация","коммиты","DRY","YAGNI","TDD"],"ar":["خطة الكتابة","المطورين","الشفرة","الاختبارات","التوثيق","الالتزامات","DRY","YAGNI","TDD"]}},"owner":"revokslab","repo":"ShipFree","repoPath":"revokslab/ShipFree","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writing-plans","description":"Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code","bodyPreview":"# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test","body":"# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test design very well.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the writing-plans skill to create the implementation plan.\"\n\n**Context:** This should be run in a dedicated worktree (created by brainstorming skill).\n\n**Save plans to:** `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature-name>.md`\n\n## Bite-Sized Task Granularity\n\n**Each step is one action (2-5 minutes):**\n- \"Write the failing test\" - step\n- \"Run it to make sure it fails\" - step\n- \"Implement the minimal code to make the test pass\" - step\n- \"Run the tests and make sure they pass\" - step\n- \"Commit\" - step\n\n## Plan Document Header\n\n**Every plan MUST start with this header:**\n\n```markdown\n# [Feature Name] Implementation Plan\n\n> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.\n\n**Goal:** [One sentence describing what this builds]\n\n**Architecture:** [2-3 sentences about approach]\n\n**Tech Stack:** [Key technologies/libraries]\n\n---\n```\n\n## Task Structure\n\n```markdown\n### Task N: [Component Name]\n\n**Files:**\n- Create: `exact/path/to/file.py`\n- Modify: `exact/path/to/existing.py:123-145`\n- Test: `tests/exact/path/to/test.py`\n\n**Step 1: Write the failing test**\n\n```python\ndef test_specific_behavior():\n    result = function(input)\n    assert result == expected\n```\n\n**Step 2: Run test to verify it fails**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: FAIL with \"function not defined\"\n\n**Step 3: Write minimal implementation**\n\n```python\ndef function(input):\n    return expected\n```\n\n**Step 4: Run test to verify it passes**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: PASS\n\n**Step 5: Commit**\n\n```bash\ngit add tests/path/test.py src/path/file.py\ngit commit -m \"feat: add specific feature\"\n```\n```\n\n## Remember\n- Exact file paths always\n- Complete code in plan (not \"add validation\")\n- Exact commands with expected output\n- Reference relevant skills with @ syntax\n- DRY, YAGNI, TDD, frequent commits\n\n## Execution Handoff\n\nAfter saving the plan, offer execution choice:\n\n**\"Plan complete and saved to `docs/plans/<filename>.md`. Two execution options:**\n\n**1. Subagent-Driven (this session)** - I dispatch fresh subagent per task, review between tasks, fast iteration\n\n**2. Parallel Session (separate)** - Open new session with executing-plans, batch execution with checkpoints\n\n**Which approach?\"**\n\n**If Subagent-Driven chosen:**\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development\n- Stay in this session\n- Fresh subagent per task + code review\n\n**If Parallel Session chosen:**\n- Guide them to open new session in worktree\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** New session uses superpowers:executing-plans"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:21:34.900Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Maintenance Agents needing structured implementation planning and documentation for Next.js SaaS boilerplates.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化实施计划和文档的代码维护代理，特别是针对 Next.js SaaS 模板。","ja":"Next.js SaaS ボイラープレートの構造化された実装計画とドキュメントが必要なコードメンテナンスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Next.js SaaS 보일러 플레이트에 구조화된 구현 계획 및 문서가 필요한 코드 유지 보수 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de mantenimiento de código que necesitan una planificación de implementación estructurada y documentación para plantillas de SaaS de Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de maintenance de code nécessitant une planification d''implémentation structurée et une documentation pour les modèles de SaaS Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Wartungsagenten, die eine strukturierte Implementierungsplanung und Dokumentation für Next.js-SaaS-Boilerplates benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Manutenção de Código que necessitam de planejamento de implementação estruturado e documentação para boilerplates SaaS do Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по обслуживанию кода, которым необходимы структурированный план реализации и документация для шаблонов SaaS Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل صيانة الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى تخطيط تنفيذ منظم وتوثيق لطبقة التأسيس SaaS ل Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive implementation plans using DRY principles, YAGNI methodology, and TDD practices, ensuring frequent commits and thorough documentation for new engineers, including which files to touch, code, testing, and relevant docs to check.","zh":"赋予代理创建综合的实施计划的能力，使用 DRY 原则、YAGNI 方法论和 TDD 实践，确保频繁提交和对新工程师的彻底文档记录，包括需要修改哪些文件、代码、测试和相关文档。","ja":"DRY 原則、YAGNI 方法論、TDD 実践を使用して包括的な実装計画を作成するエージェントの能力を強化し、新しいエンジニアにとって頻繁なコミットと徹底的なドキュメントレコードを保証します。包括するファイル、コード、テスト、関連ドキュメントなど。","ko":"DRY 원칙, YAGNI 방법론 및 TDD 연습을 사용하여 포괄적인 구현 계획을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화하여 새로운 엔지니어를 위한 빈번한 커밋 및 철저한 문서 기록을 보장합니다. 포함 파일, 코드, 테스트, 관련 문서 등.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear planes de implementación integrales utilizando principios DRY, metodología YAGNI y prácticas TDD, garantizando commits frecuentes y una documentación exhaustiva para nuevos ingenieros, incluyendo qué archivos tocar, código, pruebas y documentos relevantes para verificar.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des plans d''implémentation complets en utilisant les principes DRY, la méthodologie YAGNI et les pratiques TDD, garantissant des validations fréquentes et une documentation exhaustive pour les nouveaux ingénieurs, y compris quels fichiers toucher, code, tests et documents pertinents à vérifier.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Implementierungspläne unter Verwendung von DRY-Prinzipien, YAGNI-Methodik und TDD-Praktiken zu erstellen, um häufige Commits und eine gründliche Dokumentation für neue Ingenieure sicherzustellen, einschließlich welcher Dateien zu bearbeiten sind, Code, Tests und relevante Dokumente zu überprüfen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar planos de implementação abrangentes utilizando princípios DRY, metodologia YAGNI e práticas TDD, garantindo commits frequentes e documentação completa para novos engenheiros, incluindo quais arquivos tocar, código, testes e documentos relevantes para verificar.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать всесторонние планы реализации, используя принципы DRY, методологию YAGNI и практики TDD, обеспечивая частые коммиты и полную документацию для новых инженеров, включая какие файлы трогать, код, тесты и соответствующие документы для проверки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء خطط تنفيذ شاملة باستخدام مبادئ DRY ومنهجية YAGNI وممارسات TDD، مما يضمن التعهدات المتكررة والتوثيق الكامل للمهندسين الجدد، بما في ذلك الملفات التي يجب لمسها والشفرة والاختبارات والوثائق ذات الصلة للتحقق."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting Next.js SaaS boilerplate codebases for new engineers","Generating step-by-step implementation plans for complex tasks","Creating testing plans and validating code changes using TDD"],"zh":["为新工程师记录 Next.js SaaS 模板代码库","为复杂任务生成一步一步的实施计划","创建测试计划并使用 TDD 验证代码更改"],"ja":["新しいエンジニアのための Next.js SaaS ボイラープレート コードベースのドキュメント化","複雑なタスクのためのステップバイステップの実装計画の生成","TDD を使用したコード変更の検証とテスト計画の作成"],"ko":["새로운 엔지니어를 위한 Next.js SaaS 보일러 플레이트 코드베이스의 문서화","복잡한 작업을 위한 단계별 구현 계획의 생성","TDD를 사용하여 코드 변경 사항을 확인하고 테스트 계획을 생성"],"es":["Documentar bases de código de plantillas de SaaS de Next.js para nuevos ingenieros","Generar planes de implementación paso a paso para tareas complejas","Crear planes de pruebas y validar cambios de código utilizando TDD"],"fr":["Documenter les bases de code des modèles de SaaS Next.js pour les nouveaux ingénieurs","Générer des plans d''implémentation étape par étape pour les tâches complexes","Créer des plans de tests et valider les modifications de code en utilisant TDD"],"de":["Dokumentation von Codebasen für Next.js-SaaS-Boilerplates für neue Ingenieure","Erstellung von Schritt-für-Schritt-Implementierungsplänen für komplexe Aufgaben","Erstellung von Testplänen und Validi