thèmes","Modèles de composition de composants","Accessibilité","Intégration de formulaires"],"de":["CSS-Variable-Architektur","Dunkelmodus","Themenkonfiguration","Komponentenkompositions-Muster","Barrierefreiheit","Formularintegration"],"pt":["Configuração de tema com Tailwind v4","Integração com shadcn/ui","Compatibilidade com Vite e React","Suporte a TypeScript","Acessibilidade e padrões de composição de componentes"],"ru":["Настройка темы с Tailwind v4","Интеграция с shadcn/ui","Совместимость с Vite и React","Поддержка TypeScript","Доступность и шаблоны составления компонентов"],"ar":["إعداد الموضوعات مع Tailwind v4","التكامل مع shadcn/ui","التوافق مع Vite و React","دعم TypeScript","إمكانية الوصول ونماذج تركيبية للمكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","全栈 Web3","AI 项目","CSS 变量","暗黑模式","主题配置","组件组合","无障碍支持"],"ja":["Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","フルスタック Web3","AI プロジェクト","CSS 変数","ダークモード","テーマ設定","コンポーネント構成","アクセシビリティサポート"],"ko":["Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","풀스택 Web3","AI 프로젝트","CSS 변수","다크 모드","테마 설정","컴포넌트 구성","액세서빌리티 지원"],"es":["Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","Web3","AI","arquitectura de variables CSS","modo oscuro","configuración de temas","patrones de composición de componentes","accesibilidad"],"fr":["Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","Web3","AI","architecture des variables CSS","mode sombre","configuration des thèmes","modèles de composition de composants","accessibilité"],"de":["Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","Web3","AI","CSS-Variable-Architektur","Dunkelmodus","Themenkonfiguration","Komponentenkompositions-Muster","Barrierefreiheit"],"pt":["Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","Web3","AI","Vite","React","TypeScript","Acessibilidade","Desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","Web3","AI","Vite","React","TypeScript","Доступность","Веб-разработка"],"ar":["Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","الويب 3","AI","Vite","React","TypeScript","إمكانية الوصول","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"blockmatic","repo":"basilic","repoPath":"blockmatic/basilic","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Skill: shadcn\n\n## Scope\n\n- Applies to: Tailwind v4 with shadcn/ui setup, CSS variable architecture, dark mode, theme configuration, component composition patterns, accessibility, form integration\n- Does NOT cover: Tailwind v3, PostCSS configuration\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- Tailwind CSS v4+\n- shadcn/ui latest\n- Vite (use `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin)\n- React 18+ or Next.js 14+\n- TypeScript 5+\n\n## Principles\n\n- Use `@theme inline` to map CSS variables to Tailwind tokens\n- Use `hsl()` wrapper for color v","body":"# Skill: shadcn\n\n## Scope\n\n- Applies to: Tailwind v4 with shadcn/ui setup, CSS variable architecture, dark mode, theme configuration, component composition patterns, accessibility, form integration\n- Does NOT cover: Tailwind v3, PostCSS configuration\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- Tailwind CSS v4+\n- shadcn/ui latest\n- Vite (use `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin)\n- React 18+ or Next.js 14+\n- TypeScript 5+\n\n## Principles\n\n- Use `@theme inline` to map CSS variables to Tailwind tokens\n- Use `hsl()` wrapper for color values in `:root` and `.dark`\n- Set `\"tailwind.config\": \"\"` in `components.json` (empty for v4)\n- Delete `tailwind.config.ts` if it exists (v4 uses CSS-based config)\n- Use `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin (not PostCSS)\n- Use `cn()` utility for conditional classes\n- Semantic colors automatically adapt to dark mode (no `dark:` variants needed)\n- Use `@plugin` directive for plugins (not `@import` or `require()`)\n- Compose complex components from smaller shadcn primitives\n- Extend components via wrapper pattern (don''t modify originals)\n- Use CVA (class-variance-authority) for variant systems\n- Always use `forwardRef` for form-compatible components\n- Leverage Radix UI primitives for built-in accessibility\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST\n\n- Wrap color values with `hsl()` in `:root` and `.dark`\n- Use `@theme inline` to map all CSS variables\n- Set `\"tailwind.config\": \"\"` in `components.json`\n- Delete `tailwind.config.ts` if it exists\n- Use `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin\n\n### SHOULD\n\n- Use semantic color tokens (`--background`, `--foreground`, etc.)\n- Use `cn()` utility for conditional classes\n- Use `@plugin` directive for plugins\n- Compose components from smaller shadcn primitives\n- Use wrapper pattern to extend components (don''t modify originals)\n- Use CVA for variant systems in custom components\n- Use `forwardRef` for components that need ref forwarding\n- Test accessibility with keyboard navigation and screen readers\n- Use Radix UI primitives for complex interactions (dialogs, dropdowns, etc.)\n- Provide ARIA labels for icon-only buttons and interactive elements\n\n### AVOID\n\n- Putting `:root` or `.dark` inside `@layer base`\n- Using `.dark { @theme { } }` pattern (v4 doesn''t support nested @theme)\n- Double-wrapping colors (`hsl(var(--background))` in body)\n- Using `tailwind.config.ts` for theme colors\n- Using `@apply` directive (deprecated in v4)\n- Using `dark:` variants for semantic colors\n- Using `@import` or `require()` for plugins (use `@plugin`)\n- Modifying base shadcn components directly (use wrapper pattern)\n- Building custom dropdowns/dialogs from scratch (use Radix primitives)\n- Relying on color alone for state indication\n- Skipping accessibility testing\n\n## Interactions\n\n- Works with [nextjs](@cursor/skills/nextjs-v16/SKILL.md) for App Router setup\n- Uses [typescript](@cursor/skills/typescript-v5/SKILL.md) for type safety\n\n## Patterns\n\n### CSS Variable Setup\n\n```css\n/* src/index.css */\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n@theme inline {\n  --color-background: var(--background);\n  --color-foreground: var(--foreground);\n}\n\n:root {\n  --background: hsl(0 0% 100%);\n  --foreground: hsl(222.2 84% 4.9%);\n}\n\n.dark {\n  --background: hsl(222.2 84% 4.9%);\n  --foreground: hsl(210 40% 98%);\n}\n```\n\n### Vite Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// vite.config.ts\nimport tailwindcss from ''@tailwindcss/vite''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [react(), tailwindcss()],\n})\n```\n\n### Components Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tailwind\": {\n    \"config\": \"\",\n    \"css\": \"src/index.css\",\n    \"baseColor\": \"slate\",\n    \"cssVariables\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\nSee [Templates](templates/) (including [Component Extension](templates/component-extension.tsx)) and [Architecture](references/architecture.md) for complete setup.\n\n## References\n\n- [Architecture](references/architecture.md) - Complete setup pattern\n- [Dark Mode](references/dark-mode.md) - Dark mode implementation\n- [Common Gotchas](references/common-gotchas.md) - Common issues and fixes\n- [Migration Guide](references/migration-guide.md) - Migrating from v3\n- [Component Patterns](references/component-patterns.md) - Composition, CVA, extension patterns\n- [Accessibility](references/accessibility.md) - ARIA, keyboard navigation, screen readers\n- [Form Patterns](references/form-patterns.md) - React Hook Form integration\n\n## Resources\n\n- [shadcn/ui Tailwind v4 Guide](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/tailwind-v4)\n- [Tailwind v4 Docs](https://tailwindcss.com/docs)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:21:51.182Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring advanced CSS variable architecture and dark mode integration with Tailwind v4 and shadcn/ui.","zh":"适用于需要高级CSS变量架构和暗黑模式集成的Tailwind v4和shadcn/ui的前端代理。","ja":"Tailwind v4およびshadcn/uiの高度なCSS変数アーキテクチャとダークモード統合を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 CSS 변수 아키텍처와 Tailwind v4 및 shadcn/ui의 다크 모드 통합이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requieren una arquitectura de variables CSS avanzada y una integración de modo oscuro con Tailwind v4 y shadcn/ui.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant une architecture de variables CSS avancée et une intégration de mode sombre avec Tailwind v4 et shadcn/ui.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte CSS-Variable-Architektur und eine Dark-Mode-Integration mit Tailwind v4 und shadcn/ui erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem arquitetura de variáveis CSS avançada e integração de modo escuro com Tailwind v4 e shadcn/ui.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, требующих продвинутой архитектуры переменных CSS и интеграции темного режима с Tailwind v4 и shadcn/ui.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يتطلبون بنية متقدمة لمتغيرات CSS وتكامل وضع مظلم مع Tailwind v4 و shadcn/ui."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create responsive, accessible, and customizable web applications using Tailwind CSS v4+, shadcn/ui, and Vite, with features like theme configuration, component composition patterns, and form integration, all while leveraging TypeScript 5+ and React 18+ or Next.js 14+.","zh":"赋予代理创建响应式、可访问和可定制的Web应用程序的能力，使用Tailwind CSS v4+、shadcn/ui和Vite，具有主题配置、组件组成模式和表单集成等功能，同时利用TypeScript 5+和React 18+或Next.js 14+。","ja":"Tailwind CSS v4+、shadcn/ui、Viteを使用して、テーマ設定、コンポーネント構成パターン、フォーム統合などの機能を備えた、レスポンシブでアクセス可能なカスタマイズ可能なWebアプリケーションを作成するエージェントの能力を提供します。また、TypeScript 5+とReact 18+またはNext.js 14+を活用します。","ko":"Tailwind CSS v4+、shadcn/ui 및 Vite를 사용하여 반응형, 접근성 및 사용자 지정 가능한 웹 애플리케이션을 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다. 테마 구성, 구성 요소 구성 패턴, 양식 통합 등과 같은 기능을 가지며, TypeScript 5+ 및 React 18+ 또는 Next.js 14+를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones web responsivas, accesibles y personalizables utilizando Tailwind CSS v4+, shadcn/ui y Vite, con características como configuración de tema, patrones de composición de componentes y integración de formularios, todo mientras aprovecha TypeScript 5+ y React 18+ o Next.js 14+.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications web responsives, accessibles et personnalisables en utilisant Tailwind CSS v4+, shadcn/ui et Vite, avec des fonctionnalités telles que la configuration de thème, les modèles de composition de composants et l''intégration de formulaires, le tout en exploitant TypeScript 5+ et React 18+ ou Next.js 14+.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, responsive, zugängliche und anpassbare Webanwendungen mit Tailwind CSS v4+, shadcn/ui und Vite zu erstellen, mit Funktionen wie Themenkonfiguration, Kompositions muster für Komponenten und Formulareintegration, alles unter Ausnutzung von TypeScript 5+ und React 18+ oder Next.js 14+.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar aplicações web responsivas, acessíveis e personalizáveis usando Tailwind CSS v4+, shadcn/ui e Vite, com recursos como configuração de tema, padrões de composição de componentes e integração de formulários, tudo isso aproveitando o TypeScript 5+ e React 18+ ou Next.js 14+.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отзывчивые, доступные и настраиваемые веб-приложения, используя Tailwind CSS v4+, shadcn/ui и Vite, с функциями, такими как конфигурация темы, шаблоны составления компонентов и интеграция форм, все это, используя TypeScript 5+ и React 18+ или Next.js 14+.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات ويب مستجيبة وقابلة للوصول ومخصصة باستخدام Tailwind CSS v4+ و shadcn/ui و Vite، مع ميزات مثل تكوين الموضوع وأنماط تركيب المكونات وتكامل النماذج، كل ذلك بالاستفادة من TypeScript 5+ و React 18+ أو Next.js 14+."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring dark mode and theme settings for web applications","Building accessible and responsive UI components with shadcn/ui","Integrating forms and customizing CSS variables with Tailwind v4"],"zh":["为Web应用程序配置暗黑模式和主题设置","使用shadcn/ui构建可访问和响应式的UI组件","使用Tailwind v4集成表单和自定义CSS变量"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションのダークモードとテーマ設定の構成","shadcn/uiを使用したアクセス可能でレスポンシブなUIコンポーネントの構築","Tailwind v4を使用したフォームの統合とCSS変数のカスタマイズ"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션의 다크 모드 및 테마 설정 구성","shadcn/ui를 사용한 접근성 및 반응형 UI 컴포넌트 구축","Tailwind v4를 사용한 양식 통합 및 CSS 변수 사용자 지정"],"es":["Configuración de modo oscuro y ajustes de tema para aplicaciones web","Creación de componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y responsivos con shadcn/ui","Integración de formularios y personalización de variables CSS con Tailwind v4"],"fr":["Configuration du mode sombre et des paramètres de thème pour les applications web","Création de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et responsifs avec shadcn/ui","Intégration de formulaires et personnalisation de variables CSS avec Tailwind v4"],"de":["Konfiguration von Dark-Mode und Themen-Einstellungen für Webanwendungen","Erstellung von zugänglichen und responsiven Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten mit shadcn/ui","Integration von Formularen und Anpassung von CSS-Variablen mit Tailwind v4"],"pt":["Configurando modo escuro e configurações de tema para aplicações web","Construindo componentes de UI acessíveis e responsivos com shadcn/ui","Integrando formulários e personalizando variáveis CSS com Tailwind v4"],"ru":["Настройка темного режима и настроек темы для веб-приложений","Создание доступных и отзывчивых компонентов UI с помощью shadcn/ui","Интеграция форм и настройка переменных CSS с помощью Tailwind v4"],"ar":["تكوين وضع مظلم وإعدادات الموضوع لتطبيقات الويب","بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والمستجيبة مع shadcn/ui","دمج النماذج وتخصيص متغيرات CSS مع Tailwind v4"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailwind CSS v4+ and shadcn/ui latest","Only compatible with Vite using @tailwindcss/vite plugin","Limited to React 18+ or Next.js 14+ and TypeScript 5+"],"zh":["需要Tailwind CSS v4+和shadcn/ui最新版本","仅与使用@tailwindcss/vite插件的Vite兼容","仅限于React 18+或Next.js 14+和TypeScript 5+"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4+とshadcn/uiの最新バージョンが必要","@tailwindcss/viteプラグインを使用するViteのみと互換性がある","React 18+またはNext.js 14+とTypeScript 5+のみに限定される"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4+ 및 shadcn/ui의 최신 버전이 필요합니다.","@tailwindcss/vite 플러그인을 사용하는 Vite와만 호환됩니다.","React 18+ 또는 Next.js 14+ 및 TypeScript 5+로 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere Tailwind CSS v4+ y shadcn/ui última versión","Solo compatible con Vite utilizando el plugin @tailwindcss/vite","Limitado a React 18+ o Next.js 14+ y TypeScript 5+"],"fr":["Nécessite Tailwind CSS v4+ et shadcn/ui dernière version","Compatibilité uniquement avec Vite en utilisant le plugin @tailwindcss/vite","Limité à React 18+ ou Next.js 14+ et TypeScript 5+"],"de":["Benötigt Tailwind CSS v4+ und shadcn/ui neueste Version","Nur kompatibel mit Vite unter Verwendung des Plugins @tailwindcss/vite","Begrenzt auf React 18+ oder Next.js 14+ und TypeScript 5+"],"pt":["Exige Tailwind CSS v4+ e shadcn/ui mais recente","Somente compatível com Vite usando o plugin @tailwindcss/vite","Limitado a React 18+ ou Next.js 14+ e TypeScript 5+"],"ru":["Требует Tailwind CSS v4+ и последнюю версию shadcn/ui","Только совместимо с Vite с использованием плагина @tailwindcss/vite","Ограничено React 18+ или Next.js 14+ и TypeScript 5+"],"ar":["يتطلب Tailwind CSS v4+ و shadcn/ui الأحدث","متوافق فقط مع Vite باستخدام الإضافة @tailwindcss/vite","محدود بـ React 18+ أو Next.js 14+ و TypeScript 5+"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('victorgarciaesgi/regle/vite', 'community', 'victorgarciaesgi', 'regle', 'victorgarciaesgi/regle', 'vite', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z', '2026-02-18T10:21:52.202Z', NULL, '{"id":"victorgarciaesgi/regle/vite","name":"vite","description":{"zh":"Vite 是一个快速、优化的前端构建工具，支持 TypeScript 和 ESM，用于提高开发效率。它基于 Vite 8 beta，使用 Rolldown bundler 和 Oxc transformer","ja":"Vite は、高速で最適化されたフロントエンドビルドツールで、TypeScript と ESM をサポートします。Vite 8 beta に基づいており、Rolldown bundler と Oxc transformer を使用します","ko":"Vite는 빠르고 최적화된 프론트엔드 빌드 도구로 TypeScript와 ESM를 지원하여 개발 효율성을 향상합니다. Vite 8 beta에 기반하여 Rolldown bundler와 Oxc transformer를 사용합니다","es":"Vite es una herramienta de construcción frontend de próxima generación con servidor de desarrollo rápido y compilaciones de producción optimizadas","fr":"Vite est un outil de construction frontend de nouvelle génération avec serveur de développement rapide et compilations de production optimisées","de":"Vite ist ein Next-Generation-Frontend-Build-Tool mit schnellem Entwicklungs-Server und optimierten Produktions-Compilierungen","pt":"Vite é uma ferramenta de compilação frontend de próxima geração, com servidor de desenvolvimento rápido e builds de produção otimizados.","ru":"Vite — инструмент следующего поколения для сборки фронтенда с быстрым сервером разработки и оптимизированными сборками для производства.","ar":"Vite هي أداة بناء الجيل التالي للويب الأمامي، مع خادم التطوير السريع وعمليات بناء الإنتاج المُحسّنة.","en":"✅ Headless form validation library for Vue.js"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Vite：下一代前端构建工具","ja":"Vite：次世代フロントエンドビルドツール","ko":"Vite: 차세대 프론트엔드 빌드 도구","es":"Vite: Herramienta de construcción frontend de próxima gen...","fr":"Vite : Outil de construction frontend de nouvelle génération","de":"Vite: Next-Generation-Frontend-Build-Tool","pt":"Vite: Ferramenta de Compilação Frontend de Próxima Geração","ru":"Vite: Инструмент следующего поколения для сборки фронтенда","ar":"Vite: أداة بناء الجيل التالي للويب الأمامي","en":"vite"},"description":{"zh":"Vite 是一个快速、优化的前端构建工具，支持 TypeScript 和 ESM，用于提高开发效率。它基于 Vite 8 beta，使用 Rolldown bundler 和 Oxc transformer","ja":"Vite は、高速で最適化されたフロントエンドビルドツールで、TypeScript と ESM をサポートします。Vite 8 beta に基づいており、Rolldown bundler と Oxc transformer を使用します","ko":"Vite는 빠르고 최적화된 프론트엔드 빌드 도구로 TypeScript와 ESM를 지원하여 개발 효율성을 향상합니다. Vite 8 beta에 기반하여 Rolldown bundler와 Oxc transformer를 사용합니다","es":"Vite es una herramienta de construcción frontend de próxima generación con servidor de desarrollo rápido y compilaciones de producción optimizadas","fr":"Vite est un outil de construction frontend de nouvelle génération avec serveur de développement rapide et compilations de production optimisées","de":"Vite ist ein Next-Generation-Frontend-Build-Tool mit schnellem Entwicklungs-Server und optimierten Produktions-Compilierungen","pt":"Vite é uma ferramenta de compilação frontend de próxima geração, com servidor de desenvolvimento rápido e builds de produção otimizados.","ru":"Vite — инструмент следующего поколения для сборки фронтенда с быстрым сервером разработки и оптимизированными сборками для производства.","ar":"Vite هي أداة بناء الجيل التالي للويب الأمامي، مع خادم التطوير السريع وعمليات بناء الإنتاج المُحسّنة.","en":"✅ Headless form validation library for Vue.js"},"definition":{"en":"✅ Headless form validation library for Vue.js"},"features":{"zh":["快速开发服务器","优化的生产构建","支持 TypeScript","支持 ESM","基于 Vite 8 beta"],"ja":["高速開発サーバー","最適化された生产ビルド","TypeScript サポート","ESM サポート","Vite 8 beta に基づく"],"ko":["빠른 개발 서버","최적화된 프로덕션 빌드","TypeScript 지원","ESM 지원","Vite 8 beta 기반"],"es":["Servidor de desarrollo rápido con ESM nativo","Compilaciones de producción optimizadas","Soporte para TypeScript","Uso de Rolldown y Oxc","Actualizaciones en tiempo real"],"fr":["Serveur de développement rapide avec ESM natif","Compilations de production optimisées","Prise en charge de TypeScript","Utilisation de Rolldown et Oxc","Mises à jour en temps réel"],"de":["Schneller Entwicklungs-Server mit nativem ESM","Optimierte Produktions-Compilierungen","Unterstützung für TypeScript","Verwendung von Rolldown und Oxc","Echtzeit-Updates"],"pt":["Servidor de desenvolvimento rápido com suporte a ESM","Hot Module Replacement para atualizações em tempo real","Builds de produção otimizados","Suporte a TypeScript","Configuração condicional"],"ru":["Быстрый сервер разработки с поддержкой ESM","Горячая замена модулей для обновлений в реальном времени","Оптимизированные сборки для производства","Поддержка TypeScript","Условная конфигурация"],"ar":["خادم التطوير السريع مع دعم ESM","استبدال الوحدات الساخنة لتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي","عمليات بناء الإنتاج المُحسّنة","دعم لغة TypeScript","التكوين الشرطي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vite","前端构建工具","TypeScript","ESM","快速开发服务器","优化的生产构建"],"ja":["Vite","フロントエンドビルドツール","TypeScript","ESM","高速開発サーバー","最適化された生产ビルド"],"ko":["Vite","프론트엔드 빌드 도구","TypeScript","ESM","빠른 개발 서버","최적화된 프로덕션 빌드"],"es":["Vite","herramienta de construcción frontend","desarrollo web","TypeScript","Rolldown","Oxc","ESM","compilaciones de producción"],"fr":["Vite","outil de construction frontend","développement web","TypeScript","Rolldown","Oxc","ESM","compilations de production"],"de":["Vite","Frontend-Build-Tool","Web-Entwicklung","TypeScript","Rolldown","Oxc","ESM","Produktions-Compilierungen"],"pt":["Vite","ferramenta de compilação frontend","servidor de desenvolvimento rápido","Hot Module Replacement","builds de produção otimizados","TypeScript"],"ru":["Vite","инструмент для сборки фронтенда","быстрый сервер разработки","горячая замена модулей","оптимизированные сборки для производства","TypeScript"],"ar":["Vite","أداة بناء الويب الأمامي","خادم التطوير السريع","استبدال الوحدات الساخنة","عمليات بناء الإنتاج المُحسّنة","TypeScript"]}},"owner":"victorgarciaesgi","repo":"regle","repoPath":"victorgarciaesgi/regle","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vite","description":"Vite build tool configuration, plugin API, SSR, and Vite 8 Rolldown migration. Use when working with Vite projects, vite.config.ts, Vite plugins, or building libraries/SSR apps with Vite.","version":"2026.1.31","bodyPreview":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](refere","body":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| Features | `import.meta.glob`, asset queries (`?raw`, `?url`), `import.meta.env`, HMR API | [core-features](references/core-features.md) |\n| Plugin API | Vite-specific hooks, virtual modules, plugin ordering | [core-plugin-api](references/core-plugin-api.md) |\n\n## Build & SSR\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Build & SSR | Library mode, SSR middleware mode, `ssrLoadModule`, JavaScript API | [build-and-ssr](references/build-and-ssr.md) |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Environment API | Vite 6+ multi-environment support, custom runtimes | [environment-api](references/environment-api.md) |\n| Rolldown Migration | Vite 8 changes: Rolldown bundler, Oxc transformer, config migration | [rolldown-migration](references/rolldown-migration.md) |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### CLI Commands\n\n```bash\nvite              # Start dev server\nvite build        # Production build\nvite preview      # Preview production build\nvite build --ssr  # SSR build\n```\n\n### Common Config\n\n```ts\nimport { defineConfig } from ''vite''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [],\n  resolve: { alias: { ''@'': ''/src'' } },\n  server: { port: 3000, proxy: { ''/api'': ''http://localhost:8080'' } },\n  build: { target: ''esnext'', outDir: ''dist'' },\n})\n```\n\n### Official Plugins\n\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue` - Vue 3 SFC support\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue-jsx` - Vue 3 JSX\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react` - React with Oxc/Babel\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react-swc` - React with SWC\n- `@vitejs/plugin-legacy` - Legacy browser support\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:21:52.202Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring fast and optimized development server capabilities with native ESM and HMR support.","zh":"适用于需要快速且优化的开发服务器功能的前端代理，具有原生ESM和HMR支持。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高速で最適化された開発サーバーキャパシティを必要とする場合に適しています。ネイティブESMとHMRをサポートしています。","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 빠르고 최적화된 개발 서버 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. 네이티브 ESM 및 HMR를 지원합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren capacidades de servidor de desarrollo rápidas y optimizadas con soporte nativo para ESM y HMR.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant des capacités de serveur de développement rapides et optimisées avec un support natif pour ESM et HMR.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine schnelle und optimierte Entwicklungsserver-Funktion mit nativer ESM- und HMR-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requerem capacidades de servidor de desenvolvimento rápido e otimizado com suporte nativo ao ESM e HMR.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, требующих быстрого и оптимизированного сервера разработки с родной поддержкой ESM и HMR.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يتطلب خادم تطوير سريع ومحسّن مع دعم أصلية ل ESM و HMR."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Vite''s next-generation frontend build tool, utilizing Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer for optimized production builds, and enabling conditional configurations with `vite.config.ts` and `defineConfig`.","zh":"赋予代理使用Vite的下一代前端构建工具的能力，利用Rolldown打包器和Oxc转换器进行优化的生产构建，并通过`vite.config.ts`和`defineConfig`实现条件配置。","ja":"エージェントがViteの次世代フロントエンドビルドツールを利用できるようにし、RolldownバンドラーとOxcトランスフォーマーを使用して最適化されたプロダクションビルドを実現し、`vite.config.ts`と`defineConfig`で条件付き構成を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Vite의 차세대 프론트엔드 빌드 도구를 사용할 수 있도록 하여 Rolldown 번들러와 Oxc 트랜스포머를 사용하여 최적화된 프로덕션 빌드를 실현하며, `vite.config.ts` 및 `defineConfig`로 조건부 구성이 가능합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar la herramienta de construcción de frontend de próxima generación de Vite, utilizando el empacador Rolldown y el transformador Oxc para compilaciones de producción optimizadas, y habilitando configuraciones condicionales con `vite.config.ts` y `defineConfig`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter l''outil de construction de frontend de nouvelle génération de Vite, en utilisant le bundleur Rolldown et le transformateur Oxc pour des builds de production optimisés, et en activant des configurations conditionnelles avec `vite.config.ts` et `defineConfig`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Vites Frontend-Build-Tool der nächsten Generation zu nutzen, indem sie den Rolldown-Bundler und den Oxc-Transformer für optimierte Produktionsbuilds verwenden und bedingte Konfigurationen mit `vite.config.ts` und `defineConfig` ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar a ferramenta de compilação de frontend de próxima geração do Vite, utilizando o empacotador Rolldown e o transformador Oxc para compilações de produção otimizadas, e permitindo configurações condicionais com `vite.config.ts` e `defineConfig`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать инструмент следующего поколения для сборки фронтенда Vite, использующий пакетный менеджер Rolldown и трансформатор Oxc для оптимизированных сборок производства, и позволяет условные конфигурации с `vite.config.ts` и `defineConfig`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الاستفادة من أداة بناء واجهة المستخدم التالية الجيل من Vite، باستخدام حزمة Rolldown ومحول Oxc لإنشاء إنتاج محسّن، وتمكين التكوينات الشرطية مع `vite.config.ts` و `defineConfig`."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring development servers with native ESM and HMR","Optimizing production builds using Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer","Managing conditional configurations with `vite.config.ts` and `defineConfig`"],"zh":["使用原生ESM和HMR配置开发服务器","使用Rolldown打包器和Oxc转换器优化生产构建","使用`vite.config.ts`和`defineConfig`管理条件配置"],"ja":["ネイティブESMとHMRを使用した開発サーバーの構成","RolldownバンドラーとOxcトランスフォーマーを使用したプロダクションビルドの最適化","`vite.config.ts`と`defineConfig`を使用した条件付き構成の管理"],"ko":["네이티브 ESM 및 HMR를 사용한 개발 서버 구성","Rolldown 번들러 및 Oxc 트랜스포머를 사용한 프로덕션 빌드 최적화","`vite.config.ts` 및 `defineConfig`를 사용한 조건부 구성 관리"],"es":["Configuración de servidores de desarrollo con ESM y HMR nativos","Optimización de compilaciones de producción utilizando el empacador Rolldown y el transformador Oxc","Administración de configuraciones condicionales con `vite.config.ts` y `defineConfig`"],"fr":["Configuration de serveurs de développement avec ESM et HMR natifs","Optimisation des builds de production en utilisant le bundleur Rolldown et le transformateur Oxc","Gestion de configurations conditionnelles avec `vite.config.ts` et `defineConfig`"],"de":["Konfiguration von Entwicklungsservern mit nativem ESM und HMR","Optimierung von Produktionsbuilds unter Verwendung des Rolldown-Bundlers und des Oxc-Transformers","Verwaltung von bedingten Konfigurationen mit `vite.config.ts` und `defineConfig`"],"pt":["Configurando servidores de desenvolvimento com ESM e HMR nativos","Otimizando compilações de produção usando o empacotador Rolldown e o transformador Oxc","Gerenciando configurações condicionais com `vite.config.ts` e `defineConfig`"],"ru":["Настройка серверов разработки с родными ESM и HMR","Оптимизация сборок производства с помощью пакетного менеджера Rolldown и трансформатора Oxc","Управление условными конфигурациями с `vite.config.ts` и `defineConfig`"],"ar":["تكوين خوادم التطوير مع دعم أصلية ل ESM و HMR","تحسين إنشاء الإنتاج باستخدام حزمة Rolldown ومحول Oxc","إدارة التكوينات الشرطية مع `vite.config.ts` و `defineConfig`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript for preferred configuration","Limited to ESM, avoiding CommonJS"],"zh":["需要TypeScript进行首选配置","仅限ESM，避免CommonJS"],"ja":["優先的な構成にはTypeScriptが必要","CommonJSを避けてESMのみ"],"ko":["선호하는 구성에는 TypeScript가 필요합니다.","CommonJS를 피하고 ESM만 사용"],"es":["Requiere TypeScript para la configuración preferida","Limitado a ESM, evitando CommonJS"],"fr":["Nécessite TypeScript pour la configuration préférée","Limité à ESM, en évitant CommonJS"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript für die bevorzugte Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf ESM, wobei CommonJS vermieden wird"],"pt":["Requer TypeScript para configuração preferida","Limitado a ESM, evitando CommonJS"],"ru":["Требует TypeScript для предпочтительной конфигурации","Ограничен до ESM, избегая CommonJS"],"ar":["يتطلب TypeScript لتكوين مفضل","محدود إلى ESM، وتجنب CommonJS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
