"99 рекомендаций по UX","25 типов графиков"],"ar":["أكثر من 50 نمطًا من التصميم","97 لوحة ألوان","57 زوجًا من الخطوط","99 توجيهًا لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","25 نوعًا من الرسومات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI设计","UX设计","设计智能","设计指南","开发者工具","前端开发"],"ja":["UIデザイン","UXデザイン","デザインインテリジェンス","デザインガイド","開発者ツール","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["UI 디자인","UX 디자인","디자인 인텔리전스","디자인 가이드","개발자 도구","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["diseño UI/UX","desarrollo web","aplicaciones móviles","experiencia del usuario","guias de diseño","recomendaciones de diseño"],"fr":["conception UI/UX","développement web","applications mobiles","expérience utilisateur","guides de conception","recommandations de conception"],"de":["Design UI/UX","Web-Entwicklung","Mobile-Anwendungen","Benutzererfahrung","Design-Leitfäden","Design-Empfehlungen"],"pt":["ui/ux design","ferramenta de design","interfaces de usuário","desenvolvimento web","desenvolvimento mobile","estilos de design","paletas de cores","paragens de fontes"],"ru":["дизайн ui/ux","инструмент дизайна","пользовательские интерфейсы","веб-разработка","мобильная разработка","стили дизайна","цветовые палитры","пары шрифтов"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم","أداة التصميم","واجهات المستخدم","تطوير الويب","تطوير التطبيقات المحمولة","أنماط التصميم","اللوحات الألوان","أزواج الخطوط"]}},"owner":"cooker","repo":"wxHm","repoPath":"cooker/wxHm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Designing new UI components or pages\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\n- Implementing acce","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Designing new UI components or pages\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\n\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\n\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\n\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\n\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\n\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\n\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\n\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\n\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\n\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\n\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\n\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\n\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\n\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\n\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\n\n## How to Use\n\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\n\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\n\n```bash\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\n```\n\nThis command:\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\n```\n\n### Step 2b: Persist Design System (Master + Overrides Pattern)\n\nTo save the design system for **hierarchical retrieval across sessions**, add `--persist`:\n\n```bash\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system --persist -p \"Project Name\"\n```\n\nThis creates:\n- `design-system/MASTER.md` — Global Source of Truth with all design rules\n- `design-system/pages/` — Folder for page-specific overrides\n\n**With page-specific override:**\n```bash\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system --persist -p \"Project Name\" --page \"dashboard\"\n```\n\nThis also creates:\n- `design-system/pages/dashboard.md` — Page-specific deviations from Master\n\n**How hierarchical retrieval works:**\n1. When building a specific page (e.g., \"Checkout\"), first check `design-system/pages/checkout.md`\n2. If the page file exists, its rules **override** the Master file\n3. If not, use `design-system/MASTER.md` exclusively\n\n**Context-aware retrieval prompt:**\n```\nI am building the [Page Name] page. Please read design-system/MASTER.md.\nAlso check if design-system/pages/[page-name].md exists.\nIf the page file exists, prioritize its rules.\nIf not, use the Master rules exclusively.\nNow, generate the code...\n```\n\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\n\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\n\n```bash\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**When to use detailed searches:**\n\n| Need | Domain | Example |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\n\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`, `jetpack-compose`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\n| `jetpack-compose` | Composables, Modifiers, State Hoisting, Recomposition |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\n\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\n\n```bash\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\n```\n\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\n\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\n\n```bash\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\n```\n\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\n\n```bash\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Output Formats\n\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\n\n```bash\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\n\n# Markdown - best for documentation\npython3 .continue/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\n\n### Interaction\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\n\n### Light/Dark Mode\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\n\n### Layout\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n### Accessibility\n- [ ] All images have alt text\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:21:57.868Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-focused Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX guidelines and style recommendations for web and mobile applications.","zh":"非常适合需要全面UI/UX指南和风格建议的设计导向型代理，适用于网页和移动应用程序。","ja":"デザインに焦点を当てたエージェントが、Webおよびモバイルアプリケーションに適した包括的なUI/UXガイドラインとスタイル推奨事項を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"디자인 중심 에이전트가 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 포괄적인 UI/UX 가이드라인 및 스타일 권장 사항을 필요로 하는 경우에 иде적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes enfocados en diseño que necesitan directrices y recomendaciones de estilo UI/UX completas para aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur la conception nécessitant des directives et des recommandations de style UI/UX complètes pour les applications Web et mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte Agenten, die umfassende UI/UX-Richtlinien und Stilempfehlungen für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Design que necessitam de diretrizes abrangentes de UI/UX e recomendações de estilo para aplicativos web e móveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на дизайн, которым необходимы всесторонние рекомендации по UI/UX и стилю для веб- и мобильных приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتجهين إلى التصميم الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات شاملة حول واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم وتوصيات النمط للويب والتطبيقات المحمولة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing interfaces with 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring UX consistency across 9 technology stacks using searchable databases and priority-based recommendations with UX guidelines and chart types.","zh":"赋予代理创建视觉上吸引人的界面，拥有50+风格、97色板和57字体配对，同时确保在9个技术栈中使用可搜索数据库和基于优先级的推荐以及UX指南和图表类型来实现UX的一致性。","ja":"エージェントが、50以上のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントのペアを使用して、視覚的に美しいインターフェイスを作成できるようにし、検索可能なデータベースと優先順位に基づく推奨事項、UXガイドライン、およびチャートタイプを使用して、9つのテクノロジースタックにわたってUXの一貫性を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 50가지 이상의 스타일, 97개의 색상 팔레트, 57개의 폰트 쌍을 사용하여 시각적으로 매력적인 인터페이스를 만들 수 있도록 해줌과 동시에 검색 가능한 데이터베이스 및 우선순위 기반 추천과 UX 가이드라인 및 차트 유형을 사용하여 9개의 기술 스택에 걸쳐 UX 일관성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces visualmente atractivas con más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes, garantizando al mismo tiempo la coherencia de la experiencia del usuario en 9 pilas tecnológicas utilizando bases de datos buscables y recomendaciones basadas en prioridades con directrices de UX y tipos de gráficos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces visuellement attrayantes avec plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 appariements de polices, tout en assurant la cohérence de l''expérience utilisateur sur 9 piles technologiques en utilisant des bases de données recherchables et des recommandations basées sur les priorités avec des directives UX et des types de graphiques.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, visuell ansprechende Schnittstellen mit über 50 Stilen, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen zu erstellen, während gleichzeitig die Konsistenz der Benutzeroberfläche über 9 Technologie-Stacks mithilfe von durchsuchbaren Datenbanken und prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen mit UX-Richtlinien und Chart-Typen gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces visualmente atraentes com 50+ estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes, garantindo a consistência da experiência do usuário em 9 pilhas de tecnologia usando bancos de dados pesquisáveis e recomendações baseadas em prioridade com diretrizes de experiência do usuário e tipos de gráficos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать визуально привлекательные интерфейсы с 50+ стилями, 97 цветовыми палитрами и 57 комбинациями шрифтов, обеспечивая согласованность пользовательского опыта на 9 технологических стеках с помощью поисковых баз данных и рекомендаций на основе приоритета с руководствами по пользовательскому опыту и типами диаграмм.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات جذابة بصريًا مع أكثر من 50 نمطًا و 97 لوحة ألوان و 57 زوجًا من الخطوط، مع ضمان الاتساق في تجربة المستخدم على 9 مجموعات تقنية باستخدام قواعد بيانات قابلة للبحث وتوصيات بالاستناد إلى الأولوية مع إرشادات لتجربة المستخدم وأنواع الرسومات."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new UI components or pages with consistent styling","Generating color palettes and typography for brand consistency","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing accessibility features"],"zh":["设计具有一致样式的新UI组件或页面","为品牌一致性生成色彩调色板和字体","审查代码以查找UX问题并实施可访问性功能"],"ja":["一貫したスタイルを持つ新しいUIコンポーネントまたはページを設計する","ブランドの一貫性のためにカラーパレットとフォントを生成する","コードをレビューしてUXの問題を特定し、アクセシビリティ機能を実装する"],"ko":["일관된 스타일을 가진 새로운 UI 컴포넌트 또는 페이지를 디자인함","브랜드 일관성을 위해 색상 팔레트 및 글꼴 생성","코드를 검토하여 UX 문제를 식별하고 접근성 기능을 구현함"],"es":["Diseñar nuevos componentes de interfaz de usuario o páginas con estilos coherentes","Generar paletas de colores y tipografía para la coherencia de la marca","Revisar el código para problemas de UX e implementar características de accesibilidad"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouveaux composants d''interface utilisateur ou des pages avec un style cohérent","Générer des palettes de couleurs et une typographie pour la cohérence de la marque","Examiner le code pour les problèmes d''UX et mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités d''accessibilité"],"de":["Neue Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten oder Seiten mit konsistentem Stil entwerfen","Farbpaletten und Typografie für Markenkontinuität generieren","Code auf UX-Probleme überprüfen und Zugriffsmöglichkeiten implementieren"],"pt":["Projetar novos componentes de interface do usuário ou páginas com estilização consistente","Gerar paletas de cores e tipografia para consistência da marca","Revisar código para problemas de experiência do usuário e implementar recursos de acessibilidade"],"ru":["Проектировать новые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса или страницы с единым стилем","Генерировать цветовые палитры и типографику для согласованности бренда","Проверять код на наличие проблем с пользовательским опытом и реализовывать функции доступности"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجديدة أو الصفحات مع تنسيق متسق","توليد لوحات الألوان والطباعة الحرفية لتسلسل العلامة التجارية","مراجعة الشفرة للقضايا المتعلقة بتجربة المستخدم وتنفيذ ميزات إمكانية الوصول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to design databases and style guides","Limited to web and mobile application design"],"zh":["需要访问设计数据库和样式指南","仅限于网页和移动应用程序设计"],"ja":["デザインデータベースとスタイルガイドへのアクセスが必要","Webおよびモバイルアプリケーションの設計のみに限定される"],"ko":["디자인 데이터베이스 및 스타일 가이드에 대한 액세스가 필요함","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션 디자인에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a bases de datos de diseño y guías de estilo","Limitado al diseño de aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux bases de données de conception et aux guides de style","Limité à la conception d''applications Web et mobiles"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Design-Datenbanken und Stilguides","Begrenzt auf das Design von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige acesso a bases de dados de design e guias de estilo","Limitado ao design de aplicativos web e móveis"],"ru":["Требует доступа к базам данных дизайна и руководствам по стилю","Ограничен дизайном веб- и мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قواعد بيانات التصميم ومرشدات الأسلوب","محدود بتصميم التطبيقات الويب والجوال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('BetterSEQTA/DesQTA/premium-ui-refinement', 'community', 'BetterSEQTA', 'DesQTA', 'BetterSEQTA/DesQTA', 'premium-ui-refinement', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z', '2026-02-18T10:22:09.928Z', NULL, '{"id":"BetterSEQTA/DesQTA/premium-ui-refinement","name":"premium-ui-refinement","description":{"zh":"Premium UI 精炼是一种为 DesQTA 提供高品质用户体验的方法，通过应用动画和视觉设计模式。它遵循 Material Design 和 Svelte 转换标准","ja":"プレミアム UI リファインは、DesQTA に高品質のユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供するための方法です。アニメーションと視覚デザインパターンを適用し、Material Design と Svelte トランジションの標準に従います","ko":"프리미엄 UI 정련은 DesQTA에서 고품질의 사용자 경험을 제공하는 방법입니다. 애니메이션과 시각 디자인 패턴을 적용하며, Material Design와 Svelte 전환의 표준을 따릅니다","es":"Aplicación de patrones de animación y diseño visual para crear una experiencia de usuario premium en DesQTA","fr":"Application de modèles d''animation et de conception visuelle pour créer une expérience utilisateur premium dans DesQTA","de":"Anwendung von Animations- und visuellen Designmustern zur Erstellung einer Premium-Benutzererfahrung in DesQTA","pt":"O refinamento de UI premium envolve a aplicação de padrões de animação e design visual para criar uma experiência de usuário aprimorada em DesQTA","ru":"Премиум рефайнмент интерфейса включает применение шаблонов анимации и визуального дизайна для создания улучшенного опыта пользователя в DesQTA","ar":"تطوير واجهة المستخدم المتميزة يتضمن تطبيق أنماط التحريك والتصميم البصري لإنشاء تجربة مستخدم محسنة في DesQTA","en":"A port of the SEQTA website and BetterSEQTA+ interface to native desktop"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"高级 UI 精炼 - 为 DesQTA 提供高品质用户体验","ja":"プレミアム UI リファイン - DesQTA に高品質のユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供","ko":"프리미엄 UI 정련 - DesQTA 에서 고품질 사용자 경험 제공","es":"Refinamiento de UI premium para DesQTA","fr":"Raffinement de l''UI premium pour DesQTA","de":"Premium-UI-Verfeinerung für DesQTA","pt":"Refinamento de UI Premium para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Премиум рефайнмент интерфейса для разработчиков","ar":"تطوير واجهة المستخدم المتميزة للمطورين","en":"premium-ui-refinement"},"description":{"zh":"Premium UI 精炼是一种为 DesQTA 提供高品质用户体验的方法，通过应用动画和视觉设计模式。它遵循 Material Design 和 Svelte 转换标准","ja":"プレミアム UI リファインは、DesQTA に高品質のユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供するための方法です。アニメーションと視覚デザインパターンを適用し、Material Design と Svelte トランジションの標準に従います","ko":"프리미엄 UI 정련은 DesQTA에서 고품질의 사용자 경험을 제공하는 방법입니다. 애니메이션과 시각 디자인 패턴을 적용하며, Material Design와 Svelte 전환의 표준을 따릅니다","es":"Aplicación de patrones de animación y diseño visual para crear una experiencia de usuario premium en DesQTA","fr":"Application de modèles d''animation et de conception visuelle pour créer une expérience utilisateur premium dans DesQTA","de":"Anwendung von Animations- und visuellen Designmustern zur Erstellung einer Premium-Benutzererfahrung in DesQTA","pt":"O refinamento de UI premium envolve a aplicação de padrões de animação e design visual para criar uma experiência de usuário aprimorada em DesQTA","ru":"Премиум рефайнмент интерфейса включает применение шаблонов анимации и визуального дизайна для создания улучшенного опыта пользователя в DesQTA","ar":"تطوير واجهة المستخدم المتميزة يتضمن تطبيق أنماط التحريك والتصميم البصري لإنشاء تجربة مستخدم محسنة في DesQTA","en":"A port of the SEQTA website and BetterSEQTA+ interface to native desktop"},"definition":{"en":"A port of the SEQTA website and BetterSEQTA+ interface to native desktop"},"features":{"zh":["应用 Material Design 标准","使用 Svelte 转换","动画和视觉设计模式","元素复杂度匹配持续时间","高品质用户体验"],"ja":["Material Design 標準の適用","Svelte トランジションの使用","アニメーションと視覚デザインパターン","要素の複雑さに合わせた継続時間","高品質のユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["Material Design 표준 적용","Svelte 전환 사용","애니메이션과 시각 디자인 패턴","요소 복잡도에 따른 지속 시간","고품질 사용자 경험"],"es":["Funciones de suavización para transiciones suaves","Jerarquía de duración para cambios de UI","Compatibilidad con Material Design y Svelte","Diseño visual premium para una experiencia de usuario refinada","Aplicación de patrones de animación comprobados"],"fr":["Fonctions de lissage pour des transitions fluides","Hiérarchie de durée pour les changements d''UI","Compatibilité avec Material Design et Svelte","Conception visuelle premium pour une expérience utilisateur raffinée","Application de modèles d''animation éprouvés"],"de":["Verlaufs-Funktionen für flüssige Übergänge","Dauer-Hierarchie für UI-Änderungen","Kompatibilität mit Material Design und Svelte","Visuelles Premium-Design für eine verfeinerte Benutzererfahrung","Anwendung von bewährten Animationsmustern"],"pt":["Aplicação de funções de easing","Hierarquia de duração para elementos de UI","Uso de padrões de animação e design visual","Criação de uma experiência de usuário premium","Otimização de UI para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Применение функций easing","Иерархия продолжительности для элементов интерфейса","Использование шаблонов анимации и визуального дизайна","Создание премиум-опыта пользователя","Оптимизация интерфейса для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["تطبيق دوال التخفيف","هرمية المدة لعناصر واجهة المستخدم","استخدام أنماط التحريك والتصميم البصري","إنشاء تجربة مستخدم متميزة","تحسين واجهة المستخدم لأداء أفضل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Premium UI 精炼","DesQTA","Material Design","Svelte","用户体验设计","高品质界面","动画设计"],"ja":["プレミアム UI リファイン","DesQTA","Material Design","Svelte","ユーザーエクスペリエンス設計","高品質インターフェイス","アニメーションデザイン"],"ko":["프리미엄 UI 정련","DesQTA","Material Design","Svelte","사용자 경험 설계","고품질 인터페이스","애니메이션 디자인"],"es":["refinamiento de UI","experiencia de usuario premium","patrones de animación","diseño visual","Material Design","Svelte","desarrollo de software","ux design"],"fr":["raffinement de l''UI","expérience utilisateur premium","modèles d''animation","conception visuelle","Material Design","Svelte","développement de logiciels","conception UX"],"de":["UI-Verfeinerung","Premium-Benutzererfahrung","Animationsmuster","visuelles Design","Material Design","Svelte","Software-Entwicklung","UX-Design"],"pt":["refinamento de UI","desenvolvimento de software","experiência de usuário","animação","design visual","padrões de design","otimização de UI","desempenho de aplicativos"],"ru":["рефайнмент интерфейса","разработка программного обеспечения","опыт пользователя","анимация","визуальный дизайн","шаблоны дизайна","оптимизация интерфейса","производительность приложений"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة المستخدم","تطوير البرمجيات","تجربة المستخدم","التحريك","التصميم البصري","أنماط التصميم","تحسين واجهة المستخدم","أداء التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"BetterSEQTA","repo":"DesQTA","repoPath":"BetterSEQTA/DesQTA","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"premium-ui-refinement","description":"Apply premium animation and UI refinement patterns to create polished, refined user experiences. Use when working on animations, transitions, UI polish, or when the user asks about making elements feel more premium or refined.","bodyPreview":"# Premium UI Refinement\n\nApply proven animation and visual design patterns to create a premium, refined user experience throughout DesQTA.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Easing Functions\n\n**Never use linear easing.** Always use:\n\n- `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)` (Material Design standard)\n- `cubicInOut` from `svelte/easing` for Svelte transitions\n\n### 2. Duration Hierarchy\n\nMatch duration to element complexity:\n\n- **150-200ms**: Simple UI (buttons, dropdowns, tooltips)\n- **300ms**: Moderate changes","body":"# Premium UI Refinement\n\nApply proven animation and visual design patterns to create a premium, refined user experience throughout DesQTA.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Easing Functions\n\n**Never use linear easing.** Always use:\n\n- `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)` (Material Design standard)\n- `cubicInOut` from `svelte/easing` for Svelte transitions\n\n### 2. Duration Hierarchy\n\nMatch duration to element complexity:\n\n- **150-200ms**: Simple UI (buttons, dropdowns, tooltips)\n- **300ms**: Moderate changes (sidebars, modals, panels)\n- **400-500ms**: Complex content (page sections, data tables)\n- **500-1000ms**: Data visualizations (charts, graphs)\n\n### 3. Multi-Property Animations\n\nCombine multiple properties for richer feel:\n\n- Opacity + transform (scale/translate)\n- Width + opacity\n- Position + scale\n- Never animate just one property\n\n### 4. Transform Origin\n\nSet `transform-origin` to logical anchor points:\n\n- Text elements: `left center` (matches reading flow)\n- Buttons: `center center` (default)\n- Dropdowns: anchor to trigger element\n\n### 5. Stagger Sequential Elements\n\nUse delays for related elements:\n\n- First element: 0ms\n- Second: 100ms delay\n- Third: 200ms delay\n- Creates visual hierarchy\n\n### 6. Visual Effects Layering\n\nCombine effects for depth:\n\n- `backdrop-blur-md` for glassmorphism\n- `shadow-2xl` for elevation\n- Semi-transparent backgrounds (`bg-white/95`)\n- Multiple effects work together\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Premium Fade-In\n\n```svelte\n<div transition:fade={{ duration: 200 }}>\n  <!-- Content -->\n</div>\n```\n\n### Scale + Fade Animation\n\n```svelte\n<div\n  class=\"transition-all duration-200\"\n  style=\"animation: fadeInScale 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\">\n  <!-- Content -->\n</div>\n```\n\nCSS:\n\n```css\n@keyframes fadeInScale {\n  0% {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scale(0.95);\n  }\n  100% {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: scale(1);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Premium Dropdown\n\n```svelte\n<div\n  transition:fly={{ y: -8, duration: 200, opacity: 0 }}\n  class=\"backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl bg-white/95 dark:bg-zinc-900/90\">\n  <!-- Dropdown content -->\n</div>\n```\n\n### Staggered Sequential Loading\n\n```svelte\n<div in:fade={{ duration: 400 }}>Filters</div>\n<div in:fade={{ duration: 400, delay: 100 }}>Charts</div>\n<div in:fade={{ duration: 400, delay: 200 }}>Table</div>\n```\n\n### Chart Animations\n\n```javascript\n// Bar chart - animate from bottom\nmotion: {\n  x: { type: \"tween\", duration: 500, easing: cubicInOut },\n  y: { type: \"tween\", duration: 500, easing: cubicInOut },\n  height: { type: \"tween\", duration: 500, easing: cubicInOut },\n  width: { type: \"tween\", duration: 500, easing: cubicInOut },\n}\n\n// Area chart - clip-path reveal\nmotion={{\n  width: { type: \"tween\", duration: 1000, easing: cubicInOut }\n}}\n```\n\n### Sidebar/Major UI Transitions\n\n```svelte\n<aside\n  class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden\"\n  class:w-full={open}\n  class:w-0={!open}\n  class:opacity-0={!open}\n  class:opacity-100={open}\n  class:pointer-events-none={!open}\n  class:pointer-events-auto={open}>\n```\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\nWhen adding or refining animations:\n\n- [ ] Easing function is not linear (use `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)` or `cubicInOut`)\n- [ ] Duration matches element complexity (200ms simple, 300ms moderate, 400-500ms complex)\n- [ ] Multiple properties animated (opacity + transform, width + opacity, etc.)\n- [ ] Transform origin set appropriately for scaling/rotating\n- [ ] Sequential elements staggered with delays (100ms, 200ms)\n- [ ] Visual effects layered (blur, shadow, transparency)\n- [ ] Pointer events managed during transitions\n- [ ] Overflow handled correctly (`overflow-hidden` when needed)\n- [ ] Responsive behavior considered (mobile vs desktop)\n- [ ] Consistent with existing patterns in codebase\n\n## Examples from Codebase\n\n**Editor headings:** `src/components/Editor/EditorStyles.css` (fadeInScale animation)\n**User dropdown:** `src/lib/components/UserDropdown.svelte` (fly transition with blur)\n**Analytics charts:** `src/lib/components/analytics/` (staggered loading, chart animations)\n**Sidebar:** `src/lib/components/AppSidebar.svelte` (multi-property transitions)\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nFor detailed analysis of premium animation patterns, see [docs/development/premium-animations-analysis.md](../../docs/development/premium-animations-analysis.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:22:09.928Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing refined user interface design with cubic-bezier easing functions and Svelte transitions","zh":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing refined user interface design with cubic-bezier easing functions and Svelte transitions","ja":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing refined user interface design with cubic-bezier easing functions and Svelte transitions","ko":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing refined user interface design with cubic-bezier easing functions and Svelte transitions","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un diseño de interfaz de usuario refinado con funciones de suavizado cubic-bezier y transiciones Svelte","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une conception d''interface utilisateur raffinée avec des fonctions d''assouplissement cubic-bezier et des transitions Svelte","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein verfeinertes Benutzeroberflächendesign mit cubic-bezier-Easing-Funktionen und Svelte-Übergängen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Frontend que necessitam de design de interface do usuário refinado com funções de easing cubic-bezier e transições Svelte","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы усовершенствованные пользовательские интерфейсы с функциями cubic-bezier easing и переходами Svelte","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامي الذي يحتاج إلى تصميم واجهة مستخدم معقدة مع وظائف التأخير الكوبيك-بيزير وانتقالات سفت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create premium user experiences with proven animation patterns, utilizing cubic-bezier and cubicInOut from svelte/easing for seamless interactions, and applying duration hierarchies for element complexity","zh":"Empowers agents to create premium user experiences with proven animation patterns, utilizing cubic-bezier and cubicInOut from svelte/easing for seamless interactions, and applying duration hierarchies for element complexity","ja":"Empowers agents to create premium user experiences with proven animation patterns, utilizing cubic-bezier and cubicInOut from svelte/easing for seamless interactions, and applying duration hierarchies for element complexity","ko":"Empowers agents to create premium user experiences with proven animation patterns, utilizing cubic-bezier and cubicInOut from svelte/easing for seamless interactions, and applying duration hierarchies for element complexity","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear experiencias de usuario de alta calidad con patrones de animación probados, utilizando cubic-bezier y cubicInOut de svelte/easing para interacciones sin problemas, y aplicando jerarquías de duración para la complejidad de los elementos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences utilisateur de haute qualité avec des modèles d''animation éprouvés, en utilisant cubic-bezier et cubicInOut de svelte/easing pour des interactions sans accroc, et en appliquant des hiérarchies de durée pour la complexité des éléments","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, Premium-Benutzeroberflächen mit bewährten Animationsmustern zu erstellen, indem sie cubic-bezier und cubicInOut aus svelte/easing für nahtlose Interaktionen nutzen und Dauerhierarchien für Elementkomplexität anwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar experiências de usuário premium com padrões de animação comprovados, utilizando cubic-bezier e cubicInOut do svelte/easing para interações sem interrupção, e aplicando hierarquias de duração para complexidade de elementos","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать премиум-пользовательские trải nghiệm с проверенными анимационными шаблонами, используя cubic-bezier и cubicInOut из svelte/easing для бесперебойных взаимодействий, и применяя иерархии продолжительности для сложности элементов","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء تجارب مستخدم متقدمة باستخدام أنماط رسوم متحركة مثبتة، باستخدام cubic-bezier وcubicInOut من svelte/easing للتفاعلات السلسة، وتطبيق هرمية المدة لتعقيد العناصر"},"useCases":{"en":["Refining UI components with Material Design standard easing","Implementing duration hierarchies for simple and moderate UI changes","Enhancing Svelte transitions with cubicInOut easing functions"],"zh":["Refining UI components with Material Design standard easing","Implementing duration hierarchies for simple and moderate UI changes","Enhancing Svelte transitions with cubicInOut easing functions"],"ja":["Refining UI components with Material Design standard easing","Implementing duration hierarchies for simple and moderate UI changes","Enhancing Svelte transitions with cubicInOut easing functions"],"ko":["Refining UI components with Material Design standard easing","Implementing duration hierarchies for simple and moderate UI changes","Enhancing Svelte transitions with cubicInOut easing functions"],"es":["Perfeccionar componentes de interfaz de usuario con el estándar de suavizado de Material Design","Implementar jerarquías de duración para cambios de interfaz de usuario simples y moderados","Mejorar las transiciones Svelte con funciones de suavizado cubicInOut"],"fr":["Affiner les composants d''interface utilisateur avec la norme d''assouplissement de Material Design","Mettre en œuvre des hiérarchies de durée pour des changements d''interface utilisateur simples et modérés","Améliorer les transitions Svelte avec des fonctions d''assouplissement cubicInOut"],"de":["Verfeinern von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit dem Material-Design-Easing-Standard","Implementieren von Dauerhierarchien für einfache und moderate Benutzeroberflächenänderungen","Verbessern von Svelte-Übergängen mit cubicInOut-Easing-Funktionen"],"pt":["Aperfeiçoar componentes de UI com padrão de easing do Material Design","Implementar hierarquias de duração para alterações de UI simples e moderadas","Melhorar transições Svelte com funções de easing cubicInOut"],"ru":["Усовершенствовать компоненты UI с помощью стандарта easing Material Design","Реализовать иерархии продолжительности для простых и умеренных изменений UI","Улучшить переходы Svelte с помощью функций easing cubicInOut"],"ar":["تحسين مكونات الواجهة باستخدام معيار التأخير من تصميم المواد","تنفيذ هرمية المدة لتحديثات الواجهة البسيطة والمتوسطة","تحسين انتقالات سفت باستخدام وظائف التأخير الكوبيك-بيزير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Svelte framework for transitions","Limited to specific easing functions and duration hierarchies"],"zh":["Requires Svelte framework for transitions","Limited to specific easing functions and duration hierarchies"],"ja":["Requires Svelte framework for transitions","Limited to specific easing functions and duration hierarchies"],"ko":["Requires Svelte framework for transitions","Limited to specific easing functions and duration hierarchies"],"es":["Requiere el framework Svelte para transiciones","Limitado a funciones de suavizado específicas y jerarquías de duración"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Svelte pour les transitions","Limité à des fonctions d''assouplissement spécifiques et des hiérarchies de durée"],"de":["Benötigt das Svelte-Framework für Übergänge","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Easing-Funktionen und Dauerhierarchien"],"pt":["Requer framework Svelte para transições","Limitado a funções de easing específicas e hierarquias de duração"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Svelte для переходов","Ограничен конкретными функциями easing и иерархиями продолжительности"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار سفت للانتقالات","محدود bằng وظائف التأخير المحددة وهرمية المدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
