-change는 실험 워크플로우에서 완료된 변경을 아카이브하는 기능입니다","es":"El skill openspec-archive-change te permite archivar cambios en tu flujo de trabajo experimental","fr":"Le skill openspec-archive-change vous permet d''archiver les modifications dans votre flux de travail expérimental","de":"Das Skill openspec-archive-change ermöglicht es Ihnen, Änderungen in Ihrem experimentellen Arbeitsablauf zu archivieren","pt":"O openspec-archive-change é uma ferramenta para arquivar alterações completas no fluxo de trabalho experimental.","ru":"Openspec-archive-change - это инструмент для архивации завершенных изменений в экспериментальном рабочем процессе.","ar":"openspec-archive-change هو أداة لأرشفة التغييرات المكتملة في تدفق العمل التجريبي","en":"Your favorite web apps, now on your phone."},"definition":{"en":"Your favorite web apps, now on your phone."},"features":{"zh":["实验工作流","存档已完成更改","开发者工具","命令行接口","用户交互"],"ja":["実験ワークフロー","完了した変更のアーカイブ","開発者ツール","コマンドラインインターフェース","ユーザーインタラクション"],"ko":["실험 워크플로우","완료된 변경의 아카이브","개발자 도구","명령줄 인터페이스","사용자 상호작용"],"es":["Archivar cambios en el flujo de trabajo experimental","Seleccionar cambios disponibles con AskUserQuestion","Mostrar solo cambios activos","Incluir esquema utilizado para cada cambio","Omitir el nombre del cambio y inferirlo del contexto de la conversación"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications dans le flux de travail expérimental","Sélectionner les modifications disponibles avec AskUserQuestion","Afficher uniquement les modifications actives","Inclure le schéma utilisé pour chaque modification","Omettre le nom de la modification et le déduire du contexte de la conversation"],"de":["Änderungen im experimentellen Arbeitsablauf archivieren","Verfügbare Änderungen mit AskUserQuestion auswählen","Nur aktive Änderungen anzeigen","Für jede Änderung das verwendete Schema einbeziehen","Änderungsnamen weglassen und aus dem Konversationskontext ableiten"],"pt":["Arquivar alterações completas","Seleção de alterações ativas","Uso do AskUserQuestion tool","Execução do comando openspec list --json","Exibição de esquemas para cada alteração"],"ru":["Архивация завершенных изменений","Выбор активных изменений","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion","Выполнение команды openspec list --json","Отображение схем для каждого изменения"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة","اختيار التغييرات النشطة","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion","تشغيل الأمر openspec list --json","عرض مخططات لكل تغيير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-archive-change","实验工作流","开发者工具","命令行接口","用户交互","技术文档"],"ja":["openspec-archive-change","実験ワークフロー","開発者ツール","コマンドラインインターフェース","ユーザーインタラクション","テクニカルドキュメント"],"ko":["openspec-archive-change","실험 워크플로우","개발자 도구","명령줄 인터페이스","사용자 상호작용","테크니컬 문서"],"es":["openspec","archivar cambios","flujo de trabajo experimental","AskUserQuestion","cambios activos","esquema de cambio","desarrollo de software","automatización de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["openspec","archiver les modifications","flux de travail expérimental","AskUserQuestion","modifications actives","schéma de modification","développement de logiciels","automatisation de flux de travail"],"de":["openspec","Änderungen archivieren","experimenteller Arbeitsablauf","AskUserQuestion","aktive Änderungen","Änderungsschema","Softwareentwicklung","Automatisierung von Arbeitsabläufen"],"pt":["openspec-archive-change","arquivar alterações","fluxo de trabalho experimental","AskUserQuestion tool","openspec list --json","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["openspec-archive-change","архивация изменений","экспериментальный рабочий процесс","инструмент AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["openspec-archive-change","أرشفة التغييرات","تدفق العمل التجريبي","أداة AskUserQuestion","openspec list --json","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"theoden8","repo":"webspace_app","repoPath":"theoden8/webspace_app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-archive-change","description":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow. Use when the user wants to finalize and archive a change after implementation is complete.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for eac","body":"Archive a completed change in the experimental workflow.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show only active changes (not already archived).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check artifact completion status**\n\n   Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json` to check artifact completion.\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used\n   - `artifacts`: List of artifacts with their status (`done` or other)\n\n   **If any artifacts are not `done`:**\n   - Display warning listing incomplete artifacts\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n3. **Check task completion status**\n\n   Read the tasks file (typically `tasks.md`) to check for incomplete tasks.\n\n   Count tasks marked with `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete).\n\n   **If incomplete tasks found:**\n   - Display warning showing count of incomplete tasks\n   - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to confirm user wants to proceed\n   - Proceed if user confirms\n\n   **If no tasks file exists:** Proceed without task-related warning.\n\n4. **Assess delta spec sync state**\n\n   Check for delta specs at `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`. If none exist, proceed without sync prompt.\n\n   **If delta specs exist:**\n   - Compare each delta spec with its corresponding main spec at `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`\n   - Determine what changes would be applied (adds, modifications, removals, renames)\n   - Show a combined summary before prompting\n\n   **Prompt options:**\n   - If changes needed: \"Sync now (recommended)\", \"Archive without syncing\"\n   - If already synced: \"Archive now\", \"Sync anyway\", \"Cancel\"\n\n   If user chooses sync, execute /opsx:sync logic (use the openspec-sync-specs skill). Proceed to archive regardless of choice.\n\n5. **Perform the archive**\n\n   Create the archive directory if it doesn''t exist:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   ```\n\n   Generate target name using current date: `YYYY-MM-DD-<change-name>`\n\n   **Check if target already exists:**\n   - If yes: Fail with error, suggest renaming existing archive or using different date\n   - If no: Move the change directory to archive\n\n   ```bash\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n6. **Display summary**\n\n   Show archive completion summary including:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema that was used\n   - Archive location\n   - Whether specs were synced (if applicable)\n   - Note about any warnings (incomplete artifacts/tasks)\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Archive Complete\n\n**Change:** <change-name>\n**Schema:** <schema-name>\n**Archived to:** openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/\n**Specs:** ✓ Synced to main specs (or \"No delta specs\" or \"Sync skipped\")\n\nAll artifacts complete. All tasks complete.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Always prompt for change selection if not provided\n- Use artifact graph (openspec status --json) for completion checking\n- Don''t block archive on warnings - just inform and confirm\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive (it moves with the directory)\n- Show clear summary of what happened\n- If sync is requested, use openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven)\n- If delta specs exist, always run the sync assessment and show the combined summary before prompting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:22:02.763Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Automation Agents managing OpenSpec experimental workflow changes.","zh":"非常适合用于DevOps自动化代理管理OpenSpec实验性工作流变更。","ja":"DevOps自動化エージェントがOpenSpecの実験的ワークフローの変更を管理するのに最適です。","ko":"DevOps 자동화 에이전트가 OpenSpec 실험적 워크플로우 변경을 관리하는 데 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de DevOps que gestionan cambios de flujo de trabajo experimental de OpenSpec.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation DevOps gérant les modifications du flux de travail expérimental OpenSpec.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Automatisierungsagenten, die experimentelle Workflow-Änderungen von OpenSpec verwalten.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação DevOps que gerenciam mudanças experimentais de workflow OpenSpec.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации DevOps, управляющих экспериментальными изменениями рабочего процесса OpenSpec.","ar":"مثالي لعميل آلي أتمتة DevOps لإدارة تغييرات تدفق العمل التجريبية OpenSpec."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to programmatically archive completed experimental changes by interfacing with the OpenSpec CLI. Provides intelligent change discovery through `openspec list --json` integration and handles contextual ambiguity by prompting users for selection when needed.","zh":"使代理能够通过与OpenSpec CLI的接口来编程归档已完成的实验性变更。通过`openspec list --json`集成提供智能变更发现，并在需要时通过提示用户进行选择来处理上下文模糊性。","ja":"エージェントがOpenSpec CLIとのインターフェイスを介して完了した実験的変更をプログラムでアーカイブできるようにします。`openspec list --json`統合を通じてインテリジェントな変更の発見を提供し、必要に応じてユーザーに選択を求めることで文脈の曖昧性を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 OpenSpec CLI와의 인터페이스를 통해 완료된 실험적 변경을 프로그래밍 방식으로 보관할 수 있도록 합니다. `openspec list --json` 통합을 통해 지능형 변경 검색을 제공하며 필요한 경우 사용자에게 선택을 요청하여 문脈적 모호성을 처리합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes archivar programáticamente los cambios experimentales completados mediante la interfaz con la CLI de OpenSpec. Proporciona un descubrimiento inteligente de cambios a través de la integración de `openspec list --json` y maneja la ambigüedad contextual solicitando a los usuarios que seleccionen cuando sea necesario.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver de manière programmatique les modifications expérimentales terminées en faisant interface avec la CLI OpenSpec. Fournit une découverte intelligente de changements via l''intégration de `openspec list --json` et gère l''ambiguïté contextuelle en invitant les utilisateurs à sélectionner lorsque nécessaire.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, programmgesteuert abgeschlossene experimentelle Änderungen über die Schnittstelle mit der OpenSpec-CLI zu archivieren. Bietet intelligente Änderungserkennung durch `openspec list --json`-Integration und behandelt kontextuelle Mehrdeutigkeit, indem die Benutzer bei Bedarf zur Auswahl aufgefordert werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes arquivem programaticamente as mudanças experimentais concluídas, interfazendo com a CLI do OpenSpec. Fornece descoberta de alterações inteligentes por meio da integração do `openspec list --json` e lida com ambiguidade contextual solicitando que os usuários selecionem quando necessário.","ru":"Позволяет агентам программно архивировать завершенные экспериментальные изменения, взаимодействуя с CLI OpenSpec. Предоставляет интеллектуальное обнаружение изменений через интеграцию с `openspec list --json` и решает контекстную двусмысленность, запрашивая у пользователей выбор при необходимости.","ar":"يسمح للعميل الآلي بأرشفة التغييرات التجريبية المكتملة بشكل برمجي عن طريق التفاعل مع سطر أوامر OpenSpec. يوفر اكتشاف التغييرات الذكية من خلال التكامل مع `openspec list --json` ويحمل الغموض السياقي من خلال مطالبة المستخدمين بالاختيار عند الحاجة."},"useCases":{"en":["Archiving completed experimental changes","Automating CI/CD pipeline cleanup","Managing OpenSpec workflow states","Resolving ambiguous change requests through user prompts"],"zh":["归档已完成的实验性变更","自动化CI/CD管道清理","管理OpenSpec工作流状态","通过用户提示解析模糊的变更请求"],"ja":["完了した実験的変更のアーカイブ","CI/CDパイプラインのクリーンアップの自動化","OpenSpecワークフローの状態の管理","ユーザーのプロンプトを通じて曖昧な変更リクエストの解決"],"ko":["완료된 실험적 변경의 보관","CI/CD 파이프라인 정리 자동화","OpenSpec 워크플로우 상태 관리","사용자 프롬프트를 통해 모호한 변경 요청 해결"],"es":["Archivar cambios experimentales completados","Automatizar la limpieza de la tubería de CI/CD","Gestionar estados de flujo de trabajo de OpenSpec","Resolver solicitudes de cambio ambiguas a través de solicitudes de selección de usuario"],"fr":["Archiver les modifications expérimentales terminées","Automatiser le nettoyage de la pipeline de CI/CD","Gérer les états de flux de travail OpenSpec","Résoudre les demandes de modification ambiguës via des invites de sélection d''utilisateur"],"de":["Abgeschlossene experimentelle Änderungen archivieren","Automatisierung der Bereinigung der CI/CD-Pipeline","Verwalten von OpenSpec-Workflow-Zuständen","Auflösung mehrdeutiger Änderungsanfragen durch Benutzerauswahlanfragen"],"pt":["Arquivamento de mudanças experimentais concluídas","Automação da limpeza do pipeline CI/CD","Gerenciamento de estados de workflow OpenSpec","Resolução de solicitações de alteração ambíguas por meio de prompts de usuário"],"ru":["Архивирование завершенных экспериментальных изменений","Автоматизация очистки конвейера CI/CD","Управление состояниями рабочего процесса OpenSpec","Разрешение неоднозначных запросов на изменение через подсказки пользователя"],"ar":["أرشفة التغييرات التجريبية المكتملة","أتمتة تنظيف خط أنابيب CI/CD","إدارة حالات سير عمل OpenSpec","حل طلبات التغيير الغامضة من خلال مطالبة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenSpec CLI installation","Depends on experimental workflow context","Needs user interaction for ambiguous inputs"],"zh":["需要OpenSpec CLI安装","依赖于实验性工作流上下文","需要用户交互来处理模糊输入"],"ja":["OpenSpec CLIのインストールが必要","実験的ワークフローのコンテキストに依存","曖昧な入力の処理にユーザーのインタラクションが必要"],"ko":["OpenSpec CLI 설치가 필요","실험적 워크플로우 문脈에 의존","모호한 입력을 처리하기 위해 사용자 상호작용이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de OpenSpec","Depende del contexto del flujo de trabajo experimental","Necesita interacción del usuario para entradas ambiguas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI OpenSpec","Dépend du contexte du flux de travail expérimental","Nécessite une interaction utilisateur pour les entrées ambiguës"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der OpenSpec-CLI","Hängt vom Kontext des experimentellen Workflows ab","Benötigt Benutzereingriff für mehrdeutige Eingaben"],"pt":["Exige instalação da CLI do OpenSpec","Depende do contexto do workflow experimental","Necessita de interação do usuário para entradas ambíguas"],"ru":["Требует установки CLI OpenSpec","Зависит от контекста экспериментального рабочего процесса","Требует взаимодействия пользователя для неоднозначных входных данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت سطر أوامر OpenSpec","يعتمد على سياق تدفق العمل التجريبي","يحتاج إلى تفاعل المستخدم للإدخالات الغامضة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('IdkwhatImD0ing/Taxes/seo-audit', 'community', 'IdkwhatImD0ing', 'Taxes', 'IdkwhatImD0ing/Taxes', 'seo-audit', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z', '2026-02-18T10:22:24.513Z', NULL, '{"id":"IdkwhatImD0ing/Taxes/seo-audit","name":"seo-audit","description":{"zh":"SEOSEO","ja":"SEO","ko":"SEO","es":"El análisis de SEO te ayuda a identificar problemas y mejorar tu posición en buscadores. Obtén recomendaciones para mejorar tu rendimiento en búsquedas orgánicas.","fr":"L''audit SEO vous aide à identifier les problèmes et à améliorer votre position dans les moteurs de recherche. Obtenez des recommandations pour améliorer vos performances de recherche organique.","de":"Das SEO-Audit hilft Ihnen, Probleme zu identifizieren und Ihre Position in Suchmaschinen zu verbessern. Erhalten Sie Empfehlungen, um Ihre Suchmaschinen-Performance zu steigern.","pt":"A análise SEO é um processo que identifica problemas de otimização e fornece recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca.","ru":"Аудит SEO - это процесс, который выявляет проблемы оптимизации и предоставляет рекомендации для улучшения результатов поиска.","ar":"تقييم تحسين محركات البحث هو عملية تحدد مشاكل التحسين وتقدم توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث.","en":"Taxes"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"SEOudit","ko":"SEO","es":"Análisis de SEO: Mejora tu posición en buscadores","fr":"Audit SEO: Améliorez votre référencement","de":"SEO-Audit: Verbessere deine Suchmaschinen-Position","pt":"Análise SEO: Otimização de Desempenho de Busca","ru":"Аудит SEO: Оптимизация Результатов Поиска","ar":"تقييم SEO: تحسين أداء البحث","en":"seo-audit"},"description":{"zh":"SEOSEO","ja":"SEO","ko":"SEO","es":"El análisis de SEO te ayuda a identificar problemas y mejorar tu posición en buscadores. Obtén recomendaciones para mejorar tu rendimiento en búsquedas orgán...","fr":"L''audit SEO vous aide à identifier les problèmes et à améliorer votre position dans les moteurs de recherche. Obtenez des recommandations pour améliorer vos ...","de":"Das SEO-Audit hilft Ihnen, Probleme zu identifizieren und Ihre Position in Suchmaschinen zu verbessern. Erhalten Sie Empfehlungen, um Ihre Suchmaschinen-Perf...","pt":"A análise SEO é um processo que identifica problemas de otimização e fornece recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca.","ru":"Аудит SEO - это процесс, который выявляет проблемы оптимизации и предоставляет рекомендации для улучшения результатов поиска.","ar":"تقييم تحسين محركات البحث هو عملية تحدد مشاكل التحسين وتقدم توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث.","en":"Taxes"},"definition":{"en":"Taxes"},"features":{"zh":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"ja":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"ko":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"es":["Identificación de problemas de SEO","Análisis de estructura de sitio web","Optimización de contenido","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Análisis de velocidad de carga","Recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento en búsquedas orgánicas"],"fr":["Identification des problèmes de SEO","Analyse de la structure du site web","Optimisation du contenu","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Analyse de la vitesse de chargement","Recommandations pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique"],"de":["Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Analyse der Website-Struktur","Optimierung von Inhalten","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Analyse der Ladezeit","Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Suchmaschinen-Performance"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas de otimização","Análise de desempenho de busca","Recomendações para melhorar a visibilidade online","Análise de estrutura de site","Otimização de conteúdo","Análise de links"],"ru":["Определение проблем оптимизации","Анализ результатов поиска","Рекомендации для улучшения онлайн-видимости","Анализ структуры сайта","Оптимизация контента","Анализ ссылок"],"ar":["تحديد مشاكل التحسين","تحليل أداء البحث","توصيات لتحسين الوضوح على الإنترنت","تحليل هيكل الموقع","تحسين المحتوى","تحليل الروابط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"ja":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"ko":["SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO","SEO"],"es":["análisis de SEO","optimización de sitio web","mejora de posición en buscadores","rendimiento en búsquedas orgánicas","recomendaciones de SEO","problemas de SEO","auditoría de SEO","estrategia de SEO","herramientas de SEO"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation de site web","amélioration de position dans les moteurs de recherche","performances de recherche organique","recommandations SEO","problèmes de SEO","analyse de SEO","stratégie de SEO","outils de SEO"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Website-Optimierung","Verbesserung der Suchmaschinen-Position","Suchmaschinen-Performance","SEO-Empfehlungen","SEO-Probleme","SEO-Analyse","SEO-Strategie","SEO-Tools"],"pt":["análise SEO","otimização de busca","melhoria de desempenho de busca","visibilidade online","recomendações de SEO","análise de site","otimização de conteúdo","links de qualidade"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация поиска","улучшение результатов поиска","онлайн-видимость","рекомендации SEO","анализ сайта","оптимизация контента","качественные ссылки"],"ar":["تقييم تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين البحث","تحسين أداء البحث","الوضوح على الإنترنت","توصيات تحسين محركات البحث","تحليل الموقع","تحسين المحتوى","روابط ذات جودة"]}},"owner":"IdkwhatImD0ing","repo":"Taxes","repoPath":"IdkwhatImD0ing/Taxes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:22:24.513Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing advanced SEO analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO分析和优化能力的数字营销代理。","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが高度なSEO分析および最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 분석 및 최적화 기능을 필요로 하는 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan capacidades de análisis y optimización de SEO avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin d''une analyse et d''optimisation de SEO avancées.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketingagenten, die erweiterte SEO-Analyse- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que necessitam de análise e capacidades de otimização de SEO avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов цифрового маркетинга, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلان الرقمي الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم وقدرات تحسين SEO."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations using site context analysis, leveraging product marketing context from files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, and understanding site types to improve organic search performance.","zh":"使代理能够通过网站上下文分析、利用产品营销上下文来识别SEO问题，并提供可行的建议，以提高有机搜索性能。","ja":"エージェントがサイトコンテキスト分析を使用してSEOの問題を特定し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などのファイルから製品マーケティングコンテキストを利用して、サイトタイプを理解して有機検索パフォーマンスを向上させるための実行可能な推奨事項を提供できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 사이트 컨텍스트 분석을 사용하여 SEO 문제를 식별하고 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일에서 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하여 사이트 유형을 이해하고 유기적 검색 성능을 개선하기 위한 실행 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones acciónables utilizando el análisis de contexto del sitio, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos de archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, y comprendiendo los tipos de sitios para mejorar el rendimiento de la búsqueda orgánica.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations actionnables en utilisant l''analyse de contexte du site, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits à partir de fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, et en comprenant les types de sites pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen bereitzustellen, indem sie die Kontextanalyse der Website nutzen, den Produktmarketing-Kontext aus Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ausnutzen und die Arten von Websites verstehen, um die Leistung der organischen Suche zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações eficazes usando análise de contexto do site, aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produtos de arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e compreendendo os tipos de sites para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации с помощью анализа контекста сайта, используя контекст маркетинга продукта из файлов типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и понимая типы сайтов для улучшения органического поискового результата.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام تحليل سياق الموقع ، واستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج من ملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` ، وفهم أنواع المواقع لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website SEO performance","Generating recommendations for improvement","Analyzing site context for optimization opportunities"],"zh":["审计网站SEO性能","生成改进建议","分析网站上下文以找到优化机会"],"ja":["サイトのSEOパフォーマンスを監査する","改善のための推奨事項を生成する","サイトコンテキストを分析して最適化の機会を特定する"],"ko":["웹사이트 SEO 성능을 감사하기","개선에 대한 추천을 생성하기","사이트 컨텍스트를 분석하여 최적화 기회를 찾기"],"es":["Auditoría del rendimiento de SEO del sitio web","Generación de recomendaciones de mejora","Análisis del contexto del sitio para oportunidades de optimización"],"fr":["Audit des performances de SEO du site Web","Génération de recommandations d''amélioration","Analyse du contexte du site pour les opportunités d''optimisation"],"de":["Prüfung der SEO-Leistung der Website","Erstellung von Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung","Analyse des Kontexts der Website für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten"],"pt":["Auditoria do desempenho de SEO do site","Geração de recomendações para melhoria","Análise de contexto do site para oportunidades de otimização"],"ru":["Аудит производительности SEO сайта","Генерация рекомендаций для улучшения","Анализ контекста сайта для возможностей оптимизации"],"ar":["تدقيق أداء تحسين محركات البحث للموقع","توليد توصيات للتحسين","تحليل سياق الموقع لفرص التحسين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site context information","Needs product marketing context file for optimal results"],"zh":["需要访问网站上下文信息","需要产品营销上下文文件以获得最佳结果"],"ja":["サイトコンテキスト情報へのアクセスが必要","最適な結果を得るには製品マーケティングコンテキストファイルが必要"],"ko":["사이트 컨텍스트 정보에 접근할 수 있어야 함","최적의 결과를 얻으려면 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la información del contexto del sitio","Necesita un archivo de contexto de marketing de productos para resultados óptimos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''information de contexte du site","A besoin d''un fichier de contexte de marketing de produits pour des résultats optimaux"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Kontextinformationen der Website","Benötigt eine Produktmarketing-Kontextdatei für optimale Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Requer acesso às informações de contexto do site","Necessita do arquivo de contexto de marketing de produtos para resultados ótimos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к информации контекста сайта","Нуждается в файле контекста маркетинга продукта для оптимальных результатов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معلومات سياق الموقع","يحتاج إلى ملف سياق تسويق المنتج لأفضل النتائج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
