ntation incrémentale de conceptions","Compréhension de l''état actuel du projet","Affinement d''idées à travers un processus structuré"],"de":["Transformation von Ideen in strukturierte Designs","Fragen und alternative Exploration für die Validierung","Inkrementelle Präsentation von Designs","Verständnis des aktuellen Projektstatus","Verfeinerung von Ideen durch einen strukturierten Prozess"],"pt":["Transformação de ideias em designs completos","Questionamento estruturado e exploração alternativa","Validação incremental do design","Análise do estado atual do projeto","Exploração de alternativas de design"],"ru":["Преобразование идей в готовые дизайны","Структурированный вопрос и альтернативное исследование","Инкрементальная валидация дизайна","Анализ текущего состояния проекта","Исследование альтернатив дизайна"],"ar":["تحويل الأفكار إلى تصاميم كاملة","الاستفسار المنظم والاستكشاف البديل","التحقق المتزايد من التصميم","تحليل حالة المشروع الحالية","استكشاف بدائل التصميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["开发设计","结构化提问","替代探索","设计增量呈现","验证反馈","开发效率"],"ja":["開発設計","構造化された質問","代替の探索","設計のインクリメンタルな提示","検証のフィードバック","開発効率"],"ko":["개발 디자인","구조화된 질문","대체 탐색","디자인 증가呈现","검증 피드백","개발 효율"],"es":["lluvia de ideas","diseño estructurado","preguntas y exploración alternativa","validación de diseños","proceso de diseño","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["remue-méninges","conception structurée","questions et exploration alternative","validation de conceptions","processus de conception","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Brainstorming","strukturiertes Design","Fragen und alternative Exploration","Validierung von Designs","Designprozess","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de ideias","design de produtos","brainstorming","questionamento estruturado","exploração alternativa","validação incremental","análise de projeto"],"ru":["генерация идей","дизайн продукта","брейнсторминг","структурированный вопрос","альтернативное исследование","инкрементальная валидация","анализ проекта"],"ar":["تطوير الأفكار","تصميم المنتجات","برايمستورمينج","الاستفسار المنظم","الاستكشاف البديل","التحقق المتزايد","تحليل المشروع"]}},"owner":"nilecui","repo":"SkillsBase","repoPath":"nilecui/SkillsBase","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Brainstorming Ideas Into Designs","description":"Interactive idea refinement using Socratic method to develop fully-formed designs","version":"2.2.0","bodyPreview":"# Brainstorming Ideas Into Designs\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform rough ideas into fully-formed designs through structured questioning and alternative exploration.\n\n**Core principle:** Ask questions to understand, explore alternatives, present design incrementally for validation.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the Brainstorming skill to refine your idea into a design.\"\n\n## The Process\n\n### Phase 1: Understanding\n- Check current project state in working directory\n- Ask ONE question at a time to refi","body":"# Brainstorming Ideas Into Designs\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform rough ideas into fully-formed designs through structured questioning and alternative exploration.\n\n**Core principle:** Ask questions to understand, explore alternatives, present design incrementally for validation.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the Brainstorming skill to refine your idea into a design.\"\n\n## The Process\n\n### Phase 1: Understanding\n- Check current project state in working directory\n- Ask ONE question at a time to refine the idea\n- Prefer multiple choice when possible\n- Gather: Purpose, constraints, success criteria\n\n### Phase 2: Exploration\n- Propose 2-3 different approaches\n- For each: Core architecture, trade-offs, complexity assessment\n- Ask your human partner which approach resonates\n\n### Phase 3: Design Presentation\n- Present in 200-300 word sections\n- Cover: Architecture, components, data flow, error handling, testing\n- Ask after each section: \"Does this look right so far?\"\n\n### Phase 4: Worktree Setup (for implementation)\nWhen design is approved and implementation will follow:\n- Announce: \"I''m using the Using Git Worktrees skill to set up an isolated workspace.\"\n- Switch to skills/collaboration/using-git-worktrees\n- Follow that skill''s process for directory selection, safety verification, and setup\n- Return here when worktree ready\n\n### Phase 5: Planning Handoff\nAsk: \"Ready to create the implementation plan?\"\n\nWhen your human partner confirms (any affirmative response):\n- Announce: \"I''m using the Writing Plans skill to create the implementation plan.\"\n- Switch to skills/collaboration/writing-plans skill\n- Create detailed plan in the worktree\n\n## When to Revisit Earlier Phases\n\n**You can and should go backward when:**\n- Partner reveals new constraint during Phase 2 or 3 → Return to Phase 1 to understand it\n- Validation shows fundamental gap in requirements → Return to Phase 1\n- Partner questions approach during Phase 3 → Return to Phase 2 to explore alternatives\n- Something doesn''t make sense → Go back and clarify\n\n**Don''t force forward linearly** when going backward would give better results.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n**During exploration:**\n- When approaches have genuine trade-offs: skills/architecture/preserving-productive-tensions\n\n**Before proposing changes to existing code:**\n- Understand why it exists: skills/research/tracing-knowledge-lineages\n\n## Remember\n- One question per message during Phase 1\n- Apply YAGNI ruthlessly\n- Explore 2-3 alternatives before settling\n- Present incrementally, validate as you go\n- Go backward when needed - flexibility > rigid progression\n- Announce skill usage at start\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:22:30.184Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Agents needing structured idea refinement and design validation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化创意改进和设计验证能力的创意代理。","ja":"構造化されたアイデア改良とデザイン検証能力を必要とするクリエイティブエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 아이디어 개선 및 디자인 검증 기능이 필요한 크리에이티브 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes creativos que necesitan una refinación de ideas estructurada y capacidades de validación de diseño.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents créatifs ayant besoin d''une affination d''idées structurée et de capacités de validation de conception.","de":"Perfekt für kreative Agenten, die eine strukturierte Ideenverfeinerung und Designvalidierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Criativos que necessitam de refinamento de ideias estruturado e capacidades de validação de design.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Креативных Агентов, которым необходимы возможности структурированного совершенствования идей и проверки дизайна.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإبداعيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تعدين أفكار منظم وتحقق من تصاميم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform rough ideas into fully-formed designs through structured questioning and alternative exploration, utilizing incremental presentation for validation and leveraging core principles of understanding and exploration.","zh":"通过结构化的问题和替代方案的探索，利用增量式的呈现进行验证，并利用理解和探索的核心原则，使代理能够将粗糙的创意转化为完整的设计。","ja":"構造化された質問と代替の探索を通じて、インクリメンタルなプレゼンテーションを利用した検証を行い、理解と探索の基本原則を活用して、エージェントが粗いアイデアを完全なデザインに変換できるようにする。","ko":"구조화된 질문과 대체 탐색을 통해 증분식으로 제시하여 검증을 수행하고, 이해 및 탐색의 핵심 원칙을 활용하여 에이전트가 거친 아이디어를 완전한 디자인으로 변환할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar ideas rudimentarias en diseños completamente formados a través de una cuestionamiento estructurado y una exploración alternativa, utilizando una presentación incremental para la validación y aprovechando los principios básicos de comprensión y exploración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées rudimentaires en conceptions entièrement formées grâce à un questionnement structuré et à une exploration alternative, en utilisant une présentation incrémentale pour la validation et en exploitant les principes fondamentaux de la compréhension et de l''exploration.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, grobe Ideen in vollständig ausgebildete Entwürfe durch strukturiertes Fragen und alternatives Explorieren zu verwandeln, unter Nutzung von inkrementaler Präsentation für die Validierung und unter Ausnutzung der Grundprinzipien von Verständnis und Exploration.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar ideias brutas em projetos completamente formados por meio de questionamento estruturado e exploração de alternativas, utilizando apresentação incremental para validação e aproveitando princípios fundamentais de compreensão e exploração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить грубые идеи в полностью сформированные проекты посредством структурированного вопросования и изучения альтернатив, используя пошаговое представление для проверки и используя основные принципы понимания и изучения.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحويل الأفكار الخشنة إلى تصاميم كاملة الشكل من خلال الاستفهام المنظم واستكشاف البديلات، باستخدام العرض المتتالي للتحقق والاستفادة من المبادئ الأساسية للفهم والاستكشاف"},"useCases":{"en":["Refining project ideas through iterative questioning","Exploring alternative design solutions","Validating design increments for stakeholder feedback"],"zh":["通过迭代式的问题来完善项目创意","探索替代的设计解决方案","验证设计增量以获取利益相关者的反馈"],"ja":["イテレーティブな質問を通じてプロジェクトのアイデアを洗練する","代替のデザインソリューションを探索する","デザインのインクリメントを検証してステークホルダーのフィードバックを得る"],"ko":["반복적인 질문을 통해 프로젝트 아이디어를 완善하는 것","대체 디자인 솔루션을 탐색하는 것","디자인 증분을 검증하여 이해 관계자의 피드백을 얻는 것"],"es":["Perfeccionar ideas de proyecto a través de un cuestionamiento iterativo","Explorar soluciones de diseño alternativas","Validar incrementos de diseño para obtener comentarios de las partes interesadas"],"fr":["Affiner les idées de projet à travers un questionnement itératif","Explorer des solutions de conception alternatives","Valider les increments de conception pour obtenir des commentaires des parties prenantes"],"de":["Projektideen durch iteratives Fragen verfeinern","Alternative Designs Lösungen explorieren","Entwurfsinkremente für Stakeholder-Feedback validieren"],"pt":["Refinamento de ideias de projeto por meio de questionamento iterativo","Exploração de soluções de design alternativas","Validação de incrementos de design para feedback de partes interessadas"],"ru":["Уточнение идей проекта посредством итеративного вопросования","Изучение альтернативных решений дизайна","Проверка приращений дизайна для обратной связи заинтересованных сторон"],"ar":["تطوير أفكار المشروع من خلال الاستفهام المتكرر","استكشاف حلول بديلة للتصميم","التحقق من زيادات التصميم لتغذية الرأي من أصحاب المصلحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires working directory access for project state checking","Limited to text-based interaction for questioning and exploration"],"zh":["需要工作目录访问权限以进行项目状态检查","仅限于基于文本的交互用于提问和探索"],"ja":["プロジェクト状態のチェックに作業ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","質問と探索に使用するインタラクションはテキストベースのみ"],"ko":["프로젝트 상태 점검을 위해 작업 디렉토리 액세스 권한이 필요함","질문 및 탐색에 사용되는 상호 작용은 텍스트 기반으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio de trabajo para la comprobación del estado del proyecto","Limitado a la interacción basada en texto para el cuestionamiento y la exploración"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire de travail pour la vérification de l''état du projet","Limité à l''interaction basée sur le texte pour le questionnement et l''exploration"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Arbeitsverzeichnis für die Überprüfung des Projektzustands","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Interaktion für Fragen und Exploration"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao diretório de trabalho para verificação do estado do projeto","Limitado à interação baseada em texto para questionamento e exploração"],"ru":["Требует доступа к рабочему каталогу для проверки состояния проекта","Ограничен текстовой интеракцией для вопросования и изучения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى دليل العمل للتحقق من حالة المشروع","محدود بالتفاعل القائم على النص للاستفهام والاستكشاف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
