para optimización ASO","Despliegue en la Play Store para Android"],"fr":["Déploiement automatique sur toutes les plateformes","Flux de travail CI/CD pour les tests et les déploiements","Intégration avec TestFlight pour les tests beta sur iOS","Gestion des métadonnées de l''App Store pour l''optimisation ASO","Déploiement sur la Play Store pour Android"],"de":["Automatisches Bereitstellen auf allen Plattformen","CI/CD-Workflows für Tests und Bereitstellungen","Integration mit TestFlight für Beta-Tests auf iOS","Verwaltung von App Store-Metadaten für ASO-Optimierung","Bereitstellung in der Play Store für Android"],"pt":["Implantação automática em todas as plataformas","Otimização de metadados para lojas de aplicativos","Integração com fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD","Pré-visualização de pull requests","Envio de builds para TestFlight e Google Play","Gerenciamento de metadados da App Store"],"ru":["Автоматическое развертывание на всех платформах","Оптимизация метаданных для магазинов приложений","Интеграция с рабочими процессами CI/CD","Предварительный просмотр запросов на вытягивание","Отправка сборок в TestFlight и Google Play","Управление метаданными App Store"],"ar":["نشر تلقائي على جميع المنصات","تحسين البيانات الوصفية لمتاجر التطبيقات","التكامل مع سلاسل العمل من CI/CD","معاينة طلبات السحب","إرسال المباني إلى تطبيق TestFlight و Google Play","إدارة بيانات وصف تطبيق المتجر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo 应用部署","EAS","自动化部署","跨平台支持","测试和预览","App Store 优化","Google Play 优化","CI/CD 工作流"],"ja":["Expo アプリケーションのデプロイ","EAS","自動化されたデプロイ","マルチプラットフォーム サポート","テストとプレビュー","App Store 最適化","Google Play 最適化","CI/CD ワークフロー"],"ko":["Expo 애플리케이션 배포","EAS","자동화된 배포","멀티 플랫폼 지원","테스트 및预览","App Store 최적화","Google Play 최적화","CI/CD 워크플ロー"],"es":["despliegue de aplicaciones Expo","EAS","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Play Store","automatización de despliegues","pruebas beta","ASO"],"fr":["déploiement d''applications Expo","EAS","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Play Store","automatisation des déploiements","tests beta","ASO"],"de":["Expo-App-Bereitstellung","EAS","CI/CD","TestFlight","App Store","Play Store","Automatisierung von Bereitstellungen","Beta-Tests","ASO"],"pt":["implantação expo","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","eas","expo application services","ci/cd","testflight","google play","app store","otimização de metadados"],"ru":["экспо-развертывание","разработка приложений","eas","экспо-услуги приложений","ci/cd","testflight","google play","app store","оптимизация метаданных"],"ar":["نشر إكسبو","تطوير التطبيقات","خدمات تطبيقات إكسبو","ci/cd","تطبيق TestFlight","جوجل بلاي","متجر التطبيقات","تحسين البيانات الوصفية"]}},"owner":"sooom1627","repo":"linkcache","repoPath":"sooom1627/linkcache","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expo-deployment","description":"Deploying Expo apps to iOS App Store, Android Play Store, web hosting, and API routes","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Goog","body":"# Deployment\n\nThis skill covers deploying Expo applications across all platforms using EAS (Expo Application Services).\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/workflows.md -- CI/CD workflows for automated deployments and PR previews\n- ./references/testflight.md -- Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing\n- ./references/app-store-metadata.md -- Managing App Store metadata and ASO optimization\n- ./references/play-store.md -- Submitting Android builds to Google Play Store\n- ./references/ios-app-store.md -- iOS App Store submission and review process\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Install EAS CLI\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g eas-cli\neas login\n```\n\n### Initialize EAS\n\n```bash\nnpx eas-cli@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `eas.json` with build profiles.\n\n## Build Commands\n\n### Production Builds\n\n```bash\n# iOS App Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production\n\n# Android Play Store build\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production\n\n# Both platforms\nnpx eas-cli@latest build --profile production\n```\n\n### Submit to Stores\n\n```bash\n# iOS: Build and submit to App Store Connect\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p ios --profile production --submit\n\n# Android: Build and submit to Play Store\nnpx eas-cli@latest build -p android --profile production --submit\n\n# Shortcut for iOS TestFlight\nnpx testflight\n```\n\n## Web Deployment\n\nDeploy web apps using EAS Hosting:\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to production\nnpx expo export -p web\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy --prod\n\n# Deploy PR preview\nnpx eas-cli@latest deploy\n```\n\n## EAS Configuration\n\nStandard `eas.json` for production deployments:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"cli\": {\n    \"version\": \">= 16.0.1\",\n    \"appVersionSource\": \"remote\"\n  },\n  \"build\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"autoIncrement\": true,\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"resourceClass\": \"m-medium\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"development\": {\n      \"developmentClient\": true,\n      \"distribution\": \"internal\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"submit\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"ios\": {\n        \"appleId\": \"your@email.com\",\n        \"ascAppId\": \"1234567890\"\n      },\n      \"android\": {\n        \"serviceAccountKeyPath\": \"./google-service-account.json\",\n        \"track\": \"internal\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Platform-Specific Guides\n\n### iOS\n\n- Use `npx testflight` for quick TestFlight submissions\n- Configure Apple credentials via `eas credentials`\n- See ./reference/testflight.md for credential setup\n- See ./reference/ios-app-store.md for App Store submission\n\n### Android\n\n- Set up Google Play Console service account\n- Configure tracks: internal → closed → open → production\n- See ./reference/play-store.md for detailed setup\n\n### Web\n\n- EAS Hosting provides preview URLs for PRs\n- Production deploys to your custom domain\n- See ./reference/workflows.md for CI/CD automation\n\n## Automated Deployments\n\nUse EAS Workflows for CI/CD:\n\n```yaml\n# .eas/workflows/release.yml\nname: Release\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build-ios:\n    type: build\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n\n  submit-ios:\n    type: submit\n    needs: [build-ios]\n    params:\n      platform: ios\n      profile: production\n```\n\nSee ./reference/workflows.md for more workflow examples.\n\n## Version Management\n\nEAS manages version numbers automatically with `appVersionSource: \"remote\"`:\n\n```bash\n# Check current versions\neas build:version:get\n\n# Manually set version\neas build:version:set -p ios --build-number 42\n```\n\n## Monitoring\n\n```bash\n# List recent builds\neas build:list\n\n# Check build status\neas build:view\n\n# View submission status\neas submit:list\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:22:36.013Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile App Agents requiring streamlined Expo application deployment across multiple platforms using EAS","zh":"适合需要跨多个平台使用EAS进行流线化Expo应用程序部署的移动应用程序代理","ja":"EASを使用して複数のプラットフォームにまたがるExpoアプリケーションのストリームライン化された展開を必要とするモバイルアプリエージェントに最適","ko":"EAS를 사용하여 여러 플랫폼에서 Expo 애플리케이션을 스트림라인화된 형태로 배포해야 하는 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que requieren una implementación de aplicaciones de Expo simplificada en varias plataformas utilizando EAS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''applications mobiles nécessitant un déploiement d''applications Expo simplifié sur plusieurs plateformes à l''aide d''EAS","de":"Ideal für Mobile App-Agents, die eine strukturierte Expo-Anwendungsbereitstellung über mehrere Plattformen mit EAS erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de aplicativos móveis que exigem implantação de aplicativos Expo simplificada em várias plataformas usando EAS","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, требующих упрощенного развёртывания приложений Expo на нескольких платформах с использованием EAS","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق الجوال الذي يتطلب تثبيت تطبيق Expo المُبسّط عبر منصات متعددة باستخدام EAS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate deployments and PR previews using CI/CD workflows, submit iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing, and manage App Store metadata for ASO optimization, all while leveraging Expo Application Services (EAS) for seamless cross-platform deployment","zh":"赋予代理人使用CI/CD工作流自动化部署和PR预览的能力，向TestFlight提交iOS构建以进行 beta 测试，并管理应用商店元数据以优化ASO，同时利用Expo应用程序服务（EAS）进行无缝的跨平台部署","ja":"CI/CDワークフローを使用して展開とPRプレビューの自動化、TestFlightへのiOSビルドの提出によるベータテスト、App Storeメタデータの管理によるASOの最適化などを可能にし、Expoアプリケーションサービス（EAS）を使用してシームレスなクロスプラットフォーム展開を実現する","ko":"CI/CD 워크플로를 사용하여 배포 및 PR预览의 자동화를 가능하게 하고, TestFlight에 iOS 빌드를 제출하여 베타 테스트를进行하며, 앱 스토어 메타데이터를 관리하여 ASO를 최적화하는 등 다양한 기능을 제공하며, Expo 애플리케이션 서비스(EAS)를 사용하여 무缝한 크로스 플랫폼 배포를 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar implementaciones y vistas previas de PR utilizando flujos de trabajo de CI/CD, enviar compilaciones de iOS a TestFlight para pruebas beta y gestionar metadatos de la App Store para la optimización de ASO, todo mientras aprovecha los Servicios de Aplicación de Expo (EAS) para una implementación transversal sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les déploiements et les aperçus de PR à l''aide de flux de travail CI/CD, soumettre des builds iOS à TestFlight pour des tests bêta et gérer les métadonnées de l''App Store pour l''optimisation de l''ASO, le tout en exploitant les Services d''Application Expo (EAS) pour un déploiement transversal sans accroc","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Bereitstellungen und PR-Vorschauen mithilfe von CI/CD-Workflows zu automatisieren, iOS-Builds an TestFlight für Betatests zu senden und App Store-Metadaten für ASO-Optimierung zu verwalten, all dies unter Ausnutzung der Expo-Anwendungsdienste (EAS) für eine nahtlose Bereitstellung über mehrere Plattformen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar implantações e visualizações de PR usando fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD, enviar compilações do iOS para o TestFlight para testes beta e gerenciar metadados da App Store para otimização do ASO, tudo isso aproveitando os Serviços de Aplicativos Expo (EAS) para implantação cross-plataforma sem problemas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать развертывания и предварительные просмотры PR с помощью рабочих процессов CI/CD, отправлять сборки iOS в TestFlight для бета-тестирования и управлять метаданными App Store для оптимизации ASO, все это при использовании Служб приложений Expo (EAS) для бесшовного развертывания на нескольких платформах","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توفير تثبيت وتجربة معاينة PR أوتوماتيكية باستخدام سير عمل CI/CD، وإرسال نسخة iOS إلى تطبيق TestFlight لاختبار البيتا، وإدارة بيانات متجر التطبيقات لتحسين التموضع في متجر التطبيقات، مع الاستفادة من خدمات تطبيقات Expo (EAS) لتثبيت متوازي بدون مشاكل"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Expo application deployments across iOS and Android platforms","Submitting iOS builds to TestFlight for beta testing and feedback collection","Managing and optimizing App Store metadata for improved visibility and user engagement"],"zh":["跨iOS和Android平台自动化Expo应用程序部署","向TestFlight提交iOS构建以进行beta测试和反馈收集","管理和优化应用商店元数据以提高可见性和用户参与度"],"ja":["iOSとAndroidプラットフォームを跨ぐExpoアプリケーションの自動化された展開","TestFlightへのiOSビルドの提出によるベータテストとフィードバックの収集","App Storeメタデータの管理と最適化による可視性とユーザー参加の向上"],"ko":["iOS와 Android 플랫폼을跨는 Expo 애플리케이션의 자동화된 배포","TestFlight에 iOS 빌드를 제출하여 베타 테스트와 피드백 수집을进行","앱 스토어 메타데이터의 관리와 최적화를 통해 가시성과 사용자 참여를 향상"],"es":["Automatización de implementaciones de aplicaciones de Expo en plataformas iOS y Android","Envío de compilaciones de iOS a TestFlight para pruebas beta y recopilación de comentarios","Gestión y optimización de metadatos de la App Store para mejorar la visibilidad y el compromiso del usuario"],"fr":["Automatisation des déploiements d''applications Expo sur les plateformes iOS et Android","Soumission de builds iOS à TestFlight pour des tests bêta et une collecte de commentaires","Gestion et optimisation des métadonnées de l''App Store pour améliorer la visibilité et l''engagement de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Automatisierung von Expo-Anwendungs-Bereitstellungen auf iOS- und Android-Plattformen","Übermittlung von iOS-Builds an TestFlight für Betatests und Feedback-Sammlung","Verwaltung und Optimierung von App Store-Metadaten für verbesserte Sichtbarkeit und Benutzerengagement"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de aplicativos Expo em plataformas iOS e Android","Enviar compilações do iOS para o TestFlight para testes beta e coleta de feedback","Gerenciar e otimizar metadados da App Store para melhor visibilidade e engajamento do usuário"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывания приложений Expo на платформах iOS и Android","Отправлять сборки iOS в TestFlight для бета-тестирования и сбора отзывов","Управлять и оптимизировать метаданные App Store для улучшения видимости и вовлеченности пользователей"],"ar":["توفير تثبيت تطبيقات Expo آلي عبر منصات iOS و Android","إرسال نسخة iOS إلى تطبيق TestFlight لاختبار البيتا وجمع обрат الرأي","إدارة وضبط بيانات متجر التطبيقات لتحسين الرؤية والتفاعل مع المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo Application Services (EAS) setup and configuration","Limited to Expo-based applications","Needs access to Apple Developer and Google Play Developer accounts for TestFlight and Play Store submissions"],"zh":["需要Expo应用程序服务（EAS）的设置和配置","仅限于基于Expo的应用程序","需要访问Apple Developer和Google Play Developer账户以提交TestFlight和Play Store"],"ja":["Expoアプリケーションサービス（EAS）の設定と構成が必要","Expoベースのアプリケーションに限定","TestFlightとPlay Storeへの提出のためにApple DeveloperとGoogle Play Developerアカウントへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Expo 애플리케이션 서비스(EAS)의 설정 및 구성이 필요","Expo 기반의 애플리케이션에만 적용","TestFlight와 Play Store에 제출하기 위해 Apple Developer와 Google Play Developer 계정에 접근이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración y configuración de los Servicios de Aplicación de Expo (EAS)","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en Expo","Necesita acceso a las cuentas de Apple Developer y Google Play Developer para las presentaciones de TestFlight y Play Store"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une configuration des Services d''Application Expo (EAS)","Limité aux applications basées sur Expo","Nécessite un accès aux comptes de développeur Apple et Google Play pour les soumissions de TestFlight et Play Store"],"de":["Benötigt Einrichtung und Konfiguration der Expo-Anwendungsdienste (EAS)","Begrenzt auf Expo-basierte Anwendungen","Benötigt Zugriff auf Apple-Entwickler- und Google-Play-Entwickler-Konten für TestFlight- und Play-Store-Einreichungen"],"pt":["Exige configuração e instalação dos Serviços de Aplicativos Expo (EAS)","Limitado a aplicativos baseados em Expo","Necessita de acesso às contas do Apple Developer e Google Play Developer para envio ao TestFlight e Play Store"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации Служб приложений Expo (EAS)","Ограничен приложениями на базе Expo","Требует доступа к учетным записям Apple Developer и Google Play Developer для отправки в TestFlight и Play Store"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتثبيت خدمات تطبيقات Expo (EAS)","محدود للتطبيقات المبنية على منصة Expo","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى حسابات مطور Apple ومطور Google Play لإرسالها إلى تطبيق TestFlight ومتجر Play"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
