","팀 메트릭스","에픽 생성","유저 스토리 생성","태스크 생성"],"es":["Operaciones de sprint","Gestión de backlog","Métricas de equipo","Creación de epics y stories","Refactorización de proyectos existentes","Soporte para múltiples pilas tecnológicas"],"fr":["Opérations de sprint","Gestion de backlog","Métriques d''équipe","Création d''épics et d''histoires","Réorganisation de projets existants","Support pour plusieurs piles technologiques"],"de":["Sprint-Operationen","Backlog-Verwaltung","Teammetriken","Erstellung von Epics und Stories","Refaktorisierung von bestehenden Projekten","Unterstützung für mehrere Technologiestacks"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de sprint","Gerenciamento de backlog","Criação de épicos e histórias de usuário","Criação de tarefas de implementação","Análise de métricas de equipe"],"ru":["Управление спринтом","Управление бэклогом","Создание эпиков и историй пользователя","Создание задач реализации","Анализ командных метрик"],"ar":["إدارة السبرينت","إدارة الباكلوج","إنشاء الأساطير والقصص المستخدمة","إنشاء مهام التنفيذ","تحليل مقاييس الفريق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["敏捷项目管理","团队效率","协作工具","项目管理技能","冲刺操作","backlog 管理"],"ja":["アジャイルプロジェクト管理","チームの効率","コラボレーションツール","プロジェクト管理スキル","スプリント操作","バックログ管理"],"ko":["아자일 프로젝트 관리","팀의 효율성","협력 도구","프로젝트 관리 스킬","스프린트 운영","백로그 관리"],"es":["gestión de proyectos ágiles","desarrollo de software ágil","herramientas de gestión de proyectos","sprint","backlog","métricas de equipo","epics","stories","refactorización"],"fr":["gestion de projet agile","développement de logiciels agiles","outils de gestion de projet","sprint","backlog","métriques d''équipe","épics","histoires","réorganisation"],"de":["agiles Projektmanagement","agile Softwareentwicklung","Projektmanagement-Tools","Sprint","Backlog","Teammetriken","Epics","Stories","Refaktorisierung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento ágil","gerenciamento de projetos","sprint","backlog","métricas de equipe","Cursor IDE","pm/agile"],"ru":["скользящее развитие","управление проектами","спринт","бэклог","командные метрики","Cursor IDE","pm/agile"],"ar":["التطوير المتمكن","إدارة المشاريع","السبرينت","الباكلوج","مقاييس الفريق","Cursor IDE","pm/agile"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pm/agile","description":"Project management skill collection for Agile sprint operations, backlog management, standups, and team metrics","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# PM Skill Collection\n\nParent skill for project management capabilities. This collection bundles sub-skills for Agile sprint operations, backlog management, standups, and team metrics.\n\n## Sub-Skills\n\n| Sub-Skill | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `pm/close-sprint` | Complete sprint, calculate velocity |\n| `pm/create-epic` | Create epic with child story structure |\n| `pm/create-story` | Create user story from description with acceptance criteria |\n| `pm/create-task` | Create implementation ta","body":"# PM Skill Collection\n\nParent skill for project management capabilities. This collection bundles sub-skills for Agile sprint operations, backlog management, standups, and team metrics.\n\n## Sub-Skills\n\n| Sub-Skill | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `pm/close-sprint` | Complete sprint, calculate velocity |\n| `pm/create-epic` | Create epic with child story structure |\n| `pm/create-story` | Create user story from description with acceptance criteria |\n| `pm/create-task` | Create implementation task from story or description |\n| `pm/estimate-task` | Suggest story point estimation |\n| `pm/generate-burndown` | Create burndown chart data |\n| `pm/health-check` | Team health indicators |\n| `pm/plan-sprint` | Pull stories into sprint |\n| `pm/run-standup` | Query and report current status |\n\n## When to Use\n\n- When working with Agile/Scrum project management\n- When sprint-master or task-manager agents are active\n- When user requests sprint planning, standup, story creation, or velocity metrics\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- PM backend configured via `pm-configuration` skill\n- Jira, GitHub, or other PM backend connected\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Identify PM task**: User requests sprint planning, standup, story creation, or similar\n2. **Select sub-skill**: Route to appropriate pm/* sub-skill (e.g., pm/plan-sprint, pm/run-standup)\n3. **Execute sub-skill**: Apply the sub-skill''s process steps\n4. **Aggregate results**: Return output to user\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Configure PM backend before using any pm/* sub-skill\n- Use pm/health-check to assess team status before planning\n- Run pm/run-standup before pm/plan-sprint for context\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:22:46.611Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Agile-focused AI Agents, such as Cursor and AutoGPT, seeking to streamline project management workflows with .cursorrules and blueprints for SAP, Python, and Cloud-Native stacks.","zh":"适用于专注于敏捷开发的AI代理，例如Cursor和AutoGPT，旨在使用.cursorrules和针对SAP、Python和云原生栈的蓝图来简化项目管理工作流。","ja":"Agileに焦点を当てたAIエージェント（例：CursorとAutoGPT）が、.cursorrulesと、SAP、Python、クラウドネイティブスタック向けのブループリントを使用してプロジェクト管理ワークフローをストリームライン化するのに適しています。","ko":"Agile에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트(Cursor 및 AutoGPT와 같은)가 .cursorrules 및 SAP, Python, Cloud-Native 스택을 위한 블루프린트를 사용하여 프로젝트 관리 워크플ロー를 간소화하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en Agile, como Cursor y AutoGPT, que buscan optimizar los flujos de trabajo de gestión de proyectos con .cursorrules y plantillas para pilas SAP, Python y Cloud-Native.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur Agile, tels que Cursor et AutoGPT, cherchant à rationaliser les flux de travail de gestion de projet avec .cursorrules et des modèles pour les piles SAP, Python et Cloud-Native.","de":"Ideal für agil-fokussierte KI-Agents, wie Cursor und AutoGPT, die Projektmanagement-Workflows mit .cursorrules und Vorlagen für SAP-, Python- und Cloud-Native-Stacks optimieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em Agile, como Cursor e AutoGPT, que buscam otimizar os fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de projetos com .cursorrules e blueprints para pilhas SAP, Python e Cloud-Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Agile, таких как Cursor и AutoGPT, стремящихся оптимизировать рабочие процессы управления проектами с помощью .cursorrules и шаблонов для стеков SAP, Python и Cloud-Native.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يركزون على Agile، مثل Cursor و AutoGPT، الذين يسعون إلى简يع عمليات إدارة المشاريع مع .cursorrules والخطة الرئيسية لملحقات SAP و Python و Cloud-Native."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Agile sprint operations, including backlog management, standups, and team metrics, utilizing sub-skills like pm/close-sprint, pm/create-epic, and pm/create-story, all while supporting refactoring for existing projects.","zh":"赋予代理人自动化敏捷冲刺操作的能力，包括待办事项管理、站立会议和团队指标，利用诸如pm/close-sprint、pm/create-epic和pm/create-story之类的子技能，同时支持现有项目的重构。","ja":"エージェントにAgileスプリント操作を自動化する能力を付与します。バックログ管理、スタンドアップ、チームメトリクスなどを含み、pm/close-sprint、pm/create-epic、pm/create-storyなどのサブスキルを利用し、既存のプロジェクトのリファクタリングもサポートします。","ko":"에이전트에게 Agile 스프린트 작업을 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 백로그 관리, 스탠드업, 팀 메트릭스 등을 포함하며, pm/close-sprint, pm/create-epic, pm/create-story와 같은 하위 스킬을 사용하며 기존 프로젝트의 리팩토링도 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar las operaciones de sprint Agile, incluyendo la gestión de backlog, reuniones diarias y métricas de equipo, utilizando sub-habilidades como pm/close-sprint, pm/create-epic y pm/create-story, todo mientras admite la reestructuración de proyectos existentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de sprint Agile, y compris la gestion du backlog, les réunions quotidiennes et les métriques d''équipe, en utilisant des sous-compétences comme pm/close-sprint, pm/create-epic et pm/create-story, le tout en supportant la réorganisation de projets existants.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Agile-Sprint-Operationen zu automatisieren, einschließlich Backlog-Verwaltung, Daily Meetings und Team-Metriken, unter Verwendung von Unterfähigkeiten wie pm/close-sprint, pm/create-epic und pm/create-story, während sie die Umstrukturierung bestehender Projekte unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações de sprint Agile, incluindo gerenciamento de backlog, reuniões diárias e métricas de equipe, utilizando sub-habilidades como pm/close-sprint, pm/create-epic e pm/create-story, tudo isso enquanto suporta a reestruturação de projetos existentes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать операции спринта Agile, включая управление бэклогом, ежедневные встречи и командные метрики, используя поднавыки, такие как pm/close-sprint, pm/create-epic и pm/create-story, все это при поддержке рефакторинга существующих проектов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير آليّة عمليات سباق Agile، بما في ذلك إدارة الخلفية و الاجتماعات اليومية و معايير الفريق، باستخدام مهارات فرعية مثل pm/close-sprint و pm/create-epic و pm/create-story، مع دعم إعادة هيكلة المشاريع الحالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating sprint closure and velocity calculation with pm/close-sprint","Generating epics with child story structures using pm/create-epic","Creating user stories with acceptance criteria via pm/create-story","Refactoring existing projects to align with Agile methodologies"],"zh":["使用pm/close-sprint自动化冲刺关闭和速度计算","使用pm/create-epic生成具有子故事结构的史诗","通过pm/create-story使用接受标准创建用户故事","将现有项目重构为与敏捷方法论一致"],"ja":["pm/close-sprintを使用してスプリントのクローズと速度の計算を自動化する","pm/create-epicを使用して子ストーリー構造を持つエピックを生成する","pm/create-storyを使用して受け入れ基準を使用してユーザーストーリーを作成する","既存のプロジェクトをAgileメソドロジーに合わせてリファクタリングする"],"ko":["pm/close-sprint를 사용하여 스프린트 종료 및 속도 계산을 자동화합니다.","pm/create-epic를 사용하여 자식 스토리 구조가 있는 에픽을 생성합니다.","pm/create-story를 사용하여 수락 기준을 사용하여 사용자 스토리를 생성합니다.","기존 프로젝트를 Agile 방법론과 일치하도록 리팩토링합니다."],"es":["Automatizar el cierre y el cálculo de la velocidad del sprint con pm/close-sprint","Generar épicos con estructuras de historias secundarias utilizando pm/create-epic","Crear historias de usuario con criterios de aceptación a través de pm/create-story","Reestructurar proyectos existentes para que se alineen con las metodologías Agile"],"fr":["Automatiser la clôture et le calcul de la vitesse du sprint avec pm/close-sprint","Générer des épopées avec des structures d''histoires secondaires en utilisant pm/create-epic","Créer des histoires d''utilisateur avec des critères d''acceptation via pm/create-story","Réorganiser les projets existants pour les aligner sur les méthodologies Agile"],"de":["Automatisieren des Sprint-Schlusses und der Geschwindigkeitsberechnung mit pm/close-sprint","Erzeugen von Epics mit Kindergeschichten-Strukturen unter Verwendung von pm/create-epic","Erstellen von Benutzerstories mit Akzeptanzkriterien über pm/create-story","Umstrukturieren bestehender Projekte, um sie mit Agile-Methoden in Einklang zu bringen"],"pt":["Automatizar o fechamento do sprint e o cálculo da velocidade com pm/close-sprint","Gerar épicos com estruturas de histórias filho usando pm/create-epic","Criar histórias de usuário com critérios de aceitação via pm/create-story","Reestruturar projetos existentes para alinhar com metodologias Agile"],"ru":["Автоматизировать закрытие спринта и расчет скорости с помощью pm/close-sprint","Генерировать эпики со структурой дочерних историй с помощью pm/create-epic","Создавать пользовательские истории с критериями приемки с помощью pm/create-story","Рефакторить существующие проекты для соответствия методологиям Agile"],"ar":["توفير آليّة إغلاق السباق و حساب السرعة مع pm/close-sprint","توليد ملحقات مع هيكل قصة فرعي باستخدام pm/create-epic","إنشاء قصص مستخدم مع معايير القبول عبر pm/create-story","إعادة هيكلة المشاريع الحالية لتحقيق التطابق مع منهجيات Agile"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires configuration of .cursorrules and agent systems","Dependent on specific tech stacks like SAP, Python, and Cloud-Native for blueprint functionality"],"zh":["需要配置.cursorrules和代理系统","蓝图功能依赖于特定的技术栈，如SAP、Python和云原生"],"ja":[".cursorrulesとエージェントシステムの構成が必要","ブループリント機能は、SAP、Python、クラウドネイティブなどの特定のテクノロジースタックに依存しています"],"ko":[".cursorrules 및 에이전트 시스템 구성이 필요합니다.","블루프린트 기능은 SAP, Python, Cloud-Native와 같은 특정 기술 스택에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de .cursorrules y sistemas de agentes","Depende de pilas tecnológicas específicas como SAP, Python y Cloud-Native para la funcionalidad de plantillas"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de .cursorrules et des systèmes d''agents","Dépend de piles technologiques spécifiques comme SAP, Python et Cloud-Native pour la fonctionnalité des modèles"],"de":["Erfordert Konfiguration von .cursorrules und Agentsystemen","Hängt von bestimmten Technologie-Stacks wie SAP, Python und Cloud-Native für die Blueprint-Funktionalität ab"],"pt":["Requer configuração de .cursorrules e sistemas de agentes","Depende de pilhas de tecnologia específicas, como SAP, Python e Cloud-Native, para funcionalidade de blueprint"],"ru":["Требует настройки .cursorrules и систем агентов","Зависит от конкретных технологических стеков, таких как SAP, Python и Cloud-Native, для функциональности шаблонов"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين .cursorrules و أنظمة الوكيل","يعتمد على مكدس تقني معين، مثل SAP و Python و Cloud-Native، من أجل وظائف الخطة الرئيسية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cedpaqlab/nexus-php-framework/PHP Framework Development Skills', 'community', 'cedpaqlab', 'nexus-php-framework', 'cedpaqlab/nexus-php-framework', 'PHP Framework Development Skills', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z', '2026-02-18T10:22:53.230Z', NULL, '{"id":"cedpaqlab/nexus-php-framework/PHP Framework Development Skills","name":"PHP Framework Development Skills","description":{"zh":"PHP 8.3, Propel ORM 2.0, ","ja":"PHP 8.3, Propel ORM 2.0, ","ko":"PHP 8.3, Propel ORM 2.0, ","es":"Nuestro framework PHP 8.3+ ofrece un conjunto de herramientas para desarrollar aplicaciones web seguras y escalables","fr":"Notre framework PHP 8.3+ propose un ensemble d''outils pour développer des applications web sécurisées et évolutives","de":"Unser PHP 8.3+ Framework bietet eine Reihe von Tools für die Entwicklung von sicheren und skalierbaren Webanwendungen","pt":"Desenvolvimento de framework PHP 8.3+ com recursos avançados. Aprenda a criar controllers e gerenciar dependências","ru":"Разработка фреймворка PHP 8.3+ с продвинутыми функциями. Узнайте, как создавать контроллеры и управлять зависимостями","ar":"تطوير إطار العمل PHP 8.3+ مع ميزات متقدمة. تعلم كيفية إنشاء المُتحكمات وإدارة الاعتماديات","en":"PHP 8.3+ framework PoC featuring Propel ORM 2.0, database migrations, role-based auth, CSRF protection, and comprehensive test suite. Experimental AI-generated project."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PHP ","ja":"PHP","ko":"PHP ","es":"Desarrollo de Framework PHP 8.3+","fr":"Développement de Framework PHP 8.3+","de":"PHP 8.3+ Framework Entwicklung","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Framework PHP 8.3+","ru":"Разработка фреймворка PHP 8.3+","ar":"تطوير إطار العمل PHP 8.3+","en":"PHP Framework Development Skills"},"description":{"zh":"PHP 8.3, Propel ORM 2.0, ","ja":"PHP 8.3, Propel ORM 2.0, ","ko":"PHP 8.3, Propel ORM 2.0, ","es":"Nuestro framework PHP 8.3+ ofrece un conjunto de herramientas para desarrollar aplicaciones web seguras y escalables","fr":"Notre framework PHP 8.3+ propose un ensemble d''outils pour développer des applications web sécurisées et évolutives","de":"Unser PHP 8.3+ Framework bietet eine Reihe von Tools für die Entwicklung von sicheren und skalierbaren Webanwendungen","pt":"Desenvolvimento de framework PHP 8.3+ com recursos avançados. Aprenda a criar controllers e gerenciar dependências","ru":"Разработка фреймворка PHP 8.3+ с продвинутыми функциями. Узнайте, как создавать контроллеры и управлять зависимостями","ar":"تطوير إطار العمل PHP 8.3+ مع ميزات متقدمة. تعلم كيفية إنشاء المُتحكمات وإدارة الاعتماديات","en":"PHP 8.3+ framework PoC featuring Propel ORM 2.0, database migrations, role-based auth, CSRF protection, and comprehensive test suite. Experimental AI-generat..."},"definition":{"en":"PHP 8.3+ framework PoC featuring Propel ORM 2.0, database migrations, role-based auth, CSRF protection, and comprehensive test suite. Experimental AI-generated project."},"features":{"zh":["PHP 8.3+","Propel ORM 2.0","","CSRF",""],"ja":["PHP 8.3+","Propel ORM 2.0","","CSRF",""],"ko":["PHP 8.3+","Propel ORM 2.0","","CSRF",""],"es":["Propel ORM 2.0 para la gestión de bases de datos","Migraciones de base de datos","Autenticación basada en roles","Protección contra CSRF","Suite de pruebas completa"],"fr":["Propel ORM 2.0 pour la gestion de bases de données","Migrations de base de données","Authentification basée sur les rôles","Protection contre les attaques CSRF","Suite de tests complète"],"de":["Propel ORM 2.0 für die Datenbankverwaltung","Datenbankmigrationen","Rollenbasierte Authentifizierung","Schutz gegen CSRF-Angriffe","Umfangreiche Test-Suite"],"pt":["Propel ORM 2.0","Migrações de banco de dados","Autenticação baseada em papéis","Proteção contra CSRF","Suíte de testes abrangente"],"ru":["Propel ORM 2.0","Миграции базы данных","Ролевая аутентификация","Защита от CSRF","Комплексный набор тестов"],"ar":["Propel ORM 2.0","عمليات نقل قواعد البيانات","التحقق من الهويةตาม الأدوار","حماية ضد CSRF","مجموعة شاملة من الاختبارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PHP ","PHP ","Propel ORM","CSRF","PHP 8.3","PHP ","PHP "],"ja":["PHP ","PHP ","Propel ORM","CSRF","PHP 8.3","PHP ","PHP "],"ko":["PHP ","PHP ","Propel ORM","CSRF","PHP 8.3","PHP ","PHP "],"es":["desarrollo de framework php","php 8.3+","propel orm 2.0","seguridad web","autenticación basada en roles","protección contra csrf","suite de pruebas"],"fr":["développement de framework php","php 8.3+","propel orm 2.0","sécurité web","authentification basée sur les rôles","protection contre les attaques csrf","suite de tests"],"de":["php-framework-entwicklung","php 8.3+","propel orm 2.0","web-sicherheit","rollenbasierte authentifizierung","schutz gegen csrf-angriffe","test-suite"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de framework php","php 8.3+","propel orm 2.0","migrações de banco de dados","autenticação baseada em papéis","proteção contra csrf","suíte de testes"],"ru":["разработка фреймворка php","php 8.3+","propel orm 2.0","миграции базы данных","ролевая аутентификация","защита от csrf","комплексный набор тестов"],"ar":["تطوير إطار العمل php","php 8.3+","propel orm 2.0","عمليات نقل قواعد البيانات","التحقق من الهويةตาม الأدوار","حماية ضد csrf","مجموعة شاملة من الاختبارات"]}},"owner":"cedpaqlab","repo":"nexus-php-framework","repoPath":"cedpaqlab/nexus-php-framework","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"PHP Framework Development Skills","description":"Collection of reusable skills for developing components in the Nexus PHP Framework","bodyPreview":"# Framework Development Skills\n\n## Skill 1: Create PHP Controller\n\nWhen creating a new Controller:\n\n1. **Location**: Place in `app/Http/Controllers/` or `app/Http/Controllers/{Domain}/` following domain structure\n2. **Structure**:\n   - Use constructor injection for dependencies (ViewRenderer, Response, Services, Repositories)\n   - Methods receive `Request $request` as first parameter\n   - Return `Response` instance\n   - Use fluent Response methods (json, html, redirect, etc.)\n\n3. **Example Patte","body":"# Framework Development Skills\n\n## Skill 1: Create PHP Controller\n\nWhen creating a new Controller:\n\n1. **Location**: Place in `app/Http/Controllers/` or `app/Http/Controllers/{Domain}/` following domain structure\n2. **Structure**:\n   - Use constructor injection for dependencies (ViewRenderer, Response, Services, Repositories)\n   - Methods receive `Request $request` as first parameter\n   - Return `Response` instance\n   - Use fluent Response methods (json, html, redirect, etc.)\n\n3. **Example Pattern**:\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nnamespace App\\Http\\Controllers\\{Domain};\n\nuse App\\Http\\Request;\nuse App\\Http\\Response;\nuse App\\Services\\View\\ViewRenderer;\nuse App\\Services\\{Domain}\\{Name}Service;\n\nclass {Name}Controller\n{\n    public function __construct(\n        private ViewRenderer $viewRenderer,\n        private Response $response,\n        private {Name}Service $service\n    ) {\n    }\n\n    public function index(Request $request): Response\n    {\n        $data = $this->service->getAll();\n        return $this->response->json([''data'' => $data]);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n4. **Register in Container**: Add binding in `app/Providers/AppServiceProvider.php` if needed\n5. **Add Route**: Define route in `routes/web.php`\n6. **Create Tests**: Add corresponding test in `tests/framework/Http/Controllers/`\n\n---\n\n## Skill 2: Create Domain Service\n\nWhen creating a new Service:\n\n1. **Location**: Place in `app/Services/{Domain}/` following domain structure\n2. **Structure**:\n   - Single Responsibility Principle (one reason to change)\n   - Constructor injection for dependencies (Repositories, other Services, Logger)\n   - Use typed exceptions for error handling\n   - Methods should be focused and testable\n\n3. **Example Pattern**:\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nnamespace App\\Services\\{Domain};\n\nuse App\\Repositories\\{Domain}\\{Name}Repository;\nuse App\\Services\\Logger\\Logger;\nuse App\\Exceptions\\{Domain}\\{Name}Exception;\n\nclass {Name}Service\n{\n    public function __construct(\n        private {Name}Repository $repository,\n        private Logger $logger\n    ) {\n    }\n\n    public function doSomething(string $param): mixed\n    {\n        // Implementation with validation, logging, error handling\n        return $result;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n4. **Register in Container**: Add singleton binding in `app/Providers/AppServiceProvider.php`\n5. **Create Tests**: Add corresponding test in `tests/framework/Services/{Domain}/`\n\n---\n\n## Skill 3: Create Repository with Propel ORM\n\n**CRITICAL: Framework uses 100% Propel ORM. Never use QueryBuilder or raw SQL for data operations.**\n\nWhen creating a new Repository:\n\n1. **Location**: Place in `app/Repositories/{Domain}/` following domain structure\n2. **Structure**:\n   - Inject `PropelConnector` (or domain-specific connector) via constructor\n   - All data operations go through Propel models\n   - Use `executeInTransaction()` for multi-step operations\n   - Convert Propel models to arrays using `toArray()` helper method\n   - Never use QueryBuilder or raw SQL for data access\n\n3. **Example Pattern**:\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nnamespace App\\Repositories\\{Domain};\n\nuse App\\Repositories\\Connectors\\{Name}Connector;\nuse App\\Models\\{Name};\n\nclass {Name}Repository\n{\n    public function __construct(\n        private {Name}Connector $connector\n    ) {\n    }\n\n    public function findById(int $id): ?array\n    {\n        $model = $this->connector->find{Name}ById($id);\n        return $model ? $this->toArray($model) : null;\n    }\n\n    public function findAll(array $conditions = [], array $orderBy = [], ?int $limit = null, ?int $offset = null): array\n    {\n        $models = $this->connector->findAll{Name}s($conditions, $orderBy, $limit, $offset);\n        return array_map([$this, ''toArray''], $models);\n    }\n\n    public function create(array $data): int\n    {\n        return $this->connector->executeInTransaction(function () use ($data) {\n            $model = $this->connector->create{Name}($data);\n            return $model->getId();\n        });\n    }\n\n    public function update(int $id, array $data): int\n    {\n        return $this->connector->executeInTransaction(function () use ($id, $data) {\n            $model = $this->get{Name}OrFail($id);\n            $this->connector->update{Name}($model, $data);\n            return 1;\n        });\n    }\n\n    public function delete(int $id): int\n    {\n        return $this->connector->executeInTransaction(function () use ($id) {\n            $model = $this->get{Name}OrFail($id);\n            $this->connector->delete{Name}($model);\n            return 1;\n        });\n    }\n\n    private function get{Name}OrFail(int $id): {Name}\n    {\n        $model = $this->connector->find{Name}ById($id);\n        if ($model === null) {\n            throw new \\RuntimeException(\"{Name} with ID {$id} not found\");\n        }\n        return $model;\n    }\n\n    private function toArray({Name} $model): array\n    {\n        return [\n            ''id'' => $model->getId(),\n            // Map all properties\n            ''created_at'' => $model->getCreatedAt()?->format(''Y-m-d H:i:s''),\n            ''updated_at'' => $model->getUpdatedAt()?->format(''Y-m-d H:i:s''),\n        ];\n    }\n}\n```\n\n4. **Create Tests**: Add corresponding test in `tests/framework/Repositories/{Domain}/`\n\n---\n\n## Skill 4: Create Propel Connector\n\nWhen creating a new Propel Connector:\n\n1. **Location**: Place in `app/Repositories/Connectors/`\n2. **Structure**:\n   - Initialize Propel in constructor via `PropelInitializer::initialize()`\n   - Use Propel Query classes (e.g., `UserQuery`, `ProductQuery`)\n   - Use Propel Model classes (e.g., `User`, `Product`)\n   - Wrap queries in `executeQuery()` for error handling\n   - Use `executeInTransaction()` for write operations\n   - Never use raw SQL or QueryBuilder\n\n3. **Example Pattern**:\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nnamespace App\\Repositories\\Connectors;\n\nuse App\\Models\\{Name};\nuse App\\Models\\{Name}Query;\nuse App\\Repositories\\Connectors\\PropelInitializer;\nuse Propel\\Runtime\\Propel;\nuse Propel\\Runtime\\Exception\\PropelException;\n\nclass {Name}Connector\n{\n    public function __construct()\n    {\n        PropelInitializer::initialize();\n    }\n\n    public function find{Name}ById(int $id): ?{Name}\n    {\n        return $this->executeQuery(fn() => {Name}Query::create()->findPk($id));\n    }\n\n    public function find{Name}By{Field}(string $value): ?{Name}\n    {\n        return $this->executeQuery(fn() => {Name}Query::create()->findOneBy{Field}($value));\n    }\n\n    public function findAll{Name}s(array $conditions = [], array $orderBy = [], ?int $limit = null, ?int $offset = null): array\n    {\n        return $this->executeQuery(\n            fn() => $this->buildQuery($conditions, $orderBy, $limit, $offset)->find()->getData(),\n            []\n        );\n    }\n\n    public function create{Name}(array $data): {Name}\n    {\n        $model = new {Name}();\n        $model->set{Field}($data[''field'']);\n        // Set all fields\n        $model->save();\n        return $model;\n    }\n\n    public function update{Name}({Name} $model, array $data): {Name}\n    {\n        if (isset($data[''field''])) {\n            $model->set{Field}($data[''field'']);\n        }\n        $model->save();\n        return $model;\n    }\n\n    public function delete{Name}({Name} $model): void\n    {\n        $model->delete();\n    }\n\n    public function executeInTransaction(callable $callback): mixed\n    {\n        $connection = Propel::getConnection();\n        $connection->beginTransaction();\n        try {\n            $result = $callback();\n            $connection->commit();\n            return $result;\n        } catch (\\Exception $e) {\n            $connection->rollBack();\n            throw $e;\n        }\n    }\n\n    private function buildQuery(array $conditions, array $orderBy, ?int $limit, ?int $offset): {Name}Query\n    {\n        $query = {Name}Query::create();\n        \n        foreach ($conditions as $field => $value) {\n            $method = ''filterBy'' . ucfirst($field);\n            if (method_exists($query, $method)) {\n                $query->$method($value);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        foreach ($orderBy as $field => $direction) {\n            $method = ''orderBy'' . ucfirst($field);\n            if (method_exists($query, $method)) {\n                $query->$method($direction);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        if ($limit !== null) {\n            $query->limit($limit);\n        }\n        \n        if ($offset !== null) {\n            $query->offset($offset);\n        }\n        \n        return $query;\n    }\n\n    private function executeQuery(callable $callback, mixed $default = null): mixed\n    {\n        try {\n            return $callback();\n        } catch (PropelException $e) {\n            error_log(\"Propel error: \" . $e->getMessage());\n            return $default;\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n4. **Create Tests**: Add corresponding test in `tests/framework/Repositories/Connectors/`\n\n---\n\n## Skill 5: Use Propel ORM Models\n\nWhen working with Propel models:\n\n1. **Always use Propel Query classes for reads**:\n```php\nuse App\\Models\\User;\nuse App\\Models\\UserQuery;\n\n// Find by primary key\n$user = UserQuery::create()->findPk(1);\n\n// Find by unique field\n$user = UserQuery::create()->findOneByEmail(''user@example.com'');\n\n// Filter and order\n$admins = UserQuery::create()\n    ->filterByRole(''admin'')\n    ->orderByCreatedAt(''DESC'')\n    ->find();\n\n// Count\n$count = UserQuery::create()->filterByRole(''user'')->count();\n```\n\n2. **Always use Propel Model classes for writes**:\n```php\n// Create\n$user = new User();\n$user->setEmail(''new@example.com'');\n$user->setPassword($hashedPassword);\n$user->setName(''New User'');\n$user->save();\n\n// Update\n$user = UserQuery::create()->findPk(1);\n$user->setName(''Updated Name'');\n$user->save();\n\n// Delete\n$user = UserQuery::create()->findPk(1);\n$user->delete();\n```\n\n3. **Never use raw SQL or QueryBuilder for data operations**\n4. **Use `getData()` on collections, not `toArray()`** (returns Collection of models)\n\n---\n\n## Skill 6: Create Request Validation\n\nWhen creating a new Request validation:\n\n1. **Location**: Place in `app/Http/Requests/{Domain}/` following domain structure\n2. **Structure**:\n   - Extend `BaseRequest`\n   - Implement `rules()` method returning validation rules array\n   - Use `validated()` method to get validated data\n   - Validation errors automatically return 422 Response\n   - Use whitelist approach (only allow specified fields)\n\n3. **Example Pattern**:\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nnamespace App\\Http\\Requests\\{Domain};\n\nuse App\\Http\\Requests\\BaseRequest;\n\nclass {Name}Request extends BaseRequest\n{\n    protected function rules(): array\n    {\n        return [\n            ''field1'' => [''required'', ''string'', ''min:3'', ''max:255''],\n            ''field2'' => [''required'', ''email''],\n            ''field3'' => [''numeric'', ''min:0''],\n            ''field4'' => [''required'', ''in:value1,value2''],\n        ];\n    }\n}\n```\n\n4. **Usage in Controller**:\n```php\n$request = new {Name}Request($request, $validator, $response);\n$data = $request->validated(); // Returns array or sends 422 Response\n```\n\n5. **Create Tests**: Add corresponding test in `tests/framework/Http/Requests/{Domain}/`\n\n---\n\n## Skill 7: Create Middleware\n\nWhen creating a new Middleware:\n\n1. **Location**: Place in `app/Http/Middlewares/`\n2. **Structure**:\n   - Implement `MiddlewareInterface`\n   - Inject `Response` via constructor\n   - `handle()` method receives `Request` and `callable $next`\n   - Return `Response` from `$next($request)` or error response\n\n3. **Example Pattern**:\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nnamespace App\\Http\\Middlewares;\n\nuse App\\Http\\Request;\nuse App\\Http\\Response;\nuse App\\Http\\Middlewares\\MiddlewareInterface;\n\nclass {Name}Middleware implements MiddlewareInterface\n{\n    public function __construct(\n        private Response $response\n    ) {\n    }\n\n    public function handle(Request $request, callable $next): Response\n    {\n        // Pre-processing logic\n        \n        if (!$this->shouldProceed($request)) {\n            return $this->response->forbidden(''Access denied'');\n        }\n\n        $response = $next($request);\n\n        // Post-processing logic (optional)\n\n        return $response;\n    }\n\n    private function shouldProceed(Request $request): bool\n    {\n        // Validation logic\n        return true;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n4. **Register in Router**: Use in route definitions or route groups in `routes/web.php`\n5. **Create Tests**: Add corresponding test in `tests/framework/Http/Middlewares/`\n\n---\n\n## Skill 8: Create Database Migration\n\nWhen creating a new migration:\n\n1. **Location**: Place in `database/migrations/`\n2. **Naming**: `{timestamp}_{description}.php` (e.g., `20240114120000_create_users_table.php`)\n3. **Structure**:\n   - Implement `MigrationInterface`\n   - Use direct PDO via `Connection::getInstance()` for DDL operations\n   - Include both `up()` and `down()` methods\n   - Use raw SQL for CREATE/ALTER/DROP (DDL operations)\n   - Add proper indexes and foreign keys\n   - Use transactions for multi-step operations\n\n4. **Example Pattern**:\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nnamespace Database\\Migrations;\n\nuse App\\Database\\Migrations\\MigrationInterface;\nuse App\\Repositories\\Database\\Connection;\nuse PDO;\n\nclass {Name}Migration implements MigrationInterface\n{\n    private PDO $pdo;\n\n    public function __construct()\n    {\n        $this->pdo = Connection::getInstance();\n    }\n\n    public function up(): void\n    {\n        $this->pdo->exec(\"\n            CREATE TABLE {table_name} (\n                id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\n                column1 VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\n                column2 INT,\n                created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n                INDEX idx_column1 (column1)\n            ) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci\n        \");\n    }\n\n    public function down(): void\n    {\n        $this->pdo->exec(\"DROP TABLE IF EXISTS {table_name}\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n5. **Security**: Migrations use DDL (CREATE/ALTER/DROP) - no user input involved\n6. **Create Tests**: Add corresponding test in `tests/framework/Database/Migrations/`\n\n---\n\n## Skill 9: Create Database Seeder\n\nWhen creating a new seeder:\n\n1. **Location**: Place in `database/seeders/`\n2. **Naming**: `{timestamp}_{description}.php` (e.g., `20240101000000_DefaultUsersSeeder.php`)\n3. **Structure**:\n   - Implement `SeederInterface`\n   - Use `PropelConnector` (or domain-specific connector) for all data operations\n   - Check for existing records before creating (update if exists)\n   - Use Propel models, never raw SQL\n\n4. **Example Pattern**:\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nnamespace Database\\Seeders;\n\nuse App\\Database\\Seeders\\SeederInterface;\nuse App\\Repositories\\Connectors\\PropelConnector;\nuse App\\Services\\Security\\HashService;\n\nclass {Name}Seeder implements SeederInterface\n{\n    private HashService $hashService;\n\n    public function __construct()\n    {\n        $this->hashService = new HashService();\n    }\n\n    public function run(PropelConnector $connector): void\n    {\n        $items = [\n            [\n                ''field1'' => ''value1'',\n                ''field2'' => ''value2'',\n            ],\n        ];\n\n        foreach ($items as $itemData) {\n            $existing = $connector->find{Name}By{Field}($itemData[''field'']);\n            \n            if ($existing === null) {\n                $connector->create{Name}($itemData);\n            } else {\n                // Update existing record\n                $connector->update{Name}($existing, $itemData);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n5. **Create Tests**: Add corresponding test in `tests/framework/Database/Seeders/`\n\n---\n\n## Skill 10: Modify Propel Schema\n\nWhen modifying the database schema:\n\n1. **Location**: Edit `schema.xml` at project root\n2. **Structure**:\n   - Use Propel XML schema format\n   - Use `LONGVARCHAR` instead of `TEXT` for compatibility\n   - Define foreign keys and relationships\n   - Use ENUM types for constrained values\n\n3. **After modifying schema.xml**:\n```bash\n# Generate Propel configuration\nvendor/bin/propel config:convert\n\n# Generate models\nvendor/bin/propel model:build --schema-dir=. --output-dir=app\n```\n\n4. **Important**: \n   - Generated files in `app/Models/Base/` are auto-generated - manual fixes will be overwritten\n   - If ENUM handling needs fixes, re-apply after each `model:build`\n   - Create migration for schema changes if needed\n\n---\n\n## Skill 11: Create PHPUnit Test\n\nWhen creating a new test:\n\n1. **Location**: Place in `tests/framework/{Category}/` matching app structure\n2. **Structure**:\n   - Extend `Tests\\Support\\TestCase`\n   - Use `setUp()` and `tearDown()` for test isolation\n   - Use database transactions or fresh database for each test\n   - Follow AAA pattern (Arrange, Act, Assert)\n\n3. **Example Pattern**:\n```php\n<?php\n\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\n\nnamespace Tests\\Framework\\{Category};\n\nuse Tests\\Support\\TestCase;\nuse App\\{Category}\\{Name};\n\nclass {Name}Test extends TestCase\n{\n    protected function setUp(): void\n    {\n        parent::setUp();\n        // Setup test data\n    }\n\n    public function testSomething(): void\n    {\n        // Arrange\n        $input = ''value'';\n        \n        // Act\n        $result = $this->subject->method($input);\n        \n        // Assert\n        $this->assertEquals(''expected'', $result);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n4. **Run tests**: `vendor/bin/phpunit` or `composer test`\n\n---\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **100% Propel ORM**: Never use QueryBuilder or raw SQL for data operations. Only use direct PDO for DDL in migrations.\n\n2. **Architecture**: Controller → Service → Repository → Connector (Propel) → Database\n\n3. **SOLID Principles**: Single Responsibility, Open/Closed, Liskov Substitution, Interface Segregation, Dependency Inversion\n\n4. **Security**: \n   - CSRF protection on all forms\n   - Input validation with whitelist approach\n   - Password hashing (bcrypt)\n   - SQL injection protection (Propel ORM)\n   - XSS protection (input sanitization)\n\n5. **Code Quality**: DRY, KISS, YAGNI, \"Sur la coche\" (all quality rules applied)\n\n6. **Testing**: Comprehensive test coverage, TDD when appropriate\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:22:53.230Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full Stack Agents requiring advanced PHP framework development capabilities with Propel ORM 2.0 and role-based auth","zh":"适合需要高级PHP框架开发能力的全栈代理，尤其是Propel ORM 2.0和基于角色的身份验证","ja":"フルスタックエージェントが高度なPHPフレームワーク開発機能を必要とする場合に最適で、Propel ORM 2.0およびロールベースの認証が含まれます","ko":"고급 PHP 프레임워크 개발 기능이 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에게 적합하며 Propel ORM 2.0 및 역할 기반 인증을 포함합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Full Stack que requieren capacidades de desarrollo de framework de PHP avanzadas con Propel ORM 2.0 y autenticación basada en roles","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full Stack nécessitant des capacités de développement de framework PHP avancées avec Propel ORM 2.0 et authentification basée sur les rôles","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agenten, die erweiterte PHP-Framework-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit Propel ORM 2.0 und rollenbasierter Authentifizierung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full Stack que requerem capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento de framework PHP com Propel ORM 2.0 e autenticação baseada em função","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов, требующих продвинутых возможностей разработки фреймворка PHP с Propel ORM 2.0 и ролевой аутентификацией","ar":"مثالي لعميل متكامل يتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لتطوير إطار العمل PHP مع Propel ORM 2.0 وتأليف الدور"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build secure and scalable PHP applications using constructor injection for dependencies, fluent Response methods, and comprehensive test suites, while leveraging CSRF protection and database migrations","zh":"赋予代理构建安全可扩展的PHP应用程序的能力，使用构造函数注入依赖项、流畅的响应方法和全面测试套件，同时利用CSRF保护和数据库迁移","ja":"エージェントがコンストラクタ注入を使用して依存関係、フルエントレスポンスメソッド、包括的なテストスイートを使用してセキュアでスケーラブルなPHPアプリケーションを構築する能力を提供し、CSRF保護とデータベースマイグレーションを活用","ko":"에이전트가 의존성에 대한 생성자 주입, 응답 방법의 유연성 및 포괄적인 테스트套件을 사용하여 보안이 뛰어난 확장 가능한 PHP 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, CSRF 보호 및 데이터베이스 마이그레이션을 활용합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones PHP seguras y escalables utilizando inyección de constructores para dependencias, métodos de respuesta fluidos y suites de pruebas integrales, aprovechando la protección CSRF y las migraciones de base de datos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications PHP sécurisées et évolutives en utilisant l''injection de constructeurs pour les dépendances, des méthodes de réponse fluides et des suites de tests complètes, tout en exploitant la protection CSRF et les migrations de base de données","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere und skalierbare PHP-Anwendungen zu erstellen, indem sie Konstruktorinjektion für Abhängigkeiten, flüssige Antwortmethoden und umfassende Test-Suiten verwenden, während sie den CSRF-Schutz und Datenbankmigrationen nutzen","pt":"Permite que os agentes construam aplicações PHP seguras e escaláveis usando injeção de construtor para dependências, métodos de resposta fluentes e conjuntos de testes abrangentes, aproveitando a proteção CSRF e migrações de banco de dados","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать безопасные и масштабируемые приложения PHP, используя конструкторную инъекцию зависимостей, методы Response с поддержкой fluent, и всесторонние тестовые наборы, используя защиту от CSRF и миграции баз данных","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات PHP آمنة وقابلة للتوسيع باستخدام حقن البناء للارتباطات وأساليب الاستجابة المتدفقة ومجموعات الاختبار الشاملة، مع الاستفادة من حماية CSRF وترحيلات قاعدة البيانات"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating RESTful APIs with JSON responses","Implementing role-based authentication and authorization","Generating database migrations for schema updates"],"zh":["创建具有JSON响应的RESTful API","实现基于角色的身份验证和授权","生成数据库迁移以更新模式"],"ja":["JSONレスポンスを備えたRESTful APIを作成する","ロールベースの認証と認可を実装する","スキーマ更新のためのデータベースマイグレーションを生成する"],"ko":["JSON 응답을 갖춘 RESTful API 생성","역할 기반 인증 및 권한 부여 구현","스키마 업데이트를 위한 데이터베이스 마이그레이션 생성"],"es":["Crear APIs RESTful con respuestas JSON","Implementar autenticación y autorización basadas en roles","Generar migraciones de base de datos para actualizaciones de esquema"],"fr":["Créer des API RESTful avec des réponses JSON","Mettre en œuvre l''authentification et l''autorisation basées sur les rôles","Générer des migrations de base de données pour des mises à jour de schéma"],"de":["Erstellen von RESTful-APIs mit JSON-Antworten","Implementierung von rollenbasierter Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Generieren von Datenbankmigrationen für Schemaaufgaben"],"pt":["Criar APIs RESTful com respostas JSON","Implementar autenticação e autorização baseada em função","Gerar migrações de banco de dados para atualizações de esquema"],"ru":["Создание RESTful API с ответами JSON","Реализация ролевой аутентификации и авторизации","Генерация миграций базы данных для обновления схемы"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات RESTful مع استجابات JSON","تطبيق تأليف وتأشيرة الدور","توليد ترحيلات قاعدة البيانات لتحديث مخطط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP 8.3+ environment","Specific to Propel ORM 2.0 and may not be compatible with other ORMs"],"zh":["需要PHP 8.3+环境","特定于Propel ORM 2.0，可能与其他ORM不兼容"],"ja":["PHP 8.3+環境が必要","Propel ORM 2.0に特有であり、他のORMと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["PHP 8.3+ 환경 필요","Propel ORM 2.0에 특정되어 있으며 다른 ORM과 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere entorno PHP 8.3 o superior","Específico de Propel ORM 2.0 y puede no ser compatible con otros ORMs"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement PHP 8.3 ou supérieur","Spécifique à Propel ORM 2.0 et peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres ORMs"],"de":["Benötigt PHP 8.3+-Umgebung","Spezifisch für Propel ORM 2.0 und kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen ORMs kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Requer ambiente PHP 8.3+","Específico para Propel ORM 2.0 e pode não ser compatível com outros ORMs"],"ru":["Требуется среда PHP 8.3+","Специфичен для Propel ORM 2.0 и может быть несовместим с другими ORM"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة PHP 8.3+","محدد ل Propel ORM 2.0 وقد لا يكون متوافقًا مع أوراكل أخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
