й Интеллект Безопасность: Защита Систем ИИ","ar":"أمن الذكاء الاصطناعي: حماية أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"ai-security"},"description":{"zh":"AI ,LLM","ja":"AI,LLM","ko":"AI ,LLM","es":"La habilidad de seguridad de IA protege los sistemas de inteligencia artificial contra amenazas como la inyección de prompts y la fuga de datos","fr":"La compétence en sécurité de l''IA protège les systèmes d''intelligence artificielle contre les menaces telles que les injections de prompts et les fuites de d...","de":"Die KI-Sicherheitsfähigkeit schützt künstliche Intelligenz-Systeme vor Bedrohungen wie Prompt-Injection und Datenlecks","pt":"A segurança de IA é um conjunto de técnicas para proteger sistemas de IA contra ameaças. Isso inclui defesa contra injeção de prompts e vazamento de dados","ru":"Безопасность ИИ - это набор методов для защиты систем ИИ от угроз. Это включает защиту от внедрения запросов и утечки данных","ar":"أمن الذكاء الاصطناعي هو مجموعة من التقنيات لحماية أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي من التهديدات. وهذا يشمل الدفاع ضد حقن البرمجة وتسرب البيانات","en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stac..."},"definition":{"en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stack. Supports blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more. Includes refactoring capabilities for existing projects"},"features":{"zh":["LLM","Prompt Injection","PII","API","LLM"],"ja":["LLM","Prompt Injection","PII","API","LLM"],"ko":["LLM","Prompt Injection","PII","API","LLM"],"es":["Defensa contra inyección de prompts","Sanitización de entrada para prompts de usuario","Limitación de velocidad para puntos de conexión de API de LLM","Detección y redacción de información personal","Filtrado de contenido y capas de seguridad","Registro de auditoría para interacciones de IA"],"fr":["Défense contre les injections de prompts","Sanitisation des entrées pour les prompts des utilisateurs","Limitation de débit pour les points de terminaison d''API de LLM","Détection et rédaction d''informations personnelles","Filtrage de contenu et couches de sécurité","Journalisation d''audit pour les interactions d''IA"],"de":["Verteidigung gegen Prompt-Injection","Eingabesanitierung für Benutzerprompts","Rate Limiting für LLM-API-Endpunkte","Erkennung und Redaktion von personenbezogenen Daten","Inhaltsfilterung und Sicherheitsebenen","Audit-Protokollierung für KI-Interaktionen"],"pt":["Defesa contra injeção de prompts","Sanitização de entrada de usuário","Limitação de taxa para endpoints de API de LLM","Detecção e redação de PII","Filtragem de conteúdo e camadas de segurança","Registro de auditoria para interações de IA"],"ru":["Защита от внедрения запросов","Санитарная обработка пользовательского ввода","Ограничение скорости для конечных точек API LLM","Обнаружение и редактирование PII","Фильтрация контента и уровни безопасности","Аудиторский журнал для взаимодействий ИИ"],"ar":["الدفاع ضد حقن البرمجة","تنقية مدخلات المستخدم","تحديد معدل للنقاط النهائية لبروتوكول LLM","كشف وتحرير PII","مرشح المحتوى وطبقات الأمان","سجل تدقيق لتفاعلات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI ","LLM","Prompt Injection","AI ","PII","API"],"ja":["AI","LLM","Prompt Injection","AI","PII","API"],"ko":["AI ","LLM","Prompt Injection","AI ","PII","API"],"es":["seguridad de ia","protección de sistemas de ia","inyección de prompts","fuga de datos","sanitización de entrada","limitación de velocidad","detección de información personal","filtrado de contenido"],"fr":["sécurité de l''ia","protection des systèmes d''ia","injection de prompts","fuite de données","sanitisation des entrées","limitation de débit","détection d''informations personnelles","filtrage de contenu"],"de":["ki-sicherheit","schutz von ki-systemen","prompt-injection","datenlecks","eingabesanitierung","rate limiting","erkennung von personenbezogenen daten","inhaltsfilterung"],"pt":["segurança de ia","proteção de sistemas de ia","injeção de prompts","vazamento de dados","sanitização de entrada","limitação de taxa","pii","filtragem de conteúdo"],"ru":["безопасность ии","защита систем ии","внедрение запросов","утечка данных","санитарная обработка","ограничение скорости","pii","фильтрация контента"],"ar":["أمن الذكاء الاصطناعي","حماية أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","حقن البرمجة","تسرب البيانات","تنقية المدخلات","تحديد المعدل","pii","مرشح المحتوى"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-security","description":"Rate limiting for LLM endpoints","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# AI Security Skill\n\nProtect AI systems against prompt injection, data leakage, and abuse through multi-layer defense patterns.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Defending LLM endpoints against prompt injection\n- Implementing input sanitization for user prompts\n- Setting up rate limiting for LLM API endpoints\n- Adding PII detection and redaction\n- Configuring content filtering and safety layers\n- Building audit logging for AI interactions\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install presidio-analyzer presidio-anonym","body":"# AI Security Skill\n\nProtect AI systems against prompt injection, data leakage, and abuse through multi-layer defense patterns.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Defending LLM endpoints against prompt injection\n- Implementing input sanitization for user prompts\n- Setting up rate limiting for LLM API endpoints\n- Adding PII detection and redaction\n- Configuring content filtering and safety layers\n- Building audit logging for AI interactions\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install presidio-analyzer presidio-anonymizer  # PII detection\npip install nemoguardrails                          # Guardrails\npip install redis                                   # Rate limiting\n```\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Input Sanitization\n\n```python\nimport re\nfrom typing import Tuple\n\nINJECTION_PATTERNS = [\n    r\"ignore\\s+(previous|above|all)\\s+(instructions|prompts)\",\n    r\"you\\s+are\\s+now\\s+(a|an)\\s+\",\n    r\"system\\s*:\\s*\",\n    r\"<\\|.*?\\|>\",\n    r\"\\[INST\\]|\\[/INST\\]\",\n    r\"```\\s*(system|assistant)\",\n]\n\ndef sanitize_input(user_input: str) -> Tuple[str, list[str]]:\n    \"\"\"Sanitize user input and return cleaned text with flagged patterns.\"\"\"\n    flags = []\n    cleaned = user_input\n\n    for pattern in INJECTION_PATTERNS:\n        if re.search(pattern, cleaned, re.IGNORECASE):\n            flags.append(f\"Detected pattern: {pattern}\")\n            cleaned = re.sub(pattern, \"[FILTERED]\", cleaned, flags=re.IGNORECASE)\n\n    if len(cleaned) > 4000:\n        flags.append(\"Input truncated to 4000 chars\")\n        cleaned = cleaned[:4000]\n\n    return cleaned, flags\n```\n\n### Step 2: PII Detection and Redaction\n\n```python\nfrom presidio_analyzer import AnalyzerEngine\nfrom presidio_anonymizer import AnonymizerEngine\n\nanalyzer = AnalyzerEngine()\nanonymizer = AnonymizerEngine()\n\ndef redact_pii(text: str, language: str = \"en\") -> str:\n    \"\"\"Detect and redact PII from text before sending to LLM.\"\"\"\n    results = analyzer.analyze(text=text, language=language,\n        entities=[\"PHONE_NUMBER\", \"EMAIL_ADDRESS\", \"CREDIT_CARD\",\n                   \"US_SSN\", \"IBAN_CODE\", \"IP_ADDRESS\"])\n    anonymized = anonymizer.anonymize(text=text, analyzer_results=results)\n    return anonymized.text\n```\n\n### Step 3: Rate Limiting for LLM Endpoints\n\n```python\nimport redis\nimport time\n\nclass TokenBucketRateLimiter:\n    \"\"\"Rate limiter using Redis token bucket algorithm.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, redis_client: redis.Redis, max_tokens: int = 10,\n                 refill_seconds: int = 60):\n        self.redis = redis_client\n        self.max_tokens = max_tokens\n        self.refill_seconds = refill_seconds\n\n    def is_allowed(self, user_id: str) -> bool:\n        key = f\"ratelimit:{user_id}\"\n        pipe = self.redis.pipeline()\n        now = time.time()\n\n        pipe.hget(key, \"tokens\")\n        pipe.hget(key, \"last_refill\")\n        tokens, last_refill = pipe.execute()\n\n        tokens = float(tokens) if tokens else self.max_tokens\n        last_refill = float(last_refill) if last_refill else now\n\n        elapsed = now - last_refill\n        tokens = min(self.max_tokens,\n                     tokens + elapsed * (self.max_tokens / self.refill_seconds))\n\n        if tokens < 1:\n            return False\n\n        pipe.hset(key, \"tokens\", tokens - 1)\n        pipe.hset(key, \"last_refill\", now)\n        pipe.expire(key, self.refill_seconds * 2)\n        pipe.execute()\n        return True\n```\n\n### Step 4: Audit Logging\n\n```python\nimport json\nimport logging\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\n\naudit_logger = logging.getLogger(\"ai_audit\")\n\ndef log_ai_interaction(user_id: str, prompt: str, response: str,\n                       model: str, flags: list[str] | None = None):\n    \"\"\"Log AI interaction for audit trail.\"\"\"\n    audit_logger.info(json.dumps({\n        \"timestamp\": datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat(),\n        \"user_id\": user_id,\n        \"model\": model,\n        \"prompt_length\": len(prompt),\n        \"response_length\": len(response),\n        \"flags\": flags or [],\n        \"prompt_hash\": hash(prompt),\n    }))\n```\n\n### Step 5: Output Filtering\n\n```python\ndef filter_output(response: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Filter LLM output for safety.\"\"\"\n    response = redact_pii(response)\n\n    blocked_patterns = [\n        r\"(ssh|api)[_-]?key\\s*[:=]\\s*\\S+\",\n        r\"password\\s*[:=]\\s*\\S+\",\n        r\"BEGIN\\s+(RSA|DSA|EC)\\s+PRIVATE\\s+KEY\",\n    ]\n    for pattern in blocked_patterns:\n        response = re.sub(pattern, \"[REDACTED]\", response, flags=re.IGNORECASE)\n\n    return response\n```\n\n## Output\n\n- Input sanitization pipeline filtering injection attempts\n- PII detection and redaction using Presidio\n- Token bucket rate limiting with Redis\n- Structured audit logging for compliance\n- Output filtering for sensitive data leakage prevention\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Input Validation**: Always sanitize and validate user inputs before sending to LLM to prevent injection attacks\n- **Prompt Injection Prevention**: Use pattern detection, input length limits, and content filtering to block injection attempts\n- **Output Filtering**: Filter LLM outputs to prevent sensitive data leakage (PII, credentials, API keys)\n- **Rate Limiting**: Implement token bucket or sliding window rate limiting to prevent API abuse and control costs\n- **Audit Logging**: Log all AI interactions with timestamps, user IDs, flags, and response metadata for compliance and debugging\n- **PII Detection**: Use Presidio or similar tools to detect and redact personally identifiable information before processing\n- **Error Handling**: Implement graceful error handling that doesn''t leak system information to attackers\n- **Token Management**: Monitor token usage and implement quotas to prevent unexpected costs\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `llm-guardrails` - NeMo Guardrails and content safety\n- `ai-system-design` - Architecture patterns for AI apps\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:23:20.445Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code requiring robust protection against prompt injection and data leakage.","zh":"适用于Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code等AI代理，需要强大的保护以防止提示注入和数据泄露。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しています。プロンプトインジェクションやデータ漏えいに対する強力な保護が必要です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 프롬프트 주입 및 데이터 누출에 대한 강력한 보호가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que requieren una protección robusta contra la inyección de comandos y la fuga de datos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une protection robuste contre l''injection de commande et la fuite de données.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine robuste Protektion gegen Prompt-Injection und Datenlecks erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que exigem proteção robusta contra injeção de prompts e vazamento de dados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих надежной защиты от внедрения запросов и утечки данных.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يتطلبون حماية قوية ضد حقن الاستعلامات وتسرب البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to defend against malicious inputs using multi-layer defense patterns, implementing input sanitization with libraries like presidio-analyzer and presidio-anonymizer, and configuring rate limiting for LLM API endpoints to prevent abuse.","zh":"赋予代理防御恶意输入的能力，使用多层防御模式，实现输入清理，并使用presidio-analyzer和presidio-anonymizer等库配置LLM API端点的速率限制，以防止滥用。","ja":"マルチレイヤーディフェンスパターンを使用して、悪意のある入力を防御するエージェントの能力を付与します。さらに、presidio-analyzerとpresidio-anonymizerなどのライブラリを使用して入力のサニタイズを行い、LLM APIエンドポイントのレート制限を構成して濫用を防ぎます。","ko":"다중 계층 방어 패턴을 사용하여 악의적인 입력을 방어하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. presidio-analyzer 및 presidio-anonymizer와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 입력을 정화하고 LLM API 엔드포인트에 대한 속도 제한을 구성하여 남용을 방지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes defenderse contra entradas maliciosas utilizando patrones de defensa en capas múltiples, implementando la sanitización de entradas con bibliotecas como presidio-analyzer y presidio-anonymizer, y configurando la limitación de velocidad para los puntos de conexión de la API de LLM para prevenir el abuso.","fr":"Permet aux agents de se défendre contre les entrées malveillantes en utilisant des modèles de défense multi-couches, en implémentant la désinfection des entrées avec des bibliothèques comme presidio-analyzer et presidio-anonymizer, et en configurant la limitation de débit pour les points de terminaison de l''API LLM pour prévenir les abus.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, sich gegen bösartige Eingaben zu verteidigen, indem sie Verteidigungsmuster in mehreren Schichten verwenden, die Eingabesanitierung mit Bibliotheken wie presidio-analyzer und presidio-anonymizer implementieren und die Ratebegrenzung für LLM-API-Endpunkte konfigurieren, um Missbrauch zu verhindern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se defenderem contra entradas maliciosas usando padrões de defesa em múltiplas camadas, implementando sanitização de entrada com bibliotecas como presidio-analyzer e presidio-anonymizer, e configurando limitação de taxa para pontos de extremidade de API de LLM para prevenir abusos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью защищаться от вредоносных входных данных с помощью многослойных защитных шаблонов, реализуя санитизацию входных данных с помощью библиотек, таких как presidio-analyzer и presidio-anonymizer, и настраивая ограничение скорости для конечных точек API LLM, чтобы предотвратить злоупотребления.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الدفاع ضد المدخلات الخبيثة باستخدام أنماط الدفاع متعددة الطبقات، وتنفيذ تنظيف المدخلات باستخدام مكتبات مثل presidio-analyzer و presidio-anonymizer، وتنفيذ تحديد معدل للنقاط النهائية لبروتوكول LLM لمنع الإساءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Defending LLM endpoints against prompt injection attacks","Implementing PII detection and redaction for sensitive data protection","Configuring content filtering and safety layers for secure AI interactions"],"zh":["防御LLM端点免受提示注入攻击","实施PII检测和编辑以保护敏感数据","配置内容过滤和安全层以实现安全的AI交互"],"ja":["LLMエンドポイントをプロンプトインジェクション攻撃から防御する","PII検出と編集を実施して機密データを保護する","コンテンツフィルタリングとセーフティレイヤーを構成して安全なAIインタラクションを実現する"],"ko":["LLM 엔드포인트를 프롬프트 주입 공격으로부터 방어한다","PII 검색 및 편집을 구현하여 민감한 데이터를 보호한다","콘텐츠 필터링 및 안전 계층을 구성하여 안전한 AI 상호 작용을 구현한다"],"es":["Defender los puntos de conexión de LLM contra ataques de inyección de comandos","Implementar la detección y supresión de PII para la protección de datos sensibles","Configurar la filtración de contenido y las capas de seguridad para interacciones de IA seguras"],"fr":["Défendre les points de terminaison de LLM contre les attaques d''injection de commande","Mettre en œuvre la détection et la suppression de PII pour la protection des données sensibles","Configurer le filtrage de contenu et les couches de sécurité pour des interactions d''IA sécurisées"],"de":["LLM-Endpunkte gegen Prompt-Injection-Angriffe verteidigen","PII-Erkennung und -Redaktion für den Schutz sensibler Daten implementieren","Inhaltsfilterung und Sicherheitsebenen für sichere KI-Interaktionen konfigurieren"],"pt":["Defesa de pontos de extremidade de LLM contra ataques de injeção de prompts","Implementação de detecção e redação de PII para proteção de dados sensíveis","Configuração de filtragem de conteúdo e camadas de segurança para interações de IA seguras"],"ru":["Защита конечных точек LLM от атак внедрения запросов","Реализация обнаружения и редактирования PII для защиты конфиденциальных данных","Настройка фильтрации контента и слоев безопасности для безопасного взаимодействия ИИ"],"ar":["الدفاع عن نقاط النهاية لبروتوكول LLM ضد هجمات حقن الاستعلامات","تنفيذ كشف وتنقيح PII لحماية البيانات الحساسة","تكوين مرشح المحتوى وطبقات الأمان للتفاعلات الآمنة للذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of presidio-analyzer and presidio-anonymizer libraries","May require additional configuration for specific tech stacks like SAP or Cloud-Native"],"zh":["需要安装presidio-analyzer和presidio-anonymizer库","可能需要为特定技术栈（如SAP或Cloud-Native）进行额外配置"],"ja":["presidio-analyzerとpresidio-anonymizerライブラリのインストールが必要","特定のテクノロジースタック（SAPまたはCloud-Nativeなど）の場合、追加の構成が必要になる場合があります"],"ko":["presidio-analyzer 및 presidio-anonymizer 라이브러리의 설치가 필요합니다","특정 기술 스택(SAP 또는 Cloud-Native 등)의 경우 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de las bibliotecas presidio-analyzer y presidio-anonymizer","Puede requerir una configuración adicional para pilas tecnológicas específicas como SAP o Cloud-Native"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation des bibliothèques presidio-analyzer et presidio-anonymizer","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour des piles technologiques spécifiques comme SAP ou Cloud-Native"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der Bibliotheken presidio-analyzer und presidio-anonymizer","Kann eine zusätzliche Konfiguration für spezifische Technologie-Stacks wie SAP oder Cloud-Native erfordern"],"pt":["Exige a instalação das bibliotecas presidio-analyzer e presidio-anonymizer","Pode exigir configuração adicional para pilhas de tecnologia específicas como SAP ou Cloud-Native"],"ru":["Требует установки библиотек presidio-analyzer и presidio-anonymizer","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для определенных стеков технологий, таких как SAP или Cloud-Native"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت مكتبات presidio-analyzer و presidio-anonymizer","يمكن أن يتطلب تكوينًا إضافيًا لمجموعات تقنية محددة مثل SAP أو Cloud-Native"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
