值帮助和搜索模式","启用草稿启用 UI","支持 SAP Fiori 工具和页面"],"ja":["SAP Fiori エレメンツアプリの構築","CDS UI 注釈の構成","値のヘルプと検索パターンの追加","下書き有効 UI の有効化","SAP Fiori ツールとページのサポート"],"ko":["SAP Fiori 요소 애플리케이션 구축","CDS UI 주석 구성","값 도움말 및 검색 패턴 추가","초안 활성화 UI 활성화","SAP Fiori 도구 및 페이지 지원"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones Fiori Elements","Configuración de anotaciones CDS","Creación de informes de lista y páginas de objeto","Habilitación de interfaces de usuario con borrador","Uso de herramientas de SAP Fiori"],"fr":["Création d''applications Fiori Elements","Configuration d''annotations CDS","Création de rapports de liste et de pages d''objet","Activation d''interfaces utilisateur avec brouillon","Utilisation d''outils SAP Fiori"],"de":["Erstellung von Fiori-Elements-Anwendungen","Konfiguration von CDS-Anmerkungen","Erstellung von Listenberichten und Objektseiten","Aktivierung von Benutzeroberflächen mit Entwurf","Verwendung von SAP-Fiori-Tools"],"pt":["Criação de aplicativos Fiori Elements","Configuração de relatórios e páginas de objetos","Uso de anotações CDS para personalização","Suporte a valor de ajuda e padrões de pesquisa","Habilitação de interfaces de usuário com suporte a rascunho"],"ru":["Создание приложений Fiori Elements","Настройка отчетов и страниц объектов","Использование аннотаций CDS для настройки","Поддержка помощи значения и шаблонов поиска","Включение интерфейсов пользователя с поддержкой черновика"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات فيوري إلكترونيهات","ضبط التقارير وصفحات الكائنات","استخدام تعليقات CDS للتعديل","دعم قيمة المساعدة وأنماط البحث","تمكين واجهات المستخدم مع دعم المسودات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Fiori 开发","SAP Fiori","CDS UI 注释","值帮助","草稿启用 UI","SAP Fiori 工具","页面构建"],"ja":["Fiori 開発","SAP Fiori","CDS UI 注釈","値のヘルプ","下書き有効 UI","SAP Fiori ツール","ページ構築"],"ko":["Fiori 개발","SAP Fiori","CDS UI 주석","값 도움말","초안 활성화 UI","SAP Fiori 도구","페이지 구축"],"es":["desarrollo de Fiori","aplicaciones Fiori Elements","anotaciones CDS","SAP Fiori","interfaces de usuario personalizadas","informes de lista","páginas de objeto"],"fr":["développement Fiori","applications Fiori Elements","annotations CDS","SAP Fiori","interfaces utilisateur sur mesure","rapports de liste","pages d''objet"],"de":["Fiori-Entwicklung","Fiori-Elements-Anwendungen","CDS-Anmerkungen","SAP Fiori","maßgeschneiderte Benutzeroberflächen","Listenberichte","Objektseiten"],"pt":["desenvolvimento fiori","aplicativos fiori elements","anotações cds","relatórios personalizados","páginas de objetos","suporte a valor de ajuda","padrões de pesquisa","interface de usuário com suporte a rascunho"],"ru":["разработка fiori","приложения fiori elements","аннотации cds","настраиваемые отчеты","страницы объектов","поддержка помощи значения","шаблоны поиска","интерфейс пользователя с поддержкой черновика"],"ar":["تطوير فيوري","تطبيقات فيوري إلكترونيهات","تعليقات cds","تقارير مخصصة","صفحات الكائنات","دعم قيمة المساعدة","أنماط البحث","واجهة المستخدم مع دعم المسودات"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fiori-development","description":"Fiori Elements app creation (List Report, Object Page, Worklist), CDS annotations for UI, value helps, draft-enabled UIs, SAP Fiori Tools usage","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Fiori Development Skill\n\nCreate Fiori Elements applications using CDS annotations, configure List Reports, Object Pages, Worklists, and Overview Pages with proper value helps, field groups, and draft support.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating Fiori Elements apps (List Report, Object Page, Worklist, Overview Page)\n- Configuring CDS UI annotations (@UI.lineItem, @UI.fieldGroup, @UI.identification)\n- Adding value helps and search patterns\n- Enabling draft-enabled UIs\n- Using SAP Fiori Tools and Page Ma","body":"# Fiori Development Skill\n\nCreate Fiori Elements applications using CDS annotations, configure List Reports, Object Pages, Worklists, and Overview Pages with proper value helps, field groups, and draft support.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating Fiori Elements apps (List Report, Object Page, Worklist, Overview Page)\n- Configuring CDS UI annotations (@UI.lineItem, @UI.fieldGroup, @UI.identification)\n- Adding value helps and search patterns\n- Enabling draft-enabled UIs\n- Using SAP Fiori Tools and Page Map editor\n- Configuring charts and analytical annotations\n- Setting up Fiori Launchpad apps\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- SAP ADT (ABAP Development Tools) installed\n- SAP Fiori Tools installed in VS Code\n- RAP business object or CDS view ready\n- Service binding created and activated\n- Access to Fiori Launchpad\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Configure List Report Annotations\n\n```abap\n@EndUserText.label: ''Travel Booking Projection''\n@AccessControl.authorizationCheck: #CHECK\n@Metadata.allowExtensions: true\n@Search.searchable: true\ndefine view entity ZC_TravelBooking\n  as projection on ZI_TravelBooking\n{\n  key TravelUUID,\n      TravelID,\n      AgencyID,\n      CustomerID,\n      BeginDate,\n      EndDate,\n      TotalPrice,\n      CurrencyCode,\n      Description,\n      Status,\n      \n      /* List Report Annotations */\n      @UI: {\n        lineItem: [ { \n          position: 10, \n          importance: #HIGH,\n          type: #AS_LINK,\n          semanticObjectAction: ''display''\n        } ],\n        identification: [ { \n          position: 10, \n          label: ''Travel ID'',\n          type: #AS_LINK,\n          semanticObjectAction: ''display''\n        } ],\n        selectionField: [ { position: 10 } ]\n      }\n      TravelID,\n      \n      @UI: {\n        lineItem: [ { position: 20 } ],\n        identification: [ { position: 20 } ],\n        fieldGroup: [ { qualifier: ''General'', position: 20 } ],\n        selectionField: [ { position: 20 } ]\n      }\n      Description,\n      \n      @UI: {\n        lineItem: [ { \n          position: 30,\n          type: #AS_DATETIME,\n          formatOptions: { displayMode: #DATE_ONLY }\n        } ],\n        identification: [ { position: 30 } ],\n        fieldGroup: [ { qualifier: ''General'', position: 30 } ],\n        selectionField: [ { position: 30 } ]\n      }\n      BeginDate,\n      \n      @UI: {\n        lineItem: [ { \n          position: 40,\n          type: #AS_DATETIME,\n          formatOptions: { displayMode: #DATE_ONLY }\n        } ],\n        identification: [ { position: 40 } ],\n        fieldGroup: [ { qualifier: ''General'', position: 40 } ],\n        selectionField: [ { position: 40 } ]\n      }\n      EndDate,\n      \n      @UI: {\n        lineItem: [ { \n          position: 50,\n          type: #AS_NUMERIC,\n          unit: CurrencyCode\n        } ],\n        identification: [ { position: 50 } ],\n        fieldGroup: [ { qualifier: ''General'', position: 50 } ]\n      }\n      TotalPrice,\n      \n      @UI: {\n        lineItem: [ { \n          position: 60,\n          type: #AS_STATUS,\n          criticality: ''StatusCriticality''\n        } ],\n        identification: [ { position: 60 } ],\n        fieldGroup: [ { qualifier: ''General'', position: 60 } ],\n        selectionField: [ { position: 60 } ]\n      }\n      Status,\n      \n      /* Value Helps */\n      @Consumption.valueHelpDefinition: [ { \n        entity: { \n          name: ''ZC_Agency'', \n          element: ''AgencyID'' \n        },\n        useForValidation: true\n      } ]\n      AgencyID,\n      \n      @Consumption.valueHelpDefinition: [ { \n        entity: { \n          name: ''ZC_Customer'', \n          element: ''CustomerID'' \n        },\n        useForValidation: true\n      } ]\n      CustomerID\n}\n```\n\n### Step 2: Configure Object Page Annotations\n\n```abap\n@UI: {\n  headerInfo: {\n    typeName: ''Travel Booking'',\n    typeNamePlural: ''Travel Bookings'',\n    title: {\n      type: #STANDARD,\n      value: ''TravelID''\n    },\n    description: {\n      type: #STANDARD,\n      value: ''Description''\n    }\n  },\n  presentationVariant: [ {\n    sortOrder: [ {\n      by: ''BeginDate'',\n      direction: #DESC\n    } ]\n  } ]\n}\ndefine view entity ZC_TravelBooking\n  as projection on ZI_TravelBooking\n{\n  // ... fields ...\n  \n  /* Object Page Facets */\n  @UI.facet: [\n    {\n      id: ''GeneralInfo'',\n      type: #COLLECTION,\n      label: ''General Information'',\n      position: 10\n    },\n    {\n      id: ''TravelDetails'',\n      parentId: ''GeneralInfo'',\n      type: #FIELDGROUP_REFERENCE,\n      targetQualifier: ''TravelData'',\n      label: ''Travel Details'',\n      position: 10\n    },\n    {\n      id: ''FinancialInfo'',\n      parentId: ''GeneralInfo'',\n      type: #FIELDGROUP_REFERENCE,\n      targetQualifier: ''FinancialData'',\n      label: ''Financial Information'',\n      position: 20\n    },\n    {\n      id: ''Items'',\n      type: #IDENTIFICATION_REFERENCE,\n      targetQualifier: ''Items'',\n      label: ''Travel Items'',\n      position: 20\n    },\n    {\n      id: ''StatusInfo'',\n      type: #FIELDGROUP_REFERENCE,\n      targetQualifier: ''StatusData'',\n      label: ''Status'',\n      position: 30\n    }\n  ]\n  \n  /* Field Groups */\n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''TravelData'', \n    position: 10,\n    label: ''Travel Details''\n  } ]\n  TravelID,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''TravelData'', \n    position: 20 \n  } ]\n  Description,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''TravelData'', \n    position: 30 \n  } ]\n  AgencyID,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''TravelData'', \n    position: 40 \n  } ]\n  CustomerID,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''TravelData'', \n    position: 50 \n  } ]\n  BeginDate,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''TravelData'', \n    position: 60 \n  } ]\n  EndDate,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''FinancialData'', \n    position: 10,\n    label: ''Financial Information''\n  } ]\n  BookingFee,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''FinancialData'', \n    position: 20 \n  } ]\n  TotalPrice,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''FinancialData'', \n    position: 30 \n  } ]\n  CurrencyCode,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''StatusData'', \n    position: 10,\n    label: ''Status''\n  } ]\n  Status,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''StatusData'', \n    position: 20 \n  } ]\n  CreatedBy,\n  \n  @UI.fieldGroup: [ { \n    qualifier: ''StatusData'', \n    position: 30 \n  } ]\n  CreatedAt\n}\n```\n\n### Step 3: Configure Actions and Data Actions\n\n```abap\n@UI: {\n  lineItem: [ { \n    position: 10,\n    type: #FOR_ACTION,\n    dataAction: ''submit'',\n    label: ''Submit Booking''\n  } ],\n  identification: [ { position: 10 } ]\n}\nTravelID,\n\n@UI: {\n  lineItem: [ { \n    position: 20,\n    type: #FOR_ACTION,\n    dataAction: ''cancel'',\n    label: ''Cancel Booking''\n  } ]\n}\nStatus,\n\n/* Header Actions */\n@UI.headerInfo: {\n  typeName: ''Travel Booking'',\n  actions: [\n    {\n      type: #FOR_ACTION,\n      dataAction: ''submit'',\n      label: ''Submit''\n    },\n    {\n      type: #FOR_ACTION,\n      dataAction: ''cancel'',\n      label: ''Cancel''\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Step 4: Configure Value Helps\n\n```abap\n/* Simple Value Help */\n@Consumption.valueHelpDefinition: [ { \n  entity: { \n    name: ''ZC_Agency'', \n    element: ''AgencyID'' \n  },\n  useForValidation: true\n} ]\nAgencyID,\n\n/* Value Help with Additional Properties */\n@Consumption.valueHelpDefinition: [ { \n  entity: { \n    name: ''ZC_Customer'', \n    element: ''CustomerID'' \n  },\n  additionalBinding: [\n    {\n      localElement: ''CustomerName'',\n      element: ''CustomerName'',\n      usage: #OUTPUT_ONLY\n    },\n    {\n      localElement: ''CustomerEmail'',\n      element: ''Email'',\n      usage: #OUTPUT_ONLY\n    }\n  ],\n  useForValidation: true\n} ]\nCustomerID,\n\n/* Value Help with Filter */\n@Consumption.valueHelpDefinition: [ { \n  entity: { \n    name: ''ZC_Material'', \n    element: ''MaterialID'' \n  },\n  filter: {\n    materialType: ''SERVICE''\n  },\n  useForValidation: true\n} ]\nMaterialID\n```\n\n### Step 5: Configure Charts and Analytics\n\n```abap\n@UI.chart: [ {\n  title: ''Travel Bookings by Status'',\n  description: ''Distribution of travel bookings'',\n  chartType: #COLUMN,\n  dimensions: [ ''Status'' ],\n  measures: [ ''TotalPrice'' ],\n  qualifier: ''StatusChart''\n} ]\ndefine view entity ZC_TravelBookingAnalytics\n  as projection on ZI_TravelBooking\n{\n  Status,\n  @Aggregation.default: #SUM\n  TotalPrice,\n  \n  @UI.chart: [ {\n    qualifier: ''StatusChart'',\n    dimension: [ ''Status'' ],\n    measure: [ ''TotalPrice'' ]\n  } ]\n}\n```\n\n### Step 6: Configure Draft-Enabled UI\n\n```abap\n/* In Behavior Definition */\ndefine behavior for ZI_TravelBooking alias TravelBooking\npersistent table ztravelbook\ndraft table ztravelbook_d\nlock master total etag LastChangedAt\nwith draft\n{\n  // ... CRUD operations ...\n  \n  draft action Resume;\n  draft action Edit;\n  draft action Activate;\n  draft action Discard;\n}\n\n/* In CDS View - Draft Indicator */\n@UI: {\n  identification: [ { position: 1 } ],\n  headerInfo: {\n    typeName: ''Travel Booking'',\n    typeNamePlural: ''Travel Bookings''\n  }\n}\n%isDraft,\n```\n\n### Step 7: Create Fiori Launchpad App\n\n```json\n{\n  \"sap.app\": {\n    \"id\": \"sap.travel.booking\",\n    \"type\": \"application\",\n    \"title\": \"Travel Booking\",\n    \"description\": \"Manage travel bookings\"\n  },\n  \"sap.ui5\": {\n    \"dependencies\": {\n      \"minUI5Version\": \"1.120.0\",\n      \"libs\": {\n        \"sap.fe\": {}\n      }\n    },\n    \"routing\": {\n      \"routes\": [\n        {\n          \"pattern\": \"\",\n          \"name\": \"TravelBookingList\",\n          \"target\": \"TravelBookingList\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"pattern\": \":TravelUUID:\",\n          \"name\": \"TravelBookingObjectPage\",\n          \"target\": \"TravelBookingObjectPage\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"targets\": {\n        \"TravelBookingList\": {\n          \"type\": \"Component\",\n          \"id\": \"TravelBookingList\",\n          \"name\": \"sap.fe.templates.ListReport\",\n          \"options\": {\n            \"settings\": {\n              \"entitySet\": \"TravelBooking\",\n              \"navigation\": {\n                \"TravelBooking\": {\n                  \"detail\": {\n                    \"route\": \"TravelBookingObjectPage\"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"TravelBookingObjectPage\": {\n          \"type\": \"Component\",\n          \"id\": \"TravelBookingObjectPage\",\n          \"name\": \"sap.fe.templates.ObjectPage\",\n          \"options\": {\n            \"settings\": {\n              \"entitySet\": \"TravelBooking\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Fiori Elements Templates\n\n### List Report\n- Standard list with filtering and sorting\n- Use for master data and transactional data\n- Supports search, filters, and bulk actions\n\n### Object Page\n- Detail page for single entity\n- Use for editing and viewing details\n- Supports tabs, field groups, and sub-objects\n\n### Worklist\n- Task-based list\n- Use for approval workflows\n- Supports task actions and status updates\n\n### Overview Page\n- Analytical dashboard\n- Use for KPIs and charts\n- Supports cards, charts, and tables\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Use semantic annotations (@EndUserText.label) for all fields\n- Configure proper field groups for Object Page organization\n- Use value helps for all foreign key fields\n- Enable draft handling for complex editing scenarios\n- Use proper field types (@UI.type) for better UX\n- Configure criticality for status fields\n- Use identification annotations for key fields\n- Configure proper sorting and filtering\n- Use charts for analytical data\n- Test service binding before Fiori app development\n- Use Page Map editor in Fiori Tools for visual configuration\n- Follow Fiori design guidelines\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Missing value helps for foreign keys (poor UX)\n- Not using field groups (disorganized Object Page)\n- Missing semantic annotations (poor accessibility)\n- Not enabling draft for complex editing (data loss risk)\n- Incorrect field types (poor display)\n- Missing criticality for status fields (poor visual feedback)\n- Not testing service binding first (wasted time)\n- Ignoring Fiori design guidelines (inconsistent UX)\n\n## Related\n\n- Skill: `rap-development` - RAP BO creation\n- Skill: `cds-modeling` - CDS view creation\n- Knowledge: `sap-fiori-patterns.json` - Fiori patterns and annotations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:25:07.325Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SAP-focused Agents needing advanced Fiori Elements application development capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Fiori Elements应用开发能力的SAP专注代理。","ja":"SAPに焦点を当てたエージェントが高度なFiori Elementsアプリケーション開発機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 Fiori Elements 애플리케이션 개발 기능이 필요한 SAP 중심 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en SAP que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de aplicaciones avanzadas de Fiori Elements.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur SAP qui ont besoin de capacités de développement d''applications Fiori Elements avancées.","de":"Perfekt für SAP-fokussierte Agenten, die erweiterte Fiori-Elements-Anwendungs-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em SAP que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento de aplicativos Fiori Elements.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на SAP, которым требуются продвинутые возможности разработки приложений Fiori Elements.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على SAP ويتطلبون قابليات متقدمة لتنمية تطبيقات Fiori Elements."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create Fiori Elements apps with CDS annotations, configure List Reports, Object Pages, and Overview Pages, and leverage SAP Fiori Tools for streamlined development, all while supporting draft-enabled UIs and value helps.","zh":"赋予代理创建带有CDS注释的Fiori Elements应用、配置列表报告、对象页面和概述页面的能力，并利用SAP Fiori工具进行流畅的开发，同时支持草稿启用UI和值帮助。","ja":"CDS注釈を使用したFiori Elementsアプリの作成、リストレポート、オブジェクトページ、概要ページの構成、およびSAP Fioriツールを使用した効率的な開発をエージェントに可能にし、同時に下書き有効のUIと値のヘルプをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 CDS 주석을 사용하여 Fiori Elements 애플리케이션을 만들고, 목록 보고서, 개체 페이지 및 개요 페이지를 구성하며, SAP Fiori 도구를 사용하여 개발을 간소화할 수 있도록 하며,同時에草稿 활성화 UI 및 값 도움말을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones de Fiori Elements con anotaciones CDS, configurar informes de lista, páginas de objetos y páginas de resumen, y aprovechar las herramientas de SAP Fiori para un desarrollo optimizado, todo mientras admite interfaces de usuario habilitadas para borradores y ayudas de valor.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications Fiori Elements avec des annotations CDS, de configurer des rapports de liste, des pages d''objets et des pages de synthèse, et d''utiliser les outils SAP Fiori pour un développement rationalisé, le tout en prenant en charge les interfaces utilisateur activées pour les brouillons et les aides de valeur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Fiori-Elements-Anwendungen mit CDS-Anmerkungen zu erstellen, Listenberichte, Objektseiten und Übersichtsseiten zu konfigurieren und SAP-Fiori-Tools für ein optimiertes Entwicklungsumfeld zu nutzen, und unterstützt gleichzeitig Entwurfs-UIs und Wertehilfen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem aplicativos Fiori Elements com anotações CDS, configurem Relatórios de Lista, Páginas de Objeto e Páginas de Visão Geral e usem as Ferramentas SAP Fiori para desenvolvimento otimizado, tudo isso enquanto suportam interfaces de usuário habilitadas para rascunho e ajudas de valor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать приложения Fiori Elements с аннотациями CDS, настраивать отчеты списков, страницы объектов и страницы обзора, а также использовать инструменты SAP Fiori для оптимизированной разработки, все это при поддержке интерфейсов пользователя с функцией черновика и помощи по значению.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات Fiori Elements مع ملاحظات CDS، وتكوين تقارير القائمة وصفحات الكائنات وصفحات نظرة عامة، وتسخير أدوات SAP Fiori من أجل تطور مهيكل، كل ذلك مع دعم واجهات المستخدم المفعلة للتسويقة ومساعدة القيمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating Fiori Elements applications with customized UI annotations","Configuring List Reports and Object Pages with proper field groups and draft support","Creating draft-enabled UIs with value helps and search patterns for enhanced user experience"],"zh":["生成带有自定义UI注释的Fiori Elements应用程序","配置带有适当字段组和草稿支持的列表报告和对象页面","创建带有值帮助和搜索模式的草稿启用UI以增强用户体验"],"ja":["カスタマイズされたUI注釈を使用したFiori Elementsアプリケーションの生成","適切なフィールドグループと草稿サポートを使用したリストレポートとオブジェクトページの構成","値のヘルプと検索パターンを使用した下書き有効のUIの作成によるユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上"],"ko":["사용자 지정 UI 주석을 사용하여 Fiori Elements 애플리케이션 생성","적절한 필드 그룹 및 초안 지원을 사용하여 목록 보고서 및 개체 페이지 구성","값 도움말 및 검색 패턴을 사용하여 초안 활성화 UI 생성하여 사용자 경험을 향상"],"es":["Generar aplicaciones de Fiori Elements con anotaciones de interfaz de usuario personalizadas","Configurar informes de lista y páginas de objetos con grupos de campos y soporte de borrador adecuados","Crear interfaces de usuario habilitadas para borradores con ayudas de valor y patrones de búsqueda para una experiencia de usuario mejorada"],"fr":["Générer des applications Fiori Elements avec des annotations d''interface utilisateur personnalisées","Configurer des rapports de liste et des pages d''objets avec des groupes de champs et un support de brouillon appropriés","Créer des interfaces utilisateur activées pour les brouillons avec des aides de valeur et des modèles de recherche pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée"],"de":["Fiori-Elements-Anwendungen mit benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächenanmerkungen generieren","Listenberichte und Objektseiten mit geeigneten Feldgruppen und Entwurfsunterstützung konfigurieren","Entwurfs-UIs mit Wertehilfen und Suchmustern für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung erstellen"],"pt":["Geração de aplicações Fiori Elements com anotações de UI personalizadas","Configuração de Relatórios de Lista e Páginas de Objeto com grupos de campos apropriados e suporte a rascunho","Criação de interfaces de usuário habilitadas para rascunho com ajudas de valor e padrões de pesquisa para experiência do usuário aprimorada"],"ru":["Генерация приложений Fiori Elements с настраиваемыми аннотациями интерфейса пользователя","Настройка отчетов списков и страниц объектов с правильными группами полей и поддержкой функции черновика","Создание интерфейсов пользователя с функцией черновика и помощью по значению, а также шаблонами поиска для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["توليد تطبيقات Fiori Elements مع ملاحظات UI مخصصة","تكوين تقارير القائمة وصفحات الكائنات مع مجموعات حقول مناسبة ودعم التسويقة","إنشاء واجهات المستخدم المفعلة للتسويقة مع مساعدة القيمة وأنماط البحث لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SAP Fiori Tools and Page Manager setup","Limited to SAP tech stack and compatible with specific blueprints like SAP, Python, and Cloud-Native"],"zh":["需要SAP Fiori工具和页面管理器设置","仅限于SAP技术栈，并与特定的蓝图兼容，如SAP、Python和云原生"],"ja":["SAP Fioriツールとページマネージャーの設定が必要","SAPテクノロジースタックに限定され、SAP、Python、クラウドネイティブなどの特定のブループリントと互換性がある"],"ko":["SAP Fiori 도구 및 페이지 관리자 설정이 필요","SAP 기술 스택으로 제한되며, SAP, Python, Cloud-Native와 같은 특정 블루프린트와 호환"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de las herramientas de SAP Fiori y Page Manager","Limitado a la pila de tecnología de SAP y compatible con plantillas específicas como SAP, Python y Cloud-Native"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration des outils SAP Fiori et Page Manager","Limité à la pile technologique SAP et compatible avec des modèles spécifiques tels que SAP, Python et Cloud-Native"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung von SAP-Fiori-Tools und Page-Manager","Begrenzt auf den SAP-Technologie-Stack und kompatibel mit bestimmten Vorlagen wie SAP, Python und Cloud-Native"],"pt":["Requer configuração das Ferramentas SAP Fiori e do Gerenciador de Páginas","Limitado à pilha de tecnologia SAP e compatível com blueprints específicos como SAP, Python e Cloud-Nativo"],"ru":["Требует настройки инструментов SAP Fiori и менеджера страниц","Ограничен стеком технологий SAP и совместим с конкретными шаблонами, такими как SAP, Python и Cloud-Native"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد أدوات SAP Fiori ومدير الصفحات","محدود بقطع التكنولوجيا SAP والمتوافق مع النماذج المحددة مثل SAP و Python و Cloud-Native"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory/ai-system-design', 'community', 'gitwalter', 'cursor-agent-factory', 'gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory', 'ai-system-design', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z', '2026-02-18T10:24:36.176Z', NULL, '{"id":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory/ai-system-design","name":"ai-system-design","description":{"zh":"AI, LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, ","ja":"AI, LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, ","ko":"AI, LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, ","es":"El Skill de Diseño de Sistemas de IA permite crear sistemas de IA escalables con arquitectura y tecnologias adecuadas","fr":"Le Skill de Conception de Systèmes d''IA permet de créer des systèmes d''IA évolutifs avec une architecture et des technologies appropriées","de":"Das KI-System-Design-Skill ermöglicht die Erstellung skalierbarer KI-Systeme mit geeigneter Architektur und Technologie","pt":"O Skill de Design de Sistemas de IA permite criar sistemas de IA escaláveis com arquitetura apropriada e planejamento de infraestrutura","ru":"Навык проектирования систем ИИ позволяет создавать масштабируемые системы ИИ с подходящей архитектурой и планированием инфраструктуры","ar":"مهارة تصميم أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي تسمح بإنشاء أنظمة ذكاء اصطناعي قابلة للتوسيع مع هندسة مناسبة وتخطيط البنية التحتية","en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stack. Supports blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more. Includes refactoring capabilities for existing projects"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI ","ja":"AI","ko":"AI ","es":"Diseño de Sistemas de IA","fr":"Conception de Systèmes d''IA","de":"KI-System-Design","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Sistemas de IA com Arquitetura Escalável","ru":"Проектирование масштабируемых систем ИИ","ar":"تصميم أنظمة ذكاء اصطناعي قابلة للتوسيع","en":"ai-system-design"},"description":{"zh":"AI, LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, ","ja":"AI, LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, ","ko":"AI, LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, ","es":"El Skill de Diseño de Sistemas de IA permite crear sistemas de IA escalables con arquitectura y tecnologias adecuadas","fr":"Le Skill de Conception de Systèmes d''IA permet de créer des systèmes d''IA évolutifs avec une architecture et des technologies appropriées","de":"Das KI-System-Design-Skill ermöglicht die Erstellung skalierbarer KI-Systeme mit geeigneter Architektur und Technologie","pt":"O Skill de Design de Sistemas de IA permite criar sistemas de IA escaláveis com arquitetura apropriada e planejamento de infraestrutura","ru":"Навык проектирования систем ИИ позволяет создавать масштабируемые системы ИИ с подходящей архитектурой и планированием инфраструктуры","ar":"مهارة تصميم أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي تسمح بإنشاء أنظمة ذكاء اصطناعي قابلة للتوسيع مع هندسة مناسبة وتخطيط البنية التحتية","en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stac..."},"definition":{"en":" A configurable factory for generating Cursor IDE development agent systems. Creates .cursorrules, agents, skills, workflows, and templates for any tech stack. Supports blueprints for SAP, Python, Cloud-Native, and more. Includes refactoring capabilities for existing projects"},"features":{"zh":["LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI","SAP, Python, Cloud-Native","GPU","LLM","Vector DB"],"ja":["LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI","SAP, Python, Cloud-Native","GPU","LLM","Vector DB"],"ko":["LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI","SAP, Python, Cloud-Native","GPU","LLM","Vector DB"],"es":["Creación de sistemas de IA escalables","Selección de frameworks y tecnologias","Planificación de la infraestructura y la escalabilidad","Comparación de proveedores de LLM","Selección de modelos de embedding"],"fr":["Création de systèmes d''IA évolutifs","Sélection de frameworks et de technologies","Planification de l''infrastructure et de la scalabilité","Comparaison de fournisseurs de LLM","Sélection de modèles d''embedding"],"de":["Erstellung skalierbarer KI-Systeme","Auswahl von Frameworks und Technologien","Planung der Infrastruktur und Skalierbarkeit","Vergleich von LLM-Anbietern","Auswahl von Einbettungsmodellen"],"pt":["Criação de sistemas de IA escaláveis","Arquitetura apropriada para sistemas de IA","Planejamento de infraestrutura para sistemas de IA","Suporte a frameworks como LangChain e LangGraph","Suporte a bancos de dados de vetores como Pinecone"],"ru":["Создание масштабируемых систем ИИ","Подходящая архитектура для систем ИИ","Планирование инфраструктуры для систем ИИ","Поддержка фреймворков như LangChain и LangGraph","Поддержка векторных баз данных như Pinecone"],"ar":["إنشاء أنظمة ذكاء اصطناعي قابلة للتوسيع","الهندسة المناسبة لأنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تخطيط البنية التحتية لأنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم الإطارات مثل LangChain و LangGraph","دعم قواعد البيانات المتجهة مثل Pinecone"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","LangChain","LangGraph","CrewAI","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","GPU","LLM","Vector DB"],"ja":["AI","LangChain","LangGraph","CrewAI","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","GPU","LLM","Vector DB"],"ko":["AI","LangChain","LangGraph","CrewAI","SAP","Python","Cloud-Native","GPU","LLM","Vector DB"],"es":["diseño de sistemas de ia","arquitectura de ia","tecnologias de ia","escalabilidad de ia","frameworks de ia","llm proveedores"],"fr":["conception de systèmes d''ia","architecture d''ia","technologies d''ia","scalabilité d''ia","frameworks d''ia","fournisseurs de llm"],"de":["ki-system-design","ki-architektur","ki-technologien","ki-skalierbarkeit","ki-frameworks","llm-anbieter"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de sistemas de ia","arquitetura de sistemas de ia","planejamento de infraestrutura de ia","langchain","langgraph","pinecone","bancos de dados de vetores","frameworks de ia"],"ru":["проектирование систем ии","архитектура систем ии","планирование инфраструктуры ии","langchain","langgraph","pinecone","векторные базы данных","фреймворки ии"],"ar":["تصميم أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","هندسة أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تخطيط البنية التحتية للذكاء الاصطناعي","langchain","langgraph","pinecone","قواعد البيانات المتجهة","إطارات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"gitwalter","repo":"cursor-agent-factory","repoPath":"gitwalter/cursor-agent-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-system-design","description":"Architecture patterns, technology selection, scalability planning, and vector DB selection for AI applications","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# AI System Design Skill\n\nDesign scalable AI systems with appropriate architecture patterns, technology selection, and infrastructure planning.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Designing new AI applications\n- Selecting frameworks (LangChain vs LangGraph vs CrewAI)\n- Choosing vector databases\n- Planning scalability and GPU allocation\n- Comparing LLM providers\n- Selecting embedding models\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install langchain langgraph crewai dspy\n# Vector DB clients\npip install pinecone-client qdran","body":"# AI System Design Skill\n\nDesign scalable AI systems with appropriate architecture patterns, technology selection, and infrastructure planning.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Designing new AI applications\n- Selecting frameworks (LangChain vs LangGraph vs CrewAI)\n- Choosing vector databases\n- Planning scalability and GPU allocation\n- Comparing LLM providers\n- Selecting embedding models\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\npip install langchain langgraph crewai dspy\n# Vector DB clients\npip install pinecone-client qdrant-client weaviate-client chromadb\n```\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Architecture Patterns\n\n```python\n# architecture_patterns.py\nfrom enum import Enum\nfrom typing import Dict, List\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\nclass ArchitecturePattern(Enum):\n    MONOLITH = \"monolith\"\n    MICROSERVICES = \"microservices\"\n    SERVERLESS = \"serverless\"\n    EDGE = \"edge\"\n\n@dataclass\nclass ArchitectureDecision:\n    pattern: ArchitecturePattern\n    use_cases: List[str]\n    pros: List[str]\n    cons: List[str]\n    best_for: str\n\nARCHITECTURE_GUIDE = {\n    ArchitecturePattern.MONOLITH: ArchitectureDecision(\n        pattern=ArchitecturePattern.MONOLITH,\n        use_cases=[\n            \"Small to medium applications\",\n            \"Rapid prototyping\",\n            \"Single team ownership\",\n        ],\n        pros=[\n            \"Simpler deployment\",\n            \"Easier debugging\",\n            \"Lower operational overhead\",\n        ],\n        cons=[\n            \"Harder to scale components independently\",\n            \"Tight coupling\",\n            \"Single point of failure\",\n        ],\n        best_for=\"Applications with < 10K requests/day\",\n    ),\n    ArchitecturePattern.MICROSERVICES: ArchitectureDecision(\n        pattern=ArchitecturePattern.MICROSERVICES,\n        use_cases=[\n            \"Large-scale applications\",\n            \"Multiple teams\",\n            \"Independent scaling needs\",\n        ],\n        pros=[\n            \"Independent scaling\",\n            \"Technology diversity\",\n            \"Fault isolation\",\n        ],\n        cons=[\n            \"Complex deployment\",\n            \"Network latency\",\n            \"Distributed debugging\",\n        ],\n        best_for=\"Applications with > 100K requests/day\",\n    ),\n    ArchitecturePattern.SERVERLESS: ArchitectureDecision(\n        pattern=ArchitecturePattern.SERVERLESS,\n        use_cases=[\n            \"Event-driven workloads\",\n            \"Variable traffic\",\n            \"Cost optimization\",\n        ],\n        pros=[\n            \"Auto-scaling\",\n            \"Pay-per-use\",\n            \"No infrastructure management\",\n        ],\n        cons=[\n            \"Cold start latency\",\n            \"Vendor lock-in\",\n            \"Limited execution time\",\n        ],\n        best_for=\"Sporadic or event-driven workloads\",\n    ),\n}\n\ndef select_architecture(\n    expected_traffic: int,\n    team_size: int,\n    latency_requirement_ms: int,\n) -> ArchitecturePattern:\n    \"\"\"Select architecture pattern based on requirements.\"\"\"\n    \n    if expected_traffic < 10000 and team_size < 5:\n        return ArchitecturePattern.MONOLITH\n    elif latency_requirement_ms < 100:\n        return ArchitecturePattern.EDGE\n    elif expected_traffic > 100000:\n        return ArchitecturePattern.MICROSERVICES\n    else:\n        return ArchitecturePattern.SERVERLESS\n```\n\n### Step 2: Technology Selection Framework\n\n```python\n# technology_selection.py\nfrom enum import Enum\nfrom typing import Dict, List\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\nclass FrameworkType(Enum):\n    LANGCHAIN = \"langchain\"\n    LANGGRAPH = \"langgraph\"\n    CREWAI = \"crewai\"\n    DSPY = \"dspy\"\n    CUSTOM = \"custom\"\n\n@dataclass\nclass FrameworkComparison:\n    name: str\n    best_for: List[str]\n    strengths: List[str]\n    weaknesses: List[str]\n    complexity: str  # \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"\n\nFRAMEWORK_GUIDE = {\n    FrameworkType.LANGCHAIN: FrameworkComparison(\n        name=\"LangChain\",\n        best_for=[\n            \"RAG applications\",\n            \"Tool-using agents\",\n            \"Chain composition\",\n            \"Integration with many providers\",\n        ],\n        strengths=[\n            \"Large ecosystem\",\n            \"Many integrations\",\n            \"Good documentation\",\n            \"Flexible\",\n        ],\n        weaknesses=[\n            \"Can be verbose\",\n            \"Steeper learning curve\",\n            \"Less opinionated\",\n        ],\n        complexity=\"medium\",\n    ),\n    FrameworkType.LANGGRAPH: FrameworkComparison(\n        name=\"LangGraph\",\n        best_for=[\n            \"Stateful agents\",\n            \"Complex workflows\",\n            \"Multi-step reasoning\",\n            \"Agentic loops\",\n        ],\n        strengths=[\n            \"State management\",\n            \"Cycles and loops\",\n            \"Checkpointing\",\n            \"Visualization\",\n        ],\n        weaknesses=[\n            \"Newer framework\",\n            \"Smaller community\",\n            \"Requires LangChain knowledge\",\n        ],\n        complexity=\"medium-high\",\n    ),\n    FrameworkType.CREWAI: FrameworkComparison(\n        name=\"CrewAI\",\n        best_for=[\n            \"Multi-agent systems\",\n            \"Collaborative agents\",\n            \"Role-based agents\",\n            \"Workflow orchestration\",\n        ],\n        strengths=[\n            \"Agent collaboration\",\n            \"Role definitions\",\n            \"Task delegation\",\n            \"Built-in planning\",\n        ],\n        weaknesses=[\n            \"Less flexible\",\n            \"Opinionated structure\",\n            \"Smaller ecosystem\",\n        ],\n        complexity=\"low-medium\",\n    ),\n    FrameworkType.DSPY: FrameworkComparison(\n        name=\"DSPy\",\n        best_for=[\n            \"Prompt optimization\",\n            \"Systematic prompt engineering\",\n            \"Research applications\",\n            \"Optimization-focused workflows\",\n        ],\n        strengths=[\n            \"Prompt optimization\",\n            \"Systematic approach\",\n            \"Research-oriented\",\n            \"Composable modules\",\n        ],\n        weaknesses=[\n            \"Steeper learning curve\",\n            \"Smaller community\",\n            \"Less production-ready\",\n        ],\n        complexity=\"high\",\n    ),\n}\n\ndef select_framework(\n    use_case: str,\n    needs_state_management: bool,\n    needs_multi_agent: bool,\n    needs_optimization: bool,\n) -> FrameworkType:\n    \"\"\"Select framework based on requirements.\"\"\"\n    \n    if needs_multi_agent and not needs_state_management:\n        return FrameworkType.CREWAI\n    elif needs_state_management or needs_optimization:\n        if needs_optimization:\n            return FrameworkType.DSPY\n        else:\n            return FrameworkType.LANGGRAPH\n    else:\n        return FrameworkType.LANGCHAIN\n```\n\n### Step 3: Vector Database Selection Guide\n\n```python\n# vector_db_selection.py\nfrom enum import Enum\nfrom typing import Dict, List\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\nclass VectorDB(Enum):\n    PINECONE = \"pinecone\"\n    QDRANT = \"qdrant\"\n    WEAVIATE = \"weaviate\"\n    CHROMADB = \"chromadb\"\n    MILVUS = \"milvus\"\n\n@dataclass\nclass VectorDBComparison:\n    name: str\n    deployment: str  # \"managed\", \"self-hosted\", \"both\"\n    scalability: str  # \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"\n    cost: str  # \"free\", \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"\n    features: List[str]\n    best_for: str\n\nVECTOR_DB_GUIDE = {\n    VectorDB.PINECONE: VectorDBComparison(\n        name=\"Pinecone\",\n        deployment=\"managed\",\n        scalability=\"high\",\n        cost=\"medium-high\",\n        features=[\n            \"Fully managed\",\n            \"High performance\",\n            \"Easy to use\",\n            \"Serverless option\",\n        ],\n        best_for=\"Production applications needing reliability\",\n    ),\n    VectorDB.QDRANT: VectorDBComparison(\n        name=\"Qdrant\",\n        deployment=\"both\",\n        scalability=\"high\",\n        cost=\"low-medium\",\n        features=[\n            \"Self-hostable\",\n            \"High performance\",\n            \"Filtering support\",\n            \"Docker deployment\",\n        ],\n        best_for=\"Self-hosted production deployments\",\n    ),\n    VectorDB.WEAVIATE: VectorDBComparison(\n        name=\"Weaviate\",\n        deployment=\"both\",\n        scalability=\"high\",\n        cost=\"low-medium\",\n        features=[\n            \"GraphQL API\",\n            \"Hybrid search\",\n            \"Multi-tenancy\",\n            \"Built-in ML models\",\n        ],\n        best_for=\"Applications needing hybrid search\",\n    ),\n    VectorDB.CHROMADB: VectorDBComparison(\n        name=\"ChromaDB\",\n        deployment=\"both\",\n        scalability=\"medium\",\n        cost=\"free\",\n        features=[\n            \"Easy to use\",\n            \"Embedding functions\",\n            \"Local-first\",\n            \"Python-native\",\n        ],\n        best_for=\"Development and small-scale production\",\n    ),\n    VectorDB.MILVUS: VectorDBComparison(\n        name=\"Milvus\",\n        deployment=\"self-hosted\",\n        scalability=\"very-high\",\n        cost=\"low\",\n        features=[\n            \"Distributed\",\n            \"High throughput\",\n            \"Advanced indexing\",\n            \"Kubernetes-native\",\n        ],\n        best_for=\"Large-scale self-hosted deployments\",\n    ),\n}\n\ndef select_vector_db(\n    scale: str,  # \"small\", \"medium\", \"large\"\n    budget: str,  # \"free\", \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"\n    managed_preference: bool,\n) -> VectorDB:\n    \"\"\"Select vector database based on requirements.\"\"\"\n    \n    if budget == \"free\" or scale == \"small\":\n        return VectorDB.CHROMADB\n    elif managed_preference and budget != \"free\":\n        return VectorDB.PINECONE\n    elif scale == \"large\" and not managed_preference:\n        return VectorDB.MILVUS\n    elif managed_preference:\n        return VectorDB.WEAVIATE\n    else:\n        return VectorDB.QDRANT\n```\n\n### Step 4: LLM Provider Comparison Framework\n\n```python\n# llm_provider_comparison.py\nfrom enum import Enum\nfrom typing import Dict, List\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\nclass LLMProvider(Enum):\n    OPENAI = \"openai\"\n    ANTHROPIC = \"anthropic\"\n    GOOGLE = \"google\"\n    MISTRAL = \"mistral\"\n    COHERE = \"cohere\"\n    OPEN_SOURCE = \"open_source\"\n\n@dataclass\nclass ProviderComparison:\n    name: str\n    models: List[str]\n    strengths: List[str]\n    weaknesses: List[str]\n    cost_tier: str  # \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"\n    best_for: str\n\nPROVIDER_GUIDE = {\n    LLMProvider.OPENAI: ProviderComparison(\n        name=\"OpenAI\",\n        models=[\"gpt-4\", \"gpt-4-turbo\", \"gpt-3.5-turbo\"],\n        strengths=[\n            \"Best performance\",\n            \"Large context windows\",\n            \"Function calling\",\n            \"Wide adoption\",\n        ],\n        weaknesses=[\n            \"Higher cost\",\n            \"Rate limits\",\n            \"API dependency\",\n        ],\n        cost_tier=\"high\",\n        best_for=\"Applications needing best quality\",\n    ),\n    LLMProvider.ANTHROPIC: ProviderComparison(\n        name=\"Anthropic\",\n        models=[\"claude-3-opus\", \"claude-3-sonnet\", \"claude-3-haiku\"],\n        strengths=[\n            \"Long context (200K tokens)\",\n            \"Safety-focused\",\n            \"Good reasoning\",\n            \"Constitutional AI\",\n        ],\n        weaknesses=[\n            \"Higher cost\",\n            \"Smaller ecosystem\",\n            \"Fewer integrations\",\n        ],\n        cost_tier=\"high\",\n        best_for=\"Long-context and safety-critical applications\",\n    ),\n    LLMProvider.GOOGLE: ProviderComparison(\n        name=\"Google\",\n        models=[\"gemini-pro\", \"gemini-ultra\"],\n        strengths=[\n            \"Multimodal\",\n            \"Good performance\",\n            \"Competitive pricing\",\n            \"Google Cloud integration\",\n        ],\n        weaknesses=[\n            \"Newer API\",\n            \"Less mature\",\n            \"Fewer examples\",\n        ],\n        cost_tier=\"medium\",\n        best_for=\"Multimodal and Google Cloud users\",\n    ),\n    LLMProvider.MISTRAL: ProviderComparison(\n        name=\"Mistral AI\",\n        models=[\"mistral-large\", \"mistral-medium\", \"mistral-small\"],\n        strengths=[\n            \"Good performance\",\n            \"Competitive pricing\",\n            \"Open source models\",\n            \"European company\",\n        ],\n        weaknesses=[\n            \"Smaller community\",\n            \"Fewer integrations\",\n            \"Less documentation\",\n        ],\n        cost_tier=\"medium\",\n        best_for=\"Cost-conscious applications\",\n    ),\n    LLMProvider.OPEN_SOURCE: ProviderComparison(\n        name=\"Open Source\",\n        models=[\"Llama 2\", \"Mistral 7B\", \"Mixtral\"],\n        strengths=[\n            \"No API costs\",\n            \"Full control\",\n            \"Privacy\",\n            \"Customizable\",\n        ],\n        weaknesses=[\n            \"Infrastructure costs\",\n            \"Lower performance\",\n            \"More maintenance\",\n        ],\n        cost_tier=\"low\",\n        best_for=\"Privacy-sensitive and high-volume applications\",\n    ),\n}\n\ndef select_provider(\n    quality_requirement: str,  # \"high\", \"medium\", \"low\"\n    budget: str,  # \"high\", \"medium\", \"low\"\n    privacy_requirement: bool,\n    volume: str,  # \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"\n) -> LLMProvider:\n    \"\"\"Select LLM provider based on requirements.\"\"\"\n    \n    if privacy_requirement or volume == \"high\":\n        return LLMProvider.OPEN_SOURCE\n    elif quality_requirement == \"high\" and budget != \"low\":\n        return LLMProvider.OPENAI\n    elif budget == \"low\":\n        return LLMProvider.MISTRAL\n    else:\n        return LLMProvider.ANTHROPIC\n```\n\n### Step 5: Embedding Model Selection\n\n```python\n# embedding_selection.py\nfrom enum import Enum\nfrom typing import Dict\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\nclass EmbeddingModel(Enum):\n    OPENAI_ADA = \"text-embedding-ada-002\"\n    OPENAI_3_SMALL = \"text-embedding-3-small\"\n    OPENAI_3_LARGE = \"text-embedding-3-large\"\n    COHERE_V3 = \"cohere-v3\"\n    SENTENCE_TRANSFORMERS = \"sentence-transformers\"\n\n@dataclass\nclass EmbeddingComparison:\n    name: str\n    dimensions: int\n    cost_per_1M_tokens: float\n    quality: str  # \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"\n    best_for: str\n\nEMBEDDING_GUIDE = {\n    EmbeddingModel.OPENAI_ADA: EmbeddingComparison(\n        name=\"OpenAI Ada-002\",\n        dimensions=1536,\n        cost_per_1M_tokens=0.10,\n        quality=\"high\",\n        best_for=\"General-purpose embeddings\",\n    ),\n    EmbeddingModel.OPENAI_3_SMALL: EmbeddingComparison(\n        name=\"OpenAI 3 Small\",\n        dimensions=1536,\n        cost_per_1M_tokens=0.02,\n        quality=\"high\",\n        best_for=\"Cost-effective high-quality embeddings\",\n    ),\n    EmbeddingModel.OPENAI_3_LARGE: EmbeddingComparison(\n        name=\"OpenAI 3 Large\",\n        dimensions=3072,\n        cost_per_1M_tokens=0.13,\n        quality=\"very-high\",\n        best_for=\"Applications needing best quality\",\n    ),\n    EmbeddingModel.COHERE_V3: EmbeddingComparison(\n        name=\"Cohere v3\",\n        dimensions=1024,\n        cost_per_1M_tokens=0.10,\n        quality=\"high\",\n        best_for=\"Multilingual applications\",\n    ),\n    EmbeddingModel.SENTENCE_TRANSFORMERS: EmbeddingComparison(\n        name=\"Sentence Transformers\",\n        dimensions=384,\n        cost_per_1M_tokens=0.0,  # Free\n        quality=\"medium-high\",\n        best_for=\"Self-hosted and cost-sensitive applications\",\n    ),\n}\n\ndef select_embedding_model(\n    budget: str,\n    quality_requirement: str,\n    self_hosted: bool,\n) -> EmbeddingModel:\n    \"\"\"Select embedding model.\"\"\"\n    \n    if self_hosted:\n        return EmbeddingModel.SENTENCE_TRANSFORMERS\n    elif budget == \"low\":\n        return EmbeddingModel.OPENAI_3_SMALL\n    elif quality_requirement == \"very-high\":\n        return EmbeddingModel.OPENAI_3_LARGE\n    else:\n        return EmbeddingModel.OPENAI_ADA\n```\n\n### Step 6: Scalability Planning\n\n```python\n# scalability_planning.py\nfrom typing import Dict\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass\nclass ScalabilityPlan:\n    horizontal_scaling: bool\n    vertical_scaling: bool\n    gpu_allocation: str\n    caching_strategy: str\n    load_balancing: bool\n\ndef plan_scalability(\n    expected_rps: int,  # Requests per second\n    avg_latency_ms: int,\n    gpu_available: bool,\n) -> ScalabilityPlan:\n    \"\"\"Plan scalability strategy.\"\"\"\n    \n    # Calculate required capacity\n    required_capacity = expected_rps * (avg_latency_ms / 1000)\n    \n    if required_capacity < 10:\n        # Low traffic: vertical scaling\n        return ScalabilityPlan(\n            horizontal_scaling=False,\n            vertical_scaling=True,\n            gpu_allocation=\"single\",\n            caching_strategy=\"in-memory\",\n            load_balancing=False,\n        )\n    elif required_capacity < 100:\n        # Medium traffic: horizontal with caching\n        return ScalabilityPlan(\n            horizontal_scaling=True,\n            vertical_scaling=False,\n            gpu_allocation=\"distributed\",\n            caching_strategy=\"redis\",\n            load_balancing=True,\n        )\n    else:\n        # High traffic: full horizontal scaling\n        return ScalabilityPlan(\n            horizontal_scaling=True,\n            vertical_scaling=False,\n            gpu_allocation=\"kubernetes\",\n            caching_strategy=\"distributed-cache\",\n            load_balancing=True,\n        )\n```\n\n### Step 7: Sync vs Async Decision Tree\n\n```python\n# sync_async_design.py\nfrom enum import Enum\nfrom typing import Dict\n\nclass RequestPattern(Enum):\n    SYNC = \"synchronous\"\n    ASYNC = \"asynchronous\"\n    HYBRID = \"hybrid\"\n\ndef select_request_pattern(\n    latency_requirement_ms: int,\n    user_waiting: bool,\n    batch_processing: bool,\n) -> RequestPattern:\n    \"\"\"Select sync vs async pattern.\"\"\"\n    \n    if latency_requirement_ms < 1000 and user_waiting:\n        return RequestPattern.SYNC\n    elif batch_processing or not user_waiting:\n        return RequestPattern.ASYNC\n    else:\n        return RequestPattern.HYBRID\n\n# Async implementation example\nimport asyncio\nfrom typing import List\n\nasync def process_batch_async(requests: List[str]):\n    \"\"\"Process batch asynchronously.\"\"\"\n    tasks = [process_single(req) for req in requests]\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks)\n    return results\n```\n\n## Output\n\n- Architecture decision document\n- Technology stack selection\n- Vector database recommendation\n- LLM provider comparison\n- Scalability plan\n- Implementation roadmap\n\n## Decision Trees\n\n### Framework Selection\n```\nNeed multi-agent? → Yes → CrewAI\n                    ↓ No\nNeed state management? → Yes → LangGraph\n                    ↓ No\nNeed optimization? → Yes → DSPy\n                    ↓ No\n→ LangChain\n```\n\n### Vector DB Selection\n```\nBudget = Free? → Yes → ChromaDB\n            ↓ No\nNeed managed? → Yes → Pinecone\n            ↓ No\nScale > 1M vectors? → Yes → Milvus\n                    ↓ No\n→ Qdrant\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Start with monolith, evolve to microservices\n- Use LangChain for most applications\n- Choose managed vector DBs for production\n- Consider cost vs quality trade-offs\n- Plan for horizontal scaling from start\n- Use async for batch processing\n- Cache aggressively\n- Monitor and optimize continuously\n\n## Related\n\n- Skill: `ai-cost-optimization`\n- Skill: `ai-security`\n- Skill: `model-serving`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:24:36.176Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Architecture Agents requiring advanced system design capabilities for scalable AI applications","zh":"适用于需要高级系统设计能力的AI架构代理，以实现可扩展的AI应用","ja":"スケーラブルなAIアプリケーションを実現するために、高度なシステム設計能力が必要なAIアーキテクチャエージェントに適しています","ko":"확장 가능한 AI 애플리케이션을 구현하기 위해 고급 시스템設計 능력이 필요한 AI 아키텍처 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de arquitectura de IA que requieren capacidades de diseño de sistema avanzadas para aplicaciones de IA escalables","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''architecture d''IA nécessitant des capacités de conception de système avancées pour des applications d''IA évolutives","de":"Ideal für AI-Architektur-Agents, die erweiterte Systemdesign-Fähigkeiten für skalierbare AI-Anwendungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitetura de IA que requerem capacidades avançadas de design de sistema para aplicações de IA escaláveis","ru":"Идеально для агентов архитектуры ИИ, требующих продвинутых возможностей проектирования системы для масштабируемых приложений ИИ","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء معمارية الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تصميم نظام متقدمة لتطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي القابلة للتوسيع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design scalable AI systems with appropriate architecture patterns, selecting frameworks like LangChain, LangGraph, or CrewAI, and planning infrastructure with vector databases and GPU allocation, while comparing LLM providers and selecting embedding models","zh":"赋予代理设计可扩展的AI系统的能力，选择合适的架构模式，例如LangChain、LangGraph或CrewAI，并规划基础设施，包括向量数据库和GPU分配，同时比较LLM提供商并选择嵌入模型","ja":"エージェントにスケーラブルなAIシステムを設計する能力を付与し、適切なアーキテクチャパターンを選択します。たとえば、LangChain、LangGraph、またはCrewAIなど。また、インフラストラクチャを計画し、ベクトルデータベースやGPU割り当てを実施しながら、LLM提供者を比較し、埋め込みモデルを選択します","ko":"에이전트가 확장 가능한 AI 시스템을 설계할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 적절한 아키텍처 패턴을 선택합니다. 예를 들어, LangChain, LangGraph 또는 CrewAI와 같은 프레임워크를 선택하고, 벡터 데이터베이스 및 GPU 할당과 같은 인프라를 계획하면서 LLM 제공업체를 비교하고埋め込み 모델을 선택합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar sistemas de IA escalables con patrones de arquitectura adecuados, seleccionando marcos como LangChain, LangGraph o CrewAI, y planificando la infraestructura con bases de datos vectoriales y asignación de GPU, mientras compara proveedores de LLM y selecciona modelos de incrustación","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des systèmes d''IA évolutifs avec des modèles d''architecture appropriés, en sélectionnant des frameworks comme LangChain, LangGraph ou CrewAI, et en planifiant l''infrastructure avec des bases de données vectorielles et une allocation de GPU, tout en comparant les fournisseurs de LLM et en sélectionnant des modèles d''intégration","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, skalierbare AI-Systeme mit geeigneten Architekturmuster zu entwerfen, indem Frameworks wie LangChain, LangGraph oder CrewAI ausgewählt, die Infrastruktur mit Vektor-Datenbanken und GPU-Zuweisung geplant und LLM-Anbieter verglichen sowie Einbettungsmodelle ausgewählt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar sistemas de IA escaláveis com padrões de arquitetura apropriados, selecionando estruturas como LangChain, LangGraph ou CrewAI, e planejando infraestrutura com bancos de dados vetoriais e alocação de GPU, enquanto compara provedores de LLM e seleciona modelos de incorporação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать масштабируемые системы ИИ с соответствующими шаблонами архитектуры, выбирая фреймворки типа LangChain, LangGraph или CrewAI, и планируя инфраструктуру с векторными базами данных и распределением GPU, а также сравнивая поставщиков LLM и выбирая модели вложения","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم أنظمة ذكاء اصطناعي قابلة للتوسيع باستخدام أنماط معمارية مناسبة ، واختيار إطارات مثل LangChain و LangGraph أو CrewAI ، وتنظيم البنية التحتية مع قواعد بيانات متجهة وتخصيص وحدة معالجة الرسومات ، في حين يقارن بين مزودي LLM ويتصفح نماذج التضمين"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new AI applications with blueprints for SAP, Python, and Cloud-Native tech stacks","Refactoring existing projects for improved scalability and performance","Comparing and selecting optimal LLM providers and embedding models for specific use cases"],"zh":["使用SAP、Python和Cloud-Native技术栈的蓝图设计新的AI应用","重构现有的项目以提高可扩展性和性能","比较和选择最适合特定用例的LLM提供商和嵌入模型"],"ja":["SAP、Python、Cloud-Nativeテクノロジースタックのブループリントを使用して新しいAIアプリケーションを設計する","スケーラビリティとパフォーマンスを向上させるために既存のプロジェクトをリファクタリングする","特定のユースケースに最も適したLLM提供者と埋め込みモデルを比較して選択する"],"ko":["SAP, Python 및 Cloud-Native 기술 스택의 청사진을 사용하여 새로운 AI 애플리케이션을 설계합니다","확장성과 성능을 개선하기 위해 기존 프로젝트를 리팩토링합니다","특정 사용 사례에 가장 적합한 LLM 제공업체 및 내장 모델을 비교 및 선택합니다"],"es":["Diseñar nuevas aplicaciones de IA con planos para pilas de tecnología SAP, Python y Cloud-Native","Reorganizar proyectos existentes para mejorar la escalabilidad y el rendimiento","Comparar y seleccionar proveedores de LLM y modelos de incrustación óptimos para casos de uso específicos"],"fr":["Concevoir de nouvelles applications d''IA avec des plans pour des piles de technologie SAP, Python et Cloud-Native","Réorganiser des projets existants pour améliorer l''évolutivité et les performances","Comparer et sélectionner des fournisseurs de LLM et des modèles d''intégration optimaux pour des cas d''utilisation spécifiques"],"de":["Neue AI-Anwendungen mit Plänen für SAP-, Python- und Cloud-Native-Technologie-Stacks entwerfen","Bestehende Projekte für verbesserte Skalierbarkeit und Leistung neu organisieren","LLM-Anbieter und Einbettungsmodelle für spezifische Anwendungsfälle vergleichen und optimal auswählen"],"pt":["Projetar novas aplicações de IA com plantas para pilhas de tecnologia SAP, Python e Cloud-Native","Reestruturar projetos existentes para melhorar a escalabilidade e o desempenho","Comparar e selecionar provedores de LLM e modelos de incorporação ótimos para casos de uso específicos"],"ru":["Проектировать новые приложения ИИ с планами для стеков технологий SAP, Python и Cloud-Native","Перестраивать существующие проекты для улучшения масштабируемости и производительности","Сравнивать и выбирать оптимальных поставщиков LLM и модели вложения для конкретных случаев использования"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي جديدة مع خطط لتهيئة تكنولوجيا SAP و Python و Cloud-Native","إعادة هيكلة المشاريع الحالية لتحسين القدرة على التوسع والأداء","مقارنة واختيار مزودي LLM ونماذج التضمين المثالية لحالات استخدام محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of specific libraries including langchain, langgraph, crewai, and dspy","Dependent on vector database clients like pinecone-client and qdran","May require additional setup for GPU allocation and infrastructure planning"],"zh":["需要安装特定的库，包括langchain、langgraph、crewai和dspy","依赖于向量数据库客户端，如pinecone-client和qdran","可能需要额外的设置以进行GPU分配和基础设施规划"],"ja":["特定ライブラリ（langchain、langgraph、crewai、dspyなど）のインストールが必要","ベクトルデータベースクライアント（pinecone-client、qdranなど）に依存","GPU割り当てやインフラストラクチャ計画のために追加の設定が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["특정 라이브러리(langchain, langgraph, crewai, dspy 등)의 설치가 필요합니다","벡터 데이터베이스 클라이언트(pinecone-client, qdran 등)에 의존합니다","GPU 할당 또는 인프라 계획을 위해 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de bibliotecas específicas, incluyendo langchain, langgraph, crewai y dspy","Dependiente de clientes de bases de datos vectoriales como pinecone-client y qdran","Puede requerir una configuración adicional para la asignación de GPU y la planificación de la infraestructura"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de bibliothèques spécifiques, notamment langchain, langgraph, crewai et dspy","Dépendante de clients de bases de données vectorielles tels que pinecone-client et qdran","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour l''allocation de GPU et la planification de l''infrastructure"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation spezifischer Bibliotheken, einschließlich langchain, langgraph, crewai und dspy","Abhängig von Vektor-Datenbank-Clients wie pinecone-client und qdran","Kann eine zusätzliche Konfiguration für die GPU-Zuweisung und die Infrastrukturplanung erfordern"],"pt":["Requer a instalação de bibliotecas específicas, incluindo langchain, langgraph, crewai e dspy","Dependente de clientes de bancos de dados vetoriais como pinecone-client e qdran","Pode requerer configuração adicional para alocação de GPU e planejamento de infraestrutura"],"ru":["Требует установки специальных библиотек, включая langchain, langgraph, crewai и dspy","Зависит от клиентов векторных баз данных, таких как pinecone-client и qdran","Может требовать дополнительной настройки для распределения GPU и планирования инфраструктуры"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت مكتبات محددة ، بما في ذلك langchain و langgraph و crewai و dspy","يعتمد على عملاء قواعد 