eficiente","Soporte para rutas dinámicas","Integración con API routes","Compatibilidad con archivos especiales como _app.tsx y _document.tsx"],"fr":["Architecture propre et simple","Création de pages web efficace","Prise en charge des routes dynamiques","Intégration avec les routes API","Compatibilité avec les fichiers spéciaux tels que _app.tsx et _document.tsx"],"de":["Saubere und einfache Architektur","Effiziente Erstellung von Webseiten","Unterstützung für dynamische Routen","Integration mit API-Routen","Kompatibilität mit speziellen Dateien wie _app.tsx und _document.tsx"],"pt":["Criação de páginas personalizadas","Rotas dinâmicas","Endpoints de API","Arquitetura limpa e escalável","Integração com o Next.js"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских страниц","Динамические маршруты","Конечные точки API","Чистая и масштабируемая архитектура","Интеграция с Next.js"],"ar":["إنشاء صفحات مخصصة","مسارات ديناميكية","نقاط نهاية API","هندسة نظيفة وقابلة للتطوير","التكامل مع Next.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","Pages 路由器","路由系统","Web 应用程序","快速构建","动态路由","API 路由"],"ja":["Next.js","Pages ルーター","ルーティングシステム","Web アプリケーション","迅速に構築","動的ルーティング","API ルーティング"],"ko":["Next.js","페이지 라우터","라우팅 시스템","웹 애플리케이션","빠르게 구축","동적 라우팅","API 라우팅"],"es":["Next.js","enrutador de páginas","arquitectura limpia","desarrollo web","rutas dinámicas","API routes","React","JavaScript"],"fr":["Next.js","routeur de pages","architecture propre","développement web","routes dynamiques","routes API","React","JavaScript"],"de":["Next.js","Seiten-Router","saubere Architektur","Web-Entwicklung","dynamische Routen","API-Routen","React","JavaScript"],"pt":["Next.js","Roteador de páginas","Desenvolvimento web","Aplicações web escaláveis","Arquitetura limpa","Rotas personalizadas"],"ru":["Next.js","Маршрутизатор страниц","Веб-разработка","Масштабируемые веб-приложения","Чистая архитектура","Пользовательские маршруты"],"ar":["Next.js","موجه الصفحات","تطوير الويب","تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتطوير","هندسة نظيفة","مسارات مخصصة"]}},"owner":"jorggerojas","repo":"next-skeleton-page","repoPath":"jorggerojas/next-skeleton-page","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pages-router","description":"Work with Next.js Pages Router pages in src/pages/. Use when creating or modifying pages, working with _app.tsx, _document.tsx, or any page components in the Pages Router structure.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Pages Router\n\n## Structure\n\nThis project uses **Pages Router** exclusively. All pages go in `src/pages/`.\n\n- Regular pages: `src/pages/[filename].tsx` → `/filename` route\n- Dynamic routes: `src/pages/[id]/page.tsx` → `/[id]` route\n- API routes: `src/pages/api/[route].ts` → `/api/[route]` endpoint\n- Special files: `_app.tsx`, `_document.tsx` in `src/pages/`\n\n## Creating Pages\n\n### Basic Page\n\n```tsx\n// src/pages/about.tsx\nexport default function About() {\n  return <div>About page</div>;","body":"# Next.js Pages Router\n\n## Structure\n\nThis project uses **Pages Router** exclusively. All pages go in `src/pages/`.\n\n- Regular pages: `src/pages/[filename].tsx` → `/filename` route\n- Dynamic routes: `src/pages/[id]/page.tsx` → `/[id]` route\n- API routes: `src/pages/api/[route].ts` → `/api/[route]` endpoint\n- Special files: `_app.tsx`, `_document.tsx` in `src/pages/`\n\n## Creating Pages\n\n### Basic Page\n\n```tsx\n// src/pages/about.tsx\nexport default function About() {\n  return <div>About page</div>;\n}\n```\n\n### Dynamic Route\n\n```tsx\n// src/pages/users/[id].tsx\nimport { useRouter } from ''next/router'';\n\nexport default function User() {\n  const router = useRouter();\n  const { id } = router.query;\n  \n  return <div>User {id}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n### Nested Dynamic Route\n\n```tsx\n// src/pages/posts/[id]/[slug].tsx\nimport { useRouter } from ''next/router'';\n\nexport default function Post() {\n  const router = useRouter();\n  const { id, slug } = router.query;\n  \n  return <div>Post {id} - {slug}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n## Special Files\n\n### _app.tsx\n\nWraps all pages. Use for:\n\n- Global providers\n- Global styles\n- Layout components\n- Page-level state\n\n```tsx\n// src/pages/_app.tsx\nimport \"@/styles/globals.css\";\nimport type { AppProps } from \"next/app\";\n\nexport default function App({ Component, pageProps }: AppProps) {\n  return <Component {...pageProps} />;\n}\n```\n\n### _document.tsx\n\nCustomizes HTML document. Use for:\n\n- `<html>` and `<body>` attributes\n- Custom fonts\n- Analytics scripts\n- Meta tags\n\n```tsx\n// src/pages/_document.tsx\nimport { Html, Head, Main, NextScript } from \"next/document\";\n\nexport default function Document() {\n  return (\n    <Html lang=\"en\">\n      <Head />\n      <body className=\"antialiased\">\n        <Main />\n        <NextScript />\n      </body>\n    </Html>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Data Fetching\n\n**CRITICAL**: Only pages handle server-side data fetching. Components, hooks, or other files should NOT make server calls directly. All data fetching happens in the page file using `getServerSideProps`, `getStaticProps`, or `getStaticPaths`.\n\n### getServerSideProps\n\nThe page component goes first, then the data fetching function. **The page component''s Props type MUST be inferred from `getServerSideProps` using `InferGetServerSidePropsType`.**\n\n```tsx\n// src/pages/posts/[id].tsx\nimport type { GetServerSideProps, InferGetServerSidePropsType } from \"next\";\nimport { PageLayout } from \"@/components\";\n\nexport const getServerSideProps: GetServerSideProps = async (context) => {\n  const { id } = context.params!;\n  const res = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/posts/${id}`);\n  const post = await res.json();\n  \n  return {\n    props: { post },\n  };\n};\n\n// Type MUST be inferred from getServerSideProps\nexport default function Post({ post }: InferGetServerSidePropsType<typeof getServerSideProps>) {\n  return (\n    <PageLayout\n      title={post.title}\n      description={post.content}\n      canonical={`/posts/${post.id}`}\n    >\n      <div>\n        <h1>{post.title}</h1>\n        <p>{post.content}</p>\n      </div>\n    </PageLayout>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### getStaticProps\n\n**The page component''s Props type MUST be inferred from `getStaticProps` using `InferGetStaticPropsType`.**\n\n```tsx\n// src/pages/posts/[id].tsx\nimport type { GetStaticProps, GetStaticPaths, InferGetStaticPropsType } from \"next\";\nimport { PageLayout } from \"@/components\";\n\nexport const getStaticProps: GetStaticProps = async (context) => {\n  const { id } = context.params!;\n  const res = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/posts/${id}`);\n  const post = await res.json();\n  \n  return {\n    props: { post },\n    revalidate: 60, // ISR: revalidate every 60 seconds\n  };\n};\n\nexport const getStaticPaths: GetStaticPaths = async () => {\n  return {\n    paths: [{ params: { id: ''1'' } }, { params: { id: ''2'' } }],\n    fallback: ''blocking'', // or true, false\n  };\n};\n\n// Type MUST be inferred from getStaticProps\nexport default function Post({ post }: InferGetStaticPropsType<typeof getStaticProps>) {\n  return (\n    <PageLayout\n      title={post.title}\n      description={post.content}\n      canonical={`/posts/${post.id}`}\n    >\n      <div>\n        <h1>{post.title}</h1>\n        <p>{post.content}</p>\n      </div>\n    </PageLayout>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Type Inference\n\n**IMPORTANT**: The page component''s `Props` type **MUST** be inferred from `getServerSideProps` or `getStaticProps` using `InferGetServerSidePropsType` or `InferGetStaticPropsType`. Do not manually define the Props type.\n\n```tsx\nimport type { GetServerSideProps, InferGetServerSidePropsType } from \"next\";\n\nexport const getServerSideProps: GetServerSideProps = async () => {\n  return {\n    props: { post: { id: \"1\", title: \"Hello\" } },\n  };\n};\n\n// Type MUST be inferred from getServerSideProps\nexport default function Post({ post }: InferGetServerSidePropsType<typeof getServerSideProps>) {\n  return <div>{post.title}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n### Using Hooks in Pages\n\nPages can use custom hooks for client-side data fetching, mutations, or other client-side logic. Examples:\n\n```tsx\n// src/pages/users.tsx\nimport type { GetServerSideProps, InferGetServerSidePropsType } from \"next\";\nimport { useUsers } from \"@/hooks/users\";\n\nexport const getServerSideProps: GetServerSideProps = async () => {\n  return { props: { initialUsers: [] } };\n};\n\nexport default function UsersPage({ initialUsers }: InferGetServerSidePropsType<typeof getServerSideProps>) {\n  const { data: users, isLoading } = useUsers();\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {isLoading ? <p>Loading...</p> : <UserList users={users} />}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// src/pages/hotels/[id].tsx\nimport type { GetServerSideProps, InferGetServerSidePropsType } from \"next\";\nimport { useHotels } from \"@/hooks/hotels\";\n\nexport const getServerSideProps: GetServerSideProps = async (context) => {\n  const { id } = context.params!;\n  return { props: { hotelId: id } };\n};\n\nexport default function HotelPage({ hotelId }: InferGetServerSidePropsType<typeof getServerSideProps>) {\n  const { data: hotel } = useHotels.getById(hotelId);\n  const createMutation = useHotels.create();\n  \n  const handleCreate = () => {\n    createMutation.mutate({ name: \"New Hotel\" });\n  };\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      <h1>{hotel?.name}</h1>\n      <button onClick={handleCreate}>Create Hotel</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Note**: Server-side data fetching (API calls) should only happen in `getServerSideProps` or `getStaticProps`. Hooks like `useUsers()`, `useHotels()`, `useHotels.create()`, etc., are for client-side data fetching, mutations, or other client-side logic.\n\n## Client-Side Navigation\n\n```tsx\nimport Link from ''next/link'';\nimport { useRouter } from ''next/router'';\n\nexport default function Navigation() {\n  const router = useRouter();\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Link href=\"/about\">About</Link>\n      <button onClick={() => router.push(''/contact'')}>\n        Go to Contact\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## SEO with PageLayout\n\nUse the `PageLayout` component for SEO metadata (static or dynamic):\n\n```tsx\n// Static SEO\nimport { PageLayout } from \"@/components\";\n\nexport default function AboutPage() {\n  return (\n    <PageLayout\n      title=\"About Us\"\n      description=\"Learn more about our company\"\n      keywords=\"about, company, team\"\n      canonical=\"/about\"\n    >\n      <div>About content</div>\n    </PageLayout>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// Dynamic SEO from props\nimport type { GetServerSideProps, InferGetServerSidePropsType } from \"next\";\nimport { PageLayout } from \"@/components\";\n\nexport const getServerSideProps: GetServerSideProps = async () => {\n  return {\n    props: {\n      seo: {\n        title: \"Dynamic Page\",\n        description: \"Dynamic description\",\n      },\n    },\n  };\n};\n\nexport default function DynamicPage({ seo }: InferGetServerSidePropsType<typeof getServerSideProps>) {\n  return (\n    <PageLayout {...seo}>\n      <div>Content</div>\n    </PageLayout>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- **Always use Pages Router** - never App Router patterns\n- **Only pages handle server-side data fetching** - components, hooks, or other files should NOT make server calls\n- **Page Props type MUST be inferred** - use `InferGetServerSidePropsType<typeof getServerSideProps>` or `InferGetStaticPropsType<typeof getStaticProps>`\n- Pages are React components that export a default function\n- Data fetching functions (`getServerSideProps`, `getStaticProps`, `getStaticPaths`) go **after** the page component\n- Pages can use hooks like `useUsers()`, `useHotels()`, `useHotels.create()`, etc. for client-side data fetching and mutations\n- Use `PageLayout` component for SEO metadata (static or dynamic)\n- Use `useRouter` from `next/router` (not `next/navigation`)\n- Global styles go in `src/styles/globals.css` and imported in `_app.tsx`\n- TypeScript: Use `AppProps` from `next/app` for `_app.tsx`\n- The app includes `ErrorBoundary` and `QueryProvider` in `_app.tsx` - they wrap all pages automatically\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:25:01.311Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined Next.js page routing and API endpoint management.","zh":"非常适合需要简化 Next.js 页面路由和 API 端点管理的前端代理。","ja":"Next.js ページルーティングと API エンドポイント管理をストリームライン化する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Next.js 페이지 라우팅 및 API 엔드포인트 관리를 간소화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan enrutamiento de páginas de Next.js y administración de puntos de conexión de API optimizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend qui ont besoin d''un routage de pages Next.js et d''une gestion de points de terminaison d''API rationalisés.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes Next.js-Seiten-Routing und API-Endpunkt-Management benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de roteamento de páginas Next.js e gerenciamento de endpoints de API simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим упрощенный маршрутизационный сервис страниц Next.js и управление конечными точками API.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى توجيه صفحات Next.js ومدير نهاية نقطة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المُبسّط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create scalable and organized web applications using Next.js Pages Router, supporting dynamic routes, API routes, and special files like _app.tsx and _document.tsx, all within a clean architecture.","zh":"赋予代理创建可扩展且组织良好的 Web 应用程序的能力，使用 Next.js Pages Router 支持动态路由、API 路由和特殊文件，如 _app.tsx 和 _document.tsx，所有这些都在干净的架构中。","ja":"エージェントが、Next.js Pages Router を使用して動的ルーティング、API ルーティング、および _app.tsx や _document.tsx などの特別なファイルをサポートするスケーラブルで整理された Web アプリケーションを作成できるようにします。すべてがクリーンなアーキテクチャの中で。","ko":"에이전트가 Next.js Pages Router를 사용하여 동적 라우팅, API 라우팅 및 _app.tsx 및 _document.tsx와 같은 특수 파일을 지원하는 확장 가능하고 조직화된 웹 애플리케이션을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 모두 깨끗한 아키텍처 내에서.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones web escalables y organizadas utilizando el enrutador de páginas de Next.js, que admite rutas dinámicas, rutas de API y archivos especiales como _app.tsx y _document.tsx, todo dentro de una arquitectura limpia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications web évolutives et organisées en utilisant le routeur de pages Next.js, qui prend en charge les routes dynamiques, les routes d''API et les fichiers spéciaux comme _app.tsx et _document.tsx, le tout dans une architecture propre.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare und organisierte Webanwendungen mit dem Next.js-Seiten-Router zu erstellen, der dynamische Routen, API-Routen und spezielle Dateien wie _app.tsx und _document.tsx unterstützt, alles innerhalb einer sauberen Architektur.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem aplicações web escaláveis e organizadas usando o roteador de páginas do Next.js, que suporta rotas dinâmicas, rotas de API e arquivos especiais como _app.tsx e _document.tsx, tudo dentro de uma arquitetura limpa.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать масштабируемые и организованные веб-приложения, используя маршрутизатор страниц Next.js, поддерживающий динамические маршруты, маршруты API и специальные файлы, такие как _app.tsx и _document.tsx, все внутри чистой архитектуры.","ar":"تمكن العميل من إنشاء تطبيقات ويب منظمة وقابلة للتوسيع باستخدام مُوجّه صفحات Next.js، والذي يدعم المسارات الديناميكية ومسارات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات والملفات الخاصة مثل _app.tsx و _document.tsx، وكل ذلك داخل هيكل نظيف."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating dynamic routes for user profiles","Creating API endpoints for data fetching and manipulation","Organizing page structures for improved maintainability"],"zh":["为用户配置文件生成动态路由","创建 API 端点用于数据获取和操作","组织页面结构以提高可维护性"],"ja":["ユーザープロファイルの動的ルーティングを生成する","データの取得と操作のための API エンドポイントを作成する","メンテナンス性の向上のためのページ構造を整理する"],"ko":["사용자 프로필을 위한 동적 라우팅 생성","데이터 가져오기 및 조작을 위한 API 엔드포인트 생성","유지 보수성을 향상하기 위한 페이지 구조 조직"],"es":["Generación de rutas dinámicas para perfiles de usuario","Creación de puntos de conexión de API para la recuperación y manipulación de datos","Organización de estructuras de página para una mejor mantenibilidad"],"fr":["Génération de routes dynamiques pour les profils d''utilisateur","Création de points de terminaison d''API pour la récupération et la manipulation de données","Organisation des structures de page pour une meilleure maintenabilité"],"de":["Generierung dynamischer Routen für Benutzerprofile","Erstellung von API-Endpunkten für Datenabruf und -manipulation","Organisation von Seitenstrukturen für eine verbesserte Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Geração de rotas dinâmicas para perfis de usuário","Criação de endpoints de API para obtenção e manipulação de dados","Organização de estruturas de página para melhor manutenção"],"ru":["Генерация динамических маршрутов для профилей пользователей","Создание конечных точек API для получения и манипулирования данными","Организация структуры страниц для улучшения обслуживания"],"ar":["توليد مسارات ديناميكية لأوصاف المستخدم","إنشاء نقاط نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لاسترجاع وتنقيح البيانات","تنظيم هياكل الصفحة لتحسين الصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js framework","Exclusive use of Pages Router"],"zh":["需要 Next.js 框架","仅限 Pages Router 使用"],"ja":["Next.js フレームワークが必要","Pages Router のみを使用"],"ko":["Next.js 프레임워크 필요","Pages Router만 사용"],"es":["Requiere el marco de Next.js","Uso exclusivo del router de páginas"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Next.js","Utilisation exclusive du routeur de pages"],"de":["Benötigt das Next.js-Framework","Exklusiver Einsatz des Seiten-Router"],"pt":["Exige o framework Next.js","Uso exclusivo do Pages Router"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Next.js","Использует исключительно Pages Router"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Next.js","استخدام حصرية لموجّه الصفحات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
