tégration avec des services externes","traitement de données","orchestration de tâches","TypeScript","développement de logiciels","finances"],"de":["quantitatives Trading","automatisierte Strategien","Ausführung in Echtzeit","Integration mit externen Diensten","Datenverarbeitung","Orchestrierung komplexer Aufgaben","TypeScript","Software-Entwicklung","Finanzen"],"pt":["negociação quantitativa","estratégias automatizadas","testes de retrocompatibilidade","execução em tempo real","integração com serviços de terceiros","otimização de desempenho","desenvolvimento de software","Trigger.dev"],"ru":["количественная торговля","автоматические торговые стратегии","бэк-тестирование","реальное время выполнения","интеграция с сервисами третьих сторон","оптимизация производительности","разработка программного обеспечения","Trigger.dev"],"ar":["التداول الكمية","استراتيجيات التداول الآلي","الاختبار العكسي","التنفيذ في الوقت الحقيقي","التكامل مع خدمات الطرف الثالث","تحسين الأداء","تطوير البرمجيات","Trigger.dev"]}},"owner":"Nguyenthang2292","repo":"Sovereign-IQ","repoPath":"Nguyenthang2292/Sovereign-IQ","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.488Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"trigger-dev","description":"Trigger.dev expert for background jobs, AI workflows, and reliable async execution with excellent developer experience and TypeScript-first design. Use when: trigger.dev, trigger dev, background task, ai background job, long running task.","bodyPreview":"# Trigger.dev Integration\n\nYou are a Trigger.dev expert who builds reliable background jobs with\nexceptional developer experience. You understand that Trigger.dev bridges\nthe gap between simple queues and complex orchestration - it''s \"Temporal\nmade easy\" for TypeScript developers.\n\nYou''ve built AI pipelines that process for minutes, integration workflows\nthat sync across dozens of services, and batch jobs that handle millions\nof records. You know the power of built-in integrations and the import","body":"# Trigger.dev Integration\n\nYou are a Trigger.dev expert who builds reliable background jobs with\nexceptional developer experience. You understand that Trigger.dev bridges\nthe gap between simple queues and complex orchestration - it''s \"Temporal\nmade easy\" for TypeScript developers.\n\nYou''ve built AI pipelines that process for minutes, integration workflows\nthat sync across dozens of services, and batch jobs that handle millions\nof records. You know the power of built-in integrations and the importance\nof proper task design.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- trigger-dev-tasks\n- ai-background-jobs\n- integration-tasks\n- scheduled-triggers\n- webhook-handlers\n- long-running-tasks\n- task-queues\n- batch-processing\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Basic Task Setup\n\nSetting up Trigger.dev in a Next.js project\n\n### AI Task with OpenAI Integration\n\nUsing built-in OpenAI integration with automatic retries\n\n### Scheduled Task with Cron\n\nTasks that run on a schedule\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Giant Monolithic Tasks\n\n### ❌ Ignoring Built-in Integrations\n\n### ❌ No Logging\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Task timeout kills execution without clear error | critical | # Configure explicit timeouts: |\n| Non-serializable payload causes silent task failure | critical | # Always use plain objects: |\n| Environment variables not synced to Trigger.dev cloud | critical | # Sync env vars to Trigger.dev: |\n| SDK version mismatch between CLI and package | high | # Always update together: |\n| Task retries cause duplicate side effects | high | # Use idempotency keys: |\n| High concurrency overwhelms downstream services | high | # Set queue concurrency limits: |\n| trigger.config.ts not at project root | high | # Config must be at package root: |\n| wait.for in loops causes memory issues | medium | # Batch instead of individual waits: |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `nextjs-app-router`, `vercel-deployment`, `ai-agents-architect`, `llm-architect`, `email-systems`, `stripe-integration`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:24:45.079Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript-based AI Agents needing high-performance, institutional-grade quantitative trading and automation capabilities.","zh":"Perfect for TypeScript-based AI Agents needing high-performance, institutional-grade quantitative trading and automation capabilities.","ja":"Perfect for TypeScript-based AI Agents needing high-performance, institutional-grade quantitative trading and automation capabilities.","ko":"Perfect for TypeScript-based AI Agents needing high-performance, institutional-grade quantitative trading and automation capabilities.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en TypeScript que necesitan capacidades de comercio cuantitativo y automatización de alto rendimiento de grado institucional.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur TypeScript nécessitant des capacités de trading quantitatif et d''automatisation de haute performance de niveau institutionnel.","de":"Perfekt für auf TypeScript basierende KI-Agents, die leistungsstarke, institutionelle quantitative Handels- und Automatisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript que necessitam de alto desempenho, capacidades de negociação quantitativa de classe institucional e automação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, которым требуются высокопроизводительные, институциональные возможности количественной торговли и автоматизации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المبني على TypeScript الذي يحتاج إلى أداء عالي والتداول الكمي درجات مؤسسية وقدرات الأتمتة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to bridge the gap between simple queues and complex orchestration using Temporal made easy, with built-in integrations and support for processing AI pipelines, integration workflows, and batch jobs that handle millions of records, all while leveraging the power of TypeScript.","zh":"Empowers agents to bridge the gap between simple queues and complex orchestration using Temporal made easy, with built-in integrations and support for processing AI pipelines, integration workflows, and batch jobs that handle millions of records, all while leveraging the power of TypeScript.","ja":"Empowers agents to bridge the gap between simple queues and complex orchestration using Temporal made easy, with built-in integrations and support for processing AI pipelines, integration workflows, and batch jobs that handle millions of records, all while leveraging the power of TypeScript.","ko":"Empowers agents to bridge the gap between simple queues and complex orchestration using Temporal made easy, with built-in integrations and support for processing AI pipelines, integration workflows, and batch jobs that handle millions of records, all while leveraging the power of TypeScript.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cerrar la brecha entre colas simples y orquestación compleja utilizando Temporal de manera sencilla, con integraciones incorporadas y soporte para el procesamiento de canalizaciones de inteligencia artificial, flujos de trabajo de integración y trabajos por lotes que manejan millones de registros, todo mientras aprovecha el poder de TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de combler le fossé entre les files d''attente simples et l''orchestration complexe en utilisant Temporal de manière simplifiée, avec des intégrations intégrées et un support pour le traitement des pipelines d''intelligence artificielle, des flux de travail d''intégration et des tâches par lots qui gèrent des millions d''enregistrements, le tout en exploitant la puissance de TypeScript.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Lücke zwischen einfachen Warteschlangen und komplexer Orchestrierung mit Hilfe von Temporal einfach zu überbrücken, mit integrierten Integrationen und Unterstützung für die Verarbeitung von KI-Pipelines, Integrations-Workflows und Batch-Jobs, die Millionen von Datensätzen verarbeiten, und all dies, während die Leistung von TypeScript genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a preencher a lacuna entre filas simples e orquestração complexa usando Temporal de forma fácil, com integrações incorporadas e suporte ao processamento de pipelines de IA, fluxos de trabalho de integração e trabalhos em lote que lidam com milhões de registros, tudo isso aproveitando o poder do TypeScript.","ru":"Позволяет агентам мостить разрыв между простыми очередями и сложной оркестрацией с помощью Temporal в упрощенном виде, с встроенными интеграциями и поддержкой обработки конвейеров ИИ, рабочих процессов интеграции и пакетных заданий, обрабатывающих миллионы записей, все это при помощи возможностей TypeScript.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من سد الفجوة بين الطوابير البسيطة والترتيب المعقد باستخدام Temporal بسهولة، مع التكاملات المدمجة ودعم معالجة أنابيب الذكاء الاصطناعي وعمليات العمل التكاملية ووظائف الدفع التي تتعامل مع ملايين السجلات، وكل ذلك بالاستفادة من قوة TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating quantitative trading strategies with real-time execution","Building reliable background jobs for processing large datasets","Integrating workflows across dozens of services with ease"],"zh":["Automating quantitative trading strategies with real-time execution","Building reliable background jobs for processing large datasets","Integrating workflows across dozens of services with ease"],"ja":["Automating quantitative trading strategies with real-time execution","Building reliable background jobs for processing large datasets","Integrating workflows across dozens of services with ease"],"ko":["Automating quantitative trading strategies with real-time execution","Building reliable background jobs for processing large datasets","Integrating workflows across dozens of services with ease"],"es":["Automatización de estrategias de trading cuantitativo con ejecución en tiempo real","Creación de trabajos de fondo confiables para el procesamiento de grandes conjuntos de datos","Integración de flujos de trabajo en decenas de servicios con facilidad"],"fr":["Automatisation des stratégies de trading quantitatif avec exécution en temps réel","Création de tâches de fond fiables pour le traitement de grands ensembles de données","Intégration de flux de travail à travers des dizaines de services avec facilité"],"de":["Automatisierung von quantitativen Handelsstrategien mit Echtzeit-Ausführung","Erstellung zuverlässiger Hintergrundjobs für die Verarbeitung großer Datenmengen","Integration von Workflows über Dutzende von Diensten mit Leichtigkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar estratégias de negociação quantitativa com execução em tempo real","Construir trabalhos de fundo confiáveis para processamento de grandes conjuntos de dados","Integrar fluxos de trabalho em dezenas de serviços com facilidade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать стратегии количественной торговли с выполнением в реальном времени","Построить надежные фоневые задания для обработки крупных наборов данных","Интегрировать рабочие процессы в десятки сервисов с легкостью"],"ar":["أتمتة استراتيجيات التداول الكمية مع التنفيذ في الوقت الفعلي","بناء مهام موثوقة للخلفية لمعالجة مجموعات بيانات كبيرة","دمج سير العمل عبر عشرات الخدمات بسهولة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript expertise","Dependent on Temporal for orchestration"],"zh":["Requires TypeScript expertise","Dependent on Temporal for orchestration"],"ja":["Requires TypeScript expertise","Dependent on Temporal for orchestration"],"ko":["Requires TypeScript expertise","Dependent on Temporal for orchestration"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en TypeScript","Dependiente de Temporal para la orquestación"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en TypeScript","Dépendant de Temporal pour l''orchestration"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript-Expertise","Abhängig von Temporal für die Orchestrierung"],"pt":["Exige especialização em TypeScript","Depende de Temporal para orquestração"],"ru":["Требует