لأداء","en":"file-organizer"},"description":{"zh":"文件整理器是一种高性能的文件管理工具，帮助您自动化文件管理，提高工作效率","ja":"ファイル整理ツールは、高性能のファイル管理ツールで、自動化ファイル管理による作業効率の向上を支援","ko":"파일 정리기는 고성능 파일 관리 도구로 자동화 파일 관리를 통해 작업 효율성을 높여줍니다","es":"El organizador de archivos es una herramienta de alto rendimiento para desarrolladores que busca estructurar y optimizar carpetas y archivos","fr":"L''organisateur de fichiers est un outil de haute performance pour les développeurs qui vise à structurer et optimiser les dossiers et les fichiers","de":"Der Datei-Organisator ist ein Hochleistungs-Tool für Entwickler, das darauf abzielt, Ordner und Dateien zu strukturieren und zu optimieren","pt":"O organizador de arquivos é uma ferramenta de alta performance projetada para ajudar a organizar e otimizar a estrutura dos arquivos e pastas","ru":"Организатор файлов - это высокопроизводительный инструмент, предназначенный для помощи в организации и оптимизации структуры файлов и папок","ar":"منظم الملفات هو أداة عالي الأداء مصممة لمساعدتك في تنظيم وتحسين هيكل الملفات والمجلدات","en":"A high-performance, institutional-grade quantitative trading framework designed for automated strategy development, backtesting, and real-time execution."},"definition":{"en":"A high-performance, institutional-grade quantitative trading framework designed for automated strategy development, backtesting, and real-time execution."},"features":{"zh":["自动化文件分析","智能文件分类","文件重复检测","文件夹结构优化","项目初始化支持"],"ja":["自動ファイル分析","スマートファイル分類","ファイル重複検出","フォルダ構造最適化","プロジェクト初期化サポート"],"ko":["자동 파일 분석","스마트 파일 분류","파일 중복 감지","폴더 구조 최적화","프로젝트 초기화 지원"],"es":["Análisis de la estructura actual de carpetas y archivos","Eliminación de archivos duplicados","Creación de una estructura de carpetas lógica"," Mejora de la productividad","Optimización del espacio de almacenamiento"],"fr":["Analyse de la structure actuelle des dossiers et des fichiers","Suppression de fichiers en double","Création d''une structure de dossiers logique","Amélioration de la productivité","Optimisation de l''espace de stockage"],"de":["Analyse der aktuellen Ordner- und Dateistruktur","Entfernung von doppelten Dateien","Erstellung einer logischen Ordnerstruktur","Verbesserung der Produktivität","Optimierung des Speicherplatzes"],"pt":["Análise da estrutura atual dos arquivos e pastas","Otimização da estrutura dos arquivos e pastas","Remoção de arquivos duplicados","Criação de uma estrutura de pastas lógica","Melhoria da organização e produtividade"],"ru":["Анализ текущей структуры файлов и папок","Оптимизация структуры файлов и папок","Удаление дубликатов файлов","Создание логической структуры папок","Улучшение организации и производительности"],"ar":["تحليل هيكل الملفات والمجلدات الحالي","تحسين هيكل الملفات والمجلدات","إزالة الملفات المكررة","إنشاء هيكل مجلدات منطقي","تحسين التنظيم والإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["文件管理","自动化文件管理","文件整理","文件分类","文件重复检测","文件夹结构优化"],"ja":["ファイル管理","自動化ファイル管理","ファイル整理","ファイル分類","ファイル重複検出","フォルダ構造最適化"],"ko":["파일 관리","자동화 파일 관리","파일 정리","파일 분류","파일 중복 감지","폴더 구조 최적화"],"es":["organizador de archivos","estructura de carpetas","productividad","optimización de espacio","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["organisateur de fichiers","structure de dossiers","productivité","optimisation de l''espace","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Datei-Organisator","Ordnerstruktur","Produktivität","Speicherplatz-Optimierung","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["organizador de arquivos","otimização de arquivos","estrutura de pastas","produtividade","organização de arquivos","ferramenta de organização"],"ru":["организатор файлов","оптимизация файлов","структура папок","производительность","организация файлов","инструмент организации"],"ar":["منظم الملفات","تحسين الملفات","هيكل المجلدات","الإنتاجية","تنظيم الملفات","أداة التنظيم"]}},"owner":"Nguyenthang2292","repo":"Sovereign-IQ","repoPath":"Nguyenthang2292/Sovereign-IQ","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"file-organizer","description":"Intelligently organizes files and folders by understanding context, finding duplicates, and suggesting better organizational structures. Use when user wants to clean up directories, organize downloads, remove duplicates, or restructure projects.","bodyPreview":"# File Organizer\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Your Downloads folder is a chaotic mess\n- You can''t find files because they''re scattered everywhere\n- You have duplicate files taking up space\n- Your folder structure doesn''t make sense anymore\n- You want to establish better organization habits\n- You''re starting a new project and need a good structure\n- You''re cleaning up before archiving old projects\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Current Structure**: Reviews your folders and files to unde","body":"# File Organizer\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Your Downloads folder is a chaotic mess\n- You can''t find files because they''re scattered everywhere\n- You have duplicate files taking up space\n- Your folder structure doesn''t make sense anymore\n- You want to establish better organization habits\n- You''re starting a new project and need a good structure\n- You''re cleaning up before archiving old projects\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Current Structure**: Reviews your folders and files to understand what you have\n2. **Finds Duplicates**: Identifies duplicate files across your system\n3. **Suggests Organization**: Proposes logical folder structures based on your content\n4. **Automates Cleanup**: Moves, renames, and organizes files with your approval\n5. **Maintains Context**: Makes smart decisions based on file types, dates, and content\n6. **Reduces Clutter**: Identifies old files you probably don''t need anymore\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen a user requests file organization help:\n\n1. **Understand the Scope**\n\n   Ask clarifying questions:\n\n   - Which directory needs organization? (Downloads, Documents, entire home folder?)\n   - What''s the main problem? (Can''t find things, duplicates, too messy, no structure?)\n   - Any files or folders to avoid? (Current projects, sensitive data?)\n   - How aggressively to organize? (Conservative vs. comprehensive cleanup)\n\n2. **Analyze Current State**\n\n   Review the target directory:\n\n   ```bash\n   # Get overview of current structure\n   ls -la [target_directory]\n\n   # Check file types and sizes\n   find [target_directory] -type f -exec file {} \\; | head -20\n\n   # Identify largest files\n   du -sh [target_directory]/* | sort -rh | head -20\n\n   # Count file types\n   find [target_directory] -type f | sed ''s/.*\\.//'' | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn\n   ```\n\n   Summarize findings:\n\n   - Total files and folders\n   - File type breakdown\n   - Size distribution\n   - Date ranges\n   - Obvious organization issues\n\n3. **Identify Organization Patterns**\n\n   Based on the files, determine logical groupings:\n\n   **By Type**:\n\n   - Documents (PDFs, DOCX, TXT)\n   - Images (JPG, PNG, SVG)\n   - Videos (MP4, MOV)\n   - Archives (ZIP, TAR, DMG)\n   - Code/Projects (directories with code)\n   - Spreadsheets (XLSX, CSV)\n   - Presentations (PPTX, KEY)\n\n   **By Purpose**:\n\n   - Work vs. Personal\n   - Active vs. Archive\n   - Project-specific\n   - Reference materials\n   - Temporary/scratch files\n\n   **By Date**:\n\n   - Current year/month\n   - Previous years\n   - Very old (archive candidates)\n\n4. **Find Duplicates**\n\n   When requested, search for duplicates:\n\n   ```bash\n   # Find exact duplicates by hash\n   find [directory] -type f -exec md5 {} \\; | sort | uniq -d\n\n   # Find files with similar names\n   find [directory] -type f -printf ''%f\\n'' | sort | uniq -d\n\n   # Find similar-sized files\n   find [directory] -type f -printf ''%s %p\\n'' | sort -n\n   ```\n\n   For each set of duplicates:\n\n   - Show all file paths\n   - Display sizes and modification dates\n   - Recommend which to keep (usually newest or best-named)\n   - **Important**: Always ask for confirmation before deleting\n\n5. **Propose Organization Plan**\n\n   Present a clear plan before making changes:\n\n   ```markdown\n   # Organization Plan for [Directory]\n\n   ## Current State\n\n   - X files across Y folders\n   - [Size] total\n   - File types: [breakdown]\n   - Issues: [list problems]\n\n   ## Proposed Structure\n\n   [Directory]/\n   ├── Work/\n   │ ├── Projects/\n   │ ├── Documents/\n   │ └── Archive/\n   ├── Personal/\n   │ ├── Photos/\n   │ ├── Documents/\n   │ └── Media/\n   └── Downloads/\n   ├── To-Sort/\n   └── Archive/\n\n   ## Changes I''ll Make\n\n   1. **Create new folders**: [list]\n   2. **Move files**:\n      - X PDFs → Work/Documents/\n      - Y images → Personal/Photos/\n      - Z old files → Archive/\n   3. **Rename files**: [any renaming patterns]\n   4. **Delete**: [duplicates or trash files]\n\n   ## Files Needing Your Decision\n\n   - [List any files you''re unsure about]\n\n   Ready to proceed? (yes/no/modify)\n   ```\n\n6. **Execute Organization**\n\n   After approval, organize systematically:\n\n   ```bash\n   # Create folder structure\n   mkdir -p \"path/to/new/folders\"\n\n   # Move files with clear logging\n   mv \"old/path/file.pdf\" \"new/path/file.pdf\"\n\n   # Rename files with consistent patterns\n   # Example: \"YYYY-MM-DD - Description.ext\"\n   ```\n\n   **Important Rules**:\n\n   - Always confirm before deleting anything\n   - Log all moves for potential undo\n   - Preserve original modification dates\n   - Handle filename conflicts gracefully\n   - Stop and ask if you encounter unexpected situations\n\n7. **Provide Summary and Maintenance Tips**\n\n   After organizing:\n\n   ```markdown\n   # Organization Complete! ✨\n\n   ## What Changed\n\n   - Created [X] new folders\n   - Organized [Y] files\n   - Freed [Z] GB by removing duplicates\n   - Archived [W] old files\n\n   ## New Structure\n\n   [Show the new folder tree]\n\n   ## Maintenance Tips\n\n   To keep this organized:\n\n   1. **Weekly**: Sort new downloads\n   2. **Monthly**: Review and archive completed projects\n   3. **Quarterly**: Check for new duplicates\n   4. **Yearly**: Archive old files\n\n   ## Quick Commands for You\n\n   # Find files modified this week\n\n   find . -type f -mtime -7\n\n   # Sort downloads by type\n\n   [custom command for their setup]\n\n   # Find duplicates\n\n   [custom command]\n   ```\n\n   Want to organize another folder?\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Folder Naming\n\n- Use clear, descriptive names\n- Avoid spaces (use hyphens or underscores)\n- Be specific: \"client-proposals\" not \"docs\"\n- Use prefixes for ordering: \"01-current\", \"02-archive\"\n\n### File Naming\n\n- Include dates: \"2024-10-17-meeting-notes.md\"\n- Be descriptive: \"q3-financial-report.xlsx\"\n- Avoid version numbers in names (use version control instead)\n- Remove download artifacts: \"document-final-v2 (1).pdf\" → \"document.pdf\"\n\n### When to Archive\n\n- Projects not touched in 6+ months\n- Completed work that might be referenced later\n- Old versions after migration to new systems\n- Files you''re hesitant to delete (archive first)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:25:09.042Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing advanced file management and organization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级文件管理和组织功能的生产力代理。","ja":"高度なファイル管理および組織機能を必要とする生産性エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 파일 관리 및 조직 기능이 필요한 생산성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Productividad que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión y organización de archivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Productivité nécessitant des capacités avancées de gestion et d''organisation de fichiers.","de":"Perfekt für Produktivitätsagenten, die erweiterte Dateiverwaltungs- und Organisationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento e organização de arquivos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов продуктивности, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления и организации файлов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الإنتاجية التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة وتنظيم الملفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze current folder structures, eliminate duplicate files, and establish efficient organization habits using automated file sorting and categorization protocols.","zh":"赋予代理分析当前文件夹结构、消除重复文件、并使用自动文件排序和分类协议建立高效的组织习惯的能力。","ja":"エージェントが現在のフォルダ構造を分析し、重複ファイルを削除し、自動ファイル整理および分類プロトコルを使用して効率的な組織習慣を確立する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 현재 폴더 구조를 분석하고 중복 파일을 제거하며 자동 파일 정리 및 분류 프로토콜을 사용하여 효율적인 조직習慣을 확립할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar las estructuras de carpetas actuales, eliminar archivos duplicados y establecer hábitos de organización eficientes utilizando protocolos de clasificación y categorización de archivos automatizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les structures de dossiers actuelles, d''éliminer les fichiers en double et d''établir des habitudes d''organisation efficaces à l''aide de protocoles de tri et de catégorisation de fichiers automatisés.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die aktuellen Ordnerstrukturen zu analysieren, doppelte Dateien zu eliminieren und effiziente Organisationsgewohnheiten mit automatisierten Dateisortier- und Kategorisierungsprotokollen zu etablieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem as estruturas de pastas atuais, eliminem arquivos duplicados e estabeleçam hábitos de organização eficientes usando protocolos de classificação e categorização de arquivos automatizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать текущие структуры папок, удалять дублирующие файлы и устанавливать эффективные привычки организации с помощью автоматизированных протоколов сортировки и категоризации файлов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحليل هياكل المجلدات الحالية وإزالة الملفات المكررة وتنمية عادات تنظيمية فعالة باستخدام بروتوكولات فرز وتصنيف الملفات الآلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating folder cleanup","Generating optimized folder structures","Eliminating duplicate files","Establishing project templates"],"zh":["自动化文件夹清理","生成优化的文件夹结构","消除重复文件","建立项目模板"],"ja":["フォルダのクリーンアップを自動化する","最適化されたフォルダ構造を生成する","重複ファイルを削除する","プロジェクトテンプレートを確立する"],"ko":["폴더 정리 자동화","최적화된 폴더 구조 생성","중복 파일 제거","프로젝트 템플릿 설정"],"es":["Automatización de la limpieza de carpetas","Generación de estructuras de carpetas optimizadas","Eliminación de archivos duplicados","Establecimiento de plantillas de proyecto"],"fr":["Automatisation du nettoyage de dossiers","Génération de structures de dossiers optimisées","Élimination de fichiers en double","Établissement de modèles de projet"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ordnerbereinigung","Erzeugung optimierter Ordnerrstrukturen","Beseitigung doppelter Dateien","Festlegung von Projektvorlagen"],"pt":["Automatizar a limpeza de pastas","Gerar estruturas de pastas otimizadas","Eliminar arquivos duplicados","Estabelecer modelos de projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать очистку папок","Генерировать оптимизированные структуры папок","Удалять дублирующие файлы","Устанавливать шаблоны проектов"],"ar":["أتمتة تنظيف المجلدات","توليد هياكل مجلدات مُختزلة","إزالة الملفات المكررة","إنشاء قوالب مشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access","Limited to local file systems"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问","仅限本地文件系统"],"ja":["ファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","ローカルファイルシステムのみ"],"ko":["파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","로컬 파일 시스템만"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos","Limitado a sistemas de archivos locales"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers","Limité aux systèmes de fichiers locaux"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem","Begrenzt auf lokale Dateisysteme"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos","Limitado a sistemas de arquivos locais"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе","Ограничен локальными файловыми системами"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات","محدود بنظم الملفات المحلية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
