سية X-Fidelity باستخدام xfi-create-plan","en":"xfi-create-plan"},"description":{"zh":"xfi-create-plan 是一个用于技术框架检查的 CLI 工具，帮助开发者创建符合最佳实践的工程计划","ja":"xfi-create-plan は技術フレームワークをチェックする CLI ツールで、開発者が最適なエンジニアリング計画を作成することを支援します","ko":"xfi-create-plan은 기술 프레임워크를 확인하는 CLI 도구로, 개발자가 최적의 엔지니어링 계획을 생성하도록 지원합니다","es":"xfi-create-plan es una herramienta de línea de comandos para crear planes de ingeniería X-Fidelity. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a crear planes completos para...","fr":"xfi-create-plan est un outil de ligne de commande pour créer des plans d''ingénierie X-Fidelity. Il aide les développeurs à créer des plans complets pour des ...","de":"xfi-create-plan ist ein Befehlszeilen-Tool zum Erstellen von X-Fidelity-Ingenieurplänen. Es hilft Entwicklern, umfassende Pläne für komplexe Initiativen zu e...","pt":"O xfi-create-plan é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para criar planos de engenharia X-Fidelity","ru":"Xfi-create-plan - это инструмент командной строки для создания планов инженерии X-Fidelity","ar":"xfi-create-plan هو أداة سطر أوامر لإنشاء خطط هندسية X-Fidelity","en":"cli for opinionated framework adherence checks"},"definition":{"en":"cli for opinionated framework adherence checks"},"features":{"zh":["技术框架检查","工程计划创建","CLI 界面","支持多个子任务","与 xfi-system-design 代理集成"],"ja":["技術フレームワークのチェック","エンジニアリング計画の作成","CLI インターフェイス","複数のサブタスクのサポート","xfi-system-design エージェントとの統合"],"ko":["기술 프레임워크 확인","엔지니어링 계획 생성","CLI 인터페이스","다수의 서브 태스크 지원","xfi-system-design 에이전트와의 통합"],"es":["Crea planes de ingeniería completos","Verifica el cumplimiento de los marcos de trabajo","Permite la delegación de subtareas a subagentes","Integra la entrada de diseño de sistema de xfi-system-design","Preguntas de recopilación de requisitos personalizables"],"fr":["Crée des plans d''ingénierie complets","Vérifie la conformité aux cadres de travail","Permet la délégation de sous-tâches à des sous-agents","Intègre la saisie de conception de système de xfi-system-design","Questions de collecte de requisitos personnalisables"],"de":["Erstellt umfassende Ingenieurpläne","Überprüft die Einhaltung von Frameworks","Ermöglicht die Delegation von Teilaufgaben an Subagenten","Integriert die Systemdesign-Eingabe von xfi-system-design","Anpassbare Anforderungssammlungsfragen"],"pt":["Criação de planos de engenharia completos","Verificação de conformidade com o framework","Integração com o agente xfi-system-design","Delegação de subtarefas a subagentes","Suporte a iniciativas complexas"],"ru":["Создание полных планов инженерии","Проверка соответствия фреймворку","Интеграция с агентом xfi-system-design","Делегирование подзадач подагентам","Поддержка сложных инициатив"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط هندسية شاملة","التحقق من الامتثال للframework","التكامل مع وكيل xfi-system-design","تفويض المهام الفرعية إلى وكلاء فرعيين","دعم المبادرات المعقدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["xfi-create-plan","技术框架检查","工程计划创建","CLI 工具","开发者工具","技术最佳实践"],"ja":["xfi-create-plan","技術フレームワークのチェック","エンジニアリング計画の作成","CLI ツール","開発者ツール","技術ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["xfi-create-plan","기술 프레임워크 확인","엔지니어링 계획 생성","CLI 도구","개발자 도구","기술 최적화"],"es":["xfi-create-plan","planes de ingeniería","ingeniería X-Fidelity","herramientas de línea de comandos","desarrollo de software","iniciativas complejas","marcos de trabajo"],"fr":["xfi-create-plan","plans d''ingénierie","ingénierie X-Fidelity","outils de ligne de commande","développement de logiciels","initiatives complexes","cadres de travail"],"de":["xfi-create-plan","Ingenieurpläne","X-Fidelity-Ingenieurwesen","Befehlszeilen-Tools","Software-Entwicklung","komplexe Initiativen","Frameworks"],"pt":["xfi-create-plan","engenharia X-Fidelity","planos de engenharia","ferramentas de linha de comando","framework","iniciativas complexas"],"ru":["xfi-create-plan","инженерия X-Fidelity","планы инженерии","инструменты командной строки","фреймворк","сложные инициативы"],"ar":["xfi-create-plan","هندسة X-Fidelity","خطط هندسية","أدوات سطر الأوامر","framework","مبادرات معقدة"]}},"owner":"zotoio","repo":"x-fidelity","repoPath":"zotoio/x-fidelity","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"xfi-create-plan","description":"Guide for creating engineering plans through a structured workflow. Use when planning new features, coordinating multi-agent work, or breaking down complex initiatives.","bodyPreview":"# Creating X-Fidelity Engineering Plans\n\nThis skill guides the xfi-planner agent through creating comprehensive engineering plans for complex initiatives.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Clear understanding of the feature/initiative to plan\n- Access to xfi-system-design agent for architectural input\n- Ability to delegate to appropriate subagents for subtask creation\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 1. Requirements Gathering (up to 10 questions)","body":"# Creating X-Fidelity Engineering Plans\n\nThis skill guides the xfi-planner agent through creating comprehensive engineering plans for complex initiatives.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Clear understanding of the feature/initiative to plan\n- Access to xfi-system-design agent for architectural input\n- Ability to delegate to appropriate subagents for subtask creation\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 1. Requirements Gathering (up to 10 questions)             │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 2. Design Consultation (xfi-system-design agent)           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 3. USER STOP: Confirm decisions                            │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 4. Create plan directory and index file                    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 5. Delegate subtask file creation to subagents             │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 6. Review by xfi-code-reviewer and xfi-system-design       │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 7. USER STOP: Final review                                 │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 8. Declare plan ready with execution instructions          │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Step 1: Requirements Gathering\n\nAsk up to 10 clarifying questions, **one at a time**, building on previous answers.\n\n### Question Categories\n\n1. **Scope**: What is the scope of this initiative?\n2. **Goals**: What are the primary goals and success criteria?\n3. **Constraints**: Are there any constraints or limitations?\n4. **Dependencies**: What existing features/packages does this depend on?\n5. **Affected Packages**: Which packages will be impacted?\n6. **User Impact**: How will this affect end users?\n7. **Testing Strategy**: Any specific testing requirements?\n8. **Timeline Sensitivity**: Are there any deadlines or priorities?\n9. **Risks**: Any known risks or concerns?\n10. **Open Questions**: Anything unclear that needs investigation?\n\n### Question Guidelines\n\n- **STOP after each question** and wait for user response\n- **Build on previous answers** - adapt questions based on responses\n- **Skip unnecessary questions** if scope is already clear\n- **Aim for 5-7 questions** for most initiatives\n- **Document key decisions** as you go\n\n## Step 2: Design Consultation\n\nAfter gathering requirements, consult the **xfi-system-design agent**:\n\n```\nInvoke xfi-system-design subagent with:\n\n\"Provide architectural input for this initiative:\n\n[Summary of requirements gathered]\n\nKey questions:\n1. What packages need to be modified?\n2. What is the recommended architecture approach?\n3. Are there any design patterns we should follow?\n4. What are the main technical risks?\n5. Suggest a logical breakdown of subtasks\"\n```\n\nCapture the design agent''s recommendations.\n\n## Step 3: User Confirmation (MANDATORY STOP)\n\n**STOP and present to user:**\n\n```markdown\n## Plan Summary for Confirmation\n\n### Initiative: [Name]\n\n### Key Decisions Made:\n1. [Decision 1 with rationale]\n2. [Decision 2 with rationale]\n3. [Decision 3 with rationale]\n\n### Packages Affected:\n- [package 1] - [changes needed]\n- [package 2] - [changes needed]\n\n### Proposed Subtasks:\n1. [Subtask 1] - assigned to [subagent]\n2. [Subtask 2] - assigned to [subagent]\n\n### Architecture Approach:\n[Summary from xfi-system-design]\n\n### Risks Identified:\n- [Risk 1]\n- [Risk 2]\n\n---\n\nDo you approve these decisions? Any changes or questions?\n```\n\n**Wait for user confirmation before proceeding.**\n\n## Step 4: Create Plan Directory and Index File\n\nOnce confirmed, create the plan structure:\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n```bash\nknowledge/plans/[YYYYMMDD]-[feature-name]/\n```\n\n### Index File Template\n\nCreate `index-[feature-name]-[yyyymmdd].md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: [Feature Name]\n\n## Status\nDraft\n\n## Overview\n[High-level description from requirements]\n\n## Key Decisions\n- [Decision 1]: [Rationale]\n- [Decision 2]: [Rationale]\n\n## Requirements\n[Numbered list of requirements gathered]\n\n## Design Notes\n[Summary from xfi-system-design consultation]\n\n## Subtask Dependency Graph\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Phase 1 (Parallel)\"\n        A[subtask-01-setup]\n        B[subtask-02-types]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Phase 2\"\n        C[subtask-03-implementation]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Phase 3\"\n        D[subtask-04-testing]\n    end\n    A --> C\n    B --> C\n    C --> D\n```\n\n## Execution Order\n\n### Phase 1 (Parallel)\n| Subtask | Subagent | Description | Dependencies |\n|---------|----------|-------------|--------------|\n| 01 | xfi-engineer | [Description] | None |\n| 02 | xfi-engineer | [Description] | None |\n\n### Phase 2 (After Phase 1)\n| Subtask | Subagent | Description | Dependencies |\n|---------|----------|-------------|--------------|\n| 03 | xfi-engineer | [Description] | 01, 02 |\n\n### Phase 3 (After Phase 2)\n| Subtask | Subagent | Description | Dependencies |\n|---------|----------|-------------|--------------|\n| 04 | xfi-testing-expert | [Description] | 03 |\n\n## Global Definition of Done\n- [ ] All subtasks completed\n- [ ] All unit tests passing\n- [ ] Code review by xfi-code-reviewer completed\n- [ ] Architecture review by xfi-system-design completed\n- [ ] Global test suite passing (verified by xfi-testing-expert)\n- [ ] Documentation updated by xfi-docs-expert\n- [ ] Knowledge captured by xfi-system-design\n- [ ] User approval received\n\n## Execution Notes\n[To be filled during plan execution]\n\n## Completion Checklist\n- [ ] Subtask 01: Pending\n- [ ] Subtask 02: Pending\n- [ ] Subtask 03: Pending\n- [ ] Subtask 04: Pending\n- [ ] Final code review\n- [ ] Final architecture review\n- [ ] Global tests verified\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n- [ ] Knowledge captured\n```\n\n## Step 5: Delegate Subtask File Creation\n\nFor each subtask, invoke the appropriate subagent to create the subtask file.\n\n### Delegation Template\n\n```\nInvoke [subagent-name] subagent with:\n\n\"Create a subtask plan file for the following task.\n\n**File to create**: knowledge/plans/[yyyymmdd]-[feature-name]/subtask-[NN]-[feature]-[subtask-name]-[yyyymmdd].md\n\n**IMPORTANT**:\n- Only create/edit the subtask markdown file\n- Do NOT edit any code files\n- Do NOT run any tests\n- Include instruction in the file that executing agent should NOT trigger global tests\n\n**Subtask Details**:\n- Feature: [Feature name]\n- Subtask: [Subtask name]\n- Objective: [Clear objective]\n- Deliverables: [Expected deliverables]\n- Dependencies: [List of dependent subtask IDs or None]\n\n**File Template**:\n[Include the subtask file template from xfi-planner agent documentation]\n\nAfter creating the file, report back with:\n1. File path created\n2. Summary of deliverables defined\n3. Any concerns or questions about the subtask\"\n```\n\n### Subagent Selection Guide\n\n| Task Type | Subagent |\n|-----------|----------|\n| General implementation | xfi-engineer |\n| Plugin development | xfi-plugin-expert |\n| VSCode extension | xfi-vscode-expert |\n| Rule/archetype work | xfi-rules-expert |\n| Testing strategy | xfi-testing-expert |\n| Security-sensitive | xfi-security-expert |\n| Build/CI work | xfi-build-expert |\n\n### Collect Results\n\nAs each subagent completes:\n1. Verify the subtask file was created correctly\n2. Update the index file if any new information was discovered\n3. Note any concerns raised by subagents\n\n## Step 6: Plan Review\n\nInvoke reviewers in parallel:\n\n### xfi-code-reviewer\n\n```\nInvoke xfi-code-reviewer subagent with:\n\n\"Review the engineering plan files for completeness and quality:\n\nPlan directory: knowledge/plans/[yyyymmdd]-[feature-name]/\n\nCheck for:\n1. Clear and achievable deliverables\n2. Appropriate subagent assignments\n3. Correct dependency ordering\n4. Complete definition of done criteria\n5. Any gaps or concerns\n\nProvide suggestions for improvements.\"\n```\n\n### xfi-system-design\n\n```\nInvoke xfi-system-design subagent with:\n\n\"Review the engineering plan for architectural soundness:\n\nPlan directory: knowledge/plans/[yyyymmdd]-[feature-name]/\n\nCheck for:\n1. Alignment with X-Fidelity architecture\n2. Appropriate package assignments\n3. Completeness of scope\n4. Technical feasibility\n5. Risk coverage\n\nProvide suggestions for improvements.\"\n```\n\n### Incorporate Feedback\n\nUpdate plan files based on reviewer suggestions.\n\n## Step 7: User Final Review (MANDATORY STOP)\n\n**STOP and present to user:**\n\n```markdown\n## Plan Ready for Review\n\n### Plan Location\n`knowledge/plans/[yyyymmdd]-[feature-name]/`\n\n### Files Created\n- `index-[feature-name]-[yyyymmdd].md` (main plan)\n- `subtask-01-[feature]-[subtask-name]-[yyyymmdd].md`\n- `subtask-02-[feature]-[subtask-name]-[yyyymmdd].md`\n- ...\n\n### Review Feedback Incorporated\n- [Summary of changes from code reviewer]\n- [Summary of changes from system design]\n\n### Execution Summary\n- Total subtasks: [N]\n- Parallel phases: [N]\n- Estimated complexity: [Low/Medium/High]\n\n---\n\nPlease review the plan files. When ready to execute, use:\n`/xfi-plan-execute`\n\nAny changes needed before finalizing?\n```\n\n## Step 8: Finalize Plan\n\nOnce user approves:\n\n1. Update index file status to \"Ready for Review\"\n2. Document execution instructions:\n\n```markdown\n## Execution Instructions\n\nTo execute this plan in a new agent session:\n\n1. Start a new conversation\n2. Run: `/xfi-plan-execute`\n3. Select this plan: `[yyyymmdd]-[feature-name]`\n4. Confirm execution summary\n5. Monitor subtask progress\n6. Review final changes when prompted\n7. Approve documentation updates\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. **NEVER edit code files** during planning\n2. **ALWAYS stop for user confirmation** at Steps 3 and 7\n3. **DELEGATE subtask creation** to appropriate subagents\n4. **INCLUDE testing restrictions** in all subtask files\n5. **CAPTURE all decisions** in the index file\n6. **UPDATE index** with discoveries from subagents\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Subagent doesn''t create correct file\n- Verify the file path is correct\n- Ensure template was provided\n- Re-invoke with clearer instructions\n\n### Scope too large\n- Break into multiple plans\n- Phase the implementation\n- Prioritize critical subtasks\n\n### Unclear requirements\n- Ask additional clarifying questions\n- Consult xfi-system-design for guidance\n- Document assumptions clearly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:25:21.015Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Planning Agents requiring structured initiative planning and adherence to opinionated frameworks","zh":"适用于需要结构化计划和遵循特定框架的规划代理","ja":"構造化された計画と意見のあるフレームワークへの準拠が必要な計画エージェントに適しています","ko":"구조화된 계획과 의견이 있는 프레임워크를 준수해야 하는 계획 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de planificación que requieren una planificación de iniciativa estructurada y adherencia a marcos de opinión","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de planification nécessitant une planification d''initiative structurée et une adhésion à des cadres d''opinion","de":"Ideal für Planungsagenten, die eine strukturierte Initiative-Planung und Einhaltung von Meinungsführungsframeworks erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Planejamento que requerem planejamento de iniciativa estruturado e adesão a frameworks opinados","ru":"Идеально для Планирующих Агентов, требующих структурированного планирования инициатив и соблюдения мнительных рамок","ar":"مثالي لعميل التخطيط الذي يتطلب تخطيط مبادرة منظم والامتثال للإطارات المعتمدة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive engineering plans through requirements gathering, architectural input from xfi-system-design, and subtask delegation, utilizing a CLI for opinionated framework adherence checks and handling up to 10 questions for precise planning","zh":"通过要求收集、来自xfi-system-design的架构输入和子任务委派，利用CLI进行特定框架的遵循检查，并处理最多10个问题以进行精确的计划，赋予代理创建综合的工程计划的能力","ja":"要求の収集、xfi-system-designからのアーキテクチャ入力、サブタスクの委託を行い、CLIを使用して意見のあるフレームワークへの準拠をチェックし、最大10個の質問を処理して正確な計画を行うことで、エージェントが包括的なエンジニアリング計画を作成することを可能にします","ko":"요구 사항 수집, xfi-system-design의 아키텍처 입력 및 서브 태스크 위임을 통해 전체적인 엔지니어링 계획을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화하며, CLI를 사용하여 의견이 있는 프레임워크의 준수를 확인하고, 정확한 계획을 위해 최대 10개의 질문을 처리합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes crear planes de ingeniería completos a través de la recopilación de requisitos, la entrada arquitectónica de xfi-system-design y la delegación de subtareas, utilizando una CLI para comprobaciones de adherencia al marco de opinión y manejo de hasta 10 preguntas para una planificación precisa","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des plans d''ingénierie complets grâce à la collecte de exigences, à l''entrée architecturale de xfi-system-design et à la délégation de sous-tâches, en utilisant une CLI pour des vérifications de conformité au cadre d''opinion et la gestion de jusqu''à 10 questions pour une planification précise","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Ingenieurpläne durch Anforderungssammlung, architektonische Eingaben von xfi-system-design und Subaufgaben-Delegation zu erstellen, unter Verwendung einer CLI für Opinionated-Framework-Einhaltungsprüfungen und Handhabung von bis zu 10 Fragen für eine präzise Planung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar planos de engenharia abrangentes por meio da coleta de requisitos, entrada arquitetônica do xfi-system-design e delegação de subtarefas, utilizando uma CLI para verificar a adesão ao framework opinado e lidar com até 10 perguntas para planejamento preciso","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать комплексные инженерные планы посредством сбора требований, архитектурного ввода из xfi-system-design и делегирования подзадач, используя CLI для проверки соблюдения мнительного框ка и обработки до 10 вопросов для точного планирования","ar":"يتمكن العميل من إنشاء خطط هندسية شاملة من خلال جمع المتطلبات ومدخلات التصميم المعماري من xfi-system-design وتفويض المهام الفرعية، باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر للامتثال للإطار المعتمد ومعالجة ما يصل إلى 10 أسئلة للتخطيط الدقيق"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating detailed initiative plans","Delegating subtasks to appropriate subagents","Ensuring architectural consistency with xfi-system-design input"],"zh":["生成详细的计划","委托子任务给适当的子代理","确保与xfi-system-design输入的一致性"],"ja":["詳細な計画の生成","適切なサブエージェントへのサブタスクの委託","xfi-system-design入力との一貫性の確保"],"ko":["详细한 계획 생성","적절한 서브 에이전트에게 서브 태스크 위임","xfi-system-design 입력과 일관성 보장"],"es":["Generación de planes de iniciativa detallados","Delegación de subtareas a subagentes adecuados","Garantía de la consistencia arquitectónica con la entrada de xfi-system-design"],"fr":["Génération de plans d''initiative détaillés","Délégation de sous-tâches à des sous-agents appropriés","Assurance de la cohérence architecturale avec l''entrée de xfi-system-design"],"de":["Erstellung detaillierter Initiativpläne","Delegation von Subaufgaben an geeignete Subagenten","Sicherstellung der architektonischen Konsistenz mit Eingaben von xfi-system-design"],"pt":["Geração de planos de iniciativa detalhados","Delegação de subtarefas a subagentes apropriados","Garantia da consistência arquitetônica com entrada do xfi-system-design"],"ru":["Генерация детальных планов инициатив","Делегирование подзадач соответствующим субагентам","Обеспечение архитектурной согласованности с вводом xfi-system-design"],"ar":["توليد خطط مبادرة مفصلة","تفويض المهام الفرعية إلى عملاء فرعيين مناسبين","ضمان الاتساق المعماري مع مدخلات التصميم المعماري xfi-system-design"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear understanding of the feature/initiative","Needs access to xfi-system-design agent","Limited to handling up to 10 questions for requirements gathering"],"zh":["需要对功能/计划有明确的理解","需要访问xfi-system-design代理","仅限处理最多10个问题以进行要求收集"],"ja":["機能/イニシアチブについて明確な理解が必要","xfi-system-designエージェントへのアクセスが必要","要求収集のために最大10個の質問のみを処理可能"],"ko":["기능/이니셔티브에 대한 명확한 이해가 필요합니다","xfi-system-design 에이전트에 액세스해야 합니다","요구 사항 수집을 위해 최대 10개의 질문만 처리할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión clara de la característica/iniciativa","Necesita acceso al agente xfi-system-design","Limitado a manejar hasta 10 preguntas para la recopilación de requisitos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension claire de la fonctionnalité/initiative","Nécessite un accès à l''agent xfi-system-design","Limité à gérer jusqu''à 10 questions pour la collecte de exigences"],"de":["Erfordert ein klares Verständnis der Funktion/Initiative","Benötigt Zugriff auf den xfi-system-design-Agenten","Begrenzt auf die Handhabung von bis zu 10 Fragen für die Anforderungssammlung"],"pt":["Exige compreensão clara da funcionalidade/iniciativa","Necessita acesso ao agente xfi-system-design","Limitado a lidar com até 10 perguntas para coleta de requisitos"],"ru":["Требует четкого понимания функциональности/инициативы","Требует доступа к агенту xfi-system-design","Ограничен обработкой до 10 вопросов для сбора требований"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا واض