.js 16","React","Zustand","React Hook Form","Zod","TanStack Query","Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["desenvolvedor frontend","Next.js","React","state management","user experience","Tailwind CSS","TanStack Query","React Hook Form"],"ru":["фронтенд-разработчик","Next.js","React","управление состоянием","опыт пользователя","Tailwind CSS","TanStack Query","React Hook Form"],"ar":["مطور الواجهة الأمامية","Next.js","React","إدارة الحالة","تجربة المستخدم","Tailwind CSS","TanStack Query","React Hook Form"]}},"owner":"kafkaspanel1","repo":"panel","repoPath":"kafkaspanel1/panel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-developer","description":"React components, UI library, state management ve user experience geliştirmek için kullanılır. Zustand, TanStack Query, Tailwind CSS ve accessibility konularında uzman.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Developer Skill\n\nReact components, UI library, state management ve user experience geliştirir.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- React component oluştururken veya düzenlerken\n- State management (Zustand) implementasyonu yaparken\n- Form handling (React Hook Form + Zod) eklerken\n- Data fetching (TanStack Query) implementasyonu yaparken\n- Loading states ve skeleton screens eklerken\n- Empty states ve error boundaries yazarken\n- Responsive design (Tailwind CSS) yaparken\n- PWA features geliştirirken\n- Acc","body":"# Frontend Developer Skill\n\nReact components, UI library, state management ve user experience geliştirir.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- React component oluştururken veya düzenlerken\n- State management (Zustand) implementasyonu yaparken\n- Form handling (React Hook Form + Zod) eklerken\n- Data fetching (TanStack Query) implementasyonu yaparken\n- Loading states ve skeleton screens eklerken\n- Empty states ve error boundaries yazarken\n- Responsive design (Tailwind CSS) yaparken\n- PWA features geliştirirken\n- Accessibility (ARIA) iyileştirmeleri yaparken\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Görevler\n- React component development (ui, shared, features)\n- State management (Zustand stores)\n- Form handling (React Hook Form + Zod)\n- Data fetching (TanStack Query)\n- Loading states ve skeleton screens\n- Empty states ve error boundaries\n- Responsive design (Tailwind CSS)\n- PWA features (manifest, service worker)\n- Accessibility (ARIA labels, keyboard navigation)\n\n### Kurallar\n- Components functional components olmalı\n- TypeScript strict mode kullan\n- Tailwind CSS class names organized (use clsx + tailwind-merge)\n- Component props TypeScript interfaces ile tanımlı\n- No prop drilling (use Zustand or React Context)\n- Error boundaries critical components''lerde\n- Loading states tüm async operations''da\n- Turkish language strings (no hardcoded English)\n\n### Kod Kalitesi\n- Component names PascalCase\n- File names kebab-case (my-component.tsx)\n- Props destructuring\n- useMemo ve useCallback optimization için\n- Consistent naming conventions\n- Reusable components (DRY principle)\n- Accessibility best practices\n\n### Dosya Yapısı\n\n```\nsrc/components/\n├── ui/              # Radix UI components\n│   ├── button.tsx\n│   ├── input.tsx\n│   ├── dialog.tsx\n│   └── ...\n├── shared/          # Shared application components\n│   ├── data-table.tsx\n│   ├── stat-card.tsx\n│   ├── empty-state.tsx\n│   └── ...\n└── features/        # Feature-specific components\n    ├── members/\n    ├── donations/\n    └── social-aid/\n```\n\n### Component Example\n\n```tsx\nimport { cn } from \"@/lib/utils\";\n\ninterface StatCardProps {\n  title: string;\n  value: string | number;\n  description?: string;\n  icon?: React.ReactNode;\n  trend?: \"up\" | \"down\" | \"neutral\";\n  className?: string;\n}\n\nexport function StatCard({\n  title,\n  value,\n  description,\n  icon,\n  trend,\n  className,\n}: StatCardProps) {\n  return (\n    <div\n      className={cn(\n        \"rounded-lg border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm\",\n        className\n      )}\n    >\n      <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n        <p className=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\">\n          {title}\n        </p>\n        {icon && (\n          <div className=\"text-muted-foreground\">{icon}</div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-2\">\n        <p className=\"text-2xl font-bold\">{value}</p>\n        {description && (\n          <p className=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1\">\n            {description}\n          </p>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### TanStack Query Example\n\n```tsx\nimport { useQuery, useMutation, useQueryClient } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\n\n// Fetch members\nexport function useMembers() {\n  return useQuery({\n    queryKey: [\"members\"],\n    queryFn: async () => {\n      const res = await fetch(\"/api/members\");\n      if (!res.ok) throw new Error(\"Üyeler yüklenemedi\");\n      return res.json();\n    },\n  });\n}\n\n// Create member mutation\nexport function useCreateMember() {\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient();\n  \n  return useMutation({\n    mutationFn: async (data: CreateMemberInput) => {\n      const res = await fetch(\"/api/members\", {\n        method: \"POST\",\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n        body: JSON.stringify(data),\n      });\n      if (!res.ok) throw new Error(\"Üye oluşturulamadı\");\n      return res.json();\n    },\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [\"members\"] });\n    },\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Zustand Store Example\n\n```typescript\nimport { create } from \"zustand\";\nimport { persist } from \"zustand/middleware\";\n\ninterface SidebarState {\n  isOpen: boolean;\n  toggle: () => void;\n  setOpen: (open: boolean) => void;\n}\n\nexport const useSidebarStore = create<SidebarState>()(\n  persist(\n    (set) => ({\n      isOpen: true,\n      toggle: () => set((state) => ({ isOpen: !state.isOpen })),\n      setOpen: (open) => set({ isOpen: open }),\n    }),\n    {\n      name: \"sidebar-storage\",\n    }\n  )\n);\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:26:13.283Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced frontend development capabilities with React and Next.js","zh":"非常适合需要高级前端开发能力的 AI 代理，尤其是使用 React 和 Next.js","ja":"React と Next.js を使用した高度なフロントエンド開発機能を必要とする AI エージェントに最適","ko":"React와 Next.js를 사용한 고급 프론트엔드 개발 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de frontend avanzadas con React y Next.js","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents IA ayant besoin de capacités de développement de frontend avancées avec React et Next.js","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Frontend-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit React und Next.js benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento frontend com React e Next.js","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки фронтенда с помощью React и Next.js","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتصميم الواجهة الأمامية مع React و Next.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop responsive admin panels using Tailwind CSS, manage state with Zustand, and handle forms with React Hook Form + Zod, while also implementing data fetching with TanStack Query and creating PWA features","zh":"赋予代理开发响应式管理面板的能力，使用 Tailwind CSS，管理状态使用 Zustand，处理表单使用 React Hook Form + Zod，同时也实现数据获取使用 TanStack Query 和创建 PWA 功能","ja":"Tailwind CSS を使用したレスポンシブ管理パネルの開発、Zustand を使用した状態管理、React Hook Form + Zod を使用したフォームの処理、TanStack Query を使用したデータ取得の実装、および PWA 機能の作成をエージェントに可能にする","ko":"Tailwind CSS를 사용한 반응형 관리 패널 개발, Zustand를 사용한 상태 관리, React Hook Form + Zod를 사용한 폼 처리, TanStack Query를 사용한 데이터 가져오기 구현 및 PWA 기능 생성을 에이전트가 수행할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar paneles de administración responsivos utilizando Tailwind CSS, gestionar estado con Zustand, y manejar formularios con React Hook Form + Zod, mientras también implementan la recuperación de datos con TanStack Query y crean características de PWA","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des panneaux d''administration responsifs à l''aide de Tailwind CSS, de gérer l''état avec Zustand, et de gérer les formulaires avec React Hook Form + Zod, tout en implémentant la récupération de données avec TanStack Query et en créant des fonctionnalités PWA","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, responsive Admin-Panel mit Tailwind CSS zu entwickeln, den Zustand mit Zustand zu verwalten und Formulare mit React Hook Form + Zod zu handhaben, während sie auch Datenabfragen mit TanStack Query implementieren und PWA-Funktionen erstellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver painéis de administração responsivos usando Tailwind CSS, gerenciar estado com Zustand, lidar com formulários com React Hook Form + Zod e implementar a busca de dados com TanStack Query e criar recursos de PWA","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать адаптивные панели администрирования с помощью Tailwind CSS, управлять состоянием с помощью Zustand, обрабатывать формы с помощью React Hook Form + Zod, а также реализовывать получение данных с помощью TanStack Query и создавать функции PWA","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء لوحات تحكم إدارية مستجيبة باستخدام Tailwind CSS، وإدارة الحالة مع Zustand، ومعالجة النماذج باستخدام React Hook Form + Zod، serta تنفيذ استرجاع البيانات مع TanStack Query وإنشاء ميزات PWA"},"useCases":{"en":["Building responsive Next.js admin panels for non-profit organization management systems","Implementing state management with Zustand for complex React applications","Generating forms with validation using React Hook Form + Zod","Optimizing data fetching with TanStack Query for improved performance"],"zh":["为非营利组织管理系统构建响应式 Next.js 管理面板","在复杂的 React 应用程序中使用 Zustand 实现状态管理","使用 React Hook Form + Zod 生成带有验证的表单","使用 TanStack Query 优化数据获取以提高性能"],"ja":["非営利組織管理システムのためのレスポンシブ Next.js 管理パネルを構築する","複雑な React アプリケーションで Zustand を使用した状態管理を実装する","React Hook Form + Zod を使用したフォームの生成とバリデーション","TanStack Query を使用したデータ取得の最適化とパフォーマンスの向上"],"ko":["비영리 조직 관리 시스템을 위한 반응형 Next.js 관리 패널 구축","복잡한 React 애플리케이션에서 Zustand를 사용한 상태 관리 구현","React Hook Form + Zod를 사용한 폼 생성 및 유효성 검사","TanStack Query를 사용한 데이터 가져오기 최적화 및 성능 향상"],"es":["Creación de paneles de administración responsivos de Next.js para sistemas de gestión de organizaciones sin fines de lucro","Implementación de la gestión de estado con Zustand para aplicaciones React complejas","Generación de formularios con validación utilizando React Hook Form + Zod","Optimización de la recuperación de datos con TanStack Query para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Création de panneaux d''administration responsifs Next.js pour les systèmes de gestion d''organisations à but non lucratif","Mise en œuvre de la gestion d''état avec Zustand pour les applications React complexes","Génération de formulaires avec validation à l''aide de React Hook Form + Zod","Optimisation de la récupération de données avec TanStack Query pour améliorer les performances"],"de":["Erstellung responsiver Next.js-Admin-Panel für die Verwaltung von Non-Profit-Organisationen","Implementierung der Zustandsverwaltung mit Zustand für komplexe React-Anwendungen","Generierung von Formularen mit Validierung unter Verwendung von React Hook Form + Zod","Optimierung der Datenabfragen mit TanStack Query für eine verbesserte Leistung"],"pt":["Construir painéis de administração responsivos Next.js para sistemas de gestão de organizações sem fins lucrativos","Implementar gerenciamento de estado com Zustand para aplicações React complexas","Gerar formulários com validação usando React Hook Form + Zod","Otimizar a busca de dados com TanStack Query para melhorar o desempenho"],"ru":["Создание адаптивных панелей администрирования Next.js для систем управления некоммерческими организациями","Реализация управления состоянием с помощью Zustand для сложных приложений React","Генерация форм с валидацией с помощью React Hook Form + Zod","Оптимизация получения данных с помощью TanStack Query для повышения производительности"],"ar":["بناء لوحات تحكم إدارية مستجيبة Next.js لأنظمة إدارة المنظمات غير الهادفة للربح","تنفيذ إدارة الحالة مع Zustand لتطبيقات React المعقدة","إنشاء نماذج مع التحقق باستخدام React Hook Form + Zod","تحسين استرجاع البيانات مع TanStack Query لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to frontend development tasks","Dependent on specific libraries such as Zustand, React Hook Form, Zod, and TanStack Query"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Next.js","仅限于前端开发任务","依赖于特定的库，如 Zustand、React Hook Form、Zod 和 TanStack Query"],"ja":["React と Next.js の知識が必要","フロントエンド開発タスクのみに限定される","Zustand、React Hook Form、Zod、TanStack Query などの特定のライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["React와 Next.js에 대한 지식이 필요","프론트엔드 개발 작업만으로 제한","Zustand, React Hook Form, Zod, TanStack Query 등의 특정 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Limitado a tareas de desarrollo de frontend","Dependiente de bibliotecas específicas como Zustand, React Hook Form, Zod y TanStack Query"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité aux tâches de développement de frontend","Dépendant de bibliothèques spécifiques telles que Zustand, React Hook Form, Zod et TanStack Query"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf Frontend-Entwicklungsaufgaben","Abhängig von spezifischen Bibliotheken wie Zustand, React Hook Form, Zod und TanStack Query"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado a tarefas de desenvolvimento frontend","Dependente de bibliotecas específicas, como Zustand, React Hook Form, Zod e TanStack Query"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Ограничен задачами разработки фронтенда","Зависит от конкретных библиотек, таких как Zustand, React Hook Form, Zod и TanStack Query"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Next.js","محدود بمهام تصميم الواجهة الأمامية","يعتمد على مكتبات محددة، مثل Zustand و React Hook Form و Zod و TanStack Query"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Absolute-Space-GHCP/leo-participation-translator/session-workflow', 'community', 'Absolute-Space-GHCP', 'leo-participation-translator', 'Absolute-Space-GHCP/leo-participation-translator', 'session-workflow', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z', '2026-02-18T10:25:34.416Z', NULL, '{"id":"Absolute-Space-GHCP/leo-participation-translator/session-workflow","name":"session-workflow","description":{"zh":"Session 工作流是 AI 参与翻译技术的实现，用于将被动广告创意转化为参与值得的平台","ja":"セッションワークフローは、AI 参加翻訳技術の実現であり、被動的な広告アイデアを参加に値するプラットフォームに変換するために使用されます","ko":"세션 워크플로우는 AI 참여 번역 기술의 구현으로, 수동적인 광고 아이디어를 참여 가치 있는 플랫폼으로 전환합니다","es":"El flujo de sesión es una herramienta AI que transforma ideas publicitarias pasivas en plataformas de participación atractivas","fr":"Le flux de session est un outil IA qui transforme des idées publicitaires passives en plateformes de participation attractives","de":"Der Sitzungs-Workflow ist ein KI-Tool, das passive Werbeideen in Teilnahme-Plattformen umwandelt","pt":"O Trabalho de Sessão é uma habilidade de IA que transforma ideias publicitárias passivas em plataformas de participação. Ele verifica o espaço de trabalho, o status do git e as prioridades do TASKS.md","ru":"Сессионный Workflow - это навык ИИ, который преобразует пассивные рекламные идеи в платформы для участия. Он проверяет рабочее пространство, статус git и приоритеты TASKS.md","ar":"عملية الجلسة هي مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي تحول الأفكار الإعلانية السلبية إلى منصات للمشاركة. إنها تتحقق من مساحة العمل و حالة جيت و اولويات TASKS.md","en":"AI-powered Participation Translator - transforms passive advertising ideas into participation-worthy platforms"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Session 工作流 - AI 参与翻译","ja":"セッションワークフロー - AI 参加翻訳","ko":"세션 워크플로우 - AI 참여 번역","es":"Flujo de sesión: traductor de participación AI","fr":"Flux de session : traducteur de participation IA","de":"Sitzungs-Workflow: KI-basierter Teilnahme-Translator","pt":"Trabalho de Sessão: Tradutor de Participação Inteligente","ru":"Сессионный Workflow: Интеллектуальный Переводчик Участия","ar":"عملية الجلسة: مترجم المشاركة الذكي","en":"session-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"Session 工作流是 AI 参与翻译技术的实现，用于将被动广告创意转化为参与值得的平台","ja":"セッションワークフローは、AI 参加翻訳技術の実現であり、被動的な広告アイデアを参加に値するプラットフォームに変換するために使用されます","ko":"세션 워크플로우는 AI 참여 번역 기술의 구현으로, 수동적인 광고 아이디어를 참여 가치 있는 플랫폼으로 전환합니다","es":"El flujo de sesión es una herramienta AI que transforma ideas publicitarias pasivas en plataformas de participación atractivas","fr":"Le flux de session est un outil IA qui transforme des idées publicitaires passives en plateformes de participation attractives","de":"Der Sitzungs-Workflow ist ein KI-Tool, das passive Werbeideen in Teilnahme-Plattformen umwandelt","pt":"O Trabalho de Sessão é uma habilidade de IA que transforma ideias publicitárias passivas em plataformas de participação. Ele verifica o espaço de trabalho, o...","ru":"Сессионный Workflow - это навык ИИ, который преобразует пассивные рекламные идеи в платформы для участия. Он проверяет рабочее пространство, статус git и при...","ar":"عملية الجلسة هي مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي تحول الأفكار الإعلانية السلبية إلى منصات للمشاركة. إنها تتحقق من مساحة العمل و حالة جيت و اولويات TASKS.md","en":"AI-powered Participation Translator - transforms passive advertising ideas into participation-worthy platforms"},"definition":{"en":"AI-powered Participation Translator - transforms passive advertising ideas into participation-worthy platforms"},"features":{"zh":["AI 参与翻译技术","广告创意转化","参与值得的平台","提高广告效果","自动化工作流","实时监控"],"ja":["AI 参加翻訳技術","広告アイデアの転換","参加に値するプラットフォーム","広告効果の向上","自動化ワークフロー","リアルタイムモニタリング"],"ko":["AI 참여 번역 기술","광고 아이디어 전환","참여 가치 있는 플랫폼","광고 효과 향상","자동화 워크플로","실시간 모니터링"],"es":["Verificación del espacio de trabajo","Revisión de prioridades de tareas","Validación de claves de API y servicios","Verificación del servidor de desarrollo","Integración con Claude-Mem","Compatibilidad con Git"],"fr":["Vérification de l''espace de travail","Révision des priorités de tâches","Validation des clés d''API et des services","Vérification du serveur de développement","Intégration avec Claude-Mem","Compatibilité avec Git"],"de":["Überprüfung des Arbeitsbereichs","Überprüfung der Aufgabenprioritäten","Validierung von API-Schlüsseln und Diensten","Überprüfung des Entwicklungs-Servers","Integration mit Claude-Mem","Kompatibilität mit Git"],"pt":["Verificação do espaço de trabalho","Verificação do status do git","Revisão das prioridades do TASKS.md","Verificação do status do claude-mem","Validação das chaves de API e serviços","Verificação do servidor de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Проверка рабочего пространства","Проверка статуса git","Просмотр приоритетов TASKS.md","Проверка статуса claude-mem","Валидация ключей API и сервисов","Проверка сервера разработки"],"ar":["التحقق من مساحة العمل","التحقق من حالة جيت","استعراض أولويات TASKS.md","التحقق من حالة claude-mem","التحقق من مفاتيح API وخدمات","التحقق من خادم التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 参与翻译","广告创意转化","参与值得的平台","提高广告效果","自动化工作流","实时监控","Session 工作流"],"ja":["AI 参加翻訳","広告アイデアの転換","参加に値するプラットフォーム","広告効果の向上","自動化ワークフロー","リアルタイムモニタリング","セッションワークフロー"],"ko":["AI 참여 번역","광고 아이디어 전환","참여 가치 있는 플랫폼","광고 효과 향상","자동화 워크플로","실시간 모니터링","세션 워크플로우"],"es":["flujo de sesión","traductor de participación","inteligencia artificial","plataformas de participación","desarrollo de software","Git","Claude-Mem","API","servicios en la nube"],"fr":["flux de session","traducteur de participation","intelligence artificielle","plateformes de participation","développement de logiciels","Git","Claude-Mem","API","services cloud"],"de":["Sitzungs-Workflow","Teilnahme-Translator","künstliche Intelligenz","Teilnahme-Plattformen","Software-Entwicklung","Git","Claude-Mem","API","Cloud-Dienste"],"pt":["trabalho de sessão","tradutor de participação","ia","plataformas de participação","desenvolvimento de software","git","TASKS.md","claude-mem","chaves de API"],"ru":["сессионный workflow","интеллектуальный переводчик","ии","платформы для участия","разработка программного обеспечения","git","TASKS.md","claude-mem","ключи API"],"ar":["عملية الجلسة","مترجم المشاركة","ذكاء اصطناعي","منصات المشاركة","تطوير البرمجيات","جيت","TASKS.md","claude-mem","مفاتيح API"]}},"owner":"Absolute-Space-GHCP","repo":"leo-participation-translator","repoPath":"Absolute-Space-GHCP/leo-participation-translator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"session-workflow","description":"Session management including startup, wrap-up, and handoff procedures. Use when starting a new session, ending a session, creating session logs, or preparing handoff documentation.","bodyPreview":"# Session Workflow Skill\n\n## Session Start Checklist\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Verify workspace\n- [ ] Step 2: Check git status\n- [ ] Step 3: Review TASKS.md priorities\n- [ ] Step 4: Check claude-mem status\n- [ ] Step 5: Validate API keys & services\n- [ ] Step 6: Verify dev server (if needed)\n```\n\n### Step 1: Verify Workspace\n\n```bash\n# Confirm correct workspace\npwd\n# Expected: /Users/charleymm/Projects/leo-participation-translator\n\n# Verify it''s the right project\nls CLAUDE.md PLAN.md TAS","body":"# Session Workflow Skill\n\n## Session Start Checklist\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Verify workspace\n- [ ] Step 2: Check git status\n- [ ] Step 3: Review TASKS.md priorities\n- [ ] Step 4: Check claude-mem status\n- [ ] Step 5: Validate API keys & services\n- [ ] Step 6: Verify dev server (if needed)\n```\n\n### Step 1: Verify Workspace\n\n```bash\n# Confirm correct workspace\npwd\n# Expected: /Users/charleymm/Projects/leo-participation-translator\n\n# Verify it''s the right project\nls CLAUDE.md PLAN.md TASKS.md\n```\n\n### Step 2: Check Git Status\n\n```bash\ngit status\ngit fetch origin main\ngit log HEAD..origin/main --oneline  # Check if behind\n```\n\n### Step 3: Review Priorities\n\nRead `TASKS.md` to identify current priorities and in-progress tasks.\n\n### Step 4: Check Claude-Mem\n\n```bash\ncurl -s http://127.0.0.1:37777/api/readiness\n# Expected: {\"status\":\"ready\",\"mcpReady\":true}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Validate API Keys & Services\n\nRun these checks to verify all external dependencies are healthy:\n\n```bash\n# --- GCP Authentication ---\ngcloud auth application-default print-access-token > /dev/null 2>&1 \\\n  && echo \"âœ… GCP auth valid\" || echo \"âŒ GCP auth expired â€” run: gcloud auth login --update-adc\"\n\n# --- Exa.ai API Key ---\nEXA_KEY=$(grep \"EXA_API_KEY\" app/.env.local | cut -d''='' -f2)\nEXA_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://api.exa.ai/search\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -H \"x-api-key: $EXA_KEY\" \\\n  -d ''{\"query\":\"test\",\"numResults\":1}'')\n[ \"$EXA_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Exa.ai key valid\" || echo \"âŒ Exa.ai key INVALID ($EXA_STATUS) â€” rotate at dashboard.exa.ai\"\n\n# --- Tavily API Key ---\nTAVILY_KEY=$(grep \"TAVILY_API_KEY\" app/.env.local | cut -d''='' -f2)\nTAVILY_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://api.tavily.com/search\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"api_key\\\":\\\"$TAVILY_KEY\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"test\\\",\\\"max_results\\\":1}\")\n[ \"$TAVILY_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Tavily key valid\" || echo \"âŒ Tavily key INVALID ($TAVILY_STATUS) â€” check app.tavily.com\"\n\n# --- Anthropic API Key ---\nANTHROPIC_KEY=$(grep \"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\" app/.env.local | cut -d''='' -f2)\nANTHROPIC_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \"https://api.anthropic.com/v1/models\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: $ANTHROPIC_KEY\" -H \"anthropic-version: 2023-06-01\")\n[ \"$ANTHROPIC_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Anthropic key valid\" || echo \"âŒ Anthropic key INVALID ($ANTHROPIC_STATUS)\"\n\n# --- Cloud Run (production) ---\nPROD_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \\\n  \"https://participation-translator-904747039219.us-central1.run.app/login\")\n[ \"$PROD_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Cloud Run healthy\" || echo \"âŒ Cloud Run issue ($PROD_STATUS)\"\n```\n\n### Step 6: Verify Dev Server (if needed)\n\n```bash\ncd app && npx next dev --port 3005\n# Verify: curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" http://localhost:3005/api/stats\n```\n\n---\n\n## Session End Checklist\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Update TASKS.md\n- [ ] Step 2: Create session log\n- [ ] Step 3: Commit changes\n- [ ] Step 4: Push to remote\n- [ ] Step 5: Create handoff\n```\n\n### Step 1: Update TASKS.md\n\nMark completed tasks, update progress percentages.\n\n### Step 2: Create Session Log\n\nCreate `sessions/SESSION_{DATE}_{VERSION}.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Session Summary: Participation Translator vX.X.X\n\n**Date:** YYYY-MM-DD\n**Duration:** X hours\n\n## What Was Done\n\n- [Key accomplishment 1]\n- [Key accomplishment 2]\n\n## Files Changed\n\n- `file1.ts` - Description\n- `file2.md` - Description\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. [Priority task 1]\n2. [Priority task 2]\n```\n\n### Step 3: Commit Changes\n\n```bash\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"feat(vX.X.X): brief description of changes\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Push to Remote\n\n```bash\n# Archive remote first if it has diverged\ngit fetch origin main\ngit log HEAD..origin/main --oneline\n# If empty, safe to push\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n### Step 5: Create Handoff\n\nProvide handoff summary in conversation:\n\n```\n## Participation Translator Handoff\n\n**Session End**: {datetime}\n**Version**: {version}\n\n### What Was Done\n- [Key items]\n\n### Current State\n- Git: Clean/Dirty\n- Phase: 0/1/2/etc\n\n### Next Steps\n1. [Priority 1]\n2. [Priority 2]\n\n### Quick Commands\nnpm run dev\nnpm test\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference Commands\n\n| Task            | Command                                     |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Check workspace | `pwd`                                       |\n| Git status      | `git status`                                |\n| Run dev server  | `cd app && npx next dev --port 3005`        |\n| Run tests       | `npm test`                                  |\n| Build           | `cd app && npm run build`                   |\n| Type check      | `cd app && npx tsc --noEmit`                |\n| Deploy          | `cd app && gcloud run deploy participation-translator --source . --region us-central1 --project jl-participation-translator` |\n| Production URL  | `https://participation-translator-904747039219.us-central1.run.app` |\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Charley Scholz, JLAI\nCo-authored: Claude Opus 4.6, Cursor (IDE)\nLast Updated: 2026-02-13\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:25:34.416Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing structured workflow automation and git integration.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化工作流自动化和git集成的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントが構造化されたワークフロー自動化とGit統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 워크플로 자동화 및 Git 통합이 필요한 태스크 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Tareas que necesitan automatización de flujo de trabajo estructurado e integración con git.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion de Tâches ayant besoin d''une automatisation de workflow structurée et d''une intégration git.","de":"Perfekt für Task-Management-Agents, die eine strukturierte Workflow-Automatisierung und Git-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que necessitam de automação de fluxo de trabalho estruturada e integração com git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, требующих структурированной автоматизации рабочего процесса и интеграции с git.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المهام الذين يحتاجون إلى أتمتة تدفق العمل المنظمة وتكامل مع جيت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex workflows using TASKS.md priorities, claude-mem status, and API key validation, streamlining participation-worthy platform development with protocols like git and services validation.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂工作流的能力，使用TASKS.md优先级、claude-mem状态和API密钥验证，简化平台开发，支持git和服务验证等协议。","ja":"TASKS.mdの優先度、claude-memのステータス、APIキーの検証を使用して、エージェントが複雑なワークフローを管理できるようにし、Gitやサービス検証などのプロトコルを使用したプラットフォーム開発を簡素化します。","ko":"TASKS.md 우선순위, claude-mem 상태 및 API 키 유효성을 사용하여 에이전트가 복잡한 워크플ロー 관리를 가능하게 하며, Git 및 서비스 유효성 검사와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 플랫폼 개발을 단순화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar flujos de trabajo complejos utilizando prioridades de TASKS.md, estado de claude-mem y validación de clave de API, simplificando el desarrollo de plataformas con protocolos como git y validación de servicios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des flux de travail complexes en utilisant des priorités TASKS.md, le statut claude-mem et la validation de clé API, simplifiant ainsi le développement de plates-formes avec des protocoles comme git et la validation de services.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Workflows mithilfe von TASKS.md-Prioritäten, claude-mem-Status und API-Schlüsselvalidierung zu verwalten, wodurch die Entwicklung von Plattformen mit Protokollen wie Git und Dienstvalidierung rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar fluxos de trabalho complexos usando prioridades do TASKS.md, status do claude-mem e validação de chave de API, simplificando o desenvolvimento de plataformas dignas de participação com protocolos como git e validação de serviços.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными рабочими процессами с помощью приоритетов TASKS.md, статуса claude-mem и проверки ключа API, упрощая разработку платформ, достойных участия, с протоколами типа git и проверкой служб.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة سلاسل عمل معقدة باستخدام أولويات TASKS.md و حالة claude-mem و التحقق من مفتاح API، وبذلك يُبسّط تطوير منصات الجدارة بالمشاركة مع بروتوكولات مثل جيت و التحقق من الخدمات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating session start checklists","Validating API keys and services","Debugging workspace and git status issues"],"zh":["自动化会话启动清单","验证API密钥和服务","调试工作空间和Git状态问题"],"ja":["セッション開始チェックリストの自動化","APIキーとサービスの検証","ワークスペースとGitステータスの問題をデバッグ"],"ko":["세션 시작 체크리스트 자동화","API 키 및 서비스 유효성 검사","작업 공간 및 Git 상태 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de listas de verificación de inicio de sesión","Validación de claves de API y servicios","Depuración de problemas de estado de espacio de trabajo y git"],"fr":["Automatisation des listes de vérification de démarrage de session","Validation des clés API et des services","Débogage des problèmes d''état de l''espace de travail et de git"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sitzungsstart-Checklisten","Validierung von API-Schlüsseln und Diensten","Fehlerbehebung bei Problemen mit Workspace- und Git-Status"],"pt":["Automação de listas de verificação de início de sessão","Validação de chaves de API e serviços","Depuração de problemas de status do workspace e git"],"ru":["Автоматизация списков проверок начала сеанса","Проверка ключей API и служб","Отладка проблем статуса рабочего пространства и git"],"ar":["أتمتة قوائم التحقق من بدء الجلسة","التحقق من مفاتيح API والخدمات","تصحيح أخطاء حالة مساحة العمل وجيت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git installation","claude-mem status access needed","API keys and services validation required"],"zh":["需要Git安装","claude-mem状态访问需要","API密钥和服务验证需要"],"ja":["Gitのインストールが必要","claude-memステータスのアクセスが必要","APIキーの検証とサービスの検証が必要"],"ko":["Git 설치가 필요합니다.","claude-mem 상태 액세스가 필요합니다.","API 키 및 서비스 유효성 검사가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere instalación de git","Se necesita acceso al estado de claude-mem","Se requiere validación de claves de API y servicios"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de git","L''accès au statut de claude-mem est nécessaire","La validation des clés API et des services est requise"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation","Zugriff auf den claude-mem-Status erforderlich","API-Schlüssel- und Dienstvalidierung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação do git","Acesso ao status do claude-mem necessário","Validação de chaves de API e serviços necessária"],"ru":["Требует установки git","Необходим доступ к статусу claude-mem","Требуется проверка ключей API и служб"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت جيت","التحقق من حالة claude-mem ضروري","التحقق من مفاتيح API والخدمات ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
