hinweise","Festlegung von Commit-Nachrichtenformaten","Erstellung von Versionshinweisen für GitHub und GitLab","Verwaltung von semantischen Versionen"],"pt":["Geração automática de changelogs","Implementação de Commits Convencionais","Criação de fluxos de trabalho para notas de lançamento","Padronização de formatos de mensagens de commit","Geração de notas de lançamento para GitHub/GitLab","Gerenciamento de versionamento semântico"],"ru":["Автоматическая генерация чейнджлогов","Реализация Конвенциональных Коммитов","Создание рабочих процессов для заметок о выпуске","Стандартизация форматов сообщений о коммитах","Генерация заметок о выпуске для GitHub/GitLab","Управление семантическим версионированием"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء سجلات التعديلات","تنفيذ الإلتزامات التقليدية","إنشاء تدفقات عمل لملاحظات الإصدار","تقييس تنسيقات رسائل الإلتزام","تأتمتة إنشاء ملاحظات الإصدار لجيت هاب/جيت لاب","إدارة إصدارات семантиك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自动化变更日志","Conventional Commits","发布说明","版本管理","语义版本","Git","GitHub","GitLab","开发效率"],"ja":["自動化変更ログ","Conventional Commits","リリースノート","バージョン管理","セマンティックバージョニング","Git","GitHub","GitLab","開発効率"],"ko":["자동화 변경 로그","Conventional Commits","릴리스 노트","버전 관리","语义 버전","Git","GitHub","GitLab","개발 효율성"],"es":["automatización de registros de cambios","generación de notas de versión","commits convencionales","gestión de versiones","registros de cambios automáticos","notas de versión automáticas","github","gitlab","versiones semánticas"],"fr":["automatisation du journal des modifications","génération de notes de version","commits conventionnels","gestion de versions","journaux de modifications automatiques","notes de version automatiques","github","gitlab","versions sémantiques"],"de":["automatisierung von änderungsprotokollen","erstellung von versionshinweisen","konventionelle commits","versionenverwaltung","automatische änderungsprotokolle","automatische versionshinweise","github","gitlab","semantische versionen"],"pt":["automação de changelog","geração de changelogs","commits convencionais","notas de lançamento","versionamento semântico","github","gitlab","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["автоматизация чейнджлога","генерация чейнджлогов","конвенциональные коммиты","заметки о выпуске","семантическое версионирование","github","gitlab","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تأتمتة سجل التعديلات","إنشاء سجلات التعديلات","إلتزامات تقليدية","ملاحظات الإصدار","إصدارات семантиك","جيت هاب","جيت لاب","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"changelog-automation","description":"Automate changelog generation from commits, PRs, and releases following Keep a Changelog format. Use when setting up release workflows, generating release notes, or standardizing commit conventions.","bodyPreview":"# Changelog Automation\n\nPatterns and tools for automating changelog generation, release notes, and version management following industry standards.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up automated changelog generation\n- Implementing Conventional Commits\n- Creating release note workflows\n- Standardizing commit message formats\n- Generating GitHub/GitLab release notes\n- Managing semantic versioning\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Keep a Changelog Format\n\n```markdown\n# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to","body":"# Changelog Automation\n\nPatterns and tools for automating changelog generation, release notes, and version management following industry standards.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up automated changelog generation\n- Implementing Conventional Commits\n- Creating release note workflows\n- Standardizing commit message formats\n- Generating GitHub/GitLab release notes\n- Managing semantic versioning\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Keep a Changelog Format\n\n```markdown\n# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\nThe format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),\nand this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).\n\n## [Unreleased]\n\n### Added\n\n- New feature X\n\n## [1.2.0] - 2024-01-15\n\n### Added\n\n- User profile avatars\n- Dark mode support\n\n### Changed\n\n- Improved loading performance by 40%\n\n### Deprecated\n\n- Old authentication API (use v2)\n\n### Removed\n\n- Legacy payment gateway\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Login timeout issue (#123)\n\n### Security\n\n- Updated dependencies for CVE-2024-1234\n\n[Unreleased]: https://github.com/user/repo/compare/v1.2.0...HEAD\n[1.2.0]: https://github.com/user/repo/compare/v1.1.0...v1.2.0\n```\n\n### 2. Conventional Commits\n\n```\n<type>[optional scope]: <description>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer(s)]\n```\n\n| Type       | Description      | Changelog Section  |\n| ---------- | ---------------- | ------------------ |\n| `feat`     | New feature      | Added              |\n| `fix`      | Bug fix          | Fixed              |\n| `docs`     | Documentation    | (usually excluded) |\n| `style`    | Formatting       | (usually excluded) |\n| `refactor` | Code restructure | Changed            |\n| `perf`     | Performance      | Changed            |\n| `test`     | Tests            | (usually excluded) |\n| `chore`    | Maintenance      | (usually excluded) |\n| `ci`       | CI changes       | (usually excluded) |\n| `build`    | Build system     | (usually excluded) |\n| `revert`   | Revert commit    | Removed            |\n\n### 3. Semantic Versioning\n\n```\nMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH\n\nMAJOR: Breaking changes (feat! or BREAKING CHANGE)\nMINOR: New features (feat)\nPATCH: Bug fixes (fix)\n```\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Method 1: Conventional Changelog (Node.js)\n\n```bash\n# Install tools\nnpm install -D @commitlint/cli @commitlint/config-conventional\nnpm install -D husky\nnpm install -D standard-version\n# or\nnpm install -D semantic-release\n\n# Setup commitlint\ncat > commitlint.config.js << ''EOF''\nmodule.exports = {\n  extends: [''@commitlint/config-conventional''],\n  rules: {\n    ''type-enum'': [\n      2,\n      ''always'',\n      [\n        ''feat'',\n        ''fix'',\n        ''docs'',\n        ''style'',\n        ''refactor'',\n        ''perf'',\n        ''test'',\n        ''chore'',\n        ''ci'',\n        ''build'',\n        ''revert'',\n      ],\n    ],\n    ''subject-case'': [2, ''never'', [''start-case'', ''pascal-case'', ''upper-case'']],\n    ''subject-max-length'': [2, ''always'', 72],\n  },\n};\nEOF\n\n# Setup husky\nnpx husky init\necho \"npx --no -- commitlint --edit \\$1\" > .husky/commit-msg\n```\n\n### Method 2: standard-version Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// .versionrc.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  types: [\n    { type: \"feat\", section: \"Features\" },\n    { type: \"fix\", section: \"Bug Fixes\" },\n    { type: \"perf\", section: \"Performance Improvements\" },\n    { type: \"revert\", section: \"Reverts\" },\n    { type: \"docs\", section: \"Documentation\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"style\", section: \"Styles\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"chore\", section: \"Miscellaneous\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"refactor\", section: \"Code Refactoring\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"test\", section: \"Tests\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"build\", section: \"Build System\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"ci\", section: \"CI/CD\", hidden: true },\n  ],\n  commitUrlFormat: \"{{host}}/{{owner}}/{{repository}}/commit/{{hash}}\",\n  compareUrlFormat:\n    \"{{host}}/{{owner}}/{{repository}}/compare/{{previousTag}}...{{currentTag}}\",\n  issueUrlFormat: \"{{host}}/{{owner}}/{{repository}}/issues/{{id}}\",\n  userUrlFormat: \"{{host}}/{{user}}\",\n  releaseCommitMessageFormat: \"chore(release): {{currentTag}}\",\n  scripts: {\n    prebump: ''echo \"Running prebump\"'',\n    postbump: ''echo \"Running postbump\"'',\n    prechangelog: ''echo \"Running prechangelog\"'',\n    postchangelog: ''echo \"Running postchangelog\"'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n```json\n// package.json scripts\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"release\": \"standard-version\",\n    \"release:minor\": \"standard-version --release-as minor\",\n    \"release:major\": \"standard-version --release-as major\",\n    \"release:patch\": \"standard-version --release-as patch\",\n    \"release:dry\": \"standard-version --dry-run\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Method 3: semantic-release (Full Automation)\n\n```javascript\n// release.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  branches: [\n    \"main\",\n    { name: \"beta\", prerelease: true },\n    { name: \"alpha\", prerelease: true },\n  ],\n  plugins: [\n    \"@semantic-release/commit-analyzer\",\n    \"@semantic-release/release-notes-generator\",\n    [\n      \"@semantic-release/changelog\",\n      {\n        changelogFile: \"CHANGELOG.md\",\n      },\n    ],\n    [\n      \"@semantic-release/npm\",\n      {\n        npmPublish: true,\n      },\n    ],\n    [\n      \"@semantic-release/github\",\n      {\n        assets: [\"dist/**/*.js\", \"dist/**/*.css\"],\n      },\n    ],\n    [\n      \"@semantic-release/git\",\n      {\n        assets: [\"CHANGELOG.md\", \"package.json\"],\n        message:\n          \"chore(release): ${nextRelease.version} [skip ci]\\n\\n${nextRelease.notes}\",\n      },\n    ],\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Method 4: GitHub Actions Workflow\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/release.yml\nname: Release\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  workflow_dispatch:\n    inputs:\n      release_type:\n        description: \"Release type\"\n        required: true\n        default: \"patch\"\n        type: choice\n        options:\n          - patch\n          - minor\n          - major\n\npermissions:\n  contents: write\n  pull-requests: write\n\njobs:\n  release:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n          token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: \"20\"\n          cache: \"npm\"\n\n      - run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Configure Git\n        run: |\n          git config user.name \"github-actions[bot]\"\n          git config user.email \"github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\"\n\n      - name: Run semantic-release\n        env:\n          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n          NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\n        run: npx semantic-release\n\n  # Alternative: manual release with standard-version\n  manual-release:\n    if: github.event_name == ''workflow_dispatch''\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: \"20\"\n\n      - run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Configure Git\n        run: |\n          git config user.name \"github-actions[bot]\"\n          git config user.email \"github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\"\n\n      - name: Bump version and generate changelog\n        run: npx standard-version --release-as ${{ inputs.release_type }}\n\n      - name: Push changes\n        run: git push --follow-tags origin main\n\n      - name: Create GitHub Release\n        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v1\n        with:\n          tag_name: ${{ steps.version.outputs.tag }}\n          body_path: RELEASE_NOTES.md\n          generate_release_notes: true\n```\n\n### Method 5: git-cliff (Rust-based, Fast)\n\n```toml\n# cliff.toml\n[changelog]\nheader = \"\"\"\n# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\n\"\"\"\nbody = \"\"\"\n{% if version %}\\\n    ## [{{ version | trim_start_matches(pat=\"v\") }}] - {{ timestamp | date(format=\"%Y-%m-%d\") }}\n{% else %}\\\n    ## [Unreleased]\n{% endif %}\\\n{% for group, commits in commits | group_by(attribute=\"group\") %}\n    ### {{ group | upper_first }}\n    {% for commit in commits %}\n        - {% if commit.scope %}**{{ commit.scope }}:** {% endif %}\\\n            {{ commit.message | upper_first }}\\\n            {% if commit.github.pr_number %} ([#{{ commit.github.pr_number }}](https://github.com/owner/repo/pull/{{ commit.github.pr_number }})){% endif %}\\\n    {% endfor %}\n{% endfor %}\n\"\"\"\nfooter = \"\"\"\n{% for release in releases -%}\n    {% if release.version -%}\n        {% if release.previous.version -%}\n            [{{ release.version | trim_start_matches(pat=\"v\") }}]: \\\n                https://github.com/owner/repo/compare/{{ release.previous.version }}...{{ release.version }}\n        {% endif -%}\n    {% else -%}\n        [unreleased]: https://github.com/owner/repo/compare/{{ release.previous.version }}...HEAD\n    {% endif -%}\n{% endfor %}\n\"\"\"\ntrim = true\n\n[git]\nconventional_commits = true\nfilter_unconventional = true\nsplit_commits = false\ncommit_parsers = [\n    { message = \"^feat\", group = \"Features\" },\n    { message = \"^fix\", group = \"Bug Fixes\" },\n    { message = \"^doc\", group = \"Documentation\" },\n    { message = \"^perf\", group = \"Performance\" },\n    { message = \"^refactor\", group = \"Refactoring\" },\n    { message = \"^style\", group = \"Styling\" },\n    { message = \"^test\", group = \"Testing\" },\n    { message = \"^chore\\\\(release\\\\)\", skip = true },\n    { message = \"^chore\", group = \"Miscellaneous\" },\n]\nfilter_commits = false\ntag_pattern = \"v[0-9]*\"\nskip_tags = \"\"\nignore_tags = \"\"\ntopo_order = false\nsort_commits = \"oldest\"\n\n[github]\nowner = \"owner\"\nrepo = \"repo\"\n```\n\n```bash\n# Generate changelog\ngit cliff -o CHANGELOG.md\n\n# Generate for specific range\ngit cliff v1.0.0..v2.0.0 -o RELEASE_NOTES.md\n\n# Preview without writing\ngit cliff --unreleased --dry-run\n```\n\n### Method 6: Python (commitizen)\n\n```toml\n# pyproject.toml\n[tool.commitizen]\nname = \"cz_conventional_commits\"\nversion = \"1.0.0\"\nversion_files = [\n    \"pyproject.toml:version\",\n    \"src/__init__.py:__version__\",\n]\ntag_format = \"v$version\"\nupdate_changelog_on_bump = true\nchangelog_incremental = true\nchangelog_start_rev = \"v0.1.0\"\n\n[tool.commitizen.customize]\nmessage_template = \"{{change_type}}{% if scope %}({{scope}}){% endif %}: {{message}}\"\nschema = \"<type>(<scope>): <subject>\"\nschema_pattern = \"^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|perf|test|chore)(\\\\(\\\\w+\\\\))?:\\\\s.*\"\nbump_pattern = \"^(feat|fix|perf|refactor)\"\nbump_map = {\"feat\" = \"MINOR\", \"fix\" = \"PATCH\", \"perf\" = \"PATCH\", \"refactor\" = \"PATCH\"}\n```\n\n```bash\n# Install\npip install commitizen\n\n# Create commit interactively\ncz commit\n\n# Bump version and update changelog\ncz bump --changelog\n\n# Check commits\ncz check --rev-range HEAD~5..HEAD\n```\n\n## Release Notes Templates\n\n### GitHub Release Template\n\n```markdown\n## What''s Changed\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n{{ range .Features }}\n\n- {{ .Title }} by @{{ .Author }} in #{{ .PR }}\n  {{ end }}\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n{{ range .Fixes }}\n\n- {{ .Title }} by @{{ .Author }} in #{{ .PR }}\n  {{ end }}\n\n### 📚 Documentation\n\n{{ range .Docs }}\n\n- {{ .Title }} by @{{ .Author }} in #{{ .PR }}\n  {{ end }}\n\n### 🔧 Maintenance\n\n{{ range .Chores }}\n\n- {{ .Title }} by @{{ .Author }} in #{{ .PR }}\n  {{ end }}\n\n## New Contributors\n\n{{ range .NewContributors }}\n\n- @{{ .Username }} made their first contribution in #{{ .PR }}\n  {{ end }}\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/owner/repo/compare/v{{ .Previous }}...v{{ .Current }}\n```\n\n### Internal Release Notes\n\n```markdown\n# Release v2.1.0 - January 15, 2024\n\n## Summary\n\nThis release introduces dark mode support and improves checkout performance\nby 40%. It also includes important security updates.\n\n## Highlights\n\n### 🌙 Dark Mode\n\nUsers can now switch to dark mode from settings. The preference is\nautomatically saved and synced across devices.\n\n### ⚡ Performance\n\n- Checkout flow is 40% faster\n- Reduced bundle size by 15%\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nNone in this release.\n\n## Upgrade Guide\n\nNo special steps required. Standard deployment process applies.\n\n## Known Issues\n\n- Dark mode may flicker on initial load (fix scheduled for v2.1.1)\n\n## Dependencies Updated\n\n| Package | From    | To      | Reason                   |\n| ------- | ------- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| react   | 18.2.0  | 18.3.0  | Performance improvements |\n| lodash  | 4.17.20 | 4.17.21 | Security patch           |\n```\n\n## Commit Message Examples\n\n```bash\n# Feature with scope\nfeat(auth): add OAuth2 support for Google login\n\n# Bug fix with issue reference\nfix(checkout): resolve race condition in payment processing\n\nCloses #123\n\n# Breaking change\nfeat(api)!: change user endpoint response format\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: The user endpoint now returns `userId` instead of `id`.\nMigration guide: Update all API consumers to use the new field name.\n\n# Multiple paragraphs\nfix(database): handle connection timeouts gracefully\n\nPreviously, connection timeouts would cause the entire request to fail\nwithout retry. This change implements exponential backoff with up to\n3 retries before failing.\n\nThe timeout threshold has been increased from 5s to 10s based on p99\nlatency analysis.\n\nFixes #456\nReviewed-by: @alice\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Follow Conventional Commits** - Enables automation\n- **Write clear messages** - Future you will thank you\n- **Reference issues** - Link commits to tickets\n- **Use scopes consistently** - Define team conventions\n- **Automate releases** - Reduce manual errors\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t mix changes** - One logical change per commit\n- **Don''t skip validation** - Use commitlint\n- **Don''t manual edit** - Generated changelogs only\n- **Don''t forget breaking changes** - Mark with `!` or footer\n- **Don''t ignore CI** - Validate commits in pipeline\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/)\n- [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/)\n- [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/)\n- [semantic-release](https://semantic-release.gitbook.io/)\n- [git-cliff](https://git-cliff.org/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:26:26.322Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated changelog generation and semantic versioning management.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化变更日志生成和语义版本管理的开发代理。","ja":"自動化された変更ログの生成とセマンティックバージョニングの管理が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 변경 로그 생성 및 의미 버전 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan generación automática de registros de cambios y administración de versiones semánticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une génération automatique de journal des modifications et de gestion de version sémantique.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Änderungsprotokollgenerierung und eine semantische Versionsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de geração automática de changelog e gerenciamento de versionamento semântico.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированное создание журнала изменений и управление семантическим управлением версиями.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التطوير التي تحتاج إلى توليد سجل التغييرات الآلي وإدارة إصدارات دلالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate changelog generation, implement Conventional Commits, and manage semantic versioning using industry-standard formats and tools, supporting GitHub and GitLab release notes.","zh":"赋予代理自动化变更日志生成、实施标准提交和使用行业标准格式和工具管理语义版本的能力，支持 GitHub 和 GitLab 发布说明。","ja":"エージェントに自動化された変更ログの生成、標準的なコミットメッセージの実装、業界標準の形式とツールを使用したセマンティックバージョニングの管理機能を提供し、GitHubとGitLabのリリースノートをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 자동화된 변경 로그 생성, 표준 커밋 메시지 구현 및 산업 표준 형식 및 도구를 사용한 의미 버전 관리를 수행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며 GitHub 및 GitLab 릴리스 노트를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la generación de registros de cambios, implementar Commits Convencionales y administrar versiones semánticas utilizando formatos y herramientas estándar de la industria, con soporte para notas de lanzamiento de GitHub y GitLab.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la génération du journal des modifications, de mettre en œuvre des Commits Conventionnels et de gérer les versions sémantiques en utilisant des formats et des outils standard de l''industrie, en prenant en charge les notes de publication de GitHub et GitLab.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, die Generierung von Änderungsprotokollen zu automatisieren, konventionelle Commits umzusetzen und semantische Versionen mit Branchenstandardformaten und -tools zu verwalten, mit Unterstützung für GitHub- und GitLab-Veröffentlichungshinweise.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a geração de changelog, implementar Commits Convencionais e gerenciar versionamento semântico usando formatos e ferramentas padrão da indústria, com suporte a notas de lançamento do GitHub e GitLab.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать создание журнала изменений, реализовать Конвенциональные Коммиты и управлять семантическим управлением версиями с использованием отраслевых стандартов форматов и инструментов, поддерживающих заметки о выпуске GitHub и GitLab.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توفير توليد سجل التغييرات الآلي وتنفيذ الالتزامات التقليدية وإدارة الإصدارات الدلالية باستخدام تنسيقات وأدوات صناعية قياسية، مع دعم برای ملاحظات الإصدار GitHub و GitLab."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating changelog generation for new releases","Implementing Conventional Commits for standardized commit messages","Generating GitHub and GitLab release notes with semantic versioning"],"zh":["为新版本自动化变更日志生成","为标准化提交消息实施标准提交","使用语义版本生成 GitHub 和 GitLab 发布说明"],"ja":["新しいリリースの自動化された変更ログの生成","標準化されたコミットメッセージのためのConventional Commitsの実装","セマンティックバージョニングを使用したGitHubとGitLabのリリースノートの生成"],"ko":["새로운 릴리스를 위한 자동화된 변경 로그 생성","표준화된 커밋 메시지에 대한 컨벤셔널 커밋 구현","의미 버전을 사용한 GitHub 및 GitLab 릴리스 노트 생성"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de registros de cambios para nuevos lanzamientos","Implementar Commits Convencionales para mensajes de confirmación estandarizados","Generar notas de lanzamiento de GitHub y GitLab con versiones semánticas"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération du journal des modifications pour les nouveaux lancements","Mettre en œuvre des Commits Conventionnels pour des messages de validation standardisés","Générer des notes de publication de GitHub et GitLab avec des versions sémantiques"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Änderungsprotokollen für neue Veröffentlichungen","Umsetzung von konventionellen Commits für standardisierte Commit-Nachrichten","Erzeugen von GitHub- und GitLab-Veröffentlichungshinweisen mit semantischen Versionen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de changelog para novos lançamentos","Implementar Commits Convencionais para mensagens de commit padronizadas","Gerar notas de lançamento do GitHub e GitLab com versionamento semântico"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание журнала изменений для новых релизов","Реализовать Конвенциональные Коммиты для стандартизированных сообщений о коммите","Генерировать заметки о выпуске GitHub и GitLab с семантическим управлением версиями"],"ar":["توليد سجل التغييرات الآلي للنشرات الجديدة","تنفيذ الالتزامات التقليدية لرسائل الالتزام المعيارية","توليد ملاحظات الإصدار GitHub و GitLab مع إصدارات دلالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access","Limited to GitHub and GitLab release notes generation"],"zh":["需要 Git仓库访问权限","仅限于 GitHub 和 GitLab 发布说明生成"],"ja":["Gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","GitHubとGitLabのリリースノートの生成のみに限定される"],"ko":["Git 저장소 접근 권한이 필요","GitHub 및 GitLab 릴리스 노트 생성만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio Git","Limitado a la generación de notas de lanzamiento de GitHub y GitLab"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git","Limité à la génération de notes de publication de GitHub et GitLab"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von GitHub- und GitLab-Veröffentlichungshinweisen"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório Git","Limitado à geração de notas de lançamento do GitHub e GitLab"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию Git","Ограничен генерацией заметок о выпуске GitHub и GitLab"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع جيت","محدود بتوليد ملاحظات الإصدار GitHub و GitLab"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('shiiman/blog/blog-write', 'community', 'shiiman', 'blog', 'shiiman/blog', 'blog-write', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z', '2026-02-18T10:26:44.378Z', NULL, '{"id":"shiiman/blog/blog-write","name":"blog-write","description":{"zh":"此工具通过确认主题、结构和SEO关键词研究，生成高质量的技术博客文章","ja":"技術ブログ記事を自動生成するツール。テーマの確認、構成案の作成、SEOキーワードリサーチを実行","ko":"기술 블로그 글을 자동 생성하는 도구입니다. 주제 확인, 구조 제안, SEO 키워드 연구를 수행합니다","es":"El generador de artículos de blog técnicos crea contenido de calidad para desarrolladores. Incluye investigación de palabras clave, estructura de artículos y más.","fr":"Le générateur d''articles de blog techniques crée du contenu de qualité pour les développeurs. Il inclut la recherche de mots-clés, la structure d''articles et plus.","de":"Der technische Blogartikel-Generator erstellt hochwertigen Inhalt für Entwickler. Er umfasst Keyword-Recherche, Artikelstruktur und mehr.","pt":"O gerador de conteúdo de blog técnico é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar artigos técnicos de alta qualidade, economizando tempo e aumentando a produtividade.","ru":"Автоматический генератор технических блогов - это инструмент, который помогает создавать высококачественные технические статьи, экономя время и увеличивая производительность.","ar":"محرك إنشاء المحتوى الفني هو أداة تساعد على إنشاء مقالات فنية عالية الجودة، وتوفر الوقت وتزيد الإنتاجية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"技术博客写作工具","ja":"技術ブログ記事自動生成","ko":"기술 블로그 글쓰기 도구","es":"Generador de artículos de blog técnicos","fr":"Générateur d''articles de blog techniques","de":"Technischer Blogartikel-Generator","pt":"Gereador de Conteúdo de Blog Técnico","ru":"Автоматический генератор технических блогов","ar":"محرك إنشاء المحتوى الفني","en":"blog-write"},"description":{"zh":"此工具通过确认主题、结构和SEO关键词研究，生成高质量的技术博客文章","ja":"技術ブログ記事を自動生成するツール。テーマの確認、構成案の作成、SEOキーワードリサーチを実行","ko":"기술 블로그 글을 자동 생성하는 도구입