적화","VSCode 확장","개발 도구","소프트웨어 개발","프로젝트 관리"],"es":["ai-context-repository","diagramas de flujo de lógica","proyectos Python","extensión de vscode","arquitectura de software","flujo de datos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["ai-context-repository","diagrammes de flux de logique","projets Python","extension vscode","architecture de logiciel","flux de données","développement de logiciel","outils de développement"],"de":["ai-context-repository","Logikflussdiagramme","Python-Projekte","vscode-Erweiterung","Software-Architektur","Datenfluss","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["repositório de contexto de IA","diagramas de fluxo de lógica","projetos Python","VSCode","produtividade do desenvolvedor","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["хранилище контекста ИИ","диаграммы потока логики","проекты Python","VSCode","производительность разработчика","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مخزن السياق الاصطناعي","مخططات تدفق المنطق","مشاريع بايثون","برنامج VSCode","إنتاجية المطور","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"BenWeatherall","repo":"vscode-python-ast-extension","repoPath":"BenWeatherall/vscode-python-ast-extension","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-context-repository","description":"Guides the ai-context-writer subagent in maintaining AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md, documenting repository architecture, directory structure, component responsibilities, data flow, and extension points for the python-vis project. Use when creating or updating the repository AI context file.","bodyPreview":"# AI Context Repository Skill\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\n\r\nHelp the `ai-context-writer` subagent generate and maintain `docs/AI_CONTEXT/AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md` as the **single source of truth** for:\r\n\r\n- Overall architecture\r\n- Directory and component layout\r\n- Data flow between services\r\n- High-level extension points\r\n\r\nOther AI_CONTEXT documents (patterns, component-specific docs) should link back here for structure.\r\n\r\n## Sources to Read\r\n\r\nBefore updating the repository document, read (as appropriate)","body":"# AI Context Repository Skill\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\n\r\nHelp the `ai-context-writer` subagent generate and maintain `docs/AI_CONTEXT/AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md` as the **single source of truth** for:\r\n\r\n- Overall architecture\r\n- Directory and component layout\r\n- Data flow between services\r\n- High-level extension points\r\n\r\nOther AI_CONTEXT documents (patterns, component-specific docs) should link back here for structure.\r\n\r\n## Sources to Read\r\n\r\nBefore updating the repository document, read (as appropriate):\r\n\r\n- `@README.md` — project purpose and high-level goals\r\n- `@python_service/` — parser, models, server entry point\r\n- `@src/` — extension host, commands, integration logic\r\n- `@webview-ui/` — React + Rete webview implementation\r\n- `@tests/` — to see where tests live\r\n- `@.cursor/rules/environment.mdc` — structure and tooling expectations\r\n- Existing `@docs/AI_CONTEXT/AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md` (if present)\r\n\r\n## Required Sections in AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md\r\n\r\nAt minimum, ensure the file contains:\r\n\r\n1. **Metadata**\r\n   - Version\r\n   - Last Updated (ISO date)\r\n   - Tags (include `architecture`, `repository`)\r\n   - Cross-References to quick reference, patterns, and component-specific AI_CONTEXT docs\r\n\r\n2. **High-Level Overview**\r\n   - Goal of the system in 1–2 paragraphs\r\n   - Summary of the sidecar architecture (Python service, extension host, webview UI)\r\n\r\n3. **Directory Structure**\r\n   - An annotated tree of the most important directories:\r\n     - `python_service/`\r\n     - `src/`\r\n     - `webview-ui/`\r\n     - `tests/`\r\n     - `.cursor/`\r\n     - `_features/` (and others if relevant)\r\n\r\n4. **Component Responsibilities**\r\n   - Subsections for each major component:\r\n     - Python service\r\n     - Extension host\r\n     - Webview UI\r\n   - For each: what it does, key modules, and main responsibilities.\r\n\r\n5. **Data Flow**\r\n   - End-to-end flow from VS Code editor → extension → Python service → webview → back to editor.\r\n   - Auto-refresh flow on save.\r\n   - Error and retry flow.\r\n   - At least one **mermaid diagram** illustrating the main happy path.\r\n\r\n6. **Service Boundaries & Dependencies**\r\n   - Clarify the boundaries between:\r\n     - Python process\r\n     - Node/extension host\r\n     - Webview/browser runtime\r\n   - List key external libraries and frameworks per component.\r\n\r\n7. **Entry Points & Extension Hooks**\r\n   - Python service entry (`python_service.__main__`, `ASTParseServer`).\r\n   - Extension activation (`extension.ts`, command registration).\r\n   - Webview bootstrap (`webview-ui/src/index.tsx` and `App.tsx`).\r\n   - Guidance on where to plug in:\r\n     - New AST node visitors\r\n     - New webview messages\r\n     - New VS Code commands\r\n\r\n## Style & Constraints\r\n\r\n- Keep the document **architectural**, not tutorial-style.\r\n- Use **semantic headings** and short paragraphs.\r\n- Prefer diagrams and structured lists over long prose.\r\n- Avoid management or roadmap content; focus purely on **how the system is structured today**.\r\n- Keep under the content length limit; if it grows too large:\r\n  - Split into sub-documents (e.g. `AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY/`) per `content_length` rules.\r\n  - Provide an index with links and one-line descriptions.\r\n\r\n## Update Strategy\r\n\r\nWhen the project structure or flow changes:\r\n\r\n1. Update the directory tree to match the real repository.\r\n2. Adjust component responsibilities and data flow descriptions.\r\n3. Refresh diagrams to reflect new paths or services.\r\n4. Bump version/last-updated metadata.\r\n5. Ensure cross-references to component-specific docs remain valid.\r\n\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:27:07.733Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced data visualization and documentation capabilities for their AI context repository.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据可视化和文档能力的Python分析代理，以满足其AI上下文存储库的需求。","ja":"Python分析エージェントに高度なデータ可視化とドキュメント機能が必要な場合に適しています。AIコンテキストリポジトリの機能を活用できます。","ko":"고급 데이터 시각화 및 문서 기능이 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다. AI 컨텍스트 저장소의 기능을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos avanzados y documentación para su repositorio de contexto de IA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python ayant besoin de capacités de visualisation de données avancées et de documentation pour leur référentiel de contexte d''IA.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Datenvisualisierungs- und Dokumentationsfunktionen für ihr IA-Kontext-Repository benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de dados e documentação para o repositório de contexto de IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым требуются продвинутые возможности визуализации данных и документации для хранилища контекста ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى возможности متقدمة لتصور البيانات وتوثيق لمستودع سياق الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and maintain detailed data flow diagrams, similar to Unreal Engine''s Blueprints, for Python projects, utilizing Markdown files like `AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md` and linking to other component-specific documents for a unified structure.","zh":"赋予代理生成和维护Python项目的详细数据流程图的能力，类似于虚幻引擎的蓝图，利用Markdown文件，如`AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md`，并链接到其他组件特定文档，以实现统一结构。","ja":"エージェントがPythonプロジェクト用の詳細なデータフローダイアグラムを生成および維持できるようにします。Unreal Engineのブループリントに似たもので、Markdownファイル（例： `AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md`）を利用し、他のコンポーネント固有のドキュメントにリンクして統一された構造を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Python 프로젝트를 위한詳細한 데이터 흐름 다이어그램을 생성하고 유지할 수 있도록 합니다. 언리얼 엔진의 블루프린트와 유사한 기능으로, Markdown 파일을 활용하여(`AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md`와 같은 파일) 다른 구성 요소 특정 문서에 연결하여統一된 구조를 구현할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y mantener diagramas de flujo de datos detallados, similares a los Blueprints de Unreal Engine, para proyectos de Python, utilizando archivos Markdown como `AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md` y enlazando a otros documentos específicos de componentes para una estructura unificada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de maintenir des diagrammes de flux de données détaillés, similaires aux Blueprints d''Unreal Engine, pour les projets Python, en utilisant des fichiers Markdown tels que `AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md` et en lien avec d''autres documents spécifiques aux composants pour une structure unifiée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, detaillierte Datenflussdiagramme zu generieren und zu pflegen, ähnlich wie Unreal Engines Blueprints, für Python-Projekte, unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien wie `AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md` und verlinkt mit anderen komponentenspezifischen Dokumenten für eine einheitliche Struktur.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e manter diagramas de fluxo de dados detalhados, semelhantes aos Blueprints do Unreal Engine, para projetos Python, utilizando arquivos Markdown como `AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md` e ligando a outros documentos específicos de componentes para uma estrutura unificada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и поддерживать подробные диаграммы потока данных, аналогичные Blueprints Unreal Engine, для проектов Python, используя файлы Markdown, такие как `AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md`, и связывая их с другими документами, специфичными для компонентов, для единой структуры.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء وضبط رسومات تدفق البيانات المفصلة، 类似 إلى مخططات Unreal Engine Blueprints، لمشاريع بايثون، باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل `AI_CONTEXT_REPOSITORY.md` وربطها bằng مستندات مكونات محددة لمخطط موحد."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation updates for AI context repository","Generating data flow diagrams for Python projects","Maintaining a single source of truth for overall architecture and component layout"],"zh":["自动更新AI上下文存储库的文档","为Python项目生成数据流程图","维护整个架构和组件布局的单一真实来源"],"ja":["AIコンテキストリポジトリのドキュメントを自動更新する","Pythonプロジェクト用のデータフローダイアグラムを生成する","全体のアーキテクチャとコンポーネントレイアウトの単一の真実源を維持する"],"ko":["AI 컨텍스트 저장소의 문서를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","Python 프로젝트를 위한 데이터 흐름 다이어그램을 생성하는 것","전체 아키텍처와 구성 요소 레이아웃의 단일한 진실된 출처를 유지하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de documentación para el repositorio de contexto de IA","Generar diagramas de flujo de datos para proyectos de Python","Mantener una sola fuente de verdad para la arquitectura general y el diseño de componentes"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de documentation pour le référentiel de contexte d''IA","Générer des diagrammes de flux de données pour les projets Python","Maintenir une seule source de vérité pour l''architecture générale et la disposition des composants"],"de":["Automatisieren von Dokumentenaktualisierungen für das IA-Kontext-Repository","Generieren von Datenflussdiagrammen für Python-Projekte","Beibehalten einer einzigen Wahrheitsquelle für die allgemeine Architektur und die Komponentenlayout"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação para o repositório de contexto de IA","Gerar diagramas de fluxo de dados para projetos Python","Manter uma única fonte de verdade para a arquitetura geral e layout de componentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации для хранилища контекста ИИ","Генерировать диаграммы потока данных для проектов Python","Поддерживать единую истину для общей архитектуры и разметки компонентов"],"ar":["أتمتة تحديثات توثيق لمستودع سياق الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء مخططات تدفق البيانات لمشاريع بايثون","الحفاظ على مصدر وحيد للحقيقة لمخطط عام وترتيب المكونات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VSCode extension installation","Python project compatibility only","Manual reading of sources required before updating the repository document"],"zh":["需要安装VSCode扩展","仅兼容Python项目","更新存储库文档之前需要手动阅读源代码"],"ja":["VSCode拡張機能のインストールが必要","Pythonプロジェクトのみとの互換性","リポジトリドキュメントを更新する前にソースを手動で読む必要がある"],"ko":["VSCode 확장 프로그램 설치가 필요함","Python 프로젝트만과 호환됨","저장소 문서를 업데이트하기 전에 소스를 수동으로 읽어야 함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la extensión de VSCode","Compatibilidad solo con proyectos de Python","Lectura manual de las fuentes requerida antes de actualizar el documento del repositorio"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''extension VSCode","Compatibilité uniquement avec les projets Python","Lecture manuelle des sources requise avant de mettre à jour le document du référentiel"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der VSCode-Erweiterung","Kompatibilität nur mit Python-Projekten","Manuelle Lektüre der Quellen erforderlich, bevor das Repository-Dokument aktualisiert wird"],"pt":["Requer instalação da extensão do VSCode","Compatibilidade apenas com projetos Python","Leitura manual das fontes necessária antes de atualizar o documento do repositório"],"ru":["Требуется установка расширения VSCode","Совместимость только с проектами Python","Требуется ручное чтение источников перед обновлением документа хранилища"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ملحق VSCode","توافق فقط مع مشاريع بايثون","يتطلب قراءة يدوية للمصادر قبل تحديث وثيقة المستودع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
