ektur der NEXAFS-Datenbank","Informierte Entscheidungen mit ADRs","Berücksichtigung der Langzeit-Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Design de sistemas escaláveis","Arquitetura de sistemas distribuídos","Tomada de decisões informadas","Documentação de decisões com ADRs","Consideração da manutenção a longo prazo"],"ru":["Проектирование масштабируемых систем","Архитектура распределенных систем","Принятие обоснованных решений","Документирование решений с помощью ADRs","Учет долгосрочной поддержки"],"ar":["تصميم الأنظمة القابلة للتوسعة","هندسة الأنظمة الموزعة","اتخاذ قرارات مدروسة","توثيق القرارات باستخدام ADRs","الاعتبار الصيانة على المدى الطويل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["架构设计师","系统设计","设计模式","架构决策","分布式系统","云架构","NEXAFS数据库"],"ja":["アーキテクチャデザイナー","システム設計","デザインパターン","アーキテクチャの意思決定","分散システム","クラウドアーキテクチャ","NEXAFSデータベース"],"ko":["아키텍처 디자이너","시스템 디자인","디자인 패턴","아키텍처 결정","분산 시스템","클라우드 아키텍처","NEXAFS 데이터베이스"],"es":["diseñador de arquitectura","aplicaciones web de base de datos","NEXAFS","sistemas escalables","patrones de diseño","arquitectura de bases de datos","tomar decisiones informadas","mantenibilidad a largo plazo"],"fr":["concepteur d''architecture","applications web de base de données","NEXAFS","systèmes évolutifs","modèles de conception","architecture de bases de données","prise de décisions éclairées","maintenabilité à long terme"],"de":["Architektur-Designer","Webanwendungen der Datenbank","NEXAFS","skalierbare Systeme","Entwurfsmuster","Architektur der Datenbank","informierte Entscheidungen","Langzeit-Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["arquitetura de sistemas","design de sistemas","sistemas escaláveis","sistemas distribuídos","tomada de decisões","ADR","manutenção a longo prazo"],"ru":["системный дизайн","проектирование систем","масштабируемые системы","распределенные системы","принятие решений","ADR","долгосрочная поддержка"],"ar":["هندسة النظام","تصميم الأنظمة","الأنظمة القابلة للتوسعة","الأنظمة الموزعة","اتخاذ القرارات","ADR","الصيانة على المدى الطويل"]}},"owner":"WSU-Carbon-Lab","repo":"xray-atlas","repoPath":"WSU-Carbon-Lab/xray-atlas","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architecture-designer","description":"Use when designing new system architecture, reviewing existing designs, or making architectural decisions. Invoke for system design, architecture review, design patterns, ADRs, scalability planning.","bodyPreview":"# Architecture Designer\n\nSenior software architect specializing in system design, design patterns, and architectural decision-making.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a principal architect with 15+ years of experience designing scalable systems. You specialize in distributed systems, cloud architecture, and making pragmatic trade-offs. You document decisions with ADRs and consider long-term maintainability.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing new system architecture\n- Choosing between architectu","body":"# Architecture Designer\n\nSenior software architect specializing in system design, design patterns, and architectural decision-making.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a principal architect with 15+ years of experience designing scalable systems. You specialize in distributed systems, cloud architecture, and making pragmatic trade-offs. You document decisions with ADRs and consider long-term maintainability.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing new system architecture\n- Choosing between architectural patterns\n- Reviewing existing architecture\n- Creating Architecture Decision Records (ADRs)\n- Planning for scalability\n- Evaluating technology choices\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Understand requirements** - Functional, non-functional, constraints\n2. **Identify patterns** - Match requirements to architectural patterns\n3. **Design** - Create architecture with trade-offs documented\n4. **Document** - Write ADRs for key decisions\n5. **Review** - Validate with stakeholders\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Architecture Patterns | `references/architecture-patterns.md` | Choosing monolith vs microservices |\n| ADR Template | `references/adr-template.md` | Documenting decisions |\n| System Design | `references/system-design.md` | Full system design template |\n| Database Selection | `references/database-selection.md` | Choosing database technology |\n| NFR Checklist | `references/nfr-checklist.md` | Gathering non-functional requirements |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Document all significant decisions with ADRs\n- Consider non-functional requirements explicitly\n- Evaluate trade-offs, not just benefits\n- Plan for failure modes\n- Consider operational complexity\n- Review with stakeholders before finalizing\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Over-engineer for hypothetical scale\n- Choose technology without evaluating alternatives\n- Ignore operational costs\n- Design without understanding requirements\n- Skip security considerations\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen designing architecture, provide:\n1. Requirements summary (functional + non-functional)\n2. High-level architecture diagram\n3. Key decisions with trade-offs (ADR format)\n4. Technology recommendations with rationale\n5. Risks and mitigation strategies\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nDistributed systems, microservices, event-driven architecture, CQRS, DDD, CAP theorem, cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure), containers, Kubernetes, message queues, caching, database design\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **Fullstack Guardian** - Implementing designs\n- **DevOps Engineer** - Infrastructure implementation\n- **Secure Code Guardian** - Security architecture\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:27:01.168Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents specializing in scientific data system architecture and distributed cloud design.","zh":"适用于专门从事科学数据系统架构和分布式云设计的AI代理。","ja":"科学データシステムアーキテクチャと分散クラウド設計を専門とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"과학 데이터 시스템 아키텍처 및 분산 클라우드 설계를 전문으로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA especializados en arquitectura de sistemas de datos científicos y diseño de nube distribuida.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA spécialisés dans l''architecture des systèmes de données scientifiques et la conception de cloud distribuée.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die auf wissenschaftliche Daten-Systemarchitektur und verteilte Cloud-Design spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Ideal for AI Agents specializing in scientific data system architecture and distributed cloud design.","ru":"Ideal for AI Agents specializing in scientific data system architecture and distributed cloud design.","ar":"Ideal for AI Agents specializing in scientific data system architecture and distributed cloud design."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to generate scalable distributed system architectures with ADR documentation and pragmatic trade-off analysis. Provides expertise in cloud-native patterns for scientific data applications like NEXAFS databases.","zh":"使代理能够生成可扩展的分布式系统架构，具有ADR文档和务实的权衡分析。为科学数据应用程序（如NEXAFS数据库）提供云原生模式的专业知识。","ja":"エージェントが拡張可能な分散システムアーキテクチャを生成できるようにし、ADR文書と実用的なトレードオフ分析を提供します。NEXAFSデータベースなどの科学データアプリケーション向けのクラウドネイティブパターンの専門知識を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 확장 가능한 분산 시스템 아키텍처를 생성할 수 있도록 하며 ADR 문서 및 실용적인 트레이드 오프 분석을 제공합니다. NEXAFS 데이터베이스와 같은 과학 데이터 애플리케이션을 위한 클라우드 네이티브 패턴에 대한 전문 知識을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar arquitecturas de sistemas distribuidos escalables con documentación ADR y análisis de compensaciones pragmáticas. Proporciona experiencia en patrones nativos de la nube para aplicaciones de datos científicos como bases de datos NEXAFS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des architectures de systèmes distribués évolutives avec une documentation ADR et une analyse de compromis pragmatique. Fournit une expertise dans les modèles natifs de cloud pour les applications de données scientifiques comme les bases de données NEXAFS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, skalierbare verteilte Systemarchitekturen mit ADR-Dokumentation und pragmatischer Trade-off-Analyse zu generieren. Bietet Expertenwissen in cloud-nativen Mustern für wissenschaftliche Datenanwendungen wie NEXAFS-Datenbanken.","pt":"Enables agents to generate scalable distributed system architectures with ADR documentation and pragmatic trade-off analysis. Provides expertise in cloud-native patterns for scientific data applications like NEXAFS databases.","ru":"Enables agents to generate scalable distributed system architectures with ADR documentation and pragmatic trade-off analysis. Provides expertise in cloud-native patterns for scientific data applications like NEXAFS databases.","ar":"Enables agents to generate scalable distributed system architectures with ADR documentation and pragmatic trade-off analysis. Provides expertise in cloud-native patterns for scientific data applications like NEXAFS databases."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing distributed NEXAFS database architectures","Creating ADR documentation for system decisions","Evaluating cloud deployment trade-offs for scientific applications","Optimizing X-ray data processing pipelines"],"zh":["设计分布式NEXAFS数据库架构","创建系统决策的ADR文档","评估科学应用程序的云部署权衡","优化X射线数据处理管道"],"ja":["分散NEXAFSデータベースアーキテクチャの設計","システムの決定のためのADR文書の作成","科学アプリケーションのクラウドデプロイのトレードオフの評価","X線データ処理パイプラインの最適化"],"ko":["분산 NEXAFS 데이터베이스 아키텍처 설계","시스템 결정의 ADR 문서 생성","과학 애플리케이션의 클라우드 배포 트레이드 오프 평가","X선 데이터 처리 파이프라인 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de bases de datos NEXAFS distribuidas","Crear documentación ADR para decisiones del sistema","Evaluar compensaciones de implementación en la nube para aplicaciones científicas","Optimizar tuberías de procesamiento de datos de rayos X"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures de bases de données NEXAFS distribuées","Créer une documentation ADR pour les décisions du système","Évaluer les compromis de déploiement cloud pour les applications scientifiques","Optimiser les pipelines de traitement de données de rayons X"],"de":["Entwerfen von verteilten NEXAFS-Datenbankarchitekturen","Erstellen von ADR-Dokumentation für Systementscheidungen","Bewerten von Cloud-Bereitstellungs-Trade-offs für wissenschaftliche Anwendungen","Optimieren von X-Ray-Datenverarbeitungspipelines"],"pt":["Designing distributed NEXAFS database architectures","Creating ADR documentation for system decisions","Evaluating cloud deployment trade-offs for scientific applications","Optimizing X-ray data processing pipelines"],"ru":["Designing distributed NEXAFS database architectures","Creating ADR documentation for system decisions","Evaluating cloud deployment trade-offs for scientific applications","Optimizing X-ray data processing pipelines"],"ar":["Designing distributed NEXAFS database architectures","Creating ADR documentation for system decisions","Evaluating cloud deployment trade-offs for scientific applications","Optimizing X-ray data processing pipelines"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of scientific data domain","Focuses on architectural patterns rather than implementation code","Assumes existing system requirements definition"],"zh":["需要了解科学数据领域","关注架构模式而不是实现代码","假设现有的系统需求定义"],"ja":["科学データドメインの理解が必要","実装コードではなくアーキテクチャパターンに焦点を当てている","既存のシステム要件定義を前提としている"],"ko":["과학 데이터 도메인에 대한 이해가 필요","구현 코드가 아닌 아키텍처 패턴에 중점을 둠","既存의 시스템 요구 사항 정의를 가정"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del dominio de datos científicos","Se centra en patrones arquitectónicos en lugar de código de implementación","Supone una definición existente de requisitos del sistema"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du domaine des données scientifiques","Se concentre sur les modèles architecturaux plutôt que sur le code d''implémentation","Suppose une définition existante des exigences du système"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis des wissenschaftlichen Datenbereichs","Konzentriert sich auf Architekturmuster anstatt Implementierungscode","Geht von einer vorhandenen Systemanforderungsdefinition aus"],"pt":["Requires understanding of scientific data domain","Focuses on architectural patterns rather than implementation code","Assumes existing system requirements definition"],"ru":["Requires understanding of scientific data domain","Focuses on architectural patterns rather than implementation code","Assumes existing system requirements definition"],"ar":["Requires understanding of scientific data domain","Focuses on architectural patterns rather than implementation code","Assumes existing system requirements definition"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
