fleet地图可视化、地址自动补全和地理编码等功能","ja":"EquipQRはGoogle Mapsを使用してフリートマップの可視化、住所の自動補完、地理コードなどを実現","ko":"EquipQR는 Google Maps를 사용하여 플릿 맵 시각화, 주소 자동 완성, 지리 코드 등을 구현","es":"La integración de Google Maps en EquipQR permite visualizar mapas de flotas, autocompletar direcciones y geocodificar ubicaciones.","fr":"L''intégration de Google Maps dans EquipQR permet de visualiser des cartes de flottes, d''auto-compléter des adresses et de géocoder des emplacements.","de":"Die Integration von Google Maps in EquipQR ermöglicht die Visualisierung von Flottenkarten, die Autovervollständigung von Adressen und die Geocodierung von S...","pt":"A EquipQR usa o Google Maps para visualização de mapa de frota, preenchimento automático de endereços e geocodificação","ru":"EquipQR использует Google Maps для визуализации карты флота, автозаполнения адресов и геокодирования","ar":"تستخدم EquipQR خرائط جوجل لتصوير خريطة الأسطول وكتابة العناوين تلقائيًا والتعريف الجغرافي","en":"Manage the history of work on your fleet service equipment using secure, sharable QR codes."},"definition":{"en":"Manage the history of work on your fleet service equipment using secure, sharable QR codes."},"features":{"zh":["fleet地图可视化","地址自动补全","地理编码","安全、可分享的QR码","前端hooks/components","服务器端Supabase Edge Functions"],"ja":["フリートマップの可視化","住所の自動補完","地理コード","セキュアで共有可能なQRコード","フロントエンドhooks/components","サーバーサイドSupabase Edge Functions"],"ko":["플릿 맵 시각화","주소 자동 완성","지리 코드","안전하고 공유 가능한 QR 코드","프론트엔드 hooks/components","서버 사이드 Supabase Edge Functions"],"es":["Visualización de mapas de flotas","Autocompletado de direcciones","Geocodificación de ubicaciones","Integración con Supabase Edge Functions","Uso de claves de API de Google Maps","Compatibilidad con dispositivos móviles"],"fr":["Visualisation de cartes de flottes","Auto-complétion d''adresses","Géocodage d''emplacements","Intégration avec Supabase Edge Functions","Utilisation de clés d''API de Google Maps","Compatibilité avec les appareils mobiles"],"de":["Visualisierung von Flottenkarten","Autovervollständigung von Adressen","Geocodierung von Standorten","Integration mit Supabase Edge Functions","Verwendung von Google Maps-API-Schlüsseln","Kompatibilität mit mobilen Geräten"],"pt":["Visualização de mapa de frota","Preenchimento automático de endereços","Geocodificação","Integração com Supabase Edge Functions","Uso de hooks e componentes no frontend","Segurança com QR codes compartilháveis"],"ru":["Визуализация карты флота","Автозаполнение адресов","Геокодирование","Интеграция с Supabase Edge Functions","Использование хуков и компонентов на frontend","Безопасность с помощью QR-кодов для обмена"],"ar":["تصوير خريطة الأسطول","كتابة العناوين تلقائيًا","التعريف الجغرافي","التكامل مع Supabase Edge Functions","استخدام Hooks و المكونات في واجهة المستخدم","الأمان مع رموز QR قابلة للمشاركة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Google Maps集成","fleet服务设备管理","安全QR码","地理编码","地址自动补全","Supabase Edge Functions"],"ja":["Google Maps統合","フリートサービスの効率","セキュアQRコード","地理コード","住所の自動補完","Supabase Edge Functions"],"ko":["Google Maps 통합","플릿 서비스 장비 관리","안전 QR 코드","지리 코드","주소 자동 완성","Supabase Edge Functions"],"es":["integración de Google Maps","EquipQR","mapas de flotas","autocompletado de direcciones","geocodificación","Supabase Edge Functions","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","API de Google Maps"],"fr":["intégration de Google Maps","EquipQR","cartes de flottes","auto-complétion d''adresses","géocodage","Supabase Edge Functions","développement d''applications mobiles","API de Google Maps"],"de":["Google Maps-Integration","EquipQR","Flottenkarten","Autovervollständigung von Adressen","Geocodierung","Supabase Edge Functions","Mobile App-Entwicklung","Google Maps-API"],"pt":["integração google maps","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","fleet service","geocodificação","supabase edge functions","segurança qr code","desenvolvedores","tecnologia de localização"],"ru":["интеграция google maps","разработка приложений","флотское обслуживание","геокодирование","supabase edge functions","безопасность qr-код","разработчики","технология местоположения"],"ar":["تكامل خرائط جوجل","تطوير التطبيقات","خدمة الأسطول","التعريف الجغرافي","supabase edge functions","أمان رمز qr","المطورين","تكنولوجيا الموقع"]}},"owner":"Columbia-Cloudworks-LLC","repo":"EquipQR","repoPath":"Columbia-Cloudworks-LLC/EquipQR","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"google-maps","description":"Expert guide for developing, debugging, and extending Google Maps integration in EquipQR. Use when working with maps, geocoding, places autocomplete, location features, fleet map, Google Maps API keys, or address components. Also use when the user mentions google maps, geocode, fleet map, places autocomplete, map marker, address picker, or location.","bodyPreview":"# Google Maps Integration — EquipQR\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\nEquipQR uses Google Maps for three main features: **Fleet Map** visualization, **Places Autocomplete** address picking, and **Geocoding**. The integration spans frontend hooks/components and server-side Supabase Edge Functions.\n\n```\nBrowser                                    Supabase Edge Functions\n───────                                    ──────────────────────\nuseGoogleMapsKey ──→ public-google-maps-key ──→ GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY","body":"# Google Maps Integration — EquipQR\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\nEquipQR uses Google Maps for three main features: **Fleet Map** visualization, **Places Autocomplete** address picking, and **Geocoding**. The integration spans frontend hooks/components and server-side Supabase Edge Functions.\n\n```\nBrowser                                    Supabase Edge Functions\n───────                                    ──────────────────────\nuseGoogleMapsKey ──→ public-google-maps-key ──→ GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY\nuseGoogleMapsLoader ──→ Google Maps JS API (loads <script> with browser key)\nGooglePlacesAutocomplete ──→ PlaceAutocompleteElement (web component)\n                         └─→ places-autocomplete edge fn (fallback) ──→ GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY\nMapView (GoogleMap) ──→ @react-google-maps/api\nClickableAddress ──→ maps.google.com deep link\ngeocode-location edge fn ──→ GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY + geocoded_locations cache\n```\n\n## API Keys\n\nTwo separate keys with different restrictions:\n\n| Key | Env Var | Where Set | Used By |\n|-----|---------|-----------|---------|\n| **Browser key** | `GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY` | Supabase Edge Function secrets | `public-google-maps-key` → served to browser |\n| **Server key** | `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY` | Supabase Edge Function secrets | `geocode-location`, `places-autocomplete` |\n\n**Local development**: Set both in `supabase/functions/.env` (NOT the root `.env`).\n\n**Production**: Set in Supabase Dashboard → Project → Settings → Edge Functions → Secrets.\n\n**Important**: These are NOT Vercel env vars. Redeploying on Vercel does not affect these secrets.\n\n### Legacy key names (still supported with fallback)\n\n| Legacy Name | New Canonical Name |\n|---|---|\n| `VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY` | `GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY` |\n| `GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY` | `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY` |\n| `VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY` | `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY` |\n\nAll edge functions prefer the new name and fall back to legacy names.\n\n## Frontend Components & Hooks\n\n### `useGoogleMapsKey` (`src/hooks/useGoogleMapsKey.ts`)\n\nFetches the browser API key from the `public-google-maps-key` edge function. Returns `{ googleMapsKey, isLoading, error, retry }`.\n\n### `useGoogleMapsLoader` (`src/hooks/useGoogleMapsLoader.ts`)\n\n**Singleton** Google Maps JS API loader. Ensures the `<script>` tag is loaded exactly once across all components. Returns `{ isLoaded, loadError, googleMapsKey, isKeyLoading, keyError, retry }`.\n\n**Always use this hook** — never load the Maps JS API manually.\n\n### `GooglePlacesAutocomplete` (`src/components/ui/GooglePlacesAutocomplete.tsx`)\n\nAddress picker with three-tier fallback strategy:\n1. **Web component** — `PlaceAutocompleteElement` (Google''s native widget)\n2. **Edge function** — `places-autocomplete` edge function proxy (if web component fails, e.g. Places API New not enabled)\n3. **Plain text** — simple text input fallback\n\nProps: `{ value, onPlaceSelect, onClear, placeholder, disabled, className, isLoaded }`.\n\nReturns `PlaceLocationData`: `{ formatted_address, street, city, state, country, lat, lng }`.\n\n### `MapView` (`src/features/fleet-map/components/MapView.tsx`)\n\nFleet map component using `@react-google-maps/api` (`GoogleMap`, `MarkerF`, `InfoWindowF`). Renders colored markers by location source (team, equipment, scan, geocoded) and star markers for team HQ locations.\n\n### `ClickableAddress` (`src/components/ui/ClickableAddress.tsx`)\n\nRenders an address as a link that opens Google Maps.\n\n## Edge Functions\n\n### `public-google-maps-key`\n\n- **Purpose**: Serve the browser API key to authenticated users\n- **Auth**: JWT required (`verify_jwt = true`)\n- **Key**: `GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY`\n- **Pattern**: User-scoped client with `requireUser`\n\n### `geocode-location`\n\n- **Purpose**: Geocode addresses with caching in `geocoded_locations` table\n- **Auth**: JWT + org membership verification\n- **Key**: `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY`\n- **Rate limit**: 30 cache misses per org per minute\n- **Cache**: `geocoded_locations` table (upsert on `organization_id, normalized_text`)\n- **Input normalization**: lowercase, trim, collapse whitespace\n\n### `places-autocomplete`\n\n- **Purpose**: Proxy Google Places Autocomplete and Details APIs\n- **Auth**: JWT required\n- **Key**: `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY`\n- **Actions**: `autocomplete` (predictions) and `details` (structured address)\n- **Validation**: Zod discriminated union schema\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Adding a new map feature\n\n1. Use `useGoogleMapsLoader` to get `isLoaded` state\n2. Only render Google Maps components when `isLoaded === true`\n3. Handle `loadError` and `keyError` gracefully with error boundaries\n\n```tsx\nimport { useGoogleMapsLoader } from ''@/hooks/useGoogleMapsLoader'';\n\nfunction MyMapFeature() {\n  const { isLoaded, loadError, retry } = useGoogleMapsLoader();\n  \n  if (loadError) return <ErrorState onRetry={retry} />;\n  if (!isLoaded) return <Skeleton />;\n  \n  return <GoogleMap /* ... */ />;\n}\n```\n\n### Using the address picker\n\n```tsx\nimport GooglePlacesAutocomplete, { PlaceLocationData } from ''@/components/ui/GooglePlacesAutocomplete'';\nimport { useGoogleMapsLoader } from ''@/hooks/useGoogleMapsLoader'';\n\nfunction AddressField() {\n  const { isLoaded } = useGoogleMapsLoader();\n  \n  const handlePlaceSelect = (data: PlaceLocationData) => {\n    // data.formatted_address, data.street, data.city, \n    // data.state, data.country, data.lat, data.lng\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <GooglePlacesAutocomplete\n      isLoaded={isLoaded}\n      onPlaceSelect={handlePlaceSelect}\n      placeholder=\"Enter address...\"\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Geocoding an address server-side\n\nCall the `geocode-location` edge function:\n\n```ts\nconst { data, error } = await supabase.functions.invoke(''geocode-location'', {\n  body: { organizationId: orgId, input: addressString }\n});\n// data: { lat, lng, formatted_address } or { lat: null, lng: null }\n```\n\n### Adding a new Edge Function that uses Google Maps\n\n1. Use the `edge-function-creator` skill to scaffold the function\n2. Read the server key: `Deno.env.get(\"GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY\")`\n3. Always fall back to legacy names: `|| Deno.env.get(\"GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY\")`\n4. Never expose the server key in responses — only return processed data\n\n## Debugging\n\n### \"Map Configuration Error\" toast\n\nThe browser key fetch failed. Check:\n1. `GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY` is set in Supabase Edge Function secrets\n2. The `public-google-maps-key` function is deployed\n3. The user is authenticated (JWT required)\n\n### Places autocomplete not showing results\n\n1. Check if web component mode failed (console: `AutocompletePlaces blocked`)\n2. The component auto-falls-back to edge function mode\n3. Verify `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY` is set in Supabase secrets\n4. Check the `places-autocomplete` edge function logs\n\n### Geocoding returns `{ lat: null, lng: null }`\n\n1. Address may be unresolvable — check raw address string\n2. Rate limit may be exceeded (30/min/org) — check for 429 responses\n3. Verify `GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY` is valid and has Geocoding API enabled\n\n### Fleet map markers not appearing\n\n1. Confirm `isLoaded` is true before rendering `<GoogleMap>`\n2. Check that equipment has valid `lat`/`lng` coordinates\n3. Verify the location source in `EquipmentLocation.source` field\n\n## Google Cloud Console requirements\n\nThe project requires these APIs enabled:\n\n| API | Used By |\n|-----|---------|\n| Maps JavaScript API | Fleet map, web component autocomplete |\n| Places API | Web component autocomplete |\n| Places API (Legacy) | `places-autocomplete` edge function |\n| Geocoding API | `geocode-location` edge function |\n\nBrowser key restrictions should allow the app''s domain(s). Server key should have no referrer restrictions (IP restrictions recommended).\n\n## Key files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `src/hooks/useGoogleMapsKey.ts` | Fetch browser API key from edge function |\n| `src/hooks/useGoogleMapsLoader.ts` | Singleton Maps JS API loader |\n| `src/components/ui/GooglePlacesAutocomplete.tsx` | Address picker component |\n| `src/components/ui/ClickableAddress.tsx` | Address → Google Maps link |\n| `src/features/fleet-map/components/MapView.tsx` | Fleet map with markers |\n| `src/features/fleet-map/pages/FleetMap.tsx` | Fleet map page |\n| `src/features/fleet-map/components/FleetMapErrorBoundary.tsx` | Map error boundary |\n| `src/utils/effectiveLocation.ts` | Location resolution + Maps URL builder |\n| `src/services/placesAutocompleteService.ts` | Edge function client for places |\n| `supabase/functions/public-google-maps-key/index.ts` | Browser key edge function |\n| `supabase/functions/geocode-location/index.ts` | Geocoding edge function |\n| `supabase/functions/places-autocomplete/index.ts` | Places proxy edge function |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:27:07.422Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Location-Based Service Agents needing advanced geospatial data visualization and management capabilities with Google Maps","zh":"非常适合需要高级地理空间数据可视化和管理能力的基于位置的服务代理，特别是与Google Maps集成","ja":"ロケーションベースのサービスエージェントに適したGoogle Mapsを使用した高度な地理空間データの可視化および管理機能","ko":"고급 지리공간 데이터 시각화 및 관리 기능이 필요한 위치 기반 서비스 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 Google Maps와의 통합에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de servicios basados en ubicación que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de visualización y gestión de datos geoespaciales con Google Maps","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de services basés sur la localisation nécessitant des capacités de visualisation et de gestion de données géospatiales avancées avec Google Maps","de":"Perfekt für Standort-basierte Serviceagenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Visualisierung und Verwaltung georäumlicher Daten mit Google Maps benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Serviço Baseados em Localização que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização e gerenciamento de dados geoespaciais com o Google Maps","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов служб, основанных на местоположении, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации и управления геопространственными данными с помощью Google Maps","ar":"مثالي لعميل خدمة قائم على الموقع الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصور البيانات الجغرافية المكانية وإدارتها مع خرائط جوجل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to visualize fleet service equipment on a Fleet Map, utilize Places Autocomplete for address picking, and leverage Geocoding for precise location data, all integrated with Supabase Edge Functions and secured through sharable QR codes using GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY","zh":"赋予代理商在车队地图上可视化车队服务设备、利用地点自动完成进行地址选择，并利用地理编码进行精确位置数据分析的能力，所有这些功能都与Supabase Edge Functions集成，并通过使用GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY的可共享二维码进行安全保护","ja":"エージェントが車隊マップ上で車隊サービス機器を可視化し、Places Autocompleteを使用して住所を選択し、Geocodingを使用して正確な位置データを取得する機能を提供します。これらすべての機能はSupabase Edge Functionsと統合されており、GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEYを使用した共有可能なQRコードでセキュアに保護されています","ko":"에이전트가 플릿 맵에서 플릿 서비스 장비를 시각화하고, Places Autocomplete를 사용하여 주소를 선택하고, Geocoding을 사용하여 정확한 위치 데이터를 분석할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 모든 기능은 Supabase Edge Functions와 통합되고, GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY를 사용하는 공유 가능한 QR 코드로 보안이 보호됩니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a visualizar el equipo de servicio de flota en un mapa de flota, utilizar Autocompletar de lugares para seleccionar direcciones y aprovechar la geocodificación para obtener datos de ubicación precisos, todo integrado con Supabase Edge Functions y seguro a través de códigos QR compartibles utilizando GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY","fr":"Permet aux agents de visualiser les équipements de service de flotte sur une carte de flotte, d''utiliser Autocomplétion des lieux pour sélectionner des adresses et de tirer parti de la géocodification pour obtenir des données de localisation précises, le tout intégré à Supabase Edge Functions et sécurisé via des codes QR partagés en utilisant GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Service-Flottenausrüstung auf einer Flottenkarte zu visualisieren, Places-Autocomplete für die Adressauswahl zu nutzen und Geocoding für präzise Standortdaten zu verwenden, all dies integriert mit Supabase Edge Functions und gesichert durch teilebare QR-Codes unter Verwendung von GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY","pt":"Habilita os agentes a visualizar equipamentos de serviço de frota em um Mapa de Frota, utilizar Places Autocomplete para seleção de endereços e aproveitar Geocoding para dados de localização precisos, todos integrados com Funções de Borda Supabase e protegidos por meio de códigos QR compartilháveis usando GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью визуализировать оборудование службы флота на Карте флота, использовать Places Autocomplete для выбора адресов и использовать Geocoding для точных данных о местоположении, все интегрированное с функциями Supabase Edge и защищенное с помощью делегированных кодов QR с использованием GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصور معدات خدمة الأسطول على خريطة الأسطول، واستخدام Places Autocomplete لتحديد العناوين، وتحقيق.Geocoding لعرض بيانات الموقع الدقيقة، وكلها متكاملة مع دوال حافة Supabase وأمنها من خلال رموز QR القابلة للمشاركة باستخدام GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY"},"useCases":{"en":["Visualizing fleet service equipment locations on a map","Automating address picking with Places Autocomplete","Geocoding equipment locations for precise data analysis"],"zh":["在地图上可视化车队服务设备位置","使用Places Autocomplete自动化地址选择","对设备位置进行地理编码以进行精确数据分析"],"ja":["車隊サービス機器の位置をマップ上で可視化する","Places Autocompleteを使用して住所の選択を自動化する","機器の位置を地理コード化して正確なデータ分析を行う"],"ko":["플릿 서비스 장비의 위치를 맵에서 시각화하는 것","Places Autocomplete를 사용하여 주소 선택을 자동화하는 것","장비의 위치를 지리 코드화하여 정확한 데이터 분석을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Visualizar ubicaciones de equipo de servicio de flota en un mapa","Automatizar la selección de direcciones con Autocompletar de lugares","Geocodificar ubicaciones de equipo para un análisis de datos preciso"],"fr":["Visualiser les emplacements de l''équipement de service de flotte sur une carte","Automatiser la sélection d''adresses avec Autocomplétion des lieux","Géocodifier les emplacements de l''équipement pour une analyse de données précise"],"de":["Visualisieren von Standorten der Service-Flottenausrüstung auf einer Karte","Automatisieren der Adressauswahl mit Places-Autocomplete","Geocodieren von Ausrüstungsstandorten für eine präzise Datenanalyse"],"pt":["Visualizar locais de equipamentos de serviço de frota em um mapa","Automatizar a seleção de endereços com Places Autocomplete","Geocoding de locais de equipamentos para análise de dados precisos"],"ru":["Визуализация местоположения оборудования службы флота на карте","Автоматизация выбора адресов с помощью Places Autocomplete","Геокодирование местоположения оборудования для точного анализа данных"],"ar":["تصور مواقع معدات خدمة الأسطول على الخريطة","آليّة تحديد العناوين مع Places Autocomplete","تحقيق Geocoding لمواقع المعدات لتحليل البيانات الدقيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google Maps API Key","Dependent on Supabase Edge Functions for server-side integration","Specific to Google Maps services, limiting cross-platform compatibility"],"zh":["需要Google Maps API密钥","依赖Supabase Edge Functions进行服务器端集成","仅限Google Maps服务，限制了跨平台兼容性"],"ja":["Google Maps APIキーが必要","Supabase Edge Functionsを使用したサーバー側の統合に依存","Google Mapsサービスに限定され、クロスプラットフォームの互換性が制限される"],"ko":["Google Maps API 키가 필요합니다","서버 측 통합을 위해 Supabase Edge Functions에 의존합니다","Google Maps 서비스에만 국한되어 있으므로, 跨プラットフォーム 호환성이 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de Google Maps","Dependiente de Supabase Edge Functions para la integración en el servidor","Específico de los servicios de Google Maps, lo que limita la compatibilidad entre plataformas"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API Google Maps","Dépendant de Supabase Edge Functions pour l''intégration serveur","Spécifique aux services Google Maps, limitant la compatibilité multi-plateforme"],"de":["Benötigt einen Google Maps-API-Schlüssel","Abhängig von Supabase Edge Functions für die Server-Seiten-Integration","Spezifisch für Google Maps-Dienste, was die Plattformübergreifende Kompatibilität einschränkt"],"pt":["Exige Chave de API do Google Maps","Dependente de Funções de Borda Supabase para integração no lado do servidor","Específico para serviços do Google Maps, limitando a compatibilidade entre plataformas"],"ru":["Требует ключа API Google Maps","Зависит от функций Supabase Edge для интеграции на стороне сервера","Специфичен для сервисов Google Maps, ограничивая совместимость между платформами"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات خرائط جوجل","يعتمد على دوال حافة Supabase لتكامل الخادم","محدد لخدمات خرائط جوجل، مما يحدّ من التوافق بين المنصات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
