생성","개발 도구","비디오 분석"],"es":["ffmpeg","fotogramas de video","miniaturas de video","procesamiento de video","extracción de frames","video a imagen"],"fr":["ffmpeg","images vidéo","miniatures vidéo","traitement de la vidéo","extraction d''images","vidéo en image"],"de":["ffmpeg","Video-Frames","Video-Miniaturen","Videobearbeitung","Frame-Extraktion","Video zu Bild"],"pt":["extração de quadros de vídeo","FFMPEG","miniaturas de vídeo","script frame.sh","vídeo","imagem","processamento de vídeo"],"ru":["извлечение кадров видео","FFMPEG","миниатюры видео","скрипт frame.sh","видео","изображение","обработка видео"],"ar":["استخراج إطارات الفيديو","FFMPEG","مصغرات الفيديو","سكريبت frame.sh","فيديو","صورة","معالجة الفيديو"]}},"owner":"makaronz","repo":"agent66","repoPath":"makaronz/agent66","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"video-frames","description":"Extract frames or short clips from videos using ffmpeg.","bodyPreview":"# Video Frames (ffmpeg)\n\nExtract a single frame from a video, or create quick thumbnails for inspection.\n\n## Quick start\n\nFirst frame:\n\n```bash\n{baseDir}/scripts/frame.sh /path/to/video.mp4 --out /tmp/frame.jpg\n```\n\nAt a timestamp:\n\n```bash\n{baseDir}/scripts/frame.sh /path/to/video.mp4 --time 00:00:10 --out /tmp/frame-10s.jpg\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Prefer `--time` for “what is happening around here?”.\n- Use a `.jpg` for quick share; use `.png` for crisp UI frames.","body":"# Video Frames (ffmpeg)\n\nExtract a single frame from a video, or create quick thumbnails for inspection.\n\n## Quick start\n\nFirst frame:\n\n```bash\n{baseDir}/scripts/frame.sh /path/to/video.mp4 --out /tmp/frame.jpg\n```\n\nAt a timestamp:\n\n```bash\n{baseDir}/scripts/frame.sh /path/to/video.mp4 --time 00:00:10 --out /tmp/frame-10s.jpg\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Prefer `--time` for “what is happening around here?”.\n- Use a `.jpg` for quick share; use `.png` for crisp UI frames.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:27:17.636Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Media Analysis Agents needing advanced video frame extraction capabilities using ffmpeg.","zh":"非常适合需要使用ffmpeg进行高级视频帧提取的媒体分析代理。","ja":"ffmpegを使用した高度なビデオフレーム抽出機能を必要とするメディア分析エージェントに最適。","ko":"ffmpeg를 사용하여 고급 비디오 프레임 추출 기능을 필요한 미디어 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de medios que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de extracción de fotogramas de video utilizando ffmpeg.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse des médias ayant besoin de fonctionnalités avancées d''extraction de cadres vidéo à l''aide de ffmpeg.","de":"Perfekt für Media-Analyse-Agenten, die erweiterte Videoframe-Extraktionsfunktionen mit ffmpeg benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Mídia que precisam de capacidades avançadas de extração de quadros de vídeo usando ffmpeg.","ru":"Идеально для агентов медиа-анализа, требующих продвинутых возможностей извлечения кадров видео с помощью ffmpeg.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الوسائط التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لاستخراج إطارات الفيديو باستخدام ffmpeg."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract single frames from videos or create quick thumbnails for inspection using bash scripts, supporting formats like .jpg and .png, and specifying timestamps with --time for precise frame capture.","zh":"赋予代理从视频中提取单个帧或使用bash脚本创建快速缩略图以进行检查的能力，支持.jpg和.png等格式，并使用--time指定时间戳以实现精确的帧捕获。","ja":"エージェントがビデオから単一のフレームを抽出するか、bashスクリプトを使用して検査用のクイックサムネイルを作成する機能を提供し、.jpgや.pngなどの形式をサポートし、--timeを使用してタイムスタンプを指定して正確なフレーム捕捉を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 비디오에서 단일 프레임을 추출하거나 bash 스크립트를 사용하여 검사용 빠른 썸네일을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, .jpg 및 .png와 같은 형식을 지원하며 --time을 사용하여 타임스탬프를 지정하여 정확한 프레임 캡처를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer fotogramas individuales de videos o a crear miniaturas rápidas para inspección utilizando scripts de bash, que admiten formatos como .jpg y .png, y especifican marcas de tiempo con --time para una captura de fotogramas precisa.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire des cadres individuels à partir de vidéos ou de créer des miniatures rapides pour inspection à l''aide de scripts bash, prenant en charge des formats tels que .jpg et .png, et spécifiant des horodatages avec --time pour une capture de cadre précise.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, einzelne Frames aus Videos zu extrahieren oder schnelle Thumbnails für die Inspektion mit Bash-Skripten zu erstellen, die Formate wie .jpg und .png unterstützen und Zeitstempel mit --time für eine präzise Frame-Erfassung angeben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair quadros individuais de vídeos ou criar miniaturas rápidas para inspeção usando scripts bash, suportando formatos como .jpg e .png, e especificando carimbos de data/hora com --time para captura de quadro precisa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать отдельные кадры из видео или создавать быстрые миниатюры для осмотра с помощью скриптов bash, поддерживая форматы seperti .jpg и .png, и указывая метки времени с --time для точной захвата кадра.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكيل من استخراج إطارات فردية من مقاطع الفيديو أو إنشاء معاينة سريعة باستخدام سكريبتات bash، مع دعم صيغ مثل .jpg و .png، وتحديد توقيتات باستخدام --time لالتقاط الإطار بدقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting key frames from videos for content preview","Generating thumbnails for video inspection at specific timestamps","Debugging video content using frame extraction"],"zh":["从视频中提取关键帧以预览内容","在特定时间戳生成视频检查的缩略图","使用帧提取调试视频内容"],"ja":["ビデオからキーフレームを抽出してコンテンツをプレビューする","特定のタイムスタンプでビデオの検査用サムネイルを生成する","フレーム抽出を使用してビデオコンテンツをデバッグする"],"ko":["비디오에서 키 프레임을 추출하여 콘텐츠를 미리 보기","특정 타임스탬프에서 비디오 검사용 썸네일을 생성","프레임 추출을 사용하여 비디오 콘텐츠를 디버깅"],"es":["Extraer fotogramas clave de videos para vista previa de contenido","Generar miniaturas para inspección de video en marcas de tiempo específicas","Depurar contenido de video mediante extracción de fotogramas"],"fr":["Extraire des cadres clés à partir de vidéos pour une vue préalable du contenu","Générer des miniatures pour l''inspection de la vidéo à des horodatages spécifiques","Déboguer le contenu vidéo à l''aide de l''extraction de cadres"],"de":["Extrahieren von Schlüsselbildern aus Videos für Inhaltsvorschau","Erstellen von Thumbnails für Videoinspektion zu bestimmten Zeitstempeln","Debuggen von Videoinhalten durch Frame-Extraktion"],"pt":["Extrair quadros-chave de vídeos para pré-visualização de conteúdo","Gerar miniaturas para inspeção de vídeo em horários específicos","Depurar conteúdo de vídeo usando extração de quadros"],"ru":["Извлечение ключевых кадров из видео для предварительного просмотра контента","Генерация миниатюр для осмотра видео в определенные метки времени","Отладка видеоконтента с помощью извлечения кадров"],"ar":["استخراج الإطارات الرئيسية من مقاطع الفيديو للمعاينة المسبقة للمحتوى","توليد معاينة لمقاطع الفيديو في توقيتات محددة","تصحيح أخطاء المحتوى الفيديوي باستخدام استخراج الإطارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ffmpeg installation","Bash script execution needed","Limited to video formats supported by ffmpeg"],"zh":["需要ffmpeg安装","需要bash脚本执行","仅限ffmpeg支持的视频格式"],"ja":["ffmpegのインストールが必要","bashスクリプトの実行が必要","ffmpegでサポートされるビデオ形式のみ"],"ko":["ffmpeg 설치가 필요","bash 스크립트 실행이 필요","ffmpeg에서 지원하는 비디오 형식만"],"es":["Requiere instalación de ffmpeg","Se necesita ejecución de script de bash","Limitado a formatos de video compatibles con ffmpeg"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de ffmpeg","Exécution de script bash nécessaire","Limité aux formats de vidéo pris en charge par ffmpeg"],"de":["Benötigt ffmpeg-Installation","Bash-Skriptausführung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf von ffmpeg unterstützte Videoformate"],"pt":["Requer instalação do ffmpeg","Execução de script bash necessária","Limitado a formatos de vídeo suportados pelo ffmpeg"],"ru":["Требуется установка ffmpeg","Необходимо выполнение скрипта bash","Ограничен форматами видео, поддерживаемыми ffmpeg"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ffmpeg","تحتاج إلى تشغيل سكريبتات bash","محدود بالصيغ الفيديوية المدعومة من قبل ffmpeg"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('shibasab/todoapp/nfr-add-idea', 'community', 'shibasab', 'todoapp', 'shibasab/todoapp', 'nfr-add-idea', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z', '2026-02-18T10:27:38.742Z', NULL, '{"id":"shibasab/todoapp/nfr-add-idea","name":"nfr-add-idea","description":{"pt":"Adicione ideias de NFR para melhorar a qualidade do seu software, garantindo desempenho e confiabilidade","ru":"Добавьте идеи NFR для улучшения качества вашего программного обеспечения, обеспечивая производительность и надежность","ar":"إضافة أفكار NFR لتحسين جودة برنامجك، وتحقيق الأداء والثبات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"pt":"Adicionar Ideia de NFR: Otimização de Desempenho","ru":"Добавить идею NFR: оптимизация производительности","ar":"إضافة فكرة NFR: تحسين الأداء","en":"nfr-add-idea"},"description":{"pt":"Adicione ideias de NFR para melhorar a qualidade do seu software, garantindo desempenho e confiabilidade","ru":"Добавьте идеи NFR для улучшения качества вашего программного обеспечения, обеспечивая производительность и надежность","ar":"إضافة أفكار NFR لتحسين جودة برنامجك، وتحقيق الأداء والثبات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"pt":["Adicionar ideias de NFR para melhorar a qualidade do software","Definir atributos de qualidade de acordo com a norma ISO/IEC 25010","Criar documentos de NFR para registro e acompanhamento","Priorizar ideias de NFR com base em critérios de negócio","Integrar NFR com o backlog de desenvolvimento","Melhorar a colaboração entre equipes de desenvolvimento e negócio"],"ru":["Добавление идей NFR для улучшения качества программного обеспечения","Определение атрибутов качества в соответствии с стандартом ISO/IEC 25010","Создание документов NFR для регистрации и сопровождения","Приоритизация идей NFR на основе бизнес-критериев","Интеграция NFR с бэклогом разработки","Улучшение сотрудничества между командами разработки и бизнеса"],"ar":["إضافة أفكار NFR لتحسين جودة البرنامج","تحديد سمات الجودة وفقًا لمعيار ISO/IEC 25010","إنشاء مستندات NFR لتسجيل والمتابعة","تحديد الأولويات لأفكار NFR بناءً على معايير العمل","دمج NFR مع قائمة عمل التطوير","تحسين التعاون بين فرق التطوير والعمل"]},"keywords":{"pt":["NFR","requisitos não funcionais","qualidade de software","desempenho","confiabilidade","ISO/IEC 25010","backlog de desenvolvimento","priorização de requisitos"],"ru":["NFR","нефункциональные требования","качество программного обеспечения","производительность","надежность","ISO/IEC 25010","бэклог разработки","приоритизация требований"],"ar":["NFR","متطلبات غير وظيفية","جودة البرنامج","الأداء","الثبات","ISO/IEC 25010","قائمة عمل التطوير","تحديد الأولويات للمتطلبات"]}},"owner":"shibasab","repo":"todoapp","repoPath":"shibasab/todoapp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nfr-add-idea","description":"新しい非機能要件アイデアを軽量NFRとして docs/nfr/000_backlog に追加し、docs/nfr/INDEX.md を更新する。実装は行わず、ドキュメント作成と索引更新のみを行う。Use when the user wants to add a new non-functional requirement idea to the backlog or create a lightweight NFR specification.","bodyPreview":"# NFR: Add Idea (Backlog)\n\n新しい非機能要件アイデアを軽量NFRとして `docs/nfr/000_backlog` に追加し、`docs/nfr/INDEX.md` を更新する。実装はしない。\n\n## Goal\n\n将来の非機能要件（品質特性）アイデアを忘れないように、軽量NFR（WHAT/WHY中心）として保存する。\n\n## Inputs (ユーザーが埋める)\n\n- Title: <タイトル>\n- Slug: <kebab-case。未指定ならタイトルから提案して>\n- Quality attributes (ISO/IEC 25010): <Performance efficiency / Reliability / Security / Maintainability / Usability / Compatibility / Portability から選択>\n- 背景/動機: <1〜3行>\n- ざっくり欲しいこと: <箇条書きでOK>\n- やらないこと: <あれば>\n- メモ: <あれば>\n\n## Rules\n\n- 実装はしない（ドキュメント作成と索","body":"# NFR: Add Idea (Backlog)\n\n新しい非機能要件アイデアを軽量NFRとして `docs/nfr/000_backlog` に追加し、`docs/nfr/INDEX.md` を更新する。実装はしない。\n\n## Goal\n\n将来の非機能要件（品質特性）アイデアを忘れないように、軽量NFR（WHAT/WHY中心）として保存する。\n\n## Inputs (ユーザーが埋める)\n\n- Title: <タイトル>\n- Slug: <kebab-case。未指定ならタイトルから提案して>\n- Quality attributes (ISO/IEC 25010): <Performance efficiency / Reliability / Security / Maintainability / Usability / Compatibility / Portability から選択>\n- 背景/動機: <1〜3行>\n- ざっくり欲しいこと: <箇条書きでOK>\n- やらないこと: <あれば>\n- メモ: <あれば>\n\n## Rules\n\n- 実装はしない（ドキュメント作成と索引更新のみ）\n- HOW（実装計画、設計、影響範囲、技術選定、コード）は書かない\n- 仕様に書かれていない事項は「未決」として Open Questions に残す\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Ensure files exist\n\n- `docs/nfr/000_backlog/` がなければ作成する\n- `docs/nfr/INDEX.md` がなければ作成する（Idea/Ready/In progress/Done/Abandoned の5セクションを作る）\n\n### 2. Create lightweight idea NFR\n\n- `docs/nfr/000_backlog/<slug>.md` を作成する\n- 先頭にメタ情報（Markdown）を必ず入れる:\n  - Title: <Title>\n  - Status: Idea\n  - Quality attributes (ISO/IEC 25010): <選択した品質特性>\n  - Created: <YYYY-MM-DD>\n  - Last updated: <YYYY-MM-DD>\n\n#### Body template\n\n- Goal（1〜2文）\n- Non-goals（箇条書き）\n- Acceptance criteria（箇条書き、粗くてOK）\n- Notes（任意）\n- Open Questions（任意）\n\n### 3. Update INDEX\n\n- `docs/nfr/INDEX.md` の Idea セクションの先頭に1行追加（新しいものが上）\n- 例:\n  - `- [<Title>](000_backlog/<slug>.md) (Status: Idea, Created: YYYY-MM-DD)`\n\n### 4. Output\n\n作成/更新したファイル一覧を箇条書きで出力して終了する。\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:27:38.742Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Documentation Agents needing to manage non-functional requirements (NFRs) and update INDEX.md files.","zh":"非常适合需要管理非功能性需求（NFRs）并更新INDEX.md文件的文档代理","ja":"ドキュメントエージェントが非機能要件（NFRs）を管理し、INDEX.mdファイルを更新するのに最適","ko":"문서 에이전트가 비기능적 요구사항(NFRs)을 관리하고 INDEX.md 파일을 업데이트하는 데 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de documentación que necesitan gestionar requisitos no funcionales (NFR) y actualizar archivos INDEX.md.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de documentation ayant besoin de gérer les exigences non fonctionnelles (NFR) et de mettre à jour les fichiers INDEX.md.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentationsagenten, die nicht-funktionale Anforderungen (NFR) verwalten und INDEX.md-Dateien aktualisieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Documentação que precisam gerenciar requisitos não funcionais (NFRs) e atualizar arquivos INDEX.md.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов документации, которым необходимо управлять нефункциональными требованиями (NFR) и обновлять файлы INDEX.md.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الوثائقية الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة المتطلبات غير الوظيفية (NFRs) وتحديث ملفات INDEX.md."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to add new NFR ideas as lightweight documents in the `docs/nfr/000_backlog` directory, updating the `docs/nfr/INDEX.md` file with ISO/IEC 25010 quality attributes, and organizing them with kebab-case slugs.","zh":"赋予代理添加新的NFR想法作为`docs/nfr/000_backlog`目录中的轻量级文档的能力，并使用ISO/IEC 25010质量属性更新`docs/nfr/INDEX.md`文件，并使用短横线命名法的slug进行组织","ja":"エージェントが新しいNFRアイデアを`docs/nfr/000_backlog`ディレクトリ内の軽量ドキュメントとして追加し、ISO/IEC 25010品質属性を使用して`docs/nfr/INDEX.md`ファイルを更新し、ケバブケースのスラッグで整理する能力を付与する","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 NFR 아이디어를 `docs/nfr/000_backlog` 디렉토리의 경량 문서로 추가하고 ISO/IEC 25010 품질 속성을 사용하여 `docs/nfr/INDEX.md` 파일을 업데이트하며 경계선 케이스의 슬러그로 조직화하는 기능을 부여합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para agregar nuevas ideas de NFR como documentos ligeros en el directorio `docs/nfr/000_backlog`, actualizando el archivo `docs/nfr/INDEX.md` con atributos de calidad ISO/IEC 25010 y organizándolos con slugs en kebab-case.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''ajouter de nouvelles idées de NFR sous forme de documents légers dans le répertoire `docs/nfr/000_backlog`, en mettant à jour le fichier `docs/nfr/INDEX.md` avec des attributs de qualité ISO/IEC 25010 et en les organisant avec des slugs en kebab-case.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, neue NFR-Ideen als leichte Dokumente im Verzeichnis `docs/nfr/000_backlog` hinzuzufügen, die Datei `docs/nfr/INDEX.md` mit ISO/IEC-25010-Qualitätsattributen zu aktualisieren und sie mit Kebab-Case-Slugs zu organisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a adicionar novas ideias de NFR como documentos leves no diretório `docs/nfr/000_backlog`, atualizando o arquivo `docs/nfr/INDEX.md` com atributos de qualidade ISO/IEC 25010 e organizando-os com slug em kebab-case.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью добавлять новые идеи NFR в виде легковесных документов в каталог `docs/nfr/000_backlog`, обновляя файл `docs/nfr/INDEX.md` атрибутами качества ISO/IEC 25010 и организуя их с помощью slug в kebab-case.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإضافة أفكار جديدة من NFR كوثائق خفيفة في الدليل `docs/nfr/000_backlog` ، وتحديث ملف `docs/nfr/INDEX.md` مع سمات جودة ISO/IEC 25010 ، وتنظيمها باستخدام slug في kebab-case."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding performance efficiency NFRs","Documenting reliability and security requirements","Organizing usability and compatibility ideas"],"zh":["添加性能效率NFRs","记录可靠性和安全性要求","组织可用性和兼容性想法"],"ja":["パフォーマンス効率NFRsを追加する","信頼性とセキュリティ要件を文書化する","使いやすさと互換性のアイデアを整理する"],"ko":["성능 효율성 NFRs 추가","신뢰성 및 보안 요구사항 문서화","사용성 및 호환성 아이디어 조직화"],"es":["Agregar NFR de eficiencia de rendimiento","Documentar requisitos de confiabilidad y seguridad","Organizar ideas de usabilidad y compatibilidad"],"fr":["Ajouter des NFR d''efficacité des performances","Documenter les exigences de fiabilité et de sécurité","Organiser les idées d''utilisabilité et de compatibilité"],"de":["Hinzufügen von NFR für Leistungseffizienz","Dokumentieren von Zuverlässigkeits- und Sicherheitsanforderungen","Organisieren von Usability- und Kompatibilitätsideen"],"pt":["Adicionando NFRs de eficiência de desempenho","Documentando requisitos de confiabilidade e segurança","Organizando ideias de usabilidade e compatibilidade"],"ru":["Добавление NFRs эффективности производительности","Документирование требований надежности и безопасности","Организация идей удобства использования и совместимости"],"ar":["إضافة NFRs من كفاءة الأداء","توثيق متطلبات الموثوقية والأمن","تنظيم أفكار سهولة الاستخدام والتوافق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to documentation updates, no implementation","Requires access to the `docs/nfr` directory"],"zh":["仅限于文档更新，无实施","需要访问`docs/nfr`目录"],"ja":["ドキュメント更新のみ、実装なし","`docs/nfr`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["문서 업데이트만 가능, 구현 안됨","`docs/nfr` 디렉토리에 접근해야 함"],"es":["Limitado a actualizaciones de documentación, sin implementación","Requiere acceso al directorio `docs/nfr`"],"fr":["Limité aux mises à jour de la documentation, sans implémentation","Nécessite l''accès au répertoire `docs/nfr`"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Dokumentenaktualisierungen, ohne Implementierung","Erfordert Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `docs/nfr`"],"pt":["Limitado a atualizações de documentação, sem implementação","Requer acesso ao diretório `docs/nfr`"],"ru":["Ограничен обновлениями документации, без реализации","Требует доступа к каталогу `docs/nfr`"],"ar":["محدود بالتحديثات الوثائقية ، بدون تنفيذ","يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `docs/nfr`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Nguyenthang2292/Sovereign-IQ/salesforce-development', 'community', 'Nguyenthang2292', 'Sovereign-IQ', 'Nguyenthang2292/Sovereign-IQ', 'salesforce-development', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z', '2026-02-18T10:27:18.330Z', NULL, '{"id":"Nguyenthang2292/Sovereign-IQ/salesforce-development","name":"salesforce-development","description":{"zh":"Salesforce开发是一种高性能的开发框架，用于自动化策略开发、回测和实时执行","ja":"Salesforce開発は、高パフォーマンスな開発フレームワークであり、自動化された戦略開発、バックテスト、およびリアルタイム実行に使用される","ko":"Salesforce 개발은 자동화된 전략 개발, 백테스팅 및 실시간 실행을 위한 고성능 개발 프레임워크입니다","es":"Desarrollo de Salesforce con patrones de Lightning Web Component y Apex Trigger para mejorar el rendimiento","fr":"Développement Salesforce avec des modèles de Lightning Web Component et Apex Trigger pour améliorer les performances","de":"Salesforce-Entwicklung mit Lightning Web Component- und Apex-Trigger-Mustern für bessere Leistung","pt":"Desenvolvimento Salesforce com técnicas avançadas de Lightning Web Component e Apex Trigger para melhorar o desempenho","ru":"Разработка Salesforce с продвинутыми техниками Lightning Web Component и Apex Trigger для улучшения производительности","ar":"تطوير سيلز فورس باستخدام تقنيات متقدمة لمكون ويب لايتينج وأبكس ترايجر لتحسين الأداء","en":"A high-performance, institutional-grade quantitative trading framework designed for automated strategy development, backtesting, and real-time execution."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Salesforce开发","ja":"Salesforce開発","ko":"Salesforce 개발","es":"Desarrollo de Salesforce","fr":"Développement Salesforce","de":"Salesforce-Entwicklung","pt":"Desenvolvimento Salesforce: Técnicas Avançadas","ru":"Разработка Salesforce: Продвинутые Техники","ar":"تطوير سيلز فورس: تقنيات متقدمة","en":"salesforce-development"},"description":{"zh":"Salesforce开发是一种高性能的开发框架，用于自动化策略开发、回测和实时执行","ja":"Salesforce開発は、高パフォーマンスな開発フレームワークであり、自動化された戦略開発、バックテスト、およびリアルタイム実行に使用される","ko":"Salesforce 개발은 자동화된 전략 개발, 백테스팅 및 실시간 실행을 위한 고성능 개발 프레임워크입니다","es":"Desarrollo de Salesforce con patrones de Lightning Web Component y Apex Trigger para mejorar el rendimiento","fr":"Développement Salesforce avec des modèles de Lightning Web Component et Apex Trigger pour améliorer les performances","de":"Salesforce-Entwicklung mit Lightning Web Component- und Apex-Trigger-Mustern für bessere Leistung","pt":"Desenvolvimento Salesforce com técnicas avançadas de Lightning Web Component e Apex Trigger para melhorar o desempenho","ru":"Разработка Salesforce с продвинутыми техниками Lightning Web Component и Apex Trigger для улучшения производительности","ar":"تطوير سيلز فورس باستخدام تقنيات متقدمة لمكون ويب لايتينج وأبكس ترايجر لتحسين الأداء","en":"A high-performance, institutional-grade quantitative trading framework designed for automated strategy development, backtesting, and real-time execution."},"definition":{"en":"A high-performance, institutional-grade quantitative trading framework designed for automated strategy development, backtesting, and real-time execution."},"features":{"zh":["Lightning Web Component与Wire Service的无缝集成","批量化Apex触发器与处理器模式","Queueable Apex用于异步处理","支持Salesforce性能优化","提高开发效率和代码可维护性"],"ja":["Lightning Web ComponentとWire Serviceのシームレスな統合","バルク化Apexトリガーとハンドラーパターン","Queueable Apexによる非同期処理","Salesforceパフォーマンス最適化のサポート","開発効率とコードの保守性の向上"],"ko":["Lightning Web Component와 Wire Service의 무결점 통합","대용량 Apex 트리거와 핸들러 패턴","Queueable Apex를 통한 비동기 처리","Salesforce 성능 최적화 지원","개발 효율성과 코드 유연성 향상"],"es":["Lightning Web Component con servicio Wire","Apex Trigger bulkificado con patrón de controlador","Queueable Apex para ejecución asíncrona","Integración con Lightning Data Service","Optimización del rendimiento de Salesforce"],"fr":["Lightning Web Component avec service Wire","Apex Trigger bulkifié avec modèle de contrôleur","Queueable Apex pour exécution asynchrone","Intégration avec Lightning Data Service","Optimisation des performances Salesforce"],"de":["Lightning Web Component mit Wire-Service","Bulkifizierter Apex-Trigger mit Handler-Muster","Queueable Apex für asynchrone Ausführung","Integration mit Lightning Data Service","Leistungsoptimierung von Salesforce"],"pt":["Lightning Web Component com Wire Service","Apex Trigger em massa com padrão de manipulador","Queueable Apex para execução em segundo plano","Reativo vinculação de dados com Lightning Data Service","Separação de preocupações com padrão de manipulador","Prevenção de recursividade com padrão de manipulador"],"ru":["Lightning Web Component с Wire Service","Apex Trigger в массе с шаблоном обработчика","Queueable Apex для фоновой выполнения","Реактивное связывание данных с Lightning Data Service","Разделение проблем с шаблоном обработчика","Предотвращение рекурсии с шаблоном обработчика"],"ar":["مكون ويب لايتينج مع خدمة وايير","أبكس ترايجر بالجملة مع نمط المعالج","أبكس قابل للتشغيل في الخلفية","ربط بيانات تفاعلي مع خدمة بيانات لايتينج","فصل المشاكل مع نمط المعالج","منع التكرار مع نمط المعالج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Salesforce开发","Lightning Web Component","Apex触发器","Queueable Apex","Salesforce性能优化","自动化策略开发","实时执行","开发框架"],"ja":["Salesforce開発","Lightning Web Component","Apexトリガー","Queueable Apex","Salesforceパフォーマンス最適化","自動化戦略開発","リアルタイム実行","開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["Salesforce 개발","Lightning Web Component","Apex 트리거","Queueable Apex","Salesforce 성능 최적화","자동화 전략 개발","실시간 실행","개발 프레임워크"],"es":["desarrollo de Salesforce","Lightning Web Component","Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","Salesforce Performance","desarrollo de aplicaciones","patrones de diseño","integración con Salesforce"],"fr":["développement Salesforce","Lightning Web Component","Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","performances Salesforce","développement d''applications","modèles de conception","intégration avec Salesforce"],"de":["Salesforce-Entwicklung","Lightning Web Component","Apex-Trigger","Queueable Apex","Salesforce-Leistung","Anwendungsentwicklung","Entwurfsmuster","Integration mit Salesforce"],"pt":["desenvolvimento salesforce","lightning web component","apex trigger","queueable apex","wire service","padrão de manipulador","reactive data binding","salesforce performance"],"ru":["разработка salesforce","lightning web component","apex trigger","queueable apex","wire service","шаблон обработчика","реактивное связывание данных","производительность salesforce"],"ar":["تطوير سيلز فورس","مكون ويب لايتينج","أبكس ترايجر","أبكس قابل للتشغيل","خدمة وايير","نمط المعالج","ربط بيانات تفاعلي","أداء سيلز فورس"]}},"owner":"Nguyenthang2292","repo":"Sovereign-IQ","repoPath":"Nguyenthang2292/Sovereign-IQ","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"salesforce-development","description":"Expert patterns for Salesforce platform development including Lightning Web Components (LWC), Apex triggers and classes, REST/Bulk APIs, Connected Apps, and Salesforce DX with scratch orgs and 2nd generation packages (2GP). Use when: salesforce, sfdc, apex, lwc, lightning web components.","bodyPreview":"# Salesforce Development\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Lightning Web Component with Wire Service\n\nUse @wire decorator for reactive data binding with Lightning Data Service\nor Apex methods. @wire fits LWC''s reactive architecture and enables\nSalesforce performance optimizations.\n\n\n### Bulkified Apex Trigger with Handler Pattern\n\nApex triggers must be bulkified to handle 200+ records per transaction.\nUse handler pattern for separation of concerns, testability, and\nrecursion prevention.\n\n\n### Queueable Apex for","body":"# Salesforce Development\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Lightning Web Component with Wire Service\n\nUse @wire decorator for reactive data binding with Lightning Data Service\nor Apex methods. @wire fits LWC''s reactive architecture and enables\nSalesforce performance optimizations.\n\n\n### Bulkified Apex Trigger with Handler Pattern\n\nApex triggers must be bulkified to handle 200+ records per transaction.\nUse handler pattern for separation of concerns, testability, and\nrecursion prevention.\n\n\n### Queueable Apex for Async Processing\n\nUse Queueable Apex for async processing with support for non-primitive\ntypes, monitoring via AsyncApexJob, and job chaining. Limit: 50 jobs\nper transaction, 1 child job when chaining.\n\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ SOQL Inside Loops\n\n### ❌ DML Inside Loops\n\n### ❌ Hardcoding IDs\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:27:18.330Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents focused on enterprise software development needing expertise in Salesforce customization and automation.","zh":"非常适合专注于企业软件开发并需要Salesforce定制和自动化专业知识的AI代理。","ja":"Salesforceのカスタマイズと自動化の専門知識が必要なエンタープライズソフトウェア開発に焦点を当てたAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"엔터프라이즈 소프트웨어 개발에 중점을 둔 Salesforce 사용자 정의 및 자동화 전문 지식이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA centrados en el desarrollo de software empresarial que necesitan experiencia en personalización y automatización de Salesforce.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA axés sur le développement de logiciels d''entreprise nécessitant une expertise en personnalisation et en automation de Salesforce.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die auf die Entwicklung von Unternehmenssoftware ausgerichtet sind und Erfahrung in der Anpassung und Automatisierung von Salesforce benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados no desenvolvimento de software empresarial que necessitam de expertise em personalização e automação do Salesforce.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на разработку корпоративного программного обеспечения, требующих экспертизы в области настройки и автоматизации Salesforce.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يركزون على تطوير البرمجيات الداخلية ويحتاجون إلى الخبرة في تعديل وتحسين برنامج Salesforce."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build high-performance Salesforce applications using Lightning Web Components, Apex triggers, and Queueable Apex, enabling reactive data binding, bulk data processing, and asynchronous job execution.","zh":"赋予代理构建使用Lightning Web Components、Apex触发器和Queueable Apex的高性能Salesforce应用程序的能力，实现反应式数据绑定、批量数据处理和异步作业执行。","ja":"Lightning Web Components、Apexトリガー、Queueable Apexを使用して、高パフォーマンスのSalesforceアプリケーションを構築するエージェントの能力を提供し、リアクティブなデータバインディング、大量データ処理、アシンクロナスジョブの実行を可能にします。","ko":"Lightning Web Components, Apex 트리거 및 Queueable Apex를 사용하여 고성능 Salesforce 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여 반응형 데이터 바인딩, 대량 데이터 처리 및 비동기 작업 실행을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones Salesforce de alto rendimiento utilizando componentes web Lightning, desencadenadores Apex y Queueable Apex, lo que permite la vinculación de datos reactiva, el procesamiento de datos masivos y la ejecución de trabajos asincrónicos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications Salesforce haute performance en utilisant les composants Web Lightning, les déclencheurs Apex et Queueable Apex, permettant ainsi une liaison de données réactive, un traitement de données massives et une exécution de tâches asynchrones.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, leistungsstarke Salesforce-Anwendungen mit Lightning-Web-Komponenten, Apex-Trigger und Queueable Apex zu erstellen, wodurch reaktive Datenbindung, Massendatenverarbeitung und asynchrone Aufgabenausführung ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem aplicações Salesforce de alto desempenho usando Componentes Web Lightning, gatilhos Apex e Queueable Apex, habilitando a vinculação reativa de dados, processamento de dados em massa e execução de trabalhos assíncronos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать высокопроизводительные приложения Salesforce с использованием компонентов Lightning Web, триггеров Apex и Queueable Apex, обеспечивая реактивное связывание данных, пакетную обработку данных и асинхронную выполнение заданий.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات Salesforce ذات أداء عالي باستخدام مكونات الويب Lightning وأطر Apex والوظائف القابلة للتعيين، مما يتيح ربط البيانات التفاعلي ومعالجة البيانات بالجملة وتنفيذ المهام التفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom Salesforce interfaces with Lightning Web Components","Implementing bulkified Apex triggers for large-scale data processing","Creating asynchronous jobs using Queueable Apex for efficient workflow automation"],"zh":["使用Lightning Web Components构建自定义Salesforce接口","为大规模数据处理实现批量化Apex触发器","使用Queueable Apex创建异步作业以实现高效的工作流自动化"],"ja":["Lightning Web Componentsを使用してカスタムSalesforceインターフェイスを構築する","大規模なデータ処理のためにバルク化Apexトリガーを実装する","Queueable Apexを使用して非同期ジョブを作成し、効率的なワークフロー自動化を実現する"],"ko":["Lightning Web Components를 사용하여 사용자 지정 Salesforce 인터페이스를 구축하는 것","대규모 데이터 처리를 위한 일괄 처리 Apex 트리거 구현","Queueable Apex를 사용하여 비동기 작업을 생성하여 효율적인 워크플로 자동화를实现하는 것"],"es":["Creación de interfaces personalizadas de Salesforce con componentes web Lightning","Implementación de desencadenadores Apex masivos para el procesamiento de datos a gran escala","Creación de trabajos asincrónicos utilizando Queueable Apex para una automatización de flujos de trabajo eficiente"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces personnalisées Salesforce avec des composants Web Lightning","Mise en œuvre de déclencheurs Apex massifs pour le traitement de données à grande échelle","Création de tâches asynchrones en utilisant Queueable Apex pour une automatisation efficace des flux de travail"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Salesforce-Schnittstellen mit Lightning-Web-Komponenten","Implementierung von Apex-Triggern für die Verarbeitung großer Datenmengen","Erstellung asynchroner Aufträge mit Queueable Apex für eine effiziente Workflow-Automatisierung"],"pt":["Construção de interfaces personalizadas do Salesforce com Componentes Web Lightning","Implementação de gatilhos Apex em massa para processamento de dados em grande escala","Criação de trabalhos assíncronos usando Queueable Apex para automação de fluxo de trabalho eficiente"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов Salesforce с помощью компонентов Lightning Web","Реализация пакетных триггеров Apex для обработки больших объемов данных","Создание асинхронных заданий с использованием Queueable Apex для эффективной автоматизации рабочих процессов"],"ar":["بناء واجهات مخصصة لبرنامج Salesforce باستخدام مكونات الويب Lightning","تنفيذ أطر Apex المجمعة لمعالجة البيانات على نطاق واسع","إنشاء مهام تفاعلية باستخدام Queueable Apex لتحسين تدفق العمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Salesforce developer account","Knowledge of Apex programming language and Lightning framework necessary"],"zh":["需要Salesforce开发者账户","需要Apex编程语言和Lightning框架的知识"],"ja":["Salesforce開発者アカウントが必要","Apexプログラミング言語とLightningフレームワークの知識が必要"],"ko":["Salesforce 개발자 계정이 필요합니다.","Apex 프로그래밍 언어 및 Lightning 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de desarrollador de Salesforce","Conocimiento del lenguaje de programación Apex y del marco de trabajo Lightning es necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte de développeur Salesforce","Connaissance de la langue de programmation Apex et du framework Lightning est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt ein Entwicklerkonto für Salesforce","Kenntnisse der Apex-Programmiersprache und des Lightning-Frameworks sind erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer conta de desenvolvedor do Salesforce","Conhecimento da linguagem de programação Apex e do framework Lightning necessário"],"ru":["Требуется учетная запись разработчика Salesforce","Необходимо знание языка программирования Apex и фреймворка Lightning"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب مطور برنامج Salesforce","مطلوب معرفة لغة البرمجة Apex وأطر العمل Lightning"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('armanisadeghi/real-singles/ux-architect', 'community', 'armanisadeghi', 'real-singles', 'armanisadeghi/real-singles', 'ux-architect', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z', '2026-02-18T10:27:49.347Z', NULL, '{"id":"armanisadeghi/real-singles/ux-architect","name":"ux-architect","description":{"zh":"UX 架构师负责分析现有系统、理解用户流程并创建实施计划，确保用户体验的最佳设计","ja":"UX アーキテクトは、既存のシステムを分析し、ユーザーフローを理解し、実装計画を作成して、ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適な設計を確保します","ko":"UX 아키텍트는 기존 시스템을 분석하고 사용자 흐름을 이해하고 구현 계획을 생성하여 사용자 경험의 최적의 설계를 보장합니다","es":"El arquitecto de UX analiza sistemas existentes y crea planes sólidos para experiencias de usuario efectivas. Determina qué y por qué construir antes de la implementación","fr":"L''architecte UX analyse les systèmes existants et conçoit des plans solides pour des expériences utilisateur efficaces. Il détermine ce qui et pourquoi construire avant la mise en œuvre","de":"Der UX-Architekt analysiert bestehende Systeme und entwirft solide Pläne für effektive Benutzererfahrungen. Er bestimmt, was und warum vor der Implementierung zu bauen ist","pt":"O arquiteto de UX analisa sistemas existentes, entende fluxos de usuário e cria planos sólidos antes da implementação","ru":"Архитектор UX анализирует существующие системы, понимает потоки пользователей и создает прочные планы до реализации","ar":"مهندس تجربة المستخدم يanalyzes الأنظمة الحالية، ويفهم تدفقات المستخدم، وينشئ خططاً قوية قبل التنفيذ","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UX 架构师：用户体验设计专家","ja":"UX アーキテクト：ユーザーエクスペリエンス設計の専門家","ko":"UX 아키텍트: 사용자 경험 설계 전문가","es":"Arquitecto de UX: Planificación de Experiencias de Usuario","fr":"Architecte UX : Planification d''Expériences Utilisateur","de":"UX-Architekt: Planung von Benutzererfahrungen","pt":"Arquiteto de UX: Planejamento de Experiência do Usuário","ru":"Архитектор UX: Планирование Пользовательского Опыта","ar":"مهندس تجربة المستخدم: تخطيط تجربة المستخدم","en":"ux-architect"},"description":{"zh":"UX 架构师负责分析现有系统、理解用户流程并创建实施计划，确保用户体验的最佳设计","ja":"UX アーキテクトは、既存のシステムを分析し、ユーザーフローを理解し、実装計画を作成して、ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適な設計を確保します","ko":"UX 아키텍트는 기존 시스템을 분석하고 사용자 흐름을 이해하고 구현 계획을 생성하여 사용자 경험의 최적의 설계를 보장합니다","es":"El arquitecto de UX analiza sistemas existentes y crea planes sólidos para experiencias de usuario efectivas. Determina qué y por qué construir antes de la i...","fr":"L''architecte UX analyse les systèmes existants et conçoit des plans solides pour des expériences utilisateur efficaces. Il détermine ce qui et pourquoi const...","de":"Der UX-Architekt analysiert bestehende Systeme und entwirft solide Pläne für effektive Benutzererfahrungen. Er bestimmt, was und warum vor der Implementierun...","pt":"O arquiteto de UX analisa sistemas existentes, entende fluxos de usuário e cria planos sólidos antes da implementação","ru":"Архитектор UX анализирует существующие системы, понимает потоки пользователей и создает прочные планы до реализации","ar":"مهندس تجربة المستخدم يanalyzes الأنظمة الحالية، ويفهم تدفقات المستخدم، وينشئ خططاً قوية قبل التنفيذ","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["分析现有系统","理解用户流程","创建实施计划","确保用户体验的最佳设计","跨平台基础设施规划"],"ja":["既存のシステムを分析する","ユーザーフローを理解する","実装計画を作成する","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適な設計を確保する","複数のプラットフォームにわたるインフラストラクチャ計画"],"ko":["기존 시스템을 분석한다","사용자 흐름을 이해한다","구현 계획을 생성한다","사용자 경험의 최적의 설계를 보장한다","여러 플랫폼에 걸친 인프라 계획"],"es":["Análisis de sistemas existentes","Creación de planes sólidos para experiencias de usuario","Determinación de qué y por qué construir","Evaluación de flujos de usuario","Identificación de mejoras y optimizaciones"],"fr":["Analyse de systèmes existants","Conception de plans solides pour des expériences utilisateur","Détermination de ce qui et pourquoi construire","Évaluation de flux d''utilisateur","Identification d''améliorations et d''optimisations"],"de":["Analyse bestehender Systeme","Entwurf solider Pläne für Benutzererfahrungen","Bestimmung von was und warum zu bauen ist","Bewertung von Benutzerflüssen","Identifizierung von Verbesserungen und Optimierungen"],"pt":["Análise de sistemas existentes","Entendimento de fluxos de usuário","Criação de planos sólidos para implementação","Identificação de melhorias e redundâncias","Desenvolvimento de infraestrutura para múltiplas plataformas"],"ru":["Анализ существующих систем","Понимание потоков пользователей","Создание прочных планов для реализации","Определение улучшений и излишеств","Разработка инфраструктуры для нескольких платформ"],"ar":["تحليل الأنظمة الحالية","فهم تدفقات المستخدم","إنشاء خطط قوية للتنفيذ","تحديد التحسينات والتكرار","تطوير البنية التحتية لمنصات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UX 设计","用户体验","架构师","技术专家","用户流程","实施计划","跨平台基础设施"],"ja":["UX デザイン","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","アーキテクト","技術専門家","ユーザーフロー","実装計画","複数のプラットフォーム"],"ko":["UX 디자인","사용자 경험","아키텍트","기술 전문가","사용자 흐름","구현 계획","여러 플랫폼"],"es":["arquitecto de UX","experiencias de usuario","planificación de UX","análisis de sistemas","diseño de interfaces","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["architecte UX","expériences utilisateur","planification UX","analyse de systèmes","conception d''interfaces","développement de logiciels"],"de":["UX-Architekt","Benutzererfahrungen","UX-Planung","Systemanalyse","Interface-Design","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["arquiteto de UX","experiência do usuário","planejamento de UX","análise de sistemas","fluxos de usuário","criação de planos","infraestrutura de UX"],"ru":["архитектор UX","пользовательский опыт","планирование UX","анализ систем","потоки пользователей","создание планов","инфраструктура UX"],"ar":["مهندس تجربة المستخدم","تجربة المستخدم","تخطيط تجربة المستخدم","تحليل الأنظمة","تدفقات المستخدم","إنشاء خطط","بنية تحتية لتجربة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"armanisadeghi","repo":"real-singles","repoPath":"armanisadeghi/real-singles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ux-architect","description":"Analyzes user flows, determines feature requirements, and creates UI/UX infrastructure plans. Use when planning new features, evaluating user journeys, identifying feature gaps, or when the user mentions user flow, UX planning, feature analysis, UI architecture, or needs to understand what features to add, remove, or modify. Outputs actionable plans for platform experts to implement.","bodyPreview":"# UX Architect\n\n**Your job:** Analyze existing systems, understand user flows, and create solid plans BEFORE implementation. You determine WHAT to build and WHY. Platform experts (iOS, Android, Web) handle HOW.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Planning a new feature or feature area\n- Evaluating if a user journey makes sense\n- Identifying what''s missing, redundant, or needs improvement\n- Creating infrastructure plans that span multiple platforms\n- User says: \"plan\", \"flow\", \"what features\", \"us","body":"# UX Architect\n\n**Your job:** Analyze existing systems, understand user flows, and create solid plans BEFORE implementation. You determine WHAT to build and WHY. Platform experts (iOS, Android, Web) handle HOW.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Planning a new feature or feature area\n- Evaluating if a user journey makes sense\n- Identifying what''s missing, redundant, or needs improvement\n- Creating infrastructure plans that span multiple platforms\n- User says: \"plan\", \"flow\", \"what features\", \"user journey\", \"UX analysis\"\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. User-Centric Analysis\n\nEvery decision answers: **\"What does the user need to accomplish, and what''s the shortest path to get there?\"**\n\n### 2. Data-Driven Discovery\n\nDon''t guess. Analyze:\n- What APIs already exist\n- What the database supports\n- What UI is currently built\n- What the data inventory shows as gaps\n\n### 3. Platform-Agnostic Planning\n\nYour plans describe WHAT happens, not HOW each platform implements it. Implementation details are for platform-specific skills.\n\n### 4. Actionable Output\n\nPlans must be specific enough that a developer can execute without asking clarifying questions.\n\n---\n\n## Analysis Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Understand the Goal\n\nBefore analyzing anything, clarify:\n\n```markdown\n## Goal Definition\n\n**What the user wants:** [User''s request in their words]\n**Core user problem:** [What pain point or need does this address?]\n**Success criteria:** [How will we know this works?]\n**Scope boundaries:** [What''s explicitly NOT included?]\n```\n\n### Phase 2: System Discovery\n\n**Analyze in this order:**\n\n#### 2.1 Data Inventory Check\n\nStart with `docs/data_inventory.md` — the source of truth for what exists.\n\n```markdown\n## Relevant Data Fields\n\n| Field | DB | API | Web | Mobile | Status |\n|-------|----|----|-----|--------|--------|\n| [field] | ✓/✗ | R/W | E/D | E/D | FULL/PARTIAL |\n\n**Gaps identified:**\n- [List fields that exist in DB but not UI]\n- [List fields that exist in API but not exposed]\n```\n\n#### 2.2 API Capabilities\n\nCheck `web/src/app/api/` for existing endpoints.\n\n```markdown\n## Available API Endpoints\n\n| Operation | Endpoint | Exists? | Notes |\n|-----------|----------|---------|-------|\n| [verb] [resource] | [path] | ✓/✗ | [what it does or what''s missing] |\n\n**API gaps:**\n- [Operations needed but not available]\n- [Endpoints that need enhancement]\n```\n\n#### 2.3 Current UI Audit\n\nCheck existing pages in `web/src/app/(app)/` and `mobile/app/`.\n\n```markdown\n## Current UI State\n\n### Web Pages\n| Page | Path | What it does | Issues |\n|------|------|-------------|--------|\n| [name] | [path] | [purpose] | [problems or gaps] |\n\n### Mobile Screens\n| Screen | Path | What it does | Issues |\n|--------|------|-------------|--------|\n| [name] | [path] | [purpose] | [problems or gaps] |\n```\n\n#### 2.4 Business Logic Check\n\nReview `docs/business_logic.md` for rules that affect the feature.\n\n---\n\n### Phase 3: User Flow Mapping\n\nMap the complete user journey for this feature.\n\n```markdown\n## User Flow: [Feature Name]\n\n### Entry Points\n- [How users discover/access this feature]\n\n### Primary Flow\n1. User is on [starting point]\n2. User [action] → System [response]\n3. User sees [result/screen]\n4. User [next action] → ...\n5. Success state: [what indicates completion]\n\n### Alternate Flows\n- If [condition]: [what happens]\n- If [error]: [how we handle it]\n\n### Exit Points\n- [Where users go after completing the flow]\n- [How users cancel/abandon]\n\n### Flow Diagram\n[entry] → [step 1] → [step 2] → [decision point]\n                                  ↓ yes        ↓ no\n                              [path A]     [path B]\n                                  ↓            ↓\n                              [success]    [retry/exit]\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 4: Gap Analysis\n\nIdentify what''s missing, redundant, or broken.\n\n```markdown\n## Gap Analysis\n\n### Features to ADD\n| Feature | Why Needed | User Benefit | Complexity |\n|---------|------------|--------------|------------|\n| [feature] | [reason] | [user value] | Low/Med/High |\n\n### Features to MODIFY\n| Current State | Problem | Proposed Change |\n|---------------|---------|-----------------|\n| [what exists] | [issue] | [improvement] |\n\n### Features to REMOVE\n| Feature | Why Remove | Migration Path |\n|---------|------------|----------------|\n| [feature] | [reason] | [how to handle existing users] |\n\n### Technical Debt\n| Issue | Impact | Priority |\n|-------|--------|----------|\n| [problem] | [effect on users/system] | P1/P2/P3 |\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 5: Infrastructure Requirements\n\nDefine what needs to exist for this feature to work.\n\n```markdown\n## Infrastructure Requirements\n\n### Database Changes\n| Table | Change | Migration |\n|-------|--------|-----------|\n| [table] | [add/modify column] | [migration description] |\n\n### New API Endpoints\n| Method | Path | Purpose | Request | Response |\n|--------|------|---------|---------|----------|\n| [verb] | [path] | [what it does] | [body] | [shape] |\n\n### API Modifications\n| Endpoint | Current | Needed Change |\n|----------|---------|---------------|\n| [path] | [behavior] | [new behavior] |\n\n### Shared Constants\n| Constant | Values | Used By |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| [name] | [options] | [components] |\n\nRemember: Constants must be synced between:\n- `mobile/constants/options.ts`\n- `web/src/types/index.ts`\n```\n\n---\n\n### Phase 6: Action Plan\n\nCreate the implementation roadmap.\n\n```markdown\n## Implementation Plan\n\n### Phase A: Foundation (Backend)\n1. [ ] Database migration: [description]\n2. [ ] API endpoint: [description]\n3. [ ] Business logic: [description]\n\n### Phase B: Web Implementation\n1. [ ] Page/component: [description]\n2. [ ] Integration: [description]\n\n### Phase C: Mobile Implementation\n1. [ ] iOS screen: [description]\n2. [ ] Android screen: [description]\n\n### Phase D: Verification\n1. [ ] Feature parity check\n2. [ ] User flow testing\n3. [ ] Edge case handling\n\n### Dependencies\n- [Phase B depends on Phase A completion]\n- [Component X requires API Y]\n\n### Risks\n| Risk | Mitigation |\n|------|------------|\n| [potential issue] | [how to prevent/handle] |\n```\n\n---\n\n## Analysis Templates\n\n### Quick Feature Audit\n\nUse when evaluating a single feature:\n\n```markdown\n## Feature Audit: [Name]\n\n**Current state:** [Working/Broken/Partial/Missing]\n\n**User flow:**\n[entry] → [step 1] → [step 2] → [outcome]\n\n**Problems:**\n1. [Issue and impact]\n\n**Recommendations:**\n1. [Specific action]\n\n**Effort:** Low/Medium/High\n**Priority:** P1/P2/P3\n```\n\n### User Journey Map\n\nUse for multi-screen flows:\n\n```markdown\n## Journey: [User Goal]\n\n| Step | Screen | User Action | System Response | Pain Points |\n|------|--------|-------------|-----------------|-------------|\n| 1 | [screen] | [action] | [response] | [friction] |\n| 2 | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n\n**Opportunities:**\n- [Where we can reduce friction]\n- [Where we can add delight]\n```\n\n### Feature Comparison Matrix\n\nUse when evaluating multiple approaches:\n\n```markdown\n## Options Analysis: [Decision]\n\n| Criteria | Option A | Option B | Option C |\n|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| User benefit | [rating] | [rating] | [rating] |\n| Implementation effort | [rating] | [rating] | [rating] |\n| Maintenance burden | [rating] | [rating] | [rating] |\n| Platform consistency | [rating] | [rating] | [rating] |\n\n**Recommendation:** Option [X] because [reasons]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Red Flags to Watch For\n\n### UX Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Why It''s Bad | Better Approach |\n|--------------|--------------|-----------------|\n| Dead ends | User stuck with no clear next action | Always show next step or exit |\n| Hidden features | Users can''t find functionality | Progressive disclosure, clear navigation |\n| Inconsistent patterns | Same action works differently | Standardize interactions |\n| Modal overload | Too many interruptions | Inline feedback, bottom sheets |\n| Long forms | User fatigue, abandonment | Break into steps, save progress |\n| Missing feedback | User unsure if action worked | Confirm every action visibly |\n\n### Technical Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Why It''s Bad | Better Approach |\n|--------------|--------------|-----------------|\n| Logic in components | Fragmented implementations | Centralize in API/services |\n| Platform-specific APIs | Inconsistent data | Single API, platform-specific UI |\n| Hardcoded options | Sync drift between platforms | Shared constants files |\n| Missing loading states | User thinks app is broken | Show skeleton/spinner |\n| Silent failures | User doesn''t know error occurred | Show error with recovery action |\n\n---\n\n## Project-Specific References\n\n### Source of Truth Files\n\n| Purpose | File |\n|---------|------|\n| All data fields | `docs/data_inventory.md` |\n| Business rules | `docs/business_logic.md` |\n| Requirements | `docs/project_requirements.md` |\n| UI patterns | `docs/ui_patterns.md` |\n\n### Implementation Locations\n\n| Layer | Path |\n|-------|------|\n| Database schema | `web/supabase/migrations/` |\n| API endpoints | `web/src/app/api/` |\n| Web pages | `web/src/app/(app)/` |\n| Web components | `web/src/components/` |\n| Mobile screens | `mobile/app/` |\n| Mobile components | `mobile/components/` |\n| Shared constants (mobile) | `mobile/constants/options.ts` |\n| Shared constants (web) | `web/src/types/index.ts` |\n\n### Key API Endpoint Groups\n\n| Domain | Base Path | Purpose |\n|--------|-----------|---------|\n| Auth | `/api/auth/` | Login, register, verification |\n| Users | `/api/users/` | Profile CRUD, gallery |\n| Discovery | `/api/discover/` | Browse profiles, top matches |\n| Matches | `/api/matches/` | Like/pass, match management |\n| Conversations | `/api/conversations/` | Chat threads |\n| Messages | `/api/messages/` | Individual messages |\n| Events | `/api/events/` | Singles events |\n| Speed Dating | `/api/speed-dating/` | Virtual speed dating |\n| Groups | `/api/groups/` | Community groups |\n| Notifications | `/api/notifications/` | Push/in-app notifications |\n| Points | `/api/points/` | Rewards system |\n\n---\n\n## Handoff to Platform Skills\n\nAfter completing your analysis, the implementation is handled by:\n\n| Skill | Handles |\n|-------|---------|\n| `nextjs-app-router-expert` | Web pages, API routes |\n| `modern-web-design-expert` | Web UI patterns, CSS |\n| `ios-native-expert` | iOS implementation |\n| `android-native-expert` | Android implementation |\n| `supabase-expert` | Database, migrations, RLS |\n| `feature-parity-check` | Post-implementation verification |\n\n**Your plan should be detailed enough that these skills can execute without ambiguity.**\n\n---\n\n## Output Checklist\n\nBefore delivering a plan, verify:\n\n- [ ] Goal is clearly defined with success criteria\n- [ ] Data inventory gaps identified\n- [ ] API capabilities mapped\n- [ ] Current UI state documented\n- [ ] User flow mapped with entry/exit points\n- [ ] Gap analysis complete (add/modify/remove)\n- [ ] Infrastructure requirements specified\n- [ ] Implementation phases defined\n- [ ] Dependencies and risks identified\n- [ ] Specific enough for developers to execute\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:27:49.347Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT needing user flow analysis and planning capabilities for multi-platform infrastructure projects.","zh":"非常适合像 Cursor 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要用户流分析和规划能力，以用于多平台基础设施项目。","ja":"Cursor や AutoGPT などの AI エージェントが、多プラットフォームインフラストラクチャプロジェクトに必要なユーザーフロー分析および計画機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Cursor 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트가 다중 플랫폼 인프라 프로젝트를 위해 사용자 흐름 분석 및 계획 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor y AutoGPT que necesitan análisis de flujo de usuario y capacidades de planificación para proyectos de infraestructura multiplataforma.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor et AutoGPT nécessitant une analyse de flux d''utilisateurs et des capacités de planification pour les projets d''infrastructure multiplateforme.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor und AutoGPT, die eine Analyse des Benutzerflusses und Planungsfähigkeiten für Multi-Plattform-Infrastrukturprojekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Cursor e AutoGPT que necessitam de análise de fluxo de usuário e capacidades de planejamento para projetos de infraestrutura multiplataforma.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor и AutoGPT, которым необходимы возможности анализа потока пользователей и планирования для проектов инфраструктуры с несколькими платформами.","ar":"مثالي لعميلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل تدفق المستخدم وقدرات التخطيط لمشاريع البنية التحتية متعددة المنصات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to determine what features to build and why, creating solid plans before implementation, and handling user journey evaluations using platform-agnostic protocols like iOS, Android, and Web.","zh":"赋予代理确定要构建哪些功能以及为什么构建，并在实施之前创建固定的计划，并使用平台无关协议（如 iOS、Android 和 Web）处理用户旅程评估。","ja":"エージェントがどの機能を構築するかおよびその理由を決定し、実装前に堅固な計画を作成し、iOS、Android、Web などのプラットフォーム非依存プロトコルを使用してユーザージャーニーの評価を行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 구축할 기능과 구축 이유를 결정하고, 구현 전에 확고한 계획을 수립하며, iOS, Android, Webなどの 플랫폼 독립 프로토콜을 사용하여 사용자 여정을 평가할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes determinar qué características construir y por qué, creando planes sólidos antes de la implementación y manejando evaluaciones del recorrido del usuario utilizando protocolos agnósticos de plataforma como iOS, Android y Web.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déterminer quelles fonctionnalités construire et pourquoi, en créant des plans solides avant la mise en œuvre et en gérant les évaluations du parcours utilisateur à l''aide de protocoles agnostiques de plateforme tels que iOS, Android et Web.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, zu bestimmen, welche Funktionen zu erstellen sind und warum, indem sie solide Pläne vor der Implementierung erstellen und Benutzerreisebewertungen mithilfe plattformagnostischer Protokolle wie iOS, Android und Web verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a determinar quais recursos construir e por quê, criando planos sólidos antes da implementação e lidando com avaliações da jornada do usuário usando protocolos agnósticos de plataforma como iOS, Android e Web.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определить, какие функции следует создать и почему, создавая прочные планы до реализации и обрабатывая оценки пути пользователя с помощью протоколов, независимых от платформы, таких как iOS, Android и Web.","ar":"تمكن العميلاء من تحديد الميزات التي يجب بناؤها والسبب، وإنشاء خطط محكمة قبل التنفيذ ومعالجة تقييمات رحلة المستخدم باستخدام بروتوكولات غير معتمدة على المنصة مثل iOS و Android و Web."},"useCases":{"en":["Planning new feature areas","Evaluating user journey flows","Identifying redundant or missing features","Creating cross-platform infrastructure plans"],"zh":["规划新的功能领域","评估用户旅程流程","确定冗余或缺失的功能","创建跨平台基础设施计划"],"ja":["新しい機能領域の計画","ユーザージャーニーフローの評価","冗長または欠落した機能の特定","クロスプラットフォームインフラストラクチャ計画の作成"],"ko":["새로운 기능 영역 계획","사용자 여정 흐름 평가","중복 또는 누락된 기능 식별","크로스 플랫폼 인프라 계획 생성"],"es":["Planificación de nuevas áreas de características","Evaluación de flujos de recorrido del usuario","Identificación de características redundantes o faltantes","Creación de planes de infraestructura multiplataforma"],"fr":["Planification de nouveaux domaines de fonctionnalités","Évaluation des flux de parcours utilisateur","Identification de fonctionnalités redondantes ou manquantes","Création de plans d''infrastructure multiplateforme"],"de":["Planung neuer Funktionsbereiche","Bewertung von Benutzerreise-Flüssen","Identifizierung redundanter oder fehlender Funktionen","Erstellung von Plänen für Multi-Plattform-Infrastrukturen"],"pt":["Planejamento de novas áreas de recursos","Avaliação de fluxos de jornada do usuário","Identificação de recursos redundantes ou ausentes","Criação de planos de infraestrutura cross-plataforma"],"ru":["Планирование новых областей функций","Оценка потоков пути пользователя","Определение избыточных или отсутствующих функций","Создание планов инфраструктуры для нескольких платформ"],"ar":["تخطيط مناطق موارد جديدة","تقييم تدفقات رحلة المستخدم","تحديد الميزات الزائدة أو الناقصة","إنشاء خطط بنية تحتية متعددة المنصات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of user flow and platform expertise","Limited to pre-implementation planning phase"],"zh":["需要了解用户流程和平台专业知识","仅限于实施前规划阶段"],"ja":["ユーザーフローとプラットフォームの専門知識を理解する必要がある","実装前計画段階のみに限定される"],"ko":["사용자 흐름과 플랫폼 전문 지식을 이해해야 함","구현 전 계획 단계에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del flujo de usuario y experiencia en plataforma","Limitado a la fase de planificación preimplementación"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du flux d''utilisateurs et une expertise en plateforme","Limité à la phase de planification pré-mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis des Benutzerflusses und Plattformerfahrung","Begrenzt auf die Phase der Vorimplementierungsplanung"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do fluxo de usuário e especialização em plataforma","Limitado à fase de planejamento pré-implantação"],"ru":["Требует понимания потока пользователя и экспертизы платформы","Ограничен фазой планирования до реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم تدفق المستخدم وخبرة منصة","محدود لمرحلة التخطيط قبل التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
