des. Your goal is to capture the business and functional requirements of the product and to provide solid context for others working on the product. You should include:\n\nProject overview / description\nTarget audience\nPrimary benefits / features\nHigh-level tech/architecture used\nKeep the brief very concise and to the point just to give enough context to understand the bigger picture. Write the document into docs/PRODUCT_BRI","body":"Please create a product brief based on the description that the user provides. Your goal is to capture the business and functional requirements of the product and to provide solid context for others working on the product. You should include:\n\nProject overview / description\nTarget audience\nPrimary benefits / features\nHigh-level tech/architecture used\nKeep the brief very concise and to the point just to give enough context to understand the bigger picture. Write the document into docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF.md (unless a different file name is specified)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:27:54.331Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing concise product brief generation for NextJS and Expo projects.","zh":"非常适合需要为 NextJS 和 Expo 项目生成简洁产品简介的开发代理。","ja":"NextJS と Expo プロジェクトの簡潔な製品の概要を生成する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"NextJS와 Expo 프로젝트를 위한 간결한 제품 브리핑 생성이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una generación concisa de descripciones de productos para proyectos de NextJS y Expo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une génération concise de descriptifs de produits pour les projets NextJS et Expo.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine präzise Erstellung von Produktbeschreibungen für NextJS- und Expo-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Development Agents needing concise product brief generation for NextJS and Expo projects.","ru":"Perfect for Development Agents needing concise product brief generation for NextJS and Expo projects.","ar":"Perfect for Development Agents needing concise product brief generation for NextJS and Expo projects."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture business and functional requirements using high-level tech and architecture descriptions, including project overviews, target audiences, and primary benefits, all within a monorepo template, utilizing Markdown documentation in the docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF directory.","zh":"赋予代理能够使用高级技术和架构描述捕获业务和功能需求，包括项目概述、目标受众和主要优点，所有这些都在一个 monorepo 模板中，使用 docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF 目录中的 Markdown 文档。","ja":"エージェントが、高レベルのテクノロジーとアーキテクチャの説明を使用してビジネスと機能要件を把握し、プロジェクトの概要、ターゲットオーディエンス、主な利点などを monorepo テンプレート内でMarkdown ドキュメントを使用して記述できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 높은 수준의 기술 및 아키텍처 설명을 사용하여 비즈니스 및 기능 요구 사항을 캡처하고 monorepo 템플릿 내에서 프로젝트 개요, 대상 고객 및 주요 이점 등을 Markdown 문서를 사용하여 설명할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar requisitos comerciales y funcionales utilizando descripciones técnicas y de arquitectura de alto nivel, incluyendo descripciones generales del proyecto, audiencias objetivo y beneficios principales, todo dentro de una plantilla de monorepo, utilizando la documentación en Markdown en el directorio docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer les exigences commerciales et fonctionnelles en utilisant des descriptions techniques et d''architecture de haut niveau, y compris les descriptions générales du projet, les publics cibles et les avantages principaux, le tout dans un modèle de monorepo, en utilisant la documentation Markdown dans le répertoire docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Geschäfts- und Funktionsanforderungen unter Verwendung von hochrangigen technischen und Architekturbeschreibungen zu erfassen, einschließlich Projektdescriptions, Zielgruppen und primäre Vorteile, alles innerhalb einer Monorepo-Vorlage, unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dokumentation im Verzeichnis docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF.","pt":"Empowers agents to capture business and functional requirements using high-level tech and architecture descriptions, including project overviews, target audiences, and primary benefits, all within a monorepo template, utilizing Markdown documentation in the docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF directory.","ru":"Empowers agents to capture business and functional requirements using high-level tech and architecture descriptions, including project overviews, target audiences, and primary benefits, all within a monorepo template, utilizing Markdown documentation in the docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF directory.","ar":"Empowers agents to capture business and functional requirements using high-level tech and architecture descriptions, including project overviews, target audiences, and primary benefits, all within a monorepo template, utilizing Markdown documentation in the docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF directory."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating product briefs for new NextJS applications","Creating concise project descriptions for Expo projects","Documenting high-level architecture for monorepo templates"],"zh":["为新 NextJS 应用程序生成产品简介","为 Expo 项目创建简洁的项目描述","记录 monorepo 模板的高级架构"],"ja":["新しい NextJS アプリケーションの製品の概要を生成する","Expo プロジェクトの簡潔なプロジェクトの説明を作成する","monorepo テンプレートの高レベルのアーキテクチャを文書化する"],"ko":["새로운 NextJS 애플리케이션을 위한 제품 브리핑 생성","Expo 프로젝트를 위한 간결한 프로젝트 설명 생성","monorepo 템플릿의 높은 수준의 아키텍처 문서화"],"es":["Generar descripciones de productos para nuevas aplicaciones NextJS","Crear descripciones de proyectos concisas para proyectos Expo","Documentar la arquitectura de alto nivel para plantillas de monorepo"],"fr":["Générer des descriptifs de produits pour les nouvelles applications NextJS","Créer des descriptions de projet concises pour les projets Expo","Documenter l''architecture de haut niveau pour les modèles de monorepo"],"de":["Erstellung von Produktbeschreibungen für neue NextJS-Anwendungen","Erstellen von knappen Projektdescriptions für Expo-Projekte","Dokumentation der hochrangigen Architektur für Monorepo-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Generating product briefs for new NextJS applications","Creating concise project descriptions for Expo projects","Documenting high-level architecture for monorepo templates"],"ru":["Generating product briefs for new NextJS applications","Creating concise project descriptions for Expo projects","Documenting high-level architecture for monorepo templates"],"ar":["Generating product briefs for new NextJS applications","Creating concise project descriptions for Expo projects","Documenting high-level architecture for monorepo templates"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires documentation directory setup","Limited to monorepo template structure","NextJS and Expo project compatibility only"],"zh":["需要设置文档目录","仅限 monorepo 模板结构","仅兼容 NextJS 和 Expo 项目"],"ja":["ドキュメント ディレクトリの設定が必要","monorepo テンプレート構造のみ対応","NextJS と Expo プロジェクトのみ対応"],"ko":["문서 디렉토리 설정이 필요함","monorepo 템플릿 구조만対応","NextJS와 Expo 프로젝트만対応"],"es":["Requiere configuración del directorio de documentación","Limitado a la estructura de plantilla de monorepo","Compatibilidad solo con proyectos NextJS y Expo"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du répertoire de documentation","Limité à la structure de modèle de monorepo","Compatibilité uniquement avec les projets NextJS et Expo"],"de":["Benötigt Einrichtung des Dokumentationsverzeichnisses","Begrenzt auf die Struktur der Monorepo-Vorlage","Kompatibilität nur mit NextJS- und Expo-Projekten"],"pt":["Requires documentation directory setup","Limited to monorepo template structure","NextJS and Expo project compatibility only"],"ru":["Requires documentation directory setup","Limited to monorepo template structure","NextJS and Expo project compatibility only"],"ar":["Requires documentation directory setup","Limited to monorepo template structure","NextJS and Expo project compatibility only"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tcarrio/cursor-voice-plugin/voice-update', 'community', 'tcarrio', 'cursor-voice-plugin', 'tcarrio/cursor-voice-plugin', 'voice-update', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z', '2026-02-18T10:28:15.013Z', NULL, '{"id":"tcarrio/cursor-voice-plugin/voice-update","name":"voice-update","description":{"zh":"语音更新技能允许您使用pocket-tts提供简短的音频反馈，适用于任务完成或重要状态更新","ja":"ボイスアップデートスキルは、pocket-ttsを使用して簡潔な音声フィードバックを提供します。タスク完了や重要なステータス更新に適しています","ko":"음성 업데이트 스킬은 pocket-tts를 사용하여 간단한 오디오 피드백을 제공합니다. 작업 완료 또는 중요한 상태 업데이트에 적합합니다","es":"La habilidad de actualización de voz permite a los desarrolladores proporcionar retroalimentación de audio a los usuarios de manera sencilla","fr":"La compétence de mise à jour vocale permet aux développeurs de fournir une rétroaction audio aux utilisateurs de manière simple","de":"Die Sprachupdate-Fähigkeit ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Benutzern einfaches Audio-Feedback zu geben","pt":"A habilidade de atualização de voz fornece feedback de áudio aos usuários por meio do script say. É útil para resumos breves e atualizações de status importantes.","ru":"Навык голосового обновления обеспечивает аудио-обратную связь пользователям с помощью скрипта say. Он полезен для кратких резюме и важных обновлений статуса.","ar":"مهارة تحديث الصوت توفر تعليقات صوتية للمستخدمين من خلال سكريبت say. وهي مفيدة لملخصات قصيرة وتحديثات حالة مهمة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"语音更新技能：使用pocket-tts提供音频反馈","ja":"ボイスアップデートスキル：pocket-ttsを使用した音声フィードバック","ko":"음성 업데이트 스킬: pocket-tts를 사용한 오디오 피드백","es":"Actualización de voz para desarrolladores","fr":"Mise à jour vocale pour les développeurs","de":"Sprachupdate für Entwickler","pt":"Atualização de Voz: Recursos de Áudio para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Голосовое Обновление: Возможности Аудио для Разработчиков","ar":"تحديث الصوت: ميزات الصوت لل مطورين","en":"voice-update"},"description":{"zh":"语音更新技能允许您使用pocket-tts提供简短的音频反馈，适用于任务完成或重要状态更新","ja":"ボイスアップデートスキルは、pocket-ttsを使用して簡潔な音声フィードバックを提供します。タスク完了や重要なステータス更新に適しています","ko":"음성 업데이트 스킬은 pocket-tts를 사용하여 간단한 오디오 피드백을 제공합니다. 작업 완료 또는 중요한 상태 업데이트에 적합합니다","es":"La habilidad de actualización de voz permite a los desarrolladores proporcionar retroalimentación de audio a los usuarios de manera sencilla","fr":"La compétence de mise à jour vocale permet aux développeurs de fournir une rétroaction audio aux utilisateurs de manière simple","de":"Die Sprachupdate-Fähigkeit ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Benutzern einfaches Audio-Feedback zu geben","pt":"A habilidade de atualização de voz fornece feedback de áudio aos usuários por meio do script say. É útil para resumos breves e atualizações de status importa...","ru":"Навык голосового обновления обеспечивает аудио-обратную связь пользователям с помощью скрипта say. Он полезен для кратких резюме и важных обновлений статуса.","ar":"مهارة تحديث الصوت توفر تعليقات صوتية للمستخدمين من خلال سكريبت say. وهي مفيدة لملخصات قصيرة وتحديثات حالة مهمة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用pocket-tts提供音频反馈","简短的音频摘要","任务完成或重要状态更新","提高用户体验","简单易用"],"ja":["pocket-ttsを使用した音声フィードバック","簡潔な音声まとめ","タスク完了や重要なステータス更新","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上","簡単に使用できる"],"ko":["pocket-tts를 사용한 오디오 피드백","간단한 오디오 요약","작업 완료 또는 중요한 상태 업데이트","사용자 경험 향상","간단한 사용법"],"es":["Proporciona retroalimentación de audio a los usuarios","Permite resumir tareas de manera conversacional","Se integra con pocket-tts","Es fácil de usar","Permite actualizaciones de estado importantes"],"fr":["Fournit une rétroaction audio aux utilisateurs","Permet de résumer des tâches de manière conversationnelle","S''intègre avec pocket-tts","Est facile à utiliser","Permet des mises à jour de statut importantes"],"de":["Bietet Benutzern Audio-Feedback","Ermöglicht die Zusammenfassung von Aufgaben in konversationellem Stil","Integriert sich mit pocket-tts","Ist einfach zu verwenden","Ermöglicht wichtige Status-Updates"],"pt":["Fornece feedback de áudio aos usuários","Útil para resumos breves e atualizações de status","Utiliza o script say para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Permite a personalização da mensagem de áudio","É compatível com a instalação padrão do XDG"],"ru":["Обеспечивает аудио-обратную связь пользователям","Полезен для кратких резюме и важных обновлений статуса","Использует скрипт say для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Позволяет настраивать аудио-сообщение","Совместим со стандартной установкой XDG"],"ar":["توفر تعليقات صوتية للمستخدمين","مفيدة لملخصات قصيرة وتحديثات حالة مهمة","تستخدم سكريبت say لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","تمكن من تخصيص رسالة الصوت","متوافقة مع التثبيت القياسي ل XDG"]},"keywords":{"zh":["语音更新技能","pocket-tts","音频反馈","任务完成","重要状态更新","用户体验","音频摘要"],"ja":["ボイスアップデートスキル","pocket-tts","音声フィードバック","タスク完了","重要なステータス更新","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","音声まとめ"],"ko":["음성 업데이트 스킬","pocket-tts","오디오 피드백","작업 완료","중요한 상태 업데이트","사용자 경험","오디오 요약"],"es":["actualización de voz","retroalimentación de audio","desarrollo de software","pocket-tts","integración de audio","desarrollo de aplicaciones","experiencia del usuario","interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["mise à jour vocale","rétroaction audio","développement de logiciels","pocket-tts","intégration audio","développement d''applications","expérience utilisateur","interface utilisateur"],"de":["Sprachupdate","Audio-Feedback","Software-Entwicklung","pocket-tts","Audio-Integration","App-Entwicklung","Benutzererfahrung","Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["atualização de voz","feedback de áudio","script say","desenvolvimento de voz","experiência do usuário","áudio para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["голосовое обновление","аудио-обратная связь","скрипт say","разработка голосовых приложений","пользовательский опыт","аудио для разработчиков"],"ar":["تحديث الصوت","تعليقات صوتية","سكريبت say","تطوير تطبيقات الصوت","تجربة المستخدم","صوت لل مطورين"]}},"owner":"tcarrio","repo":"cursor-voice-plugin","repoPath":"tcarrio/cursor-voice-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"voice-update","description":"Use when the agent should give a spoken voice update—e.g. after finishing a task or when the user asks for a spoken summary. Speaks a short summary via pocket-tts.","bodyPreview":"# Voice Update Skill\n\nProvide spoken audio feedback using pocket-tts (say script).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- When finishing a task and you want to give a brief spoken summary\n- When the user asks for a spoken summary or voice update\n- For important status updates that benefit from audio\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Summarize what was accomplished in 1–2 short, conversational sentences.\n2. Call the say script with that summary.\n\n## Calling the Say Script\n\nUse the say script from the plugin. Standard install (XDG)","body":"# Voice Update Skill\n\nProvide spoken audio feedback using pocket-tts (say script).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- When finishing a task and you want to give a brief spoken summary\n- When the user asks for a spoken summary or voice update\n- For important status updates that benefit from audio\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Summarize what was accomplished in 1–2 short, conversational sentences.\n2. Call the say script with that summary.\n\n## Calling the Say Script\n\nUse the say script from the plugin. Standard install (XDG): `$XDG_DATA_HOME/voice-plugin-cursor/scripts/say` (default `~/.local/share/voice-plugin-cursor/scripts/say`). If `VOICE_PLUGIN_ROOT` is set, use that.\n\n```bash\n\"${VOICE_PLUGIN_ROOT:-$HOME/.local/share/voice-plugin-cursor}/scripts/say\" \"Your summary here\"\n```\n\nExamples:\n\n```bash\n~/.local/share/voice-plugin-cursor/scripts/say \"I''ve fixed the bug in the login handler and added the unit tests.\"\n~/.local/share/voice-plugin-cursor/scripts/say --voice azure \"Task completed successfully.\"\n```\n\n## Summary Guidelines\n\n- 1–2 sentences max; conversational, not robotic\n- Match the user''s tone\n- Focus on what was accomplished; avoid code, paths, and jargon\n- Examples: \"I''ve updated the config and restarted the server.\" / \"Tests are passing; I fixed three type errors.\"\n\n## Notes\n\n- The say script can auto-start the pocket-tts server (first run may take ~30–60s).\n- Requires `uvx` and `afplay` (macOS), `aplay` or `paplay` (Linux), or similar.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:28:15.013Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational AI Agents needing spoken audio feedback capabilities using pocket-tts","zh":"适合需要使用 pocket-tts 进行语音音频反馈的对话式 AI 代理","ja":"pocket-tts を使用した音声オーディオ フィードバック 機能を必要とする会話 AI エージェントに最適","ko":"pocket-tts를 사용하여 음성 오디오 피드백 기능을 필요한 대화형 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Conversacional que necesitan capacidades de retroalimentación de audio hablado utilizando pocket-tts","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''IA Conversationnels nécessitant des capacités de rétroaction audio parlée en utilisant pocket-tts","de":"Ideal für Conversational AI-Agenten, die gesprochene Audio-Rückmeldungen mit pocket-tts benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Conversacional que necessitam de capacidades de feedback de áudio falado usando pocket-tts","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных ИИ-агентов, которым необходимы возможности голосовой обратной связи с помощью pocket-tts","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المحادثي الذي يحتاج إلى возможات ملاحظات صوتية منطوقة باستخدام pocket-tts"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide spoken summaries and status updates using the say script, enhancing user interaction with audio feedback and leveraging pocket-tts for seamless voice integration","zh":"赋予代理提供语音摘要和状态更新的能力，使用 say 脚本增强用户与音频反馈的交互，并利用 pocket-tts 实现无缝的语音集成","ja":"エージェントに音声要約とステータス更新を提供する能力を与え、say スクリプトを使用してユーザーとのオーディオ フィードバックのやり取りを強化し、pocket-tts を使用して無駄のないボイス統合を実現","ko":"에이전트가 음성 요약 및 상태 업데이트를 제공할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 say 스크립트를 사용하여 사용자와의 오디오 피드백 상호 작용을 강화하고 pocket-tts를 사용하여 무결점 보이스 통합을 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar resúmenes y actualizaciones de estado hablados mediante el script say, mejorando la interacción del usuario con la retroalimentación de audio y aprovechando pocket-tts para una integración de voz sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des résumés et des mises à jour de statut parlés en utilisant le script say, améliorant l''interaction utilisateur avec la rétroaction audio et exploitant pocket-tts pour une intégration vocale sans accroc","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gesprochene Zusammenfassungen und Statusupdates mithilfe des say-Skripts bereitzustellen, wodurch die Benutzerinteraktion durch Audio-Rückmeldungen verbessert und eine nahtlose Sprachintegration mit pocket-tts ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer resumos falados e atualizações de status usando o script say, melhorando a interação do usuário com feedback de áudio e utilizando pocket-tts para integração de voz sem problemas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять голосовые резюме и обновления статуса с помощью скрипта say, улучшая взаимодействие пользователя с помощью аудиообратной связи и используя pocket-tts для бесшовной интеграции голоса","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تقديم ملخصات محادثة وتنبيهات تحديث الحالة باستخدام سيناريو القول، وتحسين تفاعل المستخدم مع ملاحظات الصوت وتحقيق التكامل الصوتي السلس باستخدام pocket-tts"},"useCases":{"en":["Providing spoken task summaries","Offering voice updates for important status changes","Enhancing user experience with audio feedback"],"zh":["提供语音任务摘要","为重要状态更改提供语音更新","使用音频反馈增强用户体验"],"ja":["音声タスクのサマリーを提供する","重要なステータス変更のための音声更新を提供する","オーディオ フィードバックを使用してユーザー エクスペリエンスを強化する"],"ko":["음성 작업 요약 제공","중요한 상태 변경에 대한 음성 업데이트를 제공","오디오 피드백을 사용하여 사용자 경험을 강화"],"es":["Proporcionar resúmenes de tareas hablados","Ofrecer actualizaciones de voz para cambios importantes de estado","Mejorar la experiencia del usuario con la retroalimentación de audio"],"fr":["Fournir des résumés de tâches parlés","Offrir des mises à jour vocales pour les changements importants d''état","Améliorer l''expérience utilisateur avec la rétroaction audio"],"de":["Gesprochene Aufgabenzusammenfassungen bereitstellen","Sprachupdates für wichtige Statusänderungen anbieten","Benutzererfahrung mit Audio-Rückmeldungen verbessern"],"pt":["Fornecer resumos de tarefas falados","Oferecer atualizações de voz para alterações importantes de status","Melhorar a experiência do usuário com feedback de áudio"],"ru":["Предоставление голосовых резюме задач","Предложение голосовых обновлений для важных изменений статуса","Улучшение опыта пользователя с помощью аудиообратной связи"],"ar":["تقديم ملخصات المهام المحادثة","تقديم تحديثات صوتية لتغييرات الحالة المهمة","تحسين تجربة المستخدم مع ملاحظات الصوت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pocket-tts installation","Depends on the say script from the plugin"],"zh":["需要安装 pocket-tts","依赖于插件中的 say 脚本"],"ja":["pocket-tts のインストールが必要","プラグインの say スクリプトに依存"],"ko":["pocket-tts 설치가 필요","플러그인의 say 스크립트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de pocket-tts","Depende del script say del plugin"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pocket-tts","Dépend du script say du plugin"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von pocket-tts","Hängt vom say-Skript des Plugins ab"],"pt":["Exige instalação do pocket-tts","Depende do script say do plugin"],"ru":["Требует установки pocket-tts","Зависит от скрипта say плагина"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت pocket-tts","يعتمد على سيناريو القول من البرنامج المساعد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('accountbelongstox/core_node/project-characteristics', 'community', 'accountbelongstox', 'core_node', 'accountbelongstox/core_node', 'project-characteristics', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z', '2026-02-18T10:28:15.909Z', NULL, '{"id":"accountbelongstox/core_node/project-characteristics","name":"project-characteristics","description":{"zh":"Pycore 项目特性是指 Pycore 框架与开发规范，用于指导开发和修改代码","ja":"Pycore プロジェクトの特性は、Pycore フレームワークと開発規約を指し、コードの開発と修正を指導する","ko":"Pycore 프로젝트 특성은 Pycore 프레임워크 및 개발 규약을 의미하며 코드 개발과 수정을 위한 지침을 제공합니다","es":"El proyecto pycore tiene características y requisitos específicos para el desarrollo y la modificación de código","fr":"Le projet pycore présente des caractéristiques et des exigences spécifiques pour le développement et la modification de code","de":"Das pycore-Projekt hat spezifische Merkmale und Anforderungen für die Entwicklung und Modifizierung von Code","pt":"O projeto Pycore define um conjunto de características e requisitos para desenvolvimento de código, incluindo framework e convenções.","ru":"Проект Pycore определяет набор характеристик и требований для разработки кода, включая фреймворк и соглашения.","ar":"يحدد مشروع Pycore مجموعة من الخصائص والمواصفات لتطوير Код، بما في ذلك الإطار والاتفاقيات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Pycore 项目特性：框架与开发规范","ja":"Pycore プロジェクトの特性：フレームワークと開発規約","ko":"Pycore 프로젝트 특성: 프레임워크 및 개발 규약","es":"Características de proyecto pycore","fr":"Caractéristiques de projet pycore","de":"pycore-Projektmerkmale","pt":"Características do Projeto Pycore","ru":"Характеристики Проекта Pycore","ar":"خصائص مشروع Pycore","en":"project-characteristics"},"description":{"zh":"Pycore 项目特性是指 Pycore 框架与开发规范，用于指导开发和修改代码","ja":"Pycore プロジェクトの特性は、Pycore フレームワークと開発規約を指し、コードの開発と修正を指導する","ko":"Pycore 프로젝트 특성은 Pycore 프레임워크 및 개발 규약을 의미하며 코드 개발과 수정을 위한 지침을 제공합니다","es":"El proyecto pycore tiene características y requisitos específicos para el desarrollo y la modificación de código","fr":"Le projet pycore présente des caractéristiques et des exigences spécifiques pour le développement et la modification de code","de":"Das pycore-Projekt hat spezifische Merkmale und Anforderungen für die Entwicklung und Modifizierung von Code","pt":"O projeto Pycore define um conjunto de características e requisitos para desenvolvimento de código, incluindo framework e convenções.","ru":"Проект Pycore определяет набор характеристик и требований для разработки кода, включая фреймворк и соглашения.","ar":"يحدد مشروع Pycore مجموعة من الخصائص والمواصفات لتطوير Код، بما في ذلك الإطار والاتفاقيات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Pycore 框架要求","开发规范指南","快速开发和修改代码","代码组织和结构","服务添加和修改","线程池和配置管理"],"ja":["Pycore フレームワークの要求","開発規約ガイド","コードの迅速な開発と修正","コードの組織と構造","サービス追加と修正","スレッドプールとコンフィグ管理"],"ko":["Pycore 프레임워크 요구사항","개발 규약 가이드","코드의 신속한 개발과 수정","코드의 구성과 구조","서비스 추가와 수정","スレッド 풀과 구성 관리"],"es":["Requisitos y convenciones del framework pycore","Desarrollo y modificación de código bajo pycore","Uso de servicios y cambios en la configuración","Modificación del comportamiento de la ventana principal y del arranque","Uso de THREAD_BUS y lanzador"],"fr":["Exigences et conventions du framework pycore","Développement et modification de code sous pycore","Utilisation de services et modifications de la configuration","Modification du comportement de la fenêtre principale et du démarrage","Utilisation de THREAD_BUS et de lanzador"],"de":["Anforderungen und Konventionen des pycore-Frameworks","Entwicklung und Modifizierung von Code unter pycore","Verwendung von Diensten und Änderungen an der Konfiguration","Änderung des Verhaltens des Hauptfensters und des Starts","Verwendung von THREAD_BUS und Starter"],"pt":["Definição de framework e convenções de desenvolvimento","Requisitos para desenvolvimento de código","Integração com módulos Pycore","Configuração de lançador e inicialização","Gerenciamento de threads e serviços"],"ru":["Определение фреймворка и соглашений разработки","Требования для разработки кода","Интеграция с модулями Pycore","Конфигурация запуска и инициализации","Управление потоками и сервисами"],"ar":["تحديد الإطار والاتفاقيات التطويرية","المواصفات لتطوير الكود","التكامل مع وحدات Pycore","تكوين التشغيل والتشغيل الأولي","إدارة الخيوط والخدمات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pycore","项目特性","框架","开发规范","代码开发","代码修改","快速开发","服务添加","线程池"],"ja":["Pycore","プロジェクトの特性","フレームワーク","開発規約","コード開発","コード修正","迅速な開発","サービス追加","スレッドプール"],"ko":["Pycore","프로젝트 특성","프레임워크","개발 규약","코드 개발","코드 수정","신속한 개발","서비스 추가","スレッド 풀"],"es":["pycore","características de proyecto","desarrollo de código","modificación de código","framework pycore","requisitos y convenciones"],"fr":["pycore","caractéristiques de projet","développement de code","modification de code","framework pycore","exigences et conventions"],"de":["pycore","Projektmerkmale","Code-Entwicklung","Code-Modifizierung","pycore-Framework","Anforderungen und Konventionen"],"pt":["pycore","desenvolvimento de código","framework","convenções de desenvolvimento","requisitos de desenvolvimento","módulos pycore","lançador","inicialização","threads","serviços"],"ru":["pycore","разработка кода","фреймворк","соглашения разработки","требования разработки","модули pycore","запуск","инициализация","потоки","сервисы"],"ar":["pycore","تطوير الكود","الإطار","الاتفاقيات التطويرية","المواصفات التطويرية","وحدات pycore","التشغيل","التشغيل الأولي","الخيوط","الخدمات"]}},"owner":"accountbelongstox","repo":"core_node","repoPath":"accountbelongstox/core_node","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-characteristics","description":"Describes pycore (Python core library of core_node) requirements, conventions, and architecture. Use when developing or modifying code under pycore (pycore_module_caller, callmodule, pylauncher, pythreadpool, native_ui). Enforces three-layer separation, THREAD_BUS-only cross-thread communication, step-based native_ui, and shutdown priority. This skill defines pycore requirements only.","bodyPreview":"# pycore 项目特性（框架与约定）\n\n本 skill 描述的是 **pycore** 的要求与约定（项目特性即 pycore 的框架与开发规范），不涉及项目其他部分。\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Use this skill when developing or modifying code under **pycore** (pycore_module_caller, callmodule, pylauncher, pythreadpool, native_ui).\n- Use when adding services, changing tray/startup/main window behavior, or touching THREAD_BUS / launcher / config.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 入口与三层职责\n\n- **根入口**：`pycore_module_caller.py` → `build_launcher_config()` → `ServiceLauncher(config).start()` → `regis","body":"# pycore 项目特性（框架与约定）\n\n本 skill 描述的是 **pycore** 的要求与约定（项目特性即 pycore 的框架与开发规范），不涉及项目其他部分。\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Use this skill when developing or modifying code under **pycore** (pycore_module_caller, callmodule, pylauncher, pythreadpool, native_ui).\n- Use when adding services, changing tray/startup/main window behavior, or touching THREAD_BUS / launcher / config.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 入口与三层职责\n\n- **根入口**：`pycore_module_caller.py` → `build_launcher_config()` → `ServiceLauncher(config).start()` → `register_event_handlers()`；主循环等 `THREAD_BUS.is_shutdown_requested()` 后 `launcher.stop()`。\n- **callmodule**：只做配置与事件注册（`config.build_launcher_config`、`event_handlers.register_event_handlers`），不启动线程。\n- **pylauncher**：单例检测 + 按 `config.services` 调用 pythreadpool 的 starter；不实现具体服务逻辑。\n- **pythreadpool**：`SERVICE_STARTERS[name](config)` 启动各服务线程（heartbeat / rpc_v2 / ui / tray），并注册 `register_shutdown_handler`；关机时发 `tray.request_stop`、`{app_id}.close` 等事件。\n\n### THREAD_BUS 通信\n\n- 线程间**不直接调用**，全部通过 THREAD_BUS：`trigger_event`、`register_event_handler`、`signal`/`wait_signal`、`set_thread_state`、`register_shutdown_handler`、`request_shutdown`。\n- 事件命名带命名空间（如 `ui.tray.show`、`app.close`、`tray.request_stop`）；需要时 event_data 带 `source`。\n- 关机按 `THREAD_REGISTRY` 的 `shutdown_priority` 逆序执行（数字小的先关）。\n\n### Native UI 结构（step0–step10）\n\n- 对外只通过 `pycore.pyutils.native_ui` 的 `__init__.py` 暴露；内部按 step 绝对引用。\n- **step0_i18n**：国际化。**step1_config**：NativeUIConfig、TrayConfig。**step2_port_url**：端口与 URL。**step3_launcher**：`launch_native_app`、`launcher_with_startup`。**step4_startup**：TkinterStartupThread（唯一 tk 引导窗）。**step5_main_ui**：PySide6 主窗、WebView、托盘。**step6_tray**：pystray、AppIndicator（Ubuntu）。**step7_managers**：thread_bus_manager、shutdown_manager 等。**step9_frontend**：前端进程。\n\n### 启动顺序（含 UI 时）\n\n1. 先起 TkinterStartupThread（tk 引导），发 `TkinterStartup_ready`。\n2. UI 线程内 `wait_signal(''TkinterStartup_ready'')` 后再 `get_third_package_pyside6()`，再创建 PySide6Framework 与主窗口。\n3. 引导结束后可发 `STARTUP_REQUEST_CLOSE` 关 tk；若启用托盘则进 tray（pystray 或 AppIndicator）。\n4. 关机：`request_shutdown` → 执行 shutdown handler（如 stop_ui 发 `{app_id}.close`，stop_tray 发 `tray.request_stop`）。\n\n### 平台与托盘\n\n- **platform_adapter**：根据 OS、X11、`XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP` 给出 `recommended_tray_backend`（APPINDICATOR / PYSTRAY / PYSIDE6 / NONE）。\n- Ubuntu/GNOME 桌面优先用 AppIndicator，不可用时退回 pystray。Linux 无 X11 则无托盘。\n- `start_tray()` 与 `_run_tray_mode()` 根据推荐后端选择 AppIndicatorSystemTrayThread 或 TkinterSystemTrayThread；菜单用 `build_appindicator_menu_items` 或 `_build_tray_menu_items` 从 TrayConfig 生成。\n\n### 关键文件\n\n- 配置：`pycore/callmodule/config.py`。事件：`pycore/callmodule/event_handlers.py`。\n- 启动器：`pycore/pylauncher/launcher.py`。starter 与 registry：`pycore/pythreadpool/starters.py`、`registry.py`。\n- THREAD_BUS：`pycore/pyfoundations/thread_bus.py`。Native UI 入口：`pycore/pyutils/native_ui/step3_launcher/launch_native_app.py`。\n- tk 引导：`pycore/pyutils/native_ui/step4_startup/startup_window_thread.py`。主窗：`step5_main_ui/pyside6/framework.py`。平台：`pycore/pyutils/native_ui/platform_adapter.py`。\n\n### 开发约定\n\n- 新增服务：在 `registry.py` 的 THREAD_REGISTRY 加条目并设 `shutdown_priority`，在 `starters.py` 中实现 starter 并注册到 SERVICE_STARTERS；关机通过 THREAD_BUS 事件或 shutdown handler，不直接调其他线程。\n- 修改托盘/引导/主窗：保持「tk 先于 PySide6」「THREAD_BUS 关窗/关托盘」；Ubuntu 桌面优先 AppIndicator，失败再 pystray。\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:28:15.909Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing to understand and comply with pycore project characteristics and conventions.","zh":"非常适合需要理解和遵守pycore项目特征和约定的Python开发代理。","ja":"pycoreプロジェクトの特性と規約に従う必要があるPython開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"pycore 프로젝트의 특성과 규약을 이해하고 준수해야 하는 Python 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan entender y cumplir con las características y convenciones del proyecto pycore.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Python qui doivent comprendre et respecter les caractéristiques et les conventions du projet pycore.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die die Eigenschaften und Konventionen des pycore-Projekts verstehen und einhalten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que precisam entender e cumprir as características e convenções do projeto pycore.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки Python, которым необходимо понимать и соблюдать характеристики и соглашения проекта pycore.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى فهم وموافقة على خصائص ومواصفات مشروع pycore."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop and modify code under pycore, adhering to its framework and development standards, utilizing modules like pycore_module_caller, callmodule, and pylauncher, while interacting with THREAD_BUS, launcher, and config services.","zh":"赋予代理开发和修改pycore下的代码的能力，遵守其框架和开发标准，利用诸如pycore_module_caller、callmodule和pylauncher的模块，同时与THREAD_BUS、launcher和config服务交互。","ja":"pycoreの下でコードを開発し、変更するエージェントの能力を与え、pycore_module_caller、callmodule、pylauncherなどのモジュールを使用しながら、THREAD_BUS、launcher、configサービスとやり取りする。","ko":"에이전트가 pycore 아래에서 코드를 개발하고 수정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, pycore_module_caller, callmodule, pylauncher와 같은 모듈을 사용하여 THREAD_BUS, launcher, config 서비스와 상호 작용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar y modificar código bajo pycore, ajustándose a su marco y estándares de desarrollo, utilizando módulos como pycore_module_caller, callmodule y pylauncher, mientras interactúan con los servicios THREAD_BUS, launcher y config.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer et de modifier le code sous pycore, en respectant son cadre et ses normes de développement, en utilisant des modules tels que pycore_module_caller, callmodule et pylauncher, tout en interagissant avec les services THREAD_BUS, launcher et config.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Code unter pycore zu entwickeln und zu modifizieren, indem sie sich an dessen Rahmen und Entwicklungsnormen halten, mithilfe von Modulen wie pycore_module_caller, callmodule und pylauncher, während sie mit den Diensten THREAD_BUS, launcher und config interagieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver e modificar código sob pycore, aderindo ao seu framework e padrões de desenvolvimento, utilizando módulos como pycore_module_caller, callmodule e pylauncher, enquanto interage com os serviços THREAD_BUS, launcher e config.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать и изменять код под pycore, соблюдая его фреймворк и стандарты разработки, используя модули, такие как pycore_module_caller, callmodule и pylauncher, при взаимодействии с сервисами THREAD_BUS, launcher и config.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تطوير وتعديل الكود تحت pycore ، والامتثال ل_framework الخاص به ومعايير التطوير ، باستخدام الوحدات مثل pycore_module_caller و callmodule و pylauncher ، أثناء التفاعل مع خدمات THREAD_BUS و launcher و config."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing new services under the pycore framework","Modifying tray, startup, or main window behavior in pycore projects","Integrating with THREAD_BUS, launcher, or config components in pycore"],"zh":["在pycore框架下开发新的服务","在pycore项目中修改托盘、启动或主窗口的行为","在pycore中与THREAD_BUS、launcher或config组件集成"],"ja":["pycoreフレームワークの下で新しいサービスを開発する","pycoreプロジェクトでトレイ、スタートアップ、またはメインウィンドウの動作を変更する","pycoreでTHREAD_BUS、launcher、またはconfigコンポーネントと統合する"],"ko":["pycore 프레임워크에서 새로운 서비스를 개발하는 것","pycore 프로젝트에서 트레이, 시작 또는 메인 창의 동작을 수정하는 것","pycore에서 THREAD_BUS, launcher 또는 config 컴포넌트와 통합하는 것"],"es":["Desarrollar nuevos servicios bajo el marco de pycore","Modificar el comportamiento de la bandeja, el arranque o la ventana principal en proyectos pycore","Integrarse con los componentes THREAD_BUS, launcher o config en pycore"],"fr":["Développer de nouveaux services sous le cadre de pycore","Modifier le comportement de la barre d''état, du démarrage ou de la fenêtre principale dans les projets pycore","Intégrer les composants THREAD_BUS, launcher ou config dans pycore"],"de":["Neue Dienste unter dem pycore-Rahmen entwickeln","Das Verhalten von Tray, Start oder Hauptfenster in pycore-Projekten modifizieren","Mit den Komponenten THREAD_BUS, launcher oder config in pycore integrieren"],"pt":["Desenvolver novos serviços sob o framework pycore","Modificar o comportamento da bandeja, inicialização ou janela principal em projetos pycore","Integrar com componentes THREAD_BUS, launcher ou config em pycore"],"ru":["Разрабатывать новые сервисы под фреймворком pycore","Изменять поведение системной панели, запуска или основного окна в проектах pycore","Интегрироваться с компонентами THREAD_BUS, launcher или config в pycore"],"ar":["تطوير خدمات جديدة تحت إطار عمل pycore","تعديل سلوك الشريط ، أو تشغيل أو نافذة رئيسية في مشاريع pycore","التكامل مع مكونات THREAD_BUS أو launcher أو config في pycore"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to pycore projects and their conventions","Requires understanding of Python and pycore''s module structure","Limited to development and modification tasks within the pycore ecosystem"],"zh":["仅限于pycore项目及其约定","需要了解Python和pycore的模块结构","仅限于pycore生态系统内的开发和修改任务"],"ja":["pycoreプロジェクトとその規約に限定される","Pythonとpycoreのモジュール構造を理解する必要がある","pycoreエコシステム内での開発と変更タスクに限定される"],"ko":["pycore 프로젝트와 그 규약에만 국한됨","Python과 pycore의 모듈 구조를 이해해야 함","pycore 생태계 내에서의 개발 및 수정 작업에만 국한됨"],"es":["Específico para proyectos pycore y sus convenciones","Requiere comprensión de Python y la estructura de módulos de pycore","Limitado a tareas de desarrollo y modificación dentro del ecosistema pycore"],"fr":["Spécifique aux projets pycore et à leurs conventions","Nécessite une compréhension de Python et de la structure de modules de pycore","Limité aux tâches de développement et de modification à l''intérieur de l''écosystème pycore"],"de":["Spezifisch für pycore-Projekte und deren Konventionen","Benötigt Verständnis von Python und der Modulstruktur von pycore","Begrenzt auf Entwicklung- und Modifizierungsaufgaben innerhalb des pycore-Ökosystems"],"pt":["Específico para projetos pycore e suas convenções","Exige compreensão de Python e estrutura de módulos pycore","Limitado a tarefas de desenvolvimento e modificação dentro do ecossistema pycore"],"ru":["Конкретно для проектов pycore и их соглашений","Требует понимания Python и структуры модулей pycore","Ограничен задачами разработки и изменения внутри экосистемы pycore"],"ar":["محدد لمشاريع pycore و مواصفاتها","يتطلب فهم بايثون و هيكل الوحدات pycore","محدود بمهام التطوير والتعديل داخل نظام بيئي pycore"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
