e AgentSkills.io","Creación y edición de habilidades personalizadas"],"fr":["Basé sur des répertoires","Exige un fichier SKILL.md","Portée de projet ou personnelle","Compatibilité avec la norme ouverte d''AgentSkills.io","Création et modification de compétences personnalisées"],"de":["Basiert auf Verzeichnissen","Benötigt eine SKILL.md-Datei","Projekt- oder persönlicher Umfang","Kompatibilität mit dem offenen Standard von AgentSkills.io","Erstellung und Bearbeitung von benutzerdefinierten Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Baseado em diretório","Arquivo SKILL.md obrigatório","Escopo de projeto ou pessoal","Compatível com o padrão aberto do AgentSkills.io"],"ru":["Основан на директории","Обязательный файл SKILL.md","Объем проекта или личный","Совместим с открытым стандартом AgentSkills.io"],"ar":["基于 دليل","ملف SKILL.md مطلوب","نطاق المشروع أو الشخصي","متوافق مع معيار AgentSkills.io المفتوح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技能编辑器","AgentSkills.io","开放标准","技能管理","开发工具","开发者平台"],"ja":["スキルエディター","AgentSkills.io","オープンスタンダード","スキル管理","開発ツール","開発者プラットフォーム"],"ko":["스킬 편집기","AgentSkills.io","오픈 표준","스킬 관리","개발 도구","개발자 플랫폼"],"es":["editor de habilidades","creación de habilidades","edición de habilidades","desarrollo de habilidades","AgentSkills.io","estándar abierto","competencias personalizadas"],"fr":["éditeur de compétences","création de compétences","modification de compétences","développement de compétences","AgentSkills.io","norme ouverte","compétences personnalisées"],"de":["Fähigkeits-Editor","Erstellung von Fähigkeiten","Bearbeitung von Fähigkeiten","Entwicklung von Fähigkeiten","AgentSkills.io","offener Standard","benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["editor de habilidades","criar habilidades","editar habilidades","AgentSkills.io","desenvolvimento de habilidades","padrão aberto"],"ru":["редактор навыков","создать навыки","редактировать навыки","AgentSkills.io","разработка навыков","открытый стандарт"],"ar":["محرر المهارات","إنشاء مهارات","تعديل المهارات","AgentSkills.io","تطوير المهارات","معيار مفتوح"]}},"owner":"thegameband","repo":"BadDateDemo","repoPath":"thegameband/BadDateDemo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-editor","description":"Create or edit skills following the AgentSkills.io standard. Use when user wants to create a new skill, modify an existing skill, or asks about skill configuration. Triggers on keywords like create skill, edit skill, new skill, skill-editor, SKILL.md, or make a skill that....","bodyPreview":"# Skill Editor\n\nCreate or edit skills based on user requirements.\n\n## Understanding Skills\n\nSkills follow the [AgentSkills.io](https://agentskills.io) open standard. Each skill is a **directory** containing a `SKILL.md` file with frontmatter and markdown instructions.\n\n### Key Features\n- **Directory-based**: Each skill lives in `.cursor/skills/<skill-name>/`\n- **SKILL.md Required**: Main instructions file with YAML frontmatter\n- **Project or Personal Scope**: Project skills in `.cursor/skills/`,","body":"# Skill Editor\n\nCreate or edit skills based on user requirements.\n\n## Understanding Skills\n\nSkills follow the [AgentSkills.io](https://agentskills.io) open standard. Each skill is a **directory** containing a `SKILL.md` file with frontmatter and markdown instructions.\n\n### Key Features\n- **Directory-based**: Each skill lives in `.cursor/skills/<skill-name>/`\n- **SKILL.md Required**: Main instructions file with YAML frontmatter\n- **Project or Personal Scope**: Project skills in `.cursor/skills/`, personal in `~/.cursor/skills/`\n- **Optional Supporting Files**: `scripts/`, `references/`, `assets/` subdirectories\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n```\n.cursor/skills/<skill-name>/\n├── SKILL.md           # Required - main instructions\n├── scripts/           # Optional - executable code\n├── references/        # Optional - additional docs\n└── assets/            # Optional - templates, data files\n```\n\n## Steps\n\n### Step 0: Determine Operation Mode\n\nAnalyze the request to determine whether this is a create or edit operation:\n\n1. **Edit Mode** indicators:\n   - File path mentioned (e.g., `.cursor/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md`)\n   - Skill name with edit intent (e.g., \"edit the deploy skill\", \"modify my-skill\")\n   - Explicit edit request with existing skill\n\n2. **Create Mode** indicators:\n   - Capability description (e.g., \"skill for parsing JSON\")\n   - \"create skill for...\", \"make a skill that...\"\n   - No existing skill matches\n\n3. **Ambiguous**: Search `.cursor/skills/**/SKILL.md`, ask user to clarify\n\n---\n\n## EDIT MODE\n\n### Step 1: Find the Skill\n\nSearch `.cursor/skills/**/SKILL.md`:\n- If multiple matches, list and ask user to select\n- If none found, offer to create a new skill\n\n### Step 2: Read and Analyze\n\n- Load the SKILL.md file\n- Identify frontmatter fields and content sections\n- Understand current functionality\n\n### Step 3: Get Edit Type\n\nAsk user:\n- \"What would you like to modify?\"\n- Options: \"Update frontmatter\" | \"Modify instructions\" | \"Add supporting files\" | \"Change invocation settings\"\n\n### Step 4: Apply Changes\n\n- Apply modifications to the file\n- Preserve sections not being changed\n- Confirm modifications were successful\n- Provide updated file path\n\nThen STOP.\n\n---\n\n## CREATE MODE\n\n### Step 1: Check for Duplicates\n\nSearch for similar skills:\n- Search `.cursor/skills/**/SKILL.md`\n- Search for similar functionality\n- If found, ask: edit existing, create anyway, or cancel\n\n### Step 2: Generate Skill Name\n\nBased on the request, suggest a name following these rules:\n- **Max 64 characters**\n- **Lowercase letters, numbers, and hyphens only** (`a-z`, `0-9`, `-`)\n- **Must NOT start or end with hyphen**\n- **No consecutive hyphens** (`--`)\n- Pattern: `verb-noun` or `verb-noun-qualifier` (e.g., `parse-json`, `validate-email`)\n\nConfirm with user or let them provide custom name. **Validate name before proceeding.**\n\n### Step 3: Gather Requirements\n\nAsk user:\n\n**Invocation** - \"Who should invoke this skill?\"\nOptions:\n- \"Both user and agent (Recommended)\" - Default behavior\n- \"User only\" - Add `disable-model-invocation: true`\n\n**Execution** - \"How should this skill run?\"\nOptions:\n- \"Inline (Recommended)\" - Runs in current context\n\n### Step 4: Create Skill Directory and File\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p .cursor/skills/<skill-name>\n```\n\nWrite `.cursor/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`:\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: <skill-name>\ndescription: <What this skill does and when to use it. Include keywords that help identify relevant tasks. Max 1024 chars.>\n# Optional fields:\n# disable-model-invocation: true\n# license: MIT\n# compatibility: Requires git CLI\n# metadata:\n#   author: \"Team\"\n#   version: \"1.0\"\n---\n\n<Markdown instructions to follow when skill is invoked>\n\n## Steps\n\n1. [First step - be specific about tools/methods]\n2. [Second step]\n3. [Validation/error handling]\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: [Scenario]\n**Input:** `[input]`\n**Expected behavior:** [what should happen]\n\n## Notes\n\n- [Edge cases, limitations, best practices]\n```\n\n### Step 5: Confirm Creation\n\nReport:\n- Skill name and location\n- Invocation method (`/skill-name` or automatic)\n- How to test it\n- Mention editing with skill-editor for future changes\n\nThen STOP.\n\n---\n\n## SKILL.md Format Reference\n\n### Required Frontmatter\n\n| Field | Required | Description |\n|-------|----------|-------------|\n| `name` | Yes | Must match directory name. Max 64 chars, lowercase + hyphens only |\n| `description` | Yes | What it does and when to use. Max 1024 chars. Include trigger keywords |\n\n### Optional Frontmatter\n\n| Field | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `disable-model-invocation` | `true` = only user can invoke via `/name` |\n| `license` | License name or reference to LICENSE file |\n| `compatibility` | Environment requirements (max 500 chars) |\n| `metadata` | Arbitrary key-value pairs (e.g., `author`, `version`) |\n\n## Quality Standards\n\n**Good skills**:\n- Focused (one task well)\n- Clear description with trigger keywords\n- Well-documented with examples\n- Under 500 lines (move details to `references/`)\n\n**Name validation checklist**:\n- [ ] Lowercase only\n- [ ] No spaces (use hyphens)\n- [ ] No consecutive hyphens\n- [ ] Doesn''t start/end with hyphen\n- [ ] Matches directory name\n- [ ] Max 64 characters\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Resolution |\n|-------|-------|------------|\n| Skill not found | Invalid path or name | Verify path, search for files |\n| Invalid frontmatter | Malformed YAML | Check syntax, ensure proper indentation |\n| Duplicate skill | Name already exists | Rename or offer to edit existing |\n| Missing directory | Parent doesn''t exist | Create with `mkdir -p` |\n| Invalid name | Uppercase, spaces, or special chars | Convert to valid kebab-case |\n\n## Limitations (Cursor-specific)\n\n**Note**: The following Claude Code features are NOT supported in Cursor:\n- `$ARGUMENTS` string substitutions\n- `` !`command` `` dynamic context injection\n- `argument-hint` field\n- `user-invocable` field\n- `allowed-tools` field\n- `model` field\n- `context: fork` field\n- `agent` field\n- `hooks` field\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T10:28:03.926Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents requiring customized skill development based on user specifications and the AgentSkills.io open standard.","zh":"适用于需要根据用户规格和 AgentSkills.io 开放标准自定义技能开发的开发人员代理。","ja":"ユーザー仕様と AgentSkills.io オープンスタンダードに基づいたカスタムスキル開発を必要とするデベロッパーエージェントに最適です。","ko":"사용자 사양 및 AgentSkills.io 오픈 표준을 기준으로 사용자 지정 스킬 개발이 필요한 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que requieren un desarrollo de habilidades personalizado basado en especificaciones de usuario y el estándar abierto de AgentSkills.io.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant un développement de compétences personnalisé basé sur les spécifications de l''utilisateur et la norme ouverte AgentSkills.io.","de":"Ideal für Entwickleragenten, die eine benutzerdefinierte Fertigkeitsentwicklung auf der Grundlage von Benutzerspezifikationen und dem offenen Standard von AgentSkills.io erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que exigem desenvolvimento de habilidades personalizadas com base em especificações de usuário e no padrão aberto AgentSkills.io.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, требующих индивидуального развития навыков на основе спецификаций пользователя и открытого стандарта AgentSkills.io.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب تطوير مهارات مخصصة بناءً على مواصفات المستخدم ومعيار AgentSkills.io المفتوح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create or edit skills using YAML frontmatter and markdown instructions within a directory-based structure, leveraging the SKILL.md file format for project or personal scope skills.","zh":"赋予代理创建或编辑技能的能力，使用 YAML 前置内容和 markdown 指令在基于目录的结构中，利用 SKILL.md 文件格式进行项目或个人范围的技能。","ja":"エージェントに、YAML フロントマターとマークダウン指令を使用してディレクトリベースの構造内でスキルを作成または編集する能力を与え、SKILL.md ファイル形式を使用してプロジェクトまたは個人スコープのスキルを作成します。","ko":"에이전트가 YAML 프론티어 및 마크다운 지침을 사용하여 디렉토리 기반 구조 내에서 스킬을 생성 또는 편집할 수 있는 기능을 부여하고 SKILL.md 파일 형식을 사용하여 프로젝트 또는 개인 범위의 스킬을 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear o editar habilidades utilizando YAML frontmatter y instrucciones en markdown dentro de una estructura basada en directorios, aprovechando el formato de archivo SKILL.md para habilidades de alcance de proyecto o personal.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer ou de modifier des compétences en utilisant YAML frontmatter et des instructions en markdown dans une structure basée sur des répertoires, en exploitant le format de fichier SKILL.md pour les compétences de portée de projet ou personnelle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Fähigkeiten zu erstellen oder zu bearbeiten, indem sie YAML-Frontmatter und Markdown-Anweisungen innerhalb einer verzeichnisbasierten Struktur verwenden, wodurch das SKILL.md-Dateiformat für Fähigkeiten im Projekt- oder persönlichen Umfang genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar ou editar habilidades usando frontmatter YAML e instruções markdown dentro de uma estrutura baseada em diretório, aproveitando o formato de arquivo SKILL.md para habilidades de escopo de projeto ou pessoal.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать или редактировать навыки с использованием YAML frontmatter и инструкций markdown внутри структуры, основанной на директории, используя формат файла SKILL.md для навыков проекта или личного объема.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء أو تعديل المهارات باستخدام YAML frontmatter وتعليمات markdown داخل هيكل قائم على الدليل، واستخدام تنسيق ملف SKILL.md للمهارات في نطاق المشروع أو الشخصي."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom skills for specific user requirements","Editing existing skills to adapt to new project needs","Organizing skills into project or personal scopes within the .cursor/skills/ directory"],"zh":["为特定用户要求创建自定义技能","编辑现有技能以适应新项目需求","将技能组织到项目或个人范围内的 .cursor/skills/ 目录中"],"ja":["特定ユーザー要件のためのカスタムスキルを作成する","新しいプロジェクト要件に適応するために既存のスキルを編集する","スキルをプロジェクトまたは個人のスコープ内にある .cursor/skills/ ディレクトリに組織する"],"ko":["특정 사용자 요구 사항에 대한 사용자 지정 스킬을 생성합니다.","신규 프로젝트 요구 사항에 맞게 기존 스킬을 편집합니다.","스킬을 프로젝트 또는 개인 범위 내의 .cursor/skills/ 디렉토리에 조직합니다."],"es":["Creación de habilidades personalizadas para requisitos de usuario específicos","Edición de habilidades existentes para adaptarse a nuevas necesidades de proyecto","Organización de habilidades en ámbitos de proyecto o personal dentro del directorio .cursor/skills/"],"fr":["Création de compétences personnalisées pour des exigences spécifiques de l''utilisateur","Édition de compétences existantes pour s''adapter à de nouvelles besoins de projet","Organisation de compétences dans des portées de projet ou personnelles dans le répertoire .cursor/skills/"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Fähigkeiten für spezifische Benutzeranforderungen","Bearbeitung bestehender Fähigkeiten, um neuen Projektanforderungen gerecht zu werden","Organisation von Fähigkeiten in Projekt- oder persönlichen Bereichen innerhalb des Verzeichnisses .cursor/skills/"],"pt":["Criação de habilidades personalizadas para requisitos de usuário específicos","Edição de habilidades existentes para se adaptar às novas necessidades do projeto","Organização de habilidades em projetos ou escopos pessoais dentro do diretório .cursor/skills/"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных навыков для конкретных требований пользователя","Редактирование существующих навыков для адаптации к новым потребностям проекта","Организация навыков в проектах или личном объеме внутри директории .cursor/skills/"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات مخصصة لمتطلبات المستخدم الخاصة","تعديل المهارات الحالية لتكيفها مع احتياجات المشروع الجديدة","تنظيم المهارات في نطاقات المشروع أو الشخصية داخل الدليل .cursor/skills/"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the AgentSkills.io open standard","SKILL.md file with YAML frontmatter is mandatory","Directory-based structure must be followed"],"zh":["需要遵守 AgentSkills.io 开放标准","需要 SKILL.md 文件和 YAML 前置内容","必须遵循基于目录的结构"],"ja":["AgentSkills.io オープンスタンダードに従う必要がある","SKILL.md ファイルと YAML フロントマターが必要である","ディレクトリベースの構造に従う必要がある"],"ko":["AgentSkills.io 오픈 표준을 준수해야 합니다.","SKILL.md 파일 및 YAML 프론티어가 필수입니다.","디렉토리 기반 구조를 따라야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere la adhesión al estándar abierto de AgentSkills.io","El archivo SKILL.md con YAML frontmatter es obligatorio","La estructura basada en directorios debe seguirse"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à la norme ouverte AgentSkills.io","Le fichier SKILL.md avec YAML frontmatter est obligatoire","La structure basée sur des répertoires doit être suivie"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des offenen Standards von AgentSkills.io","Die Datei SKILL.md mit YAML-Frontmatter ist obligatorisch","Die verzeichnisbasierte Struktur muss befolgt werden"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao padrão aberto AgentSkills.io","Arquivo SKILL.md com YAML frontmatter é obrigatório","Estrutura baseada em diretório deve ser seguida"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения открытого стандарта AgentSkills.io","Файл SKILL.md с YAML frontmatter является обязательным","Должна быть соблюдена структура, основанная на директории"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمعيار AgentSkills.io المفتوح","ملف SKILL.md مع YAML frontmatter هو إلزامي","يجب اتباع هيكل قائم على الدليل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
